αὶ τὸ ἐνδεχόμενον → ἡ ἀδυναμία ἐπιστήμης περὶ αὐτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF6","text":"Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν ἀορίστων καὶ διανοητικῶν τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος → ἡ ζήτησις τῶν ἀρχῶν καὶ αἰτίων τοῦ κυρίως ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1","text":"Αἱ ἐπιστῆμαι οὐκέτι διαιροῦνται μόνον κατὰ τὰ ἀντικείμενα, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὸν τρόπον τῆς οὐσίας, τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὸν χωρισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME2","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία φαίνεται καθόλου οὐχ ὡς ἐπιστήμη ἀορίστου κοινοῦ, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς ἐπιστήμη τῆς πρώτης φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τοῦ φαινομένου ὡς ὄντος εἰς τὸ ἀόριστον ὑπόλειμμα τῆς ἐνύλου ἐνδεχομενικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME4","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς καὶ τὸ ψεῦδος μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τῆς τάξεως τῶν πραγμάτων εἰς τὴν τάξιν τῆς συνθέσεως καὶ διαιρέσεως τῆς διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ζήτησις καθίσταται δυνατὴ μόνον μετὰ τὴν ἀφαίρεσιν τῶν τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος οἳ οὐκ ἔχουσιν ὡρισμένην φύσιν καὶ αἰτίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸς βαθμός — Ἡ φυσικὴ, ἡ μαθηματικὴ καὶ ἡ θεολογικὴ διακρίνονται κατὰ τὰ οἰκεῖα αὐτῶν θεωρητὰ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT2","text":"Τῆς διατάξεως βαθμός — Ἡ ἐπιστήμη ὁρίζεται ἐκ τοῦ ἔχειν γένος, ὅρον καὶ αἰτίαν ἀεὶ ἢ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολύ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT3","text":"Ὑπερστρατηγικὸς βαθμός — Ὁ λόγος τὴν ζήτησιν τοῦ ὄντος προάγει διὰ διαδοχικῶν ἀφαιρέσεων, οὐ διὰ προσθέσεως νέων κατηγορημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4","text":"Περὶ ὄντος ἢ χρόνου βαθμός — Ἡ πραγματικότης διαιρεῖται εἰς τὸ ἀεὶ καὶ ἀναγκαῖον, τὸ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολύ, καὶ τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς ἐνδεχόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς τὴν ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τῶν περιορισμῶν τῶν μερικῶν ἐπιστημῶν πρὸς τὴν καθόλου ζήτησιν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας μένει ὑπὸ τῇ ὑποθέσει ὅτι οὐσία τις ἀκίνητος καὶ χωριστὴ ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυρότατα συνέχεται ἐν τῇ διακρίσει τοῦ ἀεὶ, τοῦ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολύ, καὶ τοῦ κατὰ συμβεβηκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέσις τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας πρὸς τὴν καθολικὴν ἐπιστήμην τίθεται μᾶλλον ἢ ἐν τῷ παρόντι πλήρως ἀποδεικνύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ συμβεβηκότος εἰς ὕλην, τέλος ἢ κινοῦν ἀνοικτὴ μένει, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ταύτην τὴν διάκρισιν εἰς ὕστερον ζήτησιν παραπέμπει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT6","text":"Ἡ πολλαχότης τοῦ ὄντος καὶ ἡ ἀξίωσις μιᾶς ἐπιστήμης περὶ τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὂν συνυπάρχουσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἑνότης αὐτῶν ἐν τῇ παρούσῃ διατάξει οὐκ ἔτι ἐκτίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἀπὸ τῆς διαιρέσεως τῶν ἐπιστημῶν διὰ τῆς ἀφαιρέσεως τῶν μὴ κυρίως ὄντων εἰς τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ζήτησιν ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174626407436Z_0d195fb8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 6","source_sha256":"d66cf9ef24bb21608eac3069bc34d03efee86b40ecbbe920cd8c41b2d562e990","sha256":"8f8b55039e479926b0b98ac5a93eb926d5b8a5b5828a2bc141f2f874585830bf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:46:26.408514+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1","text":"The aporia asks how some science will study the principles of being qua being, since the other sciences, having delimited some genus, deal only with that.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS2","text":"The solution distinguishes the universal inquiry into being from the particular sciences, which assume rather than demonstrate what their object is and whether it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS3","text":"The division of the theoretical sciences according to motion and separability of substance yields first philosophy, if an unmoved and separate substance exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4","text":"The multiplicity of being compels the account to set aside being by accident and being as true, so that being in the primary sense may be sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS5","text":"The impossibility of a science of the accidental is shown from its indeterminate cause and from its occurring neither always nor for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS6","text":"The regress of generated things into principles does not proceed to infinity, but ends in a principle of the chance occurrence, whose further cause is sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS7","text":"The final movement removes the accidental and the true as affections of thought, and returns to the principles of being itself qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A1","text":"The primary inquiry seeks the principles and causes of beings qua beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A2","text":"Every particular science delimits some genus of being and deals only with this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A3","text":"The particular sciences demonstrate neither what their genus is nor whether it is, but presuppose this or take it through perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A4","text":"Physics is theoretical, because it studies substance capable of motion and accompanied by matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","text":"Eternal, unmoved, and separate substance is the object of another theoretical science besides physics and mathematics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6","text":"If there is an unmoved and separate substance, the science concerning it is primary and studies being universally qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7","text":"Being is spoken of in many ways: accidentally, as true, according to the figures of the categories, according to potentiality, and according to actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8","text":"The accidental exists neither always nor for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","text":"Every science concerns what is always or what is for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10","text":"Matter capable of being otherwise is the cause of the accidental.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11","text":"The regress of causes of generated things must terminate in some principle, if not everything is to be from necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12","text":"The true and the false are in the combination and division of thought, not in the things themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13","text":"The accidental and being as true do not indicate, apart from these, any nature that is properly a nature of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX1","text":"None of the particular sciences studies being simply or being qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX2","text":"Physics is neither practical nor productive, but theoretical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX3","text":"Physics could not know unmoved and separate substance, since it deals with things in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX4","text":"Mathematics could not be first philosophy, since it is not evident that the unmoved things it studies are studied as separate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5","text":"No science concerns the accidental, because there is no determinate capacity or art concerning such a thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX6","text":"The accidental has neither generation nor corruption in itself, but only through the coincidence of other beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX7","text":"The true and the false are not in things as their substances or affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX8","text":"The regress of causes is not permitted to proceed infinitely toward a prior cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D1","text":"The ordering of the theoretical sciences is determined from the mode of substance: whether moving or unmoved, and separate or inseparable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D2","text":"First philosophy becomes universal not as a genus common to all things, but as the prior inquiry concerning prior substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D3","text":"The absence of a science of the accidental follows from its indeterminacy and its non-regular existence.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D4","text":"Matter provides the principle capable of being otherwise, through which the accidental is possible without everything occurring by necessity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D5","text":"The examination of truth and falsity is transferred from ontology to the inquiry concerning thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:D6","text":"The inquiry into being in the primary sense proceeds through abstraction from the indeterminate and intellectual modes of saying being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1","text":"Universal ontology does not begin from general abstraction alone, but derives its warrant for universality from the priority of unmoved and separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD2","text":"Scientific knowability of being presupposes stability or regularity; hence the accidental, as indeterminate, remains outside science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD3","text":"The distinction of being from the true releases the inquiry concerning substance from logical combination and division.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD4","text":"The rejection of the infinite causal course preserves contingency from universal necessity and establishes matter as the condition of disorder.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX1","text":"Not every predication concerning some being indicates a nature or substance of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX2","text":"Not everything that comes to be can be traced back scientifically, because the indeterminate and the chance occurrence do not admit a determinate cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX3","text":"Not every causal sequence carries a necessary order, because contingent matter produces deviations from what occurs for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX4","text":"The false is not in the thing, but in the erroneous division or connection of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX5","text":"There is no universal science of being without prior substance, because its universality depends on the first nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX1","text":"Being does not constitute one univocal genus, because it is spoken of in many ways and its modes are not knowable in the same way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX2","text":"Substance is not derived from the hypotheses of the particular sciences, because these operate after having already taken what it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX3","text":"The whole of generation cannot be traced back to complete fated necessity, because then the accidental and the contingent are abolished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX4","text":"Ontology is not equated with logical truth, because the former concerns things and principles, whereas the latter concerns an affection of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS1","text":"The restriction of the particular sciences to genera leaves the inquiry into being qua being outstanding.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS2","text":"The division of substance according to motion and separability → the hypothesis of unmoved and separate substance → the priority of first philosophy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS3","text":"The multiplicity of being → the distinction of the modes of being said → the abstraction from the accidental and from being as true.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS4","text":"The non-regular existence of the accidental → the indeterminacy of its cause → the impossibility of a science concerning it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS5","text":"The threatening regress of causes into necessity → the stopping at a principle of the chance occurrence → the new inquiry concerning matter, end, and mover.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6","text":"The abstraction from modes that are not beings in the primary sense → the restoration of the inquiry to the causes of being itself qua being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF1","text":"The particular sciences presuppose their own genera → the aporia concerning the science of being qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF2","text":"Physics as the theory of moving and material substance → the distinction of physics, mathematics, and theology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF3","text":"The existence of unmoved and separate substance → first philosophy → the universal theory of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF4","text":"The multiplicity of being → the exclusion of the accidental and of being as true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF5","text":"The accidental as neither always nor for the most part → matter and contingency → the impossibility of a science concerning it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:AF6","text":"The abstraction from the indeterminate and intellectual modes of being → the inquiry into the principles and causes of being in the primary sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1","text":"The sciences are no longer divided only according to their objects, but according to the mode of substance, motion, and separability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME2","text":"First philosophy appears universal not as a science of an indeterminate commonality, but as the science of the first nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3","text":"The accidental is transferred from its appearance as being to the indeterminate remainder of material contingency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME4","text":"The true and the false are transferred from the order of things to the order of the combination and division of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME5","text":"Ontological inquiry becomes possible only after abstraction from the modes of being that do not have a determinate nature and cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT1","text":"Surface level — Physics, mathematics, and theology are distinguished according to their respective objects of theoretical study.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT2","text":"Level of arrangement — Science is defined by having a genus, a boundary, and a cause always or for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT3","text":"Hyper-strategic level — The account advances the inquiry into being through successive abstractions, not through the addition of new predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4","text":"Level concerning being or time — Reality is divided into what is always and necessary, what is for the most part, and the accidental contingent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the limitations of the particular sciences toward the universal inquiry into being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2","text":"The universality of first philosophy remains under the hypothesis that some unmoved and separate substance exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT3","text":"The arrangement is held together most strongly in the distinction among what is always, what is for the most part, and what is accidental.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4","text":"The relation of first substance to universal science is posited rather than fully demonstrated in the present context.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT5","text":"The reduction of the accidental to matter, end, or mover remains open, because the account refers this distinction to a later inquiry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT6","text":"The multiplicity of being and the claim of one science concerning being qua being coexist, but their precise unity is not yet set forth in the present arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the account, because it returns from the division of the sciences, through the abstraction from what is not being in the primary sense, to ontological inquiry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BOO6:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 6"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 06","title":"Book 6","context":"Chapter 06","original_title":"Book 6","original_context":"Chapter 06"},"original_title":"Book 6","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7","layer":"CH","title":"Book 7","order":7,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BOO7"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO7@R001","sha256":"e9594a3df64353e7144355893306eabe05bdd7aaf5aee6bafa7db3e82c6484e7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","text":"Τὸ πάλαι καὶ νῦν καὶ ἀεὶ ζητούμενον, τί τὸ ὄν, εἰς τὸ ἀπόρημα τίς ἡ οὐσία ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS2","text":"Ἡ κυρία θέσις ἐστὶν ὅτι ἡ οὐσία πρώτη ἐστὶ τοῦ ὄντος, τὰ δὲ λοιπὰ δι᾽ αὐτὴν καὶ πρὸς αὐτὴν ὄντα λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS3","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς διαγνωστικός τε καὶ μεταφυσικός ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ τοὺς δοκοῦντας τρόπους τῆς οὐσίας ἐλέγχει καὶ τὴν οὐσίαν ὡς ἀρχὴν τοῦ εἶναι ἀνασυνίστησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἐκ τοῦ ὑποκειμένου εἰς τὴν ὕλην, ἐκ δὲ τῆς ἀνεπαρκείας τῆς ὕλης εἰς τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι προχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀνάλυσις τῆς γενέσεως, τῶν μερῶν καὶ τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι τὸ εἶδος οὐ γίγνεται, ἀλλὰ τὸ σύνολον γίγνεται διὰ προϋπάρχοντος εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ μετάθεσις τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι οὐχ ὡς κοινὸν κατηγόρημα οὐδὲ ὡς στοιχεῖον, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς αἴτιον τοῦ τὴν ὕλην τόδε τι καὶ ἓν εἶναι τίθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","text":"Τὸ ὂν λέγεται πλεοναχῶς, τὰ δὲ μὴ οὐσίαι διὰ τὴν οὐσίαν ὄντα λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","text":"Ἡ οὐσία πρώτη ἐστὶ λόγῳ, γνώσει καὶ χρόνῳ, καὶ μόνη τῶν κατηγοριῶν χωριστή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A3","text":"Ἡ μάθησις ἐκ τῶν ἡμῖν γνωριμωτέρων εἰς τὰ τῇ φύσει γνωριμώτερα μεταβαίνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A4","text":"Τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι, τὸ καθόλου, τὸ γένος καὶ τὸ ὑποκείμενον οἱ μάλιστα δοκοῦντες τρόποι τῆς οὐσίας εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","text":"Ὑποκείμενόν ἐστιν ἐκεῖνο καθ᾽ οὗ τὰ ἄλλα λέγεται, αὐτὸ δὲ μηκέτι κατ᾽ ἄλλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","text":"Ἡ περιαιρετικὴ ἐφαρμογὴ τοῦ ὑποκειμένου καταλείπει τὴν ὕλην ὡς ἔσχατον ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7","text":"Τὸ χωριστὸν καὶ τὸ τόδε τι τῇ οὐσίᾳ μάλιστα προσήκει, διὸ τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ σύνολον μᾶλλον οὐσίαι τῆς ὕλης εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","text":"Τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι ἑκάστου ἐστὶ τὸ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ λεγόμενον, ὁ δὲ τούτου λόγος ὁ ὁρισμός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A9","text":"Ἐπὶ τῶν πρώτων καὶ καθ᾽ αὑτὰ λεγομένων ἕκαστον καὶ τὸ ἑκάστῳ εἶναι ταὐτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","text":"Πᾶν γιγνόμενον ὑπό τινος, ἔκ τινος καὶ τί γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","text":"Τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι οὐ γίγνεται, ἀλλὰ τὸ ἐκ μορφῆς καὶ ὕλης σύνολον γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","text":"Ἐν τῇ γενέσει οὐσίας προϋπάρχει ἑτέρα οὐσία ἐντελεχείᾳ, ἐν δὲ τῇ τέχνῃ τὸ εἶδος προϋπάρχει ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","text":"Μόνα τὰ τοῦ εἴδους μέρη εἰσὶ μέρη τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ, τὰ δὲ ὑλικὰ μέρη τοῦ συνόλου ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A14","text":"Ὁ κατὰ διαίρεσιν ὀρθὸς ὁρισμὸς διὰ τῆς οἰκείας ἀκολουθίας τῶν διαφορῶν εἰς τὴν τελευταίαν διαφορὰν τελευτᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","text":"Τὸ καθόλου, ᾗ κοινὸν καὶ κατὰ πλειόνων λεγόμενον, οὐ δύναται οὐσία εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16","text":"Μία ἐντελέχεια οὐ σύγκειται ἐξ οὐσιῶν ἐντελεχείᾳ ἐνυπαρχουσῶν, ἀλλὰ τὰ μέρη αὐτῆς δυνάμει μέρη ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","text":"Τῶν αἰσθητῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα οὔτε ἀκριβὴς ὁρισμὸς οὔτε ἀπόδειξις ἔστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕλη αὐτῶν ἐνδέχεται καὶ εἶναι καὶ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἡ κατὰ τὸ εἶδος αἴτιον πρῶτον ἐστὶ τοῦ τὴν ὕλην τόδε τι καὶ ἓν εἶναι, ἀρχὴ οὖσα καὶ οὐ στοιχεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX1","text":"Τὸ βαδίζειν, τὸ καθῆσθαι καὶ τὰ πάθη οὔτε καθ᾽ αὑτὰ πέφυκεν εἶναι οὔτε χωρίζεσθαι τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX2","text":"Αἱ φανεραὶ σωματικαὶ οὐσίαι οὐ προαποδεικνύονται μόναι οὐσίαι εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX3","text":"Ὁ διορισμὸς τῆς οὐσίας διὰ μόνου τοῦ ὑποκειμένου οὐχ ἱκανός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μόνη οὐ δύναται κυρίως οὐσία εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε τόδε τι οὔτε χωριστὴ καθ᾽ αὑτήν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX5","text":"Τὰ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς λεγόμενα οὐκ ἔχει καθ᾽ αὑτὰ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX6","text":"Οὐ πᾶς λόγος ὁ ὀνόματι ταὐτὸ σημαίνων ὁρισμός ἐστιν, ἐπεὶ οὕτως καὶ ἡ Ἰλιὰς ὁρισμὸς ἂν εἴη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX7","text":"Οἱ ἐκ προσθέσεως λόγοι τῶν παθῶν καὶ τῶν συνδεδυασμένων οὐκ εἰσὶ πρώτως καὶ ἁπλῶς ὁρισμοί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","text":"Τὸ εἶδος οὐ ποιεῖται οὐδὲ γεννᾶται, ἐπεὶ ἡ γένεσις αὐτοῦ εἰς ἄπειρον ἀναδρομὴν ἂν ἐποίει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX9","text":"Τὰ χωριστὰ εἴδη οὐδὲ πρὸς τὰς γενέσεις οὐδὲ πρὸς τὰς αἰσθητὰς οὐσίας ἀναγκαῖα αἴτια ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX10","text":"Τὰ ὑλικὰ μέρη οὐκ ἐνυπάρχει τῷ λόγῳ τοῦ εἴδους ᾗ εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX11","text":"Τὸ καθόλου, τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ ὂν οὐκ εἰσὶν οὐσίαι παρὰ τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα χωρισταί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX12","text":"Οὔτε τὸ φθαρτὸν καθ᾽ ἕκαστον οὔτε ἡ ὡς χωριστὸν καθ᾽ ἕκαστον τιθεμένη ἰδέα ἀκριβῶς ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0071","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX13","text":"Ἡ τοῦ συνόλου ἑνότης οὔτε σωρὸς τῶν στοιχείων οὔτε πρόσθετον ὑλικὸν στοιχεῖόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D1","text":"Ἡ καθόλου περὶ τοῦ ὄντος θεωρία ἀναγκαίως περὶ τῆς οὐσίας πρῶτον θεωρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","text":"Ἡ ὑποκειμενικὴ ὁδὸς μὲν εἰς τὴν ὕλην καταλήγει, τὰ δὲ κριτήρια τοῦ χωριστοῦ καὶ τοῦ τόδε τι τὸ εἶδος πρὸ τῆς ὕλης τάττει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D3","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις τοῦ πράγματος κατ᾽ ἀκρίβειαν γνῶσίς ἐστι τοῦ τί ἦν αὐτῷ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D4","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς καὶ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι τῇ μὲν οὐσίᾳ ἁπλῶς, ταῖς δὲ λοιπαῖς κατηγορίαις ἑπομένως καὶ πρὸς ἓν ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D5","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καὶ ἡ τεχνικὴ γένεσις κοινὴν διάταξιν ἔχει, ἐπειδὴ προϋπάρχον εἶδος εἰς ὕλην ἐνεργεῖ καὶ σύνολον ἀποτελεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D6","text":"Χωριστὸν παράδειγμα οὐ δεῖ πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν, ἐπεὶ τὸ ἐν τῷ γεννῶντι ἢ ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ εἶδος ἱκανὸν αἴτιον τοῦ εἴδους ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D7","text":"Τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα τοῦ αὐτοῦ εἴδους ταὐτὰ μὲν τῷ εἴδει, ἕτερα δὲ τῷ ἀριθμῷ διὰ τὴν ἑτέραν ὕλην ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D8","text":"Ἐν τῷ ἐμψύχῳ ἡ ψυχὴ πρώτη οὐσία καὶ εἶδός ἐστι, τὸ δὲ σῶμα ὕλη, τὸ δὲ ζῷον τὸ ἐξ ἀμφοῖν σύνολον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D9","text":"Τὰ μέρη τοῦ λόγου καὶ τοῦ εἴδους πρότερα ἐστίν, τὰ δὲ μέρη εἰς ἃ τὸ σύνολον ὡς εἰς ὕλην φθείρεται ὕστερα ᾗ ὑλικά.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ οὐκ ἐκ συνδέσεως πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ ὅρων, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ τῆς δυνάμει ὕλης τοῦ γένους ὑπὸ τῆς τελευταίας διαφορᾶς ὁριζομένης γίγνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D11","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν χωριστῶν ἰδεῶν ἢ κοινὸν ὡς τόδε τι ποιεῖ ἢ πλείους ὁμωνύμους οὐσίας γεννᾷ, καὶ ἑκατέρως τὴν οὐσίαν διαλύει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D12","text":"Ἡ ἐρώτησις διὰ τί ἡ ὕλη τόδε τι ἐστίν, αἴτιον ζητεῖ τὸ εἶδος, καὶ τοῦτο ἡ οὐσία ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ὄντος πολυσημία οὐκ ἰσοτιμίαν κατηγοριῶν, ἀλλὰ διάταξιν ἐξαρτήσεως περὶ μίαν πρώτην οὐσίαν γεννᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD2","text":"Ἡ ὁδὸς τῆς γνώσεως ἀντίστροφον ἔχει τάξιν πρὸς τὴν τοῦ ὄντος προτεραιότητα, ἐπειδὴ ἐκ τῶν αἰσθητῶν συνόλων ἐπὶ τὴν κατὰ τὸ εἶδος ἀρχὴν ἀνάγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD3","text":"Τὸ εἶδος τὴν κατ᾽ εἶδος ταυτότητα διὰ τῆς γενέσεως διασῴζει, ἡ δὲ ὕλη τὴν κατ᾽ ἀριθμὸν ἑτερότητα τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα παρέχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐ μετάβασις τοῦ εἴδους ἐκ τοῦ μὴ ὄντος εἰς τὸ ὄν, ἀλλὰ σύστασις ὕλης κατὰ προϋπάρχον εἶδος ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD5","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ προτεραιότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ μίαν διάταξιν ἀποτελοῦσιν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ αὐτὸ εἶδος αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ ἀρχὴ τοῦ γιγνώσκειν ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","text":"Μετὰ τὴν ἀναίρεσιν τῶν χωριστῶν καθόλου εἰδῶν, ἡ ἐνδεχομένη χωριστὴ καὶ ἄφθαρτος οὐσία δεῖ ἄλλον τρόπον εἶναι, ὃς ἐνταῦθα οὔπω διορίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX1","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πάντες οἱ τρόποι τοῦ ὄντος ὁμοίως καὶ αὐτοτελῶς ὄντες εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX2","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ κατηγορεῖσθαι τινὸς αὐτοτελῆ καὶ χωριστὴν οὐσίαν τῷ κατηγορουμένῳ παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX3","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ γένεσις δύναται ἐξ οὐδενὸς προϋπάρχοντος εἴδους ἢ δυνάμεως ἄρχεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX4","text":"Ἡ διάταξις σιγῇ ἀποκλείει πᾶσαν ἀναδρομὴν καθ᾽ ἣν ἕτερον εἶδος, ἕτερον τί ἦν εἶναι ἢ ἕτερον συνδετικὸν αἴτιον ἀεὶ προστεθήσεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0079","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀχώριστος κατὰ τὴν αἴσθησιν παρουσία ὕλης τινὸς οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι ἡ ὕλη αὕτη μέρος τοῦ εἴδους ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX6","text":"Πολλαὶ οὐσίαι ἐνεργείᾳ οὐ δύνανται μίαν οὐσίαν ἐνεργείᾳ συνιστάναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX7","text":"Τὸ νεκρὸν ἢ ἀδύνατον ἐνεργεῖν μέρος οὐ κυρίως, ἀλλ᾽ ὁμωνύμως μόνον μέρος τοῦ ζῴου λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX8","text":"Τὰ κοινὰ ὀνόματα καὶ κατηγορήματα οὐ δύνανται τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ᾗ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ὁρίσαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX9","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης αὐτοῦ πρὸς αὑτὸ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αἰτιώδη ἀπόκρισιν εἰς τὸ διὰ τί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἔσχατος ἀόριστος ὕλη, ᾗ μήτε τόδε μήτε ποσὸν μήτε ποιόν ἐστιν, ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ τελικὴ οὐσία τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX2","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ οὐσία οὐ δύναται εἶναι κοινὸν ἓν ἐπὶ πολλῶν ὅμοιον τοῖς φθαρτοῖς καθ᾽ ἕκαστα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","text":"Ἡ οὐσιώδης ἑνότης οὐ δύναται ἐκ συνάψεως αὐτοτελῶν ἐνεργείᾳ μερῶν γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX4","text":"Τὸ εἶδος οὐ δύναται ὡς χρονικὸν συμβεβηκὸς, προϊόν τινος ποιήσεως ἢ μεταβαλλόμενον ὑποκείμενον νοηθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX5","text":"Ἐπιστήμη τοῦ φθαρτοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ᾗ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ἀδύνατος τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX6","text":"Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῆς ὕλης οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ὅπου τὸ εἶδος φυσικοῦ ζῴου ἔργον, κίνησιν καὶ ὡρισμένως ἔχοντα μέρη ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ καὶ ἄφθαρτος οὐσία οὔτε τοῖς κοινοῖς εἴδεσιν οὔτε ταῖς αἰσθηταῖς συνόλοις ταυτίζεται, ἀλλὰ ἡ θετικὴ φύσις αὐτῆς ἐν τῷ παρόντι λόγῳ ἀπούσα μένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS1","text":"Ἡ πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος γεννᾷ ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν τῶν κατηγοριῶν, ἡ δὲ ἐξάρτησις αὕτη τὴν οὐσίαν ὡς πρῶτον ὂν ἀναδεικνύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS2","text":"Οἱ τέτταρες τρόποι τῆς οὐσίας ὑποβάλλονται εἰς ἔλεγχον, καὶ ἡ ὁδὸς τοῦ ὑποκειμένου διὰ τῆς ὕλης εἰς τὴν προτεραιότητα τοῦ εἴδους μετατίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS3","text":"Τὸ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ γεννᾷ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι, τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι γεννᾷ τὸν κυρίως ὁρισμόν, καὶ ὁ ὁρισμὸς τὴν ταυτότητα τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας πρὸς τὸ εἶναι αὐτῆς δηλοῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS4","text":"Ἡ τριάς τοῦ ὑφ᾽ οὗ, ἐξ οὗ καὶ ὃ γίγνεται χωρίζει τὸ προϋπάρχον εἶδος ἀπὸ τοῦ γιγνομένου συνόλου καὶ ἀποκλείει γένεσιν τοῦ εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις εἴδους καὶ ὕλης διαιρεῖ τὰ μέρη εἰς λογικὰ καὶ ὑλικά, ὁρίζει τὴν κατὰ λόγον προτεραιότητα καὶ συγκροτεῖ τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS6","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις τοῦ ἰδίου τόδε τι πρὸς τὸ κοινὸν τοιόνδε ἀναιρεῖ τὴν οὐσιότητα τοῦ καθόλου καὶ διαλύει τὴν θεωρίαν τῶν χωριστῶν ἰδεῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS7","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ ὑποκειμένου, τοῦ καθόλου καὶ τῶν στοιχείων να συνιστᾶν τὴν οὐσίαν μετατίθησι τὴν ζήτησιν εἰς τὸ αἴτιον ᾧ ἡ ὕλη ἓν καὶ τόδε τι ἐστίν, τοῦτο δὲ τὸ εἶδος ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φορὰ βαίνει οὕτως· πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος → ἐξάρτησις τῶν κατηγοριῶν → προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας → ἀνάγκη ζητεῖν τίς ἡ οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF2","text":"Ἡ δευτέρα φορὰ βαίνει οὕτως· τέτταρες ὑποψήφιοι οὐσίαι → ὑποκείμενον → ὕλη → ἔλλειψις χωριστοῦ καὶ τόδε τι → προτεραιότης εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF3","text":"Ἡ τρίτη φορὰ βαίνει οὕτως· καθ᾽ αὑτό → τί ἦν εἶναι → ὁρισμός → ταυτότης πρώτου πράγματος καὶ οὐσίας αὐτοῦ → προϋπάρχον εἶδος ἐν τῇ γενέσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF4","text":"Ἡ τετάρτη φορὰ βαίνει οὕτως· σύνολον → διάκρισις μορφικῶν καὶ ὑλικῶν μερῶν → ἑνότης διὰ τελευταίας διαφορᾶς → ἀναίρεσις καθόλου ὡς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF5","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ φορὰ βαίνει οὕτως· ἀδυναμία ὕλης, καθόλου καὶ στοιχείων → αἰτιώδης μετάθεσις τοῦ ἀπορήματος → εἶδος ὡς πρώτη αἰτία τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME1","text":"Ἡ χώρα τοῦ ὄντος ἐκ παρατάξεως ὁμωνύμων κατηγοριῶν εἰς ἱεραρχίαν περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν μεταβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME2","text":"Ἡ οὐσία παύει ταυτιζομένη τῷ ἐσχάτῳ ὑποκειμένῳ καὶ διαιρεῖται εἰς ὕλην, εἶδος καὶ σύνολον, μετὰ προτεραιότητος τοῦ εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME3","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς μετατίθεται ἐκ παντὸς σημαίνοντος λόγου εἰς λόγον πρώτου, καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ ἑνὸς πράγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις παύει νοουμένη ὡς ποίησις εἴδους καὶ νοεῖται ὡς ἐνέργεια προϋπάρχοντος εἴδους ἐν ὕλῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME5","text":"Τὰ μέρη διατάσσονται εἰς μέρη τοῦ λόγου καὶ μέρη τοῦ συνόλου, ὥστε ἡ προτεραιότης καὶ ἡ φθορὰ μὴ κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον λέγεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME6","text":"Τὸ καθόλου ἐκ τῆς χώρας τῶν χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν εἰς τὴν χώραν τοῦ κοινοῦ κατηγορήματος μετατίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME7","text":"Τὸ ἀπόρημα περὶ τοῦ τί ἐστιν ἀναδιαγράφεται ὡς ἐρώτησις διὰ τί ἡ ὕλη τόδε τι καὶ ἓν ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME8","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστητὴ χώρα περιορίζεται εἰς τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ εἶδος, τὸ δὲ αἰσθητὸν καθ᾽ ἕκαστον τῇ αἰσθήσει καὶ τῇ δόξῃ καταλείπεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface** — Ἡ ῥητὴ ζήτησις ἐξετάζει τίς ἡ οὐσία, τί τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι, τί ὁ ὁρισμός, καὶ τί ἐν τῇ γενέσει γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural** — Ἡ διάταξις τῶν κατηγοριῶν, ἡ διάκρισις ὕλης, εἴδους καὶ συνόλου, καὶ ἡ ἀντίθεσις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐντελεχείας συγκροτεῖ τὸν μηχανισμὸν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic** — Ὁ λόγος μετατίθησι τὴν ἔρευναν ἐκ τοῦ καταλέγειν τίνα πράγματα εἰσὶν οὐσίαι εἰς τὸ ζητεῖν ποία ἀρχὴ ποιεῖ τὴν ὕλην ἓν καὶ τόδε τι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ εἶδος τίθεται ἀγένητον ὡς αἴτιον καὶ λόγος, τὸ δὲ σύνολον γενητὸν καὶ φθαρτόν, ἡ δὲ ἐντελέχεια τῆς δυνάμεως πρότερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ὀκτωκαίδεκα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἐκ τῆς προτεραιότητος τῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὴν οὐσίαν ὡς μορφικὸν αἴτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ὅπου ἡ θεωρία τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ, ἡ ἀνάλυσις τῆς γενέσεως καὶ ἡ ζήτησις τοῦ διὰ τί εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ εἶδος συμπίπτουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT3","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ ἐσχάτου ὑποκειμένου εἰς τὸ χωριστὸν καὶ τόδε τι στηρίζεται ἐν μέρει τῷ «δοκεῖ μάλιστα», ὥστε τὸ κριτήριον οὐ πλήρως ἐκ τοῦ ὑποκειμένου παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόφανσις ὅτι μόνης τῆς οὐσίας ἐστὶν ὁρισμὸς καὶ ἡ παραδοχὴ ὁρισμῶν τῶν ἄλλων κατηγοριῶν συμφιλιούνται διὰ τοῦ πρώτως καὶ ἑπομένως, ὁ δὲ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς ἀναλογίας μένει ἀδιοριστότερος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","text":"Τὸ εἶδος λέγεται ἄτομον καὶ αἴτιον τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα, ὁ δὲ καθόλου λόγος κοινός ἐστιν, καὶ ἡ σχέσις τοῦ ἐνόντος εἴδους πρὸς τὸν κοινὸν λόγον οὐ πλήρως διαρθροῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις τῆς τελευταίας διαφορᾶς πρὸς τὴν οὐσίαν προϋποτίθεται ὀρθὴν καὶ συνεχή διαίρεσιν, ἣν ὁ λόγος οὐκ ἐπὶ πάντων ἀποδεικνύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT7","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μορφικῶν καὶ ὑλικῶν μερῶν σαφὴς μὲν ἐπὶ τῶν τεχνητῶν, χαλεπωτέρα δὲ ἐπὶ τῶν φυσικῶν σωμάτων μένει, ὅπου τὸ εἶδος ὡρισμένως ἔχουσαν ὕλην ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","text":"Τὸ εἶδος καὶ ὁ λόγος λέγεται ἄνευ γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς εἶναι καὶ μὴ εἶναι, ἀλλὰ ὁ τρόπος ταύτης τῆς παρουσίας καὶ ἀπουσίας οὐκ ἐνταῦθα καθορίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT9","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἡ ἐνδεχομένη ὕπαρξις χωριστῶν ἀφθάρτων οὐσιῶν βεβαιοῦνται ἢ ὑποτίθενται, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ πλήρης αὐτῶν ἀπόδειξις ἀναβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT10","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἐκ τῆς ἀνεπαρκείας τοῦ ὑποκειμένου, τῆς ὕλης καὶ τοῦ καθόλου εἰς τὸ εἶδος ὡς ἀρχὴν καὶ αἴτιον καταλήγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174706257004Z_02a89564","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 7","source_sha256":"e9594a3df64353e7144355893306eabe05bdd7aaf5aee6bafa7db3e82c6484e7","sha256":"11c08f361c46ba9f02a21cc476dd2dfe8249eebe1a41f2eead4cff762b6ab092","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:47:06.258091+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","text":"The question sought of old, now, and always—what being is—comes down to the aporia: what is substance?","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS2","text":"The governing thesis is that substance is primary among beings, while the rest are said to be because of it and in relation to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS3","text":"The argument is both diagnostic and metaphysical, because it examines the seeming modes of substance and reconstructs substance as the principle of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from the subject to matter, and from the insufficiency of matter to form and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS5","text":"The analysis of generation, parts, and definition proves that form does not come to be, but that the composite comes to be through a pre-existing form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","text":"The final shift posits essence not as a common predicate nor as an element, but as the cause of matter's being a this-something and one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","text":"Being is spoken of in many ways, while things that are not substances are said to be because of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","text":"Substance is primary in account, knowledge, and time, and alone among the categories is separable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A3","text":"Learning proceeds from what is more knowable to us to what is more knowable by nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A4","text":"Essence, the universal, the genus, and the subject are the modes that most seem to be modes of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","text":"A subject is that of which the other things are said, while it itself is no longer said of another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","text":"The subtractive application of the subject leaves matter as the ultimate subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7","text":"Separability and being a this-something belong most of all to substance; therefore form and the composite are substances more than matter is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","text":"The essence of each thing is what is said of it in itself, and the account of this is the definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A9","text":"In the case of primary things and things said in themselves, each thing and its being are identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","text":"Everything that comes to be comes to be by something, from something, and as something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","text":"Form and essence do not come to be, but the composite of form and matter comes to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","text":"In the generation of substance, another substance pre-exists in actuality; in art, form pre-exists in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","text":"Only the parts of the form are parts of the definition, whereas material parts are parts of the composite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A14","text":"The correct definition by division terminates in the last difference through the proper sequence of differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","text":"The universal, insofar as it is common and said of many things, cannot be substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16","text":"One actuality is not composed of substances present in actuality; rather, its parts are parts potentially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","text":"Of sensible particulars there is neither an exact definition nor demonstration, because their matter admits both being and not being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","text":"Substance according to form is the first cause of matter's being a this-something and one, being a principle and not an element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX1","text":"Walking, sitting, and affections are naturally neither beings in themselves nor separable from substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX2","text":"The manifest bodily substances are not pre-demonstrated to be the only substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX3","text":"The delimitation of substance through the subject alone is not sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","text":"Matter alone cannot properly be substance, since it is neither a this-something nor separable in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX5","text":"Things said incidentally do not have essence in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX6","text":"Not every account signifying the same thing as a name is a definition; otherwise the Iliad too would be a definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX7","text":"Accounts by addition of affections and of combined things are not definitions primarily and simply.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","text":"Form is neither made nor generated, since its generation would produce an infinite regress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX9","text":"Separate forms are not necessary causes either for generations or for sensible substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX10","text":"Material parts are not present in the account of form insofar as it is form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX11","text":"The universal, the one, and being are not substances separate from particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX12","text":"Neither the perishable particular nor the Idea posited as a separable particular is defined exactly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0071","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX13","text":"The unity of the composite is neither a heap of elements nor an additional material element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D1","text":"The universal inquiry concerning being necessarily inquires first concerning substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","text":"The route through the subject ends in matter, but the criteria of separability and this-something place form before matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D3","text":"Exact knowledge of a thing is knowledge of what it was for it to be.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D4","text":"Definition and essence belong simply to substance, but consequentially and with reference to one thing to the other categories.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D5","text":"Natural and technical generation have a common arrangement, because a pre-existing form acts upon matter and produces a composite.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D6","text":"No separate paradigm is needed for generation, since the form in the generator or in the soul is a sufficient cause of the form in matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D7","text":"Particulars of the same form are the same in form but different in number because of different matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D8","text":"In the ensouled thing, the soul is primary substance and form, the body is matter, and the animal is the composite from both.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D9","text":"The parts of the account and of the form are prior, whereas the parts into which the composite is destroyed as into matter are posterior insofar as they are material.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","text":"The unity of the definition arises not from the conjunction of many actual terms, but from the potential matter of the genus being delimited by the last difference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D11","text":"The theory of separate Ideas either makes a common thing into a this-something or generates many homonymous substances, and in either way dissolves substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:D12","text":"The question why matter is a this-something seeks form as cause, and this is substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1","text":"The multiplicity of meanings of being produces not an equality of categories but an order of dependence around one primary substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD2","text":"The path of knowledge has an order inverse to the priority of being, because it ascends from sensible composites to the principle according to form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD3","text":"Form preserves sameness in form through generation, while matter provides numerical otherness among particulars.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD4","text":"Generation is not a transition of form from non-being into being, but a constitution of matter according to a pre-existing form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD5","text":"The ontological priority of substance and the scientific priority of definition constitute one arrangement, because the same form is the cause of being and the principle of knowing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","text":"After the removal of separate universal forms, any separable and imperishable substance must be of another kind, which is not yet delimited here.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX1","text":"It must be false that all modes of being are beings equally and independently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX2","text":"It must be false that being predicated of something confers independent and separable substance upon what is predicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX3","text":"It must be false that generation can begin from no pre-existing form or potency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX4","text":"The arrangement tacitly excludes every regress in which another form, another essence, or another unifying cause will always be added.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0079","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX5","text":"The inseparable presence to sense of some matter does not prove that this matter is a part of the form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX6","text":"Many substances in actuality cannot constitute one substance in actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX7","text":"A dead part, or a part incapable of functioning, is said to be a part of the animal not properly but only homonymously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX8","text":"Common names and predicates cannot define the particular insofar as it is particular.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX9","text":"Its identity with itself does not provide a causal answer to the question why.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX1","text":"Ultimate indeterminate matter, insofar as it is neither this nor quantity nor quality, cannot be the final substance of the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX2","text":"A separable substance cannot be a common one over many, like the perishable particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","text":"Substantial unity cannot arise from the joining of self-subsistent parts in actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX4","text":"Form cannot be conceived as a temporal accident, a product of some making, or a changing subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX5","text":"Knowledge of the perishable particular insofar as it is particular is held to be impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX6","text":"The abstraction of matter is not permitted where the form of a natural animal requires function, motion, and determinate parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","text":"Separable and imperishable substance is identified neither with common forms nor with sensible composites, but its positive nature remains absent from the present account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS1","text":"The multiplicity of meanings of being generates an asymmetrical dependence of the categories, and this dependence displays substance as primary being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS2","text":"The four modes of substance are subjected to examination, and the route of the subject is shifted through matter to the priority of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS3","text":"What is in itself generates essence, essence generates definition in the proper sense, and definition reveals the identity of primary substance with its being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS4","text":"The triad of that by which, that from which, and that which comes to be separates the pre-existing form from the composite that comes to be and excludes the generation of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS5","text":"The distinction between form and matter divides parts into logical and material parts, determines priority in account, and constitutes the unity of definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS6","text":"The opposition of the proper this-something to the common such-and-such removes the substantiality of the universal and dissolves the theory of separate Ideas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS7","text":"The incapacity of the subject, the universal, and the elements to constitute substance shifts the inquiry to the cause by which matter is one and a this-something; and this is form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF1","text":"The first course proceeds thus: multiplicity of meanings of being → dependence of the categories → priority of substance → necessity of seeking what substance is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF2","text":"The second course proceeds thus: four candidate substances → subject → matter → lack of separability and this-something → priority of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF3","text":"The third course proceeds thus: in itself → essence → definition → identity of the primary thing and its substance → pre-existing form in generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF4","text":"The fourth course proceeds thus: composite → distinction of formal and material parts → unity through the last difference → removal of the universal as substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF5","text":"The final course proceeds thus: incapacity of matter, the universal, and the elements → causal shift of the aporia → form as the first cause of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME1","text":"The domain of being is transformed from a juxtaposition of homonymous categories into a hierarchy around substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME2","text":"Substance ceases to be identified with the ultimate subject and is divided into matter, form, and composite, with the priority of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME3","text":"Definition is shifted from every significant account to an account of a primary thing, a thing in itself and one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME4","text":"Generation ceases to be understood as the making of form and is understood as the actuality of a pre-existing form in matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME5","text":"Parts are arranged into parts of the account and parts of the composite, so that priority and destruction are not spoken of in the same way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME6","text":"The universal is shifted from the domain of separate substances to the domain of the common predicate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME7","text":"The aporia concerning what is is redrawn as the question why matter is a this-something and one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME8","text":"The domain of scientific knowledge is confined to the universal and form, while the sensible particular is left to perception and opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface** — The explicit inquiry examines what substance is, what essence is, what definition is, and what comes to be in generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural** — The arrangement of the categories, the distinction of matter, form, and composite, and the opposition of potency and actuality constitute the mechanism of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic** — The account shifts the inquiry from enumerating which things are substances to seeking which principle makes matter one and a this-something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal** — Form is posited as ungenerated, as cause and account; the composite as generated and perishable; and actuality as prior to potency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT1","text":"The eighteen axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from the priority of substance to substance as formal cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","text":"The arrangement is strongest where the theory of definition, the analysis of generation, and the inquiry into why converge upon the same form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT3","text":"The transition from the ultimate subject to separability and this-something rests partly on “seems most,” so that the criterion is not fully derived from the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT4","text":"The assertion that only substance has definition and the acceptance of definitions of the other categories are reconciled through primarily and consequentially, but the precise mode of the analogy remains less determinate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","text":"Form is said to be individual and the cause of particulars, but the universal account is common, and the relation of the immanent form to the common account is not fully articulated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT6","text":"The identification of the last difference with substance presupposes correct and continuous division, which the account does not demonstrate in every case.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT7","text":"The distinction between formal and material parts is clear in artifacts, but remains more difficult in natural bodies, where form requires matter having determinate parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","text":"Form and account are said to be and not to be without generation and destruction, but the manner of this presence and absence is not determined here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT9","text":"The temporal priority of substance and the possible existence of separable imperishable substances are affirmed or posited, but their full demonstration is deferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true direction of the account, because it concludes from the insufficiency of the subject, matter, and the universal to form as principle and cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO7:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BOO7:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 7"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 07","title":"Book 7","context":"Chapter 07","original_title":"Book 7","original_context":"Chapter 07"},"original_title":"Book 7","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8","layer":"CH","title":"Book 8","order":8,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BOO8"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO8@R001","sha256":"1fab44a3482b8da453aca0958e4eeabeb409b2c3a917ca66aac58ec2c3dfc308","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","text":"Ἡ ζήτησις ἀπὸ τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων οὐσιῶν εἰς τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι τῶν αἰσθητῶν οὐσιῶν μετατίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS2","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῶν μεταβολῶν ὡς ὕλη καὶ δύναμις τίθεται, ἵνα ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ μὴ ἀνυπόστατοι φανῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS3","text":"Τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι οὐκ ἐν τοῖς στοιχείοις, ἀλλὰ ἐν τῇ μορφῇ καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ ζητεῖται, διότι αὕτη τὸ εἶναι τοῦ συνθέτου αἰτιᾶται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία τοῦ πῶς τὰ πολλὰ μέρη ἕν τι γίγνεται λύεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","text":"Ἡ αἰτία τοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ ἡ αἰτία τοῦ εἶναι ταὐτὸν πρόβλημα γίγνεται, ἐπεὶ τὸ εἶδος τὴν ὕλην ἐνεργείᾳ τόδε τι ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS6","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συλλογισμοῦ ἐστὶν οὐσίαι πολλαχῶς λεγόμεναι → ὕλη ὡς δύναμις → μορφὴ ὡς ἐνέργεια → σύνθετον → αἰτία τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A1","text":"Τῶν οὐσιῶν τὰ αἴτια, αἱ ἀρχαὶ καὶ τὰ στοιχεῖα ζητεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A2","text":"Πᾶσα αἰσθητὴ οὐσία ὕλην ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἐστὶ τὸ μὴ τόδε τι ἐνεργείᾳ ὄν, δυνάμει δὲ τόδε τι ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῶν ἐναντίων μεταβολῶν ἀναγκαῖον ἐστίν, καὶ τοῦτο ἡ ὕλη λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια τὸ τόδε τι κατὰ λόγον χωριστὸν σημαίνουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6","text":"Τὸ σύνθετον ἐκ ὕλης καὶ μορφῆς ἐστὶν ὃ γίγνεται καὶ φθείρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","text":"Ἡ οὐσία αἰτία τοῦ εἶναι ἑκάστῳ, καὶ διὰ τοῦτο ἐν ταῖς διαφοραῖς τὸ αἴτιον ζητητέον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","text":"Ὁ κατὰ τὰς διαφορὰς λόγος τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὴν ἐνέργειαν δηλοῖ, ὁ δὲ ἐκ τῶν ἐνυπαρχόντων λόγος τὴν ὕλην μᾶλλον δηλοῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A9","text":"Τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ γένος οὐκ οὐσίαι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","text":"Ἡ σύνθεσις οὐκ ἔστιν ἐκ τῶν στοιχείων ὧν ἐστὶ σύνθεσις, οὐδὲ ἡ μῖξις ἐκ τῶν ὧν ἐστὶ μῖξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς εἷς ἐστιν οὐ συνδέσμῳ, ἀλλὰ τῷ ἑνὸς εἶναι τοῦ ὁριζομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","text":"Ἡ ἐσχάτη ὕλη καὶ ἡ μορφὴ ταὐτὸ καὶ ἕν εἰσίν, ἡ μὲν δυνάμει, ἡ δὲ ἐνεργείᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A13","text":"Τὰ μὴ ἔχοντα μήτε αἰσθητὴν μήτε νοητὴν ὕλην εὐθὺς ὅπερ ἕν τι καὶ ὅπερ ὂν τί ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX1","text":"Τὸ καθόλου οὐκ ἔστιν οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX2","text":"Τὸ γένος οὐκ ἔστιν οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX3","text":"Ἡ οὐσία οὐκ ἀποδίδοται διὰ μόνης ἀπαριθμήσεως ὕλης ἢ στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX4","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτὸ ζῷον καὶ αὐτὸ δίπουν ὡς χωριστῶν πολλῶν μετοχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ οὐκ ἐκ συνδέσμου ὀνομάτων γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX6","text":"Τὸ εἶδος οὔτε ποιεῖται οὔτε γίγνεται καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἀλλὰ τὸ τόδε σύνθετον γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX7","text":"Οὐ πάντα τὰ ὄντα ὕλην ἔχει, ἀλλὰ μόνα ὅσων γένεσις ἢ μεταβολὴ εἰς ἄλληλα ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX8","text":"Ἡ πρῶτη καὶ κοινὴ ὕλη οὐκ ἀρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν ἐγγυτάτην αἰτίαν ἑκάστου φυσικοῦ πράγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D1","text":"Αἱ διαφορὰι τῆς ὕλης, οἷον σύνθεσις, μίξις, θέσις, πύκνωσις καὶ τάξις, τὸ εἶναι τῶν αἰσθητῶν διακρίνουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D2","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς τῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας ἢ τὴν ὕλην ἢ τὴν ἐνέργειαν ἢ τὸ ἐξ ἀμφοῖν σύνθετον λέγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D3","text":"Ὁ λέγων μόνα τὰ ἐνυπάρχοντα τὴν δυνάμει οὐσίαν λέγει, ὁ δὲ τὸ οὗ ἕνεκα ἢ τὸ ἔργον τὴν ἐνέργειαν λέγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἑκάστου φυσικοῦ πράγματος οἰκεία τις ἐστίν, κἂν ἐκ κοινῆς πρώτης ἀρχῆς προέρχηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D5","text":"Τὸ ὀρθῶς αἴτιον ζητεῖν ἀπαιτεῖ τὰς δυνατὰς αἰτίας πάσας λέγειν καὶ τὰς ἐγγυτάτας προτιμᾶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D6","text":"Τὸ μεταβαλλόμενον εἰς ἐναντίον οὐκ ἀμέσως ἐξ ἐκείνου γίγνεται, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς ὑποκειμένης ὕλης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D7","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς ὥσπερ ἀριθμὸς ἀλλοιοῦται, ἐὰν μέρος τι ἀφαιρεθῇ ἢ προστεθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα τῆς οὐσίας μεταβάλλεται εἰς πρόβλημα τοῦ τί ποιεῖ τὴν δύναμιν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ συνθέτου οὐκ ἐπιγίγνεται ἐκτός τινος αἰτίας ἐν τῷ πράγματι, ἀλλὰ τῇ μορφῇ ὡς ἐνεργείᾳ ἤδη παρεστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀναζήτησις ἑνὸς ἑνοποιοῦ αἰτίου παρὰ τὴν ὕλην καὶ τὴν μορφὴν ψευδὲς πρόβλημα γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD4","text":"Αἱ χωρισταὶ ἰδέαι οὐ δύνανται τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ ἐξηγεῖσθαι, εἰ τὸ ὂν ἑνὶ τῆς μορφῆς λόγῳ συνίσταται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD5","text":"Τὸ εἶδος οὐ μέτρησιν μᾶλλον καὶ ἧττον δέχεται, ἐπεὶ τὸ καθ᾽ εἶδος εἶναι οὐκ ὡς ποσὸν λέγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ οὐσία σωρὸς στοιχείων, ἐπεὶ ὁ σωρὸς οὐ παρέχει τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνὸς εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ μορφὴ μέρος ὑλικὸν παρὰ τὰ λοιπὰ μέρη, ἐπεὶ αὕτη τὸ σύνθετον ὡς τόδε τι ὁρίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ ἀλλοίωσις ἐν τῷ εἴδει καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἀλλὰ ἐν τῷ ὑλικῷ συνθέτῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ φθορὰ ἀπλή τις γένεσις τοῦ ἐναντίου, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς εἰς ὕλην ἀναλύσεως πορεύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν τὸ ἕν γένος χωριστὸν παρὰ τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα, ἐπεὶ ἕκαστον ὂν εὐθὺς ἕν τι ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ τῆς χωριστῆς καθολικότητος ἀποκλείεται, διότι οὐκ ἀποδίδωσι τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ τόδε τι εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη δευτέρου αἰτίου τοῦ ἑνὸς παρὰ τὴν ἐνέργειαν ἀποκλείεται, πλὴν ὅπου τὸ κινοῦν τὴν γένεσιν ἀρχόμενον αἰτιᾶται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι πᾶν ὂν ὁμοίως ὑλικὸν καὶ γενητὸν ἀποκλείεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS1","text":"Αἱ μεταβολαὶ ἐπιδεικνύουσιν ὑποκείμενόν τι μένον· τὸ μένον τοῦτο ὡς ὕλη καὶ δύναμις λαμβάνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS2","text":"Αἱ διαφοραὶ τοῦ κεῖσθαι, μεμῖχθαι, δεδέσθαι καὶ πεπυκνῶσθαι τὸν λόγον τοῦ εἶναι τῶν αἰσθητῶν παρέχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","text":"Ὁ λόγος τῶν διαφορών τὸ εἶδος δηλοῖ, καὶ τὸ εἶδος ὡς ἐνέργεια τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μετὰ τῆς μορφῆς σύνθετον ποιεῖ, καὶ μόνον τὸ σύνθετον κατὰ τὴν αἴσθησιν γίγνεται καὶ φθείρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS5","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία τοῦ τί ποιεῖ τὰ πολλὰ ἕν μετατίθεται εἰς τὸ πῶς ἡ ὕλη τῇ μορφῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τόδε τι ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS6","text":"Τὰ ἄνευ ὕλης ὄντα οὐ δέονται ἑτέρου αἰτίου τῆς ἑνότητος, διότι αὐτὸ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι αὐτῶν ἓν καὶ ὂν ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF1","text":"Οὐσίαι πολλαχῶς λεγόμεναι → αἰσθηταὶ οὐσίαι πρῶτον ἐξεταζόμεναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF2","text":"Αἰσθηταὶ οὐσίαι → ὕλη ὡς τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF3","text":"Ὕλη ὡς δύναμις → μορφὴ καὶ ἐνέργεια ὡς τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF4","text":"Ὕλη καὶ μορφή → σύνθετον ὡς γενητὸν καὶ φθαρτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF5","text":"Σύνθετος λόγος → ἀπορία περὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ περὶ τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF6","text":"Δύναμις καὶ ἐνέργεια → λύσις τῆς ἀπορίας τοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ ἀπόρριψις τῆς μεθέξεως καὶ τῆς συνουσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME1","text":"Ἡ οὐσία διακρίνεται εἰς ὕλην, μορφὴν καὶ τὸ ἐξ ἀμφοῖν σύνθετον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις στοιχείων καὶ οὐσίας γίνεται δυνατή, διότι τὰ στοιχεῖα τὴν δύναμιν μᾶλλον ἢ τὸ τετελεσμένον εἶναι δηλοῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ὁρισμοῦ ὕλης, ὁρισμοῦ μορφῆς καὶ ὁρισμοῦ συνθέτου γίνεται δυνατή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ πράγματος παύει χωριστὸν πρόβλημα εἶναι καὶ γίνεται ἐνέργεια τῆς μορφῆς ἐν ὕλῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME5","text":"Τὰ ἄνευ ὕλης μετατίθεται εἰς χώραν οὗ τὸ ὂν, τὸ ἕν καὶ τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι οὐ διακρίνονται δι᾽ ἑτέρου αἰτίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸς βαθμός — Αἱ αἰσθηταὶ οὐσίαι γίγνονται, φθείρονται καὶ κατὰ τὰ πάθη, τὸν τόπον καὶ τὸ μέγεθος μεταβάλλουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT2","text":"Τῆς διατάξεως βαθμός — Ἡ ὕλη τὸ ὑποκείμενον, ἡ μορφὴ τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι, καὶ τὸ σύνθετον τὸ γενητὸν ὂν διανέμονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3","text":"Ὑπερστρατηγικὸς βαθμός — Ἡ ζήτησις αἰτίας μετακινείται ἀπὸ τῆς ἀρχῆς τῶν στοιχείων πρὸς τὴν ἐγγυτάτην καὶ οἰκείαν αἰτίαν ἑκάστου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4","text":"Περὶ ὄντος ἢ χρόνου βαθμός — Τὸ εἶδος οὐ γίνεται καὶ οὐ φθείρεται καθ᾽ αὑτό, τὸ δὲ σύνθετον μόνον ἐν χρόνῳ γίγνεται καὶ φθείρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκεῖ πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τῆς μεταβολῆς εἰς τὴν ὕλην καὶ ἀπὸ τῆς ὕλης εἰς τὴν μορφὴν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ οὐ προστιθέμενον μέρος, ἀλλὰ τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι τοῦ συνθέτου ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἐκ τῆς δυνάμεως καὶ τῆς ἐνεργείας ἀνασυνίσταται, οὐκ ἐκ μεθέξεως χωριστῶν καθόλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","text":"Ἀδιοριστότερον μένει εἰ καὶ πῶς αἱ χωρισταὶ οὐσίαι τῶν φθαρτῶν ὑπάρχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ὅπου τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνὸς εἰς τὴν αὐτὴν μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν συνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT6","text":"Ῥωγμὴ μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀγενησίας τοῦ εἴδους καὶ τῆς ἐν τοῖς φθαρτοῖς ἀμφιβολίας περὶ τῆς χωριστῆς οὐσίας αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174731585970Z_df8cd79d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 8","source_sha256":"1fab44a3482b8da453aca0958e4eeabeb409b2c3a917ca66aac58ec2c3dfc308","sha256":"e532e117af6222e2f2740d5294f3dfa3e55d884dab6c36835a13aea7ab295c68","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:47:31.587920+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","text":"The inquiry shifts from substances spoken of in many ways to the cause of the being of sensible substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS2","text":"The substrate of changes is posited as matter and potentiality, so that generation and corruption may not appear without a substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS3","text":"The what-it-was-to-be is sought not in the elements but in form and actuality, because this causes the being of the composite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS4","text":"The aporia of how the many parts become one thing is resolved through the distinction between potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","text":"The cause of the one and the cause of being become the same problem, since form makes matter actually this particular thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument is: substances spoken of in many ways → matter as potentiality → form as actuality → composite → cause of being and of the one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A1","text":"The causes, principles, and elements of substances are sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A2","text":"Every sensible substance has matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","text":"Matter is that which is not actually this particular thing, but is potentially this particular thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4","text":"A substrate of contrary changes is necessary, and this is called matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","text":"Form and actuality signify this particular thing as separable in account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6","text":"The composite of matter and form is that which comes to be and perishes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","text":"Substance is the cause of being for each thing, and for this reason the cause must be sought in the differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","text":"The account according to the differences indicates form and actuality, whereas the account from the constituents indicates matter rather.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A9","text":"The universal and the genus are not substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","text":"A composition is not composed of the elements of which it is a composition, nor is a mixture composed of the things of which it is a mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","text":"A definition is one not by conjunction, but by the being-one of the thing defined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","text":"The ultimate matter and form are the same and one, the one potentially, the other actually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:A13","text":"Things having neither sensible nor intelligible matter are immediately what one thing is and what being is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX1","text":"The universal is not substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX2","text":"The genus is not substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX3","text":"Substance is not rendered by a mere enumeration of matter or elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX4","text":"A human being is not participation in animal-itself and biped-itself as many separate things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX5","text":"The unity of the definition does not arise from a conjunction of names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX6","text":"Form is neither made nor comes to be in itself; rather, this composite comes to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX7","text":"Not all beings have matter, but only those for which there is generation or change into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX8","text":"First and common matter is not sufficient for the proximate cause of each natural thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D1","text":"The differences of matter, such as composition, mixture, position, density, and order, distinguish the being of sensible things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D2","text":"The definition of sensible substance states either matter, actuality, or the composite from both.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D3","text":"He who states only the constituents states the potential substance, whereas he who states the end or the work states actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D4","text":"The matter of each natural thing is a certain proper matter, even if it proceeds from a common first principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D5","text":"To seek the cause correctly requires stating all the possible causes and preferring the proximate ones.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D6","text":"What changes into a contrary does not come to be immediately from that contrary, but through the underlying matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:D7","text":"A definition, like a number, is altered if some part is removed or added.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","text":"The problem of substance is transformed into the problem of what makes potentiality actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2","text":"The unity of the composite does not accrue from some cause outside the thing, but is already present in form as actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3","text":"The search for a unifying cause besides matter and form becomes a false problem.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD4","text":"Separate Forms cannot explain the unity of the sensible thing if the being is constituted by one account of form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD5","text":"Form does not admit of more and less, since being according to form is not spoken of as quantity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX1","text":"Substance is not a heap of elements, since a heap does not provide the cause of being one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX2","text":"Form is not a material part alongside the remaining parts, since it determines the composite as this particular thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX3","text":"Alteration is not in form itself, but in the material composite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX4","text":"Corruption is not some simple generation of the contrary, but proceeds through dissolution into matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX5","text":"The one is not a separate genus alongside particulars, since each being is immediately some one thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX1","text":"The excess of separate universality is excluded, because it does not render the cause of being this particular thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX2","text":"The necessity of a second cause of the one besides actuality is excluded, except where the initiating mover is posited as the cause of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:SNX3","text":"The hypothesis that every being is alike material and generated is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS1","text":"Changes display some abiding substrate; this abiding thing is taken as matter and potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS2","text":"The differences of being positioned, mixed, bound, and condensed provide the account of the being of sensible things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","text":"The account of the differences indicates form, and form as actuality becomes the cause of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS4","text":"Matter with form makes a composite, and only the composite comes to be and perishes according to perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS5","text":"The aporia of what makes the many one is shifted to how matter is actually this particular thing by form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS6","text":"Beings without matter do not require another cause of unity, because their very what-it-was-to-be is one and being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF1","text":"Substances spoken of in many ways → sensible substances examined first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF2","text":"Sensible substances → matter as the substrate of changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF3","text":"Matter as potentiality → form and actuality as the cause of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF4","text":"Matter and form → composite as generated and perishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF5","text":"Composite account → aporia concerning the one and concerning the unity of the definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF6","text":"Potentiality and actuality → resolution of the aporia of the one and rejection of participation and association.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME1","text":"Substance is distinguished into matter, form, and the composite from both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME2","text":"The distinction between elements and substance becomes possible, because the elements indicate potentiality rather than completed being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME3","text":"The distinction among the definition of matter, the definition of form, and the definition of the composite becomes possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4","text":"The unity of the thing ceases to be a separate problem and becomes the actuality of form in matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME5","text":"Things without matter are transferred to a domain in which being, the one, and what-it-was-to-be are not distinguished through another cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT1","text":"Surface level — Sensible substances come to be, perish, and change with respect to affections, place, and magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT2","text":"Level of arrangement — Matter as substrate, form as cause of being, and the composite as generated being are apportioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3","text":"Super-strategic level — The search for a cause moves from the principle of elements toward the proximate and proper cause of each thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4","text":"Level concerning being or time — Form does not come to be or perish in itself, whereas only the composite comes to be and perishes in time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the transition from change to matter and from matter to form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves that form is not an added part, but the cause of the being of the composite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT3","text":"The unity of the definition is reconstructed from potentiality and actuality, not from participation in separate universals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","text":"It remains more indeterminate whether and how separate substances of perishable things exist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5","text":"The arrangement is strongest where the cause of being and the cause of the one are brought together into the same formal actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT6","text":"A fissure remains between the ungeneratedness of form and the ambiguity, in perishable things, concerning its separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BOO8:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 8"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 08","title":"Book 8","context":"Chapter 08","original_title":"Book 8","original_context":"Chapter 08"},"original_title":"Book 8","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9","layer":"CH","title":"Book 9","order":9,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BOO9"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO9@R001","sha256":"2554f3ca232ef68af745909796b533ca45539c139e2a9857108e88c0989ce0da","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS1","text":"Ζητεῖται πῶς ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια διαφέρουσι, πῶς ἐπὶ πλεῖον τῆς κινήσεως λέγονται, καὶ πῶς πρὸς τὴν οὐσίαν, τὸν χρόνον καὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν ἔχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS2","text":"Ἡ κυρία θέσις ἐστὶν ὅτι ἡ ἐνέργεια ἑτέρα τε καὶ προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως κατὰ λόγον καὶ οὐσίαν, κατὰ δὲ χρόνον διορισμένως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS3","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς ἀπὸ τῆς πρὸς κίνησιν δυνάμεως ἐπὶ τὴν καθόλου ἀντίθεσιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS4","text":"Ἡ Μεγαρικὴ ταύτισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας διὰ τῶν ἀτόπων ἀναιρεῖται, ἐπεὶ τέχνην, αἴσθησιν, γένεσιν καὶ κίνησιν ἀδύνατα ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια δι᾽ ἀναλογίας δηλοῦται καὶ εἰς τελείαν πρᾶξιν καὶ ἀτελῆ κίνησιν διαιρεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS6","text":"Ἐκ τοῦ διορισμοῦ τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος συνάγεται ἡ κατὰ λόγον, αἰτίαν, τέλος καὶ οὐσίαν προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συλλογισμοῦ τελευτᾷ εἰς τὸ ἀΐδιον ἐνεργείᾳ εἶναι καὶ εἰς τὴν ἀλήθειαν ὡς ἀκολούθημα τοῦ τρόπου καθ᾽ ὃν τὰ πράγματα ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A1","text":"Τὸ ὂν λέγεται κατὰ τὰς κατηγορίας, κατὰ δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν, καὶ κατὰ ἀλήθειαν καὶ ψεῦδος, πρώτως δὲ κατὰ τὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A2","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐπὶ πλεῖον τῶν κατὰ κίνησιν λεγομένων ἐκτείνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A3","text":"Ἡ πρώτη πρὸς κίνησιν δύναμις ἐστὶν ἀρχὴ μεταβολῆς ἐν ἄλλῳ ἢ ᾗ ἄλλο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A4","text":"Ἡ ποιητικὴ καὶ ἡ παθητικὴ δύναμις μία μέν ἐστι κατὰ τὴν σχέσιν, ἄλλη δὲ κατὰ τὸ ὑποκείμενον ἐν ᾧ ἑκάστη ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","text":"Ἡ ἄλογος δύναμις ἑνὸς ἐναντίου ἐστίν, ἡ δὲ μετὰ λόγου δύναμις τῶν ἐναντίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","text":"Ἡ μετὰ λόγου δύναμις ἐνεργεῖ τὸ ὑπὸ τῆς κυρίας ὀρέξεως ἢ προαιρέσεως αἱρεθέν, ὅταν τὰ προσήκοντα ὑποκείμενα καὶ οἱ ὅροι παρῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","text":"Δυνατόν ἐστιν ἐκεῖνο οὗ τεθέντος ἐνεργείᾳ οὐδὲν ἀδύνατον συμβαίνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A9","text":"Εἰ τοῦ Α ὄντος ἀνάγκη τὸ Β εἶναι, τοῦ Α δυνατοῦ ὄντος ἀνάγκη καὶ τὸ Β δυνατὸν εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","text":"Πᾶσα δύναμις ὡρισμένου τινὸς καὶ ποτὲ καὶ πὼς καὶ ὑπὸ ὡρισμένους ὅρους ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","text":"Ἐνέργεια ἐστὶ τὸ πρᾶγμα ὑπάρχειν μὴ ὡς δυνάμει, ἡ δὲ σχέσις αὕτη δι᾽ ἀναλογίας γνωρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","text":"Ἡ ἐν αὑτῇ τὸ τέλος ἔχουσα πρᾶξις τελεία ἐνέργεια ἐστίν, ἡ δὲ πρὸς ἕτερον τέλος φερομένη κίνησις ἀτελής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13","text":"Δυνάμει τόδε ἐστὶν ἡ προσεχὴς ὕλη ἢ κατάστασις ἣ μηδεμιᾶς ἔτι ἐντὸς μεταβολῆς δεῖται πλὴν τῆς οἰκείας ἐνεργοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια προτέρα τῷ λόγῳ ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δύναμις διὰ τῆς δυνατῆς ἐνεργείας ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","text":"Τὸ ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν ἐκ τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος γίγνεται ὑπὸ ἑτέρου ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια τέλος, εἶδος καὶ οὐσία ἐστίν, ἡ δὲ δύναμις τούτου χάριν ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","text":"Πᾶν ἁπλῶς δυνάμει ὂν ἐνδέχεται μὴ ἐνεργεῖν ἢ μὴ εἶναι, διὸ τὸ ἀΐδιον καὶ ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὂν ἁπλῶς ἐνεργείᾳ ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18","text":"Ἐπὶ μὲν τῶν συνθέτων ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ ὄντως συνθέσει ἢ διαιρέσει, ἐπὶ δὲ τῶν ἀσυνθέτων τὸ ἀληθεύειν ἐστὶ θιγεῖν καὶ νοεῖν, τὸ δὲ μὴ θιγγάνειν ἄγνοια μᾶλλον ἢ ψεῦδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX1","text":"Αἱ ὁμωνύμως ἢ καθ᾽ ὁμοιότητα λεγόμεναι δυνάμεις οὐκ εἰσὶ μέρος τοῦ κυρίου διορισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX2","text":"Ἡ δύναμις οὐχ ἡ γυμνὴ δυνατότης τοῦ εἶναί πως ἢ μὴ εἶναι ἄνευ ἀρχῆς μεταβολῆς ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX3","text":"Τὸ συμφυὲς ἓν οὐ πάσχει ὑφ᾽ ἑαυτοῦ ᾗ ταὐτόν ἐστιν, ἐπεὶ τὸ ποιεῖν καὶ πάσχειν ἑτερότητα ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία οὐ ψιλὸν μὴ ἐνεργεῖν ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ στέρησις δυνάμεως ἐν τῷ πεφυκότι ἔχειν, ὅτε καὶ ᾗ πέφυκεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX5","text":"Ἡ μετὰ λόγου δύναμις οὐ ποιεῖ τὰ ἐναντία ἅμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX6","text":"Οὐ μόνον ὁ ἐνεργῶν δύναται, οὐδὲ ὁ παυόμενος ἐνεργεῖν εὐθὺς ἀποβάλλει τὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία αἰσθήσεως οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὐδὲ τὴν αἰσθητικὴν δύναμιν, ὡς ἂν ἐκ τοῦ Πρωταγόρου λόγου συνέβαινεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX8","text":"Τὸ ψεῦδος οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστι τῷ ἀδυνάτῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX9","text":"Οὐ πᾶσα πόρρω ὕλη δυνάμει τὸ ἐξ αὐτῆς ὕστερον γενόμενον ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX10","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια οὐ ταὐτίζεται πρὸς πᾶσαν κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX11","text":"Τὸ ἄπειρον οὐ δυνάμει ἐστὶν ὡς χωριστὸν ὅλον ὕστερον ἐνεργείᾳ ἐσόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX12","text":"Οὐδὲν ἄφθαρτον ἢ ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὂν ἁπλῶς δυνάμει ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX13","text":"Τὸ κακὸν οὐ χωριστὴ πρώτη ἀρχὴ οὐδὲ ἐν τοῖς ἀϊδίοις ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","text":"Οὐ διὰ τὸ ἡμᾶς ἀληθῶς οἴεσθαι τὰ πράγματα οὕτως ἔχει, ἀλλὰ διὰ τὸ τὰ πράγματα οὕτως ἔχειν ἀληθεύει ἡ δόξα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX15","text":"Περὶ τὸ τί ἐστιν ἀσύνθετον οὐκ ἔστι καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ἀπατηθῆναι, ἀλλ᾽ ἢ νοῆσαι ἢ μὴ νοῆσαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D1","text":"Αἱ δυνάμεις τοῦ ποιεῖν, τοῦ πάσχειν καὶ τοῦ ἀντέχειν εἰς μίαν πρώτην σχέσιν μεταβολῆς ἀνάγονται, διαφέρουσι δὲ κατὰ τὸν φορέα καὶ τὸν τρόπον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D2","text":"Αἱ τέχναι καὶ αἱ ποιητικαὶ ἐπιστῆμαι δυνάμεις τῶν ἐναντίων εἰσίν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ αὐτὸς λόγος δηλοῖ τὸ πρᾶγμα καὶ δι᾽ ἀποφορᾶς τὴν στέρησιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D3","text":"Ὁ λόγος παρέχει τὴν δυνατότητα τῶν ἐναντίων, ἡ δὲ ὄρεξις ἢ προαίρεσις καὶ αἱ περιστάσεις καθορίζουσι ποῖον αὐτῶν ἐνεργήσει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D4","text":"Ἡ Μεγαρικὴ ταύτισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας ἀναιρεῖ τὴν διαμονὴν τῆς τέχνης, τῆς αἰσθήσεως καὶ τῆς ἕξεως καὶ καθιστᾷ ἀδύνατον πᾶσαν νέαν κίνησιν ἢ γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D5","text":"Τὸ νῦν ψεῦδος δύναται εἶναι δυνατόν, ἐπειδὴ μόνον ἐκεῖνο ἀδύνατόν ἐστιν οὗ ἡ ὑπόθεσις ἀδυναμίαν γεννᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D6","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης μεταδίδοται εἰς πᾶν ἀναγκαῖον ἀκόλουθον, ἄλλως ἡ τοῦ προτέρου δυνατότης αὐτὴ ἀναιρεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D7","text":"Αἱ ἕξει καὶ λόγῳ κτώμεναι δυνάμεις προενεργήσει κτῶνται, αἱ δὲ συγγενεῖς καὶ παθητικαὶ οὐ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ἀπαιτοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D8","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια πρὸς τὴν δύναμιν ἔχει ὡς τὸ οἰκοδομοῦν πρὸς τὸ οἰκοδομικόν, τὸ ὁρῶν πρὸς τὸ ὄψιν ἔχον καὶ τὸ εἶδος πρὸς τὴν ὕλην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D9","text":"Ἐν ταῖς τελείαις ἐνεργείαις τὸ ἐνεστὼς καὶ τὸ παρακείμενον συμπίπτει, ἐν δὲ ταῖς κινήσεσι τὸ κινεῖσθαι καὶ τὸ κεκινῆσθαι διαφέρει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D10","text":"Ἡ γῆ οὐκ ἔστιν εὐθὺς δυνάμει ἄνθρωπος οὐδὲ ἀνδριάς, ἀλλὰ μόνον ἡ προσεχὴς ὕλη ἣ τὴν οἰκείαν ἀρχὴν μεταβολῆς ἤδη δέχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D11","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια προτέρα ἐστὶ λόγῳ, κατὰ γένεσιν διὰ προτέρας ἐνεργείας, καὶ οὐσίᾳ διότι τέλος καὶ εἶδος ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D12","text":"Ὅπου ἕτερον ἔργον παρὰ τὴν χρῆσιν γίγνεται, ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐν τῷ ποιουμένῳ ὑπάρχει· ὅπου δὲ ἡ χρῆσις αὐτὴ τὸ ἔργον ἐστίν, ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐν τῷ ἐνεργοῦντι μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13","text":"Τὰ ἀΐδια καὶ ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὄντα οὐκ ἔχει τὴν οὐσίαν ὡς δύναμιν τοῦ εἶναι καὶ μὴ εἶναι, ἀλλ᾽ ἀεὶ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D14","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια τῆς σπουδαίας δυνάμεως βελτίων ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δύναμις ὁμοίως πρὸς τἀναντία ἔχει, ἡ δὲ ἀγαθὴ ἐνέργεια ἓν ἀγαθὸν ὡρισμένως ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15","text":"Τὰ δυνάμει ὑπάρχοντα ἐν τοῖς διαγράμμασι γνωρίζεται διὰ τῆς εἰς ἐνέργειαν ἀγωγῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ νόησις ἐνέργεια καὶ ἡ κατασκευὴ τὸ λανθάνον φανερὸν ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D16","text":"Περὶ τὰ ἐνδεχόμενα ὁ αὐτὸς λόγος ποτὲ ἀληθὴς καὶ ποτὲ ψευδὴς γίγνεται, περὶ δὲ τὰ ἀκίνητα καὶ ἀναγκαῖα ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐ μεταβάλλεται κατὰ χρόνον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια οὐ μόνον ἕτερον μέλος ἀντιθέσεως ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ τὸ μέτρον δι᾽ οὗ ἡ δύναμις ὁρίζεται, ἐλέγχεται καὶ γνωρίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2","text":"Ἡ αἰτιακὴ τάξις οὐ δύναται ἐκ μόνης δυνάμεως ἄρχεσθαι, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα μετάβασις εἰς ἐνέργειαν προτέραν ἐνέργειαν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD3","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἐκ τοῦ ἀτελοῦς πρὸς τὸ τέλος κινεῖται, ἀλλὰ τὸ τέλος κατὰ οὐσίαν καὶ λόγον προϋποτίθεται ὡς αἰτία τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας συγχρόνως διακρίνει τὸ φθαρτὸν καὶ ἐνδεχόμενον ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀφθάρτου καὶ ἀναγκαίου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD5","text":"Ἡ λογικὴ δύναμις μόνη οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ πράξεως αὐτάρκη αἰτίαν, ἀλλὰ χρῄζει ὀρέξεως, προαιρέσεως, προσήκοντος πάσχοντος καὶ ἀπουσίας κωλύματος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις τῶν δυνάμει ὄντων τελειοῦται διὰ πράξεως ἢ νοητικῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως, οὐ διὰ ψιλῆς κατοχῆς ἀδρανοῦς δυνάμεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ὑστερεῖ τῶν πραγμάτων κατὰ αἰτίαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τοῦ νοήματος ἀλήθεια ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τῆς συνθέσεως ἢ τῇ νοητικῇ θίξει τοῦ ἀσυνθέτου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD8","text":"Τὸ κακὸν ὕστερον τῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δύναμις πρὸς τἀναντία κοινή, τὸ δὲ κακὸν ἤδη ὡρισμένη ἐνέργεια τοῦ χείρονος ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι δύναμις ἀόριστος καὶ ἀπόλυτος ἄνευ ἔργου, χρόνου, τρόπου, ὑποκειμένου καὶ ὅρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX2","text":"Οὐδεμία δύναμις ἑαυτὴν ἐξ αὑτῆς εἰς ἐνέργειαν ἄγει ἄνευ ἤδη ἐνεργούσης ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX3","text":"Ὁ λόγος τῶν ἐναντίων οὐκ αὐτὸς ἱκανὸς ἐστὶν ἑνὸς ἐναντίου αἰτία γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἔχει τὸ τέλος καὶ τὸ εἶδος ἐξ ἑαυτῆς οὐδὲ διὰ τὴν χρονικὴν προτεραιότητα γίνεται οὐσίᾳ προτέρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5","text":"Τὸ ἀΐδιον οὐ δύναται ἐρείδεσθαι ἐπὶ δυνατότητι τοῦ παύσασθαι ἢ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX6","text":"Τὸ κακὸν καὶ ἡ διαφθορὰ οὐ συνιστῶσι συναΐδιον ἀρχὴν ἀντικειμένην τῷ ἀγαθῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐκ ἐκ τῆς δόξης εἰς τὰ πράγματα προβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8","text":"Τὸ ἀσύνθετον ὂν οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται ὑπὸ καταφάσεως καὶ ἀποφάσεως, ἀλλὰ μόνον νοεῖται ἢ ἀγνοεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX9","text":"Εἰ χωρισταὶ οὐσίαι ὑπάρχουσιν, οὐ δύνανται ἧττον ἐνεργείᾳ εἶναι τῶν ὑπ᾽ αὐτῶν ἐξηγουμένων ἐπιστημόνων ἢ κινουμένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX1","text":"Ἡ στέρησις, τὸ μὴ εἶναι καὶ ἡ γυμνὴ δυνατότης οὐ δύνανται εἶναι πρώτη αἰτία τῆς ἐνεργούσης τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX2","text":"Ἡ πλήρης ταύτισις δυνατοῦ καὶ ἐνεργοῦ ἀφαιρεῖ οὐ μόνον τὴν διάκρισιν δύο τρόπων τοῦ εἶναι, ἀλλὰ καὶ αὐτὴν τὴν γένεσιν καὶ τὸν χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια οὐκ εἰσὶ συμμετρικαὶ ἀρχαί, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μὲν ὑπὸ τῆς ἑτέρας ὁρίζεται, ἡ δὲ οὐχ ὁμοίως ὑπὸ τῆς πρώτης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX4","text":"Ἡ πρώτη καὶ ἀΐδιος τάξις οὐκ ἐνδέχεται τὴν ἀντίφασιν, τὴν φθοράν, τὸ ἁμάρτημα ἢ τὸ κακὸν ὡς συστατικὰς ἀρχὰς περιέχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια οὐκ ὁρίζεται δι᾽ ἑνὸς γένους κυριολεκτικῶς κοινοῦ πᾶσιν, ἀλλὰ διὰ συστοιχίας ἀναλόγων σχέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX6","text":"Ἡ τῶν πρώτων καὶ ἀσυνθέτων νόησις οὐ χωρεῖ μεταξὺ θίξεως καὶ ἀγνοίας τρίτον τρόπον ψευδοῦς συλλήψεως καθ᾽ αὑτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS1","text":"Ἡ πολλαχῶς λεγομένη δύναμις περιορίζεται πρῶτον εἰς τὴν πρὸς μίαν ἀρχὴν μεταβολῆς ἀναφερομένην δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS2","text":"Ἡ πρώτη δύναμις διαιρεῖται κατὰ ποιεῖν καὶ πάσχειν, κατὰ λόγον καὶ ἄνευ λόγου, καὶ κατὰ ψιλὴν ἢ εὖ γενομένην ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λογικῆς καὶ ἀλόγου δυνάμεως γεννᾷ τὴν ἀνάγκην ὀρέξεως ἢ προαιρέσεως ὡς κυρίας τῆς λογικῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS4","text":"Ἡ Μεγαρικὴ ταύτισις ἐλέγχεται διὰ τῆς ἀναιρέσεως ἕξεως, αἰσθήσεως, κινήσεως καὶ γενέσεως, ὅθεν ἡ ἑτερότης δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας βεβαιοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS5","text":"Ἡ ἑτερότης αὕτη ἐπιτρέπει τὸ δυνατὸν διὰ τῆς ἀπουσίας ἀδυνάτου ἀκολούθου καὶ διὰ τῶν ὡρισμένων ὅρων αὐτοῦ διορίζεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS6","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια δηλοῦται δι᾽ ἀναλογίας, ἔπειτα διαιρεῖται εἰς τελείαν πρᾶξιν καὶ ἀτελῆ κίνησιν, καὶ οὕτως γίνεται μέτρον τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7","text":"Ἐκ τοῦ μέτρου τούτου παράγεται ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας κατὰ λόγον, αἰτίαν, τέλος καὶ οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS8","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας ἀνάγει τὸ φθαρτὸν εἰς δύναμιν ἀντιφάσεως, τὸ δὲ ἀΐδιον εἰς ἀναγκαίαν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9","text":"Ἡ ἐνεργειακὴ τάξις μεταφέρεται τέλος εἰς τὴν γνῶσιν καὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν, ὅπου τὸ νοεῖν ἕπεται τῷ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φορά τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· πολλαχῶς λεγομένη δύναμις → πρώτη ἀρχὴ μεταβολῆς → λογικαὶ καὶ ἄλογοι δυνάμεις → ὄρεξις καὶ προαίρεσις → διάκρισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF2","text":"Ἡ δευτέρα φορά τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· ἀναίρεσις τῆς Μεγαρικῆς ταυτίσεως → διορισμὸς τοῦ δυνατοῦ → ἀναλογικὴ δήλωσις τῆς ἐνεργείας → διάκρισις πράξεως καὶ κινήσεως → καθορισμὸς τῆς προσεχοῦς δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF3","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ φορά τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· προτεραιότης τῷ λόγῳ → προτεραιότης κατὰ γένεσιν καὶ αἰτίαν → προτεραιότης κατὰ οὐσίαν καὶ τέλος → ἀναγκαία ἐνέργεια τῶν ἀϊδίων → ἐνεργειακὴ θεμελίωσις γνώσεως καὶ ἀληθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME1","text":"Τὸ ὂν οὐκέτι μόνον κατὰ τὰ κατηγορικὰ εἴδη διαγράφεται, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὴν διαφορὰν τοῦ δυνατοῦ καὶ τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME2","text":"Ἡ δύναμις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀορίστου ἐνδεχομένου εἰς ὡρισμένην σχέσιν ἔργου, χρόνου, τρόπου, ὑποκειμένου καὶ συνθηκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME3","text":"Ἡ λογικὴ πράξις διαγράφεται ὡς σύνθεσις λόγου, ὀρέξεως, προαιρέσεως καὶ ἐξωτερικῶν ὅρων, οὐχ ὡς αὐτόματον ἀποτέλεσμα ἐπιστήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME4","text":"Ἡ κίνησις παύει ταὐτὸν εἶναι πάσῃ ἐνεργείᾳ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μὲν πρὸς ἀπόντα τέλος φέρεται, ἡ δὲ τὸ τέλος ἐν τῷ παρόντι ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὕλη τάττεται κατὰ βαθμοὺς ἐγγύτητος πρὸς τὸ εἶδος, ὥστε μόνη ἡ προσεχὴς ὕλη κυρίως δυνάμει τόδε λέγεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ προτεραιότης τοῦ δυνάμει ἐν τῷ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ὑποτάσσεται τῇ προτέρᾳ ἐνεργείᾳ τοῦ αὐτοῦ εἴδους κατὰ τὴν αἰτιακὴν σειράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME7","text":"Τὸ φθαρτὸν καὶ τὸ ἀΐδιον διακρίνεται διὰ τοῦ εἰ ἡ οὐσία αὐτῶν περιέχει δυνατότητα τοῦ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME8","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν καὶ τὸ κακὸν παύει συμμετρικῶς ἐν ταῖς πρώταις ἀρχαῖς τάττεσθαι, ἐπειδὴ τὸ κακὸν ὡρισμένη καὶ ὕστερα ἐνέργεια ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν κυριότητα τῆς δόξης εἰς τὴν πραγματικὴν σύνθεσιν, διαίρεσιν ἢ ἀσύνθετον ἐνέργειαν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME10","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις τῶν ἀσυνθέτων διακρίνεται τῆς προτατικῆς κρίσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἐκεῖ τὸ ἀληθεύειν θίξις, τὸ δὲ ἐναντίον ἄγνοια ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ βαθμοῦ ὁ λόγος ὁρίζει δύναμιν, δυνατόν, ἐνέργειαν, κίνησιν καὶ τοὺς ὅρους τῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ διατακτικοῦ βαθμοῦ ὁ λόγος συνάπτει ποιητικὸν καὶ παθητικόν, λόγον καὶ ὄρεξιν, ὕλην καὶ εἶδος, γένεσιν καὶ προτέραν ἐνεργείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὑπερστρατηγικοῦ βαθμοῦ τὸ ζήτημα μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τοῦ εἰ κάτι δύναται εἰς τὸ ὑπὸ ποίους ὅρους δύναται καὶ ποία ἐνέργεια τὴν δύναμιν ὁρίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμοῦ ἡ ἐνέργεια τίθεται ὡς τέλος, εἶδος, οὐσία, αἰτιακὴ προτεραιότης καὶ τρόπος τοῦ ἀϊδίου εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ γνωσιολογικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ νόησις ἐνέργεια γίνεται, ἡ δὲ ἀλήθεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸν τρόπον καθ᾽ ὃν τὸ νοούμενον ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἐξαιρεθέντα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τῆς πρὸς κίνησιν δυνάμεως μέχρι τῆς ἀϊδίου ἐνεργείας καὶ τῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τῆς ἐνεργείας μένει ἀναλογική, ὥστε ὁ κοινὸς λόγος κινήσεως, πράξεως καὶ οὐσίας οὐκ ἀποδίδοται μονοσήμως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT3","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη ἀντίφασις τῆς χρονικῆς προτεραιότητος λύεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως τοῦ αὐτοῦ καθ᾽ ἀριθμὸν ἀπὸ τοῦ αὐτοῦ κατ᾽ εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT4","text":"Ἡ θέσις ὅτι πᾶσα δύναμις τῆς ἀντιφάσεώς ἐστι δυσχεραίνεται ὑπὸ τῆς προτέρας θέσεως ὅτι ἡ ἄλογος δύναμις ἑνὸς μόνον ἐστίν, καὶ συμβιβάζεται μόνον διὰ παρουσίας καὶ ἀπουσίας τῶν ὅρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κυριότης τῆς ὀρέξεως ἢ προαιρέσεως λύει τὴν ἀοριστίαν τῆς λογικῆς δυνάμεως, ἀλλὰ τὸ κριτήριον τῆς κυρίας ὀρέξεως οὐ περαιτέρω διορίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT6","text":"Ἡ καθόλου θέσις ὅτι πᾶσα κίνησις ἀτελής ἐστιν ἀντιτείνεται πρὸς τὴν ἀΐδιον κίνησιν ἣ ἀεὶ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχει, ἄνευ πλήρους ἐνταῦθα διακρίσεως τῆς συνεχοῦς ἐνεργείας ἀπὸ τελείας πράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀξιολογικὴ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας περιορίζεται εἰς τὴν σπουδαίαν δύναμιν, ἐπειδὴ ἐπὶ τῶν κακῶν ἡ ἐνέργεια χείρων τῆς κοινῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT8","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ψεύδους περὶ τὰ ἀσύνθετα ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν τῆς θίξεως τοῦ τί ἐστιν ἀπὸ ψευδοῦς κατηγορίας περὶ ἀκινήτου πράγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT9","text":"Ἡ Μεγαρικὴ ἀναίρεσις καὶ ἡ τριμερὴς προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας φέρουσι τὸ κύριον ἀποδεικτικὸν βάρος, ἡ δὲ ἀναγωγὴ εἰς τὸ πρώτως κινοῦν προϋποτίθεται ἐκ τῶν περὶ κινήσεως λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT10","text":"Ἡ διεφθαρμένη λέξις ἐν τῷ περὶ θεωρίας καὶ μελέτης χωρίῳ ἀδιοριστίαν τοπικὴν καταλείπει, οὐ μέντοι διαλύει τὴν τελικὴν καὶ οὐσιώδη προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174816296692Z_2a49b835","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 9","source_sha256":"2554f3ca232ef68af745909796b533ca45539c139e2a9857108e88c0989ce0da","sha256":"115aae5bdc3fe719aec5b79bf00ac3a2d6cfc341d2b7a3b6fcaa214205c7b84a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:48:16.297620+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS1","text":"It is investigated how potentiality and actuality differ, how they are said more broadly than motion, and how they relate to substance, time, and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS2","text":"The principal thesis is that actuality is both other than and prior to potentiality in account and substance, but qualifiedly in time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds from potentiality in relation to motion to the universal opposition of potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS4","text":"The Megarian identification of potentiality and actuality is refuted through its absurd consequences, since it makes art, perception, coming-to-be, and motion impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS5","text":"Actuality is indicated by analogy and divided into complete activity and incomplete motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS6","text":"From the definition of what is potentially, the priority of actuality in account, cause, end, and substance is inferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7","text":"The movement of the argument ends in the eternal as being in actuality and in truth as a consequence of the manner in which things are.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A1","text":"Being is spoken of according to the categories, according to potentiality and actuality, and according to truth and falsity, but primarily according to substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A2","text":"Potentiality and actuality extend more broadly than things said in relation to motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A3","text":"The primary potentiality in relation to motion is a principle of change in another or insofar as it is another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A4","text":"Productive and passive potentiality are one in relation, but different according to the subject in which each exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","text":"Irrational potentiality is of one contrary, whereas potentiality with reason is of contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","text":"Potentiality with reason actualizes what has been chosen by the governing desire or choice, whenever the appropriate subjects and conditions are present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","text":"Potentiality and actuality are not the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","text":"Possible is that upon whose being posited in actuality nothing impossible results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A9","text":"If, when A is, B must be, then, when A is possible, B too must be possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","text":"Every potentiality is of something determinate, at some time and in some manner and under determinate conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","text":"Actuality is a thing's existing not as potentially, and this relation is known through analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","text":"An activity having its end in itself is complete actuality, whereas motion directed toward another end is incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13","text":"Potentially this is the proximate matter or condition that requires no further internal change except its proper actualization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","text":"Actuality is prior in account, because potentiality is defined through the possible actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","text":"What is actual comes to be from what is potential through another thing already actual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","text":"Actuality is end, form, and substance, whereas potentiality exists for the sake of this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","text":"Everything simply potential admits of not being actual or not being; therefore what is eternal and of necessity is simply actual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18","text":"In composites, truth follows actual combination or division; but in incomposites, being true is touching and thinking, while not touching is ignorance rather than falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX1","text":"Potentialities spoken of homonymously or by likeness are not part of the primary definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX2","text":"Potentiality is not the bare possibility of being somehow or not being, without a principle of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX3","text":"A naturally unified thing does not act upon itself insofar as it is the same, since acting and being acted upon require otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX4","text":"Incapacity is not merely not being actual, but a privation of potentiality in what is naturally fitted to have it, when and insofar as it is naturally fitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX5","text":"Potentiality with reason does not produce contraries simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX6","text":"Not only the one acting is capable, nor does one who ceases to act immediately lose the potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX7","text":"The absence of perception does not abolish the perceptible or perceptive potentiality, as would result from Protagoras' argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX8","text":"Falsity is not the same as impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX9","text":"Not all remote matter is potentially what later comes to be from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX10","text":"Actuality is not identified with every motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX11","text":"The infinite is not potential as a separate whole that will later be actual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX12","text":"Nothing incorruptible or necessary is simply potential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX13","text":"Evil is neither a separate first principle nor present among eternal things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","text":"Things are not so because we truly suppose them to be so; rather, because things are so, the opinion is true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX15","text":"Concerning what an incomposite is, it is not possible to be deceived in itself, but only either to think it or not to think it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D1","text":"The potentialities of acting, being acted upon, and resisting are reduced to one primary relation of change, though they differ according to bearer and manner.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D2","text":"Arts and productive sciences are potentialities of contraries, because the same account signifies the thing and, by reference away, the privation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D3","text":"Reason supplies the possibility of contraries, while desire or choice and the circumstances determine which of them will be actualized.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D4","text":"The Megarian identification of potentiality and actuality abolishes the persistence of art, perception, and disposition, and makes every new motion or coming-to-be impossible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D5","text":"What is now false can be possible, since only that is impossible whose supposition produces impossibility.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D6","text":"Possibility is transmitted to every necessary consequent; otherwise the possibility of the antecedent itself is abolished.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D7","text":"Potentialities acquired by disposition and reason are acquired by prior activity, whereas congenital and passive potentialities do not require the same manner.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D8","text":"Actuality stands to potentiality as the builder to the capable builder, the seeing thing to that which has sight, and form to matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D9","text":"In complete actualities, the present and the perfect coincide, whereas in motions being moved and having been moved differ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D10","text":"Earth is not immediately potentially a human being or a statue, but only the proximate matter that already receives its proper principle of change.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D11","text":"Actuality is prior in account, in coming-to-be through prior actuality, and in substance because it is end and form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D12","text":"Where another product comes to be besides the use, actuality exists in the thing being made; but where the use itself is the work, actuality remains in the agent.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13","text":"Eternal and necessary things do not have their substance as a potentiality to be and not to be, but always exist actually.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D14","text":"The actuality of a good potentiality is better, because potentiality relates alike to contraries, whereas good actuality determinately produces one good.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15","text":"Things existing potentially in diagrams are known through being brought into actuality, because thinking is actuality and construction makes manifest what is hidden.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:D16","text":"Concerning contingent things, the same account becomes at one time true and at another false; concerning immovable and necessary things, truth does not change over time.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1","text":"Actuality is not merely another member of an opposition, but the measure through which potentiality is defined, tested, and known.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2","text":"The causal order cannot begin from potentiality alone, since every transition into actuality requires a prior actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD3","text":"Coming-to-be moves from the incomplete toward the end, but the end is presupposed in substance and account as the cause of the motion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD4","text":"The distinction between potentiality and actuality simultaneously distinguishes the perishable and contingent from the imperishable and necessary.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD5","text":"Rational potentiality alone does not constitute a self-sufficient cause of action, but requires desire, choice, an appropriate patient, and the absence of impediment.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","text":"Knowledge of potential beings is completed through action or intellectual actualization, not through the bare possession of an inactive potentiality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","text":"Truth is posterior to things in cause, because the truth of thought follows the actuality of combination or the intellectual touching of the incomposite.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD8","text":"Evil is posterior to potentiality, because potentiality is common to contraries, whereas evil is already a determinate actuality of the worse.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1","text":"There is no indeterminate and absolute potentiality without work, time, manner, subject, and conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX2","text":"No potentiality leads itself from itself into actuality without an already active principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX3","text":"The account of contraries is not itself sufficient to become the cause of one contrary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX4","text":"Matter does not possess end and form from itself, nor does it become prior in substance through temporal priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5","text":"The eternal cannot rest upon a potentiality of ceasing or not being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX6","text":"Evil and corruption do not constitute a coeternal principle opposed to the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","text":"Truth is not projected from opinion onto things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8","text":"The incomposite being is not exhausted by affirmation and negation, but is only thought or unknown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX9","text":"If separate substances exist, they cannot be less actual than the sciences or motions explained by them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX1","text":"Privation, non-being, and bare possibility cannot be the first cause of the active order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX2","text":"The complete identification of possible and actual removes not only the distinction of two modes of being, but also coming-to-be itself and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3","text":"Potentiality and actuality are not symmetrical principles, because the one is defined by the other, whereas the other is not similarly defined by the first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX4","text":"The first and eternal order cannot contain contradiction, corruption, error, or evil as constituent principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX5","text":"Actuality is not defined through one genus literally common to all, but through a series of analogous relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX6","text":"The thinking of first and incomposite things admits no third mode of false apprehension in itself between touching and ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS1","text":"Potentiality, spoken of in many ways, is first restricted to potentiality referred to one principle of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS2","text":"Primary potentiality is divided according to acting and being acted upon, according to reason and without reason, and according to bare or well-accomplished actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS3","text":"The distinction between rational and irrational potentiality generates the necessity of desire or choice as governing rational actualization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS4","text":"The Megarian identification is tested through the abolition of disposition, perception, motion, and coming-to-be; whence the otherness of potentiality and actuality is confirmed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS5","text":"This otherness allows the possible to be defined through the absence of an impossible consequent and through its determinate conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS6","text":"Actuality is indicated through analogy, then divided into complete activity and incomplete motion, and thus becomes the measure of what is potential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7","text":"From this measure is derived the priority of actuality in account, cause, end, and substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS8","text":"The priority of actuality reduces the perishable to a potentiality of contradiction, and the eternal to necessary actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9","text":"The order of actuality is finally transferred to knowledge and truth, where thinking follows being in actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF1","text":"The first course of the argument is: potentiality spoken of in many ways → primary principle of change → rational and irrational potentialities → desire and choice → distinction between potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF2","text":"The second course of the argument is: refutation of the Megarian identification → definition of the possible → analogical indication of actuality → distinction between activity and motion → determination of proximate potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF3","text":"The final course of the argument is: priority in account → priority in coming-to-be and cause → priority in substance and end → necessary actuality of eternal things → actual foundation of knowledge and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME1","text":"Being is no longer delineated only according to categorical kinds, but according to the difference between the possible and what exists actually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME2","text":"Potentiality is transferred from an indeterminate contingency to a determinate relation of work, time, manner, subject, and conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME3","text":"Rational action is delineated as a combination of reason, desire, choice, and external conditions, not as an automatic result of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME4","text":"Motion ceases to be identical with every actuality, since the former is directed toward an absent end, whereas the latter has the end in the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME5","text":"Matter is arranged according to degrees of proximity to form, so that only proximate matter is properly called potentially this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6","text":"The temporal priority of the potential in the individual is subordinated to the prior actuality of the same species in the causal sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME7","text":"The perishable and the eternal are distinguished by whether their substance contains the possibility of not being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME8","text":"Good and evil cease to be symmetrically ranked among first principles, because evil is a determinate and posterior actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9","text":"Truth is transferred from the authority of opinion to the real combination, division, or incomposite actuality of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME10","text":"Knowledge of incomposites is distinguished from propositional judgment, because there being true is touching, while the contrary is ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the argument defines potentiality, the possible, actuality, motion, and the conditions of actualization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT2","text":"At the ordering level, the argument connects productive and passive, reason and desire, matter and form, coming-to-be and prior actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT3","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, the question shifts from whether something can be to under what conditions it can be and what actuality defines the potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT4","text":"At the level concerning being and time, actuality is posited as end, form, substance, causal priority, and the mode of eternal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT5","text":"At the epistemological level, thinking becomes actuality, and truth depends on the manner in which what is thought exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT1","text":"The selected axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from potentiality in relation to motion as far as eternal actuality and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2","text":"The unity of actuality remains analogical, so that the common account of motion, activity, and substance is not given univocally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT3","text":"The apparent contradiction of temporal priority is resolved through the distinction between the same in number and the same in species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT4","text":"The thesis that every potentiality is of contradiction is made difficult by the prior thesis that irrational potentiality is of one thing only, and is reconciled only through the presence and absence of conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT5","text":"The governance of desire or choice resolves the indeterminacy of rational potentiality, but the criterion of governing desire is not further defined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT6","text":"The universal thesis that every motion is incomplete stands in tension with eternal motion, which always exists actually, without here a complete distinction between continuous actuality and complete activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT7","text":"The evaluative priority of actuality is limited to good potentiality, because in bad cases actuality is worse than common potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT8","text":"The absence of falsity concerning incomposites requires a distinction between touching what a thing is and a false predication concerning an immovable thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT9","text":"The Megarian refutation and the threefold priority of actuality bear the principal demonstrative weight, whereas the reduction to the first mover is presupposed from the arguments concerning motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT10","text":"The corrupt wording in the passage concerning contemplation and study leaves a local indeterminacy, yet does not dissolve the final and substantial priority of actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BOO9:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BOO9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BOO9:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 9"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 09","title":"Book 9","context":"Chapter 09","original_title":"Book 9","original_context":"Chapter 09"},"original_title":"Book 9","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2","layer":"CH","title":"Book 10","order":10,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BO_2"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_2@R001","sha256":"ceefd4752a024a269fe56ed7a1fdb2a9543801d6b96674edcd1d9a00b436f2e7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS1","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀπορεῖ τί ἐστι τὸ ἑνὶ εἶναι, πῶς πρὸς τὸ ὂν ἔχει, καὶ πῶς ἐξ αὐτοῦ αἱ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ, τοῦ ἑτέρου καὶ τῶν ἐναντίων διατάξεις γίγνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS2","text":"Τὸ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ἓν ἀνάγεται εἰς τὸ ἀδιαίρετον, κυριώτατα δὲ εἰς τὸ πρῶτον μέτρον ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS3","text":"Τὸ ἓν οὔτε χωριστὴ οὐσία οὔτε γένος ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ κατὰ πάντα τὰ σχήματα τῆς κατηγορίας τῷ ὄντι παρακολουθεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μέτρου καὶ μετρητοῦ τὴν πρὸς τὰ πολλὰ σχέσιν τοῦ ἑνός, ἡ δὲ διάκρισις ἑτερότητος καὶ διαφορᾶς τὴν τῶν ἀντικειμένων τάξιν ὁρίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις, ὡς τελεία διαφορά, τὰ ἔσχατα, τὰ μεταξύ, τὰς στερήσεις καὶ τὰς εἰδοποιούς διαιρέσεις διατάσσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS6","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λόγου καὶ ὕλης κρίνει ποῖαι ἐναντιώσεις εἶδος ποιοῦσι καὶ ποῖαι μόνον τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον πάσχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς μεταφυσικὸς καὶ διαιρετικός ἐστι, κινούμενος ἀπὸ πολυσημίας εἰς ὁρισμόν, ἀπὸ ὁρισμοῦ εἰς τάξιν ἀντιθέσεων, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς κρίσιν οὐσίας καὶ εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","text":"Πᾶς πρῶτος καὶ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ τρόπος τοῦ ἑνὸς εἰς ἀδιαίρετόν τι ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","text":"Τὸ ἑνὶ εἶναι ἐστὶ τὸ ἀδιαιρέτῳ καὶ ὡρισμένῳ τόδε τι εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","text":"Κυριώτατα ἓν ἐστὶ τὸ πρῶτον μέτρον ἑκάστου γένους, πρώτως δὲ τοῦ ποσοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","text":"Πᾶν μέτρον συγγενές ἐστι τῷ μετρουμένῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον ἑκάστου γένους ἀδιαίρετόν ἐστιν ἢ ἁπλῶς ἢ πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","text":"Ἀριθμός ἐστι πλῆθος ἑνὶ μετρητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","text":"Οὐδὲν καθόλου δύναται χωριστὴ οὐσία εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ ὂν ἰσαχῶς κατηγορεῖται καὶ οὐδὲν ἕτερον τῷ ἑκάστου εἶναι προστίθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9","text":"Ἐν ἑκάστῳ γένει τὸ ἓν φύσις τίς ἐστι τοῦ γένους, οὐ κοινὴ φύσις παρὰ πάντα τὰ γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","text":"Πᾶσα διαφορὰ προϋποτίθησι ταὐτόν τι καθ᾽ ὃ τὰ διαφέροντα συγκρίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις ἐστὶ διαφορὰ τελεία καὶ μεγίστη ἐν ταὐτῷ γένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","text":"Ἡ τελεία διαφορὰ δύο ἔσχατα ἔχει καὶ οὐ πλείω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","text":"Πᾶσα ἐναντίωσις τελείαν στέρησιν ἐν θατέρῳ τῶν ἄκρων περιέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","text":"Ἀντιφάσεως μὲν οὐκ ἔστι μεταξύ, ἐναντίων δὲ ἐνδέχεται εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15","text":"Πᾶν μεταξὺ ἐν ταὐτῷ γένει τοῖς ἄκροις ἐστὶ καὶ ἐκ τῶν ἐναντίων σύγκειται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16","text":"Τὸ ἴσον μήτε μέγα μήτε μικρόν ἐστι, πεφυκὸς δὲ ἑκάτερον δέχεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","text":"Μόνη ἡ ἐν τῷ λόγῳ ἐναντίωσις εἰδοποιεῖ, ἡ δ᾽ ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ οὐκ εἰδοποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18","text":"Τὸ φθαρτὸν καὶ τὸ ἄφθαρτον ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἐν τῇ οὐσίᾳ ὑπάρχει τοῖς οὕτως ἔχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX1","text":"Τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς ἓν οὐκ ἀνήκει τοῖς πρώτοις καὶ καθ᾽ αὑτὰ εἴδεσι τοῦ ἑνός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX2","text":"Τὸ ἁφῇ, δεσμῷ ἢ βίᾳ συνεχὲς οὐχ ὁμοίως ἓν τῷ φύσει συνεχῶς ἔχοντι ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX3","text":"Οὐ ταὐτὸν ἐστὶ τὸ ποῖα λέγεται ἓν καὶ τὸ τί ἐστι τὸ ἑνὶ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","text":"Ἡ Πυθαγορείων καὶ Πλάτωνος ὑπόθεσις, καθ᾽ ἣν αὐτὸ τὸ ἓν χωριστὴ οὐσία ἐστίν, ἀποβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX5","text":"Οὔτε τὸ ἓν οὔτε τὸ ὂν γένος ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX6","text":"Τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα μέτρα οὐ μετέχει κοινῆς τινος χωριστῆς οὐσίας τοῦ ἑνός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX7","text":"Τὸ μέτρον οὐκ ἀεὶ ἀριθμῷ ἕν ἐστιν, οὐδὲ πάντως ἁπλῶς ἀμερές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη καὶ ἡ αἴσθησις οὐ κυρίως τὰ πράγματα μετροῦσιν, ἀλλὰ μᾶλλον ὑπ᾽ αὐτῶν μετροῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX9","text":"Ὁ Πρωταγόρου ἄνθρωπος-μέτρον οὐδὲν πέρα τοῦ ἐπιστήμονος ἢ αἰσθανομένου προστίθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX10","text":"Τὸ ἓν οὐκ ἔστιν ὀλίγον, οὐδὲ τὰ πολλὰ ἁπλῶς ταὐτὰ τῷ πολλῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX11","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ τὰ πολλὰ οὐ πάντως ὡς ἐναντία ἀντίκειται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX12","text":"Ἡ ἑτερότης οὐ ταὐτὸν τῇ διαφορᾷ ἐστίν, οὐδὲ τὸ ἕτερον ἀντίφασις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX13","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις οὐκ ἔστιν ἀντίφασις, καὶ οὐ πᾶσα στέρησις ἐναντίωσίς ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX14","text":"Ἡ συναπόφασις δύο ἀνομογενῶν οὐ ποιεῖ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ μεταξύ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX15","text":"Αἱ ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ, τῷ σώματι ἢ τοῖς συμβεβηκόσιν ἐναντιώσεις οὐκ ἐξ ἀνάγκης εἴδη διαιροῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX16","text":"Χωριστὸν ἄφθαρτον εἶδος οὐ δύναται τῷ φθαρτῷ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ταὐτὸν εἴδει εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D1","text":"Τὸ φύσει συνεχὲς καὶ ἐν αὑτῷ τὴν αἰτίαν τῆς συνεχείας ἔχον μᾶλλον ἕν ἐστι τοῦ δεσμῷ συγκειμένου, ὅτι ἡ κίνησις αὐτοῦ ἀδιαιρετωτέρα ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D2","text":"Τὸ ποσὸν ᾗ ποσὸν τῷ ἑνὶ γιγνώσκεται, ἐπεὶ πᾶς ἀριθμὸς διὰ μονάδος μετρεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D3","text":"Ἡ μονὰς ἀρχὴ τοῦ ἀριθμοῦ ἐστίν, οὐκ ἀριθμὸς ᾗ ἀδιαίρετός ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D4","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ ὂν οὐ δηλοῖ πρόσθετον πρᾶγμα, ἀλλὰ τὸ ἑκάστου ὡρισμένως εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D5","text":"Ἐν τοῖς ἀριθμοῖς τὸ ἓν καὶ τὰ πολλὰ ὡς μέτρον καὶ μετρητὸν ἀντίκειται, οὐχ ὡς ἁπλῶς ἐναντία.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D6","text":"Πᾶν ὂν πρὸς πᾶν ὂν ἢ ταὐτὸν ἢ ἕτερον λέγεται, διαφέρειν δὲ δύναται μόνον ᾗ κοινόν τι ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D7","text":"Ἑνὶ μόνον ἓν ἐναντίον ὑπάρχει, ἐπεὶ ἓν τέλειον διάστημα δύο μόνον ἔσχατα ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D8","text":"Πᾶσα ἐναντιότης στέρησίς πώς ἐστιν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐ πᾶσα στέρησις τελεία διαφορὰ γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D9","text":"Τὸ ἴσον ἀμφοῖν, τοῦ μεγάλου καὶ τοῦ μικροῦ, ὡς στερητικὴ συναπόφασις ἀντίκειται καὶ διὰ τοῦτο μεταξύ ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D10","text":"Τὰ μεταξύ καὶ αἱ ὑφειμέναι διαφοραὶ ἐκ τῶν πρώτων ἐναντίων τοῦ γένους παράγονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D11","text":"Τὰ ἄτομα ἐν ταὐτῷ γένει ἕτερα τῷ εἴδει ἐστίν, ἐὰν ἐναντίωσιν ἐν τῷ λόγῳ ἔχῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D12","text":"Τὸ ἄρρεν καὶ τὸ θῆλυ, ἡ λευκότης καὶ ἡ μελανία οὐκ εἰδοποιοῦσιν, ὅταν ἡ ἐναντίωσις ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ καὶ οὐκ ἐν τῷ λόγῳ ᾖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D13","text":"Τὸ φθαρτὸν καὶ τὸ ἄφθαρτον, ἐπειδὴ οὐ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς ἀλλ᾽ ἐν τῇ οὐσίᾳ ἀντίκειται, γένει ἕτερα τίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D14","text":"Ἀδύνατον χωριστὸν ἄφθαρτον παράδειγμα καὶ φθαρτὸν καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ὡς συνώνυμα τῷ αὐτῷ εἴδει περιέχεσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης οὐ πρᾶγμα κοινὸν ὑπὲρ τὰ γένη, ἀλλὰ ἐν ἑκάστῳ γένει ἐνέργεια ὁρισμοῦ, ἀδιαιρεσίας καὶ μετρήσεώς ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD2","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ ἀδιαίρετος ἀρχὴ ἣ τὸ ὂν ὡς ἓν ὁρίζει καὶ τὴν γνῶσιν ὡς μέτρησιν δυνατὴν ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD3","text":"Ἡ τῶν ἀντικειμένων χώρα οὐχ ἑνὶ σχήματι ἀποφάσεως τάττεται, ἀλλὰ διαιρεῖται εἰς ἀντίφασιν, στέρησιν, ἐναντιότητα καὶ σχέσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD4","text":"Ὁ λόγος ὁρίζει τὰ τῶν εἰδῶν πέρατα, ἡ δὲ ὕλη διαφοροποιεῖ τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα ἄνευ ἀναγκαίας εἰδοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD5","text":"Αἱ μεταβολαί, τὰ μεταξύ καὶ αἱ ὕστεραι διαφοραὶ προϋποτίθενται πρώτας ἐναντιώσεις ὡς ἀρχὰς τοῦ γένους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD6","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν χωριστῶν εἰδῶν καταπίπτει, ἐὰν τὸ παράδειγμα ἄφθαρτον ᾖ καὶ τὸ συνώνυμον καθ᾽ ἕκαστον φθαρτόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτὸ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ἓν παρὰ τὰς φύσεις ἐν αἷς ἡ ἑνότης ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι κοινὸν γένος ὃ τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν ὡς εἴδη περιέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι μέτρον ἀπηλλαγμένον τοῦ οἰκείου γένους καὶ τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον βαθμοῦ ἀκριβείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι διαφορὰ ὅπου μηδὲν ταὐτὸν ὑπάρχει καθ᾽ ὃ γίγνεται ἡ σύγκρισις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι καθ᾽ αὑτὸ μεταβολὴ ἐξ ἄλλου γένους εἰς ἄλλο, ἀλλὰ μόνον κατὰ συμβεβηκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX6","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι μεταξύ ἄνευ ἑνὸς δεκτικοῦ πεφυκότος ἀμφότερα τὰ ἐναντία δέχεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX7","text":"Οὐδεμία ἐνδεχομένη ἢ ὑλικὴ διαφορὰ δύναται μόνη τὴν οὐσίαν διαιρεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX8","text":"Οὐ δύναται μία εἰδοποιὸς φύσις ᾗ τοιαύτη τῷ μὲν φθορὰν ἐξ ἀνάγκης, τῷ δὲ ἀφθαρσίαν ἐξ ἀνάγκης παρέχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ οὐσία τοῦ ἑνὸς προαποκλείεται, ἵνα ἡ ἑνότης κατὰ τὰ ὄντα καὶ οὐ παρὰ τὰ ὄντα λέγηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ πασῶν τῶν κατηγοριῶν εἰς ἓν γένος τοῦ ὄντος ἢ τοῦ ἑνὸς ἀδύνατος τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX3","text":"Ἡ τοῦ γιγνώσκοντος κυριότης ὡς αἰτία τῆς ἀληθείας ἀποκλείεται, ἐπεὶ ἡ γνῶσις ὑπὸ τοῦ γνωστοῦ ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται καθόλου διαλεκτικὴ καθ᾽ ἣν πᾶσα ἀπόφασις ἐναντίωσις καὶ πᾶσα συναπόφασις μεταξύ γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ταυτότης εἴδους ἡ διαμένουσα ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν ἐν οὐσίᾳ ἀναγκαίαν φθαρτότητα ἢ ἀφθαρσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS1","text":"Ἡ συναγωγὴ τοῦ συνεχοῦς, τοῦ ὅλου, τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον καὶ τοῦ καθόλου ἀνάγει τοὺς πολλοὺς τρόπους τοῦ ἑνὸς εἰς τὸ ἀδιαίρετον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS2","text":"Τὸ ἀδιαίρετον, ὅταν πρῶτον καὶ συγγενὲς ᾖ, γίνεται μέτρον, τὸ δὲ μέτρον τὸ ποσὸν εἰς ἀριθμὸν ἀνάγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS3","text":"Ἡ καθόλου κατηγορία τοῦ ἑνὸς συντεθεῖσα τῇ ἀδυναμίᾳ χωριστῆς καθόλου οὐσίας παράγει τὸ ἓν ὡς ἐνδογενῆ φύσιν ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS4","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μέτρου καὶ μετρητοῦ ἀνατάσσει τὸ ἓν καὶ τὰ πολλὰ, ἡ δὲ κοινὴ ταυτότης ἀνατάσσει τὴν ἑτερότητα εἰς διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS5","text":"Ἡ τελεία διαφορὰ παράγει δύο ἔσχατα, ἡ στέρησις ὁρίζει θάτερον, καὶ ἡ διάκρισις ἀντιφάσεως καὶ ἐναντιότητος ἀποφαίνεται πότε μεταξύ ἐνδέχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS6","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις ἐν τῷ λόγῳ εἴδη διαιρεῖ, ἡ δὲ ἐναντίωσις ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ μόνον τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα διαφοροποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS7","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαία ἀντίθεσις φθαρτοῦ καὶ ἀφθάρτου ἐν τῇ οὐσίᾳ παράγει γένει ἑτερότητα, ἡ δὲ γένει ἑτερότης ἀποκλείει τὴν συνωνυμίαν χωριστοῦ εἴδους καὶ φθαρτοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φορὰ τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ἕν → ἀδιαίρετον → πρῶτον μέτρον → ἀρχὴ ἀριθμοῦ → ἐνδογενὴς ἑνότης ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF2","text":"Ἡ δευτέρα φορὰ τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· ἓν καὶ πλῆθος → μέτρον καὶ μετρητόν → ταὐτὸν καὶ ἕτερον → διαφορά → τελεία διαφορά → ἐναντίωσις → μεταξύ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF3","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ φορὰ τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν· ἐναντίωσις ἐν λόγῳ ἢ ἐν ὕλῃ → εἰδοποιὸς ἢ μὴ εἰδοποιὸς διαφορά → φθαρτὸν καὶ ἄφθαρτον → ἀπόρριψις συνωνύμων χωριστῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","text":"Τὸ ἓν μετατίθεται ἐκ χωριστοῦ πράγματος εἰς ἀρχὴν ἀδιαιρεσίας καὶ μετρήσεως ἐν ἑκάστῳ γένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME2","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις τοῦ ποσοῦ διαγράφεται ὡς ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ πλήθους εἰς πρῶτον συγγενὲς μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME3","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος διαιρεῖται εἰς ἀριθμὸν μετρητὸν ἑνὶ καὶ εἰς πλῆθος ὑπεροχὴν ἢ ἔλλειψιν ἔχον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις παύεται μία ἀδιαίρετος σχέσις εἶναι καὶ διακρίνεται εἰς ἀντίφασιν, στέρησιν, ἐναντίωσιν καὶ πρός τι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἑτερότης μετατίθεται ἐκ ψιλῆς ἀνομοιότητος εἰς διαφορὰν ἀπαιτοῦσαν κοινὸν γένος ἢ κοινὸν ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME6","text":"Τὸ πέρας τοῦ εἴδους τίθεται ἐν τῷ λόγῳ, οὐκ ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ, τῷ σώματι ἢ τῷ συμβεβηκότι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME7","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φθαρτοῦ καὶ ἀφθάρτου μεταβάλλεται ἐκ πάθους εἰς κριτήριον οὐσιώδους καὶ γενικῆς ἑτερότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Τὰ ἄμεσα ζητούμενα εἰσὶν οἱ τρόποι τοῦ ἑνός, ἡ φύσις τοῦ μέτρου, καὶ οἱ ὅροι τοῦ ταὐτοῦ, τοῦ ἑτέρου, τοῦ ὁμοίου καὶ τοῦ ἐναντίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ἡ διάταξις ἐνεργεῖ διὰ συγγενῶν μέτρων, κοινῶν γενῶν, δεκτικῶν ὑποκειμένων καὶ τελείων διαφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Ὁ λόγος λύει τὰς ἀπορίας διακρίνων τὸ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ἀπὸ τοῦ κυρίου λόγου καὶ μετατιθεὶς τὴν ζήτησιν ἀπὸ τῶν ὀνομάτων εἰς τὰς γεννώσας σχέσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Ἡ οὐσία καθορίζεται διὰ τοῦ λόγου, ἡ δὲ φθορά καὶ ἡ ἀφθαρσία τίθενται ὡς ἀναγκαῖοι τρόποι τοῦ εἶναι, οἳ οὐ δύνανται ὑπὸ μίαν συνώνυμον φύσιν ἀδιαφόρως περιέχεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT1","text":"Τὸ τῶν ἀξιωμάτων σύστημα ἱκανόν ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τοῦ ἑνὸς εἰς τὸ μέτρον, τὴν ἐναντίωσιν καὶ τὴν εἰδοποιὸν διαφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τοῦ ποῖα λέγεται ἓν ἀπὸ τοῦ τί ἐστι τὸ ἑνὶ εἶναι κωλύει τὴν πολυσημίαν ἀντὶ ὁρισμοῦ λαμβάνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ἐν τῇ διακρίσει μέτρου καὶ μετρητοῦ καὶ ἐν τῇ διαιρέσει τῶν τρόπων τῆς ἀντιθέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT4","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ ποσοῦ εἰς τὰ ἄλλα γένη διὰ τοῦ μέτρου ἀληθῶς δηλοῦται, ὁ δὲ τρόπος τῆς ἀναλογίας οὐ πλήρως ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις ἐναντιότητος καὶ μεγίστης διαφορᾶς, καθάπερ καὶ ἡ καθολικὴ εἰδοποιὸς δύναμις τῆς ἐναντιώσεως, ἐπαγωγῇ μᾶλλον ἢ πλήρει ἀποδείξει στηρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT6","text":"Ἡ θέσις ὅτι τὰ ἐναντία ἐν ταὐτῷ γένει ἐστὶ δυσχερῶς συνάπτεται τῷ συμπεράσματι ὅτι τὸ φθαρτὸν καὶ τὸ ἄφθαρτον γένει διαφέρει, καὶ ἡ μεσίτευσις τῆς οὐσιώδους ἀνάγκης οὐ πλήρως ἐκτίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις τοῦ ἄρρενος καὶ τοῦ θήλεος εἰς τὴν ὕλην ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ φυσικῆς αἰτιολογίας ἣ ἐνταῦθα τίθεται μᾶλλον ἢ ἀποδείκνυται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT8","text":"Ἡ σύνθεσις πάντων τῶν μεταξύ ἐκ τῶν ἐναντίων μένει ἀδιοριστοτέρα περὶ τοῦ πότερον ποσοτική, εἰδοποιὸς ἢ γενετικὴ σύνθεσίς ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT9","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῶν χωριστῶν εἰδῶν ἰσχύει ὑπὸ τὴν προϋπόθεσιν ὅτι τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον συνωνύμως καὶ κυρίως ταὐτὸν εἶδος ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT10","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἐκ τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ τῆς ἑνότητος παράγει τὴν τάξιν τῶν διαφορῶν καὶ ἐκ ταύτης τὰ περὶ οὐσίας συμπεράσματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174851327621Z_9628c134","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 10","source_sha256":"ceefd4752a024a269fe56ed7a1fdb2a9543801d6b96674edcd1d9a00b436f2e7","sha256":"f0a802d0a8d45afbea0815dc231a9910307e5c5071fbed8d65c1591df1a23cef","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:48:51.329829+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS1","text":"The account investigates what it is to be one, how it relates to being, and how from it the arrangements of the same, the other, and contraries arise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS2","text":"The one said in many ways is reduced to the indivisible, and most properly to the first measure of each genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS3","text":"The one is neither a separate substance nor a genus, but accompanies being in all the figures of predication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS4","text":"The distinction between measure and measurable determines the relation of the one to the many, while the distinction between otherness and difference determines the order of opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS5","text":"Contrariety, as complete difference, orders the extremes, the intermediates, privations, and specific divisions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS6","text":"The distinction between account and matter judges which contrarieties produce species and which affect only particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","text":"The reasoning is metaphysical and divisive, proceeding from equivocity to definition, from definition to an order of oppositions, and thence to a judgment concerning substance and species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","text":"Every primary and per se mode of the one is reduced to something indivisible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","text":"To be one is to be a determinate this something by being indivisible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","text":"Most properly, the one is the first measure of each genus, and primarily of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","text":"Every measure is connatural with what is measured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5","text":"The first thing in each genus is indivisible either simply or relative to perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","text":"Number is a plurality measurable by one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","text":"No universal can be a separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","text":"The one and being are predicated equally and add nothing else to the being of each thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9","text":"In each genus the one is a certain nature of that genus, not a common nature apart from all genera.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","text":"Every difference presupposes some sameness according to which the different things are compared.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","text":"Contrariety is a complete and greatest difference in the same genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","text":"A complete difference has two extremes and no more.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","text":"Every contrariety contains a complete privation in one of the extremes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","text":"There is no intermediate of contradiction, but there may be one of contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15","text":"Every intermediate is in the same genus as the extremes and is composed from the contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16","text":"The equal is neither great nor small, but is naturally capable of receiving either.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","text":"Only contrariety in the account is species-making; contrariety in matter is not species-making.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18","text":"The corruptible and the incorruptible belong necessarily in substance to things so constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX1","text":"The accidental one does not belong among the primary and per se kinds of the one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX2","text":"What is continuous by contact, binding, or force is not one in the same way as what is continuous by nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX3","text":"What things are called one is not the same as what it is to be one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","text":"The hypothesis of the Pythagoreans and Plato, according to which the one itself is a separate substance, is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX5","text":"Neither the one nor being is a genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX6","text":"Particular measures do not participate in any common separate substance of the one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX7","text":"A measure is not always one in number, nor in every case simply without parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","text":"Knowledge and perception do not properly measure things; rather, they are measured by them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX9","text":"Protagoras' man-as-measure adds nothing beyond the knower or perceiver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX10","text":"The one is not a few, nor are the many simply the same as the multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX11","text":"The one and the many are not in every respect opposed as contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX12","text":"Otherness is not the same as difference, nor is the other the contradiction of the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX13","text":"Contrariety is not contradiction, and not every privation is contrariety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX14","text":"The joint denial of two things not in the same genus does not by itself produce an intermediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX15","text":"Contrarieties in matter, body, or accidents do not necessarily divide species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX16","text":"A separate incorruptible species cannot be the same in species as a corruptible particular.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D1","text":"What is naturally continuous and has in itself the cause of its continuity is more one than what is compounded by binding, because its motion is more indivisible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D2","text":"Quantity qua quantity is known by the one, since every number is measured by the unit.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D3","text":"The unit is the principle of number, not a number insofar as it is indivisible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D4","text":"The one and being do not signify an additional thing, but the determinate being of each thing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D5","text":"In numbers, the one and the many are opposed as measure and measurable, not as contraries simply.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D6","text":"Every being in relation to every being is called either the same or other, but it can differ only insofar as something common belongs to them.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D7","text":"Only one contrary belongs to one thing, since one complete interval has only two extremes.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D8","text":"Every contrariety is in some way a privation, but not every privation becomes a complete difference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D9","text":"The equal is opposed to both the great and the small as a privative joint denial, and for this reason is intermediate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D10","text":"The intermediates and subordinate differences are derived from the primary contraries of the genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D11","text":"Individuals in the same genus are different in species if they possess contrariety in the account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D12","text":"Male and female, whiteness and blackness, do not make species when the contrariety is in matter and not in the account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D13","text":"The corruptible and the incorruptible, because they are opposed not accidentally but in substance, are posited as different in genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:D14","text":"It is impossible for a separate incorruptible paradigm and a corruptible particular to be contained as synonymous under the same species.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","text":"Unity is not a common thing above the genera, but in each genus it is an activity of definition, indivisibility, and measurement.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD2","text":"The same indivisible principle both defines being as one and makes knowledge possible as measurement.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD3","text":"The domain of opposites is not ordered according to one form of negation, but is divided into contradiction, privation, contrariety, and relation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD4","text":"The account determines the boundaries of species, while matter differentiates particulars without necessary species-making.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD5","text":"Changes, intermediates, and subsequent differences presuppose primary contrarieties as principles of the genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD6","text":"The theory of separate species collapses if the paradigm is incorruptible and the synonymous particular is corruptible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1","text":"There is no one itself by itself apart from the natures in which unity is defined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX2","text":"There is no common genus that contains being and the one as species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX3","text":"There is no measure detached from its proper genus and its particular degree of precision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX4","text":"There is no difference where no sameness belongs according to which comparison takes place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX5","text":"There is no per se change from one genus into another, but only accidental change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX6","text":"There is no intermediate without one receptive thing naturally fitted to receive both contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX7","text":"No contingent or material difference can by itself divide substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX8","text":"One species-making nature, insofar as it is such, cannot necessarily confer corruption on one thing and incorruptibility on another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","text":"The separate substance of the one is precluded, so that unity may be spoken of according to beings and not apart from beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX2","text":"The reduction of all categories to one genus of being or of the one is declared impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX3","text":"The sovereignty of the knower as a cause of truth is excluded, since knowledge is determined by the knowable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX4","text":"Any dialectic according to which every negation becomes contrariety and every joint denial an intermediate is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX5","text":"Sameness of species that remains indifferent to necessary corruptibility or incorruptibility in substance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS1","text":"The collection of the continuous, the whole, the particular, and the universal reduces the many modes of the one to the indivisible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS2","text":"The indivisible, when it is first and connatural, becomes a measure, and the measure reduces quantity to number.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS3","text":"The universal predication of the one, combined with the impossibility of a separate universal substance, yields the one as an immanent nature of each genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS4","text":"The relation of measure and measurable orders the one and the many, while common sameness orders otherness into difference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS5","text":"Complete difference yields two extremes, privation determines one of them, and the distinction between contradiction and contrariety declares when an intermediate is possible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS6","text":"Contrariety in the account divides species, whereas contrariety in matter differentiates only particulars.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS7","text":"The necessary opposition of corruptible and incorruptible in substance yields difference in genus, and difference in genus excludes the synonymy of a separate species and a corruptible particular.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","text":"The first course of the account is: one said in many ways → indivisible → first measure → principle of number → immanent unity of each genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF2","text":"The second course of the account is: one and plurality → measure and measurable → same and other → difference → complete difference → contrariety → intermediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF3","text":"The final course of the account is: contrariety in account or in matter → species-making or non-species-making difference → corruptible and incorruptible → rejection of synonymous separate species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","text":"The one is shifted from a separate thing to a principle of indivisibility and measurement in each genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME2","text":"Knowledge of quantity is outlined as a reduction of plurality to a first connatural measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME3","text":"Plurality is divided into number measurable by one and plurality possessing excess or deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME4","text":"Opposition ceases to be one undivided relation and is distinguished into contradiction, privation, contrariety, and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME5","text":"Otherness is shifted from bare dissimilarity to difference requiring a common genus or common subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME6","text":"The boundary of species is posited in the account, not in matter, body, or accident.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME7","text":"The distinction between corruptible and incorruptible is transformed from an affection into a criterion of substantial and generic otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate questions are the modes of the one, the nature of measure, and the terms of the same, the other, the similar, and the contrary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The arrangement operates through connatural measures, common genera, receptive subjects, and complete differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The account resolves the aporiai by distinguishing what is said in many ways from the primary account and by shifting the inquiry from names to the generating relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Substance is determined through the account, while corruption and incorruptibility are posited as necessary modes of being, which cannot indifferently be contained under one synonymous nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT1","text":"The system of axioms is sufficient for reconstructing the movement from the one to measure, contrariety, and species-making difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT2","text":"The distinction between what is called one and what it is to be one prevents equivocity from being taken in place of definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT3","text":"The arrangement is strongest in the distinction between measure and measurable and in the division of the modes of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT4","text":"The transition from quantity to the other genera through measure is truly indicated, but the mode of analogy is not fully defined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT5","text":"The identification of contrariety with greatest difference, as also the universal species-making power of contrariety, rests more on induction than on complete demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT6","text":"The position that contraries are in the same genus is connected with difficulty to the conclusion that the corruptible and the incorruptible differ in genus, and the mediation of substantial necessity is not fully expounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT7","text":"The attribution of male and female to matter depends upon a natural explanation that is posited here rather than demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT8","text":"The composition of all intermediates from contraries remains indeterminate as to whether it is quantitative, species-making, or generative composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT9","text":"The rejection of separate species holds under the presupposition that the species and the particular have the same species synonymously and properly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true course of the account, because from the definition of unity it derives the order of differences and from this the conclusions concerning substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_2:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BO_2:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 10"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 10","title":"Book 10","context":"Chapter 10","original_title":"Book 10","original_context":"Chapter 10"},"original_title":"Book 10","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3","layer":"CH","title":"Book 11","order":11,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BO_3"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_3@R001","sha256":"8a5293363597cebfb7dd9add0844d5138f59870fc015e50b658a8c2594610f90","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS1","text":"Ζητεῖται πῶς μία σοφία δύναται περὶ πολλὰ καὶ γένει διαφέροντα ὄντα, περὶ τὰς ἀρχὰς αὐτῶν καὶ περὶ τὰς κοινὰς ἀρχὰς τῆς ἀποδείξεως εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS2","text":"Τὸ ὂν, καίπερ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον, πρὸς ἕν τι καὶ κοινὸν ἀνάγεται, ὥστε μίαν ἐπιστήμην δέχεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS3","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία θεωρεῖ τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὄν, τὰ τούτῳ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ συμβεβηκότα, τὰς πρώτας ἐναντιώσεις καὶ τὰς κοινὰς ἀποδεικτικὰς ἀρχάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS4","text":"Ἡ βεβαιοτάτη ἀρχὴ οὐκ ἀποδείκνυται ἁπλῶς, ἀλλὰ πρὸς τὸν ἀντιλέγοντα ἐλέγχεται διὰ τῶν ἀναγκαίων ὅρων τοῦ σημαίνειν καὶ τοῦ διαλέγεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS5","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῶν θεωρητικῶν ἐπιστημῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ τοῦ εἰ ἔστι χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία· ταύτης γὰρ οὔσης ἡ θεολογικὴ πρώτη καὶ καθόλου γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS6","text":"Τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκός, ἡ κίνησις, τὸ ἄπειρον καὶ αἱ μεταβολαὶ διορίζονται διὰ τοῦ ἀποκλείειν τὴν ἀναγκαίαν αἰτιότητα, τὴν οὐσιοποίησιν τῶν ἀφαιρέσεων καὶ τὴν σύγχυσιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς διαγνωστικῶς καὶ ἀνασυστατικῶς κινεῖται ἐξ ἀπορίας εἰς διάκρισιν τῶν σημαινομένων, ἐκ ταύτης εἰς ἀναγωγὴν πρὸς ἕν, καὶ ἐκ τῆς ἀναγωγῆς εἰς ὁρισμοὺς καὶ ἀποκλεισμούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","text":"Ἑκάστη μερικὴ ἐπιστήμη περιγράφει τι γένος καὶ τὸ τί ἐστιν αὐτοῦ λαβοῦσα ὡς ὑποκείμενον τὰ λοιπὰ ἀποδείκνυσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία θεωρεῖ τὸ ὂν καθόλου ᾗ ὄν, οὐχ ᾗ τοιόνδε τι ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","text":"Τὸ ὂν πολλαχῶς μὲν λέγεται, πάντα δὲ τὰ σημαινόμενα πρὸς ἕν τι καὶ κοινὸν ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","text":"Τῶν πρὸς ἓν λεγομένων μία δύναται εἶναι ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A5","text":"Τὰ ἐναντία μιᾶς ἐπιστήμης ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ αἱ ἐναντιώσεις εἰς πρώτας διαφορὰς καὶ στερήσεις ἀνάγονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A6","text":"Αἱ κοινόταται ἀποδεικτικαὶ ἀρχαὶ τοῖς οὖσιν ᾗ ὄντα ὑπάρχουσι καὶ διὰ τοῦτο τῇ πρώτῃ φιλοσοφίᾳ προσήκουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","text":"Ἀδύνατον τὸ αὐτὸ καθ᾽ ἕνα καὶ τὸν αὐτὸν χρόνον εἶναί τε καὶ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","text":"Τῆς βεβαιοτάτης ἀρχῆς οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῆ ἀπόδειξις ἐκ πιστοτέρας ἀρχῆς, ἔστι δὲ ἔλεγχος πρὸς τὸν ἀντιλέγοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","text":"Κοινωνία λόγου ἀπαιτεῖ ἕκαστον ὄνομα γνώριμόν τι καὶ ἓν ὡρισμένον σημαίνειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A10","text":"Ποιητικὴ μὲν ἐπιστήμη τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἐν τῷ ποιοῦντι, πρακτικὴ δὲ ἐν τῷ πράττοντι, φυσικὴ δὲ ἐν αὐτῷ τῷ κινουμένῳ τίθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","text":"Τρία γένη θεωρητικῶν ἐπιστημῶν ἐστίν, φυσική, μαθηματικὴ καὶ θεολογική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","text":"Εἰ ἔστι χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία, ἡ περὶ αὐτὴν ἐπιστήμη πρώτη καὶ καθόλου ἐστὶ τῷ προτέρα εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","text":"Πᾶσα ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ἀεὶ ὄντος ἢ τοῦ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολύ ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","text":"Τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς οὔτε ἀεὶ οὔτε ἐξ ἀνάγκης οὔτε ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολὺ γίνεται, καὶ τὰ αἴτια αὐτοῦ ἄτακτα καὶ ἀόριστά ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","text":"Κίνησίς ἐστιν ἡ τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος ᾗ τοιοῦτον ἐντελέχεια ἐν τῷ κινητῷ ὑπὸ τοῦ κινητικοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16","text":"Κίνησις καθ᾽ αὑτὴν μόνον κατὰ ποιόν, ποσὸν ἢ τόπον ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A17","text":"Μεταβολῆς μεταβολὴ καὶ κινήσεως κίνησις καθ᾽ αὑτὰς οὐκ εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18","text":"Τὸ ἄπειρον οὔτε χωριστὴ οὐσία οὔτε ἐνεργείᾳ σῶμά ἐστιν, ἀλλὰ πάθος ποσότητος καθ᾽ ἕτερόν τι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19","text":"Συνεχῆ ἐστιν ὧν τὰ ἁπτόμενα πέρατα ταὐτὸ καὶ ἓν γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τῆς σοφίας οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ τὰς πάντων τῶν ὄντων ἀρχὰς ἓν γένος ἢ ἐναντία εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὐ γένη ἐστίν, ἐπεὶ αἱ διαφοραὶ γένους οὐ μετέχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX3","text":"Τὰ χωριστὰ εἴδη καὶ τὰ μεταξύ τιθέμενα μαθηματικὰ οὐ παρέχει βέβαιον ὑποκείμενον τῇ ζητουμένῃ ἐπιστήμῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX4","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία οὐ ταὐτίζεται οὔτε τῇ περὶ τὰ φθαρτὰ αἰσθητὰ φυσικῇ οὔτε τῇ περὶ τὰ μὴ χωριστὰ μαθηματικῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX5","text":"Οὔτε ἡ ὕλη ὡς μόνον δυνάμει οὖσα οὔτε τὸ φθαρτὸν εἶδος ἱκανὴ ἀΐδιος καὶ χωριστὴ ἀρχή ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX6","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὐ δύναται ὡς χωριστὴ οὐσία κατηγορεῖσθαι πάντων, ἐπεὶ οὐ πάντα τὰ ὄντα οὐσίαι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX7","text":"Οὔτε ἡ φυσικὴ οὔτε ἡ διαλεκτικὴ οὔτε ἡ σοφιστικὴ θεωρεῖ τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX8","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς μὴ ἀντιφάσεως οὐκ ἀποδείκνυται δι᾽ ἑτέρας προτέρας καὶ πιστοτέρας ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX9","text":"Ἡ Ἡρακλείτειος συναλήθευσις τῶν ἀντικειμένων φάσεων ἀναιρεῖ τὸ ἴδιον αὐτῆς λεγόμενον καὶ πᾶσαν ὡρισμένην σημασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX10","text":"Τὸ φαινόμενον ἑκάστῳ οὐκ ἔστι μέτρον τοῦ ὄντος, οὐδὲ πᾶσαι αἱ ἀντιμαχόμεναι δόξαι ὁμοίως ἀληθεῖς εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","text":"Τοῦ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς οὐκ ἔστιν ἐπιστήμη, καὶ ἡ τύχη οὐκ ἔστι πρώτη καθ᾽ αὑτὴν αἰτία τῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX12","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὔτε ἑτερότης οὔτε ἀνισότης οὔτε μὴ ὂν οὔτε ψιλὴ δύναμις οὔτε τελεία ἐνέργεια ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX13","text":"Ἄπειρος χωριστὴ οὐσία, ἄπειρον ἐνεργείᾳ σῶμα καὶ ἄπειρος κεχωρισμένος ἀριθμὸς οὐκ εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX14","text":"Γένεσις καὶ φθορὰ οὐ κινήσεις εἰσίν, οὐδὲ μεταβολὴ δύναται καθ᾽ αὑτὴν ὑποκείμενον ἑτέρας μεταβολῆς γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D1","text":"Ἡ πολλαχῶς λεγομένη τοῦ ὄντος φύσις μίαν ἐπιστήμην δέχεται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πολλαχότης αὐτῆς ἀναφορικὴ καὶ οὐ ψιλῶς ὁμώνυμός ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D2","text":"Ὁ φιλόσοφος δύναται τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ πλῆθος, τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον, καὶ τὰς λοιπὰς πρώτας ἐναντιώσεις θεωρεῖν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D3","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν κοινῶν ἀποδεικτικῶν ἀρχῶν οὐκ ἄλλῃ μερικῇ ἐπιστήμῃ ἀλλὰ τῇ πρώτῃ φιλοσοφίᾳ ἀνήκει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D4","text":"Ὁ τὴν μὴ ἀντίφασιν ἀρνούμενος ἐλέγχεται ἐξ αὐτοῦ τοῦ ὡρισμένον τι σημαίνειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D5","text":"Ἡ καθόλου ἄρνησις τῆς ἀληθείας αὐτὴν ἑαυτὴν ἀναιρεῖ, ἐπειδὴ ἀληθῆ τινὰ ἀπόφανσιν ποιεῖσθαι ἀναγκάζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D6","text":"Ἡ ἐξίσωσις πάσης φάσεως καὶ ἀποφάσεως ἀναιρεῖ τὰς διαφορὰς τῶν πραγμάτων καὶ τὴν περὶ αὐτὰ προαίρεσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D7","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καὶ ἡ μαθηματικὴ μέρη σοφίας εἰσίν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὂν θεωροῦσιν ὑφ᾽ ὡρισμένην μόνον ὄψιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D8","text":"Ἡ θεολογικὴ τῆς φυσικῆς προτέρα γίνεται μόνον ἐὰν χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία ὑπάρχῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία καθόλου ἐστὶν οὐχ ὡς γένος πάντα περιέχουσα, ἀλλὰ τῷ περὶ τὸ φύσει πρότερον εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D10","text":"Τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς ἔξω τῆς ἀποδεικτικῆς ἐπιστήμης πίπτει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D11","text":"Ἡ ἀόριστος αἰτιότης τοῦ συμβεβηκότος διασῴζει τὸ ἐνδέχεσθαι γενέσθαι καὶ μὴ γενέσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μέση τίς ἐστι μεταξὺ ψιλῆς δυνάμεως καὶ τετελεσμένης ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13","text":"Ἀλλοίωσις, αὔξησις ἢ φθίσις, καὶ φορὰ τὰ τρία γένη κινήσεώς εἰσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D14","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ κατ᾽ ἀντίφασιν μεταβολαί εἰσιν, οὐ κινήσεις ἐν ὑποκειμένῳ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D15","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐ δύναται ἑαυτὴν ὡς ὑποκείμενον ἔχειν ἄνευ ἀπείρου ἀναδρομῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D16","text":"Τὸ ἄπειρον οὐ δύναται πρώτη οὐσία ἢ στοιχεῖον εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D17","text":"Πᾶν συνεχὲς ἁπτόμενόν ἐστιν, οὐ πᾶν δὲ ἁπτόμενον συνεχές.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς μεταφυσικῆς συνίσταται ἐν ἀναγωγῇ καὶ προτεραιότητι, οὐκ ἐν ἑνὶ ἀνωτάτῳ γένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἐπιστήμης κρίνεται ἐκ τοῦ κοινοῦ τρόπου ἀναφορᾶς τῶν ὑποκειμένων, οὐκ ἐκ τῆς ὁμογενείας αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3","text":"Ἡ ὡρισμένη σημασία τοῦ λόγου καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις ἀλλήλας στηρίζουσιν, ὥστε ἡ ἀναίρεσις τῆς μιᾶς καὶ τὴν ἄλλην ἀναιρεῖν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","text":"Ἡ τοῦ συμβεβηκότος ἀοριστία ἀποτελεῖ ὅρον τῆς ἐνδεχομενικότητος καὶ ἀποκλείει καθολικὴν αἰτιακὴν ἀνάγκην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD5","text":"Ἡ πρωτεία τῆς θεολογικῆς οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπροϋπόθετος, ἀλλ᾽ ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ ἀποδείξει χωριστῆς καὶ ἀκινήτου οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD6","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ὑπάρχει ὡς ἀτελὴς ἐνέργεια, ἐπειδὴ ἐντελέχεια μέν ἐστι, τοῦ δυνάμει δὲ ᾗ δυνάμει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD7","text":"Ἡ ἀπαγόρευσις τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ἀπείρου κωλύει τὰ πάθη τῆς ποσότητος καὶ τὰ πέρατα τῶν σωμάτων οὐσιοποιεῖσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D16","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX1","text":"Οὐ δεῖ πᾶσαν μίαν ἐπιστήμην ἓν γένος μονοσήμως λεγόμενον ἔχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX2","text":"Οὐ δεῖ τὸ ὂν ὡς ἀνώτατον γένος νοεῖν, ἵνα καθόλου ἐπιστήμη δυνατὴ γένηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX3","text":"Οὐ πᾶσα ἀρχὴ λόγον ἑτέρας προτέρας ἀρχῆς ἀπαιτεῖ, ἐπεὶ οὕτως ἡ ἀπόδειξις εἰς ἄπειρον προβαίνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX4","text":"Ὁ μηδὲν ὡρισμένον σημαίνων οὐκ ἀντίκειται λόγῳ, ἀλλ᾽ ἔξω τῆς κοινωνίας τοῦ λόγου τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX5","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν φαινομένων οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὸ ψεῦδος, οὐδὲ μεταβάλλει πᾶσαν αἴσθησιν εἰς ἴσον κριτήριον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX6","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης οὐ δύναται πᾶν γεγονὸς εἰς ἀναγκαίαν ἅλυσιν κλείειν ἄνευ ἀναιρέσεως τοῦ ἐνδεχομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX7","text":"Τὰ ἐξ ἀφαιρέσεως νοούμενα, τὰ πέρατα καὶ τὸ ἄπειρον οὐ δεῖ μεταβάλλειν εἰς χωριστὰς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX8","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι μεταβολὴ μεταβολῆς, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε ὑποκείμενον οὔτε ἔσχατον εἶδος αὐτῇ ἀποδοθῆναι δύναται ἄνευ ἀπείρου ἀναδρομῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀόριστος ταυτότης, καθ᾽ ἣν τὸ αὐτὸ ἅμα ἐστὶ καὶ οὐκ ἔστι, ἀδύνατος τίθεται, ἐπειδὴ λόγον, ἐπιστήμην καὶ πρᾶξιν ἅμα ἀφανίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX2","text":"Τὸ μὴ ὂν καὶ τὸ συμβεβηκὸς οὐ δύναται πρώτη χώρα τῆς ἐξηγήσεως γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX3","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία οὐ δύναται τὴν θεολογικὴν μορφὴν ἀπολύτως λαβεῖν πρὶν δειχθῆναι χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX4","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐ δύναται εἰς στέρησιν, δύναμιν ἢ τετελεσμένην ἐνέργειαν ἁπλῶς ἀναχθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ οὐρανοῦ οὐ δύναται ἐκ τύχης ὡς πρώτης αἰτίας γεννᾶσθαι, ἐπειδὴ τὸ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς τοῦ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ὕστερόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη γένεσις τοῦ συλλογισμοῦ ἔχει οὕτως· πολλὰ γένη ὄντων → ἀπορία περὶ μιᾶς σοφίας → ζήτησις ἑνότητος μὴ γενικῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS2","text":"Ἡ λύσις τῆς ἐπιστημονικῆς πολλαχότητος ἔχει οὕτως· πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ὄν → ἀναφορὰ πρὸς ἕν → μία θεωρία τοῦ ὄντος ᾗ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS3","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν ἐναντίων ἔχει οὕτως· πολλαὶ ἐναντιώσεις → στέρησις καὶ πρώται διαφοραί → μία ἐπιστήμη τῶν ἀντικειμένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάθεσις τῶν κοινῶν ἀρχῶν ἔχει οὕτως· καθόλου ἰσχύς → τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὄν → πρώτη φιλοσοφία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5","text":"Ὁ ἔλεγχος τῆς ἀντιφάσεως ἔχει οὕτως· ἄρνησις τῆς ἀρχῆς → ἀνάγκη ὡρισμένης σημασίας → χρήση τῆς ἀρχῆς → αὐτοαναίρεσις τῆς ἀρνήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS6","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τοῦ σχετικισμοῦ ἔχει οὕτως· διαφωνία φαινομένων → διάκρισις κριτηρίου καὶ πάθους → ἀποκλεισμὸς τῆς ἴσης ἀληθείας πάντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS7","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῶν ἐπιστημῶν ἔχει οὕτως· διαφορὰ τῶν ἀρχῶν κινήσεως → διάκρισις πρακτικῆς, ποιητικῆς καὶ θεωρητικῆς → φυσικὴ, μαθηματικὴ καὶ θεολογική → ὑπόθεσις χωριστοῦ ἀκινήτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS8","text":"Ὁ διορισμὸς τοῦ συμβεβηκότος ἔχει οὕτως· ἔλλειψις ἀναγκαιότητος καὶ συχνότητος → ἀόριστα αἴτια → ἀδυναμία ἐπιστήμης → διατήρησις τοῦ ἐνδεχομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS9","text":"Ὁ ὁρισμὸς τῆς κινήσεως ἔχει οὕτως· δύναμις → ἐντελέχεια τοῦ δυνατοῦ ᾗ δυνατόν → ἀτελὴς ἐνέργεια → κίνησις κατὰ ποιόν, ποσὸν ἢ τόπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS10","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ἀπείρου ἔχει οὕτως· οὐσιοποίησις τοῦ ἀπείρου → ἀντίφασις διαιρετοῦ καὶ ἀδιαιρέτου → ἀδυναμία χωριστῆς ὑπάρξεως → πάθος ποσότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS11","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῆς μεταβολῆς ἔχει οὕτως· ἀντίφασις → γένεσις ἢ φθορά· ἐναντία ἐν ὑποκειμένῳ → κίνησις· κοινὸν πέρας → συνέχεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF1","text":"Ἡ φορά ἄρχεται ἀπὸ τῆς ἀπορίας εἰ μία ἐπιστήμη δύναται πολλῶν ἀνομοίων ἀρχῶν καὶ οὐσιῶν εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ γένους εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα τῆς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF3","text":"Ἡ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ θεμελιοῖ μίαν θεωρίαν τοῦ ὄντος, τῶν παθῶν αὐτοῦ καὶ τῶν πρώτων ἐναντιώσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF4","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τοῦ ὄντος ἀναλαμβάνει τὰς κοινὰς ἀρχάς, καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις ἐλέγχεται διὰ τῆς ἀναγκαίας σημασίας τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη τῶν ὄντων διακρίνεται εἰς μερικὰς θεωρίας καὶ εἰς πρώτην θεωρίαν, ἧς ἡ πρωτεία ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ χωριστῆς ἀκινήτου οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF6","text":"Τὸ ὂν διαιρεῖται εἰς καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ κατὰ συμβεβηκός, καὶ τὸ δεύτερον ἐκβάλλεται ἐκ τῆς ἀναγκαίας ἐπιστήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF7","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια παρέχουσι τὸν ὁρισμὸν τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τοὺς ὅρους τῶν εἰδῶν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF8","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ φορά ἀποκλείει τὸ χωριστὸν ἄπειρον καὶ τάττει γένεσιν, φθοράν, κίνησιν, ἠρεμίαν, ἁφήν καὶ συνέχεια κατὰ διακεκριμένους λόγους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τῆς ἐπιστήμης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὁμογένειαν τῶν πραγμάτων εἰς τὴν κοινὴν πρὸς ἓν ἀναφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME2","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν παύει νοούμενον ὡς γένος καὶ τίθεται ὡς διακατηγορικὸς ὅρος τῶν ὄντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME3","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία μετατίθεται ἐκ μιᾶς παραλλήλου ἐπιστήμης εἰς θεωρίαν τῶν κοινῶν ὅρων πάσης ἀποδείξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME4","text":"Ἡ διαφωνία τῶν φαινομένων παύει ἀποτελοῦσα ἴσην πολλαπλότητα ἀληθειῶν καὶ γίνεται ζήτημα διαθέσεως τοῦ κρίνοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME5","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς καὶ ἡ τύχη μετατίθενται ἐκ τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων εἰς τὴν ἀόριστον καὶ παράγωγον περιφέρειαν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME6","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μετατίθεται ἐκ τοῦ μὴ ὄντος καὶ τῆς ἑτερότητος εἰς ὡρισμένην σχέσιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐντελεχείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME7","text":"Τὸ ἄπειρον μετατίθεται ἐκ χωριστῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ ὅλου εἰς ἐξαρτώμενον πάθος μεγέθους, ἀριθμοῦ, κινήσεως καὶ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME8","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ διαγράφεται ἐκ νέου διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως ἀντιφάσεως, ἐναντιότητος, κινήσεως, γενέσεως, φθορᾶς καὶ συνεχείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT1","text":"Ἐν τῷ ἐπιφανειακῷ βαθμῷ ὁ λόγος ἀπορεῖ περὶ τῆς μιᾶς σοφίας καὶ ὁρίζει τὸ συμβεβηκός, τὴν κίνησιν, τὸ ἄπειρον καὶ τὰ εἴδη μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT2","text":"Ἐν τῷ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμῷ αἱ ἐπιστῆμαι τάττονται κατὰ τὸ ὑφ᾽ ὃ θεωροῦσι τὸ ὄν καὶ κατὰ τὴν προτεραιότητα τοῦ ἐπιστητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT3","text":"Ἐν τῷ ὑπερστρατηγικῷ βαθμῷ ἡ ἀντίρρησις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὸ λεγόμενον εἰς τοὺς ὅρους ὑφ᾽ οὓς σημασία, διάλογος καὶ ἀπόδειξις δυνατὰ γίγνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT4","text":"Ἐν τῷ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμῷ ἡ πραγματικότης διαιρεῖται εἰς καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ συμβεβηκός, δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν, φθαρτὸν καὶ ἀκίνητον, ἀναγκαῖον καὶ ἐνδεχόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἐξαιρεθέντα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀναγωγῆς τοῦ ὄντος πρὸς μίαν ἐπιστήμην καὶ τῶν ἐφεξῆς διορισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2","text":"Ἀδιοριστότερον τοῦ δέοντος μένει τί ποτε ἀκριβῶς ἐστὶ τὸ ἓν πρὸς ὃ πάντα τὰ σημαινόμενα τοῦ ὄντος ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάταξις μάλιστα συμφωνεῖ ὅπου διακρίνει τὴν πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα ἀπὸ τῆς τοῦ γένους ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτάτη ἀπόδειξις ἐστὶν ὁ ἐλεγκτικὸς δεσμὸς μεταξὺ ὡρισμένης σημασίας, κοινωνίας λόγου καὶ μὴ ἀντιφάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ ὄνομα ἓν σημαίνειν εἰς τὸ ἐξ ἀνάγκης εἶναι τὸ σημαινόμενον πυκνοτέρα τοῦ ἀποδεδειγμένου μένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ὕπαρξις χωριστῆς καὶ ἀκινήτου οὐσίας οὐ δείκνυται ἐνταῦθα, ὥστε ἡ πρωτεία τῆς θεολογικῆς ὑποθετικὴ παραμένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀπόκρουσις τοῦ Πρωταγόρου ἰσχύει μάλιστα περὶ διεφθαρμένων αἰσθητηρίων καὶ πρακτικῶν ἀτοπιῶν, οὐ λύει δὲ πλήρως πᾶσαν διαφωνίαν περὶ καλοῦ καὶ ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT8","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τοῦ συμβεβηκότος συμφωνεῖ ἐντὸς ἑαυτῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀδυναμία ἐπιστήμης, ἡ ἀοριστία τῶν αἰτίων καὶ ἡ σωτηρία τοῦ ἐνδεχομένου ἀλλήλαις ἕπονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT9","text":"Οἱ περὶ κινήσεως, ἀπείρου καὶ συνεχείας λόγοι προϋποτίθενται πλείονας φυσικὰς διαιρέσεις καὶ ἐπαγωγὰς ἢ ὅσας αὐτοτελῶς ἐνταῦθα θεμελιοῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT10","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἐξ ἀποριῶν περὶ ἑνότητος διὰ ἀποφατικῶν ὅρων εἰς ἱεραρχίαν ἐπιστημῶν καὶ ὀντολογικῶν διορισμῶν προβαίνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T174931115433Z_5e3685d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 11","source_sha256":"8a5293363597cebfb7dd9add0844d5138f59870fc015e50b658a8c2594610f90","sha256":"0ed1890230c28d500894237707da06d2d9c15f9a5174bee3184e8aed0966bc19","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:49:31.117406+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS1","text":"It is asked how one wisdom can concern many beings differing in genus, their principles, and the common principles of demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS2","text":"Being, although spoken of in many ways, is referred to some one common thing, so as to admit one science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS3","text":"First philosophy contemplates being qua being, its attributes in itself, the primary contrarieties, and the common demonstrative principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS4","text":"The most certain principle is not simply demonstrated, but is refutatively established against one who denies it through the necessary conditions of signifying and discoursing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS5","text":"The ordering of the theoretical sciences depends on whether there is separate and unmoved substance; for if there is, theology becomes primary and universal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS6","text":"The accidental, motion, the infinite, and changes are delimited by excluding necessary causation, the substantialization of abstractions, and the confusion of potency and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","text":"The reasoning proceeds diagnostically and reconstructively from aporia to distinction of meanings, thence to reference to one, and from the reference to definitions and exclusions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","text":"Each particular science delimits some genus and, taking what it is as its subject, demonstrates the rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","text":"First philosophy contemplates being universally qua being, not qua some particular kind of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","text":"Being is spoken of in many ways, but all its significations are referred to some one common thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","text":"Of things spoken of with reference to one, there can be one science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A5","text":"Contraries belong to one science, since contrarieties are referred to primary differences and privations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A6","text":"The most common demonstrative principles belong to beings qua beings and therefore pertain to first philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","text":"It is impossible for the same thing both to be and not to be in the same respect and at the same time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","text":"Of the most certain principle there is no simple demonstration from a more certain principle, but there is a refutation against one who denies it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","text":"Communion in discourse requires each name to signify something known and one determinate thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A10","text":"Productive science places the principle of motion in the producer, practical science in the agent, and natural science in the thing moved itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","text":"There are three kinds of theoretical sciences: natural science, mathematics, and theology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","text":"If there is separate and unmoved substance, the science concerning it is primary and universal by being prior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","text":"Every science concerns what is always or what is for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","text":"The accidental comes to be neither always nor necessarily nor for the most part, and its causes are disorderly and indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","text":"Motion is the actuality in the moved thing, caused by the mover, of that which is potentially being qua such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16","text":"Motion in itself exists only in respect of quality, quantity, or place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A17","text":"A change of change and a motion of motion do not exist in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18","text":"The infinite is neither separate substance nor an actually existing body, but an attribute of quantity relative to something else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19","text":"Things are continuous when their touching limits become the same and one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX1","text":"The unity of wisdom does not require the principles of all beings to be one genus or contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","text":"Being and one are not genera, since the differences of a genus do not participate in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX3","text":"Separate Forms and the intermediate mathematical objects posited do not provide a secure subject for the science sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX4","text":"First philosophy is identified neither with natural science concerning perishable sensibles nor with mathematics concerning non-separate things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX5","text":"Neither matter, as existing only potentially, nor perishable form is an adequate eternal and separate principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX6","text":"Being and one cannot be predicated of all as separate substance, since not all beings are substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX7","text":"Neither natural science, nor dialectic, nor sophistry contemplates being qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX8","text":"The principle of non-contradiction is not demonstrated through another prior and more certain principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX9","text":"The Heraclitean simultaneous truth of opposed assertions destroys its own assertion and every determinate signification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX10","text":"What appears to each person is not a measure of being, nor are all conflicting opinions equally true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","text":"There is no science of the accidental, and chance is not a primary cause in itself of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX12","text":"Motion is neither otherness, nor inequality, nor non-being, nor bare potency, nor complete actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX13","text":"There is no infinite separate substance, actually infinite body, or infinite separate number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX14","text":"Coming-to-be and perishing are not motions, nor can a change itself become the subject of another change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D1","text":"The nature of being, spoken of in many ways, admits one science, because its multiplicity is relational and not merely homonymous.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D2","text":"The philosopher can contemplate the one and the many, the same and the other, and the remaining primary contrarieties.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D3","text":"The study of common demonstrative principles belongs not to another particular science but to first philosophy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D4","text":"One who denies non-contradiction is refuted from the very fact of signifying something determinate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D5","text":"The universal denial of truth destroys itself, since it is compelled to make some true assertion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D6","text":"The equalization of every affirmation and negation destroys the differences among things and choice concerning them.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D7","text":"Natural science and mathematics are parts of wisdom, because they contemplate being only under a determinate aspect.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D8","text":"Theology becomes prior to natural science only if separate and unmoved substance exists.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9","text":"First philosophy is universal not as a genus containing everything, but by concerning what is prior by nature.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D10","text":"The accidental falls outside demonstrative science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D11","text":"The indeterminate causality of the accidental preserves the possibility of coming to be and not coming to be.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","text":"Motion is something intermediate between bare potency and completed actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13","text":"Alteration, increase or diminution, and locomotion are the three kinds of motion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D14","text":"Coming-to-be and perishing are changes according to contradiction, not motions in a subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D15","text":"Motion cannot have itself as subject without infinite regress.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D16","text":"The infinite cannot be primary substance or an element.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:D17","text":"Everything continuous is touching, but not everything touching is continuous.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","text":"The universality of metaphysics consists in reference and priority, not in one highest genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","text":"The unity of a science is judged from the common mode of reference of its subjects, not from their homogeneity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3","text":"The determinate signification of discourse and non-contradiction support one another, so that the destruction of one destroys the other also.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","text":"The indeterminacy of the accidental constitutes a condition of contingency and excludes universal causal necessity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD5","text":"The primacy of theology is not unconditioned, but follows upon the demonstration of separate and unmoved substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD6","text":"Motion exists as incomplete actuality, because it is actuality, but of what is potential qua potential.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD7","text":"The prohibition of an actually infinite prevents the attributes of quantity and the limits of bodies from being substantialized.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A18","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A19","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D16","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX1","text":"Not every one science must have one genus spoken of univocally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX2","text":"Being need not be conceived as the highest genus for a universal science to be possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX3","text":"Not every principle requires an account from another prior principle, since then demonstration proceeds to infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX4","text":"One who signifies nothing determinate does not oppose discourse, but is placed outside communion in discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX5","text":"The difference among appearances does not eliminate falsity, nor does it turn every perception into an equal criterion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX6","text":"Causality cannot enclose every event in a necessary chain without destroying contingency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX7","text":"Things conceived by abstraction, limits, and the infinite must not be transformed into separate substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX8","text":"There is no change of change, because neither a subject nor a final form can be assigned to it without infinite regress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX1","text":"Indeterminate identity, according to which the same thing is and is not at once, is posited as impossible, since it simultaneously obliterates discourse, science, and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX2","text":"Non-being and the accidental cannot become the primary domain of explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX3","text":"First philosophy cannot absolutely assume the theological form before separate and unmoved substance has been shown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX4","text":"Motion cannot simply be reduced to privation, potency, or completed actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5","text":"The order of the heaven cannot arise from chance as a primary cause, because the accidental is posterior to what is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS1","text":"The first generation of the reasoning is as follows: many genera of beings → aporia concerning one wisdom → search for a unity that is not generic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS2","text":"The solution of scientific multiplicity is as follows: being spoken of in many ways → reference to one → one theory of being qua being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS3","text":"The reduction of contraries is as follows: many contrarieties → privation and primary differences → one science of opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS4","text":"The assignment of common principles is as follows: universal validity → being qua being → first philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5","text":"The refutation concerning contradiction is as follows: denial of the principle → necessity of determinate signification → use of the principle → self-destruction of the denial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS6","text":"The refutation of relativism is as follows: disagreement of appearances → distinction between criterion and affection → exclusion of the equal truth of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS7","text":"The ordering of the sciences is as follows: difference among principles of motion → distinction of practical, productive, and theoretical → natural science, mathematics, and theology → hypothesis of the separate unmoved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS8","text":"The delimitation of the accidental is as follows: absence of necessity and frequency → indeterminate causes → impossibility of science → preservation of contingency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS9","text":"The definition of motion is as follows: potency → actuality of the possible qua possible → incomplete actuality → motion in respect of quality, quantity, or place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS10","text":"The refutation of the actually infinite is as follows: substantialization of the infinite → contradiction of divisible and indivisible → impossibility of separate existence → attribute of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS11","text":"The ordering of change is as follows: contradiction → coming-to-be or perishing; contraries in a subject → motion; common limit → continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF1","text":"The course begins from the aporia whether one science can concern many dissimilar principles and substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","text":"The aporia is transferred from unity of genus to unity of reference to one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF3","text":"Reference to one grounds one theory of being, its attributes, and the primary contrarieties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF4","text":"The theory of being takes up the common principles, and non-contradiction is refutatively established through the necessary signification of discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF5","text":"The science of beings is distinguished into particular theories and a first theory, whose primacy depends on separate unmoved substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF6","text":"Being is divided into what is in itself and what is accidental, and the latter is excluded from necessary science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF7","text":"Potency and actuality provide the definition of motion and the terms of its kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF8","text":"The final course excludes the separate infinite and orders coming-to-be, perishing, motion, rest, contact, and continuity according to distinct accounts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","text":"The unity of science is transferred from the homogeneity of things to their common reference to one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME2","text":"Being and one cease to be conceived as genera and are posited as transcategorial terms of beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME3","text":"First philosophy is transferred from one parallel science to a theory of the common terms of every demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME4","text":"The disagreement of appearances ceases to constitute an equal multiplicity of truths and becomes a question of the disposition of the judge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME5","text":"The accidental and chance are transferred from primary causes to the indeterminate and derivative periphery of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME6","text":"Motion is transferred from non-being and otherness to a determinate relation of potency and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME7","text":"The infinite is transferred from separate substance and an actual whole to a dependent attribute of magnitude, number, motion, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME8","text":"Change is redrawn through the distinction of contradiction, contrariety, motion, coming-to-be, perishing, and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the argument raises an aporia concerning one wisdom and defines the accidental, motion, the infinite, and the kinds of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT2","text":"At the level of arrangement, the sciences are ordered according to that under which they contemplate being and according to the priority of the knowable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT3","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, the objection is transferred from what is said to the conditions under which signification, dialogue, and demonstration become possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT4","text":"At the level concerning being and time, reality is divided into what is in itself and accidental, potency and actuality, perishable and unmoved, necessary and contingent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT1","text":"The selected axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the reference of being to one science and the subsequent delimitations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2","text":"What exactly is the one to which all the significations of being are referred remains more indeterminate than it should.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT3","text":"The arrangement is most coherent where it distinguishes unity of reference to one from unity of genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest demonstration is the refutative bond between determinate signification, communion in discourse, and non-contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT5","text":"The transition from a name's signifying one thing to the signified's being necessarily remains denser than what has been demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT6","text":"The existence of separate and unmoved substance is not shown here, so the primacy of theology remains hypothetical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT7","text":"The refutation of Protagoras is strongest concerning corrupted sense-organs and practical absurdities, but does not fully resolve every disagreement concerning the beautiful and the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT8","text":"The theory of the accidental is internally coherent, because the impossibility of science, the indeterminacy of causes, and the preservation of contingency follow one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT9","text":"The accounts concerning motion, the infinite, and continuity presuppose more physical divisions and inductions than they independently establish here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement of the argument, because it proceeds from aporias concerning unity through apophatic terms to a hierarchy of sciences and ontological delimitations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_3:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BO_3:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 11"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 11","title":"Book 11","context":"Chapter 11","original_title":"Book 11","original_context":"Chapter 11"},"original_title":"Book 11","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4","layer":"CH","title":"Book 12","order":12,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BO_4"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_4@R001","sha256":"005b997e93f16151fc66537da081c9fc3fc1189b32e688f922be1c8574688e85","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS1","text":"Ὁ λόγος ζητεῖ τὰς ἀρχὰς καὶ τὰ αἴτια τῶν οὐσιῶν, ἐπεὶ ἡ οὐσία τῶν ὄντων πρώτη ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS2","text":"Ἡ τῶν οὐσιῶν διαίρεσις εἰς αἰσθητὰς μεταβλητάς τε καὶ ἀϊδίους καὶ εἰς ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν τὴν ὅλην ἀπόδειξιν τάττει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS3","text":"Ἡ τῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας μεταβολὴ ἐκ τῆς ὕλης, τοῦ εἴδους, τῆς στερήσεως καὶ τοῦ κινοῦντος ἀνασυνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS4","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα ἕτεραι μὲν ἀριθμῷ καὶ γένει, αἱ αὐταὶ δὲ κατὰ λόγον καὶ ἀναλογίαν εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀϊδιότης χρόνου καὶ κινήσεως ἀπαιτεῖ ἀΐδιον ἀρχὴν ἧς ἡ οὐσία ἐνέργειά ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀκίνητος ἐνέργεια κινεῖ ὡς νοητὸν καὶ ἐφετόν, καὶ νοεῖ ἑαυτὴν ὡς νόησις νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7","text":"Ὁ μεταφυσικὸς καὶ ἀνασυστατικὸς συλλογισμὸς ἀπὸ τῆς προτεραιότητος τῆς οὐσίας διὰ τῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ τῆς ἐνεργείας εἰς τὴν μίαν πρώτην ἀρχὴν καὶ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὅλου προχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","text":"Ἡ οὐσία τῶν λοιπῶν κατηγοριῶν προτέρα ἐστίν, ἐπεὶ πάθη καὶ κινήσεις χωρὶς οὐσίας οὐκ εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","text":"Τρεῖς εἰσὶν οὐσίαι, ἡ αἰσθητὴ φθαρτή, ἡ αἰσθητὴ ἀΐδιος καὶ ἡ ἀκίνητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","text":"Πᾶσα μεταβολὴ εἰς ἐναντίωσιν γίνεται καὶ ὑποκείμενόν τι ἀπαιτεῖ τὸ ἐν τῇ μεταβολῇ ὑπομένον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη τρίτον τι παρὰ τὰ ἐναντία ἐστὶ καὶ δυνάμει ἀμφότερα δύναται εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","text":"Πᾶν μεταβάλλει ἐκ τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος εἰς τὸ ἐνεργείᾳ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A6","text":"Ἡ ἐσχάτη ὕλη καὶ τὸ ἔσχατον εἶδος οὐ γίγνονται, ἐπεὶ πᾶσα γένεσις ὕλην, κινοῦν καὶ εἶδος προϋποτίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ οὐσία ἐκ συνωνύμου ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίας γίγνεται, ἡ δὲ τεχνητὴ ἐκ τοῦ ἐν τῇ τέχνῃ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","text":"Αἱ αἰσθηταὶ μεταβολαὶ κατὰ λόγον ἔχουσιν ὕλην, εἶδος, στέρησιν καὶ κινοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα καθ᾽ ἕκαστά εἰσιν, τὰ δὲ καθόλου μόνον κοινὸν λόγον παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καὶ ἡ κίνησις ἀΐδιά εἰσι, καὶ μόνη ἡ κατὰ τόπον κυκλικὴ φορὰ δύναται συνεχὴς εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἀρχὴν ἀπαιτεῖ ἧς ἡ οὐσία ἐνέργεια καὶ ἄνευ ὕλης ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον ἀκίνητον κινεῖ ὡς νοητὸν καὶ ἐφετόν, οὐχ ὡς αὐτὸ κινούμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον κινοῦν ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἐστὶ καὶ οὐκ ἐνδέχεται ἄλλως ἔχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14","text":"Ἐν τῷ ἀΰλῳ νῷ τὸ νοοῦν καὶ τὸ νοούμενον ταὐτόν ἐστιν, ὥστε ἡ πρώτη νόησις ἑαυτὴν νοεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","text":"Ἑκάστη ἀΐδιος οὐράνιος φορὰ ὑπὸ ἀϊδίου καὶ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ἀκινήτου οὐσίας κινεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον κινοῦν, ἐπεὶ ἄυλον, ἓν καὶ κατὰ λόγον καὶ κατ᾽ ἀριθμόν ἐστιν, ὥστε εἷς οὐρανός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν τοῦ ὅλου καὶ ὡς κεχωρισμένη πρώτη ἀρχὴ καὶ ὡς ἡ ἐξ αὐτῆς τάξις ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX1","text":"Τὸ ποιόν, τὸ ποσόν, τὸ πρός τι, τὰ πάθη καὶ αἱ κινήσεις οὔτε χωριστὰ οὔτε ἁπλῶς πρότερα τῆς οὐσίας εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX2","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐκ ἐκ τοῦ τυχόντος μὴ ὄντος οὐδ᾽ ἐκ τῶν ἐναντίων ἄνευ ὑποκειμένου γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐδενὶ τῶν ἐναντίων ἐναντία ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη καὶ τὸ εἶδος οὐ γίγνονται εἰς ἄπειρον ἐξ ἄλλης ὕλης καὶ ἄλλου εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὐκ εἰσὶ κοινὰ στοιχεῖα πάντων, ἐπεὶ καὶ τοῖς συνθέτοις ὑπάρχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","text":"Αἱ χωρισταὶ ἰδέαι οὔτε τὴν γένεσιν τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα οὔτε τὴν κίνησιν ἱκανῶς αἰτιῶνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καθ᾽ αὑτὴν οὐκ ἐξαρκεῖ πρὸς ἀΐδιον κίνησιν, ἐπεὶ ἐνδέχεται τὸ δυνάμενον μὴ ἐνεργεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX8","text":"Ψυχὴ ὕστερον οὖσα ἢ ἅμα τῷ οὐρανῷ οὐ δύναται εἶναι ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX9","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ ἁπλοῦν οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστιν, ἐπεὶ τὸ μὲν μέτρον σημαίνει, τὸ δὲ ποιάν τινα ἀμεριστίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX10","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον κινοῦν οὐκ ἔχει ὕλην, μέγεθος, μέρη, πάθος, μεταβολὴν ἢ ἐναντίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX11","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος νοῦς οὔτε ἀργὸς οὔτε ὑπὸ χείρονος νοητοῦ κυριευόμενος οὔτε ἐξ ἄλλου εἰς ἄλλο νοούμενον μεταβάλλων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX12","text":"Οὐδεμία φορὰ φορᾶς ἕνεκα εἰς ἄπειρον ὑπάρχει, ἀλλὰ πᾶσα οὐράνιος φορὰ εἰς φερόμενόν τι τελευτᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX13","text":"Τὰ ἀνθρωπόμορφα καὶ ζωόμορφα περὶ θεῶν μυθεύματα οὐ μέρος τῆς ἀποδείξεως ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14","text":"Αἱ πρῶται ἀρχαὶ οὐκ εἰσὶ πλῆθος ἀσύντακτον καὶ ἀλλήλοις ἀσύμβλητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D1","text":"Τὰ αἴτια τῶν οὐσιῶν αἴτια καὶ τῶν παθῶν καὶ τῶν κινήσεων γίγνεται, ἐπεὶ ταῦτα ἄνευ οὐσιῶν ἀναιρεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D2","text":"Αἱ αἰτίαι τέτταρες μέν εἰσι κατὰ διαίρεσιν, τρόπον δέ τινα τρεῖς, ὅταν τὸ κινοῦν τῷ εἴδει κατὰ λόγον συμπίπτῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D3","text":"Τὸ γίγνεσθαι ἐκ μὴ ὄντος σημαίνει γένεσιν ἐκ τοῦ μὴ ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος, οὐκ ἐκ ἁπλῶς μηδενός.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D4","text":"Αἱ ἰδέαι πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν περιττεύουσιν, ἐπεὶ τὸ συνώνυμον γεννῶν καὶ ὁ ἐν τῇ τέχνῃ λόγος τὴν αἰτίαν παρέχουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ πάντων αἱ αὐταὶ λέγονται μόνον κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν, ἕτεραι δὲ κατὰ γένος, ἀριθμὸν καὶ ὑποκείμενον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D6","text":"Ἡ συνύπαρξις ἀϊδίου περιόδου καὶ γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς ἀπαιτεῖ τὸ μὲν πρῶτον ἀεὶ ὡσαύτως ἐνεργεῖν, τὸ δὲ δεύτερον ἄλλως καὶ ἄλλως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D7","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῶν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ τάξει τῶν οὐρανίων φορῶν, ἡ δὲ πᾶσα τάξις ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ μιᾶς πρώτης ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D8","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ὅλου τάξις οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτοτελὴς παρὰ τὴν πρώτην οὐσίαν, ἀλλ᾽ ὥσπερ ἡ τάξις στρατεύματος ἐκ τοῦ ἄρχοντος ἔχει τὸ εὖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD1","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας συνάπτει τὴν φυσικὴν θεωρίαν τῆς μεταβολῆς πρὸς τὴν περὶ τῆς πρώτης ἀκινήτου ἀρχῆς θεωρίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας λύει ἅμα τὴν ἀπορίαν τῆς γενέσεως καὶ τὴν ἀπορίαν τῆς ἀϊδίου κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης κατὰ βαθμοὺς τάττεται, ὥστε αἱ ἐνυπάρχουσαι ἀρχαὶ τὴν μεταβολὴν διορίζειν, τὸ προσεχὲς κινοῦν αὐτὴν ἐνεργεῖν, τὸ δὲ πρῶτον ἐφετὸν τὴν ὅλην τάξιν τελειοῦν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4","text":"Ἡ κοινότης τῶν ἀρχῶν οὐ κοινὴ ὕλη ἢ κοινὸν γένος ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ ταὐτότης σχέσεως μεταξὺ ὕλης, εἴδους, στερήσεως καὶ κινοῦντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5","text":"Ἡ πρώτη οὐσία ἐστὶν ἅμα ἀναγκαῖον ὄν, ἀκίνητον αἴτιον, ἄριστον νοητόν, αὐτονοουμένη νόησις καὶ ἀΐδιος ζωή.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD6","text":"Ἡ τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων πολλότης εἰς πλῆθος ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν ἀνάγεται, ἡ δὲ ἑνότης τοῦ οὐρανοῦ τὸ πλῆθος τοῦτο ὑπὸ μίαν πρώτην ἀρχὴν τάττει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX1","text":"Εἰ μηδεμία οὐσία παρὰ τὰ αἰσθητὰ εἴη, οὐκ ἂν εἴη πρώτη ἀρχή, ἀΐδιος τάξις ἢ ἱκανὴ αἰτία τῆς οὐρανίου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX2","text":"Εἰ ἡ δύναμις ἁπλῶς προτέρα τῆς ἐνεργείας εἴη, ἐνδέχοιτο μηδὲν ἐνεργείᾳ εἶναι καὶ μηδεμίαν κίνησιν ἀρχὴν λαβεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX3","text":"Εἰ ταὐτὰ ἀριθμῷ στοιχεῖα πασῶν τῶν κατηγοριῶν εἴη, κοινόν τι πρότερον οὐσίας καὶ τῶν λοιπῶν κατηγοριῶν ὑπάρχειν ἔδει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX4","text":"Εἰ τὰ ἐναντία αὐτὰ ἄνευ ὕλης μεταβάλλοι, τὸ ἀπαθὲς ὑπ᾽ ἀλλήλων ἔδει ἑαυτὸ ποιεῖν τὸ ἐναντίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX5","text":"Εἰ ὁ πρῶτος νοῦς ἄλλο τι κρεῖττον ἑαυτοῦ νοοῖ, τὸ τίμιον αὐτοῦ ἐκτὸς αὐτοῦ κεῖται καὶ αὐτὸς οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ ἀρίστη οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX6","text":"Εἰ πλείους οὐρανοὶ τοῦ αὐτοῦ εἴδους εἴησαν, αἱ πρῶται ἀρχαὶ ἀριθμῷ πολλαὶ καὶ ὕλην ἔχουσαι εἶναι ἔδει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX7","text":"Εἰ ἀκίνητοι οὐσίαι μηδεμιᾷ ἀϊδίῳ φορᾷ συντείνοιεν, οὔτε ὡς κινοῦσαι οὔτε ὡς τέλη θέσιν ἐν τῷ ὅλῳ ἕξουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX8","text":"Εἰ τὸ πρῶτον ἔχοι ἐναντίον, ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν τῶν ἐναντίων ἔχοι καὶ οὐκ ἂν εἴη καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἁπλῆ γένεσις ἐξ ἀπολύτου μὴ ὄντος, ἐπεὶ πᾶσα γένεσις δυνάμει ὂν προϋποτίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται χάος ἢ νὺξ ἄπειρον χρόνον πρὸ τῆς ἐνεργείας, ἐπεὶ οὐδὲν δυνάμει ὂν αὐτὸ ἑαυτὸ εἰς ἐνέργειαν ἄγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ εἰς ἄπειρον ἀναγωγὴ γενέσεων, κινήσεων, ἀρχῶν καὶ τελῶν, ἐπεὶ ἄνευ πρώτου οὐδὲ τὰ ἑπόμενα ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται χωριστὴ ἀρχὴ αἰτιωδῶς ἀργή, ἐπεὶ τὸ χωριστὸν ὃ μήτε κινεῖ μήτε τέλος ἐστὶν οὐδὲν πρὸς τὴν τάξιν συντελεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὕπαρξις πολλῶν ἀσυντάκτων πρώτων κυρίων, ἐπεὶ ἡ τοῦ ὅλου τάξις μίαν ἀρχὴν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX6","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ ἀτελὲς καὶ σπερματικὸν εἶναι ἁπλῶς πρῶτον, ἐπεὶ τὸ σπέρμα ἐκ προτέρας τελείας οὐσίας γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS1","text":"Ἡ ἀχωριστία τῶν παθῶν καὶ τῶν κινήσεων γεννᾷ τὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς οὐσίας, ἡ δὲ προτεραιότης τὴν ζήτησιν τῶν ἀρχῶν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2","text":"Ἡ μεταβλητότης τῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας γεννᾷ τὴν ἐναντίωσιν, ἡ δὲ ἀδυναμία τῶν ἐναντίων αὐτῶν μεταβάλλειν γεννᾷ τὴν ὕλην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ὡς δύναμις καὶ τὸ εἶδος ὡς ἐνέργεια γεννῶσι τὸ σχῆμα τῆς μεταβολῆς ἐκ δυνάμει ὄντος εἰς ἐνεργείᾳ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS4","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν γενῶν καὶ τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα γεννᾷ ἑτέρας ἀριθμῷ ἀρχάς, ἡ δὲ κοινὴ αἰτιακὴ σχέσις τὴν κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν ταυτότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5","text":"Ἡ ἀϊδιότης χρόνου καὶ κυκλικῆς φορᾶς ἀναιρεῖ τὴν καθαρὰν δύναμιν ὡς πρώτην καὶ γεννᾷ τὴν καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS6","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία τῆς πρώτης ἐνεργείας μετατίθησι τὴν κίνησιν εἰς τὸ ἐφετὸν καὶ νοητόν, ἐξ οὗ ἡ ἀναγκαία καὶ αὐτονοουμένη ζωή συνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS7","text":"Αἱ πολλαὶ οὐράνιοι φοραὶ γεννῶσι πλείονας ἀκινήτους οὐσίας, ἡ δὲ μία πρώτη φορὰ καὶ ἡ ἀϋλία τοῦ πρώτου γεννῶσι μίαν ἀρχὴν καὶ ἕνα οὐρανόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF1","text":"Ἡ ζήτησις τῶν ἀρχῶν τῶν ὄντων μετατίθεται εἰς τὴν ζήτησιν τῶν ἀρχῶν τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF2","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν οὐσιῶν ἄγει πρῶτον εἰς τὴν ἀνάλυσιν τῆς μεταβλητῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3","text":"Ἡ ἀνάλυσις τῆς μεταβολῆς ἄγει ἐκ τῶν ἐναντίων εἰς τὴν ὕλην καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν δύναμιν καὶ τὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF4","text":"Ἡ τῶν αἰσθητῶν αἰτιῶν διάταξις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῆς ἀριθμητικῆς διαφορᾶς εἰς τὴν κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν κοινότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF5","text":"Ἡ ἀϊδιότης τῆς κινήσεως ἄγει ἐκ τῆς προτεραιότητος τῆς ἐνεργείας εἰς τὸ ἀκίνητον κινοῦν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν θείαν νόησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF6","text":"Ἡ πολλότης τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων τάττεται ὑπὸ μίαν πρώτην ἀρχήν, καὶ ἡ ἑνότης αὕτη περαίνει τὴν κριτικὴν τῶν πολλῶν καὶ ἀσυνδέτων ἀρχῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME1","text":"Τὰ ὄντα διαγράφονται οὐκέτι ὡς ὁμοτίμως παρακείμενα, ἀλλὰ περὶ τὴν προτέραν οὐσίαν τεταγμένα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME2","text":"Τὸ μὴ ὂν διαιρεῖται εἰς τὸ μὴ ἐνεργείᾳ καὶ τὸ ἁπλῶς μὴ ὄν, ὥστε ἡ γένεσις μὴ σημαίνειν δημιουργίαν ἐκ μηδενός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME3","text":"Ἡ δυὰς τῶν ἐναντίων μεταγράφεται εἰς τριάδα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕλη ὡς κοινὸν ὑποκείμενον μεταξὺ αὐτῶν τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ταὐτῶν καὶ ἑτέρων ἀρχῶν λύεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως τοῦ ταὐτοῦ κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν καὶ τοῦ ἑτέρου καθ᾽ ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐκ ψιλοῦ τρόπου τοῦ εἶναι μετατίθεται εἰς ἀρχὴν ὀντολογικῶς προτέραν τῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6","text":"Τὸ κινεῖν ἄνευ κινήσεως γίνεται νοητόν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ποιητικὴ ὠθία ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ τῆς κινήσεως ὡς πρὸς ἐφετὸν τέλος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME7","text":"Ἡ ἀστρολογικὴ διαγραφὴ τῶν φορῶν μεταβάλλεται εἰς τάξιν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν καὶ βαθμῶν προτεραιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν οὐκέτι διαιρεῖται εἰς κεχωρισμένον τέλος καὶ ἐνυπάρχουσαν τάξιν, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς πρώτη ἀρχὴ ἀμφότερα συνάπτει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT1","text":"Ἐν τῷ ἐπιφανειακῷ βαθμῷ ἐξετάζονται αἱ αἰσθηταὶ μεταβολαί, αἱ οὐράνιοι φοραὶ καὶ αἱ ἀπορίαι περὶ τοῦ θείου νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT2","text":"Ἐν τῷ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμῷ αἱ μεταβολαὶ τάττονται διὰ τῆς ὕλης, τοῦ εἴδους, τῆς στερήσεως, τοῦ κινοῦντος, τῆς δυνάμεως καὶ τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT3","text":"Ἐν τῷ ὑπερστρατηγικῷ βαθμῷ ἡ διαμάχη περὶ μιᾶς ἢ πολλῶν ἀρχῶν μετατίθεται εἰς διάκρισιν ἀριθμητικῆς ἑτερότητος, ἀναλογικῆς ταυτότητος καὶ τάξεως πρὸς μίαν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4","text":"Ἐν τῷ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμῷ ἡ ἐνέργεια προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως, ὁ χρόνος καὶ ἡ κίνησις ἀΐδια, ἡ δὲ πρώτη οὐσία ἄχρονος κατὰ γένεσιν καὶ ἀΐδιος κατὰ ζωήν τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἐξαιρεθέντα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς φορᾶς ἀπὸ τῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὴν ἀκίνητον ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT2","text":"Ἰσχυρόταται εἰσὶν ἡ ἀπόδειξις τοῦ ὑποκειμένου ἐκ τῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ ἡ ἀναίρεσις τῆς δυνάμεως ὡς ἱκανῆς αἰτίας ἀϊδίου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν αὐτῶν κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν καὶ τῶν ἑτέρων καθ᾽ ὑποκείμενον διατηρεῖ τὴν ἐντὸς τοῦ συστήματος συμφωνίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT4","text":"Ἡ οὐσία λέγεται καὶ ὕλη καὶ εἶδος καὶ σύνθετον καὶ καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια, καὶ ἡ ἀναλογία συνάπτει μὲν ταῦτα, οὐ μὴν ἕνα παντάπασιν ἀκριβῆ ὁρισμὸν παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος τῶν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ μεταβλητῶν ἀστρολογικῶν ὑποθέσεων, διὸ οἱ ἀριθμοὶ πεντήκοντα πέντε ἢ ἑπτὰ καὶ τεσσαράκοντα οὐκ ἀναγκαῖον συμπέρασμα αποτελοῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ ἑκάστης ἀϊδίου φορᾶς εἰς ἰδίαν ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν προϋποτίθησιν ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει πλήρως τὴν μονοσήμαντον ἀντιστοιχίαν κινήσεως καὶ κινοῦντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7","text":"Ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν τὸ ἐφετὸν καὶ νοητὸν παράγει ἀκριβῶς τὴν κυκλικὴν φορὰν καὶ τὰς μεταβολὰς γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς πυκνῶς μόνον δηλοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8","text":"Ἡ συνύπαρξις πολλῶν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν καὶ μιᾶς πρώτης ἀρχῆς τάξει μὲν συμβιβάζεται, ἡ δὲ περάτωσις εἰς ἕνα κοίρανον καὶ στρατιωτικῇ εἰκόνι καὶ ῥητορικῇ ἰσχύι στηρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT9","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης νοῦ καὶ νοητοῦ ἐκ τῆς ἀϋλίας συνάγεται, ἡ δὲ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις αὐτονοήσεως καὶ νοητοῦ οὐ περαιτέρω διαιρεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT10","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν ἡ ἀϊδιότης τῆς κυκλικῆς φορᾶς, ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας καὶ ἡ τελικὴ αἰτιότης τοῦ πρώτου γένωνται δεκταί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175005461643Z_b5dba374","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 12","source_sha256":"005b997e93f16151fc66537da081c9fc3fc1189b32e688f922be1c8574688e85","sha256":"128adb2076eb9aa5d9c718dabdcf1616166468df9bb2650e1cbcde94378669ac","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:50:05.463768+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS1","text":"The account seeks the principles and causes of substances, since substance is primary among beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS2","text":"The division of substances into perceptible mutable and eternal substances, and into immovable substance, orders the whole demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS3","text":"The change of perceptible substance is reconstructed from matter, form, privation, and the moving cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS4","text":"The principles of particulars are different in number and genus, but the same in account and analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","text":"The eternity of time and motion requires an eternal principle whose substance is actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS6","text":"The immovable actuality moves as an object of thought and desire, and thinks itself as thought thinking thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7","text":"The metaphysical and reconstructive reasoning proceeds from the priority of substance, through change and actuality, to the one first principle and the order of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","text":"Substance is prior to the remaining categories, since affections and motions do not exist apart from substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","text":"There are three substances: the perishable perceptible, the eternal perceptible, and the immovable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","text":"Every change occurs into contrariety and requires some underlying subject that persists in the change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4","text":"Matter is a third thing besides the contraries and can potentially be both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","text":"Everything changes from what is potentially being into what is actually being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A6","text":"Ultimate matter and ultimate form do not come to be, since every coming-to-be presupposes matter, a mover, and form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7","text":"Natural substance comes to be from a synonymously actual substance, whereas artificial substance comes to be from the account in the art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","text":"Perceptible changes have, according to account, matter, form, privation, and a mover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9","text":"The principles of particulars are particular, while the universal provides only a common account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","text":"Time and motion are eternal, and only circular locomotion can be continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","text":"Eternal motion requires a principle whose substance is actuality and which is without matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","text":"The first unmoved mover moves as an object of thought and desire, not as itself being moved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","text":"The first mover exists of necessity and cannot be otherwise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14","text":"In immaterial intellect, that which thinks and that which is thought are the same, so that first thought thinks itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","text":"Each eternal celestial motion is moved by an eternal substance that is immovable in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16","text":"The first mover, since it is immaterial, is one both in account and in number, so that there is one heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","text":"The good of the whole exists both as a separate first principle and as the order deriving from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX1","text":"Quality, quantity, relation, affections, and motions are neither separable nor simply prior to substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX2","text":"Coming-to-be does not occur from any chance non-being, nor from contraries without an underlying subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX3","text":"Matter is contrary to none of the contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX4","text":"Matter and form do not come to be to infinity from other matter and another form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5","text":"Being and one are not common elements of all things, since they also belong to composites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","text":"Separate Ideas do not adequately explain either the coming-to-be of particulars or motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7","text":"Potentiality by itself is not sufficient for eternal motion, since what is capable may fail to be actual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX8","text":"A soul that is later than, or simultaneous with, the heaven cannot be the first principle of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX9","text":"The one and the simple are not the same, since the former signifies measure, while the latter signifies a certain indivisibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX10","text":"The first mover has no matter, magnitude, parts, affection, change, or contrary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX11","text":"The first intellect is neither inactive, nor dominated by an inferior object of thought, nor changing from one object of thought to another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX12","text":"No motion exists for the sake of motion to infinity, but every celestial motion terminates in some moved thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX13","text":"Anthropomorphic and zoomorphic myths concerning gods are not part of the demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14","text":"The first principles are not an unordered multitude incompatible with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D1","text":"The causes of substances become causes also of affections and motions, since these are removed without substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D2","text":"The causes are four according to division, but in a way three, when the mover coincides with the form in account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D3","text":"Coming to be from non-being signifies coming-to-be from what is not actually being, not from absolutely nothing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D4","text":"Ideas are superfluous for coming-to-be, since the synonymous generator and the account in the art provide the cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5","text":"The principles of all things are said to be the same only by analogy, but different in genus, number, and underlying subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D6","text":"The coexistence of eternal revolution and generation and corruption requires the first to be always actual in the same way, and the second differently at different times.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D7","text":"The order of immovable substances follows the order of celestial motions, while the whole order depends upon one first principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:D8","text":"The order of the whole is not self-complete apart from the first substance, but, just as the order of an army, has its good from the commander.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD1","text":"The priority of substance connects the natural inquiry into change with the inquiry concerning the first immovable principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2","text":"The priority of actuality resolves at once the aporia of coming-to-be and the aporia of eternal motion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","text":"Causality is ordered in degrees, so that the immanent principles delimit change, the proximate mover actualizes it, and the first object of desire completes the whole order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4","text":"The commonality of principles is not common matter or a common genus, but identity of relation among matter, form, privation, and mover.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5","text":"The first substance is at once necessary being, an unmoved cause, the best object of thought, self-thinking thought, and eternal life.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD6","text":"The plurality of celestial motions is referred to a plurality of immovable substances, but the unity of heaven orders this plurality under one first principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX1","text":"If there were no substance besides perceptible things, there would be no first principle, eternal order, or sufficient cause of celestial motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX2","text":"If potentiality were simply prior to actuality, it would be possible for nothing to be actual and for no motion to take its beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX3","text":"If the elements of all categories were the same in number, some common thing prior to substance and the remaining categories would have to exist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX4","text":"If the contraries themselves changed without matter, what is impassible would have to make itself contrary through one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX5","text":"If the first intellect thinks something better than itself, its excellence lies outside itself, and it is not the best substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX6","text":"If there were several heavens of the same form, the first principles would have to be many in number and possess matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX7","text":"If immovable substances did not correspond to any eternal motion, they would have no position in the whole either as movers or as ends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX8","text":"If the first had a contrary, it would have matter and potentiality for the contraries and would not be pure actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX1","text":"Simple coming-to-be from absolute non-being is excluded, since every coming-to-be presupposes potential being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2","text":"Chaos or night for an infinite time before actuality is excluded, since nothing potentially being brings itself into actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX3","text":"An infinite regress of generations, motions, principles, and ends is excluded, since without a first, not even the subsequent things are actual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4","text":"A separate principle that is causally inactive is excluded, since what is separate and neither moves nor is an end contributes nothing to order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX5","text":"The existence of many unordered first rulers is excluded, since the order of the whole requires one principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX6","text":"That which is imperfect and seminal is excluded from being simply first, since seed comes to be from a prior complete substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS1","text":"The inseparability of affections and motions generates the priority of substance, and this priority generates the inquiry into its principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2","text":"The mutability of perceptible substance generates contrariety, and the impossibility of the contraries themselves changing generates matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS3","text":"Matter as potentiality and form as actuality generate the schema of change from potential being to actual being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS4","text":"The difference of genera and particulars generates principles different in number, while common causal relation generates identity according to analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5","text":"The eternity of time and circular motion eliminates pure potentiality as first and generates pure actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS6","text":"The immobility of first actuality transfers motion to the desirable and intelligible, from which necessary and self-thinking life is inferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS7","text":"The many celestial motions generate several immovable substances, while the one first motion and the immateriality of the first generate one principle and one heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF1","text":"The inquiry into the principles of beings is transferred to the inquiry into the principles of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF2","text":"The division of substances leads first to the analysis of mutable perceptible substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3","text":"The analysis of change leads from contraries to matter and thence to potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF4","text":"The arrangement of perceptible causes passes from numerical difference to commonality according to analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF5","text":"The eternity of motion leads from the priority of actuality to the unmoved mover and thence to divine thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF6","text":"The plurality of celestial motions is ordered under one first principle, and this unity concludes the critique of the many disconnected principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME1","text":"Beings are no longer mapped as equivalently juxtaposed, but as ordered around prior substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME2","text":"Non-being is divided into what is not actually being and what is simply non-being, so that coming-to-be does not signify creation from nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME3","text":"The pair of contraries is rewritten as a triad, because matter is posited between them as a common underlying subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4","text":"The opposition between same and different principles is resolved through the distinction between what is the same by analogy and what is different according to underlying subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5","text":"Actuality is transferred from a mere mode of being into a principle ontologically prior to potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6","text":"Moving without being moved becomes intelligible, because productive impulsion is replaced by motion toward a desirable end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME7","text":"The astronomical mapping of motions is transformed into an order of immovable substances and degrees of priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8","text":"The good is no longer divided into separate end and immanent order, but as first principle joins both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, perceptible changes, celestial motions, and aporiai concerning divine intellect are examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT2","text":"At the level of arrangement, changes are ordered through matter, form, privation, mover, potentiality, and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT3","text":"At the super-strategic level, the dispute concerning one or many principles is transferred to a distinction between numerical difference, analogical identity, and order toward one principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4","text":"At the level concerning being and time, actuality is prior to potentiality, time and motion are eternal, and first substance is posited as without temporal coming-to-be and eternal in life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT1","text":"The selected axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the course from perceptible substance to the immovable principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT2","text":"Strongest are the demonstration of the underlying subject from change and the refutation of potentiality as a sufficient cause of eternal motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT3","text":"The distinction between principles that are the same by analogy and those different according to underlying subject preserves coherence within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT4","text":"Substance is said to be both matter and form and composite and pure actuality, and analogy joins these, though it does not provide one wholly precise definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","text":"The plurality of immovable substances depends on variable astronomical hypotheses; therefore, the numbers fifty-five or forty-seven do not constitute a necessary conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6","text":"The transition from each eternal motion to its own immovable substance presupposes, but does not fully demonstrate, the univocal correspondence of motion and mover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7","text":"The way in which the desirable and intelligible precisely produces circular motion and the changes of generation and corruption is only tersely indicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8","text":"The coexistence of many immovable substances and one first principle is reconciled in order, but the conclusion in favor of one commander rests on both a military image and rhetorical force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT9","text":"The identity of intellect and intelligible is inferred from immateriality, but the precise relation between self-thinking and the intelligible is not further divided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement of the account if the eternity of circular motion, the priority of actuality, and the final causality of the first are accepted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BO_4:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 12"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 12","title":"Book 12","context":"Chapter 12","original_title":"Book 12","original_context":"Chapter 12"},"original_title":"Book 12","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5","layer":"CH","title":"Book 13","order":13,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BO_5"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_5@R001","sha256":"d210f4568fbf6834a5ef7421a1d011791b99a88dfc6e8eb5d8a4f0b604505877","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","text":"Ἡ ζήτησις σκοπεῖ πότερον παρὰ τὰς αἰσθητὰς οὐσίας ἔστιν ἀκίνητός τις καὶ ἀΐδιος οὐσία, καὶ εἰ ἔστι, τίς ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἔρευνα πρότερον ἐλέγχει τὰς ἀλλοτρίας δόξας περὶ μαθηματικῶν, ἰδεῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν, ἵνα μήτε τὰ αὐτὰ σφάλληται μήτε τὰ κοινὰ ἀδίκως ἀποβάλλῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS3","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ ἢ ἐν τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς ὡς οὐσίαι ἢ χωριστὰ παρ’ αὐτὰ ἢ μηδαμῶς ἢ ἄλλον τρόπον εἶναι ἀνάγκη· τῶν δύο πρώτων ἀναιρεθέντων, ζητητέος ὁ ἄλλος τρόπος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","text":"Ὁ ἄλλος τρόπος σῴζει τὰ μαθηματικὰ ὡς ἀληθῶς ὄντα, οὐ χωριστά, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ καὶ διὰ νοητῆς ἀφαιρέσεως θεωρούμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS5","text":"Ἡ τῶν ἰδεῶν δόξα γεννᾶται ἐκ τῆς ἀνάγκης τοῦ καθόλου πρὸς ἐπιστήμην, σφάλλεται δὲ χωρίζουσα τὸ καθόλου καὶ ποιοῦσα αὐτὸ οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS6","text":"Αἱ δυναταὶ θέσεις περὶ χωριστῶν ἀριθμῶν καὶ μεγεθῶν διαιροῦνται ἐξαντλητικῶς καὶ ἑκάστη ἐκ τῶν ἰδίων ἀρχῶν ἀδύνατα γεννᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς διαγνωστικῶς, γενεαλογικῶς καὶ ἐλεγκτικῶς κινεῖται ἐκ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἐπιστήμης πρὸς τὴν πλάνην τοῦ χωρισμοῦ, ἐκεῖθεν δὲ πρὸς τὴν ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ εἶναι κατὰ λόγον, δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","text":"Τὸ εἶναι πολλαχῶς λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","text":"Τὸ μὴ χωριστὸν δύναται εἶναι, καίπερ μὴ καθ’ αὑτὸ κεχωρισμένον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","text":"Τὸ τῷ λόγῳ πρότερον οὐ διὰ τοῦτο τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","text":"Τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερά ἐστιν ὅσα χωριζόμενα τῷ εἶναι ὑπερβάλλει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","text":"Ἐπιστήμη δύναται τὸ αὐτὸ πρᾶγμα θεωρεῖν οὐχ ᾗ αἰσθητόν, ἀλλ’ ᾗ τοιόνδε.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","text":"Τὸ τῇ διανοίᾳ χωρίζειν τὸ μὴ χωριστὸν οὐ ψεῦδος ποιεῖ, ἐὰν τὸ πρᾶγμα ᾗ τοιοῦτον θεωρῆται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A7","text":"Ὅσῳ ἁπλούστερον καὶ πρότερον τῷ λόγῳ τὸ θεωρούμενον, τοσούτῳ ἀκριβεστέρα ἡ ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","text":"Ἄνευ τοῦ καθόλου οὐκ ἔστιν ἐπιστήμην λαβεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","text":"Τὸ καθόλου, ᾗ καθόλου, οὐκ ἔστι χωριστὴ οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","text":"Ἡ οὐσία πράγματος οὐ χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τούτου οὗ ἐστιν οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐκ ἐκ παραδείγματος μόνον, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐκ κινοῦντος αἰτίου γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","text":"Ἐὰν ὑπόθεσις ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἀδύνατα γεννᾷ, ἀδύνατοι καὶ αἱ ἀρχαὶ αὐτῆς εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A13","text":"Ὁ μαθηματικὸς ἀριθμὸς ἐξ ἀδιαφόρων καὶ συμβλητῶν μονάδων κατὰ πρόσθεσιν ἀριθμεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A14","text":"Διαφορὰ μονάδων ἢ κατὰ ποσὸν ἢ κατὰ ποιὸν εἶναι ἀνάγκη, ὧν οὐδέτερον μονάδι ᾗ μονάδι ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A15","text":"Μέγεθος οὐ δύναται ἐξ ἀδιαιρέτων μεγεθῶν συγκεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","text":"Ἡ δυνάμει ἐπιστήμη τοῦ καθόλου καὶ ἀορίστου, ἡ δ’ ἐνεργείᾳ τοῦ ὡρισμένου καὶ τοῦδέ τινος ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ καὶ τὸ στοιχεῖον πρότερά ἐστιν ὧν ἐστὶν ἀρχὴ καὶ στοιχεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX1","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ οὐκ ἔνεστι τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς ὡς ἕτεραι ἐνυπάρχουσαι οὐσίαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ οὐκ εἰσὶ χωρισταὶ φύσεις παρὰ τὰ αἰσθητά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX3","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ θέσις στερεῶν, ἐπιπέδων, γραμμῶν καὶ στιγμῶν οὐ σῴζεται, διότι ἀναγκαίαν καὶ ἄτοπον σώρευσιν ὁμοίων γενῶν παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX4","text":"Οὔτε χωριστὸς οὐρανὸς οὔτε χωριστὴ φωνὴ οὔτε χωριστὴ ὄψις ἀπαιτεῖται, ἵνα ἀστρολογία, ἁρμονικὴ καὶ ὀπτικὴ ὦσιν ἐπιστῆμαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX5","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ οὔτε μᾶλλον οὐσίαι τῶν σωμάτων οὔτε τῷ εἶναι πρότερα τῶν αἰσθητῶν εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX6","text":"Οἱ καθόλου ὁρισμοὶ οὐκ εἰσὶ διὰ τοῦτο χωρισταὶ ἰδέαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX7","text":"Οἱ λόγοι οἱ τιθέμενοι τὰ εἴδη οὐ μόνον οὐκ ἀποδεικνύουσιν ἃ βούλονται, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀποφάσεων, πρός τι καὶ φθαρτῶν εἴδη γεννῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX8","text":"Τὰ εἴδη οὔτε κινήσεως οὔτε μεταβολῆς οὔτε γενέσεως αἴτια τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX9","text":"Τὸ λέγειν τὰ εἴδη παραδείγματα καὶ τὰ ἄλλα μετέχειν αὐτῶν οὐκ ἀποδίδωσι τὸ ἐργαζόμενον αἴτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX10","text":"Ὁ χωριστὸς ἀριθμὸς οὔτε μαθηματικὸς οὔτε εἰδητικὸς οὔτε ἀμφότερος ἅμα συνεπῶς δύναται εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX11","text":"Αἱ μονάδες οὔτε πᾶσαι συμβληταὶ οὔτε πᾶσαι ἀσύμβλητοι οὔτε κατ’ ἀριθμὸν μόνον συμβληταὶ δύνανται τὰς ἰδέας ἀριθμοὺς ποιεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ ἡ ἀόριστος δυὰς οὐ δύνανται τὴν λεγομένην γένεσιν τῶν χωριστῶν ἀριθμῶν ἀποδοῦναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX13","text":"Τὰ σώματα οὐκ ἐκ μαθηματικῶν μονάδων οὐδὲ τὰ μεγέθη ἐκ στιγμῶν ἢ ἀδιαιρέτων συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ ἔστι τρόπον τινά, οὐχ ὡς χωρισταὶ ἐντελέχειαι, ἀλλ’ ὡς ἐν τοῖς πράγμασιν ὑλικῶς ὑπάρχοντα καὶ τῇ διανοίᾳ ἀφαιρούμενα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D2","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία περὶ αἰσθητῶν μεγεθῶν ἐστίν, οὐχ ᾗ αἰσθητά, οὐδὲ περὶ ἑτέρων χωριστῶν μεγεθῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D3","text":"Γραμμή, ἐπίπεδον καὶ ἀριθμὸς δύνανται τῷ λόγῳ πρότερα εἶναι τοῦ σώματος, οὐ μὴν τῇ οὐσίᾳ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D4","text":"Ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἀκρίβεια ἐκ τῆς ἀφαιρέσεως κινήσεως, μεγέθους καὶ τῶν λοιπῶν συνθέτων προσδιορισμῶν αὔξεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μονίμου καὶ καθόλου λόγου πρὸς ἐπιστήμην οὐ συνεπάγεται χωριστὴν φύσιν, ἀλλ’ ἡ σύγχυσις τούτων ἐγέννησε τὴν δόξαν τῶν ἰδεῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D6","text":"Τὸ χωρίζειν τὰ καθόλου πολλαπλασιάζει τὰ ζητούμενα μᾶλλον ἢ τὰς αἰτίας τῶν αἰσθητῶν ἀποδίδωσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D7","text":"Τὰ εἴδη ὡς χωριστὰ οὔτε τὴν οὐσίαν τῶν μετεχόντων οὔτε τὴν γένεσιν αὐτῶν ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D8","text":"Ἡ ἐξαντλητικὴ διαίρεσις τῶν σχέσεων τῶν μονάδων ἀποκλείει πᾶσαν συνεπῆ κατασκευὴν εἰδητικοῦ ἢ χωριστοῦ μαθηματικοῦ ἀριθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D9","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία συνθέσεως μεγέθους ἐξ ἀδιαιρέτων ἀναιρεῖ τήν τε Πυθαγόρειον σύστασιν τῶν σωμάτων ἐξ ἀριθμῶν καὶ τὴν χωριστὴν γένεσιν γραμμῶν καὶ ἐπιπέδων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς ἐπιστήμης οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ καθόλου χωριστὰς οὐσίας, ἐπεὶ ἡ μὲν δυνάμει γνῶσις καθόλου, ἡ δ’ ἐνεργείᾳ ὡρισμένη ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","text":"Ἡ σταθερὰ νοητότης τῶν πραγμάτων οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ δεύτερον κόσμον ὁμοίων χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν, ἀλλὰ σῴζεται διὰ τοῦ καθόλου λόγου καὶ τῆς κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD2","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ τῷ λόγῳ προτέρου εἰς τὸ τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερον γεννᾷ σωρεύσεις φύσεων, ἀπείρους μεσιτείας καὶ ἀναστροφὴν τῆς ἀληθοῦς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","text":"Χωριστὴ φύσις ἥτις οὔτε ἐνυπάρχει τοῖς πράγμασιν οὔτε κινεῖ οὔτε τὴν γένεσιν αὐτῶν ἀποδίδωσιν οὐ δύναται εἶναι πρώτη αἰτία αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις μαθηματικῶν, ἰδεῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν ὡς χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ πᾶσαν ἀκίνητον καὶ ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν, ἀλλὰ μόνον τοὺς ἐνταῦθα ἐξεταζομένους ὑποψηφίους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD5","text":"Οἱ διαφορετικοὶ τρόποι προτεραιότητος κατὰ λόγον, γένεσιν, ὕλην καὶ οὐσίαν οὐ δύνανται ἀδιακρίτως εἰς μίαν ἀρχὴν συναχθῆναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας μεταθέτει τὸ πρόβλημα τῆς ἐπιστήμης ἀπὸ τὴν χωριστὴν ὕπαρξιν τοῦ καθόλου εἰς τὸν τρόπον καθ’ ὃν τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ ὡρισμένον γινώσκεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι πᾶν περὶ οὗ ἐπιστήμη ἐστὶ χωριστὴν οὐσίαν ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι ὃ τῇ διανοίᾳ χωρίζεται καὶ τῷ εἶναι χωριστόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι πᾶν ἁπλούστερον καὶ πρότερον τῷ λόγῳ πρότερόν ἐστι καὶ τῇ οὐσίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι τὸ ἓν ἐπὶ πολλῶν ἀριθμητικῶς ἓν καὶ παρὰ τὰ πολλὰ κεχωρισμένον εἶναι δεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς παράδειγμα ἱκανὴ αἰτία γενέσεώς ἐστιν ἄνευ τοῦ κινοῦντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX6","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι μονάδες δύνανται διαφέρειν ἀλλήλων μήτε κατὰ ποσὸν μήτε κατὰ ποιόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX7","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι τὸ αὐτὸ ἓν δύναται ἅμα καὶ κατὰ τὸ αὐτὸ εἶναι ὕλη τοῦ ἀριθμοῦ καὶ εἶδος αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX8","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθὲς ὅτι ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστῶν μαθηματικῶν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἀλήθειαν τῶν μαθηματικῶν ἐπιστημῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX1","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἀποκλείει νοητὸν τόπον ὃς μόνον διπλασιάζει τὰ αἰσθητὰ χωρὶς αἰτιακὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX2","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἀποκλείει μονοσήμαντον προτεραιότητα κοινὴν τῷ λόγῳ, τῇ γενέσει, τῇ ὕλῃ καὶ τῇ οὐσίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX3","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἀποκλείει τὸ καθόλου εἶναι ἅμα καθόλου κατηγορούμενον, τόδε τι καὶ χωριστὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX4","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἀποκλείει τὸ ὄνομα τῆς μεθέξεως ἢ τοῦ παραδείγματος ἀντὶ ἀποδόσεως τοῦ αἰτίου τίθεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη μετάθεσις ἐκ τῆς αἰσθητῆς οὐσίας ἐπὶ τὴν ζήτησιν ἀκινήτου καὶ ἀϊδίου οὐσίας γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS2","text":"Ἡ μαθηματικὴ φύσις διαιρεῖται εἰς ἐνύπαρξιν, χωρισμὸν, ἀνυπαρξίαν ἢ ἄλλον τρόπον τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS3","text":"Ἡ ἐνύπαρξις ὡς ἑτέρας οὐσίας ἀναιρεῖται διὰ τῆς συμπτώσεως σωμάτων καὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας τῆς διαιρέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS4","text":"Ὁ χωρισμὸς ἀναιρεῖται διὰ σωρεύσεως ἐπιπέδων, γραμμῶν, στιγμῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν, διὰ τῆς ἐλλείψεως ἑνότητος καὶ διὰ τῆς ἀδυναμίας αἰσθητῶν μαθηματικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5","text":"Τῶν δύο πρώτων τρόπων ἀναιρεθέντων, τὰ μαθηματικὰ ἀνασυστάται ὡς τὰ αἰσθητὰ θεωρούμενα οὐχ ᾗ αἰσθητά, ἀλλ’ ᾗ μήκη, ἐπίπεδα, στερεὰ ἢ ἀριθμητά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS6","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν ἰδεῶν ἀνάγεται ἐκ τῆς ῥοῆς τῶν αἰσθητῶν καὶ τῆς Σωκρατικῆς ζητήσεως τοῦ καθόλου εἰς τὸν ἀδικαιολόγητον χωρισμὸν τῶν ὁρισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS7","text":"Τὰ εἴδη δοκιμάζεται κατὰ τὴν ἔκτασιν τῶν ἀποδείξεων, τὴν συμφωνίαν πρὸς τὰς ἰδίας ἀρχὰς καὶ τὴν αἰτιακὴν αὐτῶν δύναμιν, καὶ κατὰ πάντα ταῦτα ἀποτυγχάνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS8","text":"Οἱ χωριστοὶ ἀριθμοὶ διαιροῦνται κατὰ τὴν συμβλητότητα τῶν μονάδων, τὴν σχέσιν εἰδητικοῦ καὶ μαθηματικοῦ ἀριθμοῦ καὶ τὸν χωρισμὸν ἢ ἐνυπάρχειν, καὶ ἕκαστος συνδυασμὸς ἀδύνατα παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS9","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ ἀπορία περὶ καθόλου ἐπιστήμης καὶ καθ’ ἕκαστον οὐσίας μετατίθεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως δυνάμει καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ γνῶσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","text":"Ἡ καθόλου φορὰ οὕτως ἔχει· ζήτησις ἀκινήτου οὐσίας → ἔλεγχος προτεινομένων χωριστῶν φύσεων → ἀναίρεσις ἐνυπάρξεως καὶ χωρισμοῦ → ἀνασύστασις τοῦ κατὰ λόγον εἶναι → διάκρισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF2","text":"Ἡ περὶ τῶν μαθηματικῶν φορὰ οὕτως ἔχει· διαιρετικὴ τῶν τρόπων τοῦ εἶναι → ἀδύνατον τῆς ἐνυπάρξεως → ἄτοπον τοῦ χωρισμοῦ → τὸ ᾗ τῆς θεωρίας → ἀληθὴς ἀφαίρεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF3","text":"Ἡ περὶ τῶν ἰδεῶν φορὰ οὕτως ἔχει· ῥοὴ τῶν αἰσθητῶν → ἀνάγκη καθόλου ὁρισμοῦ → χωρισμὸς τοῦ καθόλου → πολλαπλασιασμὸς καὶ ἀντίφασις → αἰτιακὴ ἀδυναμία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF4","text":"Ἡ περὶ τῶν ἀριθμῶν φορὰ οὕτως ἔχει· ἐξαντλητικὴ διαίρεσις μονάδων καὶ ἀριθμῶν → ἔλεγχος ἑκάστου τρόπου → ἀδύνατα περὶ γενέσεως, προτεραιότητος καὶ συνθέσεως → ἀναίρεσις χωριστοῦ ἀριθμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME1","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ μετατίθεται ἐκ τοῦ γένους τῶν χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν εἰς τὸ γένος τῶν κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρουμένων προσδιορισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME2","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης διακρίνεται εἰς προτεραιότητα λόγου, γενέσεως, ὕλης καὶ οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME3","text":"Ὁ νοητὸς χωρισμὸς διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τοῦ χωρισμοῦ κατὰ τὸ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME4","text":"Αἱ ἰδέαι μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς θέσεως τῶν αἰτίων εἰς τὴν θέσιν διπλασιασμῶν οἳ αὐτοὶ δεῖται αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME5","text":"Ἡ διαφωνία τῶν δοξῶν περὶ ἀριθμῶν γίνεται σημεῖον ψευδῶν ἀρχῶν μᾶλλον ἢ πολλῶν ἀληθῶν γενῶν ἀριθμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME6","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς ἐπιστήμης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ χωριστὸν ἀντικείμενον εἰς δύναμιν γνώσεως, ἡ δὲ ἐνεργὸς γνῶσις πρὸς τόδε τι ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME7","text":"Ἡ ζήτησις τῆς ἀκινήτου οὐσίας στενοῦται διὰ τῆς ἀποβολῆς μαθηματικῶν, ἰδεῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν, οὐ μὴν περαίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT1","text":"Ὁ ἐπιφανειακὸς βαθμὸς ἐξετάζει εἰ μαθηματικά, ἰδέαι, ἀριθμοὶ καὶ μεγέθη εἰσὶν οὐσίαι χωρισταί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT2","text":"Ὁ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμὸς διακρίνει τὸ ᾗ τῆς ἐπιστήμης, τὸν νοητὸν χωρισμόν, τὴν οὐσιώδη προτεραιότητα καὶ τὴν αἰτιακὴν ἰσχύν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT3","text":"Ὁ ὑπερστρατηγικὸς βαθμὸς μεταβάλλει τὴν ἔρευναν ἀπὸ τὴν προσθήκην χωριστῶν φύσεων εἰς τὸν ἔλεγχον τοῦ τρόπου καθ’ ὃν ἡ νόησις ἀφαιρεῖ καὶ ἡ ἐπιστήμη ὁρίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT4","text":"Ὁ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμὸς διακρίνει τὸ ἐντελεχείᾳ ἀπὸ τοῦ ὑλικῶς, τὸ τῷ λόγῳ πρότερον ἀπὸ τοῦ τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερον, καὶ τὴν δυνάμει καθολικὴν γνῶσιν ἀπὸ τῆς ἐνεργείᾳ ὡρισμένης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀναιρέσεως τῶν χωριστῶν μαθηματικῶν, ἰδεῶν, ἀριθμῶν καὶ μεγεθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ ἀνασύστασις τῶν μαθηματικῶν ἰσχυρότατα στηρίζεται ἐπὶ τῇ διακρίσει τοῦ πράγματος καὶ τοῦ ᾗ θεωρεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τοῦ χωριστοῦ ἀριθμοῦ ἰσχυρότατα στηρίζεται ἐπὶ τῇ ἐξαντλητικῇ διαιρέσει τῆς συμβλητότητος καὶ διαφορᾶς τῶν μονάδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4","text":"Ἀδιοριστότερον τοῦ δέοντος μένει πῶς ἀκριβῶς τὸ ὑλικῶς εἶναι τῶν μαθηματικῶν συνάπτεται πρὸς τὴν νοητὴν ἀφαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τοῦ πῶς αἱ οὐσίαι εἰσὶ χωρισταί, αἱ δὲ ἀρχαὶ γνωσταὶ καθόλου, μόνον κατὰ τὸν τρόπον τῆς γνώσεως διακρίνεται, οὐ πλήρως κατὰ τὸν τρόπον τῆς οὐσίας λύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT6","text":"Μέρος τῆς ἀποδείξεως στηρίζεται ἐπὶ σωρεύσει ἀδυνάτων καὶ ἐπὶ προτέρων διαπορημάτων, ὧν οἱ πλήρεις λόγοι ἐνταῦθα οὐκ ἀναλαμβάνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν μὴ ἐκ τῆς ἀποβολῆς τῶν ἐξετασθέντων χωριστῶν φύσεων συναχθῇ ἡ ἀνυπαρξία πάσης ἀκινήτου καὶ ἀϊδίου οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175038434800Z_6d4b5da8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 13","source_sha256":"d210f4568fbf6834a5ef7421a1d011791b99a88dfc6e8eb5d8a4f0b604505877","sha256":"9166759ae5958cb38cf35cc44f8e5798578cf7bb8d44e1ddda576ccd1f3a7b38","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:50:38.435723+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","text":"The inquiry examines whether, besides sensible substances, there is some immovable and eternal substance, and, if there is, what it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS2","text":"The investigation first examines the views of others concerning mathematical objects, Ideas, and numbers, so that it may neither err in the same respects nor unjustly reject what they hold in common.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS3","text":"Mathematical objects must either exist in sensible things as substances, or separately from them, or not at all, or in some other way; once the first two are refuted, the other way must be sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","text":"The other way preserves mathematical objects as genuinely beings, not as separate, but as considered qua such and through intellectual abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS5","text":"The doctrine of Ideas arises from the necessity of the universal for scientific knowledge, but errs by separating the universal and making it a substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS6","text":"The possible positions concerning separate numbers and magnitudes are divided exhaustively, and each generates impossibilities from its own principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","text":"The reasoning proceeds diagnostically, genealogically, and refutatively from the necessity of scientific knowledge to the error of separation, and thence to the reconstruction of being according to account, potentiality, and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","text":"Being is spoken of in many ways.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","text":"What is not separate can be, although it is not separately existent in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","text":"What is prior in account is not thereby prior in substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","text":"Those things are prior in substance which, when separated, exceed in being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","text":"Scientific knowledge can contemplate the same thing not qua sensible, but qua such-and-such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","text":"Separating by thought what is not separate does not produce falsity, if the thing is considered qua such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A7","text":"The simpler and prior in account the object contemplated, the more exact the scientific knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","text":"Without the universal, it is not possible to acquire scientific knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","text":"The universal, qua universal, is not a separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","text":"The substance of a thing is not separated from that of which it is the substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11","text":"Generation comes to be not from a paradigm alone, but also from a moving cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","text":"If a hypothesis necessarily generates impossibilities, its principles too are impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A13","text":"Mathematical number is counted by addition from indifferent and combinable units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A14","text":"A difference between units must be either in quantity or in quality, neither of which belongs to a unit qua unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A15","text":"A magnitude cannot be composed of indivisible magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","text":"Scientific knowledge in potentiality is of the universal and indeterminate, whereas scientific knowledge in actuality is of the determinate and this particular.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","text":"A principle and an element are prior to that of which they are principle and element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX1","text":"Mathematical objects are not present in sensibles as other substances existing in them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2","text":"Mathematical objects are not separate natures alongside sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX3","text":"The position of separate solids, planes, lines, and points cannot be maintained, because it produces a necessary and absurd accumulation of like kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX4","text":"Neither a separate heaven, nor a separate sound, nor a separate sight is required for astronomy, harmonics, and optics to be sciences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX5","text":"Mathematical objects are neither substances more than bodies nor prior in being to sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX6","text":"Universal definitions are not thereby separate Ideas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX7","text":"The arguments positing Forms not only fail to prove what they intend, but also generate Forms of negations, relatives, and perishables.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX8","text":"Forms are causes neither of motion, nor of change, nor of generation for sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX9","text":"To say that Forms are paradigms and that other things participate in them does not render the efficient cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX10","text":"A separate number cannot consistently be either mathematical, or eidetic, or both at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX11","text":"Units cannot, whether all combinable, all non-combinable, or combinable only according to number, make Ideas into numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","text":"The One and the indefinite dyad cannot account for the so-called generation of separate numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX13","text":"Bodies are not constituted from mathematical units, nor magnitudes from points or indivisibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","text":"Mathematical objects are in a certain way, not as separate actualities, but as existing materially in things and abstracted by thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D2","text":"Geometry is concerned with sensible magnitudes, not qua sensible, nor with other separate magnitudes.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D3","text":"A line, plane, and number may be prior in account to a body, though not prior in substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D4","text":"Mathematical exactness increases through the abstraction of motion, magnitude, and the remaining composite determinations.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D5","text":"The necessity of a stable and universal account for scientific knowledge does not entail a separate nature; rather, the confusion of these gave rise to the doctrine of Ideas.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D6","text":"Separating universals multiplies the things sought rather than rendering the causes of sensibles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D7","text":"Forms as separate explain neither the substance of participants nor their generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D8","text":"The exhaustive division of the relations of units excludes every coherent construction of eidetic or separate mathematical number.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A13","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D9","text":"The impossibility of composing magnitude from indivisibles refutes both the Pythagorean constitution of bodies from numbers and the separate generation of lines and planes.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","text":"The universality of scientific knowledge does not require universal separate substances, since knowledge in potentiality is universal, whereas knowledge in actuality is determinate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","text":"The stable intelligibility of things does not require a second world of like separate substances, but is preserved through the universal account and contemplation according to the qua.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD2","text":"The transition from what is prior in account to what is prior in substance generates accumulations of natures, infinite intermediaries, and a reversal of the true order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","text":"A separate nature which neither inheres in things, nor moves them, nor accounts for their generation cannot be their first cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","text":"The refutation of mathematical objects, Ideas, and numbers as separate substances does not refute every immovable and eternal substance, but only the candidates examined here.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD5","text":"The different modes of priority according to account, generation, matter, and substance cannot indiscriminately be reduced to one principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","text":"The distinction between potentiality and actuality shifts the problem of scientific knowledge from the separate existence of the universal to the manner in which the universal and the determinate are known.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX1","text":"It is not true that everything of which there is scientific knowledge has a separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX2","text":"It is not true that what is separated in thought is also separate in being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX3","text":"It is not true that everything simpler and prior in account is also prior in substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX4","text":"It is not true that what is one over many must be numerically one and separated apart from the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX5","text":"It is not true that likeness to a paradigm is a sufficient cause of generation without the mover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX6","text":"It is not true that units can differ from one another neither in quantity nor in quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX7","text":"It is not true that the same one can at once and in the same respect be both the matter of number and its form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX8","text":"It is not true that the rejection of separate mathematical objects refutes the truth of the mathematical sciences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX1","text":"The arrangement excludes an intelligible place which merely duplicates sensibles without causal power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX2","text":"The arrangement excludes a univocal priority common to account, generation, matter, and substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX3","text":"The arrangement excludes the universal from being simultaneously a universal predicate, a this particular, and a separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX4","text":"The arrangement excludes the name of participation or paradigm being posited in place of an account of the cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS1","text":"The first transition is made from sensible substance to the inquiry into immovable and eternal substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS2","text":"Mathematical nature is divided into inherence, separation, non-existence, or another mode of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS3","text":"Inherence as other substances is refuted through the coincidence of bodies and the impossibility of division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS4","text":"Separation is refuted through the accumulation of planes, lines, points, and numbers, through the lack of unity, and through the impossibility of sensible mathematical objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5","text":"Once the first two modes have been refuted, mathematical objects are reconstructed as sensibles considered not qua sensible, but qua lengths, planes, solids, or countable things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS6","text":"The genesis of Ideas is traced from the flux of sensibles and the Socratic search for the universal to the unjustified separation of definitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS7","text":"Forms are tested by the scope of the proofs, agreement with their own principles, and their causal power; and in all these respects they fail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS8","text":"Separate numbers are divided according to the combinability of units, the relation of eidetic and mathematical number, and separation or inherence; and every combination produces impossibilities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS9","text":"The final aporia concerning universal scientific knowledge and individual substance is shifted through the distinction between knowledge in potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","text":"The general course is as follows: inquiry into immovable substance → examination of proposed separate natures → refutation of inherence and separation → reconstruction of being according to account → distinction of potentiality and actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF2","text":"The course concerning mathematical objects is as follows: division of modes of being → impossibility of inherence → absurdity of separation → the qua of contemplation → true abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF3","text":"The course concerning Ideas is as follows: flux of sensibles → necessity of universal definition → separation of the universal → multiplication and contradiction → causal incapacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF4","text":"The course concerning numbers is as follows: exhaustive division of units and numbers → examination of each mode → impossibilities concerning generation, priority, and composition → refutation of separate number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME1","text":"Mathematical objects are shifted from the genus of separate substances to the genus of determinations considered according to the qua.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME2","text":"Priority is distinguished into priority of account, generation, matter, and substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME3","text":"Intellectual separation is distinguished from separation in being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME4","text":"Ideas are shifted from the position of causes to the position of duplications which themselves require a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME5","text":"The disagreement of doctrines concerning numbers becomes a sign of false principles rather than of many true kinds of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME6","text":"The universality of scientific knowledge is shifted from a separate object to a capacity of knowing, whereas actual knowledge is determined toward a this particular.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME7","text":"The inquiry into immovable substance is narrowed through the exclusion of mathematical objects, Ideas, and numbers, but is not thereby completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT1","text":"The superficial level examines whether mathematical objects, Ideas, numbers, and magnitudes are separate substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT2","text":"The level of arrangement distinguishes the qua of scientific knowledge, intellectual separation, substantial priority, and causal force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT3","text":"The super-strategic level transforms the inquiry from the addition of separate natures to examination of the manner in which thought abstracts and scientific knowledge defines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT4","text":"The level concerning being and time distinguishes actuality from material existence, what is prior in account from what is prior in substance, and universal knowledge in potentiality from determinate knowledge in actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the refutation of separate mathematical objects, Ideas, numbers, and magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2","text":"The positive reconstruction of mathematical objects rests most strongly on the distinction between the thing and the qua under which it is considered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT3","text":"The refutation of separate number rests most strongly on the exhaustive division of the combinability and difference of units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4","text":"It remains less determinate than is required how precisely the material being of mathematical objects is connected with intellectual abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT5","text":"The aporia concerning how substances are separate while principles are known universally is distinguished only with respect to the mode of knowing, not fully resolved with respect to the mode of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT6","text":"Part of the proof rests on an accumulation of impossibilities and on prior aporiai, whose complete accounts are not taken up here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement of the argument, provided that from the rejection of the separate natures examined one does not infer the non-existence of every immovable and eternal substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_5:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BO_5:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 13"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 13","title":"Book 13","context":"Chapter 13","original_title":"Book 13","original_context":"Chapter 13"},"original_title":"Book 13","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6","layer":"CH","title":"Book 14","order":14,"parents":["RAW_DAZY_BO_6"],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_6@R001","sha256":"13ee970c529b48659cb83d915e6b4fdb0955cfe920ec810bae15ff9449a72d15","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1","text":"Ἐξετάζεται εἰ τὰς ἀκινήτους καὶ ἀϊδίους οὐσίας δύναται γεννᾶν σύστημα ἐναντίων, τοῦ ἑνός, ἀορίστου δυάδος καὶ χωριστῶν ἀριθμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS2","text":"Ἀρχὴ πάντων οὐ δύναται εἶναι πάθος, ἐναντίον ἢ πρός τι καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου λεγόμενον, ἐπεὶ τὸ ὑποκείμενον αὐτῆς πρότερον ἂν εἴη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS3","text":"Τὸ ἕν μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὸ μέτρον, τὰ δὲ μέγα καὶ μικρόν, πολὺ καὶ ὀλίγον, ἄνισον καὶ ἕτερον ἐκ τῶν στοιχείων εἰς τὰ πάθη καὶ τὰ πρός τι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀϊδιότης δοκιμάζεται διὰ τῆς ἀκολουθίας στοιχεῖον → σύνθεσις → ὕλη → δύναμις τοῦ μὴ εἶναι, ἥτις τὴν ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS5","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ πολλαπλότης λύονται οὐ διὰ χωριστοῦ μὴ ὄντος, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς πολυσημίας τοῦ ὄντος καὶ τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS6","text":"Οἱ χωριστοὶ ἀριθμοὶ καὶ τὰ μαθηματικὰ ἐλέγχονται διὰ τοῦ ζητεῖν ποίῳ τρόπῳ αἴτια, γεννητά, χωριστὰ καὶ τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς χρήσιμα εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS7","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις ἐλεγκτική τε καὶ γενεαλογική ἐστιν, ἐκ τῶν κατηγορικῶν συγχύσεων εἰς τὰς τροπικὰς καὶ αἰτιακὰς ἀντιφάσεις βαίνουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","text":"Τὸ καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου ὂν οὐκ ἔστιν ἀρχὴ τῶν ἁπάντων, ἐπεὶ τὸ ὑποκείμενον αὐτοῦ πρότερόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","text":"Πάντα τὰ ἐναντία καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου ὑπάρχει καὶ οὐ χωριστά ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3","text":"Οὐσίᾳ ᾗ οὐσίᾳ οὐδέν ἐστιν ἐναντίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4","text":"Τὸ πρός τι ὕστερόν ἐστι τοῦ ποιοῦ καὶ τοῦ ποσοῦ καὶ μάλιστα ἀπέχει τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5","text":"Ἡ ἑκάστου ὕλη ἐστὶ τὸ δυνάμει ὂν τοῦτο ὃ ἐνεργείᾳ δύναται γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","text":"Πᾶν τὸ ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων στοιχείων συγκείμενον σύνθετόν ἐστι καὶ ὕλην ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7","text":"Τὸ δυνάμει ὂν ἐνδέχεται καὶ ἐνεργεῖν καὶ μὴ ἐνεργεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","text":"Οὐδεμία οὐσία ἀΐδιός ἐστιν ἐὰν μὴ ᾖ ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀδύνατον αὐτῇ ᾖ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ μὴ ὂν λέγεται πολλαχῶς κατὰ τὰς κατηγορίας, τὸ ψεῦδος καὶ τὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10","text":"Ἡ γένεσις γίνεται ἐκ τοῦ μὴ ὄντος ἐνεργείᾳ, ὄντος δὲ δυνάμει τοῦ γενησομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","text":"Τὸ ἓν σημαίνει μέτρον πλήθους τινός, οὐ χωριστὴν καθ᾽ αὑτὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμός ἐστι πλῆθος μεμετρημένον καὶ πλῆθος μέτρων, οὐ δὲ αὐτὸ τὸ μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A13","text":"Πάντα τὰ τῷ αὐτῷ μέτρῳ μετρούμενα κοινόν τι γένος ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A14","text":"Τὸ ἐν τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς σώμασιν ὑπάρχειν τὰ μαθηματικὰ πάθη ἀσύμβατόν ἐστι τῷ χωριστὰ εἶναι τὰ μαθηματικά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","text":"Τὸ αἴτιον ᾗ αἴτιον ἢ ὕλη ἢ εἶδος καὶ λόγος ἢ κινοῦν ἢ τέλος ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A16","text":"Ὁ αὐτὸς ἀριθμὸς δύναται πλείοσι καὶ διαφέρουσι πράγμασιν ὑπάρχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17","text":"Τοῦ ἀεὶ ὄντος οὐδὲν πρότερόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον καὶ ἀΐδιον καὶ αὐταρκέστατον ἀγαθόν ἐστι καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἐπειδὴ τὸ εὖ ἔχειν καὶ ἡ σωτηρία αὐτῷ πρώτως ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX1","text":"Οὐδὲν ἐναντίον κυρίως ἀρχὴ πάντων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX2","text":"Τὸ ἓν οὔτε χωριστὴ οὐσία οὔτε ἀριθμός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX3","text":"Τὸ ἄνισον, τὸ μέγα καὶ μικρόν, τὸ πολὺ καὶ ὀλίγον οὔτε ὕλη οὔτε στοιχεῖα οὐσίας ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX4","text":"Τὸ ψεῦδος οὐκ ἔστι παραγωγὸν μὴ ὂν ἐξ οὗ τὰ ὄντα γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἕτερον καὶ τὸ πρός τι οὔτε ἐναντία οὔτε ἀποφάσεις τοῦ ὄντος καὶ τοῦ ἑνός εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX6","text":"Ἀΐδιος οὐσία οὐ δύναται ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων ὑλικῶν στοιχείων συγκεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τῶν μαθηματικῶν καὶ ἡ ὕπαρξις τῶν ἐπιστημῶν οὐκ ἀποδεικνύουσι χωριστὰ μαθηματικὰ πράγματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX8","text":"Αἱ στιγμαί, γραμμαί, ἐπιφάνειαι καὶ τὰ λοιπὰ πέρατα οὐχ ᾗ πέρατα οὐσίαι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX9","text":"Γένεσις ἀϊδίων ἀριθμῶν κυρίως λεγομένη ἀδύνατός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς οὔτε ὕλη οὔτε εἶδος οὔτε ποιητικὸν αἴτιον οὔτε τέλος τῶν πραγμάτων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11","text":"Αἱ ἀριθμητικαὶ συμπτώσεις καὶ μικραὶ ὁμοιότητες οὐκ εἰσὶν αἰτίαι τῶν πραγμάτων οἷς συμπίπτουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX12","text":"Οὔτε ἐκβλητέον τὸ ἀγαθὸν ἐκ τοῦ πρώτου οὔτε τῷ ἑνὶ ὡς στοιχείῳ ἀριθμῶν ταὐτιστέον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D1","text":"Τὰ ἐναντία μόνον παράγωγοι διορισμοὶ ὑποκειμένου δύνανται εἶναι, ὥστε ἑτέραν αὐτῶν δεῖ ζητεῖν πρώτην ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","text":"Τὸ μέγα καὶ μικρόν, τὸ πολὺ καὶ ὀλίγον καὶ τὸ ἄνισον, ὡς πάθη ποσῶν καὶ πρός τι, οὐ δύνανται ὕλην ἀριθμῶν ἢ οὐσιῶν παρέχειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","text":"Εἰ ἀΐδιός τις οὐσία ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων στοιχείων εἴη, ἕξει ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι, ὥστε οὐκ ἔσται ἀΐδιος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ χωριστὴν φύσιν τοῦ μὴ ὄντος, ἀλλὰ τὸ δυνάμει ὂν καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ μήπω ὄν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ ὁ ἀριθμὸς ἀκολουθοῦσι τῷ μετρουμένῳ γένει καὶ οὐκ εἰσὶ πρῶται χωρισταὶ οὐσίαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος τῶν ὄντων οὐ λύεται δι᾽ ἑνὸς ἀντικειμένου τῷ ὄντι, ἀλλὰ διαιρεῖται πρῶτον κατὰ τὰς διαφόρους σημασίας τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ γνωστὰ μὲν καὶ ἀληθῆ μένει, χωριστὰ δὲ τῶν αἰσθητῶν εἶναι οὐκ ἀναγκαῖον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8","text":"Ἡ κοινότης ἀριθμοῦ ἐν διαφέρουσι πράγμασιν οὐ παρέχει οὔτε ταυτότητα οὔτε αἰτιακὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D9","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀϊδίου ἀριθμοῦ εἰσάγει πρότερον καὶ ὕστερον ἐν ᾧ πρότερον οὐ δύναται εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D10","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν τῷ πρώτῳ προσήκει καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ταύτισίς του τῷ ἑνὶ ὡς ἀριθμητικῷ στοιχείῳ ποιεῖ τὰς μονάδας ἀγαθὰς καὶ τὸ ἀντικείμενον στοιχεῖον κακὸν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD1","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν ἐναντίων ἀρχῶν γεννᾶται ἐκ τοῦ μονοσήμως λαμβάνειν τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἕν, παραθεωροῦντας τὰς κατηγορικὰς διαφοράς καὶ προάγοντας τὰ πρός τι εἰς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD2","text":"Ὁ χωριστὸς ἀριθμὸς ἅμα οὐσία καὶ ποσόν, ἀΐδιος καὶ γεννητός, χωριστὸς καὶ ἐν τοῖς σώμασιν ἐνεργός, πρῶτος καὶ ἐξ ὑστέρων κατηγοριῶν συγκείμενος καθίσταται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ αὐτονομία τῶν μαθηματικῶν οὐ συνεπάγεται ὀντολογικὴν αὐτῶν χώρισιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD4","text":"Ὅταν ἀριθμητικὴ συμφωνία ἀντὶ ὕλης, εἴδους, κινήσεως ἢ τέλους τίθηται, ἡ αἰτιολογία μεταπίπτει εἰς συλλογὴν συμπτωμάτων καὶ ἀναλογιῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ περὶ τοῦ ἀγαθοῦ ζήτησις δεῖ διακρίνειν τὸ πρῶτον ὡς αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν ἀπὸ τῆς ἀριθμητικῆς μονάδος ὡς ὑποτεθέντος στοιχείου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD6","text":"Ἡ κατηγορικὴ διάκρισις διαλύει τὸ κοινὸν ἐρώτημα πῶς πολλὰ τὰ ὄντα, ἀλλὰ καταλείπει τὸ ἀκριβέστερον ἀπόρημα πῶς πολλαὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίαι εἰσίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX1","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν μονοσήμως καὶ ὡς κοινὰ γένη πάντων λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου κατηγορούμενον ἅμα στοιχεῖον καὶ ὕλην τοῦ αὐτοῦ ὑποκειμένου εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀλήθεια προτάσεως ἢ θεωρήματος ἱκανὴ ἀπόδειξις χωριστῆς οὐσίας εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὁμοιότης, ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ ἰσότης ἢ ἡ σύμπτωσις ἄνευ ἑτέρου λόγου αἰτίαν παρέχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται χρόνος, πρότερον ἢ διαδικασία γενέσεως ἐν αὐτῷ τῷ ἀϊδίῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6","text":"Ἀποκλείεται πᾶσαν ἀρχὴν εἶναι στοιχεῖον, ἐπεὶ τὸ πρῶτον αἴτιον οὐκ ἀνάγκη ὡς ὕλη ἐνυπάρχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX7","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ πρός τι τὴν δύναμιν ἢ τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῆς γενέσεως ἀναπληροῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX1","text":"Ἀδύνατον τὸ αὐτὸ σύστημα τὰς πρώτας οὐσίας ἅμα ἀϊδίους, συνθέτους ἐξ ὕλης καὶ γεννητὰς ἐξ ἐναντίων ποιεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX2","text":"Ἀδύνατον μίαν ἀριθμητικὴν ἀντίθεσιν τὰς διαφορὰς οὐσίας, ποιοῦ, ποσοῦ καὶ πρός τι ἐξαντλεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3","text":"Ἄνευ ἀποδεδομένου τρόπου αἰτιότητος τὸ χωριστὸν μαθηματικὸν πεδίον πρὸς τὰ αἰσθητὰ ἀργὸν καὶ ἀσύνδετον μένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX4","text":"Ἐν τῷ σχήματι ἀρχή = στοιχεῖον καὶ ἕν = ἀγαθόν, οὐδεμία θέσις τοῦ ἀγαθοῦ ἀπαλλάσσεται τοῦ ποιεῖν τὸ ἀντικείμενον κακὸν καὶ τὰ σύνθετα μετέχοντα κακοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX5","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐνδιάμεσον μαθηματικὸν ἀριθμὸν μεταξὺ εἰδῶν καὶ αἰσθητῶν τίθεσθαι, ἐὰν μήτε ἴδια στοιχεῖα μήτε ἴδιον τρόπον γενέσεως μήτε αἰτιακὸν ἔργον ἔχῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη δοκιμὴ κινείται οὕτως: προτεινομένη ἀρχή → καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου ὕπαρξις → προτεραιότης τοῦ ὑποκειμένου → ἀναίρεσις τῆς πρώτης ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS2","text":"Ἡ κατηγορικὴ δοκιμὴ κινείται οὕτως: ἄνισον ἢ μέγα καὶ μικρόν → πρός τι ἢ πάθος ποσοῦ → ὕστερον οὐσίας → ἀδυναμία στοιχειώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3","text":"Ἡ τροπικὴ δοκιμὴ κινείται οὕτως: στοιχεῖα → σύνθεσις → ὕλη → δύναμις μὴ εἶναι → ἀναίρεσις ἀϊδιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS4","text":"Ἡ σημασιολογικὴ μετάθεσις κινείται οὕτως: ἓν ὂν ἀντικείμενον ἑνὶ μὴ ὄντι → πολυσημία ὄντος καὶ μὴ ὄντος → κατηγορικὴ διαίρεσις καὶ δύναμις → λύσις τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5","text":"Ἡ μέτρησις κινείται οὕτως: ἕν → μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους → μεμετρημένον πλῆθος → ἀριθμός, ἀλλ᾽ οὐ χωριστὴ οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS6","text":"Ἡ αἰτιακὴ δοκιμὴ κινείται οὕτως: ἀριθμητικὴ ἀντιστοιχία → ἔλεγχος ὕλης, εἴδους, κινήσεως καὶ τέλους → ἀπουσία αἰτιακοῦ τρόπου → σύμπτωμα ἢ ἀναλογία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7","text":"Ἡ δοκιμὴ τοῦ χωρισμοῦ κινείται οὕτως: μαθηματικὰ πάθη ἐν αἰσθητοῖς → ἀδυναμία πλήρους χωρισμοῦ → διατήρησις τῆς ἐπιστήμης ἄνευ χωριστῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ συναγωγὴ κινείται οὕτως: ἀποτυχία προτεραιότητος + ἀποτυχία ἀϊδιότητος + ἀποτυχία αἰτιότητος → ἀναίρεσις τῶν χωριστῶν ἀριθμῶν καὶ τῶν ἐναντίων ὡς πρώτων ἀρχῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1","text":"Ἡ κυρία φορὰ τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν: ἐναντίαι ἀρχαί → ἔλεγχος προτεραιότητος → κατηγορικὴ μετάθεσις → ὕλη καὶ δύναμις → ἀναίρεσις ἀϊδιότητος → πολυσημία ὄντος → αἰτιακὴ δοκιμή → ἀναίρεσις χωρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF2","text":"Ἡ ἀξιολογικὴ φορὰ τοῦ λόγου ἐστίν: ἓν ὡς πρώτη ἀρχή → ταύτισις ἑνὸς καὶ ἀγαθοῦ → μεταβολὴ τοῦ ἀντικειμένου εἰς κακόν → καθολικὴ συμμετοχὴ τῶν συνθέτων τῷ κακῷ → διάκρισις τοῦ πρώτου ἀγαθοῦ ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀριθμητικοῦ στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME1","text":"Τὰ ἐναντία μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς χώρας τῶν πρώτων ἀρχῶν εἰς τὴν χώραν τῶν ἐνυπαρχόντων διορισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME2","text":"Τὸ ἓν μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς χωριστῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὴν κατὰ γένος λειτουργίαν τοῦ μέτρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME3","text":"Τὸ μὴ ὂν μετατίθεται ἐκ χωριστῆς ἀντιθέσεως πρὸς τὸ ὂν εἰς κατηγορικὴν ἀπόφασιν, ψεῦδος καὶ δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης παύει εἶναι ἓν πρόβλημα ἀριθμοῦ καὶ διαιρεῖται εἰς πολλαπλότητα οὐσιῶν, ποιοτήτων, ποσοτήτων καὶ σχέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME5","text":"Τὰ μαθηματικὰ μετατίθεται ἐκ χωριστοῦ κόσμου εἰς γνωστὰ πάθη καὶ λόγους ἐν τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς θεωρουμένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME6","text":"Αἱ ἀριθμητικαὶ ὁμοιότητες μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς αἰτιότητος εἰς τὴν ἀναλογίαν καὶ τὸ οἰκεῖον σύμπτωμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME7","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν μετατίθεται ἐκ τοῦ ἑνὸς ὡς στοιχείου εἰς τὸ πρῶτον ὡς αὐτάρκη καὶ σωζομένην ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME8","text":"Ἡ ζήτησις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τοῦ πῶς πάντα τὰ ὄντα πολλά ἐστιν εἰς τὸ πῶς πολλαὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίαι δύνανται εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ βαθμοῦ ἐλέγχονται τὸ ἕν, ἡ ἀόριστος δυάς, τὸ μέγα καὶ μικρόν, οἱ χωριστοὶ ἀριθμοὶ καὶ αἱ ἀριθμητικαὶ συμπτώσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμοῦ διακρίνονται οὐσία, ποσόν, ποιόν, πρός τι, ὕλη, δύναμις, ἐνέργεια καὶ οἱ τρόποι τῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὑπερστρατηγικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ ζήτησις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τῆς ἐπινοήσεως ἀντιθέτων στοιχείων εἰς τὴν δοκιμὴν προτεραιότητος, τροπικῆς συνοχῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἰσχύος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμοῦ τὸ ἀΐδιον ὡς ἐνέργεια ἄνευ δυνατότητος τοῦ μὴ εἶναι τίθεται, ἡ δὲ γένεσις εἰς τὸ δυνάμει ὂν περιορίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἱκανὰ πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κυρίου ἐλέγχου εἰσίν, ἐπεὶ συνδέουσι προτεραιότητα, κατηγορίαν, δύναμιν, ἀϊδιότητα καὶ αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT2","text":"Ἰσχυροτάτη ἡ διάταξίς ἐστιν ὅπου τὸ πρός τι ὡς ὕστερον οὐσίας ἀποκλείεται ἀπὸ τῆς ὕλης, καὶ ὅπου ἡ ὕλη διὰ τῆς δυνάμεως ἀσύμβατος πρὸς τὸ ἀΐδιον δείκνυται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3","text":"Ἀδιοριστότερον μένει πῶς ἀκριβῶς πολλαὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίαι ὑφίστανται, ἐπεὶ ὁ λόγος τὴν ἀπορίαν ἀνατίθησι μᾶλλον ἢ ἐνταῦθα λύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT4","text":"Ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν τὰ μαθηματικὰ οὐ χωριστὰ ὄντα ἐπιστητὰ μένει εἰς προτέρους λόγους ἀναπέμπεται καὶ οὐ πλήρως ἐνταῦθα κατασκευάζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τῆς ἀριθμητικῆς αἰτιότητος ἀκριβῶς στηρίζεται τῷ μηδένα τῶν τεσσάρων τρόπων αἰτίας ἀποδίδοσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6","text":"Ἡ σχέσις τοῦ ἀγαθοῦ πρὸς τὴν πρώτην ἐνέργειαν δηλοῦται μὲν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ εἰς πλήρη θετικὴν θεωρίαν ἀνάγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT7","text":"Αἱ πολλαὶ ἀριθμητικαὶ ὁμοιότητες ῥητορικῶς πυκνοῦσι τὸν ἔλεγχον, ἡ δὲ ἀπόδειξις δύναται ἄνευ αὐτῶν μένειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT8","text":"Ἡ κυρία ῥωγμὴ τοῦ ἀντιπάλου συστήματος ἐστὶν ὅτι τὰ αὐτὰ ὡς ὕστερα πάθη καὶ ὡς πρότερα στοιχεῖα, ὡς γεννητὰ καὶ ὡς ἀΐδια, ὡς χωριστὰ καὶ ὡς ἐν τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς αἴτια τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἥτις ἀπὸ τῆς ἀποτυχίας τῶν προτεινομένων ἀρχῶν εἰς τὴν κατηγορικὴν καὶ τροπικὴν ἀναθεμελίωσιν χωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175110686503Z_e2d10a39","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Book 14","source_sha256":"13ee970c529b48659cb83d915e6b4fdb0955cfe920ec810bae15ff9449a72d15","sha256":"28e0fe3059374a001ad2c45ffb4649cd4af7542848801cd912a6c97b0a153dd9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:51:10.687723+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1","text":"It is examined whether a system of contraries—the one, the indefinite dyad, and separate numbers—can generate immovable and eternal substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS2","text":"The principle of all things cannot be an affection, a contrary, or something said relative to a subject, since its subject would be prior to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS3","text":"The one is transferred from substance to measure, while the great and small, much and little, unequal and other are transferred from elements to affections and relatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4","text":"Eternity is tested through the sequence element → composition → matter → potentiality not to be, which destroys eternal substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS5","text":"Generation and multiplicity are resolved not through a separate non-being, but through the multivocity of being and of potential being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS6","text":"Separate numbers and mathematical objects are examined by asking in what way they are causes, generated, separate, and useful to sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS7","text":"The demonstration is both refutative and genealogical, proceeding from categorical confusions to modal and causal contradictions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","text":"What is in a subject is not a principle of all things, since its subject is prior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","text":"All contraries exist in a subject and are not separate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3","text":"Nothing is contrary to substance qua substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4","text":"The relative is posterior to quality and quantity and is furthest removed from substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5","text":"The matter of each thing is that which is potentially this thing which it can become actually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","text":"Everything composed of immanent elements is composite and has matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7","text":"What is potentially can both be active and not be active.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","text":"No substance is eternal unless it is actuality and is incapable of not being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","text":"Being and non-being are said in many ways according to the categories, falsity, and potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10","text":"Generation comes from what is not actually, but is potentially what is to be generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","text":"The one signifies a measure of some plurality, not a separate substance in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12","text":"Number is a measured plurality and a plurality of measures, but not the measure itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A13","text":"All things measured by the same measure have some common genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A14","text":"The mathematical affections' existing in sensible bodies is incompatible with mathematical objects' being separate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","text":"A cause qua cause is either matter, form and account, mover, or end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A16","text":"The same number can belong to many and different things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17","text":"Nothing is prior to what always is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18","text":"The first, eternal, and most self-sufficient is good in itself, because well-being and preservation belong to it primarily.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX1","text":"No contrary is properly a principle of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX2","text":"The one is neither a separate substance nor a number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX3","text":"The unequal, the great and small, the much and little, are neither matter nor elements of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX4","text":"The false is not a productive non-being from which beings come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX5","text":"The other and the relative are neither contraries nor negations of being and the one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX6","text":"An eternal substance cannot be composed of immanent material elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7","text":"The truth of mathematics and the existence of sciences do not prove separate mathematical things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX8","text":"Points, lines, surfaces, and the remaining limits are not substances qua limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX9","text":"The generation of eternal numbers, properly so called, is impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10","text":"Number is neither matter, nor form, nor productive cause, nor end of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11","text":"Numerical coincidences and slight similarities are not causes of the things with which they coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX12","text":"Neither must the good be expelled from the first, nor must it be identified with the one as an element of numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D1","text":"Contraries can only be derivative determinations of a subject, so that another first principle of them must be sought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","text":"The great and small, the much and little, and the unequal, as affections of quantities and relatives, cannot provide matter for numbers or substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","text":"If some eternal substance were composed of immanent elements, it would have matter and a potentiality not to be, and therefore would not be eternal.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D4","text":"Generation does not require a separate nature of non-being, but what is potentially and not yet actually.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5","text":"The one and number follow the measured genus and are not first separate substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6","text":"The plurality of beings is not resolved through one thing opposed to being, but is first divided according to the different meanings of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","text":"Mathematical objects remain knowable and true, but need not be separate from sensibles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8","text":"The commonness of number among different things provides neither identity nor causal explanation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D9","text":"The generation of an eternal number introduces prior and posterior into that in which there can be no prior.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:D10","text":"The good belongs to the first in itself, but its identification with the one as a numerical element makes the units good and the opposed element evil.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD1","text":"The theory of contrary principles arises from taking being and the one univocally, overlooking categorical differences and elevating relatives into substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD2","text":"Separate number becomes at once substance and quantity, eternal and generated, separate and active in bodies, first and composed from posterior categories.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD3","text":"The scientific autonomy of mathematics does not entail their ontological separation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD4","text":"Whenever numerical correspondence is posited instead of matter, form, motion, or end, explanation degenerates into a collection of coincidences and analogies.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5","text":"The correct inquiry concerning the good must distinguish the first as self-sufficient actuality from the numerical unit as a posited element.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD6","text":"Categorical distinction dissolves the common question how beings are many, but leaves the more precise aporia how there are many actual substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX1","text":"It must be false that being and the one are said univocally and as common genera of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that what is predicated of a subject be at once an element and matter of the same subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the truth of a proposition or theorem be sufficient proof of a separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that similarity, numerical equality, or coincidence, without another account, provide a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5","text":"Time, priority, or a process of generation within the eternal itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6","text":"It is excluded that every principle be an element, since the first cause need not inhere as matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX7","text":"It is excluded that the relative supply the potentiality or subject of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX1","text":"It is impossible for the same system to make first substances at once eternal, composite from matter, and generated from contraries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX2","text":"It is impossible for one numerical opposition to exhaust the differences of substance, quality, quantity, and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3","text":"Without an assigned mode of causality, the separate mathematical domain remains inert and disconnected in relation to sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX4","text":"In the scheme principle = element and one = good, no positing of the good escapes making the opposite evil and composites participants in evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX5","text":"It is impossible to posit an intermediate mathematical number between forms and sensibles if it has neither its own elements, nor its own mode of generation, nor a causal function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1","text":"The first test proceeds thus: proposed principle → existence in a subject → priority of the subject → destruction of the first principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS2","text":"The categorical test proceeds thus: unequal or great and small → relative or affection of quantity → posterior to substance → impossibility of being an element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3","text":"The modal test proceeds thus: elements → composition → matter → potentiality not to be → destruction of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS4","text":"The semantic shift proceeds thus: one being opposed to one non-being → multivocity of being and non-being → categorical division and potentiality → resolution of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5","text":"Measurement proceeds thus: one → measure of a homogeneous plurality → measured plurality → number, but not separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS6","text":"The causal test proceeds thus: numerical correspondence → examination of matter, form, motion, and end → absence of causal mode → coincidence or analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7","text":"The test of separation proceeds thus: mathematical affections in sensibles → impossibility of complete separation → preservation of science without separate substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8","text":"The final inference proceeds thus: failure of priority + failure of eternity + failure of causality → destruction of separate numbers and of contraries as first principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1","text":"The principal course of the argument is: contrary principles → test of priority → categorical shift → matter and potentiality → destruction of eternity → multivocity of being → causal test → destruction of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF2","text":"The evaluative course of the argument is: one as first principle → identification of one and good → conversion of the opposite into evil → universal participation of composites in evil → distinction of the first good from the numerical element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME1","text":"Contraries are transferred from the domain of first principles to the domain of immanent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME2","text":"The one is transferred from separate substance to the generic function of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME3","text":"Non-being is transferred from a separate opposition to being to categorical negation, falsity, and potentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4","text":"Multiplicity ceases to be one problem of number and is divided into multiplicity of substances, qualities, quantities, and relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME5","text":"Mathematical objects are transferred from a separate world to knowable affections and accounts considered in sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME6","text":"Numerical similarities are transferred from causality to analogy and the proper coincidence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME7","text":"The good is transferred from the one as element to the first as self-sufficient and preserved actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME8","text":"The inquiry is transferred from how all beings are many to how many actual substances can exist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the one, the indefinite dyad, the great and small, separate numbers, and numerical coincidences are examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT2","text":"At the level of arrangement, substance, quantity, quality, relation, matter, potentiality, actuality, and the modes of causality are distinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3","text":"At the super-strategic level, the inquiry is transferred from the invention of opposing elements to the test of priority, modal coherence, and causal strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4","text":"At the level concerning being and time, the eternal is posited as actuality without potentiality not to be, while generation is restricted to potential being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the principal refutation, since they connect priority, category, potentiality, eternity, and causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT2","text":"The strongest arrangement is where the relative, as posterior to substance, is excluded from matter, and where matter, through potentiality, is shown incompatible with the eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3","text":"How precisely many actual substances subsist remains more indeterminate, since the argument raises the aporia rather than resolves it here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT4","text":"The way in which mathematical objects, though not separate, remain knowable is referred back to earlier accounts and is not fully established here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT5","text":"The destruction of numerical causality rests precisely on no one of the four modes of cause being rendered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6","text":"The relation of the good to the first actuality is indicated, but is not developed into a complete positive theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT7","text":"The many numerical similarities rhetorically thicken the refutation, but the demonstration can remain without them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT8","text":"The principal fissure of the opposing system is that the same things are posited as posterior affections and prior elements, as generated and eternal, as separate and as causes in sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement of the argument, which proceeds from the failure of the proposed principles to categorical and modal refoundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_DAZY_BO_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_DAZY_BO_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_DAZY_BO_6:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Book 14"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 14","title":"Book 14","context":"Chapter 14","original_title":"Book 14","original_context":"Chapter 14"},"original_title":"Book 14","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 01–03","order":1,"parents":["CH_DAZY_BOO1","CH_DAZY_BOO2","CH_DAZY_BOO3"],"revision":"CL_DAZY_01@R001","sha256":"7fa0196295dbaad1582828f6cec29e26639b42e71a1b9859d33c4ea5c737c7ab","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον ἀπόρημα ἐστὶν εἰ ἡ τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων σοφία δύναται ἅμα τὴν ἀλήθειαν, τὴν ἑνότητα τῆς ἐπιστήμης καὶ τὴν οὐσίαν θεμελιοῦν, ὅτε αὐτὰ ταῦτα ζητούμενα μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ ζητουμένη σοφία ὁρίζεται διὰ τῶν πρώτων καὶ καθόλου αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἰσχὺς τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ πεπερασμένην αἰτιακὴν τάξιν καὶ ἀπὸ μελλούσας διακρίσεις.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-03","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς ἀναβαίνει μὲν ἀπὸ τῶν αἰσθητῶν πρὸς τὰ καθόλου καὶ τὰ αἴτια, μετατίθησι δὲ τὴν ἀλήθειαν εἰς τάξιν τοῦ εἶναι, εἶτα δοκιμάζει διαπορητικῶς τὰ θεμέλια τῆς ἀναβάσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-04","text":"Ἡ φορὰ προβαίνει ἀπὸ φυσικὴν ὄρεξιν καὶ μερικὰς δόξας εἰς αἰτιακὴν κατάταξιν, ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς τὸν περιορισμὸν τῆς ἀπείρου ἀναγωγῆς, καὶ τέλος εἰς τὴν λύσιν τοῦ ἰδίου δεσμοῦ τῶν ἀρχῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μικτή ἐστιν, ἀναβατικὴ κατὰ τὴν γνῶσιν, ἀθροιστικὴ κατὰ τὰς δόξας, ἀποφατικὴ κατὰ τὰς ἀνεπαρκεῖς αἰτίας καὶ ἑλικοειδὴς κατὰ τὴν ἐπάνοδον ἐπὶ τὰ θεμέλια.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-06","text":"Ἡ τετραχὴ αἰτιότης, ἡ περατότης τῶν ἀρχῶν καὶ ἡ προαπορία συγκροτοῦσι διαδοχικῶς κριτήριον πληρότητος, ὅρον γνωσιμότητος καὶ μηχανὴν ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ διαπόρησις οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν προτέραν αἰτιολογίαν, ἀλλὰ ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι αἱ πρώται αἰτίαι οὔπω παρέχουσιν αὐτόθεν τὴν ἑνότητα τῆς περὶ τὸ ὂν ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις οὐ τετελεσμένη θεωρία ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ σύστημα ὅρων, ἀποκλεισμῶν καὶ ἀλύτων ἀντιτάσεων, ὃ τὸ εἶδος τῆς μελλούσης λύσεως προδιαγράφει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ τοῦ εἰδέναι ὄρεξις καθολικὴ μὲν ἐστίν, ἡ δὲ πρόσβασις πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν διανεμημένη διὰ πολλῶν καὶ μερικῶν συμβολῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἐπιστήμη κυρίως ἐστὶν ἡ τοῦ διότι καὶ τῆς αἰτίας γνῶσις, οὐχ ἡ ψιλὴ κατάληψις τοῦ ὅτι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων σοφία μεταβάλλεται εἰς θεωρίαν τῶν ἀρχῶν αἳ μάλιστα οὖσαι μάλιστα ἀληθεῖς καὶ τῶν ἄλλων αἴτιαι εἰσίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἰτιώδης πληρότης ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν οὐσίας, ὕλης, κινήσεως καὶ τέλους, ἄνευ τοῦ ταῦτα εἰς ἓν ἀδιαφοροποίητον γένος συναγαγεῖν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Πᾶσα αἰτιακὴ καὶ ὁριστικὴ ἀναγωγὴ δεῖ περαίνεσθαι εἰς πρῶτον τι, ἵνα αἰτία, τέλος, νόησις καὶ γένεσις δυνατὰ μένῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀκρίβεια οὐκ ἔστιν ἀδιαφοροποίητος ἀπαίτησις, ἀλλὰ λόγος συμμετρούμενος πρὸς τὴν φύσιν τοῦ ὑποκειμένου καὶ τὸν τρόπον τῆς ζητήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Αἱ προγενέστεραι δόξαι οὔτε αὐθεντία οὔτε ψιλὴ χρονολογία εἰσίν, ἀλλὰ διανεμημένη ὕλη βεβαιώσεως, ἐλέγχου καὶ παραγωγῆς ἀποριῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:D8","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶσα ἀρχὴ κρίνεται οὐ κατὰ τὸ ὄνομα αὐτῆς, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὴν δύναμιν αἰτιᾶσθαι τὰ φαινόμενα καὶ σῴζειν τὰ ἀναγκαῖα ἐπακόλουθα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ καθόλου ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ὄντος ἕνωσιν ἀπαιτεῖ, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἕνωσις αὕτη οὐ δύναται γένει γίγνεσθαι, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὂν πολλαχῶς λέγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ γνώσις τὸ καθόλου ζητεῖ, ἡ δὲ οὐσία τόδε τι σημαίνει· ἡ ἀντίτασις αὕτη τὴν ὅλην περὶ πρώτης ἐπιστήμης ζήτησιν ἕλκει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ εὐπορία προϋποτίθεται πλήρη γνῶσιν τοῦ δεσμοῦ, ὥστε ἡ προαπορία μέρος τῆς λύσεως καὶ οὐ πρότερον αὐτῆς ἐμπόδιον ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Τὰ πρῶτα ἀξιώματα οὐ δύναται πάντα δι᾽ ἀποδείξεως θεμελιοῦσθαι, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα ἀπόδειξις ἀναποδείκτοις τισὶν ἀρχαῖς χρῆται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","text":"[Persistent] Χωριστὴ οὐσία οὐκ ἔχει αὐτόθεν αἰτιώδη προτεραιότητα, ἐὰν ἡ πρὸς τὰ αἰσθητά, τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν γένεσιν σχέσις ἀπόρρητος μένῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-14","text":"[Terminal] Τὸ σύστημα τελευτᾷ οὐκ εἰς θετικὴν θεωρίαν, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς ἀκριβῆ προσδιορισμὸν ὧν ἡ μέλλουσα θεωρία δεῖ ἅμα σῴζειν καὶ ἀποκλείειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ γνωστικὴ ἄνοδος ἀπὸ τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον πρὸς τὴν αἰτίαν μένει, μεταβάλλεται δὲ ἀπὸ ἁπλῆν ἱεραρχίαν γνώσεως εἰς ἀντίτασιν καθολικῆς ἐπιστήμης καὶ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία τῶν δοξῶν πρῶτον βεβαιοῖ τὰ γένη τῶν αἰτίων, εἶτα γίνεται συλλογικὴ πρόσβασις πρὸς ἀλήθειαν, τέλος δὲ ὕλη διαλεκτικῆς δοκιμῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ τετραχὴ αἰτιότης ἀπὸ κανόνος πληρότητος μετατίθεται εἰς τέσσαρας πεπερασμένας ἀναγωγάς, εἶτα δὲ εἰς ἀπορίαν περὶ τῆς ἑνότητος τῆς ἐπιστήμης αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ καθόλου πρῶτον ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἀνώτερος βαθμὸς γνώσεως, εἶτα ὡς συναγωγὴ μερικῶν ἀληθειῶν, τέλος δὲ ὡς ὅρος ἀντιτιθέμενος πρὸς τὴν οὐσιώδη ὑπόστασιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία ἀπὸ ὑπόλοιπον τῆς αἰτιώδους κατατάξεως αὔξεται εἰς ἴδιον τρόπον μεθόδου, ὃς ἐλέγχει τὰ θεμέλια τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ γενεαλογικὴν κατάταξιν εἰς μέτρησιν τῆς ἀκριβείας κατὰ τὸ ὑποκείμενον, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς διαλεκτικὴν δοκιμὴν ἀντιθέτων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ κριτικὴ τῶν χωριστῶν εἰδῶν μένει κατὰ τὴν ἀπαίτησιν αἰτιώδους σχέσεως, ἀλλὰ παύει σημαίνουσα καθολικὴν ἀπόρριψιν πάσης νοητῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-08","text":"Τὸ θαυμάζειν, ὃ πρῶτον ἀφετηρία ἦν ἀναιρετέα δι᾽ αἰτίας, ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἀκριβῶς τεταγμένη ἀπορία, ἧς ἡ λύσις ἔτι ἀναβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ μνῆμαι, αἱ ἐμπειρίαι καὶ αἱ τέχναι μένουσιν ἴδιοι μηχανισμοὶ τοῦ πρώτου κατωτέρου στρώματος· εἰς τὸν νῦν βαθμὸν αὔξεται μόνον ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ ὅτι πρὸς τὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ ἐπιμέρους δόξαι τῶν προτέρων οὐ διατηροῦνται καθ᾽ ἑαυτάς, ἀλλ᾽ ἀπορροφῶνται εἰς τὴν καθόλου λειτουργίαν τῆς παραδόσεως ὡς ἐλεγχομένης ὕλης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-03","text":"Τὰ ἔθη τῶν ἀκροατῶν εἰσὶ τοπικὸν μεθοδικὸν πρόβλημα, ἡ δὲ συμμετρία λόγου καὶ πράγματος γεφυροῖ τὰς μονάδας καὶ γίνεται καθόλου κανών.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-04","text":"Τὰ μεταξύ, αἱ στιγμαί, αἱ γραμμαὶ καὶ αἱ ἐπιφάνειαι μένουσι τοπικαὶ δοκιμαί, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ διάκρισις λογικῆς προτεραιότητος καὶ οὐσιώδους χωριστότητος αὔξεται εἰς νῦν κριτήριον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-05","text":"Αἱ μυθικαὶ διηγήσεις καὶ αἱ ὀνομαστικαὶ μέθεξεις γίνονται ἄχρηστοι ὡς ἴδιαι ἐξηγήσεις, διασῴζονται δὲ ὡς παραδείγματα τοῦ ὅτι ὄνομα ἄνευ αἰτιώδους ἐνεργείας οὐκ ἀρκεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ πρακτικὴ ἐπιτυχία τοῦ ἐμπείρου μένει κατώτερος γνωστικὸς διορισμός, ἡ δὲ διάκρισις πράξεως καὶ θεωρίας αὔξεται εἰς διαφορὰν τέλους καὶ ἀκριβείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς λύσεως ἐν τῇ διαπορητικῇ μονάδι οὐκ ἔστιν ἔλλειψις μεταφερομένη εἰς τὴν σύνθεσιν, ἀλλὰ τελικὴ λειτουργία τοῦ νῦν βαθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-01","text":"Οὔτε αἴσθησις οὔτε ἐμπειρία οὔτε πρακτικὴ ἐπιτυχία μόνη σοφία ἐστίν, ἐὰν τὸ διότι καὶ ἡ καθόλου αἰτία ἀπουσιάζῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-02","text":"Ἡ σοφία οὐχ ὑπηρετικὴ οὐδὲ ποιητικὴ πρὸς ἑτέραν χρείαν ἐστίν, καίτοι ἡ πρακτικὴ ἐπιστήμη ἴδιον τέλος ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-03","text":"Οὔτε ὕλη οὔτε τύχη οὔτε ἀριθμὸς ἄνευ κινητικῆς καὶ τελικῆς αἰτίας δύναται τὴν τάξιν καὶ τὴν γένεσιν ἐξηγεῖσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπειρία τῶν αἰτίων, τῶν τελῶν καὶ τῶν ὁρισμῶν ἀποκλείεται, ἐπειδὴ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν αἰτιότητα, τὴν πρᾶξιν καὶ τὴν ἐπιστήμην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-05","text":"Ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἀκρίβεια οὐκ ἐπιβάλλεται παντὶ γένει, οὐδὲ τὸ σύνηθες τοῦ ἀκροατοῦ γίνεται κριτήριον τοῦ προσήκοντος λόγου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-06","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ προσηγορία τῶν αἰτίων οὐ συνιστᾷ αὐτόθεν μίαν ἐπιστήμην, ἐπειδὴ τὰ γένη αὐτῶν οὔτε ἓν εἰσὶν οὔτε πᾶσιν ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-07","text":"Οὐ δύναται πάντα τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀποδείκνυσθαι, οὐδὲ τὸ τί ἐστιν ὡς ἁπλοῦν πάθος τοῦ ὑποκειμένου δεικνύεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-08","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὐ δύναται γένη εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ τοῦτο τὰς διαφορὰς αὐτῶν προϋποτιθέμενον ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-09","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης, ὁ διπλασιασμὸς καὶ ἡ λογικὴ προτεραιότης οὐκ ἀντικαθιστῶσιν αἰτιώδη λόγον τῆς οὐσίας καὶ τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-01","text":"Οὐδεμία πρώτη ἐπιστήμη μένει, εἰ ἡ αἰτία μὴ πρότερον τοῦ αἰτιατοῦ ᾖ καὶ ἡ ἀναγωγὴ μὴ εἰς πεπερασμένην ἀρχὴν τελευτᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-02","text":"Οὐδεμία καθόλου ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ὄντος δύναται τὴν ἑνότητα αὐτῆς ἐκ τοῦ ὄντος ὡς γένους λαμβάνειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-03","text":"Οὔτε τὸ καθόλου δύναται ἁπλῶς τόδε τι εἶναι οὔτε τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον αὐτόθεν καθόλου γνωστόν, ἄνευ μελλούσης μεσιτευούσης διακρίσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-04","text":"Οὐδεμία θεωρία τῶν ἀρχῶν ἱκανὴ μένει, ἐὰν μὴ τὰς ἐναντίας ἐκβάσεις γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς, μονῆς καὶ μεταβολῆς διαφοροποιῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-05","text":"Οὐδεμία χωριστὴ τάξις πραγμάτων γίνεται ἐξηγητική, ἐὰν μόνον ἀντίγραφα τῶν αἰσθητῶν προστιθῇ καὶ μὴ νέαν αἰτιώδη δύναμιν παρέχῃ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-06","text":"Οὐδεμία ὀρθὴ μέθοδος μένει, εἰ ὁ τρόπος τοῦ λόγου ἀπὸ τὸ ἔθος τοῦ ἀκροατοῦ καὶ οὐκ ἀπὸ τὸ πρᾶγμα ὁρίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-07","text":"Οὐδεμία εὐπορία δυνατή ἐστιν, ἐὰν ὁ δεσμὸς τῆς ἀπορίας μὴ πρότερον ὅλος γνωσθῇ καὶ τὰ ἀντίρροπα ἐπακόλουθα μὴ δοκιμασθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","text":"Ἀδύνατος τίθεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ πᾶν αἴτιον μέσον ἑτέρου αἰτίου ἐστίν, μηδεμιᾶς πρώτης ἀρχῆς τὴν τάξιν θεμελιούσης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτός ἐστι νόησις ἢ πρᾶξις ἄνευ πεπερασμένου τέλους, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀτελεύτητος φορά ἀναιρεῖ τὸ διὰ τί.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτός ἐστι μία φύσις ἀδιάκριτος, ἣ ἅμα καθόλου καὶ τόδε τι, μία καὶ πολλά, χωριστὴ καὶ ἐνυπάρχουσα ὑποτίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ βαθυτάτη ἀπουσία ἐστὶν ὁ θετικὸς τρόπος τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ ὄντος, ἐπεὶ τὸ γένος ἀποκλείεται ἀλλ᾽ ἄλλος δεσμὸς οὔπω δίδοται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-05","text":"Ἀπαγορεύεται ἡ μεταβολὴ τῆς νοητῆς οὐσίας εἰς δεύτερον κόσμον ἀντιγράφων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ νοητότης ἄνευ αἰτιώδους σχέσεως κενὴ μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-01","text":"Ἡ σοφία τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων δυνατὴ γίνεται μόνον ἐὰν ἡ αἰτιακὴ τάξις πεπερασμένη ᾖ· ἄπειρος γὰρ ἀναγωγὴ τὸ πρῶτον καὶ τὴν γνώσιν ἅμα ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-02","text":"Τὰ τέτταρα γένη τῶν αἰτίων οὐ μόνον κατάταξιν παρέχει, ἀλλὰ τέσσαρας διακεκριμένας ἀναγωγὰς ὧν ἑκάστη δεῖ ἴδιον πέρας καὶ ἴδιον ἐξηγητικὸν ἔργον ἔχειν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-03","text":"Ἡ διαχρονικὴ συναγωγὴ δοξῶν προάγει τὴν ἀλήθειαν μόνον ὅταν αἱ δόξαι κρίνονται κατὰ τὴν αἰτιώδη δύναμιν καὶ τὰ ἀναγκαῖα ἐπακόλουθα αὐτῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-04","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὂν γένος οὐκ ἔστιν, ἡ πρώτη ἐπιστήμη ὀφείλει ζητεῖν ἕνωσιν τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων ἥτις μήτε τὰς διαφορὰς ἀναιρεῖ μήτε εἰς ἄσχετον πλῆθος διασπᾷ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀξίωσις καθόλου γνώσεως καὶ ἡ τόδε τι φύσις τῆς οὐσίας γεννῶσι τὴν κεντρικὴν ἀπορίαν ὅτι τὸ μάλιστα ἐπιστητὸν καὶ τὸ μάλιστα ὂν οὐ συμπίπτει ἁπλῶς.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-06","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ πρῶτα ἀξιώματα οὐκ ἀποδείκνυνται πάντα, ἡ διαλεκτικὴ προαπορία γίνεται προσήκων τρόπος ἐλέγχου τῶν ἀρχῶν ἄνευ κυκλικῆς ἀποδείξεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-07","text":"Χωριστὰ ὄντα δικαιοῦται μόνον ἐὰν αἰτιῶνται τὸ εἶναι, τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν γένεσιν ἢ τὴν ἀϊδιότητα, οὐ διὰ μόνην τὴν χωριστότητα.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-08","text":"Ἡ θεωρητικὴ περατότης τῶν αἰτίων καὶ ἡ πρακτικὴ περατότης τοῦ τέλους ἀποτελοῦσι μίαν ἀρχήν, καθ᾽ ἣν νοεῖν καὶ πράττειν σημαίνει πρὸς ὡρισμένον διὰ τί κινεῖσθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-09","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τελικῆς λύσεως οὐ καταλύει τὴν σύνθεσιν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει αὐτὴν εἰς ἀκριβῆ μηχανὴν καθορισμοῦ τῶν ἀναγκαίων γνωρισμάτων πάσης μελλούσης θεωρίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:GA-14","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","text":"Τὸ εἶναι, τὸ ἀληθεύειν καὶ τὸ αἰτιᾶσθαι συντάσσονται κατὰ κοινὴν βαθμίδα, ὥστε ὀντολογικὴ προτεραιότης καὶ γνωστικὴ θεμελίωσις ἀλλήλας προϋποτίθενται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις οὐχ ἁπλῶς ἀναβαίνει πρὸς τὰ πρῶτα, ἀλλ᾽ ἐπανέρχεται ἐπὶ τὰς ἀρχὰς τῆς ἰδίας ἀναβάσεως καὶ αὐτὰς διαπορεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται διπλῆ τάξις· αἱ ὕστεραι δόξαι συσσωρεύουσιν ἀλήθειαν, ἡ δὲ θεωρία δι᾽ αὐτῶν ἐπανέρχεται εἰς τὰ φύσει πρότερα καὶ ἀΐδια αἴτια.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-04","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ φυσικῶς ὀρεγόμενον αἰσθήσεως εἰς συλλέγοντα δόξας, κρίνοντα αἰτίας καὶ διαποροῦντα τὰ ἴδια κριτήρια.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-01","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ δύναμις τοῦ πράττειν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ πεπερασμένον τέλος, ὥστε ἡ τελεολογία γίνεται ὅρος οὐ μόνον κοσμικῆς τάξεως ἀλλὰ καὶ ἔμφρονος ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-06","text":"Αἱ ἐπιστῆμαι σχηματίζουσιν ἱεραρχίαν σκοπῶν καὶ αἰτιῶν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἑνότης τῆς ἀρχικωτάτης ἐπιστήμης μένει ἀπόδεικτος ὅταν τὸ ὂν γένος μὴ ᾖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης διαγράφεται ὡς πεπερασμένον ἀλλὰ διαφοροποιημένον πλέγμα αἰτίων, ἐν ᾧ οὐδεμία μία ἀρχὴ δύναται ἀδιακρίτως πᾶσαν ἔκβασιν ἐξηγεῖν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-08","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος πράττει τὴν ὀντολογίαν αὐτῆς· συλλέγει τὰ μερικά, περαίνει τὰς ἀναγωγάς, διακρίνει τὰ γένη καὶ ἀρνεῖται πρόωρον ἕνωσιν τῶν διαφορῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ ὄρεξις τοῦ εἰδέναι γεννᾷ αἴσθησιν, ἡ αἴσθησις ἐμπειρίαν, ἡ ἐμπειρία καθόλου λόγον, ὁ λόγος αἰτίαν, ἡ δὲ αἰτία νέαν ἀπορίαν περὶ τῶν πρώτων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-02","text":"Αἱ μερικαὶ δόξαι συνάγονται, κατατάσσονται κατὰ τὰ αἴτια, ἐλέγχονται διὰ τῶν παραλείψεων καὶ ἐπανέρχονται ὡς ἀντίρροποι λόγοι τῆς διαπορήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ παράλειψις αἰτίας γεννᾷ ἀνάγκην νέας αἰτίας, ἡ συμπλήρωσις τῶν τεσσάρων γεννᾷ ζήτησιν τῆς περατότητος, καὶ ἡ περατότης ζήτησιν τῆς ἑνότητος αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:D7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-04","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τῆς περατότητος συνδέει αἰτίαν, τέλος, ὁρισμὸν καὶ γνώσιν· ἡ ἀπείρου πρόοδος ἑνὸς ὅρου ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἀναίρεσις πάντων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντίτασις καθόλου καὶ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ἐστὶν ἕλκουσα ἀρχή, διότι ἐπανέρχεται ἐν τῇ γνώσει, τῇ οὐσίᾳ, ταῖς ἀρχαῖς καὶ τῇ ἑνότητι τῆς ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἀντίτασις χωριστοῦ καὶ ἐνυπάρχοντος ἑλίσσεται διὰ τῆς ἀπαιτήσεως ὅτι τὸ πρῶτον δεῖ ἅμα αὐτοτελὲς εἶναι καὶ τῶν αἰσθητῶν αἴτιον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-07","text":"Ἡ προαπορία μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀποτυχίαν ἑκατέρου κέρατος εἰς ἀπαίτησιν νέας διακρίσεως, ἡ δὲ νέα διάκρισις διατηρεῖ τὸ ζήτημα ἕως ἂν τὰ ἀληθῆ ἀμφοτέρων σωθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B01","text":"Αἰσθήσεις, μνῆμαι καὶ μερικαὶ δόξαι συναθροίζονται, ἵνα ἐμπειρία καὶ κοινὴ πρόσβασις πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν γένηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ συναγωγὴ τῶν ὁμοίων μετατίθησι τὸ γνωστικὸν κριτήριον ἀπὸ τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον καὶ τοῦ ὅτι πρὸς τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ διότι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B03","text":"Τὸ διότι διακρίνεται εἰς οὐσίαν, ὕλην, ἀρχὴν κινήσεως καὶ τέλος, αἱ δὲ προγενέστεραι θεωρίαι δοκιμάζονται κατὰ ταύτην τὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιώδης τάξις συνάπτει τὸ μάλιστα ὂν πρὸς τὸ μάλιστα ἀληθές καὶ ἀποκλείει τὴν ἄπειρον πρόοδον ὡς ἀναίρεσιν γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῶν ἀρχῶν συμπληροῦται διὰ μεθοδικῆς συμμετρίας, ὥστε ὁ τρόπος τοῦ λόγου πρὸς τὸ εἶδος τοῦ πράγματος μετρεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B06","text":"Αἱ θεμελιώδεις θέσεις μετατίθενται εἰς ἀντιθέσεις, ἕκαστον δὲ κέρας συνάπτεται πρὸς τοὺς ὅρους ἐπιστήμης, οὐσίας, αἰτίας καὶ ἀποδείξεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ ἀδυνάτων ἐξ ἀμφοτέρων τῶν κεράτων οὐ λήγει εἰς ἁπλῆν ἀναίρεσιν, ἀλλὰ γεννᾷ νέαν διάκρισιν καὶ ὅρους μελλούσης λύσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B01","text":"Φυσικὴ ὄρεξις τοῦ εἰδέναι → αἴσθησις → μνήμη → ἐμπειρία → καθόλου ὑπόληψις → αἰτιώδης ἐπιστήμη.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B02","text":"Αἰτιώδης ἐπιστήμη → τέσσαρα γένη αἰτίων → ἔλεγχος προγενεστέρων θεωριῶν → φανέρωσις παραλείψεων → παραγωγὴ ἀποριῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF5","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B03","text":"Μερικαὶ ἀλήθειαι → ζήτησις τοῦ ὅλου → αἰτιακὴ τάξις → ἀναίρεσις ἀπείρου → περατότης ἀρχῶν → δυνατότης γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B04","text":"Πεπερασμέναι ἀρχαί → ζήτησις προσήκοντος τρόπου → μέτρησις ἀκριβείας κατὰ τὸ ὑποκείμενον → ἀδυναμία καθολικῆς ἀποδεικτικῆς μεθόδου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B05","text":"Ἀμφισβήτησις τῆς πρώτης ἐπιστήμης → προαπορία → διχοτομία → ἀντίρροπα ἀδύνατα → ἀκριβέστεροι ὅροι → ἀναβολὴ θετικῆς λύσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-01","text":"Ἡ γνώσις παύει μετρεῖσθαι κατὰ πλῆθος γνωσμάτων καὶ διαγράφεται κατὰ βαθμοὺς καθολικότητος, αἰτιότητος καὶ ἐγγύτητος πρὸς τὰ πρῶτα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἰδίαν κτῆσιν εἰς κοινὴν διαχρονικὴν συναγωγήν, ἥτις ὅμως ἱεραρχεῖται κατὰ τὴν αἰτιώδη προτεραιότητα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-03","text":"Τὸ ἄπειρον παύει εἶναι ψιλὸν μέγεθος καὶ γίνεται συστημικὴ ἀπειλὴ κατὰ αἰτιότητος, τελεολογίας, ὁρισμοῦ καὶ γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-04","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία παύει νοεῖσθαι ὡς αὐτονοήτως μία ἐπιστήμη, καὶ ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ἀντικειμένου αὐτῆς γίνεται αὐτὸ τὸ ζητούμενον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις καθόλου καὶ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον μετατίθεται ἀπὸ λογικὴν διαίρεσιν εἰς ἀντίτασιν ἐπιστητότητος καὶ οὐσιώδους ὑποστάσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰσθητοῦ καὶ χωριστοῦ ἀνασχεδιάζεται κατὰ τὴν αἰτιώδη σχέσιν, οὐ κατὰ μόνην τὴν τοπικὴν ἢ λογικὴν χωριστότητα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-07","text":"Ἡ γένεσις, ἡ φθορὰ καὶ ἡ ἀϊδιότης γίνονται κριτήρια τῶν ἀρχῶν, ὥστε θεωρία τοῦ τί ἐστιν ἄνευ θεωρίας τοῦ μεταβάλλειν ἀτελὴς μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B01","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ἐπιφανειακὸν βαθμὸν ἐξετάζονται αἱ δυνάμεις τῆς γνώσεως, αἱ δόξαι περὶ σοφίας καὶ ἀληθείας, τὰ γένη τῶν αἰτίων καὶ αἱ ἀπορίαι περὶ οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B02","text":"Κατὰ τὸν τῆς διατάξεως βαθμὸν ἐνεργοῦσιν ἡ ἀνάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ ὅτι πρὸς τὸ διότι, ἡ τετραχὴ αἰτιότης, ἡ περατότης καὶ ἡ διαπορητικὴ δοκιμή.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B03","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ὑπερστρατηγικὸν βαθμὸν αἱ διαφωνίαι παύουσιν εἶναι κωλύματα καὶ γίνονται ὕλη κριτικῆς, ἐνώ ἡ πρόωρος αἵρεσις δόγματος κωλύεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B04","text":"Κατὰ τὸν περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμὸν ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται διὰ φύσει προτέρων αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ ζητεῖται φύσις σῴζουσα ἅμα μεταβολήν, πολλότητα καὶ ἀϊδιότητα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B05","text":"Κατὰ τὸν μεθοδικὸν βαθμὸν ἡ σύνθεσις πράττει τὰς θέσεις αὐτῆς διὰ συναγωγῆς μερικῶν, περατώσεως ἀναγωγῶν, διακρίσεως γενῶν καὶ ἀναβολῆς ἀνεπαρκοῦς λύσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-01","text":"Ἡ σοφία τίθεται μία ἐπιστήμη τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων, ἡ δὲ διαπόρησις ἀρνεῖται ὅτι ἡ κοινὴ προσηγορία τῶν αἰτίων ἀρκεῖ πρὸς μίαν ἐπιστήμην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἅμα συλλογικῶς ἐκ μερικῶν δοξῶν αὔξεται καὶ ἱεραρχικῶς ἀπὸ τὰ μάλιστα ὄντα ἐξαρτᾶται, ἡ δὲ σχέσις τῶν δύο τάξεων οὐ πλήρως διήρθρωται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-03","text":"Ἡ καθόλου γνώσις φέρεται ὡς γνώσις πάντων, ἡ δὲ οὐσία ὡς τόδε τι· ἡ σύνθεσις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἕνωσιν ὧν ἁπλῶς ταὐτίζειν ἀπαγορεύει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-04","text":"Ἡ τετραχὴ διαίρεσις φέρεται ὡς ὅρος πληρότητος, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἑνότης καὶ ἡ κοινὴ ἐπιστημονικὴ τάξις τῶν τεσσάρων αἰτίων μένει ἀβέβαιος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-05","text":"Αἱ πρῶται καὶ ἐλάχισται ἀρχαὶ φέρονται ὡς ἀκριβέσταται, ἡ δὲ μέθοδος ἀρνεῖται μίαν ἀκρίβειαν παντὶ ὑποκειμένῳ προσήκειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-06","text":"Ἐὰν μόνον τὰ αἰσθητὰ ᾖ, καθόλου καὶ ἀΐδιον ἀφανίζεται· ἐὰν δὲ χωριστὰ ὄντα μόνον ἀντίγραφα προστίθηται, ἡ αἰτιώδης ἐξήγησις οὐ προάγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-07","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τοῦ ἀπείρου σώζει τὸ πρῶτον, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀπόδειξις αὐτῆς ἐνίοτε προϋποτίθεται τὴν ἀξίαν τοῦ πρώτου ὃ ὀφείλει θεμελιοῦν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ μαρτυρίαν τῆς τετραχῆς αἰτιότητος εἰς συλλογικὴν γένεσιν ἀληθείας καὶ τέλος εἰς διαλεκτικὸν πεδίον ἀμφισβητήσεων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ὑπόλοιπον ἀνεπαρκοῦς αἰτιολογίας εἰς ἀναγκαίαν προπαρασκευὴν καὶ κριτήριον πάσης λύσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-03","text":"Τὸ καθόλου μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ τέλος γνωστικῆς ἀναβάσεως εἰς πηγήν ἀπορίας περὶ τῆς οὐσίας καὶ τῆς ἐπιστητότητος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-04","text":"Ἡ πρώτη αἰτία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ τέλος τῆς ἀναγωγῆς εἰς ἀντικείμενον ἐλέγχου περὶ τοῦ πῶς αἰτιᾶται καὶ πῶς γνωρίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ σημεῖον ἐπιστήμης εἰς ὡρισμένον ὄργανον, ὃ οὔτε τὸ τί ἐστιν οὔτε πάντα τὰ πρῶτα ἀξιώματα δύναται θεμελιοῦν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ τεκμήριον προτεραιότητος εἰς ὑπόθεσιν δεομένην ἰδίας αἰτιώδους δικαιώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκονίζεται ὡς πεπερασμένον πλέγμα διακεκριμένων αἰτιακῶν ὁδῶν, ὧν αἱ συνάψεις δεῖ λυθῆναι καὶ πάλιν ἀκριβέστερον δεθῆναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται ὁδοιπόρος ὃς ἀπὸ αἰσθήσεως ἀναβαίνει, τὰς φωνὰς τῶν προτέρων συλλέγει, ἐπὶ τὰ πρῶτα ἐπανέρχεται καὶ τὸν δεσμὸν τῆς ἰδίας ὁδοῦ ἐξετάζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ἑλικοειδῶς· ἡ ἱστορικὴ διαδοχὴ προάγει τὴν ζήτησιν, ἡ δὲ θεωρία δι᾽ αὐτῆς ἐπανέρχεται πρὸς τὰ φύσει πρότερα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς οὐκ ἔστιν εὐθεῖα κατάληψις πρώτης ἀρχῆς, ἀλλὰ ἀνάβασις, περάτωσις, ἀναστροφὴ πρὸς τὰ θεμέλια καὶ προσεκτικὴ διάλυσις ἀποριῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ ἐξῃρημένα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν γνωστικὴν ἀνάβασιν εἰς τὴν αἰτιακὴν περατότητα καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν διαπορητικὴν δοκιμήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B02","text":"Ἰσχυροτάτη ἡ διάταξις ἐστὶν ὅπου αἰτία, ἀλήθεια, εἶναι, περατότης καὶ γνώσις ἀλλήλων ὅροι γίνονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένει ὁ θετικὸς τρόπος τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ ὄντος, ἡ μεσίτευσις καθόλου καὶ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον καὶ ἡ διαφοροποίησις τῶν πρώτων ἀρχῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ οὐκ ἔστιν εὐθεῖα, ἀλλὰ ἑλικοειδὴς καὶ ἀνακυκλουμένη, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον κεκτημένον κριτήριον ὕστερον αὐτὸ γίνεται ἀντικείμενον ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ διάταξις συμφωνεῖ πρὸς ἑαυτὴν ὡς μηχανὴ παραγωγῆς ὅρων καὶ ἀποκλεισμῶν, οὐχ ὡς ἤδη τετελεσμένη θεωρία τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B06","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε τὴν πρώτην αἰτιολογίαν ἀκυροῖ οὔτε τὰς ὑστέρους ἀπορίας προώρως λύει, ἀλλὰ τὴν μεταβολὴν τῆς μιᾶς εἰς τὴν ἄλλην διατηρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175158969159Z_2f5ca9b1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 01–03","source_sha256":"7fa0196295dbaad1582828f6cec29e26639b42e71a1b9859d33c4ea5c737c7ab","sha256":"2e2c53125bd95ff26667878be370af424553a7a78919030cc1df87925d183e7e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:51:58.971159+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-01","text":"The principal aporia is whether wisdom concerning the first causes can at once ground truth, the unity of science, and substance, while these very things remain objects of inquiry.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-02","text":"The wisdom sought is defined through the first and universal causes, but the force of the definition depends on a finite causal order and on distinctions yet to come.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-03","text":"The argument ascends from sensibles to universals and causes, but relocates truth into an order of being, and then examines aporetically the foundations of the ascent.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-04","text":"The course proceeds from a natural desire and particular opinions to causal classification, from this to the limitation of infinite regress, and finally to the resolution of the proper nexus of principles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-05","text":"The movement is mixed: ascending with respect to knowledge, cumulative with respect to opinions, negative with respect to inadequate causes, and spiral with respect to the return upon foundations.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-06","text":"Fourfold causality, the finitude of principles, and preliminary aporia successively constitute a criterion of completeness, a condition of knowability, and an instrument of examination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-07","text":"The aporia does not overturn the preceding account of causes, but reveals that the first causes do not yet themselves provide the unity of the science concerning being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BAS-08","text":"The conclusion is not a completed theory, but a system of conditions, exclusions, and unresolved oppositions, which prefigures the form of the future solution.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The desire to know is universal, but access to truth is distributed through many partial contributions.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Science properly is knowledge of the why and of the cause, not mere apprehension of the that.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Wisdom concerning the first causes changes into a theory of principles which, being most fully, are most true and are causes of the others.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Causal completeness requires the distinction of substance, matter, motion, and end, without gathering these into one undifferentiated genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Every causal and definitional regress must terminate in some first thing, if cause, end, thinking, and generation are to remain possible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Precision is not an undifferentiated demand, but an account proportioned to the nature of the subject matter and to the manner of inquiry.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Earlier opinions are neither authority nor mere chronology, but distributed material for confirmation, examination, and the production of aporiai.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:D8","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Every principle is judged not by its name, but by its capacity to explain the phenomena and preserve the necessary consequences.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Universal science of being requires unity, but this unity cannot arise through genus, since being is said in many ways.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Knowledge seeks the universal, whereas substance signifies a this something; this opposition draws the whole inquiry concerning first science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] A successful passage presupposes full knowledge of the knot, so that preliminary aporia is part of the solution and not a prior obstacle to it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] The first axioms cannot all be grounded through demonstration, since every demonstration employs certain indemonstrable principles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","text":"[Persistent] Separate substance does not of itself possess causal priority, if its relation to sensibles, motion, and generation remains obscure.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GA-14","text":"[Terminal] The system ends not in a positive theory, but in a precise determination of what a future theory must at once preserve and exclude.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-01","text":"The cognitive ascent from the particular to the cause remains, but changes from a simple hierarchy of knowledge into an opposition between universal science and particular substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-02","text":"The history of opinions first confirms the kinds of causes, then becomes a collective access to truth, and finally material for dialectical examination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-03","text":"Fourfold causality is transferred from a norm of completeness into four finite regressions, and then into an aporia concerning the unity of their science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-04","text":"The universal first operates as a higher grade of knowledge, then as a collection of partial truths, and finally as a condition opposed to substantial subsistence.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","text":"Aporia grows from a remainder of causal classification into a proper mode of method, which examines the foundations of first philosophy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-06","text":"Method passes from genealogical classification to a measure of precision according to the subject matter, and thence to dialectical examination of opposites.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","text":"The critique of separate forms remains with respect to the requirement of causal relation, but ceases to signify a universal rejection of every intelligible substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RMD-08","text":"Wonder, which was initially a starting point to be removed through causes, returns as a precisely ordered aporia, whose solution is still deferred.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-01","text":"Memories, experiences, and arts remain proper mechanisms of the first lower layer; at the present level only the transition from the that to the cause is amplified.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-02","text":"The individual opinions of predecessors are not retained in themselves, but are absorbed into the universal function of tradition as material subject to examination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-03","text":"The habits of the hearers are a local methodological problem, whereas the proportionality of account and thing bridges the units and becomes a universal norm.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-04","text":"Intermediates, points, lines, and surfaces remain local tests, but the distinction between logical priority and substantial separateness is amplified into a present criterion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-05","text":"Mythical narratives and nominal participations become useless as proper explanations, but are preserved as examples that a name without causal efficacy is insufficient.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-06","text":"The practical success of the experienced person remains a lower cognitive determination, whereas the distinction between practice and theory is amplified into a difference of end and precision.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:CGD-07","text":"The deferral of solution in the aporetic unit is not a deficiency carried over into the synthesis, but a final function of the present level.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-01","text":"Neither perception nor experience nor practical success alone is wisdom, if the why and the universal cause are absent.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-02","text":"Wisdom is neither serviceable nor productive for another use, although practical science has its own end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-03","text":"Neither matter nor chance nor number without moving and final cause can explain order and generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","text":"The infinity of causes, ends, and definitions is excluded, because it destroys causality, action, and science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-05","text":"Mathematical precision is not imposed upon every genus, nor does what is customary to the hearer become the criterion of the appropriate account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-06","text":"The common appellation of causes does not of itself constitute one science, since their kinds are neither one nor belong to all things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-07","text":"Not all axioms can be demonstrated, nor is what a thing is demonstrated as a simple attribute of the subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-08","text":"Being and unity cannot be genera, since this, by presupposing their differences, destroys them.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:GNX-09","text":"Separateness, duplication, and logical priority do not replace a causal account of substance and generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-01","text":"No first science remains if the cause is not prior to the caused and the regress does not terminate in a finite principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-02","text":"No universal science of being can derive its unity from being as a genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-03","text":"Neither can the universal simply be a this something nor the particular of itself universally knowable, without a future mediating distinction.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-04","text":"No theory of principles remains sufficient unless it differentiates the contrary outcomes of generation and destruction, permanence and change.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-05","text":"No separate order of things becomes explanatory if it merely adds copies of sensibles and provides no new causal power.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-06","text":"No correct method remains if the mode of account is determined by the habit of the hearer and not by the thing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:DBN-07","text":"No successful passage is possible unless the knot of the aporia is first known as a whole and the contrary consequences are examined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","text":"A world is posited as impossible in which every cause is the means of another cause, with no first principle grounding the order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-02","text":"Thinking or action without a finite end is unacceptable, because endless motion destroys the why.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-03","text":"An undifferentiated single nature is unacceptable, which is supposed at once universal and a this something, one and many, separate and immanent.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-04","text":"The deepest absence is the positive mode of the unity of being, since genus is excluded but another bond is not yet given.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSA-05","text":"The transformation of intelligible substance into a second world of copies is forbidden, because intelligibility without causal relation remains empty.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-01","text":"Wisdom of the first causes becomes possible only if the causal order is finite; for infinite regress at once destroys the first and knowledge.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-02","text":"The four kinds of causes provide not only a classification, but four distinct regressions, each of which must have its own limit and its own explanatory work.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-03","text":"The diachronic collection of opinions advances truth only when opinions are judged by their causal power and their necessary consequences.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-04","text":"Since being is not a genus, first science must seek a unity of things said in many ways which neither destroys their differences nor disperses them into an unrelated multitude.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-05","text":"The claim to universal knowledge and the this-something nature of substance generate the central aporia that what is most knowable and what is most fully being do not simply coincide.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-06","text":"Since the first axioms are not all demonstrated, dialectical preliminary aporia becomes an appropriate mode of examining principles without circular demonstration.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-07","text":"Separate beings are justified only if they cause being, motion, generation, or eternity, not by separateness alone.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BOO1:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-08","text":"The theoretical finitude of causes and the practical finitude of the end constitute one principle, according to which to think and to act means to be moved toward a determinate why.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:XD-09","text":"The impossibility of a final solution does not dissolve the synthesis, but changes it into a precise instrument for determining the necessary marks of every future theory.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:GA-14","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","text":"Being, being true, and causing are ordered according to a common scale, so that ontological priority and cognitive grounding presuppose one another.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","text":"Knowledge does not merely ascend to the first things, but returns upon the principles of its own ascent and subjects them themselves to aporia.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-03","text":"Time becomes a double order: later opinions accumulate truth, while theory through them returns to the things prior by nature and to eternal causes.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-04","text":"The knowing subject changes from one naturally desiring perception into one collecting opinions, judging causes, and subjecting its own criteria to aporia.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-01","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-05","text":"The power to act depends on a finite end, so that teleology becomes a condition not only of cosmic order but also of intelligent activity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BOO1:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-06","text":"The sciences form a hierarchy of aims and causes, but the unity of the most primary science remains unproved when being is not a genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-07","text":"Reality is delineated as a finite but differentiated network of causes, in which no one principle can indiscriminately explain every outcome.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_01:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:BSD-08","text":"The method enacts its ontology: it collects particulars, terminates regressions, distinguishes genera, and refuses a premature unification of differences.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-06","CL_DAZY_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-01","text":"The desire to know generates perception, perception experience, experience universal account, account cause, and cause a new aporia concerning the first things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-02","text":"Partial opinions are collected, classified according to causes, examined through omissions, and return as counterbalancing accounts of aporia.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-03","text":"The omission of a cause generates the need for a new cause, the completion of the four generates inquiry into finitude, and finitude inquiry into their unity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:D7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-04","text":"The loop of finitude connects cause, end, definition, and knowledge; the infinite advance of one term returns as the destruction of all.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-05","text":"The opposition of universal and particular is an attracting principle, because it returns in knowledge, substance, principles, and the unity of science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-06","text":"The opposition of separate and immanent winds through the requirement that the first must at once be self-sufficient and the cause of sensibles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:RLE-07","text":"Preliminary aporia changes the failure of either horn into a demand for a new distinction, and the new distinction preserves the question until the truths of both are saved.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B01","text":"Perceptions, memories, and partial opinions are gathered, so that experience and common access to truth may arise.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B02","text":"The collection of similar things transfers the cognitive criterion from the particular and the that to the universal and the why.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B03","text":"The why is distinguished into substance, matter, principle of motion, and end, and preceding theories are tested according to this division.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO1:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B04","text":"The causal order joins what is most fully being to what is most true and excludes infinite advance as a destruction of knowledge.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B05","text":"The finitude of principles is completed through methodological proportionality, so that the mode of account is measured in relation to the form of the thing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B06","text":"Fundamental positions are transferred into oppositions, and each horn is connected to the conditions of science, substance, cause, and demonstration.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B07","text":"The production of impossibilities from both horns does not end in simple refutation, but generates a new distinction and conditions for a future solution.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B01","text":"Natural desire to know → perception → memory → experience → universal conception → causal science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B02","text":"Causal science → four kinds of causes → examination of preceding theories → disclosure of omissions → production of aporiai.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF5","CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B03","text":"Partial truths → inquiry into the whole → causal order → refutation of infinity → finitude of principles → possibility of knowledge.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B04","text":"Finite principles → inquiry into the appropriate mode → measurement of precision according to the subject matter → impossibility of a universal demonstrative method.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AF5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B05","text":"Questioning of first science → preliminary aporia → dichotomy → counterbalancing impossibilities → more precise conditions → deferral of positive solution.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-01","text":"Knowledge ceases to be measured by a multitude of cognitions and is delineated according to grades of universality, causality, and proximity to the first things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-02","text":"Truth is transferred from private possession into a common diachronic collection, which nevertheless is hierarchized according to causal priority.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-03","text":"The infinite ceases to be mere magnitude and becomes a systemic threat against causality, teleology, definition, and knowledge.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-04","text":"First philosophy ceases to be conceived as self-evidently one science, and the unity of its object becomes itself the object of inquiry.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-05","text":"The distinction between universal and particular is transferred from a logical division into an opposition between knowability and substantial subsistence.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-06","text":"The distinction between sensible and separate is redesigned according to causal relation, not according to local or logical separateness alone.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MME-07","text":"Generation, destruction, and eternity become criteria of principles, so that a theory of what a thing is without a theory of change remains incomplete.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the powers of knowledge, opinions concerning wisdom and truth, the kinds of causes, and aporiai concerning substance are examined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, the ascent from the that to the why, fourfold causality, finitude, and aporetic examination are operative.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, disagreements cease to be impediments and become material for criticism, while premature adoption of doctrine is prevented.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, reality is conceived through causes prior by nature, but a nature preserving at once change, plurality, and eternity is sought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the synthesis enacts its positions through collection of particulars, termination of regressions, distinction of genera, and deferral of an inadequate solution.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-01","text":"Wisdom is posited as one science of the first causes, but aporia denies that the common appellation of causes suffices for one science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-02","text":"Truth at once grows collectively from partial opinions and depends hierarchically on the things most fully being, but the relation of the two orders is not fully articulated.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-03","text":"Universal knowledge is presented as knowledge of all things, but substance as a this something; the synthesis requires the unity of what it forbids simply identifying.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-04","text":"The fourfold division is presented as a condition of completeness, but the unity and common scientific order of the four causes remain uncertain.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-05","text":"The first and most minimal principles are presented as most precise, but the method denies that one precision is appropriate to every subject matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO2:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-06","text":"If only sensibles exist, the universal and eternal vanish; but if separate beings are added only as copies, causal explanation does not advance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:FL-07","text":"The refutation of the infinite preserves the first, but its demonstration sometimes presupposes the value of the first which it ought to ground.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BOO2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-01","text":"History changes from testimony to fourfold causality into the collective generation of truth and finally into a dialectical field of disputes.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-02","text":"Aporia changes from a remainder of inadequate causal explanation into necessary preparation and a criterion of every solution.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-03","text":"The universal changes from the end of cognitive ascent into a source of aporia concerning substance and knowability.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-04","text":"The first cause changes from the end of regress into an object of examination concerning how it causes and how it is known.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-05","text":"Demonstration changes from a mark of science into a limited instrument, which can ground neither what a thing is nor all the first axioms.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MP-06","text":"Separateness changes from evidence of priority into a hypothesis requiring its own causal justification.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO3:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-01","text":"Reality is imaged as a finite network of distinct causal paths, whose connections must be dissolved and again bound more precisely.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a traveler who ascends from perception, gathers the voices of predecessors, returns to the first things, and examines the knot of its own path.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","text":"Time is imaged spirally: historical succession advances the inquiry, while theory through it returns toward things prior by nature.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO1:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:HSI-04","text":"The possible voyage is not a straight apprehension of a first principle, but ascent, termination, return toward foundations, and careful resolution of aporiai.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from cognitive ascent to causal finitude and thence to aporetic examination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest where cause, truth, being, finitude, and knowledge become conditions of one another.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO2:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B03","text":"The positive mode of the unity of being, the mediation of universal and particular, and the differentiation of the first principles remain indeterminate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B04","text":"The coherence is not straight, but spiral and recurrent, since every criterion acquired later itself becomes an object of examination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO3:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B05","text":"The arrangement agrees with itself as an instrument for producing conditions and exclusions, not as an already completed theory of substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BOO1:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B06","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement, because it neither invalidates the first causal account nor prematurely resolves the later aporiai, but preserves the transition from the one to the other.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO1:MRT10","CH_DAZY_BOO3:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_DAZY_01@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_DAZY_01:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 01–03"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Chapters 01–03","context":"Book 1 · Book 2 · Book 3","original_title":"Chapters 01–03","original_context":"Book 1 · Book 2 · Book 3"},"original_title":"Chapters 01–03","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 04–06","order":2,"parents":["CH_DAZY_BOO4","CH_DAZY_BOO5","CH_DAZY_BOO6"],"revision":"CL_DAZY_02@R001","sha256":"5eb5549ceb409d330e2c1e438478ed0b5f7e5f35028e6972b34d2f11632a9138","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B01","text":"Ἡ πολλαχὴ τοῦ ὄντος λέξις καὶ ὁ περιορισμὸς τῶν κατὰ μέρος ἐπιστημῶν γεννῶσι τὸ ἀπόρημα πῶς μία ἐπιστήμη τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὂν θεωρεῖν δύναται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ταύτης τῆς ἐπιστήμης οὔτε μονοσήμαντον γένος οὔτε ἀσύνδετον ὁμωνυμίαν ἀπαιτεῖ, ἀλλὰ τεταγμένην τῶν σημασιῶν πρὸς μίαν πρώτην φύσιν ἀναφοράν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B03","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων ὀνομάτων καθιστᾷ ἐνεργὸν τὴν πρὸς ἓν ἀναφοράν, διορίζουσα κατηγορίαν, αἰτίαν, ὑποκείμενον, δύναμιν, ἐντελέχειαν καὶ τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη συγκροτεῖ τὸ ἴδιον πεδίον διὰ τοῦ καθ᾽ αὑτό, τοῦ ἀναγκαίου καὶ τοῦ ἀεὶ ἢ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολύ, ἐκβάλλουσα τὸ κατὰ τύχην συμβεβηκός.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B05","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἀπὸ σημασιολογικοῦ καὶ κατηγορικοῦ κέντρου μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀρχὴν τῆς τάξεως τῶν ἐπιστημῶν, ἡ δὲ καθολικότης τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας ἐξαρτᾶται τελικῶς ἀπὸ ἀκίνητον καὶ χωριστὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B06","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς μικτός ἐστιν· ἐλεγκτικῶς μὲν ἀνακτᾶται ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος, διαιρετικῶς δὲ ἀνασυντίθεται ἡ τῶν ὄντων γραμματική, ἀποφατικῶς δὲ καθαίρεται τὸ πεδίον τοῦ κυρίως ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B07","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴ κίνησις ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν· ἀπὸ τῆς πολλαπλότητος εἰς τὸ κέντρον, ἀπὸ τοῦ κέντρου εἰς διανεμητικὰς τομάς, καὶ ἀπὸ τῶν τομῶν δι᾽ ἀποκλεισμῶν πάλιν εἰς τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὄν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις ὁρίζει τὴν δυνατὴν χώραν τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας, οὐ μέντοι πλήρως ἀποδεικνύει μήτε τὴν ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν μήτε τὴν ἀκριβῆ σχέσιν τῆς πρωτείας αὐτῆς πρὸς τὴν καθολικότητα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν πολλαχῶς λέγεται, ἀλλ᾽ οἱ τρόποι αὐτοῦ τάσσονται πρὸς κοινὸν λόγον ἢ κυριώτατον σημαινόμενον καὶ οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀσύνδετοι ὁμωνυμίαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ οὐσία μένει ἡ ἕλκουσα ἀρχή, μεταβαίνει δὲ ἀπὸ πρώτην φύσιν καὶ ὑποκείμενον εἰς μορφὴν καὶ τέλος, εἶτα εἰς ἀκίνητον καὶ χωριστὴν πρωτείαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Μία ἐπιστήμη δύναται θεωρεῖν τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα, ἐὰν ἡ ἑνότης αὐτῶν ᾖ ἀναφορικὴ καὶ ἀσύμμετρος, οὐ γενικὴ καὶ μονοσήμαντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις συναποτελοῦσι τοὺς ἀνεξάλειπτους ὅρους τοῦ σημαίνειν, τοῦ κατηγορεῖν καὶ τοῦ ἐπιστημονικῶς γιγνώσκειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Αἱ διαιρέσεις τῶν ὀνομάτων οὐ ψιλὴν λεκτικὴν τάξιν ἀλλὰ διαγραφὴν κατηγοριῶν, αἰτίων, τρόπων ὑπάρξεως καὶ βαθμῶν προτεραιότητος ποιοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ ἐπιστητὸν δεῖ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ, ἀναγκαῖον ἢ κανονικῶς ἐπανερχόμενον εἶναι, ὥστε ἡ ἀπόδειξις ὡρισμένην αἰτίαν ἔχειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς ἀπὸ ἐξηρτημένης κατηγορίας μεταβαίνει εἰς διττὸν τρόπον ὑπάρξεως καὶ τέλος εἰς ἐνδεχόμενον ὑπόλειμμα ἄνευ ἰδίας ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐντελέχεια διασῴζουσι μεταβολήν, ἐνδεχόμενον καὶ διαφορὰν χρόνου ἄνευ ἐνεργείᾳ συναληθείας τῶν ἐναντίων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἰτιότης πολλαπλῆ μένει κατὰ ὕλην, εἶδος, κινοῦν καὶ τέλος, ἀπαιτεῖ δὲ πρῶτον ὅρον ἵνα μήτε εἰς ἄπειρον ἀναχωρῇ μήτε πάντα ἐξ ἀνάγκης γίγνηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀλήθεια πρῶτον ὡς ἀντιστοιχία τοῦ λέγειν πρὸς τὸ ὂν τίθεται, εἶτα ὡς τρόπος τοῦ εἶναι ἀπαριθμεῖται, τέλος δὲ ὡς σύνθεσις καὶ διαίρεσις τῆς διανοίας ἀπὸ τοῦ κυρίως ὄντος χωρίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία καθόλου ἐστὶν οὐ διὰ κοινὸν ὑπεργένος, ἀλλὰ διὰ τὴν ἀναφορὰν τῶν ὄντων πρὸς πρώτην οὐσίαν καὶ τὴν προτεραιότητα ταύτης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ζήτησις περαίνεται διὰ ἐπαναλαμβανομένων ἀποκλεισμῶν, οἳ χωρίζουσι τὸ κυρίως ὂν ἀπὸ τῆς ἀσημαντίας, τοῦ τυχαίου καὶ τῶν παθημάτων τῆς διανοίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ πολλαχῶς λέξις ἐπανέρχεται πρῶτον ὡς ἀπόρημα τῆς ἑνότητος, εἶτα ὡς μέθοδος διαιρέσεως, τέλος δὲ ὡς ἀφορμὴ ἀφαιρέσεως τῶν μὴ κυρίως ὄντων τρόπων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ οὐσία σῴζει τὴν κεντρικὴν ἐνέργειαν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει χώραν· ἐστὶν ἀρχὴ σημασιῶν, διττὸν ὑποκείμενον καὶ εἶδος, καὶ τέλος ἀκίνητον θεωρητὸν τῆς πρώτης ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-03","text":"Τὸ ἓν μετατίθεται ἀπὸ συνακολουθοῦν πάθος τοῦ ὄντος εἰς ἀδιαιρεσίαν καὶ μέτρον, καὶ οὕτως ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς τὴν γενικωτέραν γραμματικὴν ταυτότητος καὶ διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς αὔξεται ἀπὸ κατηγορηματικὴν ἐξάρτησιν εἰς ἀοριστίαν αἰτίας καὶ ἐπιστημονικὸν ἔξω πέρας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-05","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς ἀναστρέφει τὴν ἐνέργειαν αὐτοῦ· ἀρχικῶς στηρίζει τὸν ἔλεγχον τοῦ ψεύδους, μετέπειτα δὲ χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ κυρίως ὂν ὡς πάθος διανοίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης ἀπὸ σχέσιν πρὸς ὡρισμένην ἀρχὴν πληθύνεται εἰς χρονικὴν, γνωστικὴν, δυναμικὴν καὶ οὐσιώδη τάξιν, εἶτα καθίσταται θεμέλιον τῆς καθολικότητος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐντελέχεια ἐπανέρχονται ὡς διάκρισις ἐναντίων, ὡς τρόπος παντὸς κατηγορουμένου καὶ ὡς ὅρος τῆς ἐνύλου ἐνδεχομενικότητος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-08","text":"Τὸ ἀκίνητον κινοῦν ἀρχικῶς πέρας τῆς μεταβολῆς ἐστίν, εἶτα ἀνεξήγητος ὅρος μένει, τέλος δὲ μεταβάλλεται εἰς ὑπόθεσιν τῆς πρώτης καὶ καθόλου ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ ἐπιμέρους διαιρέσεις τῶν λημμάτων μένουσι κατώτεραι, ἐὰν μὴ ἐπανέρχωνται ὡς κοινοὶ ἄξονες κατηγορίας, αἰτίας, οὐσίας, δυνάμεως καὶ τέλους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-02","text":"Ὁ τοπικὸς ἔλεγχος τοῦ ἀρνουμένου αὔξεται εἰς καθόλου ἀξίωμα ὅτι πᾶς λόγος παρασιτεῖ τοῖς ὅροις σημασίας καὶ διαφορᾶς οὓς ἀρνεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","text":"Αἱ λεξικαὶ διαιρέσεις αὔξονται εἰς ὀντολογικὴν γραμματικήν, ἐπειδὴ αἱ αὐταὶ τομαὶ πλείους ἔννοιες καὶ τρόπους ὑπάρξεως τάττουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις φυσικῆς, μαθηματικῆς καὶ πρώτης φιλοσοφίας γεφυροῖ τὴν τοπικὴν ταξινόμησιν πρὸς τὴν καθόλου ἱεραρχίαν τῶν οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-05","text":"Αἱ κατὰ μέρος περιπτώσεις τύχης καὶ συμπτώσεως οὐ διατηροῦνται καθ᾽ αὑτάς, ἀλλὰ συνάγονται εἰς τὸ καθόλου πέρας τῆς ὡρισμένης αἰτιολογίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀπαρίθμησις τοῦ ἀληθοῦς ὡς τρόπου τοῦ εἶναι ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ τὴν ἀνωτέραν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ οὐσίας τοῦ πράγματος καὶ συνθέσεως τῆς διανοίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ ὂν ἢ ἓν μονοσήμαντον γένος ἢ πλῆθος ἀσυνδέτων ὁμωνύμων ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται λόγος ἐν ᾧ αἱ ἀντικείμεναι φάσεις ἅμα ἀληθεύουσιν ἢ τὰ ὀνόματα ἀπείρους καὶ ἀορίστους σημασίας ἔχουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ συμβεβηκὸς ὡς πρῶτον ὑποκείμενον, καθόλου αἴτιον ἢ ἀρχὴ ἐπιστημονικῆς ἀποδείξεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ μονομερὴς ἀναγωγὴ πάσης αἰτιότητος εἰς μόνην ὕλην, μορφήν, κίνησιν ἢ τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις τῆς τοῦ ὄντος θεωρίας πρὸς τὴν σύνθεσιν καὶ διαίρεσιν καθ᾽ ἣν ἡ διάνοια ἀληθεύει ἢ ψεύδεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἄπειρος ἀναχώρησις ἀποδείξεων ἢ αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἡ ἀναγωγὴ πάσης γενέσεως εἰς ἀναγκαίαν εἱμαρμένην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι αἱ σημασίαι ψιλαὶ συμβάσεις εἰσίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τάξις αὐτῶν ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ οὐσίᾳ καὶ τοῖς τρόποις τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πάντα τὰ φαινόμενα καὶ συμβαίνοντα ὁμοίως ἐπιστητά ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐπιστήμη κανονικότητα καὶ ὡρισμένον αἴτιον ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX10","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-03","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι αἱ μερικαὶ ἐπιστῆμαι δύνανται ἐκ τῶν ἰδίων ὑποθέσεων τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὂν καὶ τὴν οὐσίαν θεμελιοῦν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-04","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι μεταβολὴ καὶ ἐνδεχόμενον ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἐνεργείᾳ συνύπαρξιν ἐναντίων ἢ κατάλυσιν τῆς ὡρισμένης οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-05","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ καθολικότης τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας ἐκ ψιλῆς γενικεύσεως λαμβάνεται, ἐπειδὴ ἀπὸ πρώτης φύσεως καὶ προτέρας οὐσίας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ παντελὴς ἀοριστία ἀπαράδεκτός ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κατάφασις αὐτῆς ἤδη ὡρισμένον τι σημαίνει καὶ ἑαυτὴν ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-02","text":"Τάξις ὄντων ἄνευ πρώτου θεμελίου ἀδύνατός ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ αἴσθησις, κατηγορία, συμβεβηκὸς καὶ κίνησις ἕκαστον πρότερον ὅρον ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-03","text":"Κόσμος ὅλος ἐκ τύχης καὶ συμβεβηκότων συγκείμενος ἀπαράδεκτός ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε ὑποκείμενον οὔτε ἐπιστήμην οὔτε ὡρισμένην γένεσιν συνιστᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἐξάντλησις τοῦ ὄντος ἐν αἰσθήσει ἢ διανοίᾳ ἀδύνατός ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ αἰσθητὸν κινοῦν ἀπαιτεῖ καὶ τὸ ἀληθὲς πάθος τῆς διανοίας μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ ῥιζικὴ ἄρνησις πάσης σημασίας δύναται μόνον διὰ σιωπῆς μένειν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ σιωπὴ οὐκ ἀντίπαλον σύστημα ἀλλὰ ἀπουσίαν λόγου ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-01","text":"Ἡ τεταγμένη πολλαχότης, ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν χρήσεων καὶ ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν μὴ κυρίων τρόπων συνάγουσιν ὅτι ἡ τοῦ ὄντος θεωρία ἀνακυκλουμένη κρίσις ἐστὶν καὶ οὐ κατάλογος δεδομένων πραγμάτων.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","text":"Ἡ οὐσία συνάπτει σημασιολογικὴν ἑνότητα, κατηγορηματικὴν ὑπόστασιν καὶ ἱεραρχίαν ἐπιστημῶν, ὥστε μία ἀρχὴ τρεῖς διακεκριμένας ἐνεργείας ἐπιτελεῖν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-03","text":"Ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις, τὸ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ ἡ κανονικὴ ὕπαρξις συγκροτοῦσι κοινὸν ὅρον καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ μεταβολὴ ἐπιστητὴ γίνεται ἄνευ ἀοριστίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-04","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς δύναται λέγεσθαι ὄν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἐξάρτησις αὐτοῦ ἀπὸ ὑποκειμένου καὶ ἐνδεχομένης ὕλης ἀπαγορεύει τὸ γενέσθαι αὐτὸ πρώτην ἀρχὴν ἢ ἴδιον ἐπιστητὸν γένος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀναγκαία μὲν μένει πρὸς τὴν κρίσιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀποβάλλει δὲ τὴν ἰσχὺν τοῦ αὐτοτελοῦς τρόπου οὐσίας, ὅταν ἡ τοῦ ὄντος θεωρία ἀπὸ τῆς διανοίας χωρισθῇ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-06","text":"Τὸ ἀκίνητον ἀπὸ πέρατος τῆς κινήσεως αὔξεται εἰς ὅρον τῆς καθολικότητος, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ αὔξησις αὕτη ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ὕπαρξιν ἣ τίθεται μᾶλλον ἢ ἐνταῦθα ἀποδεικνύεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης καθίσταται ἀσύμμετρον πλέγμα πολλῶν τρόπων, ὧν ἡ ἑνότης ἀπὸ κέντρου ἐξαρτᾶται ἄνευ τῆς διαφορᾶς αὐτῶν ἀφανίζεσθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἔτι μόνος τὴν προτεραιότητα μετρεῖ, ἀλλὰ ὑποτάσσεται τῇ δυνάμει, τῇ ἐντελεχείᾳ, τῇ οὐσίᾳ καὶ τῇ αἰτιακῇ ἐξαρτήσει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις γίνεται ἀνακλαστική, ἐπειδὴ ἐλέγχει τὰς σημασιολογικὰς καὶ ὀντολογικὰς προϋποθέσεις ὧν καὶ ἡ ἄρνησις αὐτῆς χρῆται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης γίνεται πλουραλιστικὴ μὲν κατὰ τὸ εἶδος, ἱεραρχικὴ δὲ κατὰ τὴν προτεραιότητα, καὶ ὁριοθετημένη κατὰ τὸ ἐνδεχόμενον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-05","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον μεταβάλλεται εἰς κριτὴν σημασιῶν, ὅρων καὶ ἐπιστημονικῶν δικαιοδοσιῶν, δεσμευόμενον δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν αὐτῶν ἀρχῶν ἃ ἐλέγχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ πολλαχὴ λέξις γεννᾷ διαίρεσιν, ἡ διαίρεσις κυρίαν σημασίαν, ἡ κυρία σημασία μίαν ἐπιστήμην, ἡ δὲ ἐπιστήμη πάλιν κρίνει τοὺς τρόπους τῆς πολλαχῆς λέξεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02","text":"Τὸ σημαίνειν γεννᾷ ὡρισμένον λόγον, ὁ λόγος οὐσίαν, ἡ οὐσία ἀποκλεισμὸν ἀντιφάσεως, ὁ δὲ ἀποκλεισμὸς διασῴζει πάλιν τὸ σημαίνειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἕλκουσα ἀρχὴ μένει, περὶ ἣν σημασίαι, κατηγορίαι, αἴτια, ἐπιστῆμαι καὶ βαθμοὶ προτεραιότητος διανέμονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ τοῦ συμβεβηκότος ὁδὸς αὔξεως ἐκ κατηγορήματος εἰς τύχην καὶ ἐξ αὐτῆς εἰς ἀοριστίαν αἰτίας καταλήγει, ὅθεν ἀπὸ τῆς ἐπιστήμης ἐκβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς κινήσεως ἑλίσσεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἀκίνητον κινοῦν πρὸς τὴν ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν πρὸς τὴν πρώτη φιλοσοφίαν ὡς καθόλου θεωρίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια περιέρχεται ἀπὸ τὸ πρᾶγμα εἰς τὸν λόγον καὶ ἀπὸ τὸν λόγον εἰς τὴν διάνοιαν, ἵνα ἡ οὐσία τοῦ πράγματος ἀπὸ τὴν κρίσιν περὶ αὐτοῦ χωρισθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:D14","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ παραλαμβάνει πλῆθος θεμελιωδῶν ὀνομάτων καὶ τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος ὡς διανεμημένην ὕλην ἔτι ἀδιορίστως τεταγμένην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ συνάγει τὴν διανεμημένην ὕλην περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν ἄνευ μεταποιεῖν αὐτὴν εἰς μονοσήμαντον γένος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ συναχθεῖσα πολλαπλότης τέμνεται κατὰ κατηγορίαν, αἰτίαν, ὑποκείμενον, προτεραιότητα, δύναμιν, ἐντελέχειαν καὶ τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B04","text":"Ἕκαστος τόμος δοκιμάζεται ἀποφατικῶς διὰ τῶν ἐγγύς, ἀλλ᾽ οὐ ταὐτῶν, περιπτώσεων καὶ διὰ τῆς ἀδυναμίας ἀντιφάσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B05","text":"Οἱ δοκιμασθέντες τρόποι διαιροῦνται εἰς κυρίως ὄντα καὶ εἰς ἐξηρτημένα, ἀόριστα ἢ διανοητικὰ πάθη ἀφαιρετέα τῆς πρώτης ζητήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας αὔξεται μέχρι τῆς ἀκινήτου καὶ χωριστῆς οὐσίας, ἣ τὴν πρώτη ἐπιστήμην καθόλου ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν μὴ κυρίως ὄντων ἐπαναφέρει τὴν μηχανὴν εἰς τὸ ὂν ᾗ ὄν, νῦν δὲ ὡς τεταγμένον καὶ ἱεραρχημένον πεδίον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B01","text":"Πολλαχὴ λέξις τοῦ ὄντος καὶ περιορισμὸς τῶν μερικῶν ἐπιστημῶν → ἀπόρημα περὶ μιᾶς καθόλου ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B02","text":"Πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ τῶν σημασιῶν → πρωτεία οὐσίας → ἀναφορικὴ ἑνότης τοῦ πεδίου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B03","text":"Καθολικότης τοῦ ὄντος → κοινὰ ἀξιώματα → μὴ ἀντίφασις → ἐλεγκτικὴ ἀνάκτησις τοῦ ὡρισμένου λόγου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B04","text":"Ὡρισμένος λόγος → διαίρεσις τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων → ὀντολογικοὶ ἄξονες → κυριώτατα σημαινόμενα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B05","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ γραμματική → διάκρισις καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ συμβεβηκότος → ὅροι ἀποδείξεως καὶ ὡρισμένης αἰτιολογίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B06","text":"Διάκρισις τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος → ἀφαίρεσις συμβεβηκότος καὶ ὡς ἀληθοῦς → ἀνάδειξις τοῦ κυρίως ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B07","text":"Προτεραιότης ἀκινήτου καὶ χωριστῆς οὐσίας → πρώτη φιλοσοφία → ἐπάνοδος εἰς τὰς ἀρχὰς τοῦ ὄντος ᾗ ὄν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ψευδὴς ἀντίθεσις μονοσημάντου γένους καὶ ἀτάκτου ὁμωνυμίας καταλύεται διὰ τῆς πρὸς ἓν τεταγμένης πολλαχότητος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λέξεως καὶ πράγματος μετατάσσεται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνάλυσις τῶν σημασιῶν γίνεται διαγραφὴ τῶν τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-03","text":"Τὰ κοινὰ λογικὰ ἀξιώματα ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς ὅροι τοῦ ὄντος καὶ τοῦ λόγου, ἡ δὲ ἀλήθεια τῆς κρίσεως διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν οὐσίαν τοῦ πράγματος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-04","text":"Αἱ ἐπιστῆμαι διαγράφονται οὐ μόνον κατὰ γένος ἀλλὰ κατὰ κίνησιν, χωρισμόν, προτεραιότητα οὐσίας καὶ τρόπον αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-05","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἁπλὸν κατηγόρημα εἰς ἐνδεχόμενον καὶ ἐπιστημονικῶς ἀόριστον ὑπόλειμμα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-06","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης παύει ταὐτίζεσθαι πρὸς χρονικὴν διαδοχήν, καὶ γίνεται πολλαπλὴ σχέσις γνώσεως, δυνάμεως, ἐντελεχείας, οὐσίας καὶ αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-07","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ εὐθεῖαν διαδοχὴν εἰς τετραμερῆ καὶ ἱεραρχημένην διάταξιν, ἐν ᾗ τὸ τυχαῖον ὅριον μᾶλλον ἢ πέμπτον εἶδος αἰτίας ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:NX12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς ζητοῦνται μία ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ὄντος, οἱ διορισμοὶ τῶν θεμελιωδῶν ὀνομάτων, ἡ τάξις τῶν θεωρητικῶν ἐπιστημῶν καὶ τὸ ἐπιστητὸν τοῦ συμβεβηκότος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B02","text":"Κατὰ τὴν διάταξιν, πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά, ἐπανερχόμεναι τομαί, βαθμοὶ προτεραιότητος καὶ ἀποκλεισμοὶ συνιστῶσιν ἀσύμμετρον σύστημα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B03","text":"Ὑπερστρατηγικῶς ἡ ἔρις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀμέσους καταφάσεις εἰς τὸν ἔλεγχον τῶν ὅρων, σημασιῶν καὶ προϋποθέσεων πάσης δυνατῆς καταφάσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B04","text":"Περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου ἡ πραγματικότης γίνεται πολυτρόπως τεταγμένη, ἱεραρχικὴ κατὰ οὐσίαν, τροπικὴ κατὰ δύναμιν καὶ ἐντελέχειαν, καὶ διῃρημένη κατὰ ἀναγκαῖον, κανονικὸν καὶ συμβεβηκός.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδικῶς τὸ σύστημα πράττει ὃ καταφάσκει, διότι διαιρεῖ τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα, ἐλέγχει τὰ ὅρια αὐτῶν καὶ ἀφαιρεῖ ὅσα ὡρισμένην φύσιν οὐκ ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης θεμελιοῦται ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς μέρους ἐπὶ τῇ πρὸς ἓν σημασιολογικῇ ἀναφορᾷ, ἀφ᾽ ἑτέρου δὲ ἐπὶ τῇ προτεραιότητι χωριστῆς οὐσίας, ἡ δὲ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις τῶν θεμελίων μένει ἄλυτος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-02","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ὡς ἔσχατον ὑποκείμενον καὶ ὡς χωριστὸν εἶδος παρέχει δύο κέντρα, ὧν ἡ μεταξύ ἕνωσις προϋποτίθεται μᾶλλον ἢ πλήρως παράγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-03","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς ἀριθμεῖται ὡς τρόπος τοῦ εἶναι καὶ συγχρόνως ἀποδίδεται τῇ συνθέσει τῆς διανοίας, ὥστε ἡ χώρα αὐτοῦ μεταξὺ ὄντος καὶ κρίσεως ἀσταθὴς μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ἀεὶ ἢ ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ πολὺ ἀπαιτεῖ σταθερότητα, ἡ δὲ ἐνδεχομένη ὕλη γεννᾷ παρεκβάσεις ἃς ἡ διάταξις ὁρίζει ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἐπιστημονικῶς ἐξαντλεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-05","text":"Ἡ ἀκίνητος οὐσία ἀναγκαία πρὸς τὴν καθολικότητα γίνεται, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ὕπαρξις αὐτῆς ὑποθετικῶς τίθεται καὶ ἡ πλήρης ἀπόδειξις ἔξω μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-01","text":"Ἡ πολλαχῶς λέξις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀπειλὴν διασπάσεως εἰς μέθοδον ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως καὶ τέλος εἰς φίλτρον τοῦ κυρίως ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-02","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ διττὸν λεκτικὸν τρόπον γένηται τὸ ὄνομα τῆς ἐνύλου ἀοριστίας καὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-03","text":"Ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐλεγκτικὴν ἀρχὴν λόγου εἰς γενικὸν ὅρον τῆς διαιρετικῆς γραμματικῆς καὶ τῆς ἀποδεικτικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκάζεται ὡς πεδίον πολλῶν τροχιῶν περὶ κεντρικὴν οὐσίαν, διερχομένων διὰ τομῶν καὶ κόσκινων πρὶν ἐπανελθεῖν εἰς τὸ κυρίως ὄν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται χαρτογράφος καὶ κριτὴς τοῦ πεδίου, οὐκ ἔξωθεν ἑστώς, ἀλλὰ δεδεμένον ὑπὸ τῆς σημασίας καὶ τῆς μὴ ἀντιφάσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκάζεται οὐχ ὡς εὐθεῖα διαδοχή, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς διαστρωμάτωσις δυνάμεως, ἐντελεχείας, κανονικῆς ἐπαναλήψεως, συμβεβηκότος καὶ ἀκινήτου ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν· ἀπὸ πολλαπλότητος πρὸς κέντρον, ἀπὸ κέντρου πρὸς διαφορὰς, καὶ δι᾽ ἀφαιρέσεως πάλιν πρὸς τὰς ἀρχὰς τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ ἐξαιρεθέντα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν πολλαχὴν λέξιν διὰ τῆς οὐσίας καὶ τῶν διαιρέσεων εἰς τὴν καθαρθεῖσαν ζήτησιν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένει πῶς ἡ πρὸς ἓν σημασιολογικὴ ἑνότης συνδέεται πρὸς τὴν καθολικότητα τὴν ἐκ προτέρας καὶ χωριστῆς οὐσίας λαμβανομένην.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ὅπου ἡ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά, αἱ ἐπανερχόμεναι τομαί καὶ ἡ διάκρισις τοῦ ἀεὶ, τοῦ κανονικοῦ καὶ τοῦ συμβεβηκότος ἀλλήλας βεβαιοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B04","text":"Τῇ ἀξιωματικῇ ἀναγωγῇ ἀντιτείνει ὅτι ἡ τετραμερὴς αἰτιότης, ἡ ἀκίνητος οὐσία καὶ ἡ ἐκ ταύτης καθολικότης καταλόγῳ ἢ ὑποθέσει μᾶλλον ἢ πλήρει ἀποδείξει στηρίζονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ ἑλικοειδῆ κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ οὐκ ἐξομαλίζει τὴν πολλαπλότητα, ἀλλὰ δείκνυσι πῶς αὕτη κεντροῦται, διαιρεῖται, ἐλέγχεται καὶ ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175240974209Z_eec6ed06","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 04–06","source_sha256":"5eb5549ceb409d330e2c1e438478ed0b5f7e5f35028e6972b34d2f11632a9138","sha256":"29d3c772902263e68483cf555c8cea0e710056657dbd19cb99d2632da56f72be","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:52:40.975091+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B01","text":"The manifold sense of being and the limitation of the particular sciences generate the aporia of how one science can study being qua being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","text":"The unity of this science requires neither a univocal genus nor an unconnected homonymy, but an ordered reference of meanings to one primary nature.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B03","text":"The division of multiply spoken names makes the reference to one operative, distinguishing category, cause, subject, potentiality, actuality, and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B04","text":"Science constitutes its proper field through the per se, the necessary, and the always or for-the-most-part, excluding the accidental concomitant.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B05","text":"Substance changes from a semantic and categorical center into a principle of the ordering of the sciences, while the universality of first philosophy ultimately depends on an unmoved and separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B06","text":"The reasoning is mixed: elenctically the determinate account is recovered; divisionally the grammar of beings is reconstructed; apophatically the field of what is primarily being is purified.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B07","text":"The true movement is spiral: from multiplicity to the center, from the center to distributive divisions, and from the divisions, through exclusions, back to being qua being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AS-B08","text":"The conclusion defines the possible domain of first philosophy, but does not fully demonstrate either the unmoved substance or the precise relation of its priority to universality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being is spoken of in many ways, but its modes are ordered toward a common account or a most primary signification and are not unconnected homonymies.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Substance remains the attracting principle, but moves from primary nature and subject to form and end, then to unmoved and separate priority.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] One science can study things spoken of in many ways, if their unity is referential and asymmetrical, not generic and univocal.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] The determinate account and non-contradiction jointly constitute the indelible conditions of signifying, predicating, and knowing scientifically.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Divisions of names produce not a bare lexical order but a delineation of categories, causes, modes of being, and degrees of priority.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] What is knowable must be per se, necessary, or recurrent in a regular manner, so that demonstration has a determinate cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] The accidental moves from a dependent category into a twofold mode of being and finally into a contingent remainder without a science of its own.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Potentiality and actuality preserve change, contingency, and temporal difference without the actual co-truth of contraries.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Causality remains multiple according to matter, form, mover, and end, but requires a first term, so that it neither recedes to infinity nor makes everything come to be from necessity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Truth is first posited as correspondence of saying to being, then enumerated as a mode of being, and finally separated, as composition and division of thought, from what is primarily being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] First philosophy is universal not through a common super-genus, but through the reference of beings to primary substance and the priority of this substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] The ontological inquiry is completed through repeated exclusions, which separate what is primarily being from insignificance, the accidental, and affections of thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-01","text":"The manifold expression recurs first as an aporia of unity, then as a method of division, and finally as an occasion for removing modes that are not primarily beings.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-02","text":"Substance preserves its central function, but changes place: it is a principle of meanings, a twofold subject and form, and finally the unmoved object of study of the primary science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-03","text":"The one is shifted from a consequent affection of being to indivisibility and measure, and is thus absorbed into the more general grammar of identity and difference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-04","text":"The accidental increases from predicative dependence into indeterminacy of cause and an outer limit of science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-05","text":"The true reverses its function: initially it supports the refutation of falsehood, but later is separated from what is primarily being as an affection of thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-06","text":"Priority expands from relation to a determinate principle into temporal, epistemic, potential, and substantial order, and then becomes the foundation of universality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-07","text":"Potentiality and actuality recur as a distinction of contraries, as a mode of every predicate, and as a condition of material contingency.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RMD-08","text":"The unmoved mover is initially the limit of change, then remains an unexplained term, and finally changes into a hypothesis of the primary and universal science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-01","text":"The particular divisions of terms remain lower-level unless they recur as common axes of category, cause, substance, potentiality, and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-02","text":"The local refutation of the denier expands into a universal axiom: every account parasitizes the conditions of meaning and difference that it denies.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","text":"Lexical divisions expand into an ontological grammar, because the same divisions order several concepts and modes of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-04","text":"The division of natural science, mathematics, and first philosophy bridges local classification to the universal hierarchy of substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-05","text":"Particular cases of chance and coincidence are not retained in themselves, but are gathered into the universal limit of determinate causation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:CGD-06","text":"The enumeration of the true as a mode of being is absorbed under the higher distinction between the substance of the thing and the composition of thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-01","text":"It is excluded that being or the one is either a univocal genus or a multitude of unconnected homonyms.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","text":"An account is excluded in which opposed assertions are true at once or names have infinite and indeterminate meanings.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","text":"The accidental is excluded as a primary subject, universal cause, or principle of scientific demonstration.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-04","text":"The one-sided reduction of all causality to matter alone, form, motion, or end is excluded.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-05","text":"The identification of the study of being with the composition and division by which thought is true or false is excluded.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX7","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:GNX-06","text":"An infinite regress of demonstrations or causes is excluded, as is the reduction of all generation to necessary fate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that meanings are bare conventions, because their order follows substance and the modes of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that all phenomena and occurrences are equally knowable, because science requires regularity and a determinate cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX10","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that the particular sciences can, from their own hypotheses, ground being qua being and substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that change and contingency require the actual coexistence of contraries or the destruction of determinate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that the universality of first philosophy is obtained from bare generalization, because it depends on primary nature and prior substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01","text":"Complete indeterminacy is unacceptable, because its affirmation already signifies something determinate and abolishes itself.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-02","text":"An order of beings without a first foundation is impossible, because perception, category, accident, and motion each require a prior term.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-03","text":"A whole world composed of chance and accidents is unacceptable, because it establishes neither subject, science, nor determinate generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-04","text":"The exhaustion of being in perception or thought is impossible, because the perceptible requires a mover and the true remains an affection of thought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX11","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSA-05","text":"The radical denial of all meaning can persist only through silence, but silence produces not an opposing system but an absence of account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-01","text":"Ordered multiplicity, the division of uses, and the removal of non-primary modes entail that the study of being is a recurrent judgment and not a catalogue of given things.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","text":"Substance joins semantic unity, predicative subsistence, and a hierarchy of sciences, so that one principle performs three distinct functions.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-03","text":"Non-contradiction, the per se, and regular existence constitute a common condition under which change becomes knowable without indeterminacy.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-04","text":"The accidental may be called a being, but its dependence on a subject and contingent matter prevents it from becoming a first principle or a proper knowable genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A13","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-05","text":"Truth remains necessary for the judgment of an account, but loses the force of an autonomous mode of substance when the study of being is separated from thought.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:XD-06","text":"The unmoved grows from the limit of motion into a condition of universality, but this growth depends on an existence that is posited rather than demonstrated here.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-01","text":"Reality becomes an asymmetrical network of many modes, whose unity depends on a center without their difference being effaced.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-02","text":"Time no longer alone measures priority, but is subordinated to potentiality, actuality, substance, and causal dependence.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-03","text":"Knowledge becomes reflexive, because it examines the semantic and ontological presuppositions which even its denial employs.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-04","text":"Causality becomes pluralistic in kind, hierarchical in priority, and delimited by contingency.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:BSD-05","text":"The knowing subject changes into a judge of meanings, conditions, and scientific jurisdictions, while being bound by the same principles it examines.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","text":"The manifold expression generates division; division generates a primary meaning; the primary meaning generates one science; and science in turn judges the modes of manifold expression.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02","text":"Signifying generates a determinate account; the account, substance; substance, the exclusion of contradiction; and this exclusion in turn preserves signifying.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BOO4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-03","text":"Substance remains an attracting principle, around which meanings, categories, causes, sciences, and degrees of priority are distributed.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-04","text":"The path of increase of the accidental ends from predicate in chance and from this in indeterminacy of cause, whence it is excluded from science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-05","text":"The principle of motion spirals from the unmoved mover to unmoved substance, and from there to first philosophy as universal theory.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:RLE-06","text":"Truth proceeds from the thing to the account and from the account to thought, so that the substance of the thing may be separated from the judgment concerning it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO5:D14","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B01","text":"The mechanism takes a multitude of fundamental names and modes of being as distributed material still ordered indeterminately.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B02","text":"Reference to one gathers the distributed material around substance without transforming it into a univocal genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B03","text":"The gathered multiplicity is divided according to category, cause, subject, priority, potentiality, actuality, and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B04","text":"Each division is tested apophatically through proximate but non-identical cases and through the impossibility of contradiction.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B05","text":"The tested modes are divided into primarily beings and dependent, indeterminate, or intellectual affections to be removed from the primary inquiry.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B06","text":"The priority of substance increases as far as unmoved and separate substance, which makes the primary science universal.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B07","text":"The removal of non-primary beings returns the mechanism to being qua being, now as an ordered and hierarchized field.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B01","text":"Manifold expression of being and limitation of the particular sciences → aporia concerning one universal science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B02","text":"Reference of meanings to one → priority of substance → referential unity of the field.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B03","text":"Universality of being → common axioms → non-contradiction → elenctic recovery of the determinate account.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B04","text":"Determinate account → division of things spoken of in many ways → ontological axes → most primary significations.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS6","CH_DAZY_BOO5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B05","text":"Ontological grammar → distinction of per se and accidental → conditions of demonstration and determinate causation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B06","text":"Distinction of modes of being → removal of the accidental and of being-as-true → disclosure of what is primarily being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B07","text":"Priority of unmoved and separate substance → first philosophy → return to the principles of being qua being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-01","text":"The false opposition between a univocal genus and disorderly homonymy is dissolved through the ordered multiplicity of reference to one.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-02","text":"The distinction between word and thing is displaced, because analysis of meanings becomes a delineation of modes of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-03","text":"The common logical axioms are recognized as conditions of being and account, while the truth of judgment is distinguished from the substance of the thing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-04","text":"The sciences are delineated not only by genus but by motion, separation, priority of substance, and mode of cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-05","text":"The accidental is displaced from a simple predicate into a contingent and scientifically indeterminate remainder.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-06","text":"Priority ceases to be identified with temporal succession and becomes a multiple relation of knowledge, potentiality, actuality, substance, and cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MME-07","text":"Causality is displaced from linear succession into a fourfold and hierarchical arrangement, in which chance is a limit rather than a fifth kind of cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:NX12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, one science of being, the determinations of fundamental names, the order of the theoretical sciences, and the knowability of the accidental are sought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B02","text":"In its arrangement, reference to one, recurrent divisions, degrees of priority, and exclusions constitute an asymmetrical system.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, the dispute is displaced from direct affirmations to the examination of the conditions, meanings, and presuppositions of every possible affirmation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B04","text":"Concerning being and time, reality becomes ordered in many ways, hierarchical according to substance, modal according to potentiality and actuality, and divided according to necessity, regularity, and accident.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","text":"Methodically, the system does what it affirms, because it divides things spoken of in many ways, examines their limits, and removes whatever has no determinate nature.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","text":"Universality is grounded, on the one hand, in the semantic reference to one and, on the other, in the priority of separate substance, but the precise relation of the foundations remains unresolved.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-02","text":"Substance as ultimate subject and as separate form provides two centers, whose mutual union is presupposed rather than fully derived.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-03","text":"The true is counted as a mode of being and simultaneously assigned to the composition of thought, so that its place between being and judgment remains unstable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-04","text":"Science of what is always or for the most part requires stability, but contingent matter generates deviations which the arrangement defines but does not scientifically exhaust.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO6:A9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:FL-05","text":"Unmoved substance becomes necessary for universality, but its existence is posited hypothetically and its full proof remains outside.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-01","text":"Manifold expression mutates from a threat of disintegration into a method of ontological order and finally into a filter of what is primarily being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:A2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-02","text":"The accidental mutates when, from a twofold linguistic mode, it becomes the name of material indeterminacy and the impossibility of science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MP-03","text":"Non-contradiction mutates from an elenctic principle of account into a general condition of divisional grammar and demonstrative knowledge.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-01","text":"Reality is imagined as a field of many trajectories around a central substance, passing through divisions and sieves before returning to what is primarily being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a cartographer and judge of the field, not standing outside it but bound by signification and non-contradiction.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-03","text":"Time is imagined not as linear succession but as a stratification of potentiality, actuality, regular recurrence, accident, and unmoved principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:ME5","CH_DAZY_BOO6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:HSI-04","text":"The possible course is spiral: from multiplicity to a center, from the center to differences, and through removal back to the principles of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from manifold expression, through substance and divisions, to the purified inquiry into being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02","text":"It remains indeterminate how the semantic unity of reference to one is connected with universality obtained from prior and separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B03","text":"The arrangement is strongest where reference to one, recurrent divisions, and the distinction among the always, the regular, and the accidental mutually confirm one another.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B04","text":"Against axiomatic reduction stands the fact that fourfold causality, unmoved substance, and the universality derived from it are supported by enumeration or hypothesis rather than full demonstration.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO5:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true spiral movement, because it does not smooth out multiplicity, but shows how it is centered, divided, examined, and returned.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO4:MRT9","CH_DAZY_BOO6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_DAZY_02@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_DAZY_02:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 04–06"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Chapters 04–06","context":"Book 4 · Book 5 · Book 6","original_title":"Chapters 04–06","original_context":"Book 4 · Book 5 · Book 6"},"original_title":"Chapters 04–06","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 07–09","order":3,"parents":["CH_DAZY_BOO7","CH_DAZY_BOO8","CH_DAZY_BOO9"],"revision":"CL_DAZY_03@R001","sha256":"20d716fd705a9ac3ae61160bd7abf3770bc87ba10986589b3fa7cceee3aa1233","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-01","text":"Τὸ διηνεκὲς ἀπόρημα περὶ τοῦ ὄντος μετατίθεται πρῶτον εἰς τὴν οὐσίαν, εἶτα εἰς τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τέλος εἰς τὴν πρὸς δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-02","text":"Ἡ κυρία θέσις ἀποφαίνεται ὅτι τὸ εἶδος, ὡς οὐσία καὶ ἐνέργεια, αἴτιόν ἐστι τοῦ τὴν ὕλην τόδε τι, ἓν καὶ ὂν εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-03","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς τοὺς δοκοῦντας τρόπους τῆς οὐσίας ἀποκλείων τὸ ζήτημα τῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὸ μέτρον, καθ᾽ ὃ δύναμις ὁρίζεται καὶ ὂν τελειοῦται, μεταβάλλει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-04","text":"Ἡ φορὰ ἐκ τοῦ ὑποκειμένου εἰς τὴν ὕλην, ἐκ τῆς ὕλης εἰς τὴν μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν, καὶ ἐκ ταύτης εἰς τὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας προχωρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-05","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς κίνησις μικτὴ καὶ ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον νεώτερον ἀπόρημα ἐπὶ τὴν αὐτὴν οὐσίαν ἐπανέρχεται, ἀλλ᾽ αὐτὴν ὡς αἴτιον, ἐνέργειαν καὶ γνωστὸν μεταμορφοῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-06","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀνασυνίσταται οὐχ ὡς ποίησις εἴδους, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς σύστασις ὕλης κατὰ προϋπάρχον εἶδος, ἧς πᾶσα μετάβασις προτέραν ἐνέργειαν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-07","text":"Ἡ ἐπίτασις ἐκ τῶν φθαρτῶν συνθέτων εἰς τὸ ἀΐδιον ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἀλήθειαν, ἣ τῷ τρόπῳ τοῦ ὄντος ἕπεται, τελευτᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις τὴν ἐνέργειαν ὡς ἕλκουσαν ἀρχὴν τοῦ εἶναι, τοῦ ἑνός, τῆς γενέσεως καὶ τῆς ἀληθείας καθίστησιν, τὴν δὲ θετικὴν φύσιν τῶν χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν ἀδιορίστως καταλείπει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ὂν οὐκ εἰς ἰσοτίμους τρόπους διασπᾶται, ἀλλὰ περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν κατὰ διάταξιν ἐξαρτήσεως συνίσταται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κατὰ τὸ εἶδος οὐσία ἀρχικῶς αἴτιον τοῦ τόδε τι εἶναι, ἔπειτα δὲ μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὕλη ἐκ τοῦ ἐσχάτου ὑποκειμένου εἰς ὡρισμένην δύναμιν μεταβάλλεται, κυρίως δὲ τόδε τι δυνάμει λέγεται ἡ προσεχὴς καὶ οἰκεία ὕλη.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ἐκ μορφῆς καὶ ὕλης σύνθετον μόνον γίγνεται καὶ φθείρεται, οὐχ ἡ μορφὴ καθ᾽ αὑτήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ εἶδος οὔτε ποιεῖται οὔτε γίγνεται καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἀλλὰ προϋπάρχει ὡς λόγος, αἴτιον καὶ ἐνέργεια τοῦ γιγνομένου συνόλου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ οὐσιώδης ἑνότης οὔτε σωρὸς στοιχείων οὔτε πρόσθετος σύνδεσμος ἐστίν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἐνέργεια καθ᾽ ἣν ἡ ὕλη ἓν ὡρισμένον πρᾶγμα ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX13","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ ὁρισμὸς ἐκ τοῦ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ καὶ τοῦ τί ἦν εἶναι ἀρχόμενος τὸ εἶδος τέλος δηλοῖ, ἐπειδὴ τὸ εἶδος καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια τὴν οὐσίαν ὁρίζουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἐνέργεια τὸ μέτρον τῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δύναμις διὰ τῆς οἰκείας δυνατῆς ἐνεργείας ὁρίζεται καὶ γνωρίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἐνέργεια προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως λόγῳ καὶ οὐσίᾳ ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ τέλος, εἶδος καὶ αἰτία τοῦ δυνάμει ὄντος ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Πᾶσα εἰς ἐνέργειαν μετάβασις προϋπάρχον εἶδος ἢ ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν αἴτιον ἀπαιτεῖ, ὥστε ἡ αἰτιακὴ τάξις οὐκ ἐκ ψιλῆς δυνάμεως ἄρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Τὸ ἀΐδιον καὶ ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὂν οὐ δύναται δυνατότητα τοῦ μὴ εἶναι περιέχειν, ἀλλ᾽ ἀεὶ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐ ποιεῖ τὰ πράγματα ὄντα, ἀλλὰ τῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τῆς πραγματικῆς συνθέσεως ἢ τῇ θίξει τοῦ ἀσυνθέτου ἕπεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ οὐσία μένει τὸ πρῶτον ζητούμενον, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ τοῦ τί ἐστιν εἰς τὸ τί αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τέλος εἰς τὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας μετατίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἐπανέρχεται πρῶτον ὡς ἔσχατον ὑποκείμενον, ἔπειτα ὡς δύναμις τοῦ τόδε τι, καὶ τέλος ὡς προσεχὴς ὕλη πρὸς οἰκείαν ἐνεργοποίησιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-03","text":"Τὸ εἶδος ἐκ ἀποκρίσεως εἰς τὸ διὰ τί μεταβάλλεται εἰς μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν καὶ τέλος εἰς μέτρον πάσης δυνάμεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἑνότης τοῦ πράγματος, ἡ δὲ λεκτικὴ σύνδεσις ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς τὴν ἐνεργειακὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ ὁριζομένου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἐκ τριάδος ποιητικοῦ, ὕλης καὶ γιγνομένου συνόλου μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀνακυκλουμένην διαδοχὴν δυνάμεως, προτέρας ἐνεργείας καὶ νέου συνθέτου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ οὐσία ἐκ προσδοκωμένης ἐξηγήσεως μετατοπίζεται εἰς ἄλυτον ὅριον, ἐνώ ἡ ἀναγκαία ἐνέργεια τῶν ἀϊδίων ἀξιωματικῶς ἐπιτείνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις ἀρχικῶς πρὸς τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι ἀνάγεται, ὕστερον δὲ ὡς νοητικὴ ἐνέργεια τῷ τρόπῳ τοῦ ὄντος ὑποτάσσεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ διαιρέσεις τῶν δυνάμεων κατὰ ποιεῖν, πάσχειν, λόγον καὶ ἀλογίαν μένουσιν ἴδιαι τοῦ κατωτέρου βαθμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ νῦν σύνθεσις μόνον τὴν ὑποταγὴν πάσης δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν χρῆται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ ὑλικαὶ διαφοραὶ συνθέσεως, μίξεως, θέσεως καὶ πυκνώσεως τοπικὰ παραδείγματα μένουσιν, τὸ δὲ αἰτιακὸν αὐτῶν σχήμα εἰς τὴν οἰκείαν μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν αὔξεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:D1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια ὕλης, καθόλου καὶ ἀορίστου δυνάμεως αὔξεται ἐκ τοπικῶν ἀποκλεισμῶν εἰς κοινὴν ἀρχήν, καθ᾽ ἣν οὐδὲν ἀόριστον αὐτὸ καθ᾽ αὑτὸ αἴτιον ἐνεργείας γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνάλυσις τῆς γενέσεως γεφυροῖ τὰς μονάδας, ἐπειδὴ τὸ προϋπάρχον εἶδος τοῦ πρώτου λόγου ἡ προτέρα ἐνέργεια τοῦ τελευταίου γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ αἰτίου τοῦ εἶναι πρὸς τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ τὸ τέλος τῆς δυνάμεως μόνον ἐν τῷ νῦν βαθμῷ ἀναφαίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ φύσις τῶν χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν οὔτε γεφυροῦται οὔτε ἀπορροφᾶται, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἀδιορίστως μετατεθειμένον ὅριον τοῦ παρόντος συστήματος μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὰ πάθη καὶ τὰ συμβεβηκότα ἀπὸ τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε καθ᾽ αὑτὰ πέφυκεν εἶναι οὔτε χωρίζεσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-02","text":"Οὔτε ἡ ὕλη μόνη οὔτε ἡ ἀπαρίθμησις στοιχείων ἀποδίδωσι τὴν οὐσίαν, διότι τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ τοῦ εἶναι ἀπολείπεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-03","text":"Τὸ καθόλου, τὸ γένος καὶ αἱ χωρισταὶ ἰδέαι ἐκβάλλονται ἐκ τῆς χώρας τῆς οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ κοινὰ κατηγορήματα οὐ δύνανται τὸ τόδε τι αἰτιᾶσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-04","text":"Οὔτε γένεσις τοῦ εἴδους οὔτε πρόσθετον ἑνοποιοῦν αἴτιον παραδέχεται τὸ σύστημα, ἐπεὶ ἀμφότερα ἄπειρον ἀναδρομὴν ἢ ψευδὲς πρόβλημα γεννῶσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-05","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας καὶ ἡ ἀόριστος δύναμις ἀποκλείονται, ἐπειδὴ ἢ τὴν γένεσιν ἀναιροῦσιν ἢ ἄνευ ὡρισμένης ἐνεργείας κεναὶ μένουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-06","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια οὔτε ἐκ τῆς δόξης προβάλλεται οὔτε περὶ τὸ ἀσύνθετον διὰ ψευδοῦς καταφάσεως ἀντιστρέφεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πάντες οἱ τρόποι τοῦ ὄντος ἢ πᾶσαι αἱ ἀρχαὶ συμμετρικῶς καὶ αὐτοτελῶς ὑπάρχουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-02","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτον εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι δύναμις ἑαυτὴν ἐξ αὑτῆς εἰς ἐνέργειαν ἄγει, ἐπεὶ οὕτως τὸ αἴτιον καὶ τὸ τέλος ἐκ τῆς δυνάμεως ἄνευ ἐνεργούσης ἀρχῆς ἐξάγοιτο.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-03","text":"Ἡ οὐσιώδης ἑνότης καταλύεται, ἐὰν ἐκ συνάψεως αὐτοτελῶν ἐνεργείᾳ μερῶν ἢ ἐξ ἑτέρου συνδετικοῦ αἰτίου παράγηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-04","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐ δύναται ἐξ οὐδενὸς προϋπάρχοντος εἴδους ἄρχεσθαι, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἰτιακὴ συνέχεια προτέραν ἐνέργειαν ἀναγκαίως ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-05","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις οὐ δύναται τὴν ἀλήθειαν εἰς τὰ πράγματα ἐμβάλλειν, ἀλλὰ νοητικὴ ἐνέργεια γίνεται μόνον ὅταν τῷ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχοντι ἀκολουθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ ἔσχατος ἀόριστος ὕλη, ἡ στέρησις καὶ ἡ γυμνὴ δυνατότης ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ τελικὴ ἀρχὴ τῆς ἐνεργούσης τάξεως εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-02","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἑνότης οὐ δύναται εἶναι ἔξωθεν σύνδεσις πολλῶν ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντων, ἀλλὰ μόνον ἐνέργεια δι᾽ ἧς τὸ δυνάμει πλῆθος ἓν ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-03","text":"Τὸ ἀΐδιον οὐ δύναται ἐρείδεσθαι ἐπὶ δυνατότητι τοῦ μὴ εἶναι, οὐδὲ ἡ πρώτη τάξις φθορὰν ἢ κακὸν ὡς συναΐδιον ἀρχὴν περιέχειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-04","text":"Τὸ πρῶτον καὶ ἀσύνθετον ὂν οὐ χωρεῖ τρίτον τρόπον μεταξὺ νοήσεως καὶ ἀγνοίας, ὥστε ἡ προτατικὴ ἀντίφασις οὐκ ἐπ᾽ αὐτοῦ κυρίως ἱδρύεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ φύσις τῆς χωριστῆς οὐσίας ἀπούσα μένει, καὶ αὕτη ἡ ἀπουσία τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τῶν φθαρτῶν μορφῶν εἰς τὴν ἀΐδιον ἐνέργειαν τάττει ἄνευ πλήρους μεσιτεύσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-01","text":"Τὸ εἶδος καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μίαν αἰτιακὴν λειτουργίαν ἀποτελοῦσιν, καθ᾽ ἣν ἡ οὐσία τὴν ὕλην ὂν καὶ ἓν ποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μόνον ὅταν ὡς προσεχὴς δύναμις πρὸς ὡρισμένην ἐνέργειαν διαγράφεται δύναται πραγματικὸν ὑποκείμενον γενέσεως εἶναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO8:D4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-03","text":"Ἐπεὶ τὸ εἶδος οὐ γίγνεται καὶ πᾶν ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν ἐκ προτέρας ἐνεργείας γίνεται, ἡ γένεσις μορφικὴν τάξιν μεταδίδωσι μᾶλλον ἢ νέον εἶδος ἐξ οὐκ ὄντος ποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῶν χωριστῶν εἰδῶν καὶ τοῦ ἑτέρου ἑνοποιοῦ αἰτίου καθιστᾷ τὴν μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν ἐνυπάρχουσαν καὶ ἀσύμμετρον πρὸς τὴν δύναμιν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX9","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἀποδεικνύεται ὀντολογική, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος εἷς ἐστιν ὅσον τὸ ὁριζόμενον μία ἐνέργεια καὶ οὐσία ἐστίν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐν τῇ ὕλῃ δυνατότης τοῦ εἶναι καὶ μὴ εἶναι καθιστᾷ τὸ σύνθετον φθαρτόν, ἡ δὲ ἀπουσία ταύτης τῆς δυνατότητος τὸ ἀΐδιον ἁπλῶς ἐνεργείᾳ τίθησιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-07","text":"Ἡ τοῦ εἶναι αἰτία καὶ ἡ τοῦ γιγνώσκειν ἀρχὴ συμπίπτουσιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀλήθεια καὶ ἡ νόησις τῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τοῦ πράγματος ἀκολουθοῦσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-08","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ αὐτάρκης μὲν αἰτία τοῦ φυσικοῦ εἶναι γίνεται, ἡ δὲ λογικὴ δύναμις πρὸς πράξιν ὀρέξεως, προαιρέσεως καὶ προσήκοντος ὑποκειμένου δεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια γίνεται καθόλου κριτήριον τοῦ κυρίως εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ μορφή, τέλος, οὐσία, ἑνότης καὶ μέτρον τῆς δυνάμεως εἰς αὐτὴν συνάγονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς γενέσεως οὐκ ἀπλῆ εὐθεῖα ἐκ δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον προτέρα δύναμις ὑπὸ προτέρας κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνεργείας περιέχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον οὐκέτι αὐτάρκης πηγὴ πράξεως νοεῖται, ἀλλὰ δύναμις ὑπὸ μορφῆς, ὀρέξεως, αἰτίου καὶ συνθηκῶν εἰς ἐνέργειαν τασσομένη.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ γνώσις οὐκ ἀδρανὴς κατοχὴ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργοποίησις τοῦ γνωστοῦ ἐστίν, καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ πῶς τὸ πρᾶγμα ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φθαρτοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου γίνεται διάκρισις μεταξὺ οὐσίας περιεχούσης δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι καὶ οὐσίας ἁπλῶς ἐνεργείᾳ οὔσης.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος τοῦ συστήματος ἀπὸ ἀποκλειστικὴν περιαιρετικὴν ἔρευναν εἰς αἰτιακὴν καὶ ἐνεργειακὴν ἀνασύστασιν μεταβαίνει, ὥστε τὸ ἀπορούμενον τέλος ὡς γεννητικὴ ἀρχὴ ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος βρόχος ἐκ τοῦ ὄντος εἰς τὴν οὐσίαν, ἐκ τῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὸ αἴτιον, καὶ ἐκ τοῦ αἰτίου εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν ἄγει, ἡ δὲ ἐνέργεια τὸ κυρίως ὂν ἐκ νέου ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-02","text":"Ὁ δεύτερος βρόχος τὸ ὑποκείμενον περιαιρεῖ μέχρι τῆς ὕλης, τὴν ὕλην ὡς ἀνεπαρκῆ δύναμιν ἀποφαίνει, καὶ διὰ τῆς μορφῆς τὴν δύναμιν ἐκ νέου ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-03","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τοῦ ὁρισμοῦ ἐκ τοῦ τί ἦν εἶναι εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ λόγου καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν τοῦ ἑνὸς ὁριζομένου ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-04","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τῆς γενέσεως προϋπάρχον εἶδος εἰς ὕλην ἐνεργεῖν ποιεῖ, νέον σύνθετον ἀποτελεῖ, καὶ διὰ τούτου τὴν κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνέργειαν εἰς ἄλλο καθ᾽ ἕκαστον διασῴζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ αὔξησις ἐκ τῆς ἐνδεχομένης φθορᾶς εἰς τὴν ἀναγκαίαν ἐνέργειαν τῶν ἀϊδίων καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἀλήθειαν προχωρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια ἕλκουσα ἀρχὴ ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἑκάστη δύναμις, μορφή, γένεσις, ἑνότης, ἀΐδιος οὐσία καὶ ἀλήθεια πρὸς αὐτὴν ἀνατάσσεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος πρῶτον εἰς ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν συνάγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ περιαιρετικὴ ἐξέτασις ὑποκειμένου, ὕλης, καθόλου καὶ στοιχείων καταλείπει τὴν ἀνάγκην μορφικοῦ αἰτίου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B03","text":"Τὸ μορφικὸν αἴτιον τὴν ὕλην τόδε τι καὶ ἓν ποιεῖ καὶ οὕτως τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι ὡς αἰτιακὴν οὐσίαν ἀνασυνίστησιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ὕλης καὶ μορφῆς μεταγράφεται εἰς διάκρισιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας, ὥστε ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ συνθέτου ἔργον ἐνεργοποιήσεως γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐνεργοποίησις πάλιν προτέραν ἐνέργειαν ἀπαιτεῖ καὶ τὴν φαινομένην χρονικὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς δυνάμεως εἰς αἰτιακὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας ἀναστρέφει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ αἰτιακὴ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας τὴν ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν ὡς ἄνευ δυνατότητος τοῦ μὴ εἶναι διαγράφει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ ἐνεργειακὴ τάξις τέλος εἰς τὴν νόησιν καὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν μεταφέρεται, ὅπου τὸ γνωρίζειν τῷ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχειν ἕπεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B01","text":"Ἡ ὅλη φορὰ οὕτω διαγράφεται· πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος → προτεραιότης οὐσίας → ἀνεπάρκεια ὑποκειμένου καὶ ὕλης → εἶδος ὡς αἴτιον → μορφὴ ὡς ἐνέργεια → δύναμις ὑπὸ ἐνεργείας ὁριζομένη → προτέρα ἐνέργεια → ἀΐδιος ἐνέργεια → ἀλήθεια ἑπομένη τῷ ὄντι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B02","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις τὴν ἐνέργειαν ὡς κοινὸν πέρας τῆς οὐσιολογικῆς, αἰτιακῆς καὶ γνωσιολογικῆς φορᾶς τίθησιν, τὴν δὲ μετάβασιν εἰς τὰς χωριστὰς οὐσίας ἀτελῆ καταλείπει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-01","text":"Ἡ χώρα τοῦ ὄντος ἐκ κατηγορικῆς ἱεραρχίας περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν εἰς δυναμικὴν διάταξιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας μεταβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-02","text":"Ἡ οὐσία παύει μόνον μορφολογικὸς διορισμὸς εἶναι καὶ γίνεται ἐνέργεια αἰτιωμένη τὸ εἶναι, τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἐκ ἀορίστου ἐσχάτου ὑποκειμένου μετατίθεται εἰς βαθμοὺς ἐγγύτητος πρὸς τὴν οἰκείαν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης παύει χωριστὸν πρόβλημα συνδέσεως εἶναι καὶ γίνεται ἡ αὐτὴ μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια δι᾽ ἧς τὸ πρᾶγμα ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-05","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ ἀντίθεσις προτέρου καὶ ὑστέρου ἀναδιαγράφεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως τοῦ αὐτοῦ καθ᾽ ἀριθμὸν καὶ τοῦ αὐτοῦ κατ᾽ εἶδος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια καὶ ἡ νόησις ἐκ τῆς χώρας τῆς αὐτονόμου κρίσεως εἰς τὴν χώραν τῆς ἐνεργειακῆς ἀκολουθίας τοῦ ὄντος μετατίθενται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ βαθμοῦ ζητεῖται τίς ἡ οὐσία, πῶς τὸ σύνθετον γίγνεται καὶ φθείρεται, καὶ τί δύναμις, ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀλήθεια εἰσίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμοῦ ὕλη, μορφή, σύνθετον, δύναμις καὶ ἐνέργεια διανέμονται ὡς ὑποκείμενον, αἴτιον, γενητὸν ὄν, δυνατότης καὶ τελείωσις.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὑπερστρατηγικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ ἔρευνα μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τοῦ καταλέγειν οὐσίας καὶ δυνατότητας εἰς τὸ ζητεῖν ποία ἐγγυτάτη ἐνέργεια ἑκάστην δύναμιν καὶ οὐσίαν ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμοῦ τὸ εἶδος ἀγένητον, τὸ σύνθετον χρονικῶς γενητόν, ἡ δὲ προτέρα ἐνέργεια αἰτία πάσης μεταβάσεως τίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδικοῦ καὶ πρακτικοῦ βαθμοῦ τὸ σύστημα διὰ περιαιρέσεως ψευδῶν αἰτίων, ἀναλύσεως γενέσεως καὶ ἐνεργοποιήσεως λανθανουσῶν δυνάμεων τὴν ἰδίαν θέσιν πράττει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-01","text":"Τὸ εἶδος ἀγένητον καὶ αἴτιον τίθεται, ἀλλ᾽ ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν ἐν τοῖς φθαρτοῖς πάρεστιν ἄνευ χωριστῆς οὐσίας οὐ πλήρως διορίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-02","text":"Τὸ εἶδος ἄτομον αἴτιον τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα λέγεται, ὁ δὲ ὁριστικὸς λόγος κοινός ἐστιν, καὶ ἡ σχέσις τούτων ἀδιάρθρωτος μένει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια καθόλου προτέρα καὶ μέτρον τῆς δυνάμεως τίθεται, ἡ δὲ ἑνότης αὐτῆς μόνον ἀναλογικὴ μένει καὶ κοινὸν μονοσήμαντον γένος οὐ παρέχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-04","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ὡς ἀτελὴς ἐνέργεια πρὸς ἀπόντα τέλος φέρεται, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἀεὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὖσα τὴν διάκρισιν ἀσταθῆ ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-01","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστὶν ὅπου τὸ ὑποκείμενον εἰς ὕλην καὶ ἡ ὕλη εἰς δύναμιν τοῦ τόδε τι μεταγράφεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-02","text":"Ὁ δεύτερος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστὶν ὅπου τὸ τί ἦν εἶναι ἐκ ὁριστικοῦ λόγου εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον καὶ ἐνέργειαν μετατίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-03","text":"Ὁ τρίτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστὶν ὅπου ἡ ἑνότης ἐκ ἀπορίας περὶ πολλῶν μερῶν εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν τῆς μορφῆς μεταβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-04","text":"Ὁ τέταρτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστὶν ὅπου ἡ χρονικὴ προτεραιότης τοῦ δυνάμει ἀναστρέφεται διὰ τῆς αἰτιακῶς προτέρας ἐνεργείας τοῦ αὐτοῦ εἴδους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης σιγῇ νοεῖται ὡς μηχανὴ διαβαθμισμένης ἐνεργοποιήσεως, ἐν ᾗ οὐδὲν δυνάμει ὂν ἀόριστον μένει ἀλλὰ πρὸς οἰκείαν μορφὴν καὶ τέλος τάττεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὑποκείμενον γίνεται σύνθετον φθαρτόν, ἡ μὲν ὕλη δύναμις οὖσα, ἡ δὲ μορφὴ ἐνέργεια καὶ αἰτία τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ὡς ἕλιξ, καθ᾽ ἣν τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ἐκ δυνάμεως γίνεται, ἀλλὰ ἡ γένεσις ἀεὶ ἀπὸ προτέρας κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνεργείας ἄρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ νόησις γίνεται ἐνέργεια θίξεως ἢ ἀνακατασκευῆς τοῦ ὄντος, οὐκ εἴδωλον ἐκ δόξης εἰς ἀδρανῆ πραγματικότητα προβαλλόμενον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ δώδεκα καθόλου ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἐκ τῆς οὐσίας εἰς τὸ μορφικὸν αἴτιον, ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν, καὶ τέλος εἰς τὸ ἀΐδιον καὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ὅπου τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι, τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνός, ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια εἰς μίαν λειτουργίαν συνάγονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιοριστότερον τοῦ δέοντος μένει πῶς τὸ ἀγένητον εἶδος ἐν τοῖς φθαρτοῖς πάρεστι καὶ πῶς ἡ χωριστὴ οὐσία πρὸς τὴν ἀΐδιον ἐνέργειαν ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04","text":"Ἀδιοριστία μένει περὶ τῆς σχέσεως τοῦ κοινοῦ ὁριστικοῦ λόγου πρὸς τὸ ἄτομον ἐνὸν εἶδος καὶ περὶ τῆς ἀναλογικῆς ἑνότητος τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ ἑλικοειδῆ κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια ὑποκειμένου, ὕλης, καθόλου καὶ ψιλῆς δυνάμεως ἐπανειλημμένως εἰς τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὴν ἐνέργειαν ὡς ἀρχὴν καταλήγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175322048614Z_812f7f7d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 07–09","source_sha256":"20d716fd705a9ac3ae61160bd7abf3770bc87ba10986589b3fa7cceee3aa1233","sha256":"8b172ef1e2f89bbe9d6a9d5bbff23e1e00d641e939a61730c22efef2fc8c271e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:53:22.050758+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-01","text":"The enduring aporia concerning being is first transferred to substance, then to the cause of being, and finally to the arrangement concerning potentiality and actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-02","text":"The principal thesis declares that form, as substance and actuality, is the cause of matter's being a this-something, one, and being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-03","text":"By excluding the apparent modes of substance, the argument transforms the question of substance into the measure by which potentiality is determined and being is completed.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-04","text":"The movement proceeds from the subject to matter, from matter to formal actuality, and from this to the priority of actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-05","text":"The true movement is mixed and spiral, because every newer aporia returns to the same substance, but transforms it as cause, actuality, and object of knowledge.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-06","text":"Coming-to-be is reconstructed not as production of form, but as constitution of matter according to a pre-existing form, every transition of which requires prior actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-07","text":"The escalation ends by proceeding from perishable composites to that which is eternal in actuality, and thence to truth, which follows the mode of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AS-08","text":"The conclusion establishes actuality as the attracting principle of being, unity, coming-to-be, and truth, while leaving the positive nature of separate substances indeterminate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being, spoken of in many ways, is not divided into coequal modes, but is constituted around substance according to an order of dependence.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Substance according to form is initially the cause of being a this-something, and subsequently becomes the formal actuality of being and of unity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Matter changes from the ultimate subject into determinate potentiality; properly speaking, that which is potentially a this-something is proximate and proper matter.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Only the composite of form and matter comes to be and perishes, not form in itself.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Form is neither produced nor comes to be in itself, but pre-exists as account, cause, and actuality of the composite that comes to be.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Substantial unity is neither a heap of elements nor an additional bond, but the actuality by which matter is one determinate thing.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX13","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Definition, beginning from the per se and the what-it-was-to-be, ultimately indicates form, because form and actuality define substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Actuality is the measure of potentiality, because potentiality is determined and known through its proper possible actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Actuality is prior to potentiality in account and substance, because it is the end, form, and cause of what is potentially.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:AS2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Every transition into actuality requires a pre-existing form or a cause already in actuality, so that the causal order does not begin from bare potentiality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] What is eternal and exists of necessity cannot contain the potentiality not to be, but always exists in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Truth does not make things beings, but follows the actuality of real composition or the contact of the uncombined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01","text":"Substance remains the first object of inquiry, but is transferred from what it is to what is the cause of being, and finally to the priority of actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-02","text":"Matter recurs first as ultimate subject, then as the potentiality of a this-something, and finally as proximate matter for proper actualization.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-03","text":"Form changes from an answer to the why into formal actuality, and finally into the measure of every potentiality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-04","text":"The unity of definition recurs as the unity of the thing, while verbal connection is absorbed into the actual unity of what is defined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-05","text":"Coming-to-be changes from a triad of agent, matter, and generated composite into a recurring succession of potentiality, prior actuality, and new composite.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06","text":"Separate substance is displaced from an expected explanation into an unresolved limit, while the necessary actuality of eternal things is intensified axiomatically.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RMD-07","text":"Knowledge is initially referred to the what-it-was-to-be, but later is subordinated, as intellectual actuality, to the mode of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-01","text":"The divisions of potentialities according to acting, being affected, reason, and irrationality remain proper to the lower level, since the present synthesis employs only the subordination of every potentiality to actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-02","text":"The material differences of composition, mixture, position, and density remain local examples, but their causal schema is elevated into proper formal actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:D1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-03","text":"The insufficiency of matter, universals, and indeterminate potentiality rises from local exclusions to a common principle according to which nothing indeterminate becomes, by itself, a cause of actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-04","text":"The analysis of coming-to-be bridges the units, because the pre-existing form of the first account becomes the prior actuality of the last.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05","text":"The identification of the cause of being with the cause of unity and the end of potentiality appears only at the present level.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:CGD-06","text":"The positive nature of separate substances is neither bridged nor absorbed, but remains as an indeterminately displaced limit of the present system.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-01","text":"The system excludes attributes and accidents from primary substance, because they are naturally neither per se nor separable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-02","text":"Neither matter alone nor an enumeration of elements renders substance, because the cause of unity and being is left out.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:NX3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-03","text":"The universal, the genus, and separate Ideas are expelled from the domain of substance, because common predicates cannot be causes of a this-something.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-04","text":"The system admits neither coming-to-be of form nor an additional unifying cause, since both generate an infinite regress or a false problem.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-05","text":"The identification of potentiality and actuality, and indeterminate potentiality, are excluded, because they either eliminate coming-to-be or remain empty without determinate actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:GNX-06","text":"Truth is neither projected from opinion nor, concerning the uncombined, reversed through a false affirmation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:NX14","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that all modes of being or all principles exist symmetrically and independently.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-02","text":"It must be unacceptable that potentiality leads itself of itself into actuality, since thus cause and end would be derived from potentiality without an actualizing principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-03","text":"Substantial unity is destroyed if it is produced from the conjunction of parts independently in actuality or from another connecting cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-04","text":"Coming-to-be cannot begin from no pre-existing form, because causal continuity necessarily requires prior actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:DBN-05","text":"Knowledge cannot insert truth into things, but becomes intellectual actuality only when it follows what exists in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01","text":"Ultimate indeterminate matter, privation, and bare possibility cannot be the final principle of the actualizing order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-02","text":"Primary unity cannot be an external connection of many things already in actuality, but only the actuality through which a potentially multiple is one.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-03","text":"The eternal cannot rest upon the potentiality not to be, nor can the primary order contain corruption or evil as a coeternal principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-04","text":"The primary and uncombined being admits no third mode between thinking and ignorance, so that propositional contradiction is not properly established concerning it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05","text":"The positive nature of separate substance remains absent, and this absence orders the transition from perishable forms to eternal actuality without full mediation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:SNX7","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-01","text":"Form and actuality constitute one causal function, by which substance makes matter a being and one.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A18","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-02","text":"Matter can be a real subject of coming-to-be only when it is delineated as proximate potentiality for determinate actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO8:D4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-03","text":"Since form does not come to be and everything in actuality comes to be from prior actuality, coming-to-be transmits a formal order rather than producing a new form from non-being.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-04","text":"The rejection of separate forms and of another unifying cause establishes formal actuality as an inherent principle and as asymmetrical to potentiality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09","CH_DAZY_BOO7:NX9","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-05","text":"The unity of definition is proved ontological, because the account is one insofar as what is defined is one actuality and substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-06","text":"The possibility in matter of being and not being makes the composite perishable, whereas the absence of this possibility renders the eternal simply in actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BOO7:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-07","text":"The cause of being and the principle of knowing coincide, because truth and thought follow the actuality of the thing.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-07","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:XD-08","text":"Form becomes a self-sufficient cause of natural being, whereas rational potentiality for action requires desire, choice, and a suitable subject.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01","text":"Actuality becomes the universal criterion of being in the primary sense, because form, end, substance, unity, and the measure of potentiality converge upon it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02","text":"The time of coming-to-be is not a simple straight line from potentiality to actuality, because each prior particular potentiality is contained by a prior actuality according to form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-03","text":"The subject is no longer conceived as a self-sufficient source of action, but as potentiality ordered into actuality by form, desire, cause, and conditions.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-04","text":"Knowledge is not an inactive possession of an account, but the actualization of the knowable, and truth depends upon how the thing exists.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-05","text":"The distinction between perishable and eternal becomes the distinction between a substance containing the potentiality not to be and a substance simply being in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06","text":"The method of the system shifts from an exclusive privative inquiry to causal and actual reconstruction, so that what was aporetic returns at last as a generative principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01","text":"The first loop leads from being to substance, from substance to cause, and from cause to actuality; actuality in turn defines again what is being in the primary sense.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-02","text":"The second loop strips away the subject down to matter, declares matter insufficient potentiality, and through form defines potentiality anew.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-03","text":"The loop of definition returns from the what-it-was-to-be to the unity of the account, and thence to the actuality of the one thing defined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A8","CH_DAZY_BOO7:D10","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-04","text":"The loop of coming-to-be makes a pre-existing form actualize in matter, produces a new composite, and through this preserves actuality according to form in another particular.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-05","text":"The escalation proceeds from contingent corruption to the necessary actuality of eternal things, and thence to truth.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:RLE-06","text":"Actuality is an attracting principle, because every potentiality, form, coming-to-be, unity, eternal substance, and truth is directed toward it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B01","text":"The plurality of senses of being is first gathered into asymmetrical dependence around substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:FGS1","CH_DAZY_BOO7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B02","text":"The privative examination of subject, matter, universal, and elements leaves the necessity of a formal cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:D2","CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B03","text":"The formal cause makes matter a this-something and one, and thus reconstructs the what-it-was-to-be as causal substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04","text":"The distinction of matter and form is rewritten as the distinction of potentiality and actuality, so that the unity of the composite becomes the work of actualization.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","text":"Actualization in turn requires prior actuality and reverses the apparent temporal priority of potentiality into the causal priority of actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","text":"The causal priority of actuality delineates eternal substance as without the potentiality not to be.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A17","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07","text":"The order of actuality is finally transferred to thought and truth, where knowing follows existing in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SD7","CH_DAZY_BOO9:FGS9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B01","text":"The whole movement is delineated thus: plurality of senses of being → priority of substance → insufficiency of subject and matter → form as cause → form as actuality → potentiality determined by actuality → prior actuality → eternal actuality → truth following being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AF1","CH_DAZY_BOO8:AF3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B02","text":"The conclusion places actuality as the common terminus of the ontological, causal, and epistemological movement, while leaving incomplete the transition to separate substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-01","text":"The domain of being changes from a categorical hierarchy around substance into a dynamic arrangement of potentiality and actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-02","text":"Substance ceases to be merely a morphological determination and becomes actuality causing being, unity, and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ME2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-03","text":"Matter is transferred from an indeterminate ultimate subject into degrees of proximity to its proper actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:A6","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-04","text":"Unity ceases to be a separate problem of connection and becomes the same formal actuality through which the thing exists.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-05","text":"The temporal opposition of prior and later is redescribed through the distinction between the same in number and the same in form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MME-06","text":"Truth and thought are transferred from the domain of autonomous judgment to the domain of the actual sequence of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME9","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, what substance is, how the composite comes to be and perishes, and what potentiality, actuality, and truth are, are investigated.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, matter, form, composite, potentiality, and actuality are distributed as subject, cause, generated being, possibility, and completion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, inquiry shifts from listing substances and possibilities to seeking which nearest actuality determines each potentiality and substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, form is posited as ungenerated, the composite as temporally generated, and prior actuality as the cause of every transition.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological and practical level, the system enacts its own position by removal of false causes, analysis of coming-to-be, and actualization of latent potentialities.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-01","text":"Form is posited as ungenerated and causal, but the manner in which it is present in perishable things without being separate substance is not fully determined.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-02","text":"Form is said to be an individual cause of particulars, but the defining account is common, and their relation remains unarticulated.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO7:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-03","text":"Actuality universally is posited as prior and as the measure of potentiality, but its unity remains only analogical and provides no common univocal genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:SNX5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:FL-04","text":"Motion, as incomplete actuality, is borne toward an absent end, but eternal motion, being always in actuality, makes the distinction unstable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME4","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-01","text":"The first point of transformation is where the subject is rewritten as matter and matter as the potentiality of a this-something.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-02","text":"The second point of transformation is where the what-it-was-to-be is transferred from a defining account into formal cause and actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:AS6","CH_DAZY_BOO8:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-03","text":"The third point of transformation is where unity changes from an aporia concerning many parts into the actuality of form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:AS4","CH_DAZY_BOO8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MP-04","text":"The fourth point of transformation is where the temporal priority of what is potentially is reversed through the causally prior actuality of the same form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01","text":"Reality is tacitly conceived as a mechanism of graded actualization, in which nothing potentially existing remains indeterminate but is ordered toward its proper form and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-02","text":"The sensible subject becomes a perishable composite: matter being potentiality, and form actuality and cause of being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO8:A12","CH_DAZY_BOO8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03","text":"Time is pictured as a spiral, according to which the particular comes to be from potentiality, while coming-to-be always begins from prior actuality according to form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:A15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:HSI-04","text":"Thought becomes an actuality of contact with or reconstruction of being, not an image projected from opinion onto inert reality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO9:D15","CH_DAZY_BOO9:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B01","text":"The twelve universal axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from substance to formal cause, thence to actuality, and finally to the eternal and truth.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest where the cause of being, the cause of unity, form, and actuality are gathered into one function.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03","text":"More indeterminate than is necessary remains how ungenerated form is present in perishable things and how separate substance relates to eternal actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BOO8:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04","text":"Indeterminacy remains concerning the relation of the common defining account to the individual immanent form, and concerning the analogical unity of actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true spiral movement, because the insufficiency of subject, matter, universal, and bare potentiality repeatedly ends in form and actuality as principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BOO7:MRT10","CH_DAZY_BOO9:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_DAZY_03@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_DAZY_03:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 07–09"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Chapters 07–09","context":"Book 7 · Book 8 · Book 9","original_title":"Chapters 07–09","original_context":"Book 7 · Book 8 · Book 9"},"original_title":"Chapters 07–09","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 10–12","order":4,"parents":["CH_DAZY_BO_2","CH_DAZY_BO_3","CH_DAZY_BO_4"],"revision":"CL_DAZY_04@R001","sha256":"e911ebd949cbd393807d03cce3a6ade9330e11c4ffba47e9bca1ebddcdc73082","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον ἀπόρημα ἐστὶ πῶς τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα, τὰ γένει διαφέροντα καὶ αἱ πολλαὶ ἀρχαὶ δύνανται μίαν ἐπιστήμην καὶ μίαν τάξιν δέχεσθαι ἄνευ κοινοῦ ἀνωτάτου γένους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης οὐχ ὡς χωριστὸν κοινὸν πράγμα συνάγει τὰ ὄντα, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται ἐκ συγγενοῦς μέτρου εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς ἀναλογικὴν καὶ τελικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-03","text":"Θεμέλιον τῆς κινήσεως ἐστὶν ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος· τὸ ἀδιαίρετον μέτρον, ἡ μία σημασία καὶ ἡ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσία τὴν ἀοριστίαν εἰς γνωστὴν τάξιν μεταβάλλουσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς ἐκ πολυσημίας διὰ διαιρέσεως καὶ ἀποκλεισμοῦ εἰς ἀσύμμετρον ἱεραρχίαν προβαίνει, ἐν ᾗ τὰ πολλὰ οὐ ταὐτὰ γίγνεται ἀλλὰ πρὸς πρῶτον ὅρον τάττεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν· ἑκάστη ἐπάνοδος εἰς τὸ ἓν μείζονα χώραν τάττει, πρῶτον τὸ μετρητόν, εἶτα τὸ ἐπιστητόν, τέλος δὲ τὸ κινούμενον ὅλον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-06","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις ἐκ τελείας διαφορᾶς μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀντικείμενον μιᾶς ἐπιστήμης καὶ τέλος εἰς γεννητικὸν σχῆμα μεταβολῆς, ὃ κοινὸν γένος ἢ ὑποκείμενον καὶ ἐνέργειαν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-07","text":"Ἡ ὑποθετικὴ πρωτεία χωριστῆς καὶ ἀκινήτου οὐσίας μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀξίωσιν καθαρᾶς ἐνεργείας, ὅταν ἡ ἀϊδιότης χρόνου καὶ κινήσεως ληφθῇ ὡς δεδομένη.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὸ πλῆθος, ἀλλὰ συνάπτει μέτρα, ἐπιστήμας, αἰτίας καὶ κινήσεις πρὸς μίαν ἀρχὴν ἣ ὡς ἀγαθὸν καὶ τάξις ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὔτε γένη οὔτε χωριστὰ κοινὰ στοιχεῖά ἐστιν, ἀλλὰ διὰ πλειόνων γενῶν κατὰ λόγον καὶ ἀναφορὰν λέγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX5","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἑνότης οὐ προστιθεῖσα οὐσία ἀλλ᾽ ὁρισμὸς τοῦ ἑκάστου ἐστίν, καθ᾽ ὃ ἕκαστον ἀδιαίρετον, μετρητὸν καὶ τόδε τι γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶσα γνώσις καὶ κοινωνία λόγου προϋποτίθεται ὡρισμένον τι, ὃ ἢ ἀδιαιρέτῳ μέτρῳ ἢ μιᾷ σημασίᾳ ἢ ἐνεργείᾳ διορίζεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ διαφορὰ καὶ ἡ μεταβολὴ οὐκ ἐνεργοῦσιν ἐν ἀπολύτῳ ἀνομοιότητι, ἀλλὰ κοινὸν λόγον, κοινὸν γένος ἢ ὑπομένον ὑποκείμενον ἀπαιτοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ ἓν μεταβάλλει τὴν ἐνέργειαν αὐτοῦ· μέτρον ἐν γένει, κέντρον ἀναφορᾶς τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων καὶ ἄυλος πρώτη ἀρχὴ τῆς τάξεως γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἑνότης ἐπιστήμης ἐκ κοινοῦ τρόπου ἀναφορᾶς καὶ προτεραιότητος, οὐκ ἐξ ἀριθμητικῆς ταυτότητος οὐδὲ ὁμογενείας τῶν ὑποκειμένων συνίσταται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις καὶ ἡ ὡρισμένη σημασία ἀλλήλας στηρίζουσιν, ὥστε ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἀοριστία μήτε λόγον μήτε ἐπιστήμην δέχεσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς οὐσίας παρέχει τὸ κοινὸν κέντρον τῆς θεωρίας, ἐπειδὴ πάθη, κινήσεις καὶ αἰτίαι τῶν λοιπῶν κατηγοριῶν ἐξ αὐτῆς ἐξαρτῶνται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς καὶ ἡ τύχη οὔτε ἀναγκαίας ἐπιστήμης ὑποκείμενον οὔτε πρώτη αἰτία διαρκούς τάξεως δύνανται εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κίνησις οὔτε ψιλὴ δύναμις οὔτε τετελεσμένη ἐνέργειά ἐστιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἐντελέχεια τοῦ δυνατοῦ δι᾽ ἧς ἡ δύναμις πρὸς εἶδος ἄγεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα διαφέρουσιν ἀριθμῷ καὶ γένει, κοινὴν δὲ τάξιν ἔχουσι διὰ τῆς ἀναλογίας ὕλης, εἴδους, στερήσεως καὶ κινοῦντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀρχὴν καθαρᾶς ἐνεργείας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δύναμις μόνη ἐνδέχεται μὴ ἐνεργεῖν καὶ οὕτως οὐ διασῴζει τὸ ἀεί.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ ἕλκει τὸ σύστημα ὡς ἀκίνητον νοητόν, αὐτονοουμένη ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀγαθὸν ὃ χωριστὴν αἰτίαν καὶ ἐνυπάρχουσαν τάξιν συνάπτει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-01","text":"Τὸ ἓν διαμένει ὡς ἀρχὴ συναγωγῆς, μεταβάλλει δὲ χώραν· ἐκ μετρητικῆς ἀρχῆς εἰς ἐπιστημονικὴν ἀναφορὰν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς αἰτιακὴν καὶ τελικὴν ἑνότητα μετατίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ μέτρον ἐπανέρχεται μεταβεβλημένον· πρῶτον συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ μετρητόν, εἶτα ὡρισμένη σημασία πρὸς τὸ λεγόμενον, τέλος δὲ ἐνέργεια πρὸς τὸ δυνάμει ὄν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις ἐκ ταξινομήσεως τῶν ἄκρων εἰς κοινὸν ἀντικείμενον θεωρίας καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς γεννητικὸν ὅρον μεταβολῆς αὔξεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης ἀναστρέφεται· ἀποβάλλεται ὅταν κοινὸν καθόλου ἢ ἀργὸν παράδειγμα ποιῇ, ὑποτίθεται δὲ καὶ τέλος βεβαιοῦται ὅταν καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀρχὴ κινήσεως γένηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μεταβαίνουσιν ἐκ τοπικοῦ ὁρισμοῦ κινήσεως εἰς ὀντολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἐν ᾗ ἡ ἐνέργεια ἀρχὴ γενέσεως καὶ ἀϊδιότητος γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ κοινότης παύει ταὐτότης πράγματος εἶναι καὶ μετατίθεται εἰς συγγένειαν μέτρου, κοινὴν ἀναφορὰν ἐπιστήμης καὶ ταυτότητα αἰτιακῆς ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστῶν ἀφαιρέσεων διαμένει, περαίνει δὲ τὸ ἔργον αὐτῆς ὅταν διακριθῇ ἡ ἀδρανὴς καθολικότης ἀπὸ χωριστὴν ἐνεργὸν οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ κατὰ μέρος κρίσεις περὶ ἀριθμοῦ, ἴσου, ἄρρενος, θήλεος καὶ χρωμάτων μένουσι παραδείγματα τῆς διακρίσεως λόγου καὶ ὕλης, οὐχ αὐτοτελεῖς ἀρχαὶ τοῦ νῦν συστήματος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:D9","CH_DAZY_BO_2:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ ἀποκρούσεις τοῦ Πρωταγόρου καὶ τῶν ἀντιμαχομένων φαινομένων αὔξονται μόνον καθ᾽ ὅσον θεμελιοῦσι τὴν ἀντικειμενικὴν ὁριστότητα τοῦ γνωστοῦ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-03","text":"Οἱ ἀριθμοὶ καὶ αἱ ἰδίαι ἀντιστοιχίαι τῶν οὐρανίων φορῶν πρὸς ἀκινήτους οὐσίας μένουσι κατώτεραι ὑποθέσεις καὶ οὐ στηρίζουσι τὴν καθόλου ἀνάγκην πρώτης ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-04","text":"Αἱ διαιρέσεις κινήσεως, γενέσεως, φθορᾶς καὶ συνεχείας γεφυροῦσι τὰς μονάδας, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφῶνται ὑπὸ τὴν ἀνωτέραν διάταξιν δυνάμεως, ἐνεργείας καὶ οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-05","text":"Εἰς τὸ νῦν μέγεθος αὔξονται μόνον αἱ προτάσεις ὅτι ἡ ἑνότης οὐ γένος, ἡ ἐπιστήμη ἀναφορική, αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀναλογικαί, καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ ἰδέα καθίσταται ἄχρηστος ὡς ἀρχὴ γενέσεως, οὐ μὴν πᾶσα χωριστὴ οὐσία ἀποβάλλεται, ἐπεὶ ἡ ἐνεργὸς καὶ τελικὴ αἰτία ἄλλην λειτουργίαν ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει κοινὸν γένος τοῦ ὄντος καὶ τοῦ ἑνός, ὥστε ἡ καθολικότης ἐξ ἀναφορᾶς, προτεραιότητος καὶ ἀναλογίας γεννᾶσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείονται τὸ χωριστὸν ἓν καὶ αἱ χωρισταὶ ἰδέαι ὡς κοινὰ παραδείγματα, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε μετροῦσι τὰ γένη οὔτε κινοῦσι τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ γιγνώσκων ὡς κυρίαρχον μέτρον τοῦ ὄντος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ ἐπιστήμη ὑπὸ τῶν πραγμάτων ὁρίζονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ συναλήθευσις φάσεως καὶ ἀποφάσεως, διότι ἀφανίζει τὴν ὡρισμένην σημασίαν καὶ ἅμα τὴν δυνατότητα διαφορᾶς, προαιρέσεως καὶ λόγου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείονται τὸ συμβεβηκὸς, ἡ τύχη καὶ ἄχρονον χάος ὡς πρῶται αἰτίαι τάξεως, ἐπειδὴ οὐ παρέχουσι συνεχή καὶ ἀναγκαίαν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείονται τὸ ἐνεργείᾳ ἄπειρον καὶ ἡ εἰς ἄπειρον ἀναγωγὴ ἀρχῶν, γενέσεων καὶ κινήσεων, ἐπειδὴ ἀφαιροῦσι πρῶτον ὅρον καὶ περάτωσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-07","text":"Ἀποκλείονται ἡ δύναμις μόνη καὶ χωριστὴ ἀργὴ οὐσία ὡς ἱκαναὶ πρῶται ἀρχαί, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ δεῖ ἐνεργεῖν ἢ τέλος εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πᾶσα ἑνότης ταυτότητα γένους ἀπαιτεῖ· ἄνευ τούτου τοῦ ἀποκλεισμοῦ οὔτε μία ἐπιστήμη πολλαχῶς λεγομένου ὄντος οὔτε ἀναλογικὴ κοινότης ἀρχῶν δυνατή ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἀόριστος σημασία δύναται εἰς λόγον εἰσελθεῖν, ἐπεὶ ὁ μηδὲν ἓν σημαίνων ἔξω τῆς διαλεκτικῆς κοινωνίας τίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-03","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι γένεσις ἐξ ἀπολύτου μηδενὸς ἢ μεταβολὴ ἄνευ ὑπομένοντος δύναται γενέσθαι, ἐπεὶ οὕτως ἡ ἐναντίωσις αὐτὴ ἑαυτὴν μεταβάλλειν ἔδει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-04","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ πρῶτον ἔχει ὕλην, δύναμιν ἢ ἐναντίον, ἐπεὶ τότε ἡ ἐνέργεια αὐτοῦ ἐνδεχομένη καὶ οὐκ ἀναγκαία γίγνοιτο.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-05","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πολλαὶ πρῶται ἀρχαὶ ἀσύντακτοι δύνανται μίαν τάξιν γεννᾶν, ἐπεὶ τὸ ὅλον ἄνευ κοινοῦ τέλους εἰς παράλληλα αἰτιακὰ συστήματα διασπᾶται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης γίνεται δεκτὴ μόνον ἐὰν αἰτιωδῶς ἐνεργῇ· ἡ μὴ κινοῦσα μηδὲ τελικὴ χωριστὴ φύσις ὑπὸ τοῦ συστήματος ὡς περιττὴ ἀποβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ ἀπροσδιόριστος πολλαχότης οὐ δύναται πρώτη χώρα εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ μέτρον, σημασία, οὐσία καὶ ἐνέργεια ἀναγκαίως προηγοῦνται πάσης γνωστῆς διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἐστὶν ἡ ἐπίπεδος πραγματικότης, ἐν ᾗ μέτρα καὶ μετρητά, οὐσίαι καὶ πάθη, δυνάμεις καὶ ἐνέργειαι ὁμοτίμως παράκειται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος τίθεται χρονικὴ ἀρχὴ ἡ προτέρα πάσης ἐνεργείας, ἐπειδὴ ὁ ἀΐδιος χρόνος καὶ ἡ συνεχὴς κίνησις ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἀείποτε ἐνεργοῦσαν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἐστὶ χωριστὴ καθολικότης ἡ ἅμα κοινὸν γένος καὶ αἰτία τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα νομίζεται· τὸ πρῶτον δύναται χωριστὸν εἶναι μόνον ὡς ἐνέργεια καὶ τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-01","text":"Ἡ μὴ γενικὴ καθολικότης τριχῶς πραγματοῦται· ὡς συγγενὲς μέτρον, ὡς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ καὶ ὡς κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν αἰτιακὴ τάξις.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ὁριστότης ἑνοποιεῖ τὴν μέτρησιν, τὸν λόγον καὶ τὴν οὐσίαν, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστος τούτων ἀοριστίαν τινὰ εἰς ἓν ἐνεργὸν πέρας ἀνάγει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις δύναται μεταβολὴν γεννᾶν μόνον ὅταν ἡ στατικὴ τῶν ἄκρων διάταξις συντεθῇ πρὸς ὕλην δυνάμει δεκτικὴν ἀμφοτέρων.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστοῦ ἑνὸς καὶ ἰδεῶν οὐκ ἀποκλείει τὴν χωριστὴν πρώτη οὐσίαν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει τὸ κριτήριον χωριστότητος ἐκ καθολικῆς ὁμοιότητος εἰς αἰτιακὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐν τῇ θεωρίᾳ τῶν ἐπιστημῶν ὑποθετικὴ θεολογικὴ πρωτεία μεταβάλλεται εἰς τελικὴν ὀντολογικὴν θέσιν διὰ τῆς ἀϊδιότητος κινήσεως καὶ τῆς ἀνεπαρκείας τῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀοριστία τοῦ συμβεβηκότος διασῴζει τὸ ἐνδεχόμενον ἐντὸς τεταγμένου ὅλου, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται εἰς πρώτην αἰτίαν τῆς τάξεως αὐξάνεσθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-09","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-07","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῆς γνώσεως μιμεῖται τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὄντος· τὸ γνωστὸν μετρεῖ τὸν γιγνώσκοντα, ἡ οὐσία τὰ πάθη, καὶ ἡ πρώτη ἐνέργεια τὰ κινούμενα.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυνίσταται ὡς σύστημα ἀσυμμέτρων ἐξαρτήσεων· τὰ πολλὰ ἐξαρτῶνται ἐκ μέτρου, τὰ πάθη ἐξ οὐσίας, ἡ κίνησις ἐξ ἐνεργείας καὶ ἡ τάξις ἐκ πρώτου τέλους.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἔχει πρῶτον χρονικὸν αἴτιον, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀΐδιος αὐτοῦ κίνησις ὀντολογικῶς ἐξαρτᾶται ἐξ ἀχρόνου κατὰ γένεσιν ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία καθόλου γίνεται οὐ διὰ κατοχὴν πάντων τῶν ὄντων ὑπὸ ἓν γένος, ἀλλὰ διὰ γνώσιν τῶν προτέρων ὅρων ὑφ᾽ οὓς αἱ μερικαὶ ἐπιστῆμαι ἀποδεικνύουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-04","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον οὐ κυριεύει τῆς ἀληθείας, ἀλλὰ μετρεῖται ὑπὸ τοῦ γνωστοῦ καὶ δεσμεύεται ὑπὸ τῆς μὴ ἀντιφάσεως, ἡ δὲ ἀνωτάτη νόησις ταὐτίζεται τῷ νοητῷ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-07","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τάξεως οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἐξάλειψιν τῆς πολλότητος, ἀλλὰ διανεμημένην ὑπόταξιν πολλῶν μέτρων, ἐπιστημῶν, αἰτίων καὶ κινήσεων πρὸς κοινὴν τελείωσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-01","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος βρόχος ἔχει οὕτως· πολλαχότης → ζήτησις ἑνότητος → ἀπόρριψις κοινοῦ γένους → σχέσις πρὸς ἕν → νέα διάταξις τῆς πολλαχότητος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-02","text":"Ὁ δεύτερος βρόχος ἔχει οὕτως· ἀόριστος λόγος → ἀνάγκη μιᾶς σημασίας → μὴ ἀντίφασις → δυνατὴ ἀπόδειξις → ἀποκλεισμὸς τῆς ἀοριστίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ κύρια ὁδὸς αὐξήσεως ἔχει οὕτως· ἐναντία → κοινὸν ὑποκείμενον → δύναμις → κίνησις → ἐνέργεια → ἀΐδιος κίνησις → καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης ἑλίσσεται διὰ διαδοχικῆς ἀρνήσεως καὶ ἀνασυστάσεως· χωριστὸν καθόλου ἀποβάλλεται, χωριστὸν ἀκίνητον ὑποτίθεται, χωριστὴ καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια καταφάσκεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἕλκουσα ἔννοια ἐστὶ τὸ ἓν ὡς ὅρος τάξεως· οὐ μένει ἀριθμητικὴ μονάς, ἀλλὰ ἀεὶ νέαν λειτουργίαν προσλαμβάνει ἕως οὗ ἀρχὴ τοῦ ὅλου γένηται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ ἀνακύκλησις συνάπτει τὸ ἀγαθὸν ὡς χωριστὴν ἀρχὴν πρὸς τὸ ἀγαθὸν ὡς ἐνυπάρχουσαν τάξιν, ὥστε τὸ τέλος τοῦ συστήματος εἰς τὴν ἀρχὴν αὐτοῦ ἐπανιέναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ πολλαχότης τῶν τρόπων τοῦ ἑνὸς συμπιέζεται εἰς ἀδιαίρετον καὶ συγγενὲς μέτρον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία χωριστοῦ καθόλου μεταβάλλει τὸ μέτρον εἰς ἐνδογενῆ ἑνότητα ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ διακατηγορικὴ πολλαχότης τοῦ ὄντος μετατίθεται ἐκ γενικῆς ταυτότητος εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφοράν, ἣ μίαν ἐπιστήμην γεννᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ μία ἐπιστήμη ἀναλαμβάνει τὰς πρώτας ἐναντιώσεις καὶ τὴν μὴ ἀντίφασιν, ὥστε τοὺς ὅρους πάσης σημασίας καὶ ἀποδείξεως ὁρίζειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις μεταβαίνει ἐκ λογικῆς τάξεως εἰς φυσικὴν μεταβολήν, ὅταν ὕλη ὡς κοινὸν δυνάμει ὑποκείμενον προστεθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ ἐκ δυνάμει εἰς ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν αὔξει τὴν ἐνέργειαν ἀπὸ τοπικοῦ πέρατος γενέσεως εἰς ὀντολογικῶς προτέραν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ ἀϊδιότης κινήσεως ἀφαιρεῖ ἀπὸ τὴν πρώτην ἀρχὴν ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν καὶ παράγει ἀκίνητον ἐνέργειαν κινοῦσαν ὡς νοητὸν καὶ ἐφετόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","text":"Ἡ ἀκίνητος ἐνέργεια συνάπτει τὴν πολλότητα τῶν κινήσεων εἰς μίαν τελικὴν τάξιν, ἐν ᾗ τὸ πρῶτον ἀγαθὸν καὶ ἡ διάταξις τοῦ ὅλου ἀλλήλων ἀχώριστα γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B01","text":"Πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ἓν → ἀδιαίρετον μέτρον → ἐνδογενὴς ἑνότης ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B02","text":"Ἐνδογενὴς ἑνότης → ἀπόρριψις κοινοῦ γένους → πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων ὄντων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B03","text":"Πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά → μία πρώτη θεωρία → κοινὰ ἀξιώματα → ὡρισμένη σημασία καὶ μὴ ἀντίφασις.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B04","text":"Πρῶται ἐναντιώσεις → κοινὸν ὑποκείμενον → δύναμις καὶ ἐνέργεια → διορισμὸς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B05","text":"Διορισμὸς μεταβολῆς → ἀναλογικὴ κοινότης αἰτίων → προτεραιότης οὐσίας καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B06","text":"Ἀΐδιος κίνησις → ἀνεπάρκεια δυνάμεως → ἀκίνητος καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια → νοητὸν καὶ ἐφετόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B07","text":"Πολλαὶ κινήσεις καὶ ἀρχαί → μία πρώτη τάξις → αὐτονοουμένη ζωή → ἀγαθὸν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης μεταγράφεται ἐκ πράγματος ἢ γένους εἰς λειτουργίαν τάξεως, ἣ κατὰ τὸ μέγεθος μέτρον, ἀναφορά, ἀναλογία ἢ πρώτη αἰτία γίνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις παύει ψιλὸν λογικὸν ζεῦγος εἶναι καὶ διακρίνεται εἰς ἀντίφασιν, ἐναντιότητα καὶ μεταβολὴν ἐν ὑποκειμένῳ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-03","text":"Ἡ κοινότης μετατίθεται ἐκ ταὐτοῦ στοιχείου εἰς ταὐτὸν λόγον σχέσεως, ὥστε τὰ γένει καὶ ἀριθμῷ ἕτερα μίαν αἰτιακὴν διάταξιν δέχεσθαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-04","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης διαιρεῖται εἰς ἀδρανῆ ἀφαίρεσιν καὶ ἐνεργὸν προτεραιότητα, ὥστε ἡ κριτικὴ τῶν ἰδεῶν καὶ ἡ κατάφασις πρώτης οὐσίας μὴ ταὐτὸν ἀντικείμενον ἔχειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-05","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης παύει μία ὁμοιότροπος ὠθία εἶναι καὶ διαγράφεται ὡς ἐνυπάρχων λόγος, προσεχὲς κινοῦν καὶ ἀκίνητον ἐφετὸν τέλος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐν τῷ ἐπιφανειακῷ βαθμῷ ζητοῦνται τὸ ἕν, τὸ ὄν, αἱ ἐναντιώσεις, ἡ μία σοφία, ἡ μεταβολὴ καὶ ἡ ἀκίνητος οὐσία.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐν τῷ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμῷ ἐνεργοῦσι συγγενῆ μέτρα, πρὸς ἓν ἀναφοραί, κοινὰ ὑποκείμενα καὶ ἀναλογικαὶ σειραὶ αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐν τῷ ὑπερστρατηγικῷ βαθμῷ ἡ ζήτησις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ταυτότητας πραγμάτων εἰς τοὺς ὅρους συγκρίσεως, σημασίας, ἀποδείξεως καὶ αἰτιακῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐν τῷ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμῷ ἡ πραγματικότης ἱεραρχεῖται ἀπὸ δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν, ἀπὸ κινουμένου εἰς ἀκίνητον καὶ ἀπὸ ἀϊδίου χρόνου εἰς ἄχρονον πρώτη ζωήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐν τῷ μεθοδικῷ βαθμῷ τὸ σύστημα πράττει ὃ καταφάσκει· διαιρεῖ τὴν πολυσημίαν, ἀποκλείει τὰ ἀόριστα ἄκρα καὶ συνάγει τὰ πολλὰ διὰ ἀναφορᾶς μᾶλλον ἢ διὰ ἐξομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἐνδογενὴς ἑνότης ἑκάστου γένους καὶ ἡ χωριστὴ πρώτη ἀρχὴ συνάπτονται μόνον ἐὰν διακριθῇ ἡ ἑνότης ὡς καθολικὸν κατηγορούμενον ἀπὸ τῆς ἑνότητος ὡς αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-02","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία καθόλου ἐστὶν ἄνευ κοινοῦ γένους, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τοῦ ἑνὸς πρὸς ὃ τὰ σημαινόμενα τοῦ ὄντος ἀνάγεται μένει ἀδιορίστως πεπυκνωμένη.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-03","text":"Ἡ σωτηρία τοῦ ἐνδεχομένου διὰ τοῦ συμβεβηκότος ἀντιτείνει τῇ ἀναγκαίᾳ καὶ ἀϊδίῳ τάξει, καὶ ἡ διάκρισις τῶν αἰτιακῶν χωρῶν μᾶλλον ἢ κοινὴ λύσις τὴν ἔντασιν κατέχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-04","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν καὶ ἡ μία πρώτη ἀρχὴ τάξει μὲν συνυπάρχει, ἡ δὲ ἀκριβὴς ἀνάγκη τῆς ὑποτάξεως στηρίζεται ἐπὶ ἀστρολογικαῖς ὑποθέσεσι καὶ τελικῇ εἰκόνι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-01","text":"Τὸ ἓν μεταβάλλει σημασίαν ὅταν ἐκ πρώτου συγγενοῦς μέτρου γένηται ἀναφορικὸν κέντρον πολλαχῶς λεγομένου ὄντος.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἐναντίωσις μεταβάλλει ἐνέργειαν ὅταν ἐκ τελείας διαφορᾶς καὶ ἀντικειμένου ἐπιστήμης γένηται ὅρος πραγματικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-03","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία μεταβαίνει ἐκ ὑποθέσεως τῆς τάξεως τῶν ἐπιστημῶν εἰς συμπέρασμα τῆς ἀϊδιότητος κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-04","text":"Τὸ κινεῖν μεταβάλλεται ἐκ ποιητικῆς ἐνεργείας εἰς τελικὴν ἕλξιν, ἀλλ᾽ ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν τὸ νοητὸν παράγει κυκλικὴν φορὰν μένει πυκνός.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς πεδίον κύκλων περὶ διαδοχικὰ κέντρα· τὰ πλήθη περὶ μέτρα, αἱ σημασίαι περὶ μίαν ἀναφοράν, αἱ μεταβολαὶ περὶ ἐνεργείας καὶ τὸ ὅλον περὶ ἀκίνητον ἀγαθόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ἀνθρώπινον ὑποκείμενον γίνεται μετρούμενον καὶ ὑπὸ τῆς σημασίας δεδεμένον, ἡ δὲ ἀνωτάτη νόησις οὐκ ἔχει ἕτερον μέτρον ἀλλ᾽ αὐτὴ ἑαυτὴν νοεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ὡς ἀΐδιος κυκλικὴ κίνησις ἄνευ πρώτης χρονικῆς ἀρχῆς, ἧς ἡ διάρκεια ἐξ ἀκινήτου καὶ ἀχρόνου ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς οὐκ ἐστὶ διαφυγὴ ἐκ τῆς πολλότητος, ἀλλὰ ἀνάβασις διὰ μέτρων, λόγων, ἀναλογιῶν καὶ αἰτιῶν πρὸς τὴν ἀρχὴν ἣ τὴν πολλότητα τάττει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ καθόλου ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἐκ τοῦ ἑνὸς ὡς μέτρου διὰ τοῦ ὄντος ὡς πρὸς ἓν λεγομένου εἰς τὴν πρώτη καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ἐν τῇ ἀπορρίψει γενικῆς ἑνότητος, ἐν τῷ ἐλέγχῳ τῆς μὴ ἀντιφάσεως καὶ ἐν τῇ ἀναγωγῇ τῆς ἀϊδίου κινήσεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένουσι τὸ ἀκριβὲς κέντρον τῆς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς, ὁ τρόπος τῆς ἀναλογίας μεταξὺ τῶν γενῶν καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς τελικὴ αἰτιότης τῆς κυκλικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B04","text":"Τὸ σύστημα συμφωνεῖ ἐὰν διακρίνῃ τὸ χωριστὸν καθόλου ἀπὸ χωριστὴν ἐνέργειαν καὶ τὴν ἀναλογικὴν κοινότητα ἀπὸ κοινὸ γένος, ἀσταθεῖ δὲ ὅπου αἱ διακρίσεις αὗται σιωπῶσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ ἑλικοειδῆ κίνησιν, ἀλλὰ τὰ ἀστρολογικὰ πλήθη, ἡ μονοσήμαντος ἀντιστοιχία κινήσεως καὶ κινοῦντος καὶ ἡ στρατιωτικὴ εἰκὼν ἀντιτείνουσιν εἰς πλήρη ἀξιωματικὴν περάτωσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175407083174Z_2f492005","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 10–12","source_sha256":"e911ebd949cbd393807d03cce3a6ade9330e11c4ffba47e9bca1ebddcdc73082","sha256":"c115806323411b963857c2bf278de9855c68ad03456c2bca7c94824fa028ae82","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:54:07.084793+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-01","text":"The principal aporia is how things said in many ways, things differing in genus, and many principles can admit one science and one order without a common highest genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-02","text":"Unity does not gather beings as a separate common thing, but changes from a cognate measure into reference to one thing, and thence into analogical and teleological order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-03","text":"The foundation of the movement is determinate account (logos); the indivisible measure, the single meaning, and actuality-substance transform indeterminacy into a knowable order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","text":"The argument proceeds from polysemy through division and exclusion to an asymmetrical hierarchy, in which the many do not become identical but are ordered toward a first term.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-05","text":"The movement is spiral; each return to the one orders a greater domain: first the measurable, then the knowable, and finally the whole that is moved.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-06","text":"Opposition changes from complete difference into the object of one science and finally into a generative schema of change, which requires a common genus or subject and actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-07","text":"The hypothetical primacy of separate and unmoved substance changes into the requirement of pure actuality, when the eternity of time and motion is taken as given.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AS-08","text":"The completion does not abolish plurality, but connects measures, sciences, causes, and motions to one principle that operates as good and order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being and the one are neither genera nor separate common elements, but are said across several genera according to account and reference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX5","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Unity is not an added substance but the definition of each thing, in accordance with which each becomes indivisible, measurable, and a this-something.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Every cognition and community of discourse presupposes something determinate, which is delimited either by an indivisible measure, or by a single meaning, or by actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Difference and change do not operate in absolute dissimilarity, but require a common account, common genus, or enduring subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The one changes its function; it becomes a measure within a genus, a center of reference for things said in many ways, and an immaterial first principle of order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The unity of science consists in a common mode of reference and priority, not in numerical identity or homogeneity of its subjects.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Non-contradiction and determinate meaning support one another, so that absolute indeterminacy admits neither discourse nor science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] The priority of substance supplies the common center of the theory, since affections, motions, and causes of the remaining categories depend upon it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] The accidental and chance can be neither the subject of necessary science nor the first cause of enduring order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A14","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Motion is neither bare potentiality nor completed actuality, but the actuality (entelecheia) of what is potential, through which potentiality is led toward form.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A15","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] The principles of particular things differ in number and genus, but have a common order through the analogy of matter, form, privation, and mover.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Eternal motion requires a principle of pure actuality, since potentiality alone can fail to be actual and thus does not preserve the eternal.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","text":"[Attractor] The first principle draws the system as an unmoved intelligible, self-thinking actuality, and good, which joins a separate cause and immanent order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-01","text":"The one remains as a principle of gathering, but changes place; it shifts from a metrical principle to scientific reference and thence to causal and teleological unity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","text":"The measure returns transformed: first cognate with the measurable, then determinate meaning in relation to what is said, and finally actuality in relation to what is potentially being.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-03","text":"Opposition grows from the classification of extremes into a common object of theory and thence into a generative condition of change.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","text":"Separateness reverses itself: it is rejected when it makes a common universal or inert paradigm, but posited and finally confirmed when it becomes pure actuality and a principle of motion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","text":"Potentiality and actuality pass from a local definition of motion to an ontological hierarchy, in which actuality becomes the principle of generation and eternity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:D12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-06","text":"Community ceases to be identity of a thing and shifts into kinship of measure, common scientific reference, and identity of causal analogy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RMD-07","text":"The rejection of separate abstractions remains, but completes its work when inert universality is distinguished from separate active substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-01","text":"Particular judgments concerning number, equal, male, female, and colors remain examples of the distinction between account and matter, not self-sufficient principles of the present system.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:D9","CH_DAZY_BO_2:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-02","text":"The refutations of Protagoras and of conflicting appearances increase only insofar as they ground the objective determinacy of the knowable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-03","text":"Numbers and the special correspondences of celestial motions to unmoved substances remain subordinate hypotheses and do not support the universal necessity of first actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-04","text":"The divisions of motion, generation, destruction, and continuity bridge the units, but are absorbed under the higher arrangement of potentiality, actuality, and substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:D13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-05","text":"Only the propositions that unity is not a genus, science is referential, principles are analogical, and actuality is prior to potentiality rise to the present scale.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:CGD-06","text":"The separate Idea becomes useless as a principle of generation; yet not every separate substance is rejected, since the active and teleological cause has another function.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-01","text":"The system excludes a common genus of being and the one, so that universality is generated from reference, priority, and analogy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-02","text":"The separate one and separate Ideas as common paradigms are excluded, since they neither measure the genera nor move generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-03","text":"The knower is excluded as the sovereign measure of being, since sensation and science are determined by things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-04","text":"The simultaneous truth of affirmation and negation is excluded, because it abolishes determinate meaning and at the same time the possibility of difference, choice, and discourse.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-05","text":"The accidental, chance, and timeless chaos are excluded as first causes of order, since they do not provide continuous and necessary actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-06","text":"Actual infinity and the regress to infinity of principles, generations, and motions are excluded, since they remove a first term and completion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX13","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:GNX-07","text":"Potentiality alone and separate inert substance are excluded as sufficient first principles, since the first principle must be active or be an end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that every unity requires identity of genus; without this exclusion, neither one science of being said in many ways nor analogical community of principles is possible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that indeterminate meaning can enter into discourse, since one who signifies no one thing is placed outside dialectical community.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that generation from absolute nothing or change without an enduring subject can occur, since in that case opposition itself would have to change itself.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that the first has matter, potentiality, or a contrary, since then its actuality would become contingent rather than necessary.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:DNX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that many unordered first principles can generate one order, since the whole without a common end is split into parallel causal systems.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX14","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","text":"Separateness is admitted only if it operates causally; a separate nature that neither moves nor is teleological is rejected by the system as superfluous.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-01","text":"Indeterminate multiplicity cannot be the first domain, since measure, meaning, substance, and actuality necessarily precede every known difference.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-02","text":"Flat reality is unacceptable, in which measures and measurables, substances and affections, potentialities and actualities lie alongside one another as equals.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-03","text":"A temporal principle prior to all actuality is posited as impossible, since eternal time and continuous motion require a principle that is always active.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","text":"A separate universality that is held to be both a common genus and the cause of particulars is unacceptable; the first can be separate only as actuality and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-01","text":"Non-generic universality is realized in three ways: as cognate measure, as reference to one thing, and as an analogical causal order.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-02","text":"Determinacy unifies measurement, discourse, and substance, since each of these brings a certain indeterminacy to one active limit.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-03","text":"Opposition can generate change only when the static arrangement of extremes is conjoined with matter potentially receptive of both.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-04","text":"The rejection of a separate one and Ideas does not exclude separate first substance, but changes the criterion of separateness from universal likeness to causal actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-05","text":"The hypothetical theological primacy in the theory of sciences changes into a final ontological position through the eternity of motion and the insufficiency of potentiality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-06","text":"The indeterminacy of the accidental preserves the contingent within an ordered whole, but is not permitted to grow into the first cause of order.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-09","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:XD-07","text":"The order of knowledge imitates the order of being: the knowable measures the knower, substance measures affections, and first actuality measures moving things.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-01","text":"Reality is reconstituted as a system of asymmetrical dependencies: the many depend on measure, affections on substance, motion on actuality, and order on a first end.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-02","text":"Time has no first temporal cause, but its eternal motion depends ontologically on actuality timeless in respect of generation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03","text":"First philosophy becomes universal not through containing all beings under one genus, but through knowledge of the prior terms under which the particular sciences demonstrate.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-04","text":"The knowing subject does not rule truth, but is measured by the knowable and bound by non-contradiction; the highest thinking is identical with the intelligible.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-03","CL_DAZY_04:GA-07","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","text":"The unity of order does not require the elimination of plurality, but the distributed subordination of many measures, sciences, causes, and motions toward a common completion.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-11","CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-01","text":"The first loop is as follows: multiplicity → search for unity → rejection of common genus → relation to one → new arrangement of multiplicity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-02","text":"The second loop is as follows: indeterminate discourse → necessity of one meaning → non-contradiction → possible demonstration → exclusion of indeterminacy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-03","text":"The principal path of escalation is as follows: contraries → common subject → potentiality → motion → actuality → eternal motion → pure actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-04","text":"Separateness coils through successive negation and reconstitution: separate universal is rejected, separate unmoved substance is posited, separate pure actuality is affirmed.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-05","text":"The attracting concept is the one as a term of order; it does not remain a numerical unit, but always takes on a new function until it becomes the principle of the whole.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:RLE-06","text":"The final recirculation joins the good as a separate principle to the good as immanent order, so that the end of the system returns into its principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B01","text":"The multiplicity of modes of the one is compressed into an indivisible and cognate measure.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS1","CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B02","text":"The impossibility of a separate universal transforms measure into the intrinsic unity of each genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BO_2:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B03","text":"The cross-categorial multiplicity of being shifts from generic identity to reference to one thing, which generates one science.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B04","text":"The one science takes up the primary oppositions and non-contradiction, so as to define the terms of every meaning and demonstration.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B05","text":"Opposition passes from logical order into natural change when matter as a common potentially existing subject is added.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B06","text":"Change from potentially being to actually being elevates actuality from a local terminus of generation to an ontologically prior principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","text":"The eternity of motion removes matter and potentiality from the first principle and produces unmoved actuality, moving as intelligible and desirable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","text":"Unmoved actuality joins the multiplicity of motions into one teleological order, in which the first good and the arrangement of the whole become inseparable from one another.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:D7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B01","text":"One said in many ways → indivisible measure → intrinsic unity of each genus.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B02","text":"Intrinsic unity → rejection of common genus → reference to one thing of beings said in many ways.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B03","text":"Reference to one thing → one first theory → common axioms → determinate meaning and non-contradiction.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B04","text":"Primary oppositions → common subject → potentiality and actuality → delimitation of change.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B05","text":"Delimitation of change → analogical community of causes → priority of substance and actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B06","text":"Eternal motion → insufficiency of potentiality → unmoved pure actuality → intelligible and desirable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:AFM-B07","text":"Many motions and principles → one first order → self-thinking life → good of the whole.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-01","text":"Unity is transcribed from a thing or genus into a function of order, which according to scale becomes measure, reference, analogy, or first cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-02","text":"Opposition ceases to be a bare logical pair and is distinguished into contradiction, contrariety, and change in a subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ME4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-03","text":"Community shifts from the same element to the same relational account, so that things other in genus and number admit one causal arrangement.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:D5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-04","text":"Separateness is divided into inert abstraction and active priority, so that the critique of Ideas and the affirmation of first substance do not have the same object.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MME-05","text":"Causality ceases to be one uniform impulse and is delineated as immanent account, proximate mover, and unmoved desirable end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the one, being, oppositions, the one wisdom, change, and unmoved substance are sought.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, cognate measures, references to one thing, common subjects, and analogical series of causes operate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, the inquiry shifts from identities of things to the conditions of comparison, meaning, demonstration, and causal order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, reality is hierarchized from potentiality to actuality, from what is moved to the unmoved, and from eternal time to timeless first life.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the system does what it affirms: it divides polysemy, excludes indeterminate extremes, and gathers the many through reference rather than assimilation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-01","text":"The intrinsic unity of each genus and the separate first principle are joined only if unity as a universal predicate is distinguished from unity as cause.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A9","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-02","text":"First philosophy is universal without a common genus, but the exact nature of the one to which the significations of being are referred remains indeterminately condensed.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-03","text":"The preservation of the contingent through the accidental is in tension with necessary and eternal order, and the distinction of causal domains rather than a common solution contains the tension.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:FL-04","text":"The plurality of unmoved substances and the one first principle coexist in order, but the precise necessity of subordination rests on astronomical hypotheses and a teleological image.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT5","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-01","text":"The one changes meaning when it becomes, from a first cognate measure, the referential center of being said in many ways.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-02","text":"Opposition changes function when it becomes, from complete difference and the object of science, a condition of actual change.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-03","text":"Separate and unmoved substance passes from a hypothesis of the order of sciences to a conclusion from the eternity of motion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:A12","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MP-04","text":"Moving changes from productive activity into teleological attraction, but the precise mode by which the intelligible produces circular motion remains dense.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:ME6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a field of circles around successive centers: multitudes around measures, meanings around one reference, changes around actualities, and the whole around unmoved good.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_3:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-02","text":"The human subject becomes measured and bound by meaning, while the highest thinking has no other measure but thinks itself.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-03","text":"Time is pictured as eternal circular motion without a first temporal principle, whose duration depends upon unmoved and timeless actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_4:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:HSI-04","text":"The possible voyage is not an escape from plurality, but an ascent through measures, accounts, analogies, and causes toward the principle that orders plurality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B01","text":"The universal axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from the one as measure, through being as said in reference to one thing, to first pure actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_04:GA-05","CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest in its rejection of generic unity, its examination of non-contradiction, and its reduction of eternal motion to actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B03","text":"The precise center of reference to one thing, the mode of analogy among genera, and the exact teleological causality of circular motion remain indeterminate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_2:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_3:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B04","text":"The system is coherent if it distinguishes the separate universal from separate actuality and analogical community from a common genus, but becomes unstable where these distinctions fall silent.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_3:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_4:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true spiral movement, but the astronomical multitudes, the univocal correspondence of motion and mover, and the military image resist complete axiomatic completion.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT6","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT8","CH_DAZY_BO_4:MRT10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_DAZY_04@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_DAZY_04:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 10–12"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Chapters 10–12","context":"Book 10 · Book 11 · Book 12","original_title":"Chapters 10–12","original_context":"Book 10 · Book 11 · Book 12"},"original_title":"Chapters 10–12","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 13–14","order":5,"parents":["CH_DAZY_BO_5","CH_DAZY_BO_6"],"revision":"CL_DAZY_05@R001","sha256":"a7970a199c25637d1454502be5135466397ddf872d113d78b8d49114b023edc2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B01","text":"Τὸ κύριον ἀπόρημα ἐστὶν εἰ ἀκίνητός τις καὶ ἀΐδιος οὐσία δύναται εὑρεθῆναι ἐν μαθηματικοῖς, εἴδεσιν, ἀριθμοῖς, ἐναντίοις ἢ στοιχείοις, ἢ εἰ πάντα ταῦτα ψευδεῖς ὑποψήφιοι τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας εἰσίν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B02","text":"Ἡ κυρία θέσις ἀποχωρίζει τὴν νοητότητα καὶ ἀλήθειαν ἀπὸ τῆς χωριστῆς οὐσίας, τὸ δὲ ἕν, τὸν ἀριθμὸν καὶ τὰ ἐναντία εἰς μέτρα, ποσὰ, πάθη καὶ σχέσεις μετατάττει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B03","text":"Θεμέλιον τῆς συνθέσεως ἐστὶ τὸ πολλαχῶς λέγεσθαι τὸ ὄν, ὥστε λόγος, οὐσία, δύναμις, ἐνέργεια, κατηγορία καὶ αἰτία μὴ εἰς μίαν ἀδιαίρετον τάξιν συμπίπτειν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς τοὺς δυνατοὺς τρόπους διαιρεῖ, τὰ ἐξ ἑκάστου ἀναγκαῖα ἀκολουθήματα δοκιμάζει, καὶ διὰ κατηγορικῆς, τροπικῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἀσυμφωνίας τὰς ὑποκειμένας ἀρχὰς ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μικτή ἐστι καὶ ἑλικοειδής· ἀπὸ χωριστῶν ὑποψηφίων εἰς ἀναίρεσιν, ἐκ ταύτης εἰς σημασιολογικὴν καὶ κατηγορικὴν ἀνασύστασιν, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς αὐστηρότερον κριτήριον ἀϊδιότητος καὶ αἰτιότητος ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις ἀποβάλλει τοὺς μαθηματικοὺς καὶ ἀριθμητικοὺς ὑποψηφίους, ἀλλὰ τὴν θετικὴν σύστασιν τῆς ἀκινήτου οὐσίας καὶ τὸ πῶς πολλαὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίαι εἰσὶν ἄλυτα καταλείπει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ μὴ ὂν πολλαχῶς λέγεται, καὶ ἡ τῶν σημαινομένων διάκρισις πρότερά ἐστι πάσης ἀποδόσεως κοινῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ νοητὸς χωρισμὸς οὔτε χωριστὴν οὐσίαν ποιεῖ οὔτε τὴν ἀλήθειαν τῆς θεωρίας ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ καθόλου ἀναγκαῖόν ἐστι πρὸς ἐπιστήμην, οὐ μὴν διὰ τοῦτο τόδε τι καὶ χωριστὴ οὐσία γίγνεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ὅσα καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου, ὡς πάθη, ἐναντία ἢ πρός τι, λέγεται, τῆς οὐσίας ὕστερα ὄντα πρώτη πάντων ἀρχὴ εἶναι οὐ δύναται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ προτεραιότης ἐκ λογικῆς διαφορᾶς μεταβάλλεται εἰς κριτήριον οὐσιώδους αὐταρκείας, ὥστε τὸ τῷ λόγῳ πρότερον μὴ ἀναγκαίως τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερον εἶναι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἐπιστήμη δύναται τὸ αὐτὸ πρᾶγμα κατὰ ἕτερον ᾗ θεωρεῖν, καὶ ἡ ἀφαίρεσις ἀκρίβειαν γεννᾷ ἄνευ διπλασιασμοῦ τῶν οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ αὐτονομία πεδίου οὐ συνεπάγεται ὀντολογικὴν αὐτοτέλειαν τοῦ γνωστοῦ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ αἰτιακὴ ἱκανότης ἐκ τῆς ἀπαιτήσεως κινοῦντος αἰτίου αὔξεται εἰς δοκιμὴν ὕλης, εἴδους, κινήσεως καὶ τέλους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Πᾶσα ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων στοιχείων σύνθεσις ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι ἔχει, διὸ ἀΐδιος οὐσία τοιαύτη σύνθεσις εἶναι οὐ δύναται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια πρῶτον τὸν τρόπον τῆς γνώσεως διακρίνει, ἔπειτα δὲ τὴν γένεσιν καὶ τὴν ἀϊδιότητα ὀντολογικῶς ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Τὸ ἓν μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους ἐστίν, ὁ δὲ ἀριθμὸς μεμετρημένον πλῆθος, οὐ πρώτη χωριστὴ οὐσία.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ζητουμένη πρώτη οὐσία ἕλκει τὸ σύστημα πρὸς ἀΐδιον καὶ αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν, ἥτις οὔτε ὕλην οὔτε δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι οὔτε ἀργὸν χωρισμὸν ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01","text":"Ὁ χωρισμὸς ἐπανέρχεται πρῶτον ὡς ὑπόθεσις μαθηματικῶν καὶ εἰδῶν, εἶτα ὡς κατηγορικῶς ἀδύνατος προτεραιότης, καὶ τέλος ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς τὴν διάκρισιν νοητῆς ἀφαιρέσεως καὶ οὐσιώδους αὐταρκείας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ καθόλου μένει ἀναγκαῖον πρὸς γνῶσιν, μεταβάλλει δὲ ἐνέργειαν· ἐκ χωριστοῦ ἀντικειμένου γίνεται τρόπος δυνάμει γνώσεως, ἡ δὲ ἐνεργὸς γνῶσις πρὸς τὸ ὡρισμένον ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης ἐκ διαφορᾶς λόγου καὶ οὐσίας μετατίθεται εἰς ἔλεγχον τοῦ εἰ προτεινομένη ἀρχὴ καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου λέγεται καὶ ἄρα ὑποκειμένου προτέρου δεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ ἓν ἀναστρέφεται ἐκ χωριστῆς οὐσίας καὶ γεννητικοῦ στοιχείου εἰς μέτρον, ὃ τῷ μετρουμένῳ γένει ἀκολουθεῖ καὶ οὐκ αὐτὸ γεννᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-05","text":"Τὸ μὴ ὂν μεταβαίνει ἐκ χωριστοῦ ἐναντίου πρὸς τὸ ὂν εἰς κατηγορικὴν ἀπόφασιν, ψεῦδος καὶ δύναμιν, δι᾽ ἧς ἡ γένεσις ἄνευ ἀντιθέτου οὐσίας νοεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐπανέρχεται μετὰ αὐξήσεως· ἡ μὲν πρώτη μονὰς δι᾽ αὐτῶν τὴν καθολικότητα τῆς γνώσεως διακρίνει, ἡ δὲ δευτέρα τὴν ἀϊδιότητα καὶ τὴν γένεσιν κρίνει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης ἐκ τοῦ ἐλέγχου τῆς ἀργίας τῶν εἰδῶν αὔξεται εἰς καθόλου κριτήριον, καθ᾽ ὃ πᾶσα ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία χωρὶς ὕλην, εἶδος, κίνησιν ἢ τέλος εἰς σύμπτωμα ὑποχωρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ σωρεύσεις στερεῶν, ἐπιπέδων, γραμμῶν καὶ στιγμῶν καὶ αἱ διαιρέσεις τῆς συμβλητότητος τῶν μονάδων μένουσι τοπικαὶ μηχαναὶ τοῦ κατωτέρου βαθμοῦ· εἰς τὸν νῦν βαθμὸν αὔξεται μόνον ὁ κανὼν ὅτι ἡ συνεπὴς ἀδυναμία τῶν τρόπων τὰς ἀρχὰς ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ γενεαλογία τῶν ἰδεῶν ἐκ τῆς ῥοῆς τῶν αἰσθητῶν μένει τοπική, ὁ δὲ χωρισμὸς τοῦ καθόλου ὡς σύγχυσις ἐπιστημονικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ οὐσιώδους ὑπάρξεως τὰς μονάδας γεφυροῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρία καὶ ἡ λειτουργία τοῦ ἑνὸς ὡς μέτρου αὔξονται εἰς κοινὴν διάταξιν, καθ᾽ ἣν ἡ νόησις προσδιορίζει ἄνευ τοῦ ποιεῖν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κατηγορικὴ καὶ τροπικὴ δοκιμὴ τοῦ δευτέρου κατωτέρου βαθμοῦ γίνεται νῦν καθόλου φίλτρον τῶν προτέρων ἐλέγχων, ἐπειδὴ δηλοῖ διὰ τί τὰ ἀφηρημένα, τὰ ἐναντία καὶ τὰ πρός τι πρώτη οὐσία εἶναι οὐ δύναται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-05","text":"Αἱ πολλαὶ ἀριθμητικαὶ συμπτώσεις καὶ αἱ ἐπιμέρους ἀσυμφωνίαι ὑπερβεβλημέναι γίγνονται, ἐπειδὴ ὁ νῦν βαθμὸς τὴν ἔλλειψιν αἰτιακοῦ τρόπου καὶ τὴν ἀσυμβατότητα συνθέσεως καὶ ἀϊδιότητος ἱκανὰς ἀρχὰς ἀναιρέσεως παρέχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὰ μαθηματικὰ εἶναι ἢ ἐν τοῖς αἰσθητοῖς ἑτέρας οὐσίας ἢ παρ᾽ αὐτὰς χωριστὰς φύσεις.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-02","text":"Τὸ καθόλου, ὁ ὁρισμὸς καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια θεωρήματος οὐκ ἀποδεικνύουσιν ἰδέαν ἢ μαθηματικὴν οὐσίαν χωριστήν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-03","text":"Πάθος, ἐναντίον, ποσὸν καὶ πρός τι ἀποκλείονται ἀπὸ τῆς τάξεως τῶν πρώτων ἀρχῶν, ἐπειδὴ ὑποκειμένου καὶ οὐσίας προϋπαρχούσης δεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-04","text":"Ἀΐδιος οὐσία ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων στοιχείων, ὕλης ἢ γενέσεως συνίστασθαι οὐ δύναται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-05","text":"Ἀριθμὸς καὶ ἀριθμητικὴ ὁμοιότης οὔτε ὕλην οὔτε εἶδος οὔτε κινοῦν οὔτε τέλος παρέχει, διὸ τῆς αἰτιότητος ἐκπίπτει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-06","text":"Τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ ἀγαθὸν οὐ ταὐτίζεται ὡς ἀριθμητικὸν στοιχεῖον, ἐπεὶ ἡ ταύτισις τὸ ἀντικείμενον κακὸν καὶ τὰ σύνθετα μετέχοντα κακοῦ ποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ νοητότης ἀπαιτεῖ δεύτερον κόσμον ὁμοίων καὶ ἀργῶν οὐσιῶν· ἄνευ τούτου τοῦ ψεύδους ἡ ἀφαίρεσις καὶ ἡ μέτρησις ἀδύνατοι ἂν γένοιντο.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ τῷ λόγῳ ἁπλούστερον, καθολικώτερον ἢ πρότερον αὐτομάτως τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρῶτόν ἐστιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ ἀναγκαίως στοιχεῖον εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ τὸ στοιχεῖον ὡς ἐνυπάρχον σύνθεσιν καὶ ὕλην ποιεῖ, ἡ δὲ πρώτη οὐσία τοιαύτην δύναμιν οὐ φέρει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὁμοιότης, ἡ μέθεξις ἢ ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ ἰσότης αἰτίαν παρέχειν, ἐὰν μὴ δηλοῦται τί κινεῖ, τί μορφοῖ, τί ὑπόκειται ἢ τί τέλος ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτόν ἐστιν ἀΐδιον ὂν ἅμα γεννητόν, σύνθετον καὶ δυνάμενον μὴ εἶναι· ἡ ἀϊδιότης ἀποκλείει τὴν ἐν αὐτῇ ὕλην καὶ χρονικὴν διαδικασίαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατον τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν ὡς μονοσήμαντα γένη πάντων τεθῆναι, διότι οὕτως αἱ διαφορὰι οὐσίας, ποιοῦ, ποσοῦ καὶ σχέσεως ἀφανίζονται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτόν ἐστι μαθηματικὸν μεταξὺ πεδίον ἄνευ ἰδίων ἀρχῶν, τρόπου γενέσεως καὶ αἰτιακῆς πρὸς τὰ αἰσθητὰ συνάψεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ βαθύτατη ἀπουσία ἐστὶν ἡ μὴ ἀποδεδομένη θετικὴ γένεσις πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν· ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῶν ψευδῶν ἀρχῶν ὁρίζει τὸ ζητούμενον, οὐδέπω δὲ αὐτὸ συνιστᾷ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-01","text":"Ἡ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ ἀφαίρεσις καὶ ἡ μέτρησις μίαν διανεμημένην ἐνέργειαν συγκροτοῦσιν· ἡ νόησις προσδιορίζει τὸ ἐνυπάρχον, τὸ δὲ μέτρον ὁρίζει τὸ ὁμογενὲς πλῆθος, ἄνευ χωριστῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-02","text":"Ἐπεὶ τὸ τῷ λόγῳ πρότερον οὐκ ἀναγκαίως τῇ οὐσίᾳ πρότερόν ἐστι καὶ τὸ καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου ὂν ὑποκειμένου προτέρου δεῖται, οὔτε καθόλου οὔτε πρός τι πρώτη ἀρχὴ δύναται εἶναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τῶν εἰδῶν κινεῖν καὶ ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ ἀριθμοῦ εἰς ἕνα τῶν τεσσάρων τρόπων αἰτίας ἐμπίπτειν συγκλίνουσιν εἰς τὸ ὅτι ἡ ὁμοιότης αἰτιότητα οὐ παρέχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας μεταλλάσσει τὴν ἐπιστημολογικὴν διαφοράν εἰς ὀντολογικὸν φίλτρον· ὃ δυνάμει μὴ εἶναι δύναται, ἀΐδιον εἶναι οὐ δύναται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-05","text":"Τὸ πολλαχῶς λέγεσθαι τὸ ὂν ἅμα τὴν χωριστὴν καθολικότητα καὶ τὸ χωριστὸν μὴ ὂν ἀχρεῖα ποιεῖ, διότι καὶ ἡ ἐπιστήμη καὶ ἡ γένεσις διὰ τρόπων τοῦ αὐτοῦ ὄντος ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις μαθηματικῶν, εἰδῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν οὐ καταλήγει εἰς ἀπουσίαν πρώτης οὐσίας, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς αὐστηρότερον αἴτημα ἀϊδίου ἐνεργείας ἄνευ ὕλης, γενέσεως καὶ ἀργίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-07","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν δύναται τῷ πρώτῳ προσήκειν μόνον ὡς αὐταρκεῖ καὶ σωζομένῃ ἐνεργείᾳ, οὐχ ὡς ἀριθμητικῇ μονάδι ἢ στοιχείῳ ἀντικειμένου κακοῦ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐ διαιρεῖται εἰς αἰσθητὸν καὶ νοητὸν κόσμον ὁμοίων πραγμάτων, ἀλλὰ διαρθροῦται κατὰ τρόπους τοῦ εἶναι, θεωρίας, δυνάμεως, ἐνεργείας καὶ αἰτιότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:XD-05","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ γνώσις οὐχ ὑποδέχεται ἕτοιμον χωριστὸν καθόλου, ἀλλὰ τὸ αὐτὸ πρᾶγμα κατὰ προσδιορισμένον ᾗ θεωρεῖ, δυνάμει μὲν καθόλου, ἐνεργείᾳ δὲ ὡρισμένως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς γενέσεως ὁρίζεται ὑπὸ τῆς μεταβάσεως ἐκ δυνάμει ὄντος εἰς ἐνέργειαν, ἡ δὲ ἀϊδιότης ἀποκλείει ταύτην τὴν ἀκολουθίαν ἐν τῇ πρώτῃ οὐσίᾳ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ οὐκ ἀναγκαίως στοιχεῖον ἐνυπάρχον ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ δεῖ αὐτὴν προτέραν, ἐνεργὸν καὶ αἰτιακῶς ἱκανὴν εἶναι· οὕτως ἡ στοιχειώδης κοσμογονία εἰς θεωρίαν ἐνεργείας μετατίθεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος τὰς ὀντολογικὰς πλάνες ὡς συγχύσεις λογικῆς προτεραιότητος, κατηγορίας, τρόπου καὶ αἰτίας ἀνασυνίστησι, ὥστε ὁ ἔλεγχος μὴ μόνον ἀπορρίπτειν ἀλλὰ νέαν χώραν τοῦ ζητήματος γεννᾶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:XD-02","CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη καθόλου γνώσεως γεννᾷ χωρισμόν, ὁ χωρισμὸς ἀδυναμίαν αἰτίας, ἡ ἀδυναμία ἀναγκάζει πρὸς τὸ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρεῖν, καὶ τοῦτο πάλιν τὴν καθόλου γνώσιν ἄνευ χωρισμοῦ σῴζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ προτεινομένη πρώτη ἀρχὴ δοκιμάζεται κατὰ τὴν προτεραιότητα, ὡς δὲ πάθος ἢ πρός τι ἀποτυγχάνει, μετατάττεται εἰς ὕστερον διορισμόν, καὶ ἡ ζήτησις πρώτης ἀρχῆς ἐκ νέου ἀνακυκλοῦται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-03","text":"Στοιχεῖον γεννᾷ σύνθεσιν, σύνθεσις ὕλην, ὕλη δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι, καὶ αὕτη ἀναίρεσιν ἀϊδιότητος· ὁ βρόχος οὕτως τὸ στοιχειῶδες πρῶτον πρὸς καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν ὠθεῖ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-04","text":"Τὸ ἓν ὡς οὐσία μεταπίπτει εἰς μέτρον, τὸ μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους δεῖται, τὸ πλῆθος μετρούμενον ἀριθμὸς γίνεται, καὶ ὁ ἀριθμὸς διὰ ταύτης τῆς γενέσεως τὴν πρώτην προτεραιότητα ἀποβάλλει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἕλκουσα ἀρχὴ τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ ἀΐδιος αὐτάρκης ἐνέργεια· πᾶσα ἀναίρεσις χωρισμοῦ, ὕλης, γενέσεως καὶ ἀργίας τὸ ζητούμενον πρὸς ταύτην συσφίγγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ πρῶτον ὑποψήφιον ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν τίθησι καὶ ἐρωτᾷ εἰ ἡ χωριστὴ νοητότης, ἡ καθολικότης ἢ ὁ ἀριθμὸς τὴν ζητουμένην αὐταρκείαν ἔχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B02","text":"Ἔπειτα τοὺς τρόπους ἐνυπάρξεως, χωρισμοῦ, συνθέσεως καὶ γενέσεως διαιρεῖ καὶ τὰ ἐξ ἑκάστου ἀναγκαῖα ἀδύνατα παράγει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B03","text":"Τῶν χωριστῶν ὑποψηφίων ἀναιρεθέντων, ἡ μηχανὴ τὴν ἀλήθειαν αὐτῶν ἀνασυνίστησιν ὡς κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρίαν, μέτρησιν ἢ κατηγορικὸν διορισμόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ ἀνασύστασις πάλιν ὑπὸ προτεραιότητος, τροπικῆς συνοχῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἰσχύος δοκιμάζεται, ἵνα τὸ νοητὸν μὴ σιγῇ εἰς οὐσίαν ἀναχθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ δύναμις τοῦ μὴ εἶναι ὅριον μεταξὺ γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου τίθησι, καὶ διὰ τούτου πᾶσαν ὑλικὴν σύνθεσιν ἀπὸ τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας ἀποκλείει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ μηχανὴ οὐχὶ θετικὸν ὂν πλήρως κατασκευάζει, ἀλλὰ διὰ διαδοχικῶν ἀποφάσεων τὸν ἐλάχιστον τύπον αὐτοῦ παράγει· πρότερον, ἀΐδιον, ἐνεργόν, αὐτάρκες καὶ αἰτιακῶς μὴ ἀργόν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AFM-B01","text":"Ζήτησις ἀκινήτου οὐσίας → χωριστοὶ μαθηματικοὶ καὶ εἰδητικοὶ ὑποψήφιοι → ἀναίρεσις χωρισμοῦ → κατὰ τὸ ᾗ ἀνασύστασις → κατηγορικὴ δοκιμὴ ἀρχῶν → δύναμις καὶ ἐνέργεια → ἀναίρεσις συνθέτου ἀϊδίου → ἕλξις πρὸς αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AFM-B02","text":"Καθόλου γνώσις → ἀδικαιολόγητος ὀντολογικὸς χωρισμός → ἀδυναμία αἰτίας → πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος → ἀφαίρεσις καὶ μέτρησις → διάκρισις γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου → ἀνοικτὴ ζήτησις πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-01","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰσθητοῦ καὶ νοητοῦ κόσμου ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ διακρίσεως πράγματος καὶ τρόπου καθ᾽ ὃ θεωρεῖται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-02","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης παύει μονοσήμαντος οὖσα καὶ διαγράφεται κατὰ λόγον, οὐσίαν, γένεσιν, ὕλην καὶ ἐξάρτησιν ἀπὸ ὑποκείμενον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-03","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης παύει ἀριθμητικὸν μόνον πρόβλημα οὖσα καὶ εἰς πολλαπλότητα κατηγοριῶν καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν μετατίθεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης χωρίζεται ἀπὸ ὁμοιότητα, μέθεξιν καὶ ἀριθμητικὴν σύμπτωσιν, καὶ ἀπαιτεῖ ῥητὸν τρόπον ὕλης, εἴδους, κινήσεως ἢ τέλους.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-05","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν μετατίθεται ἐκ τῆς ἀριθμητικῆς ἀντιθέσεως εἰς τὴν αὐταρκῆ σωτηρίαν καὶ ἐνέργειαν τοῦ πρώτου.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ βαθμοῦ ἐλέγχονται μαθηματικά, ἰδέαι, ἀριθμοί, μονάδες, ἐναντία, τὸ ἕν, ἡ ἀόριστος δυὰς καὶ τὰ ἀριθμητικὰ πάθη ὡς ὑποψήφιοι χωρισταὶ οὐσίαι.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμοῦ ἐνεργοῦσιν ἡ πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος, ἡ κατηγορικὴ τάξις, ἡ προτεραιότης, ἡ δύναμις, ἡ ἐνέργεια καὶ οἱ τέσσαρες τρόποι αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὑπερστρατηγικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ ἔρευνα παύει νέας χωριστὰς φύσεις προστιθεῖσα καὶ τὰς προτεινομένας ἀρχὰς κατὰ σημασίαν, κατηγορίαν, τρόπον καὶ αἰτιακὴν ἰσχὺν δοκιμάζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμοῦ τὸ γενητὸν ἐκ δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν μεταβαίνει, τὸ δὲ ἀΐδιον ἀδύνατον ἔχει τὸ μὴ εἶναι καὶ χρονικὴν γένεσιν οὐ δέχεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ συστήματος τὴν θέσιν αὐτοῦ πράττει· διαιρεῖ σημασίας, ἀφαιρεῖ ψευδεῖς ὑποστάσεις καὶ μόνον μετὰ τὴν ἀναίρεσιν τὸ ἔγκυρον ὑπόλοιπον ἀνασυνίστησιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ ἀνασύστασις τῶν μαθηματικῶν ταλαντεύεται μεταξὺ τοῦ ὑλικῶς ἐν τοῖς πράγμασιν εἶναι καὶ τοῦ διὰ νοητῆς ἀφαιρέσεως θεωρεῖσθαι, ἄνευ πλήρους ἀποδόσεως τῆς μεταξύ των συνάψεως.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-02","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς γνώσεως διακρίνεται μὲν ἀπὸ τὴν καθ᾽ ἕκαστον οὐσίαν διὰ δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ σχέσις τῶν δύο οὐ πλήρως λύεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-03","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυρῶς ὁρίζει τί ἡ πρώτη οὐσία οὐκ ἔστιν, ἀσθενέστερον δὲ ἀποδίδωσι πῶς πολλαὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίαι καὶ πῶς τὸ ἀγαθὸν τῇ πρώτῃ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-01","text":"Τὸ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ ἐστὶ σημεῖον μεταβολῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἐν αὐτῷ ὁ χωρισμὸς παύει ὀντολογικὸς ὢν καὶ γίνεται ἀληθὴς ἐπιστημονικὸς προσδιορισμός.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-02","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης μεταλλάσσει τὴν ἐνέργειαν αὐτῆς ὅταν ἐκ λογικῆς τάξεως εἰς δοκιμὴν οὐσιώδους ἀνεξαρτησίας μεταβῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-03","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μεταλλάσσει χώραν, ἐκ τοῦ τρόπου τῆς γνώσεως εἰς τὴν σύστασιν γενέσεως, φθορᾶς καὶ ἀϊδιότητος μεταβαίνουσα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-04","text":"Τὸ ἓν ἀναστρέφεται ὅταν ἐκ γεννητικῆς οὐσίας μέτρον γένηται, διότι ἔκτοτε τὸ μετρούμενον γένος αὐτοῦ τὴν λειτουργίαν ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ κεκρυμμένη εἰκὼν τῆς πραγματικότητος ἐστὶν οὐχὶ δύο παράλληλοι κόσμοι, ἀλλὰ μία πολυτρόπως λεγομένη χώρα, ἐν ᾗ τὰ αὐτὰ πράγματα κατὰ οὐσίαν, ποσόν, σχέσιν, δύναμιν καὶ θεωρίαν διαφόρως τάττεται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ νοοῦν ὑποκείμενον γίνεται ἀφαιροῦσα καὶ μετροῦσα ἐνέργεια, ἥτις τὸ ἐνυπάρχον προσδιορίζει ἄνευ τοῦ κατασκευάζειν χωριστὸν ἀντίγραφον.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ πλοῦς τοῦ συστήματος κόσκινον ἐοίκεν· οἱ χωριστοὶ ὑποψήφιοι διὰ προτεραιότητος, ἀϊδιότητος καὶ αἰτιότητος διηθοῦνται, μέχρι μόνον ὁ τύπος αὐτάρκους ἐνεργείας ὑπολειφθῇ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ ἐξῃρημένα ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀποβολῆς χωριστῶν μαθηματικῶν, εἰδῶν, ἀριθμῶν καὶ ἐναντίων ἀρχῶν, ἐπειδὴ συνδέουσι σημασίαν, προτεραιότητα, κατηγορίαν, δύναμιν καὶ αἰτιότητα.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ὅπου ὁ νοητὸς χωρισμὸς ἀπὸ τοῦ οὐσιώδους χωρίζεται καὶ ὅπου ἡ ὕλη διὰ τῆς δυνάμεως ἀσύμβατος πρὸς τὸ ἀΐδιον δείκνυται.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς σύνδεσις τῆς ὑλικῆς ἐνυπάρξεως τῶν μαθηματικῶν πρὸς τὴν ἀφαίρεσιν, ἡ θετικὴ σύστασις πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν καὶ ἡ πλήρης θεωρία τοῦ πρώτου ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν σῴζει, ἐὰν ἡ ἀναίρεσις τῶν προτεινομένων ἀρχῶν μὴ εἰς ἀνυπαρξίαν πάσης ἀκινήτου οὐσίας μεταβληθῇ, ἀλλὰ εἰς ἀνοικτὴν κατηγορικὴν καὶ τροπικὴν ἀναθεμελίωσιν.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175443684598Z_fc9413a4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 13–14","source_sha256":"a7970a199c25637d1454502be5135466397ddf872d113d78b8d49114b023edc2","sha256":"c9a365bd766b51bd12170dae75ddabed8697125d6743709d77ec882c386cd9a8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:54:43.685560+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B01","text":"The principal aporia is whether some unmoved and eternal substance can be found in mathematical objects, forms, numbers, contraries, or elements, or whether all these are false candidates for primary substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B02","text":"The principal thesis separates intelligibility and truth from separate substance, and transfers the one, number, and contraries into measures, quantities, attributes, and relations.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B03","text":"The foundation of the composition is that being is said in many ways, so that account, substance, potentiality, actuality, category, and cause do not converge into one indivisible order.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04","text":"The argument divides the possible modes, tests the necessary consequences from each, and overturns the underlying principles through categorical, modal, and causal incompatibility.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B05","text":"The movement is mixed and spiral: from separate candidates to refutation, from this to semantic and categorical reconstruction, and thence returns to a stricter criterion of eternity and causality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","text":"The conclusion rejects the mathematical and numerical candidates, but leaves unresolved the positive constitution of unmoved substance and how there are many substances in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being and non-being are said in many ways, and the distinction of their significations is prior to every assignment of a common principle.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Intellectual separation neither produces separate substance nor removes the truth of theory.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The universal is necessary for knowledge, but it does not thereby become a this-something and separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Whatever is said of a subject, as attributes, contraries, or relatives, being posterior to substance cannot be the first principle of all things.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Priority shifts from a logical difference into a criterion of substantial self-sufficiency, so that what is prior in account is not necessarily prior in substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Science can consider the same thing in a different respect, and abstraction produces precision without multiplying substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] The scientific autonomy of a field does not entail the ontological self-sufficiency of the known object.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Causal adequacy increases from the requirement of a moving cause into a test of matter, form, motion, and end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Every composition from immanent elements has matter and the potentiality not to be; therefore an eternal substance cannot be such a composition.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Potentiality and actuality first distinguish the mode of knowledge, then determine generation and eternity ontologically.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] The one is the measure of a homogeneous multitude, and number is a measured multitude, not primary separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The sought primary substance draws the system toward eternal and self-sufficient actuality, which has neither matter nor the potentiality not to be nor inert separation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01","text":"Separation recurs first as a hypothesis of mathematical objects and forms, then as categorically impossible priority, and finally is absorbed into the distinction between intellectual abstraction and substantial self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02","text":"The universal remains necessary for knowledge, but changes function: from a separate object it becomes a mode of knowledge in potentiality, while actual knowledge returns to the determinate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03","text":"Priority is displaced from the difference between account and substance into an examination of whether a proposed principle is said of a subject and therefore requires a prior subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04","text":"The one is reversed from separate substance and generative element into a measure, which follows the genus measured and does not itself generate it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-05","text":"Non-being passes from a separate contrary to being into categorical negation, falsity, and potentiality, through which generation is conceived without a contrary substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06","text":"Potentiality and actuality recur with increase: the first unit distinguishes through them the universality of knowledge, while the second judges eternity and generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RMD-07","text":"Causality increases from the examination of the inertness of forms into a universal criterion, according to which every numerical proportion lacking matter, form, motion, or end recedes into accident.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-01","text":"The accumulations of solids, planes, lines, and points, and the divisions of the commensurability of units, remain local devices of the lower level; at the present level only the rule is increased that the consistent impossibility of the modes overturns the principles.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-02","text":"The genealogy of ideas from the flux of sensibles remains local, but the separation of the universal as a confusion of scientific necessity and substantial existence bridges the units.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-03","text":"Theory according to the respect and the function of the one as measure increase into a common arrangement, according to which understanding determines without making a separate substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-04","text":"The categorical and modal test of the second lower level now becomes a universal filter of the previous examinations, because it shows why abstract things, contraries, and relatives cannot be primary substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:CGD-05","text":"The many numerical coincidences and particular incompatibilities become excessive, because the present level provides sufficient grounds for overturning principles in the lack of causal mode and the incompatibility of composition and eternity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-01","text":"The system excludes mathematical objects from being either other substances in sensibles or separate natures beside them.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-02","text":"The universal, definition, and truth of a theorem do not prove a separate idea or mathematical substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-03","text":"Attribute, contrary, quantity, and relative are excluded from the class of first principles, because they require a pre-existing subject and substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-04","text":"An eternal substance cannot be composed from immanent elements, matter, or generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-05","text":"Number and numerical similarity provide neither matter nor form nor mover nor end, and therefore fall outside causality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:GNX-06","text":"The one and the good are not identical as a numerical element, since this identification makes the opposed evil, and the composite things participating in it, evil.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that intelligibility requires a second world of similar and inert substances; without this falsity, abstraction and measurement would be impossible.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that what is simpler, more universal, or prior in account is automatically first in substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-03","text":"It is excluded that the first principle is necessarily an element, because the element, as immanent, produces composition and matter, whereas primary substance does not admit such potentiality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04","text":"It is excluded that similarity, participation, or numerical equality provides a cause, unless it is shown what moves, what gives form, what underlies, or what end it has.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01","text":"It is unacceptable that an eternal being is at once generated, composite, and capable of not being; eternity excludes matter and temporal process within it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02","text":"It is impossible to posit being and the one as univocal genera of all things, because in this way the differences of substance, quality, quantity, and relation disappear.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-03","text":"A mathematical intermediate realm without its own principles, mode of generation, and causal connection to sensibles is unacceptable.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04","text":"The deepest absence is the unprovided positive generation of many substances in actuality; the rejection of false principles determines what is sought, but does not yet constitute it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-01","text":"Abstraction according to the respect and measurement constitute one distributed actuality: understanding determines what is immanent, and measure defines the homogeneous multitude, without separate substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-02","text":"Since what is prior in account is not necessarily prior in substance, and what is of a subject requires a prior subject, neither the universal nor the relative can be a first principle.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-03","text":"The inability of forms to move and the inability of number to fall under one of the four modes of cause converge upon the fact that similarity provides no causality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX9","CH_DAZY_BO_6:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-04","text":"The distinction between potentiality and actuality transforms the epistemological difference into an ontological filter: what can potentially not be cannot be eternal.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A16","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-05","text":"That being is said in many ways simultaneously renders separate universality and separate non-being superfluous, because both knowledge and generation are explained through modes of the same being.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-06","text":"The rejection of mathematical objects, forms, and numbers does not conclude in the absence of primary substance, but in a stricter requirement of eternal actuality without matter, generation, and inertness.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:XD-07","text":"The good can belong to the first only as self-sufficient and preserved actuality, not as a numerical unit or element opposed to evil.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-01","text":"Reality is not divided into a sensible and an intelligible world of similar things, but is articulated according to modes of being, theory, potentiality, actuality, and causality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:XD-05","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-02","text":"Knowledge does not receive a ready-made separate universal, but considers the same thing according to a determinate respect, potentially universal but actually determinate.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-03","CL_DAZY_05:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-03","text":"The time of generation is determined by the transition from what is potentially being to actuality, while eternity excludes this sequence in primary substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-09","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A10","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-04","text":"The first principle is not necessarily an immanent element, but must be prior, active, and causally adequate; thus elemental cosmogony is displaced into a theory of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12","CH_DAZY_BO_5:A17","CH_DAZY_BO_6:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05","text":"The method reconstructs ontological errors as confusions of logical priority, category, mode, and cause, so that examination not only rejects but generates a new region of the question.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-05","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:XD-02","CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-01","text":"The necessity of universal knowledge generates separation, separation generates causal incapacity, the incapacity compels consideration according to the respect, and this in turn preserves universal knowledge without separation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D5","CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-02","text":"The proposed first principle is tested according to priority, but as an attribute or relative it fails, is transferred into a posterior determination, and the search for a first principle is recirculated anew.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-03","text":"An element generates composition, composition matter, matter the potentiality not to be, and this the rejection of eternity; thus the loop drives the elemental first toward pure actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-04","text":"The one as substance passes into measure, measure requires a homogeneous multitude, the multitude when measured becomes number, and number through this generation loses primary priority.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A11","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:RLE-05","text":"The attracting principle of the system is eternal self-sufficient actuality; every rejection of separation, matter, generation, and inertness tightens what is sought toward it.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B01","text":"The mechanism first posits a candidate unmoved substance and asks whether separate intelligibility, universality, or number possesses the sought self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B02","text":"Then it divides the modes of immanence, separation, composition, and generation, and produces the necessary impossibilities from each.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B03","text":"Once the separate candidates have been rejected, the mechanism reconstructs their truth as theory according to the respect, measurement, or categorical determination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B04","text":"The positive reconstruction is again tested by priority, modal coherence, and causal strength, so that the intelligible is not silently elevated into substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B05","text":"The potentiality not to be establishes a boundary between what is generated and what is eternal, and through this excludes every material composition from primary substance.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06","text":"The final mechanism does not fully construct a positive being, but through successive negations produces its minimal type: prior, eternal, active, self-sufficient, and not causally inert.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AFM-B01","text":"Search for unmoved substance → separate mathematical and eidetic candidates → rejection of separation → reconstruction according to the respect → categorical test of principles → potentiality and actuality → rejection of composite eternity → attraction toward self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:AFM-B02","text":"Universal knowledge → unjustified ontological separation → causal incapacity → the multivocity of being → abstraction and measurement → distinction between generated and eternal → open inquiry into many substances in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AF3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-01","text":"The distinction between sensible and intelligible world is replaced by the distinction between a thing and the mode according to which it is considered.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-02","text":"Priority ceases to be univocal and is mapped according to account, substance, generation, matter, and dependence on a subject.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ME2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-03","text":"Multiplicity ceases to be merely a numerical problem and is transferred into a multiplicity of categories and substances in actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:D6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-04","text":"Causality is separated from similarity, participation, and numerical coincidence, and requires an explicit mode of matter, form, motion, or end.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SNX4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MME-05","text":"The good is transferred from numerical opposition into the self-sufficient preservation and actuality of the first.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:SD5","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, mathematical objects, ideas, numbers, units, contraries, the one, the indefinite dyad, and numerical attributes are examined as candidate separate substances.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, the multivocity of being, categorical order, priority, potentiality, actuality, and the four modes of cause operate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyperstrategic level, the inquiry ceases to add new separate natures and tests the proposed principles according to signification, category, mode, and causal strength.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, what is generated passes from potentiality to actuality, whereas the eternal has non-being as impossible and admits no temporal generation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:ALT4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the form of the system performs its position: it divides significations, removes false hypostases, and only after rejection reconstructs the valid remainder.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-01","text":"The positive reconstruction of mathematical objects oscillates between their being materially in things and their being considered through intellectual abstraction, without fully rendering the connection between them.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D1","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-02","text":"The universality of knowledge is distinguished from particular substance through potentiality and actuality, but the ontological relation of the two is not fully resolved.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:D10","CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:FL-03","text":"The arrangement strongly determines what primary substance is not, but more weakly explains how there are many substances in actuality and how the good belongs to the first actuality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-01","text":"The according-to-the-respect is a point of change, because in it separation ceases to be ontological and becomes a true scientific determination.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:AS4","CH_DAZY_BO_5:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-02","text":"Priority changes its function when it passes from logical order into a test of substantial independence.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A3","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-03","text":"Potentiality and actuality change place, passing from the mode of knowledge into the constitution of generation, destruction, and eternity.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:SD6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MP-04","text":"The one is reversed when it becomes a measure from generative substance, because thereafter the measured genus determines its function.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:NX12","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-01","text":"The hidden image of reality is not two parallel worlds, but one region said in many ways, in which the same things are ordered differently according to substance, quantity, relation, potentiality, and theory.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02","text":"The thinking subject becomes an abstracting and measuring actuality, which determines what is immanent without constructing a separate copy.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:A6","CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:HSI-03","text":"The course of the system resembles a sieve: separate candidates are filtered through priority, eternity, and causality, until only the type of self-sufficient actuality remains.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_6:FGS8","CH_DAZY_BO_6:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the rejection of separate mathematical objects, forms, numbers, and contrary principles, because they connect signification, priority, category, potentiality, and causality.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT1","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest where intellectual separation is distinguished from substantial separation and where matter is shown, through potentiality, to be incompatible with the eternal.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT2","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B03","text":"The exact connection between the material immanence of mathematical objects and abstraction, the positive constitution of many substances in actuality, and the complete theory of the first good remain indeterminate.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT4","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true movement if the rejection of the proposed principles is not transformed into the nonexistence of every unmoved substance, but into an open categorical and modal refoundation.","refs":["CH_DAZY_BO_5:MRT7","CH_DAZY_BO_6:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_DAZY_05@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_DAZY_05:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 13–14"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Chapters 13–14","context":"Book 13 · Book 14","original_title":"Chapters 13–14","original_context":"Book 13 · Book 14"},"original_title":"Chapters 13–14","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01","layer":"MC","title":"Dazy L1 01","order":1,"parents":["CL_DAZY_01","CL_DAZY_02","CL_DAZY_03"],"revision":"MC_DAZY_L1_01@R001","sha256":"fbff0cb30fbaefd1a3f3121862f6250154894ecd9b34025df9fd1278b7995305","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-01","text":"Τὸ ἀπόρημα τοῦ νῦν συστήματος ἐστὶ πῶς ἡ τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων σοφία, ἡ μία τοῦ ὄντος ᾗ ὂν ἐπιστήμη καὶ ἡ οὐσία ὡς αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι δύνανται μίαν τάξιν συνιστάναι, μὴ γένους ἑνότητα προϋποτιθέμεναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-01","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B01","CL_DAZY_03:AS-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-02","text":"Ἡ καθόλου θέσις ὁρίζει τὸ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον ὂν διὰ τεταγμένης πρὸς οὐσίαν ἀναφορᾶς, τὴν δὲ οὐσίαν διὰ μορφικῆς ἐνεργείας ἣ τὴν ὕλην τόδε τι, ἓν καὶ ὂν ποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:AS-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-03","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῶν αἰτιακῶν ἀναγωγῶν, ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ προτέρα ἐνέργεια συναποτελοῦσι τὸ θεμέλιον καθ᾽ ὃ αἰτία, σημασία καὶ γένεσις ἐπιστηταὶ μένουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις προβαίνει ἀπὸ γνωστικῆς ἀναβάσεως καὶ διαπορήσεως εἰς διαίρεσιν τῶν πολλαχῶς λεγομένων, ἐκεῖθεν δὲ εἰς τὴν οὐσίαν, τὸ μορφικὸν αἴτιον καὶ τὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-03","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B03","CL_DAZY_03:AS-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-05","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς μικτός ἐστιν· συναγωγῇ τὰ μερικὰ προσλαμβάνει, διαπορήσει καὶ ἐλέγχῳ τὰ θεμέλια δοκιμάζει, διαιρέσει τὴν χώραν τάττει, περιαιρέσει τὰ ψευδῆ αἴτια ἀφαιρεῖ, καὶ ἐνεργειακῶς τὴν οὐσίαν ἀνασυνίστησιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-05","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-06","text":"Ἡ φορὰ ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἰτία γίνεται ἀπορία περὶ τῆς πρώτης ἀρχῆς, ἡ πολλαχὴ λέξις ἐπιστρέφει ὡς τεταγμένον πεδίον, καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια πάλιν ὁρίζει τὸ κυρίως ὄν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-07","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις συνάγει οὐσίαν, εἶδος, ἑνότητα, γένεσιν καὶ ἀλήθειαν εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν, οὐ μέντοι τὴν θετικὴν φύσιν τῆς χωριστῆς καὶ ἀϊδίου οὐσίας πλήρως διορίζει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:AS-08","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-08","text":"Τὸ σύστημα τελευτᾷ εἰς ἀκριβῆ διάταξιν ὅρων, ἀποκλεισμῶν καὶ ἀναγκαίων μεταβάσεων, ἱκανὴν μὲν τὴν χώραν τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας ἀνασυστῆσαι, ἀνεπαρκῆ δὲ πρὸς τετελεσμένην θεωρίαν τῶν πρώτων χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-08","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B08","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἐπιστήμη κυρίως ἐστὶ γνῶσις τοῦ διότι, ὥστε ὡρισμένην αἰτίαν, καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ἀντικείμενον καὶ τάξιν προτεραιότητος ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν πολλαχῶς λέγεται, οἱ δὲ τρόποι αὐτοῦ οὔτε ἰσότιμοι οὔτε ἀσύνδετοι εἰσίν, ἀλλὰ περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν κατὰ ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν τάσσονται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_03:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ οὐσία μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κέντρον σημασιῶν καὶ ὑποκείμενον εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον, ἐνέργειαν τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τοῦ ἑνός, καὶ τέλος εἰς ὅρον τῆς χωριστῆς πρωτείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἰτιότης πολλαπλῆ μὲν κατὰ ὕλην, εἶδος, κινοῦν καὶ τέλος μένει, πεπερασμένη δὲ κατὰ τὴν ἀναγωγήν, ἵνα ἐξήγησις καὶ γένεσις δυναταὶ ὦσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις εἰσὶν οἱ κοινοὶ ὅροι σημασίας, διαφορᾶς, κατηγορίας καὶ ἐπιστημονικῆς κρίσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἑνότης τῆς πρώτης ἐπιστήμης οὐ λαμβάνεται ἐκ γένους, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς, προτεραιότητος οὐσίας καὶ ταὐτότητος τοῦ αἰτίου τοῦ εἶναι πρὸς τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ ἑνός.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια οὐ πρόσθετος σύνδεσμός ἐστιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ αἰτία δι᾽ ἧς ἡ ὕλη μία οὐσία καὶ τόδε τι γίνεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἐνέργεια μέτρον καὶ τέλος τῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν, λόγῳ δὲ καὶ οὐσίᾳ προτέρα, ἐπειδὴ τὴν δύναμιν ὁρίζει καὶ τελειοῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Οὐδεμία δύναμις ἑαυτὴν ποιεῖ ἐνέργειαν, ἀλλὰ πᾶσα γένεσις προϋπάρχον εἶδος ἢ ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὂν αἴτιον ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","CL_DAZY_03:XD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀλήθεια μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ὀντολογικὴν προτεραιότητα καὶ ἀντιστοιχίαν λόγου πρὸς ὂν εἰς πάθος διανοίας, τέλος δὲ ὑποτάσσεται πάλιν τῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τοῦ πράγματος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀπορία ἀπὸ ὑπόλοιπον ἀνεπαρκοῦς αἰτιολογίας γίνεται μέθοδος διαιρέσεως, ἐλέγχου καὶ περιαιρέσεως, δι᾽ ἧς ἡ θετικὴ διάταξις παράγεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος τῆς καθολικότητος καὶ τῆς ἀϊδίου ἐνεργείας γίνεται, ἡ θετικὴ δὲ φύσις καὶ ἡ αἰτιώδης μεσίτευσις αὐτῆς ἀδιορίστως μένουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","CL_DAZY_02:FL-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ αἰτία μένει ὁ ὅρος τῆς ἐπιστήμης, μεταβάλλεται δὲ ἀπὸ πρώτην ἀρχὴν εἰς τέσσαρα γένη, ἀπὸ τούτων εἰς προτεραιότητα οὐσίας, καὶ τέλος εἰς μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ καθόλου ἐπανέρχεται πρῶτον ὡς τέλος γνωστικῆς ἀναβάσεως, ἔπειτα ὡς ἀναφορικὴ ἑνότης τοῦ ὄντος, τέλος δὲ ὡς καθόλου κριτήριον ἐνεργείας ἄνευ τοῦ γένος γενέσθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ οὐσία σῴζει τὴν ἕλκουσαν ἐνέργειαν, μετατίθεται δὲ ἀπὸ σημασιολογικὸν κέντρον εἰς τὸ τί αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς ἐνεργειακὴν προτεραιότητα.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ περατότης ἀπὸ ὅρον τῆς αἰτιακῆς ἀναγωγῆς μεταβαίνει εἰς ὡρισμένον λόγον καὶ τέλος εἰς οἰκείαν ἐνέργειαν, ἣ τὸ ἀόριστον τῆς δυνάμεως περιορίζει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία αὔξεται εἰς διαίρεσιν τῶν σημασιῶν, ἡ διαίρεσις εἰς περιαιρετικὴν δοκιμὴν τῶν αἰτίων, καὶ ἡ περίαιρεσις εἰς θετικὴν ἀνασύστασιν τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_02:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης ἀπὸ ἀνεπαρκὲς τεκμήριον προτεραιότητος μεταβάλλεται εἰς ὑπόθεσιν ἀκινήτου οὐσίας, τέλος δὲ εἰς ἄλυτον πέρας τῆς ἐνεργειακῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_02:RMD-08","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-07","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς ἀναστρέφεται· ἐκ θεμελίου τοῦ λόγου χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ κυρίως ὂν ὡς πάθος διανοίας, εἶτα ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς τὴν ἐνεργειακὴν ἀκολουθίαν τοῦ πράγματος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἱστορικὴ συναγωγὴ δοξῶν περαίνει τὸ ἔργον αὐτῆς ὅταν ἡ διαφωνία μεταβῇ εἰς ὀντολογικὴν γραμματικήν καὶ ἡ γραμματικὴ εἰς δυναμικὴν διάταξιν δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-01","text":"Αἴσθησις, μνήμη, ἐμπειρία καὶ αἱ ἐπιμέρους δόξαι μένουσι μηχαναὶ τοῦ κατωτέρου στρώματος· εἰς τὸν νῦν βαθμὸν αὔξεται μόνον ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ ὅτι πρὸς αἰτίαν καὶ πρώτην ἀρχήν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_01:CGD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ κατὰ μέρος διαιρέσεις ὀνομάτων μένουσι κατώτεραι, ἡ δὲ ἐπανερχομένη τομὴ κατηγορίας, αἰτίας, οὐσίας καὶ προτεραιότητος γίνεται ὀντολογικὴ γραμματικὴ τοῦ νῦν βαθμοῦ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-03","text":"Αἱ διαιρέσεις τῶν δυνάμεων καὶ αἱ ὑλικαὶ διαφοραὶ μένουσι τοπικαί, ἡ δὲ ὑποταγὴ πάσης δυνάμεως εἰς οἰκείαν ἐνέργειαν καὶ τὸν αὐτὸν λόγον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς γίνεται καθόλου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-04","text":"Τὴν μεταξὺ μονάδων γέφυραν ποιοῦσιν ἡ περατότης τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων, ἡ πρὸς οὐσίαν ἀναφορὰ καὶ ἡ μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια, διότι διαδοχικῶς ὁρίζουσι τὸ πρῶτον, τὸ κέντρον καὶ τὴν ἐνεργὸν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:XD-01","CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντίτασις καθόλου γνώσεως καὶ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον οὐσίας ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὴν μεγάλην μετάβασιν· ἡ οὐσία γίνεται πρῶτον ἀναφορικὸν κέντρον καὶ τέλος ἐνεργειακὸν αἴτιον τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:XD-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-06","text":"Μῦθος, ψιλὴ ὀνομασία, τυχαῖον συμβεβηκός, ἀόριστος ὕλη καὶ γυμνὴ δύναμις ὑπερβαίνονται ὡς αὐτοτελεῖς ἐξηγήσεις, διασῴζονται δὲ ὡς ὅρια τοῦ ὡρισμένου αἰτίου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:CGD-05","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-01","text":"Οὔτε αἴσθησις οὔτε ἐμπειρία οὔτε πρακτικὴ εὐστοχία ἱκανὴ σοφία ἐστίν, ἐὰν τὸ διότι καὶ ἡ καθόλου αἰτία ἀπουσιάζῃ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-02","text":"Ἄπειρος ἀναχώρησις αἰτίων, ἀποδείξεων, ὁρισμῶν ἢ τελῶν ἀποκλείεται, ἐπειδὴ ἀναιρεῖ τὸ πρῶτον, τὸ διότι καὶ τὴν δυνατότητα ἐπιστήμης.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-03","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὔτε γένη οὔτε πλῆθος ἀσυνδέτων ὁμωνύμων δύνανται εἶναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-08","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-04","text":"Ἀόριστος σημασία καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ συναλήθεια ἀντιφάσεων ἀποκλείονται, ἐπειδὴ καταλύουσι λόγον, διαφορὰν καὶ κρίσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-05","text":"Τὸ συμβεβηκὸς καὶ τὰ πάθη οὐ δύνανται πρῶται οὐσίαι, καθόλου αἴτια ἢ αὐτοτελῆ γένη ἐπιστητοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-06","text":"Οὔτε χωριστότης οὔτε καθόλου κατηγόρημα οὔτε ὕλη μόνη ἀντικαθίστησι τὸ αἴτιον δι᾽ οὗ τόδε τι ἓν καὶ ὂν ἐστίν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-09","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-07","text":"Γυμνὴ δύναμις οὔτε ἑαυτὴν ἐνεργοποιεῖ οὔτε τὴν ἀλήθειαν ποιεῖ· ἡ ἐνέργεια τοῦ πράγματος προηγεῖται καὶ ὁρίζει ἀμφότερα.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GNX-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ καθόλου ἐπιστήμη λαμβάνει τὴν ἑνότητα ἐκ τοῦ ὄντος ὡς γένους ἢ ἐκ ψιλῆς γενικεύσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-02","CL_DAZY_02:DBN-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ αἰτιακὴ τάξις δύναται ἄνευ πρώτου καὶ ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος αἰτίου συνίστασθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-03","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ἢ ἁπλῶς ταὐτὰ ἢ ἀμεσίτευτα ἕτερα ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ κοινὸς λόγος καὶ τὸ ἄτομον εἶδος ἀμφότερα ἀναγκαῖα μένουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-03","CL_DAZY_03:FL-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι χωριστὴ οὐσία ἢ νοητὸν εἶδος ἐξηγεῖ μόνον διὰ τοῦ χωρίζεσθαι· ἄνευ αἰτιώδους μεσιτεύσεως ἡ χωριστότης κενὴ μένει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-05","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ διάνοια τὴν ἀλήθειαν εἰς τὰ πράγματα ἐμβάλλει, ἐπειδὴ ἡ νόησις τῷ ἐνεργείᾳ ὑπάρχοντι ἕπεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:DBN-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-01","text":"Ἀδύνατος ὁ κόσμος ἐν ᾧ πᾶν αἴτιον μέσον ἑτέρου ἐστίν, πᾶσα τάξις ἄνευ πρώτου θεμελίου μένει καὶ ἡ ἔσχατος ἀόριστος ὕλη τὴν ἐνέργειαν γεννᾷ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_02:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἡ παντελὴς ἀοριστία, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε ὡρισμένην σημασίαν οὔτε οἰκείαν δύναμιν οὔτε τέλος ἐνεργείας καταλείπει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἡ ἑνότης ὡς ἔξωθεν σύνδεσις μερῶν ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντων, ἐπειδὴ ἀναγκάζει ἕτερον ἑνοποιοῦν αἴτιον καὶ ἄπειρον ἀναδρομήν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ βαθυτάτη ἀπουσία ἐστὶν ἡ θετικὴ φύσις τοῦ δεσμοῦ ὃς τὴν πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα, τὴν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν καὶ τὴν ἀΐδιον ἐνέργειαν ἓν θεμέλιον ποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-01","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία οὐκ ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ὑπεργένους, ἀλλὰ θεωρία τῆς πεπερασμένης καὶ ἀσύμμετρου τάξεως καθ᾽ ἣν τὰ ὄντα πρὸς οὐσίαν καὶ ἡ οὐσία πρὸς ἐνέργειαν ἀναφέρεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-02","text":"Ἡ γνωστικὴ ἄνοδος περαίνεται μόνον ὅταν ἡ συναγωγὴ τῶν καθόλου μεταβῇ εἰς διαίρεσιν τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος καὶ ἡ διαίρεσις εἰς ἐνεργειακὴν ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-03","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ διπλῆν ἀνάγκην ἔχει· ἀναπόδεικτος μὲν κατὰ τὴν λογικὴν θεμελίωσιν, ἐνεργείᾳ δὲ προτέρα κατὰ τὴν αἰτιακὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-04","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ ἀσύμμετρος διάταξις τὴν σημασιολογικὴν πολλαπλότητα καὶ τὴν ὑλικὴν πολλότητα μεσιτεύει· αἱ σημασίαι πρὸς οὐσίαν καὶ ἡ ὕλη πρὸς μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν τάσσονται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-05","text":"Ἡ προαπορία καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις συνεργοῦσιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μὲν τὰ ἀντίρροπα ἐπακόλουθα ἐνεργοποιεῖ, ἡ δὲ τὴν ὡρισμένην διαφορὰν ἣν ἡ λύσις δεῖ σῴζειν διαφυλάττει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:RLE-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-06","text":"Ὁ κοινὸς ἀποκλεισμὸς ἀπείρου ἀναγωγῆς, συμβεβηκότος καὶ αὐτοκινούσης γυμνῆς δυνάμεως γεννᾷ θετικὴν ἱεραρχίαν πρώτου αἰτίου, οὐσίας καὶ προτέρας ἐνεργείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:DBN-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ εἶναι διττῶς· ὁ λόγος κρίνεται πρὸς τὸ πρᾶγμα, ἡ δὲ νοητικὴ ἐνέργεια ἕπεται τῇ πραγματικῇ ἐνεργείᾳ, καίτοι ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐ ταὐτίζεται πρὸς τὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_02:XD-05","CL_DAZY_03:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-08","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας διχῇ θεμελιοῦται, διὰ τῆς πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητος τοῦ πεδίου καὶ διὰ τῆς προτεραιότητος χωριστῆς ἐνεργείας, ὁ δὲ δεσμὸς τῶν θεμελίων οὐ πλήρως παράγεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-12","CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-09","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς γνώσεως καὶ ὁ χρόνος τῆς γενέσεως ἀναστρέφονται ἀλλήλοις· ἡ γνώσις διὰ τῶν ὑστέρων ἐπανέρχεται εἰς τὰ φύσει πρότερα, ἡ δὲ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον γένεσις ἀπὸ προτέρας κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνεργείας ἄρχεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-03","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης γίνεται πεπερασμένον ἀλλ᾽ ἀσύμμετρον πλέγμα τρόπων καὶ αἰτιῶν, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστον ἐξηρτημένον ὂν πρὸς οὐσίαν καὶ ἕκαστη δύναμις πρὸς οἰκείαν ἐνέργειαν τάττεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-07","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται ἑλικοειδὴς τάξις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἱστορικὴ καὶ γνωστικὴ διαδοχὴ πρὸς τὰ φύσει πρότερα ἐπανέρχεται, ἡ δὲ γένεσις ὑπὸ κατ᾽ εἶδος προτέρας ἐνεργείας ἄρχεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ συλλέκτην αἰσθήσεων καὶ δοξῶν εἰς κριτὴν σημασιῶν καὶ τέλος εἰς νοητικὴν ἐνέργειαν δεδεμένην ὑπὸ τοῦ τρόπου τοῦ γνωστοῦ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-04","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ δύναμις τοῦ πράττειν οὐκ αὐτάρκης ἀρχὴ τοῦ ὑποκειμένου ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ ὡρισμένη δυνατότης ὑπὸ μορφῆς, τέλους, ὀρέξεως καὶ προτέρας ἐνεργείας τασσομένη.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος πράττει τὴν ὀντολογίαν αὐτῆς, διότι συναθροίζει τὰ μερικά, περαίνει τὰς ἀναγωγάς, διαιρεῖ τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα καὶ ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὰς λανθανούσας αἰτιακὰς σχέσεις.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-08","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἐπιστήμη γίνεται αὐτοελεγκτική, ἐπειδὴ τὰ κριτήρια δι᾽ ὧν τάττει τὸ ὂν μεταβάλλει εἰς ἀντικείμενα διαπορήσεως, ἕως ἂν ἡ σημασιολογικὴ ἑνότης αἰτιακὴν δύναμιν λάβῃ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-01","text":"Ὁ γνωστικὸς βρόχος ἄγει ἀπὸ αἰσθήσεως εἰς αἰτίαν, ἀπὸ αἰτίας εἰς ἀπορίαν, ἀπὸ ἀπορίας εἰς διαίρεσιν τοῦ ὄντος, καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς τὴν ἐνέργειαν ἣ πάλιν τὸ κυρίως ὂν ὁρίζει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ αὔξησις τῆς αἰτιότητος προβαίνει ἀπὸ παραλείψεως αἰτίας εἰς τέσσαρα γένη, ἐκεῖθεν εἰς περατότητα καὶ ἑνότητα, καὶ τέλος εἰς μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν ὡς κοινὸν πέρας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-03","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τοῦ σημαίνειν γεννᾷ ὡρισμένον λόγον, ὁ λόγος οὐσίαν, ἡ οὐσία ἀποκλεισμὸν ἀντιφάσεως, ὁ δὲ ἀποκλεισμὸς διασῴζει τὴν διαίρεσιν τῶν σημασιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἕλκουσα ἀρχὴ μένει, περὶ ἣν πρῶτον αἱ σημασίαι καὶ αἱ ἐπιστῆμαι, εἶτα ἡ ὕλη καὶ τὸ εἶδος, τέλος δὲ ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια διανέμονται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια γίνεται τελικὴ ἕλκουσα ἀρχή· ὁρίζει τὴν δύναμιν, προηγείται τῆς γενέσεως, συνιστᾷ τὴν ἑνότητα, ἀποκλείει τὴν φθορὰν τοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ θεμελιοῖ τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:RLE-06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τῆς χωριστότητος ἀπὸ κριτικὴν τῶν χωριστῶν εἰδῶν εἰς ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν καὶ ἀΐδιον ἐνέργειαν ἑλίσσεται, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς ἀδιορίστως κείμενον ὅριον καὶ οὐκ εἰς πλήρη λύσιν τελευτᾷ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ παραλαμβάνει αἰσθήσεις, μερικὰς δόξας, πολλὰς σημασίας τοῦ ὄντος καὶ δοκοῦντας τρόπους οὐσίας ὡς διανεμημένην ὕλην.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_03:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ διανεμημένη ὕλη κατατάσσεται κατὰ αἴτια καὶ δοκιμάζεται διὰ προαπορίας, ἵνα παραλείψεις, ἀντιρροπίαι καὶ ὅροι πληρότητος φανῶσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","text":"Τὸ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενον συνάγεται διὰ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν, ἄνευ μεταβολῆς τῆς τεταγμένης πολλαπλότητος εἰς μονοσήμαντον γένος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ συναχθεῖσα χώρα τέμνεται κατὰ κατηγορίαν, αἰτίαν, προτεραιότητα καὶ τρόπον ὑπάρξεως, καὶ δι᾽ ἀποκλεισμῶν καταλείπει τὴν οὐσίαν ὡς κυριώτατον ὄν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἀναλύεται εἰς ὕλην καὶ μορφήν, ἡ δὲ διάκρισις αὕτη μεταγράφεται εἰς δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν, ὥστε ἡ μορφὴ αἴτιον τοῦ εἶναι καὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς γίγνεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ προτέρα ἐνέργεια ἀναστρέφει τὴν φαινομένην χρονικὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς δυνάμεως, ἀναβαίνει εἰς τὸ ἀΐδιον καὶ ἐπαναφέρει τὴν ἀλήθειαν ὡς ἀκολουθίαν τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B01","text":"Φυσικὴ ὄρεξις τοῦ εἰδέναι → συναγωγὴ μερικῶν → γνώσις αἰτίων → περάτωσις ἀναγωγῶν → προαπορία περὶ πρώτης ἐπιστήμης → πολλαχὴ λέξις τοῦ ὄντος → πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά → πρωτεία οὐσίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B01","CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B05","CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B02","text":"Πρωτεία οὐσίας → περίαιρεσις ὕλης καὶ καθόλου → εἶδος ὡς αἴτιον → μορφὴ ὡς ἐνέργεια → δύναμις ὑπὸ ἐνεργείας ὁριζομένη → προτέρα ἐνέργεια → ἀΐδιον ἐνεργείᾳ ὄν → ἀλήθεια ἑπομένη τῷ ὄντι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ψευδὴς ἀντίθεσις ἑνὸς γένους καὶ ἀτάκτου ὁμωνυμίας καταλύεται, καὶ ἀντ᾽ αὐτῆς τίθεται τεταγμένη πολλαπλότης πρὸς μίαν οὐσίαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λέξεως καὶ πράγματος μετατάσσεται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν σημασιῶν γίνεται διαγραφὴ τρόπων τοῦ ὄντος καὶ βαθμῶν οὐσιώδους ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-03","text":"Ἡ οὐσία παύει ψιλὸν ὑποκείμενον ἢ κατηγορικὸν κέντρον εἶναι καὶ γίνεται μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια αἰτιωμένη τὸ εἶναι, τὸ ἓν καὶ τὸ τέλος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:AS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MME-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀπαρίθμησιν τεσσάρων γενῶν εἰς ἱεραρχημένην τάξιν, ἐν ᾗ τὸ εἶδος καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια τὴν ὕλην καὶ τὴν γένεσιν ὁρίζουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-07","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-05","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης παύει χρονικὴ διαδοχὴ μόνον εἶναι καὶ γίνεται γνωστική, οὐσιώδης καὶ αἰτιακή, ὥστε ἡ χρονικῶς προτέρα δύναμις ὑπὸ κατ᾽ εἶδος προτέρας ἐνεργείας περιέχεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-06","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μετατίθεται ἀπὸ αὐτόνομον χώραν κρίσεως εἰς ἐνεργειακὴν ἀκολουθίαν, ἄνευ τοῦ ἀφανίζεσθαι ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ οὐσίας πράγματος καὶ συνθέσεως διανοίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B01","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ἐπιφανειακὸν βαθμὸν ζητοῦνται ἡ σοφία τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων, ἡ μία ἐπιστήμη τοῦ ὄντος, ἡ οὐσία, ἡ γένεσις, ἡ δύναμις, ἡ ἐνέργεια καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B02","text":"Κατὰ τὸν τῆς διατάξεως βαθμὸν ἐνεργοῦσιν περατότης, πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά, ἐπανερχόμεναι τομαί, προτεραιότης οὐσίας καὶ ὑποταγὴ δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B03","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ὑπερστρατηγικὸν βαθμὸν ἡ ἔρις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ αἵρεσιν δόγματος εἰς ἔλεγχον ὅρων, σημασιῶν, δικαιοδοσιῶν καὶ τῆς οἰκείας ἐνεργείας ἑκάστης δυνάμεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B04","text":"Κατὰ τὸν περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμὸν ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται πολυτρόπως τεταγμένη, ἡ οὐσία ἐνεργειακῶς ἱεραρχημένη, καὶ ἡ γένεσις χρονικῶς ὑστέρα προτέρας κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B05","text":"Κατὰ τὸν μεθοδικὸν καὶ πρακτικὸν βαθμὸν τὸ σύστημα πράττει τὴν θέσιν αὐτοῦ διὰ συναγωγῆς, περατώσεως, διαιρέσεως, περιαιρέσεως καὶ ἐνεργοποιήσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-01","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης θεμελιοῦται ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς μὲν ἐπὶ τῇ πρὸς ἓν σημασιολογικῇ ἀναφορᾷ, ἀφ᾽ ἑτέρου δὲ ἐπὶ τῇ προτεραιότητι χωριστῆς οὐσίας, ἄνευ πλήρους παραγωγῆς τῆς σχέσεως αὐτῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-02","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τίθεται ἐνυπάρχον αἴτιον τῶν φθαρτῶν, ἡ δὲ τελικὴ αὔξησις ἀπαιτεῖ χωριστὴν καὶ ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν, ἧς ὁ πρὸς τὰ φθαρτὰ τρόπος παρουσίας ἀδιόριστος μένει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-01","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-03","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς ἀποδίδεται τῇ συνθέσει τῆς διανοίας, ἀφ᾽ ἑτέρου δὲ τῷ τρόπῳ τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος ἕπεται, ὥστε ἡ χώρα αὐτοῦ μεταξὺ κρίσεως καὶ οὐσίας ἀσταθὴς μένει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-04","text":"Τὸ εἶδος ἄτομον αἴτιον τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον τίθεται, ὁ δὲ ὁριστικὸς λόγος κοινὸς μένει, καὶ ἡ μεσίτευσις αὐτῶν οὐ πλήρως διορίζεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-05","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια καθόλου κριτήριον καὶ προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως γίνεται, ἡ δὲ ἑνότης αὐτῆς ἀναλογικὴ μόνον μένει καὶ μονοσήμαντον γένος οὐ παρέχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-03","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-01","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστίν, ὅταν ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ ὄντος μεταβῇ εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰν καὶ ὀντολογικὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_02:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-02","text":"Ὁ δεύτερος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστίν, ὅταν ἡ οὐσία ἐκ ὑποκειμένου καὶ σημασιολογικοῦ κέντρου μεταγραφῇ εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον καὶ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-02","CL_DAZY_03:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-03","text":"Ὁ τρίτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστίν, ὅταν ἡ ἑνότης παύσῃ χωριστὸν πρόβλημα συνδέσεως εἶναι καὶ γένηται ἡ ἐνέργεια δι᾽ ἧς τὸ δυνάμει πλῆθος ἕν ἐστιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:MME-04","CL_DAZY_03:MP-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-04","text":"Ὁ τέταρτος τόπος μεταβολῆς ἐστίν, ὅταν ἡ χρονικὴ προτεραιότης τῆς δυνάμεως ἀναστραφῇ εἰς αἰτιακὴν καὶ οὐσιώδη προτεραιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκονίζεται ὡς πεπερασμένον καὶ ἀσύμμετρον πεδίον αἰτιακῶν τροχιῶν, αἳ περὶ οὐσίαν τάσσονται καὶ διὰ διαβαθμισμένης ἐνεργοποιήσεως πρὸς οἰκεῖα τέλη φέρονται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται ὁδοιπόρος, χαρτογράφος καὶ ἐνεργὸς νοῦς, ὃς τὰς αἰτιακὰς ὁδοὺς λύει καὶ ἀναδεῖ, δεσμευόμενος ὑπὸ τῶν σημασιῶν καὶ τῶν ἐνεργειῶν ἃς ἐξετάζει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ὡς διπλῆ ἕλιξ· ἡ γνώσις διὰ τῶν ὑστέρων ἐπὶ τὰ φύσει πρότερα ἐπανέρχεται, ἡ δὲ γένεσις ἐκ δυνάμεως ὑπὸ προτέρας κατ᾽ εἶδος ἐνεργείας ἄρχεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς οὐκ εὐθεῖα σύλληψις πρώτης ἀρχῆς ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ ἀνάβασις, λύσις ἀποριῶν, διαίρεσις σημασιῶν, περίαιρεσις ψευδῶν αἰτίων καὶ ἐπάνοδος διὰ τῆς ἐνεργείας εἰς τὸ κυρίως ὄν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-04","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ νῦν ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ γνωστικὴν ἀνάβασιν καὶ περατότητα αἰτίων εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα, οὐσίαν, μορφικὸν αἴτιον καὶ προτεραιότητα ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B02","text":"Ἰσχυροτάτη ἡ διάταξις ἐστίν, ὅπου αἰτία, οὐσία, εἶναι, ἕν, μορφὴ καὶ ἐνέργεια ἀλλήλων ὅροι γίνονται καὶ ἡ ἀποφατικὴ περίαιρεσις θετικὴν ἀνασύστασιν ποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένουσιν ὁ δεσμὸς τῆς πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητος πρὸς τὴν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν, ὁ τρόπος παρουσίας τοῦ ἀγενήτου εἴδους ἐν τοῖς φθαρτοῖς καὶ ἡ σχέσις κοινοῦ λόγου πρὸς ἄτομον εἶδος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ ἑλικοειδῆ κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε τὰς προτέρας αἰτιολογίας ἀκυροῖ οὔτε τὴν πολλαπλότητα ἐξομαλίζει οὔτε τὴν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν προώρως πληροῖ, ἀλλὰ δείκνυσι πῶς ἕκαστον κριτήριον μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀρχὴν τοῦ ἑπομένου βαθμοῦ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B06","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175526511646Z_93c346f3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Dazy L1 01","source_sha256":"fbff0cb30fbaefd1a3f3121862f6250154894ecd9b34025df9fd1278b7995305","sha256":"fc6b36b886d4d1308277eee469cbdd25ab6beb8e6ff199e0f0fb4883b720336c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:55:26.512803+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-01","text":"The aporia of the present system is how the wisdom of first causes, the one science of being qua being, and substance as cause of being can constitute one order without presupposing the unity of a genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-01","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B01","CL_DAZY_03:AS-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-02","text":"The universal thesis defines being said in many ways through an ordered reference to substance, and substance through formal actuality, which makes matter a this-something, one, and being.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:AS-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-03","text":"The finitude of causal regressions, the determinate account, and prior actuality together constitute the foundation according to which causes, meaning, and generation remain scientifically knowable.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-04","text":"The demonstration proceeds from cognitive ascent and aporia to division of things said in many ways, and thence to substance, the formal cause, and the priority of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-03","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B03","CL_DAZY_03:AS-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-05","text":"The reasoning is mixed: by induction it takes up particulars; by aporia and refutation it tests foundations; by division it orders the field; by subtraction it removes false causes; and actualistically it reconstructs substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-05","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-06","text":"The course is spiral, because cause becomes an aporia concerning the first principle, equivocal expression returns as an ordered field, and actuality again defines being in the primary sense.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-07","text":"The completion gathers substance, form, unity, generation, and truth into actuality, yet does not fully determine the positive nature of separate and eternal substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:AS-08","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-08","text":"The system concludes in an exact ordering of terms, exclusions, and necessary transitions, sufficient to reconstruct the field of first philosophy, but insufficient for a completed theory of the first separate substances.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BAS-08","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B08","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Science in the primary sense is knowledge of the why, and therefore requires a determinate cause, an object in itself, and an order of priority.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Being is said in many ways, but its modes are neither equipollent nor unconnected; rather, they are ordered around substance according to asymmetrical dependence.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-01","CL_DAZY_03:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Substance shifts from a center of meanings and a subject to formal cause, actuality of being and of unity, and finally to the condition of separate primacy.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-02","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Causality remains multiple according to matter, form, mover, and end, but finite with respect to regression, so that explanation and generation may be possible.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] The determinate account and non-contradiction are the common conditions of meaning, difference, predication, and scientific judgment.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The unity of first science is obtained not from a genus, but from focal reference, the priority of substance, and the identity of the cause of being with the cause of unity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-03","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Formal actuality is not an additional connection, but the cause through which matter becomes one substance and a this-something.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-06","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Actuality is the measure and end of potentiality, and is prior in account and substance, because it defines and completes potentiality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-08","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] No potentiality makes itself actuality; rather, every generation requires a pre-existing form or a cause already actual.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GA-10","CL_DAZY_03:XD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Truth shifts from ontological priority and the correspondence of account to being into an affection of thought, and finally is again subordinated to the actuality of the thing.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Aporia becomes, from a residue of insufficient explanation, a method of division, refutation, and subtraction, through which positive ordering is produced.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Separate and unmoved substance becomes a necessary condition of universality and eternal actuality, but its positive nature and causal mediation remain indeterminate.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-13","CL_DAZY_02:FL-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-01","text":"Cause remains the condition of science, but changes from first principle into four kinds, from these into the priority of substance, and finally into formal actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-03","CL_DAZY_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-02","text":"The universal recurs first as the end of cognitive ascent, then as the referential unity of being, and finally as a universal criterion of actuality without becoming a genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_02:AS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-03","text":"Substance preserves its attractive efficacy, but is displaced from a semantic center to the what that is cause of being, and thence to actual priority.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-04","text":"Finitude passes from a condition of causal regression to a determinate account and finally to proper actuality, which delimits the indeterminacy of potentiality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GA-05","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_03:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-05","text":"Aporia grows into division of meanings, division into subtractive testing of causes, and subtraction into positive reconstruction of substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_02:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-06","text":"Separateness changes from insufficient evidence of priority into the hypothesis of unmoved substance, and finally into an unresolved limit of the order of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_02:RMD-08","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-07","text":"The true is reversed: from a foundation of account it is separated from being in the primary sense as an affection of thought, then absorbed into the actual sequence of the thing.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-08","text":"The historical induction of opinions completes its work when disagreement passes into ontological grammar and grammar into a dynamic ordering of potentiality and actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-01","text":"Sensation, memory, experience, and particular opinions remain mechanisms of the lower layer; at the present level only the transition from the that to cause and first principle is amplified.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_01:CGD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-02","text":"Particular divisions of names remain lower-level, but the recurrent cutting of category, cause, substance, and priority becomes the ontological grammar of the present level.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-03","text":"Divisions of potentialities and material differences remain local, but the subordination of every potentiality to its proper actuality and the same account of being and unity becomes universal.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-04","text":"The bridge between units is made by the finitude of first causes, reference to substance, and formal actuality, because they successively define the first, the center, and the active cause.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:XD-01","CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-05","text":"The tension between universal knowledge and individual substance activates the great transition: substance becomes first a referential center and finally the actual cause of the individual.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:XD-05","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-06","text":"Myth, mere naming, chance accident, indeterminate matter, and bare potentiality are surpassed as self-sufficient explanations, but preserved as limits of determinate cause.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:CGD-05","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-01","text":"Neither sensation nor experience nor practical aptitude is sufficient wisdom if the why and universal cause are absent.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-02","text":"Infinite regress of causes, demonstrations, definitions, or ends is excluded, because it abolishes the first, the why, and the possibility of science.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-03","text":"Being and unity can be neither genera nor a multitude of unconnected homonyms.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-08","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-04","text":"Indeterminate meaning and the actual co-truth of contradictions are excluded, because they dissolve account, difference, and judgment.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-05","text":"Accident and affections cannot be first substances, universal causes, or self-sufficient kinds of what is scientifically knowable.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-06","text":"Neither separateness nor universal predicate nor matter alone replaces the cause through which a this-something is one and being.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:GNX-09","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-07","text":"Bare potentiality neither actualizes itself nor makes truth; the actuality of the thing precedes and determines both.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:GNX-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that universal science takes its unity from being as a genus or from mere generalization.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-02","CL_DAZY_02:DBN-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the causal order can be constituted without a first and already actual cause.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_03:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that the universal and the individual are either simply identical or unmediatedly other, because the common account and individual form both remain necessary.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-03","CL_DAZY_03:FL-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that separate substance or intelligible form explains merely by being separate; without causal mediation separateness remains empty.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:DBN-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that thought imposes truth upon things, because intellection follows what exists actually.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:DBN-05","CL_DAZY_03:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-01","text":"Impossible is the world in which every cause is a means of another, every order remains without a first foundation, and ultimate indeterminate matter generates actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_02:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-02","text":"Complete indeterminacy is unacceptable, because it leaves neither determinate meaning nor proper potentiality nor an end of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:BSA-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-03","text":"Unity as an external connection of parts already actual is unacceptable, because it necessitates another unifying cause and an infinite regress.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_03:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","text":"The deepest absence is the positive nature of the bond that makes focal unity, separate substance, and eternal actuality one foundation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-01","text":"First philosophy is not a science of a highest genus, but a theory of the finite and asymmetrical order according to which beings are referred to substance and substance to actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_02:GA-11","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-02","text":"Cognitive ascent is completed only when induction of universals passes into division of modes of being and division into actual reconstruction of the individual.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_02:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-03","text":"The first principle has a double necessity: indemonstrable with respect to logical grounding, but prior in actuality with respect to causal generation.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GA-12","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_03:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-04","text":"The same asymmetrical arrangement mediates semantic multiplicity and material plurality: meanings are ordered toward substance and matter toward formal actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","CL_DAZY_02:XD-02","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-05","text":"Preliminary aporia and non-contradiction cooperate, because the former activates contrary consequences, while the latter preserves the determinate difference that the solution must save.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:RLE-07","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-06","text":"The common exclusion of infinite regress, accident, and self-moving bare potentiality generates a positive hierarchy of first cause, substance, and prior actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_02:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_03:DBN-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07","text":"Truth depends on being in two ways: account is judged against the thing, while intellectual actuality follows actual reality, although truth is not identical with substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_02:XD-05","CL_DAZY_03:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-08","text":"The universality of first philosophy is grounded in two ways: through the focal unity of the field and through the priority of separate actuality, but the bond between these foundations is not fully produced.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-12","CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","CL_DAZY_03:BSA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-09","text":"The time of knowledge and the time of generation are reversed relative to one another: knowledge returns through later things to what is prior by nature, while individual generation begins from actuality prior in form.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-03","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-01","text":"Reality becomes a finite but asymmetrical web of modes and causes, in which each dependent being is ordered toward substance and each potentiality toward its proper actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-07","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-02","text":"Time becomes a spiral order, because historical and cognitive succession returns to what is prior by nature, while generation begins under actuality prior in form.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-03","text":"The knowing subject changes from a collector of sensations and opinions into a judge of meanings, and finally into intellectual actuality bound by the mode of the knowable.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-10","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-04","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-04","text":"The potentiality for acting is not a self-sufficient principle of the subject, but a determinate possibility ordered by form, end, desire, and prior actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-09","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-05","text":"Method performs its ontology, because it gathers particulars, brings regressions to completion, divides things said in many ways, and actualizes latent causal relations.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-08","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-06","text":"First science becomes self-reflexively critical, because it turns into objects of aporia the criteria by which it orders being, until semantic unity acquires causal power.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","CL_DAZY_01:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-01","text":"The cognitive loop leads from sensation to cause, from cause to aporia, from aporia to division of being, and from this to actuality, which again defines being in the primary sense.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_03:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-02","text":"The increase of causality proceeds from omission of cause to four kinds, thence to finitude and unity, and finally to formal actuality as the common terminus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-03","text":"The loop of signifying generates a determinate account, account generates substance, substance generates exclusion of contradiction, and exclusion preserves the division of meanings.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RLE-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-04","text":"Substance remains an attractive principle, around which first meanings and sciences, then matter and form, and finally potentiality and actuality are distributed.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","text":"Actuality becomes the final attractive principle: it defines potentiality, precedes generation, constitutes unity, excludes the destruction of the eternal, and grounds truth.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:RLE-06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-06","text":"The loop of separateness winds from critique of separate forms to unmoved substance and eternal actuality, but ends in an indeterminately posited limit rather than a complete solution.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_02:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_03:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B01","text":"The mechanism receives sensations, particular opinions, many meanings of being, and seeming modes of substance as distributed material.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_03:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B02","text":"The distributed material is classified according to causes and tested through preliminary aporia, so that omissions, counterweights, and conditions of completeness may appear.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_01:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","text":"What is said in many ways is gathered through focal reference around substance, without changing ordered multiplicity into a univocal genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B04","text":"The gathered field is cut according to category, cause, priority, and mode of existence, and through exclusions leaves substance as being in the most primary sense.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","text":"Substance is analyzed into matter and form, and this distinction is transcribed into potentiality and actuality, so that form becomes cause of being and unity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B06","text":"Prior actuality reverses the apparent temporal priority of potentiality, ascends to the eternal, and restores truth as a consequence of what is actual.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B01","text":"Natural desire to know → induction of particulars → knowledge of causes → completion of regressions → preliminary aporia concerning first science → equivocal expression of being → focal reference → primacy of substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B01","CL_DAZY_01:AFM-B05","CL_DAZY_02:AFM-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B02","text":"Primacy of substance → subtraction of matter and universal → form as cause → form as actuality → potentiality determined by actuality → prior actuality → eternal actual being → truth following being.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_03:AFM-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-01","text":"The false opposition between one genus and disorderly homonymy is dissolved, and in its place an ordered multiplicity toward one substance is posited.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-01","CL_DAZY_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-02","text":"The distinction between word and thing is displaced, because division of meanings becomes a delineation of modes of being and degrees of substantial dependence.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-02","CL_DAZY_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-03","text":"Substance ceases to be a mere subject or categorial center and becomes formal actuality causing being, unity, and end.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:AS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MME-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-04","text":"Causality is displaced from an enumeration of four kinds into a hierarchized order in which form and actuality define matter and generation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-07","CL_DAZY_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-05","text":"Priority ceases to be merely temporal succession and becomes cognitive, substantial, and causal, so that temporally prior potentiality is encompassed by actuality prior in form.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-06","CL_DAZY_03:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-06","text":"Truth is displaced from an autonomous field of judgment into actual sequence, without the distinction between the substance of the thing and the composition of thought disappearing.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MME-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the wisdom of first causes, the one science of being, substance, generation, potentiality, actuality, and truth are sought.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, finitude, focal reference, recurring cuts, priority of substance, and subordination of potentiality to actuality are operative.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, the contest shifts from the choice of doctrine to examination of terms, meanings, jurisdictions, and the proper actuality of each potentiality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, reality is conceived as ordered in many ways, substance as hierarchized actualistically, and generation as temporally posterior to actuality prior in form.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological and practical level, the system performs its thesis through induction, completion, division, subtraction, and actualization.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_02:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-01","text":"Universality is grounded, on the one hand, in focal semantic reference, and, on the other, in the priority of separate substance, without a full derivation of their relation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-01","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-02","text":"Form is posited as an immanent cause of perishable things, but the final ascent requires separate and eternal substance, whose mode of presence among perishable things remains indeterminate.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-01","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-03","text":"The true is attributed, on the one hand, to the composition of thought, but, on the other, follows the mode of what is actual, so that its place between judgment and substance remains unstable.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-03","CL_DAZY_03:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-04","text":"Form is posited as the individual cause of the particular, but the defining account remains common, and their mediation is not fully determined.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-05","text":"Actuality becomes a universal criterion and prior to potentiality, but its unity remains merely analogical and does not provide a univocal genus.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FL-03","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-01","text":"The first point of transformation occurs when the aporia concerning the unity of being passes into focal reference and ontological division.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_02:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-02","text":"The second point of transformation occurs when substance is transcribed from subject and semantic center into formal cause and actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:FL-02","CL_DAZY_03:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-03","text":"The third point of transformation occurs when unity ceases to be a separate problem of connection and becomes the actuality through which a multitude in potentiality is one.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:MME-04","CL_DAZY_03:MP-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-04","text":"The fourth point of transformation occurs when the temporal priority of potentiality is reversed into the causal and substantial priority of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_03:FGS-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-01","text":"Reality is imaged as a finite and asymmetrical field of causal trajectories, ordered around substance and borne through graduated actualization toward their proper ends.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a traveler, cartographer, and active intellect, who untangles and rebinds causal paths, while being bound by the meanings and actualities that it examines.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-03","text":"Time is imaged as a double spiral: knowledge returns through later things to what is prior by nature, while generation begins from potentiality under actuality prior in form.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_03:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-04","text":"The possible voyage is not a direct grasp of a first principle, but ascent, resolution of aporiai, division of meanings, subtraction of false causes, and return through actuality to being in the primary sense.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:HSI-04","CL_DAZY_02:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from cognitive ascent and the finitude of causes to focal unity, substance, formal cause, and the priority of actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest where cause, substance, being, unity, form, and actuality become conditions of one another, and apophatic subtraction produces positive reconstruction.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B03","text":"There remain indeterminate the bond of focal unity to separate substance, the mode of presence of ungenerated form in perishable things, and the relation of common account to individual form.","refs":["CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B03","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true spiral movement, because it neither invalidates prior explanations nor levels multiplicity nor prematurely fills out separate substance, but shows how each criterion changes into a principle of the succeeding level.","refs":["CL_DAZY_01:MRT-B06","CL_DAZY_02:MRT-B05","CL_DAZY_03:MRT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"MC_DAZY_L1_01@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:MC_DAZY_L1_01:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Dazy L1 01"}],"identity":{"layer":"MC","kicker":"Meta-cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Dazy L1 01","context":"Chapters 01–09 · Book 1 · Book 2 · Book 3 · Book 4 · Book 5 · Book 6 · Book 7 · Book 8 · Book 9","original_title":"Dazy L1 01","original_context":"Chapters 01–09 · Book 1 · Book 2 · Book 3 · Book 4 · Book 5 · Book 6 · Book 7 · Book 8 · Book 9"},"original_title":"Dazy L1 01","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02","layer":"MC","title":"Dazy L1 02","order":2,"parents":["CL_DAZY_04","CL_DAZY_05"],"revision":"MC_DAZY_L1_02@R001","sha256":"f400f1bc2c338a7d11bbfcf3b17b6297ee7372e59691e6f1e38131ea5e9c78d2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-01","text":"Τὸ νῦν σύστημα ζητεῖ πῶς μία ἐπιστήμη καὶ μία πρώτη τάξις δύνανται τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα συνάγειν, ἅμα δὲ ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν εὑρίσκειν ἄνευ κοινοῦ γένους, χωριστοῦ καθόλου ἢ μαθηματικῆς ὑποστάσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-01","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-02","text":"Ἡ κυρία θέσις τὴν ἑνότητα ἐκ πράγματος κοινοῦ εἰς λειτουργίαν μέτρου, ἀναφορᾶς καὶ αἰτιακῆς τάξεως μετατίθησι, τὴν δὲ νοητότητα καὶ καθολικότητα ἀπὸ χωριστῆς οὐσίας ἀπολύει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-02","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03","text":"Θεμέλιον ἐστὶν ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος· τὸ μὲν πᾶσαν ἐπιστήμην ἀπὸ ἀοριστίας φυλάττει, ἡ δὲ τὰς κατηγορίας καὶ τοὺς τρόπους προτεραιότητος ἀσυγχύτους διατηρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-03","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-04","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς διττὴν ἀλλὰ συνημμένην μηχανὴν ποιεῖ· ἡ μὲν διὰ μέτρου, οὐσίας καὶ ἐνεργείας πρὸς πρῶτον ὅρον ἀνάγει, ἡ δὲ διὰ κατηγορικῆς, τροπικῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς δοκιμῆς τοὺς ψευδεῖς πρώτους ὅρους διηθεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μικτὴ καὶ ἑλικοειδής ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἑκάστη ἀναίρεσις εἰς θετικὴν ἀνασύστασιν ἐπανέρχεται, ἑκάστη δὲ κατάφασις ὑπὸ αὐστηροτέρου κριτηρίου πάλιν δοκιμάζεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-05","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης οὔτε ἁπλῶς ἀποβάλλεται οὔτε ἁπλῶς βεβαιοῦται, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ νοητῆς ἀφαιρέσεως καὶ ἀργοῦ καθολικότητος εἰς οὐσιώδη αὐτάρκειαν καὶ αἰτιακὴν ἐνέργειαν μεταβάλλεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-07","text":"Ἡ σύγκλισις γίνεται πρὸς καθαρὰν καὶ αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀΐδιος κίνησις θετικῶς τοιαύτην ἀρχὴν ἀπαιτεῖ, τὸ δὲ ἀποφατικὸν κόσκινον ὕλην, δύναμιν, σύνθεσιν καὶ ἀργίαν ἀπ᾽ αὐτῆς ἀφαιρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις ἐνισχύει μὲν τὸν τύπον τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας, οὐ περαίνει δὲ τὴν θετικὴν γένεσιν τῶν πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν οὐδὲ τὸν ἀκριβῆ τρόπον καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ πρώτη ἐνέργεια τὸ πλῆθος τάττει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὐ μονοσήμαντα γένη ἀλλὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενοι ὅροι εἰσίν, ὧν ἡ διάκρισις πάσης κοινῆς ἐπιστήμης καὶ πρώτης ἀρχῆς προηγεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἑνότης ἐν τοῖς ὑποκειμένοις οὐκ ἐπιπρόσθετος οὐσία ἀλλὰ ὁρισμὸς καὶ μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους ἐστίν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:GA-11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ καθολικότης ἀναγκαία μέν ἐστι πρὸς ἐπιστήμην, οὐ μὴν χωριστὸν κοινὸν πρᾶγμα ποιεῖ, ἐπεὶ ἡ ἑνότης τῆς γνώσεως δι᾽ ἀναφορᾶς καὶ τρόπου θεωρίας συνίσταται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ αὐτονομία ἐπιστημονικοῦ πεδίου οὐ συνεπάγεται οὐσιώδη αὐτοτέλειαν τοῦ γνωστοῦ, ἀλλὰ δηλοῖ ἴδιον τρόπον θεωρίας ἐντὸς μιᾶς πολυτρόπου πραγματικότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-07","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ οὐσία προτέρα ἐστὶ παθῶν, ποσοτήτων, σχέσεων καὶ κινήσεων, ἐπειδὴ ὅσα καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου λέγεται προϋπάρχοντος ὑποκειμένου δεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Διαφορὰ, ἐναντίωσις καὶ μεταβολὴ κοινὸν λόγον ἢ ὑπομένον ὑποκείμενον ἀπαιτοῦσιν, ὥστε μήτε ἀπόλυτον μὴ ὂν μήτε χωριστὸν ἐναντίον πρώτην οὐσίαν εἶναι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια ἐκ διορισμοῦ κινήσεως καὶ γνώσεως εἰς καθόλου κριτήριον γενέσεως, φθορᾶς καὶ ἀϊδιότητος αὔξονται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ πρώτη ἀΐδιος οὐσία καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια εἶναι δεῖ, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα σύνθεσις ἐξ ἐνυπαρχόντων στοιχείων ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι φέρει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Χωριστὴ φύσις δεκτὴ γίνεται μόνον ἐὰν οὐσιώδη αὐτάρκειαν καὶ ῥητὸν αἰτιακὸν τρόπον ἔχῃ, οὐχὶ ἐὰν μόνον νοητὴ ἢ ὁμοία ᾖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ χωριστότης μεταβάλλεται ἐκ ἀθέμιτου ὑποστάσεως καθόλου εἰς κριτήριον ἀνεξαρτησίας, ἐνεργείας καὶ αἰτιακῆς προτεραιότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ ἓν καὶ ὁ ἀριθμὸς ἀποβάλλουσι τὴν ἀξίωσιν χωριστῆς γεννητικῆς οὐσίας καὶ διασῴζονται ὡς μέτρον καὶ μεμετρημένον πλῆθος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ ἕλκει τὸ ὅλον ὡς αὐτάρκης ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀγαθὸν, οὐχ ὡς ἀριθμητικὴ μονὰς ἢ κοινὸν στοιχεῖον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CL_DAZY_05:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ θετικὴ ἀνάβασις καὶ ἡ διαδοχικὴ ἀπόφασις ἀμοιβαίως γεννῶσι τὸν ἐλάχιστον τύπον τοῦ πρώτου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μὲν ἀναγκαιότητα ἀποδίδωσιν, ἡ δὲ τὰ ἀσύμβατα ἀφαιρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ σύνθεσις περαίνει μὲν τὴν ἀπόρριψιν τῶν ψευδῶν πρώτων οὐσιῶν, ἀνοικτὴν δὲ καταλείπει τὴν θετικὴν σύστασιν τῆς πολλότητος τῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01","text":"Τὸ ἓν διαμένει ὡς ἀρχὴ ὁρισμοῦ, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ χωριστῆς οὐσίας εἰς ἐνδογενὲς μέτρον καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς αἰτιακὴν τάξιν μετατίθεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ μέτρον ἐπανέρχεται ὡς κοινὴ λειτουργία νοήσεως καὶ ὄντος· ἡ νόησις προσδιορίζει κατὰ τὸ ᾗ, τὸ δὲ ὂν ὁμογενῆ καὶ ὡρισμένην χώραν παρέχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης ἀναστρέφεται δύο φορές· πρῶτον ἀποβάλλεται ὡς ὑπόστασις καθόλου, εἶτα ἀνασυνίσταται ὡς αὐτάρκης καὶ ἐνεργὸς οὐσία.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ καθόλου μένει ἀναγκαῖον πρὸς γνώσιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἐνέργεια αὐτοῦ ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς ἀναφορικὴν ἑνότητα ἐπιστήμης καὶ εἰς προσδιορισμένην θεωρίαν τοῦ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης μεταβαίνει ἐκ τάξεως λόγου εἰς ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν, καθ᾽ ἣν τὸ καθ᾽ ὑποκειμένου, τὸ δυνάμει καὶ τὸ αἰτιακῶς ἀργὸν ὕστερα γίνεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μετατοπίζονται ἀπὸ τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν γνώσιν εἰς τὸ σύνορον γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου, ὅπου ἡ δύναμις τοῦ μὴ εἶναι γίνεται ἀποκλειστικὸν κριτήριον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστῶν ἀφαιρέσεων οὐκ ἀφανίζεται τὸ ἔργον περάνασα, ἀλλὰ μεταμορφοῦται εἰς θετικὸν αἴτημα ἐνεργοῦ, ἀϊδίου καὶ αἰτιακῶς ἱκανοῦ πρώτου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ κρίσεις περὶ ἀριθμῶν, χρωμάτων, γραμμῶν, ἐπιπέδων καὶ στερεῶν μένουσι τοπικαὶ δοκιμαί, ἐξ ὧν αὔξεται μόνον ὁ κανὼν τῆς κατὰ τρόπους ἀναιρέσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ ἀριθμητικαὶ καὶ οὐράνιαι ἀντιστοιχίαι οὐκ αὔξονται εἰς καθόλου ἀρχάς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἔλλειψις αἰτιακοῦ τρόπου ἱκανῶς αὐτὰς ὑπερβαίνει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-03","text":"Αἱ διαιρέσεις κινήσεως καὶ γενέσεως γεφυροῦσι τὰς μονάδας, ἡ δὲ κατηγορικὴ καὶ τροπικὴ δοκιμὴ αὐτὰς ἀπορροφᾷ εἰς καθόλου φίλτρον προτεραιότητος καὶ ἀϊδιότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-04","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-04","text":"Εἰς τὸ νῦν μέγεθος αὔξονται ἡ ἀναφορικὴ ἑνότης, ἡ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρία, ἡ ἀναλογικὴ αἰτιότης καὶ ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-05","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ ἰδέα καὶ ἡ γενεαλογία αὐτῆς ὑπερβαίνονται ὡς τοπικαὶ ὑποθέσεις, διαμένει δὲ ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἐπιστημονικοῦ προσδιορισμοῦ καὶ οὐσιώδους χωρισμοῦ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-06","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-06","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος τῶν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν οὐ μένει ψιλὴ κατωτέρα ὑπόθεσις, ἀλλὰ γίνεται νῦν ἄλυτον ὑπόλοιπον τῆς θετικῆς συστάσεως τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-04","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ ὂν ἢ τὸ ἓν κοινὸν γένος πάντων εἶναι, ἐπειδὴ τοῦτο τὰς διαφορὰς κατηγοριῶν καὶ τρόπων ἀφανίζει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-01","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείονται χωριστὸν ἓν, ἰδέαι καὶ μαθηματικὰ ὡς παράλληλοι οὐσίαι, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε τὸν τρόπον γενέσεως οὔτε αἰτιακὴν ἰσχὺν παρέχουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ νόησις ὡς αὐθαίρετος ποιητὴς οὐσιῶν, καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ καθόλου ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ τῆς χωριστῆς ὑποστάσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείονται ἡ συναλήθευσις ἀντιφάσεων καὶ ἡ προτεραιότης πάθους, ἐναντίου, ποσοῦ ἢ σχέσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πρώτη ἀφανίζει σημασίαν, τὰ δὲ λοιπὰ προϋποκειμένης οὐσίας δεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείονται τύχη, συμβεβηκός, ὕλη καὶ ἐνυπάρχουσα σύνθεσις ὡς πηγαὶ ἀϊδίου τάξεως, ἐπειδὴ δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι φέρουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-05","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείονται ἡ εἰς ἄπειρον ἀναγωγὴ καὶ ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ ὁμοιότης ὡς περάτωσις αἰτιότητος, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε πρῶτον ὅρον οὔτε ῥητὸν αἰτιακὸν τρόπον παρέχουσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-06","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-07","text":"Ἀποκλείονται ἡ δύναμις μόνη, ἡ ἀργὴ χωριστὴ οὐσία καὶ ἡ ὁμοιότης ἄνευ κινήσεως, εἴδους, ὕλης ἢ τέλους ὡς ἱκαναὶ πρῶται ἀρχαί.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-07","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πᾶσα ἑνότης γένος καὶ πᾶσα νοητότης δεύτερον κόσμον χωριστῶν οὐσιῶν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-01","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ ἀοριστία λόγον δέχεται ἢ ὅτι τὸ λογικῶς ἁπλούστερον καὶ καθολικώτερον αὐτομάτως οὐσιωδῶς πρότερόν ἐστιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-02","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-03","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι γένεσις ἐξ ἀπολύτου μηδενὸς ἢ μεταβολὴ διὰ χωριστοῦ μὴ ὄντος ἐξηγεῖται, ἐπειδὴ τὸ δυνάμει ὂν τὴν ἀναγκαίαν μεσιτείαν παρέχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-03","CL_DAZY_05:XD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-04","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι τὸ πρῶτον ὕλην ἢ στοιχειώδη σύνθεσιν ἔχει, ἐπειδὴ οὕτως δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι καὶ ἐξάρτησιν ἐξ ἄλλων λαμβάνει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-04","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-05","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ ἀναίρεσις χωριστῶν καθόλου ἀναιρεῖ πᾶσαν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐνεργὸς καὶ τελικὴ χωριστότης ἕτερον λόγον ἔχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἐστὶ πραγματικότης ἐπίπεδος ἢ ὑπὸ μονοσήμαντον γένος συγκλειομένη, ἐπειδὴ ἀφανίζει τὰς ἀσυμμέτρους ἐξαρτήσεις οὐσίας, πάθους, δυνάμεως καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος τίθεται χρονικὴ γένεσις τῆς πρώτης ἀϊδίου οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ τὸ γενητὸν σύνθεσιν καὶ δύναμιν τοῦ μὴ εἶναι ἐμπεριέχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἐστὶν ἡ μεταξύ χώρα ἣ χωριστὴν καθολικότητα ἢ μαθηματικὴν φύσιν τίθησιν ἄνευ ἰδίων ἀρχῶν, γενέσεως καὶ αἰτιακῆς συνάψεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ βαθυτάτη ἀπουσία περὶ ἣν τὸ σύστημα τάττεται ἐστὶν ὁ μὴ ἀποδεδομένος τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν μία πρώτη ἐνέργεια πρὸς πολλὰς ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσίας καὶ κινήσεις συνάπτεται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_04:FL-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-01","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ διάκρισις ἣ μίαν ἐπιστήμην ἄνευ κοινοῦ γένους δυνατὴν ποιεῖ καὶ καθόλου γνώσιν ἄνευ χωριστοῦ καθόλου σῴζει, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἑνότης καὶ ἐνταῦθα καὶ ἐκεῖ λειτουργικὴ καὶ ἀναφορική ἐστιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:XD-01","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστοῦ ἑνός, εἰδῶν καὶ μαθηματικῶν σταθεροποιεῖ τὴν κατάφασιν πρώτης οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ μεταβάλλει τὸ κριτήριον χωριστότητος ἐκ ὁμοιότητος εἰς αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_04:XD-04","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-03","text":"Τὸ ἓν οὐ δύναται μονοσήμως ἀπὸ τοῦ ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους εἰς τὸ ὅλον μεταφέρεσθαι· ἐν μὲν τῷ πρώτῳ μέτρον ἐστίν, ἐν δὲ τῷ ὅλῳ αἰτιακὴ καὶ τελικὴ τάξις.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-04","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μίαν διαβαθμισμένην μηχανὴν συγκροτοῦσιν, ἣ ἀπὸ τῆς γνώσεως διὰ τῆς μεταβολῆς εἰς τὸν ἀποκλεισμὸν ὕλης ἐκ τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας αὔξεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-05","text":"Ἡ αἰτιακὴ ἱκανότης γίνεται κοινὸν ἀποφατικὸν κριτήριον, καθ᾽ ὃ πᾶσα χωριστὴ ὁμοιότης, ἀριθμητικὴ σύμπτωσις ἢ ἀργὸν παράδειγμα ἀποβάλλεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-06","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη ἀντίφασις μεταξὺ ἀπορρίψεως καὶ καταφάσεως χωριστῆς οὐσίας γίνεται μηχανὴ μεταβολῆς, ἐπειδὴ ὁ χωρισμὸς ἀλλάττει ὑποκείμενον, κριτήριον καὶ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-07","text":"Ἡ πρώτη φιλοσοφία καθόλου γίνεται οὐχ ὡς κατάλογος πάντων τῶν ὄντων, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς ἔλεγχος τῶν σημασιῶν, προτεραιοτήτων, ἐξαρτήσεων καὶ αἰτιακῶν τρόπων.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-08","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τάξεως διασῴζει τὴν πολλότητα ἀντὶ τοῦ ἐξαλείφειν αὐτήν, ἀλλὰ διὰ τοῦτο ὀφείλει τὴν θετικὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τῆς πρώτης ἐνεργείας εἰς τὰς πολλὰς οὐσίας ἀποδοῦναι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυνίσταται ὡς πολυτρόπως λεγόμενον σύστημα ἀσυμμέτρων ἐξαρτήσεων, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστος τρόπος τοῦ εἶναι διὰ προτεραιότητος καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἱκανότητος κρίνεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ γνώσις οὐχὶ χωριστὸν ἀντίγραφον τοῦ ὄντος κατέχει, ἀλλὰ τὸ πρᾶγμα κατὰ ὡρισμένον τρόπον θεωρεῖ καὶ ὑπὸ τῆς τοῦ πράγματος ὁριστότητος μετρεῖται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:XD-07","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς γενέσεως ἀπὸ δυνάμεως εἰς ἐνέργειαν ῥεῖ, ἡ δὲ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἄνευ πρώτης χρονικῆς ἀρχῆς ἐξ ἀχρόνου καθαρᾶς ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-04","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον οὔτε κυρίαρχον μέτρον οὔτε παθητικὸν δοχεῖόν ἐστιν, ἀλλὰ μετρουμένη καὶ ἀφαιροῦσα ἐνέργεια ἣ τὸ ἐνυπάρχον προσδιορίζει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-04","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος γίνεται συστατικὴ τῆς ὀντολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαίρεσις σημασιῶν καὶ ἡ ἀναίρεσις ψευδῶν ὑποστάσεων παράγουσι τὴν θετικὴν χώραν τῆς πρώτης ἐνεργείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ διανεμημένη ἑνότης τοῦ ὅλου οὐκ ἀφαιρεῖ τὰ πολλὰ, ἀλλὰ καθιστᾷ τὴν ἀπόδοσιν τῆς μεταξύ των αἰτιακῆς συνάψεως τελικὸν χρέος τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-01","text":"Πολλαχότης → ζήτησις ἑνότητος → ἀπόρριψις κοινοῦ γένους → δοκιμὴ πρώτης ἀρχῆς → νέα ἀναφορικὴ τάξις → ἐπάνοδος εἰς τὴν πολλαχότητα.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-02","text":"Καθόλου γνώσις → ὀντολογικὸς χωρισμός → ἀδυναμία αἰτίας → κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρία → σωτηρία τοῦ καθόλου → νέα ἀπόρριψις χωρισμοῦ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-03","text":"Χωριστὸν καθόλου → ἀναίρεσις → νοητὴ ἀφαίρεσις → δοκιμὴ αὐταρκείας → χωριστὴ ἐνέργεια· οὕτως ἡ χωριστότης ἑλίσσεται μᾶλλον ἢ ἁπλῶς ἀναιρεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-04","text":"Ἐναντίωσις → ὑποκείμενον → δύναμις → κίνησις → ἐνέργεια → σύνθεσις → δύναμις τοῦ μὴ εἶναι → ἀποκλεισμὸς συνθέτου ἀϊδίου → καθαρὰ ἐνέργεια.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-05","text":"Τὸ ἓν ὡς χωριστὴ οὐσία μεταπίπτει εἰς μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους, ἔπειτα δὲ ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἕλκουσα τάξις τοῦ ὅλου ἄνευ ἀριθμητικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκης ἐνέργεια ἐστὶν ὁ κύριος ἑλκυστής· συνάπτει ἀγαθὸν καὶ τάξιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ μὴ ἀποδεδομένη γένεσις τῆς πολλότητος ἀνακυκλοῖ τὴν περάτωσιν εἰς νέαν ζήτησιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-06","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ δέχεται πολλαχότητα τρόπων καὶ προτεινομένας χωριστὰς οὐσίας, ἵνα ἐξετάσῃ εἰ ἑνότης, νοητότης ἢ ἀριθμὸς τὴν ζητουμένην αὐτάρκειαν ἔχει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B02","text":"Ἔπειτα διαιρεῖ σημασίας, κατηγορίας, τρόπους ἐνυπάρξεως καὶ χωρισμοῦ, μεταβάλλουσα τὴν ἄμορφον πολλαχότητα εἰς πεδίον ἐλεγχομένων ἐξαρτήσεων.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ ὡρισμένη σημασία, ἡ προτεραιότης καὶ ἡ αἰτιακὴ ἰσχὺς δοκιμάζουσιν ἕκαστον ὑποψήφιον, ὥστε τὸ νοητὸν μὴ ἀκρίτως εἰς οὐσίαν μεταπίπτειν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B04","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04","text":"Τῶν χωριστῶν ὑποψηφίων ἀναιρεθέντων, ἡ μηχανὴ τὰς ἔγκυρους λειτουργίας αὐτῶν ἀνασυνίστησιν ὡς μέτρον, κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρίαν, πάθος ἢ σχέσην.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ δύναμις τοῦ μὴ εἶναι χωρίζει γενητὸν καὶ ἀΐδιον, ἡ δὲ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἀφαιρεῖ ὕλην καὶ δύναμιν ἀπὸ τῆς πρώτης οὐσίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ ἀκίνητος ἐνέργεια συνάπτει τὴν τάξιν ὡς ἀγαθὸν καὶ παράγει τὸν ἐλάχιστον τύπον τοῦ πρώτου, ἀλλὰ τὴν θετικὴν σύστασιν τῶν πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν ἀκατάσκευον καταλείπει.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AFM-B01","text":"Πολυσημία καὶ πολλαχότης → ἀνάγκη ὡρισμένου λόγου → ἀπόρριψις κοινοῦ γένους → προτεινόμεναι χωρισταὶ οὐσίαι → κατηγορικὴ καὶ αἰτιακὴ δοκιμή → ἀνασύστασις μέτρου καὶ θεωρίας.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AFM-B02","text":"Κοινὸν ὑποκείμενον → δύναμις καὶ μεταβολή → προτεραιότης ἐνεργείας → ἀΐδιος κίνησις → ἀποκλεισμὸς ὕλης καὶ ἀργίας → αὐτάρκης πρώτη ἐνέργεια → ἀνοικτὴ γένεσις πολλῶν οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης μεταγράφεται ἐκ πράγματος ἢ στοιχείου εἰς κλιμακωτὴν λειτουργίαν μέτρου, ἀναφορᾶς, ἀναλογίας καὶ τελικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-02","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης παύει δυαδικὴ διαίρεσις κόσμων οὖσα καὶ διακρίνεται εἰς νοητὴν ἀφαίρεσιν, ἀδρανῆ ὑπόστασιν καὶ οὐσιώδη αὐταρκῆ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-04","CL_DAZY_05:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-03","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης παύει μονοσήμαντος οὖσα καὶ γίνεται χάρτης λογικῆς, οὐσιώδους, τροπικῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:MME-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης χωρίζεται ἀπὸ ὁμοιότητα καὶ ἀριθμητικὴν σύμπτωσιν καὶ διαγράφεται ὡς ῥητὸς τρόπος ὕλης, εἴδους, κινήσεως ἢ τέλους.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-05","CL_DAZY_05:MME-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-05","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης μετατίθεται ἐκ ἀριθμητικοῦ πλήθους εἰς διαφορὰν κατηγοριῶν, τρόπων ἐναντιώσεως καὶ ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-02","CL_DAZY_05:MME-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-06","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος παύει ἐξωτερικὸν ὄργανον οὖσα καὶ γίνεται εἰκὼν τῆς πραγματικότητος, ἐπειδὴ ὥσπερ ὁ λόγος διαιρεῖ καὶ τάττει, οὕτω καὶ τὸ ὂν κατὰ τρόπους καὶ προτεραιότητας διαρθροῦται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ βαθμοῦ ἐλέγχονται τὸ ἕν, τὸ ὄν, μαθηματικά, ἰδέαι, ἀριθμοί, ἐναντία, μεταβολή, ἀΐδιος κίνησις καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ τῆς διατάξεως βαθμοῦ ἐνεργοῦσι μέτρα, πρὸς ἓν ἀναφοραί, κατηγορικαὶ ἐξαρτήσεις, κοινὰ ὑποκείμενα, δύναμις, ἐνέργεια καὶ αἰτιακοὶ τρόποι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὑπερστρατηγικοῦ βαθμοῦ ἡ ἔρευνα μετατίθεται ἀπὸ καταλόγου χωριστῶν ὄντων εἰς δοκιμὴν σημασίας, προτεραιότητος, τρόπου καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμοῦ τὸ γενητὸν διὰ δυνάμεως μεταβάλλεται, ἡ δὲ ἀΐδιος κίνησις ἐξ ἀκινήτου καὶ ἀχρόνου ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδικοῦ βαθμοῦ τὸ σύστημα πράττει τὴν ἰδίαν θέσιν, διαιροῦν τὰ πολλαχῶς λεγόμενα, ἀφαιροῦν ψευδεῖς ὑποστάσεις καὶ συνάγον τὰ πολλὰ ἄνευ ἐξομοιώσεως.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἐνδογενὴς ἑνότης τῶν γενῶν καὶ ἡ χωριστὴ πρώτη οὐσία συμφωνοῦσι μόνον ἐὰν ὁ νοητὸς χωρισμὸς, ἡ ὑλικὴ ἐνύπαρξις καὶ ἡ αἰτιακὴ αὐτάρκεια ἀκριβῶς διακριθῶσιν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-01","CL_DAZY_05:FL-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-02","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ κατάφασις πρώτης ἐνεργείας ὑπερβαίνει τὴν ἀποφατικὴν ἰσχὺν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ τὸ τί οὐκ ἔστιν ἀκριβέστερον ὁρίζεται ἢ τὸ πῶς πολλὰς οὐσίας γεννᾷ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-02","CL_DAZY_05:FL-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-03","text":"Ἡ σωτηρία τοῦ ἐνδεχομένου ἐν τῷ γενητῷ καὶ ἡ ἀναγκαία ἀϊδιότης τῆς πρώτης τάξεως συνυπάρχουσι διὰ χωρισμὸν αἰτιακῶν χωρῶν, οὐ διὰ κοινὸν ἑνιαῖον τρόπον.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-04","text":"Τὸ κινεῖν μεταβαίνει ἐκ ποιητικῆς ἐνεργείας εἰς τελικὴν ἕλξιν, ἀλλ᾽ ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν τὸ νοητὸν ἐνεργῶς τάττει τὴν κίνησιν μένει πεπυκνωμένος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-04","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-01","text":"Τὸ ἓν μεταβάλλει σημασίαν ὅταν ἐκ χωριστῆς γεννητικῆς οὐσίας γένηται μέτρον, καὶ πάλιν ἐνέργειαν ὅταν ἐκ μέτρου γένηται τάξις τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-01","CL_DAZY_05:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-02","text":"Ἡ χωριστὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος οὐσία μεταβαίνει ἐκ ὑποθέσεως εἰς συμπέρασμα μόνον ὅταν τὸ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ παύσῃ ὀντολογικὸς χωρισμὸς νοεῖσθαι.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-03","CL_DAZY_05:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-03","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης μεταλλάσσει τὴν ἐνέργειαν αὐτῆς ὅταν ἐκ λογικῆς τάξεως γένηται δοκιμὴ οὐσιώδους ἀνεξαρτησίας καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:MP-02","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-04","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μεταλλάσσουσι χώραν ὅταν ἐκ φυσικοῦ διορισμοῦ κινήσεως καὶ γνωστικοῦ τρόπου γένωνται ὅρος μεταξὺ γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:MP-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς πεδίον κύκλων διερχομένων διὰ κοσκίνου· ἕκαστον πλῆθος περὶ ἴδιον μέτρον τάττεται, πᾶσα δὲ προτεινομένη ἀρχὴ διὰ προτεραιότητος, ἀϊδιότητος καὶ αἰτιότητος διηθεῖται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ἀνθρώπινον ὑποκείμενον γίνεται μετρούμενον καὶ ἅμα μετροῦσα ἐνέργεια, ἐπειδὴ τὴν τοῦ πράγματος ὁριστότητα δέχεται καὶ κατὰ προσδιορισμένον τρόπον ἀφαιρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ὡς ἀΐδιος κυκλικὴ κίνησις, ἐν ᾗ αἱ γενέσεις ἐκ δυνάμεως ῥέουσιν, αὐτὴ δὲ ἡ διάρκεια ἐξ ἀχρόνου ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς οὐκ ἐστὶ φυγὴ εἰς δεύτερον κόσμον, ἀλλ᾽ ἀνάβασις διὰ μέτρων, ἀφαιρέσεων, αἰτιακῶν δοκιμῶν καὶ ἀνακυκλουμένων ἀνασκευῶν πρὸς αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-04","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ νῦν ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς διττῆς μηχανῆς, ἣ τὰ πολλὰ δι᾽ ἀναφορᾶς τάττει καὶ τοὺς ψευδεῖς πρώτους ὅρους διὰ σημασίας, τρόπου καὶ αἰτιότητος ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστὶν ἐν τῇ ἀπορρίψει γενικῆς ἑνότητος, ἐν τῇ διακρίσει νοητοῦ καὶ οὐσιώδους χωρισμοῦ καὶ ἐν τῷ ἀποκλεισμῷ ὕλης ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀϊδίου.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B03","text":"Ἀδιορίστως μένουσιν ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς, ἡ σύνδεσις ἀφαιρέσεως καὶ ἐνυπάρξεως, ἡ τελικὴ αἰτιότης τῆς κινήσεως καὶ ἡ σύστασις πολλῶν ἐνεργείᾳ οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B03","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B04","text":"Τὸ σύστημα συμφωνεῖ ἐὰν τὴν ἀναίρεσιν χωριστῶν καθόλου μὴ μεταβάλλῃ εἰς ἀναίρεσιν πάσης χωριστῆς οὐσίας, καὶ ἡ ἀνασύστασις σῴζει τὴν ἀληθῆ κίνησιν ἐὰν τὴν τελικὴν ἀπορίαν ἄλυτον διατηρῇ.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B04","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175610808276Z_2c361ec1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Dazy L1 02","source_sha256":"f400f1bc2c338a7d11bbfcf3b17b6297ee7372e59691e6f1e38131ea5e9c78d2","sha256":"e34258428f3ccdf262602750f7d211371ca7f4998a51669092aae120c5ad8cd6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:56:10.809303+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-01","text":"The present system asks how one science and one primary order can gather together things said in many ways, while also finding an unmoved substance without a common genus, a separate universal, or a mathematical hypostasis.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-01","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-02","text":"The principal thesis transfers unity from a common thing to the function of measure, reference, and causal order, and detaches intelligibility and universality from separate substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-02","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03","text":"The foundation is determinate account and the multivocity of being; the former preserves every science from indeterminacy, while the latter keeps categories and modes of priority unconfused.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-03","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-04","text":"The reasoning establishes a double but connected mechanism: one leads through measure, substance, and actuality to a first term; the other sifts false first terms through categorical, modal, and causal testing.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-05","text":"The movement is mixed and spiral, since every refutation returns to a positive reconstruction, while every affirmation is again tested under a stricter criterion.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-05","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06","text":"Separateness is neither simply rejected nor simply affirmed, but is transformed from intelligible abstraction and inert universality into substantial self-sufficiency and causal actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-07","text":"The convergence is toward pure and self-sufficient actuality, because eternal motion positively requires such a principle, while the apophatic sieve removes matter, potentiality, composition, and inactivity from it.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_05:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-08","text":"The conclusion strengthens the type of primary substance, but does not complete the positive generation of the many substances in actuality or the precise manner in which the first actuality orders the plurality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being and one are not univocal genera but terms said in many ways, the distinction of which precedes every common science and first principle.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-01","CL_DAZY_05:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Unity among subjects is not an additional substance but the definition and measure of a homogeneous plurality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-02","CL_DAZY_05:GA-11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Universality is necessary for science, but does not make a separate common thing, since the unity of knowledge consists through reference and a mode of contemplation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The autonomy of a scientific field does not entail the substantial self-sufficiency of what is known, but indicates a proper mode of contemplation within one multiform reality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-07","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Substance is prior to affections, quantities, relations, and motions, because whatever is said of a subject requires a pre-existing subject.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Difference, opposition, and change require a common account or an underlying subject, so that neither absolute non-being nor a separate contrary is primary substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Potentiality and actuality expand from a determination of motion and knowledge into a universal criterion of generation, destruction, and eternity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-10","CL_DAZY_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] The first eternal substance must be pure actuality, since every composition from inherent elements bears matter and the potentiality not to be.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-12","CL_DAZY_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] A separate nature is accepted only if it possesses substantial self-sufficiency and an explicit causal mode, not if it is merely intelligible or similar.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","CL_DAZY_05:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Separateness changes from an illicit hypostatization of universals into a criterion of independence, actuality, and causal priority.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] The one and number relinquish the claim to separate generative substance and are preserved as measure and measured plurality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:GA-11","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The first principle draws the whole as self-sufficient actuality and good, not as an arithmetical unit or a common element.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-13","CL_DAZY_05:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","text":"[Emergent] Positive ascent and successive negation mutually produce the minimal type of the first, because the former supplies necessity and the latter removes incompatibilities.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","text":"[Terminal] The synthesis completes the rejection of false primary substances, but leaves open the positive constitution of the plurality of substances in actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:AS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01","text":"The one remains as a principle of definition, but is transferred from separate substance to immanent measure and thence to causal order.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-02","text":"Measure returns as a common function of thought and being: thought determines according to the respect in which, while being provides a homogeneous and determinate domain.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03","text":"Separateness is reversed twice: first it is rejected as the hypostasis of a universal, then reconstructed as self-sufficient and active substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-04","text":"The universal remains necessary for knowledge, but its actuality is absorbed into the relational unity of science and into determinate contemplation of the particular.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-06","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-05","text":"Priority passes from an order of account to asymmetric dependence, according to which what is said of a subject, what is in potentiality, and what is causally inactive become posterior.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GA-08","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06","text":"Potentiality and actuality are displaced from motion and knowledge to the boundary between generated and eternal, where the potentiality not to be becomes an exclusive criterion.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-07","text":"The rejection of separate abstractions does not disappear once it has completed its task, but is transformed into a positive demand for a first principle that is active, eternal, and causally sufficient.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-07","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-01","text":"Judgments concerning numbers, colors, lines, planes, and solids remain local tests, from which only the rule of refutation according to modes grows.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-01","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-02","text":"Arithmetical and celestial correspondences do not grow into universal principles, because the lack of a causal mode sufficiently surpasses them.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-03","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-03","text":"Divisions of motion and generation bridge the units, while categorical and modal testing absorbs them into a universal filter of priority and eternity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-04","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-04","text":"At the present scale, relational unity, contemplation according to the respect in which, analogical causality, and the priority of actuality increase.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-05","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-05","text":"The separate Idea and its genealogy are surpassed as local hypotheses, while the distinction between scientific determination and substantial separation remains.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:CGD-06","CL_DAZY_05:CGD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-06","text":"The plurality of unmoved substances does not remain a bare lower-level hypothesis, but now becomes an unresolved remainder of the positive constitution of the whole.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-04","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-01","text":"It is excluded that being or one is a common genus of all things, because this obliterates differences of categories and modes.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-01","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-02","text":"A separate one, Ideas, and mathematical entities as parallel substances are excluded, because they provide neither a mode of generation nor causal force.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-02","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03","text":"Thought as an arbitrary maker of substances is excluded, and the truth of the universal is disconnected from separate hypostasis.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-03","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04","text":"The simultaneous truth of contradictions and the priority of affection, contrary, quantity, or relation are excluded, because the former destroys meaning, while the latter require presupposed substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-04","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-05","text":"Chance, accident, matter, and inherent composition are excluded as sources of eternal order, because they bear the potentiality not to be.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-05","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06","text":"Infinite regress and arithmetical similarity as a completion of causality are excluded, because they provide neither a first term nor an explicit causal mode.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-06","CL_DAZY_05:GNX-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-07","text":"Potentiality alone, inert separate substance, and similarity without motion, form, matter, or end are excluded as sufficient first principles.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:GNX-07","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that every unity requires a genus and every intelligibility a second world of separate substances.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-01","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that indeterminacy admits an account, or that what is logically simpler and more universal is automatically substantially prior.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-02","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that generation from absolute nothing or change through separate non-being is explained, since what is potentially being provides the necessary mediation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-03","CL_DAZY_05:XD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that the first has matter or elemental composition, since in this way it receives the potentiality not to be and dependence upon other things.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:DBN-04","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that the refutation of separate universals refutes every separate substance, since active and final separateness has another account.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-01","text":"A reality that is flat or enclosed under a univocal genus is unacceptable, because it obliterates the asymmetric dependencies of substance, affection, potentiality, and actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-02","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-02","text":"A temporal generation of the first eternal substance is held impossible, because what is generated contains composition and the potentiality not to be.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-03","text":"The intermediate region that posits separate universality or mathematical nature without proper principles, generation, and causal connection is unacceptable.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04","text":"The deepest absence around which the system is ordered is the unrendered manner in which one first actuality is connected to many substances in actuality and motions.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04","CL_DAZY_04:FL-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-01","text":"The same distinction that makes one science possible without a common genus also preserves universal knowledge without a separate universal, because unity is functional and relational both here and there.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:XD-01","CL_DAZY_05:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-02","text":"The rejection of a separate one, forms, and mathematical entities stabilizes the affirmation of primary substance, because it transforms the criterion of separateness from similarity into self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","CL_DAZY_04:XD-04","CL_DAZY_05:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-03","text":"The one cannot be transferred univocally from homogeneous plurality to the whole: in the former it is measure, while in the latter it is causal and final order.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-02","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-04","text":"Potentiality and actuality constitute one graded mechanism, which grows from knowledge through change to the exclusion of matter from primary substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-05","text":"Causal sufficiency becomes a common apophatic criterion, by which every separate similarity, arithmetical coincidence, or inert paradigm is rejected.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","CL_DAZY_04:DBN-06","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-06","text":"The apparent contradiction between rejecting and affirming separate substance becomes a mechanism of transformation, because separation changes subject, criterion, and actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_04:RMD-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-07","text":"First philosophy becomes universal not as a catalogue of all beings, but as an examination of meanings, priorities, dependencies, and causal modes.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-08","text":"The unity of order preserves plurality rather than eliminating it, but for this reason it must render the positive transition from the first actuality to the many substances.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-01","text":"Reality is reconstructed as a system said in many ways of asymmetric dependencies, in which each mode of being is judged through priority and causal sufficiency.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-01","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-02","text":"Knowledge does not possess a separate copy of being, but contemplates the thing in a determinate manner and is measured by the determinacy of the thing.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:XD-07","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03","text":"The time of generation flows from potentiality into actuality, while eternal motion, without a first temporal principle, depends upon timeless pure actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-08","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-02","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-04","text":"The knowing subject is neither a sovereign measure nor a passive receptacle, but an actuality that is measured and abstracts, determining what is inherent.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-04","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-04","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-05","text":"Method becomes constitutive of ontology, because the division of meanings and the refutation of false hypostases produce the positive domain of first actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13","CL_DAZY_05:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-06","text":"The distributed unity of the whole does not remove the many, but makes the rendering of their mutual causal connection the final obligation of the system.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-14","CL_DAZY_04:BSD-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-01","text":"Multiplicity → search for unity → rejection of common genus → testing of first principle → new relational order → return to multiplicity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-02","text":"Universal knowledge → ontological separation → incapacity for causation → contemplation according to the respect in which → preservation of the universal → new rejection of separation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:RLE-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-03","text":"Separate universal → refutation → intelligible abstraction → test of self-sufficiency → separate actuality; thus separateness spirals rather than is simply refuted.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-04","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-04","text":"Opposition → subject → potentiality → motion → actuality → composition → potentiality not to be → exclusion of composite eternal being → pure actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-03","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-05","text":"The one as separate substance passes into the measure of homogeneous plurality, then returns as the attracting order of the whole without arithmetical identity.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-06","text":"Self-sufficient actuality is the principal attractor: it joins good and order, but the unrendered generation of plurality recycles the conclusion into a new inquiry.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RLE-06","CL_DAZY_05:RLE-05","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01","text":"The mechanism receives multiplicity of modes and proposed separate substances, in order to examine whether unity, intelligibility, or number possesses the self-sufficiency sought.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B01","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B02","text":"It then divides meanings, categories, modes of inherence and separation, transforming unformed multiplicity into a field of examinable dependencies.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B03","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B03","text":"Determinate meaning, priority, and causal force test each candidate, so that the intelligible does not indiscriminately pass into substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B04","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04","text":"Once the separate candidates have been refuted, the mechanism reconstructs their valid functions as measure, contemplation according to the respect in which, affection, or relation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B02","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05","text":"The potentiality not to be separates generated from eternal, while eternal motion removes matter and potentiality from primary substance.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B07","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B06","text":"Unmoved actuality joins order as good and produces the minimal type of the first, but leaves unconstructed the positive constitution of the many substances in actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","CL_DAZY_05:FGS-B06","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AFM-B01","text":"Multivocity and multiplicity → necessity of determinate account → rejection of common genus → proposed separate substances → categorical and causal testing → reconstruction of measure and contemplation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:AS-04","CL_DAZY_05:AS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:AFM-B02","text":"Common subject → potentiality and change → priority of actuality → eternal motion → exclusion of matter and inactivity → self-sufficient first actuality → open generation of many substances.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FGS-B08","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01","text":"Unity is rewritten from a thing or element into a graded function of measure, reference, analogy, and final order.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-01","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-02","text":"Separateness ceases to be a binary division of worlds and is distinguished into intelligible abstraction, inactive hypostasis, and substantial self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-04","CL_DAZY_05:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-03","text":"Priority ceases to be univocal and becomes a map of logical, substantial, modal, and causal dependence.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:MME-02","CL_DAZY_04:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-04","text":"Causality is separated from similarity and arithmetical coincidence and is delineated as an explicit mode of matter, form, motion, or end.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-05","CL_DAZY_05:MME-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-05","text":"Multiplicity is transferred from numerical plurality to difference of categories, modes of opposition, and substances in actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MME-02","CL_DAZY_05:MME-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-06","text":"Method ceases to be an external instrument and becomes an image of reality, because just as account divides and orders, so being too is articulated according to modes and priorities.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the one, being, mathematics, Ideas, numbers, contraries, change, eternal motion, and unmoved substance are examined.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B01","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, measures, references to one, categorical dependencies, common subjects, potentiality, actuality, and causal modes operate.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B02","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, inquiry is transferred from a catalogue of separate beings to a test of meaning, priority, mode, and causal sufficiency.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B03","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, what is generated changes through potentiality, while eternal motion depends upon unmoved and timeless actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B04","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the system performs its own thesis, dividing things said in many ways, removing false hypostases, and gathering the many without assimilation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:ALT-B05","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-01","text":"The immanent unity of genera and separate primary substance agree only if intelligible separation, material inherence, and causal self-sufficiency are precisely distinguished.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-01","CL_DAZY_05:FL-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-02","text":"The positive affirmation of first actuality exceeds the apophatic force of the system, because what it is not is defined more precisely than how it generates many substances.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-02","CL_DAZY_05:FL-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-03","text":"The preservation of the contingent in the generated and the necessary eternity of the first order coexist through a separation of causal domains, not through one common unified mode.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:FL-03","CL_DAZY_05:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-04","text":"Moving passes from productive actuality to final attraction, but the manner in which the intelligible actively orders motion remains compressed.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-04","CL_DAZY_05:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-01","text":"The one changes meaning when it becomes measure from separate generative substance, and again actuality when it becomes the order of the whole from measure.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-01","CL_DAZY_05:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-02","text":"Separate and unmoved substance passes from hypothesis to conclusion only when contemplation according to the respect in which ceases to be understood as ontological separation.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MP-03","CL_DAZY_05:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-03","text":"Priority alters its function when it becomes, from logical order, a test of substantial independence and causal sufficiency.","refs":["CL_DAZY_05:MP-02","CL_DAZY_05:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-04","text":"Potentiality and actuality change domain when they become, from a natural determination of motion and a cognitive mode, a boundary between generated and eternal.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:RMD-05","CL_DAZY_05:MP-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a field of circles passing through a sieve: each plurality is ordered around its proper measure, while every proposed principle is sifted through priority, eternity, and causality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-01","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-02","text":"The human subject becomes an actuality that is measured and at the same time measures, because it receives the determinacy of the thing and abstracts in a determinate manner.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-02","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-03","text":"Time is imaged as eternal circular motion, in which generations flow from potentiality, while duration itself depends upon timeless actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-03","CL_DAZY_05:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-04","text":"The possible voyage is not flight into a second world, but ascent through measures, abstractions, causal tests, and recurrent refutations toward self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:HSI-04","CL_DAZY_05:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstruction of the double mechanism that orders the many through reference and refutes false first terms through meaning, mode, and causality.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B01","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest in its rejection of generic unity, its distinction between intelligible and substantial separation, and its exclusion of matter from the eternal.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B02","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B03","text":"The precise manner of reference to one, the connection of abstraction and inherence, the final causality of motion, and the constitution of many substances in actuality remain undetermined.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B03","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B04","text":"The system is coherent if it does not transform the refutation of separate universals into the refutation of every separate substance, and reconstruction preserves true motion if it keeps the final aporia unresolved.","refs":["CL_DAZY_04:MRT-B04","CL_DAZY_05:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"MC_DAZY_L1_02@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:MC_DAZY_L1_02:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Dazy L1 02"}],"identity":{"layer":"MC","kicker":"Meta-cluster · Metaphysica","title":"Dazy L1 02","context":"Chapters 10–14 · Book 10 · Book 11 · Book 12 · Book 13 · Book 14","original_title":"Dazy L1 02","original_context":"Chapters 10–14 · Book 10 · Book 11 · Book 12 · Book 13 · Book 14"},"original_title":"Dazy L1 02","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"WB_DAZY","layer":"WB","title":"Metaphysics","order":1,"parents":["MC_DAZY_L1_01","MC_DAZY_L1_02"],"revision":"WB_DAZY@R002","sha256":"3d8f5c82a7d25c1d65c31a49eceb24f83ce0835aa5807f279d064543d443a35d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον ἀπόρημα ἐστὶ πῶς ἡ σοφία τῶν πρώτων αἰτίων μίαν ἐπιστήμην τοῦ πολλαχῶς λεγομένου ὄντος συνιστᾷ καὶ πρὸς πρώτην οὐσίαν ἀνάγει, μήτε κοινὸν γένος μήτε χωριστὸν καθόλου ὑποτιθεμένη.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ καθόλου θέσις τὴν ἑνότητα ἐκ κοινῆς ὑποστάσεως εἰς ἀσύμμετρον ἀναφορὰν μετατίθησιν, ἐν ᾗ τὰ ὄντα πρὸς οὐσίαν, ἡ δὲ οὐσία πρὸς μορφὴν καὶ ἐνέργειαν τάττεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-03","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῶν αἰτίων, ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις παρέχουσι τὸ ἐλάχιστον θεμέλιον, ἄνευ οὗ οὔτε διαίρεσις σημασιῶν οὔτε κρίσις πρώτης ἀρχῆς δυνατή ἐστιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-04","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς μικτὴν μηχανὴν ποιεῖ· συναγωγῇ καὶ διαπορήσει τὰς ἀρχὰς ζητεῖ, διαιρέσει καὶ περιαιρέσει τοὺς ὑποψηφίους δοκιμάζει, ἐνεργειακῇ δὲ ἀνασυστάσει τὸ πρῶτον ὁρίζει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ οὐσία μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κέντρον τῶν σημασιῶν καὶ ὑποκείμενον τῶν κατηγορουμένων εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον, ἡ δὲ χωριστότης ἀπὸ ψευδῆ ὑπόστασιν καθόλου εἰς αὐτάρκη αἰτιακὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-06","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ ἀνάβασις ἐκ τῆς ἀϊδίου κινήσεως καὶ ἡ ἀποφατικὴ ἀφαίρεσις ὕλης, δυνάμεως, συνθέσεως καὶ ἀργίας συγκλίνουσιν εἰς καθαρὰν καὶ αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς κίνησις ἑλικοειδὴς καὶ μικτή ἐστιν· ἡ πολλαχότης ἑνοῦται ἄνευ ἐξαλείψεως, πᾶσα δὲ ἑνότης πάλιν ὑπὸ αἰτιακῆς ἱκανότητος δοκιμάζεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ περάτωσις καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν καὶ ἀκίνητον πρώτη οὐσίαν ἀναγκαίαν ποιεῖ, ἀλλὰ τὴν θετικὴν σύναψιν τοῦ πρώτου πρὸς τὰς πολλὰς οὐσίας ἀκατάσκευον καταλείπει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἐπιστήμη κυρίως τὸ διότι γιγνώσκει, διὸ ὡρισμένον ἀντικείμενον, αἰτίαν καὶ τάξιν προτεραιότητος ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν πολλαχῶς λέγεται κατὰ τεταγμένην ἀλλ᾽ ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν, οὐχ ὡς μονοσήμαντα γένη οὐδ᾽ ὡς ἄτακτα ὁμώνυμα.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ οὐσία ἀπὸ ὑποκείμενον καὶ ἀναφορικὸν κέντρον μεταβαίνει εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον, προτέραν ἐνέργειαν καὶ ὅρον πρώτης αὐταρκείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἰτιακὴ ἀναγωγὴ πεπερασμένη εἶναι δεῖ, ἐπεὶ ἡ εἰς ἄπειρον πρόοδος τὸ πρῶτον, τὸ διότι καὶ τὴν γένεσιν ἀναιρεῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ ὡρισμένος λόγος καὶ ἡ μὴ ἀντίφασις κοινοὶ ὅροι σημασίας, διαφορᾶς, κατηγορίας καὶ πάσης δοκιμῆς τῶν πρώτων ἀρχῶν εἰσίν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ μία πρώτη ἐπιστήμη συνίσταται διὰ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς καὶ ἰδίου τρόπου θεωρίας, οὐ διὰ γένους ἢ χωριστῆς καθολικῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια οὐκ ἔξωθεν συνδεῖ προϋπάρχοντα μέρη, ἀλλὰ τὴν ὕλην μίαν οὐσίαν, τόδε τι καὶ ὂν ποιεῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἐνέργεια λόγῳ, οὐσίᾳ καὶ αἰτίᾳ προτέρα τῆς δυνάμεως ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ τὴν δύναμιν ὁρίζει, κινεῖ καὶ τελειοῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ ἓν ἀπὸ χωριστῆς ἀριθμητικῆς ἀρχῆς μετατίθεται εἰς μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους καὶ τέλος εἰς αἰτιακὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ χωριστότης θεμιτὴ γίνεται μόνον ὅταν νοητὴν ἀφαίρεσιν ὑπερβᾶσα οὐσιώδη αὐτάρκειαν, ἐνεργὸν τρόπον καὶ αἰτιακὴν ἱκανότητα ἔχῃ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ διαπορία καὶ ἡ διαδοχικὴ ἀπόφασις οὐ μόνον ἀναιροῦσιν, ἀλλὰ τὸν ἐλάχιστον θετικὸν τύπον τοῦ πρώτου παράγουσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πρώτη ἀρχὴ ἕλκει τὸ σύστημα ὡς καθαρὰ, αὐτάρκης καὶ ἀΐδιος ἐνέργεια, ἅμα δὲ ὡς ἀγαθὸν καὶ τέλος τάξεως.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ πρώτη ἐνέργεια ἀναγκαίως βεβαιοῦται, ὁ δὲ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν τὰς πολλὰς οὐσίας καὶ κινήσεις τάττει ἀδιορίστως μένει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ αἰτία διαμένει ὅρος τῆς ἐπιστήμης, αὔξεται δὲ ἀπὸ τεσσάρων γενῶν εἰς πεπερασμένην ἱεραρχίαν καὶ τέλος εἰς δοκιμὴν ἐνεργοῦ αὐταρκείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ καθόλου καὶ τὸ ἓν σῴζουσι τὴν ἑνοποιὸν ἐνέργειαν, ἀποβάλλουσι δὲ τὴν ἀξίωσιν γένους ἢ χωριστῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἐπανέρχονται ὡς ἀναφορὰ καὶ μέτρον.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ οὐσία σῴζει τὴν κεντρικὴν προτεραιότητα, μετατίθεται δὲ ἀπὸ σημασιολογικὸν κέντρον εἰς μορφὴν, ἐνέργειαν καὶ πρώτη αὐτάρκη οὐσίαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ καθόλου μένει ἀναγκαῖον πρὸς γνώσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ οὐσιωτικὴ δύναμις αὐτοῦ ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς τὸν τρόπον θεωρίας καὶ τὴν ἀναφορικὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης ἀναστρέφεται· ἀναιρεῖται ὡς ἀργὴ ὑπόστασις καθόλου, ἀνασυνίσταται δὲ ὡς αὐτάρκης καὶ αἰτιωδῶς ἐνεργὸς οὐσία.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης ἀπὸ χρονικὴν ἢ λογικὴν τάξιν αὔξεται εἰς χάρτην οὐσιώδους, τροπικῆς καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἐνέργεια ἀπὸ τέλος ἑκάστης δυνάμεως μεταβάλλεται εἰς κριτήριον γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου, εἶτα δὲ εἰς τελικὴν ἕλκουσαν ἀρχήν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-08","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς ἀπὸ ὀντολογικὸν θεμέλιον μετατίθεται εἰς πάθος διανοίας, οὐκ ἀπολύεται δὲ τοῦ ὄντος, ἀλλὰ τῇ ἐνεργείᾳ τοῦ πράγματος πάλιν ὑποτάσσεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-09","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία αὔξεται εἰς διαίρεσιν καὶ περίαιρεσιν, ἡ δὲ ἀπόρριψις τῶν ψευδῶν χωριστῶν ὑποστάσεων μεταμορφοῦται εἰς θετικὸν αἴτημα πρώτης ἐνεργείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-01","text":"Αἴσθησις, μνήμη, ἐμπειρία καὶ ἐπιμέρους δόξαι μένουσι κατώτεραι γνωστικαὶ μηχαναί· μόνον ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τοῦ ὅτι πρὸς τὸ διότι αὔξεται εἰς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ τοπικαὶ διαιρέσεις ὀνομάτων, ἀριθμῶν καὶ σχημάτων οὐ διαμένουσιν αὐτοτελεῖς, ἀλλὰ τὴν καθόλου μέθοδον τομῆς σημασιῶν καὶ δοκιμῆς ὑποστάσεων γεννῶσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-03","text":"Αἱ ὑλικαὶ διαφοραὶ καὶ αἱ διαιρέσεις δυνάμεων μένουσι τοπικαί, ἡ δὲ ὑποταγὴ πάσης δυνάμεως εἰς οἰκείαν ἐνέργειαν γίνεται καθόλου κριτήριον.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-04","text":"Αἱ ἱστορικαὶ δόξαι καὶ οἱ χωριστοὶ ὑποψήφιοι περαίνουσι τὸ τοπικὸν ἔργον αὐτῶν, ὅταν αἱ ἔγκυροι λειτουργίαι αὐτῶν ὡς μέτρον, λόγος ἢ αἰτία ἀνασυσταθῶσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-05","text":"Τὸ πλῆθος τῶν ἀκινήτων οὐσιῶν καὶ ἡ πρὸς αὐτὰς μεσίτευσις οὐκ ἀποβάλλονται ὡς κατώτερα ζητήματα, ἀλλὰ γίνονται ἄλυτον ὑπόλοιπον τοῦ ὅλου βιβλίου.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-01","text":"Οὔτε αἴσθησις οὔτε ἐμπειρία οὔτε πρακτικὴ εὐστοχία σοφία ἐστίν, ἐὰν ἡ καθόλου αἰτία καὶ τὸ διότι ἀπουσιάζῃ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-02","text":"Τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ ἓν οὔτε κοινὰ γένη οὔτε ἄτακτα πλήθη ὁμωνύμων εἶναι δύνανται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-03","text":"Ἄπειρος ἀναχώρησις αἰτίων καὶ ἀριθμητικὴ ὁμοιότης ἀποκλείονται ὡς περατώσεις, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε πρῶτον ὅρον οὔτε ῥητὸν τρόπον αἰτίας παρέχουσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-04","text":"Ἀόριστος σημασία καὶ συναλήθευσις ἀντιφάσεων ἀποκλείονται, διότι καταλύουσι διαφοράν, κρίσιν καὶ τὴν ὡρισμένην χώραν ἑκάστου αἰτίου.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-05","text":"Συμβεβηκός, πάθος, ποσόν, σχέσις, τύχη καὶ ὕλη οὐ δύνανται πρώται οὐσίαι ἢ πηγαὶ ἀϊδίου τάξεως εἶναι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-06","text":"Χωριστὸν ἕν, ἰδέαι, μαθηματικὰ καὶ γυμνὴ δύναμις ἀποκλείονται ὡς πρῶται ἀρχαί, ἐὰν αἰτιακὴν ἰσχὺν καὶ ἐνεργὸν τρόπον μὴ παρέχωσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-01","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι πᾶσα ἑνότης κοινὸν γένος καὶ πᾶσα νοητότης χωριστὴν οὐσίαν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-02","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι αἰτιακὴ τάξις ἄνευ πρώτου καὶ ἤδη ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος αἰτίου δύναται συνίστασθαι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-03","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ ἀναίρεσις χωριστῶν καθόλου ἀναιρεῖ πᾶσαν χωριστὴν οὐσίαν, ἐπεὶ ἡ αὐτάρκης ἐνέργεια ἕτερον λόγον χωρισμοῦ ἔχει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-04","text":"Ψεῦδος εἶναι δεῖ ὅτι ἡ διάνοια αὐθαιρέτως ποιεῖ τὴν ἀλήθειαν ἢ τὰς οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ αὐτὴ ὑπὸ τῆς ὁριστότητος τοῦ πράγματος μετρεῖται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπαράδεκτος ἐστὶ πραγματικότης ἐπίπεδος, μονοσήμαντος ἢ παντελῶς ἀόριστος, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε ἀσύμμετρον ἐξάρτησιν οὔτε ὡρισμένην ἐνέργειαν καταλείπει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος ὁ κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἔσχατος ὕλη ἢ ἡ γυμνὴ δύναμις ἑαυτὴν ἐνεργοποιεῖ καὶ ἡ πρώτη ἀΐδιος οὐσία χρονικῶς γίγνεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ βαθυτάτη ἀπουσία ἐστὶν ὁ θετικὸς λόγος τοῦ δεσμοῦ καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ πρώτη ἐνέργεια τὴν πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα, τὰς πολλὰς οὐσίας καὶ τὴν κίνησιν συντάττει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-01","text":"Ἡ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰ καὶ ἡ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ θεωρία ἀμοιβαίως δηλοῦσιν ὅτι μία ἐπιστήμη δύναται καθόλου εἶναι ἄνευ κοινοῦ γένους καὶ χωριστοῦ καθόλου.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-02","WB_DAZY:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις χωριστῶν εἰδῶν οὐκ ἀντιφάσκει τῇ καταφάσει πρώτης χωριστῆς οὐσίας, ἐπειδὴ ὁ χωρισμὸς μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ὁμοιότητα εἰς αὐτάρκη αἰτιακὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-10","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-03","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῆς αἰτιακῆς ἀναγωγῆς καὶ ἡ ἀΐδιος κίνησις συνεργοῦσιν, ὥστε πρῶτον ἐνεργείᾳ αἴτιον καὶ καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν ἀναγκαία ποιεῖν.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-04","WB_DAZY:GA-08","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-04","text":"Τὸ ἓν μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ μέτρον ὁμογενοῦς πλήθους εἰς τελικὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὅλου, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ μετάβασις ἀναλογικὴ καὶ οὐ μονοσήμαντός ἐστιν.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-02","WB_DAZY:GA-09","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-05","text":"Ὁ κοινὸς ἀποκλεισμὸς ἀπείρου ἀναγωγῆς, ἀργῶν ὑποστάσεων καὶ αὐτοκινούσης δυνάμεως ἀνασυνίστησι τὰς ἔγκυρους λειτουργίας αὐτῶν ὡς μέτρον, εἶδος καὶ προτέραν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-04","WB_DAZY:GA-07","WB_DAZY:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-06","text":"Ἡ γνώσις καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια οὔτε χωριστὸν ἀντίγραφον οὔτε αὐθαίρετον ποίημα εἰσίν, ἀλλὰ νοητικαὶ ἐνέργειαι ὑπὸ τῆς πραγματικῆς ἐνεργείας μετρούμεναι.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-07","text":"Ἡ διχῇ θεμελιουμένη καθολικότης τῆς πρώτης φιλοσοφίας γεννᾷ τελικὸν χρέος· δεῖ τὴν πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα καὶ τὴν πρώτη χωριστὴ ἐνέργειαν διὰ θετικῆς αἰτιακῆς συνάψεως ἑνῶσαι.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-06","WB_DAZY:GA-12","WB_DAZY:GA-13","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης γίνεται πεπερασμένον καὶ πολυτρόπως λεγόμενον πλέγμα ἀσυμμέτρων ἐξαρτήσεων, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστον ὂν κατὰ οὐσίαν, δύναμιν, ἐνέργειαν καὶ αἰτιακὴν ἱκανότητα τάττεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἐπιστήμη γίνεται αὐτοελεγκτική, ἐπειδὴ οὐ μόνον τὰ ὄντα ἀλλὰ καὶ τὰ κριτήρια ἑνότητος, προτεραιότητος καὶ χωρισμοῦ εἰς διαπόρησιν ἄγει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ γιγνῶσκον ὑποκείμενον μεταβάλλεται εἰς μετρούμενον καὶ μετροῦσαν ἐνέργειαν, ἥτις ἀφαιρεῖ κατὰ τὸ ᾗ, δεσμεύεται δὲ ὑπὸ τοῦ τρόπου τοῦ γνωστοῦ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος διπλῆν ἀσυμμετρίαν λαμβάνει· ἡ γνώσις ἐκ τῶν ὑστέρων ἐπὶ τὰ φύσει πρότερα ἐπανέρχεται, ἡ δὲ γένεσις ἐκ δυνάμεως ὑπὸ ἀχρόνου προτέρας ἐνεργείας τάττεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος γίνεται μέρος τῆς ὀντολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ συναγωγή, ἡ διαίρεσις καὶ ἡ περίαιρεσις πράττουσι τὴν τεταγμένην πολλαπλότητα καὶ τὴν ἐνεργειακὴν προτεραιότητα ἃς ἀποφαίνονται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-01","text":"Ὁ γνωστικὸς βρόχος ἄγει ἀπὸ αἰσθήσεως εἰς αἰτίαν, ἐκεῖθεν εἰς ἀπορίαν καὶ διαίρεσιν, τέλος δὲ διὰ τῆς ἐνεργείας πάλιν εἰς τὸ κυρίως ὄν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-02","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τῆς πολλαχότητος ζητεῖ ἑνότητα, ἀπορρίπτει τὸ κοινὸν γένος, συγκροτεῖ ἀναφορικὴν τάξιν καὶ ἐπανέρχεται εἰς τὰ πολλὰ ὡς τεταγμένα.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης αὔξεται ἀπὸ τέσσαρα γένη εἰς περατότητα, ἀπὸ περατότητος εἰς μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς καθαρὰν ἐνέργειαν ἄνευ δυνάμεως τοῦ μὴ εἶναι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-04","text":"Ὁ βρόχος τῆς χωριστότητος ἀπὸ κριτικὴν χωριστῶν καθόλου εἰς νοητὴν ἀφαίρεσιν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς αὐτάρκη χωριστὴν ἐνέργειαν ἑλίσσεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκης ἐνέργεια κύριος ἑλκυστὴς γίνεται, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀνεξήγητος σύστασις τῆς πολλότητος ἀνακυκλοῖ τὴν φαινομένην περάτωσιν εἰς νέαν διαπόρησιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B01","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ παραλαμβάνει αἰσθήσεις, δόξας, πολλὰς σημασίας τοῦ ὄντος καὶ προτεινομένας χωριστὰς οὐσίας ὡς διανεμημένην ὕλην ἐλέγχου.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ διανεμημένη ὕλη διὰ ὡρισμένου λόγου, προαπορίας καὶ διαιρέσεως μεταβάλλεται εἰς πεδίον διακεκριμένων σημασιῶν, κατηγοριῶν καὶ αἰτιακῶν ἀξιώσεων.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B03","text":"Τὸ πεδίον συνάγεται διὰ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾶς περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν, ἄνευ τοῦ τὴν τεταγμένην πολλαπλότητα εἰς μονοσήμαντον γένος μεταβάλλειν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ συναχθεῖσα χώρα διὰ προτεραιότητος καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἰσχύος τοὺς ὑποψηφίους διηθεῖ, ἀναιροῦσα τὰς ψευδεῖς ὑποστάσεις καὶ σῴζουσα τὰς ἐγκύρους λειτουργίας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ οὐσία ἀναλύεται εἰς ὕλην καὶ μορφήν, ἡ δὲ διάκρισις μεταγράφεται εἰς δύναμιν καὶ ἐνέργειαν, ὥστε τὸ γενητὸν ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀϊδίου χωρίζεσθαι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ προτέρα ἐνέργεια ἀναστρέφει τὴν χρονικὴν φαινομένην πρωτείαν τῆς δυνάμεως καὶ συγκλίνει εἰς ἀκίνητον πρώτη ἐνέργειαν, ἀκατάσκευον δὲ καταλείπει τὴν παραγωγὴν τῶν πολλῶν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:AFM-B01","text":"Φυσικὴ ὄρεξις τοῦ εἰδέναι → γνῶσις αἰτίων → περάτωσις ἀναγωγῶν → προαπορία → πολυσημία τοῦ ὄντος → πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά → πρωτεία οὐσίας → μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:AFM-B02","text":"Μορφικὴ ἐνέργεια → προτεραιότης ἐνεργείας → ἀπόρριψις χωριστῶν καθόλου → διάκρισις νοητῆς καὶ οὐσιώδους χωριστότητος → ἀΐδιος κίνησις → καθαρὰ πρώτη ἐνέργεια → ἀνοικτὴ σύναψις τῶν πολλῶν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις μονοσήμαντου γένους καὶ ἀτάκτου ὁμωνυμίας καταλύεται, ἀντ᾽ αὐτῆς δὲ τίθεται τεταγμένη πολλαπλότης κατὰ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰν καὶ ἀσύμμετρον προτεραιότητα.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἐκ πράγματος ἢ κοινοῦ στοιχείου μεταγράφεται εἰς κλιμακωτὴν λειτουργίαν μέτρου, ἀναφορᾶς, μορφικῆς ἐνεργείας καὶ τελικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-03","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης παύει δυαδικὴ διαίρεσις κόσμων οὖσα καὶ διακρίνεται εἰς νοητὴν ἀφαίρεσιν, ἀδρανῆ ὑπόστασιν καὶ αὐτάρκη αἰτιακὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-04","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης καὶ ἡ αἰτιότης ἀπαλλάσσονται τῆς ψιλῆς χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς καὶ τῆς ὁμοιότητος, γενόμεναι χάρτης οὐσιώδους ἀνεξαρτησίας καὶ ῥητῶν τρόπων ἐνεργείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος παύει ἐξωτερικὸν ὄργανον οὖσα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαίρεσις καὶ ἡ περίαιρεσις τὴν αὐτὴν πολυτρόπως τεταγμένην πραγματικότητα πράττουσιν ἣν ἀνασυνιστῶσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B01","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ἐπιφανειακὸν βαθμὸν ζητοῦνται σοφία, αἰτία, ὄν, ἕν, οὐσία, γένεσις, ἀριθμός, κίνησις, δύναμις, ἐνέργεια καὶ ἀκίνητος πρώτη οὐσία.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B02","text":"Κατὰ τὸν τῆς διατάξεως βαθμὸν ἐνεργοῦσι περατότης, πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορά, μέτρον, κατηγορικὴ ἐξάρτησις, μορφικὴ αἰτιότης καὶ προτεραιότης ἐνεργείας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B03","text":"Κατὰ τὸν ὑπερστρατηγικὸν βαθμὸν ἡ ἔρευνα ἀπὸ αἵρεσιν δόγματος καὶ καταλόγου χωριστῶν ὄντων μετατίθεται εἰς δοκιμὴν σημασίας, τρόπου, προτεραιότητος καὶ αἰτιακῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B04","text":"Κατὰ τὸν περὶ ὄντος καὶ χρόνου βαθμὸν ἡ πραγματικότης πολυτρόπως ἱεραρχεῖται, τὸ γενητὸν διὰ δυνάμεως μεταβάλλεται, ἡ δὲ διάρκεια ἐξ ἀχρόνου ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B05","text":"Κατὰ τὸν μεθοδικὸν βαθμὸν τὸ σύστημα τὴν ἰδίαν θέσιν πράττει, συνάγον τὰ πολλὰ ἄνευ ἐξομοιώσεως καὶ ἀφαιροῦν τὰς ψευδεῖς ὑποστάσεις ἄνευ ἀφανισμοῦ τῶν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-01","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης θεμελιοῦται ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς μὲν ἐπὶ τῇ πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορᾷ, ἀφ᾽ ἑτέρου δὲ ἐπὶ τῇ χωριστῇ πρώτῃ οὐσίᾳ, ἄνευ πλήρους παραγωγῆς τοῦ δεσμοῦ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-02","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ ἐνυπάρχον αἴτιον τῶν φθαρτῶν τίθεται, ἡ δὲ πρώτη οὐσία χωριστὴ καὶ ἀΐδιος, ὁ δὲ τρόπος τῆς αἰτιακῆς παρουσίας αὐτῆς οὐκ ἀποδίδοται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-03","text":"Τὸ ἀληθὲς μεταξὺ συνθέσεως τῆς διανοίας καὶ τρόπου τοῦ ἐνεργείᾳ ὄντος μένει, ὥστε ἡ ἐξάρτησις αὐτοῦ βεβαία, ἡ δὲ ἀκριβὴς χώρα ἀσταθὴς εἶναι.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-04","text":"Ἡ θετικὴ κατάφασις τῆς πρώτης ἐνεργείας ὑπερβαίνει τὴν ἀποδεικτικὴν ἰσχὺν τῆς περιαιρέσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἀκριβέστερον δηλοῦται τί οὐκ ἔστιν ἢ πῶς τὰ πολλὰ τάττει.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-01","text":"Ὁ πρῶτος τόπος μεταβολῆς γίνεται ὅταν ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῆς ἑνότητος τοῦ ὄντος μεταγραφῇ εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἀναφορὰν καὶ ὀντολογικὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-02","text":"Ὁ δεύτερος τόπος μεταβολῆς γίνεται ὅταν ἡ οὐσία ἐκ ὑποκειμένου καὶ σημασιολογικοῦ κέντρου μεταβῇ εἰς μορφικὸν αἴτιον καὶ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-03","text":"Ἡ χωριστότης μεταλλάσσει ὑποκείμενον καὶ ἐνέργειαν ὅταν ἐκ ἀθέμιτης ὑποστάσεως καθόλου γένηται κριτήριον αὐταρκοῦς καὶ ἐνεργοῦ οὐσίας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-04","text":"Ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ ἐνέργεια μεταλλάσσουσι χώραν ὅταν ἐκ φυσικοῦ διορισμοῦ κινήσεως γένωνται σύνορον γενητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου καὶ κριτήριον πρώτης οὐσίας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκονίζεται ὡς πεπερασμένον ἀσύμμετρον πεδίον κύκλων καὶ αἰτιακῶν τροχιῶν, ἐν ᾧ πᾶσα προτεινομένη ἀρχὴ διὰ κοσκίνου προτεραιότητος, ἀϊδιότητος καὶ ἐνεργείας διέρχεται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται ὁδοιπόρος καὶ χαρτογράφος, ἅμα μετρούμενον ὑπὸ τῶν πραγμάτων καὶ μετροῦν κατὰ τοὺς ὡρισμένους τρόπους θεωρίας.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἰκονίζεται ὡς διπλῆ ἕλιξ ἐντὸς ἀϊδίου κύκλου· ἡ γνώσις ἐπανέρχεται ἐπὶ τὰ πρότερα, ἡ γένεσις ῥεῖ ἐκ δυνάμεως, ἡ δὲ διάρκεια ἐξ ἀχρόνου ἐνεργείας ἐξαρτᾶται.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ δυνατὸς πλοῦς οὐκ ἐστὶ φυγὴ εἰς δεύτερον κόσμον, ἀλλὰ ἀνάβασις δι᾽ ἀποριῶν, διαιρέσεων, αἰτιακῶν δοκιμῶν καὶ ἐπανόδων πρὸς αὐτάρκη ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ νῦν ἀξιώματα ἱκανά ἐστι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν γνῶσιν αἰτίων εἰς πρὸς ἓν ἑνότητα, οὐσίαν, μορφικὴν ἐνέργειαν καὶ καθαρὰν πρώτη οὐσίαν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ διάταξις ἰσχυροτάτη ἐστίν, ὅπου ἡ ἀποφατικὴ περίαιρεσις τὰς ψευδεῖς ἑνότητας ἀναιρεῖ καὶ τὰς ἐγκύρους λειτουργίας αὐτῶν ὡς αἰτίαν, μέτρον καὶ ἐνέργειαν ἀνασυνίστησιν.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις τὴν ἀληθῆ ἑλικοειδῆ κίνησιν σῴζει μόνον ἐὰν μήτε τὴν πολλαπλότητα ἐξομαλίζῃ μήτε τὴν τελικὴν ἀπορίαν τῆς αἰτιακῆς συνάψεως προώρως πληροῖ.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T175647426245Z_c040b6f5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Metaphysics","source_sha256":"3d8f5c82a7d25c1d65c31a49eceb24f83ce0835aa5807f279d064543d443a35d","sha256":"5362cb598b64fc716af44151d9d201422b758d55bf2d5d6fca4b19c537ebd635","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T17:56:47.427331+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-01","text":"The principal aporia is how wisdom concerning first causes constitutes a single science of being said in many ways and refers it to primary substance, while positing neither a common genus nor a separate universal.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-02","text":"The universal position shifts unity from common subsistence to asymmetrical reference, in which beings are ordered toward substance, and substance toward form and actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-03","text":"The finitude of causes, determinate account, and non-contradiction provide the minimal foundation, without which neither division of meanings nor judgment concerning a first principle is possible.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-04","text":"The reasoning makes a mixed mechanism: by induction and aporia it seeks principles; by division and removal it tests the candidates; by reconstructing through actuality it defines the first.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-05","text":"Substance passes from being the center of meanings and the subject of predicates to being formal cause, and separateness from a false universal subsistence to self-sufficient causal actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-06","text":"The positive ascent from eternal motion and the apophatic removal of matter, potentiality, composition, and inactivity converge upon pure and self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-07","text":"The true movement is spiral and mixed: multiplicity is unified without erasure, and every unity is in turn tested by causal adequacy.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BAS-08","text":"The completion makes pure actuality and an unmoved primary substance necessary, but leaves unconstructed the positive connection of the first to the many substances.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AS-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Science primarily knows the why, and therefore requires a determinate object, a cause, and an order of priority.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Being and one are said in many ways according to ordered but asymmetrical dependence, not as univocal genera nor as unordered homonyms.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Substance passes from subject and relational center into formal cause, prior actuality, and the condition of primary self-sufficiency.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Causal reduction must be finite, since progress to infinity abolishes the first, the why, and coming-to-be.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Determinate account and non-contradiction are common conditions of meaning, difference, category, and every test of first principles.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The one first science is constituted through reference to one and a proper mode of contemplation, not through a genus or a separate universal substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Formal actuality does not externally connect pre-existing parts, but makes matter one substance, a this-something, and a being.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Actuality is prior to potentiality in account, substance, and cause, because it defines, moves, and completes potentiality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] The one shifts from a separate numerical principle to a measure of homogeneous multitude and finally to the causal order of the whole.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Separateness becomes legitimate only when, surpassing intelligible abstraction, it has substantial self-sufficiency, an active mode, and causal adequacy.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-09","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Aporia and successive negation not only remove, but produce the minimal positive type of the first.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The first principle draws the system as pure, self-sufficient, and eternal actuality, and at the same time as the good and the end of order.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] The first actuality is necessarily confirmed, but the manner in which it orders the many substances and motions remains indeterminate.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-01","text":"Cause remains a condition of science, but grows from four kinds into a finite hierarchy and finally into a test of active self-sufficiency.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-02","text":"The universal and the one preserve their unifying function, but discard the claim of being a genus or separate substance and return as reference and measure.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-03","text":"Substance preserves central priority, but shifts from a semantic center into form, actuality, and primary self-sufficient substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-04","text":"The universal remains necessary for knowledge, but its substantial power is absorbed into the mode of contemplation and relational unity.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:GA-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-05","text":"Separateness is reversed: it is removed as inactive universal subsistence, but reconstructed as self-sufficient and causally active substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:AS-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-06","text":"Priority grows from temporal or logical order into a map of substantial, modal, and causal dependence.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-07","text":"Actuality changes from the end of each potentiality into a criterion of generated and eternal being, and then into a final attractive principle.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-08","text":"The true shifts from ontological foundation into an affection of thought, yet is not released from being, but is again subordinated to the actuality of the thing.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RMD-09","text":"Aporia grows into division and removal, while rejection of false separate subsistences is transformed into a positive demand for first actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-01","text":"Perception, memory, experience, and particular opinions remain lower cognitive mechanisms; only the transition from the that to the why grows into the whole.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-02","text":"Local divisions of names, numbers, and figures do not remain self-sufficient, but generate the universal method of cutting meanings and testing subsistences.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-03","text":"Material differences and divisions of potentialities remain local, but the subordination of every potentiality to its proper actuality becomes a universal criterion.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:CGD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-04","text":"Historical opinions and separate candidates complete their local task when their valid functions are reconstructed as measure, account, or cause.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:CGD-05","text":"The multitude of unmoved substances and mediation toward them are not discarded as lower questions, but become an unresolved remainder of the whole book.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:CGD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-01","text":"Neither perception nor experience nor practical aptitude is wisdom, if the universal cause and the why are absent.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-02","text":"Being and one can be neither common genera nor unordered multitudes of homonyms.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-03","text":"Infinite regress of causes and numerical similarity are excluded as completions, since they provide neither a first boundary nor an explicit mode of cause.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-04","text":"Indeterminate meaning and the joint truth of contradictions are excluded, because they destroy difference, judgment, and the determinate place of each cause.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-05","text":"Accident, affection, quantity, relation, chance, and matter cannot be primary substances or sources of eternal order.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:GNX-06","text":"A separate one, Ideas, mathematical objects, and bare potentiality are excluded as first principles if they provide no causal force and active mode.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:GNX-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that every unity requires a common genus and every intelligibility a separate substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that a causal order can be constituted without a first cause that is already in actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that the removal of separate universals removes every separate substance, since self-sufficient actuality has another account of separation.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:DBN-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that thought arbitrarily makes truth or substances, since it is itself measured by the determinacy of the thing.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:GNX-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-01","text":"A flat, univocal, or wholly indeterminate reality is unacceptable, because it leaves neither asymmetrical dependence nor determinate actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-02","text":"Impossible is the world in which ultimate matter or bare potentiality actualizes itself and the first eternal substance comes to be temporally.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSA-03","text":"The deepest absence is the positive account of the bond according to which first actuality orders unity in reference to one, the many substances, and motion.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSA-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-01","text":"Reference to one and contemplation in respect of what it is mutually show that one science can be universal without a common genus and separate universal.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-02","WB_DAZY:GA-06","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-02","text":"The rejection of separate forms does not contradict the affirmation of a first separate substance, because separation shifts from similarity to self-sufficient causal actuality.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-10","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_01:DBN-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-03","text":"The finitude of causal reduction and eternal motion cooperate so as to make a first cause in actuality and pure actuality necessary.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-04","WB_DAZY:GA-08","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-04","text":"The one passes from a measure of homogeneous multitude to the final order of the whole, but the transition is analogical and not univocal.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-02","WB_DAZY:GA-09","WB_DAZY:GA-12","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-05","text":"The common exclusion of infinite regress, inactive subsistences, and self-moving potentiality reconstructs their valid functions as measure, form, and prior actuality.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-04","WB_DAZY:GA-07","WB_DAZY:GA-11","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-06","text":"Knowledge and truth are neither a separate copy nor an arbitrary product, but intellectual actualities measured by real actuality.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-08","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:XD-07","text":"The twofold-grounded universality of first philosophy generates a final obligation: unity in reference to one and first separate actuality must be unified through a positive causal connection.","refs":["WB_DAZY:GA-06","WB_DAZY:GA-12","WB_DAZY:GA-13","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-08","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-01","text":"Reality becomes a finite and multiply-said web of asymmetrical dependencies, in which each being is ordered according to substance, potentiality, actuality, and causal adequacy.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-02","text":"First science becomes self-testing, because it brings into aporia not only beings but also the criteria of unity, priority, and separation.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-03","text":"The knowing subject changes into an actuality that is measured and measures, which abstracts in respect of what it is, but is bound by the mode of the knowable.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-04","text":"Time assumes a double asymmetry: knowledge returns from what is posterior to what is prior by nature, while coming-to-be is ordered from potentiality by timeless prior actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:BSD-05","text":"Method becomes part of ontology, because induction, division, and removal enact the ordered multiplicity and priority of actuality that they declare.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:BSD-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-01","text":"The cognitive loop leads from perception to cause, thence to aporia and division, and finally through actuality back to being in the primary sense.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-02","text":"The loop of multiplicity seeks unity, rejects the common genus, constitutes a relational order, and returns to the many as ordered.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-03","text":"Causality grows from four kinds into finitude, from finitude into formal actuality, and from this into pure actuality without the potentiality not to be.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-04","text":"The loop of separateness winds from critique of separate universals to intelligible abstraction and thence to self-sufficient separate actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:RLE-05","text":"Self-sufficient actuality becomes the dominant attractor, but the unexplained constitution of multiplicity recycles the apparent completion into a new aporia.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RLE-05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:RLE-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B01","text":"The mechanism receives perceptions, opinions, the many meanings of being, and proposed separate substances as distributed material for testing.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B02","text":"The distributed material is transformed through determinate account, preliminary aporia, and division into a field of distinguished meanings, categories, and causal claims.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B03","text":"The field is gathered through reference to one around substance, without changing ordered multiplicity into a univocal genus.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B04","text":"Through priority and causal force, the gathered region filters the candidates, removing false subsistences and preserving valid functions.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B05","text":"Substance is analyzed into matter and form, and the distinction is transcribed into potentiality and actuality, so that the generated is separated from the eternal.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FGS-B06","text":"Prior actuality reverses the apparent temporal primacy of potentiality and converges upon unmoved first actuality, but leaves unconstructed the production of the many.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:AFM-B01","text":"Natural desire to know → knowledge of causes → finitude of reductions → preliminary aporia → multiplicity of meanings of being → reference to one → primacy of substance → formal actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:AFM-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:AFM-B02","text":"Formal actuality → priority of actuality → rejection of separate universals → distinction of intelligible and substantial separateness → eternal motion → pure first actuality → open connection of the many.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FGS-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FGS-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-01","text":"The opposition between univocal genus and unordered homonymy is dissolved, and in its place is posited ordered multiplicity according to reference to one and asymmetrical priority.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-02","text":"Unity is transcribed from a thing or common element into a graded function of measure, reference, formal actuality, and final order.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-03","text":"Separateness ceases to be a binary division of worlds and is distinguished into intelligible abstraction, inactive subsistence, and self-sufficient causal actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:RMD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-04","text":"Priority and causality are freed from mere temporal succession and similarity, becoming a map of substantial independence and explicit modes of actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MME-05","text":"Method ceases to be an external instrument, because division and removal enact the same multiply ordered reality that they reconstruct.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MME-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MME-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, wisdom, cause, being, one, substance, coming-to-be, number, motion, potentiality, actuality, and unmoved primary substance are sought.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B02","text":"At the level of arrangement, finitude, reference to one, measure, categorical dependence, formal causality, and priority of actuality are operative.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B03","text":"At the hyper-strategic level, inquiry shifts from choosing a doctrine and cataloguing separate beings to testing meaning, mode, priority, and causal adequacy.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B04","text":"At the level concerning being and time, reality is hierarchized in many ways, the generated changes through potentiality, and duration depends on timeless actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the system enacts its own position, gathering the many without assimilation and removing false subsistences without annihilating functions.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:ALT-B05","MC_DAZY_L1_02:ALT-B05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-01","text":"Universality is grounded on the one hand in reference to one, and on the other in the separate first substance, without a complete derivation of the bond.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-02","text":"Form is posited as an immanent cause of perishable things, whereas the first substance is separate and eternal; but the mode of its causal presence is not rendered.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-03","text":"The true remains between the composition of thought and the mode of what is in actuality, so that its dependence is certain but its exact place is unstable.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:FL-03","MC_DAZY_L1_01:XD-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:FL-04","text":"The positive affirmation of first actuality exceeds the demonstrative force of removal, because what it is not is indicated more precisely than how it orders the many.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:FL-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-01","text":"The first point of change occurs when the aporia concerning the unity of being is transcribed into reference to one and ontological division.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-02","text":"The second point of change occurs when substance passes from subject and semantic center into formal cause and actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-03","text":"Separateness changes subject and actuality when it becomes, from an illegitimate universal subsistence, a criterion of self-sufficient and active substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MP-04","text":"Potentiality and actuality change place when, from a physical determination of motion, they become the boundary of the generated and eternal and a criterion of primary substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_02:RMD-06","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-01","text":"Reality is imaged as a finite asymmetrical field of circles and causal trajectories, in which every proposed principle passes through a sieve of priority, eternity, and actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes traveller and cartographer, at once measured by things and measuring according to determinate modes of contemplation.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-03","text":"Time is imaged as a double helix within an eternal circle: knowledge returns to what is prior, coming-to-be flows from potentiality, and duration depends on timeless actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-03","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:HSI-04","text":"The possible voyage is not flight into a second world, but ascent through aporias, divisions, causal tests, and returns toward self-sufficient actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:HSI-04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:HSI-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the movement from knowledge of causes to unity in reference to one, substance, formal actuality, and pure primary substance.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B01","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B02","text":"The arrangement is strongest where apophatic removal abolishes false unities and reconstructs their valid functions as cause, measure, and actuality.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B02","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"WB_DAZY:MRT-B03","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true spiral movement only if it neither smooths out multiplicity nor prematurely fills the final aporia of causal connection.","refs":["MC_DAZY_L1_01:MRT-B04","MC_DAZY_L1_02:MRT-B04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"WB_DAZY@R002","source_variant_id":"canonical:WB_DAZY:WB_DAZY@R002","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Metaphysica"}],"identity":{"layer":"WB","kicker":"Whole book","title":"Metaphysics","context":"","original_title":"Metaphysica"},"original_title":"Metaphysica","title_language_code":"en"}],"seal":"SEAL_DAZY_82BC8CD59EC9E6178134","version_work_id":"WORK_STORE_PERSEUS_GREEK_TLG0086_TLG025_PERSEUS_GRC2","version_label":"Added 14 Oct 2026 · Run 15 Oct 2026 · gpt-5.6-terra / gpt-5.6-sol","version_revision":"65240cdc8455a0318f64ef8ee0d4f0e1b26605ab4b41ea11835b6e56bc8dbc9a","original_title":"Metaphysica","title_language_code":"en","title_translation":{"schema":"care-title-heading-translation/1","language_code":"en","rendition_type":"machine","originals_preserved":true},"original_year":-350},{"id":"WORK_STORE_PERSEUS_GREEK_TLG0059_TLG031_PERSEUS_GRC2","slug":"beta-8805fe2c663d049f","title":"Timaeus","author":"Plato","edition":"John Burnet","year":"-360","description":"","cover_url":"./assets/covers/beta-8805fe2c663d049f-ba5df89a85e8d5ea.png","source_url":"https://github.com/PerseusDL/canonical-greekLit/blob/01b725d835e6e733062ffd79e0efdbae1ba06e5c/data/tlg0059/tlg031/tlg0059.tlg031.perseus-grc2.xml","source_notices":{"provider":"Perseus Greek","source_url":"https://github.com/PerseusDL/canonical-greekLit/blob/01b725d835e6e733062ffd79e0efdbae1ba06e5c/data/tlg0059/tlg031/tlg0059.tlg031.perseus-grc2.xml","licence":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","statement":"CC BY-SA 4.0 repository default; individual edition review required"},"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","sources":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1","title":"Section 17","order":1,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1","text":"ΣΩ. εἷς, δύο, τρεῖς· ὁ δὲ δὴ τέταρτος ἡμῖν, ὦ φίλε Τίμαιε, ποῦ τῶν χθὲς μὲν δαιτυμόνων, τὰ νῦν δὲ ἑστιατόρων;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ἀσθένειά τις αὐτῷ συνέπεσεν, ὦ Σώκρατες· οὐ γὰρ ἂν ἑκὼν τῆσδε ἀπελείπετο τῆς συνουσίας.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. οὐκοῦν σὸν τῶνδέ τε ἔργον καὶ τὸ ὑπὲρ τοῦ ἀπόντος ἀναπληροῦν μέρος;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. πάνυ μὲν οὖν, καὶ κατὰ δύναμίν γε οὐδὲν ἐλλείψομεν· οὐδὲ γὰρ ἂν εἴη δίκαιον, χθὲς ὑπὸ σοῦ ξενισθέντας οἷς ἦν πρέπον ξενίοις, μὴ οὐ προθύμως σὲ τοὺς λοιποὺς ἡμῶν ἀνταφεστιᾶν.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν μέμνησθε ὅσα ὑμῖν καὶ περὶ ὧν ἐπέταξα εἰπεῖν;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. τὰ μὲν μεμνήμεθα, ὅσα δὲ μή, σὺ παρὼν ὑπομνήσεις· μᾶλλον δέ, εἰ μή τί σοι χαλεπόν, ἐξ ἀρχῆς διὰ βραχέων πάλιν ἐπάνελθε αὐτά, ἵνα βεβαιωθῇ μᾶλλον παρʼ ἡμῖν. \n\n \n\nΣΩ. ταῦτʼ ἔσται. χθές που τῶν ὑπʼ ἐμοῦ ῥηθέντων λόγων περὶ πολιτείας ἦν τὸ κεφάλαιον οἵα τε καὶ ἐξ οἵων ἀνδρῶν ἀρίστη κατεφαίνετʼ ἄν μοι γενέσθαι.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. καὶ μάλα γε ἡμῖν, ὦ Σώκρατες, ῥηθεῖσα πᾶσιν κατὰ νοῦν.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν οὐ τὸ τῶν γεωργῶν ὅσαι τε ἄλλαι τέχναι πρῶτον ἐν αὐτῇ χωρὶς διειλόμεθα ἀπὸ τοῦ γένους τοῦ τῶν προπολεμησόντων;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ναί.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. καὶ κατὰ φύσιν δὴ δόντες τὸ καθʼ αὑτὸν ἑκάστῳ  πρόσφορον ἓν μόνον ἐπιτήδευμα, μίαν ἑκάστῳ τέχνην, τούτους οὓς πρὸ πάντων ἔδει πολεμεῖν, εἴπομεν ὡς ἄρʼ αὐτοὺς δέοι φύλακας εἶναι μόνον τῆς πόλεως, εἴτε τις ἔξωθεν ἢ καὶ τῶν ἔνδοθεν ἴοι κακουργήσων, δικάζοντας μὲν πρᾴως τοῖς  ἀρχομένοις ὑπʼ αὐτῶν καὶ φύσει φίλοις οὖσιν, χαλεποὺς δὲ ἐν ταῖς μάχαις τοῖς ἐντυγχάνουσιν τῶν ἐχθρῶν γιγνομένους.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","text":"ΣΩ. εἷς, δύο, τρεῖς· ὁ δὲ δὴ τέταρτος ἡμῖν, ὦ φίλε Τίμαιε, ποῦ τῶν χθὲς μὲν δαιτυμόνων, τὰ νῦν δὲ ἑστιατόρων;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","text":"ΤΙ. ἀσθένειά τις αὐτῷ συνέπεσεν, ὦ Σώκρατες· οὐ γὰρ ἂν ἑκὼν τῆσδε ἀπελείπετο τῆς συνουσίας.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","text":"ΣΩ. οὐκοῦν σὸν τῶνδέ τε ἔργον καὶ τὸ ὑπὲρ τοῦ ἀπόντος ἀναπληροῦν μέρος;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","text":"ΤΙ. πάνυ μὲν οὖν, καὶ κατὰ δύναμίν γε οὐδὲν ἐλλείψομεν· οὐδὲ γὰρ ἂν εἴη δίκαιον, χθὲς ὑπὸ σοῦ ξενισθέντας οἷς ἦν πρέπον ξενίοις, μὴ οὐ προθύμως σὲ τοὺς λοιποὺς ἡμῶν ἀνταφεστιᾶν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","text":"ΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν μέμνησθε ὅσα ὑμῖν καὶ περὶ ὧν ἐπέταξα εἰπεῖν;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ μὲν μεμνήμεθα, ὅσα δὲ μή, σὺ παρὼν ὑπομνήσεις· μᾶλλον δέ, εἰ μή τί σοι χαλεπόν, ἐξ ἀρχῆς διὰ βραχέων πάλιν ἐπάνελθε αὐτά, ἵνα βεβαιωθῇ μᾶλλον παρʼ ἡμῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","text":"ΣΩ. ταῦτʼ ἔσται. χθές που τῶν ὑπʼ ἐμοῦ ῥηθέντων λόγων περὶ πολιτείας ἦν τὸ κεφάλαιον οἵα τε καὶ ἐξ οἵων ἀνδρῶν ἀρίστη κατεφαίνετʼ ἄν μοι γενέσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0008","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ μάλα γε ἡμῖν, ὦ Σώκρατες, ῥηθεῖσα πᾶσιν κατὰ νοῦν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","text":"ΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν οὐ τὸ τῶν γεωργῶν ὅσαι τε ἄλλαι τέχναι πρῶτον ἐν αὐτῇ χωρὶς διειλόμεθα ἀπὸ τοῦ γένους τοῦ τῶν προπολεμησόντων;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0010","text":"ΤΙ. ναί.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ κατὰ φύσιν δὴ δόντες τὸ καθʼ αὑτὸν ἑκάστῳ  πρόσφορον ἓν μόνον ἐπιτήδευμα, μίαν ἑκάστῳ τέχνην, τούτους οὓς πρὸ πάντων ἔδει πολεμεῖν, εἴπομεν ὡς ἄρʼ αὐτοὺς δέοι φύλακας εἶναι μόνον τῆς πόλεως, εἴτε τις ἔξωθεν ἢ καὶ τῶν ἔνδοθεν ἴοι κακουργήσων, δικάζοντας μὲν πρᾴως τοῖς  ἀρχομένοις ὑπʼ αὐτῶν καὶ φύσει φίλοις οὖσιν, χαλεποὺς δὲ ἐν ταῖς μάχαις τοῖς ἐντυγχάνουσιν τῶν ἐχθρῶν γιγνομένους.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"6c008339829a891bcb525bc35c12d29955c0e35468eb299157c6ba199882c5b9","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224415865589Z_86be5427","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 17","source_sha256":"6c008339829a891bcb525bc35c12d29955c0e35468eb299157c6ba199882c5b9","sha256":"06876ac7e5d45d21a5e7d65f10e5412fbb00015115b6bc327a777366a44478ed","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:15.865635+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","text":"SOC. One, two, three—but where, my dear Timaeus, is the fourth of us, who yesterday was one of the diners, and is now one of the hosts?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","text":"TIM. Some illness has befallen him, Socrates; for he would not willingly have absented himself from this gathering.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","text":"SOC. Is it not then your task, and that of these others, to make up also the absent man's part?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","text":"TIM. Certainly; and, so far as lies in our power, we shall omit nothing. For it would not be just that, having yesterday been entertained by you with the hospitality that was fitting, we who remain should not eagerly entertain you in return.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","text":"SOC. Then do you remember how many things, and concerning what matters, I enjoined you to speak?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","text":"TIM. We remember some of them; and those we do not, you being present will remind us of. Or rather, if it is not troublesome to you, go over them again briefly from the beginning, so that they may be more firmly established with us.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","text":"SOC. That shall be done. Yesterday, I suppose, the main point of the discourse I delivered concerning a constitution was what sort of constitution, and composed of what sort of men, seemed to me likely to prove the best.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0008","text":"TIM. And indeed, Socrates, what was said pleased us all exceedingly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0008"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","text":"SOC. Did we not first separate off in it the class of farmers and all the other crafts from the race of those who were to fight in advance?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0010","text":"TIM. Yes.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0010"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","text":"SOC. And after assigning, according to nature, to each one his own single suitable pursuit, one craft to each, did we not say that those who had to fight before all others ought to be guardians only of the city, should anyone from without, or even from within, go to work mischief—judging gently those subject to them, who were their friends by nature, but becoming stern in battles toward such of the enemies as they encountered?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011"]}],"source_digest":"5338247a4e54e3cc423bf95e3aafc9ed2da558cb7478ea3717c081b4fe6871dc","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 17"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 17","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2","title":"Section 18","order":2,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2","text":"ΤΙ. παντάπασι μὲν οὖν.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. φύσιν γὰρ οἶμαί τινα τῶν φυλάκων τῆς ψυχῆς ἐλέγομεν ἅμα μὲν θυμοειδῆ, ἅμα δὲ φιλόσοφον δεῖν εἶναι διαφερόντως, ἵνα πρὸς ἑκατέρους δύναιντο ὀρθῶς πρᾷοι καὶ χαλεποὶ γίγνεσθαι.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ναί.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. τί δὲ τροφήν; ἆρʼ οὐ γυμναστικῇ καὶ μουσικῇ μαθήμασίν τε ὅσα προσήκει τούτοις, ἐν ἅπασι τεθράφθαι;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. πάνυ μὲν οὖν. \n\n \n\nΣΩ. τοὺς δέ γε οὕτω τραφέντας ἐλέχθη που μήτε χρυσὸν μήτε ἄργυρον μήτε ἄλλο ποτὲ μηδὲν κτῆμα ἑαυτῶν ἴδιον νομίζειν δεῖν, ἀλλʼ ὡς ἐπικούρους μισθὸν λαμβάνοντας τῆς φυλακῆς παρὰ τῶν σῳζομένων ὑπʼ αὐτῶν, ὅσος σώφροσιν μέτριος, ἀναλίσκειν τε δὴ κοινῇ καὶ συνδιαιτωμένους μετὰ ἀλλήλων ζῆν, ἐπιμέλειαν ἔχοντας ἀρετῆς διὰ παντός, τῶν ἄλλων ἐπιτηδευμάτων ἄγοντας σχολήν.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ἐλέχθη καὶ ταῦτα ταύτῃ. \n\n \n\nΣΩ. καὶ μὲν δὴ καὶ περὶ γυναικῶν ἐπεμνήσθημεν, ὡς τὰς φύσεις τοῖς ἀνδράσιν παραπλησίας εἴη συναρμοστέον, καὶ τὰ ἐπιτηδεύματα πάντα κοινὰ κατά τε πόλεμον καὶ κατὰ τὴν ἄλλην δίαιταν δοτέον πάσαις.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ταύτῃ καὶ ταῦτα ἐλέγετο.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. τί δὲ δὴ τὸ περὶ τῆς παιδοποιίας; ἢ τοῦτο μὲν διὰ τὴν ἀήθειαν τῶν λεχθέντων εὐμνημόνευτον, ὅτι κοινὰ τὰ τῶν γάμων καὶ τὰ τῶν παίδων πᾶσιν ἁπάντων ἐτίθεμεν, μηχανωμένους ὅπως μηδείς ποτε τὸ γεγενημένον αὐτῶν ἰδίᾳ γνώσοιτο,  νομιοῦσιν δὲ πάντες πάντας αὐτοὺς ὁμογενεῖς, ἀδελφὰς μὲν καὶ ἀδελφοὺς ὅσοιπερ ἂν τῆς πρεπούσης ἐντὸς ἡλικίας γίγνωνται, τοὺς δʼ ἔμπροσθεν καὶ ἄνωθεν γονέας τε καὶ γονέων προγόνους, τοὺς δʼ εἰς τὸ κάτωθεν ἐκγόνους παῖδάς τε ἐκγόνων;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. ναί, καὶ ταῦτα εὐμνημόνευτα ᾗ λέγεις.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ὅπως δὲ δὴ κατὰ δύναμιν εὐθὺς γίγνοιντο ὡς ἄριστοι τὰς φύσεις, ἆρʼ οὐ μεμνήμεθα ὡς τοὺς ἄρχοντας ἔφαμεν καὶ τὰς ἀρχούσας δεῖν εἰς τὴν τῶν γάμων σύνερξιν λάθρᾳ  μηχανᾶσθαι κλήροις τισὶν ὅπως οἱ κακοὶ χωρὶς οἵ τʼ ἀγαθοὶ ταῖς ὁμοίαις ἑκάτεροι συλλήξονται, καὶ μή τις αὐτοῖς ἔχθρα διὰ ταῦτα γίγνηται, τύχην ἡγουμένοις αἰτίαν τῆς συλλήξεως;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. μεμνήμεθα.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. παντάπασι μὲν οὖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","text":"ΣΩ. φύσιν γὰρ οἶμαί τινα τῶν φυλάκων τῆς ψυχῆς ἐλέγομεν ἅμα μὲν θυμοειδῆ, ἅμα δὲ φιλόσοφον δεῖν εἶναι διαφερόντως, ἵνα πρὸς ἑκατέρους δύναιντο ὀρθῶς πρᾷοι καὶ χαλεποὶ γίγνεσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0003","text":"ΤΙ. ναί.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","text":"ΣΩ. τί δὲ τροφήν; ἆρʼ οὐ γυμναστικῇ καὶ μουσικῇ μαθήμασίν τε ὅσα προσήκει τούτοις, ἐν ἅπασι τεθράφθαι;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0005","text":"ΤΙ. πάνυ μὲν οὖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","text":"ΣΩ. τοὺς δέ γε οὕτω τραφέντας ἐλέχθη που μήτε χρυσὸν μήτε ἄργυρον μήτε ἄλλο ποτὲ μηδὲν κτῆμα ἑαυτῶν ἴδιον νομίζειν δεῖν, ἀλλʼ ὡς ἐπικούρους μισθὸν λαμβάνοντας τῆς φυλακῆς παρὰ τῶν σῳζομένων ὑπʼ αὐτῶν, ὅσος σώφροσιν μέτριος, ἀναλίσκειν τε δὴ κοινῇ καὶ συνδιαιτωμένους μετὰ ἀλλήλων ζῆν, ἐπιμέλειαν ἔχοντας ἀρετῆς διὰ παντός, τῶν ἄλλων ἐπιτηδευμάτων ἄγοντας σχολήν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0007","text":"ΤΙ. ἐλέχθη καὶ ταῦτα ταύτῃ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ μὲν δὴ καὶ περὶ γυναικῶν ἐπεμνήσθημεν, ὡς τὰς φύσεις τοῖς ἀνδράσιν παραπλησίας εἴη συναρμοστέον, καὶ τὰ ἐπιτηδεύματα πάντα κοινὰ κατά τε πόλεμον καὶ κατὰ τὴν ἄλλην δίαιταν δοτέον πάσαις.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0009","text":"ΤΙ. ταύτῃ καὶ ταῦτα ἐλέγετο.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","text":"ΣΩ. τί δὲ δὴ τὸ περὶ τῆς παιδοποιίας; ἢ τοῦτο μὲν διὰ τὴν ἀήθειαν τῶν λεχθέντων εὐμνημόνευτον, ὅτι κοινὰ τὰ τῶν γάμων καὶ τὰ τῶν παίδων πᾶσιν ἁπάντων ἐτίθεμεν, μηχανωμένους ὅπως μηδείς ποτε τὸ γεγενημένον αὐτῶν ἰδίᾳ γνώσοιτο,  νομιοῦσιν δὲ πάντες πάντας αὐτοὺς ὁμογενεῖς, ἀδελφὰς μὲν καὶ ἀδελφοὺς ὅσοιπερ ἂν τῆς πρεπούσης ἐντὸς ἡλικίας γίγνωνται, τοὺς δʼ ἔμπροσθεν καὶ ἄνωθεν γονέας τε καὶ γονέων προγόνους, τοὺς δʼ εἰς τὸ κάτωθεν ἐκγόνους παῖδάς τε ἐκγόνων;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0011","text":"ΤΙ. ναί, καὶ ταῦτα εὐμνημόνευτα ᾗ λέγεις.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","text":"ΣΩ. ὅπως δὲ δὴ κατὰ δύναμιν εὐθὺς γίγνοιντο ὡς ἄριστοι τὰς φύσεις, ἆρʼ οὐ μεμνήμεθα ὡς τοὺς ἄρχοντας ἔφαμεν καὶ τὰς ἀρχούσας δεῖν εἰς τὴν τῶν γάμων σύνερξιν λάθρᾳ  μηχανᾶσθαι κλήροις τισὶν ὅπως οἱ κακοὶ χωρὶς οἵ τʼ ἀγαθοὶ ταῖς ὁμοίαις ἑκάτεροι συλλήξονται, καὶ μή τις αὐτοῖς ἔχθρα διὰ ταῦτα γίγνηται, τύχην ἡγουμένοις αἰτίαν τῆς συλλήξεως;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0013","text":"ΤΙ. μεμνήμεθα.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"58a6c3daaaaa803968a13446dca9e02c83c206808af5dcc8c0cf6b1650fb39c4","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224424703134Z_d2f7c846","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 18","source_sha256":"58a6c3daaaaa803968a13446dca9e02c83c206808af5dcc8c0cf6b1650fb39c4","sha256":"a3392fb114eb7192a0c83aa4268b77d728ce980d6a4fc912521b5f5fab1de074","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:24.703167+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0001","text":"TI. Certainly altogether.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","text":"SO. For I think we said that the nature of a guardian of the soul must be at once spirited and, in an exceptional degree, philosophical, so that they might rightly become gentle and harsh toward each class.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0003","text":"TI. Yes.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","text":"SO. And what of their upbringing? Is it not to be reared in gymnastics and music and in the studies appropriate to these, in all respects?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0005","text":"TI. Certainly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0005"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","text":"SO. And surely it was said that those reared in this way must consider neither gold nor silver nor any other possession whatsoever to be their own private property; but that, as auxiliaries receiving from those whom they preserve a wage for their guardianship, such as is moderate for temperate men, they must spend it in common and live together, sharing meals with one another, taking thought for virtue throughout their lives, and being free from other pursuits.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0007","text":"TI. These things too were said thus.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0007"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","text":"SO. And indeed we also mentioned women: that natures similar to those of the men were to be fitted together with them, and that all pursuits, both in war and in the rest of their way of life, were to be assigned in common to all.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0009","text":"TI. These things too were spoken thus.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0009"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","text":"SO. And what then about the matter of begetting children? Or is this, because of the strangeness of what was said, easy to remember: that we made marriages and children common to all in every respect, contriving that no one should ever recognize as his own the offspring born from himself; but that all should regard all as kindred—those who come to be within the fitting span of age, as sisters and brothers; those before them and above them, as parents and ancestors of parents; and those below, as descendants, children and descendants' children?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0011","text":"TI. Yes, and these things too are easy to remember, as you say.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0011"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","text":"SO. And in order that they might immediately become, so far as possible, of the best natures, do we not remember that we said the rulers, both male and female, must secretly contrive by means of certain lotteries, in the arrangement of marriages, that the bad and the good should each pair with those like themselves, and that no hostility should arise among them on this account, since they would consider chance to be the cause of the pairing?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0013","text":"TI. We remember.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0013"]}],"source_digest":"963edfe7d194b529b479ea098c668a26a00c320a57c2e63228bc0cba072b6756","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 18"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 18","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3","title":"Section 19","order":3,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ μὴν ὅτι γε τὰ μὲν τῶν ἀγαθῶν θρεπτέον ἔφαμεν εἶναι, τὰ δὲ τῶν κακῶν εἰς τὴν ἄλλην λάθρᾳ διαδοτέον πόλιν· ἐπαυξανομένων δὲ σκοποῦντας ἀεὶ τοὺς ἀξίους πάλιν ἀνάγειν δεῖν, τοὺς δὲ παρὰ σφίσιν ἀναξίους εἰς τὴν τῶν ἐπανιόντων χώραν μεταλλάττειν;\n\n \n\nΤΙ. οὕτως.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν δὴ διεληλύθαμεν ἤδη καθάπερ χθές, ὡς ἐν κεφαλαίοις πάλιν ἐπανελθεῖν, ἢ ποθοῦμεν ἔτι τι τῶν ῥηθέντων, ὦ φίλε Γίμαιε, ὡς ἀπολειπόμενον; \n\n \n\nΤΙ. οὐδαμῶς, ἀλλὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἦν τὰ λεχθέντα, ὦ Σώκρατες.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ἀκούοιτʼ ἂν ἤδη τὰ μετὰ ταῦτα περὶ τῆς πολιτείας ἣν διήλθομεν, οἷόν τι πρὸς αὐτὴν πεπονθὼς τυγχάνω. προσέοικεν δὲ δή τινί μοι τοιῷδε τὸ πάθος, οἷον εἴ τις ζῷα καλά που θεασάμενος, εἴτε ὑπὸ γραφῆς εἰργασμένα εἴτε καὶ ζῶντα ἀληθινῶς ἡσυχίαν δὲ ἄγοντα, εἰς ἐπιθυμίαν ἀφίκοιτο θεάσασθαι κινούμενά τε αὐτὰ καί τι τῶν τοῖς σώμασιν δοκούντων  προσήκειν κατὰ τὴν ἀγωνίαν ἀθλοῦντα· ταὐτὸν καὶ ἐγὼ πέπονθα πρὸς τὴν πόλιν ἣν διήλθομεν. ἡδέως γὰρ ἄν του λόγῳ διεξιόντος ἀκούσαιμʼ ἂν ἄθλους οὓς πόλις ἀθλεῖ, τούτους αὐτὴν ἀγωνιζομένην πρὸς πόλεις ἄλλας, πρεπόντως εἴς τε πόλεμον ἀφικομένην καὶ ἐν τῷ πολεμεῖν τὰ προσήκοντα ἀποδιδοῦσαν τῇ παιδείᾳ καὶ τροφῇ κατά τε τὰς ἐν τοῖς ἔργοις πράξεις καὶ κατὰ τὰς ἐν τοῖς λόγοις διερμηνεύσεις πρὸς ἑκάστας τῶν πόλεων. ταῦτʼ οὖν, ὦ Κριτία καὶ Ἑρμόκρατες,  ἐμαυτοῦ μὲν αὐτὸς κατέγνωκα μή ποτʼ ἂν δυνατὸς γενέσθαι τοὺς ἄνδρας καὶ τὴν πόλιν ἱκανῶς ἐγκωμιάσαι. καὶ τὸ μὲν ἐμὸν οὐδὲν θαυμαστόν· ἀλλὰ τὴν αὐτὴν δόξαν εἴληφα καὶ περὶ τῶν πάλαι γεγονότων καὶ περὶ τῶν νῦν ὄντων ποιητῶν, οὔτι τὸ ποιητικὸν ἀτιμάζων γένος, ἀλλὰ παντὶ δῆλον ὡς τὸ μιμητικὸν ἔθνος, οἷς ἂν ἐντραφῇ, ταῦτα μιμήσεται ῥᾷστα καὶ ἄριστα, τὸ δʼ ἐκτὸς τῆς τροφῆς ἑκάστοις  γιγνόμενον χαλεπὸν μὲν ἔργοις, ἔτι δὲ χαλεπώτερον λόγοις εὖ μιμεῖσθαι. τὸ δὲ τῶν σοφιστῶν γένος αὖ πολλῶν μὲν λόγων καὶ καλῶν ἄλλων μάλʼ ἔμπειρον ἥγημαι, φοβοῦμαι δὲ μή πως, ἅτε πλανητὸν ὂν κατὰ πόλεις οἰκήσεις τε ἰδίας οὐδαμῇ διῳκηκός, ἄστοχον ἅμα φιλοσόφων ἀνδρῶν ᾖ καὶ πολιτικῶν, ὅσʼ ἂν οἷά τε ἐν πολέμῳ καὶ μάχαις πράττοντες ἔργῳ καὶ λόγῳ προσομιλοῦντες ἑκάστοις πράττοιεν καὶ λέγοιεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ μὴν ὅτι γε τὰ μὲν τῶν ἀγαθῶν θρεπτέον ἔφαμεν εἶναι, τὰ δὲ τῶν κακῶν εἰς τὴν ἄλλην λάθρᾳ διαδοτέον πόλιν· ἐπαυξανομένων δὲ σκοποῦντας ἀεὶ τοὺς ἀξίους πάλιν ἀνάγειν δεῖν, τοὺς δὲ παρὰ σφίσιν ἀναξίους εἰς τὴν τῶν ἐπανιόντων χώραν μεταλλάττειν;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0002","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0003","text":"ΣΩ. ἆρʼ οὖν δὴ διεληλύθαμεν ἤδη καθάπερ χθές, ὡς ἐν κεφαλαίοις πάλιν ἐπανελθεῖν, ἢ ποθοῦμεν ἔτι τι τῶν ῥηθέντων, ὦ φίλε Γίμαιε, ὡς ἀπολειπόμενον;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0004","text":"ΤΙ. οὐδαμῶς, ἀλλὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἦν τὰ λεχθέντα, ὦ Σώκρατες.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","text":"ΣΩ. ἀκούοιτʼ ἂν ἤδη τὰ μετὰ ταῦτα περὶ τῆς πολιτείας ἣν διήλθομεν, οἷόν τι πρὸς αὐτὴν πεπονθὼς τυγχάνω. προσέοικεν δὲ δή τινί μοι τοιῷδε τὸ πάθος, οἷον εἴ τις ζῷα καλά που θεασάμενος, εἴτε ὑπὸ γραφῆς εἰργασμένα εἴτε καὶ ζῶντα ἀληθινῶς ἡσυχίαν δὲ ἄγοντα, εἰς ἐπιθυμίαν ἀφίκοιτο θεάσασθαι κινούμενά τε αὐτὰ καί τι τῶν τοῖς σώμασιν δοκούντων  προσήκειν κατὰ τὴν ἀγωνίαν ἀθλοῦντα· ταὐτὸν καὶ ἐγὼ πέπονθα πρὸς τὴν πόλιν ἣν διήλθομεν. ἡδέως γὰρ ἄν του λόγῳ διεξιόντος ἀκούσαιμʼ ἂν ἄθλους οὓς πόλις ἀθλεῖ, τούτους αὐτὴν ἀγωνιζομένην πρὸς πόλεις ἄλλας, πρεπόντως εἴς τε πόλεμον ἀφικομένην καὶ ἐν τῷ πολεμεῖν τὰ προσήκοντα ἀποδιδοῦσαν τῇ παιδείᾳ καὶ τροφῇ κατά τε τὰς ἐν τοῖς ἔργοις πράξεις καὶ κατὰ τὰς ἐν τοῖς λόγοις διερμηνεύσεις πρὸς ἑκάστας τῶν πόλεων. ταῦτʼ οὖν, ὦ Κριτία καὶ Ἑρμόκρατες,  ἐμαυτοῦ μὲν αὐτὸς κατέγνωκα μή ποτʼ ἂν δυνατὸς γενέσθαι τοὺς ἄνδρας καὶ τὴν πόλιν ἱκανῶς ἐγκωμιάσαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","text":"καὶ τὸ μὲν ἐμὸν οὐδὲν θαυμαστόν· ἀλλὰ τὴν αὐτὴν δόξαν εἴληφα καὶ περὶ τῶν πάλαι γεγονότων καὶ περὶ τῶν νῦν ὄντων ποιητῶν, οὔτι τὸ ποιητικὸν ἀτιμάζων γένος, ἀλλὰ παντὶ δῆλον ὡς τὸ μιμητικὸν ἔθνος, οἷς ἂν ἐντραφῇ, ταῦτα μιμήσεται ῥᾷστα καὶ ἄριστα, τὸ δʼ ἐκτὸς τῆς τροφῆς ἑκάστοις  γιγνόμενον χαλεπὸν μὲν ἔργοις, ἔτι δὲ χαλεπώτερον λόγοις εὖ μιμεῖσθαι. τὸ δὲ τῶν σοφιστῶν γένος αὖ πολλῶν μὲν λόγων καὶ καλῶν ἄλλων μάλʼ ἔμπειρον ἥγημαι, φοβοῦμαι δὲ μή πως, ἅτε πλανητὸν ὂν κατὰ πόλεις οἰκήσεις τε ἰδίας οὐδαμῇ διῳκηκός, ἄστοχον ἅμα φιλοσόφων ἀνδρῶν ᾖ καὶ πολιτικῶν, ὅσʼ ἂν οἷά τε ἐν πολέμῳ καὶ μάχαις πράττοντες ἔργῳ καὶ λόγῳ προσομιλοῦντες ἑκάστοις πράττοιεν καὶ λέγοιεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"d8fffb37150e4bcc4d01e2b3693c2ce9549a400d4fd2f4b1487d8582ee5f81c5","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224432240404Z_83caeeab","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 19","source_sha256":"d8fffb37150e4bcc4d01e2b3693c2ce9549a400d4fd2f4b1487d8582ee5f81c5","sha256":"e4734107586976f78199d98c581a20bd481cbe1d84d5f2ff0bef7a01ca3591da","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:32.240442+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","text":"Soc. And surely we said that the children of the good must be reared, but those of the bad must be secretly distributed among the rest of the city; and that, as they grow up, one must continually watch them and bring back up again those who are worthy, while transferring the unworthy among themselves into the country of those who are coming up in their place?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0002","text":"Tim. Thus.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0003","text":"Soc. Have we then now gone through, as it were yesterday, so as to return again in headings, or do we still desire anything of what was said, dear Timaeus, as having been omitted?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0004","text":"Tim. Not at all, Socrates; rather, those very things were what was said.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0004"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","text":"Soc. Then hear now what comes after this concerning the constitution which we went through, and what sort of feeling I happen to have toward it. My feeling is like something of this kind: as if someone, having somewhere beheld beautiful animals, whether fashioned by painting or indeed actually alive but remaining at rest, should come to desire to behold them in motion and competing in some contest in what seem to be the bodily activities appropriate to them. This is the very feeling I have toward the city which we went through. For I should gladly hear someone expounding in speech the contests that a city engages in, with this city contending against other cities, coming fittingly into war and, in waging war, rendering what is appropriate to its education and upbringing, both in its actions in deeds and in its interpretations in words toward each of the cities. So then, Critias and Hermocrates, I have myself judged that I should never be capable of adequately praising the men and the city.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","text":"And there is nothing surprising in my own case; but I have formed the same opinion also about poets of former times and those now existing—not dishonoring the poetic race at all, but because it is plain to everyone that the imitative tribe will imitate most easily and best those things amid which it has been brought up, whereas what arises outside each person's upbringing is difficult to imitate well in deeds, and still more difficult in words. As for the tribe of sophists, again, I consider it experienced in many speeches and many other fine matters; yet I fear that, since it is nomadic among cities and has never administered private dwellings anywhere, it may fall short, at the same time, of philosophic and political men in respect of the kinds of things that they might do in war and battles, both acting in deed and conversing in word with each individual, doing and saying.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006"]}],"source_digest":"9a57ebcef1a02b2c09f69b68a154ab3eee7d1d5b28d096adac450dd05b3edc40","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 19"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 19","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2","title":"Section 20","order":4,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2","text":"ΣΩ. καταλέλειπται δὴ τὸ τῆς ὑμετέρας ἕξεως γένος,  ἅμα ἀμφοτέρων φύσει καὶ τροφῇ μετέχον. Τίμαιός τε γὰρ ὅδε, εὐνομωτάτης ὢν πόλεως τῆς ἐν Ἰταλίᾳ Λοκρίδος, οὐσίᾳ καὶ γένει οὐδενὸς ὕστερος ὢν τῶν ἐκεῖ, τὰς μεγίστας μὲν ἀρχάς τε καὶ τιμὰς τῶν ἐν τῇ πόλει μετακεχείρισται, φιλοσοφίας δʼ αὖ κατʼ ἐμὴν δόξαν ἐπʼ ἄκρον ἁπάσης ἐλήλυθεν· Κριτίαν δέ που πάντες οἱ τῇδε ἴσμεν οὐδενὸς ἰδιώτην ὄντα ὧν λέγομεν. τῆς δὲ Ἑρμοκράτους αὖ περὶ φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς, πρὸς ἅπαντα ταῦτʼ εἶναι ἱκανὴν πολλῶν μαρτυρούντων  πιστευτέον. διὸ καὶ χθὲς ἐγὼ διανοούμενος, ὑμῶν δεομένων τὰ περὶ τῆς πολιτείας διελθεῖν, προθύμως ἐχαριζόμην, εἰδὼς ὅτι τὸν ἑξῆς λόγον οὐδένες ἂν ὑμῶν ἐθελόντων ἱκανώτερον ἀποδοῖεν—εἰς γὰρ πόλεμον πρέποντα καταστήσαντες τὴν πόλιν ἅπαντʼ αὐτῇ τὰ προσήκοντα ἀποδοῖτʼ ἂν μόνοι τῶν νῦν—εἰπὼν δὴ τἀπιταχθέντα ἀντεπέταξα ὑμῖν ἃ καὶ νῦν λέγω. συνωμολογήσατʼ οὖν κοινῇ σκεψάμενοι πρὸς ὑμᾶς  αὐτοὺς εἰς νῦν ἀνταποδώσειν μοι τὰ τῶν λόγων ξένια, πάρειμί τε οὖν δὴ κεκοσμημένος ἐπʼ αὐτὰ καὶ πάντων ἑτοιμότατος ὢν δέχεσθαι.\n\n \n\nΕΡ. καὶ μὲν δή, καθάπερ εἶπεν Τίμαιος ὅδε, ὦ Σώκρατες, οὔτε ἐλλείψομεν προθυμίας οὐδὲν οὔτε ἔστιν οὐδεμία πρόφασις ἡμῖν τοῦ μὴ δρᾶν ταῦτα· ὥστε καὶ χθές, εὐθὺς ἐνθένδε ἐπειδὴ παρὰ Κριτίαν πρὸς τὸν ξενῶνα οὗ καὶ καταλύομεν ἀφικόμεθα, καὶ ἔτι πρότερον καθʼ ὁδὸν αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἐσκοποῦμεν.  ὅδε οὖν ἡμῖν λόγον εἰσηγήσατο ἐκ παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς· ὃν καὶ νῦν λέγε, ὦ Κριτία, τῷδε, ἵνα συνδοκιμάσῃ πρὸς τὴν ἐπίταξιν εἴτʼ ἐπιτήδειος εἴτε ἀνεπιτήδειός ἐστι.\n\n \n\nΚΡ. ταῦτα χρὴ δρᾶν, εἰ καὶ τῷ τρίτῳ κοινωνῷ Τιμαίῳ συνδοκεῖ.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. δοκεῖ μήν.\n\n \n\nΚΡ. ἄκουε δή, ὦ Σώκρατες, λόγου μάλα μὲν ἀτόπου, παντάπασί γε μὴν ἀληθοῦς, ὡς ὁ τῶν ἑπτὰ σοφώτατος  Σόλων ποτʼ ἔφη. ἦν μὲν οὖν οἰκεῖος καὶ σφόδρα φίλος ἡμῖν Δρωπίδου τοῦ προπάππου, καθάπερ λέγει πολλαχοῦ καὶ αὐτὸς ἐν τῇ ποιήσει·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","text":"ΣΩ. καταλέλειπται δὴ τὸ τῆς ὑμετέρας ἕξεως γένος,  ἅμα ἀμφοτέρων φύσει καὶ τροφῇ μετέχον. Τίμαιός τε γὰρ ὅδε, εὐνομωτάτης ὢν πόλεως τῆς ἐν Ἰταλίᾳ Λοκρίδος, οὐσίᾳ καὶ γένει οὐδενὸς ὕστερος ὢν τῶν ἐκεῖ, τὰς μεγίστας μὲν ἀρχάς τε καὶ τιμὰς τῶν ἐν τῇ πόλει μετακεχείρισται, φιλοσοφίας δʼ αὖ κατʼ ἐμὴν δόξαν ἐπʼ ἄκρον ἁπάσης ἐλήλυθεν· Κριτίαν δέ που πάντες οἱ τῇδε ἴσμεν οὐδενὸς ἰδιώτην ὄντα ὧν λέγομεν. τῆς δὲ Ἑρμοκράτους αὖ περὶ φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς, πρὸς ἅπαντα ταῦτʼ εἶναι ἱκανὴν πολλῶν μαρτυρούντων  πιστευτέον. διὸ καὶ χθὲς ἐγὼ διανοούμενος, ὑμῶν δεομένων τὰ περὶ τῆς πολιτείας διελθεῖν, προθύμως ἐχαριζόμην, εἰδὼς ὅτι τὸν ἑξῆς λόγον οὐδένες ἂν ὑμῶν ἐθελόντων ἱκανώτερον ἀποδοῖεν—εἰς γὰρ πόλεμον πρέποντα καταστήσαντες τὴν πόλιν ἅπαντʼ αὐτῇ τὰ προσήκοντα ἀποδοῖτʼ ἂν μόνοι τῶν νῦν—εἰπὼν δὴ τἀπιταχθέντα ἀντεπέταξα ὑμῖν ἃ καὶ νῦν λέγω.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","text":"συνωμολογήσατʼ οὖν κοινῇ σκεψάμενοι πρὸς ὑμᾶς  αὐτοὺς εἰς νῦν ἀνταποδώσειν μοι τὰ τῶν λόγων ξένια, πάρειμί τε οὖν δὴ κεκοσμημένος ἐπʼ αὐτὰ καὶ πάντων ἑτοιμότατος ὢν δέχεσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","text":"ΕΡ. καὶ μὲν δή, καθάπερ εἶπεν Τίμαιος ὅδε, ὦ Σώκρατες, οὔτε ἐλλείψομεν προθυμίας οὐδὲν οὔτε ἔστιν οὐδεμία πρόφασις ἡμῖν τοῦ μὴ δρᾶν ταῦτα· ὥστε καὶ χθές, εὐθὺς ἐνθένδε ἐπειδὴ παρὰ Κριτίαν πρὸς τὸν ξενῶνα οὗ καὶ καταλύομεν ἀφικόμεθα, καὶ ἔτι πρότερον καθʼ ὁδὸν αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἐσκοποῦμεν.  ὅδε οὖν ἡμῖν λόγον εἰσηγήσατο ἐκ παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς· ὃν καὶ νῦν λέγε, ὦ Κριτία, τῷδε, ἵνα συνδοκιμάσῃ πρὸς τὴν ἐπίταξιν εἴτʼ ἐπιτήδειος εἴτε ἀνεπιτήδειός ἐστι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0004","text":"ΚΡ. ταῦτα χρὴ δρᾶν, εἰ καὶ τῷ τρίτῳ κοινωνῷ Τιμαίῳ συνδοκεῖ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0005","text":"ΤΙ. δοκεῖ μήν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","text":"ΚΡ. ἄκουε δή, ὦ Σώκρατες, λόγου μάλα μὲν ἀτόπου, παντάπασί γε μὴν ἀληθοῦς, ὡς ὁ τῶν ἑπτὰ σοφώτατος  Σόλων ποτʼ ἔφη. ἦν μὲν οὖν οἰκεῖος καὶ σφόδρα φίλος ἡμῖν Δρωπίδου τοῦ προπάππου, καθάπερ λέγει πολλαχοῦ καὶ αὐτὸς ἐν τῇ ποιήσει·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"f44c739210257040c53701408a74f9669e4d56f747cda13651d97e0f681bb708","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224440056432Z_c9f3fffd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 20","source_sha256":"f44c739210257040c53701408a74f9669e4d56f747cda13651d97e0f681bb708","sha256":"60a14930a77a530edcbecabdea8db5e6fc3eddf7a61d4e5a4bd45a0d1cd01105","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:40.056473+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","text":"SOC. There remains, then, the class of your disposition, sharing by nature and upbringing in both. For this Timaeus here, being from Locri in Italy, a city most well governed, and inferior to none there in property and birth, has held the greatest offices and honors in his city, and in philosophy too, in my judgment, has reached the summit of all attainment. And as for Critias, all of us here know that he is no layman in any of the matters of which we speak. Concerning Hermocrates, moreover, we must believe the testimony of many that he is, by nature and upbringing, competent for all these things. Therefore yesterday too, when you requested that I go through the matters concerning the constitution, I readily complied, knowing that no one would be more capable than you, if willing, of rendering the discourse that follows—for, having placed the city in circumstances suited to war, you alone among men now living would assign to it all that befits it. So, having spoken what was enjoined upon me, I in turn imposed upon you what I am now saying.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","text":"You therefore agreed among yourselves, after deliberating together, to repay me by now the guest-gift of speeches; and so I have come, adorned for it and altogether most ready to receive it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","text":"HER. Indeed, Socrates, as Timaeus here said, we shall be lacking in eagerness in no respect, nor is there any excuse for us not to do these things. Accordingly, yesterday too, immediately after we left here and arrived at Critias's, at the lodging where we are also staying, and even earlier on the way, we were considering these very matters. So this man introduced to us a story from an ancient report. Tell it now, then, Critias, to this man, so that he may approve with regard to the injunction whether it is suitable or unsuitable.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0004","text":"CR. This must be done, if it also seems good to Timaeus, our third partner.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0004"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0005","text":"TI. It does indeed seem good.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0005"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","text":"CR. Listen then, Socrates, to a story most strange, yet altogether true, as Solon, the wisest of the seven, once declared. He was a kinsman and very great friend of our great-grandfather Dropides, as he himself says in many places in his poetry;","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006"]}],"source_digest":"06072d7feff43023a4a28b5fd99eba915d38db0d5f81eef9c5effd3cd81e7fb0","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 20"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 20","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4","title":"Section 21","order":5,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4","text":"ΚΡ. πρὸς δὲ Κριτίαν τὸν ἡμέτερον πάππον εἶπεν, ὡς ἀπεμνημόνευεν αὖ πρὸς ἡμᾶς ὁ γέρων, ὅτι μεγάλα καὶ θαυμαστὰ τῆσδʼ εἴη παλαιὰ ἔργα τῆς πόλεως ὑπὸ χρόνου καὶ φθορᾶς ἀνθρώπων ἠφανισμένα, πάντων δὲ ἓν μέγιστον,  οὗ νῦν ἐπιμνησθεῖσιν πρέπον ἂν ἡμῖν εἴη σοί τε ἀποδοῦναι χάριν καὶ τὴν θεὸν ἅμα ἐν τῇ πανηγύρει δικαίως τε καὶ ἀληθῶς οἷόνπερ ὑμνοῦντας ἐγκωμιάζειν.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. εὖ λέγεις. ἀλλὰ δὴ ποῖον ἔργον τοῦτο Κριτίας οὐ λεγόμενον μέν, ὡς δὲ πραχθὲν ὄντως ὑπὸ τῆσδε τῆς πόλεως ἀρχαῖον διηγεῖτο κατὰ τὴν Σόλωνος ἀκοήν;\n\n \n\nΚΡ. ἐγὼ φράσω, παλαιὸν ἀκηκοὼς λόγον οὐ νέου ἀνδρός. ἦν μὲν γὰρ δὴ τότε Κριτίας, ὡς ἔφη, σχεδὸν ἐγγὺς  ἤδη τῶν ἐνενήκοντα ἐτῶν, ἐγὼ δέ πῃ μάλιστα δεκέτης· ἡ δὲ Κουρεῶτις ἡμῖν οὖσα ἐτύγχανεν Ἀπατουρίων. τὸ δὴ τῆς ἑορτῆς σύνηθες ἑκάστοτε καὶ τότε συνέβη τοῖς παισίν· ἆθλα γὰρ ἡμῖν οἱ πατέρες ἔθεσαν ῥαψῳδίας. πολλῶν μὲν οὖν δὴ καὶ πολλὰ ἐλέχθη ποιητῶν ποιήματα, ἅτε δὲ νέα κατʼ ἐκεῖνον τὸν χρόνον ὄντα τὰ Σόλωνος πολλοὶ τῶν παίδων ᾔσαμεν. εἶπεν οὖν τις τῶν φρατέρων, εἴτε δὴ δοκοῦν αὐτῷ τότε εἴτε καὶ χάριν τινὰ τῷ Κριτίᾳ φέρων, δοκεῖν οἱ τά τε  ἄλλα σοφώτατον γεγονέναι Σόλωνα καὶ κατὰ τὴν ποίησιν αὖ τῶν ποιητῶν πάντων ἐλευθεριώτατον. ὁ δὴ γέρων— σφόδρα γὰρ οὖν μέμνημαι—μάλα τε ἥσθη καὶ διαμειδιάσας εἶπεν· εἴ γε, ὦ Ἀμύνανδρε, μὴ παρέργῳ τῇ ποιήσει κατεχρήσατο, ἀλλʼ ἐσπουδάκει καθάπερ ἄλλοι, τόν τε λόγον ὃν ἀπʼ Αἰγύπτου δεῦρο ἠνέγκατο ἀπετέλεσεν, καὶ μὴ διὰ τὰς στάσεις ὑπὸ κακῶν τε ἄλλων ὅσα ηὗρεν ἐνθάδε ἥκων ἠναγκάσθη  καταμελῆσαι, κατά γε ἐμὴν δόξαν οὔτε Ἡσίοδος οὔτε Ὅμηρος οὔτε ἄλλος οὐδεὶς ποιητὴς εὐδοκιμώτερος ἐγένετο ἄν ποτε αὐτοῦ. τίς δʼ ἦν ὁ λόγος, ἦ δʼ ὅς, ὦ Κριτία; ἦ περὶ μεγίστης, ἔφη, καὶ ὀνομαστοτάτης πασῶν δικαιότατʼ ἂν πράξεως οὔσης, ἣν ἥδε ἡ πόλις ἔπραξε μέν, διὰ δὲ χρόνον καὶ φθορὰν τῶν ἐργασαμένων οὐ διήρκεσε δεῦρο ὁ λόγος. λέγε ἐξ ἀρχῆς, ἦ δʼ ὅς, τί τε καὶ πῶς καὶ παρὰ τίνων ὡς ἀληθῆ διακηκοὼς ἔλεγεν ὁ Σόλων.  ἔστιν τις κατʼ Αἴγυπτον, ἦ δʼ ὅς, ἐν τῷ Δέλτα, περὶ ὃν κατὰ κορυφὴν σχίζεται τὸ τοῦ Νείλου ῥεῦμα Σαϊτικὸς ἐπικαλούμενος νομός, τούτου δὲ τοῦ νομοῦ μεγίστη πόλις Σάις—ὅθεν δὴ καὶ Ἄμασις ἦν ὁ βασιλεύς—οἷς τῆς πόλεως θεὸς ἀρχηγός τίς ἐστιν, Αἰγυπτιστὶ μὲν τοὔνομα Νηίθ, Ἑλληνιστὶ δέ, ὡς ὁ ἐκείνων λόγος, Ἀθηνᾶ· μάλα δὲ φιλαθήναιοι καί τινα τρόπον οἰκεῖοι τῶνδʼ εἶναί φασιν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. πρὸς δὲ Κριτίαν τὸν ἡμέτερον πάππον εἶπεν, ὡς ἀπεμνημόνευεν αὖ πρὸς ἡμᾶς ὁ γέρων, ὅτι μεγάλα καὶ θαυμαστὰ τῆσδʼ εἴη παλαιὰ ἔργα τῆς πόλεως ὑπὸ χρόνου καὶ φθορᾶς ἀνθρώπων ἠφανισμένα, πάντων δὲ ἓν μέγιστον,  οὗ νῦν ἐπιμνησθεῖσιν πρέπον ἂν ἡμῖν εἴη σοί τε ἀποδοῦναι χάριν καὶ τὴν θεὸν ἅμα ἐν τῇ πανηγύρει δικαίως τε καὶ ἀληθῶς οἷόνπερ ὑμνοῦντας ἐγκωμιάζειν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","text":"ΣΩ. εὖ λέγεις. ἀλλὰ δὴ ποῖον ἔργον τοῦτο Κριτίας οὐ λεγόμενον μέν, ὡς δὲ πραχθὲν ὄντως ὑπὸ τῆσδε τῆς πόλεως ἀρχαῖον διηγεῖτο κατὰ τὴν Σόλωνος ἀκοήν;","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","text":"ΚΡ. ἐγὼ φράσω, παλαιὸν ἀκηκοὼς λόγον οὐ νέου ἀνδρός. ἦν μὲν γὰρ δὴ τότε Κριτίας, ὡς ἔφη, σχεδὸν ἐγγὺς  ἤδη τῶν ἐνενήκοντα ἐτῶν, ἐγὼ δέ πῃ μάλιστα δεκέτης· ἡ δὲ Κουρεῶτις ἡμῖν οὖσα ἐτύγχανεν Ἀπατουρίων. τὸ δὴ τῆς ἑορτῆς σύνηθες ἑκάστοτε καὶ τότε συνέβη τοῖς παισίν· ἆθλα γὰρ ἡμῖν οἱ πατέρες ἔθεσαν ῥαψῳδίας. πολλῶν μὲν οὖν δὴ καὶ πολλὰ ἐλέχθη ποιητῶν ποιήματα, ἅτε δὲ νέα κατʼ ἐκεῖνον τὸν χρόνον ὄντα τὰ Σόλωνος πολλοὶ τῶν παίδων ᾔσαμεν. εἶπεν οὖν τις τῶν φρατέρων, εἴτε δὴ δοκοῦν αὐτῷ τότε εἴτε καὶ χάριν τινὰ τῷ Κριτίᾳ φέρων, δοκεῖν οἱ τά τε  ἄλλα σοφώτατον γεγονέναι Σόλωνα καὶ κατὰ τὴν ποίησιν αὖ τῶν ποιητῶν πάντων ἐλευθεριώτατον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","text":"ὁ δὴ γέρων— σφόδρα γὰρ οὖν μέμνημαι—μάλα τε ἥσθη καὶ διαμειδιάσας εἶπεν· εἴ γε, ὦ Ἀμύνανδρε, μὴ παρέργῳ τῇ ποιήσει κατεχρήσατο, ἀλλʼ ἐσπουδάκει καθάπερ ἄλλοι, τόν τε λόγον ὃν ἀπʼ Αἰγύπτου δεῦρο ἠνέγκατο ἀπετέλεσεν, καὶ μὴ διὰ τὰς στάσεις ὑπὸ κακῶν τε ἄλλων ὅσα ηὗρεν ἐνθάδε ἥκων ἠναγκάσθη  καταμελῆσαι, κατά γε ἐμὴν δόξαν οὔτε Ἡσίοδος οὔτε Ὅμηρος οὔτε ἄλλος οὐδεὶς ποιητὴς εὐδοκιμώτερος ἐγένετο ἄν ποτε αὐτοῦ. τίς δʼ ἦν ὁ λόγος, ἦ δʼ ὅς, ὦ Κριτία; ἦ περὶ μεγίστης, ἔφη, καὶ ὀνομαστοτάτης πασῶν δικαιότατʼ ἂν πράξεως οὔσης, ἣν ἥδε ἡ πόλις ἔπραξε μέν, διὰ δὲ χρόνον καὶ φθορὰν τῶν ἐργασαμένων οὐ διήρκεσε δεῦρο ὁ λόγος. λέγε ἐξ ἀρχῆς, ἦ δʼ ὅς, τί τε καὶ πῶς καὶ παρὰ τίνων ὡς ἀληθῆ διακηκοὼς ἔλεγεν ὁ Σόλων.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","text":"ἔστιν τις κατʼ Αἴγυπτον, ἦ δʼ ὅς, ἐν τῷ Δέλτα, περὶ ὃν κατὰ κορυφὴν σχίζεται τὸ τοῦ Νείλου ῥεῦμα Σαϊτικὸς ἐπικαλούμενος νομός, τούτου δὲ τοῦ νομοῦ μεγίστη πόλις Σάις—ὅθεν δὴ καὶ Ἄμασις ἦν ὁ βασιλεύς—οἷς τῆς πόλεως θεὸς ἀρχηγός τίς ἐστιν, Αἰγυπτιστὶ μὲν τοὔνομα Νηίθ, Ἑλληνιστὶ δέ, ὡς ὁ ἐκείνων λόγος, Ἀθηνᾶ· μάλα δὲ φιλαθήναιοι καί τινα τρόπον οἰκεῖοι τῶνδʼ εἶναί φασιν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"abe71c6986f79546dcc408876657b3b965835c24554f2dead7159fc18d2e0718","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224448950605Z_d5c28481","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 21","source_sha256":"abe71c6986f79546dcc408876657b3b965835c24554f2dead7159fc18d2e0718","sha256":"3f27f1bb73aaa8a2dc07fa5e27e021e3631e6755601be840c86b1585a59627d4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:48.950638+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","text":"CRIT. And concerning Critias, our grandfather, he said—as the old man in turn recollected to us—that there were great and marvelous ancient deeds of this city, obliterated by time and the destruction of men; but one of them was greatest of all, which, now that we have mentioned it, it would be fitting for us both to repay you a favor and at the same time, during the festival, justly and truly, as though hymning her, to praise the goddess.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","text":"SOC. Well said. But what was this deed, Critias, which he related, not as merely spoken of, but as truly accomplished in ancient times by this city, according to Solon's report?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","text":"CRIT. I shall tell it, having heard an old account from no young man. For Critias was then, as he said, already nearly ninety years old, while I was about ten; and it happened that the Cureotis of the Apaturia was our festival. What was customary at the festival on each occasion happened then too for us boys: our fathers set prizes for us in recitation. So, many poems by many poets were recited; and since Solon's poems were new at that time, many of the boys sang them. Then one of the members of the brotherhood said, whether because he really thought so then or because he was paying some compliment to Critias, that Solon seemed to him to have become both wisest in other respects and, again, in poetry the most liberal of all poets.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","text":"The old man—for I remember it very clearly indeed—was greatly pleased and, smiling, said: “Yes, Amynander, if he had not employed poetry as a by-work, but had devoted himself to it seriously like others, and had completed the account which he brought here from Egypt, and had not been compelled, because of the factions and the other evils that he found here upon his arrival, to neglect it, then, in my opinion, neither Hesiod nor Homer nor any other poet would ever have become more renowned than he.” “And what was the account, Critias?” said he. “It was about a deed,” he said, “the greatest and most famous of all, and most justly so, which this city performed; but through time and the destruction of those who performed it, the account did not endure down to us.” “Tell from the beginning,” said he, “what it was, and how, and from whom Solon said it, having heard it as true.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","text":"“There is in Egypt,” said he, “in the Delta, around which, at its apex, the stream of the Nile divides, a district called the Saïtic district; and the greatest city of this district is Saïs—from which King Amasis too came. They have a certain goddess as founder of the city, whose name in Egyptian is Neith, and in Greek, according to their account, Athena. They are very fond of Athens and claim to be in some way akin to our people.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005"]}],"source_digest":"bd4094969794d27dac8f857d9d177d96501bed87c951ab4a09f3bc8fde190d90","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 21"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 21","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5","title":"Section 22","order":6,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5","text":"ΚΡ. οἷ δὴ Σόλων ἔφη πορευθεὶς σφόδρα τε γενέσθαι παρʼ αὐτοῖς ἔντιμος,  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ παλαιὰ ἀνερωτῶν ποτε τοὺς μάλιστα περὶ ταῦτα τῶν ἱερέων ἐμπείρους, σχεδὸν οὔτε αὑτὸν οὔτε ἄλλον Ἕλληνα οὐδένα οὐδὲν ὡς ἔπος εἰπεῖν εἰδότα περὶ τῶν τοιούτων ἀνευρεῖν. καί ποτε προαγαγεῖν βουληθεὶς αὐτοὺς περὶ τῶν ἀρχαίων εἰς λόγους, τῶν τῇδε τὰ ἀρχαιότατα λέγειν ἐπιχειρεῖν, περὶ Φορωνέως τε τοῦ πρώτου λεχθέντος καὶ Νιόβης, καὶ μετὰ τὸν κατακλυσμὸν αὖ περὶ Δευκαλίωνος  καὶ Πύρρας ὡς διεγένοντο μυθολογεῖν, καὶ τοὺς ἐξ αὐτῶν γενεαλογεῖν, καὶ τὰ τῶν ἐτῶν ὅσα ἦν οἷς ἔλεγεν πειρᾶσθαι διαμνημονεύων τοὺς χρόνους ἀριθμεῖν· καί τινα εἰπεῖν τῶν ἱερέων εὖ μάλα παλαιόν· ὦ Σόλων, Σόλων, Ἕλληνες ἀεὶ παῖδές ἐστε, γέρων δὲ Ἕλλην οὐκ ἔστιν. ἀκούσας οὖν, πῶς τί τοῦτο λέγεις; φάναι.νέοι ἐστέ, εἰπεῖν, τὰς ψυχὰς πάντες· οὐδεμίαν γὰρ ἐν αὐταῖς ἔχετε διʼ ἀρχαίαν ἀκοὴν παλαιὰν δόξαν οὐδὲ μάθημα χρόνῳ πολιὸν οὐδέν. τὸ  δὲ τούτων αἴτιον τόδε. πολλαὶ κατὰ πολλὰ φθοραὶ γεγόνασιν ἀνθρώπων καὶ ἔσονται, πυρὶ μὲν καὶ ὕδατι μέγισται, μυρίοις δὲ ἄλλοις ἕτεραι βραχύτεραι. τὸ γὰρ οὖν καὶ παρʼ ὑμῖν λεγόμενον, ὥς ποτε Φαέθων Ἡλίου παῖς τὸ τοῦ πατρὸς ἅρμα ζεύξας διὰ τὸ μὴ δυνατὸς εἶναι κατὰ τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς ὁδὸν ἐλαύνειν τά τʼ ἐπὶ γῆς συνέκαυσεν καὶ αὐτὸς κεραυνωθεὶς διεφθάρη, τοῦτο μύθου μὲν σχῆμα ἔχον λέγεται, τὸ δὲ  ἀληθές ἐστι τῶν περὶ γῆν κατʼ οὐρανὸν ἰόντων παράλλαξις καὶ διὰ μακρῶν χρόνων γιγνομένη τῶν ἐπὶ γῆς πυρὶ πολλῷ φθορά. τότε οὖν ὅσοι κατʼ ὄρη καὶ ἐν ὑψηλοῖς τόποις καὶ ἐν ξηροῖς οἰκοῦσιν μᾶλλον διόλλυνται τῶν ποταμοῖς καὶ θαλάττῃ προσοικούντων· ἡμῖν δὲ ὁ Νεῖλος εἴς τε τἆλλα σωτὴρ καὶ τότε ἐκ ταύτης τῆς ἀπορίας σῴζει λυόμενος. ὅταν δʼ αὖ θεοὶ τὴν γῆν ὕδασιν καθαίροντες κατακλύζωσιν, οἱ μὲν ἐν τοῖς ὄρεσιν διασῴζονται βουκόλοι νομῆς τε, οἱ δʼ ἐν ταῖς  παρʼ ὑμῖν πόλεσιν εἰς τὴν θάλατταν ὑπὸ τῶν ποταμῶν φέρονται· κατὰ δὲ τήνδε χώραν οὔτε τότε οὔτε ἄλλοτε ἄνωθεν ἐπὶ τὰς ἀρούρας ὕδωρ ἐπιρρεῖ, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον κάτωθεν πᾶν ἐπανιέναι πέφυκεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. οἷ δὴ Σόλων ἔφη πορευθεὶς σφόδρα τε γενέσθαι παρʼ αὐτοῖς ἔντιμος,  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ παλαιὰ ἀνερωτῶν ποτε τοὺς μάλιστα περὶ ταῦτα τῶν ἱερέων ἐμπείρους, σχεδὸν οὔτε αὑτὸν οὔτε ἄλλον Ἕλληνα οὐδένα οὐδὲν ὡς ἔπος εἰπεῖν εἰδότα περὶ τῶν τοιούτων ἀνευρεῖν. καί ποτε προαγαγεῖν βουληθεὶς αὐτοὺς περὶ τῶν ἀρχαίων εἰς λόγους, τῶν τῇδε τὰ ἀρχαιότατα λέγειν ἐπιχειρεῖν, περὶ Φορωνέως τε τοῦ πρώτου λεχθέντος καὶ Νιόβης, καὶ μετὰ τὸν κατακλυσμὸν αὖ περὶ Δευκαλίωνος  καὶ Πύρρας ὡς διεγένοντο μυθολογεῖν, καὶ τοὺς ἐξ αὐτῶν γενεαλογεῖν, καὶ τὰ τῶν ἐτῶν ὅσα ἦν οἷς ἔλεγεν πειρᾶσθαι διαμνημονεύων τοὺς χρόνους ἀριθμεῖν· καί τινα εἰπεῖν τῶν ἱερέων εὖ μάλα παλαιόν· ὦ Σόλων, Σόλων, Ἕλληνες ἀεὶ παῖδές ἐστε, γέρων δὲ Ἕλλην οὐκ ἔστιν. ἀκούσας οὖν, πῶς τί τοῦτο λέγεις; φάναι.νέοι ἐστέ, εἰπεῖν, τὰς ψυχὰς πάντες· οὐδεμίαν γὰρ ἐν αὐταῖς ἔχετε διʼ ἀρχαίαν ἀκοὴν παλαιὰν δόξαν οὐδὲ μάθημα χρόνῳ πολιὸν οὐδέν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","text":"τὸ  δὲ τούτων αἴτιον τόδε. πολλαὶ κατὰ πολλὰ φθοραὶ γεγόνασιν ἀνθρώπων καὶ ἔσονται, πυρὶ μὲν καὶ ὕδατι μέγισται, μυρίοις δὲ ἄλλοις ἕτεραι βραχύτεραι. τὸ γὰρ οὖν καὶ παρʼ ὑμῖν λεγόμενον, ὥς ποτε Φαέθων Ἡλίου παῖς τὸ τοῦ πατρὸς ἅρμα ζεύξας διὰ τὸ μὴ δυνατὸς εἶναι κατὰ τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς ὁδὸν ἐλαύνειν τά τʼ ἐπὶ γῆς συνέκαυσεν καὶ αὐτὸς κεραυνωθεὶς διεφθάρη, τοῦτο μύθου μὲν σχῆμα ἔχον λέγεται, τὸ δὲ  ἀληθές ἐστι τῶν περὶ γῆν κατʼ οὐρανὸν ἰόντων παράλλαξις καὶ διὰ μακρῶν χρόνων γιγνομένη τῶν ἐπὶ γῆς πυρὶ πολλῷ φθορά. τότε οὖν ὅσοι κατʼ ὄρη καὶ ἐν ὑψηλοῖς τόποις καὶ ἐν ξηροῖς οἰκοῦσιν μᾶλλον διόλλυνται τῶν ποταμοῖς καὶ θαλάττῃ προσοικούντων· ἡμῖν δὲ ὁ Νεῖλος εἴς τε τἆλλα σωτὴρ καὶ τότε ἐκ ταύτης τῆς ἀπορίας σῴζει λυόμενος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","text":"ὅταν δʼ αὖ θεοὶ τὴν γῆν ὕδασιν καθαίροντες κατακλύζωσιν, οἱ μὲν ἐν τοῖς ὄρεσιν διασῴζονται βουκόλοι νομῆς τε, οἱ δʼ ἐν ταῖς  παρʼ ὑμῖν πόλεσιν εἰς τὴν θάλατταν ὑπὸ τῶν ποταμῶν φέρονται· κατὰ δὲ τήνδε χώραν οὔτε τότε οὔτε ἄλλοτε ἄνωθεν ἐπὶ τὰς ἀρούρας ὕδωρ ἐπιρρεῖ, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον κάτωθεν πᾶν ἐπανιέναι πέφυκεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"41490b74c334b8ba8e8aedf64c67e8b6b555ab1ec1e7d4029d75a8a713cfc7de","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224456854807Z_519b7712","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 22","source_sha256":"41490b74c334b8ba8e8aedf64c67e8b6b555ab1ec1e7d4029d75a8a713cfc7de","sha256":"55260a1d0181c72cbde4e5028d247ef599e78d5b2c64e0865d361840f77aed81","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:44:56.854998+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","text":"CR. There, Solon said that he had become highly honoured among them; and indeed, when he once questioned the priests most expert in such matters about antiquity, he found that neither he himself nor any other Greek, so to speak, knew anything whatever about things of this kind. And once, wishing to draw them into conversation about ancient matters, he began to recount the most ancient things known here—about Phoroneus, said to have been the first man, and Niobe; and after the deluge he told myths again about Deucalion and Pyrrha, how they survived, and traced the genealogies from them, and, recalling the number of years in the events he was recounting, attempted to calculate the times. Then one of the priests, a very old man, said: “Solon, Solon, you Greeks are always children; there is no old Greek.” Hearing this, he said, “What do you mean by saying this?” “You are all young in your souls,” he said; “for in them you possess no old opinion derived through ancient hearing, nor any learning grey with age.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","text":"The cause of this is as follows. There have been, and will be, many destructions of humankind in many ways, the greatest by fire and water, and others lesser ones by countless other means. For the story told among you too, that once Phaethon, son of Helios, having yoked his father's chariot, because he was unable to drive it along his father's course, burned up the things upon earth and was himself destroyed when struck by lightning—for all that this is told in the form of a myth, its truth is a deviation of the bodies moving in the heavens around the earth, and, occurring over long intervals of time, a destruction by much fire of the things upon earth. Then those who dwell in mountains and in high and dry places perish more than those dwelling near rivers and the sea; but for us the Nile, our saviour in other respects also, then saves us from this difficulty by being released.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","text":"But whenever the gods, cleansing the earth with waters, inundate it, those in the mountains—herdsmen and shepherds—are saved, whereas those in the cities among you are carried by the rivers into the sea. But in this country neither then nor at any other time does water flow down from above upon the fields; on the contrary, everything is naturally disposed to rise up from below.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"59e25e389886c49dcc0daf67d9cff08ff546836268d0d7e361d6c8c2c17185af","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 22"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 22","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6","title":"Section 23","order":7,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6","text":"ΚΡ. ὅθεν καὶ διʼ ἃς αἰτίας τἀνθάδε σῳζόμενα λέγεται παλαιότατα· τὸ δὲ ἀληθές, ἐν πᾶσιν τοῖς τόποις ὅπου μὴ χειμὼν ἐξαίσιος ἢ καῦμα ἀπείργει, πλέον,  τοτὲ δὲ ἔλαττον ἀεὶ γένος ἐστὶν ἀνθρώπων. ὅσα δὲ ἢ παρʼ ὑμῖν ἢ τῇδε ἢ καὶ κατʼ ἄλλον τόπον ὧν ἀκοῇ ἴσμεν, εἴ πού τι καλὸν ἢ μέγα γέγονεν ἢ καί τινα διαφορὰν ἄλλην ἔχον, πάντα γεγραμμένα ἐκ παλαιοῦ τῇδʼ ἐστὶν ἐν τοῖς ἱεροῖς καὶ σεσωσμένα· τὰ δὲ παρʼ ὑμῖν καὶ τοῖς ἄλλοις ἄρτι κατεσκευασμένα ἑκάστοτε τυγχάνει γράμμασι καὶ ἅπασιν ὁπόσων πόλεις δέονται, καὶ πάλιν διʼ εἰωθότων ἐτῶν ὥσπερ νόσημα ἥκει φερόμενον αὐτοῖς ῥεῦμα οὐράνιον καὶ τοὺς ἀγραμμάτους  τε καὶ ἀμούσους ἔλιπεν ὑμῶν, ὥστε πάλιν ἐξ ἀρχῆς οἷον νέοι γίγνεσθε, οὐδὲν εἰδότες οὔτε τῶν τῇδε οὔτε τῶν παρʼ ὑμῖν, ὅσα ἦν ἐν τοῖς παλαιοῖς χρόνοις. τὰ γοῦν νυνδὴ γενεαλογηθέντα, ὦ Σόλων, περὶ τῶν παρʼ ὑμῖν ἃ διῆλθες, παίδων βραχύ τι διαφέρει μύθων, οἳ πρῶτον μὲν ἕνα γῆς κατακλυσμὸν μέμνησθε πολλῶν ἔμπροσθεν γεγονότων, ἔτι δὲ τὸ κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον γένος ἐπʼ ἀνθρώπους ἐν τῇ χώρᾳ παρʼ ὑμῖν οὐκ ἴστε γεγονός, ἐξ ὧν σύ τε καὶ πᾶσα ἡ  πόλις ἔστιν τὰ νῦν ὑμῶν, περιλειφθέντος ποτὲ σπέρματος βραχέος, ἀλλʼ ὑμᾶς λέληθεν διὰ τὸ τοὺς περιγενομένους ἐπὶ πολλὰς γενεὰς γράμμασιν τελευτᾶν ἀφώνους. ἦν γὰρ δή ποτε, ὦ Σόλων, ὑπὲρ τὴν μεγίστην φθορὰν ὕδασιν ἡ νῦν Ἀθηναίων οὖσα πόλις ἀρίστη πρός τε τὸν πόλεμον καὶ κατὰ πάντα εὐνομωτάτη διαφερόντως· ᾗ κάλλιστα ἔργα καὶ πολιτεῖαι γενέσθαι λέγονται κάλλισται πασῶν ὁπόσων ὑπὸ  τὸν οὐρανὸν ἡμεῖς ἀκοὴν παρεδεξάμεθα. ἀκούσας οὖν ὁ Σόλων ἔφη θαυμάσαι καὶ πᾶσαν προθυμίαν σχεῖν δεόμενος τῶν ἱερέων πάντα διʼ ἀκριβείας οἱ τὰ περὶ τῶν πάλαι πολιτῶν ἑξῆς διελθεῖν. τὸν οὖν ἱερέα φάναι· φθόνος οὐδείς, ὦ Σόλων, ἀλλὰ σοῦ τε ἕνεκα ἐρῶ καὶ τῆς πόλεως ὑμῶν, μάλιστα δὲ τῆς θεοῦ χάριν, ἣ τήν τε ὑμετέραν καὶ τήνδε ἔλαχεν καὶ ἔθρεψεν καὶ ἐπαίδευσεν, προτέραν μὲν τὴν παρʼ  ὑμῖν ἔτεσιν χιλίοις, ἐκ Γῆς τε καὶ Ἡφαίστου τὸ σπέρμα παραλαβοῦσα ὑμῶν, τήνδε δὲ ὑστέραν. τῆς δὲ ἐνθάδε διακοσμήσεως παρʼ ἡμῖν ἐν τοῖς ἱεροῖς γράμμασιν ὀκτακισχιλίων ἐτῶν ἀριθμὸς γέγραπται. περὶ δὴ τῶν ἐνακισχίλια γεγονότων ἔτη πολιτῶν σοι δηλώσω διὰ βραχέων νόμους, καὶ τῶν ἔργων αὐτοῖς ὃ κάλλιστον ἐπράχθη·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. ὅθεν καὶ διʼ ἃς αἰτίας τἀνθάδε σῳζόμενα λέγεται παλαιότατα· τὸ δὲ ἀληθές, ἐν πᾶσιν τοῖς τόποις ὅπου μὴ χειμὼν ἐξαίσιος ἢ καῦμα ἀπείργει, πλέον,  τοτὲ δὲ ἔλαττον ἀεὶ γένος ἐστὶν ἀνθρώπων. ὅσα δὲ ἢ παρʼ ὑμῖν ἢ τῇδε ἢ καὶ κατʼ ἄλλον τόπον ὧν ἀκοῇ ἴσμεν, εἴ πού τι καλὸν ἢ μέγα γέγονεν ἢ καί τινα διαφορὰν ἄλλην ἔχον, πάντα γεγραμμένα ἐκ παλαιοῦ τῇδʼ ἐστὶν ἐν τοῖς ἱεροῖς καὶ σεσωσμένα· τὰ δὲ παρʼ ὑμῖν καὶ τοῖς ἄλλοις ἄρτι κατεσκευασμένα ἑκάστοτε τυγχάνει γράμμασι καὶ ἅπασιν ὁπόσων πόλεις δέονται, καὶ πάλιν διʼ εἰωθότων ἐτῶν ὥσπερ νόσημα ἥκει φερόμενον αὐτοῖς ῥεῦμα οὐράνιον καὶ τοὺς ἀγραμμάτους  τε καὶ ἀμούσους ἔλιπεν ὑμῶν, ὥστε πάλιν ἐξ ἀρχῆς οἷον νέοι γίγνεσθε, οὐδὲν εἰδότες οὔτε τῶν τῇδε οὔτε τῶν παρʼ ὑμῖν, ὅσα ἦν ἐν τοῖς παλαιοῖς χρόνοις.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","text":"τὰ γοῦν νυνδὴ γενεαλογηθέντα, ὦ Σόλων, περὶ τῶν παρʼ ὑμῖν ἃ διῆλθες, παίδων βραχύ τι διαφέρει μύθων, οἳ πρῶτον μὲν ἕνα γῆς κατακλυσμὸν μέμνησθε πολλῶν ἔμπροσθεν γεγονότων, ἔτι δὲ τὸ κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον γένος ἐπʼ ἀνθρώπους ἐν τῇ χώρᾳ παρʼ ὑμῖν οὐκ ἴστε γεγονός, ἐξ ὧν σύ τε καὶ πᾶσα ἡ  πόλις ἔστιν τὰ νῦν ὑμῶν, περιλειφθέντος ποτὲ σπέρματος βραχέος, ἀλλʼ ὑμᾶς λέληθεν διὰ τὸ τοὺς περιγενομένους ἐπὶ πολλὰς γενεὰς γράμμασιν τελευτᾶν ἀφώνους. ἦν γὰρ δή ποτε, ὦ Σόλων, ὑπὲρ τὴν μεγίστην φθορὰν ὕδασιν ἡ νῦν Ἀθηναίων οὖσα πόλις ἀρίστη πρός τε τὸν πόλεμον καὶ κατὰ πάντα εὐνομωτάτη διαφερόντως· ᾗ κάλλιστα ἔργα καὶ πολιτεῖαι γενέσθαι λέγονται κάλλισται πασῶν ὁπόσων ὑπὸ  τὸν οὐρανὸν ἡμεῖς ἀκοὴν παρεδεξάμεθα. ἀκούσας οὖν ὁ Σόλων ἔφη θαυμάσαι καὶ πᾶσαν προθυμίαν σχεῖν δεόμενος τῶν ἱερέων πάντα διʼ ἀκριβείας οἱ τὰ περὶ τῶν πάλαι πολιτῶν ἑξῆς διελθεῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","text":"τὸν οὖν ἱερέα φάναι· φθόνος οὐδείς, ὦ Σόλων, ἀλλὰ σοῦ τε ἕνεκα ἐρῶ καὶ τῆς πόλεως ὑμῶν, μάλιστα δὲ τῆς θεοῦ χάριν, ἣ τήν τε ὑμετέραν καὶ τήνδε ἔλαχεν καὶ ἔθρεψεν καὶ ἐπαίδευσεν, προτέραν μὲν τὴν παρʼ  ὑμῖν ἔτεσιν χιλίοις, ἐκ Γῆς τε καὶ Ἡφαίστου τὸ σπέρμα παραλαβοῦσα ὑμῶν, τήνδε δὲ ὑστέραν. τῆς δὲ ἐνθάδε διακοσμήσεως παρʼ ἡμῖν ἐν τοῖς ἱεροῖς γράμμασιν ὀκτακισχιλίων ἐτῶν ἀριθμὸς γέγραπται. περὶ δὴ τῶν ἐνακισχίλια γεγονότων ἔτη πολιτῶν σοι δηλώσω διὰ βραχέων νόμους, καὶ τῶν ἔργων αὐτοῖς ὃ κάλλιστον ἐπράχθη·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"510b2ca7a4f87e07699c560ea7e9dffe78169e3777c5f483ddb8a30fa984f21e","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224508825718Z_4c849631","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 23","source_sha256":"510b2ca7a4f87e07699c560ea7e9dffe78169e3777c5f483ddb8a30fa984f21e","sha256":"8f907c3174e24dd19e753c1104518db25e4251f206041f8a95d6c5b306315fc3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:08.825794+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","text":"CR. This is why, and for what reasons, the things preserved here are said to be most ancient. But the truth is that, in all places where neither excessive winter nor heat prevents it, there is always a race of human beings, now greater, now smaller. And whatever has happened either among you or here or also in another place, of such things as we know by report, if anything noble or great, or possessing some other distinction, all has from of old been written down here in the temples and preserved; whereas among you and among the others, at each time, letters and all the things that cities need have only just been provided, and again, after the customary number of years, a heavenly stream comes borne upon them like a disease, and leaves among you the unlettered and unmusical, so that you become again, as it were, young from the beginning, knowing nothing either of the things here or of those among you that were in ancient times.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","text":"For indeed the genealogies just now recounted by you, Solon, concerning those among you which you went through, differ little from children's tales: first, you remember one inundation of the earth, though many had occurred before it; further, you do not know that the fairest and best race among human beings came to be in the land among you, from which both you and your whole city as it now is have sprung, when once a small seed was left over; but this has escaped you because those who survived for many generations came to their end without utterance in letters. For once, Solon, before the greatest destruction by waters, the city which is now that of the Athenians was the best both in war and, outstandingly, in good order in every respect; in it, they say, there came to be the fairest deeds and constitutions fairest of all those of which we have received report under heaven. On hearing this, Solon said that he was amazed and was most eager, requesting the priests to go through for him, with complete precision and in order, all the matters concerning the citizens of old.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","text":"The priest then said: “There is no envy, Solon; rather, I shall tell it for your sake and that of your city, but most of all as a favor to the goddess, who received by lot, nurtured, and educated both your land and this one—yours earlier by a thousand years, having received your seed from Earth and Hephaestus, and this one later. The number of years since the ordering here is recorded among us in the sacred writings as eight thousand. So I shall briefly make known to you the laws of the citizens of nine thousand years ago, and the fairest deed that was performed by them.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"4a56ca49ae72cd6321ef17785f792a38b95acdda9e624c02157009c0771d099b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 23"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 23","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7","title":"Section 24","order":8,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7","text":"ΚΡ. τὸ δʼ ἀκριβὲς περὶ  πάντων ἐφεξῆς εἰς αὖθις κατὰ σχολὴν αὐτὰ τὰ γράμματα λαβόντες διέξιμεν. τοὺς μὲν οὖν νόμους σκόπει πρὸς τοὺς τῇδε· πολλὰ γὰρ παραδείγματα τῶν τότε παρʼ ὑμῖν ὄντων ἐνθάδε νῦν ἀνευρήσεις, πρῶτον μὲν τὸ τῶν ἱερέων γένος ἀπὸ τῶν ἄλλων χωρὶς ἀφωρισμένον, μετὰ δὲ τοῦτο τὸ τῶν δημιουργῶν, ὅτι καθʼ αὑτὸ ἕκαστον ἄλλῳ δὲ οὐκ ἐπιμειγνύμενον δημιουργεῖ, τό τε τῶν νομέων καὶ τὸ τῶν θηρευτῶν τό τε  τῶν γεωργῶν. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ μάχιμον γένος ᾔσθησαί που τῇδε ἀπὸ πάντων τῶν γενῶν κεχωρισμένον, οἷς οὐδὲν ἄλλο πλὴν τὰ περὶ τὸν πόλεμον ὑπὸ τοῦ νόμου προσετάχθη μέλειν· ἔτι δὲ ἡ τῆς ὁπλίσεως αὐτῶν σχέσις ἀσπίδων καὶ δοράτων, οἷς ἡμεῖς πρῶτοι τῶν περὶ τὴν Ἀσίαν ὡπλίσμεθα, τῆς θεοῦ καθάπερ ἐν ἐκείνοις τοῖς τόποις παρʼ ὑμῖν πρώτοις ἐνδειξαμένης. τὸ δʼ αὖ περὶ τῆς φρονήσεως, ὁρᾷς που τὸν νόμον τῇδε ὅσην ἐπιμέλειαν ἐποιήσατο εὐθὺς κατʼ ἀρχὰς περί τε  τὸν κόσμον, ἅπαντα μέχρι μαντικῆς καὶ ἰατρικῆς πρὸς ὑγίειαν ἐκ τούτων θείων ὄντων εἰς τὰ ἀνθρώπινα ἀνευρών, ὅσα τε ἄλλα τούτοις ἕπεται μαθήματα πάντα κτησάμενος. ταύτην οὖν δὴ τότε σύμπασαν τὴν διακόσμησιν καὶ σύνταξιν ἡ θεὸς προτέρους ὑμᾶς διακοσμήσασα κατῴκισεν, ἐκλεξαμένη τὸν τόπον ἐν ᾧ γεγένησθε, τὴν εὐκρασίαν τῶν ὡρῶν ἐν αὐτῷ κατιδοῦσα, ὅτι φρονιμωτάτους ἄνδρας οἴσοι· ἅτε οὖν φιλοπόλεμός  τε καὶ φιλόσοφος ἡ θεὸς οὖσα τὸν προσφερεστάτους αὐτῇ μέλλοντα οἴσειν τόπον ἄνδρας, τοῦτον ἐκλεξαμένη πρῶτον κατῴκισεν. ᾠκεῖτε δὴ οὖν νόμοις τε τοιούτοις χρώμενοι καὶ ἔτι μᾶλλον εὐνομούμενοι πάσῃ τε παρὰ πάντας ἀνθρώπους ὑπερβεβληκότες ἀρετῇ, καθάπερ εἰκὸς γεννήματα καὶ παιδεύματα θεῶν ὄντας. πολλὰ μὲν οὖν ὑμῶν καὶ μεγάλα ἔργα τῆς πόλεως τῇδε γεγραμμένα θαυμάζεται, πάντων μὴν  ἓν ὑπερέχει μεγέθει καὶ ἀρετῇ· λέγει γὰρ τὰ γεγραμμένα ὅσην ἡ πόλις ὑμῶν ἔπαυσέν ποτε δύναμιν ὕβρει πορευομένην ἅμα ἐπὶ πᾶσαν Εὐρώπην καὶ Ἀσίαν, ἔξωθεν ὁρμηθεῖσαν ἐκ τοῦ Ἀτλαντικοῦ πελάγους.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. τὸ δʼ ἀκριβὲς περὶ  πάντων ἐφεξῆς εἰς αὖθις κατὰ σχολὴν αὐτὰ τὰ γράμματα λαβόντες διέξιμεν. τοὺς μὲν οὖν νόμους σκόπει πρὸς τοὺς τῇδε· πολλὰ γὰρ παραδείγματα τῶν τότε παρʼ ὑμῖν ὄντων ἐνθάδε νῦν ἀνευρήσεις, πρῶτον μὲν τὸ τῶν ἱερέων γένος ἀπὸ τῶν ἄλλων χωρὶς ἀφωρισμένον, μετὰ δὲ τοῦτο τὸ τῶν δημιουργῶν, ὅτι καθʼ αὑτὸ ἕκαστον ἄλλῳ δὲ οὐκ ἐπιμειγνύμενον δημιουργεῖ, τό τε τῶν νομέων καὶ τὸ τῶν θηρευτῶν τό τε  τῶν γεωργῶν. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ μάχιμον γένος ᾔσθησαί που τῇδε ἀπὸ πάντων τῶν γενῶν κεχωρισμένον, οἷς οὐδὲν ἄλλο πλὴν τὰ περὶ τὸν πόλεμον ὑπὸ τοῦ νόμου προσετάχθη μέλειν· ἔτι δὲ ἡ τῆς ὁπλίσεως αὐτῶν σχέσις ἀσπίδων καὶ δοράτων, οἷς ἡμεῖς πρῶτοι τῶν περὶ τὴν Ἀσίαν ὡπλίσμεθα, τῆς θεοῦ καθάπερ ἐν ἐκείνοις τοῖς τόποις παρʼ ὑμῖν πρώτοις ἐνδειξαμένης.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","text":"τὸ δʼ αὖ περὶ τῆς φρονήσεως, ὁρᾷς που τὸν νόμον τῇδε ὅσην ἐπιμέλειαν ἐποιήσατο εὐθὺς κατʼ ἀρχὰς περί τε  τὸν κόσμον, ἅπαντα μέχρι μαντικῆς καὶ ἰατρικῆς πρὸς ὑγίειαν ἐκ τούτων θείων ὄντων εἰς τὰ ἀνθρώπινα ἀνευρών, ὅσα τε ἄλλα τούτοις ἕπεται μαθήματα πάντα κτησάμενος. ταύτην οὖν δὴ τότε σύμπασαν τὴν διακόσμησιν καὶ σύνταξιν ἡ θεὸς προτέρους ὑμᾶς διακοσμήσασα κατῴκισεν, ἐκλεξαμένη τὸν τόπον ἐν ᾧ γεγένησθε, τὴν εὐκρασίαν τῶν ὡρῶν ἐν αὐτῷ κατιδοῦσα, ὅτι φρονιμωτάτους ἄνδρας οἴσοι· ἅτε οὖν φιλοπόλεμός  τε καὶ φιλόσοφος ἡ θεὸς οὖσα τὸν προσφερεστάτους αὐτῇ μέλλοντα οἴσειν τόπον ἄνδρας, τοῦτον ἐκλεξαμένη πρῶτον κατῴκισεν. ᾠκεῖτε δὴ οὖν νόμοις τε τοιούτοις χρώμενοι καὶ ἔτι μᾶλλον εὐνομούμενοι πάσῃ τε παρὰ πάντας ἀνθρώπους ὑπερβεβληκότες ἀρετῇ, καθάπερ εἰκὸς γεννήματα καὶ παιδεύματα θεῶν ὄντας.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","text":"πολλὰ μὲν οὖν ὑμῶν καὶ μεγάλα ἔργα τῆς πόλεως τῇδε γεγραμμένα θαυμάζεται, πάντων μὴν  ἓν ὑπερέχει μεγέθει καὶ ἀρετῇ· λέγει γὰρ τὰ γεγραμμένα ὅσην ἡ πόλις ὑμῶν ἔπαυσέν ποτε δύναμιν ὕβρει πορευομένην ἅμα ἐπὶ πᾶσαν Εὐρώπην καὶ Ἀσίαν, ἔξωθεν ὁρμηθεῖσαν ἐκ τοῦ Ἀτλαντικοῦ πελάγους.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"3ec1a7caa5044ddc8fece4c749007adffac148cb3ddc3394ec4dfef77e8bc6a5","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224515851629Z_8b669a00","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 24","source_sha256":"3ec1a7caa5044ddc8fece4c749007adffac148cb3ddc3394ec4dfef77e8bc6a5","sha256":"5fb8843a494c4a1a6c4929a6f5441bd08d0cc6c30f5e20fdf307895d32586c00","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:15.851665+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","text":"CR. We shall go through the exact particulars concerning everything in due order later, when we have leisure and take up the writings themselves. But consider the laws in relation to those here; for you will find here now many examples of what existed among you then: first, the class of priests set apart separately from the others; and after this, that of craftsmen, because each practises a craft by itself and does not mix with another; and that of herdsmen and that of hunters and that of farmers. And indeed, you have doubtless noticed that here the warrior class is separated from all the classes, to whom the law enjoined that they should concern themselves with nothing other than matters of war; and further, the character of their armament, of shields and spears, with which we were the first among those around Asia to be armed, the goddess having first indicated it among you in those regions, just as [she did] in these.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","text":"And again concerning intelligence, you surely see what great care the law here took from the very beginning concerning the order of the universe, discovering from these divine things all the way down to divination and medicine for health among human things, and acquiring all the other studies that follow upon these. Thus it was that the goddess, having first ordered you with this entire arrangement and constitution, settled you, choosing the place in which you were born, since she saw the temperateness of the seasons in it, because it would produce most intelligent men. Since, then, the goddess was both war-loving and wisdom-loving, she chose the place that was destined to bear men most akin to herself and settled it first. So you lived under such laws, and even more excellently governed, surpassing all human beings in every virtue, as was fitting for offspring and nurture of gods.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","text":"Many and great deeds of your city are recorded here and are admired; yet one surpasses them all in magnitude and virtue. For the writings tell how great a power your city once brought to a halt, a power proceeding insolently at once against all Europe and Asia, advancing from outside, from the Atlantic sea.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"b6a60635f439bf3792876d3295f93795fb5b2de161eca9560deb01b3e540ebcc","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 24"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 24","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8","title":"Section 25","order":9,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8","text":"ΚΡ. τότε γὰρ πορεύσιμον ἦν τὸ ἐκεῖ πέλαγος· νῆσον γὰρ πρὸ τοῦ στόματος εἶχεν ὃ καλεῖτε, ὥς φατε, ὑμεῖς Ἡρακλέους στήλας, ἡ δὲ νῆσος ἅμα Λιβύης ἦν καὶ Ἀσίας μείζων, ἐξ ἧς ἐπιβατὸν ἐπὶ τὰς ἄλλας νήσους τοῖς τότε ἐγίγνετο πορευομένοις, ἐκ δὲ τῶν νήσων  ἐπὶ τὴν καταντικρὺ πᾶσαν ἤπειρον τὴν περὶ τὸν ἀληθινὸν ἐκεῖνον πόντον. τάδε μὲν γάρ, ὅσα ἐντὸς τοῦ στόματος οὗ λέγομεν, φαίνεται λιμὴν στενόν τινα ἔχων εἴσπλουν· ἐκεῖνο δὲ πέλαγος ὄντως ἥ τε περιέχουσα αὐτὸ γῆ παντελῶς ἀληθῶς ὀρθότατʼ ἂν λέγοιτο ἤπειρος. ἐν δὲ δὴ τῇ Ἀτλαντίδι νήσῳ ταύτῃ μεγάλη συνέστη καὶ θαυμαστὴ δύναμις βασιλέων, κρατοῦσα μὲν ἁπάσης τῆς νήσου, πολλῶν δὲ ἄλλων νήσων καὶ μερῶν τῆς ἠπείρου· πρὸς δὲ τούτοις ἔτι τῶν ἐντὸς τῇδε  Λιβύης μὲν ἦρχον μέχρι πρὸς Αἴγυπτον, τῆς δὲ Εὐρώπης μέχρι Τυρρηνίας. αὕτη δὴ πᾶσα συναθροισθεῖσα εἰς ἓν ἡ δύναμις τόν τε παρʼ ὑμῖν καὶ τὸν παρʼ ἡμῖν καὶ τὸν ἐντὸς τοῦ στόματος πάντα τόπον μιᾷ ποτὲ ἐπεχείρησεν ὁρμῇ δουλοῦσθαι. τότε οὖν ὑμῶν, ὦ Σόλων, τῆς πόλεως ἡ δύναμις εἰς ἅπαντας ἀνθρώπους διαφανὴς ἀρετῇ τε καὶ ῥώμῃ ἐγένετο· πάντων γὰρ προστᾶσα εὐψυχίᾳ καὶ τέχναις ὅσαι κατὰ πόλεμον,  τὰ μὲν τῶν Ἑλλήνων ἡγουμένη, τὰ δʼ αὐτὴ μονωθεῖσα ἐξ ἀνάγκης τῶν ἄλλων ἀποστάντων, ἐπὶ τοὺς ἐσχάτους ἀφικομένη κινδύνους, κρατήσασα μὲν τῶν ἐπιόντων τρόπαιον ἔστησεν, τοὺς δὲ μήπω δεδουλωμένους διεκώλυσεν δουλωθῆναι, τοὺς δʼ ἄλλους, ὅσοι κατοικοῦμεν ἐντὸς ὅρων Ἡρακλείων, ἀφθόνως ἅπαντας ἠλευθέρωσεν. ὑστέρῳ δὲ χρόνῳ σεισμῶν ἐξαισίων καὶ κατακλυσμῶν γενομένων, μιᾶς  ἡμέρας καὶ νυκτὸς χαλεπῆς ἐπελθούσης, τό τε παρʼ ὑμῖν μάχιμον πᾶν ἁθρόον ἔδυ κατὰ γῆς, ἥ τε Ἀτλαντὶς νῆσος ὡσαύτως κατὰ τῆς θαλάττης δῦσα ἠφανίσθη· διὸ καὶ νῦν ἄπορον καὶ ἀδιερεύνητον γέγονεν τοὐκεῖ πέλαγος, πηλοῦ κάρτα βραχέος ἐμποδὼν ὄντος, ὃν ἡ νῆσος ἱζομένη παρέσχετο. τὰ μὲν δὴ ῥηθέντα, ὦ Σώκρατες, ὑπὸ τοῦ παλαιοῦ  Κριτίου κατʼ ἀκοὴν τὴν Σόλωνος, ὡς συντόμως εἰπεῖν, ἀκήκοας· λέγοντος δὲ δὴ χθὲς σοῦ περὶ πολιτείας τε καὶ τῶν ἀνδρῶν οὓς ἔλεγες, ἐθαύμαζον ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενος αὐτὰ ἃ νῦν λέγω, κατανοῶν ὡς δαιμονίως ἔκ τινος τύχης οὐκ ἄπο σκοποῦ συνηνέχθης τὰ πολλὰ οἷς Σόλων εἶπεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. τότε γὰρ πορεύσιμον ἦν τὸ ἐκεῖ πέλαγος· νῆσον γὰρ πρὸ τοῦ στόματος εἶχεν ὃ καλεῖτε, ὥς φατε, ὑμεῖς Ἡρακλέους στήλας, ἡ δὲ νῆσος ἅμα Λιβύης ἦν καὶ Ἀσίας μείζων, ἐξ ἧς ἐπιβατὸν ἐπὶ τὰς ἄλλας νήσους τοῖς τότε ἐγίγνετο πορευομένοις, ἐκ δὲ τῶν νήσων  ἐπὶ τὴν καταντικρὺ πᾶσαν ἤπειρον τὴν περὶ τὸν ἀληθινὸν ἐκεῖνον πόντον. τάδε μὲν γάρ, ὅσα ἐντὸς τοῦ στόματος οὗ λέγομεν, φαίνεται λιμὴν στενόν τινα ἔχων εἴσπλουν· ἐκεῖνο δὲ πέλαγος ὄντως ἥ τε περιέχουσα αὐτὸ γῆ παντελῶς ἀληθῶς ὀρθότατʼ ἂν λέγοιτο ἤπειρος. ἐν δὲ δὴ τῇ Ἀτλαντίδι νήσῳ ταύτῃ μεγάλη συνέστη καὶ θαυμαστὴ δύναμις βασιλέων, κρατοῦσα μὲν ἁπάσης τῆς νήσου, πολλῶν δὲ ἄλλων νήσων καὶ μερῶν τῆς ἠπείρου· πρὸς δὲ τούτοις ἔτι τῶν ἐντὸς τῇδε  Λιβύης μὲν ἦρχον μέχρι πρὸς Αἴγυπτον, τῆς δὲ Εὐρώπης μέχρι Τυρρηνίας.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","text":"αὕτη δὴ πᾶσα συναθροισθεῖσα εἰς ἓν ἡ δύναμις τόν τε παρʼ ὑμῖν καὶ τὸν παρʼ ἡμῖν καὶ τὸν ἐντὸς τοῦ στόματος πάντα τόπον μιᾷ ποτὲ ἐπεχείρησεν ὁρμῇ δουλοῦσθαι. τότε οὖν ὑμῶν, ὦ Σόλων, τῆς πόλεως ἡ δύναμις εἰς ἅπαντας ἀνθρώπους διαφανὴς ἀρετῇ τε καὶ ῥώμῃ ἐγένετο· πάντων γὰρ προστᾶσα εὐψυχίᾳ καὶ τέχναις ὅσαι κατὰ πόλεμον,  τὰ μὲν τῶν Ἑλλήνων ἡγουμένη, τὰ δʼ αὐτὴ μονωθεῖσα ἐξ ἀνάγκης τῶν ἄλλων ἀποστάντων, ἐπὶ τοὺς ἐσχάτους ἀφικομένη κινδύνους, κρατήσασα μὲν τῶν ἐπιόντων τρόπαιον ἔστησεν, τοὺς δὲ μήπω δεδουλωμένους διεκώλυσεν δουλωθῆναι, τοὺς δʼ ἄλλους, ὅσοι κατοικοῦμεν ἐντὸς ὅρων Ἡρακλείων, ἀφθόνως ἅπαντας ἠλευθέρωσεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","text":"ὑστέρῳ δὲ χρόνῳ σεισμῶν ἐξαισίων καὶ κατακλυσμῶν γενομένων, μιᾶς  ἡμέρας καὶ νυκτὸς χαλεπῆς ἐπελθούσης, τό τε παρʼ ὑμῖν μάχιμον πᾶν ἁθρόον ἔδυ κατὰ γῆς, ἥ τε Ἀτλαντὶς νῆσος ὡσαύτως κατὰ τῆς θαλάττης δῦσα ἠφανίσθη· διὸ καὶ νῦν ἄπορον καὶ ἀδιερεύνητον γέγονεν τοὐκεῖ πέλαγος, πηλοῦ κάρτα βραχέος ἐμποδὼν ὄντος, ὃν ἡ νῆσος ἱζομένη παρέσχετο. τὰ μὲν δὴ ῥηθέντα, ὦ Σώκρατες, ὑπὸ τοῦ παλαιοῦ  Κριτίου κατʼ ἀκοὴν τὴν Σόλωνος, ὡς συντόμως εἰπεῖν, ἀκήκοας· λέγοντος δὲ δὴ χθὲς σοῦ περὶ πολιτείας τε καὶ τῶν ἀνδρῶν οὓς ἔλεγες, ἐθαύμαζον ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενος αὐτὰ ἃ νῦν λέγω, κατανοῶν ὡς δαιμονίως ἔκ τινος τύχης οὐκ ἄπο σκοποῦ συνηνέχθης τὰ πολλὰ οἷς Σόλων εἶπεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"fb7e64a89608ebe1a276b2b278fbeb9957f2cc2c3fce41ce5dc8610a1326e6ca","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224523754377Z_cbaa3369","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 25","source_sha256":"fb7e64a89608ebe1a276b2b278fbeb9957f2cc2c3fce41ce5dc8610a1326e6ca","sha256":"ae2b61c44750c6e27b53be483ad34b44b1589e0fd52fcd30a8b786f41febb8d3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:23.754548+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","text":"CRIT. For at that time the sea there was navigable; for it had an island before the mouth which you say, as you assert, is called the Pillars of Heracles; and the island was larger than Libya and Asia together, and from it there was passage for those then travelling to the other islands, and from the islands to the whole opposite mainland surrounding that true sea. For all these regions, as many as lie within the mouth of which we speak, appear to be a harbour with a certain narrow entrance; but that is truly a sea, and the land which surrounds it might most correctly and altogether truly be called a mainland. Now on this island of Atlantis there had arisen a great and marvellous power of kings, holding sway over the whole island, and over many other islands and parts of the mainland; and besides these, of the regions on this side, they ruled Libya as far as Egypt and Europe as far as Tyrrhenia.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","text":"This entire power, then, gathered together into one, once attempted in a single onslaught to enslave both your country and ours and every region within the mouth. It was then, Solon, that the power of your city became manifest to all mankind in both courage and strength; for, surpassing all in nobility of spirit and in every art pertaining to war, at first leading the Greeks, then compelled by necessity to stand alone when the others had withdrawn, it came to the utmost perils; and, having prevailed over the attackers, it set up a trophy, prevented those not yet enslaved from being enslaved, and generously set free all the rest of us who dwell within the bounds of Heracles.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","text":"But afterward, when extraordinary earthquakes and floods occurred, there came one grievous day and night, in which all your warrior class together sank beneath the earth, and likewise the island of Atlantis, sinking beneath the sea, vanished. Hence even now the sea there has become impassable and unsearchable, a very shallow mud being an obstacle, which the island, as it settled, produced. Thus, Socrates, you have heard in brief the things related by the elder Critias from Solon's report. And when yesterday you spoke about the constitution and the men whom you described, I marvelled as I recalled the very matters which I am now relating, perceiving how, by some divine fortune, you had in most respects coincided not without aim with what Solon said.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"2e72f39417a365004d53ef908510c23af4984109192ce0f559464191b1a9f7c8","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 25"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 25","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9","title":"Section 26","order":10,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9","text":"ΚΡ. οὐ μὴν  ἐβουλήθην παραχρῆμα εἰπεῖν· διὰ χρόνου γὰρ οὐχ ἱκανῶς ἐμεμνήμην. ἐνενόησα οὖν ὅτι χρεὼν εἴη με πρὸς ἐμαυτὸν πρῶτον ἱκανῶς πάντα ἀναλαβόντα λέγειν οὕτως. ὅθεν ταχὺ συνωμολόγησά σοι τὰ ἐπιταχθέντα χθές, ἡγούμενος, ὅπερ ἐν ἅπασι τοῖς τοιοῖσδε μέγιστον ἔργον, λόγον τινὰ πρέποντα τοῖς βουλήμασιν ὑποθέσθαι, τούτου μετρίως ἡμᾶς εὐπορήσειν. οὕτω δή, καθάπερ ὅδʼ εἶπεν, χθές τε εὐθὺς ἐνθένδε ἀπιὼν  πρὸς τούσδε ἀνέφερον αὐτὰ ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενος, ἀπελθών τε σχεδόν τι πάντα ἐπισκοπῶν τῆς νυκτὸς ἀνέλαβον. ὡς δή τοι, τὸ λεγόμενον, τὰ παίδων μαθήματα θαυμαστὸν ἔχει τι μνημεῖον. ἐγὼ γὰρ ἃ μὲν χθὲς ἤκουσα, οὐκ ἂν οἶδʼ εἰ δυναίμην ἅπαντα ἐν μνήμῃ πάλιν λαβεῖν· ταῦτα δὲ ἃ πάμπολυν χρόνον διακήκοα, παντάπασι θαυμάσαιμʼ ἂν εἴ τί με αὐτῶν διαπέφευγεν. ἦν μὲν οὖν μετὰ πολλῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ  παιδιᾶς τότε ἀκουόμενα, καὶ τοῦ πρεσβύτου προθύμως με διδάσκοντος, ἅτʼ ἐμοῦ πολλάκις ἐπανερωτῶντος, ὥστε οἷον ἐγκαύματα ἀνεκπλύτου γραφῆς ἔμμονά μοι γέγονεν· καὶ δὴ καὶ τοῖσδε εὐθὺς ἔλεγον ἕωθεν αὐτὰ ταῦτα, ἵνα εὐποροῖεν λόγων μετʼ ἐμοῦ. νῦν οὖν, οὗπερ ἕνεκα πάντα ταῦτα εἴρηται, λέγειν εἰμὶ ἕτοιμος, ὦ Σώκρατες, μὴ μόνον ἐν κεφαλαίοις ἀλλʼ ὥσπερ ἤκουσα καθʼ ἕκαστον· τοὺς δὲ πολίτας καὶ τὴν πόλιν ἣν χθὲς ἡμῖν ὡς ἐν μύθῳ διῄεισθα σύ, νῦν μετενεγκόντες  ἐπὶ τἀληθὲς δεῦρο θήσομεν ὡς ἐκείνην τήνδε οὖσαν, καὶ τοὺς πολίτας οὓς διενοοῦ φήσομεν ἐκείνους τοὺς ἀληθινοὺς εἶναι προγόνους ἡμῶν, οὓς ἔλεγεν ὁ ἱερεύς. πάντως ἁρμόσουσι καὶ οὐκ ἀπᾳσόμεθα λέγοντες αὐτοὺς εἶναι τοὺς ἐν τῷ τότε ὄντας χρόνῳ. κοινῇ δὲ διαλαμβάνοντες ἅπαντες πειρασόμεθα τὸ πρέπον εἰς δύναμιν οἷς ἐπέταξας ἀποδοῦναι. σκοπεῖν οὖν δὴ χρή, ὦ Σώκρατες, εἰ κατὰ νοῦν ὁ λόγος ἡμῖν  οὗτος, ἤ τινα ἔτʼ ἄλλον ἀντʼ αὐτοῦ ζητητέον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","text":"ΚΡ. οὐ μὴν  ἐβουλήθην παραχρῆμα εἰπεῖν· διὰ χρόνου γὰρ οὐχ ἱκανῶς ἐμεμνήμην. ἐνενόησα οὖν ὅτι χρεὼν εἴη με πρὸς ἐμαυτὸν πρῶτον ἱκανῶς πάντα ἀναλαβόντα λέγειν οὕτως. ὅθεν ταχὺ συνωμολόγησά σοι τὰ ἐπιταχθέντα χθές, ἡγούμενος, ὅπερ ἐν ἅπασι τοῖς τοιοῖσδε μέγιστον ἔργον, λόγον τινὰ πρέποντα τοῖς βουλήμασιν ὑποθέσθαι, τούτου μετρίως ἡμᾶς εὐπορήσειν. οὕτω δή, καθάπερ ὅδʼ εἶπεν, χθές τε εὐθὺς ἐνθένδε ἀπιὼν  πρὸς τούσδε ἀνέφερον αὐτὰ ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενος, ἀπελθών τε σχεδόν τι πάντα ἐπισκοπῶν τῆς νυκτὸς ἀνέλαβον. ὡς δή τοι, τὸ λεγόμενον, τὰ παίδων μαθήματα θαυμαστὸν ἔχει τι μνημεῖον. ἐγὼ γὰρ ἃ μὲν χθὲς ἤκουσα, οὐκ ἂν οἶδʼ εἰ δυναίμην ἅπαντα ἐν μνήμῃ πάλιν λαβεῖν· ταῦτα δὲ ἃ πάμπολυν χρόνον διακήκοα, παντάπασι θαυμάσαιμʼ ἂν εἴ τί με αὐτῶν διαπέφευγεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","text":"ἦν μὲν οὖν μετὰ πολλῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ  παιδιᾶς τότε ἀκουόμενα, καὶ τοῦ πρεσβύτου προθύμως με διδάσκοντος, ἅτʼ ἐμοῦ πολλάκις ἐπανερωτῶντος, ὥστε οἷον ἐγκαύματα ἀνεκπλύτου γραφῆς ἔμμονά μοι γέγονεν· καὶ δὴ καὶ τοῖσδε εὐθὺς ἔλεγον ἕωθεν αὐτὰ ταῦτα, ἵνα εὐποροῖεν λόγων μετʼ ἐμοῦ. νῦν οὖν, οὗπερ ἕνεκα πάντα ταῦτα εἴρηται, λέγειν εἰμὶ ἕτοιμος, ὦ Σώκρατες, μὴ μόνον ἐν κεφαλαίοις ἀλλʼ ὥσπερ ἤκουσα καθʼ ἕκαστον· τοὺς δὲ πολίτας καὶ τὴν πόλιν ἣν χθὲς ἡμῖν ὡς ἐν μύθῳ διῄεισθα σύ, νῦν μετενεγκόντες  ἐπὶ τἀληθὲς δεῦρο θήσομεν ὡς ἐκείνην τήνδε οὖσαν, καὶ τοὺς πολίτας οὓς διενοοῦ φήσομεν ἐκείνους τοὺς ἀληθινοὺς εἶναι προγόνους ἡμῶν, οὓς ἔλεγεν ὁ ἱερεύς. πάντως ἁρμόσουσι καὶ οὐκ ἀπᾳσόμεθα λέγοντες αὐτοὺς εἶναι τοὺς ἐν τῷ τότε ὄντας χρόνῳ. κοινῇ δὲ διαλαμβάνοντες ἅπαντες πειρασόμεθα τὸ πρέπον εἰς δύναμιν οἷς ἐπέταξας ἀποδοῦναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","text":"σκοπεῖν οὖν δὴ χρή, ὦ Σώκρατες, εἰ κατὰ νοῦν ὁ λόγος ἡμῖν  οὗτος, ἤ τινα ἔτʼ ἄλλον ἀντʼ αὐτοῦ ζητητέον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"8ee7092dc0bc5e0224085c77f7ae802e3eea51fc0975ffc8745e15bc96098cd9","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224532224229Z_26ee58b9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 26","source_sha256":"8ee7092dc0bc5e0224085c77f7ae802e3eea51fc0975ffc8745e15bc96098cd9","sha256":"7e2e59e673099dd14de4c18ecc75d82370d4941ad22fac2be1ad00c432d71845","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:32.224341+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","text":"CR. Yet I was not willing to speak at once; for after an interval of time I did not remember adequately. I reflected, then, that I ought first, having sufficiently recalled everything to myself, to speak thus. Hence I quickly agreed with you yesterday as to what was enjoined, thinking that, which is the greatest task in all such matters, namely to posit some discourse suitable to the purposes, we should be moderately well supplied with this. So indeed, as this man said, immediately yesterday on leaving here I recounted these things to these men, recalling them; and when I had gone away, I recovered almost everything by reviewing it during the night. For indeed, as the saying goes, the lessons of childhood possess something wonderful in the way of memory. For what I heard yesterday, I do not know whether I could recover all again in memory; but of these things which I heard a very long time ago, I should be altogether amazed if anything of them had escaped me.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","text":"They were heard then with much pleasure and playfulness, and with the old man eagerly teaching me, since I questioned him repeatedly, so that they have become fixed in me like encaustic paintings that cannot be washed out; and indeed I was telling these very things to these men straightway from early morning, so that they might be supplied with arguments along with me. Now then, for the sake of which all this has been said, I am ready to speak, Socrates, not merely in headings but, as I heard it, point by point. And the citizens and the city which yesterday you went through for us as in a myth, we shall now transfer into truth and set down here as being that city, and we shall say that the citizens whom you had in mind are those true ancestors of ours, of whom the priest spoke. They will fit in every way, and we shall not strike a false note in saying that they are those who existed at that time. And all of us, taking our shares together, shall endeavor, to the extent of our power, to render what is fitting in response to the task you enjoined.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","text":"We must then consider, Socrates, whether this account is to our mind, or whether some other must still be sought in its place.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"4ead477cb987ab83fcb75c5681134e3d6f786ad99ebec2c53b15c825321cb9b4","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 26"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 26","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10","title":"Section 27","order":11,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_10","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ τίνʼ ἄν, ὦ Κριτία, μᾶλλον ἀντὶ τούτου μεταλάβοιμεν, ὃς τῇ τε παρούσῃ τῆς θεοῦ θυσίᾳ διὰ τὴν οἰκειότητʼ ἂν πρέποι μάλιστα, τό τε μὴ πλασθέντα μῦθον ἀλλʼ ἀληθινὸν λόγον εἶναι πάμμεγά που. πῶς γὰρ καὶ πόθεν ἄλλους ἀνευρήσομεν ἀφέμενοι τούτων; οὐκ ἔστιν, ἀλλʼ ἀγαθῇ τύχῃ χρὴ λέγειν μὲν ὑμᾶς, ἐμὲ δὲ ἀντὶ τῶν χθὲς λόγων νῦν  ἡσυχίαν ἄγοντα ἀντακούειν.\n\n \n\nΚΡ. σκόπει δὴ τὴν τῶν ξενίων σοι διάθεσιν, ὦ Σώκρατες, ᾗ διέθεμεν. ἔδοξεν γὰρ ἡμῖν Τίμαιον μέν, ἅτε ὄντα ἀστρονομικώτατον ἡμῶν καὶ περὶ φύσεως τοῦ παντὸς εἰδέναι μάλιστα ἔργον πεποιημένον, πρῶτον λέγειν ἀρχόμενον ἀπὸ τῆς τοῦ κόσμου γενέσεως, τελευτᾶν δὲ εἰς ἀνθρώπων φύσιν· ἐμὲ δὲ μετὰ τοῦτον, ὡς παρὰ μὲν τούτου δεδεγμένον ἀνθρώπους τῷ λόγῳ γεγονότας, παρὰ σοῦ δὲ πεπαιδευμένους διαφερόντως  αὐτῶν τινας, κατὰ δὲ τὸν Σόλωνος λόγον τε καὶ νόμον εἰσαγαγόντα αὐτοὺς ὡς εἰς δικαστὰς ἡμᾶς ποιῆσαι πολίτας τῆς πόλεως τῆσδε ὡς ὄντας τοὺς τότε Ἀθηναίους, οὓς ἐμήνυσεν ἀφανεῖς ὄντας ἡ τῶν ἱερῶν γραμμάτων φήμη, τὰ λοιπὰ δὲ ὡς περὶ πολιτῶν καὶ Ἀθηναίων ὄντων ἤδη ποιεῖσθαι τοὺς λόγους.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. τελέως τε καὶ λαμπρῶς ἔοικα ἀνταπολήψεσθαι τὴν τῶν λόγων ἑστίασιν. σὸν οὖν ἔργον λέγειν ἄν, ὦ Τίμαιε, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο, ὡς ἔοικεν, εἴη καλέσαντα κατὰ νόμον θεούς. \n\n \n\nΤΙ. ἀλλʼ, ὦ Σώκρατες, τοῦτό γε δὴ πάντες ὅσοι καὶ κατὰ βραχὺ σωφροσύνης μετέχουσιν, ἐπὶ παντὸς ὁρμῇ καὶ σμικροῦ καὶ μεγάλου πράγματος θεὸν ἀεί που καλοῦσιν· ἡμᾶς δὲ τοὺς περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λόγους ποιεῖσθαί πῃ μέλλοντας, ᾗ γέγονεν ἢ καὶ ἀγενές ἐστιν, εἰ μὴ παντάπασι παραλλάττομεν, ἀνάγκη θεούς τε καὶ θεὰς ἐπικαλουμένους εὔχεσθαι πάντα κατὰ νοῦν ἐκείνοις μὲν μάλιστα, ἑπομένως  δὲ ἡμῖν εἰπεῖν. καὶ τὰ μὲν περὶ θεῶν ταύτῃ παρακεκλήσθω· τὸ δʼ ἡμέτερον παρακλητέον, ᾗ ῥᾷστʼ ἂν ὑμεῖς μὲν μάθοιτε, ἐγὼ δὲ ᾗ διανοοῦμαι μάλιστʼ ἂν περὶ τῶν προκειμένων ἐνδειξαίμην.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","text":"ΣΩ. καὶ τίνʼ ἄν, ὦ Κριτία, μᾶλλον ἀντὶ τούτου μεταλάβοιμεν, ὃς τῇ τε παρούσῃ τῆς θεοῦ θυσίᾳ διὰ τὴν οἰκειότητʼ ἂν πρέποι μάλιστα, τό τε μὴ πλασθέντα μῦθον ἀλλʼ ἀληθινὸν λόγον εἶναι πάμμεγά που. πῶς γὰρ καὶ πόθεν ἄλλους ἀνευρήσομεν ἀφέμενοι τούτων; οὐκ ἔστιν, ἀλλʼ ἀγαθῇ τύχῃ χρὴ λέγειν μὲν ὑμᾶς, ἐμὲ δὲ ἀντὶ τῶν χθὲς λόγων νῦν  ἡσυχίαν ἄγοντα ἀντακούειν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","text":"ΚΡ. σκόπει δὴ τὴν τῶν ξενίων σοι διάθεσιν, ὦ Σώκρατες, ᾗ διέθεμεν. ἔδοξεν γὰρ ἡμῖν Τίμαιον μέν, ἅτε ὄντα ἀστρονομικώτατον ἡμῶν καὶ περὶ φύσεως τοῦ παντὸς εἰδέναι μάλιστα ἔργον πεποιημένον, πρῶτον λέγειν ἀρχόμενον ἀπὸ τῆς τοῦ κόσμου γενέσεως, τελευτᾶν δὲ εἰς ἀνθρώπων φύσιν· ἐμὲ δὲ μετὰ τοῦτον, ὡς παρὰ μὲν τούτου δεδεγμένον ἀνθρώπους τῷ λόγῳ γεγονότας, παρὰ σοῦ δὲ πεπαιδευμένους διαφερόντως  αὐτῶν τινας, κατὰ δὲ τὸν Σόλωνος λόγον τε καὶ νόμον εἰσαγαγόντα αὐτοὺς ὡς εἰς δικαστὰς ἡμᾶς ποιῆσαι πολίτας τῆς πόλεως τῆσδε ὡς ὄντας τοὺς τότε Ἀθηναίους, οὓς ἐμήνυσεν ἀφανεῖς ὄντας ἡ τῶν ἱερῶν γραμμάτων φήμη, τὰ λοιπὰ δὲ ὡς περὶ πολιτῶν καὶ Ἀθηναίων ὄντων ἤδη ποιεῖσθαι τοὺς λόγους.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","text":"ΣΩ. τελέως τε καὶ λαμπρῶς ἔοικα ἀνταπολήψεσθαι τὴν τῶν λόγων ἑστίασιν. σὸν οὖν ἔργον λέγειν ἄν, ὦ Τίμαιε, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο, ὡς ἔοικεν, εἴη καλέσαντα κατὰ νόμον θεούς.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","text":"ΤΙ. ἀλλʼ, ὦ Σώκρατες, τοῦτό γε δὴ πάντες ὅσοι καὶ κατὰ βραχὺ σωφροσύνης μετέχουσιν, ἐπὶ παντὸς ὁρμῇ καὶ σμικροῦ καὶ μεγάλου πράγματος θεὸν ἀεί που καλοῦσιν· ἡμᾶς δὲ τοὺς περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λόγους ποιεῖσθαί πῃ μέλλοντας, ᾗ γέγονεν ἢ καὶ ἀγενές ἐστιν, εἰ μὴ παντάπασι παραλλάττομεν, ἀνάγκη θεούς τε καὶ θεὰς ἐπικαλουμένους εὔχεσθαι πάντα κατὰ νοῦν ἐκείνοις μὲν μάλιστα, ἑπομένως  δὲ ἡμῖν εἰπεῖν. καὶ τὰ μὲν περὶ θεῶν ταύτῃ παρακεκλήσθω· τὸ δʼ ἡμέτερον παρακλητέον, ᾗ ῥᾷστʼ ἂν ὑμεῖς μὲν μάθοιτε, ἐγὼ δὲ ᾗ διανοοῦμαι μάλιστʼ ἂν περὶ τῶν προκειμένων ἐνδειξαίμην.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"ae90d3ce55b1f86f557b4229de1c391f105e1152b63cbfc752287bebe8b01fe3","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224539308742Z_ea259f8d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 27","source_sha256":"ae90d3ce55b1f86f557b4229de1c391f105e1152b63cbfc752287bebe8b01fe3","sha256":"53241e1fe6221106ccd1932ea7a821f8e1187302fa7ee93fc1d811fc15049fe8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:39.308848+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","text":"SOC. And whom, Critias, could we more suitably take in place of him, one who, because of his kinship, would be especially fitting for the present sacrifice to the goddess, and who would also make it by no means a fabricated myth but a true account? For how, and whence, shall we discover others if we let these go? It is not possible; but with good fortune you must speak, while I, in exchange for yesterday's speeches, now keep quiet and listen in return.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","text":"CRIT. Consider, then, Socrates, the arrangement we have made for your entertainment. For it seemed to us that Timaeus—since he is the most astronomical among us and has made it his chief work to know about the nature of the universe—should speak first, beginning from the generation of the cosmos and ending with the nature of human beings; and that I, after him, receiving from him human beings generated in speech, and from you certain of them exceptionally educated, should, bringing them before us as judges in accordance with Solon's account and law, make them citizens of this city, as being those Athenians of that time whom the report of the sacred writings has declared to have become obscure; and that thereafter I should frame the rest of the speeches concerning them as citizens and Athenians already.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","text":"SOC. It seems that I shall receive in return a complete and splendid banquet of speeches. It would then, Timaeus, as seems likely, be your task to speak next, after duly invoking the gods according to law.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","text":"TIM. But, Socrates, this at any rate is what all who partake even slightly of prudence always do: at the outset of every undertaking, small or great, they somehow invoke a god. And we, who are about to make speeches concerning the universe—whether it has come into being or is also ungenerated, unless we are wholly astray—must, invoking gods and goddesses, pray that we may say everything in a manner pleasing above all to them, and consequently to ourselves. So let the gods have been invoked in this way; but our own matter must be invoked, so that you may most readily learn, and I may most fully set forth, as I conceive it, the matters proposed.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"5cd957e6f7d899a6f879111fe6bbff0acfc5eb3c9ae733b6be5fe3e86643062b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 27"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 27","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11","title":"Section 28","order":12,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_11","text":"ΤΙ. ἔστιν οὖν δὴ κατʼ ἐμὴν δόξαν πρῶτον διαιρετέον τάδε· τί τὸ ὂν ἀεί, γένεσιν δὲ οὐκ ἔχον, καὶ τί τὸ γιγνόμενον μὲν  ἀεί, ὂν δὲ οὐδέποτε; τὸ μὲν δὴ νοήσει μετὰ λόγου περιληπτόν, ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὄν, τὸ δʼ αὖ δόξῃ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως ἀλόγου δοξαστόν, γιγνόμενον καὶ ἀπολλύμενον, ὄντως δὲ οὐδέποτε ὄν. πᾶν δὲ αὖ τὸ γιγνόμενον ὑπʼ αἰτίου τινὸς ἐξ ἀνάγκης γίγνεσθαι· παντὶ γὰρ ἀδύνατον χωρὶς αἰτίου γένεσιν σχεῖν. ὅτου μὲν οὖν ἂν ὁ δημιουργὸς πρὸς τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον βλέπων ἀεί, τοιούτῳ τινὶ προσχρώμενος παραδείγματι, τὴν ἰδέαν καὶ δύναμιν αὐτοῦ ἀπεργάζηται, καλὸν ἐξ ἀνάγκης  οὕτως ἀποτελεῖσθαι πᾶν· οὗ δʼ ἂν εἰς γεγονός, γεννητῷ παραδείγματι προσχρώμενος, οὐ καλόν. ὁ δὴ πᾶς οὐρανὸς —ἢ κόσμος ἢ καὶ ἄλλο ὅτι ποτὲ ὀνομαζόμενος μάλιστʼ ἂν δέχοιτο, τοῦθʼ ἡμῖν ὠνομάσθω—σκεπτέον δʼ οὖν περὶ αὐτοῦ πρῶτον, ὅπερ ὑπόκειται περὶ παντὸς ἐν ἀρχῇ δεῖν σκοπεῖν, πότερον ἦν ἀεί, γενέσεως ἀρχὴν ἔχων οὐδεμίαν, ἢ γέγονεν, ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς τινος ἀρξάμενος. γέγονεν· ὁρατὸς γὰρ ἁπτός τέ ἐστιν καὶ σῶμα ἔχων, πάντα δὲ τὰ τοιαῦτα αἰσθητά, τὰ  δʼ αἰσθητά, δόξῃ περιληπτὰ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως, γιγνόμενα καὶ γεννητὰ ἐφάνη. τῷ δʼ αὖ γενομένῳ φαμὲν ὑπʼ αἰτίου τινὸς ἀνάγκην εἶναι γενέσθαι.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἔστιν οὖν δὴ κατʼ ἐμὴν δόξαν πρῶτον διαιρετέον τάδε· τί τὸ ὂν ἀεί, γένεσιν δὲ οὐκ ἔχον, καὶ τί τὸ γιγνόμενον μὲν  ἀεί, ὂν δὲ οὐδέποτε; τὸ μὲν δὴ νοήσει μετὰ λόγου περιληπτόν, ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὄν, τὸ δʼ αὖ δόξῃ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως ἀλόγου δοξαστόν, γιγνόμενον καὶ ἀπολλύμενον, ὄντως δὲ οὐδέποτε ὄν. πᾶν δὲ αὖ τὸ γιγνόμενον ὑπʼ αἰτίου τινὸς ἐξ ἀνάγκης γίγνεσθαι· παντὶ γὰρ ἀδύνατον χωρὶς αἰτίου γένεσιν σχεῖν. ὅτου μὲν οὖν ἂν ὁ δημιουργὸς πρὸς τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον βλέπων ἀεί, τοιούτῳ τινὶ προσχρώμενος παραδείγματι, τὴν ἰδέαν καὶ δύναμιν αὐτοῦ ἀπεργάζηται, καλὸν ἐξ ἀνάγκης  οὕτως ἀποτελεῖσθαι πᾶν· οὗ δʼ ἂν εἰς γεγονός, γεννητῷ παραδείγματι προσχρώμενος, οὐ καλόν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","text":"ὁ δὴ πᾶς οὐρανὸς —ἢ κόσμος ἢ καὶ ἄλλο ὅτι ποτὲ ὀνομαζόμενος μάλιστʼ ἂν δέχοιτο, τοῦθʼ ἡμῖν ὠνομάσθω—σκεπτέον δʼ οὖν περὶ αὐτοῦ πρῶτον, ὅπερ ὑπόκειται περὶ παντὸς ἐν ἀρχῇ δεῖν σκοπεῖν, πότερον ἦν ἀεί, γενέσεως ἀρχὴν ἔχων οὐδεμίαν, ἢ γέγονεν, ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς τινος ἀρξάμενος. γέγονεν· ὁρατὸς γὰρ ἁπτός τέ ἐστιν καὶ σῶμα ἔχων, πάντα δὲ τὰ τοιαῦτα αἰσθητά, τὰ  δʼ αἰσθητά, δόξῃ περιληπτὰ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως, γιγνόμενα καὶ γεννητὰ ἐφάνη. τῷ δʼ αὖ γενομένῳ φαμὲν ὑπʼ αἰτίου τινὸς ἀνάγκην εἶναι γενέσθαι.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"89c50de6810fb6b411729995f7aa7120b9f1833145f0f87437b17b258d0e24d5","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224545359576Z_696b587a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 28","source_sha256":"89c50de6810fb6b411729995f7aa7120b9f1833145f0f87437b17b258d0e24d5","sha256":"47ddaabd36605b8ef4fb318c575537fb71aa18d358f135dda9ba74ba81ee61e9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:45.359694+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","text":"TI. Then, in my opinion, we must first make the following distinction: what is that which always is and has no becoming, and what is that which is always becoming and never is? The one is apprehensible by intellection together with an account, always being in the same way; the other is opinionable by opinion together with non-rational sensation, becoming and perishing, but never truly being. Again, everything that comes to be must necessarily come to be through some cause; for it is impossible for anything to have coming-to-be apart from a cause. Whenever, then, the craftsman, looking to that which always remains the same and employing as a pattern something of that sort, works out its form and power, everything is necessarily brought to completion beautiful in this way; but whenever he looks to that which has come to be, employing a generated pattern, it is not beautiful.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","text":"The whole heaven—whether it is most proper to call it cosmos or by whatever other name it might accept, let this be the name by which it is called by us—we must first consider concerning it that which it is laid down that one must consider at the outset concerning everything: whether it always was, having no beginning of coming-to-be, or whether it has come to be, having begun from some beginning. It has come to be; for it is visible and tangible and has a body, and all such things are perceptible; and perceptible things, apprehensible by opinion together with sensation, appeared to be becoming and generated. And we say that that which has come to be must necessarily have come to be through some cause.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"cdc4c425b9bfbdc3ad5eb6d6181998ed6975f3f259a7de98fb39edcbc980e8c9","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 28"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 28","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12","title":"Section 29","order":13,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_12","text":"ΤΙ. τὸν μὲν οὖν ποιητὴν καὶ πατέρα τοῦδε τοῦ παντὸς εὑρεῖν τε ἔργον καὶ εὑρόντα εἰς πάντας ἀδύνατον λέγειν· τόδε δʼ οὖν πάλιν ἐπισκεπτέον περὶ αὐτοῦ, πρὸς πότερον τῶν παραδειγμάτων ὁ τεκταινόμενος αὐτὸν  ἀπηργάζετο, πότερον πρὸς τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ καὶ ὡσαύτως ἔχον ἢ πρὸς τὸ γεγονός. εἰ μὲν δὴ καλός ἐστιν ὅδε ὁ κόσμος ὅ τε δημιουργὸς ἀγαθός, δῆλον ὡς πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον ἔβλεπεν· εἰ δὲ ὃ μηδʼ εἰπεῖν τινι θέμις, πρὸς γεγονός. παντὶ δὴ σαφὲς ὅτι πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον· ὁ μὲν γὰρ κάλλιστος τῶν γεγονότων, ὁ δʼ ἄριστος τῶν αἰτίων. οὕτω δὴ γεγενημένος πρὸς τὸ λόγῳ καὶ φρονήσει περιληπτὸν καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον δεδημιούργηται·  τούτων δὲ ὑπαρχόντων αὖ πᾶσα ἀνάγκη τόνδε τὸν κόσμον εἰκόνα τινὸς εἶναι. μέγιστον δὴ παντὸς ἄρξασθαι κατὰ φύσιν ἀρχήν. ὧδε οὖν περί τε εἰκόνος καὶ περὶ τοῦ παραδείγματος αὐτῆς διοριστέον, ὡς ἄρα τοὺς λόγους, ὧνπέρ εἰσιν ἐξηγηταί, τούτων αὐτῶν καὶ συγγενεῖς ὄντας· τοῦ μὲν οὖν μονίμου καὶ βεβαίου καὶ μετὰ νοῦ καταφανοῦς μονίμους καὶ ἀμεταπτώτους—καθʼ ὅσον οἷόν τε καὶ ἀνελέγκτοις προσήκει λόγοις εἶναι καὶ ἀνικήτοις, τούτου δεῖ  μηδὲν ἐλλείπειν—τοὺς δὲ τοῦ πρὸς μὲν ἐκεῖνο ἀπεικασθέντος, ὄντος δὲ εἰκόνος εἰκότας ἀνὰ λόγον τε ἐκείνων ὄντας· ὅτιπερ πρὸς γένεσιν οὐσία, τοῦτο πρὸς πίστιν ἀλήθεια. ἐὰν οὖν, ὦ Σώκρατες, πολλὰ πολλῶν πέρι, θεῶν καὶ τῆς τοῦ παντὸς γενέσεως, μὴ δυνατοὶ γιγνώμεθα πάντῃ πάντως αὐτοὺς ἑαυτοῖς ὁμολογουμένους λόγους καὶ ἀπηκριβωμένους ἀποδοῦναι, μὴ θαυμάσῃς· ἀλλʼ ἐὰν ἄρα μηδενὸς ἧττον παρεχώμεθα εἰκότας, ἀγαπᾶν χρή, μεμνημένους ὡς ὁ λέγων ἐγὼ  ὑμεῖς τε οἱ κριταὶ φύσιν ἀνθρωπίνην ἔχομεν, ὥστε περὶ τούτων τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον ἀποδεχομένους πρέπει τούτου μηδὲν ἔτι πέρα ζητεῖν.\n\n \n\nΣΩ. ἄριστα, ὦ Τίμαιε, παντάπασί τε ὡς κελεύεις ἀποδεκτέον· τὸ μὲν οὖν προοίμιον θαυμασίως ἀπεδεξάμεθά σου, τὸν δὲ δὴ νόμον ἡμῖν ἐφεξῆς πέραινε.\n\n \n\nΤΙ. λέγωμεν δὴ διʼ ἥντινα αἰτίαν γένεσιν καὶ τὸ πᾶν  τόδε ὁ συνιστὰς συνέστησεν. ἀγαθὸς ἦν, ἀγαθῷ δὲ οὐδεὶς περὶ οὐδενὸς οὐδέποτε ἐγγίγνεται φθόνος· τούτου δʼ ἐκτὸς ὢν πάντα ὅτι μάλιστα ἐβουλήθη γενέσθαι παραπλήσια ἑαυτῷ.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὸν μὲν οὖν ποιητὴν καὶ πατέρα τοῦδε τοῦ παντὸς εὑρεῖν τε ἔργον καὶ εὑρόντα εἰς πάντας ἀδύνατον λέγειν· τόδε δʼ οὖν πάλιν ἐπισκεπτέον περὶ αὐτοῦ, πρὸς πότερον τῶν παραδειγμάτων ὁ τεκταινόμενος αὐτὸν  ἀπηργάζετο, πότερον πρὸς τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ καὶ ὡσαύτως ἔχον ἢ πρὸς τὸ γεγονός. εἰ μὲν δὴ καλός ἐστιν ὅδε ὁ κόσμος ὅ τε δημιουργὸς ἀγαθός, δῆλον ὡς πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον ἔβλεπεν· εἰ δὲ ὃ μηδʼ εἰπεῖν τινι θέμις, πρὸς γεγονός. παντὶ δὴ σαφὲς ὅτι πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον· ὁ μὲν γὰρ κάλλιστος τῶν γεγονότων, ὁ δʼ ἄριστος τῶν αἰτίων. οὕτω δὴ γεγενημένος πρὸς τὸ λόγῳ καὶ φρονήσει περιληπτὸν καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον δεδημιούργηται·  τούτων δὲ ὑπαρχόντων αὖ πᾶσα ἀνάγκη τόνδε τὸν κόσμον εἰκόνα τινὸς εἶναι. μέγιστον δὴ παντὸς ἄρξασθαι κατὰ φύσιν ἀρχήν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","text":"ὧδε οὖν περί τε εἰκόνος καὶ περὶ τοῦ παραδείγματος αὐτῆς διοριστέον, ὡς ἄρα τοὺς λόγους, ὧνπέρ εἰσιν ἐξηγηταί, τούτων αὐτῶν καὶ συγγενεῖς ὄντας· τοῦ μὲν οὖν μονίμου καὶ βεβαίου καὶ μετὰ νοῦ καταφανοῦς μονίμους καὶ ἀμεταπτώτους—καθʼ ὅσον οἷόν τε καὶ ἀνελέγκτοις προσήκει λόγοις εἶναι καὶ ἀνικήτοις, τούτου δεῖ  μηδὲν ἐλλείπειν—τοὺς δὲ τοῦ πρὸς μὲν ἐκεῖνο ἀπεικασθέντος, ὄντος δὲ εἰκόνος εἰκότας ἀνὰ λόγον τε ἐκείνων ὄντας· ὅτιπερ πρὸς γένεσιν οὐσία, τοῦτο πρὸς πίστιν ἀλήθεια. ἐὰν οὖν, ὦ Σώκρατες, πολλὰ πολλῶν πέρι, θεῶν καὶ τῆς τοῦ παντὸς γενέσεως, μὴ δυνατοὶ γιγνώμεθα πάντῃ πάντως αὐτοὺς ἑαυτοῖς ὁμολογουμένους λόγους καὶ ἀπηκριβωμένους ἀποδοῦναι, μὴ θαυμάσῃς· ἀλλʼ ἐὰν ἄρα μηδενὸς ἧττον παρεχώμεθα εἰκότας, ἀγαπᾶν χρή, μεμνημένους ὡς ὁ λέγων ἐγὼ  ὑμεῖς τε οἱ κριταὶ φύσιν ἀνθρωπίνην ἔχομεν, ὥστε περὶ τούτων τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον ἀποδεχομένους πρέπει τούτου μηδὲν ἔτι πέρα ζητεῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0003","text":"ΣΩ. ἄριστα, ὦ Τίμαιε, παντάπασί τε ὡς κελεύεις ἀποδεκτέον· τὸ μὲν οὖν προοίμιον θαυμασίως ἀπεδεξάμεθά σου, τὸν δὲ δὴ νόμον ἡμῖν ἐφεξῆς πέραινε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","text":"ΤΙ. λέγωμεν δὴ διʼ ἥντινα αἰτίαν γένεσιν καὶ τὸ πᾶν  τόδε ὁ συνιστὰς συνέστησεν. ἀγαθὸς ἦν, ἀγαθῷ δὲ οὐδεὶς περὶ οὐδενὸς οὐδέποτε ἐγγίγνεται φθόνος· τούτου δʼ ἐκτὸς ὢν πάντα ὅτι μάλιστα ἐβουλήθη γενέσθαι παραπλήσια ἑαυτῷ.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"3c44b6c07dce2d38d8a60c89861674e2d185ef0a3501b0caeb423d3fc7d15e77","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224554269485Z_4c774928","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 29","source_sha256":"3c44b6c07dce2d38d8a60c89861674e2d185ef0a3501b0caeb423d3fc7d15e77","sha256":"8b7c51273e72b44004fe8dcb6c02936f65f7312c7a08e10b2a142fd84e90d654","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:45:54.269592+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","text":"TIM. To find the maker and father of this universe is indeed a task, and, having found him, to declare him to all is impossible. Yet this again must be considered concerning him: toward which of the paradigms did he who fashioned it work, whether toward that which is the same and alike, or toward that which has come to be? Now if this cosmos is beautiful and its craftsman good, it is clear that he looked toward the eternal; but if—to say which is not even permitted to anyone—toward that which has come to be. It is then clear to everyone that he looked toward the eternal; for this is the most beautiful of things that have come to be, and he the best of causes. Thus having come to be, it has been crafted with reference to that which is comprehensible by reason and intelligence and remains the same. And since these things are so, it is altogether necessary that this cosmos be an image of something. It is most important to begin every matter from a beginning according to nature.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","text":"Thus, then, must a distinction be made concerning an image and concerning its paradigm itself: that the accounts, of whatever things they are interpreters, are akin to those very things. Accounts of what is stable and firm and manifest with intelligence must themselves be stable and unchangeable—as far as possible; and, insofar as it befits accounts to be irrefutable and invincible, they must lack nothing in this respect. But accounts of what has been likened to that, being an image, must be likely accounts, in proportion to those others. For as being is to coming-to-be, so is truth to belief. If, then, Socrates, concerning many things—gods and the generation of the universe—we prove unable to render accounts that agree with themselves in every way and are exact, do not be surprised. But if we offer accounts no less likely, we must be content, remembering that both I who speak and you who judge have human nature, so that, in accepting the likely myth concerning these matters, it is fitting to seek nothing further beyond this.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0003","text":"SOC. Excellent, Timaeus; we must accept it altogether as you bid. We have wonderfully accepted your prelude; now carry through for us in sequence the discourse.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","text":"TIM. Let us say then for what cause he who constituted it constituted this coming-to-be and this all. He was good; and in one who is good no envy concerning anything ever arises. Being free from this, he wished all things, so far as possible, to come to be like himself.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"b78909b582c4f7858439e750e6ff1217f54e4b5fa022b002f6aee4585b8e6b52","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 29"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 29","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3","title":"Section 30","order":14,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3","text":"ΤΙ. ταύτην δὴ γενέσεως καὶ κόσμου μάλιστʼ ἄν τις ἀρχὴν κυριωτάτην  παρʼ ἀνδρῶν φρονίμων ἀποδεχόμενος ὀρθότατα ἀποδέχοιτʼ ἄν. βουληθεὶς γὰρ ὁ θεὸς ἀγαθὰ μὲν πάντα, φλαῦρον δὲ μηδὲν εἶναι κατὰ δύναμιν, οὕτω δὴ πᾶν ὅσον ἦν ὁρατὸν παραλαβὼν οὐχ ἡσυχίαν ἄγον ἀλλὰ κινούμενον πλημμελῶς καὶ ἀτάκτως, εἰς τάξιν αὐτὸ ἤγαγεν ἐκ τῆς ἀταξίας, ἡγησάμενος ἐκεῖνο τούτου πάντως ἄμεινον. θέμις δʼ οὔτʼ ἦν οὔτʼ ἔστιν τῷ ἀρίστῳ δρᾶν ἄλλο πλὴν τὸ κάλλιστον·  λογισάμενος οὖν ηὕρισκεν ἐκ τῶν κατὰ φύσιν ὁρατῶν οὐδὲν ἀνόητον τοῦ νοῦν ἔχοντος ὅλον ὅλου κάλλιον ἔσεσθαί ποτε ἔργον, νοῦν δʼ αὖ χωρὶς ψυχῆς ἀδύνατον παραγενέσθαι τῳ. διὰ δὴ τὸν λογισμὸν τόνδε νοῦν μὲν ἐν ψυχῇ, ψυχὴν δʼ ἐν σώματι συνιστὰς τὸ πᾶν συνετεκταίνετο, ὅπως ὅτι κάλλιστον εἴη κατὰ φύσιν ἄριστόν τε ἔργον ἀπειργασμένος. οὕτως οὖν δὴ κατὰ λόγον τὸν εἰκότα δεῖ λέγειν τόνδε τὸν κόσμον ζῷον ἔμψυχον ἔννουν τε τῇ ἀληθείᾳ διὰ τὴν τοῦ θεοῦ  γενέσθαι πρόνοιαν. τούτου δʼ ὑπάρχοντος αὖ τὰ τούτοις ἐφεξῆς ἡμῖν λεκτέον, τίνι τῶν ζῴων αὐτὸν εἰς ὁμοιότητα ὁ συνιστὰς συνέστησεν. τῶν μὲν οὖν ἐν μέρους εἴδει πεφυκότων μηδενὶ καταξιώσωμεν —ἀτελεῖ γὰρ ἐοικὸς οὐδέν ποτʼ ἂν γένοιτο καλόν—οὗ δʼ ἔστιν τἆλλα ζῷα καθʼ ἓν καὶ κατὰ γένη μόρια, τούτῳ πάντων ὁμοιότατον αὐτὸν εἶναι τιθῶμεν. τὰ γὰρ δὴ νοητὰ ζῷα πάντα ἐκεῖνο ἐν ἑαυτῷ περιλαβὸν ἔχει, καθάπερ ὅδε ὁ  κόσμος ἡμᾶς ὅσα τε ἄλλα θρέμματα συνέστηκεν ὁρατά.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ταύτην δὴ γενέσεως καὶ κόσμου μάλιστʼ ἄν τις ἀρχὴν κυριωτάτην  παρʼ ἀνδρῶν φρονίμων ἀποδεχόμενος ὀρθότατα ἀποδέχοιτʼ ἄν. βουληθεὶς γὰρ ὁ θεὸς ἀγαθὰ μὲν πάντα, φλαῦρον δὲ μηδὲν εἶναι κατὰ δύναμιν, οὕτω δὴ πᾶν ὅσον ἦν ὁρατὸν παραλαβὼν οὐχ ἡσυχίαν ἄγον ἀλλὰ κινούμενον πλημμελῶς καὶ ἀτάκτως, εἰς τάξιν αὐτὸ ἤγαγεν ἐκ τῆς ἀταξίας, ἡγησάμενος ἐκεῖνο τούτου πάντως ἄμεινον. θέμις δʼ οὔτʼ ἦν οὔτʼ ἔστιν τῷ ἀρίστῳ δρᾶν ἄλλο πλὴν τὸ κάλλιστον·  λογισάμενος οὖν ηὕρισκεν ἐκ τῶν κατὰ φύσιν ὁρατῶν οὐδὲν ἀνόητον τοῦ νοῦν ἔχοντος ὅλον ὅλου κάλλιον ἔσεσθαί ποτε ἔργον, νοῦν δʼ αὖ χωρὶς ψυχῆς ἀδύνατον παραγενέσθαι τῳ. διὰ δὴ τὸν λογισμὸν τόνδε νοῦν μὲν ἐν ψυχῇ, ψυχὴν δʼ ἐν σώματι συνιστὰς τὸ πᾶν συνετεκταίνετο, ὅπως ὅτι κάλλιστον εἴη κατὰ φύσιν ἄριστόν τε ἔργον ἀπειργασμένος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","text":"οὕτως οὖν δὴ κατὰ λόγον τὸν εἰκότα δεῖ λέγειν τόνδε τὸν κόσμον ζῷον ἔμψυχον ἔννουν τε τῇ ἀληθείᾳ διὰ τὴν τοῦ θεοῦ  γενέσθαι πρόνοιαν. τούτου δʼ ὑπάρχοντος αὖ τὰ τούτοις ἐφεξῆς ἡμῖν λεκτέον, τίνι τῶν ζῴων αὐτὸν εἰς ὁμοιότητα ὁ συνιστὰς συνέστησεν. τῶν μὲν οὖν ἐν μέρους εἴδει πεφυκότων μηδενὶ καταξιώσωμεν —ἀτελεῖ γὰρ ἐοικὸς οὐδέν ποτʼ ἂν γένοιτο καλόν—οὗ δʼ ἔστιν τἆλλα ζῷα καθʼ ἓν καὶ κατὰ γένη μόρια, τούτῳ πάντων ὁμοιότατον αὐτὸν εἶναι τιθῶμεν. τὰ γὰρ δὴ νοητὰ ζῷα πάντα ἐκεῖνο ἐν ἑαυτῷ περιλαβὸν ἔχει, καθάπερ ὅδε ὁ  κόσμος ἡμᾶς ὅσα τε ἄλλα θρέμματα συνέστηκεν ὁρατά.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"5a1383a9dd9f20f4ba43538ebad240aaf593c3f780ea64152e8fb7af540368db","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224600652007Z_3534f61e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 30","source_sha256":"5a1383a9dd9f20f4ba43538ebad240aaf593c3f780ea64152e8fb7af540368db","sha256":"e32ac74f7dd0ef798a098b1755957177fc7906ce4e88cd39e276691c32e4402c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:00.652174+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","text":"TIM. This, then, is the principle of coming-to-be and of the cosmos which one would most rightly accept, accepting it from wise men as most authoritative. For since the god wished that all things should be good, and nothing base, so far as possible, he thus took over all that was visible, not at rest but moving discordantly and without order, and brought it from disorder into order, considering that the latter was in every way better than the former. For it neither was nor is permitted to the best to do anything other than what is most beautiful. And so, upon reasoning, he found that, among things visible by nature, no work that is without intelligence would ever be more beautiful, as a whole, than a whole possessing intelligence; and that intelligence could not come to be present in anything apart from soul. On account of this reasoning, then, placing intelligence in soul and soul in body, he fashioned the all together, so that he might have accomplished a work that was by nature most beautiful and best.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","text":"Thus, then, according to the likely account, one must say that this cosmos truly came to be a living creature endowed with soul and intelligence through the providence of god. This being so, we must next say what follows: in likeness to which of living creatures did he who constituted it constitute it? Let us not deem it worthy of likeness to any of those things naturally constituted in the form of a part—for nothing that resembles an incomplete thing could ever come to be beautiful—but let us hold that it is most like that of which all the other living creatures are parts, both individually and according to kinds. For that contains within itself all the intelligible living creatures, just as this cosmos has constituted us and all the other visible creatures.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"813369e68394ee7b9da6f94713499d0bee2aeb60b155226be32a656aea4e82d1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 30"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 30","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13","title":"Section 31","order":15,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_13","text":"ΤΙ. τῷ γὰρ τῶν νοουμένων καλλίστῳ καὶ κατὰ πάντα τελέῳ μάλιστα αὐτὸν ὁ θεὸς ὁμοιῶσαι βουληθεὶς ζῷον ἓν ὁρατόν, πάνθʼ ὅσα  αὐτοῦ κατὰ φύσιν συγγενῆ ζῷα ἐντὸς ἔχον ἑαυτοῦ, συνέστησε. πότερον οὖν ὀρθῶς ἕνα οὐρανὸν προσειρήκαμεν, ἢ πολλοὺς καὶ ἀπείρους λέγειν ἦν ὀρθότερον; ἕνα, εἴπερ κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα δεδημιουργημένος ἔσται. τὸ γὰρ περιέχον πάντα ὁπόσα νοητὰ ζῷα μεθʼ ἑτέρου δεύτερον οὐκ ἄν ποτʼ εἴη· πάλιν γὰρ ἂν ἕτερον εἶναι τὸ περὶ ἐκείνω δέοι ζῷον, οὗ μέρος ἂν εἴτην ἐκείνω, καὶ οὐκ ἂν ἔτι ἐκείνοιν ἀλλʼ ἐκείνῳ τῷ περιέχοντι τόδʼ ἂν ἀφωμοιωμένον λέγοιτο ὀρθότερον. ἵνα  οὖν τόδε κατὰ τὴν μόνωσιν ὅμοιον ᾖ τῷ παντελεῖ ζῴῳ, διὰ ταῦτα οὔτε δύο οὔτʼ ἀπείρους ἐποίησεν ὁ ποιῶν κόσμους, ἀλλʼ εἷς ὅδε μονογενὴς οὐρανὸς γεγονὼς ἔστιν καὶ ἔτʼ ἔσται. σωματοειδὲς δὲ δὴ καὶ ὁρατὸν ἁπτόν τε δεῖ τὸ γενόμενον εἶναι, χωρισθὲν δὲ πυρὸς οὐδὲν ἄν ποτε ὁρατὸν γένοιτο, οὐδὲ ἁπτὸν ἄνευ τινὸς στερεοῦ, στερεὸν δὲ οὐκ ἄνευ γῆς· ὅθεν ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ γῆς τὸ τοῦ παντὸς ἀρχόμενος συνιστάναι σῶμα ὁ θεὸς ἐποίει. δύο δὲ μόνω καλῶς συνίστασθαι τρίτου χωρὶς  οὐ δυνατόν· δεσμὸν γὰρ ἐν μέσῳ δεῖ τινα ἀμφοῖν συναγωγὸν γίγνεσθαι. δεσμῶν δὲ κάλλιστος ὃς ἂν αὑτὸν καὶ τὰ συνδούμενα ὅτι μάλιστα ἓν ποιῇ, τοῦτο δὲ πέφυκεν ἀναλογία κάλλιστα ἀποτελεῖν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τῷ γὰρ τῶν νοουμένων καλλίστῳ καὶ κατὰ πάντα τελέῳ μάλιστα αὐτὸν ὁ θεὸς ὁμοιῶσαι βουληθεὶς ζῷον ἓν ὁρατόν, πάνθʼ ὅσα  αὐτοῦ κατὰ φύσιν συγγενῆ ζῷα ἐντὸς ἔχον ἑαυτοῦ, συνέστησε. πότερον οὖν ὀρθῶς ἕνα οὐρανὸν προσειρήκαμεν, ἢ πολλοὺς καὶ ἀπείρους λέγειν ἦν ὀρθότερον; ἕνα, εἴπερ κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα δεδημιουργημένος ἔσται. τὸ γὰρ περιέχον πάντα ὁπόσα νοητὰ ζῷα μεθʼ ἑτέρου δεύτερον οὐκ ἄν ποτʼ εἴη· πάλιν γὰρ ἂν ἕτερον εἶναι τὸ περὶ ἐκείνω δέοι ζῷον, οὗ μέρος ἂν εἴτην ἐκείνω, καὶ οὐκ ἂν ἔτι ἐκείνοιν ἀλλʼ ἐκείνῳ τῷ περιέχοντι τόδʼ ἂν ἀφωμοιωμένον λέγοιτο ὀρθότερον. ἵνα  οὖν τόδε κατὰ τὴν μόνωσιν ὅμοιον ᾖ τῷ παντελεῖ ζῴῳ, διὰ ταῦτα οὔτε δύο οὔτʼ ἀπείρους ἐποίησεν ὁ ποιῶν κόσμους, ἀλλʼ εἷς ὅδε μονογενὴς οὐρανὸς γεγονὼς ἔστιν καὶ ἔτʼ ἔσται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","text":"σωματοειδὲς δὲ δὴ καὶ ὁρατὸν ἁπτόν τε δεῖ τὸ γενόμενον εἶναι, χωρισθὲν δὲ πυρὸς οὐδὲν ἄν ποτε ὁρατὸν γένοιτο, οὐδὲ ἁπτὸν ἄνευ τινὸς στερεοῦ, στερεὸν δὲ οὐκ ἄνευ γῆς· ὅθεν ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ γῆς τὸ τοῦ παντὸς ἀρχόμενος συνιστάναι σῶμα ὁ θεὸς ἐποίει. δύο δὲ μόνω καλῶς συνίστασθαι τρίτου χωρὶς  οὐ δυνατόν· δεσμὸν γὰρ ἐν μέσῳ δεῖ τινα ἀμφοῖν συναγωγὸν γίγνεσθαι. δεσμῶν δὲ κάλλιστος ὃς ἂν αὑτὸν καὶ τὰ συνδούμενα ὅτι μάλιστα ἓν ποιῇ, τοῦτο δὲ πέφυκεν ἀναλογία κάλλιστα ἀποτελεῖν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"2d40b1a480c55fdaefdb7582f527569c0fc90adee3f3a99f69f20a13abb4493a","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224606479128Z_edfae8b5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 31","source_sha256":"2d40b1a480c55fdaefdb7582f527569c0fc90adee3f3a99f69f20a13abb4493a","sha256":"f9781fe70dfa5f6889fb2c595ecc231f60d37a8a291ba70b308a688fe5c40b75","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:06.479241+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","text":"TIM. For wishing to make it as like as possible to the fairest and in every way most complete of intelligible living beings, the god constituted it as one visible living being, having within itself all the living beings that are by nature akin to it. Then, have we rightly designated one heaven, or would it have been more correct to speak of many and infinite heavens? One, if indeed it is to have been fashioned according to the paradigm. For that which embraces all the intelligible living beings could never be second along with another; for again there would have to be another living being around those two, of which they would be parts, and this would more correctly be said to have been assimilated, not to those two, but to that which embraces them. Therefore, in order that this universe might be like the all-complete living being in respect of its uniqueness, for these reasons the maker made neither two nor infinite worlds, but this one only-begotten heaven has come to be and is and shall yet be.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","text":"And what has come to be must indeed be bodily, visible, and tangible; but nothing could ever become visible apart from fire, nor tangible without something solid, nor solid without earth. Hence, when the god began to constitute the body of the universe, he made it from fire and earth. But it is not possible for two alone to be well joined together without a third; for there must arise between them some bond to bring both together. And the finest of bonds is that which makes itself and the things bound together as much as possible one; and proportion is by nature best fitted to accomplish this.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"de4913dea99e2a650aa9f6f93d7458d32e02e0c27b4d0429fb3b8ebbdaa82060","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 31"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 31","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14","title":"Section 32","order":16,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_14","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπόταν γὰρ ἀριθμῶν τριῶν εἴτε ὄγκων  εἴτε δυνάμεων ὡντινωνοῦν ᾖ τὸ μέσον, ὅτιπερ τὸ πρῶτον πρὸς αὐτό, τοῦτο αὐτὸ πρὸς τὸ ἔσχατον, καὶ πάλιν αὖθις, ὅτι τὸ ἔσχατον πρὸς τὸ μέσον, τὸ μέσον πρὸς τὸ πρῶτον, τότε τὸ μέσον μὲν πρῶτον καὶ ἔσχατον γιγνόμενον, τὸ δʼ ἔσχατον καὶ τὸ πρῶτον αὖ μέσα ἀμφότερα, πάνθʼ οὕτως ἐξ ἀνάγκης τὰ αὐτὰ εἶναι συμβήσεται, τὰ αὐτὰ δὲ γενόμενα ἀλλήλοις ἓν πάντα ἔσται. εἰ μὲν οὖν ἐπίπεδον μέν, βάθος δὲ μηδὲν ἔχον ἔδει γίγνεσθαι τὸ τοῦ παντὸς σῶμα, μία μεσότης ἂν ἐξήρκει  τά τε μεθʼ αὑτῆς συνδεῖν καὶ ἑαυτήν, νῦν δὲ στερεοειδῆ γὰρ αὐτὸν προσῆκεν εἶναι, τὰ δὲ στερεὰ μία μὲν οὐδέποτε, δύο δὲ ἀεὶ μεσότητες συναρμόττουσιν· οὕτω δὴ πυρός τε καὶ γῆς ὕδωρ ἀέρα τε ὁ θεὸς ἐν μέσῳ θείς, καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα καθʼ ὅσον ἦν δυνατὸν ἀνὰ τὸν αὐτὸν λόγον ἀπεργασάμενος, ὅτιπερ πῦρ πρὸς ἀέρα, τοῦτο ἀέρα πρὸς ὕδωρ, καὶ ὅτι ἀὴρ πρὸς ὕδωρ, ὕδωρ πρὸς γῆν, συνέδησεν καὶ συνεστήσατο οὐρανὸν ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτόν. καὶ διὰ ταῦτα ἔκ τε δὴ τούτων τοιούτων  καὶ τὸν ἀριθμὸν τεττάρων τὸ τοῦ κόσμου σῶμα ἐγεννήθη διʼ ἀναλογίας ὁμολογῆσαν, φιλίαν τε ἔσχεν ἐκ τούτων, ὥστε εἰς ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ συνελθὸν ἄλυτον ὑπό του ἄλλου πλὴν ὑπὸ τοῦ συνδήσαντος γενέσθαι. τῶν δὲ δὴ τεττάρων ἓν ὅλον ἕκαστον εἴληφεν ἡ τοῦ κόσμου σύστασις. ἐκ γὰρ πυρὸς παντὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος καὶ γῆς συνέστησεν αὐτὸν ὁ συνιστάς, μέρος οὐδὲν οὐδενὸς οὐδὲ δύναμιν ἔξωθεν ὑπολιπών, τάδε διανοηθείς,  πρῶτον μὲν ἵνα ὅλον ὅτι μάλιστα ζῷον τέλεον ἐκ τελέων  τῶν μερῶν εἴη,","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπόταν γὰρ ἀριθμῶν τριῶν εἴτε ὄγκων  εἴτε δυνάμεων ὡντινωνοῦν ᾖ τὸ μέσον, ὅτιπερ τὸ πρῶτον πρὸς αὐτό, τοῦτο αὐτὸ πρὸς τὸ ἔσχατον, καὶ πάλιν αὖθις, ὅτι τὸ ἔσχατον πρὸς τὸ μέσον, τὸ μέσον πρὸς τὸ πρῶτον, τότε τὸ μέσον μὲν πρῶτον καὶ ἔσχατον γιγνόμενον, τὸ δʼ ἔσχατον καὶ τὸ πρῶτον αὖ μέσα ἀμφότερα, πάνθʼ οὕτως ἐξ ἀνάγκης τὰ αὐτὰ εἶναι συμβήσεται, τὰ αὐτὰ δὲ γενόμενα ἀλλήλοις ἓν πάντα ἔσται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","text":"εἰ μὲν οὖν ἐπίπεδον μέν, βάθος δὲ μηδὲν ἔχον ἔδει γίγνεσθαι τὸ τοῦ παντὸς σῶμα, μία μεσότης ἂν ἐξήρκει  τά τε μεθʼ αὑτῆς συνδεῖν καὶ ἑαυτήν, νῦν δὲ στερεοειδῆ γὰρ αὐτὸν προσῆκεν εἶναι, τὰ δὲ στερεὰ μία μὲν οὐδέποτε, δύο δὲ ἀεὶ μεσότητες συναρμόττουσιν· οὕτω δὴ πυρός τε καὶ γῆς ὕδωρ ἀέρα τε ὁ θεὸς ἐν μέσῳ θείς, καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα καθʼ ὅσον ἦν δυνατὸν ἀνὰ τὸν αὐτὸν λόγον ἀπεργασάμενος, ὅτιπερ πῦρ πρὸς ἀέρα, τοῦτο ἀέρα πρὸς ὕδωρ, καὶ ὅτι ἀὴρ πρὸς ὕδωρ, ὕδωρ πρὸς γῆν, συνέδησεν καὶ συνεστήσατο οὐρανὸν ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτόν. καὶ διὰ ταῦτα ἔκ τε δὴ τούτων τοιούτων  καὶ τὸν ἀριθμὸν τεττάρων τὸ τοῦ κόσμου σῶμα ἐγεννήθη διʼ ἀναλογίας ὁμολογῆσαν, φιλίαν τε ἔσχεν ἐκ τούτων, ὥστε εἰς ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ συνελθὸν ἄλυτον ὑπό του ἄλλου πλὴν ὑπὸ τοῦ συνδήσαντος γενέσθαι. τῶν δὲ δὴ τεττάρων ἓν ὅλον ἕκαστον εἴληφεν ἡ τοῦ κόσμου σύστασις.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","text":"ἐκ γὰρ πυρὸς παντὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος καὶ γῆς συνέστησεν αὐτὸν ὁ συνιστάς, μέρος οὐδὲν οὐδενὸς οὐδὲ δύναμιν ἔξωθεν ὑπολιπών, τάδε διανοηθείς,  πρῶτον μὲν ἵνα ὅλον ὅτι μάλιστα ζῷον τέλεον ἐκ τελέων  τῶν μερῶν εἴη,","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"d0bf3aed5b75fbdd7f2216194f1cbff1b4cb2cb410d3cbe1bafd86da1b3bed10","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224611974615Z_469f1b16","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 32","source_sha256":"d0bf3aed5b75fbdd7f2216194f1cbff1b4cb2cb410d3cbe1bafd86da1b3bed10","sha256":"9d548cd72148c6670dbbbfdf904fa091b4e81c536ec2149bcb2b53de25adfa1b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:11.974752+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","text":"TI. For whenever, of three numbers or masses or powers whatsoever, the middle is such that as the first is to it, so it itself is to the last, and again conversely, as the last is to the middle, so the middle is to the first, then the middle, becoming first and last, and the last and the first in turn both becoming middles, all will thus necessarily come to be the same; and having become the same as one another, all will be one.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","text":"If, then, the body of the all had to come to be a plane, having no depth, one mean would have sufficed both to bind together the things following it and itself; but as it was fitting that it be solid, and solids are never fitted together by one mean but always by two, thus indeed, placing water and air in the middle between fire and earth, and fashioning them in the same ratio to one another as far as was possible—so that as fire is to air, so air is to water, and as air is to water, so water is to earth—God bound together and constituted a visible and tangible heaven. And for these reasons, from these things, such as they are and four in number, the body of the cosmos was generated, brought into agreement through proportion; and from these it acquired friendship, so that, having come together into identity with itself, it became indissoluble by anything else except by him who bound it together. And the constitution of the cosmos has received one whole of each of the four.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","text":"For he who constituted it constituted it from all fire and water and air and earth, leaving outside no part or power of any of them, with these thoughts: first, that it might be, as far as possible, a whole and complete living being from complete parts,","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"98078050a40b39ab089c752c945879488b9eb8304cf84506e58a68dc69c80edd","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 32"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 32","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15","title":"Section 33","order":17,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_15","text":"ΤΙ. πρὸς δὲ τούτοις ἕν, ἅτε οὐχ ὑπολελειμμένων ἐξ ὧν ἄλλο τοιοῦτον γένοιτʼ ἄν, ἔτι δὲ ἵνʼ ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον ᾖ, κατανοῶν ὡς συστάτῳ σώματι θερμὰ καὶ ψυχρὰ καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα δυνάμεις ἰσχυρὰς ἔχει περιιστάμενα ἔξωθεν καὶ προσπίπτοντα ἀκαίρως λύει καὶ νόσους γῆράς τε ἐπάγοντα φθίνειν ποιεῖ. διὰ δὴ τὴν αἰτίαν καὶ τὸν λογισμὸν τόνδε ἕνα ὅλον ὅλων ἐξ ἁπάντων τέλεον καὶ ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον  αὐτὸν ἐτεκτήνατο. σχῆμα δὲ ἔδωκεν αὐτῷ τὸ πρέπον καὶ τὸ συγγενές. τῷ δὲ τὰ πάντα ἐν αὑτῷ ζῷα περιέχειν μέλλοντι ζῴῳ πρέπον ἂν εἴη σχῆμα τὸ περιειληφὸς ἐν αὑτῷ πάντα ὁπόσα σχήματα· διὸ καὶ σφαιροειδές, ἐκ μέσου πάντῃ πρὸς τὰς τελευτὰς ἴσον ἀπέχον, κυκλοτερὲς αὐτὸ ἐτορνεύσατο, πάντων τελεώτατον ὁμοιότατόν τε αὐτὸ ἑαυτῷ σχημάτων, νομίσας μυρίῳ κάλλιον ὅμοιον ἀνομοίου. λεῖον δὲ δὴ κύκλῳ  πᾶν ἔξωθεν αὐτὸ ἀπηκριβοῦτο πολλῶν χάριν. ὀμμάτων τε γὰρ ἐπεδεῖτο οὐδέν, ὁρατὸν γὰρ οὐδὲν ὑπελείπετο ἔξωθεν, οὐδʼ ἀκοῆς, οὐδὲ γὰρ ἀκουστόν· πνεῦμά τε οὐκ ἦν περιεστὸς δεόμενον ἀναπνοῆς, οὐδʼ αὖ τινος ἐπιδεὲς ἦν ὀργάνου σχεῖν ᾧ τὴν μὲν εἰς ἑαυτὸ τροφὴν δέξοιτο, τὴν δὲ πρότερον ἐξικμασμένην ἀποπέμψοι πάλιν. ἀπῄει τε γὰρ οὐδὲν οὐδὲ προσῄειν αὐτῷ ποθεν—οὐδὲ γὰρ ἦν—αὐτὸ γὰρ ἑαυτῷ τροφὴν τὴν ἑαυτοῦ φθίσιν παρέχον καὶ πάντα ἐν ἑαυτῷ καὶ ὑφʼ  ἑαυτοῦ πάσχον καὶ δρῶν ἐκ τέχνης γέγονεν· ἡγήσατο γὰρ αὐτὸ ὁ συνθεὶς αὔταρκες ὂν ἄμεινον ἔσεσθαι μᾶλλον ἢ προσδεὲς ἄλλων. χειρῶν δέ, αἷς οὔτε λαβεῖν οὔτε αὖ τινα ἀμύνασθαι χρεία τις ἦν, μάτην οὐκ ᾤετο δεῖν αὐτῷ προσάπτειν, οὐδὲ ποδῶν οὐδὲ ὅλως τῆς περὶ τὴν βάσιν  ὑπηρεσίας.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. πρὸς δὲ τούτοις ἕν, ἅτε οὐχ ὑπολελειμμένων ἐξ ὧν ἄλλο τοιοῦτον γένοιτʼ ἄν, ἔτι δὲ ἵνʼ ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον ᾖ, κατανοῶν ὡς συστάτῳ σώματι θερμὰ καὶ ψυχρὰ καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα δυνάμεις ἰσχυρὰς ἔχει περιιστάμενα ἔξωθεν καὶ προσπίπτοντα ἀκαίρως λύει καὶ νόσους γῆράς τε ἐπάγοντα φθίνειν ποιεῖ. διὰ δὴ τὴν αἰτίαν καὶ τὸν λογισμὸν τόνδε ἕνα ὅλον ὅλων ἐξ ἁπάντων τέλεον καὶ ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον  αὐτὸν ἐτεκτήνατο. σχῆμα δὲ ἔδωκεν αὐτῷ τὸ πρέπον καὶ τὸ συγγενές. τῷ δὲ τὰ πάντα ἐν αὑτῷ ζῷα περιέχειν μέλλοντι ζῴῳ πρέπον ἂν εἴη σχῆμα τὸ περιειληφὸς ἐν αὑτῷ πάντα ὁπόσα σχήματα· διὸ καὶ σφαιροειδές, ἐκ μέσου πάντῃ πρὸς τὰς τελευτὰς ἴσον ἀπέχον, κυκλοτερὲς αὐτὸ ἐτορνεύσατο, πάντων τελεώτατον ὁμοιότατόν τε αὐτὸ ἑαυτῷ σχημάτων, νομίσας μυρίῳ κάλλιον ὅμοιον ἀνομοίου. λεῖον δὲ δὴ κύκλῳ  πᾶν ἔξωθεν αὐτὸ ἀπηκριβοῦτο πολλῶν χάριν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","text":"ὀμμάτων τε γὰρ ἐπεδεῖτο οὐδέν, ὁρατὸν γὰρ οὐδὲν ὑπελείπετο ἔξωθεν, οὐδʼ ἀκοῆς, οὐδὲ γὰρ ἀκουστόν· πνεῦμά τε οὐκ ἦν περιεστὸς δεόμενον ἀναπνοῆς, οὐδʼ αὖ τινος ἐπιδεὲς ἦν ὀργάνου σχεῖν ᾧ τὴν μὲν εἰς ἑαυτὸ τροφὴν δέξοιτο, τὴν δὲ πρότερον ἐξικμασμένην ἀποπέμψοι πάλιν. ἀπῄει τε γὰρ οὐδὲν οὐδὲ προσῄειν αὐτῷ ποθεν—οὐδὲ γὰρ ἦν—αὐτὸ γὰρ ἑαυτῷ τροφὴν τὴν ἑαυτοῦ φθίσιν παρέχον καὶ πάντα ἐν ἑαυτῷ καὶ ὑφʼ  ἑαυτοῦ πάσχον καὶ δρῶν ἐκ τέχνης γέγονεν· ἡγήσατο γὰρ αὐτὸ ὁ συνθεὶς αὔταρκες ὂν ἄμεινον ἔσεσθαι μᾶλλον ἢ προσδεὲς ἄλλων. χειρῶν δέ, αἷς οὔτε λαβεῖν οὔτε αὖ τινα ἀμύνασθαι χρεία τις ἦν, μάτην οὐκ ᾤετο δεῖν αὐτῷ προσάπτειν, οὐδὲ ποδῶν οὐδὲ ὅλως τῆς περὶ τὴν βάσιν  ὑπηρεσίας.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"fc0f83ec22b54f5134f705074007bb99f5ea0f56e501725f4956ca48831a6963","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224618648074Z_2f40f49b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 33","source_sha256":"fc0f83ec22b54f5134f705074007bb99f5ea0f56e501725f4956ca48831a6963","sha256":"bbecac0acb40ebc8a832e774a15bdbe114572e509178dfc00a86f82eafd68d1f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:18.648117+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","text":"And besides these things, [he made it] one, since there were no remnants from which another such [world] could come to be; and further, in order that it might be ageless and free from disease, considering that, when hot and cold things and all things that possess strong powers stand around a compounded body from without and fall upon it untimely, they dissolve it and, bringing on diseases and old age, cause it to waste away. For this cause and reasoning, then, he fashioned it as one whole, complete from all wholes, perfect and ageless and free from disease. He gave it the fitting and kindred shape. For the living creature that was to contain within itself all living creatures, the fitting shape would be that which embraces within itself all sorts of shapes; wherefore he rounded it into a spherical form, equally distant in every direction from the middle to its extremities, circular, the most perfect and most like itself of all shapes, judging the like infinitely fairer than the unlike. And he finished it off entirely smooth all around on the outside, for many reasons.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","text":"For it had no need of eyes, since nothing visible was left outside; nor of hearing, since neither was there anything audible. Nor was there air standing around in need of respiration; nor again was it in need of any organ by which it might receive food into itself and send forth again that which had previously been drained of its moisture. For nothing went away from it, nor did anything come to it from anywhere—for there was nothing; rather, it itself, providing itself with nourishment from its own wasting, and undergoing and doing all things in itself and by itself, has come to be by art. For its composer judged that, being self-sufficient, it would be better than if it were dependent upon others. And hands, for which there was no need either to grasp anything or again to ward anyone off, he thought it unnecessary to attach to it in vain; nor feet, nor indeed any service connected with locomotion.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"4907abe99fd2d1357e735d79a2618e29196bdc0a7b6f69fc31a0f8f4bb5697a7","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 33"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 33","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16","title":"Section 34","order":18,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_16","text":"ΤΙ. κίνησιν γὰρ ἀπένειμεν αὐτῷ τὴν τοῦ σώματος οἰκείαν, τῶν ἑπτὰ τὴν περὶ νοῦν καὶ φρόνησιν μάλιστα οὖσαν· διὸ δὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ καὶ ἐν ἑαυτῷ περιαγαγὼν αὐτὸ ἐποίησε κύκλῳ κινεῖσθαι στρεφόμενον, τὰς δὲ ἓξ ἁπάσας κινήσεις ἀφεῖλεν καὶ ἀπλανὲς ἀπηργάσατο ἐκείνων. ἐπὶ δὲ τὴν περίοδον ταύτην ἅτʼ οὐδὲν ποδῶν δέον ἀσκελὲς καὶ ἄπουν αὐτὸ ἐγέννησεν. οὗτος δὴ πᾶς ὄντος ἀεὶ λογισμὸς θεοῦ περὶ τὸν ποτὲ  ἐσόμενον θεὸν λογισθεὶς λεῖον καὶ ὁμαλὸν πανταχῇ τε ἐκ μέσου ἴσον καὶ ὅλον καὶ τέλεον ἐκ τελέων σωμάτων σῶμα ἐποίησεν· ψυχὴν δὲ εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτοῦ θεὶς διὰ παντός τε ἔτεινεν καὶ ἔτι ἔξωθεν τὸ σῶμα αὐτῇ περιεκάλυψεν, καὶ κύκλῳ δὴ κύκλον στρεφόμενον οὐρανὸν ἕνα μόνον ἔρημον κατέστησεν, διʼ ἀρετὴν δὲ αὐτὸν αὑτῷ δυνάμενον συγγίγνεσθαι καὶ οὐδενὸς ἑτέρου προσδεόμενον, γνώριμον δὲ καὶ φίλον ἱκανῶς αὐτὸν αὑτῷ. διὰ πάντα δὴ ταῦτα εὐδαίμονα θεὸν αὐτὸν ἐγεννήσατο. τὴν δὲ δὴ ψυχὴν οὐχ ὡς νῦν ὑστέραν ἐπιχειροῦμεν λέγειν,  οὕτως ἐμηχανήσατο καὶ ὁ θεὸς νεωτέραν—οὐ γὰρ ἂν ἄρχεσθαι πρεσβύτερον ὑπὸ νεωτέρου συνέρξας εἴασεν—ἀλλά πως ἡμεῖς πολὺ μετέχοντες τοῦ προστυχόντος τε καὶ εἰκῇ ταύτῃ πῃ καὶ λέγομεν, ὁ δὲ καὶ γενέσει καὶ ἀρετῇ προτέραν καὶ πρεσβυτέραν ψυχὴν σώματος ὡς δεσπότιν καὶ ἄρξουσαν ἀρξομένου  συνεστήσατο ἐκ τῶνδέ τε καὶ τοιῷδε τρόπῳ.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. κίνησιν γὰρ ἀπένειμεν αὐτῷ τὴν τοῦ σώματος οἰκείαν, τῶν ἑπτὰ τὴν περὶ νοῦν καὶ φρόνησιν μάλιστα οὖσαν· διὸ δὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ καὶ ἐν ἑαυτῷ περιαγαγὼν αὐτὸ ἐποίησε κύκλῳ κινεῖσθαι στρεφόμενον, τὰς δὲ ἓξ ἁπάσας κινήσεις ἀφεῖλεν καὶ ἀπλανὲς ἀπηργάσατο ἐκείνων. ἐπὶ δὲ τὴν περίοδον ταύτην ἅτʼ οὐδὲν ποδῶν δέον ἀσκελὲς καὶ ἄπουν αὐτὸ ἐγέννησεν. οὗτος δὴ πᾶς ὄντος ἀεὶ λογισμὸς θεοῦ περὶ τὸν ποτὲ  ἐσόμενον θεὸν λογισθεὶς λεῖον καὶ ὁμαλὸν πανταχῇ τε ἐκ μέσου ἴσον καὶ ὅλον καὶ τέλεον ἐκ τελέων σωμάτων σῶμα ἐποίησεν· ψυχὴν δὲ εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτοῦ θεὶς διὰ παντός τε ἔτεινεν καὶ ἔτι ἔξωθεν τὸ σῶμα αὐτῇ περιεκάλυψεν, καὶ κύκλῳ δὴ κύκλον στρεφόμενον οὐρανὸν ἕνα μόνον ἔρημον κατέστησεν, διʼ ἀρετὴν δὲ αὐτὸν αὑτῷ δυνάμενον συγγίγνεσθαι καὶ οὐδενὸς ἑτέρου προσδεόμενον, γνώριμον δὲ καὶ φίλον ἱκανῶς αὐτὸν αὑτῷ. διὰ πάντα δὴ ταῦτα εὐδαίμονα θεὸν αὐτὸν ἐγεννήσατο.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","text":"τὴν δὲ δὴ ψυχὴν οὐχ ὡς νῦν ὑστέραν ἐπιχειροῦμεν λέγειν,  οὕτως ἐμηχανήσατο καὶ ὁ θεὸς νεωτέραν—οὐ γὰρ ἂν ἄρχεσθαι πρεσβύτερον ὑπὸ νεωτέρου συνέρξας εἴασεν—ἀλλά πως ἡμεῖς πολὺ μετέχοντες τοῦ προστυχόντος τε καὶ εἰκῇ ταύτῃ πῃ καὶ λέγομεν, ὁ δὲ καὶ γενέσει καὶ ἀρετῇ προτέραν καὶ πρεσβυτέραν ψυχὴν σώματος ὡς δεσπότιν καὶ ἄρξουσαν ἀρξομένου  συνεστήσατο ἐκ τῶνδέ τε καὶ τοιῷδε τρόπῳ.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"369dfb5b2bce2fd097412d853cf488b7e44bf7d4a1c14f2181fcb46cd156c14c","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224624247322Z_d61f587a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 34","source_sha256":"369dfb5b2bce2fd097412d853cf488b7e44bf7d4a1c14f2181fcb46cd156c14c","sha256":"e80dcff316f7d9d368a2cfe93166b92d649a4fa1fe64d86476567cb999e066f5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:24.247388+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","text":"For he assigned to it the motion proper to a body, that one of the seven which is especially concerned with intellect and wisdom; wherefore, having made it revolve uniformly in the same place and within itself, he caused it to move in a circle, but removed all the six other motions and rendered it free from wandering in respect of them. And since for this revolution it had no need of feet, he generated it without legs and without feet. Such then was the entire calculation of the god concerning the god that was one day to be: having calculated it, he made it a body smooth and even in every direction, everywhere equidistant from the center, whole and complete, composed of complete bodies. And, placing soul in its center, he stretched it through the whole and moreover enveloped the body outside with it; and he established one single solitary heaven, revolving as a circle in a circle, capable by virtue of its excellence of consorting with itself and needing nothing else, and sufficiently known and dear to itself. For all these reasons, he generated it as a blessed god.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","text":"But the soul, not as we now undertake to speak of it, did the god contrive as later than the body—for he would not, having joined them together, have allowed the elder to be ruled by the younger—but we, sharing greatly in what happens by chance and at random, speak somehow in this way; whereas he constituted soul prior and elder than body both in generation and in excellence, as mistress and ruler of that which was to be ruled, from these elements and in the following manner.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"a397e850b0da6178a6b1c10216cc5500bc3e1e32846e711c839c6bd151e2ae31","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 34"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 34","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17","title":"Section 35","order":19,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_17","text":"ΤΙ. τῆς ἀμερίστου καὶ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐχούσης οὐσίας καὶ τῆς αὖ περὶ τὰ σώματα γιγνομένης μεριστῆς τρίτον ἐξ ἀμφοῖν ἐν μέσῳ συνεκεράσατο οὐσίας εἶδος, τῆς τε ταὐτοῦ φύσεως  καὶ τῆς τοῦ ἑτέρου, καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ συνέστησεν ἐν μέσῳ τοῦ τε ἀμεροῦς αὐτῶν καὶ τοῦ κατὰ τὰ σώματα μεριστοῦ· καὶ τρία λαβὼν αὐτὰ ὄντα συνεκεράσατο εἰς μίαν πάντα ἰδέαν, τὴν θατέρου φύσιν δύσμεικτον οὖσαν εἰς ταὐτὸν συναρμόττων βίᾳ.  μειγνὺς δὲ μετὰ τῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἐκ τριῶν ποιησάμενος ἕν, πάλιν ὅλον τοῦτο μοίρας ὅσας προσῆκεν διένειμεν, ἑκάστην δὲ ἔκ τε ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου καὶ τῆς οὐσίας μεμειγμένην. ἤρχετο δὲ διαιρεῖν ὧδε. μίαν ἀφεῖλεν τὸ πρῶτον ἀπὸ παντὸς μοῖραν, μετὰ δὲ ταύτην ἀφῄρει διπλασίαν ταύτης, τὴν δʼ αὖ τρίτην ἡμιολίαν μὲν τῆς δευτέρας, τριπλασίαν δὲ τῆς πρώτης, τετάρτην δὲ τῆς δευτέρας διπλῆν, πέμπτην δὲ τριπλῆν τῆς  τρίτης, τὴν δʼ ἕκτην τῆς πρώτης ὀκταπλασίαν, ἑβδόμην δʼ ἑπτακαιεικοσιπλασίαν τῆς πρώτης·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τῆς ἀμερίστου καὶ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐχούσης οὐσίας καὶ τῆς αὖ περὶ τὰ σώματα γιγνομένης μεριστῆς τρίτον ἐξ ἀμφοῖν ἐν μέσῳ συνεκεράσατο οὐσίας εἶδος, τῆς τε ταὐτοῦ φύσεως  καὶ τῆς τοῦ ἑτέρου, καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ συνέστησεν ἐν μέσῳ τοῦ τε ἀμεροῦς αὐτῶν καὶ τοῦ κατὰ τὰ σώματα μεριστοῦ· καὶ τρία λαβὼν αὐτὰ ὄντα συνεκεράσατο εἰς μίαν πάντα ἰδέαν, τὴν θατέρου φύσιν δύσμεικτον οὖσαν εἰς ταὐτὸν συναρμόττων βίᾳ.  μειγνὺς δὲ μετὰ τῆς οὐσίας καὶ ἐκ τριῶν ποιησάμενος ἕν, πάλιν ὅλον τοῦτο μοίρας ὅσας προσῆκεν διένειμεν, ἑκάστην δὲ ἔκ τε ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου καὶ τῆς οὐσίας μεμειγμένην. ἤρχετο δὲ διαιρεῖν ὧδε. μίαν ἀφεῖλεν τὸ πρῶτον ἀπὸ παντὸς μοῖραν, μετὰ δὲ ταύτην ἀφῄρει διπλασίαν ταύτης, τὴν δʼ αὖ τρίτην ἡμιολίαν μὲν τῆς δευτέρας, τριπλασίαν δὲ τῆς πρώτης, τετάρτην δὲ τῆς δευτέρας διπλῆν, πέμπτην δὲ τριπλῆν τῆς  τρίτης, τὴν δʼ ἕκτην τῆς πρώτης ὀκταπλασίαν, ἑβδόμην δʼ ἑπτακαιεικοσιπλασίαν τῆς πρώτης·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"1d2c701bcc3ef8ad634759ef398d058e357d37a2dad26db49a9670b41b4565ee","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224628658662Z_adf78f19","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 35","source_sha256":"1d2c701bcc3ef8ad634759ef398d058e357d37a2dad26db49a9670b41b4565ee","sha256":"ce41fd3458d1d787c4daa9b26517a253751b1861651131a99436c5800d5749d0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:28.658697+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","text":"TI. Of the indivisible and ever unchanging being, and again of the divisible being that comes to be in bodies, he compounded, from both, a third kind of being intermediate between them; and, as regards the nature of the Same and that of the Other, he likewise constituted it intermediate between their indivisible and their divisible aspect in bodies. And taking these three as they were, he blended them all into one form, forcibly fitting together into the Same the nature of the Other, which is difficult to mix. And, having mixed them with Being and made one out of three, he again divided this whole into as many portions as was fitting, each portion being mixed from the Same, the Other, and Being. And he began to divide as follows. First he took away one portion from the whole; after this he took away one twice as large as this; then a third, one-and-a-half times the second and three times the first; a fourth, double the second; a fifth, triple the third; a sixth, eight times the first; and a seventh, twenty-seven times the first;","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001"]}],"source_digest":"0b592ce350e1514f1600a665c56b1663c6651aa1a72822b922416fac775b178c","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 35"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 35","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18","title":"Section 36","order":20,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_18","text":"ΤΙ. μετὰ δὲ ταῦτα συνεπληροῦτο  τά τε διπλάσια καὶ τριπλάσια διαστήματα, μοίρας ἔτι ἐκεῖθεν ἀποτέμνων καὶ τιθεὶς εἰς τὸ μεταξὺ τούτων, ὥστε ἐν ἑκάστῳ διαστήματι δύο εἶναι μεσότητας, τὴν μὲν ταὐτῷ μέρει τῶν ἄκρων αὐτῶν ὑπερέχουσαν καὶ ὑπερεχομένην, τὴν δὲ ἴσῳ μὲν κατʼ ἀριθμὸν ὑπερέχουσαν, ἴσῳ δὲ ὑπερεχομένην. ἡμιολίων δὲ διαστάσεων καὶ ἐπιτρίτων καὶ ἐπογδόων γενομένων ἐκ τούτων τῶν δεσμῶν ἐν ταῖς πρόσθεν διαστάσεσιν,  τῷ τοῦ ἐπογδόου διαστήματι τὰ ἐπίτριτα πάντα συνεπληροῦτο, λείπων αὐτῶν ἑκάστου μόριον, τῆς τοῦ μορίου ταύτης διαστάσεως λειφθείσης ἀριθμοῦ πρὸς ἀριθμὸν ἐχούσης τοὺς ὅρους ἓξ καὶ πεντήκοντα καὶ διακοσίων πρὸς τρία καὶ τετταράκοντα καὶ διακόσια. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ μειχθέν, ἐξ οὗ ταῦτα κατέτεμνεν, οὕτως ἤδη πᾶν κατανηλώκει. ταύτην οὖν τὴν σύστασιν πᾶσαν διπλῆν κατὰ μῆκος σχίσας, μέσην πρὸς μέσην ἑκατέραν ἀλλήλαις οἷον χεῖ προσβαλὼν κατέκαμψεν  εἰς ἓν κύκλῳ, συνάψας αὑταῖς τε καὶ ἀλλήλαις ἐν τῷ καταντικρὺ τῆς προσβολῆς, καὶ τῇ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν ταὐτῷ περιαγομένῃ κινήσει πέριξ αὐτὰς ἔλαβεν, καὶ τὸν μὲν ἔξω, τὸν δʼ ἐντὸς ἐποιεῖτο τῶν κύκλων. τὴν μὲν οὖν ἔξω φορὰν ἐπεφήμισεν εἶναι τῆς ταὐτοῦ φύσεως, τὴν δʼ ἐντὸς τῆς θατέρου. τὴν μὲν δὴ ταὐτοῦ κατὰ πλευρὰν ἐπὶ δεξιὰ περιήγαγεν, τὴν δὲ θατέρου κατὰ διάμετρον ἐπʼ ἀριστερά, κράτος δʼ ἔδωκεν τῇ  ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιφορᾷ· μίαν γὰρ αὐτὴν ἄσχιστον εἴασεν, τὴν δʼ ἐντὸς σχίσας ἑξαχῇ ἑπτὰ κύκλους ἀνίσους κατὰ τὴν τοῦ διπλασίου καὶ τριπλασίου διάστασιν ἑκάστην, οὐσῶν ἑκατέρων τριῶν, κατὰ τἀναντία μὲν ἀλλήλοις προσέταξεν ἰέναι τοὺς κύκλους, τάχει δὲ τρεῖς μὲν ὁμοίως, τοὺς δὲ τέτταρας ἀλλήλοις καὶ τοῖς τρισὶν ἀνομοίως, ἐν λόγῳ δὲ φερομένους. ἐπεὶ δὲ κατὰ νοῦν τῷ συνιστάντι πᾶσα ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς σύστασις ἐγεγένητο, μετὰ τοῦτο πᾶν τὸ σωματοειδὲς ἐντὸς  αὐτῆς ἐτεκταίνετο καὶ μέσον μέσῃ συναγαγὼν προσήρμοττεν· ἡ δʼ ἐκ μέσου πρὸς τὸν ἔσχατον οὐρανὸν πάντῃ διαπλακεῖσα κύκλῳ τε αὐτὸν ἔξωθεν περικαλύψασα, αὐτὴ ἐν αὑτῇ στρεφομένη, θείαν ἀρχὴν ἤρξατο ἀπαύστου καὶ ἔμφρονος βίου πρὸς τὸν σύμπαντα χρόνον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. μετὰ δὲ ταῦτα συνεπληροῦτο  τά τε διπλάσια καὶ τριπλάσια διαστήματα, μοίρας ἔτι ἐκεῖθεν ἀποτέμνων καὶ τιθεὶς εἰς τὸ μεταξὺ τούτων, ὥστε ἐν ἑκάστῳ διαστήματι δύο εἶναι μεσότητας, τὴν μὲν ταὐτῷ μέρει τῶν ἄκρων αὐτῶν ὑπερέχουσαν καὶ ὑπερεχομένην, τὴν δὲ ἴσῳ μὲν κατʼ ἀριθμὸν ὑπερέχουσαν, ἴσῳ δὲ ὑπερεχομένην. ἡμιολίων δὲ διαστάσεων καὶ ἐπιτρίτων καὶ ἐπογδόων γενομένων ἐκ τούτων τῶν δεσμῶν ἐν ταῖς πρόσθεν διαστάσεσιν,  τῷ τοῦ ἐπογδόου διαστήματι τὰ ἐπίτριτα πάντα συνεπληροῦτο, λείπων αὐτῶν ἑκάστου μόριον, τῆς τοῦ μορίου ταύτης διαστάσεως λειφθείσης ἀριθμοῦ πρὸς ἀριθμὸν ἐχούσης τοὺς ὅρους ἓξ καὶ πεντήκοντα καὶ διακοσίων πρὸς τρία καὶ τετταράκοντα καὶ διακόσια. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ μειχθέν, ἐξ οὗ ταῦτα κατέτεμνεν, οὕτως ἤδη πᾶν κατανηλώκει.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","text":"ταύτην οὖν τὴν σύστασιν πᾶσαν διπλῆν κατὰ μῆκος σχίσας, μέσην πρὸς μέσην ἑκατέραν ἀλλήλαις οἷον χεῖ προσβαλὼν κατέκαμψεν  εἰς ἓν κύκλῳ, συνάψας αὑταῖς τε καὶ ἀλλήλαις ἐν τῷ καταντικρὺ τῆς προσβολῆς, καὶ τῇ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν ταὐτῷ περιαγομένῃ κινήσει πέριξ αὐτὰς ἔλαβεν, καὶ τὸν μὲν ἔξω, τὸν δʼ ἐντὸς ἐποιεῖτο τῶν κύκλων. τὴν μὲν οὖν ἔξω φορὰν ἐπεφήμισεν εἶναι τῆς ταὐτοῦ φύσεως, τὴν δʼ ἐντὸς τῆς θατέρου. τὴν μὲν δὴ ταὐτοῦ κατὰ πλευρὰν ἐπὶ δεξιὰ περιήγαγεν, τὴν δὲ θατέρου κατὰ διάμετρον ἐπʼ ἀριστερά, κράτος δʼ ἔδωκεν τῇ  ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιφορᾷ· μίαν γὰρ αὐτὴν ἄσχιστον εἴασεν, τὴν δʼ ἐντὸς σχίσας ἑξαχῇ ἑπτὰ κύκλους ἀνίσους κατὰ τὴν τοῦ διπλασίου καὶ τριπλασίου διάστασιν ἑκάστην, οὐσῶν ἑκατέρων τριῶν, κατὰ τἀναντία μὲν ἀλλήλοις προσέταξεν ἰέναι τοὺς κύκλους, τάχει δὲ τρεῖς μὲν ὁμοίως, τοὺς δὲ τέτταρας ἀλλήλοις καὶ τοῖς τρισὶν ἀνομοίως, ἐν λόγῳ δὲ φερομένους.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","text":"ἐπεὶ δὲ κατὰ νοῦν τῷ συνιστάντι πᾶσα ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς σύστασις ἐγεγένητο, μετὰ τοῦτο πᾶν τὸ σωματοειδὲς ἐντὸς  αὐτῆς ἐτεκταίνετο καὶ μέσον μέσῃ συναγαγὼν προσήρμοττεν· ἡ δʼ ἐκ μέσου πρὸς τὸν ἔσχατον οὐρανὸν πάντῃ διαπλακεῖσα κύκλῳ τε αὐτὸν ἔξωθεν περικαλύψασα, αὐτὴ ἐν αὑτῇ στρεφομένη, θείαν ἀρχὴν ἤρξατο ἀπαύστου καὶ ἔμφρονος βίου πρὸς τὸν σύμπαντα χρόνον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"72f2109bdea22d2ee76222701252c1dc99532efeae70cd5e02d016718c510637","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224638803159Z_cbd9e2d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 36","source_sha256":"72f2109bdea22d2ee76222701252c1dc99532efeae70cd5e02d016718c510637","sha256":"90c3d823510c4d56c56723f0a7904d54c75d00098fdb13a5b6817ca0a357da1c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:38.803202+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","text":"Then he went on to fill out the double and triple intervals, cutting off portions still from there and placing them between these, so that in each interval there should be two means, the one exceeding and being exceeded by the same part of the extremes themselves, the other exceeding by an equal number and being exceeded by an equal number. And, hemiolic, epitritic, and epogdoic intervals having arisen from these bonds in the preceding intervals, he filled out all the epitritic intervals by the epogdoic interval, leaving in each of them a fraction, the interval of this fraction left over having its terms in the ratio of number to number, two hundred and fifty-six to two hundred and forty-three. And thus he had now used up the whole mixture from which he was cutting these portions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","text":"He then split this whole composition, double in length, lengthwise, and, bringing the middle of each to the middle of the other like the letter chi, bent them into a circle, joining them both to themselves and to one another at the point opposite their intersection; and he embraced them with the motion which revolves uniformly in the same place, making one of the circles outer and the other inner. He declared the outer revolution to be that of the nature of the Same, and the inner that of the Other. The revolution of the Same he carried around laterally toward the right, that of the Other diagonally toward the left; but he gave supremacy to the revolution of the Same and Like. For he left it one and undivided, but, splitting the inner one sixfold, he made seven unequal circles, each according to the interval of the double and triple, there being three of each; and he ordained the circles to proceed in directions contrary to one another, three at the same speed, but the other four at speeds unlike one another and unlike those of the three, though moving in proportion.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","text":"And when, in the thought of the one who was composing it, the whole composition of the soul had come into being, after this he fashioned all that is bodily within it, and, bringing middle to middle, fitted it together. But the soul, interwoven throughout from the middle to the outermost heaven and enveloping it externally in a circle, itself revolving within itself, began a divine beginning of unceasing and intelligent life for all time.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"8a5e6fa33d1774f47fcebd0174db29f175a0fa6f81e11cba1a4b01d7cbbc36c5","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 36"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 36","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19","title":"Section 37","order":21,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_19","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ τὸ μὲν δὴ σῶμα ὁρατὸν οὐρανοῦ γέγονεν, αὐτὴ δὲ ἀόρατος μέν, λογισμοῦ δὲ μετέχουσα καὶ  ἁρμονίας ψυχή, τῶν νοητῶν ἀεί τε ὄντων ὑπὸ τοῦ ἀρίστου ἀρίστη γενομένη τῶν γεννηθέντων. ἅτε οὖν ἐκ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ τῆς θατέρου φύσεως ἔκ τε οὐσίας τριῶν τούτων συγκραθεῖσα μοιρῶν, καὶ ἀνὰ λόγον μερισθεῖσα καὶ συνδεθεῖσα, αὐτή τε ἀνακυκλουμένη πρὸς αὑτήν, ὅταν οὐσίαν σκεδαστὴν ἔχοντός τινος ἐφάπτηται καὶ ὅταν ἀμέριστον, λέγει κινουμένη διὰ πάσης ἑαυτῆς ὅτῳ τʼ ἄν τι ταὐτὸν ᾖ καὶ ὅτου ἂν  ἕτερον, πρὸς ὅτι τε μάλιστα καὶ ὅπῃ καὶ ὅπως καὶ ὁπότε συμβαίνει κατὰ τὰ γιγνόμενά τε πρὸς ἕκαστον ἕκαστα εἶναι καὶ πάσχειν καὶ πρὸς τὰ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχοντα ἀεί. λόγος δὲ ὁ κατὰ ταὐτὸν ἀληθὴς γιγνόμενος περί τε θάτερον ὂν καὶ περὶ τὸ ταὐτόν, ἐν τῷ κινουμένῳ ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ φερόμενος ἄνευ φθόγγου καὶ ἠχῆς, ὅταν μὲν περὶ τὸ αἰσθητὸν γίγνηται καὶ ὁ τοῦ θατέρου κύκλος ὀρθὸς ἰὼν εἰς πᾶσαν αὐτοῦ τὴν ψυχὴν διαγγείλῃ, δόξαι καὶ πίστεις γίγνονται βέβαιοι καὶ ἀληθεῖς,  ὅταν δὲ αὖ περὶ τὸ λογιστικὸν ᾖ καὶ ὁ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ κύκλος εὔτροχος ὢν αὐτὰ μηνύσῃ, νοῦς ἐπιστήμη τε ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἀποτελεῖται· τούτω δὲ ἐν ᾧ τῶν ὄντων ἐγγίγνεσθον, ἄν ποτέ τις αὐτὸ ἄλλο πλὴν ψυχὴν εἴπῃ, πᾶν μᾶλλον ἢ τἀληθὲς ἐρεῖ. ὡς δὲ κινηθὲν αὐτὸ καὶ ζῶν ἐνόησεν τῶν ἀιδίων θεῶν γεγονὸς ἄγαλμα ὁ γεννήσας πατήρ, ἠγάσθη τε καὶ εὐφρανθεὶς ἔτι δὴ μᾶλλον ὅμοιον πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα ἐπενόησεν ἀπεργάσασθαι.  καθάπερ οὖν αὐτὸ τυγχάνει ζῷον ἀίδιον ὄν, καὶ τόδε τὸ πᾶν οὕτως εἰς δύναμιν ἐπεχείρησε τοιοῦτον ἀποτελεῖν. ἡ μὲν οὖν τοῦ ζῴου φύσις ἐτύγχανεν οὖσα αἰώνιος, καὶ τοῦτο μὲν δὴ τῷ γεννητῷ παντελῶς προσάπτειν οὐκ ἦν δυνατόν· εἰκὼ δʼ ἐπενόει κινητόν τινα αἰῶνος ποιῆσαι, καὶ διακοσμῶν ἅμα οὐρανὸν ποιεῖ μένοντος αἰῶνος ἐν ἑνὶ κατʼ ἀριθμὸν ἰοῦσαν αἰώνιον εἰκόνα, τοῦτον ὃν δὴ χρόνον ὠνομάκαμεν.  ἡμέρας γὰρ καὶ νύκτας καὶ μῆνας καὶ ἐνιαυτούς, οὐκ ὄντας πρὶν οὐρανὸν γενέσθαι, τότε ἅμα ἐκείνῳ συνισταμένῳ τὴν γένεσιν αὐτῶν μηχανᾶται· ταῦτα δὲ πάντα μέρη χρόνου, καὶ τό τʼ ἦν τό τʼ ἔσται χρόνου γεγονότα εἴδη, ἃ δὴ φέροντες λανθάνομεν ἐπὶ τὴν ἀίδιον οὐσίαν οὐκ ὀρθῶς.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ τὸ μὲν δὴ σῶμα ὁρατὸν οὐρανοῦ γέγονεν, αὐτὴ δὲ ἀόρατος μέν, λογισμοῦ δὲ μετέχουσα καὶ  ἁρμονίας ψυχή, τῶν νοητῶν ἀεί τε ὄντων ὑπὸ τοῦ ἀρίστου ἀρίστη γενομένη τῶν γεννηθέντων. ἅτε οὖν ἐκ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ τῆς θατέρου φύσεως ἔκ τε οὐσίας τριῶν τούτων συγκραθεῖσα μοιρῶν, καὶ ἀνὰ λόγον μερισθεῖσα καὶ συνδεθεῖσα, αὐτή τε ἀνακυκλουμένη πρὸς αὑτήν, ὅταν οὐσίαν σκεδαστὴν ἔχοντός τινος ἐφάπτηται καὶ ὅταν ἀμέριστον, λέγει κινουμένη διὰ πάσης ἑαυτῆς ὅτῳ τʼ ἄν τι ταὐτὸν ᾖ καὶ ὅτου ἂν  ἕτερον, πρὸς ὅτι τε μάλιστα καὶ ὅπῃ καὶ ὅπως καὶ ὁπότε συμβαίνει κατὰ τὰ γιγνόμενά τε πρὸς ἕκαστον ἕκαστα εἶναι καὶ πάσχειν καὶ πρὸς τὰ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχοντα ἀεί.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","text":"λόγος δὲ ὁ κατὰ ταὐτὸν ἀληθὴς γιγνόμενος περί τε θάτερον ὂν καὶ περὶ τὸ ταὐτόν, ἐν τῷ κινουμένῳ ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ φερόμενος ἄνευ φθόγγου καὶ ἠχῆς, ὅταν μὲν περὶ τὸ αἰσθητὸν γίγνηται καὶ ὁ τοῦ θατέρου κύκλος ὀρθὸς ἰὼν εἰς πᾶσαν αὐτοῦ τὴν ψυχὴν διαγγείλῃ, δόξαι καὶ πίστεις γίγνονται βέβαιοι καὶ ἀληθεῖς,  ὅταν δὲ αὖ περὶ τὸ λογιστικὸν ᾖ καὶ ὁ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ κύκλος εὔτροχος ὢν αὐτὰ μηνύσῃ, νοῦς ἐπιστήμη τε ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἀποτελεῖται· τούτω δὲ ἐν ᾧ τῶν ὄντων ἐγγίγνεσθον, ἄν ποτέ τις αὐτὸ ἄλλο πλὴν ψυχὴν εἴπῃ, πᾶν μᾶλλον ἢ τἀληθὲς ἐρεῖ. ὡς δὲ κινηθὲν αὐτὸ καὶ ζῶν ἐνόησεν τῶν ἀιδίων θεῶν γεγονὸς ἄγαλμα ὁ γεννήσας πατήρ, ἠγάσθη τε καὶ εὐφρανθεὶς ἔτι δὴ μᾶλλον ὅμοιον πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα ἐπενόησεν ἀπεργάσασθαι.  καθάπερ οὖν αὐτὸ τυγχάνει ζῷον ἀίδιον ὄν, καὶ τόδε τὸ πᾶν οὕτως εἰς δύναμιν ἐπεχείρησε τοιοῦτον ἀποτελεῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","text":"ἡ μὲν οὖν τοῦ ζῴου φύσις ἐτύγχανεν οὖσα αἰώνιος, καὶ τοῦτο μὲν δὴ τῷ γεννητῷ παντελῶς προσάπτειν οὐκ ἦν δυνατόν· εἰκὼ δʼ ἐπενόει κινητόν τινα αἰῶνος ποιῆσαι, καὶ διακοσμῶν ἅμα οὐρανὸν ποιεῖ μένοντος αἰῶνος ἐν ἑνὶ κατʼ ἀριθμὸν ἰοῦσαν αἰώνιον εἰκόνα, τοῦτον ὃν δὴ χρόνον ὠνομάκαμεν.  ἡμέρας γὰρ καὶ νύκτας καὶ μῆνας καὶ ἐνιαυτούς, οὐκ ὄντας πρὶν οὐρανὸν γενέσθαι, τότε ἅμα ἐκείνῳ συνισταμένῳ τὴν γένεσιν αὐτῶν μηχανᾶται· ταῦτα δὲ πάντα μέρη χρόνου, καὶ τό τʼ ἦν τό τʼ ἔσται χρόνου γεγονότα εἴδη, ἃ δὴ φέροντες λανθάνομεν ἐπὶ τὴν ἀίδιον οὐσίαν οὐκ ὀρθῶς.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"06d57d4f0ab322ed6e64b3430276f37e1cd856b1dad90922639a5b33eab250a9","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224647667602Z_097b5152","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 37","source_sha256":"06d57d4f0ab322ed6e64b3430276f37e1cd856b1dad90922639a5b33eab250a9","sha256":"d88972c00f549ad2c9d50b6b2d05702bf89c023cd70a98190ddb5330c4611f87","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:47.667639+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","text":"TIM. And indeed the body of the heaven has come to be visible, but the soul invisible, partaking of reason and harmony, having become, through the best, the best of things that have come to be, among intelligible things that are always. Since, then, she has been blended together from the nature of the Same and of the Different and from being, these three portions, and has been divided and bound together according to proportion, and herself revolves back upon herself, whenever she touches something having dispersed being and whenever something indivisible, she declares, moving through her whole self, to what anything may be the same and from what it may be different, and in relation to what especially, and where and how and when it comes about that each thing is and is affected in relation to each several thing among things coming to be, and in relation to things that are always in the same state.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","text":"And when the discourse that is true and in accordance with the Same, concerning both the Different and the Same, is borne without voice or sound in that which is moved by itself, whenever it concerns the perceptible and the circle of the Different, proceeding aright, reports it throughout its whole soul, firm and true opinions and beliefs arise; but whenever in turn it concerns the rational, and the circle of the Same, being well-turned, makes these things manifest, understanding and knowledge are necessarily brought to completion. And if anyone should ever say that that in which these two come to be is anything other than soul, he will say anything rather than the truth. But when the father who begot it perceived that it, having been set in motion and alive, had come to be a shrine of the eternal gods, he was delighted; and rejoicing, he further devised to make it still more like the paradigm. Therefore, since that happens to be an eternal living creature, he undertook, so far as was possible, to bring this all into completion as such.\n\nThe nature of the living creature, then, happened to be eternal, and to attach this completely to what is generated was not possible. But he devised to make some moving image of eternity, and, while ordering the heaven, makes an eternal image, proceeding according to number, of eternity abiding in one—this image which indeed we have named time. For days and nights and months and years, which did not exist before heaven came to be, he contrives their coming-to-be at the same time as it is being constituted. But all these are parts of time; and “was” and “will be” are forms of time that have come to be, which we unwittingly carry over to eternal being, not correctly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","text":"The nature of the living creature, then, happened to be eternal, and to attach this completely to what is generated was not possible. But he devised to make some moving image of eternity, and, while ordering the heaven, makes an eternal image, proceeding according to number, of eternity abiding in one—this image which indeed we have named time. For days and nights and months and years, which did not exist before heaven came to be, he contrives their coming-to-be at the same time as it is being constituted. But all these are parts of time; and “was” and “will be” are forms of time that have come to be, which we unwittingly carry over to eternal being, not correctly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"2c32d0b4ab880f2422bab6cde31c2c6b3c09cfb8b5e850cd0a3bebbc4630a575","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 37"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 37","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20","title":"Section 38","order":22,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_20","text":"ΤΙ. λέγομεν γὰρ δὴ ὡς ἦν ἔστιν τε καὶ ἔσται, τῇ δὲ τὸ ἔστιν μόνον κατὰ τὸν  ἀληθῆ λόγον προσήκει, τὸ δὲ ἦν τό τʼ ἔσται περὶ τὴν ἐν χρόνῳ γένεσιν ἰοῦσαν πρέπει λέγεσθαι—κινήσεις γάρ ἐστον, τὸ δὲ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον ἀκινήτως οὔτε πρεσβύτερον οὔτε νεώτερον προσήκει γίγνεσθαι διὰ χρόνου οὐδὲ γενέσθαι ποτὲ οὐδὲ γεγονέναι νῦν οὐδʼ εἰς αὖθις ἔσεσθαι, τὸ παράπαν τε οὐδὲν ὅσα γένεσις τοῖς ἐν αἰσθήσει φερομένοις προσῆψεν, ἀλλὰ χρόνου ταῦτα αἰῶνα μιμουμένου καὶ κατʼ ἀριθμὸν κυκλουμένου γέγονεν εἴδη—καὶ πρὸς τούτοις ἔτι τὰ τοιάδε,  τό τε γεγονὸς εἶναι γεγονὸς καὶ τὸ γιγνόμενον εἶναι γιγνόμενον, ἔτι τε τὸ γενησόμενον εἶναι γενησόμενον καὶ τὸ μὴ ὂν μὴ ὂν εἶναι, ὧν οὐδὲν ἀκριβὲς λέγομεν. περὶ μὲν οὖν τούτων τάχʼ ἂν οὐκ εἴη καιρὸς πρέπων ἐν τῷ παρόντι διακριβολογεῖσθαι. χρόνος δʼ οὖν μετʼ οὐρανοῦ γέγονεν, ἵνα ἅμα γεννηθέντες ἅμα καὶ λυθῶσιν, ἄν ποτε λύσις τις αὐτῶν γίγνηται, καὶ κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα τῆς διαιωνίας φύσεως, ἵνʼ ὡς ὁμοιότατος  αὐτῷ κατὰ δύναμιν ᾖ· τὸ μὲν γὰρ δὴ παράδειγμα πάντα αἰῶνά ἐστιν ὄν, ὁ δʼ αὖ διὰ τέλους τὸν ἅπαντα χρόνον γεγονώς τε καὶ ὢν καὶ ἐσόμενος. ἐξ οὖν λόγου καὶ διανοίας θεοῦ τοιαύτης πρὸς χρόνου γένεσιν, ἵνα γεννηθῇ χρόνος, ἥλιος καὶ σελήνη καὶ πέντε ἄλλα ἄστρα, ἐπίκλην ἔχοντα πλανητά, εἰς διορισμὸν καὶ φυλακὴν ἀριθμῶν χρόνου γέγονεν· σώματα δὲ αὐτῶν ἑκάστων ποιήσας ὁ θεὸς ἔθηκεν εἰς τὰς περιφορὰς ἃς ἡ θατέρου περίοδος ᾔειν, ἑπτὰ οὔσας ὄντα  ἑπτά, σελήνην μὲν εἰς τὸν περὶ γῆν πρῶτον, ἥλιον δὲ εἰς τὸν δεύτερον ὑπὲρ γῆς, ἑωσφόρον δὲ καὶ τὸν ἱερὸν Ἑρμοῦ λεγόμενον εἰς  τάχει μὲν ἰσόδρομον ἡλίῳ κύκλον ἰόντας, τὴν δὲ ἐναντίαν εἰληχότας αὐτῷ δύναμιν· ὅθεν καταλαμβάνουσίν τε καὶ καταλαμβάνονται κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὑπʼ ἀλλήλων ἥλιός τε καὶ ὁ τοῦ Ἑρμοῦ καὶ ἑωσφόρος. τὰ δʼ ἄλλα οἷ δὴ καὶ διʼ ἃς αἰτίας ἱδρύσατο, εἴ τις ἐπεξίοι πάσας, ὁ λόγος  πάρεργος ὢν πλέον ἂν ἔργον ὧν ἕνεκα λέγεται παράσχοι. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν ἴσως τάχʼ ἂν κατὰ σχολὴν ὕστερον τῆς ἀξίας τύχοι διηγήσεως·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. λέγομεν γὰρ δὴ ὡς ἦν ἔστιν τε καὶ ἔσται, τῇ δὲ τὸ ἔστιν μόνον κατὰ τὸν  ἀληθῆ λόγον προσήκει, τὸ δὲ ἦν τό τʼ ἔσται περὶ τὴν ἐν χρόνῳ γένεσιν ἰοῦσαν πρέπει λέγεσθαι—κινήσεις γάρ ἐστον, τὸ δὲ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον ἀκινήτως οὔτε πρεσβύτερον οὔτε νεώτερον προσήκει γίγνεσθαι διὰ χρόνου οὐδὲ γενέσθαι ποτὲ οὐδὲ γεγονέναι νῦν οὐδʼ εἰς αὖθις ἔσεσθαι, τὸ παράπαν τε οὐδὲν ὅσα γένεσις τοῖς ἐν αἰσθήσει φερομένοις προσῆψεν, ἀλλὰ χρόνου ταῦτα αἰῶνα μιμουμένου καὶ κατʼ ἀριθμὸν κυκλουμένου γέγονεν εἴδη—καὶ πρὸς τούτοις ἔτι τὰ τοιάδε,  τό τε γεγονὸς εἶναι γεγονὸς καὶ τὸ γιγνόμενον εἶναι γιγνόμενον, ἔτι τε τὸ γενησόμενον εἶναι γενησόμενον καὶ τὸ μὴ ὂν μὴ ὂν εἶναι, ὧν οὐδὲν ἀκριβὲς λέγομεν. περὶ μὲν οὖν τούτων τάχʼ ἂν οὐκ εἴη καιρὸς πρέπων ἐν τῷ παρόντι διακριβολογεῖσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","text":"χρόνος δʼ οὖν μετʼ οὐρανοῦ γέγονεν, ἵνα ἅμα γεννηθέντες ἅμα καὶ λυθῶσιν, ἄν ποτε λύσις τις αὐτῶν γίγνηται, καὶ κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα τῆς διαιωνίας φύσεως, ἵνʼ ὡς ὁμοιότατος  αὐτῷ κατὰ δύναμιν ᾖ· τὸ μὲν γὰρ δὴ παράδειγμα πάντα αἰῶνά ἐστιν ὄν, ὁ δʼ αὖ διὰ τέλους τὸν ἅπαντα χρόνον γεγονώς τε καὶ ὢν καὶ ἐσόμενος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","text":"ἐξ οὖν λόγου καὶ διανοίας θεοῦ τοιαύτης πρὸς χρόνου γένεσιν, ἵνα γεννηθῇ χρόνος, ἥλιος καὶ σελήνη καὶ πέντε ἄλλα ἄστρα, ἐπίκλην ἔχοντα πλανητά, εἰς διορισμὸν καὶ φυλακὴν ἀριθμῶν χρόνου γέγονεν· σώματα δὲ αὐτῶν ἑκάστων ποιήσας ὁ θεὸς ἔθηκεν εἰς τὰς περιφορὰς ἃς ἡ θατέρου περίοδος ᾔειν, ἑπτὰ οὔσας ὄντα  ἑπτά, σελήνην μὲν εἰς τὸν περὶ γῆν πρῶτον, ἥλιον δὲ εἰς τὸν δεύτερον ὑπὲρ γῆς, ἑωσφόρον δὲ καὶ τὸν ἱερὸν Ἑρμοῦ λεγόμενον εἰς  τάχει μὲν ἰσόδρομον ἡλίῳ κύκλον ἰόντας, τὴν δὲ ἐναντίαν εἰληχότας αὐτῷ δύναμιν· ὅθεν καταλαμβάνουσίν τε καὶ καταλαμβάνονται κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὑπʼ ἀλλήλων ἥλιός τε καὶ ὁ τοῦ Ἑρμοῦ καὶ ἑωσφόρος. τὰ δʼ ἄλλα οἷ δὴ καὶ διʼ ἃς αἰτίας ἱδρύσατο, εἴ τις ἐπεξίοι πάσας, ὁ λόγος  πάρεργος ὢν πλέον ἂν ἔργον ὧν ἕνεκα λέγεται παράσχοι. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν ἴσως τάχʼ ἂν κατὰ σχολὴν ὕστερον τῆς ἀξίας τύχοι διηγήσεως·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"2a0cef8cfa902894cbeab3cd22aa01c0f775bdd86d57d8097caf964cb15b63dd","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224654687697Z_95c26b8b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 38","source_sha256":"2a0cef8cfa902894cbeab3cd22aa01c0f775bdd86d57d8097caf964cb15b63dd","sha256":"d8b7c06f4699f85ce1f863fb69db29577bd9b25f7ccf841e0b62c6a04b318170","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:46:54.687731+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","text":"For we say, I suppose, that it was and is and will be, whereas to it belongs, according to the true account, only “is”; but “was” and “will be” are fittingly said concerning the coming-to-be that proceeds in time—for they are motions; but that which is forever in the same state immovably ought neither to become older nor younger through time, nor ever to have come to be, nor to have come to be now, nor to be about to be in the future; indeed, it ought to have none at all of those things which coming-to-be has attached to the things borne along in perception. Rather, these have come to be forms of time, which imitates eternity and revolves according to number. And besides these, there are such expressions as these: that what has come to be is what has come to be, and what is coming to be is what is coming to be, and again that what will come to be is what will come to be, and that what is not is what is not—none of which do we speak accurately. But perhaps it would not be a fitting occasion at present to make precise distinctions concerning these matters.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","text":"Time, then, came to be together with heaven, in order that, having been generated together, they might also be dissolved together, if ever any dissolution of them should occur; and it came to be after the pattern of the ever-enduring nature, in order that it might be as like it as possible according to its capacity. For the pattern is what is for all eternity, whereas it, having come to be and being and to be through all time unto its end, is in turn so.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","text":"Accordingly, from such reasoning and thought of god concerning the generation of time, in order that time might be generated, the sun and moon and five other stars, called the planets, came to be for the distinguishing and safeguarding of the numbers of time. And, having made the bodies of each of them, god set them in the revolutions through which the circuit of the Different went—seven being seven: the moon in the first circuit around the earth, the sun in the second above the earth, and the morning-star and the one called sacred to Hermes in a circle proceeding with speed equal to that of the sun, but having received a power contrary to it. Hence the sun, the star of Hermes, and the morning-star overtake and are overtaken by one another alike. But the other stars—where and for what reasons he established them—if someone should go through all these matters, the account, being incidental, would provide a greater task than the matters for whose sake it is spoken. These things, then, perhaps later, at leisure, may receive an account worthy of them;","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"7472541e9359d9f69e28e27a4c5306d9bdc1da8260f0a476f76b047f74380c5b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 38"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 38","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21","title":"Section 39","order":23,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_21","text":"ΤΙ. ἐπειδὴ δὲ οὖν εἰς τὴν ἑαυτῷ πρέπουσαν ἕκαστον ἀφίκετο φορὰν τῶν ὅσα ἔδει συναπεργάζεσθαι χρόνον, δεσμοῖς τε ἐμψύχοις σώματα δεθέντα ζῷα ἐγεννήθη τό τε προσταχθὲν ἔμαθεν, κατὰ δὴ τὴν θατέρου φορὰν  πλαγίαν οὖσαν, διὰ τῆς ταὐτοῦ φορᾶς ἰούσης τε καὶ κρατουμένης, τὸ μὲν μείζονα αὐτῶν, τὸ δʼ ἐλάττω κύκλον ἰόν, θᾶττον μὲν τὰ τὸν ἐλάττω, τὰ δὲ τὸν μείζω βραδύτερον περιῄειν. τῇ δὴ ταὐτοῦ φορᾷ τὰ τάχιστα περιιόντα ὑπὸ τῶν βραδύτερον ἰόντων ἐφαίνετο καταλαμβάνοντα καταλαμβάνεσθαι· πάντας γὰρ τοὺς κύκλους αὐτῶν στρέφουσα ἕλικα διὰ τὸ διχῇ κατὰ  τὰ ἐναντία ἅμα προϊέναι τὸ βραδύτατα ἀπιὸν ἀφʼ αὑτῆς οὔσης ταχίστης ἐγγύτατα ἀπέφαινεν. ἵνα δʼ εἴη μέτρον ἐναργές τι πρὸς ἄλληλα βραδυτῆτι καὶ τάχει καὶ τὰ περὶ τὰς ὀκτὼ φορὰς πορεύοιτο, φῶς ὁ θεὸς ἀνῆψεν ἐν τῇ πρὸς γῆν δευτέρᾳ τῶν περιόδων, ὃ δὴ νῦν κεκλήκαμεν ἥλιον, ἵνα ὅτι μάλιστα εἰς ἅπαντα φαίνοι τὸν οὐρανὸν μετάσχοι τε ἀριθμοῦ τὰ ζῷα ὅσοις ἦν προσῆκον, μαθόντα παρὰ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου  περιφορᾶς. νὺξ μὲν οὖν ἡμέρα τε γέγονεν οὕτως καὶ διὰ ταῦτα, ἡ τῆς μιᾶς καὶ φρονιμωτάτης κυκλήσεως περίοδος· μεὶς δὲ ἐπειδὰν σελήνη περιελθοῦσα τὸν ἑαυτῆς κύκλον ἥλιον ἐπικαταλάβῃ, ἐνιαυτὸς δὲ ὁπόταν ἥλιος τὸν ἑαυτοῦ περιέλθῃ κύκλον. τῶν δʼ ἄλλων τὰς περιόδους οὐκ ἐννενοηκότες ἄνθρωποι, πλὴν ὀλίγοι τῶν πολλῶν, οὔτε ὀνομάζουσιν οὔτε πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμετροῦνται σκοποῦντες ἀριθμοῖς, ὥστε ὡς ἔπος  εἰπεῖν οὐκ ἴσασιν χρόνον ὄντα τὰς τούτων πλάνας, πλήθει μὲν ἀμηχάνῳ χρωμένας, πεποικιλμένας δὲ θαυμαστῶς· ἔστιν δʼ ὅμως οὐδὲν ἧττον κατανοῆσαι δυνατὸν ὡς ὅ γε τέλεος ἀριθμὸς χρόνου τὸν τέλεον ἐνιαυτὸν πληροῖ τότε, ὅταν ἁπασῶν τῶν ὀκτὼ περιόδων τὰ πρὸς ἄλληλα συμπερανθέντα τάχη σχῇ κεφαλὴν τῷ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίως ἰόντος ἀναμετρηθέντα κύκλῳ. κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ καὶ τούτων ἕνεκα ἐγεννήθη τῶν ἄστρων ὅσα διʼ οὐρανοῦ πορευόμενα ἔσχεν τροπάς, ἵνα τόδε  ὡς ὁμοιότατον ᾖ τῷ τελέῳ καὶ νοητῷ ζῴῳ πρὸς τὴν τῆς διαιωνίας μίμησιν φύσεως. καὶ τὰ μὲν ἄλλα ἤδη μέχρι χρόνου γενέσεως ἀπείργαστο εἰς ὁμοιότητα ᾧπερ ἀπεικάζετο, τὸ δὲ μήπω τὰ πάντα ζῷα ἐντὸς αὑτοῦ γεγενημένα περιειληφέναι, ταύτῃ ἔτι εἶχεν ἀνομοίως. τοῦτο δὴ τὸ κατάλοιπον ἀπηργάζετο αὐτοῦ πρὸς τὴν τοῦ παραδείγματος ἀποτυπούμενος φύσιν. ᾗπερ οὖν νοῦς ἐνούσας ἰδέας τῷ ὃ ἔστιν ζῷον, οἷαί τε ἔνεισι καὶ ὅσαι, καθορᾷ, τοιαύτας καὶ τοσαύτας διενοήθη δεῖν καὶ τόδε σχεῖν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἐπειδὴ δὲ οὖν εἰς τὴν ἑαυτῷ πρέπουσαν ἕκαστον ἀφίκετο φορὰν τῶν ὅσα ἔδει συναπεργάζεσθαι χρόνον, δεσμοῖς τε ἐμψύχοις σώματα δεθέντα ζῷα ἐγεννήθη τό τε προσταχθὲν ἔμαθεν, κατὰ δὴ τὴν θατέρου φορὰν  πλαγίαν οὖσαν, διὰ τῆς ταὐτοῦ φορᾶς ἰούσης τε καὶ κρατουμένης, τὸ μὲν μείζονα αὐτῶν, τὸ δʼ ἐλάττω κύκλον ἰόν, θᾶττον μὲν τὰ τὸν ἐλάττω, τὰ δὲ τὸν μείζω βραδύτερον περιῄειν. τῇ δὴ ταὐτοῦ φορᾷ τὰ τάχιστα περιιόντα ὑπὸ τῶν βραδύτερον ἰόντων ἐφαίνετο καταλαμβάνοντα καταλαμβάνεσθαι· πάντας γὰρ τοὺς κύκλους αὐτῶν στρέφουσα ἕλικα διὰ τὸ διχῇ κατὰ  τὰ ἐναντία ἅμα προϊέναι τὸ βραδύτατα ἀπιὸν ἀφʼ αὑτῆς οὔσης ταχίστης ἐγγύτατα ἀπέφαινεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","text":"ἵνα δʼ εἴη μέτρον ἐναργές τι πρὸς ἄλληλα βραδυτῆτι καὶ τάχει καὶ τὰ περὶ τὰς ὀκτὼ φορὰς πορεύοιτο, φῶς ὁ θεὸς ἀνῆψεν ἐν τῇ πρὸς γῆν δευτέρᾳ τῶν περιόδων, ὃ δὴ νῦν κεκλήκαμεν ἥλιον, ἵνα ὅτι μάλιστα εἰς ἅπαντα φαίνοι τὸν οὐρανὸν μετάσχοι τε ἀριθμοῦ τὰ ζῷα ὅσοις ἦν προσῆκον, μαθόντα παρὰ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου  περιφορᾶς. νὺξ μὲν οὖν ἡμέρα τε γέγονεν οὕτως καὶ διὰ ταῦτα, ἡ τῆς μιᾶς καὶ φρονιμωτάτης κυκλήσεως περίοδος· μεὶς δὲ ἐπειδὰν σελήνη περιελθοῦσα τὸν ἑαυτῆς κύκλον ἥλιον ἐπικαταλάβῃ, ἐνιαυτὸς δὲ ὁπόταν ἥλιος τὸν ἑαυτοῦ περιέλθῃ κύκλον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","text":"τῶν δʼ ἄλλων τὰς περιόδους οὐκ ἐννενοηκότες ἄνθρωποι, πλὴν ὀλίγοι τῶν πολλῶν, οὔτε ὀνομάζουσιν οὔτε πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμετροῦνται σκοποῦντες ἀριθμοῖς, ὥστε ὡς ἔπος  εἰπεῖν οὐκ ἴσασιν χρόνον ὄντα τὰς τούτων πλάνας, πλήθει μὲν ἀμηχάνῳ χρωμένας, πεποικιλμένας δὲ θαυμαστῶς· ἔστιν δʼ ὅμως οὐδὲν ἧττον κατανοῆσαι δυνατὸν ὡς ὅ γε τέλεος ἀριθμὸς χρόνου τὸν τέλεον ἐνιαυτὸν πληροῖ τότε, ὅταν ἁπασῶν τῶν ὀκτὼ περιόδων τὰ πρὸς ἄλληλα συμπερανθέντα τάχη σχῇ κεφαλὴν τῷ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίως ἰόντος ἀναμετρηθέντα κύκλῳ. κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ καὶ τούτων ἕνεκα ἐγεννήθη τῶν ἄστρων ὅσα διʼ οὐρανοῦ πορευόμενα ἔσχεν τροπάς, ἵνα τόδε  ὡς ὁμοιότατον ᾖ τῷ τελέῳ καὶ νοητῷ ζῴῳ πρὸς τὴν τῆς διαιωνίας μίμησιν φύσεως. καὶ τὰ μὲν ἄλλα ἤδη μέχρι χρόνου γενέσεως ἀπείργαστο εἰς ὁμοιότητα ᾧπερ ἀπεικάζετο, τὸ δὲ μήπω τὰ πάντα ζῷα ἐντὸς αὑτοῦ γεγενημένα περιειληφέναι, ταύτῃ ἔτι εἶχεν ἀνομοίως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","text":"τοῦτο δὴ τὸ κατάλοιπον ἀπηργάζετο αὐτοῦ πρὸς τὴν τοῦ παραδείγματος ἀποτυπούμενος φύσιν. ᾗπερ οὖν νοῦς ἐνούσας ἰδέας τῷ ὃ ἔστιν ζῷον, οἷαί τε ἔνεισι καὶ ὅσαι, καθορᾷ, τοιαύτας καὶ τοσαύτας διενοήθη δεῖν καὶ τόδε σχεῖν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"ad9fc990cd586a9f81fe0a8119670ec5f84cfc76a25e408fd45f522aca6b0e49","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224708816584Z_cd8baf2e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 39","source_sha256":"ad9fc990cd586a9f81fe0a8119670ec5f84cfc76a25e408fd45f522aca6b0e49","sha256":"33144d92516ef25727529a3165c524e87a5a44554c726d46550c8849ece97c8a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:08.816668+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","text":"TI. Since, then, each had arrived at the motion fitting for itself, in the time required for accomplishing what it had to accomplish together, and since bodies bound by living bonds had become living creatures and had learned what had been enjoined upon them, then, in accordance with the motion of the Other, which is oblique, while that of the Same proceeds and prevails, some of them, moving in a greater circle, and others in a lesser, went around more swiftly in the lesser circle, but more slowly in the greater. By the motion of the Same, those going around most swiftly appeared to be overtaken by those going more slowly, and to overtake them; for, by turning all their circles into a spiral, because they proceed simultaneously in two contrary directions, it made that which departed most slowly from itself—which itself is most swift—appear nearest.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","text":"And in order that there might be some clear measure of their relative slowness and swiftness, and that they might proceed in their eight revolutions, the god kindled a light in the second of the circuits from the earth, that which we now call the sun, in order that it might shine as much as possible throughout the whole heaven, and that those living creatures to whom it belonged might partake of number, having learned it from the revolution of the Same and the Like. Thus, then, night and day came to be, and for these reasons: the period of the one and most intelligent revolution. A month is when the moon, having gone round its own circle, overtakes the sun; and a year, whenever the sun has gone round its own circle.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","text":"But men, having not considered the periods of the others—except a few among many—neither name them nor measure them against one another by observing them with numbers; so that, one may say, they do not know that the wanderings of these, employing an immeasurable multitude and wonderfully variegated, are time. Yet it is nonetheless possible to understand that the complete number of time fulfills the complete year when the relative speeds of all the eight revolutions, having been brought to completion, attain their consummation, measured by the circle of that which goes in the same and uniform manner. Accordingly, and for these reasons, those of the stars which, travelling through heaven, have turnings came to be, in order that this might be as like as possible to the complete and intelligible Living Creature, in imitation of its eternal nature. And the other things had already been fashioned, as far as the generation of time, into a likeness of that to which it was being likened; but in not yet having embraced within itself all living creatures that had come to be, it was still unlike in this respect.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","text":"This remaining part he was fashioning in it, taking the nature of the paradigm as his model. Therefore, in whatever manner intellect perceives the Forms existing in that which is the Living Creature—what sorts they are and how many—such and so many did he conceive that this too must possess.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"6af96d93b9b31d7c17dc3821775954f0da5860c5da0b4ee94f0ec1963e295d62","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 39"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 39","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4","title":"Section 40","order":24,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4","text":"ΤΙ. εἰσὶν δὴ τέτταρες, μία μὲν οὐράνιον θεῶν γένος, ἄλλη δὲ  πτηνὸν καὶ ἀεροπόρον, τρίτη δὲ ἔνυδρον εἶδος, πεζὸν δὲ καὶ χερσαῖον τέταρτον. τοῦ μὲν οὖν θείου τὴν πλείστην ἰδέαν ἐκ πυρὸς ἀπηργάζετο, ὅπως ὅτι λαμπρότατον ἰδεῖν τε κάλλιστον εἴη, τῷ δὲ παντὶ προσεικάζων εὔκυκλον ἐποίει, τίθησίν τε εἰς τὴν τοῦ κρατίστου φρόνησιν ἐκείνῳ συνεπόμενον, νείμας περὶ πάντα κύκλῳ τὸν οὐρανόν, κόσμον ἀληθινὸν αὐτῷ πεποικιλμένον εἶναι καθʼ ὅλον. κινήσεις δὲ δύο προσῆψεν ἑκάστῳ, τὴν μὲν ἐν ταὐτῷ κατὰ ταὐτά, περὶ τῶν αὐτῶν ἀεὶ  τὰ αὐτὰ ἑαυτῷ διανοουμένῳ, τὴν δὲ εἰς τὸ πρόσθεν, ὑπὸ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιφορᾶς κρατουμένῳ· τὰς δὲ πέντε κινήσεις ἀκίνητον καὶ ἑστός, ἵνα ὅτι μάλιστα αὐτῶν ἕκαστον γένοιτο ὡς ἄριστον. ἐξ ἧς δὴ τῆς αἰτίας γέγονεν ὅσʼ ἀπλανῆ τῶν ἄστρων ζῷα θεῖα ὄντα καὶ ἀίδια καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν ταὐτῷ στρεφόμενα ἀεὶ μένει· τὰ δὲ τρεπόμενα καὶ πλάνην τοιαύτην ἴσχοντα, καθάπερ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἐρρήθη, κατʼ ἐκεῖνα γέγονεν. γῆν δὲ τροφὸν μὲν ἡμετέραν, ἰλλομένην δὲ  τὴν περὶ τὸν διὰ παντὸς πόλον τεταμένον, φύλακα καὶ δημιουργὸν νυκτός τε καὶ ἡμέρας ἐμηχανήσατο, πρώτην καὶ πρεσβυτάτην θεῶν ὅσοι ἐντὸς οὐρανοῦ γεγόνασιν. χορείας δὲ τούτων αὐτῶν καὶ παραβολὰς ἀλλήλων, καὶ  τὰς τῶν κύκλων πρὸς ἑαυτοὺς ἐπανακυκλήσεις καὶ προχωρήσεις, ἔν τε ταῖς συνάψεσιν ὁποῖοι τῶν θεῶν κατʼ ἀλλήλους γιγνόμενοι καὶ ὅσοι καταντικρύ, μεθʼ οὕστινάς τε ἐπίπροσθεν ἀλλήλοις ἡμῖν τε κατὰ χρόνους οὕστινας ἕκαστοι κατακαλύπτονται καὶ πάλιν ἀναφαινόμενοι φόβους καὶ σημεῖα τῶν  μετὰ ταῦτα γενησομένων τοῖς οὐ δυναμένοις λογίζεσθαι πέμπουσιν, τὸ λέγειν ἄνευ διʼ ὄψεως τούτων αὖ τῶν μιμημάτων μάταιος ἂν εἴη πόνος· ἀλλὰ ταῦτά τε ἱκανῶς ἡμῖν ταύτῃ καὶ τὰ περὶ θεῶν ὁρατῶν καὶ γεννητῶν εἰρημένα φύσεως ἐχέτω τέλος. περὶ δὲ τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων εἰπεῖν καὶ γνῶναι τὴν γένεσιν μεῖζον ἢ καθʼ ἡμᾶς, πειστέον δὲ τοῖς εἰρηκόσιν ἔμπροσθεν, ἐκγόνοις μὲν θεῶν οὖσιν, ὡς ἔφασαν, σαφῶς δέ που τούς γε αὑτῶν προγόνους εἰδόσιν· ἀδύνατον οὖν θεῶν  παισὶν ἀπιστεῖν, καίπερ ἄνευ τε εἰκότων καὶ ἀναγκαίων ἀποδείξεων λέγουσιν, ἀλλʼ ὡς οἰκεῖα φασκόντων ἀπαγγέλλειν ἑπομένους τῷ νόμῳ πιστευτέον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. εἰσὶν δὴ τέτταρες, μία μὲν οὐράνιον θεῶν γένος, ἄλλη δὲ  πτηνὸν καὶ ἀεροπόρον, τρίτη δὲ ἔνυδρον εἶδος, πεζὸν δὲ καὶ χερσαῖον τέταρτον. τοῦ μὲν οὖν θείου τὴν πλείστην ἰδέαν ἐκ πυρὸς ἀπηργάζετο, ὅπως ὅτι λαμπρότατον ἰδεῖν τε κάλλιστον εἴη, τῷ δὲ παντὶ προσεικάζων εὔκυκλον ἐποίει, τίθησίν τε εἰς τὴν τοῦ κρατίστου φρόνησιν ἐκείνῳ συνεπόμενον, νείμας περὶ πάντα κύκλῳ τὸν οὐρανόν, κόσμον ἀληθινὸν αὐτῷ πεποικιλμένον εἶναι καθʼ ὅλον. κινήσεις δὲ δύο προσῆψεν ἑκάστῳ, τὴν μὲν ἐν ταὐτῷ κατὰ ταὐτά, περὶ τῶν αὐτῶν ἀεὶ  τὰ αὐτὰ ἑαυτῷ διανοουμένῳ, τὴν δὲ εἰς τὸ πρόσθεν, ὑπὸ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιφορᾶς κρατουμένῳ· τὰς δὲ πέντε κινήσεις ἀκίνητον καὶ ἑστός, ἵνα ὅτι μάλιστα αὐτῶν ἕκαστον γένοιτο ὡς ἄριστον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","text":"ἐξ ἧς δὴ τῆς αἰτίας γέγονεν ὅσʼ ἀπλανῆ τῶν ἄστρων ζῷα θεῖα ὄντα καὶ ἀίδια καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἐν ταὐτῷ στρεφόμενα ἀεὶ μένει· τὰ δὲ τρεπόμενα καὶ πλάνην τοιαύτην ἴσχοντα, καθάπερ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἐρρήθη, κατʼ ἐκεῖνα γέγονεν. γῆν δὲ τροφὸν μὲν ἡμετέραν, ἰλλομένην δὲ  τὴν περὶ τὸν διὰ παντὸς πόλον τεταμένον, φύλακα καὶ δημιουργὸν νυκτός τε καὶ ἡμέρας ἐμηχανήσατο, πρώτην καὶ πρεσβυτάτην θεῶν ὅσοι ἐντὸς οὐρανοῦ γεγόνασιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","text":"χορείας δὲ τούτων αὐτῶν καὶ παραβολὰς ἀλλήλων, καὶ  τὰς τῶν κύκλων πρὸς ἑαυτοὺς ἐπανακυκλήσεις καὶ προχωρήσεις, ἔν τε ταῖς συνάψεσιν ὁποῖοι τῶν θεῶν κατʼ ἀλλήλους γιγνόμενοι καὶ ὅσοι καταντικρύ, μεθʼ οὕστινάς τε ἐπίπροσθεν ἀλλήλοις ἡμῖν τε κατὰ χρόνους οὕστινας ἕκαστοι κατακαλύπτονται καὶ πάλιν ἀναφαινόμενοι φόβους καὶ σημεῖα τῶν  μετὰ ταῦτα γενησομένων τοῖς οὐ δυναμένοις λογίζεσθαι πέμπουσιν, τὸ λέγειν ἄνευ διʼ ὄψεως τούτων αὖ τῶν μιμημάτων μάταιος ἂν εἴη πόνος· ἀλλὰ ταῦτά τε ἱκανῶς ἡμῖν ταύτῃ καὶ τὰ περὶ θεῶν ὁρατῶν καὶ γεννητῶν εἰρημένα φύσεως ἐχέτω τέλος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","text":"περὶ δὲ τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων εἰπεῖν καὶ γνῶναι τὴν γένεσιν μεῖζον ἢ καθʼ ἡμᾶς, πειστέον δὲ τοῖς εἰρηκόσιν ἔμπροσθεν, ἐκγόνοις μὲν θεῶν οὖσιν, ὡς ἔφασαν, σαφῶς δέ που τούς γε αὑτῶν προγόνους εἰδόσιν· ἀδύνατον οὖν θεῶν  παισὶν ἀπιστεῖν, καίπερ ἄνευ τε εἰκότων καὶ ἀναγκαίων ἀποδείξεων λέγουσιν, ἀλλʼ ὡς οἰκεῖα φασκόντων ἀπαγγέλλειν ἑπομένους τῷ νόμῳ πιστευτέον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"489ab65b81a995e694316130ff6c093dc595fde2f32da01e3bcd97eb34050284","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224716514043Z_aca0c3ce","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 40","source_sha256":"489ab65b81a995e694316130ff6c093dc595fde2f32da01e3bcd97eb34050284","sha256":"64b3fdfd402f101af1786f826dc3ca4a1b66d72387dbd7432c050ed67fcfec32","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:16.514101+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","text":"There are, then, four kinds: one, the heavenly kind of gods; another, the winged and air-borne kind; a third, the aquatic kind; and a fourth, the pedestrian and terrestrial. Of the divine kind he fashioned the greater part from fire, in order that it might be as bright as possible to see and as beautiful; and, likening it to the All, he made it well-rounded and set it in the intelligence of the most powerful, to follow that intelligence, distributing it in a circle about the whole heaven, that it might be a true cosmos, variegated throughout in its entirety. To each he assigned two motions: one in the same place and in the same manner, as it thinks always the same things about the same things in itself; the other forward, though mastered by the revolution of the Same and the Similar. But he made it motionless and fixed with respect to the five motions, in order that each of them might become as excellent as possible.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","text":"For which reason those of the stars that are divine living beings and eternal, and that always remain revolving in the same manner in the same place, have come to be; while those that turn and possess such wandering as was described earlier have come to be in that way. And the earth, our nurse, wound about the pole stretched through the whole, he contrived as the guardian and artificer of night and day, first and eldest of the gods that have come to be within heaven.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","text":"But to speak of the dances of these very bodies and of their mutual conjunctions, and of the return-circlings and forward motions of their circles relative to one another; and, at their conjunctions, which of the gods come to be beside one another and how many are opposite; and after which ones they are in front of one another, and at what times each is hidden from us and again appears, sending terrors and signs of things to come to those unable to calculate—to speak of these matters without visual representations of these very imitations would be a futile labor. But let this suffice for us in this respect, and let what has been said concerning the nature of the visible and generated gods have its end.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","text":"Concerning the other daimones, to speak of and to know their generation is beyond us; but we must trust those who have spoken before, being, as they said, offspring of gods and surely knowing their own ancestors clearly. It is impossible, then, to disbelieve children of gods, even though they speak without probable or necessary demonstrations; rather, since they claim to report what is familiar to them, one must believe them, following the law.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"3f7cbebe999879ffadc36ece05b8a06ba4e60e67e456a6ff33c87b936209e25c","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 40"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 40","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22","title":"Section 41","order":25,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_22","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτως οὖν κατʼ ἐκείνους ἡμῖν ἡ γένεσις περὶ τούτων τῶν θεῶν ἐχέτω καὶ λεγέσθω. Γῆς τε καὶ Οὐρανοῦ παῖδες Ὠκεανός τε καὶ Τηθὺς ἐγενέσθην, τούτων δὲ Φόρκυς Κρόνος τε καὶ Ῥέα καὶ ὅσοι μετὰ  τούτων, ἐκ δὲ Κρόνου καὶ Ῥέας Ζεὺς Ἥρα τε καὶ πάντες ὅσους ἴσμεν ἀδελφοὺς λεγομένους αὐτῶν, ἔτι τε τούτων ἄλλους ἐκγόνους· ἐπεὶ δʼ οὖν πάντες ὅσοι τε περιπολοῦσιν φανερῶς καὶ ὅσοι φαίνονται καθʼ ὅσον ἂν ἐθέλωσιν θεοὶ γένεσιν ἔσχον, λέγει πρὸς αὐτοὺς ὁ τόδε τὸ πᾶν γεννήσας τάδε— θεοὶ θεῶν, ὧν ἐγὼ δημιουργὸς πατήρ τε ἔργων, διʼ ἐμοῦ γενόμενα ἄλυτα ἐμοῦ γε μὴ ἐθέλοντος. τὸ μὲν οὖν δὴ  δεθὲν πᾶν λυτόν, τό γε μὴν καλῶς ἁρμοσθὲν καὶ ἔχον εὖ λύειν ἐθέλειν κακοῦ· διʼ ἃ καὶ ἐπείπερ γεγένησθε, ἀθάνατοι μὲν οὐκ ἐστὲ οὐδʼ ἄλυτοι τὸ πάμπαν, οὔτι μὲν δὴ λυθήσεσθέ γε οὐδὲ τεύξεσθε θανάτου μοίρας, τῆς ἐμῆς βουλήσεως μείζονος ἔτι δεσμοῦ καὶ κυριωτέρου λαχόντες ἐκείνων οἷς ὅτʼ ἐγίγνεσθε συνεδεῖσθε. νῦν οὖν ὃ λέγω πρὸς ὑμᾶς ἐνδεικνύμενος, μάθετε. θνητὰ ἔτι γένη λοιπὰ τρία ἀγέννητα· τούτων δὲ μὴ γενομένων οὐρανὸς ἀτελὴς ἔσται· τὰ γὰρ ἅπαντʼ ἐν  αὑτῷ γένη ζῴων οὐχ ἕξει, δεῖ δέ, εἰ μέλλει τέλεος ἱκανῶς εἶναι. διʼ ἐμοῦ δὲ ταῦτα γενόμενα καὶ βίου μετασχόντα θεοῖς ἰσάζοιτʼ ἄν· ἵνα οὖν θνητά τε ᾖ τό τε πᾶν τόδε ὄντως ἅπαν ᾖ, τρέπεσθε κατὰ φύσιν ὑμεῖς ἐπὶ τὴν τῶν ζῴων δημιουργίαν, μιμούμενοι τὴν ἐμὴν δύναμιν περὶ τὴν ὑμετέραν γένεσιν. καὶ καθʼ ὅσον μὲν αὐτῶν ἀθανάτοις ὁμώνυμον εἶναι προσήκει, θεῖον λεγόμενον ἡγεμονοῦν τε ἐν αὐτοῖς τῶν ἀεὶ δίκῃ καὶ ὑμῖν ἐθελόντων ἕπεσθαι, σπείρας καὶ ὑπαρξάμενος  ἐγὼ παραδώσω· τὸ δὲ λοιπὸν ὑμεῖς, ἀθανάτῳ θνητὸν προσυφαίνοντες, ἀπεργάζεσθε ζῷα καὶ γεννᾶτε τροφήν τε διδόντες αὐξάνετε καὶ φθίνοντα πάλιν δέχεσθε. ταῦτʼ εἶπε, καὶ πάλιν ἐπὶ τὸν πρότερον κρατῆρα, ἐν ᾧ τὴν τοῦ παντὸς ψυχὴν κεραννὺς ἔμισγεν, τὰ τῶν πρόσθεν ὑπόλοιπα κατεχεῖτο μίσγων τρόπον μέν τινα τὸν αὐτόν, ἀκήρατα δὲ οὐκέτι κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὡσαύτως, ἀλλὰ δεύτερα καὶ τρίτα. συστήσας δὲ τὸ πᾶν διεῖλεν ψυχὰς ἰσαρίθμους τοῖς ἄστροις,  ἔνειμέν θʼ ἑκάστην πρὸς ἕκαστον, καὶ ἐμβιβάσας ὡς ἐς ὄχημα τὴν τοῦ παντὸς φύσιν ἔδειξεν, νόμους τε τοὺς εἱμαρμένους εἶπεν αὐταῖς, ὅτι γένεσις πρώτη μὲν ἔσοιτο τεταγμένη μία πᾶσιν, ἵνα μήτις ἐλαττοῖτο ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ, δέοι δὲ σπαρείσας αὐτὰς εἰς τὰ προσήκοντα ἑκάσταις ἕκαστα ὄργανα χρόνων  φῦναι ζῴων τὸ θεοσεβέστατον, διπλῆς δὲ οὔσης τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης φύσεως, τὸ κρεῖττον τοιοῦτον εἴη γένος ὃ καὶ ἔπειτα κεκλήσοιτο ἀνήρ.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτως οὖν κατʼ ἐκείνους ἡμῖν ἡ γένεσις περὶ τούτων τῶν θεῶν ἐχέτω καὶ λεγέσθω. Γῆς τε καὶ Οὐρανοῦ παῖδες Ὠκεανός τε καὶ Τηθὺς ἐγενέσθην, τούτων δὲ Φόρκυς Κρόνος τε καὶ Ῥέα καὶ ὅσοι μετὰ  τούτων, ἐκ δὲ Κρόνου καὶ Ῥέας Ζεὺς Ἥρα τε καὶ πάντες ὅσους ἴσμεν ἀδελφοὺς λεγομένους αὐτῶν, ἔτι τε τούτων ἄλλους ἐκγόνους· ἐπεὶ δʼ οὖν πάντες ὅσοι τε περιπολοῦσιν φανερῶς καὶ ὅσοι φαίνονται καθʼ ὅσον ἂν ἐθέλωσιν θεοὶ γένεσιν ἔσχον, λέγει πρὸς αὐτοὺς ὁ τόδε τὸ πᾶν γεννήσας τάδε— θεοὶ θεῶν, ὧν ἐγὼ δημιουργὸς πατήρ τε ἔργων, διʼ ἐμοῦ γενόμενα ἄλυτα ἐμοῦ γε μὴ ἐθέλοντος. τὸ μὲν οὖν δὴ  δεθὲν πᾶν λυτόν, τό γε μὴν καλῶς ἁρμοσθὲν καὶ ἔχον εὖ λύειν ἐθέλειν κακοῦ· διʼ ἃ καὶ ἐπείπερ γεγένησθε, ἀθάνατοι μὲν οὐκ ἐστὲ οὐδʼ ἄλυτοι τὸ πάμπαν, οὔτι μὲν δὴ λυθήσεσθέ γε οὐδὲ τεύξεσθε θανάτου μοίρας, τῆς ἐμῆς βουλήσεως μείζονος ἔτι δεσμοῦ καὶ κυριωτέρου λαχόντες ἐκείνων οἷς ὅτʼ ἐγίγνεσθε συνεδεῖσθε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","text":"νῦν οὖν ὃ λέγω πρὸς ὑμᾶς ἐνδεικνύμενος, μάθετε. θνητὰ ἔτι γένη λοιπὰ τρία ἀγέννητα· τούτων δὲ μὴ γενομένων οὐρανὸς ἀτελὴς ἔσται· τὰ γὰρ ἅπαντʼ ἐν  αὑτῷ γένη ζῴων οὐχ ἕξει, δεῖ δέ, εἰ μέλλει τέλεος ἱκανῶς εἶναι. διʼ ἐμοῦ δὲ ταῦτα γενόμενα καὶ βίου μετασχόντα θεοῖς ἰσάζοιτʼ ἄν· ἵνα οὖν θνητά τε ᾖ τό τε πᾶν τόδε ὄντως ἅπαν ᾖ, τρέπεσθε κατὰ φύσιν ὑμεῖς ἐπὶ τὴν τῶν ζῴων δημιουργίαν, μιμούμενοι τὴν ἐμὴν δύναμιν περὶ τὴν ὑμετέραν γένεσιν. καὶ καθʼ ὅσον μὲν αὐτῶν ἀθανάτοις ὁμώνυμον εἶναι προσήκει, θεῖον λεγόμενον ἡγεμονοῦν τε ἐν αὐτοῖς τῶν ἀεὶ δίκῃ καὶ ὑμῖν ἐθελόντων ἕπεσθαι, σπείρας καὶ ὑπαρξάμενος  ἐγὼ παραδώσω· τὸ δὲ λοιπὸν ὑμεῖς, ἀθανάτῳ θνητὸν προσυφαίνοντες, ἀπεργάζεσθε ζῷα καὶ γεννᾶτε τροφήν τε διδόντες αὐξάνετε καὶ φθίνοντα πάλιν δέχεσθε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","text":"ταῦτʼ εἶπε, καὶ πάλιν ἐπὶ τὸν πρότερον κρατῆρα, ἐν ᾧ τὴν τοῦ παντὸς ψυχὴν κεραννὺς ἔμισγεν, τὰ τῶν πρόσθεν ὑπόλοιπα κατεχεῖτο μίσγων τρόπον μέν τινα τὸν αὐτόν, ἀκήρατα δὲ οὐκέτι κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὡσαύτως, ἀλλὰ δεύτερα καὶ τρίτα. συστήσας δὲ τὸ πᾶν διεῖλεν ψυχὰς ἰσαρίθμους τοῖς ἄστροις,  ἔνειμέν θʼ ἑκάστην πρὸς ἕκαστον, καὶ ἐμβιβάσας ὡς ἐς ὄχημα τὴν τοῦ παντὸς φύσιν ἔδειξεν, νόμους τε τοὺς εἱμαρμένους εἶπεν αὐταῖς, ὅτι γένεσις πρώτη μὲν ἔσοιτο τεταγμένη μία πᾶσιν, ἵνα μήτις ἐλαττοῖτο ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ, δέοι δὲ σπαρείσας αὐτὰς εἰς τὰ προσήκοντα ἑκάσταις ἕκαστα ὄργανα χρόνων  φῦναι ζῴων τὸ θεοσεβέστατον, διπλῆς δὲ οὔσης τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης φύσεως, τὸ κρεῖττον τοιοῦτον εἴη γένος ὃ καὶ ἔπειτα κεκλήσοιτο ἀνήρ.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"3b6d822e78937e428079f833d8f64b2c8dbf057c974d0ddff897ae7f08393074","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224727472376Z_285fadd5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 41","source_sha256":"3b6d822e78937e428079f833d8f64b2c8dbf057c974d0ddff897ae7f08393074","sha256":"244f51140c0f1f76871af9e7fbed037aaa9efd35b9b904c65fd697bd33db3336","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:27.472423+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","text":"TIM. Let, then, the account of the generation concerning these gods stand and be spoken by us in accordance with them. Of Earth and Uranus, Oceanus and Tethys were born; and of these, Phorcys and Cronus and Rhea and all those with them; and of Cronus and Rhea, Zeus and Hera and all those whom we know to be called their brothers and sisters, and yet other descendants of these. Since, then, all the gods who visibly revolve and those who appear whenever they wish had come into being, he who had begotten this All said to them as follows: “Gods of gods, whose maker and father of works I am: what has come to be through me is indissoluble, unless I myself will it. Now everything that has been bound is dissoluble; but to wish to dissolve what has been finely fitted together and is well constituted is the act of one who is evil. Therefore, since you have come into being, you are neither immortal nor wholly indissoluble; yet certainly you shall not be dissolved nor meet with the portion of death, having obtained a bond still greater and more sovereign than those by which, when you were coming into being, you were bound together.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","text":"“Now learn what I say to you, making it clear. There remain three mortal kinds yet unborn; and if these do not come into being, the heaven will be incomplete. For it will not contain within itself every kind of living creature, which it must have if it is to be sufficiently complete. But if these should come into being through me and partake of life, they would be equal to gods. Therefore, in order that they may be mortal and that this All may truly be all, turn yourselves according to your nature to the making of living creatures, imitating my power in respect of your own generation. And so far as it is fitting for any of them to be homonymous with the immortals, being called divine and ruling within them those who are always willing to follow justice and you, I myself, having sown and given them a beginning, will deliver over; but for the rest, you, weaving mortal together with immortal, fashion living creatures and beget them, and, giving them nourishment, cause them to grow, and receive them back again when they perish.”","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","text":"Having said these things, he again into the former mixing-bowl, in which he had mixed and blended the soul of the All, poured the remnants from the former mixture, mixing them in a manner somewhat the same, though no longer in the same way unadulterated, but second and third in purity. And having constituted the whole, he divided it into souls equal in number to the stars, assigning each soul to each star; and having mounted them, as into a vehicle, upon the nature of the All, he showed them, and declared to them the laws ordained by fate: that the first birth should be one and the same for all, so that none might be diminished by him; and that, when he had sown them into the instruments of time appropriate to each, they must grow into the most god-fearing of living creatures; and since human nature is twofold, the superior kind should be that which would thereafter be called man.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"664a236c8382e13a7a748f0c8b0cfdcade7c0f85682fe4fe8a622b09b5ff3f06","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 41"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 41","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23","title":"Section 42","order":26,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_23","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπότε δὴ σώμασιν ἐμφυτευθεῖεν ἐξ ἀνάγκης, καὶ τὸ μὲν προσίοι, τὸ δʼ ἀπίοι τοῦ σώματος αὐτῶν, πρῶτον μὲν αἴσθησιν ἀναγκαῖον εἴη μίαν πᾶσιν ἐκ βιαίων παθημάτων σύμφυτον γίγνεσθαι, δεύτερον δὲ ἡδονῇ καὶ λύπῃ μεμειγμένον ἔρωτα, πρὸς δὲ τούτοις φόβον καὶ θυμὸν ὅσα  τε ἑπόμενα αὐτοῖς καὶ ὁπόσα ἐναντίως πέφυκε διεστηκότα· ὧν εἰ μὲν κρατήσοιεν, δίκῃ βιώσοιντο, κρατηθέντες δὲ ἀδικίᾳ. καὶ ὁ μὲν εὖ τὸν προσήκοντα χρόνον βιούς, πάλιν εἰς τὴν τοῦ συννόμου πορευθεὶς οἴκησιν ἄστρου, βίον εὐδαίμονα καὶ συνήθη ἕξοι, σφαλεὶς δὲ τούτων εἰς γυναικὸς φύσιν ἐν τῇ  δευτέρᾳ γενέσει μεταβαλοῖ· μὴ παυόμενός τε ἐν τούτοις ἔτι κακίας, τρόπον ὃν κακύνοιτο, κατὰ τὴν ὁμοιότητα τῆς τοῦ τρόπου γενέσεως εἴς τινα τοιαύτην ἀεὶ μεταβαλοῖ θήρειον φύσιν, ἀλλάττων τε οὐ πρότερον πόνων λήξοι, πρὶν τῇ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιόδῳ τῇ ἐν αὑτῷ συνεπισπώμενος τὸν πολὺν ὄχλον καὶ ὕστερον προσφύντα ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος  καὶ γῆς, θορυβώδη καὶ ἄλογον ὄντα, λόγῳ κρατήσας εἰς τὸ τῆς πρώτης καὶ ἀρίστης ἀφίκοιτο εἶδος ἕξεως. διαθεσμοθετήσας δὲ πάντα αὐτοῖς ταῦτα, ἵνα τῆς ἔπειτα εἴη κακίας ἑκάστων ἀναίτιος, ἔσπειρεν τοὺς μὲν εἰς γῆν, τοὺς δʼ εἰς σελήνην, τοὺς δʼ εἰς τἆλλα ὅσα ὄργανα χρόνου· τὸ δὲ μετὰ τὸν σπόρον τοῖς νέοις παρέδωκεν θεοῖς σώματα πλάττειν θνητά, τό τʼ ἐπίλοιπον, ὅσον ἔτι ἦν ψυχῆς ἀνθρωπίνης δέον  προσγενέσθαι, τοῦτο καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα ἀκόλουθα ἐκείνοις ἀπεργασαμένους ἄρχειν, καὶ κατὰ δύναμιν ὅτι κάλλιστα καὶ ἄριστα τὸ θνητὸν διακυβερνᾶν ζῷον, ὅτι μὴ κακῶν αὐτὸ ἑαυτῷ γίγνοιτο αἴτιον. καὶ ὁ μὲν δὴ ἅπαντα ταῦτα διατάξας ἔμενεν ἐν τῷ ἑαυτοῦ κατὰ τρόπον ἤθει·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπότε δὴ σώμασιν ἐμφυτευθεῖεν ἐξ ἀνάγκης, καὶ τὸ μὲν προσίοι, τὸ δʼ ἀπίοι τοῦ σώματος αὐτῶν, πρῶτον μὲν αἴσθησιν ἀναγκαῖον εἴη μίαν πᾶσιν ἐκ βιαίων παθημάτων σύμφυτον γίγνεσθαι, δεύτερον δὲ ἡδονῇ καὶ λύπῃ μεμειγμένον ἔρωτα, πρὸς δὲ τούτοις φόβον καὶ θυμὸν ὅσα  τε ἑπόμενα αὐτοῖς καὶ ὁπόσα ἐναντίως πέφυκε διεστηκότα· ὧν εἰ μὲν κρατήσοιεν, δίκῃ βιώσοιντο, κρατηθέντες δὲ ἀδικίᾳ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","text":"καὶ ὁ μὲν εὖ τὸν προσήκοντα χρόνον βιούς, πάλιν εἰς τὴν τοῦ συννόμου πορευθεὶς οἴκησιν ἄστρου, βίον εὐδαίμονα καὶ συνήθη ἕξοι, σφαλεὶς δὲ τούτων εἰς γυναικὸς φύσιν ἐν τῇ  δευτέρᾳ γενέσει μεταβαλοῖ· μὴ παυόμενός τε ἐν τούτοις ἔτι κακίας, τρόπον ὃν κακύνοιτο, κατὰ τὴν ὁμοιότητα τῆς τοῦ τρόπου γενέσεως εἴς τινα τοιαύτην ἀεὶ μεταβαλοῖ θήρειον φύσιν, ἀλλάττων τε οὐ πρότερον πόνων λήξοι, πρὶν τῇ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιόδῳ τῇ ἐν αὑτῷ συνεπισπώμενος τὸν πολὺν ὄχλον καὶ ὕστερον προσφύντα ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος  καὶ γῆς, θορυβώδη καὶ ἄλογον ὄντα, λόγῳ κρατήσας εἰς τὸ τῆς πρώτης καὶ ἀρίστης ἀφίκοιτο εἶδος ἕξεως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","text":"διαθεσμοθετήσας δὲ πάντα αὐτοῖς ταῦτα, ἵνα τῆς ἔπειτα εἴη κακίας ἑκάστων ἀναίτιος, ἔσπειρεν τοὺς μὲν εἰς γῆν, τοὺς δʼ εἰς σελήνην, τοὺς δʼ εἰς τἆλλα ὅσα ὄργανα χρόνου· τὸ δὲ μετὰ τὸν σπόρον τοῖς νέοις παρέδωκεν θεοῖς σώματα πλάττειν θνητά, τό τʼ ἐπίλοιπον, ὅσον ἔτι ἦν ψυχῆς ἀνθρωπίνης δέον  προσγενέσθαι, τοῦτο καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα ἀκόλουθα ἐκείνοις ἀπεργασαμένους ἄρχειν, καὶ κατὰ δύναμιν ὅτι κάλλιστα καὶ ἄριστα τὸ θνητὸν διακυβερνᾶν ζῷον, ὅτι μὴ κακῶν αὐτὸ ἑαυτῷ γίγνοιτο αἴτιον. καὶ ὁ μὲν δὴ ἅπαντα ταῦτα διατάξας ἔμενεν ἐν τῷ ἑαυτοῦ κατὰ τρόπον ἤθει·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"f01e864893c82d6245e6c980245656806c907d9fc7176af8b9a910cc70f64af5","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224736758767Z_d70aee54","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 42","source_sha256":"f01e864893c82d6245e6c980245656806c907d9fc7176af8b9a910cc70f64af5","sha256":"727466cb5f771d87d04a9b5e420f784ce11d8a86138d139029733b38bae854bb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:36.758955+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","text":"TI. Whenever they should necessarily be implanted in bodies, and something should come to and something depart from their bodies, first it would be necessary that there should arise in all of them one connate sensation from violent affections; second, desire mingled with pleasure and pain; and besides these, fear and spirit, and all things that follow upon these, as well as all that are by nature set apart in opposition to them. If they should master these, they would live justly; but if mastered by them, unjustly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","text":"And he who had lived well for the fitting time, returning again to the habitation of the star allotted to him by law, would have a blessed and familiar life; but if he failed in these things, he would change into a woman's nature in the second generation. And if even then he did not cease from wickedness, according to the manner in which he became wicked he would continually change into some such bestial nature, and would not cease from his labours of change before, by following along with the revolution of the same and the similar within himself, and mastering by reason the great throng, tumultuous and irrational, subsequently attached to it from fire and water and air and earth, he should arrive at the form of the first and best condition.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","text":"And, having legislated for them all these things, so that he might be blameless for the subsequent wickedness of each, he sowed some into the earth, others into the moon, and others into all the remaining instruments of time. After the sowing, he handed over to the younger gods the task of fashioning mortal bodies, and, having wrought what remained—whatever still had to be added to the human soul—and all things consequent upon these, of ruling, and of steering the mortal living creature, to the extent of their power, as beautifully and excellently as possible, unless it should itself become the cause of evils to itself. And he, having arranged all these things, remained in his own customary character.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"bb09715950b89b91d86f114898f2c5e31cf7c7c9ef8ad92480841a430538a768","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 42"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 42","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24","title":"Section 43","order":27,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_24","text":"ΤΙ. μένοντος δὲ νοήσαντες οἱ παῖδες τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς τάξιν ἐπείθοντο αὐτῇ, καὶ λαβόντες ἀθάνατον ἀρχὴν θνητοῦ ζῴου, μιμούμενοι τὸν σφέτερον δημιουργόν, πυρὸς καὶ γῆς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος ἀπὸ τοῦ κόσμου δανειζόμενοι  μόρια ὡς ἀποδοθησόμενα πάλιν, εἰς ταὐτὸν τὰ λαμβανόμενα συνεκόλλων, οὐ τοῖς ἀλύτοις οἷς αὐτοὶ συνείχοντο δεσμοῖς, ἀλλὰ διὰ σμικρότητα ἀοράτοις πυκνοῖς γόμφοις συντήκοντες, ἓν ἐξ ἁπάντων ἀπεργαζόμενοι σῶμα ἕκαστον, τὰς τῆς ἀθανάτου ψυχῆς περιόδους ἐνέδουν εἰς ἐπίρρυτον σῶμα καὶ ἀπόρρυτον. αἱ δʼ εἰς ποταμὸν ἐνδεθεῖσαι πολὺν οὔτʼ ἐκράτουν οὔτʼ ἐκρατοῦντο, βίᾳ δὲ ἐφέροντο καὶ ἔφερον, ὥστε τὸ  μὲν ὅλον κινεῖσθαι ζῷον, ἀτάκτως μὴν ὅπῃ τύχοι προϊέναι καὶ ἀλόγως, τὰς ἓξ ἁπάσας κινήσεις ἔχον· εἴς τε γὰρ τὸ πρόσθε καὶ ὄπισθεν καὶ πάλιν εἰς δεξιὰ καὶ ἀριστερὰ κάτω τε καὶ ἄνω καὶ πάντῃ κατὰ τοὺς ἓξ τόπους πλανώμενα προῄειν. πολλοῦ γὰρ ὄντος τοῦ κατακλύζοντος καὶ ἀπορρέοντος κύματος ὃ τὴν τροφὴν παρεῖχεν, ἔτι μείζω θόρυβον ἀπηργάζετο τὰ τῶν προσπιπτόντων παθήματα ἑκάστοις, ὅτε  πυρὶ προσκρούσειε τὸ σῶμά τινος ἔξωθεν ἀλλοτρίῳ περιτυχὸν ἢ καὶ στερεῷ γῆς πάγῳ ὑγροῖς τε ὀλισθήμασιν ὑδάτων, εἴτε ζάλῃ πνευμάτων ὑπὸ ἀέρος φερομένων καταληφθείη, καὶ ὑπὸ πάντων τούτων διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἱ κινήσεις ἐπὶ τὴν ψυχὴν φερόμεναι προσπίπτοιεν· αἳ δὴ καὶ ἔπειτα διὰ ταῦτα ἐκλήθησάν τε καὶ νῦν ἔτι αἰσθήσεις συνάπασαι κέκληνται. καὶ δὴ καὶ τότε ἐν τῷ παρόντι πλείστην καὶ μεγίστην παρεχόμεναι κίνησιν, μετὰ τοῦ ῥέοντος ἐνδελεχῶς  ὀχετοῦ κινοῦσαι καὶ σφοδρῶς σείουσαι τὰς τῆς ψυχῆς περιόδους, τὴν μὲν ταὐτοῦ παντάπασιν ἐπέδησαν ἐναντία αὐτῇ ῥέουσαι καὶ ἐπέσχον ἄρχουσαν καὶ ἰοῦσαν, τὴν δʼ αὖ θατέρου διέσεισαν, ὥστε τὰς τοῦ διπλασίου καὶ τριπλασίου τρεῖς ἑκατέρας ἀποστάσεις καὶ τὰς τῶν ἡμιολίων καὶ ἐπιτρίτων καὶ ἐπογδόων μεσότητας καὶ συνδέσεις, ἐπειδὴ παντελῶς λυταὶ οὐκ ἦσαν πλὴν ὑπὸ τοῦ συνδήσαντος, πάσας μὲν  στρέψαι στροφάς, πάσας δὲ κλάσεις καὶ διαφθορὰς τῶν κύκλων ἐμποιεῖν, ὁσαχῇπερ ἦν δυνατόν, ὥστε μετʼ ἀλλήλων μόγις συνεχομένας φέρεσθαι μέν, ἀλόγως δὲ φέρεσθαι, τοτὲ μὲν ἀντίας, ἄλλοτε δὲ πλαγίας, τοτὲ δὲ ὑπτίας· οἷον ὅταν τις ὕπτιος ἐρείσας τὴν κεφαλὴν μὲν ἐπὶ γῆς, τοὺς δὲ πόδας ἄνω προσβαλὼν ἔχῃ πρός τινι, τότε ἐν τούτῳ τῷ πάθει τοῦ τε πάσχοντος καὶ τῶν ὁρώντων τά τε δεξιὰ ἀριστερὰ καὶ τὰ ἀριστερὰ δεξιὰ ἑκατέροις τὰ ἑκατέρων φαντάζεται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. μένοντος δὲ νοήσαντες οἱ παῖδες τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς τάξιν ἐπείθοντο αὐτῇ, καὶ λαβόντες ἀθάνατον ἀρχὴν θνητοῦ ζῴου, μιμούμενοι τὸν σφέτερον δημιουργόν, πυρὸς καὶ γῆς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος ἀπὸ τοῦ κόσμου δανειζόμενοι  μόρια ὡς ἀποδοθησόμενα πάλιν, εἰς ταὐτὸν τὰ λαμβανόμενα συνεκόλλων, οὐ τοῖς ἀλύτοις οἷς αὐτοὶ συνείχοντο δεσμοῖς, ἀλλὰ διὰ σμικρότητα ἀοράτοις πυκνοῖς γόμφοις συντήκοντες, ἓν ἐξ ἁπάντων ἀπεργαζόμενοι σῶμα ἕκαστον, τὰς τῆς ἀθανάτου ψυχῆς περιόδους ἐνέδουν εἰς ἐπίρρυτον σῶμα καὶ ἀπόρρυτον. αἱ δʼ εἰς ποταμὸν ἐνδεθεῖσαι πολὺν οὔτʼ ἐκράτουν οὔτʼ ἐκρατοῦντο, βίᾳ δὲ ἐφέροντο καὶ ἔφερον, ὥστε τὸ  μὲν ὅλον κινεῖσθαι ζῷον, ἀτάκτως μὴν ὅπῃ τύχοι προϊέναι καὶ ἀλόγως, τὰς ἓξ ἁπάσας κινήσεις ἔχον· εἴς τε γὰρ τὸ πρόσθε καὶ ὄπισθεν καὶ πάλιν εἰς δεξιὰ καὶ ἀριστερὰ κάτω τε καὶ ἄνω καὶ πάντῃ κατὰ τοὺς ἓξ τόπους πλανώμενα προῄειν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","text":"πολλοῦ γὰρ ὄντος τοῦ κατακλύζοντος καὶ ἀπορρέοντος κύματος ὃ τὴν τροφὴν παρεῖχεν, ἔτι μείζω θόρυβον ἀπηργάζετο τὰ τῶν προσπιπτόντων παθήματα ἑκάστοις, ὅτε  πυρὶ προσκρούσειε τὸ σῶμά τινος ἔξωθεν ἀλλοτρίῳ περιτυχὸν ἢ καὶ στερεῷ γῆς πάγῳ ὑγροῖς τε ὀλισθήμασιν ὑδάτων, εἴτε ζάλῃ πνευμάτων ὑπὸ ἀέρος φερομένων καταληφθείη, καὶ ὑπὸ πάντων τούτων διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἱ κινήσεις ἐπὶ τὴν ψυχὴν φερόμεναι προσπίπτοιεν· αἳ δὴ καὶ ἔπειτα διὰ ταῦτα ἐκλήθησάν τε καὶ νῦν ἔτι αἰσθήσεις συνάπασαι κέκληνται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","text":"καὶ δὴ καὶ τότε ἐν τῷ παρόντι πλείστην καὶ μεγίστην παρεχόμεναι κίνησιν, μετὰ τοῦ ῥέοντος ἐνδελεχῶς  ὀχετοῦ κινοῦσαι καὶ σφοδρῶς σείουσαι τὰς τῆς ψυχῆς περιόδους, τὴν μὲν ταὐτοῦ παντάπασιν ἐπέδησαν ἐναντία αὐτῇ ῥέουσαι καὶ ἐπέσχον ἄρχουσαν καὶ ἰοῦσαν, τὴν δʼ αὖ θατέρου διέσεισαν, ὥστε τὰς τοῦ διπλασίου καὶ τριπλασίου τρεῖς ἑκατέρας ἀποστάσεις καὶ τὰς τῶν ἡμιολίων καὶ ἐπιτρίτων καὶ ἐπογδόων μεσότητας καὶ συνδέσεις, ἐπειδὴ παντελῶς λυταὶ οὐκ ἦσαν πλὴν ὑπὸ τοῦ συνδήσαντος, πάσας μὲν  στρέψαι στροφάς, πάσας δὲ κλάσεις καὶ διαφθορὰς τῶν κύκλων ἐμποιεῖν, ὁσαχῇπερ ἦν δυνατόν, ὥστε μετʼ ἀλλήλων μόγις συνεχομένας φέρεσθαι μέν, ἀλόγως δὲ φέρεσθαι, τοτὲ μὲν ἀντίας, ἄλλοτε δὲ πλαγίας, τοτὲ δὲ ὑπτίας· οἷον ὅταν τις ὕπτιος ἐρείσας τὴν κεφαλὴν μὲν ἐπὶ γῆς, τοὺς δὲ πόδας ἄνω προσβαλὼν ἔχῃ πρός τινι, τότε ἐν τούτῳ τῷ πάθει τοῦ τε πάσχοντος καὶ τῶν ὁρώντων τά τε δεξιὰ ἀριστερὰ καὶ τὰ ἀριστερὰ δεξιὰ","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","text":"ἑκατέροις τὰ ἑκατέρων φαντάζεται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"be518bd3ab5f309adf88f47243e81ca94fd6ad2734ec1d76802802fb72307834","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224745823729Z_46fed1e4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 43","source_sha256":"be518bd3ab5f309adf88f47243e81ca94fd6ad2734ec1d76802802fb72307834","sha256":"502cae2dc940049d0d491818215d2bfd7329ddc4c706071614fdd508d6d8dac8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:45.823852+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","text":"And, while he remained, the children, having understood their father's ordinance, obeyed it; and, taking the immortal principle of a mortal living creature, in imitation of their own craftsman, they borrowed from the cosmos portions of fire and earth, and of water and air, as things to be restored again; and they cemented together into one the portions received—not with the indissoluble bonds by which they themselves were held together, but fusing them by dense, invisible rivets because of their smallness—and, fashioning each body one from all these things, they bound the revolutions of the immortal soul into a body subject to influx and efflux. And, being bound into a great river, they neither mastered nor were mastered, but were borne forcibly and bore in turn, so that the whole living creature was moved, but proceeded disorderly, wherever chance took it, and irrationally, possessing all six motions: for it went wandering forward and backward, and again right and left, down and up, and in every direction through the six regions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","text":"For since the wave that flooded in and flowed away, which provided nourishment, was great, the affections produced by the things striking against each individual caused an even greater tumult, whenever someone's body encountered from without an alien fire, or a solid mass of earth, or the slippery fluids of waters, or was overtaken by a storm of winds borne through the air; and the motions from all these things, being conveyed through the body to the soul, struck upon it. It was indeed for these reasons that they were then called, and are still now collectively called, sensations.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","text":"And indeed, even then, in the present case, producing the most numerous and greatest motion, moving with the ever-flowing channel and violently shaking the revolutions of the soul, they wholly impeded the revolution of the Same, flowing contrary to it, and checked it in its ruling and going; while they shook the revolution of the Other, so that the three intervals in each case of the double and the triple, and the means and bonds of the sesquialters, epitrites, and epogdoons—since they were not altogether dissoluble except by him who had bound them—made every sort of turning and produced every possible fracture and corruption of the circles, so far as was possible, with the result that, scarcely holding together with one another, they were borne along, but borne irrationally: now contrariwise, at another time obliquely, and now upside down. Just as when someone, lying on his back, has his head resting on the ground and his feet raised and set against something, then in this condition both for the person so affected and for those looking on, the right things appear left and the left things right","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","text":"to each respectively, the things of the one appearing as those of the other.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"239260def37ef8c9655fe3806fe705361d2b09493ee792df00c5e4a990579d27","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 43"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 43","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25","title":"Section 44","order":28,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_25","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν δὴ τοῦτο καὶ τοιαῦτα ἕτερα αἱ περιφοραὶ πάσχουσαι σφοδρῶς, ὅταν τέ τῳ τῶν ἔξωθεν τοῦ ταὐτοῦ γένους ἢ τοῦ θατέρου περιτύχωσιν, τότε ταὐτόν τῳ καὶ θάτερόν του τἀναντία τῶν ἀληθῶν προσαγορεύουσαι ψευδεῖς καὶ ἀνόητοι γεγόνασιν, οὐδεμία τε ἐν αὐταῖς τότε περίοδος ἄρχουσα οὐδʼ ἡγεμών ἐστιν· αἷς δʼ ἂν ἔξωθεν αἰσθήσεις τινὲς φερόμεναι καὶ προσπεσοῦσαι συνεπισπάσωνται καὶ τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς ἅπαν κύτος, τόθʼ αὗται κρατούμεναι κρατεῖν δοκοῦσι. καὶ διὰ δὴ ταῦτα πάντα τὰ παθήματα νῦν κατʼ ἀρχάς τε ἄνους ψυχὴ γίγνεται  τὸ πρῶτον, ὅταν εἰς σῶμα ἐνδεθῇ θνητόν. ὅταν δὲ τὸ τῆς αὔξης καὶ τροφῆς ἔλαττον ἐπίῃ ῥεῦμα, πάλιν δὲ αἱ περίοδοι λαμβανόμεναι γαλήνης τὴν ἑαυτῶν ὁδὸν ἴωσι καὶ καθιστῶνται μᾶλλον ἐπιόντος τοῦ χρόνου, τότε ἤδη πρὸς τὸ κατὰ φύσιν ἰόντων σχῆμα ἑκάστων τῶν κύκλων αἱ περιφοραὶ κατευθυνόμεναι, τό τε θάτερον καὶ τὸ ταὐτὸν προσαγορεύουσαι κατʼ ὀρθόν, ἔμφρονα τὸν ἔχοντα αὐτὰς γιγνόμενον ἀποτελοῦσιν. ἂν μὲν οὖν δὴ καὶ συνεπιλαμβάνηταί τις ὀρθὴ τροφὴ παιδεύσεως,  ὁλόκληρος ὑγιής τε παντελῶς, τὴν μεγίστην ἀποφυγὼν νόσον, γίγνεται· καταμελήσας δέ, χωλὴν τοῦ βίου διαπορευθεὶς ζωήν, ἀτελὴς καὶ ἀνόητος εἰς Ἅιδου πάλιν ἔρχεται. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν ὕστερά ποτε γίγνεται· περὶ δὲ τῶν νῦν προτεθέντων δεῖ διελθεῖν ἀκριβέστερον, τὰ δὲ πρὸ τούτων, περὶ σωμάτων κατὰ μέρη τῆς γενέσεως καὶ περὶ ψυχῆς, διʼ ἅς τε αἰτίας καὶ προνοίας γέγονε θεῶν, τοῦ μάλιστα  εἰκότος ἀντεχομένοις, οὕτω καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα πορευομένοις διεξιτέον. τὰς μὲν δὴ θείας περιόδους δύο οὔσας, τὸ τοῦ παντὸς σχῆμα ἀπομιμησάμενοι περιφερὲς ὄν, εἰς σφαιροειδὲς σῶμα ἐνέδησαν, τοῦτο ὃ νῦν κεφαλὴν ἐπονομάζομεν, ὃ θειότατόν τέ ἐστιν καὶ τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν πάντων δεσποτοῦν· ᾧ καὶ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα παρέδοσαν ὑπηρεσίαν αὐτῷ συναθροίσαντες θεοί, κατανοήσαντες ὅτι πασῶν ὅσαι κινήσεις ἔσοιντο μετέχοι. ἵνʼ οὖν μὴ κυλινδούμενον ἐπὶ γῆς ὕψη τε καὶ βάθη παντοδαπὰ  ἐχούσης ἀποροῖ τὰ μὲν ὑπερβαίνειν, ἔνθεν δὲ ἐκβαίνειν, ὄχημα αὐτῷ τοῦτο καὶ εὐπορίαν ἔδοσαν·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν δὴ τοῦτο καὶ τοιαῦτα ἕτερα αἱ περιφοραὶ πάσχουσαι σφοδρῶς, ὅταν τέ τῳ τῶν ἔξωθεν τοῦ ταὐτοῦ γένους ἢ τοῦ θατέρου περιτύχωσιν, τότε ταὐτόν τῳ καὶ θάτερόν του τἀναντία τῶν ἀληθῶν προσαγορεύουσαι ψευδεῖς καὶ ἀνόητοι γεγόνασιν, οὐδεμία τε ἐν αὐταῖς τότε περίοδος ἄρχουσα οὐδʼ ἡγεμών ἐστιν· αἷς δʼ ἂν ἔξωθεν αἰσθήσεις τινὲς φερόμεναι καὶ προσπεσοῦσαι συνεπισπάσωνται καὶ τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς ἅπαν κύτος, τόθʼ αὗται κρατούμεναι κρατεῖν δοκοῦσι. καὶ διὰ δὴ ταῦτα πάντα τὰ παθήματα νῦν κατʼ ἀρχάς τε ἄνους ψυχὴ γίγνεται  τὸ πρῶτον, ὅταν εἰς σῶμα ἐνδεθῇ θνητόν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","text":"ὅταν δὲ τὸ τῆς αὔξης καὶ τροφῆς ἔλαττον ἐπίῃ ῥεῦμα, πάλιν δὲ αἱ περίοδοι λαμβανόμεναι γαλήνης τὴν ἑαυτῶν ὁδὸν ἴωσι καὶ καθιστῶνται μᾶλλον ἐπιόντος τοῦ χρόνου, τότε ἤδη πρὸς τὸ κατὰ φύσιν ἰόντων σχῆμα ἑκάστων τῶν κύκλων αἱ περιφοραὶ κατευθυνόμεναι, τό τε θάτερον καὶ τὸ ταὐτὸν προσαγορεύουσαι κατʼ ὀρθόν, ἔμφρονα τὸν ἔχοντα αὐτὰς γιγνόμενον ἀποτελοῦσιν. ἂν μὲν οὖν δὴ καὶ συνεπιλαμβάνηταί τις ὀρθὴ τροφὴ παιδεύσεως,  ὁλόκληρος ὑγιής τε παντελῶς, τὴν μεγίστην ἀποφυγὼν νόσον, γίγνεται· καταμελήσας δέ, χωλὴν τοῦ βίου διαπορευθεὶς ζωήν, ἀτελὴς καὶ ἀνόητος εἰς Ἅιδου πάλιν ἔρχεται. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν ὕστερά ποτε γίγνεται· περὶ δὲ τῶν νῦν προτεθέντων δεῖ διελθεῖν ἀκριβέστερον, τὰ δὲ πρὸ τούτων, περὶ σωμάτων κατὰ μέρη τῆς γενέσεως καὶ περὶ ψυχῆς, διʼ ἅς τε αἰτίας καὶ προνοίας γέγονε θεῶν, τοῦ μάλιστα  εἰκότος ἀντεχομένοις, οὕτω καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα πορευομένοις διεξιτέον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","text":"τὰς μὲν δὴ θείας περιόδους δύο οὔσας, τὸ τοῦ παντὸς σχῆμα ἀπομιμησάμενοι περιφερὲς ὄν, εἰς σφαιροειδὲς σῶμα ἐνέδησαν, τοῦτο ὃ νῦν κεφαλὴν ἐπονομάζομεν, ὃ θειότατόν τέ ἐστιν καὶ τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν πάντων δεσποτοῦν· ᾧ καὶ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα παρέδοσαν ὑπηρεσίαν αὐτῷ συναθροίσαντες θεοί, κατανοήσαντες ὅτι πασῶν ὅσαι κινήσεις ἔσοιντο μετέχοι. ἵνʼ οὖν μὴ κυλινδούμενον ἐπὶ γῆς ὕψη τε καὶ βάθη παντοδαπὰ  ἐχούσης ἀποροῖ τὰ μὲν ὑπερβαίνειν, ἔνθεν δὲ ἐκβαίνειν, ὄχημα αὐτῷ τοῦτο καὶ εὐπορίαν ἔδοσαν·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"05d84966a0b3893598f690b737bc1f9a11e6b0c8fa82c6d0be991306b91e779a","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224757570059Z_9c1d52a0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 44","source_sha256":"05d84966a0b3893598f690b737bc1f9a11e6b0c8fa82c6d0be991306b91e779a","sha256":"58cd9b1efaf95cd399d9a268eaa0120660a20f5d0e9e9f145c9e2f76c8d7ec9b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:47:57.570090+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","text":"TIM. This same thing, then, and other such things, the revolutions suffer violently whenever they encounter something external belonging either to the kind of the Same or to that of the Different; then, calling the same and the different of something contrary to the truths, they become false and unintelligent, and at that time there is no revolution in them that rules or leads. But whenever certain sensations borne in from outside fall upon them and draw along with them the whole vessel of the soul, then these, though mastered, seem to be masters. And because of all these affections, the soul at first, when it is bound into a mortal body, comes to be without intelligence.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","text":"But when the lesser stream of growth and nourishment comes upon it, and the revolutions, again obtaining calm, proceed along their own path and become more settled as time advances, then, as the revolutions of each of the circles are directed toward the shape that goes according to nature, and correctly designate both the Different and the Same, they bring it about that he who possesses them becomes intelligent. If, then, in addition, one receives the right nurture of education, he becomes whole and altogether sound, having escaped the greatest disease; but if he neglects this, having passed through life with a lame existence, he returns again to Hades incomplete and unintelligent. These things, then, come about later; but the matters now set forth must be gone through more exactly, and those preceding them—concerning bodies according to the parts of their generation, and concerning soul, through what causes and providential design of the gods they came to be—must be expounded, holding fast to what is most likely and proceeding accordingly.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","text":"The two divine revolutions, then, imitating the shape of the all, which is spherical, they bound within a spherical body—this which we now call the head, which is both most divine and rules over all that is within us. To it the gods also handed over the whole body, having gathered it together as its servant, considering that it would partake in all such movements as there might be. So that, rolling upon the earth, which has heights and depths of every kind, it might not be at a loss either to pass over some things or to emerge from others, they gave it this as a vehicle and means of ready passage:","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"5bde421e209d2436ffbc861605af44de882baf9d7ac8a378277ad6328a959830","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 44"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 44","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26","title":"Section 45","order":29,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_26","text":"ΤΙ. ὅθεν δὴ μῆκος τὸ σῶμα ἔσχεν, ἐκτατά τε κῶλα καὶ καμπτὰ ἔφυσεν τέτταρα θεοῦ μηχανησαμένου πορείαν, οἷς ἀντιλαμβανόμενον καὶ ἀπερειδόμενον διὰ πάντων τόπων πορεύεσθαι δυνατὸν γέγονε,  τὴν τοῦ θειοτάτου καὶ ἱερωτάτου φέρον οἴκησιν ἐπάνωθεν ἡμῶν. σκέλη μὲν οὖν χεῖρές τε ταύτῃ καὶ διὰ ταῦτα προσέφυ πᾶσιν· τοῦ δʼ ὄπισθεν τὸ πρόσθεν τιμιώτερον καὶ ἀρχικώτερον νομίζοντες θεοὶ ταύτῃ τὸ πολὺ τῆς πορείας ἡμῖν ἔδοσαν. ἔδει δὴ διωρισμένον ἔχειν καὶ ἀνόμοιον τοῦ σώματος τὸ πρόσθεν ἄνθρωπον. διὸ πρῶτον μὲν περὶ τὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς κύτος, ὑποθέντες αὐτόσε τὸ πρόσωπον, ὄργανα ἐνέδησαν  τούτῳ πάσῃ τῇ τῆς ψυχῆς προνοίᾳ, καὶ διέταξαν τὸ μετέχον ἡγεμονίας τοῦτʼ εἶναι, τὸ κατὰ φύσιν πρόσθεν· τῶν δὲ ὀργάνων πρῶτον μὲν φωσφόρα συνετεκτήναντο ὄμματα, τοιᾷδε ἐνδήσαντες αἰτίᾳ. τοῦ πυρὸς ὅσον τὸ μὲν κάειν οὐκ ἔσχε, τὸ δὲ παρέχειν φῶς ἥμερον, οἰκεῖον ἑκάστης ἡμέρας, σῶμα ἐμηχανήσαντο γίγνεσθαι. τὸ γὰρ ἐντὸς ἡμῶν ἀδελφὸν ὂν τούτου πῦρ εἰλικρινὲς ἐποίησαν διὰ τῶν ὀμμάτων ῥεῖν λεῖον καὶ πυκνὸν ὅλον μέν, μάλιστα δὲ τὸ μέσον συμπιλήσαντες  τῶν ὀμμάτων, ὥστε τὸ μὲν ἄλλο ὅσον παχύτερον στέγειν πᾶν, τὸ τοιοῦτον δὲ μόνον αὐτὸ καθαρὸν διηθεῖν. ὅταν οὖν μεθημερινὸν ᾖ φῶς περὶ τὸ τῆς ὄψεως ῥεῦμα, τότε ἐκπῖπτον ὅμοιον πρὸς ὅμοιον, συμπαγὲς γενόμενον, ἓν σῶμα οἰκειωθὲν συνέστη κατὰ τὴν τῶν ὀμμάτων εὐθυωρίαν, ὅπῃπερ ἂν ἀντερείδῃ τὸ προσπῖπτον ἔνδοθεν πρὸς ὃ τῶν ἔξω συνέπεσεν. ὁμοιοπαθὲς δὴ διʼ ὁμοιότητα πᾶν γενόμενον, ὅτου τε ἂν αὐτό  ποτε ἐφάπτηται καὶ ὃ ἂν ἄλλο ἐκείνου, τούτων τὰς κινήσεις διαδιδὸν εἰς ἅπαν τὸ σῶμα μέχρι τῆς ψυχῆς αἴσθησιν παρέσχετο ταύτην ᾗ δὴ ὁρᾶν φαμεν. ἀπελθόντος δὲ εἰς νύκτα τοῦ συγγενοῦς πυρὸς ἀποτέτμηται· πρὸς γὰρ ἀνόμοιον ἐξιὸν ἀλλοιοῦταί τε αὐτὸ καὶ κατασβέννυται, συμφυὲς οὐκέτι τῷ πλησίον ἀέρι γιγνόμενον, ἅτε πῦρ οὐκ ἔχοντι. παύεταί τε οὖν ὁρῶν, ἔτι τε ἐπαγωγὸν ὕπνου γίγνεται· σωτηρίαν γὰρ ἣν οἱ θεοὶ τῆς ὄψεως ἐμηχανήσαντο, τὴν τῶν βλεφάρων  φύσιν, ὅταν ταῦτα συμμύσῃ, καθείργνυσι τὴν τοῦ πυρὸς ἐντὸς δύναμιν, ἡ δὲ διαχεῖ τε καὶ ὁμαλύνει τὰς ἐντὸς κινήσεις, ὁμαλυνθεισῶν δὲ ἡσυχία γίγνεται, γενομένης δὲ πολλῆς μὲν ἡσυχίας βραχυόνειρος ὕπνος ἐμπίπτει,","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὅθεν δὴ μῆκος τὸ σῶμα ἔσχεν, ἐκτατά τε κῶλα καὶ καμπτὰ ἔφυσεν τέτταρα θεοῦ μηχανησαμένου πορείαν, οἷς ἀντιλαμβανόμενον καὶ ἀπερειδόμενον διὰ πάντων τόπων πορεύεσθαι δυνατὸν γέγονε,  τὴν τοῦ θειοτάτου καὶ ἱερωτάτου φέρον οἴκησιν ἐπάνωθεν ἡμῶν. σκέλη μὲν οὖν χεῖρές τε ταύτῃ καὶ διὰ ταῦτα προσέφυ πᾶσιν· τοῦ δʼ ὄπισθεν τὸ πρόσθεν τιμιώτερον καὶ ἀρχικώτερον νομίζοντες θεοὶ ταύτῃ τὸ πολὺ τῆς πορείας ἡμῖν ἔδοσαν. ἔδει δὴ διωρισμένον ἔχειν καὶ ἀνόμοιον τοῦ σώματος τὸ πρόσθεν ἄνθρωπον. διὸ πρῶτον μὲν περὶ τὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς κύτος, ὑποθέντες αὐτόσε τὸ πρόσωπον, ὄργανα ἐνέδησαν  τούτῳ πάσῃ τῇ τῆς ψυχῆς προνοίᾳ, καὶ διέταξαν τὸ μετέχον ἡγεμονίας τοῦτʼ εἶναι, τὸ κατὰ φύσιν πρόσθεν· τῶν δὲ ὀργάνων πρῶτον μὲν φωσφόρα συνετεκτήναντο ὄμματα, τοιᾷδε ἐνδήσαντες αἰτίᾳ. τοῦ πυρὸς ὅσον τὸ μὲν κάειν οὐκ ἔσχε, τὸ δὲ παρέχειν φῶς ἥμερον, οἰκεῖον ἑκάστης ἡμέρας, σῶμα ἐμηχανήσαντο γίγνεσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","text":"τὸ γὰρ ἐντὸς ἡμῶν ἀδελφὸν ὂν τούτου πῦρ εἰλικρινὲς ἐποίησαν διὰ τῶν ὀμμάτων ῥεῖν λεῖον καὶ πυκνὸν ὅλον μέν, μάλιστα δὲ τὸ μέσον συμπιλήσαντες  τῶν ὀμμάτων, ὥστε τὸ μὲν ἄλλο ὅσον παχύτερον στέγειν πᾶν, τὸ τοιοῦτον δὲ μόνον αὐτὸ καθαρὸν διηθεῖν. ὅταν οὖν μεθημερινὸν ᾖ φῶς περὶ τὸ τῆς ὄψεως ῥεῦμα, τότε ἐκπῖπτον ὅμοιον πρὸς ὅμοιον, συμπαγὲς γενόμενον, ἓν σῶμα οἰκειωθὲν συνέστη κατὰ τὴν τῶν ὀμμάτων εὐθυωρίαν, ὅπῃπερ ἂν ἀντερείδῃ τὸ προσπῖπτον ἔνδοθεν πρὸς ὃ τῶν ἔξω συνέπεσεν. ὁμοιοπαθὲς δὴ διʼ ὁμοιότητα πᾶν γενόμενον, ὅτου τε ἂν αὐτό  ποτε ἐφάπτηται καὶ ὃ ἂν ἄλλο ἐκείνου, τούτων τὰς κινήσεις διαδιδὸν εἰς ἅπαν τὸ σῶμα μέχρι τῆς ψυχῆς αἴσθησιν παρέσχετο ταύτην ᾗ δὴ ὁρᾶν φαμεν. ἀπελθόντος δὲ εἰς νύκτα τοῦ συγγενοῦς πυρὸς ἀποτέτμηται· πρὸς γὰρ ἀνόμοιον ἐξιὸν ἀλλοιοῦταί τε αὐτὸ καὶ κατασβέννυται, συμφυὲς οὐκέτι τῷ πλησίον ἀέρι γιγνόμενον, ἅτε πῦρ οὐκ ἔχοντι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","text":"παύεταί τε οὖν ὁρῶν, ἔτι τε ἐπαγωγὸν ὕπνου γίγνεται· σωτηρίαν γὰρ ἣν οἱ θεοὶ τῆς ὄψεως ἐμηχανήσαντο, τὴν τῶν βλεφάρων  φύσιν, ὅταν ταῦτα συμμύσῃ, καθείργνυσι τὴν τοῦ πυρὸς ἐντὸς δύναμιν, ἡ δὲ διαχεῖ τε καὶ ὁμαλύνει τὰς ἐντὸς κινήσεις, ὁμαλυνθεισῶν δὲ ἡσυχία γίγνεται, γενομένης δὲ πολλῆς μὲν ἡσυχίας βραχυόνειρος ὕπνος ἐμπίπτει,","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"dac36887a8d903c3594b53345b95b0584f806e4d0cbfb7cc30ab0dc5017d4be1","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224806858942Z_58d51077","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 45","source_sha256":"dac36887a8d903c3594b53345b95b0584f806e4d0cbfb7cc30ab0dc5017d4be1","sha256":"cd8d6367690c5ddb44fa01db32858a7730f4c3a680f5e6fdad09241ba9625fb4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:06.859049+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","text":"And so, from this cause, the body acquired length, and, for the sake of locomotion, god contrived that it should grow four limbs both extensible and flexible, by means of which, grasping and being supported, it has become able to travel through every place, bearing above us the dwelling-place of that which is most divine and most sacred. Thus, then, legs and hands were attached to all for this reason and through these causes; and since the gods deemed the front more honorable and more fitted for rule than the back, in this direction they gave us the greater part of our movement. Therefore a human being had to have the front of the body distinct and unlike [the rest]. Accordingly, first, having set the face in the vessel of the head, they fitted into it organs for all the forethought of the soul, and ordained that this, the naturally frontward part, should partake in ruling. And of the organs they first jointly fashioned light-bearing eyes, attaching them for the following cause. As much of fire as does not possess burning, but does possess the power to provide gentle light, appropriate to each day, they contrived to come into being as a body.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","text":"For they caused the pure fire within us, being akin to this, to flow through the eyes, smooth and dense throughout, but especially compressing the middle of the eyes, so that all the rest, insofar as it is thicker, might keep everything in, while this alone, being such, might filter through pure. Whenever, then, there is daylight around the stream of vision, then, like falling upon like, it becomes compact and, having been made akin, is constituted as one body along the straight course of the eyes, wherever the inwardly falling [stream] may press against that with which one of the external things has coincided. And having become similarly affected through similarity, whatever it may itself at any time touch, and whatever else may touch that, it communicates their motions through the whole body as far as the soul, and thus provides that perception by which we say that we see. But when the kindred fire has departed into night, it is cut off; for, going out toward what is unlike, it is both altered and extinguished, no longer becoming connatural with the neighboring air, since the latter has no fire.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","text":"Thus it ceases to see, and moreover becomes an inducement to sleep. For the safeguard of vision which the gods devised—the nature of the eyelids—when these close together, shuts in the power of the fire within; and this disperses and smooths the internal motions, and when they have been smoothed, stillness arises; and when there is much stillness, a sleep with few dreams falls upon [one],","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"c3b04a834d59b9054bc0d33e466d76f6247c3207832d7cac75b04497a49e197a","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 45"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 45","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27","title":"Section 46","order":30,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_27","text":"ΤΙ. καταλειφθεισῶν δέ τινων κινήσεων μειζόνων, οἷαι καὶ ἐν οἵοις ἂν τόποις λείπωνται,  τοιαῦτα καὶ τοσαῦτα παρέσχοντο ἀφομοιωθέντα ἐντὸς ἔξω τε ἐγερθεῖσιν ἀπομνημονευόμενα φαντάσματα. τὸ δὲ περὶ τὴν τῶν κατόπτρων εἰδωλοποιίαν καὶ πάντα ὅσα ἐμφανῆ καὶ λεῖα, κατιδεῖν οὐδὲν ἔτι χαλεπόν. ἐκ γὰρ τῆς ἐντὸς ἐκτός τε τοῦ πυρὸς ἑκατέρου κοινωνίας ἀλλήλοις, ἑνός τε αὖ περὶ τὴν λειότητα ἑκάστοτε γενομένου καὶ πολλαχῇ μεταρρυθμισθέντος,  πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἐμφαίνεται, τοῦ περὶ τὸ πρόσωπον πυρὸς τῷ περὶ τὴν ὄψιν πυρὶ περὶ τὸ λεῖον καὶ λαμπρὸν συμπαγοῦς γιγνομένου. δεξιὰ δὲ φαντάζεται τὰ ἀριστερά, ὅτι τοῖς ἐναντίοις μέρεσιν τῆς ὄψεως περὶ τἀναντία μέρη γίγνεται ἐπαφὴ παρὰ τὸ καθεστὸς ἔθος τῆς προσβολῆς· δεξιὰ δὲ τὰ δεξιὰ καὶ τὰ ἀριστερὰ ἀριστερὰ τοὐναντίον, ὅταν μεταπέσῃ συμπηγνύμενον ᾧ συμπήγνυται φῶς,  τοῦτο δέ, ὅταν ἡ τῶν κατόπτρων λειότης, ἔνθεν καὶ ἔνθεν ὕψη λαβοῦσα, τὸ δεξιὸν εἰς τὸ ἀριστερὸν μέρος ἀπώσῃ τῆς ὄψεως καὶ θάτερον ἐπὶ θάτερον. κατὰ δὲ τὸ μῆκος στραφὲν τοῦ προσώπου ταὐτὸν τοῦτο ὕπτιον ἐποίησεν πᾶν φαίνεσθαι, τὸ κάτω πρὸς τὸ ἄνω τῆς αὐγῆς τό τʼ ἄνω πρὸς τὸ κάτω πάλιν ἀπῶσαν. ταῦτʼ οὖν πάντα ἔστιν τῶν συναιτίων οἷς θεὸς ὑπηρετοῦσιν χρῆται τὴν τοῦ ἀρίστου κατὰ τὸ δυνατὸν ἰδέαν  ἀποτελῶν· δοξάζεται δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν πλείστων οὐ συναίτια ἀλλὰ αἴτια εἶναι τῶν πάντων, ψύχοντα καὶ θερμαίνοντα πηγνύντα τε καὶ διαχέοντα καὶ ὅσα τοιαῦτα ἀπεργαζόμενα. λόγον δὲ οὐδένα οὐδὲ νοῦν εἰς οὐδὲν δυνατὰ ἔχειν ἐστίν. τῶν γὰρ ὄντων ᾧ νοῦν μόνῳ κτᾶσθαι προσήκει, λεκτέον ψυχήν—τοῦτο δὲ ἀόρατον, πῦρ δὲ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ γῆ καὶ ἀὴρ σώματα πάντα ὁρατὰ γέγονεν—τὸν δὲ νοῦ καὶ ἐπιστήμης ἐραστὴν ἀνάγκη τὰς τῆς ἔμφρονος φύσεως αἰτίας πρώτας  μεταδιώκειν, ὅσαι δὲ ὑπʼ ἄλλων μὲν κινουμένων, ἕτερα δὲ κατὰ ἀνάγκης κινούντων γίγνονται, δευτέρας. ποιητέον δὴ κατὰ ταῦτα καὶ ἡμῖν· λεκτέα μὲν ἀμφότερα τὰ τῶν αἰτιῶν γένη, χωρὶς δὲ ὅσαι μετὰ νοῦ καλῶν καὶ ἀγαθῶν δημιουργοὶ καὶ ὅσαι μονωθεῖσαι φρονήσεως τὸ τυχὸν ἄτακτον ἑκάστοτε ἐξεργάζονται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καταλειφθεισῶν δέ τινων κινήσεων μειζόνων, οἷαι καὶ ἐν οἵοις ἂν τόποις λείπωνται,  τοιαῦτα καὶ τοσαῦτα παρέσχοντο ἀφομοιωθέντα ἐντὸς ἔξω τε ἐγερθεῖσιν ἀπομνημονευόμενα φαντάσματα. τὸ δὲ περὶ τὴν τῶν κατόπτρων εἰδωλοποιίαν καὶ πάντα ὅσα ἐμφανῆ καὶ λεῖα, κατιδεῖν οὐδὲν ἔτι χαλεπόν. ἐκ γὰρ τῆς ἐντὸς ἐκτός τε τοῦ πυρὸς ἑκατέρου κοινωνίας ἀλλήλοις, ἑνός τε αὖ περὶ τὴν λειότητα ἑκάστοτε γενομένου καὶ πολλαχῇ μεταρρυθμισθέντος,  πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἐμφαίνεται, τοῦ περὶ τὸ πρόσωπον πυρὸς τῷ περὶ τὴν ὄψιν πυρὶ περὶ τὸ λεῖον καὶ λαμπρὸν συμπαγοῦς γιγνομένου.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","text":"δεξιὰ δὲ φαντάζεται τὰ ἀριστερά, ὅτι τοῖς ἐναντίοις μέρεσιν τῆς ὄψεως περὶ τἀναντία μέρη γίγνεται ἐπαφὴ παρὰ τὸ καθεστὸς ἔθος τῆς προσβολῆς· δεξιὰ δὲ τὰ δεξιὰ καὶ τὰ ἀριστερὰ ἀριστερὰ τοὐναντίον, ὅταν μεταπέσῃ συμπηγνύμενον ᾧ συμπήγνυται φῶς,  τοῦτο δέ, ὅταν ἡ τῶν κατόπτρων λειότης, ἔνθεν καὶ ἔνθεν ὕψη λαβοῦσα, τὸ δεξιὸν εἰς τὸ ἀριστερὸν μέρος ἀπώσῃ τῆς ὄψεως καὶ θάτερον ἐπὶ θάτερον. κατὰ δὲ τὸ μῆκος στραφὲν τοῦ προσώπου ταὐτὸν τοῦτο ὕπτιον ἐποίησεν πᾶν φαίνεσθαι, τὸ κάτω πρὸς τὸ ἄνω τῆς αὐγῆς τό τʼ ἄνω πρὸς τὸ κάτω πάλιν ἀπῶσαν. ταῦτʼ οὖν πάντα ἔστιν τῶν συναιτίων οἷς θεὸς ὑπηρετοῦσιν χρῆται τὴν τοῦ ἀρίστου κατὰ τὸ δυνατὸν ἰδέαν  ἀποτελῶν· δοξάζεται δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν πλείστων οὐ συναίτια ἀλλὰ αἴτια εἶναι τῶν πάντων, ψύχοντα καὶ θερμαίνοντα πηγνύντα τε καὶ διαχέοντα καὶ ὅσα τοιαῦτα ἀπεργαζόμενα. λόγον δὲ οὐδένα οὐδὲ νοῦν εἰς οὐδὲν δυνατὰ ἔχειν ἐστίν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","text":"τῶν γὰρ ὄντων ᾧ νοῦν μόνῳ κτᾶσθαι προσήκει, λεκτέον ψυχήν—τοῦτο δὲ ἀόρατον, πῦρ δὲ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ γῆ καὶ ἀὴρ σώματα πάντα ὁρατὰ γέγονεν—τὸν δὲ νοῦ καὶ ἐπιστήμης ἐραστὴν ἀνάγκη τὰς τῆς ἔμφρονος φύσεως αἰτίας πρώτας  μεταδιώκειν, ὅσαι δὲ ὑπʼ ἄλλων μὲν κινουμένων, ἕτερα δὲ κατὰ ἀνάγκης κινούντων γίγνονται, δευτέρας. ποιητέον δὴ κατὰ ταῦτα καὶ ἡμῖν· λεκτέα μὲν ἀμφότερα τὰ τῶν αἰτιῶν γένη, χωρὶς δὲ ὅσαι μετὰ νοῦ καλῶν καὶ ἀγαθῶν δημιουργοὶ καὶ ὅσαι μονωθεῖσαι φρονήσεως τὸ τυχὸν ἄτακτον ἑκάστοτε ἐξεργάζονται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"c1ac9f3793ef15465487f19e27f04dc1389c44c07dbb8e2c91ad6f566abaf863","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224813820074Z_03d77f22","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 46","source_sha256":"c1ac9f3793ef15465487f19e27f04dc1389c44c07dbb8e2c91ad6f566abaf863","sha256":"f119bb1538363f8f85abd3072259b3472fd854ecc3a69021772f19c22e58e7cb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:13.820102+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","text":"XIX. And when certain greater motions are left behind, of what sort and in what places they may be left, they furnish images of such and so great things, assimilated and remembered when awakened within and without. And concerning the image-making of mirrors and all things that are manifest and smooth, it is no longer difficult to perceive. For from the mutual communion of the fire within and that without, and when each time one fire has come to be around the smoothness and has been altered in many ways, all such phenomena necessarily appear, when the fire about the face becomes compact with the fire about vision upon the smooth and bright surface.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","text":"But the right appears left, because contact takes place between opposite parts of the vision and opposite parts [of the object], contrary to the established habit of impingement; but right things appear right and left things left, conversely, whenever the light which is compacted with that with which it is compacted shifts over. This occurs when the smoothness of the mirrors, having acquired elevations on both sides, thrusts the right [side] into the left part of vision and the other into the other. And when it is turned along the length of the face, this same thing makes the whole appear upside down, thrusting the lower part of the ray toward the upper and, again, the upper toward the lower. All these, then, are among the contributory causes which god employs as servants in accomplishing, so far as possible, the form of the best. Yet by most people they are supposed to be not contributory causes but causes of all things, cooling and heating, condensing and dispersing, and producing whatever else is of that kind. But they are incapable of possessing any reason or intelligence for anything.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","text":"For among things that are, that to which alone it belongs to possess intelligence must be called soul—and this is invisible, whereas fire and water and earth and air have all come to be visible bodies—and the lover of intelligence and knowledge must pursue the first causes of intelligent nature, while those which arise through being moved by others and in turn moving other things by necessity are secondary. We too must proceed accordingly: both kinds of causes must be stated, but separately—those which, together with intelligence, are makers of things fair and good, and those which, deprived of intelligence, produce whatever disorderly thing chances to occur on each occasion.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"0a69e132fb40a6838d31cec8579ed745f12029d184355c143999bc28bf3675b6","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 46"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 46","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28","title":"Section 47","order":31,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_28","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ μὲν οὖν τῶν ὀμμάτων συμμεταίτια πρὸς τὸ σχεῖν τὴν δύναμιν ἣν νῦν εἴληχεν εἰρήσθω· τὸ δὲ μέγιστον αὐτῶν εἰς ὠφελίαν ἔργον, διʼ ὃ θεὸς αὔθʼ ἡμῖν  δεδώρηται, μετὰ τοῦτο ῥητέον. ὄψις δὴ κατὰ τὸν ἐμὸν λόγον αἰτία τῆς μεγίστης ὠφελίας γέγονεν ἡμῖν, ὅτι τῶν νῦν λόγων περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λεγομένων οὐδεὶς ἄν ποτε ἐρρήθη μήτε ἄστρα μήτε ἥλιον μήτε οὐρανὸν ἰδόντων. νῦν δʼ ἡμέρα τε καὶ νὺξ ὀφθεῖσαι μῆνές τε καὶ ἐνιαυτῶν περίοδοι καὶ ἰσημερίαι καὶ τροπαὶ μεμηχάνηνται μὲν ἀριθμόν, χρόνου δὲ ἔννοιαν περί τε τῆς τοῦ παντὸς φύσεως ζήτησιν ἔδοσαν· ἐξ ὧν  ἐπορισάμεθα φιλοσοφίας γένος, οὗ μεῖζον ἀγαθὸν οὔτʼ ἦλθεν οὔτε ἥξει ποτὲ τῷ θνητῷ γένει δωρηθὲν ἐκ θεῶν. λέγω δὴ τοῦτο ὀμμάτων μέγιστον ἀγαθόν· τἆλλα δὲ ὅσα ἐλάττω τί ἂν ὑμνοῖμεν, ὧν ὁ μὴ φιλόσοφος τυφλωθεὶς ὀδυρόμενος ἂν θρηνοῖ μάτην; ἀλλὰ τούτου λεγέσθω παρʼ ἡμῶν αὕτη ἐπὶ ταῦτα αἰτία, θεὸν ἡμῖν ἀνευρεῖν δωρήσασθαί τε ὄψιν, ἵνα τὰς ἐν οὐρανῷ τοῦ νοῦ κατιδόντες περιόδους χρησαίμεθα ἐπὶ τὰς περιφορὰς τὰς τῆς παρʼ ἡμῖν διανοήσεως, συγγενεῖς  ἐκείναις οὔσας, ἀταράκτοις τεταραγμένας, ἐκμαθόντες δὲ καὶ λογισμῶν κατὰ φύσιν ὀρθότητος μετασχόντες, μιμούμενοι τὰς τοῦ θεοῦ πάντως ἀπλανεῖς οὔσας, τὰς ἐν ἡμῖν πεπλανημένας καταστησαίμεθα. φωνῆς τε δὴ καὶ ἀκοῆς πέρι πάλιν ὁ αὐτὸς λόγος, ἐπὶ ταὐτὰ τῶν αὐτῶν ἕνεκα παρὰ θεῶν δεδωρῆσθαι. λόγος τε γὰρ ἐπʼ αὐτὰ ταῦτα τέτακται, τὴν μεγίστην συμβαλλόμενος εἰς αὐτὰ μοῖραν, ὅσον τʼ αὖ μουσικῆς  φωνῇ χρήσιμον πρὸς ἀκοὴν ἕνεκα ἁρμονίας ἐστὶ δοθέν. ἡ δὲ ἁρμονία, συγγενεῖς ἔχουσα φορὰς ταῖς ἐν ἡμῖν τῆς ψυχῆς περιόδοις, τῷ μετὰ νοῦ προσχρωμένῳ Μούσαις οὐκ ἐφʼ ἡδονὴν ἄλογον καθάπερ νῦν εἶναι δοκεῖ χρήσιμος, ἀλλʼ ἐπὶ τὴν γεγονυῖαν ἐν ἡμῖν ἀνάρμοστον ψυχῆς περίοδον εἰς κατακόσμησιν καὶ συμφωνίαν ἑαυτῇ σύμμαχος ὑπὸ Μουσῶν δέδοται· καὶ ῥυθμὸς αὖ διὰ τὴν ἄμετρον ἐν ἡμῖν καὶ χαρίτων  ἐπιδεᾶ γιγνομένην ἐν τοῖς πλείστοις ἕξιν ἐπίκουρος ἐπὶ ταὐτὰ ὑπὸ τῶν αὐτῶν ἐδόθη. τὰ μὲν οὖν παρεληλυθότα τῶν εἰρημένων πλὴν βραχέων ἐπιδέδεικται τὰ διὰ νοῦ δεδημιουργημένα· δεῖ δὲ καὶ τὰ διʼ ἀνάγκης γιγνόμενα τῷ λόγῳ παραθέσθαι.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ μὲν οὖν τῶν ὀμμάτων συμμεταίτια πρὸς τὸ σχεῖν τὴν δύναμιν ἣν νῦν εἴληχεν εἰρήσθω· τὸ δὲ μέγιστον αὐτῶν εἰς ὠφελίαν ἔργον, διʼ ὃ θεὸς αὔθʼ ἡμῖν  δεδώρηται, μετὰ τοῦτο ῥητέον. ὄψις δὴ κατὰ τὸν ἐμὸν λόγον αἰτία τῆς μεγίστης ὠφελίας γέγονεν ἡμῖν, ὅτι τῶν νῦν λόγων περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λεγομένων οὐδεὶς ἄν ποτε ἐρρήθη μήτε ἄστρα μήτε ἥλιον μήτε οὐρανὸν ἰδόντων. νῦν δʼ ἡμέρα τε καὶ νὺξ ὀφθεῖσαι μῆνές τε καὶ ἐνιαυτῶν περίοδοι καὶ ἰσημερίαι καὶ τροπαὶ μεμηχάνηνται μὲν ἀριθμόν, χρόνου δὲ ἔννοιαν περί τε τῆς τοῦ παντὸς φύσεως ζήτησιν ἔδοσαν· ἐξ ὧν  ἐπορισάμεθα φιλοσοφίας γένος, οὗ μεῖζον ἀγαθὸν οὔτʼ ἦλθεν οὔτε ἥξει ποτὲ τῷ θνητῷ γένει δωρηθὲν ἐκ θεῶν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","text":"λέγω δὴ τοῦτο ὀμμάτων μέγιστον ἀγαθόν· τἆλλα δὲ ὅσα ἐλάττω τί ἂν ὑμνοῖμεν, ὧν ὁ μὴ φιλόσοφος τυφλωθεὶς ὀδυρόμενος ἂν θρηνοῖ μάτην; ἀλλὰ τούτου λεγέσθω παρʼ ἡμῶν αὕτη ἐπὶ ταῦτα αἰτία, θεὸν ἡμῖν ἀνευρεῖν δωρήσασθαί τε ὄψιν, ἵνα τὰς ἐν οὐρανῷ τοῦ νοῦ κατιδόντες περιόδους χρησαίμεθα ἐπὶ τὰς περιφορὰς τὰς τῆς παρʼ ἡμῖν διανοήσεως, συγγενεῖς  ἐκείναις οὔσας, ἀταράκτοις τεταραγμένας, ἐκμαθόντες δὲ καὶ λογισμῶν κατὰ φύσιν ὀρθότητος μετασχόντες, μιμούμενοι τὰς τοῦ θεοῦ πάντως ἀπλανεῖς οὔσας, τὰς ἐν ἡμῖν πεπλανημένας καταστησαίμεθα. φωνῆς τε δὴ καὶ ἀκοῆς πέρι πάλιν ὁ αὐτὸς λόγος, ἐπὶ ταὐτὰ τῶν αὐτῶν ἕνεκα παρὰ θεῶν δεδωρῆσθαι. λόγος τε γὰρ ἐπʼ αὐτὰ ταῦτα τέτακται, τὴν μεγίστην συμβαλλόμενος εἰς αὐτὰ μοῖραν, ὅσον τʼ αὖ μουσικῆς  φωνῇ χρήσιμον πρὸς ἀκοὴν ἕνεκα ἁρμονίας ἐστὶ δοθέν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","text":"ἡ δὲ ἁρμονία, συγγενεῖς ἔχουσα φορὰς ταῖς ἐν ἡμῖν τῆς ψυχῆς περιόδοις, τῷ μετὰ νοῦ προσχρωμένῳ Μούσαις οὐκ ἐφʼ ἡδονὴν ἄλογον καθάπερ νῦν εἶναι δοκεῖ χρήσιμος, ἀλλʼ ἐπὶ τὴν γεγονυῖαν ἐν ἡμῖν ἀνάρμοστον ψυχῆς περίοδον εἰς κατακόσμησιν καὶ συμφωνίαν ἑαυτῇ σύμμαχος ὑπὸ Μουσῶν δέδοται· καὶ ῥυθμὸς αὖ διὰ τὴν ἄμετρον ἐν ἡμῖν καὶ χαρίτων  ἐπιδεᾶ γιγνομένην ἐν τοῖς πλείστοις ἕξιν ἐπίκουρος ἐπὶ ταὐτὰ ὑπὸ τῶν αὐτῶν ἐδόθη. τὰ μὲν οὖν παρεληλυθότα τῶν εἰρημένων πλὴν βραχέων ἐπιδέδεικται τὰ διὰ νοῦ δεδημιουργημένα· δεῖ δὲ καὶ τὰ διʼ ἀνάγκης γιγνόμενα τῷ λόγῳ παραθέσθαι.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"a448ebb82503dcdd94a9d278a3688015ec1bfbb2030bb6aa03e612acc81e15e1","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224822214199Z_00a06b57","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 47","source_sha256":"a448ebb82503dcdd94a9d278a3688015ec1bfbb2030bb6aa03e612acc81e15e1","sha256":"33b7bd9caeb34826f1bf5f889ca54a9222472001a211aa970171101ee1f5b869","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:22.214335+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","text":"TIM. Let what are contributory causes in the eyes' having acquired the power which they now possess have been stated; but next we must speak of their greatest work for benefit, for the sake of which the god has given them to us. For sight, according to my account, has come to be the cause of our greatest benefit, because none of the accounts now being spoken concerning the universe would ever have been spoken if we had seen neither stars nor sun nor heaven. But now, day and night having been seen, and months and the circuits of years, and equinoxes and solstices, have contrived number and bestowed the conception of time and inquiry concerning the nature of the universe; from these we have procured the kind of philosophy, than which no greater good has ever come, nor ever will come, as a gift from gods to the mortal race.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","text":"This, then, I say is the eyes' greatest good; but as for all the other lesser things, why should we hymn them, things for which the non-philosopher, if blinded, would lament and mourn in vain? Rather, let this be said by us as the cause directed to these things: that god gave us sight in order that, observing the revolutions of intelligence in heaven, we might employ them upon the revolutions of the thought that is in us—these being akin to those, though the latter are untroubled and ours disturbed—and, having learned them and partaken of the correctness of calculations according to nature, by imitating the altogether unerring revolutions of the god, we might set right those that have wandered in us. And again the same account applies concerning voice and hearing: they have been bestowed by the gods for the same purposes and on account of the same things. For speech has been ordered toward these very ends, contributing the greatest part to them; and whatever use of musical voice is useful for hearing has been given for the sake of harmony.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","text":"And harmony, having motions akin to the revolutions of the soul within us, is useful to one who makes use of the Muses with intelligence not for irrational pleasure, as it now seems to be, but has been given by the Muses as an ally for bringing into order and concord with itself the revolution of the soul that has come to be without harmony in us. And rhythm in turn, because of the condition arising in most of us that is without measure and deficient in graces, has been given by the same [gods] as an aid for the same purposes. Thus the foregoing matters of what has been said, apart from a few things, have displayed those things fashioned through intelligence; but it is necessary also to set alongside the account the things that come to be through necessity.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"87194791e074833997612bd8e9efc5de7be1e3214c8a0d26a943359a53f7ce32","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 47"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 47","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29","title":"Section 48","order":32,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_29","text":"ΤΙ. μεμειγμένη γὰρ  οὖν ἡ τοῦδε τοῦ κόσμου γένεσις ἐξ ἀνάγκης τε καὶ νοῦ συστάσεως ἐγεννήθη· νοῦ δὲ ἀνάγκης ἄρχοντος τῷ πείθειν αὐτὴν τῶν γιγνομένων τὰ πλεῖστα ἐπὶ τὸ βέλτιστον ἄγειν, ταύτῃ κατὰ ταῦτά τε διʼ ἀνάγκης ἡττωμένης ὑπὸ πειθοῦς ἔμφρονος οὕτω κατʼ ἀρχὰς συνίστατο τόδε τὸ πᾶν. εἴ τις οὖν ᾗ γέγονεν κατὰ ταῦτα ὄντως ἐρεῖ, μεικτέον καὶ τὸ τῆς πλανωμένης εἶδος αἰτίας, ᾗ φέρειν πέφυκεν· ὧδε οὖν πάλιν  ἀναχωρητέον, καὶ λαβοῦσιν αὐτῶν τούτων προσήκουσαν ἑτέραν ἀρχὴν αὖθις αὖ, καθάπερ περὶ τῶν τότε νῦν οὕτω περὶ τούτων πάλιν ἀρκτέον ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς. τὴν δὴ πρὸ τῆς οὐρανοῦ γενέσεως πυρὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος καὶ γῆς φύσιν θεατέον αὐτὴν καὶ τὰ πρὸ τούτου πάθη· νῦν γὰρ οὐδείς πω γένεσιν αὐτῶν μεμήνυκεν, ἀλλʼ ὡς εἰδόσιν πῦρ ὅτι ποτέ ἐστιν καὶ ἕκαστον αὐτῶν λέγομεν ἀρχὰς αὐτὰ τιθέμενοι στοιχεῖα τοῦ παντός, προσῆκον αὐτοῖς οὐδʼ ἂν ὡς ἐν συλλαβῆς  εἴδεσιν μόνον εἰκότως ὑπὸ τοῦ καὶ βραχὺ φρονοῦντος ἀπεικασθῆναι. νῦν δὲ οὖν τό γε παρʼ ἡμῶν ὧδε ἐχέτω· τὴν μὲν περὶ ἁπάντων εἴτε ἀρχὴν εἴτε ἀρχὰς εἴτε ὅπῃ δοκεῖ τούτων πέρι τὸ νῦν οὐ ῥητέον, διʼ ἄλλο μὲν οὐδέν, διὰ δὲ τὸ χαλεπὸν εἶναι κατὰ τὸν παρόντα τρόπον τῆς διεξόδου δηλῶσαι τὰ δοκοῦντα, μήτʼ οὖν ὑμεῖς οἴεσθε δεῖν ἐμὲ λέγειν, οὔτʼ αὐτὸς αὖ πείθειν ἐμαυτὸν εἴην ἂν δυνατὸς ὡς ὀρθῶς ἐγχειροῖμʼ  ἂν τοσοῦτον ἐπιβαλλόμενος ἔργον· τὸ δὲ κατʼ ἀρχὰς ῥηθὲν διαφυλάττων, τὴν τῶν εἰκότων λόγων δύναμιν, πειράσομαι μηδενὸς ἧττον εἰκότα, μᾶλλον δέ, καὶ ἔμπροσθεν ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς περὶ ἑκάστων καὶ συμπάντων λέγειν. θεὸν δὴ καὶ νῦν ἐπʼ ἀρχῇ τῶν λεγομένων σωτῆρα ἐξ ἀτόπου καὶ ἀήθους διηγήσεως πρὸς τὸ τῶν εἰκότων δόγμα διασῴζειν ἡμᾶς  ἐπικαλεσάμενοι πάλιν ἀρχώμεθα λέγειν. ἡ δʼ οὖν αὖθις ἀρχὴ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς ἔστω μειζόνως τῆς πρόσθεν διῃρημένη· τότε μὲν γὰρ δύο εἴδη διειλόμεθα, νῦν δὲ τρίτον ἄλλο γένος ἡμῖν δηλωτέον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. μεμειγμένη γὰρ  οὖν ἡ τοῦδε τοῦ κόσμου γένεσις ἐξ ἀνάγκης τε καὶ νοῦ συστάσεως ἐγεννήθη· νοῦ δὲ ἀνάγκης ἄρχοντος τῷ πείθειν αὐτὴν τῶν γιγνομένων τὰ πλεῖστα ἐπὶ τὸ βέλτιστον ἄγειν, ταύτῃ κατὰ ταῦτά τε διʼ ἀνάγκης ἡττωμένης ὑπὸ πειθοῦς ἔμφρονος οὕτω κατʼ ἀρχὰς συνίστατο τόδε τὸ πᾶν. εἴ τις οὖν ᾗ γέγονεν κατὰ ταῦτα ὄντως ἐρεῖ, μεικτέον καὶ τὸ τῆς πλανωμένης εἶδος αἰτίας, ᾗ φέρειν πέφυκεν· ὧδε οὖν πάλιν  ἀναχωρητέον, καὶ λαβοῦσιν αὐτῶν τούτων προσήκουσαν ἑτέραν ἀρχὴν αὖθις αὖ, καθάπερ περὶ τῶν τότε νῦν οὕτω περὶ τούτων πάλιν ἀρκτέον ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","text":"τὴν δὴ πρὸ τῆς οὐρανοῦ γενέσεως πυρὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος καὶ γῆς φύσιν θεατέον αὐτὴν καὶ τὰ πρὸ τούτου πάθη· νῦν γὰρ οὐδείς πω γένεσιν αὐτῶν μεμήνυκεν, ἀλλʼ ὡς εἰδόσιν πῦρ ὅτι ποτέ ἐστιν καὶ ἕκαστον αὐτῶν λέγομεν ἀρχὰς αὐτὰ τιθέμενοι στοιχεῖα τοῦ παντός, προσῆκον αὐτοῖς οὐδʼ ἂν ὡς ἐν συλλαβῆς  εἴδεσιν μόνον εἰκότως ὑπὸ τοῦ καὶ βραχὺ φρονοῦντος ἀπεικασθῆναι. νῦν δὲ οὖν τό γε παρʼ ἡμῶν ὧδε ἐχέτω· τὴν μὲν περὶ ἁπάντων εἴτε ἀρχὴν εἴτε ἀρχὰς εἴτε ὅπῃ δοκεῖ τούτων πέρι τὸ νῦν οὐ ῥητέον, διʼ ἄλλο μὲν οὐδέν, διὰ δὲ τὸ χαλεπὸν εἶναι κατὰ τὸν παρόντα τρόπον τῆς διεξόδου δηλῶσαι τὰ δοκοῦντα, μήτʼ οὖν ὑμεῖς οἴεσθε δεῖν ἐμὲ λέγειν, οὔτʼ αὐτὸς αὖ πείθειν ἐμαυτὸν εἴην ἂν δυνατὸς ὡς ὀρθῶς ἐγχειροῖμʼ  ἂν τοσοῦτον ἐπιβαλλόμενος ἔργον· τὸ δὲ κατʼ ἀρχὰς ῥηθὲν διαφυλάττων, τὴν τῶν εἰκότων λόγων δύναμιν, πειράσομαι μηδενὸς ἧττον εἰκότα, μᾶλλον δέ, καὶ ἔμπροσθεν ἀπʼ ἀρχῆς περὶ ἑκάστων καὶ συμπάντων λέγειν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","text":"θεὸν δὴ καὶ νῦν ἐπʼ ἀρχῇ τῶν λεγομένων σωτῆρα ἐξ ἀτόπου καὶ ἀήθους διηγήσεως πρὸς τὸ τῶν εἰκότων δόγμα διασῴζειν ἡμᾶς  ἐπικαλεσάμενοι πάλιν ἀρχώμεθα λέγειν. ἡ δʼ οὖν αὖθις ἀρχὴ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς ἔστω μειζόνως τῆς πρόσθεν διῃρημένη· τότε μὲν γὰρ δύο εἴδη διειλόμεθα, νῦν δὲ τρίτον ἄλλο γένος ἡμῖν δηλωτέον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"de6693f478197456bda9de1ef112c4967cddd380e8e780bdf802e5178d8e3c1c","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224830221867Z_47c1f547","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 48","source_sha256":"de6693f478197456bda9de1ef112c4967cddd380e8e780bdf802e5178d8e3c1c","sha256":"6d4b21f839afc008201f820a1e19bd1ae6dc88a56d451199394ef0cc53004c62","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:30.221897+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","text":"TIM. For the generation of this cosmos, being mixed, was begotten from a conjunction of necessity and intellect; and intellect, ruling over necessity by persuading it to bring most of the things that come to be toward what is best—thus, in accordance with these things, necessity being overcome by intelligent persuasion, this all was so constituted in the beginning. If, then, anyone is to say truly how it has come to be in this way, the form of the wandering cause also must be mixed in, in the manner in which it is naturally fitted to bear. Thus, then, we must again withdraw; and, having taken a different beginning appropriate to these very matters, we must once more begin again from the beginning concerning these things, just as then we did concerning those matters now.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","text":"We must behold the nature itself of fire, water, air, and earth before the generation of heaven, and the affections prior to this. For no one has yet disclosed their generation; but, as though we knew what fire ever is, and each of them, we speak of them, positing them themselves as principles, elements of the all—whereas it would not be fitting for them to be likened, even with plausibility, merely to the forms of a syllable by one who has even a little intelligence. But let what comes from us stand thus: concerning the principle or principles of all things, or however it seems fitting to speak about these matters, nothing is now to be said—not for any other reason, but because it is difficult, in the present manner of exposition, to make clear what appears to us. Nor should you suppose that I ought to speak of it, nor should I myself be able to persuade myself that I would be undertaking rightly so great a task if I set my hand to it. But, preserving what was said at the beginning—the power of probable accounts—I shall attempt to speak, from the beginning and concerning each thing and all things together, with accounts no less probable, indeed more probable, than those before.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","text":"Now, again at the beginning of what is said, having invoked god as saviour, to preserve us from an strange and unfamiliar exposition unto the doctrine of what is probable, let us begin again to speak. Let the beginning concerning the all, then, be divided anew more extensively than the former one. For then we divided two forms, but now we must make clear to ourselves another, third kind.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"247df9fc2d19cb6cb4f2c4ca4ee31593a3ae19de66a50444fdb08c5bd6a3396b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 48"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 48","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30","title":"Section 49","order":33,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_30","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ μὲν γὰρ δύο ἱκανὰ ἦν ἐπὶ τοῖς ἔμπροσθεν λεχθεῖσιν, ἓν μὲν ὡς παραδείγματος εἶδος ὑποτεθέν, νοητὸν καὶ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὄν, μίμημα δὲ  παραδείγματος δεύτερον, γένεσιν ἔχον καὶ ὁρατόν. τρίτον δὲ τότε μὲν οὐ διειλόμεθα, νομίσαντες τὰ δύο ἕξειν ἱκανῶς· νῦν δὲ ὁ λόγος ἔοικεν εἰσαναγκάζειν χαλεπὸν καὶ ἀμυδρὸν εἶδος ἐπιχειρεῖν λόγοις ἐμφανίσαι. τίνʼ οὖν ἔχον δύναμιν καὶ φύσιν αὐτὸ ὑποληπτέον; τοιάνδε μάλιστα· πάσης εἶναι γενέσεως ὑποδοχὴν αὐτὴν οἷον τιθήνην. εἴρηται μὲν οὖν τἀληθές, δεῖ δὲ ἐναργέστερον εἰπεῖν περὶ αὐτοῦ, χαλεπὸν  δὲ ἄλλως τε καὶ διότι προαπορηθῆναι περὶ πυρὸς καὶ τῶν μετὰ πυρὸς ἀναγκαῖον τούτου χάριν· τούτων γὰρ εἰπεῖν ἕκαστον ὁποῖον ὄντως ὕδωρ χρὴ λέγειν μᾶλλον ἢ πῦρ, καὶ ὁποῖον ὁτιοῦν μᾶλλον ἢ καὶ ἅπαντα καθʼ ἕκαστόν τε, οὕτως ὥστε τινὶ πιστῷ καὶ βεβαίῳ χρήσασθαι λόγῳ, χαλεπόν. πῶς οὖν δὴ τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ καὶ πῇ καὶ τί περὶ αὐτῶν εἰκότως διαπορηθέντες ἂν λέγοιμεν; πρῶτον μέν, ὃ δὴ νῦν ὕδωρ ὠνομάκαμεν, πηγνύμενον ὡς δοκοῦμεν λίθους καὶ γῆν γιγνόμενον  ὁρῶμεν, τηκόμενον δὲ καὶ διακρινόμενον αὖ ταὐτὸν τοῦτο πνεῦμα καὶ ἀέρα, συγκαυθέντα δὲ ἀέρα πῦρ, ἀνάπαλιν δὲ συγκριθὲν καὶ κατασβεσθὲν εἰς ἰδέαν τε ἀπιὸν αὖθις ἀέρος πῦρ, καὶ πάλιν ἀέρα συνιόντα καὶ πυκνούμενον νέφος καὶ ὁμίχλην, ἐκ δὲ τούτων ἔτι μᾶλλον συμπιλουμένων ῥέον ὕδωρ, ἐξ ὕδατος δὲ γῆν καὶ λίθους αὖθις, κύκλον τε οὕτω διαδιδόντα εἰς ἄλληλα, ὡς φαίνεται, τὴν γένεσιν. οὕτω δὴ τούτων οὐδέποτε  τῶν αὐτῶν ἑκάστων φανταζομένων, ποῖον αὐτῶν ὡς ὂν ὁτιοῦν τοῦτο καὶ οὐκ ἄλλο παγίως διισχυριζόμενος οὐκ αἰσχυνεῖταί τις ἑαυτόν; οὐκ ἔστιν, ἀλλʼ ἀσφαλέστατα μακρῷ περὶ τούτων τιθεμένους ὧδε λέγειν· ἀεὶ ὃ καθορῶμεν ἄλλοτε ἄλλῃ γιγνόμενον, ὡς πῦρ, μὴ τοῦτο ἀλλὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἑκάστοτε προσαγορεύειν πῦρ, μηδὲ ὕδωρ τοῦτο ἀλλὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἀεί, μηδὲ ἄλλο ποτὲ μηδὲν ὥς τινα ἔχον βεβαιότητα, ὅσα  δεικνύντες τῷ ῥήματι τῷ τόδε καὶ τοῦτο προσχρώμενοι δηλοῦν ἡγούμεθά τι· φεύγει γὰρ οὐχ ὑπομένον τὴν τοῦ τόδε καὶ τοῦτο καὶ τὴν τῷδε καὶ πᾶσαν ὅση μόνιμα ὡς ὄντα αὐτὰ ἐνδείκνυται φάσις. ἀλλὰ ταῦτα μὲν ἕκαστα μὴ λέγειν, τὸ δὲ τοιοῦτον ἀεὶ περιφερόμενον ὅμοιον ἑκάστου πέρι καὶ συμπάντων οὕτω καλεῖν, καὶ δὴ καὶ πῦρ τὸ διὰ παντὸς τοιοῦτον, καὶ ἅπαν ὅσονπερ ἂν ἔχῃ γένεσιν·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ μὲν γὰρ δύο ἱκανὰ ἦν ἐπὶ τοῖς ἔμπροσθεν λεχθεῖσιν, ἓν μὲν ὡς παραδείγματος εἶδος ὑποτεθέν, νοητὸν καὶ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὄν, μίμημα δὲ  παραδείγματος δεύτερον, γένεσιν ἔχον καὶ ὁρατόν. τρίτον δὲ τότε μὲν οὐ διειλόμεθα, νομίσαντες τὰ δύο ἕξειν ἱκανῶς· νῦν δὲ ὁ λόγος ἔοικεν εἰσαναγκάζειν χαλεπὸν καὶ ἀμυδρὸν εἶδος ἐπιχειρεῖν λόγοις ἐμφανίσαι. τίνʼ οὖν ἔχον δύναμιν καὶ φύσιν αὐτὸ ὑποληπτέον; τοιάνδε μάλιστα· πάσης εἶναι γενέσεως ὑποδοχὴν αὐτὴν οἷον τιθήνην. εἴρηται μὲν οὖν τἀληθές, δεῖ δὲ ἐναργέστερον εἰπεῖν περὶ αὐτοῦ, χαλεπὸν  δὲ ἄλλως τε καὶ διότι προαπορηθῆναι περὶ πυρὸς καὶ τῶν μετὰ πυρὸς ἀναγκαῖον τούτου χάριν· τούτων γὰρ εἰπεῖν ἕκαστον ὁποῖον ὄντως ὕδωρ χρὴ λέγειν μᾶλλον ἢ πῦρ, καὶ ὁποῖον ὁτιοῦν μᾶλλον ἢ καὶ ἅπαντα καθʼ ἕκαστόν τε, οὕτως ὥστε τινὶ πιστῷ καὶ βεβαίῳ χρήσασθαι λόγῳ, χαλεπόν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","text":"πῶς οὖν δὴ τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ καὶ πῇ καὶ τί περὶ αὐτῶν εἰκότως διαπορηθέντες ἂν λέγοιμεν; πρῶτον μέν, ὃ δὴ νῦν ὕδωρ ὠνομάκαμεν, πηγνύμενον ὡς δοκοῦμεν λίθους καὶ γῆν γιγνόμενον  ὁρῶμεν, τηκόμενον δὲ καὶ διακρινόμενον αὖ ταὐτὸν τοῦτο πνεῦμα καὶ ἀέρα, συγκαυθέντα δὲ ἀέρα πῦρ, ἀνάπαλιν δὲ συγκριθὲν καὶ κατασβεσθὲν εἰς ἰδέαν τε ἀπιὸν αὖθις ἀέρος πῦρ, καὶ πάλιν ἀέρα συνιόντα καὶ πυκνούμενον νέφος καὶ ὁμίχλην, ἐκ δὲ τούτων ἔτι μᾶλλον συμπιλουμένων ῥέον ὕδωρ, ἐξ ὕδατος δὲ γῆν καὶ λίθους αὖθις, κύκλον τε οὕτω διαδιδόντα εἰς ἄλληλα, ὡς φαίνεται, τὴν γένεσιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","text":"οὕτω δὴ τούτων οὐδέποτε  τῶν αὐτῶν ἑκάστων φανταζομένων, ποῖον αὐτῶν ὡς ὂν ὁτιοῦν τοῦτο καὶ οὐκ ἄλλο παγίως διισχυριζόμενος οὐκ αἰσχυνεῖταί τις ἑαυτόν; οὐκ ἔστιν, ἀλλʼ ἀσφαλέστατα μακρῷ περὶ τούτων τιθεμένους ὧδε λέγειν· ἀεὶ ὃ καθορῶμεν ἄλλοτε ἄλλῃ γιγνόμενον, ὡς πῦρ, μὴ τοῦτο ἀλλὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἑκάστοτε προσαγορεύειν πῦρ, μηδὲ ὕδωρ τοῦτο ἀλλὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἀεί, μηδὲ ἄλλο ποτὲ μηδὲν ὥς τινα ἔχον βεβαιότητα, ὅσα  δεικνύντες τῷ ῥήματι τῷ τόδε καὶ τοῦτο προσχρώμενοι δηλοῦν ἡγούμεθά τι· φεύγει γὰρ οὐχ ὑπομένον τὴν τοῦ τόδε καὶ τοῦτο καὶ τὴν τῷδε καὶ πᾶσαν ὅση μόνιμα ὡς ὄντα αὐτὰ ἐνδείκνυται φάσις. ἀλλὰ ταῦτα μὲν ἕκαστα μὴ λέγειν, τὸ δὲ τοιοῦτον ἀεὶ περιφερόμενον ὅμοιον ἑκάστου πέρι καὶ συμπάντων οὕτω καλεῖν, καὶ δὴ καὶ πῦρ τὸ διὰ παντὸς τοιοῦτον, καὶ ἅπαν ὅσονπερ ἂν ἔχῃ γένεσιν·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"8a8be8f90d402d8fd847dd3c481cb262f7685cd5066abd81c7c7cf213344ecd1","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224839409616Z_a18cb4f2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 49","source_sha256":"8a8be8f90d402d8fd847dd3c481cb262f7685cd5066abd81c7c7cf213344ecd1","sha256":"716d34913454e4c936695d1a6f5e9d4e1af54f2eda976697738fbb903cab192f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:39.409705+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","text":"TI. For the two were sufficient for the things said before: one, posited as a kind of paradigm, intelligible and always being in the same way; the second, an imitation of the paradigm, having coming-to-be and visible. But a third we did not then distinguish, thinking that the two would be sufficient; whereas now the argument seems to compel us to attempt to make manifest in speech a difficult and obscure kind. What power and nature, then, must it be supposed to have? Chiefly this: that it is a receptacle of all becoming, as it were a nurse. What has been said is true; but it is necessary to speak more clearly about it—and this is difficult for other reasons too, and because, for this purpose, it is necessary first to raise difficulties concerning fire and the things that come after fire. For it is difficult to say of these which one, being what it really is, one ought to call water rather than fire, and which one anything whatever rather than each and every one severally, so as to employ some trustworthy and firm account.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","text":"How then, precisely, and in what way, and what concerning them might we reasonably say after raising difficulties? First, that which we have now named water, when it is compacted, we see becoming stones and earth, as it seems; but when melted and dispersed, this same thing becomes breath and air; and air, when kindled together, becomes fire; while conversely fire, when combined and quenched and again passing into the form of air, becomes air; and air, coming together and being condensed, becomes cloud and mist; and from these, when they are still more compressed, flowing water; and from water, earth and stones again—thus, as appears, passing on to one another the cycle of becoming.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","text":"Thus, since none of these ever appears as the same individual thing, who would not be ashamed of himself if, insisting firmly that it is some one of them that is this and not another, he claimed it as being anything whatever? It is not possible; rather, by far the safest course in laying down an account concerning these things is to speak as follows: what we always observe becoming different at different times, such as fire—do not call this fire, but call that which is such on each occasion fire; nor call this water, but that which is such always; nor ever call anything else anything as possessing some stability, whenever, pointing with the expressions “this” and “that,” we suppose that we are making something clear. For it escapes, not enduring the assertion of “this” and “that,” or “in this way,” and every assertion that indicates them as permanent beings. But one should not call each of these things thus; rather, one should call “such” that which is always carried around, alike in respect of each and all together; and indeed fire too, that which is such throughout, and everything whatsoever that has becoming.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"8785d82b849368177e5eebfe463fd1f066c830aae478b79d59138f5c7de9f999","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 49"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 49","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5","title":"Section 50","order":34,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5","text":"ΤΙ. ἐν ᾧ δὲ ἐγγιγνόμενα ἀεὶ ἕκαστα αὐτῶν φαντάζεται καὶ πάλιν ἐκεῖθεν ἀπόλλυται,  μόνον ἐκεῖνο αὖ προσαγορεύειν τῷ τε τοῦτο καὶ τῷ τόδε προσχρωμένους ὀνόματι, τὸ δὲ ὁποιονοῦν τι, θερμὸν ἢ λευκὸν ἢ καὶ ὁτιοῦν τῶν ἐναντίων, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα ἐκ τούτων, μηδὲν ἐκεῖνο αὖ τούτων καλεῖν. ἔτι δὲ σαφέστερον αὐτοῦ πέρι προθυμητέον αὖθις εἰπεῖν. εἰ γὰρ πάντα τις σχήματα πλάσας ἐκ χρυσοῦ μηδὲν μεταπλάττων παύοιτο ἕκαστα εἰς ἅπαντα, δεικνύντος δή τινος αὐτῶν ἓν καὶ ἐρομένου  τί ποτʼ ἐστί, μακρῷ πρὸς ἀλήθειαν ἀσφαλέστατον εἰπεῖν ὅτι χρυσός, τὸ δὲ τρίγωνον ὅσα τε ἄλλα σχήματα ἐνεγίγνετο, μηδέποτε λέγειν ταῦτα ὡς ὄντα, ἅ γε μεταξὺ τιθεμένου μεταπίπτει, ἀλλʼ ἐὰν ἄρα καὶ τὸ τοιοῦτον μετʼ ἀσφαλείας ἐθέλῃ δέχεσθαί τινος, ἀγαπᾶν. ὁ αὐτὸς δὴ λόγος καὶ περὶ τῆς τὰ πάντα δεχομένης σώματα φύσεως. ταὐτὸν αὐτὴν ἀεὶ προσρητέον· ἐκ γὰρ τῆς ἑαυτῆς τὸ παράπαν οὐκ ἐξίσταται δυνάμεως—δέχεταί τε γὰρ ἀεὶ τὰ πάντα, καὶ  μορφὴν οὐδεμίαν ποτὲ οὐδενὶ τῶν εἰσιόντων ὁμοίαν εἴληφεν οὐδαμῇ οὐδαμῶς· ἐκμαγεῖον γὰρ φύσει παντὶ κεῖται, κινούμενόν τε καὶ διασχηματιζόμενον ὑπὸ τῶν εἰσιόντων, φαίνεται δὲ διʼ ἐκεῖνα ἄλλοτε ἀλλοῖον—τὰ δὲ εἰσιόντα καὶ ἐξιόντα τῶν ὄντων ἀεὶ μιμήματα, τυπωθέντα ἀπʼ αὐτῶν τρόπον τινὰ δύσφραστον καὶ θαυμαστόν, ὃν εἰς αὖθις μέτιμεν. ἐν δʼ οὖν τῷ παρόντι χρὴ γένη διανοηθῆναι τριττά, τὸ μὲν  γιγνόμενον, τὸ δʼ ἐν ᾧ γίγνεται, τὸ δʼ ὅθεν ἀφομοιούμενον φύεται τὸ γιγνόμενον. καὶ δὴ καὶ προσεικάσαι πρέπει τὸ μὲν δεχόμενον μητρί, τὸ δʼ ὅθεν πατρί, τὴν δὲ μεταξὺ τούτων φύσιν ἐκγόνῳ, νοῆσαί τε ὡς οὐκ ἂν ἄλλως, ἐκτυπώματος ἔσεσθαι μέλλοντος ἰδεῖν ποικίλου πάσας ποικιλίας, τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ ἐν ᾧ ἐκτυπούμενον ἐνίσταται γένοιτʼ ἂν παρεσκευασμένον εὖ, πλὴν ἄμορφον ὂν ἐκείνων ἁπασῶν τῶν ἰδεῶν ὅσας  μέλλοι δέχεσθαί ποθεν. ὅμοιον γὰρ ὂν τῶν ἐπεισιόντων τινὶ τὰ τῆς ἐναντίας τά τε τῆς τὸ παράπαν ἄλλης φύσεως ὁπότʼ ἔλθοι δεχόμενον κακῶς ἂν ἀφομοιοῖ, τὴν αὑτοῦ παρεμφαῖνον ὄψιν. διὸ καὶ πάντων ἐκτὸς εἰδῶν εἶναι χρεὼν τὸ τὰ πάντα ἐκδεξόμενον ἐν αὑτῷ γένη, καθάπερ περὶ τὰ ἀλείμματα ὁπόσα εὐώδη τέχνῃ μηχανῶνται πρῶτον τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ ὑπάρχον, ποιοῦσιν ὅτι μάλιστα ἀώδη τὰ δεξόμενα ὑγρὰ τὰς ὀσμάς· ὅσοι τε ἔν τισιν τῶν μαλακῶν σχήματα ἀπομάττειν ἐπιχειροῦσι, τὸ παράπαν σχῆμα οὐδὲν ἔνδηλον ὑπάρχειν ἐῶσι, προομαλύναντες δὲ ὅτι λειότατον ἀπεργάζονται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἐν ᾧ δὲ ἐγγιγνόμενα ἀεὶ ἕκαστα αὐτῶν φαντάζεται καὶ πάλιν ἐκεῖθεν ἀπόλλυται,  μόνον ἐκεῖνο αὖ προσαγορεύειν τῷ τε τοῦτο καὶ τῷ τόδε προσχρωμένους ὀνόματι, τὸ δὲ ὁποιονοῦν τι, θερμὸν ἢ λευκὸν ἢ καὶ ὁτιοῦν τῶν ἐναντίων, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα ἐκ τούτων, μηδὲν ἐκεῖνο αὖ τούτων καλεῖν. ἔτι δὲ σαφέστερον αὐτοῦ πέρι προθυμητέον αὖθις εἰπεῖν. εἰ γὰρ πάντα τις σχήματα πλάσας ἐκ χρυσοῦ μηδὲν μεταπλάττων παύοιτο ἕκαστα εἰς ἅπαντα, δεικνύντος δή τινος αὐτῶν ἓν καὶ ἐρομένου  τί ποτʼ ἐστί, μακρῷ πρὸς ἀλήθειαν ἀσφαλέστατον εἰπεῖν ὅτι χρυσός, τὸ δὲ τρίγωνον ὅσα τε ἄλλα σχήματα ἐνεγίγνετο, μηδέποτε λέγειν ταῦτα ὡς ὄντα, ἅ γε μεταξὺ τιθεμένου μεταπίπτει, ἀλλʼ ἐὰν ἄρα καὶ τὸ τοιοῦτον μετʼ ἀσφαλείας ἐθέλῃ δέχεσθαί τινος, ἀγαπᾶν. ὁ αὐτὸς δὴ λόγος καὶ περὶ τῆς τὰ πάντα δεχομένης σώματα φύσεως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","text":"ταὐτὸν αὐτὴν ἀεὶ προσρητέον· ἐκ γὰρ τῆς ἑαυτῆς τὸ παράπαν οὐκ ἐξίσταται δυνάμεως—δέχεταί τε γὰρ ἀεὶ τὰ πάντα, καὶ  μορφὴν οὐδεμίαν ποτὲ οὐδενὶ τῶν εἰσιόντων ὁμοίαν εἴληφεν οὐδαμῇ οὐδαμῶς· ἐκμαγεῖον γὰρ φύσει παντὶ κεῖται, κινούμενόν τε καὶ διασχηματιζόμενον ὑπὸ τῶν εἰσιόντων, φαίνεται δὲ διʼ ἐκεῖνα ἄλλοτε ἀλλοῖον—τὰ δὲ εἰσιόντα καὶ ἐξιόντα τῶν ὄντων ἀεὶ μιμήματα, τυπωθέντα ἀπʼ αὐτῶν τρόπον τινὰ δύσφραστον καὶ θαυμαστόν, ὃν εἰς αὖθις μέτιμεν. ἐν δʼ οὖν τῷ παρόντι χρὴ γένη διανοηθῆναι τριττά, τὸ μὲν  γιγνόμενον, τὸ δʼ ἐν ᾧ γίγνεται, τὸ δʼ ὅθεν ἀφομοιούμενον φύεται τὸ γιγνόμενον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","text":"καὶ δὴ καὶ προσεικάσαι πρέπει τὸ μὲν δεχόμενον μητρί, τὸ δʼ ὅθεν πατρί, τὴν δὲ μεταξὺ τούτων φύσιν ἐκγόνῳ, νοῆσαί τε ὡς οὐκ ἂν ἄλλως, ἐκτυπώματος ἔσεσθαι μέλλοντος ἰδεῖν ποικίλου πάσας ποικιλίας, τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ ἐν ᾧ ἐκτυπούμενον ἐνίσταται γένοιτʼ ἂν παρεσκευασμένον εὖ, πλὴν ἄμορφον ὂν ἐκείνων ἁπασῶν τῶν ἰδεῶν ὅσας  μέλλοι δέχεσθαί ποθεν. ὅμοιον γὰρ ὂν τῶν ἐπεισιόντων τινὶ τὰ τῆς ἐναντίας τά τε τῆς τὸ παράπαν ἄλλης φύσεως ὁπότʼ ἔλθοι δεχόμενον κακῶς ἂν ἀφομοιοῖ, τὴν αὑτοῦ παρεμφαῖνον ὄψιν. διὸ καὶ πάντων ἐκτὸς εἰδῶν εἶναι χρεὼν τὸ τὰ πάντα ἐκδεξόμενον ἐν αὑτῷ γένη, καθάπερ περὶ τὰ ἀλείμματα ὁπόσα εὐώδη τέχνῃ μηχανῶνται πρῶτον τοῦτʼ αὐτὸ ὑπάρχον, ποιοῦσιν ὅτι μάλιστα ἀώδη τὰ δεξόμενα ὑγρὰ τὰς ὀσμάς· ὅσοι τε ἔν τισιν τῶν μαλακῶν σχήματα ἀπομάττειν ἐπιχειροῦσι, τὸ παράπαν σχῆμα οὐδὲν ἔνδηλον ὑπάρχειν ἐῶσι, προομαλύναντες δὲ ὅτι λειότατον ἀπεργάζονται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"7b22ee402f91b7715fb878207b1a9c426f56a455dacac5639c24a351dbc8c5cc","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224848549538Z_c8adf14e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 50","source_sha256":"7b22ee402f91b7715fb878207b1a9c426f56a455dacac5639c24a351dbc8c5cc","sha256":"91f9014cb0cab0c897a1db0b8a521f54add7ed351691608b2c255ff1997d8a33","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:48.549583+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","text":"And that in which each of them, as it comes to be, continually appears and again thence perishes, that alone we should in turn designate, employing the names “this” and “this here”; but whatever sort of thing it may be—hot or white, or indeed anything whatsoever of the opposites, and all things that arise from these—we should not in turn call it any of these. Yet we must again endeavor to speak more clearly concerning it. For if someone, having fashioned all shapes out of gold, never ceased recasting each into all the others, and someone pointed to one of them and asked what it was, it would be by far safest, with regard to truth, to say that it is gold; but as for the triangle and whatever other shapes came to be in it, never to speak of these as things that are, since they change while he is making the assertion; but if it is willing to accept even the expression “such a thing” with security, one should be content. The same account, then, applies also to the nature that receives all bodies.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","text":"It must always be called the same; for it never at all departs from its own capacity—for it always receives all things, and never in any way or anywhere has it taken on any form like any of the things entering into it. For by nature it lies as a matrix for everything, moved and shaped by the things entering into it, and through them it appears different at different times; while the things entering and departing are always imitations of the things that are, impressed from them in some manner difficult to express and wondrous, which we shall examine again later. For the present, then, three kinds must be conceived: that which comes to be, that in which it comes to be, and that from which, being assimilated, what comes to be grows.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","text":"And indeed it is fitting to liken that which receives to a mother, that from which to a father, and the nature between these to offspring; and to understand that, if it is to be ready to behold an impressed copy varied with every variety, that very thing in which it is impressed could not otherwise be well prepared except by being without form from all those Forms which it may be destined to receive from somewhere. For, being like to any one of the things that enter, whenever it received things of an opposite nature or of a nature altogether different, it would assimilate them badly, showing forth its own appearance. Therefore that which is to receive within itself all kinds must be outside all Forms, just as, in the case of fragrant ointments that craftsmen contrive, they first ensure this very thing: they make the liquids that are to receive the odors as odorless as possible; and those who undertake to impress shapes in any soft substances allow no shape at all to be manifest in them, but first smooth them and make them as even as possible.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"da8126471dea51f45d36ee7f35ef29a557b4bdc154d75413cd3381ca1dfa3b53","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 50"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 50","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31","title":"Section 51","order":35,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_31","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν οὖν καὶ τῷ τὰ τῶν πάντων ἀεί τε ὄντων κατὰ πᾶν ἑαυτοῦ πολλάκις ἀφομοιώματα καλῶς μέλλοντι δέχεσθαι πάντων ἐκτὸς αὐτῷ προσήκει πεφυκέναι τῶν εἰδῶν. διὸ δὴ τὴν τοῦ γεγονότος ὁρατοῦ καὶ πάντως αἰσθητοῦ μητέρα καὶ ὑποδοχὴν μήτε γῆν μήτε ἀέρα μήτε πῦρ μήτε ὕδωρ λέγωμεν, μήτε ὅσα ἐκ τούτων μήτε ἐξ ὧν ταῦτα γέγονεν· ἀλλʼ ἀνόρατον εἶδός τι καὶ ἄμορφον, πανδεχές, μεταλαμβάνον  δὲ ἀπορώτατά πῃ τοῦ νοητοῦ καὶ δυσαλωτότατον αὐτὸ λέγοντες οὐ ψευσόμεθα. καθʼ ὅσον δʼ ἐκ τῶν προειρημένων δυνατὸν ἐφικνεῖσθαι τῆς φύσεως αὐτοῦ, τῇδʼ ἄν τις ὀρθότατα λέγοι· πῦρ μὲν ἑκάστοτε αὐτοῦ τὸ πεπυρωμένον μέρος φαίνεσθαι, τὸ δὲ ὑγρανθὲν ὕδωρ, γῆν τε καὶ ἀέρα καθʼ ὅσον ἂν μιμήματα τούτων δέχηται. λόγῳ δὲ δὴ μᾶλλον τὸ τοιόνδε διοριζομένους περὶ αὐτῶν διασκεπτέον· ἆρα ἔστιν τι πῦρ αὐτὸ ἐφʼ ἑαυτοῦ καὶ πάντα περὶ ὧν ἀεὶ λέγομεν οὕτως  αὐτὰ καθʼ αὑτὰ ὄντα ἕκαστα, ἢ ταῦτα ἅπερ καὶ βλέπομεν, ὅσα τε ἄλλα διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἰσθανόμεθα, μόνα ἐστὶν τοιαύτην ἔχοντα ἀλήθειαν, ἄλλα δὲ οὐκ ἔστι παρὰ ταῦτα οὐδαμῇ οὐδαμῶς, ἀλλὰ μάτην ἑκάστοτε εἶναί τί φαμεν εἶδος ἑκάστου νοητόν, τὸ δʼ οὐδὲν ἄρʼ ἦν πλὴν λόγος; οὔτε οὖν δὴ τὸ παρὸν ἄκριτον καὶ ἀδίκαστον ἀφέντα ἄξιον φάναι διισχυριζόμενον ἔχειν οὕτως, οὔτʼ ἐπὶ λόγου μήκει πάρεργον  ἄλλο μῆκος ἐπεμβλητέον· εἰ δέ τις ὅρος ὁρισθεὶς μέγας διὰ βραχέων φανείη, τοῦτο μάλιστα ἐγκαιριώτατον γένοιτʼ ἄν. ὧδε οὖν τήν γʼ ἐμὴν αὐτὸς τίθεμαι ψῆφον. εἰ μὲν νοῦς καὶ δόξα ἀληθής ἐστον δύο γένη, παντάπασιν εἶναι καθʼ αὑτὰ ταῦτα, ἀναίσθητα ὑφʼ ἡμῶν εἴδη, νοούμενα μόνον· εἰ δʼ, ὥς τισιν φαίνεται, δόξα ἀληθὴς νοῦ διαφέρει τὸ μηδέν, πάνθʼ ὁπόσʼ αὖ διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἰσθανόμεθα θετέον βεβαιότατα.  δύο δὴ λεκτέον ἐκείνω, διότι χωρὶς γεγόνατον ἀνομοίως τε ἔχετον. τὸ μὲν γὰρ αὐτῶν διὰ διδαχῆς, τὸ δʼ ὑπὸ πειθοῦς ἡμῖν ἐγγίγνεται· καὶ τὸ μὲν ἀεὶ μετʼ ἀληθοῦς λόγου, τὸ δὲ ἄλογον· καὶ τὸ μὲν ἀκίνητον πειθοῖ, τὸ δὲ μεταπειστόν· καὶ τοῦ μὲν πάντα ἄνδρα μετέχειν φατέον, νοῦ δὲ θεούς, ἀνθρώπων δὲ γένος βραχύ τι.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν οὖν καὶ τῷ τὰ τῶν πάντων ἀεί τε ὄντων κατὰ πᾶν ἑαυτοῦ πολλάκις ἀφομοιώματα καλῶς μέλλοντι δέχεσθαι πάντων ἐκτὸς αὐτῷ προσήκει πεφυκέναι τῶν εἰδῶν. διὸ δὴ τὴν τοῦ γεγονότος ὁρατοῦ καὶ πάντως αἰσθητοῦ μητέρα καὶ ὑποδοχὴν μήτε γῆν μήτε ἀέρα μήτε πῦρ μήτε ὕδωρ λέγωμεν, μήτε ὅσα ἐκ τούτων μήτε ἐξ ὧν ταῦτα γέγονεν· ἀλλʼ ἀνόρατον εἶδός τι καὶ ἄμορφον, πανδεχές, μεταλαμβάνον  δὲ ἀπορώτατά πῃ τοῦ νοητοῦ καὶ δυσαλωτότατον αὐτὸ λέγοντες οὐ ψευσόμεθα. καθʼ ὅσον δʼ ἐκ τῶν προειρημένων δυνατὸν ἐφικνεῖσθαι τῆς φύσεως αὐτοῦ, τῇδʼ ἄν τις ὀρθότατα λέγοι· πῦρ μὲν ἑκάστοτε αὐτοῦ τὸ πεπυρωμένον μέρος φαίνεσθαι, τὸ δὲ ὑγρανθὲν ὕδωρ, γῆν τε καὶ ἀέρα καθʼ ὅσον ἂν μιμήματα τούτων δέχηται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","text":"λόγῳ δὲ δὴ μᾶλλον τὸ τοιόνδε διοριζομένους περὶ αὐτῶν διασκεπτέον· ἆρα ἔστιν τι πῦρ αὐτὸ ἐφʼ ἑαυτοῦ καὶ πάντα περὶ ὧν ἀεὶ λέγομεν οὕτως  αὐτὰ καθʼ αὑτὰ ὄντα ἕκαστα, ἢ ταῦτα ἅπερ καὶ βλέπομεν, ὅσα τε ἄλλα διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἰσθανόμεθα, μόνα ἐστὶν τοιαύτην ἔχοντα ἀλήθειαν, ἄλλα δὲ οὐκ ἔστι παρὰ ταῦτα οὐδαμῇ οὐδαμῶς, ἀλλὰ μάτην ἑκάστοτε εἶναί τί φαμεν εἶδος ἑκάστου νοητόν, τὸ δʼ οὐδὲν ἄρʼ ἦν πλὴν λόγος; οὔτε οὖν δὴ τὸ παρὸν ἄκριτον καὶ ἀδίκαστον ἀφέντα ἄξιον φάναι διισχυριζόμενον ἔχειν οὕτως, οὔτʼ ἐπὶ λόγου μήκει πάρεργον  ἄλλο μῆκος ἐπεμβλητέον· εἰ δέ τις ὅρος ὁρισθεὶς μέγας διὰ βραχέων φανείη, τοῦτο μάλιστα ἐγκαιριώτατον γένοιτʼ ἄν. ὧδε οὖν τήν γʼ ἐμὴν αὐτὸς τίθεμαι ψῆφον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","text":"εἰ μὲν νοῦς καὶ δόξα ἀληθής ἐστον δύο γένη, παντάπασιν εἶναι καθʼ αὑτὰ ταῦτα, ἀναίσθητα ὑφʼ ἡμῶν εἴδη, νοούμενα μόνον· εἰ δʼ, ὥς τισιν φαίνεται, δόξα ἀληθὴς νοῦ διαφέρει τὸ μηδέν, πάνθʼ ὁπόσʼ αὖ διὰ τοῦ σώματος αἰσθανόμεθα θετέον βεβαιότατα.  δύο δὴ λεκτέον ἐκείνω, διότι χωρὶς γεγόνατον ἀνομοίως τε ἔχετον. τὸ μὲν γὰρ αὐτῶν διὰ διδαχῆς, τὸ δʼ ὑπὸ πειθοῦς ἡμῖν ἐγγίγνεται· καὶ τὸ μὲν ἀεὶ μετʼ ἀληθοῦς λόγου, τὸ δὲ ἄλογον· καὶ τὸ μὲν ἀκίνητον πειθοῖ, τὸ δὲ μεταπειστόν· καὶ τοῦ μὲν πάντα ἄνδρα μετέχειν φατέον, νοῦ δὲ θεούς, ἀνθρώπων δὲ γένος βραχύ τι.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"0246dd828213741ca862f7515737d55bf4f221b488a9056a35070cddb3a4ced7","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224857344502Z_dedbf0a4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 51","source_sha256":"0246dd828213741ca862f7515737d55bf4f221b488a9056a35070cddb3a4ced7","sha256":"86bb05b6aeba7716c57218276d600b2864f98e2a46e7ff68b1995bbfd3e53ced","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:48:57.344650+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","text":"Therefore it is fitting that that which is to receive in all its entirety many likenesses of the things that always are should itself by nature be outside all the Forms. Wherefore let us call the mother and receptacle of what has come to be visible and in every way perceptible neither earth nor air nor fire nor water, nor any of the things composed from these, nor those from which these have come to be; but if we call it a certain invisible and formless kind, all-receptive, partaking in the intelligible in some most perplexing and most hard-to-grasp manner, we shall not speak falsely. So far as it is possible, from what has been said before, to attain to its nature, one might speak most correctly as follows: that at any time the part of it that has been set on fire appears as fire, that which has been moistened as water, and as earth and air insofar as it receives imitations of these.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","text":"But we must rather examine them by making the following distinction in argument: is there some fire itself, by itself, and likewise all those things of which we always say that each is itself by itself; or are these things which we see, and all the others which we perceive through the body, alone possessed of such reality, while besides these there is nowhere and in no way anything else, and it is in vain each time that we say there is some intelligible Form of each thing, whereas it was really nothing but a word? It is neither fitting to leave the present question undistinguished and undecided and assert emphatically that it is so, nor should another length be added as an incidental matter to the length of the argument; but if some great definition, stated in few words, should appear, that would be most timely. Thus, then, I myself cast my vote.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","text":"If intellect and true opinion are two kinds, then these Forms, imperceptible by us and apprehended by intellect alone, most certainly exist by themselves. But if, as seems to some, true opinion differs not at all from intellect, then all the things that we in turn perceive through the body must be held to be most certain.\n\nBut the two must be said to be distinct, because they have come to be separate and are unlike in character. For the one arises in us through teaching, the other through persuasion; and the one is always accompanied by a true account, the other is irrational; and the one is unshaken by persuasion, the other open to persuasion; and of the latter every man must be said to partake, but of intellect the gods, and a small portion of the human race.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"da5ec0ac08c651a5833a024a69dc9411086c7acb5113327e3fc8f4b9f9284cd0","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 51"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 51","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32","title":"Section 52","order":36,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_32","text":"ΤΙ. τούτων δὲ οὕτως ἐχόντων  ὁμολογητέον ἓν μὲν εἶναι τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ εἶδος ἔχον, ἀγέννητον καὶ ἀνώλεθρον, οὔτε εἰς ἑαυτὸ εἰσδεχόμενον ἄλλο ἄλλοθεν οὔτε αὐτὸ εἰς ἄλλο ποι ἰόν, ἀόρατον δὲ καὶ ἄλλως ἀναίσθητον, τοῦτο ὃ δὴ νόησις εἴληχεν ἐπισκοπεῖν· τὸ δὲ ὁμώνυμον ὅμοιόν τε ἐκείνῳ δεύτερον, αἰσθητόν, γεννητόν, πεφορημένον ἀεί, γιγνόμενόν τε ἔν τινι τόπῳ καὶ πάλιν ἐκεῖθεν ἀπολλύμενον, δόξῃ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως περιληπτόν· τρίτον δὲ αὖ γένος ὂν τὸ τῆς χώρας ἀεί, φθορὰν οὐ προσδεχόμενον,  ἕδραν δὲ παρέχον ὅσα ἔχει γένεσιν πᾶσιν, αὐτὸ δὲ μετʼ ἀναισθησίας ἁπτὸν λογισμῷ τινι νόθῳ, μόγις πιστόν, πρὸς ὃ δὴ καὶ ὀνειροπολοῦμεν βλέποντες καί φαμεν ἀναγκαῖον εἶναί που τὸ ὂν ἅπαν ἔν τινι τόπῳ καὶ κατέχον χώραν τινά, τὸ δὲ μήτʼ ἐν γῇ μήτε που κατʼ οὐρανὸν οὐδὲν εἶναι. ταῦτα δὴ πάντα καὶ τούτων ἄλλα ἀδελφὰ καὶ περὶ τὴν ἄυπνον καὶ ἀληθῶς φύσιν ὑπάρχουσαν ὑπὸ ταύτης τῆς ὀνειρώξεως  οὐ δυνατοὶ γιγνόμεθα ἐγερθέντες διοριζόμενοι τἀληθὲς λέγειν, ὡς εἰκόνι μέν, ἐπείπερ οὐδʼ αὐτὸ τοῦτο ἐφʼ ᾧ γέγονεν ἑαυτῆς ἐστιν, ἑτέρου δέ τινος ἀεὶ φέρεται φάντασμα, διὰ ταῦτα ἐν ἑτέρῳ προσήκει τινὶ γίγνεσθαι, οὐσίας ἁμωσγέπως ἀντεχομένην, ἢ μηδὲν τὸ παράπαν αὐτὴν εἶναι, τῷ δὲ ὄντως ὄντι βοηθὸς ὁ διʼ ἀκριβείας ἀληθὴς λόγος, ὡς ἕως ἄν τι τὸ μὲν ἄλλο ᾖ, τὸ δὲ ἄλλο, οὐδέτερον ἐν οὐδετέρῳ ποτὲ γενόμενον  ἓν ἅμα ταὐτὸν καὶ δύο γενήσεσθον. οὗτος μὲν οὖν δὴ παρὰ τῆς ἐμῆς ψήφου λογισθεὶς ἐν κεφαλαίῳ δεδόσθω λόγος, ὄν τε καὶ χώραν καὶ γένεσιν εἶναι, τρία τριχῇ, καὶ πρὶν οὐρανὸν γενέσθαι· τὴν δὲ δὴ γενέσεως τιθήνην ὑγραινομένην καὶ πυρουμένην καὶ τὰς γῆς τε καὶ ἀέρος μορφὰς δεχομένην, καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα τούτοις πάθη συνέπεται  πάσχουσαν, παντοδαπὴν μὲν ἰδεῖν φαίνεσθαι, διὰ δὲ τὸ μήθʼ ὁμοίων δυνάμεων μήτε ἰσορρόπων ἐμπίμπλασθαι κατʼ οὐδὲν αὐτῆς ἰσορροπεῖν, ἀλλʼ ἀνωμάλως πάντῃ ταλαντουμένην σείεσθαι μὲν ὑπʼ ἐκείνων αὐτήν, κινουμένην δʼ αὖ πάλιν ἐκεῖνα σείειν·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τούτων δὲ οὕτως ἐχόντων  ὁμολογητέον ἓν μὲν εἶναι τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ εἶδος ἔχον, ἀγέννητον καὶ ἀνώλεθρον, οὔτε εἰς ἑαυτὸ εἰσδεχόμενον ἄλλο ἄλλοθεν οὔτε αὐτὸ εἰς ἄλλο ποι ἰόν, ἀόρατον δὲ καὶ ἄλλως ἀναίσθητον, τοῦτο ὃ δὴ νόησις εἴληχεν ἐπισκοπεῖν· τὸ δὲ ὁμώνυμον ὅμοιόν τε ἐκείνῳ δεύτερον, αἰσθητόν, γεννητόν, πεφορημένον ἀεί, γιγνόμενόν τε ἔν τινι τόπῳ καὶ πάλιν ἐκεῖθεν ἀπολλύμενον, δόξῃ μετʼ αἰσθήσεως περιληπτόν· τρίτον δὲ αὖ γένος ὂν τὸ τῆς χώρας ἀεί, φθορὰν οὐ προσδεχόμενον,  ἕδραν δὲ παρέχον ὅσα ἔχει γένεσιν πᾶσιν, αὐτὸ δὲ μετʼ ἀναισθησίας ἁπτὸν λογισμῷ τινι νόθῳ, μόγις πιστόν, πρὸς ὃ δὴ καὶ ὀνειροπολοῦμεν βλέποντες καί φαμεν ἀναγκαῖον εἶναί που τὸ ὂν ἅπαν ἔν τινι τόπῳ καὶ κατέχον χώραν τινά, τὸ δὲ μήτʼ ἐν γῇ μήτε που κατʼ οὐρανὸν οὐδὲν εἶναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","text":"ταῦτα δὴ πάντα καὶ τούτων ἄλλα ἀδελφὰ καὶ περὶ τὴν ἄυπνον καὶ ἀληθῶς φύσιν ὑπάρχουσαν ὑπὸ ταύτης τῆς ὀνειρώξεως  οὐ δυνατοὶ γιγνόμεθα ἐγερθέντες διοριζόμενοι τἀληθὲς λέγειν, ὡς εἰκόνι μέν, ἐπείπερ οὐδʼ αὐτὸ τοῦτο ἐφʼ ᾧ γέγονεν ἑαυτῆς ἐστιν, ἑτέρου δέ τινος ἀεὶ φέρεται φάντασμα, διὰ ταῦτα ἐν ἑτέρῳ προσήκει τινὶ γίγνεσθαι, οὐσίας ἁμωσγέπως ἀντεχομένην, ἢ μηδὲν τὸ παράπαν αὐτὴν εἶναι, τῷ δὲ ὄντως ὄντι βοηθὸς ὁ διʼ ἀκριβείας ἀληθὴς λόγος, ὡς ἕως ἄν τι τὸ μὲν ἄλλο ᾖ, τὸ δὲ ἄλλο, οὐδέτερον ἐν οὐδετέρῳ ποτὲ γενόμενον  ἓν ἅμα ταὐτὸν καὶ δύο γενήσεσθον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","text":"οὗτος μὲν οὖν δὴ παρὰ τῆς ἐμῆς ψήφου λογισθεὶς ἐν κεφαλαίῳ δεδόσθω λόγος, ὄν τε καὶ χώραν καὶ γένεσιν εἶναι, τρία τριχῇ, καὶ πρὶν οὐρανὸν γενέσθαι· τὴν δὲ δὴ γενέσεως τιθήνην ὑγραινομένην καὶ πυρουμένην καὶ τὰς γῆς τε καὶ ἀέρος μορφὰς δεχομένην, καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα τούτοις πάθη συνέπεται  πάσχουσαν, παντοδαπὴν μὲν ἰδεῖν φαίνεσθαι, διὰ δὲ τὸ μήθʼ ὁμοίων δυνάμεων μήτε ἰσορρόπων ἐμπίμπλασθαι κατʼ οὐδὲν αὐτῆς ἰσορροπεῖν, ἀλλʼ ἀνωμάλως πάντῃ ταλαντουμένην σείεσθαι μὲν ὑπʼ ἐκείνων αὐτήν, κινουμένην δʼ αὖ πάλιν ἐκεῖνα σείειν·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"58a1d1a3470f9a2cde34d5372f591c72b201b0a95d69af87773871fd808fd49c","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224906447586Z_e016fd45","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 52","source_sha256":"58a1d1a3470f9a2cde34d5372f591c72b201b0a95d69af87773871fd808fd49c","sha256":"24f490870542c2c6991ef6938188ce700a32ed664a77055ed8a7a915a687e7d9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:06.447638+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","text":"TIM. These things being so, it must be agreed that there is, first, that which has its Form always the same, ungenerated and imperishable, neither admitting into itself anything else from elsewhere nor itself going anywhere into another, invisible and otherwise imperceptible—this, indeed, which intellection has obtained to contemplate; and, second, that which bears the same name and is like it, perceptible, generated, always in motion, coming to be in some place and again perishing from there, apprehensible by opinion with perception; and, third, there is always the kind of the χώρα, not admitting destruction, providing a seat for all things that have generation, itself graspable without perception by a certain bastard reasoning, scarcely credible, toward which indeed we gaze as in a dream and say that it is necessary that everything that is be somewhere in some place and occupy some χώρα, while that which is neither on earth nor anywhere under heaven is nothing.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","text":"All these things, then, and other things akin to these, concerning the sleepless and truly existing nature, because of this dream-state we are unable, when awakened, to distinguish and state the truth: that, in the case of an image, since not even that very thing on which it has come to be is its own, but it is always borne as a phantom of some other thing, it is fitting for it to come to be in something else, somehow clinging to being, or else not to be at all; while the precise true account comes to the aid of that which truly is: so long as one thing is one thing and another another, neither, having ever come to be in the other, will become at once one and the same and two.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","text":"Let this, then, be granted as the summary account, reckoned according to my judgment: that being and χώρα and generation are three, threefold, and existed even before heaven came to be. But the nurse of generation, becoming moist and fiery and receiving the forms of earth and air, and undergoing whatever other affections follow upon these, appears manifold to behold; yet, because it is filled with neither similar nor evenly balanced powers, it is in no respect evenly balanced itself, but, being everywhere unevenly swayed, is shaken by those things, and, in turn, being moved, shakes those things.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"cce916a1ee682b80cd7e865fbef58c7d2a2d27911e8e650eb6540546219efc27","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 52"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 52","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33","title":"Section 53","order":37,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_33","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ κινούμενα ἄλλα ἄλλοσε ἀεὶ φέρεσθαι διακρινόμενα, ὥσπερ τὰ ὑπὸ τῶν πλοκάνων τε καὶ ὀργάνων τῶν περὶ τὴν τοῦ σίτου κάθαρσιν σειόμενα καὶ  ἀνικμώμενα τὰ μὲν πυκνὰ καὶ βαρέα ἄλλῃ, τὰ δὲ μανὰ καὶ κοῦφα εἰς ἑτέραν ἵζει φερόμενα ἕδραν· τότε οὕτω τὰ τέτταρα γένη σειόμενα ὑπὸ τῆς δεξαμενῆς, κινουμένης αὐτῆς οἷον ὀργάνου σεισμὸν παρέχοντος, τὰ μὲν ἀνομοιότατα πλεῖστον αὐτὰ ἀφʼ αὑτῶν ὁρίζειν, τὰ δὲ ὁμοιότατα μάλιστα εἰς ταὐτὸν συνωθεῖν, διὸ δὴ καὶ χώραν ταῦτα ἄλλα ἄλλην ἴσχειν, πρὶν καὶ τὸ πᾶν ἐξ αὐτῶν διακοσμηθὲν γενέσθαι. καὶ τὸ μὲν δὴ πρὸ τούτου πάντα ταῦτʼ εἶχεν ἀλόγως καὶ ἀμέτρως·  ὅτε δʼ ἐπεχειρεῖτο κοσμεῖσθαι τὸ πᾶν, πῦρ πρῶτον καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ γῆν καὶ ἀέρα, ἴχνη μὲν ἔχοντα αὑτῶν ἄττα, παντάπασί γε μὴν διακείμενα ὥσπερ εἰκὸς ἔχειν ἅπαν ὅταν ἀπῇ τινος θεός, οὕτω δὴ τότε πεφυκότα ταῦτα πρῶτον διεσχηματίσατο εἴδεσί τε καὶ ἀριθμοῖς. τὸ δὲ ᾗ δυνατὸν ὡς κάλλιστα ἄριστά τε ἐξ οὐχ οὕτως ἐχόντων τὸν θεὸν αὐτὰ συνιστάναι, παρὰ πάντα ἡμῖν ὡς ἀεὶ τοῦτο λεγόμενον ὑπαρχέτω· νῦν δʼ οὖν τὴν διάταξιν αὐτῶν ἐπιχειρητέον ἑκάστων καὶ γένεσιν  ἀήθει λόγῳ πρὸς ὑμᾶς δηλοῦν, ἀλλὰ γὰρ ἐπεὶ μετέχετε τῶν κατὰ παίδευσιν ὁδῶν διʼ ὧν ἐνδείκνυσθαι τὰ λεγόμενα ἀνάγκη, συνέψεσθε. πρῶτον μὲν δὴ πῦρ καὶ γῆ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀὴρ ὅτι σώματά ἐστι, δῆλόν που καὶ παντί· τὸ δὲ τοῦ σώματος εἶδος πᾶν καὶ βάθος ἔχει. τὸ δὲ βάθος αὖ πᾶσα ἀνάγκη τὴν ἐπίπεδον περιειληφέναι φύσιν· ἡ δὲ ὀρθὴ τῆς ἐπιπέδου βάσεως ἐκ τριγώνων συνέστηκεν. τὰ δὲ τρίγωνα πάντα ἐκ δυοῖν ἄρχεται  τριγώνοιν, μίαν μὲν ὀρθὴν ἔχοντος ἑκατέρου γωνίαν, τὰς δὲ ὀξείας· ὧν τὸ μὲν ἕτερον ἑκατέρωθεν ἔχει μέρος γωνίας ὀρθῆς πλευραῖς ἴσαις διῃρημένης, τὸ δʼ ἕτερον ἀνίσοις ἄνισα μέρη νενεμημένης. ταύτην δὴ πυρὸς ἀρχὴν καὶ τῶν ἄλλων σωμάτων ὑποτιθέμεθα κατὰ τὸν μετʼ ἀνάγκης εἰκότα λόγον πορευόμενοι· τὰς δʼ ἔτι τούτων ἀρχὰς ἄνωθεν θεὸς οἶδεν καὶ ἀνδρῶν ὃς ἂν ἐκείνῳ φίλος ᾖ. δεῖ δὴ λέγειν ποῖα  κάλλιστα σώματα γένοιτʼ ἂν τέτταρα, ἀνόμοια μὲν ἑαυτοῖς, δυνατὰ δὲ ἐξ ἀλλήλων αὐτῶν ἄττα διαλυόμενα γίγνεσθαι· τούτου γὰρ τυχόντες ἔχομεν τὴν ἀλήθειαν γενέσεως πέρι γῆς τε καὶ πυρὸς τῶν τε ἀνὰ λόγον ἐν μέσῳ. τόδε γὰρ οὐδενὶ συγχωρησόμεθα, καλλίω τούτων ὁρώμενα σώματα εἶναί που καθʼ ἓν γένος ἕκαστον ὄν. τοῦτʼ οὖν προθυμητέον, τὰ διαφέροντα κάλλει σωμάτων τέτταρα γένη συναρμόσασθαι καὶ φάναι τὴν τούτων ἡμᾶς φύσιν ἱκανῶς εἰληφέναι.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ κινούμενα ἄλλα ἄλλοσε ἀεὶ φέρεσθαι διακρινόμενα, ὥσπερ τὰ ὑπὸ τῶν πλοκάνων τε καὶ ὀργάνων τῶν περὶ τὴν τοῦ σίτου κάθαρσιν σειόμενα καὶ  ἀνικμώμενα τὰ μὲν πυκνὰ καὶ βαρέα ἄλλῃ, τὰ δὲ μανὰ καὶ κοῦφα εἰς ἑτέραν ἵζει φερόμενα ἕδραν· τότε οὕτω τὰ τέτταρα γένη σειόμενα ὑπὸ τῆς δεξαμενῆς, κινουμένης αὐτῆς οἷον ὀργάνου σεισμὸν παρέχοντος, τὰ μὲν ἀνομοιότατα πλεῖστον αὐτὰ ἀφʼ αὑτῶν ὁρίζειν, τὰ δὲ ὁμοιότατα μάλιστα εἰς ταὐτὸν συνωθεῖν, διὸ δὴ καὶ χώραν ταῦτα ἄλλα ἄλλην ἴσχειν, πρὶν καὶ τὸ πᾶν ἐξ αὐτῶν διακοσμηθὲν γενέσθαι. καὶ τὸ μὲν δὴ πρὸ τούτου πάντα ταῦτʼ εἶχεν ἀλόγως καὶ ἀμέτρως·  ὅτε δʼ ἐπεχειρεῖτο κοσμεῖσθαι τὸ πᾶν, πῦρ πρῶτον καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ γῆν καὶ ἀέρα, ἴχνη μὲν ἔχοντα αὑτῶν ἄττα, παντάπασί γε μὴν διακείμενα ὥσπερ εἰκὸς ἔχειν ἅπαν ὅταν ἀπῇ τινος θεός, οὕτω δὴ τότε πεφυκότα ταῦτα πρῶτον διεσχηματίσατο εἴδεσί τε καὶ ἀριθμοῖς.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","text":"τὸ δὲ ᾗ δυνατὸν ὡς κάλλιστα ἄριστά τε ἐξ οὐχ οὕτως ἐχόντων τὸν θεὸν αὐτὰ συνιστάναι, παρὰ πάντα ἡμῖν ὡς ἀεὶ τοῦτο λεγόμενον ὑπαρχέτω· νῦν δʼ οὖν τὴν διάταξιν αὐτῶν ἐπιχειρητέον ἑκάστων καὶ γένεσιν  ἀήθει λόγῳ πρὸς ὑμᾶς δηλοῦν, ἀλλὰ γὰρ ἐπεὶ μετέχετε τῶν κατὰ παίδευσιν ὁδῶν διʼ ὧν ἐνδείκνυσθαι τὰ λεγόμενα ἀνάγκη, συνέψεσθε. πρῶτον μὲν δὴ πῦρ καὶ γῆ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀὴρ ὅτι σώματά ἐστι, δῆλόν που καὶ παντί· τὸ δὲ τοῦ σώματος εἶδος πᾶν καὶ βάθος ἔχει. τὸ δὲ βάθος αὖ πᾶσα ἀνάγκη τὴν ἐπίπεδον περιειληφέναι φύσιν· ἡ δὲ ὀρθὴ τῆς ἐπιπέδου βάσεως ἐκ τριγώνων συνέστηκεν. τὰ δὲ τρίγωνα πάντα ἐκ δυοῖν ἄρχεται  τριγώνοιν, μίαν μὲν ὀρθὴν ἔχοντος ἑκατέρου γωνίαν, τὰς δὲ ὀξείας· ὧν τὸ μὲν ἕτερον ἑκατέρωθεν ἔχει μέρος γωνίας ὀρθῆς πλευραῖς ἴσαις διῃρημένης, τὸ δʼ ἕτερον ἀνίσοις ἄνισα μέρη νενεμημένης.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","text":"ταύτην δὴ πυρὸς ἀρχὴν καὶ τῶν ἄλλων σωμάτων ὑποτιθέμεθα κατὰ τὸν μετʼ ἀνάγκης εἰκότα λόγον πορευόμενοι· τὰς δʼ ἔτι τούτων ἀρχὰς ἄνωθεν θεὸς οἶδεν καὶ ἀνδρῶν ὃς ἂν ἐκείνῳ φίλος ᾖ. δεῖ δὴ λέγειν ποῖα  κάλλιστα σώματα γένοιτʼ ἂν τέτταρα, ἀνόμοια μὲν ἑαυτοῖς, δυνατὰ δὲ ἐξ ἀλλήλων αὐτῶν ἄττα διαλυόμενα γίγνεσθαι· τούτου γὰρ τυχόντες ἔχομεν τὴν ἀλήθειαν γενέσεως πέρι γῆς τε καὶ πυρὸς τῶν τε ἀνὰ λόγον ἐν μέσῳ. τόδε γὰρ οὐδενὶ συγχωρησόμεθα, καλλίω τούτων ὁρώμενα σώματα εἶναί που καθʼ ἓν γένος ἕκαστον ὄν. τοῦτʼ οὖν προθυμητέον, τὰ διαφέροντα κάλλει σωμάτων τέτταρα γένη συναρμόσασθαι καὶ φάναι τὴν τούτων ἡμᾶς φύσιν ἱκανῶς εἰληφέναι.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"41662fd1cb3d195e0c21a84ef2052b4ed352267abf3fcca21cf2e97ec5f8e3ef","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224917024734Z_667ad069","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 53","source_sha256":"41662fd1cb3d195e0c21a84ef2052b4ed352267abf3fcca21cf2e97ec5f8e3ef","sha256":"1f0e9132fdd7b2c204962f3c5cc7ae01cb1b549d8ce6261807a00003f38d2cc1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:17.024857+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","text":"TI. And the things that are in motion are always carried in different directions, being separated, just as the things shaken and winnowed by the wicker baskets and implements used in the cleansing of grain—the dense and heavy settling in one place, the sparse and light being carried to another resting-place. So then the four kinds, shaken by the receptacle, itself in motion and providing, as it were, a shaking such as that of an instrument, would separate themselves from one another most greatly when most unlike, and would thrust themselves together into the same place most when most alike; whence indeed these came to occupy different regions, before even the universe composed from them had come to be ordered. And before this, all these things had them without reason and without measure; but when the universe was undertaken to be ordered, fire first and water and earth and air—having certain traces of themselves, but being altogether in the condition in which it is likely that everything is whenever a god is absent from it—being thus constituted at that time, he first fashioned them by means of forms and numbers.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","text":"But that, so far as possible, the god constituted them most beautifully and best out of things not so disposed, let this stand for us, as having always been said throughout. Now, then, we must attempt to make clear to you, by an unfamiliar account, their arrangement and the generation of each; but since you share in those paths of education through which it is necessary to demonstrate what is said, you will follow. First, then, that fire and earth and water and air are bodies is surely clear to everyone; and every form of body also has depth. And every depth must necessarily embrace the nature of plane surface; and the rectilinear basis of plane surface is composed of triangles. All triangles begin from two triangles, each having one right angle and acute angles; of these, the one has on each side equal portions of a right angle divided by equal sides, while the other has unequal portions distributed by unequal sides.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","text":"This, then, we posit as the principle of fire and of the other bodies, proceeding in accordance with the likely account that goes together with necessity; but the principles still higher than these are known to god, and to whatever man is dear to him. We must then say what four bodies would come to be most beautiful, unlike one another, yet capable, when certain of them are dissolved, of coming to be from one another. For if we attain this, we possess the truth concerning the generation of earth and fire and those intermediate between them according to proportion. For we shall concede to no one that there are anywhere bodies more beautiful than these, each being of a single kind. We must therefore be eager to fit together the four kinds of bodies that differ in beauty, and to say that we have sufficiently grasped their nature.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"214354105a88dbf107cb881e241dd5ebcf08f93859cec696abf327fb5b905561","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 53"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 53","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34","title":"Section 54","order":38,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_34","text":"ΤΙ. τοῖν δὴ δυοῖν τριγώνοιν τὸ μὲν ἰσοσκελὲς μίαν εἴληχεν φύσιν, τὸ δὲ πρόμηκες ἀπεράντους· προαιρετέον οὖν αὖ τῶν ἀπείρων τὸ κάλλιστον, εἰ μέλλομεν ἄρξεσθαι κατὰ τρόπον. ἂν οὖν τις ἔχῃ κάλλιον ἐκλεξάμενος εἰπεῖν εἰς τὴν τούτων σύστασιν, ἐκεῖνος οὐκ ἐχθρὸς ὢν ἀλλὰ φίλος κρατεῖ· τιθέμεθα δʼ οὖν τῶν πολλῶν τριγώνων κάλλιστον ἕν, ὑπερβάντες τἆλλα, ἐξ οὗ τὸ ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον ἐκ τρίτου συνέστηκεν.  διότι δέ, λόγος πλείων· ἀλλὰ τῷ τοῦτο ἐλέγξαντι καὶ ἀνευρόντι δὴ οὕτως ἔχον κεῖται φίλια τὰ ἆθλα. προῃρήσθω δὴ δύο τρίγωνα ἐξ ὧν τό τε τοῦ πυρὸς καὶ τὰ τῶν ἄλλων σώματα μεμηχάνηται, τὸ μὲν ἰσοσκελές, τὸ δὲ τριπλῆν κατὰ δύναμιν ἔχον τῆς ἐλάττονος τὴν μείζω πλευρὰν ἀεί. τὸ δὴ πρόσθεν ἀσαφῶς ῥηθὲν νῦν μᾶλλον διοριστέον. τὰ γὰρ τέτταρα γένη διʼ ἀλλήλων εἰς ἄλληλα ἐφαίνετο πάντα γένεσιν ἔχειν, οὐκ ὀρθῶς φανταζόμενα· γίγνεται μὲν γὰρ ἐκ  τῶν τριγώνων ὧν προῃρήμεθα γένη τέτταρα, τρία μὲν ἐξ ἑνὸς τοῦ τὰς πλευρὰς ἀνίσους ἔχοντος, τὸ δὲ τέταρτον ἓν μόνον ἐκ τοῦ ἰσοσκελοῦς τριγώνου συναρμοσθέν. οὔκουν δυνατὰ πάντα εἰς ἄλληλα διαλυόμενα ἐκ πολλῶν σμικρῶν ὀλίγα μεγάλα καὶ τοὐναντίον γίγνεσθαι, τὰ δὲ τρία οἷόν τε· ἐκ γὰρ ἑνὸς ἅπαντα πεφυκότα λυθέντων τε τῶν μειζόνων πολλὰ σμικρὰ ἐκ τῶν αὐτῶν συστήσεται, δεχόμενα τὰ προσήκοντα ἑαυτοῖς σχήματα, καὶ σμικρὰ ὅταν αὖ πολλὰ κατὰ  τὰ τρίγωνα διασπαρῇ, γενόμενος εἷς ἀριθμὸς ἑνὸς ὄγκου μέγα ἀποτελέσειεν ἂν ἄλλο εἶδος ἕν. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν λελέχθω περὶ τῆς εἰς ἄλληλα γενέσεως· οἷον δὲ ἕκαστον αὐτῶν γέγονεν εἶδος καὶ ἐξ ὅσων συμπεσόντων ἀριθμῶν, λέγειν ἂν ἑπόμενον εἴη. ἄρξει δὴ τό τε πρῶτον εἶδος καὶ σμικρότατον συνιστάμενον, στοιχεῖον δʼ αὐτοῦ τὸ τὴν ὑποτείνουσαν τῆς ἐλάττονος πλευρᾶς διπλασίαν ἔχον μήκει· σύνδυο δὲ τοιούτων κατὰ διάμετρον συντιθεμένων καὶ τρὶς τούτου  γενομένου, τὰς διαμέτρους καὶ τὰς βραχείας πλευρὰς εἰς ταὐτὸν ὡς κέντρον ἐρεισάντων, ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον ἐξ ἓξ τὸν ἀριθμὸν ὄντων γέγονεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τοῖν δὴ δυοῖν τριγώνοιν τὸ μὲν ἰσοσκελὲς μίαν εἴληχεν φύσιν, τὸ δὲ πρόμηκες ἀπεράντους· προαιρετέον οὖν αὖ τῶν ἀπείρων τὸ κάλλιστον, εἰ μέλλομεν ἄρξεσθαι κατὰ τρόπον. ἂν οὖν τις ἔχῃ κάλλιον ἐκλεξάμενος εἰπεῖν εἰς τὴν τούτων σύστασιν, ἐκεῖνος οὐκ ἐχθρὸς ὢν ἀλλὰ φίλος κρατεῖ· τιθέμεθα δʼ οὖν τῶν πολλῶν τριγώνων κάλλιστον ἕν, ὑπερβάντες τἆλλα, ἐξ οὗ τὸ ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον ἐκ τρίτου συνέστηκεν.  διότι δέ, λόγος πλείων· ἀλλὰ τῷ τοῦτο ἐλέγξαντι καὶ ἀνευρόντι δὴ οὕτως ἔχον κεῖται φίλια τὰ ἆθλα. προῃρήσθω δὴ δύο τρίγωνα ἐξ ὧν τό τε τοῦ πυρὸς καὶ τὰ τῶν ἄλλων σώματα μεμηχάνηται, τὸ μὲν ἰσοσκελές, τὸ δὲ τριπλῆν κατὰ δύναμιν ἔχον τῆς ἐλάττονος τὴν μείζω πλευρὰν ἀεί. τὸ δὴ πρόσθεν ἀσαφῶς ῥηθὲν νῦν μᾶλλον διοριστέον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","text":"τὰ γὰρ τέτταρα γένη διʼ ἀλλήλων εἰς ἄλληλα ἐφαίνετο πάντα γένεσιν ἔχειν, οὐκ ὀρθῶς φανταζόμενα· γίγνεται μὲν γὰρ ἐκ  τῶν τριγώνων ὧν προῃρήμεθα γένη τέτταρα, τρία μὲν ἐξ ἑνὸς τοῦ τὰς πλευρὰς ἀνίσους ἔχοντος, τὸ δὲ τέταρτον ἓν μόνον ἐκ τοῦ ἰσοσκελοῦς τριγώνου συναρμοσθέν. οὔκουν δυνατὰ πάντα εἰς ἄλληλα διαλυόμενα ἐκ πολλῶν σμικρῶν ὀλίγα μεγάλα καὶ τοὐναντίον γίγνεσθαι, τὰ δὲ τρία οἷόν τε· ἐκ γὰρ ἑνὸς ἅπαντα πεφυκότα λυθέντων τε τῶν μειζόνων πολλὰ σμικρὰ ἐκ τῶν αὐτῶν συστήσεται, δεχόμενα τὰ προσήκοντα ἑαυτοῖς σχήματα, καὶ σμικρὰ ὅταν αὖ πολλὰ κατὰ  τὰ τρίγωνα διασπαρῇ, γενόμενος εἷς ἀριθμὸς ἑνὸς ὄγκου μέγα ἀποτελέσειεν ἂν ἄλλο εἶδος ἕν. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν λελέχθω περὶ τῆς εἰς ἄλληλα γενέσεως· οἷον δὲ ἕκαστον αὐτῶν γέγονεν εἶδος καὶ ἐξ ὅσων συμπεσόντων ἀριθμῶν, λέγειν ἂν ἑπόμενον εἴη.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","text":"ἄρξει δὴ τό τε πρῶτον εἶδος καὶ σμικρότατον συνιστάμενον, στοιχεῖον δʼ αὐτοῦ τὸ τὴν ὑποτείνουσαν τῆς ἐλάττονος πλευρᾶς διπλασίαν ἔχον μήκει· σύνδυο δὲ τοιούτων κατὰ διάμετρον συντιθεμένων καὶ τρὶς τούτου  γενομένου, τὰς διαμέτρους καὶ τὰς βραχείας πλευρὰς εἰς ταὐτὸν ὡς κέντρον ἐρεισάντων, ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον ἐξ ἓξ τὸν ἀριθμὸν ὄντων γέγονεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"ab4d2b25fbf1744d0b1402fbf7e07522adb43cb56563dc0fb895365efc615be1","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224928266013Z_632225d6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 54","source_sha256":"ab4d2b25fbf1744d0b1402fbf7e07522adb43cb56563dc0fb895365efc615be1","sha256":"50a5cfbb01e11238063b45f62651cb71bdc5d9e948caf322f0415029d8a49aff","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:28.266043+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","text":"TI. Of the two triangles, then, the isosceles has received one nature, but the scalene infinitely many; we must therefore again choose the most beautiful among the infinite, if we are to proceed in due fashion. If, then, anyone is able to say that he has selected a more beautiful one for the construction of these, he prevails not as an enemy but as a friend. We, however, set down as the most beautiful one among the many triangles, passing over the rest, that from which the equilateral triangle has been constituted out of three. Why this is so requires a longer account; but the prizes are laid up in friendship for him who tests this and discovers that it is indeed so. Let, then, two triangles be selected, from which both the body of fire and those of the other things have been contrived: the one isosceles, the other having always its greater side threefold in power to the lesser. What was previously said obscurely must now be more precisely defined.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","text":"For the four kinds appeared all to have generation into one another through one another, but this appearance was not correct. For four kinds are generated from the triangles which we have selected: three from the one which has unequal sides, but the fourth, one only, fitted together from the isosceles triangle. Therefore it is not possible for all, by being dissolved into one another, to become from many small things a few large ones, and conversely; but it is possible for the three. For, since all are by nature from one, when the larger ones are dissolved, many small ones will be put together from the same things, receiving the shapes proper to themselves; and again, whenever many small ones are dispersed according to the triangles, having become one number they might produce one large bulk, one other kind. Let this, then, have been said concerning their generation into one another; and it would next be consequent to say what form each of them has come to be, and from the concurrence of how many numbers.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","text":"The first form, then, and that which is constituted as smallest, will begin; and its element is that which has its hypotenuse double in length of the lesser side. When two such are combined along a diagonal, and this happens three times, with the diagonals and the short sides resting together upon the same point as a centre, one equilateral triangle, six in number, has come to be.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"cc40d03972debadf70ed42b2d6310ac81bd83a9bd34ff4309275032663146146","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 54"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 54","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35","title":"Section 55","order":39,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_35","text":"ΤΙ. τρίγωνα δὲ ἰσόπλευρα συνιστάμενα τέτταρα κατὰ σύντρεις ἐπιπέδους γωνίας μίαν στερεὰν  γωνίαν ποιεῖ, τῆς ἀμβλυτάτης τῶν ἐπιπέδων γωνιῶν ἐφεξῆς γεγονυῖαν· τοιούτων δὲ ἀποτελεσθεισῶν τεττάρων πρῶτον εἶδος στερεόν, ὅλου περιφεροῦς διανεμητικὸν εἰς ἴσα μέρη καὶ ὅμοια, συνίσταται. δεύτερον δὲ ἐκ μὲν τῶν αὐτῶν τριγώνων, κατὰ δὲ ἰσόπλευρα τρίγωνα ὀκτὼ συστάντων, μίαν ἀπεργασαμένων στερεὰν γωνίαν ἐκ τεττάρων ἐπιπέδων· καὶ γενομένων ἓξ τοιούτων τὸ δεύτερον αὖ σῶμα οὕτως ἔσχεν τέλος. τὸ δὲ τρίτον ἐκ δὶς ἑξήκοντα τῶν στοιχείων συμπαγέντων,  στερεῶν δὲ γωνιῶν δώδεκα, ὑπὸ πέντε ἐπιπέδων τριγώνων ἰσοπλεύρων περιεχομένης ἑκάστης, εἴκοσι βάσεις ἔχον ἰσοπλεύρους τριγώνους γέγονεν. καὶ τὸ μὲν ἕτερον ἀπήλλακτο τῶν στοιχείων ταῦτα γεννῆσαν, τὸ δὲ ἰσοσκελὲς τρίγωνον ἐγέννα τὴν τοῦ τετάρτου φύσιν, κατὰ τέτταρα συνιστάμενον, εἰς τὸ κέντρον τὰς ὀρθὰς γωνίας συνάγον, ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τετράγωνον ἀπεργασάμενον· ἓξ δὲ τοιαῦτα  συμπαγέντα γωνίας ὀκτὼ στερεὰς ἀπετέλεσεν, κατὰ τρεῖς ἐπιπέδους ὀρθὰς συναρμοσθείσης ἑκάστης· τὸ δὲ σχῆμα τοῦ συστάντος σώματος γέγονεν κυβικόν, ἓξ ἐπιπέδους τετραγώνους ἰσοπλεύρους βάσεις ἔχον. ἔτι δὲ οὔσης συστάσεως μιᾶς πέμπτης, ἐπὶ τὸ πᾶν ὁ θεὸς αὐτῇ κατεχρήσατο ἐκεῖνο διαζωγραφῶν. ἃ δή τις εἰ πάντα λογιζόμενος ἐμμελῶς ἀποροῖ πότερον ἀπείρους χρὴ κόσμους εἶναι λέγειν ἢ πέρας ἔχοντας, τὸ μὲν  ἀπείρους ἡγήσαιτʼ ἂν ὄντως ἀπείρου τινὸς εἶναι δόγμα ὧν ἔμπειρον χρεὼν εἶναι, πότερον δὲ ἕνα ἢ πέντε αὐτοὺς ἀληθείᾳ πεφυκότας λέγειν ποτὲ προσήκει, μᾶλλον ἂν ταύτῃ στὰς εἰκότως διαπορήσαι. τὸ μὲν οὖν δὴ παρʼ ἡμῶν ἕνα αὐτὸν κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον πεφυκότα μηνύει θεόν, ἄλλος δὲ εἰς ἄλλα πῃ βλέψας ἕτερα δοξάσει. καὶ τοῦτον μὲν μεθετέον, τὰ δὲ γεγονότα νῦν τῷ λόγῳ γένη διανείμωμεν εἰς πῦρ καὶ γῆν καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀέρα. γῇ μὲν δὴ τὸ κυβικὸν εἶδος δῶμεν·  ἀκινητοτάτη γὰρ τῶν τεττάρων γενῶν γῆ καὶ τῶν σωμάτων πλαστικωτάτη, μάλιστα δὲ ἀνάγκη γεγονέναι τοιοῦτον τὸ τὰς βάσεις ἀσφαλεστάτας ἔχον· βάσις δὲ ἥ τε τῶν κατʼ ἀρχὰς τριγώνων ὑποτεθέντων ἀσφαλεστέρα κατὰ φύσιν ἡ τῶν ἴσων πλευρῶν τῆς τῶν ἀνίσων, τό τε ἐξ ἑκατέρου συντεθὲν ἐπίπεδον ἰσόπλευρον ἰσοπλεύρου τετράγωνον τριγώνου κατά τε μέρη καὶ καθʼ ὅλον στασιμωτέρως ἐξ ἀνάγκης βέβηκεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τρίγωνα δὲ ἰσόπλευρα συνιστάμενα τέτταρα κατὰ σύντρεις ἐπιπέδους γωνίας μίαν στερεὰν  γωνίαν ποιεῖ, τῆς ἀμβλυτάτης τῶν ἐπιπέδων γωνιῶν ἐφεξῆς γεγονυῖαν· τοιούτων δὲ ἀποτελεσθεισῶν τεττάρων πρῶτον εἶδος στερεόν, ὅλου περιφεροῦς διανεμητικὸν εἰς ἴσα μέρη καὶ ὅμοια, συνίσταται. δεύτερον δὲ ἐκ μὲν τῶν αὐτῶν τριγώνων, κατὰ δὲ ἰσόπλευρα τρίγωνα ὀκτὼ συστάντων, μίαν ἀπεργασαμένων στερεὰν γωνίαν ἐκ τεττάρων ἐπιπέδων· καὶ γενομένων ἓξ τοιούτων τὸ δεύτερον αὖ σῶμα οὕτως ἔσχεν τέλος. τὸ δὲ τρίτον ἐκ δὶς ἑξήκοντα τῶν στοιχείων συμπαγέντων,  στερεῶν δὲ γωνιῶν δώδεκα, ὑπὸ πέντε ἐπιπέδων τριγώνων ἰσοπλεύρων περιεχομένης ἑκάστης, εἴκοσι βάσεις ἔχον ἰσοπλεύρους τριγώνους γέγονεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","text":"καὶ τὸ μὲν ἕτερον ἀπήλλακτο τῶν στοιχείων ταῦτα γεννῆσαν, τὸ δὲ ἰσοσκελὲς τρίγωνον ἐγέννα τὴν τοῦ τετάρτου φύσιν, κατὰ τέτταρα συνιστάμενον, εἰς τὸ κέντρον τὰς ὀρθὰς γωνίας συνάγον, ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τετράγωνον ἀπεργασάμενον· ἓξ δὲ τοιαῦτα  συμπαγέντα γωνίας ὀκτὼ στερεὰς ἀπετέλεσεν, κατὰ τρεῖς ἐπιπέδους ὀρθὰς συναρμοσθείσης ἑκάστης· τὸ δὲ σχῆμα τοῦ συστάντος σώματος γέγονεν κυβικόν, ἓξ ἐπιπέδους τετραγώνους ἰσοπλεύρους βάσεις ἔχον. ἔτι δὲ οὔσης συστάσεως μιᾶς πέμπτης, ἐπὶ τὸ πᾶν ὁ θεὸς αὐτῇ κατεχρήσατο ἐκεῖνο διαζωγραφῶν. ἃ δή τις εἰ πάντα λογιζόμενος ἐμμελῶς ἀποροῖ πότερον ἀπείρους χρὴ κόσμους εἶναι λέγειν ἢ πέρας ἔχοντας, τὸ μὲν  ἀπείρους ἡγήσαιτʼ ἂν ὄντως ἀπείρου τινὸς εἶναι δόγμα ὧν ἔμπειρον χρεὼν εἶναι, πότερον δὲ ἕνα ἢ πέντε αὐτοὺς ἀληθείᾳ πεφυκότας λέγειν ποτὲ προσήκει, μᾶλλον ἂν ταύτῃ στὰς εἰκότως διαπορήσαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","text":"τὸ μὲν οὖν δὴ παρʼ ἡμῶν ἕνα αὐτὸν κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον πεφυκότα μηνύει θεόν, ἄλλος δὲ εἰς ἄλλα πῃ βλέψας ἕτερα δοξάσει. καὶ τοῦτον μὲν μεθετέον, τὰ δὲ γεγονότα νῦν τῷ λόγῳ γένη διανείμωμεν εἰς πῦρ καὶ γῆν καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀέρα. γῇ μὲν δὴ τὸ κυβικὸν εἶδος δῶμεν·  ἀκινητοτάτη γὰρ τῶν τεττάρων γενῶν γῆ καὶ τῶν σωμάτων πλαστικωτάτη, μάλιστα δὲ ἀνάγκη γεγονέναι τοιοῦτον τὸ τὰς βάσεις ἀσφαλεστάτας ἔχον· βάσις δὲ ἥ τε τῶν κατʼ ἀρχὰς τριγώνων ὑποτεθέντων ἀσφαλεστέρα κατὰ φύσιν ἡ τῶν ἴσων πλευρῶν τῆς τῶν ἀνίσων, τό τε ἐξ ἑκατέρου συντεθὲν ἐπίπεδον ἰσόπλευρον ἰσοπλεύρου τετράγωνον τριγώνου κατά τε μέρη καὶ καθʼ ὅλον στασιμωτέρως ἐξ ἀνάγκης βέβηκεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"81da5bb2aaaae48ecd663e49f86598094a2272accbe2812be503cab35ac26c57","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224937757561Z_8cf001d1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 55","source_sha256":"81da5bb2aaaae48ecd663e49f86598094a2272accbe2812be503cab35ac26c57","sha256":"08b4e0b613e966153b72076fed5baa62d4d50310c674fbeb438559bda11440cd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:37.757589+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","text":"TI. Four equilateral triangles, then, when put together with three plane angles, produce one solid angle, succeeding the most obtuse of the plane angles; and when four such angles have been completed, the first solid figure is constituted, dividing the whole circumference into equal and similar parts. The second, again, is from the same triangles, but when eight equilateral triangles have been combined, producing one solid angle from four plane angles; and when six such angles have come into being, the second body in turn thus reached its completion. The third, compacted from twice sixty of the elements, and having twelve solid angles, each contained by five equilateral plane triangles, has come to have twenty bases, equilateral triangles.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","text":"And the one sort had done with producing these elements, whereas the isosceles triangle produced the nature of the fourth, being combined four at a time, bringing their right angles together toward the centre, and making one equilateral square; and six such squares, compacted together, completed eight solid angles, each fitted together from three right plane angles. And the figure of the body so constituted became cubic, having six plane, equilateral square bases. Moreover, since there was one fifth composition, the god made use of it for the whole, painting it in diverse colours.\n\nIf, then, someone, calculating all these things correctly, should be at a loss whether one ought to say that there are worlds without limit or having a limit, he would consider the opinion that they are without limit to be truly the doctrine of someone ignorant of those things of which he ought to have experience; but whether it is ever fitting to say that they are by nature one or five in truth—taking his stand on this point, he would more reasonably be perplexed.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","text":"Our account, then, declares that it is one, by nature, according to the likely account, made by god; but another person, looking elsewhere in some other respect, will hold other opinions. Let him be dismissed; and let us now distribute the kinds which have come to be in our account among fire and earth and water and air. To earth, then, let us assign the cubic form; for earth is the most immovable of the four kinds and the most plastic of bodies, and it is especially necessary that that which has the most secure bases should have become such. Now, of the triangles postulated at the beginning, the base with equal sides is by nature more secure than that with unequal sides; and the equilateral plane composed from each of them—both the equilateral square and the equilateral triangle—has necessarily taken a more stable stand, both in its parts and as a whole.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"b24ff14696cb83aaa8449bfd7d293bec209ea2ddef39def9306f6c65c724b8dc","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 55"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 55","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36","title":"Section 56","order":40,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_36","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ  γῇ μὲν τοῦτο ἀπονέμοντες τὸν εἰκότα λόγον διασῴζομεν, ὕδατι δʼ αὖ τῶν λοιπῶν τὸ δυσκινητότατον εἶδος, τὸ δʼ εὐκινητότατον πυρί, τὸ δὲ μέσον ἀέρι· καὶ τὸ μὲν σμικρότατον σῶμα πυρί, τὸ δʼ αὖ μέγιστον ὕδατι, τὸ δὲ μέσον ἀέρι· καὶ τὸ μὲν ὀξύτατον αὖ πυρί, τὸ δὲ δεύτερον ἀέρι, τὸ δὲ τρίτον ὕδατι. ταῦτʼ οὖν δὴ πάντα, τὸ μὲν ἔχον ὀλιγίστας βάσεις εὐκινητότατον ἀνάγκη πεφυκέναι, τμητικώτατόν τε  καὶ ὀξύτατον ὂν πάντῃ πάντων, ἔτι τε ἐλαφρότατον, ἐξ ὀλιγίστων συνεστὸς τῶν αὐτῶν μερῶν· τὸ δὲ δεύτερον δευτέρως τὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἔχειν, τρίτως δὲ τὸ τρίτον. ἔστω δὴ κατὰ τὸν ὀρθὸν λόγον καὶ κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα τὸ μὲν τῆς πυραμίδος στερεὸν γεγονὸς εἶδος πυρὸς στοιχεῖον καὶ σπέρμα· τὸ δὲ δεύτερον κατὰ γένεσιν εἴπωμεν ἀέρος, τὸ δὲ τρίτον ὕδατος. πάντα οὖν δὴ ταῦτα δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι σμικρὰ οὕτως, ὡς καθʼ  ἓν ἕκαστον μὲν τοῦ γένους ἑκάστου διὰ σμικρότητα οὐδὲν ὁρώμενον ὑφʼ ἡμῶν, συναθροισθέντων δὲ πολλῶν τοὺς ὄγκους αὐτῶν ὁρᾶσθαι· καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν ἀναλογιῶν περί τε τὰ πλήθη καὶ τὰς κινήσεις καὶ τὰς ἄλλας δυνάμεις πανταχῇ τὸν θεόν, ὅπῃπερ ἡ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἑκοῦσα πεισθεῖσά τε φύσις ὑπεῖκεν, ταύτῃ πάντῃ διʼ ἀκριβείας ἀποτελεσθεισῶν ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ συνηρμόσθαι ταῦτα ἀνὰ λόγον. ἐκ δὴ πάντων ὧνπερ τὰ γένη προειρήκαμεν ὧδʼ ἂν κατὰ  τὸ εἰκὸς μάλιστʼ ἂν ἔχοι. γῆ μὲν συντυγχάνουσα πυρὶ διαλυθεῖσά τε ὑπὸ τῆς ὀξύτητος αὐτοῦ φέροιτʼ ἄν, εἴτʼ ἐν αὐτῷ πυρὶ λυθεῖσα εἴτʼ ἐν ἀέρος εἴτʼ ἐν ὕδατος ὄγκῳ τύχοι, μέχριπερ ἂν αὐτῆς πῃ συντυχόντα τὰ μέρη, πάλιν συναρμοσθέντα αὐτὰ αὑτοῖς, γῆ γένοιτο—οὐ γὰρ εἰς ἄλλο γε εἶδος ἔλθοι ποτʼ ἄν—ὕδωρ δὲ ὑπὸ πυρὸς μερισθέν, εἴτε καὶ ὑπʼ ἀέρος, ἐγχωρεῖ γίγνεσθαι συστάντα ἓν μὲν πυρὸς σῶμα, δύο  δὲ ἀέρος· τὰ δὲ ἀέρος τμήματα ἐξ ἑνὸς μέρους διαλυθέντος δύʼ ἂν γενοίσθην σώματα πυρός. καὶ πάλιν, ὅταν ἀέρι πῦρ ὕδασίν τε ἤ τινι γῇ περιλαμβανόμενον ἐν πολλοῖς ὀλίγον, κινούμενον ἐν φερομένοις, μαχόμενον καὶ νικηθὲν καταθραυσθῇ, δύο πυρὸς σώματα εἰς ἓν συνίστασθον εἶδος ἀέρος· καὶ κρατηθέντος ἀέρος κερματισθέντος τε ἐκ δυοῖν ὅλοιν καὶ ἡμίσεος ὕδατος εἶδος ἓν ὅλον ἔσται συμπαγές.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ  γῇ μὲν τοῦτο ἀπονέμοντες τὸν εἰκότα λόγον διασῴζομεν, ὕδατι δʼ αὖ τῶν λοιπῶν τὸ δυσκινητότατον εἶδος, τὸ δʼ εὐκινητότατον πυρί, τὸ δὲ μέσον ἀέρι· καὶ τὸ μὲν σμικρότατον σῶμα πυρί, τὸ δʼ αὖ μέγιστον ὕδατι, τὸ δὲ μέσον ἀέρι· καὶ τὸ μὲν ὀξύτατον αὖ πυρί, τὸ δὲ δεύτερον ἀέρι, τὸ δὲ τρίτον ὕδατι. ταῦτʼ οὖν δὴ πάντα, τὸ μὲν ἔχον ὀλιγίστας βάσεις εὐκινητότατον ἀνάγκη πεφυκέναι, τμητικώτατόν τε  καὶ ὀξύτατον ὂν πάντῃ πάντων, ἔτι τε ἐλαφρότατον, ἐξ ὀλιγίστων συνεστὸς τῶν αὐτῶν μερῶν· τὸ δὲ δεύτερον δευτέρως τὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτʼ ἔχειν, τρίτως δὲ τὸ τρίτον. ἔστω δὴ κατὰ τὸν ὀρθὸν λόγον καὶ κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα τὸ μὲν τῆς πυραμίδος στερεὸν γεγονὸς εἶδος πυρὸς στοιχεῖον καὶ σπέρμα· τὸ δὲ δεύτερον κατὰ γένεσιν εἴπωμεν ἀέρος, τὸ δὲ τρίτον ὕδατος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","text":"πάντα οὖν δὴ ταῦτα δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι σμικρὰ οὕτως, ὡς καθʼ  ἓν ἕκαστον μὲν τοῦ γένους ἑκάστου διὰ σμικρότητα οὐδὲν ὁρώμενον ὑφʼ ἡμῶν, συναθροισθέντων δὲ πολλῶν τοὺς ὄγκους αὐτῶν ὁρᾶσθαι· καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν ἀναλογιῶν περί τε τὰ πλήθη καὶ τὰς κινήσεις καὶ τὰς ἄλλας δυνάμεις πανταχῇ τὸν θεόν, ὅπῃπερ ἡ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἑκοῦσα πεισθεῖσά τε φύσις ὑπεῖκεν, ταύτῃ πάντῃ διʼ ἀκριβείας ἀποτελεσθεισῶν ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ συνηρμόσθαι ταῦτα ἀνὰ λόγον. ἐκ δὴ πάντων ὧνπερ τὰ γένη προειρήκαμεν ὧδʼ ἂν κατὰ  τὸ εἰκὸς μάλιστʼ ἂν ἔχοι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","text":"γῆ μὲν συντυγχάνουσα πυρὶ διαλυθεῖσά τε ὑπὸ τῆς ὀξύτητος αὐτοῦ φέροιτʼ ἄν, εἴτʼ ἐν αὐτῷ πυρὶ λυθεῖσα εἴτʼ ἐν ἀέρος εἴτʼ ἐν ὕδατος ὄγκῳ τύχοι, μέχριπερ ἂν αὐτῆς πῃ συντυχόντα τὰ μέρη, πάλιν συναρμοσθέντα αὐτὰ αὑτοῖς, γῆ γένοιτο—οὐ γὰρ εἰς ἄλλο γε εἶδος ἔλθοι ποτʼ ἄν—ὕδωρ δὲ ὑπὸ πυρὸς μερισθέν, εἴτε καὶ ὑπʼ ἀέρος, ἐγχωρεῖ γίγνεσθαι συστάντα ἓν μὲν πυρὸς σῶμα, δύο  δὲ ἀέρος· τὰ δὲ ἀέρος τμήματα ἐξ ἑνὸς μέρους διαλυθέντος δύʼ ἂν γενοίσθην σώματα πυρός. καὶ πάλιν, ὅταν ἀέρι πῦρ ὕδασίν τε ἤ τινι γῇ περιλαμβανόμενον ἐν πολλοῖς ὀλίγον, κινούμενον ἐν φερομένοις, μαχόμενον καὶ νικηθὲν καταθραυσθῇ, δύο πυρὸς σώματα εἰς ἓν συνίστασθον εἶδος ἀέρος· καὶ κρατηθέντος ἀέρος κερματισθέντος τε ἐκ δυοῖν ὅλοιν καὶ ἡμίσεος ὕδατος εἶδος ἓν ὅλον ἔσται συμπαγές.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"b7709c3d3aa29e5ef64366d548d2fe0f7a7a7258bc92dc34e89ae162ed779171","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224946798972Z_fe97f963","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 56","source_sha256":"b7709c3d3aa29e5ef64366d548d2fe0f7a7a7258bc92dc34e89ae162ed779171","sha256":"8821ec8a49ad7d373c3c70437b85199ccf9e7635e7f75bc8af4231212492f2bf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:46.799050+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","text":"TIM. Therefore, by assigning this [figure] to earth, we preserve the probable account; and to water, of the remaining [figures], the most difficult to move; to fire the most easily moved; and the intermediate one to air. And [we assign] the smallest body to fire, the largest in turn to water, and the intermediate one to air; and again the sharpest to fire, the second to air, and the third to water. Accordingly, in all these cases, that which has the fewest bases must by nature be the most mobile, being in every way the most cutting and the sharpest of all, and further the lightest, since it consists of the fewest of the same parts; while the second has these same properties in the second degree, and the third in the third degree. Let it then be established, both according to the correct account and according to the probable one, that the solid figure which has come to be from the pyramid is the element and seed of fire; that the second in generation, let us say, is that of air; and that the third is that of water.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","text":"All these things, then, must be conceived as so small that, individually, each kind is unseen by us because of its smallness, whereas when many have been gathered together their masses are seen. And indeed, as regards the proportions in their numbers and motions and other powers, everywhere the god has fitted these together in due proportion, in whatever way the nature of necessity, yielding voluntarily and having been persuaded, gave way—once all things had been brought to completion by him with precision. From all the kinds which we have previously described, then, this would most probably be their condition.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","text":"Earth, when it encounters fire and is dissolved by its sharpness, might be carried along, whether it happened to be dissolved in the fire itself or in a mass of air or of water, until such time as its parts, coming together somewhere, were again fitted together with one another and became earth—for it could never come into another figure. But water, when divided by fire, or also by air, may, when compounded, become one body of fire and two of air; and portions of air, when one part has been dissolved, might become two bodies of fire. And again, whenever fire, enclosed by air and waters or by some earth—being little among many [things], moving among things carried along, struggling and defeated—is broken up, two bodies of fire combine into one figure of air; and when air has been overcome and fragmented, from two whole [bodies] and a half, one whole compact figure of water will be.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"8914176f7e1c2353829f93107588c083af5ac16b06b65fda1dff239750389a03","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 56"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 56","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37","title":"Section 57","order":41,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_37","text":"ΤΙ. ὧδε γὰρ δὴ λογισώμεθα αὐτὰ πάλιν, ὡς ὅταν ἐν πυρὶ λαμβανόμενον τῶν  ἄλλων ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ τι γένος τῇ τῶν γωνιῶν καὶ κατὰ τὰς πλευρὰς ὀξύτητι τέμνηται, συστὰν μὲν εἰς τὴν ἐκείνου φύσιν πέπαυται τεμνόμενον—τὸ γὰρ ὅμοιον καὶ ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ γένος ἕκαστον οὔτε τινὰ μεταβολὴν ἐμποιῆσαι δυνατὸν οὔτε τι παθεῖν ὑπὸ τοῦ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὁμοίως τε ἔχοντος—ἕως δʼ ἂν εἰς ἄλλο τι γιγνόμενον ἧττον ὂν κρείττονι μάχηται, λυόμενον οὐ παύεται. τά τε αὖ σμικρότερα ὅταν ἐν τοῖς μείζοσιν πολλοῖς περιλαμβανόμενα  ὀλίγα διαθραυόμενα κατασβεννύηται, συνίστασθαι μὲν ἐθέλοντα εἰς τὴν τοῦ κρατοῦντος ἰδέαν πέπαυται κατασβεννύμενα γίγνεταί τε ἐκ πυρὸς ἀήρ, ἐξ ἀέρος ὕδωρ· ἐὰν δʼ εἰς ταὐτὰ ἴῃ καὶ τῶν ἄλλων τι συνιὸν γενῶν μάχηται, λυόμενα οὐ παύεται, πρὶν ἢ παντάπασιν ὠθούμενα καὶ διαλυθέντα ἐκφύγῃ πρὸς τὸ συγγενές, ἢ νικηθέντα, ἓν ἐκ πολλῶν ὅμοιον τῷ κρατήσαντι γενόμενον, αὐτοῦ σύνοικον μείνῃ. καὶ  δὴ καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα τὰ παθήματα διαμείβεται τὰς χώρας ἅπαντα· διέστηκεν μὲν γὰρ τοῦ γένους ἑκάστου τὰ πλήθη κατὰ τόπον ἴδιον διὰ τὴν τῆς δεχομένης κίνησιν, τὰ δὲ ἀνομοιούμενα ἑκάστοτε ἑαυτοῖς, ἄλλοις δὲ ὁμοιούμενα, φέρεται διὰ τὸν σεισμὸν πρὸς τὸν ἐκείνων οἷς ἂν ὁμοιωθῇ τόπον. ὅσα μὲν οὖν ἄκρατα καὶ πρῶτα σώματα διὰ τοιούτων αἰτιῶν γέγονεν· τὸ δʼ ἐν τοῖς εἴδεσιν αὐτῶν ἕτερα ἐμπεφυκέναι γένη τὴν ἑκατέρου τῶν στοιχείων αἰτιατέον σύστασιν,  μὴ μόνον ἓν ἑκατέραν μέγεθος ἔχον τὸ τρίγωνον φυτεῦσαι κατʼ ἀρχάς, ἀλλʼ ἐλάττω τε καὶ μείζω, τὸν ἀριθμὸν δὲ ἔχοντα τοσοῦτον ὅσαπερ ἂν ᾖ τἀν τοῖς εἴδεσι γένη. διὸ δὴ συμμειγνύμενα αὐτά τε πρὸς αὑτὰ καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα τὴν ποικιλίαν ἐστὶν ἄπειρα· ἧς δὴ δεῖ θεωροὺς γίγνεσθαι τοὺς μέλλοντας περὶ φύσεως εἰκότι λόγῳ χρήσεσθαι. κινήσεως οὖν στάσεώς τε πέρι, τίνα τρόπον καὶ μεθʼ ὧντινων γίγνεσθον, εἰ μή τις διομολογήσεται, πόλλʼ ἂν εἴη  ἐμποδὼν τῷ κατόπισθεν λογισμῷ. τὰ μὲν οὖν ἤδη περὶ αὐτῶν εἴρηται, πρὸς δʼ ἐκείνοις ἔτι τάδε, ἐν μὲν ὁμαλότητι μηδέποτε ἐθέλειν κίνησιν ἐνεῖναι. τὸ γὰρ κινησόμενον ἄνευ τοῦ κινήσοντος ἢ τὸ κινῆσον ἄνευ τοῦ κινησομένου χαλεπόν, μᾶλλον δὲ ἀδύνατον, εἶναι· κίνησις δὲ οὐκ ἔστιν τούτων ἀπόντων, ταῦτα δὲ ὁμαλὰ εἶναί ποτε ἀδύνατον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὧδε γὰρ δὴ λογισώμεθα αὐτὰ πάλιν, ὡς ὅταν ἐν πυρὶ λαμβανόμενον τῶν  ἄλλων ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ τι γένος τῇ τῶν γωνιῶν καὶ κατὰ τὰς πλευρὰς ὀξύτητι τέμνηται, συστὰν μὲν εἰς τὴν ἐκείνου φύσιν πέπαυται τεμνόμενον—τὸ γὰρ ὅμοιον καὶ ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ γένος ἕκαστον οὔτε τινὰ μεταβολὴν ἐμποιῆσαι δυνατὸν οὔτε τι παθεῖν ὑπὸ τοῦ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὁμοίως τε ἔχοντος—ἕως δʼ ἂν εἰς ἄλλο τι γιγνόμενον ἧττον ὂν κρείττονι μάχηται, λυόμενον οὐ παύεται. τά τε αὖ σμικρότερα ὅταν ἐν τοῖς μείζοσιν πολλοῖς περιλαμβανόμενα  ὀλίγα διαθραυόμενα κατασβεννύηται, συνίστασθαι μὲν ἐθέλοντα εἰς τὴν τοῦ κρατοῦντος ἰδέαν πέπαυται κατασβεννύμενα γίγνεταί τε ἐκ πυρὸς ἀήρ, ἐξ ἀέρος ὕδωρ· ἐὰν δʼ εἰς ταὐτὰ ἴῃ καὶ τῶν ἄλλων τι συνιὸν γενῶν μάχηται, λυόμενα οὐ παύεται, πρὶν ἢ παντάπασιν ὠθούμενα καὶ διαλυθέντα ἐκφύγῃ πρὸς τὸ συγγενές, ἢ νικηθέντα, ἓν ἐκ πολλῶν ὅμοιον τῷ κρατήσαντι γενόμενον, αὐτοῦ σύνοικον μείνῃ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","text":"καὶ  δὴ καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα τὰ παθήματα διαμείβεται τὰς χώρας ἅπαντα· διέστηκεν μὲν γὰρ τοῦ γένους ἑκάστου τὰ πλήθη κατὰ τόπον ἴδιον διὰ τὴν τῆς δεχομένης κίνησιν, τὰ δὲ ἀνομοιούμενα ἑκάστοτε ἑαυτοῖς, ἄλλοις δὲ ὁμοιούμενα, φέρεται διὰ τὸν σεισμὸν πρὸς τὸν ἐκείνων οἷς ἂν ὁμοιωθῇ τόπον. ὅσα μὲν οὖν ἄκρατα καὶ πρῶτα σώματα διὰ τοιούτων αἰτιῶν γέγονεν· τὸ δʼ ἐν τοῖς εἴδεσιν αὐτῶν ἕτερα ἐμπεφυκέναι γένη τὴν ἑκατέρου τῶν στοιχείων αἰτιατέον σύστασιν,  μὴ μόνον ἓν ἑκατέραν μέγεθος ἔχον τὸ τρίγωνον φυτεῦσαι κατʼ ἀρχάς, ἀλλʼ ἐλάττω τε καὶ μείζω, τὸν ἀριθμὸν δὲ ἔχοντα τοσοῦτον ὅσαπερ ἂν ᾖ τἀν τοῖς εἴδεσι γένη. διὸ δὴ συμμειγνύμενα αὐτά τε πρὸς αὑτὰ καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα τὴν ποικιλίαν ἐστὶν ἄπειρα· ἧς δὴ δεῖ θεωροὺς γίγνεσθαι τοὺς μέλλοντας περὶ φύσεως εἰκότι λόγῳ χρήσεσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","text":"κινήσεως οὖν στάσεώς τε πέρι, τίνα τρόπον καὶ μεθʼ ὧντινων γίγνεσθον, εἰ μή τις διομολογήσεται, πόλλʼ ἂν εἴη  ἐμποδὼν τῷ κατόπισθεν λογισμῷ. τὰ μὲν οὖν ἤδη περὶ αὐτῶν εἴρηται, πρὸς δʼ ἐκείνοις ἔτι τάδε, ἐν μὲν ὁμαλότητι μηδέποτε ἐθέλειν κίνησιν ἐνεῖναι. τὸ γὰρ κινησόμενον ἄνευ τοῦ κινήσοντος ἢ τὸ κινῆσον ἄνευ τοῦ κινησομένου χαλεπόν, μᾶλλον δὲ ἀδύνατον, εἶναι· κίνησις δὲ οὐκ ἔστιν τούτων ἀπόντων, ταῦτα δὲ ὁμαλὰ εἶναί ποτε ἀδύνατον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"80eb503afe0cc682d1e7b8359d5b68a59b9d83945a95c750aaa86c52ec0d4f5a","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T224954564656Z_8d21e7e1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 57","source_sha256":"80eb503afe0cc682d1e7b8359d5b68a59b9d83945a95c750aaa86c52ec0d4f5a","sha256":"7631e9141346b4149d6f98c181da5cf738860590e33e3089333033247314ff9c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:49:54.564792+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","text":"TI. Let us then reason about these things again in this way: whenever some kind among the others, being caught in fire, is cut by it through the sharpness of its angles and along its sides, when it has been constituted into that nature, it ceases to be cut—for no kind which is like and the same as itself is capable either of producing any change in itself or of suffering anything from that which is similarly disposed in the same way—but so long as, becoming something else and being weaker, it contends with what is stronger, it does not cease from being dissolved. Again, whenever smaller things, enclosed among many larger ones, are broken into a few pieces and extinguished, if they are willing to be constituted into the form of the prevailing thing, they cease to be extinguished, and from fire air comes to be, and from air water; but if, in passing into the same things, some other of the kinds that come together contends with them, they do not cease from being dissolved until, being altogether thrust apart and dissolved, they escape to what is akin, or, defeated, having become one thing from many, like that which prevailed, they remain there as its fellow-inhabitant.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","text":"And indeed, in accordance with these affections, all things change places. For the multitudes of each kind have been separated into their own place by the motion of that which receives them; but those which at any time become unlike themselves and like others are carried, because of the shaking, toward the place of those to which they become like. Thus, the unmixed and primary bodies have come to be through such causes; but that other kinds should be inborn among their forms must be ascribed to the constitution of each of the two elements: that not just one triangle of a single size was planted at the beginning in each case, but both smaller and larger ones, their number being as great as the kinds there may be among the forms. Hence, when they are mingled both with themselves and with one another, their variety is infinite; and those who intend to employ a likely account concerning nature must become observers of this.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","text":"Now concerning motion and rest—how and through what things they come to be—unless one agrees upon this, many things would stand in the way of the reasoning that follows. What has already been said about them, then, stands; but in addition to those points, this too: that motion should never be willing to exist in uniformity. For it is difficult—or rather impossible—for that which is to be moved to exist without that which moves it, or that which moves without that which is to be moved; and motion does not exist when these are absent, while it is impossible for these ever to be uniform.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"bfeee8633f8034225f1ea838d440c57e7cc898bde5ff05156cd7fe1199a65664","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 57"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 57","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38","title":"Section 58","order":42,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_38","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτω δὴ στάσιν μὲν ἐν ὁμαλότητι, κίνησιν δὲ εἰς ἀνωμαλότητα ἀεὶ  τιθῶμεν· αἰτία δὲ ἀνισότης αὖ τῆς ἀνωμάλου φύσεως. ἀνισότητος δὲ γένεσιν μὲν διεληλύθαμεν· πῶς δέ ποτε οὐ κατὰ γένη διαχωρισθέντα ἕκαστα πέπαυται τῆς διʼ ἀλλήλων κινήσεως καὶ φορᾶς, οὐκ εἴπομεν. ὧδε οὖν πάλιν ἐροῦμεν. ἡ τοῦ παντὸς περίοδος, ἐπειδὴ συμπεριέλαβεν τὰ γένη, κυκλοτερὴς οὖσα καὶ πρὸς αὑτὴν πεφυκυῖα βούλεσθαι συνιέναι, σφίγγει πάντα καὶ κενὴν χώραν οὐδεμίαν ἐᾷ λείπεσθαι. διὸ  δὴ πῦρ μὲν εἰς ἅπαντα διελήλυθε μάλιστα, ἀὴρ δὲ δεύτερον, ὡς λεπτότητι δεύτερον ἔφυ, καὶ τἆλλα ταύτῃ· τὰ γὰρ ἐκ μεγίστων μερῶν γεγονότα μεγίστην κενότητα ἐν τῇ συστάσει παραλέλοιπεν, τὰ δὲ σμικρότατα ἐλαχίστην. ἡ δὴ τῆς πιλήσεως σύνοδος τὰ σμικρὰ εἰς τὰ τῶν μεγάλων διάκενα συνωθεῖ. σμικρῶν οὖν παρὰ μεγάλα τιθεμένων καὶ τῶν ἐλαττόνων τὰ μείζονα διακρινόντων, τῶν δὲ μειζόνων ἐκεῖνα συγκρινόντων, πάντʼ ἄνω κάτω μεταφέρεται πρὸς τοὺς ἑαυτῶν τόπους·  μεταβάλλον γὰρ τὸ μέγεθος ἕκαστον καὶ τὴν τόπων μεταβάλλει στάσιν. οὕτω δὴ διὰ ταῦτά τε ἡ τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος διασῳζομένη γένεσις ἀεὶ τὴν ἀεὶ κίνησιν τούτων οὖσαν ἐσομένην τε ἐνδελεχῶς παρέχεται. μετὰ δὴ ταῦτα δεῖ νοεῖν ὅτι πυρός τε γένη πολλὰ γέγονεν, οἷον φλὸξ τό τε ἀπὸ τῆς φλογὸς ἀπιόν, ὃ κάει μὲν οὔ, φῶς δὲ τοῖς ὄμμασιν παρέχει, τό τε φλογὸς ἀποσβεσθείσης ἐν  τοῖς διαπύροις καταλειπόμενον αὐτοῦ· κατὰ ταὐτὰ δὲ ἀέρος, τὸ μὲν εὐαγέστατον ἐπίκλην αἰθὴρ καλούμενος, ὁ δὲ θολερώτατος ὁμίχλη τε καὶ σκότος, ἕτερά τε ἀνώνυμα εἴδη, γεγονότα διὰ τὴν τῶν τριγώνων ἀνισότητα. τὰ δὲ ὕδατος διχῇ μὲν πρῶτον, τὸ μὲν ὑγρόν, τὸ δὲ χυτὸν γένος αὐτοῦ. τὸ μὲν οὖν ὑγρὸν διὰ τὸ μετέχον εἶναι τῶν γενῶν τῶν ὕδατος ὅσα σμικρά, ἀνίσων ὄντων, κινητικὸν αὐτό τε καθʼ αὑτὸ καὶ ὑπʼ ἄλλου διὰ τὴν ἀνωμαλότητα καὶ τὴν τοῦ σχήματος ἰδέαν γέγονεν· τὸ  δὲ ἐκ μεγάλων καὶ ὁμαλῶν στασιμώτερον μὲν ἐκείνου καὶ βαρὺ πεπηγὸς ὑπὸ ὁμαλότητός ἐστιν, ὑπὸ δὲ πυρὸς εἰσιόντος καὶ διαλύοντος αὐτὸ τὴν ὁμαλότητα ἀποβάλλει, ταύτην δὲ ἀπολέσαν μετίσχει μᾶλλον κινήσεως, γενόμενον δὲ εὐκίνητον, ὑπὸ τοῦ πλησίον ἀέρος ὠθούμενον καὶ κατατεινόμενον ἐπὶ γῆν, τήκεσθαι μὲν τὴν τῶν ὄγκων καθαίρεσιν, ῥοὴν δὲ τὴν κατάτασιν ἐπὶ γῆν ἐπωνυμίαν ἑκατέρου τοῦ πάθους ἔλαβεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτω δὴ στάσιν μὲν ἐν ὁμαλότητι, κίνησιν δὲ εἰς ἀνωμαλότητα ἀεὶ  τιθῶμεν· αἰτία δὲ ἀνισότης αὖ τῆς ἀνωμάλου φύσεως. ἀνισότητος δὲ γένεσιν μὲν διεληλύθαμεν· πῶς δέ ποτε οὐ κατὰ γένη διαχωρισθέντα ἕκαστα πέπαυται τῆς διʼ ἀλλήλων κινήσεως καὶ φορᾶς, οὐκ εἴπομεν. ὧδε οὖν πάλιν ἐροῦμεν. ἡ τοῦ παντὸς περίοδος, ἐπειδὴ συμπεριέλαβεν τὰ γένη, κυκλοτερὴς οὖσα καὶ πρὸς αὑτὴν πεφυκυῖα βούλεσθαι συνιέναι, σφίγγει πάντα καὶ κενὴν χώραν οὐδεμίαν ἐᾷ λείπεσθαι. διὸ  δὴ πῦρ μὲν εἰς ἅπαντα διελήλυθε μάλιστα, ἀὴρ δὲ δεύτερον, ὡς λεπτότητι δεύτερον ἔφυ, καὶ τἆλλα ταύτῃ· τὰ γὰρ ἐκ μεγίστων μερῶν γεγονότα μεγίστην κενότητα ἐν τῇ συστάσει παραλέλοιπεν, τὰ δὲ σμικρότατα ἐλαχίστην. ἡ δὴ τῆς πιλήσεως σύνοδος τὰ σμικρὰ εἰς τὰ τῶν μεγάλων διάκενα συνωθεῖ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","text":"σμικρῶν οὖν παρὰ μεγάλα τιθεμένων καὶ τῶν ἐλαττόνων τὰ μείζονα διακρινόντων, τῶν δὲ μειζόνων ἐκεῖνα συγκρινόντων, πάντʼ ἄνω κάτω μεταφέρεται πρὸς τοὺς ἑαυτῶν τόπους·  μεταβάλλον γὰρ τὸ μέγεθος ἕκαστον καὶ τὴν τόπων μεταβάλλει στάσιν. οὕτω δὴ διὰ ταῦτά τε ἡ τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος διασῳζομένη γένεσις ἀεὶ τὴν ἀεὶ κίνησιν τούτων οὖσαν ἐσομένην τε ἐνδελεχῶς παρέχεται. μετὰ δὴ ταῦτα δεῖ νοεῖν ὅτι πυρός τε γένη πολλὰ γέγονεν, οἷον φλὸξ τό τε ἀπὸ τῆς φλογὸς ἀπιόν, ὃ κάει μὲν οὔ, φῶς δὲ τοῖς ὄμμασιν παρέχει, τό τε φλογὸς ἀποσβεσθείσης ἐν  τοῖς διαπύροις καταλειπόμενον αὐτοῦ· κατὰ ταὐτὰ δὲ ἀέρος, τὸ μὲν εὐαγέστατον ἐπίκλην αἰθὴρ καλούμενος, ὁ δὲ θολερώτατος ὁμίχλη τε καὶ σκότος, ἕτερά τε ἀνώνυμα εἴδη, γεγονότα διὰ τὴν τῶν τριγώνων ἀνισότητα. τὰ δὲ ὕδατος διχῇ μὲν πρῶτον, τὸ μὲν ὑγρόν, τὸ δὲ χυτὸν γένος αὐτοῦ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","text":"τὸ μὲν οὖν ὑγρὸν διὰ τὸ μετέχον εἶναι τῶν γενῶν τῶν ὕδατος ὅσα σμικρά, ἀνίσων ὄντων, κινητικὸν αὐτό τε καθʼ αὑτὸ καὶ ὑπʼ ἄλλου διὰ τὴν ἀνωμαλότητα καὶ τὴν τοῦ σχήματος ἰδέαν γέγονεν· τὸ  δὲ ἐκ μεγάλων καὶ ὁμαλῶν στασιμώτερον μὲν ἐκείνου καὶ βαρὺ πεπηγὸς ὑπὸ ὁμαλότητός ἐστιν, ὑπὸ δὲ πυρὸς εἰσιόντος καὶ διαλύοντος αὐτὸ τὴν ὁμαλότητα ἀποβάλλει, ταύτην δὲ ἀπολέσαν μετίσχει μᾶλλον κινήσεως, γενόμενον δὲ εὐκίνητον, ὑπὸ τοῦ πλησίον ἀέρος ὠθούμενον καὶ κατατεινόμενον ἐπὶ γῆν, τήκεσθαι μὲν τὴν τῶν ὄγκων καθαίρεσιν, ῥοὴν δὲ τὴν κατάτασιν ἐπὶ γῆν ἐπωνυμίαν ἑκατέρου τοῦ πάθους ἔλαβεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"f5c2754938f30f9d5f668c86de59e00c0d4bacf1ec86e5bfee69402bee4d7d12","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225002706106Z_dad1b09e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 58","source_sha256":"f5c2754938f30f9d5f668c86de59e00c0d4bacf1ec86e5bfee69402bee4d7d12","sha256":"f093c77a491b450d1455d31f11021656a330a766d549fb40eb9e16f7bc9d0b94","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:02.706142+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","text":"TI. Thus, then, let us posit rest in uniformity, and motion always in non-uniformity; and inequality is in turn the cause of the non-uniform nature. We have gone through the generation of inequality; but how it is that, when each of the kinds has been separated according to its kind, they have not ceased from passing and being carried through one another, we have not said. Let us therefore state it again as follows. Since the revolution of the all has encompassed the kinds, being circular and naturally tending to come together upon itself, it compresses everything and allows no empty space to be left. For this reason fire has passed through all things most of all, air second, as it is by nature second in fineness, and the rest accordingly; for things composed of the greatest parts have left the greatest void in their structure, while those composed of the smallest parts have left the least. Thus the compression caused by the constriction thrusts the small things into the interstices of the large ones.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","text":"When, then, small things are placed alongside large ones, and the lesser separate the greater, while the greater combine those, everything is conveyed up and down toward its own places; for each thing, by changing in magnitude, also changes its station of place. Thus, then, through these causes the generation of non-uniformity, being preserved, continually provides their motion, which is and will be incessantly continuous. After this we must understand that many kinds of fire have come to be: for example, flame, and that which departs from flame, which does not burn but provides light to the eyes, and that which remains in the glowing bodies themselves when flame has been extinguished. Likewise, of air: the most transparent kind is called, by name, aether, while the murkiest is mist and darkness, along with other unnamed forms, produced because of the inequality of the triangles. The kinds of water are first twofold: one is the liquid kind, the other its fusible kind.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","text":"The liquid kind, then, because it partakes of those kinds of water which are small, being unequal, has become capable of motion both by itself and by another, on account of its non-uniformity and the form of its shape. But that composed of large and uniform parts is more stationary than the former and, through its uniformity, is heavy and congealed; yet when fire enters and dissolves it, it loses its uniformity, and, having lost this, it partakes more of motion. Having become readily movable, and being pushed by the neighbouring air and stretched down toward the earth, melting received its name from the removal of its masses, and flowing from its extension down toward the earth—each name corresponding to one of the two affections.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"4619da2d4054082a85dd3a85295723b8322673ae4b5dc370fb11bff7c2d98acf","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 58"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 58","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39","title":"Section 59","order":43,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_39","text":"ΤΙ. πάλιν δʼ ἐκπίπτοντος αὐτόθεν τοῦ πυρός, ἅτε οὐκ εἰς κενὸν ἐξιόντος, ὠθούμενος ὁ πλησίον ἀὴρ εὐκίνητον ὄντα ἔτι τὸν ὑγρὸν ὄγκον εἰς τὰς τοῦ πυρὸς ἕδρας συνωθῶν αὐτὸν αὑτῷ συμμείγνυσιν· ὁ δὲ συνωθούμενος ἀπολαμβάνων τε τὴν ὁμαλότητα πάλιν, ἅτε τοῦ τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος δημιουργοῦ πυρὸς ἀπιόντος, εἰς ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ καθίσταται. καὶ τὴν μὲν τοῦ πυρὸς ἀπαλλαγὴν ψῦξιν, τὴν δὲ σύνοδον ἀπελθόντος ἐκείνου πεπηγὸς εἶναι γένος προσερρήθη. τούτων δὴ πάντων  ὅσα χυτὰ προσείπομεν ὕδατα, τὸ μὲν ἐκ λεπτοτάτων καὶ ὁμαλωτάτων πυκνότατον γιγνόμενον, μονοειδὲς γένος, στίλβοντι καὶ ξανθῷ χρώματι κοινωθέν, τιμαλφέστατον κτῆμα χρυσὸς ἠθημένος διὰ πέτρας ἐπάγη· χρυσοῦ δὲ ὄζος, διὰ πυκνότητα σκληρότατον ὂν καὶ μελανθέν, ἀδάμας ἐκλήθη. τὸ δʼ ἐγγὺς μὲν χρυσοῦ τῶν μερῶν, εἴδη δὲ πλείονα ἑνὸς ἔχον, πυκνότητι δέ, τῇ μὲν χρυσοῦ πυκνότερον ὄν, καὶ γῆς μόριον ὀλίγον καὶ λεπτὸν μετασχόν, ὥστε σκληρότερον εἶναι, τῷ  δὲ μεγάλα ἐντὸς αὑτοῦ διαλείμματα ἔχειν κουφότερον, τῶν λαμπρῶν πηκτῶν τε ἓν γένος ὑδάτων χαλκὸς συσταθεὶς γέγονεν· τὸ δʼ ἐκ γῆς αὐτῷ μειχθέν, ὅταν παλαιουμένω διαχωρίζησθον πάλιν ἀπʼ ἀλλήλων, ἐκφανὲς καθʼ αὑτὸ γιγνόμενον ἰὸς λέγεται. τἆλλα δὲ τῶν τοιούτων οὐδὲν ποικίλον ἔτι διαλογίσασθαι τὴν τῶν εἰκότων μύθων μεταδιώκοντα ἰδέαν· ἣν ὅταν τις ἀναπαύσεως ἕνεκα τοὺς περὶ τῶν ὄντων ἀεὶ καταθέμενος λόγους, τοὺς γενέσεως πέρι διαθεώμενος  εἰκότας ἀμεταμέλητον ἡδονὴν κτᾶται, μέτριον ἂν ἐν τῷ βίῳ παιδιὰν καὶ φρόνιμον ποιοῖτο. ταύτῃ δὴ καὶ τὰ νῦν ἐφέντες τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο τῶν αὐτῶν πέρι τὰ ἑξῆς εἰκότα δίιμεν τῇδε. τὸ πυρὶ μεμειγμένον ὕδωρ, ὅσον λεπτὸν ὑγρόν τε διὰ τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν ὁδὸν ἣν κυλινδούμενον ἐπὶ γῆς ὑγρὸν λέγεται, μαλακόν τε αὖ τῷ τὰς βάσεις ἧττον ἑδραίους οὔσας ἢ τὰς γῆς ὑπείκειν, τοῦτο ὅταν πυρὸς ἀποχωρισθὲν ἀέρος τε μονωθῇ,  γέγονεν μὲν ὁμαλώτερον, συνέωσται δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν ἐξιόντων εἰς αὑτό, παγέν τε οὕτως τὸ μὲν ὑπὲρ γῆς μάλιστα παθὸν ταῦτα χάλαζα, τὸ δʼ ἐπὶ γῆς κρύσταλλος, τὸ δὲ ἧττον, ἡμιπαγές τε ὂν ἔτι, τὸ μὲν ὑπὲρ γῆς αὖ χιών, τὸ δʼ ἐπὶ γῆς συμπαγὲν ἐκ δρόσου γενόμενον πάχνη λέγεται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. πάλιν δʼ ἐκπίπτοντος αὐτόθεν τοῦ πυρός, ἅτε οὐκ εἰς κενὸν ἐξιόντος, ὠθούμενος ὁ πλησίον ἀὴρ εὐκίνητον ὄντα ἔτι τὸν ὑγρὸν ὄγκον εἰς τὰς τοῦ πυρὸς ἕδρας συνωθῶν αὐτὸν αὑτῷ συμμείγνυσιν· ὁ δὲ συνωθούμενος ἀπολαμβάνων τε τὴν ὁμαλότητα πάλιν, ἅτε τοῦ τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος δημιουργοῦ πυρὸς ἀπιόντος, εἰς ταὐτὸν αὑτῷ καθίσταται. καὶ τὴν μὲν τοῦ πυρὸς ἀπαλλαγὴν ψῦξιν, τὴν δὲ σύνοδον ἀπελθόντος ἐκείνου πεπηγὸς εἶναι γένος προσερρήθη. τούτων δὴ πάντων  ὅσα χυτὰ προσείπομεν ὕδατα, τὸ μὲν ἐκ λεπτοτάτων καὶ ὁμαλωτάτων πυκνότατον γιγνόμενον, μονοειδὲς γένος, στίλβοντι καὶ ξανθῷ χρώματι κοινωθέν, τιμαλφέστατον κτῆμα χρυσὸς ἠθημένος διὰ πέτρας ἐπάγη· χρυσοῦ δὲ ὄζος, διὰ πυκνότητα σκληρότατον ὂν καὶ μελανθέν, ἀδάμας ἐκλήθη.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","text":"τὸ δʼ ἐγγὺς μὲν χρυσοῦ τῶν μερῶν, εἴδη δὲ πλείονα ἑνὸς ἔχον, πυκνότητι δέ, τῇ μὲν χρυσοῦ πυκνότερον ὄν, καὶ γῆς μόριον ὀλίγον καὶ λεπτὸν μετασχόν, ὥστε σκληρότερον εἶναι, τῷ  δὲ μεγάλα ἐντὸς αὑτοῦ διαλείμματα ἔχειν κουφότερον, τῶν λαμπρῶν πηκτῶν τε ἓν γένος ὑδάτων χαλκὸς συσταθεὶς γέγονεν· τὸ δʼ ἐκ γῆς αὐτῷ μειχθέν, ὅταν παλαιουμένω διαχωρίζησθον πάλιν ἀπʼ ἀλλήλων, ἐκφανὲς καθʼ αὑτὸ γιγνόμενον ἰὸς λέγεται. τἆλλα δὲ τῶν τοιούτων οὐδὲν ποικίλον ἔτι διαλογίσασθαι τὴν τῶν εἰκότων μύθων μεταδιώκοντα ἰδέαν· ἣν ὅταν τις ἀναπαύσεως ἕνεκα τοὺς περὶ τῶν ὄντων ἀεὶ καταθέμενος λόγους, τοὺς γενέσεως πέρι διαθεώμενος  εἰκότας ἀμεταμέλητον ἡδονὴν κτᾶται, μέτριον ἂν ἐν τῷ βίῳ παιδιὰν καὶ φρόνιμον ποιοῖτο. ταύτῃ δὴ καὶ τὰ νῦν ἐφέντες τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο τῶν αὐτῶν πέρι τὰ ἑξῆς εἰκότα δίιμεν τῇδε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","text":"τὸ πυρὶ μεμειγμένον ὕδωρ, ὅσον λεπτὸν ὑγρόν τε διὰ τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν ὁδὸν ἣν κυλινδούμενον ἐπὶ γῆς ὑγρὸν λέγεται, μαλακόν τε αὖ τῷ τὰς βάσεις ἧττον ἑδραίους οὔσας ἢ τὰς γῆς ὑπείκειν, τοῦτο ὅταν πυρὸς ἀποχωρισθὲν ἀέρος τε μονωθῇ,  γέγονεν μὲν ὁμαλώτερον, συνέωσται δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν ἐξιόντων εἰς αὑτό, παγέν τε οὕτως τὸ μὲν ὑπὲρ γῆς μάλιστα παθὸν ταῦτα χάλαζα, τὸ δʼ ἐπὶ γῆς κρύσταλλος, τὸ δὲ ἧττον, ἡμιπαγές τε ὂν ἔτι, τὸ μὲν ὑπὲρ γῆς αὖ χιών, τὸ δʼ ἐπὶ γῆς συμπαγὲν ἐκ δρόσου γενόμενον πάχνη λέγεται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"1f79ca9bc543251025759244b6be9da21ad90a7e6f0470c5cb75872420fbdec3","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225011298652Z_6b2215f4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 59","source_sha256":"1f79ca9bc543251025759244b6be9da21ad90a7e6f0470c5cb75872420fbdec3","sha256":"1fd564f7dd5dde26db2ce99a7dfcf685bf7eba5d19993a99ed4ff44ec9934089","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:11.298734+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","text":"Again, when the fire escapes from that place, since it does not go out into a void, the neighboring air, being thrust aside, and still mobile, presses the moist mass into the seats of the fire and mingles it with itself; and what is pressed together, recovering its uniformity again, since the fire, the artificer of irregularity, has departed, settles into identity with itself. And the departure of fire was called cooling, while the coming together after its departure was called a solidified kind. Of all these waters which we called fusible, that which, being composed of the finest and most uniform parts, becomes most dense, a single-kind genus, sharing a bright and yellow color, is gold, a possession most precious, filtered and compacted through rock; and the offshoot of gold, being very hard because of its density and having become black, was called adamant.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","text":"That which is near gold in its parts, but has more than one form, and in density is denser than gold on the one hand, and has partaken of a small and fine portion of earth, so as to be harder, but on the other hand is lighter because it has large intervals within itself—this, one kind among the bright and solidified waters, when compacted, has become bronze; and the earth mixed with it, when the two separate from one another again as it grows old, becoming visible by itself, is called verdigris. But as for the other things of this sort, there is no longer anything variegated to work out, for one pursuing the form of likely accounts; whenever someone, for the sake of rest, laying aside accounts concerning things that are always, contemplates likely accounts concerning becoming and gains an unregretted pleasure, he would make a measured and prudent pastime in life. Thus, then, having let these matters go, let us proceed in this way to the next likely account concerning the same things.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","text":"Water mixed with fire—so far as it is fine and moist because of its motion and the course along which it rolls upon the earth—is called liquid; and it is soft, again, because its bases, being less firmly seated than those of earth, yield. When this has been separated from fire and isolated from air, it has become more uniform, but has been compressed by those [particles] entering into itself; and thus, having solidified, that which has suffered this most above the earth is called hail, that upon the earth, ice, and that which has suffered it less and is still half-solidified, above the earth is called snow, while that upon the earth, compacted from dew, is called frost.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"d9a84edc4b7e6a6833fb627554c31d9db3be843cce7d7fd9ad4d700afbb0290c","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 59"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 59","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6","title":"Section 60","order":44,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ δὴ πλεῖστα ὑδάτων εἴδη μεμειγμένα ἀλλήλοις—σύμπαν μὲν τὸ γένος,  διὰ τῶν ἐκ γῆς φυτῶν ἠθημένα, χυμοὶ λεγόμενοι—διὰ δὲ τὰς μείξεις ἀνομοιότητα ἕκαστοι σχόντες τὰ μὲν ἄλλα πολλὰ ἀνώνυμα γένη παρέσχοντο, τέτταρα δὲ ὅσα ἔμπυρα εἴδη, διαφανῆ μάλιστα γενόμενα, εἴληφεν ὀνόματα αὐτῶν, τὸ μὲν τῆς ψυχῆς μετὰ τοῦ σώματος θερμαντικὸν οἶνος, τὸ δὲ λεῖον καὶ διακριτικὸν ὄψεως διὰ ταῦτά τε ἰδεῖν λαμπρὸν καὶ στίλβον λιπαρόν τε φανταζόμενον ἐλαιηρὸν εἶδος, πίττα καὶ κίκι καὶ ἔλαιον αὐτὸ ὅσα τʼ ἄλλα τῆς αὐτῆς δυνάμεως· ὅσον δὲ διαχυτικὸν  μέχρι φύσεως τῶν περὶ τὸ στόμα συνόδων, ταύτῃ τῇ δυνάμει γλυκύτητα παρεχόμενον, μέλι τὸ κατὰ πάντων μάλιστα πρόσρημα ἔσχεν, τὸ δὲ τῆς σαρκὸς διαλυτικὸν τῷ κάειν, ἀφρῶδες γένος, ἐκ πάντων ἀφορισθὲν τῶν χυμῶν, ὀπὸς ἐπωνομάσθη. γῆς δὲ εἴδη, τὸ μὲν ἠθημένον διὰ ὕδατος τοιῷδε τρόπῳ γίγνεται σῶμα λίθινον. τὸ συμμιγὲς ὕδωρ ὅταν ἐν τῇ συμμείξει κοπῇ, μετέβαλεν εἰς ἀέρος ἰδέαν· γενόμενος δὲ  ἀὴρ εἰς τὸν ἑαυτοῦ τόπον ἀναθεῖ. κενὸν δʼ ὑπερεῖχεν αὐτῶν οὐδέν· τὸν οὖν πλησίον ἔωσεν ἀέρα. ὁ δὲ ἅτε ὢν βαρύς, ὠσθεὶς καὶ περιχυθεὶς τῷ τῆς γῆς ὄγκῳ, σφόδρα ἔθλιψεν συνέωσέν τε αὐτὸν εἰς τὰς ἕδρας ὅθεν ἀνῄει ὁ νέος ἀήρ· συνωσθεῖσα δὲ ὑπὸ ἀέρος ἀλύτως ὕδατι γῆ συνίσταται πέτρα, καλλίων μὲν ἡ τῶν ἴσων καὶ ὁμαλῶν διαφανὴς μερῶν, αἰσχίων δὲ ἡ ἐναντία. τὸ δὲ ὑπὸ πυρὸς τάχους τὸ νοτερὸν  πᾶν ἐξαρπασθὲν καὶ κραυρότερον ἐκείνου συστάν, ᾧ γένει κέραμον ἐπωνομάκαμεν, τοῦτο γέγονεν· ἔστιν δὲ ὅτε νοτίδος ὑπολειφθείσης χυτὴ γῆ γενομένη διὰ πυρὸς ὅταν ψυχθῇ, γίγνεται τὸ μέλαν χρῶμα ἔχον λίθος. τὼ δʼ αὖ κατὰ ταὐτὰ μὲν ταῦτα ἐκ συμμείξεως ὕδατος ἀπομονουμένω πολλοῦ, λεπτοτέρων δὲ ἐκ γῆς μερῶν ἁλμυρώ τε ὄντε, ἡμιπαγῆ γενομένω καὶ λυτὼ πάλιν ὑφʼ ὕδατος, τὸ μὲν ἐλαίου καὶ γῆς καθαρτικὸν γένος λίτρον, τὸ δʼ εὐάρμοστον ἐν ταῖς κοινωνίαις  ταῖς περὶ τὴν τοῦ στόματος αἴσθησιν ἁλῶν κατὰ λόγον  θεοφιλὲς σῶμα ἐγένετο. τὰ δὲ κοινὰ ἐξ ἀμφοῖν ὕδατι μὲν οὐ λυτά, πυρὶ δέ, διὰ τὸ τοιόνδε οὕτω συμπήγνυται. γῆς ὄγκους πῦρ μὲν ἀήρ τε οὐ τήκει· τῆς γὰρ συστάσεως τῶν διακένων αὐτῆς σμικρομερέστερα πεφυκότα, διὰ πολλῆς εὐρυχωρίας ἰόντα, οὐ βιαζόμενα, ἄλυτον αὐτὴν ἐάσαντα ἄτηκτον παρέσχεν· τὰ δὲ ὕδατος ἐπειδὴ μείζω πέφυκεν μέρη, βίαιον ποιούμενα τὴν διέξοδον, λύοντα αὐτὴν τήκει.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ δὴ πλεῖστα ὑδάτων εἴδη μεμειγμένα ἀλλήλοις—σύμπαν μὲν τὸ γένος,  διὰ τῶν ἐκ γῆς φυτῶν ἠθημένα, χυμοὶ λεγόμενοι—διὰ δὲ τὰς μείξεις ἀνομοιότητα ἕκαστοι σχόντες τὰ μὲν ἄλλα πολλὰ ἀνώνυμα γένη παρέσχοντο, τέτταρα δὲ ὅσα ἔμπυρα εἴδη, διαφανῆ μάλιστα γενόμενα, εἴληφεν ὀνόματα αὐτῶν, τὸ μὲν τῆς ψυχῆς μετὰ τοῦ σώματος θερμαντικὸν οἶνος, τὸ δὲ λεῖον καὶ διακριτικὸν ὄψεως διὰ ταῦτά τε ἰδεῖν λαμπρὸν καὶ στίλβον λιπαρόν τε φανταζόμενον ἐλαιηρὸν εἶδος, πίττα καὶ κίκι καὶ ἔλαιον αὐτὸ ὅσα τʼ ἄλλα τῆς αὐτῆς δυνάμεως· ὅσον δὲ διαχυτικὸν  μέχρι φύσεως τῶν περὶ τὸ στόμα συνόδων, ταύτῃ τῇ δυνάμει γλυκύτητα παρεχόμενον, μέλι τὸ κατὰ πάντων μάλιστα πρόσρημα ἔσχεν, τὸ δὲ τῆς σαρκὸς διαλυτικὸν τῷ κάειν, ἀφρῶδες γένος, ἐκ πάντων ἀφορισθὲν τῶν χυμῶν, ὀπὸς ἐπωνομάσθη. γῆς δὲ εἴδη, τὸ μὲν ἠθημένον διὰ ὕδατος τοιῷδε τρόπῳ γίγνεται σῶμα λίθινον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","text":"τὸ συμμιγὲς ὕδωρ ὅταν ἐν τῇ συμμείξει κοπῇ, μετέβαλεν εἰς ἀέρος ἰδέαν· γενόμενος δὲ  ἀὴρ εἰς τὸν ἑαυτοῦ τόπον ἀναθεῖ. κενὸν δʼ ὑπερεῖχεν αὐτῶν οὐδέν· τὸν οὖν πλησίον ἔωσεν ἀέρα. ὁ δὲ ἅτε ὢν βαρύς, ὠσθεὶς καὶ περιχυθεὶς τῷ τῆς γῆς ὄγκῳ, σφόδρα ἔθλιψεν συνέωσέν τε αὐτὸν εἰς τὰς ἕδρας ὅθεν ἀνῄει ὁ νέος ἀήρ· συνωσθεῖσα δὲ ὑπὸ ἀέρος ἀλύτως ὕδατι γῆ συνίσταται πέτρα, καλλίων μὲν ἡ τῶν ἴσων καὶ ὁμαλῶν διαφανὴς μερῶν, αἰσχίων δὲ ἡ ἐναντία. τὸ δὲ ὑπὸ πυρὸς τάχους τὸ νοτερὸν  πᾶν ἐξαρπασθὲν καὶ κραυρότερον ἐκείνου συστάν, ᾧ γένει κέραμον ἐπωνομάκαμεν, τοῦτο γέγονεν· ἔστιν δὲ ὅτε νοτίδος ὑπολειφθείσης χυτὴ γῆ γενομένη διὰ πυρὸς ὅταν ψυχθῇ, γίγνεται τὸ μέλαν χρῶμα ἔχον λίθος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","text":"τὼ δʼ αὖ κατὰ ταὐτὰ μὲν ταῦτα ἐκ συμμείξεως ὕδατος ἀπομονουμένω πολλοῦ, λεπτοτέρων δὲ ἐκ γῆς μερῶν ἁλμυρώ τε ὄντε, ἡμιπαγῆ γενομένω καὶ λυτὼ πάλιν ὑφʼ ὕδατος, τὸ μὲν ἐλαίου καὶ γῆς καθαρτικὸν γένος λίτρον, τὸ δʼ εὐάρμοστον ἐν ταῖς κοινωνίαις  ταῖς περὶ τὴν τοῦ στόματος αἴσθησιν ἁλῶν κατὰ λόγον  θεοφιλὲς σῶμα ἐγένετο. τὰ δὲ κοινὰ ἐξ ἀμφοῖν ὕδατι μὲν οὐ λυτά, πυρὶ δέ, διὰ τὸ τοιόνδε οὕτω συμπήγνυται. γῆς ὄγκους πῦρ μὲν ἀήρ τε οὐ τήκει· τῆς γὰρ συστάσεως τῶν διακένων αὐτῆς σμικρομερέστερα πεφυκότα, διὰ πολλῆς εὐρυχωρίας ἰόντα, οὐ βιαζόμενα, ἄλυτον αὐτὴν ἐάσαντα ἄτηκτον παρέσχεν· τὰ δὲ ὕδατος ἐπειδὴ μείζω πέφυκεν μέρη, βίαιον ποιούμενα τὴν διέξοδον, λύοντα αὐτὴν τήκει.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"521f3a70028a1308b33e1e5f10f6d787f9f726e4c3e437b8dcac9396029d1868","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225019894828Z_8bf358d6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 60","source_sha256":"521f3a70028a1308b33e1e5f10f6d787f9f726e4c3e437b8dcac9396029d1868","sha256":"01409f9c199e454df4526e08ddabd5ff3dad285872328774a936215f4d9b5bf6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:19.894864+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","text":"TIM. Now the very many kinds of waters, mixed with one another—the whole class, when strained through the plants that grow from the earth, being called “juices”—having each acquired dissimilarity through their mixtures, have produced many other unnamed kinds; but four kinds, as many as are fiery, having become especially transparent, have received names. That which warms the soul together with the body is wine; that which is smooth and discriminative of sight, and for these reasons appears bright, gleaming, and oily, is the oily kind—pitch, castor oil, oil itself, and all the others of the same power. That which is diffusible as far as the natural passages about the mouth, and by this power provides sweetness, has most generally received the appellation honey; while that which dissolves flesh by burning, a foamy kind separated off from all the juices, was named sap. Of kinds of earth, that which is strained through water becomes a stony body in the following way.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","text":"When the water mixed in it is cut off in the mixture, it changes into the form of air; and, having become air, it rises to its own place. But there was no void above them; it therefore pushed the neighboring air. And this, being heavy, when pushed and poured around the mass of earth, strongly compressed it and forced it together into the seats from which the new air was rising; and earth, compressed by air without dissolution by water, becomes rock—the more beautiful kind being that composed of equal and uniform transparent parts, the uglier its opposite. But that from which all moisture has been snatched away by the swiftness of fire, and which has become more brittle than that, is what we have named the kind called pottery. Sometimes, when moisture is left behind and earth, made fluid through fire, is cooled, there comes to be a stone having a black color.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","text":"Again, two things which in the same way are separated from a mixture of much water, but consist of finer parts of earth and are saline, becoming half-solid and again soluble by water: the one, a kind cleansing oil and earth, became natron; the other, well fitted for the associations concerned with the sensation of the mouth, became salt, a body dear to the gods according to reason. The things common to both, not soluble by water but by fire, are compacted in the following way. Fire and air do not melt masses of earth; for, being by nature composed of parts smaller than the interstices of its structure, passing through with much room and applying no force, they leave it undissolved and render it unmelted. But the parts of water, since they are naturally larger, force their way through violently and, dissolving it, melt it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"5209030352766ef4623f8056eeadfd8be266f6a6a8dd274c1d7416d961b975a6","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 60"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 60","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40","title":"Section 61","order":45,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_40","text":"ΤΙ. γῆν  μὲν γὰρ ἀσύστατον ὑπὸ βίας οὕτως ὕδωρ μόνον λύει, συνεστηκυῖαν δὲ πλὴν πυρὸς οὐδέν· εἴσοδος γὰρ οὐδενὶ πλὴν πυρὶ λέλειπται. τὴν δὲ ὕδατος αὖ σύνοδον τὴν μὲν βιαιοτάτην πῦρ μόνον, τὴν δὲ ἀσθενεστέραν ἀμφότερα, πῦρ τε καὶ ἀήρ, διαχεῖτον, ὁ μὲν κατὰ τὰ διάκενα, τὸ δὲ καὶ κατὰ τὰ τρίγωνα· βίᾳ δὲ ἀέρα συστάντα οὐδὲν λύει πλὴν κατὰ τὸ στοιχεῖον, ἀβίαστον δὲ κατατήκει μόνον πῦρ. τὰ δὴ τῶν συμμείκτων ἐκ γῆς τε καὶ ὕδατος σωμάτων, μέχριπερ ἂν  ὕδωρ αὐτοῦ τὰ τῆς γῆς διάκενα καὶ βίᾳ συμπεπιλημένα κατέχῃ, τὰ μὲν ὕδατος ἐπιόντα ἔξωθεν εἴσοδον οὐκ ἔχοντα μέρη περιρρέοντα τὸν ὅλον ὄγκον ἄτηκτον εἴασεν, τὰ δὲ πυρὸς εἰς τὰ τῶν ὑδάτων διάκενα εἰσιόντα, ὅπερ ὕδωρ γῆν, τοῦτο πῦρ  ἀπεργαζόμενα, τηχθέντι τῷ κοινῷ σώματι ῥεῖν μόνα αἴτια συμβέβηκεν· τυγχάνει δὲ ταῦτα ὄντα, τὰ μὲν ἔλαττον ἔχοντα ὕδατος ἢ γῆς, τό τε περὶ τὴν ὕαλον γένος  ἅπαν ὅσα τε λίθων χυτὰ εἴδη καλεῖται, τὰ δὲ πλέον ὕδατος αὖ, πάντα ὅσα κηροειδῆ καὶ θυμιατικὰ σώματα συμπήγνυται. καὶ τὰ μὲν δὴ σχήμασι κοινωνίαις τε καὶ μεταλλαγαῖς εἰς ἄλληλα πεποικιλμένα εἴδη σχεδὸν ἐπιδέδεικται· τὰ δὲ παθήματα αὐτῶν διʼ ἃς αἰτίας γέγονεν πειρατέον ἐμφανίζειν. πρῶτον μὲν οὖν ὑπάρχειν αἴσθησιν δεῖ τοῖς λεγομένοις ἀεί, σαρκὸς δὲ καὶ τῶν περὶ σάρκα γένεσιν, ψυχῆς τε ὅσον θνητόν, οὔπω διεληλύθαμεν· τυγχάνει δὲ οὔτε ταῦτα χωρὶς  τῶν περὶ τὰ παθήματα ὅσα αἰσθητικὰ οὔτʼ ἐκεῖνα ἄνευ τούτων δυνατὰ ἱκανῶς λεχθῆναι, τὸ δὲ ἅμα σχεδὸν οὐ δυνατόν. ὑποθετέον δὴ πρότερον θάτερα, τὰ δʼ ὑποτεθέντα ἐπάνιμεν αὖθις. ἵνα οὖν ἑξῆς τὰ παθήματα λέγηται τοῖς γένεσιν, ἔστω πρότερα ἡμῖν τὰ περὶ σῶμα καὶ ψυχὴν ὄντα. πρῶτον μὲν οὖν ᾗ πῦρ θερμὸν λέγομεν, ἴδωμεν ὧδε σκοποῦντες, τὴν διάκρισιν καὶ τομὴν αὐτοῦ περὶ τὸ σῶμα ἡμῶν γιγνομένην  ἐννοηθέντες. ὅτι μὲν γὰρ ὀξύ τι τὸ πάθος, πάντες σχεδὸν αἰσθανόμεθα·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. γῆν  μὲν γὰρ ἀσύστατον ὑπὸ βίας οὕτως ὕδωρ μόνον λύει, συνεστηκυῖαν δὲ πλὴν πυρὸς οὐδέν· εἴσοδος γὰρ οὐδενὶ πλὴν πυρὶ λέλειπται. τὴν δὲ ὕδατος αὖ σύνοδον τὴν μὲν βιαιοτάτην πῦρ μόνον, τὴν δὲ ἀσθενεστέραν ἀμφότερα, πῦρ τε καὶ ἀήρ, διαχεῖτον, ὁ μὲν κατὰ τὰ διάκενα, τὸ δὲ καὶ κατὰ τὰ τρίγωνα· βίᾳ δὲ ἀέρα συστάντα οὐδὲν λύει πλὴν κατὰ τὸ στοιχεῖον, ἀβίαστον δὲ κατατήκει μόνον πῦρ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","text":"τὰ δὴ τῶν συμμείκτων ἐκ γῆς τε καὶ ὕδατος σωμάτων, μέχριπερ ἂν  ὕδωρ αὐτοῦ τὰ τῆς γῆς διάκενα καὶ βίᾳ συμπεπιλημένα κατέχῃ, τὰ μὲν ὕδατος ἐπιόντα ἔξωθεν εἴσοδον οὐκ ἔχοντα μέρη περιρρέοντα τὸν ὅλον ὄγκον ἄτηκτον εἴασεν, τὰ δὲ πυρὸς εἰς τὰ τῶν ὑδάτων διάκενα εἰσιόντα, ὅπερ ὕδωρ γῆν, τοῦτο πῦρ  ἀπεργαζόμενα, τηχθέντι τῷ κοινῷ σώματι ῥεῖν μόνα αἴτια συμβέβηκεν· τυγχάνει δὲ ταῦτα ὄντα, τὰ μὲν ἔλαττον ἔχοντα ὕδατος ἢ γῆς, τό τε περὶ τὴν ὕαλον γένος  ἅπαν ὅσα τε λίθων χυτὰ εἴδη καλεῖται, τὰ δὲ πλέον ὕδατος αὖ, πάντα ὅσα κηροειδῆ καὶ θυμιατικὰ σώματα συμπήγνυται. καὶ τὰ μὲν δὴ σχήμασι κοινωνίαις τε καὶ μεταλλαγαῖς εἰς ἄλληλα πεποικιλμένα εἴδη σχεδὸν ἐπιδέδεικται· τὰ δὲ παθήματα αὐτῶν διʼ ἃς αἰτίας γέγονεν πειρατέον ἐμφανίζειν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","text":"πρῶτον μὲν οὖν ὑπάρχειν αἴσθησιν δεῖ τοῖς λεγομένοις ἀεί, σαρκὸς δὲ καὶ τῶν περὶ σάρκα γένεσιν, ψυχῆς τε ὅσον θνητόν, οὔπω διεληλύθαμεν· τυγχάνει δὲ οὔτε ταῦτα χωρὶς  τῶν περὶ τὰ παθήματα ὅσα αἰσθητικὰ οὔτʼ ἐκεῖνα ἄνευ τούτων δυνατὰ ἱκανῶς λεχθῆναι, τὸ δὲ ἅμα σχεδὸν οὐ δυνατόν. ὑποθετέον δὴ πρότερον θάτερα, τὰ δʼ ὑποτεθέντα ἐπάνιμεν αὖθις. ἵνα οὖν ἑξῆς τὰ παθήματα λέγηται τοῖς γένεσιν, ἔστω πρότερα ἡμῖν τὰ περὶ σῶμα καὶ ψυχὴν ὄντα. πρῶτον μὲν οὖν ᾗ πῦρ θερμὸν λέγομεν, ἴδωμεν ὧδε σκοποῦντες, τὴν διάκρισιν καὶ τομὴν αὐτοῦ περὶ τὸ σῶμα ἡμῶν γιγνομένην  ἐννοηθέντες. ὅτι μὲν γὰρ ὀξύ τι τὸ πάθος, πάντες σχεδὸν αἰσθανόμεθα·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"f205b7719e718c21951de2801f4de6d30464e9530b5beef35a865f62897ff4e8","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225026467612Z_ea7cc2e5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 61","source_sha256":"f205b7719e718c21951de2801f4de6d30464e9530b5beef35a865f62897ff4e8","sha256":"1503c7d18623d7fe79417cbdd0f0c2a356c998a67a3e8c0e77eec1e65dbaab32","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:26.467698+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","text":"For earth that is unconsolidated by force is thus dissolved by water alone, whereas when consolidated nothing dissolves it except fire; for entrance has been left open to nothing except fire. Again, of the union of water, its most violent dissolution is effected by fire alone, while its weaker dissolution is effected by both, fire and air: the latter through the interstices, the former also through the triangles. But nothing dissolves air when it has been forcibly compacted except according to the element; while only fire melts it when it is not forcibly compacted.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","text":"Accordingly, among bodies compounded of earth and water, so long as the water itself occupies the interstices of the earth and is compacted together by force, the portions of water that come from outside, having no entrance, flow around the whole mass and leave it unmelted; but the portions of fire, entering into the interstices of the water and producing in respect of water what water produces in respect of earth, have consequently become the sole causes of the common body, when melted, flowing. Such bodies are, on the one hand, those containing less water than earth—namely, the whole class concerned with glass and all the kinds of stones called fusible—and, on the other hand, those containing more water, namely all the bodies that are compacted as wax-like and incense-like substances. And these things, diversified into kinds by shapes, combinations, and transformations into one another, have now almost been displayed; but we must try to make clear their affections, through what causes they have arisen.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","text":"First, then, there must always be perception in the things spoken of; but we have not yet gone through the generation of flesh and of the things about flesh, nor that part of soul which is mortal. Yet neither these things can be adequately spoken of apart from the affections insofar as they are perceptive, nor those things without these; but to do both at once is virtually impossible. We must therefore first posit one of the two, and then return again to what has been posited. In order, then, that the affections may be discussed consecutively with their generations, let matters concerning body and soul come first for us. First, then, let us consider in this way why we say that fire is hot, having in mind its separation and cutting occurring about our body. For that the affection is something sharp, nearly all of us perceive.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"1ff3e6372f5a8c86939503fb82d7af24fb1f9851ce55e2ede50373b000e5a64b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 61"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 61","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41","title":"Section 62","order":46,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_41","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν δὲ λεπτότητα τῶν πλευρῶν καὶ γωνιῶν ὀξύτητα τῶν τε μορίων σμικρότητα καὶ τῆς φορᾶς τὸ τάχος, οἷς πᾶσι σφοδρὸν ὂν καὶ τομὸν ὀξέως τὸ προστυχὸν ἀεὶ  τέμνει, λογιστέον ἀναμιμνῃσκομένοις τὴν τοῦ σχήματος αὐτοῦ γένεσιν, ὅτι μάλιστα ἐκείνη καὶ οὐκ ἄλλη φύσις διακρίνουσα ἡμῶν κατὰ σμικρά τε τὰ σώματα κερματίζουσα τοῦτο ὃ νῦν θερμὸν λέγομεν εἰκότως τὸ πάθημα καὶ τοὔνομα παρέσχεν. τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτων κατάδηλον μέν, ὅμως δὲ μηδὲν ἐπιδεὲς ἔστω λόγου. τὰ γὰρ δὴ τῶν περὶ τὸ σῶμα ὑγρῶν μεγαλομερέστερα εἰσιόντα, τὰ σμικρότερα ἐξωθοῦντα, εἰς τὰς ἐκείνων οὐ δυνάμενα ἕδρας ἐνδῦναι, συνωθοῦντα ἡμῶν  τὸ νοτερόν, ἐξ ἀνωμάλου κεκινημένου τε ἀκίνητον διʼ ὁμαλότητα καὶ τὴν σύνωσιν ἀπεργαζόμενα πήγνυσιν· τὸ δὲ παρὰ φύσιν συναγόμενον μάχεται κατὰ φύσιν αὐτὸ ἑαυτὸ εἰς τοὐναντίον ἀπωθοῦν. τῇ δὴ μάχῃ καὶ τῷ σεισμῷ τούτῳ τρόμος καὶ ῥῖγος ἐτέθη, ψυχρόν τε τὸ πάθος ἅπαν τοῦτο καὶ τὸ δρῶν αὐτὸ ἔσχεν ὄνομα. σκληρὸν δέ, ὅσοις ἂν ἡμῶν ἡ σὰρξ ὑπείκῃ, μαλακὸν δέ, ὅσα ἂν τῇ σαρκί· πρὸς ἄλληλά τε οὕτως. ὑπείκει δὲ ὅσον ἐπὶ σμικροῦ βαίνει· τὸ δὲ ἐκ  τετραγώνων ὂν βάσεων, ἅτε βεβηκὸς σφόδρα, ἀντιτυπώτατον εἶδος, ὅτι τε ἂν εἰς πυκνότητα συνιὸν πλείστην ἀντίτονον ᾖ μάλιστα. βαρὺ δὲ καὶ κοῦφον μετὰ τῆς τοῦ κάτω φύσεως ἄνω τε λεγομένης ἐξεταζόμενον ἂν δηλωθείη σαφέστατα. φύσει γὰρ δή τινας τόπους δύο εἶναι διειληφότας διχῇ τὸ πᾶν ἐναντίους, τὸν μὲν κάτω, πρὸς ὃν φέρεται πάνθʼ ὅσα τινὰ ὄγκον σώματος ἔχει, τὸν δὲ ἄνω, πρὸς ὃν ἀκουσίως ἔρχεται πᾶν, οὐκ ὀρθὸν οὐδαμῇ νομίζειν· τοῦ γὰρ παντὸς  οὐρανοῦ σφαιροειδοῦς ὄντος, ὅσα μὲν ἀφεστῶτα ἴσον τοῦ μέσου γέγονεν ἔσχατα, ὁμοίως αὐτὰ χρὴ ἔσχατα πεφυκέναι, τὸ δὲ μέσον τὰ αὐτὰ μέτρα τῶν ἐσχάτων ἀφεστηκὸς ἐν τῷ καταντικρὺ νομίζειν δεῖ πάντων εἶναι. τοῦ δὴ κόσμου ταύτῃ πεφυκότος, τί τῶν εἰρημένων ἄνω τις ἢ κάτω τιθέμενος οὐκ ἐν δίκῃ δόξει τὸ μηδὲν προσῆκον ὄνομα λέγειν; ὁ μὲν γὰρ μέσος ἐν αὐτῷ τόπος οὔτε κάτω πεφυκὼς οὔτε ἄνω λέγεσθαι δίκαιος, ἀλλʼ αὐτὸ ἐν μέσῳ· ὁ δὲ πέριξ οὔτε δὴ μέσος οὔτʼ ἔχων διάφορον αὑτοῦ μέρος ἕτερον θατέρου μᾶλλον πρὸς τὸ μέσον ἤ τι τῶν καταντικρύ. τοῦ δὲ ὁμοίως πάντῃ πεφυκότος ποῖά τις ἐπιφέρων ὀνόματα αὐτῷ ἐναντία καὶ πῇ καλῶς ἂν ἡγοῖτο λέγειν;","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν δὲ λεπτότητα τῶν πλευρῶν καὶ γωνιῶν ὀξύτητα τῶν τε μορίων σμικρότητα καὶ τῆς φορᾶς τὸ τάχος, οἷς πᾶσι σφοδρὸν ὂν καὶ τομὸν ὀξέως τὸ προστυχὸν ἀεὶ  τέμνει, λογιστέον ἀναμιμνῃσκομένοις τὴν τοῦ σχήματος αὐτοῦ γένεσιν, ὅτι μάλιστα ἐκείνη καὶ οὐκ ἄλλη φύσις διακρίνουσα ἡμῶν κατὰ σμικρά τε τὰ σώματα κερματίζουσα τοῦτο ὃ νῦν θερμὸν λέγομεν εἰκότως τὸ πάθημα καὶ τοὔνομα παρέσχεν. τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτων κατάδηλον μέν, ὅμως δὲ μηδὲν ἐπιδεὲς ἔστω λόγου. τὰ γὰρ δὴ τῶν περὶ τὸ σῶμα ὑγρῶν μεγαλομερέστερα εἰσιόντα, τὰ σμικρότερα ἐξωθοῦντα, εἰς τὰς ἐκείνων οὐ δυνάμενα ἕδρας ἐνδῦναι, συνωθοῦντα ἡμῶν  τὸ νοτερόν, ἐξ ἀνωμάλου κεκινημένου τε ἀκίνητον διʼ ὁμαλότητα καὶ τὴν σύνωσιν ἀπεργαζόμενα πήγνυσιν· τὸ δὲ παρὰ φύσιν συναγόμενον μάχεται κατὰ φύσιν αὐτὸ ἑαυτὸ εἰς τοὐναντίον ἀπωθοῦν. τῇ δὴ μάχῃ καὶ τῷ σεισμῷ τούτῳ τρόμος καὶ ῥῖγος ἐτέθη, ψυχρόν τε τὸ πάθος ἅπαν τοῦτο καὶ τὸ δρῶν αὐτὸ ἔσχεν ὄνομα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","text":"σκληρὸν δέ, ὅσοις ἂν ἡμῶν ἡ σὰρξ ὑπείκῃ, μαλακὸν δέ, ὅσα ἂν τῇ σαρκί· πρὸς ἄλληλά τε οὕτως. ὑπείκει δὲ ὅσον ἐπὶ σμικροῦ βαίνει· τὸ δὲ ἐκ  τετραγώνων ὂν βάσεων, ἅτε βεβηκὸς σφόδρα, ἀντιτυπώτατον εἶδος, ὅτι τε ἂν εἰς πυκνότητα συνιὸν πλείστην ἀντίτονον ᾖ μάλιστα. βαρὺ δὲ καὶ κοῦφον μετὰ τῆς τοῦ κάτω φύσεως ἄνω τε λεγομένης ἐξεταζόμενον ἂν δηλωθείη σαφέστατα. φύσει γὰρ δή τινας τόπους δύο εἶναι διειληφότας διχῇ τὸ πᾶν ἐναντίους, τὸν μὲν κάτω, πρὸς ὃν φέρεται πάνθʼ ὅσα τινὰ ὄγκον σώματος ἔχει, τὸν δὲ ἄνω, πρὸς ὃν ἀκουσίως ἔρχεται πᾶν, οὐκ ὀρθὸν οὐδαμῇ νομίζειν· τοῦ γὰρ παντὸς  οὐρανοῦ σφαιροειδοῦς ὄντος, ὅσα μὲν ἀφεστῶτα ἴσον τοῦ μέσου γέγονεν ἔσχατα, ὁμοίως αὐτὰ χρὴ ἔσχατα πεφυκέναι, τὸ δὲ μέσον τὰ αὐτὰ μέτρα τῶν ἐσχάτων ἀφεστηκὸς ἐν τῷ καταντικρὺ νομίζειν δεῖ πάντων εἶναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","text":"τοῦ δὴ κόσμου ταύτῃ πεφυκότος, τί τῶν εἰρημένων ἄνω τις ἢ κάτω τιθέμενος οὐκ ἐν δίκῃ δόξει τὸ μηδὲν προσῆκον ὄνομα λέγειν; ὁ μὲν γὰρ μέσος ἐν αὐτῷ τόπος οὔτε κάτω πεφυκὼς οὔτε ἄνω λέγεσθαι δίκαιος, ἀλλʼ αὐτὸ ἐν μέσῳ· ὁ δὲ πέριξ οὔτε δὴ μέσος οὔτʼ ἔχων διάφορον αὑτοῦ μέρος ἕτερον θατέρου μᾶλλον πρὸς τὸ μέσον ἤ τι τῶν καταντικρύ. τοῦ δὲ ὁμοίως πάντῃ πεφυκότος ποῖά τις ἐπιφέρων ὀνόματα αὐτῷ ἐναντία καὶ πῇ καλῶς ἂν ἡγοῖτο λέγειν;","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"b21003cfaa103337f308a532c6573561b0bd0424814e421f73608518ff34b8d0","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225035377907Z_8421cfdf","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 62","source_sha256":"b21003cfaa103337f308a532c6573561b0bd0424814e421f73608518ff34b8d0","sha256":"456324a91205521cffb2e0f304ff2d06c4c4c29774745a6c069828688f0dcb24","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:35.378060+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","text":"TIM. The fineness of the sides and the sharpness of the angles, the smallness of the particles, and the swiftness of their motion—by all of which, being violent and cutting, it always sharply cuts whatever it encounters—must be accounted for by recalling the generation of its shape itself: that this nature especially, and no other, dividing us up and breaking our bodies into small pieces, reasonably provided both this affection and the name which we now call hot. Its opposite is evident; nevertheless, let it lack no account. For the larger particles of the liquids around the body, entering in and thrusting out the smaller, being unable to enter into their seats, compress our moisture and, out of what has been unevenly moved, produce rest through uniformity and compression, and congelation; but what is unnaturally compacted strives, in accordance with nature, to thrust itself back into the opposite condition. To this struggle and this shaking were assigned trembling and shivering; and the whole affection is called cold, as is that which produces it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","text":"Hard, in the case of whatever our flesh yields to; soft, whatever yields to the flesh; and so too in relation to one another. It yields insofar as it gives way over a small extent; but that which has square bases, being very firmly set, is the most resistant kind, especially if, coming together into the greatest density, it is most taut. Heavy and light, moreover, may be made most clear if examined together with the nature called below and above. For to suppose that there are by nature two regions which have divided the whole in two, opposite to one another—the one below, toward which are borne all things that have any bodily bulk, and the other above, toward which everything goes unwillingly—is in no way right. For since the whole heaven is spherical, whatever things, standing at an equal distance from the center, have become extremities, must equally be naturally extremities; while the center, being distant by the same measures from the extremities, must be regarded as opposite to all of them.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","text":"Since the cosmos is naturally constituted in this way, which of the things mentioned could one place above or below without seeming, justly, to use a name that is in no way appropriate? For the central region within it is by nature entitled to be called neither below nor above, but simply in the middle; while the region around it is neither central, nor does it have any part of itself differing from another as being more toward the center, or toward any of the opposite points. And to that which is naturally alike in every direction, what contrary names could one apply, and in what way could one think oneself to be speaking correctly?","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"43750c9779dde820366be7ba5cb07761c0fddc791f6e19ab7dbdb44ffd66a388","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 62"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 62","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42","title":"Section 63","order":47,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_42","text":"ΤΙ. εἰ γάρ τι καὶ στερεὸν εἴη κατὰ μέσον τοῦ  παντὸς ἰσοπαλές, εἰς οὐδὲν ἄν ποτε τῶν ἐσχάτων ἐνεχθείη διὰ τὴν πάντῃ ὁμοιότητα αὐτῶν· ἀλλʼ εἰ καὶ περὶ αὐτὸ πορεύοιτό τις ἐν κύκλῳ, πολλάκις ἂν στὰς ἀντίπους ταὐτὸν αὐτοῦ κάτω καὶ ἄνω προσείποι. τὸ μὲν γὰρ ὅλον, καθάπερ εἴρηται νυνδή, σφαιροειδὲς ὄν, τόπον τινὰ κάτω, τὸν δὲ ἄνω λέγειν ἔχειν οὐκ ἔμφρονος· ὅθεν δὲ ὠνομάσθη ταῦτα καὶ ἐν οἷς ὄντα εἰθίσμεθα διʼ ἐκεῖνα καὶ τὸν οὐρανὸν ὅλον οὕτω διαιρούμενοι  λέγειν, ταῦτα διομολογητέον ὑποθεμένοις τάδε ἡμῖν. εἴ τις ἐν τῷ τοῦ παντὸς τόπῳ καθʼ ὃν ἡ τοῦ πυρὸς εἴληχε μάλιστα φύσις, οὗ καὶ πλεῖστον ἂν ἠθροισμένον εἴη πρὸς ὃ φέρεται, ἐπεμβὰς ἐπʼ ἐκεῖνο καὶ δύναμιν εἰς τοῦτο ἔχων, μέρη τοῦ πυρὸς ἀφαιρῶν ἱσταίη τιθεὶς εἰς πλάστιγγας, αἴρων τὸν ζυγὸν καὶ τὸ πῦρ ἕλκων εἰς ἀνόμοιον ἀέρα βιαζόμενος  δῆλον ὡς τοὔλαττόν που τοῦ μείζονος ῥᾷον βιᾶται· ῥώμῃ γὰρ μιᾷ δυοῖν ἅμα μετεωριζομένοιν τὸ μὲν ἔλαττον μᾶλλον, τὸ δὲ πλέον ἧττον ἀνάγκη που κατατεινόμενον συνέπεσθαι τῇ βίᾳ, καὶ τὸ μὲν πολὺ βαρὺ καὶ κάτω φερόμενον κληθῆναι, τὸ δὲ σμικρὸν ἐλαφρὸν καὶ ἄνω. ταὐτὸν δὴ τοῦτο δεῖ φωρᾶσαι δρῶντας ἡμᾶς περὶ τόνδε τὸν τόπον. ἐπὶ γὰρ γῆς βεβῶτες γεώδη γένη διιστάμενοι, καὶ γῆν ἐνίοτε αὐτήν, ἕλκομεν εἰς ἀνόμοιον ἀέρα βίᾳ καὶ παρὰ φύσιν, ἀμφότερα τοῦ  συγγενοῦς ἀντεχόμενα, τὸ δὲ σμικρότερον ῥᾷον τοῦ μείζονος βιαζομένοις εἰς τὸ ἀνόμοιον πρότερον συνέπεται· κοῦφον οὖν αὐτὸ προσειρήκαμεν, καὶ τὸν τόπον εἰς ὃν βιαζόμεθα, ἄνω, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτοις πάθος βαρὺ καὶ κάτω. ταῦτʼ οὖν δὴ διαφόρως ἔχειν αὐτὰ πρὸς αὑτὰ ἀνάγκη διὰ τὸ τὰ πλήθη τῶν γενῶν τόπον ἐναντίον ἄλλα ἄλλοις κατέχειν—τὸ γὰρ ἐν ἑτέρῳ κοῦφον ὂν τόπῳ τῷ κατὰ τὸν ἐναντίον τόπον ἐλαφρῷ  καὶ τῷ βαρεῖ τὸ βαρὺ τῷ τε κάτω τὸ κάτω καὶ τὸ ἄνω τῷ ἄνω πάντʼ ἐναντία καὶ πλάγια καὶ πάντως διάφορα πρὸς ἄλληλα ἀνευρεθήσεται γιγνόμενα καὶ ὄντα—τόδε γε μὴν ἕν τι διανοητέον περὶ πάντων αὐτῶν, ὡς ἡ μὲν πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ὁδὸς ἑκάστοις οὖσα βαρὺ μὲν τὸ φερόμενον ποιεῖ, τὸν δὲ τόπον εἰς ὃν τὸ τοιοῦτον φέρεται, κάτω, τὰ δὲ τούτοις ἔχοντα ὡς ἑτέρως θάτερα. περὶ δὴ τούτων αὖ τῶν παθημάτων ταῦτα αἴτια εἰρήσθω.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. εἰ γάρ τι καὶ στερεὸν εἴη κατὰ μέσον τοῦ  παντὸς ἰσοπαλές, εἰς οὐδὲν ἄν ποτε τῶν ἐσχάτων ἐνεχθείη διὰ τὴν πάντῃ ὁμοιότητα αὐτῶν· ἀλλʼ εἰ καὶ περὶ αὐτὸ πορεύοιτό τις ἐν κύκλῳ, πολλάκις ἂν στὰς ἀντίπους ταὐτὸν αὐτοῦ κάτω καὶ ἄνω προσείποι. τὸ μὲν γὰρ ὅλον, καθάπερ εἴρηται νυνδή, σφαιροειδὲς ὄν, τόπον τινὰ κάτω, τὸν δὲ ἄνω λέγειν ἔχειν οὐκ ἔμφρονος· ὅθεν δὲ ὠνομάσθη ταῦτα καὶ ἐν οἷς ὄντα εἰθίσμεθα διʼ ἐκεῖνα καὶ τὸν οὐρανὸν ὅλον οὕτω διαιρούμενοι  λέγειν, ταῦτα διομολογητέον ὑποθεμένοις τάδε ἡμῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","text":"εἴ τις ἐν τῷ τοῦ παντὸς τόπῳ καθʼ ὃν ἡ τοῦ πυρὸς εἴληχε μάλιστα φύσις, οὗ καὶ πλεῖστον ἂν ἠθροισμένον εἴη πρὸς ὃ φέρεται, ἐπεμβὰς ἐπʼ ἐκεῖνο καὶ δύναμιν εἰς τοῦτο ἔχων, μέρη τοῦ πυρὸς ἀφαιρῶν ἱσταίη τιθεὶς εἰς πλάστιγγας, αἴρων τὸν ζυγὸν καὶ τὸ πῦρ ἕλκων εἰς ἀνόμοιον ἀέρα βιαζόμενος  δῆλον ὡς τοὔλαττόν που τοῦ μείζονος ῥᾷον βιᾶται· ῥώμῃ γὰρ μιᾷ δυοῖν ἅμα μετεωριζομένοιν τὸ μὲν ἔλαττον μᾶλλον, τὸ δὲ πλέον ἧττον ἀνάγκη που κατατεινόμενον συνέπεσθαι τῇ βίᾳ, καὶ τὸ μὲν πολὺ βαρὺ καὶ κάτω φερόμενον κληθῆναι, τὸ δὲ σμικρὸν ἐλαφρὸν καὶ ἄνω. ταὐτὸν δὴ τοῦτο δεῖ φωρᾶσαι δρῶντας ἡμᾶς περὶ τόνδε τὸν τόπον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","text":"ἐπὶ γὰρ γῆς βεβῶτες γεώδη γένη διιστάμενοι, καὶ γῆν ἐνίοτε αὐτήν, ἕλκομεν εἰς ἀνόμοιον ἀέρα βίᾳ καὶ παρὰ φύσιν, ἀμφότερα τοῦ  συγγενοῦς ἀντεχόμενα, τὸ δὲ σμικρότερον ῥᾷον τοῦ μείζονος βιαζομένοις εἰς τὸ ἀνόμοιον πρότερον συνέπεται· κοῦφον οὖν αὐτὸ προσειρήκαμεν, καὶ τὸν τόπον εἰς ὃν βιαζόμεθα, ἄνω, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτοις πάθος βαρὺ καὶ κάτω. ταῦτʼ οὖν δὴ διαφόρως ἔχειν αὐτὰ πρὸς αὑτὰ ἀνάγκη διὰ τὸ τὰ πλήθη τῶν γενῶν τόπον ἐναντίον ἄλλα ἄλλοις κατέχειν—τὸ γὰρ ἐν ἑτέρῳ κοῦφον ὂν τόπῳ τῷ κατὰ τὸν ἐναντίον τόπον ἐλαφρῷ  καὶ τῷ βαρεῖ τὸ βαρὺ τῷ τε κάτω τὸ κάτω καὶ τὸ ἄνω τῷ ἄνω πάντʼ ἐναντία καὶ πλάγια καὶ πάντως διάφορα πρὸς ἄλληλα ἀνευρεθήσεται γιγνόμενα καὶ ὄντα—τόδε γε μὴν ἕν τι διανοητέον περὶ πάντων αὐτῶν, ὡς ἡ μὲν πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ὁδὸς ἑκάστοις οὖσα βαρὺ μὲν τὸ φερόμενον ποιεῖ, τὸν δὲ τόπον εἰς ὃν τὸ τοιοῦτον φέρεται, κάτω, τὰ δὲ τούτοις ἔχοντα ὡς ἑτέρως θάτερα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0004","text":"περὶ δὴ τούτων αὖ τῶν παθημάτων ταῦτα αἴτια εἰρήσθω.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"fbe81d58afe57b905b197d517c903ad4c6ade6131f8121f68ce3aab42a939913","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225043012488Z_f5700b7e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 63","source_sha256":"fbe81d58afe57b905b197d517c903ad4c6ade6131f8121f68ce3aab42a939913","sha256":"8a5a8cdf89fb6c2eea7e94f2a70b6836e71699b60b41befd59450027bf047eed","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:43.012678+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","text":"For if there were anything solid, equally balanced at the center of the universe, it would never be borne toward any of the extremities, owing to their uniformity in every direction; rather, even if someone were to travel around it in a circle, he would often, standing at the antipodes, call the same point of it below and above. For the whole, being spherical, as was said just now, it is not the mark of a sensible person to say that it has some region below and another above. But from what these things were named, and in what conditions we are accustomed, because of those things, thus to speak while dividing the whole heaven, these points must be agreed upon, if we make the following assumptions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","text":"If someone, in that region of the universe in which the nature of fire has obtained its proper place especially—where also the greatest quantity of it would be gathered, toward which it is borne—were to step upon that and, having power over it, remove portions of fire, set them in scales, raise the balance-beam, and forcibly draw the fire into unlike air, it is clear that the lesser is somehow more easily forced than the greater. For when two things are raised at once by one force, the lesser must, being more stretched, follow the force more, and the greater less; and the large is called heavy and borne downward, the small light and upward. We must surely find this same thing to be so in our actions concerning this region here.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","text":"For standing upon the earth, separating earthy kinds, and sometimes earth itself, we draw them by force and contrary to nature into unlike air, while both cling to their kindred; and, when we force them into the unlike, the smaller more readily follows before the greater. We have therefore called it light, and the place into which we force it, upward; while the affection contrary to these we call heavy and downward. These things, then, must necessarily stand differently in relation to one another, because the masses of the kinds occupy regions opposite, one to another—for what is light in one region, in relation to what is light in the opposite region, and the heavy in relation to the heavy, and the below to the below and the above to the above, will be found to become and be altogether opposite, oblique, and in every way different from one another. Yet one thing must be understood concerning them all: namely, that the course toward what is kindred, belonging to each, makes what is borne heavy, and makes the place toward which such a thing is borne below; while the other things have the opposite condition in another way.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0004","text":"Let these, then, be stated as the causes concerning these affections.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"e9a5e455ccc70b6df9131c212ed8bd9a6e012f98cfd2e7567daf6ae2ce45e58f","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 63"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 63","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43","title":"Section 64","order":48,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_43","text":"ΤΙ. λείου δʼ αὖ καὶ τραχέος παθήματος αἰτίαν πᾶς που κατιδὼν καὶ ἑτέρῳ δυνατὸς ἂν εἴη λέγειν· σκληρότης γὰρ ἀνωμαλότητι μειχθεῖσα, τὸ δʼ  ὁμαλότης πυκνότητι παρέχεται. μέγιστον δὲ καὶ λοιπὸν τῶν κοινῶν περὶ ὅλον τὸ σῶμα παθημάτων τὸ τῶν ἡδέων καὶ τῶν ἀλγεινῶν αἴτιον ἐν οἷς διεληλύθαμεν, καὶ ὅσα διὰ τῶν τοῦ σώματος μορίων αἰσθήσεις κεκτημένα καὶ λύπας ἐν αὑτοῖς ἡδονάς θʼ ἅμα ἑπομένας ἔχει. ὧδʼ οὖν κατὰ παντὸς αἰσθητοῦ καὶ ἀναισθήτου παθήματος τὰς αἰτίας λαμβάνωμεν, ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενοι τὸ τῆς  εὐκινήτου τε καὶ δυσκινήτου φύσεως ὅτι διειλόμεθα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν· ταύτῃ γὰρ δὴ μεταδιωκτέον πάντα ὅσα ἐπινοοῦμεν ἑλεῖν. τὸ μὲν γὰρ κατὰ φύσιν εὐκίνητον, ὅταν καὶ βραχὺ πάθος εἰς αὐτὸ ἐμπίπτῃ, διαδίδωσιν κύκλῳ μόρια ἕτερα ἑτέροις ταὐτὸν ἀπεργαζόμενα, μέχριπερ ἂν ἐπὶ τὸ φρόνιμον ἐλθόντα ἐξαγγείλῃ τοῦ ποιήσαντος τὴν δύναμιν· τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον ἑδραῖον ὂν κατʼ οὐδένα τε κύκλον ἰὸν πάσχει μόνον,  ἄλλο δὲ οὐ κινεῖ τῶν πλησίον, ὥστε οὐ διαδιδόντων μορίων μορίοις ἄλλων ἄλλοις τὸ πρῶτον πάθος ἐν αὐτοῖς ἀκίνητον εἰς τὸ πᾶν ζῷον γενόμενον ἀναίσθητον παρέσχεν τὸ παθόν. ταῦτα δὲ περί τε ὀστᾶ καὶ τὰς τρίχας ἐστὶν καὶ ὅσʼ ἄλλα γήϊνα τὸ πλεῖστον ἔχομεν ἐν ἡμῖν μόρια· τὰ δὲ ἔμπροσθεν περὶ τὰ τῆς ὄψεως καὶ ἀκοῆς μάλιστα, διὰ τὸ πυρὸς ἀέρος τε ἐν αὐτοῖς δύναμιν ἐνεῖναι μεγίστην. τὸ δὴ τῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης ὧδε δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι· τὸ μὲν παρὰ φύσιν καὶ  βίαιον γιγνόμενον ἁθρόον παρʼ ἡμῖν πάθος ἀλγεινόν, τὸ δʼ εἰς φύσιν ἀπιὸν πάλιν ἁθρόον ἡδύ, τὸ δὲ ἡρέμα καὶ κατὰ σμικρὸν ἀναίσθητον, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτοις ἐναντίως. τὸ δὲ μετʼ εὐπετείας γιγνόμενον ἅπαν αἰσθητὸν μὲν ὅτι μάλιστα, λύπης δὲ καὶ ἡδονῆς οὐ μετέχον, οἷον τὰ περὶ τὴν ὄψιν αὐτὴν παθήματα, ἣ δὴ σῶμα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἐρρήθη καθʼ ἡμέραν συμφυὲς ἡμῶν γίγνεσθαι. ταύτῃ γὰρ τομαὶ μὲν καὶ καύσεις καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα πάσχει λύπας οὐκ ἐμποιοῦσιν, οὐδὲ  ἡδονὰς πάλιν ἐπὶ ταὐτὸν ἀπιούσης εἶδος, μέγισται δὲ αἰσθήσεις καὶ σαφέσταται καθʼ ὅτι τʼ ἂν πάθῃ καὶ ὅσων ἂν αὐτή πῃ προσβαλοῦσα ἐφάπτηται· βία γὰρ τὸ πάμπαν οὐκ ἔνι τῇ διακρίσει τε αὐτῆς καὶ συγκρίσει.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. λείου δʼ αὖ καὶ τραχέος παθήματος αἰτίαν πᾶς που κατιδὼν καὶ ἑτέρῳ δυνατὸς ἂν εἴη λέγειν· σκληρότης γὰρ ἀνωμαλότητι μειχθεῖσα, τὸ δʼ  ὁμαλότης πυκνότητι παρέχεται. μέγιστον δὲ καὶ λοιπὸν τῶν κοινῶν περὶ ὅλον τὸ σῶμα παθημάτων τὸ τῶν ἡδέων καὶ τῶν ἀλγεινῶν αἴτιον ἐν οἷς διεληλύθαμεν, καὶ ὅσα διὰ τῶν τοῦ σώματος μορίων αἰσθήσεις κεκτημένα καὶ λύπας ἐν αὑτοῖς ἡδονάς θʼ ἅμα ἑπομένας ἔχει. ὧδʼ οὖν κατὰ παντὸς αἰσθητοῦ καὶ ἀναισθήτου παθήματος τὰς αἰτίας λαμβάνωμεν, ἀναμιμνῃσκόμενοι τὸ τῆς  εὐκινήτου τε καὶ δυσκινήτου φύσεως ὅτι διειλόμεθα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν· ταύτῃ γὰρ δὴ μεταδιωκτέον πάντα ὅσα ἐπινοοῦμεν ἑλεῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","text":"τὸ μὲν γὰρ κατὰ φύσιν εὐκίνητον, ὅταν καὶ βραχὺ πάθος εἰς αὐτὸ ἐμπίπτῃ, διαδίδωσιν κύκλῳ μόρια ἕτερα ἑτέροις ταὐτὸν ἀπεργαζόμενα, μέχριπερ ἂν ἐπὶ τὸ φρόνιμον ἐλθόντα ἐξαγγείλῃ τοῦ ποιήσαντος τὴν δύναμιν· τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον ἑδραῖον ὂν κατʼ οὐδένα τε κύκλον ἰὸν πάσχει μόνον,  ἄλλο δὲ οὐ κινεῖ τῶν πλησίον, ὥστε οὐ διαδιδόντων μορίων μορίοις ἄλλων ἄλλοις τὸ πρῶτον πάθος ἐν αὐτοῖς ἀκίνητον εἰς τὸ πᾶν ζῷον γενόμενον ἀναίσθητον παρέσχεν τὸ παθόν. ταῦτα δὲ περί τε ὀστᾶ καὶ τὰς τρίχας ἐστὶν καὶ ὅσʼ ἄλλα γήϊνα τὸ πλεῖστον ἔχομεν ἐν ἡμῖν μόρια· τὰ δὲ ἔμπροσθεν περὶ τὰ τῆς ὄψεως καὶ ἀκοῆς μάλιστα, διὰ τὸ πυρὸς ἀέρος τε ἐν αὐτοῖς δύναμιν ἐνεῖναι μεγίστην. τὸ δὴ τῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης ὧδε δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι· τὸ μὲν παρὰ φύσιν καὶ  βίαιον γιγνόμενον ἁθρόον παρʼ ἡμῖν πάθος ἀλγεινόν, τὸ δʼ εἰς φύσιν ἀπιὸν πάλιν ἁθρόον ἡδύ, τὸ δὲ ἡρέμα καὶ κατὰ σμικρὸν ἀναίσθητον, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον τούτοις ἐναντίως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","text":"τὸ δὲ μετʼ εὐπετείας γιγνόμενον ἅπαν αἰσθητὸν μὲν ὅτι μάλιστα, λύπης δὲ καὶ ἡδονῆς οὐ μετέχον, οἷον τὰ περὶ τὴν ὄψιν αὐτὴν παθήματα, ἣ δὴ σῶμα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἐρρήθη καθʼ ἡμέραν συμφυὲς ἡμῶν γίγνεσθαι. ταύτῃ γὰρ τομαὶ μὲν καὶ καύσεις καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα πάσχει λύπας οὐκ ἐμποιοῦσιν, οὐδὲ  ἡδονὰς πάλιν ἐπὶ ταὐτὸν ἀπιούσης εἶδος, μέγισται δὲ αἰσθήσεις καὶ σαφέσταται καθʼ ὅτι τʼ ἂν πάθῃ καὶ ὅσων ἂν αὐτή πῃ προσβαλοῦσα ἐφάπτηται· βία γὰρ τὸ πάμπαν οὐκ ἔνι τῇ διακρίσει τε αὐτῆς καὶ συγκρίσει.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"5b23836d20dbf1ca12694425eb55b98a356678dd99e175b407237e3ca44a6e0b","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225050461813Z_3f787c0d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 64","source_sha256":"5b23836d20dbf1ca12694425eb55b98a356678dd99e175b407237e3ca44a6e0b","sha256":"2d5560e22f8a6593d64490dd2ef999de0d0f1a73134b9638a441a18ee6d7c986","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:50.461923+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","text":"T. And the cause of a smooth and a rough affection, anyone who has observed it would surely be able to state to another: for hardness combined with unevenness produces the latter, while smoothness combined with density produces the former. But the greatest and remaining cause among the affections common to the whole body is that of pleasures and pains, in the cases we have gone through, and in all those which, through the parts of the body endowed with perception, have pains and pleasures consequent upon them at the same time. Thus, then, let us take the causes in the case of every perceptible and imperceptible affection, recalling what we distinguished earlier concerning the nature that is readily moved and that which is moved with difficulty; for it is by pursuing this that we must track down everything we conceive of grasping.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","text":"For that which is by nature readily moved, whenever even a slight affection falls upon it, transmits it in a circle, part to part producing the same effect, until, having reached the rational part, it reports the power of that which acted. Its opposite, being fixed and proceeding in no circle, undergoes the affection alone and moves none of the neighboring things; so that, since parts do not transmit to parts, the first affection, remaining unmoved within them and extending to the whole living creature, renders that which has undergone it imperceptive. These cases concern bones and hair and whatever other parts we have within us that contain for the most part earth; whereas the former concern especially the organs of sight and hearing, because a very great power of fire and air is present in them. One must conceive pleasure and pain as follows: an affection contrary to nature and violent, arising suddenly within us, is painful; that which returns again to nature suddenly is pleasant; but what occurs gently and little by little is imperceptible, and its opposite is, contrariwise, the opposite of these.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","text":"But everything that occurs with ease is perceptible in the highest degree, yet has no share in pain or pleasure—for example, the affections concerning sight itself, which was said earlier to be a body growing together with us day by day. For cuts and burnings and all other things that it suffers produce no pains in it, nor, when it returns again to the same form, pleasures; but the perceptions are greatest and clearest in whatever respect it may suffer and whatever things it may touch by coming into contact with them in some way. For there is no violence at all in its separation and combination.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"b8a3353e80e43482faff807d12af3a2c81294e4082505558b1eda6f215f8a451","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 64"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 64","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44","title":"Section 65","order":49,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_44","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δʼ ἐκ μειζόνων μερῶν σώματα μόγις εἴκοντα τῷ δρῶντι, διαδιδόντα δὲ εἰς ὅλον τὰς κινήσεις, ἡδονὰς ἴσχει καὶ λύπας, ἀλλοτριούμενα  μὲν λύπας, καθιστάμενα δὲ εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ πάλιν ἡδονάς. ὅσα δὲ κατὰ σμικρὸν τὰς ἀποχωρήσεις ἑαυτῶν καὶ κενώσεις εἴληφεν, τὰς δὲ πληρώσεις ἁθρόας καὶ κατὰ μεγάλα, κενώσεως μὲν ἀναίσθητα, πληρώσεως δὲ αἰσθητικὰ γιγνόμενα, λύπας μὲν οὐ παρέχει τῷ θνητῷ τῆς ψυχῆς, μεγίστας δὲ ἡδονάς· ἔστιν δὲ ἔνδηλα περὶ τὰς εὐωδίας. ὅσα δὲ ἀπαλλοτριοῦται μὲν ἁθρόα, κατὰ σμικρὰ δὲ μόγις τε εἰς ταὐτὸν  πάλιν ἑαυτοῖς καθίσταται, τοὐναντίον τοῖς ἔμπροσθεν πάντα ἀποδίδωσιν· ταῦτα δʼ αὖ περὶ τὰς καύσεις καὶ τομὰς τοῦ σώματος γιγνόμενά ἐστιν κατάδηλα. καὶ τὰ μὲν δὴ κοινὰ τοῦ σώματος παντὸς παθήματα, τῶν τʼ ἐπωνυμιῶν ὅσαι τοῖς δρῶσιν αὐτὰ γεγόνασι, σχεδὸν εἴρηται· τὰ δʼ ἐν ἰδίοις μέρεσιν ἡμῶν γιγνόμενα, τά τε πάθη καὶ τὰς αἰτίας αὖ τῶν δρώντων, πειρατέον εἰπεῖν, ἄν πῃ  δυνώμεθα. πρῶτον οὖν ὅσα τῶν χυμῶν πέρι λέγοντες ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἀπελίπομεν, ἴδια ὄντα παθήματα περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν, ἐμφανιστέον ᾗ δυνατόν. φαίνεται δὲ καὶ ταῦτα, ὥσπερ οὖν καὶ τὰ πολλά, διὰ συγκρίσεών τέ τινων καὶ διακρίσεων γίγνεσθαι, πρὸς δὲ αὐταῖς κεχρῆσθαι μᾶλλόν τι τῶν ἄλλων τραχύτησί τε καὶ λειότησιν. ὅσα μὲν γὰρ εἰσιόντα περὶ τὰ φλέβια, οἷόνπερ δοκίμια τῆς γλώττης  τεταμένα ἐπὶ τὴν καρδίαν, εἰς τὰ νοτερὰ τῆς σαρκὸς καὶ ἁπαλὰ ἐμπίπτοντα γήϊνα μέρη κατατηκόμενα συνάγει τὰ φλέβια καὶ ἀποξηραίνει, τραχύτερα μὲν ὄντα στρυφνά, ἧττον δὲ τραχύνοντα αὐστηρὰ φαίνεται· τὰ δὲ τούτων τε ῥυπτικὰ καὶ πᾶν τὸ περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν ἀποπλύνοντα, πέρα μὲν τοῦ μετρίου τοῦτο δρῶντα καὶ προσεπιλαμβανόμενα ὥστε ἀποτήκειν αὐτῆς τῆς φύσεως, οἷον ἡ τῶν λίτρων  δύναμις, πικρὰ πάνθʼ οὕτως ὠνόμασται, τὰ δὲ ὑποδεέστερα τῆς λιτρώδους ἕξεως ἐπὶ τὸ μέτριόν τε τῇ ῥύψει χρώμενα ἁλυκὰ ἄνευ πικρότητος τραχείας καὶ φίλα μᾶλλον ἡμῖν φαντάζεται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δʼ ἐκ μειζόνων μερῶν σώματα μόγις εἴκοντα τῷ δρῶντι, διαδιδόντα δὲ εἰς ὅλον τὰς κινήσεις, ἡδονὰς ἴσχει καὶ λύπας, ἀλλοτριούμενα  μὲν λύπας, καθιστάμενα δὲ εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ πάλιν ἡδονάς. ὅσα δὲ κατὰ σμικρὸν τὰς ἀποχωρήσεις ἑαυτῶν καὶ κενώσεις εἴληφεν, τὰς δὲ πληρώσεις ἁθρόας καὶ κατὰ μεγάλα, κενώσεως μὲν ἀναίσθητα, πληρώσεως δὲ αἰσθητικὰ γιγνόμενα, λύπας μὲν οὐ παρέχει τῷ θνητῷ τῆς ψυχῆς, μεγίστας δὲ ἡδονάς· ἔστιν δὲ ἔνδηλα περὶ τὰς εὐωδίας. ὅσα δὲ ἀπαλλοτριοῦται μὲν ἁθρόα, κατὰ σμικρὰ δὲ μόγις τε εἰς ταὐτὸν  πάλιν ἑαυτοῖς καθίσταται, τοὐναντίον τοῖς ἔμπροσθεν πάντα ἀποδίδωσιν· ταῦτα δʼ αὖ περὶ τὰς καύσεις καὶ τομὰς τοῦ σώματος γιγνόμενά ἐστιν κατάδηλα. καὶ τὰ μὲν δὴ κοινὰ τοῦ σώματος παντὸς παθήματα, τῶν τʼ ἐπωνυμιῶν ὅσαι τοῖς δρῶσιν αὐτὰ γεγόνασι, σχεδὸν εἴρηται· τὰ δʼ ἐν ἰδίοις μέρεσιν ἡμῶν γιγνόμενα, τά τε πάθη καὶ τὰς αἰτίας αὖ τῶν δρώντων, πειρατέον εἰπεῖν, ἄν πῃ  δυνώμεθα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","text":"πρῶτον οὖν ὅσα τῶν χυμῶν πέρι λέγοντες ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν ἀπελίπομεν, ἴδια ὄντα παθήματα περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν, ἐμφανιστέον ᾗ δυνατόν. φαίνεται δὲ καὶ ταῦτα, ὥσπερ οὖν καὶ τὰ πολλά, διὰ συγκρίσεών τέ τινων καὶ διακρίσεων γίγνεσθαι, πρὸς δὲ αὐταῖς κεχρῆσθαι μᾶλλόν τι τῶν ἄλλων τραχύτησί τε καὶ λειότησιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","text":"ὅσα μὲν γὰρ εἰσιόντα περὶ τὰ φλέβια, οἷόνπερ δοκίμια τῆς γλώττης  τεταμένα ἐπὶ τὴν καρδίαν, εἰς τὰ νοτερὰ τῆς σαρκὸς καὶ ἁπαλὰ ἐμπίπτοντα γήϊνα μέρη κατατηκόμενα συνάγει τὰ φλέβια καὶ ἀποξηραίνει, τραχύτερα μὲν ὄντα στρυφνά, ἧττον δὲ τραχύνοντα αὐστηρὰ φαίνεται· τὰ δὲ τούτων τε ῥυπτικὰ καὶ πᾶν τὸ περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν ἀποπλύνοντα, πέρα μὲν τοῦ μετρίου τοῦτο δρῶντα καὶ προσεπιλαμβανόμενα ὥστε ἀποτήκειν αὐτῆς τῆς φύσεως, οἷον ἡ τῶν λίτρων  δύναμις, πικρὰ πάνθʼ οὕτως ὠνόμασται, τὰ δὲ ὑποδεέστερα τῆς λιτρώδους ἕξεως ἐπὶ τὸ μέτριόν τε τῇ ῥύψει χρώμενα ἁλυκὰ ἄνευ πικρότητος τραχείας καὶ φίλα μᾶλλον ἡμῖν φαντάζεται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"c1c63329675c4b7c713b036e110f1e3e8390d9147c772fe494960b778de90354","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225057138572Z_87621d68","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 65","source_sha256":"c1c63329675c4b7c713b036e110f1e3e8390d9147c772fe494960b778de90354","sha256":"f3163020fb9dec5440ece95960e85b3cf442cdb1d884d85a539caa3e1d27bbfb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:50:57.138685+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","text":"TI. Bodies composed of larger parts, yielding only with difficulty to what acts upon them but transmitting the motions throughout the whole, involve pleasures and pains: pains when they are alienated, pleasures when they are restored again to the same condition. But whatever has received its departures and evacuations little by little, while its replenishments are sudden and on a large scale, being insensitive to evacuation but sensitive to replenishment, affords no pains to the mortal part of the soul, but very great pleasures; this is evident in the case of fragrances. But whatever is alienated suddenly, while being restored to the same condition again only little by little and with difficulty, produces in every respect the opposite of the foregoing; and this is plainly the case with burnings and cuttings of the body. Thus, then, the affections common to the whole body, and however many names have arisen for them from the things that act upon them, have almost been described. But we must try, if we are somehow able, to describe those occurring in our particular parts, both the affections and, in turn, the causes of the things acting upon them.\n\n","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","text":"First, then, whatever concerning the humours we omitted in the previous discussion—being affections peculiar to the tongue—must be made manifest as far as possible. These too, like most things, appear to arise through certain combinations and separations, and, in addition to these, to employ roughness and smoothness more than the other things do.\n\n","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","text":"For whatever, entering upon the little veins stretched like testing-instruments of the tongue toward the heart, falls upon the moist and tender earthy parts of the flesh and, by dissolving them, contracts the little veins and dries them out, appears astringent if rougher, but austere if it produces roughness to a lesser degree. And those things which cleanse these and wash away everything about the tongue—if they do this beyond measure and moreover seize upon it so as to dissolve even its very nature, as does the power of lye—have all thus been called bitter; whereas those inferior to the lye-like condition, employing cleansing in a moderate degree, appear saline, without harsh bitterness, and more agreeable to us.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"1c64f4a20a53082e3cc6118e40708017ee21821200b46b3378224d5205197ed9","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 65"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 65","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45","title":"Section 66","order":50,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_45","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ τῇ τοῦ στόματος θερμότητι κοινωνήσαντα καὶ λεαινόμενα ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ, συνεκπυρούμενα καὶ πάλιν αὐτὰ ἀντικάοντα τὸ διαθερμῆναν, φερόμενά τε ὑπὸ κουφότητος ἄνω πρὸς τὰς τῆς κεφαλῆς αἰσθήσεις, τέμνοντά τε  πάνθʼ ὁπόσοις ἂν προσπίπτῃ, διὰ ταύτας τὰς δυνάμεις δριμέα πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐλέχθη. τὸ δὲ αὖ τῶν προλελεπτυσμένων μὲν ὑπὸ σηπεδόνος, εἰς δὲ τὰς στενὰς φλέβας ἐνδυομένων, καὶ τοῖς ἐνοῦσιν αὐτόθι μέρεσιν γεώδεσιν καὶ ὅσα ἀέρος συμμετρίαν ἔχοντα, ὥστε κινήσαντα περὶ ἄλληλα ποιεῖν κυκᾶσθαι, κυκώμενα δὲ περιπίπτειν τε καὶ εἰς ἕτερα ἐνδυόμενα ἕτερα κοῖλα ἀπεργάζεσθαι περιτεινόμενα τοῖς εἰσιοῦσιν—  ἃ δὴ νοτίδος περὶ ἀέρα κοίλης περιταθείσης, τοτὲ μὲν γεώδους, τοτὲ δὲ καὶ καθαρᾶς, νοτερὰ ἀγγεῖα ἀέρος, ὕδατα κοῖλα περιφερῆ τε γενέσθαι, καὶ τὰ μὲν τῆς καθαρᾶς διαφανεῖς περιστῆναι κληθείσας ὄνομα πομφόλυγας, τὰ δὲ τῆς γεώδους ὁμοῦ κινουμένης τε καὶ αἰρομένης ζέσιν τε καὶ ζύμωσιν ἐπίκλην λεχθῆναι—τὸ δὲ τούτων αἴτιον τῶν παθημάτων ὀξὺ προσρηθῆναι. σύμπασιν δὲ τοῖς περὶ ταῦτα εἰρημένοις  πάθος ἐναντίον ἀπʼ ἐναντίας ἐστὶ προφάσεως· ὁπόταν ἡ τῶν εἰσιόντων σύστασις ἐν ὑγροῖς, οἰκεία τῇ τῆς γλώττης ἕξει πεφυκυῖα, λεαίνῃ μὲν ἐπαλείφουσα τὰ τραχυνθέντα, τὰ δὲ παρὰ φύσιν συνεστῶτα ἢ κεχυμένα τὰ μὲν συνάγῃ, τὰ δὲ χαλᾷ, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅτι μάλιστα ἱδρύῃ κατὰ φύσιν, ἡδὺ καὶ προσφιλὲς παντὶ πᾶν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἴαμα τῶν βιαίων παθημάτων γιγνόμενον κέκληται γλυκύ.  καὶ τὰ μὲν ταύτῃ ταῦτα· περὶ δὲ δὴ τὴν τῶν μυκτήρων δύναμιν, εἴδη μὲν οὐκ ἔνι. τὸ γὰρ τῶν ὀσμῶν πᾶν ἡμιγενές, εἴδει δὲ οὐδενὶ συμβέβηκεν συμμετρία πρὸς τό τινα σχεῖν ὀσμήν· ἀλλʼ ἡμῶν αἱ περὶ ταῦτα φλέβες πρὸς μὲν τὰ γῆς ὕδατός τε γένη στενότεραι συνέστησαν, πρὸς δὲ τὰ πυρὸς ἀέρος τε εὐρύτεραι, διὸ τούτων οὐδεὶς οὐδενὸς ὀσμῆς πώποτε ᾔσθετό τινος, ἀλλὰ ἢ βρεχομένων ἢ σηπομένων ἢ τηκομένων ἢ θυμιωμένων γίγνονταί τινων. μεταβάλλοντος γὰρ  ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα ἀέρος τε εἰς ὕδωρ ἐν τῷ μεταξὺ τούτων γεγόνασιν, εἰσίν τε ὀσμαὶ σύμπασαι καπνὸς ἢ ὁμίχλη, τούτων δὲ τὸ μὲν ἐξ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ ἰὸν ὁμίχλη, τὸ δὲ ἐξ ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα καπνός· ὅθεν λεπτότεραι μὲν ὕδατος, παχύτεραι δὲ ὀσμαὶ σύμπασαι γεγόνασιν ἀέρος.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὰ δὲ τῇ τοῦ στόματος θερμότητι κοινωνήσαντα καὶ λεαινόμενα ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ, συνεκπυρούμενα καὶ πάλιν αὐτὰ ἀντικάοντα τὸ διαθερμῆναν, φερόμενά τε ὑπὸ κουφότητος ἄνω πρὸς τὰς τῆς κεφαλῆς αἰσθήσεις, τέμνοντά τε  πάνθʼ ὁπόσοις ἂν προσπίπτῃ, διὰ ταύτας τὰς δυνάμεις δριμέα πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐλέχθη.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0002","text":"τὸ δὲ αὖ τῶν προλελεπτυσμένων μὲν ὑπὸ σηπεδόνος, εἰς δὲ τὰς στενὰς φλέβας ἐνδυομένων, καὶ τοῖς ἐνοῦσιν αὐτόθι μέρεσιν γεώδεσιν καὶ ὅσα ἀέρος συμμετρίαν ἔχοντα, ὥστε κινήσαντα περὶ ἄλληλα ποιεῖν κυκᾶσθαι, κυκώμενα δὲ περιπίπτειν τε καὶ εἰς ἕτερα ἐνδυόμενα ἕτερα κοῖλα ἀπεργάζεσθαι περιτεινόμενα τοῖς εἰσιοῦσιν—  ἃ δὴ νοτίδος περὶ ἀέρα κοίλης περιταθείσης, τοτὲ μὲν γεώδους, τοτὲ δὲ καὶ καθαρᾶς, νοτερὰ ἀγγεῖα ἀέρος, ὕδατα κοῖλα περιφερῆ τε γενέσθαι, καὶ τὰ μὲν τῆς καθαρᾶς διαφανεῖς περιστῆναι κληθείσας ὄνομα πομφόλυγας, τὰ δὲ τῆς γεώδους ὁμοῦ κινουμένης τε καὶ αἰρομένης ζέσιν τε καὶ ζύμωσιν ἐπίκλην λεχθῆναι—τὸ δὲ τούτων αἴτιον τῶν παθημάτων ὀξὺ προσρηθῆναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","text":"σύμπασιν δὲ τοῖς περὶ ταῦτα εἰρημένοις  πάθος ἐναντίον ἀπʼ ἐναντίας ἐστὶ προφάσεως· ὁπόταν ἡ τῶν εἰσιόντων σύστασις ἐν ὑγροῖς, οἰκεία τῇ τῆς γλώττης ἕξει πεφυκυῖα, λεαίνῃ μὲν ἐπαλείφουσα τὰ τραχυνθέντα, τὰ δὲ παρὰ φύσιν συνεστῶτα ἢ κεχυμένα τὰ μὲν συνάγῃ, τὰ δὲ χαλᾷ, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅτι μάλιστα ἱδρύῃ κατὰ φύσιν, ἡδὺ καὶ προσφιλὲς παντὶ πᾶν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἴαμα τῶν βιαίων παθημάτων γιγνόμενον κέκληται γλυκύ.  καὶ τὰ μὲν ταύτῃ ταῦτα· περὶ δὲ δὴ τὴν τῶν μυκτήρων δύναμιν, εἴδη μὲν οὐκ ἔνι. τὸ γὰρ τῶν ὀσμῶν πᾶν ἡμιγενές, εἴδει δὲ οὐδενὶ συμβέβηκεν συμμετρία πρὸς τό τινα σχεῖν ὀσμήν· ἀλλʼ ἡμῶν αἱ περὶ ταῦτα φλέβες πρὸς μὲν τὰ γῆς ὕδατός τε γένη στενότεραι συνέστησαν, πρὸς δὲ τὰ πυρὸς ἀέρος τε εὐρύτεραι, διὸ τούτων οὐδεὶς οὐδενὸς ὀσμῆς πώποτε ᾔσθετό τινος, ἀλλὰ ἢ βρεχομένων ἢ σηπομένων ἢ τηκομένων ἢ θυμιωμένων γίγνονταί τινων.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","text":"μεταβάλλοντος γὰρ  ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα ἀέρος τε εἰς ὕδωρ ἐν τῷ μεταξὺ τούτων γεγόνασιν, εἰσίν τε ὀσμαὶ σύμπασαι καπνὸς ἢ ὁμίχλη, τούτων δὲ τὸ μὲν ἐξ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ ἰὸν ὁμίχλη, τὸ δὲ ἐξ ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα καπνός· ὅθεν λεπτότεραι μὲν ὕδατος, παχύτεραι δὲ ὀσμαὶ σύμπασαι γεγόνασιν ἀέρος.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"4fa06a3ac527a45577cdd771bcc22d8c5bb4977ffa30f7e0dfca652598ddd54e","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225107957611Z_d7b9611c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 66","source_sha256":"4fa06a3ac527a45577cdd771bcc22d8c5bb4977ffa30f7e0dfca652598ddd54e","sha256":"090484632d9f6c96e2a35642e8b1290f08891f6a95ef2e1fca471bd443d967e2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:07.957642+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","text":"TIM. But those things which share in the heat of the mouth and are smoothed by it, being kindled along with it and in turn themselves heating that which warmed them, and being borne upward by their lightness toward the senses in the head, and cutting whatever things they may strike—by these powers all such things have been called pungent.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0002","text":"But that which has been finely divided by putrefaction and enters into the narrow veins, and, with the earthy parts present there and with such as have a due proportion of air, having set them in motion about one another causes them to be agitated—while, being agitated, they fall upon one another and, entering into others, produce other hollows by being stretched around the things entering in—these, namely, when moisture is stretched around hollow air, at one time earthy and at another also pure, become moist vessels of air, hollow and spherical waters; and those of the pure kind, becoming transparent, are called by the name bubbles, while those of the earthy kind, moving and rising together, are said to have the designation of boiling and fermentation; and the cause of these affections is called sharp.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","text":"For all the things spoken of in this connection have an opposite affection from an opposite cause: whenever the constitution of the things entering, being in liquids and naturally akin to the condition of the tongue, by being spread over smooths what has become rough, and draws together what has been unnaturally compacted or dispersed, relaxing some things and contracting others, and establishes everything, so far as possible, according to nature, every such remedy for violent affections, becoming pleasant and welcome to all, is called sweet. And so much for these matters. Concerning the power of the nostrils, however, there are no kinds; for the whole class of smells is intermediate, and no commensurability with any definite smell belongs to any kind. But our veins in these matters have been formed narrower in relation to the kinds of earth and water, and wider in relation to those of fire and air; hence none of these has ever perceived any smell of any other, but smells arise from things being moistened, putrefied, melted, or burned as incense.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","text":"For in the change of water into air and of air into water they arise in the interval between these; and all smells are either smoke or mist. Of these, that which proceeds from air into water is mist, while that which proceeds from water into air is smoke. Whence all smells have become finer than water, but thicker than air.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"5ad4b2d6e3a5e47fb6b9d124e4fae386defe76ac8ab5f90fd5303b68c73ff3b2","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 66"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 66","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46","title":"Section 67","order":51,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_46","text":"ΤΙ. δηλοῦνται δὲ ὁπόταν τινὸς ἀντιφραχθέντος περὶ τὴν ἀναπνοὴν ἄγῃ τις βίᾳ τὸ πνεῦμα εἰς αὑτόν· τότε γὰρ ὀσμὴ μὲν οὐδεμία συνδιηθεῖται, τὸ δὲ πνεῦμα τῶν ὀσμῶν ἐρημωθὲν αὐτὸ μόνον  ἕπεται. δύʼ οὖν ταῦτα ἀνώνυμα τὰ τούτων ποικίλματα γέγονεν, οὐκ ἐκ πολλῶν οὐδὲ ἁπλῶν εἰδῶν ὄντα, ἀλλὰ διχῇ τό θʼ ἡδὺ καὶ τὸ λυπηρὸν αὐτόθι μόνω διαφανῆ λέγεσθον, τὸ μὲν τραχῦνόν τε καὶ βιαζόμενον τὸ κύτος ἅπαν, ὅσον ἡμῶν μεταξὺ κορυφῆς τοῦ τε ὀμφαλοῦ κεῖται, τὸ δὲ ταὐτὸν τοῦτο καταπραῧνον καὶ πάλιν ᾗ πέφυκεν ἀγαπητῶς ἀποδιδόν. τρίτον δὲ αἰσθητικὸν ἐν ἡμῖν μέρος ἐπισκοποῦσιν τὸ περὶ  τὴν ἀκοήν, διʼ ἃς αἰτίας τὰ περὶ αὐτὸ συμβαίνει παθήματα, λεκτέον. ὅλως μὲν οὖν φωνὴν θῶμεν τὴν διʼ ὤτων ὑπʼ ἀέρος ἐγκεφάλου τε καὶ αἵματος μέχρι ψυχῆς πληγὴν διαδιδομένην, τὴν δὲ ὑπʼ αὐτῆς κίνησιν, ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς μὲν ἀρχομένην, τελευτῶσαν δὲ περὶ τὴν τοῦ ἥπατος ἕδραν, ἀκοήν· ὅση δʼ αὐτῆς ταχεῖα, ὀξεῖαν, ὅση δὲ βραδυτέρα, βαρυτέραν· τὴν δὲ ὁμοίαν ὁμαλήν τε καὶ λείαν, τὴν δὲ ἐναντίαν τραχεῖαν·  μεγάλην δὲ τὴν πολλήν, ὅση δὲ ἐναντία, σμικράν. τὰ δὲ περὶ συμφωνίας αὐτῶν ἐν τοῖς ὕστερον λεχθησομένοις ἀνάγκη ῥηθῆναι. τέταρτον δὴ λοιπὸν ἔτι γένος ἡμῖν αἰσθητικόν, ὃ διελέσθαι δεῖ συχνὰ ἐν ἑαυτῷ ποικίλματα κεκτημένον, ἃ σύμπαντα μὲν χρόας ἐκαλέσαμεν, φλόγα τῶν σωμάτων ἑκάστων ἀπορρέουσαν, ὄψει σύμμετρα μόρια ἔχουσαν πρὸς αἴσθησιν· ὄψεως δʼ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν αὐτὸ περὶ τῶν αἰτίων τῆς γενέσεως  ἐρρήθη. τῇδʼ οὖν τῶν χρωμάτων πέρι μάλιστα εἰκὸς πρέποι τʼ ἂν ἐπιεικεῖ λόγῳ διεξελθεῖν· τὰ φερόμενα ἀπὸ τῶν ἄλλων μόρια ἐμπίπτοντά τε εἰς τὴν ὄψιν τὰ μὲν ἐλάττω, τὰ δὲ μείζω, τὰ δʼ ἴσα τοῖς αὐτῆς τῆς ὄψεως μέρεσιν εἶναι· τὰ μὲν οὖν ἴσα ἀναίσθητα, ἃ δὴ καὶ διαφανῆ λέγομεν, τὰ δὲ μείζω καὶ ἐλάττω, τὰ μὲν συγκρίνοντα, τὰ δὲ διακρίνοντα αὐτήν, τοῖς περὶ τὴν σάρκα θερμοῖς καὶ ψυχροῖς καὶ τοῖς  περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν στρυφνοῖς, καὶ ὅσα θερμαντικὰ ὄντα δριμέα ἐκαλέσαμεν, ἀδελφὰ εἶναι, τά τε λευκὰ καὶ τὰ μέλανα, ἐκείνων παθήματα γεγονότα ἐν ἄλλῳ γένει τὰ αὐτά, φανταζόμενα δὲ ἄλλα διὰ ταύτας τὰς αἰτίας.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. δηλοῦνται δὲ ὁπόταν τινὸς ἀντιφραχθέντος περὶ τὴν ἀναπνοὴν ἄγῃ τις βίᾳ τὸ πνεῦμα εἰς αὑτόν· τότε γὰρ ὀσμὴ μὲν οὐδεμία συνδιηθεῖται, τὸ δὲ πνεῦμα τῶν ὀσμῶν ἐρημωθὲν αὐτὸ μόνον  ἕπεται. δύʼ οὖν ταῦτα ἀνώνυμα τὰ τούτων ποικίλματα γέγονεν, οὐκ ἐκ πολλῶν οὐδὲ ἁπλῶν εἰδῶν ὄντα, ἀλλὰ διχῇ τό θʼ ἡδὺ καὶ τὸ λυπηρὸν αὐτόθι μόνω διαφανῆ λέγεσθον, τὸ μὲν τραχῦνόν τε καὶ βιαζόμενον τὸ κύτος ἅπαν, ὅσον ἡμῶν μεταξὺ κορυφῆς τοῦ τε ὀμφαλοῦ κεῖται, τὸ δὲ ταὐτὸν τοῦτο καταπραῧνον καὶ πάλιν ᾗ πέφυκεν ἀγαπητῶς ἀποδιδόν. τρίτον δὲ αἰσθητικὸν ἐν ἡμῖν μέρος ἐπισκοποῦσιν τὸ περὶ  τὴν ἀκοήν, διʼ ἃς αἰτίας τὰ περὶ αὐτὸ συμβαίνει παθήματα, λεκτέον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","text":"ὅλως μὲν οὖν φωνὴν θῶμεν τὴν διʼ ὤτων ὑπʼ ἀέρος ἐγκεφάλου τε καὶ αἵματος μέχρι ψυχῆς πληγὴν διαδιδομένην, τὴν δὲ ὑπʼ αὐτῆς κίνησιν, ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς μὲν ἀρχομένην, τελευτῶσαν δὲ περὶ τὴν τοῦ ἥπατος ἕδραν, ἀκοήν· ὅση δʼ αὐτῆς ταχεῖα, ὀξεῖαν, ὅση δὲ βραδυτέρα, βαρυτέραν· τὴν δὲ ὁμοίαν ὁμαλήν τε καὶ λείαν, τὴν δὲ ἐναντίαν τραχεῖαν·  μεγάλην δὲ τὴν πολλήν, ὅση δὲ ἐναντία, σμικράν. τὰ δὲ περὶ συμφωνίας αὐτῶν ἐν τοῖς ὕστερον λεχθησομένοις ἀνάγκη ῥηθῆναι. τέταρτον δὴ λοιπὸν ἔτι γένος ἡμῖν αἰσθητικόν, ὃ διελέσθαι δεῖ συχνὰ ἐν ἑαυτῷ ποικίλματα κεκτημένον, ἃ σύμπαντα μὲν χρόας ἐκαλέσαμεν, φλόγα τῶν σωμάτων ἑκάστων ἀπορρέουσαν, ὄψει σύμμετρα μόρια ἔχουσαν πρὸς αἴσθησιν· ὄψεως δʼ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν αὐτὸ περὶ τῶν αἰτίων τῆς γενέσεως  ἐρρήθη.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","text":"τῇδʼ οὖν τῶν χρωμάτων πέρι μάλιστα εἰκὸς πρέποι τʼ ἂν ἐπιεικεῖ λόγῳ διεξελθεῖν· τὰ φερόμενα ἀπὸ τῶν ἄλλων μόρια ἐμπίπτοντά τε εἰς τὴν ὄψιν τὰ μὲν ἐλάττω, τὰ δὲ μείζω, τὰ δʼ ἴσα τοῖς αὐτῆς τῆς ὄψεως μέρεσιν εἶναι· τὰ μὲν οὖν ἴσα ἀναίσθητα, ἃ δὴ καὶ διαφανῆ λέγομεν, τὰ δὲ μείζω καὶ ἐλάττω, τὰ μὲν συγκρίνοντα, τὰ δὲ διακρίνοντα αὐτήν, τοῖς περὶ τὴν σάρκα θερμοῖς καὶ ψυχροῖς καὶ τοῖς  περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν στρυφνοῖς, καὶ ὅσα θερμαντικὰ ὄντα δριμέα ἐκαλέσαμεν, ἀδελφὰ εἶναι, τά τε λευκὰ καὶ τὰ μέλανα, ἐκείνων παθήματα γεγονότα ἐν ἄλλῳ γένει τὰ αὐτά, φανταζόμενα δὲ ἄλλα διὰ ταύτας τὰς αἰτίας.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"1c39e03b8f89cac004444ca110b2b08746f9fd368fbcbadffc82ec7c9aa800e2","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225119251478Z_377a2e68","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 67","source_sha256":"1c39e03b8f89cac004444ca110b2b08746f9fd368fbcbadffc82ec7c9aa800e2","sha256":"500cba4e1fc9752d7dec22bb9568a5f9fbab16645fae94131a71cce8a535d8b7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:19.251598+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","text":"These are made evident whenever, with something having been blocked around the breathing, one forcibly draws the breath into oneself; for then no odour is filtered through along with it, but the air, stripped of odours, follows by itself alone. Thus the variations of these two have come to be unnamed, not being composed of many or simple kinds; but here only the pleasant and the painful are said to appear distinctly in a twofold way: the one roughening and forcing the whole cavity, so much of us as lies between the crown and the navel, the other soothing this same region and restoring it again agreeably according to its nature. Concerning the third perceptive part in us, that concerned with hearing, and the causes through which the affections occurring in it arise, we must speak.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","text":"In general, then, let us posit that sound is a blow transmitted through the ears by air, brain, and blood as far as the soul; and let us call the motion caused by it, beginning from the head and ending about the seat of the liver, hearing. Such sound as is swift is high, and such as is slower, lower; that which is similar is even and smooth, and that which is contrary, harsh; that which is great in quantity is loud, and that which is contrary, small. What concerns their concords must necessarily be spoken of in what will be said later. There still remains for us a fourth perceptive kind, which must be distinguished, possessing within itself many varieties. We have called them all colours: a flame flowing off from each of the bodies, having particles commensurate with sight for perception. As for sight itself, the account of the causes of its generation was given earlier.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","text":"Concerning colours, then, it would especially be likely and fitting to proceed by a reasonable account in the following way: the particles borne from the other bodies and falling upon sight are some smaller, some larger, and some equal to the parts of sight itself. Those that are equal are imperceptible—these indeed we call transparent—whereas those that are larger and smaller, some contract sight and others separate it, being akin to the hot and cold things concerned with the flesh, and to the astringent things concerned with the tongue, and to all those heating things which we called pungent. And white and black are affections identical with those, occurring in another kind, but appearing different because of these causes.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"12477e60aef606b281ea7c55dd18492880d1176cbfb82008e19fd6236952d3ad","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 67"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 67","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47","title":"Section 68","order":52,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_47","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτως οὖν αὐτὰ προσρητέον· τὸ μὲν διακριτικὸν τῆς ὄψεως λευκόν, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον αὐτοῦ μέλαν, τὴν δὲ ὀξυτέραν φορὰν καὶ γένους πυρὸς ἑτέρου προσπίπτουσαν καὶ διακρίνουσαν τὴν ὄψιν μέχρι τῶν ὀμμάτων, αὐτάς τε τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν τὰς διεξόδους  βίᾳ διωθοῦσαν καὶ τήκουσαν, πῦρ μὲν ἁθρόον καὶ ὕδωρ, ὃ δάκρυον καλοῦμεν, ἐκεῖθεν ἐκχέουσαν, αὐτὴν δὲ οὖσαν πῦρ ἐξ ἐναντίας ἀπαντῶσαν, καὶ τοῦ μὲν ἐκπηδῶντος πυρὸς οἷον ἀπʼ ἀστραπῆς, τοῦ δʼ εἰσιόντος καὶ περὶ τὸ νοτερὸν κατασβεννυμένου, παντοδαπῶν ἐν τῇ κυκήσει ταύτῃ γιγνομένων χρωμάτων, μαρμαρυγὰς μὲν τὸ πάθος προσείπομεν, τὸ δὲ τοῦτο ἀπεργαζόμενον λαμπρόν τε καὶ στίλβον ἐπωνομάσαμεν.  τὸ δὲ τούτων αὖ μεταξὺ πυρὸς γένος, πρὸς μὲν τὸ τῶν ὀμμάτων ὑγρὸν ἀφικνούμενον καὶ κεραννύμενον αὐτῷ, στίλβον δὲ οὔ· τῇ δὲ διὰ τῆς νοτίδος αὐγῇ τοῦ πυρὸς μειγνυμένου χρῶμα ἔναιμον παρασχομένῃ, τοὔνομα ἐρυθρὸν λέγομεν. λαμπρόν τε ἐρυθρῷ λευκῷ τε μειγνύμενον ξανθὸν γέγονεν· τὸ δὲ ὅσον μέτρον ὅσοις, οὐδʼ εἴ τις εἰδείη, νοῦν ἔχει τὸ λέγειν, ὧν μήτε τινὰ ἀνάγκην μήτε τὸν εἰκότα λόγον καὶ μετρίως ἄν τις εἰπεῖν εἴη δυνατός. ἐρυθρὸν δὲ δὴ  μέλανι λευκῷ τε κραθὲν ἁλουργόν· ὄρφνινον δέ, ὅταν τούτοις μεμειγμένοις καυθεῖσίν τε μᾶλλον συγκραθῇ μέλαν. πυρρὸν δὲ ξανθοῦ τε καὶ φαιοῦ κράσει γίγνεται, φαιὸν δὲ λευκοῦ τε καὶ μέλανος, τὸ δὲ ὠχρὸν λευκοῦ ξανθῷ μειγνυμένου. λαμπρῷ δὲ λευκὸν συνελθὸν καὶ εἰς μέλαν κατακορὲς ἐμπεσὸν κυανοῦν χρῶμα ἀποτελεῖται, κυανοῦ δὲ λευκῷ κεραννυμένου γλαυκόν, πυρροῦ δὲ μέλανι πράσιον. τὰ δὲ  ἄλλα ἀπὸ τούτων σχεδὸν δῆλα αἷς ἂν ἀφομοιούμενα μείξεσιν διασῴζοι τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον. εἰ δέ τις τούτων ἔργῳ σκοπούμενος βάσανον λαμβάνοι, τὸ τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης καὶ θείας φύσεως ἠγνοηκὼς ἂν εἴη διάφορον, ὅτι θεὸς μὲν τὰ πολλὰ εἰς ἓν συγκεραννύναι καὶ πάλιν ἐξ ἑνὸς εἰς πολλὰ διαλύειν ἱκανῶς ἐπιστάμενος ἅμα καὶ δυνατός, ἀνθρώπων δὲ οὐδεὶς οὐδέτερα τούτων ἱκανὸς οὔτε ἔστι νῦν οὔτε εἰς αὖθίς ποτε ἔσται.  ταῦτα δὴ πάντα τότε ταύτῃ πεφυκότα ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὁ τοῦ καλλίστου τε καὶ ἀρίστου δημιουργὸς ἐν τοῖς γιγνομένοις παρελάμβανεν, ἡνίκα τὸν αὐτάρκη τε καὶ τὸν τελεώτατον θεὸν ἐγέννα, χρώμενος μὲν ταῖς περὶ ταῦτα αἰτίαις ὑπηρετούσαις, τὸ δὲ εὖ τεκταινόμενος ἐν πᾶσιν τοῖς γιγνομένοις αὐτός.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. οὕτως οὖν αὐτὰ προσρητέον· τὸ μὲν διακριτικὸν τῆς ὄψεως λευκόν, τὸ δʼ ἐναντίον αὐτοῦ μέλαν, τὴν δὲ ὀξυτέραν φορὰν καὶ γένους πυρὸς ἑτέρου προσπίπτουσαν καὶ διακρίνουσαν τὴν ὄψιν μέχρι τῶν ὀμμάτων, αὐτάς τε τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν τὰς διεξόδους  βίᾳ διωθοῦσαν καὶ τήκουσαν, πῦρ μὲν ἁθρόον καὶ ὕδωρ, ὃ δάκρυον καλοῦμεν, ἐκεῖθεν ἐκχέουσαν, αὐτὴν δὲ οὖσαν πῦρ ἐξ ἐναντίας ἀπαντῶσαν, καὶ τοῦ μὲν ἐκπηδῶντος πυρὸς οἷον ἀπʼ ἀστραπῆς, τοῦ δʼ εἰσιόντος καὶ περὶ τὸ νοτερὸν κατασβεννυμένου, παντοδαπῶν ἐν τῇ κυκήσει ταύτῃ γιγνομένων χρωμάτων, μαρμαρυγὰς μὲν τὸ πάθος προσείπομεν, τὸ δὲ τοῦτο ἀπεργαζόμενον λαμπρόν τε καὶ στίλβον ἐπωνομάσαμεν.  τὸ δὲ τούτων αὖ μεταξὺ πυρὸς γένος, πρὸς μὲν τὸ τῶν ὀμμάτων ὑγρὸν ἀφικνούμενον καὶ κεραννύμενον αὐτῷ, στίλβον δὲ οὔ· τῇ δὲ διὰ τῆς νοτίδος αὐγῇ τοῦ πυρὸς μειγνυμένου χρῶμα ἔναιμον παρασχομένῃ, τοὔνομα ἐρυθρὸν λέγομεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","text":"λαμπρόν τε ἐρυθρῷ λευκῷ τε μειγνύμενον ξανθὸν γέγονεν· τὸ δὲ ὅσον μέτρον ὅσοις, οὐδʼ εἴ τις εἰδείη, νοῦν ἔχει τὸ λέγειν, ὧν μήτε τινὰ ἀνάγκην μήτε τὸν εἰκότα λόγον καὶ μετρίως ἄν τις εἰπεῖν εἴη δυνατός. ἐρυθρὸν δὲ δὴ  μέλανι λευκῷ τε κραθὲν ἁλουργόν· ὄρφνινον δέ, ὅταν τούτοις μεμειγμένοις καυθεῖσίν τε μᾶλλον συγκραθῇ μέλαν. πυρρὸν δὲ ξανθοῦ τε καὶ φαιοῦ κράσει γίγνεται, φαιὸν δὲ λευκοῦ τε καὶ μέλανος, τὸ δὲ ὠχρὸν λευκοῦ ξανθῷ μειγνυμένου. λαμπρῷ δὲ λευκὸν συνελθὸν καὶ εἰς μέλαν κατακορὲς ἐμπεσὸν κυανοῦν χρῶμα ἀποτελεῖται, κυανοῦ δὲ λευκῷ κεραννυμένου γλαυκόν, πυρροῦ δὲ μέλανι πράσιον. τὰ δὲ  ἄλλα ἀπὸ τούτων σχεδὸν δῆλα αἷς ἂν ἀφομοιούμενα μείξεσιν διασῴζοι τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","text":"εἰ δέ τις τούτων ἔργῳ σκοπούμενος βάσανον λαμβάνοι, τὸ τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης καὶ θείας φύσεως ἠγνοηκὼς ἂν εἴη διάφορον, ὅτι θεὸς μὲν τὰ πολλὰ εἰς ἓν συγκεραννύναι καὶ πάλιν ἐξ ἑνὸς εἰς πολλὰ διαλύειν ἱκανῶς ἐπιστάμενος ἅμα καὶ δυνατός, ἀνθρώπων δὲ οὐδεὶς οὐδέτερα τούτων ἱκανὸς οὔτε ἔστι νῦν οὔτε εἰς αὖθίς ποτε ἔσται.  ταῦτα δὴ πάντα τότε ταύτῃ πεφυκότα ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὁ τοῦ καλλίστου τε καὶ ἀρίστου δημιουργὸς ἐν τοῖς γιγνομένοις παρελάμβανεν, ἡνίκα τὸν αὐτάρκη τε καὶ τὸν τελεώτατον θεὸν ἐγέννα, χρώμενος μὲν ταῖς περὶ ταῦτα αἰτίαις ὑπηρετούσαις, τὸ δὲ εὖ τεκταινόμενος ἐν πᾶσιν τοῖς γιγνομένοις αὐτός.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"4f4728d080f99977467716a6696bec37301371014261d8746ed23190e4756ebf","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225128153603Z_3cab9a3f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 68","source_sha256":"4f4728d080f99977467716a6696bec37301371014261d8746ed23190e4756ebf","sha256":"0c1f0cb0bc31754c7c2dc46499410a7f4d42baae6b13a66072154be351a38e58","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:28.153629+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","text":"TI. Thus, then, they must be designated as follows: that which discriminates in vision, white; and its opposite, black; and the more piercing motion, of another kind of fire, which strikes upon and divides vision as far as the eyes, and forcibly thrusts open and melts the very passages of the eyes, pouring forth from there a mass of fire and water—which we call a tear—while itself being fire meeting it from without; and, as the one fire leaps forth as if from lightning, while the other enters in and is quenched in the moisture, and all kinds of colours arise in this commingling, we have called the affection flashes, and that which produces this bright and gleaming.\n\nAgain, the kind of fire intermediate between these, when it reaches the moisture of the eyes and is blended with it, gleams but does not shine brightly; but when the ray of fire is mixed through the moisture, which yields a blood-red colour, we call its name red.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","text":"Bright mingled with red and white has become yellow; but to say in what proportion to what things has no sense, even if someone knew it, since one would be unable to state either any necessity or the likely account of these things with due measure. Red, moreover, mixed with black and white, is purple; and dark blue, whenever black, more thoroughly blended with these mixtures, is also burnt. Auburn arises from a mixture of yellow and grey, grey from white and black, and pale yellow from white mixed with yellow. White combined with bright, and falling into saturated black, produces a blue colour; blue mixed with white, sea-green; and auburn with black, leek-green. The other colours, moreover, are nearly clear from these, according to the mixtures to which they are assimilated, if one would preserve the likely account.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","text":"But if anyone, examining these matters in practice, were to take an experiment as a test, he would be ignorant of the difference between human and divine nature: namely, that a god both knows sufficiently and is able to blend many things into one and again dissolve one into many, whereas no human being is competent in either of these respects, either now or ever hereafter.\n\nAll these things, then, being by nature thus constituted of necessity, the craftsman of what is fairest and best took over among things coming to be, when he was begetting the self-sufficient and most complete god; employing the causes concerning these things as auxiliaries, but himself fashioning the good in all things that come to be.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"b0e1fd17da39a94441725f39c02b6a436f81238c12346d2b251eb987a30a947d","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 68"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 68","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48","title":"Section 69","order":53,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_48","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ δὴ χρὴ δύʼ αἰτίας εἴδη διορίζεσθαι, τὸ μὲν ἀναγκαῖον, τὸ δὲ θεῖον, καὶ τὸ μὲν θεῖον ἐν ἅπασιν ζητεῖν  κτήσεως ἕνεκα εὐδαίμονος βίου, καθʼ ὅσον ἡμῶν ἡ φύσις ἐνδέχεται, τὸ δὲ ἀναγκαῖον ἐκείνων χάριν, λογιζόμενον ὡς ἄνευ τούτων οὐ δυνατὰ αὐτὰ ἐκεῖνα ἐφʼ οἷς σπουδάζομεν μόνα κατανοεῖν οὐδʼ αὖ λαβεῖν οὐδʼ ἄλλως πως μετασχεῖν. ὅτʼ οὖν δὴ τὰ νῦν οἷα τέκτοσιν ἡμῖν ὕλη παράκειται τὰ τῶν αἰτίων γένη διυλισμένα, ἐξ ὧν τὸν ἐπίλοιπον λόγον δεῖ συνυφανθῆναι, πάλιν ἐπʼ ἀρχὴν ἐπανέλθωμεν διὰ βραχέων, ταχύ τε εἰς ταὐτὸν πορευθῶμεν ὅθεν δεῦρο ἀφικόμεθα,  καὶ τελευτὴν ἤδη κεφαλήν τε τῷ μύθῳ πειρώμεθα ἁρμόττουσαν ἐπιθεῖναι τοῖς πρόσθεν. ὥσπερ γὰρ οὖν καὶ κατʼ ἀρχὰς ἐλέχθη, ταῦτα ἀτάκτως ἔχοντα ὁ θεὸς ἐν ἑκάστῳ τε αὐτῷ πρὸς αὑτὸ καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμετρίας ἐνεποίησεν, ὅσας τε καὶ ὅπῃ δυνατὸν ἦν ἀνάλογα καὶ σύμμετρα εἶναι. τότε γὰρ οὔτε τούτων, ὅσον μὴ τύχῃ, τι μετεῖχεν, οὔτε τὸ παράπαν ὀνομάσαι τῶν νῦν ὀνομαζομένων ἀξιόλογον ἦν οὐδέν, οἷον πῦρ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ εἴ τι τῶν ἄλλων· ἀλλὰ πάντα ταῦτα  πρῶτον διεκόσμησεν, ἔπειτʼ ἐκ τούτων πᾶν τόδε συνεστήσατο, ζῷον ἓν ζῷα ἔχον τὰ πάντα ἐν ἑαυτῷ θνητὰ ἀθάνατά τε. καὶ τῶν μὲν θείων αὐτὸς γίγνεται δημιουργός, τῶν δὲ θνητῶν τὴν γένεσιν τοῖς ἑαυτοῦ γεννήμασιν δημιουργεῖν προσέταξεν. οἱ δὲ μιμούμενοι, παραλαβόντες ἀρχὴν ψυχῆς ἀθάνατον, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο θνητὸν σῶμα αὐτῇ περιετόρνευσαν ὄχημά τε πᾶν τὸ σῶμα ἔδοσαν ἄλλο τε εἶδος ἐν αὐτῷ ψυχῆς προσῳκοδόμουν τὸ θνητόν, δεινὰ καὶ ἀναγκαῖα ἐν ἑαυτῷ  παθήματα ἔχον, πρῶτον μὲν ἡδονήν, μέγιστον κακοῦ δέλεαρ, ἔπειτα λύπας, ἀγαθῶν φυγάς, ἔτι δʼ αὖ θάρρος καὶ φόβον, ἄφρονε συμβούλω, θυμὸν δὲ δυσπαραμύθητον, ἐλπίδα δʼ εὐπαράγωγον· αἰσθήσει δὲ ἀλόγῳ καὶ ἐπιχειρητῇ παντὸς ἔρωτι συγκερασάμενοι ταῦτα, ἀναγκαίως τὸ θνητὸν γένος συνέθεσαν. καὶ διὰ ταῦτα δὴ σεβόμενοι μιαίνειν τὸ θεῖον, ὅτι μὴ πᾶσα ἦν ἀνάγκη, χωρὶς ἐκείνου κατοικίζουσιν εἰς  ἄλλην τοῦ σώματος οἴκησιν τὸ θνητόν, ἰσθμὸν καὶ ὅρον διοικοδομήσαντες τῆς τε κεφαλῆς καὶ τοῦ στήθους, αὐχένα μεταξὺ τιθέντες, ἵνʼ εἴη χωρίς. ἐν δὴ τοῖς στήθεσιν καὶ τῷ καλουμένῳ θώρακι τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς θνητὸν γένος ἐνέδουν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ δὴ χρὴ δύʼ αἰτίας εἴδη διορίζεσθαι, τὸ μὲν ἀναγκαῖον, τὸ δὲ θεῖον, καὶ τὸ μὲν θεῖον ἐν ἅπασιν ζητεῖν  κτήσεως ἕνεκα εὐδαίμονος βίου, καθʼ ὅσον ἡμῶν ἡ φύσις ἐνδέχεται, τὸ δὲ ἀναγκαῖον ἐκείνων χάριν, λογιζόμενον ὡς ἄνευ τούτων οὐ δυνατὰ αὐτὰ ἐκεῖνα ἐφʼ οἷς σπουδάζομεν μόνα κατανοεῖν οὐδʼ αὖ λαβεῖν οὐδʼ ἄλλως πως μετασχεῖν. ὅτʼ οὖν δὴ τὰ νῦν οἷα τέκτοσιν ἡμῖν ὕλη παράκειται τὰ τῶν αἰτίων γένη διυλισμένα, ἐξ ὧν τὸν ἐπίλοιπον λόγον δεῖ συνυφανθῆναι, πάλιν ἐπʼ ἀρχὴν ἐπανέλθωμεν διὰ βραχέων, ταχύ τε εἰς ταὐτὸν πορευθῶμεν ὅθεν δεῦρο ἀφικόμεθα,  καὶ τελευτὴν ἤδη κεφαλήν τε τῷ μύθῳ πειρώμεθα ἁρμόττουσαν ἐπιθεῖναι τοῖς πρόσθεν. ὥσπερ γὰρ οὖν καὶ κατʼ ἀρχὰς ἐλέχθη, ταῦτα ἀτάκτως ἔχοντα ὁ θεὸς ἐν ἑκάστῳ τε αὐτῷ πρὸς αὑτὸ καὶ πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμετρίας ἐνεποίησεν, ὅσας τε καὶ ὅπῃ δυνατὸν ἦν ἀνάλογα καὶ σύμμετρα εἶναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","text":"τότε γὰρ οὔτε τούτων, ὅσον μὴ τύχῃ, τι μετεῖχεν, οὔτε τὸ παράπαν ὀνομάσαι τῶν νῦν ὀνομαζομένων ἀξιόλογον ἦν οὐδέν, οἷον πῦρ καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ εἴ τι τῶν ἄλλων· ἀλλὰ πάντα ταῦτα  πρῶτον διεκόσμησεν, ἔπειτʼ ἐκ τούτων πᾶν τόδε συνεστήσατο, ζῷον ἓν ζῷα ἔχον τὰ πάντα ἐν ἑαυτῷ θνητὰ ἀθάνατά τε. καὶ τῶν μὲν θείων αὐτὸς γίγνεται δημιουργός, τῶν δὲ θνητῶν τὴν γένεσιν τοῖς ἑαυτοῦ γεννήμασιν δημιουργεῖν προσέταξεν. οἱ δὲ μιμούμενοι, παραλαβόντες ἀρχὴν ψυχῆς ἀθάνατον, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο θνητὸν σῶμα αὐτῇ περιετόρνευσαν ὄχημά τε πᾶν τὸ σῶμα ἔδοσαν ἄλλο τε εἶδος ἐν αὐτῷ ψυχῆς προσῳκοδόμουν τὸ θνητόν, δεινὰ καὶ ἀναγκαῖα ἐν ἑαυτῷ  παθήματα ἔχον, πρῶτον μὲν ἡδονήν, μέγιστον κακοῦ δέλεαρ, ἔπειτα λύπας, ἀγαθῶν φυγάς, ἔτι δʼ αὖ θάρρος καὶ φόβον, ἄφρονε συμβούλω, θυμὸν δὲ δυσπαραμύθητον, ἐλπίδα δʼ εὐπαράγωγον· αἰσθήσει δὲ ἀλόγῳ καὶ ἐπιχειρητῇ παντὸς ἔρωτι συγκερασάμενοι ταῦτα, ἀναγκαίως τὸ θνητὸν γένος συνέθεσαν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","text":"καὶ διὰ ταῦτα δὴ σεβόμενοι μιαίνειν τὸ θεῖον, ὅτι μὴ πᾶσα ἦν ἀνάγκη, χωρὶς ἐκείνου κατοικίζουσιν εἰς  ἄλλην τοῦ σώματος οἴκησιν τὸ θνητόν, ἰσθμὸν καὶ ὅρον διοικοδομήσαντες τῆς τε κεφαλῆς καὶ τοῦ στήθους, αὐχένα μεταξὺ τιθέντες, ἵνʼ εἴη χωρίς. ἐν δὴ τοῖς στήθεσιν καὶ τῷ καλουμένῳ θώρακι τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς θνητὸν γένος ἐνέδουν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"fb452eb079e98c0b395acd38924817ba5c96be74e652e556d5448755fd8747bb","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225138116211Z_70e2fb33","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 69","source_sha256":"fb452eb079e98c0b395acd38924817ba5c96be74e652e556d5448755fd8747bb","sha256":"4c07f9d82dffcf2aeeedf1354b6c304a8355b88f0795f79fe11736b993088c72","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:38.116243+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","text":"TI. For this reason, then, one must distinguish two kinds of causes, the necessary and the divine; and one must seek the divine in all things for the sake of acquiring a happy life, insofar as our nature admits, and the necessary for the sake of those things, reasoning that without these it is impossible either to apprehend those very things upon which alone we are intent, or again to grasp them, or in any other way to partake of them. Since, then, the kinds of causes have now been set before us, as material before builders, refined out, from which the remaining account must be woven together, let us return again briefly to the beginning, and swiftly proceed to the same point from which we arrived here, and let us now attempt to put upon the foregoing account an end and a head fitting to the tale. For, as indeed was said also at the beginning, when these things were in disorder, the god wrought in each of them, both in relation to itself and in relation to one another, such proportions as, and in whatever way, it was possible for them to be proportional and commensurate.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","text":"For then it partook of none of these, save insofar as it happened to do so, nor was it at all fitting to name any of the things now named—such as fire and water, or any of the others. But first he ordered all these things, and thereafter from these he composed this whole, one living creature containing within itself all living creatures, mortal and immortal. Of the divine beings he himself becomes demiurge; but the generation of the mortal beings he commanded his own offspring to fashion. And they, imitating him, having received the immortal principle of soul, next turned a mortal body around it and gave it the whole body as a vehicle; and in it they built alongside another kind of soul, the mortal kind, having within itself terrible and necessary affections: first pleasure, the greatest lure of evil; then pains, fugitives from goods; and again courage and fear, senseless counsellors; spirit, difficult to console; and hope, easily led astray. Mixing these with irrational sensation and with desire that ventures upon everything, they thus, of necessity, composed the mortal kind.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","text":"And for these reasons, reverencing the pollution of the divine, since there was not every necessity, they housed the mortal part separately from that, in another dwelling-place of the body, building a neck as an isthmus and boundary between the head and the breast, in order that it might be separate. Thus in the breasts and in what is called the thorax they bound the mortal kind of soul.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"88c44ca8c12c6da5acd95921dcc9e4676e856f15bd45cdb1f1661edaa0506a4c","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 69"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 69","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7","title":"Section 70","order":54,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ ἐπειδὴ τὸ μὲν ἄμεινον αὐτῆς, τὸ δὲ χεῖρον ἐπεφύκει, διοικοδομοῦσι τοῦ θώρακος αὖ τὸ κύτος, διορίζοντες οἷον  γυναικῶν, τὴν δὲ ἀνδρῶν χωρὶς οἴκησιν, τὰς φρένας διάφραγμα εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτῶν τιθέντες. τὸ μετέχον οὖν τῆς ψυχῆς ἀνδρείας καὶ θυμοῦ, φιλόνικον ὄν, κατῴκισαν ἐγγυτέρω τῆς κεφαλῆς μεταξὺ τῶν φρενῶν τε καὶ αὐχένος, ἵνα τοῦ λόγου κατήκοον ὂν κοινῇ μετʼ ἐκείνου βίᾳ τὸ τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν κατέχοι γένος, ὁπότʼ ἐκ τῆς ἀκροπόλεως τῷ τʼ ἐπιτάγματι καὶ λόγῳ μηδαμῇ πείθεσθαι ἑκὸν ἐθέλοι· τὴν δὲ δὴ καρδίαν  ἅμμα τῶν φλεβῶν καὶ πηγὴν τοῦ περιφερομένου κατὰ πάντα τὰ μέλη σφοδρῶς αἵματος εἰς τὴν δορυφορικὴν οἴκησιν κατέστησαν, ἵνα, ὅτε ζέσειεν τὸ τοῦ θυμοῦ μένος, τοῦ λόγου παραγγείλαντος ὥς τις ἄδικος περὶ αὐτὰ γίγνεται πρᾶξις ἔξωθεν ἢ καί τις ἀπὸ τῶν ἔνδοθεν ἐπιθυμιῶν, ὀξέως διὰ πάντων τῶν στενωπῶν πᾶν ὅσον αἰσθητικὸν ἐν τῷ σώματι, τῶν τε παρακελεύσεων καὶ ἀπειλῶν αἰσθανόμενον, γίγνοιτο ἐπήκοον καὶ ἕποιτο πάντῃ, καὶ τὸ βέλτιστον οὕτως ἐν αὐτοῖς  πᾶσιν ἡγεμονεῖν ἐῷ. τῇ δὲ δὴ πηδήσει τῆς καρδίας ἐν τῇ τῶν δεινῶν προσδοκίᾳ καὶ τῇ τοῦ θυμοῦ ἐγέρσει, προγιγνώσκοντες ὅτι διὰ πυρὸς ἡ τοιαύτη πᾶσα ἔμελλεν οἴδησις γίγνεσθαι τῶν θυμουμένων, ἐπικουρίαν αὐτῇ μηχανώμενοι τὴν τοῦ πλεύμονος ἰδέαν ἐνεφύτευσαν, πρῶτον μὲν μαλακὴν καὶ ἄναιμον, εἶτα σήραγγας ἐντὸς ἔχουσαν οἷον σπόγγου κατατετρημένας, ἵνα τό τε πνεῦμα καὶ τὸ πῶμα δεχομένη,  ψύχουσα, ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ῥᾳστώνην ἐν τῷ καύματι παρέχοι· διὸ δὴ τῆς ἀρτηρίας ὀχετοὺς ἐπὶ τὸν πλεύμονα ἔτεμον, καὶ περὶ τὴν καρδίαν αὐτὸν περιέστησαν οἷον μάλαγμα, ἵνʼ ὁ θυμὸς ἡνίκα ἐν αὐτῇ ἀκμάζοι, πηδῶσα εἰς ὑπεῖκον καὶ ἀναψυχομένη, πονοῦσα ἧττον, μᾶλλον τῷ λόγῳ μετὰ θυμοῦ δύναιτο ὑπηρετεῖν. τὸ δὲ δὴ σίτων τε καὶ ποτῶν ἐπιθυμητικὸν τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ ὅσων ἔνδειαν διὰ τὴν τοῦ σώματος ἴσχει φύσιν, τοῦτο  εἰς τὸ μεταξὺ τῶν τε φρενῶν καὶ τοῦ πρὸς τὸν ὀμφαλὸν ὅρου κατῴκισαν, οἷον φάτνην ἐν ἅπαντι τούτῳ τῷ τόπῳ τῇ τοῦ σώματος τροφῇ τεκτηνάμενοι· καὶ κατέδησαν δὴ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἐνταῦθα ὡς θρέμμα ἄγριον, τρέφειν δὲ συνημμένον ἀναγκαῖον, εἴπερ τι μέλλοι ποτὲ θνητὸν ἔσεσθαι γένος.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ ἐπειδὴ τὸ μὲν ἄμεινον αὐτῆς, τὸ δὲ χεῖρον ἐπεφύκει, διοικοδομοῦσι τοῦ θώρακος αὖ τὸ κύτος, διορίζοντες οἷον  γυναικῶν, τὴν δὲ ἀνδρῶν χωρὶς οἴκησιν, τὰς φρένας διάφραγμα εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτῶν τιθέντες.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","text":"τὸ μετέχον οὖν τῆς ψυχῆς ἀνδρείας καὶ θυμοῦ, φιλόνικον ὄν, κατῴκισαν ἐγγυτέρω τῆς κεφαλῆς μεταξὺ τῶν φρενῶν τε καὶ αὐχένος, ἵνα τοῦ λόγου κατήκοον ὂν κοινῇ μετʼ ἐκείνου βίᾳ τὸ τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν κατέχοι γένος, ὁπότʼ ἐκ τῆς ἀκροπόλεως τῷ τʼ ἐπιτάγματι καὶ λόγῳ μηδαμῇ πείθεσθαι ἑκὸν ἐθέλοι· τὴν δὲ δὴ καρδίαν  ἅμμα τῶν φλεβῶν καὶ πηγὴν τοῦ περιφερομένου κατὰ πάντα τὰ μέλη σφοδρῶς αἵματος εἰς τὴν δορυφορικὴν οἴκησιν κατέστησαν, ἵνα, ὅτε ζέσειεν τὸ τοῦ θυμοῦ μένος, τοῦ λόγου παραγγείλαντος ὥς τις ἄδικος περὶ αὐτὰ γίγνεται πρᾶξις ἔξωθεν ἢ καί τις ἀπὸ τῶν ἔνδοθεν ἐπιθυμιῶν, ὀξέως διὰ πάντων τῶν στενωπῶν πᾶν ὅσον αἰσθητικὸν ἐν τῷ σώματι, τῶν τε παρακελεύσεων καὶ ἀπειλῶν αἰσθανόμενον, γίγνοιτο ἐπήκοον καὶ ἕποιτο πάντῃ, καὶ τὸ βέλτιστον οὕτως ἐν αὐτοῖς  πᾶσιν ἡγεμονεῖν ἐῷ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","text":"τῇ δὲ δὴ πηδήσει τῆς καρδίας ἐν τῇ τῶν δεινῶν προσδοκίᾳ καὶ τῇ τοῦ θυμοῦ ἐγέρσει, προγιγνώσκοντες ὅτι διὰ πυρὸς ἡ τοιαύτη πᾶσα ἔμελλεν οἴδησις γίγνεσθαι τῶν θυμουμένων, ἐπικουρίαν αὐτῇ μηχανώμενοι τὴν τοῦ πλεύμονος ἰδέαν ἐνεφύτευσαν, πρῶτον μὲν μαλακὴν καὶ ἄναιμον, εἶτα σήραγγας ἐντὸς ἔχουσαν οἷον σπόγγου κατατετρημένας, ἵνα τό τε πνεῦμα καὶ τὸ πῶμα δεχομένη,  ψύχουσα, ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ῥᾳστώνην ἐν τῷ καύματι παρέχοι· διὸ δὴ τῆς ἀρτηρίας ὀχετοὺς ἐπὶ τὸν πλεύμονα ἔτεμον, καὶ περὶ τὴν καρδίαν αὐτὸν περιέστησαν οἷον μάλαγμα, ἵνʼ ὁ θυμὸς ἡνίκα ἐν αὐτῇ ἀκμάζοι, πηδῶσα εἰς ὑπεῖκον καὶ ἀναψυχομένη, πονοῦσα ἧττον, μᾶλλον τῷ λόγῳ μετὰ θυμοῦ δύναιτο ὑπηρετεῖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","text":"τὸ δὲ δὴ σίτων τε καὶ ποτῶν ἐπιθυμητικὸν τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ ὅσων ἔνδειαν διὰ τὴν τοῦ σώματος ἴσχει φύσιν, τοῦτο  εἰς τὸ μεταξὺ τῶν τε φρενῶν καὶ τοῦ πρὸς τὸν ὀμφαλὸν ὅρου κατῴκισαν, οἷον φάτνην ἐν ἅπαντι τούτῳ τῷ τόπῳ τῇ τοῦ σώματος τροφῇ τεκτηνάμενοι· καὶ κατέδησαν δὴ τὸ τοιοῦτον ἐνταῦθα ὡς θρέμμα ἄγριον, τρέφειν δὲ συνημμένον ἀναγκαῖον, εἴπερ τι μέλλοι ποτὲ θνητὸν ἔσεσθαι γένος.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"27cbee02bbe3f82c4079fb66531da14e0a604aa2a542fb55ccea60c136dd65fb","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225145382949Z_acdaf937","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 70","source_sha256":"27cbee02bbe3f82c4079fb66531da14e0a604aa2a542fb55ccea60c136dd65fb","sha256":"da34a696a7a26856dd96e59bf563575690412874890c3ce6970cebe43f64c189","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:45.383043+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","text":"And since one part of it was naturally better, the other worse, they built up again the cavity of the thorax, separating, as it were, the dwelling-place of women from that of men, and setting the midriff as a partition between them.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","text":"That part, then, which shares in the soul's courage and spirit, being fond of victory, they settled nearer to the head, between the midriff and the neck, in order that, being obedient to reason, it might together with it forcibly restrain the tribe of desires, whenever it should not willingly wish in any way to obey command and reason from the citadel. And they established the heart, the knot of the veins and source of the blood that courses vehemently through all the limbs, in the dwelling-place of the guard, so that, whenever the force of spirit should boil, reason having announced that some unjust action is taking place against them either from without or perhaps from some of the desires within, everything in the body that is capable of sensation, perceiving both exhortations and threats, might swiftly, through all the narrow passages, become obedient and follow everywhere, and thus allow what is best to rule among them all.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","text":"And concerning the leaping of the heart in the expectation of terrors and the arousing of spirit, knowing beforehand that every such swelling of the spirited parts was going to arise through fire, they contrived assistance for it and implanted the form of the lung: first soft and bloodless, then having within it channels perforated like a sponge, so that, receiving both breath and drink, it might cool and provide respiration and relief in the heat. Therefore they cut channels of the windpipe toward the lung and placed it around the heart like a cushion, so that whenever spirit should be at its height in it, the heart, leaping into what yields and being refreshed, might suffer less and be more able to serve reason together with spirit.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","text":"But that part of the soul which desires foods and drinks and whatever things it has need of because of the body's nature, this they settled in the region between the midriff and the boundary toward the navel, fashioning in all this place, as it were, a manger for the nourishment of the body. And they bound this sort of thing there as a wild creature, though it was necessarily connected with nourishment, if ever there was to be a mortal race.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"596eab8de3f081a4a56679451614a02fb1e2c94aed83e9f4d3931a14c8f58082","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 70"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 70","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49","title":"Section 71","order":55,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_49","text":"ΤΙ. ἵνʼ οὖν ἀεὶ νεμόμενον πρὸς φάτνῃ καὶ ὅτι πορρωτάτω τοῦ βουλευομένου κατοικοῦν, θόρυβον καὶ βοὴν ὡς ἐλαχίστην παρέχον,  τὸ κράτιστον καθʼ ἡσυχίαν περὶ τοῦ πᾶσι κοινῇ καὶ ἰδίᾳ συμφέροντος ἐῷ βουλεύεσθαι, διὰ ταῦτα ἐνταῦθʼ ἔδοσαν αὐτῷ τὴν τάξιν. εἰδότες δὲ αὐτὸ ὡς λόγου μὲν οὔτε συνήσειν ἔμελλεν, εἴ τέ πῃ καὶ μεταλαμβάνοι τινὸς αὐτῶν αἰσθήσεως, οὐκ ἔμφυτον αὐτῷ τὸ μέλειν τινῶν ἔσοιτο λόγων, ὑπὸ δὲ εἰδώλων καὶ φαντασμάτων νυκτός τε καὶ μεθʼ ἡμέραν μάλιστα ψυχαγωγήσοιτο, τούτῳ δὴ θεὸς ἐπιβουλεύσας αὐτῷ τὴν ἥπατος  ἰδέαν συνέστησε καὶ ἔθηκεν εἰς τὴν ἐκείνου κατοίκησιν, πυκνὸν καὶ λεῖον καὶ λαμπρὸν καὶ γλυκὺ καὶ πικρότητα ἔχον μηχανησάμενος, ἵνα ἐν αὐτῷ τῶν διανοημάτων ἡ ἐκ τοῦ νοῦ φερομένη δύναμις, οἷον ἐν κατόπτρῳ δεχομένῳ τύπους καὶ κατιδεῖν εἴδωλα παρέχοντι, φοβοῖ μὲν αὐτό, ὁπότε μέρει τῆς πικρότητος χρωμένη συγγενεῖ, χαλεπὴ προσενεχθεῖσα ἀπειλῇ, κατὰ πᾶν ὑπομειγνῦσα ὀξέως τὸ ἧπαρ, χολώδη χρώματα ἐμφαίνοι, συνάγουσά τε πᾶν ῥυσὸν καὶ τραχὺ ποιοῖ,  λοβὸν δὲ καὶ δοχὰς πύλας τε τὸ μὲν ἐξ ὀρθοῦ κατακάμπτουσα καὶ συσπῶσα, τὰ δὲ ἐμφράττουσα συγκλείουσά τε, λύπας καὶ ἄσας παρέχοι, καὶ ὅτʼ αὖ τἀναντία φαντάσματα ἀποζωγραφοῖ πρᾳότητός τις ἐκ διανοίας ἐπίπνοια, τῆς μὲν πικρότητος ἡσυχίαν παρέχουσα τῷ μήτε κινεῖν μήτε προσάπτεσθαι τῆς ἐναντίας ἑαυτῇ φύσεως ἐθέλειν, γλυκύτητι δὲ τῇ κατʼ ἐκεῖνο συμφύτῳ πρὸς αὐτὸ χρωμένη καὶ πάντα  ὀρθὰ καὶ λεῖα αὐτοῦ καὶ ἐλεύθερα ἀπευθύνουσα, ἵλεών τε καὶ εὐήμερον ποιοῖ τὴν περὶ τὸ ἧπαρ ψυχῆς μοῖραν κατῳκισμένην, ἔν τε τῇ νυκτὶ διαγωγὴν ἔχουσαν μετρίαν, μαντείᾳ χρωμένην καθʼ ὕπνον, ἐπειδὴ λόγου καὶ φρονήσεως οὐ μετεῖχε. μεμνημένοι γὰρ τῆς τοῦ πατρὸς ἐπιστολῆς οἱ συστήσαντες ἡμᾶς, ὅτε τὸ θνητὸν ἐπέστελλεν γένος ὡς ἄριστον εἰς δύναμιν ποιεῖν, οὕτω δὴ κατορθοῦντες καὶ τὸ φαῦλον  ἡμῶν, ἵνα ἀληθείας πῃ προσάπτοιτο, κατέστησαν ἐν τούτῳ τὸ μαντεῖον. ἱκανὸν δὲ σημεῖον ὡς μαντικὴν ἀφροσύνῃ θεὸς ἀνθρωπίνῃ δέδωκεν· οὐδεὶς γὰρ ἔννους ἐφάπτεται μαντικῆς ἐνθέου καὶ ἀληθοῦς, ἀλλʼ ἢ καθʼ ὕπνον τὴν τῆς φρονήσεως πεδηθεὶς δύναμιν ἢ διὰ νόσον, ἢ διά τινα ἐνθουσιασμὸν παραλλάξας.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἵνʼ οὖν ἀεὶ νεμόμενον πρὸς φάτνῃ καὶ ὅτι πορρωτάτω τοῦ βουλευομένου κατοικοῦν, θόρυβον καὶ βοὴν ὡς ἐλαχίστην παρέχον,  τὸ κράτιστον καθʼ ἡσυχίαν περὶ τοῦ πᾶσι κοινῇ καὶ ἰδίᾳ συμφέροντος ἐῷ βουλεύεσθαι, διὰ ταῦτα ἐνταῦθʼ ἔδοσαν αὐτῷ τὴν τάξιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","text":"εἰδότες δὲ αὐτὸ ὡς λόγου μὲν οὔτε συνήσειν ἔμελλεν, εἴ τέ πῃ καὶ μεταλαμβάνοι τινὸς αὐτῶν αἰσθήσεως, οὐκ ἔμφυτον αὐτῷ τὸ μέλειν τινῶν ἔσοιτο λόγων, ὑπὸ δὲ εἰδώλων καὶ φαντασμάτων νυκτός τε καὶ μεθʼ ἡμέραν μάλιστα ψυχαγωγήσοιτο, τούτῳ δὴ θεὸς ἐπιβουλεύσας αὐτῷ τὴν ἥπατος  ἰδέαν συνέστησε καὶ ἔθηκεν εἰς τὴν ἐκείνου κατοίκησιν, πυκνὸν καὶ λεῖον καὶ λαμπρὸν καὶ γλυκὺ καὶ πικρότητα ἔχον μηχανησάμενος, ἵνα ἐν αὐτῷ τῶν διανοημάτων ἡ ἐκ τοῦ νοῦ φερομένη δύναμις, οἷον ἐν κατόπτρῳ δεχομένῳ τύπους καὶ κατιδεῖν εἴδωλα παρέχοντι, φοβοῖ μὲν αὐτό, ὁπότε μέρει τῆς πικρότητος χρωμένη συγγενεῖ, χαλεπὴ προσενεχθεῖσα ἀπειλῇ, κατὰ πᾶν ὑπομειγνῦσα ὀξέως τὸ ἧπαρ, χολώδη χρώματα ἐμφαίνοι, συνάγουσά τε πᾶν ῥυσὸν καὶ τραχὺ ποιοῖ,  λοβὸν δὲ καὶ δοχὰς πύλας τε τὸ μὲν ἐξ ὀρθοῦ κατακάμπτουσα καὶ συσπῶσα, τὰ δὲ ἐμφράττουσα συγκλείουσά τε, λύπας καὶ ἄσας παρέχοι, καὶ ὅτʼ αὖ τἀναντία φαντάσματα ἀποζωγραφοῖ πρᾳότητός","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","text":"τις ἐκ διανοίας ἐπίπνοια, τῆς μὲν πικρότητος ἡσυχίαν παρέχουσα τῷ μήτε κινεῖν μήτε προσάπτεσθαι τῆς ἐναντίας ἑαυτῇ φύσεως ἐθέλειν, γλυκύτητι δὲ τῇ κατʼ ἐκεῖνο συμφύτῳ πρὸς αὐτὸ χρωμένη καὶ πάντα  ὀρθὰ καὶ λεῖα αὐτοῦ καὶ ἐλεύθερα ἀπευθύνουσα, ἵλεών τε καὶ εὐήμερον ποιοῖ τὴν περὶ τὸ ἧπαρ ψυχῆς μοῖραν κατῳκισμένην, ἔν τε τῇ νυκτὶ διαγωγὴν ἔχουσαν μετρίαν, μαντείᾳ χρωμένην καθʼ ὕπνον, ἐπειδὴ λόγου καὶ φρονήσεως οὐ μετεῖχε. μεμνημένοι γὰρ τῆς τοῦ πατρὸς ἐπιστολῆς οἱ συστήσαντες ἡμᾶς, ὅτε τὸ θνητὸν ἐπέστελλεν γένος ὡς ἄριστον εἰς δύναμιν ποιεῖν, οὕτω δὴ κατορθοῦντες καὶ τὸ φαῦλον  ἡμῶν, ἵνα ἀληθείας πῃ προσάπτοιτο, κατέστησαν ἐν τούτῳ τὸ μαντεῖον. ἱκανὸν δὲ σημεῖον ὡς μαντικὴν ἀφροσύνῃ θεὸς ἀνθρωπίνῃ δέδωκεν· οὐδεὶς γὰρ ἔννους ἐφάπτεται μαντικῆς ἐνθέου καὶ ἀληθοῦς, ἀλλʼ ἢ καθʼ ὕπνον τὴν τῆς φρονήσεως πεδηθεὶς δύναμιν ἢ διὰ νόσον, ἢ διά τινα ἐνθουσιασμὸν παραλλάξας.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"aa01d867cc59e6f2573792fd712158b59bb3dc6ac166940f8374277539246b1f","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225154415994Z_0331d3eb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 71","source_sha256":"aa01d867cc59e6f2573792fd712158b59bb3dc6ac166940f8374277539246b1f","sha256":"d18790d84be8e5c3d19e20bf3daa49e307c1d9e28f5b36090a5d57e1d5be6e45","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:51:54.416128+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","text":"Therefore, in order that, always feeding at its manger and dwelling as far as possible from the deliberative part, and producing the least possible uproar and noise, it might allow what is best to deliberate in quiet concerning what is advantageous to all in common and severally, for these reasons they assigned it this station.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","text":"And knowing that it would not be capable of understanding reason, and that, even if it should somehow partake of some perception of them, it would not have it in its nature to care for any arguments, but would be chiefly beguiled by images and phantasms by night and by day, the god, having devised a plot against it, constructed the form of the liver and placed it in that one's dwelling, contriving it dense and smooth and bright and sweet, and possessing bitterness, in order that in it the power of thoughts borne from intellect, as in a mirror receiving impressions and providing images to behold, might frighten it whenever, using the kindred part of bitterness, it applies a harsh threat, sharply mingling it throughout the whole liver, and might display bilious colours, and, drawing together all that is fluid, make it rough; and, bending and contracting one lobe and its receptacles and gates from the upright, while obstructing and closing the others, might produce pains and nausea; and whenever, again, it paints in the opposite phantasms of gentleness","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","text":"some inspiration from intelligence, affording quiet to the bitterness, since it is unwilling either to set in motion or to touch the nature opposed to itself, but using the sweetness connate with it in that region and setting all its parts straight and smooth and free, might render gentle and serene the portion of soul settled about the liver, and give it a moderate pastime during the night, employing divination in sleep, since it did not partake of reason and understanding. For those who constituted us, mindful of the command of the father, when he enjoined them to make the mortal kind as excellent as was within their power, thus indeed setting even our inferior part aright, in order that it might somehow touch upon truth, established the prophetic faculty in this part. And it is sufficient evidence that god has given divination to human unreason: for no one in his right mind lays hold upon inspired and true divination, unless he has his power of understanding fettered in sleep, or has been deranged through disease, or through some enthusiasm.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"96f63cc8ef889e2fa18955b31ca7be5ee5d117ec1fc863420e2a0a278db1d9b1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 71"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 71","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50","title":"Section 72","order":56,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_50","text":"ΤΙ. ἀλλὰ συννοῆσαι μὲν ἔμφρονος τά τε ῥηθέντα ἀναμνησθέντα ὄναρ ἢ ὕπαρ ὑπὸ τῆς μαντικῆς τε καὶ ἐνθουσιαστικῆς φύσεως, καὶ ὅσα ἂν φαντάσματα  ὀφθῇ, πάντα λογισμῷ διελέσθαι ὅπῃ τι σημαίνει καὶ ὅτῳ μέλλοντος ἢ παρελθόντος ἢ παρόντος κακοῦ ἢ ἀγαθοῦ· τοῦ δὲ μανέντος ἔτι τε ἐν τούτῳ μένοντος οὐκ ἔργον τὰ φανέντα καὶ φωνηθέντα ὑφʼ ἑαυτοῦ κρίνειν, ἀλλʼ εὖ καὶ πάλαι λέγεται τὸ πράττειν καὶ γνῶναι τά τε αὑτοῦ καὶ ἑαυτὸν σώφρονι μόνῳ προσήκειν. ὅθεν δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν προφητῶν γένος ἐπὶ  ταῖς ἐνθέοις μαντείαις κριτὰς ἐπικαθιστάναι νόμος· οὓς μάντεις αὐτοὺς ὀνομάζουσίν τινες, τὸ πᾶν ἠγνοηκότες ὅτι τῆς διʼ αἰνιγμῶν οὗτοι φήμης καὶ φαντάσεως ὑποκριταί, καὶ οὔτι μάντεις, προφῆται δὲ μαντευομένων δικαιότατα ὀνομάζοιντʼ ἄν. ἡ μὲν οὖν φύσις ἥπατος διὰ ταῦτα τοιαύτη τε καὶ ἐν τόπῳ ᾧ λέγομεν πέφυκε, χάριν μαντικῆς· καὶ ἔτι μὲν δὴ ζῶντος ἑκάστου τὸ τοιοῦτον σημεῖα ἐναργέστερα ἔχει, στερηθὲν δὲ τοῦ ζῆν γέγονε τυφλὸν καὶ τὰ μαντεῖα ἀμυδρότερα  ἔσχεν τοῦ τι σαφὲς σημαίνειν. ἡ δʼ αὖ τοῦ γείτονος αὐτῷ σύστασις καὶ ἕδρα σπλάγχνου γέγονεν ἐξ ἀριστερᾶς χάριν ἐκείνου, τοῦ παρέχειν αὐτὸ λαμπρὸν ἀεὶ καὶ καθαρόν, οἷον κατόπτρῳ παρεσκευασμένον καὶ ἕτοιμον ἀεὶ παρακείμενον ἐκμαγεῖον. διὸ δὴ καὶ ὅταν τινὲς ἀκαθαρσίαι γίγνωνται διὰ νόσους σώματος περὶ τὸ ἧπαρ, πάντα ἡ σπληνὸς καθαίρουσα αὐτὰ δέχεται μανότης, ἅτε κοίλου καὶ ἀναίμου ὑφανθέντος·  ὅθεν πληρούμενος τῶν ἀποκαθαιρομένων μέγας καὶ ὕπουλος αὐξάνεται, καὶ πάλιν, ὅταν καθαρθῇ τὸ σῶμα, ταπεινούμενος εἰς ταὐτὸν συνίζει. τὰ μὲν οὖν περὶ ψυχῆς, ὅσον θνητὸν ἔχει καὶ ὅσον θεῖον, καὶ ὅπῃ καὶ μεθʼ ὧν καὶ διʼ ἃ χωρὶς ᾠκίσθη, τὸ μὲν ἀληθὲς ὡς εἴρηται, θεοῦ συμφήσαντος τότʼ ἂν οὕτως μόνως διισχυριζοίμεθα· τό γε μὴν εἰκὸς ἡμῖν εἰρῆσθαι, καὶ νῦν καὶ ἔτι μᾶλλον ἀνασκοποῦσι διακινδυνευτέον τὸ φάναι καὶ πεφάσθω.  τὸ δʼ ἑξῆς δὴ τούτοισιν κατὰ ταὐτὰ μεταδιωκτέον· ἦν δὲ τὸ τοῦ σώματος ἐπίλοιπον ᾗ γέγονεν. ἐκ δὴ λογισμοῦ τοιοῦδε συνίστασθαι μάλιστʼ ἂν αὐτὸ πάντων πρέποι.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἀλλὰ συννοῆσαι μὲν ἔμφρονος τά τε ῥηθέντα ἀναμνησθέντα ὄναρ ἢ ὕπαρ ὑπὸ τῆς μαντικῆς τε καὶ ἐνθουσιαστικῆς φύσεως, καὶ ὅσα ἂν φαντάσματα  ὀφθῇ, πάντα λογισμῷ διελέσθαι ὅπῃ τι σημαίνει καὶ ὅτῳ μέλλοντος ἢ παρελθόντος ἢ παρόντος κακοῦ ἢ ἀγαθοῦ· τοῦ δὲ μανέντος ἔτι τε ἐν τούτῳ μένοντος οὐκ ἔργον τὰ φανέντα καὶ φωνηθέντα ὑφʼ ἑαυτοῦ κρίνειν, ἀλλʼ εὖ καὶ πάλαι λέγεται τὸ πράττειν καὶ γνῶναι τά τε αὑτοῦ καὶ ἑαυτὸν σώφρονι μόνῳ προσήκειν. ὅθεν δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν προφητῶν γένος ἐπὶ  ταῖς ἐνθέοις μαντείαις κριτὰς ἐπικαθιστάναι νόμος· οὓς μάντεις αὐτοὺς ὀνομάζουσίν τινες, τὸ πᾶν ἠγνοηκότες ὅτι τῆς διʼ αἰνιγμῶν οὗτοι φήμης καὶ φαντάσεως ὑποκριταί, καὶ οὔτι μάντεις, προφῆται δὲ μαντευομένων δικαιότατα ὀνομάζοιντʼ ἄν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","text":"ἡ μὲν οὖν φύσις ἥπατος διὰ ταῦτα τοιαύτη τε καὶ ἐν τόπῳ ᾧ λέγομεν πέφυκε, χάριν μαντικῆς· καὶ ἔτι μὲν δὴ ζῶντος ἑκάστου τὸ τοιοῦτον σημεῖα ἐναργέστερα ἔχει, στερηθὲν δὲ τοῦ ζῆν γέγονε τυφλὸν καὶ τὰ μαντεῖα ἀμυδρότερα  ἔσχεν τοῦ τι σαφὲς σημαίνειν. ἡ δʼ αὖ τοῦ γείτονος αὐτῷ σύστασις καὶ ἕδρα σπλάγχνου γέγονεν ἐξ ἀριστερᾶς χάριν ἐκείνου, τοῦ παρέχειν αὐτὸ λαμπρὸν ἀεὶ καὶ καθαρόν, οἷον κατόπτρῳ παρεσκευασμένον καὶ ἕτοιμον ἀεὶ παρακείμενον ἐκμαγεῖον. διὸ δὴ καὶ ὅταν τινὲς ἀκαθαρσίαι γίγνωνται διὰ νόσους σώματος περὶ τὸ ἧπαρ, πάντα ἡ σπληνὸς καθαίρουσα αὐτὰ δέχεται μανότης, ἅτε κοίλου καὶ ἀναίμου ὑφανθέντος·  ὅθεν πληρούμενος τῶν ἀποκαθαιρομένων μέγας καὶ ὕπουλος αὐξάνεται, καὶ πάλιν, ὅταν καθαρθῇ τὸ σῶμα, ταπεινούμενος εἰς ταὐτὸν συνίζει.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","text":"τὰ μὲν οὖν περὶ ψυχῆς, ὅσον θνητὸν ἔχει καὶ ὅσον θεῖον, καὶ ὅπῃ καὶ μεθʼ ὧν καὶ διʼ ἃ χωρὶς ᾠκίσθη, τὸ μὲν ἀληθὲς ὡς εἴρηται, θεοῦ συμφήσαντος τότʼ ἂν οὕτως μόνως διισχυριζοίμεθα· τό γε μὴν εἰκὸς ἡμῖν εἰρῆσθαι, καὶ νῦν καὶ ἔτι μᾶλλον ἀνασκοποῦσι διακινδυνευτέον τὸ φάναι καὶ πεφάσθω.  τὸ δʼ ἑξῆς δὴ τούτοισιν κατὰ ταὐτὰ μεταδιωκτέον· ἦν δὲ τὸ τοῦ σώματος ἐπίλοιπον ᾗ γέγονεν. ἐκ δὴ λογισμοῦ τοιοῦδε συνίστασθαι μάλιστʼ ἂν αὐτὸ πάντων πρέποι.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"978e00c53c938a92a69a0d70045d59fc80ece34fa254e6960d1e300e4262731e","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225202220272Z_e86b21b2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 72","source_sha256":"978e00c53c938a92a69a0d70045d59fc80ece34fa254e6960d1e300e4262731e","sha256":"6e176b5220fe719e763e3424d2bb6b59c9fa80d137b837437b9cde3f4d2f9c1c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:02.220405+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","text":"TI. But to understand intelligently the things spoken and recalled, whether in a dream or while awake, by the prophetic and inspired nature, and to distinguish by reasoning all the apparitions that may be seen—how they signify something and of what future, past, or present evil or good—they are signs; this is not the task of one who is still mad and remains in that condition, to judge the things that have appeared and been uttered by himself. Rather, it is rightly and long ago said that it belongs to the sober-minded person alone to act and to know both his own affairs and himself. Hence indeed it is the custom to set the race of interpreters as judges over inspired prophecies; some call them themselves seers, being wholly unaware that they are interpreters of the utterance and apparition given through riddles, and are not at all seers, but would most rightly be called prophets of things divined.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","text":"The nature of the liver, then, has for these reasons come to be such as it is and in the place of which we speak, for the sake of divination; and, while each person is still alive, such a thing has clearer signs, but when deprived of life it has become blind and has acquired dimmer oracles, unable to signify anything clear. The composition and seat of the viscous organ adjoining it, on the left, have in turn come to be for the sake of that organ: to keep it always bright and clean, like a mirror prepared and always lying ready beside it as an impression-receiver. Therefore, whenever certain impurities arise around the liver through bodily diseases, the porous substance of the spleen, cleansing them all, receives them, since it is woven hollow and bloodless; wherefore, being filled with what is being cleansed away, it grows large and festering, and again, when the body has been cleansed, it shrinks and settles back together into the same state.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","text":"Concerning the soul, then—what mortal part it has and what divine part, and where, with whom, and for what reasons these were separately housed—we should maintain that the truth is as has been said only if a god agreed with us. Yet that what has been said by us is likely, both now and still more upon further examination, we must venture to affirm; and let it be affirmed. Next, in the same way, we must pursue what follows these matters: namely, how the remainder of the body came to be. That it should be constituted above all things from some such reasoning as follows would be most fitting.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"9c9b52b1f3fca477bd51a87d87446267476fc81b1a995e8c6eda97fbdaa9267b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 72"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 72","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51","title":"Section 73","order":57,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_51","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν ἐσομένην ἐν ἡμῖν ποτῶν καὶ ἐδεστῶν ἀκολασίαν ᾔδεσαν οἱ συντιθέντες ἡμῶν τὸ γένος, καὶ ὅτι τοῦ μετρίου καὶ ἀναγκαίου διὰ μαργότητα πολλῷ χρησοίμεθα πλέονι· ἵνʼ οὖν μὴ φθορὰ διὰ νόσους ὀξεῖα γίγνοιτο καὶ ἀτελὲς τὸ γένος εὐθὺς  τὸ θνητὸν τελευτῷ, ταῦτα προορώμενοι τῇ τοῦ περιγενησομένου πώματος ἐδέσματός τε ἕξει τὴν ὀνομαζομένην κάτω κοιλίαν ὑποδοχὴν ἔθεσαν, εἵλιξάν τε πέριξ τὴν τῶν ἐντέρων γένεσιν, ὅπως μὴ ταχὺ διεκπερῶσα ἡ τροφὴ ταχὺ πάλιν τροφῆς ἑτέρας δεῖσθαι τὸ σῶμα ἀναγκάζοι, καὶ παρέχουσα ἀπληστίαν, διὰ γαστριμαργίαν ἀφιλόσοφον καὶ ἄμουσον πᾶν ἀποτελοῖ τὸ γένος, ἀνυπήκοον τοῦ θειοτάτου τῶν παρʼ ἡμῖν.  τὸ δὲ ὀστῶν καὶ σαρκῶν καὶ τῆς τοιαύτης φύσεως πέρι πάσης ὧδε ἔσχεν. τούτοις σύμπασιν ἀρχὴ μὲν ἡ τοῦ μυελοῦ γένεσις· οἱ γὰρ τοῦ βίου δεσμοί, τῆς ψυχῆς τῷ σώματι συνδουμένης, ἐν τούτῳ διαδούμενοι κατερρίζουν τὸ θνητὸν γένος· αὐτὸς δὲ ὁ μυελὸς γέγονεν ἐξ ἄλλων. τῶν γὰρ τριγώνων ὅσα πρῶτα ἀστραβῆ καὶ λεῖα ὄντα πῦρ τε καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀέρα καὶ γῆν διʼ ἀκριβείας μάλιστα ἦν παρασχεῖν δυνατά, ταῦτα ὁ θεὸς ἀπὸ τῶν ἑαυτῶν ἕκαστα γενῶν χωρὶς  ἀποκρίνων, μειγνὺς δὲ ἀλλήλοις σύμμετρα, πανσπερμίαν παντὶ θνητῷ γένει μηχανώμενος, τὸν μυελὸν ἐξ αὐτῶν ἀπηργάσατο, καὶ μετὰ ταῦτα δὴ φυτεύων ἐν αὐτῷ κατέδει τὰ τῶν ψυχῶν γένη, σχημάτων τε ὅσα ἔμελλεν αὖ σχήσειν οἷά τε καθʼ ἕκαστα εἴδη, τὸν μυελὸν αὐτὸν τοσαῦτα καὶ τοιαῦτα διῃρεῖτο σχήματα εὐθὺς ἐν τῇ διανομῇ τῇ κατʼ ἀρχάς. καὶ τὴν μὲν τὸ θεῖον σπέρμα οἷον ἄρουραν μέλλουσαν ἕξειν ἐν αὑτῇ περιφερῆ πανταχῇ πλάσας ἐπωνόμασεν τοῦ μυελοῦ  ταύτην τὴν μοῖραν ἐγκέφαλον, ὡς ἀποτελεσθέντος ἑκάστου ζῴου τὸ περὶ τοῦτʼ ἀγγεῖον κεφαλὴν γενησόμενον· ὃ δʼ αὖ τὸ λοιπὸν καὶ θνητὸν τῆς ψυχῆς ἔμελλε καθέξειν, ἅμα στρογγύλα καὶ προμήκη διῃρεῖτο σχήματα, μυελὸν δὲ πάντα ἐπεφήμισεν, καὶ καθάπερ ἐξ ἀγκυρῶν βαλλόμενος ἐκ τούτων πάσης ψυχῆς δεσμοὺς περὶ τοῦτο σύμπαν ἤδη τὸ σῶμα ἡμῶν ἀπηργάζετο, στέγασμα μὲν αὐτῷ πρῶτον συμπηγνὺς περὶ  ὅλον ὀστέινον. τὸ δὲ ὀστοῦν συνίστησιν ὧδε. γῆν διαττήσας καθαρὰν καὶ λείαν ἐφύρασε καὶ ἔδευσεν μυελῷ, καὶ μετὰ τοῦτο εἰς πῦρ αὐτὸ ἐντίθησιν, μετʼ ἐκεῖνο δὲ εἰς ὕδωρ βάπτει, πάλιν δὲ εἰς πῦρ, αὖθίς τε εἰς ὕδωρ· μεταφέρων δʼ οὕτω πολλάκις εἰς ἑκάτερον ὑπʼ ἀμφοῖν ἄτηκτον ἀπηργάσατο.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν ἐσομένην ἐν ἡμῖν ποτῶν καὶ ἐδεστῶν ἀκολασίαν ᾔδεσαν οἱ συντιθέντες ἡμῶν τὸ γένος, καὶ ὅτι τοῦ μετρίου καὶ ἀναγκαίου διὰ μαργότητα πολλῷ χρησοίμεθα πλέονι· ἵνʼ οὖν μὴ φθορὰ διὰ νόσους ὀξεῖα γίγνοιτο καὶ ἀτελὲς τὸ γένος εὐθὺς  τὸ θνητὸν τελευτῷ, ταῦτα προορώμενοι τῇ τοῦ περιγενησομένου πώματος ἐδέσματός τε ἕξει τὴν ὀνομαζομένην κάτω κοιλίαν ὑποδοχὴν ἔθεσαν, εἵλιξάν τε πέριξ τὴν τῶν ἐντέρων γένεσιν, ὅπως μὴ ταχὺ διεκπερῶσα ἡ τροφὴ ταχὺ πάλιν τροφῆς ἑτέρας δεῖσθαι τὸ σῶμα ἀναγκάζοι, καὶ παρέχουσα ἀπληστίαν, διὰ γαστριμαργίαν ἀφιλόσοφον καὶ ἄμουσον πᾶν ἀποτελοῖ τὸ γένος, ἀνυπήκοον τοῦ θειοτάτου τῶν παρʼ ἡμῖν.  τὸ δὲ ὀστῶν καὶ σαρκῶν καὶ τῆς τοιαύτης φύσεως πέρι πάσης ὧδε ἔσχεν. τούτοις σύμπασιν ἀρχὴ μὲν ἡ τοῦ μυελοῦ γένεσις· οἱ γὰρ τοῦ βίου δεσμοί, τῆς ψυχῆς τῷ σώματι συνδουμένης, ἐν τούτῳ διαδούμενοι κατερρίζουν τὸ θνητὸν γένος· αὐτὸς δὲ ὁ μυελὸς γέγονεν ἐξ ἄλλων.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","text":"τῶν γὰρ τριγώνων ὅσα πρῶτα ἀστραβῆ καὶ λεῖα ὄντα πῦρ τε καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ ἀέρα καὶ γῆν διʼ ἀκριβείας μάλιστα ἦν παρασχεῖν δυνατά, ταῦτα ὁ θεὸς ἀπὸ τῶν ἑαυτῶν ἕκαστα γενῶν χωρὶς  ἀποκρίνων, μειγνὺς δὲ ἀλλήλοις σύμμετρα, πανσπερμίαν παντὶ θνητῷ γένει μηχανώμενος, τὸν μυελὸν ἐξ αὐτῶν ἀπηργάσατο, καὶ μετὰ ταῦτα δὴ φυτεύων ἐν αὐτῷ κατέδει τὰ τῶν ψυχῶν γένη, σχημάτων τε ὅσα ἔμελλεν αὖ σχήσειν οἷά τε καθʼ ἕκαστα εἴδη, τὸν μυελὸν αὐτὸν τοσαῦτα καὶ τοιαῦτα διῃρεῖτο σχήματα εὐθὺς ἐν τῇ διανομῇ τῇ κατʼ ἀρχάς.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","text":"καὶ τὴν μὲν τὸ θεῖον σπέρμα οἷον ἄρουραν μέλλουσαν ἕξειν ἐν αὑτῇ περιφερῆ πανταχῇ πλάσας ἐπωνόμασεν τοῦ μυελοῦ  ταύτην τὴν μοῖραν ἐγκέφαλον, ὡς ἀποτελεσθέντος ἑκάστου ζῴου τὸ περὶ τοῦτʼ ἀγγεῖον κεφαλὴν γενησόμενον· ὃ δʼ αὖ τὸ λοιπὸν καὶ θνητὸν τῆς ψυχῆς ἔμελλε καθέξειν, ἅμα στρογγύλα καὶ προμήκη διῃρεῖτο σχήματα, μυελὸν δὲ πάντα ἐπεφήμισεν, καὶ καθάπερ ἐξ ἀγκυρῶν βαλλόμενος ἐκ τούτων πάσης ψυχῆς δεσμοὺς περὶ τοῦτο σύμπαν ἤδη τὸ σῶμα ἡμῶν ἀπηργάζετο, στέγασμα μὲν αὐτῷ πρῶτον συμπηγνὺς περὶ  ὅλον ὀστέινον. τὸ δὲ ὀστοῦν συνίστησιν ὧδε. γῆν διαττήσας καθαρὰν καὶ λείαν ἐφύρασε καὶ ἔδευσεν μυελῷ, καὶ μετὰ τοῦτο εἰς πῦρ αὐτὸ ἐντίθησιν, μετʼ ἐκεῖνο δὲ εἰς ὕδωρ βάπτει, πάλιν δὲ εἰς πῦρ, αὖθίς τε εἰς ὕδωρ· μεταφέρων δʼ οὕτω πολλάκις εἰς ἑκάτερον ὑπʼ ἀμφοῖν ἄτηκτον ἀπηργάσατο.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"4174cc77e8d90d5aa1b9b86c5cc9393bae7324f2bddf1d5825a7a85858aa7822","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225210386770Z_a600d4a5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 73","source_sha256":"4174cc77e8d90d5aa1b9b86c5cc9393bae7324f2bddf1d5825a7a85858aa7822","sha256":"5693a35eace788591ffeba2a4c03ca6a7cf367c37b197088b25f522d4923fb9e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:10.386875+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","text":"T. Those who compounded our race knew the future intemperance in us concerning drinks and foods, and that through wantonness we should make use of much more than what is moderate and necessary. Therefore, lest destruction through diseases should arise swiftly and the mortal race should immediately come to an untimely end, foreseeing these things they made the receptacle called the lower belly to contain the surplus of drink and food, and they coiled the formation of the intestines around it, so that nourishment, not passing through quickly, might not compel the body quickly again to require other nourishment, and, by producing insatiability, through gluttony might render the entire race unphilosophic and unmusical, disobedient to the most divine thing within us.\n\nConcerning the whole nature of bones and flesh and things of that kind, it was as follows. For all these, the origin was the generation of marrow; for the bonds of life, by which the soul is bound together with the body, were distributed through this and took root in the mortal race. But marrow itself came to be from other things.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","text":"For of the triangles which, being primary, unwarped, and smooth, were most exactly able to furnish fire, water, air, and earth, the god, separating each from its own kind, and mixing them with one another in due proportion, fashioned marrow from them, contriving a seed-mixture for every mortal kind. Then, planting and fastening in it the kinds of souls, he at once divided the marrow itself, in the original distribution, into as many and such shapes as each kind was in turn to possess.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","text":"And the portion of the marrow which was to contain in itself, as though in a field, the divine seed, he fashioned spherical in every direction and named this portion of the marrow brain, since, when each living creature had been completed, the vessel around this was to become a head. But that which in turn was to contain the remaining and mortal part of the soul, he divided into shapes at once round and elongated, and called it all marrow; and, as though casting anchors from these, he fashioned from them the bonds of every soul around this now entire body of ours, first constructing around it an entire bony covering.\n\nHe composes bone as follows. Having sifted earth that was pure and smooth, he kneaded and moistened it with marrow; then he put it into fire, after that dipped it into water, then again into fire, and once more into water. Transferring it thus many times into each of the two, he rendered it indissoluble by both.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"5f520eaccaaf8d0de4fcc73ac4010d43849920e50a38cf6416dfc0bd88688769","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 73"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 73","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52","title":"Section 74","order":58,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_52","text":"ΤΙ. καταχρώμενος δὴ τούτῳ περὶ μὲν τὸν ἐγκέφαλον αὐτοῦ σφαῖραν περιετόρνευσεν ὀστεΐνην, ταύτῃ δὲ στενὴν διέξοδον  κατελείπετο· καὶ περὶ τὸν διαυχένιον ἅμα καὶ νωτιαῖον μυελὸν ἐξ αὐτοῦ σφονδύλους πλάσας ὑπέτεινεν οἷον στρόφιγγας, ἀρξάμενος ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς, διὰ παντὸς τοῦ κύτους. καὶ τὸ πᾶν δὴ σπέρμα διασῴζων οὕτως λιθοειδεῖ περιβόλῳ συνέφραξεν, ἐμποιῶν ἄρθρα, τῇ θατέρου προσχρώμενος ἐν αὐτοῖς ὡς μέσῃ ἐνισταμένῃ δυνάμει, κινήσεως καὶ κάμψεως ἕνεκα. τὴν δʼ αὖ τῆς ὀστεΐνης φύσεως ἕξιν ἡγησάμενος  τοῦ δέοντος κραυροτέραν εἶναι καὶ ἀκαμπτοτέραν, διάπυρόν τʼ αὖ γιγνομένην καὶ πάλιν ψυχομένην σφακελίσασαν ταχὺ διαφθερεῖν τὸ σπέρμα ἐντὸς αὑτῆς, διὰ ταῦτα οὕτω τὸ τῶν νεύρων καὶ τὸ τῆς σαρκὸς γένος ἐμηχανᾶτο, ἵνα τῷ μὲν πάντα τὰ μέλη συνδήσας ἐπιτεινομένῳ καὶ ἀνιεμένῳ περὶ τοὺς στρόφιγγας καμπτόμενον τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἐκτεινόμενον παρέχοι, τὴν δὲ σάρκα προβολὴν μὲν καυμάτων, πρόβλημα δὲ χειμώνων, ἔτι δὲ πτωμάτων οἷον τὰ πιλητὰ ἔσεσθαι κτήματα,  σώμασιν μαλακῶς καὶ πρᾴως ὑπείκουσαν, θερμὴν δὲ νοτίδα ἐντὸς ἑαυτῆς ἔχουσαν θέρους μὲν ἀνιδίουσαν καὶ νοτιζομένην ἔξωθεν ψῦχος κατὰ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα παρέξειν οἰκεῖον, διὰ χειμῶνος δὲ πάλιν αὖ τούτῳ τῷ πυρὶ τὸν προσφερόμενον ἔξωθεν καὶ περιιστάμενον πάγον ἀμυνεῖσθαι μετρίως. ταῦτα ἡμῶν διανοηθεὶς ὁ κηροπλάστης, ὕδατι μὲν καὶ πυρὶ καὶ γῇ συμμείξας καὶ συναρμόσας, ἐξ ὀξέος καὶ ἁλμυροῦ συνθεὶς  ζύμωμα ὑπομείξας αὐτοῖς, σάρκα ἔγχυμον καὶ μαλακὴν συνέστησεν· τὴν δὲ τῶν νεύρων φύσιν ἐξ ὀστοῦ καὶ σαρκὸς ἀζύμου κράσεως μίαν ἐξ ἀμφοῖν μέσην δυνάμει συνεκεράσατο, ξανθῷ χρώματι προσχρώμενος. ὅθεν συντονωτέραν μὲν καὶ γλισχροτέραν σαρκῶν, μαλακωτέραν δὲ ὀστῶν ὑγροτέραν τε ἐκτήσατο δύναμιν νεῦρα· οἷς συμπεριλαβὼν ὁ θεὸς ὀστᾶ καὶ μυελόν, δήσας πρὸς ἄλληλα νεύροις, μετὰ ταῦτα σαρξὶν  πάντα αὐτὰ κατεσκίασεν ἄνωθεν. ὅσα μὲν οὖν ἐμψυχότατα τῶν ὀστῶν ἦν, ὀλιγίσταις συνέφραττε σαρξίν, ἃ δʼ ἀψυχότατα ἐντός, πλείσταις καὶ πυκνοτάταις, καὶ δὴ κατὰ τὰς συμβολὰς τῶν ὀστῶν, ὅπῃ μήτινα ἀνάγκην ὁ λόγος ἀπέφαινεν δεῖν αὐτὰς εἶναι, βραχεῖαν σάρκα ἔφυσεν, ἵνα μήτε ἐμποδὼν ταῖς καμπαῖσιν οὖσαι δύσφορα τὰ σώματα ἀπεργάζοιντο, ἅτε δυσκίνητα γιγνόμενα, μήτʼ αὖ πολλαὶ καὶ πυκναὶ σφόδρα τε ἐν ἀλλήλαις ἐμπεπιλημέναι, διὰ στερεότητα ἀναισθησίαν ἐμποιοῦσαι, δυσμνημονευτότερα καὶ κωφότερα τὰ περὶ τὴν διάνοιαν ποιοῖεν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καταχρώμενος δὴ τούτῳ περὶ μὲν τὸν ἐγκέφαλον αὐτοῦ σφαῖραν περιετόρνευσεν ὀστεΐνην, ταύτῃ δὲ στενὴν διέξοδον  κατελείπετο· καὶ περὶ τὸν διαυχένιον ἅμα καὶ νωτιαῖον μυελὸν ἐξ αὐτοῦ σφονδύλους πλάσας ὑπέτεινεν οἷον στρόφιγγας, ἀρξάμενος ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς, διὰ παντὸς τοῦ κύτους. καὶ τὸ πᾶν δὴ σπέρμα διασῴζων οὕτως λιθοειδεῖ περιβόλῳ συνέφραξεν, ἐμποιῶν ἄρθρα, τῇ θατέρου προσχρώμενος ἐν αὐτοῖς ὡς μέσῃ ἐνισταμένῃ δυνάμει, κινήσεως καὶ κάμψεως ἕνεκα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","text":"τὴν δʼ αὖ τῆς ὀστεΐνης φύσεως ἕξιν ἡγησάμενος  τοῦ δέοντος κραυροτέραν εἶναι καὶ ἀκαμπτοτέραν, διάπυρόν τʼ αὖ γιγνομένην καὶ πάλιν ψυχομένην σφακελίσασαν ταχὺ διαφθερεῖν τὸ σπέρμα ἐντὸς αὑτῆς, διὰ ταῦτα οὕτω τὸ τῶν νεύρων καὶ τὸ τῆς σαρκὸς γένος ἐμηχανᾶτο, ἵνα τῷ μὲν πάντα τὰ μέλη συνδήσας ἐπιτεινομένῳ καὶ ἀνιεμένῳ περὶ τοὺς στρόφιγγας καμπτόμενον τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἐκτεινόμενον παρέχοι, τὴν δὲ σάρκα προβολὴν μὲν καυμάτων, πρόβλημα δὲ χειμώνων, ἔτι δὲ πτωμάτων οἷον τὰ πιλητὰ ἔσεσθαι κτήματα,  σώμασιν μαλακῶς καὶ πρᾴως ὑπείκουσαν, θερμὴν δὲ νοτίδα ἐντὸς ἑαυτῆς ἔχουσαν θέρους μὲν ἀνιδίουσαν καὶ νοτιζομένην ἔξωθεν ψῦχος κατὰ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα παρέξειν οἰκεῖον, διὰ χειμῶνος δὲ πάλιν αὖ τούτῳ τῷ πυρὶ τὸν προσφερόμενον ἔξωθεν καὶ περιιστάμενον πάγον ἀμυνεῖσθαι μετρίως.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","text":"ταῦτα ἡμῶν διανοηθεὶς ὁ κηροπλάστης, ὕδατι μὲν καὶ πυρὶ καὶ γῇ συμμείξας καὶ συναρμόσας, ἐξ ὀξέος καὶ ἁλμυροῦ συνθεὶς  ζύμωμα ὑπομείξας αὐτοῖς, σάρκα ἔγχυμον καὶ μαλακὴν συνέστησεν· τὴν δὲ τῶν νεύρων φύσιν ἐξ ὀστοῦ καὶ σαρκὸς ἀζύμου κράσεως μίαν ἐξ ἀμφοῖν μέσην δυνάμει συνεκεράσατο, ξανθῷ χρώματι προσχρώμενος. ὅθεν συντονωτέραν μὲν καὶ γλισχροτέραν σαρκῶν, μαλακωτέραν δὲ ὀστῶν ὑγροτέραν τε ἐκτήσατο δύναμιν νεῦρα· οἷς συμπεριλαβὼν ὁ θεὸς ὀστᾶ καὶ μυελόν, δήσας πρὸς ἄλληλα νεύροις, μετὰ ταῦτα σαρξὶν  πάντα αὐτὰ κατεσκίασεν ἄνωθεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","text":"ὅσα μὲν οὖν ἐμψυχότατα τῶν ὀστῶν ἦν, ὀλιγίσταις συνέφραττε σαρξίν, ἃ δʼ ἀψυχότατα ἐντός, πλείσταις καὶ πυκνοτάταις, καὶ δὴ κατὰ τὰς συμβολὰς τῶν ὀστῶν, ὅπῃ μήτινα ἀνάγκην ὁ λόγος ἀπέφαινεν δεῖν αὐτὰς εἶναι, βραχεῖαν σάρκα ἔφυσεν, ἵνα μήτε ἐμποδὼν ταῖς καμπαῖσιν οὖσαι δύσφορα τὰ σώματα ἀπεργάζοιντο, ἅτε δυσκίνητα γιγνόμενα, μήτʼ αὖ πολλαὶ καὶ πυκναὶ σφόδρα τε ἐν ἀλλήλαις ἐμπεπιλημέναι, διὰ στερεότητα ἀναισθησίαν ἐμποιοῦσαι, δυσμνημονευτότερα καὶ κωφότερα τὰ περὶ τὴν διάνοιαν ποιοῖεν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"5b6cdb8e2974ab390cda45b8ff6b2d02248ad1bdbf864f644f1106220ac080db","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225223912478Z_f55bdebb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 74","source_sha256":"5b6cdb8e2974ab390cda45b8ff6b2d02248ad1bdbf864f644f1106220ac080db","sha256":"105cf8e8abbac68a2dd0839c8d35ed29cf1cf557148217583d982ce0d31821fa","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:23.912636+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","text":"So, making use of this, he turned a bony sphere around the brain itself, leaving in it a narrow outlet; and, having fashioned vertebrae from it around the marrow both of the neck and of the spine, he stretched them out like pivots, beginning from the head, through the whole trunk. And thus, preserving all the seed, he enclosed it in a stony casing, making joints, and employing in them the power of the other as an intervening mean, for the sake of motion and flexion.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","text":"But judging the condition of the bony nature to be harder and more inflexible than was fitting, and that, when becoming incandescent and then again cooling, it would, by mortifying, quickly destroy the seed within itself, for these reasons he contrived the race of sinews and that of flesh in this manner: so that, by the former, binding together all the limbs and, being tightened and relaxed around the pivots, it might cause the body to bend and stretch; while by the flesh it might have a protection against heats, a defence against winters, and further, against falls, something like padded possessions, yielding softly and gently to bodies, and containing within itself a warm moisture which, in summer, by exuding and being moistened externally, would provide a fitting coolness throughout the whole body, and in winter, again, by means of this fire, would moderately ward off the frost that is brought from without and stands around it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","text":"Having devised these things concerning us, the wax-moulder, mixing and fitting together water, fire, and earth, and composing a dough from acid and salty things and mixing it with them, formed flesh, juicy and soft; and he blended the nature of sinews from a mixture of bone and unfermented flesh, one power from both, intermediate in potency, employing a yellow colour. Wherefore sinews acquired a power more tense and glutinous than flesh, but softer and moister than bones. Enclosing bones and marrow with these, the god bound them to one another by sinews, and thereafter shaded all of them above with flesh.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","text":"Now those bones which were most ensouled he enclosed with the fewest fleshes, but those which were least ensouled within with the most numerous and densest; and indeed at the junctions of the bones, wherever reason declared that there was no necessity for them to be, he caused a scanty flesh to grow, in order that they might neither, by obstructing the bendings, render the bodies difficult to manage, since they would become hard to move, nor, again, being many and dense and strongly packed into one another, produce insensibility through solidity and make the things concerning understanding more forgetful and more dull.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"098fee3a65df6e5b1aa3e628accf4532953b08591a1d44acffdce62e34d2b65a","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 74"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 74","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53","title":"Section 75","order":59,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_53","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ δὴ τό τε τῶν μηρῶν καὶ κνημῶν καὶ  τὸ περὶ τὴν τῶν ἰσχίων φύσιν τά τε περὶ τὰ τῶν βραχιόνων ὀστᾶ καὶ τὰ τῶν πήχεων, καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα ἡμῶν ἄναρθρα, ὅσα τε ἐντὸς ὀστᾶ διʼ ὀλιγότητα ψυχῆς ἐν μυελῷ κενά ἐστιν φρονήσεως, ταῦτα πάντα συμπεπλήρωται σαρξίν· ὅσα δὲ ἔμφρονα, ἧττον—εἰ μή πού τινα αὐτὴν καθʼ αὑτὴν αἰσθήσεων ἕνεκα σάρκα οὕτω συνέστησεν, οἷον τὸ τῆς γλώττης εἶδος— τὰ δὲ πλεῖστα ἐκείνως· ἡ γὰρ ἐξ ἀνάγκης γιγνομένη καὶ  συντρεφομένη φύσις οὐδαμῇ προσδέχεται πυκνὸν ὀστοῦν καὶ σάρκα πολλὴν ἅμα τε αὐτοῖς ὀξυήκοον αἴσθησιν. μάλιστα γὰρ ἂν αὐτὰ πάντων ἔσχεν ἡ περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν σύστασις, εἴπερ ἅμα συμπίπτειν ἠθελησάτην, καὶ τὸ τῶν ἀνθρώπων γένος σαρκώδη ἔχον ἐφʼ ἑαυτῷ καὶ νευρώδη κρατεράν τε κεφαλὴν βίον ἂν διπλοῦν καὶ πολλαπλοῦν καὶ ὑγιεινότερον καὶ ἀλυπότερον τοῦ νῦν κατεκτήσατο. νῦν δὲ τοῖς περὶ τὴν ἡμετέραν γένεσιν δημιουργοῖς, ἀναλογιζομένοις πότερον πολυχρονιώτερον  χεῖρον ἢ βραχυχρονιώτερον βέλτιον ἀπεργάσαιντο γένος, συνέδοξεν τοῦ πλείονος βίου, φαυλοτέρου δέ, τὸν ἐλάττονα ἀμείνονα ὄντα παντὶ πάντως αἱρετέον· ὅθεν δὴ μανῷ μὲν ὀστῷ, σαρξὶν δὲ καὶ νεύροις κεφαλήν, ἅτε οὐδὲ καμπὰς ἔχουσαν, οὐ συνεστέγασαν. κατὰ πάντα οὖν ταῦτα εὐαισθητοτέρα μὲν καὶ φρονιμωτέρα, πολὺ δὲ ἀσθενεστέρα παντὸς ἀνδρὸς προσετέθη κεφαλὴ σώματι. τὰ δὲ νεῦρα διὰ  ταῦτα καὶ οὕτως ὁ θεὸς ἐπʼ ἐσχάτην τὴν κεφαλὴν περιστήσας κύκλῳ περὶ τὸν τράχηλον ἐκόλλησεν ὁμοιότητι, καὶ τὰς σιαγόνας ἄκρας αὐτοῖς συνέδησεν ὑπὸ τὴν φύσιν τοῦ προσώπου· τὰ δʼ ἄλλα εἰς ἅπαντα τὰ μέλη διέσπειρε, συνάπτων ἄρθρον ἄρθρῳ. τὴν δὲ δὴ τοῦ στόματος ἡμῶν δύναμιν ὀδοῦσιν καὶ γλώττῃ καὶ χείλεσιν ἕνεκα τῶν ἀναγκαίων καὶ τῶν ἀρίστων διεκόσμησαν οἱ διακοσμοῦντες ᾗ νῦν  διατέτακται, τὴν μὲν εἴσοδον τῶν ἀναγκαίων μηχανώμενοι χάριν, τὴν δʼ ἔξοδον τῶν ἀρίστων· ἀναγκαῖον μὲν γὰρ πᾶν ὅσον εἰσέρχεται τροφὴν διδὸν τῷ σώματι, τὸ δὲ λόγων νᾶμα ἔξω ῥέον καὶ ὑπηρετοῦν φρονήσει κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον πάντων ναμάτων.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. διὸ δὴ τό τε τῶν μηρῶν καὶ κνημῶν καὶ  τὸ περὶ τὴν τῶν ἰσχίων φύσιν τά τε περὶ τὰ τῶν βραχιόνων ὀστᾶ καὶ τὰ τῶν πήχεων, καὶ ὅσα ἄλλα ἡμῶν ἄναρθρα, ὅσα τε ἐντὸς ὀστᾶ διʼ ὀλιγότητα ψυχῆς ἐν μυελῷ κενά ἐστιν φρονήσεως, ταῦτα πάντα συμπεπλήρωται σαρξίν· ὅσα δὲ ἔμφρονα, ἧττον—εἰ μή πού τινα αὐτὴν καθʼ αὑτὴν αἰσθήσεων ἕνεκα σάρκα οὕτω συνέστησεν, οἷον τὸ τῆς γλώττης εἶδος— τὰ δὲ πλεῖστα ἐκείνως· ἡ γὰρ ἐξ ἀνάγκης γιγνομένη καὶ  συντρεφομένη φύσις οὐδαμῇ προσδέχεται πυκνὸν ὀστοῦν καὶ σάρκα πολλὴν ἅμα τε αὐτοῖς ὀξυήκοον αἴσθησιν. μάλιστα γὰρ ἂν αὐτὰ πάντων ἔσχεν ἡ περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν σύστασις, εἴπερ ἅμα συμπίπτειν ἠθελησάτην, καὶ τὸ τῶν ἀνθρώπων γένος σαρκώδη ἔχον ἐφʼ ἑαυτῷ καὶ νευρώδη κρατεράν τε κεφαλὴν βίον ἂν διπλοῦν καὶ πολλαπλοῦν καὶ ὑγιεινότερον καὶ ἀλυπότερον τοῦ νῦν κατεκτήσατο.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","text":"νῦν δὲ τοῖς περὶ τὴν ἡμετέραν γένεσιν δημιουργοῖς, ἀναλογιζομένοις πότερον πολυχρονιώτερον  χεῖρον ἢ βραχυχρονιώτερον βέλτιον ἀπεργάσαιντο γένος, συνέδοξεν τοῦ πλείονος βίου, φαυλοτέρου δέ, τὸν ἐλάττονα ἀμείνονα ὄντα παντὶ πάντως αἱρετέον· ὅθεν δὴ μανῷ μὲν ὀστῷ, σαρξὶν δὲ καὶ νεύροις κεφαλήν, ἅτε οὐδὲ καμπὰς ἔχουσαν, οὐ συνεστέγασαν. κατὰ πάντα οὖν ταῦτα εὐαισθητοτέρα μὲν καὶ φρονιμωτέρα, πολὺ δὲ ἀσθενεστέρα παντὸς ἀνδρὸς προσετέθη κεφαλὴ σώματι. τὰ δὲ νεῦρα διὰ  ταῦτα καὶ οὕτως ὁ θεὸς ἐπʼ ἐσχάτην τὴν κεφαλὴν περιστήσας κύκλῳ περὶ τὸν τράχηλον ἐκόλλησεν ὁμοιότητι, καὶ τὰς σιαγόνας ἄκρας αὐτοῖς συνέδησεν ὑπὸ τὴν φύσιν τοῦ προσώπου· τὰ δʼ ἄλλα εἰς ἅπαντα τὰ μέλη διέσπειρε, συνάπτων ἄρθρον ἄρθρῳ.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","text":"τὴν δὲ δὴ τοῦ στόματος ἡμῶν δύναμιν ὀδοῦσιν καὶ γλώττῃ καὶ χείλεσιν ἕνεκα τῶν ἀναγκαίων καὶ τῶν ἀρίστων διεκόσμησαν οἱ διακοσμοῦντες ᾗ νῦν  διατέτακται, τὴν μὲν εἴσοδον τῶν ἀναγκαίων μηχανώμενοι χάριν, τὴν δʼ ἔξοδον τῶν ἀρίστων· ἀναγκαῖον μὲν γὰρ πᾶν ὅσον εἰσέρχεται τροφὴν διδὸν τῷ σώματι, τὸ δὲ λόγων νᾶμα ἔξω ῥέον καὶ ὑπηρετοῦν φρονήσει κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον πάντων ναμάτων.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"918d6f75c5af94694a0d7216ea038e46ae6a0aee23f3ed97e2f495ea0b66f79e","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225230748772Z_dfa46886","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 75","source_sha256":"918d6f75c5af94694a0d7216ea038e46ae6a0aee23f3ed97e2f495ea0b66f79e","sha256":"cc26c7e53b244148a7fb6447e86d997ebfe2ee01689bc948cd6f19b8a695b1e5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:30.748927+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","text":"Therefore the regions of the thighs and shins, and that about the nature of the hips, and those about the bones of the upper arms and forearms, and whatever other parts of us are without joints, as well as whatever bones within, through paucity of soul, are empty of intelligence in their marrow—all these are filled with flesh. But those which are intelligent are less so—unless perhaps it has somewhere constituted flesh itself by itself in this way for the sake of sensations, such as the form of the tongue—while most are so in the former way. For the nature that comes to be and is nourished by necessity nowhere admits dense bone and much flesh together with acute sensation in them. For most of all the structure about the head would have possessed all these things, if indeed they had been willing to coincide; and the race of human beings, having upon itself a fleshy and sinewy and strong head, would have acquired a life double and manifold, healthier and more painless than the present one.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","text":"But now, to the artificers concerned with our generation, as they reckoned whether they should fashion a longer-lived but inferior race or a shorter-lived but better one, it seemed that the lesser life, being better, was in every way to be chosen by everyone over the greater, inferior one. Wherefore they did not enclose the head, which has no bendings, with dense bone and flesh and sinews. Accordingly, in all these respects a head more perceptive and more intelligent, but much weaker than that of every man, was added to the body. For these reasons and in this manner, having set the sinews around the head at its extremity, the god fastened them in a circle about the neck by likeness, and bound the extremities of the jaws together with them beneath the nature of the face; the rest he dispersed through all the limbs, joining joint to joint.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","text":"And the power of our mouth they who ordered it arranged, as it is now disposed, by means of teeth and tongue and lips, for the sake of necessities and of the best things: contriving its entrance for the sake of necessities, and its exit for that of the best things. For everything that enters, supplying nourishment to the body, is necessary; but the stream of words flowing outward and serving intelligence is the fairest and best of all streams.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"a2e5cade1e60f1b3b080247dbd956a6b064db76a7d60a4262a0150878dff79b1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 75"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 75","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54","title":"Section 76","order":60,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_54","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν δʼ αὖ κεφαλὴν οὔτε μόνον ὀστεΐνην ψιλὴν δυνατὸν ἐᾶν ἦν διὰ τὴν ἐν ταῖς ὥραις ἐφʼ ἑκάτερον ὑπερβολήν, οὔτʼ αὖ συσκιασθεῖσαν κωφὴν καὶ ἀναίσθητον διὰ τὸν τῶν σαρκῶν ὄχλον περιιδεῖν γιγνομένην· τῆς δὴ  σαρκοειδοῦς φύσεως οὐ καταξηραινομένης λέμμα μεῖζον περιγιγνόμενον ἐχωρίζετο, δέρμα τὸ νῦν λεγόμενον. τοῦτο δὲ διὰ τὴν περὶ τὸν ἐγκέφαλον νοτίδα συνιὸν αὐτὸ πρὸς αὑτὸ καὶ βλαστάνον κύκλῳ περιημφιέννυεν τὴν κεφαλήν· ἡ δὲ νοτὶς ὑπὸ τὰς ῥαφὰς ἀνιοῦσα ἦρδε καὶ συνέκλεισεν αὐτὸ ἐπὶ τὴν κορυφήν, οἷον ἅμμα συναγαγοῦσα, τὸ δὲ τῶν ῥαφῶν παντοδαπὸν εἶδος γέγονε διὰ τὴν τῶν περιόδων δύναμιν καὶ τῆς τροφῆς, μᾶλλον μὲν ἀλλήλοις μαχομένων τούτων πλείους,  ἧττον δὲ ἐλάττους. τοῦτο δὴ πᾶν τὸ δέρμα κύκλῳ κατεκέντει πυρὶ τὸ θεῖον, τρηθέντος δὲ καὶ τῆς ἰκμάδος ἔξω διʼ αὐτοῦ φερομένης τὸ μὲν ὑγρὸν καὶ θερμὸν ὅσον εἰλικρινὲς ἀπῄειν, τὸ δὲ μεικτὸν ἐξ ὧν καὶ τὸ δέρμα ἦν, αἰρόμενον μὲν ὑπὸ τῆς φορᾶς ἔξω μακρὸν ἐτείνετο, λεπτότητα ἴσην ἔχον τῷ κατακεντήματι, διὰ δὲ βραδυτῆτα ἀπωθούμενον ὑπὸ τοῦ περιεστῶτος ἔξωθεν πνεύματος πάλιν ἐντὸς ὑπὸ τὸ δέρμα  εἱλλόμενον κατερριζοῦτο· καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ τὰ πάθη τὸ τριχῶν γένος ἐν τῷ δέρματι πέφυκεν, συγγενὲς μὲν ἱμαντῶδες ὂν αὐτοῦ, σκληρότερον δὲ καὶ πυκνότερον τῇ πιλήσει τῆς ψύξεως, ἣν ἀποχωριζομένη δέρματος ἑκάστη θρὶξ ψυχθεῖσα συνεπιλήθη. τούτῳ δὴ λασίαν ἡμῶν ἀπηργάσατο τὴν κεφαλὴν ὁ ποιῶν, χρώμενος μὲν αἰτίοις τοῖς εἰρημένοις, διανοούμενος δὲ ἀντὶ σαρκὸς αὐτὸ δεῖν εἶναι στέγασμα τῆς  περὶ τὸν ἐγκέφαλον ἕνεκα ἀσφαλείας κοῦφον καὶ θέρους χειμῶνός τε ἱκανὸν σκιὰν καὶ σκέπην παρέχειν, εὐαισθησίας δὲ οὐδὲν διακώλυμα ἐμποδὼν γενησόμενον. τὸ δʼ ἐν τῇ περὶ τοὺς δακτύλους καταπλοκῇ τοῦ νεύρου καὶ τοῦ δέρματος ὀστοῦ τε, συμμειχθὲν ἐκ τριῶν, ἀποξηρανθὲν ἓν κοινὸν συμπάντων σκληρὸν γέγονεν δέρμα, τοῖς μὲν συναιτίοις τούτοις δημιουργηθέν, τῇ δὲ αἰτιωτάτῃ διανοίᾳ τῶν ἔπειτα ἐσομένων ἕνεκα εἰργασμένον. ὡς γάρ ποτε ἐξ ἀνδρῶν γυναῖκες καὶ τἆλλα  θηρία γενήσοιντο, ἠπίσταντο οἱ συνιστάντες ἡμᾶς, καὶ δὴ καὶ τῆς τῶν ὀνύχων χρείας ὅτι πολλὰ τῶν θρεμμάτων καὶ ἐπὶ πολλὰ δεήσοιτο ᾔδεσαν, ὅθεν ἐν ἀνθρώποις εὐθὺς γιγνομένοις ὑπετυπώσαντο τὴν τῶν ὀνύχων γένεσιν. τούτῳ δὴ τῷ λόγῳ καὶ ταῖς προφάσεσιν ταύταις δέρμα τρίχας ὄνυχάς τε ἐπʼ ἄκροις τοῖς κώλοις ἔφυσαν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὴν δʼ αὖ κεφαλὴν οὔτε μόνον ὀστεΐνην ψιλὴν δυνατὸν ἐᾶν ἦν διὰ τὴν ἐν ταῖς ὥραις ἐφʼ ἑκάτερον ὑπερβολήν, οὔτʼ αὖ συσκιασθεῖσαν κωφὴν καὶ ἀναίσθητον διὰ τὸν τῶν σαρκῶν ὄχλον περιιδεῖν γιγνομένην· τῆς δὴ  σαρκοειδοῦς φύσεως οὐ καταξηραινομένης λέμμα μεῖζον περιγιγνόμενον ἐχωρίζετο, δέρμα τὸ νῦν λεγόμενον. τοῦτο δὲ διὰ τὴν περὶ τὸν ἐγκέφαλον νοτίδα συνιὸν αὐτὸ πρὸς αὑτὸ καὶ βλαστάνον κύκλῳ περιημφιέννυεν τὴν κεφαλήν· ἡ δὲ νοτὶς ὑπὸ τὰς ῥαφὰς ἀνιοῦσα ἦρδε καὶ συνέκλεισεν αὐτὸ ἐπὶ τὴν κορυφήν, οἷον ἅμμα συναγαγοῦσα, τὸ δὲ τῶν ῥαφῶν παντοδαπὸν εἶδος γέγονε διὰ τὴν τῶν περιόδων δύναμιν καὶ τῆς τροφῆς, μᾶλλον μὲν ἀλλήλοις μαχομένων τούτων πλείους,  ἧττον δὲ ἐλάττους.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","text":"τοῦτο δὴ πᾶν τὸ δέρμα κύκλῳ κατεκέντει πυρὶ τὸ θεῖον, τρηθέντος δὲ καὶ τῆς ἰκμάδος ἔξω διʼ αὐτοῦ φερομένης τὸ μὲν ὑγρὸν καὶ θερμὸν ὅσον εἰλικρινὲς ἀπῄειν, τὸ δὲ μεικτὸν ἐξ ὧν καὶ τὸ δέρμα ἦν, αἰρόμενον μὲν ὑπὸ τῆς φορᾶς ἔξω μακρὸν ἐτείνετο, λεπτότητα ἴσην ἔχον τῷ κατακεντήματι, διὰ δὲ βραδυτῆτα ἀπωθούμενον ὑπὸ τοῦ περιεστῶτος ἔξωθεν πνεύματος πάλιν ἐντὸς ὑπὸ τὸ δέρμα  εἱλλόμενον κατερριζοῦτο· καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ τὰ πάθη τὸ τριχῶν γένος ἐν τῷ δέρματι πέφυκεν, συγγενὲς μὲν ἱμαντῶδες ὂν αὐτοῦ, σκληρότερον δὲ καὶ πυκνότερον τῇ πιλήσει τῆς ψύξεως, ἣν ἀποχωριζομένη δέρματος ἑκάστη θρὶξ ψυχθεῖσα συνεπιλήθη.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","text":"τούτῳ δὴ λασίαν ἡμῶν ἀπηργάσατο τὴν κεφαλὴν ὁ ποιῶν, χρώμενος μὲν αἰτίοις τοῖς εἰρημένοις, διανοούμενος δὲ ἀντὶ σαρκὸς αὐτὸ δεῖν εἶναι στέγασμα τῆς  περὶ τὸν ἐγκέφαλον ἕνεκα ἀσφαλείας κοῦφον καὶ θέρους χειμῶνός τε ἱκανὸν σκιὰν καὶ σκέπην παρέχειν, εὐαισθησίας δὲ οὐδὲν διακώλυμα ἐμποδὼν γενησόμενον. τὸ δʼ ἐν τῇ περὶ τοὺς δακτύλους καταπλοκῇ τοῦ νεύρου καὶ τοῦ δέρματος ὀστοῦ τε, συμμειχθὲν ἐκ τριῶν, ἀποξηρανθὲν ἓν κοινὸν συμπάντων σκληρὸν γέγονεν δέρμα, τοῖς μὲν συναιτίοις τούτοις δημιουργηθέν, τῇ δὲ αἰτιωτάτῃ διανοίᾳ τῶν ἔπειτα ἐσομένων ἕνεκα εἰργασμένον. ὡς γάρ ποτε ἐξ ἀνδρῶν γυναῖκες καὶ τἆλλα  θηρία γενήσοιντο, ἠπίσταντο οἱ συνιστάντες ἡμᾶς, καὶ δὴ καὶ τῆς τῶν ὀνύχων χρείας ὅτι πολλὰ τῶν θρεμμάτων καὶ ἐπὶ πολλὰ δεήσοιτο ᾔδεσαν, ὅθεν ἐν ἀνθρώποις εὐθὺς γιγνομένοις ὑπετυπώσαντο τὴν τῶν ὀνύχων γένεσιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","text":"τούτῳ δὴ τῷ λόγῳ καὶ ταῖς προφάσεσιν ταύταις δέρμα τρίχας ὄνυχάς τε ἐπʼ ἄκροις τοῖς κώλοις ἔφυσαν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"1c753e01bc815172ee9ab085cebe2f77ab5c18a00d4b5ae9fd83191c2800aae2","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225243550396Z_d6a04aa5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 76","source_sha256":"1c753e01bc815172ee9ab085cebe2f77ab5c18a00d4b5ae9fd83191c2800aae2","sha256":"c10495e4908f7fdc38f99e9424b995d483f7043ad79728d899df7e1dd8dca6d3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:43.550432+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","text":"But it was not possible to leave the head merely bare and bony, because of the excess in either direction of the seasons; nor again to allow it, shaded over, to become dull and insensible because of the mass of flesh. Accordingly, from the flesh-like nature, when it was not wholly dried out, a larger remnant was separated off—the thing now called skin. And this, owing to the moisture around the brain, coming together with itself and growing, clothed the head all around; and the moisture, rising beneath the sutures, watered it and closed it together upon the crown, having gathered it like a knot. The manifold character of the sutures came about through the power of the revolutions and of the nourishment: when these contend more with one another, they are more numerous; when less, fewer.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","text":"Then the divine being pricked all this skin round about with fire; and, when it had been pierced and the moisture was carried outward through it, whatever was purely wet and hot passed away, while that which was mixed, from which the skin too consisted, being drawn outward by the motion, was extended to a great length, having a fineness equal to that of the puncture; but, owing to its slowness, being thrust back by the surrounding breath from outside, it was coiled again inward beneath the skin and took root. And in consequence of these affections the race of hairs has grown in the skin, being akin to it and cord-like, but harder and denser through the felting of cooling, by which each hair, separated from the skin and cooled, was compacted together.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","text":"By this means the maker rendered our head hairy, employing the causes mentioned, but intending that, instead of flesh, it should be a light covering for the sake of the safety of the region around the brain, sufficient to provide shade and shelter in summer and winter, and not to become any hindrance to sensation. And that which, in the interweaving around the fingers, of sinew and skin and bone, being mixed from three things and dried out, became one common hard skin of them all, was fashioned by these as contributing causes, but wrought by the most sovereign intelligence for the sake of things that were thereafter to be. For those who constituted us knew that from men women and the other animals would one day come to be, and they knew also that many of the living creatures would have need of the use of nails for many purposes; whence, in human beings as they were immediately coming into being, they sketched out beforehand the generation of nails.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","text":"For this reason, then, and from these causes, they caused skin, hairs, and nails to grow upon the extremities of the limbs.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"bb887d5b15f97d01aef4bffd5f4c559a62a30a58685f58c54ffb0cd443b1dff1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 76"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 76","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55","title":"Section 77","order":61,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_55","text":"ΤΙ.  ἐπειδὴ δὲ πάντʼ ἦν τὰ τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου συμπεφυκότα  μέρη καὶ μέλη, τὴν δὲ ζωὴν ἐν πυρὶ καὶ πνεύματι συνέβαινεν ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἔχειν αὐτῷ, καὶ διὰ ταῦτα ὑπὸ τούτων τηκόμενον κενούμενόν τʼ ἔφθινεν, βοήθειαν αὐτῷ θεοὶ μηχανῶνται. τῆς γὰρ ἀνθρωπίνης συγγενῆ φύσεως φύσιν ἄλλαις ἰδέαις καὶ αἰσθήσεσιν κεραννύντες, ὥσθʼ ἕτερον ζῷον εἶναι, φυτεύουσιν· ἃ δὴ νῦν ἥμερα δένδρα καὶ φυτὰ καὶ σπέρματα παιδευθέντα ὑπὸ γεωργίας τιθασῶς πρὸς ἡμᾶς ἔσχεν, πρὶν δὲ ἦν μόνα τὰ  τῶν ἀγρίων γένη, πρεσβύτερα τῶν ἡμέρων ὄντα. πᾶν γὰρ οὖν ὅτιπερ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν, ζῷον μὲν ἂν ἐν δίκῃ λέγοιτο ὀρθότατα· μετέχει γε μὴν τοῦτο ὃ νῦν λέγομεν τοῦ τρίτου ψυχῆς εἴδους, ὃ μεταξὺ φρενῶν ὀμφαλοῦ τε ἱδρῦσθαι λόγος, ᾧ δόξης μὲν λογισμοῦ τε καὶ νοῦ μέτεστιν τὸ μηδέν, αἰσθήσεως δὲ ἡδείας καὶ ἀλγεινῆς μετὰ ἐπιθυμιῶν. πάσχον γὰρ διατελεῖ πάντα, στραφέντι δʼ αὐτῷ ἐν ἑαυτῷ περὶ ἑαυτό, τὴν  μὲν ἔξωθεν ἀπωσαμένῳ κίνησιν, τῇ δʼ οἰκείᾳ χρησαμένῳ, τῶν αὑτοῦ τι λογίσασθαι κατιδόντι φύσει οὐ παραδέδωκεν ἡ γένεσις. διὸ δὴ ζῇ μὲν ἔστιν τε οὐχ ἕτερον ζῴου, μόνιμον δὲ καὶ κατερριζωμένον πέπηγεν διὰ τὸ τῆς ὑφʼ ἑαυτοῦ κινήσεως ἐστερῆσθαι. ταῦτα δὴ τὰ γένη πάντα φυτεύσαντες οἱ κρείττους τοῖς ἥττοσιν ἡμῖν τροφήν, τὸ σῶμα αὐτὸ ἡμῶν διωχέτευσαν τέμνοντες οἷον ἐν κήποις ὀχετούς, ἵνα ὥσπερ ἐκ νάματος ἐπιόντος ἄρδοιτο. καὶ πρῶτον μὲν ὀχετοὺς κρυφαίους ὑπὸ  τὴν σύμφυσιν τοῦ δέρματος καὶ τῆς σαρκὸς δύο φλέβας ἔτεμον νωτιαίας, δίδυμον ὡς τὸ σῶμα ἐτύγχανεν δεξιοῖς τε καὶ ἀριστεροῖς ὄν· ταύτας δὲ καθῆκαν παρὰ τὴν ῥάχιν, καὶ τὸν γόνιμον μεταξὺ λαβόντες μυελόν, ἵνα οὗτός τε ὅτι μάλιστα θάλλοι, καὶ ἐπὶ τἆλλα εὔρους ἐντεῦθεν ἅτε ἐπὶ κάταντες ἡ ἐπίχυσις γιγνομένη παρέχοι τὴν ὑδρείαν ὁμαλήν. μετὰ δὲ ταῦτα σχίσαντες περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν τὰς φλέβας καὶ διʼ  ἀλλήλων ἐναντίας πλέξαντες διεῖσαν, τὰς μὲν ἐκ τῶν δεξιῶν ἐπὶ τἀριστερὰ τοῦ σώματος, τὰς δʼ ἐκ τῶν ἀριστερῶν ἐπὶ τὰ δεξιὰ κλίναντες, ὅπως δεσμὸς ἅμα τῇ κεφαλῇ πρὸς τὸ σῶμα εἴη μετὰ τοῦ δέρματος, ἐπειδὴ νεύροις οὐκ ἦν κύκλῳ κατὰ κορυφὴν περιειλημμένη, καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν αἰσθήσεων πάθος ἵνʼ ἀφʼ ἑκατέρων τῶν μερῶν εἰς ἅπαν τὸ σῶμα εἴη διάδηλον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","text":"ΤΙ.  ἐπειδὴ δὲ πάντʼ ἦν τὰ τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου συμπεφυκότα  μέρη καὶ μέλη, τὴν δὲ ζωὴν ἐν πυρὶ καὶ πνεύματι συνέβαινεν ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἔχειν αὐτῷ, καὶ διὰ ταῦτα ὑπὸ τούτων τηκόμενον κενούμενόν τʼ ἔφθινεν, βοήθειαν αὐτῷ θεοὶ μηχανῶνται. τῆς γὰρ ἀνθρωπίνης συγγενῆ φύσεως φύσιν ἄλλαις ἰδέαις καὶ αἰσθήσεσιν κεραννύντες, ὥσθʼ ἕτερον ζῷον εἶναι, φυτεύουσιν· ἃ δὴ νῦν ἥμερα δένδρα καὶ φυτὰ καὶ σπέρματα παιδευθέντα ὑπὸ γεωργίας τιθασῶς πρὸς ἡμᾶς ἔσχεν, πρὶν δὲ ἦν μόνα τὰ  τῶν ἀγρίων γένη, πρεσβύτερα τῶν ἡμέρων ὄντα. πᾶν γὰρ οὖν ὅτιπερ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν, ζῷον μὲν ἂν ἐν δίκῃ λέγοιτο ὀρθότατα· μετέχει γε μὴν τοῦτο ὃ νῦν λέγομεν τοῦ τρίτου ψυχῆς εἴδους, ὃ μεταξὺ φρενῶν ὀμφαλοῦ τε ἱδρῦσθαι λόγος, ᾧ δόξης μὲν λογισμοῦ τε καὶ νοῦ μέτεστιν τὸ μηδέν, αἰσθήσεως δὲ ἡδείας καὶ ἀλγεινῆς μετὰ ἐπιθυμιῶν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","text":"πάσχον γὰρ διατελεῖ πάντα, στραφέντι δʼ αὐτῷ ἐν ἑαυτῷ περὶ ἑαυτό, τὴν  μὲν ἔξωθεν ἀπωσαμένῳ κίνησιν, τῇ δʼ οἰκείᾳ χρησαμένῳ, τῶν αὑτοῦ τι λογίσασθαι κατιδόντι φύσει οὐ παραδέδωκεν ἡ γένεσις. διὸ δὴ ζῇ μὲν ἔστιν τε οὐχ ἕτερον ζῴου, μόνιμον δὲ καὶ κατερριζωμένον πέπηγεν διὰ τὸ τῆς ὑφʼ ἑαυτοῦ κινήσεως ἐστερῆσθαι. ταῦτα δὴ τὰ γένη πάντα φυτεύσαντες οἱ κρείττους τοῖς ἥττοσιν ἡμῖν τροφήν, τὸ σῶμα αὐτὸ ἡμῶν διωχέτευσαν τέμνοντες οἷον ἐν κήποις ὀχετούς, ἵνα ὥσπερ ἐκ νάματος ἐπιόντος ἄρδοιτο. καὶ πρῶτον μὲν ὀχετοὺς κρυφαίους ὑπὸ  τὴν σύμφυσιν τοῦ δέρματος καὶ τῆς σαρκὸς δύο φλέβας ἔτεμον νωτιαίας, δίδυμον ὡς τὸ σῶμα ἐτύγχανεν δεξιοῖς τε καὶ ἀριστεροῖς ὄν· ταύτας δὲ καθῆκαν παρὰ τὴν ῥάχιν, καὶ τὸν γόνιμον μεταξὺ λαβόντες μυελόν, ἵνα οὗτός τε ὅτι μάλιστα θάλλοι, καὶ ἐπὶ τἆλλα εὔρους ἐντεῦθεν ἅτε ἐπὶ κάταντες ἡ ἐπίχυσις γιγνομένη παρέχοι τὴν ὑδρείαν ὁμαλήν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","text":"μετὰ δὲ ταῦτα σχίσαντες περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν τὰς φλέβας καὶ διʼ  ἀλλήλων ἐναντίας πλέξαντες διεῖσαν, τὰς μὲν ἐκ τῶν δεξιῶν ἐπὶ τἀριστερὰ τοῦ σώματος, τὰς δʼ ἐκ τῶν ἀριστερῶν ἐπὶ τὰ δεξιὰ κλίναντες, ὅπως δεσμὸς ἅμα τῇ κεφαλῇ πρὸς τὸ σῶμα εἴη μετὰ τοῦ δέρματος, ἐπειδὴ νεύροις οὐκ ἦν κύκλῳ κατὰ κορυφὴν περιειλημμένη, καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῶν αἰσθήσεων πάθος ἵνʼ ἀφʼ ἑκατέρων τῶν μερῶν εἰς ἅπαν τὸ σῶμα εἴη διάδηλον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"29f243a047ba6ed05016ea1c278820ec6b60fc2272a079b072ad02eac13d4b21","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225251451963Z_b761614d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 77","source_sha256":"29f243a047ba6ed05016ea1c278820ec6b60fc2272a079b072ad02eac13d4b21","sha256":"1ffcde0303b1d3c3336d1108af9addfa071b79be8443a3470d303d054d3fcd40","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:52:51.452100+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","text":"TI. Now when all the parts and members belonging to the mortal living creature had grown together, and it was necessarily the case that it had its life in fire and air, and that for these reasons, being melted away and emptied by these, it was perishing, the gods devise assistance for it. For, blending a nature kindred to the human nature with other forms and sensations, so as to make another living creature, they plant them—those which now, tamed by agriculture, we have as cultivated trees and plants and seeds, amenably disposed toward us; but before, there were only the kinds of wild things, being older than the cultivated. For everything whatsoever that partakes of life might most correctly be called, in justice, a living creature; and this thing of which we now speak partakes of the third kind of soul, which, it is said, is established between the midriff and the navel, and which has no share at all in opinion, reasoning, and intellect, but in pleasant and painful sensation accompanied by desires.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","text":"For it continues throughout to be affected; and generation did not grant it, when it had turned upon itself within itself, thrusting away the motion from without and employing its own, to calculate or apprehend anything of its own nature. Wherefore it lives and is not other than a living creature, but, because it is deprived of motion by itself, it stands fixed, stationary and rooted. Having planted all these kinds, the better beings, as food for us inferior beings, channelled our very body, cutting, as it were in gardens, conduits, in order that it might be watered as by an incoming stream from a spring. First, beneath the conjunction of skin and flesh, they cut two hidden conduits, the dorsal veins, twin, as the body happened to be right and left; and they led these down beside the spine, taking between them the generative marrow, in order that this might flourish as much as possible, and that the pouring from there, as down a slope, might provide an even irrigation upon the rest.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","text":"After this, having split the veins around the head and interwoven them with one another in opposite directions, they passed them through, bending those from the right toward the left parts of the body and those from the left toward the right, so that, together with the skin, there might be a bond from the head to the body, since it was not enclosed all around at the crown by sinews; and also so that the affection of the senses from both parts might be manifest throughout the whole body.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"56521925f8c25d6caed918d1b0635a5d0d7759d851767a3d7336d57401f0aa8b","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 77"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 77","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56","title":"Section 78","order":62,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_56","text":"ΤΙ. τὸ δʼ ἐντεῦθεν ἤδη τὴν ὑδραγωγίαν παρεσκεύασαν τρόπῳ τινὶ  τοιῷδε, ὃν κατοψόμεθα ῥᾷον προδιομολογησάμενοι τὸ τοιόνδε, ὅτι πάντα ὅσα ἐξ ἐλαττόνων συνίσταται στέγει τὰ μείζω, τὰ δὲ ἐκ μειζόνων τὰ σμικρότερα οὐ δύναται, πῦρ δὲ πάντων γενῶν σμικρομερέστατον, ὅθεν διʼ ὕδατος καὶ γῆς ἀέρος τε καὶ ὅσα ἐκ τούτων συνίσταται διαχωρεῖ καὶ στέγειν οὐδὲν αὐτὸ δύναται. ταὐτὸν δὴ καὶ περὶ τῆς παρʼ ἡμῖν κοιλίας διανοητέον, ὅτι σιτία μὲν καὶ ποτὰ ὅταν εἰς αὐτὴν ἐμπέσῃ,  στέγει, πνεῦμα δὲ καὶ πῦρ σμικρομερέστερα ὄντα τῆς αὑτῆς συστάσεως οὐ δύναται. τούτοις οὖν κατεχρήσατο ὁ θεὸς εἰς τὴν ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας ἐπὶ τὰς φλέβας ὑδρείαν, πλέγμα ἐξ ἀέρος καὶ πυρὸς οἷον οἱ κύρτοι συνυφηνάμενος, διπλᾶ κατὰ τὴν εἴσοδον ἐγκύρτια ἔχον, ὧν θάτερον αὖ πάλιν διέπλεξεν δίκρουν· καὶ ἀπὸ τῶν ἐγκυρτίων δὴ διετείνατο οἷον σχοίνους κύκλῳ διὰ παντὸς πρὸς τὰ ἔσχατα τοῦ πλέγματος. τὰ μὲν  οὖν ἔνδον ἐκ πυρὸς συνεστήσατο τοῦ πλοκάνου ἅπαντα, τὰ δʼ ἐγκύρτια καὶ τὸ κύτος ἀεροειδῆ, καὶ λαβὼν αὐτὸ περιέστησεν τῷ πλασθέντι ζῴῳ τρόπον τοιόνδε. τὸ μὲν τῶν ἐγκυρτίων εἰς τὸ στόμα μεθῆκεν· διπλοῦ δὲ ὄντος αὐτοῦ κατὰ μὲν τὰς ἀρτηρίας εἰς τὸν πλεύμονα καθῆκεν θάτερον, τὸ δʼ εἰς τὴν κοιλίαν παρὰ τὰς ἀρτηρίας· τὸ δʼ ἕτερον σχίσας τὸ μέρος ἑκάτερον κατὰ τοὺς ὀχετοὺς τῆς ῥινὸς ἀφῆκεν κοινόν, ὥσθʼ ὅτε μὴ κατὰ στόμα ἴοι θάτερον, ἐκ τούτου πάντα καὶ τὰ  ἐκείνου ῥεύματα ἀναπληροῦσθαι. τὸ δὲ ἄλλο κύτος τοῦ κύρτου περὶ τὸ σῶμα ὅσον κοῖλον ἡμῶν περιέφυσεν, καὶ πᾶν δὴ τοῦτο τοτὲ μὲν εἰς τὰ ἐγκύρτια συρρεῖν μαλακῶς, ἅτε ἀέρα ὄντα, ἐποίησεν, τοτὲ δὲ ἀναρρεῖν μὲν τὰ ἐγκύρτια, τὸ δὲ πλέγμα, ὡς ὄντος τοῦ σώματος μανοῦ, δύεσθαι εἴσω διʼ αὐτοῦ καὶ πάλιν ἔξω, τὰς δὲ ἐντὸς τοῦ πυρὸς ἀκτῖνας διαδεδεμένας ἀκολουθεῖν ἐφʼ ἑκάτερα ἰόντος τοῦ ἀέρος, καὶ τοῦτο,  ἕωσπερ ἂν τὸ θνητὸν συνεστήκῃ ζῷον, μὴ διαπαύεσθαι γιγνόμενον· τούτῳ δὲ δὴ τῷ γένει τὸν τὰς ἐπωνυμίας θέμενον ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ἐκπνοὴν λέγομεν θέσθαι τοὔνομα. πᾶν δὲ δὴ τό τʼ ἔργον καὶ τὸ πάθος τοῦθʼ ἡμῶν τῷ σώματι γέγονεν ἀρδομένῳ καὶ ἀναψυχομένῳ τρέφεσθαι καὶ ζῆν·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὸ δʼ ἐντεῦθεν ἤδη τὴν ὑδραγωγίαν παρεσκεύασαν τρόπῳ τινὶ  τοιῷδε, ὃν κατοψόμεθα ῥᾷον προδιομολογησάμενοι τὸ τοιόνδε, ὅτι πάντα ὅσα ἐξ ἐλαττόνων συνίσταται στέγει τὰ μείζω, τὰ δὲ ἐκ μειζόνων τὰ σμικρότερα οὐ δύναται, πῦρ δὲ πάντων γενῶν σμικρομερέστατον, ὅθεν διʼ ὕδατος καὶ γῆς ἀέρος τε καὶ ὅσα ἐκ τούτων συνίσταται διαχωρεῖ καὶ στέγειν οὐδὲν αὐτὸ δύναται. ταὐτὸν δὴ καὶ περὶ τῆς παρʼ ἡμῖν κοιλίας διανοητέον, ὅτι σιτία μὲν καὶ ποτὰ ὅταν εἰς αὐτὴν ἐμπέσῃ,  στέγει, πνεῦμα δὲ καὶ πῦρ σμικρομερέστερα ὄντα τῆς αὑτῆς συστάσεως οὐ δύναται. τούτοις οὖν κατεχρήσατο ὁ θεὸς εἰς τὴν ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας ἐπὶ τὰς φλέβας ὑδρείαν, πλέγμα ἐξ ἀέρος καὶ πυρὸς οἷον οἱ κύρτοι συνυφηνάμενος, διπλᾶ κατὰ τὴν εἴσοδον ἐγκύρτια ἔχον, ὧν θάτερον αὖ πάλιν διέπλεξεν δίκρουν· καὶ ἀπὸ τῶν ἐγκυρτίων δὴ διετείνατο οἷον σχοίνους κύκλῳ διὰ παντὸς πρὸς τὰ ἔσχατα τοῦ πλέγματος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","text":"τὰ μὲν  οὖν ἔνδον ἐκ πυρὸς συνεστήσατο τοῦ πλοκάνου ἅπαντα, τὰ δʼ ἐγκύρτια καὶ τὸ κύτος ἀεροειδῆ, καὶ λαβὼν αὐτὸ περιέστησεν τῷ πλασθέντι ζῴῳ τρόπον τοιόνδε. τὸ μὲν τῶν ἐγκυρτίων εἰς τὸ στόμα μεθῆκεν· διπλοῦ δὲ ὄντος αὐτοῦ κατὰ μὲν τὰς ἀρτηρίας εἰς τὸν πλεύμονα καθῆκεν θάτερον, τὸ δʼ εἰς τὴν κοιλίαν παρὰ τὰς ἀρτηρίας· τὸ δʼ ἕτερον σχίσας τὸ μέρος ἑκάτερον κατὰ τοὺς ὀχετοὺς τῆς ῥινὸς ἀφῆκεν κοινόν, ὥσθʼ ὅτε μὴ κατὰ στόμα ἴοι θάτερον, ἐκ τούτου πάντα καὶ τὰ  ἐκείνου ῥεύματα ἀναπληροῦσθαι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","text":"τὸ δὲ ἄλλο κύτος τοῦ κύρτου περὶ τὸ σῶμα ὅσον κοῖλον ἡμῶν περιέφυσεν, καὶ πᾶν δὴ τοῦτο τοτὲ μὲν εἰς τὰ ἐγκύρτια συρρεῖν μαλακῶς, ἅτε ἀέρα ὄντα, ἐποίησεν, τοτὲ δὲ ἀναρρεῖν μὲν τὰ ἐγκύρτια, τὸ δὲ πλέγμα, ὡς ὄντος τοῦ σώματος μανοῦ, δύεσθαι εἴσω διʼ αὐτοῦ καὶ πάλιν ἔξω, τὰς δὲ ἐντὸς τοῦ πυρὸς ἀκτῖνας διαδεδεμένας ἀκολουθεῖν ἐφʼ ἑκάτερα ἰόντος τοῦ ἀέρος, καὶ τοῦτο,  ἕωσπερ ἂν τὸ θνητὸν συνεστήκῃ ζῷον, μὴ διαπαύεσθαι γιγνόμενον· τούτῳ δὲ δὴ τῷ γένει τὸν τὰς ἐπωνυμίας θέμενον ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ἐκπνοὴν λέγομεν θέσθαι τοὔνομα. πᾶν δὲ δὴ τό τʼ ἔργον καὶ τὸ πάθος τοῦθʼ ἡμῶν τῷ σώματι γέγονεν ἀρδομένῳ καὶ ἀναψυχομένῳ τρέφεσθαι καὶ ζῆν·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"d2181e9d941fc2e0ba176d6f1b3b213d62fcffa8219320b5fc424559b51ffb71","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225302707629Z_d4ffab37","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 78","source_sha256":"d2181e9d941fc2e0ba176d6f1b3b213d62fcffa8219320b5fc424559b51ffb71","sha256":"719559a47805bdd51ed6187a89576d28631321b3c6d1436ae46a33d83f325b53","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:02.707714+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","text":"And thereafter they contrived the conveyance of water in some such manner as follows, which we shall more easily observe if we first agree upon this: that all things constituted from smaller parts contain the larger, whereas those constituted from larger parts cannot contain the smaller; and fire is the most fine-parted of all kinds, whence it passes through water and earth and air and whatever is constituted from these, and nothing can contain it. The same, then, must also be understood concerning the belly in us: whenever foods and drinks fall into it, it contains them, but breath and fire, being more fine-parted than its own constitution, it cannot contain. These, then, the god employed for the watering from the belly to the veins, weaving together a network of air and fire like the wicker fish-traps, having at its entrance two funnel-like openings, one of which he again interwove as two-pronged; and from the funnel-like openings he stretched, as it were, cords in a circle throughout to the extremities of the network.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","text":"All the interior parts of the plaiting, then, he constituted of fire, but the funnel-like openings and the cavity of an airy nature; and, taking it, he set it round the creature that had been fashioned in the following manner. One of the funnel-like openings he let into the mouth; and, since it was double, one part he let down through the arteries into the lung, and the other into the belly beside the arteries. The other, having split each part, he let out in common by the channels of the nostrils, so that, whenever one did not go through the mouth, all the streams of that one too might be replenished from this.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","text":"But the other cavity of the fish-trap he inflated round about all that part of our body which is hollow; and he caused all this, being air, at one time to flow softly into the funnel-like openings, and at another time for the funnel-like openings to flow back, while the network, since the body is porous, passes inward through it and outward again; and he caused the rays of fire distributed within to follow in either direction as the air moved, and this not to cease occurring so long as the mortal creature should remain constituted. And it is to this kind, we say, that he who established the names gave the name inhalation and exhalation. And the whole function and affection of this in our body has come about so that, being watered and cooled, it may be nourished and live.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"0cf1e01bb3299a27f2826e5071abc9d5f5b2567c0f8e17678fa58df6736e4016","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 78"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 78","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57","title":"Section 79","order":63,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_57","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπόταν γὰρ εἴσω καὶ ἔξω τῆς ἀναπνοῆς ἰούσης τὸ πῦρ ἐντὸς συνημμένον ἕπηται, διαιωρούμενον δὲ ἀεὶ διὰ τῆς κοιλίας εἰσελθὸν τὰ  σιτία καὶ ποτὰ λάβῃ, τήκει δή, καὶ κατὰ σμικρὰ διαιροῦν, διὰ τῶν ἐξόδων ᾗπερ πορεύεται διάγον, οἷον ἐκ κρήνης ἐπʼ ὀχετοὺς ἐπὶ τὰς φλέβας ἀντλοῦν αὐτά, ῥεῖν ὥσπερ αὐλῶνος διὰ τοῦ σώματος τὰ τῶν φλεβῶν ποιεῖ ῥεύματα. πάλιν δὲ τὸ τῆς ἀναπνοῆς ἴδωμεν πάθος, αἷς χρώμενον αἰτίαις τοιοῦτον γέγονεν οἷόνπερ τὰ νῦν ἐστιν. ὧδʼ οὖν.  ἐπειδὴ κενὸν οὐδέν ἐστιν εἰς ὃ τῶν φερομένων δύναιτʼ ἂν εἰσελθεῖν τι, τὸ δὲ πνεῦμα φέρεται παρʼ ἡμῶν ἔξω, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο ἤδη παντὶ δῆλον ὡς οὐκ εἰς κενόν, ἀλλὰ τὸ πλησίον ἐκ τῆς ἕδρας ὠθεῖ· τὸ δʼ ὠθούμενον ἐξελαύνει τὸ πλησίον ἀεί, καὶ κατὰ ταύτην τὴν ἀνάγκην πᾶν περιελαυνόμενον εἰς τὴν ἕδραν ὅθεν ἐξῆλθεν τὸ πνεῦμα, εἰσιὸν ἐκεῖσε καὶ ἀναπληροῦν αὐτὴν συνέπεται τῷ πνεύματι, καὶ τοῦτο ἅμα πᾶν  οἷον τροχοῦ περιαγομένου γίγνεται διὰ τὸ κενὸν μηδὲν εἶναι. διὸ δὴ τὸ τῶν στηθῶν καὶ τὸ τοῦ πλεύμονος ἔξω μεθιὲν τὸ πνεῦμα πάλιν ὑπὸ τοῦ περὶ τὸ σῶμα ἀέρος, εἴσω διὰ μανῶν τῶν σαρκῶν δυομένου καὶ περιελαυνομένου, γίγνεται πλῆρες· αὖθις δὲ ἀποτρεπόμενος ὁ ἀὴρ καὶ διὰ τοῦ σώματος ἔξω ἰὼν εἴσω τὴν ἀναπνοὴν περιωθεῖ κατὰ τὴν τοῦ στόματος καὶ τὴν τῶν μυκτήρων δίοδον. τὴν δʼ αἰτίαν τῆς ἀρχῆς αὐτῶν θετέον  τήνδε. πᾶν ζῷον αὑτοῦ τἀντὸς περὶ τὸ αἷμα καὶ τὰς φλέβας θερμότατα ἔχει, οἷον ἐν ἑαυτῷ πηγήν τινα ἐνοῦσαν πυρός· ὃ δὴ καὶ προσῃκάζομεν τῷ τοῦ κύρτου πλέγματι, κατὰ μέσον διατεταμένον ἐκ πυρὸς πεπλέχθαι πᾶν, τὰ δὲ ἄλλα ὅσα ἔξωθεν, ἀέρος. τὸ θερμὸν δὴ κατὰ φύσιν εἰς τὴν αὑτοῦ χώραν ἔξω πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ὁμολογητέον ἰέναι· δυοῖν δὲ τοῖν διεξόδοιν οὔσαιν, τῆς μὲν κατὰ τὸ σῶμα ἔξω, τῆς δὲ αὖ  κατὰ τὸ στόμα καὶ τὰς ῥῖνας, ὅταν μὲν ἐπὶ θάτερα ὁρμήσῃ, θάτερα περιωθεῖ, τὸ δὲ περιωσθὲν εἰς τὸ πῦρ ἐμπῖπτον θερμαίνεται, τὸ δʼ ἐξιὸν ψύχεται. μεταβαλλούσης δὲ τῆς θερμότητος καὶ τῶν κατὰ τὴν ἑτέραν ἔξοδον θερμοτέρων γιγνομένων πάλιν ἐκείνῃ ῥέπον αὖ τὸ θερμότερον μᾶλλον, πρὸς τὴν αὑτοῦ φύσιν φερόμενον, περιωθεῖ τὸ κατὰ θάτερα· τὸ δὲ τὰ αὐτὰ πάσχον καὶ τὰ αὐτὰ ἀνταποδιδὸν ἀεί, κύκλον οὕτω σαλευόμενον ἔνθα καὶ ἔνθα ἀπειργασμένον ὑπʼ ἀμφοτέρων τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ἐκπνοὴν γίγνεσθαι παρέχεται.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὁπόταν γὰρ εἴσω καὶ ἔξω τῆς ἀναπνοῆς ἰούσης τὸ πῦρ ἐντὸς συνημμένον ἕπηται, διαιωρούμενον δὲ ἀεὶ διὰ τῆς κοιλίας εἰσελθὸν τὰ  σιτία καὶ ποτὰ λάβῃ, τήκει δή, καὶ κατὰ σμικρὰ διαιροῦν, διὰ τῶν ἐξόδων ᾗπερ πορεύεται διάγον, οἷον ἐκ κρήνης ἐπʼ ὀχετοὺς ἐπὶ τὰς φλέβας ἀντλοῦν αὐτά, ῥεῖν ὥσπερ αὐλῶνος διὰ τοῦ σώματος τὰ τῶν φλεβῶν ποιεῖ ῥεύματα. πάλιν δὲ τὸ τῆς ἀναπνοῆς ἴδωμεν πάθος, αἷς χρώμενον αἰτίαις τοιοῦτον γέγονεν οἷόνπερ τὰ νῦν ἐστιν. ὧδʼ οὖν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","text":"ἐπειδὴ κενὸν οὐδέν ἐστιν εἰς ὃ τῶν φερομένων δύναιτʼ ἂν εἰσελθεῖν τι, τὸ δὲ πνεῦμα φέρεται παρʼ ἡμῶν ἔξω, τὸ μετὰ τοῦτο ἤδη παντὶ δῆλον ὡς οὐκ εἰς κενόν, ἀλλὰ τὸ πλησίον ἐκ τῆς ἕδρας ὠθεῖ· τὸ δʼ ὠθούμενον ἐξελαύνει τὸ πλησίον ἀεί, καὶ κατὰ ταύτην τὴν ἀνάγκην πᾶν περιελαυνόμενον εἰς τὴν ἕδραν ὅθεν ἐξῆλθεν τὸ πνεῦμα, εἰσιὸν ἐκεῖσε καὶ ἀναπληροῦν αὐτὴν συνέπεται τῷ πνεύματι, καὶ τοῦτο ἅμα πᾶν  οἷον τροχοῦ περιαγομένου γίγνεται διὰ τὸ κενὸν μηδὲν εἶναι. διὸ δὴ τὸ τῶν στηθῶν καὶ τὸ τοῦ πλεύμονος ἔξω μεθιὲν τὸ πνεῦμα πάλιν ὑπὸ τοῦ περὶ τὸ σῶμα ἀέρος, εἴσω διὰ μανῶν τῶν σαρκῶν δυομένου καὶ περιελαυνομένου, γίγνεται πλῆρες· αὖθις δὲ ἀποτρεπόμενος ὁ ἀὴρ καὶ διὰ τοῦ σώματος ἔξω ἰὼν εἴσω τὴν ἀναπνοὴν περιωθεῖ κατὰ τὴν τοῦ στόματος καὶ τὴν τῶν μυκτήρων δίοδον. τὴν δʼ αἰτίαν τῆς ἀρχῆς αὐτῶν θετέον  τήνδε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","text":"πᾶν ζῷον αὑτοῦ τἀντὸς περὶ τὸ αἷμα καὶ τὰς φλέβας θερμότατα ἔχει, οἷον ἐν ἑαυτῷ πηγήν τινα ἐνοῦσαν πυρός· ὃ δὴ καὶ προσῃκάζομεν τῷ τοῦ κύρτου πλέγματι, κατὰ μέσον διατεταμένον ἐκ πυρὸς πεπλέχθαι πᾶν, τὰ δὲ ἄλλα ὅσα ἔξωθεν, ἀέρος. τὸ θερμὸν δὴ κατὰ φύσιν εἰς τὴν αὑτοῦ χώραν ἔξω πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ὁμολογητέον ἰέναι· δυοῖν δὲ τοῖν διεξόδοιν οὔσαιν, τῆς μὲν κατὰ τὸ σῶμα ἔξω, τῆς δὲ αὖ  κατὰ τὸ στόμα καὶ τὰς ῥῖνας, ὅταν μὲν ἐπὶ θάτερα ὁρμήσῃ, θάτερα περιωθεῖ, τὸ δὲ περιωσθὲν εἰς τὸ πῦρ ἐμπῖπτον θερμαίνεται, τὸ δʼ ἐξιὸν ψύχεται. μεταβαλλούσης δὲ τῆς θερμότητος καὶ τῶν κατὰ τὴν ἑτέραν ἔξοδον θερμοτέρων γιγνομένων πάλιν ἐκείνῃ ῥέπον αὖ τὸ θερμότερον μᾶλλον, πρὸς τὴν αὑτοῦ φύσιν φερόμενον, περιωθεῖ τὸ κατὰ θάτερα· τὸ δὲ τὰ αὐτὰ πάσχον καὶ τὰ αὐτὰ ἀνταποδιδὸν ἀεί, κύκλον οὕτω σαλευόμενον ἔνθα καὶ ἔνθα ἀπειργασμένον ὑπʼ ἀμφοτέρων τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ἐκπνοὴν γίγνεσθαι παρέχεται.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"86655252b52fde8910fa0ed332cede1feed24e3bfd0fbdb06eff48e0ed9f9bff","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225311093791Z_8587a322","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 79","source_sha256":"86655252b52fde8910fa0ed332cede1feed24e3bfd0fbdb06eff48e0ed9f9bff","sha256":"e865ba4e33e8e8a1c7fc1ab2ab9fd8c210bbb8fb364a3de9b8f284bb110225d3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:11.093846+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","text":"TI. For whenever the fire, following along with the breath as it goes in and out, is connected within, and, being continually suspended through the belly, upon entering takes hold of the foods and drinks, it melts them; and, dividing them into small parts, it conducts them through the passages by which it travels, drawing them, as it were, from a spring into channels, into the veins, and makes the streams of the veins flow through the body as through a conduit. Let us again consider the affection of respiration, by what causes it has come to be such as it now is. Thus, then.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","text":"Since there is no void into which anything of the things in motion could enter, and breath is carried outward from us, what follows is now clear to everyone: it goes not into a void, but pushes what is nearest from its place; and what is pushed always drives out what is nearest; and by this necessity everything, being driven round, follows the breath, entering into the place from which the breath went out and filling it again; and all this occurs at once, as though a wheel were being turned, because there is no void. Accordingly, when that of the breast and of the lung lets the breath out, it again becomes full through the air around the body, which enters through the porous flesh and is driven round. And when the air in turn is driven back and goes out through the body, it thrusts the breath inward through the passage of the mouth and that of the nostrils. The cause of their beginning must be stated as follows.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","text":"Every animal has the regions about its blood and veins hottest, as though there were within it a certain fountain of fire; this indeed we compared to the woven enclosure of a fish-trap, stretched out through the middle and woven wholly of fire, while all the parts outside are of air. Now it must be admitted that what is hot naturally goes outward to its own region, toward what is akin to it. And since there are two outlets, one outward through the body, and the other again through the mouth and nostrils, whenever it rushes toward one of them, it thrusts round toward the other; and what has been thrust round, falling into the fire, is heated, while what goes out is cooled. But when the heat changes, and the things at the other outlet become hotter, then again that which is hotter, tending more in that direction and being borne toward its own nature, thrusts round what is at the other outlet. And this, ever undergoing and repaying the same things, produces respiration and expiration by fashioning a circle oscillating now this way, now that, through the agency of both.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"93b1e0e8c8052d7a75e5f0b592c179e1937b706f20fcf3582b4eb617fd89e3b1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 79"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 79","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8","title":"Section 80","order":64,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ τῶν περὶ τὰς ἰατρικὰς σικύας παθημάτων  αἴτια καὶ τὰ τῆς καταπόσεως τά τε τῶν ῥιπτουμένων, ὅσα ἀφεθέντα μετέωρα καὶ ὅσα ἐπὶ γῆς φέρεται, ταύτῃ διωκτέον, καὶ ὅσοι φθόγγοι ταχεῖς τε καὶ βραδεῖς ὀξεῖς τε καὶ βαρεῖς φαίνονται, τοτὲ μὲν ἀνάρμοστοι φερόμενοι διʼ ἀνομοιότητα τῆς ἐν ἡμῖν ὑπʼ αὐτῶν κινήσεως, τοτὲ δὲ σύμφωνοι διʼ ὁμοιότητα. τὰς γὰρ τῶν προτέρων καὶ θαττόνων οἱ βραδύτεροι κινήσεις ἀποπαυομένας ἤδη τε εἰς ὅμοιον ἐληλυθυίας,  αἷς ὕστερον αὐτοὶ προσφερόμενοι κινοῦσιν ἐκείνας, καταλαμβάνουσιν, καταλαμβάνοντες δὲ οὐκ ἄλλην ἐπεμβάλλοντες ἀνετάραξαν κίνησιν, ἀλλʼ ἀρχὴν βραδυτέρας φορᾶς κατὰ τὴν τῆς θάττονος, ἀποληγούσης δέ, ὁμοιότητα προσάψαντες, μίαν ἐξ ὀξείας καὶ βαρείας συνεκεράσαντο πάθην· ὅθεν ἡδονὴν μὲν τοῖς ἄφροσιν, εὐφροσύνην δὲ τοῖς ἔμφροσιν διὰ τὴν τῆς θείας ἁρμονίας μίμησιν ἐν θνηταῖς γενομένην φοραῖς παρέσχον. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ τῶν ὑδάτων πάντα ῥεύματα, ἔτι δὲ  τὰ τῶν κεραυνῶν πτώματα καὶ τὰ θαυμαζόμενα ἠλέκτρων περὶ τῆς ἕλξεως καὶ τῶν Ἡρακλείων λίθων, πάντων τούτων ὁλκὴ μὲν οὐκ ἔστιν οὐδενί ποτε, τὸ δὲ κενὸν εἶναι μηδὲν περιωθεῖν τε αὑτὰ ταῦτα εἰς ἄλληλα, τό τε διακρινόμενα καὶ συγκρινόμενα πρὸς τὴν αὑτῶν διαμειβόμενα ἕδραν ἕκαστα ἰέναι πάντα, τούτοις τοῖς παθήμασιν πρὸς ἄλληλα συμπλεχθεῖσιν τεθαυματουργημένα τῷ κατὰ τρόπον ζητοῦντι φανήσεται.  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῆς ἀναπνοῆς, ὅθεν ὁ λόγος ὥρμησεν, κατὰ ταῦτα καὶ διὰ τούτων γέγονεν, ὥσπερ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν εἴρηται, τέμνοντος μὲν τὰ σιτία τοῦ πυρός, αἰωρουμένου δὲ ἐντὸς τῷ πνεύματι συνεπομένου, τὰς φλέβας τε ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας τῇ συναιωρήσει πληροῦντος τῷ τὰ τετμημένα αὐτόθεν ἐπαντλεῖν· καὶ διὰ ταῦτα δὴ καθʼ ὅλον τὸ σῶμα πᾶσιν τοῖς ζῴοις τὰ τῆς τροφῆς νάματα οὕτως ἐπίρρυτα γέγονεν. νεότμητα δὲ καὶ ἀπὸ συγγενῶν ὄντα, τὰ μὲν καρπῶν, τὰ δὲ χλόης,  ἃ θεὸς ἐπʼ αὐτὸ τοῦθʼ ἡμῖν ἐφύτευσεν, εἶναι τροφήν, παντοδαπὰ μὲν χρώματα ἴσχει διὰ τὴν σύμμειξιν, ἡ δʼ ἐρυθρὰ πλείστη περὶ αὐτὰ χρόα διαθεῖ, τῆς τοῦ πυρὸς τομῆς τε καὶ ἐξομόρξεως ἐν ὑγρῷ δεδημιουργημένη φύσις.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ τῶν περὶ τὰς ἰατρικὰς σικύας παθημάτων  αἴτια καὶ τὰ τῆς καταπόσεως τά τε τῶν ῥιπτουμένων, ὅσα ἀφεθέντα μετέωρα καὶ ὅσα ἐπὶ γῆς φέρεται, ταύτῃ διωκτέον, καὶ ὅσοι φθόγγοι ταχεῖς τε καὶ βραδεῖς ὀξεῖς τε καὶ βαρεῖς φαίνονται, τοτὲ μὲν ἀνάρμοστοι φερόμενοι διʼ ἀνομοιότητα τῆς ἐν ἡμῖν ὑπʼ αὐτῶν κινήσεως, τοτὲ δὲ σύμφωνοι διʼ ὁμοιότητα. τὰς γὰρ τῶν προτέρων καὶ θαττόνων οἱ βραδύτεροι κινήσεις ἀποπαυομένας ἤδη τε εἰς ὅμοιον ἐληλυθυίας,  αἷς ὕστερον αὐτοὶ προσφερόμενοι κινοῦσιν ἐκείνας, καταλαμβάνουσιν, καταλαμβάνοντες δὲ οὐκ ἄλλην ἐπεμβάλλοντες ἀνετάραξαν κίνησιν, ἀλλʼ ἀρχὴν βραδυτέρας φορᾶς κατὰ τὴν τῆς θάττονος, ἀποληγούσης δέ, ὁμοιότητα προσάψαντες, μίαν ἐξ ὀξείας καὶ βαρείας συνεκεράσαντο πάθην· ὅθεν ἡδονὴν μὲν τοῖς ἄφροσιν, εὐφροσύνην δὲ τοῖς ἔμφροσιν διὰ τὴν τῆς θείας ἁρμονίας μίμησιν ἐν θνηταῖς γενομένην φοραῖς παρέσχον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","text":"καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ τῶν ὑδάτων πάντα ῥεύματα, ἔτι δὲ  τὰ τῶν κεραυνῶν πτώματα καὶ τὰ θαυμαζόμενα ἠλέκτρων περὶ τῆς ἕλξεως καὶ τῶν Ἡρακλείων λίθων, πάντων τούτων ὁλκὴ μὲν οὐκ ἔστιν οὐδενί ποτε, τὸ δὲ κενὸν εἶναι μηδὲν περιωθεῖν τε αὑτὰ ταῦτα εἰς ἄλληλα, τό τε διακρινόμενα καὶ συγκρινόμενα πρὸς τὴν αὑτῶν διαμειβόμενα ἕδραν ἕκαστα ἰέναι πάντα, τούτοις τοῖς παθήμασιν πρὸς ἄλληλα συμπλεχθεῖσιν τεθαυματουργημένα τῷ κατὰ τρόπον ζητοῦντι φανήσεται.  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὸ τῆς ἀναπνοῆς, ὅθεν ὁ λόγος ὥρμησεν, κατὰ ταῦτα καὶ διὰ τούτων γέγονεν, ὥσπερ ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν εἴρηται, τέμνοντος μὲν τὰ σιτία τοῦ πυρός, αἰωρουμένου δὲ ἐντὸς τῷ πνεύματι συνεπομένου, τὰς φλέβας τε ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας τῇ συναιωρήσει πληροῦντος τῷ τὰ τετμημένα αὐτόθεν ἐπαντλεῖν· καὶ διὰ ταῦτα δὴ καθʼ ὅλον τὸ σῶμα πᾶσιν τοῖς ζῴοις τὰ τῆς τροφῆς νάματα οὕτως ἐπίρρυτα γέγονεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","text":"νεότμητα δὲ καὶ ἀπὸ συγγενῶν ὄντα, τὰ μὲν καρπῶν, τὰ δὲ χλόης,  ἃ θεὸς ἐπʼ αὐτὸ τοῦθʼ ἡμῖν ἐφύτευσεν, εἶναι τροφήν, παντοδαπὰ μὲν χρώματα ἴσχει διὰ τὴν σύμμειξιν, ἡ δʼ ἐρυθρὰ πλείστη περὶ αὐτὰ χρόα διαθεῖ, τῆς τοῦ πυρὸς τομῆς τε καὶ ἐξομόρξεως ἐν ὑγρῷ δεδημιουργημένη φύσις.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"3fbe09e4bd13ab4d664de20c43d1f35b21a9e81c36c8d8d928d5ae12a953c03b","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225325291353Z_55b3aa3d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 80","source_sha256":"3fbe09e4bd13ab4d664de20c43d1f35b21a9e81c36c8d8d928d5ae12a953c03b","sha256":"b47affc02ae8553acbb38c4cf59e5a498c4d3f5ef89ffdd8b2e49b281ec17258","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:25.291479+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","text":"TIM. And indeed the causes of the affections connected with medical cupping-glasses, and those of swallowing, and of things thrown—whatever, when released, are borne aloft and whatever are borne upon the earth—must be pursued in this way; and likewise whatever sounds appear swift or slow, high-pitched or low-pitched, at one time discordant because of the dissimilarity of the motion produced by them within us, and at another consonant because of its similarity. For the slower motions overtake the motions of those that are earlier and swifter, when these have already ceased and have come to be similar to those which the slower motions, subsequently added, themselves set in motion; and, in overtaking them, they do not disturb them by imposing another motion, but, attaching the beginning of a slower movement to the ending of the swifter one in accordance with similarity, they blend together one affection from high and low pitch. Hence they afford pleasure to the foolish, but delight to the wise, through an imitation of the divine harmony that has arisen in mortal motions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","text":"And indeed all the streams of waters, further the fallings of thunderbolts, and the marvellous properties of amber concerning attraction and of Heraclean stones—all these involve no attraction by anything at any time; rather, there being no void, these things thrust one another around, and, as they are separated and combined, each goes to its own place by interchange: when these affections are interwoven with one another, all will appear marvellously wrought to him who investigates in the proper manner.\n\nAnd indeed breathing also, from which the account set out, has come about in this way and through these causes, as was said previously: the fire cutting the foods, and, being suspended within, accompanied by the breath, filling the veins from the belly by this joint suspension, through its pumping up thence the things that have been cut. And for these reasons, throughout the whole body, the streams of nourishment have thus become flowing in upon all living creatures.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","text":"But when they are freshly cut and akin—some of the fruits, others of herbage—which god planted for us for this very purpose, namely to be food, they possess colours of every kind because of the mixture; but red colour is most prevalent among them, its nature having been fashioned by the cutting and purging of fire in moisture.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"568a87b46557ff5714d5662ebdcedbd3d90a334c0e25e40c59877cba16c28060","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 80"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 80","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58","title":"Section 81","order":65,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_58","text":"ΤΙ. ὅθεν τοῦ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα ῥέοντος τὸ χρῶμα ἔσχεν οἵαν ὄψιν διεληλύθαμεν ὃ καλοῦμεν αἷμα, νομὴν σαρκῶν καὶ σύμπαντος τοῦ σώματος,  ὅθεν ὑδρευόμενα ἕκαστα πληροῖ τὴν τοῦ κενουμένου βάσιν· ὁ δὲ τρόπος τῆς πληρώσεως ἀποχωρήσεώς τε γίγνεται καθάπερ ἐν τῷ παντὶ παντὸς ἡ φορὰ γέγονεν, ἣν τὸ συγγενὲς πᾶν φέρεται πρὸς ἑαυτό. τὰ μὲν γὰρ δὴ περιεστῶτα ἐκτὸς ἡμᾶς τήκει τε ἀεὶ καὶ διανέμει πρὸς ἕκαστον εἶδος τὸ ὁμόφυλον ἀποπέμποντα, τὰ δὲ ἔναιμα αὖ, κερματισθέντα ἐντὸς παρʼ ἡμῖν καὶ περιειλημμένα ὥσπερ ὑπʼ  οὐρανοῦ συνεστῶτος ἑκάστου τοῦ ζῴου, τὴν τοῦ παντὸς ἀναγκάζεται μιμεῖσθαι φοράν· πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς οὖν φερόμενον ἕκαστον τῶν ἐντὸς μερισθέντων τὸ κενωθὲν τότε πάλιν ἀνεπλήρωσεν. ὅταν μὲν δὴ πλέον τοῦ ἐπιρρέοντος ἀπίῃ, φθίνει πᾶν, ὅταν δὲ ἔλαττον, αὐξάνεται. νέα μὲν οὖν σύστασις τοῦ παντὸς ζῴου, καινὰ τὰ τρίγωνα οἷον ἐκ δρυόχων ἔτι ἔχουσα τῶν γενῶν, ἰσχυρὰν μὲν τὴν σύγκλεισιν αὐτῶν πρὸς ἄλληλα κέκτηται, συμπέπηγεν δὲ ὁ πᾶς ὄγκος αὐτῆς  ἁπαλός, ἅτʼ ἐκ μυελοῦ μὲν νεωστὶ γεγονυίας, τεθραμμένης δὲ ἐν γάλακτι· τὰ δὴ περιλαμβανόμενα ἐν αὐτῇ τρίγωνα ἔξωθεν ἐπεισελθόντα, ἐξ ὧν ἂν ᾖ τά τε σιτία καὶ ποτά, τῶν ἑαυτῆς τριγώνων παλαιότερα ὄντα καὶ ἀσθενέστερα καινοῖς ἐπικρατεῖ τέμνουσα, καὶ μέγα ἀπεργάζεται τὸ ζῷον τρέφουσα ἐκ πολλῶν ὁμοίων. ὅταν δʼ ἡ ῥίζα τῶν τριγώνων χαλᾷ διὰ τὸ πολλοὺς ἀγῶνας ἐν πολλῷ χρόνῳ πρὸς πολλὰ  ἠγωνίσθαι, τὰ μὲν τῆς τροφῆς εἰσιόντα οὐκέτι δύναται τέμνειν εἰς ὁμοιότητα ἑαυτοῖς, αὐτὰ δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν ἔξωθεν ἐπεισιόντων εὐπετῶς διαιρεῖται· φθίνει δὴ πᾶν ζῷον ἐν τούτῳ κρατούμενον, γῆράς τε ὀνομάζεται τὸ πάθος. τέλος δέ, ἐπειδὰν τῶν περὶ τὸν μυελὸν τριγώνων οἱ συναρμοσθέντες μηκέτι ἀντέχωσιν δεσμοὶ τῷ πόνῳ διιστάμενοι, μεθιᾶσιν τοὺς τῆς ψυχῆς αὖ δεσμούς, ἡ δὲ λυθεῖσα κατὰ φύσιν μεθʼ ἡδονῆς  ἐξέπτατο· πᾶν γὰρ τὸ μὲν παρὰ φύσιν ἀλγεινόν, τὸ δʼ ᾗ πέφυκεν γιγνόμενον ἡδύ. καὶ θάνατος δὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὁ μὲν κατὰ νόσους καὶ ὑπὸ τραυμάτων γιγνόμενος ἀλγεινὸς καὶ βίαιος, ὁ δὲ μετὰ γήρως ἰὼν ἐπὶ τέλος κατὰ φύσιν ἀπονώτατος τῶν θανάτων καὶ μᾶλλον μεθʼ ἡδονῆς γιγνόμενος ἢ λύπης.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὅθεν τοῦ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα ῥέοντος τὸ χρῶμα ἔσχεν οἵαν ὄψιν διεληλύθαμεν ὃ καλοῦμεν αἷμα, νομὴν σαρκῶν καὶ σύμπαντος τοῦ σώματος,  ὅθεν ὑδρευόμενα ἕκαστα πληροῖ τὴν τοῦ κενουμένου βάσιν· ὁ δὲ τρόπος τῆς πληρώσεως ἀποχωρήσεώς τε γίγνεται καθάπερ ἐν τῷ παντὶ παντὸς ἡ φορὰ γέγονεν, ἣν τὸ συγγενὲς πᾶν φέρεται πρὸς ἑαυτό. τὰ μὲν γὰρ δὴ περιεστῶτα ἐκτὸς ἡμᾶς τήκει τε ἀεὶ καὶ διανέμει πρὸς ἕκαστον εἶδος τὸ ὁμόφυλον ἀποπέμποντα, τὰ δὲ ἔναιμα αὖ, κερματισθέντα ἐντὸς παρʼ ἡμῖν καὶ περιειλημμένα ὥσπερ ὑπʼ  οὐρανοῦ συνεστῶτος ἑκάστου τοῦ ζῴου, τὴν τοῦ παντὸς ἀναγκάζεται μιμεῖσθαι φοράν· πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς οὖν φερόμενον ἕκαστον τῶν ἐντὸς μερισθέντων τὸ κενωθὲν τότε πάλιν ἀνεπλήρωσεν. ὅταν μὲν δὴ πλέον τοῦ ἐπιρρέοντος ἀπίῃ, φθίνει πᾶν, ὅταν δὲ ἔλαττον, αὐξάνεται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","text":"νέα μὲν οὖν σύστασις τοῦ παντὸς ζῴου, καινὰ τὰ τρίγωνα οἷον ἐκ δρυόχων ἔτι ἔχουσα τῶν γενῶν, ἰσχυρὰν μὲν τὴν σύγκλεισιν αὐτῶν πρὸς ἄλληλα κέκτηται, συμπέπηγεν δὲ ὁ πᾶς ὄγκος αὐτῆς  ἁπαλός, ἅτʼ ἐκ μυελοῦ μὲν νεωστὶ γεγονυίας, τεθραμμένης δὲ ἐν γάλακτι· τὰ δὴ περιλαμβανόμενα ἐν αὐτῇ τρίγωνα ἔξωθεν ἐπεισελθόντα, ἐξ ὧν ἂν ᾖ τά τε σιτία καὶ ποτά, τῶν ἑαυτῆς τριγώνων παλαιότερα ὄντα καὶ ἀσθενέστερα καινοῖς ἐπικρατεῖ τέμνουσα, καὶ μέγα ἀπεργάζεται τὸ ζῷον τρέφουσα ἐκ πολλῶν ὁμοίων. ὅταν δʼ ἡ ῥίζα τῶν τριγώνων χαλᾷ διὰ τὸ πολλοὺς ἀγῶνας ἐν πολλῷ χρόνῳ πρὸς πολλὰ  ἠγωνίσθαι, τὰ μὲν τῆς τροφῆς εἰσιόντα οὐκέτι δύναται τέμνειν εἰς ὁμοιότητα ἑαυτοῖς, αὐτὰ δὲ ὑπὸ τῶν ἔξωθεν ἐπεισιόντων εὐπετῶς διαιρεῖται· φθίνει δὴ πᾶν ζῷον ἐν τούτῳ κρατούμενον, γῆράς τε ὀνομάζεται τὸ πάθος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","text":"τέλος δέ, ἐπειδὰν τῶν περὶ τὸν μυελὸν τριγώνων οἱ συναρμοσθέντες μηκέτι ἀντέχωσιν δεσμοὶ τῷ πόνῳ διιστάμενοι, μεθιᾶσιν τοὺς τῆς ψυχῆς αὖ δεσμούς, ἡ δὲ λυθεῖσα κατὰ φύσιν μεθʼ ἡδονῆς  ἐξέπτατο· πᾶν γὰρ τὸ μὲν παρὰ φύσιν ἀλγεινόν, τὸ δʼ ᾗ πέφυκεν γιγνόμενον ἡδύ. καὶ θάνατος δὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὁ μὲν κατὰ νόσους καὶ ὑπὸ τραυμάτων γιγνόμενος ἀλγεινὸς καὶ βίαιος, ὁ δὲ μετὰ γήρως ἰὼν ἐπὶ τέλος κατὰ φύσιν ἀπονώτατος τῶν θανάτων καὶ μᾶλλον μεθʼ ἡδονῆς γιγνόμενος ἢ λύπης.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"ce8e2e404f131e90f79782fef2a2b3fec6a685a01850a6aa92f1aae397dbaf2e","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225332829435Z_e5cd080a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 81","source_sha256":"ce8e2e404f131e90f79782fef2a2b3fec6a685a01850a6aa92f1aae397dbaf2e","sha256":"3695fdf52c325979e931980ac511d75fef93681fc698c706210a5eb8d5d88962","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:32.829532+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","text":"XIX. Thus the flowing substance in the body has acquired the appearance which we have described, that which we call blood, the nourishment of flesh and of the whole body, from which each part, drawing water, fills up the place that is emptied. The manner of replenishment and withdrawal comes about just as, in the universe, the motion of everything has come about, by which everything akin is borne toward itself. For the things that stand around us outside continually melt and distribute themselves, sending each kind toward that which is of the same stock; while the blooded things, broken into small pieces within us and enclosed, as it were, beneath the heaven constituted by each living creature, are compelled to imitate the motion of the whole. Therefore each of the portions divided within, being borne toward its kindred, then again replenishes that which has been emptied. When more departs than flows in, everything wastes away; but when less, it grows.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","text":"A new constitution of the whole living creature, then, having the triangles of its kinds still fresh, as it were from their blocks of timber, possesses a strong fastening of them to one another; and its whole bulk is compacted soft, since it has lately come into being from marrow and has been nourished on milk. The triangles enclosed in it, entering from outside, from which the foods and drinks consist, being older and weaker than its own triangles, it overpowers by cutting them up into new ones, and makes the living creature large by nourishing it from many like parts. But when the root of the triangles becomes relaxed because, over much time, it has contended in many contests against many things, it is no longer able to cut up the incoming nourishment into likeness to itself, while it is itself easily divided by those entering from outside. Then every living creature, being overcome in this condition, wastes away, and the affection is called old age.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","text":"Finally, when the bonds of the triangles around the marrow, having been joined together, no longer withstand the strain but come apart, they release in turn the bonds of the soul; and she, being released according to nature, flies away with pleasure. For everything contrary to nature is painful, whereas what comes to be as it is by nature is pleasant. And death likewise: that which comes about through diseases and wounds is painful and violent, but that which, with old age, proceeds to its end according to nature is the least painful of deaths, and comes about rather with pleasure than with grief.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"aa7cfe4114b8330d508d212365d973a6b1ad033168f124706ee0fb478fdd3cce","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 81"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 81","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59","title":"Section 82","order":66,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_59","text":"ΤΙ. τὸ δὲ τῶν νόσων ὅθεν συνίσταται, δῆλόν που καὶ παντί.  τεττάρων γὰρ ὄντων γενῶν ἐξ ὧν συμπέπηγεν τὸ σῶμα, γῆς πυρὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος, τούτων ἡ παρὰ φύσιν πλεονεξία καὶ ἔνδεια καὶ τῆς χώρας μετάστασις ἐξ οἰκείας ἐπʼ ἀλλοτρίαν γιγνομένη, πυρός τε αὖ καὶ τῶν ἑτέρων ἐπειδὴ γένη πλείονα ἑνὸς ὄντα τυγχάνει, τὸ μὴ προσῆκον ἕκαστον ἑαυτῷ προσλαμβάνειν, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα τοιαῦτα, στάσεις καὶ νόσους παρέχει· παρὰ φύσιν γὰρ ἑκάστου γιγνομένου καὶ μεθισταμένου θερμαίνεται μὲν ὅσα ἂν πρότερον ψύχηται,  ξηρὰ δὲ ὄντα εἰς ὕστερον γίγνεται νοτερά, καὶ κοῦφα δὴ καὶ βαρέα, καὶ πάσας πάντῃ μεταβολὰς δέχεται. μόνως γὰρ δή, φαμέν, ταὐτὸν ταὐτῷ κατὰ ταὐτὸν καὶ ὡσαύτως καὶ ἀνὰ λόγον προσγιγνόμενον καὶ ἀπογιγνόμενον ἐάσει ταὐτὸν ὂν αὑτῷ σῶν καὶ ὑγιὲς μένειν· ὃ δʼ ἂν πλημμελήσῃ τι τούτων ἐκτὸς ἀπιὸν ἢ προσιόν, ἀλλοιότητας παμποικίλας καὶ νόσους φθοράς τε ἀπείρους παρέξεται. δευτέρων δὴ συστάσεων αὖ κατὰ φύσιν συνεστηκυιῶν,  δευτέρα κατανόησις νοσημάτων τῷ βουλομένῳ γίγνεται συννοῆσαι. μυελοῦ γὰρ ἐξ ἐκείνων ὀστοῦ τε καὶ σαρκὸς καὶ νεύρου συμπαγέντος, ἔτι τε αἵματος ἄλλον μὲν τρόπον, ἐκ δὲ τῶν αὐτῶν γεγονότος, τῶν μὲν ἄλλων τὰ πλεῖστα ᾗπερ τὰ πρόσθεν, τὰ δὲ μέγιστα τῶν νοσημάτων τῇδε χαλεπὰ συμπέπτωκεν· ὅταν ἀνάπαλιν ἡ γένεσις τούτων πορεύηται, τότε ταῦτα διαφθείρεται. κατὰ φύσιν γὰρ σάρκες μὲν καὶ νεῦρα ἐξ αἵματος γίγνεται, νεῦρον μὲν ἐξ ἰνῶν διὰ τὴν συγγένειαν,  σάρκες δὲ ἀπὸ τοῦ παγέντος ὃ πήγνυται χωριζόμενον ἰνῶν· τὸ δὲ ἀπὸ τῶν νεύρων καὶ σαρκῶν ἀπιὸν αὖ γλίσχρον καὶ λιπαρὸν ἅμα μὲν τὴν σάρκα κολλᾷ πρὸς τὴν τῶν ὀστῶν φύσιν αὐτό τε τὸ περὶ τὸν μυελὸν ὀστοῦν τρέφον αὔξει, τὸ δʼ αὖ διὰ τὴν πυκνότητα τῶν ὀστῶν διηθούμενον καθαρώτατον γένος τῶν τριγώνων λειότατόν τε καὶ λιπαρώτατον, λειβόμενον ἀπὸ τῶν ὀστῶν καὶ στάζον, ἄρδει τὸν  μυελόν. καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα μὲν γιγνομένων ἑκάστων ὑγίεια συμβαίνει τὰ πολλά· νόσοι δέ, ὅταν ἐναντίως. ὅταν γὰρ τηκομένη σὰρξ ἀνάπαλιν εἰς τὰς φλέβας τὴν τηκεδόνα ἐξιῇ, τότε μετὰ πνεύματος αἷμα πολύ τε καὶ παντοδαπὸν ἐν ταῖς φλεψὶ χρώμασι καὶ πικρότησι ποικιλλόμενον, ἔτι δὲ ὀξείαις καὶ ἁλμυραῖς δυνάμεσι, χολὰς καὶ ἰχῶρας καὶ φλέγματα παντοῖα ἴσχει·","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τὸ δὲ τῶν νόσων ὅθεν συνίσταται, δῆλόν που καὶ παντί.  τεττάρων γὰρ ὄντων γενῶν ἐξ ὧν συμπέπηγεν τὸ σῶμα, γῆς πυρὸς ὕδατός τε καὶ ἀέρος, τούτων ἡ παρὰ φύσιν πλεονεξία καὶ ἔνδεια καὶ τῆς χώρας μετάστασις ἐξ οἰκείας ἐπʼ ἀλλοτρίαν γιγνομένη, πυρός τε αὖ καὶ τῶν ἑτέρων ἐπειδὴ γένη πλείονα ἑνὸς ὄντα τυγχάνει, τὸ μὴ προσῆκον ἕκαστον ἑαυτῷ προσλαμβάνειν, καὶ πάνθʼ ὅσα τοιαῦτα, στάσεις καὶ νόσους παρέχει· παρὰ φύσιν γὰρ ἑκάστου γιγνομένου καὶ μεθισταμένου θερμαίνεται μὲν ὅσα ἂν πρότερον ψύχηται,  ξηρὰ δὲ ὄντα εἰς ὕστερον γίγνεται νοτερά, καὶ κοῦφα δὴ καὶ βαρέα, καὶ πάσας πάντῃ μεταβολὰς δέχεται. μόνως γὰρ δή, φαμέν, ταὐτὸν ταὐτῷ κατὰ ταὐτὸν καὶ ὡσαύτως καὶ ἀνὰ λόγον προσγιγνόμενον καὶ ἀπογιγνόμενον ἐάσει ταὐτὸν ὂν αὑτῷ σῶν καὶ ὑγιὲς μένειν· ὃ δʼ ἂν πλημμελήσῃ τι τούτων ἐκτὸς ἀπιὸν ἢ προσιόν, ἀλλοιότητας παμποικίλας καὶ νόσους φθοράς τε ἀπείρους παρέξεται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","text":"δευτέρων δὴ συστάσεων αὖ κατὰ φύσιν συνεστηκυιῶν,  δευτέρα κατανόησις νοσημάτων τῷ βουλομένῳ γίγνεται συννοῆσαι. μυελοῦ γὰρ ἐξ ἐκείνων ὀστοῦ τε καὶ σαρκὸς καὶ νεύρου συμπαγέντος, ἔτι τε αἵματος ἄλλον μὲν τρόπον, ἐκ δὲ τῶν αὐτῶν γεγονότος, τῶν μὲν ἄλλων τὰ πλεῖστα ᾗπερ τὰ πρόσθεν, τὰ δὲ μέγιστα τῶν νοσημάτων τῇδε χαλεπὰ συμπέπτωκεν· ὅταν ἀνάπαλιν ἡ γένεσις τούτων πορεύηται, τότε ταῦτα διαφθείρεται. κατὰ φύσιν γὰρ σάρκες μὲν καὶ νεῦρα ἐξ αἵματος γίγνεται, νεῦρον μὲν ἐξ ἰνῶν διὰ τὴν συγγένειαν,  σάρκες δὲ ἀπὸ τοῦ παγέντος ὃ πήγνυται χωριζόμενον ἰνῶν· τὸ δὲ ἀπὸ τῶν νεύρων καὶ σαρκῶν ἀπιὸν αὖ γλίσχρον καὶ λιπαρὸν ἅμα μὲν τὴν σάρκα κολλᾷ πρὸς τὴν τῶν ὀστῶν φύσιν αὐτό τε τὸ περὶ τὸν μυελὸν ὀστοῦν τρέφον αὔξει, τὸ δʼ αὖ διὰ τὴν πυκνότητα τῶν ὀστῶν διηθούμενον καθαρώτατον γένος τῶν τριγώνων λειότατόν τε καὶ λιπαρώτατον, λειβόμενον ἀπὸ τῶν ὀστῶν καὶ στάζον, ἄρδει τὸν  μυελόν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","text":"καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα μὲν γιγνομένων ἑκάστων ὑγίεια συμβαίνει τὰ πολλά· νόσοι δέ, ὅταν ἐναντίως. ὅταν γὰρ τηκομένη σὰρξ ἀνάπαλιν εἰς τὰς φλέβας τὴν τηκεδόνα ἐξιῇ, τότε μετὰ πνεύματος αἷμα πολύ τε καὶ παντοδαπὸν ἐν ταῖς φλεψὶ χρώμασι καὶ πικρότησι ποικιλλόμενον, ἔτι δὲ ὀξείαις καὶ ἁλμυραῖς δυνάμεσι, χολὰς καὶ ἰχῶρας καὶ φλέγματα παντοῖα ἴσχει·","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"cd141fc158e998beff07ce9ca2df6820bac88155bb4b64220d65afcaa24975b1","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225341100334Z_bf8f70c2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 82","source_sha256":"cd141fc158e998beff07ce9ca2df6820bac88155bb4b64220d65afcaa24975b1","sha256":"d3a5b73b2db1489e90cce4627d1e5068949cf234fe1b793e93459351ff602bd8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:41.100504+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","text":"TI. And whence diseases arise is surely clear to everyone. For since there are four kinds of things from which the body has been compounded—earth, fire, water, and air—their excessive abundance and deficiency contrary to nature, and their migration from their proper place to an alien one; and again, since fire and the other things happen to possess more kinds than one, the taking on by each of what does not belong to itself, and all such occurrences, produce disorders and diseases. For when each comes to be and is displaced contrary to nature, those things which were formerly cooled are heated, things that were dry become afterward moist, and light and heavy; and they admit every kind of change in every direction. For only, we say, will the same thing, coming to and departing from the same thing in the same respect and in the same manner and according to proportion, allow it, being the same in relation to itself, to remain sound and healthy; but whatever transgresses any of these conditions by going away or coming to otherwise will produce exceedingly varied alterations, diseases, and endless destructions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","text":"And when secondary compounds have in turn been compounded according to nature, a second consideration of diseases arises for one who wishes to understand them. For marrow, bone, flesh, and sinew having been compacted from those things, and blood having come to be in another manner but from the same things, most of the rest [of diseases] occur in the same way as those mentioned before; but the greatest diseases have happened to be grievous in the following way. Whenever the generation of these things proceeds in reverse, then they are destroyed. For according to nature flesh and sinews come to be from blood: sinew from fibres because of their kinship, and flesh from the coagulum that coagulates, when it is separated from the fibres. But that which departs in turn from the sinews and flesh, being at once glutinous and fatty, both fastens the flesh to the nature of the bones and itself nourishes and increases the bone around the marrow; while that which is in turn filtered through the density of the bones—the purest kind of triangles, smoothest and fattiest—flowing and dripping from the bones, irrigates the marrow.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","text":"And when each thing comes to be in these ways, health for the most part results; but diseases result when the contrary occurs. For whenever flesh, melting away, discharges the melted matter back into the veins, then, together with air, much blood in the veins, variegated in colours and bitterness, and further in sharp and saline powers, contains bile, ichors, and phlegms of every kind;","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"05afe3e3409da40b94d95e39a4d37c95230fb9674a152724cfa08dc4afb71fa3","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 82"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 82","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60","title":"Section 83","order":67,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_60","text":"ΤΙ. παλιναίρετα γὰρ πάντα γεγονότα καὶ διεφθαρμένα τό τε αἷμα αὐτὸ πρῶτον διόλλυσι, καὶ αὐτὰ οὐδεμίαν  τροφὴν ἔτι τῷ σώματι παρέχοντα φέρεται πάντῃ διὰ τῶν φλεβῶν, τάξιν τῶν κατὰ φύσιν οὐκέτʼ ἴσχοντα περιόδων, ἐχθρὰ μὲν αὐτὰ αὑτοῖς διὰ τὸ μηδεμίαν ἀπόλαυσιν ἑαυτῶν ἔχειν, τῷ συνεστῶτι δὲ τοῦ σώματος καὶ μένοντι κατὰ χώραν πολέμια, διολλύντα καὶ τήκοντα. ὅσον μὲν οὖν ἂν παλαιότατον ὂν τῆς σαρκὸς τακῇ, δύσπεπτον γιγνόμενον μελαίνει μὲν ὑπὸ παλαιᾶς συγκαύσεως, διὰ δὲ τὸ πάντῃ διαβεβρῶσθαι  πικρὸν ὂν παντὶ χαλεπὸν προσπίπτει τοῦ σώματος ὅσον ἂν μήπω διεφθαρμένον ᾖ, καὶ τοτὲ μὲν ἀντὶ τῆς πικρότητος ὀξύτητα ἔσχεν τὸ μέλαν χρῶμα, ἀπολεπτυνθέντος μᾶλλον τοῦ πικροῦ, τοτὲ δὲ ἡ πικρότης αὖ βαφεῖσα αἵματι χρῶμα ἔσχεν ἐρυθρώτερον, τοῦ δὲ μέλανος τούτῳ συγκεραννυμένου χλοῶδες· ἔτι δὲ συμμείγνυται ξανθὸν χρῶμα μετὰ τῆς πικρότητος, ὅταν νέα συντακῇ σὰρξ ὑπὸ τοῦ περὶ τὴν φλόγα πυρός. καὶ τὸ μὲν κοινὸν ὄνομα πᾶσιν τούτοις ἤ τινες  ἰατρῶν που χολὴν ἐπωνόμασαν, ἢ καί τις ὢν δυνατὸς εἰς πολλὰ μὲν καὶ ἀνόμοια βλέπειν, ὁρᾶν δὲ ἐν αὐτοῖς ἓν γένος ἐνὸν ἄξιον ἐπωνυμίας πᾶσιν· τὰ δʼ ἄλλα ὅσα χολῆς εἴδη λέγεται, κατὰ τὴν χρόαν ἔσχεν λόγον αὐτῶν ἕκαστον ἴδιον. ἰχὼρ δέ, ὁ μὲν αἵματος ὀρὸς πρᾷος, ὁ δὲ μελαίνης χολῆς ὀξείας τε ἄγριος, ὅταν συμμειγνύηται διὰ θερμότητα ἁλμυρᾷ δυνάμει· καλεῖται δὲ ὀξὺ φλέγμα τὸ τοιοῦτον. τὸ δʼ αὖ μετʼ ἀέρος τηκόμενον ἐκ νέας καὶ ἁπαλῆς σαρκός, τούτου δὲ  ἀνεμωθέντος καὶ συμπεριληφθέντος ὑπὸ ὑγρότητος, καὶ πομφολύγων συστασῶν ἐκ τοῦ πάθους τούτου καθʼ ἑκάστην μὲν ἀοράτων διὰ σμικρότητα, συναπασῶν δὲ τὸν ὄγκον παρεχομένων ὁρατόν, χρῶμα ἐχουσῶν διὰ τὴν τοῦ ἀφροῦ γένεσιν ἰδεῖν λευκόν, ταύτην πᾶσαν τηκεδόνα ἁπαλῆς σαρκὸς μετὰ πνεύματος συμπλακεῖσαν λευκὸν εἶναι φλέγμα φαμέν. φλέγματος δὲ αὖ νέου συνισταμένου ὀρὸς ἱδρὼς καὶ δάκρυον,  ὅσα τε ἄλλα τοιαῦτα σώματα τὸ καθʼ ἡμέραν χεῖται καθαιρόμενα· καὶ ταῦτα μὲν δὴ πάντα νόσων ὄργανα γέγονεν, ὅταν αἷμα μὴ ἐκ τῶν σιτίων καὶ ποτῶν πληθύσῃ κατὰ φύσιν, ἀλλʼ ἐξ ἐναντίων τὸν ὄγκον παρὰ τοὺς τῆς φύσεως λαμβάνῃ νόμους.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. παλιναίρετα γὰρ πάντα γεγονότα καὶ διεφθαρμένα τό τε αἷμα αὐτὸ πρῶτον διόλλυσι, καὶ αὐτὰ οὐδεμίαν  τροφὴν ἔτι τῷ σώματι παρέχοντα φέρεται πάντῃ διὰ τῶν φλεβῶν, τάξιν τῶν κατὰ φύσιν οὐκέτʼ ἴσχοντα περιόδων, ἐχθρὰ μὲν αὐτὰ αὑτοῖς διὰ τὸ μηδεμίαν ἀπόλαυσιν ἑαυτῶν ἔχειν, τῷ συνεστῶτι δὲ τοῦ σώματος καὶ μένοντι κατὰ χώραν πολέμια, διολλύντα καὶ τήκοντα. ὅσον μὲν οὖν ἂν παλαιότατον ὂν τῆς σαρκὸς τακῇ, δύσπεπτον γιγνόμενον μελαίνει μὲν ὑπὸ παλαιᾶς συγκαύσεως, διὰ δὲ τὸ πάντῃ διαβεβρῶσθαι  πικρὸν ὂν παντὶ χαλεπὸν προσπίπτει τοῦ σώματος ὅσον ἂν μήπω διεφθαρμένον ᾖ, καὶ τοτὲ μὲν ἀντὶ τῆς πικρότητος ὀξύτητα ἔσχεν τὸ μέλαν χρῶμα, ἀπολεπτυνθέντος μᾶλλον τοῦ πικροῦ, τοτὲ δὲ ἡ πικρότης αὖ βαφεῖσα αἵματι χρῶμα ἔσχεν ἐρυθρώτερον, τοῦ δὲ μέλανος τούτῳ συγκεραννυμένου χλοῶδες· ἔτι δὲ συμμείγνυται ξανθὸν χρῶμα μετὰ τῆς πικρότητος, ὅταν νέα συντακῇ σὰρξ ὑπὸ τοῦ περὶ τὴν φλόγα πυρός.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","text":"καὶ τὸ μὲν κοινὸν ὄνομα πᾶσιν τούτοις ἤ τινες  ἰατρῶν που χολὴν ἐπωνόμασαν, ἢ καί τις ὢν δυνατὸς εἰς πολλὰ μὲν καὶ ἀνόμοια βλέπειν, ὁρᾶν δὲ ἐν αὐτοῖς ἓν γένος ἐνὸν ἄξιον ἐπωνυμίας πᾶσιν· τὰ δʼ ἄλλα ὅσα χολῆς εἴδη λέγεται, κατὰ τὴν χρόαν ἔσχεν λόγον αὐτῶν ἕκαστον ἴδιον. ἰχὼρ δέ, ὁ μὲν αἵματος ὀρὸς πρᾷος, ὁ δὲ μελαίνης χολῆς ὀξείας τε ἄγριος, ὅταν συμμειγνύηται διὰ θερμότητα ἁλμυρᾷ δυνάμει· καλεῖται δὲ ὀξὺ φλέγμα τὸ τοιοῦτον. τὸ δʼ αὖ μετʼ ἀέρος τηκόμενον ἐκ νέας καὶ ἁπαλῆς σαρκός, τούτου δὲ  ἀνεμωθέντος καὶ συμπεριληφθέντος ὑπὸ ὑγρότητος, καὶ πομφολύγων συστασῶν ἐκ τοῦ πάθους τούτου καθʼ ἑκάστην μὲν ἀοράτων διὰ σμικρότητα, συναπασῶν δὲ τὸν ὄγκον παρεχομένων ὁρατόν, χρῶμα ἐχουσῶν διὰ τὴν τοῦ ἀφροῦ γένεσιν ἰδεῖν λευκόν, ταύτην πᾶσαν τηκεδόνα ἁπαλῆς σαρκὸς μετὰ πνεύματος συμπλακεῖσαν λευκὸν εἶναι φλέγμα φαμέν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","text":"φλέγματος δὲ αὖ νέου συνισταμένου ὀρὸς ἱδρὼς καὶ δάκρυον,  ὅσα τε ἄλλα τοιαῦτα σώματα τὸ καθʼ ἡμέραν χεῖται καθαιρόμενα· καὶ ταῦτα μὲν δὴ πάντα νόσων ὄργανα γέγονεν, ὅταν αἷμα μὴ ἐκ τῶν σιτίων καὶ ποτῶν πληθύσῃ κατὰ φύσιν, ἀλλʼ ἐξ ἐναντίων τὸν ὄγκον παρὰ τοὺς τῆς φύσεως λαμβάνῃ νόμους.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"06f6c3c7be600816df66731209ce28dab7d8a2cf5538fc549da814cfd67635cb","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225348314097Z_fcf45d06","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 83","source_sha256":"06f6c3c7be600816df66731209ce28dab7d8a2cf5538fc549da814cfd67635cb","sha256":"7dd2937e34d116188db93a0925582d4b320b9d4fc6c83acdf9d0a57fc869a78f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:53:48.314132+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","text":"For all things that have come to be and have been corrupted are reversible, and first it destroys the blood itself; and, themselves no longer providing any nourishment to the body, they are borne everywhere through the veins, no longer retaining the order of the natural circuits, hostile to themselves because they have no enjoyment of themselves, and inimical to the body that is constituted and remains in its place, destroying and melting it away. So long, then, as the oldest part of the flesh is melted, becoming indigestible it turns black from an old co-burning; and, because it has been utterly corroded, being bitter it attacks harshly every part of the body that has not yet been corrupted. At one time, instead of bitterness, the black colour acquires acridity, as the bitter element is more attenuated; at another, the bitterness, again dyed with blood, acquires a redder colour; and, when black is blended with this, a greenish one. Further, a yellow colour is mingled with bitterness whenever fresh flesh is melted away by the fire around the flame.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","text":"And the common name for all these either certain physicians somewhere have given as bile, or else someone capable of looking to many and dissimilar things, yet of seeing in them one genus present, worthy of one name for them all. But the other kinds said to be of bile have each received its own account according to their colour. Ichor: that which is the serum of blood is mild, while that of black bile and acrid is savage, whenever it is mixed, through heat, with a saline power; and such a thing is called sharp phlegm. Again, that which is melting with air from fresh and tender flesh—when this has become winded and enclosed by moisture, and bubbles have formed from this affection, individually invisible because of their smallness but collectively presenting a visible mass, having, owing to the production of foam, a white colour to behold—we say that this entire melting-away of tender flesh intertwined with breath is white phlegm.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","text":"And when fresh phlegm is forming, its serum is sweat and tears, and all other such fluids as are poured out daily in purgation. And all these, indeed, have become instruments of diseases whenever blood is not produced in abundance from foods and drinks according to nature, but receives its bulk from contraries, contrary to the laws of nature.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"72e3ab41a56f1b018f4112fe157b26903359f9666a7c960e5c78ade37daef9b6","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 83"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 83","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61","title":"Section 84","order":68,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_61","text":"ΤΙ. διακρινομένης μὲν οὖν ὑπὸ νόσων τῆς σαρκὸς ἑκάστης, μενόντων δὲ τῶν πυθμένων αὐταῖς ἡμίσεια τῆς συμφορᾶς ἡ δύναμις—ἀνάληψιν γὰρ ἔτι μετʼ εὐπετείας ἴσχει— τὸ δὲ δὴ σάρκας ὀστοῖς συνδοῦν ὁπότʼ ἂν νοσήσῃ, καὶ μηκέτι αὐτὸ ἐξ ἰνῶν αἷμα καὶ νεύρων ἀποχωριζόμενον ὀστῷ μὲν τροφή, σαρκὶ δὲ πρὸς ὀστοῦν γίγνηται δεσμός, ἀλλʼ ἐκ λιπαροῦ καὶ λείου καὶ γλίσχρου τραχὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν αὐχμῆσαν ὑπὸ κακῆς διαίτης γένηται, τότε ταῦτα πάσχον πᾶν τὸ τοιοῦτον καταψήχεται μὲν αὐτὸ πάλιν ὑπὸ τὰς σάρκας καὶ τὰ νεῦρα, ἀφιστάμενον ἀπὸ τῶν ὀστῶν, αἱ δʼ ἐκ τῶν  ῥιζῶν συνεκπίπτουσαι τά τε νεῦρα γυμνὰ καταλείπουσι καὶ μεστὰ ἅλμης· αὐταὶ δὲ πάλιν εἰς τὴν αἵματος φορὰν ἐμπεσοῦσαι τὰ πρόσθεν ῥηθέντα νοσήματα πλείω ποιοῦσιν. χαλεπῶν δὲ τούτων περὶ τὰ σώματα παθημάτων γιγνομένων μείζω ἔτι γίγνεται τὰ πρὸ τούτων, ὅταν ὀστοῦν διὰ πυκνότητα σαρκὸς ἀναπνοὴν μὴ λαμβάνον ἱκανήν, ὑπʼ εὐρῶτος θερμαινόμενον, σφακελίσαν μήτε τὴν τροφὴν καταδέχηται  πάλιν τε αὐτὸ εἰς ἐκείνην ἐναντίως ἴῃ ψηχόμενον, ἡ δʼ εἰς σάρκας, σὰρξ δὲ εἰς αἷμα ἐμπίπτουσα τραχύτερα πάντα τῶν πρόσθεν τὰ νοσήματα ἀπεργάζηται· τὸ δʼ ἔσχατον πάντων, ὅταν ἡ τοῦ μυελοῦ φύσις ἀπʼ ἐνδείας ἤ τινος ὑπερβολῆς νοσήσῃ, τὰ μέγιστα καὶ κυριώτατα πρὸς θάνατον τῶν νοσημάτων ἀποτελεῖ, πάσης ἀνάπαλιν τῆς τοῦ σώματος φύσεως ἐξ ἀνάγκης ῥυείσης. τρίτον δʼ αὖ νοσημάτων εἶδος τριχῇ δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι  γιγνόμενον, τὸ μὲν ὑπὸ πνεύματος, τὸ δὲ φλέγματος, τὸ δὲ χολῆς. ὅταν μὲν γὰρ ὁ τῶν πνευμάτων τῷ σώματι ταμίας πλεύμων μὴ καθαρὰς παρέχῃ τὰς διεξόδους ὑπὸ ῥευμάτων φραχθείς, ἔνθα μὲν οὐκ ἰόν, ἔνθα δὲ πλεῖον ἢ τὸ προσῆκον πνεῦμα εἰσιὸν τὰ μὲν οὐ τυγχάνοντα ἀναψυχῆς σήπει, τὰ δὲ τῶν φλεβῶν διαβιαζόμενον καὶ συνεπιστρέφον αὐτὰ τῆκόν τε τὸ σῶμα εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτοῦ διάφραγμά τʼ ἴσχον  ἐναπολαμβάνεται, καὶ μυρία δὴ νοσήματα ἐκ τούτων ἀλγεινὰ μετὰ πλήθους ἱδρῶτος πολλάκις ἀπείργασται. πολλάκις δʼ ἐν τῷ σώματι διακριθείσης σαρκὸς πνεῦμα ἐγγενόμενον καὶ ἀδυνατοῦν ἔξω πορευθῆναι τὰς αὐτὰς τοῖς ἐπεισεληλυθόσιν ὠδῖνας παρέσχεν, μεγίστας δέ, ὅταν περὶ τὰ νεῦρα καὶ τὰ ταύτῃ φλέβια περιστὰν καὶ ἀνοιδῆσαν τούς τε ἐπιτόνους καὶ τὰ συνεχῆ νεῦρα οὕτως εἰς τὸ ἐξόπισθεν κατατείνῃ τούτοις· ἃ δὴ καὶ ἀπʼ αὐτοῦ τῆς συντονίας τοῦ παθήματος τὰ νοσήματα τέτανοί τε καὶ ὀπισθότονοι προσερρήθησαν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. διακρινομένης μὲν οὖν ὑπὸ νόσων τῆς σαρκὸς ἑκάστης, μενόντων δὲ τῶν πυθμένων αὐταῖς ἡμίσεια τῆς συμφορᾶς ἡ δύναμις—ἀνάληψιν γὰρ ἔτι μετʼ εὐπετείας ἴσχει— τὸ δὲ δὴ σάρκας ὀστοῖς συνδοῦν ὁπότʼ ἂν νοσήσῃ, καὶ μηκέτι αὐτὸ ἐξ ἰνῶν αἷμα καὶ νεύρων ἀποχωριζόμενον ὀστῷ μὲν τροφή, σαρκὶ δὲ πρὸς ὀστοῦν γίγνηται δεσμός, ἀλλʼ ἐκ λιπαροῦ καὶ λείου καὶ γλίσχρου τραχὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν αὐχμῆσαν ὑπὸ κακῆς διαίτης γένηται, τότε ταῦτα πάσχον πᾶν τὸ τοιοῦτον καταψήχεται μὲν αὐτὸ πάλιν ὑπὸ τὰς σάρκας καὶ τὰ νεῦρα, ἀφιστάμενον ἀπὸ τῶν ὀστῶν, αἱ δʼ ἐκ τῶν  ῥιζῶν συνεκπίπτουσαι τά τε νεῦρα γυμνὰ καταλείπουσι καὶ μεστὰ ἅλμης· αὐταὶ δὲ πάλιν εἰς τὴν αἵματος φορὰν ἐμπεσοῦσαι τὰ πρόσθεν ῥηθέντα νοσήματα πλείω ποιοῦσιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","text":"χαλεπῶν δὲ τούτων περὶ τὰ σώματα παθημάτων γιγνομένων μείζω ἔτι γίγνεται τὰ πρὸ τούτων, ὅταν ὀστοῦν διὰ πυκνότητα σαρκὸς ἀναπνοὴν μὴ λαμβάνον ἱκανήν, ὑπʼ εὐρῶτος θερμαινόμενον, σφακελίσαν μήτε τὴν τροφὴν καταδέχηται  πάλιν τε αὐτὸ εἰς ἐκείνην ἐναντίως ἴῃ ψηχόμενον, ἡ δʼ εἰς σάρκας, σὰρξ δὲ εἰς αἷμα ἐμπίπτουσα τραχύτερα πάντα τῶν πρόσθεν τὰ νοσήματα ἀπεργάζηται· τὸ δʼ ἔσχατον πάντων, ὅταν ἡ τοῦ μυελοῦ φύσις ἀπʼ ἐνδείας ἤ τινος ὑπερβολῆς νοσήσῃ, τὰ μέγιστα καὶ κυριώτατα πρὸς θάνατον τῶν νοσημάτων ἀποτελεῖ, πάσης ἀνάπαλιν τῆς τοῦ σώματος φύσεως ἐξ ἀνάγκης ῥυείσης. τρίτον δʼ αὖ νοσημάτων εἶδος τριχῇ δεῖ διανοεῖσθαι  γιγνόμενον, τὸ μὲν ὑπὸ πνεύματος, τὸ δὲ φλέγματος, τὸ δὲ χολῆς.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","text":"ὅταν μὲν γὰρ ὁ τῶν πνευμάτων τῷ σώματι ταμίας πλεύμων μὴ καθαρὰς παρέχῃ τὰς διεξόδους ὑπὸ ῥευμάτων φραχθείς, ἔνθα μὲν οὐκ ἰόν, ἔνθα δὲ πλεῖον ἢ τὸ προσῆκον πνεῦμα εἰσιὸν τὰ μὲν οὐ τυγχάνοντα ἀναψυχῆς σήπει, τὰ δὲ τῶν φλεβῶν διαβιαζόμενον καὶ συνεπιστρέφον αὐτὰ τῆκόν τε τὸ σῶμα εἰς τὸ μέσον αὐτοῦ διάφραγμά τʼ ἴσχον  ἐναπολαμβάνεται, καὶ μυρία δὴ νοσήματα ἐκ τούτων ἀλγεινὰ μετὰ πλήθους ἱδρῶτος πολλάκις ἀπείργασται. πολλάκις δʼ ἐν τῷ σώματι διακριθείσης σαρκὸς πνεῦμα ἐγγενόμενον καὶ ἀδυνατοῦν ἔξω πορευθῆναι τὰς αὐτὰς τοῖς ἐπεισεληλυθόσιν ὠδῖνας παρέσχεν, μεγίστας δέ, ὅταν περὶ τὰ νεῦρα καὶ τὰ ταύτῃ φλέβια περιστὰν καὶ ἀνοιδῆσαν τούς τε ἐπιτόνους καὶ τὰ συνεχῆ νεῦρα οὕτως εἰς τὸ ἐξόπισθεν κατατείνῃ τούτοις· ἃ δὴ καὶ ἀπʼ αὐτοῦ τῆς συντονίας τοῦ παθήματος τὰ νοσήματα τέτανοί τε καὶ ὀπισθότονοι προσερρήθησαν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"0316e11cb56b6cf70308377cab2ca3f81ce3ac039d5e9078bce65d8b6ea37833","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225403658538Z_2f401fdc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 84","source_sha256":"0316e11cb56b6cf70308377cab2ca3f81ce3ac039d5e9078bce65d8b6ea37833","sha256":"9dc3bc5c005a4f898235e8e7308a5fd9b22dcd62451f6cf0c994c0666594115f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:03.658635+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","text":"Now when each of the fleshes is being separated by diseases, while their foundations remain, the force of the affliction is half as great—for it still admits of recovery with ease. But whenever that which binds the fleshes to the bones becomes diseased, and, no longer separating itself from fibres, blood, and sinews, becomes both nourishment for the bone and a bond fastening flesh to bone, but from being oily and smooth and glutinous becomes rough and salty and parched through bad regimen, then every such thing, when so affected, is chilled back down beneath the fleshes and sinews, withdrawing from the bones; and the fleshes, falling away together from their roots, leave the sinews bare and full of brine. And they themselves, falling again into the current of the blood, produce in greater number the diseases previously described.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","text":"When such grievous affections arise in the bodies, still greater are those which precede them: whenever bone, because of the density of the flesh, fails to receive sufficient respiration and, being heated by mildew, becomes gangrenous, and neither receives its nourishment, while it itself in turn, being cooled, proceeds contrariwise into that nourishment, and this enters into the fleshes, and flesh into blood, it produces diseases in every respect harsher than the former ones. But the last of all occurs whenever the nature of the marrow becomes diseased through deficiency or some excess: it brings about the greatest and most sovereign of diseases tending toward death, since the whole nature of the body is necessarily flowing in reverse. A third kind of disease must again be conceived as arising in three ways: one from breath, one from phlegm, and one from bile.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","text":"For whenever the lung, the steward of the breaths for the body, does not provide clear passages, being blocked by fluxes, breath, failing to enter in some places and entering in others in greater quantity than is fitting, causes those parts which do not obtain cooling to decay; while, forcing its way through the veins and twisting them together, it melts the body and, being shut up in the diaphragm at its middle, has often produced from these causes countless painful diseases accompanied by much sweat. And often, when flesh has been separated within the body, breath generated therein and unable to proceed out has produced the same pains as those which have entered from without; and the greatest pains of all, whenever it stands about the sinews and the veins there and, by swelling, stretches backward in this way both the tension-cords and the sinews continuous with them. It is indeed from this very straining of the affection that the diseases were called tetani and opisthotonoi.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"103ba10887a35b4b2fe62b3f246a6301a1f8b558fe1206b67268a7615ca3d820","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 84"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 84","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62","title":"Section 85","order":69,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_62","text":"ΤΙ. ὧν καὶ τὸ φάρμακον χαλεπόν· πυρετοὶ γὰρ οὖν δὴ τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐπιγιγνόμενοι  μάλιστα λύουσιν. τὸ δὲ λευκὸν φλέγμα διὰ τὸ τῶν πομφολύγων πνεῦμα χαλεπὸν ἀποληφθέν, ἔξω δὲ τοῦ σώματος ἀναπνοὰς ἴσχον ἠπιώτερον μέν, καταποικίλλει δὲ τὸ σῶμα λεύκας ἀλφούς τε καὶ τὰ τούτων συγγενῆ νοσήματα ἀποτίκτον. μετὰ χολῆς δὲ μελαίνης κερασθὲν ἐπὶ τὰς περιόδους τε τὰς ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ θειοτάτας οὔσας ἐπισκεδαννύμενον καὶ συνταράττον αὐτάς, καθʼ ὕπνον μὲν ἰὸν πρᾳΰτερον,  ἐγρηγορόσιν δὲ ἐπιτιθέμενον δυσαπαλλακτότερον· νόσημα δὲ ἱερᾶς ὂν φύσεως ἐνδικώτατα ἱερὸν λέγεται. φλέγμα δʼ ὀξὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν πηγὴ πάντων νοσημάτων ὅσα γίγνεται καταρροϊκά· διὰ δὲ τοὺς τόπους εἰς οὓς ῥεῖ παντοδαποὺς ὄντας παντοῖα ὀνόματα εἴληφεν. ὅσα δὲ φλεγμαίνειν λέγεται τοῦ σώματος, ἀπὸ τοῦ κάεσθαί τε καὶ φλέγεσθαι, διὰ χολὴν γέγονε πάντα. λαμβάνουσα μὲν οὖν ἀναπνοὴν ἔξω παντοῖα  ἀναπέμπει φύματα ζέουσα, καθειργνυμένη δʼ ἐντὸς πυρίκαυτα νοσήματα πολλὰ ἐμποιεῖ, μέγιστον δέ, ὅταν αἵματι καθαρῷ συγκερασθεῖσα τὸ τῶν ἰνῶν γένος ἐκ τῆς ἑαυτῶν διαφορῇ τάξεως, αἳ διεσπάρησαν μὲν εἰς αἷμα, ἵνα συμμέτρως λεπτότητος ἴσχοι καὶ πάχους καὶ μήτε διὰ θερμότητα ὡς ὑγρὸν ἐκ μανοῦ τοῦ σώματος ἐκρέοι, μήτʼ αὖ πυκνότερον δυσκίνητον  ὂν μόλις ἀναστρέφοιτο ἐν ταῖς φλεψίν. καιρὸν δὴ τούτων ἶνες τῇ τῆς φύσεως γενέσει φυλάττουσιν· ἃς ὅταν τις καὶ τεθνεῶτος αἵματος ἐν ψύξει τε ὄντος πρὸς ἀλλήλας συναγάγῃ, διαχεῖται πᾶν τὸ λοιπὸν αἷμα, ἐαθεῖσαι δὲ ταχὺ μετὰ τοῦ περιεστῶτος αὐτὸ ψύχους συμπηγνύασιν. ταύτην δὴ τὴν δύναμιν ἐχουσῶν ἰνῶν ἐν αἵματι χολὴ φύσει παλαιὸν αἷμα γεγονυῖα καὶ πάλιν ἐκ τῶν σαρκῶν εἰς τοῦτο τετηκυῖα, θερμὴ καὶ ὑγρὰ κατʼ ὀλίγον τὸ πρῶτον ἐμπίπτουσα πήγνυται  διὰ τὴν τῶν ἰνῶν δύναμιν, πηγνυμένη δὲ καὶ βίᾳ κατασβεννυμένη χειμῶνα καὶ τρόμον ἐντὸς παρέχει.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὧν καὶ τὸ φάρμακον χαλεπόν· πυρετοὶ γὰρ οὖν δὴ τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐπιγιγνόμενοι  μάλιστα λύουσιν. τὸ δὲ λευκὸν φλέγμα διὰ τὸ τῶν πομφολύγων πνεῦμα χαλεπὸν ἀποληφθέν, ἔξω δὲ τοῦ σώματος ἀναπνοὰς ἴσχον ἠπιώτερον μέν, καταποικίλλει δὲ τὸ σῶμα λεύκας ἀλφούς τε καὶ τὰ τούτων συγγενῆ νοσήματα ἀποτίκτον. μετὰ χολῆς δὲ μελαίνης κερασθὲν ἐπὶ τὰς περιόδους τε τὰς ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ θειοτάτας οὔσας ἐπισκεδαννύμενον καὶ συνταράττον αὐτάς, καθʼ ὕπνον μὲν ἰὸν πρᾳΰτερον,  ἐγρηγορόσιν δὲ ἐπιτιθέμενον δυσαπαλλακτότερον· νόσημα δὲ ἱερᾶς ὂν φύσεως ἐνδικώτατα ἱερὸν λέγεται. φλέγμα δʼ ὀξὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν πηγὴ πάντων νοσημάτων ὅσα γίγνεται καταρροϊκά· διὰ δὲ τοὺς τόπους εἰς οὓς ῥεῖ παντοδαποὺς ὄντας παντοῖα ὀνόματα εἴληφεν. ὅσα δὲ φλεγμαίνειν λέγεται τοῦ σώματος, ἀπὸ τοῦ κάεσθαί τε καὶ φλέγεσθαι, διὰ χολὴν γέγονε πάντα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","text":"λαμβάνουσα μὲν οὖν ἀναπνοὴν ἔξω παντοῖα  ἀναπέμπει φύματα ζέουσα, καθειργνυμένη δʼ ἐντὸς πυρίκαυτα νοσήματα πολλὰ ἐμποιεῖ, μέγιστον δέ, ὅταν αἵματι καθαρῷ συγκερασθεῖσα τὸ τῶν ἰνῶν γένος ἐκ τῆς ἑαυτῶν διαφορῇ τάξεως, αἳ διεσπάρησαν μὲν εἰς αἷμα, ἵνα συμμέτρως λεπτότητος ἴσχοι καὶ πάχους καὶ μήτε διὰ θερμότητα ὡς ὑγρὸν ἐκ μανοῦ τοῦ σώματος ἐκρέοι, μήτʼ αὖ πυκνότερον δυσκίνητον  ὂν μόλις ἀναστρέφοιτο ἐν ταῖς φλεψίν. καιρὸν δὴ τούτων ἶνες τῇ τῆς φύσεως γενέσει φυλάττουσιν· ἃς ὅταν τις καὶ τεθνεῶτος αἵματος ἐν ψύξει τε ὄντος πρὸς ἀλλήλας συναγάγῃ, διαχεῖται πᾶν τὸ λοιπὸν αἷμα, ἐαθεῖσαι δὲ ταχὺ μετὰ τοῦ περιεστῶτος αὐτὸ ψύχους συμπηγνύασιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","text":"ταύτην δὴ τὴν δύναμιν ἐχουσῶν ἰνῶν ἐν αἵματι χολὴ φύσει παλαιὸν αἷμα γεγονυῖα καὶ πάλιν ἐκ τῶν σαρκῶν εἰς τοῦτο τετηκυῖα, θερμὴ καὶ ὑγρὰ κατʼ ὀλίγον τὸ πρῶτον ἐμπίπτουσα πήγνυται  διὰ τὴν τῶν ἰνῶν δύναμιν, πηγνυμένη δὲ καὶ βίᾳ κατασβεννυμένη χειμῶνα καὶ τρόμον ἐντὸς παρέχει.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"24e9dcc3e66969fa0329a3f24d961c769a94c435102ca773fcdac826135d3a5f","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225410341102Z_6d15aebb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 85","source_sha256":"24e9dcc3e66969fa0329a3f24d961c769a94c435102ca773fcdac826135d3a5f","sha256":"87fa0be4ed0e5e57cea1de41c953eaa0a8cde5e1c9100d3c129ae717ec2b5838","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:10.341196+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","text":"And of these the remedy too is difficult; for fevers, indeed, supervening upon such conditions, most especially dissolve them. But white phlegm, confined because of the breath in the bubbles, produces mild respirations outside the body, but variegates the body, giving birth to white leprosies, alphoi, and the diseases akin to these. When mixed with black bile and dispersed upon the circuits in the head, which are most divine, and disturbing them, it is milder when it comes during sleep, but when it attacks those who are awake it is harder to get rid of; and, being a disease of a sacred nature, it is with the greatest justice called sacred. Sharp and saline phlegm is the source of all diseases that arise from flux; and, because the places into which it flows are of every kind, it has received all kinds of names. And all the conditions of the body said to be inflamed have arisen from bile, from being burned and inflamed.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","text":"Thus, when it takes in respiration, it sends forth outside all kinds of boiling eruptions; but when shut up within, it produces many fiery diseases—chiefly when, having been mixed with pure blood, it separates the race of fibres from their proper order. These were dispersed throughout the blood so that it might possess a due measure of thinness and thickness, and neither, through heat, flow out of the porous body as a liquid, nor again, being denser and hard to move, scarcely circulate in the veins. The fibres preserve this proportion by their natural formation. Whenever someone brings them together with one another in blood even of a dead body, while it is in cooling, all the remaining blood is liquefied; but, if left alone, they quickly congeal it together with the cold surrounding it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","text":"Since the fibres in the blood possess this power, bile—which by nature has become old blood and has again melted from the flesh into it—being hot and moist, when it first enters little by little, is congealed through the power of the fibres; and, being congealed and forcibly quenched, it produces cold and trembling within.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"d08c35d4308509625e08e1de7891646edef72c20ae97ebcf686d95f006313210","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 85"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 85","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63","title":"Section 86","order":70,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_63","text":"ΤΙ. πλείων δʼ ἐπιρρέουσα, τῇ παρʼ αὐτῆς θερμότητι κρατήσασα τὰς ἶνας εἰς ἀταξίαν ζέσασα διέσεισεν· καὶ ἐὰν μὲν ἱκανὴ διὰ τέλους κρατῆσαι γένηται, πρὸς τὸ τοῦ μυελοῦ διαπεράσασα γένος κάουσα ἔλυσεν τὰ τῆς ψυχῆς αὐτόθεν οἷον νεὼς πείσματα μεθῆκέν τε ἐλευθέραν, ὅταν δʼ ἐλάττων ᾖ τό τε σῶμα ἀντίσχῃ τηκόμενον, αὐτὴ κρατηθεῖσα ἢ κατὰ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα ἐξέπεσεν, ἢ διὰ τῶν φλεβῶν εἰς τὴν κάτω συνωσθεῖσα ἢ τὴν ἄνω κοιλίαν, οἷον φυγὰς ἐκ πόλεως στασιασάσης ἐκ  τοῦ σώματος ἐκπίπτουσα, διαρροίας καὶ δυσεντερίας καὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα νοσήματα πάντα παρέσχετο. τὸ μὲν οὖν ἐκ πυρὸς ὑπερβολῆς μάλιστα νοσῆσαν σῶμα συνεχῆ καύματα καὶ πυρετοὺς ἀπεργάζεται, τὸ δʼ ἐξ ἀέρος ἀμφημερινούς, τριταίους δʼ ὕδατος διὰ τὸ νωθέστερον ἀέρος καὶ πυρὸς αὐτὸ εἶναι· τὸ δὲ γῆς, τετάρτως ὂν νωθέστατον τούτων, ἐν τετραπλασίαις περιόδοις χρόνου καθαιρόμενον, τεταρταίους πυρετοὺς ποιῆσαν ἀπαλλάττεται μόλις.  καὶ τὰ μὲν περὶ τὸ σῶμα νοσήματα ταύτῃ συμβαίνει γιγνόμενα, τὰ δὲ περὶ ψυχὴν διὰ σώματος ἕξιν τῇδε. νόσον μὲν δὴ ψυχῆς ἄνοιαν συγχωρητέον, δύο δʼ ἀνοίας γένη, τὸ μὲν μανίαν, τὸ δὲ ἀμαθίαν. πᾶν οὖν ὅτι πάσχων τις πάθος ὁπότερον αὐτῶν ἴσχει, νόσον προσρητέον, ἡδονὰς δὲ καὶ λύπας ὑπερβαλλούσας τῶν νόσων μεγίστας θετέον τῇ ψυχῇ· περιχαρὴς γὰρ ἄνθρωπος ὢν ἢ καὶ τἀναντία ὑπὸ  λύπης πάσχων, σπεύδων τὸ μὲν ἑλεῖν ἀκαίρως, τὸ δὲ φυγεῖν, οὔθʼ ὁρᾶν οὔτε ἀκούειν ὀρθὸν οὐδὲν δύναται, λυττᾷ δὲ καὶ λογισμοῦ μετασχεῖν ἥκιστα τότε δὴ δυνατός. τὸ δὲ σπέρμα ὅτῳ πολὺ καὶ ῥυῶδες περὶ τὸν μυελὸν γίγνεται καὶ καθαπερεὶ δένδρον πολυκαρπότερον τοῦ συμμέτρου πεφυκὸς ᾖ, πολλὰς μὲν καθʼ ἕκαστον ὠδῖνας, πολλὰς δʼ ἡδονὰς κτώμενος ἐν ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις καὶ τοῖς περὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα τόκοις, ἐμμανὴς τὸ πλεῖστον γιγνόμενος τοῦ βίου διὰ τὰς μεγίστας ἡδονὰς  καὶ λύπας, νοσοῦσαν καὶ ἄφρονα ἴσχων ὑπὸ τοῦ σώματος τὴν ψυχήν, οὐχ ὡς νοσῶν ἀλλʼ ὡς ἑκὼν κακὸς δοξάζεται· τὸ δὲ ἀληθὲς ἡ περὶ τὰ ἀφροδίσια ἀκολασία κατὰ τὸ πολὺ μέρος διὰ τὴν ἑνὸς γένους ἕξιν ὑπὸ μανότητος ὀστῶν ἐν σώματι ῥυώδη καὶ ὑγραίνουσαν νόσος ψυχῆς γέγονεν. καὶ σχεδὸν δὴ πάντα ὁπόσα ἡδονῶν ἀκράτεια καὶ ὄνειδος ὡς ἑκόντων λέγεται τῶν κακῶν, οὐκ ὀρθῶς ὀνειδίζεται· κακὸς  μὲν γὰρ ἑκὼν οὐδείς, διὰ δὲ πονηρὰν ἕξιν τινὰ τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἀπαίδευτον τροφὴν ὁ κακὸς γίγνεται κακός, παντὶ δὲ ταῦτα ἐχθρὰ καὶ ἄκοντι προσγίγνεται. καὶ πάλιν δὴ τὸ περὶ τὰς λύπας ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ διὰ σῶμα πολλὴν ἴσχει κακίαν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. πλείων δʼ ἐπιρρέουσα, τῇ παρʼ αὐτῆς θερμότητι κρατήσασα τὰς ἶνας εἰς ἀταξίαν ζέσασα διέσεισεν· καὶ ἐὰν μὲν ἱκανὴ διὰ τέλους κρατῆσαι γένηται, πρὸς τὸ τοῦ μυελοῦ διαπεράσασα γένος κάουσα ἔλυσεν τὰ τῆς ψυχῆς αὐτόθεν οἷον νεὼς πείσματα μεθῆκέν τε ἐλευθέραν, ὅταν δʼ ἐλάττων ᾖ τό τε σῶμα ἀντίσχῃ τηκόμενον, αὐτὴ κρατηθεῖσα ἢ κατὰ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα ἐξέπεσεν, ἢ διὰ τῶν φλεβῶν εἰς τὴν κάτω συνωσθεῖσα ἢ τὴν ἄνω κοιλίαν, οἷον φυγὰς ἐκ πόλεως στασιασάσης ἐκ  τοῦ σώματος ἐκπίπτουσα, διαρροίας καὶ δυσεντερίας καὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα νοσήματα πάντα παρέσχετο. τὸ μὲν οὖν ἐκ πυρὸς ὑπερβολῆς μάλιστα νοσῆσαν σῶμα συνεχῆ καύματα καὶ πυρετοὺς ἀπεργάζεται, τὸ δʼ ἐξ ἀέρος ἀμφημερινούς, τριταίους δʼ ὕδατος διὰ τὸ νωθέστερον ἀέρος καὶ πυρὸς αὐτὸ εἶναι· τὸ δὲ γῆς, τετάρτως ὂν νωθέστατον τούτων, ἐν τετραπλασίαις περιόδοις χρόνου καθαιρόμενον, τεταρταίους πυρετοὺς ποιῆσαν ἀπαλλάττεται μόλις.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","text":"καὶ τὰ μὲν περὶ τὸ σῶμα νοσήματα ταύτῃ συμβαίνει γιγνόμενα, τὰ δὲ περὶ ψυχὴν διὰ σώματος ἕξιν τῇδε. νόσον μὲν δὴ ψυχῆς ἄνοιαν συγχωρητέον, δύο δʼ ἀνοίας γένη, τὸ μὲν μανίαν, τὸ δὲ ἀμαθίαν. πᾶν οὖν ὅτι πάσχων τις πάθος ὁπότερον αὐτῶν ἴσχει, νόσον προσρητέον, ἡδονὰς δὲ καὶ λύπας ὑπερβαλλούσας τῶν νόσων μεγίστας θετέον τῇ ψυχῇ· περιχαρὴς γὰρ ἄνθρωπος ὢν ἢ καὶ τἀναντία ὑπὸ  λύπης πάσχων, σπεύδων τὸ μὲν ἑλεῖν ἀκαίρως, τὸ δὲ φυγεῖν, οὔθʼ ὁρᾶν οὔτε ἀκούειν ὀρθὸν οὐδὲν δύναται, λυττᾷ δὲ καὶ λογισμοῦ μετασχεῖν ἥκιστα τότε δὴ δυνατός.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","text":"τὸ δὲ σπέρμα ὅτῳ πολὺ καὶ ῥυῶδες περὶ τὸν μυελὸν γίγνεται καὶ καθαπερεὶ δένδρον πολυκαρπότερον τοῦ συμμέτρου πεφυκὸς ᾖ, πολλὰς μὲν καθʼ ἕκαστον ὠδῖνας, πολλὰς δʼ ἡδονὰς κτώμενος ἐν ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις καὶ τοῖς περὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα τόκοις, ἐμμανὴς τὸ πλεῖστον γιγνόμενος τοῦ βίου διὰ τὰς μεγίστας ἡδονὰς  καὶ λύπας, νοσοῦσαν καὶ ἄφρονα ἴσχων ὑπὸ τοῦ σώματος τὴν ψυχήν, οὐχ ὡς νοσῶν ἀλλʼ ὡς ἑκὼν κακὸς δοξάζεται· τὸ δὲ ἀληθὲς ἡ περὶ τὰ ἀφροδίσια ἀκολασία κατὰ τὸ πολὺ μέρος διὰ τὴν ἑνὸς γένους ἕξιν ὑπὸ μανότητος ὀστῶν ἐν σώματι ῥυώδη καὶ ὑγραίνουσαν νόσος ψυχῆς γέγονεν. καὶ σχεδὸν δὴ πάντα ὁπόσα ἡδονῶν ἀκράτεια καὶ ὄνειδος ὡς ἑκόντων λέγεται τῶν κακῶν, οὐκ ὀρθῶς ὀνειδίζεται· κακὸς  μὲν γὰρ ἑκὼν οὐδείς, διὰ δὲ πονηρὰν ἕξιν τινὰ τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἀπαίδευτον τροφὴν ὁ κακὸς γίγνεται κακός, παντὶ δὲ ταῦτα ἐχθρὰ καὶ ἄκοντι προσγίγνεται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","text":"καὶ πάλιν δὴ τὸ περὶ τὰς λύπας ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ ταὐτὰ διὰ σῶμα πολλὴν ἴσχει κακίαν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"7d7a374b3d73d229c3645de29ee9e34a9d29475cb16032ac813d36894fec152b","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225419597769Z_9b5facf4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 86","source_sha256":"7d7a374b3d73d229c3645de29ee9e34a9d29475cb16032ac813d36894fec152b","sha256":"50e3780aa24bfb6c53afbbb6d6b13286b1e1b48a22a2fa3daf7a226311c7124a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:19.597800+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","text":"T. And when a greater quantity flows in, overcoming by its own heat, boiling the fibres into disorder, it shook them apart; and if it becomes sufficient to prevail throughout to the end, penetrating as far as the kind of marrow, it burns and dissolves the bonds of the soul there, as it were the moorings of a ship, and lets it go free. But if it is less, and the body holds out while being melted, then, itself overcome, it either is dispersed through the whole body, or, being forced through the veins into the lower or upper belly, as an exile cast out of a city rent by faction, it produces diarrhoea and dysentery and all such diseases. Thus the body that has fallen ill chiefly through an excess of fire produces continuous burnings and fevers; that through air, quotidian fevers; that through water, tertian fevers, because it is slower than air and fire; while that through earth, being fourth and slowest of these, is purged in fourfold periods of time, produces quartan fevers, and is relieved only with difficulty.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","text":"And diseases concerning the body arise in this way, while those concerning the soul arise through the condition of the body as follows. We must grant that lack of understanding is a disease of the soul; and there are two kinds of lack of understanding, the one madness, the other ignorance. Whatever affection a person suffers when he has either of these must therefore be called a disease; and excessive pleasures and pains must be regarded as the greatest diseases of the soul. For a man who is excessively delighted, or conversely is suffering under pain, in his haste untimely to seize the one and to escape the other, can neither see nor hear anything rightly; he is mad, and at that very time is least able to partake of reason.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","text":"And in one whose seed becomes abundant and fluid about the marrow, and who is by nature like a tree more fruitful than is proportionate, gaining many pangs on each occasion and many pleasures in desires and in the begettings connected with such things, becoming mad for the greater part of his life because of the greatest pleasures and pains, and having his soul diseased and without understanding because of the body, he is thought to be wicked not as being diseased but as being willingly wicked. But the truth is that licentiousness in sexual matters, for the most part, has become a disease of the soul through the condition of one kind, owing to porousness of the bones in the body, which makes it fluid and moist. And nearly all cases that are called lack of self-control in pleasures and are reproached as evils willingly committed are reproached incorrectly. For no one is willingly wicked; rather, through some bad condition of the body and an uneducated upbringing, the wicked man becomes wicked; and these things come upon everyone as hostile and against his will.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","text":"And again, in the matter of pains, the soul likewise acquires much vice through the body.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004"]}],"source_digest":"27d0cdf4d6b1c0481d309bde5a95506ade6f00d2028f0a8e8990fa89280aecd7","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 86"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 86","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64","title":"Section 87","order":71,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_64","text":"ΤΙ. ὅτου γὰρ ἂν ἢ τῶν ὀξέων καὶ τῶν ἁλυκῶν φλεγμάτων καὶ ὅσοι πικροὶ καὶ χολώδεις χυμοὶ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα πλανηθέντες ἔξω μὲν μὴ λάβωσιν ἀναπνοήν, ἐντὸς δὲ εἱλλόμενοι  τὴν ἀφʼ αὑτῶν ἀτμίδα τῇ τῆς ψυχῆς φορᾷ συμμείξαντες ἀνακερασθῶσι, παντοδαπὰ νοσήματα ψυχῆς ἐμποιοῦσι μᾶλλον καὶ ἧττον καὶ ἐλάττω καὶ πλείω, πρός τε τοὺς τρεῖς τόπους ἐνεχθέντα τῆς ψυχῆς, πρὸς ὃν ἂν ἕκαστʼ αὐτῶν προσπίπτῃ, ποικίλλει μὲν εἴδη δυσκολίας καὶ δυσθυμίας παντοδαπά, ποικίλλει δὲ θρασύτητός τε καὶ δειλίας, ἔτι δὲ λήθης ἅμα καὶ δυσμαθίας. πρὸς δὲ τούτοις, ὅταν οὕτως  κακῶς παγέντων πολιτεῖαι κακαὶ καὶ λόγοι κατὰ πόλεις ἰδίᾳ τε καὶ δημοσίᾳ λεχθῶσιν, ἔτι δὲ μαθήματα μηδαμῇ τούτων ἰατικὰ ἐκ νέων μανθάνηται, ταύτῃ κακοὶ πάντες οἱ κακοὶ διὰ δύο ἀκουσιώτατα γιγνόμεθα· ὧν αἰτιατέον μὲν τοὺς φυτεύοντας ἀεὶ τῶν φυτευομένων μᾶλλον καὶ τοὺς τρέφοντας τῶν τρεφομένων, προθυμητέον μήν, ὅπῃ τις δύναται, καὶ διὰ τροφῆς καὶ διʼ ἐπιτηδευμάτων μαθημάτων τε φυγεῖν μὲν κακίαν, τοὐναντίον δὲ ἑλεῖν. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν δὴ τρόπος ἄλλος λόγων.  τὸ δὲ τούτων ἀντίστροφον αὖ, τὸ περὶ τὰς τῶν σωμάτων καὶ διανοήσεων θεραπείας αἷς αἰτίαις σῴζεται, πάλιν εἰκὸς καὶ πρέπον ἀνταποδοῦναι· δικαιότερον γὰρ τῶν ἀγαθῶν πέρι μᾶλλον ἢ τῶν κακῶν ἴσχειν λόγον. πᾶν δὴ τὸ ἀγαθὸν καλόν, τὸ δὲ καλὸν οὐκ ἄμετρον· καὶ ζῷον οὖν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἐσόμενον σύμμετρον θετέον. συμμετριῶν δὲ τὰ μὲν σμικρὰ διαισθανόμενοι συλλογιζόμεθα, τὰ δὲ κυριώτατα καὶ μέγιστα  ἀλογίστως ἔχομεν. πρὸς γὰρ ὑγιείας καὶ νόσους ἀρετάς τε καὶ κακίας οὐδεμία συμμετρία καὶ ἀμετρία μείζων ἢ ψυχῆς αὐτῆς πρὸς σῶμα αὐτό· ὧν οὐδὲν σκοποῦμεν οὐδʼ ἐννοοῦμεν, ὅτι ψυχὴν ἰσχυρὰν καὶ πάντῃ μεγάλην ἀσθενέστερον καὶ ἔλαττον εἶδος ὅταν ὀχῇ, καὶ ὅταν αὖ τοὐναντίον συμπαγῆτον τούτω, οὐ καλὸν ὅλον τὸ ζῷον—ἀσύμμετρον γὰρ ταῖς μεγίσταις συμμετρίαις—τὸ δὲ ἐναντίως ἔχον πάντων θεαμάτων τῷ δυναμένῳ καθορᾶν κάλλιστον καὶ ἐρασμιώτατον.  οἷον οὖν ὑπερσκελὲς ἢ καί τινα ἑτέραν ὑπέρεξιν ἄμετρον ἑαυτῷ τι σῶμα ὂν ἅμα μὲν αἰσχρόν, ἅμα δʼ ἐν τῇ κοινωνίᾳ τῶν πόνων πολλοὺς μὲν κόπους, πολλὰ δὲ σπάσματα καὶ διὰ τὴν παραφορότητα πτώματα παρέχον μυρίων κακῶν αἴτιον ἑαυτῷ,","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ὅτου γὰρ ἂν ἢ τῶν ὀξέων καὶ τῶν ἁλυκῶν φλεγμάτων καὶ ὅσοι πικροὶ καὶ χολώδεις χυμοὶ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα πλανηθέντες ἔξω μὲν μὴ λάβωσιν ἀναπνοήν, ἐντὸς δὲ εἱλλόμενοι  τὴν ἀφʼ αὑτῶν ἀτμίδα τῇ τῆς ψυχῆς φορᾷ συμμείξαντες ἀνακερασθῶσι, παντοδαπὰ νοσήματα ψυχῆς ἐμποιοῦσι μᾶλλον καὶ ἧττον καὶ ἐλάττω καὶ πλείω, πρός τε τοὺς τρεῖς τόπους ἐνεχθέντα τῆς ψυχῆς, πρὸς ὃν ἂν ἕκαστʼ αὐτῶν προσπίπτῃ, ποικίλλει μὲν εἴδη δυσκολίας καὶ δυσθυμίας παντοδαπά, ποικίλλει δὲ θρασύτητός τε καὶ δειλίας, ἔτι δὲ λήθης ἅμα καὶ δυσμαθίας.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","text":"πρὸς δὲ τούτοις, ὅταν οὕτως  κακῶς παγέντων πολιτεῖαι κακαὶ καὶ λόγοι κατὰ πόλεις ἰδίᾳ τε καὶ δημοσίᾳ λεχθῶσιν, ἔτι δὲ μαθήματα μηδαμῇ τούτων ἰατικὰ ἐκ νέων μανθάνηται, ταύτῃ κακοὶ πάντες οἱ κακοὶ διὰ δύο ἀκουσιώτατα γιγνόμεθα· ὧν αἰτιατέον μὲν τοὺς φυτεύοντας ἀεὶ τῶν φυτευομένων μᾶλλον καὶ τοὺς τρέφοντας τῶν τρεφομένων, προθυμητέον μήν, ὅπῃ τις δύναται, καὶ διὰ τροφῆς καὶ διʼ ἐπιτηδευμάτων μαθημάτων τε φυγεῖν μὲν κακίαν, τοὐναντίον δὲ ἑλεῖν. ταῦτα μὲν οὖν δὴ τρόπος ἄλλος λόγων.  τὸ δὲ τούτων ἀντίστροφον αὖ, τὸ περὶ τὰς τῶν σωμάτων καὶ διανοήσεων θεραπείας αἷς αἰτίαις σῴζεται, πάλιν εἰκὸς καὶ πρέπον ἀνταποδοῦναι· δικαιότερον γὰρ τῶν ἀγαθῶν πέρι μᾶλλον ἢ τῶν κακῶν ἴσχειν λόγον. πᾶν δὴ τὸ ἀγαθὸν καλόν, τὸ δὲ καλὸν οὐκ ἄμετρον· καὶ ζῷον οὖν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἐσόμενον σύμμετρον θετέον. συμμετριῶν δὲ τὰ μὲν σμικρὰ διαισθανόμενοι συλλογιζόμεθα, τὰ δὲ κυριώτατα καὶ μέγιστα  ἀλογίστως ἔχομεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","text":"πρὸς γὰρ ὑγιείας καὶ νόσους ἀρετάς τε καὶ κακίας οὐδεμία συμμετρία καὶ ἀμετρία μείζων ἢ ψυχῆς αὐτῆς πρὸς σῶμα αὐτό· ὧν οὐδὲν σκοποῦμεν οὐδʼ ἐννοοῦμεν, ὅτι ψυχὴν ἰσχυρὰν καὶ πάντῃ μεγάλην ἀσθενέστερον καὶ ἔλαττον εἶδος ὅταν ὀχῇ, καὶ ὅταν αὖ τοὐναντίον συμπαγῆτον τούτω, οὐ καλὸν ὅλον τὸ ζῷον—ἀσύμμετρον γὰρ ταῖς μεγίσταις συμμετρίαις—τὸ δὲ ἐναντίως ἔχον πάντων θεαμάτων τῷ δυναμένῳ καθορᾶν κάλλιστον καὶ ἐρασμιώτατον.  οἷον οὖν ὑπερσκελὲς ἢ καί τινα ἑτέραν ὑπέρεξιν ἄμετρον ἑαυτῷ τι σῶμα ὂν ἅμα μὲν αἰσχρόν, ἅμα δʼ ἐν τῇ κοινωνίᾳ τῶν πόνων πολλοὺς μὲν κόπους, πολλὰ δὲ σπάσματα καὶ διὰ τὴν παραφορότητα πτώματα παρέχον μυρίων κακῶν αἴτιον ἑαυτῷ,","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"94c760562b43a05f7e7d972548a436bcc551b385a7e2e3cf44bc9477a5f426b4","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225428870226Z_9c6e45f3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 87","source_sha256":"94c760562b43a05f7e7d972548a436bcc551b385a7e2e3cf44bc9477a5f426b4","sha256":"f131efaea3c835562bea4bf6c2f8b3eb763b53057595d9a1d2307eee50c02648","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:28.870264+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","text":"For whatever acute and saline phlegms, and whatever bitter and bilious humours, wandering through the body, fail to obtain respiration outwardly, but, being confined within and mingling the vapour from themselves with the motion of the soul, are blended with it, produce disorders of the soul of every kind, more and less, fewer and more; and, being borne toward the three regions of the soul, according to whichever of them each falls upon, they diversify every kind of ill-temper and despondency, and diversify courage and cowardice, and further forgetfulness together with difficulty in learning.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","text":"Moreover, when, in addition to these things, bad constitutions have thus been established and bad speeches are spoken in cities, privately and publicly, and when furthermore no studies curative of these are learned from youth onward, in this way all of us who are bad become bad through two causes most involuntary. Of these, one should blame those who always plant rather than those who are planted, and those who rear rather than those who are reared; nevertheless, one should be zealous, insofar as one is able, through nourishment and pursuits and studies, to flee vice and choose its opposite. This, then, is another manner of discourse.\n\nBut conversely, it is fitting and appropriate in turn to give an account of the causes through which the care of bodies and minds is preserved; for it is more just to dwell in discourse concerning good things rather than bad. Now every good thing is beautiful, and the beautiful is not without measure; therefore a living creature that is to be such must be posited as commensurate. Of commensurabilities, we perceive and reckon those that are small, but those that are most authoritative and greatest we possess without calculation.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","text":"For in regard to health and diseases, virtues and vices, there is no commensurability or lack of commensurability greater than that of soul itself in relation to body itself. Yet we neither observe nor consider this: that when a strong and altogether great soul rides in a weaker and smaller form, or again when the contrary pair is compacted together, the whole living creature is not beautiful—for it is incommensurate in its greatest commensurabilities—whereas that which is disposed oppositely is, for one able to behold it, the most beautiful and most love-worthy of all spectacles.\n\nJust as, then, a body having legs excessively long, or some other disproportionate excess in itself, is at once ugly and, in sharing in labours, affords itself many toils, many spasms, and, through its instability, falls, being the cause of countless evils to itself,","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"2e660d0c09607f4c8d8d3b16a6778ed1d4d8a50463c44b64d6855a329025e5de","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 87"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 87","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65","title":"Section 88","order":72,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_65","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν δὴ διανοητέον καὶ περὶ τοῦ συναμφοτέρου, ζῷον ὃ καλοῦμεν, ὡς ὅταν τε ἐν αὐτῷ ψυχὴ κρείττων  οὖσα σώματος περιθύμως ἴσχῃ, διασείουσα πᾶν αὐτὸ ἔνδοθεν νόσων ἐμπίμπλησι, καὶ ὅταν εἴς τινας μαθήσεις καὶ ζητήσεις συντόνως ἴῃ, κατατήκει, διδαχάς τʼ αὖ καὶ μάχας ἐν λόγοις ποιουμένη δημοσίᾳ καὶ ἰδίᾳ διʼ ἐρίδων καὶ φιλονικίας γιγνομένων διάπυρον αὐτὸ ποιοῦσα σαλεύει, καὶ ῥεύματα ἐπάγουσα, τῶν λεγομένων ἰατρῶν ἀπατῶσα τοὺς πλείστους, τἀναίται αἰτιᾶσθαι ποιεῖ· σῶμά τε ὅταν αὖ μέγα καὶ ὑπέρψυχον σμικρᾷ συμφυὲς ἀσθενεῖ τε διανοίᾳ γένηται, διττῶν  ἐπιθυμιῶν οὐσῶν φύσει κατʼ ἀνθρώπους, διὰ σῶμα μὲν τροφῆς, διὰ δὲ τὸ θειότατον τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν φρονήσεως, αἱ τοῦ κρείττονος κινήσεις κρατοῦσαι καὶ τὸ μὲν σφέτερον αὔξουσαι, τὸ δὲ τῆς ψυχῆς κωφὸν καὶ δυσμαθὲς ἀμνῆμόν τε ποιοῦσαι, τὴν μεγίστην νόσον ἀμαθίαν ἐναπεργάζονται. μία δὴ σωτηρία πρὸς ἄμφω, μήτε τὴν ψυχὴν ἄνευ σώματος κινεῖν μήτε σῶμα ἄνευ ψυχῆς, ἵνα ἀμυνομένω γίγνησθον ἰσορρόπω καὶ  ὑγιῆ. τὸν δὴ μαθηματικὸν ἤ τινα ἄλλην σφόδρα μελέτην διανοίᾳ κατεργαζόμενον καὶ τὴν τοῦ σώματος ἀποδοτέον κίνησιν, γυμναστικῇ προσομιλοῦντα, τόν τε αὖ σῶμα ἐπιμελῶς πλάττοντα τὰς τῆς ψυχῆς ἀνταποδοτέον κινήσεις, μουσικῇ καὶ πάσῃ φιλοσοφίᾳ προσχρώμενον, εἰ μέλλει δικαίως τις ἅμα μὲν καλός, ἅμα δὲ ἀγαθὸς ὀρθῶς κεκλῆσθαι. κατὰ δὲ ταὐτὰ ταῦτα καὶ τὰ μέρη θεραπευτέον, τὸ τοῦ παντὸς  ἀπομιμούμενον εἶδος. τοῦ γὰρ σώματος ὑπὸ τῶν εἰσιόντων καομένου τε ἐντὸς καὶ ψυχομένου, καὶ πάλιν ὑπὸ τῶν ἔξωθεν ξηραινομένου καὶ ὑγραινομένου καὶ τὰ τούτοις ἀκόλουθα πάσχοντος ὑπʼ ἀμφοτέρων τῶν κινήσεων, ὅταν μέν τις ἡσυχίαν ἄγον τὸ σῶμα παραδιδῷ ταῖς κινήσεσι, κρατηθὲν διώλετο, ἐὰν δὲ ἥν τε τροφὸν καὶ τιθήνην τοῦ παντὸς προσείπομεν μιμῆταί τις, καὶ τὸ σῶμα μάλιστα μὲν μηδέποτε ἡσυχίαν ἄγειν ἐᾷ, κινῇ δὲ καὶ σεισμοὺς ἀεί τινας ἐμποιῶν αὐτῷ διὰ  παντὸς τὰς ἐντὸς καὶ ἐκτὸς ἀμύνηται κατὰ φύσιν κινήσεις, καὶ μετρίως σείων τά τε περὶ τὸ σῶμα πλανώμενα παθήματα καὶ μέρη κατὰ συγγενείας εἰς τάξιν κατακοσμῇ πρὸς ἄλληλα, κατὰ τὸν πρόσθεν λόγον ὃν περὶ τοῦ παντὸς ἐλέγομεν, οὐκ ἐχθρὸν παρʼ ἐχθρὸν τιθέμενον ἐάσει πολέμους ἐντίκτειν τῷ σώματι καὶ νόσους, ἀλλὰ φίλον παρὰ φίλον τεθὲν ὑγίειαν  ἀπεργαζόμενον παρέξει.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ταὐτὸν δὴ διανοητέον καὶ περὶ τοῦ συναμφοτέρου, ζῷον ὃ καλοῦμεν, ὡς ὅταν τε ἐν αὐτῷ ψυχὴ κρείττων  οὖσα σώματος περιθύμως ἴσχῃ, διασείουσα πᾶν αὐτὸ ἔνδοθεν νόσων ἐμπίμπλησι, καὶ ὅταν εἴς τινας μαθήσεις καὶ ζητήσεις συντόνως ἴῃ, κατατήκει, διδαχάς τʼ αὖ καὶ μάχας ἐν λόγοις ποιουμένη δημοσίᾳ καὶ ἰδίᾳ διʼ ἐρίδων καὶ φιλονικίας γιγνομένων διάπυρον αὐτὸ ποιοῦσα σαλεύει, καὶ ῥεύματα ἐπάγουσα, τῶν λεγομένων ἰατρῶν ἀπατῶσα τοὺς πλείστους, τἀναίται αἰτιᾶσθαι ποιεῖ· σῶμά τε ὅταν αὖ μέγα καὶ ὑπέρψυχον σμικρᾷ συμφυὲς ἀσθενεῖ τε διανοίᾳ γένηται, διττῶν  ἐπιθυμιῶν οὐσῶν φύσει κατʼ ἀνθρώπους, διὰ σῶμα μὲν τροφῆς, διὰ δὲ τὸ θειότατον τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν φρονήσεως, αἱ τοῦ κρείττονος κινήσεις κρατοῦσαι καὶ τὸ μὲν σφέτερον αὔξουσαι, τὸ δὲ τῆς ψυχῆς κωφὸν καὶ δυσμαθὲς ἀμνῆμόν τε ποιοῦσαι, τὴν μεγίστην νόσον ἀμαθίαν ἐναπεργάζονται.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","text":"μία δὴ σωτηρία πρὸς ἄμφω, μήτε τὴν ψυχὴν ἄνευ σώματος κινεῖν μήτε σῶμα ἄνευ ψυχῆς, ἵνα ἀμυνομένω γίγνησθον ἰσορρόπω καὶ  ὑγιῆ. τὸν δὴ μαθηματικὸν ἤ τινα ἄλλην σφόδρα μελέτην διανοίᾳ κατεργαζόμενον καὶ τὴν τοῦ σώματος ἀποδοτέον κίνησιν, γυμναστικῇ προσομιλοῦντα, τόν τε αὖ σῶμα ἐπιμελῶς πλάττοντα τὰς τῆς ψυχῆς ἀνταποδοτέον κινήσεις, μουσικῇ καὶ πάσῃ φιλοσοφίᾳ προσχρώμενον, εἰ μέλλει δικαίως τις ἅμα μὲν καλός, ἅμα δὲ ἀγαθὸς ὀρθῶς κεκλῆσθαι. κατὰ δὲ ταὐτὰ ταῦτα καὶ τὰ μέρη θεραπευτέον, τὸ τοῦ παντὸς  ἀπομιμούμενον εἶδος.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","text":"τοῦ γὰρ σώματος ὑπὸ τῶν εἰσιόντων καομένου τε ἐντὸς καὶ ψυχομένου, καὶ πάλιν ὑπὸ τῶν ἔξωθεν ξηραινομένου καὶ ὑγραινομένου καὶ τὰ τούτοις ἀκόλουθα πάσχοντος ὑπʼ ἀμφοτέρων τῶν κινήσεων, ὅταν μέν τις ἡσυχίαν ἄγον τὸ σῶμα παραδιδῷ ταῖς κινήσεσι, κρατηθὲν διώλετο, ἐὰν δὲ ἥν τε τροφὸν καὶ τιθήνην τοῦ παντὸς προσείπομεν μιμῆταί τις, καὶ τὸ σῶμα μάλιστα μὲν μηδέποτε ἡσυχίαν ἄγειν ἐᾷ, κινῇ δὲ καὶ σεισμοὺς ἀεί τινας ἐμποιῶν αὐτῷ διὰ  παντὸς τὰς ἐντὸς καὶ ἐκτὸς ἀμύνηται κατὰ φύσιν κινήσεις, καὶ μετρίως σείων τά τε περὶ τὸ σῶμα πλανώμενα παθήματα καὶ μέρη κατὰ συγγενείας εἰς τάξιν κατακοσμῇ πρὸς ἄλληλα, κατὰ τὸν πρόσθεν λόγον ὃν περὶ τοῦ παντὸς ἐλέγομεν, οὐκ ἐχθρὸν παρʼ ἐχθρὸν τιθέμενον ἐάσει πολέμους ἐντίκτειν τῷ σώματι καὶ νόσους, ἀλλὰ φίλον παρὰ φίλον τεθὲν ὑγίειαν  ἀπεργαζόμενον παρέξει.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"ad7f8fe17ff070ea084412b0d0eadb60de37fcc5f830e4f1d09c5e07d39d27b3","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225436448533Z_ca7ac3cb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 88","source_sha256":"ad7f8fe17ff070ea084412b0d0eadb60de37fcc5f830e4f1d09c5e07d39d27b3","sha256":"43cdc9a5f069da94b04ad58878280a6fe122b2ae0562757dda841c6f8588828b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:36.448677+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","text":"The same, then, must be understood also concerning the combined whole, which we call a living creature: whenever in it the soul, being stronger than the body, vehemently holds sway, shaking the whole of it from within and filling it with diseases; and whenever it goes intensely into certain studies and investigations, it wears it away; and again, when, in giving instruction and engaging in contests of argument, publicly and privately, through contentions and quarrels that arise, it makes it feverish and sets it in agitation, bringing on fluxes and deceiving most of those called physicians, causing them to assign the causes to what is not responsible. And whenever, again, a large body, joined to a small and weak intellect, comes to be over-souled, since there are by nature among human beings two desires, one for nourishment on account of the body, the other for wisdom on account of that most divine thing within us, the motions of the stronger prevail and increase what belongs to themselves, while making that of the soul dull, difficult to learn, and forgetful, and produce the greatest disease, ignorance.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","text":"There is then one preservation against both: neither to move the soul without the body nor the body without the soul, in order that, defending themselves against one another, they may become balanced and healthy. Thus, to one who works out mathematics or some other intensive study with his intellect, bodily motion must also be given, by his associating with gymnastics; and to one who carefully fashions his body, the motions of the soul must in turn be given, by his making use of music and all philosophy, if he is rightly to be called at once beautiful and at once good. And in the same way these parts too must be cared for, imitating the form of the whole.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","text":"For when the body is burned within by what enters it and cooled, and again dried and moistened by what is outside, and undergoes the consequences of these from both kinds of motion, whenever someone surrenders the body in a state of rest to these motions, it is overcome and perishes. But if someone imitates that which we called the nourisher and nurse of the whole, and above all never allows the body to remain at rest, but keeps it in motion and, continually producing certain shakings in it throughout, naturally defends against the motions within and without, and by shaking moderately brings into order with one another, according to their kinships, the wandering affections and parts about the body—according to the earlier account which we gave concerning the whole—he will not allow enemy set beside enemy to engender wars and diseases in the body; rather, friend set beside friend, producing health, he will provide.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"1d855e3ca692306753ee00259ba368a8213b1dbb373fb55778a43e87fc75434c","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 88"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 88","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66","title":"Section 89","order":73,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_66","text":"ΤΙ. τῶν δʼ αὖ κινήσεων ἡ ἐν ἑαυτῷ ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ ἀρίστη κίνησις—μάλιστα γὰρ τῇ διανοητικῇ καὶ τῇ τοῦ παντὸς κινήσει συγγενής—ἡ δὲ ὑπʼ ἄλλου χείρων· χειρίστη δὲ ἡ κειμένου τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἄγοντος ἡσυχίαν διʼ ἑτέρων αὐτὸ κατὰ μέρη κινοῦσα. διὸ δὴ τῶν καθάρσεων καὶ συστάσεων τοῦ σώματος ἡ μὲν διὰ τῶν γυμνασίων ἀρίστη, δευτέρα δὲ ἡ διὰ τῶν αἰωρήσεων κατά τε τοὺς πλοῦς καὶ ὅπῃπερ ἂν ὀχήσεις ἄκοποι γίγνωνται· τρίτον δὲ εἶδος κινήσεως  σφόδρα ποτὲ ἀναγκαζομένῳ χρήσιμον, ἄλλως δὲ οὐδαμῶς τῷ νοῦν ἔχοντι προσδεκτέον, τὸ τῆς φαρμακευτικῆς καθάρσεως γιγνόμενον ἰατρικόν. τὰ γὰρ νοσήματα, ὅσα μὴ μεγάλους ἔχει κινδύνους, οὐκ ἐρεθιστέον φαρμακείαις. πᾶσα γὰρ σύστασις νόσων τρόπον τινὰ τῇ τῶν ζῴων φύσει προσέοικε. καὶ γὰρ ἡ τούτων σύνοδος ἔχουσα τεταγμένους τοῦ βίου γίγνεται χρόνους τοῦ τε γένους σύμπαντος, καὶ καθʼ αὑτὸ τὸ ζῷον εἱμαρμένον ἕκαστον ἔχον τὸν βίον φύεται,  χωρὶς τῶν ἐξ ἀνάγκης παθημάτων· τὰ γὰρ τρίγωνα εὐθὺς κατʼ ἀρχὰς ἑκάστου δύναμιν ἔχοντα συνίσταται μέχρι τινὸς χρόνου δυνατὰ ἐξαρκεῖν, οὗ βίον οὐκ ἄν ποτέ τις εἰς τὸ πέραν ἔτι βιῴη. τρόπος οὖν ὁ αὐτὸς καὶ τῆς περὶ τὰ νοσήματα συστάσεως· ἣν ὅταν τις παρὰ τὴν εἱμαρμένην τοῦ χρόνου φθείρῃ φαρμακείαις, ἅμα ἐκ σμικρῶν μεγάλα καὶ πολλὰ ἐξ ὀλίγων νοσήματα φιλεῖ γίγνεσθαι. διὸ παιδαγωγεῖν δεῖ διαίταις πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα, καθʼ ὅσον ἂν ᾖ τῳ σχολή,  ἀλλʼ οὐ φαρμακεύοντα κακὸν δύσκολον ἐρεθιστέον. καὶ περὶ μὲν τοῦ κοινοῦ ζῴου καὶ τοῦ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα αὐτοῦ μέρους, ᾗ τις ἂν καὶ διαπαιδαγωγῶν καὶ διαπαιδαγωγούμενος ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ μάλιστʼ ἂν κατὰ λόγον ζῴη, ταύτῃ λελέχθω· τὸ δὲ δὴ παιδαγωγῆσον αὐτὸ μᾶλλόν που καὶ πρότερον παρασκευαστέον εἰς δύναμιν ὅτι κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον εἰς τὴν παιδαγωγίαν εἶναι. διʼ ἀκριβείας μὲν οὖν περὶ τούτων  διελθεῖν ἱκανὸν ἂν γένοιτο αὐτὸ καθʼ αὑτὸ μόνον ἔργον· τὸ δʼ ἐν παρέργῳ κατὰ τὰ πρόσθεν ἑπόμενος ἄν τις οὐκ ἄπο τρόπου τῇδε σκοπῶν ὧδε τῷ λόγῳ διαπεράναιτʼ ἄν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τῶν δʼ αὖ κινήσεων ἡ ἐν ἑαυτῷ ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ ἀρίστη κίνησις—μάλιστα γὰρ τῇ διανοητικῇ καὶ τῇ τοῦ παντὸς κινήσει συγγενής—ἡ δὲ ὑπʼ ἄλλου χείρων· χειρίστη δὲ ἡ κειμένου τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἄγοντος ἡσυχίαν διʼ ἑτέρων αὐτὸ κατὰ μέρη κινοῦσα. διὸ δὴ τῶν καθάρσεων καὶ συστάσεων τοῦ σώματος ἡ μὲν διὰ τῶν γυμνασίων ἀρίστη, δευτέρα δὲ ἡ διὰ τῶν αἰωρήσεων κατά τε τοὺς πλοῦς καὶ ὅπῃπερ ἂν ὀχήσεις ἄκοποι γίγνωνται· τρίτον δὲ εἶδος κινήσεως  σφόδρα ποτὲ ἀναγκαζομένῳ χρήσιμον, ἄλλως δὲ οὐδαμῶς τῷ νοῦν ἔχοντι προσδεκτέον, τὸ τῆς φαρμακευτικῆς καθάρσεως γιγνόμενον ἰατρικόν. τὰ γὰρ νοσήματα, ὅσα μὴ μεγάλους ἔχει κινδύνους, οὐκ ἐρεθιστέον φαρμακείαις. πᾶσα γὰρ σύστασις νόσων τρόπον τινὰ τῇ τῶν ζῴων φύσει προσέοικε.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","text":"καὶ γὰρ ἡ τούτων σύνοδος ἔχουσα τεταγμένους τοῦ βίου γίγνεται χρόνους τοῦ τε γένους σύμπαντος, καὶ καθʼ αὑτὸ τὸ ζῷον εἱμαρμένον ἕκαστον ἔχον τὸν βίον φύεται,  χωρὶς τῶν ἐξ ἀνάγκης παθημάτων· τὰ γὰρ τρίγωνα εὐθὺς κατʼ ἀρχὰς ἑκάστου δύναμιν ἔχοντα συνίσταται μέχρι τινὸς χρόνου δυνατὰ ἐξαρκεῖν, οὗ βίον οὐκ ἄν ποτέ τις εἰς τὸ πέραν ἔτι βιῴη. τρόπος οὖν ὁ αὐτὸς καὶ τῆς περὶ τὰ νοσήματα συστάσεως· ἣν ὅταν τις παρὰ τὴν εἱμαρμένην τοῦ χρόνου φθείρῃ φαρμακείαις, ἅμα ἐκ σμικρῶν μεγάλα καὶ πολλὰ ἐξ ὀλίγων νοσήματα φιλεῖ γίγνεσθαι. διὸ παιδαγωγεῖν δεῖ διαίταις πάντα τὰ τοιαῦτα, καθʼ ὅσον ἂν ᾖ τῳ σχολή,  ἀλλʼ οὐ φαρμακεύοντα κακὸν δύσκολον ἐρεθιστέον.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","text":"καὶ περὶ μὲν τοῦ κοινοῦ ζῴου καὶ τοῦ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα αὐτοῦ μέρους, ᾗ τις ἂν καὶ διαπαιδαγωγῶν καὶ διαπαιδαγωγούμενος ὑφʼ αὑτοῦ μάλιστʼ ἂν κατὰ λόγον ζῴη, ταύτῃ λελέχθω· τὸ δὲ δὴ παιδαγωγῆσον αὐτὸ μᾶλλόν που καὶ πρότερον παρασκευαστέον εἰς δύναμιν ὅτι κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον εἰς τὴν παιδαγωγίαν εἶναι. διʼ ἀκριβείας μὲν οὖν περὶ τούτων  διελθεῖν ἱκανὸν ἂν γένοιτο αὐτὸ καθʼ αὑτὸ μόνον ἔργον· τὸ δʼ ἐν παρέργῳ κατὰ τὰ πρόσθεν ἑπόμενος ἄν τις οὐκ ἄπο τρόπου τῇδε σκοπῶν ὧδε τῷ λόγῳ διαπεράναιτʼ ἄν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"e4e4316ef3cefbcc2f8679c9f82c319df16f2273594a562a7705266191b728a4","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225449743642Z_cbb00ad4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 89","source_sha256":"e4e4316ef3cefbcc2f8679c9f82c319df16f2273594a562a7705266191b728a4","sha256":"6ab8a34fd3c91213a3d111ffce053569133a0abe3a0cb61b53706f4f2d61addc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:49.743675+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","text":"TI. And of motions, the motion in itself, produced by itself, is best—for it is most akin to the motion of understanding and to that of the universe—whereas that produced by another is inferior; and worst is that which, while the body lies still and remains at rest, moves it piecemeal through others. Wherefore, of the purifications and restorations of the body, that effected through exercises is best; second is that effected through swayings, both in voyages and wherever else effortless conveyances occur; and a third kind of motion, useful when one is at times under strong compulsion, but otherwise in no way to be admitted by a man of understanding, is the medical one produced by pharmaceutical purgation. For diseases, so far as they involve no great dangers, must not be irritated by drugs. For every constitution of diseases is in some way like the nature of living creatures.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","text":"For the conjunction of these also comes to be with fixed periods of life, both for the whole kind and for each living creature individually, which is born possessing its allotted life, apart from affections arising from necessity. For the triangles, possessing from the very beginning of each its power, are so constituted as to be able to suffice for a certain time, beyond which no one could ever live on. The same is therefore the case with the constitution concerned with diseases: whenever someone, by drugs, destroys it contrary to the allotted term of time, great and numerous diseases are wont to arise at once from small and few ones. Wherefore all such things must be regulated by regimens, insofar as one has leisure, but one must not irritate a difficult evil by medicating it.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","text":"And concerning the common living creature and the part of it that is according to its body—how one, both guiding and being guided by oneself, might live most in accordance with reason—let this have been said. But that which is to guide it must surely be prepared, more and beforehand, to be as fair and excellent as possible in capacity for the guidance. To go through these matters with precision might indeed become a sufficient task in itself alone; but, following on the preceding discussion by way of an accessory task, one would not unreasonably, by considering the matter in this way, carry the account through as follows.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"054456de50f2375170cd3fc0827f9e57e3cb2a1d3893cefe50010adadd88c933","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 89"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 89","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9","title":"Section 90","order":74,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9","text":"ΤΙ. καθάπερ εἴπομεν πολλάκις, ὅτι τρία τριχῇ ψυχῆς ἐν ἡμῖν εἴδη κατῴκισται, τυγχάνει δὲ ἕκαστον κινήσεις ἔχον, οὕτω κατὰ ταὐτὰ καὶ νῦν ὡς διὰ βραχυτάτων ῥητέον ὅτι τὸ μὲν αὐτῶν ἐν ἀργίᾳ διάγον καὶ τῶν ἑαυτοῦ κινήσεων ἡσυχίαν ἄγον ἀσθενέστατον ἀνάγκη γίγνεσθαι, τὸ δʼ ἐν γυμνασίοις ἐρρωμενέστατον·  διὸ φυλακτέον ὅπως ἂν ἔχωσιν τὰς κινήσεις πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμέτρους. τὸ δὲ δὴ περὶ τοῦ κυριωτάτου παρʼ ἡμῖν ψυχῆς εἴδους διανοεῖσθαι δεῖ τῇδε, ὡς ἄρα αὐτὸ δαίμονα θεὸς ἑκάστῳ δέδωκεν, τοῦτο ὃ δή φαμεν οἰκεῖν μὲν ἡμῶν ἐπʼ ἄκρῳ τῷ σώματι, πρὸς δὲ τὴν ἐν οὐρανῷ συγγένειαν ἀπὸ γῆς ἡμᾶς αἴρειν ὡς ὄντας φυτὸν οὐκ ἔγγειον ἀλλὰ οὐράνιον, ὀρθότατα λέγοντες· ἐκεῖθεν γάρ, ὅθεν ἡ πρώτη τῆς ψυχῆς γένεσις ἔφυ, τὸ θεῖον τὴν κεφαλὴν καὶ ῥίζαν ἡμῶν  ἀνακρεμαννὺν ὀρθοῖ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα. τῷ μὲν οὖν περὶ τὰς ἐπιθυμίας ἢ περὶ φιλονικίας τετευτακότι καὶ ταῦτα διαπονοῦντι σφόδρα πάντα τὰ δόγματα ἀνάγκη θνητὰ ἐγγεγονέναι, καὶ παντάπασιν καθʼ ὅσον μάλιστα δυνατὸν θνητῷ γίγνεσθαι, τούτου μηδὲ σμικρὸν ἐλλείπειν, ἅτε τὸ τοιοῦτον ηὐξηκότι· τῷ δὲ περὶ φιλομαθίαν καὶ περὶ τὰς ἀληθεῖς φρονήσεις ἐσπουδακότι καὶ ταῦτα μάλιστα τῶν αὑτοῦ γεγυμνασμένῳ  φρονεῖν μὲν ἀθάνατα καὶ θεῖα, ἄνπερ ἀληθείας ἐφάπτηται, πᾶσα ἀνάγκη που, καθʼ ὅσον δʼ αὖ μετασχεῖν ἀνθρωπίνῃ φύσει ἀθανασίας ἐνδέχεται, τούτου μηδὲν μέρος ἀπολείπειν, ἅτε δὲ ἀεὶ θεραπεύοντα τὸ θεῖον ἔχοντά τε αὐτὸν εὖ κεκοσμημένον τὸν δαίμονα σύνοικον ἑαυτῷ, διαφερόντως εὐδαίμονα εἶναι. θεραπεία δὲ δὴ παντὶ παντὸς μία, τὰς οἰκείας ἑκάστῳ τροφὰς καὶ κινήσεις ἀποδιδόναι. τῷ δʼ ἐν ἡμῖν θείῳ συγγενεῖς εἰσιν κινήσεις αἱ τοῦ παντὸς διανοήσεις  καὶ περιφοραί· ταύταις δὴ συνεπόμενον ἕκαστον δεῖ, τὰς περὶ τὴν γένεσιν ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ διεφθαρμένας ἡμῶν περιόδους ἐξορθοῦντα διὰ τὸ καταμανθάνειν τὰς τοῦ παντὸς ἁρμονίας τε καὶ περιφοράς, τῷ κατανοουμένῳ τὸ κατανοοῦν ἐξομοιῶσαι κατὰ τὴν ἀρχαίαν φύσιν, ὁμοιώσαντα δὲ τέλος ἔχειν τοῦ προτεθέντος ἀνθρώποις ὑπὸ θεῶν ἀρίστου βίου πρός τε τὸν παρόντα καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον.  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ νῦν ἡμῖν ἐξ ἀρχῆς παραγγελθέντα διεξελθεῖν περὶ τοῦ παντὸς μέχρι γενέσεως ἀνθρωπίνης σχεδὸν ἔοικε τέλος ἔχειν. τὰ γὰρ ἄλλα ζῷα ᾗ γέγονεν αὖ, διὰ βραχέων ἐπιμνηστέον, ὃ μή τις ἀνάγκη μηκύνειν· οὕτω γὰρ ἐμμετρότερός τις ἂν αὑτῷ δόξειεν περὶ τοὺς τούτων λόγους εἶναι. τῇδʼ οὖν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἔστω λεγόμενον.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. καθάπερ εἴπομεν πολλάκις, ὅτι τρία τριχῇ ψυχῆς ἐν ἡμῖν εἴδη κατῴκισται, τυγχάνει δὲ ἕκαστον κινήσεις ἔχον, οὕτω κατὰ ταὐτὰ καὶ νῦν ὡς διὰ βραχυτάτων ῥητέον ὅτι τὸ μὲν αὐτῶν ἐν ἀργίᾳ διάγον καὶ τῶν ἑαυτοῦ κινήσεων ἡσυχίαν ἄγον ἀσθενέστατον ἀνάγκη γίγνεσθαι, τὸ δʼ ἐν γυμνασίοις ἐρρωμενέστατον·  διὸ φυλακτέον ὅπως ἂν ἔχωσιν τὰς κινήσεις πρὸς ἄλληλα συμμέτρους. τὸ δὲ δὴ περὶ τοῦ κυριωτάτου παρʼ ἡμῖν ψυχῆς εἴδους διανοεῖσθαι δεῖ τῇδε, ὡς ἄρα αὐτὸ δαίμονα θεὸς ἑκάστῳ δέδωκεν, τοῦτο ὃ δή φαμεν οἰκεῖν μὲν ἡμῶν ἐπʼ ἄκρῳ τῷ σώματι, πρὸς δὲ τὴν ἐν οὐρανῷ συγγένειαν ἀπὸ γῆς ἡμᾶς αἴρειν ὡς ὄντας φυτὸν οὐκ ἔγγειον ἀλλὰ οὐράνιον, ὀρθότατα λέγοντες· ἐκεῖθεν γάρ, ὅθεν ἡ πρώτη τῆς ψυχῆς γένεσις ἔφυ, τὸ θεῖον τὴν κεφαλὴν καὶ ῥίζαν ἡμῶν  ἀνακρεμαννὺν ὀρθοῖ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","text":"τῷ μὲν οὖν περὶ τὰς ἐπιθυμίας ἢ περὶ φιλονικίας τετευτακότι καὶ ταῦτα διαπονοῦντι σφόδρα πάντα τὰ δόγματα ἀνάγκη θνητὰ ἐγγεγονέναι, καὶ παντάπασιν καθʼ ὅσον μάλιστα δυνατὸν θνητῷ γίγνεσθαι, τούτου μηδὲ σμικρὸν ἐλλείπειν, ἅτε τὸ τοιοῦτον ηὐξηκότι· τῷ δὲ περὶ φιλομαθίαν καὶ περὶ τὰς ἀληθεῖς φρονήσεις ἐσπουδακότι καὶ ταῦτα μάλιστα τῶν αὑτοῦ γεγυμνασμένῳ  φρονεῖν μὲν ἀθάνατα καὶ θεῖα, ἄνπερ ἀληθείας ἐφάπτηται, πᾶσα ἀνάγκη που, καθʼ ὅσον δʼ αὖ μετασχεῖν ἀνθρωπίνῃ φύσει ἀθανασίας ἐνδέχεται, τούτου μηδὲν μέρος ἀπολείπειν, ἅτε δὲ ἀεὶ θεραπεύοντα τὸ θεῖον ἔχοντά τε αὐτὸν εὖ κεκοσμημένον τὸν δαίμονα σύνοικον ἑαυτῷ, διαφερόντως εὐδαίμονα εἶναι. θεραπεία δὲ δὴ παντὶ παντὸς μία, τὰς οἰκείας ἑκάστῳ τροφὰς καὶ κινήσεις ἀποδιδόναι.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","text":"τῷ δʼ ἐν ἡμῖν θείῳ συγγενεῖς εἰσιν κινήσεις αἱ τοῦ παντὸς διανοήσεις  καὶ περιφοραί· ταύταις δὴ συνεπόμενον ἕκαστον δεῖ, τὰς περὶ τὴν γένεσιν ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ διεφθαρμένας ἡμῶν περιόδους ἐξορθοῦντα διὰ τὸ καταμανθάνειν τὰς τοῦ παντὸς ἁρμονίας τε καὶ περιφοράς, τῷ κατανοουμένῳ τὸ κατανοοῦν ἐξομοιῶσαι κατὰ τὴν ἀρχαίαν φύσιν, ὁμοιώσαντα δὲ τέλος ἔχειν τοῦ προτεθέντος ἀνθρώποις ὑπὸ θεῶν ἀρίστου βίου πρός τε τὸν παρόντα καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον.  καὶ δὴ καὶ τὰ νῦν ἡμῖν ἐξ ἀρχῆς παραγγελθέντα διεξελθεῖν περὶ τοῦ παντὸς μέχρι γενέσεως ἀνθρωπίνης σχεδὸν ἔοικε τέλος ἔχειν. τὰ γὰρ ἄλλα ζῷα ᾗ γέγονεν αὖ, διὰ βραχέων ἐπιμνηστέον, ὃ μή τις ἀνάγκη μηκύνειν· οὕτω γὰρ ἐμμετρότερός τις ἂν αὑτῷ δόξειεν περὶ τοὺς τούτων λόγους εἶναι. τῇδʼ οὖν τὸ τοιοῦτον ἔστω λεγόμενον.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"bf60dab7d97f42f3dd09e350b2a0d6cfd474447f35c23aaecf292dda3c9852c2","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225458298168Z_5d627493","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 90","source_sha256":"bf60dab7d97f42f3dd09e350b2a0d6cfd474447f35c23aaecf292dda3c9852c2","sha256":"d3067934cfe041059b0c53b7b722872b988cd02c7b65b5d6e66cf9ca0ff39c35","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:54:58.298203+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","text":"Timaeus. As we have often said, since three kinds of soul, divided three ways, have been established within us, and each happens to possess motions, so now too, in the briefest possible terms, it must be said that whichever of them passes its time in idleness and keeps its own motions at rest must necessarily become weakest, whereas that which is in exercise becomes strongest. Therefore care must be taken that they have motions commensurate with one another. And concerning the most authoritative kind of soul within us, one must conceive as follows: that god has given it to each person as a divinity, that which, we say, dwells at the summit of our body and raises us from earth toward our kinship in heaven, since we are a plant not earthly but heavenly—speaking most rightly. For from that place whence the first generation of the soul sprang, the divine, suspending our head and root, keeps the whole body upright.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","text":"For one who has devoted himself to desires or to contentious ambition, and has laboured intensely at these things, all his opinions must necessarily have become mortal, and, insofar as it is most possible to become mortal, he must fall short in no respect thereof, since he has fostered what is of such a kind. But one who has been earnest about love of learning and true thoughts, and has especially exercised these faculties of his own, must necessarily, if he lays hold of truth, think immortal and divine things; and insofar, again, as it is possible for human nature to partake of immortality, he falls short in no part thereof. And since he always tends the divine and has the divinity that dwells with him well ordered, he is pre-eminently blessed. There is indeed one treatment for every thing: to render to each its proper nourishment and motions.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","text":"The motions akin to the divine within us are the thoughts and revolutions of the universe. Each person, then, must follow these, correcting the revolutions in our head that have been corrupted through generation, by learning thoroughly the harmonies and revolutions of the universe; he must make that which thinks like unto that which is thought, according to its ancient nature, and, having made it like, attain the end of the best life appointed by the gods for human beings, both for the present time and for that which follows.\n\nAnd indeed, the things enjoined upon us from the beginning, concerning the universe down to the generation of humans, now seem almost to have reached their end. For as to how the other animals in turn came into being, it must be mentioned briefly; there is no need for anyone to prolong the account. For thus one would seem to oneself to be more moderate in these discussions. Let the matter, then, be stated as follows.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"00ef34cf53c1d43d0ef72d19e778037ee2f77ab6ca04be68ec804560cd099a12","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 90"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 90","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67","title":"Section 91","order":75,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_67","text":"ΤΙ. τῶν γενομένων ἀνδρῶν ὅσοι δειλοὶ καὶ τὸν βίον ἀδίκως διῆλθον, κατὰ λόγον τὸν εἰκότα γυναῖκες μετεφύοντο ἐν τῇ δευτέρᾳ  γενέσει· καὶ κατʼ ἐκεῖνον δὴ τὸν χρόνον διὰ ταῦτα θεοὶ τὸν τῆς συνουσίας ἔρωτα ἐτεκτήναντο, ζῷον τὸ μὲν ἐν ἡμῖν, τὸ δʼ ἐν ταῖς γυναιξὶν συστήσαντες ἔμψυχον, τοιῷδε τρόπῳ ποιήσαντες ἑκάτερον. τὴν τοῦ ποτοῦ διέξοδον, ᾗ διὰ τοῦ πλεύμονος τὸ πῶμα ὑπὸ τοὺς νεφροὺς εἰς τὴν κύστιν ἐλθὸν καὶ τῷ πνεύματι θλιφθὲν συνεκπέμπει δεχομένη, συνέτρησαν εἰς τὸν ἐκ τῆς κεφαλῆς κατὰ τὸν αὐχένα καὶ διὰ τῆς ῥάχεως  μυελὸν συμπεπηγότα, ὃν δὴ σπέρμα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν λόγοις εἴπομεν· ὁ δέ, ἅτʼ ἔμψυχος ὢν καὶ λαβὼν ἀναπνοήν, τοῦθʼ ᾗπερ ἀνέπνευσεν, τῆς ἐκροῆς ζωτικὴν ἐπιθυμίαν ἐμποιήσας αὐτῷ, τοῦ γεννᾶν ἔρωτα ἀπετέλεσεν. διὸ δὴ τῶν μὲν ἀνδρῶν τὸ περὶ τὴν τῶν αἰδοίων φύσιν ἀπειθές τε καὶ αὐτοκρατὲς γεγονός, οἷον ζῷον ἀνυπήκοον τοῦ λόγου, πάντων διʼ ἐπιθυμίας οἰστρώδεις ἐπιχειρεῖ κρατεῖν· αἱ δʼ ἐν  ταῖς γυναιξὶν αὖ μῆτραί τε καὶ ὑστέραι λεγόμεναι διὰ τὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτα, ζῷον ἐπιθυμητικὸν ἐνὸν τῆς παιδοποιίας, ὅταν ἄκαρπον παρὰ τὴν ὥραν χρόνον πολὺν γίγνηται, χαλεπῶς ἀγανακτοῦν φέρει, καὶ πλανώμενον πάντῃ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα, τὰς τοῦ πνεύματος διεξόδους ἀποφράττον, ἀναπνεῖν οὐκ ἐῶν εἰς ἀπορίας τὰς ἐσχάτας ἐμβάλλει καὶ νόσους παντοδαπὰς ἄλλας παρέχει, μέχριπερ ἂν ἑκατέρων ἡ ἐπιθυμία καὶ ὁ  ἔρως συναγαγόντες, οἷον ἀπὸ δένδρων καρπὸν καταδρέψαντες, ὡς εἰς ἄρουραν τὴν μήτραν ἀόρατα ὑπὸ σμικρότητος καὶ ἀδιάπλαστα ζῷα κατασπείραντες καὶ πάλιν διακρίναντες μεγάλα ἐντὸς ἐκθρέψωνται καὶ μετὰ τοῦτο εἰς φῶς ἀγαγόντες ζῴων ἀποτελέσωσι γένεσιν. γυναῖκες μὲν οὖν καὶ τὸ θῆλυ πᾶν οὕτω γέγονεν· τὸ δὲ τῶν ὀρνέων φῦλον μετερρυθμίζετο, ἀντὶ τριχῶν πτερὰ φύον, ἐκ τῶν ἀκάκων ἀνδρῶν, κούφων δέ, καὶ μετεωρολογικῶν μέν, ἡγουμένων δὲ διʼ ὄψεως  τὰς περὶ τούτων ἀποδείξεις βεβαιοτάτας εἶναι διʼ εὐήθειαν. τὸ δʼ αὖ πεζὸν καὶ θηριῶδες γέγονεν ἐκ τῶν μηδὲν προσχρωμένων φιλοσοφίᾳ μηδὲ ἀθρούντων τῆς περὶ τὸν οὐρανὸν φύσεως πέρι μηδέν, διὰ τὸ μηκέτι ταῖς ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ χρῆσθαι περιόδοις, ἀλλὰ τοῖς περὶ τὰ στήθη τῆς ψυχῆς ἡγεμόσιν ἕπεσθαι μέρεσιν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. τῶν γενομένων ἀνδρῶν ὅσοι δειλοὶ καὶ τὸν βίον ἀδίκως διῆλθον, κατὰ λόγον τὸν εἰκότα γυναῖκες μετεφύοντο ἐν τῇ δευτέρᾳ  γενέσει· καὶ κατʼ ἐκεῖνον δὴ τὸν χρόνον διὰ ταῦτα θεοὶ τὸν τῆς συνουσίας ἔρωτα ἐτεκτήναντο, ζῷον τὸ μὲν ἐν ἡμῖν, τὸ δʼ ἐν ταῖς γυναιξὶν συστήσαντες ἔμψυχον, τοιῷδε τρόπῳ ποιήσαντες ἑκάτερον. τὴν τοῦ ποτοῦ διέξοδον, ᾗ διὰ τοῦ πλεύμονος τὸ πῶμα ὑπὸ τοὺς νεφροὺς εἰς τὴν κύστιν ἐλθὸν καὶ τῷ πνεύματι θλιφθὲν συνεκπέμπει δεχομένη, συνέτρησαν εἰς τὸν ἐκ τῆς κεφαλῆς κατὰ τὸν αὐχένα καὶ διὰ τῆς ῥάχεως  μυελὸν συμπεπηγότα, ὃν δὴ σπέρμα ἐν τοῖς πρόσθεν λόγοις εἴπομεν· ὁ δέ, ἅτʼ ἔμψυχος ὢν καὶ λαβὼν ἀναπνοήν, τοῦθʼ ᾗπερ ἀνέπνευσεν, τῆς ἐκροῆς ζωτικὴν ἐπιθυμίαν ἐμποιήσας αὐτῷ, τοῦ γεννᾶν ἔρωτα ἀπετέλεσεν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","text":"διὸ δὴ τῶν μὲν ἀνδρῶν τὸ περὶ τὴν τῶν αἰδοίων φύσιν ἀπειθές τε καὶ αὐτοκρατὲς γεγονός, οἷον ζῷον ἀνυπήκοον τοῦ λόγου, πάντων διʼ ἐπιθυμίας οἰστρώδεις ἐπιχειρεῖ κρατεῖν· αἱ δʼ ἐν  ταῖς γυναιξὶν αὖ μῆτραί τε καὶ ὑστέραι λεγόμεναι διὰ τὰ αὐτὰ ταῦτα, ζῷον ἐπιθυμητικὸν ἐνὸν τῆς παιδοποιίας, ὅταν ἄκαρπον παρὰ τὴν ὥραν χρόνον πολὺν γίγνηται, χαλεπῶς ἀγανακτοῦν φέρει, καὶ πλανώμενον πάντῃ κατὰ τὸ σῶμα, τὰς τοῦ πνεύματος διεξόδους ἀποφράττον, ἀναπνεῖν οὐκ ἐῶν εἰς ἀπορίας τὰς ἐσχάτας ἐμβάλλει καὶ νόσους παντοδαπὰς ἄλλας παρέχει, μέχριπερ ἂν ἑκατέρων ἡ ἐπιθυμία καὶ ὁ  ἔρως συναγαγόντες, οἷον ἀπὸ δένδρων καρπὸν καταδρέψαντες, ὡς εἰς ἄρουραν τὴν μήτραν ἀόρατα ὑπὸ σμικρότητος καὶ ἀδιάπλαστα ζῷα κατασπείραντες καὶ πάλιν διακρίναντες μεγάλα ἐντὸς ἐκθρέψωνται καὶ μετὰ τοῦτο εἰς φῶς ἀγαγόντες ζῴων ἀποτελέσωσι γένεσιν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","text":"γυναῖκες μὲν οὖν καὶ τὸ θῆλυ πᾶν οὕτω γέγονεν· τὸ δὲ τῶν ὀρνέων φῦλον μετερρυθμίζετο, ἀντὶ τριχῶν πτερὰ φύον, ἐκ τῶν ἀκάκων ἀνδρῶν, κούφων δέ, καὶ μετεωρολογικῶν μέν, ἡγουμένων δὲ διʼ ὄψεως  τὰς περὶ τούτων ἀποδείξεις βεβαιοτάτας εἶναι διʼ εὐήθειαν. τὸ δʼ αὖ πεζὸν καὶ θηριῶδες γέγονεν ἐκ τῶν μηδὲν προσχρωμένων φιλοσοφίᾳ μηδὲ ἀθρούντων τῆς περὶ τὸν οὐρανὸν φύσεως πέρι μηδέν, διὰ τὸ μηκέτι ταῖς ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ χρῆσθαι περιόδοις, ἀλλὰ τοῖς περὶ τὰ στήθη τῆς ψυχῆς ἡγεμόσιν ἕπεσθαι μέρεσιν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"9c002c5819ce1aef60edf1b7086d5b997fbd9e73e5de86bfb8b48a0d6035c3fa","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225506436406Z_2c205fd9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 91","source_sha256":"9c002c5819ce1aef60edf1b7086d5b997fbd9e73e5de86bfb8b48a0d6035c3fa","sha256":"1e65008eeed795ce906ec1ae2e73f3ad97277d9d9dc937fa332c5d4f058fac14","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:55:06.436490+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","text":"And as many of the men who had come into being as were cowardly and had passed through life unjustly were, according to the likely account, transplanted into women in the second birth. And at that time, for these reasons, the gods devised the desire for intercourse, establishing a living creature, one in us and the other in women, each made in the following way. They bored together into the marrow, compacted from the head down the neck and through the spine—which in the previous accounts we called seed—the passage for drink, which receives the draught that has come through the lung beneath the kidneys into the bladder and sends it out together by compression with the breath. And this marrow, being animate and having received respiration, implanting in itself, along the very path by which it breathed, a life-giving desire of outflow, brought about the desire to beget.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","text":"Wherefore the part about the nature of the genital organs in men, having become disobedient and self-willed, like a creature unsubmissive to reason, attempts, under the goad of desires, to rule over everything. But in women, in turn, the so-called wombs and uteri, for these same reasons, being a creature within them desirous of childbearing, whenever it remains fruitless for a long time beyond the due season, bears this grievously and indignantly, and, wandering everywhere through the body, obstructing the passages of breath and not allowing respiration, throws them into the utmost perplexities and produces all manner of other diseases, until the desire and love of both, bringing them together, as though plucking fruit from trees, sow into the womb as into a field living creatures invisible because of their smallness and without form, and then, having again distinguished them, rear them large within and thereafter bring them into the light and accomplish the generation of living creatures.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","text":"Thus women and the whole female sex came into being. The race of birds was transformed from harmless but light-minded men, concerned with celestial matters, yet, through simplicity, believing that the surest demonstrations concerning these things were through sight; in place of hair they grew feathers. And the footed and beastly kind came into being from those who made no use at all of philosophy and gave no thought whatever to the nature concerning heaven, because they no longer made use of the revolutions in the head, but followed the ruling parts of the soul around the breast.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003"]}],"source_digest":"b38e38af132911410dd2a8576154edc7c9bb409e83b0185c3dc41c6d22254228","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 91"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 91","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68","title":"Section 92","order":76,"chapter_id":"CH_JP8E_S_68","text":"ΤΙ. ἐκ τούτων οὖν τῶν ἐπιτηδευμάτων τά τʼ ἐμπρόσθια κῶλα καὶ τὰς κεφαλὰς εἰς γῆν ἑλκόμενα ὑπὸ συγγενείας ἤρεισαν, προμήκεις τε καὶ παντοίας ἔσχον τὰς  κορυφάς, ὅπῃ συνεθλίφθησαν ὑπὸ ἀργίας ἑκάστων αἱ περιφοραί· τετράπουν τε τὸ γένος αὐτῶν ἐκ ταύτης ἐφύετο καὶ πολύπουν τῆς προφάσεως, θεοῦ βάσεις ὑποτιθέντος πλείους τοῖς μᾶλλον ἄφροσιν, ὡς μᾶλλον ἐπὶ γῆν ἕλκοιντο. τοῖς δʼ ἀφρονεστάτοις αὐτῶν τούτων καὶ παντάπασιν πρὸς γῆν πᾶν τὸ σῶμα κατατεινομένοις ὡς οὐδὲν ἔτι ποδῶν χρείας οὔσης, ἄποδα αὐτὰ καὶ ἰλυσπώμενα ἐπὶ γῆς ἐγέννησαν. τὸ δὲ  τέταρτον γένος ἔνυδρον γέγονεν ἐκ τῶν μάλιστα ἀνοητοτάτων καὶ ἀμαθεστάτων, οὓς οὐδʼ ἀναπνοῆς καθαρᾶς ἔτι ἠξίωσαν οἱ μεταπλάττοντες, ὡς τὴν ψυχὴν ὑπὸ πλημμελείας πάσης ἀκαθάρτως ἐχόντων, ἀλλʼ ἀντὶ λεπτῆς καὶ καθαρᾶς ἀναπνοῆς ἀέρος εἰς ὕδατος θολερὰν καὶ βαθεῖαν ἔωσαν ἀνάπνευσιν· ὅθεν ἰχθύων ἔθνος καὶ τὸ τῶν ὀστρέων συναπάντων τε ὅσα ἔνυδρα γέγονεν, δίκην ἀμαθίας ἐσχάτης ἐσχάτας οἰκήσεις  εἰληχότων. καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ πάντα τότε καὶ νῦν διαμείβεται τὰ ζῷα εἰς ἄλληλα, νοῦ καὶ ἀνοίας ἀποβολῇ καὶ κτήσει μεταβαλλόμενα. καὶ δὴ καὶ τέλος περὶ τοῦ παντὸς νῦν ἤδη τὸν λόγον ἡμῖν φῶμεν ἔχειν· θνητὰ γὰρ καὶ ἀθάνατα ζῷα λαβὼν καὶ συμπληρωθεὶς ὅδε ὁ κόσμος οὕτω, ζῷον ὁρατὸν τὰ ὁρατὰ περιέχον, εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεὸς αἰσθητός, μέγιστος καὶ ἄριστος κάλλιστός τε καὶ τελεώτατος γέγονεν εἷς οὐρανὸς ὅδε μονογενὴς ὤν.","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","text":"ΤΙ. ἐκ τούτων οὖν τῶν ἐπιτηδευμάτων τά τʼ ἐμπρόσθια κῶλα καὶ τὰς κεφαλὰς εἰς γῆν ἑλκόμενα ὑπὸ συγγενείας ἤρεισαν, προμήκεις τε καὶ παντοίας ἔσχον τὰς  κορυφάς, ὅπῃ συνεθλίφθησαν ὑπὸ ἀργίας ἑκάστων αἱ περιφοραί· τετράπουν τε τὸ γένος αὐτῶν ἐκ ταύτης ἐφύετο καὶ πολύπουν τῆς προφάσεως, θεοῦ βάσεις ὑποτιθέντος πλείους τοῖς μᾶλλον ἄφροσιν, ὡς μᾶλλον ἐπὶ γῆν ἕλκοιντο. τοῖς δʼ ἀφρονεστάτοις αὐτῶν τούτων καὶ παντάπασιν πρὸς γῆν πᾶν τὸ σῶμα κατατεινομένοις ὡς οὐδὲν ἔτι ποδῶν χρείας οὔσης, ἄποδα αὐτὰ καὶ ἰλυσπώμενα ἐπὶ γῆς ἐγέννησαν.","kind":"passage"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","text":"τὸ δὲ  τέταρτον γένος ἔνυδρον γέγονεν ἐκ τῶν μάλιστα ἀνοητοτάτων καὶ ἀμαθεστάτων, οὓς οὐδʼ ἀναπνοῆς καθαρᾶς ἔτι ἠξίωσαν οἱ μεταπλάττοντες, ὡς τὴν ψυχὴν ὑπὸ πλημμελείας πάσης ἀκαθάρτως ἐχόντων, ἀλλʼ ἀντὶ λεπτῆς καὶ καθαρᾶς ἀναπνοῆς ἀέρος εἰς ὕδατος θολερὰν καὶ βαθεῖαν ἔωσαν ἀνάπνευσιν· ὅθεν ἰχθύων ἔθνος καὶ τὸ τῶν ὀστρέων συναπάντων τε ὅσα ἔνυδρα γέγονεν, δίκην ἀμαθίας ἐσχάτης ἐσχάτας οἰκήσεις  εἰληχότων. καὶ κατὰ ταῦτα δὴ πάντα τότε καὶ νῦν διαμείβεται τὰ ζῷα εἰς ἄλληλα, νοῦ καὶ ἀνοίας ἀποβολῇ καὶ κτήσει μεταβαλλόμενα. καὶ δὴ καὶ τέλος περὶ τοῦ παντὸς νῦν ἤδη τὸν λόγον ἡμῖν φῶμεν ἔχειν· θνητὰ γὰρ καὶ ἀθάνατα ζῷα λαβὼν καὶ συμπληρωθεὶς ὅδε ὁ κόσμος οὕτω, ζῷον ὁρατὸν τὰ ὁρατὰ περιέχον, εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεὸς αἰσθητός, μέγιστος καὶ ἄριστος κάλλιστός τε καὶ τελεώτατος γέγονεν εἷς οὐρανὸς ὅδε μονογενὴς ὤν.","kind":"passage"}],"sha256":"7329eea17d7d5a6e596055fb593b205a7a850d141380172ba7774faddf0e3d6a","language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"SOURCE_TR_20261014T225519546070Z_dc722160","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 92","source_sha256":"7329eea17d7d5a6e596055fb593b205a7a850d141380172ba7774faddf0e3d6a","sha256":"fe85a070d08f7e1351e13aa8d1ffe7d9c6b0fdd27ee58266f33fd4ddef39beb7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:55:19.546154+00:00","paragraphs":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","text":"TI. From these pursuits, then, their fore-limbs and their heads, being dragged down to the earth by kinship, they supported upon the ground; and they acquired elongated and all manner of shapes of crowns, wherever the revolutions of each had been compressed by idleness. From this cause their kind grew four-footed and many-footed, since god supplied more bases to those more devoid of understanding, so that they might be drawn still more toward the earth. But those among these which were most mindless, and which stretched their whole body altogether toward the earth, as having no longer any need of feet, they made footless and writhing upon the ground.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001"]},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","text":"The fourth kind became aquatic, from those who were most foolish and most unlearned; those whom the remodelers no longer deemed worthy even of pure respiration, since their soul was rendered impure by every kind of transgression, but instead of the fine and pure respiration of air they thrust them into the turbid and deep respiration of water. Hence came the race of fishes and that of shellfish and all the creatures that have become aquatic, having received the most remote dwellings as a penalty for the utmost ignorance. And in this way, then, all living creatures then and now pass into one another, changing through loss and acquisition of understanding and of lack of understanding. And now let us say that we have at last brought our account concerning the all to its end; for this cosmos, having received mortal and immortal living creatures and having thus been completed, has become a visible living creature containing visible things, a perceptible god, image of the intelligible, greatest and best, fairest and most perfect—this one heaven, only-begotten.","kind":"passage","source_paragraph_ids":["RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002"]}],"source_digest":"8ee8ee9ee0bbbb37af330557df94f93f5cbc0c9353ed0a5d1b400ae85df9caeb","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 92"}],"passage_basis":"frozen-grounding","original_title":"Section 92","title_language_code":"en"}],"units":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1","layer":"CH","title":"Section 17","order":1,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC1"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC1@R001","sha256":"ac479e0e6d42cf064b7957650ef8cc3437797714efad852b84507dd7419e71b9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS1","text":"Ἡ συνουσία ἀπαιτεῖ τὸν ἀπόντα ἑταῖρον ἀναπληρωθῆναι, ἵνα τὸ κοινὸν ἔργον μὴ λειφθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS2","text":"Ἡ πρόσφατος πολιτείας διήγησις ἀναμιμνήσκεται, ἵνα ἡ ἐφεξῆς ἀνάπτυξις ἐπὶ βεβαίῳ λόγῳ στηρίζηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀρίστη πόλις νοεῖται ἐκ τῆς κατὰ φύσιν διαιρέσεως τῶν ἔργων καὶ τῶν ἀνδρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS4","text":"Οἱ γεωργοὶ καὶ αἱ λοιπαὶ τέχναι χωρίζονται ἀπὸ τοῦ γένους τῶν προπολεμησόντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS5","text":"Τὸ γένος τῶν πολεμιστῶν ἀφορίζεται εἰς τὴν μίαν φυλακὴν τῆς πόλεως, ἵνα τοῖς οἰκείοις πραΰς καὶ τοῖς ἐχθροῖς χαλεπὸν ᾖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κοινωνοῦ δύναται ὑπὸ τῶν παρόντων ἀναπληρωθῆναι κατὰ δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2","text":"Ὁ πολιτικὸς λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνάμνησιν τῶν προτέρων ὅρων, ἵνα ἡ συνέχεια αὐτοῦ βεβαιωθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀρίστη πολιτεία συγκροτεῖται ἐκ διακεκριμένων γενῶν ἀνδρῶν καὶ ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","text":"Ἑκάστῳ κατὰ φύσιν ἓν οἰκεῖον ἐπιτήδευμα προσήκει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5","text":"Οἱ γεωργοὶ καὶ αἱ λοιπαὶ τέχναι ἄλλο γένος εἰσὶν ἢ οἱ προπολεμοῦντες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","text":"Οἱ προπολεμοῦντες ὀφείλουσι φύλακες μόνον τῆς πόλεως εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","text":"Ἡ φυλακὴ περιλαμβάνει τὴν ἀντιμετώπισιν κακουργίας ἔξωθεν τε καὶ ἔνδοθεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ πρὸς τοὺς ἀρχομένους καὶ φύσει φίλους πραΰς, πρὸς δὲ τοὺς ἐχθροὺς ἐν μάχῃ χαλεπὸς δεῖ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX1","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τῇ ἀδιακρίτῳ μίξει τῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX2","text":"Ὁ γεωργὸς οὐ ταὐτὸ γένος ἐστὶ τῷ προπολεμοῦντι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX3","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ οὐκ ὀφείλει πλείονα ἀσύμβατα ἐπιτηδεύματα ἀναλαμβάνειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX4","text":"Ἡ φυλακὴ οὐ περιορίζεται εἰς ἐξωτερικοὺς ἐχθρούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX5","text":"Ἡ φιλία πρὸς τοὺς οἰκείους οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστι τῇ πραότητι πρὸς τοὺς ἐχθρούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX6","text":"Ὁ ἀπὼν ἑταῖρος οὐ καθιστᾷ ἀδύνατον τὸ κοινὸν ἔργον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ κοινὴ συνουσία ἀπαιτεῖ ἔργον καὶ ἡ ἀπουσία δύναται ἀναπληροῦσθαι, οἱ παρόντες ἀναλαμβάνουσι καὶ τὸ μέρος τοῦ ἀπόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ πολιτικὸς λόγος ἐπὶ προτέρων ὅρων συνέχεται, ἡ ἀνάμνησις γίνεται μέθοδος βεβαιώσεως, οὐχὶ ἁπλῆ ἐπανάληψις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἑκάστῳ κατὰ φύσιν ἓν ἔργον προσήκει, ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀριστεία ἀπαιτεῖ λειτουργικὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ γεωργοὶ καὶ οἱ λοιποὶ τεχνῖται ἕτερον γένος εἰσίν, ἡ πόλις διαρθροῦται διὰ διακεκριμένων λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ προπολεμοῦντες εἰσὶ φύλακες μόνον, ἡ στρατιωτικὴ ἰδιότης μετατρέπεται εἰς πολιτικὴν ἀποστολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ κακουργία δύναται ἔσωθεν ἢ ἔξωθεν ἰέναι, ἡ φυλακὴ ἀναφέρεται πρὸς πᾶσαν ἀπειλὴν τῆς πόλεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ οἰκεῖοι καὶ οἱ ἐχθροὶ διαφέρουσι, ἡ ἀρετὴ τοῦ φύλακος ἔχει διπλῆν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐχὶ ἀντιφατικὴν, διάθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD1","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῆς πόλεως παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἀντιστοιχίας φύσεως, ἔργου καὶ πολιτικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ ἑνότης δὲν παράγεται διὰ ὁμοιομορφίας, ἀλλὰ διὰ συντονισμοῦ ἀνομοίων καὶ ἀμοιβαίως ὡρισμένων λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD3","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ ὡς ὅριον μεταξὺ τοῦ οἰκείου καὶ τοῦ ἐχθρικοῦ ἐγγυᾶται ἅμα τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν τάξιν καὶ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἄμυναν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ ἀπόντος καὶ ἡ ἀνάμνησις τοῦ προτέρου λόγου συνδέουσι τὴν κοινωνικὴν συνέχειαν μετὰ τῆς ὀργανώσεως τῆς πόλεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ὡς σύνολον ἀτόμων ἄνευ φυσικῆς καὶ λειτουργικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἰσότης τῶν πολιτικῶν μερῶν οὐ σημαίνει ταὐτότητα ἔργων καὶ ἱκανοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀσφάλεια τῆς πόλεως οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται μόνον ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικῆς ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX4","text":"Ἡ πραότης οὐ νοεῖται ὡς καθολικὴ ἀδυναμία πρὸς πᾶσαν ἐναντίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX5","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ συνέχεια οὐκ ἀναμένει τὴν ἀπαραμείωτον παρουσίαν πάντων τῶν ἀρχικῶν κοινωνῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται πόλις ἧς ἡ ἑνότης ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τῇ ἀνεξέλεγκτῳ ἐναλλαγῇ τῶν ρόλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἠθικὴ τάξις ἣ τὴν πρὸς τοὺς οἰκείους φιλίαν ἐκλαμβάνει ὡς ὑποχρέωσιν ἀδιακρίτου ἐπιεικείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται πολιτεία ἣ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν καὶ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἀπειλὴν διαχωρίζει ὥστε τὴν μίαν νὰ μὴ λογίζηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία τοῦ τετάρτου ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀρχικῆς κοινότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS1","text":"Ἀπουσία κοινωνοῦ → ἀνάληψις τοῦ κενοῦ → διατήρησις κοινῆς ἑστιάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS2","text":"Προηγούμενος πολιτικὸς λόγος → ἀνάμνησις ὅρων → βεβαίωσις συνεχείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS3","text":"Φυσικὴ διαφορά → διαίρεσις γενῶν → ἀνάθεσις ἑνὸς ἐπιτηδεύματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS4","text":"Ἔργον πολέμου → ἀποκλειστικὴ φυλακή → πολιτικὴ προστασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS5","text":"Ἀπειλὴ ἔξωθεν ἢ ἔνδοθεν → διαφοροποίησις οἰκείων καὶ ἐχθρῶν → πραότης πρὸς τοὺς πρώτους καὶ χαλεπότης πρὸς τοὺς δευτέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6","text":"Φύσις + ἔργον + ὅριον φίλου/ἐχθροῦ → ἱεράρχησις πολιτικῶν λειτουργιῶν → ἀρίστη πολιτεία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1","text":"Ἀπουσία τοῦ τετάρτου → ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ κοινοῦ μέρους → ἀνάμνησις τοῦ προτέρου πολιτικοῦ λόγου → διάκρισις γενῶν καὶ τεχνῶν → ἀνάθεσις τῆς φυλακῆς → διπλὴ ἠθικὴ στάσις τοῦ φύλακος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME1","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς λειτουργικῶς διῃρημένον ὅλον καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἄθροισμα ὁμοίων μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις γεωργίας, τεχνῶν καὶ πολέμου μετατρέπει τὴν κατανομήν ἔργων εἰς θεμέλιον πολιτικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3","text":"Ἡ φυλακὴ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ στρατιωτικῆς ἐνασχολήσεως εἰς καθολικὴν λειτουργίαν διατηρήσεως τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀπειλὴ κατατάσσεται εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ πεδίον πολιτικῆς προστασίας μετὰ τῆς ἐξωτερικῆς ἐπιθέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ τοῦ φύλακος ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς ἐλεγχόμενη διαφοροποίησις διαθέσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ πραότης ἢ ἁπλὴ ἀγριότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ συνομιλία ἀναπληροῖ τὸν ἀπόντα καὶ ἀναμιμνήσκει τὸν λόγον περὶ τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ πολιτεία ὀργανώνεται διὰ διακρίσεως γενῶν, φυσικῶν ἔργων καὶ ἀποκλειστικῶν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ ἅμα ἐσωτερικὴν συνοχήν, ἐξωτερικὴν ἄμυναν καὶ σαφῆ ὅρον τοῦ φίλου πρὸς τὸν ἐχθρόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ φύσις προηγεῖται τοῦ ἔργου, τὸ ἔργον καθορίζει τὴν θέσιν ἐν τῇ πόλει, καὶ ἡ ἀνάμνησις συνδέει τὸ παρελθὸν σχέδιον μετὰ τῆς παρούσης ἀναπτύξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνάμνησιν τοῦ λόγου πρὸς τὴν πολιτικὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀκολουθίαν ἀναπλήρωσις → ἀνάμνησις → διαίρεσις → φυλακή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ φυσικὴ καταλληλότης ἀποδεικνύεται, διότι ὁ λόγος τὴν προϋποθέτει μᾶλλον ἢ ἀναλύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἐπίσης ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις μεταξὺ τῶν φυλάκων καὶ τῶν ἀρχομένων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἠθικὴ διάκρισις δηλοῦται ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἐπεξηγεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐντὸς τῆς ἀρχῆς ἑνὸς ἔργου ἑκάστῳ, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀναπόδεικτον ἀντιστοιχίαν φύσεως καὶ λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὸ παραγωγικὸν σχήμα, ἀλλὰ καταλείπει ἀνεπεξέργαστον τὴν πολιτικὴν νομιμοποίησιν τῆς ἱεραρχικῆς διαιρέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225537901483Z_e1fd149d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 17","source_sha256":"ac479e0e6d42cf064b7957650ef8cc3437797714efad852b84507dd7419e71b9","sha256":"4048a6536d2b1a99b436857e58791461e8a373af47b98d4c0593f70ceba44f07","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:55:37.902423+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS1","text":"The association requires that the absent companion be replaced, so that the common work may not be left undone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS2","text":"The recent account of the constitution is recalled, so that the ensuing development may rest upon a firm account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS3","text":"The best city is conceived from the division of works and men according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS4","text":"Farmers and the other crafts are separated from the class of those who fight in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS5","text":"The class of warriors is delimited as the single guardianship of the city, so that it may be gentle toward its own and harsh toward enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1","text":"The absence of a participant can be made good by those present, according to their capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2","text":"Political discourse requires recollection of the preceding terms, so that its continuity may be secured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","text":"The best constitution is composed of distinct classes of men and works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","text":"To each person, one proper pursuit according to nature is fitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5","text":"Farmers and the other crafts are a different class from those who fight in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","text":"Those who fight in advance ought to be guardians of the city alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","text":"Guardianship includes the confrontation of wrongdoing both from without and from within.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8","text":"The guardian must be gentle toward those governed and naturally friendly, but harsh in battle toward enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX1","text":"Political order is not founded upon the undifferentiated mixture of works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX2","text":"The farmer is not the same class as the one who fights in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX3","text":"The guardian ought not to undertake several incompatible pursuits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX4","text":"Guardianship is not limited to external enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX5","text":"Friendship toward one's own is not the same as gentleness toward enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX6","text":"The absent companion does not render the common work impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D1","text":"Since common association requires work and absence can be made good, those present undertake also the absent person's share.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D2","text":"Since political discourse is held together by preceding terms, recollection becomes a method of confirmation, not mere repetition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D3","text":"Since one work according to nature is fitting to each person, political excellence requires a functional division.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D4","text":"Since farmers and the other craftsmen are a different class, the city is articulated through distinct functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D5","text":"Since those who fight in advance are guardians alone, military identity is transformed into a political mission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D6","text":"Since wrongdoing can come from within or from without, guardianship extends to every threat to the city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:D7","text":"Since one's own and enemies differ, the virtue of the guardian has a double, but not contradictory, disposition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD1","text":"The order of the city is generated from the correspondence of nature, work, and political function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2","text":"Social unity is not generated through uniformity, but through the coordination of dissimilar and mutually defined functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD3","text":"The guardian, as a boundary between what is one's own and what is hostile, guarantees both internal order and external defense.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD4","text":"The replacement of the absent person and the recollection of the preceding discourse connect social continuity with the organization of the city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX1","text":"The constitution is not posited as an aggregate of individuals without natural and functional order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX2","text":"The equality of political parts does not mean identity of works and capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX3","text":"The security of the city does not depend solely on external resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX4","text":"Gentleness is not conceived as universal weakness toward every opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX5","text":"Political continuity does not await the undiminished presence of all the original participants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX1","text":"A city whose unity rests upon the uncontrolled interchange of roles is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX2","text":"A moral order that takes friendship toward one's own as an obligation of indiscriminate leniency is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX3","text":"A constitution that separates internal and external threat so as not to take one of them into account is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX4","text":"The absence of the fourth permits the reconstruction of the discourse, but does not remove the necessity of an original community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS1","text":"Absence of a participant → undertaking of the vacancy → preservation of common association.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS2","text":"Preceding political discourse → recollection of terms → confirmation of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS3","text":"Natural difference → division of classes → assignment of one pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS4","text":"Work of war → exclusive guardianship → political protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS5","text":"Threat from without or from within → differentiation of one's own and enemies → gentleness toward the former and harshness toward the latter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6","text":"Nature + work + boundary of friend/enemy → hierarchy of political functions → best constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1","text":"Absence of the fourth → replacement of the common share → recollection of the preceding political discourse → distinction of classes and crafts → assignment of guardianship → the guardian's double ethical stance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME1","text":"The city appears as a functionally divided whole and not as an aggregate of similar parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2","text":"The distinction of agriculture, crafts, and war transforms the distribution of works into a foundation of political order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3","text":"Guardianship shifts from a military occupation to a universal function of preserving the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME4","text":"Internal threat is placed in the same field of political protection as external attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME5","text":"The virtue of the guardian is reconstructed as a controlled differentiation of dispositions, not as mere gentleness or mere ferocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The conversation replaces the absent person and recalls the discourse concerning the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The constitution is organized through the distinction of classes, natural works, and exclusive functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Political order requires at once internal cohesion, external defense, and a clear boundary of friend from enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Nature precedes work, work determines one's position in the city, and recollection connects the past plan with the present development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from recollection of the discourse to political division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the sequence replacement → recollection → division → guardianship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT3","text":"The manner in which natural suitability is demonstrated is underdetermined, because the discourse presupposes it rather than analyzes it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT4","text":"Likewise underdetermined is the precise relation between the guardians and those governed, because the ethical distinction is indicated but not explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5","text":"The structure is coherent within the principle of one work for each person, but depends upon an unproved correspondence of nature and function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC1:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6","text":"The compression preserves the generative schema, but leaves unelaborated the political legitimation of hierarchical division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC1@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC1:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 17"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 01","title":"Section 17","context":"Chapter 01","original_title":"Section 17","original_context":"Chapter 01"},"original_title":"Section 17","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2","layer":"CH","title":"Section 18","order":2,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_2"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_2@R001","sha256":"ea88e1ffaa8103999c8c64f9e9cc1171aa181d9b88fe0ea631bec99de04dec6e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅπως οἱ φύλακες ἅμα μὲν θυμοειδεῖς πρὸς τοὺς πολεμίους, ἅμα δὲ φιλοσοφικῶς φρονοῦντες πρὸς τοὺς οἰκείους γίγνωνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS2","text":"Ἡ λύσις ἀνατίθεται εἴς τε τὴν παιδείαν καὶ εἰς τὴν ἀφαίρεσιν τῶν ἰδιωτικῶν κτήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS3","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὴν φύλαξιν εἰς κοινὴν δίαιταν, κοινὰ γυναικεῖα ἐπιτηδεύματα καὶ κοινὴν παιδοποιίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS4","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς καθολικὴ κοινωνικὴ γνώσις, ἐν ᾗ οὐδεὶς ἰδίᾳ γιγνώσκει τὸ γεγενημένον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ διοικεῖται κρυφίως ὑπὸ τῶν ἀρχόντων, ἵνα ἡ τῶν φυλάκων φύσις ὡς ἄριστη κατὰ δύναμιν γίγνηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ δεῖ ἅμα θυμοειδὴς καὶ φιλόσοφος εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ φύλαξις προϋποθέτει παιδείαν διὰ γυμναστικῆς, μουσικῆς καὶ τῶν προσηκόντων μαθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ δεῖ μηδὲν κτῆμα ἴδιον νομίζειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","text":"Οἱ φύλακες δεῖ κοινῇ ἀναλίσκειν καὶ συνδιαιτωμένους ζῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιμέλεια τῆς ἀρετῆς ἀπαιτεῖ σχολὴν ἀπὸ τῶν ἄλλων ἐπιτηδευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6","text":"Αἱ τῶν γυναικῶν φύσεις δύνανται ταῖς τῶν ἀνδρῶν παραπλησίως συναρμόττεσθαι πρὸς τὰ τῆς φυλακῆς ἔργα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","text":"Τὰ τῶν γάμων καὶ τὰ τῶν παίδων δεῖ κοινὰ τοῖς φύλαξιν τίθεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀρίστη τῶν φυλάκων φύσις δύναται διοικεῖσθαι διὰ κρυφίας ἀρχοντικῆς συζεύξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια τῆς ἀτομικῆς γενέσεως ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ καθολικῇ συγγενείᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A10","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη τύχη δύναται νὰ κρύπτῃ τὴν ἐσκεμμένην ἀρχοντικὴν ἐπιλογήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX1","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ οὐκ ἔστιν ἰδιώτης κτήμων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX2","text":"Ἡ φυλακὴ οὐκ ἐναρμονίζεται μετὰ ἰδίας περιουσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX3","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ δίαιτα οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει χωριστὴν ἰδιωτικὴν βιοτήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX4","text":"Τὰ τῆς γυναικείας φύσεως οὐκ ἀποκλείονται ἐξ ὁμοίων ἔργων διὰ μόνην τὴν διαφοράν τοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX5","text":"Ὁ γάμος οὐκ ὑφίσταται ὡς ἰδιωτικὴ καὶ ἀποκλειστικὴ σύμβασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX6","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια οὐκ ὁρίζεται διὰ τῆς ἰδίας γνώσεως τῶν φυσικῶν γονέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX7","text":"Ἡ σύζευξις οὐκ ἀφίεται εἰς ἀνεξέλεγκτον τύχην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ φύλαξ ὀφείλει ἀντιστρόφους διαθέσεις πρὸς ἑκατέρους ἔχειν, ἡ παιδεία δεῖ ἅμα πραΰτητα καὶ χαλεπότητα καλλιεργεῖν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἰδία κτῆσις ἀφαιρεῖται, ὁ μισθὸς τῆς φυλακῆς μετατρέπεται εἰς κοινὸν καὶ μετρημένον τρόπον ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ φύλακες ἀπαλλάττονται τῶν ἰδίων ἐπιτηδευμάτων, ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀρετὴ καθίσταται ὁ κύριος σκοπὸς τοῦ βίου αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ γυναῖκες δύνανται κοινωνεῖν τῶν αὐτῶν ἔργων, ἡ φύλαξις παύει εἶναι ἀποκλειστικῶς ἀνδρικὴ λειτουργία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ γάμοι καὶ οἱ παῖδες καθίστανται κοινοί, ἡ φυσικὴ οἰκογένεια μετασχηματίζεται εἰς πολιτικὴν συγγένειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ ἄρχοντες κρύπτουσι τὴν ἐπιλογὴν ὑπὸ μορφῇ κλήρου, ἡ κοινωνικὴ εἰρήνη στηρίζεται ἐπὶ ἀγνοίᾳ τῆς πραγματικῆς αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1","text":"Ἡ κατάργησις τῆς ἰδιωτικότητος ἐν κτήσει, ἔρωτι καὶ γενέσει ἐνοποιεῖ τὸ σῶμα τῶν φυλάκων ὡς μίαν πολιτικὴν οἰκογένειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοινότης τῶν βίων προϋποθέτει ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις δύναται νὰ ρυθμίζῃ οὐ μόνον πράξεις, ἀλλὰ καὶ δεσμοὺς, ἐπιθυμίας καὶ γενεάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία συντηρεῖ τὴν ἑνότητά της διὰ συνδυασμοῦ παιδείας, ὑλικοῦ κοινοτισμοῦ, συγγενικοῦ ἀνασχηματισμοῦ καὶ κρυφίας διοικήσεως τῆς ἀναπαραγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ τοῦ φύλακος οὐκ ἀναπτύσσεται ἐν πεδίῳ ἰδιωτικῆς αὐτονομίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης οὐκ ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ φυσικῶν οἰκογενειακῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX3","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ εἰρήνη οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ φανερὰν ἰσότητα μεταξὺ τῆς ἀληθοῦς διοικήσεως καὶ τῆς κοινῆς πεποιθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ οὐκ θεωρεῖται ἀνεξάρτητος φυσικὴ διαδικασία, ἀλλὰ ὕλη πολιτικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX5","text":"Ἡ κοινότης οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀμοιβαίαν γνώσιν τῶν ἀτομικῶν ἀφετηριῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ὅπως ὁ φύλαξ ἔχῃ ἰδίαν περιουσίαν, ἰδίαν οἰκογένειαν καὶ ἰδίαν γενεαλογικὴν ταυτότητα συγχρόνως μετὰ τῆς πλήρους πολιτικῆς ἀφοσιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἀφετοῦ φυσικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκρύπτεται ὅτι ἡ καθολικὴ συγγένεια ἀπαιτεῖ συστηματικὴν ἀμνησίαν τῶν ἰδίων γενέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἀληθοῦς πολιτικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ καὶ κοινωνικῶς πιστευομένης τύχης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1","text":"Διπλὴ φύσις τοῦ φύλακος → διττὴ παιδεία → ἱκανότης πρὸς πραότητα καὶ χαλεπότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2","text":"Ἀνάγκη ἀρετῆς → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίας κτήσεως → κοινὴ δίαιτα → ἀπερίσπαστος πολιτικὴ ἐπιμέλεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS3","text":"Ὁμοιότης φύσεων ἀνδρῶν καὶ γυναικῶν → κοινὰ ἔργα → καθολικοποίησις τῆς φυλακῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4","text":"Κοινὸς γάμος καὶ κοινὰ τέκνα → ἄγνοια ἀτομικῆς γενέσεως → κατασκευή καθολικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS5","text":"Σκοπὸς ἀρίστης φύσεως → κρυφία ἀρχοντικὴ σύζευξις → φαινομένη τύχη → ἀποφυγὴ ἔχθρας → ἀναπαραγωγικὴ ρύθμισις τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1","text":"Ἀντίθεσις θυμοειδοῦς καὶ φιλοσόφου φύσεως → παιδευτικὴ σύνθεσις → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδιωτικοῦ βίου → κοινὴ πολιτικὴ ζωή → ἀνασχηματισμὸς γάμου καὶ συγγενείας → κρυφία ἀναπαραγωγικὴ διοίκησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἰδιωτικὴ κτῆσις μεταταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φυσικὸν δικαίωμα εἰς κίνδυνον διαιρέσεως τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀνδρικοῦ καὶ γυναικείου πολιτικοῦ ἔργου καταλύεται ἐντὸς τῆς τάξεως τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME3","text":"Ἡ οἰκογένεια μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ φυσικὴν μονάδα εἰς κατασκευὴν πολιτικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4","text":"Ἡ τύχη ἀναφαίνεται ὡς κοινωνικὸ περίβλημα ἐσκεμμένης ἀρχοντικῆς ἐπιλογῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ τάξις ὁρίζει τὴν τροφὴν, τὴν κτῆσιν, τὴν δίαιταν, τὸν γάμον καὶ τὴν παιδοποιίαν τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ τάξις ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἰδιωτικὴν οἰκογένειαν καὶ περιουσίαν διὰ κοινοῦ πολιτικοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ πολιτικὴ κυριαρχία ἐμφανίζεται ὡς διοίκησις τῶν συνθηκῶν ὑπὸ αἷς οἱ φύλακες αἰσθάνονται συγγενεῖς καὶ ἴσοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, ἡ ταυτότης τοῦ προσώπου ἀποσπᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἰδίαν γένεσιν καὶ ἐγγράφεται εἰς μίαν τεταγμένην πολιτικὴν γενεαλογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν παιδείαν τοῦ φύλακος εἰς τὴν πολιτικὴν διοίκησιν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται στὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ ἰδιωτικότης γεννᾷ διχασμόν, ἐνῶ ἡ κοινότης γεννᾷ ἑνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT3","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μεταξὺ ἀρετῆς, ἀρίστης φύσεως καὶ κρυφίας εὐγονικῆς διοικήσεως παραμένει ἐν μέρει ἀναπόδεικτος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ τοῦ συστήματος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀντίφασιν μεταξὺ καθολικῆς συγγενείας καὶ ἀναγκαίας ἀγνοίας τῆς φυσικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν λογικὴν ἀκολουθίαν, ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἐξαλείφει τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ φανερᾶς κοινότητος καὶ κρυφίας ἀρχοντικῆς χειραγωγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225827553601Z_eec67ba2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 18","source_sha256":"ea88e1ffaa8103999c8c64f9e9cc1171aa181d9b88fe0ea631bec99de04dec6e","sha256":"ed487599ce799853677577486980579a53f34380ff69543e8d49cfff71c5748f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:58:27.554555+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS1","text":"The problem is how the guardians may become at once spirited toward enemies and philosophically minded toward those close to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS2","text":"The solution is assigned both to education and to the removal of private possessions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS3","text":"The political order extends from guardianship to common living, common women's pursuits, and common childbearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS4","text":"Kinship is reshaped as universal social knowledge, in which no one knows privately what has been born.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS5","text":"Reproduction is secretly administered by the rulers, so that the nature of the guardians may become as excellent as possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","text":"The guardian must be at once spirited and philosophical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2","text":"Correct guardianship presupposes education through gymnastics, music, and the appropriate studies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","text":"The guardian must regard no possession as private.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","text":"The guardians must consume in common and live together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A5","text":"The cultivation of virtue requires leisure from other pursuits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6","text":"The natures of women can be fitted similarly to those of men for the tasks of guardianship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","text":"Matters concerning marriages and children must be made common to the guardians.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8","text":"The best nature of the guardians can be administered through secret ruler-directed pairing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9","text":"Ignorance of individual birth serves universal kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:A10","text":"Apparent chance can conceal deliberate ruler-directed selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX1","text":"The guardian is not a private property-holder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX2","text":"Guardianship is not harmonized with private property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX3","text":"Common living does not permit a separate private life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX4","text":"The capacities of female nature are not excluded from similar tasks solely on account of difference of sex.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX5","text":"Marriage does not exist as a private and exclusive contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX6","text":"Kinship is not defined through private knowledge of one's natural parents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX7","text":"Pairing is not left to uncontrolled chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D1","text":"Since the guardian must have opposed dispositions toward each group, education must cultivate gentleness and harshness at once.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D2","text":"Since private possession is removed, the remuneration of guardianship is transformed into a common and measured way of life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D3","text":"Since the guardians are released from private pursuits, political virtue becomes the principal aim of their life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D4","text":"Since women can share in the same tasks, guardianship ceases to be an exclusively male function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D5","text":"Since marriages and children become common, the natural family is transformed into political kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:D6","text":"Since the rulers conceal selection under the form of a lottery, social peace rests upon ignorance of the real cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1","text":"The abolition of privacy in property, love, and birth unifies the body of guardians as one political family.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2","text":"The community of lives presupposes that the political order can regulate not only actions, but also bonds, desires, and generations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","text":"The state sustains its unity through a combination of education, material communism, kinship restructuring, and secret administration of reproduction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX1","text":"The virtue of the guardian does not develop in a field of private autonomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX2","text":"Political unity is not founded upon natural family bonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX3","text":"Social peace does not require manifest equality between true administration and common belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4","text":"Reproduction is not regarded as an independent natural process, but as material for political planning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX5","text":"Community does not require mutual knowledge of individual origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX1","text":"The possibility that the guardian may have private property, a private family, and a private genealogical identity simultaneously with complete political devotion is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX2","text":"The idea that political unity is produced from unfettered natural kinship is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3","text":"It is concealed that universal kinship requires systematic forgetting of one's own births.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX4","text":"The complete distinction between true political planning and socially believed chance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1","text":"Double nature of the guardian → dual education → capacity for gentleness and harshness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2","text":"Necessity of virtue → removal of private possession → common living → undistracted political care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS3","text":"Similarity of the natures of men and women → common tasks → universalization of guardianship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4","text":"Common marriage and common children → ignorance of individual birth → construction of universal kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS5","text":"Aim of the best nature → secret ruler-directed pairing → apparent chance → avoidance of enmity → reproductive regulation of the guardians.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1","text":"Opposition of spirited and philosophical nature → educational synthesis → removal of private life → common political life → restructuring of marriage and kinship → secret reproductive administration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME1","text":"Private possession is reclassified from a natural right into a danger of division among the guardians.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME2","text":"The distinction between male and female political work is abolished within the class of guardians.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME3","text":"The family is transformed from a natural unit into a construction of political unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4","text":"Chance appears as the social covering of deliberate ruler-directed selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT1","text":"On the surface, the order determines the food, property, way of life, marriage, and childbearing of the guardians.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the order replaces the private family and property with a common political body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, political sovereignty appears as administration of the conditions under which the guardians feel themselves to be kin and equal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the identity of the person is detached from private birth and inscribed in an ordered political genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the basic movement from the education of the guardian to the political administration of birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT2","text":"The internal coherence rests on the assumption that privacy generates division, whereas community generates unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT3","text":"The relation between virtue, the best nature, and secret eugenic administration remains partly unproved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT4","text":"The architecture of the system depends on a contradiction between universal kinship and necessary ignorance of natural kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the logical sequence, but does not eliminate the tension between manifest community and secret ruler-directed manipulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_2:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 18"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 02","title":"Section 18","context":"Chapter 02","original_title":"Section 18","original_context":"Chapter 02"},"original_title":"Section 18","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3","layer":"CH","title":"Section 19","order":3,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_3"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_3@R001","sha256":"62dd2a6a316b497d01e1835324484aa647cb256e625dd6da0e2ea9a6d36fe063","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS1","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία ὁρίζεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως τῶν τρεπτέων ἀγαθῶν καὶ τῶν ἀποπεμπτέων κακῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2","text":"Ἡ θεωρηθεῖσα πολιτεία ζητεῖται ἤδη οὐχ ὡς λόγος ἀκίνητος, ἀλλʼ ὡς ζῷον κινούμενον καὶ ἀγωνιζόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις τῆς πολιτείας μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς τάξεως εἰς τὰ ἔργα καὶ τοὺς λόγους τοῦ πολέμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἐπαινετὴ πολιτεία ὀφείλει ἀποδιδόναι τῇ παιδείᾳ καὶ τροφῇ τὰ προσήκοντα διὰ τῆς πράξεως καὶ τῆς διερμηνείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ ἐπαίνου ἀναλύεται εἰς πρόβλημα μιμήσεως, ἐμπειρίας καὶ πολιτικῆς ἐνσώματου γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A1","text":"Τὰ ἀγαθὰ τρέφειν δεῖ, τὰ δὲ κακὰ ἀφανῶς εἰς ἄλλην πόλιν διαδιδόναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A2","text":"Ἡ πόλις ὀφείλει ἀεὶ τοὺς ἀξίους ἀνάγειν καὶ τοὺς ἀναξίους μεταλλάττειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ πολιτεία οὐκ ἀρκεῖται τῷ γεγραμμένῳ λόγῳ, ἀλλὰ δεῖται κινήσεως καὶ ἀγῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία κρίνεται πρὸς ἄλλας πόλεις διὰ πολέμου καὶ διὰ τῶν πρὸς αὐτὰς λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","text":"Ἡ πράξις καὶ ὁ λόγος ὀφείλουσιν ἀποδιδόναι τὰ προσήκοντα τῇ παιδείᾳ καὶ τῇ τροφῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","text":"Ἡ μίμησις ἄριστα κατορθοῦται περὶ ὧν ὁ μιμούμενος ἐτράφη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","text":"Τὰ ἐκτὸς τῆς οἰκείας τροφῆς γιγνόμενα χαλεπώτερον μιμεῖται ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἔργῳ καὶ ἔτι χαλεπώτερον λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς πολιτικὴ ἐμπειρία συνάπτεται πρὸς οἰκείαν πόλιν καὶ διωκημένην οἴκησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9","text":"Ἡ πολυλογία καὶ ἡ σοφιστικὴ ἐμπειρία οὐκ ἐγγυῶνται πολιτικὴν καὶ πολεμικὴν ἐπάρκειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX1","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία οὐκ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἀκίνητος εἰκών ἢ ἁπλῶς γεγραμμένον θέαμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX2","text":"Ὁ ἔπαινος οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει μόνος τὴν ἀρετὴν τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX3","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία οὐκ ἀξιοῦται διὰ μόνης τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς εὐταξίας, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς πρὸς ἄλλας πόλεις πράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX4","text":"Ἡ μίμησις οὐκ ἐξισοῦται πρὸς ἀφηρημένην καὶ ἀπροϋπόθετον ἀναπαράστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX5","text":"Ἡ σοφιστικὴ πολυπειρία οὐκ ἀναπληροῖ τὴν ἔλλειψιν οἰκείας πολιτείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX6","text":"Ὁ πλανώμενος κατὰ πόλεις οὐκ ἔχει αὐτομάτως τὴν ἱκανότητα κρίνειν ἢ διερμηνεύειν τὰ πολιτικὰ καὶ πολεμικά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀξία τῆς πολιτείας ἀπαιτεῖ δοκιμασίαν ἐκτὸς τοῦ θεωρητικοῦ της σχεδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2","text":"Ἡ παιδεία τεκμηριοῦται ὅταν μετασχηματίζηται εἰς προσήκουσαν πράξιν καὶ λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D3","text":"Ἡ μιμητικὴ ἱκανότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν κοινωνικὴν καὶ πολιτικὴν ἀνατροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D4","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις οἰκείας πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας καθιστᾷ ἀβέβαιον τὸν ἔπαινον τῆς πόλεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D5","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ πολέμου ἀπαιτεῖ γνώσιν τῶν ἔργων καὶ τῶν πρὸς ἑκάστην πόλιν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D6","text":"Ὁ ἐπαίνων τὴν πόλιν ἐπιχειρῶν ὑπερβαίνει τὰ ὅρια τῆς ἁπλῆς ῥητορικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD1","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῆς πολιτείας μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀπαίτησιν ἐνσώματου καὶ διαπολιτικοῦ ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ γνώσις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀνατροφῆς, τόπου, πράξεως καὶ λόγου ἑνότητα, οὐχ ὡς ἀφηρημένη δεξιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία οἰκείας πόλεως ὑπονομεύει συγχρόνως τὴν μίμησιν, τὴν πολιτικὴν κρίσιν καὶ τὸν ἔπαινον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαράστασις τῆς ἰδανικῆς πόλεως ἀπαιτεῖ ἤδη τὴν ἀναπαράστασιν τῶν ἀγώνων, τῶν ἔργων καὶ τῶν λόγων αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD5","text":"Ἡ ῥητορικὴ ἐπάρκεια ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἐπάρκειαν ὅταν λείπῃ ἡ ἐντοπισμένη ἐμπειρία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τῆς πολιτείας οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται ἐν τῇ θεωρίᾳ αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἀδιάφορον τὸ ποῦ καὶ ὑπὸ ποίας τροφῆς ἐγένετο ὁ λέγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ πολιτικὴ γλῶσσα ἀνεξάρτητος τῶν πολιτικῶν σωμάτων καὶ τῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ἐμπειρία πολλῶν πόλεων νὰ θεωρῆται ἄνευ ἑδραίας πολιτικῆς τοποθετήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεί ἡ γνώσις τῶν λόγων, ἐὰν μὴ συνοδεύηται ὑπὸ γνώσεως τῶν ἀγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX6","text":"Οὐκ ὑπάρχει καθαρὰ πολιτικὴ μίμησις ἔξω τῶν ὅρων τῆς παιδείας καὶ τῆς τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἀπολύτως οὐδετέρου παρατηρητοῦ τῆς πολιτείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πόλις ἣ μόνον ἐν λόγῳ ὑφίσταται καὶ οὐδέποτε εἰς ἀγῶνα καθίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ καθολικὴ ῥητορικὴ ἱκανότης ἄνευ τόπου, τροφῆς καὶ πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς πολιτικῆς γνώσεως εἰς ἀφηρημένην πολυλογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS1","text":"Διάκρισις ἀγαθῶν καὶ κακῶν → θρέψις τῶν ἀξίων καὶ ἀποπομπὴ τῶν ἀναξίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2","text":"Ἰδανικὴ πολιτεία → ἀπαίτησις κινήσεως, ἀγῶνος καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς δοκιμασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS3","text":"Παιδεία καὶ τροφή → ἱκανότης μιμήσεως τοῦ οἰκείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS4","text":"Ἔλλειψις οἰκείας τροφῆς → δυσχέρεια ἀκριβοῦς μιμήσεως ἔργῳ καὶ λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS5","text":"Πόλις ἐν πολέμῳ → ἀνάγκη πολιτικῆς, πολεμικῆς καὶ ῥητορικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS6","text":"Πλανώμενος σοφιστής → πολυλογία ἄνευ οἰκείας πολιτείας → ἀβεβαιότης ἐπαίνου καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS7","text":"Ἀδυναμία ἐπαίνου → μετάθεσις τοῦ προβλήματος ἀπὸ τὴν ῥητορικὴν τέχνην εἰς τὴν ἐμπειρικὴν καὶ πολιτικὴν ἐπάρκειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις τῆς πόλεως → ἀπαίτησις κινήσεως → πολεμικὴ δοκιμασία → ἀπόδοσις παιδείας διὰ πράξεως καὶ λόγου → ὅρια μιμήσεως → κριτικὴ τῆς πλανωμένης σοφιστικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME1","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὸ πεδίον τοῦ σχεδίου εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἐνεργοῦ δοκιμασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME2","text":"Ἡ μίμησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς λειτουργία τροφῆς, τόπου καὶ πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ λόγου καὶ πράξεως ὑποχωρεῖ, ἐπειδὴ ὁ πολιτικὸς λόγος κρίνεται διὰ τῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME4","text":"Ἡ πολυμάθεια τῶν πόλεων παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ αὐτομάτως πολιτικὴν ἐπάρκειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME5","text":"Ὁ ἔπαινος τῆς πόλεως ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς πρόβλημα θέσεως, ἀνατροφῆς καὶ συμμετοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πόλις ζητεῖται ὡς ἀγωνιζομένη πρὸς ἄλλας πόλεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ τροφὴ παράγουσι τὴν ἱκανότητα πράξεως, λόγου καὶ μιμήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀξιολόγησις τῆς πολιτείας μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὸν ἔπαινον εἰς τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν δοκιμασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πολιτεία νοεῖται ὡς ζῶσα κίνησις ἣ ἀποδεικνύει τὴν ταυτότητα αὐτῆς διὰ συνεχοῦς πράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἰδανικὴν πολιτείαν εἰς τὴν ἐνεργὸν πολιτικὴν δοκιμασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT2","text":"Ἡ δομὴ διασώζει τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν πόλις, ἀγών, παιδεία, μίμησις, ἐμπειρία καὶ ἔπαινος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT3","text":"Ὑπολείπεται ἀκαθόριστον εἰ ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ ἐπαίνου ὀφείλεται κυρίως εἰς ἔλλειψιν τεχνικῆς, ἐμπειρίας ἢ πολιτικῆς θέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει ὅτι ἡ οἰκεία πόλις παρέχει προνομιακὴν γνώσιν τῶν πολιτικῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα σύνδεσις τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ ἐξάρτησις τοῦ λόγου ἀπὸ τὴν πράξιν καὶ τῆς μιμήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν τροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα σύνδεσις ἐστὶν ἡ ἀνεπαρκῶς ἐξηγημένη μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν πλανητὴν σοφιστικὴν ἐμπειρίαν εἰς τὴν ἀναγκαίαν ἀνεπάρκειαν πολιτικῆς κρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225846671352Z_ea4e05b4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 19","source_sha256":"62dd2a6a316b497d01e1835324484aa647cb256e625dd6da0e2ea9a6d36fe063","sha256":"d1a817eaeba4407122d73af5d5ed3b4546bd1ca9de5e95c488fc0abd81d1f234","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:58:46.673762+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS1","text":"The polity is defined through the distinction between goods to be nurtured and evils to be sent away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2","text":"The polity contemplated is now sought not as an unmoving account, but as a living creature in motion and engaged in struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS3","text":"The demonstration of the polity passes from internal order to the deeds and accounts of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS4","text":"The praiseworthy polity must render to education and nurture what is fitting through action and interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS5","text":"The inability to praise is analyzed into a problem of imitation, experience, and embodied political knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A1","text":"It is necessary to nurture goods, but secretly to disperse evils into another city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A2","text":"The city must always raise up the worthy and transform the unworthy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","text":"The correct polity is not satisfied with the written account, but requires motion and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","text":"The polity is judged in relation to other cities through war and through the accounts directed toward them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","text":"Action and account must render to education and nurture what is fitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","text":"Imitation is accomplished best concerning the things in which the imitator was nurtured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","text":"A human being imitates more difficultly in deed, and still more difficultly in account, the things that occur outside his own nurture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","text":"True political experience is bound to one's own city and an administered habitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9","text":"Verbosity and sophistic experience do not guarantee political and military sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX1","text":"The polity is not defined as an unmoving image or as a merely written spectacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX2","text":"Praise alone does not demonstrate the virtue of the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX3","text":"The polity is not evaluated through internal good order alone, but through action in relation to other cities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX4","text":"Imitation is not equated with abstract and presuppositionless representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX5","text":"Sophistic extensive experience does not make up for the lack of one's own polity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX6","text":"One who wanders among cities does not automatically possess the capacity to judge or interpret political and military matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D1","text":"The value of the polity requires testing beyond its theoretical design.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2","text":"Education is evidenced when it is transformed into fitting action and account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D3","text":"Imitative capacity depends upon social and political upbringing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D4","text":"The lack of one's own political experience renders praise of the city uncertain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D5","text":"An account concerning war requires knowledge of deeds and of relations toward each city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:D6","text":"One who undertakes to praise the city exceeds the limits of mere rhetorical experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD1","text":"The theory of the polity is transformed into a demand for embodied and intercultural testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2","text":"Political knowledge appears as a unity of upbringing, place, action, and account, not as an abstract skill.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD3","text":"The absence of one's own city simultaneously undermines imitation, political judgment, and praise.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD4","text":"The representation of the ideal city already requires the representation of its struggles, deeds, and accounts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD5","text":"Rhetorical sufficiency is separated from political sufficiency when localized experience is lacking.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX1","text":"The truth of the polity is not exhausted in its theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX2","text":"It is not indifferent where and under what nurture the speaker came to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX3","text":"Political language is not independent of political bodies and deeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX4","text":"Experience of many cities may not be regarded without a firm political positioning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX5","text":"Knowledge of accounts is not sufficient unless it is accompanied by knowledge of struggles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX6","text":"There is no pure political imitation outside the conditions of education and nurture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an absolutely neutral observer of the polity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX2","text":"The city which exists only in account and never enters into struggle is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX3","text":"Universal rhetorical capacity without place, nurture, and political experience is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX4","text":"The reduction of political knowledge to abstract verbosity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS1","text":"Distinction between goods and evils → nurturing of the worthy and expulsion of the unworthy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2","text":"Ideal polity → requirement of motion, struggle, and external testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS3","text":"Education and nurture → capacity for imitation of what is one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS4","text":"Lack of one's own nurture → difficulty of precise imitation in deed and account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS5","text":"City at war → necessity of political, military, and rhetorical experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS6","text":"Wandering sophist → verbosity without one's own polity → uncertainty of praise and judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS7","text":"Inability to praise → transfer of the problem from rhetorical art to empirical and political sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1","text":"Internal order of the city → requirement of motion → military testing → rendering of education through action and account → limits of imitation → critique of wandering sophistic experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME1","text":"The polity moves from the field of design into the field of active testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME2","text":"Imitation is reclassified as a function of nurture, place, and political experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3","text":"The distinction between account and action recedes, since political account is judged through deeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME4","text":"Extensive learning about cities ceases automatically to signify political sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME5","text":"Praise of the city emerges as a problem of position, upbringing, and participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the city is sought as struggling against other cities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, education and nurture produce the capacity for action, account, and imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, evaluation of the polity is transferred from praise to external testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the polity is conceived as living motion that demonstrates its identity through continuous action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the transition from the ideal polity to active political testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT2","text":"The structure preserves the sequence city, struggle, education, imitation, experience, and praise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT3","text":"It remains undetermined whether the inability to praise is due principally to a lack of art, experience, or political position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent, but presupposes that one's own city provides privileged knowledge of political deeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection of the system is the dependence of account upon action and of imitation upon nurture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT6","text":"The weakest connection is the insufficiently explained transition from wandering sophistic experience to the necessary insufficiency of political judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_3:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 19"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 03","title":"Section 19","context":"Chapter 03","original_title":"Section 19","original_context":"Chapter 03"},"original_title":"Section 19","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2","layer":"CH","title":"Section 20","order":4,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC2"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC2@R001","sha256":"09470082ab2a5e6250c5ce431a170d7984d8a59765a6b825f2435da9014248f7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS1","text":"Τὸ ζητούμενον ἐστὶ λόγον ἀποδοῦναι τῇ περὶ πολιτείας ζητήσει, ὥστε ἡ πόλις ἐν πολέμῳ πρακτικῶς ἐμφανισθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἱκανότης τοῦ λόγου ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ φύσεως, τροφῆς, πολιτικῆς πείρας καὶ φιλοσοφικῆς παιδείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS3","text":"Ἡ προηγουμένη πολιτείας ἔκθεσις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀνταπόδοσιν λόγων καὶ κοινωνικὴν ὑποχρέωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS4","text":"Ἡ διήγησις ἐκ παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς εἰσάγεται ὡς πιθανὸς φορεὺς ἀληθείας, καίπερ ἄτοπος φαινομένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀφήγησις τοῦ παλαιοῦ λόγου παραδίδεται πρὸς κοινὴν δοκιμασίαν τῆς καταλληλότητος αὐτοῦ πρὸς τὴν ἐπίταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἕξις συγκροτεῖται ἐκ φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς ἅμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἱκανότης καὶ ἡ φιλοσοφικὴ ἱκανότης δύνανται νὰ συνυπάρχωσιν ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ προσώπῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀξιοπιστία τοῦ λέγοντος στηρίζεται καὶ εἰς πολιτικὴν ἐμπειρίαν καὶ εἰς φιλοσοφικὴν ἀκρότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","text":"Ἡ περὶ πολιτείας θεωρία ἀπαιτεῖ μεταγωγὴν εἰς πολεμικὴν πράξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5","text":"Ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ ἀποδώσῃ τῇ πόλει τὰ προσήκοντα, ἐὰν αὐτὴ τεθῇ εἰς κατάστασιν πολέμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6","text":"Ἡ ἀνταπόδοσις λόγων ἔχει χαρακτῆρα ξενίου καὶ κοινῆς συμφωνίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ ἀκοὴ δύναται νὰ παρέχῃ ἀληθῆ λόγον, ἔστω καὶ ἄτοπον φαινομένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8","text":"Ἡ καταλληλότης τοῦ παραδεδομένου λόγου χρήζει κοινῆς δοκιμασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ διήγησις ἐνεργοποιεῖται ὅταν συνδεθῇ πρὸς συγκεκριμένην σκηνὴν ἀκροάσεως καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἱκανότης οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς μόνην φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀξία οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς γένος ἢ οὐσίαν μόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX3","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία οὐκ ἀποκλείει τὴν πολιτικὴν ἀρχήν καὶ τιμήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX4","text":"Ἡ περὶ πολιτείας ἔρευνα οὐκ ἀρκείται εἰς ἀφηρημένην περιγραφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX5","text":"Ἡ παλαιότης τοῦ λόγου οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει μόνη τὴν ἀναλήθειαν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἀτοπία τοῦ λόγου οὐκ ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἀλήθειαν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX7","text":"Ἡ παράδοσις οὐκ ἀπαλλάσσεται τῆς κρίσεως διὰ μόνην τὴν ἐπίκλησιν παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX8","text":"Ἡ ἀκρόασις οὐκ εἶναι παθητικὴ παραλαβή, ἀλλὰ κοινὴ δοκιμή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D1","text":"Ἡ σύζευξις φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν συνάφειαν πολιτικῆς πράξεως καὶ φιλοσοφίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D2","text":"Ἡ συνύπαρξις πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας καὶ φιλοσοφικῆς παιδείας νομιμοποιεῖ τὴν ἀνάθεσιν τοῦ λόγου εἰς συγκεκριμένους φορεῖς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαράστασις πόλεως ἐν πολέμῳ μεταφέρει τὴν πολιτειακὴ θεωρίαν ἀπὸ τὸ κανονιστικὸν ἐπίπεδον εἰς τὸ δραστικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D4","text":"Ἡ προηγουμένη συζήτησις παράγει ὑποχρέωσιν συνεχίσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δωρεὰ λόγων ζητεῖ ἀνταπόδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","text":"Ἡ ἐπίκλησις Σόλωνος καὶ παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς μετατρέπει τὴν διήγησιν εἰς μαρτυρούμενον, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἄνευ ἐλέγχου, λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ δοκιμασία μεταβάλλει τὴν διήγησιν ἀπὸ ἰδιωτικὴν μνήμην εἰς δημόσιον ἀντικείμενον κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀληθοφάνεια τοῦ πολιτικοῦ λόγου παράγεται ἐκ τῆς συμπλοκῆς βίου, παιδείας, πράξεως καὶ παραδόσεως, οὐκ ἐκ μιᾶς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD2","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς μορφὴ ἧς ἡ πληρότης φαίνεται μόνον ὅταν ἀναμετρηθῇ πρὸς πόλεμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD3","text":"Ἡ παράδοσις λειτουργεῖ ταὐτοχρόνως ὡς πηγαὶ ἀληθείας καὶ ὡς ἀντικείμενον ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάθεσις τοῦ λόγου ἐμπεριέχει ἤδη ἐπιμερισμὸν ρόλων, ἀμοιβαίαν ἐμπιστοσύνην καὶ συλλογικὴν δέσμευσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀφήγησις ἀποκτᾷ πολιτικὴν δύναμιν ὅταν ἡ μνήμη ἐντάσσηται εἰς παρόντα διάλογον καὶ μέλλοντα ἔργα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ λόγου οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀπομονωμένην, ἀπρόσωπον ἀπόδειξιν ἔξωθεν τοῦ κοινωνικοῦ πλαισίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX2","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφικὴ ἱκανότης οὐκ ὑφίσταται ὡς ἀπολιτικὴ καὶ ἀκοινώνητος θεωρία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX3","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία οὐκ νοεῖται ὡς κλειστὸν ἰδεῶδες σχῆμα ἀπηλλαγμένον στρατηγικῆς ἐφαρμογῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX4","text":"Ἡ παράδοσις οὐκ νοεῖται οὔτε ὡς ἀπαραβίαστος αὐθεντία οὔτε ὡς ἄχρηστον παρελθόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀξιολόγησις τοῦ λόγου οὐκ ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἱκανότητα τοῦ φορέως καὶ τὴν περίστασιν τῆς ἀκροάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἀπολύτως ἀσύνδετου θεωρητικοῦ λόγου, ὃς οὔτε πράξιν οὔτε κοινὴν κρίσιν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ διάκρισις φιλοσόφου καὶ πολιτικοῦ ὡς ἀναγκαίως ἀντιθέτων τύπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται παρελθὸν ὃ μένει ἀδρανὲς ἔξω τῆς παρούσης πολιτικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἀλήθεια ἥτις ἀπαιτεῖ ἄνευ ἐλέγχου ὑποταγὴν τοῦ ἀκροατοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX5","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὁ πλήρης κανὼν ὃς ἂν ἀποφασίζῃ ἐξ ἀρχῆς τὴν ἀλήθειαν τῆς παλαιᾶς διηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS1","text":"Φύσις καὶ τροφή → συγκρότησις ἕξεως → πολιτικὴ καὶ φιλοσοφικὴ ἱκανότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS2","text":"Προηγουμένη πολιτειακὴ συζήτησις → ἀπαίτησις ἀνταποδόσεως → ἀνάθεσις νέου λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS3","text":"Πολιτεία → τοποθέτησις εἰς πόλεμον → ἀπαίτησις πρακτικῆς ἀποδόσεως τῶν προσήκοντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS4","text":"Παλαιὰ ἀκοή → ἀτοπία καὶ ἀλήθεια → ἐπίκλησις παραδόσεως → κοινὴ δοκιμασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS5","text":"Κοινωνικὴ ἱκανότης τοῦ φορέως + παραδεδομένον ὑλικόν + συλλογικὴ κρίσις → πολιτικῶς ἐνεργὸς διήγησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS6","text":"Θεωρητικὸς σχεδιασμός → πολεμικὴ προσομοίωσις → ἀνάγκη ἱστορικοῦ παραδείγματος → ἀφήγησις ὡς ἀπόδοσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF1","text":"Προηγουμένη πολιτείας ἔκθεσις → ἀπαίτησις ἀνταποδόσεως → ἐπείγουσα ἐπιλογὴ ἱκανῶν φορέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF2","text":"Συνδυασμὸς φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς → συνδυασμὸς πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας καὶ φιλοσοφίας → ἀξιοπιστία τοῦ κύκλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF3","text":"Πολιτεία ἐν πολέμῳ → ἀνάγκη ἐνεργοῦ παραδείγματος → μεταγωγὴ ἀπὸ θεωρίαν εἰς διήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF4","text":"Παλαιὰ ἀκοή → ἄτοπος ἀλλὰ ἀληθὴς λόγος → δημόσια ἀκρόασις → κοινὴ κρίσις καταλληλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις θεωρίας καὶ πράξεως μετατοπίζεται εἰς κύκλον ἀμοιβαίας συμπληρώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME2","text":"Ὁ φορεὺς τοῦ λόγου ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἁπλοῦ ἀφηγητοῦ εἰς πολιτικοφιλοσοφικὸν ἐγγυητήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME3","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ μνήμη μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἀδρανὲς κατάλοιπον εἰς ὑλικόν, ὃ δύναται νὰ ἐνεργοποιήσῃ τὴν πολιτειακὴν θεωρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια παύει νὰ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἁπλῶς δεδομένη καὶ ἐγγράφεται εἰς διαδικασίαν κοινῆς ἀποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5","text":"Ἡ πόλις χαρτογραφεῖται ὡς μορφὴ ἣ ὀφείλει νὰ ἀποδειχθῇ καὶ ἐν συνθήκαις συγκρούσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ διήγησις τοῦ Κριτίου ἀνταποκρίνεται εἰς τὴν παράκλησιν τοῦ Σωκράτους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ ἀνάθεσις λόγου στηρίζεται εἰς ἕξιν ἐκ φύσεως, τροφῆς, παιδείας καὶ κοινωνικοῦ κύρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ περὶ πολιτείας θεωρία ἀναζητεῖ ἱστορικὸν ἢ μυθικὸν ὑπόδειγμα, ἵνα ἐλεγχθῇ ἡ πρακτικὴ ἐμβέλεια αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Τὸ παρελθὸν οὐκ ἀπολιθῶται, ἀλλὰ μεταφέρεται διὰ μνήμης εἰς παρὸν διάλογον καὶ μέλλουσαν πολιτικὴν πράξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5","text":"Ἐπιστημολογικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ ἀλήθεια συντίθεται ἐκ μαρτυρίας, ἱκανότητος τοῦ λέγοντος, παραδόσεως καὶ συλλογικοῦ ἐλέγχου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξονικοὶ ὅροι ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ πολιτείαν εἰς πολεμικὴν ἐφαρμογὴν καὶ παλαιὰν διήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT2","text":"Ἡ δομὴ παραμένει ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κοινὴ ἀνάθεσις συνδέει θεωρίαν, ἀκρόασιν καὶ ἀνταπόδοσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένον μένει τὸ ἀκριβὲς περιεχόμενον τῆς παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς καὶ ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ διήγησις θὰ ἀποδείξῃ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἱκανότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT4","text":"Ἡ μεγαλύτερη ἰσχὺς τοῦ συστήματος ἔγκειται στῇ συνδέσει κοινωνικοῦ κύρους, φιλοσοφικῆς παιδείας καὶ πολιτικῆς πράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT5","text":"Ἡ βασικὴ ἔντασις ἔγκειται μεταξὺ τῆς ἐπικλήσεως τῆς παλαιᾶς ἀληθείας καὶ τῆς ἀνάγκης κοινῆς δοκιμασίας αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλ᾽ ἀφήνει ἀνοικτὸν τὸ ἐὰν ἡ παράδοσις ἀποτελεῖ ἱστορικὴν μαρτυρίαν, ποιητικὴν κατασκευήν ἢ πολιτικὸν ὑπόδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225555875855Z_8e601444","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 20","source_sha256":"09470082ab2a5e6250c5ce431a170d7984d8a59765a6b825f2435da9014248f7","sha256":"f91b56c7b5b8d11af2b923bc05d42d1b05f5630f35b30b983b9276d1d8c284d7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:55:55.876937+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS1","text":"The task is to give an account of the inquiry concerning the constitution, so that the city may be displayed in war in practical terms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2","text":"The adequacy of the account depends on nature, nurture, political experience, and philosophical education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS3","text":"The preceding exposition of the constitution is transformed into a requital of accounts and a social obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS4","text":"A narrative from an ancient hearing is introduced as a plausible bearer of truth, although it appears strange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS5","text":"The narration of the ancient account is delivered for common testing of its suitability to the injunction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","text":"Human disposition is constituted from nature and nurture together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","text":"Political capacity and philosophical capacity can coexist in the same person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","text":"The credibility of the speaker rests both on political experience and on philosophical acuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","text":"The theory concerning the constitution requires transposition into martial action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5","text":"The account ought to render to the city what is fitting, if it is placed in a state of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6","text":"The requital of accounts has the character of guest-friendship and common agreement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","text":"An ancient hearing can furnish a true account, even if it appears strange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8","text":"The suitability of the transmitted account requires common testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9","text":"Political narration is activated when it is connected to a specific scene of hearing and judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX1","text":"Capacity is not reducible to nature alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX2","text":"Political worth is not reducible to stock or essence alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX3","text":"Philosophy does not exclude political rule and honor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX4","text":"Inquiry concerning the constitution is not content with abstract description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX5","text":"The antiquity of the account does not by itself prove its untruth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX6","text":"The strangeness of the account does not invalidate its truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX7","text":"Tradition is not exempt from judgment merely by invocation of an ancient hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX8","text":"Hearing is not passive reception, but common testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D1","text":"The conjunction of nature and nurture makes possible the connection between political action and philosophy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D2","text":"The coexistence of political experience and philosophical education legitimates entrusting the account to specific bearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D3","text":"The representation of a city at war transfers constitutional theory from the normative level to the active one.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D4","text":"The preceding discussion produces an obligation of continuation, because the gift of accounts seeks requital.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","text":"The invocation of Solon and an ancient hearing transforms the narration into a witnessed, but not unexamined, account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6","text":"Common testing transforms narration from private memory into a public object of judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD1","text":"The verisimilitude of political discourse is produced from the interweaving of life, education, action, and tradition, not from a single principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD2","text":"The constitution is reconstituted as a form whose completeness appears only when it is measured against war.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD3","text":"Tradition functions simultaneously as a source of truth and as an object of examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD4","text":"The entrusting of the account already includes an apportionment of roles, mutual trust, and collective commitment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD5","text":"Narration acquires political power when memory is incorporated into present dialogue and future deeds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX1","text":"The truth of the account does not depend on isolated, impersonal proof outside the social context.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX2","text":"Philosophical capacity does not exist as apolitical and unsocial theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX3","text":"The constitution is not conceived as a closed ideal form free from strategic application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX4","text":"Tradition is conceived neither as inviolable authority nor as useless past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5","text":"The evaluation of the account is not separated from the capacity of its bearer and the circumstances of the hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an absolutely disconnected theoretical account, requiring neither action nor common judgment, is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX2","text":"The distinction between philosopher and politician as necessarily opposed types is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX3","text":"A past that remains inactive outside present political use is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX4","text":"Truth requiring the hearer's unexamined submission is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX5","text":"The complete criterion that would decide from the outset the truth of the ancient narration is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS1","text":"Nature and nurture → constitution of disposition → political and philosophical capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS2","text":"Preceding constitutional discussion → demand for requital → entrusting of a new account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS3","text":"Constitution → placement in war → demand for practical rendering of what is fitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS4","text":"Ancient hearing → strangeness and truth → invocation of tradition → common testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS5","text":"Social capacity of the bearer + transmitted material + collective judgment → politically active narration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS6","text":"Theoretical design → martial simulation → need for a historical example → narration as rendering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF1","text":"Preceding exposition of the constitution → demand for requital → urgent selection of capable bearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF2","text":"Combination of nature and nurture → combination of political experience and philosophy → credibility of the circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF3","text":"Constitution at war → need for an active example → transposition from theory into narration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF4","text":"Ancient hearing → strange but true account → public hearing → common judgment of suitability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1","text":"The distinction between theory and practice is shifted into a cycle of mutual completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME2","text":"The bearer of the account is reclassified from a mere narrator into a political-philosophical guarantor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME3","text":"Ancient memory is transformed from an inactive remnant into material capable of activating constitutional theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4","text":"Truth ceases to appear as simply given and is inscribed within a process of common acceptance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5","text":"The city is mapped as a form that must prove itself also under conditions of conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT1","text":"Surface level: Critias's narration responds to Socrates' request.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT2","text":"Structural level: The entrusting of the account rests on disposition derived from nature, nurture, education, and social standing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT3","text":"Meta-strategic level: The theory concerning the constitution seeks a historical or mythical paradigm, so that its practical reach may be tested.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: The past does not petrify, but is carried through memory into present dialogue and future political action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5","text":"Epistemological level: Truth is composed from testimony, the capacity of the speaker, tradition, and collective examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT1","text":"The axial terms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from constitution to martial application and ancient narration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT2","text":"The structure remains internally coherent, because common entrusting connects theory, hearing, and requital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise content of the ancient hearing and the manner in which the narration will demonstrate political capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT4","text":"The system's greatest strength lies in the connection of social standing, philosophical education, and political action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT5","text":"The basic tension lies between the invocation of ancient truth and the need for its common testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account, but leaves open whether tradition constitutes historical testimony, poetic construction, or a political paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC2:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 20"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 04","title":"Section 20","context":"Chapter 04","original_title":"Section 20","original_context":"Chapter 04"},"original_title":"Section 20","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4","layer":"CH","title":"Section 21","order":5,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_4"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_4@R001","sha256":"241484333417a9232364aed5510ad46abd7505e2dbf5f034bdba9f3723a5f4fc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS1","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἔργα παλαιὰ καὶ θαυμαστὰ διὰ χρόνου καὶ φθορᾶς ἀνθρώπων ἀφανῆ γεγονότα ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS2","text":"Τὸ μέγιστον ἔργον οὐχ ὡς μῦθος μόνον, ἀλλʼ ὡς ὄντως πραχθὲν ζητεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ ἔργου συγκροτεῖται διὰ διαδοχικῆς μνήμης, ἀπὸ τοῦ Αἰγύπτου λόγου διὰ Σόλωνος εἰς Κριτίαν καὶ τοὺς παρόντας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS4","text":"Ἡ ποιητικὴ ἀμέλεια καὶ αἱ στάσεις τῆς πόλεως ἐξηγοῦνται ὡς αἰτίαι τῆς ἀτελοῦς μεταδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS5","text":"Ἡ διήγησις ἐπαναφέρει τὸ λησμονηθὲν ἔργον εἰς τὴν ἑορτὴν καὶ συνδέει τὴν πολιτικὴν μνήμην πρὸς τὴν θεὸν Ἀθηνᾶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A1","text":"Τὰ ἔργα τῶν πόλεων δύνανται ὑπὸ χρόνου καὶ ἀνθρωπίνης φθορᾶς ἀφανισθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A2","text":"Ἔργον πόλεως δύναται ὄντως πραχθὲν εἶναι καὶ μὴ μόνον λεγόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A3","text":"Τὸ μέγεθος καὶ ἡ δικαιοσύνη τοῦ ἔργου καθιστῶσιν αὐτὸ ἄξιον ἀναμνήσεως καὶ ἐγκωμίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ παρελθόντος μεταδίδεται διὰ μαρτυρικῆς ἀλυσίδος προσώπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5","text":"Ὁ Σόλων ἀληθῆ λόγον ἐξ Αἰγύπτου ἤνεγκεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A6","text":"Ἡ Σόλωνος ποίησις ἠδύνατο τὸν λόγον τοῦτον τελειῶσαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A7","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ στάσις καὶ τὰ ἄλλα κακὰ ἐμπόδια ἐγένοντο τῆς ποιητικῆς ἐργασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A8","text":"Ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ ἑορτὴ διατηροῦσιν ἴχνη παλαιῶν λόγων διὰ ᾠδῆς καὶ ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9","text":"Ἡ Σάις ἐν Αἰγύπτῳ ἔχει θεὸν ἀρχηγὸν ἣν οἱ Αἰγύπτιοι Νηίθ, οἱ δὲ Ἕλληνες Ἀθηνᾶν καλοῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10","text":"Ἡ πρὸς τὴν Ἀθηνᾶν συγγένεια τῶν Σαϊτῶν ἐπιτρέπει τὴν διαπολιτισμικὴν σύνδεσιν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX1","text":"Τὸ παλαιὸν ἔργον οὐκ ἀπομνημονεύεται ὡς ἀπρόσβλητος καὶ πλήρης παράδοσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀλήθεια οὐ ταυτίζεται πρὸς ἁπλὸν μῦθον ἢ ποιητικὴν κατασκευήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις σημερινῆς διηγήσεως οὐ σημαίνει ὅτι τὸ ἔργον οὐκ ἐγένετο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX4","text":"Ὁ Σόλων οὐκ ἀπέτυχε διὰ ἀδυναμίαν ποιητικήν, ἀλλὰ διὰ περιστάσεις πολιτικὰς καὶ ἄλλα κακά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX5","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πόλις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ κλειστὸν καὶ αὐτάρκες πεδίον μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἑορτὴ οὐκ ἀναφέρεται μόνον εἰς τὴν παροῦσαν διασκέδασιν, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ καταστήσῃ ἐνεργὸν τὸ παρελθόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ χρόνος καὶ ἡ φθορὰ ἀφανίζουσι τὰ ἔργα, ἡ ἀνάκτησις τοῦ παρελθόντος απαιτεῖ ἐνεργὸν μνημονικὴν διήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἔργον εἶναι καὶ μέγα καὶ δίκαιον, ἡ ἀναφορά αὐτοῦ γίνεται χρέος πρὸς τὴν πόλιν καὶ τὴν θεόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D3","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ γέροντος, Σόλωνος, Κριτίου καὶ παρόντων μετατρέπει τὴν ἀτομικὴν ἀκοὴν εἰς συλλογικὴν μαρτυρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D4","text":"Ἡ ἀποτυχία τοῦ Σόλωνος νὰ ποιήσῃ τὸν λόγον ἐξηγεῖται ὡς διακοπὴ μεταδόσεως, οὐχ ὡς ἀκύρωσις τῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀνάκλησις τοῦ Αἰγυπτιακοῦ λόγου ἀποδίδει ξένην ἀρχὴν εἰς Ἀθηναϊκὴν αὐτογνωσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D6","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἀναφορά εἰς Ἀθηνᾶν συνδέει τὴν Σάιν καὶ τὴν Ἀθήναν διὰ θρησκευτικῆς καὶ πολιτιστικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD1","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ μνήμη παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀγῶνος κατὰ τῆς χρονικῆς καὶ κοινωνικῆς λήθης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ ἔργου ἐξαρτᾶται οὐ μόνον ἀπὸ τὸ περιεχόμενον, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀκεραιότητα τῆς μεταδοτικῆς ἀλυσίδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀθηναϊκὴ ταυτότης ἀνασυγκροτεῖται διὰ ἀλλοτρίου μαρτυρίου, ὥστε τὸ ξένον νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς κάτοπτρον τοῦ οἰκείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD4","text":"Ἡ λήθη τοῦ ἔργου δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλὴν ἀπουσίαν, ἀλλὰ ἀποτέλεσμα πολιτικῶν ῥηγμάτων καὶ ἀτελοῦς ποιητικῆς μορφοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἀλήθεια δὲν προϋποθέτει ὅτι ὅ,τι ἐγένετο διασώζεται αὐτομάτως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX2","text":"Ἡ συλλογικὴ ταυτότης δὲν παράγεται ἐκ μόνης αὐτοπαρατηρήσεως τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ποιητικὴ ἀξία δὲν ἀρκεί, ἐὰν ἡ πόλις στερεῖται πολιτικῆς ἡσυχίας καὶ συνέχειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX4","text":"Ἡ θρησκευτικὴ συγγένεια δὲν περιορίζεται εἰς ἑνὸς τόπου ἢ ἑνὸς λαοῦ ἰδιοκτησίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀδιατάρακτος συνέχεια ἀναμνήσεως, ἣν ἡ διήγησις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀναπληρώσῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ αὐτάρκης ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀρχὴ τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐμφανίζεται διὰ Αἰγύπτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει ἡ πλήρης ταύτισις τοῦ ἱεροῦ, τοῦ πολιτικοῦ καὶ τοῦ ποιητικοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ διαφορετικὴν μετάδοσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS1","text":"Παλαιὸν ἔργον → χρονικὴ φθορά → ἀπώλεια μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS2","text":"Ἀπωλεσθεῖσα μνήμη → ξένη μαρτυρία → ἀλυσὶς μεταδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS3","text":"Διακοπὴ ποιητικῆς καὶ πολιτικὴ στάσις → ἀτελὴς διατήρησις τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS4","text":"Ἀνάκλησις ἐν ἑορτῇ → ἐπανασύνδεσις πόλεως, θεοῦ καὶ παρελθόντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AF1","text":"Ἀφανὲς παρελθὸν → ἀπαίτησις ἀκριβοῦς διηγήσεως → διάκρισις ἔργου καὶ μύθου → ἀλυσὶς Σόλωνος καὶ Αἰγύπτου → ἐξήγησις τῆς λήθης → ἱερὰ καὶ πολιτικὴ ἐπαναφορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ διασωθὲν τεκμήριον εἰς τὸ ἔργον τῆς ἀνασυγκροτήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2","text":"Ἡ λήθη ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς πολιτικὰ καὶ ποιητικὰ παραγόμενον φαινόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις Ἀθηναϊκοῦ καὶ Αἰγυπτιακοῦ καταλύεται διὰ κοινῆς θεολογικῆς ἀναφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἑορτὴ μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ χρονικὸν συμβάν εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἐνεργοποιήσεως συλλογικῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐξετάζεται ἡ διήγησις παλαιοῦ ἔργου τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ μνήμη ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ χρόνον, φθοράν, στάσιν, ποίησιν καὶ διαδοχὴν μαρτύρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀνακτᾶται διὰ ἀναπλαισιώσεως τῆς πολιτικῆς αὐτοκατανοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ παρελθὸν παραμένει δυνάμει παρόν, ἐὰν ἡ διήγησις ἀνανεωθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ λήθης εἰς μαρτυρίαν καὶ ἀπὸ μαρτυρίας εἰς ἱερὰν ἐπανενεργοποίησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένει τὸ πλήρες περιεχόμενον τοῦ μεγάλου ἔργου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ περικοπὴ ἀναβάλλει τὴν ἀνάπτυξιν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀξιοπιστία της ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀλυσίδα μνήμης ἣν ἡ ἴδια ἡ λήθη ἔχει διακόψει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT5","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὴν γενετικὴν λογικὴν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀνοικτὴν τὴν σχέσην μεταξὺ ἱστορικῆς ἀληθείας, ποιητικῆς μορφῆς καὶ ῥητορικῆς ἐγκωμιάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225902249419Z_30cc59c0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 21","source_sha256":"241484333417a9232364aed5510ad46abd7505e2dbf5f034bdba9f3723a5f4fc","sha256":"3beb156d4d1eed5ea442b327a02758ee5b70c38c3a719708133c1229d8b9a34b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:59:02.252407+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS1","text":"The city possesses ancient and wondrous deeds that have become obscure through time and the destruction of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS2","text":"The greatest deed is sought not merely as a myth, but as something actually accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS3","text":"The truth of the deed is constituted through successive memory, from the Egyptian account through Solon to Critias and those present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS4","text":"Poetic neglect and the civil dissensions of the city are explained as causes of incomplete transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS5","text":"The narrative restores the forgotten deed to the festival and connects political memory with the goddess Athena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A1","text":"The deeds of cities can be obliterated by time and human destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A2","text":"A deed of a city can have been actually accomplished and not merely spoken of.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A3","text":"The greatness and justice of the deed make it worthy of remembrance and encomium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","text":"The truth of the past is transmitted through a testimonial chain of persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5","text":"Solon brought a true account from Egypt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A6","text":"Solon's poetry was able to bring this account to completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A7","text":"Political faction and other evils became obstacles to poetic work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A8","text":"Education and festival preserve traces of ancient accounts through song and remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9","text":"Sais in Egypt has as its tutelary goddess one whom the Egyptians call Neith, and the Greeks Athena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10","text":"The kinship of the Saitians with Athena permits the cross-cultural connection of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX1","text":"The ancient deed is not remembered as an unassailed and complete tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX2","text":"Political truth is not identified with a simple myth or poetic construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX3","text":"The absence of a present narrative does not mean that the deed did not occur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX4","text":"Solon did not fail through poetic incapacity, but through political circumstances and other evils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX5","text":"The Athenian city does not constitute a closed and self-sufficient field of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:NX6","text":"The festival does not refer only to present entertainment, but can render the past active.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D1","text":"Since time and destruction obliterate deeds, the recovery of the past requires an active memorial narrative.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D2","text":"Since the deed is both great and just, its recounting becomes a duty toward the city and the goddess.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D3","text":"The succession of the old man, Solon, Critias, and those present transforms individual hearing into collective testimony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D4","text":"Solon's failure to compose the account is explained as an interruption of transmission, not as a nullification of the truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D5","text":"The recollection of the Egyptian account assigns a foreign origin to Athenian self-knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:D6","text":"The common reference to Athena connects Sais and Athens through religious and cultural kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD1","text":"Political memory is presented as the result of a struggle against temporal and social oblivion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD2","text":"The truth of the deed depends not only on its content, but also on the integrity of the chain of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3","text":"Athenian identity is reconstituted through foreign testimony, so that the foreign functions as a mirror of the familiar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD4","text":"The oblivion of the deed does not constitute a mere absence, but the result of political ruptures and incomplete poetic formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX1","text":"Historical truth does not presuppose that whatever occurred is preserved automatically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX2","text":"Collective identity is not produced from the city's self-observation alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX3","text":"Poetic value is not sufficient if the city lacks political tranquillity and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX4","text":"Religious kinship is not restricted to the possession of one place or one people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX1","text":"Unbroken continuity of remembrance is absent, which the narrative is compelled to replace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX2","text":"A self-sufficient Athenian origin of the account is excluded, since truth appears through Egypt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX3","text":"The complete identification of sacred, political, and poetic discourse remains impossible, since each depends upon a different transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS1","text":"Ancient deed → temporal destruction → loss of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS2","text":"Lost memory → foreign testimony → chain of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS3","text":"Interruption of poetry and political faction → incomplete preservation of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:FGS4","text":"Recollection at a festival → reconnection of city, god, and past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:AF1","text":"Obscure past → demand for an exact narrative → distinction between deed and myth → chain of Solon and Egypt → explanation of oblivion → sacred and political restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1","text":"History is displaced from the preserved proof to the work of reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2","text":"Oblivion is reclassified as a phenomenon produced politically and poetically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME3","text":"The distinction between Athenian and Egyptian is dissolved through a common theological reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4","text":"The festival is transformed from a temporal event into a mechanism for activating collective memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the narrative of an ancient deed of the city is examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, memory depends on time, destruction, faction, poetry, and the succession of witnesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, truth is recovered through a reframing of political self-understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the past remains potentially present, if the narrative is renewed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from oblivion to testimony and from testimony to sacred reactivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3","text":"The full content of the great deed remains underdetermined, because the passage postpones its development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent, but its reliability depends on a chain of memory that oblivion itself has interrupted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT5","text":"The compression preserves the generative logic of the account, but leaves open the relation among historical truth, poetic form, and rhetorical encomium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_4:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 21"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 05","title":"Section 21","context":"Chapter 05","original_title":"Section 21","original_context":"Chapter 05"},"original_title":"Section 21","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5","layer":"CH","title":"Section 22","order":6,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_5"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_5@R001","sha256":"2250b3bce4816f2f6240a4d92ed7945df24ebc5fc41dd2feef7de2c616220c5b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS1","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀντιπαραβάλλει τὴν Ἑλληνικὴν ἀρχαιότητα πρὸς τὴν Αἰγυπτιακὴν μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS2","text":"Ὁ ἱερεὺς μεταστρέφει τὸ καύχημα περὶ παλαιότητος εἰς διάγνωσιν ἀμνημονείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀμνημονεία τῶν Ἑλλήνων ἀποδίδοται οὐκ εἰς φυσικὴν νεότητα, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς ἐπαναλαμβανομένας καταστροφὰς ἀνθρώπων καὶ γνώμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS4","text":"Οἱ μῦθοι περὶ Φαέθοντος καὶ κατακλυσμοῦ ἐρμηνεύονται ὡς σχηματικαὶ ἀναπαραστάσεις κοσμικῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS5","text":"Ἡ γεωγραφία καὶ ὁ Νεῖλος διαφοροποιοῦσι τὴν Αἰγυπτιακὴν ἐπιβίωσιν ἀπὸ τὰς Ἑλληνικὰς καταστροφάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS6","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ παρελθόντος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιβίωσιν φορέων μνήμης καὶ ἀρχεῖων, οὐχὶ μόνον ἀπὸ τὴν ἀρχαιότητα τῶν γεγονότων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","text":"Οἱ Ἕλληνες παρουσιάζονται ὡς νεώτατοι ταῖς ψυχαῖς, ἐπειδὴ στεροῦνται παλαιᾶς ἀκοῆς καὶ χρόνῳ πολιᾶς μαθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","text":"Πολλαὶ φθοραὶ ἀνθρώπων γίγνονται καὶ αὖθις ἔσονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","text":"Αἱ μέγισται φθοραὶ προκαλοῦνται ὑπὸ πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","text":"Οἱ μῦθοι δύνανται νὰ περιέχωσιν ἀληθῆ κοσμολογικὴν δομήν ὑπὸ μυθικῷ σχήματι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5","text":"Ἡ παρέκκλισις τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων δύναται νὰ ἐπιφέρη πυρὶ πολλῷ φθοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","text":"Αἱ γεωγραφικαὶ θέσεις οὐκ ἴσως ὑπομένουν ὁμοίως τὰς κοσμικὰς καταστροφάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","text":"Ἡ Αἴγυπτος ὑπὸ τοῦ Νείλου σώζεται ἀπὸ τινὰς ἀπορίας καὶ φθοράς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A8","text":"Ὁ κατακλυσμὸς φέρει τοὺς κατοικοῦντας παρὰ ταῖς πόλεσιν εἰς θάλασσαν, ἐνώ οἱ ὀρεινοὶ δύνανται διασῴζεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9","text":"Ἐν τῇ Αἰγύπτῳ τὸ ὕδωρ οὐκ ἄνωθεν ἐπὶ τὰς ἀρούρας ἐπιρρεῖ, ἀλλὰ κάτωθεν ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX1","text":"Οἱ Ἕλληνες οὔτε γέροντες οὔτε φορεῖς ἀδιακόπου παλαιᾶς μνήμης εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX2","text":"Ἡ Ἑλληνικὴ ἀρχαιολογία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀσφαλὲς μέτρον πραγματικῆς χρονικῆς συνέχειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX3","text":"Ὁ μῦθος τοῦ Φαέθοντος οὐ λαμβάνεται ὡς ἁπλοῦς ἱστορικὸς βίος, ἀλλ᾽ οὐδὲ ἀπορρίπτεται ὡς κενὴ μυθοπλασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX4","text":"Αἱ καταστροφαὶ οὐκ εἰσὶν ἅπαξ γεγονυῖαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιβίωσις οὐκ ἔχει τὴν αὐτὴν μορφὴν ἐν πάσαις ταῖς χώραις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀρχαιότης τοῦ τόπου οὐ συνεπάγεται διασωθεῖσαν ἀνθρωπίνην μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D1","text":"Ἐὰν αἱ φθοραὶ ἐπαναλαμβάνωνται καὶ ἡ μνήμη ἀφανίζηται, ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη κοινωνία ἐπανέρχεται εἰς κατάστασιν φαινομενικῆς νεότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία παλαιᾶς γνώσεως ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τὴν ἀπώλειαν φορέων μνήμης, οὐ διὰ τὴν ἀπουσίαν παλαιῶν γεγονότων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3","text":"Τὸ μυθικὸν σχῆμα δύναται νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς ἀπομεινάριον φυσικῆς ἐξηγήσεως, ἧς ἡ κυριολεκτικὴ γνώσις ἀπωλέσθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D4","text":"Ἡ Ἑλληνικὴ παράδοσις περὶ Φαέθοντος ἀναγιγνώσκεται ὡς μνήμη οὐρανίου παρεκκλίσεως καὶ πυρὸς καταστροφικοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D5","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ καὶ ἡ διάσωσις ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ τὴν τοπογραφίαν, ὥστε ἡ αὐτὴ κοσμικὴ μεταβολὴ νὰ παράγῃ διαφόρους ἀνθρωπίνους ἀποτελέσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D6","text":"Ὁ Νεῖλος παρέχει εἰδικὸν μηχανισμὸν διασώσεως, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὕδωρ ἐν Αἰγύπτῳ ἀκολουθεῖ ἄλλην φοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἱστορικὴ συνέχεια οὐκ εἶναι καθολικὴ ἀνθρώπινη κατάστασις, ἀλλὰ τοπικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα ἀντοχῆς, διασώσεως καὶ μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης ἀναδιατάσσεται ἀπὸ χρονικὸν ἰδίωμα εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα μνημονικῆς συνέχειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3","text":"Ἡ Αἴγυπτος λειτουργεῖ ὡς θεσμικὸν καὶ γεωγραφικὸν ἀντίθετον τῆς Ἑλλάδος: ἐκεῖ ἡ διαφύλαξις τῆς μνήμης καθίσταται δυνατή, ἐνθάδε δὲ ἡ καταστροφὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν λήθην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ περιοδικότης μετατρέπει τὴν ἱστορίαν εἰς ἀκολουθίαν ἀπωλειῶν καὶ μερικῶν ἐπανεκκινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ ἀνθρωπότης ἀποθησαυρίζει ἀδιακόπως τὴν ἐμπειρίαν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ παλαιὰ ἀλήθεια διασώζεται ἀναγκαίως ἐν τῇ ἀρχαίᾳ παραδόσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ φύσις τῶν καταστροφῶν ἐξηγεῖται ἐκ τῶν ἀνθρωπίνων μύθων μόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ γεωγραφικὴ ἐπιβίωσις εἰς ἕνα τόπον ἀρκεί πρὸς καθολικὴν ἀνθρωπίνην ἐπιβίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ λήθη εἶναι ψυχολογικὸν ἴδιον τῶν ζώντων· ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῶν καὶ γεωγραφικῶν συνθηκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ὑπόθεσις μιᾶς ἀδιάσπαστης παγκοσμίου ἱστορίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὁ καθολικὸς φορεὺς μνήμης ὃς θὰ ἐπέζη πᾶσαν καταστροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀδύνατος ἰδέα ἐστὶν ἡ ἑνιαία σύμπτωσις φυσικῆς ἀρχαιότητος, πολιτικῆς συνέχειας καὶ ἀληθοῦς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX4","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπωθημένη δυνατότης ἐστὶν ὅτι οἱ Ἕλληνες ἔχουσιν ἀληθῶς γέροντα πολιτισμὸν, ὃς ἀπλῶς οὔπω ἐξηγέρθη εἰς μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS1","text":"Ἀρχαία γεγονότα → ἐπαναλαμβανόμεναι κοσμικαὶ φθοραί → ἀφανισμὸς πληθυσμῶν καὶ μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS2","text":"Ἀπώλεια μνήμης → φαινομενικὴ νεότης ζώντων κοινωνιῶν → ψευδὴς καύχησις περὶ ἀρχαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS3","text":"Μυθικὸν σχῆμα → ἀποκρυπτογραφουμένη φυσικὴ ἀλήθεια → ἀνασύνδεσις μύθου καὶ κοσμολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS4","text":"Κοσμικὴ μεταβολή → χωρικῶς διαφοροποιημένη καταστροφή → τοπικὴ διάσωσις ἢ ἀφανισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS5","text":"Νεῖλος καὶ ἰδιόρρυθμος ῥοή → ἀντοχὴ Αἰγύπτου → διατήρησις παλαιᾶς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS6","text":"Διατήρησις γνώσεως → ἀντίθεσις Αἰγύπτου καὶ Ἑλλάδος → ἀνατροπὴ τοῦ Ἑλληνικοῦ αὐτοπροσδιορισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1","text":"Ἑλληνικὸν καύχημα περὶ ἀρχαιότητος → Αἰγυπτιακὴ ἀντιστροφή → διάγνωσις μνημονικῆς νεότητος → περιοδικοὶ κατακλυσμοὶ καὶ πυρκαϊαί → μυθολογικὴ κωδικοποίησις φυσικῆς ἀληθείας → γεωγραφικὴ διαφοροποίησις τῆς ἐπιβιώσεως → Αἰγυπτιακὴ πρωτοκαθεδρία μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἰσχυρισμὸν ταυτότητος εἰς πρόβλημα διασώσεως μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2","text":"Ὁ μῦθος καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις παύουσιν νὰ εἶναι ἀντίθετα καὶ συνδέονται διὰ τῆς ἐρμηνείας τοῦ μυθικοῦ σχήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία παύει νὰ φαίνεται γραμμικὴ καὶ χαρτογραφεῖται ὡς περιοδικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις μετὰ καθολικὰς φθοράς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4","text":"Ἡ γεωγραφία καθίσταται αἰτία ἐπιστημονικῆς καὶ πολιτισμικῆς ἀνισότητος, οὐχὶ ἁπλοῦν σκηνικὸν τῶν γεγονότων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME5","text":"Ἡ Αἴγυπτος ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀποθήκη διασωθείσης μνήμης, ἐνώ ἡ Ἑλλὰς ὡς τόπος ἐπαναλαμβανομένης λήθης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ὁ ἱερεὺς ἐξηγεῖ τὴν διαφορὰν Ἑλλήνων καὶ Αἰγυπτίων περὶ τῆς ἀρχαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ μνήμη ρυθμίζεται ὑπὸ καταστροφῶν, τοπογραφίας, ὑδάτων καὶ διασώσεως πληθυσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἐρμηνεία μεταφέρει τὸ κύρος ἀπὸ τὸν Ἑλληνικὸν λόγον εἰς τὸν Αἰγυπτιακὸν φορέα μνήμης καὶ ἀναγκάζει τὸν ἀκροατὴν νὰ ἀναγνώσῃ τοὺς μύθους ἐκ νέου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ὁ χρόνος νοεῖται κυκλικῶς καὶ καταστροφικῶς· ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἱστορία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ συνεχῆ συσσώρευσιν, ἀλλὰ διακοπτομένην ἀνάκτησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ἀρχαιότητος, μνήμης, φυσικῆς καταστροφῆς καὶ γεωγραφικῆς διασώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις τῶν θέσεων μένει ἐξαρτημένη ἀπὸ τὸ ὅτι ταῦτα λέγει ὁ Αἰγύπτιος ἱερεύς ὡς διήγησιν τοῦ Κριτίου, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀμέσως ἀποδεδειγμένα γεγονότα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τῇ ἀλληλουχίᾳ φθορά → λήθη → φαινομενικὴ νεότης → ἀναγνώρισις διασωθείσης μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT5","text":"Ἡ τάσις μένει ἀνεπίλυτος μεταξὺ καθολικῶν κοσμικῶν φθορῶν καὶ ἐξαιρετικῆς Αἰγυπτιακῆς συνέχειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διασῴζει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλ᾽ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν δραματικὴν δύναμιν τῆς ἀντιθέσεως Ἑλληνικοῦ καυχήματος καὶ Αἰγυπτιακῆς ἀποκαλύψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225919273182Z_ae562dc5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 22","source_sha256":"2250b3bce4816f2f6240a4d92ed7945df24ebc5fc41dd2feef7de2c616220c5b","sha256":"5236f3bd6e4c7ccde851c45b8300cd86625b7347daa215ab4918b1c86f0929af","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:59:19.275388+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS1","text":"The argument contrasts Greek antiquity with Egyptian memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS2","text":"The priest turns the boast concerning antiquity into a diagnosis of forgetfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS3","text":"The forgetfulness of the Greeks is attributed not to natural youth, but to recurrent destructions of human beings and understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS4","text":"The myths concerning Phaethon and the flood are interpreted as schematic representations of cosmic changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS5","text":"Geography and the Nile differentiate Egyptian survival from Greek destructions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS6","text":"Knowledge of the past depends upon the survival of bearers of memory and archives, not only upon the antiquity of events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","text":"The Greeks are presented as youngest in their souls, because they lack ancient hearing and learning grey with time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","text":"Many destructions of human beings occur and will occur again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","text":"The greatest destructions are caused by fire and water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","text":"Myths can contain a true cosmological structure beneath a mythical form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5","text":"A deviation of the heavenly motions can bring destruction by much fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","text":"Geographical locations do not equally endure cosmic catastrophes in the same way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","text":"Egypt is saved by the Nile from certain difficulties and destructions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A8","text":"The flood carries those dwelling near cities into the sea, whereas mountain-dwellers can be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9","text":"In Egypt water does not flow down upon the fields from above, but returns from below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX1","text":"The Greeks are neither old nor bearers of uninterrupted ancient memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX2","text":"Greek archaeology does not constitute a secure measure of real temporal continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX3","text":"The myth of Phaethon is not taken as a simple historical life, but neither is it rejected as empty myth-making.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX4","text":"The catastrophes are not events that happened only once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX5","text":"Survival does not have the same form in all countries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX6","text":"The natural antiquity of a place does not entail preserved human memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D1","text":"If destructions recur and memory vanishes, human society returns to a state of apparent youth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D2","text":"The absence of ancient knowledge is explained by the loss of bearers of memory, not by the absence of ancient events.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3","text":"The mythical form can function as a remnant of a natural explanation whose literal knowledge has been lost.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D4","text":"The Greek tradition concerning Phaethon is read as a memory of heavenly deviation and destructive fire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D5","text":"Destruction and preservation depend upon topography, so that the same cosmic change produces different human results.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:D6","text":"The Nile provides a special mechanism of preservation, because water in Egypt follows another direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1","text":"Historical continuity is not a universal human condition, but a local result of endurance, preservation, and transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD2","text":"Antiquity is rearranged from a temporal property into a result of mnemonic continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3","text":"Egypt functions as the institutional and geographical opposite of Greece: there the preservation of memory becomes possible, whereas here destruction repeats forgetfulness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD4","text":"Cosmic periodicity transforms history into a sequence of losses and partial restarts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that humanity continuously stores up its experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that ancient truth is necessarily preserved in ancient tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the nature of catastrophes is explained from human myths alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that geographical survival in one place suffices for universal human survival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that forgetfulness is a psychological property of the living; it appears as a result of cosmic and geographical conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX1","text":"The hypothesis of an unbroken global history is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX2","text":"The universal bearer of memory that would survive every catastrophe is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX3","text":"The impossible idea is the unified coincidence of natural antiquity, political continuity, and true knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX4","text":"The more deeply repressed possibility is that the Greeks truly possess an old civilization, which simply has not yet awakened into memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS1","text":"Ancient events → recurrent cosmic destructions → annihilation of populations and memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS2","text":"Loss of memory → apparent youth of living societies → false boast concerning antiquity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS3","text":"Mythical form → deciphered natural truth → reconnection of myth and cosmology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS4","text":"Cosmic change → spatially differentiated destruction → local preservation or annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS5","text":"Nile and distinctive flow → endurance of Egypt → preservation of ancient knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS6","text":"Preservation of knowledge → opposition of Egypt and Greece → reversal of Greek self-definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1","text":"Greek boast concerning antiquity → Egyptian reversal → diagnosis of mnemonic youth → periodic floods and conflagrations → mythological encoding of natural truth → geographical differentiation of survival → Egyptian primacy of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1","text":"Antiquity is shifted from a claim of identity into a problem of the preservation of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2","text":"Myth and natural explanation cease to be opposites and are connected through interpretation of the mythical form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME3","text":"History ceases to appear linear and is mapped as periodic reconstruction after universal destructions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4","text":"Geography becomes a cause of scientific and cultural inequality, not a mere setting of events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME5","text":"Egypt is reclassified as a repository of preserved memory, while Greece is reclassified as a place of recurrent forgetfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The priest explains the difference between Greeks and Egyptians concerning antiquity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Memory is regulated by catastrophes, topography, waters, and the preservation of populations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The interpretation transfers authority from Greek discourse to the Egyptian bearer of memory and compels the listener to read the myths anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Time is conceived cyclically and catastrophically; human history does not constitute continuous accumulation, but interrupted recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT2","text":"The derivation preserves the distinction among antiquity, memory, natural catastrophe, and geographical preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT3","text":"The attribution of the positions remains dependent upon the fact that the Egyptian priest says these things as Critias' account, not as immediately demonstrated facts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests upon the sequence destruction → forgetfulness → apparent youth → recognition of preserved memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT5","text":"The tension remains unresolved between universal cosmic destructions and exceptional Egyptian continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument, but removes the dramatic force of the opposition between Greek boasting and Egyptian revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_5:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 22"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 06","title":"Section 22","context":"Chapter 06","original_title":"Section 22","original_context":"Chapter 06"},"original_title":"Section 22","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6","layer":"CH","title":"Section 23","order":7,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_6"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_6@R001","sha256":"a553f86f851d4a37b3c405eb2b6d6eddc528027d0fc6e38d64bdec5d498c8c2e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία ἀφορᾶται τὴν ἀνεπάρκειαν τῶν παρὰ Σόλωνι γνώσεων περὶ τῆς ἀρχαίας ἱστορίας καὶ πολιτείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπουσίαν γεγονότων εἰς τὴν περιοδικὴν ἀπώλειαν μνήμης καὶ γραφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3","text":"Ἡ διατήρησις τῆς γνώσεως ἀποδίδοται εἰς τὴν ἀδιάκοπον ἱερατικὴν γραφήν καὶ τὴν θεσμικὴν μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαία Ἀθήνα ἀναφαίνεται ὡς πόλις προγενεστέρα, πολεμικῶς ἀρίστη καὶ κατὰ νόμους διαφερόντως εὔνομος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασκαφὴ τοῦ λησμονημένου παρελθόντος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκριβῆ διήγησιν παρὰ τῶν φορέων τῆς σωζομένης γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A1","text":"Ὁ ἀνθρώπινος πληθυσμὸς διαμένει κατὰ τόπους ἀεὶ μεταβαλλόμενος, ὅταν οἱ φυσικαὶ καταστροφαὶ μὴ ἀνακόπτωσι τὴν ζωήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","text":"Κατὰ περιοδικοὺς χρόνους οὐράνιον ῥεῦμα ἢ μεγάλη φυσικὴ φθορὰ καταλύει τὰ ἐν πόλεσι γράμματα καὶ τὰς τέχνας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3","text":"Οἱ ἐπιζῶντες μετὰ τὴν φθορὰν ἐπανέρχονται σχεδὸν ἐξ ἀρχῆς, ἄπειροι τῶν παλαιοτέρων πραγμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια τῶν νεωτέρων περὶ τῶν παλαιῶν ἐξηγεῖται ὑπὸ τὴν ἀπώλειαν τῶν φορέων τῆς γραπτῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5","text":"Τὰ σημαντικὰ ἔργα καὶ τὰ μεγάλα γεγονότα τῶν ἀνθρώπων δύνανται νὰ διασωθῶσι διὰ παλαιᾶς γραφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ κοινότης διατηρεῖ ἀδιάκοπον γραπτὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A7","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ μεταξὺ τῶν πολιτισμῶν ἐξηγεῖται ἐκ τῆς διαφορᾶς τῶν ὑποδοχῶν μνήμης καὶ παιδείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","text":"Ἡ παρὰ Σόλωνι γενεαλογία περὶ τῶν ἀρχαίων Ἀθηνῶν ἀποτυγχάνει νὰ διασώσῃ τὸ ἀληθὲς παρελθόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","text":"Ἡ νῦν Ἀθηναίων πόλις ἔχει προγενεστέραν ἱστορικὴν μορφὴν ὑπερβαίνουσαν τὴν γνωστὴν μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10","text":"Ἡ προγενεστέρα Ἀθήνα ἦν κατὰ πόλεμον ἀρίστη καὶ κατὰ πολιτείαν εὐνομοτάτη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς γνώσις τῆς λησμονημένης πολιτείας ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διήγησιν τῶν ἱερέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A12","text":"Ἡ θεὸς ἔθρεψε καὶ ἐπαίδευσε δύο συγγενεῖς πολιτικὰς κοινότητας, ἀλλὰ κατὰ διαφορετικοὺς χρόνους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια τῶν νεωτέρων οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι τὰ παλαιὰ γεγονότα οὐκ ἐγένοντο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης οὐκ ὁρίζεται ὑπὸ τῆς σωζομένης μνήμης μόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ οὐκ ἀφανίζει ἀναγκαίως τὸ γένος τῶν ἀνθρώπων, ἀλλὰ κυρίως τὴν παιδείαν καὶ τὴν γραφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX4","text":"Ἡ νεωτέρα πόλις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὴν πρώτην καὶ πλήρη μορφὴν τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX5","text":"Ἡ προφορικὴ παράδοσις τῶν πολιτῶν οὐκ ἐπαρκεῖ πρὸς ἀκριβῆ ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀρχαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη πολιτικὴ ἱστορία οὐκ εἶναι γραμμικὴ καὶ ἀδιάκοπος πρόοδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐπαναλαμβανομένη φυσικὴ φθορὰ παράγει ἐπαναλαμβανομένην λήθην τῶν πολιτισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D2","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις γραπτῶν μαρτυριῶν μετατρέπει τὴν ἱστορικὴν συνέχειαν εἰς μυθολογικὴν ἀνάμνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D3","text":"Ὁ φορεὺς τῆς ἀρχαίας γραφῆς ἀποκτᾷ γνωσιολογικὴν ὑπεροχὴν ἔναντι τῶν κοινοτήτων αἳ ἐπανεκκινοῦσιν ἐκ λήθης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης τῆς Ἀθηναϊκῆς πολιτείας δύναται νὰ ἀναγνωρισθῇ μόνον διὰ ἐξωτερικῆς ἀρχῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D5","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀριστεία τῆς πόλεως ἀποκρύπτεται ὅταν ἡ μνήμη διακόπτεται, ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἀκυροῦται ὡς γεγονός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D6","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ Ἀθηναίων καὶ ἄλλων λαῶν ἐνδέχεται νὰ ὀφείληται οὐχὶ εἰς φύσιν, ἀλλὰ εἰς τὴν τύχην τῆς μνήμης καὶ τῆς παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἀλήθεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ὑλικὰ καὶ θεσμικὰ συστήματα διατηρήσεως, οὐ μόνον ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν τῶν γεγονότων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ μεταβάλλει τὴν πολιτικὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἐπειδὴ διανέμει ἀνίσως τὴν πρόσβασιν πρὸς τὸ παρελθόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ γνώσις λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀρχὴ ἐπικυρώσεως τοῦ ἀνασυσταθέντος παρελθόντος καὶ τῆς πολιτικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀριστεία ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς λανθάνουσα δυνατότης ἣν ἡ συλλογικὴ λήθη ἀπέκρυψεν, οὐχὶ ὡς καινὴ ἐφεύρεσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ παρὸν ἐξαρκεῖ ὡς μέτρον τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου δυνατοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ ἱστορικὴ λήθη ἔχει ἀμιγῶς φυσικὴν ἢ ἀμιγῶς γνωστικὴν αἰτίαν· ἡ φθορὰ καὶ ἡ ἀπώλεια θεσμῶν συμπλέκονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ πολιτισμικὴ ἀνάπτυξις διατηρεῖται αὐτομάτως διὰ τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ὁ ἱστορικὸς λόγος εἶναι ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ τὸν φορέα ὃς ἔχει τὰ ἀρχεῖα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀξία ταυτίζεται μὲ τὴν ἀναγνωρισμένην ὑπὸ τῶν συγχρόνων μνήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία τοῦ παρελθόντος ἀπὸ τὴν κοινὴν μνήμην δὲν γίνεται δεκτὴ ὡς ἀπουσία τοῦ ἴδιου τοῦ παρελθόντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX2","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης ὅτι οἱ νεώτεροι ζῶσιν ἐπάνω ἐρειπίων λησμονημένων πολιτειῶν ἀποκλείει τὴν αὐτάρκειαν τῆς νεωτέρας αὐτοσυνειδησίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX3","text":"Ἡ πλήρης ἱστορικὴ αὐτονομία τῶν πολιτῶν ἀφαιρεῖται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ παρελθόντος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ξένην ἀρχὴν διασώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX4","text":"Ἡ γραφὴ γίνεται ὅρος τοῦ ἐὰν ἕνας πολιτισμὸς παραμείνῃ ὑποκείμενον ἱστορίας ἢ καταπέσῃ εἰς ἀρχὴν ἄνευ μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1","text":"Φυσικὴ περιοδικότης → καταστροφὴ γραφῆς καὶ παιδείας → ἐπανεκκίνησις ἀγραμμάτου πληθυσμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS2","text":"Ἐπανεκκίνησις → διακοπὴ γενεαλογικῆς μνήμης → μετατροπὴ ἱστορίας εἰς μῦθον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3","text":"Ἱερατικὴ γραπτὴ συνέχεια → συσσώρευσις ἀρχείων → ἀσύμμετρος γνώσις μεταξὺ πολιτισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS4","text":"Ἀσύμμετρος γνώσις → διάψευσις τῆς νεωτέρας αὐτοεικόνος → ἀνάκλησις λησμονημένης Ἀθηναϊκῆς πολιτείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS5","text":"Ἀνάκλησις παρελθόντος → ἀποκατάστασις πολιτικῆς ἀριστείας → ἀπαίτησις ἀκριβοῦς διηγήσεως παρὰ τῶν ἱερέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AF1","text":"Ἀνεπαρκὴς γενεαλογία → περιοδικὴ φυσικὴ φθορά → ἀπώλεια γραφῆς → συλλογικὴ λήθη → ἱερατικὴ ἀνάκτησις → ἀποκάλυψις ἀρχαίας Ἀθηναϊκῆς ἀριστείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ γραμμικὴν διαδοχὴν εἰς κυκλικὸν σχῆμα καταστροφῆς καὶ ἐπανεκκινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀπόδειξιν ἀπουσίας εἰς σύμπτωμα ἀπωλείας μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3","text":"Ἡ γραφὴ ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς πολιτικὸς μηχανισμὸς συνέχειας, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ὡς μέσον ἐπικοινωνίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME4","text":"Ἡ νεωτέρα πόλις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἀτελὴς ἐπιβίωσις προγενεστέρας πολιτικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ κοινότης ἀναλαμβάνει τὸν ρόλον τοῦ ἐξωτερικοῦ ρυθμιστοῦ τῆς ἱστορικῆς ἀλήθειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ διήγησις διορθοῖ τὴν περὶ τῆς ἀρχαίας Ἀθήνας ἄγνοιαν τοῦ Σόλωνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ ἐπιβίωσις τῆς πολιτισμικῆς μνήμης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ φυσικὰς συνθήκας καὶ θεσμοὺς γραπτῆς διατηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς γνώσεως μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν τοπικὴν παράδοσιν εἰς τὸν ἔχοντα τὰ ἀρχεῖα καὶ τὴν ἐρμηνευτικὴν ἐξουσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι καταστροφικὸς καὶ ἐπαναληπτικός· οἱ πολιτισμοὶ δύνανται νὰ ἀφανίζωνται ὡς μνῆμαι ἐνώ παραμένωσιν ὡς λανθάνουσαι δυνατότητες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἐπαρκοῦσιν ὥστε νὰ ἀνασυστήσωσι τὴν κύριαν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν λήθην εἰς τὴν ἱερατικὴν ἀποκάλυψιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν σύνδεσιν φυσικῆς φθορᾶς, ἀπωλείας γραφῶν καὶ διακοπῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT3","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀπροσδιόριστον εἰ ἡ ἀρχαία πολιτικὴ ἀριστεία ἀποδεικνύεται ἢ ἀπλῶς μαρτυρεῖται ὑπὸ τῶν ἱερέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν τῆς ἱερατικῆς ἀρχῆς ὡς ἀξιόπιστου φορέως μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT5","text":"Ἡ συμπύκνωσις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν ῥητορικὴν ἐπιβράδυνσιν καὶ τὴν ἀκριβῆ χρονολογικὴν ἀκολουθίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225936139687Z_0e1e5bcc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 23","source_sha256":"a553f86f851d4a37b3c405eb2b6d6eddc528027d0fc6e38d64bdec5d498c8c2e","sha256":"233280cf62d5d36b9dba2981667461014230fe5d857259e210d3110c16b25b22","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:59:36.143329+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS1","text":"The aporia concerns the insufficiency of Solon's knowledge concerning ancient history and constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS2","text":"The aporia is shifted from the absence of events to the periodic loss of memory and writings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3","text":"The preservation of knowledge is attributed to uninterrupted priestly writing and institutional memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS4","text":"Ancient Athens appears as an earlier city, best in war and distinctively well governed according to laws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS5","text":"The excavation of the forgotten past requires an exact account from the bearers of preserved knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A1","text":"The human population remains in places, always changing, whenever natural catastrophes do not interrupt life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","text":"At periodic times a celestial stream or great natural destruction annihilates the writings and arts in cities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3","text":"Those who survive after the destruction return almost from the beginning, ignorant of earlier matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","text":"The ignorance of later people concerning earlier things is explained by the loss of the bearers of written memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5","text":"The significant works and great events of human beings can be preserved through ancient writing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","text":"The priestly community preserves an uninterrupted written principle of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A7","text":"The difference between civilizations is explained by the difference in the receptacles of memory and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","text":"The genealogy available to Solon concerning ancient Athens fails to preserve the true past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","text":"The present city of the Athenians has an earlier historical form exceeding known memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10","text":"The earlier Athens was best in war and most well-governed in constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11","text":"Exact knowledge of the forgotten constitution depends on the account of the priests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:A12","text":"The goddess reared and educated two kindred political communities, but at different times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX1","text":"The ignorance of later people does not prove that the earlier events did not occur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX2","text":"Antiquity is not defined by preserved memory alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX3","text":"Natural catastrophe does not necessarily obliterate the race of human beings, but chiefly education and writing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX4","text":"The later city does not constitute the first and complete form of the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX5","text":"The oral tradition of citizens does not suffice for an exact reconstruction of antiquity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX6","text":"Human political history is not linear and uninterrupted progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D1","text":"Repeated natural destruction produces repeated forgetting among civilizations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D2","text":"The lack of written testimonies transforms historical continuity into mythological recollection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D3","text":"The bearer of ancient writing acquires epistemic superiority over communities that restart from forgetfulness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D4","text":"The antiquity of the Athenian constitution can be recognized only through an external principle of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D5","text":"The political excellence of the city is concealed when memory is interrupted, but is not annulled as a fact.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:D6","text":"The difference between Athenians and other peoples may be due not to nature, but to the fortune of memory and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A7","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD1","text":"Historical truth depends on material and institutional systems of preservation, not only on the occurrence of events.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD2","text":"Natural catastrophe changes political hierarchy, because it distributes access to the past unequally.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3","text":"Priestly knowledge functions as a principle of validation of the reconstructed past and of political identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4","text":"Political excellence emerges as a latent potentiality which collective forgetting concealed, not as a new invention.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that the present suffices as a measure of human possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that historical forgetting has a purely natural or purely cognitive cause; destruction and the loss of institutions are intertwined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that cultural development is preserved automatically through time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that historical discourse is independent of the bearer who possesses the archives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that political value is identical with the memory recognized by contemporaries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX1","text":"The absence of the past from common memory is not accepted as the absence of the past itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX2","text":"The possibility that later people live upon the ruins of forgotten constitutions excludes the self-sufficiency of later self-consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX3","text":"The complete historical autonomy of citizens is removed, because the truth of the past depends on an alien principle of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX4","text":"Writing becomes a condition of whether a civilization remains a subject of history or falls into an origin without memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1","text":"Natural periodicity → destruction of writing and education → restarting of an illiterate population.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS2","text":"Restarting → interruption of genealogical memory → transformation of history into myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3","text":"Priestly written continuity → accumulation of archives → asymmetrical knowledge between civilizations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS4","text":"Asymmetrical knowledge → refutation of the later self-image → recollection of a forgotten Athenian constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS5","text":"Recollection of the past → restoration of political excellence → requirement of an exact account from the priests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:AF1","text":"Insufficient genealogy → periodic natural destruction → loss of writing → collective forgetting → priestly recovery → revelation of ancient Athenian excellence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1","text":"History is shifted from linear succession to a cyclical pattern of destruction and restarting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2","text":"Ignorance is reclassified from proof of absence to a symptom of lost memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3","text":"Writing emerges as a political mechanism of continuity, not merely as a means of communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME4","text":"The later city appears as an incomplete survival of an earlier political form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5","text":"The priestly community assumes the role of the external regulator of historical truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The account corrects Solon's ignorance concerning ancient Athens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The survival of cultural memory depends on natural conditions and institutions of written preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The principle of knowledge is shifted from local tradition to the one possessing the archives and interpretive authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Time is destructive and repetitive; civilizations can vanish as memories while remaining as latent potentialities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal movement from forgetting to priestly revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT2","text":"Internal coherence rests on the connection of natural destruction, loss of writings, and interruption of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT3","text":"It remains indeterminate whether ancient political excellence is proved or merely attested by the priests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction depends on accepting priestly authority as a reliable bearer of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT5","text":"The condensation preserves the actual movement of the discourse, but removes rhetorical retardation and precise chronological sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_6:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 23"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 07","title":"Section 23","context":"Chapter 07","original_title":"Section 23","original_context":"Chapter 07"},"original_title":"Section 23","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7","layer":"CH","title":"Section 24","order":8,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_7"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_7@R001","sha256":"0e71cb36227056d6671835fb71aa8e1bca1f864a314afc0f2c1c9dca81805fe3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS1","text":"Τὸ ἀκριβὲς τῶν λεγομένων ἀναβάλλεται εἰς ὕστερον, ἐνταῦθα δὲ ὁ λόγος διὰ τῶν νόμων καὶ τῶν παραδειγμάτων προχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS2","text":"Ἡ πόλις ὁρίζεται διὰ τῆς κατὰ γένη διακρίσεως καὶ τῆς ἑκάστῳ γένει προσήκουσας ἔργου τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS3","text":"Ἡ πολεμικὴ τάξις ἀποχωρίζεται τῶν ἄλλων γενῶν, ὥστε ἡ κοινωνικὴ ἑνότης νὰ μὴ σημαίνῃ ἀδιαίρετον ἔργων σύγχυσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS4","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις συγκροτεῖται ἀπὸ κοσμικὴν θεωρίαν εἰς μαντικὴν, ἰατρικὴν καὶ τὰ ἑπόμενα μαθήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS5","text":"Θεία διάταξις, τόπος καὶ εὐκρασία τῶν ὡρῶν συναρμόζονται πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν φρονιμωτάτων ἀνδρῶν καὶ ἀρίστης πολιτείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ τῆς πόλεως ἀποδεικνύεται τελικῶς διὰ τῆς παύσεως ἐξωτερικῆς δυνάμεως ὕβρει ἐπὶ Εὐρώπην καὶ Ἀσίαν ὁρμησάσης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","text":"Ὁ νόμος διατάσσει τὴν πόλιν κατὰ διακεκριμένα γένη καὶ ἔργα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2","text":"Ἕκαστον δημιουργικὸν γένος ἐπιτελεῖ τὸ ἴδιον ἔργον καὶ οὐ συγχέεται τοῖς ἄλλοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","text":"Τὸ μάχιμον γένος ἀφωρισμένον ἐστὶν ἀπὸ πάντων τῶν ἄλλων καὶ ὑπὸ τοῦ νόμου περὶ τὰ πολεμικὰ μόνον ἐπιμελεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ φρόνησις ἀρχὴν λαμβάνει ἀπὸ τὴν θεωρίαν τοῦ κόσμου καὶ ἐκτείνεται εἰς πρακτικὰς ἐπιστήμας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","text":"Θεὰ ἡ πόλιν διακοσμεῖ, συντάσσει καὶ κατοικίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6","text":"Ὁ τόπος καὶ ἡ εὐκρασία τῶν ὡρῶν συμβάλλουσιν εἰς τὴν γένεσιν φρονίμων ἀνδρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7","text":"Ἡ θεία φύσις συνδυάζει φιλοπολεμίαν καὶ φιλοσοφίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","text":"Ἡ θεόθεν γενεὰ καὶ παιδεία παράγουσιν ὑπερέχουσαν πολιτικὴν ἀρετήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9","text":"Ἡ μεγίστη ἀπόδειξις τῆς ἀρετῆς ἐστὶν ἡ σωτηρία τῶν Ἑλλήνων καὶ τῶν ἄλλων ἀνθρώπων ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ὕβριν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX1","text":"Ἡ εὐνομία οὐκ ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τῇ συγχύσει τῶν κοινωνικῶν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX2","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ κοινὸν ἀδιάκριτον ἔργον πάντων τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX3","text":"Τὸ μάχιμον γένος οὐκ ἐπιφορτίζεται ἄλλαις ἀσχoλίαις παρὰ τὰ πολεμικά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX4","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις οὐ περιορίζεται εἰς πολεμικὴν ἰσχύν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ τῆς πόλεως οὐκ ἀποδεικνύεται διὰ τῆς ἁπλῆς ὑπεροχῆς ἐν ὅπλοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX6","text":"Ἡ πόλις οὐκ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς αὐτοφυὴς ἢ ἀθέσμως συγκροτημένη κοινότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D1","text":"Ἐκ τῆς διακρίσεως τῶν γενῶν καὶ τῆς ἰδιοπραγίας παράγεται τάξις ἧς ἡ σταθερότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ μὴ ἐπιμείγνυσθαι τὰ ἔργα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D2","text":"Ἐκ τοῦ χωρισμοῦ τοῦ μαχίμου γένους παράγεται ἡ θεσμικὴ ἀποκλειστικότης τῆς πολεμικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D3","text":"Ἐκ τῆς κοσμικῆς θεωρίας παράγεται ἑνιαία ἁλυσὶς γνώσεως ἀπὸ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ κόσμου μέχρι τὴν ὑγείαν καὶ τὴν μαντικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D4","text":"Ἐκ τῆς θείας διακοσμήσεως καὶ τῆς καταλλήλου χώρας παράγεται ἡ ἀναγκαία συνάφεια θεσμοῦ, περιβάλλοντος καὶ ἀνθρωπίνης φρονήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D5","text":"Ἐκ τοῦ συνδυασμοῦ φιλοπολεμίας καὶ φιλοσοφίας παράγεται τύπος πολιτείας ὅστις ἅμα διανοεῖται καὶ μάχεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D6","text":"Ἐκ τῆς θεόθεν παιδείας καὶ τῆς διατεταγμένης πολιτείας παράγεται ἀξίωσις ὑπεροχῆς ἔναντι πάντων τῶν ἀνθρώπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D7","text":"Ἐκ τῆς ἐξωτερικῆς ἀπειλῆς καὶ τῆς ἀναχαιτίσεως αὐτῆς παράγεται ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἐπιβεβαίωσις τῆς ἀρετῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία κατασκευάζεται ὡς ὅλον ἐν ᾧ κοινωνικὴ διαίρεσις, γνωστικὴ παιδεία, θεία πρόνοια καὶ στρατιωτικὴ ἀποστολὴ ἀλληλοβεβαιοῦνται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴν διάταξιν εἰς ἐξωτερικὴν ἱστορικὴν σωτηρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD3","text":"Ἡ θεία ἐκλογὴ τοῦ τόπου νομιμοποιεῖ συγχρόνως τὴν κοινωνικὴν ἱεράρχησιν, τὴν παιδείαν καὶ τὴν πολεμικὴν ἀποστολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐπικράτησις τῆς πόλεως ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀναγκαῖον ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς της τάξεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς τυχαία στρατιωτικὴ νίκη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις δύναται νὰ θεμελιωθῇ χωρὶς προδιαγεγραμμένην διαφορὰν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φρόνησις αὐτοτελῶς παράγει τὸν πολιτισμὸν ἄνευ κοσμικοῦ καὶ θείου προτύπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολεμικὴ δύναμις ἀποτελεῖ ἀρκετὸν κριτήριον πολιτικῆς ἀξίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀρετὴ ἔχει μόνον ἐσωτερικὸν ἢ τοπικὸν χαρακτῆρα καὶ οὐδεμίαν σχέσιν πρὸς τὴν ἱστορικὴν σωτηρίαν ἄλλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ὁ τόπος εἶναι οὐδέτερος ὡς πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν τοῦ πολιτικοῦ ἤθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ συστήματος ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη αὐτοθεμελίωσις τῆς πόλεως· ἡ ἀρχὴ μετατίθεται εἰς θείαν ἐκλογὴν καὶ κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης πολιτείας ἥτις ἔχει ἀρετὴν ἄνευ ἱεραρχικῆς διακρίσεως καὶ λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ οὐδέτερος ἱστορία· ἡ πόλις ἢ σώζει τοὺς ἄλλους ἢ ἀποτυγχάνει νὰ ἀποδείξῃ τὴν ἀρετήν της.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS1","text":"Θεία ἐκλογὴ τόπου → εὐκρασία κλίματος → γένεσις φρονίμων ἀνδρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS2","text":"Κοσμικὴ θεωρία → ἐπιστημονικὴ καὶ πρακτικὴ παιδεία → φρόνησις πολιτική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS3","text":"Διαίρεσις γενῶν → ἰδιοπραγία → κοινωνικὴ τάξις → σταθερὰ πολιτεία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS4","text":"Χωρισμὸς μαχίμου γένους → πολεμικὴ ἀποστολὴ → ἀναχαίτισις ἐξωτερικῆς ὕβρεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS5","text":"Θεία τάξις + φρόνησις + πολεμικὴ ἱκανότης → ὑπεροχὴ πολιτείας → ἱστορικὴ ἀπόδειξις ἀρετῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AF1","text":"Ἀναβολὴ ἀκριβείας → ἐξέτασις νόμων → διάκρισις γενῶν → σύνδεσις φρονήσεως καὶ κόσμου → θεία κατοίκησις → ἀξίωσις ἀρετῆς → παύσις ἐξωτερικῆς ὕβρεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME1","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ διαίρεσις ἀναταξινομείται ὡς ὅρος εὐνομίας καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἔλλειψις ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME2","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀτομικὴν διάνοιαν εἰς συνεχὲς κοσμολογικὸν καὶ θεσμικὸν σύστημα γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME3","text":"Ὁ τόπος μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ γεωγραφικὸν δεδομένον εἰς αἴτιον πολιτικῆς καὶ διανοητικῆς ἀριστείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4","text":"Ἡ στρατιωτικὴ νίκη ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς τεκμήριον συνολικῆς πολιτικῆς ἀρετῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME5","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς σύνθεσις φιλοσοφίας καὶ πολέμου, ὄχι ὡς ἀμιγὴς στρατιωτικὴ ἢ διανοητικὴ δύναμις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ λόγος ἐξετάζει νόμους, γένη, ἔργα, ὅπλα καὶ πολεμικὸν ἔργον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πόλις συγκροτεῖται διὰ λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ, παιδείας καὶ θεσμικῆς ἱεραρχίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀρετὴ κρίνεται διὰ τῆς ἱκανότητος ἀντιμετωπίζειν ἐξωτερικὴν ὕβριν καὶ διασώζειν τοὺς ἄλλους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πολιτεία ἐμφανίζεται ὡς θεόθεν καὶ κοσμικῶς προδιατεταγμένη, ἡ δὲ ἱστορικὴ νίκη ὡς ἐκδήλωσις τῆς προϋπαρχούσης τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κυρίας κινήσεως ἀπὸ νόμιμον διάταξιν εἰς ἱστορικὴν ἀπόδειξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν χωρισμοῦ, παιδείας, θείας προνοίας καὶ πολεμικῆς σωτηρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθʼ ὃν ἡ κοσμολογικὴ γνώσις μεταβαίνει εἰς συγκεκριμένους θεσμούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἐπίσης ἡ ἱστορικὴ μαρτυρία τῶν μεγάλων ἔργων, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἐπικαλεῖται γεγραμμένα τεκμήρια ἄνευ περαιτέρω ἐξετάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὡς μυθοπολιτικὴ θεμελίωσις, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν θείας αἰτιότητος καὶ κληρονομημένης ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας κοινωνικῆς ἱεραρχίας καὶ τῆς καθολικῆς σωτηριολογικῆς ἀξιώσεως τῆς πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225953555550Z_e61deb4d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 24","source_sha256":"0e71cb36227056d6671835fb71aa8e1bca1f864a314afc0f2c1c9dca81805fe3","sha256":"e0a3e18340ed9a31499c1465a1d7323127cce40fc3bb909480687896bba1f0af","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:59:53.558771+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS1","text":"The precise account of what is said is deferred until later; here the argument proceeds through laws and examples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS2","text":"The city is defined through the distinction by classes and the ordering of the work appropriate to each class.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS3","text":"The military class is separated from the other classes, so that social unity may not signify an undivided confusion of functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS4","text":"Prudence is constituted from cosmic theory into divination, medicine, and the subsequent disciplines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS5","text":"Divine ordering, place, and the temperateness of the seasons are harmonized toward the generation of most prudent men and the best regime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS6","text":"The virtue of the city is finally demonstrated through the stopping of an external power that had rushed in hubris against Europe and Asia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","text":"The law orders the city according to distinct classes and functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2","text":"Each productive class performs its own function and is not confused with the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","text":"The military class is set apart from all the others and, under the law, attends only to military matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","text":"Political prudence takes its beginning from the contemplation of the cosmos and extends into practical sciences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","text":"A goddess adorns, orders, and settles the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6","text":"Place and the temperateness of the seasons contribute to the generation of prudent men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7","text":"The divine nature combines love of war and love of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","text":"Divinely bestowed lineage and education produce superior political virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9","text":"The greatest proof of virtue is the salvation of the Greeks and other human beings from external hubris.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX1","text":"Good order under law is not grounded in the confusion of social functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX2","text":"Production does not constitute a common, undifferentiated function of all classes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX3","text":"The military class is not burdened with other occupations besides military ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX4","text":"Prudence is not limited to military strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX5","text":"The virtue of the city is not demonstrated by mere superiority in arms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX6","text":"The city does not appear as a self-grown or unlawfully constituted community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D1","text":"From the distinction of classes and the performance of one's own function arises an order whose stability depends on functions not being intermixed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D2","text":"From the separation of the military class arises the institutional exclusivity of the military function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D3","text":"From cosmic theory arises a unified chain of knowledge from the order of the cosmos through health and divination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D4","text":"From divine ordering and suitable land arises the necessary connection of institution, environment, and human prudence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D5","text":"From the combination of love of war and love of wisdom arises a type of regime that both thinks and fights.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D6","text":"From divinely bestowed education and the ordered regime arises a claim of superiority over all human beings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:D7","text":"From the external threat and its repulsion arises the historical confirmation of virtue.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1","text":"The regime is constructed as a whole in which social division, cognitive education, divine providence, and military mission mutually confirm one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD2","text":"Virtue is transformed from internal ordering into external historical salvation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD3","text":"The divine selection of place simultaneously legitimates social hierarchy, education, and military mission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD4","text":"The predominance of the city appears as a necessary result of its internal order and not as an accidental military victory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX1","text":"The idea that political order can be founded without a preordained differentiation of functions is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX2","text":"The idea that human prudence autonomously produces civilization without a cosmic and divine model is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX3","text":"The idea that military power constitutes a sufficient criterion of political worth is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX4","text":"The idea that virtue has only an internal or local character and no relation to the historical salvation of others is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:DNX5","text":"The idea that place is neutral with respect to the generation of political character is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX1","text":"Human self-foundation of the city is absent from the system; the principle is transferred to divine selection and cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX2","text":"The possibility of a regime possessing virtue without hierarchical distinction and functional separation is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX3","text":"Neutral history is absent; the city either saves others or fails to demonstrate its virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS1","text":"Divine selection of place → temperateness of climate → generation of prudent men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS2","text":"Cosmic theory → scientific and practical education → political prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS3","text":"Division of classes → performance of one's own function → social order → stable regime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS4","text":"Separation of the military class → military mission → repulsion of external hubris.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS5","text":"Divine order + prudence + military capacity → superiority of the regime → historical proof of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:AF1","text":"Deferral of precision → examination of laws → distinction of classes → connection of prudence and cosmos → divine settlement → claim of virtue → stopping of external hubris.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME1","text":"Social division is reclassified as a condition of good order under law and not as a lack of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME2","text":"Prudence is shifted from individual intellect into a continuous cosmological and institutional system of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME3","text":"Place is transformed from a geographical datum into a cause of political and intellectual excellence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4","text":"Military victory is reclassified as evidence of comprehensive political virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME5","text":"The city emerges as a synthesis of philosophy and war, not as a purely military or intellectual power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the argument examines laws, classes, functions, arms, and military function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the city is constituted through functional separation, education, and institutional hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, virtue is judged through the capacity to confront external hubris and save others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the regime appears as divinely and cosmically preordered, and historical victory as a manifestation of the pre-existing order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for a reconstruction of the principal movement from lawful ordering to historical proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the sequence of separation, education, divine providence, and military salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT3","text":"The precise manner in which cosmological knowledge passes into particular institutions is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT4","text":"The historical testimony of great deeds is likewise underdetermined, since the argument invokes written evidences without further examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT5","text":"The structure is coherent as a mythopolitical foundation, but depends on the acceptance of divine causality and inherited superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT6","text":"The principal tension remains between necessary social hierarchy and the city's universal soteriological claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_7:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 24"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 08","title":"Section 24","context":"Chapter 08","original_title":"Section 24","original_context":"Chapter 08"},"original_title":"Section 24","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8","layer":"CH","title":"Section 25","order":9,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_8"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_8@R001","sha256":"483c4608c3fb3c94b9c4c5bbffc0c47c146a1d060a63a7adfb304180f83fcbd4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαία γεωγραφία μετατίθησι τὸ γνωστὸν πέλαγος εἰς μείζονα κόσμον καὶ τὰς Ἡρακλείους στήλας εἰς πέρας ὁρίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS2","text":"Ἐκ τούτου συγκροτεῖται ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς ὡς κέντρον βασιλικῆς δυνάμεως ὑπερβαίνουσας νῆσον καὶ ἤπειρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἐπεκτεινομένη δύναμις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς καθολικὴν ἀπειλὴν δουλώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS4","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ πόλις τῶν Ἀθηναίων ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς μοναδικὸς ἀντιστατικὸς φορεὺς ἀρετῆς, ῥώμης καὶ πολεμικῆς τέχνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS5","text":"Ἡ νίκη τῶν Ἀθηναίων παράγει ἐλευθερίαν διὰ τοὺς ἔτι ἀδούλωτους καὶ τοὺς ἐντὸς τῶν ὁρίων κατοικοῦντας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS6","text":"Σεισμὸς καὶ κατακλυσμὸς ἀφανίζουσιν ἅμα τὴν Ἀτλαντίδα καὶ τὸ μάχιμον τῶν Ἀθηναίων, ὥστε ἡ διήγησις νὰ ἐπιβιώσῃ μόνον ὡς μνήμη συνδεομένη πρὸς τὴν περὶ πολιτείας θεωρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A1","text":"Ὁ γεωγραφικὸς κόσμος τῆς διηγήσεως εἶναι μείζων τοῦ ἐντὸς τῶν Ἡρακλείων στηλῶν γνωστοῦ χώρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A2","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς νῆσος ἀποτελεῖ πολιτικὸν καὶ στρατιωτικὸν κέντρον μεγάλης βασιλικῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντικὴ δύναμις ἄρχει πολλῶν νήσων καὶ μερῶν τῆς ἠπείρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","text":"Ἡ συγκεντρωμένη Ἀτλαντικὴ ἰσχὺς ἐπιχειρεῖ δουλῶσαι ὅλον τὸν περικείμενον πολιτικὸν χώρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ Ἀθήνα διαθέτει ἀρετήν, εὐψυχίαν, ῥώμην καὶ πολεμικὴν τέχνην ἱκανὰς πρὸς ἀντίστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πόλις δύναται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ τὴν ἡγεμονίαν τῶν Ἑλλήνων ἢ νὰ ἀμυνθῇ μόνη ὅταν οἱ ἄλλοι ἀποστῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ νίκη ἐλευθεροῖ τοὺς μὴ δεδουλωμένους καὶ ἐμποδίζει τὴν περαιτέρω δουλείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","text":"Φυσικὴ καταστροφή δύναται νὰ ἀφανίσῃ ἅμα πολιτικὰ σώματα, στρατιωτικὴν δύναμιν καὶ γεωγραφικὴν προσβασιμότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","text":"Ἡ ἀπολεσθεῖσα ἱστορία διασώζεται διὰ διαδοχῆς ἀκοῆς, ἀπὸ Κριτίαν πρὸς Σόλωνα καὶ ἔπειτα πρὸς τὸν Σωκράτην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10","text":"Ἡ μνήμη τῆς παλαιᾶς Ἀθηναϊκῆς πράξεως ἐνεργοποιεῖται ὡς ἐρμηνευτικὸς φακὸς τῆς περὶ πολιτείας συζητήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX1","text":"Ἡ θάλασσα ἐκτὸς τῶν Ἡρακλείων στηλῶν οὐκ ἔστιν ἄπειρος ἢ ἀδιάβατος κατὰ τὴν ἀρχαίαν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX2","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπλῶς νῆσος ἰδιωτική, ἀλλὰ πολιτικὸς πυρήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX3","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντικὴ ἐπέκτασις οὐκ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἁπλῆ κυριαρχία, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἀπόπειρα καθολικῆς δουλώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX4","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀντίστασις οὐκ ἐρείδεται μόνον εἰς συμμαχικὴν ἀριθμητικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἐλευθερία τῶν ἐντὸς τῶν ὁρίων οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτόματον πολιτικὴν κατάστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX6","text":"Ἡ λήθη τῆς παλαιᾶς τάξεως οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι ἡ τάξις οὐδέποτε ὑπῆρξεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX7","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ οὐκ ἀφανίζει μόνον τὴν Ἀτλαντίδα, ἀλλὰ καὶ τὸ ἀρχικὸν Ἀθηναϊκὸν πολεμικὸν ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D1","text":"Ἡ διεύρυνσις τοῦ γεωγραφικοῦ χάρτου καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν νοηματοδότησιν τῆς Ἀτλαντικῆς δυνάμεως ὡς διαπεριφερειακῆς ἡγεμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D2","text":"Ἡ πολυκεντρικὴ κυριαρχία τῆς Ἀτλαντίδος μετατρέπει τὴν τοπικὴ σύγκρουσιν εἰς ἀγῶνα περὶ τῆς ἐλευθερίας ὅλου τοῦ ἐντὸς χώρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D3","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πολιτικὴ ἀρετὴ ἀποδεικνύεται ἐν τῇ ἀναλήψει κινδύνου ὅταν οἱ λοιποὶ σύμμαχοι ἀποστῶσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D4","text":"Ἡ νίκη τῶν Ἀθηναίων ἔχει διπλὸν ἀποτέλεσμα: ἀνακόπτει τὴν Ἀτλαντικὴν προέλασιν καὶ ἀποκαθιστᾷ τὴν ἐλευθερίαν τῶν ἄλλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ διακόπτει τὴν ἱστορικὴν συνέχεια καὶ μεταβάλλει τὴν γεωγραφίαν εἰς ἐμπόδιον μνήμης καὶ ἔρευνας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀνάμνησις τῆς Ἀθηναϊκῆς πράξεως ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν συγγενείας μεταξὺ τῆς ἐν τῷ παρόντι πολιτείας θεωρίας καὶ τοῦ παλαιοῦ πολιτικοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀρετὴ ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἡ ἱκανότης ἀντιστῆναι πρὸς καθολικὴν ἰσχὺν καὶ συγχρόνως νὰ ἐλευθεροῖ ἄλλους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντικὴ ἡγεμονία καὶ ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἐλευθερωτικὴ ἡγεμονία συγκροτοῦν ἀντίθετα καθολικὰ μοντέλα πολιτικῆς ἐπεκτάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀπότομος μηχανισμὸς ἐξισώσεως, ὁ ὁποῖος ἀφανίζει καὶ τὸν δυνάστην καὶ τὸν ἀμυνόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀνάμνησις παράγεται ἐκ συνδυασμοῦ ἀφανισμοῦ, ἀποσπασματικῆς ἀκοῆς καὶ ἐπανασυνδέσεως πρὸς νεωτέραν θεωρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD5","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ μοναχὴ ἀντίστασις ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἐπιβεβαιοῦται ὑπὸ τῆς πράξεως μᾶλλον ἢ ὑπὸ τῆς ἀπλῆς κατοχῆς ἰσχύος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἐλευθερία οὐκ ἐκλαμβάνεται ὡς φυσικὴ ἢ προϋπάρχουσα κατάστασις, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει ἀντίστασιν πρὸς δύναμιν δουλώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX2","text":"Ἡ μεγάλη γεωγραφικὴ ἔκτασις οὐκ ἀρκέσει ἄνευ πολιτικῆς ἑνοποιήσεως καὶ στρατιωτικῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ πλήρη καὶ ἀπρόσκοπτον ἀποθήκην γεγονότων, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σωζομένας μεταδόσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἣ ἐλευθεροῖ τοὺς ἄλλους οὐκ ἀποφεύγει ἀναγκαίως τὴν ἡγεμονικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX5","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἐγγυᾶται τὴν διατήρησιν πολιτικῶν ἢ μνημονικῶν μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX6","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια μεταξὺ παλαιοῦ παραδείγματος καὶ νεωτέρας θεωρίας οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει ταυτότητα, ἀλλὰ παράγει ἐρμηνευτικὴν ἀναγνώρισιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἐλευθερία ὑφίσταται ἄνευ κινδύνου, πολέμου καὶ ἀναλήψεως συλλογικῆς ἰσχύος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ σταθερὰ διάκρισις μεταξὺ δικαίας ἡγεσίας καὶ ἐπεκτατικῆς κυριαρχίας, ἐπειδὴ ἀμφότεραι συγκροτοῦνται διὰ ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀμεσότης μεταξὺ παρελθόντος καὶ παρόντος· ἡ πολιτικὴ σημασία τοῦ παρελθόντος ἐμφανίζεται μόνον διὰ ἀναμνήσεως καὶ ἐρμηνευτικῆς ἐπαναφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ὁριστικὴ νίκη ἐπὶ τῆς δουλώσεως παραμένει ἀδύνατος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ καταστροφὴ ἀφανίζει καὶ τὸν φορέα τῆς νίκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS1","text":"Ἐπέκτασις γεωγραφικοῦ ὁρίζοντος → συγκρότησις διαπεριφερειακῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS2","text":"Συγκεντρωμένη κυριαρχία → καθολικὴ ἀπόπειρα δουλώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS3","text":"Καθολικὴ ἀπειλή → ἀνάδειξις Ἀθηναϊκῆς ἀρετῆς διὰ κινδύνου καὶ μοναχικῆς ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS4","text":"Ἀθηναϊκὴ νίκη → παρεμπόδισις δουλείας → ἐλευθέρωσις τοῦ ἐντὸς χώρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS5","text":"Σεισμὸς καὶ κατακλυσμός → κατάλυσις πολιτικῶν σωμάτων καὶ γεωγραφικῶν διαβάσεων → ἀνάγκη διαμεσολαβημένης μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS6","text":"Διαμεσολαβημένη μνήμη → ἀναγνώρισις ἀντιστοιχίας μεταξὺ παλαιοῦ πολιτικοῦ ἔργου καὶ παρούσης περὶ πολιτείας θεωρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF1","text":"Περιορισμένος γεωγραφικὸς ὁρίζων → ἀνασύνθεσις μείζονος κόσμου → Ἀτλαντικὴ συγκεντρωμένη ἰσχύς → καθολικὴ ἀπειλὴ δουλώσεως → Ἀθηναϊκὴ μοναχικὴ ἀντίστασις → ἐλευθέρωσις → φυσικὴ καταστροφή → μνημονικὴ ἐπανενεργοποίησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF2","text":"Ἀτλαντικὴ ἡγεμονία → ἀνάγκη ἀντιθέτου πολιτικοῦ παραδείγματος → Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀρετή → ἀνάσχεσις δουλείας → ἱστορικὸς ἀφανισμός → ἐρμηνευτικὴ σύνδεσις πρὸς τὴν πολιτείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1","text":"Ὁ χάρτης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ κλειστὸν ἐσωτερικὸν πέλαγος εἰς ἀνοικτὸν σύστημα νήσων, ἠπείρων καὶ πολιτικῶν ζωνῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME2","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ τόπον εἰς μηχανὴν διακρατικῆς κυριαρχίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πόλις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ τοπικὴ κοινότητα εἰς φορέα καθολικῆς ἀπελευθερώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME4","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ συνδέει γεωλογίαν, πολιτικὴν ἱστορίαν καὶ ἀδυναμίαν ἐμπειρικοῦ ἐλέγχου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME5","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ μνήμη καθίσταται ἐνεργὸν ὑπόβαθρον τῆς νεωτέρας πολιτικῆς θεωρίας, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ἀφηγηματικὸν παρένθεμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Περιγράφεται ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς, ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀντίστασις, ἡ νίκη καὶ ὁ κατακλυσμὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἀντιπαρατίθενται δύο μορφαὶ πολιτικῆς συγκεντρώσεως: ἡ δουλωτικὴ ἐπέκτασις καὶ ἡ ἐλευθερωτικὴ ἀντίστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἀνάμνησις τοῦ παλαιοῦ πολέμου ἐπαναπλαισιοῖ τὴν συζήτησιν περὶ πολιτείας καὶ ἀνδρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ὑπόκειται εἰς ἀφανισμόν, ἐνῶ ἡ ἱστορικὴ παρουσία διασώζεται μόνον διὰ χρονικῆς μεταδόσεως καὶ ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT1","text":"Αἱ δέκα ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ ἐπιχειρηματικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία γεωγραφικὴ διεύρυνσις → ἡγεμονικὴ ἀπειλή → Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀντίστασις → ἐλευθέρωσις → καταστροφὴ → μνήμη διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τῆς Ἀθηναϊκῆς πολιτείας καὶ ὁ τρόπος καθ’ ὃν ἡ νεωτέρα θεωρία ἀντιστοιχεῖ πρὸς τὸ παλαιὸν παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ ἐσωτερικῶς συνέχεται ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἀντίθεσιν δουλώσεως καὶ ἐλευθερώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μεγαλύτερα ἔντασις ἐνυπάρχει τῇ συνυπάρξει Ἀθηναϊκῆς ἀπελευθερωτικῆς δράσεως καὶ ἡγεμονικῆς ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀφηγηματικὴν ἀκοήν καὶ ἀπὸ ἐρμηνευτικὴν ἐπανασύνδεσιν, διὸ ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἀξίωσις παραμένει μερικῶς ἀνοικτή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230012803007Z_0cb4ccbd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 25","source_sha256":"483c4608c3fb3c94b9c4c5bbffc0c47c146a1d060a63a7adfb304180f83fcbd4","sha256":"17917d2897e274569b47b674877ec3aaad726c7206b191cd3e5ed109eca9244f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:00:12.805591+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS1","text":"Ancient geography relocates the known sea into a larger world and the Pillars of Heracles to the end of a boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS2","text":"From this Atlantis is constituted as a center of royal power extending beyond island and continent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS3","text":"The expanding power is transformed into a universal threat of enslavement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS4","text":"The ancient city of the Athenians emerges as the unique resistant bearer of virtue, strength, and military art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS5","text":"The victory of the Athenians produces freedom for those not yet enslaved and for those dwelling within the boundaries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS6","text":"Earthquake and flood simultaneously obliterate Atlantis and the fighting force of the Athenians, so that the narrative survives only as a memory connected to the theory concerning the constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A1","text":"The geographical world of the narrative is larger than the known region within the Pillars of Heracles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A2","text":"The island of Atlantis constitutes a political and military center of a great royal power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","text":"The Atlantic power rules many islands and parts of the continent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","text":"The concentrated Atlantic power undertakes to enslave the entire surrounding political space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","text":"Ancient Athens possesses virtue, courage, strength, and military art sufficient for resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","text":"The Athenian city is able to assume leadership of the Greeks or to defend itself alone when the others withdraw.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7","text":"The Athenian victory frees those not enslaved and prevents further enslavement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","text":"Natural disaster can simultaneously obliterate political bodies, military power, and geographical accessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","text":"The lost history is preserved through a succession of reports, from Critias to Solon and then to Socrates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10","text":"The memory of the ancient Athenian deed is activated as an interpretive lens for the discussion concerning the constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX1","text":"The sea beyond the Pillars of Heracles is not infinite or impassable in the ancient arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX2","text":"Atlantis is not merely a private island, but a political nucleus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX3","text":"Atlantic expansion is not defined as simple dominion, but as an attempt at universal enslavement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX4","text":"Athenian resistance does not rest solely upon allied numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX5","text":"The freedom of those within the boundaries does not constitute an automatic political condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX6","text":"The forgetting of the ancient order does not prove that the order never existed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX7","text":"Natural disaster does not obliterate Atlantis alone, but also the original Athenian military subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D1","text":"The expansion of the geographical map makes possible the signification of Atlantic power as transregional hegemony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D2","text":"The polycentric dominion of Atlantis transforms the local conflict into a struggle concerning the freedom of the whole inner space.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D3","text":"Athenian political virtue is demonstrated in the undertaking of danger when the remaining allies withdraw.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D4","text":"The victory of the Athenians has a double result: it checks the Atlantic advance and restores the freedom of the others.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5","text":"The catastrophe interrupts historical continuity and transforms geography into an obstacle to memory and inquiry.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6","text":"The recollection of the Athenian deed permits the recognition of an affinity between the theory concerning the constitution in the present and the ancient political paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1","text":"Political virtue appears as the capacity to resist universal power and at the same time to free others.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2","text":"Atlantic hegemony and Athenian liberating hegemony constitute opposing universal models of political expansion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3","text":"Natural disaster functions as an abrupt mechanism of equalization, which obliterates both the oppressor and the defender.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4","text":"Political memory is produced from a combination of obliteration, fragmentary report, and reconnection to a later theory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD5","text":"The solitary Athenian resistance reveals that political order is confirmed by deed rather than by the simple possession of power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1","text":"Freedom is not understood as a natural or pre-existing condition, but presupposes resistance to a power of enslavement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX2","text":"Great geographical extent is not sufficient without political unification and military capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3","text":"History does not constitute a complete and unobstructed repository of events, but depends upon preserved transmissions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4","text":"The city that frees others does not necessarily avoid the hegemonic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX5","text":"The natural order does not guarantee the preservation of political or memorial forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX6","text":"The affinity between an ancient paradigm and a later theory does not prove identity, but produces interpretive recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1","text":"Absent is a world in which freedom exists without danger, war, and the assumption of collective power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX2","text":"The stable distinction between just leadership and expansionist dominion is excluded, since both are constituted through superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX3","text":"Immediacy between past and present is absent; the political significance of the past appears only through recollection and interpretive return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4","text":"Definitive victory over enslavement remains impossible, because catastrophe obliterates even the bearer of victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS1","text":"Expansion of geographical horizon → constitution of transregional power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS2","text":"Concentrated dominion → universal attempt at enslavement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS3","text":"Universal threat → emergence of Athenian virtue through danger and solitary resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS4","text":"Athenian victory → prevention of enslavement → liberation of the inner space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS5","text":"Earthquake and flood → dissolution of political bodies and geographical passages → necessity of mediated memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS6","text":"Mediated memory → recognition of correspondence between ancient political work and the present theory concerning the constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF1","text":"Limited geographical horizon → reconstruction of a larger world → Atlantic concentrated power → universal threat of enslavement → Athenian solitary resistance → liberation → natural disaster → memorial reactivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF2","text":"Atlantic hegemony → necessity of an opposing political paradigm → Athenian virtue → checking of enslavement → historical obliteration → interpretive connection to the constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1","text":"The map is shifted from a closed inner sea to an open system of islands, continents, and political zones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME2","text":"Atlantis is transformed from a place into a mechanism of interstate dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3","text":"The Athenian city is reclassified from a local community into a bearer of universal liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME4","text":"The catastrophe links geology, political history, and the impossibility of empirical verification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME5","text":"Ancient memory becomes an active substratum of later political theory, not merely a narrative parenthesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Atlantis, Athenian resistance, victory, and the flood are described.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Two forms of political concentration are opposed: enslaving expansion and liberating resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The recollection of the ancient war reframes the discussion concerning the constitution and men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Political order is subject to obliteration, while historical presence is preserved only through temporal transmission and recollection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT1","text":"The ten principles suffice for the reconstruction of the basic argumentative mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT2","text":"The sequence geographical expansion → hegemonic threat → Athenian resistance → liberation → catastrophe → memory preserves the actual movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT3","text":"The precise nature of the Athenian constitution and the manner in which the later theory corresponds to the ancient paradigm are underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent with respect to the opposition between enslavement and liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension inheres in the coexistence of Athenian liberating action and hegemonic superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on narrative report and interpretive reconnection; hence the historical claim remains partially open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_8:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 25"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 09","title":"Section 25","context":"Chapter 09","original_title":"Section 25","original_context":"Chapter 09"},"original_title":"Section 25","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9","layer":"CH","title":"Section 26","order":10,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SE_9"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_9@R001","sha256":"f4d1b2609311d4d8036c98b512c095b08a628332ca7f0ab141178bc335b78c83","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀνάκλησις τοῦ παλαιοῦ λόγου προϋποτίθεται πρὶν ἢ ἡ διήγησις λεχθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS2","text":"Ἡ μακρὰ καὶ ἐπαναλαμβανομένη μάθησις βεβαιότερον ἐν τῇ μνήμῃ μένει ἢ ἡ πρόσφατος ἀκρόασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS3","text":"Ὁ χθεσινὸς μῦθος μετασχηματίζεται εἰς λόγον καθ᾽ ἕκαστα ἀκριβῶς ἀποδιδόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS4","text":"Ἡ μυθικὴ πόλις καὶ οἱ μυθικοὶ πολῖται μεταφέρονται εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς ὡς ἡ παροῦσα πόλις καὶ οἱ ἀληθινοὶ πρόγονοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS5","text":"Ἡ προτεινομένη ταύτισις ζητεῖται νὰ ἐλεγχθῇ ὡς πρέπουσα πρὸς τὸν λόγον, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς νὰ ἐπιβληθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","text":"Ἡ διήγησις δεῖται προτέρου χρόνου ἀναλήψεως καὶ ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀνάμνησις ἀπαιτεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν ἐπισκόπησιν καὶ ἀνασύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ καὶ πολλάκις ἀκουσθεῖσα διδασκαλία ἐγκαθίσταται μονιμώτερον ἐν τῇ μνήμῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀπόδοσις τοῦ λόγου ὀφείλει νὰ περιλαμβάνῃ τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα, οὐ μόνον τὰ κεφάλαια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","text":"Ὁ λόγος ὁ ἀρμόζων τοῖς βουλήμασιν ἀποτελεῖ τὸ κύριον ἔργον τῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","text":"Ἡ πόλις τοῦ χθεσινοῦ μύθου δύναται νὰ μετατεθῇ εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς ὡς ἡ αὐτὴ παροῦσα πόλις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7","text":"Οἱ μυθικοὶ πολῖται δύνανται νὰ ἐρμηνευθῶσιν ὡς οἱ ἀληθινοὶ πρόγονοι τῶν παρόντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις τοῦ πρέποντος λόγου ἀποτελεῖ κοινὴν δοκιμὴν τῶν συνομιλητῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ ταύτισις παραμένει ὑπὸ ἔλεγχον καὶ δύναται νὰ ἀντικατασταθῇ δι᾽ ἄλλης ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX1","text":"Ὁ λόγος οὐκ ἀναλαμβάνεται παραχρῆμα ἄνευ χρόνου πρὸς ἑαυτὸν ἀνασκοπήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις οὐ περιορίζεται εἰς κεφαλαιώδεις περιλήψεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX3","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ διήγησις οὐ παραμένει ἀποκεκλεισμένη ἐν τῷ μύθῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX4","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις τῆς παλαιᾶς πόλεως πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν οὐ θεωρεῖται αὐτομάτως βεβαία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX5","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἀπόπειρα οὐ συνίσταται εἰς ἀνεξέλεγκτον ἀποδοχὴν τοῦ προτεινομένου λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν ἀκριβῆ ἀπόδοσιν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D2","text":"Ἡ ἐπαναλαμβανομένη διδασκαλία παρέχει σταθερώτερον ὑπόβαθρον ἀναμνήσεως ἢ ἡ χθεσινὴ ἀκρόασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια τῆς ἀναμνήσεως νομιμοποιεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὸ κεφαλαιῶδες εἰς τὸ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D4","text":"Ἡ μεταφορὰ τῆς μυθικῆς πόλεως εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἐπανερμηνείαν τῶν προσώπων ὡς ἱστορικῶν προγόνων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τῆς μεταφορᾶς κρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν καταλληλότητα τοῦ λόγου καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον ἀπὸ τὴν δυνατότητα τῆς ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1","text":"Ἡ μνήμη μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ παθητικὴν διατήρησιν εἰς μέθοδον ἐνεργοῦ ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2","text":"Ἡ μυθικὴ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου λειτουργεῖ ὡς προσχέδιον ἐρμηνείας τοῦ ἀληθινοῦ πολιτικοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις γίνεται συλλογικὴ διαδικασία ἐλέγχου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀτομικὴ μνήμη ὀφείλει νὰ καταστῇ κοινὸς λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX1","text":"Ἡ παροῦσα πόλις οὐ θεωρεῖται ἀσύνδετος πρὸς τὴν παλαιὰν διήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαίως ἀντίθετος πρὸς τὸν μῦθον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX3","text":"Ἡ μνήμη οὐ θεωρεῖται ἁπλῶς ἀτομικὴ ἢ ἀνεπαρκὴς πρὸς κοινὴν ἀπόδοσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν πολιτῶν οὐ συγκροτεῖται μόνον ἐκ τοῦ παρόντος, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ προγονικὴν ἀναφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ὁ παλαιὸς λόγος νὰ μείνῃ ἄνευ ἐνεργοῦ σχέσεως πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν πόλιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὁριστικὴ διάκρισις μεταξὺ μυθικῆς κατασκευῆς καὶ ἀληθινῆς πολιτικῆς καταγωγῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναζήτησις ἄλλου λόγου παραμένει ἀνοικτή, ἀλλ᾽ οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀναβάλῃ τὴν ἀνάγκην τῆς ἀποδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS1","text":"Πρόσφατος ἀκρόασις καὶ παλαιὰ διδασκαλία διακρίνονται κατὰ τὴν ἰσχὺν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀνάληψις μετατρέπει τὴν μνήμην εἰς ἕτοιμον λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS3","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια τοῦ λόγου μεταφέρει τὴν διήγησιν ἀπὸ τὸ κεφαλαιῶδες εἰς τὰ καθ᾽ ἕκαστα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS4","text":"Ἡ μετάθεσις ἀπὸ τὸν μῦθον εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς ταυτίζει πόλιν, πολίτας καὶ προγόνους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS5","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ δοκιμὴ ἐλέγχει εἰ ἡ ταύτισις παράγει πρέποντα λόγον ἢ ἀπαιτεῖ ἄλλην ἐρμηνείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1","text":"Ἀνεπαρκὴς πρόσφατος μνήμη → ἐσωτερικὴ ἀνάληψις → ἀκριβὴς ἀναδιήγησις → μετάθεσις τοῦ μύθου εἰς τὸ ἀληθές → προγονικὴ ταύτισις → κοινὸς ἔλεγχος καταλληλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀξία τῆς μνήμης μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀμεσότητα τῆς ἀκροάσεως εἰς τὴν χρονικὴν ἐδραίωσιν τῆς μαθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μύθου καὶ ἀληθείας ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς διαδικασία μεταφορᾶς καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME3","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀναγιγνώσκεται ὡς ἱστορικὴ συνέχεια καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον ὡς παροῦσα κοινότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις τοῦ λόγου μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἀτομικὴν ἀνάμνησιν εἰς συλλογικὴν κατασκευήν νοήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀναδιήγησις ὧν ἠκούσθη πρότερον καθίσταται δυνατή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ὁ χρόνος, ἡ ἐπανάληψις καὶ ἡ κοινὴ ἐξέτασις συγκροτοῦσι τὴν ἐγκυρότητα τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ὁ μῦθος χρησιμοποιεῖται ὡς ὄργανον ἐπαναπροσδιορισμοῦ τῆς παρούσης πολιτικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ παρελθὸν καὶ τὸ παρὸν συνδέονται διὰ μνήμης, ὥστε οἱ παλαιοὶ πολῖται νὰ καθίστανται πρόγονοι τῶν νῦν ὄντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT1","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία τῶν ἀξιωμάτων ἀρκεῖ πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2","text":"Ἡ δομὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ἀναμνήσεως, ἀναδιηγήσεως, μεταφορᾶς καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις τῆς παλαιᾶς πόλεως πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν παραμένει ὑπόθεσις καὶ οὐχὶ ἀποδεδειγμένον δεδομένον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται στὴν ἀλληλουχία μνήμης, ἀκριβείας καὶ καταλληλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή παραμένει ἐλλιπὴς ὡς πρὸς τὰ πραγματολογικὰ κριτήρια τοῦ «ἀληθοῦς» καὶ τοῦ «πρέποντος».","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT6","text":"Ἡ συμπυκνωμένη μηχανὴ διασώζει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφίησιν ἀπροσδιόριστον τὸ περιεχόμενον τῆς ἀναμενομένης πολιτικῆς διηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230028016032Z_107aca52","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 26","source_sha256":"f4d1b2609311d4d8036c98b512c095b08a628332ca7f0ab141178bc335b78c83","sha256":"9ebb33e11b9991ed9ea46ac8646da120ef7ba5c9c68d22604b1f9871644c733b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:00:28.017035+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS1","text":"The exact recollection of the old account is presupposed before the narration is spoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS2","text":"Long and repeated learning remains more securely in memory than recent hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS3","text":"Yesterday's myth is transformed into an account rendered exactly in particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS4","text":"The mythical city and the mythical citizens are transferred into the true as the present city and the true ancestors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS5","text":"The proposed identification is sought to be tested as fitting to the account, not simply imposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","text":"The narration requires a prior time of retrieval and recollection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","text":"Recollection requires internal review and reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","text":"Old teaching, heard many times, is established more permanently in memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4","text":"The exact rendering of the account ought to include the particulars, not only the headings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","text":"The account suited to the intentions constitutes the principal work of reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","text":"The city of yesterday's myth can be transferred into the true as that same present city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7","text":"The mythical citizens can be interpreted as the true ancestors of those now present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","text":"The rendering of the fitting account constitutes a common test of the interlocutors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9","text":"The final identification remains under examination and can be replaced by another explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX1","text":"The account is not retrieved immediately without time for reviewing it to oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX2","text":"The rendering is not confined to summary outlines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX3","text":"The old narration does not remain enclosed in myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX4","text":"The identification of the old city with the present one is not regarded as automatically certain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX5","text":"The common attempt does not consist in an unexamined acceptance of the proposed account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D1","text":"Internal reconstruction makes possible the exact rendering of the account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D2","text":"Repeated teaching provides a more stable basis for recollection than yesterday's hearing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D3","text":"The accuracy of recollection authorizes the transition from the summary outline to the particulars.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D4","text":"The transfer of the mythical city into the true permits the reinterpretation of the persons as historical ancestors.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5","text":"The truth of the transfer is judged by the suitability of the account and not only by the possibility of recollection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1","text":"Memory is transformed from passive retention into a method of active reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2","text":"The mythical form of the account functions as a sketch for interpreting the true political world.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A5","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A6","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3","text":"Reconstruction becomes a collective process of examination, because individual memory must become a common account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX1","text":"The present city is not regarded as unconnected with the old narration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX2","text":"Truth is not conceived as necessarily opposed to myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX3","text":"Memory is not regarded as merely individual or inadequate for a common rendering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4","text":"The identity of the citizens is not constituted from the present alone, but depends on ancestral reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX1","text":"The possibility that the old account should remain without an active relation to the present city is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX2","text":"The definitive distinction between mythical construction and true political descent is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX3","text":"The search for another account remains open, but cannot defer the necessity of rendering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS1","text":"Recent hearing and old teaching are distinguished by the strength of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS2","text":"Internal retrieval transforms memory into a ready account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS3","text":"The accuracy of the account transfers the narration from the summary outline to the particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS4","text":"The transfer from myth into the true identifies city, citizens, and ancestors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS5","text":"The common test examines whether the identification produces a fitting account or requires another interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1","text":"Inadequate recent memory → internal retrieval → exact re-narration → transfer of myth into the true → ancestral identification → common examination of suitability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1","text":"The value of memory shifts from the immediacy of hearing to the temporal consolidation of learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2","text":"The distinction between myth and truth is reshaped as a process of transfer and examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME3","text":"The city is read as historical continuity and not only as a present community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4","text":"The rendering of the account is transformed from individual recollection into a collective construction of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The exact re-narration of what was heard before becomes possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Time, repetition, and common examination constitute the validity of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Myth is used as an instrument for redefining present political identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The past and the present are connected through memory, so that the old citizens become ancestors of those who now are.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT1","text":"The sequence of axioms suffices for reconstructing the basic movement of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2","text":"The structure preserves the distinction among recollection, re-narration, transfer, and examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3","text":"The identification of the old city with the present one remains a hypothesis and not a demonstrated datum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4","text":"Internal coherence rests on the sequence of memory, accuracy, and suitability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction remains incomplete with respect to the factual criteria of the «true» and the «fitting».","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SE_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT6","text":"The condensed mechanism preserves the movement of the account, but leaves indeterminate the content of the expected political narration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SE_9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SE_9:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 26"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 10","title":"Section 26","context":"Chapter 10","original_title":"Section 26","original_context":"Chapter 10"},"original_title":"Section 26","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10","layer":"CH","title":"Section 27","order":11,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_10"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_10@R001","sha256":"d5a8882061920c102442e8da3f2ceec414df49bdda5605ef4380b79c47bda6e6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1","text":"Τὸ ζητούμενον ἐστὶ λόγος ἀληθής, οὐ μῦθος πεπλασμένος, καὶ τῇ ἱερᾷ περιστάσει προσήκων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS2","text":"Ἡ διάταξις τῶν λόγων μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κοσμογονίας εἰς ἀνθρωπολογίαν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς πολιτικὴν ἱστορίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS3","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ διήγησις προϋποτίθεται ὑπὸ τῆς κοσμικῆς καὶ ἀνθρωπίνης γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀληθοφάνεια καὶ ἡ εὐταξία τοῦ λόγου ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ θεῶν ἐπίκλησιν καὶ εὐχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀπαιτεῖ συντονισμὸν θείας εὐμενείας, ἀνθρωπίνης μαθήσεως καὶ τοῦ λέγοντος ἐνδείξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","text":"Ὁ προσήκων λόγος τῇ θυσίᾳ καὶ τῇ ἑορτῇ ὀφείλει εἶναι ἀληθής, οὐ πλασθεὶς μῦθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","text":"Ὁ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λόγος ἀνάγκη θεοὺς καὶ θεὰς ἐπικαλεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ τάξις τῆς ἐξηγήσεως ἄρχεται ἀπὸ τῆς τοῦ κόσμου γενέσεως καὶ τελευτᾷ εἰς τὴν ἀνθρώπων φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","text":"Οἱ ἄνθρωποι τῷ λόγῳ γεγονότες δύνανται ὕστερον πολιτικῶς καὶ παιδευτικῶς προσδιορισθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A5","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀφήγησις δύναται τοὺς παλαιοὺς Ἀθηναίους εἰς δικαστὰς καὶ πολίτας τῆς παρούσης πόλεως καταστήσειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ τῶν λέξεων ὀργανῶται διὰ ἀμοιβαίας ξενίας καὶ κατανομῆς ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","text":"Ἡ εὐστοχία τοῦ λόγου ζητεῖται μάλιστα πρὸς τοὺς θεούς, ἑπομένως δὲ πρὸς τοὺς ἀνθρώπους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A8","text":"Ὁ λέγων ὀφείλει τὸν λόγον οὕτως ἐνδείκνυσθαι ὥστε οἱ μὲν ἀκούοντες μανθάνειν, αὐτὸς δὲ τὴν διάνοιαν σαφηνίζειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX1","text":"Ὁ προσήκων λόγος οὐκ ἔστι μῦθος πλασθείς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX2","text":"Ἡ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς ἐξήγησις οὐκ ἀρκεῖται τῇ ἀνθρωπίνῃ αὐταρκείᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX3","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ διήγησις οὐκ ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ κοσμογονίας καὶ ἀνθρωπογονίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX4","text":"Οἱ ἄνθρωποι οὐκ εἰσάγονται ὡς ἄνευ γενέσεως καὶ παιδείας ὑπάρχοντες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX5","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ τῶν λόγων οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀτάκτως ἐπιτελουμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX6","text":"Ὁ λόγος οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ μόνον τὴν τοῦ λέγοντος δύναμιν, ἀλλὰ καὶ θείαν εὔνοιαν καὶ ἀκροατῶν μάθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D1","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ ἀφήγησις καθίσταται ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς ἀνθρωπολογικῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D2","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης τῶν Ἀθηναίων παράγεται διὰ γενεᾶς, παιδείας, νόμου καὶ μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία ξενία μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀφήγησιν εἰς συλλογικὴν ἔργων ἀνάληψιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D4","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ λόγου συνδέεται μὲν πρὸς τὴν ἀποφυγὴν πλαστοῦ μύθου, ἐξαρτᾶται δὲ καὶ ἀπὸ θείαν ἐπίκλησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D5","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀποκτᾷ διπλῆν κατεύθυνσιν, πρὸς θεοὺς ὡς κριτὰς εὐστοχίας καὶ πρὸς ἀνθρώπους ὡς μαθητάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D6","text":"Ἡ σιωπὴ τοῦ Σωκράτους ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἀνάληψιν τοῦ κοσμολογικοῦ λόγου ὑπὸ τοῦ Τιμαίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀφήγησις ὅλη μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ἁλυσίδα, ἐν ᾗ τὸ θεῖον θεμελιοῖ τὸ κοσμικόν, τὸ κοσμικὸν τὸ ἀνθρώπινον, καὶ τὸ ἀνθρώπινον τὸ πολιτικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία παρίσταται οὐχ ὡς ἀφετηρία, ἀλλʼ ὡς τελικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῆς τάξεως καὶ παιδευτικῆς διαμεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD3","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ παντὸς καθίσταται κοινὸν ἔργον θεῶν, λέγοντος καὶ ἀκουόντων, οὐκ ἰδιωτικὴ ἐπίδειξις σοφίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀπαίτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου συνυπάρχει μετὰ τῆς ἀναγνωρίσεως ὅτι ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἀπόφανσις δεῖται ἐπικλήσεως καὶ εὐχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ κόσμος νοητὸς εἶναι ἄνευ γενέσεως, τάξεως καὶ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις νοηθῆναι ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς κοσμικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πολιτικὴ κοινότης συγκροτεῖσθαι ἄνευ μνήμης, νόμου καὶ παιδείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ λόγος περὶ τοῦ ὄντος ἔχειν πλήρη ἐξουσίαν ἐφʼ ἑαυτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀκρίβεια τοῦ λόγου ἀποχωρίζεσθαι ἀπὸ τῆς σχέσεως λέγοντος καὶ ἀκουόντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX1","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ δυνατότης λόγου καθαρώς κοσμικοῦ, ὃς οὔτε θείαν ἐπίκλησιν οὔτε ἀνθρωπίνην μάθησιν χρῄζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX2","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ δυνατότης πολιτείας ἀνεξαρτήτου κοσμολογικῆς καὶ ἀνθρωπολογικῆς θεμελιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX3","text":"Ἀνεπίτρεπτος μένει λόγος ὃς ἀπαιτεῖ ἀλήθειαν ἀλλὰ ἀρνεῖται τὴν ἀβεβαιότητα καὶ τὴν ἐξάρτησιν τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4","text":"Ἡ σιωπηρῶς κυκλουμένη ἀπουσία ἐστὶν ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἐγγύησις ὅτι ὁ ἀληθὴς λόγος ἄνευ θείας συναινέσεως κατορθωθήσεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS1","text":"Ἱερὰ περίστασις → ἀπαίτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου → ἀπόρριψις πλαστοῦ μύθου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS2","text":"Ἐπίκλησις θεῶν → εὐχὴ περὶ τοῦ παντός → ἐξάρτησις τοῦ λόγου ἀπὸ θείας εὐμενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3","text":"Γένεσις κόσμου → φύσις ἀνθρώπων → δυνατότης πολιτικῆς ἐντάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS4","text":"Παραλαβὴ ἀνθρώπων → παιδεία ἐκλεκτῶν → νόμος καὶ μνήμη → συγκρότησις πολιτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS5","text":"Κατανομὴ ῥόλων → ἀμοιβαία ξενία → ἀνάληψις τοῦ ἑπομένου λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS6","text":"Θεία εὐστοχία → ἀνθρωπίνη μάθησις → ἐνδείξις τῆς διανοίας τοῦ λέγοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF1","text":"Ἱερὰ περίστασις → ζήτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου → ἀπόρριψις πλαστοῦ μύθου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF2","text":"Ἀνάγκη θείας ἐπικλήσεως → κοσμολογικὴ ἀφετηρία → ἀνθρωπολογικὴ συνέχεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF3","text":"Γεγονότες ἄνθρωποι → πεπαιδευμένοι ἄνθρωποι → Ἀθηναῖοι πολῖται καὶ δικασταί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF4","text":"Παράδοσις λόγου → ἀμοιβαία ξενία → ἀνάληψις τῆς ἑπομένης ἀφηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF5","text":"Θεοὶ ὡς κριταί → ἄνθρωποι ὡς μαθηταί → λόγος ὡς κοινὴ ἐνέργεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀφήγησις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ μεμονωμένων πολιτῶν εἰς ἱεραρχημένην κλίμακα κόσμου, ἀνθρώπου καὶ πόλεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μύθου καὶ ἀληθοῦς λόγου ἐπανατάσσεται ὡς διάκρισις πλαστῆς κατασκευῆς καὶ θεμελιωμένης ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης ἀνακατατάσσεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα γενεᾶς, παιδείας, νόμου καὶ ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME4","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ γνώσεως ἀναφαίνεται ὡς συνεργασία θείας ἐπικλήσεως, λέξεως καὶ ἀκροάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME5","text":"Ἡ σιωπὴ τοῦ προηγουμένου ὁμιλητοῦ μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀπουσία λόγου εἰς προϋπόθεσιν νέας ἀφηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ σκηνὴ ρυθμίζει τίς λέγει, τίς ἀκούει, καὶ τίς ἀναλαμβάνει τὸν ἑπόμενον λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις συνδέει κοσμολογίαν, ἀνθρωπολογίαν, παιδείαν καὶ πολιτικὴν συγκρότησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ πειθὼ τοῦ λόγου θεμελιοῦται διὰ ἐπικλήσεως θεῶν, κατανομῆς ρόλων καὶ προετοιμασίας ἀκροατῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ πολιτικὸν ὂν ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ὕστερον προϊόν κοσμικῆς γενέσεως καὶ ἀνθρωπίνης παιδεύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἱερὰν περίστασιν εἰς τὸν κοσμολογικὸν καὶ πολιτικὸν λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν κόσμος → ἄνθρωπος → πόλις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τοῦ ἀληθοῦς λόγου καὶ ἡ σχέση αὐτοῦ πρὸς τὸν μῦθον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὸν μένει τὸ σύστημα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ θεία ἐπίκλησις, ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη μάθησις καὶ ἡ διαδοχὴ τῶν λόγων ἀλληλοσυμπληροῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα σύνδεσις ἐστὶν ἡ ἐξάρτησις τῆς πολιτικῆς ἀφηγήσεως ἀπὸ κοσμολογίαν καὶ ἀνθρωπολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κυριωτέρα ἔντασις ἐστὶν ὅτι ὁ λόγος ζητεῖται ὡς ἀληθής, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἐπιτυχία αὐτοῦ παραμένει ἐξαρτημένη ἀπὸ θείαν εὐμένειαν καὶ ἀνθρωπίνην ἱκανότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230047306367Z_dee9324c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 27","source_sha256":"d5a8882061920c102442e8da3f2ceec414df49bdda5605ef4380b79c47bda6e6","sha256":"7c0ccde426c4fdc551a3285e04c26a93680187379002b8601e73ca4fd0ba9abd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:00:47.310766+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1","text":"What is sought is a true account, not a fabricated myth, and one appropriate to the sacred occasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS2","text":"The arrangement of the accounts proceeds from cosmology to anthropology and thence to political history.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS3","text":"The political narrative is presupposed by cosmic and human genesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS4","text":"The plausibility and good order of the account depend on the invocation of the gods and prayer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AS5","text":"The exposition requires the coordination of divine favor, human learning, and the speaker's presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","text":"The account appropriate to sacrifice and festival ought to be true, not a fabricated myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","text":"The account concerning the all necessarily invokes gods and goddesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","text":"The correct order of exposition begins from the genesis of the cosmos and ends in the nature of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","text":"Human beings, once generated in the account, can subsequently be determined politically and educationally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A5","text":"The political narrative can make the ancient Athenians judges and citizens of the present city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","text":"The succession of speeches is organized through reciprocal hospitality and the distribution of tasks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","text":"The aptness of the account is sought chiefly in relation to the gods, and consequently in relation to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:A8","text":"The speaker ought to present the account in such a way that the hearers learn, while he himself makes his thought clear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX1","text":"The appropriate account is not a fabricated myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX2","text":"The explanation concerning the all is not sufficient unto human self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX3","text":"The political narrative is not severed from cosmology and anthropogony.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX4","text":"Human beings are not introduced as existing without genesis and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX5","text":"The succession of accounts is not carried out disorderly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:NX6","text":"The account requires not only the speaker's capacity, but also divine favor and the learning of the hearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D1","text":"The cosmological narrative becomes the beginning of anthropological explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D2","text":"The political identity of the Athenians is produced through generation, education, law, and memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D3","text":"Reciprocal hospitality transforms the narrative into a collective undertaking of tasks.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D4","text":"The truth of the account is connected, on the one hand, with the avoidance of fabricated myth, and depends, on the other, also on divine invocation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D5","text":"The account acquires a double direction: toward the gods as judges of aptness and toward human beings as learners.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:D6","text":"Socrates' silence permits Timaeus to undertake the cosmological account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1","text":"The whole narrative is transformed into a hierarchical chain, in which the divine grounds the cosmic, the cosmic the human, and the human the political.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2","text":"The polity is presented not as a starting point, but as the final result of cosmic order and educational mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A3","CH_JP8E_S_10:A4","CH_JP8E_S_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD3","text":"Knowledge of the all becomes a common work of gods, speaker, and hearers, not a private display of wisdom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A6","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7","CH_JP8E_S_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SD4","text":"The demand for a true account coexists with the recognition that human assertion requires invocation and prayer.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:A1","CH_JP8E_S_10:A2","CH_JP8E_S_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that the cosmos be intelligible without genesis, order, and account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that human nature be conceived as independent of cosmic genesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the political community be constituted without memory, law, and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the account concerning being possess complete authority by itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that the precision of the account be separated from the relation between speaker and hearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX1","text":"Absent is the possibility of an account purely cosmic, requiring neither divine invocation nor human learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX2","text":"Absent is the possibility of a polity independent of cosmological and anthropological foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX3","text":"An account that demands truth but denies the uncertainty and dependence of human thought remains impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4","text":"The absence silently encircled is the absolute guarantee that the true account will be accomplished without divine assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS1","text":"Sacred occasion → demand for a true account → rejection of fabricated myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS2","text":"Invocation of gods → prayer concerning the all → dependence of the account on divine favor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3","text":"Genesis of cosmos → nature of human beings → possibility of political integration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS4","text":"Reception of human beings → education of the chosen → law and memory → constitution of citizens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS5","text":"Distribution of roles → reciprocal hospitality → undertaking of the following account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS6","text":"Divine aptness → human learning → presentation of the speaker's thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF1","text":"Sacred occasion → seeking of a true account → rejection of fabricated myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF2","text":"Necessity of divine invocation → cosmological starting point → anthropological continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF3","text":"Generated human beings → educated human beings → Athenian citizens and judges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF4","text":"Handing over of the account → reciprocal hospitality → undertaking of the following narrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:AF5","text":"Gods as judges → human beings as learners → account as common activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1","text":"The narrative is shifted from individual citizens to a hierarchical scale of cosmos, human being, and city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME2","text":"The distinction between myth and true account is reordered as the distinction between fabricated construction and grounded explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3","text":"Political identity is rearranged as the result of generation, education, law, and recollection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME4","text":"The production of knowledge appears as a collaboration of divine invocation, speech, and hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ME5","text":"The silence of the preceding speaker transforms the absence of speech into a presupposition of a new narrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the scene regulates who speaks, who listens, and who undertakes the following account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the exposition connects cosmology, anthropology, education, and political constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the persuasiveness of the account is grounded through invocation of the gods, distribution of roles, and preparation of hearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:ALT4","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the political being appears as a later product of cosmic genesis and human education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from the sacred occasion to the cosmological and political account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the sequence cosmos → human being → city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT3","text":"The precise nature of the true account and its relation to myth are underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT4","text":"The system remains internally coherent, because divine invocation, human learning, and the succession of accounts complement one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection is the dependence of the political narrative on cosmology and anthropology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6","text":"The principal tension is that the account is sought as true, but its success remains dependent on divine favor and human capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_10:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_10:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 27"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 11","title":"Section 27","context":"Chapter 11","original_title":"Section 27","original_context":"Chapter 11"},"original_title":"Section 27","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11","layer":"CH","title":"Section 28","order":12,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_11"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_11@R001","sha256":"5a0ba11831d333b8563ff4f9d30a8a194a2fca3d2d0758d71f842e8154f34a3e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS1","text":"Ἡ πρώτη διάκρισις ἀποβλέπει εἰς τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν καὶ εἰς τὸ γιγνόμενον, ὃ ὂν κυρίως οὐδέποτε ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS2","text":"Τὸ μὲν ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ὂν νοήσει μετὰ λόγου περιλαμβάνεται, τὸ δὲ γιγνόμενον δόξῃ μετ᾽ αἰσθήσεως ἀλόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS3","text":"Πᾶν τὸ γιγνόμενον ἐξ ἀνάγκης ὑπὸ τινὸς αἰτίου γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS4","text":"Ἡ τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ποίησις κρίνεται ἐκ τοῦ παραδείγματος, ᾧ προσβλέπει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS5","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ὡς ὁρατὸς καὶ ἁπτὸς καὶ σωματώδης ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς γενόμενος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις κινείται ἀπὸ τῆς ὀντολογικῆς διαιρέσεως εἰς τὴν αἰσθητὴν σύστασιν τοῦ κόσμου καὶ εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην αἰτίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","text":"Τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν οὔτε γένεσιν ἔχει οὔτε κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον μεταβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον ἀεὶ γίγνεται καὶ ἀπόλλυται, ὄντως δὲ οὐδέποτε ὂν κυρίως ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A3","text":"Τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν νοήσει μετὰ λόγου περιληπτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A4","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον δόξῃ μετ᾽ αἰσθήσεως ἀλόγου δοξαστόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","text":"Πᾶν τὸ γιγνόμενον ὑπὸ αἰτίου τινὸς ἐξ ἀνάγκης γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A6","text":"Ἡ ποιότης τοῦ γινομένου ἐκ τοῦ παραδείγματος ἐξαρτᾶται, πρὸς ὃ ὁ δημιουργὸς βλέπει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","text":"Τὸ ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτὸν καὶ σῶμα ἔχον αἰσθητόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A8","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ γενητὰ καὶ γιγνόμενα εἶναι δεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A9","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ὁρατὸς καὶ ἁπτὸς καὶ σῶμα ἔχων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A10","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἄρα ἀρχὴν γενέσεως ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX1","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον οὔτε ἀγέννητον οὔτε κυρίως ὂν εἶναι δύναται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX2","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὔτε καθαρῇ νοήσει οὔτε ἀλόγως ἄνευ αἰσθήσεως συλλαμβάνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX3","text":"Γένεσις χωρὶς αἰτίου ἀδύνατός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX4","text":"Δημιουργία πρὸς γεννητὸν παράδειγμα βλέπουσα οὐ καλὸν ἀποτελεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX5","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς οὔτε ἀεί ἐστιν οὔτε ἀρχὴν γενέσεως οὐκ ἔχων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX6","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ δόξα οὔτε τὴν ἀναλλοίωτον ἀλήθειαν παρέχει οὔτε τὸ ὄντως ὂν καθ᾽ αὑτὸ ἀποκαλύπτει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D1","text":"Ὅ τι ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχει, τοῦτο ἀντιδιαστέλλεται πρὸς πᾶν τὸ γιγνόμενον καὶ φθειρόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D2","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ σύλληψις τοῦ ἀμεταβλήτου καὶ ἡ δοξαστικὴ σύλληψις τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ ἀνήκουσιν εἰς διακεκριμένα γνωστικὰ πεδία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A3","CH_JP8E_S_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ αἰσθητὸν γιγνόμενόν ἐστιν, ὁ κόσμος ὡς αἰσθητὸς οὐ δύναται νὰ εἶναι ἀρχὴ ἑαυτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","CH_JP8E_S_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D4","text":"Ἡ ὁρατὴ καὶ σωματώδης σύστασις τοῦ οὐρανοῦ τεκμηριοῖ τὸ γενητὸν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","CH_JP8E_S_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D5","text":"Ἐφ᾽ ὅσον ὁ οὐρανὸς γέγονεν, ἀνάγκη τινὸς αἰτίου ὑπάρχειν ὑπὲρ τῆς γενέσεως αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D6","text":"Ἡ καλὴ κοσμοποιία προϋποθέτει παράδειγμα ἀγέννητον καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A6","CH_JP8E_S_11:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὡς γενητὸς ὑποτάσσεται ὑπερκοσμίῳ αἰτιακῷ λόγῳ καὶ οὐκ ἔχει ἀπόλυτον ὀντολογικὴν αὐτάρκειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A9","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ κόσμου διχάζεται εἰς τὸ νοητὸν παράδειγμα, ὃ μένει, καὶ εἰς τὸ αἰσθητὸν εἴδωλον, ὃ γίγνεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","CH_JP8E_S_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις νοεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ ἀμετάβλητον παράδειγμα εἰς μεταβλητὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","CH_JP8E_S_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναγνώρισις τοῦ κόσμου ὡς γενητοῦ καθιστᾷ τὴν αἰτίαν ἀναγκαίαν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἔτι πλήρως προσδιορίζει τὴν φύσιν αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὂν δύναται αὐτὸ ἑαυτὸ γεννῆσαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ γένεσις ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξήγητον ἀρχὴν ἄνευ αἰτιακῆς ἀναφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ αἴσθησις παρέχει τὴν αὐτὴν γνωστικὴν βεβαιότητα ἣν παρέχει ἡ νόησις μετὰ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ γιγνόμενον καὶ τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν ἀποτελοῦσιν ἕνα καὶ τὸ αὐτὸ ὀντολογικὸν γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ὁ κόσμος, ἐπειδὴ ὁρατός ἐστιν, ἀνάγκη καὶ ἀγέννητος εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ συστήματος ἡ δυνατότης κόσμου ὃς ἅμα αἰσθητὸς καὶ ἀγέννητος ἂν εἴη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης γενέσεως ἣ οὔτε αἰτίαν οὔτε παράδειγμα ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX3","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὡς τοιοῦτον ὑστερεῖ τοῦ ἀμεταβλήτου κατὰ τὸ εἶναι καὶ κατὰ τὴν γνῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX4","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ ὕπαρξις ἔχει ἔξωθεν ἢ ὑπερκειμένην ἀρχὴν καὶ οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται διὰ μόνης τῆς ἐμφάσεως τῶν αἰσθητῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS1","text":"Ἀμετάβλητον ὄν → γένεσις καὶ φθορά → διάκρισις νοήσεως καὶ δόξης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS2","text":"Γιγνόμενον → ἀναγκαῖον αἴτιον → ἀναζήτησις παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS3","text":"Ἀγέννητον παράδειγμα → καλή δημιουργία· γεννητὸν παράδειγμα → μὴ καλὴ δημιουργία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS4","text":"Ὁρατόν καὶ ἁπτόμενον σῶμα → αἰσθητόν → γενητόν → οὐρανὸς γεγονώς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS5","text":"Οὐρανὸς γεγονώς → ἀρχὴ γενέσεως → ἀναγκαία αἰτία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AF1","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ διαίρεσις → γνωστικὴ ἀντιστοίχησις → καθολικὴ αἰτιακὴ ἀνάγκη → κριτήριον παραδείγματος → αἰσθητὴ ἀπόδειξις τοῦ γενητοῦ → ἀναγκαία αἰτία τοῦ οὐρανοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME1","text":"Ὁ κόσμος μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ αὐτοτελὲς ὂν εἰς γεγονὸς ὑποκείμενον αἰτίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις εἶναι–γίγνεσθαι γίνεται συγχρόνως ἀντίθεσις γνώσεως–δόξης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ παρουσία τοῦ κόσμου μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἔνδειξιν ἀυταρκείας εἰς τεκμήριον γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME4","text":"Ἡ ποιότης τῆς δημιουργίας ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται διὰ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς ἀγέννητον ἢ γεννητὸν παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ὁ οὐρανὸς χαρακτηρίζεται ὡς ὁρατὸς, ἁπτὸς καὶ σωματώδης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἀνάγεται εἰς τὸ γιγνόμενον καὶ τὸ γιγνόμενον εἰς αἰτίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις τοῦ κόσμου μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῆς περιγραφῆς αὐτοῦ εἰς τὴν ἀναζήτησιν τοῦ παραδείγματος καὶ τοῦ ποιητικοῦ αἰτίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν ἀντιτίθεται πρὸς τὸ γεγονὸς ὡς ἀγέννητον πρὸς γενητόν καὶ ἀναλλοίωτον πρὸς μεταβλητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκούσιν ὥστε ἀνακατασκευάσαι τὴν βασικὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τῆς διαιρέσεως εἰς τὴν αἰτιολογίαν τοῦ οὐρανοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται κυρίως τῇ καθολικῇ ἀρχῇ ὅτι πᾶν τὸ γιγνόμενον ἔχει αἴτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις τοῦ γενητοῦ τοῦ κόσμου εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα ἢ ὁ πλήρης προσδιορισμὸς τοῦ αἰτίου αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μεταξὺ δημιουργοῦ, παραδείγματος καὶ κόσμου δηλοῦται δομικῶς, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀναπτύσσεται εἰς πλήρη κοσμογονικὴν ἀφήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν διαφυλάξῃ τὴν ἱεράρχησιν ἀγέννητον ὄν → γενητὸς κόσμος → ἀναγκαία αἰτία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230106495567Z_897135ce","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 28","source_sha256":"5a0ba11831d333b8563ff4f9d30a8a194a2fca3d2d0758d71f842e8154f34a3e","sha256":"5d9225ff991d6db05c67231e99d1aa6649a27c837ce69d4901bad77a9144dc42","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:01:06.498424+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS1","text":"The first distinction concerns that which always is and that which becomes, which never properly is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS2","text":"That which always is in the same way is comprehended by intellect with reason, whereas that which becomes is apprehended by opinion with irrational perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS3","text":"Everything that becomes comes to be necessarily through some cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS4","text":"The making of the demiurge is judged from the paradigm at which he looks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS5","text":"Heaven, as visible, tangible, and corporeal, is recognized as having come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AS6","text":"The demonstration proceeds from the ontological division to the perceptible constitution of the cosmos and to the necessity of a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","text":"That which always is neither has coming-to-be nor changes while remaining the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","text":"That which becomes always comes to be and perishes, but never properly is in truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A3","text":"That which always is is comprehensible by intellect with reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A4","text":"That which becomes is opinable by opinion with irrational perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","text":"Everything that becomes comes to be necessarily through some cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A6","text":"The quality of what comes to be depends upon the paradigm toward which the demiurge looks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","text":"That which is visible, tangible, and possesses a body is perceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A8","text":"Perceptible things must be generated and becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A9","text":"Heaven is visible, tangible, and possesses a body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:A10","text":"Therefore, heaven has a beginning of coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX1","text":"That which becomes can be neither ungenerated nor properly being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX2","text":"The perceptible is apprehended neither by pure intellect nor irrationally without perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX3","text":"Coming-to-be without a cause is impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX4","text":"A creation looking toward a generated paradigm does not produce what is beautiful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX5","text":"Heaven neither always is nor lacks a beginning of coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:NX6","text":"Perceptible opinion neither provides unchangeable truth nor reveals being-that-truly-is itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D1","text":"Whatever remains always the same is distinguished from everything that comes to be and perishes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D2","text":"The scientific apprehension of the unchangeable and the opinionative apprehension of the perceptible belong to distinct cognitive fields.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A3","CH_JP8E_S_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D3","text":"Since the perceptible is becoming, the cosmos, as perceptible, cannot be its own principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","CH_JP8E_S_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D4","text":"The visible and corporeal constitution of heaven proves its generated character.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A7","CH_JP8E_S_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D5","text":"Inasmuch as heaven has come to be, it is necessary that some cause exist for its coming-to-be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:D6","text":"Beautiful world-making presupposes an ungenerated paradigm that remains the same.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A6","CH_JP8E_S_11:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1","text":"The cosmos, as generated, is subject to a supracosmic causal account and does not possess absolute ontological self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A9","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2","text":"The truth of the cosmos is divided into the intelligible paradigm, which remains, and the perceptible image, which becomes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","CH_JP8E_S_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD3","text":"Cosmic order is conceived as the result of a transition from an unchangeable paradigm to changeable becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A1","CH_JP8E_S_11:A2","CH_JP8E_S_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4","text":"The recognition of the cosmos as generated renders a cause necessary, but does not yet fully determine its nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5","CH_JP8E_S_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that the perceptible being can generate itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that coming-to-be constitutes an inexplicable principle without causal reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that perception provides the same cognitive certainty as intellect with reason provides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that that which becomes and that which always is constitute one and the same ontological genus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that the cosmos, because it is visible, must also be ungenerated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX1","text":"The possibility is absent from the system of a cosmos that might be at once perceptible and ungenerated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX2","text":"Absent is the possibility of a coming-to-be that requires neither cause nor paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX3","text":"It is presupposed that the perceptible, as such, is inferior to the unchangeable in being and in knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX4","text":"It is presupposed that cosmic existence has an external or higher principle and is not explained through the mere manifestation of perceptible things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS1","text":"Unchangeable being → coming-to-be and perishing → distinction of intellect and opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS2","text":"That which becomes → necessary cause → search for a paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS3","text":"Ungenerated paradigm → beautiful creation; generated paradigm → not beautiful creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS4","text":"Visible and tangible body → perceptible → generated → heaven having come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS5","text":"Heaven having come to be → beginning of coming-to-be → necessary cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:AF1","text":"Ontological division → cognitive correspondence → universal causal necessity → criterion of paradigm → perceptible proof of the generated → necessary cause of heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME1","text":"The cosmos is shifted from a self-subsistent being to an event subject to a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME2","text":"The opposition being–becoming becomes at the same time an opposition knowledge–opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3","text":"The perceptible presence of the cosmos is transformed from an indication of self-sufficiency into evidence of coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ME4","text":"The quality of creation is redefined through its relation to an ungenerated or generated paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, heaven is characterized as visible, tangible, and corporeal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the perceptible is referred back to that which becomes, and that which becomes to a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation of the cosmos passes from its description to the search for the paradigm and the productive cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT4","text":"Ontologically and temporally, that which always is is opposed to that which has come to be, as ungenerated to generated and unchangeable to changeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from division to the causal explanation of heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT2","text":"The internal coherence rests chiefly on the universal principle that everything which becomes has a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3","text":"The demonstration of the generated character of the cosmos is stronger than the complete determination of its cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT4","text":"The relation among demiurge, paradigm, and cosmos is indicated structurally, but is not developed into a complete cosmogonic narrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of the account if it preserves the hierarchy: ungenerated being → generated cosmos → necessary cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_11:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 28"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 12","title":"Section 28","context":"Chapter 12","original_title":"Section 28","original_context":"Chapter 12"},"original_title":"Section 28","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12","layer":"CH","title":"Section 29","order":13,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_12"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_12@R001","sha256":"fbdaebe3439218b08e7c73c745a5c1568bd6fc1f32415de044b73cfdedc8843c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS1","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ποιητοῦ καὶ πατρὸς τοῦ παντὸς εὕρεσις χαλεπή ἐστιν, ἡ δὲ περὶ αὐτοῦ λέξις πᾶσιν ἀδύνατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS2","text":"Ἡ τοῦ κόσμου φύσις ἐκ τῆς πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον παράδειγμα βλέψεως τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος, ἐπειδὴ κάλλιστος τῶν γεγονότων ἐστίν, εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ νοητοῦ παραδείγματος ἀναγκαίως ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS4","text":"Οἱ περὶ τοῦ γεγονότος λόγοι πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν ἔχουσιν ὥσπερ ἡ εἰκὼν πρὸς τὸ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις ἀκριβοῦς καὶ παντάπασιν ὁμολογουμένης γνώσεως περὶ τούτων ἀδυνατεῖ, ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος ἀρκείτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS6","text":"Ἡ τοῦ κόσμου σύστασις ἐκ τῆς ἀγαθότητος τοῦ δημιουργοῦ καὶ τῆς ἀφθόνου βουλήσεως πάντα ὅτι μάλιστα ἑαυτῷ παραπλήσια γενέσθαι παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς ἄριστος τῶν αἰτίων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A2","text":"Ὁ κόσμος κάλλιστος τῶν γεγονότων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","text":"Τὸ ἀίδιον καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον ἐστὶν ὑπόδειγμα τοῦ γεγονότος κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","text":"Ὁ κόσμος γεγονὼς ἐστὶν εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","text":"Τὸ γεγονὸς πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον ἔχει ὡς ἡ εἰκὼν πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","text":"Ἡ τῶν λόγων ἀκρίβεια ὀφείλει τῇ τοῦ ἀντικειμένου φύσει σύμμετρος εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A7","text":"Περὶ τῶν γεγονότων καὶ τῶν θεῶν ἀνθρωπίνη παντάπασιν ἀκριβὴς γνῶσις οὐκ ἐφικτή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","text":"Ὁ ἀγαθὸς οὐδενὶ φθονεῖ, ἀλλὰ βούλεται πάντα ὅτι μάλιστα ἑαυτῷ παραπλήσια γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A9","text":"Ἡ τοῦ παντὸς σύστασις ἐκ τῆς ἀγαθῆς βουλήσεως τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX1","text":"Ὁ ποιητὴς καὶ πατὴρ τοῦ παντὸς οὔτε ῥᾳδίως εὑρίσκεται οὔτε πᾶσιν ἀκριβῶς λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX2","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ἐκ τοῦ γεγονότος παραδείγματος δημιουργεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ἔστι τὸ ἀίδιον αὐτό, ἀλλὰ γέγονεν εἰκὼν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX4","text":"Οἱ περὶ τῆς γενέσεως λόγοι οὐκ ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἀπόλυτον ἀκρίβειαν καὶ ἀναμφισβητησίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX5","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος οὐκ ἐπιδέχεται ἀπέραντον ζήτησιν πέραν τοῦ εἰκότος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX6","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία οὐκ ἀποδίδεται φθόνῳ, ἐλλείψει ἀγαθότητος, ἢ ἀλόγῳ συμβεβηκότι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ δημιουργὸς ἄριστος καὶ ὁ κόσμος κάλλιστος, ὁ δημιουργὸς πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον παράδειγμα βλέπει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","CH_JP8E_S_12:A2","CH_JP8E_S_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ κόσμος πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον ἐποιήθη, ἀναγκαίως εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχοντος ὑπάρχει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","CH_JP8E_S_12:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D3","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τοῦ κόσμου ἐπιβάλλει τοὺς περὶ αὐτοῦ λόγους εἰκότας καὶ οὐκ ἀμεταπτώτους εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀξίωσις τοῦ λόγου περιορίζεται ὑπὸ τοῦ τρόπου τοῦ ὄντος περὶ οὗ λέγει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D5","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος ἀποτελεῖ τὸ προσήκον πέρας τῆς περὶ τοῦ κόσμου καὶ τῶν θεῶν διηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία φθόνου ἐν τῷ ἀγαθῷ δημιουργῷ καθίστησι τὴν τοῦ κόσμου ὁμοίωσιν πρὸς αὐτὸν σκοπὸν τῆς δημιουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D7","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις νοεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀγαθῆς βουλήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀναγκαία συνέπεια ἀποκλειστικῶς μηχανικῶν αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ κατωτερότης τοῦ γεγονότος καθορίζει ἅμα τὴν γνωσιολογικὴν κατωτερότητα τῶν περὶ αὐτοῦ λόγων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν παραδείγματος, εἰκόνος, καὶ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀγαθότης τοῦ δημιουργοῦ λειτουργεῖ ὡς αἰτία ὁμοιώσεως καὶ ὡς ἀρχὴ τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀποδοχὴ τοῦ εἰκότος μύθου συνδέει τὴν κοσμολογικὴν ἀλήθειαν πρὸς τὸ μέτρον τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἄγνοια οὐ καταλύει τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ περιορίζει τὸ εἶδος τοῦ λόγου ὃς περὶ αὐτῆς δύναται ἀποδοθῆναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX1","text":"Τὸ γεγονὸς οὐκ ἔχει τὴν αὐτὴν ὀντολογικὴν βεβαιότητα μετὰ τοῦ ἀϊδίου παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX2","text":"Ὁ λόγος οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ τὴν ἀμεταβλητότητα τοῦ ὄντος ὅταν ἀναφέρηται εἰς τὸ γεγονός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη διάνοια οὐκ ἔχει παντελῆ πρόσβασιν εἰς τὴν τοῦ παντὸς γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX4","text":"Ἡ δημιουργικὴ αἰτία οὐκ ἀναζητεῖται ἐν ἀνάγκῃ ἀντιθέτῳ πρὸς τὴν ἀγαθότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια περὶ τοῦ γεγονότος οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον βεβαιότητος ὃν ἀπαιτεῖ τὸ ἀίδιον ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης λόγου ὃς ἅμα περὶ τοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ τοῦ γεγονότος ἰσοσθενῶς ἀληθεύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀξίωσις ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ ἀρχὴ δύναται νὰ παρασταθῇ ὡς πλήρως ἐξαντλημένη ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος ταυτότης εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος παραμένει ἀδύνατος ἐντὸς τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία πλήρους ἀκριβείας οὐκ ἀφήνει κενὸν ἄνευ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ὁρίζει τὸ πεδίον τοῦ εἰκότος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS1","text":"Ἀγαθὸς δημιουργός → ἀπουσία φθόνου → βούλησις ὁμοιώσεως → σύστασις τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2","text":"Ἀίδιον παράδειγμα → δημιουργικὴ βλέψις → γεγονὸς κάλλιστον → κόσμος ὡς εἰκών.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS3","text":"Ἀίδιον ὄν → σταθερὸς λόγος· γεγονὸς εἰκών → εἰκὼς λόγος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS4","text":"Ἀνθρωπίνη περατότης → ἀδυναμία πλήρους ἀκριβείας → ἀποδοχὴ τοῦ εἰκότος μύθου → παῦσις τοῦ πέραν ζητεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ διαφορά παραδείγματος καὶ εἰκόνος → γνωσιολογικὴ διαφορά ἀληθείας καὶ πίστεως → ἀναλογία λόγου καὶ πράγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1","text":"Δυσχέρεια εὑρέσεως τοῦ δημιουργοῦ → διάκρισις ἀϊδίου παραδείγματος καὶ γεγονότος → ἀπόδειξις τοῦ κόσμου ὡς εἰκόνος → διάκρισις ἀληθοῦς καὶ εἰκότος λόγου → περιορισμὸς τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης ἀκριβείας → ἀποδοχὴ τοῦ εἰκότος μύθου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF2","text":"Κάλλος τοῦ κόσμου καὶ ἀγαθότης τοῦ δημιουργοῦ → πρὸς τὸ ἀίδιον βλέψις → ὁμοίωσις τοῦ γεγονότος → κοσμικὴ σύστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF3","text":"Ἀγαθότης → ἀπουσία φθόνου → βούλησις τοῦ ὁμοίου → γένεσις τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME1","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτόνομον ὄν εἰς εἰκόνα παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀναδιατάσσεται κατὰ βαθμίδας ὀντολογικῆς ἀναφορᾶς καὶ οὐκ ὡς ἑνιαία ἀκρίβεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους γνώσεως μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἐλάττωμα τοῦ λόγου εἰς ὅρον προσήκοντα τῇ φύσει τοῦ ἀντικειμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ τὸν φθόνον καὶ συνδέεται πρὸς τὴν ἀγαθὴν ὁμοίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία ὑπάγεται ὑπὸ κανόνα μεθοδολογικόν, καθʼ ὃν ὁ λόγος πρέπει νὰ ὁμοιοῦται τῷ εἴδει τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανείας ἐπιπέδου ὁ κόσμος παρουσιάζεται ὡς γεγονὼς καὶ καλὸς εἰκών.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις παράγεται ἐκ σχέσεως δημιουργοῦ, παραδείγματος, καὶ εἰκόνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ λόγος ὁρίζει τὸ προσήκον μέτρον βεβαιότητος καὶ ἀπαγορεύει τὴν ἀπαίτησιν ὑπερβολικῆς ἀκριβείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ ἀίδιον τίθεται ὡς πρότερον παράδειγμα, τὸ δὲ γεγονὸς ὡς ὕστερον καὶ μεταβλητὴ εἰκών.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀγαθότητα τοῦ δημιουργοῦ εἰς τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς λειτουργία τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ὡς πατρὸς καὶ τεχνίτου μένει μερικῶς ὑποκαθορισμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικόν ἐφʼ ὅσον διακρίνει τὸ ἀίδιον ἀπὸ τὸ γεγονὸς καὶ τὴν ἀλήθειαν ἀπὸ τὸ εἰκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα δομὴ τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος ἐντοπίζεται στὴν ἀναλογίαν παραδείγματος, εἰκόνος, καὶ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις συνίσταται στὸ ὅτι ὁ λόγος ἀξιοῖ ἀναγκαίαν κοσμολογικὴν δομὴν ἐνώ ταὐτοχρόνως ὁμολογεῖ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν πλήρους ἀκριβείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ κειμένου, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀνοικτὸν τὸ ὅριον μεταξὺ φιλοσοφικῆς ἀποδείξεως καὶ εἰκότος μύθου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230125792722Z_60fc3158","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 29","source_sha256":"fbdaebe3439218b08e7c73c745a5c1568bd6fc1f32415de044b73cfdedc8843c","sha256":"139732d9918a877d1e6fe6a66ba063e558ec93a048688fee4201bba0e55d3d37","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:01:25.796412+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS1","text":"The discovery of the maker and father of the universe is difficult, and speaking about him to all is impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS2","text":"The nature of the cosmos is explained from the demiurge's contemplation of the eternal paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS3","text":"Since the cosmos is the most beautiful of things that have come to be, it is necessarily an image of the eternal and intelligible paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS4","text":"Accounts concerning what has come to be stand in relation to truth as an image does to what is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS5","text":"Since human nature is incapable of precise and wholly agreed-upon knowledge concerning these matters, let the likely myth suffice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AS6","text":"The constitution of the cosmos is produced from the goodness of the demiurge and the ungrudging will that all things should become as like himself as possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","text":"The demiurge is the best of causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A2","text":"The cosmos is the most beautiful of things that have come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","text":"The eternal and unchanging is the model of the cosmos that has come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","text":"The cosmos, having come to be, is an image of the eternal paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","text":"What has come to be stands in relation to the eternal as an image does to a paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","text":"The precision of accounts ought to be commensurate with the nature of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A7","text":"Wholly precise human knowledge concerning things that have come to be and the gods is unattainable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","text":"The good begrudges no one, but wills that all things become as like himself as possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:A9","text":"The constitution of the universe is explained from the good will of the demiurge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX1","text":"The maker and father of the universe is neither easily discovered nor precisely spoken of to all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX2","text":"The cosmos is not fashioned from a paradigm that has come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX3","text":"The cosmos is not the eternal itself, but has come to be as its image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX4","text":"Accounts concerning coming-to-be do not require absolute precision and indisputability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX5","text":"The likely myth does not admit boundless inquiry beyond what is likely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:NX6","text":"Creation is not attributed to envy, a lack of goodness, or an irrational accident.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D1","text":"Since the demiurge is best and the cosmos most beautiful, the demiurge looks to the eternal paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","CH_JP8E_S_12:A2","CH_JP8E_S_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D2","text":"Since the cosmos was made with reference to the eternal, it is necessarily an image of the intelligible and unchanging.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","CH_JP8E_S_12:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D3","text":"The changeability of the cosmos entails that accounts concerning it be likely and not unchanging.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D4","text":"The scientific claim of an account is limited by the manner of being of that about which it speaks.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D5","text":"The likely myth constitutes the fitting end of the account concerning the cosmos and the gods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D6","text":"The absence of envy in the good demiurge makes the assimilation of the cosmos to him the aim of creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:D7","text":"Cosmic order is conceived as the result of good will and not as the necessary consequence of exclusively mechanical causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","text":"The ontological inferiority of what has come to be simultaneously determines the epistemological inferiority of accounts concerning it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD2","text":"Cosmology is transformed into a hierarchy of paradigm, image, and likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3","CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD3","text":"The goodness of the demiurge functions as a cause of assimilation and as a principle of cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A1","CH_JP8E_S_12:A8","CH_JP8E_S_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD4","text":"Acceptance of the likely myth connects cosmological truth to the measure of human knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A5","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SD5","text":"Human ignorance does not abolish cosmic order, but limits the kind of account that can be given of it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_S_12:A6","CH_JP8E_S_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX1","text":"What has come to be does not possess the same ontological certainty as the eternal paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX2","text":"An account cannot assume the unchangeability of being when it refers to what has come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX3","text":"Human understanding does not have complete access to the coming-to-be of the universe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX4","text":"The creative cause is not sought in necessity opposed to goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX5","text":"Truth concerning what has come to be does not require the same mode of certainty that eternal being requires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an account that is equally true concerning both the eternal and what has come to be is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX2","text":"The claim that the cosmic principle can be represented as fully exhaustive knowledge is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX3","text":"The absolute identity of image and paradigm remains impossible within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX4","text":"The absence of complete precision does not leave a void without account, but defines the field of the likely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS1","text":"Good demiurge → absence of envy → will of assimilation → constitution of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2","text":"Eternal paradigm → demiurgic contemplation → most beautiful thing that has come to be → cosmos as image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS3","text":"Eternal being → stable account; image that has come to be → likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS4","text":"Human finitude → inability of complete precision → acceptance of the likely myth → cessation of inquiry beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5","text":"Ontological difference between paradigm and image → epistemological difference between truth and belief → analogy of account and thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1","text":"Difficulty of discovering the demiurge → distinction between eternal paradigm and what has come to be → demonstration of the cosmos as image → distinction between true and likely account → limitation of human precision → acceptance of the likely myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF2","text":"Beauty of the cosmos and goodness of the demiurge → contemplation of the eternal → assimilation of what has come to be → cosmic constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:AF3","text":"Goodness → absence of envy → will of the like → coming-to-be of the universe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME1","text":"The cosmos is reclassified from an autonomous being into an image of a paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME2","text":"Truth is rearranged according to degrees of ontological reference and not as uniform precision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3","text":"The impossibility of complete knowledge is transformed from a defect of account into a condition fitting to the nature of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME4","text":"Cosmic coming-to-be is disconnected from envy and connected to good assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5","text":"Cosmology is subordinated to a methodological rule according to which an account must be assimilated to the kind of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the cosmos is presented as a thing that has come to be and as a beautiful image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, cosmic order is produced from the relation of demiurge, paradigm, and image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the account defines the fitting measure of certainty and forbids the demand for excessive precision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the eternal is posited as the prior paradigm, and what has come to be as the later and changeable image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal movement from the goodness of the demiurge to the likely myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT2","text":"The precise function of the demiurge as father and craftsman remains partially underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as it distinguishes the eternal from what has come to be and truth from the likely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT4","text":"The strongest structure of the argument is located in the analogy of paradigm, image, and account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT5","text":"The principal tension consists in the fact that the account claims a necessary cosmological structure while simultaneously acknowledging the impossibility of complete precision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text, but leaves open the boundary between philosophical demonstration and likely myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_12:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 29"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 13","title":"Section 29","context":"Chapter 13","original_title":"Section 29","original_context":"Chapter 13"},"original_title":"Section 29","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3","layer":"CH","title":"Section 30","order":14,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC3"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC3@R001","sha256":"b45b87fca379de09188c33aa920155f9586012893af039d0a82495444b881ca7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS1","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅπως ἡ ὁρατὴ κινούμενη καὶ ἄτακτος πολλότης εἰς κόσμον κάλλιστον καταχθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τοῦ λόγου τίθεται ἐν τῇ ἀγαθότητι καὶ προνοίᾳ τοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS3","text":"Ἡ τάξις προκρίνεται τῆς ἀταξίας ὡς ἀμείνων καὶ καλλίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS4","text":"Ἡ τελεία καλλονὴ ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἕνωσιν νοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5","text":"Ἐκ τούτων ὁ κόσμος ἀποδεικνύεται ζῷον ἔμψυχον καὶ ἔννουν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS6","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης τοῦ κόσμου οὐ πρὸς μέρος τι ζῴου ἀλλὰ πρὸς τὸ καθόλου νοητὸν ζῷον ὁρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","text":"Ὁ θεὸς βούλεται πάντα ἀγαθὰ εἶναι καὶ μηδὲν φαῦλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2","text":"Ἡ τάξις ἀμείνων ἐστὶ τῆς ἀταξίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","text":"Τὸ ἄριστον ὂν πράττει τὸ κάλλιστον καὶ οὐδέν ἄλλο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A4","text":"Τὸ ὅλον νοῦν ἔχον κάλλιον ἔργον ἐστὶ παντὸς ἀνόητου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","text":"Νοῦς χωρὶς ψυχῆς οὐ δύναται παραγενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι συνισταμένη τὸ ὅλον ἐμψυχώνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7","text":"Τὸ κάλλιστον κατὰ φύσιν ἔργον ἐστὶ τὸ ἔμψυχον καὶ ἔννουν ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8","text":"Τὸ ὅλον κάλλος ἀπαιτεῖ πληρότητα καὶ οὐκ ἀνεκτὸν ἔχει τὸ ἀτελές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὀφείλει ὁμοιότατος εἶναι τῷ καθόλου νοητῷ ζῴῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10","text":"Τὸ καθόλου νοητὸν ζῷον περιέχει ἐν ἑαυτῷ πάντα τὰ νοητὰ ζῷα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX1","text":"Ὁ θεὸς οὔτε τὸ φαῦλον βούλεται οὔτε φαῦλον ἔργον ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ τελικόν καὶ ἄριστον σχῆμα τοῦ ὁρατοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX3","text":"Τὸ ἄριστον οὐ δύναται πράττειν ἄλλο πλὴν τὸ κάλλιστον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX4","text":"Νοῦς ἀσύνδετος πρὸς ψυχὴν οὐκ ἔχει δυνατότητα ὑπάρξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἀνόητον ὅλον οὐ δύναται νὰ ὑπερέχῃ τοῦ νοῦν ἔχοντος ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX6","text":"Τὸ ἀτελὲς οὐ δύναται νὰ εἶναι τὸ καλόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX7","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ὁμοιοῦται πρὸς ἓν μερικὸν ἢ εἰδικὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX8","text":"Τὸ ὅλον οὐκ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἄψυχος καὶ ἄλογος συναγωγὴ ὁρατῶν πραγμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ θεία βούλησις ἀγαθὴ καὶ ἡ τάξις ἀμείνων, ἡ ἀταξία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἄριστον πράττει τὸ κάλλιστον, ἡ κοσμοποιία ἔχει ἀναγκαῖον κανονισμὸν πρὸς τὸ κάλλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ νοῦν ἔχον ὅλον ὑπερέχει τοῦ ἀνόητου, ὁ δημιουργὸς συνιστᾷ τὸ πᾶν ὡς ἔννοον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ νοῦς χωρὶς ψυχῆς ἀδύνατος, ὁ νοῦς ἐν ψυχῇ καὶ ἡ ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι τίθεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D5","text":"Ἡ σύνθεσις νοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος καθιστᾷ τὸν κόσμον ζῷον ἔμψυχον καὶ ἔννουν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἀτελὲς οὐκ ἔχει κάλλος, ἡ κοσμικὴ ὁμοιότης ζητεῖ τὸ καθόλου καὶ πλήρες.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ καθόλου νοητὸν ζῷον περιέχει πάντα τὰ νοητά, ὁ κόσμος ὡς ὁρατὸς ἀντίστοιχος περιλαμβάνει πάντα τὰ ὁρατὰ ζῷα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμογένεσις μετατρέπει τὴν τυχαίαν κίνησιν εἰς ἑνιαῖον ὅλον διὰ διαδοχικῆς ἐνσωματώσεως τάξεως, ψυχῆς καὶ νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2","text":"Τὸ ὅλον ἀποκτᾷ ὀντολογικὴν προτεραιότητα, ἐπειδὴ τὰ μέρη νοοῦνται ὡς περιεχόμενα ἐν αὐτῷ καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτάρκεις ἀρχαί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀγαθότης τοῦ δημιουργοῦ λειτουργεῖ ὡς παραγωγικὸς νόμος, ὁ ὁποῖος μεταβάλλει τὴν κρίσιν περὶ τοῦ κόσμου ἀπὸ τὸ ὑπάρχειν εἰς τὸ ὑπάρχειν καλῶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4","text":"Ὁ κόσμος γίνεται εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ ζῴου οὐ διὰ ἀπλῆς ὁμοιότητος μορφῆς, ἀλλὰ διὰ καθολικῆς περιεκτικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς αὐτόματη γένεσις ἐκ τυφλῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία οὐκ ἔχει τελικὴν ἐξηγητικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἢ τὸ ὁρατὸν οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτάρκη ὅρον τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα ἐν τῇ κοσμικῇ συνθέσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX5","text":"Τὸ μερικὸν οὐ δύναται νὰ χρησιμεύσῃ ὡς ἔσχατον πρότυπον τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","text":"Ἡ τελειότης οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλὴν ἄθροισιν ἀρίστων μερῶν, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ καθολικὴν ἐνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς ἂν ᾖ ὁρατὸς μὲν ἀλλὰ χωρὶς ἐσωτερικῆς ζωῆς καὶ νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἡ ἀτέλεια νὰ συμβιβασθῇ πρὸς τὸ ἀπόλυτον κάλλος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πολλότης τῶν ζῴων νὰ προηγῆται τοῦ ἑνιαίου περιέχοντος ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις νὰ νοηθῇ ἔξωθεν τῆς ἀγαθῆς προνοίας καὶ τοῦ λογικοῦ προτύπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS1","text":"Θεία ἀγαθότης → ἀπόρριψις τοῦ φαύλου → ἔγκρισις τοῦ καλλίστου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS2","text":"Ἄτακτος κίνησις → δημιουργικὴ παρέμβασις → τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS3","text":"Κριτήριον τοῦ καλλίστου → προτεραιότης τοῦ ἐννόου ὅλου → ἐνσωμάτωσις νοῦ ἐν ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS4","text":"Ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι → ἔμψυχος σύνθεσις → κόσμος-ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS5","text":"Ἀπόρριψις τοῦ μερικοῦ προτύπου → ἀναζήτησις τοῦ καθόλου → ὁμοίωσις πρὸς τὸ νοητὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS6","text":"Καθολικὸν νοητὸν περιέχον → καθολικὸν ὁρατὸν περιεχόμενον → κόσμος ὡς πλήρες ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AF1","text":"Ἄτακτος ὁρατὴ κίνησις → θεία ἀγαθότης → τάξις καὶ κάλλος → σύνδεσις νοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος → κόσμος ἔμψυχος καὶ ἔννους → ὁμοίωσις πρὸς τὸ καθόλου νοητὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ τελικὴν κοσμικὴν κατάστασιν εἰς ἀρχικὸν ὑλικόν, ὃ χρήζει μορφώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2","text":"Ὁ κόσμος μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ σύνολον ὁρατῶν πραγμάτων εἰς ἓν ζῷον ἔχον ἐσωτερικὴν ἀρχὴν ζωῆς καὶ νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME3","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μέρους καὶ ὅλου ἀναστρέφεται· τὰ μέρη ὁρίζονται διὰ τῆς συμμετοχῆς εἰς τὸ καθόλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τελειότης ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ τὸ εἶδος τινὸς μερικοῦ ζῴου καὶ συνδέεται πρὸς τὴν καθολικὴν περιεκτικότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία νοεῖται ὡς λογικὴ ἀναγκαιότης τῆς ἀγαθότητος καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀδιάφορος ἐπιλογή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ὁ λόγος ἀποφαίνεται περὶ τῆς γενέσεως καὶ τῆς φύσεως τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ὁ κόσμος παράγεται διὰ τῆς ὑποτάξεως τῆς κινήσεως εἰς τάξιν καὶ τῆς συνδέσεως σώματος, ψυχῆς καὶ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναγκάζει τὸν ἀναγνώστην νὰ κρίνῃ τὸ ὄν ἀπὸ τὸ πρότυπον τοῦ ὅλου καὶ οὐκ ἀπὸ τὰ μεμονωμένα φαινόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ ὄν ἔχει ἱεραρχικὴν διάρθρωσιν, ἐν ᾗ τὸ νοητὸν πρότυπον προηγείται, ἡ ψυχὴ μεσολαβεῖ, καὶ τὸ σῶμα ἐνσωματοῖ τὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT5","text":"Χρονικῶς, ἡ γένεσις ἐκ τῆς ἀταξίας εἰς τὴν τάξιν παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἄπαξ δημιουργικὴ μετάβασις, ἐνώ τὸ τελικὸν εἶναι σταθερὸν καὶ καθολικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκούντως ἀνασυνιστῶσι τὸν λόγον, ἐπειδὴ περιέχουσι τὴν θείαν βούλησιν, τὴν προτεραιότητα τῆς τάξεως, τὴν ἀνάγκην τοῦ νοῦ, καὶ τὸ καθόλου πρότυπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀκολουθία συνεκτική ἐστιν ἐφʼ ὅσον ἡ ἀγαθότης ὑποτίθεται ὡς ἀναγκαίως δημιουργική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη ὡς πρὸς τὸ πῶς ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἀταξία ὑπάρχει πρὶν ἢ παρὰ τῇ θεϊκῇ τάξει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέσις ἀνάγκης καὶ θείας προνοίας δὲν ἐπιλύεται πλήρως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀναγκαιότης τοῦ καλλίστου συγκαλύπτει τὸ περιθώριον ἐπιλογῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα δομὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐστὶν ἡ παραγωγὴ τοῦ ἐμψύχου ὅλου ἐκ τῆς ἀλληλουχίας τάξεως, ψυχῆς καὶ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα δομὴ ἐστὶν ἡ ἀναπόδεικτος μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ ὅτι τὸ καθόλου ἐστὶ κάλλιον εἰς τὸ ὅτι ὁ κόσμος ὄντως ἐκεῖνο μιμεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT7","text":"Ἡ συμπιεσμένη ἀνασύνθεσις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀνερμήνευτον τὸ καθεστὼς τῆς ἀρχικῆς ὕλης καὶ τῆς ἀταξίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225613804347Z_ec4ab7b1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 30","source_sha256":"b45b87fca379de09188c33aa920155f9586012893af039d0a82495444b881ca7","sha256":"9ce37b2ff3c6168ff638cedc964812360aabb5b071e1e5cbf3e7d5ef63324024","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:56:13.806731+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS1","text":"The principal problem is how the visible, moving, and disorderly multiplicity may be brought into a most beautiful cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS2","text":"The starting point of the argument is posited in the goodness and providence of god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS3","text":"Order is preferred to disorder as better and more beautiful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS4","text":"Perfect beauty requires the union of intellect, soul, and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5","text":"From these, the cosmos is demonstrated to be an ensouled and intelligent living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS6","text":"The likeness of the cosmos is determined not in relation to some part of a living being, but in relation to the universal intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","text":"God wills all things to be good and nothing base.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2","text":"Order is better than disorder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","text":"That which is best does what is most beautiful and nothing else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A4","text":"A whole possessing intellect is a more beautiful work than every unintelligent one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","text":"Intellect cannot come to be without soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6","text":"Soul, constituted in body, ensouls the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7","text":"The most beautiful work according to nature is the ensouled and intelligent whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8","text":"The beauty of the whole requires completeness and does not admit what is incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","text":"The cosmos ought to be most like the universal intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10","text":"The universal intelligible living being contains within itself all intelligible living beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX1","text":"God neither wills what is base nor makes a base work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX2","text":"Disorder does not constitute the final and best form of the visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX3","text":"What is best cannot do anything other than what is most beautiful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX4","text":"Intellect unconnected with soul has no possibility of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX5","text":"The unintelligent whole cannot surpass the whole possessing intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX6","text":"What is incomplete cannot be the beautiful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX7","text":"The cosmos is not assimilated to one particular or specific living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX8","text":"The whole is not recognized as a soulless and irrational aggregate of visible things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1","text":"Since the divine will is good and order is better, disorder is transformed into order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D2","text":"Since what is best does what is most beautiful, world-making has a necessary norm toward beauty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D3","text":"Since the whole possessing intellect surpasses the unintelligent one, the demiurge constitutes the all as intelligent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D4","text":"Since intellect without soul is impossible, intellect is placed in soul and soul in body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D5","text":"The composition of intellect, soul, and body renders the cosmos an ensouled and intelligent living being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D6","text":"Since the incomplete has no beauty, cosmic likeness seeks the universal and complete.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:D7","text":"Since the universal intelligible living being contains all intelligibles, the cosmos, as its visible counterpart, includes all visible living beings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD1","text":"Cosmogony transforms random motion into a unified whole through the successive incorporation of order, soul, and intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2","text":"The whole acquires ontological priority, since the parts are understood as contained within it and not as self-sufficient principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3","text":"The goodness of the demiurge operates as a productive law, which changes the judgment concerning the cosmos from existing to existing well.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4","text":"The cosmos becomes an image of the intelligible living being not through a mere similarity of form, but through universal comprehensiveness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX1","text":"Reality is not explained as spontaneous generation from blind motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX2","text":"Disorder has no final explanatory principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX3","text":"Matter or the visible does not constitute a self-sufficient condition of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX4","text":"The soul is not understood as independent of the body in the cosmic composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX5","text":"The particular cannot serve as the ultimate model of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","text":"Perfection does not constitute a mere aggregate of the best parts, but requires universal unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX1","text":"A cosmos that is visible but without inner life and thought is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX2","text":"The possibility that imperfection may be reconciled with absolute beauty is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX3","text":"The multiplicity of living beings preceding the unified containing whole is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:SNX4","text":"Cosmic generation being understood apart from good providence and the rational model is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS1","text":"Divine goodness → rejection of the base → approval of the most beautiful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS2","text":"Disorderly motion → demiurgic intervention → order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS3","text":"Criterion of the most beautiful → priority of the intelligent whole → incorporation of intellect in soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS4","text":"Soul in body → ensouled composition → cosmos-living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS5","text":"Rejection of the particular model → search for the universal → assimilation to the intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS6","text":"Universal intelligible container → universal visible contained thing → cosmos as a complete whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:AF1","text":"Disorderly visible motion → divine goodness → order and beauty → connection of intellect, soul, and body → ensouled and intelligent cosmos → assimilation to the universal intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1","text":"Disorder is redescribed from a final cosmic state into initial material requiring formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2","text":"The cosmos is redescribed from a collection of visible things into one living being having an internal principle of life and thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME3","text":"The relation of part and whole is reversed: the parts are defined through participation in the universal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME4","text":"Cosmic perfection is disconnected from the form of some particular living being and connected with universal comprehensiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5","text":"Creation is understood as a rational necessity of goodness and not as an indifferent choice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT1","text":"On the surface, the argument pronounces upon the generation and nature of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the cosmos is produced through the subordination of motion to order and the connection of body, soul, and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation compels the reader to judge being from the model of the whole and not from isolated phenomena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, being has a hierarchical articulation, in which the intelligible model takes precedence, soul mediates, and body embodies order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT5","text":"Temporally, the generation from disorder into order is presented as a once-for-all creative transition, whereas final being is stable and universal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT1","text":"The principles sufficiently reconstruct the argument, because they contain the divine will, the priority of order, the necessity of intellect, and the universal model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT2","text":"The internal sequence is coherent insofar as goodness is assumed to be necessarily creative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined as to how the initial disorder exists before or alongside divine order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT4","text":"The relation between necessity and divine providence is not fully resolved, since the necessity of the most beautiful obscures the scope of choice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT5","text":"The strongest structure of the argument is the production of the ensouled whole from the sequence of order, soul, and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT6","text":"The weakest structure is the unproved transition from the claim that the universal is more beautiful to the claim that the cosmos in fact imitates it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT7","text":"The compressed reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but leaves unexplained the status of the initial matter and disorder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC3:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 30"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 14","title":"Section 30","context":"Chapter 14","original_title":"Section 30","original_context":"Chapter 14"},"original_title":"Section 30","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13","layer":"CH","title":"Section 31","order":15,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_13"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_13@R001","sha256":"e598cdb832b2bf0f16fdf4cd0b7b6de12eeb93a7afca84dd5297c157064e9bc8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν εἰ πολλοὶ ἢ εἷς οὐρανοὶ ὀρθῶς λέγονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς κρίσεως ἐστὶ τὸ νοητὸν παράδειγμα, ὃ ὡς τέλειον ζῷον πάντα τὰ συγγενῆ ἐν ἑαυτῷ περιέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS3","text":"Ἐκ τῆς ὁμοιώσεως πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα συνάγεται ὅτι ὁ οὐρανὸς ὀφείλει εἷς καὶ μονογενὴς εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS4","text":"Ἡ ὁρατὴ καὶ ἁπτὴ σύστασις ἀπαιτεῖ σῶμα, τὸ δὲ σῶμα ἀπαιτεῖ πῦρ καὶ γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ δύο στοιχεῖα ἄνευ τρίτου δεσμοῦ οὐ συνίστανται καλῶς, ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου ἀπαιτεῖ ἀναλογικὴν σύνδεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","text":"Τὸ θεῖον ποιεῖν βούλεται τὸ γενόμενον ὅμοιον τῷ καλλίστῳ καὶ παντελεῖ νοητῷ ζῴῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","text":"Τὸ παντελὲς νοητὸν ζῷον περιέχει ἐν ἑαυτῷ πάντα τὰ κατὰ φύσιν συγγενῆ ζῷα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","text":"Τὸ ὁμοίωμα τοῦ παντελοῦς παραδείγματος δεῖ κατὰ τὴν μόνωσιν ἓν εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A4","text":"Δεύτερον ὅλον περιέχον ἅπαντα τὰ νοητὰ ζῷα ἀπαιτεῖ ἕτερον ὑπερκείμενον περιέχον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A5","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ὁμοιώματι τοῦ παραδείγματος γενόμενος ἐστὶν εἷς καὶ μονογενής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","text":"Τὸ γενόμενον σῶμα δεῖ σωματοειδὲς, ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτόν εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A7","text":"Τὸ ὁρατὸν ἀπαιτεῖ πυρός τινος παρουσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A8","text":"Τὸ ἁπτὸν ἀπαιτεῖ στερεότητα, ἡ δὲ στερεότης ἀπαιτεῖ γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","text":"Δύο πράγματα καλῶς συνίστασθαι ἄνευ τρίτου συναγωγοῦ δεσμοῦ ἀδύνατον ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A10","text":"Κάλλιστος δεσμὸς ἡ ἀναλογία, ἐπειδὴ ἓν ποιεῖ τόν τε δεσμὸν καὶ τὰ δεδεμένα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ὀρθὸν εἰπεῖν πολλοὺς ἢ ἀπείρους οὐρανούς, ἐὰν ὁ οὐρανὸς κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα γέγονεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX2","text":"Οὐ δύναται δεύτερον ὅλον νὰ περιέχῃ πάντα τὰ νοητὰ ζῷα ἄνευ ἑτέρου ὑπερκειμένου ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπλῶς ἄθροισμα πολλῶν ἀνεξαρτήτων κόσμων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX4","text":"Τὸ ὁρατὸν οὐ δύναται χωρὶς πυρὸς γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἁπτὸν οὐ δύναται ἄνευ στερεοῦ, οὐδὲ τὸ στερεὸν ἄνευ γῆς ὑπάρξαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX6","text":"Δύο ἀρχαὶ ἄνευ μέσου δεσμοῦ οὐ δύνανται καλῶς ἑνοῦσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ τοῦ κόσμου πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα μεταβάλλει τὸ ἐρώτημα περὶ πλήθους εἰς ἐρώτημα ὁμοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D2","text":"Ἡ ὑπόθεσις δευτέρου κόσμου ἐπιφέρει ἀναγκαίως ὑπερκείμενον περιέχοντα κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία τῶν περιεχόντων ἀναβάλλει τὴν ἀληθῆ ὁμοίωσιν ἀπὸ τοῦ δευτέρου πρὸς τὸ ἕτερον τὸ περιέχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D4","text":"Ἡ ὁρατότης καὶ ἁπτότης τοῦ κόσμου ἐπιβάλλει ὑλικὴν διπλῆν ἀφετηρίαν, πῦρ καὶ γῆν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","CH_JP8E_S_13:A7","CH_JP8E_S_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D5","text":"Ἡ συνύπαρξις πυρὸς καὶ γῆς ἀπαιτεῖ τρίτον στοιχεῖον ἢ μέσον, ὃ τὰ διεστῶτα συνάξει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία καθίσταται ὄχι μόνον τρόπος συνδέσεως ἀλλὰ καὶ παραγωγὸς κοσμικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου παράγεται διὰ δύο παραλλήλων ἀναγκῶν: ὁμοιώσεως πρὸς ἕν παράδειγμα καὶ δεσμεύσεως τῶν συστατικῶν εἰς ἕν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2","text":"Τὸ ἕν τοῦ κόσμου εἶναι ἅμα μορφολογικὸν καὶ συνθετικόν: ἕν ὡς ὅλον καὶ ἕν ὡς δεδεμένον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A5","CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία μετατρέπει τὴν πολλαπλότητα ἀπὸ ἀρχὴν ὄντος εἰς ἐσωτερικὸν περιεχόμενον ἑνὸς ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀρχὴ ἑνοποιήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἑνότης οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν διαφοράν τῶν δεδεμένων ἀλλὰ τὴν συνάγει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ τέλειον δύναται νὰ ἔχῃ ἴσον καὶ ἀνεξάρτητον ἀντίγραφο παρʼ αὑτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα εἶναι ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὸ πλῆθος τῶν κόσμων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ σῶμα δύναται νὰ ὑπάρχῃ ὡς ἀσύνδετος παράθεσις στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ ἑνότης εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία διαιρέσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἔργον δεσμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐξηγεῖται ἀπὸ τὰ μέρη μόνα, ἄνευ παραδείγματος καὶ σχέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἦν ἴσος, πλήρης καὶ ἀνεξάρτητος παρὰ τὸ παντελὲς παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει πολλαπλότης ἔξωθεν τοῦ ἑνὸς ὅλου· πᾶσα πολλαπλότης ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν περιεκτικότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἑνότης ἄνευ μέσου, σχέσεως καὶ δεσμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἄρρητος διάστασις μεταξὺ τοῦ νοητοῦ παραδείγματος καὶ τοῦ ὁρατοῦ κόσμου, ἐπειδὴ ὁ δεύτερος ὀφείλει νὰ συγκροτηθῇ κατʼ ὁμοίωσιν τοῦ πρώτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS1","text":"Παντελὲς νοητὸν ζῷον → καθολικὴ περιεκτικότης → ἀπαίτησις μοναδικοῦ ὁμοιώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS2","text":"Ὑπόθεσις δευτέρου ὅλου → ἀνάγκη τρίτου περιέχοντος → ἀκύρωσις τῆς ἀληθοῦς ὁμοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS3","text":"Ἀπαίτησις ὁρατοῦ καὶ ἁπτοῦ σώματος → πῦρ καὶ γῆ → ἀνάγκη στερεᾶς συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS4","text":"Δύο ἀρχαὶ → ἔλλειψις αὐτάρκους συνδέσεως → τρίτος συναγωγὸς δεσμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5","text":"Δεσμὸς κατὰ ἀναλογίαν → ἑνότης τοῦ δεσμοῦ καὶ τῶν δεδεμένων → καλὴ κοσμικὴ σύστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AF1","text":"Ἀπορία περὶ πλήθους → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς τὸ νοητὸν παράδειγμα → ἀπόδειξις τῆς μοναδικότητος → ὑλικὴ θεμελίωσις τοῦ σώματος → ἀνάγκη μέσου δεσμοῦ → ἀναλογία ὡς ἀρχὴ ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάκριση «εἷς ἢ πολλοί» ἀνασχηματίζεται εἰς σχέσιν παραδείγματος καὶ ὁμοιώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν ζῴων μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὸ ἐξωτερικὸν ἐπίπεδον πολλῶν κόσμων εἰς τὸ ἐσωτερικὸν περιεχόμενον ἑνὸς κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη παύει νὰ φαίνεται ὡς ἀσύνδετον ὑπόστρωμα καὶ γίνεται σύστημα ἀπαιτήσεων: ὁρατότης, ἁπτότης, στερεότης, γῆ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται ὡς παραγόμενος δεσμός, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία πλήθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία συνδέει τὴν κοσμικὴ μορφὴ μὲ τὴν ὑλικὴ σύστασιν, ἀντιστρέφουσα τὸ χάσμα μεταξὺ εἴδους καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ λόγος ἀποφαίνεται ὅτι ὁ οὐρανὸς εἷς ἐστὶ καὶ οὐ πολλοί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ μοναδικότης παράγεται ἀπὸ τὴν καθολικὴ περιεκτικότητα τοῦ παραδείγματος καὶ τὴν ἀνάγκην ἑνὸς ὁμοιώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ἐρώτημα λύεται οὐ διὰ ἀμέσου ἀριθμητικοῦ προσδιορισμοῦ ἀλλὰ διὰ μεταφορᾶς τοῦ κριτηρίου πρὸς τὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ γινόμενον ὑπάρχει ὡς ὁρατὸν ὁμοίωμα νοητοῦ παντελοῦς ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ συνθετικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πραγματικότης τοῦ σώματος ἀπαιτεῖ σχέσιν, μέσον καὶ ἀναλογικὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κύριου συλλογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα εἰς τὴν μοναδικότητα καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν μοναδικότητα εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς χαρακτὴρ τοῦ τρίτου δεσμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἐνταῦθα δηλοῦται ὡς ἀναγκαῖος μέσος ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἐξειδικεύεται πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ μένει ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν ὁμοιότητα εἰς τὴν μοναδικότητα καὶ ἀπὸ τὰ δύο στοιχεῖα εἰς τὸν δεσμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα δομὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐστὶν ἡ ἀλληλουχία περιεκτικότης, ὁμοίωμα, ἑνότης, δεσμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις περὶ τῆς μοναδικότητος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν ὅτι τὸ παντελὲς παράδειγμα δὲν ἐπιδέχεται ἴσον ἐξωτερικὸν ἀντίγραφο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230143353813Z_44c11661","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 31","source_sha256":"e598cdb832b2bf0f16fdf4cd0b7b6de12eeb93a7afca84dd5297c157064e9bc8","sha256":"befc80bd03b24ee969ea1157cedb2066c47206f5b245d43dd43daf77b7c10597","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:01:43.356405+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS1","text":"The problem is whether many or one heavens are correctly spoken of.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS2","text":"The principle of judgment is the intelligible paradigm, which, as a complete living being, contains in itself all kindred beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS3","text":"From assimilation to the paradigm it follows that the heaven ought to be one and unique.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS4","text":"The visible and tangible constitution requires a body, and body requires fire and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AS5","text":"Since two elements do not combine well without a third binding bond, the unity of the cosmos requires proportional connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","text":"The divine wills to make what has come to be like the fairest and most complete intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","text":"The complete intelligible living being contains in itself all living beings kindred by nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","text":"The likeness of the complete paradigm must be one in respect of its singleness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A4","text":"A second whole containing all intelligible living beings requires another encompassing whole set over it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A5","text":"The heaven, having come to be as a likeness of the paradigm, is one and unique.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","text":"The generated body must be corporeal, visible, and tangible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A7","text":"The visible requires the presence of some fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A8","text":"The tangible requires solidity, and solidity requires earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","text":"It is impossible for two things to be well combined without a third unifying bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:A10","text":"The finest bond is proportion, because it makes both the bond and the things bound one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX1","text":"It is not correct to say that there are many or infinite heavens, if the heaven has come to be according to the paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX2","text":"A second whole cannot contain all intelligible living beings without another encompassing whole set over it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX3","text":"The cosmos is not merely an aggregate of many independent worlds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX4","text":"The visible cannot come to be without fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX5","text":"The tangible cannot exist without the solid, nor the solid without earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:NX6","text":"Two principles cannot be well united without an intermediate bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D1","text":"The reference of the cosmos to the paradigm transforms the question concerning multiplicity into a question of likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D2","text":"The hypothesis of a second cosmos necessarily entails an encompassing cosmos set over it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D3","text":"The sequence of encompassing things defers true likeness from the second to the other, encompassing thing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D4","text":"The visibility and tangibility of the cosmos impose a twofold material starting-point: fire and earth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","CH_JP8E_S_13:A7","CH_JP8E_S_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D5","text":"The coexistence of fire and earth requires a third element or middle term, which will bring together the separated things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:D6","text":"Proportion becomes not only a mode of connection but also a producer of cosmic unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD1","text":"The unity of the cosmos is produced through two parallel necessities: assimilation to one paradigm and the binding of the constituents into one.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A1","CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2","text":"The oneness of the cosmos is at once morphological and compositional: one as a whole and one as a bound body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A5","CH_JP8E_S_13:A6","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3","text":"Cosmology transforms multiplicity from a principle of being into the internal content of one whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2","CH_JP8E_S_13:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4","text":"Proportion functions as a principle of unification, because unity does not abolish the difference of the bound things but brings it together.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A9","CH_JP8E_S_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX1","text":"The hypothesis that the complete can have an equal and independent copy alongside itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX2","text":"The hypothesis that likeness to the paradigm is indifferent to the number of worlds is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX3","text":"The hypothesis that body can exist as an unconnected juxtaposition of elements is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX4","text":"The hypothesis that unity is a mere absence of division and not the work of a bond is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX5","text":"The hypothesis that cosmic order is explained by the parts alone, without paradigm and relation, is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX1","text":"There is no cosmos that would be equal, complete, and independent alongside the complete paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX2","text":"There is no multiplicity outside the one whole; every multiplicity is subordinated to internal comprehensiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX3","text":"There is no unity without a middle term, relation, and bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX4","text":"An unspoken separation between the intelligible paradigm and the visible cosmos is excluded, since the latter ought to be constituted in likeness of the former.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS1","text":"Complete intelligible living being → universal comprehensiveness → requirement of a unique likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS2","text":"Hypothesis of a second whole → necessity of a third encompassing thing → nullification of true likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS3","text":"Requirement of a visible and tangible body → fire and earth → necessity of a solid constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS4","text":"Two principles → lack of self-sufficient connection → third unifying bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5","text":"Bond according to proportion → unity of the bond and the things bound → fine cosmic constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:AF1","text":"Perplexity concerning multiplicity → reduction to the intelligible paradigm → demonstration of uniqueness → material grounding of body → necessity of an intermediate bond → proportion as a principle of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME1","text":"The distinction “one or many” is reshaped into a relation of paradigm and likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2","text":"The multiplicity of living beings is moved from the external level of many worlds into the internal content of one cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3","text":"Matter ceases to appear as an unconnected substrate and becomes a system of requirements: visibility, tangibility, solidity, earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME4","text":"Unity is redefined as a produced bond, not as a mere absence of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ME5","text":"Proportion connects cosmic form with material constitution, reversing the gap between form and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the argument declares that the heaven is one and not many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, uniqueness is produced from the universal comprehensiveness of the paradigm and the necessity of one likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the question is resolved not through direct numerical determination but through transfer of the criterion to likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, what comes to be exists as a visible likeness of an intelligible complete living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:ALT5","text":"At the compositional level, the reality of body requires relation, a middle term, and proportional unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from the paradigm to uniqueness and from uniqueness to bodily composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3","text":"The precise character of the third bond is underdetermined, since here it is indicated as a necessary middle term but is not fully specified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT4","text":"The transition from likeness to uniqueness and from the two elements to the bond remains internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT5","text":"The strongest structure of the argument is the sequence: comprehensiveness, likeness, unity, bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT6","text":"The demonstration concerning uniqueness depends on accepting that the complete paradigm does not admit an equal external copy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_13:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_13@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_13:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 31"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 15","title":"Section 31","context":"Chapter 15","original_title":"Section 31","original_context":"Chapter 15"},"original_title":"Section 31","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14","layer":"CH","title":"Section 32","order":16,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_14"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_14@R001","sha256":"4e0e10cafafdc59f45107d490d78e3d6851e1d072d52495aa20f04a258635273","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS1","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου ζητεῖται διὰ τῆς ἀναλογίας τῶν στοιχείων καὶ τῶν μέσων δεσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία ἀναλογία τοῦ πρώτου, τοῦ μέσου καὶ τοῦ ἐσχάτου μεταβάλλει τὰ ἑτερογενῆ εἰς κοινωνίαν καὶ ἑνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ πᾶν στερεοειδὲς δεῖ εἶναι, μία μεσότης οὐκ ἀρκεῖ, ἀλλὰ δύο μεσότητες ἀναγκαῖαι γίγνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS4","text":"Ὁ θεὸς διὰ πυρὸς, γῆς, ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος, μέσας σχέσεις καὶ λόγους ἐπιτιθείς, συνέδησε τὸν οὐρανόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ σύνθεσις γεννᾷ σώμα κόσμου ἓν, ὅλον, φίλον ἑαυτῷ καὶ ἄλυτον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS6","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ σύστασις περιλαμβάνει ὅλον τὸ πῦρ, τὸ ὕδωρ, τὸν ἀέρα καὶ τὴν γῆν, ἵνα τὸ ζῷον ᾖ τέλειον ἐκ τελείων μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","text":"Ἐν τρισὶν ὄγκοις ἢ δυνάμεσιν ἡ ἀμοιβαία ἀναλογία καθιστᾷ τὸ μέσον πρῶτον καὶ ἔσχατον, τὰ δὲ ἄκρα μέσα ἀλλήλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","text":"Τὰ ἀμοιβαίως ταὐτὰ γενόμενα εἰς ἓν πάντα συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A3","text":"Ἐὰν τὸ πᾶν ἐπίπεδον ᾖ, μία μεσότης ἀρκεῖ πρὸς σύνδεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","text":"Ἐὰν τὸ πᾶν στερεοειδὲς ᾖ, δύο μεσότητες ἀεὶ συνάπτουσι τὰ ἄκρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία τοῦ πυρὸς πρὸς τὸν ἀέρα καὶ τοῦ ἀέρος πρὸς τὸ ὕδωρ συνδέει τὸ πῦρ καὶ τὸ ὕδωρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A6","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία τοῦ ἀέρος πρὸς τὸ ὕδωρ καὶ τοῦ ὕδατος πρὸς τὴν γῆν συνδέει τὸν ἀέρα καὶ τὴν γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ σύνδεσις τῶν τεττάρων στοιχείων γεννᾷ τὸ ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτὸν οὐράνιον σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","text":"Τὸ σῶμα τοῦ κόσμου ἓν ὅλον ἐκ τῶν τεττάρων στοιχείων ἀποτελεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A9","text":"Ἡ ὁλότης τοῦ κόσμου ἀπαιτεῖ μὴ ὑπολείπεσθαι μέρος οὐδὲ δύναμιν ἔξωθεν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A10","text":"Τὸ τέλειον ζῷον δεῖ ἐκ τελείων μερῶν ὅλον εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX1","text":"Τὸ στερεοειδὲς πᾶν οὐ συνίσταται διὰ μιᾶς μόνον μεσότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX2","text":"Τὰ ἄκρα οὐ δύνανται ἄνευ ἀναλογικῶν μέσων εἰς ἑνότητα συναρμοσθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ὁλότης οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει στοιχεῖον ἢ δύναμιν ἔξωθεν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX4","text":"Τὸ σῶμα τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἔστιν ἄτακτος συνάθροισις μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἀνατίθεται εἰς ἄλλον δεσμόν παρὰ τὸν συνδήσαντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία μετατρέπει τὴν διαφοράν τῶν στοιχείων εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν σχέσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D2","text":"Ἡ στερεὰ μορφὴ τοῦ κόσμου ἐπιβάλλει διπλὴν μεσολάβησιν ἀντὶ ἁπλῆς συνδέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A3","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D3","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ πυρός, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς ἀποτελεῖ συνεχῆ λόγον ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σχέσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπὸ ἁπλῆς συνυπάρξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D5","text":"Ἡ ὁλότης τοῦ κόσμου ἀποκλείει τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν συμπλήρωσιν ἢ ἐνίσχυσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ σύστασις παρέχει τῷ κόσμῳ φιλίαν πρὸς ἑαυτὸν καὶ ἀλυσιδωτὸν δεσμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς καθολικὴ ἀρχὴ μετατροπῆς πολλῶν διακεκριμένων σωμάτων εἰς ἓν αὐτάρκες ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD2","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ κόσμου καὶ ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ πληρότης αὐτοῦ ἀλληλοπροϋποτίθενται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος νοεῖται ὡς ὅλον ὃ συνέχεται ἐκ τῆς ἰδίας ἐσωτερικῆς διατάξεως καὶ οὐκ ἐκ ἐξωτερικοῦ περιβάλλοντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD4","text":"Ἡ θεία κατασκευὴ συνίσταται οὐ μόνον εἰς παραγωγὴν σωμάτων, ἀλλὰ εἰς ἐγκαθίδρυσιν ἀναγκαίων σχέσεων μεταξὺ αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX1","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν στοιχείων οὐ θεωρεῖται ἱκανὴ καθ’ ἑαυτὴν πρὸς κόσμου γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀναιρετικὴ ἐξάλειψις τῶν διαφορών, ἀλλ’ ὡς ἀναλογικὴ τάξις αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","text":"Τὸ μέσον οὐκ ἔχει ἁπλῶς βοηθητικὸν ρόλον, ἀλλὰ συγκροτεῖ τὴν ταυτότητα τῶν ἄκρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX4","text":"Τὸ ὅλον οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ μερῶν ἀδιάφορων πρὸς τὴν ὅλην μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX5","text":"Ἡ τελειότης οὐκ ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ προσθήκης ἔξωθεν ὕλης ἢ δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐν τῷ συστήματι κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἐστηρίζετο εἰς τυχαίαν συνάθροισιν ἢ ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπιδιόρθωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἀσυνδέτου πολλαπλότητος ἣ μὴ μεταβάλλεται διὰ λόγου εἰς ἑνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἔχοι ἀτελῆ μέρη καὶ ἐκ τούτων ὅλον τέλειον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικότης τοῦ δεσμοῦ ἀπουσιάζει ὡς θεμελιώδης ὑπόθεσις τῆς κοσμικῆς ἀυταρκείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS1","text":"Ἀμοιβαία ἀναλογία → ἀναστροφὴ πρώτου, μέσου καὶ ἐσχάτου → ἑνότης τῶν λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS2","text":"Στερεοειδὴς μορφή → ἀνάγκη δύο μεσοτήτων → σύνδεσις τῶν τεσσάρων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS3","text":"Πῦρ : ἀήρ :: ἀήρ : ὕδωρ → ἀὴρ : ὕδωρ :: ὕδωρ : γῆ → συνεχὴς ἀναλογικὸς δεσμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS4","text":"Ἀναλογικὸς δεσμός → ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτὸν οὐράνιον σῶμα → ἓν ὅλον σώμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS5","text":"Ὅλον τῶν τεσσάρων στοιχείων → ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικοῦ ὑπολείμματος → αὐτάρκεια καὶ φιλία πρὸς ἑαυτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS6","text":"Αὐτάρκεια μερῶν → τέλειον ζῷον ἐκ τελείων μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1","text":"Διαφορὰ στοιχείων → ἀναλογικὴ μεσότης → διπλὸς στερεὸς δεσμός → σύστασις κόσμου → ὁλότης καὶ αὐτάρκεια → τέλειον ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","text":"Τὸ μέσον ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ μεταβατικὸν διάστημα εἰς παραγωγικὴν ἀρχὴν ταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἁπλῆς συνάψεως εἰς ἀναλογικὴν ὁμολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME3","text":"Ἡ στερεότης ἐπιφέρει ἀναγκαίαν δομὴν δύο μεσοτήτων καὶ ἀκυροῖ τὸ μονὸν σχῆμα συνδέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME4","text":"Τὰ τέσσαρα στοιχεῖα ἀναταξινοῦνται ὡς ἀλληλοσυμπληρούμενα μέρη ἑνὸς ὅλου καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνεξάρτηται ὕλαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","text":"Ἡ τελειότης ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς πληρότης ἐσωτερικῶν μερῶν, ἄνευ ἐξωτερικῆς προσθήκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ λόγος πραγματεύεται τὴν σύνθεσιν πυρός, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀναλογία καὶ αἱ μεσότητες συγκροτοῦσι τὴν στερεὰν ἑνότητα τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἑνότης ἐξηγεῖται διὰ σχέσεων ἀναγκαιότητος καὶ οὐ διὰ ἁπλῆς παραθέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ κόσμος ὑποτίθεται ὡς ἓν ἔμψυχον καὶ τέλειον ὅλον, οὗ ἡ ἀυτάρκεια ἐρείδεται εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν πληρότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς ἀναλογίας, τῶν δύο μεσοτήτων, τῆς τετραστοιχείας καὶ τῆς ὁλότητος ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ κύριου συλλογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ ἀπὸ τὸν μαθηματικὸν λόγον εἰς τὴν κοσμολογικὴν τελειότητα παραμένει ἐν μέρει ἐλλειπής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀκολουθία εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ’ ὅσον ἡ στερεὰ μορφὴ ἀπαιτεῖ δύο μεσότητας καὶ τὸ ὅλον ἀπαιτεῖ τὰ τέσσαρα στοιχεῖα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα λειτουργία τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναλογίαν εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ παραμένει ὑποκείμενη εἰς ἐλλείψεις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πηγαία περίοδος λήγει πρὶν δηλωθῇ πλήρως ὁ τελικὸς λόγος τῆς τελειότητος τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230159590377Z_148e516e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 32","source_sha256":"4e0e10cafafdc59f45107d490d78e3d6851e1d072d52495aa20f04a258635273","sha256":"b1c4caa7e6c5ec7545301ae967291df2385870732ca0f8525da4371b0b14dc59","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:01:59.595429+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS1","text":"The order of the cosmos is sought through the proportion of the elements and the intermediate bonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS2","text":"The reciprocal proportion of the first, the middle, and the last transforms heterogeneous things into communion and unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS3","text":"Since the whole must be solid, one mean is not sufficient, but two means become necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS4","text":"God, by imposing intermediate relations and ratios through fire, earth, water, and air, bound together the heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS5","text":"Proportional composition produces a single, whole body of the cosmos, friendly to itself and indissoluble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AS6","text":"The cosmic constitution encompasses all fire, water, air, and earth, so that the living being may be complete from complete parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","text":"In three magnitudes or powers, reciprocal proportion makes the middle first and last, and the extremes each other's middles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","text":"Things that have become mutually the same all cohere into one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A3","text":"If the whole is plane, one mean suffices for connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","text":"If the whole is solid, two means always join the extremes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","text":"The proportion of fire to air and of air to water connects fire and water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A6","text":"The proportion of air to water and of water to earth connects air and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","text":"The proportional connection of the four elements produces the visible and tangible heavenly body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","text":"The body of the cosmos consists as one whole of the four elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A9","text":"The wholeness of the cosmos requires that neither part nor power be left outside the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:A10","text":"The complete living being must be whole from complete parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX1","text":"A solid whole is not constituted through only one mean.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX2","text":"The extremes cannot be fitted together into unity without proportional intermediates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX3","text":"Cosmic wholeness does not permit an element or power outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX4","text":"The body of the cosmos is not a disorderly aggregation of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:NX5","text":"The unity of the cosmos is not ascribed to another bond besides that which bound it together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D1","text":"Proportion transforms the difference of the elements into reciprocal relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D2","text":"The solid form of the cosmos imposes double mediation instead of simple connection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A3","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D3","text":"The sequence of fire, air, water, and earth constitutes a continuous ratio of proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","text":"Cosmic unity depends upon relation and not upon mere coexistence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D5","text":"The wholeness of the cosmos excludes external completion or reinforcement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:D6","text":"Proportional constitution provides the cosmos with friendship toward itself and an unbreakable bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A2","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD1","text":"Proportion functions as a universal principle for transforming many distinct bodies into one self-sufficient whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A1","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD2","text":"The form of the cosmos and its internal fullness mutually presuppose one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A4","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","text":"The cosmos is conceived as a whole held together by its own internal arrangement and not by an external environment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A7","CH_JP8E_S_14:A8","CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SD4","text":"Divine construction consists not only in the production of bodies, but in the establishment of necessary relations between them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A5","CH_JP8E_S_14:A6","CH_JP8E_S_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX1","text":"The difference of the elements is not regarded as sufficient in itself for the generation of a cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX2","text":"Unity is not conceived as an eliminative effacement of differences, but as their proportional order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","text":"The middle does not merely have an auxiliary role, but constitutes the identity of the extremes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX4","text":"The whole is not composed of parts indifferent to the whole form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX5","text":"Completeness is not attained through the addition of external matter or power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX1","text":"Absent from the system is a cosmos that would rest upon a chance aggregation or external repair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX2","text":"The possibility of an unconnected multiplicity that is not transformed through ratio into unity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a cosmos that would have incomplete parts and from these a complete whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX4","text":"The externality of the bond is absent as a fundamental presupposition of cosmic self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS1","text":"Reciprocal proportion → reversal of first, middle, and last → unity of ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS2","text":"Solid form → necessity of two means → connection of the four elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS3","text":"Fire : air :: air : water → air : water :: water : earth → continuous proportional bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS4","text":"Proportional bond → visible and tangible heavenly body → one whole body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS5","text":"Whole of the four elements → absence of external remainder → self-sufficiency and friendship toward itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS6","text":"Self-sufficiency of parts → complete living being from complete parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1","text":"Difference of elements → proportional mean → double solid bond → constitution of the cosmos → wholeness and self-sufficiency → complete living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","text":"The middle is reclassified from a transitional interval into a productive principle of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME2","text":"Unity is shifted from simple conjunction to proportional agreement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME3","text":"Solidity entails a necessary structure of two means and invalidates the single form of connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME4","text":"The four elements are reclassified as mutually complementary parts of one whole and not as independent materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","text":"Completeness is recognized as the fullness of internal parts, without external addition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the account addresses the composition of fire, air, water, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, proportion and the means constitute the solid unity of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, unity is explained through relations of necessity and not through mere juxtaposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, the cosmos is posited as one ensouled and complete whole, whose self-sufficiency rests upon internal fullness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT1","text":"The principles of proportion, of the two means, of the four elements, and of wholeness suffice for reconstructing the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT2","text":"The derivation from mathematical ratio to cosmological completeness remains partly deficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT3","text":"The internal sequence is coherent insofar as the solid form requires two means and the whole requires the four elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest function is the transition from proportion to the unity of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction remains subject to deficiencies, because the source passage ends before the final account of the completeness of the living being is fully stated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_14@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_14:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 32"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 16","title":"Section 32","context":"Chapter 16","original_title":"Section 32","original_context":"Chapter 16"},"original_title":"Section 32","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15","layer":"CH","title":"Section 33","order":17,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_15"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_15@R001","sha256":"d871772a81f5ee2cf4f2b368c4bdce1688abc570531b7a840fe23604a85f2a48","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS1","text":"Τὸ ζητούμενον ἐστὶν ἓν ὅλον ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον, ὃ μηδενὸς ἄλλου ὑπολειφθέντος δύναται γίγνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἐκτὸς προσβολὴ θερμῶν, ψυχρῶν καὶ ἄλλων ἰσχυρῶν δυνάμεων συστάσεις λύει καὶ φθορὰν ἐπιφέρει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS3","text":"Ὁ συνθεὶς διὰ ταύτην τὴν αἰτίαν ἓν ὅλον ἐκ πάντων τέλειον, ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον ἐτεκτήνατο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS4","text":"Τὸ ὅλον ὀφείλει τὸ συγγενὲς αὐτῷ σχῆμα ἔχειν, ὥστε ἡ σφαιροειδὴς καὶ κυκλοτερὴς μορφὴ τὴν τελειότητα καὶ τὴν πρὸς ἑαυτὴν ὁμοιότητα δηλοῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS5","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκεια τοῦ ὅλου ἀπαιτεῖ ἀπουσίαν ἐξωτερικῶν αἰσθητηρίων, ὀργάνων, προσόδων καὶ ἀπορροῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","text":"Ἡ ἐκτὸς ἐπιπίπτουσα ἰσχυρὰ δύναμις δύναται λύειν συστάσεις καὶ γεννᾶν νόσον καὶ γῆρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A2","text":"Τὸ ἀπαθὲς πρὸς φθορὰν ὅλον δεῖ μηδενὸς ἄλλου ὑπολείπεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","text":"Τὸ ἐκ πάντων ἓν ὅλον δύναται περιέχειν πάντα τὰ ζῷα καὶ πάντα τὰ σχήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","text":"Τὸ περιέχον πάντα ὀφείλει σχῆμα περιληπτικὸν καὶ συγγενὲς τῇ καθόλου φύσει ἔχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","text":"Ἡ σφαῖρα ἴσον ἀπέχει πανταχόθεν ἀπὸ τοῦ μέσου πρὸς τὰς τελευτάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","text":"Ἡ πρὸς ἑαυτὸ ὁμοιότης τελειοτέρα ἐστὶν ἢ ἡ πρὸς ἕτερον ἀνομοιότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A7","text":"Τὸ παντελῶς περιέχον οὐδενὸς ἐκτὸς ὁρατοῦ ἢ ἀκουστοῦ δεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","text":"Τὸ μηδενὸς ἔξωθεν προσδεόμενον οὔτε ἀναπνοῆς οὔτε τροφῆς οὔτε ὀργάνου χρῄζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A9","text":"Ὅταν μηδὲν ἔξωθεν εἰσέρχηται ἢ ἐξέρχηται, αὐτὸ τὸ ὅλον ἑαυτῷ τροφὴν παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A10","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκεια βελτίων ἐστὶν ἢ ἡ ἐξ ἄλλων ἔνδεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A11","text":"Χεῖρες, πόδες καὶ ὑπηρεσίαι βάσεως προστίθενται μόνον ὅταν λήψεως, ἀμύνης ἢ κινήσεως ἔξωθεν χρεία ᾖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX1","text":"Τὸ ὅλον οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ὑπὸ ἐξωτερικῶν θερμῶν, ψυχρῶν ἢ ἄλλων δυνάμεων διαλύεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX2","text":"Οὐδὲν ὁρατὸν ἢ ἀκουστὸν ὑπολείπεται ἔξωθεν τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX3","text":"Τὸ ὅλον οὐκ ἔχει περιεστῶτα ἀέρα, ὃς ἀναπνοῆς χρείαν ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX4","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἔξωθεν ἡ τροφὴ οὐδὲ ἡ ἀποβολὴ τῆς ἐξικμασμένης οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX5","text":"Οὐδεμία εἴσοδος οὐδὲ ἔξοδος ἀπὸ τόπου τινὸς πρὸς τὸ ὅλον ὑπάρχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX6","text":"Οὐ χεῖρες οὐδὲ πόδες οὐδὲ ὅλως ὄργανα προσήκοντα τῇ λήψει, τῇ ἀμύνῃ ἢ τῇ βάσει ἀναγκαῖα εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX7","text":"Τὸ ὅλον οὐκ ἔχει ἐξωτερικὸν ἀντίπαλον ἢ συμπλήρωμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ δύναμις φθείρει, ἡ ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικοῦ περιβάλλοντος γίνεται ὅρος τῆς ἀφθαρσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","CH_JP8E_S_15:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὅλον περιέχει πάντα, ἡ μορφὴ αὐτοῦ δεῖ ὥστε μηδὲν σχῆμα ἔξωθεν αὐτοῦ μένειν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D3","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ ἐπιτείνει τὴν ἑνότητα, ἐπειδὴ πᾶν μέρος ἀπὸ τοῦ μέσου ἴσον ἀπέχει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","CH_JP8E_S_15:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D4","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς ἑαυτὸ μετατρέπει τὸ ὅλον εἰς ἀρχὴν καὶ μέτρον ἑαυτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οὐδὲν ὁρατὸν ἢ ἀκουστὸν ἔξωθεν ὑπολείπεται, ὄμμα καὶ ἀκοὴ περιττὰ καθίστανται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οὐδὲν ἔξωθεν εἰσέρχεται ἢ ἐξέρχεται, ἡ διατροφή καὶ ἡ φθορὰ ἐνδογενεῖς γίγνονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D7","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας καθιστᾷ τὰ ὄργανα λογικῶς ἀναγκαῖα ἢ περιττὰ κατὰ τὸν σκοπὸν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀφθαρσία τοῦ ὅλου παράγεται οὐχὶ διὰ συνεχοῦς ἀντιστάσεως πρὸς ἔξωθεν φθοράν, ἀλλὰ διὰ κατασκευῆς ἄνευ ἐξωτερικοῦ πεδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","CH_JP8E_S_15:A2","CH_JP8E_S_15:A7","CH_JP8E_S_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ, ἡ ἐνέργεια καὶ ἡ διατροφή τοῦ ὅλου ἀνάγονται εἰς μίαν ἀρχήν, ἥτις οὔτε δέχεται οὔτε ἀποβάλλει ἔξωθεν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3","text":"Τὸ ὅλον γίνεται κλειστὴ αὐτοπαραγωγὸς τάξις, ἐν ᾗ τὸ περιέχον, τὸ περιεχόμενον καὶ τὸ τρεφόμενον συμπίπτουσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4","text":"Ἡ τελειότης ὁρίζεται ὡς ἀπουσία σχέσεως ἀναγκαίας πρὸς ἕτερον καὶ ὡς πλήρης ὁμοιότης πρὸς ἑαυτό.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ὡς ἀνοικτὸν σύστημα, τρεφόμενον ὑπὸ ἐξωτερικῶν ῥοῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὕπαρξις ὡς ἀλληλεξάρτησις τοῦ ὅλου πρὸς ἄλλα ὄντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ αἴσθησις ὡς ἀπάντησις πρὸς ἀνεξάρτητον ἔξω κόσμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ζωὴ ὡς διαρκὴς λῆψις καὶ ἀποβολὴ ὕλης ἐκτὸς τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ τελειότης ὡς δύναμις ἐξουσιάζουσα ἢ ἀμυνομένη ἐναντίον ἄλλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὁ ἔξωθεν κόσμος ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος τοῦ εἶναι τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἑτερότης ὡς θεμελιώδης ἀρχὴ τῆς τελειότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ χρεία κινήσεως πρὸς ἕτερον, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα λειτουργία ἐντὸς τοῦ ὅλου τελεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4","text":"Ἀδύνατον καθίσταται τὸ ὅλον ὡς ἔλλειψιν, ὡς ἀνοικτὴν ἐξάρτησιν ἢ ὡς ἀτελῆ σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS1","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ ἰσχυρὰ δύναμις → λύσις συστάσεως → νόσος καὶ γῆρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS2","text":"Ἀπαίτησις ἀφθαρσίας → ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικοῦ περιβάλλοντος → κλειστὸν ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS3","text":"Περιεκτικὴ καθολικότης → σχῆμα περιληπτικόν → σφαῖρα ἴσων ἀποστάσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS4","text":"Σφαιρικὴ ὁμοιότης → ἑνιαῖον μέτρον → τελειότης καὶ αὐτοταυτότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS5","text":"Παντελὴς περιεκτικότης → μηδὲν ἔξωθεν ὁρατὸν ἢ ἀκουστόν → ἀπουσία ὀμμάτων καὶ ἀκοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS6","text":"Μηδὲν ἔξωθεν εἰσιόν → μηδὲν ἐξιόν → αὐτοτροφία καὶ ἐνδογενὴς λειτουργία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS7","text":"Αὐτάρκεια → κατάργησις ὀργάνων λήψεως, ἀμύνης καὶ βάσεως → ὅλον ἀνενδεές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AF1","text":"Φθορὰ ἐκτὸς ἐπιπιπτοῦσα → ἀνάγκη ἀφθαρσίας → κλειστὴ καθολικότης → σφαιρικὴ ὁμοιότης → ἀνυπαρξία ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας → αὐτάρκες ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AF2","text":"Ἐξωτερικὸς κίνδυνος → ἀποκλεισμὸς τοῦ ἔξω → ἐσωτερικὴ αὐτοσυντήρησις → κατάργησις αἰσθητηρίων καὶ ὀργάνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1","text":"Ἡ τελειότης μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἱκανότητα πρὸς ἔξωθεν ἐνέργειαν εἰς τὴν ἀπουσίαν ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","text":"Ἡ σφαῖρα γίνεται τὸ σχῆμα τῆς καθολικῆς περιεκτικότητος, τῆς ἰσορροπίας καὶ τῆς αὐτοταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ὅρον φθορᾶς καὶ ὅρον αὐταρκείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητήρια καὶ τὰ μέλη παύουσιν εἶναι καθόλου γνωρίσματα ζωῆς καὶ γίγνονται ὄργανα ἐλλείψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME5","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ ἀναπαρίσταται ὡς αὐτοπαθὴς καὶ αὐτοτροφὸς κύκλος, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνταλλαγὴ πρὸς ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου κατασκευάζεται ἓν ζῷον σφαιροειδές, τέλειον, ἀγήρων καὶ ἄνοσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀφθαρσία ἐξασφαλίζεται διὰ ἀποκλεισμοῦ ἐξωτερικῶν ἐπιδράσεων καὶ διὰ ἐσωτερικῆς αὐτοσυντηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀπουσία, ἡ ἀποβολὴ καὶ ἡ ἀνενδεία γίγνονται ὅροι θετικῆς τελειότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ ὄν ὑποτίθεται αὐτοτελές, ἑαυτῷ ὅμοιον, αὐτοπαθὲς καὶ μὴ ἐξαρτώμενον ἀπὸ ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ διαρκὴς ὕπαρξις ἀπαιτεῖ κατάργησιν τῶν μηχανισμῶν γήρως, νόσου καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν φθορὰν πρὸς τὸ αὐτάρκες ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν αἰτίας, μορφῆς, αἰσθήσεως, τροφῆς καὶ ὀργάνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν ταύτισιν περιεκτικότητος, ὁμοιότητος καὶ αὐταρκείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀδιευκρίνιστον πῶς ἡ ἐνδογενὴς φθίσις δύναται νὰ παρέχῃ τροφὴν χωρὶς νὰ ἐπιφέρῃ λύσιν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT5","text":"Ὑπομένει ἔντασις μεταξὺ τοῦ ὅλου ὡς παντὸς περιέχοντος καὶ τοῦ ὅλου ὡς ζῴου, ὃ πάσχει καὶ δρᾷ ἐν ἑαυτῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κατασκευὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὸν ἀποκλεισμὸν τοῦ ἔξωθεν, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἄρρητον ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ φθορὰ δύναται νὰ μετασχηματισθῇ εἰς συντήρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230220056541Z_c1a61fcd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 33","source_sha256":"d871772a81f5ee2cf4f2b368c4bdce1688abc570531b7a840fe23604a85f2a48","sha256":"32a1155588ce79093c11e65d3231266b766a7abf729c5f3b490e5f95c4c0496c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:02:20.057625+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS1","text":"What is sought is one whole, ageless and free from disease, which can come to be with nothing else left over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS2","text":"The external assault of hot, cold, and other powerful forces dissolves compounds and brings about destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS3","text":"For this reason, the maker fashioned one whole out of all things, complete, ageless, and free from disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS4","text":"The whole ought to have the shape akin to it, so that the spherical and circular form signifies completeness and likeness to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AS5","text":"The self-sufficiency of the whole requires the absence of external sense-organs, instruments, inflows, and outflows.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","text":"A powerful force falling upon it from outside can dissolve compounds and generate disease and old age.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A2","text":"A whole immune to destruction must have nothing else left over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","text":"The one whole composed of all things can contain all living creatures and all shapes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","text":"That which contains all things ought to have a comprehensive shape akin to universal nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","text":"A sphere is equally distant in every direction from the centre to the extremities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","text":"Likeness to itself is more complete than unlikeness to another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A7","text":"That which completely contains all things requires nothing visible or audible outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","text":"That which needs nothing from outside requires neither respiration nor nourishment nor an instrument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A9","text":"Whenever nothing enters or exits from outside, the whole itself provides nourishment for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A10","text":"Self-sufficiency is better than neediness dependent upon others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:A11","text":"Hands, feet, and means of support are added only when there is need of acquisition, defence, or movement from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX1","text":"The whole cannot be dissolved by external hot, cold, or other forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX2","text":"Nothing visible or audible remains outside the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX3","text":"The whole does not have surrounding air, which creates a need for respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX4","text":"Neither nourishment nor the expulsion of exhausted substance is outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX5","text":"There is no entrance or exit from any place to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX6","text":"Neither hands nor feet nor, in general, instruments suited to acquisition, defence, or support are necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:NX7","text":"The whole has no external opponent or complement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D1","text":"Since external force destroys, the absence of an external environment becomes a condition of indestructibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","CH_JP8E_S_15:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D2","text":"Since the whole contains all things, its form must be such that no shape remains outside it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D3","text":"The spherical form intensifies unity, since every part is equally distant from the centre.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","CH_JP8E_S_15:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D4","text":"Likeness to itself makes the whole into the principle and measure of itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D5","text":"Since nothing visible or audible remains outside, sight and hearing become superfluous.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D6","text":"Since nothing enters or exits from outside, nourishment and decay become endogenous.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:D7","text":"The lack of external need renders organs logically necessary or superfluous according to the purpose of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD1","text":"The indestructibility of the whole is produced not through continuous resistance to external decay, but through a construction without an external field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A1","CH_JP8E_S_15:A2","CH_JP8E_S_15:A7","CH_JP8E_S_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2","text":"The form, activity, and nourishment of the whole are referred to one principle, which neither receives nor expels from outside.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A4","CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","CH_JP8E_S_15:A8","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3","text":"The whole becomes a closed self-producing order, in which that which contains, that which is contained, and that which is nourished coincide.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A3","CH_JP8E_S_15:A9","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4","text":"Perfection is defined as the absence of a necessary relation to another and as complete likeness to itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A6","CH_JP8E_S_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX1","text":"The cosmic order as an open system nourished by external flows is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX2","text":"Existence as the interdependence of the whole upon other beings is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX3","text":"Sensation as a response to an independent external world is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX4","text":"Life as the continuous intake and expulsion of matter outside the living creature is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX5","text":"Perfection as a power ruling over or defending itself against others is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1","text":"The external world is absent as a necessary condition of the being of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX2","text":"Otherness is absent as a fundamental principle of perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX3","text":"The need for movement toward another is absent, since every function is performed within the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4","text":"The whole becomes impossible as a deficiency, as an open dependency, or as an incomplete composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS1","text":"External powerful force → dissolution of compound → disease and old age.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS2","text":"Requirement of indestructibility → absence of external environment → closed whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS3","text":"Comprehensive universality → comprehensive shape → sphere of equal distances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS4","text":"Spherical likeness → unified measure → perfection and self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS5","text":"Complete comprehensiveness → nothing visible or audible outside → absence of eyes and hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS6","text":"Nothing entering from outside → nothing exiting → self-nourishment and endogenous function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS7","text":"Self-sufficiency → abolition of organs of acquisition, defence, and support → whole lacking nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AF1","text":"Externally impinging decay → necessity of indestructibility → closed universality → spherical likeness → non-existence of external need → self-sufficient whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:AF2","text":"External danger → exclusion of the outside → internal self-maintenance → abolition of sense-organs and instruments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1","text":"Perfection is transferred from the capacity for action upon what is outside to the absence of external need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","text":"The sphere becomes the shape of universal comprehensiveness, equilibrium, and self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME3","text":"The distinction between internal and external is transformed into a condition of destruction and a condition of self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","text":"The sense-organs and members cease to be general marks of life and become instruments of deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ME5","text":"Life is represented as a self-affected and self-nourishing cycle, not as an exchange with another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT1","text":"At the superficial level, one spherical, complete, ageless, and disease-free living creature is constructed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, indestructibility is secured through exclusion of external influences and through internal self-maintenance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, absence, exclusion, and lack of need become conditions of positive perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, being is posited as self-complete, like itself, self-affected, and not dependent upon another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, enduring existence requires the abolition of the mechanisms of old age, disease, and external destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the movement from external destruction to the self-sufficient whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT2","text":"The sequence preserves the succession of cause, form, sensation, nourishment, and organs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests upon the identification of comprehensiveness, likeness, and self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","text":"It remains unexplained how endogenous wasting can provide nourishment without bringing about the dissolution of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the whole as containing everything and the whole as a living creature that is affected and acts within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6","text":"The construction is coherent insofar as it concerns the exclusion of what is outside, but it depends upon the unspoken principle that internal decay can be transformed into maintenance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_15@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_15:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 33"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 17","title":"Section 33","context":"Chapter 17","original_title":"Section 33","original_context":"Chapter 17"},"original_title":"Section 33","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16","layer":"CH","title":"Section 34","order":18,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_16"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_16@R001","sha256":"79389133295a79a40a2e342b15ff5788fab855f521404e03fc260816de10c1b5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ὀρθὴ τάξις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς ἐν τῇ γενέσει τοῦ θεοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ κίνησις ἀναπλάττεται ὡς ἡ τοῦ σώματος οἰκεία κίνησις, ἡ κυκλικὴ καὶ νοερᾷ φύσει συγγενής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ οὐρανοῦ παράγεται διὰ περιορισμοῦ τῶν ἄλλων κινήσεων καὶ διὰ τῆς ἀποδόσεως μιᾶς ἀπλανεστάτης περιφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS4","text":"Τὸ παντελὲς σῶμα ἀπαιτεῖ ψυχὴν ἐντὸς καὶ διὰ παντὸς ἐκτεινομένην, ἥτις αὐτὸ συνέχει καὶ περιέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ γένεσιν καὶ ἀρετὴν προτέρα τοῦ σώματος ὑφίσταται ὡς δεσπότις καὶ ἄρχουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS6","text":"Ἡ διήγησις διορθοῦται ἀπὸ τὴν φαινομένην χρονικὴν ὑστερότητα τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὴν ὀντολογικὴν καὶ κυριαρχικὴν προτεραιότητά της.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","text":"Ἡ τοῦ σώματος οἰκεία κίνησις ἐστὶν ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A2","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις ἀνάγεται εἰς νοῦν καὶ φρόνησιν μᾶλλον ἢ αἱ λοιπαὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ οὐρανοῦ απαιτεῖ τὴν ἀφαίρεσιν τῶν ἓξ ἄλλων κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A4","text":"Τὸ κοσμικὸν σῶμα δεῖ εἶναι λεῖον, ὁμαλόν, ἴσον ἐκ μέσου καὶ ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A5","text":"Ὁ κόσμος συνίσταται ἐκ τῶν τελέων σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A6","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ τίθεται ἐν τῷ μέσῳ τοῦ σώματος καὶ διὰ παντὸς αὐτοῦ ἐκτείνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ περιέχει τὸ σῶμα καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον περιέχεται ὑπ’ αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A8","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀποτελεῖ ἕνα μόνον κύκλον κυκλικῶς στρεφόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A9","text":"Τὸ θεῖον ὂν δύναται δι’ ἀρετῆς αὐτῷ συγγίγνεσθαι καὶ οὐδενὸς ἑτέρου προσδεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A10","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκεια καὶ ἡ αὐτογνωσία συνιστῶσι τὴν εὐδαιμονίαν τοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A11","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ γένεσιν καὶ ἀρετὴν προτέρα καὶ πρεσβυτέρα τοῦ σώματος ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A12","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἔχει τὴν τάξιν δεσπότιδος καὶ ἀρχούσης, τὸ δὲ σῶμα τὴν τάξιν ἀρχομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX1","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ πολλῶν ἀσυνδέτων οὐρανῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ κίνησις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἄτακτος ἢ πολυειδῶς διεσπασμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX3","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς οὐκ ἔχει πόδας, σκέλη, ἢ ὄργανα βαδίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX4","text":"Τὸ σῶμα τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀνώμαλον, τραχὺ, ἄνισον, ἢ ἀτελές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔχει δευτέραν καὶ ὑστερογενῆ τάξιν πρὸς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX6","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἐστὶν ἐξάρτημα τοῦ σώματος οὔτε παθητικὸς ὑποδοχεὺς αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX7","text":"Ὁ θεὸς οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἑτέρου ὄντος πρὸς τὴν ὕπαρξιν ἢ τὴν εὐδαιμονίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX8","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη σειρά τῆς διηγήσεως οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν σειράν τῶν γενομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν ἓξ κινήσεων μετατρέπει τὸν οὐρανὸν ἀπὸ πολυκινησίας εἰς ἑνιαίαν νοερὰν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","CH_JP8E_S_16:A2","CH_JP8E_S_16:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D2","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ ἀποδίδει τῷ κόσμῳ αὐτάρκη κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ οὐδὲν ἔξωθεν ὄργανον κινήσεως χρειάζεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","CH_JP8E_S_16:A4","CH_JP8E_S_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ γίνεται ἀρχὴ συνοχῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἐντὸς τοῦ σώματος τίθεται καὶ συγχρόνως ὑπὲρ τὸ σῶμα ἐκτείνεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A6","CH_JP8E_S_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D4","text":"Ἡ εὐδαιμονία τοῦ θεοῦ ἀκολουθεῖ ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἑνότητος, τῆς αὐταρκείας καὶ τῆς πρὸς ἑαυτὸν γνωριμίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A9","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D5","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ψυχῆς καθιστᾷ τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν ἱεραρχικὴν καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς χωρικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A11","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τελειότης παράγεται ὡς σύμπτωσις γεωμετρικῆς ἑνότητος, κυκλικῆς αὐτοκινήσεως καὶ ψυχικῆς κυριαρχίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικότης τοῦ κόσμου καὶ ἡ αὐτάρκεια τοῦ θεοῦ συγκροτοῦν σύστημα ὃ οὐδενὸς ἐξωτερικοῦ ὅρου δεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ δὲν προστίθεται ὕστερον εἰς ἕτοιμον σῶμα, ἀλλὰ καθιστᾷ τὸ σῶμα κόσμον διὰ τῆς ἐπιβολῆς τάξεως καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ προτεραιότης τῆς ψυχῆς μετατρέπει τὸ σωματικὸν ὅλον ἀπὸ αὐτοτελὲς ὑποκείμενον εἰς ὑποτεταγμένον φορέα ψυχικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","text":"Ἡ διόρθωσις τῆς διηγήσεως ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι ἡ γενετικὴ ἀκολουθία τῶν λόγων δύναται νὰ ἀποκρύπτῃ τὴν ἀληθινὴν τάξιν τῶν ὄντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX1","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ὤθησιν ἢ ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀπλῆν μεταβολὴν τόπου, ἀλλὰ φέρει ἐντός της μορφὴν νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης οὐκ ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ συναρμογῆς ἀνεξαρτήτων μερῶν, ἀλλὰ διὰ ὑποταγῆς τῶν κινήσεων εἰς μίαν κυρίαν περιφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX4","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ δύναται νὰ ἀποτελῇ τὸ ἔσχατον ὑποκείμενον τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ κατ’ ἀνάγκην τὴν ἐμφανῆ χρονολογικὴν σειράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς ἔχει ἀνάγκην ἑτέρου ὄντος διὰ τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν συνοχὴν ἢ τὴν εὐδαιμονίαν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ ὕλη ἢ τὸ σῶμα δύναται αὐτοτελῶς νὰ παράγῃ τάξιν καὶ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ πρώτου μὲ τὸ πρῶτον λεγόμενον ἐν τῷ λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ συστήματος ἡ ἔξωθεν ἀντίστασις, ἡ ἀμοιβαία ἐξάρτησις καὶ ἡ ἐνδεχόμενη διάλυσις τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS1","text":"Ἀπόδοσις οἰκείας κινήσεως τῷ σώματι → ὑποτίμησις τῶν ἓξ ἄλλων κινήσεων → ἑνιαία κυκλικὴ περιφορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2","text":"Κυκλικὴ περιφορά → σφαιρικὴ καὶ ἄπους μορφή → αὐτοκίνησις χωρὶς ἐξωτερικὸν ὄργανον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS3","text":"Τελειότης σώματος → τοποθέτησις ψυχῆς ἐν τῷ μέσῳ → ἐπέκτασις ψυχῆς διὰ παντὸς τοῦ σώματος → συνοχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS4","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ ψυχικὴ συνοχή → αὐτάρκεια → αὐτογνωσία → εὐδαιμονία θεοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS5","text":"Φαινομένη ὕστερη γένεσις ψυχῆς → ἀπόρριψις τῆς χρονολογικῆς ἀναγνώσεως → ὀντολογικὴ προτεραιότης ψυχῆς → κυριαρχία ἐπὶ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF1","text":"Ἀνάγκη κοσμικῆς ἑνότητος → ἐπιλογὴ κυκλικῆς κινήσεως → ἀφαίρεσις τῶν λοιπῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF2","text":"Ἑνιαία κίνησις → τέλειον καὶ αὐτάρκες σῶμα → ἕνας οὐρανὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF3","text":"Τέλειον σῶμα → ψυχὴ ἐντός τε καὶ ἐκτός → συνοχὴ καὶ αὐτογνωσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF4","text":"Φαινομένη χρονικὴ ὕστερη ψυχῆς → διόρθωσις τῆς διηγήσεως → ψυχὴ πρεσβυτέρα καὶ ἄρχουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME1","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φυσικὴ μεταβολὴ εἰς φορέα νοερᾶς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME2","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἄθροισμα κινήσεων εἰς ἑνιαῖον αὐτοκινούμενον ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὸν μέρος τοῦ σώματος εἰς περιέχουσαν καὶ κυβερνώσαν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ χρονικὴν διαδοχὴν εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ἐξάρτηση ἀρχούσης καὶ ἀρχομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME5","text":"Ἡ εὐδαιμονία ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὰ ἀγαθὰ καὶ συνδέεται μὲ αὐτάρκειαν καὶ αὐτοσχέσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ὁ οὐρανὸς κινεῖται κυκλικῶς, ἄπους καὶ ἑνιαίως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ἡ ψυχὴ περιέχει καὶ κυβερνᾷ τὸ σῶμα, ἐνώ ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις ἐνοποιεῖ τὸ κοσμικὸν ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Ἡ διήγησις ἀναθεωρεῖται ὅταν ἡ φαινομένη σειρά συγκρούεται μὲ τὴν ὀντολογικὴ ἱεραρχία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Ἡ ψυχὴ εἶναι προτέρα τοῦ σώματος κατὰ γένεσιν καὶ ἀρετήν, μολονότι ἡ διήγησις δύναται νὰ τὴν παρουσιάζῃ ὡς ὕστερον λεγομένην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν κυκλικὴν κίνησιν πρὸς τὴν ψυχικὴν κυριαρχίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν σύνδεσιν γεωμετρικῆς τελειότητος, αὐταρκείας καὶ ψυχικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς συνθέσεως τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ τῶν στοιχείων τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT4","text":"Ἡ κύρια τάσις ἐστὶν ἡ προτεραιότης τῆς ψυχῆς, ἀλλὰ παραμένει τάσις μεταξὺ χρονικῆς διηγήσεως καὶ ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικόν ὑπὸ τὴν ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ ἡγεῖται τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ ἡ συνοχὴ αὐτοῦ προϋποθέτει ἀποδοχὴν τῆς ψυχῆς ὡς αὐτοκινήτου καὶ αὐταρκοῦς ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230238917135Z_30bab75c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 34","source_sha256":"79389133295a79a40a2e342b15ff5788fab855f521404e03fc260816de10c1b5","sha256":"b1fc071b377449db641a3e5616c6e3f1d02edaf320dc3a20d57ce3e73a617096","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:02:38.920940+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS1","text":"The problem is the correct ordering of body and soul in the generation of the divine cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS2","text":"Cosmic motion is recast as the body's proper motion, circular and akin to an intellectual nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS3","text":"The unity of heaven is produced through the restriction of the other motions and through the assignment of one most unerring revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS4","text":"The complete body requires a soul extending within and throughout it, which holds it together and encompasses it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS5","text":"The soul subsists as prior to the body in generation and excellence, as mistress and ruler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AS6","text":"The account is corrected from the soul's apparent temporal posteriority toward its ontological and governing priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","text":"The body's proper motion is circular motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A2","text":"Circular motion is referred to intellect and prudence more than the remaining motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A3","text":"The unity of heaven requires the removal of the six other motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A4","text":"The cosmic body must be smooth, even, equidistant from the center, and whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A5","text":"The cosmos is composed of the complete bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A6","text":"The soul is placed in the middle of the body and extends throughout all of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","text":"The soul encompasses the body and is not merely encompassed by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A8","text":"Heaven constitutes one single circle rotating circularly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A9","text":"The divine being is able through virtue to consort with itself and has need of nothing else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A10","text":"Self-sufficiency and self-knowledge constitute the happiness of god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A11","text":"The soul is prior and older than the body in generation and excellence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:A12","text":"The soul has the rank of mistress and ruler, while the body has the rank of that which is ruled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX1","text":"The cosmos is not composed of many unconnected heavens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX2","text":"Cosmic motion is not disorderly or diversely fragmented.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX3","text":"Heaven has neither feet, legs, nor organs of walking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX4","text":"The body of the cosmos is not uneven, rough, unequal, or incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX5","text":"The soul does not have a secondary and later-generated rank in relation to the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX6","text":"The soul is neither an appendage of the body nor its passive receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX7","text":"God does not depend on another being for existence or happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:NX8","text":"The apparent sequence of the account does not demonstrate the ontological order of the things generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D1","text":"The removal of the six motions transforms heaven from multiplicity of motion into a unified intellectual order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","CH_JP8E_S_16:A2","CH_JP8E_S_16:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D2","text":"The spherical form accords the cosmos self-sufficient motion, since it needs no external organ of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A1","CH_JP8E_S_16:A4","CH_JP8E_S_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D3","text":"The soul becomes a principle of cohesion, because it is placed within the body and at the same time extends beyond the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A6","CH_JP8E_S_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D4","text":"The happiness of god follows from internal unity, self-sufficiency, and acquaintance with itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A9","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:D5","text":"The priority of soul renders cosmic order hierarchical and not merely spatial.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A11","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD1","text":"Cosmic perfection is produced as the conjunction of geometrical unity, circular self-motion, and psychic sovereignty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD2","text":"The inwardness of the cosmos and the self-sufficiency of god constitute a system requiring no external condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3","text":"The soul is not added later to a ready-made body, but makes the body into a cosmos through the imposition of order and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4","text":"The ontological priority of soul transforms the bodily whole from a self-subsisting subject into a subordinate bearer of psychic principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","text":"The correction of the account reveals that the generative sequence of the statements can conceal the true order of beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX1","text":"The order of the cosmos is not explained by external impulse or necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX2","text":"Motion is not mere change of place, but bears within itself a form of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX3","text":"Unity is not achieved through the fitting together of independent parts, but through the subordination of motions to one ruling revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX4","text":"The body cannot constitute the ultimate subject of cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX5","text":"The principle does not necessarily follow the evident chronological sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a cosmos that has need of another being for its motion, cohesion, or happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the supposition that matter or body can independently produce order and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the identification of the first with what is first said in the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX4","text":"External resistance, mutual dependence, and the possible dissolution of the cosmos are absent from the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS1","text":"Assignment of proper motion to the body → devaluation of the six other motions → unified circular revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2","text":"Circular revolution → spherical and footless form → self-motion without an external organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS3","text":"Perfection of body → placement of soul in the middle → extension of soul throughout the whole body → cohesion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS4","text":"Internal psychic cohesion → self-sufficiency → self-knowledge → happiness of god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS5","text":"Apparent later generation of soul → rejection of the chronological reading → ontological priority of soul → sovereignty over the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF1","text":"Necessity of cosmic unity → selection of circular motion → removal of the remaining motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF2","text":"Unified motion → complete and self-sufficient body → one heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF3","text":"Complete body → soul both within and without → cohesion and self-knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:AF4","text":"Apparent temporal posteriority of soul → correction of the account → soul older and ruling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME1","text":"Motion is reclassified from natural change into a bearer of intellectual order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME2","text":"Heaven is reclassified from an aggregate of motions into a unified self-moving whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3","text":"The soul is reclassified from an internal part of the body into an encompassing and governing principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4","text":"Generation is reclassified from temporal succession into the hierarchical dependence of ruler and ruled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ME5","text":"Happiness is dissociated from external goods and associated with self-sufficiency and relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT1","text":"Surface — Heaven moves circularly, footlessly, and as one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT2","text":"Structural — The soul encompasses and governs the body, while circular motion unifies the cosmic whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The account is revised when the apparent sequence conflicts with the ontological hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The soul is prior to the body in generation and excellence, although the account may present it as spoken of later.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from circular motion to psychic sovereignty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT2","text":"Internal cohesion depends on the connection of geometrical perfection, self-sufficiency, and psychic principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT3","text":"The precise manner of the composition of the soul and of the elements of the body is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT4","text":"The principal tendency is the priority of soul, but a tension remains between temporal account and ontological order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT5","text":"The system is internally coherent under the principle that the soul leads the body, but its cohesion presupposes acceptance of the soul as a self-moving and self-sufficient principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_16@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_16:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 34"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 18","title":"Section 34","context":"Chapter 18","original_title":"Section 34","original_context":"Chapter 18"},"original_title":"Section 34","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17","layer":"CH","title":"Section 35","order":19,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_17"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_17@R001","sha256":"3b35843edc775874604f9c16d5f5d70413e5f4ab40ae6fa731961290b72b7b27","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα συνίσταται ἐν τῷ συνάψαι τὴν ἀμέριστον οὐσίαν πρὸς τὴν κατὰ τὰ σώματα μεριστήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS2","text":"Ἡ λύσις ἀπαιτεῖ τρίτην οὐσίαν, ἐκ τῆς τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ τῆς τοῦ ἑτέρου φύσεως συγκειμένην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀσύμμετρος ἑτερότης εἰς ἓν συναρμόζεται βίᾳ, διὰ μεσότητος καὶ μίξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS4","text":"Τὸ ἓν ἐκ τῶν τριῶν συγκείμενον ὅλον διαιρεῖται εἰς μοίρας, ὧν ἑκάστη περιέχει τὸ ταὐτόν, τὸ ἕτερον καὶ τὴν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS5","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις ἀκολουθεῖ ἀριθμητικὴν τάξιν, ἵνα ἡ ἐκ πολλῶν σύστασις λάβῃ μετρητὴν ἀναλογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","text":"Ὑπάρχει οὐσία ἀμέριστος καὶ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A2","text":"Ὑπάρχει οὐσία μεριστὴ γιγνομένη περὶ τὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A3","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ φύσις καὶ ἡ τοῦ ἑτέρου φύσις ἀνήκουσιν εἰς τὴν σύστασιν τῆς μικτῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A4","text":"Τρίτον εἶδος οὐσίας τίθεται ἐν μέσῳ τοῦ ἀμεροῦς καὶ τοῦ κατὰ τὰ σώματα μεριστοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ ἑτέρου δύσμεικτός ἐστιν καὶ οὐκ ἄνευ βίας εἰς ταὐτὸν συναρμόζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A6","text":"Τὰ τρία γένη δύνανται διὰ μίξεως εἰς μίαν ἰδέαν συντεθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","text":"Τὸ ἓν μικτὸν ὅλον δύναται εἰς προσήκουσας μοίρας διαιρεθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A8","text":"Ἑκάστη μοῖρα ἐκ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ, τοῦ ἑτέρου καὶ τῆς οὐσίας μεμειγμένη ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν μοιρῶν ὀρίζεται διὰ λόγων ἀριθμητικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A10","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία τῶν πρώτων μοιρῶν ἐστὶν ἡ μονάς, τὸ διπλάσιον, τὸ ἡμιόλιον τοῦ δευτέρου καὶ τὸ τριπλάσιον τῆς πρώτης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ σύστασις οὔτε ἐκ μόνου τοῦ ἀμεροῦς οὔτε ἐκ μόνου τοῦ μεριστοῦ προέρχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX2","text":"Τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀρχικῶς ἁπλῶς ἑνωμένα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἑτερότης οὐκ ἀφ’ ἑαυτῆς εἰς ἁρμονικὴν ἑνότητα συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης οὐκ ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἄμεσος ταυτότης τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX5","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις οὐκ ἔστιν ἄτακτος κατακερματισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX6","text":"Οὐδεμία μοῖρα ἀμιγὴς ἑνὸς μόνου γένους ὑποτίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D1","text":"Ἡ παρουσία τρίτης οὐσίας καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τῆς ἀμερισίας εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν μεριστότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","CH_JP8E_S_17:A2","CH_JP8E_S_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὅλου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ μίξιν ἀνομοίων γενῶν, οὐχὶ ἀπὸ ἀναίρεσιν τῆς διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A3","CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D3","text":"Ἡ βία τῆς συναρμογῆς δηλοῖ ὅτι ἡ ἑνότης εἶναι παραγόμενον ἔργον καὶ οὐχὶ δεδομένη φυσικὴ κατάστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τοῦ ὅλου διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀρχικὴν μίξιν ἐν ἑκάστῃ μοίρᾳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D5","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς μετατρέπει τὴν μικτὴν οὐσίαν εἰς ἱεραρχημένην πολλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D6","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἀριθμητικὴ τάξις συγκροτεῖται διὰ σχέσεων πολλαπλασιασμοῦ καὶ ἡμιολίας, οὐ διὰ ἴσων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης παράγεται διὰ τριπλῆς μεσολαβήσεως: ὑλικῆς μίξεως, βιαίας συναρμογῆς καὶ ἀριθμητικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία ἀποτελεῖ τὸ μέσον δι’ οὗ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ διαφορά μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD3","text":"Ἡ πολλότης δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἑνότητα, ἐπειδὴ ἑκάστη διαφορά περιέχει τὴν αὐτὴν τριαδικὴν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD4","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ ὅλου ἔχει συγχρόνως ὀντολογικὸν καὶ μαθηματικὸν χαρακτῆρα· τὸ ὂν καὶ ὁ λόγος τῆς διαιρέσεως συμπίπτουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","text":"Ἡ κοσμογένεσις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἐπιβολὴ μορφῆς ἐπὶ στοιχείων ἃ καθ’ ἑαυτὰ δυσχερῶς συνάπτονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ ὂν ἔχει μίαν μόνον ὀντολογικὴν βαθμίδα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ διαφορά δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ χωρὶς σχέσιν πρὸς ἑνοποιητικὸν μέσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ ἐκπηγάζει αὐτομάτως ἐκ τῆς ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ διαίρεσις ἀποσπᾷ τὰ μέρη ἀπὸ τὸ ὅλον ἢ ἀπὸ τὴν κοινὴν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ μαθηματικὴ τάξις εἶναι ἐξωτερικὸς στολισμὸς ἐπὶ ἤδη τετελεσμένου ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἑνότητος ἄνευ μεσότητος, βίας καὶ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX2","text":"Ἀποσιωπᾶται ἡ δυνατότης ἑτέρας σχέσεως μεταξὺ ἀμεροῦς καὶ μεριστοῦ παρὰ τὴν τριαδικὴν μίξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἀταξία τῆς ἑτερότητος δὲν ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς αὐτόνομος κόσμος, ἀλλὰ μόνον ὡς ὕλη πρὸς συναρμογήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","text":"Ἀδύνατον καθίσταται σύμπαν ὃ ἔχει μόνον ἐνότητα ἢ μόνον διαφοράν· ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ἀλήθεια ἐγκλείεται ἐν τῇ ἀναγκαστῇ συνθέσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS1","text":"Ἀμέριστος οὐσία + μεριστὴ οὐσία → ἀνάγκη τρίτου μεσολαβητικοῦ εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS2","text":"Ταὐτόν + ἕτερον + οὐσία → μία μικτὴ ἰδέα διὰ βιαίας συναρμογῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS3","text":"Μικτὴ ἰδέα → ὅλον διαιρετόν εἰς μοίρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS4","text":"Ὅλον → μοῖραι, ἑκάστη ἐκ τῶν αὐτῶν τριῶν γενῶν μεμειγμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS5","text":"Μοῖραι → ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS6","text":"Ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι → ἱεραρχημένη τάξις πολλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS7","text":"Ἱεραρχημένη πολλότης → ἑνότης ἣ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","text":"Ἀντίθεσις ἀμερίστου καὶ μεριστοῦ → εὕρεσις τρίτου γένους → μίξις ταὐτοῦ, ἑτέρου καὶ οὐσίας → βιαία συναρμογή → διαίρεσις τοῦ ὅλου → ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία → κοσμικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2","text":"Ἀσυμβατότης → μεσότης → ἑνότης → διατήρησις τῆς διαφορᾶς → μετρητὴ πολλότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀρχικὴν ταυτότητα εἰς παραγόμενη σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","text":"Ἡ διαφορά ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀντίθετον τῆς τάξεως εἰς ἀναγκαῖον συστατικὸν τῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME3","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ διάλυσιν τοῦ ὅλου εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἀνάπτυξιν τῆς μικτῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME4","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ μέτρον ποσοτήτων εἰς γενετικὸν μηχανισμὸν κοσμικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀποδεσμεύεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλότητα καὶ συνδέεται μὲ τὴν ἐλεγχόμενην ἑτερογένειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT1","text":"**Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον:** Περιγράφεται ἡ ἀνάμειξις τριῶν γενῶν καὶ ἡ διαίρεσις αὐτῶν εἰς ἀριθμητικὰς μοίρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT2","text":"**Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον:** Ἡ κοσμικὴ σύστασις ἀπαιτεῖ μεσότητα, ἀναγκαστικὴν συναρμογὴν καὶ διατήρησιν τῆς μικτῆς φύσεως ἐν τοῖς μέρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","text":"**Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον:** Ἡ ἀντίθεσις δὲν λύεται διὰ ἀποκλεισμοῦ ἑνὸς πόλου, ἀλλὰ διὰ μετατροπῆς αὐτῆς εἰς ἀναλογικῶς ῥυθμισμένην σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT4","text":"**Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον:** Τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς γιγνόμενον ἐκ διαδοχικῆς συγκράσεως καὶ διαιρέσεως, ὄχι ὡς ἀκίνητος ἁπλότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς ἀμερισίας, τῆς μεριστότητος, τῆς ταυτότητος, τῆς ἑτερότητος καὶ τῆς μεσότητος ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη βιαίας συναρμογῆς ἐξηγεῖ τὴν παραγωγὴν τῆς ἑνότητος ἐκ ἀνομοίων ἀρχῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ διαίρεσις ἐξηγεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὸ ἓν μικτὸν ὅλον εἰς ἱεραρχημένην πολλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ λογικὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαίρεσις δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν κοινὴν μίξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἐκκρεμότης ἔγκειται ἐν τῇ συνυπάρξει βιαίας συναρμογῆς καὶ ἀκριβοῦς ἀναλογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν νοηθῇ ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης ὡς ἐπιτελεσθεῖσα σύνθεσις καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς προϋπάρχουσα ἁπλότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230257256232Z_cc089e68","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 35","source_sha256":"3b35843edc775874604f9c16d5f5d70413e5f4ab40ae6fa731961290b72b7b27","sha256":"44ce66a8375c30e6c2523893f53c9d0bfeb581b45e7d4d1363ce4671118f2348","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:02:57.257400+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS1","text":"The problem consists in joining indivisible essence to the divisible essence found among bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS2","text":"The solution requires a third essence, composed from the nature of the Same and that of the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS3","text":"The incommensurate difference is forcibly fitted together into one, through mediation and mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS4","text":"The one whole composed from the three is divided into portions, each of which contains the Same, the Different, and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AS5","text":"The division follows an arithmetical order, so that the composition from many may receive a measurable proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","text":"There is an indivisible essence, always remaining in the same condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A2","text":"There is a divisible essence arising among bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A3","text":"The nature of the Same and the nature of the Different belong to the constitution of the mixed essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A4","text":"A third kind of essence is posited between the indivisible and that which is divisible among bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","text":"The nature of the Different is difficult to mix and is not fitted together into the Same without force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A6","text":"The three kinds can be composed into one form through mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","text":"The one mixed whole can be divided into fitting portions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A8","text":"Each portion is mixed from the Same, the Different, and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","text":"The division of the portions is determined through arithmetical ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:A10","text":"The sequence of the first portions is the unit, the double, the sesquialter of the second, and the triple of the first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX1","text":"Cosmic constitution proceeds neither from the indivisible alone nor from the divisible alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX2","text":"The Same and the Different are not originally simply united.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX3","text":"Difference does not of itself constitute itself into a harmonious unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX4","text":"Unity does not appear as an immediate identity of the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX5","text":"Division is not a disorderly fragmentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:NX6","text":"No portion is posited as unmixed from only one kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D1","text":"The presence of a third essence makes possible the transition from indivisibility to bodily divisibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","CH_JP8E_S_17:A2","CH_JP8E_S_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D2","text":"The unity of the whole depends upon the mixture of dissimilar kinds, not upon the removal of difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A3","CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D3","text":"The force of the fitting-together signifies that unity is a produced work and not a given natural condition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","text":"The division of the whole preserves the original mixture in each portion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D5","text":"Number transforms the mixed essence into a hierarchized multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:D6","text":"The first arithmetical order is constituted through relations of multiplication and sesquialtery, not through equal parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","text":"Cosmic unity is produced through a triple mediation: material mixture, forcible fitting-together, and arithmetical arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","text":"Proportion constitutes the means through which ontological difference is transformed into cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD3","text":"Multiplicity does not remove unity, because each difference contains the same triadic constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD4","text":"The order of the whole has simultaneously an ontological and a mathematical character; being and the ratio of division coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","text":"Cosmogony appears as the imposition of form upon elements that are, in themselves, difficult to join together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that being has only one ontological level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that difference can be conceived without relation to a unifying means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that form springs automatically from matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that division detaches the parts from the whole or from the common constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that mathematical order is an external ornament upon an already completed being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX1","text":"The possibility of unity without mediation, force, and ratio is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX2","text":"The possibility of another relation between the indivisible and the divisible besides the triadic mixture is left unspoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX3","text":"The original disorder of difference is not recognized as an autonomous cosmos, but only as material for fitting together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","text":"A universe having only unity or only difference becomes impossible; ontological truth is enclosed within the compelled composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS1","text":"Indivisible essence + divisible essence → necessity of a third mediating kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS2","text":"Same + Different + essence → one mixed form through forcible fitting-together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS3","text":"Mixed form → a whole divisible into portions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS4","text":"Whole → portions, each mixed from the same three kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS5","text":"Portions → arithmetical ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS6","text":"Arithmetical ratios → hierarchized order of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS7","text":"Hierarchized multiplicity → unity that preserves internal difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","text":"Opposition of indivisible and divisible → discovery of a third kind → mixture of Same, Different, and essence → forcible fitting-together → division of the whole → arithmetical proportion → cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2","text":"Incompatibility → mediation → unity → preservation of difference → measurable multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1","text":"Unity is reclassified from original identity into produced composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","text":"Difference is reclassified from the opposite of order into a necessary constituent of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME3","text":"Division is reclassified from dissolution of the whole into an internal development of mixed unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME4","text":"Number is reclassified from a measure of quantities into a generative mechanism of cosmic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","text":"Cosmic order is detached from simplicity and linked with controlled heterogeneity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT1","text":"**Surface level:** The mixing of three kinds and their division into arithmetical portions are described.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT2","text":"**Structural level:** Cosmic constitution requires mediation, compulsory fitting-together, and preservation of the mixed nature in the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Opposition is not resolved through the exclusion of one pole, but through its transformation into a proportionally regulated composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT4","text":"**Ontological and temporal level:** Being is conceived as coming to be through successive blending and division, not as immobile simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT1","text":"The principles of indivisibility, divisibility, identity, difference, and mediation suffice for reconstructing the basic argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT2","text":"The necessity of forcible fitting-together explains the production of unity from dissimilar principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT3","text":"Arithmetical division explains the transition from the one mixed whole to hierarchized multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT4","text":"The internal logic is coherent, because division does not remove the common mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","text":"The principal unresolved issue lies in the coexistence of forcible fitting-together and exact proportional order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument if cosmic unity is conceived as an accomplished composition and not as pre-existing simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_17@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_17:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 35"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 19","title":"Section 35","context":"Chapter 19","original_title":"Section 35","original_context":"Chapter 19"},"original_title":"Section 35","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18","layer":"CH","title":"Section 36","order":20,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_18"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_18@R001","sha256":"6b4f367f704cc0c2ede492dea68a27924f0c4f213c8632f416bfa1e217e81268","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ διὰ μαθηματικῶν λόγων καὶ μεσοτήτων συγκροτεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS2","text":"Ἐκ τῶν διπλασίων καὶ τριπλασίων διαστημάτων παράγονται δύο εἴδη μεσότητος, τὸ ἀναλογικόν τε καὶ τὸ ἁρμονικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ σύνθεσις ἐκτείνεται εἰς ἁρμονικὴν τάξιν, ἣν ὁ δεσμὸς τῶν λόγων ἐνοποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἑνωμένη σύστασις σχίζεται, κάμπτεται καὶ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς δύο κυκλικὰς κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS5","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ ὑπερέχει τῆς κινήσεως τοῦ θατέρου, ἡ δὲ ἐντὸς διαίρεσις παράγει ἑπτὰ ἀνομοίους κύκλους κατὰ λόγους τεταγμένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ νοῦν συνεστήθη, τὸ σωματοειδὲς ἐντὸς αὐτῆς τεκταίνεται καὶ ὁ χρόνος ἀρχίζει ὡς ἀπαύστου ἐμφρόνου βίου κύκλος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ συγκροτεῖται ἐκ μαθηματικῶν διαστημάτων καὶ λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A2","text":"Τὰ διπλάσια καὶ τριπλάσια διαστήματα δύνανται νὰ πληρωθοῦν διὰ μεσοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ μέσοτης ἴσῳ ἀριθμῷ διαφέρει ἀπὸ τῶν ἄκρων καὶ ὑπερέχει αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A4","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονικὴ μέσοτης ἴσῳ λόγῳ διαφέρει καὶ ὑπερέχει τῶν ἄκρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","text":"Οἱ μαθηματικοὶ λόγοι συνδέουσι τὰ διπλάσια, τριπλάσια, ἡμιόλια, ἐπίτριτα καὶ ἐπόγδοα διαστήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑπολειπομένη διαφορὰ ἔχει ἀριθμητικὸν λόγον 256 πρὸς 243.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","text":"Ἡ ὅλη σύστασις τῆς ψυχῆς διαιρετὴ καὶ κυκλικῶς μετασχηματιστή ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A8","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ἡ φύσις τοῦ θατέρου ἐκφράζονται διὰ διακεκριμένων κυκλικῶν φορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","text":"Ἡ φορὰ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ ἔχει κυριώτερον κράτος καὶ μένει ἄσχιστος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","text":"Ἡ φορὰ τοῦ θατέρου διαιρεῖται εἰς ἑπτὰ κύκλους, οἳ κινοῦνται ἀντιθέτως καὶ κατὰ ἀναλογίας ταχύτητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A11","text":"Τὸ σωματοειδὲς ἐντὸς τῆς ψυχῆς τεκταίνεται καὶ προσαρμόζεται πρὸς τὸ μέσον αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις τῆς ψυχῆς ἀποτελεῖ ἀρχὴν χρόνου καὶ ἐμφρόνου ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἀσύνδετος ἢ ἄλογος σύστασίς ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX2","text":"Τὰ διαστήματα οὐ πληροῦνται ἀτάκτως, ἀλλὰ διὰ καθωρισμένων μεσοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία οὐ ταὐτίζεται μόνον πρὸς ἀριθμητικὴν ἰσότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX4","text":"Τὸ ὑπολειπόμενον μόριον οὐκ ἀφίεται ἄλογον ἢ ἀμέτρητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX5","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐ μία ἄκριτος φορά ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX6","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ οὐκ ἔχει τὴν αὐτὴν τάξιν μὲ τὴν φύσιν τοῦ θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX7","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐ προϋπάρχει τῆς ψυχικῆς κυκλικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX8","text":"Τὸ σωματοειδὲς οὐκ ἔξωθεν ἀσύνδετον ἐπιτίθεται τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ γίνεται ἁρμονικὸν συνεχὲς ἐπειδὴ τὰ διαστήματα συνδέονται διὰ δύο διακεκριμένων μεσοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A2","CH_JP8E_S_18:A3","CH_JP8E_S_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D2","text":"Ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἀκρίβεια διατηρεῖται καὶ ἐν τῷ ὑπολείμματι, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαφορὰ ἀποδίδοται εἰς λόγον 256:243.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D3","text":"Ἡ ἐνιαία ψυχικὴ σύστασις δύναται νὰ μετασχηματισθῇ εἰς δομὴν κινήσεων χωρὶς νὰ χάσῃ τὴν ἑνότητά της.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου ἐγγράφεται ὡς διάκρισις ἐξωτερικῆς καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς φορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D5","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ ἐγγυᾶται τὴν πρωτεύουσαν ἑνότητα τῆς κοσμικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","text":"Οἱ ἑπτὰ ἐσωτερικοὶ κύκλοι παράγουσι διαφοροποιημένην τάξιν κινήσεων ὑπὸ κοινὸν λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D7","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὡς σωματοειδὴς τάξις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ προϋπάρχουσαν ψυχικὴν ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καθίσταται ἐνεργὸς ρυθμὸς ζωῆς διὰ τῆς ἀπαύστου κυκλικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀναδύεται ὡς μετάβασις ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν ἀναλογίαν εἰς ἐνσώματον κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A1","CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου δὲν καταργεῖ τὴν διαφοράν, ἀλλὰ τὴν ἐντάσσει εἰς ἱεραρχημένον σύστημα κυκλικῶν λόγων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A8","CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς δεσμὸς μεταξὺ ἀδιαιρέτου ἑνότητος, διαιρετῆς πολλότητος καὶ σωματικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος παράγεται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ συνέπεια τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνεξάρτητον πλαίσιον τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἐμφροσύνη τοῦ βίου ἐρείδεται εἰς τὴν ἀναλογικὴν ἐπανάληψιν τῶν κυκλικῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐ θεμελιοῦται εἰς ἀσύνδετα ἔσχατα στοιχεῖα, ἀλλὰ εἰς σχέσεις λόγου καὶ μεσότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις τοῦ κόσμου οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀρχίσῃ ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα ὡς πρωταρχικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX3","text":"Ἡ πολλότης οὐκ ἔχει αὐτοτελῆ τάξιν ἄνευ ἐνοποιούσης κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ διαφορά οὐ σημαίνει ἀπουσία κοινοῦ μέτρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐ νοεῖται ὡς νεκρὸν δοχεῖον, ἀλλὰ ὡς ζῶσα ἀκολουθία κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ ὕλη προηγείται τῆς ψυχικῆς καὶ νοητῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἑνότης ἄνευ ἱεραρχίας, ἀναλογίας καὶ διαφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται χρόνος χωρὶς ἐπαναλαμβανομένην κυκλικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως εἰς ἁπλὴν παράθεσιν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS1","text":"Διπλάσια καὶ τριπλάσια διαστήματα → ἀριθμητικὴ καὶ ἁρμονικὴ μέσοτης → συμπλήρωσις τῶν διαστημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS2","text":"Ἁρμονικοὶ δεσμοί → ἐπόγδοοι καὶ ἐπίτριτοι λόγοι → ὑπόλοιπον 256:243 → πλήρης κατανάλωσις τοῦ μειχθέντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS3","text":"Ἑνιαία σύστασις → σχίσις κατὰ μῆκος → κάμψις εἰς κύκλους → ἐξωτερικὴ καὶ ἐσωτερικὴ φορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS4","text":"Φύσις ταὐτοῦ → ἄσχιστος ἐξωτερικὴ κίνησις → πρωτεύουσα ἑνότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5","text":"Φύσις θατέρου → ἑξαπλῆς διαίρεσις → ἑπτὰ ἄνισοι κύκλοι → διαφοροποιημέναι κινήσεις κατὰ λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","text":"Συγκρότησις ψυχῆς → ἐνσωμάτωσις τοῦ σωματοειδοῦς → περιβολὴ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ → ἀπαύστου ἐμφρόνου χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","text":"Ἀριθμητικὸν διάστημα → μεσότης → ἁρμονικὸς δεσμός → ἐνιαία ψυχὴ → διπλῆ κυκλικὴ φορά → ἱεραρχημένοι ἑπτὰ κύκλοι → ἐνσωμάτωσις → χρόνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ τάξις μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀφηρημένον μέτρον εἰς κοσμογονικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς μηχανισμὸς μετασχηματίζων λόγους εἰς κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης καὶ ἡ διαφορά παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀντίθετα καὶ γίνονται δύο ἐπίπεδα τῆς αὐτῆς κυκλικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME4","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀνακατατάσσεται ὡς ἐσωτερικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα ψυχικῆς ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME5","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναφαίνεται ὡς μετρητὴ καὶ ἐνεργὸς μορφὴ τῆς κοσμικῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, περιγράφεται ἡ διαίρεσις διαστημάτων, ἡ σύνδεσις κύκλων καὶ ἡ γένεσις χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἀναλογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν κινήσεων καὶ σωματικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὰ ἀποτελέσματα εἰς τὸ σύστημα σχέσεων ὃ τὰ παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ εἶναι νοεῖται ὡς ἔμψυχος, ἀναλογικὴ καὶ κυκλικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι, αἱ δύο μεσότητες, ἡ διάκρισις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου καὶ ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT2","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχικὴν σύνθεσιν εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν κατασκευήν διατηρεῖται ὡς κεντρικὴ γενετικὴ ἀκολουθία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς λειτουργία τοῦ 256:243 καὶ ἡ λεπτομερὴς τάξις τῶν ἑπτὰ κύκλων μένει μερικῶς ὑποκαθορισμένη ἐν τῇ συμπιέσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική ἐφʼ ὅσον ἡ ψυχὴ τίθεται ὡς ἀρχὴ λόγου, κινήσεως καὶ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν ὅτι ἡ σωματικὴ τάξις παράγεται ἐκ προγενεστέρας ψυχικῆς ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230317379227Z_acd60b05","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 36","source_sha256":"6b4f367f704cc0c2ede492dea68a27924f0c4f213c8632f416bfa1e217e81268","sha256":"4d953649904461ae084c2a4a32a2264c0010b4647a8e1504fc3a546fb638e77e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:03:17.380360+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS1","text":"The soul is constituted through mathematical ratios and means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS2","text":"From double and triple intervals are produced two kinds of mean, the proportional and the harmonic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","text":"The numerical composition extends into harmonic order, which the bond of ratios unifies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS4","text":"The unified composition is split, bent, and transformed into two circular motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS5","text":"The motion of the Same prevails over the motion of the Different, while the internal division produces seven dissimilar circles according to ordered ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AS6","text":"Since the soul was constituted according to intellect, the corporeal is fashioned within it, and time begins as the circle of unceasing intelligent life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A1","text":"The soul is constituted from mathematical intervals and ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A2","text":"Double and triple intervals can be filled by means of means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A3","text":"The arithmetic mean differs from the extremes by an equal number and exceeds them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A4","text":"The harmonic mean differs from and exceeds the extremes by an equal ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","text":"Mathematical ratios connect the double, triple, sesquialter, sesquitertian, and sesquioctave intervals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","text":"The remaining difference has the numerical ratio 256 to 243.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","text":"The entire composition of the soul is divisible and transformable into circles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A8","text":"The nature of the Same and the nature of the Different are expressed through distinct circular revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","text":"The revolution of the Same has greater mastery and remains unsplit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","text":"The revolution of the Different is divided into seven circles, which move oppositely and according to proportions of speed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A11","text":"The corporeal is fashioned within the soul and fitted to its middle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","text":"The circular motion of the soul constitutes the beginning of time and intelligent life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX1","text":"The soul is not an unconnected or irrational composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX2","text":"The intervals are not filled disorderly, but through determinate means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX3","text":"Harmony is not identified merely with numerical equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX4","text":"The remaining portion is not left irrational or unmeasured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX5","text":"Motion is not one undifferentiated revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX6","text":"The nature of the Same does not have the same order as the nature of the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX7","text":"Time does not preexist the psychic circular motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:NX8","text":"The corporeal is not imposed upon the soul from without as something unconnected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D1","text":"The soul becomes a harmonic continuum because the intervals are connected through two distinct means.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A2","CH_JP8E_S_18:A3","CH_JP8E_S_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D2","text":"Mathematical precision is preserved even in the remainder, because the difference is rendered as the ratio 256:243.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D3","text":"The unified psychic composition can be transformed into a structure of motions without losing its unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D4","text":"The distinction of Same and Different is inscribed as the distinction between external and internal revolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D5","text":"The predominance of the Same guarantees the primary unity of cosmic motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","text":"The seven internal circles produce a differentiated order of motions under a common ratio.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D7","text":"The cosmos as corporeal order depends on a preexisting psychic proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","text":"Time becomes an active rhythm of life through unceasing circular motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","text":"Cosmic order emerges as a transition from numerical proportion to embodied motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A1","CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","text":"The unity of the cosmos does not abolish difference, but incorporates it into a hierarchized system of circular ratios.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A8","CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","text":"Proportion functions as a bond between indivisible unity, divisible multiplicity, and corporeal order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4","text":"Time is produced as an internal consequence of the soul and not as an independent framework of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5","text":"The intelligence of life rests upon the proportional repetition of circular motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX1","text":"Reality is founded not on unconnected ultimate elements, but on relations of ratio and mean.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","text":"The explanation of the cosmos cannot begin from body as a primary principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX3","text":"Multiplicity has no self-subsisting order without a unifying motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4","text":"Internal difference does not signify the absence of a common measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","text":"Time is not conceived as a dead receptacle, but as a living sequence of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX1","text":"A cosmos in which matter precedes psychic and intelligible order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX2","text":"Unity without hierarchy, proportion, and difference is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","text":"Time without recurrent circular activity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX4","text":"The reduction of cosmic order to a mere juxtaposition of bodies is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS1","text":"Double and triple intervals → arithmetic and harmonic mean → completion of the intervals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS2","text":"Harmonic bonds → sesquioctave and sesquitertian ratios → remainder 256:243 → complete consumption of what has been mixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS3","text":"Unified composition → splitting lengthwise → bending into circles → external and internal revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS4","text":"Nature of the Same → unsplit external motion → primary unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5","text":"Nature of the Different → sixfold division → seven unequal circles → differentiated motions according to ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","text":"Constitution of the soul → embodiment of the corporeal → encompassing of the heaven → unceasing intelligent time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","text":"Numerical interval → mean → harmonic bond → unified soul → double circular revolution → hierarchized seven circles → embodiment → time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1","text":"Numerical order is transferred from an abstract measure into a cosmogonic power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","text":"The soul is reclassified as a mechanism transforming ratios into motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","text":"Unity and difference cease to be opposites and become two levels of the same circular order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME4","text":"The body is reclassified as an internal result of psychic proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ME5","text":"Time appears as a measuring and active form of the cosmic soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the division of intervals, the connection of circles, and the generation of time are described.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, mathematical proportion is transformed into a hierarchy of motions and corporeal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, explanation passes from the results to the system of relations that produces them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, being is conceived as an ensouled, proportional, and circular order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT1","text":"The numerical ratios, the two means, the distinction of Same and Different, and circular motion suffice for reconstruction of the basic argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT2","text":"The transition from psychic composition to corporeal construction is preserved as a central generative sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","text":"The precise function of 256:243 and the detailed order of the seven circles remain partially underdetermined in the compression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the soul is posited as the principle of ratio, motion, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but depends upon accepting that corporeal order is produced from a prior psychic proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_18@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_18:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 36"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 20","title":"Section 36","context":"Chapter 20","original_title":"Section 36","original_context":"Chapter 20"},"original_title":"Section 36","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19","layer":"CH","title":"Section 37","order":21,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_19"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_19@R001","sha256":"676bc14c3896b78f0e9ad9062ea94beb5c3c54e54d5e61c50d899201811c3c25","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ σύστασις τοῦ ὁρατοῦ κόσμου ὡς γεννητοῦ ἀλλὰ ζῶντος καὶ νοῦ μετέχοντος ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς ἐξηγήσεως μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, ἣ διὰ κινήσεως ἑαυτῆς συνδέει τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ θάτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS3","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῆς ψυχῆς παράγει διακεκριμένα γνωστικὰ ἀποτελέσματα κατὰ τὸ αἰσθητὸν καὶ τὸ λογιστικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS4","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὁρίζεται ὡς εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου ζῴου, ἐπειδὴ τὸ γεννητὸν οὐ δύναται αὐτὸ τὸ ἀΐδιον εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS5","text":"Ὁ χρόνος παράγεται ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος διὰ τῆς κοσμικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS6","text":"Ἡ διάκριση τοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ τοῦ γεννητοῦ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀποδέσμευσιν τῶν χρονικῶν μορφῶν ἀπὸ τῆς ἀϊδίου οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα τοῦ οὐρανοῦ ὁρατόν ἐστι καὶ γεγονός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀόρατός ἐστι, λογισμοῦ καὶ ἁρμονίας μετέχει, καὶ ἀρίστη γίνεται τῶν γεννηθέντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ συνίσταται ἐκ τῆς φύσεως τοῦ ταὐτοῦ, τοῦ θατέρου καὶ τῆς οὐσίας, κατὰ λόγον μερισθεῖσα καὶ συνδεθεῖσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ διὰ τῆς αὐτῆς κινήσεως ἀνακυκλοῦσα διακρίνει τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","text":"Ὁ ἀληθὴς λόγος ἐν τῇ κινήσει τῆς ψυχῆς γιγνόμενος ἀποτελεῖ τὰς γνωστικὰς κρίσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","text":"Περὶ τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὁ λόγος γενόμενος παράγει δόξας καὶ πίστεις βεβαίας καὶ ἀληθεῖς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A7","text":"Περὶ τὸ λογιστικὸν ὁ λόγος γενόμενος παράγει νοῦν καὶ ἐπιστήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ἐστὶ ζῷον ἔμψυχον καὶ νοήμον, γεγονὸς ὡς ἄγαλμα τῶν ἀϊδίων θεῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","text":"Τὸ γεννητὸν οὐ δύναται παντελῶς ταὐτὸν εἶναι τῷ ἀϊδίῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἐστὶ κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος, ἅμα τῷ οὐρανῷ διακοσμηθείς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A11","text":"Ἡμέραι, νύκτες, μῆνες καὶ ἐνιαυτοὶ συνίστανται ἅμα τῷ οὐρανῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A12","text":"Τὸ ἦν καὶ τὸ ἔσται εἴδη χρόνου ἐστίν, οὐκ ἀκριβῶς κατηγορητέα τῆς ἀϊδίου οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔστι σῶμα ὁρατόν, ἀλλὰ ἀόρατος καὶ λογιστικὴ ἀρχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῆ ἀμιγής μονάς, ἀλλὰ σύγκρασις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ, τοῦ θατέρου καὶ τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3","text":"Ἡ γνῶσις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀκίνητος ἀποθήκευσις, ἀλλὰ λόγος κινούμενος ἐν ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX4","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτομάτως νοῦν καὶ ἐπιστήμην, ἀλλὰ δόξαν καὶ πίστιν ὅταν ὁ περὶ αὐτὸ λόγος κινηθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","text":"Ὁ γεννητὸς κόσμος οὐκ ἔστι τὸ ἀΐδιον ζῷον αὐτό, ἀλλὰ εἰκὼν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX6","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἦν πρὸ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ ὡς αὐθύπαρκτος τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX7","text":"Τὸ ἦν καὶ τὸ ἔσται οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀΐδια εἴδη τῆς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχὴ ἐκ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ τοῦ θατέρου συνεκράθη καὶ κατὰ λόγον ἐμερίσθη, δύναται ἑκάστου πρὸς ἕκαστον σχέσιν καὶ πάθος διαγινώσκειν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἐν τῇ αὐτοκινησίᾳ τῆς ψυχῆς γίγνεται, ἡ γνῶσις ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ ἐσωτερικῇ κυκλήσει τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ τοῦ θατέρου κύκλος ἀναγγέλλει τὸ αἰσθητόν, ἡ αἴσθησις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς βεβαίαν δόξαν καὶ πίστιν διὰ τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ κύκλος ὀρθῶς φέρεται περὶ τὸ λογιστικόν, ἡ ψυχικὴ κίνησις τελειοῦται εἰς νοῦν καὶ ἐπιστήμην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ κόσμος ἐστὶν εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου ζῴου, ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις μιμεῖται τὴν ἀϊδιότητα χωρὶς νὰ ταὐτίζηται αὐτῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ γεννητὸν οὐ δύναται προσάψασθαι παντελῶς τῷ ἀϊδίῳ, ὁ χρόνος ἀντιπροσωπεύει τὸν αἰῶνα ὡς κινητὴ εἰκών.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ χρόνος συνίσταται ἅμα τῷ οὐρανῷ, αἱ χρονικαὶ διαιρέσεις ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D8","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἦν καὶ τὸ ἔσται εἴδη χρόνου εἰσίν, ἡ προβολὴ αὐτῶν ἐπὶ τὴν ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν συγχέει τὸ γίγνεσθαι μετὰ τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A11","CH_JP8E_S_19:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ καθίσταται ἡ μεσότης ἣ μετατρέπει τὴν κοσμικὴν ὕλην εἰς γνωρίσιμον τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ αἰσθητοῦ καὶ νοητοῦ δὲν ἀποτελεῖ χωρισμὸν δύο ἀσυνδέτων κόσμων, ἀλλὰ δύο τρόπους κινήσεως τοῦ λόγου ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος διατηρεῖ τὴν ὁμοιότητα πρὸς τὸ ἀΐδιον μόνον διὰ μιμητικῆς χρονικῆς τάξεως, οὐ διὰ κυριολεκτικῆς ταὐτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀποτελεῖ κοσμολογικὴν μηχανὴν ἐμφανίσεως τῆς ἀϊδιότητος ἐν τῷ γεννητῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἐσφαλμένη κατηγορία τοῦ ἦν καὶ τοῦ ἔσται ἐπὶ τῆς ἀϊδίου οὐσίας ἐπιφέρει ὀντολογικὴν σύγχυσιν μεταξὺ χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς καὶ ἀχρόνου εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια δὲν προϋπάρχει τῆς ψυχῆς ὡς ἀσύνδετος ἀντικειμενικὴ κατοχή, ἀλλὰ ἀποτελεῖται διὰ τῆς ψυχικῆς κινήσεως τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2","text":"Ἡ γνώσις δὲν παράγεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν παρουσίαν τῶν πραγμάτων, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνεργὸν διάκρισιν ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἀναπαραγωγὴ τοῦ ἀϊδίου δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν διαφορὰν μεταξὺ παραδείγματος καὶ εἰκόνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4","text":"Ἡ χρονικότης δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξάρτητον περιέχον, ἀλλὰ παράγωγον τῆς διακοσμήσεως τοῦ οὐρανοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀΐδιος οὐσία δὲν ὑπόκειται εἰς γένεσιν, διαδοχήν, παρελθὸν ἢ μέλλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὁμοίως ὑλικὸς καὶ ἄψυχος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κοσμικὴ ὁμοιότης πρὸς τὸ ἀΐδιον προϋποθέτει ψυχὴν καὶ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἀΐδιος χρόνος ὡς τρίτον τι παρὰ τὸν αἰῶνα καὶ τὸ γεννητόν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ χρόνος ἐστὶν εἰκὼν ἐν κινήσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταὐτότης εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος· ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δύναται μόνον μιμεῖσθαι τὸ ἀΐδιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὀντολογία ἣ ἀναγνωρίζει τὸ παρελθὸν καὶ τὸ μέλλον ὡς ἀνεξάρτητα συστατικὰ τοῦ ἀϊδίου εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1","text":"Ἀΐδιον παράδειγμα → γεννητὸς οὐρανὸς → ἔμψυχος κοσμικὴ σύστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2","text":"Ταὐτόν + θάτερον + οὐσία → λόγος καὶ ἁρμονία → αὐτοκίνητος ψυχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS3","text":"Κίνησις ψυχῆς περὶ τὸ αἰσθητόν → δόξα καὶ πίστις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS4","text":"Κίνησις ψυχῆς περὶ τὸ λογιστικόν → νοῦς καὶ ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","text":"Ἀδυναμία τοῦ γεννητοῦ νὰ εἶναι αὐτὸ τὸ ἀΐδιον → εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6","text":"Κοσμικὴ διακόσμησις → οὐρανὸς + χρονικαὶ διαιρέσεις → κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS7","text":"Σύγχυσις χρόνου καὶ αἰῶνος → ἐσφαλμένη κατηγορία τοῦ ἦν καὶ τοῦ ἔσται ἐπὶ τῆς ἀϊδίου οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF1","text":"Γεννητὸς ὁρατὸς κόσμος → ἀνάγκη ψυχικῆς ἀρχῆς → σύστασις ψυχῆς ἐκ ταὐτοῦ, θατέρου καὶ οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","text":"Σύστασις ψυχῆς → αὐτοκίνητος κύκλος → διάκρισις ταὐτοῦ καὶ ἑτέρου → ἀληθὴς λόγος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3","text":"Ἀληθὴς λόγος → αἰσθητὸν / λογιστικόν → δόξα καὶ πίστις / νοῦς καὶ ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF4","text":"Ἔμψυχος νοήμων κόσμος → εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου ζῴου → διάκριση παραδείγματος καὶ γεννητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF5","text":"Ἀδυναμία ταὐτοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ γεννητοῦ → χρόνος ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν αἰῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF6","text":"Χρόνος → ἡμέρα, νύξ, μήν, ἐνιαυτός → διόρθωσις τῆς χρονικῆς προβολῆς ἐπὶ τὴν ἀΐδιον οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ περιθωριακὸς φορεὺς ζωῆς εἰς κοσμολογικὸν μηχανισμὸν διακρίσεως καὶ γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκριση αἰσθητοῦ καὶ νοητοῦ ἀνασυντάσσεται ὡς διαφορά δύο γνωστικῶν λειτουργιῶν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐθύπαρκτον πλαίσιον εἰς παράγωγον εἰκόνα τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME4","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ταυτοχρόνως σῶμα, ζῷον, νοητικὴ τάξις καὶ μέτρον χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME5","text":"Ἡ γλώσσα τοῦ παρελθόντος καὶ τοῦ μέλλοντος περιορίζεται στὸ γεννητὸν καὶ ἀφαιρεῖται ἀπὸ τὸ ἀΐδιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ὁ οὐρανὸς καὶ ὁ χρόνος ἐξηγοῦνται ὡς γεγονότα τῆς κοσμικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ ψυχὴ συνδέει σωματικὴν διακόσμησιν, λογικὴν διάκρισιν καὶ γνωστικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ἀνάλυσις ἀπαιτεῖ νὰ διακρίνεται ἡ εἰκὼν ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα καὶ ἡ χρονικὴ μίμησις ἀπὸ τὴν ἀΐδιον πραγματικότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ ἀΐδιον ὑφίσταται ἄνευ χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς, ἐνῷ τὸ γεννητὸν ὑφίσταται διὰ κινήσεως, χρόνου καὶ εἰκονικῆς ὁμοιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀκολουθίας ἀπὸ τὸ ἀΐδιον παράδειγμα εἰς τὸν γεννητὸν κόσμον καὶ τὸν χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT2","text":"Ἡ σύστασις τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ οἱ δύο κύκλοι αὐτῆς ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀναγωγὴν τῶν γνωστικῶν ἀποτελεσμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ σύνδεσις μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς ψυχῆς καὶ χρονικῆς διακοσμήσεως παραμένει ἐν μέρει ἐλλειπτικὴ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","text":"Ἡ διάκριση αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν μεταφορὰν τῆς εἰκόνος καὶ τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5","text":"Τὸ κύριον ἀνεπίλυτον σημεῖον ἐστὶν ὅτι ὁ χρόνος, ὡς εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος, ἀπαιτεῖ ὁμοιότητα πρὸς ἐκεῖνο ὃ κατὰ τὸν ὁρισμὸν οὐ δύναται νὰ περιλάβῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος, ἐὰν ἡ ψυχὴ νοηθῇ ὡς μεσολαβητικὴ τάξις μεταξὺ ἀϊδίου παραδείγματος καὶ γεννητῆς εἰκόνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230340333017Z_68e42d02","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 37","source_sha256":"676bc14c3896b78f0e9ad9062ea94beb5c3c54e54d5e61c50d899201811c3c25","sha256":"d384bcf54e81502eb4e7542ec5bef72f6b6d96e07e52e8f66f694e84909bf265","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:03:40.337849+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS1","text":"The problem is the constitution of the visible cosmos as generated, yet living and partaking of intellect, as a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS2","text":"The starting point of explanation is shifted from body to soul, which through its own motion connects the Same and the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS3","text":"The order of the soul produces distinct cognitive results with respect to the sensible and the rational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS4","text":"The cosmos is defined as an image of the eternal living creature, since what is generated cannot itself be eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS5","text":"Time is produced as a moving image of eternity through cosmic motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AS6","text":"The distinction between the eternal and the generated requires the disengagement of temporal forms from eternal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A1","text":"The body of heaven is visible and has come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A2","text":"The soul is invisible, partakes of reason and harmony, and becomes the best of generated things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","text":"The soul is composed from the nature of the Same, the Different, and being, divided and joined according to proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","text":"The soul, revolving through the same motion, distinguishes the Same and the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","text":"True reason, arising in the motion of the soul, brings about cognitive judgments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","text":"When reason arises concerning the sensible, it produces firm and true opinions and beliefs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A7","text":"When reason arises concerning the rational, it produces intellect and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","text":"The cosmos is an ensouled and intelligent living creature, having come to be as a statue of the eternal gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","text":"What is generated cannot be altogether the same as the eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","text":"Time is a moving image of eternity, ordered together with heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A11","text":"Days, nights, months, and years are constituted together with heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:A12","text":"‘Was’ and ‘will be’ are forms of time, not predicates properly applicable to eternal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX1","text":"The soul is not a visible body, but an invisible and rational principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX2","text":"The soul is not a simple unmixed unit, but a mixture of the Same, the Different, and being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3","text":"Knowledge is not motionless storage, but reason moving in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX4","text":"The sensible does not automatically bring about intellect and knowledge, but opinion and belief when the reason concerning it is set in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","text":"The generated cosmos is not the eternal living creature itself, but its image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX6","text":"Time was not before heaven as a self-subsisting order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:NX7","text":"‘Was’ and ‘will be’ are not eternal forms of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","text":"Since the soul was blended from the Same and the Different and divided according to proportion, it is able to discern the relation and affection of each thing toward each.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D2","text":"Since reason arises in the self-motion of the soul, knowledge follows the soul’s internal revolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","text":"Since the circle of the Different reports the sensible, perception is transformed into firm opinion and belief through reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","text":"Since the circle of the Same is correctly borne around the rational, psychic motion is perfected into intellect and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","text":"Since the cosmos is an image of the eternal living creature, cosmic order imitates eternity without being identical with it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","text":"Since what is generated cannot be wholly attached to the eternal, time represents eternity as a moving image.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D7","text":"Since time is constituted together with heaven, temporal divisions depend upon cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:D8","text":"Since ‘was’ and ‘will be’ are forms of time, their projection onto eternal being confuses becoming with being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A11","CH_JP8E_S_19:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","text":"The soul becomes the mediation that converts cosmic matter into knowable order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2","text":"The difference between the sensible and the intelligible does not constitute a separation of two unconnected worlds, but two modes of the motion of reason in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3","text":"The cosmos preserves its likeness to the eternal only through imitative temporal order, not through literal identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","text":"Time constitutes a cosmological mechanism for the manifestation of eternity in the generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SD5","text":"The erroneous predication of ‘was’ and ‘will be’ of eternal being brings about ontological confusion between temporal succession and timeless being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1","text":"Truth does not pre-exist the soul as an unconnected objective possession, but is constituted through the psychic motion of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2","text":"Knowledge is not produced by the mere presence of things, but by the active distinction of the Same and the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3","text":"The cosmic reproduction of the eternal does not eliminate the difference between paradigm and image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4","text":"Temporality does not constitute an independent container, but a derivative of the ordering of heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5","text":"Eternal being is not subject to generation, succession, past, or future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1","text":"A cosmos equally material and soulless is excluded, since cosmic likeness to the eternal presupposes soul and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2","text":"Eternal time as some third thing alongside eternity and the generated is excluded, since time is an image in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3","text":"The identity of image and paradigm is excluded; cosmic order can only imitate the eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX4","text":"An ontology that recognizes past and future as independent constituents of eternal being is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1","text":"Eternal paradigm → generated heaven → ensouled cosmic constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2","text":"Same + Different + being → reason and harmony → self-moving soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS3","text":"Motion of soul concerning the sensible → opinion and belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS4","text":"Motion of soul concerning the rational → intellect and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","text":"Impossibility for the generated to be the eternal itself → image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6","text":"Cosmic ordering → heaven + temporal divisions → moving image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS7","text":"Confusion of time and eternity → erroneous predication of ‘was’ and ‘will be’ of eternal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF1","text":"Generated visible cosmos → necessity of a psychic principle → constitution of soul from the Same, the Different, and being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","text":"Constitution of soul → self-moving circle → distinction of the Same and the Other → true reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3","text":"True reason → sensible / rational → opinion and belief / intellect and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF4","text":"Ensouled intelligent cosmos → image of the eternal living creature → distinction between paradigm and generated thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF5","text":"Impossibility of the same eternal and generated thing → time as a moving image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:AF6","text":"Time → day, night, month, year → correction of temporal projection onto eternal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","text":"The soul is shifted from a marginal bearer of life into a cosmological mechanism of distinction and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2","text":"The distinction between the sensible and the intelligible is reconstituted as the difference of two cognitive functions of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3","text":"Time is reclassified from a self-subsisting framework into a derivative image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME4","text":"Heaven appears as at once body, living creature, intellectual order, and measure of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ME5","text":"The language of past and future is restricted to the generated and removed from the eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Heaven and time are explained as events of cosmic generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The soul connects bodily ordering, rational distinction, and cognitive result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The analysis requires that the image be distinguished from the paradigm and temporal imitation from eternal reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The eternal exists without temporal succession, whereas the generated exists through motion, time, and imagistic likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the sequence from the eternal paradigm to the generated cosmos and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT2","text":"The constitution of the soul and its two circles suffice for deriving the cognitive results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3","text":"The internal connection between the cosmic soul and temporal ordering remains partly elliptical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","text":"The distinction between eternity and time is coherent, but rests upon the metaphor of image and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5","text":"The principal unresolved point is that time, as an image of eternity, requires likeness to that which it cannot, by definition, contain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument if the soul is understood as a mediating order between eternal paradigm and generated image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_19@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_19:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 37"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 21","title":"Section 37","context":"Chapter 21","original_title":"Section 37","original_context":"Chapter 21"},"original_title":"Section 37","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20","layer":"CH","title":"Section 38","order":22,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_20"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_20@R001","sha256":"6491cdc7dfc2841e8325be772330c1a910adbc1037880e65e2b2cdf00c7f6836","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS1","text":"Ὁ λόγος διακρίνει τὸ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον ἀπὸ τῶν ἐν χρόνῳ γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS2","text":"Τὸ ἀκίνητον ὂν ἀληθῶς λέγεται μόνον ὡς ἔστιν, οὐχ ὡς ἦν ἢ ἔσται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS3","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται μετὰ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ ὡς κινούμενη εἰκὼν τῆς αἰωνίας φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS4","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τῶν οὐρανίων σωμάτων διακρίνει καὶ φυλάττει τοὺς ἀριθμοὺς τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS5","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ λόγου καὶ διανοίας θεοῦ, ἀλλʼ ἡ πλήρης αἰτιολογία τῶν ἄστρων ἀναβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","text":"Τὸ ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ ἔχον οὔτε γίγνεται οὔτε μεταβάλλεται διὰ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","text":"Τὸ ἦν καὶ τὸ ἔσται προσήκει τοῖς ἐν χρόνῳ γιγνομένοις, ἐπειδὴ κινήσεις εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","text":"Ὁ χρόνος συνέστηκε μετὰ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ καὶ ἅμα αὐτῷ γενηθήσεται καὶ λυθήσεται, εἴ ποτε λύσις αὐτῶν γένοιτο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος κατὰ δύναμιν ἀπεικάζει τὴν διαιώνιον φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A5","text":"Ἡ αἰωνία φύσις ἔστιν ἀεὶ πᾶς αἰών, ὁ δὲ χρόνος διὰ παντὸς γεγονώς τε καὶ ὢν καὶ ἐσόμενος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","text":"Ἐκ λόγου καὶ διανοίας θεοῦ ὁ χρόνος καὶ τὰ οὐράνια σώματα συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","text":"Τὰ πλανητὰ ἄστρα τέτακται εἰς περιφορὰς πρὸς διορισμὸν καὶ φυλακὴν ἀριθμῶν χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀστρονομικὴ τάξις περιλαμβάνει ἑπτὰ ἄστρα καὶ διακεκριμένας περιφορὰς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX1","text":"Τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν οὔτε πρεσβύτερον οὔτε νεώτερον γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX2","text":"Τὸ ἀκίνητον οὔτε γεγονὸς οὔτε γιγνόμενον οὔτε γενησόμενόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX3","text":"Τὸ αἰώνιον οὐκ ἐνδέχεται ῥήμασι χρόνου ὡς ἦν καὶ ἔσται ἀκριβῶς δηλοῦσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ αἰώνιος φύσις αὐτή, ἀλλὰ μίμημα αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX5","text":"Ἡ πλήρης διήγησις τῶν περὶ τὰ ἄστρα αἰτιῶν οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ παρόν ἔργον τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν ἀκίνητόν ἐστιν, ἡ χρονικὴ γλῶσσα περὶ αὐτοῦ παράγει ἀνακριβῆ λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἦν καὶ τὸ ἔσται δηλοῖ κίνησιν, ὁ χρόνος ἀναφέρεται πρωτίστως εἰς τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ χρόνος ἀπεικὼν τοῦ αἰῶνός ἐστιν, ἡ χρονικὴ διαδοχὴ ἀποτελεῖ ἀναλογικὴν μίμησιν τῆς ἀμεταβλήτου μονιμότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ χρόνος συνέστηκε μετὰ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ, ἡ λύσις τοῦ ἑνὸς οὐ χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τῆς λύσεως τοῦ ἑτέρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ πλανητὰ ἄστρα τετάχθαι εἰς περιφορὰς, αἱ κινήσεις αὐτῶν καθίστανται μέτρα καὶ φύλακες τῆς χρονικῆς ἀριθμήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ οὐράνιος τάξις ἐκ λόγου καὶ διανοίας θεοῦ γέγονεν, ἡ κοσμικὴ κίνησις οὐκ ἄτακτος ἀλλὰ διακεκριμένη ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD1","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καθίσταται ὁντολογικῶς δεύτερος: ὑπάρχει ὡς γενητὴ μίμησις τοῦ αἰῶνος καὶ οὐχ ὡς αὐτοτελὴς ἀρχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου μετατρέπει τὴν κοσμολογίαν εἰς ἀντιστοιχίαν ἀμεταβλήτου προτύπου καὶ κινητοῦ εἰκόνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD3","text":"Ἡ χρονικότης τοῦ κόσμου οὐ σημαίνει ἁπλῶς φθοράν, ἀλλὰ τάξιν κινήσεων ἣ μιμεῖται τὴν αἰώνιον μονήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια περὶ τοῦ αἰῶνος καὶ ἡ ἀκρίβεια περὶ τῶν χρονικῶν γιγνομένων ἀπαιτοῦσι διαφορετικοὺς τρόπους λέξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς ἕνα μόνον χρονικὸν καθεστώς, ἐπειδὴ τὸ αἰώνιον καὶ τὸ γενητὸν ἔχουσιν ἑτερογενεῖς τρόπους τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX2","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ διαδοχὴ οὐ δύναται νὰ χρησιμεύσῃ ὡς ἡ ἔσχατη ἐξήγησις τῆς τάξεως τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX3","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τῶν οὐρανίων σωμάτων οὐκ ἔχει μόνον φυσικὴν φοράν, ἀλλὰ ὑπάγεται εἰς λειτουργίαν ἀριθμητικῆς χρονικῆς διακρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία χρόνου καὶ αἰῶνος οὐκ ἐξαλείφει τὴν διαφορὰν αὐτῶν, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἦν ἄνευ χρόνου, ἐφʼ ὅσον ὁ οὐρανὸς καὶ ὁ χρόνος ἅμα συνίστανται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἀπόλυτος ταύτισις τοῦ αἰῶνος μετὰ τῆς χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἐξήγησις τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως ἄνευ νοῦ, λόγου καὶ διατεταγμένης κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἀκρίβεια τοῦ καθημερινοῦ χρονικοῦ λεξιλογίου ὅταν ἐφαρμόζηται ἀδιακρίτως εἰς τὸ αἰώνιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS1","text":"Ἀμετάβλητον εἶναι → ἀποβολὴ χρονικῶν κατηγοριῶν → διάκρισις αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2","text":"Αἰώνιον παράδειγμα → γένεσις οὐρανοῦ καὶ χρόνου → κινητὴ εἰκὼν τῆς αἰωνιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS3","text":"Λόγος καὶ διάνοια θεοῦ → σύστασις οὐρανίων σωμάτων → περιφοραὶ → ἀριθμητὴ χρονικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS4","text":"Χρονικὴ γένεσις → ἀνάγκη διακεκριμένων μέτρων → λειτουργικὴ ἀνάθεσις τοῖς πλανήταις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS5","text":"Ἀνακρίβεια χρονικῶν ῥημάτων → ἀναβολὴ περιττῆς λεπτολογίας → διατήρησις τοῦ κεντρικοῦ κοσμολογικοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AF1","text":"Χρονικὴ ἀνακρίβεια → διάκρισις αἰῶνος καὶ γένεσις → χρόνος ὡς μίμημα αἰῶνος → οὐρανὸς ὡς φορεὺς κινήσεων → ἄστρα ὡς μέτρα χρόνου → ἀναβολὴ δευτερευούσης ἀστρονομικῆς αἰτιολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME1","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτοτελὴς διάστασις εἰς γενητὴν εἰκόνα τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME2","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ μεταξὺ «ἔστιν» καὶ «ἦν/ἔσται» γίνεται ὀντολογικὸς φραγμὸς μεταξὺ ἀκινήτου εἶναι καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME3","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ τόπον σωμάτων εἰς σύστημα ἀριθμητικῆς χρονικῆς μετρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME4","text":"Ἡ πλανητικὴ κίνησις ἀποκτᾷ διπλὴν λειτουργίαν: φυσικὴν περιφοράν καὶ χρονικὸν διορισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME5","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ ἀκρίβεια περιορίζεται ὑπὸ ῥητορικῆς ἱεραρχήσεως μεταξὺ κύριας δομῆς καὶ παρεργοῦ λεπτολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ἡ διάταξις τοῦ χρόνου, τοῦ οὐρανοῦ, τοῦ ἡλίου, τῆς σελήνης καὶ τῶν πλανητῶν περιγράφεται ὡς κοσμικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ τάξις παράγεται διὰ τῆς σχέσεως ἀκινήτου παραδείγματος, κινητοῦ οὐρανοῦ καὶ ἀριθμητῶν περιφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ὁ λόγος ἀναγκάζεται νὰ διακρίνῃ τὴν ἀκριβῆ ὀντολογικὴ γλῶσσαν ἀπὸ τὴν συμβατικὴ χρονικὴ ὀνοματολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Ὁ αἰὼν δηλοῖ ἀμετάβλητον πληρότητα, ὁ δὲ χρόνος διαδοχικὴν γένεσιν ἥτις μιμεῖται τὴν πληρότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ὀκτὼ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κυρίου κοσμολογικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν βασικὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν εἰς τὴν ἀστρονομικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς σημασία τῶν ἑκάστης πλανητικῆς περιφορᾶς καὶ αἱ ἐπιμέρους αἰτίαι τῆς διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν ἀναλογίαν παραδείγματος καὶ εἰκόνος, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀναλογία δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ἀπόστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς λεπτομεροῦς ἀστρονομικῆς διηγήσεως ἀφήνει τὸ τελικὸν αἰτιολογικὸν δίκτυον ἐσκεμμένως ἀτελές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230357637442Z_27e06bca","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 38","source_sha256":"6491cdc7dfc2841e8325be772330c1a910adbc1037880e65e2b2cdf00c7f6836","sha256":"9acd04173875481b6cbb3101f2d56e240ceaaf129d02ab51d5178d39871faee8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:03:57.638427+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS1","text":"The account distinguishes that which is always in the same state from things that come to be in time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS2","text":"The unmoved being is truly said only as it is, not as it was or will be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS3","text":"Time comes to be together with the heaven as a moving image of eternal nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS4","text":"The motion of the heavenly bodies distinguishes and preserves the numbers of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AS5","text":"The cosmic order depends upon the reason and intelligence of god, but the full causal account of the stars is deferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","text":"That which is always in the same state neither comes to be nor changes through time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","text":"“Was” and “will be” belong to things coming to be in time, since they are motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","text":"Time has been constituted together with the heaven and will be generated and dissolved together with it, if ever their dissolution should occur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","text":"Time, insofar as it can, imitates eternal nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A5","text":"Eternal nature is always the whole of eternity, whereas time is throughout having come to be, being, and being to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","text":"From the reason and intelligence of god, time and the heavenly bodies are constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","text":"The wandering stars have been arranged in revolutions for the determination and preservation of the numbers of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:A8","text":"The astronomical order encompasses seven stars and distinct revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX1","text":"That which always is becomes neither older nor younger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX2","text":"The unmoved is neither something that has come to be, nor something coming to be, nor something that will come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX3","text":"The eternal does not admit of being accurately expressed by temporal verbs such as “was” and “will be.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX4","text":"Time is not eternal nature itself, but an imitation of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:NX5","text":"The full account of the causes concerning the stars does not constitute the present task of the discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D1","text":"Since that which always is is unmoved, temporal language concerning it produces an inexact account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D2","text":"Since “was” and “will be” signify motion, time refers primarily to becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D3","text":"Since time is an image of eternity, temporal succession constitutes an analogical imitation of immutable permanence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D4","text":"Since time has been constituted together with the heaven, the dissolution of the one is not separable from the dissolution of the other.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D5","text":"Since the wandering stars have been arranged in revolutions, their motions become measures and guardians of temporal enumeration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:D6","text":"Since the heavenly order has come to be from the reason and intelligence of god, cosmic motion is not disorderly but distinct.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD1","text":"Time becomes ontologically secondary: it exists as a generated imitation of eternity and not as a self-subsistent principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD2","text":"The distinction between eternity and time transforms cosmology into a correspondence between an immutable model and a moving image.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD3","text":"The temporality of the cosmos does not signify merely decay, but an order of motions that imitates eternal abiding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SD4","text":"Truth concerning eternity and precision concerning temporal things coming to be require different modes of expression.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1","text":"Reality is not reducible to a single temporal regime, because the eternal and the generated have heterogeneous modes of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX2","text":"Temporal succession cannot serve as the ultimate explanation of the order of the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX3","text":"The motion of the heavenly bodies has not only a natural direction, but is subordinated to the function of numerical temporal distinction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX4","text":"The analogy of time and eternity does not eliminate their difference, but presupposes it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3","CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX1","text":"A cosmos that would be without time is excluded, insofar as the heaven and time are constituted simultaneously.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX2","text":"An absolute identification of eternity with temporal succession is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4","CH_JP8E_S_20:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX3","text":"An explanation of cosmic order without intellect, reason, and ordered motion is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A6","CH_JP8E_S_20:A7","CH_JP8E_S_20:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:SNX4","text":"The complete precision of ordinary temporal vocabulary when it is indiscriminately applied to the eternal is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1","CH_JP8E_S_20:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS1","text":"Immutable being → rejection of temporal categories → distinction between eternity and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2","text":"Eternal paradigm → generation of heaven and time → moving image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS3","text":"Reason and intelligence of god → constitution of heavenly bodies → revolutions → numerable temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS4","text":"Temporal generation → necessity of distinct measures → functional assignment to the planets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS5","text":"Inexactness of temporal verbs → deferral of superfluous detail → preservation of the central cosmological account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:AF1","text":"Temporal inexactness → distinction between eternity and becoming → time as an imitation of eternity → heaven as bearer of motions → stars as measures of time → deferral of secondary astronomical causation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME1","text":"Time is reclassified from a self-subsistent dimension into a generated image of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME2","text":"The difference between “is” and “was/will be” becomes an ontological barrier between unmoved being and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME3","text":"Heaven is transformed from a place of bodies into a system of numerical temporal measurement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME4","text":"Planetary motion acquires a double function: natural revolution and temporal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ME5","text":"Cosmological precision is restricted by a rhetorical hierarchy between primary structure and incidental detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The arrangement of time, heaven, the sun, the moon, and the planets is described as cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Order is produced through the relation of an unmoved paradigm, moving heaven, and numerable revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The discourse is compelled to distinguish precise ontological language from conventional temporal nomenclature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Eternity signifies immutable fullness, whereas time signifies successive becoming that imitates fullness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT1","text":"The eight principles suffice for reconstructing the principal cosmological mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the basic movement from ontological distinction to astronomical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT3","text":"The precise significance of each planetary revolution and the individual causes of the arrangement are underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT4","text":"Internal coherence rests upon the analogy of paradigm and image, but the analogy does not eliminate ontological distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT5","text":"The deferral of the detailed astronomical account leaves the final causal network deliberately incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_20@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_20:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 38"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 22","title":"Section 38","context":"Chapter 22","original_title":"Section 38","original_context":"Chapter 22"},"original_title":"Section 38","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21","layer":"CH","title":"Section 39","order":23,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_21"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_21@R001","sha256":"e2912bc19b1c4930df46aede8853c679030cdb9a65d3874051ac2ab824d5b7ba","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐκ τῆς ἀμοιβαίας κινήσεως τῶν οὐρανίων κύκλων συγκροτεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS2","text":"Ἡ ταὐτοῦ φορὰ ἐντός τῆς θατέρου φορᾶς διαφορὰς τάχους, κύκλων καὶ καταλήψεων καθιστᾷ φανεράς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS3","text":"Ὁ ἥλιος ὡς φανερὸν μέτρον συνδέει τὰς οὐρανίας κινήσεις πρὸς ἀριθμὸν καὶ χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS4","text":"Ἡμέρα, μήν, ἐνιαυτός καὶ τέλειος χρόνος παράγονται ἐκ τῶν περιόδων καὶ τῆς πρὸς ἀλλήλας συμμετρίας αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS5","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία τῶν ἄστρων καὶ τῶν λοιπῶν ζῴων ἀποσκοπεῖ εἰς τὴν ὁμοιότητα τοῦ αἰωνίου νοητοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A1","text":"Πᾶν ὃ ἔδει συναπεργάζεσθαι χρόνον ἀφικνεῖται εἰς τὴν ἑαυτῷ πρέπουσαν φορὰν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A2","text":"Τὰ ζῷα σώματά τε δεδεμένα δεσμοῖς ἐμψύχοις καὶ τὴν προσταχθεῖσαν τάξιν μεμαθηκότα γεννᾶται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A3","text":"Ἡ τῶν κύκλων κίνησις συντίθεται ἐκ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ τῆς θατέρου φορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A4","text":"Οἱ κύκλοι διαφέρουσι κατὰ μέγεθος καὶ κατὰ τάχος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ταὐτοῦ φορὰ δύναται τοὺς διαφόρους κύκλους ὡς καταλαμβάνοντας καὶ καταλαμβανομένους φαίνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","text":"Ὁ ἥλιος ἐτέθη ἐν τῇ δευτέρᾳ πρὸς γῆν περιόδῳ ἵνα μέτρον ἐναργὲς γένηται τάχους καὶ βραδύτητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ἡλίου καὶ τῆς σελήνης περίοδος ὁρίζει τὰς βασικὰς διαιρέσεις τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἐστὶν ἡ περίοδος μιᾶς φρονιμωτάτης κυκλήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A9","text":"Ὁ τέλειος ἐνιαυτὸς πληροῦται ὅταν αἱ ὀκτὼ περίοδοι πρὸς ἀλλήλας τελεσφόρως συμμετρηθῶσι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","text":"Τὰ ἄστρα ἐγεννήθησαν ἵνα ὁ οὐρανὸς ὁμοιότατος γένηται τῷ τελείῳ καὶ νοητῷ ζῴῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A11","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία συμπληροῖ τὸ ὑπόλοιπον τῆς ἀνομοιότητος πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A12","text":"Ὁ νοῦς ὁρῶν τὰς ἐνυπαρχούσας ἰδέας ὁρίζει τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ πλῆθος τῶν δημιουργητέων ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX1","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀδιάφορον ἢ ἀσύνδετον ῥοήν, ἀλλὰ τάξιν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX2","text":"Ἡ ταχύτης οὐκ ὁρίζεται ἀπολύτως, ἀλλὰ πρὸς ἑτέρους κύκλους συγκρίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἡμέρα, ὁ μήν, καὶ ὁ ἐνιαυτὸς οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀνεξάρτητοι χρόνοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια τῶν ἀνθρώπων οὐ σημαίνει ἀπουσίαν τῶν ἄλλων περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX5","text":"Τὸ δημιουργούμενον οὐκ ἔχει ἤδη τελείαν ὁμοιότητα πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX6","text":"Τὰ ζῷα οὐκ ἀποτελοῦν ἀδιαμόρφωτον πληθυσμόν, ἀλλὰ ἀριθμητὰ καὶ εἰδητικῶς προδιατεταγμένα ὄντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ κύκλοι διαφέρουσι κατὰ μέγεθος καὶ τάχος, ἡ κοινὴ φορὰ παράγει φαινόμενα καταλήψεως καὶ ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3","CH_JP8E_S_21:A4","CH_JP8E_S_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ ἥλιος τίθεται ὡς μέτρον, αἱ οὐράνιαι κινήσεις καθίστανται ἀριθμηταὶ καὶ συγκρίσιμοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","CH_JP8E_S_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ σελήνη καὶ ὁ ἥλιος ἐπανέρχονται εἰς τοὺς ἰδίους κύκλους, ἡ περίοδος αὐτῶν παράγει μήνα καὶ ἐνιαυτόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","CH_JP8E_S_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ τέλειος χρόνος ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν σύμπτωσιν ὀκτὼ περιόδων, ὁ ἐνιαυτὸς εἶναι ὅλον ἀριθμητὸν τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ πολλοὶ οὐ συννοοῦσι τὰς περιόδους, ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἄγνοια ἀποκρύπτει μάλλον ἢ καταργεῖ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ οὐρανὸς μιμεῖται τὸ νοητὸν ζῷον, αἱ οὐράνιαι περίοδοι ἔχουν κοσμολογικὸν καὶ μιμητικὸν τέλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A9","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὑπόλοιπον τῆς ἀνομοιότητος μένει, ἡ δημιουργία συνεχίζεται ὡς συμπλήρωσις τοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται ὁρατὴ ἐκτύπωσις τῆς αἰωνιότητος διὰ τῆς κανονισμένης κινήσεως τῶν κύκλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ γνώσις ἀπαιτεῖ μετατροπὴν τῆς φαινομένης κινήσεως εἰς ἀριθμητὴν σχέση.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀτέλεια τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὸ παράδειγμα, ἀλλὰ κινητοποιεῖ τὴν δημιουργικὴν συμπλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A11","CH_JP8E_S_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD4","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ χρόνου καὶ ἡ τάξις τῶν ζῴων ὑπάγονται ἀμφότεραι εἰς ἕνα νοητικὸν πρότυπον εἴδους, πλήθους καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ κίνησις δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ χωρὶς κοινὸν μέτρον καὶ σχέσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ὁ χρόνος προϋπάρχει τοῦ οὐρανοῦ ὡς αὐτόνομος οὐσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ὀνοματοθεσία παράγει τὰ χρονικὰ μεγέθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν κύκλων διαλύει τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ κοσμικοῦ σχεδίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ δημιουργία εἶναι ἄνευ ὁρίου προσθήκη ὕλης· εἶναι ἀποτύπωσις δεδομένου παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX6","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὸ πλῆθος τῶν ζῴων ἀναφαίνονται τυχαίως ἢ ἐμπειρικῶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX1","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ δυνατότης χρόνου ἄνευ κοσμικῆς κινήσεως καὶ ἄνευ ἀναφορᾶς πρὸς τὸ ταὐτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX2","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ δυνατότης ἀσυμμέτρου κόσμου, ἐν ᾧ αἱ περίοδοι οὐκ ἀναφέρονται εἰς κοινὴν τελείωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX3","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ δυνατότης δημιουργίας ἣ μὴ μιμεῖται νοητὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ ἐντελὴς ταυτότης μεταξὺ αἰωνίου παραδείγματος καὶ αἰσθητοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX5","text":"Ἀπούσα ἐστὶν ἡ ἐλευθέρα καὶ ἀνεξέλεγκτος ἐρμηνεία τοῦ οὐρανίου χρόνου ὑπὸ τῶν ἀνθρώπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS1","text":"Ἀρχὴ: ἡ διάκρισις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου ἐν τῇ κινήσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS2","text":"Δομή: ἡ διάκρισις παράγει κύκλους διαφόρου μεγέθους καὶ τάχους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS3","text":"Μέτρον: ὁ ἥλιος καθιστᾷ τὰς διαφορὰς τῶν κινήσεων φανερὰς καὶ ἀριθμητάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS4","text":"Χρονικὴ παραγωγή: ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῶν περιόδων παράγει ἡμέραν, μῆνα, ἐνιαυτὸν καὶ τέλειον χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS5","text":"Κοσμικὴ μίμησις: ὁ χρόνος καὶ οἱ ἀστέρες ἀποτυποῦσι τὴν αἰώνιον φύσιν τοῦ νοητοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS6","text":"Συμπλήρωσις: ἡ ὑπολειπομένη ἀνομοιότης προκαλεῖ τὴν δημιουργίαν τῶν λοιπῶν ζῴων κατὰ τὰς ἰδέας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF1","text":"Διαφοραὶ κινήσεων → σύγκρισις κύκλων → ἐμφάνεια καταλήψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF2","text":"Ἐμφάνεια κινήσεων → ἥλιος ὡς μέτρον → ἀριθμητὴ χρονικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF3","text":"Χρονικὴ τάξις → ἡμέρα, μήν, ἐνιαυτός → τέλειος ἐνιαυτὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF4","text":"Τέλειος χρόνος → μίμησις αἰωνίου ζῴου → συμπλήρωσις τοῦ κοσμικοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ῥοὴ ἀφηρημένη εἰς σύστημα συγχρονισμένων περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME2","text":"Ἡ ταχύτης ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα πράγματος εἰς σχέσιν ἀμοιβαίας μετρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια τῶν πολλῶν ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν τάξιν τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME4","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ζῷον μιμητικὸν καὶ ὄργανον χρονικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία ἀναφαίνεται ὡς διαδικασία ἀποκαταστάσεως ὁμοιότητος, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλῆ γένεσις ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT1","text":"**Surface**: Αἱ κινήσεις ἡλίου, σελήνης καὶ τῶν ἄλλων ἄστρων ὁρίζουσι τὰ χρονικὰ μεγέθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT2","text":"**Structural**: Ἡ κοινὴ φορὰ συνδέει ἀντιθέτους κατευθύνσεις, διαφόρους κύκλους καὶ ἀνομοίους ταχύτητας εἰς μίαν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic**: Ἡ γνώσις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀριθμητικὴν σύγκρισιν τῶν περιόδων καὶ ὑπερβαίνει τὴν κοινὴν ὄψιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal**: Ὁ αἰσθητὸς χρόνος εἶναι μίμημα τῆς αἰωνιότητος, ἐντελῶς ὁριζόμενον διὰ τῆς κυκλικῆς κινήσεως καὶ τοῦ νοητοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ περὶ ταὐτοῦ, θατέρου, κύκλων, μέτρου καὶ παραδείγματος ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ κύριου συλλογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ ἡμέρας, μηνός, ἐνιαυτοῦ καὶ τελείου χρόνου διατηρεῖται ἄνευ τῶν παραδειγματικῶν λεπτομερειῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT3","text":"Ἡ σχέση τοῦ ἡλίου πρὸς τὸ μέτρον καὶ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ πρὸς τὸ νοητὸν ζῷον εἶναι ἀναγκαία πρὸς τὴν πλήρη ἀνασύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ σχέσις τῶν ὀκτὼ περιόδων καὶ ἡ λεπτομερὴς σημασία τῶν λοιπῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ χρονικὴ τάξις καὶ ἡ ζωική συμπλήρωσις ὑπάγονται εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ μιμητικὸν πρότυπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν διαφοροποιημένην κίνησιν πρὸς τὸ μέτρον, ἀπὸ τὸ μέτρον πρὸς τὸν χρόνον, καὶ ἀπὸ τὸν χρόνον πρὸς τὴν κοσμικὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230415993589Z_425cc4c1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 39","source_sha256":"e2912bc19b1c4930df46aede8853c679030cdb9a65d3874051ac2ab824d5b7ba","sha256":"6ac99964025cf8386857253c523dc1d51c15199530aaec60e68310551f8cc6fe","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:04:15.997154+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS1","text":"The cosmic order is constituted from the reciprocal motion of the celestial circles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS2","text":"The motion of the same within the motion of the other makes differences of speed, circles, and overtaking manifest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS3","text":"The sun, as a manifest measure, connects the celestial motions to number and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS4","text":"Day, month, year, and perfect time are produced from the revolutions and their mutual commensurability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AS5","text":"The creation of the stars and of the remaining living beings aims at likeness to the eternal intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A1","text":"Everything that was required to cooperate in producing time arrives at the motion proper to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A2","text":"Living beings are generated with bodies bound by animate bonds and having learned the prescribed order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A3","text":"The motion of the circles is composed of the motion of the same and that of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A4","text":"The circles differ in magnitude and in speed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","text":"The common motion of the same can make the different circles appear as overtaking and being overtaken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","text":"The sun was placed in the second revolution from the earth in order that it might become a clear measure of swiftness and slowness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","text":"The revolution of the sun and moon determines the basic divisions of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","text":"Time is the revolution of one most intelligent rotation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A9","text":"The perfect year is completed when the eight revolutions are brought into mutually effective commensuration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","text":"The stars were generated so that the heaven might become most like the perfect and intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A11","text":"Creation completes the remainder of dissimilarity relative to the paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:A12","text":"Intellect, seeing the ideas inherent within it, determines the form and number of the living beings to be created.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX1","text":"Time does not constitute an indifferent or disconnected flow, but an order of revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX2","text":"Speed is not determined absolutely, but is compared with other circles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX3","text":"The day, month, and year are not independent times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX4","text":"Human ignorance does not signify the absence of the other revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX5","text":"What is being created does not already possess perfect likeness to the paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:NX6","text":"Living beings do not constitute an unformed multitude, but beings numerable and prearranged according to form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D1","text":"Since the circles differ in magnitude and speed, the common motion produces phenomena of overtaking and superiority.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3","CH_JP8E_S_21:A4","CH_JP8E_S_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D2","text":"Since the sun is posited as a measure, the celestial motions become numerable and comparable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","CH_JP8E_S_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D3","text":"Since the moon and the sun return to their proper circles, their revolution produces month and year.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","CH_JP8E_S_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D4","text":"Since perfect time requires the coincidence of eight revolutions, the year is a numerable whole of the celestial motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D5","text":"Since most people do not comprehend the revolutions, human ignorance conceals rather than abolishes the order of time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D6","text":"Since heaven imitates the intelligible living being, the celestial revolutions have a cosmological and imitative end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A9","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:D7","text":"Since the remainder of dissimilarity remains, creation continues as a completion of the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1","text":"Time becomes a visible imprint of eternity through the regulated motion of the circles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD2","text":"Cosmic knowledge requires the conversion of apparent motion into a numerable relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A5","CH_JP8E_S_21:A6","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3","text":"The imperfection of the sensible cosmos does not annul the paradigm, but mobilizes creative completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A11","CH_JP8E_S_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SD4","text":"The order of time and the order of living beings are both subordinated to one intelligible model of form, number, and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A8","CH_JP8E_S_21:A10","CH_JP8E_S_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that motion can be conceived without a common measure and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that time pre-exists heaven as an autonomous substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that human naming produces temporal magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the multiplicity of circles dissolves the unity of the cosmic design.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that creation is a limitless addition of matter; it is an imprint of a given paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX6","text":"It is excluded that the form and number of living beings appear by chance or empirically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX1","text":"Absent is the possibility of time without cosmic motion and without reference to the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX2","text":"Absent is the possibility of an incommensurate cosmos, in which the revolutions are not referred to a common completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX3","text":"Absent is the possibility of a creation that does not imitate an intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4","text":"Absent is complete identity between the eternal paradigm and the sensible cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX5","text":"Absent is the free and uncontrolled interpretation of celestial time by human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS1","text":"Principle: the distinction of the same and the other in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS2","text":"Structure: the distinction produces circles of different magnitude and speed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS3","text":"Measure: the sun renders the differences of motions manifest and numerable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS4","text":"Temporal production: the repetition of revolutions produces day, month, year, and perfect time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS5","text":"Cosmic imitation: time and the stars imprint the eternal nature of the intelligible living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS6","text":"Completion: the remaining dissimilarity brings about the creation of the remaining living beings according to the ideas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF1","text":"Differences of motions → comparison of circles → appearance of overtaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF2","text":"Appearance of motions → sun as measure → numerable temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF3","text":"Temporal order → day, month, year → perfect year.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:AF4","text":"Perfect time → imitation of the eternal living being → completion of the cosmic living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1","text":"Time is reclassified from abstract flow into a system of synchronized revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME2","text":"Speed is reclassified from a property of a thing into a relation of reciprocal measurement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME3","text":"The ignorance of the many is separated from the ontological order of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME4","text":"Heaven appears as an imitative living being and an instrument of temporal knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5","text":"Creation appears as a process of restoring likeness, not as a simple generation of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT1","text":"**Surface**: The motions of the sun, moon, and other stars determine temporal magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT2","text":"**Structural**: The common motion connects opposite directions, different circles, and unequal speeds into one order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic**: Knowledge requires numerical comparison of the revolutions and transcends ordinary sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal**: Sensible time is an imitation of eternity, wholly determined through circular motion and the intelligible paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT1","text":"The principles concerning the same, the other, circles, measure, and paradigm suffice for reconstructing the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT2","text":"The production of day, month, year, and perfect time is preserved without the paradigmatic details.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT3","text":"The relation of the sun to measure and of heaven to the intelligible living being is necessary for the complete reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT4","text":"The precise mechanical relation of the eight revolutions and the detailed significance of the remaining living beings remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent, because temporal order and the completion of living beings are subordinated to the same imitative model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from differentiated motion toward measure, from measure toward time, and from time toward cosmic likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_21:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_21@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_21:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 39"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 23","title":"Section 39","context":"Chapter 23","original_title":"Section 39","original_context":"Chapter 23"},"original_title":"Section 39","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4","layer":"CH","title":"Section 40","order":24,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC4"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC4@R001","sha256":"bf0ee672d8e207777b87eb17deaf9b131bcb7370eaf628597dc4537a4318c2eb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS1","text":"Τὸ θεῖον διαιρεῖται εἰς τέτταρα γένη κατὰ στοιχεῖον καὶ τόπον: οὐράνιον, ἀεροπόρον, ἔνυδρον, χερσαῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS2","text":"Τὸ οὐράνιον γένος ἐκ πυρὸς κατεσκευάσθη ὡς λαμπρότατον καὶ κάλλιστον, σφαιροειδὲς καὶ νοῦν ἔχον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS3","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῶν κινήσεων διακρίνει τὰ ἀΐδια καὶ ἀπλανῆ ἀπὸ τὰ πλανώμενα καὶ μεταβαλλόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS4","text":"Ἡ γῆ ὡς τροφὸς καὶ φύλαξ συνδέει τὴν κοσμικὴν περιφοράν πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν νυκτὸς καὶ ἡμέρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS5","text":"Ἡ ὄψις τῶν οὐρανίων μιμημάτων ἀποτελεῖ προϋπόθεσιν τοῦ λόγου περὶ τῶν φαινομένων, ἐνώ ἡ περὶ τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων γνῶσις ὑπερβαίνει τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην δύναμιν καὶ ἀνατίθεται τῇ παραδόσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A1","text":"Τὰ θεῖα γένη διακρίνονται κατὰ τὸν οὐρανόν, τὸν ἀέρα, τὸ ὕδωρ καὶ τὴν γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","text":"Τὸ οὐράνιον θεῖον ἐκ πυρὸς ἐδημιουργήθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3","text":"Ἡ τοῦ πυρὸς λαμπρότης καὶ ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ ἐκφράζουσι κάλλος καὶ κοσμικήν ὁλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","text":"Τὸ οὐράνιον ζῷον ὑπόκειται τῇ φρονήσει τοῦ κρατίστου καὶ νοεῖ περὶ τῶν αὐτῶν ἀεί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","text":"Δύο κινήσεις συνέχουσι τὴν οὐράνιον τάξιν: ἡ ταὐτὴ καὶ ὁμοία περιφορά καὶ ἡ πρὸς τὸ πρόσθεν φορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A6","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία τῶν πέντε κινήσεων ἀποβλέπει εἰς τὸ βέλτιστον ἑκάστου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7","text":"Τὰ ἀπλανῆ ἄστρα μένει ἀΐδια καὶ κατὰ ταὐτὰ στρέφεται, τὰ δὲ πλανώμενα ἔχει κίνησιν καὶ πλάνην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A8","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἐστὶ τροφὸς τῶν ἀνθρώπων, φύλαξ τῆς νυκτὸς καὶ τῆς ἡμέρας, καὶ πρεσβυτάτη τῶν ἐντὸς οὐρανοῦ θεῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9","text":"Αἱ συνάψεις, ἀποκρύψεις, ἐπανακυκλήσεις καὶ προχωρήσεις τῶν κύκλων συγκροτοῦσιν ὁρατὴν τάξιν σημείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων ὑπερβαίνει τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην ἱκανότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","text":"Ἡ μαρτυρία τῶν θεῶν ὡς ἐκγόνων θεῶν γίνεται πιστευτὴ διὰ τὴν ὑποτιθεμένην οἰκειότητα πρὸς τοὺς προγόνους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12","text":"Ὅπου λείπουσιν εἰκότες καὶ ἀναγκαῖαι ἀποδείξεις, ὁ νόμος τῆς παραδόσεως ἀναπληροῖ τὴν ἀπόδειξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ἄνευ ὕλης καὶ στοιχείου νοεῖται τὸ οὐράνιον θεῖον, ἀλλὰ ἐκ πυρὸς κατεσκευασμένον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX2","text":"Οὐκ ἀόριστος καὶ ἄτακτος ἐστὶν ἡ οὐράνιος κίνησις, ἀλλὰ τεταγμένη κατὰ κύκλους καὶ ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX3","text":"Οὐ ταὐτὸν ἐστὶ τὸ ἀπλανὲς καὶ τὸ πλανώμενον θεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX4","text":"Οὐκ ἡ γῆ ἐστὶ μόνον ἄψυχος τόπος, ἀλλὰ τροφὸς, φύλαξ καὶ δημιουργὸς χρονικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX5","text":"Οὐκ ἐφικτὴ διὰ λόγου μόνου ἡ ἀναφορὰ τῶν οὐρανίων σημείων, ἄνευ τῆς ὄψεως τῶν μιμημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX6","text":"Οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖται πλήρης ἀπόδειξις περὶ τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γένεσις αὐτῶν ὑπερβαίνει τὸ ἀνθρώπινον μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ οὐράνιον ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ σφαιρικῶς ἐποιήθη, ἡ λαμπρότης καὶ ἡ κυκλικότης αὐτοῦ δηλοῦσιν ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ ἐνταῦθα ἐπιτελεῖ γνωστικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ οὐράνιον νοεῖ περὶ τῶν αὐτῶν καὶ κινεῖται κατὰ ταὐτά, ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ κόσμου συνδέεται μετὰ τῆς ἐπαναληπτικῆς κανονικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ ἀπλανῆ μένει κατὰ ταὐτὰ καὶ τὰ πλανώμενα ἔχει πλάνην, ἡ μεταβολὴ ταξινομεῖται ὡς διαφορά κοσμικοῦ γένους καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀνωμαλία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ γῆ φυλάσσει νύκτα καὶ ἡμέραν, ὁ χρόνος παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα θείας περιστροφῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνεξάρτητον πλαίσιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ συνάψεις καὶ ἀποκρύψεις ἀποτελοῦσι σημεῖα, τὸ ὁρατὸν φαινόμενον δύναται νὰ παρέχει προειδοποιήσεις μόνον ἐκείνῳ ὃς δύναται νὰ λογίζηται τὴν τάξιν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ γένεσις τῶν ἄλλων δαιμόνων ὑπερβαίνει τὸ ἀνθρώπινον, ἡ γνώσις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόδειξιν εἰς τὴν πίστιν τῆς παραδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἕνωσις στοιχειακῆς ὕλης, γεωμετρικῆς μορφῆς, νοερᾶς κινήσεως καὶ θεσμισμένης μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀστρονομικὴ τάξις μετατρέπει τὴν κίνησιν εἰς φορέα νοήματος, ὥστε ἡ περιφορά νὰ γίνεται συγχρόνως φυσικὴ αἰτία καὶ σημεῖον μελλόντων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ γνώσις ἔχει διπλὴν ὁδόν: ἑρμηνεύει τὰ ὁρατὰ διὰ λόγου καὶ ὄψεως, ἀλλὰ καταφεύγει εἰς παράδοσιν ὅταν ὑπερβαίνῃ τὰ ἀνθρώπινα ὅρια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐγκυρότης τῆς παραδόσεως θεμελιοῦται οὐχὶ εἰς ἀναγκαστικὴν ἀπόδειξιν, ἀλλὰ εἰς τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν συγγένειαν τῶν μαρτύρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ φύσις ἐξηγεῖται ἄνευ νοῦ, τάξεως καὶ τελικοῦ προσανατολισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ κίνησις ἐστὶ καθαρὴ μεταβολὴ ἄνευ διακρίσεως μεταξὺ κανονικότητος καὶ πλάνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι τὸ ὁρατὸν σημεῖον ἔχει νόημα ἄνευ ἑρμηνευτικῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ ἀπόδειξις ὀφείλει πάντοτε νὰ ἐπεκτείνεται πέραν τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου μέτρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἀπόλυτον διάκρισιν μεταξὺ φυσικῆς αἰτίας, θείας ἐνεργείας καὶ χρονικοῦ σημείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἀνθρωπίνης ἀυτοτελοῦς ἐποπτείας τοῦ παντὸς γένους τῶν θείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀπόδειξις ἣν ὑποκαθιστᾷ ἡ πίστις πρὸς τοὺς παλαιοτέρους μάρτυρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἄνευ ὀράσεως καὶ λογισμοῦ ἐρμηνεία τῶν οὐρανίων φαινομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδιαφοροποίητος εἰκὼν τοῦ θείου, ἐπειδὴ τὸ θεῖον ὀργανώνεται διὰ βαθμίδων, στοιχείων, κινήσεων καὶ βαθμῶν γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS1","text":"Διαίρεσις τοῦ θείου κατὰ στοιχεῖον καὶ τόπον → ἱεράρχησις τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS2","text":"Πῦρ + σφαιρικὴ μορφή + νοῦς + κυκλικὴ κίνησις → ἀΐδιος καὶ κανονικὴ οὐράνιος θεότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS3","text":"Ἀπόκρυψις + σύναψις + ἐπανακύκλησις → ὁρατὸν σημεῖον → φόβος ἢ προμήθεια κατὰ τὴν ἑρμηνευτικὴν ἱκανότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4","text":"Ὑπέρβασις τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου μέτρου → ἀδυναμία ἀποδείξεως → προσφυγὴ εἰς θεογενῆ παράδοσιν → πίστις κατὰ νόμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF1","text":"Ποικιλία θείων γενῶν → στοιχειακὴ διαίρεσις → οὐράνια γεωμετρικὴ τάξις → διάκρισις ἀπλανῶν καὶ πλανωμένων → γῆ ὡς χρονικὸς σύνδεσμος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2","text":"Ὁρατὴ κυκλικὴ τάξις → σημεῖα μελλόντων → ὅριον τοῦ λόγου ἄνευ ὄψεως → ὅριον τῆς ἀποδείξεως → παράδοσις καὶ πίστις περὶ τῶν ἀοράτων δαιμόνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME1","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ παθητικὸν τόπον εἰς θείαν λειτουργίαν τροφῆς, φυλακῆς καὶ χρονικῆς δημιουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME2","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ ἀπλανῶν καὶ πλανωμένων μετατρέπει τὴν κίνησιν εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ταξινόμησιν τοῦ θείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς γίνεται ταὐτοχρόνως κόσμος, ζῷον, μηχανὴ κινήσεων καὶ γραμματεῖον σημείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις διαιρεῖται εἰς ἐμπειρικὴν ἀνάγνωσιν τῶν ὁρατῶν καὶ παραδοσιακὴν πίστιν τῶν ὑπερανθρωπίνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία γνώσεως δὲν καταστρέφει τὸν λόγον, ἀλλὰ μετακινεί τὴν πηγήν κύρους ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόδειξιν εἰς τὴν συγγένειαν καὶ τὸν νόμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον: τέτταρα θεῖα γένη, οὐράνιαι κινήσεις, γῆ, ἄστρα καὶ δαίμονες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις παράγεται διὰ στοιχείων, σχημάτων, νοήσεως, περιφορῶν καὶ ἱεραρχικῶν διακρίσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ συνδυάζῃ ὄψιν, λογισμόν, ὅριον ἀποδείξεως καὶ πίστιν παραδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς ἔμψυχος, κυκλική, ἱεραρχική, καὶ ὁ χρόνος ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἐπαρκῶς ἀνασυνιστῶσι τὴν διαίρεσιν τῶν θείων, τὴν οὐράνιαν μηχανήν, τὸν ρόλον τῆς γῆς καὶ τὸ ὅριον τῆς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ κοσμολογικὴν ταξινόμησιν εἰς ἐπιστημολογικὴν ὑποχώρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν αἱ πέντε κινήσεις νοοῦνται καὶ συνδέονται πρὸς τὰ πλανώμενα σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4","text":"Ἐνυπάρχει τάσις μεταξὺ τῆς ἀπαίτησης λογικοῦ λογισμοῦ περὶ τῶν οὐρανίων καὶ τῆς ἀποδοχῆς παραδόσεως ἄνευ ἀναγκαίων ἀποδείξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται στὴ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ τοῦ ὁρατοῦ, ὃ δύναται νὰ λογισθῇ, καὶ τοῦ ὑπερανθρωπίνου, ὃ πιστεύεται κατὰ νόμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225631728682Z_5b28de4f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 40","source_sha256":"bf0ee672d8e207777b87eb17deaf9b131bcb7370eaf628597dc4537a4318c2eb","sha256":"a816a387f4d569504659e9a9a34fd86828178f2460cb7c2333c469de3f912fac","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:56:31.732356+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS1","text":"The divine is divided into four kinds according to element and place: celestial, aerial, aquatic, terrestrial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS2","text":"The celestial kind was fashioned from fire as most radiant and most beautiful, spherical and possessing intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS3","text":"The order of motions distinguishes the eternal and fixed from the wandering and changing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS4","text":"The earth, as nurse and guardian, connects the cosmic revolution with the coming-to-be of night and day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AS5","text":"The sight of the celestial likenesses constitutes a prerequisite for discourse concerning phenomena, whereas knowledge concerning the other daimons exceeds human capacity and is entrusted to tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A1","text":"The divine kinds are distinguished according to heaven, air, water, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","text":"The celestial divine was created from fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3","text":"The radiance of fire and the spherical form express beauty and cosmic wholeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","text":"The celestial living being is subject to the intelligence of the supreme and thinks always about the same things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","text":"Two motions sustain the celestial order: the same and uniform revolution, and the forward motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A6","text":"The immobility of the five motions aims at what is best for each.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7","text":"The fixed stars remain eternal and turn in the same way, while the wandering ones have motion and wandering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A8","text":"The earth is the nurse of human beings, guardian of night and day, and eldest of the gods within heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9","text":"Conjunctions, occultations, revolutions, and progressions of the circles constitute a visible order of signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","text":"The coming-to-be of the other daimons exceeds human capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","text":"The testimony of the gods as offspring of gods becomes credible through their presumed kinship with their ancestors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12","text":"Where plausible and necessary proofs are lacking, the law of tradition supplies the proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX1","text":"The celestial divine is not conceived without matter and element, but as fashioned from fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX2","text":"Celestial motion is not indeterminate and disorderly, but ordered according to circles and uniformity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX3","text":"The fixed and the wandering divine are not the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX4","text":"The earth is not merely an inanimate place, but nurse, guardian, and maker of temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX5","text":"Reference to the celestial signs is not attainable through discourse alone, without sight of the likenesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX6","text":"A complete proof concerning the other daimons is not required, since their coming-to-be exceeds the human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D1","text":"Since the celestial was made from fire and spherically, its radiance and circularity show that form here performs a cognitive and cosmological function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D2","text":"Since the celestial thinks about the same things and moves in the same ways, the truth of the cosmos is connected with repetitive regularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D3","text":"Since the fixed remain in the same way and the wandering have wandering, change is classified as a difference of cosmic kind and not as a simple irregularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D4","text":"Since the earth guards night and day, time is presented as the result of divine rotation and not as an independent framework.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D5","text":"Since conjunctions and occultations constitute signs, the visible phenomenon can provide warnings only to one who can calculate its order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:D6","text":"Since the coming-to-be of the other daimons exceeds the human, knowledge passes from proof to faith in tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1","text":"Cosmic order is constituted as a union of elemental matter, geometrical form, intellectual motion, and instituted memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2","text":"Astronomical order transforms motion into a bearer of meaning, so that revolution becomes simultaneously a natural cause and a sign of things to come.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3","text":"Scientific knowledge has a double path: it interprets visible things through discourse and sight, but has recourse to tradition when it exceeds human limits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD4","text":"The validity of tradition is grounded not in compelling proof, but in the hierarchical kinship of the witnesses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the idea that nature is explained without intellect, order, and final orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the idea that motion is pure change without a distinction between regularity and wandering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the idea that the visible sign has meaning without interpretive capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the idea that proof must always extend beyond the human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5","text":"The system excludes an absolute distinction between natural cause, divine activity, and temporal sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1","text":"The possibility of autonomous human contemplation of the entire kind of divine things is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX2","text":"The proof that faith in earlier witnesses replaces is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX3","text":"Interpretation of celestial phenomena without sight and calculation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX4","text":"An undifferentiated image of the divine is excluded, since the divine is organized through levels, elements, motions, and degrees of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS1","text":"Division of the divine according to element and place → hierarchy of kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS2","text":"Fire + spherical form + intellect + circular motion → eternal and regular celestial divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS3","text":"Occultation + conjunction + revolution → visible sign → fear or forethought according to interpretive capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4","text":"Transcendence of the human measure → impossibility of proof → recourse to god-born tradition → faith according to law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF1","text":"Variety of divine kinds → elemental division → celestial geometrical order → distinction of fixed and wandering bodies → earth as temporal link.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2","text":"Visible circular order → signs of things to come → limit of discourse without sight → limit of proof → tradition and faith concerning the invisible daimons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME1","text":"The earth is reclassified from a passive place into a divine function of nourishment, guardianship, and temporal creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME2","text":"The difference between fixed and wandering bodies transforms motion into a hierarchical classification of the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3","text":"Heaven becomes at once cosmos, living being, machine of motions, and archive of signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4","text":"Proof is divided into empirical reading of visible things and traditional faith in superhuman things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME5","text":"The incapacity for knowledge does not destroy discourse, but shifts the source of authority from proof to kinship and law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT1","text":"Surface level: four divine kinds, celestial motions, earth, stars, and daimons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT2","text":"Structural level: cosmic order is produced through elements, shapes, thought, revolutions, and hierarchical distinctions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: discourse must combine sight, calculation, the limit of proof, and faith in tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: reality is conceived as animate, circular, hierarchical, and time as the result of cosmic motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT1","text":"The axioms sufficiently reconstruct the division of divine things, the celestial mechanism, the role of the earth, and the limit of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from cosmological classification to epistemological retreat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT3","text":"The precise manner in which the five motions are conceived and connected with the wandering bodies is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4","text":"There is a tension between the demand for rational calculation concerning celestial things and the acceptance of tradition without necessary proofs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT5","text":"The internal coherence rests on the distinction between the visible, which can be calculated, and the superhuman, which is believed according to law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC4:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 40"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 24","title":"Section 40","context":"Chapter 24","original_title":"Section 40","original_context":"Chapter 24"},"original_title":"Section 40","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22","layer":"CH","title":"Section 41","order":25,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_22"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_22@R001","sha256":"b1e4a2a2d2955dbd5b0eed68df6c1f08eda5b9393405e395751d52314aeb84e4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις ἀνάγεται εἰς γενεαλογικὴν τάξιν θεῶν καὶ εἰς δημιουργικὴν βούλησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS2","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς διακρίνει τὸ πεποιημένον ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀγενήτου καὶ τὸ λυτόν ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀλύτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS3","text":"Οἱ ὑπὸ τοῦ δημιουργοῦ γενόμενοι θεοὶ οὔτε ἀθάνατοι καθ᾽ ἑαυτοὺς οὔτε παντάπασιν ἄλυτοι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS4","text":"Ἡ τοῦ παντὸς τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν γένεσιν τῶν θνητῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεία δημιουργία παρέχει τὸ ἀθάνατον μέρος, ἐνώ δὲ οἱ θεοὶ τὸ θνητὸν ἐξυφαίνουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS6","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ διανομή, ἡ ἀστρολογικὴ τάξις καὶ οἱ εἱμαρμένοι νόμοι καθιστῶσι τὴν γένεσιν ἱεραρχημένην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS7","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις διχάζεται, καὶ τὸ κρεῖττον γένος αὐτῆς ὀνομάζεται ἀνήρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A1","text":"Πᾶν τὸ γενόμενον ἔχει αἰτίαν δημιουργικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","text":"Τὸ δεδεμένον πᾶν δύναται λυθῆναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","text":"Τὸ καλῶς ἁρμοσθὲν οὐ λύεται ἄνευ βουλήσεως τοῦ ἁρμόσαντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A4","text":"Οἱ γενόμενοι θεοὶ ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ κρείττονος δεσμοῦ καὶ βουλήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","text":"Ἡ τοῦ παντὸς τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν παρουσίαν πάντων τῶν γενῶν τῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ γένεσις ὀφείλει νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν θείαν δημιουργικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","text":"Ἡ θεία δημιουργία παρέχει σπέρμα καὶ ἀρχὴν ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A8","text":"Οἱ νεώτεροι θεοὶ κατασκευάζουσι τὰ θνητὰ σώματα καὶ τρέφουσι τὴν φθαρτὴν ζωήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","text":"Αἱ ψυχαὶ διανέμονται κατ᾽ ἀριθμὸν πρὸς τοὺς ἀστέρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","text":"Ἡ γένεσις διέπεται ὑπὸ κοινῶν νόμων εἱμαρμένης καὶ ὑπὸ διακεκριμένων ὀργάνων χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις ἔχει διπλὴν σύστασιν καὶ ἱεραρχικὴν διαφοροποίησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX1","text":"Οἱ γενόμενοι θεοὶ οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀγέννητοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX2","text":"Οἱ γενόμενοι θεοὶ οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀθάνατοι καθ᾽ ἑαυτούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX3","text":"Οἱ γενόμενοι θεοὶ οὐκ εἰσὶν παντάπασιν ἄλυτοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX4","text":"Ἡ λύσις τοῦ καλῶς ἡρμοσμένου οὐκ ἔστιν ἔργον ἀγαθόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX5","text":"Τὸ τέλειον οὐ δύναται νὰ μένῃ ἄνευ τῶν θνητῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX6","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ γένεσις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀμιγῆ θείαν δημιουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX7","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν οὐκ ἔχει ἀυτοτελῆ ἀρχὴν ἀλλὰ προσυφαίνεται τῷ ἀθανάτῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX8","text":"Οὐ πᾶσα ψυχὴ ἀδιακρίτως ἐν παντὶ σώματι φυτεύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX9","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις οὐκ ἔχει ἁπλῆν καὶ ὁμοιογενῆ μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία τῶν θεῶν ἐξασφαλίζεται ὑπὸ τῆς τοῦ δημιουργοῦ βουλήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὑπὸ τῆς ἰδίας γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","CH_JP8E_S_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D2","text":"Ἡ δημιουργικὴ ἐξουσία διαιρεῖται εἰς πρώτην θείαν σύστασιν καὶ δευτέραν παραγωγὴν θνητῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D3","text":"Ἡ ὁλοκλήρωσις τοῦ κόσμου μετατρέπει τὴν θνητότητα ἀπὸ ἔλλειμμα εἰς ἀναγκαῖον συστατικὸν τῆς οὐρανίας τελειότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","CH_JP8E_S_22:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D4","text":"Τὸ θνητὸ ζῷον ἀποτελεῖ σύνθεσιν ἀθανάτου ἀρχῆς καὶ φθαρτοῦ ὑφάσματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ λαμβάνει κοσμικὴν θέσιν πρὸ τῆς ἐνσώματης γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη γένεσις ὑπόκειται συγχρόνως εἰς καθολικὴν εἱμαρμένην καὶ εἰς ἰδιαίτερον ὄργανον γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D7","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης φύσεως ἐγγράφεται ἐν τῇ κοσμογονικῇ τάξει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ὑπόστασις διατηρεῖται διὰ ἱεραρχικῆς μεταβιβάσεως τῆς δημιουργικῆς δυνάμεως, ἀπὸ τοῦ πρώτου δημιουργοῦ εἰς τοὺς νεωτέρους θεούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1","CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία δὲν δηλοῖ ἀπουσίαν γενέσεως ἀλλὰ διατήρησιν ὑπὸ ὑπερκειμένου δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","CH_JP8E_S_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD3","text":"Ὁ κόσμος γίνεται πλήρης μόνον ὅταν ἡ θεία τάξις περιλάβῃ τὴν φθοράν, τὴν τροφήν, τὴν αὔξησιν καὶ τὴν ἀπόκρισιν τοῦ θνητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ κοσμολογία μεταφέρει τὴν ἀξίαν ἀπὸ τῆς ἁπλῆς ὑπάρξεως εἰς τὴν τάξιν, τὴν ὑπακοὴν καὶ τὴν ἀναλογίαν πρὸς τὸ θεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπολογία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ προϋπάρχουσαν μεταφυσικὴν διανομήν ψυχῶν, χρόνων καὶ σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐ δύναται νὰ θεωρηθῇ ἀνεξάρτητος συνδημιουργὸς τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX2","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐ δύναται νὰ ἐρμηνευθῇ ὡς ἄτακτος αὐτογένεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX3","text":"Ἡ θνητότης οὐ δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς ἀπλὴ ἀποτυχία τῆς δημιουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX4","text":"Οἱ κατώτεροι θεοὶ οὐ δύνανται νὰ ἀναλάβωσιν ἀνεξέλεγκτον δημιουργικὴν κυριότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐ δύναται νὰ ὑπάρχῃ ἔξω τῆς κοσμικῆς ἀριθμητικῆς καὶ τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη διαφορά οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀποσυνδεθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἦν τέλειος ἄνευ τῆς θνητῆς ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει θεὸς ὃς ἂν ἐκ τῆς γενέσεως αὐτοῦ αὐτομάτως ἦν ἀθάνατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει γένεσις ἄνευ μεσίτης, διαδόχου καὶ ἱεραρχικῆς ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις ἄνευ προδιαγεγραμμένης κοσμικῆς θέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ θνητὸν ἔχει ἀξίαν ἢ νόημα ἔξω τῆς προσμίξεως πρὸς τὸ ἀθάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS1","text":"Δημιουργικὴ αἰτία → Γένεσις θεῶν → Δυνατὴ λύσις → Διάσῳσις διὰ βουλήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS2","text":"Ἀτέλεια τοῦ οὐρανοῦ → Ἀνάγκη θνητῶν γενῶν → Ἐπιμερισμὸς δημιουργικῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS3","text":"Θεῖον σπέρμα → Θνητὸν ὕφασμα → Σύνθεσις ζῴων → Τροφὴ καὶ φθορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS4","text":"Κοσμικὴ σύστασις → Διανομὴ ψυχῶν πρὸς ἀστέρες → Νόμοι εἱμαρμένης → Σωματικὴ γένεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS5","text":"Διπλὴ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις → Ἱεράρχησις γενῶν → Προτεραιότης τοῦ ἀνδρὸς ὡς κρείττονος γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AF1","text":"Γενεαλογικὴ γένεσις θεῶν → Ὅρος τῆς θεϊκῆς ἀθανασίας → Ἐγγύησις τοῦ δημιουργοῦ → Ἀνάγκη τῶν θνητῶν γενῶν → Καταμερισμὸς δημιουργίας → Κοσμικὴ διανομὴ ψυχῶν → Ἱεράρχησις τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1","text":"Ἡ θνητότης ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ στέρησις εἰς ἀναγκαῖον ὅρον τῆς κοσμικῆς πληρότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2","text":"Ἡ θεϊκὴ δημιουργία ἀνατέμνεται εἰς πρωταρχικὴν σύστασιν καὶ δευτερογενῆ μορφοποίησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀγέννητον φύσιν καὶ συνδέεται μὲ τὴν ἀνακλητὴν βούλησιν τοῦ δημιουργοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME4","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἄμορφον ἐσωτερικότητα εἰς ἀριθμημένην καὶ ἀστρολογικῶς τεταγμένην μονάδα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη διαφορά ἐντάσσεται εἰς κοσμολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν ἀντὶ νὰ παραμένῃ ἀνθρωπολογικῶς οὐδέτερος διαχωρισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφανειακὴ τάξις ἀποτελεῖται ἀπὸ γένεσιν θεῶν, κατασκευὴν ζῴων καὶ γένεσιν ἀνθρώπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT2","text":"Ἡ δομικὴ τάξις ἀποτελεῖται ἀπὸ καταμερισμὸν δημιουργικῆς ἐξουσίας, ἱεραρχικὴν ἐξάρτησιν καὶ εἱμαρμένην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT3","text":"Ἡ μεταστρατηγικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως ὡς ὅρου τῆς ὀρθῆς γενέσεως καὶ τῆς ὑπακοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT4","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ καὶ χρονικὴ τάξις νοεῖ τὸ εἶναι ὡς ἀκολουθίαν γενέσεως, δεσμοῦ, διανομῆς, αὐξήσεως καὶ φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT5","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία τοῦ κειμένου ἐνοποιεῖ τὸ ἀθάνατον καὶ τὸ θνητὸν διὰ προσυφάνσεως, οὐ διὰ ἐξισώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν θεογονίαν εἰς τὴν κοσμολογίαν καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς τὴν ἀνθρωπολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT3","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἐξάρτησιν τῶν γενητῶν ἀπὸ τὸν δημιουργόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἔντασις ἔγκειται ἐν τῷ ὅτι οἱ θεοὶ χαρακτηρίζονται λύσιμοι κατὰ φύσιν ἀλλ᾽ ἄλυτοι κατὰ βούλησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT5","text":"Δευτέρα ἔντασις ἔγκειται ἐν τῷ ὅτι ἡ θνητότης καθίσταται ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν τελειότητα, ἀλλὰ παραμένει κατώτερον ὑλικὸν τῆς θείας δημιουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἱεράρχησις ἐξάγεται ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμολογικὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ γέφυρα μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς εἱμαρμένης καὶ ἀξιολογικῆς ὑπεροχῆς μένει ἐλλιπῶς ἀποδεδειγμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ὡς ἀνωτάτης αἰτίας καὶ τῆς τελειότητος ὡς πληρότητος πάντων τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230436992489Z_afc68ce6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 41","source_sha256":"b1e4a2a2d2955dbd5b0eed68df6c1f08eda5b9393405e395751d52314aeb84e4","sha256":"a8ca0834090610a61152805cd80fcf6a00b1411946a028c6cc7cb19b8412dfc9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:04:36.996909+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS1","text":"Cosmic genesis is traced back to a genealogical order of gods and to a demiurgic will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS2","text":"The demiurge distinguishes what has been made from the ungenerated, and the dissoluble from the indissoluble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS3","text":"The gods generated by the demiurge are neither immortal in themselves nor altogether indissoluble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS4","text":"The perfection of the whole requires the generation of mortal kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS5","text":"Divine demiurgy provides the immortal part, while the gods weave together the mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS6","text":"The distribution of souls, the astral order, and the laws of fate render genesis hierarchical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AS7","text":"Human nature is divided in two, and its superior kind is called man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A1","text":"Everything that has come to be has a demiurgic cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","text":"Everything that is bound can be dissolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","text":"What has been well fitted together is not dissolved without the will of the one who fitted it together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A4","text":"Generated gods depend upon a stronger bond and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","text":"The perfection of the whole requires the presence of all kinds of living beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","text":"Mortal genesis must follow divine demiurgic power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","text":"Divine demiurgy provides seed and the principle of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A8","text":"The younger gods construct mortal bodies and nourish perishable life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","text":"Souls are distributed by number among the stars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","text":"Genesis is governed by common laws of fate and by distinct instruments of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:A11","text":"Human nature has a double constitution and a hierarchical differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX1","text":"Generated gods are not ungenerated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX2","text":"Generated gods are not immortal in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX3","text":"Generated gods are not altogether indissoluble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX4","text":"The dissolution of what has been well fitted together is not a good work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX5","text":"The perfect cannot remain without mortal kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX6","text":"Mortal genesis does not constitute unmixed divine demiurgy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX7","text":"The mortal does not have an autonomous principle, but is woven together with the immortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX8","text":"Not every soul is implanted indiscriminately in every body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:NX9","text":"Human nature does not have a simple and homogeneous form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D1","text":"The immortality of the gods is secured by the will of the demiurge and not by their own generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","CH_JP8E_S_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D2","text":"Demiurgic authority is divided into a primary divine constitution and a secondary production of mortals.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D3","text":"The completion of the cosmos transforms mortality from a deficiency into a necessary constituent of celestial perfection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","CH_JP8E_S_22:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D4","text":"The mortal living being constitutes a composite of an immortal principle and a perishable fabric.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A7","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D5","text":"The soul receives a cosmic position prior to embodied generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D6","text":"Human genesis is subject simultaneously to universal fate and to a particular instrument of generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:D7","text":"The hierarchy of human nature is inscribed within the cosmogonic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD1","text":"Cosmic subsistence is maintained through a hierarchical transmission of demiurgic power, from the first demiurge to the younger gods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1","CH_JP8E_S_22:A6","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD2","text":"Immortality does not signify absence of generation, but preservation by a superordinate bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A2","CH_JP8E_S_22:A3","CH_JP8E_S_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD3","text":"The cosmos becomes complete only when the divine order includes decay, nourishment, growth, and the response of the mortal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5","CH_JP8E_S_22:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD4","text":"Hierarchical cosmology transfers value from mere existence to order, obedience, and proportion to the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SD5","text":"Anthropology depends upon a pre-existing metaphysical distribution of souls, times, and bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9","CH_JP8E_S_22:A10","CH_JP8E_S_22:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX1","text":"Matter cannot be regarded as an independent co-creator of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX2","text":"Genesis cannot be interpreted as disorderly self-generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX3","text":"Mortality cannot be conceived as a mere failure of demiurgy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX4","text":"The lower gods cannot assume uncontrolled demiurgic sovereignty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX5","text":"The soul cannot exist outside cosmic arithmetic and order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX6","text":"Human difference cannot be disconnected from cosmological hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1","text":"There is no cosmos that would be perfect without mortal life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX2","text":"There is no god who would be automatically immortal by virtue of his generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3","text":"There is no genesis without intermediary, successor, and hierarchical dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX4","text":"There is no human nature without a preordained cosmic position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX5","text":"The idea that the mortal has value or meaning outside its admixture with the immortal is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS1","text":"Demiurgic cause → Generation of gods → Possible dissolution → Preservation through will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS2","text":"Imperfection of heaven → Necessity of mortal kinds → Apportionment of demiurgic works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS3","text":"Divine seed → Mortal fabric → Composite of living beings → Nourishment and decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS4","text":"Cosmic constitution → Distribution of souls among stars → Laws of fate → Bodily generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS5","text":"Double human nature → Hierarchization of kinds → Priority of the man as the superior kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:AF1","text":"Genealogical generation of gods → Condition of divine immortality → Guarantee of the demiurge → Necessity of mortal kinds → Division of demiurgy → Cosmic distribution of souls → Hierarchization of human nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1","text":"Mortality is reclassified from a privation into a necessary condition of cosmic completeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2","text":"Divine demiurgy is dissected into primary constitution and secondary formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME3","text":"Immortality is disconnected from ungenerated nature and connected with the revocable will of the demiurge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME4","text":"The soul is shifted from formless interiority into a numbered and astrally ordered unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ME5","text":"Human difference is incorporated into a cosmological hierarchy instead of remaining an anthropologically neutral distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT1","text":"The surface order consists of the generation of gods, the construction of living beings, and the generation of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT2","text":"The structural order consists of the division of demiurgic authority, hierarchical dependence, and fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT3","text":"The metastrategic order requires acceptance of the cosmic order as a condition of right generation and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT4","text":"The ontological and temporal order conceives being as a sequence of generation, bond, distribution, growth, and decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT5","text":"The ontology of the text unifies the immortal and the mortal through interweaving, not through equalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from theogony to cosmology and from the latter to anthropology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent with respect to the dependence of generated things upon the demiurge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT4","text":"The internal tension lies in the fact that the gods are characterized as dissoluble by nature but indissoluble by will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT5","text":"A second tension lies in the fact that mortality becomes necessary for perfection, yet remains inferior material of divine demiurgy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT6","text":"The human hierarchy is derived from the cosmological order, but the bridge between cosmic fate and evaluative superiority remains insufficiently demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends upon accepting the demiurge as the highest cause and perfection as the fullness of all kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_22@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_22:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 41"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 25","title":"Section 41","context":"Chapter 25","original_title":"Section 41","original_context":"Chapter 25"},"original_title":"Section 41","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23","layer":"CH","title":"Section 42","order":26,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_23"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_23@R001","sha256":"3634935404abbb3801826f358fa148e8f5aa4306ff953333e06fda7e142a04e1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἐνσάρκωσις τῆς ψυχῆς ἀναγκαίως γεννᾷ κοινὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ παθητικὰς κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS2","text":"Ἐκ τῆς συμπλοκῆς ἡδονῆς, λύπης, ἔρωτος, φόβου καὶ θυμοῦ ἡ ψυχὴ τίθεται ὑπὸ τὸ ἠθικὸν κριτήριον τοῦ κρατεῖν ἢ κρατεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἐπικράτησις τοῦ λογικοῦ ὑφίσταται δικαιοσύνην καὶ ἀνοδικήν ἐπάνοδον, ἡ δὲ ἧττα γεννᾷ ἀδικίαν καὶ μεταβολὰς εἰς χείρονας φύσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS4","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ ἐπανόρθωσις τελεῖται ὅταν ὁ λόγος κατακρατήσῃ τοῦ ἀλόγου πλήθους τῶν σωματικῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS5","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις διανέμει τὰς ψυχὰς καὶ παραδίδωσι τὴν θνητὴν κατασκευήν τοῖς νεωτέροις θεοῖς, ὥστε ἡ θεία αἰτία νὰ μὴ γένηται αἰτία τῆς ἑκάστης κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐνσωματουμένη ἀναγκαίως ὑφίσταται βιαίας σωματικὰς παθήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A2","text":"Ἐκ τῶν παθήσεων ἀναγκαίως γεννᾶται μία κοινὴ αἴσθησις τοῖς ἐνσωματουμένοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A3","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη συνιστῶσιν ἔρωτα, ὁ δὲ φόβος καὶ ὁ θυμὸς ἀκολουθοῦσιν ὡς ψυχικαὶ δυνάμεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","text":"Τὸ λογικὸν καὶ τὸ ἄλογον ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ δύνανται ἢ κρατεῖν ἢ κρατεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","text":"Ἡ τοῦ λογικοῦ ἐπικράτησις ὀνομάζεται δικαιοσύνη, ἡ δὲ ὑποταγὴ αὐτοῦ ἀδικία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A6","text":"Ὁ βίος ὁ κατὰ δικαιοσύνην τελεσθεὶς ἐπιστρέφει τὴν ψυχὴν εἰς τὴν οἰκείαν ἀστρικὴν οἴκησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","text":"Ἡ ἀποτυχία τῆς ψυχῆς ἐπιφέρει διαδοχικὰς μεταβολὰς εἰς γυναικείαν καὶ θηριώδη φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A8","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ εἰς χείρονα φύσιν παύεται μόνον διὰ τῆς ἐπικρατήσεως τοῦ λόγου ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀλόγου πλήθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A9","text":"Ὁ κόσμος περιέχει ἱεραρχικὴν σπορὰν ψυχῶν εἰς γῆν, σελήνην καὶ τὰ ἄλλα ὄργανα τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","text":"Οἱ νεώτεροι θεοὶ κατασκευάζουσι τὰ θνητὰ σώματα καὶ κυβερνῶσι τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον κατὰ δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A11","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῆς θείας δημιουργίας ἀποσυνδέει τὸν πρώτιστον δημιουργὸν ἀπὸ τὴν ἰδίαν αἰτιότητα τῶν ὕστερον κακῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A12","text":"Ὁ πρώτιστος δημιουργὸς μένει ἐν τῷ ἰδίῳ ἀγαθῷ ἤθει καὶ οὐ μεταβάλλεται μετὰ τὴν κοσμικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἐνσωμάτωσις οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπαθὴς κατάστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ καθαρὰν ἐλευθέραν πρόσληψιν, ἀλλὰ γεννᾶται ἐκ βιαίων παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κακία οὐκ ἀποδίδοται ἀμέσως τῷ πρώτῳ δημιουργῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἐνσώματος ζωὴ οὐκ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς τελικὴ καὶ ἀμετάβλητος μοῖρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἧττα τοῦ λόγου οὐκ ἐξισοῦται πρὸς ἁπλῆν ἀδρανῆ ἀποτυχίαν, ἀλλὰ μεταποιεῖ τὸ εἶδος τοῦ ζῶντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX6","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἀφήνει τὴν θνητὴν κακίαν ἄνευ αἰτιολογικῶν ὁρίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐνσωμάτωσις παράγει βιαίας παθήσεις καὶ κοινὴν αἴσθησιν, ἡ ἠθικὴ διαγωγὴ ἀναδύεται ἐν πεδίῳ σωματικῶν ἀναγκῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","CH_JP8E_S_23:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἡδονὴ, ἡ λύπη, ὁ ἔρως, ὁ φόβος καὶ ὁ θυμὸς ἐνεργοῦσιν ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ, ἡ δικαιοσύνη γίνεται ἔργον ἐσωτερικῆς κυριαρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A3","CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","CH_JP8E_S_23:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ δικαιοσύνη ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπικράτησιν τοῦ λόγου, ὁ ἀγαθὸς βίος ἔχει κοσμικὴν συνέπειαν, τὴν ἐπάνοδον εἰς τὸ ἀστρικὸν οἰκεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀδικία ἐστὶν ἧττα τοῦ λόγου, ἡ ψυχὴ καθίσταται ὑποκείμενον μορφολογικῆς ὑποβιβάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνάκαμψις ἀπαιτεῖ λογικὴν κυριαρχίαν, ἡ σωτηρία ἔχει χαρακτῆρα ἐπαναγωγῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλῆς ἀπαλλαγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ θνητὴ κατασκευή παραδίδοται τοῖς νεωτέροις θεοῖς, ἡ κοσμικὴ αἰτιότης διαιρεῖται μεταξὺ πρώτης τάξεως καὶ δευτέρας κατασκευῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A9","CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","CH_JP8E_S_23:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ τάξις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κοσμικὴν ὀντολογίαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀρετὴ καὶ ἡ κακία μεταβάλλουσι τὸ εἶδος τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2","text":"Ὁ χρόνος λειτουργεῖ ὡς μηχανισμὸς ἐπαναληπτικῆς κρίσεως, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ψυχὴ περιφέρεται μέχρις οὗ ὁ λόγος ἀναλάβῃ τὴν κυριαρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A6","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ πολλαπλότης ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἄλογον πλήθος ὃ δεῖ συνταχθῆναι ὑπὸ τῆς ταὐτοῦ καὶ ὁμοίου περιόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀπολογία τοῦ πρώτου δημιουργοῦ στηρίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν κατανομήν, ἣ μεταθέτει τὴν διαχείρισιν τοῦ θνητοῦ κακοῦ εἰς κατωτέρας θείας ἀρχάς καὶ εἰς τὴν ψυχὴν αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","CH_JP8E_S_23:A11","CH_JP8E_S_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα δὲν δύναται νὰ θεωρηθῇ ὡς ἁπλοῦν περίβλημα ἀδιάφορον πρὸς τὴν ψυχικήν κρίσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX2","text":"Ἡ κακία δὲν ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἔξωθεν ἀρχὴ ἰσόκυρος τῷ δημιουργικῷ ἀγαθῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ δὲν ἀπαλλάσσεται ἀπὸ τὴν εὐθύνην διὰ μόνης τῆς ἐπικλήσεως τῆς σωματικῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δὲν νοεῖται ὡς ἄπαξ ὁλοκληρωθεῖσα, ἀλλὰ περιέχει διαρκῆ κύκλον ἐκπτώσεως καὶ ἀνατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ σωματικὴ ὕλη ἀποτελεῖ τελικὴν καὶ αὐτόνομον αἰτίαν τοῦ κακοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἠθικὴ κρίσις ἄνευ ἐσωτερικῆς ἱεραρχίας μεταξὺ λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἀμετάκλητος ἀποξένωσις τῆς ψυχῆς ἀπὸ τὸ ἀρχέγονον εἶδος αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS1","text":"Ἐνσωμάτωσις → βίαια πάθη → κοινὴ αἴσθησις καὶ ὀρέξεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS2","text":"Ὀρέξεις καὶ θυμοειδεῖς κινήσεις → σύγκρουσις λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου → δικαιοσύνη ἢ ἀδικία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS3","text":"Δικαιοσύνη → ἐπάνοδος εἰς τὴν ἀστρικὴν οἴκησιν· ἀδικία → διαδοχικὴ ζωικὴ μεταβολή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4","text":"Ἀνακύκλησις πόνων → ἐπικράτησις τοῦ λόγου ἐπὶ τοῦ σωματικοῦ πλήθους → ἐπιστροφὴ εἰς τὸ πρῶτον ἄριστον εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS5","text":"Πρώτη θεία διάταξις → σπορὰ ψυχῶν → θνητὴ κατασκευή ὑπὸ νεωτέρων θεῶν → περιορισμὸς τῆς πρώτης θείας αἰτιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AF1","text":"Ἐνσωμάτωσις → παθητικὴ αἴσθησις → ἐσωτερικὴ σύγκρουσις → ἠθικὴ κυριαρχία → μεταθανάτιος μορφολογικὴ κρίσις → ἐπάνοδος ἢ ἐκφυλισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ἀξιολόγησις μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν πράξιν εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν σχέσιν λόγου καὶ παθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ κυκλικῆς ἀλληλεξαρτήσεως παθήσεως, κρίσεως καὶ μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME3","text":"Ἡ μεταθανάτιος μοίρα ταξινομεῖται ὡς συνέχεια τῆς ἠθικῆς μορφῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ ἀμοιβὴ ἢ τιμωρία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME4","text":"Ἡ θεολογικὴ αἰτιότης διαιρείται, ὥστε ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου νὰ συνυπάρχῃ μετὰ τῆς ἀτομικῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ἀντικείμενον εἶναι ἡ γένεσις τῆς ἐνσώματης αἰσθήσεως καὶ τῶν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ψυχὴ ὀργανώνεται ὡς πεδίον ἱεραρχικῆς συγκρούσεως λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ σωτηρία ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται ὡς ἄσκησις κυριαρχίας ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐσωτερικοῦ πλήθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ χρόνος γίνεται κύκλος μορφολογικῆς ἐκπτώσεως καὶ ἐπιστροφῆς πρὸς τὸ ὅμοιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκούσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνσωμάτωσιν μέχρι τὴν ἐπάνοδον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκριση μεταξὺ σωματικῆς ἀνάγκης, ψυχικῆς εὐθύνης καὶ θείας αἰτιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῶν ἐπιμέρους μεταβολῶν εἰς τὰς γυναικείας καὶ θηριώδεις φύσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν ἀναλογίαν μεταξὺ ἠθικῆς κυριαρχίας καὶ κοσμικῆς ἐπανόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαιότητος τῶν σωματικῶν παθημάτων καὶ τῆς ἀποδόσεως τῆς κακίας εἰς τὴν ψυχικὴν ἧτταν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230454343991Z_479d3005","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 42","source_sha256":"3634935404abbb3801826f358fa148e8f5aa4306ff953333e06fda7e142a04e1","sha256":"548c40ec71bc58c3251bd586057d27ad9311d0f43a7f69cdc7c64ef7025b5b98","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:04:54.346442+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS1","text":"The embodiment of the soul necessarily generates common sensation and affective motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS2","text":"From the interweaving of pleasure, pain, desire, fear, and anger, the soul is placed under the ethical criterion of ruling or being ruled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS3","text":"The predominance of the rational establishes justice and an upward return, whereas defeat generates injustice and transformations into worse natures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS4","text":"Cyclical restoration is accomplished when reason gains mastery over the irrational multitude of bodily elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AS5","text":"The cosmic order apportions souls and entrusts the mortal construction to the younger gods, so that the divine cause may not become the cause of each particular evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","text":"The soul, upon becoming embodied, necessarily undergoes violent bodily affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A2","text":"From the affections there necessarily arises one common sensation for those becoming embodied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A3","text":"Pleasure and pain constitute desire, while fear and anger follow as psychic powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","text":"The rational and the irrational in the soul are able either to rule or to be ruled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","text":"The predominance of the rational is called justice, while its subjection is injustice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A6","text":"The life brought to completion in accordance with justice returns the soul to its proper astral dwelling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","text":"The soul's failure brings successive transformations into female and beastly nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A8","text":"Transformation into a worse nature ceases only through the predominance of reason over the irrational multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A9","text":"The cosmos contains a hierarchical sowing of souls into earth, moon, and the other instruments of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","text":"The younger gods construct mortal bodies and govern the mortal living being according to their power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A11","text":"The division of divine creation disconnects the primary creator from his own causality of subsequent evils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:A12","text":"The primary creator remains in his own good character and does not change after the cosmic arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX1","text":"Embodiment is not an impassible state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX2","text":"Sensation does not constitute a pure free reception, but arises from violent affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX3","text":"Moral evil is not immediately attributed to the first creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX4","text":"Embodied life is not recognized as a final and unchangeable lot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX5","text":"The defeat of reason is not equated with mere inert failure, but transforms the form of the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:NX6","text":"The order of the cosmos does not leave mortal evil without causal limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D1","text":"Since embodiment produces violent affections and common sensation, ethical conduct emerges in a field of bodily necessities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","CH_JP8E_S_23:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D2","text":"Since pleasure, pain, desire, fear, and anger operate in the soul, justice becomes a work of inner mastery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A3","CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","CH_JP8E_S_23:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D3","text":"Since justice depends on the predominance of reason, the good life has a cosmic consequence: return to the astral home.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D4","text":"Since injustice is the defeat of reason, the soul becomes subject to morphological degradation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D5","text":"Since return requires rational mastery, salvation has the character of a leading-back and not of mere release.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:D6","text":"Since mortal construction is entrusted to the younger gods, cosmic causality is divided between the first order and secondary construction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A9","CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","CH_JP8E_S_23:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1","text":"The ethical order is transformed into cosmic ontology, since virtue and vice alter the form of the soul and of the living being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2","text":"Time functions as a mechanism of repeated judgment, in which the soul revolves until reason resumes mastery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A6","CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD3","text":"Bodily multiplicity is interpreted as an irrational multitude which must be ordered by the revolution of the Same and the Similar.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A1","CH_JP8E_S_23:A4","CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SD4","text":"The defense of the first creator rests on a hierarchical distribution, which transfers the management of mortal evil to lower divine principles and to the soul itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A10","CH_JP8E_S_23:A11","CH_JP8E_S_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX1","text":"The body cannot be regarded as a simple covering indifferent to psychic judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX2","text":"Evil is not explained as an external principle equal in force to the creative good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX3","text":"The soul is not released from responsibility by the invocation of bodily necessity alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4","text":"The cosmic order is not conceived as completed once and for all, but contains a continuous cycle of decline and restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a cosmos in which bodily matter constitutes a final and autonomous cause of evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX2","text":"Excluded is ethical judgment without an internal hierarchy between reason and the irrational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an irrevocable estrangement of the soul from its original form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS1","text":"Embodiment → violent affections → common sensation and appetites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS2","text":"Appetites and spirited motions → conflict of reason and the irrational → justice or injustice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS3","text":"Justice → return to the astral dwelling; injustice → successive animal transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4","text":"Recurrence of sufferings → predominance of reason over the bodily multitude → return to the first best form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS5","text":"First divine arrangement → sowing of souls → mortal construction by younger gods → limitation of first divine causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:AF1","text":"Embodiment → affective sensation → internal conflict → ethical mastery → post-mortem morphological judgment → return or degeneration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1","text":"Ethical evaluation shifts from the simple act to the internal relation of reason and affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME2","text":"The opposition of soul and body is replaced by a cyclical interdependence of affection, judgment, and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME3","text":"The post-mortem lot is classified as a continuation of ethical form and not as an external reward or punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ME4","text":"Theological causality is divided, so that the order of the cosmos may coexist with individual responsibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the object is the genesis of embodied sensation and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the soul is organized as a field of hierarchical conflict between reason and the irrational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, salvation is redefined as the exercise of mastery over the inner multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, time becomes a cycle of morphological decline and return toward the similar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from embodiment to return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction between bodily necessity, psychic responsibility, and divine causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT3","text":"The precise manner of the individual transformations into female and beastly natures is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT4","text":"Internal coherence rests on the analogy between ethical mastery and cosmic return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT5","text":"The principal tension remains between the necessity of bodily affections and the attribution of evil to psychic defeat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_23:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_23@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_23:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 42"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 26","title":"Section 42","context":"Chapter 26","original_title":"Section 42","original_context":"Chapter 26"},"original_title":"Section 42","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24","layer":"CH","title":"Section 43","order":27,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_24"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_24@R001","sha256":"f9012739698738294df8ce54790f143912a808588e06560b7d292e475426fb16","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS1","text":"Ἡ νεωτέρα δημιουργία μεταφέρει τὴν πατρικὴν τάξιν εἰς θνητὰ ζῷα διὰ μιμήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS2","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα συγκροτεῖται ἐκ κοσμικῶν στοιχείων δανεισθέντων καὶ πάλιν ἀποδοθησομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχὴ ἐνδεῖται εἰς σῶμα ῥεῦστόν τε καὶ παθητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS4","text":"Αἱ ἐξωτερικαὶ προσβολαὶ διὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχὴν φερόμεναι γεννῶσι τὰς αἰσθήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS5","text":"Ἡ σφοδρότης τῶν αἰσθήσεων ἐμποδίζει τὴν ταὐτοῦ περίοδον καὶ διασείει τὴν θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS6","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ ἀταξία παράγεται ὡς παραμόρφωσις τῶν ἀρχικῶς δεδεμένων κύκλων ὑπὸ σωματικῶν ῥευμάτων καὶ παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS7","text":"Τὸ ἔμβιον ὅλον κινεῖται, ἀλλʼ οὔτε ἄρχει τῆς κινήσεως οὔτε ἔχει ἔλλογον κατεύθυνσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A1","text":"Οἱ παῖδες δημιουργοὶ μιμοῦνται τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς δημιουργικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A2","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα συνίσταται ἐκ πυρός, γῆς, ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος λαμβανομένων ἀπὸ τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A3","text":"Τὰ συστατικὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰσάγονται ὡς δάνεια ἀποδοθησόμενα πάλιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","text":"Οἱ δεσμοὶ τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος εἰσὶν ἀόρατοι καὶ πυκνοί, ἀλλʼ οὐκ ἄλυτοι κατὰ τὸν τρόπον τῶν δεσμῶν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","text":"Αἱ περίοδοι τῆς ἀθανάτου ψυχῆς ἐντίθενται εἰς ῥέον καὶ ἀπορρέον σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ὑπόκειται ἀεὶ εἰς ἐξωτερικὰς προσβολὰς πυρός, γῆς, ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","text":"Αἱ σωματικαὶ κινήσεις μεταφέρονται διὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A8","text":"Αἱ κινήσεις αἱ φερόμεναι εἰς τὴν ψυχὴν καλοῦνται αἰσθήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","text":"Αἱ αἰσθήσεις ἰσχυρότατα κινοῦσαι τὴν ψυχήν ἐναντιοῦνται τῇ περιόδῳ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","text":"Αἱ αἰσθήσεις διασείουσαι τὴν περίοδον τοῦ θατέρου στρέφουσι καὶ διαφθείρουσι τοὺς ἐν αὐτῇ κύκλους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A11","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον ἔχει πάσας τὰς ἓξ κινήσεις, ἄνευ ἔλλογου τάξεως καὶ κατευθύνσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX1","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα οὐ συνδέεται τοῖς ἀλύτοις δεσμοῖς οἷς ἡ ψυχὴ συνέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX2","text":"Ἡ σύστασις τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτόχθων ἢ αὐτάρκης, ἀλλὰ δανειακή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ κίνησις οὔτε κρατεῖ οὔτε κρατεῖται ὑπὸ τῶν ψυχικῶν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX4","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐκ ἔστιν ἀμέτοχος μετάδοσις ἐξωτερικοῦ πράγματος, ἀλλὰ σωματικὴ κίνησις εἰς ψυχὴν προσπίπτουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX5","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ ζῴου οὐκ ἔχει μίαν φυσικὴν κατεύθυνσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἐνσωμάτωσις οὐ διατηρεῖ ἀκέραιον τὸν ἐν ψυχῇ ρυθμὸν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία οὐκ ἀπουσιάζει κινήσεως, ἀλλὰ συνίσταται ἐν κινήσει ἀλόγως φερομένῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D1","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ σωματικότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν ἀπόληψιν καὶ ἀπόδοσιν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A2","CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D2","text":"Ἡ ῥευστότης τοῦ σώματος καθιστᾷ τὴν ψυχὴν δεκτικὴν συνεχοῦς ἐξωτερικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D3","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποτελεῖ μετάδοσιν πάθους ἀπὸ τὸ περιβάλλον διὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D4","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ὄχλησις ἐμποδίζει τὴν ψυχὴν ἀπὸ τοῦ αὐτομάτου ἄρχειν τῶν περιόδων αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D5","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις τῶν ψυχικῶν κύκλων παράγεται ὑπὸ κινήσεων αἳ κατὰ δύναμιν συνέχονται, ἀλλὰ κατὰ λόγον οὐ συνέχονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D6","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν κατευθύνσεων καθιστᾷ τὴν ἐμπειρίαν ἀσταθῆ καὶ ἀμφίσημον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἐνσώματος ψυχὴ ἀποτελεῖ πεδίον συγκρούσεως μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς μαθηματικῆς τάξεως καὶ ἀλόγου σωματικῆς ῥοῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐ προστίθεται ἔξωθεν τῇ ψυχικῇ ζωῇ, ἀλλὰ μετασχηματίζει ἐνεργῶς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν κυκλικότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A8","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ ἐνέργεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ δεσμοὺς οἵτινες παρέχουσι συνοχήν, οὐχὶ δὲ αὐτοκυβέρνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία τοῦ ζῴου εἶναι παραγόμενον ἀντιθέτων ῥοῶν, οὐκ ἁπλῆ ἀπουσία ρυθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθεύει ὅτι ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχὴ, ἐνσωματωθεῖσα, διατηρεῖ ἀνεμπόδιστον τὸν ἴδιον νόμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθεύει ὅτι τὸ σῶμα εἶναι παθητικὸν δοχεῖον ἄνευ ἐνεργοῦ ἐπιδράσεως ἐπὶ τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθεύει ὅτι ἡ κίνησις καθʼ ἑαυτὴν δηλοῖ τάξιν ἢ σκοπόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθεύει ὅτι ἡ ψυχικὴ ἑνότης ἀρκεί πρὸς ἀναχαίτισιν τῶν σωματικῶν προσβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀληθεύει ὅτι ἡ ἀντίληψις ἔχει ἁπλῆν κατεύθυνσιν ἀπὸ ἀντικειμένου εἰς γνωρίζοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἐνσώματος ψυχὴ δύναται ἀδιαταράκτως νὰ ἐπαναλάβῃ τὴν ἀρχικήν της τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις μεταξὺ ψυχικῆς κινήσεως καὶ σωματικοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου ἡ ἐγγύησις ὅτι ἡ πολλαπλὴ κίνησις ἀναχθήσεται εἰς ἕνα λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX4","text":"Τὸ ἀπαραβίαστον τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἑνότητος τῆς ψυχῆς μένει ἀδύνατον ἐντὸς τῆς σωματικῆς ῥοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS1","text":"Δημιουργικὴ μίμησις → δανεισμὸς στοιχείων → θνητὴ σύνθεσις σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS2","text":"Ἀθάνατοι ψυχικοὶ κύκλοι → ἔνδεσις εἰς ῥευστὸν σῶμα → ἔκθεσις εἰς προσβολάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ προσβολή → σωματικὴ κίνησις → μετάδοσις εἰς ψυχήν → αἴσθησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4","text":"Ἐντατικὴ αἴσθησις → παρεμπόδισις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ → διάσεισις τοῦ θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS5","text":"Διάσεισις κύκλων → στροφαί, κλάσεις καὶ φθοραί → ἀλόγως συνεχομένη κίνησις τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS6","text":"Πολλαπλὴ ἀκανόνιστος κίνησις → ἀπώλεια προσανατολισμοῦ → ἀμφίδρομος καὶ ἀντεστραμμένη φαντασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF1","text":"Κοσμικὴ τάξις → μιμητικὴ δημιουργία → δανειακὴ σωματικότης → ἐνσωμάτωσις ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF2","text":"Ῥευστὸν σῶμα → ἐξωτερικαὶ προσβολαί → αἰσθητικὴ μετάδοσις → ψυχικὴ διάσεισις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF3","text":"Ψυχικοὶ κύκλοι → παρεμπόδισις καὶ διασάλευσις → ἀλόγιστος ἑξακίνησις → ἀναστροφὴ τῶν φαινομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ γνωστικὴν λήψιν εἰς μεταδοτικὴν σωματοψυχικὴν κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ παραμόρφωσις δεσμῶν καὶ κύκλων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἔλλειψις κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἐνεργὸς μηχανισμὸς ψυχικῆς διαταράξεως, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλοῦν περίβλημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κύκλον ἀμοιβαίας μεταδόσεως κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ δεξιῶν καὶ ἀριστερῶν ἀποκαλύπτει τὴν σχετικότητα τῆς φαντασίας πρὸς τὴν σωματικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Τὸ ζῷον κινεῖται πρὸς πᾶσαν τὰς ἓξ κατευθύνσεις ἄνευ σταθερᾶς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ σωματικὴ ῥοὴ καὶ αἱ ἐξωτερικαὶ προσβολαὶ διαταράσσουσι τοὺς ψυχικοὺς κύκλους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἀντίληψις πρέπει νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς πεδίον μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀμέσος καθρέπτης τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχὴ ἐν χρόνῳ καὶ ῥοῇ σώματος ὑφίσταται διάστασιν μεταξὺ κυκλικῆς τάξεως καὶ παροδικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκούσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς παραγωγῆς ἀπὸ τὴν δημιουργίαν τοῦ σώματος μέχρι τὴν διασάλευσιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου διατηρεῖ τὸ μαθηματικὸν ὑπόβαθρον τῆς ψυχικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT3","text":"Ἡ σχέσις ἀναλογιῶν, μεσοτήτων καὶ κύκλων μένει μερικῶς ἀνενεργὸς ἐὰν ἀφαιρεθῇ ἡ προγενεστέρα κοσμολογικὴ κατασκευή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικό ὡς σύνδεσις κοσμικῆς τάξεως, σωματικῆς ῥοῆς καὶ ψυχικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κυριωτέρα ἔντασις ἔγκειται ἐν τῷ ὅτι ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχή, ἡ ὁποία φέρει ἐντός της τάξιν, δύναται ὅμως ὑπὸ τοῦ σώματος νὰ ἐμποδισθῇ καὶ νὰ διασπασθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ὑποdetermined τὸν τρόπον καθʼ ὃν ἡ ψυχὴ ἀνακτᾷ τὴν ἀρχικὴν αὐτῆς τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230513056093Z_744b701d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 43","source_sha256":"f9012739698738294df8ce54790f143912a808588e06560b7d292e475426fb16","sha256":"8c308ac8b15568f86637284e356f160bff2a5ce7ff515efc11db71a184745c4d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:05:13.059618+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS1","text":"The later creation conveys the paternal order into mortal living beings through imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS2","text":"The mortal body is constituted from cosmic elements borrowed and to be returned again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS3","text":"The immortal soul is bound into a body both flowing and subject to affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS4","text":"External impacts, conveyed through the body into the soul, generate sensations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS5","text":"The intensity of sensations impedes the circuit of the Same and shakes that of the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS6","text":"Psychic disorder is produced as a deformation of the circles originally bound together by bodily flows and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AS7","text":"The living whole moves, but neither governs its movement nor possesses rational direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A1","text":"The child creators imitate the father's creative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A2","text":"The mortal body consists of fire, earth, water, and air taken from the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A3","text":"The constituents of the body are introduced as loans to be returned again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","text":"The bonds of the mortal body are invisible and dense, but not indissoluble in the manner of the bonds by which the soul is held together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","text":"The circuits of the immortal soul are set into a flowing and outflowing body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","text":"The body is always subject to external impacts of fire, earth, water, and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","text":"Bodily movements are conveyed through the body into the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A8","text":"The movements conveyed into the soul are called sensations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","text":"Sensations moving the soul most forcefully oppose the circuit of the Same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","text":"Sensations shaking the circuit of the Different twist and corrupt the circles within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:A11","text":"The mortal living being has all six motions, without rational order and direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX1","text":"The mortal body is not joined by the indissoluble bonds by which the soul is held together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX2","text":"The constitution of the body is not indigenous or self-sufficient, but borrowed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX3","text":"Bodily movement neither governs nor is governed by the psychic circuits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX4","text":"Sensation is not an uninvolved transmission of an external thing, but a bodily movement impinging upon the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX5","text":"The movement of the living being does not have one natural direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX6","text":"Embodiment does not preserve intact the rhythm within the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:NX7","text":"Disorder is not an absence of movement, but consists in movement borne irrationally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D1","text":"Mortal corporeality depends on the reciprocal taking and returning of the elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A2","CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D2","text":"The fluidity of the body renders the soul receptive to continuous external disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D3","text":"Sensation constitutes a transmission of affection from the surrounding environment through the body into the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D4","text":"External disturbance prevents the soul from automatically governing its own circuits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D5","text":"The dissolution of the psychic circles is produced by movements that are held together in power, but are not held together in reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:D6","text":"The multiplicity of directions renders experience unstable and ambiguous.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1","text":"The embodied soul constitutes a field of conflict between cosmic mathematical order and irrational bodily flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2","text":"Sensation is not added externally to psychic life, but actively transforms internal circularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7","CH_JP8E_S_24:A8","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3","text":"Mortal activity depends on bonds that provide cohesion, but not self-government.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4","text":"The disorder of the living being is a product of contrary flows, not a simple absence of rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A6","CH_JP8E_S_24:A9","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10","CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX1","text":"It is not true that the immortal soul, once embodied, preserves its own law unimpeded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX2","text":"It is not true that the body is a passive receptacle without active influence upon the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX3","text":"It is not true that movement in itself signifies order or purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX4","text":"It is not true that psychic unity suffices to ward off bodily impacts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX5","text":"It is not true that perception has a simple direction from object to knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX1","text":"A world in which the embodied soul can undisturbedly recover its original order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX2","text":"The absolute distinction between psychic movement and bodily affection is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX3","text":"There is absent from the mortal living being any guarantee that multiple movement will be reduced to one account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX4","text":"The inviolability of the soul's internal unity remains impossible within bodily flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS1","text":"Creative imitation → borrowing of elements → mortal composition of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS2","text":"Immortal psychic circles → binding into a fluid body → exposure to impacts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3","text":"External impact → bodily movement → transmission into the soul → sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4","text":"Intense sensation → impediment of the Same → shaking of the Different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS5","text":"Shaking of circles → turnings, bendings, and corruptions → irrationally held-together movement of the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS6","text":"Multiple irregular movement → loss of orientation → reciprocal and inverted imagination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF1","text":"Cosmic order → imitative creation → borrowed corporeality → embodiment of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF2","text":"Fluid body → external impacts → sensory transmission → psychic shaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:AF3","text":"Psychic circles → impediment and disturbance → irrational sixfold motion → reversal of appearances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1","text":"Sensation is reclassified from cognitive reception into a transmissive body-soul movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME2","text":"Disorder appears as an internal deformation of bonds and circles, not as a simple lack of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3","text":"The body is recognized as an active mechanism of psychic disturbance, not as a mere covering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4","text":"The opposition between internal and external is transformed into a cycle of reciprocal transmission of movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ME5","text":"The reversal of right and left reveals the relativity of imagination to bodily arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The living being moves in all six directions without stable order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Bodily flow and external impacts disturb the psychic circles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Perception must be understood as a field of transformation and not as an immediate mirror of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The immortal soul, in time and the flow of the body, undergoes a tension between circular order and transient disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the basic derivation from the creation of the body to the disturbance of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT2","text":"The distinction between the Same and the Different preserves the mathematical basis of psychic disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT3","text":"The relation of proportions, means, and circles remains partially inactive if the earlier cosmological construction is removed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT4","text":"The system is internally coherent as a connection of cosmic order, bodily flow, and psychic disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT5","text":"The chief tension lies in the fact that the immortal soul, which bears order within itself, can nevertheless be impeded and broken apart by the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument, but leaves underdetermined the manner in which the soul recovers its original order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_24@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_24:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 43"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 27","title":"Section 43","context":"Chapter 27","original_title":"Section 43","original_context":"Chapter 27"},"original_title":"Section 43","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25","layer":"CH","title":"Section 44","order":28,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_25"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_25@R001","sha256":"da9f6799d302704724cc17b12d0a2c0593b5a2a994163abf4901b916a13390a5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ὅταν σώματι θνητῷ συνδεθῇ, ἀρχικῶς ἄνους καὶ ἀτάκτως κινεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS2","text":"Αἱ ἔξωθεν αἰσθήσεις τὰς ψυχικὰς περιφορὰς κρατοῦσαι τὴν ἑαυτῶν κυριαρχίαν ἐμφανίζουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS3","text":"Ἡ διαταραχὴ συγχέει τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ θάτερον καὶ ψευδεῖς κρίσεις γεννᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τὰς περιφορὰς γαληνεύει καὶ πρὸς τὴν κατὰ φύσιν τάξιν ἐπαναφέρει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS5","text":"Ἡ παιδεία τὴν φυσικὴν ἀποκατάστασιν συμπληροῦσα τὴν ψυχὴν ὁλόκληρον καὶ ὑγιῆ ἀποτελεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS6","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ καὶ τὸ σῶμα ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ θείας προνοίας, ἣ τὴν κεφαλὴν φορέα τῶν θείων περιόδων καὶ ἄρχουσαν τοῦ σώματος καθίστησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","text":"Ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ δύο θεῖαι περιφοραὶ διακρίνονται, ἡ τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ἡ τοῦ θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","text":"Ἡ συνάφεια τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα διαταράσσει τὴν ἐγγενῆ τάξιν τῶν περιφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","text":"Αἱ ἔξωθεν αἰσθήσεις δύνανται τὸ σύνολον τῆς ψυχῆς συνεπισπᾶσθαι καὶ κρατεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","text":"Ἡ διαταραχὴ τῶν περιφορῶν καταργεῖ προσωρινῶς τὴν ἐν αὐταῖς ἡγεμονίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A5","text":"Ἡ διαταραχὴ συγχεῖ τὰς κρίσεις περὶ ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","text":"Ὁ χρόνος δύναται τὰς περιφορὰς ἐκ τῆς ταραχῆς εἰς γαλήνην ἐπαναφέρειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐπανόρθωσις τῶν περιφορῶν καθιστᾷ τὸν ἔχοντα αὐτὰς ἔμφρονα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A8","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ τροφὴ τῆς παιδεύσεως ἀναγκαία ἐστὶν εἰς τὴν πλήρη ψυχικὴν ὑγείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ σφαιροειδὴς οὖσα ἐνσωματοῖ τὰς θείας περιόδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A10","text":"Τὸ λοιπὸν σῶμα ὑπηρεσίαν παρέχει τῇ κεφαλῇ, ἣ τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν δεσπόζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια τὸ σῶμα ὡς ὄχημα καὶ εὐπορίαν τῇ κεφαλῇ συνέστησεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἐνσώματος ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔστιν ἐξ ἀρχῆς ἔμφρων καὶ τεταγμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX2","text":"Αἱ αἰσθήσεις οὐκ εἰσὶν ἁπλῶς ὄργανα ἀληθοῦς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX3","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ κίνησις οὐ ταὐτίζεται ἀναγκαίως τῇ κατὰ φύσιν περιόδῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἡσυχία τῶν περιφορῶν οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ἄνευ παιδευτικῆς τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX5","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἔχει τὴν κυρίαν ἀρχὴν τοῦ ἐν ἡμῖν ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX6","text":"Ἡ παραμέλησις τῆς παιδεύσεως οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀδιάφορον βιοτικὴν ἐπιλογήν, ἀλλὰ ψυχικὴν ἀτέλειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐνσώματος ζωή ἀρχίζει ὡς κατάσταση ἐσωτερικῆς ἀκυβερνησίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","CH_JP8E_S_25:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D2","text":"Ὅταν αἱ αἰσθήσεις συμπαρασύρωσι τὴν ψυχήν, ἡ ἐπικρατοῦσα δύναμις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἡττημένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D3","text":"Ἡ σύγχυσις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ καὶ τοῦ θατέρου μετατρέπει τὴν ψυχικὴν κίνησιν εἰς ψευδῆ κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_25:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D4","text":"Ἡ πάροδος τοῦ χρόνου λειτουργεῖ ὡς μηχανισμὸς ἐπανατάξεως τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D5","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπαναφοράν τῶν περιφορῶν εἰς τὴν φυσικὴν ὁδόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D6","text":"Ἡ παιδεία μεταβάλλει τὴν φυσικὴν ἀποκατάστασιν εἰς ὁλοκληρωμένην ὑγείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D7","text":"Ἡ ἀμέλεια τῆς παιδεύσεως διατηρεῖ τὴν ψυχὴν ἐν καταστάσει ἀτελείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D8","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ τῆς κεφαλῆς ἀντιστοιχεῖ πρὸς τὴν κυκλικὴν φύσιν τῶν θείων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","CH_JP8E_S_25:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D9","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις ὑποτάσσεται λειτουργικῶς τῇ ψυχικῇ ἀρχῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A10","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη νόσος νοεῖται πρωτίστως ὡς ἀποδιοργάνωσις τῆς ψυχικῆς κυβερνήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ σωματικὴ βλάβη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","CH_JP8E_S_25:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς παιδεία ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἐπανεκπαίδευσις τῶν ψυχικῶν κινήσεων πρὸς τὴν οἰκείαν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπολογία συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχία, ἐν ᾗ ἡ κεφαλὴ ἄρχει, τὸ σῶμα ὑπηρετεῖ, καὶ αἱ αἰσθήσεις ἀπειλοῦσι τὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη τελείωσις ἀπαιτεῖ σύμπραξιν φύσεως, χρόνου, παιδείας καὶ θείας μορφοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἔξοδος ἐκ τῆς ψυχικῆς συγχύσεως εἶναι διαδικασία ἀνακατασκευῆς τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἡγεμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐ θεωρεῖται ἀνεξάρτητος καὶ αὐτάρκης ἀρχὴ νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἐνσώματος κατάσταση οὐ θεωρεῖται φυσικῶς ἰσορροπημένη ἀπὸ τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἁπλῆ ἀσώματος ἐνέργεια ἀποχωρισμένη ἀπὸ συγκεκριμένας κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐπανόρθωσις οὐ θεωρεῖται αὐτόματος καὶ ὁριστικὴ χωρίς ἀγωγὴν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX5","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἑνότητα οὐ συνιστᾷ αὐτοτελῆ ὀντολογικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη εὐτυχία οὐ δύναται νὰ ὁρισθῇ ἀνεξαρτήτως τῆς ψυχικῆς τελειώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ σωματικὴ ἐμπειρία καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια συμπίπτουσιν ἄνευ μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἀνθρώπου ὃς ἄνευ παιδείας ἀποκτᾷ πλήρη φρόνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰσοτιμία ψυχικῆς κυβερνήσεως καὶ αἰσθητικῆς παρασυρμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀπὸ τὸ σύστημα ἡ δυνατότης ἀσώματου ἢ ἀδομήτου ἀνθρώπου· ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναγκαστικῶς ἐνσωματοῦται καὶ ὑπομένει κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐλευθερία ὡς αὐτοθέσπισις ἄνευ φυσικῆς καὶ παιδευτικῆς τάξεως παραμένει ἀδιανόητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS1","text":"Θεῖαι περιφοραὶ → ἐνσώματος σύνδεσις → ἐξωτερικὴ αἴσθησις → συμπαράσυρσις τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS2","text":"Συμπαράσυρσις → κατάλυσις ἐσωτερικῆς ἡγεμονίας → σύγχυσις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου → ψευδὴς κρίσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS3","text":"Παρέλευσις χρόνου → γαλήνευσις περιφορῶν → ἐπαναφορά εἰς τὴν κατὰ φύσιν ὁδόν → γένεσις φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS4","text":"Φυσικὴ ἐπανόρθωσις + ὀρθὴ παιδεία → ὁλόκληρος καὶ ὑγιὴς ψυχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS5","text":"Ἀμέλεια παιδείας → ἀτελὴς βίος → ἀνόητος ἐπιστροφή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS6","text":"Θεία πρόνοια → σφαιροειδὴς κεφαλή → ἐνσωμάτωσις θείων κινήσεων → ἡγεμονία κεφαλῆς ἐπὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1","text":"Ἐνσώματος διαταραχή → αἰσθητικὸς παρασυρμός → σύγχυσις κρίσεων → χρονικὴ γαλήνευσις → φυσικὴ ἐπανόρθωσις → παιδευτικὴ τελείωσις → κεφαλὴ ὡς ἔδρα θείας ἡγεμονίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἀφροσύνη ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἠθικὸν ἐλάττωμα εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα ἐνσώματης διαταραχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ πηγήν βεβαίας γνώσεως εἰς δύναμιν συμπαρασυρμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME3","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν διάρκεια εἰς παράγοντα ψυχικῆς ἀνατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME4","text":"Ἡ παιδεία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ μετάδοσιν πληροφοριῶν εἰς ρύθμισιν τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν περιφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτοτελὲς ὅλον εἰς ὄχημα καὶ ὑπηρετικὴν διάταξιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς συντονισμὸς φυσικῆς κινήσεως καὶ παιδευτικῆς διαμορφώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ ζήτημα εἶναι ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν παιδικὴν ἀφροσύνην εἰς τὴν φρόνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, τὸ ζήτημα εἶναι ἡ σύγκρουσις μεταξὺ ἐσωτερικῶν περιφορῶν καὶ ἐξωτερικῶν αἰσθήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ τελείωσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἐπανόρθωσιν τῆς ἡγεμονίας καὶ παιδευτικὴν ρύθμισιν, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ἀπόρριψιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, ὁ ἄνθρωπος ὁρίζεται ὡς ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι, ἧς ἡ τάξις ἀναπαράγει τὴν κοσμικὴν κυκλικότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5","text":"Χρονικῶς, ἡ ψυχικὴ τελείωσις ἀκολουθεῖ διαδοχὴν διαταραχῆς, ἡσυχίας, ἐπανόδου καὶ παιδευτικῆς συμπληρώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν αἰτιακὴν ἁλυσίδα ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνσωμάτωσιν μέχρι τὴν παιδευτικὴν τελείωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ φυσικῆς ἐπανόδου καὶ παιδευτικῆς ὁλοκληρώσεως παραμένει ἀναγκαία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέση μεταξὺ ψυχῆς, κεφαλῆς καὶ σώματος ἀνασυντίθεται συνεκτικῶς ὡς ἱεραρχία ἡγεμονίας καὶ ὑπηρεσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT5","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς μηχανισμὸς διʼ οὗ ὁ χρόνος ἐπαναφέρει τὰς περιφοράς εἰς τὴν φυσικὴν ὁδόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT6","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἐπίσης ἡ ἀκριβὴς μορφὴ τῆς παιδευτικῆς τροφῆς, ἣ μόνον ὡς ὅρος τελειώσεως δηλοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικόν, ἀλλὰ ἐρείδεται εἰς τὴν ἀναπόδεικτον συνάφειαν γεωμετρικῆς μορφῆς, ψυχικῆς κινήσεως καὶ θείας προνοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT8","text":"Ἡ συμπύκνωσις διασώζει τὸ πραγματικὸν πέρασμα ἀπὸ διαταραχὴν εἰς ἀνάταξιν, ἀλλὰ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν λεπτομερεστέραν φυσιολογίαν τῶν σωμάτων καὶ τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230532829705Z_80ec519f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 44","source_sha256":"da9f6799d302704724cc17b12d0a2c0593b5a2a994163abf4901b916a13390a5","sha256":"98f6653198871756e8bbbf9bc99875ec24a734572b4e1afc0401c5ed78347d48","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:05:32.834174+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS1","text":"When the soul is joined to a mortal body, it is initially irrational and moves disorderly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS2","text":"The external sensations, mastering the soul's revolutions, reveal their own dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS3","text":"The disturbance confounds the Same and the Other and generates false judgments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS4","text":"Time calms the revolutions and restores them to their order according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS5","text":"Education, completing natural restoration, renders the soul whole and healthy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AS6","text":"The soul and the body are accounted for through divine providence, which establishes the head as bearer of the divine revolutions and ruler of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","text":"Two divine revolutions are distinguished in the soul, that of the Same and that of the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","text":"The conjunction of the soul with the mortal body disturbs the innate order of the revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","text":"The external sensations can draw the whole of the soul along with them and hold sway over it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","text":"The disturbance of the revolutions temporarily abolishes the rule inherent in them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A5","text":"The disturbance confounds judgments concerning the Same and the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","text":"Time can restore the revolutions from disturbance to calm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","text":"The natural restoration of the revolutions makes their possessor intelligent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A8","text":"The proper nourishment of education is necessary for complete psychic health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","text":"The head, being spherical, embodies the divine revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A10","text":"The rest of the body provides service to the head, which rules over what is in us.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","text":"Divine providence constituted the body as a vehicle and means of ready passage for the head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX1","text":"The embodied soul is not from the beginning intelligent and ordered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX2","text":"The senses are not simply instruments of true knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX3","text":"Psychic motion is not necessarily identical with the revolution according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX4","text":"The natural quiet of the revolutions is not sufficient without educational nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX5","text":"The body does not possess the governing principle of the whole within us.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:NX6","text":"The neglect of education does not constitute an indifferent choice of life, but psychic incompleteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D1","text":"Embodied life begins as a condition of internal lack of governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","CH_JP8E_S_25:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D2","text":"When the senses draw the soul along with them, the prevailing power appears as defeated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D3","text":"The confusion of the Same and the Other transforms psychic motion into false judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_25:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D4","text":"The passage of time functions as a mechanism for the reordering of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D5","text":"Prudence depends on the restoration of the revolutions to their natural path.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D6","text":"Education transforms natural restoration into complete health.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D7","text":"Neglect of education keeps the soul in a state of incompleteness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D8","text":"The spherical form of the head corresponds to the circular nature of the divine motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A1","CH_JP8E_S_25:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:D9","text":"The bodily arrangement is functionally subordinated to the psychic principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A10","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD1","text":"Human disease is understood primarily as a disorganization of psychic governance and not as a mere bodily injury.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A2","CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","CH_JP8E_S_25:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD2","text":"True education operates as a retraining of psychic motions toward their proper order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD3","text":"Anthropology is constituted as a hierarchy in which the head rules, the body serves, and the senses threaten order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A3","CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD4","text":"Human perfection requires the cooperation of nature, time, education, and divine formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A6","CH_JP8E_S_25:A8","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5","text":"The exit from psychic confusion is a process of reconstructing internal governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_25:A7","CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX1","text":"Sensation is not regarded as an independent and self-sufficient principle of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX2","text":"The embodied condition is not regarded as naturally balanced from birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX3","text":"The soul is not conceived as a simple incorporeal activity separated from determinate motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX4","text":"Restoration is not regarded as automatic and definitive without education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX5","text":"Bodily unity does not constitute a self-subsisting ontological principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:DNX6","text":"Human happiness cannot be defined independently of psychic perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX1","text":"A world in which bodily experience and truth coincide without mediation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX2","text":"The possibility of a human being who acquires complete prudence without education is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX3","text":"The equivalence of psychic governance and sensory being-drawn-along is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX4","text":"Absent from the system is the possibility of an incorporeal or unstructured human being; the soul is necessarily embodied and undergoes motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5","text":"Freedom as self-legislation without natural and educational order remains unthinkable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS1","text":"Divine revolutions → embodied conjunction → external sensation → drawing-along of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS2","text":"Drawing-along → dissolution of internal governance → confusion of the Same and the Other → false judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS3","text":"Passage of time → calming of the revolutions → restoration to the path according to nature → generation of prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS4","text":"Natural restoration + correct education → whole and healthy soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS5","text":"Neglect of education → incomplete life → irrational return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS6","text":"Divine providence → spherical head → embodiment of divine motions → rule of the head over the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1","text":"Embodied disturbance → sensory drawing-along → confusion of judgments → temporal calming → natural restoration → educational perfection → head as seat of divine governance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME1","text":"Initial folly is reclassified from a moral defect into an effect of embodied disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2","text":"Sensation is shifted from a source of certain knowledge into a force of drawing-along.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME3","text":"Time is transformed from mere duration into a factor of psychic reordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME4","text":"Education is shifted from the transmission of information into the regulation of internal revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","text":"The body is reclassified from a self-subsisting whole into a vehicle and a serving arrangement of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","text":"Health is recognized as the coordination of natural motion and educational formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT1","text":"On the surface, the issue is the transition from childish folly to prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the issue is the conflict between internal revolutions and external sensations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, perfection requires the restoration of governance and educational regulation, not merely the rejection of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, the human being is defined as a soul in a body, whose order reproduces cosmic circularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5","text":"Temporally, psychic perfection follows a sequence of disturbance, quiet, return, and educational completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the causal chain from embodiment through educational perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT3","text":"The distinction between natural return and educational completion remains necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT4","text":"The relation among soul, head, and body is coherently reconstructed as a hierarchy of governance and service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT5","text":"The precise mechanism through which time restores the revolutions to the natural path is underspecified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT6","text":"Also underspecified is the precise form of educational nourishment, which is indicated only as a condition of perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7","text":"The system is internally coherent, but rests on the unproven conjunction of geometrical form, psychic motion, and divine providence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT8","text":"The condensation preserves the actual passage from disturbance to reordering, but removes the more detailed physiology of bodies and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_25@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_25:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 44"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 28","title":"Section 44","context":"Chapter 28","original_title":"Section 44","original_context":"Chapter 28"},"original_title":"Section 44","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26","layer":"CH","title":"Section 45","order":29,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_26"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_26@R001","sha256":"1ef507d9d43abe9666918ae9264591d423b437d58dadc59faa7a3282602489dc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS1","text":"Τὸ θεῖον ἐποίησε τὸ ἀνθρώπινον σῶμα μακρὸν καὶ τετρασκελὲς, ἵνα διὰ στηρίξεως καὶ κινήσεως τὸ θεῖον οἴκημα φέρῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS2","text":"Ἡ πρόσθια πλευρὰ ἀφορίζεται ὡς ἡγεμονικὴ καὶ ἀρχικὴ διὰ τῆς φυσικῆς διατάξεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS3","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ καὶ τὸ πρόσωπον καθίστανται τόπος ὀργάνων ὑπηρετούντων τὴν προνοίαν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS4","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ συγγενείας καὶ συμπάθειας τοῦ ἐντὸς πυρὸς πρὸς τὸ ἔξω φῶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS5","text":"Ἡ ὁρατὴ αἴσθησις γεννᾶται ὅταν τὸ ἔσω καὶ τὸ ἔξω ὁμοιοπαθὲς πῦρ ἓν συνεχὲς σῶμα κατὰ τὴν ὄψιν συστήσῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS6","text":"Ἡ νὺξ λύει τὴν συγγένειαν τοῦ πυρός, παύει τὴν ὄψιν καὶ προετοιμάζει τὸν ὕπνον διὰ καταστολῆς τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","text":"Ἡ θεία μηχανὴ καθορίζει τὴν κατασκευήν τοῦ σώματος πρὸς συγκεκριμένην πορείαν καὶ λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A2","text":"Τὸ πρόσθεν τοῦ σώματος ἐστὶν ἀφωρισμένον ἀπὸ τοῦ ὄπισθεν καὶ κατέχει φυσικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ περιέχει τὸ ἡγεμονικὸν μέρος καὶ τὰ ὄργανα τῆς ψυχικῆς προνοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","text":"Ὁ ὀφθαλμὸς εἶναι ὄργανον φωσφόρον, διὰ τοῦ ὁποίου ῥεῖ τὸ συγγενὲς ἔσω πῦρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","text":"Τὸ ἔσω πῦρ ὁμοιοῦται πρὸς τὸ ἥμερον ἔξω φῶς καὶ δύναται δι’ αὐτοῦ νὰ συναφθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A6","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης τῶν πυρῶν παράγει συμπάθειαν καὶ μετάδοσιν κινήσεων διὰ τοῦ σώματος μέχρι τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A7","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἐνεργεῖ μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ καὶ ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ φωτεινὴ δύναμις παραμένουν συγγενεῖς καὶ συνεχείς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A8","text":"Τὰ βλέφαρα φυλάττουσι τὸ ὄμμα, ἀποκλείοντα τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν δύναμιν ὅταν ἡ ὄψις παύηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A9","text":"Ἡ κατάσβεσις καὶ ἡ ὁμαλοποίησις τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν κινήσεων ἐπιφέρει ἡσυχίαν καὶ ὕπνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX1","text":"Τὸ πρόσθεν τοῦ ἀνθρώπου οὐκ ἔστιν ἀδιάκριτον ἢ ὅμοιον τῷ ὄπισθεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2","text":"Ἡ ὄψις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀμιγῶς παθητικὴν πρόσληψιν ἔξωθεν μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX3","text":"Τὸ ὁρᾶν οὐκ ἐπιτελεῖται χωρὶς ἐσωτερικὸν πυρὶ καὶ σωματικὴν ῥοήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX4","text":"Τὸ φῶς τῆς ἡμέρας οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἄσχετον πρὸς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν φύσιν τοῦ ὄμματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX5","text":"Ὁ ὕπνος οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία ἐρεθισμοῦ, ἀλλ’ ὡς μεταβολὴ καὶ καταστολὴ κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX6","text":"Τὰ βλέφαρα οὐκ εἰσὶν ἁπλὸν κάλυμμα, ἀλλὰ ὄργανον σωτηρίας τῆς ὄψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις καθιστᾷ τὴν κίνησιν δυνατὴν διὰ τῶν μελῶν ὡς σημείων ἀντιλήψεως καὶ ἐρείσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","CH_JP8E_S_26:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D2","text":"Ἡ προτεραιότης τοῦ προσώπου ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἐγκατάστασιν τῶν ὀργάνων τῆς ἡγεμονικῆς ψυχικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A2","CH_JP8E_S_26:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D3","text":"Ἡ ὄρασις συνίσταται ὡς ἕνωσις ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ πυρὸς κατὰ τὴν εὐθυωρίαν τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","CH_JP8E_S_26:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D4","text":"Ὅ,τι ἅπτεται τοῦ ὁρατικοῦ ῥεύματος μεταδίδει κινήσεις εἰς ὅλον τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἕως τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D5","text":"Ἡ νὺξ ἀναστέλλει τὴν ὄψιν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἔσω πῦρ ἐκπίπτει πρὸς ἀνόμοιον περιβάλλον καὶ παύει νὰ εἶναι συμφυὲς τῷ πλησίον ἀέρι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D6","text":"Ἡ σύμμυσις τῶν βλεφάρων περιορίζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν δύναμιν, ἵνα αἱ κινήσεις διαχυθῶσι καὶ ὁμαλυνθῶσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A8","CH_JP8E_S_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις παράγεται οὔτε ἐκ τοῦ σώματος μόνου οὔτε ἐκ τοῦ κόσμου μόνου, ἀλλ’ ἐκ τῆς δυναμικῆς συνάψεως συγγενῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ ὁρατοῦ ἐνσωματοῦται ὡς μετάδοσις κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὸ ὄργανον εἰς τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἀπὸ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογία ἐμφανίζει τὴν θείαν πρόνοιαν ὡς ἀρχιτεκτονικὴν ὀργάνωσιν σκοπῶν, ὀργάνων, ὁμοιοτήτων καὶ ρυθμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","CH_JP8E_S_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἡμέρα καὶ ἡ νὺξ ἀποτελοῦσιν δύο διαφορετικὰ καθεστῶτα σωματικῆς συγγενείας, ἐνεργείας καὶ ἡσυχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A7","CH_JP8E_S_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι τὸ ὅτι τὸ σῶμα ἐστὶν ἄμορφος ὕλη ἄνευ προσανατολισμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ θέση καὶ ἡ διάταξις ἑκάστου μέλους φέρει λειτουργικὸν λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX2","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι τὸ ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ ἐνεργεῖ ἀνεξαρτήτως ὀργάνων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις φθάνει εἰς αὐτὴν διὰ σωματικῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX3","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι τὸ ὅτι ἡ ὄψις ἀπαιτεῖ μόνον ἔξωθεν φῶς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συγγένεια τοῦ πυρὸς εἶναι συνθετικὸς ὅρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX4","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι τὸ ὅτι ἡ ἀναστολὴ τῆς ὄψεως εἶναι ἀπλὴ στέρησις, ἐπειδὴ ἀποτελεῖ ἐνεργὸν ρύθμισιν καὶ σωτηρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι τὸ ὅτι ἡ ὁμοιότης εἶναι στατικὴ ὁμοιότητα, ἐπειδὴ λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀγωγὸς κινήσεων καὶ παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ αἴσθησις ὑπάρχει χωρὶς ἀντιστοιχίαν ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὄργανον ὃ ἐνεργεῖ ἄνευ θείας τάξεως καὶ ἄνευ ἐντεταγμένου τέλους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἀπόλυτος χωρισμὸς ψυχῆς, σώματος καὶ κόσμου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις προϋποθέτει τὴν δι’ αὐτῶν συνέχεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδιάκοπος ἐνέργεια τῆς ὄψεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὄψις ὑπόκειται εἰς ρυθμὸν ἐνεργείας, ἀποσβέσεως καὶ ἀναπαύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS1","text":"Θεία μηχανή → διάταξις σώματος → ὁρισμὸς προσθίου καὶ ἡγεμονικοῦ μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS2","text":"Ἡγεμονικὸν πρόσθεν → κεφαλὴ καὶ πρόσωπον → ἐγκατάστασις ὀργάνων ψυχικῆς προνοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS3","text":"Ὄργανον ὄψεως → ἔσω πῦρ → συγγένεια πρὸς ἔξω φῶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS4","text":"Συγγένεια πυρῶν → ἕνωσις καὶ συμπάθεια → μετάδοσις κινήσεων → ὄρασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS5","text":"Νυκτερινὴ ἀνομοιότης → ἀλλοίωσις καὶ κατάσβεσις → παῦσις ὄψεως → σύμμυσις βλεφάρων → ὕπνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF1","text":"Σωματικὴ ἀνάγκη κινήσεως → θεία διάταξις μελῶν → ἱεράρχησις προσθίου καὶ ὀπισθίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF2","text":"Ἱεράρχησις τοῦ σώματος → ἡγεμονικὴ κεφαλή → ὀφθαλμοὶ ὡς φωσφόρα ὄργανα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF3","text":"Ἐσωτερικὸν πῦρ + ἔξω φῶς → ὁμοιότης → συμπαγὴς ὁρατικὴ σύνδεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF4","text":"Ὁρατικὴ σύνδεσις → μετάδοσις κινήσεων → αἴσθησις ὄψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF5","text":"Νυκτερινὴ ἀνομοιότης → διάλυσις τῆς συνδέσεως → καταστολὴ πυρός → ὕπνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχημένη μηχανὴ προσανατολισμένη πρὸς κίνησιν καὶ νόησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME2","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ἀπὸ παθητικὴν λήψιν εἰς σχέσιν ὁμοιότητος, ῥοῆς καὶ συμπαθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς συνεχὴς μετάβασις ἀπὸ κόσμου εἰς ὄργανον, σῶμα καὶ ψυχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME4","text":"Ἡ νὺξ ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς φυσικὸς μετασχηματισμὸς σχέσεων πυρός, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία ἡμέρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME5","text":"Ὁ ὕπνος ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς ρυθμιστικὴ ἀναγκαία λειτουργία τῆς αἰσθήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς γυμνὴ διακοπή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ὕψους ἡ ἀφήγησις ἐξηγεῖ τὴν κατασκευήν τῶν σκελῶν, τῶν χειρῶν, τῆς κεφαλῆς, τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν καὶ τῶν βλεφάρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ὕψους ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ συνδέεται μὲ ἱεράρχησιν, κίνησιν, ὄργανα καὶ μετάδοσιν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ὕψους ἡ ὄψις ἐρμηνεύεται διὰ τῆς ἀναγωγῆς τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ εἰς σχέσιν συγγενείας καὶ ἐνεργοῦ συμμετοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ὕψους τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς δίκτυον ὁμοιοτήτων, ῥοῶν, παθῶν καὶ θείας τελεολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ὕψους ἡ ἡμέρα καὶ ἡ νὺξ ὁρίζουσι κύκλον ἐνεργείας, ἀποσβέσεως, ἡσυχίας καὶ ὀνειρώδους ὕπνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἐννέα ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ἀκολουθίας ἀπὸ τὴν θείαν σωματοποίησιν μέχρι τὸν ὕπνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν κύριαν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνατομίαν εἰς τὴν φυσιολογίαν καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν φυσιολογίαν εἰς τὴν αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τῆς μεταδόσεως ἀπὸ τὸ ὁρατικὸν ῥεῦμα εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὸν μένει τὸ σύστημα ὅσον ἀφορά τὴν ὁμοιότητα, τὴν συμπάθειαν καὶ τὴν ἀναστολὴν τῆς ὄψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχύς τοῦ συστήματος ἔγκειται στὴν ἑνιαία σύνδεσιν θείας προνοίας, σωματικῆς κατασκευῆς καὶ αἰσθητικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀσάφεια ἔγκειται στὸ ὅτι ἡ ὁμοιότης λειτουργεῖ συγχρόνως ὡς φυσικὴ ὕλη, αἰτιακὴ δύναμις καὶ ὅρος γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230551351599Z_c1f4bea8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 45","source_sha256":"1ef507d9d43abe9666918ae9264591d423b437d58dadc59faa7a3282602489dc","sha256":"48bccc7fef3993eabc4e504b868a0abe604e2784ed799fe8e90fab30081c5774","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:05:51.354405+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS1","text":"The divine made the human body long and four-legged, so that through support and movement it might bear the divine dwelling-place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS2","text":"The front side is delimited as ruling and primary through the natural arrangement of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS3","text":"The head and face are established as the place of organs serving the providence of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS4","text":"Sight is explained through the kinship and sympathy of the inner fire toward the outer light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS5","text":"Visible perception arises when the inward and outward like-affected fire constitutes one continuous body along the line of sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AS6","text":"Night dissolves the kinship of the fire, stops sight, and prepares sleep through the suppression of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","text":"The divine contrivance determines the construction of the body toward a specific course and function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A2","text":"The front of the body is delimited from the back and possesses a natural primacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","text":"The head contains the ruling part and the organs of the soul's providence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","text":"The eye is a light-bearing organ through which the kindred inner fire flows.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","text":"The inner fire is assimilated to the mild outer light and is able to be joined with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A6","text":"The likeness of the fires produces sympathy and the transmission of motions through the body as far as the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A7","text":"Sight operates only when the internal and external luminous power remain kindred and continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A8","text":"The eyelids guard the eye, shutting off the internal power when sight ceases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:A9","text":"The quenching and smoothing of internal motions bring about repose and sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX1","text":"The front of the human being is not undifferentiated or like the back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2","text":"Sight does not constitute a purely passive reception of forms from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX3","text":"Seeing is not accomplished without internal fire and bodily flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX4","text":"The light of day does not operate as something unrelated to the inner nature of the eye.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX5","text":"Sleep is not interpreted as a simple absence of stimulation, but as a change and suppression of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:NX6","text":"The eyelids are not a mere covering, but an organ for the preservation of sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D1","text":"The bodily arrangement makes movement possible through the limbs as points of perception and support.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","CH_JP8E_S_26:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D2","text":"The priority of the face permits the installation of the organs of the ruling psychic function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A2","CH_JP8E_S_26:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D3","text":"Vision is constituted as the union of internal and external fire along the straight gaze of the eyes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","CH_JP8E_S_26:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D4","text":"Whatever touches the visual stream transmits motions into the whole body and as far as the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D5","text":"Night suspends sight, because the inner fire falls into a dissimilar environment and ceases to be congenial with the adjacent air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:D6","text":"The closing of the eyelids confines the internal power, so that the motions may be dispersed and smoothed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A8","CH_JP8E_S_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1","text":"Perception is produced neither from the body alone nor from the world alone, but from the dynamic conjunction of kindred powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A4","CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2","text":"Knowledge of the visible is embodied as a transmission of motion from the organ into the body and from the body into the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","CH_JP8E_S_26:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3","text":"Physiology displays divine providence as an architectonic organization of ends, organs, likenesses, and rhythms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1","CH_JP8E_S_26:A3","CH_JP8E_S_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SD4","text":"Day and night constitute two different regimes of bodily kinship, activity, and repose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A5","CH_JP8E_S_26:A7","CH_JP8E_S_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1","text":"It must be false that the body is formless matter without orientation, since the position and arrangement of each limb bears a functional rationale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX2","text":"It must be false that the soul operates independently of organs, since perception reaches it through bodily transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX3","text":"It must be false that sight requires only light from without, since the inner kinship of fire is a constitutive condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX4","text":"It must be false that the suspension of sight is a simple privation, since it constitutes an active regulation and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5","text":"It must be false that likeness is static similarity, since it functions as a conduit of motions and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX1","text":"A world in which perception exists without correspondence between inner and outer is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX2","text":"An organ that operates without divine order and without an ordered end is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX3","text":"An absolute separation of soul, body, and world is excluded, since perception presupposes continuity through them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX4","text":"The uninterrupted activity of sight is excluded, since sight is subject to a rhythm of activity, extinction, and rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS1","text":"Divine contrivance → arrangement of body → determination of front and ruling part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS2","text":"Ruling front → head and face → installation of organs of psychic providence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS3","text":"Organ of sight → inner fire → kinship with outer light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS4","text":"Kinship of fires → union and sympathy → transmission of motions → vision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS5","text":"Nocturnal dissimilarity → alteration and quenching → cessation of sight → closing of eyelids → sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF1","text":"Bodily necessity of movement → divine arrangement of limbs → hierarchy of front and back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF2","text":"Hierarchy of the body → ruling head → eyes as light-bearing organs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF3","text":"Internal fire + outer light → likeness → compact visual connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF4","text":"Visual connection → transmission of motions → perception of sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:AF5","text":"Nocturnal dissimilarity → dissolution of the connection → suppression of fire → sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME1","text":"The body is remapped as a hierarchical contrivance oriented toward movement and understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME2","text":"Sight is remapped from passive reception into a relation of likeness, flow, and sympathy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3","text":"Perception is remapped as a continuous passage from world to organ, body, and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME4","text":"Night is remapped as a natural transformation of the relations of fire, not as a simple absence of day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ME5","text":"Sleep is remapped as a necessary regulatory function of perception and not as bare interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the account explains the construction of the legs, hands, head, eyes, and eyelids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, bodily form is connected with hierarchy, movement, organs, and the transmission of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, sight is interpreted through the reduction of the sensible to a relation of kinship and active participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, being is conceived as a network of likenesses, flows, affections, and divine teleology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, day and night define a cycle of activity, extinction, repose, and dreamlike sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT1","text":"The nine principles suffice for reconstructing the sequence from divine embodiment to sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the main movement from anatomy to physiology and from physiology to perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT3","text":"The precise nature of the transmission from the visual stream to the soul is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT4","text":"The system remains internally coherent with respect to likeness, sympathy, and the suspension of sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT5","text":"The strength of the system lies in the unified connection of divine providence, bodily construction, and perceptual function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT6","text":"The ambiguity lies in the fact that likeness functions simultaneously as natural matter, causal power, and condition of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_26@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_26:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 45"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 29","title":"Section 45","context":"Chapter 29","original_title":"Section 45","original_context":"Chapter 29"},"original_title":"Section 45","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27","layer":"CH","title":"Section 46","order":30,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_27"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_27@R001","sha256":"28795115951a16a77f4b2a90bc502e79126b8a3b33e1ac7fae7f3abc42b54cd8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἐμφάνεια τῶν φαντασμάτων καὶ τῶν εἰδώλων ἀναζητεῖ μηχανικὴν καὶ φυσικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ τῶν δεξιῶν καὶ ἀριστερῶν, ὡς καὶ τοῦ ἄνω καὶ κάτω, παράγεται ἐκ τῆς συμπλοκῆς ὄψεως, φωτὸς καὶ λεότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS3","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ σώματα παρέχουσι συναίτια, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ αὐτοτελῆ αἴτια τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS4","text":"Ὁ νοῦς ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ πρώτων αἰτίων, συνδεδεμένων πρὸς φρόνησιν, καὶ δευτέρων αἰτίων, κινουμένων καὶ ἕτερα κινούντων κατ᾽ ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἔρευνα ὀφείλει νὰ συντάξῃ ἀμφότερα τὰ γένη τῶν αἰτίων, χωρὶς νὰ συγχέῃ τὴν ὑλικὴν ἀνάγκην πρὸς τὴν νοερὰν δημιουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A1","text":"Ἡ ἀφομοίωσις καὶ ἡ μνήμη τῶν φαντασμάτων ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ καταλειφθεῖσας κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","text":"Ἡ λεία καὶ λαμπρὰ ἐπιφάνεια δύναται νὰ ποιῇ εἴδωλα διὰ κοινωνίας τοῦ ἐντὸς καὶ τοῦ ἐκτὸς πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","text":"Ἡ διάταξις τῆς ἐπαφῆς ἀνασχηματίζει τὰ φαινόμενα μέρη τοῦ ὁρωμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A4","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῆς ἐπαφῆς δύναται νὰ ἀντιστρέψῃ τὰ δεξιὰ καὶ τὰ ἀριστερά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιμήκης μεταστροφὴ τῆς ὄψεως δύναται νὰ ποιήσῃ τὸ κάτω ἄνω καὶ τὸ ἄνω κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","text":"Τὰ πῦρ, ὕδωρ, γῆ καὶ ἀὴρ εἰσὶ σώματα ὁρατά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ εἶναι τὸ ἀόρατον ὂν ᾧ προσήκει ὁ νοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","text":"Τὰ ὁρατὰ σώματα οὐκ ἔχουσιν αὐτὰ καθ᾽ αὑτὰ λόγον ἢ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","text":"Πρῶται αἰτίαι εἰσὶν αἱ μετὰ νοῦ δημιουργοὶ τοῦ καλοῦ καὶ ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","text":"Δεύτεραι αἰτίαι εἰσὶν αἱ ὑπὸ κινουμένων κινούμεναι καὶ ἕτερα κινεῖν κατ᾽ ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A11","text":"Ὁ ἀκριβὴς λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ διακρίνῃ τὰ δύο γένη τῶν αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX1","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ ἀποτελέσματα οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀναγκαίως αὐτοτελεῖς αἰτίαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX2","text":"Τὰ ψύχοντα, θερμαίνοντα, πήγνυντα καὶ διαχέοντα οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἰδίῳ τρόπῳ λόγον ἢ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX3","text":"Ἡ λεότης οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἀπλὴ ὕλη, ἀλλὰ ὡς ὅρος σχηματισμοῦ εἰδώλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη οὐ ταὐτίζεται πρὸς τὴν φρόνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX5","text":"Τὸ ὁρατὸν οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ μόνον γένος τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀλληλουχία κινήσεων οὐκ ἀρκεῖ μόνη πρὸς τὴν ἐξήγησιν τοῦ καλοῦ καὶ ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐπαφὴ ὄψεως καὶ φωτὸς ἐν λεῖᾳ ἐπιφανείᾳ μεταβάλλεται, τὸ φαινόμενον εἴδωλον δύναται νὰ μὴ διατηρῇ τὴν χωρικὴν τάξιν τοῦ πρωτοτύπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ τῶν δεξιῶν καὶ ἀριστερῶν ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀντιθέτου ἐπαφῆς τῶν μερῶν τῆς ὄψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ τοῦ ἄνω καὶ τοῦ κάτω παράγεται ὅταν ἡ ὄψις στραφῇ κατὰ μῆκος καὶ μεταβάλῃ τὴν συμπλοκὴν τοῦ φωτός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ σώματα εἰσὶν ὁρατά, ἡ ἐξήγησις τοῦ νοῦ δὲν δύναται νὰ ἀναχθῇ εἰς σωματικὰς κινήσεις μόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἐπιβάλλει διάκρισιν μεταξὺ νοερῶν πρώτων αἰτίων καὶ σωματικῶν δευτέρων αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D6","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ φύσεως ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν συμπαράθεσιν τῆς ἀναγκαιότητος καὶ τῆς νοερᾶς δημιουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις διαιροῦσα τὰ αἴτια μετατρέπει τὸ φαινόμενον ἀπὸ αὐτοτελῆ δύναμιν εἰς ὄργανον κοσμικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD2","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ τάξις ἀποκτᾷ ἐξηγηματικὴν ἀξίαν μόνον ὅταν συνδεθῇ πρὸς ὑπερκείμενον νοῦν καὶ σκοπόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη λειτουργεῖ ὡς συναίτιον, ὄχι ὡς ἡ τελικὴ ἀρχὴ τοῦ κοσμικοῦ σχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐρμηνεία τῆς φύσεως λαμβάνει ἱεραρχικὴν μορφήν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ νοῦς ἀναζητεῖ πρῶτα τὰ φρόνιμα αἴτια καὶ ἔπειτα τὰ κατ᾽ ἀνάγκην κινούμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι πᾶν τὸ ἐνεργοῦν ἐν τῷ κόσμῳ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ νοῦ καὶ προαιρέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ ὑλικὴ ἀνάγκη ἀποτελεῖ πλήρη καὶ ἔσχατον κοσμογονικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ ὄψις ἀντιλαμβάνεται τὰ πράγματα ἄνευ μεσολαβήσεων, ἐπαφῶν καὶ σχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","CH_JP8E_S_27:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ φαινομένη ἀντιστροφὴ ἀποτελεῖ ἰδιότητα τοῦ πράγματος καθ᾽ αὑτό, ἀντὶ νὰ ἀποτελῇ ἀποτέλεσμα σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία νοῦ ἐκ τῶν σωμάτων δὲν σημαίνει ἀπουσία τάξεως, ἀλλὰ ἀνάγκην ὑπερκειμένης ἀρχῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τῶν σωματικῶν αἰτίων νὰ ἔχωσι λόγον ἀποκλείει τὸν αὐτόματον ταυτισμὸν φύσεως καὶ νοήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις προϋποθέτει ὅτι τὸ ἄλογον καὶ ἀναγκαῖον δὲν ἐξαντλεῖ τὸ δυνατὸν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS1","text":"Καταλειφθεῖσαι κινήσεις → κοινωνία ἐντὸς καὶ ἐκτὸς πυρός → σύμπηξις περὶ λείαν ἐπιφάνειαν → ἀπομνημονευόμενον φάντασμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS2","text":"Μεταβολὴ ἐπαφῆς → ἀνασχηματισμὸς χωρικῆς σχέσεως → ἀντιστροφὴ δεξιῶν καὶ ἀριστερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS3","text":"Κατὰ μῆκος στροφὴ ὄψεως → μετατόπισις φωτὸς → ἀντιστροφὴ ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS4","text":"Ὁρατὸν σῶμα → ἔλλειψις λόγου καὶ νοῦ → ἀνάγκη διακρίσεως ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS5","text":"Νοερὰ δημιουργία → ὑποταγὴ τῶν σωματικῶν κινήσεων → χρησιμοποίησις τῶν ἀναγκαίων κινήσεων ὡς συναιτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6","text":"Διάκρισις πρώτων καὶ δευτέρων αἰτίων → διπλὴ ἐξήγησις φύσεως → ἀποφυγὴ τῆς ταυτίσεως ἀνάγκης καὶ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1","text":"Φαινόμενα εἴδωλα → μηχανισμὸς ὄψεως καὶ λεότητος → ἀντιστροφαὶ τῶν σχέσεων → διάκρισις συναίτιων καὶ αἰτίων → ἱεράρχησις νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης → διπλὸς λόγος περὶ αἰτιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","text":"Τὸ εἴδωλον μετατάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀπλὸν ἀντίγραφον εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα γεωμετρικῆς καὶ φυσικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ παύει νὰ εἶναι παράδοξον τοῦ πράγματος καὶ γίνεται συνέπεια τῆς διατάξεως τῆς ἐπαφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς συντελοῦσα εἰς τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα, ἀλλὰ ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ὑπερκείμενον αἰτιακὸν σχέδιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν τελικὴν ἐξήγησιν, χωρὶς νὰ ἀκυροῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ φύσεως μετακινείται ἀπὸ μονομερῆ μηχανισμὸν εἰς σύνθεσιν νοερῶν καὶ ἀναγκαίων αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐξηγοῦνται τὰ εἴδωλα, αἱ ἀντιστροφαὶ καὶ αἱ φαινομενικαὶ μετατοπίσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἐμφάνεια ἀναλύεται εἰς κοινωνίαν πυρός, ἐπαφήν, λεότητα καὶ κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἔρευνα διατάσσεται ὥστε νὰ μὴ συγχέῃ τὰ συναίτια πρὸς τὰ κυρίως αἴτια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ψυχὴ καὶ ὁ νοῦς τίθενται ὑπεράνω τῶν ὁρατῶν σωμάτων, ἐνῶ ἡ ἀνάγκη μένει δευτέρα αἰτιακὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ τελεολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὰ ἀναγκαῖα αἴτια ὑπηρετοῦσι τὴν πραγμάτωσιν τοῦ ἀρίστου κατὰ τὸ δυνατόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀναγκαῖα στοιχεία πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν εἰσὶν ἡ θεωρία τῆς ἐμφανίσεως, ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ σώματος, καὶ ἡ διπλὴ τάξις αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία ἀπὸ τὴν ὀπτικὴν ἐπαφὴν εἰς τὴν κοσμολογικὴν αἰτιότητα διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3","text":"Ἡ κατασκευὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνάγκη ὁρίζεται ὡς συναίτιον καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἔσχατον αἴτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν ὁ νοῦς ἐνεργεῖ ἐπὶ τῶν συγκεκριμένων σωματικῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα δομὴ τοῦ λόγου ἔγκειται εἰς τὴν ἀκριβῆ διάκρισιν αἰτίου, συναίτιου καὶ ἀποτελέσματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα περιοχή ἔγκειται εἰς τὴν ἀναγκαίαν ἀλλ᾽ οὐ πλήρως ἀναπτυγμένην γεφύρωσιν μεταξὺ νοερᾶς προθέσεως καὶ σωματικῆς μηχανικῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230608956861Z_813144bf","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 46","source_sha256":"28795115951a16a77f4b2a90bc502e79126b8a3b33e1ac7fae7f3abc42b54cd8","sha256":"d3bd1762e243836c0f815fd7475878c09625a94786d9c899b10f391c7476d6b7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:06:08.957890+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS1","text":"The appearance of phantasms and images requires a mechanical and natural explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS2","text":"The reversal of right and left, as also of above and below, is produced from the interweaving of sight, light, and smoothness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS3","text":"Sensible bodies provide contributory causes, but not self-sufficient causes, of cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS4","text":"Intellect requires a distinction between primary causes, connected with prudence, and secondary causes, moved and moving others by necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5","text":"Scientific inquiry ought to coordinate both kinds of causes, without conflating material necessity with intellectual creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A1","text":"The assimilation and memory of phantasms depend upon residual motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","text":"A smooth and bright surface is able to produce images through the communion of inner and outer fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","text":"The arrangement of contact reshapes the apparent parts of the thing seen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A4","text":"A change of contact can reverse right and left.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A5","text":"A longitudinal turning of sight can make below above and above below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","text":"Fire, water, earth, and air are visible bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","text":"The soul is the invisible being to which intellect belongs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","text":"Visible bodies do not themselves, in themselves, possess reason or intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","text":"Primary causes are those which, with intellect, are makers of the beautiful and the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","text":"Secondary causes are those moved by things moved and moving others by necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:A11","text":"Precise discourse ought to distinguish the two kinds of causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX1","text":"Sensible effects are not necessarily self-sufficient causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX2","text":"Things that cool, heat, congeal, and diffuse do not possess reason or intellect in their own manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX3","text":"Smoothness is not interpreted as mere matter, but as a condition for the formation of images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX4","text":"Necessity is not identified with prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX5","text":"The visible does not constitute the sole kind of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:NX6","text":"The natural sequence of motions alone is not sufficient for the explanation of the beautiful and the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D1","text":"Since the contact of sight and light upon a smooth surface changes, the appearing image may fail to preserve the spatial order of the original.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D2","text":"The reversal of right and left is explained as the result of contrary contact among the parts of sight.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D3","text":"The reversal of above and below is produced when sight is turned lengthwise and alters the interweaving of light.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D4","text":"Since bodies are visible, the explanation of intellect cannot be reduced to bodily motions alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D5","text":"The distinction between soul and body imposes a distinction between intellectual primary causes and bodily secondary causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A6","CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:D6","text":"Discourse concerning nature requires the juxtaposition of necessity and intellectual creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD1","text":"Scientific explanation, by dividing causes, transforms the phenomenon from a self-sufficient power into an instrument of cosmic ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD2","text":"Sensible order acquires explanatory value only when it is connected with a superordinate intellect and purpose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3","text":"Necessity functions as a contributory cause, not as the final principle of cosmic formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4","text":"The interpretation of nature takes a hierarchical form, because intellect seeks first the prudent causes and then those moved by necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A7","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that everything acting in the cosmos acts through intellect and choice.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that material necessity constitutes a complete and ultimate cosmogonic explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that sight apprehends things without mediations, contacts, and formations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A2","CH_JP8E_S_27:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the apparent reversal constitutes a property of the thing in itself, rather than being the result of a relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A3","CH_JP8E_S_27:A4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1","text":"The absence of intellect from bodies does not mean the absence of order, but the necessity of a superordinate principle of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX2","text":"The incapacity of bodily causes to possess reason excludes the automatic identification of nature and thought.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX3","text":"Cosmic order presupposes that the irrational and necessary do not exhaust the potentiality of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A9","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS1","text":"Residual motions → communion of inner and outer fire → conjunction around a smooth surface → remembered phantasm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS2","text":"Change of contact → reshaping of spatial relation → reversal of right and left.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS3","text":"Lengthwise turning of sight → displacement of light → reversal of above and below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS4","text":"Visible body → lack of reason and intellect → necessity of distinguishing soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS5","text":"Intellectual creation → subordination of bodily motions → use of necessary motions as contributory causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6","text":"Distinction between primary and secondary causes → double explanation of nature → avoidance of identifying necessity and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1","text":"Apparent images → mechanism of sight and smoothness → reversals of relations → distinction between contributory causes and causes → hierarchy of intellect and necessity → double discourse concerning causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","text":"The image is reclassified from a mere copy into the result of a geometrical and natural relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2","text":"The reversal ceases to be a paradox of the thing and becomes a consequence of the arrangement of contact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3","text":"Matter is recognized as contributing to the effect, but is subordinated to a superordinate causal plan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4","text":"Natural explanation is distinguished from final explanation, without being invalidated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","text":"Discourse concerning nature shifts from a one-sided mechanism to a synthesis of intellectual and necessary causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, images, reversals, and apparent displacements are explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, appearance is analyzed into communion of fire, contact, smoothness, and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, inquiry is ordered so as not to conflate contributory causes with causes in the proper sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, soul and intellect are placed above visible bodies, while necessity remains a secondary causal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5","text":"At the teleological level, necessary causes serve the realization of the best, insofar as possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT1","text":"The necessary elements for reconstruction are the theory of appearance, the distinction between intellect and body, and the double order of causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT2","text":"The sequence from visual contact to cosmological causality preserves the actual movement of the discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3","text":"The construction is internally coherent, because necessity is defined as a contributory cause and not as an ultimate cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4","text":"The manner in which intellect acts upon particular bodily motions is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT5","text":"The strongest structure of the discourse lies in the precise distinction between cause, contributory cause, and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6","text":"The weakest region lies in the necessary but not fully developed bridging between intellectual intention and bodily mechanics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_27:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_27@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_27:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 46"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 30","title":"Section 46","context":"Chapter 30","original_title":"Section 46","original_context":"Chapter 30"},"original_title":"Section 46","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28","layer":"CH","title":"Section 47","order":31,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_28"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_28@R001","sha256":"eeda9b4a44daf91f4d633bf338adb00dbacaae83c4469c7d053b230cdb486a94","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἡ μεγίστη αἰτία τῶν ἀνθρωπίνων ὠφελειῶν, ἐπειδὴ ἄνευ οὐρανίου θεάσεως οἱ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς λόγοι οὐκ ἂν ἐγένοντο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS2","text":"Ἡ θέα τῶν οὐρανίων φαινομένων μετασχηματίζει τὴν αἴσθησιν εἰς ἀριθμητικὴν τάξιν καὶ ἔννοιαν χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS3","text":"Ἐκ τῆς χρονικῆς καὶ κοσμικῆς τάξεως γεννᾶται ἡ φιλοσοφία, ὡς μέγιστον θεῖον δῶρον τῷ θνητῷ γένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ περιοδικότης παρέχει πρότυπον πρὸς διόρθωσιν τῶν πεπλανημένων περιόδων τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS5","text":"Ἡ φωνὴ, ἡ ἀκοή, ἡ ἁρμονία καὶ ὁ ῥυθμὸς ἐδόθησαν πρὸς κόσμησιν καὶ συμφωνίαν τῆς ἀτάκτου ψυχῆς, οὐχὶ πρὸς ἄλογον ἡδονήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS6","text":"Ἡ περὶ τῶν διὰ νοῦ δημιουργηθέντων ἐξήγησις συμπληροῦται διὰ τῆς ἀναφορᾶς εἰς τὰ διʼ ἀνάγκης γιγνόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν θέαν ἄστρων, ἡλίου καὶ οὐρανοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","text":"Ἡ θέα τῶν ἡμερῶν, νυκτῶν, μηνῶν, ἐνιαυτῶν, ἰσημεριῶν καὶ τροπῶν παράγει ἀριθμητὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητὴ τάξις τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων παράγει ἔννοιαν χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια χρόνου καὶ ἡ ζήτησις τῆς φύσεως τοῦ παντὸς παράγουσι φιλοσοφίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία ἐστὶ τὸ μέγιστον ἀγαθὸν ὃ θεοὶ δεδώκασι τῷ θνητῷ γένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","text":"Αἱ οὐράνιαι περίοδοι εἰσὶ συγγενεῖς ταῖς περιόδοις τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","text":"Αἱ τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης διανοίας περίοδοι εἰσὶ πεπλανημέναι καὶ ἀτάκτως τεταραγμέναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","text":"Ἡ μάθησις τῆς οὐρανίου τάξεως δύναται διὰ μιμήσεως νὰ καταστήσῃ τὴν διάνοιαν ὀρθὴν καὶ ἄπλανη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A9","text":"Ὁ λόγος, ἡ μουσικὴ ἁρμονία καὶ ὁ ῥυθμὸς δύνανται νὰ μετακοσμῶσι τὴν ἄτακτον ψυχὴν εἰς συμφωνίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A10","text":"Ἡ πλήρης κοσμολογικὴ ἐξήγησις ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ τῶν διὰ νοῦ καὶ τῶν διʼ ἀνάγκης γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις οὐχὶ μόνον πρὸς ἐλάττονας πρακτικὰς ὠφελείας ἐδόθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX2","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία οὐκ ἂν ἐγένετο ἄνευ θεάσεως τῶν οὐρανίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX3","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ ὄργανα οὐκ ὁρίζονται κατὰ τὴν ἡδονὴν ἣν παρέχουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX4","text":"Ἡ μουσικὴ οὐκ ἔχει κύριον τέλος τὴν ἄλογον ἡδονήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξάρτητον διακόσμησιν ἔξω τῆς ψυχικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX6","text":"Ὁ ῥυθμὸς οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλῶς ἀκρόαμα, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ ἀντιτάσσηται τῇ ἀμετρίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX7","text":"Ἡ περὶ τοῦ κόσμου ἐξήγησις οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται ἐν τοῖς διὰ νοῦ δημιουργηθεῖσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀστρονομικὴ παρατήρησις καθίσταται ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος τῆς φιλοσοφικῆς ἀναζητήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_28:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D2","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται νοητὸς ὡς ἀριθμητὴ τάξις κινήσεων καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς γυμνὴ διαδοχὴ παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D3","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία μετατρέπει τὰ αἰσθητὰ φαινόμενα εἰς παιδευτικὸν ὑπόδειγμα τῆς διανοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A3","CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D4","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία ἀποτελεῖ ὄχι ἁπλῆν γνώσιν τοῦ κόσμου, ἀλλὰ διόρθωσιν τοῦ γνωρίζοντος ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D5","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία καὶ ὁ ῥυθμὸς λειτουργοῦσι θεραπευτικῶς ἐπὶ τῆς ψυχῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἀναμορφοῦσι τὰς ἐν αὐτῇ κινήσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D6","text":"Ἡ χρήσις τῶν Μουσῶν γίνεται ὀρθὴ μόνον ὅταν ὁ νοῦς ἡγεμονεύῃ τῆς αἰσθητικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D7","text":"Ἡ θεία δωρεὰ τῶν αἰσθήσεων ἀποβλέπει εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ὁμοίωσιν πρὸς τὴν θείαν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐντάσσεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν ὅπου τὸ φαινόμενον ὑπηρετεῖ τῷ νοητῷ καὶ τὸ φυσικὸν τῷ ἠθικῷ μετασχηματισμῷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2","text":"Ὁ κόσμος λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐξωτερικὸς κανὼν διʼ οὗ ἡ ἀνθρώπινη ψυχὴ δύναται νὰ ἐπανιδρύσῃ τὴν ἰδίαν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη, ἡ φιλοσοφία καὶ ἡ μουσικὴ συγκροτοῦσιν ἕνα κοινὸν σχέδιον ἀποκαταστάσεως τῆς ψυχικῆς περιφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD4","text":"Ἡ θεολογικὴ τελεολογία συνδέει τὴν δωρεὰν τῶν αἰσθήσεων μὲ τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀνθρωπίνης αὐτοδιορθώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης ἀνοίγει δύο συμπληρωματικὰ ἐπεξηγηματικὰ πεδία ἐντὸς τῆς κοσμολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX1","text":"Ἡ γνώσις οὐκ ἀναπτύσσεται ὡς αὐτόνομος ἐσωτερικὴ ἐνέργεια ἀνεξάρτητος τῶν αἰσθητῶν προτύπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX2","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἄτακτος συσσώρευσις γεγονότων ἄνευ ἀριθμοῦ καὶ περιοδικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔχει ἐξ ἀρχῆς ἄπταιστον καὶ αὐτόνομον τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX4","text":"Ἡ πολιτισμικὴ ἢ αἰσθητικὴ ἐνέργεια οὐκ ἀξιολογεῖται κατὰ μόνην τὴν τέρψιν ἣν παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX5","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ μόνον ἀντικείμενον θεωρίας, ἀλλὰ ἀποκλείεται νὰ μένῃ ἄνευ μιμητικῆς ἐπιδράσεως ἐπὶ τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐπιστητὸς ἀλλὰ παιδευτικῶς ἀδιάφορος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ διάστασις μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς καὶ ψυχικῆς κινήσεως νὰ ᾖ ἀγεφύρωτος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἡδονὴ νὰ ἀποτελῇ τελικὸν κριτήριον τῆς ἀξίας τῶν αἰσθητῶν τεχνῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ κοσμολογικὴ ἀλήθεια νὰ ὁλοκληρωθῇ χωρὶς τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν τῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS1","text":"Ὄψις → θέα οὐρανίων κινήσεων → ἀριθμὸς → ἔννοια χρόνου → ζήτησις τῆς φύσεως τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS2","text":"Ζήτησις τοῦ παντός → φιλοσοφία → διάγνωσις τῆς πεπλανημένης ψυχικῆς περιφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS3","text":"Οὐράνια ἀπλανὴς περιοδικότης → συγγένεια πρὸς τὴν διάνοιαν → μίμησις → διόρθωσις τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS4","text":"Φωνὴ καὶ ἀκοή → λόγος καὶ μουσική → ἁρμονικὴ καὶ ῥυθμικὴ τάξις → κατακόσμησις τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS5","text":"Δημιουργία διὰ νοῦ → ἀνάγκη ὡς συμπληρωματικὸς παράγων → πληρεστέρα κοσμολογικὴ ἐξήγησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AF1","text":"Ἐρώτημα περὶ τῆς μεγίστης ὠφελείας τῶν ὀμμάτων → ἀναγωγὴ τῆς ὄψεως εἰς ὅρον κοσμολογίας → ἀριθμητικὴ καὶ χρονικὴ σύλληψις → γένεσις φιλοσοφίας → μίμησις οὐρανίου τάξεως → ἁρμονικὴ καὶ ῥυθμικὴ θεραπεία τῆς ψυχῆς → μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὰ διὰ νοῦ εἰς τὰ διʼ ἀνάγκης γιγνόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ βιολογικὸν ὄργανον εἰς ἀρχὴν φιλοσοφικῆς κοσμογνωσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀόριστον ῥοὴν εἰς μετρήσιμον καὶ περιοδικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME3","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ θεωρητικὴν ἐνασχόλησιν εἰς ἔργον ἐπανορθώσεως τῆς διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME4","text":"Ἡ μουσικὴ ἀποσπάται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπλὴν τέρψιν καὶ ἐντάσσεται εἰς παιδευτικὴν καὶ θεραπευτικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME5","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ ἐξήγησις διαιρεῖται εἰς τάξιν νοητὴν καὶ ἀναγκαστικήν, ὥστε ἡ δημιουργία νὰ μὴν ἀναχθῇ εἰς ἕνα μόνον αἴτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ ὄψις, ἡ ἀκοή, ἡ φωνή, ἡ μουσικὴ καὶ ὁ ῥυθμὸς ἐξετάζονται κατὰ τὰς ὠφελείας αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Αἱ αἰσθήσεις καὶ αἱ τέχναι μεσολαβοῦσι μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς περιοδικότητος καὶ ψυχικῆς ἀνατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ θεωρία ὀφείλει νὰ μετατρέπῃ τὴν παρατήρησιν εἰς μίμησιν καὶ τὴν ἀκρόασιν εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν συμφωνίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ ὂν συγκροτεῖται διὰ συμπλοκῆς νοῦ, περιοδικότητος καὶ ἀνάγκης, ἐνῶ ὁ χρόνος νοεῖται ὡς ἀριθμητὴ κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσιν πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ὄψιν εἰς τὴν φιλοσοφίαν καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν μουσικὴν εἰς τὴν ψυχικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάρθρωσις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀκολουθίαν αἰσθητόν → ἀριθμητόν → νοητόν → ψυχικῶς μετασχηματιστικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθʼ ὃν αἱ οὐράνιαι κινήσεις μεταδίδουσιν ὀρθότητα εἰς τὴν διάνοιαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἐπίσης ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις μεταξὺ τοῦ λόγου, τῆς μουσικῆς καὶ τῆς ἐνεργείας τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν ἀναλογίαν μεταξὺ κοσμικῶν καὶ ψυχικῶν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀνοίγει ἐσκεμμένως ἕτερον αἰτιολογικὸν πεδίον, ὃ δὲν ἀναπτύσσεται ἐνταῦθα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230626304141Z_01582126","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 47","source_sha256":"eeda9b4a44daf91f4d633bf338adb00dbacaae83c4469c7d053b230cdb486a94","sha256":"6221f3a4e0be3cc39e8ef78f87dd7b17705895b6457bf757ac930cf90db7676e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:06:26.307713+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS1","text":"Sight is presented as the greatest cause of human benefits, since without contemplation of the heavens, discourses concerning the all would not have arisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS2","text":"The viewing of celestial phenomena transforms sensation into numerical order and a conception of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS3","text":"From temporal and cosmic order philosophy is born, as the greatest divine gift to the mortal race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS4","text":"Cosmic periodicity provides a model for the correction of the errant revolutions of human thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS5","text":"Voice, hearing, harmony, and rhythm were given for the adornment and concord of the disorderly soul, not for irrational pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AS6","text":"The explanation of things created through intellect is completed through reference to things coming to be through necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","text":"Sight makes possible the viewing of stars, the sun, and the heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","text":"The viewing of days, nights, months, years, equinoxes, and solstices produces numerical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A3","text":"The numerical order of celestial motions produces a conception of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","text":"The conception of time and the inquiry into the nature of the all produce philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","text":"Philosophy is the greatest good that the gods have given to the mortal race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","text":"The celestial revolutions are akin to the revolutions of human thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","text":"The revolutions of human thought are errant and disturbed in a disorderly manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","text":"Learning celestial order can, through imitation, render thought correct and unerring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A9","text":"Speech, musical harmony, and rhythm can reorder the disorderly soul into concord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:A10","text":"A complete cosmological explanation requires a distinction between things that come to be through intellect and those that come to be through necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX1","text":"Sight was not given merely for lesser practical benefits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX2","text":"Philosophy would not have arisen without contemplation of the heavens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX3","text":"The sense organs are not determined by the pleasure that they provide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX4","text":"Music does not have irrational pleasure as its principal end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX5","text":"Harmony does not constitute an independent adornment apart from psychic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX6","text":"Rhythm is not merely something heard, but can oppose lack of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:NX7","text":"The explanation concerning the cosmos is not exhausted in things created through intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D1","text":"Astronomical observation becomes a necessary condition of philosophical inquiry.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_28:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D2","text":"Time becomes intelligible as the numerical order of motions and not as a bare succession of affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D3","text":"Cosmology transforms sensible phenomena into an educational model for thought.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A3","CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D4","text":"Philosophy constitutes not mere knowledge of the cosmos, but correction of the knowing subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D5","text":"Harmony and rhythm function therapeutically upon the soul, because they reform the motions within it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D6","text":"The use of the Muses becomes correct only when intellect governs sensory activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:D7","text":"The divine gift of the senses aims at inward assimilation to divine order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD1","text":"Sensation is integrated into a hierarchy in which the phenomenal serves the intelligible and the natural serves ethical transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A1","CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2","text":"The cosmos functions as an external norm through which the human soul can re-establish its own order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD3","text":"Science, philosophy, and music constitute a common plan for the restoration of psychic revolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A4","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD4","text":"Theological teleology connects the gift of the senses with the necessity of human self-correction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A5","CH_JP8E_S_28:A7","CH_JP8E_S_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SD5","text":"The distinction between intellect and necessity opens two complementary explanatory fields within cosmology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX1","text":"Knowledge does not develop as an autonomous internal activity independent of sensible models.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX2","text":"Nature is not interpreted as a disorderly accumulation of events without number and periodicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX3","text":"The human soul does not possess from the outset an unfailing and autonomous order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX4","text":"Cultural or aesthetic activity is not evaluated solely according to the enjoyment it produces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX5","text":"Cosmic order does not constitute merely an object of contemplation, but is precluded from remaining without an imitative effect upon the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX1","text":"A cosmos that is knowable but educationally indifferent is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX2","text":"It is excluded that the gap between cosmic and psychic motion be unbridgeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX3","text":"It is excluded that pleasure constitute the final criterion of the value of the sensible arts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:SNX4","text":"It is excluded that cosmological truth be completed without recognition of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS1","text":"Sight → viewing of celestial motions → number → conception of time → inquiry into the nature of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS2","text":"Inquiry into the all → philosophy → diagnosis of the errant psychic revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS3","text":"Unerring celestial periodicity → kinship with thought → imitation → correction of the revolutions within us.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS4","text":"Voice and hearing → speech and music → harmonic and rhythmic order → adornment of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS5","text":"Creation through intellect → necessity as a complementary factor → fuller cosmological explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:AF1","text":"Question concerning the greatest benefit of the eyes → elevation of sight into a condition of cosmology → numerical and temporal apprehension → birth of philosophy → imitation of celestial order → harmonic and rhythmic therapy of the soul → transition from things through intellect to things coming to be through necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1","text":"Sight is reclassified from a biological organ into a principle of philosophical knowledge of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","text":"Time is reclassified from an indeterminate flow into measurable and periodic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME3","text":"Philosophy is reclassified from a theoretical occupation into a work of restoring thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME4","text":"Music is detached from mere enjoyment and integrated into an educational and therapeutic function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ME5","text":"Cosmological explanation is divided into intelligible and necessitating order, so that creation is not reduced to a single cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Sight, hearing, voice, music, and rhythm are examined according to their benefits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The senses and arts mediate between cosmic periodicity and psychic reordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Theory must transform observation into imitation and listening into inward concord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is constituted through the interweaving of intellect, periodicity, and necessity, while time is conceived as numbered motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the transition from sight to philosophy and from music to psychic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2","text":"The structure preserves the sequence sensible → numerable → intelligible → psychically transformative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT3","text":"The precise manner in which celestial motions transmit correctness to thought is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT4","text":"The precise relation between speech, music, and the activity of intellect is likewise underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT5","text":"The mechanism is internally coherent, but rests upon the analogy between cosmic and psychic revolutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT6","text":"The reference to necessity deliberately opens another causal field, which is not developed here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_28@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_28:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 47"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 31","title":"Section 47","context":"Chapter 31","original_title":"Section 47","original_context":"Chapter 31"},"original_title":"Section 47","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29","layer":"CH","title":"Section 48","order":32,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_29"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_29@R001","sha256":"d9e1fd7b98e7df0d0857cc2e9165680c208997acb2f05fd3826d36bafa4cc841","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS1","text":"Τὸ γίγνεσθαι τοῦ κόσμου ἐκ συνθέσεως νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS2","text":"Ὁ νοῦς τὴν ἀνάγκην πείθων τὰ γιγνόμενα ὡς ἐπὶ τὸ βέλτιστον ἄγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις οὐκ ἀρκεί, ἐὰν μὴ καὶ ἡ πλανωμένη αἰτία ληφθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναχωρεῖ πρὸ τῆς οὐρανοῦ γενέσεως, ἵνα θεωρήσῃ τὴν προκοσμικὴν φύσιν τῶν στοιχείων καὶ τὰ πάθη αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία τοῦ λόγου ὁρίζει τὸν παρόντα λόγον ὡς εἰκότα καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀναγκαίως ἀποδεικτικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS6","text":"Ἡ νέα ἀρχὴ διαιρέσει τὸ παντὸς γένος εἰς τρία, ἀντὶ τῶν πρότερον δύο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","text":"Ἡ τοῦ κόσμου γένεσις ἐκ νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης μεμειγμένων συνέστηκεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","text":"Ὁ νοῦς ἄρχει τῆς ἀνάγκης διὰ πειθοῦς, οὐ διὰ βιαίας καταλύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη ἀντιστέκεται τῇ νοερᾷ τάξει, ἀλλὰ πείθεται ἐπὶ τὸ βέλτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","text":"Ἡ πλανωμένη αἰτία συντελεῖ τῇ γενέσει τῶν γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις προϋποθέτει προκοσμικὴν κατάστασιν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","text":"Τὸ πῦρ, ὕδωρ, ἀήρ, καὶ γῆ οὐκ ἀποδεικνύονται αὐτόματα ἀρχαὶ τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A7","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα ἔχουσι φύσιν καὶ πάθη πρὸ τῆς οὐρανοῦ γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","text":"Ὁ παρὼν τρόπος διεξόδου οὐκ ἐξαρκεῖ πρὸς δήλωσιν τῆς ἀπολύτου ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A9","text":"Ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει διαφυλάττειν τὴν δύναμιν τῶν εἰκότων λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A10","text":"Ἡ περὶ τοῦ παντὸς διήγησις χρειάζεται νέα διαίρεσιν γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ τοῦ κόσμου γένεσις ἔργον ἀνάγκης μόνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ὁ νοῦς κύριος διὰ καταναγκασμοῦ, ἀλλὰ διὰ πειθοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἐξαιρετέα ἐστὶν ἡ πλανωμένη αἰτία ὡς ἀσήμαντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεί ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὰ τέσσαρα στοιχεῖα ὡς εἰς ἀρχὰς δεδομένας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX5","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ὁ λόγος ποιεῖν ὡς εἰδὼς ἤδη τί ποτε ἐστὶν ἕκαστον στοιχεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX6","text":"Οὐκ ἀξιοῖ ὁ λόγος ἀναγκαίαν ἀπόδειξιν ἐν τῷ παρόντι τρόπῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX7","text":"Οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται τὸ γένος τοῦ παντὸς διὰ τῆς πρότερον διαιρέσεως εἰς δύο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ νοῦς τὴν ἀνάγκην πείθει, ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις προκύπτει ἐκ συνδιαλλαγῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἐκ ἑνὸς αἰτίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ πλανωμένη αἰτία μετέχει τῆς γενέσεως, ἡ ἐπιστήμη τοῦ κόσμου ἀπαιτεῖ λόγον καὶ τῆς ἀταξίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ προκοσμικὴ κατάστασις προϋποτίθεται, ἡ ἐξήγησις τῆς τάξεως ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀναζητήσῃ πρότερον ὑλικόν καὶ παθητικόν πεδίον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ στοιχεῖα οὐκ εἰσὶν αὐτόδηλοι ἀρχαί, ἡ ὀντολογία αὐτῶν πρέπει νὰ ἀναζητηθῇ πρὸ τῆς κοσμικῆς μορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ παρὼν τρόπος λόγου ἀδυνατεῖ τὴν ἀπόλυτον δήλωσιν, ἡ μέθοδος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν βεβαιότητα εἰς τὴν εἰκότα πιθανότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","CH_JP8E_S_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ νέα ἀρχὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἄλλην διαίρεσιν, ἡ κοσμολογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς τριμερῆ ὀντολογικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου νοεῖται ὡς ἐπιτυχὴς ἐπιβολὴ μορφῆς ἐπὶ ἀντιστεκομένης ὕλης, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀπουσία ἀταξίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3","CH_JP8E_S_29:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD2","text":"Ἡ αἰτιολογία γίνεται ἱεραρχική· ὁ νοῦς παρέχει τὸ τέλος, ἡ ἀνάγκη τὴν ἀντίστασιν, καὶ ἡ πλανωμένη αἰτία τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἀναστροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀξίωσις περιορίζεται ἐκ τῆς ἀδυναμίας δηλώσεως τῶν ἀρχῶν, ἀλλὰ διασώζεται διὰ τῆς εἰκότος διηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","CH_JP8E_S_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναζήτησις τῆς ἀρχῆς ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις προϋποθέτει ὄχι μόνον ἀρχὴν ἀλλὰ καὶ ὑποδοχὴν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ τάξις δύναται νὰ ἐξηγηθῇ χωρὶς ἀντίστασιν καὶ ἀταξίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι τὰ αἰσθητὰ στοιχεῖα εἰσὶν ἔσχαται καὶ αὐτοθεμελίωτοι ἀρχαί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ταύτισιν τῆς ἀληθείας μὲ τὴν ἀπολύτως ἀναγκαίαν ἀπόδειξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει κοσμολογίαν ἥτις δὲν διακρίνει τὸ μορφοποιοῦν αἴτιον ἀπὸ τὸ παθητικὸν πεδίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ λόγου ἡ δυνατότης πλήρους ἐποπτείας τῆς ἀπολύτου ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἁπλῆ ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ παντὸς εἰς ἓν μόνον γένος αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ὑπολειπομένη ἀβεβαιότης περὶ τῶν ἀρχῶν δὲν ἐξαλείφεται, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπεται εἰς ὅρον τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS1","text":"Ἀνάγκη καὶ νοῦς → συνθετὴ γένεσις τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS2","text":"Πειθὼ τοῦ νοῦ → ὑποταγὴ τῆς ἀνάγκης εἰς τὸ βέλτιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS3","text":"Ἀναγνώρισις πλανωμένης αἰτίας → ἀναχώρησις πρὸ τῆς κοσμικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS4","text":"Προκοσμικὴ φύσις καὶ πάθη στοιχείων → ἀναίρεσις τῶν αὐτοθεμελίωτων στοιχειακῶν ἀρχῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS5","text":"Ὅριον τοῦ λόγου → εἰκὼς διήγησις → νέα τριμερὴς διαίρεσις τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AF1","text":"Μεικτὴ γένεσις → πειθὴ νοῦ πρὸς ἀνάγκην → ἀναγνώρισις πλανωμένης αἰτίας → ἀναδρομὴ εἰς τὸ προκοσμικόν → ἀποστασιοποίησις ἀπὸ τῶν δεδομένων στοιχειακῶν ἀρχῶν → περιορισμὸς εἰς εἰκότα λόγον → τριμερὴς ἀρχὴ τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἔσχατον ἐμπόδιον εἰς συντελεστὴν τῆς κοσμικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME2","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα μεταταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ δεδομένας ἀρχὰς εἰς φαινόμενα ἔχοντα προτέραν φύσιν καὶ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME3","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν τοῦ οὐρανοῦ εἰς τὴν προϊστορίαν τοῦ ὑλικοῦ πεδίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀξίωσις ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς πιστὴ εἰκὼς ὑπὸ ὅρους γνωστικῆς ἀνεπάρκειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐξηγεῖται ἡ γένεσις τοῦ κόσμου ἐκ νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου διακρίνεται ἡ μορφοποιοῦσα πειθὼ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀντιστεκομένην αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ λόγος ἀναθεωρεῖ τὴν μέθοδον αὐτοῦ, ἐγκαταλείπων τὴν ἀξίωσιν ἀπολύτου δηλώσεως καὶ διασώζων τὸ εἰκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ ὂν τοῦ κόσμου προϋποθέτει τρίτον γένος ὑποδοχῆς μεταξὺ νοητῆς τάξεως καὶ γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμικὴν γένεσιν εἰς τὴν τριμερῆ διαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν συμπληρωματικὴ διάκρισιν νοῦ, ἀνάγκης, καὶ πλανωμένης αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τοῦ τρίτου γένους, ἐπειδὴ ἐνταῦθα μόνον προαναγγέλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT4","text":"Ἡ μεγαλύτερη ἔντασις ἔγκειται μεταξὺ τῆς ἀξιώσεως περὶ τῆς κοσμικῆς αἰτιότητος καὶ τῆς ὁμολογουμένης ἀδυναμίας πλήρους δηλώσεως τῶν ἀρχῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν διατηρῇ τὴν ἀναδρομὴν, τὸ εἰκὸς, καὶ τὴν ἀνολοκλήρωτον τριμερῆ ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230642015559Z_b4813d5e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 48","source_sha256":"d9e1fd7b98e7df0d0857cc2e9165680c208997acb2f05fd3826d36bafa4cc841","sha256":"699a25c21f9f044d7022c9ef3b7286f2bcb348e288b9afe3855e7e2d32e55829","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:06:42.017915+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS1","text":"The coming-to-be of the cosmos is explained from a combination of intellect and necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS2","text":"Intellect, persuading necessity, leads the things that come to be toward what is best, for the most part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS3","text":"Cosmic coming-to-be is not sufficient unless the wandering cause is also taken into account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS4","text":"The explanation withdraws to before the generation of heaven, in order to contemplate the precosmic nature of the elements and their affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS5","text":"The difficulty of the account defines the present discourse as likely and not as necessarily demonstrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AS6","text":"The new beginning will divide the kind of the all into three, instead of the former two.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","text":"The coming-to-be of the cosmos has been constituted from intellect and necessity mixed together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","text":"Intellect rules necessity through persuasion, not through violent subjugation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A3","text":"Necessity resists intelligible order, but is persuaded toward what is best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","text":"The wandering cause contributes to the coming-to-be of things that come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","text":"Cosmic coming-to-be presupposes a precosmic condition of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","text":"Fire, water, air, and earth are not self-evidently established as principles of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A7","text":"The elements have a nature and affections before the generation of heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","text":"The present mode of exposition is not sufficient for a declaration of the absolute principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A9","text":"The account must preserve the force of likely accounts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:A10","text":"The account concerning the all requires a new division of kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX1","text":"The coming-to-be of the cosmos is not the work of necessity alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX2","text":"Intellect is not master through compulsion, but through persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX3","text":"The wandering cause is not to be excluded as insignificant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX4","text":"Reference to the four elements as given principles is not sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX5","text":"The account is not permitted to proceed as though it already knew what each element is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX6","text":"The account does not claim a necessary demonstration in the present mode.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:NX7","text":"The kind of the all is not exhausted by the former division into two.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D1","text":"Since intellect persuades necessity, cosmic order results from a negotiation and not from a single cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D2","text":"Since the wandering cause participates in coming-to-be, knowledge of the cosmos requires an account of disorder as well.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D3","text":"Since the precosmic condition is presupposed, the explanation of order is compelled to seek a prior material and passive field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D4","text":"Since the elements are not self-evident principles, their ontology must be sought before cosmic formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D5","text":"Since the present mode of discourse is unable to make an absolute declaration, the method passes from certainty to likely probability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","CH_JP8E_S_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:D6","text":"Since the new beginning requires another division, cosmology is transformed into a tripartite ontological arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1","text":"The order of the cosmos is conceived as the successful imposition of form upon resisting matter, not as the absence of disorder.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3","CH_JP8E_S_29:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD2","text":"Causation becomes hierarchical: intellect provides the end, necessity the resistance, and the wandering cause the field of reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:A4","CH_JP8E_S_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3","text":"The scientific claim is limited by the inability to declare the principles, but is preserved through the likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A8","CH_JP8E_S_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SD4","text":"The search for the principle reveals that cosmic order presupposes not only a principle but also a receptacle of coming-to-be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A5","CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that order can be explained without resistance and disorder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that the perceptible elements are ultimate and self-grounding principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the identification of truth with absolutely necessary demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a cosmology that does not distinguish the form-producing cause from the passive field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a complete apprehension of the absolute principle is absent from the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX2","text":"The simple reduction of the all to one single kind of cause is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3","text":"The residual uncertainty concerning the principles is not eliminated, but is transformed into a condition of the likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS1","text":"Necessity and intellect → composite coming-to-be of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS2","text":"Persuasion of intellect → subordination of necessity to what is best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS3","text":"Recognition of the wandering cause → withdrawal to before cosmic coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS4","text":"Precosmic nature and affections of the elements → refutation of self-grounding elemental principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS5","text":"Limit of the account → likely account → new tripartite division of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:AF1","text":"Composite coming-to-be → persuasion of intellect over necessity → recognition of the wandering cause → regression to the precosmic → distancing from given elemental principles → restriction to a likely account → tripartite principle of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME1","text":"Necessity is shifted from an ultimate obstacle to a contributor to cosmic coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME2","text":"The elements are reclassified from given principles into phenomena having a prior nature and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME3","text":"Cosmology is extended from the coming-to-be of heaven to the prehistory of the material field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ME4","text":"The scientific claim is reshaped as a faithful likeness under conditions of epistemic insufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the coming-to-be of the cosmos from intellect and necessity is explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, form-producing persuasion is distinguished from resistant causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the account revises its method, abandoning the claim of absolute declaration and preserving likelihood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the being of the cosmos presupposes a third kind of receptacle between intelligible order and things that come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the transition from cosmic coming-to-be to the tripartite division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT2","text":"The internal coherence rests on the complementary distinction of intellect, necessity, and the wandering cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT3","text":"The precise nature of the third kind is underdetermined, since here it is only announced in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT4","text":"The greatest tension lies between the claim concerning cosmic causality and the acknowledged inability fully to declare the principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account if it maintains the regression, likelihood, and the incomplete tripartite principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_29:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_29@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_29:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 48"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 32","title":"Section 48","context":"Chapter 32","original_title":"Section 48","original_context":"Chapter 32"},"original_title":"Section 48","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30","layer":"CH","title":"Section 49","order":33,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_30"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_30@R001","sha256":"59fbc051b33248d5f6fdca49c4b6ac39feae907eb2e070038ebf28cb5f295f19","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS1","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀναγκάζεται νὰ προσθέσῃ τρίτον γένος πρὸς τὸ νοητὸ παράδειγμα καὶ τὸ γενόμενον μίμημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS2","text":"Τὸ τρίτον γένος τίθεται ὡς ὑποδοχὴ πάσης γενέσεως καὶ ὡς τιθήνη τῶν γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS3","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῶν στοιχείων καθιστᾷ ἀβέβαιον τὸ ἀποδίδειν αὐτοῖς πάγιαν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS4","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία τῶν φαινομένων ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ ὀνομάτων δηλούντων τὸ τοιοῦτον καὶ τὸ ἀεὶ περιφερόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς διάκρισις τῶν γιγνομένων ἀπαιτεῖ λόγον ἐπιεικῆ μᾶλλον ἢ ἀμετάκλητον βεβαιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","text":"Τὸ νοητὸ παράδειγμα ἔχει τὸ εἶναι ἀεὶ κατὰ ταὐτά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","text":"Τὸ ὁρατὸ γιγνόμενον εἶναι μίμημα τοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A3","text":"Τρίτον γένος ὑπάρχει ὡς ὑποδοχὴ πάσης γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A4","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ λειτουργεῖ ὡς τιθήνη τῶν γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα μεταβάλλονται ἀμοιβαίως εἰς ἄλληλα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A6","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ δύναται νὰ γίγνηται γῆ, λίθος, ἀήρ, πῦρ, νέφος, ὁμίχλη καὶ πάλιν ὕδωρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","text":"Ὅ,τι ἀεὶ μεταβάλλεται, δὲν παρέχει ἀσφαλῆ ὑπόστασιν διὰ μόνιμον ὀνομασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","text":"Ἡ δεικτικὴ φράσις «τόδε» ἢ «τοῦτο» ὑποβάλλει ψευδῶς μονιμότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A9","text":"Ἀσφαλέστερον ἐστὶ τὸ μεταβαλλόμενον νὰ ὀνομάζηται κατὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον, οὐ κατὰ πάγιον ὄνομα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A10","text":"Ὁ περὶ τῶν γιγνομένων λόγος δύναται νὰ εἶναι μόνον εἰκὼς καὶ ἐπιεικής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX1","text":"Τὸ τρίτον γένος δὲν εἶναι οὔτε τὸ νοητὸ παράδειγμα οὔτε τὸ ὁρατὸ μίμημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX2","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον δὲν εἶναι ὂν ἀμετάβλητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX3","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ δὲν εἶναι πάγιον «τοῦτο» ἀνεξαρτήτως τῶν μεταμορφώσεών του.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX4","text":"Τὸ πῦρ, ὁ ἀήρ, ἡ γῆ καὶ τὰ λοιπὰ δὲν ἔχουν ἑκάστως ἀκλόνητον ταυτότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX5","text":"Ἡ δεικτικὴ ὀνομασία δὲν ἀποκαλύπτει κατ’ ἀνάγκην βεβαίαν οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX6","text":"Οὐδεὶς ἀκριβὴς λόγος δύναται νὰ στηριχθῇ σὲ ὅ,τι συνεχῶς διαλύεται καὶ συντίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία μεταβολὴ τῶν στοιχείων ἀφαιρεῖ ἀπὸ τὰ φαινόμενα τὴν ἀξίωσιν σταθερᾶς ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὕδωρ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς πολλά, τὸ ὄνομα «ὕδωρ» δηλοῖ εἶδος μεταβολῆς μᾶλλον ἢ ἀμετάβλητον πράγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A6","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τοῦ «τόδε» ἀπαιτεῖ ἀντικατάστασιν τῆς οὐσιαστικῆς ὀνοματοθεσίας ὑπὸ περιγραφῆς τοῦ τρόπου τοῦ γίγνεσθαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D4","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ καθίσταται ἀναγκαία ὡς χωριστὸς ὅρος, ἐπειδὴ τὸ παράδειγμα καὶ τὸ μίμημα δὲν ἐξηγοῦν μόνα τὸ γίγνεσθαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D5","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ τῶν μεταβαλλομένων ὀφείλει νὰ παραμένῃ εἰκὼς, ἐπειδὴ ἀντικείμενά του εἶναι ἀσταθῆ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης διαιρείται ὄχι μόνον εἰς παράδειγμα καὶ φαινόμενον, ἀλλὰ καὶ εἰς τόπον ὑποδοχῆς, ὅπου ἡ γένεσις καθίσταται δυνατή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD2","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία τῶν φαινομένων μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναζήτησιν πραγμάτων εἰς τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν μεταβαλλόντων σχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD3","text":"Ἡ γλῶσσα ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ δὲν δύναται νὰ τὴν καθηλώσῃ ὡς μόνιμον οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD4","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ μεταβολὴ καταλύει τὴν ἀφελῆ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ἀρχικοῦ στοιχείου καὶ παραγώγου μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX1","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον δὲν δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς αὐτοτελὴς οὐσία ἀποκομμένη ἀπὸ τὴν ὑποδοχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἐμπειρικὴ ὄψις δὲν ἀρκεῖ γιὰ νὰ θεμελιώσῃ ὀντολογικὴ βεβαιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀλλαγὴ δὲν εἶναι ἐπιφανειακὸ πάθος ἀμεταβλήτων πραγμάτων, ἀλλὰ ὅρος τοῦ τρόπου καθ’ ὃν τὰ πράγματα φαίνονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία δὲν ἔχει πλήρη κυριότητα ἐπὶ τοῦ ὄντος, ὅταν τὸ ὂν ἐμφανίζεται μόνον διὰ μεταβάσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX5","text":"Ὁ ἀκριβὴς ἀποφαντικὸς λόγος περὶ τῶν στοιχείων προϋποθέτει σταθερότητα, ἣν τὰ στοιχεῖα αὐτὰ δὲν διαθέτουν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ φαινόμενον εἶναι ἁπλῶς ἕν πράγμα μὲν ἐμφανιζόμενον ὑπὸ πολλὰς μορφάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης σύμπτωσις ὀνόματος, πράγματος καὶ ὑποκειμένου ὑποστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἐξάλειψις τῆς ἀβεβαιότητος διὰ ἁπλῆς ἐπιμονῆς εἰς τὰ δεικτικά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ παραμένει ἀναγκαία ὡς ἀπρόσωπος ὅρος, ὃς δὲν μεταπίπτει εἰς ἕν ἀπὸ τὰ φαινόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS1","text":"Νοητὸ παράδειγμα → ὁρατὸ μίμημα → ἀνεπάρκεια δυαδικοῦ σχήματος → ὑποδοχὴ γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS2","text":"Ὑποδοχὴ → ἀμοιβαία μεταβολὴ στοιχείων → κυκλικὴ γένεσις → ἀστάθεια ταυτοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS3","text":"Ἀστάθεια ταυτοτήτων → ἀδυναμία κυριολεκτικοῦ «τόδε» → ὀνομασία τοῦ τοιούτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS4","text":"Μεταβαλλόμενον φαινόμενον → ἀνάγκη εἰκότος λόγου → ἀποφυγὴ ἀμετάκλητης ὀντολογικῆς βεβαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AF1","text":"Δυαδικὸν ὀντολογικὸν σχήμα → ἀνάγκη τρίτου γένους → ὑποδοχὴ τῆς γενέσεως → κυκλικὴ μεταμόρφωσις → ἀστάθεια στοιχειακῆς ταυτότητος → ἀπόρριψις τοῦ «τόδε» → λόγος περὶ τοῦ τοιούτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME1","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ χαρτογράφησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ δύο γένη εἰς τριμερὲς σχήμα παραδείγματος, μιμήματος καὶ ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME2","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἰδίας οὐσίας εἰς προσωρινοὺς σχηματισμοὺς μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξὺ «εἶναι» καὶ «γίγνεσθαι» ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ διαφορᾶς μεταξὺ σταθεροῦ παραδείγματος καὶ περιφερομένου φαινομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4","text":"Ἡ γλωσσικὴ ἀκρίβεια ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται ὡς πιστὴ παρακολούθησις τῆς μεταβολῆς, οὐχὶ ὡς κατοχὴ μονίμου ὀνόματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὰ στοιχεῖα περιγράφονται ὡς μεταβαλλόμενα ἀπὸ μίαν μορφὴν εἰς ἄλλην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ ὑποδοχὴν διακεκριμένην ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα καὶ τὰ ἐν αὐτῇ γιγνόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ παραιτηθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀξίωσιν ἀπόλυτης δηλώσεως καὶ νὰ χρησιμοποιήσῃ εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ σταθερὸ εἶναι ἀνήκει τῷ παραδείγματι, ἐνῷ τὸ φαινόμενον χαρακτηρίζεται ὑπὸ γένεσιν, μεταβολὴν καὶ ἀδυναμίαν μονίμου δεικτικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι γιὰ νὰ ἀνασυστήσουν τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὸ δυαδικὸ σχῆμα εἰς τὸ τρίτον γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία τῆς κυκλικῆς μεταβολῆς ἀρκεῖ γιὰ νὰ παραχθῇ ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῶν παγίων ὀνομάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT3","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ’ ὅσον διακρίνει τὸ ἀμετάβλητον παράδειγμα ἀπὸ τὸ μεταβαλλόμενον φαινόμενον καὶ τὴν ὑποδοχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ τρόπος καθ’ ὃν ἡ ὑποδοχὴ σχετίζεται ἀκριβῶς πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα, ἐπειδὴ λειτουργεῖ κυρίως ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα πλευρὰ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ παραγωγὴ γλωσσικῆς ἀβεβαιότητος ἀπὸ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἔντασις παραμένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας ὀνομασίας τῶν στοιχείων καὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας νὰ δηλωθῇ ὁποιονδήποτε στοιχεῖον ὡς πάγιον «τοῦτο».","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διασώζει τὴν βασικὴ κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ συμπιέζει τὴν ἀπορίαν περὶ τοῦ πῶς ἡ ὑποδοχὴ καθίσταται νοητὴ ἄνευ ἰδίας φαινομενικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230659130610Z_fffb9c78","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 49","source_sha256":"59fbc051b33248d5f6fdca49c4b6ac39feae907eb2e070038ebf28cb5f295f19","sha256":"f5e510ada6f07b337c578fd69233aa6f41afcfb2ff88c29f65cc6e797c7e1507","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:06:59.131636+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS1","text":"The argument is compelled to add a third kind alongside the intelligible paradigm and the generated imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS2","text":"The third kind is posited as the receptacle of all becoming and as the nurse of things that come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS3","text":"The transformation of the elements makes it uncertain to ascribe a fixed being to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS4","text":"The naming of phenomena is replaced by names signifying the such-like and that which is ever in circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AS5","text":"The precise distinction of things that come to be requires a fitting account rather than irrevocable certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","text":"The intelligible paradigm possesses being always in the same respect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","text":"The visible thing that comes to be is an imitation of the paradigm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A3","text":"A third kind exists as the receptacle of all becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A4","text":"The receptacle functions as the nurse of things that come to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","text":"Phenomena change reciprocally into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A6","text":"Water can become earth, stone, air, fire, cloud, mist, and again water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","text":"Whatever always changes does not provide a secure subsistence for a permanent name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","text":"The demonstrative expression «τόδε» or «τοῦτο» falsely suggests permanence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A9","text":"It is safer for what changes to be named according to the such-like, not according to a fixed name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:A10","text":"The account concerning things that come to be can be only likely and fitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX1","text":"The third kind is neither the intelligible paradigm nor the visible imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX2","text":"What comes to be is not an unchanging being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX3","text":"Water is not a fixed «τοῦτο» independently of its transformations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX4","text":"Fire, air, earth, and the rest do not each have an unshaken identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX5","text":"Demonstrative naming does not necessarily disclose a certain being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:NX6","text":"No precise account can be based on that which continually dissolves and is compounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D1","text":"The reciprocal transformation of the elements removes from phenomena the claim to stable identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D2","text":"Since water appears as many things, the name «ὕδωρ» signifies a mode of change rather than an unchanging thing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A6","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D3","text":"The rejection of «τόδε» requires the replacement of substantive naming by a description of the manner of becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D4","text":"The receptacle becomes necessary as a separate term, since the paradigm and the imitation alone do not explain becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:D5","text":"The account concerning changing things must remain likely, because its objects are unstable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1","text":"Reality is divided not only into paradigm and phenomenon, but also into a place of reception, where becoming becomes possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A1","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2","CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD2","text":"The ontology of phenomena shifts from the search for things to the recognition of changing formations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD3","text":"Language is compelled to follow becoming, but cannot fix it as a permanent being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A7","CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SD4","text":"Cyclical transformation dissolves the naive distinction between an original element and a derivative form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A5","CH_JP8E_S_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX1","text":"What comes to be cannot be conceived as a self-subsistent being cut off from the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX2","text":"Empirical appearance is not sufficient to ground ontological certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX3","text":"Change is not a superficial affection of unchanging things, but a condition of the manner in which things appear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX4","text":"Naming does not have complete mastery over being when being appears only through transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX5","text":"A precise assertoric account of the elements presupposes a stability which the elements themselves do not possess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX1","text":"The idea that the phenomenon is simply one thing appearing under many forms is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2","text":"The complete coincidence of name, thing, and subject of subsistence is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX3","text":"The elimination of uncertainty through mere insistence on demonstratives is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4","text":"The receptacle remains necessary as an impersonal term which does not pass over into one of the phenomena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS1","text":"Intelligible paradigm → visible imitation → inadequacy of the dual schema → receptacle of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS2","text":"Receptacle → reciprocal transformation of elements → cyclical becoming → instability of identities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS3","text":"Instability of identities → impossibility of literal «τόδε» → naming of the such-like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS4","text":"Changing phenomenon → necessity of a likely account → avoidance of irrevocable ontological certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:AF1","text":"Dual ontological schema → necessity of a third kind → receptacle of becoming → cyclical transformation → instability of elemental identity → rejection of «τόδε» → account concerning the such-like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME1","text":"Ontological mapping moves from two kinds to a tripartite schema of paradigm, imitation, and receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME2","text":"The elements are reclassified from proper beings into temporary formations of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME3","text":"The opposition between «εἶναι» and «γίγνεσθαι» is replaced by a difference between stable paradigm and circulating phenomenon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4","text":"Linguistic precision is redefined as faithful tracking of change, not as possession of a permanent name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the elements are described as changing from one form into another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT2","text":"Structurally, becoming requires a receptacle distinct from the paradigm and from the things coming to be within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the account must relinquish the claim to absolute assertion and employ a likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, stable being belongs to the paradigm, whereas the phenomenon is characterized by becoming, change, and the impossibility of permanent demonstrative identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the dual schema to the third kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT2","text":"The sequence of cyclical transformation suffices to produce the rejection of fixed names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as it distinguishes the unchanging paradigm from the changing phenomenon and the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT4","text":"The manner in which the receptacle relates precisely to the paradigm is underdetermined, since it functions principally as a necessary condition of reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT5","text":"The stronger aspect of the system is the derivation of linguistic uncertainty from ontological change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT6","text":"The internal tension remains between the necessary naming of the elements and the impossibility of designating any element as a fixed «τοῦτο».","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the fundamental movement of the account, but compresses the aporia concerning how the receptacle becomes intelligible without a proper phenomenal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_30@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_30:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 49"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 33","title":"Section 49","context":"Chapter 33","original_title":"Section 49","original_context":"Chapter 33"},"original_title":"Section 49","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5","layer":"CH","title":"Section 50","order":34,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC5"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC5@R001","sha256":"9dd00602fd34ba4842ed16653b152c44bf028ff0f29c547fbb3f8e71e0f9f8ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS1","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον καὶ μεταβαλλόμενον οὐκ ἀσφαλῶς ὡς αὐτὸ τὸ ὄν προσαγορεύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀσφαλεστάτη προσηγορία τοῦ ὑποκειμένου ἐστὶν ὅτι χρυσός, οὐχ ὅτι τρίγωνον ἢ ἄλλο σχῆμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS3","text":"Ἡ τὰ πάντα δεχομένη φύσις ἀεὶ ταὐτὴ λέγεσθαι δεῖ, ἐπειδὴ μορφὴν ἰδίαν οὐδέποτε λαμβάνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS4","text":"Τὰ εἰσιόντα καὶ ἐξιόντα μιμήματα τῶν ὄντων ἐστίν, οὐχ αὐτὰ τὰ ὄντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5","text":"Τρία γένη διανοητέα καθίστανται· τὸ γιγνόμενον, τὸ ἐν ᾧ γίγνεται, καὶ τὸ ὅθεν ἀφομοιοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS6","text":"Ὁ δεχόμενος πατρὶ μὲν καὶ μητρὶ εἰκάζεται, ἡ δὲ μεταξὺ φύσις ἐκγόνῳ, ἵνα ἡ γένεσις ὡς σχέσις ὑποκειμένου, προτύπου καὶ ἐκτυπώματος νοηθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον ἀεὶ ἐν μεταβολῇ καὶ ἀφανείᾳ διατελεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A2","text":"Τὸ μεταβαλλόμενον οὐκ ἔχει βεβαίαν ὀντολογικὴν ὀνομασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῶν μεταβολῶν ἀσφαλέστερον ὡς χρυσὸς ἢ ὡς σχῆμα προσαγορεύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","text":"Ἡ χώρα ἢ δεξαμενὴ τῶν σωμάτων πάντα δέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐδέποτε ἴδιον εἶδος ἢ μορφὴν λαμβάνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","text":"Ἡ χώρα διὰ τῶν εἰσιόντων φαίνεται ἄλλοτε ἀλλοία, αὐτὴ δὲ ἐκ τῆς ἑαυτῆς δυνάμεως οὐκ ἐξίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","text":"Τὰ εἰσιόντα καὶ ἐξιόντα ἀεὶ μιμήματα τῶν ὄντων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8","text":"Ἡ γένεσις προϋποθέτει τριττὴν διάκρισιν γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9","text":"Τὸ δεχόμενον ὀφείλει εἶναι ἄμορφον, ἵνα τὰ ἐπεισιόντα μὴ παραμορφῶται κατὰ τὴν ἰδίαν ὄψιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ μορφῶν ἀπαιτεῖ ὑποκείμενον λεῖον, ὁμαλὸν καὶ ἀνεπίσημον ὡς πρὸς ἴδιον σχῆμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX1","text":"Τὸ τρίγωνον καὶ τὰ ἄλλα σχήματα οὐκ εἰσὶν αὐτὸ τὸ ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX2","text":"Τὸ θερμὸν, τὸ λευκὸν καὶ τὰ ἐναντία οὐκ ἀποτελοῦσι τὴν ταυτότητα τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX3","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐκ ἔχει ἴδιον εἶδος ἐν ᾧ τὰ πάντα δέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX4","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον οὐκ ἔστιν ἀμετάβλητον ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX5","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα σχήματα οὐκ εἰσὶν αὐτὰ τὰ ὄντα, ἀλλὰ μιμήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX6","text":"Τὸ δεχόμενον οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται νὰ ἐμφανίζῃ ἴδιον χαρακτῆρα ὅταν τὰ ἄλλα ἐν αὐτῷ ἐκτυπῶνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D1","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία ὀφείλει νὰ διακρίνῃ τὸ σταθερὸν ὑποκείμενον ἀπὸ τὰ ἐφήμερα πάθη καὶ σχήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀναγνώρισις τῆς χώρας ἀπαιτεῖ ἀφαίρεσιν παντὸς ἰδίου εἴδους ἀπὸ αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D3","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη μεταβολὴ τῆς χώρας ὀφείλεται εἰς τὴν ἐναλλαγὴν τῶν εἰσιόντων, οὐκ εἰς μεταβολὴν τῆς ἰδίας οὐσίας της.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D4","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ἀνάλυσις δὲν ἀρκείται εἰς τὸ γιγνόμενον, ἀλλὰ χρειάζεται τόπον δεκτικὸν καὶ πρότυπον ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀμορφία τοῦ δεχομένου καθίσταται θετικὴ προϋπόθεσις τῆς ἀκριβοῦς ἐκτυπώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD1","text":"Ἡ χώρα λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὀντολογικὸς ὅρος δυνατότητος διὰ τὴν ἐμφάνισιν πολλῶν μορφῶν, χωρὶς νὰ ταυτίζηται μὲ καμίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD2","text":"Ἡ σταθερότης τοῦ ὑποκειμένου καὶ ἡ ἀστάθεια τῶν φαινομένων συνυπάρχουσιν μόνον ἐὰν ἡ χώρα νοηθῇ ὡς ἀμετάβλητος δεκτικότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD3","text":"Ἡ γενετικὴ τάξις συγκροτεῖται ὡς σχέσις προτύπου, δεκτοῦ καὶ ἐκτυπώματος, ὄχι ὡς αὐτοτελὴς γένεσις ἐκ τοῦ μηδενός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD4","text":"Ἡ χώρα εἶναι συγχρόνως ἀναγκαία διὰ πᾶσαν μορφὴν καὶ ἀδύνατον νὰ ἀναγνωρισθῇ διὰ ἰδίας μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ ὑποκείμενον τῶν σωμάτων εἶναι μία ἐκ τῶν ἐμφανῶν ποιοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ μεταβολὴ τῶν φαινομένων δηλοῖ μεταβολὴν τοῦ δεκτικοῦ ὑποβάθρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὰ μιμήματα ἔχουσι τὴν αὐτὴν ὀντολογικὴν τάξιν μὲ τὰ ὄντα ὧν μιμήματα εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ δεχόμενον δύναται νὰ συνεισφέρῃ ἴδιον σχῆμα χωρὶς νὰ νοθεύῃ τὴν ἐκτύπωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι ἡ γένεσις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ ἑνὸς μόνον γένους ἢ διὰ μιᾶς μόνης αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους ἀποτελεῖ τὸ κρυφὸν θεμέλιον τῆς καθολικῆς δεκτικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX2","text":"Ἄνευ ἀναγνωρίσιμου ὑποβάθρου, τὰ φαινόμενα θὰ συνέπιπτον ἢ μὲ τὰ μιμήματα ἢ μὲ τὰ πρότυπα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3","text":"Ἡ θεωρία foreclausit τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ ὕλη δύναται νὰ εἶναι αὐτόνομος φορεὺς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4","text":"Ἡ χώρα δὲν δύναται νὰ παρουσιασθῇ ἄνευ τῶν μορφῶν, ἀλλὰ οὔτε δύναται νὰ ταυτισθῇ μὲ αὐτάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ἀνάγκη τοῦ δεκτικοῦ ἀποκαλύπτεται μόνον ὡς ἀδυναμία ἰδίας μορφοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS1","text":"Μεταβολὴ φαινομένων → διάκρισις ὑποκειμένου καὶ παθημάτων → ἀσφαλὴς ὀνομασία τοῦ ὑποκειμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS2","text":"Εἴσοδος καὶ ἔξοδος μιμημάτων → φαινομένη ἀλλοίωσις → διατήρησις τῆς ταυτότητος τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS3","text":"Πρότυπον → δεκτικόν → ἐκτύπωμα → γένεσις φαινομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS4","text":"Ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους → καθολικὴ δεκτικότης → ἀκριβέστερη ἐκτύπωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS5","text":"Ἴδιον σχῆμα τοῦ δεχομένου → παραμόρφωσις τῶν εἰσιόντων → ἀποτυχία ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS6","text":"Ὑπόβαθρον ὡς μητέρα, πρότυπον ὡς πατήρ, γιγνόμενον ὡς ἔκγονον → τριμερὴς γενετικὴ ἀρχιτεκτονική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1","text":"Ἀστάθεια τῶν σχημάτων → ἀναζήτησις σταθεροῦ ὑποκειμένου → χρυσὸς ὡς ἀσφαλὴς ὀνομασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF2","text":"Ἀσφάλεια τοῦ ὑποκειμένου → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς τὴν χώραν → ἀφαίρεσις παντὸς ἰδίου εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF3","text":"Ἀφαίρεσις εἴδους → διάκρισις δεκτικοῦ, προτύπου καὶ γιγνομένου → ἐξήγησις τῆς ἐκτυπώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF4","text":"Καθολικὴ δεκτικότης → ἀνάγκη ἀμορφίας → δυνατότης πιστῆς ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF5","text":"Ἴδιον γνώρισμα τοῦ δεχομένου → ἀνάμειξις δεκτοῦ καὶ δεχομένου → ἀποκλεισμὸς ἰδίου σχήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME1","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ σχήματα μετατάσσονται ἀπὸ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὄντος εἰς τὴν τάξιν τοῦ μιμήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἐνεργὸς ὅρος δεκτικότητος, ἀλλὰ οὐχ ὡς παραγωγὸς ἰδίας μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME3","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀνασυντάσσεται ἀπὸ δυαδικὴ σχέσις μορφῆς καὶ ὕλης εἰς τριμερῆ σχέσιν προτύπου, χώρας καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME4","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τοῦ ὑποκειμένου χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν φαινομένην ταυτότητα τῶν προσκαίρων ποιοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀναπαράστασις ἀποκτᾷ ὡς ὅρον οὐ τὴν πληρότητα, ἀλλὰ τὴν ἀπουσίαν ἀνταγωνιστικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ σχήματα καὶ αἱ ποιότητες γίγνονται καὶ φθείρονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ χώρα ὑποδέχεται τὰ πάντα χωρὶς νὰ ἔχῃ ἴδιον εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ὀρθή νοηματοδότησις ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ὑποκειμένου, προτύπου καὶ μιμήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ γιγνόμενον ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σταθερὸν δεκτικὸν καὶ ἀπὸ πρότυπον ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀλληλουχία εἰσόδου καὶ ἐξόδου γεννᾷ φαινομένην μεταβολὴν ἐπὶ ἀμεταβλήτου ὑποβάθρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς ὀντολογικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ γιγνομένου, δεκτικοῦ καὶ προτύπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT3","text":"Ἡ λειτουργία τῶν παραδειγμάτων τοῦ χρυσοῦ, τοῦ ἀλείμματος καὶ τοῦ ἀποματτομένου μαλακοῦ ὑλικοῦ παραμένει ὑποdetermined ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀκριβῆ ἀναλογίαν τους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ χώρα περιγράφεται διὰ μεταφορῶν οἰκειακῶν καὶ τεχνικῶν, ἃ δὲν ἀναλύονται πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα ἀρχὴ εἶναι ἡ ἀνάγκη ἀμόρφου δεκτικοῦ διὰ τὴν καθολικὴν ἀφομοίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἐσωτερικὴ τάσις παραμένει ἡ ταυτόχρονος ἀπαίτησις τῆς χώρας ὡς ἀναγκαίας πραγματικότητος καὶ ἡ ἀδυναμία περιγραφῆς αὐτῆς διὰ ἰδίου εἴδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225651571463Z_5de1d2cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 50","source_sha256":"9dd00602fd34ba4842ed16653b152c44bf028ff0f29c547fbb3f8e71e0f9f8ff","sha256":"46754aa62a5d2ae21c7caade9069a42dff8ca4dec0a75bdf668189e950a68f82","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:56:51.575022+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS1","text":"What comes to be and changes is not securely designated as being itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS2","text":"The most secure designation of the substrate is that it is gold, not that it is a triangle or another shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS3","text":"The nature that receives all things must always be said to be the same, since it never assumes a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS4","text":"The things entering and departing are imitations of beings, not beings themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5","text":"Three kinds are to be conceived: that which comes to be, that in which it comes to be, and that from which it is assimilated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS6","text":"The recipient is likened to a father and mother, while the intermediate nature is likened to offspring, so that coming-to-be may be conceived as a relation of substrate, model, and imprint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","text":"What comes to be persists always in change and disappearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A2","text":"What changes has no fixed ontological designation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3","text":"The substrate of changes is more securely designated as gold than as shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","text":"The receptacle, or container, of bodies receives all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","text":"The receptacle never assumes a form or shape of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","text":"The receptacle appears at one time one way and at another another way through the things entering it, but it does not depart from itself by its own power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","text":"The things entering and departing are always imitations of beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8","text":"Coming-to-be presupposes a threefold distinction of kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9","text":"The recipient must be formless, so that the things entering it are not distorted according to its own appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10","text":"The reproduction of forms requires a substrate smooth, even, and without distinctive mark with respect to its own shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX1","text":"The triangle and the other shapes are not the substrate itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX2","text":"The hot, the white, and their opposites do not constitute the identity of the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX3","text":"The receptacle has no form of its own in which it receives all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX4","text":"What comes to be is not unchanging being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX5","text":"The apparent shapes are not beings themselves, but imitations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX6","text":"The recipient must not display a character of its own when other things are impressed in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D1","text":"Naming must distinguish the stable substrate from transient affections and shapes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D2","text":"The recognition of the receptacle requires the abstraction from it of every form of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D3","text":"The apparent change of the receptacle is due to the alternation of the things entering it, not to a change of its own essence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D4","text":"Ontological analysis does not rest content with what comes to be, but requires a receptive place and a model of assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5","text":"The formlessness of the recipient becomes a positive condition of precise imprinting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD1","text":"The receptacle functions as an ontological condition of possibility for the appearance of many forms, without being identified with any of them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD2","text":"The stability of the substrate and the instability of appearances coexist only if the receptacle is conceived as unchanging receptivity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD3","text":"The generative order is constituted as a relation of model, recipient, and imprint, not as an independent coming-to-be out of nothing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD4","text":"The receptacle is at once necessary for every form and impossible to recognize through a form of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that the substrate of bodies is one of the manifest qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that the change of appearances indicates a change of the receptive underlying basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that imitations have the same ontological rank as the beings of which they are imitations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the recipient can contribute a shape of its own without adulterating the imprint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that coming-to-be is explained through only one kind or through only one cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX1","text":"The absence of a form of its own constitutes the hidden foundation of universal receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX2","text":"Without a recognizable underlying basis, appearances would collapse either into imitations or into models.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3","text":"The theory foreclausit the idea that matter can be an autonomous bearer of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4","text":"The receptacle cannot be presented without forms, but neither can it be identified with them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX5","text":"The ontological necessity of the recipient is disclosed only as the impossibility of its own formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS1","text":"Change of appearances → distinction between substrate and affections → secure designation of the substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS2","text":"Entrance and departure of imitations → apparent alteration → preservation of the identity of the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS3","text":"Model → recipient → imprint → coming-to-be of an appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS4","text":"Absence of a form of its own → universal receptivity → more precise imprinting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS5","text":"Shape of the recipient's own → distortion of the things entering → failure of assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS6","text":"Underlying basis as mother, model as father, what comes to be as offspring → tripartite generative architecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1","text":"Instability of shapes → search for a stable substrate → gold as a secure designation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF2","text":"Security of the substrate → reduction to the receptacle → abstraction of every form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF3","text":"Abstraction of form → distinction of recipient, model, and what comes to be → explanation of imprinting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF4","text":"Universal receptivity → necessity of formlessness → possibility of faithful assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF5","text":"A property of the recipient's own → mixture of received thing and recipient → exclusion of a shape of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME1","text":"Sensible shapes are transferred from the order of being to the order of imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME2","text":"Matter emerges as an active condition of receptivity, but not as a producer of a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME3","text":"Coming-to-be is reconfigured from a dyadic relation of form and matter into a tripartite relation of model, receptacle, and what comes to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME4","text":"The identity of the substrate is separated from the apparent identity of temporary qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME5","text":"Precise representation acquires as its condition not fullness, but the absence of a competing form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, shapes and qualities come to be and perish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the receptacle receives all things without having a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, correct attribution of meaning requires a distinction among substrate, model, and imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, what comes to be depends on a stable recipient and on a model of assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, the sequence of entrance and departure produces apparent change upon an unchanging underlying basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the basic ontological movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction among what comes to be, recipient, and model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT3","text":"The function of the examples of gold, ointment, and the imprinted soft material remains underdetermined as regards their precise analogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent, but the receptacle is described through domestic and technical metaphors that are not fully analyzed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT5","text":"The strongest principle is the necessity of a formless recipient for universal assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT6","text":"The principal internal tension remains the simultaneous requirement of the receptacle as a necessary reality and the impossibility of describing it through a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC5:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 50"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 34","title":"Section 50","context":"Chapter 34","original_title":"Section 50","original_context":"Chapter 34"},"original_title":"Section 50","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31","layer":"CH","title":"Section 51","order":35,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_31"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_31@R001","sha256":"27f52f29200320803f1ff7c7bf6962923614fe5b0e0e76077577e1f490f27add","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS1","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ τοῦ γιγνομένου ζητεῖται ὡς ὁ τόπος τῶν πολλαχῶς γιγνομένων ἀφομοιωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS2","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐ ταὐτίζεται οὔτε τοῖς στοιχείοις οὔτε τοῖς ἐξ αὐτῶν γενομένοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS3","text":"Ἀνάγκη αὐτὴν νοεῖν ὡς ἀόρατον, ἄμορφον καὶ πανδεχῆ φύσιν, ἣ δέχεται τὰ εἴδη χωρὶς αὐτὴ εἶδος γενέσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν νοητῶν καὶ αἰσθητῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ εἰ νοῦς καὶ δόξα ἀληθὴς δύο γένη ἢ μία δύναμις εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS5","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν δύο γνώσεων ἐρείδεται ἐν ταῖς ἀρχαῖς, τοῖς τρόποις γενέσεως καὶ τῇ μεταβολῇ ἑκατέρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS6","text":"Ἐκ τούτων ἀνάγεται ὅτι νοῦς καὶ δόξα ἀληθὴς χωρὶς μὲν ὄντα, ἀνομοίως δὲ ἔχοντα, δύο γένη εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον ὁρατὸν καὶ αἰσθητὸν ἀνάγκη τινὸς ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ δέχεται πολλὰ καὶ ἀλλήλοις ἀνόμοια ἀπεικονίσματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","text":"Ὅ τι δέχεται πάντα τὰ εἴδη, αὐτὸ οὐ δύναται εἶδος ἴδιον ἔχειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A4","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἔστι γῆ, ἀήρ, πῦρ, ὕδωρ, οὐδὲ τὰ ἐκ τούτων γεγονότα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A5","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ ἐστὶν ἀόρατος καὶ ἄμορφος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ πανδεχής ἐστιν, ἀλλὰ καθʼ αὑτὴν οὐδὲν τῶν δεχομένων ἀποτελεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A7","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ φαίνεται ὡς πῦρ, ὕδωρ, γῆ καὶ ἀήρ κατὰ τὸ μέρος τῆς ὑποδοχῆς ὃ ἑκάστου μίμημα δέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","text":"Ἡ ὑπόθεσις τῶν καθʼ αὑτὰ νοητῶν εἰδῶν ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","text":"Ὁ νοῦς καὶ ἡ δόξα ἀληθὴς διαφέρουσι κατὰ τὴν γένεσιν καὶ τὸν τρόπον βεβαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","text":"Ὁ μὲν νοῦς διὰ διδασκαλίας γίγνεται, ἡ δὲ δόξα ἀληθὴς διὰ πειθοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A11","text":"Ὁ μὲν νοῦς μετὰ λόγου ἀληθοῦς καὶ ἀκίνητος ὑπάρχει, ἡ δὲ δόξα ἀληθὴς ἄλογός τε καὶ μεταπειστή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A12","text":"Πάντες ἄνθρωποι μετέχουσι δόξης ἀληθοῦς, νοῦ δὲ θεοί καὶ βραχύ τι μέρος ἀνθρώπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX1","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἔστιν οὐδὲν τῶν τεσσάρων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX2","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἔστιν ἐκείνων ὅσα ἐκ τῶν στοιχείων γεγονέναι λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX3","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἔχει ὁρατὸν εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX4","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἔχει ἴδιον μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX5","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐκ ἐστὶν αὐτὸ τὸ νοητόν, ἀλλὰ μόλις καὶ ἀπορώτατα μετέχει τούτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX6","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ οὐ δύνανται ἄνευ ἐξετάσεως τεθεῖν ὡς τὰ μόνα ἀληθῶς ὄντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX7","text":"Ὁ νοῦς οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστι τῇ δόξῃ τῇ ἀληθεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX8","text":"Ἡ δόξα ἀληθὴς οὐκ ἔχει τὴν ἀκινησίαν καὶ τὸν ἀληθῆ λόγον τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D1","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ δὲν εἰσὶν αὐτοτελῆ στοιχεῖα, ἀλλὰ φαινόμενα τῆς ὑποδοχῆς κατὰ τὰ δεχόμενα ἀπεικονίσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A4","CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D2","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὑλικόν τι πεδίον ἐν ᾧ τὰ εἴδη γίγνεται αἰσθητά, οὐχ ὡς ἓν αἰσθητὸν γένος παρὰ τὰ ἄλλα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀορασία καὶ ἀμορφία τῆς ὑποδοχῆς ἀναγκαῖαι γίγνονται, ἐπειδὴ ἴδιον εἶδος ἂν ἐκώλυε τὴν καθολικὴν ὑποδοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","CH_JP8E_S_31:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D4","text":"Εἰ νοῦς καὶ δόξα ἀληθὴς δύο γένη εἰσίν, τότε τὰ νοητὰ εἴδη ὑφίστανται καθʼ αὑτὰ καὶ οὐκ αἰσθητῶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν γνωστικῶν δυνάμεων καθιστᾷ τὴν διάκρισιν νοητοῦ καὶ αἰσθητοῦ ὀντολογικῶς ἀναγκαίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D6","text":"Ἡ δόξα ἀληθὴς δύναται ὀρθὴ εἶναι χωρὶς ἐπιστήμης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πειθὼ οὐ συνδέεται ἀναγκαίως μετὰ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D7","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ μετοχὴ τῶν ἀνθρώπων δόξης ἀληθοῦς δὲν συνεπάγεται καθολικὴν μετοχὴν νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ ἐπιβάλλει τριμερῆ διάρθρωσιν τῆς γενέσεως: εἶδος, ὑποδοχή, καὶ γιγνόμενον ἀπεικόνισμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD2","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἀποκτᾷ ἀλήθειαν ὡς ἐμφάνισις καὶ μίμημα, οὐχ ὡς ἀνεξάρτητον αὐτὸ καθʼ αὑτὸ ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογικὴ ἱεραρχία ἀναπαράγει ὀντολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ τρόπος γνώσεως δηλοῖ τὸν τρόπον τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4","text":"Ἡ σταθερότης τοῦ νοῦ καὶ ἡ μεταπειστότης τῆς δόξης ἀληθοῦς χωρίζουσι τὴν ἀλήθειαν ἀπὸ τῆς ἁπλῆς ὀρθότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη γνώσις κατὰ τὸ πλεῖστον μένει ἐν τῷ πεδίῳ τῆς πειθοῦς, ἐνώ ἡ νοητικὴ ἐπιστήμη γίνεται σπάνια καὶ ἀναβατικὴ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","CH_JP8E_S_31:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐ δύναται νὰ ἐξαντληθῇ ἐν τῷ ὁρατῷ καὶ αἰσθητῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX2","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐ δύναται νὰ ἐξηγηθῇ ὡς ἁπλῆ μετάπτωσις ἑνὸς ὑπάρχοντος στοιχείου εἰς ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ οὐ δύναται νὰ συλληφθῇ διὰ κατηγοριῶν αἱ ὁποῖαι ἁρμόζουσι τοῖς μορφωμένοις ὄντως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐ δύναται νὰ ταυτισθῇ οὔτε μὲ τὸ ὀρθῶς δοξάζειν οὔτε μὲ τὸ ἀναμφίβολον αἰσθάνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX5","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῆς δόξης ἀληθοῦς οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν σπανιότητα τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὸ φαινόμενον ἔχει πλήρη καὶ ἀνεξάρτητον οὐσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑποδοχὴ νὰ ἔχῃ θετικὴν ταυτότητα ἰσοδύναμον πρὸς τὰ εἴδη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀλήθεια νὰ εἶναι ἁπλῶς ἓν καὶ τὸ αὐτὸ κτῆμα ὅλων τῶν γνωστικῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαία ἀρχὴ τῆς γενέσεως παραμένει ἀκατονόμαστος ὡς πρὸς τὸ τί ἐστιν καθʼ αὑτήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS1","text":"Πολλαπλὰ αἰσθητὰ ἀπεικονίσματα → ἀνάγκη κοινῆς ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS2","text":"Κοινὴ ὑποδοχή → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίου εἴδους, μορφῆς καὶ στοιχειακῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS3","text":"Ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίου εἴδους → ἀόρατος, ἄμορφος καὶ πανδεχὴς ὑποδοχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS4","text":"Πανδεχὴς ὑποδοχή → αἰσθητὰ ὡς μιμήματα τῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS5","text":"Ἔλεγχος τῶν τρόπων γνώσεως → διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS6","text":"Διδασκαλία, ἀληθὴς λόγος, ἀκινησία / πειθώ, ἀλογία, μεταπειστότης → δύο γένη γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS7","text":"Δύο γένη γνώσεως → δύο τάξεις ὄντων, νοητὰ καὶ αἰσθητά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1","text":"Ἀνάγκη ὑποδοχῆς → ἀπογύμνωσις τῆς ὑποδοχῆς ἀπὸ στοιχεῖα καὶ μορφήν → ὁρισμὸς πανδεχοῦς ἀρχῆς → διάκρισις μιμήματος καὶ εἴδους → ἀμφισβήτησις τῆς ἀποκλειστικῆς αἰσθητῆς ἀληθείας → διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς → ὀντολογικὴ διάκρισις νοητοῦ καὶ αἰσθητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1","text":"Τὸ ὑλικόν ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ στοιχεῖον εἰς ὑποδοχὴν τῶν μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME2","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτοτελὲς ὄν εἰς μίμημα ἐν ὑποδοχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν ὀρθὴν πειθώ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς μετατρέπει τὴν θεωρίαν τῆς γνώσεως εἰς κριτήριον ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME5","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἀνθρωπίνη δόξα παύει νὰ τεκμαίρῃ καθολικὴν ἐπιστημονικὴν ἱκανότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ὑποδοχὴ δέχεται τὰ φαινόμενα τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ εἴδους, ὑποδοχῆς καὶ μιμήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἔρευνα μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ ἀναμφισβήτητον φαινόμενον εἰς τὴν κρίσιν τῶν ὅρων τῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ εἶναι διαιρείται εἰς νοητὴν σταθερότητα, αἰσθητὴν γένεσιν καὶ ἄμορφον δεκτικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ γνωσιολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ νοῦς ἀκινητεῖται διὰ λόγου, ἡ δὲ δόξα μεταβάλλεται διὰ πειθοῦς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκῶσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τῶν αἰσθητῶν φαινομένων πρὸς τὴν ὑποδοχὴν καὶ ἀκολούθως πρὸς τὴν διάκρισιν νοῦ καὶ δόξης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάρθρωσις διασῴζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἐξάρτησιν μεταξὺ κοσμολογίας, ὀντολογίας καὶ γνωσιολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀκαθόριστον τὸ θετικὸν εἶναι τῆς ὑποδοχῆς καὶ ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς μετοχῆς αὐτῆς τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT4","text":"Ὑπομένει ἐπίσης ἀνοικτὸν τὸ ἐὰν ἡ διάκριση νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς ἀποδεικνύεται ἢ θεμελιοῦται διὰ λειτουργικῶν γνωρισμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν ὑποδοχή–μίμημα–εἶδος–γνώσις, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀποφατικὴν περιγραφὴν τῆς πρώτης ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230720060106Z_8359b68a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 51","source_sha256":"27f52f29200320803f1ff7c7bf6962923614fe5b0e0e76077577e1f490f27add","sha256":"47fb60c3c53cbc2a52490c1c7aaea9704813a525b9065ae0e3c9d881886811e0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:07:20.061997+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS1","text":"The receptacle of that which comes to be is sought as the place of the images that come to be in many ways.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS2","text":"The receptacle is identified neither with the elements nor with the things generated from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS3","text":"It is necessary to conceive it as an invisible, formless, and all-receptive nature, which receives the Forms without itself becoming a Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS4","text":"The distinction between intelligibles and sensibles depends on whether intellect and true opinion are two kinds or one capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS5","text":"The difference between the two cognitions rests upon their principles, modes of generation, and change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AS6","text":"From these it follows that intellect and true opinion, being separate and having dissimilar conditions, are two kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","text":"That which comes to be, visible and perceptible, necessarily requires some receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","text":"The receptacle receives many images dissimilar to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","text":"Whatever receives all the Forms cannot itself have any proper Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A4","text":"The receptacle is neither earth, air, fire, nor water, nor the things that have come to be from these.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A5","text":"The receptacle is invisible and formless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","text":"The receptacle is all-receptive, but in itself it constitutes none of the things received.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A7","text":"Sensibles appear as fire, water, earth, and air according to the part of the receptacle that receives an imitation of each.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","text":"The hypothesis of intelligible Forms in themselves requires a distinction between intellect and true opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","text":"Intellect and true opinion differ in generation and in their mode of certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","text":"Intellect comes to be through teaching, while true opinion comes to be through persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A11","text":"Intellect exists with true account and immovability, whereas true opinion is both without account and open to persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:A12","text":"All human beings partake of true opinion, but intellect belongs to gods and to some small portion of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX1","text":"The receptacle is none of the four elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX2","text":"The receptacle is not among those things said to have come to be from the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX3","text":"The receptacle has no visible Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX4","text":"The receptacle has no proper shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX5","text":"The receptacle is not the intelligible itself, but partakes of it only with difficulty and most perplexingly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX6","text":"Sensibles cannot, without examination, be posited as the only things that truly are.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX7","text":"Intellect is not identical with true opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:NX8","text":"True opinion does not possess the immovability and true account of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D1","text":"Sensibles are not self-sufficient elements, but appearances of the receptacle according to the images it receives.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A4","CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D2","text":"The receptacle functions as a certain material field in which the Forms become perceptible, not as one perceptible kind alongside the others.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D3","text":"The invisibility and formlessness of the receptacle become necessary, since a proper Form would impede universal reception.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","CH_JP8E_S_31:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D4","text":"If intellect and true opinion are two kinds, then intelligible Forms subsist in themselves and not perceptibly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D5","text":"The distinction of cognitive capacities renders the distinction between intelligible and sensible ontologically necessary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D6","text":"True opinion can be correct without knowledge, because persuasion is not necessarily connected with account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:D7","text":"The universal human participation in true opinion does not entail universal participation in intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1","text":"The receptacle imposes a threefold articulation of generation: Form, receptacle, and generated image.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A1","CH_JP8E_S_31:A2","CH_JP8E_S_31:A3","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD2","text":"The sensible acquires truth as manifestation and imitation, not as an independently existing thing in itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A6","CH_JP8E_S_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD3","text":"The epistemological hierarchy reproduces an ontological hierarchy, because the mode of cognition indicates the mode of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A8","CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4","text":"The stability of intellect and the persuadability of true opinion separate truth from mere correctness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A9","CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SD5","text":"Human cognition for the most part remains in the field of persuasion, whereas intellectual knowledge becomes rare and ascending.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A10","CH_JP8E_S_31:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX1","text":"Reality cannot be exhausted in the visible and perceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX2","text":"Generation cannot be explained as a simple transition of one existing element into another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX3","text":"The receptacle cannot be grasped through categories suited to things that are formed in reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX4","text":"Truth cannot be identified either with opining correctly or with perceiving indubitably.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX5","text":"The universality of true opinion does not remove the rarity of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX1","text":"A world in which the phenomenon has full and independent substance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX2","text":"The receptacle's having a positive identity equivalent to the Forms is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX3","text":"Truth's being simply one and the same possession of all cognitive capacities is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX4","text":"The necessary principle of generation remains unnameable as to what it is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS1","text":"Multiple sensible images → necessity of a common receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS2","text":"Common receptacle → removal of proper Form, shape, and elemental identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS3","text":"Removal of proper Form → invisible, formless, and all-receptive receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS4","text":"All-receptive receptacle → sensibles as imitations of the Forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS5","text":"Examination of the modes of cognition → distinction between intellect and true opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS6","text":"Teaching, true account, immovability / persuasion, absence of account, persuadability → two kinds of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS7","text":"Two kinds of cognition → two orders of beings, intelligibles and sensibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1","text":"Necessity of a receptacle → stripping the receptacle of elements and shape → definition of an all-receptive principle → distinction between imitation and Form → challenge to exclusively sensible truth → distinction between intellect and true opinion → ontological distinction between intelligible and sensible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1","text":"The material is reclassified from element into receptacle of Forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME2","text":"The sensible is reclassified from self-sufficient being into imitation in a receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME3","text":"Truth is distinguished from mere perception and correct persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME4","text":"The distinction between intellect and true opinion transforms the theory of knowledge into a criterion of ontological order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ME5","text":"Common human opinion ceases to imply universal scientific capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT1","text":"At the superficial level, the receptacle receives the appearances of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, generation requires a distinction among Form, receptacle, and imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, inquiry moves from the indubitable phenomenon to the judgment of the conditions of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, being is divided into intelligible stability, sensible generation, and a formless receptive principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT5","text":"At the epistemological and temporal level, intellect is rendered immovable through account, while opinion changes through persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the movement from sensible phenomena to the receptacle and subsequently to the distinction between intellect and opinion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT2","text":"The articulation preserves the internal dependence among cosmology, ontology, and epistemology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3","text":"The positive being of the receptacle and the precise manner of its participation in the intelligible remain indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT4","text":"It likewise remains open whether the distinction between intellect and true opinion is demonstrated or grounded through functional characteristics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5","text":"The system is coherent with respect to the sequence receptacle–imitation–Form–cognition, but depends upon an apophatic description of the first principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_31@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_31:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 51"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 35","title":"Section 51","context":"Chapter 35","original_title":"Section 51","original_context":"Chapter 35"},"original_title":"Section 51","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32","layer":"CH","title":"Section 52","order":36,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_32"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_32@R001","sha256":"5d17a9d81f9a1614678d74c0d63b5116d759d25b8a7c339c915cb037754fee1e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS1","text":"Τὸ ὂν ἀκριβῶς διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τοῦ γιγνομένου καὶ ἀπὸ τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS2","text":"Τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ εἶδος ἔχον ἀγέννητον καὶ ἀνώλεθρον ὑφίσταται ὡς ἀόρατον ἀντικείμενον νοήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS3","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον αἰσθητὸν καὶ γεννητὸν εἶναι εἰκών, ἀεὶ φερομένη καὶ ἐν τόπῳ γιγνομένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS4","text":"Ἡ χώρα τρίτον γένος ἐστίν, ἕδρα παρέχουσα παντὶ τῷ γιγνομένῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS5","text":"Ἡ συνήθης ὑπόληψις συγχέει τὸ εἶναι πρὸς τὸ ἐν τόπῳ εἶναι, καὶ οὐ δύναται ἀπὸ τοῦ ὀνειρώδους διακρίνειν τὸ ἀληθές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς διαίρεσις τῶν τριῶν γενῶν ἀπαιτεῖ χώραν ἄνευ ἰδίας αἰσθητῆς μορφῆς, ἀλλʼ ὑποδεκτικὴν τῶν μορφῶν καὶ τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","text":"Τὸ κατὰ ταὐτὰ εἶδος ἔχον ἀγέννητόν τε καὶ ἀνώλεθρόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","text":"Τὸ νοητὸν οὔτε εἰς ἄλλο μεταβαίνει οὔτε ἄλλο εἰς ἑαυτὸ δέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A3","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον αἰσθητόν, γεννητόν, κινητὸν καὶ φθαρτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A4","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον ἐν τόπῳ γίγνεται καὶ ἐκεῖθεν ἀπόλλυται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A5","text":"Ἡ χώρα ἀεὶ ὑπάρχει καὶ φθορὰν οὐ προσδέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","text":"Ἡ χώρα ἕδραν παρέχει πᾶσι τοῖς ἔχουσι γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","text":"Ἡ χώρα αἰσθήσει ἀναίσθητος οὖσα λογισμῷ τινὶ νόθῳ μόλις πιστεύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A8","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον εἰκὼν ἑτέρου τινός ἐστι καὶ οὐκ αὐτὸ ἑαυτοῦ ἡ ἀρχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A9","text":"Ἡ γένεσις, ἡ χώρα καὶ τὸ ὄν συγκροτοῦσι τρία διακεκριμένα γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","text":"Ἡ χώρα μεταβάλλεται κατὰ τὰς ἐν αὐτῇ δεχομένας μορφὰς καὶ κινήσεις, οὐκ ἰδίαν μορφὴν ἀποκτῶσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A11","text":"Αἱ ἐν τῇ χώρᾳ δυνάμεις οὔτε ὁμοῖαι οὔτε ἰσόρροποι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A12","text":"Ἡ ἀνισορροπία τῶν δυνάμεων προκαλεῖ τὴν ἀνωμάλως ταλαντευομένην κίνησιν τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX1","text":"Τὸ νοητὸν οὐκ ἔστιν αἰσθητόν, γεννητόν, φερόμενον ἢ φθαρτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX2","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον οὐκ ἔστιν ἀγέννητον καὶ ἀμετάβλητον ὡς τὸ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX3","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐκ ἔστιν εἷδος ἢ αἰσθητὸν ὑποκείμενον ἰδίᾳ μορφῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX4","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐκ ἔστιν ἄλλη γένεσις ἢ ἄλλο εἶδος παρὰ τὸ ὄν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX5","text":"Τὸ μὴ ἐν γῇ μηδὲ κατʼ οὐρανὸν εἶναι οὐ σημαίνει ὅτι μηδὲν ὄντως ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX6","text":"Οὐδὲν τῶν ἑτέρων ὄντων δύναται ἅμα ἓν καὶ δύο γενέσθαι, ὅταν τὸ μὲν ἕτερον ᾖ τὸ δὲ ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX7","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐκ ἔστιν ὑποδοχὴ ἰσορρόπων καὶ ὁμοίων δυνάμεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὄν ἀγέννητόν ἐστι καὶ τὸ γιγνόμενον γεννητόν, τὸ εἶναι καὶ τὸ γίγνεσθαι οὐ δύνανται ταὐτὸν γένος εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","CH_JP8E_S_32:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ γιγνόμενον ἐν τόπῳ γίγνεται, ἡ χώρα ἀναγκαία ἐστὶν ὡς ὑποδοχὴ τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A4","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ γιγνόμενον εἰκών ἐστιν ἑτέρου, οὐκ ἔχει πλήρη αὐτοτέλειαν οὐδὲ ἴδιον ἀρχικὸν εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","CH_JP8E_S_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ χώρα οὐκ ἔχει ἴδιον αἰσθητὸν εἶδος, ἡ γνώσις αὐτῆς οὐκ ἐκ τῆς αἰσθήσεως ἀλλὰ ἐκ νόθου λογισμοῦ γίνεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","CH_JP8E_S_32:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ τρία γένη διακεκριμένα μένει, τὸ γιγνόμενον ἐν τῇ χώρᾳ ὑφίσταται χωρίς τοῦ ταὐτὸν εἶναι τῇ χώρᾳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ δυνάμεις τῆς χώρας ἀνίσως ἔχουσιν, ἡ χώρα ὑπὸ τῶν ἐν αὐτῇ κινουμένων σείεται καὶ αὖ ταῦτα κινεί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","CH_JP8E_S_32:A11","CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ εἰκὼν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἑτέρου καὶ ἡ χώρα παρέχει ἕδραν, τὸ γιγνόμενον ἔχει διπλῆν ἀναφοράν, πρὸς εἶδος καὶ πρὸς ὑποδοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης διαιροῦται ὄχι μόνον εἰς νοητὸν καὶ αἰσθητόν, ἀλλὰ καὶ εἰς τὸ τρίτον πεδίον τῆς ὑποδοχῆς, ἄνευ οὗ ἡ γένεσις ἀδιανόητος μένει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","CH_JP8E_S_32:A3","CH_JP8E_S_32:A5","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD2","text":"Ἡ χώρα καθίσταται ὅρος μεταξὺ τοῦ ἀμεταβλήτου ὄντος καὶ τοῦ μεταβαλλομένου γιγνομένου, χωρὶς νὰ ἀναχθῇ εἰς ἕτερον εἶδος οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD3","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀμοιβαία δυναμικὴ σχέσις εἰκόνων, μορφῶν καὶ ὑποδοχῆς, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλῆ μεταβολὴ ἑνὸς αὐτοτελοῦς ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A8","CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς διαίρεσις τῶν γενῶν ἀπαιτεῖ διάνοιαν ἱκανὴν νὰ διακρίνῃ τὸ αἰσθητὸν φαινόμενον ἀπὸ τὸ ὑποδεκτικὸν ὑπόβαθρον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX1","text":"Τὸ ὂν οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς χωρικὴν παρουσίαν, καὶ ἡ χωρικὴ παρουσία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ μέτρον τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX2","text":"Τὸ γιγνόμενον οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς αἰσθητῆς ἐμφανείας μόνης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐμφάνεια προϋποθέτει χώραν καὶ εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3","text":"Ἡ χώρα οὐ δύναται νὰ ἐννοηθῇ ὡς ἀδρανὲς δοχεῖον ἔξωθεν τῶν κινήσεων, ἐπειδὴ καὶ πάσχει ὑπὸ αὐτῶν καὶ ἀντιδρᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀναχθῇ εἰς ἓν μόνον ἀρχικόν γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀκρίβεια οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀγνοήσῃ τὴν ἀποδεικτικῶς ἀσθενεστέραν, ἀλλὰ ἀναγκαίαν, σύλληψιν τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου τὸ γιγνόμενον ἂν ὑπῆρχεν ἄνευ ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ φαινομένου μετὰ τοῦ ὄντως ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ τόπου εἰς ἁπλὸν ἐξωτερικὸν γνώρισμα τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἐπιστημολογικὴ διαφάνεια τοῦ θεμελίου τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἁρμονικὴ ἰσορροπία ὡς ἀρχικὴ κατάστασις τῆς χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS1","text":"Ἀμετάβλητον εἶδος → εἰκὼν γιγνομένη → ἀνάγκη ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS2","text":"Διάκρισις ὄντος καὶ γιγνομένου → ἀναγνώρισις χώρας ὡς τρίτου γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS3","text":"Ἀπουσία ἰδίας μορφῆς τῆς χώρας → νόθος λογισμὸς → δυσχερὴς πίστις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4","text":"Ἀνομοιότης δυνάμεων → ἀνισορροπία → σεισμὸς χώρας → ἀντισεισμὸς τῶν ἐν αὐτῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS5","text":"Ἡ τριμερὴς ὀντολογία → ἀποφυγὴ ταυτίσεως τοῦ ὄντος, τῆς χώρας καὶ τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AF1","text":"Σύγχυσις τοῦ εἶναι μετὰ τοῦ ἐν τόπῳ εἶναι → διάκρισις ὄντος καὶ γιγνομένου → ἀνάγκη τρίτου γένους → χώρα ὡς ὑποδοχή → ἀνισορροπία καὶ κίνησις → τριμερὴς σύλληψις τῆς πραγματικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1","text":"Ὁ τόπος μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὴν περίστασιν εἰς ὀντολογικὴν προϋπόθεσιν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME2","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς εἰκὼν ἐξαρτωμένη ἀπὸ εἶδος καὶ χώραν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης παύει νὰ ἀποτελῆ διμερῆ ἀντίθεσιν νοητοῦ καὶ αἰσθητοῦ καὶ γίνεται τριμερὴς διάταξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία τῶν κινήσεων ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀνισορροπίας δυνάμεων ἐν τῇ ὑποδοχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME5","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τῶν θεμελιωδῶν ὅρων τῆς γενέσεως ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀναγκαία μὲν ἀτελὴς δὲ σύλληψις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Τὰ πράγματα φαίνονται γεννώμενα, φθειρόμενα καὶ μετακινούμενα ἐν τόπῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ φαινομένη γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν τριπλὴν διάταξιν εἴδους, χώρας καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἀκριβὴς σκέψις ὀφείλει νὰ ἀντισταθῇ τῇ ὀνειρώξει, ἣ ταυτίζει τὸ ὄντως ὂν μὲ τὸ χωρικῶς φαινόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ εἶδος καὶ ἡ χώρα ἀεὶ ὑπάρχουσιν, ἐνώ τὸ γιγνόμενον ὑπόκειται εἰς γένεσιν, κίνησιν καὶ φθοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἕνδεκα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς τριμεροῦς ὀντολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ τῆς χώρας ἐκ τῆς ἀνάγκης τόπου καὶ ὑποδοχῆς διασώζει τὴν κύρια κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἰδίας μορφῆς καὶ δεκτικῆς ὑποστάσεως παραμένει ἐννοιολογικῶς δυσχερής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT4","text":"Ἡ χώρα διατηρεῖ ἀμφίσημον χαρακτῆρα, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε εἶδος οὔτε ἁπλὸν μηδὲν ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν ἀκριβῆ διάκρισιν ἀγεννήτου ὄντος, γεννητοῦ εἰκόνος καὶ ἀφθάρτου χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις παραμένει ἐλλιπὴς ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὸν τρόπον καθʼ ὃν ἡ χώρα δύναται ἅμα πάσχειν καὶ κινεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230738492590Z_a51eaed1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 52","source_sha256":"5d17a9d81f9a1614678d74c0d63b5116d759d25b8a7c339c915cb037754fee1e","sha256":"4881c556d3dbe81edeaed20baacde808c71bb9f6b2222ae0d573efbf5d52657e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:07:38.496363+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS1","text":"Being is precisely distinguished from becoming and from the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS2","text":"That which always has the same form subsists as an ungenerated and imperishable, invisible object of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS3","text":"That which becomes is a perceptible and generated image, ever borne along and coming to be in a place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS4","text":"The receptacle is a third kind, providing a seat for everything that comes to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS5","text":"Ordinary supposition confuses being with being in a place, and is unable to distinguish the true from the dreamlike.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AS6","text":"The precise division of the three kinds requires a receptacle without a perceptible form of its own, but receptive of forms and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","text":"That which always has the same form is both ungenerated and imperishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","text":"The intelligible neither changes into another nor admits another into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A3","text":"That which becomes is perceptible, generated, movable, and perishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A4","text":"That which becomes comes to be in a place and perishes from there.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A5","text":"The receptacle always exists and does not admit of destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","text":"The receptacle provides a seat for all things that have generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","text":"Being imperceptible to sense, the receptacle is scarcely believed in by a certain bastard reasoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A8","text":"That which becomes is an image of something else and is not itself its own principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A9","text":"Generation, the receptacle, and Being constitute three distinct kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","text":"The receptacle changes in accordance with the forms and motions received in it, without acquiring a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A11","text":"The powers in the receptacle are neither alike nor balanced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:A12","text":"The imbalance of the powers causes the irregularly oscillating motion of the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX1","text":"The intelligible is not perceptible, generated, borne along, or perishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX2","text":"That which becomes is not ungenerated and unchanging like Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX3","text":"The receptacle is not a form or a perceptible substrate with a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX4","text":"The receptacle is not another generation or another form beside Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX5","text":"Not being either on earth or in heaven does not signify that something is not truly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX6","text":"None of the other beings can become one and two at once, whenever the one is one thing and the other another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:NX7","text":"The receptacle is not the reception of balanced and similar powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D1","text":"Since Being is ungenerated and that which becomes is generated, being and becoming cannot be the same kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","CH_JP8E_S_32:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D2","text":"Since that which becomes comes to be in a place, the receptacle is necessary as the recipient of generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A4","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D3","text":"Since that which becomes is an image of another, it does not possess full self-subsistence or an original being of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","CH_JP8E_S_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D4","text":"Since the receptacle has no perceptible form of its own, knowledge of it arises not from sense but from bastard reasoning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","CH_JP8E_S_32:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D5","text":"Since the three kinds remain distinct, that which becomes subsists in the receptacle without being identical with the receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D6","text":"Since the powers of the receptacle are unequal, the receptacle is shaken by the things moved within it and in turn moves them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","CH_JP8E_S_32:A11","CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:D7","text":"Since the image depends on another and the receptacle provides a seat, that which becomes has a double reference: to form and to receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD1","text":"Reality is divided not only into the intelligible and the perceptible, but also into the third field of reception, without which generation remains unthinkable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1","CH_JP8E_S_32:A3","CH_JP8E_S_32:A5","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD2","text":"The receptacle becomes a boundary between unchanging Being and changing becoming, without being reduced to another kind of substance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A2","CH_JP8E_S_32:A6","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD3","text":"Generation appears as a reciprocal dynamic relation of images, forms, and receptacle, not as a simple alteration of one self-subsistent substrate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A8","CH_JP8E_S_32:A10","CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SD4","text":"The true division of kinds requires thought capable of distinguishing the perceptible phenomenon from the receptive substratum.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7","CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX1","text":"Being is not reducible to spatial presence, and spatial presence does not constitute the measure of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX2","text":"That which becomes is not explained by perceptible appearance alone, since appearance presupposes receptacle and form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3","text":"The receptacle cannot be conceived as an inert vessel external to motions, since it both undergoes their action and reacts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX4","text":"Generation cannot be reduced to one single primary kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX5","text":"Scientific precision cannot ignore the demonstratively weaker, yet necessary, conception of the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX1","text":"A world in which that which becomes could exist without a receptacle is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX2","text":"The identification of the phenomenon with that which truly is is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX3","text":"The reduction of place to a mere external property of bodies is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX4","text":"The complete epistemological transparency of the ground of generation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX5","text":"Harmonious equilibrium as the original state of the receptacle is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS1","text":"Unchanging form → image coming to be → necessity of a receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS2","text":"Distinction of Being and becoming → recognition of the receptacle as a third kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS3","text":"Absence of the receptacle's own form → bastard reasoning → difficult belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4","text":"Dissimilarity of powers → imbalance → shaking of the receptacle → counter-shaking of what is within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS5","text":"Tripartite ontology → avoidance of identifying Being, the receptacle, and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:AF1","text":"Confusion of being with being in a place → distinction of Being and becoming → necessity of a third kind → receptacle as recipient → imbalance and motion → tripartite conception of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1","text":"Place is transformed from a geometrical circumstance into an ontological precondition of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME2","text":"The perceptible is reclassified as an image dependent on form and receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3","text":"Reality ceases to constitute a twofold opposition of intelligible and perceptible and becomes a tripartite arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME4","text":"The disorder of motions is interpreted as a result of an imbalance of powers in the receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ME5","text":"Knowledge of the fundamental conditions of generation is recognized as a necessary yet incomplete conception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Things appear to be generated, to perish, and to be moved in a place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Apparent generation requires the threefold arrangement of form, receptacle, and that which becomes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Precise thought must resist dreamlike imagining, which identifies that which truly is with what appears spatially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Form and the receptacle always exist, whereas that which becomes is subject to generation, motion, and destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT1","text":"The eleven axioms suffice for reconstructing the tripartite ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT2","text":"The derivation of the receptacle from the necessity of place and reception preserves the principal movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT3","text":"The distinction between a form of one's own and receptive subsistence remains conceptually difficult.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT4","text":"The receptacle retains an ambiguous character, since it is neither form nor simple nothingness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT5","text":"The internal coherence of the system rests on the precise distinction between ungenerated Being, generated image, and imperishable receptacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction remains incomplete with respect to the manner in which the receptacle can at once undergo action and cause motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_32@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_32:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 52"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 36","title":"Section 52","context":"Chapter 36","original_title":"Section 52","original_context":"Chapter 36"},"original_title":"Section 52","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33","layer":"CH","title":"Section 53","order":37,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_33"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_33@R001","sha256":"62684ba9c598023eb3641ec36954f70f1fbbc9fc5e2d2b2e7df964244a2d6854","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS1","text":"Τὸ ἀδιάκριτον καὶ ἄτακτον τῶν τεσσάρων γενῶν ὑπὸ κινήσεως σειστικῆς διακρίνεται καὶ εἰς διαφόρους χώρας ἀποχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τὰ ἀνόμοια χωρίζει καὶ τὰ ὅμοια εἰς ταὐτὸν συνάγει πρὶν ἢ τὸ πᾶν κεκοσμημένον γένηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS3","text":"Ἡ κοσμοποίησις μεταβάλλει τὴν ἄλογον καὶ ἄμετρον κατάστασιν εἰς διάταξιν κατὰ εἴδη καὶ ἀριθμούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS4","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν σωμάτων ἀναλύεται ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα εἰς βάθος, ἐπίπεδον, τρίγωνα καὶ στοιχειώδεις τριγωνικὰς ἀρχάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀρχὴ τῶν ἀρχῶν παραμένει θεῷ καὶ τῷ θεῷ φίλῳ ἀνδρὶ γνωστή, ἐνώ ὁ λόγος περὶ τῶν σωμάτων παραμένει εἰκὼς καὶ μετ᾽ ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","text":"Πρὸ τῆς κοσμήσεως τὰ τέτταρα γένη εἶχον ἄλογον καὶ ἄμετρον διάθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","text":"Κίνησις τῆς δεξαμενῆς ἢ χώρας ἐνεργεῖ ὡς σεισμὸς καὶ διακρίνει τὰ κινούμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","text":"Τὰ ἀνόμοια χωρίζεται ἀπ᾽ ἀλλήλων, τὰ δὲ ὅμοια συνωθεῖται εἰς ταὐτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις συνίσταται ἐκ μορφῶν καὶ ἀριθμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A5","text":"Πῦρ, ὕδωρ, γῆ καὶ ἀήρ εἰσὶ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A6","text":"Πᾶν σῶμα ἔχει εἶδος καὶ βάθος, τὸ δὲ βάθος περιέχει ἐπίπεδον φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ ἐπίπεδος βάσις συνίσταται ἐκ τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","text":"Τὰ τρίγωνα ἀνάγονται εἰς δύο πρωταρχικοὺς τύπους ὀρθογωνίων τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A9","text":"Τὰ τέτταρα κάλλιστα σώματα δέον ἐστὶν εἶναι ἀνόμοια καθ᾽ ἕκαστον γένος, ἀλλὰ δύνασθαι ἀλλήλων διαλύεσθαι καὶ μετασχηματίζεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν σωμάτων δύναται νὰ δηλωθῇ διὰ λόγου εἰκότος, ὁ οποίος πορεύεται μετὰ ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A11","text":"Αἱ ἔτι ἀνωτέρω ἀρχαὶ τῶν τριγώνων ὑπερβαίνουσι τὴν παροῦσαν ἀπόδειξιν καὶ ἀποδίδονται θεῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX1","text":"Ἡ πρὸ τῆς κοσμήσεως κατάστασις οὔτε λόγῳ οὔτε μέτρῳ ὡρισμένη ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX2","text":"Τὰ τέτταρα γένη οὔτε ἀρχῆθεν ἐν μιᾷ χώρα συνῆν οὔτε ἀδιακρίτως συνεκράθησαν κατὰ τὴν τελικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ διάταξις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς αὐτόματον συσσώρευσιν, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει διακοσμοῦσαν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX4","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀναλύεται τελικῶς εἰς ἄμορφον βάθος, ἀλλὰ τὸ βάθος ἀνάγεται εἰς ἐπίπεδα καὶ τρίγωνα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX5","text":"Οὐ συγχωρεῖται ὅτι ἕκαστον γένος σώματος ἔχει ἄλλο κάλλιον σῶμα κατὰ τὸ αὐτὸ γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX6","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ τῶν ἀνωτάτων ἀρχῶν οὔτε πλήρης ἀπόδειξις οὔτε θεία γνώσις ἀνθρώπων ἀπλῶς ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D1","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν τόπων τῶν σωμάτων παράγεται ἐκ τῆς διακρίσεως τῶν ἀνομοίων καὶ τῆς συνάξεως τῶν ὁμοίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","CH_JP8E_S_33:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς μετάβασις ἀπὸ ἀλόγου κινήσεως εἰς μαθηματικῶς ὡρισμένην διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D3","text":"Ἡ σώματος γένεσις δύναται νὰ ἀκολουθήσῃ ἀναλυτικὴν κλίμακα ἀπὸ τὸ βάθος εἰς τὴν ἐπίπεδον βάσιν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὰ τρίγωνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A5","CH_JP8E_S_33:A6","CH_JP8E_S_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D4","text":"Ἡ πολυμορφία τῶν σωμάτων ἀνάγεται εἰς ὀλίγας γεωμετρικὰς ἀρχὰς ἀντὶ ἀπείρων ἀδιαφοροποιήτων στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","CH_JP8E_S_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D5","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης μετασχηματισμοῦ τῶν σωμάτων ἀπαιτεῖ κοινὴν γεωμετρικὴν ὑποδομήν ὑπὸ τὰ διαφέροντα εἴδη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D6","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις τῆς γένεσης ἔχει ὅριον ἐν τῷ εἰκότι λόγῳ, ἐπειδὴ αἱ ἀνώτεραι ἀρχαὶ δὲν ἀποδεικνύονται ἀνθρωπίνως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","CH_JP8E_S_33:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν, ἀλλὰ μετασχηματίζει τὴν ἄτακτον κίνησιν εἰς μηχανισμὸν διακρίσεως, συναγωγῆς καὶ μορφοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ διαφορά τῶν σωμάτων θεμελιοῦται ταὐτοχρόνως εἰς χωρικὴν ἀπονομήν, μαθηματικὴν μορφήν καὶ δυνατότητα διαλύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία συνδέει τὴν αἰσθητὴν γένεσιν μὲ ἱεραρχία γνώσεως, ὅπου ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάγκη ἐξηγεῖ τὰ ἐγγύτερα, ἐνώ ἡ θεία γνώσις φυλάσσει τὰ ἀνώτατα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","CH_JP8E_S_33:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD4","text":"Τὸ κάλλος τῶν σωμάτων κρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἀναλογίαν καὶ τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν μεταβλητότητα, οὐχὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν αὐτοτέλειαν ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ κόσμος νὰ εἶναι ἐξ ἀρχῆς πλήρως κεκοσμημένος, ὡς εἰ ἡ τάξις ἦν ἀρχικὴ καὶ ἀμετάβλητος ἰδιότης τῆς ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἑτερότης τῶν σωμάτων νὰ σημαίνῃ πλήρη ἀσυνέχεια καὶ ἀδυναμία μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις νὰ ἀπαιτῇ ἀναγωγὴν ὅλων τῶν ἀρχῶν εἰς ἓν καὶ τὸ αὐτὸ γνωστικὸν ἐπίπεδον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ μαθηματικὴ μορφὴ νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὸν ἐξωτερικὸν σχῆμα ἐπὶ ἑτοίμων σωμάτων, ἀφοῦ συγκροτεῖ τὴν ταυτότητα καὶ τὴν γένεσίν των.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ τάξις νὰ ἐρμηνεύηται χωρὶς προγενεστέραν ἀταξίαν, διάκρισιν καὶ διαδικασίαν συγκροτήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτως ἀδιαμόρφωτης ὕλης ἀποτελεῖ τὸ ἀφανὲς ὅριον τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ τὰ γένη ἔχουσιν ἤδη ἴχνη τῶν ἑαυτῶν πρὶν τὴν τελικὴν κοσμήσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία ἀνθρωπίνης γνώσεως τῶν ἀνωτάτων ἀρχῶν διασώζει τὴν ὑπεροχὴν τοῦ θείου ἐντός τοῦ ἔλλογου κοσμολογικοῦ σχήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX3","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις προϋποθέτει ὅτι ἡ ἀταξία δὲν εἶναι τελικὴ πραγματικότης, ἀλλὰ ἀνοικτὴ κατάστασις πρὸς μορφοποίησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῶν σωμάτων μένει ἀνεξάντλητη ὑπὸ τὸ γεωμετρικὸν σχήμα, ἐπειδὴ τὸ γεωμετρικὸν ἔδαφος ἔχει ἔτι ἀνώτερον θεμέλιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1","text":"Ἄλογος καὶ ἄμετρος κατάστασις → κίνησις τῆς χώρας ὡς σεισμικὸν ὄργανον → διάκρισις ἀνομοίων καὶ σύναξις ὁμοίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS2","text":"Χωρικὴ διαφοροποίησις → ἐπιχείρησις κοσμήσεως → εἴδη καὶ ἀριθμοὶ ὡς ἀρχὴ τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS3","text":"Σῶμα → βάθος → ἐπίπεδος φύσις → τριγωνικὴ βάσις → δύο πρωταρχικοὶ τύποι ὀρθογωνίων τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS4","text":"Κοινὴ τριγωνικὴ ὑποδομή → τέτταρα ἀνόμοια σώματα → δυνατότης διαλύσεως καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ ἀλλήλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS5","text":"Γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάγκη → εἰκὼς λόγος περὶ τῆς γενέσεως → ὅριον γνώσεως ἐν ταῖς ἀνωτέραις ἀρχαῖς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS6","text":"Θεία διάταξις → σύνδεσις κάλλους, μορφῆς, ἀριθμοῦ καὶ μεταβλητότητος → κοσμικὴ σύνθεσις ἐκ μὴ κεκοσμημένων ὑλῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AF1","text":"Ἄτακτος πολλότης → σεισμικὴ διάκρισις → χωρικὴ ἀπονομή → κοσμικὴ διάταξις → γεωμετρικὴ ἀναγωγή → τετραπλῆ σωματικὴ μορφή → εἰκὼς ἀλλὰ ἀναγκαῖος λόγος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AF2","text":"Ἀρχικὴ ἀμετρία → ὁμοιότης καὶ ἀνομοιότης → μορφὴ καὶ ἀριθμός → τρίγωνα → σώματα → δυνατότης μετασχηματισμοῦ → ὅριον θείας ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς προγενεστέρα φάσις τῆς κοσμήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME2","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν στοιχείων μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ ποιοτικὴν περιγραφήν εἰς σχέσιν γεωμετρικῆς μορφῆς, ἀριθμοῦ καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME3","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν σωμάτων ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ ἀδιαίρετα στοιχεῖα καὶ ἐγγράφεται εἰς ἱεραρχημένην διαδικασίαν ἀναλύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία μεταβολὴ τῶν σωμάτων καταργεῖ τὴν ἀπόλυτον ἀντίθεσιν μεταξύ ταυτότητος καὶ διαφοράς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀπόδειξις ὁριοθετεῖται χωρὶς νὰ ἀκυροῦται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάγκη συνυπάρχει μὲ τὴν ἀποφατικὴ ἀναφορὰν εἰς τὸ θεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Τὰ τέτταρα γένη κινούμενα διακρίνεται, χωρίζεται καὶ καταλαμβάνει ἄλλην χώραν ἕκαστον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις παράγεται διὰ μηχανισμοῦ διακρίσεως, συναγωγῆς, μορφοποιήσεως καὶ ἀριθμητικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ὁ λόγος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀφηρημένην κοσμοποίησιν εἰς ἐλεγχόμενην παραγωγὴν τῶν σωμάτων, ὥστε ἡ γένεσις νὰ ἐξηγῆται μὲ κλιμακωτὴν ἀναγωγήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ πραγματικότης ἔχει διαδοχικὰ ἐπίπεδα, ἀπὸ προγενεστέραν ἀταξίαν διὰ τῆς κοσμήσεως εἰς γεωμετρικῶς συγκροτημένα σώματα, ἐνώ τὸ ἀνώτατον θεμέλιον μένει ὑπεράνω τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου χρόνου καὶ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀναγκαῖα ἀξιώματα ἀρκούσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀταξίαν εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία διασώζει τὴν ἀναγωγὴν ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα εἰς τὴν τριγωνικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή παραμένει ἐλλιπὴς ὡς πρὸς τὴν τελικὴν θεμελίωσιν τῶν δύο τριγωνικῶν τύπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ τοῦ σχήματος στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν σύζευξιν γεωμετρικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα πλευρὰ τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ ἄρρητος μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν θείαν κοσμοποιὸν ἐνέργειαν εἰς τὴν συγκεκριμένην γεωμετρικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀδιευκρίνιστον εἰ ἡ γεωμετρία εἶναι ἡ ὄντως ἀρχὴ τῶν σωμάτων ἢ ἡ ἀναγκαία μορφὴ τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230756622268Z_1cdbc532","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 53","source_sha256":"62684ba9c598023eb3641ec36954f70f1fbbc9fc5e2d2b2e7df964244a2d6854","sha256":"543221d13fa9578e4e019498deb874783259ab5c1cd094d8c493a236f432926a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:07:56.625217+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS1","text":"The undifferentiated and disorderly state of the four kinds is differentiated by a shaking motion and withdraws into different regions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS2","text":"Motion separates dissimilars and gathers similars together before the whole comes to be ordered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS3","text":"Cosmogenesis transforms the irrational and measureless condition into an arrangement according to forms and numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS4","text":"The generation of bodies is analyzed from body into depth, plane, triangles, and elementary triangular principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AS5","text":"The exact principle of principles remains known to god and to the man dear to god, whereas the account concerning bodies remains likely and according to necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","text":"Before ordering, the four kinds had an irrational and measureless disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","text":"Motion of the receptacle or region operates as an earthquake and differentiates the things moved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","text":"Dissimilars are separated from one another, while similars are pressed together into the same place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","text":"Cosmic order consists of forms and numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A5","text":"Fire, water, earth, and air are bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A6","text":"Every body has form and depth, and depth contains a plane nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","text":"The right plane base consists of triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","text":"The triangles are reduced to two primary types of right-angled triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A9","text":"The four most beautiful bodies must be dissimilar in each kind, yet able to be dissolved into and transformed into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","text":"The generation of bodies can be set forth through a likely account, which proceeds according to necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:A11","text":"The yet higher principles of triangles exceed the present demonstration and are ascribed to god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX1","text":"The condition before ordering is determined neither by reason nor by measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX2","text":"The four kinds neither originally coexisted in one region nor were indiscriminately mixed together according to the final order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX3","text":"Cosmic arrangement does not constitute a merely automatic accumulation, but presupposes an ordering activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX4","text":"Body is not ultimately analyzed into formless depth; rather, depth is reduced to planes and triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX5","text":"It is not conceded that each kind of body has another more beautiful body within the same kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:NX6","text":"The account concerning the highest principles is neither a complete demonstration nor, simply, divine knowledge of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D1","text":"The difference among the places of bodies is produced from the separation of dissimilars and the gathering of similars.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","CH_JP8E_S_33:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D2","text":"Cosmic order appears as a transition from irrational motion to a mathematically determined arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D3","text":"The generation of body can follow an analytical scale from depth to the plane base and thence to triangles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A5","CH_JP8E_S_33:A6","CH_JP8E_S_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D4","text":"The multiplicity of bodies is reduced to a few geometrical principles rather than infinitely many undifferentiated elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","CH_JP8E_S_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D5","text":"The possibility of transformation of bodies requires a common geometrical substructure beneath the differing forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:D6","text":"The explanation of generation has its limit in the likely account, because the higher principles are not demonstrated humanly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","CH_JP8E_S_33:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1","text":"The order of the cosmos does not remove motion, but transforms disorderly motion into a mechanism of differentiation, gathering, and formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1","CH_JP8E_S_33:A2","CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD2","text":"The natural difference of bodies is grounded simultaneously in spatial allotment, mathematical form, and the possibility of dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A3","CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","CH_JP8E_S_33:A7","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3","text":"Cosmology connects sensible generation with a hierarchy of knowledge, in which geometrical necessity explains what is nearer, while divine knowledge preserves what is highest.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A10","CH_JP8E_S_33:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SD4","text":"The beauty of bodies is judged from internal proportion and reciprocal mutability, not from the mere self-sufficiency of each kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A4","CH_JP8E_S_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that the cosmos should be fully ordered from the beginning, as though order were an original and immutable property of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that the otherness of bodies should signify complete discontinuity and impossibility of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that physical explanation should require the reduction of all principles to one and the same cognitive level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that mathematical form should be a mere external shape imposed upon ready-made bodies, since it constitutes their identity and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that order should be interpreted without prior disorder, differentiation, and a process of constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX1","text":"The absence of absolutely unformed matter constitutes the hidden limit of the account, since the kinds already have traces of their own before final ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX2","text":"The impossibility of human knowledge of the highest principles preserves the superiority of the divine within the rational cosmological schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX3","text":"Cosmic order presupposes that disorder is not final reality, but a condition open to formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4","text":"The principle of bodies remains inexhaustible beneath the geometrical schema, because the geometrical ground has a yet higher foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1","text":"Irrational and measureless condition → motion of the region as a seismic instrument → separation of dissimilars and gathering of similars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS2","text":"Spatial differentiation → undertaking of ordering → forms and numbers as the principle of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS3","text":"Body → depth → plane nature → triangular base → two primary types of right-angled triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS4","text":"Common triangular substructure → four dissimilar bodies → possibility of dissolution and transformation into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS5","text":"Geometrical necessity → likely account concerning generation → limit of knowledge in the higher principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS6","text":"Divine arrangement → connection of beauty, form, number, and mutability → cosmic composition from unordered materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AF1","text":"Disorderly multiplicity → seismic differentiation → spatial allotment → cosmic arrangement → geometrical reduction → fourfold bodily form → likely but necessary account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:AF2","text":"Initial lack of measure → similarity and dissimilarity → form and number → triangles → bodies → possibility of transformation → limit of divine principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1","text":"Disorder is reclassified as a prior phase of ordering and not as a mere absence of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME2","text":"The difference of the elements is transferred from qualitative description into a relation of geometrical form, number, and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME3","text":"The generation of bodies is detached from indivisible elements and inscribed within a hierarchized process of analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME4","text":"The reciprocal alteration of bodies abolishes the absolute opposition between identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ME5","text":"Scientific demonstration is delimited without being invalidated, because geometrical necessity coexists with apophatic reference to the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The four moving kinds are differentiated, separated, and each occupies a different region.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Cosmic order is produced through a mechanism of differentiation, gathering, formation, and numerical arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The account proceeds from abstract cosmogenesis to a controlled production of bodies, so that generation may be explained through a graded reduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality has successive levels, from prior disorder through ordering to geometrically constituted bodies, while the highest foundation remains above human time and account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT1","text":"The necessary axioms suffice for reconstructing the movement from disorder to cosmic arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT2","text":"The sequence preserves the reduction from body to the triangular principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction remains incomplete with respect to the final grounding of the two triangular types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence of the schema rests upon the conjunction of geometrical necessity and likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT5","text":"The weakest side of the system is the unspoken transition from the divine cosmopoietic activity to the specific geometrical arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6","text":"Compression does not remove the actual movement of the account, but leaves unresolved whether geometry is truly the principle of bodies or the necessary form of human explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_33:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_33@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_33:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 53"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 37","title":"Section 53","context":"Chapter 37","original_title":"Section 53","original_context":"Chapter 37"},"original_title":"Section 53","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34","layer":"CH","title":"Section 54","order":38,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_34"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_34@R001","sha256":"daf6f03edb8d3349499be818802bec54a7d4b0ce96e54308550d22b34d48b7d6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἐκ πολλῶν τριγώνων σύστασις τῶν τεσσάρων γενῶν σωμάτων καὶ ἡ πρὸς ἄλληλα γένεσις αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀσαφὴς δόξα ὅτι πάντα τὰ γένη διʼ ἀλλήλων γίγνεται ἀνασκευάζεται διὰ τῆς διακρίσεως τῶν δύο πρωταρχικῶν τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS3","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἐπιλογὴ τοῦ καλλίστου τριγώνου παρέχει τὸν ὑλικὸν κανόνα τῆς κοσμικῆς συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS4","text":"Τρία γένη ἐκ τοῦ ἀνισοπλεύρου τριγώνου γίγνεται, τὸ δὲ τέταρτον ἐκ τοῦ ἰσοσκελοῦς μόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS5","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ μεταβολὴ περιορίζεται εἰς τὰ τρία συγγενῆ γένη, ἐπειδὴ κοινὴν τὴν στοιχειώδη μορφὴν ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιλογὴν τῶν τριγώνων εἰς τὸν ἀριθμὸν καὶ τὴν διάταξιν τῶν ἐξ αὐτῶν συνισταμένων σχημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A1","text":"Ἐκ τῶν ἀπείρων τριγώνων δεῖ προαιρεῖσθαι τὸ κάλλιστον πρὸς ὀρθὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A2","text":"Τὸ ἰσοσκελὲς τρίγωνον ἔχει μίαν μόνον πρωταρχικὴν φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A3","text":"Τὸ πρόμηκες τρίγωνον ἔχει ἀπεράντους δυνατὰς μορφάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A4","text":"Τὸ πρόμηκες στοιχειῶδες τρίγωνον ἔχει πλευρὰν μείζονα τριπλασίαν κατὰ δύναμιν τῆς ἐλάττονος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A5","text":"Τὰ δύο ἐπιλεγέντα τρίγωνα χρησιμεύει ὡς στοιχεῖα τῆς τοῦ πυρὸς καὶ τῶν ἄλλων σωμάτων μηχανῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","text":"Τὰ τέτταρα γένη σωμάτων ἐκ τῶν δύο τούτων τριγώνων συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","text":"Τρία γένη ἐκ τοῦ ἀνισοσκελοῦς τριγώνου παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","text":"Ἓν γένος μόνον ἐκ τοῦ ἰσοσκελοῦς τριγώνου συναρμόζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις τῶν μειζόνων σχημάτων εἰς τὰ στοιχεῖα αὐτῶν ἐπιτρέπει νέαν σύστασιν ὁμογενῶν μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","text":"Ἡ σύστασις τοῦ ἰσοπλεύρου τριγώνου ἐκ ἓξ στοιχειωδῶν τριγώνων διέπει τὴν ἀριθμητικὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς πρώτης μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A11","text":"Ἡ διάμετρος καὶ αἱ βραχεῖαι πλευραὶ τῶν στοιχείων δύνανται νὰ ἐρείδωνται πρὸς ἓν κέντρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A12","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ ἑκάστου γένους ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸν ἀριθμὸν καὶ τὴν σύμπτωσιν τῶν συντιθεμένων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ὀρθὸν ὅτι πάντα τὰ τέτταρα γένη διʼ ἀλλήλων εἰς ἄλληλα μεταβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ τῶν τριγώνων ἀρχὴ ἀδιακρίτως ἀπείρων σχημάτων ἐκλογή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἔχει τὸ ἰσοσκελὲς καὶ τὸ πρόμηκες τρίγωνον τὴν αὐτὴν γενετικὴν ἰσχύν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX4","text":"Οὐ δύναται τὸ τέταρτον γένος νὰ ἀναλυθῇ καὶ νὰ συγκροτηθῇ κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ὥσπερ τὰ τρία ἄλλα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ἡ ἀναφορά εἰς τὰ τέτταρα γένη χωρὶς διορισμὸν τῶν στοιχείων καὶ τῶν ἀριθμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX6","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ἀνάμιξις τῆς ἰσοπλεύρου μορφῆς μετὰ τῆς στοιχειώδους μορφῆς ὡς εἰ ἦσαν ἡ αὐτὴ γεωμετρικὴ μονάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς κοσμικῆς κατασκευῆς ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ μοναδικῆς καὶ πολυμόρφου στοιχειώδους φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A1","CH_JP8E_S_34:A2","CH_JP8E_S_34:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D2","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια τῶν τριῶν γενῶν ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τοῦ κοινοῦ ἀνισοσκελοῦς στοιχείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","CH_JP8E_S_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία μεταβολὴ τῶν τριῶν γενῶν γίνεται δυνατὴ διὰ λύσεως τῶν μεγάλων μορφῶν καὶ ἀνασυστάσεως τῶν αὐτῶν μικρῶν στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D4","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία μεταβολὴ τοῦ τετάρτου γένους πρὸς τὰ ἄλλα ἀποκλείεται ὑπὸ τῆς διαφορᾶς τοῦ στοιχείου αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","CH_JP8E_S_34:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D5","text":"Ἡ ποσότης τῶν στοιχείων καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον ἡ ποιότης αὐτῶν καθορίζει τὸ εἶδος τοῦ συνισταμένου σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D6","text":"Ἓξ στοιχειώδη πρόμηκη τρίγωνα, κατὰ διάμετρον συντιθέμενα, δύνανται νὰ ἀποτελέσωσιν ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","CH_JP8E_S_34:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D7","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ σύστασις προηγείται τῆς πλήρους περιγραφῆς ἑκάστου γένους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης μεταβολῆς τῶν σωμάτων θεμελιοῦται ἐπὶ κοινῆς ὑλικῆς μορφῆς καὶ οὐκ ἐπὶ καθολικῆς ἀναγωγῆς πάντων εἰς πάντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ποικιλία παράγεται διὰ συνδυασμοῦ πεπερασμένων στοιχειωδῶν τύπων καὶ ποσοτικῶν διατάξεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A4","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου συνυπάρχει μετὰ μερικοῦ ἀποκλεισμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ κοινὴ γενετικὴ ἀρχὴ ἔχει μόνον τὰ τρία γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","CH_JP8E_S_34:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία μεταβάλλεται εἰς ὀντολογικὸν κριτήριον, ὅταν ἡ δυνατότης γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν σύστασιν τῶν σχημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A5","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἀδιάφορος ὕλη ἔξωθεν τῶν σχημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX2","text":"Ἡ γένεσις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀκαθόριστος ῥοὴ μεταξὺ ὁποιωνδήποτε σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὑλικὴ ἐνότητα οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἑνιαίαν καὶ ἀδιαίρετον γενεσιουργὸν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX4","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ παθητικῶς τῇ ποσότητι, ἀλλὰ συνκαθορίζει τὸ τί ἐστι τὸ γιγνόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀπόδειξις οὐκ ἀρκείται εἰς ὑπόθεσιν· δεῖ καὶ τὸν ἀριθμὸν καὶ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν σύνθεσιν δεικνύναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ πᾶσα μεταβολὴ εἴη ἀδιακρίτως δυνατή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀρχὴ ἑνὸς καθολικοῦ στοιχείου, ἐξ οὗ ἅπαντα τὰ γένη ὁμοίως παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει ἡ πλήρης ἀναγωγὴ τῆς διαφορᾶς εἰς μίαν μόνην γεωμετρικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου προϋποθέτει ὅτι τινὲς μεταβολαὶ ἐπιτρεπταί, τινὲς δὲ ἀπαγορευμέναι εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS1","text":"Ἀπειρία τριγώνων → ἐκλογὴ τοῦ καλλίστου → διάκρισις ἰσοσκελοῦς καὶ προμήκους στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS2","text":"Δύο στοιχειώδεις τύποι → τέτταρα γένη σωμάτων → τρία γένη ἐκ κοινοῦ στοιχείου καὶ ἓν γένος ἐξ ἰδίου στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS3","text":"Διάλυσις μειζόνων μορφῶν → ἐπανένωσις μικρῶν στοιχείων → δυνατὴ μεταβολὴ τῶν τριῶν συγγενῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS4","text":"Ἀνομοιότης στοιχείου → ἀδυναμία καθολικῆς μεταβολῆς → ὅρος τῆς κοσμικῆς μεταμορφώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS5","text":"Μῆκος πλευρῶν + διάμετρος + ἀριθμὸς στοιχείων → ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον → πρώτη προσδιορισμένη μορφὴ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AF1","text":"Ἀσαφὴς καθολικὴ γένεσις → γεωμετρικὴ ἐπιλογὴ → διάκρισις στοιχείων → μερικὴ μεταβολή → ἀριθμητικὴ ἀπόδειξις → προσδιορισμὸς πρώτης μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME1","text":"Τὰ σώματα ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φαινόμενα γένη εἰς συνθέσεις γεωμετρικῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξὺ γένεως καὶ φθορᾶς ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς λύσις καὶ ἀνασύνθεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME3","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ μεταβολὴ καταλύεται καὶ ἀντʼ αὐτῆς τίθεται ἱεράρχησις συγγενῶν καὶ ἀσυγγενῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὸς λογισμός καὶ γίνεται ὅρος τῆς ὑλικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ τί φαίνεται εἰς τὸ ἐξ ὅσων καὶ κατὰ ποίαν διάταξιν συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ὕψος: ἕξ τρίγωνα συντιθέμενα ἀποτελοῦσιν ἓν ἰσόπλευρον τρίγωνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ὕψος: τὰ τέτταρα γένη διακρίνεται κατὰ τὴν κοινὴν ἢ ἴδιον στοιχειώδη μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ὕψος: ἡ ἀσαφὴς γενετικὴ ὑπόθεσις ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ ἐλεγχόμενης ἀριθμητικογεωμετρικῆς κατασκευῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν ὕψος: τὸ εἶδος τοῦ σώματος ὁρίζεται ὑπὸ τῆς μορφῆς, τοῦ ἀριθμοῦ καὶ τῆς δυνατότητος λύσεως καὶ συνθέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5","text":"Χρονικὸν ὕψος: ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ νοεῖται ὡς ἀναστρέψιμος μετάβασις μεταξὺ συνθέσεως καὶ διαλύσεως, ἀλλὰ οὐχὶ ὡς καθολικὴ ἀναστρεψιμότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κύριου συλλογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιλογὴν τῶν τριγώνων πρὸς τὴν περιορισμένην μεταβολὴν τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ πλήρης ἀντιστοιχία τῶν τεσσάρων γενῶν πρὸς τὰ συγκεκριμένα στερεὰ, ἐπειδὴ τὸ χωρίον ἐνταῦθα προχωρεῖ μόνον εἰς τὴν πρώτην σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT4","text":"Συνεκτικὸς ὁ μηχανισμὸς ἐστίν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δυνατότης μεταβολῆς ἐξάγεται ἀπὸ τὴν κοινότητα τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα πρότασις ἐστὶν ἡ διάκρισις τῶν τριῶν μεταβλητῶν γενῶν ἀπὸ τὸ τέταρτον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὰς κατασκευὰς καὶ ἀριθμητικοὺς διορισμούς, οὓς τὸ χωρίον μόνον ἐν μέρει ἐκθέτει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT7","text":"Ἡ συμπύκνωσις οὐκ ἀφαιρεῖ τὸν θεμελιώδη ὅρον ὅτι οὐ πάντα πάντα γίγνεται, ἀλλὰ μόνον τὰ κοινὴν στοιχειώδη φύσιν ἔχοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230814148015Z_67abbe7b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 54","source_sha256":"daf6f03edb8d3349499be818802bec54a7d4b0ce96e54308550d22b34d48b7d6","sha256":"445d3bf8cb0a41da8604f81e2adeb3b4a0a016a971a0c2f295cecd6b07c19f1b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:08:14.151696+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS1","text":"The problem is the composition of the four kinds of bodies from many triangles and their generation into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS2","text":"The vague opinion that all the kinds come to be from one another is refuted by the distinction between the two primary triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS3","text":"The geometrical selection of the most beautiful triangle supplies the material principle of cosmic composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS4","text":"Three kinds arise from the scalene triangle, whereas the fourth arises from the isosceles alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS5","text":"Possible transformation is limited to the three kindred kinds, because they possess a common elementary form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AS6","text":"The demonstration proceeds from the selection of the triangles to the number and arrangement of the figures constituted from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A1","text":"From among the infinite triangles, the most beautiful must be chosen as a correct principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A2","text":"The isosceles triangle has only one primary nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A3","text":"The oblong triangle has limitless possible forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A4","text":"The oblong elementary triangle has a greater side triple in power to the lesser.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A5","text":"The two selected triangles serve as elements of the mechanism of fire and of the other bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","text":"The four kinds of bodies are composed from these two triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","text":"Three kinds are produced from the scalene triangle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","text":"Only one kind is fitted together from the isosceles triangle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","text":"The dissolution of the larger figures into their elements permits a new composition of homogeneous forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","text":"The composition of the equilateral triangle from six elementary triangles governs the numerical principle of the first form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A11","text":"The hypotenuse and the short sides of the elements can be made to rest upon a single centre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:A12","text":"The form of each kind depends upon the number and conjunction of the constituent elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX1","text":"It is not correct that all four kinds are transformed from one another into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX2","text":"The principle of triangles is not an indiscriminate selection from infinite figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX3","text":"The isosceles and the oblong triangle do not possess the same generative power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX4","text":"The fourth kind cannot be dissolved and constituted in the same manner as the other three.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX5","text":"Reference to the four kinds is not sufficient without specification of the elements and the numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:NX6","text":"The conflation of the equilateral form with the elementary form, as though they were the same geometrical unit, is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D1","text":"The principle of cosmic construction requires a distinction between a unique and a multiform elementary nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A1","CH_JP8E_S_34:A2","CH_JP8E_S_34:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D2","text":"The kinship of the three kinds rests upon the common scalene element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","CH_JP8E_S_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D3","text":"The reciprocal transformation of the three kinds becomes possible through dissolution of the large forms and reconstitution of the same small elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D4","text":"The reciprocal transformation of the fourth kind into the others is excluded by the difference of its element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","CH_JP8E_S_34:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D5","text":"The quantity of the elements, and not only their quality, determines the species of the constituted body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D6","text":"Six elementary oblong triangles, composed along the hypotenuse, can constitute one equilateral triangle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","CH_JP8E_S_34:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:D7","text":"Numerical composition precedes the full description of each kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A10","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","text":"The possibility of transformation of bodies is founded upon a common material form and not upon a universal reduction of all things to all things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A6","CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2","text":"Cosmic diversity is produced through a combination of finite elementary types and quantitative arrangements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A4","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3","text":"The unity of the cosmos coexists with partial exclusion, since only the three kinds have a common generative principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A7","CH_JP8E_S_34:A8","CH_JP8E_S_34:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4","text":"Geometry becomes an ontological criterion when the possibility of generation and destruction depends upon the composition of figures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A5","CH_JP8E_S_34:A9","CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX1","text":"The nature of bodies is not explained as indifferent matter outside the figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX2","text":"Generation is not an indeterminate flux among arbitrary bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX3","text":"Material unity does not require a single and indivisible generative principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX4","text":"Form does not passively follow quantity, but jointly determines what the thing coming to be is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX5","text":"Scientific demonstration is not satisfied with a hypothesis; it must show both the number and the geometrical composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX1","text":"A cosmos in which every transformation would be indiscriminately possible is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX2","text":"The principle of one universal element, from which all kinds are produced alike, is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX3","text":"The complete reduction of difference to one single geometrical order remains impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4","text":"The order of the cosmos presupposes that some transformations are permitted, while others are forbidden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS1","text":"Infinity of triangles → selection of the most beautiful → distinction of isosceles and oblong element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS2","text":"Two elementary types → four kinds of bodies → three kinds from a common element and one kind from its own element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS3","text":"Dissolution of larger forms → reunion of small elements → possible transformation of the three kindred kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS4","text":"Dissimilarity of element → impossibility of universal transformation → limit of cosmic metamorphosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS5","text":"Length of sides + hypotenuse + number of elements → equilateral triangle → first determinate form of body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:AF1","text":"Vague universal generation → geometrical selection → distinction of elements → partial transformation → numerical demonstration → determination of the first form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME1","text":"Bodies are reclassified from apparent kinds into compositions of geometrical elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2","text":"The opposition between generation and destruction is reshaped as dissolution and recomposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME3","text":"Universal transformation is abolished and replaced by a hierarchy of kindred and unrelated kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4","text":"Number ceases to be mere calculation and becomes a condition of material identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ME5","text":"Explanation shifts from what appears to of how many things, and in what arrangement, it is constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT1","text":"Surface level: six triangles composed together constitute one equilateral triangle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT2","text":"Structural level: the four kinds are distinguished according to their common or proper elementary form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: the vague generative hypothesis is replaced by a controlled arithmetico-geometrical construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT4","text":"Ontological level: the species of body is defined by form, number, and the possibility of dissolution and composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5","text":"Temporal level: generation and destruction are conceived as a reversible transition between composition and dissolution, but not as universal reversibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from the selection of triangles to the limited transformation of the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT3","text":"The complete correspondence of the four kinds to the specific solids remains underdetermined, because the passage here proceeds only to the first composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT4","text":"The mechanism is coherent, because the possibility of transformation is derived from the commonality of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT5","text":"The stronger proposition is the distinction of the three mutable kinds from the fourth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT6","text":"Precision depends upon geometrical constructions and numerical specifications, which the passage sets forth only in part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_34:MRT7","text":"The condensation does not remove the fundamental condition that not all things come to be from all things, but only those possessing a common elementary nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_34:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_34@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_34:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 54"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 38","title":"Section 54","context":"Chapter 38","original_title":"Section 54","original_context":"Chapter 38"},"original_title":"Section 54","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35","layer":"CH","title":"Section 55","order":39,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_35"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_35@R001","sha256":"4002d866d60c7658bb5a9483b875b6f4ab827af541e69815e126d356b6b94d93","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS1","text":"Ἐκ τῶν ἰσοπλεύρων καὶ ἰσοσκελῶν τριγώνων αἱ στερεαὶ γωνίαι καὶ τὰ κανονικὰ σώματα συνίστανται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS2","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ σύστασις τῶν σωμάτων παρέχει τὸν τρόπον τῆς διανομῆς αὐτῶν εἰς τὰ τέτταρα γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS3","text":"Ἑκάστῳ γένει ἀποδίδοται τὸ σχῆμα ὃ τῇ φυσικῇ ἰδιότητι αὐτοῦ μάλιστα ἁρμόττει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη τῶν βάσεων καὶ τῆς στερεότητος καθιστᾷ τὸ κυβικὸν εἶδος γῆς ἴδιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις χρῆται τῇ πέμπτῃ συστάσει πρὸς τὴν τοῦ παντὸς διακόσμησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS6","text":"Ἐκ τῆς ἀριθμητικῆς περατότητος τῶν σχημάτων προκύπτει λόγος ὑπὲρ ἑνὸς κόσμου, μολονότι ἡ ἀπορία περὶ πλειόνων κόσμων μένει δυνατή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A1","text":"Αἱ στερεαὶ γωνίαι συγκροτοῦνται ἐκ πεπερασμένων ἐπιπέδων γωνιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","text":"Τὰ κανονικὰ στερεὰ σώματα παράγονται ἐκ ὡρισμένων συνθέσεων ἰσοπλεύρων ἢ ἰσοσκελῶν τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","text":"Ἡ τετραμερὴς γεωμετρικὴ τάξις τῶν στοιχείων ἀκολουθεῖ τὰ τέτταρα πρώτα κανονικὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A4","text":"Τὸ τετράεδρον ἀντιστοιχεῖ τῷ πυρί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A5","text":"Τὸ ὀκτάεδρον ἀντιστοιχεῖ τῷ ἀέρι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A6","text":"Τὸ εἰκοσάεδρον ἀντιστοιχεῖ τῷ ὕδατι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A7","text":"Τὸ κυβικὸν ἀντιστοιχεῖ τῇ γῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἐστὶν ἀκινητοτάτη καὶ πλαστικωτάτη τῶν τεσσάρων γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A9","text":"Ἡ ἀσφάλεια τῆς βάσεως ἀποτελεῖ κριτήριον φυσικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A10","text":"Ἔστι πέμπτη σύστασις, ἣν ὁ θεὸς χρῆται πρὸς τὴν τοῦ παντὸς διακόσμησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος μηνύει ἕνα κόσμον πεφυκότα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A12","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία περὶ ἑνὸς ἢ πλειόνων κόσμων δὲν λύεται διὰ καθολικῆς ἀποδείξεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX1","text":"Τὰ στοιχεία οὐκ ἀποτελοῦνται ἀπὸ ἀόριστον καὶ ἀριθμητικῶς ἄπειρον σχημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX2","text":"Ἡ γῆ οὐκ ἀποδίδοται τῷ τριγώνῳ, ἀλλὰ τῷ κυβικῷ στερεῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX3","text":"Τὸ κυβικὸν εἶδος οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται διὰ κινητότητος, ἀλλὰ διὰ σταθερότητος καὶ ἀσφαλοῦς βάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX4","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις οὐκ ἀνήκει ἁπλῶς εἰς τὰ τέτταρα στοιχειώδη γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX5","text":"Ὁ περὶ πλειόνων κόσμων λόγος οὐκ ἔχει τὴν αὐτὴν βεβαιότητα μετὰ τοῦ περὶ ἑνὸς κόσμου λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς ἀριθμὸν ἀνεξάρτητον θείας διακοσμήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ στερεαὶ γωνίαι ἔχουσιν ὡρισμένας ἐπιπέδους γωνίας, τὰ κανονικὰ σώματα περιορίζονται εἰς ὡρισμένα εἴδη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A1","CH_JP8E_S_35:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ τέτταρα πρώτα σώματα ἔχουσι διακεκριμένας γεωμετρικὰς συστάσεις, δύνανται νὰ λειτουργῶσιν ὡς φορεῖς τῶν τεσσάρων γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ κυβικὸν σώμα ἔχει ἰσοπλεύρους τετραγώνους βάσεις καὶ σταθερὰς γωνίας, ἡ γῆ ἀποκτᾷ τὴν ἰδιότητα τοῦ βεβηκότος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A7","CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις διαφέρει ἀπὸ τὰ στοιχεῖα, ἡ λειτουργία αὐτῆς ἀναφέρεται εἰς τὸ ὅλον καὶ οὐχὶ εἰς ἕν τι στοιχεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος προκρίνει ἕνα κόσμον, ἡ περατὴ γεωμετρικὴ τάξις ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἑνιαία κοσμικὴ διάταξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD1","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ διαφορά τῶν στοιχείων ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς διαφορά γεωμετρικῶν μορφῶν, βάσεων καὶ κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία γίνεται σύστημα ἀντιστοιχιῶν ἐν ᾧ ἡ μορφὴ ἐξηγεῖ τὴν φυσικὴν δύναμιν καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ δύναμις ἐπικυροῖ τὴν μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A4","CH_JP8E_S_35:A5","CH_JP8E_S_35:A6","CH_JP8E_S_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῶν κανονικῶν σχημάτων μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀριθμητικὴν τάξιν εἰς τελολογικὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν διὰ θείας χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10","CH_JP8E_S_35:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου στηρίζεται ὄχι μόνον εἰς γεωμετρικὴν περατότητα, ἀλλὰ καὶ εἰς ἀξιολόγησιν τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις τῶν στοιχείων οὐκ εἶναι ἄμορφος ὕλη προγενεστέρα πάσης μαθηματικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἁπλὴ συσσώρευσις μερῶν ἄνευ ἀναλογίας καὶ σχηματικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀναγκαιότης οὐκ ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν μαθηματικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ πολλαπλότης οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ πρωταρχικὸν μέτρον τῆς πραγματικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις οὐκ εἶναι ἐξωτερικὴ ἐπιβολὴ ἐπὶ ἀδιάφορα σώματα, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ τῶν ἐμφύτων μορφῶν αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς θὰ ἦν ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν γεωμετρικὴν τάξιν καὶ τὴν θείαν διακόσμησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ ἀπειρία ἔχει αὐτομάτως μείζονα ὀντολογικὴν ἰσχὺν ἢ ἡ περατὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ κόσμου εἰς ἀριθμητικὴν ἀνάγκην ἄνευ ἐρμηνευτικῆς κρίσεως περὶ τοῦ εἰκότος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος σύμπτωσις μαθηματικῆς δυνατότητος καὶ φυσικῆς ὑπάρξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS1","text":"Ἀπλᾶ τρίγωνα → σύνθεσις ἐπιπέδων γωνιῶν → στερεαὶ γωνίαι → κανονικὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS2","text":"Κανονικὰ σώματα → διακεκριμέναι γεωμετρικαὶ ἰδιότητες → ἀντιστοιχία πρὸς πῦρ, ἀέρα, ὕδωρ καὶ γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS3","text":"Σταθερὴ βάσις καὶ ἀκινησία → κυβικὴ μορφή → φυσικὴ συγγένεια πρὸς τὴν γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS4","text":"Πέμπτη σύστασις → ὑπέρβασις τῆς τετραμεροῦς στοιχειακῆς τάξεως → διακόσμησις τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS5","text":"Περατὴ μορφολογία → ἀπορία περὶ κοσμικῆς πολλαπλότητος → προτίμησις τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου διὰ τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6","text":"Γεωμετρικὴ μορφή → φυσικὴ ἰδιότης → στοιχειακὴ ἀπόδοσις → θεία κοσμικὴ σύνταξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AF1","text":"Τριγωνικὰ στοιχεῖα → στερεὰ σώματα → στοιχειακὴ ἀντιστοιχία → κριτήριον σταθερᾶς βάσεως → ἀπόδοσις τῆς γῆς τῷ κύβῳ → πέμπτη κοσμικὴ σύστασις → εἷς κόσμος κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀόριστον ὑπόστρωμα εἰς σχηματισμένην καὶ μετρήσιμον γεωμετρικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν στοιχείων μετασχηματίζεται εἰς διάκρισιν μορφῶν, βάσεων, στερεότητος καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME3","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς τὸ στοιχεῖον τῆς ἀσφαλεστάτης βάσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ὡς ἕν τι τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME4","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη μορφὴ ἀναβαίνει ἀπὸ στοιχειακὸν ἀντικείμενον εἰς ὄργανον τῆς ὅλης κοσμικῆς διακοσμήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῶν κόσμων μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν ἐρώτησιν εἰς ζήτημα ἐρμηνείας τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ὕψους περιγράφονται αἱ συνθέσεις τριγώνων, αἱ στερεαὶ γωνίαι καὶ τὰ κανονικὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ὕψους ἡ γεωμετρικὴ μορφὴ καθορίζει τὴν φυσικὴν ἰδιότητα ἑκάστου στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ὕψους ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος ἐπιλέγει τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ κόσμου ἐντὸς ἀπορίας περὶ ἀπείρων κόσμων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ὕψους τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς πεπερασμένη, μορφοποιημένη καὶ θεοδιακόσμητος τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ὕψους ἡ θεία διάταξις προηγείται λογικῶς τῆς διαιρέσεως τῶν γεγονότων εἰς τὰ γένη τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς πορείας ἀπὸ τὴν τριγωνικὴν σύστασιν εἰς τὴν στοιχειακὴν διανομήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστοιχία τοῦ κυβικοῦ σώματος πρὸς τὴν γῆν ἀνασυνίσταται διὰ τῆς σταθερότητος καὶ τῆς ἀσφαλοῦς βάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT3","text":"Ἡ λειτουργία τῆς πέμπτης συστάσεως ἀνασυνίσταται μόνον ὡς κοσμικὴ διακόσμησις, οὐχὶ ὡς πλήρως ὡρισμένον στοιχεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου παραμένει ἐξαρτωμένη ἀπὸ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον καὶ οὐκ ἀποδεικνύεται ἀναγκαίως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν παραγωγήν καὶ τὴν στοιχειακὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT6","text":"Ἡ δομὴ παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀκριβῆ φύσιν τῆς πέμπτης συστάσεως καὶ τὸν λόγον τῆς προτιμήσεως τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διασῴζει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀπορία περὶ πλειόνων κόσμων παραμένει ἀνεπίλυτος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230831096405Z_7e12fbd4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 55","source_sha256":"4002d866d60c7658bb5a9483b875b6f4ab827af541e69815e126d356b6b94d93","sha256":"82fad8f9e122d12e9ebb94c1a190e8dcc94ca9b7d3885cf7f58d5f6ec94f9ccc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:08:31.099715+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS1","text":"Solid angles and regular bodies are composed from equilateral and isosceles triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS2","text":"The geometrical constitution of bodies provides the manner of their distribution among the four kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS3","text":"To each kind is assigned the shape that most suitably accords with its natural property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS4","text":"The necessity of bases and solidity renders the cubic form proper to earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS5","text":"The divine arrangement employs the fifth constitution for the adornment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AS6","text":"From the numerical finitude of the shapes arises an argument for one cosmos, although the aporia concerning multiple cosmoses remains possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A1","text":"Solid angles are composed of finite plane angles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","text":"Regular solid bodies are generated from determinate combinations of equilateral or isosceles triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","text":"The fourfold geometrical order of the elements follows the first four regular bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A4","text":"The tetrahedron corresponds to fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A5","text":"The octahedron corresponds to air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A6","text":"The icosahedron corresponds to water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A7","text":"The cube corresponds to earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","text":"Earth is the most immovable and most malleable of the four kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A9","text":"The security of the base constitutes a criterion of natural affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A10","text":"There is a fifth constitution, which the god employs for the adornment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","text":"The likely account indicates one cosmos by nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:A12","text":"The aporia concerning one or multiple cosmoses is not resolved through a universal demonstration, but through the likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX1","text":"The elements are not composed of an indeterminate and numerically infinite number of shapes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX2","text":"Earth is not assigned to the triangle, but to the cubic solid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX3","text":"The cubic form is not explained by mobility, but by stability and a secure base.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX4","text":"The fifth constitution does not simply belong to the four elemental kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX5","text":"The account concerning multiple cosmoses does not have the same certainty as the account concerning one cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:NX6","text":"The truth of cosmic order is not reducible to a number independent of divine adornment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D1","text":"Since solid angles have determinate plane angles, regular bodies are limited to determinate kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A1","CH_JP8E_S_35:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D2","text":"Since the first four bodies have distinct geometrical constitutions, they can function as bearers of the four kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D3","text":"Since the cubic body has equilateral square bases and stable angles, earth acquires the property of being fixed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A7","CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D4","text":"Since the fifth constitution differs from the elements, its function refers to the whole and not to a particular element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:D5","text":"Since the likely account prefers one cosmos, finite geometrical order is interpreted as a unified cosmic arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD1","text":"The natural difference of the elements is reconstructed as a difference of geometrical forms, bases, and motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2","text":"Cosmology becomes a system of correspondences in which form explains natural power and natural power confirms form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A4","CH_JP8E_S_35:A5","CH_JP8E_S_35:A6","CH_JP8E_S_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","text":"The finitude of regular shapes transforms numerical order into teleological cosmic order through divine use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A2","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10","CH_JP8E_S_35:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","text":"The unity of the cosmos rests not only on geometrical finitude, but also on an evaluation of the likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX1","text":"The nature of the elements is not formless matter prior to every mathematical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX2","text":"Body is not explained as a mere accumulation of parts without proportion and formal necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX3","text":"Natural necessity is not separated from mathematical form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX4","text":"Cosmic multiplicity does not constitute the primary measure of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5","text":"Divine arrangement is not an external imposition upon indifferent bodies, but operates through their innate forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX1","text":"A cosmos that would be indifferent to geometrical order and divine adornment is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX2","text":"The principle that infinity automatically possesses greater ontological force than finite order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX3","text":"The complete reduction of the cosmos to numerical necessity without interpretive judgment concerning the likely is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX4","text":"The absolute coincidence of mathematical possibility and physical existence is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS1","text":"Simple triangles → composition of plane angles → solid angles → regular bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS2","text":"Regular bodies → distinct geometrical properties → correspondence with fire, air, water, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS3","text":"Stable base and immobility → cubic form → natural affinity with earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS4","text":"Fifth constitution → transcendence of the fourfold elemental order → adornment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS5","text":"Finite morphology → aporia concerning cosmic multiplicity → preference for one cosmos through the likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6","text":"Geometrical form → natural property → elemental assignment → divine cosmic ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:AF1","text":"Triangular elements → solid bodies → elemental correspondence → criterion of a stable base → assignment of earth to the cube → fifth cosmic constitution → one cosmos according to the likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1","text":"Matter is displaced from an indeterminate substrate into a formed and measurable geometrical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2","text":"The distinction of the elements is transformed into a distinction of forms, bases, solidity, and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME3","text":"Earth is reclassified as the element of the most secure base and not simply as one among the bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME4","text":"The fifth form rises from an elemental object to an instrument of the overall cosmic adornment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ME5","text":"The aporia concerning the cosmoses is shifted from a numerical question to a matter of interpreting the likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the compositions of triangles, solid angles, and regular bodies are described.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, geometrical form determines the natural property of each element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the likely account chooses the unity of the cosmos amid the aporia concerning infinite cosmoses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, being is conceived as a finite, formed, and divinely adorned order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, divine arrangement logically precedes the division of things into the kinds of elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the course from triangular constitution to elemental distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT2","text":"The correspondence of the cubic body with earth is reconstructed through stability and a secure base.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT3","text":"The function of the fifth constitution is reconstructed only as cosmic adornment, not as a fully determinate element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT4","text":"The unity of the cosmos remains dependent upon the likely account and is not necessarily demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT5","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as it concerns geometrical generation and elemental correspondence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT6","text":"The structure remains underdetermined with respect to the precise nature of the fifth constitution and the reason for preferring one cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the account, but the aporia concerning multiple cosmoses remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_35:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_35@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_35:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 55"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 39","title":"Section 55","context":"Chapter 39","original_title":"Section 55","original_context":"Chapter 39"},"original_title":"Section 55","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36","layer":"CH","title":"Section 56","order":40,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_36"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_36@R001","sha256":"3ec75b0da98358f5d4f1b3f2357c26a6435982648828fbf422af2e34c87edc0a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ κατὰ λόγον ἀπόδοσις τῶν φυσικῶν ἰδιοτήτων τοῖς στοιχείοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2","text":"Ἡ λύσις ἀναγάγει τὴν κίνησιν, τὸ μέγεθος, τὴν ὀξύτητα καὶ τὴν ἐλαφρότητα εἰς τὴν γεωμετρικὴν σύστασιν τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS3","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ τάξις μετατίθεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν πυρός, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις συνάπτει τὰ πλήθη, τὰς κινήσεις καὶ τὰς δυνάμεις διὰ ἀναλογιῶν ὑπὸ τὴν ἑκουσίως πεισθεῖσαν ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS5","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ μεταβολὴ συντελεῖται διὰ διάλυσιν, τμηματισμόν, μεταφοράν καὶ πάλιν σύστασιν τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS6","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ ἑκάστου στοιχείου διατηρεῖται ἢ μεταβάλλεται μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία τῶν μερῶν ἐπιτρέπῃ τὴν νέαν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A1","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἀποδίδοται τῷ δυσκινητοτάτῳ εἴδει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A2","text":"Τὸ πῦρ ἀποδίδοται τῷ εὐκινητοτάτῳ, ἐλαφροτάτῳ καὶ ὀξύτατῳ εἴδει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","text":"Ὁ ἀὴρ κατέχει τὴν μέσην τάξιν κατὰ κίνησιν, μέγεθος καὶ ὀξύτητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A4","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ κατέχει τὸ μέγιστον μέγεθος καὶ τὴν δεύτεραν τάξιν κατὰ ὀξύτητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A5","text":"Ἡ εὐκινησία αὐξάνει ὅσῳ ἐλαττοῦνται αἱ βάσεις καὶ τὰ συστατικὰ μέρη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A6","text":"Ἡ ὀξύτης καὶ ἡ τμητικὴ δύναμις ἀκολουθοῦσι τῇ ἐλαχίστῃ καὶ λεπτοτάτῃ συστάσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","text":"Τὸ στερεὸν εἶδος τῆς πυραμίδος ἀποτελεῖ στοιχεῖον καὶ σπέρμα πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","text":"Τὸ δεύτερον κατὰ γένεσιν εἶδος ἀποτελεῖ τὸ στοιχεῖον τοῦ ἀέρος, τὸ δὲ τρίτον τὸ στοιχεῖον τοῦ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A9","text":"Τὰ στοιχειακὰ μέρη εἶναι καθ’ ἓν ἀόρατα διὰ σμικρότητα, ὁρατὰ δὲ γίγνονται κατὰ συναθροισμὸν πολλῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A10","text":"Ὁ θεὸς συνήρμοσε τὰ πλήθη, τὰς κινήσεις καὶ τὰς δυνάμεις κατὰ ἀκριβοῦς ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη οὐκ ἀντιτάσσεται ἀλύτως τῇ θεϊκῇ διατάξει, ἀλλὰ πείθεται καὶ ὑπεκχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A12","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ στοιχείων ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διάλυσιν καὶ τὴν ἀνασύνθεσιν τῶν ἀριθμητῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX1","text":"Τὸ στοιχεῖον οὐκ ὁρίζεται ἀπὸ αἰσθητὴν ἐμφάνειαν ἑκάστου μεμονωμένου μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX2","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ διαφορά οὐκ ἀποδίδεται εἰς ἄτακτον ἢ ἀναίτιον ποιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX3","text":"Τὸ πῦρ οὐκ ἔχει τὸ μέγεθος καὶ τὴν βραδυκίνησιν τῆς γῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX4","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ οὐκ εἶναι ἀπλὴ ἀφανισμὸς ἢ δημιουργία ἐκ μηδενός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX5","text":"Ἡ γῆ διαλυθεῖσα οὐ μεταβαίνει εἰς ὁποιοδήποτε ἄλλο εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἀπὸ ἀσύνδετα πλήθη καὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀνυπέρβλητος δύναμις ἄνευ πειθοῦς καὶ διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐλαχιστότης τῶν βάσεων καθιστᾷ τὸ πῦρ τὸ πλέον εὐκίνητον, τμητικὸν καὶ ἐλαφρόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A2","CH_JP8E_S_36:A5","CH_JP8E_S_36:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D2","text":"Ἡ μέση γεωμετρικὴ τάξις παράγει τὴν μέσην φυσικὴν τάξιν τοῦ ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D3","text":"Ἡ συνάθροισις ἀοράτων μερῶν παράγει τὰ ὁρατὰ σώματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D4","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις γῆς ὑπὸ πυρὸς ἢ ἄλλου ὄγκου μεταφέρει τὰ μέρη, ἀλλ’ ἡ ἐπανασύστασις αὐτῶν ἀποκαθιστᾷ γῆν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A1","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D5","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις ὕδατος δύναται νὰ παράγῃ ἓν σῶμα πυρός καὶ δύο σώματα ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D6","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις ἀέρος δύναται νὰ παράγῃ δύο σώματα πυρός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D7","text":"Δύο σώματα πυρός συνιστῶσιν ἓν εἶδος ἀέρος ὅταν τὸ πῦρ συντριβῇ καὶ ἡττηθῇ ἐν τῇ κινήσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D8","text":"Δύο καὶ ἥμισυ σώματα ἀέρος συνιστῶσιν ἓν ὅλον σῶμα ὕδατος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A4","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ταυτότης τῶν στοιχείων ὁρίζεται ὡς σταθερὸς κανὼν ἀνασυνθέσεως, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀκίνητος ὕλη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῶν στοιχείων εἶναι μεταβολὴ ἀριθμητικῆς καὶ γεωμετρικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ ἑνότητα τῶν σωμάτων ἀποτελεῖ μακροκλίμακα φαινόμενον παραγόμενον ἐκ μικροκλίμακος ἀοράτων σχημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις προκύπτει ἐκ συντονισμοῦ θείας ἀναλογίας καὶ ὑλικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD5","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ φυσιολογία περιγράφεται ὡς διαδοχὴ νίκης, καταθραύσεως, διαλύσεως καὶ ἀνασυστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἄμορφος καὶ ἀριθμητικῶς ἀδιάκριτος φορεύς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX2","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ οὐκ ὑπάρχει χωρὶς δυναμικὴν ἰδιότητα, μέγεθος καὶ τρόπον κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX3","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ οὐκ ἀποτελοῦν ἀσυνεχῆ γεγονότα ἄνευ διατηρουμένης ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4","text":"Ἡ θεία τάξις οὐκ ἐπιβάλλεται ἔξωθεν ἀντιθέτως πρὸς τὴν φύσιν, ἀλλὰ πραγματοῦται διὰ τῆς πειθοῦς τῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν φαινομένων εἰς γεωμετρίαν οὐκ ἀφήνει τὴν μεταβολὴν ἀνερμήνευτον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης στοιχείων ἀπολύτως ἀσυσχετίστων πρὸς ἀριθμόν, μορφὴν καὶ λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης κόσμου ὅπου ἡ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ διάταξις ἀλληλοαναιροῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἐπιστήμης ἡ ὁποία ἀρκείται εἰς τὴν ἁπλὴν αἴσθησιν τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης μεταβολῆς ἄνευ διατηρήσεως ὑποκειμένης στοιχειακῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS1","text":"Γεωμετρικὴ σύστασις → κίνησις, μέγεθος, ὀξύτης, ἐλαφρότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS2","text":"Ἰδιότητες σωμάτων → στοιχειακὴ ἱεράρχησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS3","text":"Ἱεράρχησις στοιχείων + θεία ἀναλογία → κοσμικὴ συναρμογή ὑπὸ πειθομένην ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS4","text":"Διάλυσις μερῶν → μεταφορά, τμηματισμός, μάχη καὶ νίκη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS5","text":"Ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία μερῶν → νέα στοιχειακὴ σύστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS6","text":"Νέα σύστασις → διατήρησις ἢ μεταβολὴ στοιχειακῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS7","text":"Ἀόρατα μέρη → συνάθροισις → ὁρατὸς ὄγκος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AF1","text":"Ἀπόδοσις φυσικῶν ἰδιοτήτων → γεωμετρικὴ θεμελίωσις → στοιχειακὴ ἱεράρχησις → θεία ἀναλογική συναρμογή → διάλυσις καὶ τμηματισμός → ἀριθμητικὴ ἀνασύστασις → μεταβολὴ στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME1","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἁπλὰ ὑλικὰ γένη εἰς γεωμετρικὰ καὶ δυναμικὰ συστήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ μικροσκοπικοῦ καὶ μακροσκοπικοῦ μεταβάλλει τὸ κριτήριον τῆς σωματικῆς ὑπάρξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME3","text":"Ἡ μεταστοιχείωσις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀνασύνθεσις ἀναλογιῶν καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἄτακτος ποιοτικὴ μεταβολή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἀντίπαλον τῆς τάξεως εἰς ὑλικὸν ὄρον τῆς θείας διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME5","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ μεταβολὴ ἀναγινώσκεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀοράτων κινήσεων καὶ λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφανειακὴ βαθμίς περιλαμβάνει τὰς παρατηρουμένας διαφορὰς κινήσεως, μεγέθους, ὀξύτητος καὶ βάρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT2","text":"Ἡ δομικὴ βαθμίς ἀναγάγει τὰς διαφορὰς εἰς γεωμετρικὰ σχήματα, πλήθη μερῶν καὶ σχέσεις κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT3","text":"Ἡ μεταστρατηγικὴ βαθμίς ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἁπλὴν περιγραφὴν μεταβολῆς διὰ μηχανισμοῦ ἀναλογικῆς συναρμογῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT4","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ βαθμίς νοεῖ τὰ ὄντα ὡς γιγνόμενα ἐκ ἀοράτων μερῶν, διαλυτῶν μορφῶν καὶ διατηρουμένων λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT5","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ βαθμίς ἀναπαριστᾷ τὴν φύσιν ὡς κύκλον διαλύσεως, κινήσεως, ἥττης καὶ ἐπανασυστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκῶσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν μορφὴν εἰς τὴν στοιχειακὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT2","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν σύνδεσιν μορφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐπακριβὴς γεωμετρικὴ ἀντιστοιχία τῶν πάντων στοιχείων μένει ἐν μέρει ὑποκαθορισμένη ἐν τῷ παρόντι χωρίῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέση θείας διατάξεως καὶ φυσικῆς ἀνάγκης δηλοῦται ὡς πειθώ, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἐξηγεῖται ὡς πλήρης μηχανισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν στοιχείων διατηρεῖται καὶ μεταβάλλεται συγχρόνως, ἀνάλογα πρὸς τὸ ἐὰν θεωρῆται ὡς μορφὴ ἢ ὡς σύστασις μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν βασικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ στηρίζεται εἰς ἀποσιωπηθεῖσας γεωμετρικὰς προϋποθέσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230848419195Z_5db8d6cd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 56","source_sha256":"3ec75b0da98358f5d4f1b3f2357c26a6435982648828fbf422af2e34c87edc0a","sha256":"3736e95a29525221e2ada93b139b77e8216515a91e2af41296514eadfb8e7720","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:08:48.420120+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS1","text":"The problem is the rational attribution of natural properties to the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2","text":"The solution reduces motion, magnitude, sharpness, and lightness to the geometrical constitution of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS3","text":"The geometrical order is transferred into a hierarchical correspondence of fire, air, water, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","text":"The divine ordering joins quantities, motions, and powers through proportions, under necessity voluntarily persuaded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS5","text":"Elemental change is accomplished through dissolution, fragmentation, transfer, and the reconstitution of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AS6","text":"The form of each element is preserved or changed only when the numerical proportion of the parts permits the new constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A1","text":"Earth is assigned to the least mobile kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A2","text":"Fire is assigned to the most mobile, lightest, and sharpest kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","text":"Air occupies the middle rank in respect of motion, magnitude, and sharpness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A4","text":"Water occupies the greatest magnitude and the second rank in respect of sharpness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A5","text":"Mobility increases as the bases and constituent parts diminish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A6","text":"Sharpness and cutting power follow the smallest and finest constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","text":"The solid form of the pyramid constitutes the element and seed of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","text":"The second kind in generation constitutes the element of air, and the third the element of water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A9","text":"Elemental parts are individually invisible owing to smallness, but become visible through the aggregation of many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A10","text":"God fitted together quantities, motions, and powers according to exact proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A11","text":"Necessity does not oppose the divine ordering absolutely, but is persuaded and yields.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:A12","text":"The change of elements depends on the dissolution and recomposition of numerical parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX1","text":"The element is not defined by the perceptible appearance of each isolated part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX2","text":"Elemental difference is not attributed to a disordered or uncaused quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX3","text":"Fire does not possess the magnitude and slowness of motion of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX4","text":"Change is not simple annihilation or creation from nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX5","text":"Earth, once dissolved, does not pass into just any other kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX6","text":"The natural order is not constituted from unconnected quantities and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:NX7","text":"Necessity is not conceived as an insurmountable power without persuasion and ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D1","text":"The minimality of the bases renders fire the most mobile, cutting, and light.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A2","CH_JP8E_S_36:A5","CH_JP8E_S_36:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D2","text":"The middle geometrical rank produces the middle natural rank of air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D3","text":"The aggregation of invisible parts produces visible bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D4","text":"The dissolution of earth by fire or another mass transfers the parts, but their reconstitution restores earth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A1","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D5","text":"The dissolution of water can produce one body of fire and two bodies of air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D6","text":"The dissolution of air can produce two bodies of fire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D7","text":"Two bodies of fire constitute one kind of air when fire is crushed and defeated in motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A3","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:D8","text":"Two and a half bodies of air constitute one whole body of water.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A4","CH_JP8E_S_36:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","text":"The natural identity of the elements is defined as a stable rule of recomposition, not as immobile matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2","text":"The change of elements is a change of numerical and geometrical relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3","text":"The perceptible unity of bodies constitutes a macro-scale phenomenon produced from a micro-scale of invisible figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD4","text":"The cosmic order arises from the coordination of divine proportion and material necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SD5","text":"Elemental physiology is described as a succession of victory, crushing, dissolution, and reconstitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX1","text":"Matter does not operate as a formless and numerically undifferentiated bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX2","text":"Form does not exist without a dynamic property, magnitude, and mode of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX3","text":"Coming-to-be and destruction do not constitute discontinuous events without a preserved proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4","text":"The divine order is not imposed externally in opposition to nature, but is realized through the persuasion of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX5","text":"The reduction of phenomena to geometry does not leave change unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX1","text":"The possibility of elements absolutely unrelated to number, form, and ratio is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX2","text":"The possibility of a world in which necessity and order mutually negate one another is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX3","text":"The possibility of a science that is content with the simple perception of bodies is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX4","text":"The possibility of change without the preservation of an underlying elemental order is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS1","text":"Geometrical constitution → motion, magnitude, sharpness, lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS2","text":"Properties of bodies → elemental hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS3","text":"Hierarchy of elements + divine proportion → cosmic fitting-together under persuaded necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS4","text":"Dissolution of parts → transfer, fragmentation, battle, and victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS5","text":"Numerical proportion of parts → new elemental constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS6","text":"New constitution → preservation or change of elemental form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS7","text":"Invisible parts → aggregation → visible mass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:AF1","text":"Attribution of natural properties → geometrical foundation → elemental hierarchy → divine proportional fitting-together → dissolution and fragmentation → numerical reconstitution → change of elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME1","text":"The elements are reclassified from simple material genera into geometrical and dynamic systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME2","text":"The distinction between the microscopic and the macroscopic changes the criterion of bodily existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME3","text":"Transmutation is recognized as a recomposition of proportions and not as a disordered qualitative change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4","text":"Necessity is transformed from an opponent of order into a material condition of divine ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ME5","text":"Perceptible change is read as the result of invisible motions and ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT1","text":"The surface level includes the observed differences of motion, magnitude, sharpness, and weight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT2","text":"The structural level reduces the differences to geometrical figures, quantities of parts, and relations of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT3","text":"The meta-strategic level replaces the simple description of change with a mechanism of proportional fitting-together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT4","text":"The ontological level conceives beings as coming to be from invisible parts, dissoluble forms, and preserved ratios.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT5","text":"The temporal level represents nature as a cycle of dissolution, motion, defeat, and reconstitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for a reconstruction of the progression from geometrical form to elemental change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT2","text":"The structure is internally coherent with respect to the connection of form, motion, and proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT3","text":"The precise geometrical correspondence of all the elements remains partly underdetermined in the present passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT4","text":"The relation of divine order and natural necessity is indicated as persuasion, but is not explained as a complete mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT5","text":"The identity of the elements is preserved and changed at once, according as it is considered as form or as a constitution of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the fundamental movement of the account, but rests on unspoken geometrical presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_36@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_36:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 56"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 40","title":"Section 56","context":"Chapter 40","original_title":"Section 56","original_context":"Chapter 40"},"original_title":"Section 56","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37","layer":"CH","title":"Section 57","order":41,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_37"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_37@R001","sha256":"ab6617bc6f3fa82cbf317d21de35d15fbfe3826425da7b096b4e53f354e2a201","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS1","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ φθορὰ τῶν σωμάτων ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς συγκρούσεως, διαλύσεως καὶ συνθέσεως τῶν συγγενῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS2","text":"Τὸ ὅμοιον πρὸς τὸ ὅμοιον οὔτε πάσχειν οὔτε μεταβάλλειν δύναται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS3","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ ἄρχεται ὅταν τὸ ἀσθενέστερον γένος ἰσχυροτέρῳ ἀνομοίῳ ἀντιμάχηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἥττα ἢ ἡ διαφυγὴ ἀνακατανέμει τὰ σώματα κατὰ τὸ συγγενές, ἡ δὲ νίκη μετασχηματίζει τὸ ἡττημένον εἰς τὸ κρατοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS5","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ δεχομένου διαχωρίζει τὰ γένη κατὰ χώρας καὶ φέρει τὰ ἀνομοιούμενα πρὸς τὰ ὁμοιούμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS6","text":"Ἡ ποικιλία τῶν στοιχείων προκύπτει ἐκ τῆς διαφορᾶς μεγέθους καὶ πλήθους τῶν τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS7","text":"Ἡ περὶ φύσεως εἰκὼς λογισμὸς προϋποθέτει θεωρίαν κινήσεως, στάσεως, συγγενείας καὶ ἀνομοιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS8","text":"Ἐν ὁμαλότητι κίνησις οὐκ ἐνδέχεται, ἐπειδὴ ἄνευ κινοῦντος καὶ κινουμένου οὐκ ἔστι κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","text":"Τὸ ὅμοιον καὶ ταὐτὸν ἑαυτῷ οὔτε μεταβάλλει οὔτε πάσχει ὑπὸ τοῦ ὁμοίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A2","text":"Τὸ ἀνόμοιον δύναται ἀντιμάχεσθαι τῷ ἀνομοίῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","text":"Τὸ ἧττον ὂν διαλύεται ὅταν κρείττονι γένει μάχηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις παύει μόνον διὰ διαφυγῆς πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ἢ διὰ νίκης καὶ ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A5","text":"Τὰ μικρότερα σώματα δύνανται ὑπὸ μειζόνων περιλαμβανόμενα διαθραύεσθαι καὶ κατασβέννυσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A6","text":"Ἡ νίκη τοῦ κρατοῦντος μετατρέπει τὸ ἡττημένον εἰς ὅμοιον τῷ κρατήσαντι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ δεχομένου διασπείρει τὰ γένη κατὰ τόπους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A8","text":"Τὸ ἀνομοιούμενον φέρεται πρὸς τὸν τόπον τοῦ γένους ᾧ ὁμοιοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A9","text":"Τὰ πρῶτα καὶ ἄκρατα σώματα συγκροτεῖται διὰ τῶν ἀνωτέρω παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","text":"Ἕκαστον στοιχεῖον περιέχει γένη τριγώνων διαφόρου μεγέθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A11","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς τῶν τριγωνικῶν γενῶν ἀντιστοιχεῖ τοῖς γένεσιν τῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","text":"Κίνησις ἄνευ κινοῦντος ἢ κινοῦντος ἄνευ κινουμένου ἀδύνατός ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A13","text":"Ἡ τέλεια ὁμαλότης οὔτε κινοῦν οὔτε κινούμενον παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX1","text":"Οὐ τὸ ὅμοιον ὑπὸ τοῦ ὁμοίου μεταβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX2","text":"Οὐ παύεται ἡ διάλυσις ἐνόσον τὸ διαλυόμενον ἄλλο γένος ὂν κρείττονι ἀντιμάχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεί μία μόνη τριγωνικὴ μορφὴ πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX4","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἡ ποικιλία τῶν σωμάτων ἄνευ μειζόνων καὶ ἐλαττόνων μεγεθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX5","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ὁ τόπος ἀκίνητος καὶ ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX6","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν κίνησις ἐν καθαρᾷ ὁμαλότητι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX7","text":"Οὐ δύναται ὁ φυσικὸς λογισμὸς ἀμελεῖν τὸν τρόπον κινήσεως καὶ στάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D1","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ πυρὸς εἰς ἀέρα καὶ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ κατασβέσει τῶν μικροτέρων ὑπὸ τῶν μειζόνων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","CH_JP8E_S_37:A5","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D2","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια λειτουργεῖ ὡς τέλος τῆς διαλύσεως καὶ ὡς κριτήριον τῆς μετακινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D3","text":"Ἡ νίκη οὐχὶ μόνον καταστρέφει τὸ ἡττημένον, ἀλλὰ καὶ τὸ ἀνασυνιστᾷ κατὰ τὴν ἰδέαν τοῦ κρατοῦντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D4","text":"Ἡ ἐναλλαγὴ τῶν χωρῶν ἀποτελεῖ συνέπειαν τῆς διπλῆς κινήσεως τοῦ δεχομένου καὶ τῆς ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀπειρία τῆς φυσικῆς ποικιλίας γεννᾶται ἐκ τῶν ἀπείρων μίξεων τῶν μεγεθῶν, γενῶν καὶ πλήθων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","CH_JP8E_S_37:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D6","text":"Ἡ στάσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἕξιν ἢ σύστασιν ἥτις ἀποκλείει τὴν ἀντίθετον κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1","text":"Ἡ φύσις συγκροτεῖται ὡς δυναμικὸς κύκλος διαλύσεως, ἀφομοιώσεως, διαφυγῆς καὶ νέας συγκροτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἔχει ἀπόλυτον μονιμότητα, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖται μόνον διὰ σχέσεων συγγενείας καὶ ἀντιμαχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","CH_JP8E_S_37:A2","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3","text":"Ὁ τόπος γίνεται δυναμικὸς μηχανισμὸς κατανομῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κίνησις τοῦ δεχομένου ἀναδιατάσσει τὰ γένη κατὰ τὴν ἀφομοίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη τῆς φύσεως μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν περιγραφὴν σωμάτων εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην συσχετισμοῦ μορφῆς, μεγέθους, πλήθους, κινήσεως καὶ στάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A9","CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","CH_JP8E_S_37:A11","CH_JP8E_S_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD5","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀποκαλύπτεται ὡς ὅρος ἀκινησίας καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀρχὴ αὐτόματης κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται διὰ ἀμοιβαίας ἐνεργείας ὁμοίων ὄντων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX2","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκαθόριστον χάος, ἀλλὰ δομημένην διαφοράν καὶ ἀνισότητα δύναμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX3","text":"Ἡ διατήρησις ἑνὸς γένους οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀπομονώσεως ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τῆς ἀνακατατάξεως τῶν συγγενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX4","text":"Ὁ τόπος οὐκ ὑπάρχει ὡς κενὴ ὑποδοχή ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῶν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιομορφία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ὑποκείμενον ἐνεργείας, ἐπειδὴ στερεῖται διακρίσεως κινοῦντος καὶ κινουμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται εἰς μίαν ἀρχικὴν γεωμετρικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τῆς φύσεως ἡ ἀμετάβλητος ταυτότης ἥτις δύναται αὐτὴ καθʼ αὑτὴν νὰ ἐνεργῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ κίνησις γεννᾶται ἐκ καθαρᾶς ὁμοιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπολύτως σταθερὰ χωρικὴ τάξις, ἐπειδὴ ὁ σεισμὸς τοῦ δεχομένου μεταφέρει τὰ γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ φύσις ὡς πεπερασμένον καὶ ἁπλοῦν σύστημα ἀδιαφοροποίητων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX5","text":"Ἡ θεωρία οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀποχωρίσῃ τὴν ἀναγκαίαν τάξιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπειρίαν τῶν μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1","text":"Διαφορά τριγωνικῶν μεγεθῶν καὶ γενῶν → Ἀσύμμετρος δύναμις → Ἀντιμαχία στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2","text":"Ἀντιμαχία → Διάλυσις τοῦ ἧττονoς → Ἀφομοίωσις ἢ διαφυγὴ πρὸς τὸ συγγενές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS3","text":"Ἀφομοίωσις → Νέα σύστασις σώματος → Μεταβολὴ στοιχείου καὶ γένεσις ἑτέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS4","text":"Κίνησις τοῦ δεχομένου → Χωρικὴ διασπορά → Προσέλευσις τῶν ἀνομοιουμένων πρὸς τοὺς συγγενεῖς τόπους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS5","text":"Ποικιλία μεγεθῶν καὶ πλήθους → Ἄπειροι μίξεις → Πολλαπλὰ φυσικὰ εἴδη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS6","text":"Ὁμαλότης → Ἔλλειψις κινοῦντος καὶ κινουμένου → Ἀδυναμία κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS7","text":"Ἀνάγκη κινήσεως καὶ στάσεως → Ὑπόδειγμα εἰκότος λόγου περὶ φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF1","text":"Ἀπορία περὶ γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς → Διάκρισις ὁμοίου καὶ ἀνομοίου → Ἱεράρχησις δυνάμεως → Διάλυσις ἢ ἀφομοίωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF2","text":"Ἀφομοίωσις → Μεταβολὴ στοιχείων → Ἐναλλαγὴ χωρῶν → Ἀπειρία φυσικῆς ποικιλίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF3","text":"Ἀπειρία ποικιλίας → Ἀνάγκη θεωρίας κινήσεως καὶ στάσεως → Ἀπόδειξις ὅτι ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀποκλείει κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME1","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς σχέσις δυνάμεων καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀλλαγὴ ὀνομάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2","text":"Ὁ τόπος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ παθητικὸν περιέχον εἰς ἐνεργὸν παράγοντα χωρικῆς διανομῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀνομοιότης καθίσταται ὅρος παραγωγῆς κινήσεως καὶ μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ μικροδομὴ καθίσταται ἀρχὴ τῆς μακροκοσμικῆς ποικιλίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν τάξιν ὡς παραγωγικὴ δύναμις καὶ συνδέεται μὲ τὴν ἀκινησίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ ἀλλαγὴ στοιχείων ἐξηγεῖται διὰ θραύσεως, κατασβέσεως καὶ ἐπανασυστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ φύσις ὀργανώνεται διὰ συγγενείας, ἀντιμαχίας, ἱεραρχίας δυνάμεως καὶ χωρικῆς κατανομῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ὁ περὶ φύσεως λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ συνδέῃ τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν στάσιν, τὴν μορφήν, τὸ μέγεθος καὶ τὸ πλῆθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ γίγνεσθαι προϋποθέτει διαφοράν, σχέσιν καὶ ἀσύμμετρον δύναμιν, ἐνῷ ἡ ἀπόλυτος ὁμοιότης συνεπάγεται ἀκινησίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT5","text":"Χρονικῶς, ἡ ταυτότης τῶν σωμάτων διατηρεῖται μόνον ὡς προσωρινὸν ἀποτέλεσμα συνεχῶν διαλύσεων καὶ συνθέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνομοιότητα εἰς τὴν ἀντιμαχίαν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις τῆς χωρικῆς μετακινήσεως ἀπαιτεῖ ἅμα τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ δεχομένου καὶ τὴν ἀφομοιωτικὴν συγγένειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT3","text":"Ἡ σύνδεσις τῶν τριγώνων πρὸς τὰ εἴδη παραμένει σχηματικὴ καὶ οὐχὶ πλήρως ἀναλυμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἀκραίτου σώματος καὶ μικτῶν εἰδῶν ἐρείδεται εἰς ὑπόθεσιν ἥτις δὲν ἀναπτύσσεται ἐνταῦθα πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ ἐφόσον ἡ ὁμοιότης ἀκινητοποιεῖ καὶ ἡ ἀνομοιότης κινεί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας γεωμετρικῆς τάξεως καὶ τῆς ἀπείρου ποικιλίας τῶν μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν λογικὴν ἀκολουθίαν, ἀλλὰ συμπιέζει τὴν ἀκριβῆ φυσικὴν λειτουργίαν τῶν τριγωνικῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230908989352Z_45ee8cc1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 57","source_sha256":"ab6617bc6f3fa82cbf317d21de35d15fbfe3826425da7b096b4e53f354e2a201","sha256":"3286ac71e502c8973a70dd930f47f21191dfaf2ceda20e416bb0f3e9a26dbedb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:09:08.990708+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS1","text":"The generation and destruction of bodies are explained through the conflict, dissolution, and composition of cognate kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS2","text":"Like cannot either be affected or change in relation to like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS3","text":"Change begins when the weaker kind contends against a stronger unlike kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS4","text":"Defeat or escape redistributes bodies according to kinship, whereas victory transforms the defeated into the prevailing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS5","text":"The motion of the receptacle separates the kinds according to places and carries those becoming alike toward those becoming alike.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS6","text":"The diversity of the elements arises from the difference in the size and number of the triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS7","text":"The likely account concerning nature presupposes a theory of motion, rest, kinship, and unlikeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AS8","text":"In uniformity motion is impossible, since without a mover and a thing moved there is no motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","text":"What is like and identical to itself neither changes nor is affected by what is like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A2","text":"What is unlike can contend against what is unlike.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","text":"What is weaker is dissolved when it contends with a stronger kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","text":"Dissolution ceases only through escape toward what is cognate or through victory and assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A5","text":"Smaller bodies, when enclosed by larger ones, can be shattered and extinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A6","text":"The victory of the prevailing transforms the defeated into something like that which prevailed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","text":"The motion of the receptacle disperses the kinds according to places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A8","text":"That which is becoming unlike is carried toward the place of the kind to which it is becoming like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A9","text":"The primary and unmixed bodies are constituted through the foregoing affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","text":"Each element contains kinds of triangles of differing size.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A11","text":"The number of triangular kinds corresponds to the kinds of forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","text":"Motion without a mover, or a mover without a thing moved, is impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:A13","text":"Perfect uniformity provides neither a mover nor a thing moved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX1","text":"Like is not changed by like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX2","text":"Dissolution does not cease so long as what is being dissolved, being another kind, contends against a stronger kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX3","text":"One triangular form alone is not sufficient for the generation of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX4","text":"The diversity of bodies does not exist without greater and lesser magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX5","text":"Place is not motionless and indifferent toward bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX6","text":"There is no motion in pure uniformity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:NX7","text":"Natural reasoning cannot neglect the manner of motion and rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D1","text":"The change of fire into air and of air into water follows upon the extinction of the smaller by the larger.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","CH_JP8E_S_37:A5","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D2","text":"Kinship functions as the end of dissolution and as the criterion of displacement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D3","text":"Victory not only destroys the defeated, but also reconstitutes it according to the form of the prevailing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D4","text":"The alternation of places is a consequence of the double motion of the receptacle and of assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D5","text":"The infinity of natural diversity is generated from the infinite mixtures of sizes, kinds, and numbers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","CH_JP8E_S_37:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:D6","text":"Rest requires a condition or constitution that excludes contrary motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1","text":"Nature is constituted as a dynamic cycle of dissolution, assimilation, escape, and new constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","CH_JP8E_S_37:A3","CH_JP8E_S_37:A4","CH_JP8E_S_37:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2","text":"The identity of bodies does not possess absolute permanence, but is preserved only through relations of kinship and conflict.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A1","CH_JP8E_S_37:A2","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3","text":"Place becomes a dynamic mechanism of distribution, since the motion of the receptacle rearranges the kinds according to assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4","text":"The science of nature passes from the simple description of bodies to the necessity of correlating form, size, number, motion, and rest.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A9","CH_JP8E_S_37:A10","CH_JP8E_S_37:A11","CH_JP8E_S_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SD5","text":"Uniformity is revealed as a condition of immobility and not as a principle of spontaneous motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX1","text":"Nature is not explained through the reciprocal action of like beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX2","text":"Change does not require indeterminate chaos, but structured difference and inequality of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX3","text":"The preservation of one kind does not depend on isolation, but on the rearrangement of cognate kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX4","text":"Place does not exist as an empty receptacle independent of motion and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX5","text":"Uniformity does not constitute a subject of action, because it lacks the distinction between mover and thing moved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX6","text":"Natural causality is not exhausted in one original geometric form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX1","text":"Unchangeable identity that can act of itself is absent from nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX2","text":"A world in which motion is generated from pure likeness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX3","text":"An absolutely stable spatial order is excluded, since the shaking of the receptacle carries the kinds elsewhere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX4","text":"Nature as a finite and simple system of undifferentiated elements is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:SNX5","text":"Theory cannot separate necessary order from the infinity of mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1","text":"Difference of triangular sizes and kinds → Asymmetric power → Conflict of elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2","text":"Conflict → Dissolution of the weaker → Assimilation or escape toward what is cognate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS3","text":"Assimilation → New constitution of a body → Change of element and generation of another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS4","text":"Motion of the receptacle → Spatial dispersion → Movement of those becoming unlike toward cognate places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS5","text":"Variety of sizes and number → Infinite mixtures → Multiple natural forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS6","text":"Uniformity → Absence of mover and thing moved → Impossibility of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS7","text":"Necessity of motion and rest → Model of a likely account concerning nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF1","text":"Problem concerning generation and destruction → Distinction of like and unlike → Hierarchy of power → Dissolution or assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF2","text":"Assimilation → Change of elements → Alternation of places → Infinity of natural diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:AF3","text":"Infinity of diversity → Necessity of a theory of motion and rest → Demonstration that uniformity excludes motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME1","text":"Change is remapped as a relation of powers and not as a simple change of names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2","text":"Place is reclassified from a passive container into an active factor of spatial distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME3","text":"Unlikeness becomes a condition for the production of motion and change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4","text":"Geometric microstructure becomes the principle of macrocosmic diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ME5","text":"Uniformity is separated from order as a productive power and connected with immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the change of elements is explained through breaking, extinction, and reconstitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2","text":"Structurally, nature is organized through kinship, conflict, hierarchy of power, and spatial distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the account concerning nature must connect motion, rest, form, size, and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, becoming presupposes difference, relation, and asymmetric power, whereas absolute likeness entails immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT5","text":"Temporally, the identity of bodies is preserved only as a temporary result of continuous dissolutions and compositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from unlikeness to conflict and thence to change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT2","text":"The explanation of spatial displacement requires both the motion of the receptacle and assimilative kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT3","text":"The connection of the triangles to the forms remains schematic and not fully analyzed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT4","text":"The distinction between an unmixed body and mixed forms rests on a hypothesis that is not fully developed here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT5","text":"The mechanism is internally coherent insofar as likeness immobilizes and unlikeness moves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT6","text":"The principal tension remains between necessary geometric order and the infinite diversity of mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_37:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the logical sequence, but compresses the precise natural operation of the triangular kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_37@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_37:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 57"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 41","title":"Section 57","context":"Chapter 41","original_title":"Section 57","original_context":"Chapter 41"},"original_title":"Section 57","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38","layer":"CH","title":"Section 58","order":42,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_38"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_38@R001","sha256":"0460d7efab701cf58a0114ad101723925eb01f22f704c241b6cc9cd70e43a9c2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS1","text":"Ἡ στάσις ἐν ὁμαλότητι καὶ ἡ κίνησις εἰς ἀνωμαλότητα τάσσονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀνωμαλότης ἀνάγεται εἰς ἀνισότητα, ἧς ἡ γένεσις ἤδη δεδηλωμένη ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS3","text":"Τὸ ὑπόλοιπον πρόβλημα ἐστὶ πῶς, καὶ μετὰ τὸν κατὰ γένη διαχωρισμόν, ἡ διʼ ἀλλήλων κίνησις καὶ φορά διαμένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS4","text":"Ἡ κυκλοτερὴς περίοδος τοῦ παντὸς συνιέναι πρὸς ἑαυτὴν βουλομένη πάντα συνέχει καὶ κενὴν χώραν οὐκ ἐᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS5","text":"Ἡ σύμπιεσις, τὰ μεγέθη καὶ αἱ μεταξύ τους κεναὶ διαφορὰι παράγουσι συνεχή μεταφοράν καὶ ἀναπαράγουσι τὴν ἀνωμαλίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS6","text":"Ἐκ τῆς αὐτῆς ἀρχῆς ἐξηγεῖται ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν γενῶν πυρός, ἀέρος καὶ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS7","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀκινητοποιεῖ καὶ πήγνυσιν, ἡ δὲ διάλυσις τῆς ὁμαλότητος ἐπαναφέρει κίνησιν καὶ ῥοήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀποτελεῖ τὸν ὅρον τῆς στάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀνωμαλότης ἀποτελεῖ τὴν αἰτίαν τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀνωμαλότης ἑδράζεται ἐν ἀνισότητι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","text":"Ἡ περίοδος τοῦ παντὸς εἶναι κυκλοτερὴς καὶ πρὸς ἑαυτὴν συνιέναι πεφυκυῖα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A5","text":"Ἡ συμπεριληπτικὴ κίνησις τοῦ παντὸς συνέχει πάντα καὶ καταργεῖ τὴν κενὴν χώραν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα διαφέρουσι κατὰ λεπτότητα, μέγεθος, πυκνότητα καὶ κενότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","text":"Τὰ ἐκ μεγάλων μερῶν συγκείμενα ἀφίνουσι πλείονα κενότητα, τὰ δὲ ἐκ μικρῶν ἐλάττονα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","text":"Ἡ σύνοδος τῆς πιλήσεως ὠθεῖ τὰ μικρὰ εἰς τὰ διάκενα τῶν μεγάλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A9","text":"Μεταβολὴ μεγέθους συνεπάγεται μεταβολὴν στάσεως καὶ τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A10","text":"Ἡ ἀνισότης τῶν τριγώνων γεννᾷ τὰ πολλὰ εἴδη τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A11","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ διαιρεῖται εἰς ὑγρὸν καὶ χυτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A12","text":"Ἡ εἴσοδος τοῦ πυρὸς διαλύει τὴν ὁμαλότητα τοῦ πεπηγότος καὶ ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὴν κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX1","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς ἀμιγῆ ὁμαλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX2","text":"Ἡ στάσις οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται διὰ καθαρῆς ἀνωμαλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ὁ κατὰ γένη διαχωρισμὸς πρὸς ἐξήγησιν τῆς διαρκούς φορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX4","text":"Οὐδεμία κενὴ χώρα ἀνέχεται ἐν τῇ συστάσει τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX5","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἓν μόνον ἀμετάβλητον εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX6","text":"Τὸ πεπηγὸς οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀμετακίνητον φύσιν, ἐὰν ἡ ὁμαλότης αὐτοῦ διαλυθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX7","text":"Ἡ ῥοὴ οὐκ εἶναι ἄσχετος κίνησις, ἀλλὰ ὀνομασία συγκεκριμένης μεταβολῆς πρὸς γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ καθιστᾷ τὴν κίνησιν ἀναγκαστικῶς κυκλοφοροῦσαν καὶ ἀλληλοεξαρτωμένην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D2","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ λεπτότητος τάσσει τὴν διείσδυσιν τῶν στοιχείων, ὥστε τὸ πῦρ διεληλυθέναι μάλιστα καὶ τὸν ἀέρα δεύτερον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A5","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D3","text":"Ἡ συνύπαρξις μικρῶν καὶ μεγάλων μερῶν παράγει ἀμοιβαίαν μεταφοράν πρὸς τοὺς οἰκείους τόπους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D4","text":"Ἡ διασωζομένη γένεσις τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος καθίστησι τὴν κίνησιν ἀεί τε παροῦσαν καὶ ἐσομένην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","CH_JP8E_S_38:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D5","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν μορφῶν πυρός καὶ ἀέρος ἐξηγεῖται ὡς συνέπεια τῆς διαφορᾶς τῶν τριγώνων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D6","text":"Τὸ ὑγρὸν γένος τοῦ ὕδατος κινεῖται διὰ τὴν συμμετοχὴν μικρῶν καὶ ἀνίσων γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10","CH_JP8E_S_38:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D7","text":"Τὸ χυτόν, ἐκ μεγάλων καὶ ὁμαλῶν συγκείμενον, γίνεται βαρὺ καὶ στασιμώτερον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D8","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις τῆς ὁμαλότητος τοῦ χυτοῦ μεταβάλλει τὴν πήξιν εἰς εὐκινησίαν, τήξιν καὶ ῥοήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δὲν στηρίζεται ἐπὶ ἀκινησίας, ἀλλʼ ἐπὶ ἀδιαλείπτου ἀναπαραγωγῆς διαφορῶν ἐντός τινος καθολικοῦ περιορισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς ἀτελοῦς συμπτώσεως μεγεθῶν, σχημάτων καὶ τόπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD3","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ μορφῆς καὶ ἡ μεταβολὴ τόπου ἀποτελοῦσιν ἕνα ἐνιαῖον φυσικὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης εἶναι σχετικὴ καὶ ἀναστρέψιμος κατάστασις, ἐπειδὴ δύναται διὰ τοῦ πυρὸς νὰ λυθῇ καὶ νὰ μετατραπῇ εἰς κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD5","text":"Ἡ ποιοτικὴ διαφορὰ τῶν σωμάτων παράγεται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὴν ἀνισότητα, οὐχὶ ἀπὸ ἀσύνδετον πολλαπλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX1","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶ τὸ παντελῶς κενόν, ἐὰν ἡ καθολικὴ περίοδος πάντοτε συνέχῃ τὰ ὄντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX2","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ ἀκίνητος ἑτερότης ὡς τελικὴ ἐξήγησις τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ κίνησις νὰ ἀποχωρισθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν σχέσιν μεγάλου καὶ μικροῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX4","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ γένεσις τῶν εἰδῶν νὰ νοηθῇ χωρὶς διαφοροποίησιν τριγώνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX5","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ ὁμαλότης νὰ παραμείνῃ ἀμετάβλητος ὅταν εἰσέρχηται δύναμις διαλυτική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX6","text":"Ἀδύνατον ἐστὶν ἡ φυσικὴ ὀνομασία νὰ διαχωρισθῇ ἀπὸ τὸ πάθος καὶ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ πράγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὃς ἔχει καθαρὰς καὶ ἀμετάβλητους ὁμοιογενείας ἄνευ ἐσωτερικῶν διακένων καὶ ἀνισοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις τῶν γενῶν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ συμπίεσις αὐτὰ πάλιν ἀναγκάζει εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν διείσδυσιν καὶ φοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀρχὴ ἐξωτερικὴ πρὸς τὴν κίνησιν· ἡ κίνησις παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς συστάσεως τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ σταθερότης ὡς τελικὸς σκοπός, διότι ἡ διατήρησις τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως προϋποθέτει διαρκῆ μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS1","text":"Ὁμαλότης → στάσις· ἀνισότης → ἀνωμαλότης → κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS2","text":"Κυκλοτερὴς περίοδος → συμπίεσις πάντων → ἀπουσία κενοῦ → ἀμοιβαία ὤθησις καὶ φορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3","text":"Μεγάλα μέρη καὶ μικρὰ μέρη → ἄνισα διάκενα → εἴσοδος μικρῶν εἰς μεγάλα → μεταβολὴ μεγέθους καὶ τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS4","text":"Ἀνισότης τριγώνων → πολλὰ γένη στοιχείων → διαφορετικὴ κινητικότης καὶ πυκνότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS5","text":"Ὁμοιογενὲς πεπηγός → στασιμότης· εἴσοδος πυρός → διάλυσις ὁμαλότητος → εὐκινησία → τήξις καὶ ῥοή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF1","text":"Ἀπορία περὶ τῆς διαρκούς κινήσεως → ἀναγωγὴ τῆς κινήσεως εἰς ἀνωμαλότητα → ἀναγωγὴ τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος εἰς ἀνισότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF2","text":"Ἀνισότης μερῶν καὶ διακένων → συμπίεσις καὶ ἀμοιβαία μεταφορά → διατήρησις τῆς ἀνωμαλότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF3","text":"Διαφορὰ τριγώνων → πολλαπλὰ εἴδη πυρός, ἀέρος καὶ ὕδατος → διαφορετικαὶ καταστάσεις κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF4","text":"Διάλυσις ὁμαλότητος τοῦ πεπηγότος → μετάβασις ἀπὸ στάσιν εἰς κίνησιν → ὀνομασία τῶν παθῶν ὡς τήξεως καὶ ῥοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀνεξήγητον συμβεβηκός εἰς ἀναγκαῖον ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς ἀνισότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν στοιχείων μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἀπόλυτον διαχωρισμὸν εἰς διαβάθμισιν λεπτότητος, μεγέθους καὶ πυκνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις κενοῦ ἀναδεικνύει τὴν ὕλην ὡς δίκτυον ἀμοιβαίων πιέσεων καὶ μεταφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4","text":"Ἡ στάσις καὶ ἡ κίνησις παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀπόλυτοι ἀντιθέσεις καὶ γίνονται μεταβαταὶ καταστάσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME5","text":"Τὰ φυσικὰ ὀνόματα ἀνασυνδέονται μὲ συγκεκριμένα πάθη, κατευθύνσεις καὶ μεταβολὰς τῆς συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ἐξηγοῦνται αἱ κινήσεις, αἱ πυκνότητες καὶ αἱ μεταβολαὶ πυρός, ἀέρος καὶ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ κοσμικὴ μηχανὴ συγκροτεῖται ἐκ ὁμαλότητος, ἀνωμαλότητος, μεγεθῶν, διακένων καὶ πιέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῆς διαρκούς κινήσεως λύεται διὰ μετατοπίσεως ἀπὸ τὸν διαχωρισμὸν τῶν γενῶν εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν σχέσιν τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς διαρκῶς μεταβαλλόμενη σύνθεσις, ἐν ᾗ ἡ τάξις διασώζεται διὰ συνεχούς γενέσεως ἀνωμαλίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ κύριου μηχανισμοῦ: ὁμαλότης, ἀνωμαλότης, ἀνισότης, συμπίεσις καὶ κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν, ἐπειδὴ ἀρχίζει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπορίαν περὶ τῆς κινήσεως καὶ καταλήγει εἰς τὰ συγκεκριμένα γένη τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς γενέσεως τῶν τριγώνων καὶ ἡ πλήρης γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάλυσις τῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική ἐφʼ ὅσον ἡ ὁμαλότης νοεῖται ὡς πρόσκαιρος καὶ ἡ ἀνωμαλότης ὡς ἀναπαραγομένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα σύνδεσις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ἀκολουθία ἀνισότης → ἀνωμαλότης → κίνησις → γένεσις μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ συμπύκνωσιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀναγκαιότης τῆς κυκλοφορίας καὶ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὴν διαφορὰν εἰς φυσικὴν ποιότητα δὲν ἀναπτύσσονται πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230928187961Z_19634cdc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 58","source_sha256":"0460d7efab701cf58a0114ad101723925eb01f22f704c241b6cc9cd70e43a9c2","sha256":"d0441103f13d541544775c86cd48b33229746f18cb70d049181ef3f4064a0b7b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:09:28.189384+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS1","text":"Rest is assigned to uniformity, and motion to irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS2","text":"Irregularity is referred back to inequality, whose generation has already been made clear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS3","text":"The remaining problem is how, even after the division according to kinds, reciprocal motion and transport persist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS4","text":"The circular revolution of the whole, tending to converge upon itself, holds all things together and permits no empty space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS5","text":"Compression, magnitudes, and the empty differences between them produce continuous transfer and reproduce irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS6","text":"From the same principle is explained the multiplicity of the kinds of fire, air, and water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AS7","text":"Uniformity immobilizes and congeals, whereas the dissolution of uniformity restores motion and flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","text":"Uniformity constitutes the condition of rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","text":"Irregularity constitutes the cause of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","text":"Irregularity is grounded in inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","text":"The revolution of the whole is circular and naturally disposed to converge upon itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A5","text":"The encompassing motion of the whole holds all things together and abolishes empty space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","text":"The elements differ in fineness, magnitude, density, and voidness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","text":"Things composed of large parts leave more voidness, whereas those composed of small parts leave less.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","text":"The convergence of compression drives the small into the intervals of the large.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A9","text":"A change of magnitude entails a change of position and place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A10","text":"The inequality of the triangles generates the many kinds of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A11","text":"Water is divided into the liquid and the fusible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:A12","text":"The entrance of fire dissolves the uniformity of what has congealed and activates motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX1","text":"Motion is not reducible to unmixed uniformity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX2","text":"Rest is not explained through pure irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX3","text":"Division according to kinds is not sufficient for explaining continuous transport.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX4","text":"No empty space is admitted in the constitution of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX5","text":"The elements do not possess only one immutable form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX6","text":"What has congealed does not constitute an immovable nature, if its uniformity is dissolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:NX7","text":"Flow is not unrelated motion, but the designation of a determinate change toward earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D1","text":"The absence of void makes motion necessarily circulatory and mutually dependent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D2","text":"The difference in fineness orders the penetration of the elements, so that fire has passed through most of all, and air second.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A5","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D3","text":"The coexistence of small and large parts produces reciprocal transfer toward their proper places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D4","text":"The preserved generation of irregularity renders motion both always present and yet to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","CH_JP8E_S_38:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D5","text":"The multiplicity of the forms of fire and air is explained as a consequence of the difference among the triangles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D6","text":"The liquid kind of water moves through the participation of small and unequal kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A3","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10","CH_JP8E_S_38:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D7","text":"The fusible, composed of large and uniform parts, becomes heavy and more stationary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:D8","text":"The dissolution of the uniformity of the fusible transforms congealing into mobility, melting, and flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1","text":"Cosmic order is not founded upon immobility, but upon the uninterrupted reproduction of differences within a certain universal constraint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A4","CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD2","text":"Motion appears as the result of the incomplete coincidence of magnitudes, shapes, and places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A7","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD3","text":"Change of form and change of place constitute a single unified natural mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4","text":"Uniformity is a relative and reversible condition, since through fire it can be dissolved and transformed into motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A1","CH_JP8E_S_38:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SD5","text":"The qualitative difference of bodies is produced from geometrical inequality, not from disconnected multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A6","CH_JP8E_S_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX1","text":"The completely empty is impossible, if the universal revolution always holds beings together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX2","text":"Immobile otherness is impossible as the final explanation of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX3","text":"It is impossible for motion to be separated from the relation of large and small.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX4","text":"It is impossible for the generation of forms to be conceived without differentiation of triangles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX5","text":"It is impossible for uniformity to remain unchanged when a dissolving power enters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX6","text":"It is impossible for natural designation to be separated from the affection and motion of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX1","text":"A world having pure and immutable homogeneities without internal intervals and inequalities is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2","text":"The absolute distinction of kinds is excluded, since compression again compels them into reciprocal penetration and transport.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3","text":"An external principle of motion is absent; motion is produced from the internal constitution of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4","text":"Stability as a final end is excluded, because the preservation of cosmic order presupposes continuous change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS1","text":"Uniformity → rest; inequality → irregularity → motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS2","text":"Circular revolution → compression of all things → absence of void → reciprocal thrust and transport.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3","text":"Large parts and small parts → unequal intervals → entry of small into large → change of magnitude and place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS4","text":"Inequality of triangles → many kinds of elements → differing mobility and density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS5","text":"Homogeneous congealed body → immobility; entry of fire → dissolution of uniformity → mobility → melting and flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF1","text":"Aporia concerning continuous motion → reduction of motion to irregularity → reduction of irregularity to inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF2","text":"Inequality of parts and intervals → compression and reciprocal transfer → preservation of irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF3","text":"Difference of triangles → multiple kinds of fire, air, and water → differing states of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:AF4","text":"Dissolution of the uniformity of what has congealed → transition from rest to motion → designation of the affections as melting and flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1","text":"Motion is reclassified from an unexplained accident into a necessary result of inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2","text":"The distinction of the elements is transformed from absolute separation into gradation of fineness, magnitude, and density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME3","text":"The lack of void reveals matter as a network of reciprocal pressures and transfers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4","text":"Rest and motion cease to be absolute opposites and become transitory states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ME5","text":"Natural names are reconnected with determinate affections, directions, and changes of constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The motions, densities, and changes of fire, air, and water are explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The cosmic mechanism is constituted from uniformity, irregularity, magnitudes, intervals, and pressure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The aporia concerning continuous motion is resolved through a shift from the separation of kinds to the internal relation of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being is conceived as a continuously changing composite, in which order is preserved through the continuous generation of irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal mechanism: uniformity, irregularity, inequality, compression, and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual course, because it begins from the aporia concerning motion and ends with the determinate kinds of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3","text":"The precise manner of the generation of the triangles and the complete geometrical analysis of the forms are underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as uniformity is conceived as temporary and irregularity as reproduced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection of the system is the sequence inequality → irregularity → motion → generation of forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT6","text":"The explanation depends on condensation, because the necessity of circulation and the transition from geometrical difference to natural quality are not fully developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_38@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_38:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 58"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 42","title":"Section 58","context":"Chapter 42","original_title":"Section 58","original_context":"Chapter 42"},"original_title":"Section 58","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39","layer":"CH","title":"Section 59","order":43,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_39"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_39@R001","sha256":"3be5f256780e9f6e3058ba4dd9b3adb3b6fd1189ea352f087f4a0ffb71ed555b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS1","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν στερεῶν καὶ ῥευστῶν σωμάτων ἐκ τῆς κινήσεως, μίξεως, ἀποχωρήσεως καὶ συμπήξεως τῶν στοιχειακῶν δυνάμεων ἐξηγεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS2","text":"Τὸ πῦρ, ὡς ποιητὴς ἀνωμαλίας καὶ κινήσεως, μεταβάλλει τὸν ὑγρὸν ὄγκον καὶ τὴν πύκνωσιν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀποχώρησις τοῦ πυρὸς ἐπιφέρει ψῦξιν, ὁμαλότητα, συμπίεσιν καὶ πήξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS4","text":"Αἱ διαφοραὶ τῶν μετάλλων παράγονται ἐκ πυκνότητος, προσμίξεως γῆς, ἐσωτερικῶν διαστημάτων καὶ ἀποχωρισμοῦ τῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS5","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ γενετικὴ λογικὴ ἐφαρμόζεται καὶ εἰς χάλαζαν, κρύσταλλον, χιόνα καὶ πάχνην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS6","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις παραχωρεῖ ἐνίοτε τὴν ἀκρίβειαν αὐτῆς τῷ εἰκότι μύθῳ καὶ τῇ μετρίᾳ παιδιᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A1","text":"Τὸ πῦρ οὐκ εἰς κενὸν ἐκπίπτει, ἀλλὰ τὸν πλησίον ἀέρα ὠθεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A2","text":"Ὁ κινούμενος ἀὴρ τὸν ὑγρὸν ὄγκον συνωθεῖ πρὸς τὰς τοῦ πυρὸς ἕδρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀνωμαλία τοῦ ὑγροῦ ὄγκου συνδέεται πρὸς τὴν παρουσίαν τοῦ πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀποχώρησις τοῦ πυρὸς ἐπιφέρει ψῦξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","text":"Μετὰ τὴν ἀποχώρησιν τοῦ πυρός, ὁ συνωθούμενος ὄγκος ἀναλαμβάνει ὁμαλότητα καὶ καθίσταται εἰς τὸ αὑτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","text":"Ἡ σύνοδος τοῦ ὄγκου μετὰ τὴν ἀποχώρησιν τοῦ πυρὸς παράγει πήξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης καὶ ἡ ὁμοιογένεια καθορίζουσι τὸ γένος τοῦ σχηματιζομένου σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","text":"Ἡ πρόσμιξις γῆς αὐξάνει τὴν σκληρότητα, ἐὰν μὴ ἀντισταθμίζηται ὑπὸ μεγάλων ἐσωτερικῶν διαστημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A9","text":"Τὰ ἐσωτερικὰ διαλείμματα μειοῦσι τὸ βάρος καὶ τὴν πυκνότητα τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","text":"Ὁ ἀποχωρισμὸς τῶν μικτῶν συστατικῶν κατὰ τὸν χρόνον ἀποκαλύπτει διακεκριμένα γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A11","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ τὸ πυρὶ μεμειγμένον εἶναι λεπτόν, ὑγρόν, κινούμενον καὶ μαλακόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A12","text":"Ἡ ἀποχώρησις τοῦ πυρὸς καὶ ἡ μόνωσις ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀέρος καθιστῶσι τὸ ὕδωρ ὁμαλώτερον καὶ συμπαγές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A13","text":"Ὁ τόπος καὶ ὁ βαθμὸς τῆς πήξεως διαφοροποιοῦσι τὰ παγώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A14","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος δύναται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ τὴν ἐξήγησιν ὅπου ἡ λεπτολογία παύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἐκβολὴ τοῦ πυρὸς οὐ γίνεται εἰς κενόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀνωμαλία τοῦ ὄγκου οὐκ ἔχει αὐτοτελῆ ἀρχήν, ἀλλὰ ἀποδίδεται τῷ πυρί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX3","text":"Ἡ πήξις οὐκ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀρχικὴ καὶ ἀμετάβλητος ἰδιότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX4","text":"Ἡ σκληρότης οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ μονοσήμαντα τῇ πυκνότητι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἐγγὺς χρυσοῦ γένος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἓν ἁπλοῦν καὶ μονοειδὲς σώμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX6","text":"Τὸ βάρος οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται μόνον ἐκ τῆς ὕλης, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐκ τῶν ἐντὸς διαστημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX7","text":"Τὰ γένη τῶν παγωμάτων οὐ διαφοροποιοῦνται μόνον κατὰ τὸ εἶδος τοῦ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX8","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ διήγησις οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ πάντοτε πλήρη λογισμὸν τῶν ἐπιμέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D1","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ πυρὸς παράγει ἀνωμαλίαν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ ἀὴρ ὠθούμενος συνωθεῖ τὸν ὑγρὸν ὄγκον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A1","CH_JP8E_S_39:A2","CH_JP8E_S_39:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀποχώρησις τοῦ πυρὸς μεταβάλλει τὸν ὄγκον ἀπὸ ἀνώμαλον εἰς ὁμαλὸν καὶ ἀπὸ κινούμενον εἰς πεπηγότα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D3","text":"Ὁ χρυσὸς σχηματίζεται ὅταν τὸ ὕδωρ γένηται ἐκ λεπτοτάτων, ὁμαλωτάτων καὶ πυκνοτάτων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D4","text":"Ὁ ἀδάμας ἀποτελεῖ πυκνὸν καὶ μελανθὲν ὄζον χρυσοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D5","text":"Ὁ χαλκὸς ἔχει μικτὴν σύστασιν, ἐπειδὴ συνδυάζει γειτνίασιν πρὸς τὸν χρυσόν, πρόσμιξιν γῆς καὶ ἐσωτερικὰ κενά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","CH_JP8E_S_39:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D6","text":"Ἡ ἰὸς γίνεται φανερὰ ὅταν τὸ γήινον μέρος ἀπὸ τοῦ χαλκοῦ χωρισθῇ διὰ παλαιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D7","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ τὸ πυρὶ μεμειγμένον γίνεται μαλακὸν διὰ τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν ἀσταθῆ βάσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D8","text":"Ἡ ἀποχώρησις τοῦ πυρὸς καὶ ἡ μόνωσις ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀέρος ἐπιτρέπουσι τὴν συμπαγῆ πήξιν τοῦ ὕδατος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D9","text":"Ἡ χάλαζα καὶ ὁ κρύσταλλος ἀποτελοῦνται ἐκ ἰσχυροτέρας πήξεως, ἡ δὲ χιὼν καὶ ἡ πάχνη ἐκ ἡμιπαγοῦς ἢ ἡττονικῆς πήξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D10","text":"Ἡ διαφοροποίησις ἄνωθεν καὶ ἐπὶ γῆς ἐντάσσει τὸν τόπον εἰς τὴν αἰτιολογίαν τῶν παγωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD1","text":"Τὰ φυσικὰ γένη ἀνασυντίθενται ὡς προσωριναὶ καταστάσεις ἰσορροπίας, αἳ παράγονται ἐκ μεταβολῆς δυνάμεων καὶ οὐκ ἐκ ἀμεταβλήτων οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A3","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD2","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης ἑκάστου σώματος συγκροτεῖται ἐκ σχέσεως πυκνότητος, κινήσεως, προσμίξεως, κενοτήτων, χρόνου καὶ τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","CH_JP8E_S_39:A9","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἑνὸς στοιχείου ἐκ τῆς μίξεως δύναται νὰ μετασχηματίσῃ ὁλόκληρον τὸ γένος τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","CH_JP8E_S_39:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις ἔχει διπλὴν κλίμακα, ἀκριβῆ μὲν ἐν ταῖς βασικαῖς σχέσεσιν, εἰκαστικὴν δὲ ἐν ταῖς ἀπείροις λεπτομερείαις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον διαφυλάττει τὴν γενετικὴν δομὴν, ἐνῶ ἀναστέλλει τὴν ἀξίωσιν ἀπολύτου ἀκριβείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX1","text":"Τὰ σώματα οὐ νοοῦνται ὡς ἄσχετοι καὶ αὐτάρκεις μονάδες ἀνεξάρτητοι κινήσεως καὶ μίξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται χωρὶς ἀλληλεπίδρασιν τοῦ πυρός, τοῦ ἀέρος, τῆς γῆς καὶ τοῦ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX3","text":"Ἡ στερεότης οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ πρωτογενῆ ἀρχήν, ἀλλὰ ἀποτέλεσμα ἀποχωρήσεως, ὁμαλύνσεως καὶ συνόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX4","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς μίαν μόνην μετρικὴν παράμετρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5","text":"Ὁ χρόνος οὐκ ἔξωθεν παραμένει τῆς φυσικῆς συστάσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ παλαιώσεως καὶ διαχωρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ γνώσις οὐκ ἔχει ἀνάγκην ἀναγάγειν πᾶσαν λεπτομέρειαν εἰς ἀναμφισβήτητον ἀπόδειξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἰδέα ὕλης ἀκίνητης, ἀμιγοῦς καὶ ἀμεταβλήτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου τὰ γένη τῶν σωμάτων ὑπάρχουσι πρὸ τῶν διαδικασιῶν αἳ αὐτὰ παράγουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἀντιδιαστολὴ φύσεως καὶ χρόνου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παλαίωσις μετασχηματίζει τὴν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἐπιστημονικὴ βεβαιότης ὑποχωρεῖ πρὸ τῆς εἰκαστικῆς ἀνακατασκευῆς τῶν γενέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX5","text":"Ἀποσιωπᾶται ἡ ἐξάντλησις τῶν ἐπιμέρους γενῶν, ἵνα διατηρηθῇ ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς γενετικῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS1","text":"Παρουσία πυρός → κίνησις πυρός → ὠθουμένος ἀήρ → συνώθησις ὑγροῦ ὄγκου → ἀνωμαλία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS2","text":"Ἀποχώρησις πυρός → ψῦξις → ἀνάληψις ὁμαλότητος → σύνοδος → πήξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS3","text":"Πύκνωσις + ὁμοιογένεια → χρυσός· πυκνὸν μελανθὲν ὄζον χρυσοῦ → ἀδάμας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS4","text":"Γειτνίασις πρὸς χρυσόν + πρόσμιξις γῆς + ἐσωτερικὰ διαλείμματα → χαλκός· παλαίωσις + διαχωρισμός → ἰός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS5","text":"Ὕδωρ + πῦρ → λεπτότης, κίνησις, μαλακότης· ἀποχώρησις πυρός + μόνωσις ἀέρος → ὁμαλότης καὶ σύμπηξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS6","text":"Σύμπηξις ἄνω γῆς → χάλαζα ἢ χιών· σύμπηξις ἐπὶ γῆς → κρύσταλλος ἢ πάχνη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS7","text":"Ὑπερβολὴ λεπτολογίας → ἀδυναμία πλήρους διαλογισμοῦ → προσφυγὴ εἰς εἰκὸς μῦθον → φρόνιμος παιδιὰ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF1","text":"Ἐκροὴ πυρός → ὠθουμένος ἀήρ → ἀνωμαλία ὑγροῦ ὄγκου → ἀποχώρησις πυρός → ψῦξις καὶ ὁμαλότης → πήξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF2","text":"Πήξις → διαφοραὶ πυκνότητος καὶ μίξεως → γένεσις μετάλλων → παλαίωσις → διαχωρισμὸς συστατικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF3","text":"Μικτὸν ὕδωρ → ἀπομόνωσις ἀπὸ πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος → βαθμοὶ καὶ τόποι πήξεως → χάλαζα, κρύσταλλος, χιών, πάχνη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF4","text":"Ὅριο λεπτομεροῦς λογισμοῦ → εἰκὼς μῦθος → μετρία καὶ φρόνιμος παιδιὰ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME1","text":"Τὰ μέταλλα μεταγράφονται ἀπὸ ἁπλὰ ὀνόματα πραγμάτων εἰς ἀποτελέσματα πυκνώσεως, προσμίξεως, κενότητος καὶ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME2","text":"Ἡ πήξις μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν μεταβολὴν εἰς ἀκολουθίαν ψύξεως, ὁμαλύνσεως καὶ συνόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME3","text":"Ὁ τόπος ἐντάσσεται ὡς αἰτιώδης παράγων εἰς τὴν διάκρισιν τῶν φυσικῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME4","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ μόνον βάρος, ἐπειδὴ συνδέεται καὶ μὲ ὁμοιογένειαν, σκληρότητα καὶ ἐσωτερικὰ διαστήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς φυσιολογία καὶ ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος συνυπάρχουσιν ὡς δύο βαθμοὶ τοῦ αὐτοῦ γενετικοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT1","text":"Surface: Τὸ χωρίον ὀνομάζει καὶ διακρίνει χρυσόν, ἀδάμαντα, χαλκόν, ἰόν, χάλαζαν, κρύσταλλον, χιόνα καὶ πάχνην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT2","text":"Structural: Τὰ γένη παράγονται διὰ μηχανισμῶν κινήσεως, ἀποχωρήσεως, μίξεως, πυκνώσεως, κενότητος καὶ διαχωρισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸν αἰτιακὸν λογισμὸν εἰς τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον ὅταν ἡ λεπτομέρεια ὑπερβαίνῃ τὴν ἀναγκαίαν δομήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Τὰ ὄντα νοοῦνται ὡς γινόμεναι καταστάσεις, ὧν ἡ ταυτότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ δυνάμεις, σχέσεις, τόπους καὶ χρονικὸν διαχωρισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξίωμαί εἰσιν ἱκανοὶ πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ βασικοῦ γενετικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία πυρὸς, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς ἐπαρκῶς ἐξηγεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ κίνησιν εἰς πήξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις πυκνότητος, προσμίξεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῶν διαστημάτων ἐπαρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν ἀνακατασκευὴν τῶν μεταλλικῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τόπου καὶ βαθμοῦ πήξεως ἐπαρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν ἀνακατασκευὴν τῶν τεσσάρων παγωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT5","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται αἱ ἐπιμέρους ἰδιότητες τῶν λοιπῶν σωμάτων, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἐκ προθέσεως παραιτεῖται τῆς πλήρους λεπτολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT6","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ φυσικὴν ἀπόδειξιν εἰς εἰκὸς μῦθον διατηρεῖ ἀνοικτὴν τὴν ἀκρίβειαν τῶν τελικῶν συμπερασμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T230948152619Z_c9adbf21","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 59","source_sha256":"3be5f256780e9f6e3058ba4dd9b3adb3b6fd1189ea352f087f4a0ffb71ed555b","sha256":"b5b746d20223f68d93d3ba33360df11d388f55f99817286b58f914d53474c57d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:09:48.156048+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS1","text":"The generation of solid and fluid bodies is explained from the motion, mixture, separation, and consolidation of the elemental powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS2","text":"Fire, as the producer of irregularity and motion, alters the fluid mass and its density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS3","text":"The withdrawal of fire brings about cooling, regularity, compression, and solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS4","text":"The differences among metals are produced from density, admixture of earth, internal intervals, and separation of the constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS5","text":"The same generative logic is applied also to hail, crystal, snow, and frost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AS6","text":"Detailed physical explanation sometimes yields its precision to the likely myth and moderate play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A1","text":"Fire does not issue forth into a void, but pushes the adjacent air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A2","text":"The moving air compresses the fluid mass toward the seats of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A3","text":"The irregularity of the fluid mass is connected with the presence of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","text":"The withdrawal of fire brings about cooling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","text":"After the withdrawal of fire, the compressed mass regains regularity and settles into its own state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","text":"The coming-together of the mass after the withdrawal of fire produces solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","text":"Density and homogeneity determine the kind of body being formed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","text":"The admixture of earth increases hardness, unless it is counterbalanced by large internal intervals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A9","text":"Internal gaps diminish the weight and density of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","text":"The separation of mixed constituents over time discloses distinct kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A11","text":"Water mixed with fire is fine, fluid, in motion, and soft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A12","text":"The withdrawal of fire and isolation from air render water more regular and compact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A13","text":"The place and degree of solidification differentiate the congelations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:A14","text":"The likely myth can undertake explanation where detailed discourse ceases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX1","text":"The discharge of fire does not occur into a void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX2","text":"The irregularity of the mass has no independent origin, but is attributed to fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX3","text":"Solidification does not appear as an original and unchanging property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX4","text":"Hardness does not follow univocally from density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX5","text":"The kind akin to gold does not constitute one simple and uniform body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX6","text":"Weight depends not only on matter, but also on the internal intervals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX7","text":"The kinds of congelations are not differentiated only according to the kind of water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:NX8","text":"Physical account does not always require a complete calculation of particulars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D1","text":"The motion of fire produces irregularity, because the air, being pushed, compresses the fluid mass.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A1","CH_JP8E_S_39:A2","CH_JP8E_S_39:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D2","text":"The withdrawal of fire changes the mass from irregular to regular and from moving to solidified.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D3","text":"Gold is formed when water comes to consist of the finest, most regular, and densest parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D4","text":"Adamant is a dense and blackened shoot of gold.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D5","text":"Copper has a mixed constitution, because it combines proximity to gold, admixture of earth, and internal voids.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","CH_JP8E_S_39:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D6","text":"Verdigris becomes manifest when the earthy part is separated from copper through aging.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D7","text":"Water mixed with fire becomes soft through motion and an unstable base.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D8","text":"The withdrawal of fire and isolation from air permit the compact solidification of water.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D9","text":"Hail and crystal consist in a stronger solidification, while snow and frost consist in a semi-solidified or weaker solidification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:D10","text":"Differentiation above and on earth incorporates place into the causation of congelations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD1","text":"Natural kinds are reconstituted as temporary states of equilibrium, produced from the alteration of powers and not from unchanging substances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A3","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD2","text":"The identity of each body is constituted from the relation of density, motion, admixture, voids, time, and place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A8","CH_JP8E_S_39:A9","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD3","text":"The absence of one element from the mixture can transform the entire kind of body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A4","CH_JP8E_S_39:A5","CH_JP8E_S_39:A10","CH_JP8E_S_39:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4","text":"Physical explanation has a double scale: precise in fundamental relations, but conjectural in infinite details.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7","CH_JP8E_S_39:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5","text":"Reference to the likely myth preserves the generative structure while suspending the claim to absolute precision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_39:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX1","text":"Bodies are not conceived as unrelated and self-sufficient units independent of motion and mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX2","text":"Matter is not explained without the interaction of fire, air, earth, and water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX3","text":"Solidity is not a primary principle, but the result of withdrawal, regularization, and coming-together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX4","text":"The difference among bodies is not reducible to one single metric parameter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5","text":"Time does not remain external to physical constitution, but operates through aging and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX6","text":"Physical knowledge has no need to reduce every detail to indisputable demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX1","text":"The idea of matter that is motionless, unmixed, and unchanging is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX2","text":"A world in which the kinds of bodies exist prior to the processes that produce them is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX3","text":"The complete distinction between nature and time is excluded, since aging transforms constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX4","text":"Absolute scientific certainty yields to conjectural reconstruction of generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX5","text":"An exhaustive treatment of the individual kinds is omitted, in order that the principle of generative explanation may be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS1","text":"Presence of fire → motion of fire → pushed air → compression of fluid mass → irregularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS2","text":"Withdrawal of fire → cooling → recovery of regularity → coming-together → solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS3","text":"Density + homogeneity → gold; dense blackened shoot of gold → adamant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS4","text":"Proximity to gold + admixture of earth + internal gaps → copper; aging + separation → verdigris.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS5","text":"Water + fire → fineness, motion, softness; withdrawal of fire + isolation from air → regularity and solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS6","text":"Solidification above the earth → hail or snow; solidification on the earth → crystal or frost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS7","text":"Excess of detail → inability of complete calculation → recourse to likely myth → prudent play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF1","text":"Outflow of fire → pushed air → irregularity of fluid mass → withdrawal of fire → cooling and regularity → solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF2","text":"Solidification → differences of density and mixture → generation of metals → aging → separation of constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF3","text":"Mixed water → isolation from fire and air → degrees and places of solidification → hail, crystal, snow, frost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:AF4","text":"Limit of detailed calculation → likely myth → moderate and prudent play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME1","text":"Metals are redescribed from simple names of things into results of densification, admixture, voidness, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME2","text":"Solidification is redescribed from a simple change into a sequence of cooling, regularization, and coming-together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME3","text":"Place is incorporated as a causal factor in the distinction of natural kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME4","text":"Density ceases to signify weight alone, because it is connected also with homogeneity, hardness, and internal intervals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ME5","text":"Precise natural account and likely myth coexist as two degrees of the same generative account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT1","text":"Surface: The passage names and distinguishes gold, adamant, copper, verdigris, hail, crystal, snow, and frost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT2","text":"Structural: Kinds are produced through mechanisms of motion, withdrawal, mixture, densification, voidness, and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Explanation passes from causal calculation to likely myth when detail exceeds the necessary structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Beings are conceived as coming-to-be states, whose identity depends upon powers, relations, places, and temporal separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the basic generative mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT2","text":"The sequence of fire, air, water, and earth sufficiently explains the transition from motion to solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT3","text":"The distinction of density, admixture, and internal intervals is sufficient for reconstructing the metallic kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT4","text":"The distinction of place and degree of solidification is sufficient for reconstructing the four congelations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT5","text":"The particular properties of the remaining bodies are underdetermined, because the account intentionally relinquishes complete detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT6","text":"The structure is coherent, but the transition from physical demonstration to likely myth keeps open the precision of the final conclusions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_39@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_39:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 59"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 43","title":"Section 59","context":"Chapter 43","original_title":"Section 59","original_context":"Chapter 43"},"original_title":"Section 59","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6","layer":"CH","title":"Section 60","order":44,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC6"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC6@R001","sha256":"30c1e2b6870733813a7ee42976647fa4b51da2118bfb5f5f39b5ad307bc3682e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS1","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ εἰς πολλὰ εἴδη μεμιγμένον ὑποβάλλει τοὺς χυμοὺς καὶ τὰ ἐξ αὐτῶν σώματα εἰς διαφοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS2","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν μειγμάτων ὁρίζεται ἀπὸ τὰς ἐνεργείας αὐτῶν πρὸς ψυχήν, ὄψιν, γεύσιν, σάρκα καὶ γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS3","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν ἰδιαίτερον δύναμιν ἑκάστου διαφανοῦς ἢ ἀφορισθέντος γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS4","text":"Ἡ στερεοποίησις τῆς γῆς παράγεται διὰ μεταβολῆς, ἀναχωρήσεως ἀέρος, ἀπουσίας κενοῦ, πιέσεως καὶ συνίστασθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS5","text":"Ἡ θερμότης ἀφαιρεῖ τὸ ὑγρόν, ἡ δὲ ψῦξις παγιοῖ τὸ καταλειφθέν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS6","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις ἢ ἡ ἀδιάλυτος σύστασις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ μέγεθος τῶν μερῶν καὶ τὴν ἰσχὺν τῆς διεξόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS7","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις κινείται ἀπὸ τὴν μείξιν πρὸς τὴν διαφοροποίησιν, ἐκ ταύτης πρὸς τὴν δύναμιν, καὶ ἐκ τῆς δυνάμεως πρὸς τὴν ὀνομασίαν καὶ τὴν γένεσιν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","text":"Τὰ πλείστα τῶν ὑδάτων εἴδη ἐκ μειγμάτων ἀλλήλων συνίστανται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","text":"Ἡ μεῖξις παράγει ἀνομοιότητα τῶν γενῶν καὶ διαφοροποιεῖ τὰς δυνάμεις αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3","text":"Τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν σωμάτων δηλοῦσι κυρίως τὴν ἐνεργὸν δύναμιν αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A4","text":"Ἡ θερμαντικὴ δύναμις ἐν τῷ μεικτῷ ὕδατι παράγει οἶνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A5","text":"Ἡ λεία, διακριτικὴ καὶ λιπαρὰ δύναμις πρὸς τὴν ὄψιν παράγει τὸ ἐλαιώδες γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A6","text":"Ἡ διαχυτικὴ δύναμις πρὸς τὰς περὶ τὸ στόμα συνόδους παράγει γλυκύτητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A7","text":"Ἡ διαλυτικὴ δύναμις τοῦ πυρὸς πρὸς τὴν σάρκα παράγει τὸ ἀφρῶδες γένος τοῦ ὀποῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","text":"Ἡ γῆ διὰ ὑδατικῆς ἠθήσεως δύναται εἰς λίθινον σῶμα μεταβάλλεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","text":"Ἡ ἀποκοπὴ τοῦ συμμείκτου ὕδατος μεταβάλλει μέρος αὐτοῦ εἰς ἀέρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","text":"Κενὸν οὐδὲν ὑπερέχει τῶν μετακινουμένων σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11","text":"Ὁ ἀναχωρῶν ἀὴρ ὠθεῖ τὸν πλησίον ἀέρα, ὁ δὲ ἀὴρ πιέζει καὶ συνιστᾷ τὴν γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12","text":"Ἡ πυρὰ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν νοτίδα, καὶ ἡ ψυχθεῖσα γῆ δύναται εἰς κεράμον ἢ μέλανα λίθον μεταβάλλεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A13","text":"Ἡ ἀπομόνωσις ὕδατος καὶ λεπτοτέρων γήινων μερῶν παράγει ἡμιπαγῆ ἅλα καὶ λίτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14","text":"Τὰ μεγάλα γήινα μέρη ὑπὸ πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος οὐ τήκεται, τὰ δὲ μείζονα ὑδάτινα μέρη βιαίως διερχόμενα τὴν γῆν λύει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX1","text":"Τὰ σώματα οὐκ ἀνάγονται εἰς ἀμιγῆ ὕδατα, ἀλλὰ εἰς μεμιγμένα εἴδη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX2","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἀποδίδοται εἰς ἄυλον ὀνοματοθεσίαν, ἀλλὰ εἰς συγκεκριμένας δυνάμεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX3","text":"Ἡ μετακίνησις οὐ γίνεται διὰ κενοῦ ἀνεμποδίστου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX4","text":"Ἡ γῆ οὐ τήκεται ὑπὸ πυρὸς ἢ ἀέρος, ὅταν τὰ μέρη αὐτῶν μικρότερα ᾖ τῶν γηίνων διακένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX5","text":"Ἡ ὑδατικὴ διάλυσις οὐκ ἐπιτελεῖται ἄνευ βιαίας διεξόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX6","text":"Τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν ὑλικῶν γενῶν οὐ καλύπτει ἅπαντας τοὺς δυνατοὺς συνδυασμούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ὁμοιότης τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἀρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν αἰτιακὴν ἐξήγησιν αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ μεῖξις παράγει διαφοράς, τὰ ὕδατα διαιροῦνται εἰς πολλὰ λειτουργικὰ γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ δυνάμεις τῶν μειγμάτων διαφέρουσιν, ἡ ὀνομασία δύναται νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν ἐνέργειαν μᾶλλον ἢ τὴν ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀποκοπὴ ὑδάτινου μέρους προκαλεῖ ἀλλαγὴν εἴδους, ἐπειδὴ τὸ συμμιγὲς ὕδωρ μεταβαίνει εἰς ἀέρα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D4","text":"Ἡ ἄνοδος τοῦ ἀέρος γεννᾷ μηχανικὴν ἁλυσίδα ὠθήσεως, πιέσεως καὶ συμπήξεως τῆς γῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D5","text":"Ἡ ποιότης τοῦ λίθου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἰσότητα καὶ ὁμαλότητα τῶν συστατικῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις νοτίδος ὑπὸ πυρὸς καὶ ἡ ἐπακολουθοῦσα ψῦξις μετατρέπουσι τὴν ὑγρὰν γῆν εἰς κεράμον ἢ λίθον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D7","text":"Ἡ ἀπομόνωσις ὕδατος καὶ λεπτοτέρων γήινων μερῶν ἐξηγεῖ τὴν γένεσιν σωμάτων ἡμιπαγῶν, ἅτινα δύνανται πάλιν ὑπὸ ὕδατος λυθῆναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D8","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ μεγέθους τῶν μερῶν ἐξηγεῖ διὰ τί τὸ πυρ καὶ ὁ ἀὴρ ἀφίησι τὴν γῆν ἄλυτον, ἐνώ τὸ ὕδωρ αὐτὴν τήκει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1","text":"Ἡ ὑλικὴ κοσμολογία συνδέει ἑνὶ σχήματι τὴν γένεσιν, τὴν ὀνομασίαν, τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν μηχανικὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD2","text":"Τὸ εἶδος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀκίνητον οὐσίαν, ἀλλὰ προσωρινὴν σύστασιν ἣ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ μείξεις, ἀποκρίσεις καὶ μεταβολὰς πιέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD3","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ ποιότης ἑκάστου σώματος ἀνάγεται εἰς σχέσιν ὕλης καὶ ἐνεργείας, οὐχὶ εἰς ἁπλῆν παρουσίαν στοιχείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ μετατρέπει πᾶσαν μεταβολὴν εἰς ἀλληλουχίαν ἀναπληρώσεως, ὠθήσεως καὶ συμπιέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD5","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης διαλύσεως ὁρίζεται σχετικῶς ὑπὸ τοῦ μεγέθους τῶν πόρων καὶ τῶν διερχομένων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX1","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἄθροισμα ἀμεταβλήτων ὑλικῶν μονάδων, ἀλλὰ ὡς δίκτυον μεταβαλλομένων συστάσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται αἰτία ἥτις χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὑλικὴν κίνησιν, τὴν πίεσιν, τὴν θερμότητα ἢ τὴν διάλυσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις μεταξὺ φυσικῆς συστάσεως καὶ λειτουργικῆς ἰδιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἀδιάφορος ὁ χώρος τῆς κινήσεως· ἡ πληρότης τοῦ κόσμου ἐπιβάλλει ἀμοιβαίαν ἀντίδρασιν τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεί ἡ θερμότης ὡς γενικὴ δύναμις· ἡ ἀποτελεσματικότης αὐτῆς ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν μικρομέρειαν καὶ τὴν διάταξιν τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὰ πράγματα ὑφίστανται χωρὶς ἀναγκαστικὴν ἀλληλομετατόπισιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ ὄνομα προϋπάρχει τῆς δυνάμεως καὶ ἀνεξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ὕλην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀμετάβλητος ταυτότης τῶν φυσικῶν γενῶν· ἕκαστον γένος ἐρείδεται εἰς ἰσορροπίαν ἣ δύναται νὰ λυθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἑνιαία ἀρχὴ ἣ ἐξηγεῖ μόνη τὰς μεταβολάς· ἡ ἐξήγησις διανέμεται εἰς μεῖξιν, μέγεθος, κίνησιν, θερμότητα καὶ ψῦξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS1","text":"Μείξις ὕδατος → ἀνομοιότης γενῶν → διαφοροποίησις δυνάμεων → λειτουργικὴ ὀνοματοθεσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS2","text":"Συμμεμιγμένον ὕδωρ → κοπή/ἀπομόνωσις → μεταβολὴ εἰς ἀέρα → ἄνοδος → ὠθούμενος ἀὴρ → συμπίεσις γῆς → λίθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS3","text":"Ὑγρὰ γῆ → ἀφαίρεσις νοτίδος ὑπὸ πυρός → κραυροτέρα σύστασις → ψῦξις → κεράμος ἢ μέλας λίθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS4","text":"Ὕδωρ καὶ λεπτομέρη γῆς → ἀπομόνωσις → ἡμιπάγια ἅλα/λίτρον → λύσις ὑπὸ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS5","text":"Γῆ καὶ ὕδωρ → μεγάλα γήινα μέρη → ἀντίστασις πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος → μείζονα ὑδάτινα μέρη → βιαία διέξοδος → τήξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF1","text":"Ἀνάμειξις ὑδάτων → ἀνομοιότης → ἐνεργειακὴ διαφοροποίησις → ὀνόματα σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF2","text":"Ἀποκοπὴ συμμείκτου ὕδατος → ἀὴρ → ἀπουσία κενοῦ → ὠθήσεις → συμπίεσις → λίθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF3","text":"Θέρμανσις → ἀφαίρεσις ὑγροῦ → στερεοποίησις διὰ ψύξεως → κεράμος/μέλας λίθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF4","text":"Διαφορά μεγέθους μερῶν → διαφορά διελεύσεως → ἀντίστασις ἢ διάλυσις τῆς γῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν σωμάτων μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὀνομασίαν εἰς τὴν ἐνεργὸν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME2","text":"Ἡ στερεότης ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀλληλεπικαλυπτομένων κινήσεων καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀρχικὴ ἀκινησία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις κενοῦ ἐνοποιεῖ τὴν κοσμολογίαν εἰς σύστημα ἀναγκαστικῶν μετατοπίσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις, ἡ τήξις καὶ ἡ στερεοποίησις ἐπαναταξινομοῦνται ὡς φαινόμενα σχετικῆς μικροδομῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις, ἡ χρησιμότης καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ σύστασις περιλαμβάνονται εἰς κοινὴν ἐξηγητικὴν κλίμακα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Τὰ εἴδη οἴνου, ἐλαίου, μέλιτος, ὀποῦ, λίθου, κεράμου, ἅλατος καὶ λίτρου δηλοῦνται διὰ τῶν ἰδίων ἐνεργειῶν καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ σύστασις τῶν σωμάτων παράγεται ἀπὸ μείξεις, ἀποχωρήσεις, πιέσεις, μεγέθη μερῶν καὶ θερμικὰς μεταβολάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀπαιτεῖ μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὸ φαινόμενον ὄνομα εἰς τὸν μηχανισμὸν τῆς δυνάμεως, καὶ ἀπὸ τὸν μηχανισμὸν εἰς τὴν ἀναγκαστικὴν ἀλληλεπίδρασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὰ σώματα εἰσὶ χρονικαὶ ἰσορροπίαι ἐν συνεχεῖ μεταβολῇ, ὧν ἡ ταυτότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διατήρησιν συγκεκριμένης συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα τῶν ἀξιωμάτων ἀρκεῖ πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν μεῖξιν πρὸς τὰ εἴδη καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν κίνησιν πρὸς τὰ στερεά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ παραμένει μερικῶς ἀπροσδιόριστος ὡς πρὸς τὸ ἀκριβὲς μικροφυσικὸν μέτρον τῶν μερῶν καὶ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν λογικὴν τῶν ὀνομάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὸν ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἀπουσίαν κενοῦ, τὴν πίεσιν, τὸ μέγεθος τῶν μερῶν καὶ τὴν θερμικὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἰσχύς τοῦ ἐξηγητικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ ἐντοπίζεται εἰς τὴν σύνδεσιν ποιοτήτων καὶ μηχανικῶν αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀσάφεια ἐμφανίζεται ἐν τῇ συνυπάρξει περιγραφῆς, αἰσθητικῆς ἀξιολογήσεως καὶ θεολογικοῦ χαρακτηρισμοῦ χωρὶς πλήρη ἀναγωγὴν αὐτῶν εἰς τὸν αὐτὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἐὰν ἡ γένεσις νοηθῇ ὡς ἀλληλουχία μείξεως, διαφοροποιήσεως, μετατοπίσεως καὶ στερεοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225711526394Z_463097d9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 60","source_sha256":"30c1e2b6870733813a7ee42976647fa4b51da2118bfb5f5f39b5ad307bc3682e","sha256":"97695eff153a18df7079d2788e18521b09e63062ffc116e31a098dc472ac68a7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:57:11.529948+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS1","text":"Water mixed into many kinds brings the humors and the bodies arising from them into differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS2","text":"The difference among mixtures is defined by their operations in relation to soul, sight, taste, flesh, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS3","text":"Naming follows the distinctive power of each transparent or determinate kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS4","text":"The solidification of earth is produced through transformation, the withdrawal of air, the absence of void, pressure, and coming together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS5","text":"Heat removes the moisture, while cooling fixes what remains.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS6","text":"Dissolution or indissoluble composition depends on the size of the parts and the force of passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS7","text":"The explanation proceeds from mixture to differentiation, from this to power, and from power to naming and the generation of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","text":"Most kinds of waters consist from mixtures with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","text":"Mixture produces dissimilarity of kinds and differentiates their powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3","text":"The names of bodies signify chiefly their active power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A4","text":"The heating power in mixed water produces wine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A5","text":"The smooth, discriminating, and oily power in relation to sight produces the oily kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A6","text":"The diffusive power in relation to the regions around the mouth produces sweetness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A7","text":"The dissolving power of fire in relation to flesh produces the foamy kind of juice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","text":"Earth, through watery filtration, can be transformed into a stony body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","text":"The cutting off of mixed water transforms part of it into air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","text":"No void exceeds the bodies that are displaced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11","text":"The withdrawing air pushes the neighboring air, and the air compresses and consolidates the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12","text":"Fire removes moisture, and cooled earth can be transformed into tile or black stone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A13","text":"The isolation of water and finer earthy parts produces semi-solid salts and nitre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14","text":"Large earthy parts are not melted by fire and air, whereas larger watery parts, passing violently through the earth, dissolve it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX1","text":"Bodies are not reduced to unmixed waters, but to mixed kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX2","text":"The generation of bodies is not ascribed to immaterial naming, but to concrete powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX3","text":"Displacement does not occur through an unobstructed void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX4","text":"Earth is not melted by fire or air when their parts are smaller than the interstices of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX5","text":"Watery dissolution is not accomplished without violent passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX6","text":"The names of material kinds do not encompass all possible combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX7","text":"The external similarity of bodies does not suffice for their causal explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D1","text":"Since mixture produces differences, waters are divided into many functional kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2","text":"Since the powers of mixtures differ, naming can follow operation rather than matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D3","text":"The cutting off of a watery part causes a change of kind, because the mixed water passes into air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D4","text":"The rising of air generates a mechanical chain of pushing, compression, and consolidation of earth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D5","text":"The quality of stone depends on the equality and uniformity of its constituent parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D6","text":"The removal of moisture by fire and the ensuing cooling transform wet earth into tile or stone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D7","text":"The isolation of water and finer earthy parts explains the generation of semi-solid bodies, which can in turn be dissolved by water.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:D8","text":"The difference in the size of parts explains why fire and air leave earth undissolved, whereas water melts it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1","text":"Material cosmology connects within one schema generation, naming, perception, and mechanical transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD2","text":"Kind is not an immobile substance, but a temporary composition dependent on mixtures, separations, and changes of pressure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD3","text":"The perceptible quality of each body is reduced to a relation of matter and operation, not to the simple presence of an element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4","text":"The absence of void turns every transformation into a sequence of replenishment, pushing, and compression.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD5","text":"The possibility of dissolution is defined relatively by the size of pores and of passing parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX1","text":"Reality is not conceived as an aggregate of unchanging material units, but as a network of changing compositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX2","text":"A cause that is separated from material motion, pressure, heat, or dissolution is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX3","text":"There is no absolute distinction between natural composition and functional property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX4","text":"The space of motion is not indifferent; the fullness of the cosmos imposes reciprocal reaction among bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX5","text":"Heat as a general power does not suffice; its effectiveness depends on the minuteness and arrangement of the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX1","text":"A world in which things exist without necessary mutual displacement is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX2","text":"The notion that the name pre-exists power and is independent of matter is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX3","text":"The unchanging identity of natural kinds is excluded; each kind rests upon an equilibrium that can be dissolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4","text":"The single principle that alone explains transformations is absent; explanation is distributed among mixture, size, motion, heat, and cooling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS1","text":"Mixture of water → dissimilarity of kinds → differentiation of powers → functional naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS2","text":"Mixed water → cutting off/isolation → transformation into air → rising → air being pushed → compression of earth → stone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS3","text":"Wet earth → removal of moisture by fire → drier composition → cooling → tile or black stone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS4","text":"Water and fine parts of earth → isolation → semi-solid salts/nitre → dissolution by water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS5","text":"Earth and water → large earthy parts → resistance to fire and air → larger watery parts → violent passage → melting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF1","text":"Mixing of waters → dissimilarity → differentiation of powers → names of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF2","text":"Cutting off of mixed water → air → absence of void → pushings → compression → stone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF3","text":"Heating → removal of moisture → solidification through cooling → tile/black stone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF4","text":"Difference in the size of parts → difference of passage → resistance or dissolution of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME1","text":"The distinction of bodies is shifted from naming to active power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME2","text":"Solidity appears as the result of overlapping motions and not as original immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME3","text":"The lack of void unifies cosmology into a system of necessary displacements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME4","text":"Dissolution, melting, and solidification are reclassified as phenomena of relative microstructure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5","text":"Perception, usefulness, and natural composition are included within a common explanatory scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The kinds of wine, oil, honey, juice, stone, tile, salt, and nitre are signified through their proper operations and transformations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The composition of bodies is produced by mixtures, separations, pressures, sizes of parts, and thermal transformations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Explanation requires a transition from the apparent name to the mechanism of power, and from the mechanism to necessary interaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Bodies are temporal equilibria in continual transformation, whose identity depends on the preservation of a determinate composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT1","text":"The system of axioms suffices for reconstructing the basic movement from mixture to kinds and from motion to solids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains partly indeterminate with respect to the exact microphysical measure of the parts and the internal logic of the names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent with regard to the absence of void, pressure, the size of parts, and thermal transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT4","text":"The strength of the explanatory mechanism lies in the connection of qualities and mechanical causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT5","text":"Ambiguity appears in the coexistence of description, aesthetic evaluation, and theological characterization without their full reduction to the same mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of the argument if generation is understood as a sequence of mixture, differentiation, displacement, and solidification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC6:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 60"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 44","title":"Section 60","context":"Chapter 44","original_title":"Section 60","original_context":"Chapter 44"},"original_title":"Section 60","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40","layer":"CH","title":"Section 61","order":45,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_40"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_40@R001","sha256":"3daca02ec83b2656b75a468e619e342f13f5c469f037fdc896e3a8d7255e1a5e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ διάλυσις καὶ ἡ τήξις τῶν μικτῶν σωμάτων κατὰ τὰς ἐν τοῖς στοιχείοις εἰσόδους καὶ διακρίσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀπάντησις ἀναφέρει τὰ πάθη τῶν σωμάτων εἰς τὴν δύναμιν καὶ τὸν τρόπον τῆς τῶν στοιχείων συμπλοκῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS3","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῆς βίᾳ καὶ τῆς ἀβιάστου συστάσεως καθορίζει τὸ ποῖον στοιχεῖον δύναται λύειν ἢ κατατήκειν ἕκαστον σώμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS4","text":"Τὰ μικτὰ σώματα διακρίνονται κατὰ τὴν ἀναλογίαν γῆς καὶ ὕδατος καὶ κατὰ τὰ σχήματα καὶ τὰς μεταβολὰς αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὰ σωματικὰ πάθη συνδέονται πρὸς αἴσθησιν, σάρκα, ψυχὴν θνητὴν καὶ γένεσιν, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῶν σωμάτων εἰς τὰ σώματι καὶ ψυχῇ συμβαίνοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἔρευνα τὰ μὲν περὶ σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς προτάσσει, τὰ δὲ περὶ τῶν αἰσθητῶν παθημάτων ὕστερον ἐπανέρχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","text":"Ἡ ἀσύστατος γῆ ὑπὸ βίας λύεται μόνον ὑπὸ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","text":"Ἡ συνεστηκυῖα γῆ πλὴν πυρὸς ὑπὸ οὐδενὸς λύεται, ἐπειδὴ μόνον τῷ πυρὶ εἴσοδος ὑπολείπεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","text":"Ἡ βιαιοτάτη σύνοδος τοῦ ὕδατος λύεται μόνον ὑπὸ πυρός, ἡ δὲ ἀσθενεστέρα ὑπὸ πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A4","text":"Ὁ ἀὴρ κατὰ μὲν τὰ διάκενα, τὸ δὲ πῦρ καὶ κατὰ τὰ τρίγωνα εἰσδύονται εἰς τὴν σύστασιν τοῦ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A5","text":"Ἀέρα βίᾳ συστάντα οὐδὲν λύει πλὴν τὸ κατὰ τὸ στοιχεῖον συγγενές, ἀέρα δὲ ἀβίαστον μόνον τὸ πῦρ κατατήκει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","text":"Ἐν τοῖς μικτοῖς ἐκ γῆς καὶ ὕδατος σώμασι τὸ ὕδωρ κατέχει τὰ διάκενα τῆς γῆς καὶ συνέχει τὸ κοινὸν σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A7","text":"Τὰ ὕδατος μέρη, μὴ ἔχοντα εἴσοδον ἔξωθεν, περιρρέει μὲν τὸν ὄγκον, οὐ τήκει δὲ αὐτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","text":"Τὰ πυρὸς μέρη εἰσδύντα εἰς τὰ τοῦ ὕδατος διάκενα μεταβάλλει τὸ ὕδωρ εἰς γῆν καὶ τήκει τὸ κοινὸν σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A9","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία ὕδατος καὶ γῆς παράγει διακεκριμένα γένη μικτῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","text":"Τὰ πάθη τῶν σωμάτων οὐ δύνανται ἱκανῶς λεχθῆναι χωρὶς τῶν αἰσθητικῶν παθημάτων, οὐδὲ τὰ αἰσθητικὰ πάθη χωρὶς τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A11","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἐξήγησις σώματος, ψυχῆς καὶ αἰσθήσεως οὐκ ἐφικτὴ ἅμα, ἀλλὰ διὰ διαδοχῆς ὑποθέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἀσύστατος γῆ οὐ λύεται ὑπὸ πυρὸς ἢ ἄλλου στοιχείου, ἀλλὰ μόνον ὑπὸ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX2","text":"Ἡ συνεστηκυῖα γῆ οὐ λύεται ὑπὸ ὕδατος, ἀέρος ἢ ἄλλου τινός, ἀλλὰ μόνον ὑπὸ πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX3","text":"Τὸ ὕδωρ οὐ διαλύεται κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ὑπὸ πάντων τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἔξωθεν περιρροὴ τοῦ ὕδατος οὐκ ἀρκεῖ πρὸς τήξιν τοῦ μικτοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX5","text":"Ὁ ἀὴρ οὐ λύει καθόλου τὴν βίᾳ συνεστηκυῖαν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX6","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἀφήγησις σώματος, ψυχῆς καὶ αἰσθήσεως οὐ δύναται νὰ γένηται ἅμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX7","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τῆς σαρκὸς καὶ τῶν περὶ σάρκα οὐ προϋποτίθεται ὡς ἤδη διηκριβωμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D1","text":"Ἡ λύσις σώματος ἐξαρτᾶται οὐ μόνον ἀπὸ τὸ στοιχεῖον τοῦ διαλύοντος, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀπὸ τὸ εἶδος τῆς προϋπαρχούσης συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","CH_JP8E_S_40:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D2","text":"Ἡ εἴσοδος εἰς τὰ διάκενα ἀποτελεῖ ὅρον τῆς τήξεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἡ ἁπλῆ περιβολὴ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A7","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία γῆς καὶ ὕδατος καθορίζει εἰ τὸ μικτὸν σῶμα γίνεται ὑαλῶδες καὶ χυτὸν ἢ κηροειδὲς καὶ θυμιατικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","CH_JP8E_S_40:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D4","text":"Ἡ τῶν στοιχείων εἰσχώρησις εἰς τὰ διάκενα μεταβάλλει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν σύστασιν καὶ ἐξ αὐτῆς παράγει ῥοήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D5","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν σωματικῶν παθημάτων ἀναγκάζεται νὰ προχωρῇ πρὸς τὴν θεωρίαν τῆς αἰσθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D6","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῆς ἐξηγήσεως γίνεται μεθοδολογικὸς ὅρος, ἐπειδὴ τὰ συμπλεκόμενα γένη οὐ δύνανται νὰ ἐκτεθῶσιν ἅμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη νοεῖται ὡς δυναμικὸν πλέγμα διαπερατότητος, ἀντιστάσεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς εἰσόδου, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀδρανὴς ὄγκος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","CH_JP8E_S_40:A4","CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης διαβαθμίζεται κατὰ τὴν βίαν τῆς συστάσεως καὶ τὴν ἐνεργὸν ἰδιότητα τοῦ εἰσιόντος στοιχείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","CH_JP8E_S_40:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3","text":"Ἡ σύστασις, ἡ διάλυσις, τὸ πάθος καὶ ἡ αἴσθησις ἀνήκουσιν εἰς μίαν ἱεραρχικὴν ἀλυσίδα ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς ἀναφορᾶς εἰς τὴν ψυχὴν διαφυλάττει τὴν ἀναλυτικὴν προτεραιότητα τοῦ σώματος, χωρὶς νὰ ἀποκόπτῃ τὸ σωματικὸν ἀπὸ τὸ ψυχικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX1","text":"Ἡ σύστασις τῶν σωμάτων οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἁπλὴ παράθεσις ἀδιαφόρων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀποτελεσματικὴ αἰτιότης οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς μόνην τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπαφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX3","text":"Ἡ διαλυτικὴ δύναμις οὐκ εἶναι καθολικὴ ἢ ὁμοιόμορφος, ἀλλὰ συναρτᾶται πρὸς δομὴν καὶ τρόπον συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX4","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξάρτητον ἐπίπεδον ἀποκεκομμένον ἀπὸ τὰ πάθη τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX5","text":"Ἡ μεθοδολογικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ταυτόχρονον ἀνάπτυξιν πάντων τῶν ἀλληλεξαρτωμένων γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ μεταβολὴ γίνεται ἄνευ διαφοράς ἐσωτερικῆς διαπερατότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ πάθος ἐμφανίζεται πρὶν ἢ ἄνευ σωματικῆς διαρθρώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπολύτως αὐτόνομος ἐπιστήμη τοῦ σώματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐξήγησις αὐτοῦ ἐκτείνεται εἰς ψυχὴν καὶ αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4","text":"Ἡ πλήρης ταυτόχρονος ὁρατὴ ὁλοκλήρωσις τῆς θεωρίας παραμένει ἀδύνατος· ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ διαδοχὴν καὶ ἐπανόδον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS1","text":"Διαφορά συστάσεως → διαφορά εἰσόδου → διαφορά διαλύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS2","text":"Διάκενα γῆς καὶ ὕδατος → εἴσοδος πυρός → μεταβολὴ ὕδατος εἰς γῆν → τήξις κοινοῦ σώματος → ῥοή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS3","text":"Ἀναλογία γῆς καὶ ὕδατος → κοινωνία σχημάτων καὶ μεταλλαγῶν → ποικιλία μικτῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS4","text":"Πάθη σωμάτων → αἴσθησις → σάρξ καὶ τὰ περὶ σάρκα → θνητὴ ψυχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5","text":"Ἀλληλεξάρτησις γενῶν → ἀδυναμία ταυτόχρονης ἐκθέσεως → προτεραιότης σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς → ὕστερος ἐπανέλεγχος τῶν ὑποθέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AF1","text":"Σύστασις στοιχείων → εἴσοδος καὶ διάκενα → διάλυσις ἢ τῆξις → γένη μικτῶν σωμάτων → σωματικὰ πάθη → αἴσθησις → μεθοδολογικὴ ἀναβολὴ → ἔναρξις θεωρίας σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ γενικὴν ἐπίδρασιν εἰς σχέσιν συγκεκριμένης δομῆς καὶ συγκεκριμένης εἰσόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME2","text":"Τὰ μικτὰ σώματα ἀναφαίνονται ὡς γένη παραγόμενα ἀπὸ ἀναλογίαν καὶ μεταβολήν, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλῶς δεδομένα ἀντικείμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3","text":"Τὸ σωματικὸν πάθος συνδέεται δομικῶς πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν, ὥστε ἡ φυσικὴ θεωρία μεταβαίνει εἰς θεωρίαν τοῦ αἰσθανομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τῆς ταυτόχρονης ἐκθέσεως μετατρέπει τὴν ἀκολουθίαν τῆς ἀποδείξεως εἰς μέρος τῆς φυσικῆς μεθόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ λύσις, ἡ τήξις καὶ ἡ ῥοὴ τῶν σωμάτων ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ διάταξις, τὰ διάκενα, ἡ βία καὶ ἡ ἀναλογία καθορίζουν τὴν ἐνεργὸν αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἔρευνα ὀφείλει νὰ μεταβαίνῃ ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν τῶν σωμάτων εἰς τὰ πάθη, τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν ψυχήν κατὰ τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ σώμα, τὸ πάθος καὶ ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀλληλοεξαρτώμενα ἐπίπεδα, ἃ ὁ χρόνος τῆς ἐξηγήσεως ἀναγκαστικῶς διαχωρίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν ὥστε νὰ ἀνασυστήσωσι τὴν κύριαν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν στοιχειακὴν σύστασιν εἰς τὰ σωματικὰ καὶ αἰσθητικὰ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις παραμένει ὑποδεεστέρα ὡς πρὸς τὴν πλήρη θεωρίαν τῆς σαρκὸς, τῶν αἰσθήσεων καὶ τῆς θνητῆς ψυχῆς, ἐπειδὴ ταῦτα ἐνταῦθα προαναγγέλλονται μόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT3","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ᾽ ὅσον ἡ εἴσοδος, τὰ διάκενα καὶ ἡ ἀναλογία συνδέουν τὴν μικροδομὴν πρὸς τὸ πάθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT4","text":"Ἡ κυριωτέρα ἐκκρεμότης ἔγκειται στὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας ἀλληλεξαρτήσεως σώματος καὶ αἰσθήσεως καὶ τῆς ἀναγκαίας χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς τῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὸν μηχανισμὸν τῆς ἀιτιότητος, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀνοικτὸν τὸ πῶς ἡ φυσικὴ μετάβασις καταλήγει εἰς τὴν συγκεκριμένην αἴσθησιν τοῦ θερμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231007169643Z_edf30899","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 61","source_sha256":"3daca02ec83b2656b75a468e619e342f13f5c469f037fdc896e3a8d7255e1a5e","sha256":"4d14390afd07fbf53f0cefe5b0b8ce5f2ee442ae109ec9196db99b905cd2ce64","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:10:07.170796+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1","text":"The problem is the dissolution and melting of mixed bodies according to the ingressions and separations among the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS2","text":"The answer refers the affections of bodies to the power and mode of the interweaving of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS3","text":"The difference between forced and unforced composition determines which element can dissolve or melt each body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS4","text":"Mixed bodies are distinguished according to the proportion of earth and water and according to their shapes and transformations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS5","text":"Since bodily affections are connected with sensation, flesh, mortal soul, and generation, the explanation passes from bodies to what happens to body and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AS6","text":"The inquiry puts forward matters concerning body and soul first, and later returns to matters concerning sensible affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","text":"Uncompounded earth is dissolved by force only by water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","text":"Cohered earth is dissolved by nothing except fire, since ingress remains only to fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","text":"The most violent union of water is dissolved only by fire, but the weaker one by fire and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A4","text":"Air penetrates through the interstices, while fire penetrates both through the interstices and through the triangles, into the composition of water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A5","text":"Nothing dissolves air forcibly compacted except what is akin to it in respect of the element, but only fire melts unforced air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","text":"In mixed bodies composed of earth and water, water occupies the interstices of earth and holds the common body together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A7","text":"The parts of water, having no ingress from outside, flow around the mass but do not melt it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","text":"The parts of fire, entering into the interstices of water, transform water into earth and melt the common body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A9","text":"The proportion of water and earth produces distinct kinds of mixed bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","text":"The affections of bodies cannot be adequately discussed apart from sensible affections, nor sensible affections apart from bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:A11","text":"A common explanation of body, soul, and sensation is not possible simultaneously, but only through a succession of hypotheses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX1","text":"Uncompounded earth is not dissolved by fire or another element, but only by water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX2","text":"Cohered earth is not dissolved by water, air, or anything else, but only by fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX3","text":"Water is not dissolved in the same way by all the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX4","text":"The external flowing-around of water is not sufficient for the melting of the mixed body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX5","text":"Air does not in any way dissolve a forcibly cohered composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX6","text":"A common account of body, soul, and sensation cannot be given simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:NX7","text":"The generation of flesh and of things concerning flesh is not presupposed as already precisely determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D1","text":"The dissolution of a body depends not only on the element of what dissolves it, but also on the kind of pre-existing composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","CH_JP8E_S_40:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D2","text":"Entry into the interstices constitutes a condition of melting, rather than the mere surrounding of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A7","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D3","text":"The proportion of earth and water determines whether the mixed body becomes glassy and fusible or wax-like and incense-like.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","CH_JP8E_S_40:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D4","text":"The penetration of the elements into the interstices transforms the internal composition and from it produces flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D5","text":"The theory of bodily affections is compelled to proceed to the theory of sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:D6","text":"The order of explanation becomes a methodological condition, since intertwined kinds cannot be expounded simultaneously.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1","text":"Matter is conceived as a dynamic network of penetrability, resistance, and internal ingress, not as an inert mass.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A2","CH_JP8E_S_40:A4","CH_JP8E_S_40:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD2","text":"Natural causality is graded according to the force of the composition and the active property of the entering element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A1","CH_JP8E_S_40:A3","CH_JP8E_S_40:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3","text":"Composition, dissolution, affection, and sensation belong to a single hierarchical chain of explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A8","CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SD4","text":"Deferring reference to the soul preserves the analytical priority of the body without severing the bodily from the psychic.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX1","text":"The composition of bodies is not explained as a mere juxtaposition of indifferent elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX2","text":"Efficient causality is not reducible to external contact alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX3","text":"Dissolving power is not universal or uniform, but is correlated with structure and mode of composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX4","text":"Sensation does not constitute an independent level cut off from the affections of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX5","text":"Methodological order does not permit the simultaneous development of all interdependent kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX1","text":"A world in which transformation occurs without a difference of internal penetrability is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX2","text":"The notion that affection appears prior to, or without, bodily articulation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX3","text":"An absolutely autonomous science of body is excluded, since its explanation extends to soul and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4","text":"The complete simultaneous visible completion of the theory remains impossible; order requires succession and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS1","text":"Difference of composition → difference of ingress → difference of dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS2","text":"Interstices of earth and water → ingress of fire → transformation of water into earth → melting of the common body → flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS3","text":"Proportion of earth and water → communion of shapes and transformations → variety of mixed kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS4","text":"Affections of bodies → sensation → flesh and things concerning flesh → mortal soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5","text":"Interdependence of kinds → impossibility of simultaneous exposition → priority of body and soul → subsequent re-examination of the hypotheses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:AF1","text":"Composition of elements → ingress and interstices → dissolution or melting → kinds of mixed bodies → bodily affections → sensation → methodological deferral → beginning of the theory of body and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1","text":"Dissolution is reclassified from a general effect into a relation of determinate structure and determinate ingress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME2","text":"Mixed bodies appear as kinds produced from proportion and transformation, not as merely given objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3","text":"Bodily affection is structurally connected to sensation, so that natural theory passes into a theory of the sentient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4","text":"The impossibility of simultaneous exposition transforms the sequence of demonstration into part of natural method.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The dissolution, melting, and flow of bodies are explained through the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Internal arrangement, interstices, force, and proportion determine active causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Inquiry must proceed in order from the generation of bodies to affections, sensation, and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Body, affection, and sensation constitute interdependent levels, which the time of explanation necessarily separates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal movement from elemental composition to bodily and sensible affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains deficient with respect to the complete theory of flesh, the senses, and the mortal soul, because these are only announced here in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as ingress, interstices, and proportion connect microstructure to affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT4","text":"The chief unresolved issue lies in the tension between the necessary interdependence of body and sensation and the necessary temporal succession of the explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the mechanism of causality, but leaves open how the natural transition arrives at the determinate sensation of heat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_40:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_40@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_40:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 61"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 45","title":"Section 61","context":"Chapter 45","original_title":"Section 61","original_context":"Chapter 45"},"original_title":"Section 61","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41","layer":"CH","title":"Section 62","order":46,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_41"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_41@R001","sha256":"4d0e87de3d33ba6639cd45c22640d82d6df341acb87755fde289fb4e5c916a9a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS1","text":"Τὸ θερμὸν καὶ τὸ ψυχρὸν ἐκ τῆς κινήσεως, τῆς διακρίσεως καὶ τῆς συνθέσεως τῶν σωμάτων ἀναγκαῖον ἐξηγεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS2","text":"Ἡ τοῦ σχήματος φύσις ὁρίζει τὸ πῶς τὰ μόρια δρῶσιν ἐπὶ τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS3","text":"Τὸ σκληρὸν καὶ τὸ μαλακὸν οὐκ ἀπολύτως, ἀλλὰ πρὸς τὴν ὑποχωρητικὴν δύναμιν τῆς σαρκὸς λέγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS4","text":"Τὸ βαρὺ καὶ τὸ κοῦφον δεῖ πρὸς τὴν φορὰν κάτω καὶ ἄνω σκοπεῖν, ἀλλὰ τὸ κάτω καὶ τὸ ἄνω οὐκ ἔχει καθολικὴν ἰσχὺν ἐν σφαιροειδεῖ κόσμῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ διάταξις τοῦ παντὸς καταλύει τὴν ἀπόλυτον ἀντίθεσιν τοῦ ἄνω καὶ τοῦ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS6","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ ὀνοματοθεσία ἀπαιτεῖ τὰ φυσικὰ μεγέθη καὶ τὰς σχέσεις αὐτῶν μὴ ἀποσπᾶν ἀπὸ τῆς κοσμικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ σχήματος διαφορίζει τὰ σώματα καὶ τὰ πάθη αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A2","text":"Ἡ λεπτότης τῶν πλευρῶν καὶ ἡ ὀξύτης τῶν γωνιῶν αὐξάνει τὴν τομὴν καὶ τὴν δραστικὴν ὀξύτητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","text":"Ἡ σμικρότης τῶν μορίων καὶ τὸ τάχος τῆς φορᾶς συντελεῖ εἰς τὸ τέμνειν τὸ προστυχόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","text":"Τὸ θερμὸν ὀνομάζεται ἐκ τῆς κινήσεως ἣ διακρίνει καὶ κατακερματίζει τὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","text":"Τὰ μεγαλομερέστερα ὑγρὰ εἰσιόντα ἐξωθεῖ τὰ σμικρότερα καὶ συνωθεῖ τὸ νοτερόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A6","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης καὶ ἡ σύνωσις δύναται τὸ κινούμενον ἐκ τοῦ ἀνωμάλου εἰς ἀκινησίαν καὶ πήξιν ἀγαγεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","text":"Τὸ παρὰ φύσιν συναγόμενον ἀντιμάχεται τῇ φυσικῇ κινήσει καὶ ἑαυτὸ ἀπωθεῖ πρὸς τὸ ἐναντίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A8","text":"Ὁ τρόμος καὶ τὸ ῥῖγος ἐκ τῆς μάχης καὶ τοῦ σεισμοῦ τῶν ἀντιμαχομένων κινήσεων παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","text":"Τὸ σκληρὸν καὶ τὸ μαλακὸν καθορίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ εἰ ἡ σὰρξ ὑπείκει ἢ ἀντιτείνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A10","text":"Τὸ ἐκ τετραγώνων βάσεων συνεστὸς ἀντιτυπώτατον γίνεται διὰ τὴν στερεότητα καὶ τὴν πυκνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A11","text":"Ἡ φορὰ τῶν σωμάτων ἐρμηνεύεται διὰ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς τὸ κάτω καὶ τὸ ἄνω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","text":"Ὁ σφαιροειδὴς οὐρανὸς οὐ παρέχει ἓν ἀπόλυτον κάτω οὐδὲ ἓν ἀπόλυτον ἄνω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","text":"Τὸ μέσον τοῦ κόσμου οὔτε κάτω οὔτε ἄνω ἐστίν, ἀλλὰ μέσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A14","text":"Τὰ περιφερικὰ μέρη τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἔχει ἕτερον μέρος μᾶλλον πρὸς τὸ μέσον ἢ πρὸς τὸ ἀντικείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX1","text":"Τὸ θερμὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἄνευ τῆς μορφῆς, τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς διακρίσεως τῶν μορίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX2","text":"Τὸ ψυχρὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῶς ἕτερον πάθος ἀνεξάρτητον τῆς συμπήξεως καὶ τῆς ἀντιμάχης τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX3","text":"Τὸ σκληρὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπόλυτον κατηγόρημα ἀνεξάρτητον τοῦ προσλαμβάνοντος σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX4","text":"Τὸ μαλακὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπόλυτον ἴδιον τῶν πραγμάτων, ἀλλὰ δηλοῖ τὴν πρὸς τὴν σάρκα ὑποχώρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX5","text":"Τὸ βαρὺ οὐκ ὁρίζεται διὰ ἀπολύτου τόπου κάτω ἐν τῷ παντί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX6","text":"Τὸ κοῦφον οὐκ ὁρίζεται διὰ ἀπολύτου τόπου ἄνω ἐν τῷ παντί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX7","text":"Τὸ μέσον οὐκ ἔχει δίκαιον νὰ ὀνομάζηται κάτω ἢ ἄνω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX8","text":"Τὰ περιφερικὰ οὐκ ἔχει δίκαιον νὰ ὀνομάζηται καθολικῶς μέσον ἢ ἄνω ἢ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D1","text":"Ὅσῳ λεπτότερα καὶ ὀξύτερα τὰ μόρια, τοσούτῳ σφοδρότερον τέμνει τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A2","CH_JP8E_S_41:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D2","text":"Ἡ τομὴ γίνεται ὄνομα καὶ πάθος θερμότητος ὅταν ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ἡ κίνησις διακρίνῃ τὰ σώματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D3","text":"Ἡ εἴσοδος τῶν μεγάλων ὑγρῶν καὶ ἡ ἔξωσις τῶν μικρῶν παράγει συμπίλησιν καὶ πήξιν τοῦ νοτεροῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","CH_JP8E_S_41:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀπώθησις τοῦ παρὰ φύσιν συνεστῶτος μετατρέπει τὴν συμπίλησιν εἰς σεισμὸν καὶ ῥῖγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","CH_JP8E_S_41:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D5","text":"Ἡ σκληρότης καὶ ἡ μαλακότης εἰσὶν ἀντιθετικοὶ σχετικοὶ προσδιορισμοὶ τῆς αὐτῆς ὑλικῆς ἀντιδράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D6","text":"Ἡ τετραγωνικὴ βάσις καὶ ἡ πυκνότης συνάπτει τὴν μορφὴν τοῦ σώματος πρὸς τὴν ἀντιτυπίαν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D7","text":"Τὸ βαρὺ καὶ τὸ κοῦφον δύναται νὰ ἐξηγηθῇ μόνον ἐν σχέσει πρὸς κοσμικὴν φοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D8","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ τοῦ κόσμου ἀκυροῖ τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἓν σημείον εἶναι φύσει κάτω καὶ ἓν ἄνω πρὸς πάντα τὰ μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη μετασχηματίζονται ἀπὸ ἀπολύτους ποιότητας εἰς σχέσεις μορφῆς, κινήσεως, ὕλης καὶ θέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","CH_JP8E_S_41:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις παράγει τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν παθημάτων ἀπὸ μηχανισμοὺς μεταβολῆς, οὐκ ἀπὸ ἄρρητα ἢ ἀκίνητα εἴδη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","CH_JP8E_S_41:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία ἐλέγχει τὴν ὀρθότητα τῶν καθημερινῶν ἀντιθέσεων καὶ ἀφαιρεῖ ἀπὸ αὐτὰς τὴν καθολικὴν ἀξίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A11","CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία ὀφείλει νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν ἀναλογίαν τῆς κοσμικῆς διατάξεως καὶ οὐχὶ νὰ ἐπιβάλλῃ ἀνθρωποκεντρικὰς κατευθύνσεις εἰς τὸ πᾶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ἐξήγησις τῶν παθημάτων διὰ γυμνῶν ὀνομάτων ἀποκεκομμένων ἀπὸ τὰς σωματικὰς αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ἀπόδοσις φυσικῆς ἰσχύος εἰς τὴν ἁπλῆν ἐμπειρικὴν ἀντίθεσιν θερμοῦ καὶ ψυχροῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ταύτισις τῆς ὑλικῆς ἀντιστάσεως μετὰ μιᾶς ἀμεταβλήτου ποιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ προβολὴ τῆς γήινης ἐμπειρίας τοῦ ἄνω καὶ τοῦ κάτω ἐπὶ τὸ σφαιροειδὲς πᾶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ περιφέρεια ἔχει ἓν προνομιούχον ἀντίθετον μέρος πρὸς τὸ μέσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐκ τοῦ κόσμου ἕνα κοινὸν προνομιακὸν πλαίσιον ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἰσχύον ἐπὶ παντὸς τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀπόλυτος αὐτοτέλεια τῶν αἰσθητῶν κατηγοριῶν· αὗται ἀναφέρονται πάντοτε εἰς σχέσεις μορφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κοσμολογία ἣ ἐκλαμβάνει τὸν ἀνθρώπινον προσανατολισμὸν ὡς μέτρον τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ὀνομασία δύναται νὰ παραμένῃ ὀρθὴ ἐὰν ἀγνοῇ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν συμμετρίαν τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","text":"Μορφὴ σώματος → λεπτότης, γωνιῶν ὀξύτης, μορίων σμικρότης → ταχεία τομή → πάθος καὶ ὄνομα θερμότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2","text":"Μεγαλομερέστερον ὑγρόν → εἴσοδος καὶ ἔξωσις μικροτέρων → σύνωσις καὶ πήξις → ἀντίστροφος φυσικὴ ἀπώθησις → τρόμος καὶ ῥῖγος → ψυχρότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS3","text":"Ὑποχώρησις σαρκὸς ἢ ἀντίστασις σαρκὸς → σχετικὸς προσδιορισμὸς μαλακοῦ ἢ σκληροῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS4","text":"Τετραγωνικὴ βάσις + πυκνότης → μέγιστη ἀντιτυπία → σκληρότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS5","text":"Σωματικὸς ὄγκος + φορά → σχέσις πρὸς κάτω/ἄνω → ὁρισμὸς βαρύτητος/κουφότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS6","text":"Σφαιροειδὴς οὐρανός → ἴση ἀπόστασις τῶν ἐσχάτων ἀπὸ τὸ μέσον → ἀκύρωσις ἀπολύτου ἄνω/κάτω → ὀρθὴ σχεσιακὴ ὀνοματοθεσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","text":"Ἀπορία περὶ τῶν αἰσθητῶν παθημάτων → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς μορφὴν καὶ κίνησιν → μηχανικὴ ἐξήγησις θερμοῦ καὶ ψυχροῦ → σχετικοποίησις σκληροῦ καὶ μαλακοῦ → κοσμολογικὴ ἀναθεώρησις βαρέος καὶ κούφου → ἀπόρριψις ἀπολύτου ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","text":"Ἐμπειρικὴ ἀντίθεσις → φυσικὴ αἰτία → γεωμετρικὴ διάταξις → ἔλεγχος τῶν ὀνομάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","text":"Τὰ πάθη θερμόν, ψυχρόν, σκληρόν καὶ μαλακόν ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀποτελέσματα σχέσεων καὶ κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀπολύτου καὶ σχετικοῦ μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὕλην εἰς τὴν κοσμολογικὴν ὀνοματοθεσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἄνω/κάτω παύει νὰ εἶναι καθολικὸς χάρτης καὶ γίνεται τοπικὴ ἢ σχεσιακὴ διάκρισις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME4","text":"Τὸ μέσον καὶ ἡ περιφέρεια ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς γεωμετρικαὶ θέσεις, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνθρωπομορφικαὶ κατευθύνσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὀρθότης τῶν ὀνομάτων ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν αὐτῶν πρὸς τὴν δομὴν τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT1","text":"Ὁρατὸν ἐπίπεδον: τὰ πάθη τοῦ θερμοῦ, ψυχροῦ, σκληροῦ, μαλακοῦ, βαρέος καὶ κούφου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: μορφαὶ, μεγέθη, κινήσεις, συμπιλήσεις, ἀπωθήσεις καὶ σχέσεις πρὸς τὴν σάρκα καὶ τὸν τόπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ἡ φυσικὴ καὶ γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάλυσις ἐλέγχει τὰς κοινὰς ὀνομασίας καὶ ἀποτρέπει τὴν ἀπόλυτον χρήσιν αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: τὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη νοεῖται ὡς γιγνόμενα ἐκ μεταβολῶν ἐν κινήσει, ἐν ὕλῃ καὶ ἐν κοσμικῇ συμμετρίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT1","text":"Αἱ προτεινόμεναι ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς πορείας ἀπὸ τὴν μορφὴν καὶ τὴν κίνησιν εἰς τὰ φυσικὰ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάρθρωσις διασώζει τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ θερμὸν καὶ ψυχρὸν εἰς σκληρὸν καὶ μαλακόν, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς βαρὺ καὶ κοῦφον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT3","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ κοσμολογικὴ ἀναίρεσις ἀπολύτου ἄνω καὶ κάτω προκύπτει συνεπῶς ἐκ τῆς σφαιρικῆς συμμετρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς φυσικὴ ἀλληλουχία δι’ ἧς ἡ πήξις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς τὸ ψυχρόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει ἤδη τὴν γεωμετρικὴν ἀρχὴν τοῦ σφαιροειδοῦς κόσμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα κίνησις τοῦ λόγου ἐστὶν ἡ μετάθεσις ἀπὸ ἀπολύτους ποιότητας εἰς σχεσιακὰ φυσικὰ συμβάντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231027090109Z_db7f48c2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 62","source_sha256":"4d0e87de3d33ba6639cd45c22640d82d6df341acb87755fde289fb4e5c916a9a","sha256":"127f0958d036a6276577145767a983c2823b904922af0aae50452b6f0c784a87","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:10:27.091385+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS1","text":"It is necessary to explain the hot and the cold from the motion, separation, and combination of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS2","text":"The nature of shape determines how particles act upon bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS3","text":"The hard and the soft are spoken of not absolutely, but in relation to the yielding power of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS4","text":"The heavy and the light must be considered in relation to motion downward and upward, but downward and upward have no universal force in a spherical cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","text":"The spherical arrangement of the whole abolishes the absolute opposition of above and below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AS6","text":"Correct naming requires that natural magnitudes and their relations not be detached from the cosmic arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","text":"The nature of shape differentiates bodies and their affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A2","text":"Thinness of sides and sharpness of angles increase cutting and active sharpness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","text":"The smallness of particles and the speed of motion contribute to cutting whatever is encountered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","text":"The hot is named from the motion that separates and fragments bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","text":"Larger-parted liquids entering drive out the smaller and compress the moist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A6","text":"Smoothness and compression are able to bring what is moving from unevenness into stillness and coagulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","text":"What is compressed contrary to nature opposes natural motion and thrusts itself toward the contrary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A8","text":"Trembling and shivering are produced from the conflict and agitation of opposing motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","text":"The hard and the soft are determined by whether flesh yields or resists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A10","text":"What consists of square bases becomes most resistant to impact through solidity and density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A11","text":"The motion of bodies is interpreted through its relation to below and above.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","text":"The spherical heaven provides neither one absolute below nor one absolute above.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","text":"The middle of the cosmos is neither below nor above, but middle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:A14","text":"The peripheral parts of the cosmos have no part more toward the middle than toward the opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX1","text":"The hot is not without the form, motion, and separation of particles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX2","text":"The cold is not simply another affection independent of coagulation and the opposition of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX3","text":"The hard is not an absolute predicate independent of the body receiving it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX4","text":"The soft is not an absolute property of things, but signifies yielding in relation to flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX5","text":"The heavy is not defined through an absolute place below in the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX6","text":"The light is not defined through an absolute place above in the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX7","text":"The middle has no right to be called below or above.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:NX8","text":"The peripheral has no right to be called universally middle, above, or below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D1","text":"The thinner and sharper the particles, the more violently the body cuts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A2","CH_JP8E_S_41:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D2","text":"Cutting becomes the name and affection of heat when form and motion separate bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D3","text":"The entry of large liquids and the expulsion of small ones produces compression and coagulation of the moist.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","CH_JP8E_S_41:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D4","text":"The natural repulsion of what has been combined contrary to nature transforms compression into agitation and shivering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","CH_JP8E_S_41:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D5","text":"Hardness and softness are opposing relative determinations of the same material reaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D6","text":"The square base and density connect the body's form with its resistance to impact.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D7","text":"The heavy and the light can be explained only in relation to cosmic motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:D8","text":"The spherical form of the cosmos invalidates the supposition that one point is by nature below and one above with respect to all parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","text":"Sensible affections are transformed from absolute qualities into relations of form, motion, matter, and position.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","CH_JP8E_S_41:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","text":"Natural explanation derives the names of affections from mechanisms of change, not from ineffable or immobile forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1","CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_41:A5","CH_JP8E_S_41:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","text":"Cosmology tests the correctness of everyday oppositions and removes from them their universal claim.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A11","CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","text":"Naming ought to follow the proportion of the cosmic arrangement and not impose anthropocentric directions upon the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A12","CH_JP8E_S_41:A13","CH_JP8E_S_41:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","text":"Explanation of affections through bare names detached from bodily causes is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX2","text":"The attribution of natural force to the simple empirical opposition of hot and cold is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX3","text":"The identification of material resistance with one unchangeable quality is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX4","text":"The projection of terrestrial experience of above and below onto the spherical whole is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX5","text":"The supposition that the periphery has one privileged opposite part in relation to the middle is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1","text":"A common privileged framework of above and below valid in every place is absent from the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","text":"The absolute self-subsistence of sensible categories is absent; they always refer to relations of form, motion, and place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX3","text":"A cosmology that takes human orientation as the measure of the whole is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4","text":"The idea that naming can remain correct if it ignores the geometrical symmetry of the cosmos is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","text":"Bodily form → thinness, sharpness of angles, smallness of particles → rapid cutting → affection and name of heat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2","text":"Larger-parted liquid → entry and expulsion of smaller things → compression and coagulation → contrary natural repulsion → trembling and shivering → coldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS3","text":"Yielding of flesh or resistance of flesh → relative determination of soft or hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS4","text":"Square base + density → greatest resistance to impact → hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS5","text":"Bodily mass + motion → relation to below/above → definition of heaviness/lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS6","text":"Spherical heaven → equal distance of the extremities from the middle → abolition of absolute above/below → correct relational naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","text":"Problem concerning sensible affections → reduction to form and motion → mechanical explanation of hot and cold → relativization of hard and soft → cosmological revision of heavy and light → rejection of absolute above and below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","text":"Empirical opposition → natural cause → geometrical arrangement → examination of names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","text":"The affections hot, cold, hard, and soft are reclassified as results of relations and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","text":"The distinction between absolute and relative is transferred from matter to cosmological naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3","text":"The opposition above/below ceases to be a universal map and becomes a local or relational distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME4","text":"The middle and the periphery are recognized as geometrical positions, not as anthropomorphic directions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","text":"The correctness of names depends on their correspondence to the structure of the cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT1","text":"Visible level: the affections of hot, cold, hard, soft, heavy, and light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2","text":"Structural level: forms, magnitudes, motions, compressions, repulsions, and relations to flesh and place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: natural and geometrical analysis tests common names and prevents their absolute use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: sensible affections are conceived as coming to be from changes in motion, in matter, and in cosmic symmetry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT1","text":"The proposed principles suffice for reconstructing the course from form and motion to natural affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT2","text":"The articulation preserves the transition from hot and cold to hard and soft, and thence to heavy and light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT3","text":"The final cosmological refutation of absolute above and below follows consistently from spherical symmetry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","text":"The precise natural sequence through which coagulation is transformed into cold remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent, but already presupposes the geometrical principle of the spherical cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT6","text":"The strongest movement of the argument is the shift from absolute qualities to relational natural events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_41:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_41@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_41:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 62"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 46","title":"Section 62","context":"Chapter 46","original_title":"Section 62","original_context":"Chapter 46"},"original_title":"Section 62","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42","layer":"CH","title":"Section 63","order":47,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_42"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_42@R001","sha256":"566a8e99977c301573f157a299fe3976b084649e27e9adf50f0fb6579ca381ad","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅτι τὰ ἄνω καὶ κάτω ὡς καθολικοὶ τόποι ἀσύμβατα φαίνονται πρὸς τὴν σφαιροειδῆ τοῦ παντὸς μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἀναπλαισιοῦται διὰ τῶν φυσικῶν κινήσεων καὶ τῶν συγγενῶν τόπων τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαιότης τῆς κινήσεως ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν σχέσιν τοῦ φερομένου πρὸς τὸ ὅμοιον ἢ ἀνόμοιον περιβάλλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS4","text":"Τὸ μικρότερον ῥᾷον βιάζεται εἰς τὸ ἀνόμοιον, τὸ δὲ μεῖζον ἀντιστέλλεται μᾶλλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS5","text":"Οἱ ὅροι βαρύ, κοῦφον, κάτω καὶ ἄνω δηλοῦσι σχέσεις φυσικῆς φορᾶς καὶ τόπου, οὐκ ἀπόλυτα χωρικὰ γνωρίσματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","text":"Τὸ πᾶν σφαιροειδές ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A2","text":"Ἐν τῷ σφαιροειδεῖ παντὶ ἡ καθολικὴ ὁμοιότης τῶν ἐσχάτων ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἀπόλυτον διάκρισιν ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","text":"Ἕκαστον γένος ἔχει συγγενῆ τόπον, πρὸς ὃν ἡ φυσικὴ αὐτοῦ κίνησις φέρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀπομάκρυνσις ἀπὸ τὸ συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ ἀνόμοιον γίνεται βίᾳ καὶ παρὰ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ δύναμις τὸ μικρότερον μέρος ῥᾷον ἀναγκάζει ἢ τὸ μεῖζον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A6","text":"Τὸ μεῖζον μέρος ὑπὸ τῆς βίας κατατεινόμενον μᾶλλον ἀντιτείνει καὶ βραδύτερον συνέπεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","text":"Ἡ πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ὁδὸς τὸ φερόμενον βαρὺ ποιεῖ καὶ τὸν οἰκεῖον τόπον κάτω σημαίνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A8","text":"Ἡ πρὸς τὸ ἀνόμοιον βιαία μεταφορά τὸ φερόμενον κοῦφον καλεῖ καὶ τὸν ἀναγκαστικὸν τόπον ἄνω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A9","text":"Τὰ ἄνω καὶ κάτω, τὰ βαρέα καὶ κοῦφα, πρὸς τὰ γένη καὶ τοὺς τόπους αὐτῶν διαφόρως ἀντιπαρατίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","text":"Οἱ φυσικοὶ ὅροι τῶν τόπων ἐκ τῶν τρόπων κινήσεως καὶ ἀντιστάσεως ἐρμηνεύονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX1","text":"Τὸ ἄνω οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπόλυτος τόπος τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX2","text":"Τὸ κάτω οὐκ ἔστιν ἑνὶ τρόπῳ ὁριζόμενον πρὸς πάντα τὰ γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX3","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ περιφορά περὶ τὸ πᾶν οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει μίαν ἀκίνητον καθολικὴν διεύθυνσιν ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX4","text":"Τὸ βαρὺ οὐκ ὁρίζεται χωρὶς τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς τὸ συγγενές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX5","text":"Τὸ κοῦφον οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀπόλυτον ἰδιότητα ἀνεξάρτητον ἀπὸ τὸν τόπον καὶ τὴν βίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6","text":"Ἡ βιαία μεταφορὰ οὐκ ἔχει τὸ αὐτὸ νόημα μὲ τὴν φυσικὴν φορὰν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX7","text":"Οἱ ὀνομασίαι ἄνω, κάτω, βαρὺ καὶ κοῦφον οὐκ ἀναφέρονται ἀδιακρίτως εἰς πάντα τὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ πᾶν σφαιροειδές ἐστιν καὶ τὰ ἔσχατα ὁμοιόμορφα, ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἄνω καὶ κάτω γίνεται σχετική πρὸς τὴν θέσιν τοῦ παρατηροῦντος καὶ τοῦ κινούμενου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον γένος ἔχει συγγενῆ τόπον, ἡ φυσικὴ κίνησις ἑκάστου σώματος ὁρίζει τὸ οἰκεῖον κάτω αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ πρὸς τὸ ἀνόμοιον κίνησις γίνεται βίᾳ, τὸ ἄνω δηλοῖ τὸν τόπον εἰς ὃν τὸ σῶμα ἀναγκάζεται ἀπομακρυνόμενον ἀπὸ τὸ συγγενές.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ μικρότερον ῥᾷον μετακινείται, ἡ αὐτὴ δύναμις ποιεῖ τὸ μικρὸν κοῦφον καὶ τὸ πολὺ βαρύτερον κατὰ τὴν ἀναγκαστικὴν μεταφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","CH_JP8E_S_42:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ οἱ τόποι τῶν γενῶν ἀντιτίθενται, τὸ κοῦφον ἐν ἑτέρῳ τόπῳ δύναται νὰ συμπέσῃ μὲ τὸ βαρὺ ἐν ἀντιθέτῳ τόπῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ φυσικὴ ὁδὸς ὁρίζει τὸ βάρος καὶ τὸ κάτω, ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία τῶν χωρικῶν ἀντιθέσεων ἀκολουθεῖ τὰ πάθη τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","text":"Ἡ χωρικὴ τάξις τοῦ παντὸς παράγεται ἀπὸ σχεσιακὰ πρότυπα φυσικῆς κινήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπὸ μίαν ἐνιαίαν ἐξωτερικὴν διεύθυνσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2","text":"Ἡ σημασία τῶν θεμελιωδῶν χωρικῶν ὅρων μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν θέσιν εἰς τὴν αἰτιακὴν φοράν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_42:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ κόσμου συνυπάρχει μὲ πολλαπλὰ καὶ ἀντιθετικὰ συστήματα φυσικῶν τόπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία τοῦ ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἀποτελεῖ ἐρμηνευτικὴν ἀφαίρεσιν ἀπὸ ἐπαναλαμβανόμενα πάθη βίας, ἀντιστάσεως καὶ φυσικῆς ἐπιστροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ σφαιρικότης ἐπιβάλλει μίαν κοινὴν ἀρχὴν προσανατολισμοῦ εἰς πάντα τὰ σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ ἀντίστασις ἢ ἡ μετακίνησις νοεῖται χωρὶς σχέσεως πρὸς τὴν φύσιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ταύτισιν γεωμετρικῆς κατευθύνσεως καὶ φυσικῆς ἀξίας τοῦ τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἀνεξαρτησίαν τῶν ὀνομάτων ἀπὸ τὰ φαινόμενα κινήσεως δι’ ὧν ἐφαρμόζονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ἑνιαίαν μέτρησιν τοῦ βάρους καὶ τῆς κουφότητος ἔξωθεν τῶν ἀντιθέσεων τῶν συγγενῶν τόπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἕνα ἀπόλυτον ἄνω καὶ κάτω, ἃ δύνανται νὰ ἰσχύωσιν ὁμοίως διὰ πᾶσαν φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης καθολικῆς χωρικῆς ὀνοματολογίας ἀνεξαρτήτου ἀπὸ τὰ γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ διάκριση μεταξὺ φυσικῆς φορᾶς καὶ βιαίας μεταφορᾶς ὡς ἁπλοῦ γεωμετρικοῦ προσανατολισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἕνας τόπος ὃς ἂν ἦν ἄνω ἢ κάτω καθ’ αὑτὸν, πρὶν ὁρισθῇ διὰ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς συγγενῆ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS1","text":"Σφαιροειδὲς πᾶν → ἀναίρεσις ἀπολύτου ἄνω/κάτω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2","text":"Συγγενὴς φύσις → οἰκεῖος τόπος → φυσικὴ φορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS3","text":"Ἀπομάκρυνσις πρὸς ἀνόμοιον → βία καὶ ἀντίστασις → σχετικὸν βάρος καὶ κουφότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS4","text":"Μέγεθος σώματος + κοινὴ δύναμις → διαφορὰ εὐκινησίας → διαφορὰ ὀνομασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5","text":"Πολλαπλοὶ συγγενεῖς τόποι → ἀντιθετικαὶ κατευθύνσεις → σχεσιακὴ κοσμικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","text":"Ἀπορία περὶ ἀπολύτου ἄνω/κάτω → σφαιρικὴ ἀναπλαισίωσις → συγγενεῖς τόποι τῶν γενῶν → φυσικὴ καὶ βιαία κίνησις → σχετικὸν βάρος καὶ κουφότης → ἀντιθετικὴ χωρικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","text":"Ὁ γεωμετρικὸς χάρτης τοῦ κόσμου μετασχηματίζεται εἰς χάρτην σχεσιακῶν φυσικῶν φορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἄνω/κάτω παύει νὰ εἶναι καθολικὴ καὶ γίνεται πολλαπλῶς ἀναφερομένη πρὸς τὰ γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3","text":"Τὸ βάρος καὶ ἡ κουφότης ἀναταξινομοῦνται ὡς ἀποτελέσματα σχέσεως φύσεως, τόπου καὶ βίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ παντὸς δὲν καταργεῖ τὴν τοπικὴν ἀντίθεσιν, ἀλλὰ τὴν παράγει ὡς διαφορὰν συγγενῶν τόπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ ἀνάλυσις ἀφορά τὰ ὀνόματα ἄνω, κάτω, βαρὺ καὶ κοῦφον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἀφορά τὴν σχέσιν φυσικῆς φύσεως, συγγενοῦς τόπου, βίας καὶ ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἀπόλυτον χωρικὴν διχοτομίαν διὰ σχεσιακῆς καὶ συγκριτικῆς ταξινομήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ εἶναι τοῦ τόπου καὶ τῆς κινήσεως νοεῖται ἐκ τῆς φύσεως τοῦ σώματος καὶ τῆς φοράς του πρὸς ἢ ἀπὸ τὸ συγγενές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κυρίας κινήσεως τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν σφαιρικὴν μορφὴν εἰς τὴν σχεσιακὴν σημασίαν τῶν τόπων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διάκρισιν φυσικῆς καὶ βιαίας κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος κατὰ τὸν ὁποῖον ἕκαστον γένος κατέχει τὸν συγγενῆ τόπον αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","text":"Ἡ τάσις μεταξὺ καθολικῆς σφαιρικότητος καὶ πολλαπλῶν σχεσιακῶν κατευθύνσεων παραμένει ἐνεργός, ἀλλ’ οὐ καταστρέφει τὸ σχήμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231047161586Z_658d4797","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 63","source_sha256":"566a8e99977c301573f157a299fe3976b084649e27e9adf50f0fb6579ca381ad","sha256":"b6c0044222be3c40a70a7b701a013b28e38a7bf5c741bf27040a50a8949d7537","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:10:47.162694+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS1","text":"The problem is that up and down, as universal places, appear incompatible with the spherical form of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS2","text":"The distinction between up and down is reframed through natural motions and the cognate places of the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS3","text":"The necessity of motion depends on the relation of the thing moved to a similar or dissimilar surrounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS4","text":"The smaller is more easily forced into the dissimilar, whereas the greater resists more.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AS5","text":"The terms heavy, light, down, and up signify relations of natural motion and place, not absolute spatial features.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","text":"The whole is spherical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A2","text":"In the spherical whole, the universal similarity of the extremities removes the absolute distinction between up and down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","text":"Each kind has a cognate place, toward which its natural motion is borne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","text":"Removal from the cognate toward the dissimilar occurs by force and contrary to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","text":"The same force compels the smaller part more easily than the greater.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A6","text":"The greater part, being strained by force, resists more and follows more slowly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","text":"The path toward the cognate makes the thing moved heavy and signifies its proper place as down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A8","text":"Forced transport toward the dissimilar calls the thing moved light and the compulsory place up.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A9","text":"Up and down, heavy and light, are contraposed differently in relation to the kinds and their places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","text":"The natural terms of places are interpreted from the modes of motion and resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX1","text":"Up is not an absolute place of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX2","text":"Down is not defined in one manner with respect to all kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX3","text":"Circular revolution around the whole does not demonstrate one immovable universal direction of up and down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX4","text":"The heavy is not defined apart from its relation to the cognate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX5","text":"The light does not constitute an absolute property independent of place and force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6","text":"Forced transport does not have the same meaning as natural motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:NX7","text":"The designations up, down, heavy, and light do not refer indiscriminately to all bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D1","text":"Since the whole is spherical and the extremities are uniform, the opposition of up and down becomes relative to the position of the observer and of the thing moved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D2","text":"Since each kind has a cognate place, the natural motion of each body defines its proper down.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D3","text":"Since motion toward the dissimilar occurs by force, up signifies the place into which the body is compelled as it moves away from the cognate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D4","text":"Since the smaller is more easily moved, the same force makes the small light and the large heavier in accordance with compulsory transport.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","CH_JP8E_S_42:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D5","text":"Since the places of the kinds are opposed, the light in one place can coincide with the heavy in an opposite place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:D6","text":"Since the natural path defines weight and down, the naming of spatial oppositions follows the affections of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","text":"The spatial order of the whole is produced from relational patterns of natural motion and not from one uniform external direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2","text":"The meaning of fundamental spatial terms shifts from geometrical position to the causal direction of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_42:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","text":"The unity of the cosmos coexists with multiple and opposed systems of natural places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A1","CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SD4","text":"The naming of up and down constitutes an interpretive abstraction from recurrent affections of force, resistance, and natural return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A5","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the supposition that cosmic sphericity imposes one common principle of orientation upon all bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the supposition that resistance or displacement is conceived apart from relation to the nature of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the identification of geometrical direction with the natural value of place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the independence of names from the phenomena of motion through which they are applied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a uniform measure of heaviness and lightness outside the oppositions of cognate places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1","text":"There is absent an absolute up and down that can hold alike for every nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX2","text":"There is absent the possibility of a universal spatial nomenclature independent of the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX3","text":"There is absent the distinction between natural motion and forced transport as simple geometrical orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX4","text":"There is absent a place that would be up or down in itself, before being defined through relation to a cognate nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS1","text":"Spherical whole → removal of absolute up/down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2","text":"Cognate nature → proper place → natural motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS3","text":"Removal toward the dissimilar → force and resistance → relative heaviness and lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS4","text":"Size of body + common force → difference in mobility → difference in designation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5","text":"Multiple cognate places → opposed directions → relational cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","text":"Puzzle concerning absolute up/down → spherical reframing → cognate places of the kinds → natural and forced motion → relative heaviness and lightness → opposed spatial order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","text":"The geometrical map of the cosmos is transformed into a map of relational natural motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME2","text":"The opposition up/down ceases to be universal and becomes multiply referred to the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3","text":"Heaviness and lightness are reclassified as results of the relation among nature, place, and force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","text":"The unity of the whole does not abolish local opposition, but produces it as a difference of cognate places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT1","text":"Superficially, the analysis concerns the names up, down, heavy, and light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT2","text":"Structurally, it concerns the relation of natural nature, cognate place, force, and resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, it replaces absolute spatial dichotomy with relational and comparative classification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, the being of place and motion is conceived from the nature of the body and its direction toward or away from the cognate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for a reconstruction of the principal movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT2","text":"The derivation preserves the transition from spherical form to the relational meaning of places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence depends on the distinction between natural and forced motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT4","text":"The precise manner in which each kind occupies its cognate place is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","text":"The tension between universal sphericity and multiple relational directions remains active, but does not destroy the schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_42:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_42@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_42:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 63"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 47","title":"Section 63","context":"Chapter 47","original_title":"Section 63","original_context":"Chapter 47"},"original_title":"Section 63","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43","layer":"CH","title":"Section 64","order":48,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_43"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_43@R001","sha256":"5998d5fd3fb4d7f5e221b4be6341d4919bcf812bce8751899a024f2ad3baf7ce","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS1","text":"Τὸ λείον καὶ τὸ τραχὺ ἀνάγεται εἰς σκληρότητα, ἀνωμαλότητα, ὁμαλότητα καὶ πυκνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS2","text":"Τὰ κοινὰ πάθη τοῦ σώματος ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς διαφορᾶς εὐκινήτου καὶ δυσκινήτου φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS3","text":"Ἡ εὐκίνητος φύσις μεταδίδωσι τὸ πάθος διὰ τῶν μορίων μέχρι τοῦ φρονίμου, ἡ δὲ ἑδραία φύσις τὸ πάθος ἀπομονώνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη διακρίνονται κατὰ τὴν φοράν, τὴν βίαν καὶ τὸ μέγεθος τῆς μεταβολῆς πρὸς ἢ παρὰ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS5","text":"Οὐ πᾶν αἰσθητὸν πάθος μετέχει λύπης ἢ ἡδονῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ τὸ πάθος οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A1","text":"Ἡ σκληρότης μετὰ ἀνωμαλότητος ποιεῖ τὸ τραχύ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A2","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης παρέχει τὴν ὁμαλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","text":"Αἱ σωματικαὶ παθήσεις ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ τῆς διαφορᾶς εὐκινήτου καὶ δυσκινήτου φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","text":"Τὸ εὐκίνητον μόριον μεταδίδωσι τὸ πάθος κυκλικῶς ἀπὸ μορίου εἰς μόριον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A5","text":"Ἡ μετάδοσις τοῦ πάθους δύναται νὰ φθάσῃ μέχρι τοῦ φρονίμου, ὅπου δηλοῦται ἡ ποιήσασα δύναμις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","text":"Τὸ ἑδραῖον μόριον οὔτε μεταδίδωσι τὸ πάθος οὔτε κινεῖ τὰ πλησίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","text":"Τὸ ἀθρόον καὶ βίαιον παρὰ φύσιν πάθος ποιεῖ λύπην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A8","text":"Τὸ ἀθρόον καὶ εἰς φύσιν ἐπανιὸν πάθος ποιεῖ ἡδονήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","text":"Τὸ κατὰ μικρὸν γιγνόμενον πάθος καθίσταται ἀναίσθητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","text":"Τὸ εὐπετῶς γιγνόμενον πάθος δύναται εἶναι αἰσθητὸν ἄνευ λύπης καὶ ἡδονῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A11","text":"Ἡ ὄψις καὶ ἡ ἀκοὴ ἰσχυροτέραν ἔχουσι δύναμιν πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A12","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ ἡδονὴ ἢ λύπη ἀποτελοῦσι διακεκριμένα, οὐ ταὐτά, πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX1","text":"Τὸ τραχὺ οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς μόνην τὴν σκληρότητα, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει καὶ ἀνωμαλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX2","text":"Τὸ ἑδραῖον μόριον οὐ μεταδίδωσι τὸ πάθος εἰς τὸ ὅλον ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX3","text":"Οὐ πᾶν πάθος τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἐστὶν ἡδὺ ἢ λυπηρόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX4","text":"Τὸ βραδὺ καὶ κατὰ μικρὸν γιγνόμενον πάθος οὐκ ἀναγκαίως γίνεται αἰσθητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX5","text":"Ἡ ὄψις οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ βίας ἐν τῇ διακρίσει καὶ συγκρίσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX6","text":"Αἱ σωματικαὶ μεταβολαὶ οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἅπασαι τὸ αὐτὸ αἰσθητικὸν καὶ παθητικόν ἀποτέλεσμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D1","text":"Ἐὰν πάθος ἐμπέσῃ εἰς εὐκίνητον φύσιν, ἡ ἐνέργεια τοῦ πάθους ἐπεκτείνεται πέραν τοῦ πρώτου μορίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D2","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ μετάδοσις φθάσῃ μέχρι τοῦ φρονίμου, τὸ ζῷον δύναται νὰ ἀναγγείλῃ τὴν αἰτίαν τοῦ πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D3","text":"Ἐὰν τὰ μόρια μὴ μεταδίδωσι τὸ πάθος, τὸ πάθος μένει τοπικὸν καὶ τὸ ὅλον ζῷον ἀναίσθητον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D4","text":"Ἡ λύπη σημαίνει βιαίαν ἀπομάκρυνσιν ἀπὸ τῆς φύσεως, ἡ δὲ ἡδονὴ βιαίαν ἐπάνοδον εἰς αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D5","text":"Ἡ βαθμὴ τῆς αἰσθήσεως οὐ καθορίζει μόνη τὴν βαθμὴν τῆς ἡδονῆς ἢ τῆς λύπης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D6","text":"Τὰ μόρια τὰ πλείστον γήϊνα ὄντα, οἷον ὀστᾶ καὶ τρίχες, ἀνάγονται πρὸς τὴν δυσκίνητον ἑδραῖαν φύσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D7","text":"Ἡ ὄψις καὶ ἡ ἀκοὴ ἐμφανέστερον αἰσθάνονται διὰ τὴν μείζονα δύναμιν πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος ἐν αὐταῖς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ αἴσθησις συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἁλυσὶς μεταδόσεως, ἧς τὸ τέλος εἶναι ἡ γνωστικὴ ἀναγγελία τῆς αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀναισθησία οὐ σημαίνει ἀπουσίαν πάθους, ἀλλὰ ἀποτυχίαν τοῦ πάθους νὰ διαδοθῇ διὰ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD3","text":"Τὸ κριτήριον τῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ τῆς λύπης εἶναι δυναμικόν: ἡ φορά, ἡ βία καὶ ἡ σχέσις πρὸς τὴν φύσιν ὑπερέχουσι τῆς γυμνῆς αἰσθητότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A8","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","CH_JP8E_S_43:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰσθήσεως, λύπης καὶ ἡδονῆς ἀποτρέπει τὴν ἀναγωγὴν πάντων τῶν παθημάτων εἰς ἓν πάθος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX1","text":"Τὸ πάθος οὐ θεωρεῖται ὡς ἁπλῶς ἐνυπάρχον ἐν ἑνὶ κέντρῳ τοῦ σώματος· ἡ ἐμφάνισίς του ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ μετάδοσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀναγνώρισις τῆς αἰτίας οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ παντὶ σωματικῷ πάθει, ἀλλὰ μόνον τῷ διαδιδομένῳ μέχρι τοῦ φρονίμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη οὐρίζονται οὐχὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἔντασιν τῆς αἰσθήσεως μόνην, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὴν φυσικὴν κατεύθυνσιν τῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἐνιαία ἐστὶ κατὰ τὴν κινητικότητα· ἡ αἰσθητικὴ λειτουργία προϋποθέτει ἀνομοιογένειαν μορίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ, τοῦ συναισθηματικοῦ καὶ τοῦ γνωστικοῦ ἐπιπέδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται σώμα ὅλον ὁμοίως κινητὸν καὶ ὁμοίως παθητικόν· ἡ καθολικὴ αἴσθησις προϋποθέτει διαφορὰς κινητικότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη εἶναι ἁπλαὶ ἀντιδράσεις εἰς οἱανδήποτε αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς σωματικῆς αἰσθήσεως εἰς ἄνευ διακρίσεως ἐπιβολὴν βίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","text":"Σωματικὴ σύστασις → διαφορὰ εὐκινήτου καὶ ἑδραίου → μετάδοσις ἢ ἀπομόνωσις πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2","text":"Πάθος ἐν εὐκινήτῳ μορίῳ → κυκλικὴ μετάδοσις → ἄφιξις εἰς τὸ φρόνιμον → ἀναγγελία τῆς ποιησάσης δυνάμεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3","text":"Πάθος ἐν ἑδραίῳ μορίῳ → ἀπουσία μεταδόσεως → τοπικὴ πάθησις → ἀναισθησία τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4","text":"Μεταβολὴ παρὰ φύσιν καὶ βιαία → λύπη· μεταβολὴ εἰς φύσιν καὶ βιαία → ἡδονή· μεταβολὴ βραδεῖα → ἀναισθησία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS5","text":"Εὐπετὴς μεταβολὴ → σαφὴς αἴσθησις χωρὶς ἡδονὴν ἢ λύπην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","text":"Λεῖον/τραχύ → σωματικὴ αἰτιότης → εὐκίνητον/ἑδραῖον → μετάδοσις/ἀπομόνωσις → αἴσθησις ἢ ἀναισθησία → ἡδονὴ/λύπη ἢ οὐδέτερον αἰσθητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AF2","text":"Διαφορὰ συστάσεως → τρόπος κινήσεως → ἔκτασις τοῦ πάθους → σχέσις πρὸς φύσιν → ποιοτικὸς χαρακτὴρ τοῦ βιώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1","text":"Τὸ σωματικὸν πάθος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ τοπικὴν μεταβολὴν εἰς δίκτυον μεταδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις διαχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἡδονὴν καὶ τὴν λύπην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀναισθησία ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀποτυχία κυκλοφορίας τοῦ πάθους, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀπουσία σωματικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","text":"Τὸ σώμα χαρτογραφεῖται ὡς ἄθροισμα μορίων διαφόρου κινητικότητος, οὐχὶ ὡς ὁμοιογενὴς μηχανή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὄψις καὶ ἡ ἀκοὴ ἐμφανίζονται ὡς ἰδιαίτερα αἰσθητήρια διὰ τὴν σύστασιν πυρὸς καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, λείον, τραχὺ, ἡδὺ, λυπηρὸν καὶ αἰσθητὸν διακρίνονται ὡς τρόποι παθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ κινητικότης τῶν μορίων καθορίζει τὴν μετάδοσιν, τὴν ἀπομόνωσιν καὶ τὴν ἐμβέλειαν τοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν περιγραφὴν τοῦ βιώματος εἰς τὸν μηχανισμὸν ὃς παράγει τὴν διάκρισιν αἰσθήσεως, ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ πάθος νοεῖται ὡς κίνησις μεταξὺ παρὰ φύσιν, ἐπάνοδον εἰς φύσιν, καὶ βραδεῖαν ἀναίσθητον μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς κινητικότητος, τῆς μεταδόσεως καὶ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς φύσιν ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κύριου ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰσθήσεως ἀπὸ ἡδονὴν καὶ λύπην εἶναι ἀναγκαία πρὸς τὴν ἀνασύστασιν τῆς τελικῆς θέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς συσχέτισις τῶν παραδειγμάτων περὶ ὄψεως, τομῶν καὶ καύσεων μένει μερικῶς ὑποκαθορισμένη ἐκ τῆς συμπυκνώσεως τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικό ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν μετάδοσιν τοῦ πάθους καὶ τὴν διάκρισιν τῶν ποιοτήτων αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα περιοχή τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν μικροδομὴν τῶν μορίων εἰς τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν τῆς αἰτίας ὑπὸ τοῦ φρονίμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου: ἀπὸ τὴν σωματικὴν σύστασιν, διὰ τῆς μεταδόσεως, εἰς τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὸν ποιοτικὸν χαρακτῆρα τοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231105421826Z_6a98cd75","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 64","source_sha256":"5998d5fd3fb4d7f5e221b4be6341d4919bcf812bce8751899a024f2ad3baf7ce","sha256":"0142cfbadcf14521fc93ebcf9f8e2e0ca0b3bc62a88fc34641abaadf80432e9e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:11:05.424867+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS1","text":"The smooth and the rough are reduced to hardness, unevenness, smoothness, and density.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS2","text":"The common affections of the body are explained through the difference between mobile and immobile nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS3","text":"Mobile nature transmits the affection through the parts as far as the intelligent part, whereas stationary nature isolates the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS4","text":"Pleasure and pain are distinguished according to the direction, force, and magnitude of the change toward or contrary to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AS5","text":"Not every perceptible affection partakes of pain or pleasure, since sensation and affection are not the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A1","text":"Hardness together with unevenness produces roughness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A2","text":"Density provides smoothness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","text":"Bodily affections are explained through the difference between mobile and immobile nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","text":"The mobile part transmits the affection in a circuit from part to part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A5","text":"The transmission of the affection can reach as far as the intelligent part, where the acting force is indicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","text":"The stationary part neither transmits the affection nor moves the neighboring parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","text":"A sudden and violent affection contrary to nature produces pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A8","text":"A sudden affection returning to nature produces pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","text":"An affection occurring little by little becomes imperceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","text":"An affection occurring easily can be perceptible without pain and pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A11","text":"Sight and hearing possess a stronger power of fire and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:A12","text":"Sensation and pleasure or pain constitute distinct, not identical, affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX1","text":"The rough is not reduced to hardness alone, but also presupposes unevenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX2","text":"The stationary part does not transmit the affection to the whole living creature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX3","text":"Not every perceptible affection is pleasant or painful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX4","text":"An affection occurring slowly and little by little does not necessarily become perceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX5","text":"Sight does not operate through force in discrimination and combination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:NX6","text":"Not all bodily changes have the same perceptual and affective result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D1","text":"If an affection falls upon mobile nature, the activity of the affection extends beyond the first part.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D2","text":"If the transmission reaches as far as the intelligent part, the living creature can report the cause of the affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D3","text":"If the parts do not transmit the affection, the affection remains local and the whole living creature is insensible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D4","text":"Pain signifies a violent departure from nature, whereas pleasure signifies a violent return to it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D5","text":"The degree of sensation alone does not determine the degree of pleasure or pain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D6","text":"The parts that are mostly earthy, such as bones and hairs, are referred to immobile stationary nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:D7","text":"Sight and hearing perceive more clearly because of the greater power of fire and air in them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","text":"Bodily sensation is constituted as a chain of transmission, whose end is the cognitive report of the cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A3","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","text":"Insensibility does not signify the absence of affection, but the failure of the affection to be transmitted through the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD3","text":"The criterion of pleasure and pain is dynamic: direction, force, and relation to nature prevail over bare perceptibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A8","CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","CH_JP8E_S_43:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","text":"The distinction of sensation, pain, and pleasure prevents the reduction of all affections to one affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX1","text":"Affection is not regarded as simply residing in one center of the body; its manifestation depends upon transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX2","text":"Recognition of the cause does not follow every bodily affection, but only that which is transmitted as far as the intelligent part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX3","text":"Pleasure and pain are defined not by the intensity of sensation alone, but by the natural direction of the change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4","text":"The nature of the body is not uniform with respect to mobility; perceptual function presupposes heterogeneity of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX1","text":"The identification of the perceptual, affective, and cognitive levels is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2","text":"A body wholly alike in mobility and alike in susceptibility to affection is excluded; universal sensation presupposes differences of mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX3","text":"The idea that pleasure and pain are simple reactions to any sensation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX4","text":"The reduction of bodily sensation to an indiscriminate imposition of force is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","text":"Bodily constitution → difference between mobile and stationary → transmission or isolation of affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2","text":"Affection in a mobile part → circular transmission → arrival at the intelligent part → report of the acting force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3","text":"Affection in a stationary part → absence of transmission → local affection → insensibility of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4","text":"Change contrary to nature and violent → pain; change toward nature and violent → pleasure; slow change → insensibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS5","text":"Easy change → clear sensation without pleasure or pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","text":"Smooth/rough → bodily causality → mobile/stationary → transmission/isolation → sensation or insensibility → pleasure/pain or neutral perceptible state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:AF2","text":"Difference of constitution → manner of movement → extent of affection → relation to nature → qualitative character of experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1","text":"Bodily affection is reclassified from a local change into a network of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2","text":"Sensation is separated from pleasure and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME3","text":"Insensibility is reclassified as a failure of the circulation of affection, not as an absence of bodily change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","text":"The body is mapped as an aggregate of parts of differing mobility, not as a homogeneous mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ME5","text":"Sight and hearing appear as distinctive senses because of their constitution of fire and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, smooth, rough, pleasant, painful, and perceptible are distinguished as modes of affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the mobility of the parts determines the transmission, isolation, and scope of the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the explanation passes from the description of experience to the mechanism that produces the distinction between sensation, pleasure, and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, affection is conceived as movement between what is contrary to nature, return to nature, and slow imperceptible change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT1","text":"The principles of mobility, transmission, and relation to nature suffice for reconstructing the main argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT2","text":"The distinction of sensation from pleasure and pain is necessary for reconstructing the final position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT3","text":"The precise correlation of the examples concerning sight, cuts, and burns remains partly underdetermined by the condensation of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT4","text":"The system is internally coherent with respect to the transmission of affection and the distinction of its qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","text":"The weaker region of the system is the transition from the microstructure of the parts to recognition of the cause by the intelligent part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument: from bodily constitution, through transmission, to sensation and the qualitative character of affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_43:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_43@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_43:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 64"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 48","title":"Section 64","context":"Chapter 48","original_title":"Section 64","original_context":"Chapter 48"},"original_title":"Section 64","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44","layer":"CH","title":"Section 65","order":49,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_44"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_44@R001","sha256":"ca34bebc9adbfef0f26483d3e78088ceba7a294b1e610c3ca86bc9afe57524cd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ γένεσις τῶν ἡδονῶν καὶ λυπῶν ἐκ τῶν σωματικῶν κινήσεων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς ἀλλοτριώσεως καὶ τῆς εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ κατάστασεως τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS3","text":"Ὁ τρόπος τῆς κενώσεως καὶ τῆς πληρώσεως, ἢ βραδὺς ἢ ἁθρόος, καθορίζει τὸ εἰ αἴσθησις γενήσεται καὶ ποία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS4","text":"Ἡ καθόλου σωματικὴ θεωρία μεταβαίνει εἰς τὰ ἴδια πάθη τῆς γλώττης καὶ τῶν χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS5","text":"Αἱ γευστικαὶ διαφοραὶ παράγονται κυρίως διὰ συγκρίσεων, διακρίσεων, τραχύτητος καὶ λειότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","text":"Τὰ σώματα τῶν μειζόνων μερῶν ἀντιδρῶσιν ἀτελῶς τῷ δρῶντι καὶ διαδίδωσι τὰς κινήσεις εἰς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀλλοτρίωσις τῶν μερῶν γεννᾷ λύπην, ἡ δὲ εἰς τὴν οἰκείαν κατάστασιν ἐπάνοδος γεννᾷ ἡδονήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","text":"Ἡ βραδεῖα κένωσις δύναται νὰ μένῃ ἀναίσθητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A4","text":"Ἡ ἁθρόα πλήρωσις δύναται νὰ γένηται αἰσθητὴ καὶ ἡδίστη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","text":"Ἡ ἁθρόα ἀλλοτρίωσις καὶ ἡ βραδεῖα ἐπάνοδος παράγουσι τὸ ἀντίθετον τοῦ προηγουμένου πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","text":"Τὰ κοινὰ πάθη τοῦ σώματος καὶ τὰ ἴδια πάθη τῶν μερῶν ἀνήκουσιν εἰς τὸ αὐτὸ αἰτιακὸν σχήμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","text":"Τὰ πάθη τῆς γλώττης γίγνονται διὰ συγκρίσεως καὶ διακρίσεως τῶν εἰσιόντων χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","text":"Ἡ τραχύτης καὶ ἡ λειότης ἔχουσιν ἐν τῇ γεύσει προέχουσαν αἰτιακὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A9","text":"Ἡ ἐπίδρασις τῶν χυμῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τοῦ πόσον ἀποξηραίνουσι, καθαίρουσιν ἢ διαλύουσι τὰ ὑγρά μέρη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖται ἐκ πάσης κινήσεως ἢ κενώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ οὐ ταὐτίζεται πρὸς πᾶσαν ἀλλοτρίωσιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX3","text":"Ἡ λύπη οὐ γεννᾶται ἐκ πάσης ἀποχωρήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐκ ῥυθμοῦ καὶ τρόπου μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX4","text":"Ἡ γεύσις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῆν ἰδιότητα τοῦ χυμοῦ χωρὶς σωματικὴν ἀλληλεπίδρασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX5","text":"Ἡ τραχύτης οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ ἀνεξαρτήτως τῆς ἐν τῇ σαρκὶ ξηράνσεως καὶ συστολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX6","text":"Τὸ πικρὸν οὐκ ὁρίζεται ἁπλῶς ὡς τὸ ἁλυκώτερον, ἀλλὰ ὡς ὑπερβαίνουσα ῥυπτικὴ καὶ διαλυτικὴ δύναμις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διαφορὰν μεταξὺ ρυθμοῦ ἀλλοιώσεως καὶ ρυθμοῦ ἐπαναστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_44:A4","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ δύναται νὰ μεγιστοποιηθῇ ὅταν ἡ πλήρωσις εἶναι ἁθρόα, ἐνώ ἡ κένωσις παραμένει ἀναίσθητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_44:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ βλάβη γίνεται κατάδηλος ὅταν ἡ ἀλλοτρίωσις εἶναι ἁθρόα καὶ ἡ ἀποκατάστασις βραδεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","text":"Ἡ γεύσις εἶναι τοπικὴ μορφὴ τοῦ γενικοῦ νόμου τῆς σωματικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D5","text":"Οἱ στρυφνοὶ χυμοὶ συστέλλουσι καὶ ξηραίνουσι τὰ ὑγρά μέρη τῆς γλώττης, ὥστε φαίνεσθαι αὐστηροί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D6","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολικὴ ῥύψις καὶ διάλυσις τῆς φύσεως τῆς γλώττης παράγει τὸ πικρόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D7","text":"Ἡ μετρία ῥυπτικὴ ἐνέργεια παράγει τὸ ἁλυκὸν ἄνευ ἰσχυρᾶς πικρότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","text":"Τὸ πάθος δὲν καθορίζεται μόνον ἀπὸ τὸ τί εἰσέρχεται εἰς τὸ σῶμα, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὸ πῶς ἡ εἴσοδος μεταβάλλει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη ἀποτελοῦσι σχέσεις μεταξὺ κινήσεως, ἀντιστάσεως καὶ ἀποκαταστάσεως, οὐκ ἀκίνητες ποιότητες τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἰδιαίτερη αἴσθησις ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἐξειδίκευσις καθολικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD4","text":"Τὸ μέτρον μετατρέπει τὴν αὐτὴν βασικὴν ἐνέργειαν ἀπὸ ἡδέα εἰς δυσάρεστον ἢ ἀπὸ ἁλυκὴν εἰς πικράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐ θεωρεῖται παθητικὸν δοχεῖον ἀποδεχόμενον ἀναλλοίωτα τὰ ἔξωθεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ ὀνομασία τοῦ πάθους προϋπάρχει τῆς σωματικῆς αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX3","text":"Οὐ χωρίζεται ἡ ἔξωθεν δύναμις ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἀντίδρασιν ἣν προκαλεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεί ἡ ποιοτικὴ διαφορὰ τῶν χυμῶν χωρὶς ποσοτικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις οὐ στηρίζεται εἰς ἁπλὴν ἀντιστοίχισιν ὀνόματος καὶ αἰσθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἰδέα ἀμεταβλήτων αἰσθητῶν ποιοτήτων ἀνεξαρτήτων ἀπὸ τὸ σωματικὸν συμβάν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη ἔχουσιν ἰδίαν αἰτίαν παρὰ τὴν κίνησιν τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX3","text":"Ἡ γεύσις δὲν ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἄμεσος φανέρωσις τῆς φύσεως τοῦ πράγματος, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀλληλεπιδράσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS1","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ ἐνέργεια → κίνησις τῶν μερῶν → διάδοσις εἰς τὸ ὅλον → ἀλλοτρίωσις ἢ ἐπάνοδος → λύπη ἢ ἡδονή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS2","text":"Ρυθμὸς κενώσεως καὶ πληρώσεως → βαθμὸς αἰσθητότητος → μέγεθος τοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS3","text":"Εἴσοδος χυμοῦ εἰς τὴν γλῶτταν → σύγκρισις καὶ διάκρισις → ξήρανσις, καθαρισμὸς ἢ διάλυσις → τραχύτης, αὐστηρότης, πικρότης ἢ ἁλυκότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS4","text":"Ὑπερβολὴ ἐνεργείας → ἀποτήξις τῆς φυσικῆς ἕξεως → πικρόν· μετριότης ἐνεργείας → ῥύψις χωρὶς διαλυτικὴν ὑπερβολήν → ἁλυκόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AF1","text":"Καθολικὰ σωματικὰ πάθη → χρονικὸς τρόπος μεταβολῆς → διάκρισις ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης → μετάβασις εἰς τὰ τοπικὰ πάθη → γεύσις ὡς σύγκρισις καὶ διάκρισις → ταξινόμησις χυμῶν κατὰ μέτρον καὶ ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AF2","text":"Ἀλλοτρίωσις → ἐντόπισις τῆς σωματικῆς ἀντιδράσεως → τραχύτης ἢ λειότης → ῥυπτικὴ ἢ διαλυτικὴ δύναμις → γευστικὸν πάθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἀλλοτριώσεως καὶ ἐπαναστάσεως ἐπαναχαράσσει τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἡδονῆς καὶ τῆς λύπης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καὶ ὁ ρυθμὸς μεταβολῆς καθίστανται ἀναγκαῖες διαστάσεις τῆς αἰσθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME3","text":"Ἡ γεύσις μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα τοῦ ἀντικειμένου εἰς σχέσιν χυμοῦ καὶ σωματικῆς ὑφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις πικροῦ καὶ ἁλυκοῦ ἐρείδεται εἰς τὴν ὑπερβολὴν ἢ τὴν μετριότητα τῆς καθαρτικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ἡ γεύσις ἀποτελεῖ πάθος τῆς γλώττης προκαλούμενον ὑπὸ χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2","text":"Structural — Τὰ πάθη παράγονται ἀπὸ σχέσεις ἐνεργείας, ἀντιστάσεως, ξηράνσεως, διαλύσεως καὶ ἀποκαταστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ὀνοματολογίαν τῶν αἰσθημάτων πρὸς τὴν ἀνασύνθεσιν τῶν αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Τὸ αἰσθητὸν εἶναι γεγονὸς μεταβολῆς, ἐν ᾧ ὁ χρόνος, ὁ ρυθμὸς καὶ ἡ ἐπάνοδος συνδιαμορφοῦσι τὸ πάθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἐννέα ἀξίαι ἀρκοῦσιν ὡς ἐλάχιστος σκελετὸς ἀνασυστάσεως τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ τῶν γενικῶν παθῶν καὶ ἡ μετάβασις εἰς τὴν γεύσιν διασώζονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς διάκρισις μεταξὺ στρυφνοῦ, αὐστηροῦ, πικροῦ καὶ ἁλυκοῦ παραμένει μερικῶς ὑποκαθορισμένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT4","text":"Ἡ σχέσις τραχύτητος καὶ λειότητος πρὸς τὰς ἐπιμέρους γευστικὰς ὀνομασίας δὲν τυποποιεῖται πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὸν ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἐξάρτησιν τοῦ πάθους ἀπὸ τὸν τρόπον τῆς σωματικῆς μεταβολῆς, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀνοικτὴν τὴν πλήρη ταξινόμησιν τῶν αἰσθητῶν ποιοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει τὸ καθόλου σωματικὸν σχῆμα μὲ τὴν τοπικὴν φυσιολογίαν τῆς γλώττης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231127200097Z_c54808ff","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 65","source_sha256":"ca34bebc9adbfef0f26483d3e78088ceba7a294b1e610c3ca86bc9afe57524cd","sha256":"0ace80f953ee158140f0a323670a24a60061396bd487fc66c7950d130e5793cf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:11:27.201553+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS1","text":"The problem is the generation of pleasures and pains from bodily motions and changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS2","text":"Sensation is explained through the alienation and the return to the same condition of the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS3","text":"The manner of emptying and filling, whether slow or sudden, determines whether sensation will arise and what kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS4","text":"The general bodily theory passes into the particular affections of the tongue and of the humours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AS5","text":"Differences of taste are produced chiefly through compression, separation, roughness, and smoothness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","text":"The bodies of the larger parts react incompletely to the agent and transmit the motions to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","text":"The alienation of the parts generates pain, while the return to their proper condition generates pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","text":"Slow emptying can remain imperceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A4","text":"Sudden filling can become perceptible and most pleasant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","text":"Sudden alienation and slow return produce the opposite of the preceding affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","text":"The common affections of the body and the particular affections of the parts belong to the same causal schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","text":"The affections of the tongue arise through the compression and separation of the incoming humours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","text":"Roughness and smoothness possess a predominant causal power in taste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:A9","text":"The effect of the humours depends on how much they dry, cleanse, or dissolve the moist parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX1","text":"Sensation does not arise from every motion or emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX2","text":"Pleasure is not identical with every alienation of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX3","text":"Pain is not generated by every departure, but by the rhythm and manner of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX4","text":"Taste does not constitute a simple property of the humour without bodily interaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX5","text":"Roughness does not operate independently of the drying and contraction in the flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:NX6","text":"The bitter is not defined simply as the saltier, but as an excessive cleansing and dissolving power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D1","text":"Sensation depends on the difference between the rate of alteration and the rate of restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_44:A4","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D2","text":"Pleasure can be maximized when filling is sudden, while emptying remains imperceptible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_44:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D3","text":"Bodily harm becomes manifest when alienation is sudden and restoration slow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","text":"Taste is a local form of the general law of bodily change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D5","text":"Astringent humours contract and dry the moist parts of the tongue, so as to appear harsh.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D6","text":"Excessive cleansing and dissolution of the nature of the tongue produces bitterness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:D7","text":"Moderate cleansing activity produces the salty without strong bitterness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","text":"An affection is determined not only by what enters the body, but by how the entry changes the internal order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD2","text":"Pleasure and pain constitute relations among motion, resistance, and restoration, not immobile qualities of bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A1","CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_44:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD3","text":"Particular sensation is explained as a specification of a universal mechanism of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SD4","text":"Measure transforms the same basic activity from pleasant into unpleasant, or from salty into bitter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A8","CH_JP8E_S_44:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","text":"The body is not regarded as a passive receptacle that receives external things unaltered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX2","text":"It is not assumed that the designation of the affection precedes the bodily cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX3","text":"The external power is not separated from the internal reaction that it causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX4","text":"The qualitative difference of the humours is not sufficient without quantitative and temporal measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX5","text":"Scientific explanation is not grounded in a simple correspondence between name and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","text":"The idea of unchanging sensible qualities independent of the bodily event is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX2","text":"A world in which pleasure and pain have a cause of their own apart from the motion of the parts is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX3","text":"Taste is not recognized as a direct manifestation of the nature of the thing, but as a result of interaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS1","text":"External activity → motion of the parts → transmission to the whole → alienation or return → pain or pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS2","text":"Rate of emptying and filling → degree of perceptibility → magnitude of the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS3","text":"Entry of humour into the tongue → compression and separation → drying, cleansing, or dissolution → roughness, harshness, bitterness, or saltiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:FGS4","text":"Excess of activity → melting away of the natural condition → bitter; moderation of activity → cleansing without dissolving excess → salty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AF1","text":"Universal bodily affections → temporal manner of change → distinction between pleasure and pain → transition to local affections → taste as compression and separation → classification of humours according to measure and activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:AF2","text":"Alienation → localization of the bodily reaction → roughness or smoothness → cleansing or dissolving power → gustatory affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME1","text":"The distinction between alienation and restoration redraws the field of pleasure and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","text":"Time and the rate of change become necessary dimensions of sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME3","text":"Taste is transformed from a property of the object into a relation between humour and bodily texture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ME4","text":"The distinction between bitter and salty rests upon the excess or moderation of cleansing activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT1","text":"Surface — Taste is an affection of the tongue caused by humours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2","text":"Structural — Affections are produced from relations of activity, resistance, drying, dissolution, and restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Explanation shifts from the nomenclature of sensations toward the reconstruction of causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The sensible is an event of change, in which time, rhythm, and return jointly shape the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT1","text":"The nine axioms suffice as a minimal skeleton for reconstructing the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT2","text":"The derivation of the general affections and the transition to taste are preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT3","text":"The precise distinction among astringent, harsh, bitter, and salty remains partially underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT4","text":"The relation of roughness and smoothness to the individual gustatory names is not fully systematized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as it concerns the dependence of affection on the manner of bodily change, but it leaves open the complete classification of sensible qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, because it connects the universal bodily schema with the local physiology of the tongue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_44:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_44@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_44:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 65"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 49","title":"Section 65","context":"Chapter 49","original_title":"Section 65","original_context":"Chapter 49"},"original_title":"Section 65","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45","layer":"CH","title":"Section 66","order":50,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_45"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_45@R001","sha256":"0e64d6e6aad478fd6c5feac7e2df37421f3642c72fbfca4c23da271c43aa0c8a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἀνάγωγη τῶν γεύσεων καὶ ὀσμῶν εἰς σωματικὰ πάθη καὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετατίθησι τὰ ὀνόματα ἀπὸ ἁπλὰς ποιότητας εἰς δυνάμεις, συστάσεις, μεταβολὰς καὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS3","text":"Ἡ δριμύτης παράγεται ἐκ θερμότητος, λεάνσεως, συνεκπυρώσεως, ἀντικρούσεως καὶ ἀνοδίου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS4","text":"Ἡ γλυκύτης παράγεται ἐκ ἐναντίου πάθους, ὅταν ὑγρὰ σύστασις τὰ τραχέα λειαίνῃ καὶ τὰ παρὰ φύσιν συνεστῶτα ἢ κεχυμένα συνάγῃ ἢ χαλᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS5","text":"Ἡ ὀσμὴ οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς ἴδιον εἶδος, ἀλλὰ εἰς μεταβατικὰ σώματα μεταξύ ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS6","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ καπνοῦ καὶ ὁμίχλης ἐξηγεῖται ἀπὸ τὴν κατεύθυνσιν τῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ τὴν σχετικὴν πυκνότητα τῶν ὀσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","text":"Αἱ αἰσθηταὶ ποιότητες ὀνομάζονται κατὰ τὰς δυνάμεις καὶ τὰ πάθη τὰ ἐνεργοῦντα ἐν τοῖς σώμασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","text":"Ἡ θερμότης δύναται λεαίνειν, συνεκπυροῦν καὶ ἀντικρούειν τὸ διαθερμῆναν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A3","text":"Ἡ κουφότης φέρει τὰ θερμανθέντα ἄνω πρὸς τὰς τῆς κεφαλῆς αἰσθήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","text":"Ἡ δριμύτης συνδέεται μετὰ τῆς τομῆς καὶ τῆς βιαίας προσβολῆς τῶν αἰσθητηρίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","text":"Ἡ γλυκύτης ἐστὶν ἴαμα ἐναντίον βιαίων καὶ παρὰ φύσιν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑγρὰ σύστασις ἡ οἰκεία τῇ ἕξει τῆς γλώττης δύναται λειαίνειν, συνάγειν, χαλᾷν καὶ καθιστάναι κατὰ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","text":"Τὸ τῶν ὀσμῶν πᾶν ἡμιγενές ἐστι καὶ οὐκ ἔχει ἴδιον εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","text":"Οὐδεμία τῶν στοιχειωδῶν γενῶν ἔχει καθ᾽ ἑαυτὴν συμμετρίαν πρὸς τὸ ποιεῖν ὀσμήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A9","text":"Αἱ περὶ τοὺς μυκτῆρας φλέβες πρὸς μὲν γῆν καὶ ὕδωρ στενότεραι, πρὸς δὲ πῦρ καὶ ἀέρα εὐρύτεραί εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A10","text":"Ὀσμαὶ γίγνονται ἐν ταῖς μεταβολαῖς τοῦ ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα καὶ τοῦ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A11","text":"Ἡ ἐκ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ μεταβολὴ καλεῖται ὁμίχλη, ἡ δὲ ἐκ ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα μεταβολὴ καλεῖται καπνός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A12","text":"Πᾶσαι αἱ ὀσμαὶ λεπτότεραι μὲν ὕδατος, παχύτεραι δὲ ἀέρος εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX1","text":"Ἡ δριμύτης οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλὴ ἰδιότης ἀποκεχωρισμένη ἀπὸ θερμότητα καὶ κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX2","text":"Ἡ γλυκύτης οὐκ ἔστιν ἀνενέργητος ποιότης, ἀλλ᾽ ἐναντίον πάθος καὶ θεραπεία βιαίων παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3","text":"Ἡ ὀσμὴ οὐκ ἔχει ἴδιον γένος ἢ ὡρισμένον εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX4","text":"Οὐδεὶς ἄνθρωπος αἰσθάνεται ὀσμὴν ἀπὸ γῆς, ὕδατος, πυρὸς ἢ ἀέρος ὡς ἀμεταβλήτων γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX5","text":"Ἡ ὀσμὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ σταθερὸν πέμπτον στοιχεῖον παρὰ τὰ τέτταρα γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX6","text":"Καπνὸς καὶ ὁμίχλη οὐ ταὐτόν εἰσιν, ἀλλὰ διαφέρονται κατὰ τὴν φοράν τῆς στοιχειώδους μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ θερμότης λεαίνει καὶ ἀντικρούει, τὰ ὑπὸ τῆς θερμότητος τοῦ στόματος μεταβαλλόμενα λέγεται δριμέα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ κουφότης τὰ θερμὰ ἄνω φέρει, ἡ δριμὺς δύναμις φθάνει πρὸς τὰ ἐν τῇ κεφαλῇ αἰσθητήρια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A3","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ γλυκύτης τὰ τραχέα λεαίνει καὶ τὰ διεστῶτα συνάγει ἢ χαλᾷ, γίνεται θεραπεία τῶν ἐναντίων παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὀσμὴ ἐστὶ μεταβατικὴ καὶ ἡμιγενής, αἱ ὀσμαὶ γίγνονται κατὰ σήψιν, τῆξιν, ὕγρανσιν ἢ θυμίασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ ῥῖνες στενότερον δέχονται γῆν καὶ ὕδωρ, ἀλλ᾽ εὐρύτερον πῦρ καὶ ἀέρα, ἡ ὀσμὴ ἐνεργεῖ κυρίως ἐν μεταβάσει καὶ οὐκ ἐν μονίμῳ στοιχείῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","CH_JP8E_S_45:A9","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ καπνὸς ἐκ ὕδατος εἰς ἀέρα πορεύεται καὶ ἡ ὁμίχλη ἐκ ἀέρος εἰς ὕδωρ, ὁ καπνὸς λεπτότερος καὶ ἡ ὁμίχλη παχυτέρα κατὰ τὴν ἀναλογίαν τῶν σωμάτων νοεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A11","CH_JP8E_S_45:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα σχέσεων καὶ μεταβολῶν, οὐχ ὡς ἀναγνώρισις αὐτοτελῶν αἰσθητῶν οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις δριμύτητος καὶ γλυκύτητος ἀνασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀντίθεσιν βίαιας διαταράξεως καὶ φυσικῆς ἀποκαταστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","text":"Ἡ ὀσμή, ἐπειδὴ στερεῖται ἰδίου εἴδους, ἀποτελεῖ αἰσθητὸν σημεῖον μεταβάσεως μεταξὺ στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία τῶν αἰσθητῶν ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν φυσικὴν αἰτιότητα τῶν παθημάτων καὶ οὐχὶ τὴν φαινομενικὴν ὁμοιότητα τῶν ἐμπειριῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","CH_JP8E_S_45:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX1","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖται νὰ ἔχῃ ἴδιον καὶ ἀμετάβλητον ὑπόστασιν ἵνα ὀνομασθῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης οὐκ ἐρείδεται εἰς ἀπλὰς ἀντιστοιχίας μεταξύ στοιχείου καὶ αἰσθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ποιότης οὐκ ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ πάθος, τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν διάταξιν τῶν δεχομένων σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἰατρικὴ ἢ φυσικὴ ἀποκατάστασις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἄρσις πάσης κινήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐπαναφορά τῆς κινήσεως εἰς τὸ κατὰ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐμπειρικὴ διάκρισις τῶν ὀσμῶν οὐκ ἐγγυᾶται ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν ἰδίων εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὰ αἰσθητὰ ὀνόματα ἀποκαλύπτουσιν αὐτοτελεῖς οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ὀσμὴ ὑπάρχει ὡς σταθερὸν στοιχεῖον ἀνεξάρτητον μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους τῶν ὀσμῶν ἐμποδίζει τὴν ἀναγωγὴν τῆς αἰσθήσεως εἰς καθαρὰν ταξινομίαν οὐσιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀφήνει ἐκτός τὴν ἀμεσότητα τοῦ αἰσθάνεσθαι ὡς τελικὴν ἀρχήν, ἐπειδὴ ἀπαιτεῖ κρυπτοὺς μηχανισμοὺς μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS1","text":"Στοιχειακὴ σύστασις → θερμικὴ ἢ ὑγρὰ δύναμις → σωματικὴ μεταβολή → προσβολὴ αἰσθητηρίου → ὀνομασία τοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS2","text":"Τραχύτης ἢ παρά φύσιν σύστασις → λείανσις, σύναξις ἢ χάλασις → φυσικὴ ἑδραίωσις → γλυκύτης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS3","text":"Σῆψις, τῆξις, ὕγρανσις ἢ θυμίασις → μετάβασις ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος → ὀσμή → διάκρισις καπνοῦ καὶ ὁμίχλης κατὰ τὴν φοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","text":"Ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους → ἀνάγκη σχεσιακῆς αἰτιότητος → ἀναγωγὴ τῶν ὀσμῶν εἰς μεταβατικὰ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","text":"Ἀκατέργαστα αἰσθητὰ ὀνόματα → φυσικὴ ἀνάλυσις τῶν δυνάμεων → ἀντίθεσις δριμέος καὶ γλυκέος → ἀποκλεισμὸς ἰδίων εἰδῶν τῶν ὀσμῶν → μεταβολὴ ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος → διάκρισις καπνοῦ καὶ ὁμίχλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF2","text":"Πάθος → σωματικὴ κίνησις → σύστασις ἢ διάλυσις → αἴσθησις → ὀνομασία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF3","text":"Σταθερὸν στοιχεῖον ὡς ὑπόθεσις → ἀδυναμία ἐξηγήσεως τῆς ὀσμῆς → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς μεταβατικὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME1","text":"Ἡ δριμύτης καὶ ἡ γλυκύτης μετακινοῦνται ἀπὸ τὸ πεδίον τῶν ἁπλῶν ποιοτήτων εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῶν σωματικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2","text":"Ἡ ὀσμὴ ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς φαινόμενον μεταβάσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἴδιον στοιχειῶδες εἶδος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις καπνοῦ καὶ ὁμίχλης γίνεται διάκρισις κατευθύνσεων μεταβολῆς, οὐχὶ μόνον ὀπτικῶν μορφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογία τῶν αἰσθητηρίων γίνεται ὅρος τῆς ἐξήγησης τῶν αἰσθητῶν διαφορών.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, δριμύτης, γλυκύτης καὶ ὀσμὴ δηλοῦσι διαφορετικὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ταῦτα τὰ πάθη παράγονται ἐκ συστάσεων, κινήσεων, θερμότητος, ὑγρότητος καὶ μεταβάσεων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν περιγραφὴν τῆς αἰσθήσεως διὰ γενετικῆς ἀνακατασκευῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ αἰσθητὰ φαίνονται ὡς σχέσεις μεταβολῆς μᾶλλον ἢ ὡς ἀμετάβλητοι φορεῖς ποιοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ὀσμὴ ὑφίσταται ὡς συμβὰν μεταβάσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς μόνιμος χαρακτήρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ περὶ δυνάμεων, παθημάτων, στοιχειωδῶν μεταβολῶν καὶ αἰσθητηρίων ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ κύριου συλλογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν αἰσθητὴν ὀνομασίαν πρὸς τὴν φυσικὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ τῆς σχέσεως μεταξύ φλεβῶν, στοιχείων καὶ αἰσθητηρίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ μένει ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξύ βιαίας διαταράξεως καὶ φυσικῆς ἀποκαταστάσεως, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ γένεσις τῶν ὀσμῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ συμπυκνωμένην στοιχειολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἰσχυροποιεῖται ὅπου συνδέει ὄνομα, πάθος καὶ κίνησιν, ἀσθενεῖ δὲ ὅπου ἡ ἀπουσία εἴδους ὑποκαθίσταται διὰ ἀναλογίας μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231147315068Z_c8cae57a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 66","source_sha256":"0e64d6e6aad478fd6c5feac7e2df37421f3642c72fbfca4c23da271c43aa0c8a","sha256":"5957ff0fc5a1e18fd3e7397c65d81b473cb3112e4d2368f479ad5982b86f6298","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:11:47.316163+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS1","text":"The problem is the reduction of tastes and smells to bodily affections and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2","text":"The explanation transfers the names from simple qualities to powers, compositions, changes, and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS3","text":"Pungency is produced from heat, smoothing, conflagration, striking-back, and upward motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS4","text":"Sweetness is produced from the contrary affection, when a moist composition smooths the rough things and gathers together or loosens things unnaturally compacted or dispersed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS5","text":"Smell is not reduced to a proper form, but to transitional bodies between water and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AS6","text":"The difference between smoke and mist is explained from the direction of change and the relative density of smells.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","text":"Sensible qualities are named according to the powers and affections that operate in bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","text":"Heat is able to smooth, set ablaze together, and strike back that which has been heated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A3","text":"Lightness carries heated things upward toward the senses of the head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","text":"Pungency is connected with cutting and the violent impact upon the sense-organs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","text":"Sweetness is a remedy against violent and unnatural affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A6","text":"A moist composition congenial to the condition of the tongue is able to smooth, gather together, loosen, and restore according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","text":"The whole class of smells is half-generated and has no proper form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","text":"None of the elemental genera has, by itself, a commensurateness for producing smell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A9","text":"The veins around the nostrils are narrower toward earth and water, but wider toward fire and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A10","text":"Smells arise in the changes of water into air and of air into water.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A11","text":"The change from air into water is called mist, while the change from water into air is called smoke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:A12","text":"All smells are finer than water but thicker than air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX1","text":"Pungency is not a simple property separated from heat and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX2","text":"Sweetness is not an inactive quality, but a contrary affection and a treatment of violent affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3","text":"Smell has no proper genus or determinate form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX4","text":"No human being perceives a smell from earth, water, fire, or air as unchanging genera.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX5","text":"Smell does not constitute a stable fifth element alongside the four genera.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:NX6","text":"Smoke and mist are not the same, but differ according to the direction of elemental change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D1","text":"Since heat smooths and strikes back, things altered by the heat of the mouth are called pungent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D2","text":"Since lightness carries hot things upward, the pungent power reaches the sense-organs in the head.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A3","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D3","text":"Since sweetness smooths the rough things and gathers together or loosens things that are separated, it becomes a treatment of contrary affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D4","text":"Since smell is transitional and half-generated, smells arise through putrefaction, melting, moistening, or exhalation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D5","text":"Since the nostrils receive earth and water more narrowly, but fire and air more widely, smell operates chiefly in transition and not in a permanent element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","CH_JP8E_S_45:A9","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:D6","text":"Since smoke proceeds from water into air and mist from air into water, smoke is understood as finer and mist as thicker according to the proportion of the bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A11","CH_JP8E_S_45:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","text":"Sensation is interpreted as the result of relations and changes, not as recognition of self-subsistent sensible substances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2","text":"The opposition of pungency and sweetness is reshaped into an opposition of violent disturbance and natural restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","CH_JP8E_S_45:A5","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","text":"Smell, because it lacks a proper form, constitutes a sensible sign of transition between elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A7","CH_JP8E_S_45:A8","CH_JP8E_S_45:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SD4","text":"The naming of sensible things follows the natural causality of affections and not the apparent similarity of experiences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:A4","CH_JP8E_S_45:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX1","text":"The sensible need not have a proper and unchanging subsistence in order to be named.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX2","text":"Natural causality does not rest upon simple correspondences between element and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX3","text":"Quality is not separated from affection, motion, and the arrangement of the bodies that receive them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX4","text":"Medical or natural restoration is not the removal of all motion, but the return of motion to what is according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","text":"The empirical distinction of smells does not guarantee an ontological distinction of proper forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1","text":"The hypothesis that sensible names disclose self-subsistent substances is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX2","text":"A world in which smell exists as a stable element independent of change is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX3","text":"The absence of a proper form of smells prevents the reduction of sensation to a pure taxonomy of substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX4","text":"The explanation leaves aside the immediacy of sensing as a final principle, because it requires hidden mechanisms of change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS1","text":"Elemental composition → thermal or moist power → bodily change → impact upon a sense-organ → naming of the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS2","text":"Roughness or unnatural composition → smoothing, gathering together, or loosening → natural stabilization → sweetness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS3","text":"Putrefaction, melting, moistening, or exhalation → transition of water and air → smell → distinction of smoke and mist according to direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","text":"Absence of a proper form → necessity of relational causality → reduction of smells to transitional affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","text":"Unprocessed sensible names → natural analysis of powers → opposition of pungent and sweet → exclusion of proper forms of smells → change of water and air → distinction of smoke and mist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF2","text":"Affection → bodily motion → composition or dissolution → sensation → naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:AF3","text":"Stable element as hypothesis → inability to explain smell → reduction to transitional coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME1","text":"Pungency and sweetness are moved from the domain of simple qualities into the domain of bodily affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2","text":"Smell is reclassified as a phenomenon of transition and not as a proper elemental form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME3","text":"The distinction of smoke and mist becomes a distinction of directions of change, not merely of visual forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","text":"The physiology of the sense-organs becomes a condition for the explanation of sensible differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, pungency, sweetness, and smell signify different sensible affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, these affections are produced from compositions, motions, heat, moisture, and transitions of elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the explanation replaces the description of sensation through genetic reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, sensible things appear as relations of change rather than as unchanging bearers of qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, smell exists as an event of transition and not as a permanent character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT1","text":"The principles concerning powers, affections, elemental changes, and sense-organs suffice for reconstructing the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from sensible naming to natural coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3","text":"The precise mechanics of the relation among veins, elements, and sense-organs remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT4","text":"The opposition between violent disturbance and natural restoration remains internally coherent, but the coming-to-be of smells depends upon a condensed elemental theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5","text":"The explanation is strengthened where it connects name, affection, and motion, but weakens where the absence of form is replaced by an analogy of changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_45:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_45@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_45:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 66"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 50","title":"Section 66","context":"Chapter 50","original_title":"Section 66","original_context":"Chapter 50"},"original_title":"Section 66","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46","layer":"CH","title":"Section 67","order":51,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_46"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_46@R001","sha256":"b281f22341181c2275855af60c36ece7ed8cdb9100bd4195ba00502c3246e580","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS1","text":"Τὸ κώλυμα τῆς ἀναπνοῆς καὶ ἡ βίαιος εἰσπνοὴ δείκνυσιν ὅτι τὸ πνεῦμα δύναται χωρὶς ὀσμῆς κινεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη ἀνάγονται εἰς σωματικὰς κινήσεις, αἳ τὸ αὐτὸ μέρος τραχύνουσιν ἢ καταπραΰνουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀκοὴ ὁρίζεται διὰ διαδόσεως πληγῆς ἀερίου διὰ τῶν ὤτων καὶ διὰ κινήσεως ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς πρὸς τὸ ἧπαρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS4","text":"Αἱ διαφοραὶ τῶν φωνῶν ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ τάχους, ὀξύτητος, βραδύτητος, βάρους, ὁμαλότητος, τραχύτητος καὶ μεγέθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS5","text":"Ἡ χροιὰ ἐξηγεῖται διὰ σωματικῶν μορίων ἀπορρεόντων ἀπὸ τὰ σώματα καὶ πρὸς τὴν ὄψιν συμμετρουμένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS6","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις παράγεται ἐκ τῆς σχέσεως μεγέθους τῶν προσπιπτόντων μορίων πρὸς τὰ μόρια τοῦ αἰσθητηρίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A1","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ δύναται νὰ ἐμποδισθῇ καὶ βιαίως νὰ ἐπιστραφῇ πρὸς τὸ ἔσω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","text":"Τὸ πνεῦμα δύναται νὰ χωρίζηται ἀπὸ τὰς ὀσμάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A3","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη εἶναι διαφοραὶ παθήματος ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ σωματικῷ τόπῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","text":"Τὸ πάθημα τοῦ σώματος δύναται νὰ περιγραφῇ διὰ κινήσεως καὶ μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","text":"Ἡ φωνὴ εἶναι πληγὴ διὰ τοῦ ἀέρος μεταδιδομένη διὰ τῶν ὤτων μέχρι τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A6","text":"Ἡ ἀκοὴ εἶναι κίνησις ἀρχομένη ἀπὸ τῆς κεφαλῆς καὶ τελευτῶσα περὶ τὸ ἧπαρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A7","text":"Αἱ φωναὶ διαφέρουσι κατὰ τὸ τάχος, τὴν ὀξύτητα, τὴν βαρύτητα, τὴν ὁμαλότητα, τὴν τραχύτητα καὶ τὸ μέγεθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","text":"Αἱ χροιὰι εἶναι φλόγα ἀπὸ τῶν σωμάτων ἀπορρέουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","text":"Τὰ ἀπορρέοντα μόρια προσπίπτουσιν εἰς τὴν ὄψιν καὶ συγκρίνονται πρὸς τὰ ἐκείνης μόρια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","text":"Ἡ ἰσότης μεγέθους πρὸς τὸ αἰσθητήριον ἀποτελεῖ ἀναισθησίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A11","text":"Τὰ μείζονα καὶ ἐλάττονα μόρια συγκρίνουσιν ἢ διακρίνουσιν τὴν ὄψιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","text":"Τὰ αὐτὰ σωματικὰ πάθη δύνανται ἐν ἄλλῳ γένει νὰ φαίνωνται ὡς ἄλλα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1","text":"Ἡ χωρὶς ὀσμῆς κίνησις τοῦ πνεύματος ἀποκλείει τὴν ταύτισιν παντὸς πνεύματος πρὸς ὀσμήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη οὐκ ἀποτελοῦν πολλάς τινας ἁπλὰς εἰκόνας ἢ πολλὰ εἴδη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX3","text":"Ἡ φωνὴ οὐκ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἄυλος ἢ ἀσώματος σημασία, ἀλλὰ ὡς μεταδιδομένη πληγή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX4","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ τῆς φωνῆς οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς μίαν μόνην ποιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX5","text":"Ἡ χροιὰ οὐκ εἶναι ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ σωματικὴν ἀπόρροιαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX6","text":"Τὰ ἴσα πρὸς τὰ μόρια τῆς ὄψεως οὐκ ἐνεργοῦσιν ὡς αἰσθητὰ χρώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX7","text":"Τὸ φαινόμενον λευκὸν καὶ μέλαν οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς τὸ αὐτὸ πάθος ὡς τὸ θερμὸν, τὸ ψυχρόν, τὸ στρυφνόν, ἢ τὸ δριμύ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ὀσμῆς ἐν τῷ βιαίῳ πνεύματι καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν διάκρισιν τοῦ φορέως ἀπὸ τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ περιεχομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A1","CH_JP8E_S_46:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D2","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη νοοῦνται ὡς ἀντίθετοι τρόποι σωματικῆς ἐνεργείας καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτόνομα πράγματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A3","CH_JP8E_S_46:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D3","text":"Ἡ φωνὴ ἀποτελεῖ σύνδεσιν ἀέρος, ὤτων, ἐγκεφάλου, αἵματος καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D4","text":"Ἡ ταξινόμησις τῶν φωνῶν μετατρέπει τὰ αἰσθητὰ ἀκούσματα εἰς μετρήσιμα γνωρίσματα κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D5","text":"Ἡ χροιὰ γίνεται αἰσθητὴ μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἀπόρροια τῶν σωμάτων ἔχῃ τὸ προσήκον μέτρον πρὸς τὴν ὄψιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D6","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις τῆς χροιᾶς παράγεται ἀπὸ σχέσιν καὶ σύγκρισιν, οὐκ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόρροιαν μόνην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D7","text":"Ἡ ἴση ποσότης μορίων ἀποβάλλει τὸ ἀπορρέον ἀπὸ τὴν σφαίραν τοῦ φαινομένου, ἐνῷ ἡ ἀνισότης παράγει σύγκρισιν ἢ διάκρισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐν γένει ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς ἀποτελεσματικὴ σχέσις σωματικῶν κινήσεων, μεταδόσεων καὶ μέτρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","CH_JP8E_S_46:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὐκ ἔχει ἑνιαίαν ἀρχήν, ἀλλὰ γεννᾶται ἐκ διαφορετικῶν μηχανισμῶν κατὰ τὴν ὄσφρησιν, τὴν ἀκοὴν καὶ τὴν ὄψιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","text":"Ἡ φαινομενικὴ ποιότης ἀναδύεται ἐκ ποσοτικῆς ἀναλογίας μεταξὺ ἐξωτερικοῦ μορίου καὶ ἐσωτερικοῦ ὀργάνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD4","text":"Τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν αἰσθητῶν διαφοροποιήσεων ἐπιβάλλονται ἐπὶ κινήσεων καὶ παθημάτων, ὧν ἡ ὑλικὴ ἀρχὴ δύναται νὰ εἶναι κοινή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A7","CH_JP8E_S_46:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι τὰ αἰσθητὰ εἴδη ὑπάρχουσιν ἀνεξάρτητα ἀπὸ σωματικὰς μεταδόσεις καὶ σχέσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν αἰσθήσεων εἰς μίαν κοινὴν, ἀδιαφοροποίητον ἐσωτερικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἴση ἀντιστοιχία μεταξὺ αἰσθητηρίου καὶ ἀπορροῆς αὐξάνει τὴν αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἀντικειμενικοῦ πάθους καὶ ὑποκειμενικῆς φαντασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπαίτησις ὅτι ἕκαστον ὄνομα αἰσθητοῦ ἀντιστοιχεῖ πρὸς ἴδιον καὶ ἀμιγὲς φυσικὸν γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀμεσοῦς προσβάσεως εἰς τὰ πράγματα δομεῖ τὴν αἴσθησιν ὡς ἐνδιάμεσον μηχανισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία σταθερᾶς ταυτότητος μεταξὺ πάθους καὶ φαινομένου καθιστᾷ τὸ αἰσθητὸν ἐξαρτώμενον ἀπὸ σχέσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναβαλλομένη ἐξήγησις τῆς συμφωνίας ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι ἡ παροῦσα ταξινόμησις τῶν φωνῶν μένει ἀτελής.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","text":"Τὸ μὴ ὀνομαζόμενον ὑπόβαθρον τῆς θεωρίας εἶναι ἡ ἀνάγκη μεταφράσεως τῶν ποιοτήτων εἰς κινήσεις, μέτρα καὶ ἀναλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1","text":"Κώλυμα ἀναπνοῆς → βίαιος ἐπιστροφὴ πνεύματος → χωρισμὸς πνεύματος καὶ ὀσμῆς → διάκρισις ὀσμῆς καὶ φορέως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS2","text":"Σωματικὴ κίνησις → τραχύτης ἢ πραΰτης τοῦ αὐτοῦ τόπου → πάθος λύπης ἢ ἡδονῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS3","text":"Πληγὴ ἀέρος → διάδοσις διὰ ὤτων, ἐγκεφάλου καὶ αἵματος → κίνησις πρὸς τὸ ἧπαρ → ἀκοή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS4","text":"Μεταβολὴ κινήσεως → τάχος, ὀξύτης, βάρος, ὁμαλότης, τραχύτης, μέγεθος → διαφοροποίησις φωνῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5","text":"Ἀπόρροια σώματος → πρόσπτωσις εἰς ὄψιν → σύγκρισις μεγέθους → ἀναισθησία, σύγκρισις ἢ διάκρισις → χροιά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6","text":"Κοινὸν σωματικὸν πάθος → ἑτέρα γένεσις → διάφορος φαντασία → διαφοροποίησις ὀνομάτων καὶ φαινομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AF1","text":"Ἀμφιβολία περὶ τοῦ φορέως τῆς αἰσθήσεως → χωρισμὸς φορέως καὶ περιεχομένου → ἀναγωγὴ τῶν παθημάτων εἰς κινήσεις → ὁρισμὸς τῆς ἀκοῆς διὰ μεταδόσεως → ὁρισμὸς τῆς χροιᾶς διὰ ἀναλογίας μορίων → γενικὴ ἐξάρτησις τοῦ φαινομένου ἀπὸ σχέσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1","text":"Ἡ ὀσμή, ἡ φωνή, ἡ ἡδονή, ἡ λύπη καὶ ἡ χροιὰ μεταφέρονται ἀπὸ τὴν σφαῖραν τῶν ἀδιαίρετων ποιοτήτων εἰς τὴν σφαῖραν τῶν μηχανικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις χαρτογραφεῖται ὡς διαδοχὴ μεταδόσεων μεταξὺ σώματος, ὀργάνου καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἰσότης καὶ ἡ ἀνισότης τῶν μορίων καθίστανται κριτήρια ἀναισθησίας, συγκρίσεως καὶ διακρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ τῶν αἰσθήσεων γίνεται λειτουργικὴ καὶ ὄχι οὐσιολογική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αὐτὴ ὑλικὴ κίνησις δύναται νὰ φανῇ ἄλλως ἐν ἄλλῳ γένει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορά εἰς τὴν μελλοντικὴν συμφωνία ἀναστέλλει τὴν τελικὴν ἐνοποίησιν τῆς θεωρίας τῶν φωνῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐξηγοῦνται ἡ ὀσμή, ἡ ἡδονή, ἡ λύπη, ἡ φωνὴ καὶ ἡ χροιά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ αἴσθησις συγκροτεῖται ἐκ μεταδόσεως, σωματικῆς κινήσεως, ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀντιδράσεως ὀργάνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ θεωρία μετατρέπει τὰ ποιοτικὰ ὀνόματα εἰς ταξινομίαν φυσικῶν διαφορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ φαινόμενον οὔτε ταὐτίζεται ἁπλῶς πρὸς τὸ ἐξωτερικὸν πράγμα οὔτε χωρίζεται ἀπὸ αὐτό, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἐν σχέσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἐξήγησις κινείται ἀπὸ τὸ ἤδη λεχθὲν περὶ ὄψεως πρὸς τὸ ὕστερον λεχθησόμενον περὶ συμφωνίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ σωματικοῦ ἐρεθίσματος πρὸς αἰσθητὸν φαινόμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ φορέως, μεταδόσεως, ὀργάνου καὶ παθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς γένεσις τῆς συμφωνίας τῶν φωνῶν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ μένει ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς σχεσιακῆς αἰσθήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ ποσοτικὴν ἀναλογίαν εἰς ποιοτικὸν φαινόμενον συμπυκνοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν πορείαν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ οὐχὶ πλήρη φυσιολογικὴν ἀπόδειξιν τῶν μηχανισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231206526935Z_aacfb953","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 67","source_sha256":"b281f22341181c2275855af60c36ece7ed8cdb9100bd4195ba00502c3246e580","sha256":"ee966db8bafedc9ea71ba36e1bfbf4a4654a5f1a5a4a1183edb171ce09baac6f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:12:06.527879+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS1","text":"The obstruction of breathing and the forcible inhalation show that air can move without smell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS2","text":"Pleasure and pain are reduced to bodily movements, which roughen or soothe the same part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS3","text":"Hearing is defined through the transmission of an aerial blow through the ears and through motion from the head toward the liver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS4","text":"The differences among sounds are explained through speed, sharpness, slowness, heaviness, smoothness, roughness, and magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS5","text":"Colour is explained through bodily particles flowing off from bodies and proportioned to sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AS6","text":"Sensation is produced from the relation of the magnitude of the impinging particles to the particles of the sense-organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A1","text":"Breathing can be obstructed and forcibly turned back inward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","text":"Air can be separated from smells.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A3","text":"Pleasure and pain are differences of affection in the same bodily place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","text":"The affection of the body can be described through motion and change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","text":"Sound is a blow transmitted through the air by way of the ears as far as the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A6","text":"Hearing is a motion beginning from the head and ending around the liver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A7","text":"Sounds differ in speed, sharpness, heaviness, smoothness, roughness, and magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","text":"Colours are a flame flowing off from bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","text":"The flowing-off particles impinge upon sight and are compared with its particles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","text":"Equality of magnitude relative to the sense-organ constitutes insensibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A11","text":"The larger and smaller particles compare or distinguish sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","text":"The same bodily affections can appear as different in another kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1","text":"The motion of air without smell excludes the identification of every air-current with smell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX2","text":"Pleasure and pain do not constitute several simple images or many kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX3","text":"Sound is not defined as an immaterial or incorporeal signification, but as a transmitted blow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX4","text":"The difference of sound is not reduced to one single quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX5","text":"Colour is not independent of bodily effluence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX6","text":"Things equal to the particles of sight do not act as perceptible colours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:NX7","text":"What appears white and black does not simply constitute the same affection as the hot, the cold, the astringent, or the pungent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","text":"The absence of smell in forced air makes possible the distinction of the carrier from the perceptible content.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A1","CH_JP8E_S_46:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D2","text":"Pleasure and pain are understood as opposite modes of bodily activity and not as autonomous things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A3","CH_JP8E_S_46:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D3","text":"Sound constitutes a connection of air, ears, brain, blood, and soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D4","text":"The classification of sounds converts perceptible sounds into measurable characteristics of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D5","text":"Colour becomes perceptible only when the effluence from bodies has the fitting measure relative to sight.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D6","text":"The sensation of colour is produced from relation and comparison, not from effluence alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:D7","text":"An equal quantity of particles removes what flows off from the sphere of appearance, whereas inequality produces comparison or distinction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","text":"Sensation in general is reconstructed as an effective relation of bodily motions, transmissions, and measures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A8","CH_JP8E_S_46:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","text":"The perceptible does not have a single principle, but arises from different mechanisms in smell, hearing, and sight.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","CH_JP8E_S_46:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","text":"Phenomenal quality emerges from a quantitative proportion between an external particle and an internal organ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SD4","text":"The names of perceptible differentiations are imposed upon motions and affections whose material principle can be common.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A4","CH_JP8E_S_46:A7","CH_JP8E_S_46:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that perceptible kinds exist independently of bodily transmissions and relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2","text":"The reduction of sensations to one common, undifferentiated internal capacity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX3","text":"The idea that equal correspondence between sense-organ and effluence increases sensation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX4","text":"The absolute distinction between objective affection and subjective appearance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX5","text":"The requirement that every name of a perceptible corresponds to a proper and unmixed natural kind is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","text":"The absence of direct access to things structures sensation as an intermediate mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX2","text":"The absence of a stable identity between affection and appearance makes the perceptible dependent upon relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","text":"The deferred explanation of concord reveals that the present classification of sounds remains incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","text":"The unnamed basis of the theory is the necessity of translating qualities into motions, measures, and proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1","text":"Obstruction of breathing → forcible return of air → separation of air and smell → distinction of smell and carrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS2","text":"Bodily motion → roughness or gentleness of the same place → affection of pain or pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS3","text":"Blow of air → transmission through ears, brain, and blood → motion toward the liver → hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS4","text":"Change of motion → speed, sharpness, heaviness, smoothness, roughness, magnitude → differentiation of sounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5","text":"Effluence from body → impingement upon sight → comparison of magnitude → insensibility, comparison, or distinction → colour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6","text":"Common bodily affection → different generation → different appearance → differentiation of names and phenomena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:AF1","text":"Doubt concerning the carrier of sensation → separation of carrier and content → reduction of affections to motions → definition of hearing through transmission → definition of colour through proportion of particles → general dependence of appearance upon relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1","text":"Smell, sound, pleasure, pain, and colour are transferred from the sphere of indivisible qualities to the sphere of mechanical affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","text":"Sensation is mapped as a succession of transmissions between body, organ, and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME3","text":"The equality and inequality of particles become criteria of insensibility, comparison, and distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4","text":"The distinction among sensations becomes functional and not essential, since the same material motion can appear otherwise in another kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5","text":"The reference to future concord suspends the final unification of the theory of sounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, smell, pleasure, pain, sound, and colour are explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, sensation is constituted from transmission, bodily motion, proportion, and the reaction of the organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the theory converts qualitative names into a taxonomy of natural differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, appearance is neither simply identified with the external thing nor separated from it, but is produced in relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, the explanation moves from what has already been said concerning sight toward what will later be said concerning concord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for a reconstruction of the basic movement from bodily stimulus to perceptible phenomenon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction between carrier, transmission, organ, and affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3","text":"The precise generation of the concord of sounds remains underdetermined, because the explanation is deferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4","text":"The principle of relational sensation remains internally coherent, but the transition from quantitative proportion to qualitative phenomenon is condensed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual course of the argument, but not a complete physiological demonstration of the mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_46:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_46@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_46:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 67"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 51","title":"Section 67","context":"Chapter 51","original_title":"Section 67","original_context":"Chapter 51"},"original_title":"Section 67","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47","layer":"CH","title":"Section 68","order":52,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_47"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_47@R001","sha256":"e51072e5028725039f5b82a9d36221037ad4b4dc8f5505233a323ccaa9511c5b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν χρωμάτων καὶ τῶν παθημάτων τῆς ὄψεως εἰς φυσικὰς κινήσεις, κράσεις καὶ ἀντιθέσεις πυρός, ὕδατος καὶ ὑγρότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS2","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς συναντήσεως τοῦ ἐκπηδῶντος καὶ τοῦ εἰσιόντος πυρός, ὧν ἡ κίνησις καὶ ἡ κατάσβεσις γεννῶσι τὰ φαινόμενα χρώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS3","text":"Τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν χρωμάτων δηλοῦσιν οὐκ ἀπλὰς οὐσίας, ἀλλὰ διαφόρους κράσεις στοιχείων καὶ παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ποσότης τῶν κραθέντων οὔτε ἀνάγκῃ οὔτε εἰκότι λόγῳ ἀνθρωπίνως ἀποδεικτή ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεία φύσις δύναται τὰ πολλὰ εἰς ἓν συγκεραννύναι καὶ τὸ ἓν εἰς πολλὰ διαλύειν, ἡ δὲ ἀνθρωπίνη οὐδετέραν ταύτην δύναμιν ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS6","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς τὰς ἀναγκαίας αἰτίας ὑπηρέτιδας λαμβάνει, αὐτὸς δὲ τὴν εὐταξίαν καὶ τὸ κάλλιστον ἐν τοῖς γιγνομένοις τεκταίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ πυρὸς ἐκ τοῦ ὄμματος ἐκπηδῶντος καὶ πυρὸς ἔξωθεν εἰσιόντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A2","text":"Τὸ ἐκπηδῶν πῦρ διὰ τῶν ὀφθαλμικῶν διεξόδων βίᾳ ὠθεῖται καὶ τήκει αὐτάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A3","text":"Ἡ τήξις τοῦ ὀφθαλμοῦ γεννᾷ ὕδωρ, ὃ δάκρυον καλεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","text":"Τὸ ἐκ τοῦ ὄμματος πῦρ τῷ ἐξωτερικῷ πυρὶ ἀπαντᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις καὶ ἡ σύμμειξις τῶν δύο πυρῶν γεννᾷ τὰ χρώματα καὶ τὰς μαρμαρυγάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A6","text":"Τὸ λευκὸν ὀνομάζεται τὸ διακριτικὸν τῆς ὄψεως, τὸ δὲ μέλαν τὸ ἐναντίον αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A7","text":"Τὸ λαμπρὸν καὶ στίλβον ἐστὶ τὸ αἴτιον τῶν μαρμαρυγῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","text":"Τὸ ἐρυθρὸν παράγεται ὅταν πῦρ μετὰ τῆς ὀφθαλμικῆς νοτίδος κεραννύηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A9","text":"Τὰ λοιπὰ χρώματα παράγονται διὰ διαδοχικῶν μίξεων λευκοῦ, μέλανος, λαμπροῦ, ἐρυθροῦ, ξανθοῦ, φαιοῦ καὶ κυανοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις τῶν χρωμάτων ὑπόκειται σεῖρᾳ ἀναγκαίων αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ ἡ τελικὴ εὐταξία αὐτῶν ἀνήκει τῷ δημιουργῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς μέτρησις τῶν μίξεων ὑπερβαίνει τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην γνωστικήν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A12","text":"Ὁ θεὸς μόνος ἱκανός ἐστιν ἅμα τὰ πολλὰ συντιθέναι καὶ τὰ ἑνιαῖα εἰς πολλὰ διαλύειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX1","text":"Τὸ χρῶμα οὐκ ἔστιν ἀμετάβλητος καὶ ἁπλῆ οὐσία ἀνεξάρτητος τῶν μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX2","text":"Ἡ ὄψις οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ μονῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἐκπομπῆς ἢ μονῆς ἐξωτερικῆς προσπτώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX3","text":"Τὸ δάκρυον οὐκ ἐστὶν ἄσχετον πρὸς τὴν ὀπτικὴν ἐνέργειαν, ἀλλὰ προϊόν τῆς ἐνεργείας ταύτης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX4","text":"Τὰ χρώματα οὐκ ὑφίστανται χωρὶς κίνησιν, ἀντίθεσιν καὶ σύμμειξιν πυρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ποσολογία τῶν χρωματικῶν κραθέντων οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀνθρωπίνως ἐφικτὴν ἐπιστήμην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX6","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος οὔτε τὰ πολλὰ εἰς ἓν ἀκριβῶς συγκεραννύναι οὔτε τὸ ἓν εἰς πολλὰ τελείως διαλύειν δύναται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX7","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὰς ἀναγκαίας φυσικὰς αἰτίας, οὐδὲ ἄνευ αὐτῶν τὸ γιγνόμενον συνίστησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D1","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἐστὶν γεγονὸς σχεσιακὸν καὶ δυναμικόν, οὐχὶ ἰδιότης ἑνὸς μόνου ὀργάνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D2","text":"Τὸ δάκρυον ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ὑλικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς βίᾳ κινήσεως καὶ τῆς τήξεως τοῦ ὀφθαλμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A2","CH_JP8E_S_47:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D3","text":"Ἡ μαρμαρυγὴ δηλοῖ πάθος παραγόμενον ἐκ τῆς ἀλληλεπιδράσεως ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ πυρός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D4","text":"Ἡ χρωματικὴ διαφορά ἀναλύεται εἰς διαφοράν κράσεως καὶ οὐκ εἰς ἑτερογένειαν ἀσύνδετων οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D5","text":"Ἐκ τῶν ὀλίγων πρωταρχικῶν χρωμάτων δύναται εἰκότως παραχθῆναι πλῆθος ἄλλων χρωματικῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A6","CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D6","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος ἐπιτρέπεται ἐκεῖ ὅπου ἡ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς μέτρησις ἀδυνατοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D7","text":"Ἡ θεία δημιουργία συνίσταται οὐκ εἰς ἀπουσίαν αἰτιῶν, ἀλλὰ εἰς κυριαρχικὴν σύνθεσιν καὶ τάξιν τῶν αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις τῶν αἰσθητῶν ποιῶν μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῶν φαινομένων εἰς μηχανισμὸν σχέσεων, μίξεων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀναγκαιότης καὶ ἡ δημιουργικὴ τάξις συνυπάρχουσιν ὡς δύο ἐπίπεδα τῆς αὐτῆς κοσμογονικῆς διαδικασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη γνώσις ὁρίζεται ὡς ἐξάρτησις ἀπὸ εἰκότα λόγον, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πλήρης σύνθεσις καὶ ἀνάλυσις τῶν αἰτίων ἀνήκει μόνον τῷ θείῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD4","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ θεοῦ καὶ ἀνθρώπου ἐντοπίζεται οὐ μόνον εἰς τὸ ποσὸν τῆς γνώσεως, ἀλλὰ εἰς τὴν δύναμιν ἐνεργεῖν ἐπὶ τῆς ἑνότητος καὶ τῆς πολλαπλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX1","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀρχὴν ἀμέθεκτον καὶ ἀκίνητον, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἐκ σχέσεων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις οὐκ ταυτίζεται ἀναγκαίως μετὰ μαθηματικῆς ἀκριβείας περὶ πάντων τῶν ποσοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης οὐκ αὐτομάτως παράγει τὸ κάλλιστον, ἐὰν μὴ ὑπάρχῃ δύναμις συνθετικὴ καὶ τακτική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX4","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν φαινομένων οὐκ ἀποδεικνύει ἀπουσίαν ἑνιαίας γενετικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ ἀνθρώπου οὐκ ἀκυροῖ τὸν λόγον, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει τὸ εἶδος αὐτοῦ εἰς εἰκότα καὶ μετρημένον μῦθον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου τὰ φαινόμενα ἔχουσιν ἀπολύτως ἄσχετον καὶ ἀσύνθετον ἑτερότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἀνθρωπίνη κατοχὴ τῆς κοσμικῆς δυνάμεως συνθέσεως καὶ διαλύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης λόγου ὃς ἅμα ἀναγκαίως καὶ πλήρως ἀποδίδωσι τὰς ἀκριβοῦς ποσοτικὰς σχέσεις τῶν μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX4","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου δὲν ἐκπηγάζει ἐκ τῶν φυσικῶν αἰτίων μόνων, ἀλλὰ προϋποτίθεται ἀρχὴ ἡ ὁποία δὲν ἀναλύεται εἰς τὰ ὑπηρετικὰ αἴτια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS1","text":"Ἐσωτερικὸν πῦρ + ἐξωτερικὸν πῦρ → ἀντίθεσις καὶ σύμμειξις → ὄψις καὶ μαρμαρυγή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS2","text":"Κίνησις πυρός → βίαιος ὠσμὸς τῶν ὀφθαλμικῶν διεξόδων → τήξις → δάκρυον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS3","text":"Πῦρ + ὀφθαλμικὴ νοτίς → ἐρυθρόν → διαδοχικαὶ κράσεις → πολυειδῆ χρώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS4","text":"Πρωταρχικαὶ χρωματικαὶ διαφορὰι → σύνθεσις καὶ ἀφομοίωσις → εἰκὼς λόγος περὶ τῶν λοιπῶν χρωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS5","text":"Ἀνάγκη φυσικῶν αἰτίων + ἀδυναμία ἀνθρωπίνης πλήρους μετρήσεως → περιορισμὸς εἰς εἰκότα καὶ μετρίως λεγόμενον λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS6","text":"Θεία δύναμις συνθέσεως καὶ διαλύσεως + φυσικαὶ αἰτίαι → δημιουργικὴ εὐταξία τῶν γιγνομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AF1","text":"Φαινόμενα χρώματα καὶ ὄψις → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς πυρὸς κινήσεις → ἀντίθεσις καὶ σύμμειξις → γένεσις χρωματικῶν διαφορών → ὅριον ἀνθρωπίνης ποσολογίας → διάκρισις θείας καὶ ἀνθρωπίνης δυνάμεως → δημιουργικὴ τάξις διὰ τῶν φυσικῶν αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AF2","text":"Αἴσθησις → μηχανισμὸς κράσεως → εἰκὼς ἐπιστημονικὸς λόγος → θεολογικὸς περιορισμὸς τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου λόγου → ὑποταγὴ τῶν αἰτίων εἰς δημιουργικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1","text":"Τὸ χρῶμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φαινομενικὴν ποιότητα εἰς παραγόμενον ἀποτέλεσμα φυσικῆς κράσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME2","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἀλληλεπίδρασις ἐσωτερικῆς καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς ἐνεργείας, οὐχὶ ὡς μονόδρομος λήψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια τῆς φυσικῆς ἐπιστήμης διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξήγησιν διὰ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀναγκαιότης ἐντάσσεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν τάξιν, ὅπου τὰ αἴτια ὑπηρετοῦσι καὶ ὁ δημιουργὸς τεκταίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις θεοῦ καὶ ἀνθρώπου μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὸ πεδίον τῆς γνώσεως εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῆς κοσμοποιητικῆς ἱκανότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφάνεια τοῦ λόγου περιγράφει τὴν ὄψιν, τὰ δάκρυα, τὰ χρώματα καὶ τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2","text":"Τὸ δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον ἀναλύει τὰ φαινόμενα εἰς κινήσεις, ἀντιθέσεις, νοτίδα, πῦρ καὶ διαδοχικὰς κράσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT3","text":"Τὸ μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον ὁρίζει πότε ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ ἀρκῆται εἰς εἰκότα ἐξήγησιν καὶ πῶς ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἀναζήτησις ὑποτάσσεται εἰς τὸ μέτρον τῆς δυνάμεως αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT4","text":"Τὸ ὀντολογικὸν ἐπίπεδον προϋποθέτει κόσμον ὅπου ἡ πολλαπλότης γεννᾶται ἐκ συνθέσεων, ἡ ἀνάγκη ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ τάξει, καὶ ἡ τελικὴ εὐταξία ἀνάγεται εἰς δημιουργικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ περὶ διπλοῦ πυρός, ἀντιθέσεως, κράσεως καὶ χρωματικῆς παραγωγῆς ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ φυσικοῦ μέρους τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φυσικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος καὶ δημιουργικῆς τάξεως ἀρκεῖ πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς θεολογικῆς καταλήξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3","text":"Ἡ δομὴ παραμένει ἐλλιπὴς ὡς πρὸς τὰς ἀκριβοῦς ποσοτικὰς σχέσεις τῶν μίξεων, ἐπειδὴ αὐτὰς ὁ λόγος ρητῶς ἀποκλείει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην ἀκρίβειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος στηρίζεται στὴν ἱεράρχησιν τῶν αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ φυσικὸν μοντέλον εἰς τὴν θείαν δημιουργίαν παραμένει ἀναλογικὴ καὶ οὐχὶ πλήρως ἀποδεικτική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου: ἀπὸ τὴν αἴσθησιν εἰς τὸν μηχανισμόν, ἀπὸ τὸν μηχανισμὸν εἰς τὸ ὅριον τοῦ λόγου, καὶ ἀπὸ τοῦ ὁρίου εἰς τὴν θείαν δημιουργικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231226859660Z_69ac2c2a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 68","source_sha256":"e51072e5028725039f5b82a9d36221037ad4b4dc8f5505233a323ccaa9511c5b","sha256":"8fa83f37175d2d8915f49d1d9bed94967bea1b2e6cc54175f8a11bba20e5c6df","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:12:26.860672+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS1","text":"The problem is the reduction of colors and affections of sight to natural motions, mixtures, and oppositions of fire, water, and moisture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS2","text":"Sight is explained through the meeting of the leaping-out and the entering fire, whose motion and extinction generate the apparent colors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS3","text":"The names of colors signify not simple substances, but different mixtures of elements and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS4","text":"The exact quantity of the things mixed is demonstrable by humans neither by necessity nor by a likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS5","text":"The divine nature can blend the many into one and dissolve the one into many, whereas the human nature possesses neither of these powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AS6","text":"The demiurge takes the necessary causes as servants, while himself fashioning order and what is most beautiful in the things coming to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","text":"Sight consists of fire leaping out from the eye and fire entering from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A2","text":"The leaping-out fire is driven violently through the ocular passages and melts them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A3","text":"The melting of the eye generates water, which is called a tear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","text":"The fire from the eye meets the external fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","text":"The opposition and commingling of the two fires generate colors and gleams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A6","text":"White is called that which discriminates sight, and black its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A7","text":"The bright and shining is the cause of gleams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","text":"Red is produced when fire is mixed with the moisture of the eye.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A9","text":"The remaining colors are produced through successive mixtures of white, black, bright, red, yellow, gray, and blue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","text":"The natural generation of colors is subject to a sequence of necessary causes, but their final order belongs to the demiurge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","text":"The exact measurement of the mixtures exceeds human cognitive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:A12","text":"God alone is capable both of combining the many at once and of dissolving unified things into many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX1","text":"Color is not an unchanging and simple substance independent of mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX2","text":"Sight does not operate through an internal emission alone or an external incidence alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX3","text":"A tear is not unrelated to visual activity, but is a product of that activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX4","text":"Colors do not subsist without motion, opposition, and commingling of fires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX5","text":"The exact proportion of color-mixtures does not constitute a science attainable by humans.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX6","text":"A human being can neither blend the many exactly into one nor dissolve the one completely into many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:NX7","text":"The demiurge does not remove the necessary natural causes, nor does he constitute what comes to be without them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D1","text":"Sight is a relational and dynamic event, not a property of one organ alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D2","text":"The tear appears as a material result of the violent motion and melting of the eye.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A2","CH_JP8E_S_47:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D3","text":"The gleam signifies an affection produced from the interaction of internal and external fire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A4","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D4","text":"Chromatic difference is analyzed into a difference of mixture and not into a heterogeneity of unconnected substances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D5","text":"From the few primary colors, a multitude of other chromatic forms can plausibly be produced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A6","CH_JP8E_S_47:A8","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D6","text":"A likely account is permitted where necessity and exact measurement are impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:D7","text":"Divine creation consists not in the absence of causes, but in a sovereign composition and ordering of causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1","text":"The explanation of sensible qualities passes from appearances to a mechanism of relations, mixtures, and changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A1","CH_JP8E_S_47:A5","CH_JP8E_S_47:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD2","text":"Natural necessity and creative order coexist as two levels of the same cosmogonic process.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A10","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD3","text":"Human knowledge is defined as dependence upon a likely account, since the complete composition and analysis of causes belongs only to the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SD4","text":"The difference between god and human is located not only in the amount of knowledge, but in the power to act upon unity and multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A11","CH_JP8E_S_47:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX1","text":"The sensible does not require an unparticipated and unmoved principle, but is produced from relations and changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2","text":"Scientific explanation is not necessarily identical with mathematical exactness concerning all quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX3","text":"Natural causality does not automatically produce what is most beautiful, unless there is a compositional and ordering power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX4","text":"The multiplicity of phenomena does not prove the absence of a unified generative principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX5","text":"Human incapacity does not invalidate the account, but changes its kind into a likely and measured myth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX1","text":"A world in which phenomena possess absolutely unrelated and uncompounded otherness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX2","text":"Complete human possession of the cosmic power of composition and dissolution is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX3","text":"The possibility is absent of an account that at once necessarily and fully renders the exact quantitative relations of mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:SNX4","text":"The order of the cosmos does not spring from natural causes alone, but presupposes a principle that is not analyzed into the serving causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS1","text":"Internal fire + external fire → opposition and commingling → sight and gleam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS2","text":"Motion of fire → violent thrusting of the ocular passages → melting → tear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS3","text":"Fire + ocular moisture → red → successive mixtures → manifold colors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS4","text":"Primary chromatic differences → composition and assimilation → likely account concerning the remaining colors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS5","text":"Necessity of natural causes + impossibility of complete human measurement → restriction to a likely and moderately stated account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS6","text":"Divine power of composition and dissolution + natural causes → creative good order of things coming to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AF1","text":"Apparent colors and sight → reduction to motions of fire → opposition and commingling → generation of chromatic differences → limit of human proportioning → distinction of divine and human power → creative order through natural causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:AF2","text":"Sensation → mechanism of mixture → likely scientific account → theological limitation of human account → subordination of causes to creative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1","text":"Color is reclassified from an apparent quality into a produced result of natural mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME2","text":"Sight appears as an interaction of internal and external activity, not as a one-way reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME3","text":"The exactness of natural science is distinguished from explanation through a likely account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME4","text":"Natural necessity is integrated into a hierarchical order, in which causes serve and the demiurge fashions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ME5","text":"The distinction between god and human is transferred from the field of knowledge to the field of world-making capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT1","text":"The surface of the account describes sight, tears, colors, and the names of affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2","text":"The structural level analyzes phenomena into motions, oppositions, moisture, fire, and successive mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT3","text":"The metastrategic level determines when the account ought to rest content with a likely explanation and how human inquiry is subordinated to the measure of its power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT4","text":"The ontological level presupposes a cosmos in which multiplicity is generated from compositions, necessity serves order, and final good order is referred back to creative power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT1","text":"The principles concerning double fire, opposition, mixture, and chromatic production suffice for reconstructing the natural part of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT2","text":"The distinction between natural necessity and creative order suffices for reconstructing the theological conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3","text":"The structure remains deficient with respect to the exact quantitative relations of mixtures, because the account expressly excludes them from human exactness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence of the system rests on the hierarchy of causes, but the transition from the natural model to divine creation remains analogical and not fully demonstrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account: from sensation to mechanism, from mechanism to the limit of account, and from the limit to divine creative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_47:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_47@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_47:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 68"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 52","title":"Section 68","context":"Chapter 52","original_title":"Section 68","original_context":"Chapter 52"},"original_title":"Section 68","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48","layer":"CH","title":"Section 69","order":53,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_48"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_48@R001","sha256":"18bf201ef0b5a8680807515d59f587531ee1e53b06cb3b8a01a7cf1caa08d1e9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS1","text":"Τὸ ἐπιχειρούμενον πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ διάκρισις τῶν αἰτίων, ὧν ἄνευ τὰ ἀναζητούμενα οὔτε νοηθῆναι οὔτε κτηθῆναι δύναται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαία αἰτία ὑποτάσσεται τῇ θείᾳ, ὡς ὄργανον τῶν ἀνωτέρων σκοπῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS3","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις ἐκ τῆς ἀτάκτου ὕλης τάξιν, ἀναλογίαν καὶ συμμετρίαν παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS4","text":"Ἐκ τῆς κοσμήσεως τῶν στοιχείων συνίσταται ἓν καθολικὸν ζῷον, περιέχον θνητὰ καὶ ἀθάνατα γένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχή προηγείται τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος, ὃ ὡς ὄχημα αὐτῇ προστίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS6","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν μέρος τῆς ψυχῆς συγκροτεῖται διὰ παθημάτων ἀναγκαίων, ἃ τὸ θεῖον μὴ μιαίνῃ διακεκριμένη κατοίκησις περιορίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","text":"Δύο γένη αἰτίων διακρίνεται· τὸ ἀναγκαῖον καὶ τὸ θεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A2","text":"Τὸ θεῖον αἴτιον ζητεῖται ἕνεκα εὐδαίμονος βίου, καθόσον ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις δύναται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","text":"Τὸ ἀναγκαῖον αἴτιον ζητεῖται ὡς ὅρος χωρὶς οὗ τὸ θεῖον τέλος οὔτε κατανοεῖται οὔτε λαμβάνεται οὔτε μετέχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ὕλη ἄτακτος ἐστὶ πρὶν ὁ θεὸς αὐτὴν διακοσμῆσαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","text":"Ὁ θεὸς ἐν τοῖς οὖσιν ἐνότητα, ἀναλογίαν καὶ συμμετρίαν ἐγκαθίστησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","text":"Ἐκ τῆς κοσμήσεως τῶν στοιχείων συγκροτεῖται ἓν σύμπαν ζῷον, περιέχον θνητὰ καὶ ἀθάνατα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","text":"Ὁ θεὸς αὐτὸς δημιουργεῖ τὰ θεῖα, τὴν δὲ γένεσιν τῶν θνητῶν τοῖς ἑαυτοῦ γεννήμασι παραδίδωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀθάνατος ψυχὴ λαμβάνεται ὡς ἀρχή, πρὸς ἣν τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα ὡς ὄχημα κατασκευάζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A9","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν μέρος τῆς ψυχῆς συνίσταται ἐκ ἡδονῆς, λύπης, θάρρους, φόβου, θυμοῦ, ἐλπίδος, αἰσθήσεως καὶ ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A10","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν τῆς ψυχῆς χωρὶς τοῦ θείου ἐνοικίζεται ἐν τῷ θώρακι, ἵνα ὁρὸς ᾖ μεταξὺ κεφαλῆς καὶ στήθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1","text":"Τὸ ἀναγκαῖον οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτάρκης τελικὴ αἰτία, ἀλλὰ προϋπόθεσις τοῦ θείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ὕλη οὔτε κεκοσμημένη οὔτε ἀξιόλογον ὄνομα ἔχουσα ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX3","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἀρχέγονόν τινα αὐτοτελῆ τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX4","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν οὐ συγχέεται τῷ θείῳ μέρει τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX5","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτόνομος οὐδὲ ἄνευ ψυχῆς νοητὴ ἀρχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX6","text":"Τὰ πάθη τοῦ θνητοῦ μέρους οὔτε καθαρῶς ἀγαθὰ οὔτε ἁπλῶς περιττά εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX7","text":"Ὁ θεὸς οὐ ποιεῖ τὴν θνητὴν γένεσιν κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ᾧ τὰ θεῖα δημιουργεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX8","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ κόσμου οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαίρεσιν τῶν ψυχικῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαία αἰτία ἀποκτᾷ σημασίαν μόνον ἐκ τῆς σχέσεως αὐτῆς πρὸς τὸ θεῖον τέλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","CH_JP8E_S_48:A2","CH_JP8E_S_48:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D2","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ μετασχηματισμὸν τῆς ἀτάκτου ὕλης εἰς σχέσεις ἀναλογίας καὶ συμμετρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D3","text":"Τὰ νῦν ὀνομαζόμενα στοιχεῖα γίγνεται νοητὰ ὡς στοιχεῖα μόνον μετὰ τὴν θείαν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D4","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ τοῦ κόσμου ἑνότης περιλαμβάνει ἱεραρχικὴν διαφοράν μεταξὺ ἀθανάτων καὶ θνητῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D5","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ τοῦ ἀνθρώπου ὡς φορεὺς ψυχῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς πρώτιστη ἀρχὴ νοεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D6","text":"Τὰ πάθη τοῦ θνητοῦ μέρους ἀποτελοῦσι λειτουργικὴν σύνθεσιν τῆς θνητῆς ζωῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γένεσις αὐτῆς διʼ αὐτῶν συντελεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D7","text":"Ἡ χωρικὴ διαίρεσις τῆς κεφαλῆς καὶ τοῦ θώρακος ἀποτυποῖ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν τοῦ θείου καὶ τοῦ θνητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὡς ὅλον παράγεται διὰ συνθέσεως δύο ἀρχῶν, ὧν ἡ μία παρέχει τέλος καὶ ἡ ἑτέρα παρέχει ὑλικόν καὶ ἀναγκαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD2","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία εἶναι διαβαθμισμένη: ὁ θεὸς τάσσει τὸ καθόλου, τὰ δὲ θεῖα γεννήματα ἐνεργοῦσι τὴν θνητὴν ἐξειδίκευσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ψυχή φέρει ἐν ἑαυτῇ ἐσωτερικὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἣν ἡ σωματικὴ χωροθέτησις ἐνσαρκώνει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν πάθος καθίσταται ἀναγκαῖον ὄργανον τῆς γενέσεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς ἀναγκαιότητος αὐτοῦ παραμένει κατώτερον τοῦ θείου λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀποφυγὴ μίξεως θείου καὶ θνητοῦ σώζει τὴν ἁγιότητα τοῦ θείου διὰ γεωγραφικῆς καὶ λειτουργικῆς ἀποστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX1","text":"Τὸ ἄτακτον οὐ δύναται αὐτόθεν νὰ παράγῃ κόσμον ἢ νοητὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἰσόκυρον συνδημιουργὸν τῆς θείας τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX3","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ φύσις οὐκ ἔχει ἄμεσον πρόσβασιν πρὸς τὸ θεῖον ἄνευ μεσολαβήσεως καὶ διακρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ ζῴου οὐ σημαίνει ὁμοιογένειαν τῶν μερῶν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX5","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνάγκη οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀναγορευθῇ εἰς τελικὴν ἀξίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX6","text":"Τὸ θεῖον οὐκ ἐμπλέκεται ἀδιακρίτως εἰς τὴν παθητικὴν καὶ ἐπιθυμητικὴν ζωήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης κόσμου ὃς αὐτομάτως ἐκ τῆς ὕλης ἀναδύεται ἄνευ νοῦ καὶ τελικοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδιάκριτος συνέχεια μεταξὺ θείου καὶ θνητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ σῶμα ἢ τὰ πάθη ἀποτελοῦσι τὴν πρωταρχικὴν ταυτότητα τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς τάξεως παραμένει ὑπεράνω τῆς ἀναγκαίας μηχανῆς, ἣν ὅμως ὁ λόγος δὲν δύναται νὰ καταργήσῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS1","text":"Ἄτακτος ὕλη → ἔλλειψις ἀξιολόγου μορφῆς → θεία διάταξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS2","text":"Θεία διάταξις → ἀναλογία καὶ συμμετρία → συγκρότησις καθολικοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS3","text":"Καθολικὸν ζῷον → διάκρισις ἀθανάτων καὶ θνητῶν → καταμερισμὸς δημιουργικῶν ἔργων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS4","text":"Ἀθάνατος ψυχή → σωματικὸν ὄχημα → προσθήκη θνητοῦ ψυχικοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS5","text":"Θνητὸν ψυχικὸν γένος → πάθη καὶ αἴσθησις → ἀναγκαία σύνθεσις θνητῆς ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS6","text":"Ἀναγκαία θνητότης → κίνδυνος μίξεως πρὸς τὸ θεῖον → χωρικὸς διαχωρισμὸς κεφαλῆς καὶ θώρακος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS7","text":"Θεῖον τέλος → ἀναγκαία ὕλη καὶ πάθη ὡς μέσα → δυνατότης εὐδαιμονίας κατὰ τὸ ἀνθρώπινον μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF1","text":"Διάκρισις αἰτίων → ὑποταγὴ τῆς ἀνάγκης τῷ θείῳ → ἀνάκλησις τῆς κοσμογονικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF2","text":"Ἄτακτον ὕλη → θεία κόσμησις → ἀναλογία καὶ συμμετρία → ἓν καθολικὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF3","text":"Καθολικὴ ἑνότης → δημιουργικὴ ἱεραρχία → ἀθάνατος ψυχή καὶ θνητὸν σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF4","text":"Θνητὸν σῶμα → θνητὸν ψυχικὸν γένος → πάθη ἀναγκαῖα πρὸς γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF5","text":"Ἀναγκαιότης παθημάτων → κίνδυνος μολύνσεως τοῦ θείου → χωρισμὸς τῶν ψυχικῶν οἰκήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότητα μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ μονομερῆ ἀρχὴν εἰς ἱεραρχημένην σύμπραξιν θείου καὶ ἀναγκαίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἀδιαμόρφωτον δεδομένον εἰς ὑπόστρωμα ὃ λαμβάνει ὀντολογικὴν σημασίαν διὰ τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME3","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς ὄχημα, ἐνῷ ἡ ψυχή διαιρεῖται εἰς ἀθάνατον καὶ θνητὸν λειτουργικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME4","text":"Τὰ πάθη παύουν νὰ φαίνωνται ὡς ἁπλὰ ἐλαττώματα καὶ γίγνονται δομικαὶ συνθήκαι τῆς θνητῆς ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5","text":"Ὁ χωρικὸς διαχωρισμὸς κεφαλῆς καὶ θώρακος καθίσταται χάρτης τῆς ἱεραρχίας τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ὁ λόγος ὁρίζει τὰ γένη τῶν αἰτίων καὶ τὴν ἐν τῷ σώματι θέσιν τοῦ θνητοῦ ψυχικοῦ μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ὁ λόγος συνδέει ἀταξίαν, θείαν κόσμησιν, ἱεραρχίαν καὶ σωματικὴν διαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἀναγκαία φύσις δὲν ἀπορρίπτεται, ἀλλὰ ἐντάσσεται ὑφ᾽ ἕνα ἀνώτερον τελικόν σκοπόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς σύνθεσις τάξεως καὶ ἀνάγκης, ἀθανασίας καὶ θνητότητος, ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT5","text":"Χρονικῶς, ἡ θεία διάταξις προηγείται τῆς γενέσεως τῶν ἐπιμέρους θνητῶν καὶ καθορίζει τὸ πλαίσιον αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκoῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀταξίαν εἰς τὴν θείαν κόσμησιν καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς τὴν θνητὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις θείου καὶ ἀναγκαίου διατηρεῖ τὴν κύριαν ἀρχιτεκτονικὴν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT3","text":"Ἡ γενεαλογία τῆς θνητῆς ψυχῆς ἀνασυγκροτεῖται ἐκ τῆς σχέσεως ἀθανάτου ψυχῆς, σώματος καὶ παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς λειτουργία ἑκάστου πάθους ἐν τῇ ἠθικῇ ἀνατάξει τοῦ ἀνθρώπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT5","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάσις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαιότητος τῶν παθημάτων καὶ τῆς ἀποστροφῆς τοῦ θείου ἀπὸ αὐτά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνάγκη λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὑλικόν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐχὶ ὡς τελικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφίησιν ἀνοικτὸν τὸ πῶς ἡ θνητὴ φύσις δύναται νὰ μετάσχῃ τοῦ θείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231247226905Z_43a8c765","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 69","source_sha256":"18bf201ef0b5a8680807515d59f587531ee1e53b06cb3b8a01a7cf1caa08d1e9","sha256":"6df40fe98722f1f20c9e475aa8ac62a5e6a3bade5a1c5c6a6ed8e588439d572b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:12:47.228331+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS1","text":"The problem undertaken is the distinction of the causes, without which the things sought can neither be understood nor attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS2","text":"The necessary cause is subordinated to the divine, as an instrument of the higher ends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS3","text":"The divine ordering produces order, proportion, and symmetry from disorderly matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS4","text":"From the ordering of the elements there is constituted one universal living being, containing mortal and immortal kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS5","text":"The immortal soul precedes the mortal body, which is added to it as a vehicle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AS6","text":"The mortal part of the soul is constituted through necessary affections, which a separate dwelling-place restricts, lest it pollute the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","text":"Two kinds of causes are distinguished: the necessary and the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A2","text":"The divine cause is sought for the sake of a happy life, insofar as human nature is able.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","text":"The necessary cause is sought as a condition without which the divine end is neither understood nor received nor participated in.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","text":"Primordial matter is disorderly before god orders it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","text":"God establishes unity, proportion, and symmetry among beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","text":"From the ordering of the elements there is constituted one whole living being, containing mortals and immortals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","text":"God himself fashions the divine beings, but entrusts the generation of mortals to his own offspring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","text":"The immortal soul is taken as a principle, in relation to which the mortal body is constructed as a vehicle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A9","text":"The mortal part of the soul consists of pleasure, pain, courage, fear, anger, hope, sensation, and desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:A10","text":"The mortal part of the soul is housed apart from the divine in the thorax, so that there may be a boundary between the head and the chest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1","text":"The necessary is not a self-sufficient final cause, but a presupposition of the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX2","text":"Primordial matter is neither ordered nor possessed of a noteworthy name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX3","text":"The elements do not possess any primordial self-sufficient order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX4","text":"The mortal is not confused with the divine part of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX5","text":"The body is neither autonomous nor an intelligible principle without soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX6","text":"The affections of the mortal part are neither purely good nor simply superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX7","text":"God does not produce mortal generation in the same manner in which he fashions divine beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:NX8","text":"The unity of the cosmos does not abolish the internal division of the kinds of soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D1","text":"The necessary cause acquires significance only from its relation to the divine end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","CH_JP8E_S_48:A2","CH_JP8E_S_48:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D2","text":"Cosmic order requires the transformation of disorderly matter into relations of proportion and symmetry.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D3","text":"What are now called elements become intelligible as elements only after the divine ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D4","text":"The universal unity of the cosmos includes a hierarchical difference between immortals and mortals.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D5","text":"The bodily form of the human being is understood as a bearer of soul and not as a primary principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D6","text":"The affections of the mortal part constitute a functional composition of mortal life, since its generation is completed through them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:D7","text":"The spatial division of head and thorax reflects the ontological distinction between the divine and the mortal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1","text":"The cosmos as a whole is produced through the composition of two principles, one of which supplies an end and the other matter and necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A1","CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","CH_JP8E_S_48:A4","CH_JP8E_S_48:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD2","text":"Creation is graded: god orders the universal, while the divine offspring effect the mortal particularization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","CH_JP8E_S_48:A6","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3","text":"The human soul bears within itself an internal hierarchy, which bodily spatial arrangement embodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4","text":"Mortal affection becomes a necessary instrument of generation, but by virtue of its necessity it remains inferior to divine reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A3","CH_JP8E_S_48:A7","CH_JP8E_S_48:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SD5","text":"The avoidance of the mixture of divine and mortal preserves the holiness of the divine through geographical and functional distance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A8","CH_JP8E_S_48:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX1","text":"The disorderly cannot of itself produce a cosmos or intelligible unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX2","text":"Matter does not constitute an equal co-creator of divine order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX3","text":"Mortal nature has no direct access to the divine without mediation and distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4","text":"The unity of the living being does not mean the homogeneity of its parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX5","text":"Bodily necessity cannot be elevated into final value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX6","text":"The divine does not become indiscriminately involved in affective and desirous life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a cosmos that emerges automatically from matter without intellect and final reason is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX2","text":"Undifferentiated continuity between divine and mortal is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX3","text":"The idea that the body or the affections constitute the primary identity of being is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX4","text":"The principle of order remains above the necessary mechanism, which reason nevertheless cannot abolish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS1","text":"Disorderly matter → lack of a worthy form → divine ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS2","text":"Divine ordering → proportion and symmetry → constitution of a universal living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS3","text":"Universal living being → distinction of immortals and mortals → allocation of creative works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS4","text":"Immortal soul → bodily vehicle → addition of a mortal psychic kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS5","text":"Mortal psychic kind → affections and sensation → necessary composition of mortal life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS6","text":"Necessary mortality → danger of mixture with the divine → spatial separation of head and thorax.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS7","text":"Divine end → necessary matter and affections as means → possibility of happiness according to the human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF1","text":"Distinction of causes → subordination of necessity to the divine → recollection of the cosmogonic beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF2","text":"Disorderly matter → divine ordering → proportion and symmetry → one universal living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF3","text":"Universal unity → creative hierarchy → immortal soul and mortal body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF4","text":"Mortal body → mortal psychic kind → affections necessary for generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:AF5","text":"Necessity of affections → danger of pollution of the divine → separation of the soul's dwelling-places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1","text":"Causality is recast from a unilateral principle into a hierarchized cooperation of divine and necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME2","text":"Matter is transformed from an unformed datum into a substrate that receives ontological significance through order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME3","text":"The body is reclassified as a vehicle, while the soul is divided into immortal and mortal functional parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME4","text":"The affections cease to appear as mere defects and become structural conditions of mortal life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5","text":"The spatial separation of head and thorax becomes a map of the hierarchy of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the discourse defines the kinds of causes and the location in the body of the mortal psychic part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT2","text":"Structurally, the discourse connects disorder, divine ordering, hierarchy, and bodily division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, necessary nature is not rejected, but integrated under a higher final purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT4","text":"Ontologically, being is understood as a composition of order and necessity, immortality and mortality, soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT5","text":"Temporally, divine ordering precedes the generation of individual mortals and determines their framework.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from disorder to divine ordering and from this to mortal composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT2","text":"The distinction between divine and necessary preserves the principal architecture of the discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT3","text":"The genealogy of the mortal soul is reconstructed from the relation of immortal soul, body, and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT4","text":"The precise function of each affection in the human being's ethical reordering remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT5","text":"An internal tension remains between the necessity of the affections and the divine's aversion from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT6","text":"The architecture is coherent, because necessity functions as material, but not as final.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_48:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the discourse, but leaves open how mortal nature can participate in the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_48@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_48:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 69"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 53","title":"Section 69","context":"Chapter 53","original_title":"Section 69","original_context":"Chapter 53"},"original_title":"Section 69","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7","layer":"CH","title":"Section 70","order":54,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC7"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC7@R001","sha256":"0382fd1bb10615eddd1a0ffadb7d3f07ca69c0a31095e614c47035c20f43f052","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS1","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις τῶν ἀντιμαχομένων μερῶν τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς ἱεραρχικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ διαίρεσις τοῦ σώματος ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαίρεσιν λόγου, θυμοῦ καὶ ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS3","text":"Ὁ λόγος τίθεται ὡς ἡγεμονικὸς πόλος, ὁ δὲ θυμὸς ὡς ἔνοπλος μεσίτης πρὸς τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS4","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ κατασκευή παρέχει τοῖς ἀνωτέροις μέρεσιν ὄργανα ἐπιβολῆς, ἀκοῆς, προειδοποιήσεως καὶ ψύξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία ἀπομονόνεται καὶ προσδένεται ὡς ἀναγκαῖον ἄγριον θρέμμα, ὅπως τὸ θνητὸν γένος διαμένῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS6","text":"Ὁ συλλογισμὸς εἶναι φυσιολογικὸς καὶ τελεολογικός: ἐκ τῆς συγκρούσεως τῶν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων ἄγει εἰς τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν ἐνοίκησιν καὶ τὴν ἐλεγχόμενην διατήρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ περιέχει διακεκριμένα μέρη, ὧν τὸ μὲν βέλτιον καὶ τὸ δὲ χεῖρον πέφυκεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἔχει φυσικὴν ἀρχηγικὴν τάξιν ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","text":"Ὁ θυμὸς εἶναι φιλονικώτερος δύναμις, συγγενὴς τῷ λόγῳ ἀλλὰ οὐ ταὐτός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία τῶν σίτων καὶ ποτῶν ἀποτελεῖ κατώτερον καὶ ἀναγκαῖον ψυχικὸν μέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ ἡγεμονία τοῦ λόγου προϋποθέτει μεσολάβησιν τοῦ θυμοῦ πρὸς κατακράτησιν τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","text":"Τὰ μέρη τῆς ψυχῆς ἀντιστοιχοῦν πρὸς διακεκριμένους τόπους καὶ λειτουργίας τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7","text":"Ἡ καρδία συνδέει τὸν θυμὸν πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν ταχεῖαν σωματικὴν ἀντίδρασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8","text":"Ὁ πλεύμων μετριάζει τὴν θερμότητα τοῦ θυμοῦ καὶ καθιστᾷ αὐτὸν ὑπηρετικὸν τῷ λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία χρειάζεται τροφὴν καὶ δεσμὸν, ἵνα καταστήσῃ δυνατὴν τὴν διατήρησιν τοῦ θνητοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ τάξις ἀποβλέπει εἰς τὴν λειτουργικὴν ὑποταγὴν τῶν κατωτέρων δυνάμεων ταῖς ἀνωτέραις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῆν καὶ ἀδιαίρετον δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX2","text":"Ὁ θυμὸς οὔτε ταὐτίζεται τῷ λόγῳ οὔτε παραδίδοται ἀκρίτως ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία οὐκ ἔχει τὴν ἀρχηγικὴν θέσιν ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX4","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ τάξις οὐκ ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ τῆς ἀμέσου ἐξουσίας τοῦ λόγου μόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX5","text":"Ἡ καρδία οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλῶς πηγή ζωῆς, ἀλλὰ ὄργανον θυμοῦ καὶ στρατιωτικῆς ἐγρηγόρσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX6","text":"Ὁ πλεύμων οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀδιάφορον ἀναπνευστικὸν ὄργανον, ἀλλὰ μηχανὴ καταπραΰνουσα τὸν θυμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX7","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία οὐκ ἐξαλείφεται ἐκ τῆς ὀρθῆς ζωῆς, ἀλλὰ δεῖται περιορισμοῦ καὶ τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX8","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ οἴκησις οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ τυχαίαν διάταξιν, ἀλλὰ ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ ψυχικῇ ἱεραρχίᾳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D1","text":"Ὁ λόγος, ἐπειδὴ ἄρχει τῇ φύσει, χρειάζεται σωματικὸν ὑποστήριγμα διὰ τὴν ἐπιβολὴν ἐπὶ τῶν κατωτέρων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D2","text":"Ὁ θυμὸς καθίσταται φύλαξ τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ δύναται νὰ ἀκούῃ τὰς ἐντολὰς αὐτοῦ καὶ νὰ ἀντιστῇ ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D3","text":"Ἡ καρδία ἀποτελεῖ κέντρον ταχείας μεταδόσεως τοῦ θυμοῦ διὰ τοῦ αἵματος καὶ τῶν αἰσθητικῶν διόδων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D4","text":"Ἡ προσδοκία κινδύνου ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὸν θυμὸν πρὶν ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ πράξις ἀποτελέσῃ πλήρη ἀντίκτυπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D5","text":"Ἡ ψύξις καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ μετατρέπουσι τὴν ὀργὴν ἀπὸ ἀνεξέλεγκτον θερμότητα εἰς ἐλεγχόμενον ὄργανον ὑπηρεσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D6","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία ἐγκαθίσταται χαμηλότερον, ἵνα διατρέφηται μὲν συνεχῶς, ἀλλὰ μὴ διεκδικῇ τὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D7","text":"Ἡ διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν συνύπαρξιν καὶ τὸν δεσμὸν δυνάμεων αἳ καθ᾽ ἑαυτὰς ἀνισόρροποι εἰσίν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἔλλογος κυριαρχία κατασκευάζεται ὡς σύνθεσις ἀρχῆς, ἐνδιάμεσης βίας καὶ δεδεμένης ἀναγκαιότητος, οὐχὶ ὡς καθαρὴ ἀυτοκυβέρνησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνατομία μεταγράφει τὴν πολιτικὴν εἰκόνα ἱεραρχίας, φρουρᾶς, ἐπιτάγματος καὶ καταναγκασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD3","text":"Ἡ ὀργὴ ἀποτελεῖ ταὐτοχρόνως ἀπειλὴν ἀποστασίας καὶ ὄργανον ἐπανιδρύσεως τῆς λογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη, ἣν ἐπιβάλλει ἡ θνητότης, ἐμποδίζει τὴν πλήρη ἀπομάκρυνσιν τῆς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ ἐπιβάλλει τὴν διοίκησιν αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἑνότητα τοῦ σώματος δὲν σημαίνει ἰσοτιμίαν τῶν μερῶν, ἀλλὰ διαφοράν τόπων, λειτουργιῶν καὶ βαθμῶν ὑπηρεσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ ψυχικὴ λειτουργία προϋποθέτει ὅτι αἱ ἐσωτερικαὶ δυνάμεις οὐκ εἰσὶν ἰσότιμοι ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX2","text":"Ὁ λόγος οὐκ ἀρκεῖ αὐτὸς καθ᾽ ἑαυτὸν πρὸς τὴν πραγματικὴν ἐπιβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3","text":"Ἡ τάξις οὐκ ἐδραιώνεται ἄνευ σωματικῶν μηχανῶν μεταδόσεως, ἀναχαίτισης καὶ ἐπιτηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία οὐκ ἔχει ἀνεξάρτητον τελεολογίαν ἔξω τῆς διατηρήσεως τοῦ θνητοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX5","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἄτακτος συσσώρευσις μερῶν, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἐσκεμμένη κατασκευή πρὸς διοίκησιν συγκρούσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX6","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ εἰρήνη οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀπουσίαν ἀντιθέσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐπιτυχῆ κατανομήν καὶ χαλιναγώγησιν δυνάμεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ψυχῆς ἧς πάντα τὰ μέρη αὐτομάτως συμφωνοῦσι πρὸς ἕνα ἀδιαίρετον ἐγώ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀρχὴ ἄνευ μεσολαβητοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἡγεμονία χρειάζεται ἐκτελεστικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπολύτως ἐλεύθερα ἀναπτυσσομένη ἐπιθυμία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ θνητὴ ζωή ἀπαιτεῖ δεσμόν, τροφήν καὶ ὅρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ πλήρης διάλυσις τῆς βίας ἐκ τῆς λογικῆς τάξεως· ἡ τάξις διατηρεῖται διὰ διοικουμένης βίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνατομικὴ οὐδετερότης, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστος τόπος τοῦ σώματος ἤδη φέρει βαθμὸν καὶ σκοπὸν ψυχικῆς ἐξουσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS1","text":"Διαίρεσις ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων → ἱεράρχησις βελτίονος καὶ χείρονος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS2","text":"Ἱεράρχησις → χωριστὴ σωματικὴ οἴκησις κατὰ λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS3","text":"Ἀρχὴ λόγου → ἀνάγκη φύλακος ἐναντίον τῆς ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS4","text":"Φύλαξ θυμός → καρδιακὴ μετάδοσις ἐντολῶν, ἀπειλῶν καὶ αἰσθητικῆς ἐγρηγόρσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5","text":"Θυμικὴ θερμότης → πνευμονικὴ ψύξις, ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἐλάττωσις πόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS6","text":"Ἀναγκαία ἐπιθυμία → κατώτερος τόπος, τροφή, δεσμός καὶ διατήρησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS7","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ κατανομή → ὑπηρετικὴ ἑνότης τοῦ θνητοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF1","text":"Ἀντίθεσις ψυχικῶν μερῶν → ἀνατομικὴ διάκρισις → λόγος ὡς ἀκρόπολις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF2","text":"Λογικὴ ἀρχή → θυμὸς ὡς δορυφορικὴ φρουρά → κατακράτησις ἐπιθυμιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF3","text":"Θυμικὴ ἔγερσις → καρδιακὴ μετάδοσις → πνευμονικὴ μετρίασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF4","text":"Σωματικὴ ἀνάγκη → ἐπιθυμία τροφῆς → δεδεμένη κατώτερη οἴκησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5","text":"Διαφοροποίησις καὶ ἔλεγχος → διοικημένη ἑνότης → διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς χάρτης ψυχικῆς ἐξουσίας καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὸν φυσικὸν σύνολον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2","text":"Ὁ θυμὸς ἐπανακαθορίζεται ὡς ἐνδιάμεσος πολιτικο-στρατιωτικὸς μηχανισμὸς μεταξὺ ἀρχῆς καὶ ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία μεταπίπτει ἀπὸ ἀντιπάλου τῆς τάξεως εἰς ἀναγκαῖον ἀλλὰ δεδεμένον ὑπόστρωμα ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME4","text":"Ἡ ὀργὴ παύει νὰ φαίνηται ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀταξία καὶ γίνεται ὄργανον ἐπανεπιβολῆς τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἁρμονία ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀσύμμετρης χωροθεσίας καὶ λειτουργικῆς ὑποταγῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Τὰ ψυχικὰ μέρη τοποθετοῦνται εἰς κεφαλήν, θώρακα, καρδίαν, πλεύμονα καὶ κοιλιακὸν τόπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις ἐγκαθιδρύει μηχανὴν ἱεραρχίας, φρουρᾶς, ἐλέγχου καὶ περιορισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ λογικὴ ἀρχὴ ἐπιτυγχάνει μόνον ὅταν μετασχηματίζει τὸν θυμὸν εἰς σύμμαχον καὶ τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν εἰς διοικούμενον πόρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ θνητὴ φύσις συγκροτεῖται διὰ διαρκούς ἀνακυκλώσεως θερμότητος, ἀναπνοῆς, τροφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ τάξις δὲν εἶναι δεδομένη ἁπλῶς ἐν τῇ φύσει, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργεῖται συνεχῶς διὰ σωματικῶν μηχανισμῶν ἀντιδράσεως καὶ μετριασμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ βασικοῦ συλλογισμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ συνδέουσι τὴν ψυχικὴν διαίρεσιν πρὸς τὴν σωματικὴν οἴκησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἱεράρχησιν τῶν μερῶν εἰς τὴν διοίκησιν τῆς θνητῆς ὑπάρξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ ἐρείδεται ἐπὶ τῇ λειτουργικῇ ἀντιστοιχίᾳ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4","text":"Ἀπομένει ὑποκαθορισμένον εἰ ἡ ἀνατομικὴ αἰτιότης εἶναι κυριολεκτικὴ ἢ εἰκονικὴ μεταγραφή τῆς ψυχικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς λογικῆς ἡγεμονίας καὶ τῆς ἀναγκαίας χρήσεως βίας πρὸς ἐπιβολὴν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT6","text":"Ἡ δεύτερα ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας ἐπιθυμίας καὶ τῆς ἀπαξιωμένης αὐτῆς θέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT7","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὸ γενετικὸν σχήμα, ἀλλ᾽ ἀφαιρεῖ τὰς λεπτομερείας τῆς φυσιολογικῆς τεκμηριώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225731956983Z_c6e81445","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 70","source_sha256":"0382fd1bb10615eddd1a0ffadb7d3f07ca69c0a31095e614c47035c20f43f052","sha256":"193da8221f7b22c1a58536b1093b6fbc68ab07d324bf1bba82bedb6f4f909113","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:57:31.960205+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS1","text":"The central problem is the bodily arrangement of the conflicting parts of the soul toward a hierarchical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2","text":"The anatomical division of the body repeats the internal division of reason, spirit, and appetite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS3","text":"Reason is placed as the ruling pole, and spirit as an armed mediator in relation to appetite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS4","text":"The bodily construction provides the higher parts with instruments of imposition, hearing, warning, and cooling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS5","text":"Appetite is isolated and bound as a necessary wild creature, so that the mortal race may endure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS6","text":"The reasoning is physiological and teleological: from the conflict of psychic powers it leads to hierarchical habitation and controlled preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","text":"The soul contains distinct parts, of which one is naturally better and another worse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","text":"Reason has a natural commanding rank in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","text":"Spirit is a more contentious power, akin to reason but not identical with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","text":"The appetite for food and drink constitutes a lower and necessary part of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","text":"The correct rule of reason presupposes the mediation of spirit for the restraint of appetites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","text":"The parts of the soul correspond to distinct locations and functions of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7","text":"The heart connects spirit with sensation and rapid bodily reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8","text":"The lung moderates the heat of spirit and makes it serviceable to reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","text":"Appetite needs nourishment and binding, in order to make possible the preservation of the mortal race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10","text":"The bodily order aims at the functional subordination of the lower powers to the higher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX1","text":"The soul does not constitute a simple and indivisible power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX2","text":"Spirit is neither identified with reason nor uncritically surrendered to the appetites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX3","text":"Appetite does not have the commanding position in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX4","text":"Correct order is not achieved through the direct authority of reason alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX5","text":"The heart is not simply a source of life, but an instrument of spirit and military vigilance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX6","text":"The lung is not an indifferent respiratory organ, but a mechanism that soothes spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX7","text":"Appetite is not eliminated from the correct life, but requires limitation and nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX8","text":"Bodily habitation does not follow a random arrangement, but serves the psychic hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D1","text":"Reason, because it rules by nature, needs bodily support for imposition upon the lower parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D2","text":"Spirit becomes the guardian of reason, because it is able to hear its commands and resist the appetites.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D3","text":"The heart constitutes a center of rapid transmission of spirit through the blood and the sensory channels.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D4","text":"The expectation of danger activates spirit before the external action produces a full impact.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D5","text":"Cooling and respiration transform anger from uncontrolled heat into a controlled instrument of service.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D6","text":"Appetite is established lower down, so that it may indeed be continuously nourished, but may not lay claim to rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:D7","text":"The preservation of the mortal body requires the coexistence and binding of powers that are, in themselves, unbalanced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","text":"Rational sovereignty is constructed as a composite of rule, intermediate force, and bound necessity, not as pure self-government.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2","text":"Bodily anatomy transcribes the political image of hierarchy, guard, command, and compulsion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD3","text":"Anger constitutes at once a threat of rebellion and an instrument for the re-establishment of rational order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4","text":"The necessity imposed by mortality prevents the complete removal of appetite and imposes its governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5","text":"The unity of the body does not mean equality of the parts, but difference of places, functions, and degrees of service.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX1","text":"Correct psychic functioning presupposes that the internal powers are not equal with respect to rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX2","text":"Reason is not sufficient by itself for actual imposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3","text":"Order is not established without bodily mechanisms of transmission, restraint, and supervision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX4","text":"Appetite has no independent teleology outside the preservation of the mortal whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX5","text":"Nature is not explained as a disorderly accumulation of parts, but as a deliberate construction for the governance of conflicts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX6","text":"Internal peace does not constitute an absence of opposition, but a successful distribution and bridling of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a soul whose every part automatically agrees with one indivisible self is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX2","text":"Rule without a mediator is excluded, because sovereignty needs executive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX3","text":"Absolutely freely developing appetite is excluded, because mortal life requires binding, nourishment, and limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX4","text":"The complete elimination of force from rational order is absent; order is preserved through administered force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX5","text":"Anatomical neutrality is excluded, because every place of the body already bears a degree and purpose of psychic authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS1","text":"Division of psychic powers → hierarchy of better and worse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS2","text":"Hierarchy → separate bodily habitation according to function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS3","text":"Rule of reason → need for a guardian against appetite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS4","text":"Guardian spirit → cardiac transmission of commands, threats, and sensory vigilance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5","text":"Spirited heat → pulmonary cooling, respiration, and reduction of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS6","text":"Necessary appetite → lower place, nourishment, binding, and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS7","text":"Hierarchical distribution → serviceable unity of the mortal whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF1","text":"Opposition of psychic parts → anatomical distinction → reason as acropolis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF2","text":"Rational rule → spirit as satellite guard → restraint of appetites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF3","text":"Spirited arousal → cardiac transmission → pulmonary moderation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF4","text":"Bodily necessity → appetite for nourishment → bound lower habitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5","text":"Differentiation and control → administered unity → preservation of the mortal race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1","text":"The body is reclassified as a map of psychic authority and not as a simple natural whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2","text":"Spirit is redefined as an intermediate politico-military mechanism between rule and necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3","text":"Appetite shifts from an opponent of order to a necessary but bound substrate of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME4","text":"Anger ceases to appear as simple disorder and becomes an instrument for the reimposition of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME5","text":"Internal harmony is recognized as the result of asymmetrical placement and functional subordination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The parts of the soul are located in the head, chest, heart, lung, and abdominal region.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The bodily arrangement establishes a mechanism of hierarchy, guard, control, and limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Rational rule succeeds only when it transforms spirit into an ally and appetite into a governed resource.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Mortal nature is constituted through the continuous recycling of heat, respiration, nourishment, movement, and control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Order is not simply given in nature, but is continuously enacted through bodily mechanisms of reaction and moderation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the basic reasoning, because they connect psychic division with bodily habitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from the hierarchization of the parts to the governance of mortal existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests upon the functional correspondence of soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether anatomical causality is literal or an imagistic transcription of psychic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT5","text":"The principal tension remains between rational sovereignty and the necessary use of force for its imposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT6","text":"The second tension remains between necessary appetite and its devalued position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT7","text":"The compression preserves the generative schema, but removes the details of the physiological substantiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC7:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 70"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 54","title":"Section 70","context":"Chapter 54","original_title":"Section 70","original_context":"Chapter 54"},"original_title":"Section 70","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49","layer":"CH","title":"Section 71","order":55,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_49"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_49@R001","sha256":"9955894e602c4b555421dbcb937616daad0e9d79181f97d1f243a7063613da98","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS1","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν μέρος, ἀφρόνητον ὂν καὶ ἀποκεχωρισμένον τοῦ βουλευομένου, ὑφίσταται ὡς πρόβλημα διοικήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS2","text":"Ἡ θεία τάξις ἀποδίδωσι τῷ ἀλόγῳ μέρει τόπον ἥσυχον καὶ ἀπόμακρον τοῦ νοῦ, ἵνα ὁ νοῦς περὶ τοῦ κοινῇ καὶ ἰδίᾳ συμφέροντος βουλεύηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἄλογον οὔτε λόγου μετέχει οὔτε λόγοις αὐτομάτως μέλει, ἡ ἐπιρροὴ τοῦ νοῦ διὰ σωματικοῦ ὀργάνου ἐπιτελεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS4","text":"Τὸ ἧπαρ καθίσταται εἴδωλον καὶ κάτοπτρον τῶν διανοημάτων, δι᾽ οὗ φόβος, λύπη, πραότης καὶ ἡμερότης διαμορφοῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS5","text":"Ἡ πικρότης καὶ ἡ γλυκύτης τοῦ ἥπατος ἀντιστοιχοῦσιν ἀντιθέτοις κινήσεσιν, αἳ τὸ ἄλογον μέρος ἢ ταράσσουσιν ἢ ἡσυχάζουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἄλογον στερεῖται φρονήσεως, ἡ μαντικὴ ἐγκαθίσταται ἐν αὐτῷ ὡς ἀτελὴς πρόσβασις πρὸς ἀλήθειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS7","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς μαντικὴ οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ κατὰ νηφάλιον φρόνησιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἐν ὕπνῳ, νόσῳ ἢ ἐνθουσιασμῷ, ὅταν ἡ φρόνησις πεδῆται ἢ παραλλάσσηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","text":"Ὁ νοῦς δύναται περὶ τοῦ συμφέροντος βουλεύεσθαι καὶ τὴν ὀρθὴν τάξιν ἐπιζητεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","text":"Τὸ ἄλογον θνητὸν μέρος οὔτε λόγου συνίησιν οὔτε ἐμφύτως λόγων φροντίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A3","text":"Τὸ ἄλογον μέρος ἐνεργεῖ κυρίως διὰ εἰδώλων καὶ φαντασμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀποχωρίζει τὸ ἄλογον ἀπὸ τὸ κέντρον τοῦ βουλεύεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","text":"Τὸ ἧπαρ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ σωματικὸν ὄργανον τῆς πρὸς τὸ ἄλογον ἐπιρροῆς τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","text":"Τὸ ἧπαρ δέχεται τοὺς τύπους τῶν διανοημάτων ὥσπερ κάτοπτρον εἰδώλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","text":"Ἡ πικρότης τοῦ ἥπατος δύναται φόβον, ταραχὴν καὶ λύπην ἐνεργεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","text":"Ἡ γλυκύτης τοῦ ἥπατος δύναται ἡσυχίαν, πραότητα καὶ εὐημερίαν ἐνεργεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A9","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ διάπλασις τοῦ ἥπατος ἀναπαριστᾷ τὴν ἀντίθεσιν ταραχώδους καὶ ἡμέρου ψυχικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ ἐδρεύει ἐν τῷ ἀλόγῳ μέρει ὡς ὑποκατάστατον φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ ἀλήθεια προκύπτει ὅταν ἡ συνήθης φρόνησις ἀδρανῇ ἢ μεταβάλληται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A12","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἀφροσύνη δύναται νὰ καταστῇ φορεὺς θείας μαντικῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX1","text":"Τὸ ἄλογον μέρος οὐκ ἔστιν αὐτόνομος βουλευτικὴ δύναμις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX2","text":"Ἡ πρόσβασις τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν οὐκ ἐξισοῦται πρὸς νηφάλιον λογικὴν κατανόησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX3","text":"Τὸ ἄλογον οὐκ ἄρχει τοῦ νοῦ οὔτε κατοικεῖ πλησίον τοῦ βουλευομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX4","text":"Τὸ ἧπαρ οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλῶς βιολογικὸν ὄργανον ἄνευ ψυχικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX5","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ συνειδητῆς ἀποδείξεως ἢ ἐπιστημονικῆς φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἀφροσύνη οὐκ ἀποκλείει ἀναγκαίως πᾶσαν σχέσιν πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX7","text":"Ὁ ὕπνος, ἡ νόσος καὶ ὁ ἐνθουσιασμὸς οὐκ εἰσὶν ἁπλῶς στερήσεις ἐνεργείας, ἀλλὰ τρόποι παραλλαγῆς τῆς φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἄλογον οὔτε λόγου συνίησιν οὔτε λόγων φροντίζει, ἡ πρὸς αὐτὸ παιδαγωγία δεῖται εἰδώλων, φαντασμάτων καὶ σωματικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ νοῦς ἀποχωρίζεται τοῦ ἀλόγου, ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις συγκροτεῖται διὰ μεσολαβήσεως καὶ οὐ διὰ ἄμεσου διαλόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἧπαρ δέχεται τοὺς τύπους τῶν διανοημάτων, τὰ νοητικὰ πάθη μεταγράφονται εἰς σωματικὰ σημεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ πικρότης καὶ ἡ γλυκύτης ἔχουσιν ἀντιθέτους ἐνεργείας, ἡ αὐτὴ νοητικὴ δύναμις δύναται ἢ φόβον καὶ λύπην ἢ πραότητα καὶ ἡμερότητα γεννᾶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","CH_JP8E_S_49:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ μαντικὴ ἐδρεύει ἐν τῷ ἀλόγῳ, τὰ μαντικὰ σημεῖα ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἑρμηνείαν ἀπὸ ἐκείνου τοῦ μέρους ὃ ἔχει φρόνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ φρόνησις δεσμεύεται ἢ παραλλάσσεται, ἡ ἀφροσύνη δύναται νὰ καταστῇ δίαυλος μαντικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ ἀλήθεια διανέμεται ἱεραρχικῶς: ὁ νοῦς παράγει τὴν κατεύθυνσιν, τὸ ἧπαρ μεταγράφει τὴν ἐπιρροήν, καὶ τὸ ἄλογον μέρος δέχεται ἢ ἀναγγέλλει τὸ σημεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A4","CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ παθολογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς χαρτογραφία τῆς ἀντιθέσεως μεταξὺ νοητικῆς ἀπειλῆς καὶ νοητικῆς πραότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","CH_JP8E_S_49:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι ἡ ἀλήθεια δύναται νὰ διέλθῃ διὰ καταστάσεως ἥτις ἀποκλείει τὴν ἄμεσον λογικὴν αὐτοσυνειδησίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","text":"Ἡ θεία κατασκευή τοῦ σώματος μετατρέπει τὴν ἔλλειψιν λόγου ἀπὸ καθαρὴν ἀδυναμίαν εἰς ἀτελῆ λειτουργίαν ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα προϋποθέτει ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἑνιαίαν καὶ ὁμοιογενῆ γνωστικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX2","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀποκλείεται ἀπὸ τὴν παραγωγὴν νοήματος, ἀλλὰ μετέχει ταύτης διὰ παθημάτων καὶ σημείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX3","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ ἀλήθεια οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ πάντοτε ἐνεργὸν ἔλεγχον καὶ ἐνσυνείδητον κρίσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX4","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ θεία πρόνοια οὐκ ἀφήνει τὸ ἄλογον ἀδιοίκητον, ἀλλὰ ἐνσωματοῖ μηχανὴν ἐπικοινωνίας πρὸς αὐτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX5","text":"Προϋποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ ἀπουσία φρονήσεως οὐκ ἔχει τὸ αὐτὸ νόημα πρὸς τὸ ἀδύνατον παντὸς σημείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἀληθείας ἥτις θὰ ἦτο πλήρως ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ σωματικὴν καὶ ψυχικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὁμοιόμορφος ἐπικοινωνία μεταξὺ νοῦ καὶ παντὸς μέρους τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ταύτισις φρονήσεως καὶ ἀληθείας, ἐπειδὴ ἀλήθεια δύναται νὰ φανερωθῇ καὶ διὰ ἀφροσύνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ ἄλογον ἔχει ἢ καθαρὴν ἀνεξαρτησίαν ἢ καθαρὴν ἀχρηστίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","text":"Νοῦς βουλευόμενος → ἄλογον μέρος ἀποχωριζόμενον → ἧπαρ ὡς μεσολαβητικὸν κάτοπτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS2","text":"Νοητικὸς τύπος → ἡπατικὴ ἀντανάκλασις → πικρὴ ἢ γλυκεῖα σωματικὴ διάθεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS3","text":"Πικρὰ διάθεσις → φόβος, σύσπασις, λύπη· γλυκεῖα διάθεσις → ἡσυχία, πραότης, εὐημερία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS4","text":"Ἔλλειψις φρονήσεως → ἐγκατάστασις μαντείου → φανέρωσις δι᾽ ὕπνου, νόσου ἢ ἐνθουσιασμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5","text":"Μαντικὸν σημεῖον → ἀνάγκη νοερᾶς ἑρμηνείας → ἐπανασύνδεσις τοῦ ἀλόγου πρὸς τὸ φρόνιμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AF1","text":"Ἄλογον καὶ ἀκυβέρνητον μέρος → ἀπομάκρυνσις ἀπὸ τὸ βουλευόμενον → ἧπαρ ὡς ὄργανον ἐπιρροῆς → ἀντανάκλασις νοητικῶν τύπων → σωματικὴ ταραχὴ ἢ ἡμερότης → μαντικὴ ἐν ἀφροσύνῃ → ἀνάγκη νοερᾶς ἀποκωδικοποιήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","text":"Τὸ ἧπαρ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἁπλὸν σπλάγχνον εἰς μεσολαβητικὸν χάρτην τῆς ψυχικῆς ἐπικοινωνίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνωμαλία ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἐνδεχόμενον ἀποτύπωμα νοητικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME3","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἐπιστήμης εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἀτελοῦς ἐπικοινωνίας μεταξὺ ἀλόγου καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀφροσύνη παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ μόνον στέρησιν καὶ καθίσταται ἐπίσης δίαυλος ἀποκαλύψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις νοῦ καὶ σώματος ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ ἱεραρχικῆς ἀλληλεπιδράσεως διὰ σωματικῶν σημείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ἧπαρ ἀντιδρᾷ πρὸς νοητικὰ φαντάσματα διὰ φόβου ἢ πραότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ψυχὴ διαιρεῖται εἰς νοῦν, ἄλογον μέρος καὶ σωματικὴν μεσολάβησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ μαντικὴ ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν μεταξὺ παραγωγῆς σημείου καὶ ἑρμηνείας σημείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀλήθεια δύναται νὰ φανερῶται κατὰ χρόνον ὅπου ἡ συνήθης φρόνησις ὕπνῳ, νόσῳ ἢ ἐνθουσιασμῷ μεταβάλλεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὸν νοῦν πρὸς τὸ ἄλογον καὶ ἀπὸ τὸ ἄλογον πρὸς τὴν μαντικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ θείας κατασκευῆς, σωματικῆς μεσολαβήσεως καὶ ἀλόγου προσλήψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς αἰτιώδης σχέσις μεταξὺ νοητικῶν τύπων καὶ συγκεκριμένων ἡπατικῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐφόσον ἡ μαντικὴ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἀτελὴς λειτουργία καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἐπιστήμη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἔντασις παραμένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀξίας τῆς μαντικῆς ἀληθείας καὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας τοῦ μαντευομένου νὰ κρίνῃ αὐτήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφίησιν ἀνοικτὸν τὸ πῶς ὁ φρόνιμος ἑρμηνευτὴς μετατρέπει τὸ ἄλογον σημεῖον εἰς ἀληθῆ γνώσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231305546190Z_7a4c2bc5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 71","source_sha256":"9955894e602c4b555421dbcb937616daad0e9d79181f97d1f243a7063613da98","sha256":"6ab7b6aaa24cf60c0339a1b05b634ca94b86849f5ed442431b50193f90ec42c7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:13:05.547247+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS1","text":"The mortal part, being without intelligence and separated from that which deliberates, stands as a problem of governance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS2","text":"The divine order assigns to the irrational part a quiet place far removed from intellect, so that intellect may deliberate concerning what is advantageous both in common and in private.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS3","text":"Since the irrational neither partakes of reason nor automatically cares for rational accounts, the influence of intellect is effected through a bodily organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS4","text":"The liver is established as an image and mirror of thoughts, through which fear, grief, gentleness, and mildness are formed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS5","text":"The bitterness and sweetness of the liver correspond to opposed motions, which either disturb or calm the irrational part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS6","text":"Since the irrational lacks intelligence, divination is installed in it as an incomplete access to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AS7","text":"True divination does not operate through sober intelligence, but in sleep, illness, or inspiration, whenever intelligence is fettered or altered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","text":"Intellect is able to deliberate concerning what is advantageous and to seek the correct order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","text":"The irrational mortal part neither understands reason nor is naturally concerned with rational accounts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A3","text":"The irrational part operates principally through images and apparitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A4","text":"The cosmic order separates the irrational from the center of deliberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","text":"The liver constitutes the bodily organ of intellect's influence upon the irrational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","text":"The liver receives the impressions of thoughts like a mirror of images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","text":"The bitterness of the liver can produce fear, disturbance, and grief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","text":"The sweetness of the liver can produce calm, gentleness, and well-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A9","text":"The bodily configuration of the liver represents the opposition between turbulent and gentle psychic motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","text":"Divination resides in the irrational part as a substitute for intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","text":"Divinatory truth arises when customary intelligence is inactive or altered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:A12","text":"Human folly can become a bearer of divine divination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX1","text":"The irrational part is not an autonomous deliberative power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX2","text":"The soul's access to truth is not equivalent to sober rational understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX3","text":"The irrational neither rules intellect nor dwells near that which deliberates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX4","text":"The liver is not merely a biological organ devoid of psychic function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX5","text":"Divination does not operate through conscious demonstration or scientific intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","text":"Folly does not necessarily exclude every relation to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:NX7","text":"Sleep, illness, and inspiration are not merely privations of activity, but modes of alteration of intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D1","text":"Since the irrational neither understands reason nor cares for rational accounts, its guidance requires images, apparitions, and bodily affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D2","text":"Since intellect is separated from the irrational, internal order is constituted through mediation and not through direct dialogue.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D3","text":"Since the liver receives the impressions of thoughts, mental affections are transcribed into bodily signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D4","text":"Since bitterness and sweetness have opposed effects, the same mental power can produce either fear and grief or gentleness and mildness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","CH_JP8E_S_49:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D5","text":"Since divination resides in the irrational, divinatory signs require interpretation by that part which possesses intelligence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:D6","text":"Since intelligence is bound or altered, folly can become a channel of divinatory activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","text":"Psychic truth is distributed hierarchically: intellect produces the direction, the liver transcribes the influence, and the irrational part receives or announces the sign.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A1","CH_JP8E_S_49:A4","CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD2","text":"Bodily pathology functions as a mapping of the opposition between mental threat and mental gentleness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","CH_JP8E_S_49:A7","CH_JP8E_S_49:A8","CH_JP8E_S_49:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","text":"Divination reveals that truth can pass through a state that excludes immediate rational self-consciousness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_49:A11","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","text":"The divine construction of the body transforms the lack of reason from a pure incapacity into an incomplete function of truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that the soul is not a unified and homogeneous cognitive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX2","text":"It is presupposed that the body is not excluded from the production of meaning, but participates in it through affections and signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX3","text":"It is presupposed that truth does not always require active examination and conscious judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX4","text":"It is presupposed that divine providence does not leave the irrational ungoverned, but incorporates a mechanism of communication with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX5","text":"It is presupposed that the absence of intelligence does not have the same meaning as the impossibility of every sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","text":"The possibility of truth that would be wholly independent of bodily and psychic arrangement is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","text":"Uniform communication between intellect and every part of the soul is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX3","text":"The absolute identification of intelligence and truth is excluded, since truth can also be manifested through folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX4","text":"The idea that the irrational possesses either pure independence or pure uselessness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","text":"Deliberating intellect → separated irrational part → liver as mediating mirror.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS2","text":"Mental impression → hepatic reflection → bitter or sweet bodily disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS3","text":"Bitter disposition → fear, constriction, grief; sweet disposition → calm, gentleness, well-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS4","text":"Lack of intelligence → installation of an oracle → manifestation through sleep, illness, or inspiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5","text":"Divinatory sign → need for intellectual interpretation → reconnection of the irrational to the intelligent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:AF1","text":"Irrational and ungoverned part → removal from that which deliberates → liver as organ of influence → reflection of mental impressions → bodily disturbance or mildness → divination in folly → need for intellectual decoding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","text":"The liver is reclassified from a simple viscera into a mediating map of psychic communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME2","text":"Bodily abnormality is recognized as a possible imprint of mental activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME3","text":"Divination shifts from the field of knowledge into the field of incomplete communication between irrationality and intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME4","text":"Folly ceases to signify only privation and also becomes a channel of revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","text":"The opposition of intellect and body is replaced by hierarchical interaction through bodily signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT1","text":"At the superficial level, the liver responds to mental apparitions through fear or gentleness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the soul is divided into intellect, irrational part, and bodily mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, divination requires a distinction between the production of a sign and the interpretation of a sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, truth can be manifested at a time when customary intelligence is altered by sleep, illness, or inspiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the fundamental movement from intellect to the irrational and from the irrational to divination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction between divine construction, bodily mediation, and irrational reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3","text":"The precise causal relation between mental impressions and specific hepatic alterations remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","text":"The internal structure is coherent, insofar as divination is defined as an incomplete function and not as knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT5","text":"The principal tension remains between the value of divinatory truth and the incapacity of the diviner to judge it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_49:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account, but leaves open how the intelligent interpreter transforms the irrational sign into true knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_49@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_49:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 71"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 55","title":"Section 71","context":"Chapter 55","original_title":"Section 71","original_context":"Chapter 55"},"original_title":"Section 71","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50","layer":"CH","title":"Section 72","order":56,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_50"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_50@R001","sha256":"8a2f388b39ee3aa4cccf6ba2a91f7d555f92360726ddc49a10c12cf1ab60ee01","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶ τὸ κρίνειν τὰ μαντικὰ φαντάσματα καὶ ῥήματα ὀρθῶς, ὅταν ἡ ψυχὴ ὑπὸ μανίας κατέχηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μετατίθησι τὴν κρίσιν ἀπὸ τοῦ μαντευομένου πρὸς τὸν σώφρονα ἑρμηνευτήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ σημασία ἀπαιτεῖ λογικὴν διαίρεσιν τοῦ σημείου καὶ ἀναφορὰν εἰς τὸ παρελθὸν, τὸ παρὸν, ἢ τὸ μέλλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία τοῦ ἥπατος καὶ τοῦ σπληνὸς ἐξηγεῖ τὴν σωματικὴν ὑποδομὴν τῆς μαντικῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS5","text":"Ἡ γνώσις περὶ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος παρουσιάζεται ὡς εἰκὸς καὶ ὄχι ὡς ἀναμφισβήτητος λόγος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS6","text":"Ὁ λόγος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἑρμηνείαν τῶν σημείων εἰς τὴν παραγωγὴν τοῦ λοιποῦ σώματος ἐκ λογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","text":"Τὰ ὑπὸ μαντικῆς καὶ ἐνθουσιασμοῦ φαινόμενα καὶ λεγόμενα ἔχουσι σημασίαν περὶ κακοῦ ἢ ἀγαθοῦ κατὰ χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","text":"Ὁ μαινόμενος, ὅσον ἔτι ἐν τῇ μανίᾳ μένει, οὐ δύναται αὐτὸς ὀρθῶς κρίνειν τὰ φανέντα καὶ ῥηθέντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A3","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις μόνη ἐπιτρέπει τὸ πράττειν καὶ γιγνώσκειν τὰ οἰκεῖα καὶ ἑαυτόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A4","text":"Οἱ προφῆται εἰσὶν ἑρμηνευταὶ τῶν διʼ αἰνιγμάτων μαντευομένων, οὐχὶ οἱ κυρίως μαντεῖς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A5","text":"Ὁ νόμος ἀπαιτεῖ κριτὰς ἐπὶ ταῖς ἐνθέοις μαντείαις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","text":"Ὁ ζῶν ἥπαρ ἔχει ἐναργέστερα σημεῖα, τὸ δὲ ἀποθανὸν γίνεται τυφλὸν καὶ ἀμυδρὸν εἰς μαντείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","text":"Ὁ σπλὴν καθαίρει τὸ ἧπαρ καὶ διατηρεῖ αὐτὸ καθαρὸν καὶ λαμπρόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","text":"Ἡ διὰ τοῦ σώματος μαντικὴ λειτουργία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ συγκεκριμένην ἀνατομικὴν σύστασιν καὶ ἕδραν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","text":"Ἡ εἰκὼς περὶ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἀληθές, ὃ μόνον θεία συμφωνία βεβαιοῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A10","text":"Τὸ λοιπὸν τοῦ σώματος δεῖ ζητεῖν κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν λογισμὸν ᾧ ἡ προηγουμένη φυσιολογία συνεστήθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX1","text":"Ἡ μανία οὐκ ἔχει ἐν ἑαυτῇ τὴν ἱκανότητα τῆς κρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX2","text":"Ὁ προφήτης οὐκ ἔστιν ὁ αὐτόθεν μάντις, ἀλλʼ ὑποκριτὴς καὶ ἑρμηνευτὴς ξένης φωνῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX3","text":"Τὰ μαντικὰ φαινόμενα οὐκ εἰσὶν ἄμεσα καὶ αὐτοφανῆ ἀληθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ λειτουργία τοῦ ἥπατος οὐκ ἀμεταβλήτως διαμένει μετὰ θάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογικὴ ἐξήγησις οὐκ ἔχει ἀναγκαίως τὴν ἀκρίβειαν θείας ἀποκαλύψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6","text":"Ἡ διήγησις περὶ ψυχῆς οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει ἀνεπιφύλακτον ἀξίωσιν ἀληθείας ἄνευ θείας κυρώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D1","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ γνώσις γίνεται διαδικασία διπλῆ: ἀρχικὴ φανέρωσις ὑπὸ μανίας καὶ ὕστερος λογικὸς ἔλεγχος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D2","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ ἐγκυρότης τῆς μαντείας ἀπαιτεῖ διαμεσολάβησιν κριτῶν καὶ προφητῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A4","CH_JP8E_S_50:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D3","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ τοῦ ὀργάνου ἀποτελεῖ ὅρον τῆς σαφηνείας τῶν μαντικῶν σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D4","text":"Ὁ σπλὴν λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὀργανικὸν φίλτρον, ὃ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἑτοιμότητα τοῦ ἥπατος πρὸς σημασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ κατάστασις τοῦ σώματος μεταβάλλει τὴν ἐνέργειαν τῆς μαντικῆς καὶ τὴν σαφήνειαν τῶν σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ τῆς ψυχῆς δεῖ νὰ μένῃ ὑποθετικὸς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἀπόδειξις ὑπολείπεται τῆς θείας βεβαιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τῆς μαντείας δὲν παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἀρχικῆς ἐμπειρίας μόνης, ἀλλʼ ἐκ τῆς ὀρθῆς κατανομῆς ρόλων μεταξὺ μανίας, σημείου, ἑρμηνείας καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A3","CH_JP8E_S_50:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὑλικὴ συνθήκη τῆς σημασίας, ἀλλʼ οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτάρκης ἐγγύησις τῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις ἀποκτᾷ ἐπιστημολογικὴν ἀξίαν διὰ ῥητῆς μετριοπαθείας καὶ ὄχι διὰ ἀπολύτου βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία καὶ ἡ ψυχολογία ὑπάγονται εἰς ἕνα κοινὸν παραγωγικὸν σχήμα, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστον φαινόμενον ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἰδίαν ὑλικὴν καὶ λειτουργικὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἐμπειρία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτομάτως κριτήριον ἐρμηνείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX2","text":"Ἡ θεία ἢ μαντικὴ προέλευσις οὐκ καταργεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀνθρωπίνης διακρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματολογία οὐκ ταυτίζει ἀναγκαίως τὸ ὄνομα τοῦ μάντεως μὲ τὴν πραγματικὴν λειτουργίαν τοῦ προφήτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ὕλη τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἀδιάφορον ἄθροισμα ὀργάνων, ἀλλὰ ὡς τεταγμένον σύστημα σχέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη διάνοια οὐκ δύναται νὰ μετατρέψῃ τὸ εἰκὸς εἰς ἀναγκαῖον ἄνευ ἐξωτερικῆς κυρώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὸ σημεῖον ἑρμηνεύεται ἄνευ διαμεσολαβήσεως, κρίσεως καὶ κανόνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης σύμπτωσις μαντικῆς ἐμπνεύσεως καὶ συνειδητῆς γνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνατομία ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ τελεολογίαν καὶ λειτουργικὴν τάξιν ὕλη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἐπιστημονικὴ κατοχή τῶν περὶ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος λόγων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS1","text":"Μαντικὴ ἔκστασις → Φάντασμα καὶ φωνή → Ἀδυναμία αὐτοκρίσεως → Σώφρων ἑρμηνευτής → Λογικὴ διαίρεσις τοῦ σημείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS2","text":"Θεόπνευστος ἀινιγματικὴ φήμη → Προφητικὴ ὑπόκρισις → Κριτὴς → Κοινωνικὴ ἐπικύρωσις τῆς μαντείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS3","text":"Ζῶν ἥπαρ → Ἐναργὴς σημασιοδότης → Σπλὴν καθαρτικός → Διατήρησις λαμπρότητος → Μαντικὴ ἑτοιμότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS4","text":"Νόσος ἢ θάνατος → Φθορὰ τῆς ὀργανικῆς λειτουργίας → Ἀμυδρότης ἢ τύφλωσις τῶν σημείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","text":"Ἀνθρωπίνη ὑπόθεσις → Διάκρισις εἰκότος καὶ ἀληθοῦς → Ἀνάγκη θείας συμφωνίας → Προσωρινὴ ἀναστολὴ βεβαιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS6","text":"Λογισμὸς περὶ τῆς ψυχῆς → Ἀνατομικὴ ἀρχή → Παραγωγὴ τοῦ λοιποῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AF1","text":"Ἀμφισημία μαντικῶν σημείων → Ἀδυναμία τοῦ μαινομένου → Ἀνάγκη σώφρονος κριτοῦ → Διάκρισις μάντεως καὶ προφήτου → Ἀνατομικὴ θεμελίωσις τῆς μαντικῆς → Ὑποθετικὴ γνώσις ψυχῆς → Παραγωγὴ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1","text":"Ἡ μαντεία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτόματον ἀποκάλυψιν εἰς σημεῖον ἀπαιτοῦν ἑρμηνείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME2","text":"Ὁ προφήτης ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φορέα πρωτογενοῦς γνώσεως εἰς διαμεσολαβητὴν ξένης μαντικῆς φωνῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος νοήσεως τῆς μαντικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀληθείας καὶ εἰκότος μετατρέπει τὴν φυσιολογικὴν ἐξήγησιν εἰς πειραματικὸν καὶ ὑποθετικὸν λόγον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME5","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ ψυχὴν εἰς σῶμα ἐνοποιεῖ ψυχολογικὴν, ἀνατομικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Φαντάσματα, φωναὶ, μαντεῖαι καὶ ὄργανα τοῦ σώματος ἀποτελοῦσι τὰ ἄμεσα ἀντικείμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ σημασία παράγεται διὰ σχέσεως μανίας, ὀργάνου, καθάρσεως, κριτοῦ καὶ ἑρμηνείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ γνώσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀπόστασιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἐμπειρίαν καὶ ὑποταγὴν τῆς ἐμπνεύσεως εἰς λογικὸν ἔλεγχον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ θεῖον καὶ τὸ θνητὸν διακρίνονται, ἐνῶ ἡ σαφήνεια τῶν σημείων μεταβάλλεται κατὰ ζωὴν, νόσον καὶ θάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα τῶν ἀξιωμάτων ἀρκεῖ πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς πορείας ἀπὸ μαντικὴν φανέρωσιν εἰς λογικὴν κρίσιν καὶ φυσιολογικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται στὴ διάκρισιν ἐμπνεύσεως, ἑρμηνείας, ὀργανικῆς συνθήκης καὶ θείας βεβαιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθʼ ὃν τὰ σωματικὰ σημεῖα σημαίνουσι τὰ μέλλοντα, παρόντα ἢ παρελθόντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4","text":"Παραμένει τάσις μεταξὺ τῆς ἀξιώσεως σημασίας τῶν μαντικῶν σημείων καὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας αὐτάρκους ἀποδείξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει ἐρμηνευτικὴν ἐγκράτειαν, ἀνατομικὴν τελεολογίαν καὶ ἐπιστημολογικὴν μετριοπάθειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231321699013Z_e2e11618","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 72","source_sha256":"8a2f388b39ee3aa4cccf6ba2a91f7d555f92360726ddc49a10c12cf1ab60ee01","sha256":"437856a16bd0cf1d4256fa91f26e4278d6f49f50c88b01bac9d00b6ebc715110","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:13:21.699970+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS1","text":"The problem is to judge prophetic visions and utterances correctly when the soul is possessed by madness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2","text":"The distinction transfers judgment from the diviner to the temperate interpreter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","text":"Prophetic signification requires a rational division of the sign and reference to the past, the present, or the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS4","text":"The anatomy of the liver and spleen explains the bodily infrastructure of divination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS5","text":"Knowledge concerning soul and body is presented as probable and not as indisputable account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AS6","text":"The account passes from the interpretation of signs to the derivation of the rest of the body from reasoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","text":"Things appearing and spoken under divination and inspiration have significance concerning evil or good in relation to time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","text":"The madman, so long as he remains in madness, cannot himself correctly judge the things that appeared and were spoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A3","text":"Prudence alone permits one to act and to know what belongs to oneself and oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A4","text":"Prophets are interpreters of things divined through riddles, not diviners in the strict sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A5","text":"The law requires judges over divinations inspired by a god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","text":"The living liver has more distinct signs, whereas the dead one becomes blind and dim for divination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","text":"The spleen cleanses the liver and keeps it pure and bright.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","text":"The divinatory function through the body depends on a determinate anatomical composition and seat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","text":"The probable account concerning soul and body is distinguished from the true, which divine agreement alone confirms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:A10","text":"The rest of the body must be sought according to the same reasoning by which the preceding physiology was constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX1","text":"Madness does not possess within itself the capacity for judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX2","text":"The prophet is not the diviner himself, but an exponent and interpreter of another's voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX3","text":"Divinatory appearances are not immediate and self-evident truths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX4","text":"The anatomical function of the liver does not remain unaltered after death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5","text":"Physiological explanation does not necessarily possess the precision of divine revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6","text":"The account concerning the soul does not permit an unqualified claim to truth without divine ratification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D1","text":"Divinatory knowledge becomes a twofold process: an initial disclosure through madness and a subsequent rational examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D2","text":"The social validity of divination requires the mediation of judges and prophets.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A4","CH_JP8E_S_50:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D3","text":"The life of the organ constitutes a condition for the clarity of divinatory signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D4","text":"The spleen functions as an organic filter that preserves the liver's readiness for signification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D5","text":"The anatomical condition of the body alters the operation of divination and the clarity of signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","text":"The account concerning the soul must remain hypothetical, because human proof falls short of divine confirmation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","text":"The truth of divination is not produced from the initial experience alone, but from the correct allocation of roles among madness, sign, interpretation, and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A1","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A3","CH_JP8E_S_50:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2","text":"Physiology functions as a material condition of signification, but not as a self-sufficient guarantee of truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD3","text":"Scientific explanation acquires epistemological value through explicit moderation and not through absolute certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4","text":"Anatomy and psychology fall under a common generative schema, in which each phenomenon requires its own material and functional cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A7","CH_JP8E_S_50:A8","CH_JP8E_S_50:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX1","text":"Inner experience does not automatically constitute a criterion of interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX2","text":"Divine or divinatory origin does not abolish the need for human discrimination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX3","text":"Nomenclature does not necessarily identify the name of the diviner with the actual function of the prophet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX4","text":"The matter of the body is not explained as an indifferent aggregate of organs, but as an ordered system of relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX5","text":"Human thought cannot convert the probable into the necessary without external ratification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1","text":"A world in which the sign is interpreted without mediation, judgment, and rule is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX2","text":"The complete coincidence of divinatory inspiration and conscious knowledge is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX3","text":"Anatomy as matter independent of teleology and functional order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX4","text":"Absolute scientific possession of accounts concerning soul and body is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS1","text":"Divinatory ecstasy → Vision and voice → Inability of self-judgment → Temperate interpreter → Rational division of the sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS2","text":"God-inspired enigmatic utterance → Prophetic interpretation → Judge → Social validation of divination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS3","text":"Living liver → Clear signifier → Purifying spleen → Preservation of brightness → Divinatory readiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS4","text":"Disease or death → Corruption of organic function → Dimness or blindness of signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","text":"Human hypothesis → Distinction of probable and true → Need for divine agreement → Provisional suspension of certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS6","text":"Reasoning concerning the soul → Anatomical principle → Derivation of the rest of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:AF1","text":"Ambiguity of divinatory signs → Inability of the madman → Need for a temperate judge → Distinction between diviner and prophet → Anatomical grounding of divination → Hypothetical knowledge of the soul → Derivation of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1","text":"Divination is reclassified from automatic revelation into a sign requiring interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME2","text":"The prophet is reclassified from a bearer of primary knowledge into a mediator of another's divinatory voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3","text":"Anatomy is shown to be a necessary condition for understanding divinatory function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4","text":"The distinction between truth and probability transforms physiological explanation into an experimental and hypothetical account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ME5","text":"The transition from soul to body unifies psychological, anatomical, and cosmological causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Visions, voices, divinations, and organs of the body constitute the immediate objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Signification is produced through the relation of madness, organ, purification, judge, and interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Knowledge requires distance from experience and the subjection of inspiration to rational examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The divine and the mortal are distinguished, while the clarity of signs changes according to life, disease, and death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT1","text":"The system of axioms suffices for reconstructing the course from divinatory disclosure to rational judgment and physiological explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2","text":"Internal coherence rests on the distinction among inspiration, interpretation, organic condition, and divine certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT3","text":"The precise manner in which bodily signs signify future, present, or past things is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4","text":"There remains a tension between the claim of signification by divinatory signs and the inability of self-sufficient proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account, because it connects interpretive restraint, anatomical teleology, and epistemological moderation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_50:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_50@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_50:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 72"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 56","title":"Section 72","context":"Chapter 56","original_title":"Section 72","original_context":"Chapter 56"},"original_title":"Section 72","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51","layer":"CH","title":"Section 73","order":57,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_51"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_51@R001","sha256":"913b5ec0a6551a50e53c41f7c2384dd65e9932e04cf5784be85ec1f53f3beaf7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἀκολασία τῶν θνητῶν περὶ ποτῶν καὶ ἐδεστῶν καὶ ἡ ἐξ αὐτῆς φθορὰ τοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS2","text":"Ἡ τοῦ σώματος κατασκευή ἀναφαίνεται ὡς πρόνοια πρὸς τὸ ἀναγκαῖον καὶ μέτριον, οὐ πρὸς τὴν ἀπληστίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS3","text":"Ἡ κάτω κοιλία καὶ ἡ εἱλικτὴ γένεσις τῶν ἐντέρων ρυθμίζουσι τὴν παραμονὴν τῆς τροφῆς, ἵνα μὴ ἡ ἀδιάκοπος ἐπιθυμία κατακυριεύσῃ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS4","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή τῶν ὀστῶν καὶ σαρκῶν ἀνάγεται εἰς τὸν μυελόν, ὅπου οἱ δεσμοὶ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ῥιζοῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις τῶν στοιχείων καὶ τῶν τριγώνων παράγει τὰ σχήματα τοῦ μυελοῦ, τὸν ἐγκέφαλον, τὸν ὀστοῦν καὶ τὸ λοιπὸν σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS6","text":"Ἡ γένεσις τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος συνίσταται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ σύνδεσις ψυχικοῦ σπέρματος, μυελοῦ, ὀστέων καὶ σαρκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν γένος ἐνδέχεται διὰ μαργότητα πολλῷ πλέονι τοῦ μετρίου καὶ ἀναγκαίου χρῆσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀμετρία τροφῆς καὶ ποτοῦ δύναται νόσους καὶ πρόωρον φθορὰν ἐργάζεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις ἐτέθη προνοητικῶς πρὸς τὴν διατήρησιν τοῦ θνητοῦ γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ δεῖ βραδέως διεκπεραίνεσθαι, ἵνα μὴ τὸ σῶμα ἀναγκάζηται διὰ ταχύτητα πάλιν τροφῆς δεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A5","text":"Ἡ ἀπληστία ἀποσπά τὸ γένος ἀπὸ τοῦ θειοτάτου παρ’ ἡμῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","text":"Ὁ μυελὸς ἀποτελεῖ τὴν ἀρχὴν τῶν ὀστῶν, σαρκῶν καὶ τῆς λοιπῆς σωματικῆς φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A7","text":"Οἱ δεσμοὶ τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὸ σῶμα διὰ τοῦ μυελοῦ ἐνσωματοῦνται καὶ ῥιζοῦνται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","text":"Τὰ πρῶτα, λεῖα καὶ ἄστραβα τρίγωνα δύνανται ἀκριβέστατα παρέχειν πῦρ, ὕδωρ, ἀέρα καὶ γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A9","text":"Ἡ θεία δύναμις ἀποκρίνει τὰ στοιχειώδη γένη, συγκεράννυσιν αὐτὰ συμμέτρως καὶ ἐξ αὐτῶν παράγει τὸν μυελόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A10","text":"Ὁ μυελὸς διαιρεῖται κατὰ τὰ μέλλοντα σχήματα τῶν ψυχικῶν καὶ σωματικῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A11","text":"Ὁ ἐγκέφαλος ὑποδέχεται τὸ θεῖον σπέρμα, ὁ δὲ λοιπὸς μυελὸς τὸ θνητὸν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A12","text":"Τὸ ὀστοῦν παράγεται διὰ διαδοχικῆς μεταφορᾶς γῆς μεμιγμένης μυελῷ διὰ πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX1","text":"Τὸ σωματικὸν γένος οὐκ ἀρκείται αὐτομάτως τῷ μετρίῳ καὶ ἀναγκαίῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX2","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐ δεῖ ταχέως διεκπεραιοῦσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX3","text":"Ἡ γαστριμαργία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ φιλοσοφίαν οὐδὲ μουσικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπληστία οὐ συμβιβάζεται πρὸς τὸ θειότατον μέρος τοῦ ἀνθρώπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX5","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἄτακτον ἢ ἀσύνδετον σωρείαν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX6","text":"Ὁ μυελὸς οὐκ ἔχει ἁπλῶς ὕλην, ἀλλὰ λειτουργεῖ ὡς φορεὺς δεσμῶν ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX7","text":"Τὰ ὀστᾶ οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἀρχὴν ἀνεξάρτητον τῆς στοιχειώδους καὶ μυελικῆς συστάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀμετρία φθείρει καὶ ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις προνοεῖ, ἡ λειτουργία τῶν πεπτικῶν ὀργάνων ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς μηχανὴ περιορισμοῦ τῆς ἀπληστίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ταχεῖα διέλευσις τῆς τροφῆς γεννᾷ νέαν ἀνάγκην, ἡ βραδύτης τῆς πεπτικῆς κινήσεως καθίσταται ὅρος σωματικῆς αὐταρκείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ γαστριμαργία ἀποσπᾷ ἀπὸ τοῦ θειοτάτου, ἡ σωματικὴ ῥύθμισις ἔχει συγχρόνως ἠθικὴν καὶ γνωστικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ μυελὸς ῥιζοῖ τὸ θνητὸν γένος, ἡ σωματικὴ στερεότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ τῆς ἀρχικῆς συνδέσεως ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ μυελὸς παράγεται ἐκ συμμέτρου κράσεως τῶν στοιχείων, ἡ ὀργανικὴ μορφὴ ἐρείδεται εἰς μαθηματικὴν ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D6","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ μυελὸς διαιρεῖται κατὰ τὰ μέλλοντα σχήματα, ὁ ἐγκέφαλος καὶ τὰ λοιπὰ τοῦ σώματος μέρη ἔχουσι διακεκριμένην ἀρχιτεκτονικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A10","CH_JP8E_S_51:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D7","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὀστοῦν ἀπαιτεῖ διαδοχικὴν ἐπεξεργασίαν πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος, ἡ σκληρότης τοῦ σώματος ἀποτελεῖ προϊόν μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ οὐκ ἀρχικὴν δεδομένην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἐνσώματος ἠθικὸς μηχανισμός, ὃς μετατρέπει τὴν ἀνάγκην τῆς διατροφῆς εἰς ὅρον πειθαρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ θνητοῦ ὄντος παράγεται διὰ ἀλυσιδώτου τάξεως στοιχείων, μυελοῦ, ψυχῆς, ὀστῶν καὶ σαρκῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9","CH_JP8E_S_51:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν θνητότητα, ἀλλὰ κατασκευάζει ἐντὸς αὐτῆς μηχανὰς παρατάσεως καὶ συγκρατήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ ἐξήγησις συγχρόνως ἀποκαθιστᾷ κοσμικὴν τάξιν καὶ ἀποδίδωσι τὴν ἀταξίαν τῇ ἀνθρωπίνῃ ἀμετρίᾳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX1","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν σώμα δὲν νοεῖται ὡς ἀρχὴ αὐτοτελοῦς ἐπιθυμίας, ἀλλ’ ὡς διάταξις ἣν ἡ θεία πρόνοια προκαταλαμβάνει καὶ περιορίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX2","text":"Ἡ βιολογικὴ λειτουργία δὲν ἐπιτρέπεται νὰ ἀναχθῇ εἰς ἁπλὴν μηχανικὴν αἰτίαν ἄνευ ἠθικῆς σημασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἀδιάφορον ὑπόστρωμα, ἀλλὰ ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ἀναλογίαν, σχήμα καὶ σκοπόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ψυχή δὲν ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀσώματος δύναμις ἀνεξάρτητος τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ δέεται διὰ τοῦ μυελοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX5","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ σταθερότης δὲν θεωρεῖται φυσικῶς αὐτόματος, ἀλλὰ προϊόν ἐπεξεργασίας καὶ συνδέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἐπιθυμία ἔχει ἀπεριόριστον φυσικὸν κύρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ διάστασις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς ὡς ἀρχικὴ καὶ ἀνυπέρβλητος ῥήξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὕλη ὡς ἀνόητος τυχαιότης ἄνευ μορφοποιούσης τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἑνὸς θνητοῦ γένους ἀπηλλαγμένου ἀπὸ νόσου, φθορᾶς καὶ ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιβίωσις δὲν νοεῖται ἄνευ περιορισμοῦ τῆς ἀπληστίας καὶ ὑποταγῆς τοῦ σώματος εἰς ὑψηλοτέραν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","text":"Ἀνθρωπίνη ἀμετρία → κίνδυνος νόσου καὶ φθορᾶς → θεία πρόνοια → κατασκευή πεπτικῆς ἀνασχέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2","text":"Βραδεῖα διάλυσις τροφῆς → περιορισμὸς ἐπαναλαμβανομένης ἀνάγκης → ἔλεγχος ἀπληστίας → διατήρησις γένους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","text":"Πρῶτα τρίγωνα → σύμμετρος κράσις στοιχείων → γένεσις μυελοῦ → ρίζωσις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS4","text":"Διαίρεσις μυελοῦ κατὰ σχήματα → ἐγκέφαλος καὶ λοιπὸς μυελός → διαφοροποίησις θείου καὶ θνητοῦ ψυχικοῦ μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5","text":"Μυελὸς → ὀστέινον κάλυμμα → διαδοχὴ πυρὸς καὶ ὕδατος → ἄτηκτον ὀστοῦν → σωματικὴ στερέωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6","text":"Σωματικὴ ἀνάγκη → ὀργανικὴ ρύθμισις → ψυχικὴ ἱεράρχησις → διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ ὄντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AF1","text":"Ἀμετρία → φθορὰ τοῦ γένους → προνοητικὴ ἀνατομία → ρύθμισις τροφῆς → μυελὸς ὡς σύνδεσμος → διαίρεσις ψυχικοῦ καὶ σωματικοῦ → ὀστέινος σχηματισμός → στερεὰ σωματικὴ τάξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1","text":"Ἡ πέψις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἁπλῆν βιολογικὴν λειτουργίαν εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἠθικῆς ῥυθμίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2","text":"Ὁ μυελὸς ἀναδεικνύεται εἰς μεταβατικὸν τόπον ὅπου ἡ ψυχὴ συνδέεται ὀργανικῶς μετὰ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἀνασυντάσσεται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ διάταξις τοῦ θείου καὶ τοῦ θνητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φύσεως καὶ ἠθικῆς καταλύεται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ φυσικὴ κατασκευή ἤδη ἐνσωματῶνει κανόνα συμπεριφορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME5","text":"Ἡ στερεότης τοῦ σώματος ταξινομεῖται ὡς τελικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα στοιχειώδους μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀρχικὴ ἁπλότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφάνεια περιλαμβάνει τροφήν, ποτά, κοιλίαν, ἔντερα, μυελόν, ὀστᾶ καὶ σάρκας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2","text":"Ἐν δομικῷ ἐπιπέδῳ ἡ λειτουργία τοῦ σώματος ρυθμίζει ἀνάγκην, ἐπιθυμίαν, ψυχήν καὶ διατήρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT3","text":"Ἐν μεταστρατηγικῷ ἐπιπέδῳ ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις μετατρέπει τὴν ἠθικὴν ἀπειλὴν τῆς ἀμετρίας εἰς ὀργανικὸν κανόνα περιορισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT4","text":"Ἐν ὀντολογικῷ ἐπιπέδῳ τὸ θνητὸν ὄν συνίσταται διὰ συνδέσεως ψυχῆς, στοιχείων, σχημάτων καὶ μεταβαλλομένης ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5","text":"Ἐν χρονικῷ ἐπιπέδῳ ἡ γένεσις προχωρεῖ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀρχικὴν σπερματικὴν διαίρεσιν εἰς διαδοχικοὺς μετασχηματισμοὺς ὀργάνων καὶ ὑλῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀμετρίαν εἰς τὴν προνοητικὴν σωματικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν πεπτικῆς ῥυθμίσεως, μυελικῆς συνδέσεως καὶ ὀστέινης στερεώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθ’ ὃν ὁ μυελὸς μεταβαίνει εἰς σάρκα καὶ τὰ λοιπὰ μέρη τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ’ ὅσον ἡ θεία πρόνοια, ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἀναλογία καὶ ἡ ἠθικὴ ῥύθμισις λαμβάνονται ὡς ἑνιαῖον σύστημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα σύνδεσις τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ ἀλληλεξάρτησις ψυχῆς, μυελοῦ καὶ σωματικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἐνδογενὴς ἔντασις ἔγκειται ἐν τῷ ὅτι τὸ σῶμα κατασκευάζεται πρὸς διατήρησιν, ἀλλὰ παραμένει ἐξ ἀρχῆς ὑποκείμενον εἰς νόσον, ἀνάγκην καὶ φθοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν γενετικὴν λογικὴν τοῦ χωρίου, ἀλλὰ συμπτύσσει τὴν λεπτομέρειαν τῶν στοιχειωδῶν μετασχηματισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231340801344Z_1f9e9735","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 73","source_sha256":"913b5ec0a6551a50e53c41f7c2384dd65e9932e04cf5784be85ec1f53f3beaf7","sha256":"1ee2bbd73228b7754c4e9357dfd16599dc84da338ddd3a61e0a8e728ff035990","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:13:40.802406+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS1","text":"The problem is the intemperance of mortals concerning drink and food, and the consequent destruction of the race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS2","text":"The construction of the body appears as providence directed toward what is necessary and moderate, not toward greed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS3","text":"The lower belly and the convoluted formation of the intestines regulate the retention of food, so that uninterrupted desire may not gain mastery over the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS4","text":"The construction of bones and flesh is traced back to marrow, where the bonds of soul and body are rooted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS5","text":"The divine arrangement of the elements and triangles produces the forms of marrow, the brain, bone, and the rest of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AS6","text":"The generation of the mortal body consists as a hierarchical connection of psychic seed, marrow, bones, and flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","text":"The mortal race is capable, through foolishness, of using far more than what is moderate and necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","text":"Immoderation in food and drink can produce diseases and premature destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","text":"The bodily arrangement was providentially established for the preservation of the mortal race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","text":"Food must be conveyed slowly, lest the body be compelled, on account of rapidity, to require food again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A5","text":"Greed draws the race away from what is most divine in us.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","text":"Marrow constitutes the principle of bones, flesh, and the remaining bodily nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A7","text":"The bonds of the soul to the body are embodied and rooted through marrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","text":"The primary, smooth, and even triangles are able most exactly to furnish fire, water, air, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A9","text":"Divine power separates the elemental kinds, mixes them proportionately, and from them produces marrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A10","text":"Marrow is divided according to the future forms of the psychic and bodily parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A11","text":"The brain receives the divine seed, while the remaining marrow receives the mortal part of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:A12","text":"Bone is produced through the successive transference, by fire and water, of earth mixed with marrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX1","text":"The bodily race is not automatically satisfied with what is moderate and necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX2","text":"Food must not be conveyed quickly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX3","text":"Gluttony does not constitute philosophy or music.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX4","text":"Greed is not compatible with the most divine part of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX5","text":"The body does not constitute a disorderly or unconnected heap of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX6","text":"Marrow does not merely have matter, but functions as the bearer of bonds between soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:NX7","text":"Bones do not have a principle independent of elemental and marrowy composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D1","text":"Since immoderation destroys and bodily arrangement provides, the operation of the digestive organs is interpreted as a mechanism for limiting greed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D2","text":"Since the rapid passage of food generates a new need, the slowness of digestive motion becomes a condition of bodily self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D3","text":"Since gluttony draws one away from what is most divine, bodily regulation has simultaneously an ethical and cognitive function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D4","text":"Since marrow roots the mortal race, bodily solidity depends upon the original connection of soul and body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D5","text":"Since marrow is produced from a proportionate mixture of the elements, organic form rests upon mathematical proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D6","text":"Since marrow is divided according to future forms, the brain and the remaining parts of the body have a distinct architectural function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A10","CH_JP8E_S_51:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:D7","text":"Since bone requires successive processing by fire and water, the hardness of the body is a product of transformation and not an original given.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1","text":"Bodily form appears as an embodied ethical mechanism, which transforms the necessity of nourishment into a condition of discipline.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A4","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2","text":"The unity of the mortal being is produced through a concatenated order of elements, marrow, soul, bones, and flesh.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9","CH_JP8E_S_51:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","text":"Divine providence does not eliminate mortality, but constructs within it mechanisms of prolongation and restraint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4","text":"Anatomical explanation simultaneously restores cosmic order and attributes disorder to human immoderation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A1","CH_JP8E_S_51:A3","CH_JP8E_S_51:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX1","text":"The mortal body is not conceived as the principle of self-directed desire, but as an arrangement which divine providence anticipates and limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX2","text":"Biological function is not permitted to be reduced to a simple mechanical cause without ethical significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3","text":"Matter does not constitute an indifferent substratum, but is subject to proportion, shape, and purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX4","text":"The soul does not appear as an incorporeal power independent of the body, but is bound through marrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX5","text":"Bodily stability is not regarded as naturally automatic, but as a product of processing and connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX1","text":"A world in which desire possesses unlimited natural authority is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX2","text":"The separation of body and soul as an original and insurmountable rupture is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3","text":"Matter as mindless contingency without formative order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a mortal race freed from disease, destruction, and necessity is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5","text":"Survival is not conceived without the limitation of greed and the subjection of the body to a higher order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","text":"Human immoderation → danger of disease and destruction → divine providence → construction of digestive restraint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2","text":"Slow digestion of food → limitation of recurrent need → control of greed → preservation of the race.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","text":"Primary triangles → proportionate mixture of elements → generation of marrow → rooting of soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS4","text":"Division of marrow according to forms → brain and remaining marrow → differentiation of the divine and mortal parts of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5","text":"Marrow → bony covering → succession of fire and water → infusible bone → bodily consolidation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6","text":"Bodily necessity → organic regulation → psychic hierarchy → preservation of the mortal being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:AF1","text":"Immoderation → destruction of the race → providential anatomy → regulation of food → marrow as bond → division of psychic and bodily → bony formation → solid bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1","text":"Digestion is shifted from a simple biological function into a mechanism of ethical regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2","text":"Marrow is brought to light as a transitional place where the soul is organically connected with the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME3","text":"Bodily architecture is reconstituted as a hierarchical arrangement of the divine and the mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","text":"The opposition between nature and ethics is dissolved, because natural construction already embodies a rule of conduct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ME5","text":"The solidity of the body is classified as the final result of elemental transformation and not as original simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT1","text":"The surface includes food, drinks, belly, intestines, marrow, bones, and flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the function of the body regulates need, desire, soul, and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, bodily arrangement transforms the ethical threat of immoderation into an organic rule of limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, the mortal being consists through the connection of soul, elements, forms, and changing matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, generation proceeds from the original seminal division to successive transformations of organs and materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the basic movement from immoderation to providential bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the sequence of digestive regulation, marrowy connection, and bony consolidation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3","text":"The exact manner in which marrow passes into flesh and the remaining parts of the body is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as divine providence, mathematical proportion, and ethical regulation are taken as a unified system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection of the system is the interdependence of soul, marrow, and bodily form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6","text":"The intrinsic tension lies in the fact that the body is constructed for preservation, yet remains from the beginning subject to disease, necessity, and destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the genetic logic of the passage, but condenses the detail of the elemental transformations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_51:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_51@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_51:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 73"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 57","title":"Section 73","context":"Chapter 57","original_title":"Section 73","original_context":"Chapter 57"},"original_title":"Section 73","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52","layer":"CH","title":"Section 74","order":58,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_52"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_52@R001","sha256":"418b4a21b39e17531472631310319ddd11218854fcfbbdf4928489e03ecd5eb7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS1","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅπως τὸ ἔμψυχον σπέρμα ἐν σώματι στερεῷ μὲν διασωθῇ, κινήσιμος δὲ καὶ αἰσθητικὴ ἡ σύστασις μείνῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS2","text":"Ἡ λύσις ἀναζητεῖται διὰ διαβαθμισμένης συνθέσεως ὀστέων, μυελῶν, νεύρων καὶ σαρκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS3","text":"Ἕκαστον γένος ὕλης ὁρίζεται ἐκ τῆς ἰδίας ἀνεπαρκείας καὶ τῆς πρὸς τὸ ὅλον λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ σώματος ἀνακατασκευάζεται ὡς μηχανὴ ἀμοιβαίας ἀντισταθμίσεως σκληρότητος, καμπῆς, θερμότητος καὶ προστασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS5","text":"Ὁ λόγος κινεῖται ἀπὸ τὴν διάσωσιν τοῦ σπέρματος πρὸς τὴν ἀναλογίαν τῶν καλυμμάτων καὶ τὴν ἀποφυγὴν τῆς ἀκινησίας καὶ ἀναισθησίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","text":"Τὸ σπέρμα ἀπαιτεῖ περίβλημα στερεὸν ὑπὲρ τῆς διασώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","text":"Ἡ ὀστέινη φύσις ἐστὶν ἰσχυροτέρα καὶ ἀκαμπτοτέρα τοῦ προσήκοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","text":"Ἡ ὀστέινη θερμότης καὶ ψῦξις δύναται ταχέως φθείρειν τὸ ἐντὸς σπέρμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","text":"Ἡ κίνησις καὶ ἡ κάμψις ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἄρθρωσιν καὶ μέσην δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα δύνανται συνδέειν, κάμπτειν καὶ ἐκτείνειν τὰ μέλη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ προστασίᾳ ἀπὸ καυμάτων, χειμώνων καὶ πτωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A7","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ περιέχει θερμὴν νοτίδα, ἣ τὸ θερινὸν ψῦχος καὶ τὸ χειμερινὸν πάγος μετριάζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A8","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ συνίσταται ἐκ στοιχείων ὕδατος, πυρός, γῆς καὶ ὀξέος ἁλμυροῦ μίγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A9","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα καταλαμβάνουσι μέσην δύναμιν μεταξὺ σαρκὸς καὶ ὀστοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","text":"Ἡ ποσότης τῆς σαρκὸς ὀφείλει ἀκολουθεῖν τῇ ζωτικῇ ἀναγκαιότητι καὶ ταῖς συμβολαῖς τῶν ὀστέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A11","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ ὕλης ἐν ταῖς καμπαῖς δύναται ποιεῖν τὸ σῶμα δυσκίνητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A12","text":"Ἡ πυκνὴ καὶ στερεὰ σάρξ δύναται ποιεῖν τὸ σῶμα ἀναίσθητον καὶ τὰ περὶ τὴν διάνοιαν κωφά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀρκεί ἄνευ περιβλήματος πρὸς τὴν διάσωσιν τοῦ σπέρματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX2","text":"Τὸ ὀστοῦν οὐκ ἐπαρκεῖ μόνος ὁ φορεὺς τῆς ζωτικῆς συνέχειας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX3","text":"Ἡ σκληρότης οὐ ταυτίζεται πρὸς τὴν ἀρμόζουσαν σωματικὴν ἕξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀκαμψία οὐ δύναται ἀφ’ ἑαυτῆς παρέχειν κίνησιν καὶ κάμψιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX5","text":"Ἡ γυμνότης τῶν ὀστέων οὐκ ἀρκεί πρὸς θερμικὴν καὶ μηχανικὴν προστασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX6","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ κάλυψις σαρκὶ οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ὅπου ἐμποδίζει τὰς καμπὰς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX7","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης καὶ στερεότης οὐκ ἀποτελοῦσιν ἄνευ ὅρου ἀρετὴν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D1","text":"Ἡ στερεὰ ὀστέινη περίφραξις ὑποχρεοῖ τὴν κατασκευήν ἀρθρώσεων καὶ μέσων κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὀστοῦν φθείρει τὸ ἐντὸς σπέρμα, ἀπαιτεῖται ἑτέρα ὕλη μεσιτεύουσα μεταξὺ ὀστέου καὶ σαρκὸς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D3","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα ἀναλαμβάνουσι τὴν σύνδεσιν τῶν ὀστέων καὶ τὴν μετατροπὴν τῆς στερεότητος εἰς καμπτὴν κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D4","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐξωτερικὸν ἀμυντήριον καὶ ὡς θερμικὸς ῥυθμιστὴς τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D5","text":"Ἡ διαφοροποίησις τῆς σαρκικῆς καλύψεως κατὰ τὴν ζωτικότητα τῶν ὀστέων παράγει ἀνομοιόμορφον σωματικὴν ἐπένδυσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D6","text":"Ἡ ἐλάττωσις σαρκὸς κατὰ τὰς συμβολὰς τῶν ὀστέων διατηρεῖ τὴν κινητικότητα τῶν μελῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D7","text":"Ἡ ἀποφυγὴ τῆς ὑπερβολικῆς σαρκὸς διατηρεῖ τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν διανοητικὴν ἐγρήγορσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα συγκροτεῖται διὰ ἱεραρχημένης ἀντισταθμίσεως, ἐν ᾗ ἡ ἑκάστου ὕλης ἀνεπάρκεια μετατρέπεται εἰς λειτουργίαν ἑτέρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD2","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ σώματος παράγεται οὐκ ἐκ μιᾶς ἀρχῆς, ἀλλ’ ἐκ διαδοχικῶν μεσολαβήσεων μεταξὺ ζωῆς, στερεότητος, κινήσεως καὶ προστασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀναλογία ὁρίζεται ἀρνητικῶς ὑπὸ τῶν βλαβῶν αἳ ἐκ τῆς ὑπερβολῆς ἑκάστου στοιχείου γεννῶνται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","CH_JP8E_S_52:A11","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD4","text":"Ἡ τελεολογικὴ κατασκευή τοῦ σώματος συνδέει τὴν ἀνατομίαν πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν, τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν διάνοιαν ὡς ἑνιαῖον σύστημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ ὕλη ἔχει ἀνεξάρτητον καὶ ἀδιάφορον σύστασιν ἔξω τοῦ τελικοῦ ἔργου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ὑπεροχὴ μιᾶς σωματικῆς ἀξίας ἐπὶ πάντων τῶν λειτουργικῶν ἀναγκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX3","text":"Οὐ χωρίζονται ἡ μηχανικὴ κίνησις, ἡ θερμικὴ ρύθμισις, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ διάνοια εἰς ἀνεξάρτητα πεδία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀναγνωρίζεται ἡ προστασία ὡς ἁπλὴ προσθήκη ἐπὶ σώματος ἤδη τετελεσμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX5","text":"Οὐκ ἀναγνωρίζεται ἡ στερεότης ὡς τελικὸς σκοπὸς ἄνευ τοῦ μέτρου τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς αἰσθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης σώματος ὃ ἅμα ἄνευ συμβιβασμοῦ ἔσται στερεὸν, εὔκαμπτον, θερμὸν καὶ αἰσθητικόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἁπλῆ ὕλη ὡς αὐτάρκης ἐξήγησις τῆς σωματικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ ὁλότητα οὐ νοεῖται ἄνευ ἐσωτερικῶν ὁρίων, ἀποκλίσεων καὶ λειτουργικῶν περιορισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS1","text":"Ζωτικὸν σπέρμα → ἀνάγκη στερεᾶς διασώσεως → ὀστέινος περίβολος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS2","text":"Ὀστέινος περίβολος → ἀκαμψία καὶ θερμικὸς κίνδυνος → νεῦρα ὡς μέση συνδετικὴ δύναμις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS3","text":"Νευρικὴ σύνδεσις → κάμψις καὶ ἔκτασις → σκελετὸς κινητός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS4","text":"Κινητὸς σκελετός → ἀνάγκη ἐξωτερικῆς ἀμύνης καὶ θερμικῆς ῥυθμίσεως → μαλακὴ ἔγχυμος σάρξ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS5","text":"Σαρκικὴ ἐπένδυσις → κίνδυνος δυσκινησίας, ἀναισθησίας καὶ κωφώσεως → διαφορὰ πάχους κατὰ ζωτικότητα καὶ συμβολάς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS6","text":"Περιορισμὸς ὕλης → συντήρησις κινήσεως, αἰσθήσεως καὶ διανοητικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AF1","text":"Διάσωσις σπέρματος → ὀστέινη περίφραξις → ἀκαμψία καὶ φθορά → νεῦρα → κίνησις → σάρξ → προστασία → περιορισμὸς σαρκὸς → αἴσθησις καὶ διάνοια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1","text":"Τὸ ὀστοῦν ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἁπλὸν στήριγμα εἰς φυλακὴν ἣ χρειάζεται μεσολάβησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ὑποκείμενον μέρος εἰς δυναμικὴν γέφυραν μεταξὺ στερεότητος καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME3","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἁπλὸν κάλυμμα εἰς θερμικὸν, μηχανικὸν καὶ αἰσθητηριακὸν ῥυθμιστήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀφθονία ὕλης παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ τελειότητα καὶ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς πιθανὴ πηγή δυσλειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ διάταξις συνδέεται ἄμεσα πρὸς τὴν δυνατότητα διανοεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ἡ κατασκευὴ ὀστέων, νεύρων, μυελῶν καὶ σαρκῶν ρυθμίζεται πρὸς συγκεκριμένα σωματικὰ ἔργα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2","text":"Structural: Τὸ σώμα συγκροτεῖται ὡς σύστημα διαβαθμισμένων ὑλικῶν, ὧν ἡ λειτουργία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν ἀναλογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ τί ἐστιν ἕκαστον μέρος πρὸς τὸ τί κίνδυνον ἀποτρέπει καὶ τί ἔργον καθιστᾷ δυνατόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Ἡ σωματικὴ φύσις νοεῖται τελεολογικῶς, ὡς διαδοχὴ λύσεων ἐπὶ ἀναγκῶν καὶ ὡς ρύθμισις θερμότητος, ψύξεως, κινήσεως καὶ φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσιν ἀνακατασκευάσαι τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τῆς διασώσεως τοῦ σπέρματος εἰς τὴν διαφοροποίησιν τῆς σαρκὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν κεντρικὴν ἀκολουθίαν στερεότης → μεσολάβησις → κίνησις → προστασία → περιορισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT3","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς χημικὴ σύστασις τῶν σαρκῶν καὶ νεύρων παραμένει ὑποτεταγμένη τῷ λειτουργικῷ λόγῳ καὶ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτοτελῆ ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἡ τελεολογία ὁρίζει τὸ μέτρον ἑκάστου ὑλικοῦ στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀνάγκης στερεᾶς προστασίας καὶ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἐλευθέρας κινήσεως καὶ αἰσθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231356841043Z_606a469b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 74","source_sha256":"418b4a21b39e17531472631310319ddd11218854fcfbbdf4928489e03ecd5eb7","sha256":"5bfc266095f3b36afebb6b9da805c1cda7b6df31e9e22a26dc5e365cbd712811","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:13:56.842203+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS1","text":"The principal problem is how the ensouled seed may be preserved in a solid body, while the composition remains capable of motion and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS2","text":"The solution is sought through a graduated composition of bones, marrows, sinews, and flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS3","text":"Each kind of matter is defined by its own insufficiency and by its function in relation to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4","text":"The nature of the body is reconstructed as a mechanism of reciprocal counterbalancing of hardness, bending, heat, and protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AS5","text":"The account proceeds from the preservation of the seed toward the proportion of coverings and the avoidance of immobility and insensibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","text":"The seed requires a solid enclosure for the sake of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","text":"The bony nature is stronger and more inflexible than is fitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","text":"Bony heat and cold are capable of rapidly destroying the seed within.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","text":"Motion and bending require articulation and a middle power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","text":"Sinews are capable of connecting, bending, and extending the limbs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","text":"Flesh serves for protection against heats, winters, and falls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A7","text":"Flesh contains warm moisture, which moderates summer cold and winter frost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A8","text":"Flesh consists of the elements of water, fire, earth, and a sharp salty mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A9","text":"Sinews occupy a middle power between flesh and bone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","text":"The quantity of flesh ought to follow vital necessity and the joints of the bones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A11","text":"An excess of matter at the bends is capable of making the body difficult to move.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:A12","text":"Dense and solid flesh is capable of making the body insensible and the faculties concerning thought dull.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX1","text":"The body is not sufficient without an enclosure for the preservation of the seed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX2","text":"Bone alone is not sufficient as the bearer of vital continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX3","text":"Hardness is not identical with the fitting bodily condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX4","text":"Inflexibility cannot by itself provide motion and bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX5","text":"The nakedness of the bones is not sufficient for thermal and mechanical protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX6","text":"Universal covering with flesh is not permitted where it impedes the bends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:NX7","text":"Density and solidity do not constitute, without qualification, a virtue of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D1","text":"The solid bony enclosure necessitates the construction of joints and means of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D2","text":"Since bone destroys the seed within, another matter mediating between bone and flesh is required.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D3","text":"Sinews undertake the connection of the bones and the transformation of solidity into flexible motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D4","text":"Flesh functions as an external defense and as a thermal regulator of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D5","text":"The differentiation of fleshly covering according to the vitality of the bones produces a non-uniform bodily covering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D6","text":"The reduction of flesh at the joints of the bones preserves the mobility of the limbs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:D7","text":"The avoidance of excessive flesh preserves sensation and intellectual wakefulness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1","text":"The body is constituted through a hierarchized counterbalancing, in which the insufficiency of each matter is transformed into the function of another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A2","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD2","text":"The form of the body is produced not from a single principle, but from successive mediations between life, solidity, motion, and protection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1","CH_JP8E_S_52:A4","CH_JP8E_S_52:A6","CH_JP8E_S_52:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD3","text":"Bodily proportion is defined negatively by the harms that arise from the excess of each element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A3","CH_JP8E_S_52:A11","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SD4","text":"The teleological construction of the body connects anatomy with sensation, motion, and thought as a unified system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A5","CH_JP8E_S_52:A10","CH_JP8E_S_52:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX1","text":"It is not assumed that matter has an independent and indifferent constitution outside its final function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX2","text":"The predominance of one bodily value over all functional necessities is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX3","text":"Mechanical motion, thermal regulation, sensation, and thought are not separated into independent fields.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX4","text":"Protection is not recognized as a simple addition to a body already completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX5","text":"Solidity is not recognized as a final end without the measure of motion and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX1","text":"The possibility is absent of a body that will at once, without compromise, be solid, flexible, warm, and sensitive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX2","text":"Simple matter is excluded as a self-sufficient explanation of bodily form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX3","text":"Anatomical wholeness is not conceived without internal limits, deviations, and functional constraints.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS1","text":"Vital seed → necessity of solid preservation → bony enclosure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS2","text":"Bony enclosure → inflexibility and thermal danger → sinews as a middle connective power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS3","text":"Sinewy connection → bending and extension → movable skeleton.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS4","text":"Movable skeleton → necessity of external defense and thermal regulation → soft juicy flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS5","text":"Fleshly covering → danger of difficulty of motion, insensibility, and dullness → variation in thickness according to vitality and joints.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:FGS6","text":"Limitation of matter → preservation of motion, sensation, and intellectual activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:AF1","text":"Preservation of seed → bony enclosure → inflexibility and destruction → sinews → motion → flesh → protection → limitation of flesh → sensation and thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1","text":"Bone is reclassified from a simple support into a guard that requires mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","text":"Sinews are reclassified from a subordinate part into a dynamic bridge between solidity and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME3","text":"Flesh is reclassified from a simple covering into a thermal, mechanical, and sensory regulator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME4","text":"Abundance of matter ceases to signify perfection and is interpreted as a possible source of dysfunction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ME5","text":"Anatomical arrangement is directly connected with the capacity to think.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT1","text":"Surface: The construction of bones, sinews, marrows, and flesh is regulated toward specific bodily functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2","text":"Structural: The body is constituted as a system of graduated materials, whose function depends upon their reciprocal proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The explanation passes from what each part is to what danger it averts and what function it makes possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Bodily nature is conceived teleologically, as a succession of solutions to necessities and as a regulation of heat, cooling, motion, and destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice to reconstruct the transition from the preservation of the seed to the differentiation of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central sequence: solidity → mediation → motion → protection → limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT3","text":"The detailed chemical composition of flesh and sinews remains subordinate to the functional account and does not constitute an independent principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as teleology determines the measure of each material element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT5","text":"The internal tension remains between the necessity of solid protection and the necessity of free motion and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_52:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_52@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_52:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 74"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 58","title":"Section 74","context":"Chapter 58","original_title":"Section 74","original_context":"Chapter 58"},"original_title":"Section 74","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53","layer":"CH","title":"Section 75","order":59,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_53"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_53@R001","sha256":"d475358db21afaf8d24b86fe683a194fe4666798b3dcfebdd5d5292e79f4e16e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS1","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ σύνθεσις ὀστέων, σαρκῶν, νεύρων καὶ αἰσθήσεως ὑπὸ περιορισμῶν φυσικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS2","text":"Ἡ διάταξις τοῦ σώματος ἐξηγεῖται διὰ τῆς ἀναλογίας ἀκριβείας, ἰσχύος, μακροβιότητος καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS3","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς ὄργανον φρονήσεως καὶ αἰσθήσεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ τοῦτο ἀσθενέστερον τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS4","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή τῶν νεύρων ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην συνδέσεως κεφαλῆς, γνάθων, αὐχένος καὶ μελῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS5","text":"Ἡ τοῦ στόματος τάξις διακρίνει τὴν εἴσοδον τῶν ἀναγκαίων ἀπὸ τὴν ἔξοδον τῶν ἀρίστων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS6","text":"Ὁ λόγος κινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνατομικὴν διάταξιν πρὸς τὴν τελεολογικὴν ἱεράρχησιν τροφῆς καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","text":"Ἡ φύσις συντίθησι τὰ μέρη κατὰ τὴν ἀναγκαιότητα τῆς ἐνεργείας αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","text":"Τὸ πυκνὸν ὀστοῦν καὶ ἡ πολλὴ σὰρξ περιορίζουσι τὴν ὀξεῖαν αἴσθησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A3","text":"Τὰ ἔμφρονα μέρη ὀλιγωτέραν σάρκα προσδέχονται ἢ τὰ ἄφρονα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","text":"Ἡ μακροβιότης καὶ ἡ ἀρετὴ τοῦ βίου οὐ συμπίπτουσιν ἀναγκαίως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A5","text":"Ὁ βραχύτερος ἀλλὰ βελτίων βίος προκριτέος τοῦ μακροτέρου ἀλλὰ φαυλοτέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ δεῖ εἶναι εὐαισθητοτέρα καὶ φρονιμωτέρα, ἔστω καὶ ἀσθενεστέρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A7","text":"Ἡ ἀσφάλεια τῆς κεφαλῆς περιορίζεται ὑπὸ τῆς ἀνάγκης διατηρήσεως αἰσθήσεως καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A8","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα ὑπηρετοῦσι τὴν σύνδεσιν καὶ τὴν κίνησιν τῶν ἄρθρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","text":"Ἡ διάταξις τοῦ στόματος ὀργανώνει χωριστὰ τὴν λήψιν τροφῆς καὶ τὴν ἔκφρασιν λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A10","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ θεραπεύει τὸ σῶμα, ὁ δὲ λόγος ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ φρονήσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβεστάτη αἴσθησις οὐ συμβιβάζεται ἅμα μετὰ πυκνοῦ ὀστοῦ καὶ πολλῆς σαρκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX2","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ οὐ δύναται ἅμα να εἶναι κραταιοτάτη, σαρκωδεστάτη καὶ φρονιμωτάτη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX3","text":"Ἡ μακρὰ διάρκεια τοῦ βίου οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀφ᾽ ἑαυτῆς τὸ ἄριστον τέλος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX4","text":"Τὰ ἔμφρονα ὀστᾶ οὐ δύνανται νὰ πληρωθῶσιν ὁμοίως τοῖς ἀφρόσιν ὑπὸ σαρκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX5","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ οὐ στεγάζεται διὰ συμπαγοῦς ὀστέου καὶ βαρείας σαρκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX6","text":"Τὸ στόμα οὐκ ἔχει μίαν ἀδιαίρετον λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX7","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐκ ἀνήκει τῷ αὐτῷ τελεολογικῷ γένει μετὰ τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D1","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ γίνεται φρονιμωτέρα καὶ εὐαισθητοτέρα ὅσον ἀφαιρεῖται ἀπ᾽ αὐτῆς ἡ σωματικὴ πυκνότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A3","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀσθένεια τῆς κεφαλῆς ἀποτελεῖ τίμημα τῆς γνωστικῆς ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D3","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ σώματος ἐκφράζει προτίμησιν ποιότητος βίου ἀντὶ ποσότητος χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","CH_JP8E_S_53:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D4","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ περίστασις τῶν νεύρων περὶ τὸν αὐχένα ἐξασφαλίζει τὴν προσάρτησιν τῆς κεφαλῆς πρὸς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D5","text":"Ἡ διάσπειρσις τῶν νεύρων εἰς τὰ μέλη μετατρέπει τὸ σώμα εἰς ἑνιαῖον κινητικὸν σύστημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D6","text":"Ἡ ὀδοντοφυΐα, ἡ γλῶσσα καὶ τὰ χείλη μερίζουσι τὴν στοματικὴν λειτουργίαν κατὰ τὴν εἴσοδον καὶ τὴν ἔξοδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D7","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀναβαίνει τελεολογικῶς ὑπὲρ τῆς τροφῆς, ἐπειδὴ συνδέεται πρὸς τὴν φρόνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","CH_JP8E_S_53:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ παράγεται ὡς σύστημα ἀντισταθμίσεων, ἐν ᾧ ἡ αὔξησις μιᾶς ἱκανότητος ἀπαιτεῖ περιορισμὸν ἄλλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις ἐνσωματοῦται διὰ ἀσθενείας, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὄργανον αὐτῆς ἀποκλείει τὴν πλήρη ὀχυρότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία ἀποκαλύπτει ἱεράρχησιν ὅπου ἡ φρόνησις καὶ ὁ λόγος ἔχουσιν ὑψηλότερον τέλος ἢ ἡ συντήρησις τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A5","CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","CH_JP8E_S_53:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ ζῴου συγκροτεῖται διὰ ἀρθρώσεων καὶ συνδέσεων, οὐ διὰ ὁμοιογενοῦς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","CH_JP8E_S_53:A8","CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀπεριόριστος δύναμις συνδυασμοῦ πάντων τῶν ἀγαθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἀρκεί πρὸς τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῆς μορφῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τάξις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σκοπῶν καὶ ἀναγκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX3","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ παθητικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα ὑλικῆς πυκνότητος, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ ὑλικὴν ἐλάττωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX4","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ὑγεία οὐκ ἔχει ἀπόλυτον προτεραιότητα ἔναντι τῆς φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX5","text":"Ἡ λειτουργικὴ ἑνότης τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ ταὐτότητος τῶν μερῶν, ἀλλὰ διὰ διαφορᾶς καὶ συνδέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ φύσις παρέχει ἅμα ἀθανασίαν, ἰσχύν, ὀξύτητα αἰσθήσεως καὶ φρόνησιν ἄνευ κόστους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ σῶμα ἀποτελεῖ ἀδιάφορον φορέα νοῦ· ἡ διάταξίς του ἤδη φέρει ἀξιακὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰσοδυναμία τροφῆς καὶ λόγου, ἐπειδὴ τὸ μὲν συντηρεῖ τὸ ζῆν, ὁ δὲ ὑπηρετεῖ τῇ φρονήσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX4","text":"Ἡ πλήρης σωματικὴ ἀκεραιότης ἀπουσιάζει ὡς δυνατότης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γνώσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἴδιον σωματικὸν τίμημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS1","text":"Ἀνάγκη λειτουργίας → περιορισμὸς ὕλης → διαφοροποίησις μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS2","text":"Ἀπαίτησις αἰσθήσεως καὶ φρονήσεως → ἐλάττωσις σαρκὸς καὶ πυκνότητος ὀστέου → εὐαισθησία καὶ ἀσθένεια κεφαλῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS3","text":"Δίλημμα μακροβιότητος καὶ ἀρετῆς → προτίμησις βελτίονος βραχυτέρου βίου → ἄοπλος καὶ ἀσθενὴς κεφαλή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS4","text":"Ἀνάγκη ἑνότητος σώματος → κυκλικὴ σύνδεσις νεύρων → ἄρθρωσις κεφαλῆς καὶ μελῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS5","text":"Διάκρισις ἀναγκαίου καὶ ἀρίστου → εἴσοδος τροφῆς καὶ ἔξοδος λόγου → ὑλικὴ συντήρησις καὶ νοερὰ ὑπηρεσία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AF1","text":"Περιορισμὸς τῆς φυσικῆς συνθέσεως → ἀντιστάθμισις ἰσχύος καὶ φρονήσεως → ἰδιαίτερη κατασκευὴ κεφαλῆς → νευρικὴ ἑνότης σώματος → τελεολογικὴ διάκρισις τροφῆς καὶ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2","text":"Ἀνατομικὴ διαφορά → λειτουργικὴ ἱεράρχησις → προτεραιότης φρονήσεως ἔναντι ἁπλῆς διατηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀσθένεια τῆς κεφαλῆς ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαῖον ἀντάλλαγμα τῆς φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME2","text":"Ἡ μακροβιότης ἀποσυνδέεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἄριστον, ἐνώ ἡ ποιότης τοῦ βίου γίνεται μέτρον φυσικῆς κατασκευῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME3","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἱεραρχημένον δίκτυον λειτουργιῶν καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὸν ἄθροισμα ὀργάνων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME4","text":"Τὸ στόμα μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ κοινὸν ἀνατομικὸν μέρος εἰς ὅριον μεταξὺ σωματικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ νοερᾶς ἀριστείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ὕλης καὶ νοῦ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ σχέσεως ὀργανώσεως, ὅπου ἡ ὕλη μορφοῦται πρὸς νοερὸν τέλος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT1","text":"Surface — Τὰ ὀστᾶ, αἱ σάρκες, τὰ νεῦρα, ἡ κεφαλὴ καὶ τὸ στόμα διατάσσονται πρὸς ἰδίας λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ἡ σωματικὴ κατασκευή ρυθμίζεται ὑπὸ ἀναγκῶν, ἀμοιβαίων περιορισμῶν καὶ συνδέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ «τί ἐστιν» εἰς τὸ «τίνος ἕνεκα οὕτως ἐτάχθη», ἀναδεικνύουσα τὴν τελεολογίαν τῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Ἡ φύσις νοεῖται ὡς πεπερασμένη διάταξις ἐν χρόνῳ, ἣ προτιμᾷ βελτίονα βίον ἀντὶ μακροτέρου καὶ ἀναγνωρίζει ἀναγκαίαν σύγκρουσιν ἀγαθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκούσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναγκαιότητα τῆς φύσεως πρὸς τὴν τελεολογίαν τοῦ στόματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν ἀναγκαίου, ἀρίστου, αἰσθητοῦ καὶ φρονίμου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται στὴν ἀρχὴ ὅτι πᾶσα κερδισμένη ἱκανότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἄλλην ὑλικὴν ὑποχώρησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος, καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ δημιουργικὴ διάνοια ἐπιλέγει τὸ βέλτιον ἀντὶ τοῦ μακροτέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τελεολογικὴν ὑπόθεσιν, ἣ συνδέει τὴν ἀνατομίαν πρὸς ἱεράρχησιν τῶν ἀγαθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT6","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διατηρεῖ τὸ παραγωγικὸν σχήμα, ἀλλὰ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν λεπτομέρειαν τῶν ἐπιμέρους ἀνατομικῶν συνδέσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231416989117Z_742925b2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 75","source_sha256":"d475358db21afaf8d24b86fe683a194fe4666798b3dcfebdd5d5292e79f4e16e","sha256":"cdf37d4572a401282917b5f75fe687db4d976913deeec3ee0b984d93acf507e8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:14:16.993006+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS1","text":"The principal problem is the composition of bones, flesh, nerves, and sensation under natural constraints.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS2","text":"The arrangement of the body is explained through the proportion of precision, strength, longevity, and prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS3","text":"The head is displayed as an organ of prudence and sensation, but for this reason weaker than the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS4","text":"The construction of the nerves follows the necessity of connecting the head, jaws, neck, and limbs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS5","text":"The arrangement of the mouth distinguishes the entrance of necessities from the exit of the finest things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AS6","text":"The argument moves from anatomical arrangement toward the teleological hierarchy of nourishment and prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","text":"Nature composes the parts according to the necessity of their function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","text":"Dense bone and abundant flesh limit acute sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A3","text":"Prudent parts admit less flesh than imprudent ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","text":"Longevity and the excellence of life do not necessarily coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A5","text":"A shorter but better life is to be preferred to a longer but inferior one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","text":"The head must be more sensitive and more prudent, even if weaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A7","text":"The safety of the head is limited by the necessity of preserving sensation and prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A8","text":"The nerves serve the connection and movement of the joints.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","text":"The arrangement of the mouth separately organizes the reception of food and the expression of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:A10","text":"Food tends the body, whereas speech serves prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX1","text":"The most precise sensation is not compatible at once with dense bone and abundant flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX2","text":"The head cannot at once be strongest, most fleshy, and most prudent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX3","text":"Long duration of life does not in itself constitute the highest end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX4","text":"Prudent bones cannot be filled with flesh in the same manner as imprudent ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX5","text":"The head is not enclosed by compact bone and heavy flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX6","text":"The mouth does not have one indivisible function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:NX7","text":"Food does not belong to the same teleological genus as speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D1","text":"The head becomes more prudent and more sensitive insofar as bodily density is removed from it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A3","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D2","text":"The bodily weakness of the head constitutes the price of cognitive superiority.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D3","text":"The form of the body expresses a preference for quality of life rather than quantity of time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","CH_JP8E_S_53:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D4","text":"The circular disposition of the nerves around the neck secures the attachment of the head to the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D5","text":"The dispersion of the nerves into the limbs transforms the body into a unified motor system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D6","text":"Dentition, the tongue, and the lips divide oral function according to entrance and exit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:D7","text":"Speech ascends teleologically above food, because it is connected with prudence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","CH_JP8E_S_53:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","text":"Bodily form is produced as a system of compensations, in which the increase of one capacity requires the limitation of another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A4","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2","text":"Prudence is embodied through weakness, because its organ excludes complete fortification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A2","CH_JP8E_S_53:A6","CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3","text":"Anatomy reveals a hierarchy in which prudence and speech have a higher end than the maintenance of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A5","CH_JP8E_S_53:A9","CH_JP8E_S_53:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4","text":"The unity of the animal is constituted through articulations and connections, not through homogeneous matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1","CH_JP8E_S_53:A8","CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX1","text":"Nature is not conceived as an unlimited power of combining all goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX2","text":"Matter does not suffice for the explanation of form, because order depends upon purposes and necessities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX3","text":"Sensation is not a passive result of material density, but requires material diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX4","text":"Bodily health does not have absolute priority over prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX5","text":"The functional unity of the body is not achieved through identity of parts, but through difference and connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which nature provides at once immortality, strength, acuity of sensation, and prudence without cost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2","text":"The idea that the body constitutes an indifferent bearer of mind is excluded; its arrangement already bears an axiological order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX3","text":"The equivalence of food and speech is excluded, because the former sustains life, whereas the latter serves prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX4","text":"Complete bodily integrity is absent as a possibility, because knowledge requires its own bodily price.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS1","text":"Necessity of function → limitation of matter → differentiation of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS2","text":"Requirement of sensation and prudence → reduction of flesh and density of bone → sensitivity and weakness of the head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS3","text":"Dilemma of longevity and excellence → preference for a better shorter life → unarmed and weak head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS4","text":"Necessity of bodily unity → circular connection of nerves → articulation of head and limbs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:FGS5","text":"Distinction between the necessary and the best → entrance of food and exit of speech → material maintenance and intellectual service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AF1","text":"Constraint of natural composition → compensation between strength and prudence → distinctive construction of the head → nervous unity of the body → teleological distinction between food and speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2","text":"Anatomical difference → functional hierarchy → priority of prudence over mere preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1","text":"The weakness of the head is reclassified as a necessary exchange for prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME2","text":"Longevity is disconnected from the highest good, while quality of life becomes a measure of natural construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME3","text":"The body appears as a hierarchical network of functions and not as a mere aggregate of organs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME4","text":"The mouth is transformed from a common anatomical part into a boundary between bodily necessity and intellectual excellence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ME5","text":"The opposition of matter and mind is replaced by a relation of organization, in which matter is formed toward an intellectual end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT1","text":"Surface — The bones, flesh, nerves, head, and mouth are arranged for their respective functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT2","text":"Structural — Bodily construction is regulated by necessities, reciprocal constraints, and connections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation passes from “what it is” to “for the sake of what it was thus arranged,” bringing out the teleology of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Nature is conceived as a finite arrangement in time, which prefers a better life to a longer one and recognizes a necessary conflict of goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the principal movement from the necessity of nature toward the teleology of the mouth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction among the necessary, the best, the perceptible, and the prudent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests upon the principle that every acquired capacity requires another material concession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT4","text":"The precise manner in which creative intelligence chooses the better rather than the longer is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT5","text":"The demonstration depends upon a teleological hypothesis that connects anatomy with a hierarchy of goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_53:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT6","text":"The compression preserves the generative schema, but removes the detail of the individual anatomical connections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_53@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_53:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 75"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 59","title":"Section 75","context":"Chapter 59","original_title":"Section 75","original_context":"Chapter 59"},"original_title":"Section 75","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54","layer":"CH","title":"Section 76","order":60,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_54"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_54@R001","sha256":"e03afc17dc03aa84e55984b454cfb79f50da64dd94410a92009c3e7fa8f9159c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS1","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ οὔτε γυμνὴ ὀστέων οὔτε ὑπὸ σαρκῶν ἀναίσθητος δύναται εἶναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη τῶν φυσικῶν παθῶν γεννᾷ δέρμα, τρίχας καὶ ὄνυχας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS3","text":"Ἡ ὑγρότης, αἱ ῥαφαί, ἡ κίνησις, τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ ἡ ψῦξις συνδιαμορφοῦσι τὰ περιβλήματα τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS4","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς μεταχειρίζεται ταύτας τὰς συναιτίας πρὸς τελικὴν διάνοιαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS5","text":"Τὸ δέρμα, αἱ τρίχες καὶ οἱ ὄνυχες ἀποκτοῦσι τὴν μορφὴν αὐτῶν ἕνεκα ἀσφαλείας, σκέπης, αἰσθήσεως καὶ τῶν μελλόντων χρῆσθαι ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ κατασκευή ἀπαιτεῖ μέσον μεταξὺ γυμνότητος καὶ ὑπερβολῆς σαρκῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A2","text":"Ἡ περὶ τὸν ἐγκέφαλον νοτὶς ἀποτελεῖ ὕλην τοῦ δέρματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A3","text":"Τὸ δέρμα συνίσταται διὰ συνόδου, βλαστήσεως, ῥαφῶν καὶ συγκλείσεως περὶ τὴν κορυφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A4","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν περιόδων καὶ τῆς τροφῆς παράγει ποικίλα εἴδη ῥαφῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A5","text":"Τὸ θεῖον πῦρ διατρυπᾷ τὸ δέρμα καὶ χωρίζει τὸ εἰλικρινὲς ὑγρὸν καὶ θερμὸν ἀπὸ τοῦ μικτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","text":"Τὸ μικτὸν ὑλικὸν ἐκτεινόμενον καὶ πάλιν ὑπὸ τοῦ πνεύματος ἀπωθούμενον ῥιζοῦται ὑπὸ τὸ δέρμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A7","text":"Ἡ ψῦξις καὶ ἡ πίλησις μεταβάλλουσι τὸ συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ δέρμα ὑλικὸν εἰς τρίχας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A8","text":"Ὁ δημιουργὸς ἐπιτάσσει ταῖς φυσικαῖς συναιτίαις τελικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A9","text":"Τὸ δέρμα χρησιμεύει ὡς κοῦφον σκέπασμα τοῦ ἐγκεφάλου καὶ ὡς σκιά τε καὶ σκέπη κατὰ θέρος καὶ χειμῶνα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A10","text":"Ἡ σκληρότης τῶν ὀνύχων προκύπτει ἐκ τῆς συμπλοκῆς νεύρου, δέρματος καὶ ὀστοῦ καὶ ἐκ τῆς ἀποξηράνσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A11","text":"Οἱ ὄνυχες προκατασκευάζονται ἐν τῷ ἀνθρωπίνῳ σώματι διὰ τὰς μελλοντικὰς χρείας τῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A12","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ διάνοια διατάσσει τὴν ὕλην πρὸς τὰ ἔπειτα ἐσόμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX1","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ οὔτε μόνον ὀστεΐνη καὶ ψιλὴ μένει οὔτε ὑπὸ πολλῆς σαρκὸς συσκιασθεῖσα κωφὴ καὶ ἀναίσθητος γίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX2","text":"Τὸ δέρμα οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῶς ἀπομένουσα σάρξ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX3","text":"Αἱ τρίχες οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀνεξάρτητος οὐσία, ἀλλὰ συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ δέρμα γένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX4","text":"Οἱ ὄνυχες οὐκ ἀποτελοῦνται ἐκ μιᾶς μόνης σωματικῆς ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX5","text":"Αἱ φυσικαὶ συναιτίαι οὐκ ἀρκοῦσιν ἄνευ τῆς τελικῆς διανοίας τοῦ δημιουργοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη ἀποτρέπει τὰ δύο ἄκρα τῆς γυμνῆς ὀστεΐνης κεφαλῆς καὶ τῆς σαρκώδους ἀναισθησίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D2","text":"Ἡ ὑγρότης τοῦ ἐγκεφάλου δύναται νὰ συγκροτῇ περίβλημα κυκλικὸν περὶ τὴν κεφαλήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A2","CH_JP8E_S_54:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D3","text":"Ἡ ποικιλία τῶν ῥαφῶν ἐκφράζει τὴν ἀντίθεσιν τῶν περιοδικῶν κινήσεων καὶ τῆς τροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A3","CH_JP8E_S_54:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D4","text":"Ἡ διὰ πυρὸς διάτρησις τοῦ δέρματος ἐπιτρέπει ἐκροὴν τοῦ καθαροῦ ὑγροῦ καὶ θερμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D5","text":"Ἡ παλίνδρομος κίνησις τοῦ μικτοῦ ὑλικοῦ ἐξηγεῖ τὴν ἐμφύτευσιν τῶν τριχῶν ὑπὸ τὸ δέρμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D6","text":"Ἡ τρίχα συνδυάζει συγγένειαν πρὸς τὸ δέρμα καὶ σκληρότητα ἐκ ψύξεως καὶ πιλήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D7","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή τοῦ δέρματος μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ μηχανικὴν γένεσιν εἰς ὄργανον προστασίας καὶ σκέπης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A8","CH_JP8E_S_54:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D8","text":"Ἡ συμπλοκὴ τριῶν ὑλῶν παράγει κοινὸν σκληρὸν περίβλημα ἱκανὸν νὰ λειτουργήσῃ ὡς ὄνυξ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D9","text":"Ἡ πρόβλεψις τῶν μελλουσῶν χρῆσεων ἐξηγεῖ τὴν πρώιμον παρουσίαν τῶν ὀνύχων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A11","CH_JP8E_S_54:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ παράγεται ἐκ συμπράξεως ἀναγκαίων κινήσεων καὶ τελικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ, οὐκ ἐκ μιᾶς αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη γίνεται ὄργανον μόνον ὅταν ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις ἐνταχθῇ εἰς προϋπολογισμὸν μελλοντικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD3","text":"Ἡ μορφολογία τοῦ σώματος ἀποκαλύπτει ἱεραρχίαν αἰτίων, ἐν ᾗ αἱ συναιτίαι ἐνεργοῦσιν ὑπὸ ἀνωτέρας διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4","text":"Ἡ πρόνοια τοῦ δημιουργοῦ ἐνεργεῖ διὰ τῶν περιορισμῶν τῆς ὕλης, μεταβάλλουσα τὰ πάθη αὐτῆς εἰς ἀσφάλειαν καὶ χρείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτόνομον ἀρχὴν ἱκανὴν νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ τὴν λειτουργικὴν τάξιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX2","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἄτακτος συσσώρευσις παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3","text":"Ἡ παροῦσα μορφὴ οὐκ ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ τὰ μέλλοντα εἴδη καὶ τὰς χρείας αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX4","text":"Ἡ χρήσις οὐκ ἔπεται μόνον ὕστερον τῇ μορφῇ, ἀλλὰ συντελεῖ προκαταβολικῶς εἰς τὸν σχηματισμὸν αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ ἔχει μόνον ὑλικὴν καὶ μηχανικὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνατροπὴ τῆς χρονικῆς τάξεως, καθ’ ἣν τὸ μέλλον χρῆμα δύναται νὰ ἐνεργῇ ὡς αἰτία τοῦ παρόντος σχηματισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται σωματικὴ φύσις ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν, τὴν προστασίαν καὶ τὴν χρείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS1","text":"Ἄκρα ἀνεπαρκῆ → ἀνάγκη μεσοῦ περιβλήματος → σύστασις δέρματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS2","text":"Νοτὶς ἐγκεφάλου → σύνοδος καὶ ῥαφαί → κύκλωσις κεφαλῆς → δέρμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS3","text":"Διάτρησις πυρός → διάκρισις καθαροῦ καὶ μικτοῦ → κίνησις καὶ ψῦξις → τρίχες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS4","text":"Συμπλοκὴ νεύρου, δέρματος καὶ ὀστοῦ → ἀποξήρανσις → σκληρότης → ὄνυχες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS5","text":"Φυσικαὶ συναιτίαι → ὑλικὴ μορφή → τελικὴ διάνοια → προστασία, σκέπη, αἴσθησις καὶ μελλοντικὴ χρεία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AF1","text":"Ἀνεπάρκεια τῶν ἄκρων → ἀνάγκη περιβλήματος → ὑλικὴ γένεσις δέρματος → διαφοροποίησις τριχῶν καὶ ὀνύχων → τελικὴ ἐρμηνεία → προσανατολισμὸς πρὸς τὰ μέλλοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1","text":"Τὸ δέρμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ὑπόλειμμα σαρκὸς εἰς λειτουργικὸν περίβλημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2","text":"Αἱ τρίχες καὶ οἱ ὄνυχες ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἐπιφανειακὰ γνωρίσματα εἰς ἀποτελέσματα ὑλικῆς διεργασίας καὶ τελικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φύσεως καὶ σκοποῦ καταλύεται, ἐπειδὴ ὁ σκοπὸς ἐνεργεῖ διὰ τῶν φυσικῶν συναιτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ μέλλοντος εἰσάγεται εἰς τὴν ἐξήγησιν τοῦ παρόντος σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἐξηγεῖται ἡ γένεσις δέρματος, τριχῶν καὶ ὀνύχων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ παράγεται ἐκ ἀλληλεπιδράσεως ὑγρότητος, πυρός, πνεύματος, ψύξεως καὶ ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναγκάζει τὰ μηχανικὰ αἴτια νὰ ὑπαχθῶσιν εἰς τελικὴν διάνοιαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ γιγνόμενον νοεῖται ὡς σύνδεσις ἀνάγκης, προνοίας καὶ μελλοντικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT1","text":"Οἱ πυρηνικοὶ ὅροι ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς πορείας ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνεπάρκειαν τῶν ἄκρων εἰς τὴν τελικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις συναιτίων καὶ αἰτιωτάτης διανοίας διασώζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἱεράρχησιν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ ἀκολουθία τῆς ὑγρότητος, τοῦ πυρός, τοῦ πνεύματος καὶ τῆς ψύξεως παραμένει μερικῶς ἐξαρτωμένη ἀπὸ τὴν συμπυκνωμένην φυσιολογικὴν περιγραφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ’ ὅσον ἡ τελικὴ αἰτία νοεῖται ὡς ἐνεργοῦσα διὰ τῶν ἀναγκαίων φυσικῶν παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἔνωσις φυσικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ προνοίας παραμένει τὸ κύριον σημεῖον ἐντάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231434360962Z_f8b92340","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 76","source_sha256":"e03afc17dc03aa84e55984b454cfb79f50da64dd94410a92009c3e7fa8f9159c","sha256":"ab59784db99707502da15f06c824cf248acc049286157e514993e7e2c469ab87","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:14:34.364877+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS1","text":"The head can be neither bare of bones nor rendered insensible by flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS2","text":"The necessity of natural affections generates skin, hair, and nails.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS3","text":"Moisture, sutures, motion, breath, and cooling jointly shape the coverings of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS4","text":"The demiurge employs these contributory causes toward final intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AS5","text":"Skin, hair, and nails acquire their form for the sake of security, covering, sensation, and the animals that will make use of them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A1","text":"Bodily construction requires a mean between nakedness and an excess of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A2","text":"The moisture around the brain constitutes the material of the skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A3","text":"The skin is constituted through conjunction, growth, sutures, and closure around the crown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A4","text":"The difference of periods and nourishment produces various kinds of sutures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A5","text":"The divine fire perforates the skin and separates the pure moist and hot element from the mixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","text":"The mixed material, extending and then being driven back by the breath, takes root beneath the skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A7","text":"Cooling and felting transform the material akin to the skin into hair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A8","text":"The demiurge assigns a final function to the natural contributory causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A9","text":"The skin serves as a light covering of the brain and as both shade and shelter in summer and winter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A10","text":"The hardness of nails arises from the interweaving of sinew, skin, and bone, and from drying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A11","text":"Nails are pre-formed in the human body for the future needs of animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:A12","text":"Final intelligence orders matter toward what is to come thereafter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX1","text":"The head neither remains merely bony and bare nor, shaded by much flesh, becomes deaf and insensible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX2","text":"The skin is not merely remaining flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX3","text":"Hair is not an independent substance, but a kind akin to the skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX4","text":"Nails are not composed of one bodily material alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:NX5","text":"Natural contributory causes do not suffice without the final intelligence of the demiurge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D1","text":"Necessity prevents the two extremes of the naked bony head and fleshy insensibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D2","text":"The moisture of the brain can form a circular covering around the head.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A2","CH_JP8E_S_54:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D3","text":"The variety of sutures expresses the opposition of periodic motions and nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A3","CH_JP8E_S_54:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D4","text":"The perforation of the skin by fire permits an outflow of the pure moist and hot element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D5","text":"The reciprocal motion of the mixed material explains the implantation of hairs beneath the skin.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D6","text":"Hair combines kinship with the skin and hardness from cooling and felting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D7","text":"The construction of the skin is transformed from mechanical generation into an organ of protection and covering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A8","CH_JP8E_S_54:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D8","text":"The interweaving of three materials produces a common hard covering capable of functioning as a nail.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:D9","text":"The anticipation of future uses explains the early presence of nails.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A11","CH_JP8E_S_54:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD1","text":"Bodily form is produced from the cooperation of necessary motions and final design, not from a single cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD2","text":"Matter becomes an instrument only when natural generation is incorporated into a reckoning of future use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD3","text":"The morphology of the body reveals a hierarchy of causes, in which contributory causes operate under a higher intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4","text":"The providence of the demiurge operates through the constraints of matter, transforming its affections into security and use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX1","text":"Matter does not constitute an autonomous principle capable of explaining the functional order of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX2","text":"Natural generation is not interpreted as a disorderly accumulation of affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3","text":"The present form is not severed from future kinds and their needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX4","text":"Use does not merely follow form later, but contributes in advance to its formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX1","text":"A world in which bodily form has only a material and mechanical cause is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX2","text":"The reversal of the temporal order is excluded, according to which a future thing can act as a cause of present formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX3","text":"A bodily nature indifferent to sensation, protection, and use is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS1","text":"Inadequate extremes → necessity of an intermediate covering → constitution of skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS2","text":"Moisture of the brain → conjunction and sutures → encircling of the head → skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS3","text":"Perforation by fire → distinction of pure and mixed → motion and cooling → hair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS4","text":"Interweaving of sinew, skin, and bone → drying → hardness → nails.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:FGS5","text":"Natural contributory causes → material form → final intelligence → protection, covering, sensation, and future use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:AF1","text":"Inadequacy of the extremes → necessity of a covering → material generation of skin → differentiation of hair and nails → final interpretation → orientation toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1","text":"The skin is reclassified from a remnant of flesh into a functional covering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2","text":"Hair and nails are reclassified from surface features into results of material process and final design.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3","text":"The opposition of nature and purpose is dissolved, because purpose operates through natural contributory causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4","text":"The time of the future is introduced into the explanation of the present body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the generation of skin, hair, and nails is explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT2","text":"Structurally, bodily form is produced from the interaction of moisture, fire, breath, cooling, and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation compels mechanical causes to be subordinated to final intelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT4","text":"Ontologically and temporally, what comes to be is conceived as a conjunction of necessity, providence, and future use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT1","text":"The core terms suffice for reconstructing the course from the inadequacy of the extremes to final form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT2","text":"The distinction between contributory causes and the supreme causal intelligence preserves the internal hierarchy of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT3","text":"The precise mechanical sequence of moisture, fire, breath, and cooling remains partly dependent on the condensed physiological description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the final cause is understood as operating through necessary natural affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the account, but the union of natural necessity and providence remains the principal point of tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_54:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_54@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_54:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 76"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 60","title":"Section 76","context":"Chapter 60","original_title":"Section 76","original_context":"Chapter 60"},"original_title":"Section 76","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55","layer":"CH","title":"Section 77","order":61,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_55"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_55@R001","sha256":"636634495859430b58e08385880f62863c7c042b1abf9fbe5baccc20cfed561d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS1","text":"Τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον, ἐκ πυρὸς καὶ πνεύματος συνεστώς, φθείρεται διὰ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς καταναλώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS2","text":"Οἱ θεοὶ τῇ φυτεύσει καὶ τῇ τροφῇ μηχανῶνται τὴν τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος σωτηρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS3","text":"Τὰ φυτὰ ζῷά ἐστιν, ἀλλὰ μετέχει μόνον τοῦ τρίτου εἴδους ψυχῆς, ἄνευ λόγου, λογισμοῦ καὶ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS4","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ ψυχὴ αἰσθάνεται ἡδονὴν καὶ λύπην μετὰ ἐπιθυμιῶν, ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἔχει τὴν ἑαυτῆς κίνησιν οὐδὲ τὴν περὶ ἑαυτῆς διάνοιαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεία κατασκευή μετατρέπει τὸ σῶμα εἰς ὑδραυλικὸν σύστημα, ὅπως ἡ τροφὴ διὰ φλεβῶν διανέμηται καὶ τὸ ζῷον διαμένῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A1","text":"Τὰ μέρη καὶ τὰ μέλη τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου συμπεφυκότα εἰσίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A2","text":"Ἡ ζωή τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος ἐν πυρὶ καὶ πνεύματι ἀνάγκην ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","text":"Τὸ πῦρ καὶ τὸ πνεῦμα τὸ σῶμα τήκει καὶ κενοῖ, ὥστε αὐτὸ φθίνειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","text":"Ἡ θεία μηχανὴ τὴν φθορὰν τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου διὰ βοηθητικῆς κατασκευῆς ἀντιμετωπίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","text":"Πᾶν τὸ τοῦ ζῆν μετέχον δικαίως ζῷον καλεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","text":"Τὰ φυτὰ μετέχει τοῦ τρίτου εἴδους ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","text":"Ἡ τρίτη ψυχὴ ἔχει αἴσθησιν ἡδείας καὶ ἀλγεινῆς μετὰ ἐπιθυμιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A8","text":"Ἡ τρίτη ψυχὴ οὔτε δόξης οὔτε λογισμοῦ οὔτε νοῦ μετέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","text":"Ὅ,τι ἑαυτὸ πρὸς ἑαυτὸ στρέφεται καὶ τὴν ἔξωθεν κίνησιν ἀπωθεῖ, οὐ δύναται τὰ ἑαυτοῦ λογίσασθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A10","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ ζωή διαμένει ἀκίνητος καὶ ἐρριζωμένη, διὰ τὸ ἐστερῆσθαι τῆς ὑφʼ ἑαυτῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","text":"Τὰ φυτευθέντα γένη παρέχονται τῷ ἀνθρωπίνῳ σώματι τροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A12","text":"Αἱ φλέβες ὑδροφόροι ὀχετοὶ εἰσὶν, διʼ ὧν ἡ τροφὴ πρὸς τὰ τοῦ σώματος μέρη ἐπιχέεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A13","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία τοῦ σώματος ἀπαιτεῖ δεξιὰς καὶ ἀριστερὰς φλέβας, αἳ περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν διαπλέκονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A14","text":"Ἡ φλεβικὴ πλοκὴ συνδέει κεφαλὴν καὶ σῶμα καὶ καθιστᾷ τὸ τῶν αἰσθήσεων πάθος διὰ παντὸς τοῦ σώματος δήλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX1","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ ψυχὴ οὔτε λογικὴ οὔτε νοητικὴ οὔτε συλλογιστικὴ ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX2","text":"Τὸ φυτὸν οὐ δύναται ἑαυτὸ κινεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX3","text":"Τὸ φυτὸν οὐ δύναται περὶ ἑαυτοῦ λογίζεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX4","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ οὐ ταὐτόν ἐστι τῇ αὐτοκινήσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX5","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης οὐ συνεπάγεται λόγον ἢ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX6","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐ παρέχεται ἀτάκτως, ἀλλὰ διὰ τεταγμένων ὀχετῶν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D1","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ τοῦ σώματος καθίσταται ἀνάγκη ἐξωτερικῆς ἢ τεχνικῆς ἀναπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A2","CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D2","text":"Τὸ φυτὸν ὡς ζῷον κατατάσσεται κατὰ τὸ ζῆν, ἀλλʼ οὐ κατὰ τὸ νοεῖν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D3","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ ψυχὴ ἀποτελεῖ ἐλάχιστον βαθμὸν ζωῆς, ἐν ᾧ πάθος καὶ ἐπιθυμία ὑπάρχει ἄνευ διανοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D4","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις αὐτοκινήσεως μεταβάλλει τὸ φυτὸν εἰς ἔμβιον μὲν ἀλλὰ ἐρριζωμένον ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","CH_JP8E_S_55:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D5","text":"Ἡ γεωργία ἡμεροῖ τὰ ἄγρια γένη καὶ καθιστᾷ αὐτὰ λειτουργικὰ πρὸς τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην τροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D6","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ τροφή νοεῖται ὡς ῥεῦμα, ὃ διὰ φλεβικῶν ὀχετῶν ἀρδεύει τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D7","text":"Ἡ διπλὴ διάταξις τῶν φλεβῶν ἐγγυᾶται τὴν ἀμφίπλευρον διανομήν, τὴν συνδετικὴν ἑνότητα καὶ τὴν διάχυσιν τῆς αἰσθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A13","CH_JP8E_S_55:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1","text":"Ἡ ζωή ἐν τῷ κειμένῳ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ κλίμαξ, ἧς τὸ κατώτατον ὅριον ἐστὶ πάθος καὶ ἐπιθυμία, οὐ λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","text":"Ἡ θεία τάξις ἀντισταθμίζει τὴν φυσικὴν φθορὰν διὰ μεταβολῆς τοῦ περιβάλλοντος καὶ διὰ ἐσωτερικῆς ὑδραυλικῆς ὀργανώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3","text":"Τὸ σῶμα καὶ τὸ φυτὸν ὑπάγονται ἑνὶ διαγράμματι, ἐν ᾧ ἡ διατήρησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ῥοήν, διανομήν, σύνδεσιν καὶ ἀναπλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A10","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις λόγου δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ὀργανωμένην λειτουργίαν, ἀλλὰ μεταφέρει τὴν τάξιν ἀπὸ τὸ ἐσωτερικὸν λογισμὸν εἰς τὴν κατασκευὴν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A8","CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12","CH_JP8E_S_55:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ δὲν προϋποθέτει καθολικῶς συνείδησιν, αὐτογνωσίαν ἢ λογικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ὀργάνωσις τοῦ σώματος δὲν ἀνάγεται εἰς τὴν βούλησιν τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ καὶ ἡ διατήρησις δὲν ἀποτελοῦν ἔργα ἀναγκαίως ἐπιτελούμενα ὑπὸ λογικοῦ ὑποκειμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ζῴου δὲν ἐδράζεται μόνον εἰς τὴν αὐτοκίνητον ψυχήν, ἀλλὰ καὶ εἰς τὴν ἀνατομικὴν σύνδεσιν καὶ τὴν ῥοὴν τῆς τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ζωή, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ νόησις συμπίπτουσιν ἀδιακρίτως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀκινησία ἰσοδυναμεῖ πρὸς ἀψυχίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀντίληψις τοῦ σώματος ὡς ἀδρανοῦς περιβλήματος· τὸ σῶμα ἐστὶ μηχανὴ ἐνεργοῦ διατηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS1","text":"Συμπεφυκότα μέρη καὶ ζωὴ ἐν πυρὶ καὶ πνεύματι → τήξις καὶ κένωσις → φθορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS2","text":"Φθορά → θεία μηχανή → φυτικὴ παραγωγὴ καὶ τροφὴ → ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ θνητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS3","text":"Μετοχὴ ζωῆς → τρίτον εἶδος ψυχῆς → ἡδονὴ, λύπη, ἐπιθυμία → ἀπουσία λόγου καὶ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS4","text":"Ἔλλειψις αὐτοκινήσεως → ῥίζωσις καὶ μονιμότης → φυτικὴ ζωή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS5","text":"Τροφή → φλέβες ὡς ὀχετοί → ἐπιχέουσα ῥοή → θρέψις μυελοῦ καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS6","text":"Δεξιὰ καὶ ἀριστερὰ φλεβικὰ δίκτυα → πλοκὴ περὶ τὴν κεφαλήν → δεσμὸς κεφαλῆς καὶ σώματος → διάχυσις αἰσθήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF1","text":"Φυσικὴ φθορὰ → θεία βοήθεια → φυτικὴ δημιουργία → τροφικὴ ἀναπλήρωσις → σωματικὴ ὀργάνωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF2","text":"Ὁρισμὸς τοῦ ζῴου κατὰ τὸ ζῆν → διαβάθμισις τῶν ψυχῶν → ἀφαίρεσις λόγου καὶ αὐτοκινήσεως ἀπὸ τὸ φυτὸν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF3","text":"Ἔλλειψις διανοίας → ἐσωτερικὴ πάθησις → ἀκινησία καὶ ῥίζωσις → ἔμβιος ἐξάρτησις ἀπὸ ἔξωθεν τροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF4","text":"Τροφὴ ὡς ὕδωρ → φλέβες ὡς κῆπος καὶ ὀχετοί → διανομή → σύνδεσις σώματος καὶ αἴσθησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1","text":"Τὸ ὅριον μεταξὺ ζῴου καὶ φυτοῦ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν νόησιν εἰς τὴν μετοχὴν τοῦ ζῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ χαρτογραφεῖται κατὰ βαθμούς, ὥστε αἴσθησις καὶ ἐπιθυμία νὰ χωρίζωνται ἀπὸ λόγον καὶ νοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς πρόβλημα ῥοῆς καὶ ἀναπληρώσεως, οὐχὶ μόνον ὡς ἀπώλεια οὐσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME4","text":"Τὸ σώμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς δίκτυον ὀχετῶν, ὅπου ἡ ἀνατομία ἐπιτελεῖ τὸ ἔργον τῆς διατηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME5","text":"Ἡ γεωργία συνδέεται λειτουργικῶς μὲ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην βιολογίαν, ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ προέκτασις τῆς σωματικῆς θρέψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ἡ φυτικὴ καὶ ἀνθρωπίνη ζωή διατηρεῖται διὰ τροφῆς καὶ σωματικῆς ῥοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ ζωή συγκροτεῖται διὰ ἱεραρχικῶν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων καὶ διὰ ἀνατομικοῦ δικτύου ὀχετῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὸ βάρος ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διάνοιαν εἰς τὴν θείαν κατασκευήν, τὴν γεωργίαν καὶ τὴν ὀργάνωσιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ ζῷον εἶναι πρόσκαιρον καὶ φθειρόμενον, ἀλλὰ ἡ τάξις τοῦ κόσμου παρατείνει τὴν ζωήν διὰ κυκλοφορίας, ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ συνδέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT1","text":"Αἱ προτάσεις ἀρκέουσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν φθορὰν πρὸς τὴν θείαν ἀναπλήρωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ζωῆς, αἰσθήσεως, ἐπιθυμίας, λόγου καὶ νοῦ διασῴζει τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν ἀρχιτεκτονικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ ἀκολουθία ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι αἱ φλέβες λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς ὀχετοὶ τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθʼ ὃν ἡ φυτικὴ ψυχὴ συνδέεται μὲ τὴν καθολικὴν ψυχολογίαν τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυρὰ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν φθορᾶς, τροφῆς, ῥοῆς καὶ διατηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν τῆς θείας τελεολογίας καὶ τῆς ἀναλογίας κήπου καὶ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231454071551Z_1fcf831e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 77","source_sha256":"636634495859430b58e08385880f62863c7c042b1abf9fbe5baccc20cfed561d","sha256":"d97fe71e3959013b25702da136959dfe63fdfc6438386b38940980733b58b51e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:14:54.074931+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS1","text":"The mortal living creature, composed of fire and breath, perishes through internal consumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS2","text":"The gods contrive the preservation of the mortal body through planting and nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS3","text":"Plants are living creatures, but they partake only of the third kind of soul, without reason, calculation, and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS4","text":"The vegetal soul perceives pleasure and pain together with desires, but it possesses neither self-motion nor thought concerning itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AS5","text":"Divine construction transforms the body into a hydraulic system, so that nourishment may be distributed through veins and the living creature may endure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A1","text":"The parts and members of the mortal living creature are naturally conjoined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A2","text":"The life of the mortal body has necessity in fire and breath.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","text":"Fire and breath melt and empty the body, so that it itself wastes away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","text":"The divine contrivance confronts the decay of the mortal living creature through an auxiliary construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","text":"Everything that partakes of life is rightly called a living creature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","text":"Plants partake of the third kind of soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","text":"The third soul has perception of pleasant and painful things together with desires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A8","text":"The third soul partakes neither of opinion nor of calculation nor of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","text":"Whatever turns itself toward itself and repels motion from without is unable to calculate its own things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A10","text":"Vegetal life remains motionless and rooted because it is deprived of motion by itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","text":"The planted kinds provide nourishment to the human body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A12","text":"The veins are water-bearing channels through which nourishment is poured upon the parts of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A13","text":"The symmetry of the body requires right and left veins, which are interwoven around the head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:A14","text":"The venous interweaving connects head and body and renders the affection of the senses manifest throughout the whole body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX1","text":"The vegetal soul is neither rational nor intellectual nor inferential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX2","text":"The plant is unable to move itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX3","text":"The plant is unable to calculate concerning itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX4","text":"Life is not identical with self-motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX5","text":"The perception of pleasure and pain does not entail reason or intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:NX6","text":"Nourishment is not supplied without order, but through the ordered channels of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D1","text":"The decay of the body becomes a necessity for external or technical replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A2","CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D2","text":"The plant is classified as a living creature according to living, but not according to thinking.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D3","text":"The vegetal soul constitutes the lowest degree of life, in which affection and desire exist without thought.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D4","text":"The absence of self-motion makes the plant into a living but rooted being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","CH_JP8E_S_55:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D5","text":"Agriculture tames the wild kinds and renders them functional for human nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D6","text":"Bodily nourishment is conceived as a stream which irrigates the body through venous channels.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:D7","text":"The double arrangement of the veins guarantees bilateral distribution, connective unity, and the diffusion of sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A13","CH_JP8E_S_55:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1","text":"Life in the text is defined as a hierarchical scale, whose lowest limit is affection and desire, not reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A5","CH_JP8E_S_55:A6","CH_JP8E_S_55:A7","CH_JP8E_S_55:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","text":"Divine order counterbalances natural decay through transformation of the environment and through internal hydraulic organization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3","text":"The body and the plant fall under one schema, in which preservation depends upon flow, distribution, connection, and replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_55:A10","CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","text":"The absence of reason does not abolish organized function, but transfers order from internal calculation to the construction of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A8","CH_JP8E_S_55:A9","CH_JP8E_S_55:A12","CH_JP8E_S_55:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX1","text":"Life does not universally presuppose consciousness, self-knowledge, or rational activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX2","text":"The organization of the body is not reducible to the will of the living creature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX3","text":"Reproduction and preservation are not works necessarily performed by a rational subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX4","text":"The unity of the living creature is founded not only upon the self-moving soul, but also upon anatomical connection and the flow of nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX1","text":"A world in which life, sensation, and intellection coincide without distinction is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX2","text":"The idea that immobility is equivalent to lifelessness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX3","text":"The conception of the body as an inert covering is excluded; the body is a mechanism of active preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS1","text":"Naturally conjoined parts and life in fire and breath → melting and emptying → decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS2","text":"Decay → divine contrivance → vegetal production and nourishment → replenishment of the mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS3","text":"Participation in life → third kind of soul → pleasure, pain, desire → absence of reason and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS4","text":"Lack of self-motion → rootedness and permanence → vegetal life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS5","text":"Nourishment → veins as channels → pouring flow → nourishment of marrow and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS6","text":"Right and left venous networks → interweaving around the head → bond of head and body → diffusion of sensations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF1","text":"Natural decay → divine aid → vegetal creation → nutritive replenishment → bodily organization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF2","text":"Definition of the living creature according to living → gradation of souls → removal of reason and self-motion from the plant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF3","text":"Lack of thought → internal affection → immobility and rootedness → living dependence on nourishment from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:AF4","text":"Nourishment as water → veins as garden and channels → distribution → connection of body and sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1","text":"The boundary between living creature and plant is shifted from intellection to participation in life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME2","text":"The soul is mapped by degrees, so that sensation and desire are separated from reason and intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3","text":"Decay is recognized as a problem of flow and replenishment, not merely as loss of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME4","text":"The body is reclassified as a network of channels, in which anatomy performs the work of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ME5","text":"Agriculture is functionally connected with human biology, as an external extension of bodily nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Vegetal and human life is preserved through nourishment and bodily flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Life is constituted through hierarchical psychic powers and through an anatomical network of channels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The explanation shifts the weight from internal thought to divine construction, agriculture, and the organization of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The living creature is temporary and perishable, but the order of the cosmos prolongs life through circulation, replenishment, and connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT1","text":"The propositions suffice for reconstructing the movement from decay toward divine replenishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT2","text":"The distinction among life, sensation, desire, reason, and intellect preserves the hierarchical architecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT3","text":"The anatomical sequence requires the assumption that the veins function as channels of nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4","text":"The precise manner in which the vegetal soul is connected with the general psychology of the living creature is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT5","text":"The internal coherence is strong insofar as concerns the correspondence of decay, nourishment, flow, and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but depends upon acceptance of divine teleology and of the analogy between garden and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_55:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_55@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_55:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 77"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 61","title":"Section 77","context":"Chapter 61","original_title":"Section 77","original_context":"Chapter 61"},"original_title":"Section 77","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56","layer":"CH","title":"Section 78","order":62,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_56"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_56@R001","sha256":"3c82966211c4d3aa41d09237858bcb27886b50ac295998928b0fb8c4f081feb5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἐξήγησις τοῦ τρόπου καθ’ ὃν ἡ τροφὴ καὶ τὸ ποτὸν ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας πρὸς τὰς φλέβας διαχωρεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναδιατυποῦται διὰ τῆς σχέσεως μεγέθους, συστάσεως καὶ στεγανότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS3","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή τοῦ ὀργανικοῦ δικτύου ἐξηγεῖται ὡς πλέγμα ἀέρος καὶ πυρός, ὃ περιβάλλει τὴν κοιλίαν καὶ συνδέεται πρὸς τὸ στόμα, τὸν πλεύμονα, τὰς ἀρτηρίας καὶ τὴν ῥῖνα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ παράγονται ἐκ τῆς ἀμοιβαίας κινήσεως τοῦ ἀερώδους κύτους καὶ τοῦ πλέγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀέναος ταύτη κίνησις ἀρδεύει, ἀναψύχει, τρέφει καὶ διατηρεῖ τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον ζῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A1","text":"Τὰ ἐκ μικροτέρων μερῶν συνιστάμενα δύνανται νὰ περιέχειν τὰ μείζονα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A2","text":"Τὰ ἐκ μειζόνων μερῶν συνιστάμενα οὐ δύνανται νὰ περιέχειν τὰ μικρότερα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A3","text":"Τὸ πῦρ ἐστὶ τὸ λεπτομερέστατον τῶν γενῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A4","text":"Τὸ λεπτομερέστερον δύναται νὰ διέρχηται διὰ τῶν παχυτέρων, ἀλλ’ οὐ δύναται νὰ στέγηται ὑπ’ αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","text":"Ἡ κοιλία δύναται νὰ στέγη τὰ σιτία καὶ τὰ ποτά, ἀλλ’ οὐ τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ τὸ πῦρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑδρεία τῆς κοιλίας πρὸς τὰς φλέβας ἀπαιτεῖ τεχνητὸν πλέγμα ἀέρος καὶ πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","text":"Τὸ πλέγμα ἔχει εἰσόδους, διπλὰ ἐγκύρτια, διακλαδώσεις καὶ περιφερειακοὺς ὀχετούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","text":"Τὸ ἔνδον τοῦ πλοκάνου συνίσταται ἐκ πυρός, τὰ δὲ ἐγκύρτια καὶ τὸ κύτος ἐκ ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","text":"Τὸ ἀερώδες κύτος περιβάλλει τὸ κοῖλον μέρος τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἀλληλεπιδρᾷ πρὸς τὸ πλέγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία κίνησις ἀέρος, πυρός, πλέγματος καὶ κύτους διαρκεί ὅσον διαμένει τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον συνεστηκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ ὀνομάζουσι τὸ γένος τῆς ταύτης ἀντιρρόπου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A12","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀρδεία καὶ ἀνάψυξις ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ τὴν ἐκπνοήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX1","text":"Ἡ κοιλία οὐ δύναται νὰ στέγη τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ τὸ πῦρ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX2","text":"Τὸ λεπτομερέστερον οὐ δύναται νὰ περιέχηται ὑπὸ τῆς παχυτέρας συστάσεως ὡς ὕλη στεγανή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX3","text":"Τὸ πῦρ οὐ δύναται νὰ διατηρῆται ἀκίνητον ἐν ὕδατι, γῇ, ἀέρι ἢ τοῖς ἐκ τούτων συγκειμένοις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX4","text":"Ἡ ὑδρεία οὐ συντελεῖται διὰ τῆς κοιλίας μόνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῆ εἴσοδος ἀέρος διὰ τοῦ στόματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX6","text":"Ἡ ζωή τοῦ ζῴου οὐ διατηρεῖται διὰ στατικῆς ἀποθηκεύσεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ συνεχούς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D1","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ μεγέθους μετατρέπεται εἰς διαφορὰν διαπερατότητος καὶ στεγανότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A1","CH_JP8E_S_56:A2","CH_JP8E_S_56:A3","CH_JP8E_S_56:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D2","text":"Ἐπεὶ ἡ κοιλία στέγει τὰ παχύτερα, τὰ λεπτότερα ῥεύματα ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἰδιαίτερον μηχανισμόν διακινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D3","text":"Τὸ πλέγμα λειτουργεῖ ὡς μεταβατικὸς μηχανισμὸς μεταξὺ τῆς κοιλίας καὶ τῶν φλεβῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D4","text":"Ἡ διπλὴ εἴσοδος καὶ ἡ διακλάδωσις τοῦ πλέγματος ἐπιτρέπουσι τὴν ἀναπλήρωσιν τῶν ῥευμάτων ἐκ στόματος καὶ ῥινός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D5","text":"Ἡ ἐναλλαγὴ εἰσροῆς καὶ ἐκροῆς τοῦ ἀέρος κινεί τὸ πλέγμα διὰ τοῦ μανοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","CH_JP8E_S_56:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D6","text":"Αἱ ἐντὸς τοῦ πυρὸς ἀκτῖνες ἀκολουθοῦσι τὴν ἀμφίδρομον πορείαν τοῦ ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D7","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ ἀποτελοῦσιν ὀνοματοδοτημένην ἐνότητα φυσικῆς ἀμοιβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ τροφή ἀνασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ περιεχόμενον κοιλίας εἰς κυκλοφοροῦσαν ὑλικὴν δύναμιν διὰ δικτυωμένης διαμεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD2","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ συγκροτεῖται ὡς σύστημα ἀντιρρόπων ῥευμάτων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀπλὴ κατοχὴ ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD3","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ σώματος ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἀναπνευστικὴ μηχανή, ἧς τὰ διάφορα μέρη παράγουσιν ἓν διαρκὲς λειτουργικὸν κύκλωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD4","text":"Ἡ θνητότης σημαίνει ὅτι ἡ ζωτικὴ κυκλοφορία ἔχει ὅρον τὸν χρόνον τῆς σωματικῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ λειτουργία οὐ νοεῖται ὡς αὐτοτελὴς δύναμις ἄνευ γεωμετρικῆς καὶ ὑλικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐ θεωρεῖται ἀδιάφορος ὄγκος, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἱεραρχημένη κατὰ μέγεθος, λεπτότητα καὶ διαπερατότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐ μεταβαίνει εὐθέως εἰς τὰς φλέβας· ἡ μετάβασις προϋποθέτει ὀργανικὴν διαμεσολάβησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ οὐ χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν θρέψιν, τὴν ψύξιν καὶ τὴν διατήρησιν τῆς ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὰ σώματα λειτουργοῦσιν ἀνεξαρτήτως τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς διατάξεως τῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀντίληψις τῆς ζωῆς ὡς ἀκίνητης ἐνέργειας ἢ ὡς ἁπλῆς κατοχῆς τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης διατηρήσεως τοῦ ζῴου ἄνευ συνεχῶς ἀνανεουμένης ἀντιρρόπου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS1","text":"Διαβάθμισις μερῶν κατὰ μέγεθος → διάκρισις στεγανότητος καὶ διαπερατότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2","text":"Ἀδυναμία τῆς κοιλίας νὰ στέγῃ τὰ λεπτότερα → κατασκευή πλέγματος ἀέρος καὶ πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS3","text":"Πλέγμα, ἐγκύρτια, κύτος καὶ ὀχετοί → σύνδεσις στόματος, ῥινός, πνεύμονος, κοιλίας καὶ φλεβῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS4","text":"Ἀντίρροπος κίνησις ἀέρος καὶ πλέγματος → ἀναπνοή καὶ ἐκπνοή → ἄρδευσις, ἀνάψυξις, θρέψις, ζωή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AF1","text":"Ἀνάγκη ἐξηγήσεως τῆς ὑδρείας → φυσικὸς κανὼν μεγεθῶν → ἀδυναμία τῆς κοιλίας → πλεκτὴ διαμεσολάβησις → ἀμφίδρομος ἀερώδης κίνησις → ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἐκπνοή → διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1","text":"Ἡ κοιλία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ δοχεῖον τροφῆς εἰς κόμβον ὀργανικοῦ κυκλώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ τοπικὴν κίνησιν ἀέρος εἰς μηχανισμὸν θρέψεως καὶ ζωτικῆς συντηρήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3","text":"Ἡ σχέση κοιλίας, φλεβῶν, πνεύμονος, στόματος καὶ ῥινὸς ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἑνιαῖον δίκτυον ῥευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις στερεοῦ, ὑγροῦ, ἀερώδους καὶ πυρώδους μετατρέπεται εἰς χάρτην λειτουργικῶν ρόλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ τροφὴ καὶ τὸ ποτὸν μεταφέρονται ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας πρὸς τὰς φλέβας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ μεταφορά παράγεται διὰ πλέγματος, κοιλότητος, διακλαδώσεων καὶ ἀντιρρόπων ῥευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ μεμονωμένον ὄργανον εἰς τὸ δίκτυον τῶν ἀλληλεξαρτωμένων λειτουργιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ ζῷον ὑφίσταται ὡς διαρκὴς γένεσις ἐν κινήσει, ἧς ἡ παῦσις συμπίπτει πρὸς τὴν παῦσιν τῆς ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ὁρισμοὶ μεγέθους, λεπτότητος, στεγανότητος καὶ διαπερατότητος ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς τὴν ἀρχικὴν ἀνάγκην τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT2","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή τοῦ πλέγματος καὶ τοῦ κύτους ἀρκεῖ εἰς τὴν ἀνασύστασιν τῆς ὀργανικῆς διαμεσολαβήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀντίρροπος κίνησις ἀέρος καὶ πλέγματος ἀρκεῖ εἰς τὴν παραγωγὴν τῆς ἀναπνοῆς καὶ τῆς ἐκπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἀνάπτυξις τῆς ἀρδεύσεως, τῆς ἀναψύξεως καὶ τῆς θρέψεως ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀποδοχὴν τῆς ἑνιαίας ζωτικῆς κυκλοφορίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς φυσικὴ σχέση τῆς ὑδρείας πρὸς τὴν φλεβικὴν μεταφορὰν μένει μερικῶς ἀδιευκρίνιστος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλ’ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν συμπύκνωσιν τῶν εἰκονικῶν καὶ ἀνατομικῶν περιγραφῶν εἰς λειτουργικοὺς κανόνας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231510415010Z_59a18253","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 78","source_sha256":"3c82966211c4d3aa41d09237858bcb27886b50ac295998928b0fb8c4f081feb5","sha256":"5ee7f69db4ca7f49a3b7ba8edf6da24416b63c532e19091a27544613485c7c8c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:15:10.420835+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS1","text":"The problem is the explanation of the manner in which food and drink pass from the stomach to the veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS2","text":"The explanation is reformulated through the relation of magnitude, composition, and impermeability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS3","text":"The construction of the organic network is explained as a mesh of air and fire, which surrounds the stomach and is connected to the mouth, the lung, the arteries, and the nose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS4","text":"Inhalation and exhalation are produced from the reciprocal motion of the airy cavity and the mesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AS5","text":"This perpetual motion irrigates, cools, nourishes, and keeps the mortal animal alive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A1","text":"Things composed of smaller parts can contain larger things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A2","text":"Things composed of larger parts cannot contain smaller things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A3","text":"Fire is the finest-parted of the kinds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A4","text":"What is finer-parted can pass through what is thicker, but cannot be contained by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","text":"The stomach can contain foods and drinks, but not breath and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","text":"The irrigation from the stomach to the veins requires an artificial mesh of air and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","text":"The mesh has entrances, double bands, branches, and peripheral channels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","text":"The interior of the braided structure consists of fire, while the bands and the cavity consist of air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","text":"The airy cavity surrounds the hollow part of the body and interacts with the mesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","text":"The reciprocal motion of air, fire, mesh, and cavity continues as long as the mortal animal remains constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A11","text":"Inhalation and exhalation name the kind of this counterbalancing motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:A12","text":"Bodily irrigation and cooling depend upon inhalation and exhalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX1","text":"The stomach cannot contain breath and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX2","text":"What is finer-parted cannot be contained by the thicker composition as an impermeable material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX3","text":"Fire cannot remain motionless in water, earth, air, or things composed of these.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX4","text":"Irrigation is not accomplished through the stomach alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX5","text":"Inhalation is not a simple entry of air through the mouth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:NX6","text":"The life of the animal is not maintained through static storage, but through continuous motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D1","text":"Difference of magnitude is transformed into difference of permeability and impermeability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A1","CH_JP8E_S_56:A2","CH_JP8E_S_56:A3","CH_JP8E_S_56:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D2","text":"Since the stomach contains the thicker things, the finer streams require a distinct mechanism of movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D3","text":"The mesh functions as a transitional mechanism between the stomach and the veins.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D4","text":"The double entrance and branching of the mesh permit the replenishment of the streams from mouth and nose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D5","text":"The alternation of inflow and outflow of air moves the mesh through the porous body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","CH_JP8E_S_56:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D6","text":"The rays within the fire follow the bidirectional course of the air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A8","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:D7","text":"Inhalation and exhalation constitute a named unity of natural reciprocity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1","text":"Bodily nourishment is reshaped from stomach-content into circulating material force through networked mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A5","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD2","text":"Life is constituted as a system of counterbalancing streams, not as a mere possession of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD3","text":"The form of the body operates as a respiratory machine, whose different parts produce one continuous functional circuit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:A7","CH_JP8E_S_56:A9","CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SD4","text":"Mortality means that vital circulation has as its limit the time of bodily constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10","CH_JP8E_S_56:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX1","text":"Natural function is not conceived as a self-subsistent power without geometrical and material arrangement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX2","text":"Matter is not regarded as an indifferent mass, but as hierarchized according to magnitude, fineness, and permeability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3","text":"Food does not pass directly into the veins; the passage presupposes organic mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX4","text":"Inhalation is not separated from nourishment, cooling, and the preservation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX1","text":"A world in which bodies function independently of the internal arrangement of their parts is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX2","text":"The conception of life as motionless activity or as mere possession of food is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX3","text":"The possibility of preserving the animal without continuously renewed counterbalancing motion is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS1","text":"Gradation of parts according to magnitude → distinction of impermeability and permeability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2","text":"Inability of the stomach to contain the finer things → construction of a mesh of air and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS3","text":"Mesh, bands, cavity, and channels → connection of mouth, nose, lung, stomach, and veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS4","text":"Counterbalancing motion of air and mesh → inhalation and exhalation → irrigation, cooling, nourishment, life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:AF1","text":"Need to explain irrigation → natural rule of magnitudes → inability of the stomach → woven mediation → bidirectional airy motion → inhalation and exhalation → preservation of the mortal animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1","text":"The stomach is reclassified from a receptacle of nourishment into a node of an organic circuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME2","text":"Inhalation is reclassified from a local motion of air into a mechanism of nourishment and vital maintenance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3","text":"The relation of stomach, veins, lung, mouth, and nose appears as a unified network of streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ME4","text":"The distinction of solid, liquid, airy, and fiery is transformed into a map of functional roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Food and drink are conveyed from the stomach to the veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The conveyance is produced through mesh, cavity, branches, and counterbalancing streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The explanation passes from the isolated organ to the network of interdependent functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The animal exists as a continuous becoming in motion, the cessation of which coincides with the cessation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT1","text":"The definitions of magnitude, fineness, impermeability, and permeability suffice for the initial necessity of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT2","text":"The construction of the mesh and cavity suffices for the reconstruction of organic mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT3","text":"The counterbalancing motion of air and mesh suffices for the production of inhalation and exhalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT4","text":"The development of irrigation, cooling, and nourishment depends upon acceptance of the unified vital circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_56:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT5","text":"The mechanism is internally coherent, but the precise physical relation of irrigation to venous conveyance remains partly unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of the account, but depends upon condensing the figurative and anatomical descriptions into functional rules.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_56@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_56:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 78"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 62","title":"Section 78","context":"Chapter 62","original_title":"Section 78","original_context":"Chapter 62"},"original_title":"Section 78","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57","layer":"CH","title":"Section 79","order":63,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_57"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_57@R001","sha256":"c1778e182b8dbed25c82ee0a73009c86290fc371574b4c9d4a083957e21fa890","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ζητεῖται ὡς φυσικὴ κίνησις ἀέρος ἐν σώματι, ἧς ἡ αἰτία δέον ἐστὶν ἀποδοῦναι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ πνεύματος συνδέεται πρὸς τὸ ἐντὸς πῦρ καὶ πρὸς τὴν τοῦ σώματος θερμότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀναπνοὴν ἀπὸ εἴσοδον εἰς μηδὲν εἰς ἀλληλοδιαδοχὴν ὠθήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS4","text":"Ἡ εἰσπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ παράγονται ἐκ τῆς ἀμοιβαίας μετατοπίσεως ἀέρος καὶ πνεύματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS5","text":"Τὸ ἐντὸς θερμὸν, ὡς συγγενὲς τῷ ἔξω πυρί, κατευθύνει ἐναλλὰξ τὰ ῥεύματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἀποτελεῖ κυκλικὴν κίνησιν, ἣ ἐκ τῆς διαφορᾶς θερμότητος παράγει εἴσοδον καὶ ἔξοδον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","text":"Οὐδὲν κενὸν ὑπάρχει εἰς ὃ δύναται τι εἰσελθεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","text":"Τὸ ἐκ τοῦ σώματος ἐξερχόμενον πνεῦμα ὠθεῖ τὸ πλησίον ἀεὶ, καὶ τὸ ὠθούμενον ὠθεῖ ἕτερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A3","text":"Τὸ ὠθούμενον ἀναγκάζεται περιιέναι καὶ πληροῦν τὸν τόπον ὅθεν τὸ πνεῦμα ἐξῆλθεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","text":"Τὸ ζῷον περὶ τὸ αἷμα καὶ τὰς φλέβας θερμότατον ἔχει, ὥσπερ πηγὴν πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A5","text":"Τὸ θερμὸν κατὰ φύσιν πρὸς τὴν συγγενῆ ἑαυτοῦ χώραν ἔξω φέρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","text":"Δύο διέξοδοι ὑπάρχουσιν, ἡ μὲν διὰ τοῦ σώματος ἔξω, ἡ δὲ διὰ στόματος καὶ ῥινῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","text":"Ὅταν τὸ θερμὸν πρὸς τὴν μίαν διέξοδον ὁρμήσῃ, τὸ κατὰ τὴν ἑτέραν περιωθεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A8","text":"Τὸ πῦρ διαλύει τὰ σιτία καὶ τὰ ποτά, διαιρεῖ κατὰ σμικρὰ καὶ εἰς τὰς φλέβας διαπέμπει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","text":"Τὸ ἐμπίπτον εἰς τὸ πῦρ θερμαίνεται, τὸ δὲ ἐξιὸν ψύχεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῆς θερμότητος ἀναστρέφει τὴν ῥοπὴν τοῦ θερμοτέρου πρὸς τὴν ἑτέραν διέξοδον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","text":"Ἡ ἀμοιβαία ὠθὴ καὶ ἀνταπόδοσις τῶν ἀέρος καὶ πυρός συνιστᾷ κύκλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A12","text":"Ἡ ἐναλλασσόμενη κυκλικὴ κίνησις παράγει ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ἐκπνοήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX1","text":"Ἡ εἴσοδος τοῦ πνεύματος οὐ γίνεται διὰ κενοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX2","text":"Τὸ πνεῦμα οὐ μετακινείται ἐν ἀδιαφόρῳ χώρῳ, ἀλλὰ διὰ συνεχοῦς ὠθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ οὐκ ἔστιν ἁπλῆ εἴσοδος ἀέρος εἰς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἐκπνοὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ μεμονωμένην ἔξοδον ἄνευ ἀντιδράσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἐντὸς τοῦ ζῴου θερμὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἀκίνητον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX6","text":"Αἱ δύο διέξοδοι οὐ λειτουργοῦσιν ἀνεξαρτήτως ἀλλήλων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX7","text":"Ἡ πέψις οὐκ ἔστιν ἀσύνδετος πρὸς τὴν τοῦ πυρὸς κυκλοφορίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ κενὸν οὐκ ἔστιν καὶ τὸ ἐκπνεόμενον ὠθεῖ, ἡ εἴσοδος τοῦ ἀέρος ἀνάγκη ἐστὶν ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ ἐκκενωθέντος τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","CH_JP8E_S_57:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ λαμβάνει χώραν διὰ τῶν σαρκῶν καὶ τῶν στοματικῶν καὶ ῥινικῶν διόδων ὡς συνεχοῦς περιελαύνσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","CH_JP8E_S_57:A3","CH_JP8E_S_57:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ θερμὸν πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ἔξω ῥέπει, ἡ κίνησις τοῦ ἀέρος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν πηγὴν πυρός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D4","text":"Ὅταν τὸ θερμὸν ὁρμᾷ πρὸς μίαν διέξοδον, ἡ ἑτέρα γίνεται τόπος ἀναγκαστικῆς ἐκτοπίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","CH_JP8E_S_57:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D5","text":"Ἡ θέρμανσις τοῦ εἰσιόντος καὶ ἡ ψῦξις τοῦ ἐξιόντος μεταβάλλουσι τὴν ἐπόμενην ῥοπήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀναγκαίας φάσεις τοῦ αὐτοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D7","text":"Τὸ ἐντὸς πῦρ, ἅμα κινοῦν τὸ πνεῦμα, μεταβάλλει τὰ σιτία καὶ τὰ ποτὰ εἰς ῥεύματα τῶν φλεβῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD1","text":"Ἡ ζωτικὴ λειτουργία νοεῖται ὡς ἐνιαῖος κύκλος θερμότητος, ὠθήσεως, ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ διανομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A8","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD2","text":"Ἡ διατήρησις τοῦ ζῴου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν μεταβολὴν ἐσωτερικοῦ πυρός καὶ περιβάλλοντος ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A5","CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD3","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης τῆς ἀναπνοῆς μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἁπλῆς ἀνατομικῆς διόδου εἰς ἀλληλεξαρτώμενον φυσικὸν σύστημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","CH_JP8E_S_57:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4","text":"Ἡ κυκλικότης τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἀναζήτησιν μιᾶς ἀρχῆς ἀποκεκομμένης ἀπὸ τὴν ἀντιδρῶσαν κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ χῶρος ὡς ἀδρανὴς καὶ κενὸς ὑπόβαθρον κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ὡς γραμμικὴ μετάβασις ἀπὸ ἔξω εἰς ἔσω.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνεξαρτησία τοῦ ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ τοῦ περιβάλλοντος στοιχείου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀμετάβλητος ταυτότης τοῦ θερμοῦ καὶ τοῦ ψυχροῦ κατὰ τὴν κυκλοφορίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ διάσπασις τῆς ζωτικῆς λειτουργίας εἰς ἀσύνδετα ἀναπνευστικὰ καὶ πεπτικὰ γεγονότα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἀναπνοῆς ἄνευ συνεχῶς ἀνακυκλουμένης ὠθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀκίνητον ἐσωτερικὸν κέντρον, ὃ ἂν προκαλῇ τὴν κίνησιν μένον ἄθικτον ὑπὸ τῶν ἀποτελεσμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὅριον ἀπολύτως χωρίζον τὸ ζῷον ἀπὸ τὸν περιέχοντα ἀέρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX4","text":"Ἀδύνατον καθίσταται νὰ νοηθῇ ἡ ζωή ὡς ἁπλὴ διαδοχὴ ἐσωτερικῶν καταστάσεων ἄνευ περιβαλλοντικῆς ἀνταποκρίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1","text":"Ἀπουσία κενοῦ → ἀλληλοδιαδοχὴ ὠθήσεων → ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ ἐκκενωθέντος τόπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS2","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ πηγὴ πυρός → ῥοπὴ τοῦ θερμοῦ πρὸς τὸ συγγενές → ἐκτόπισις ἀέρος κατὰ δύο διόδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS3","text":"Εἴσοδος ἀέρος → ἐμπλοκὴ εἰς τὸ πῦρ → θέρμανσις· ἔξοδος ἀέρος → ἀπομάκρυνσις ἀπὸ τὸ πῦρ → ψῦξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS4","text":"Μεταβολὴ θερμότητος → ἀντιστροφὴ ῥοπῆς → ἐναλλαγὴ εἰσπνοῆς καὶ ἐκπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5","text":"Κυκλικὴ ἀνταπόδοσις πυρός καὶ ἀέρος → διαρκὴς ἀναπνευστικὴ κίνησις → ζωτικὴ ἑνότητα πνεύματος, πέψεως καὶ φλεβῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AF1","text":"Ἐξήγησις τῆς ἀναπνοῆς → ἀπόρριψις τοῦ κενοῦ → θεωρία τῆς ὠθήσεως → ἐσωτερικὴ πηγὴ πυρός → διπλὴ διέξοδος → θερμικὴ ἀντιστροφή → κυκλικὴ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἐκπνοή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AF2","text":"Πῦρ ἐντὸς τοῦ ζῴου → διάλυσις τροφῆς → διανομὴ διὰ φλεβῶν· τὸ αὐτὸ πῦρ → κίνησις ἀέρος → διαδοχὴ εἰσόδου καὶ ἐξόδου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME1","text":"Ὁ χώρος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ κενὸν δοχεῖον εἰς πεδίον ἀλληλοδιαδόχων ὠθήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν ἀνατομικὴν λειτουργίαν εἰς θερμομηχανικὸν κύκλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3","text":"Αἱ ἐσωτερικαὶ καὶ ἐξωτερικαὶ κινήσεις συνδέονται ὡς ἀμοιβαῖοι ὅροι μιᾶς διεργασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME4","text":"Ἡ πέψις, ἡ κυκλοφορία τῶν φλεβῶν καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἐντάσσονται εἰς κοινὴν λειτουργικὴν οἰκονομίαν πυρός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις εἰσπνοῆς καὶ ἐκπνοῆς μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ δυϊκὴν διάζευξιν εἰς ἀντιστρεφομένας φάσεις ἑνὸς κύκλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἡ εἴσοδος καὶ ἡ ἔξοδος τοῦ πνεύματος ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ τῆς διαδοχικῆς ὠθήσεως ἀέρος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ συγκροτεῖται ὑπὸ ἀπουσίας κενοῦ, δύο διόδων, διαφορᾶς θερμότητος καὶ περιελαύνσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὸ βάρος ἀπὸ τὸ φαινόμενον τῆς διόδου εἰς τὸ σύστημα τῶν ἀλληλεξαρτωμένων κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Ἡ φύσις νοεῖται ὡς ἀέναος κύκλος μεταβολῆς, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἀρχὴ καὶ ἡ ἀνταπόδοσις συμπλέκονται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT1","text":"Τὰ δώδεκα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κύριου μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπουσίαν κενοῦ πρὸς τὴν κυκλικὴν ἀναπνοὴν διατηρεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT3","text":"Ἡ σύνδεσις τοῦ πυρός, τῆς πέψεως καὶ τῶν φλεβῶν παραμένει ἀναγκαία, ἀλλὰ δευτερεύει πρὸς τὴν κύριαν ἐξήγησιν τῆς ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀρχὴ τῆς θερμότητος καὶ ἡ μηχανικὴ ὠθὴ συνδέονται λειτουργικῶς, οὐχὶ διὰ πλήρους φυσιολογικῆς ἀναλύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὡς πρὸς τὴν κυκλικότητα, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις τοῦ πυρός, τοῦ πνεύματος καὶ τοῦ ἀέρος μένει ἐν μέρει ἀδιευκρίνιστος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν κεντρικὴν κίνησιν: οὐδὲν κενόν, ἀμοιβαία ὠθήσις, θερμικὴ ἀντιστροφή, κυκλικὴ ἀναπνοή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231527423060Z_f8a1296e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 79","source_sha256":"c1778e182b8dbed25c82ee0a73009c86290fc371574b4c9d4a083957e21fa890","sha256":"25aa0210a71588c80d2a3b88770da3a26d05c3b479d235e1f2558a0e6b485339","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:15:27.427327+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS1","text":"Respiration is investigated as a natural movement of air in a body, the cause of which must be rendered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS2","text":"The movement of breath is connected with the internal fire and with the heat of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS3","text":"The absence of void transforms respiration from entry into nothing into a succession of thrusts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS4","text":"Inhalation and exhalation are produced from the reciprocal displacement of air and breath.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS5","text":"The internal heat, as akin to the external fire, directs the flows alternately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AS6","text":"Respiration constitutes a circular motion which, from the difference in heat, produces entry and exit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","text":"No void exists into which anything can enter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","text":"The breath issuing from the body always pushes what is near, and what is pushed pushes another thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A3","text":"What is pushed is compelled to go around and fill the place from which the breath departed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","text":"The animal has its greatest heat about the blood and the veins, as though a source of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A5","text":"What is hot is naturally borne outward toward its own kindred region.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","text":"There are two outlets, one outward through the body, the other through the mouth and nostrils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","text":"Whenever the hot moves toward one outlet, it pushes around that at the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A8","text":"Fire dissolves foods and drinks, divides them into small parts, and sends them through to the veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","text":"What enters into the fire is heated, while what goes out is cooled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","text":"The change of heat reverses the tendency of the hotter toward the other outlet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","text":"The reciprocal thrust and return of air and fire constitute a cycle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:A12","text":"The alternating circular motion produces inhalation and exhalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX1","text":"The entry of breath does not occur through a void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX2","text":"Breath does not move in an indifferent space, but through continuous thrust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX3","text":"Respiration is not a simple entry of air into the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX4","text":"Exhalation does not constitute an isolated exit without reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX5","text":"The heat within the animal is not motionless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX6","text":"The two outlets do not function independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:NX7","text":"Digestion is not unconnected with the circulation of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D1","text":"Since there is no void and what is exhaled pushes, the entry of air must be the replenishment of the evacuated place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","CH_JP8E_S_57:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D2","text":"Respiration takes place through the flesh and the oral and nasal passages as a continuous circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A2","CH_JP8E_S_57:A3","CH_JP8E_S_57:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D3","text":"Since the hot inclines outward toward what is akin, the movement of air depends upon the internal source of fire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D4","text":"Whenever the hot rushes toward one outlet, the other becomes a place of compelled displacement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","CH_JP8E_S_57:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D5","text":"The heating of what enters and the cooling of what goes out alter the subsequent tendency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D6","text":"Inhalation and exhalation constitute necessary phases of the same mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:D7","text":"The internal fire, while moving the breath, transforms foods and drinks into flows of the veins.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD1","text":"Vital function is conceived as a unified cycle of heat, thrust, replenishment, and distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A8","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD2","text":"The preservation of the animal depends upon the reciprocal change of internal fire and surrounding air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A4","CH_JP8E_S_57:A5","CH_JP8E_S_57:A9","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD3","text":"The causality of respiration is shifted from a simple anatomical passage to an interdependent natural system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1","CH_JP8E_S_57:A6","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","CH_JP8E_S_57:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4","text":"The circularity of the mechanism nullifies the search for a single origin detached from the reactive motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A7","CH_JP8E_S_57:A10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX1","text":"Space as an inert and empty substrate of motion is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX2","text":"Respiration as a linear transition from outside to inside is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX3","text":"The independence of the internal and the surrounding element is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX4","text":"The unchanging identity of the hot and the cold during circulation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5","text":"The fragmentation of vital function into unconnected respiratory and digestive events is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX1","text":"The possibility of respiration without continuously recirculating thrust is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2","text":"There is absent a motionless internal center which might cause motion while remaining untouched by its effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3","text":"There is absent a boundary absolutely separating the animal from the encompassing air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX4","text":"It becomes impossible to conceive life as a simple succession of internal states without environmental response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1","text":"Absence of void → succession of thrusts → replenishment of the evacuated place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS2","text":"Internal source of fire → tendency of the hot toward what is akin → displacement of air through two passages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS3","text":"Entry of air → involvement in fire → heating; exit of air → removal from fire → cooling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS4","text":"Change of heat → reversal of tendency → alternation of inhalation and exhalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5","text":"Circular return of fire and air → continuous respiratory motion → vital unity of breath, digestion, and veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AF1","text":"Explanation of respiration → rejection of the void → theory of thrust → internal source of fire → double outlet → thermal reversal → circular inhalation and exhalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:AF2","text":"Fire within the animal → dissolution of food → distribution through veins; the same fire → movement of air → succession of entry and exit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME1","text":"Space is reclassified from an empty container into a field of successive thrusts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2","text":"Respiration is reclassified from a simple anatomical function into a thermomechanical cycle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3","text":"Internal and external motions are connected as reciprocal conditions of one process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME4","text":"Digestion, the circulation of the veins, and respiration are integrated into a common functional economy of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ME5","text":"The distinction between inhalation and exhalation is transformed from a dual disjunction into reversible phases of one cycle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The entry and exit of breath are explained through the successive thrust of air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Respiration is constituted by the absence of void, two passages, difference in heat, and circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The explanation shifts the weight from the phenomenon of passage to the system of interdependent motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Nature is conceived as an everlasting cycle of change, in which origin and return are intertwined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT1","text":"The twelve axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the principal mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT2","text":"The sequence from the absence of void to circular respiration is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT3","text":"The connection of fire, digestion, and veins remains necessary, but is secondary to the principal explanation of respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT4","text":"The internal principle of heat and mechanical thrust are connected functionally, not through a complete physiological analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5","text":"The mechanism is coherent with respect to circularity, but the precise relation of fire, breath, and air remains partly unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central movement: no void, reciprocal thrust, thermal reversal, circular respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_57:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_57@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_57:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 79"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 63","title":"Section 79","context":"Chapter 63","original_title":"Section 79","original_context":"Chapter 63"},"original_title":"Section 79","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8","layer":"CH","title":"Section 80","order":64,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC8"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC8@R001","sha256":"5df48f1bc5ff60bad6e9ae766f9b46c13c2f3a855f61af3afd2de4d052601e74","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS1","text":"Τὸ ζητούμενον ἐστὶν ἡ τῶν σωματικῶν παθημάτων αἰτιολογία διὰ κινήσεων καὶ συμμείξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS2","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα, ὥσπερ ἡ ἕλξις, ἡ φωνή, ἡ ἀναπνοή καὶ ἡ τροφή, ἀνατάττονται εἰς ἐσωτερικὰς ἀλληλοπαθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS3","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης τῶν κινήσεων παράγει συμφωνίαν, ἡ δὲ ἀνομοιότης ἀναρμοστίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS4","text":"Ἡ τῶν ταχέων καὶ βραδέων φορῶν σύγκρασις ἐξηγεῖ τὰ αἰσθητὰ ἀποτελέσματα καὶ τὰς ἡδονὰς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS5","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ κινητικὴ αἰτιότης ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὰ φυσικὰ φαινόμενα εἰς τὴν ἀναπνοήν, τὴν θρέψιν καὶ τὴν χρωματικὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1","text":"Πᾶν πάθημα ἐκ κινήσεων καὶ μεταβολῶν ἑδρῶν ἀναζητητέον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης κινήσεων συμφωνίαν ποιεῖ, ἡ δὲ ἀνομοιότης ἀναρμοστίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3","text":"Ἡ βραδυτέρα κίνησις, καταλαμβάνουσα τὴν παυομένην ταχυτέραν, νέα φορὰν οὐκ ἐμβάλλει, ἀλλὰ τὴν προϋπάρχουσαν ἀρχὴν μετασχηματίζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","text":"Ἐκ τῆς συμπλοκῆς ὀξείας καὶ βαρείας φορᾶς μία μικτὴ κίνησις καὶ ἓν πάθημα παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A5","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ εὐφροσύνη ἀποτελοῦν ἐν θνηταῖς φοραῖς μίμησιν θείας ἁρμονίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A6","text":"Τὰ ῥεύματα καὶ αἱ πτώσεις γίγνονται διὰ τῆς ἀλληλοσυμπλοκῆς κινήσεων καὶ μεταβολῆς ἑδρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A7","text":"Τὸ πῦρ τέμνει τὰ σιτία, τὸ δὲ πνεῦμα αἰωρεῖ καὶ συμπαραφέρει τὰ τετμημένα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","text":"Ἡ συναιώρησις τοῦ πνεύματος πληροῖ τὰς φλέβας ἀπὸ τῆς κοιλίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9","text":"Τὰ ἐκ τῆς τροφῆς νάματα διὰ τῆς φλεβικῆς πληρώσεως ἐπὶ πᾶν τὸ σῶμα ἐπίρρυτα γίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A10","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ τροφὴ ἐκ νεοτμήτων καὶ συγγενῶν καρπῶν καὶ χλόης συνίσταται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11","text":"Ἡ σύμμειξις τῶν συστατικῶν παράγει τὴν ποικιλίαν τῶν χρωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A12","text":"Ἡ πλείστη ἐρυθρότης παράγεται ἐκ τῆς τοῦ πυρὸς τομῆς καὶ ἐξομόρξεως ἐν ὑγρῷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ἕλξις ὡς αὐτοτελὴς αἰτία τῶν ῥευμάτων, τῶν κεραυνῶν, τῶν ἠλέκτρων ἢ τῶν Ἡρακλείων λίθων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστι κενὸν ὡς ἐξωτερικὸς μηχανισμὸς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἡ ἀμοιβαία ὤθησις αὐτῶν ἑαυτὰ κινεῖ κατὰ τρόπον ἁπλοῦν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX4","text":"Οὐχ ἑτέρα κίνησις ἐμβάλλεται ὅταν ἡ βραδεῖα κίνησις τὴν ταχυτέραν καταλαμβάνῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX5","text":"Οὐ χωρὶς φυσικῆς ἀναλύσεως ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ εὐφροσύνη νοητέα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX6","text":"Οὐκ ἀπὸ ἀσύνδετον ἢ ἄσχετον ὕλην ἡ σωματικὴ θρέψις παράγεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D1","text":"Ἡ συμφωνία τῶν φθόγγων ἐκ τῆς ὁμοιότητος τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν κινήσεων ἀποτελεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D2","text":"Ἡ ἀναρμοστία τῶν φθόγγων ἐκ τῆς ἀνομοιότητος τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν κινήσεων παράγεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D3","text":"Ἡ σύγκρασις ταχείας καὶ βραδείας φορᾶς μεταβάλλει δύο κινήσεις εἰς ἓν αἰσθητὸν πάθημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D4","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ τῶν ἀφρόνων καὶ ἡ εὐφροσύνη τῶν ἐμφρόνων ἀποτελοῦν δύο προσλήψεις τῆς αὐτῆς ἁρμονικῆς διαδικασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D5","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα τῆς ἕλξεως ἐξηγοῦνται ὡς ἀποτελέσματα συνδεδεμένων κινήσεων καὶ ἀμοιβαίων μεταβολῶν ἑδρῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D6","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ θρέψις ἀποτελοῦν ἐνιαίαν ἀκολουθίαν πυρὸς, πνεύματος, φλεβῶν καὶ νάματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D7","text":"Ἡ διάχυσις τῆς τροφῆς εἰς ὅλον τὸ σῶμα ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν πλήρωσιν τῶν φλεβῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D8","text":"Ἡ χρωματικὴ ποικιλία τῶν φυτικῶν τροφῶν ἀνάγεται εἰς τὴν σύμμειξιν τῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1","text":"Ἕν καθολικὸν κινητικὸν πρότυπον συνδέει φυσικὰ φαινόμενα, αἴσθησιν καὶ βιολογικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2","text":"Ἡ φαινομενικὴ αἰτιότης τῶν πραγμάτων ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ δικτύου ἀλληλοπαθῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ὑπερφυσικὴν ἐπέμβασιν, ἀλλὰ μορφὴν ἐνσώματου συντονισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD4","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ νοεῖται ὡς συνεχὴς μεταβίβασις τετμημένων καὶ αἰωρουμένων ὑλικῶν ῥευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD5","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια παραμένει ὡς ἀρχὴ διαθέσεως τῆς φυτικῆς τροφῆς, ἐνώ ἡ ἐνέργεια τῆς θρέψεως ἐξηγεῖται μηχανικῶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX1","text":"Τὸ αἰτιατὸν δίκτυον οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἄμεσον, ἐξωτερικὴν δύναμιν ἕλξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνοικτὸν χωρικὸν κενὸν μεταξὺ τῶν κινουμένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX3","text":"Τὸ πάθημα οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῆν μεταφορὰν ἑνὸς πράγματος, ἀλλὰ γένεσιν ἐκ συσχετισμοῦ κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ὁλότηϲ οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἄθροισμα ἀσύνδετων μορίων, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἐνεργὸς ἀλληλουχία ῥευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX5","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ ποιότης οὐκ ἔχει ἀνεξάρτητον ὑπόστασιν παρὰ τὰς κινήσεις αἳ αὐτὴν συγκροτοῦσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ὑπόθεσις ἀδρανοῦς ὕλης ἥτις ἀναμένει ἐξωτερικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος διῃρημένος εἰς ἀσύνδετα ἐπίπεδα φυσικοῦ, βιολογικοῦ καὶ αἰσθητικοῦ αἰτίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται ἡ ἑρμηνεία τῆς ἁρμονίας ὡς ἁπλῆς ὑποκειμενικῆς ἐντυπώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX4","text":"Ἀδιάθετος μένει ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ζωή, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ θρέψις ἔχουσιν ἴδια καὶ ἀσύμβατα αἴτια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1","text":"Κίνησις → ὁμοιότης ἢ ἀνομοιότης → συμφωνία ἢ ἀναρμοστία → ἁρμονικὸν πάθημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS2","text":"Ταχύτης καὶ βραδύτης → κατάληψις κινήσεων → σύγκρασις φορῶν → ἡδονὴ ἢ εὐφροσύνη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS3","text":"Ἀλληλοσυμπλοκὴ κινήσεων → μεταβολὴ ἑδρῶν → ῥεῦμα, πτῶσις ἢ φαινομένη ἕλξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS4","text":"Πῦρ → τομὴ σιτίων → πνεῦμα → πλήρωσις φλεβῶν → διάχυσις θρεπτικῶν ναμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS5","text":"Σύμμειξις φυτικῶν συστατικῶν → ποικιλία χρωμάτων· τομὴ καὶ ἐξόμορξις πυρός → ἐρυθρότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1","text":"Φαινόμενα ἕλξεως καὶ ῥοῆς → ἀπόρριψις ἕλξεως καὶ κενοῦ → ἀλληλοσυμπλοκὴ κινήσεων → καθολικὴ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF2","text":"Ταχεῖς καὶ βραδεῖς φθόγγοι → ὁμοιότης ἢ ἀνομοιότης κινήσεων → ἁρμονία ἢ ἀναρμοστία → ἡδονὴ ἢ εὐφροσύνη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF3","text":"Ἀναπνοή → τομὴ τροφῆς ὑπὸ πυρός → συναιώρησις πνεύματος → φλεβικὴ πλήρωσις → καθολικὴ θρέψις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF4","text":"Νεότμητα φυτά → σύμμειξις → χρωματικὴ ποικιλία → ἐρυθρότης ἐκ πυρικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἕλξις, ἡ ῥοή, ἡ πτῶσις καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ κατατάσσονται εἰς κοινὸν πεδίον κινητικῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φυσικοῦ καὶ αἰσθητικοῦ ἀποτελέσματος ἀποδυναμοῦται διὰ τῆς κοινῆς γενέσεως ἐκ κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀφηρημένην τάξιν εἰς ἐνσώματον σχέσιν ὁμοίων φορῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME4","text":"Ἡ θρέψις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ῥευματικὴ ἀναδιανομή, οὐχ ὡς ἁπλὴ πρόσληψις τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME5","text":"Ἡ χροιὰ ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα συστάσεως καὶ πυρικῆς κατεργασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ἐξηγοῦνται φθόγγοι, ῥεύματα, κεραυνοί, ἠλέκτροι, λίθοι, ἀναπνοή, τροφή καὶ χρώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Τὰ φαινόμενα συγκροτοῦνται ὑπὸ συσχετισμῶν κινήσεων, μεταβολῶν ἑδρῶν, τεμῶν καὶ ῥευμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ζητῇ μηχανισμοὺς πίσωθεν τῶν φαινομένων καὶ νὰ ἀπορρίπτῃ τὰς ἐπιφανεῖς ὀνομασίας αἰτίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Τὸ ὂν νοεῖται ὡς διαρκὴς μεταβολὴ καὶ διαδοχὴ φορῶν, ἐν ᾗ τὸ πρόσθεν πάθημα γίνεται ἀρχὴ τοῦ ὕστερον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν ὥστε ἀνασυστῆσαι τὴν κοινὴν κινητικὴν λογικὴν τῶν φαινομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόρριψιν ἕλξεως καὶ κενοῦ πρὸς τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ τὴν θρέψιν διατηρεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθ’ ὃν ἡ μηχανικὴ σύγκρασις μεταβαίνει εἰς ἡδονὴν ἢ εὐφροσύνην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT4","text":"Ἐντάσεως ἐστὶν ἡ συνύπαρξις θείας φυτεύσεως καὶ μηχανικῆς ἐξηγήσεως τῆς τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κατασκευή ἰσχυρὰ μένει ὅπου ἡ αἰτιότης ἀκολουθεῖ ἀλληλουχίαν κινήσεων, ἐλλιπὴς δὲ ὅπου ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ φυσικὸν εἰς τὸ ποιοτικὸν ἀπαιτεῖ ἄρρητον γέφυραν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225751145142Z_12ce6816","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 80","source_sha256":"5df48f1bc5ff60bad6e9ae766f9b46c13c2f3a855f61af3afd2de4d052601e74","sha256":"057d40d9111582261e6c9b5bb4ffda566854468ede11ffb2cd69756088c5dc54","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:57:51.149158+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS1","text":"What is sought is the causal account of bodily affections through motions and changes of positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS2","text":"The phenomena, such as attraction, voice, respiration, and nourishment, are referred back to internal mutual affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS3","text":"Similarity of motions produces concord, whereas dissimilarity produces discordance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS4","text":"The blending of swift and slow motions explains perceptible effects and pleasures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS5","text":"The same motional causality extends from natural phenomena to respiration, nourishment, and the generation of color.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1","text":"Every affection must be investigated from motions and changes of positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2","text":"Similarity of motions produces concord, whereas dissimilarity produces discordance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3","text":"The slower motion, overtaking the faster motion that is coming to a stop, does not introduce a new motion, but transforms the pre-existing principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","text":"From the interweaving of acute and grave motion, one mixed motion and one affection are produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A5","text":"Pleasure and delight constitute, in mortal motions, an imitation of divine harmony.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A6","text":"Flows and falls occur through the mutual interweaving of motions and changes of positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A7","text":"Fire cuts the foodstuffs, while breath suspends and carries along the severed portions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","text":"The co-suspension of breath fills the veins from the belly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9","text":"The streams from nourishment become flowing over the whole body through the filling of the veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A10","text":"Plant nourishment consists of newly cut and kindred fruits and grass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11","text":"The mixture of the constituents produces the variety of colors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:A12","text":"The greatest redness is produced from the cutting and wiping-out of fire in moisture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1","text":"There is no attraction as a self-sufficient cause of flows, thunderbolts, amber, or Heraclean stones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2","text":"There is no void as an external mechanism of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX3","text":"Their reciprocal pushing does not move themselves in a simple manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX4","text":"No other motion is introduced when the slow motion overtakes the faster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX5","text":"Pleasure and delight are not to be understood apart from natural analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX6","text":"Bodily nourishment is not produced from unconnected or unrelated matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D1","text":"The concord of tones is constituted from the similarity of the motions within us.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D2","text":"The discordance of tones is produced from the dissimilarity of internal motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D3","text":"The blending of swift and slow motion transforms two motions into one perceptible affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D4","text":"The pleasure of the foolish and the delight of the prudent constitute two apprehensions of the same harmonic process.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D5","text":"The phenomena of attraction are explained as effects of connected motions and reciprocal changes of positions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D6","text":"Respiration and nourishment constitute a unified sequence of fire, breath, veins, and stream.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D7","text":"The diffusion of nourishment into the whole body follows the filling of the veins.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:D8","text":"The chromatic variety of plant foods is referred back to the mixture of their constituents.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1","text":"One universal motional pattern connects natural phenomena, sensation, and biological function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2","text":"The apparent causality of things is replaced by a network of mutually affecting motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD3","text":"Harmony does not constitute a supernatural intervention, but a form of embodied coordination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD4","text":"Life is understood as a continuous transfer of severed and suspended material streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD5","text":"Divine providence remains as the principle of the disposition of plant nourishment, while the operation of nourishment is explained mechanically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX1","text":"The causal network does not require an immediate, external force of attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX2","text":"Motion does not require an open spatial void between the things moved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX3","text":"The affection does not constitute a simple transfer of one thing, but a coming-to-be from the relation of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4","text":"Bodily wholeness is not explained as an aggregate of unconnected parts, but as an active succession of streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX5","text":"Perceptible quality has no independent subsistence apart from the motions that constitute it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX1","text":"The hypothesis of inert matter awaiting an external force is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX2","text":"A world divided into unconnected levels of natural, biological, and perceptual cause is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX3","text":"The interpretation of harmony as a merely subjective impression becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX4","text":"The idea that life, sensation, and nourishment have distinct and incompatible causes remains unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1","text":"Motion → similarity or dissimilarity → concord or discordance → harmonic affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS2","text":"Swiftness and slowness → overtaking of motions → blending of motions → pleasure or delight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS3","text":"Mutual interweaving of motions → change of positions → flow, fall, or apparent attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS4","text":"Fire → cutting of foodstuffs → breath → filling of veins → diffusion of nutritive streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS5","text":"Mixture of plant constituents → variety of colors; cutting and wiping-out by fire → redness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1","text":"Phenomena of attraction and flow → rejection of attraction and void → mutual interweaving of motions → universal natural causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF2","text":"Swift and slow tones → similarity or dissimilarity of motions → harmony or discordance → pleasure or delight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF3","text":"Respiration → cutting of food by fire → co-suspension of breath → filling of veins → universal nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF4","text":"Newly cut plants → mixture → chromatic variety → redness from fiery activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME1","text":"Attraction, flow, fall, and respiration are classified within a common field of motional causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2","text":"The distinction between natural and perceptual effect is weakened through their common generation from motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3","text":"Harmony is shifted from an abstract order to an embodied relation of similar motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME4","text":"Nourishment appears as a redistribution of streams, not as a simple intake of food.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME5","text":"Color is reclassified as an effect of composition and fiery processing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Tones, flows, thunderbolts, ambers, stones, respiration, food, and colors are explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Phenomena are constituted by relations of motions, changes of positions, cuttings, and streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Explanation is compelled to seek mechanisms behind phenomena and to reject superficial names as causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is understood as a continuous change and succession of motions, in which the preceding affection becomes the principle of the subsequent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the common motional logic of the phenomena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT2","text":"The sequence from the rejection of attraction and void to respiration and nourishment is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT3","text":"The precise manner in which mechanical blending passes into pleasure or delight is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT4","text":"The coexistence of divine planting and a mechanical explanation of food is one of tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5","text":"The construction remains strong where causality follows a succession of motions, but deficient where the transition from the natural to the qualitative requires an ineffable bridge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC8:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 80"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 64","title":"Section 80","context":"Chapter 64","original_title":"Section 80","original_context":"Chapter 64"},"original_title":"Section 80","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58","layer":"CH","title":"Section 81","order":65,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_58"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_58@R001","sha256":"836842456b7bc494972f6df73c2beb51814f84b112408c38b5957006ba07c8e3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS1","text":"Τὸ αἷμα ὡς ῥέον τροφικὸν στοιχεῖον νομεύει τὰς σάρκας καὶ σύμπαν τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS2","text":"Ἡ πλήρωσις τοῦ κενοῦ καὶ ἡ ἀπόκρισις τῆς τροφῆς ἐξηγοῦνται διὰ τῆς πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς φορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS3","text":"Ἡ αὔξησις καὶ ἡ φθίσις ἀκολουθοῦσι τῇ ἀναλογίᾳ τοῦ ἐπιρρέοντος πρὸς τὸ ἀπιόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS4","text":"Ἡ νεότης στηρίζεται εἰς νέους καὶ ἰσχυροὺς τριγωνικοὺς δεσμούς, οἳ μεταβάλλουσι τὴν ἐπεισερχομένην τροφὴν εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καὶ οἱ πολλοὶ ἀγῶνες χαλαροῦσι τὴν ῥίζαν τῶν τριγώνων, ὥστε ἡ τροφὴ μηκέτι ὁμοιοῦται πρὸς τὸ ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS6","text":"Ὁ γήρως καὶ ὁ θάνατος ἐξηγοῦνται ὡς διαδοχικὴ λύσις τῶν σωματικῶν καὶ ψυχικῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS7","text":"Ἡ κατὰ φύσιν λύσις εἶναι ἡδεῖα, ἐνώ ἡ παρὰ φύσιν φθορὰ διὰ νόσου ἢ τραύματος εἶναι ἀλγεινὴ καὶ βίαιος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα πληροῦται διὰ τῆς ἀναπληρώσεως τοῦ κενοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","text":"Πᾶν συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς φέρεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A3","text":"Τὸ αἷμα διανέμει τροφὴν εἰς τὰς σάρκας καὶ εἰς πᾶν τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","text":"Ἡ ἐντὸς τοῦ ζῴου φορὰ μιμεῖται τὴν τοῦ παντὸς φοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","text":"Ἡ ἰσορροπία ἐπιρροῆς καὶ ἀπορροῆς συνέχει τὴν ζωὴν τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τῆς ἀπορροῆς προκαλεῖ φθίσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A7","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τοῦ ἐπιρρέοντος προκαλεῖ αὔξησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","text":"Οἱ νέοι τριγωνικοὶ σχηματισμοὶ ἰσχυρότεροι εἰσὶ τῶν παλαιοτέρων καὶ ἀσθενεστέρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ καθίσταται σωματικὴ ὕλη μόνον ὅταν τὰ ἔνδον τρίγωνα τέμνωσιν αὐτὴν εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A10","text":"Ὁ χρόνος, οἱ ἀγῶνες καὶ ἡ ἐπανάληψις φθείρουσι τὴν δύναμιν τῶν τριγωνικῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις τῶν περὶ τὸν μυελὸν δεσμῶν ἐπιφέρει τὴν λύσιν τῶν δεσμῶν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A12","text":"Τὸ κατὰ φύσιν γιγνόμενον ἡδὺ ἐστίν, τὸ δὲ παρὰ φύσιν ἀλγεινόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX1","text":"Ἡ πλήρωσις τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τυχαίαν ἢ ἄτακτον εἴσοδον ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐκ ἐνισχύει τὸ ζῷον ἄνευ μετασχηματισμοῦ εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX3","text":"Ἡ αὔξησις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἄπειρος οὐδὲ ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναλογίαν ἐπιρροῆς καὶ ἀπορροῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX4","text":"Ὁ γήρως οὐκ ἐστὶν αἰφνίδιον ἢ ἀμιγῶς ἐξωτερικὸν συμβεβηκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX5","text":"Ὁ φυσικὸς θάνατος οὐκ ἐστὶν ἡ αὐτὴ λύσις μετὰ τοῦ θανάτου ἐκ νόσου ἢ τραύματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX6","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀποχώρησις τῆς ψυχῆς οὐκ ἀναγκαστικῶς συνδέεται μετὰ λύπης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D1","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ διατηρεῖται ὅταν ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ διανομή ἀναπληροῖ τὰ συνεχῶς κενωθέντα μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A1","CH_JP8E_S_58:A3","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D2","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ ἀφομοιοῦται διότι ἡ σωματικὴ φορά ἀναζητεῖ τὸ συγγενὲς καὶ μεταβάλλει τὸ ἀνόμοιον εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D3","text":"Ἡ αὔξησις δηλοῖ πλεονάζουσαν εἴσοδον, ἡ δὲ φθίσις δηλοῖ πλεονάζουσαν ἔξοδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A6","CH_JP8E_S_58:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D4","text":"Τὸ νεαρὸν ζῷον αὔξεται ἐπειδὴ οἱ ἔνδον σχηματισμοὶ κρατοῦσι τῶν παλαιοτέρων τριγώνων τῆς τροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D5","text":"Ὁ γήρως ἄρχεται ὅταν τὸ ζῷον ἀδυνατῇ τέμνειν τὴν εἰσερχομένην τροφὴν εἰς τὴν ἑαυτοῦ ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D6","text":"Ἡ ἔξωθεν ὕλη κατακρατεῖ τὸ γηρῶν ζῷον ἐπειδὴ οἱ ἐντὸς δεσμοὶ εὐχερέστερον διαιροῦνται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D7","text":"Ὁ φυσικὸς θάνατος ἐπελθεῖν δύναται ὅταν ἡ διάλυσις τῶν σωματικῶν δεσμῶν ἀφήσῃ τοὺς τῆς ψυχῆς δεσμούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D8","text":"Ἡ διαφορά τῶν θανάτων ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ διαφορᾷ τῆς αἰτίας: ἡ βίαιος φθορὰ ἀλγεινή, ἡ φυσικὴ λύσις ἡδεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1","text":"Ἡ ζωὴ ἐν τῷ σώματι ὁρίζεται ὡς δυναμικὴ ἀναπαραγωγὴ κοσμικῆς κινήσεως διὰ τοπικῆς ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD2","text":"Ἡ φθορά ἐστὶν ἀποτυχία τῆς ἀφομοιωτικῆς ἐξουσίας τοῦ σώματος πρὸς τὴν εἰσερχομένην ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀναλογίαν δυνάμεως μεταξὺ τοῦ ζῴου καὶ τῶν ἔξωθεν ἐπεισιόντων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD4","text":"Ὁ θάνατος νοεῖται ὡς μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνεργὸν σύγκρισιν καὶ ἀφομοίωσιν εἰς τὴν λύσιν τῶν συνεκτικῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη ταξινομοῦνται οὐχὶ κατὰ τὴν ἔκβασιν μόνον, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὸ εἰ ἡ κίνησις συμφωνεῖ ἢ ἀντιμάχεται τῇ φύσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὕλη οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἀδιάφορον ποσόν, ἀλλὰ ὑπόκειται εἰς συγγένειαν, φοράν, διαίρεσιν καὶ ἀφομοίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ταυτότης οὐκ ἐδράζεται εἰς ἀμετάβλητον πυρήνα, ἀλλὰ εἰς συνεχή ἀναπλήρωσιν καὶ συνοχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX3","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἐξωτερικὸν ἐχθρόν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἴδια ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ δύναμις ἐξασθενεῖ διὰ χρόνου καὶ ἀγῶνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀπολύτως ἀσύνδετος πρὸς τὴν σωματικὴν δομήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX5","text":"Ὁ θάνατος οὐκ ἀπαιτεῖ ἓν καθολικὸν πάθος, ἀλλὰ διακρίνεται κατὰ τὸν τρόπον τῆς λύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἰδέα ἀμεταβλήτου σωματικοῦ εἶναι ὑποκειμένου ὑπὸ τὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ κίνησις τῶν μερῶν δὲν ἀκολουθεῖ καθολικὴν τάξιν συγγενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνάπτυξις ὡς ἁπλὴ προσθήκη μεγέθους ἄνευ ἀνασχηματισμοῦ τῆς ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ φυσικὴ λύσις ὡς ἀναγκαίως ἀρνητικὴ ἐμπειρία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5","text":"Ἀποσιωπᾶται ἡ δυνατότης ἰσορροπίας ἄνευ φθορᾶς ἢ λύσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ χρονικὴ διάρκεια νοεῖται ὡς σταδιακὴ ἐξασθένησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1","text":"Κενὸν σώματος → εἴσοδος συγγενοῦς ὕλης → ἐσωτερικὴ φορὰ → ἀφομοιωτικὴ διαίρεσις → ἀναπλήρωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS2","text":"Ἐπιρροὴ > ἀπορροή → αὔξησις· ἀπορροὴ > ἐπιρροή → φθίσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS3","text":"Νεότης → ἰσχυροὶ τριγωνικοὶ δεσμοί → ἐπικράτησις ἐπὶ τῆς τροφῆς → σωματικὴ αὔξησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS4","text":"Χρόνος καὶ ἀγῶνες → χαλάρωσις ῥίζης → ἀδυναμία ἀφομοιώσεως → ἐπικράτησις ἔξωθεν τριγώνων → γήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS5","text":"Διάλυσις μυελικῶν δεσμῶν → λύσις ψυχικῶν δεσμῶν → ἀπόπτησις ψυχῆς → φυσικὸς θάνατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS6","text":"Παρὰ φύσιν διάλυσις διὰ νόσου ἢ τραύματος → βίαιος πόνος· κατὰ φύσιν διάλυσις διὰ γήρως → ἡδεῖα ἀποχώρησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1","text":"Κένωσις τοῦ σώματος → ἀναπλήρωσις διὰ συγγενείας → ἀφομοίωσις τῆς τροφῆς → αὔξησις ἢ φθίσις → χαλάρωσις τῶν τριγωνικῶν δεσμῶν → γήρως → διάλυσις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς → διάκρισις φυσικοῦ καὶ βιαίου θανάτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME1","text":"Ἡ διατροφή μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ καθημερινὴν λειτουργίαν εἰς κοσμολογικὴν διαδικασίαν ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀνάπτυξις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς ἀντίθετα ἀποτελέσματα τῆς αὐτῆς ἀναλογίας ῥοῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME3","text":"Ὁ γήρως μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν ἢ ἐξωτερικὴν κατηγορίαν εἰς μηχανικὴν ἐξασθένησιν τῆς ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4","text":"Ὁ θάνατος διαιρεῖται εἰς φυσικὴν λύσιν καὶ βίαιον διακοπήν, ἀντὶ νὰ νοῆται ὡς ἓν ἀδιαφοροποίητον συμβάν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ τοποθετεῖται ἐντός συνεχίσεως σωματικῶν δεσμῶν, χωρὶς νὰ ταυτίζηται ἀπλῶς μετὰ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ αἷμα, ἡ τροφή, ἡ αὔξησις, ὁ γήρως καὶ ὁ θάνατος συνδέονται εἰς μίαν βιολογικὴν ἀκολουθίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀκολουθία ἐξηγεῖται διὰ ῥοῶν, συγγενείας, τριγωνικῶν σχηματισμῶν καὶ δεσμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἑκάστοτε κατάστασις τοῦ ζῴου κρίνεται ἀπὸ τὸ ποῖον μέρος κρατεῖ: ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ἀφομοιωτικὴ δύναμις ἢ ἡ ἔξωθεν διαιρετικὴ ὕλη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ζῷον ὑφίσταται ὡς προσωρινὴ σύνθεσις ἐντὸς καθολικῆς κινήσεως, ἣν ὁ χρόνος ἀναγκαίως ἐξασθενεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ παθολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ νόσος καὶ τὸ τραῦμα ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀποκλίσεις τῆς φυσικῆς λύσεως καὶ ἐπιφέρουσιν ἄλγος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκῶσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναπλήρωσιν μέχρι τὸν θάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διασώζει τὴν ἐνότητα μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς φορᾶς, σωματικῆς διατροφῆς καὶ βιολογικῆς φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φυσικοῦ καὶ βιαίου θανάτου προϋποθέτει τὴν ἀξίαν τοῦ κατὰ φύσιν ὡς ἡδέος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ὁ ἀκριβὴς χαρακτὴρ τῶν τριγώνων, ἡ φύσις τῶν ψυχικῶν δεσμῶν καὶ ὁ τρόπος τῆς ἀποπτήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT5","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν σωματικὴν λύσιν εἰς τὴν ἡδονὴν παραμένει ἐξαρτωμένη ἀπὸ συνοπτικὴν φυσιολογικὴν καὶ ἀξιολογικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν γενετικὴν ἀκολουθίαν, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἐξαντλεῖ τὰς ἐνδιάμεσας μηχανικὰς λεπτομερείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231545453218Z_ad732f0e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 81","source_sha256":"836842456b7bc494972f6df73c2beb51814f84b112408c38b5957006ba07c8e3","sha256":"c7b2cab70906562941120037caef77018efbffa74153b1d4afab5593152f91a6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:15:45.457422+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS1","text":"Blood, as a flowing nutritive element, tends the flesh and the whole body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS2","text":"The filling of the void and the reception of nourishment are explained through motion toward what is akin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS3","text":"Growth and wasting follow the proportion of what flows in to what departs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS4","text":"Youth is supported by new and strong triangular bonds, which transform incoming nourishment into likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5","text":"Time and many struggles loosen the root of the triangles, so that nourishment is no longer assimilated to the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS6","text":"Old age and death are explained as the successive dissolution of bodily and psychic bonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AS7","text":"Dissolution according to nature is pleasant, whereas destruction contrary to nature through disease or wound is painful and violent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A1","text":"The body is filled through replenishment of the void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","text":"Everything akin is carried toward what is akin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A3","text":"Blood distributes nourishment to the flesh and to the whole body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","text":"The motion within the living being imitates the motion of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","text":"The balance of inflow and outflow sustains the life of the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A6","text":"The predominance of outflow causes wasting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A7","text":"The predominance of what flows in causes growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","text":"New triangular formations are stronger than older and weaker ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","text":"Nourishment becomes bodily matter only when the internal triangles cut it into likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A10","text":"Time, struggles, and repetition wear away the strength of triangular bonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","text":"The dissolution of the bonds around the marrow brings about the dissolution of the bonds of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:A12","text":"What occurs according to nature is pleasant, but what occurs contrary to nature is painful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX1","text":"The filling of the body does not constitute a chance or disorderly entry of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2","text":"Nourishment does not strengthen the living being without transformation into likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX3","text":"Growth is neither unlimited nor independent of the proportion of inflow and outflow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX4","text":"Old age is not a sudden or purely external occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX5","text":"Natural death is not the same dissolution as death from disease or wound.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:NX6","text":"The natural departure of the soul is not necessarily associated with pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D1","text":"Life is maintained when internal distribution replenishes the parts continually emptied.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A1","CH_JP8E_S_58:A3","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D2","text":"Nourishment is assimilated because bodily motion seeks what is akin and transforms the unlike into likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D3","text":"Growth indicates an excessive entry, while wasting indicates an excessive exit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A6","CH_JP8E_S_58:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D4","text":"The young living being grows because its internal formations prevail over the older triangles of nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D5","text":"Old age begins when the living being is unable to cut incoming nourishment into its own likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D6","text":"External matter overcomes the aging living being because the internal bonds are more easily divided.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D7","text":"Natural death can occur when the dissolution of bodily bonds releases the bonds of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:D8","text":"The difference among deaths follows the difference in cause: violent destruction is painful, natural dissolution pleasant.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1","text":"Life in the body is defined as the dynamic reproduction of cosmic motion through local assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD2","text":"Destruction is the failure of the body's assimilative power in relation to incoming matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3","text":"Time alters the proportion of power between the living being and the external things entering it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A8","CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD4","text":"Death is understood as a transition from active combination and assimilation to the dissolution of cohesive bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A9","CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SD5","text":"Pleasure and pain are classified not according to outcome alone, but according to whether motion accords with or opposes nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A11","CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX1","text":"Matter does not act as an indifferent quantity, but is subject to kinship, motion, division, and assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX2","text":"Bodily identity is not grounded in an unchanging core, but in continual replenishment and cohesion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX3","text":"Destruction does not require an external enemy, since internal power itself weakens through time and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX4","text":"The soul does not appear as wholly unconnected with bodily structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX5","text":"Death does not require one universal affection, but is distinguished according to the manner of dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX1","text":"The idea of an unchanging bodily being underlying change is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX2","text":"A world in which the motion of parts does not follow a universal order of kinship is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX3","text":"Development as a simple addition of magnitude without reconfiguration of matter is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX4","text":"Natural dissolution as a necessarily negative experience is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5","text":"The possibility of equilibrium without destruction or dissolution is left unspoken, since temporal duration is understood as gradual weakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1","text":"Void of the body → entry of akin matter → internal motion → assimilative division → replenishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS2","text":"Inflow > outflow → growth; outflow > inflow → wasting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS3","text":"Youth → strong triangular bonds → predominance over nourishment → bodily growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS4","text":"Time and struggles → loosening of the root → inability to assimilate → predominance of external triangles → old age.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS5","text":"Dissolution of marrow-bonds → dissolution of psychic bonds → flight of the soul → natural death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS6","text":"Dissolution contrary to nature through disease or wound → violent pain; dissolution according to nature through old age → pleasant departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1","text":"Emptying of the body → replenishment through kinship → assimilation of nourishment → growth or wasting → loosening of triangular bonds → old age → dissolution of body and soul → distinction between natural and violent death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME1","text":"Nutrition is transformed from an everyday function into a cosmological process of assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME2","text":"Development and destruction are recognized as opposite results of the same proportion of flows.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME3","text":"Old age is shifted from a moral or external category into a mechanical weakening of assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4","text":"Death is divided into natural dissolution and violent interruption, instead of being understood as one undifferentiated event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5","text":"The soul is placed within a continuity of bodily bonds, without simply being identified with the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, blood, nourishment, growth, old age, and death are connected in one biological sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the sequence is explained through flows, kinship, triangular formations, and bonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the condition of the living being at any given time is judged by which side prevails: the internal assimilative power or the external divisive matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the living being exists as a temporary composite within universal motion, which time necessarily weakens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT5","text":"At the pathological level, disease and wound constitute deviations from natural dissolution and bring pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstruction of the basic movement from replenishment to death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the unity between cosmic motion, bodily nutrition, and biological destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT3","text":"The distinction between natural and violent death presupposes the value of what is according to nature as pleasant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT4","text":"The precise character of the triangles, the nature of psychic bonds, and the manner of flight are underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent, but the transition from bodily dissolution to pleasure remains dependent on a general physiological and evaluative principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_58:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6","text":"The compression preserves the generative sequence, but does not exhaust the intermediate mechanical details.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_58@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_58:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 81"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 65","title":"Section 81","context":"Chapter 65","original_title":"Section 81","original_context":"Chapter 65"},"original_title":"Section 81","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59","layer":"CH","title":"Section 82","order":66,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_59"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_59@R001","sha256":"d7580db767022c735d565a71ddbf9ce38c7ee0428c4d3eaabdf2bf60ed39e2f4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα τῶν νόσων ἀνάγεται εἰς τὴν παρὰ φύσιν σύστασιν καὶ μεταβολὴν τῶν στοιχείων τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS2","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἐρμηνεύεται διὰ πλεονεξίας, ἐνδείας, μετατοπίσεως καὶ ἀνοικείου προσλήψεως τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS3","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἐκ τῆς κατὰ λόγον προσόδου καὶ ἀποδόσεως τῶν αὐτῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τῶν πρώτων στοιχείων εἰς τὰ δεύτερα συστήματα, τὸν μυελόν, τὰ ὀστᾶ, τὰς σάρκας, τὰ νεῦρα καὶ τὸ αἷμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS5","text":"Ἡ φθορά γίνεται φανερωτέρα ὅταν ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις τῶν συστατικῶν ἀντιστρέφηται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἐκ γῆς, πυρός, ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος συμπέπηγεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","text":"Ἡ παρὰ φύσιν πλεονεξία καὶ ἔνδεια τῶν στοιχείων νόσους καὶ στάσεις παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","text":"Ἡ μετατόπισις στοιχείου ἐκ τῆς οἰκείας χώρας εἰς ἀλλοτρίαν χώραν προκαλεῖ παθολογικὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A4","text":"Ἕκαστον στοιχεῖον ὀφείλει προσλαμβάνειν τὸ οἰκεῖον καὶ μὴ τὸ ἀνόμοιον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A5","text":"Ἡ κατὰ λόγον καὶ ὡσαύτως προσθήκη καὶ ἀφαίρεσις διατηρεῖ τὸ σώμα ὑγιές.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A6","text":"Ἡ ἐκτὸς τοῦ λόγου προσέλευσις ἢ ἀποχώρησις γεννᾷ ποικίλας ἀλλοιώσεις καὶ ἀπείρους φθοράς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","text":"Τὰ δεύτερα σωματικὰ συστήματα συγκροτοῦνται κατὰ φύσιν ἐκ τῶν πρώτων στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","text":"Ὁ μυελός, τὰ ὀστᾶ, αἱ σάρκες, τὰ νεῦρα καὶ τὸ αἷμα ἔχουσι διακεκριμένας γενέσεις ἐκ συγγενῶν ὑλῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A9","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια συμβαίνει ὅταν ἡ γένεσις τῶν δευτέρων συστάσεων πορεύηται κατὰ φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","text":"Ἡ νόσος γίνεται ὅταν ἡ γένεσις τῶν συστάσεων πορεύηται ἐναντίως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A11","text":"Ἡ τήξις τῆς σαρκὸς εἰς τὰς φλέβας μεταβάλλει τὸ αἷμα καὶ γεννᾷ χολάς, ἰχῶρας καὶ φλέγματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX1","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια οὐκ ἔγκειται ἐν τῇ ἀτάκτῳ προσόδῳ καὶ ἀποδόσει τῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX2","text":"Τὸ στοιχεῖον οὐ δύναται ἀκινδύνως μεταβαίνειν ἐκ τῆς οἰκείας χώρας εἰς ἀλλοτρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX3","text":"Οὐ πᾶσα πρόσληψις ὕλης εἰς ἕκαστον γένος εἶναι φυσική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX4","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξήγητον συμβεβηκός, ἀλλὰ ἀπόκλισιν ἀπὸ τῆς φυσικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX5","text":"Τὰ ὀστᾶ, αἱ σάρκες, τὰ νεῦρα καὶ ὁ μυελὸς οὐ συνίστανται ἀδιακρίτως ἢ ἀγενεαλογήτως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἀνάπαλιν γένεσις οὐ διατηρεῖ τὴν ὑγίειαν, ἀλλὰ διαφθείρει τὰ γεννώμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ νόσος ἀκολουθεῖ τῇ παρὰ φύσιν μεταβολῇ, αἱ μεταβολαὶ θερμότητος, ψυχρότητος, ξηρότητος, ὑγρότητος, κουφότητος καὶ βαρύτητος ἀποτελοῦσι μορφὰς παθολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","CH_JP8E_S_59:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὑγίεια ἀπαιτεῖ λόγον ἐν ταῖς προσόδοις καὶ ἀποχωρήσεσιν, ἡ σωματικὴ ταυτότης διατηρεῖται διὰ ῥυθμισμένης ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ δεύτεραι συστάσεις ἔχουσι φυσικὴν γένεσιν, ἡ νόσος δύναται νὰ ἐξηγηθῇ ὡς διαστροφὴ συγκεκριμένης γενετικῆς ἀκολουθίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ αἱ σάρκες καὶ τὰ νεῦρα γίγνονται ἐκ τοῦ αἵματος, ἡ φθορὰ τῶν σαρκῶν δύναται νὰ ἐπανεισάγῃ ἀλλοιωμένην ὕλην εἰς τὰς φλέβας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀλλοιωμένη ὕλη τοῦ αἵματος ποικίλλεται κατὰ χρώματα, πικρότητας καὶ ὀξύτητας, ἡ νόσος ἐκδηλοῦται ὡς πολλαπλασιασμὸς ἀσυμβάτων δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ὕπαρξις συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχία ἀλληλοεξαρτωμένων μετασχηματισμῶν, ὧν ἡ διατάραξις ἐν ἑνὶ ἐπιπέδῳ ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς ἄλλα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A1","CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD2","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἐστὶν οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ἔλλειψις ἢ πλεόνασμα, ἀλλὰ ἀνατροπὴ τῆς φυσικῆς τάξεως τῶν μεταβάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","CH_JP8E_S_59:A9","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD3","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια νοεῖται ὡς δυναμικὴ ταυτότης, ἥτις σώζεται μόνον διὰ συμμετρίας προσόδων καὶ ἀποχωρήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A5","CH_JP8E_S_59:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4","text":"Ἡ παθολογία ἀναπτύσσεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀντιστροφὴν τῆς γενέσεως: ὃ ἔδει νὰ τρέφῃ καὶ νὰ συγκροτῇ, γίνεται φορεὺς διαλύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX1","text":"Ἡ νόσος προϋποθέτει ὅτι τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἔχει ἄμορφον ἢ ἀδιάφορον ὕλην, ἀλλὰ ὡρισμένην φυσικὴν τάξιν συστάσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀλλοίωσις οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἀπλὴ μετακίνησις, ἀλλὰ ὡς μετακίνησις ἐναντία τῷ φυσικῷ λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX3","text":"Τὸ ὑγιὲς σώμα οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ στατικὴν ἀκινησίαν, ἀλλὰ ῥοὴν ἧς ὁ λόγος δὲν διαταράσσεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX4","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ οὐκ ἀρχίζει μόνον ἐν τῷ τελικοῦ ὀργάνου, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ ἀρχίσῃ ἐν τῇ ἀναστροφῇ τῆς γενετικῆς πορείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ σώματος οὐκ ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ τὴν συγγένειαν καὶ τὴν διαδοχὴν τῶν ὑλῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ὕλη ἔχει ἀδιάφορον θέσιν καὶ ἡ μεταβολὴ στερεῖται φυσικοῦ μέτρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις μεταξὺ γενέσεως καὶ φθορᾶς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ φθορὰ γεννᾶται ἐκ τῆς ἀναστροφῆς τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἄμεσος ἀναγωγὴ τῆς νόσου εἰς ἔξωθεν αἰτίαν· ἡ παθολογία συγκροτεῖται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἀταξίας τῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS1","text":"Τέσσαρα στοιχεῖα → φυσικὴ σύστασις σώματος → ἀναλογία προσόδων καὶ ἀποχωρήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS2","text":"Πλεονεξία ἢ ἔνδεια → μετατόπισις ἢ ἀνόμειος πρόσληψις → παρὰ φύσιν μεταβολή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS3","text":"Πρῶτα στοιχεῖα → μυελός, ὀστᾶ, σάρκες, νεῦρα, αἷμα → φυσικὴ θρέψις καὶ συγκρότησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4","text":"Ἀνάπαλιν γένεσις → τήξις σαρκῶν εἰς φλέβας → ἀλλοιωμένον αἷμα → χολαί, ἰχῶρες, φλέγματα → νόσος καὶ φθορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1","text":"Νόσος → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς στοιχειακὴν ἀνωμαλίαν → διάκρισις φυσικῆς καὶ παρὰ φύσιν μεταβολῆς → ἀναλογία ὡς ὅρος ὑγιείας → ἱεραρχικὴ ἐξήγησις τῶν συστάσεων → ἀντιστροφὴ γενέσεως → φθορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME1","text":"Ἡ νόσος μετατάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀόριστον πάθος εἰς μετρήσιμον ἀπόκλισιν ἀναλογίας καὶ χώρας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις πρώτων καὶ δευτέρων συστάσεων ἐπιτρέπει πολυεπίπεδον ἐξήγησιν τῆς παθολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME3","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀναστροφὴ φυσικῆς γενέσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία ὑγείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME4","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς διατηρουμένη ἰσορροπία ἐν κινήσει, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀμετάβλητος κατάστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ νόσος φαίνεται ὡς ἀλλοίωσις θερμοῦ, ψυχροῦ, ξηροῦ, ὑγροῦ, κούφου ἢ βαρέος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT2","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ νόσος παράγεται ἐκ πλεονεξίας, ἐνδείας, μετατοπίσεως καὶ ἀνοικείου προσλήψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταφέρει τὴν προσοχὴν ἀπὸ τὸ σύμπτωμα εἰς τὴν ἀκολουθίαν τῆς γενέσεως καὶ τῆς φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ σώμα νοεῖται ὡς γένεσις διαδοχικῶν συστάσεων, ἧς ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ παράγει φθοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἕνδεκα ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ βασικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ τῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία στοιχεῖα → σύστασις → ἀναλογία → ἀπόκλισις → φθορὰ διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀκριβῆ μηχανικὴν σχέσιν τῶν τεσσάρων στοιχείων πρὸς ἕκαστον νόσημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν ἀπαίτησιν φυσικοῦ λόγου, ἀναλογίας καὶ γενετικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἰσχυροποιεῖται ἐν τῇ συνδέσει στοιχειακῆς ἀνωμαλίας καὶ ἀντεστραμμένης γενέσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ συνοπτικὴν ὑπόθεσιν περὶ τοῦ τί ἐστι φύσει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231601830112Z_8c9473ce","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 82","source_sha256":"d7580db767022c735d565a71ddbf9ce38c7ee0428c4d3eaabdf2bf60ed39e2f4","sha256":"e996a1c5f3556a518a4d9b82f3bb5dc6ebd8ce9abc647afc5967c641b6a8a3db","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:16:01.832361+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS1","text":"The problem of diseases is referred back to the unnatural composition and alteration of the elements of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS2","text":"Disease is interpreted through excess, deficiency, displacement, and the reception of what is alien by the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS3","text":"Health depends upon the proportionate accession and departure of these same constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS4","text":"The explanation proceeds from the primary elements to the secondary systems: marrow, bones, flesh, sinews, and blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AS5","text":"Corruption becomes clearer when the natural generation of the constituents is reversed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A1","text":"The body has been compounded from earth, fire, water, and air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","text":"The unnatural excess and deficiency of the elements produces diseases and disturbances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","text":"The displacement of an element from its proper place into an alien place causes a pathological alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A4","text":"Each element ought to receive what is proper to it and not what is dissimilar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A5","text":"Proportionate and equal addition and subtraction preserve the body in health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A6","text":"Accession or departure outside proportion gives rise to varied alterations and countless corruptions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","text":"The secondary bodily systems are naturally constituted from the primary elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","text":"Marrow, bones, flesh, sinews, and blood have distinct generations from kindred materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A9","text":"Health occurs when the generation of the secondary compositions proceeds according to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","text":"Disease occurs when the generation of the compositions proceeds contrariwise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:A11","text":"The melting of flesh into the veins alters the blood and produces biles, ichors, and phlegms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX1","text":"Health does not consist in the disorderly accession and departure of the constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX2","text":"An element cannot pass without danger from its proper place into an alien one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX3","text":"Not every reception of matter into each kind is natural.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX4","text":"Disease is not an inexplicable accident, but a deviation from natural generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX5","text":"Bones, flesh, sinews, and marrow are not constituted indiscriminately or without lineage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:NX6","text":"Reverse generation does not preserve health, but corrupts what is generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D1","text":"Since disease follows upon unnatural alteration, alterations of heat, cold, dryness, moisture, lightness, and heaviness constitute forms of pathology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","CH_JP8E_S_59:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D2","text":"Since health requires proportion in accessions and departures, bodily identity is preserved through regulated proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D3","text":"Since the secondary compositions have a natural generation, disease can be explained as a distortion of a determinate generative sequence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D4","text":"Since flesh and sinews arise from blood, the corruption of the flesh can reintroduce altered matter into the veins.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:D5","text":"Since the altered matter of blood varies according to colors, bitternesses, and sharpnesses, disease manifests itself as a multiplication of incompatible powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1","text":"Bodily existence is constituted as a hierarchy of interdependent transformations, the disturbance of which at one level extends to others.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A1","CH_JP8E_S_59:A7","CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD2","text":"Disease is not simply deficiency or excess, but the overturning of the natural order of transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A2","CH_JP8E_S_59:A3","CH_JP8E_S_59:A9","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD3","text":"Health is conceived as a dynamic identity, preserved only through the symmetry of accessions and departures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A5","CH_JP8E_S_59:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4","text":"Pathology develops from the reversal of generation: what ought to nourish and constitute becomes a bearer of dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A8","CH_JP8E_S_59:A10","CH_JP8E_S_59:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX1","text":"Disease presupposes that the body does not have formless or indifferent matter, but a determinate natural order of compositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX2","text":"Alteration is not explained as mere movement, but as movement contrary to the natural logos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX3","text":"The healthy body is not static immobility, but a flow whose logos is not disturbed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX4","text":"Corruption does not begin only in the final organ, but can begin in the reversal of the generative course.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX5","text":"The unity of the body is not severed from the kinship and succession of its materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX1","text":"A world in which matter has an indifferent position and change lacks a natural measure is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2","text":"The absolute distinction between generation and corruption is excluded, since corruption is generated from the reversal of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX3","text":"A direct reduction of disease to an external cause is absent; pathology is constituted from the internal disorder of the constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS1","text":"Four elements → natural composition of the body → proportion of accessions and departures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS2","text":"Excess or deficiency → displacement or dissimilar reception → unnatural alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS3","text":"Primary elements → marrow, bones, flesh, sinews, blood → natural nourishment and constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4","text":"Reverse generation → melting of flesh into veins → altered blood → biles, ichors, phlegms → disease and corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1","text":"Disease → reduction to elemental anomaly → distinction between natural and unnatural alteration → proportion as the condition of health → hierarchical explanation of compositions → reversal of generation → corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME1","text":"Disease is shifted from an indeterminate affection to a measurable deviation of proportion and place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME2","text":"The distinction between primary and secondary compositions permits a multilevel explanation of pathology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME3","text":"Corruption is recognized as the reversal of natural generation and not as a mere absence of health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ME4","text":"Health is reclassified as a maintained equilibrium in motion, not as an unchanging state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT1","text":"Superficially, disease appears as an alteration of hot, cold, dry, moist, light, or heavy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT2","text":"Structurally, disease is produced from excess, deficiency, displacement, and alien reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation shifts attention from the symptom to the sequence of generation and corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT4","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the body is conceived as the generation of successive compositions, whose reversal produces corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT1","text":"The eleven principles suffice for reconstructing the basic mechanism of the explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT2","text":"The sequence elements → composition → proportion → deviation → corruption preserves the actual movement of the account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the precise mechanical relation of the four elements to each disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests on the requirement of natural logos, proportion, and generative succession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_59:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT5","text":"The explanation is strengthened in its connection of elemental anomaly and reversed generation, but depends on a summary hypothesis concerning what is by nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_59@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_59:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 82"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 66","title":"Section 82","context":"Chapter 66","original_title":"Section 82","original_context":"Chapter 66"},"original_title":"Section 82","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60","layer":"CH","title":"Section 83","order":67,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_60"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_60@R001","sha256":"0cfc1b089138675228a7dd194c4376f6022a79025db13be913ccd366d0c58361","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS1","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ γένεσις παθολογικῶν σωμάτων ἐκ αἵματος καὶ σαρκὸς διεφθαρμένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ διάκρισις τίθησι τὸ αἷμα τὸ κατὰ φύσιν τρεπτικόν, πρὸς τὰ σώματα τὰ ἐκ παλαιώσεως καὶ φθορᾶς γεννώμενα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS3","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ ἀναλύεται διὰ κινήσεως ἄτακτου, ἀπώλειας τροφικῆς δυνάμεως, θερμότητος, ὑγρότητος, ἀέρος καὶ χρωματικῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS4","text":"Πολλὰ ἀνόμοια προϊόντα ὑπάγονται εἰς κοινὸν γένος, ἐνῶ τὰ ἴδια εἴδη διακρίνονται κατὰ τὴν χρόαν καὶ τὴν σύστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἰχὼρ καὶ τὸ φλέγμα προκύπτουσιν ἐκ συγκεκριμένων μίξεων αἵματος, χολῆς, σαρκὸς, πνεύματος, ἀέρος καὶ ὑγρότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS6","text":"Ἡ νόσος παράγεται ὅταν ὁ ὄγκος τοῦ αἵματος αὔξηται οὐκ ἐκ τροφῆς καὶ πόματος κατὰ φύσιν, ἀλλὰ παρὰ τοὺς νόμους τῆς φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A1","text":"Τὸ κατὰ φύσιν αἷμα παρέχει τροφὴν τῷ σώματι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","text":"Τὸ διεφθαρμένον αἷμα ἀποβάλλει τὴν τροφικὴν δύναμιν καὶ γίνεται πολέμιον τοῦ συνεστῶτος σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις τῶν περιόδων ῥυθμίζει τὴν κίνησιν τῶν σωματικῶν ὑγρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","text":"Ἡ παλαίωσις καὶ ἡ συγκαῦσις μεταβάλλουσι τὴν σάρκα εἰς δύσπεπτα, πικρά, ὀξέα καὶ χρωματικῶς μεταβεβλημένα σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","text":"Ἕν κοινὸν γένος δύναται νὰ περιλαμβάνῃ πολλὰ ἀνόμοια σώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A6","text":"Αἱ χροιαὶ τῶν σωμάτων δηλοῦσι διαφορὰς ἐν τῇ συστάσει καὶ τῇ γενέσει αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A7","text":"Ἡ θερμότης, ὁ ἀήρ, τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ ἡ ὑγρότης μετασχηματίζουσι τὰ ἐκ νέας ἢ ἁπαλῆς σαρκὸς παραγόμενα ὑγρά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","text":"Τὰ παθολογικὰ σώματα γίνονται ὄργανα νόσων ὅταν ὁ ὄγκος τοῦ αἵματος αὐξάνηται παρὰ τοὺς φυσικοὺς νόμους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A9","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αὔξησις τοῦ αἵματος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὰ σιτία καὶ τὰ ποτά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX1","text":"Τὸ διεφθαρμένον αἷμα οὔτε τροφὴ σώματος ἐστὶν οὔτε οὐδέτερον ῥεῦμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τῶν παθολογικῶν ὑγρῶν οὐκ ἔχει τὴν κατὰ φύσιν τάξιν τῶν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX3","text":"Τὰ παλαιὰ καὶ διεφθαρμένα σώματα οὐκ εἰσὶν ἁπλῆ ὕλη, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὰ πολέμια τοῦ διαμένοντος σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX4","text":"Ἡ χολὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἓν ἀπαράλλακτον καὶ ἁπλοῦν σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX5","text":"Τὸ φλέγμα οὐκ ἔχει μίαν μόνην γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἐκ διαφόρων μίξεων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX6","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐκ ἀνάγεται εἰς πᾶσαν αὔξησιν αἵματος, ἀλλὰ εἰς αὔξησιν παρὰ τὸν φυσικὸν τρόπον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ διεφθαρμένον αἷμα ἀποβάλλει τὴν τροφικὴν δύναμιν καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις διαταράσσεται, ἡ ἄτακτος κυκλοφορία αὐτοῦ φθείρει τὸ σώμα ἀντὶ τοῦ τρέφειν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ παλαίωσις, ἡ συγκαῦσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ μεταβάλλουσι τὴν σάρκα, αἱ πικραί, ὀξεῖαι, μέλαιναι, ἐρυθραὶ, χλωραὶ καὶ ξανθαὶ μορφαὶ ἀποτελοῦσι φάσεις μιᾶς φθαρτικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D3","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἓν γένος περιλαμβάνει πολλὰ ἀνόμοια σώματα, τὸ κοινὸν ὄνομα τῆς χολῆς δηλοῖ γενετικὴν συγγένειαν καὶ οὐχὶ ταυτότητα συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D4","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ θερμότης, ὁ ἀήρ, τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ ἡ ὑγρότης μετασχηματίζουσι τὰ σώματα, ὁ ἰχὼρ καὶ τὸ φλέγμα ἀποτελοῦνται διὰ μίξεως καὶ παθήσεως, οὐχὶ διὰ ἁπλῆς παρουσίας ἑνὸς στοιχείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A6","CH_JP8E_S_60:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D5","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ φυσικὴ αὔξησις τοῦ αἵματος ἐκ τροφῆς καὶ πόματος γίνεται, ἡ παρὰ φύσιν αὔξησις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς αἰτία τῆς νοσογόνου καταστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","CH_JP8E_S_60:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD1","text":"Ἡ παθολογία συγκροτεῖται ὡς διατάραξις μεταβολικῆς τάξεως, ἐν ᾗ ἡ ὕλη παύει νὰ ἐντάσσηται εἰς τὸν φυσικὸν κύκλον τροφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ καθάρσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A1","CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","CH_JP8E_S_60:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD2","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματολογία τῶν παθολογικῶν σωμάτων ἐπιτελεῖ διπλὴν ἐργασίαν: ἑνοποιεῖ τὰ ἀνόμοια κατὰ γένος καὶ διακρίνει αὐτὰ κατὰ χροιὰν, σύστασιν καὶ γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD3","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ νοεῖται ὡς δυναμικὴ παραγωγὴ νέων παθολογικῶν μορφῶν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παλαιὰ σάρξ καὶ τὰ σωματικὰ ὑγρά ἀλληλεπιδρῶσιν ὑπὸ θερμότητος, ἀέρος, πνεύματος καὶ ὑγρότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","CH_JP8E_S_60:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναγνωρίζεται ὄχι μόνον ἐκ τῆς ποιότητος τῶν σωμάτων, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐκ τῆς παρὰ φύσιν ποσότητος καὶ κινήσεως αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","CH_JP8E_S_60:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX1","text":"Τὰ σωματικὰ ὑγρά οὐκ ἐξηγοῦνται ὡς ἀμετάβληται οὐσίαι ἀνεξάρτητοι ἀπὸ τὴν θερμότητα, τὴν μίξιν καὶ τὴν κίνησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX2","text":"Ἡ παθολογικὴ μεταβολὴ οὐκ ἔχει μόνην αἰτίαν τὴν χροιάν· ἡ χροιὰ ἀπαιτεῖ γενετικὴν καὶ φυσικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ὕλη τοῦ σώματος οὐκ εἶναι ἀδρανὴς ὑπόστασις ἔξωθεν τῶν νόμων τῆς φύσεως, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται διὰ φυσικῶν περιόδων καὶ παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX4","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐκ ἐπιβάλλεται ἀπολύτως ἔξωθεν τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς μεταβολῆς τῶν συστατικῶν αὐτοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ κανονικότης οὐκ ὁρίζεται μόνον ὑπὸ τῆς προελεύσεως, ἀλλὰ καὶ ὑπὸ τῆς τάξεως, τοῦ μέτρου καὶ τῆς περιόδου τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὸ αἷμα παραμένει ἁπλοῦν, ἀκίνητον καὶ ἀνεπηρέαστον ὑπὸ τῶν μεταβολῶν τῆς σαρκὸς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις ὑγιείας καὶ νόσου ὡς δύο ἑξωτερικῶν οὐσιῶν· ἡ νόσος ἀναφύεται ἐκ τῆς διαταραχῆς τοῦ φυσικοῦ κύκλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐνιαία ἀρχὴ ἡ ὁποία νὰ ἐξηγῇ ἅπαντα τὰ ὑγρά· ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ γένους συνυπάρχει μετὰ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἑτερογενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀποκλειομένη δυνατότης εἶναι ὅτι ἡ παθολογία ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς θέμα ὀνομασίας· ἀντιθέτως, ἡ ὀνοματολογία ἀκολουθεῖ πραγματικὰς μεταβολὰς ὕλης, κινήσεως καὶ ποσότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS1","text":"Φυσικὴ τροφή καὶ πόσις → φυσικὴ αὔξησις αἵματος → τροφοδοτικὴ λειτουργία → διατήρησις σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS2","text":"Παλαίωσις ἢ συγκαῦσις σαρκὸς → φθορά καὶ μεταβολὴ χρώματος → γένεσις πικρῶν, ὀξέων καὶ χολωδῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS3","text":"Νέα ἢ ἁπαλὴ σάρξ + θερμότης + ἀήρ + πνεῦμα + ὑγρότης → τήκεδονες, ἰχὼρ καὶ λευκὸν φλέγμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS4","text":"Ἀπώλεια τροφικῆς δυνάμεως + διατάραξις φυσικῶν περιόδων → ἄτακτος κυκλοφορία → ἐχθρότης πρὸς τὸ σώμα → φθορά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS5","text":"Παρὰ φύσιν αὔξησις τοῦ αἵματος → συσσώρευσις παθολογικῶν σωμάτων → ὄργανα νόσων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS6","text":"Ποικιλία σωματικῶν προϊόντων → ἀναγνώρισις κοινοῦ γένους → διάκρισις εἰδῶν κατὰ χρόαν, μίξιν καὶ γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AF1","text":"Φυσικὴ τροφὴ → φθορά αἵματος καὶ σαρκὸς → ἀπώλεια τάξεως καὶ τροφῆς → χρωματικὴ καὶ συστατικὴ διαφοροποίησις → γένεσις χολῆς, ἰχώρος καὶ φλέγματος → παρὰ φύσιν ὄγκος → νόσος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME1","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία καὶ ἡ νόσος ἀναχαρτογραφοῦνται ὡς δύο τρόποι ῥυθμίσεως τῆς ὕλης, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλαῖ ἀντίθετοι ποιότητες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME2","text":"Ἡ χρωματικὴ ποικιλία μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἐπιφαινόμενον εἰς σημεῖον διαδικασίας, μίξεως καὶ μεταβολῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀνάμεσα εἴδει καὶ γένει ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἑνότητα τῆς χολῆς χωρὶς ἐξάλειψιν τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν διαφορών.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME4","text":"Ἡ νόσος μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἐξωτερικὸν συμβεβηκός εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἀπόκλισιν ὄγκου, κινήσεως καὶ προελεύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἰατρικὴ ταξινόμησις συνδέει τὴν ὀνοματολογίαν μὲ τὴν αἰτιολογίαν, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖ ἀνοικτὴν τὴν ἑτερογένειαν τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφάνεια ἀφορά τὰ ὁρατὰ χρώματα καὶ τὰ ῥέοντα σώματα, ὡς μέλαινα, ἐρυθρά, χλωρά, ξανθὰ καὶ λευκά.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT2","text":"Τὸ δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον ἀφορά τὴν ἀλληλεπίδρασιν αἵματος, σαρκὸς, θερμότητος, ἀέρος, πνεύματος καὶ ὑγρότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT3","text":"Τὸ μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον ἀνασυνδέει τὴν ὀνομασίαν μὲ τὴν ταξινόμησιν γένους, εἴδους, χρώματος καὶ γενετικῆς διαδικασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT4","text":"Τὸ ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον ὑποθέτει φύσιν ὡς τάξιν περιόδων, ἐν ᾗ ἡ παλαίωσις, ἡ γένεσις, ἡ φθορά, ἡ ῥοὴ καὶ ἡ κάθαρσις καθορίζουσι τὸ ὑγιὲς καὶ τὸ νοσῶδες.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἐξαγόμενα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν φυσικὴν τροφὴν εἰς τὴν παρὰ φύσιν νόσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ἑνὸς γένους καὶ πολλῶν ἐσωτερικῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀκριβῆ σημασίαν τῶν φυσικῶν ὀνομάτων καὶ τὴν ἱεράρχησιν τῶν μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT4","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐπειδὴ συνδέει προέλευσιν, κίνησιν, ποσότητα, χροιὰν καὶ παθολογικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα ἀρχὴ εἶναι ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξὺ φυσικῆς τάξεως καὶ παρὰ φύσιν ὄγκου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα περιοχή ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξ ὄψεως μετάβασιν ἀπὸ χρώματος εἰς σύστασιν καὶ αἰτίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT7","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὸν παραγωγικὸν μηχανισμόν, ἀλλὰ παραλείπει τὰ ἀκριβῆ ὅρια μεταξὺ τῶν ἐπιμέρους μορφῶν χολῆς, ἰχώρος καὶ φλέγματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231618998620Z_d3685279","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 83","source_sha256":"0cfc1b089138675228a7dd194c4376f6022a79025db13be913ccd366d0c58361","sha256":"1fd428ea1584c2bcc050ae57be0934cb227e27b233ad03a3a2a1e2fe58654e7a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:16:18.999573+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS1","text":"The central problem is the generation of pathological bodies from corrupted blood and flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS2","text":"The initial distinction posits blood according to nature as nutritive, in contrast to bodies generated from aging and corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS3","text":"Corruption is analyzed through disorderly motion, loss of nutritive power, heat, moisture, air, and chromatic changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS4","text":"Many dissimilar products fall under a common genus, while the particular species are distinguished by color and composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS5","text":"Ichor and phlegm arise from determinate mixtures of blood, bile, flesh, pneuma, air, and moisture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AS6","text":"Disease is produced when the bulk of blood increases not from food and drink according to nature, but contrary to the laws of nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A1","text":"Blood according to nature provides nourishment to the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","text":"Corrupted blood loses its nutritive power and becomes hostile to the constituted body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","text":"The natural order of periods regulates the movement of bodily fluids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","text":"Aging and co-burning transform flesh into indigestible, bitter, acid, and chromatically altered bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","text":"One common genus can include many dissimilar bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A6","text":"The colors of bodies indicate differences in their composition and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A7","text":"Heat, air, pneuma, and moisture transform the fluids produced from fresh or tender flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","text":"Pathological bodies become instruments of diseases when the bulk of blood increases contrary to natural laws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:A9","text":"The natural increase of blood depends on foods and drinks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX1","text":"Corrupted blood is neither nourishment for the body nor a neutral flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX2","text":"The movement of pathological fluids does not have the natural order of periods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX3","text":"Old and corrupted bodies are not simple matter, but active enemies of the enduring body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX4","text":"Bile does not constitute one invariable and simple body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX5","text":"Phlegm does not have one sole generation, but is produced from various mixtures and changes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:NX6","text":"Disease is not reducible to every increase of blood, but to an increase contrary to the natural manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D1","text":"Since corrupted blood loses its nutritive power and the natural order is disturbed, its disorderly circulation corrupts the body instead of nourishing it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D2","text":"Since aging, co-burning, and corruption transform flesh, bitter, acid, black, red, green, and yellow forms constitute phases of one corruptive generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D3","text":"Since one genus includes many dissimilar bodies, the common name of bile indicates generative kinship and not identity of composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D4","text":"Since heat, air, pneuma, and moisture transform bodies, ichor and phlegm are constituted through mixture and affection, not through the simple presence of one element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A6","CH_JP8E_S_60:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:D5","text":"Since the natural increase of blood occurs from food and drink, the increase contrary to nature is recognized as a cause of the disease-producing condition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","CH_JP8E_S_60:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD1","text":"Pathology is constituted as a disturbance of metabolic order, in which matter ceases to be integrated into the natural cycle of nourishment, movement, and purification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A1","CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","CH_JP8E_S_60:A8","CH_JP8E_S_60:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD2","text":"The nomenclature of pathological bodies performs a double task: it unifies dissimilar things by genus and distinguishes them by color, composition, and generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A5","CH_JP8E_S_60:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD3","text":"Corruption is conceived as the dynamic production of new pathological forms, because old flesh and bodily fluids interact under heat, air, pneuma, and moisture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A4","CH_JP8E_S_60:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4","text":"Disease is recognized not only from the quality of bodies, but also from their quantity and movement contrary to nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:A2","CH_JP8E_S_60:A3","CH_JP8E_S_60:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX1","text":"Bodily fluids are not explained as unchanging substances independent of heat, mixture, and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX2","text":"Pathological change does not have color as its sole cause; color requires a generative and natural explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX3","text":"The matter of the body is not an inert substrate outside the laws of nature, but changes through natural periods and affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX4","text":"Disease is not imposed absolutely from outside the body, but is produced from the internal alteration of its constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5","text":"Natural regularity is defined not only by origin, but also by the order, measure, and period of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which blood remains simple, unmoving, and unaffected by the changes of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX2","text":"The absolute distinction between health and disease as two external substances is excluded; disease arises from the disturbance of the natural cycle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3","text":"There is no single principle that explains all fluids; the unity of the genus coexists with internal heterogeneity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX4","text":"The excluded possibility is that pathology is merely a matter of naming; on the contrary, nomenclature follows real changes of matter, movement, and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS1","text":"Natural food and drink → natural increase of blood → nutritive function → preservation of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS2","text":"Aging or co-burning of flesh → corruption and change of color → generation of bitter, acid, and bilious bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS3","text":"Fresh or tender flesh + heat + air + pneuma + moisture → meltings, ichor, and white phlegm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS4","text":"Loss of nutritive power + disturbance of natural periods → disorderly circulation → hostility toward the body → corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS5","text":"Increase of blood contrary to nature → accumulation of pathological bodies → instruments of diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:FGS6","text":"Variety of bodily products → recognition of a common genus → distinction of species by color, mixture, and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:AF1","text":"Natural nourishment → corruption of blood and flesh → loss of order and nourishment → chromatic and compositional differentiation → generation of bile, ichor, and phlegm → bulk contrary to nature → disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME1","text":"Health and disease are remapped as two modes of regulation of matter, not as simple opposite qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME2","text":"Chromatic variety is transformed from an epiphenomenon into a sign of process, mixture, and change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME3","text":"The distinction between species and genus permits the unity of bile without eliminating internal differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME4","text":"Disease is shifted from an external accident to an internal deviation of bulk, movement, and origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ME5","text":"Medical classification connects nomenclature with causation, but keeps open the heterogeneity of bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT1","text":"The surface concerns visible colors and flowing bodies, such as black, red, green, yellow, and white.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT2","text":"The structural level concerns the interaction of blood, flesh, heat, air, pneuma, and moisture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT3","text":"The meta-strategic level reconnects naming with the classification of genus, species, color, and generative process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:ALT4","text":"The ontological and temporal level presupposes nature as an order of periods, in which aging, generation, corruption, flow, and purification determine the healthy and the diseased.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice for a reconstruction of the basic movement from natural nourishment to disease contrary to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction between one genus and many internal species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the precise meaning of natural names and the hierarchy of mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent because it connects origin, movement, quantity, color, and pathological activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT5","text":"The strongest principle is the opposition between natural order and bulk contrary to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_60:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT6","text":"The weaker area depends on the transition, on the basis of appearance, from color to composition and cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT7","text":"The compression preserves the productive mechanism, but omits the precise boundaries among the particular forms of bile, ichor, and phlegm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_60@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_60:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 83"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 67","title":"Section 83","context":"Chapter 67","original_title":"Section 83","original_context":"Chapter 67"},"original_title":"Section 83","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61","layer":"CH","title":"Section 84","order":68,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_61"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_61@R001","sha256":"ef73baf01bfe47a34082ac66c7165246042236e71e09a385a8222ecacbe05cba","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ κλιμάκωσις τῶν σωματικῶν νόσων διὰ τῆς διαφθορᾶς τῶν συνδέσεων, τῆς τροφῆς καὶ τῆς ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS2","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐχ ἁπλῶς ἐν ἑνὶ μέρει μένει, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῶν ἱστῶν εἰς ἄλλα μέρη μεταδίδοται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ βλάβη γίνεται βαρύτερα ὅταν διαταραχθῶσιν οἱ δεσμοὶ σαρκὸς καὶ ὀστέων, ἡ θρέψις, ἡ ἀναπνοή, ἢ ἡ τοῦ μυελοῦ φύσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόφραξις τῶν διεξόδων τοῦ πνεύμονος μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀνωμαλίαν τοῦ πνεύματος εἰς διάχυτον σωματικὴν φθοράν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις προχωρεῖ ἀπὸ τῆς τοπικῆς διαφθορᾶς εἰς τὴν κυκλοφορίαν, εἶτα εἰς τὴν συνολικὴν φύσιν τοῦ σώματος καὶ τὸν θάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A1","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀκεραιότητα τῶν δεσμῶν μεταξὺ σαρκὸς καὶ ὀστέων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀσθένεια τῆς σαρκὸς δύναται νὰ καταλυθῇ ἐν μέρει, ἐὰν οἱ ὑποκείμενοι πυθμένες μένωσιν ἀκέραιοι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A3","text":"Ἡ κακὴ δίαιτα μεταβάλλει τὸ λιπαρὸν καὶ λείον θρεπτικὸν στοιχεῖον εἰς τραχὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν ὕλην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A4","text":"Ἡ ἀποσύνδεσις τῶν ὀστέων, τῶν νεύρων καὶ τῶν σαρκῶν διαταράσσει τὴν ἀνταλλαγὴν τροφῆς καὶ δεσμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἡ ἀποσπασθεῖσα ἀπὸ τὰ ὀστᾶ ἐπανέρχεται εἰς τὰς σάρκας καὶ τὰ νεῦρα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστροφὴ τῆς διεφθαρμένης ὕλης εἰς τὴν φορὰν τοῦ αἵματος πολλαπλασιάζει τὰ προϋπάρχοντα νοσήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A7","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης τῆς σαρκὸς δύναται νὰ στερήσῃ τὸ ὀστοῦν τῆς ἱκανῆς ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A8","text":"Τὸ ὀστοῦν τὸ μὴ ἀναπνέον θερμαίνεται ὑπὸ εὐρῶτος, σφακελίζει καὶ ἀπορρίπτει τὴν τροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A9","text":"Ἡ νόσος τοῦ μυελοῦ, διʼ ἐνδείας ἢ ὑπερβολῆς, παράγει τὰ μέγιστα καὶ κυριώτατα νοσήματα πρὸς θάνατον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A10","text":"Τρία γένη νόσων ἀνάγονται εἰς πνεῦμα, φλέγμα καὶ χολήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A11","text":"Ὁ πνεύμων εἶναι ὁ ταμίας τῶν πνευμάτων καὶ ἡ καθαρότης τῶν διεξόδων αὐτοῦ ρυθμίζει τὴν ἀναπνοήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A12","text":"Ἡ ἀπόφραξις τῶν διεξόδων προκαλεῖ ἢ ἔλλειψιν ἢ πλεονασμὸν πνεύματος κατὰ τόπους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A13","text":"Τὸ ἐγκλεισθὲν πνεῦμα δύναται νὰ διατείνῃ τὰ νεῦρα καὶ τὰ παρακείμενα φλέβια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX1","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλὴ καὶ ἀκίνητος τοπικὴ βλάβη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX2","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ οὐ δύναται νὰ χωρισθῇ ἀπὸ τὰ ὀστᾶ ἄνευ διαταραχῆς τῶν νεύρων καὶ τοῦ αἵματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX3","text":"Ἡ διεφθαρμένη ὕλη οὐκ ἀποβάλλεται ἄνευ ἐπανεισόδου εἰς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀνεξάρτητον λειτουργίαν ἄνευ τῶν ἱστῶν καὶ τῶν ἀγγείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX5","text":"Ἡ βαρύτης τῆς νόσου οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖ μόνον τὸ μέγεθος τῆς ἀρχικῆς βλάβης, ἀλλὰ τὸ βάθος τοῦ προσβεβλημένου μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX6","text":"Ἡ νόσος τοῦ μυελοῦ οὐκ ἰσοδυναμεῖ πρὸς ἐπιφανειακὴν νόσον σαρκὸς ἢ δέρματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D1","text":"Ἐὰν οἱ πυθμένες μένωσιν ἀκέραιοι, ἡ δύναμις τῆς συμφορᾶς ἡμίσεια γίνεται καὶ ἡ ἀνάληψις εὐχερεστέρα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A1","CH_JP8E_S_61:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D2","text":"Ἡ κακὴ δίαιτα μετατρέπει τὴν θρεπτικὴν ὕλην εἰς διαβρωτικὸν παράγοντα ἀποσυνδέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A3","CH_JP8E_S_61:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀποσύνδεσις τῶν ὀστέων ἐκβάλλει τὰ νεῦρα γυμνὰ καὶ πλήρη ἁλμύρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A4","CH_JP8E_S_61:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D4","text":"Ἡ ἐκβολὴ τῆς ὕλης ἐκ τῶν ὀστέων ἐπιτείνει τὰς νόσους διὰ τῆς εἰς τὸ αἷμα ἐπανόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D5","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης τῆς σαρκὸς μετατρέπει τὴν ἀνεπαρκῆ ἀναπνοὴν τοῦ ὀστοῦ εἰς σήψιν καὶ σφακελισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A7","CH_JP8E_S_61:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D6","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τῆς διεφθαρμένης ὕλης ἀπὸ ὀστοῦ εἰς σάρκα καὶ ἀπὸ σαρκὸς εἰς αἷμα παράγει διαδοχικὴν κλιμάκωσιν τῆς νόσου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","CH_JP8E_S_61:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D7","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις ἢ ἡ ὑπερβολὴ τοῦ μυελοῦ ἀντιστρέφει τὴν φυσικὴν ἀνάπαλσιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D8","text":"Ἡ ἀπόφραξις τοῦ πνεύμονος προκαλεῖ διαφοροποιημένην κατανομήν τοῦ πνεύματος, μετὰ σήψεως τῶν ἀναψύξεως στερουμένων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A11","CH_JP8E_S_61:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D9","text":"Τὸ πλεονάζον πνεῦμα διαβιάζεται διὰ τῶν φλεβῶν, τήκει τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἐγκλείεται περὶ τὸ διάφραγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D10","text":"Τὸ ἐγκλεισθὲν πνεῦμα προκαλεῖ ὠδίνας καὶ, ὅταν περιλάβῃ νεῦρα, παράγει τέτανον καὶ ὀπισθότονον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ νόσος νοεῖται ὡς ἀλυσὶς μεταμορφώσεων, ἐν ᾗ ἡ τοπικὴ ἀνωμαλία γίνεται κυκλοφοριακὴ καὶ ἔπειτα συστημική.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD2","text":"Ἡ κρισιμότης ἑκάστης νόσου ἀυξάνει ὅσῳ ἡ βλάβη μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιφάνειαν πρὸς τοὺς βαθυτέρους ὑποστηρικτικοὺς μηχανισμούς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3","text":"Ἡ τροφή, ἡ ἀναπνοή, ἡ κυκλοφορία καὶ ἡ νευρικὴ τάσις ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀλληλοεξαρτώμενα πεδία μιᾶς σωματικῆς μηχανῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ κυκλοφορία τῆς νοσηρᾶς ὕλης καθιστᾷ τὸ σῶμα φορέα τῆς ἰδίας αὐτοῦ διαφθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ ἐξήγησις συνδέει τὴν αἰτίαν τῆς νόσου μετὰ τῆς μορφῆς τοῦ πόνου καὶ τῆς τελικῆς ἐκβάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ ἀπολύτως αὐτοτελῶν μερῶν, ἃ δύνανται νοσεῖν ἄνευ ἀλληλεπιδράσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ οὐκ εἶναι ἁπλῶς ὕλη προστιθεμένη τῷ σώματι, ἀλλὰ στοιχεῖον ὃ δύναται νὰ μεταβληθῇ εἰς δεσμὸν ἢ διάλυσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ μόνον ὡς εἴσοδος πνεύματος, ἀλλὰ ὡς μηχανισμὸς διανομῆς, ψύξεως καὶ ἀποφυγῆς σήψεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX4","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἰσορροπία οὐκ ἐρείδεται εἰς ἓν μόνον συστατικόν, ἀλλὰ εἰς τὴν ἀδιάκοπον ἀμοιβαίαν διέλευσιν ὕλης καὶ πνεύματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX5","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ νόσος οὐκ ἔχει ἁπλῶς ἕνα τόπον, ἀλλὰ σημαίνει ἀναστροφὴν τῆς συνολικῆς τάξεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ εἰκὼν τοῦ σώματος ὡς στατικοῦ ἀθροίσματος μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ νόσος ἔχει γραμμικὴν καὶ ἀναστρέψιμον μόνον πορείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης διάκρισις μεταξὺ ὕλης, κινήσεως, πνεύματος καὶ αἵματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀκεραίου συνδέσμου, καθαρᾶς διεξόδου καὶ ὀρθῆς ἀνακυκλώσεως ὑποβαστάζει ὅλην τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῆς παθολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1","text":"Ὑγιὴς σύνδεσις καὶ ὀρθή θρέψις → διατήρησις τῶν ἱστῶν → εὐχερὴς ἀνάληψις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2","text":"Κακὴ δίαιτα → μεταβολὴ θρεπτικῆς ὕλης → διάλυσις δεσμῶν σαρκὸς καὶ ὀστέων → ἔκθεσις νεύρων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS3","text":"Ἔκθεσις καὶ σήψις → ἐπανείσοδος νοσηρᾶς ὕλης εἰς τὸ αἷμα → πολλαπλασιασμὸς νοσημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS4","text":"Πυκνότης σαρκὸς → ἀνεπαρκὴς ἀναπνοὴ ὀστέων → εὐρῶς καὶ σφακελισμός → βαρύτερα νοσήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS5","text":"Νόσος μυελοῦ → ἀναστροφὴ τῆς σωματικῆς ἀναπαύσεως → μέγιστος κίνδυνος θανάτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS6","text":"Ἀπόφραξις πνεύμονος → ἀσύμμετρος κατανομή πνεύματος → σῆψις, διάτασις καὶ τήξις → ὠδὴ καὶ σπασμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF1","text":"Ἀρχικὴ νόσος σαρκὸς → διατάραξις δεσμῶν → μεταβολὴ θρεπτικῆς ὕλης → ἐπανείσοδος εἰς τὸ αἷμα → κλιμάκωσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF2","text":"Πυκνότης σαρκὸς → στέρησις ἀναπνοῆς ὀστέων → σήψις ὀστέων → βαθύτερα νοσήματα → θάνατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF3","text":"Ἀπόφραξις πνεύμονος → ἔλλειψις ἢ πλεονασμὸς πνεύματος → ἐγκλεισμὸς περὶ νεῦρα → τέτανος καὶ ὀπισθότονος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME1","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ συμβεβηκὸς τοῦ μέρους εἰς δυναμικὴν μετάδοσιν διὰ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2","text":"Ἡ βαρύτης ἀνατομικῶς χαρτογραφεῖται κατὰ βάθος: σὰρξ, ὀστοῦν, μυελός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME3","text":"Ἡ δίαιτα καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἀναδεικνύονται ὡς κοινὰ περάσματα μεταξὺ τοπικῆς καὶ συστημικῆς παθολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME4","text":"Ὁ πόνος καὶ ὁ σπασμὸς ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς τελικὰ ἀποτελέσματα ἐσωτερικῆς ἀποφράξεως καὶ διατάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις τῶν τριῶν γενῶν νόσου ἐπεκτείνει τὸ αἰτιολογικὸν πεδίον πέραν τῆς ἀμιγοῦς παθήσεως τῆς σαρκός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον: Παρατηροῦνται σῆψις, ὠδῖνες, ἱδρώς, τέτανος καὶ ὀπισθότονος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ παθολογία παράγεται ἀπὸ δεσμούς, διεξόδους, ἀγγεῖα, νεῦρα καὶ στρώματα ἱστῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταφέρει τὴν ἀναζήτησιν τῆς αἰτίας ἀπὸ τὸ σύμπτωμα εἰς τὴν ἀλυσίδα τῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Τὸ σῶμα νοεῖται ὡς κυκλοφοροῦσα τάξις, ἧς ἡ διατάραξις προχωρεῖ ἀναδρομικῶς καὶ ἀναστρέφει τὴν φυσικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς πορείας ἀπὸ τὴν τοπικὴν βλάβην εἰς τὴν γενικευμένην νόσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις στηρίζεται κυρίως εἰς τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν δεσμοῦ, θρέψεως, ἀναπνοῆς, κυκλοφορίας καὶ βάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φλέγματος καὶ χολῆς παραμένει ὑποδηλουμένη μᾶλλον ἢ ἀναπτυγμένη, ἐπειδὴ τὸ χωρίον ἐστιάζει εἰς τὸ πνεῦμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα ἐν τῇ περιγραφῇ τῆς διαδοχικῆς μεταδόσεως ἢ ἐν τῇ πλήρει ταξινομίᾳ τῶν αἰτίων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις προϋποθέτει ἀνατομικὴν καὶ χυμικὴν φυσιολογίαν, ἣν δὲν ἀποδεικνύει ἐκ νέου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἐλάχιστη μηχανὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν: ἀκεραιότης → διατάραξις → μετάδοσις → βάθυνσις → συστημικὴ ἀναστροφή → θάνατος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231638809878Z_1823842c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 84","source_sha256":"ef73baf01bfe47a34082ac66c7165246042236e71e09a385a8222ecacbe05cba","sha256":"0efd4b2a73c70fc714dafc6b1ef7539566c52d0906f47c1ce94937867312f95f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:16:38.810987+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS1","text":"The problem is the generation and escalation of bodily diseases through the corruption of connections, nourishment, and respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS2","text":"Disease does not simply remain in one part, but is transmitted through the tissues to other parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS3","text":"The initial injury becomes graver when the bonds of flesh and bones, nourishment, respiration, or the nature of marrow are disturbed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4","text":"The obstruction of the passages of the lung transforms the irregularity of pneuma into diffuse bodily corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AS5","text":"The explanation proceeds from local corruption to circulation, then to the overall nature of the body and death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A1","text":"Health requires the integrity of the bonds between flesh and bones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A2","text":"The disease of the flesh can be destroyed in part, if the underlying foundations remain intact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A3","text":"A bad diet transforms the fatty and smooth nutritive element into rough and salty matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A4","text":"The disconnection of bones, nerves, and flesh disturbs the exchange of nourishment and bonding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","text":"Matter detached from the bones returns into the flesh and nerves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","text":"The return of corrupted matter into the course of the blood multiplies pre-existing diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A7","text":"The density of the flesh can deprive the bone of sufficient respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A8","text":"A bone that does not breathe is heated by ichor, becomes gangrenous, and rejects nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A9","text":"Disease of the marrow, through deficiency or excess, produces the greatest and most decisive diseases tending toward death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A10","text":"Three kinds of diseases are referred to pneuma, phlegm, and bile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A11","text":"The lung is the steward of the pneumas, and the cleanliness of its passages regulates respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A12","text":"The obstruction of the passages causes either deficiency or excess of pneuma in particular places.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:A13","text":"Confined pneuma can stretch the nerves and the adjacent veins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX1","text":"Disease is not a simple and immobile local injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX2","text":"Flesh cannot be separated from bones without disturbance of the nerves and blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX3","text":"Corrupted matter is not expelled without re-entering the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX4","text":"Respiration does not constitute an independent function apart from the tissues and vessels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX5","text":"The severity of disease does not follow only the magnitude of the initial injury, but the depth of the affected part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:NX6","text":"Disease of the marrow is not equivalent to a superficial disease of flesh or skin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D1","text":"If the foundations remain intact, the force of the calamity becomes half as great and recovery easier.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A1","CH_JP8E_S_61:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D2","text":"A bad diet turns nutritive matter into a corrosive agent of disconnection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A3","CH_JP8E_S_61:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D3","text":"The disconnection of the bones leaves the nerves exposed and full of salinity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A4","CH_JP8E_S_61:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D4","text":"The expulsion of matter from the bones intensifies diseases through its return into the blood.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D5","text":"The density of the flesh transforms the insufficient respiration of bone into putrefaction and gangrene.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A7","CH_JP8E_S_61:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D6","text":"The movement of corrupted matter from bone into flesh and from flesh into blood produces a successive escalation of disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A5","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","CH_JP8E_S_61:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D7","text":"Deficiency or excess of marrow reverses the body's natural restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D8","text":"Obstruction of the lung produces a differentiated distribution of pneuma, with putrefaction of the parts deprived of cooling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A11","CH_JP8E_S_61:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D9","text":"Excess pneuma forces its way through the veins, melts the body, and is confined around the diaphragm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:D10","text":"Confined pneuma causes pains and, when it encompasses nerves, produces tetanus and opisthotonus.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1","text":"Bodily disease is conceived as a chain of transformations, in which a local irregularity becomes circulatory and then systemic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD2","text":"The criticality of each disease increases insofar as the injury passes from the surface toward the deeper supporting mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3","text":"Nourishment, respiration, circulation, and nervous tension constitute interdependent fields of one bodily machine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4","text":"The internal circulation of diseased matter makes the body the bearer of its own corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SD5","text":"The anatomical explanation connects the cause of disease with the form of pain and the final outcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX1","text":"The body does not consist of absolutely self-contained parts that can be diseased without interaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2","text":"Nourishment is not simply matter added to the body, but an element that can be transformed into bonding or dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3","text":"Respiration operates not only as an intake of pneuma, but as a mechanism of distribution, cooling, and avoidance of putrefaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX4","text":"Bodily equilibrium rests not on one constituent alone, but on the uninterrupted reciprocal passage of matter and pneuma.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX5","text":"The final disease does not simply have one location, but signifies a reversal of the body's overall order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX1","text":"The image of the body as a static aggregate of parts is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX2","text":"The idea that disease has only a linear and reversible course is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX3","text":"The complete distinction between matter, movement, pneuma, and blood is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4","text":"The absence of an intact bond, a clear passage, and proper recirculation underlies the entire explanation of pathology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1","text":"Healthy connection and proper nourishment → preservation of the tissues → easy recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2","text":"Bad diet → transformation of nutritive matter → dissolution of the bonds of flesh and bones → exposure of nerves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS3","text":"Exposure and putrefaction → re-entry of diseased matter into the blood → multiplication of diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS4","text":"Density of flesh → insufficient respiration of bones → ichor and gangrene → graver diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS5","text":"Disease of marrow → reversal of bodily repose → greatest danger of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS6","text":"Obstruction of the lung → asymmetric distribution of pneuma → putrefaction, distension, and melting → pain and spasm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF1","text":"Initial disease of flesh → disturbance of bonds → transformation of nutritive matter → re-entry into the blood → escalation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF2","text":"Density of flesh → deprivation of respiration in bones → putrefaction of bones → deeper diseases → death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:AF3","text":"Obstruction of the lung → deficiency or excess of pneuma → confinement around nerves → tetanus and opisthotonus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME1","text":"Disease is reclassified from an affection of a part into dynamic transmission through the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2","text":"Severity is anatomically mapped according to depth: flesh, bone, marrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME3","text":"Diet and respiration are brought to light as common passages between local and systemic pathology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME4","text":"Pain and spasm are recognized as final results of internal obstruction and distension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ME5","text":"The distinction of the three kinds of disease extends the etiological field beyond the unmixed affection of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT1","text":"Superficial level: Putrefaction, pains, sweat, tetanus, and opisthotonus are observed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2","text":"Structural level: Pathology is produced by bonds, passages, vessels, nerves, and layers of tissues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: The explanation transfers the search for cause from the symptom to the chain of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: The body is conceived as a circulating order, the disturbance of which proceeds recursively and reverses natural functioning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic course from local injury to generalized disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction rests chiefly on the sequence of bonding, nourishment, respiration, circulation, and depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT3","text":"The distinction of phlegm and bile remains implied rather than developed, because the passage focuses on pneuma.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence of the system is stronger in the description of successive transmission than in the complete taxonomy of causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT5","text":"The explanation presupposes an anatomical and humoral physiology, which it does not demonstrate anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6","text":"The minimal mechanism preserves the actual movement: integrity → disturbance → transmission → deepening → systemic reversal → death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_61:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_61@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_61:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 84"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 68","title":"Section 84","context":"Chapter 68","original_title":"Section 84","original_context":"Chapter 68"},"original_title":"Section 84","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62","layer":"CH","title":"Section 85","order":69,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_62"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_62@R001","sha256":"ef97727ae01e13ed8d9fa88b572e9eba752aa648186899f8bad48edb956097fe","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ἡ γένεσις πολλῶν νοσημάτων ἐκ τῶν ἐν τῷ σώματι ῥευμάτων καὶ μίξεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS2","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναφέρεται ἀπὸ τῶν ὀνομάτων καὶ τῶν φαινομένων εἰς τὰς κινήσεις, τὰς ἕξεις καὶ τὰς μίξεις τῶν χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS3","text":"Τὸ φλέγμα καὶ ἡ χολὴ διαφοροποιούνται κατὰ ποιότητα, τόπον, θερμότητα, ῥοήν, καὶ σχέσιν πρὸς τὸ αἷμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS4","text":"Ἡ τάξις τῶν ἰνῶν τοῦ αἵματος ἀποτελεῖ τὸν μηχανισμὸν τῆς συμμετρίας καὶ τῆς κυκλοφορίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS5","text":"Ἡ διατάραξις ταύτης τῆς τάξεως μεταβάλλει τὰ ῥεύματα εἰς πήξεις, καύσεις, τρόμους, καὶ νοσήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A1","text":"Τὸ λευκὸν φλέγμα, διὰ τὸ πνεῦμα τῶν πομφολύγων, δυσχερῶς ἀποχωρίζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","text":"Τὸ φλέγμα, ἐκτὸς μὲν τοῦ σώματος ἀναπνοὴν ἔχον, ἠπιώτερον γίνεται, ἐντὸς δὲ καταλαμβανόμενον ποικίλα νοσήματα παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","text":"Τὸ φλέγμα τὸ ὀξὺ καὶ ἁλμυρὸν ἀποτελεῖ πηγὴν τῶν καταρροϊκῶν νοσημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A4","text":"Πᾶν τὸ λεγόμενον φλεγμαίνειν τοῦ σώματος ἀπὸ χολῆς γέγονεν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A5","text":"Ἡ χολὴ ἐκτὸς μὲν ἀναπνεομένη παντοῖα φύματα ἀναπέμπει, ἐντὸς δὲ κατειργομένη πυρίκαυστα νοσήματα ἐμποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A6","text":"Τὸ αἷμα ὀφείλει διὰ τῶν ἰνῶν μέτριον πάχος καὶ λεπτότητα ἔχειν, ἵνα μήτε ἐκρέῃ μήτε δυσκινήτως παγῇ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A7","text":"Αἱ ἶνες τὸ αἷμα διατηροῦσιν ἐν τῇ οἰκείᾳ τάξει καὶ δύνανται ἅμα διαχέειν ἢ πήγνυναι αὐτό.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","text":"Ἡ χολὴ παλαιὸν αἷμα ἐκ τῶν σαρκῶν τετηκυῖα, θερμὴ καὶ ὑγρὰ οὖσα, ὑπὸ τῆς τῶν ἰνῶν δυνάμεως πήγνυται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A9","text":"Ἡ πήξις τῆς χολῆς καὶ ἡ βίαιος κατάσβεσις αὐτῆς χειμῶνα καὶ τρόμον ἐντὸς παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX1","text":"Τὰ νοσήματα οὐκ ἀποδίδοται εἰς ἀσώματον ἢ ἐξωτερικὴν αἰτίαν, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς σωματικὰς κινήσεις καὶ μίξεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX2","text":"Τὸ «ἱερὸν» νόσημα οὐ σημαίνει ὅτι ἡ γένεσις αὐτοῦ ἐκφεύγει τὴν φυσικὴν αἰτιολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX3","text":"Τὸ φλέγμα οὐκ ἔχει μίαν ἀμετάβλητον παθολογικὴν δύναμιν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται κατὰ τόπον καὶ περίστασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἐντὸς κατακράτησις τῶν χυμῶν οὐ ταυτίζεται μετὰ τῆς ἐκτὸς ἀναπνοῆς αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX5","text":"Ἡ χολὴ οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλῶς ὑγρὸν ῥευστόν, ἀλλὰ δύναται διὰ τῆς πήξεως νὰ μεταβάλῃ τὴν ὅλην λειτουργίαν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6","text":"Τὰ πολλὰ ὀνόματα τῶν νοσημάτων οὐ δηλοῦσι πολλὰς ἀρχὰς, ἀλλὰ τὰς διαφόρους ὁδοὺς τοῦ αὐτοῦ ῥεύματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐντὸς παραμονὴ τοῦ φλέγματος μετατρέπει ἥπιαν ὕλην εἰς πολλαπλὴν νοσηματικὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A1","CH_JP8E_S_62:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D2","text":"Ἡ διαφορὰ μεταξὺ καταρροῆς καὶ φλεγμονῆς παράγεται ἐκ τῆς διαφορᾶς τῆς ποιότητος καὶ τῆς ὁδοῦ τοῦ χυμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","CH_JP8E_S_62:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D3","text":"Ἡ ἔξοδος τῆς χολῆς ἀποφορτίζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν θερμότητα, ἡ δὲ ἐντὸς κατάκλεισις αὐξάνει τὴν καυστικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D4","text":"Ἡ ὀμαλὴ κυκλοφορία τοῦ αἵματος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀκριβῆ ἀναλογίαν λεπτότητος καὶ πάχους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D5","text":"Ἡ διατάραξις τῆς τάξεως τῶν ἰνῶν δύναται νὰ προκαλέσῃ ἢ διασπορὰν τοῦ αἵματος ἢ ἀκαριαίαν πήξιν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D6","text":"Ἡ εἴσοδος θερμῆς χολῆς εἰς τὸ αἷμα ἐνεργοποιεῖ μηχανισμὸν πήξεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς ψύξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D7","text":"Τὸ αἴτιον τοῦ τρόμου οὐκ ἔγκειται μόνον στὴν θερμότητα, ἀλλὰ στὴν ἀπότομον ἀναστολὴν τῆς θερμότητος διὰ πήξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1","text":"Ἡ παθολογία συγκροτεῖται ὡς δυναμικὴ μεταβολὴ ὕλης, ἐν ᾗ ὁ αὐτὸς χυμὸς ἄλλοτε ἀποφορτίζει καὶ ἄλλοτε νοσοποιεῖ, ἀναλόγως τῆς θέσεως καὶ τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","CH_JP8E_S_62:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2","text":"Ἡ τάξις τοῦ σώματος δὲν εἶναι ἀκινησία, ἀλλὰ ρυθμισμένη ῥοὴ ἡ ὁποία διατηρεῖται διὰ λεπτοῦ μέτρου ἀνάμεσα εἰς ὑγρότητα καὶ πυκνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A6","CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3","text":"Ἡ νόσος γίνεται ὁρατὴ ὡς ἀποτυχία μετασχηματισμοῦ: ἡ ἀναπνοὴ γίνεται κατάκλεισις, ἡ ῥοὴ γίνεται πήξις, καὶ ἡ θερμότης γίνεται τρόμος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","CH_JP8E_S_62:A5","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιολογία ἀνασκευάζει τὴν ἐπιφανειακὴν πολυμορφίαν τῶν νοσημάτων, ἀνάγων αὐτὰ εἰς ὀλίγους μηχανισμοὺς ῥοῆς, μίξεως, καύσεως καὶ πήξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","CH_JP8E_S_62:A4","CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἄθροισμα σταθερῶν οὐσιῶν, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς σύστημα ἀλληλεπιδρώντων καὶ μεταβαλλόντων ὑγρῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2","text":"Ἡ αἰτία οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται πρωτίστως ἀπὸ τὴν ὀνομασίαν τοῦ νοσήματος, ἀλλ᾽ ἀπὸ τὴν ὁδὸν καὶ τὴν κατάστασιν τῆς ὕλης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX3","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἰσορροπία οὐκ ἀσφαλίζεται ἅπαξ, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ συνεχή ρύθμισιν τῆς πυκνότητος, τῆς θερμότητος καὶ τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX4","text":"Ὁ αὐτὸς μηχανισμὸς δύναται νὰ εἶναι σωτήριος ἢ νοσοποιός, ἀναλόγως τοῦ χρόνου καὶ τοῦ τόπου τῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὸ σωματικὸν πάθος ἔχει μίαν μόνον, ἀμετάβλητον καὶ ἀνεξάρτητον σημασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ριζικὴ διάκρισις μεταξὺ φυσικῆς αἰτίας καὶ ἱερᾶς σημασίας· ἡ ἱερότης ἀνασυντάσσεται ἐντὸς τῆς φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται ἡ ἐξήγησις τῆς νόσου διὰ μόνου τοῦ τελικοῦ συμπτώματος, ἄνευ ἀναδρομῆς εἰς τὴν ἀφανῆ κίνησιν τῶν χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1","text":"Χυμικὴ ὕλη → ποιοτικὴ διαφοροποίησις → ῥοὴ ἢ κατάκλεισις → μίξις πρὸς αἷμα → διατάραξις ἰνῶν → πήξις ἢ διασπορά → νόσημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2","text":"Ἔξοδος χυμοῦ → ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἀποφόρτισις· ἐντὸς κατάληψις → θερμότης, καῦσις, καὶ νοσογένεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS3","text":"Ἰσορροπία λεπτότητος καὶ πάχους → ὀμαλὴ κυκλοφορία· ἀπόκλισις τῆς τάξεως → ἐκροὴ ἢ δυσκίνητος πήξις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS4","text":"Θερμὴ χολὴ + καθαρὸν αἷμα + ἶνες → πήξις → κατάσβεσις θερμότητος → χειμὼν καὶ τρόμος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AF1","text":"Δυσχερὴς θεραπεία → διαφοραὶ φλέγματος καὶ χολῆς → φυσικὴ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν νοσημάτων → ρύθμισις ῥοῆς καὶ πυκνότητος → διατάραξις ἰνῶν → πήξις, ψῦξις, καὶ τρόμος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AF2","text":"Ποικιλία νοσημάτων → κοινὴ χυμικὴ γένεσις → ἐσωτερικὴ μεταβολὴ τοῦ αἵματος → παθολογικὴ ἀναστροφὴ τῆς φυσικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME1","text":"Τὰ διάφορα νοσήματα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ὡς τοπικαὶ καὶ ποιοτικαὶ μορφαὶ ὀλίγων χυμικῶν μηχανισμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἱερότης μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὸ ὑπερφυσικὸν αἴτιον εἰς τὴν ἐξαιρετικὴν φυσικὴν διαδικασίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ, ἡ ῥοὴ, ἡ πήξις, καὶ ἡ θερμότης καθίστανται ἐνιαῖο διαγνωστικὸν πεδίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4","text":"Ἡ θεραπευτικὴ δυσχέρεια ἐξηγεῖται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἀμφισημίας τῶν μηχανισμῶν, οἳ δύνανται καὶ νὰ λύωσι καὶ νὰ νοσοποιῶσι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον: πυρετός, λευκαὶ ἀλφοί, καταρροαί, φλεγμοναί, καῦσις, χειμὼν, καὶ τρόμος ἐμφανίζονται ὡς συμπτώματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: τὰ συμπτώματα παράγονται ἐκ τῆς θέσεως, τῆς ῥοῆς, τῆς μίξεως, καὶ τῆς πήξεως τῶν χυμῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ ὄνομα τοῦ νοσήματος εἰς τὸν μηχανισμὸν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: ἡ σωματικὴ τάξις νοεῖται ὡς διαρκὴς ρύθμισις μεταξὺ ῥοῆς, θερμότητος, πυκνότητος, καὶ πήξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς αἰτιολογικῆς κινήσεως τοῦ χωρίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὰ συμπτώματα εἰς τὰς χυμικὰς καὶ ἰνώδεις διεργασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT3","text":"Ἐλλείπει ἀκριβὴς θεραπευτικὴ μέθοδος, ἐπειδὴ τὸ χωρίον δηλοῖ μόνον ὅτι ὁ πυρετὸς λύει τινὰς τοιαύτας καταστάσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ θεωρία εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ σχέσις μεταξὺ φλέγματος, χολῆς, καὶ ἰνῶν παραμένει μερικῶς ἀδιευκρίνιστος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT5","text":"Ἡ κύρια τάσις ἀναφαίνεται ἐν τῇ ἐντάσει μεταξὺ ῥοῆς καὶ πήξεως, ἀποβολῆς καὶ κατακλείσεως, θερμότητος καὶ ψύξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231656111013Z_444e6306","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 85","source_sha256":"ef97727ae01e13ed8d9fa88b572e9eba752aa648186899f8bad48edb956097fe","sha256":"8740a1b3272c8c07ce90b3db7ca8df590ff7f2773a8040c2f9d43129449fb4cb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:16:56.112497+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS1","text":"The problem is the generation of many diseases from the flows and mixtures within the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS2","text":"Disease is referred away from names and phenomena to the movements, dispositions, and mixtures of the humors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS3","text":"Phlegm and bile are differentiated according to quality, place, heat, flow, and relation to blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS4","text":"The order of the fibers of the blood constitutes the mechanism of symmetry and circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AS5","text":"The disturbance of this order transforms flows into coagulations, burnings, tremors, and diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A1","text":"White phlegm, because of the air in its bubbles, is separated with difficulty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","text":"Phlegm, when aired outside the body, becomes milder; but when enclosed within, it produces various diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","text":"Sharp and salty phlegm constitutes a source of catarrhal diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A4","text":"Everything called inflammation of the body has arisen from bile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A5","text":"Bile, when aired outside, sends forth all manner of swellings; but when confined within, it produces fiery diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A6","text":"Through its fibers, blood must have a moderate thickness and thinness, so that it neither flows out nor coagulates with difficulty of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A7","text":"The fibers preserve the blood in its proper order and are able at once to disperse or to coagulate it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","text":"Bile, being old blood melted from the flesh, and being hot and moist, is coagulated by the power of the fibers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:A9","text":"The coagulation of bile and its violent extinction produce coldness and trembling within.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX1","text":"Diseases are not attributed to an incorporeal or external cause, but to bodily movements and mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX2","text":"The “sacred” disease does not signify that its generation escapes natural causation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX3","text":"Phlegm does not possess one unchanging pathological power, but changes according to place and circumstance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX4","text":"The retention of humors within is not identical with their aeration outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX5","text":"Bile is not simply a fluid moisture, but can, through coagulation, alter the whole function of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6","text":"The many names of diseases do not indicate many principles, but the different paths of the same flow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D1","text":"The persistence of phlegm within transforms mild matter into a multiple cause of disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A1","CH_JP8E_S_62:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D2","text":"The difference between catarrh and inflammation arises from the difference in the quality and path of the humor.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","CH_JP8E_S_62:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D3","text":"The exit of bile discharges internal heat, whereas its enclosure within increases its burning power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D4","text":"The smooth circulation of blood depends on the exact proportion of thinness and thickness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D5","text":"The disturbance of the order of the fibers can cause either dispersion of the blood or its instantaneous coagulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D6","text":"The entry of hot bile into the blood activates a mechanism of coagulation and internal cooling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:D7","text":"The cause of trembling lies not only in heat, but in the abrupt inhibition of heat through coagulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A8","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1","text":"Pathology is constituted as a dynamic alteration of matter, in which the same humor at one time discharges and at another produces disease, according to position and movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","CH_JP8E_S_62:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2","text":"The order of the body is not immobility, but regulated flow, maintained through a subtle measure between moisture and density.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A6","CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3","text":"Disease becomes visible as a failure of transformation: aeration becomes enclosure, flow becomes coagulation, and heat becomes trembling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A2","CH_JP8E_S_62:A5","CH_JP8E_S_62:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4","text":"Natural causation overturns the superficial multiplicity of diseases, reducing them to a few mechanisms of flow, mixture, burning, and coagulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A3","CH_JP8E_S_62:A4","CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX1","text":"The body is not conceived as an aggregate of stable substances, but as a system of interacting and changing fluids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2","text":"The cause depends not primarily on the name of the disease, but on the path and condition of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX3","text":"Natural equilibrium is not secured once and for all, but requires continual regulation of density, heat, and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX4","text":"The same mechanism can be salutary or disease-producing, according to the time and place of its operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which bodily affection has only one, unchanging, and independent meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX2","text":"The radical distinction between natural cause and sacred meaning is absent; sacredness is reconstituted within nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX3","text":"An explanation of disease by the final symptom alone, without recourse to the unseen movement of the humors, becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1","text":"Humoral matter → qualitative differentiation → flow or enclosure → mixture with blood → disturbance of fibers → coagulation or dispersion → disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2","text":"Exit of humor → aeration and discharge; enclosure within → heat, burning, and generation of disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS3","text":"Balance of thinness and thickness → smooth circulation; deviation from order → outflow or sluggish coagulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS4","text":"Hot bile + pure blood + fibers → coagulation → extinction of heat → coldness and trembling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AF1","text":"Difficult treatment → differences of phlegm and bile → natural reduction of diseases → regulation of flow and density → disturbance of fibers → coagulation, cooling, and trembling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:AF2","text":"Variety of diseases → common humoral generation → internal alteration of blood → pathological reversal of natural order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME1","text":"The various diseases are reclassified as local and qualitative forms of a few humoral mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME2","text":"Sacredness is shifted from the supernatural cause to the exceptional natural process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME3","text":"Aeration, flow, coagulation, and heat become a unified diagnostic field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4","text":"The difficulty of treatment is explained by the internal ambiguity of the mechanisms, which can both dissolve and produce disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT1","text":"Surface level: fever, white alphoi, catarrhs, inflammations, burning, coldness, and trembling appear as symptoms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT2","text":"Structural level: symptoms are produced from the position, flow, mixture, and coagulation of the humors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: explanation passes from the name of the disease to the mechanism of its generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: bodily order is conceived as continual regulation between flow, heat, density, and coagulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic causal movement of the passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from symptoms to humoral and fibrous processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT3","text":"A precise therapeutic method is lacking, because the passage indicates only that fever dissolves certain such conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT4","text":"The internal theory is coherent, but the relation between phlegm, bile, and fibers remains partly unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT5","text":"The principal tension appears in the opposition between flow and coagulation, expulsion and enclosure, heat and cooling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_62:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_62@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_62:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 85"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 69","title":"Section 85","context":"Chapter 69","original_title":"Section 85","original_context":"Chapter 69"},"original_title":"Section 85","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63","layer":"CH","title":"Section 86","order":70,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_63"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_63@R001","sha256":"4fc3378125339dddcea50820570837c2adbf5008a1b39e375b49594656b1b051","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS1","text":"Ἡ νόσος τοῦ σώματος παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ὑπερβολῆς καὶ τῆς ἀντιστάσεως τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS2","text":"Ἡ τοῦ σώματος διάθεσις μεταδίδωσι τῇ ψυχῇ τὰς νόσους αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS3","text":"Ἡ νόσος τῆς ψυχῆς ὀνομάζεται ἄνοια καὶ διαιρεῖται εἰς μανίαν καὶ ἀμαθίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS4","text":"Αἱ ὑπερβάλλουσαι ἡδοναὶ καὶ λύπαι κωλύουσι τὴν ὀρθὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὸν λογισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS5","text":"Αἱ ἠθικαὶ κακίαι πολλάκις ἀνάγονται εἰς σωματικὴν ἕξιν καὶ ἀπαίδευτον τροφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS6","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κατηγορία τοῦ ἑκουσίου ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ φυσιολογικῆς καὶ παιδευτικῆς αἰτιολογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A1","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ θερμότητος, ψύξεως, ὑγρότητος ἢ βάρους διαταράσσει τὴν σωματικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A2","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα διαφέρουσι κατὰ τὴν ταχύτητα καὶ τὴν βραδύτητα τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς καθάρσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνωμαλία δύναται νὰ λύσῃ τὴν συνοχὴν τῶν ἰνῶν καὶ νὰ ἐκτοπίσῃ τὴν ζωτικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ πάσχει διὰ τῆς ἕξεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","text":"Νόσος τῆς ψυχῆς ἐστὶν ἡ ἄνοια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A6","text":"Δύο γένη ἀνοίας εἰσίν, ἡ μανία καὶ ἡ ἀμαθία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A7","text":"Αἱ ὑπερβολαὶ ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης εἰσὶ μεγίσται ψυχικῶν νόσων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A8","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ πάθους ἀδυνατεῖ τὴν ὀρθὴν κρίσιν, αἴσθησιν καὶ λογιστικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἕξις καὶ ἡ ἀπαίδευτος τροφὴ συντελοῦσιν εἰς τὴν γένεσιν τῆς κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A10","text":"Ὁ κακὸς οὐ γίνεται κακὸς ἐκ καθαροῦ ἑκουσίου, ἀλλὰ διὰ βλαβερὰν σωματικὴν ἕξιν καὶ ἀπαιδευσίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ νόσος οὐκ ἀποδίδεται μόνον εἰς ἠθικὴν προαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀκολασία οὐκ ἔχει ὡς ἀναγκαίαν ἀρχὴν τὴν ἑκούσιον κακίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX3","text":"Ὁ πάσχων ὑπὸ μανίας ἢ ἀμαθίας οὐκ ἔχει πλήρη λογιστικὴν κυριότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX4","text":"Αἱ ἡδοναὶ καὶ αἱ λύπαι οὐκ εἰσὶν ἁπλῶς ἠθικαὶ ἀμοιβαί, ἀλλὰ δύνανται νὰ εἶναι νοσηματικαὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἐξηγεῖται ἀνεξαρτήτως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX6","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ψόγος οὐκ ἀρκεί εἰς τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῆς κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ σωματικὴ ἕξις νοσεῖ, ἡ ψυχὴ δύναται νὰ ἀπολέσῃ τὴν ὀρθὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνωμαλία μετασχηματίζει τὸ φυσικὸν πάθος εἰς ψυχικὴν ἄνοιαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A3","CH_JP8E_S_63:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D3","text":"Ἡ μανία καὶ ἡ ἀμαθία εἰσὶ τρόποι νοσηρᾶς ἀποτυχίας τοῦ λογισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","CH_JP8E_S_63:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D4","text":"Ὁ ὑπὸ ὑπερβολῆς χαρᾶς ἢ λύπης κατεχόμενος ἀδυνατεῖ νὰ ἴδῃ καὶ νὰ ἀκούσῃ ὀρθῶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A7","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D5","text":"Ἡ ἀφροδίσια ἀκολασία ἀνάγεται εἰς ὑγρὰν καὶ ῥυώδη σωματικὴν διάθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D6","text":"Ἡ κακία ἀπαιτεῖ θεραπευτικὴν καὶ παιδευτικὴν ἐξήγησιν μᾶλλον ἢ ψόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","CH_JP8E_S_63:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ συμπεριφορὰ ἐντάσσεται εἰς συνεχὲς σωματικῆς αἰτιότητος, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ψυχικὴ κρίσις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν τοῦ σώματος τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη εὐθύνη ἀποδυναμοῦται ὅταν ἡ πράξις ἐρμηνεύηται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα νόσου καὶ ἀπαιδευσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","CH_JP8E_S_63:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD3","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία τῆς ψυχῆς προϋποθέτει μεταβολὴν οὐ μόνον φρονήματος, ἀλλὰ καὶ σώματος καὶ τροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἄνοια καθίσταται γέφυρα μεταξὺ φυσιολογικῆς διαταραχῆς καὶ ἠθικῆς παρεκτροπῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","CH_JP8E_S_63:A6","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX1","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ψυχὴ αὐτάρκης, ἡ ὁποία δύναται ἀνεξαρτήτως τοῦ σώματος νὰ κυβερνᾷ τὰ πάθη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX2","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ γνώσις μόνη ἀρκεί πρὸς τὴν ἀποτροπὴν τῆς κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX3","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται ὅτι ἡ ἠθικὴ ἀποτυχία ἔχει μίαν ἑνιαίαν καὶ καθαρῶς βουλητικὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX4","text":"Οὐκ ὑποτίθεται διακεκριμένον ὅριον μεταξὺ σωματικῆς νόσου καὶ ψυχικῆς δυσλειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἠθικὴ κρίσις ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ τὴν φυσικὴν αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἑκουσιότης ὡς τελικὴ ἐξήγησις τοῦ κακοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναλαμβάνει ἀδιαμεσολάβητον κυριότητα τῶν ἡδονῶν, λυπῶν καὶ ἐπιθυμιῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀναγκαίας ἠθικῆς ἐνοχῆς ἀφήνει ἀδιευκρίνιστον τὸ μέτρον τῆς προσωπικῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS1","text":"Ἐκ στοιχειακῆς ὑπερβολῆς γεννᾶται σωματικὴ διαταραχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ διαταραχὴ μεταδίδεται διὰ τῆς ἕξεως εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS3","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ διαταραχὴ ταξινομεῖται ὡς μανία ἢ ἀμαθία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS4","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ ἡδονῆς ἢ λύπης καταλύει αἴσθησιν καὶ λογισμόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS5","text":"Ἡ καταλυθεῖσα κρίσις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀκολασία, ἀκράτεια ἢ κακία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS6","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη ἑκούσιος κακία ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς νόσος συνδεδεμένη μετὰ σώματος καὶ ἀπαιδευσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1","text":"Στοιχειακὴ ὑπερβολή → σωματικὴ νόσος → μετάδοσις εἰς ψυχήν → ἄνοια → ὑπερβολὴ ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης → ἀπώλεια λογισμοῦ → ἀναθεώρησις τῆς ἠθικῆς ἐνοχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AF2","text":"Σωματικὴ ἕξις → πάθος → νοσηρὰ ψυχικὴ διάθεσις → πράξις φαινομένη ἑκούσιος → φυσιολογικὴ καὶ παιδευτικὴ ἀναγωγή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME1","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νόσου σώματος καὶ νόσου ψυχῆς μετατρέπεται εἰς ἑνιαίαν αἰτιώδη κλίμακα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2","text":"Ἡ κακία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ πεδίον τῆς μομφῆς εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῆς διαγνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ἀκράτεια ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς πιθανὸν σύμπτωμα σωματικῆς ἕξεως καὶ ἀπαιδευσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","text":"Ἡ θεραπευτικὴ στρατηγικὴ ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὸν λογισμόν εἰς τὸ σῶμα, τὴν τροφὴν καὶ τὴν παιδείαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, πυρετοὶ καὶ ἀσθένειαι ταξινομοῦνται κατὰ τὴν ὑπεροχὴν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ σωματικὴ ἕξις λειτουργεῖ ὡς μεσολαβητὴς μεταξὺ φύσεως καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἠθικὴ μομφὴ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ διαγνώσεως, παιδείας καὶ θεραπείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ψυχὴ νοεῖται ὡς δύναμις ἐνσώματος καὶ διαπερατὴ ὑπὸ φυσικῶν παθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ βραδύτης ἢ ἡ ταχύτης τῆς στοιχειακῆς κινήσεως καθορίζει τὴν περιοδικότητα καὶ τὴν ἐπιμονὴν τῆς νόσου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκῶσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν φυσιολογίαν εἰς τὴν ἠθικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν σωματικὴν διαταραχὴν εἰς τὴν ψυχικὴν ἄνοιαν καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἀναθεώρησιν τοῦ ἑκουσίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται τὸ ἀκριβὲς κανονιστικὸν καθεστὼς τῆς εὐθύνης μετὰ τὴν ἀπόρριψιν τῆς ἁπλῆς μομφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος ἐρείδεται στὴν ἀδιάρρηκτον σύνδεσιν σώματος, ψυχῆς, πάθους καὶ λογισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT5","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα τοῦ μηχανήματος λειτουργία ἐστὶν ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς ἠθικῆς παρεκτροπῆς εἰς νοσηρὰν αἰτιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT6","text":"Ἡ κύρια ἐκκρεμότης ἐστὶν ἡ συνύπαρξις τῆς φυσιολογικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος μετὰ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἀποδόσεως παιδευτικῆς ἢ θεραπευτικῆς κατευθύνσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231714866206Z_d8a8ebef","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 86","source_sha256":"4fc3378125339dddcea50820570837c2adbf5008a1b39e375b49594656b1b051","sha256":"69c07932877332d1e73606cd7d48314505b0ed7038a55fc7814e692745377ec0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:17:14.867109+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS1","text":"Disease of the body arises from the excess and opposition of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS2","text":"The condition of the body transmits its diseases to the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS3","text":"Disease of the soul is called unreason (ἄνοια) and is divided into madness and ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS4","text":"Excessive pleasures and pains impede correct perception and reasoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS5","text":"Moral vices are often reduced to bodily condition and uneducated nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AS6","text":"The moral category of the voluntary is replaced by physiological and educational causation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A1","text":"An excess of heat, cold, moisture, or weight disturbs bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A2","text":"The elements differ according to the swiftness and slowness of motion and of purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A3","text":"Bodily irregularity can dissolve the cohesion of the fibres and displace the vital power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","text":"The soul is affected through the condition of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","text":"Disease of the soul is unreason (ἄνοια).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A6","text":"There are two kinds of unreason (ἄνοια): madness and ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A7","text":"Excesses of pleasure and pain are the greatest of diseases of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A8","text":"Excess of passion disables correct judgment, perception, and the reasoning faculty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","text":"Bodily condition and uneducated nourishment contribute to the generation of vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:A10","text":"The vicious person does not become vicious through pure voluntariness, but through harmful bodily condition and lack of education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX1","text":"Disease of the soul is not attributed solely to moral choice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX2","text":"Incontinence does not have voluntary vice as its necessary origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX3","text":"One afflicted by madness or ignorance does not possess full rational mastery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX4","text":"Pleasures and pains are not merely moral reciprocities, but can be pathological movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5","text":"The soul is not explained independently of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:NX6","text":"Moral blame is not sufficient for explaining vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D1","text":"Since bodily condition is diseased, the soul can lose correct judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D2","text":"Bodily irregularity transforms natural affection into psychic unreason (ἄνοια).","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A3","CH_JP8E_S_63:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D3","text":"Madness and ignorance are modes of diseased failure of reasoning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","CH_JP8E_S_63:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D4","text":"One possessed by an excess of joy or pain is unable to see and hear correctly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A7","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D5","text":"Sexual incontinence is reduced to a moist and flowing bodily condition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:D6","text":"Vice requires a therapeutic and educational explanation rather than blame.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","CH_JP8E_S_63:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD1","text":"Moral conduct is situated within a continuum of bodily causality, in which psychic judgment depends on the order of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A8","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD2","text":"Human responsibility is weakened when action is interpreted as the result of disease and lack of education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A9","CH_JP8E_S_63:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD3","text":"Treatment of the soul presupposes a change not only of understanding, but also of body and nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A4","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SD4","text":"Unreason (ἄνοια) becomes a bridge between physiological disturbance and moral deviation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A5","CH_JP8E_S_63:A6","CH_JP8E_S_63:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX1","text":"A self-sufficient soul, able independently of the body to govern the passions, is not assumed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX2","text":"It is not assumed that knowledge alone suffices for the prevention of vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX3","text":"It is not assumed that moral failure has a single and purely volitional cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX4","text":"No distinct boundary between bodily disease and psychic dysfunction is assumed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1","text":"A world in which moral judgment is severed from natural causality is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX2","text":"Absolute voluntariness as the final explanation of evil is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX3","text":"The idea that the soul assumes unmediated mastery of pleasures, pains, and desires is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX4","text":"The absence of necessary moral guilt leaves the measure of personal responsibility undetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS1","text":"From elemental excess bodily disturbance arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS2","text":"Bodily disturbance is transmitted through condition to the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS3","text":"Psychic disturbance is classified as madness or ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS4","text":"Excess of pleasure or pain destroys perception and reasoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS5","text":"The destroyed judgment appears as licentiousness, incontinence, or vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS6","text":"Apparent voluntary vice is reclassified as disease connected with body and lack of education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1","text":"Elemental excess → bodily disease → transmission to the soul → unreason (ἄνοια) → excess of pleasure and pain → loss of reasoning → revision of moral guilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:AF2","text":"Bodily condition → passion → diseased psychic condition → apparently voluntary action → physiological and educational reduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME1","text":"The distinction between disease of the body and disease of the soul is transformed into a unified causal scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2","text":"Vice is shifted from the field of blame to the field of diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME3","text":"Moral incontinence is recognized as a possible symptom of bodily condition and lack of education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","text":"The therapeutic strategy extends from reasoning to the body, nourishment, and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, fevers and ailments are classified according to the predominance of the elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, bodily condition functions as a mediator between nature and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, moral blame is replaced by diagnosis, education, and treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, the soul is conceived as an embodied power and as permeable by natural affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, the slowness or swiftness of elemental motion determines the periodicity and persistence of disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from physiology to ethics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from bodily disturbance to psychic unreason (ἄνοια), and thence to the revision of the voluntary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT3","text":"The precise normative status of responsibility is underdetermined after the rejection of simple blame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence of the system rests upon the unbreakable connection of body, soul, passion, and reasoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT5","text":"The strongest function of the mechanism is the reduction of moral deviation to diseased causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_63:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT6","text":"The principal unresolved issue is the coexistence of physiological necessity with the need to assign an educational or therapeutic direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_63@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_63:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 86"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 70","title":"Section 86","context":"Chapter 70","original_title":"Section 86","original_context":"Chapter 70"},"original_title":"Section 86","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64","layer":"CH","title":"Section 87","order":71,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_64"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_64@R001","sha256":"96dc903172eac18634e5035a30c243731073c943918c456b9510d32f99a941d7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀνωμαλία, ὅταν ἀναπνοὴν μὴ λαμβάνῃ καὶ ἀτμοὺς τῇ κινήσει τῆς ψυχῆς συγκεράννυται, ψυχικὰς νόσους γεννᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS2","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ διαφθορὰ διὰ κακῶν πολιτειῶν, λόγων καὶ ἀπαιδεύτων μαθημάτων ἐνισχύεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS3","text":"Ἡ κακία τῶν ἀνθρώπων ἐξηγεῖται ὡς ἀκουσιωτέρα γένεσις, ἧς αἰτιώτεροι οἱ φυτεύοντες καὶ τρέφοντες τῶν φυτευομένων καὶ τρεφομένων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS4","text":"Ὁ λόγος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῶν κακῶν εἰς τὴν ἀντίστροφον ἀπόδοσιν τῶν αἰτίων τῆς σωτηρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5","text":"Τὸ ἀγαθὸν καὶ καλὸν ὑποτίθεται σύμμετρον, ἡ δὲ μείζων συμμετρία ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS6","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ ἑνὸς μέρους ἔναντι τοῦ ἑτέρου καθιστᾷ τὸ ζῷον ἀσύμμετρον, αἰσχρὸν καὶ βλαβερὸν, ἐνώ ἡ ἀντίστροφος ἁρμονία καθίσταται κάλλιστη καὶ ἐρασμιωτάτη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A1","text":"Οἱ ὀξεῖς, ἁλυκοί, πικροὶ καὶ χολώδεις χυμοὶ, ἐὰν ἐντὸς τοῦ σώματος εἱλῶνται καὶ μὴ ἀναπνέωνται, νοσήματα γεννῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A2","text":"Ἡ τῶν χυμῶν ἀτμὶς τῇ φορᾷ τῆς ψυχῆς συγκερασθεῖσα ποικίλας ψυχικὰς δυσχέρειας παράγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A3","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ τριμερὴς οὖσα δέχεται τὰς σωματικὰς ἐπιρροὰς κατὰ τὸ μέρος εἰς ὃ προσπίπτουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","text":"Ἡ κακὴ πολιτεία καὶ οἱ κακοὶ λόγοι τὴν ψυχικὴν διαφθορὰν κοινωνικῶς καὶ πολιτικῶς ἐπαυξάνουσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","text":"Ἡ ἀμάθητος ἀγωγὴ στερεῖ τὰς ἰατικὰς τῆς ψυχῆς παιδείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","text":"Οἱ ἄνθρωποι γίγνονται κακοὶ διὰ δύο ἀκουσιωτάτους αἰτίους, τῆς σωματικῆς κράσεως καὶ τῆς ἀγωγῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A7","text":"Οἱ φυτεύοντες καὶ τρέφοντες αἰτιώτεροι τῶν φυτευομένων καὶ τρεφομένων εἰσὶν ὅταν ἡ κακία διὰ γένεσιν καὶ τροφὴν ἐπιτελῆται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A8","text":"Ἡ κακία δύναται διὰ τροφῆς, ἐπιτηδευμάτων καὶ μαθημάτων φεύγεσθαι, ἡ δὲ ἀρετὴ ἀντιθέτως αἱρεῖσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A9","text":"Πᾶν τὸ ἀγαθὸν καλόν ἐστιν, τὸ δὲ καλὸν οὐκ ἄμετρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","text":"Ἡ τοῦ ζῴου καλλονὴ προϋποθέτει συμμετρίαν τῶν συστατικῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A11","text":"Οὐδεμία συμμετρία μείζων ἐστὶν ἢ ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὸ σῶμα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A12","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυρὰ ψυχὴ ἐν ἀσθενεστέρῳ σώματι, ἢ τὸ ἰσχυρὸν σῶμα ἐν ἀσθενεστέρᾳ ψυχῇ, ἀσύμμετρον τὸ ὅλον ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A13","text":"Ἡ συμμετρικὴ σύμπηξις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος τὸ ζῷον κάλλιστον καὶ ἐρασμιώτατον ποιεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ νόσος οὐκ ἀποδίδοται μόνον εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἠθικὴν προαίρεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX2","text":"Ἡ κακία οὐκ ἀποδίδοται ἀκέραια τοῖς κακοῖς ὡς ἑκουσία ἀρχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX3","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία οὐκ ὁρίζεται ὡς λόγος ἄνευ τροφῆς, ἔθους καὶ μαθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX4","text":"Τὸ καλὸν οὐκ ἔστιν ἄμετρον ἢ ἀπλῶς ὑπερέχον μέγεθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX5","text":"Τὸ ζῷον οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἀπὸ ἀνεξάρτητα μέρη ἃ δύνανται ἀσύμμετρα συνυπάρχειν ἄνευ βλάβης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX6","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ὑπεροχὴ οὐκ ἐγγυᾶται τὴν τοῦ ὅλου καλλονήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D1","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ κατακράτησις τῶν χυμῶν μετασχηματίζει σωματικὴν ἀνωμαλίαν εἰς ποικίλην ψυχικὴ συμπτωματολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A1","CH_JP8E_S_64:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D2","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τῆς ψυχικῆς δυσχέρειας ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ μέρος τῆς ψυχῆς ὃ δέχεται τὴν σωματικὴν ἐπίδρασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A2","CH_JP8E_S_64:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D3","text":"Ἡ κακία ἐνισχύεται ὅταν ἡ σωματικὴ προδιάθεσις συμπέσῃ μετὰ κοινωνικοῦ καὶ παιδευτικοῦ περιβάλλοντος ἀθεραπεύτου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","CH_JP8E_S_64:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D4","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ εὐθύνη μετατοπίζεται πρὸς τοὺς μηχανισμοὺς γενέσεως καὶ τροφῆς, οὐχὶ μόνον πρὸς τὸ τελικὸν πρόσωπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","CH_JP8E_S_64:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D5","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία τῆς κακίας ἀπαιτεῖ παράλληλον μεταβολὴν σώματος, ἔθους καὶ μαθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","CH_JP8E_S_64:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D6","text":"Ἡ σωματοψυχικὴ ἀναλογία γίνεται κριτήριον ὑγείας, ἀρετῆς καὶ καλλονῆς ἅμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A9","CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D7","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ ἑνὸς συστατικοῦ, ἔστω καὶ ἀγαθοῦ καθʼ ἑαυτό, μεταβάλλεται εἰς κακὸν ὅταν καταλύῃ τὴν συνολικὴν συμμετρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη κακία συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἀλληλεπίδρασις φύσεως, σωματικῆς κινήσεως, πολιτείας καὶ παιδείας, οὐχὶ ὡς μονομερὴς ἠθικὴ ἐκλογή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἰατρικὴ, ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἀποτελοῦσιν ἑνιαῖον θεραπευτικὸν πεδίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία λειτουργεῖ ὡς καθολικὸς κανὼν ὃς συνδέει ὑγείαν, ἀρετήν, κάλλος καὶ κοινωνικὴν εὐθύνην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ δὲν κρίνεται κατὰ τὸ ἑνὸς μέρους μέγεθος, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν αὐτοῦ νὰ συνυπάρξῃ μετὰ τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς καλλονῆς μετατρέπει τὴν ἀνατομίαν καὶ τὴν ψυχολογίαν εἰς προβλήματα ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀλληλοκρατήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἀδρανὴς φορεὺς ἔξωθεν ἐπιβαλλομένων ψυχικῶν νοσημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔχει πλήρη αὐτονομίαν ἀπὸ τὰς σωματικὰς κράσεις καὶ κινήσεις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX3","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ διαφθορὰ οὐκ εἶναι ἀπλῶς ἐξωτερικὸν πλαίσιον, ἀλλὰ συντελεῖ εἰς τὴν ἐγκατάστασιν τῆς κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ αὐτογένεσις τοῦ ἀτόμου ἀποκλείεται ὡς ἐπαρκὴς ἐξήγησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ καλοῦ εἰς τὸ μέγεθος, τὴν δύναμιν ἢ τὴν ὑπεροχὴν ἀπορρίπτεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ψυχὴ, τὸ σῶμα, ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ πολιτεία ἔχουσιν ἀνεξάρτητα καὶ ἀσύμπτωτα αἴτια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἀπολύτου ἐσωτερικῆς ἐνοχῆς, ἣν οὔτε φύσις οὔτε τροφὴ οὔτε πολιτεία συνδιαμορφοῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX3","text":"Ἀδύνατον καθίσταται τὸ ἰσχυρὸν μέρος νὰ ἀξιολογηθῇ χωρὶς τὴν σχέσιν αὐτοῦ πρὸς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀναζητουμένη τάξις δὲν ἐρείδεται εἰς ἀπόλυτον ὑπεροχήν, ἀλλὰ εἰς ἀπουσίαν ἀσύμμετρου ὑπερβάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS1","text":"Σωματικοὶ χυμοί → ἐσωτερικὴ κατακράτησις → σύμμειξις ἀτμοῦ καὶ ψυχικῆς φορᾶς → ψυχικὴ νόσος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS2","text":"Σωματικὴ προδιάθεσις + κακὴ πολιτεία + κακοὶ λόγοι + ἀθεράπευτος παιδεία → ἀκουσία γένεσις κακίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS3","text":"Διάγνωσις αἰτίων → μετατόπισις εὐθύνης πρὸς τοὺς γεννῶντας καὶ τρέφοντας → θεραπεία διὰ τροφῆς, ἐπιτηδευμάτων καὶ μαθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS4","text":"Ἐξήγησις κακῶν → ἀντιστροφὴ τοῦ λόγου → ἀναζήτησις τῶν αἰτίων τῆς σωτηρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS5","text":"Ἀγαθόν → καλόν → συμμετρία → ἀναλογία ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος → ὑγεία, ἀρετή, καλλονή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS6","text":"Ἀσύμμετρος ὑπεροχή → σωματικὴ ἢ ψυχικὴ δυσλειτουργία → αἰσχύνη, κόπος, πτῶσις καὶ βλάβη τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AF1","text":"Σωματικὴ κατακράτησις → ψυχικὴ νόσος → κοινωνικοπαιδευτικὴ ἐνίσχυσις → ἀκουσία κακία → μετατόπισις αἰτίας → θεραπευτικὴ παιδεία → συμμετρία ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος → κάλλος ἢ αἰσχύνη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AF2","text":"Νόσος → αἰτιολογία → εὐθύνη τῶν γεννώντων καὶ τρεφόντων → ἀποφυγὴ κακίας → ἀντίστροφος λόγος περὶ σωτηρίας → κανὼν συμμετρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME1","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ νόσος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἠθικὴ ἀποτυχία εἰς σωματοψυχικὸν συμβάν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2","text":"Ἡ κακία μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἄτομον εἰς τὸ πλέγμα γένεσις–τροφή–πολιτεία–παιδεία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME3","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ μονόλογον νουθεσίας εἰς σύνθετον ρύθμισιν σώματος, ἔθους καὶ μαθήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME4","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ὑποχωρεῖ μπροστὰ εἰς ἀναλυτικὴν τῆς μεταξύ των συμμετρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME5","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ καλλονήν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀξία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναλογίαν πρὸς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT1","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ καὶ ψυχικὴ συμπτωματολογία ἀποτελεῖ τὸ ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον τοῦ λόγου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT2","text":"Ὁ μηχανισμὸς τοῦ λόγου εἶναι ἡ ἀλληλεπίδρασις χυμῶν, ψυχικῶν μερῶν, πολιτείας καὶ παιδείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT3","text":"Τὸ μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον μεταφέρει τὴν πράξιν ἀπὸ τὴν καταδίκην τοῦ ἀτόμου εἰς τὴν ἀναμόρφωσιν τῶν συνθηκῶν γενέσεως καὶ τροφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4","text":"Τὸ ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ὑπόβαθρον νοεῖ τὸ ζῷον ὡς γιγνόμενον ἐκ προγενεστέρων κράσεων, ἀγωγῶν καὶ σχέσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἔτοιμον αὐτοτελὲς ὑποκείμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκέουσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ βασικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ: σωματικὴ αἰτία, ψυχικὴ ἐπίδρασις, κοινωνικοπαιδευτικὴ ἐνίσχυσις, θεραπεία καὶ συμμετρία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT2","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ τοῦ λόγου διατηρεῖται ἐκ τῆς ἐξηγήσεως τῶν κακῶν εἰς τὴν ἀντίστροφον ἐξήγησιν τῶν ἀγαθῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν ἐνιαίαν ἀρχὴ τῆς συμμετρίας, ἥτις συνδέει ἰατρικὴν, ἠθικὴν καὶ αἰσθητικὴν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις μεταξὺ τῶν τριῶν τόπων τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ τῶν συγκεκριμένων νοσημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT5","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει καὶ ἡ πρακτικὴ μορφὴ τῆς θεραπευτικῆς παιδείας, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ὁρίζει τὰ μέσα γενικῶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις αἰτιότητος τοῖς φυτεύουσι καὶ τρέφουσι δημιουργεῖ τάσιν μετατοπίσεως τῆς ἐνοχῆς, ἣν ὁ λόγος δὲν ἀναλύει πλήρως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ συμπλήρωσιν ἐκεῖ ὅπου ἡ ῥητορικὴ ἀντιστροφὴ ὑπερέχει τῆς λεπτομεροῦς ἀποδείξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231736352541Z_4f0d8678","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 87","source_sha256":"96dc903172eac18634e5035a30c243731073c943918c456b9510d32f99a941d7","sha256":"1a2f5de73c7f0f3fa03aceb4216a20d7b5eea1eb9479cddcdcaf7307f0dff157","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:17:36.353614+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS1","text":"Bodily irregularity, when it does not receive respiration and vapours are mingled with the motion of the soul, generates diseases of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS2","text":"Corruption of the soul is strengthened through bad constitutions, discourses, and uneducated studies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS3","text":"Human vice is explained as a more involuntary becoming, for which those who beget and nourish are more responsible than those begotten and nourished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS4","text":"The argument passes from the explanation of evils to the reverse attribution of the causes of salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5","text":"The good and the beautiful are posited as commensurate, and the greater commensurateness is that of soul to body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AS6","text":"The predominance of one part over the other renders the living being disproportionate, ugly, and harmful, whereas the converse harmony renders it most beautiful and most lovable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A1","text":"Pungent, saline, bitter, and bilious humours, if they are confined within the body and do not respire, generate diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A2","text":"The vapour of the humours, when mingled with the course of the soul, produces various psychic difficulties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A3","text":"The soul, being tripartite, receives bodily influences according to the part upon which they fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","text":"Bad constitution and bad discourses increase the corruption of the soul socially and politically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","text":"Unlearned upbringing deprives one of the soul's medicinal educations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","text":"Human beings become bad through two most involuntary causes: bodily constitution and upbringing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A7","text":"Those who beget and nourish are more responsible than those begotten and nourished when vice is brought about through generation and nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A8","text":"Vice can be avoided through nourishment, pursuits, and studies, while virtue, conversely, can be chosen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A9","text":"Everything good is beautiful, and the beautiful is not without measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","text":"The beauty of the living being presupposes commensurateness among its constituent parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A11","text":"No commensurateness is greater than that of soul to body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A12","text":"A strong soul in a weaker body, or a strong body in a weaker soul, makes the whole disproportionate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:A13","text":"The commensurate joining of soul and body makes the living being most beautiful and most lovable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX1","text":"Disease of the soul is not attributed solely to an internal moral choice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX2","text":"Vice is not attributed wholly to the bad as a voluntary origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX3","text":"Therapy is not defined as discourse without nourishment, habit, and learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX4","text":"The beautiful is not without measure or simply a preponderant magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX5","text":"The living being is not composed of independent parts that can coexist disproportionately without harm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:NX6","text":"Bodily predominance does not guarantee the beauty of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D1","text":"The internal retention of humours transforms bodily irregularity into diverse psychic symptomatology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A1","CH_JP8E_S_64:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D2","text":"The form of psychic difficulty depends on the part of the soul that receives the bodily influence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A2","CH_JP8E_S_64:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D3","text":"Vice is intensified when bodily predisposition coincides with an untreated social and educational environment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","CH_JP8E_S_64:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D4","text":"Moral responsibility shifts toward the mechanisms of generation and nourishment, not solely toward the final person.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","CH_JP8E_S_64:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D5","text":"The therapy of vice requires a parallel alteration of body, habit, and learning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A5","CH_JP8E_S_64:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D6","text":"The body-soul proportion becomes a criterion of health, virtue, and beauty at once.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A9","CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:D7","text":"The predominance of one constituent, even if good in itself, becomes an evil when it destroys the overall commensurateness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1","text":"Human vice is constituted as an interaction of nature, bodily motion, constitution, and education, not as a one-sided moral choice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2","text":"Medicine, education, and political order constitute a unified therapeutic field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3","text":"Commensurateness functions as a universal rule connecting health, virtue, beauty, and social responsibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD4","text":"Excess is judged not by the magnitude of one part, but by its inability to coexist with the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SD5","text":"The principle of beauty transforms anatomy and psychology into problems of proportion and mutual constraint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX1","text":"The body does not act as a passive bearer of diseases of the soul imposed from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX2","text":"The soul does not possess complete autonomy from bodily constitutions and motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX3","text":"Social corruption is not merely an external framework, but contributes to the establishment of vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX4","text":"The moral self-generation of the individual is excluded as a sufficient explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:DNX5","text":"The reduction of the beautiful to magnitude, power, or predominance is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which soul, body, education, and constitution have independent and non-coincident causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX2","text":"The possibility of absolute internal guilt, which neither nature nor nourishment nor constitution jointly shapes, is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX3","text":"It becomes impossible for the strong part to be evaluated without its relation to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX4","text":"The order sought is not grounded in absolute predominance, but in the absence of disproportionate excess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS1","text":"Bodily humours → internal retention → mixture of vapour and psychic course → disease of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS2","text":"Bodily predisposition + bad constitution + bad discourses + untreated education → involuntary generation of vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS3","text":"Diagnosis of causes → shift of responsibility toward those who beget and nourish → therapy through nourishment, pursuits, and studies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS4","text":"Explanation of evils → reversal of the argument → search for the causes of salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS5","text":"Good → beautiful → commensurateness → proportion of soul and body → health, virtue, beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS6","text":"Disproportionate predominance → bodily or psychic dysfunction → shame, toil, ruin, and harm to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AF1","text":"Bodily retention → disease of the soul → social-educational intensification → involuntary vice → shift of cause → therapeutic education → commensurateness of soul and body → beauty or shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:AF2","text":"Disease → causal explanation → responsibility of those who beget and nourish → avoidance of vice → reverse argument concerning salvation → rule of commensurateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME1","text":"Disease of the soul is reclassified from moral failure into a body-soul event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2","text":"Vice is transferred from the individual to the nexus generation–nourishment–constitution–education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME3","text":"Therapy is transformed from a monologue of admonition into a composite regulation of body, habit, and learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME4","text":"The distinction between soul and body recedes before an analysis of their commensurateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ME5","text":"Predominance ceases to signify beauty, because value depends on proportion to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT1","text":"Bodily and psychic symptomatology constitutes the superficial level of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT2","text":"The mechanism of the argument is the interaction of humours, parts of the soul, constitution, and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT3","text":"The meta-strategic level transfers action from the condemnation of the individual to the reformation of the conditions of generation and nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4","text":"The ontological and temporal background conceives the living being as coming to be from prior constitutions, upbringings, and relations, not as a ready-made self-sufficient subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic mechanism: bodily cause, psychic effect, social-educational intensification, therapy, and commensurateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT2","text":"The sequence of the argument is preserved from the explanation of evils to the reverse explanation of goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT3","text":"Internal coherence rests on the unified principle of commensurateness, which connects medicine, ethics, and aesthetics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT4","text":"The precise relation between the three regions of the soul and the particular diseases remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT5","text":"The practical form of therapeutic education likewise remains underdetermined, because the argument specifies the means only generally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT6","text":"The attribution of causality to those who beget and nourish creates a tension toward shifting guilt, which the argument does not fully analyze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but requires supplementation where rhetorical reversal exceeds detailed demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_64:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_64@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_64:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 87"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 71","title":"Section 87","context":"Chapter 71","original_title":"Section 87","original_context":"Chapter 71"},"original_title":"Section 87","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65","layer":"CH","title":"Section 88","order":72,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_65"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_65@R001","sha256":"773dcfb35e655916baf0ba5511f67536a68ac9fd01070a456c99e2f97d414af5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS1","text":"Τὸ ζῷον συναμφότερον ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἐστίν, ὧν ἡ ἀσύμμετρος κίνησις νόσους καὶ ἀμαθίαν γεννᾷ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS2","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ κρείττων οὖσα δύναται τὸ σῶμα διαταράττειν, ὥσπερ καὶ τὸ μέγα σῶμα τὴν ψυχὴν ἀσθενῆ καὶ δυσμαθῆ ποιεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS3","text":"Ἡ σωτηρία ἐν τῇ ἀμοιβαίᾳ καὶ ἰσορρόπῳ κινήσει ψυχῆς τε καὶ σώματος ἔγκειται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS4","text":"Ἡ διανοητικὴ μελέτη γυμναστικῆς, ἡ δὲ σωματικὴ πλάσις μουσικῆς καὶ φιλοσοφίας ἀνταποδίδεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS5","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία τῶν μερῶν κατὰ τὸ εἶδος τοῦ παντὸς ὀφείλει γίγνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS6","text":"Ἡ μετρία καὶ συνεχὴς κίνησις τὰ διεσπαρμένα πάθη εἰς τάξιν συνάγει καὶ ὑγίειαν ἀπεργάζεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A1","text":"Τὸ ἀνθρώπινον ζῷον ἐκ ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος συναμφότερον συγκέκριται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","text":"Δύο φυσικαὶ ἐπιθυμίαι ἐν τῷ ἀνθρώπῳ εἰσίν, ἡ μὲν διὰ σώματος τροφῆς, ἡ δὲ διὰ τοῦ θειοτάτου φρονήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","text":"Ἡ κρείττων κίνησις δύναται τὸ ὑφ’ ἑαυτῆς κινούμενον μέρος αὔξειν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον ἀσθενὲς ποιεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A4","text":"Ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς μεγίστη νόσος ἀμαθία ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ καὶ τὸ σῶμα ἀλλήλων χωριζόμενα οὔτε ὑγιαίνειν οὔτε σώζεσθαι δύνανται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια ἰσορροπία καὶ τάξις τῶν κινήσεων ἐστίν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A7","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἐκ τῆς ἀτάκτου κρατήσεως ἐναντίων κινήσεων ἐγγίγνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A8","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἐπιμέλεια ἑνὸς μέρους ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀνταπόδοσιν κινήσεως τοῦ ἑτέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","text":"Ἡ φύσις τοῦ παντὸς πρότυπον θεραπείας καὶ κινήσεως τοῖς μέρεσι παρέχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A10","text":"Ἡ μετρία συνεχὴς κίνησις τὰ πάθη καὶ τὰ μέρη κατὰ συγγένειαν εἰς τάξιν κοσμεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX1","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ὑγιὲς τὴν ψυχὴν ἄνευ σώματος κινεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX2","text":"Οὐκ ἔστιν ὑγιὲς τὸ σῶμα ἄνευ ψυχῆς κινεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX3","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ἡ μονόπλευρος καλλιέργεια τῆς διανοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX4","text":"Οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ἡ μονόπλευρος πλάσις τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX5","text":"Οὐκ ἡ ἡσυχία τοῦ σώματος ἀλλ’ ἡ κατὰ φύσιν κίνησις αὐτὸ σώζει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX6","text":"Οὐχ ἡ παράθεσις ἐχθροῦ παρ’ ἐχθρὸν ὑγίειαν ποιεῖ, ἀλλ’ ἡ σύνταξις φίλου παρὰ φίλον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX7","text":"Οὐχ ἡ τυχαία κίνησις ἀλλ’ ἡ μετρία καὶ τεταγμένη κίνησις θεραπευτική ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D1","text":"Ὅταν ἡ ψυχὴ σφοδρῶς τὰς μαθήσεις καὶ ζητήσεις διώκῃ, τὸ σῶμα δύναται νόσοις πληροῦσθαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A1","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D2","text":"Ὅταν τὸ σῶμα μέγα καὶ ὑπέρψυχον γένηται, αἱ σωματικαὶ ἐπιθυμίαι τὴν φρόνησιν καταδουλοῦν δύνανται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀσύμμετρος ἐπιδίωξις τῆς τροφῆς ἢ τῆς νοήσεως ἀντίστοιχον μέρος ἀσθενὲς καὶ δυσμαθὲς ἀπεργάζεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D4","text":"Ὁ διανοίᾳ μαθηματικὴν μελέτην κατεργαζόμενος ὀφείλει γυμναστικῇ τὴν τοῦ σώματος κίνησιν ἀποδιδόναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D5","text":"Ὁ τὸ σῶμα ἐπιμελῶς πλάττων ὀφείλει μουσικῇ καὶ φιλοσοφίᾳ τὰς τῆς ψυχῆς κινήσεις ἀνταποδιδόναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D6","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀκινησία τὰ εἰσιόντα καὶ ἔξωθεν πάθη κρατεῖν ἐᾷ, ὥστε τὸ σῶμα φθείρεσθαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D7","text":"Ἡ συνεχὴς καὶ μετρία κίνησις τὰ πλανώμενα πάθη εἰς συγγενῆ μέρη διανέμει καὶ κοσμεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D8","text":"Ἡ κατὰ τὸ παράδειγμα τοῦ παντὸς θεραπεία ἐχθρὰς κινήσεις εἰς φιλίαν καὶ τάξιν μεταβάλλει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A7","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια οὐκ ἀπουσία κινήσεως ἀλλὰ ἀμοιβαία ρύθμισις καὶ ἰσορροπία κινήσεων ἐστίν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD2","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀπαιτεῖ συγχρόνως ἀντιστάθμισιν τῆς ψυχικῆς καὶ τῆς σωματικῆς ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ νόσος καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ ἀμαθία ἑνὸς ἀσυμμέτρου συστήματος δύο ἐκφάνσεις γίγνονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A4","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD4","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐν τῷ ἀνθρωπίνῳ σώματι διὰ μιμήσεως καὶ ῥυθμίσεως τῶν κινήσεων ἀναπαράγεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD5","text":"Ἡ ἀγωγὴ τοῦ καλοῦ καὶ ἀγαθοῦ ἀνθρώπου ἐστὶ σύνθεσις διανοητικῆς, μουσικῆς καὶ σωματικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐχ ὡς αὐτάρκης ἀρχὴ ἀλλ’ ὡς σώματι συνδεδεμένη δύναμις νοεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐχ ὡς ἀδρανὲς ὄργανον ἀλλ’ ὡς ἐνεργὸν συγκυβερνῶν τῇ ψυχῇ τίθεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX3","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐχ ὡς ἁπλῆ ἐξωτερικὴ προσβολὴ ἀλλ’ ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ ἀταξία κινήσεων ἐκλαμβάνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX4","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις οὐκ ἀντιτίθεται τῇ σωματικῇ κινήσει, ἀλλὰ ταύτης ἀμοιβαίαν ἀνταπόδοσιν ἀπαιτεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX5","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία οὐκ ἐπὶ ἀπομονωμένων μερῶν ἀλλ’ ἐπὶ τοῦ ὅλου καὶ τῶν συγγενειῶν αὐτοῦ θεμελιοῦται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX6","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τοῦ κρείττονος μέρους οὐκ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην τῆς ἀμοιβαίας ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ σωτηρία ἐκ τῆς ἀκινησίας ἢ τῆς ἀποσπάσεως ἑνὸς μέρους ἐγίγνετο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑγεία ὡς ἁπλὴ ἐπικράτησις τοῦ πνευματικοῦ ἐπὶ τοῦ σωματικοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀντίθεσις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ὡς τελικὴ ὀντολογικὴ δομή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἣ περὶ πάντα τὸν λόγον ἐνεργεῖ ἐστὶν ἡ ἀπουσία ἀμέτοχου καὶ ἀσυσχετίστου μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀδύνατος ἐνέργεια ἐν τῷ συστήματι ἐστὶν ἡ κίνησις ἣ οὔτε ἑαυτὴν ῥυθμίζει οὔτε ἑτέρῳ μέρει ἀνταποκρίνεται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS1","text":"Συναμφότερον ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος → δύο φυσικαὶ ἐπιθυμίαι → ἀσύμμετρος ἐπικράτησις → νόσος σώματος ἢ ἀμαθία ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2","text":"Ἀναγνώρισις τῆς ἀμοιβαίας ἐξαρτήσεως → ἀπόρριψις τῆς μονόπλευρου ἀγωγῆς → ἀνταπόδοσις κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS3","text":"Νοητικὴ μελέτη → γυμναστικὴ κίνησις σώματος· σωματικὴ πλάσις → μουσικὴ καὶ φιλοσοφικὴ κίνησις ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS4","text":"Κοσμικὸν πρότυπον → μίμησις τροφῆς καὶ τιθήνης τοῦ παντός → συνεχὴς μετρία κίνησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS5","text":"Συνεχὴς μετρία κίνησις → ἀποτροπὴ κρατήσεως τῶν παθῶν → τάξις συγγενῶν μερῶν → ὑγίεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS6","text":"Ἀναλογία ὅλου καὶ μερῶν → ὁλοκληρωτικὴ θεραπεία → καλὸς καὶ ἀγαθὸς ἄνθρωπος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1","text":"Ἀσύμμετρος κίνησις ψυχῆς ἢ σώματος → ἐσωτερικὴ νόσος ἢ ἀμαθία → διάγνωσις τῆς διπλῆς ἐξαρτήσεως → ἀμοιβαία ἀνταπόδοσις κινήσεων → μίμησις τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως → μετρία συνεχὴς κίνησις → ὑγίεια.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME1","text":"Ἡ ἀσθένεια μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἁπλῶς σωματικὸν ἐπὶ τὴν ἀταξίαν τοῦ συναμφοτέρου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2","text":"Ἡ παιδεία ἐπαναχαράσσεται ὡς ἀμοιβαία σύζευξις γυμναστικῆς, μουσικῆς, φιλοσοφίας καὶ μαθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία παύει εἶναι οὐδετέρα κατάστασις καὶ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς παράγων φθορᾶς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4","text":"Τὸ ὑγιὲς ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἐνεργὸς τάξις ἀντιθέτων κινήσεων, οὐχ ὡς ἀπουσία παθήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5","text":"Τὸ ἀνθρώπινον σῶμα ἐντάσσεται εἰς κοσμικὴν ἀναλογίαν, ὥστε ἡ θεραπεία τῶν μερῶν νὰ ἀπαιτῇ θεωρίαν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ἡ ὑγεία ἀπαιτεῖ κίνησιν ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος κατὰ συμμετρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ ἀνισορροπία τῶν δύο φυσικῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν παράγει σωματικὴν νόσον ἢ ψυχικὴν ἀμαθίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ὀρθὴ θεραπεία ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν μονομέρειαν διὰ τῆς ἀνταποδοτικῆς ἀγωγῆς καὶ τῆς ὁλοκληρωτικῆς ἐπιμελείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Τὸ ζῷον ὡς συναμφότερον διατείνει διὰ συνεχῶν κινήσεων, αἳ μιμοῦνται τὴν ἀΐδιον τάξιν τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ κυρίου ἐπιχειρήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἀσύμμετρον ἐνέργειαν πρὸς τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν ρύθμισιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ στηρίζεται στὴν ἀρχὴ ὅτι ψυχὴ καὶ σῶμα οὔτε χωρίζονται οὔτε θεραπεύονται μονομερώς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT4","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀδιευκρίνιστον τὸ ἀκριβὲς μέτρον τῆς «μετρίας» κινήσεως καὶ ὁ τρόπος τῆς πρακτικῆς σταθμίσεως αὐτῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT5","text":"Ἡ τάσις μεταξὺ τῆς ἀναγκαίας συνεχούς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς ἀπαιτουμένης μετριότητος παραμένει ἐν μέρει ἄλυτος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τῆς ψυχῆς συνυπάρχει μὲ τὴν ἀναπόδραστον σωματικὴν ἀνταπόδοσιν, χωρὶς πλήρη ἱεράρχησιν τῶν δύο.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὸν πυρήνα, τὴν ἀντίθεσιν καὶ τὴν τελικὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἀταξίαν εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231756037981Z_394bd404","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 88","source_sha256":"773dcfb35e655916baf0ba5511f67536a68ac9fd01070a456c99e2f97d414af5","sha256":"ec80574be5b51e0309f86a15fddd32c422db26e5aa547ae9cf88f85d3a0f753f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:17:56.038941+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS1","text":"The living creature is a composite of soul and body, whose disproportionate motion generates diseases and ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS2","text":"The soul, being superior, can disturb the body, just as the large body can make the soul weak and slow to learn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS3","text":"Salvation lies in the reciprocal and balanced motion of both soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS4","text":"Intellectual study is reciprocated by gymnastics, and bodily formation by music and philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS5","text":"The treatment of the parts ought to take place according to the form of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AS6","text":"Moderate and continuous motion gathers the scattered affections into order and produces health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A1","text":"The human living creature is composed as a composite of soul and body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","text":"There are two natural desires in the human being: one, through the body, for nourishment; the other, through the most divine part, for understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","text":"The stronger motion can increase the part moved by itself and make the other weak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A4","text":"The greatest disease of the soul is ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","text":"Soul and body, when separated from one another, are able neither to be healthy nor to be saved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","text":"Health is balance and order of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A7","text":"Disease arises from the disorderly predominance of contrary motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A8","text":"The exact care of one part requires a reciprocal return of motion from the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","text":"The nature of the whole provides the parts with a model of treatment and motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:A10","text":"Moderate continuous motion orders the affections and the parts according to kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX1","text":"It is not healthy to move the soul without the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX2","text":"It is not healthy to move the body without the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX3","text":"The one-sided cultivation of the intellect is not sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX4","text":"The one-sided formation of the body is not sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX5","text":"It is not the body's rest, but motion according to nature, that preserves it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX6","text":"It is not the placing of enemy beside enemy that produces health, but the ordering of friend beside friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:NX7","text":"It is not random motion but moderate and ordered motion that is therapeutic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D1","text":"Whenever the soul vigorously pursues lessons and inquiries, the body can become full of diseases.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A1","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D2","text":"Whenever the body becomes large and over-spirited, bodily desires can enslave prudence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D3","text":"The disproportionate pursuit of nourishment or understanding makes the corresponding part weak and slow to learn.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A2","CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D4","text":"One who works out mathematical study with the intellect ought to render to the body its motion through gymnastics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D5","text":"One who carefully forms the body ought to reciprocate the motions of the soul through music and philosophy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D6","text":"Bodily immobility allows incoming and external affections to prevail, so that the body is corrupted.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D7","text":"Continuous and moderate motion distributes wandering affections among kindred parts and orders them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:D8","text":"Treatment according to the model of the whole transforms hostile motions into friendship and order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A7","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1","text":"Health is not an absence of motion but a reciprocal regulation and balance of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD2","text":"Treatment requires at once a counterbalancing of psychic and bodily predominance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD3","text":"Bodily disease and psychic ignorance become two manifestations of one disproportionate system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A3","CH_JP8E_S_65:A4","CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD4","text":"Cosmic order is reproduced in the human body through imitation and regulation of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A6","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9","CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SD5","text":"The education of the beautiful and good human being is a synthesis of intellectual, musical, and bodily motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5","CH_JP8E_S_65:A8","CH_JP8E_S_65:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX1","text":"The soul is conceived not as a self-sufficient principle but as a power bound to the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX2","text":"The body is posited not as an inert instrument but as actively governing together with the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX3","text":"Disease is understood not as a simple external assault but as an internal disorder of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX4","text":"Prudence is not opposed to bodily motion, but requires its reciprocal return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX5","text":"Treatment is founded not upon isolated parts but upon the whole and its kinships.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX6","text":"The superiority of the stronger part does not remove the necessity of reciprocal dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which salvation would arise from immobility or from the detachment of one part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX2","text":"Health as the simple predominance of the spiritual over the bodily is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX3","text":"The opposition of soul and body as a final ontological structure is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4","text":"The absence operative throughout the entire account is the absence of an unparticipating and unrelated part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX5","text":"The impossible activity in the system is motion that neither regulates itself nor responds to another part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS1","text":"Composite of soul and body → two natural desires → disproportionate predominance → disease of body or ignorance of soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2","text":"Recognition of reciprocal dependence → rejection of one-sided education → reciprocal return of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS3","text":"Intellectual study → gymnastic motion of the body; bodily formation → musical and philosophical motion of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS4","text":"Cosmic model → imitation of the nourishment and nurse of the whole → continuous moderate motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS5","text":"Continuous moderate motion → prevention of the predominance of affections → order of kindred parts → health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS6","text":"Analogy of whole and parts → holistic treatment → beautiful and good human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1","text":"Disproportionate motion of soul or body → internal disease or ignorance → diagnosis of double dependence → reciprocal return of motions → imitation of cosmic order → moderate continuous motion → health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME1","text":"Illness is shifted from the merely bodily to the disorder of the composite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2","text":"Education is redrawn as a reciprocal conjunction of gymnastics, music, philosophy, and studies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3","text":"Immobility ceases to be a neutral state and is recognized as a factor of corruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4","text":"The healthy is recognized as an active order of contrary motions, not as the absence of affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5","text":"The human body is integrated into a cosmic analogy, so that the treatment of the parts requires contemplation of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Health requires motion of soul and body in accordance with proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The imbalance of the two natural desires produces bodily disease or psychic ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Correct treatment replaces one-sidedness through reciprocal education and holistic care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The living creature, as a composite, extends through continuous motions that imitate the everlasting order of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the principal argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT2","text":"The derivation preserves the movement from disproportionate activity toward reciprocal regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on the principle that soul and body are neither separated nor treated one-sidedly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT4","text":"The precise measure of “moderate” motion and the manner of its practical weighing remain unspecified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT5","text":"The tension between necessary continuous motion and required moderation remains partly unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6","text":"The superiority of the soul coexists with unavoidable bodily reciprocity, without a complete hierarchy of the two.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the core, the opposition, and the final transition from disorder to cosmic likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_65:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_65@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_65:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 88"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 72","title":"Section 88","context":"Chapter 72","original_title":"Section 88","original_context":"Chapter 72"},"original_title":"Section 88","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66","layer":"CH","title":"Section 89","order":73,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_66"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_66@R001","sha256":"08465c57742f7a1f235dd1a187386661acab4578715ab470c4055417911235a9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS1","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὁ καθορισμὸς τῆς ἀρίστης κινήσεως καὶ τῆς ὀρθῆς θεραπείας τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS2","text":"Ἡ ἀξία τῆς κινήσεως κρίνεται ἀπὸ τὸ εἰ ἑαυτὴν κινεῖ ἢ ὑπʼ ἄλλου κινεῖται.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀγωγὴ ἀνάγεται εἰς διαβάθμισιν κινήσεων καὶ καθάρσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS4","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἐρμηνεύεται κατʼ ἀναλογίαν πρὸς τὴν φυσικὴν σύστασιν καὶ τὸν τεταγμένον χρόνον τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS5","text":"Ἡ διὰ φαρμάκων βίαιος παρέμβασις δύναται νὰ διαταράξῃ τὴν φυσικὴν τάξιν καὶ νὰ πολλαπλασιάσῃ τὰ νοσήματα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS6","text":"Ἡ δίαιτα καὶ ἡ παιδαγωγία προκρίνονται ὡς ἡπιώτεραι μορφαὶ διορθώσεως, ἐνῶ τὸ φάρμακον περιορίζεται εἰς ἔσχατον ἀνάγκης ὅρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","text":"Ἡ ἐν ἑαυτῷ ὑφʼ ἑαυτοῦ κίνησις ἐστὶν ἀρίστη, διότι συγγενεύει πρὸς τὴν διανοητικὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ παντός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","text":"Ἡ ὑπʼ ἄλλου κίνησις ἐστὶ χείρων τῆς αὐτοκινήτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A3","text":"Ἡ κίνησις σώματος ἀκινήτου καθʼ ἑαυτὸ καὶ κατὰ μέρη διʼ ἑτέρων ἐνεργουμένη ἐστὶ χειρίστη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A4","text":"Τῶν σωματικῶν καθάρσεων ἡ διὰ γυμνασίων ἐστὶν ἀρίστη, ἡ διὰ αἰωρήσεων δευτέρα, ἡ δὲ διὰ φαρμακευτικῆς καθάρσεως τρίτη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","text":"Ἡ φαρμακευτικὴ κάθαρσις ἐπιτρέπεται μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἀνάγκη σφόδρα πιέζῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","text":"Τὰ ἄνευ μεγάλου κινδύνου νοσήματα οὐ χρὴ διὰ φαρμάκων ἐρεθίζειν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","text":"Ἡ σύστασις τῶν νοσημάτων ὁμοιάζει τῇ φυσικῇ συστάσει τῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","text":"Ἕκαστον ζῷον ἔχει τεταγμένον βίον, ὅνπερ ἡ φυσικὴ σύστασις δύναται μέχρι τινὸς χρόνου διατηρεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","text":"Ἡ παρὰ τὸν εἱμαρμένον χρόνον φθορὰ τῆς νόσου δύναται ἐκ μικρῶν κακῶν μεγάλα καὶ πολλὰ νοσήματα ποιεῖν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A10","text":"Ἡ δίαιτα παιδαγωγεῖ τὰ τοιαῦτα νοσήματα ἡπιώτερον ἢ ἡ φαρμακευτική βία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A11","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ παιδαγωγία προϋποθέτει τὴν πρότερον παρασκευὴν τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος εἰς τὸ κάλλιστον καὶ ἄριστον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικῶς ἐπιβαλλομένη κίνησις οὐκ ἔχει τὴν ἀξίαν τῆς αὐτοκινήτου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX2","text":"Ἡ κίνησις σώματος ἀδρανοῦς καὶ κατὰ μέρη ἐξωτερικῶς χειραγωγουμένου οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ὀρθὴν ἀγωγήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX3","text":"Ἡ φαρμακευτικὴ κάθαρσις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἡ κανονικὴ ἢ πρώτη μέθοδος θεραπείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX4","text":"Τὰ ἄνευ μεγάλου κινδύνου νοσήματα οὐ πρέπει νὰ διεγείρωνται διὰ φαρμακείων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX5","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία οὐκ ὀφείλει νὰ παραβιάζῃ τὸν φυσικῶς τεταγμένον χρόνον τοῦ πάθους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX6","text":"Ἡ παιδαγωγία οὐκ ἀρχίζει ἀπὸ τὴν διόρθωσιν τοῦ ἄλλου, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὴν παρασκευὴν τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D1","text":"Ἡ ἀξία τῆς θεραπευτικῆς κινήσεως ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸν βαθμὸν αὐτονομίας της καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον ἀπὸ τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","CH_JP8E_S_66:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D2","text":"Ἡ γυμναστικὴ προκρίνεται ὡς ἡ πρώτη σωματικὴ μέθοδος, ἐπειδὴ ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὸ σῶμα διὰ κινήσεως ἐγγυτέρας τῆς αὐτοκινήτου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D3","text":"Ἡ αἰώρησις ἀποτελεῖ μεσαίαν λύσιν, ἐπειδὴ παρέχει κίνησιν ἄνευ τῆς πληρεστέρας ἐνεργοποιήσεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D4","text":"Ἡ φαρμακευτικὴ θεραπεία ἐξαιροῦσα τὴν φυσικὴν πορείαν τοῦ νοσήματος δύναται νὰ μεταβάλῃ ἓν πάθος εἰς πλείονα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D5","text":"Ἡ δίαιτα λειτουργεῖ ὡς παιδαγωγικὴ ρύθμισις τοῦ σώματος, ἐπειδὴ διορθοῖ χωρὶς βιαίαν διακοπὴν τῆς φυσικῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D6","text":"Ἡ θεραπευτικὴ τέχνη ὀφείλει νὰ διακρίνῃ μεταξὺ παθήματος ἀναγκαίου καὶ παθήματος ἐπιδεκτικοῦ ἡπίας ἀγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις γίνεται κανονιστικὸς κανὼν θεραπείας, ὥστε ἡ θεραπεία νὰ κρίνεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἂν συνεργεῖ μετὰ τοῦ χρόνου καὶ τῆς συστάσεως ἢ ἂν βιάζη αὐτά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀρίστη ἀγωγὴ μεταφέρει τὸ κέντρον τῆς θεραπείας ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπέμβασιν εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἐνεργοποίησιν καὶ αὐτορρύθμισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A3","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἰατρικὴ παρέμβασις ἀποκτᾷ νομιμότητα μόνον ὡς ἐξαίρεσις ὑπὸ τὸ μέτρον τῆς ἀναγκαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","text":"Ἡ παιδαγωγία τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἡ παιδαγωγία τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος ἀποτελοῦν ἕν ἀναδραστικὸν σύστημα αὐτοδιορθώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX1","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία οὐ νοεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀπεριορίστου τεχνικοῦ ἐλέγχου τοῦ σώματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐ θεωρεῖται ὡς ἀδρανὲς ὑλικόν, ὅπερ ἡ ἰατρικὴ τέχνη δύναται κατὰ βούλησιν νὰ μεταπλάττῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX3","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς ἐξωτερικὸν ἐχθρὸν ἀποκοπτέον ἀπὸ τὸ φυσικὸν γίγνεσθαι.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιτάχυνσις τῆς θεραπείας οὐ ταυτίζεται ἀναγκαίως πρὸς τὴν βελτίωσιν τοῦ θεραπευομένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἢ τεχνικὴ γνώσις οὐκ ἀρκεῖ ἄνευ ἀγωγῆς τοῦ φορέως τῆς θεραπείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ φύσις ἀποτελεῖ ἀπλῶς ἀτελὲς ὑλικόν, ἡ δὲ τέχνη ἀπεριόριστον κυρίαρχον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι πᾶσα παρέκκλισις ἀπαιτεῖ ἄμεσον ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπέμβασιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX3","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης θεραπείας ἄνευ σεβασμοῦ πρὸς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν τάξιν, τὸ μέτρον καὶ τὸν χρόνον τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἐλευθερία ἐπεμβάσεως ἀπορρίπτεται ὑπὲρ ἐνὸς συστήματος ὅπου ἡ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ φύσις θέτουσι τὰ ὅρια τῆς τέχνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS1","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ κίνησις → αὐτονομία → συγγένεια πρὸς νοῦν καὶ κόσμον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS2","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ κίνησις → ἐλάττωσις αὐτονομίας → ὑποδεεστέρα ἀγωγή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS3","text":"Βαθμὸς κινήσεως → ἱεράρχησις γυμνασίου, αἰωρήσεως, φαρμάκου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","text":"Φυσικὴ σύστασις νόσου → τεταγμένος χρόνος → ὅριον θεραπευτικῆς παρεμβάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5","text":"Βίαιος φαρμακευτικὴ διακοπή → παραβίασις χρόνου → πολλαπλασιασμὸς παθημάτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS6","text":"Δίαιτα καὶ ἐσωτερικὴ παιδαγωγία → ἡπία ρύθμισις → διατήρησις φυσικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS7","text":"Παρασκευὴ τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος → ὀρθὴ παιδαγωγία → λογικὴ διαγωγὴ τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AF1","text":"Ἱεράρχησις κινήσεων → ἱεράρχησις σωματικῶν καθάρσεων → περιορισμὸς φαρμάκου → φυσιολογικὴ ἀναλογία νόσου καὶ ζῴου → κίνδυνος βιαίας θεραπείας → προτίμησις διαίτης → προπαρασκευὴ τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME1","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ μηχανικὴν ἐπέμβασιν εἰς βαθμισμένην μορφὴν κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME2","text":"Ἡ νόσος μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν κατηγορίαν τοῦ ἁπλοῦ ἐχθροῦ εἰς τὴν κατηγορίαν φυσικῆς συστάσεως ἔχουσας χρόνον καὶ ὅρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME3","text":"Ἡ φαρμακευτικὴ ἰσχὺς μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ προνόμιον εἰς ἐξαιρετικὴν ἀπάντησιν ἀνάγκης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀγωγὴ τοῦ θεραπευομένου συνδέεται ἀναγκαίως πρὸς τὴν ἀγωγὴν τοῦ θεραπεύοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φύσεως καὶ τέχνης ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ τῆς ἀντιθέσεως συνεργοῦσης καὶ βιαίας τέχνης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου διατάσσονται κινήσεις, καθάρσεις, δίαιται καὶ φάρμακα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ θεραπεία ὑπάγεται εἰς τὴν ἱεράρχησιν αὐτονομίας, ἐξωτερικῆς κινήσεως καὶ φυσικοῦ χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ὀρθὴ μέθοδος ἐστὶν ἡ ἐλάττωσις τῆς βίας καὶ ἡ ἐνίσχυσις τῆς αὐτορυθμίσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ ζῷον ἔχει ἐσωτερικὴν σύστασιν καὶ πεπερασμένον φυσικὸν βίον, ὃν ἡ τέχνη δύναται ἢ νὰ συντηρήσῃ ἢ νὰ διαταράξῃ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT1","text":"Οἱ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν πρὸς ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς βασικῆς ἱεραρχίας κινήσεως καὶ θεραπείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT2","text":"Ἡ παραγωγὴ τῆς προτιμήσεως τῆς διαίτης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν σύνδεσιν τῆς θεωρίας κινήσεως πρὸς τὴν φυσιολογίαν τῆς νόσου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή στηρίζεται εἰς τὴν κοινὴν ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἡ ὀρθὴ ἀγωγὴ συνεργεῖ μετὰ τῆς φυσικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4","text":"Ἡ βασικὴ ἔντασις μένει μεταξὺ τοῦ εἱμαρμένου χρόνου τοῦ ζῴου καὶ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἐξωτερικῆς ἐπεμβάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ τῆς θεραπευτικῆς παιδαγωγίας καὶ τῆς φαρμακευτικῆς βίας παραμένει ἰσχυρά, ἀλλὰ τὸ μέτρον τῆς «σφόδρα ἀναγκαίας» περιπτώσεως μένει ἀδιευκρίνιστον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ταυτότης τοῦ παιδαγωγουμένου καὶ τοῦ παιδαγωγοῦντος μένει μερικῶς ἀνοικτή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231813723090Z_1135ab73","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 89","source_sha256":"08465c57742f7a1f235dd1a187386661acab4578715ab470c4055417911235a9","sha256":"f698f5787ad078419e3a09977524f9aef43a90b12ee8bd22645a4796ee700c53","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:18:13.726711+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS1","text":"The problem is the determination of the best motion and the correct treatment of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS2","text":"The value of motion is judged by whether it moves itself or is moved by another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS3","text":"Bodily regimen is reduced to a gradation of motions and purifications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS4","text":"Disease is interpreted by analogy with the natural constitution and the appointed time of the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS5","text":"Violent intervention by means of drugs can disturb the natural order and multiply diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AS6","text":"Diet and education are preferred as gentler forms of correction, whereas the drug is restricted to an extreme condition of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","text":"Motion in itself by itself is best, because it is akin to intellectual motion and to the motion of the all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","text":"Motion by another is inferior to self-motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A3","text":"The motion of a body inert in itself and in its parts, effected by others, is worst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A4","text":"Of bodily purifications, that through exercises is best, that through swinging is second, and that through medicinal purification is third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","text":"Medicinal purification is permitted only when necessity presses severely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","text":"Diseases without great danger ought not to be provoked by means of drugs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","text":"The constitution of diseases resembles the natural constitution of living beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","text":"Each living being has an appointed life, which its natural constitution is able to preserve up to a certain time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","text":"The destruction of disease contrary to its destined time can make great and many diseases out of small evils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A10","text":"Diet educates such diseases more gently than medicinal violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:A11","text":"Correct education presupposes the prior preparation of the educator toward what is most beautiful and best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX1","text":"Motion externally imposed does not possess the value of self-motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX2","text":"The motion of a passive body externally manipulated in its parts does not constitute correct regimen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX3","text":"Medicinal purification is not the regular or primary method of treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX4","text":"Diseases without great danger ought not to be stimulated by means of drugs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX5","text":"Treatment ought not to violate the naturally appointed time of the affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:NX6","text":"Education does not begin from the correction of another, but from the preparation of the educator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D1","text":"The value of therapeutic motion depends on its degree of autonomy and not solely on the result.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","CH_JP8E_S_66:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D2","text":"Gymnastics is preferred as the first bodily method, because it activates the body through motion closer to self-motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D3","text":"Swinging constitutes an intermediate solution, because it provides motion without the fuller activation of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A2","CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D4","text":"Medicinal treatment, interrupting the natural course of disease, can transform one affection into several.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D5","text":"Diet functions as a pedagogical regulation of the body, because it corrects without violently interrupting the natural constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:D6","text":"The therapeutic art ought to distinguish between a necessary affection and an affection susceptible to gentle regimen.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1","text":"Natural order becomes a normative rule of treatment, so that treatment is judged by whether it cooperates with time and constitution or forces them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A7","CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","text":"The best regimen shifts the center of treatment from external intervention to internal activation and self-regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A3","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD3","text":"Medical intervention acquires legitimacy only as an exception under the measure of necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A6","CH_JP8E_S_66:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","text":"The education of the body and the education of the educator constitute one feedback system of self-correction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_S_66:A10","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX1","text":"Health is not conceived as the result of unlimited technical control of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX2","text":"The body is not regarded as inert material which the medical art can reshape at will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX3","text":"Disease does not constitute merely an external enemy to be cut off from natural becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX4","text":"The acceleration of treatment is not necessarily identical with the improvement of the one treated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX5","text":"Scientific or technical knowledge is not sufficient without the education of the bearer of treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX1","text":"A world is excluded in which nature constitutes merely imperfect material and art an unlimited master.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX2","text":"The idea that every deviation requires immediate external intervention is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX3","text":"The possibility of treatment without respect for the internal order, measure, and time of the living being is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX4","text":"Absolute freedom of intervention is rejected in favor of a system in which necessity and nature set the limits of art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS1","text":"Internal motion → autonomy → kinship with intellect and cosmos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS2","text":"External motion → diminution of autonomy → inferior regimen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS3","text":"Degree of motion → hierarchy of exercise, swinging, drug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","text":"Natural constitution of disease → appointed time → limit of therapeutic intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5","text":"Violent medicinal interruption → violation of time → multiplication of affections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS6","text":"Diet and internal education → gentle regulation → preservation of natural order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS7","text":"Preparation of the educator → correct education → rational conduct of the living being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:AF1","text":"Hierarchy of motions → hierarchy of bodily purifications → restriction of the drug → physiological analogy of disease and living being → danger of violent treatment → preference for diet → prior preparation of the educator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME1","text":"Treatment is reclassified from mechanical intervention into a graduated form of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME2","text":"Disease is shifted from the category of the simple enemy into the category of a natural constitution having time and limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME3","text":"Medicinal power is transformed from a privilege into an exceptional response to necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME4","text":"The regimen of the one treated is necessarily connected with the regimen of the one treating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5","text":"The opposition of nature and art is replaced by the opposition of cooperative and violent art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, motions, purifications, diets, and drugs are arranged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, treatment is subordinated to the hierarchy of autonomy, external motion, and natural time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3","text":"At the meta-strategic level, the correct method is the reduction of violence and the strengthening of self-regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the living being has an internal constitution and a finite natural life, which art can either preserve or disturb.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the basic hierarchy of motion and treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT2","text":"The derivation of the preference for diet requires connecting the theory of motion with the physiology of disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3","text":"Internal coherence rests on the common principle that correct regimen cooperates with natural order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4","text":"The basic tension remains between the destined time of the living being and the necessity of external intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5","text":"The distinction between therapeutic education and medicinal violence remains strong, but the measure of the “severely necessary” case remains unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument, but the precise identity of the one being educated and the educator remains partly open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_66:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_66@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_66:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 89"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 73","title":"Section 89","context":"Chapter 73","original_title":"Section 89","original_context":"Chapter 73"},"original_title":"Section 89","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9","layer":"CH","title":"Section 90","order":74,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_SEC9"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC9@R001","sha256":"03f2dc441e1087ba62e4ebf35a6ee8cc5212003cee3071d5d4ff540463d47bc0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ τριχῇ διῃρημένη ἐστίν, καὶ ἕκαστον εἶδος ἰδίας κινήσεις ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS2","text":"Ἀργία μὲν ἀσθενεῖ τὸ ψυχικὸν εἶδος, ἄσκησις δὲ ἐρρωννύει· διὸ τὰς κινήσεις εἰς συμμετρίαν ἄγειν δεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS3","text":"Τὸ κυριώτατον εἶδος τῆς ψυχῆς θεῖος δαίμων ἐστίν, ὃς τὸ σῶμα πρὸς τὴν οὐράνιον συγγένειαν ἀνάγει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS4","text":"Ἡ κατὰ τὰς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ φιλονικίας ἄσκησις θνητὰ φρονήματα γεννᾷ, ἡ δὲ φιλομάθεια καὶ ἀληθὴς φρόνησις τὸ θεῖον καὶ ἀθάνατον ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS5","text":"Θεραπεία τῆς ψυχῆς ἐστὶν ἡ προσήκουσα τροφὴ καὶ κίνησις ἑκάστου μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν τοῦ παντὸς ἁρμονιῶν καὶ περιφορῶν ἐπανορθοῖ τὰς διεφθαρμένας ψυχῆς περιόδους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7","text":"Ἡ ἐξομοίωσις τοῦ νοοῦντος πρὸς τὸ νοούμενον θεμελιοῖ τὸν ἄριστον ἀνθρώπινον βίον εἰς τὸν παρόντα καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","text":"Τρία εἴδη ψυχῆς ἐν τῷ ἀνθρώπῳ κατοικεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","text":"Ἕκαστον ψυχῆς εἶδος ἰδίας κινήσεις ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3","text":"Ἡ ἀργία τὴν ψυχὴν ἀσθενεστέραν ποιεῖ, ἡ δὲ ἄσκησις ἰσχυροτέραν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","text":"Ἡ σωτηρία τῆς ψυχῆς ἀπαιτεῖ συμμετρίαν τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A5","text":"Τὸ κυριώτατον ψυχῆς εἶδος θεῖος δαίμων ἐστὶ καὶ οὐράνιαν συγγένειαν ἔχει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ κατὰ τὴν ἀρχὴν αὐτῆς οὐ γήϊνον μόνον ἀλλὰ καὶ οὐράνιον φυτόν ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία καὶ ἡ φιλονικία τὰ φρονήματα πρὸς τὸ θνητὸν ἐπιστρέφει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","text":"Ἡ φιλομάθεια καὶ ἡ ἀληθὴς φρόνησις τὸ θεῖον καὶ ἀθάνατον ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία κατὰ τὸ ἀνθρώπινον μέτρον διὰ μετοχῆς τοῦ θείου δυνατή ἐστιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","text":"Θεραπεία ἐστὶν ἡ προσήκουσα τροφὴ καὶ κίνησις ἑκάστου ψυχικοῦ μέρους.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","text":"Αἱ τοῦ παντὸς διανοήσεις καὶ περιφοραὶ συγγενεῖς εἰσι τῷ ἐν ἡμῖν θείῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12","text":"Ἡ κατανόησις τῶν κοσμικῶν ἁρμονιῶν ἐπανορθοῖ τὰς διεφθαρμένας περιόδους τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13","text":"Ὁ ἄριστος βίος συνίσταται ἐν τῇ ἐξομοιώσει τοῦ νοοῦντος πρὸς τὸ νοούμενον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἀδιαίρετός ἐστιν οὐδὲ ἀκίνητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX2","text":"Ἡ ἀργία οὐκ ἐστὶν οὐδετέρα κατάστασις, ἀλλὰ γενεσιουργὸς αἰτία ἀσθενείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἰσχὺς τῆς ψυχῆς οὐκ ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ μιᾶς καὶ ἀδιακρίτου κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX4","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος οὐκ ἔστιν ἀπολύτως γήϊνος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX5","text":"Ἡ ἐνασχόλησις ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις καὶ ταῖς φιλονικίαις οὐκ ἄγει πρὸς τὸ θεῖον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX6","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία οὐκ ἐστὶν ἡ ὁμοιόμορφος τροφὴ πάντων τῶν ψυχικῶν μερῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX7","text":"Ἡ φιλομάθεια οὐκ ἀρκεί, ἐὰν μὴ ἅπτηται ἀληθείας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX8","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ θεωρία οὐκ ἐστὶν ἁπλὴ συσσώρευσις γνώσεων, ἀλλὰ ἐπανόρθωσις ψυχικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D1","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον μέρος ἰδίαν κίνησιν ἔχει καὶ ἡ ἀργία ἀσθενεῖ, ἡ παιδεία ὀφείλει τὰ μέρη ἀναλόγως γυμνάζειν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D2","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ κυριώτατον μέρος οὐράνιας συγγενείας μετέχει, ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἀνάτασις γίνεται διὰ τῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως τούτου τοῦ μέρους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D3","text":"Ἡ κατεύθυνσις τῆς ζωῆς πρὸς τὸ θνητὸν ἢ τὸ θεῖον κρίνεται ἐκ τοῦ ποῖον ψυχικὸν εἶδος ἀσκεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D4","text":"Ὁ ἀληθῶς φιλομαθὴς ἀναγκαίως μετέχει τοῦ θείου κατὰ τὸ μέτρον τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D5","text":"Ἡ εὐδαιμονία προκύπτει ἐκ τῆς ἀδιαλείπτου θεραπείας τοῦ θείου ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ κόσμου μεταβάλλει τὸ γνωρίζον, ἐπειδὴ ἐπανορθοῖ τὰς ἐσωτερικὰς περιφοράς αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","text":"Ὁ ἄριστος βίος οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται εἰς τὸ παρόν, ἀλλὰ ἐκτείνεται εἰς τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον διὰ τῆς ἐξομοιώσεως πρὸς τὸ θεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη τελείωσις ἐστὶν οὐχὶ ἀπαλλαγὴ ἀπὸ τὴν σωματικότητα, ἀλλὰ κοσμικὴ ἐναρμόνισις τῶν ψυχικῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία μετατρέπεται εἰς ἠθικὴν τεχνολογία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ θεωρία τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων ἀποτελεῖ μέθοδον μετασχηματισμοῦ τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD3","text":"Ἡ θνητότης οὐκ ἀναιρεῖται ἀπολύτως, ἀλλὰ ὑπερβαίνεται κατὰ τὸ μέτρον ᾧ ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη φύσις μετέχει τοῦ θείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD4","text":"Ἡ ὀρθὴ ψυχικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ ἅμα διάκρισιν τῶν μερῶν καὶ ἑνότητα τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX1","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι πᾶσαι αἱ ψυχικαὶ κινήσεις ἰσοτίμως ἀγαθαί εἰσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ σωματικὴ ὕπαρξις ἀποτελεῖ τὸ πλήρες μέτρον τοῦ ἀνθρώπου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX3","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ γνώσις δύναται νὰ παραμένῃ ἐξωτερικὴ πρὸς τὸν γνωρίζοντα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX4","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ ἀθανασία ἐστὶν ἢ παντελῶς ἀδύνατος ἢ ἄνευ ὅρου κεκτημένη.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX5","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ εὐδαιμονία δύναται νὰ χωρισθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμικὴν καὶ θείαν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX6","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀποκλείει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη παιδεία ἀπαιτεῖ μόνον πληροφορίαν καὶ οὐ μεταβολὴν κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ ἄνθρωπος ὡς ὂν ἀπολύτως αὐτόνομον, ἀσύνδετον πρὸς τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν ἠθικὴν διαμόρφωσιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ τελείωσις ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπαλλαγὴ ἀπὸ τὸ θνητόν· ἡ τελείωσις προϋποθέτει μεταμόρφωσιν καὶ ἐξομοίωσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀξία τοῦ βίου ὡς ἔργον μόνον τοῦ παρόντος χρόνου· ὁ βίος νοεῖται ὑπὸ τὴν προοπτικὴν τοῦ ἔπειτα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS1","text":"Τριμερὴς ψυχὴ → διαφοραὶ κινήσεων → ἀνάγκη ἀσκήσεως καὶ συμμετρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS2","text":"Ἀμέλεια ἐπιθυμητικοῦ ἢ θυμοειδοῦς → αὔξησις θνητῶν φρονημάτων → προσήλωσις εἰς τὸ θνητόν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS3","text":"Φιλομάθεια καὶ ἀληθὴς φρόνησις → ἐνεργοποίησις τοῦ θείου → μετοχὴ ἀθανασίας κατὰ τὸ ἀνθρώπινον μέτρον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4","text":"Θεραπεία ἑκάστου μέρους → ἁρμονία ψυχικῶν κινήσεων → εὐδαιμονία.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5","text":"Θεωρία κοσμικῶν περιφορῶν → ἐπανόρθωσις διεφθαρμένων περιόδων → ἐξομοίωσις νοοῦντος καὶ νοουμένου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6","text":"Ἐξομοίωσις πρὸς τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν → ἄριστος βίος εἰς τὸν παρόντα καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS7","text":"Ὁλοκλήρωσις τῆς περὶ τοῦ παντὸς καὶ τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης γενέσεως διδασκαλίας → μετάβασις εἰς σύντομον μνείαν τῶν ἄλλων ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1","text":"Διαίρεσις τῆς ψυχῆς → διαφοροποίησις κινήσεων → ἀνάγκη συμμετρίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF2","text":"Ἐπιθυμία καὶ φιλονικία → θνητὴ κατεύθυνσις· φιλομάθεια καὶ ἀλήθεια → θεία κατεύθυνσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF3","text":"Θεία συγγένεια → θεραπεία καὶ ἄσκησις → ἐπανόρθωσις ψυχικῶν περιόδων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF4","text":"Κατανόησις τοῦ παντός → ἐξομοίωσις τοῦ νοοῦντος → ἄριστος βίος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF5","text":"Ὁλοκλήρωσις τῆς ἀνθρωπολογικῆς διδασκαλίας → σύντομος μετάβασις εἰς τὰ ἄλλα ζῷα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἑνιαία οὐσία εἰς ἱεραρχημένον σύστημα κινήσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME2","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπολογία συνδέεται ἀδιασπάστως μετὰ κοσμολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ὁ κοσμικὸς ῥυθμὸς γίνεται κανὼν ψυχικῆς ὀρθώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3","text":"Ἡ γνώσις μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ θεωρητικὴν κατοχὴν εἰς ἄσκησιν καὶ θεραπείαν τοῦ γνωρίζοντος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME4","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία ἐπαναχαράσσεται ὡς βαθμὸς μετοχῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλῆ διχοτομία μεταξὺ θνητοῦ καὶ ἀθανάτου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME5","text":"Ἡ εὐδαιμονία μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἡδονὴν ἢ τὴν ἐπικράτησιν εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἁρμονίαν καὶ τὴν θείαν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME6","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἱστορία τῆς παιδείας ἐντάσσεται εἰς χρονικὸν ὁρίζοντα ὃς περιλαμβάνει καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα χρόνον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT1","text":"Ἐπιφανειακὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ ὀρθή διαχείρισις τῶν τριῶν ψυχικῶν εἰδῶν ἀπαιτεῖ ἄσκησιν καὶ συμμετρίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT2","text":"Δομικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη κατάστασις παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἀναλογίας τῶν ψυχικῶν κινήσεων καὶ τῆς τροφῆς ἣν ἕκαστον μέρος λαμβάνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT3","text":"Μεταστρατηγικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ἡ φιλοσοφικὴ παιδεία ἐπαναπροσανατολίζει τὸν ἄνθρωπον ἀπὸ τὰ θνητὰ πρὸς τὰ θεῖα διὰ τῆς θεωρίας καὶ τῆς ἀσκήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT4","text":"Ὀντολογικὸν καὶ χρονικὸν ἐπίπεδον: Ὁ ἄνθρωπος νοεῖται ὡς οὐράνιον φυτόν, τοῦ ὁποίου ἡ τελείωσις ἐκτείνεται πέραν τοῦ παρόντος χρόνου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT1","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν τριμερῆ ψυχὴν εἰς τὸν ἄριστον βίον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT2","text":"Ἡ δομὴ ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτική ἐστιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχικὴ ἄσκησις, ἡ κοσμικὴ θεωρία καὶ ἡ θεία ἐξομοίωσις ἀνήκουσιν εἰς ἓν σύστημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα ἀκολουθία ἐστὶν ἡ σύνδεσις κινήσεως, γνώσεως, ἐπανoρθώσεως καὶ εὐδαιμονίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις μεταξὺ τῶν τριῶν ψυχικῶν εἰδῶν καὶ τῆς ἐνιαίας κοσμικῆς ἁρμονίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT5","text":"Ἐπίσης ἀδιευκρίνιστον μένει πῶς ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἐλευθερία συνάδει πρὸς τὴν δεδομένην θείαν συγγένειαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT6","text":"Ἡ ἀθανασία διατηρεῖ ἀμφισημίαν, ἐπειδὴ δηλοῖ καὶ θείαν πραγματικότητα καὶ περιορισμένην ἀνθρωπίνην μετοχήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὴν ἀκολουθίαν ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχικὴν διαίρεσιν διὰ τῆς θεραπείας καὶ τῆς κοσμικῆς ἐξομοιώσεως πρὸς τὴν μεταβασιν εἰς τὰ ἄλλα ζῷα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T225811519502Z_db4ba499","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 90","source_sha256":"03f2dc441e1087ba62e4ebf35a6ee8cc5212003cee3071d5d4ff540463d47bc0","sha256":"81568e85cc8851b64b953bb3fa3e1a99c6737003572f60832725bbe617e4ffb2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T22:58:11.528049+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS1","text":"The soul is divided in three, and each kind has its own motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS2","text":"Inactivity weakens the psychic kind, while exercise strengthens it; therefore, the motions must be brought into proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS3","text":"The most sovereign kind of soul is a divine daimon, which raises the body toward its celestial kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS4","text":"The exercise directed toward appetites and contentiousness engenders mortal dispositions, whereas love of learning and true prudence activate the divine and immortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS5","text":"Care of the soul is the fitting nourishment and motion of each part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6","text":"The contemplation of the harmonies and revolutions of the all corrects the corrupted circuits of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7","text":"The assimilation of that which thinks to that which is thought grounds the best human life for the present and subsequent time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","text":"Three kinds of soul dwell in the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","text":"Each kind of soul has its own motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3","text":"Inactivity makes the soul weaker, whereas exercise makes it stronger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","text":"The preservation of the soul requires proportion among its motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A5","text":"The most sovereign kind of soul is a divine daimon and has celestial kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6","text":"According to its origin, the soul is not merely an earthly but also a celestial plant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","text":"Appetite and contentiousness turn dispositions toward the mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","text":"Love of learning and true prudence activate the divine and immortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","text":"Immortality, according to the human measure, is possible through participation in the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","text":"Care is the fitting nourishment and motion of each psychic part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","text":"The thoughts and revolutions of the all are akin to the divine within us.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12","text":"Understanding cosmic harmonies corrects the corrupted circuits of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13","text":"The best life consists in the assimilation of that which thinks to that which is thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX1","text":"The soul is neither indivisible nor unmoved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX2","text":"Inactivity is not a neutral condition, but a generative cause of weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX3","text":"The strength of the soul is not constituted by one undifferentiated motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX4","text":"The human being is not absolutely earthly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX5","text":"Engagement with appetites and contentiousness does not lead toward the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX6","text":"Care is not the uniform nourishment of all psychic parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX7","text":"Love of learning is not sufficient, unless it touches truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX8","text":"Cosmic contemplation is not a mere accumulation of knowledge, but a correction of psychic motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D1","text":"Since each part has its own motion and inactivity weakens, education ought to train the parts proportionally.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D2","text":"Since the most sovereign part participates in celestial kinship, human elevation comes about through the activation of this part.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D3","text":"The direction of life toward the mortal or the divine is determined by which psychic kind is exercised.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D4","text":"The truly lover of learning necessarily participates in the divine according to the measure of human nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D5","text":"Happiness arises from the unceasing care of the divine in the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6","text":"Knowledge of the cosmos transforms the knower, because it corrects that person's internal revolutions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","text":"The best life is not exhausted in the present, but extends into subsequent time through assimilation to the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","text":"Human perfection is not release from embodiment, but cosmic harmonization of psychic motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2","text":"Cosmology is transformed into an ethical technology, because contemplation of celestial motions constitutes a method for transforming the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD3","text":"Mortality is not absolutely abolished, but is transcended to the extent that human nature participates in the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD4","text":"The right psychic order requires at once distinction among the parts and unity of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that all psychic motions are equally good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that bodily existence constitutes the complete measure of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that knowledge can remain external to the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that immortality is either wholly impossible or possessed without qualification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that happiness can be separated from cosmic and divine order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX6","text":"The system excludes the hypothesis that human education requires only information and not a change of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1","text":"The human being as an absolutely autonomous being, unconnected to cosmic order, is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX2","text":"A cosmos indifferent to the ethical formation of the soul is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX3","text":"Perfection as mere release from mortality is excluded; perfection presupposes transformation and assimilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX4","text":"The value of life as a work only of present time is excluded; life is conceived under the perspective of subsequent time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS1","text":"Tripartite soul → differences of motions → necessity of exercise and proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS2","text":"Neglect of the appetitive or spirited part → increase of mortal dispositions → attachment to the mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS3","text":"Love of learning and true prudence → activation of the divine → participation in immortality according to the human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4","text":"Care of each part → harmony of psychic motions → happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5","text":"Contemplation of cosmic revolutions → correction of corrupted circuits → assimilation of that which thinks and that which is thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6","text":"Assimilation to cosmic order → best life in present and subsequent time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS7","text":"Completion of the teaching concerning the all and human generation → transition to a brief mention of the other animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1","text":"Division of the soul → differentiation of motions → necessity of proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF2","text":"Appetite and contentiousness → mortal direction; love of learning and truth → divine direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF3","text":"Divine kinship → care and exercise → correction of psychic circuits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF4","text":"Understanding of the all → assimilation of that which thinks → best life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF5","text":"Completion of the anthropological teaching → brief transition to the other animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1","text":"The soul is reclassified from a unified substance into a hierarchized system of motions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME2","text":"Anthropology is connected inseparably with cosmology, because cosmic rhythm becomes the standard of psychic rectification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3","text":"Knowledge is transformed from theoretical possession into exercise and care of the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME4","text":"Immortality is redrawn as a degree of participation and not as a simple dichotomy between mortal and immortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME5","text":"Happiness is shifted from pleasure or domination to internal harmony and divine likeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME6","text":"The human history of education is placed within a temporal horizon that includes subsequent time as well.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT1","text":"Surface level: The correct management of the three psychic kinds requires exercise and proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT2","text":"Structural level: The human condition is produced from the proportion of psychic motions and the nourishment that each part receives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: Philosophical education reorients the human being from mortal things toward divine things through contemplation and exercise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: The human being is conceived as a celestial plant, whose perfection extends beyond present time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from the tripartite soul to the best life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT2","text":"The structure is internally coherent, because psychic exercise, cosmic contemplation, and divine assimilation belong to one system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3","text":"The strongest sequence is the connection of motion, knowledge, correction, and happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4","text":"The precise relation between the three psychic kinds and the unified cosmic harmony remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT5","text":"Likewise, it remains unexplained how human freedom accords with given divine kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT6","text":"Immortality retains ambiguity, because it signifies both divine reality and limited human participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the sequence from psychic division through care and cosmic assimilation to the transition to the other animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_SEC9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_SEC9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_SEC9:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 90"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 74","title":"Section 90","context":"Chapter 74","original_title":"Section 90","original_context":"Chapter 74"},"original_title":"Section 90","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67","layer":"CH","title":"Section 91","order":75,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_67"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_67@R001","sha256":"e52093061e900b9494ebe23d484f4f4c6cbced86b27e7bf51c61695d1209a947","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS1","text":"Τὸ χωρίον ζητεῖ ἐξηγῆσαι τὴν γένεσιν τῶν φύλων, τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν καὶ τῶν ζῴων διὰ τῆς προηγουμένης ἠθικῆς καὶ διανοητικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS2","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ ἀπὸ ἀνδρῶν εἰς γυναῖκας καὶ εἰς ἄλλα ζῷα ἀποδίδεται ὡς ἀναλογία πρὸς τὸν πρότερον τρόπον τοῦ βίου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS3","text":"Οἱ θεοὶ μετασχηματίζουσι τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν εἰς ἔμψυχον σωματικὸν μηχανισμόν, ὃς ἀποβλέπει εἰς τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS4","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγικὴ ὁρμὴ ἐγκαθίσταται ὡς δύναμις ἐν μέρει ἀπειθὴς τῷ λόγῳ καὶ ἰδίαν ἀρχὴν ἔχουσα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS5","text":"Ἡ ἀκάρπωτος ἐπιθυμία μεταβάλλεται εἰς σωματικὴν νόσον, ἕως ἂν ἡ συνουσία καὶ ἡ γένεσις ἐπιτελεσθῶσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS6","text":"Ἡ ταξινόμησις τῶν φύλων καὶ τῶν ζῴων ἀκολουθεῖ βαθμίδας ἠθικῆς καὶ νοητικῆς ἀνωτερότητος καὶ κατωτερότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ μετασχηματίζεται κατὰ τὸν πρότερον τρόπον τοῦ βίου καὶ τὴν πρότερον ἠθικὴν στάσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","text":"Ἡ δειλία καὶ ἡ ἀδικία ἐπιφέρουσι μετάπτωσιν εἰς γυναικείαν φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","text":"Οἱ θεοὶ ἐποίησαν τὸν ἔρωτα τῆς συνουσίας ὡς ὄργανον τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","text":"Τὸ σπέρμα καὶ τὰ γεννητικὰ μέρη εἰσὶν ἔμψυχα καὶ κινούμενα ὑπὸ ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","text":"Τὰ γεννητικὰ μέρη δύνανται ἀντιτάσσεσθαι τῷ λόγῳ καὶ κρατεῖν τοῦ σώματος διὰ τῆς ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","text":"Ἡ μήτρα ἔχει φύσιν ζῴου ἐπιθυμητικοῦ, προσανατολισμένου εἰς τὴν παιδοποιίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","text":"Ἡ μακρὰ ἀκαρπία τῆς μήτρας παράγει περιπλάνησιν, ἀπόφραξιν τῶν πόρων, δύσπνοιαν καὶ νόσον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A8","text":"Ἡ συνουσία ἑνοῖ τὰς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ ἐπιφέρει τὴν σύλληψιν, τὴν κυοφορίαν καὶ τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ καὶ διανοητικὴ διάθεσις τοῦ ὄντος προσδιορίζει τὴν ζωικὴν μορφὴν ἣν λαμβάνει.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία καὶ ἡ θεωρία τῆς οὐρανίας φύσεως συνιστῶσιν ὑψηλότερον τρόπον ψυχικῆς διοικήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","text":"Ἡ ἐγκατάλειψις τῆς φιλοσοφίας καὶ τῆς θεωρίας ὑποβιβάζει τὴν ψυχὴν εἰς χερσαίαν καὶ θηριώδη φύσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX1","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ οὐδέτερον σωματικὸν γεγονός, ἀλλὰ ἐρμηνεύεται διὰ ἔρωτος καὶ ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX2","text":"Τὸ γεννητικὸν μέρος οὐκ ὑποτάσσεται πλήρως τῷ λόγῳ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX3","text":"Ἡ μήτρα οὐκ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς παθητικὸς τόπος κυοφορίας, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἔμψυχον ἐπιθυμητικὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἀκαρπία οὐκ εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία γενέσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς σωματικὴ διαταραχή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX5","text":"Τὰ εἴδη τῶν ζῴων οὐκ εἰσὶν ἀνεξάρτητα ἠθικῆς καὶ διανοητικῆς τάξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX6","text":"Ἡ χερσαία θηριώδης φύσις οὐκ ἀποδίδεται εἰς ἁπλὴν φυσικὴν ἀνάγκην.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D1","text":"Ἡ γυναικεία φύσις κατασκευάζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἠθικῆς ὑποβάσεως καὶ συγχρόνως ὡς φορεὺς ἀναπαραγωγικῆς ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","CH_JP8E_S_67:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","text":"Ὁ ἔρως τῆς συνουσίας μετατρέπει τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν εἰς τελεολογικὴν κίνησιν πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D3","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ὀδύνη ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἀποτυχία τῆς φυσικῆς τελειώσεως τῆς ἀναπαραγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D4","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία δύναται νὰ ἀποτελέσῃ ἐσωτερικὸν ἄρχοντα, ὅταν ὁ λόγος ἀδυνατῇ νὰ τὴν κυβερνήσῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D5","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ποιότης τοῦ βίου ἐγγράφεται εἰς τὴν μορφολογίαν καὶ τὴν συμπεριφορὰν τοῦ εἴδους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D6","text":"Ἡ θεωρητικὴ ἀπασχόλησις πρὸς τὸν οὐρανὸν λειτουργεῖ ὡς κριτήριον διακρίσεως μεταξὺ πτηνῆς καὶ θηριώδους φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD1","text":"Ἡ βιολογία τοῦ χωρίου ἀνασυντάσσεται ὡς ἠθικο-κοσμολογικὴ ἱεραρχία, ἐν ᾗ σῶμα, ψυχή, εἶδος καὶ ἠθικὴ διάθεσις ἀλληλοπαράγονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία παρουσιάζεται ὡς διττὴ δύναμις, ἅμα ἀπειθὴς τῷ λόγῳ καὶ ὑπηρετοῦσα τὴν κοσμικὴν τελεολογίαν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD3","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀποκτᾷ τελεολογικὸν νόημα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ σωματικὴ διαταραχὴ ἀποδίδεται εἰς ἀνεκπλήρωτον φυσικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπολογικὴ διαφορά μετατρέπεται εἰς κοσμικὴν κλίμακα ἀξίας, ἀπὸ τὴν φιλοσοφικὴν θεωρίαν μέχρι τῆς θηριώδους ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει πλήρη διάκρισιν μεταξὺ ψυχικοῦ κινήτρου καὶ σωματικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX2","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀξιολογικῶς ἀδιάφορον ὑπόστρωμα, ἀλλὰ φέρει ἴχνην προηγουμένης ψυχικῆς ποιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ οὐκ δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ ἄνευ ἔρωτος, ἐπιθυμίας καὶ τελικοῦ προορισμοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀσθένεια οὐκ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς αὐτόνομος φυσικὴ διαδικασία ἄνευ ἀναφορᾶς εἰς τὴν γενετήσιον τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ἰσότιμος συνέχεια μεταξὺ ἀνθρώπων, γυναικῶν, πτηνῶν καὶ θηρίων ἀποκλείεται ὑπὸ ἱεραρχικῆς γενεαλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX1","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ δὲν ἐκφράζει ἠθικὴν ἢ διανοητικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX2","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἐπιθυμία ἐλεύθερα ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν καὶ μὴ ἐντεταγμένη εἰς κοσμικὴν τελεολογίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται φυσιολογία ἄνευ ψυχικῆς ἀξιολογήσεως καὶ νόσος ἄνευ τελικοῦ νοήματος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX4","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ δυνατότης ἡ ἀνορθολογικὴ ἐπιθυμία νὰ συνιστᾷ ἀνεξάρτητον ἀρχὴν, ἥτις δὲν ἐπανεντάσσεται εἰς τὴν τάξιν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS1","text":"Πρότερος βίος → ἠθικὴ καὶ διανοητικὴ ποιότης → μεταβολὴ ψυχῆς → ἀνάληψις νέας ζωικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS2","text":"Θεία κατασκευή → ἔμψυχα γεννητικὰ μέρη → ἀναπαραγωγικὴ ἐπιθυμία → ἔρως συνουσίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS3","text":"Ἀκάρπεια → περιπλάνησις καὶ ἀπόφραξις → νόσος → συνουσία → σύλληψις καὶ γένεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS4","text":"Ἔλλειψις φιλοσοφίας καὶ θεωρίας → ὑποχώρησις τοῦ λόγου → κυριαρχία τῶν κατωτέρων ψυχικῶν μερῶν → πτηνὴ ἢ θηριώδης μορφή.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ψυχολογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς γενεαλογίαν σωμάτων καὶ εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF1","text":"Ἠθικὴ ἀποτυχία → μετενσωμάτωσις → διαφοροποίησις φύλων καὶ εἰδῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF2","text":"Ἔμψυχα γεννητικὰ μέρη → ἀπειθὴς ἐπιθυμία → ἔρως → γένεσις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF3","text":"Ἀνεκπλήρωτος φυσικὴ ὁρμή → σωματικὴ νόσος → ἀναπαραγωγικὴ ἀποκατάστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF4","text":"Ἀπουσία φιλοσοφίας → ἀπώλεια θεωρητικῆς διοικήσεως → ζωικὴ ὑποβάθμισις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1","text":"Τὸ φύλον ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ φυσικὴν διαφοράν εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα ἠθικῆς μεταμορφώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME2","text":"Ἡ σεξουαλικὴ ἐπιθυμία ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ πάθος εἰς μηχανισμὸν γενέσεως, ὃς ὅμως διατηρεῖ ἀπειθῆ ἐσωτερικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME3","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ τυχαίαν βλάβην εἰς ἔνδειξιν ἀνεκπληρώτου τελεολογικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4","text":"Ἡ ταξινομία τῶν ζῴων ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἠθικὸς χάρτης τῶν τρόπων ζωῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία καθίσταται βιολογικῶς παραγωγικὴ δύναμις καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον θεωρητικὴ ἐνασχόλησις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT1","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφανειακὴ βαθμίς περιλαμβάνει τὴν γένεσιν γυναικῶν, πτηνῶν, χερσαίων καὶ θηριωδῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT2","text":"Ἡ δομικὴ βαθμίς συνδέει τὰ γεννητικὰ ὄργανα, τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν, τὴν νόσον καὶ τὴν γένεσιν εἰς ἕνα σωματικὸν σύστημα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3","text":"Ἡ μεταστρατηγικὴ βαθμίς μετατρέπει τὴν φιλοσοφίαν καὶ τὴν θεωρίαν τοῦ οὐρανοῦ εἰς κριτήριον ἀναβάσεως ἢ καταπτώσεως τοῦ ζῴου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT4","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ βαθμίς προϋποθέτει κόσμον ἐν ᾧ ἠθικὴ διάθεσις, ψυχικὴ διοίκησις, σωματικὴ μορφὴ καὶ εἶδος ἀποτελοῦσιν ἑνιαίαν αἰτιακὴν ἁλυσίδα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ βαθμίς συνδέει τὸν πρότερον βίον μὲ τὴν ὕστερον σωματικὴν μοῖραν διὰ μεταμορφωτικῆς γενεαλογίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν διάθεσιν εἰς ζωικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT2","text":"Ἡ κατασκευὴ τοῦ ἔρωτος ὡς ἀναπαραγωγικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ διατηρεῖ τὸν κεντρικὸν αἰτιακὸν ἄξονα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT3","text":"Ἡ ἀπειθὴς αὐτονομία τῶν γεννητικῶν μερῶν παραμένει ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῆς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ τῆς νόσου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4","text":"Ἡ ἱεράρχησις τῶν εἰδῶν ἀνασυντίθεται μόνον ἐὰν ἡ φιλοσοφία νοηθῇ ὡς ἀρχὴ σωματικῆς καὶ ὀντολογικῆς ἀνώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT5","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος ᾧ ἡ προηγουμένη ψυχὴ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς συγκεκριμένην σωματικὴν μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT6","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάσις παραμένει μεταξὺ τῆς ἀπειθοῦς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ τῆς θείας τελεολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πρώτη ἀντιστέκεται τῷ λόγῳ ἐνῶ ἡ δευτέρα τὴν ἐντάσσει εἰς τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT7","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ χωρίου, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἱεραρχικὴν καὶ τελεολογικὴν ἐρμηνείαν τῆς φύσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231832631663Z_6965a93a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 91","source_sha256":"e52093061e900b9494ebe23d484f4f4c6cbced86b27e7bf51c61695d1209a947","sha256":"11ccbef355141acd96276e695e08e64d6832cc12917ca410685902108f58babf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:18:32.634839+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS1","text":"The passage seeks to explain the generation of the sexes, desires, and animals through the preceding moral and intellectual order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS2","text":"The transformation from men into women and into other animals is assigned as proportionate to the prior manner of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS3","text":"The gods transform desire into an ensouled bodily mechanism, which aims at generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS4","text":"The reproductive impulse is established as a power partly disobedient to reason and possessing its own principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS5","text":"Unfruitful desire is transformed into bodily disease, until intercourse and generation are accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AS6","text":"The classification of sexes and animals follows gradations of moral and intellectual superiority and inferiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","text":"The soul is transformed according to the prior manner of life and the prior moral disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","text":"Cowardice and injustice bring about a transition into female nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","text":"The gods made the desire for intercourse as an instrument of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","text":"The semen and the generative parts are ensouled and moved by desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","text":"The generative parts are able to oppose reason and to gain mastery over the body through desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","text":"The womb has the nature of a desirous animal, oriented toward childbearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","text":"The womb's prolonged barrenness produces wandering, blockage of the passages, shortness of breath, and disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A8","text":"Intercourse unites the desires and brings about conception, gestation, and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","text":"The moral and intellectual disposition of the being determines the animal form that it receives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","text":"Philosophy and contemplation of the celestial nature constitute a higher mode of governance of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","text":"The abandonment of philosophy and contemplation degrades the soul into a terrestrial and beastly nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX1","text":"Reproduction does not constitute a neutral bodily event, but is interpreted through erotic desire and appetite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX2","text":"The generative part is not fully subject to reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX3","text":"The womb does not appear as a passive place of gestation, but as an ensouled desirous animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX4","text":"Barrenness is not a mere absence of generation, but an active bodily disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX5","text":"The kinds of animals are not independent of moral and intellectual order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:NX6","text":"Terrestrial beastly nature is not attributed to mere natural necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D1","text":"Female nature is constructed as the result of moral decline and at the same time as the bearer of reproductive desire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","CH_JP8E_S_67:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","text":"The desire for intercourse converts desire into a teleological motion toward generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D3","text":"Bodily pain is interpreted as a failure of the natural completion of reproduction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D4","text":"Desire can become an internal ruler when reason is unable to govern it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D5","text":"The moral quality of life is inscribed in the morphology and behavior of the species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:D6","text":"Theoretical engagement directed toward heaven functions as a criterion of distinction between avian and beastly nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD1","text":"The biology of the passage is reconstituted as a moral-cosmological hierarchy, in which body, soul, species, and moral disposition mutually produce one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2","text":"Desire is presented as a twofold power, at once disobedient to reason and serving the cosmic teleology of generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A3","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD3","text":"Disease acquires teleological meaning, because bodily disturbance is attributed to an unfulfilled natural function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SD4","text":"Anthropological difference is transformed into a cosmic scale of value, from philosophical contemplation to beastly life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX1","text":"Nature does not permit a complete distinction between psychic motive and bodily form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX2","text":"The body does not constitute an evaluatively indifferent substrate, but bears traces of prior psychic quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX3","text":"Reproduction cannot be understood without erotic desire, appetite, and final purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX4","text":"Illness is not recognized as an autonomous natural process without reference to the generative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX5","text":"An equal continuity among men, women, birds, and beasts is excluded by a hierarchical genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX1","text":"A world in which bodily form does not express moral or intellectual order is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX2","text":"A desire freely indifferent to generation and not integrated into a cosmic teleology is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX3","text":"A physiology without psychic evaluation and a disease without final meaning are excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX4","text":"The possibility that irrational desire constitutes an independent principle that is not reintegrated into the order of generation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS1","text":"Prior life → moral and intellectual quality → transformation of soul → assumption of a new animal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS2","text":"Divine construction → ensouled generative parts → reproductive desire → desire for intercourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS3","text":"Barrenness → wandering and blockage → disease → intercourse → conception and generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS4","text":"Lack of philosophy and contemplation → retreat of reason → domination of the lower parts of the soul → avian or beastly form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5","text":"Moral psychology is transformed into a genealogy of bodies and species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF1","text":"Moral failure → reincarnation → differentiation of sexes and species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF2","text":"Ensouled generative parts → disobedient desire → erotic desire → generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF3","text":"Unfulfilled natural impulse → bodily disease → reproductive restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:AF4","text":"Absence of philosophy → loss of theoretical governance → animal degradation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1","text":"Sex is reclassified from a natural difference into the result of moral transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME2","text":"Sexual desire is reclassified from a passion into a mechanism of generation, which nevertheless retains a disobedient internal power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME3","text":"Disease is reclassified from an accidental injury into an indication of an unfulfilled teleological function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4","text":"The taxonomy of animals is reclassified as a moral map of modes of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5","text":"Philosophy becomes a biologically productive power and not merely a theoretical occupation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT1","text":"The surface level includes the generation of women, birds, terrestrial animals, and beasts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT2","text":"The structural level connects the generative organs, desire, disease, and generation into one bodily system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3","text":"The metastrategic level transforms philosophy and contemplation of heaven into a criterion for the ascent or descent of the animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT4","text":"The ontological level presupposes a world in which moral disposition, governance of the soul, bodily form, and species constitute a unified causal chain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5","text":"The temporal level connects the prior life with the later bodily fate through a transformative genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT1","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from moral disposition to animal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT2","text":"The construction of erotic desire as a reproductive mechanism preserves the central causal axis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT3","text":"The disobedient autonomy of the generative parts remains necessary for the explanation of desire and disease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4","text":"The hierarchy of species is reconstructed only if philosophy is understood as a principle of bodily and ontological ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT5","text":"The precise manner in which the preceding soul is transformed into a particular bodily form is underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT6","text":"An internal tension remains between disobedient desire and divine teleology, because the former resists reason while the latter integrates it into generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the passage, but depends upon a hierarchical and teleological interpretation of nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_67:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_67@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_67:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 91"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 75","title":"Section 91","context":"Chapter 75","original_title":"Section 91","original_context":"Chapter 75"},"original_title":"Section 91","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68","layer":"CH","title":"Section 92","order":76,"parents":["RAW_JP8E_S_68"],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_68@R001","sha256":"d5ed27ce87e1d6129fadd8601474cecfdf53722e782f80d6ebf68a97726422a4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS1","text":"Ἡ ἀφροσύνη καὶ ἡ ἀργία μετασχηματίζουσι τὸ σῶμα κατὰ τὴν πρὸς γῆν ἕλξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ ἐκφράζει βαθμοὺς νοῦ καὶ ἀνοίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS3","text":"Ἡ ἐσχάτη ἀμάθεια ἀπολήγει εἰς ὑδρόβιον καὶ κατώτατον οἴκησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS4","text":"Τὰ ζῷα μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἄλληλα διὰ ἀποβολῆς καὶ κτήσεως νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS5","text":"Ἐκ τῆς ἱεραρχικῆς πληρώσεως θνητῶν καὶ ἀθανάτων συγκροτεῖται ὁ κόσμος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS6","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ὡς ἓν ὁρατὸν ζῷον ἀποτελεῖ αἰσθητὴν εἰκόνα τοῦ νοητοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ ἕξις τοῦ νοῦ ἢ τῆς ἀνοίας δύναται νὰ καθορίζῃ τὴν σωματικὴ μορφήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","text":"Ἡ ἀργία καὶ ἡ ἀφροσύνη ἕλκουσι τὰ ζῷα πρὸς τὴν γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A3","text":"Ἡ πρὸς γῆν ἕλξις ἐκδηλοῦται διὰ μορφολογικῆς συμπιέσεως καὶ ἀπώλειας ὀρθίας στάσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A4","text":"Ἡ πολυποδία καὶ ἡ τετραποδία εἰσὶν ἀποτελέσματα βαθύτερης προσδέσεως πρὸς τὸ γήινον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A5","text":"Ἡ ἀκραία ἀφροσύνη ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν χρείαν ποδῶν καὶ παράγει ἑρπετὸν τρόπον κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","text":"Ἡ ἐσχάτη ἀμάθεια ἀλλοιώνει οὐ μόνον τὸ σῶμα ἀλλὰ καὶ τὸ μέσον τῆς ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A7","text":"Ἡ καθαρὰ ἀναπνοὴ ἀέρος ἀνήκει σε ὑψηλότερη κατάσταση ψυχῆς, ἐνώ ἡ θολερὰ ὑδάτινη ἀναπνοὴ δηλοῖ κατώτατη κατάσταση.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A8","text":"Τὰ ἔνυδρα ζῷα καταλαμβάνουσι τὰς ἐσχάτας οἰκήσεις ὡς δίκην ἐσχάτης ἀμαθίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ μεταξὺ τῶν ζωικῶν εἰδῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ κτῆσιν ἢ ἀποβολὴν νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","text":"Ὁ κόσμος περιέχει ἅπαντα τὰ ὁρατὰ καὶ συνίσταται ἐκ θνητῶν καὶ ἀθανάτων ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A11","text":"Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι εἷς, μονογενής, ὁρατὸς καὶ τετελεσμένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A12","text":"Ὁ αἰσθητὸς κόσμος εἶναι εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεοῦ καὶ αἰσθητὸς θεός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX1","text":"Ἡ ζωικὴ διαφοροποίησις οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἀξιακῶς οὐδέτερον φυσικὸν πλῆθος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX2","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ οὐκ ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχικὴ ποιότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX3","text":"Ἡ ἀνοησία οὐκ ἀφήνει ἀμετάβλητον τὸν τρόπον κινήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX4","text":"Ἡ ἐσχάτη ἀμάθεια οὐκ ἀπολαύει καθαρᾶς ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX5","text":"Τὸ ἔνυδρον γένος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ὑψηλότερον ἢ ἰσότιμον οἴκημα πρὸς τὰ ἄλλα ζῷα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX6","text":"Ὁ κόσμος οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ ἄτακτον συνάθροισιν πολλῶν ἀνεξαρτήτων κόσμων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7","text":"Ἡ τελείωσις τοῦ παντὸς οὐκ ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ ἀπουσίας ἢ ἀποκλεισμοῦ τῶν θνητῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D1","text":"Ὅσον ἡ ἀφροσύνη αὐξάνει, τοσοῦτον ἡ ὀρθία καὶ ἀνθρώπινος κινητικὴ δομὴ ὑποχωρεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","CH_JP8E_S_68:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D2","text":"Ἡ μορφολογία τῶν ζῴων λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὁρατὴ κλίμαξ τῆς ψυχικῆς διαβαθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","CH_JP8E_S_68:A4","CH_JP8E_S_68:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D3","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ζωτικὸν μέσον εἰς δείκτη καθαρότητος ἢ ἀκαθαρσίας τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","CH_JP8E_S_68:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D4","text":"Ἡ χωρικὴ ἐγκατάστασις τῶν ζῴων ἐνσωματώνει τὴν ἠθικὴν ἀξίαν τῶν ψυχικῶν καταστάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","CH_JP8E_S_68:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","text":"Ἡ ζωικὴ φύσις παραμένει δυναμικὴ κλίμαξ καὶ οὐχὶ ἀμετάβλητος ταξινομία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","text":"Ἡ πληρότης τοῦ κόσμου προϋποθέτει τὴν συνύπαρξιν καὶ τῶν ὑψηλῶν καὶ τῶν κατωτάτων ζωικῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D7","text":"Ἡ ὁρατὴ πολλαπλότης ἀναφέρεται τελικῶς εἰς μίαν κοσμικὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ μορφολογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κοσμολογικὴν καὶ ἠθικὴν γραμματικήν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2","text":"Ἡ ἀπώλεια τοῦ νοῦ παράγει συγχρόνως σωματικὴν καθίζησιν, χωρικὴν ὑποβάθμισιν καὶ περιορισμὸν ζωτικῶν δυνατοτήτων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία τῶν ζῴων ἐνοποιεῖ ψυχήν, σῶμα, κίνησιν, ἀναπνοήν καὶ οἴκησιν ὑπὸ μίαν αἰτιακὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4","text":"Ἡ ἐξέλιξις τῶν ζωικῶν μορφῶν νοεῖται ὡς ἀμφίδρομος μεταβολὴ κατὰ τὴν κτῆσιν ἢ τὴν ἀποβολὴν τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","text":"Ἡ τελειότης τοῦ κόσμου περιλαμβάνει τὴν ἀτέλειαν τῶν μερῶν ὡς ἀναγκαῖον στοιχεῖον τῆς καθολικῆς πληρότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης λειτουργεῖ ὡς τελικὸς ὁρίζων ὅστις ἀνατάσσει τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν πολλαπλότητα εἰς μίαν εἰκόνα τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX1","text":"Ἡ φύσις οὐκ εἶναι αὐτόνομος μηχανὴ ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς ψυχικῆς ποιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX2","text":"Ἡ ἀμάθεια οὐκ εἶναι καθαρῶς ἐσωτερικὴ ἢ γνωσιολογικὴ κατάστασις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX3","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῶν εἰδῶν οὐκ ἐρμηνεύεται ὡς ἀξιακῶς ἀδιάφορος φυσικὸς μηχανισμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4","text":"Ὁ χώρος οὐκ εἶναι ὁμοιογενὴς ὑποδοχὴ σωμάτων, ἀλλὰ φορεὺς βαθμίδων καὶ συνεπειῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ τάξις οὐκ ἀποκλείει τὸ κατώτατον, ἀλλὰ τὸ ἐντάσσει εἰς τὴν ὁλότητα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX6","text":"Ἡ ἀτομικὴ ζωὴ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ τελικὸν μέτρον τῆς κοσμικῆς τελειότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX1","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης μορφῆς ἄνευ ἠθικῆς σημασίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX2","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει φυσικὸς κόσμος ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὸν νοῦν καὶ τὴν ἀνοίαν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX3","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀξία τοῦ ἀνοήτου ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος καὶ αὐτοτελὴς τρόπος ὑπάρξεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX4","text":"Ἡ ἀπολύτως ἀσύνδετος πολλαπλότης τοῦ παντὸς παραμένει ἀδιανόητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX5","text":"Ἡ ἀτελὴς ζωὴ δὲν ἔχει ἰδίαν τελικὴν σημασίαν ἔξωθεν τῆς κοσμικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS1","text":"Ψυχικὴ ἕξις → νοῦς ἢ ἀνοία → βαθμὸς προσδέσεως πρὸς γῆν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS2","text":"Ἀργία καὶ ἀφροσύνη → σωματικὴ συμπίεσις → τετραποδία, πολυποδία ἢ ἑρπυσμός.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3","text":"Ἐσχάτη ἀμάθεια → ἀκάθαρτος ψυχή → ὑδάτινη ἀναπνοή → ἰχθύες καὶ ὄστρεα.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4","text":"Κτῆσις ἢ ἀποβολὴ νοῦ → μεταβολὴ ζωικῆς μορφῆς → ἀμοιβαία μετάβασις τῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS5","text":"Θνητὰ καὶ ἀθάνατα ζῷα → συμπλήρωσις τοῦ παντός → ἓν ὁρατὸν ζῷον.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS6","text":"Ὁρατὸν ζῷον → εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ → αἰσθητὸς θεὸς, εἷς καὶ τετελεσμένος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF1","text":"Ἀφροσύνη καὶ ἀργία → γήινη ἕλξις → μορφολογικὴ ὑποβάθμισις → ὑδάτινη ἐσχατιά → μεταβολὴ διὰ νοῦ → κοσμικὴ πληρότης.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF2","text":"Ψυχικὴ ποιότης → σωματικὴ μορφή → τρόπος κινήσεως → μέσον ἀναπνοῆς → οἴκησις → θέση ἐν τῷ παντί.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3","text":"Ζωικὴ πολλαπλότης → ἱεραρχικὴ τάξις → ἑνιαία σύνθεσις → ὁρατὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1","text":"Ἡ μορφολογία ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ὁρατὴ ἠθικὴ καὶ νοητικὴ διαβάθμισις.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ ἐνιαίας ψυχοσωματικῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φύσεως καὶ τιμωρίας συγχωνεύεται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ἡ οἴκησις λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς δίκη τῆς ἀμαθίας.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME4","text":"Ἡ ζωικὴ ποικιλία παύει νὰ φαίνεται ὡς ἁπλὴ συνύπαρξις καὶ γίνεται ἀλληλουχία μεταπτώσεων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5","text":"Ἡ τελειότης τοῦ κόσμου μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἄριστον μέρος εἰς τὴν ὁλοκληρίαν τοῦ συνόλου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT1","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ γένη τῶν ζῴων διακρίνονται κατὰ μορφήν, κίνησιν καὶ οἴκησιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT2","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀνοησία παράγει καθίζησιν τοῦ σώματος καὶ περιορισμὸν τοῦ ζωτικοῦ μέσου.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT3","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ταξινομία τῶν ζῴων μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀφήγησιν ἀποβολῆς καὶ κτήσεως νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT4","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ αἰσθητὸν πᾶν νοεῖται ὡς ἑνιαία εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT5","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ζωικὴ τάξις παραμένει μεταβλητὴ κατὰ τὴν ἀλλαγὴν τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT1","text":"Αἱ ἀξίαι ἀρκούσιν ὥστε ἀνασυστήσασθαι τὴν βασικὴν αἰτιακὴν ἀκολουθίαν ἀπὸ τῆς ἀνοίας μέχρι τῆς ζωικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT2","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ βιολογικὴν περιγραφήν εἰς ἠθικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν τάξιν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT3","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς αἰτία καὶ ὁ φορεὺς τῶν μεταπλάσεων τῶν ζῴων.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT4","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ μένει ἡ σύνδεσις νοῦ, σώματος, ἀναπνοῆς καὶ οἰκήσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5","text":"Ἐντάσεις παραμένουσι μεταξὺ τῆς σταθερᾶς ἱεραρχίας τῶν εἰδῶν καὶ τῆς ἀμφίδρομου μεταβολῆς αὐτῶν.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6","text":"Ἄλλη ἔντασις παραμένει μεταξὺ τῆς τελειότητος τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου καὶ τῆς ἐν αὐτῷ διαρκῶς ἐνεργοῦ μεταπτώσεως.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231851594125Z_6375c079","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Section 92","source_sha256":"d5ed27ce87e1d6129fadd8601474cecfdf53722e782f80d6ebf68a97726422a4","sha256":"5b005474f8fceb004efaf95710027d2caa651963f5a61d150c1e1102c801183b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:18:51.597562+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS1","text":"Foolishness and idleness transform the body in accordance with its attraction toward the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS2","text":"Bodily form expresses degrees of intellect and unintelligence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS3","text":"Utter ignorance ends in an aquatic and lowest dwelling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS4","text":"Animals change into one another through the loss and acquisition of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS5","text":"The cosmos is constituted from the hierarchical completion of mortal and immortal beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AS6","text":"The cosmos, as one visible living creature, constitutes a perceptible image of the intelligible god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","text":"The psychic disposition of intellect or unintelligence can determine bodily form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","text":"Idleness and foolishness draw animals toward the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A3","text":"Attraction toward the earth manifests itself through morphological compression and loss of upright stance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A4","text":"Many-footedness and four-footedness are results of a deeper attachment to the earthly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A5","text":"Extreme foolishness removes the need for feet and produces a creeping mode of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","text":"Utter ignorance alters not only the body but also the medium of respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A7","text":"Pure respiration of air belongs to a higher condition of soul, whereas murky watery respiration indicates the lowest condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A8","text":"Aquatic animals occupy the lowest dwellings as the penalty of utter ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","text":"Change among animal species depends upon the acquisition or loss of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","text":"The cosmos contains all visible things and consists of mortal and immortal living creatures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A11","text":"The cosmos is one, unique, visible, and complete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:A12","text":"The perceptible cosmos is an image of the intelligible god and a perceptible god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX1","text":"Animal differentiation does not constitute an evaluatively neutral natural multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX2","text":"Bodily form is not separable from psychic quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX3","text":"Unintelligence does not leave the mode of movement unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX4","text":"Utter ignorance does not enjoy pure respiration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX5","text":"The aquatic kind does not constitute a higher or equivalent dwelling relative to the other animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX6","text":"The cosmos does not constitute a disorderly aggregation of many independent worlds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7","text":"The completion of the whole is not achieved through the absence or exclusion of mortal animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D1","text":"The more foolishness increases, the more the upright and human locomotive structure recedes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","CH_JP8E_S_68:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D2","text":"The morphology of animals functions as a visible scale of psychic gradation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1","CH_JP8E_S_68:A4","CH_JP8E_S_68:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D3","text":"Respiration is transformed from a vital medium into an indicator of purity or impurity of soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","CH_JP8E_S_68:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D4","text":"The spatial settlement of animals embodies the moral value of psychic states.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A2","CH_JP8E_S_68:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","text":"Animal nature remains a dynamic scale and not an unchanging taxonomy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","text":"The completeness of the cosmos presupposes the coexistence of both the highest and the lowest animal forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:D7","text":"Visible multiplicity is ultimately referred to one cosmic unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","text":"Natural morphology is transformed into a cosmological and moral grammar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2","text":"The loss of intellect simultaneously produces bodily sinking, spatial degradation, and limitation of vital capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","text":"The hierarchy of animals unifies soul, body, movement, respiration, and dwelling under one causal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4","text":"The evolution of animal forms is conceived as a bidirectional change according to the acquisition or loss of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","text":"The perfection of the cosmos includes the imperfection of its parts as a necessary element of universal completeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6","text":"Cosmic unity functions as a final horizon that reorders hierarchical multiplicity into one image of the intelligible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX1","text":"Nature is not an autonomous mechanism independent of psychic quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX2","text":"Ignorance is not a purely internal or epistemological condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX3","text":"The change of species is not interpreted as an evaluatively indifferent natural mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4","text":"Space is not a homogeneous receptacle of bodies, but a bearer of degrees and consequences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5","text":"The ontological order does not exclude the lowest, but integrates it into the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX6","text":"Individual life does not constitute the final measure of cosmic perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX1","text":"The possibility of form without moral significance is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX2","text":"A natural world indifferent to intellect and unintelligence is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX3","text":"The value of the unintelligent as an independent and self-sufficient mode of existence is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX4","text":"The absolutely unconnected multiplicity of the whole remains unthinkable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX5","text":"Imperfect life has no intrinsic final significance outside cosmic unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS1","text":"Psychic disposition → intellect or unintelligence → degree of attachment to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS2","text":"Idleness and foolishness → bodily compression → four-footedness, many-footedness, or creeping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3","text":"Utter ignorance → impure soul → watery respiration → fish and shellfish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4","text":"Acquisition or loss of intellect → change of animal form → reciprocal transition of animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS5","text":"Mortal and immortal living creatures → completion of the whole → one visible living creature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS6","text":"Visible living creature → image of the intelligible → perceptible god, one and complete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF1","text":"Foolishness and idleness → earthly attraction → morphological degradation → aquatic extremity → change through intellect → cosmic completeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF2","text":"Psychic quality → bodily form → mode of movement → medium of respiration → dwelling → position in the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3","text":"Animal multiplicity → hierarchical order → unified composition → visible image of the intelligible god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1","text":"Morphology is reclassified as a visible moral and intellectual gradation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2","text":"The distinction between soul and body is replaced by a unified psychosomatic causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","text":"The distinction between nature and punishment is merged, because form and dwelling function as the penalty of ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME4","text":"Animal diversity ceases to appear as mere coexistence and becomes a sequence of transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5","text":"The perfection of the cosmos is shifted from the best part to the integrity of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the kinds of animals are distinguished according to form, movement, and dwelling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, unintelligence produces the sinking of the body and limitation of the vital medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the taxonomy of animals is transformed into a narrative of the loss and acquisition of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, the entire perceptible realm is conceived as a unified image of the intelligible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT5","text":"At the temporal level, the animal order remains changeable according to the change of intellect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic causal sequence from unintelligence to animal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from biological description to moral and cosmological order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT3","text":"The precise cause and agent of the transformations of animals remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT4","text":"The connection of intellect, body, respiration, and dwelling remains internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5","text":"Tensions remain between the fixed hierarchy of species and their bidirectional change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6","text":"Another tension remains between the perfection of the one cosmos and the continuously active transition within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_JP8E_S_68:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_JP8E_S_68@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_JP8E_S_68:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Section 92"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 76","title":"Section 92","context":"Chapter 76","original_title":"Section 92","original_context":"Chapter 76"},"original_title":"Section 92","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 01–03","order":1,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SEC1","CH_JP8E_SE_2","CH_JP8E_SE_3"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_01@R001","sha256":"78e6ab6970b435ac9fa2447fb6d6abcc9217d3aeacda7f953ffa87f7dae3ef0b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ ὅπως ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης παραχθῇ οὐχὶ ἐκ ὁμοιομορφίας, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ ἀκριβοῦς ἀντιστοιχίας φύσεως, ἔργου καὶ λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία καὶ ἡ ἀνάμνησις μετατρέπουσι τὴν τοπικὴν συνομιλίαν εἰς μηχανὴν διατηρήσεως πολιτικῆς συνεχείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-03","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ διαφορά ἀρχικῶς διαιρεῖ τὰ ἔργα, εἶτα ἀνασχηματίζεται διὰ παιδείας καὶ κοινῆς ζωῆς εἰς ἑνιαῖον σῶμα φυλάκων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-04","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ὅριον στρατιωτικῆς προστασίας εἰς καθολικὴν πολιτικὴν, παιδευτικὴν καὶ βιολογικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κατάργησις κτήσεως, ἰδίας οἰκογενείας καὶ ἰδίας γενέσεως ἐπιχειρεῖ νὰ μεταβάλῃ τὴν κοινωνικὴν συγγένειαν εἰς πολιτικὸν κατασκεύασμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-06","text":"Ἡ θεωρητικὴ πολιτεία δὲν ἀρκείται εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ κίνησιν, πόλεμον καὶ ἐξωτερικὴν δοκιμασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-07","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ γνώσις κρίνεται ἐκ τῆς παιδείας, τοῦ τόπου, τῆς πράξεως καὶ τοῦ λόγου, ὥστε ἡ ἀφηρημένη πολυλογία νὰ ἀποκλείηται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σπειροειδής· ἡ διαίρεσις παράγει φύλαξιν, ἡ φύλαξις κοινότητα, ἡ κοινότης κρυφὸν σχεδιασμόν, καὶ ἡ πράξις ἐπανελέγχει τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολιτεία συγκροτεῖται διὰ διακεκριμένων φύσεων, ἔργων καὶ λειτουργιῶν, οὐ διὰ ἀδιακρίτου μίξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ πολιτικὴ συνέχεια δύναται νὰ διατηρῆται διὰ ἀναπληρώσεως τοῦ ἀπόντος καὶ ἀναμνήσεως τῶν προτέρων ὅρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ φύλαξ ἔχει ἀποκλειστικὴν λειτουργίαν προστασίας, ἡ ὁποία περιλαμβάνει ἔσωθεν καὶ ἔξωθεν ἀπειλάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φύλαξις ἀπαιτεῖ συνδυασμὸν πραότητος πρὸς τοὺς οἰκείους καὶ χαλεπότητος πρὸς τοὺς ἐχθρούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ παιδεία δὲν μεταδίδει μόνον γνώσεις, ἀλλὰ κατασκευάζει τὴν διπλὴν διάθεσιν καὶ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἱκανότητα τοῦ φύλακος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίας κτήσεως καὶ ἰδίας βιοτῆς ἀποσκοπεῖ εἰς τὴν ἀπερίσπαστον πολιτικὴν ἀφοσίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης ἀνασχηματίζει τὴν φυσικὴν οἰκογένειαν εἰς κοινὴν συγγένειαν ἐλεγχόμενην ὑπὸ τῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φύσις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κριτήριον κατανομῆς ἔργων εἰς ὕλην παιδευτικοῦ καὶ ἀναπαραγωγικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πόλις εἶναι ζῶσα κίνησις, ἧς ἡ ταυτότης ἀποδεικνύεται διὰ ἀγῶνος καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ λόγος περὶ πολιτείας ὀφείλει νὰ μετασχηματίζηται εἰς πράξιν, πολεμικὴν δοκιμασίαν καὶ προσήκουσαν διερμηνείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀληθὴς πολιτικὴ γνώσις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ οἰκείαν τροφήν, τόπον, πράξιν καὶ πολιτικὴν ἐμπειρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ συστήματος παράγεται ἐκ συντονισμοῦ διαφοροποιημένων λειτουργιῶν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενης κοινότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν ἔργων ἐπανέρχεται σταθερῶς, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν κοινωνικὴν κατανομήν εἰς ὅλον τὸν σχεδιασμὸν τοῦ πολιτικοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς φύσεως μετακινείται ἀπὸ προϋπάρχουσαν καταλληλότητα εἰς δύναμιν ἣν ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ ἀρχὴ ρυθμίζουσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-03","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ ἐπανέρχεται ὡς στρατιώτης, ὡς παιδευόμενος χαρακτήρ, ὡς κοινόβιος καὶ ὡς φορεὺς πολιτικῆς κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ κοινότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ συντονισμὸν ἀνομοίων λειτουργιῶν εἰς ὁμοιοποίησιν τοῦ βίου τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἰδιωτικότης ἀντιστρέφει τὸ πρόσημον αὐτῆς· ἀπὸ πιθανὴ φυσικὴ ἀξίωσις γίνεται κίνδυνος διαιρέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-06","text":"Ὁ λόγος μετακινείται ἀπὸ μέσον μνήμης καὶ συνεχείας εἰς ὄργανον ἐλέγχου τῆς πράξεως καὶ τῆς πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-07","text":"Ὁ πόλεμος μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ἀπειλὴν εἰς κριτήριον ἀληθείας τῆς πολιτείας καὶ τοῦ περὶ αὐτῆς λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία, ἀρχικῶς τοπικὸν κενόν, ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς γενικωτέραν θεωρίαν θεσμικῆς ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ πολιτικῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὴ παραμένει ἡ συγκεκριμένη ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ ἀπόντος κοινωνοῦ· ἐπὶ τοῦ παρόντος ἐπιπέδου γίνεται πρότυπον θεσμικῆς συνεχείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-02","text":"Τοπικαὶ παραμένουν αἱ λεπτομέρειαι τροφῆς, κτήσεως, γάμου καὶ παιδοποιίας· ἡ διαβαθμισμένη ἀφαίρεσις τῆς ἰδιωτικότητος ὅμως κλιμακοῦται εἰς ἀρχὴν πολιτικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις γεωργῶν, τεχνιτῶν καὶ πολεμιστῶν κλιμακοῦται εἰς γενικὴν ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἕκαστος ἔχει ἓν οἰκεῖον πολιτικὸν ἔργον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ διπλὴ διάθεσις τοῦ φύλακος γεφυροῖ τὴν πρώτη ἀμυντικὴν λειτουργίαν μὲ τὴν ὕστερον παιδευτικὴν κατασκευήν τοῦ χαρακτῆρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ κρυφία σύζευξις καὶ ἡ φαινομένη τύχη εἶναι κατώτερη μηχανὴ, ἀλλὰ ἐπὶ τοῦ cluster ἀναφαίνονται ὡς ὑπόδειγμα κρυφῆς διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις οἰκείας πόλεως δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ τοπικὴ ἀδυναμία, ἀλλὰ καταλύτης μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ῥητορικὴν ἐπάρκειαν εἰς τὴν ἐνσώματον κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀκίνητος εἰκὼν τῆς πόλεως ὑπερβαίνεται· ἡ τρέχουσα σύνθεσις ἀπαιτεῖ πόλιν κινουμένην, ἀγωνιζομένην καὶ αὐτοελεγχόμενην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται πολιτεία ἣ συγχέει ἀδιακρίτως τὰ ἔργα καὶ τὰς φύσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἰδιωτικὴν κτῆσιν, ἰδίαν οἰκογένειαν καὶ ἀτομικὴν γενεαλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ὁ φύλαξ ὁ ὁριζόμενος μόνον ὑπὸ ἐξωτερικῶν πολεμίων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πόλις ἀπειλεῖται καὶ ἔσωθεν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ πραότης ὡς ἀδιάκριτος ἀδυναμία, ὥσπερ καὶ ἡ χαλεπότης ὡς καθολικὴ στάσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται πολιτεία ἣ μένει μόνον ἐν γεγραμμένῳ λόγῳ καὶ οὐκ ὑπομένει ἀγῶνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ὁ οὐδέτερος παρατηρητής, ὁ ὁποῖος ἀξιολογεῖ τὴν πόλιν ἄνευ τόπου, τροφῆς καὶ συμμετοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-07","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀνεξέλεγκτος τύχη ὡς ἀρχὴ κοινωνικῆς ἀναπαραγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ πόλις δύναται νὰ ἑνωθῇ διὰ ἀνεξέλεγκτης ἐναλλαγῆς ρόλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν φυσικὴν αὐτάρκειαν τῆς ἰδιωτικῆς οἰκογενείας, ἐὰν ἡ πολιτικὴ συγγένεια μέλλῃ νὰ γενικευθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ ἀποκλείεσθαι ἡ διάστασις θεωρίας καὶ πράξεως, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἀποδεικνύεται μόνον διὰ τῶν ἔργων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ ἀποκλείεσθαι τὴν ἀφηρημένην πολιτικὴν ἱκανότητα, ἣν ἡ πολυλογία ἀξιοῖ ἄνευ οἰκείας πολιτείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ ἀποκλείεσθαι τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης γεννᾶται ἄνευ ἐλέγχου τῶν δεσμῶν, τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν καὶ τῶν γενεῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-06","text":"Δεῖ ἀποκλείεσθαι τὴν ἀνεπιτήρητον φυσικὴν ἀναπαραγωγήν, ἐὰν ἡ φύσις ἀποτελῇ ὕλην πολιτικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα περιβάλλεται ὑπὸ τῆς ἀπουσίας καθολικοῦ πολιτικοῦ λόγου ἀνεξαρτήτου τόπου, τροφῆς καὶ ἐμπειρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται πολιτικὴ ἑνότης ἣ οὔτε διαιρεῖ τὰ ἔργα οὔτε ἐλέγχει τὰς ἰδιωτικὰς προσδέσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀνεξαρτήτου φυσικῆς συγγενείας καθιστᾷ τὴν πολιτικὴν συγγένειαν ἀναγκαίαν, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐξαρτωμένην ἀπὸ ἀμνησίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-04","text":"Τὸ ἀδύνατον ἄνευ τοῦ ὁποίου τὸ σύστημα καταρρέει εἶναι πόλις ἡ ὁποία ἀξιολογεῖται μόνον ἐκ τοῦ λόγου καὶ οὐδέποτε ἐκ τῆς πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-05","text":"Ὁ βαθύτερος κενὸς τόπος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ πλήρης νομιμοποίησις τῆς ἱεραρχικῆς διοικήσεως, ἣ ὑπονοεῖται ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀποδεικνύεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-01","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀρχικῶς ἑνοῦται διὰ λειτουργικῆς διαφοροποιήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ τάξις τῶν φυλάκων ἑνοῦται ὕστερον διὰ καταργήσεως τῆς ἰδιωτικότητος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","CL_JP8E_01:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-02","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ γίνεται ὅχι μόνον ὅριον μεταξὺ φίλου καὶ ἐχθροῦ, ἀλλὰ μηχανὴ ἣ ἐνοποιεῖ παιδείαν, βίον, συγγένειαν καὶ ἀναπαραγωγήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-03","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ συγγένεια δὲν παράγεται ἁπλῶς ἐκ κοινῆς ζωῆς, ἀλλὰ ἐκ συστηματικῆς ἀγνοίας τῆς ἀτομικῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπαίτησις ἐνσώματου πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας ἐπαναφέρει τὴν παιδείαν τοῦ φύλακος ὡς ἀρχὴν ἐλέγχου τῆς πόλεως, οὐχὶ μόνον ὡς ἐσωτερικὴν ἀγωγήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","CL_JP8E_01:GA-10","CL_JP8E_01:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-05","text":"Ἡ φύσις ἀφ᾽ ἑνὸς θεμελιώνει τὴν κατανομήν, ἀφ᾽ ἑτέρου γίνεται ἀντικείμενον ἐπιλογῆς· οὕτως ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις περιέχει ἤδη πολιτικὴν τεχνολογίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6","CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ καὶ ἐξωτερικὴ ἀπειλή, συνδεθεῖσαι μὲ τὴν πολεμικὴν δοκιμασίαν, καθιστῶσι τὴν πόλιν ὁντότητα ἣ ὁρίζεται διὰ συνεχοῦς ἀντιπαραθέσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","CL_JP8E_01:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἅμα φανερὰν κοινότητα καὶ κρυφὴν διοίκησιν, ὥστε ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις νὰ στηρίζηται εἰς παραγωγικὴν ἀντίφασιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CL_JP8E_01:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SE_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία γίνεται μηχανὴ μετασχηματισμοῦ φυσικῶν διαφορών εἰς διοικησίμους πολιτικὰς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης ἀναφαίνεται ὡς διπλὴ κίνησις: διαφοροποιεῖ τὴν πόλιν συνολικῶς, ἀλλὰ ὁμοιοποιεῖ ἐσωτερικῶς τὸ σῶμα τῶν φυλάκων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ κοινωνικὴν τάξιν εἰς βιοπολιτικὸν ὄργανον, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀποστολὴ αὐτοῦ ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς βίον, δεσμούς, γένεσιν καὶ κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἐξουσία δὲν ἐλέγχει μόνον πράξεις, ἀλλὰ καὶ τοὺς ὅρους ὑφ᾽ οἷς οἱ ἄνθρωποι αἰσθάνονται συγγενεῖς, ἴσοι καὶ ἱκανοί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ γνώσις ἀποκτᾷ κύρος μόνον ὅταν ἡ γλῶσσα ἐπιστρέφῃ εἰς τόπον, τροφήν, πράξιν καὶ ἀγῶνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαράστασις τῆς ἰδανικῆς πόλεως ἀναγκάζεται νὰ καταστήσῃ ὁρατὴν τὴν ἀγωνίαν, τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν δοκιμασίαν καὶ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἐνσώματον γνώσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ δομὴ παράγει πολιτείαν ἣ ἀναπαράγει ἑαυτὴν διὰ παιδείας, κοινότητος, κρυφῆς ρυθμίσεως καὶ συνεχῶς ἐπαναλαμβανομένης δοκιμασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-01","text":"Φυσικὴ διαφορά → διαίρεσις ἔργων → φύλαξις → κοινὸς βίος φυλάκων → ἐνιαία πολιτικὴ λειτουργία → ἐπανεπιβεβαίωσις τῆς διαφοράς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-02","text":"Ἀνάγκη ἀρετῆς → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδιωτικότητος → ἀπαλλαγὴ ἀπὸ περισπασμούς → κοινότης → ἐντονώτερος ἔλεγχος τοῦ βίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-03","text":"Κοινὴ συγγένεια → ἄγνοια ἀτομικῆς γενέσεως → κρυφὴ ἀναπαραγωγικὴ διοίκησις → φαινομένη τύχη → ἐπανίδρυσις κοινῆς συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-04","text":"Παιδεία → διάθεσις → πράξις → ἐξωτερικὴ δοκιμασία → ἀπόδειξις ἢ διάψευσις τῆς παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-05","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις → πολεμικὴ κίνησις → ἀνάγκη ἐμπειρίας → ἔλεγχος τοῦ λόγου → ἀναθεώρησις τοῦ τί ἐστιν πολιτικὴ γνώσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἰδέα τῆς ἀρίστης πολιτείας λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἑλκτικὸς πόλος, πρὸς ὃν ἐπιστρέφουσιν ἡ διαίρεσις, ἡ κοινότης, ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ καὶ ἡ δοκιμασία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-07","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία τοῦ θεωρητικοῦ σχεδίου σπείρεται εἰς κίνησιν, ὅταν ἡ πόλις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀποδείξῃ ἑαυτὴν ἐν πολέμῳ καὶ λόγῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B01","text":"Ἀπουσία ἢ ἀσυνέχεια → ἀναπλήρωσις καὶ ἀνάμνησις → διατήρησις κοινοῦ πολιτικοῦ ἔργου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B02","text":"Φυσικὴ διαφορότης → λειτουργικὴ διαίρεσις → ἀποκλειστικὴ φυλακὴ → ἱεράρχησις πολιτικῶν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B03","text":"Διπλὴ φύσις τοῦ φύλακος → παιδεία → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδιωτικοῦ βίου → κοινὸς πολιτικὸς χαρακτήρ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B04","text":"Κοινότης κτήσεως, γάμου καὶ παιδοποιίας → ἄγνοια ἰδίας γενέσεως → κατασκευὴ πολιτικῆς συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B05","text":"Ἰδανικὴ πολιτεία → κίνησις καὶ ἀγών → ἀπόδοσις παιδείας διὰ πράξεως καὶ λόγου → ἔλεγχος μιμήσεως καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B06","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ διάρθρωσις + κοινὸς βίος + κρυφὴ διοίκησις + ἐξωτερικὴ δοκιμασία → πολιτεία ἣ ἀναπαράγει καὶ ἐλέγχει ἑαυτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀπουσία κοινωνοῦ → ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ κενοῦ → ἀνάμνησις πολιτικοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀνάμνησις συνεχείας → διάκρισις φύσεων καὶ ἔργων → ἀνάθεσις τῆς φυλακῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B03","text":"Φύλαξις → παιδευτικὴ σύνθεσις πραότητος καὶ χαλεπότητος → κοινὸς βίος καὶ κατάργησις ἰδιωτικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B04","text":"Κοινὸς βίος → πολιτικὴ συγγένεια → κρυφὴ διοίκησις τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B05","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις → κίνησις καὶ πόλεμος → ἐξωτερικὴ δοκιμασία τῆς πολιτείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B06","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ δοκιμασία → ἀνάγκη οἰκείας ἐμπειρίας → ἀποχωρισμὸς πολιτικῆς γνώσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀφηρημένην πολυλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-01","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἄθροισμα προσώπων εἰς λειτουργικῶς διῃρημένον καὶ ἀμοιβαίως ἐξαρτώμενον ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-02","text":"Ἡ φυλακὴ μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ στρατιωτικὴν ἐνασχόλησιν εἰς καθολικὴν λειτουργίαν διατηρήσεως τοῦ πολιτικοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-03","text":"Ἡ οἰκογένεια παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀφετηρία πολιτικῆς ἑνότητος καὶ γίνεται ἀντικείμενον θεσμικοῦ ἀνασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναπαραγωγὴ ἐντάσσεται εἰς τὴν πολιτικὴν τεχνολογίαν, ἐνῶ ἡ τύχη ἀποκαλύπτεται ὡς περίβλημα ἐπιλογῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λόγου καὶ πράξεως ὑποχωρεῖ, διότι ὁ λόγος πολιτείας κρίνεται διὰ τῶν ἔργων αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-06","text":"Ἡ μίμησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα τροφῆς, τόπου καὶ πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀφηρημένη δεξιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-07","text":"Ἡ ἀξιολόγησις τῆς πολιτείας μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὸν ἔπαινον εἰς τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν δοκιμασίαν καὶ τὴν ἐνσώματον ἱκανότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα ρυθμίζει ἔργα, φύλακας, κτῆσιν, γάμον, παιδοποιίαν, πόλεμον καὶ ἔπαινον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ διάρθρωσις τῶν λειτουργιῶν συνδέεται μὲ κοινὸν βίον, κοινὴν συγγένειαν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενην ἀναπαραγωγήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ πολιτικὴ κυριαρχία ἐμφανίζεται ὡς διοίκησις τῶν ὅρων ὑφ᾽ οἷς παράγονται ἑνότης, ἀρετὴ καὶ κρίσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, ἡ ταυτότης τοῦ προσώπου ἀποσπᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἰδίαν γένεσιν καὶ ἐγγράφεται εἰς τεταγμένην πολιτικὴν γενεαλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς καὶ performatively, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ συστήματος μιμεῖται τὴν ἀρχήν του, ἐπειδὴ ἀνασυνθέτει τὸ ὅλον διὰ ἀναπληρώσεως, ἐπαναλήψεως καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-01","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἐπικαλεῖται τὴν φύσιν ὡς θεμέλιον, ἀλλὰ συγχρόνως ἀνασχηματίζει τὴν φύσιν διὰ παιδείας καὶ ἀναπαραγωγικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-02","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ συγγένεια ἀπαιτεῖ κοινότητα, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀμνησίαν· ἡ ἑνότης οὖν παράγεται διὰ γνώσεως καὶ ἀγνοίας συγχρόνως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-03","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη ἰσότης τῶν φυλάκων συνυπάρχει μὲ κρυφὴν ἱεράρχησιν τῶν ἀρχόντων, ὥστε ἡ κοινότης νὰ μὴν εἶναι διαφανής.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπαίτησις οἰκείας πολιτικῆς ἐμπειρίας ἰσχυροποιεῖ τὸν ἔλεγχον τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀπειλεῖ νὰ περιορίσῃ τὴν ἐμβέλειαν τῆς πολιτικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-05","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία θέλει νὰ ἀποκλείσῃ τὴν τύχην, ἀλλὰ χρειάζεται τὴν φαινομένην τύχην ὡς κάλυμμα τῆς διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-01","text":"Ἡ φύσις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀνακαλυπτόμενον κριτήριον εἰς διοικούμενον ἀντικείμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-02","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὸν προστάτην εἰς μηχανὴν παραγωγῆς πολιτικοῦ χαρακτῆρος καὶ συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-03","text":"Ἡ κοινότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀμοιβαῖον συντονισμὸν εἰς ἐλεγχόμενην ἀμνησίαν καὶ ὁμοιοποίησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-04","text":"Ἡ πόλις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀκίνητον σχέδιον εἰς ζῷον κινούμενον, ὅπερ ἀποδεικνύει τὴν ταυτότητα αὐτοῦ διὰ πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-05","text":"Ὁ λόγος μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀνάμνησιν θεμελιωδῶν ὅρων εἰς ἐργαλεῖον ἐλέγχου τῆς πολιτικῆς ἐπάρκειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς ζῶσα πολιτικὴ μηχανή, ἣ μετατρέπει φύσεις, δεσμούς καὶ κινήσεις εἰς λειτουργικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος, καὶ μάλιστα ὁ φύλαξ, γίνεται κόμβος ἐν δικτύῳ παιδείας, κοινότητος, ἀναπαραγωγῆς καὶ πολεμικῆς ἐτοιμότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἀναπαραγωγικός· ἡ πολιτεία συντηρεῖται μόνον ἐὰν ἀναπαιδεύῃ, ἀναπαράγῃ καὶ ἐπανεξετάζῃ ἑαυτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ στρατηγικὴ δὲν εἶναι ἡ ἁπλῆ ἀπόδρασις, ἀλλὰ ἡ πλοήγησις μεταξὺ διαφοροποιήσεως, κοινοποιήσεως, κρυφῆς διοικήσεως καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς δοκιμασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν λειτουργικὴν διαίρεσιν πρὸς τὴν ἐνσώματον καὶ πολεμικὴν δοκιμασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἐλάχιστη ἀκολουθία εἶναι ἀναπλήρωσις → ἀνάμνησις → διαίρεσις → φύλαξις → κοινότης → ἀγών → ἐμπειρικὸς ἔλεγχος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν φύσεως, ἔργου, παιδείας καὶ πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B04","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀπόδειξις τῆς φυσικῆς καταλληλότητος, ἡ νομιμοποίησις τῆς ἱεραρχίας καὶ τὰ ὅρια τῆς κρυφίας διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὸ παραγωγικὸν σχήμα, ἀλλὰ ἀναγκαίως ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀποσιώπησιν, ἀκολουθίαν καὶ ῥητορικὴν συμπίεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B06","text":"Ἀνθεκτικὸν ἀξίωμα μένει ἡ ἐξάρτησις τοῦ λόγου ἀπὸ τὴν πράξιν· ἀνθεκτικὴ δὲ ἀντίστασις μένει ἡ ἀπόδειξις ὅτι ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ κοινότης εἶναι δικαία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231923978589Z_8309d903","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 01–03","source_sha256":"78e6ab6970b435ac9fa2447fb6d6abcc9217d3aeacda7f953ffa87f7dae3ef0b","sha256":"17013c50fdb96ac3c6a3492b1344101be0951bdf5f09244f85e580515245aea2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:19:23.981433+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-01","text":"The system seeks for political unity to be produced not from uniformity, but from the precise correspondence of nature, function, and operation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-02","text":"Absence and recollection transform local conversation into a mechanism for preserving political continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-03","text":"Natural difference initially divides functions, then is reshaped through education and common life into a unified body of guardians.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-04","text":"The guardian passes from the boundary of military protection into a comprehensive political, educational, and biological function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-05","text":"The abolition of property, private family, and individual birth attempts to transform social kinship into a political construction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-06","text":"The theoretical constitution is not content with internal order, but requires movement, war, and external testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-07","text":"Political knowledge is judged from education, place, action, and speech, so that abstract verbosity is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AS-08","text":"The movement of the system is spiral-shaped: division produces guardianship, guardianship community, community hidden planning, and action retests the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The constitution is constituted through distinct natures, functions, and operations, not through indiscriminate mixture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Political continuity can be preserved through replacement of what is absent and recollection of prior terms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The guardian has the exclusive function of protection, which includes threats within and without.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Guardianship requires a combination of gentleness toward one's own and harshness toward enemies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Education does not merely transmit knowledge, but constructs the guardian's double disposition and political capacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The removal of private property and private life aims at undistracted political devotion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Political unity reshapes the natural family into common kinship controlled by rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Nature passes from a criterion for allocating functions into material for educational and reproductive planning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] The city is a living movement, whose identity is demonstrated through struggle and external relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Discourse concerning the constitution must be transformed into action, military testing, and fitting interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] True political knowledge depends upon proper nourishment, place, action, and political experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The unity of the system is produced from coordination of differentiated functions and controlled community.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-01","text":"The division of functions recurs steadily, but mutates from a simple social allocation into the entire design of the political body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-02","text":"The concept of nature shifts from pre-existing suitability into a capacity regulated by education and rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-03","text":"The guardian recurs as soldier, as an educated character, as one living in common, and as bearer of political judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-04","text":"Community mutates from coordination of dissimilar functions into homogenization of the guardians' life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-05","text":"Privacy reverses its valence: from a possible natural claim it becomes a danger of division.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-06","text":"Speech shifts from a means of memory and continuity into an instrument for testing action and political experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-07","text":"War changes from an external threat into a criterion of the truth of the constitution and of the discourse concerning it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RMD-08","text":"Absence, initially a local void, is absorbed into a more general theory of institutional replacement and political memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-01","text":"The specific replacement of the absent companion remains local; at the present level it becomes a model of institutional continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-02","text":"The details of nourishment, property, marriage, and procreation remain local; yet the graduated removal of privacy escalates into a principle of political unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-03","text":"The distinction among farmers, craftsmen, and warriors escalates into the general principle that each has one proper political function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-04","text":"The guardian's double disposition bridges the initial defensive function with the later educational construction of character.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-05","text":"Secret coupling and apparent chance are a lower mechanism, but at the cluster level they emerge as a model of hidden administration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-06","text":"The lack of one's own city is not a simple local weakness, but a catalyst for transition from rhetorical adequacy to embodied judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:CGD-07","text":"The motionless image of the city is surpassed; the present synthesis requires a city in motion, struggling, and self-testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-01","text":"A constitution that indiscriminately confuses functions and natures is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-02","text":"The idea that political unity requires private property, private family, and individual genealogy is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-03","text":"The guardian defined solely by external enemies is rejected, since the city is also threatened from within.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-04","text":"Gentleness as indiscriminate weakness is rejected, as is harshness as a universal disposition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-05","text":"A constitution that remains only in written discourse and does not endure struggle is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-06","text":"The neutral observer, who evaluates the city without place, nourishment, and participation, is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:GNX-07","text":"Uncontrolled chance as a principle of social reproduction is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-01","text":"The hypothesis that the city can be united through uncontrolled interchange of roles must be false.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-02","text":"The natural self-sufficiency of the private family must be false, if political kinship is to be universalized.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-03","text":"The separation of theory and practice must be excluded, since discourse is demonstrated only through deeds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-04","text":"Abstract political competence, which verbosity claims without a proper constitution, must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-05","text":"The idea that political unity arises without control of bonds, desires, and generations must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:DBN-06","text":"Unsupervised natural reproduction must be excluded, if nature constitutes material for political planning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-01","text":"The system is encompassed by the absence of a universal political discourse independent of place, nourishment, and experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-02","text":"Political unity that neither divides functions nor controls private attachments becomes impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-03","text":"The absence of independent natural kinship makes political kinship necessary, but also dependent upon forgetting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-04","text":"The impossibility without which the system collapses is a city evaluated only from discourse and never from action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSA-05","text":"The system's deepest empty place is the complete legitimation of hierarchical administration, which is implied but not demonstrated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-01","text":"The city is initially united through functional differentiation, but the class of guardians is subsequently united through abolition of privacy.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","CL_JP8E_01:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-02","text":"The guardian becomes not only a boundary between friend and enemy, but a mechanism unifying education, life, kinship, and reproduction.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-03","text":"Universal kinship is produced not simply from common life, but from systematic ignorance of individual birth.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_2:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-04","text":"The requirement of embodied political experience restores the guardian's education as a principle for testing the city, not merely as internal upbringing.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-05","CL_JP8E_01:GA-10","CL_JP8E_01:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-05","text":"Nature, on the one hand, grounds allocation; on the other, becomes an object of selection; thus natural order already contains political technology.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6","CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-06","text":"Internal and external threat, joined to military testing, make the city an entity defined through continual confrontation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-03","CL_JP8E_01:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:XD-07","text":"Unity requires both manifest community and hidden administration, so that political order rests upon a productive contradiction.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-07","CL_JP8E_01:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SE_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-01","text":"The constitution becomes a mechanism for transforming natural differences into administrable political functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-02","text":"Political unity appears as a double movement: it differentiates the city as a whole, but internally homogenizes the body of guardians.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-03","text":"The guardian is transformed from a social class into a biopolitical instrument, since its mission extends to life, bonds, birth, and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-04","text":"Political power controls not only actions, but also the conditions under which people feel themselves kin, equal, and capable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-05","text":"Political knowledge acquires authority only when language returns to place, nourishment, action, and struggle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_3:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-06","text":"The representation of the ideal city is compelled to make visible anxiety, external testing, and embodied political knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:SD4","CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:BSD-07","text":"The overall structure produces a constitution that reproduces itself through education, community, hidden regulation, and continually repeated testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-01","text":"Natural difference → division of functions → guardianship → common life of guardians → unified political function → reconfirmation of difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-02","text":"Need for virtue → removal of privacy → release from distractions → community → more intense control of life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-03","text":"Common kinship → ignorance of individual birth → hidden reproductive administration → apparent chance → re-establishment of common kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-04","text":"Education → disposition → action → external testing → confirmation or refutation of education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-05","text":"Internal order → military movement → need for experience → testing of discourse → revision of what political knowledge is.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-06","text":"The idea of the best constitution functions as an attractive pole, to which division, community, reproduction, and testing return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:RLE-07","text":"The immobility of the theoretical design is sown into movement when the city is compelled to prove itself in war and discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B01","text":"Absence or discontinuity → replacement and recollection → preservation of common political function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B02","text":"Natural diversity → functional division → exclusive guardianship → hierarchy of political functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B03","text":"Double nature of the guardian → education → removal of private life → common political character.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B04","text":"Community of property, marriage, and procreation → ignorance of one's own birth → construction of political kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B05","text":"Ideal constitution → movement and struggle → rendering of education through action and discourse → testing of imitation and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FGS-B06","text":"Internal structure + common life + hidden administration + external testing → a constitution that reproduces and tests itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B01","text":"Absence of a companion → replacement of the void → recollection of political discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B02","text":"Recollection of continuity → distinction of natures and functions → assignment of guardianship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B03","text":"Guardianship → educational synthesis of gentleness and harshness → common life and abolition of privacy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B04","text":"Common life → political kinship → hidden administration of birth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B05","text":"Internal order → movement and war → external testing of the constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:AFM-B06","text":"External testing → need for proper experience → separation of political knowledge from abstract verbosity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-01","text":"The city is reclassified from an aggregate of persons into a functionally divided and mutually dependent whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-02","text":"Guardianship is transformed from a military occupation into a comprehensive function of preserving the political body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-03","text":"The family ceases to be the starting point of political unity and becomes an object of institutional reshaping.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-04","text":"Reproduction is incorporated into political technology, while chance is disclosed as a covering for selection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-05","text":"The distinction between discourse and action recedes, because discourse about the constitution is judged through its deeds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-06","text":"Imitation is reclassified as the result of nourishment, place, and political experience, not as an abstract skill.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MME-07","text":"Evaluation of the constitution is transferred from praise to external testing and embodied capacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface, the system regulates functions, guardians, property, marriage, procreation, war, and praise.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, the articulation of functions is connected with common life, common kinship, and controlled reproduction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, political sovereignty appears as administration of the conditions under which unity, virtue, and judgment are produced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the identity of the person is detached from individual birth and inscribed in an ordered political genealogy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically and performatively, the form of the system imitates its principle, since it recomposes the whole through replacement, repetition, and transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-01","text":"Political order invokes nature as foundation, but simultaneously reshapes nature through education and reproductive planning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-02","text":"Universal kinship requires community, but also forgetting; unity is therefore produced through knowledge and ignorance simultaneously.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-03","text":"The apparent equality of the guardians coexists with a hidden hierarchy of rulers, so that community is not transparent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-04","text":"The requirement of proper political experience strengthens the testing of discourse, but threatens to restrict the scope of political knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:FL-05","text":"The constitution wishes to exclude chance, but needs apparent chance as a cover for administration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-01","text":"Nature mutates from a criterion to be discovered into an object to be administered.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-02","text":"The guardian mutates from an external protector into a mechanism for producing political character and kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-03","text":"Community mutates from mutual coordination into controlled forgetting and homogenization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-04","text":"The city mutates from an immobile design into a living creature in motion, which demonstrates its identity through action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MP-05","text":"Discourse mutates from recollection of fundamental terms into an instrument for testing political adequacy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a living political machine, transforming natures, bonds, and movements into functional order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-02","text":"The human being, and especially the guardian, becomes a node in a network of education, community, reproduction, and military readiness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-03","text":"The time of the system is reproductive: the constitution is sustained only if it re-educates, reproduces, and re-examines itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:HSI-04","text":"The possible strategy is not simple escape, but navigation between differentiation, communalization, hidden administration, and external testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal movement from functional division toward embodied and military testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B02","text":"The minimal sequence is replacement → recollection → division → guardianship → community → struggle → empirical testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is coherent with respect to the correspondence of nature, function, education, and action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B04","text":"The precise demonstration of natural suitability, the legitimation of hierarchy, and the limits of hidden administration are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the generative schema, but necessarily depends on omission, sequence, and rhetorical compression.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_01:MRT-B06","text":"A resilient axiom remains the dependence of discourse on action; a resilient resistance remains the demonstration that hierarchical community is just.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SEC1:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_01@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_01:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 01–03"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 01–03","context":"Section 17 · Section 18 · Section 19","original_title":"Chapters 01–03","original_context":"Section 17 · Section 18 · Section 19"},"original_title":"Chapters 01–03","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 04–06","order":2,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SEC2","CH_JP8E_SE_4","CH_JP8E_SE_5"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_02@R001","sha256":"0e71af671058a7f025c62fd32262ab42d0849fa3affcc44bc00a2b06acdb3fac","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ λόγον ὃς ἀποδεικνύει τὴν πολιτείαν οὐχὶ μόνον ἐν θεωρίᾳ, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐν πολέμῳ καὶ φθορᾷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ κανονιστικὸν σχέδιον εἰς μορφὴν ἣ ὀφείλει νὰ ἐπιβεβαιωθῇ ὑπὸ συγκρούσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-03","text":"Ἡ ἱκανότης τοῦ πολιτικοῦ λόγου συγκροτεῖται ἐκ φύσεως, τροφῆς, παιδείας καὶ ἐμπειρίας, οὐκ ἐκ μιᾶς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-04","text":"Τὸ παρελθὸν ἀπειλεῖται ὑπὸ χρόνου, φθορᾶς, στάσεων καὶ καταστροφῶν, ὥστε ἡ μνήμη αὐτοῦ νὰ ἀπαιτῇ ἐνεργὸν ἀνάκτησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μεταδίδεται διὰ ἀλυσίδος μαρτύρων, ἀλλὰ ἡ γεωγραφία καὶ ἡ καταστροφὴ καθορίζουσι ποῖοι φορεῖς ἐπιζῶσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-06","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ διήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἀμφίβολον ἄκουσμα εἰς κοινὸν ἀντικείμενον κρίσεως καὶ πολιτικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ πραγματικὴ κίνησις εἶναι κυκλικὴ καὶ καταστροφική: φθορά, λήθη, φαινομενικὴ νεότης, ἀνάκτησις, καὶ νέα ἀπειλή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ σύγκλεισις οὐ παρέχει ἀπόλυτον βεβαιότητα, ἀλλὰ ἀνατάσσει τὴν ἀρχαιότητα ὡς ζήτημα διασώσεως μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ἕξις εἶναι σύνθεσις φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς, ἣ δύναται νὰ ἐπεκταθῇ εἰς πολιτικὴν καὶ φιλοσοφικὴν ἱκανότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ θεωρία περὶ πολιτείας ἀπαιτεῖ μεταγωγὴν εἰς πράξιν, ἰδίως ὅταν ἡ πόλις τίθηται ἐν πολέμῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀξιοπιστία τοῦ λόγου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸν φορέα, τὴν κοινωνικὴν ἐμπειρίαν καὶ τὴν περίστασιν τῆς ἀκροάσεως, οὐκ ἀπὸ ἀφηρημένην ἀπόδειξιν μόνην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ παλαιὰ ἀκοὴ δύναται νὰ φέρῃ ἀλήθειαν, ἀλλὰ μόνον ὅταν ὑποβάλληται εἰς κοινὴν δοκιμασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ παρελθόντος ἀπαιτεῖ διαδοχὴν μαρτύρων καὶ φορέων μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ μνήμη εἶναι ἐνεργὸς ἀνασυγκρότησις κατὰ τῆς χρονικῆς καὶ κοινωνικῆς λήθης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀρχαιότης μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα τοῦ γεγονότος εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα διασωθείσης μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ὁ χρόνος νοεῖται ὡς κυκλικὸς καὶ καταστροφικός, ὥστε ἡ ἱστορία νὰ μὴν εἶναι γραμμικὴ συσσώρευσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ μῦθος δύναται νὰ κωδικοποιῇ κοσμολογικὴν ἀλήθειαν, ἧς ἡ κυριολεκτικὴ γνώσις ἔχει ἀπωλεσθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ καταστροφὴ καὶ ἡ διάσωσις διαφοροποιοῦνται κατὰ τόπον, ὥστε ἡ γεωγραφία νὰ καθίσταται ὑποδομὴ μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ Αἴγυπτος καὶ ἡ Ἑλλὰς λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς ἀντίθετοι φορεῖς μνήμης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μία διασῴζει ὅπου ἡ ἑτέρα λησμονεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐγγράφεται εἰς διαδικασίαν κοινῆς ἀποδοχῆς καὶ ἐλέγχου, οὐχὶ εἰς δεδομένον ἀνεξέταστον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ Ἑλληνικὴ ταυτότης ἀνασυγκροτεῖται διὰ ξένης μαρτυρίας καὶ οὐκέτι δύναται νὰ στηρίζηται εἰς αὐτάρκη αὐτογνωσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-14","text":"[Attractor] Ἀπουσιάζει πλήρης κανὼν ὃς ἀποφασίζει ἐξ ἀρχῆς τὴν ἀλήθειαν· ἡ ἀλήθεια παράγεται διὰ διαδοχικῆς δοκιμῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ σύζευξις φύσεως καὶ τροφῆς ἐπανέρχεται μεταβεβλημένη ὡς σύζευξις φυσικῆς καταστροφῆς, τοπογραφίας καὶ διασώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενον θεωρίας εἰς φορέα ὃς δοκιμάζεται ὑπὸ πολέμου, λήθης καὶ καταστροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ ἀκοὴ ἐπανέρχεται ὡς πολιτικὸς λόγος, ἔπειτα ὡς μαρτυρικὴ ἀλυσίς, καὶ τέλος ὡς κωδικοποιημένη κοσμολογία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀκρόασις μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ κοινὴν δοκιμασίαν εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἐνεργοποιήσεως λησμονημένου παρελθόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης ἀναστρέφει τὸ νόημα αὐτῆς: οὐκέτι σημαίνει ἀπλῶς παλαιότητα γεγονότων, ἀλλὰ ἐπιβίωσιν φορέων μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ Αἴγυπτος ἀναλαμβάνει λειτουργίαν ἣν ἀρχικῶς εἶχεν ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ αὐτοπαρουσίασις: γίνεται καθρέπτης καὶ ἐλεγκτὴς τοῦ οἰκείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀπώλεια τοῦ περιεχομένου τοῦ μεγάλου ἔργου δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν λειτουργίαν του· ἀπομένει ὡς ἀνοικτὸς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὰ μένουσιν αἱ λεπτομέρειαι τῆς ἑορτῆς, τῶν προσώπων καὶ τῆς ἀκριβοῦς διηγήσεως τοῦ ἔργου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-02","text":"Εἰς τὸν παρόντα ὄροφον ἀναβαίνει ἡ γενικὴ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ μνήμη ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ φορεῖς, θεσμούς, τόπους καὶ ἀλυσίδας μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-03","text":"Γέφυρα μεταξὺ τῶν μονάδων γίνεται ἡ μετατροπὴ τοῦ θεωρητικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ εἰς πρακτικὴν, μνημονικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν δοκιμήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-04","text":"Καταλύτης μεταβάσεως εἶναι ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξὺ Ἑλληνικοῦ καυχήματος καὶ Αἰγυπτιακῆς ἀποκαλύψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-05","text":"Ἀπαρχαιοῦται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀρχαιότης, ἡ ἀλήθεια καὶ ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀξία δύνανται νὰ ἀποδειχθῶσιν ἐκ μόνου τοῦ ἰσχυρισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-06","text":"Ἀπορροφεῖται ἡ ἀτομικὴ μαρτυρία εἰς ὑψηλοτέραν δομὴν, ὅπου ἡ ἀλήθεια παράγεται ὑπὸ συλλογικῆς κρίσεως καὶ θεσμικῆς συνέχειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἱκανότης ἣ ἀνάγεται εἰς μόνην φύσιν, γένος ἢ οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ θεωρία ἣ μένει ἀφηρημένη καὶ ἀδοκίμαστος ὑπὸ πράξεως, πολέμου ἢ πολιτικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ παλαιότης ὡς αὐτόματος ἀπόδειξις ἀληθείας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παράδοσις ὀφείλει νὰ κρίνῃ καὶ νὰ κρίνεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ λήθη ὡς ἁπλῶς ψυχολογικὸν ἴδιον· ἐξηγεῖται διὰ καταστροφῶν, γεωγραφίας καὶ διακοπῆς φορέων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ γραμμικὴ καὶ καθολικὴ ἱστορία, ἐν ᾗ πᾶσα ἐμπειρία συσσωρεύεται ἀδιακόπως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-01","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια δὲν προϋποθέτει ὅτι τὸ γεγονὸς διασώζεται αὐτομάτως ἐν μνήμῃ, ποιήσει ἢ ἀρχείῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-02","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἰδέα αὐτάρκους πολιτισμοῦ, ὃς δύναται νὰ γνωρίζῃ ἑαυτὸν ἄνευ ξένης μαρτυρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-03","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ διχοτομία μύθου καὶ φυσικῆς ἐξηγήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ὁ μῦθος δύναται νὰ διασώζῃ ἀπωλεσθεῖσαν γνώσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-04","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὁμοιομόρφου καταστροφῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τοπογραφία διανέμει ἀνισομερώς τὴν ἐπιβίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-05","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀξιολόγησις δὲν χωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἱκανότητα τοῦ λέγοντος καὶ τὴν περίστασιν τῆς ἀκροάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀδιάσπαστος παγκόσμιος ἱστορία, ἣ θὰ ἐπέτρεπε τὴν ἀσφαλῆ συσσώρευσιν πάσης γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει καθολικὸς φορεὺς μνήμης ὃς ἐπιζῇ πάσας τὰς φθορὰς καὶ μεταδίδει ἀδιάκοπον συνέχεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει ἡ πλήρης σύμπτωσις φυσικῆς ἀρχαιότητος, πολιτικῆς συνέχειας καὶ ἀληθοῦς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπωθημένη δυνατότης εἶναι ὅτι ἡ Ἑλλὰς ἔχει γέροντα πολιτισμὸν ὃν ἁπλῶς οὔπω ἀνεκάλεσεν εἰς μνήμην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-01","text":"Ἡ πολεμικὴ δοκιμασία τῆς πολιτείας καὶ ἡ καταστροφικὴ δοκιμασία τῆς μνήμης συντίθενται εἰς μίαν ἀρχήν: πόλις ὑφίσταται μόνον ὅταν δύναται νὰ πράττῃ καὶ νὰ διασῴζῃ τὸν λόγον αὐτῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-02","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ κρίσις καὶ ἡ μαρτυρικὴ ἀλυσὶς καθιστῶσι τὴν πολιτικὴν ἀλήθειαν διαδικασίαν μεταδόσεως, οὐχὶ ἁπλὸν περιεχόμενον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀτοπία τῆς παλαιᾶς διηγήσεως μετατρέπεται, διὰ τῆς κοσμολογικῆς ἀναγνώσεως, εἰς σημεῖον ἀπωλεσθείσης φυσικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ξένη μαρτυρία μετακινεί τὸ κύρος ἀπὸ τὴν Ἑλληνικὴν αὐτοπαρουσίασιν εἰς ἀλυσίδα διαπολιτισμικῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-05","text":"Ἡ φύσις, ἡ γεωγραφία καὶ ἡ πολιτικὴ ἱκανότης ἀναφαίνονται ὡς ἐνιαῖον σύστημα προϋποθέσεων τῆς διασώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-01","CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀνάθεσις τοῦ λόγου ὡς ἀνταπόδοσις καὶ ἡ ἑορτὴ ὡς ἐνεργοποίησις μνήμης παράγουσι κοινὴν δέσμευσιν πρὸς τὸ παρελθόν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-07","text":"Ἡ θεωρία ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἐπανέρχηται ἀπὸ τὴν πράξιν εἰς τὴν μνήμην, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν μνήμην εἰς νέα δοκιμασίαν τῆς πράξεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία ἀνασυγκροτεῖται ὡς δίκτυον ἐπιλεκτικῆς ἐπιβιώσεως, ὅπου γεγονότα, τόποι, θεσμοὶ καὶ ἀφηγήσεις οὐ διασῴζονται ὁμοίως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πόλις παύει νὰ εἶναι κλειστὸν εἰδεατὸν σχῆμα καὶ γίνεται ἀρχείον ὃ δοκιμάζεται ὑπὸ πολέμου, φθορᾶς καὶ λήθης.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ αὐτογνωσία παράγεται ἐκ ξένης μαρτυρίας, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἔξωθεν βλέμμα ἀνακαλύπτει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἀπώλειαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_4:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ φιλοσοφία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀρχαιολογίαν διακοπῶν, ἣ ζητεῖ οὐ μόνον τί ἐγένετο, ἀλλὰ καὶ τί ἐχάθη καὶ διὰ τί.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-05","text":"Ὁ μῦθος λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀρχείον ἐπιβιώσεως, ὃ μεταφέρει ἀλήθειαν χωρὶς νὰ ἐγγυᾶται ἀμέσως τὴν κυριολεκτικὴν ἱστορικότητα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-06","text":"Ὁ φορεὺς τῆς ἀληθείας δὲν εἶναι ἓν πρόσωπον, ἀλλὰ κατανεμημένον σύστημα προσώπων, τόπων, ἑορτῶν, θεῶν καὶ παραδόσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-01","text":"Ἀπαίτησις πρακτικοῦ λόγου → διήγησις παλαιοῦ ἔργου → κοινὴ κρίσις → ἀνανεωμένη ἀπαίτησις ἀποδείξεως τῆς πολιτείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-02","text":"Καταστροφή → λήθη → φαινομενικὴ νεότης → ξένη μαρτυρία → ἀνάκτησις → νέα ἐπισφάλεια μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἐκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὸ πρόσωπον εἰς τὴν πόλιν, ἀπὸ τὴν πόλιν εἰς τὸν πολιτισμόν, καὶ ἀπὸ τοῦ πολιτισμοῦ εἰς τὸν κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-04","text":"Ἐλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος γίνεται ἡ μνήμη ὑπὸ διακοπήν: πᾶσα ἀλήθεια ἐπιστρέφει ὡς ἀνάκτησις, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλῆ παρουσία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς λήθης δὲν εἶναι πλεονασμός, ἀλλὰ μεταβολὴ φάσεως: ἡ λήθη γίνεται ἀπὸ προσωπικὴ ἀδυναμία κοσμικὸς καὶ γεωγραφικὸς μηχανισμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-06","text":"Ὅπου ὁ λόγος γίνεται μηχανή, ἡ παράδοσις μετατρέπει τὸ ἀφανὲς παρελθὸν εἰς παρόντα πολιτικὸν ἔργον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B01","text":"Ἀπαίτησις πολιτικοῦ λόγου → σύνθεσις φύσεως, τροφῆς, πείρας καὶ παιδείας → ἐπιλογὴ ἱκανοῦ φορέως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B02","text":"Πολιτεία → πολεμικὴ περίστασις → ἀνάγκη πρακτικῆς ἀποδόσεως → ἀφήγησις ὡς πολιτικὴ ἀπόδειξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B03","text":"Παλαιὰ ἀκοή → ἀμφιβολία → μαρτυρικὴ ἀλυσίς → κοινὴ δοκιμασία → δημόσια ἐνεργοποίησις μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B04","text":"Ἀρχαῖον ἔργον → κοσμικὴ φθορά → ἀπώλεια φορέων → φαινομενικὴ νεότης → ἀναζήτησις ξένης μαρτυρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B05","text":"Μυθικὸν σχῆμα → ἀποκρυπτογραφουμένη φυσικὴ ἀλήθεια → ἀνασύνδεσις μνήμης καὶ κοσμολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B06","text":"Κοσμικὴ μεταβολή → χωρικῶς διαφοροποιημένη διάσωσις → ἀνισόρροπος πολιτισμικὴ συνέχεια → ἀνατροπὴ αὐτοχθόνου αὐτογνωσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B07","text":"Διασωθεῖσα γνώσις → ξένος ἔλεγχος → κοινὴ κρίσις → πολιτικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις τοῦ παρελθόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B01","text":"Θεωρητικὴ πολιτεία → ἀνάγκη πολεμικῆς ἐφαρμογῆς → ἀνάθεσις λόγου εἰς ἱκανὸν φορέα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B02","text":"Παλαιὰ διήγησις → δημόσια ἀκρόασις → διάκρισις ἔργου καὶ μύθου → κοινὴ κρίσις καταλληλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B03","text":"Ἀρχαιότης ὡς καύχημα → Αἰγυπτιακὴ ἀντιστροφή → διάγνωσις Ἑλληνικῆς μνημονικῆς νεότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B04","text":"Μνημονικὴ νεότης → περιοδικοὶ κατακλυσμοὶ καὶ πυρκαϊαί → μυθολογικὴ κωδικοποίησις φυσικῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B05","text":"Γεωγραφικὴ διαφοροποίησις ἐπιβιώσεως → Αἰγυπτιακὴ συνέχεια → ἀνασύνθεσις πολιτικῆς ταυτότητος διὰ ξένης μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-01","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις θεωρίας καὶ πράξεως μετατοπίζεται εἰς ἀνακυκλούμενον σύστημα ἀμοιβαίας δοκιμῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-02","text":"Ἡ μνήμη ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ παθητικὴν ἀποθήκευσιν εἰς πολιτικὴν ἐργασίαν ἀνασυγκροτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-03","text":"Ἡ λήθη γίνεται παραγόμενον φαινόμενον πολιτικῶν ῥηγμάτων, φυσικῶν φθορῶν καὶ ἀτελοῦς μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-04","text":"Ὁ μῦθος καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις παύουσιν ἀλληλοαποκλειόμενα· ὁ μῦθος γίνεται φορεὺς ἀπωλεσθείσης γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-05","text":"Ἡ γεωγραφία παύει νὰ εἶναι σκηνικὸν καὶ καθίσταται αἰτία πολιτισμικῆς καὶ ἐπιστημονικῆς ἀνισότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-06","text":"Ἡ Αἴγυπτος ἀνατάσσεται ὡς ἀποθήκη διασωθείσης μνήμης, ἡ δὲ Ἑλλὰς ὡς τόπος ἐπαναλαμβανομένης λήθης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ διήγησις παλαιοῦ ἔργου ἀπαντᾷ εἰς ἀπαίτησιν πολιτικοῦ λόγου καὶ ἀναμνήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἱκανότητα φορέως, ἀλυσίδα μαρτύρων, γεωγραφίαν, θεσμοὺς καὶ ἑορτάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐρμηνεία μεταφέρει τὸ κύρος ἀπὸ τὴν Ἑλληνικὴν αὐτοπαρουσίασιν εἰς ξένον φορέα μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, ἡ πραγματικότης ἀποτελεῖται ἐκ κυκλικῶν φθορῶν καὶ μερικῶν ἐπανεκκινήσεων, οὐκ ἐκ ἀδιακόπου προόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, τὸ σύστημα ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνάγνωσιν ἣ συνδυάζει μαρτυρίαν, ἀπόκρυφον φυσικὴν δομήν, πολιτικὴν περίστασιν καὶ κοινὸν ἔλεγχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-01","text":"Ἡ παράδοσις προβάλλεται ὡς πηγή ἀληθείας, ἀλλὰ ἡ διακοπὴ τῆς μεταδόσεως ἀναγκάζει αὐτὴν νὰ ὑποβάλληται εἰς ἔλεγχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-02","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τῶν καταστροφῶν συγκρούεται πρὸς τὴν ἐξαιρετικὴν Αἰγυπτιακὴν συνέχεια· ἡ ἐξαίρεσις ἀπειλεῖ τὸ καθολικόν σχήμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-03","text":"Ὁ μῦθος ἀποκρυπτογραφεῖται ὡς φυσικὴ ἀλήθεια, ἀλλὰ ἡ διήγησις διατηρεῖ ἀνοικτὸν εἰ πρόκειται περὶ ἱστορίας, ποιήσεως ἢ πολιτικοῦ ὑποδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ αὐτογνωσία ἀπαιτεῖ ξένην μαρτυρίαν, ὥστε ἡ αὐτάρκεια τῆς πόλεως νὰ ἀκυροῦται διὰ τοῦ τρόπου τῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχαιότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ χρονικὴν προτεραιότητα εἰς ἀποτέλεσμα διασώσεως καὶ μεταδόσεως μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἀτοπία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ λόγον ἀπορρίψεως εἰς ἔνδειξιν ὅτι ὁ λόγος φέρει ἀπωλεσθεῖσαν γνώσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-03","text":"Ἡ γεωγραφία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ περιβάλλον γεγονότων εἰς ἐνεργὸν μηχανισμὸν ἐπιβιώσεως καὶ πολιτισμικῆς ἀνισότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-04","text":"Ἡ πόλις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενον περιγραφῆς εἰς ὑποκείμενον ὃ ὀφείλει νὰ ἀποδείξῃ τὴν ἱκανότητά του ἐν κρίσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς κυκλικὸν ἀρχείον ὑπὸ καταστροφὴν, ἐν ᾧ ἡ γνώσις ἐπιζῇ μόνον διὰ τοπικῶν καὶ ἀτελῶν φορέων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται σύνδεσμος καὶ ἐπιμελητὴς ἀλυσίδων μνήμης, οὐχὶ κυρίαρχος κάτοχος ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι διακεκομμένος, καταστροφικός, καὶ ἐπανερχόμενος· τὸ παρελθὸν δύναται νὰ γίνῃ παρόν μόνον διὰ ἀνανεωμένης διηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης ἀγῶνος ἔγκειται ἐν τῇ διασώσει, τῇ ἀνασυνθέσει καὶ τῇ κοινῇ δοκιμασίᾳ τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B01","text":"Οἱ παρόντες ἀξονικοὶ ὅροι ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ πολιτείαν καὶ πόλεμον εἰς μνήμην, καταστροφὴν καὶ διαπολιτισμικὴν μαρτυρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσι τὸ ἀκριβὲς περιεχόμενον τοῦ μεγάλου ἔργου, ἡ κυριολεκτικὴ ἱστορικότης τῆς διηγήσεως καὶ ἡ ἔκτασις τῆς κοσμικῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀλληλουχία φθορά → λήθη → φαινομενικὴ νεότης → ἀνάκτησις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἐν πολλαῖς κλίμαξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ συμπίεσις διασῴζει τὴν γενετικὴν λογικήν, ἀλλὰ δὲν δύναται νὰ ἀφαιρέσῃ τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ ἱστορικῆς ἀληθείας, ποιητικῆς μορφῆς καὶ πολιτικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀβεβαιότης δὲν λύεται, ἀλλὰ λειτουργεῖ ὡς μηχανισμὸς κοινῆς δοκιμῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T231955141026Z_7a2feb12","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 04–06","source_sha256":"0e71af671058a7f025c62fd32262ab42d0849fa3affcc44bc00a2b06acdb3fac","sha256":"0c84f78c743ab5f068627d928f02d78dc2dd8156d75ecd8a79903fd9098ea3d0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:19:55.141968+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-01","text":"The system seeks an account that demonstrates the constitution not only in theory, but also in war and destruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-02","text":"The constitution is transformed from a normative plan into a form that must be confirmed through conflict.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-03","text":"The capacity for political discourse is constituted from nature, nurture, education, and experience, not from a single principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-04","text":"The past is threatened by time, destruction, civil strife, and catastrophes, so that its memory requires active recovery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-05","text":"Truth is transmitted through a chain of witnesses, but geography and destruction determine which bearers survive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4","CH_JP8E_SE_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-06","text":"The ancient narrative passes from doubtful hearsay into a common object of judgment and political use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-07","text":"The actual movement is cyclical and destructive: destruction, forgetting, apparent youth, recovery, and a new threat.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BAS-08","text":"The final closure does not provide absolute certainty, but reorders antiquity as a matter of the preservation of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Human disposition is a compound of nature and nurture, which can be extended into political and philosophical capacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Theory concerning the constitution requires transfer into practice, especially when the city is placed in war.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The reliability of discourse depends on the bearer, social experience, and the circumstance of hearing, not on abstract proof alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ancient hearsay can bear truth, but only when it is subjected to common testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Knowledge of the past requires a succession of witnesses and bearers of transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Political memory is an active reconstruction against temporal and social forgetting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Antiquity is transformed from a property of the event into the result of preserved memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Time is conceived as cyclical and destructive, so that history is not a linear accumulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Myth can encode cosmological truth whose literal knowledge has been lost.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Destruction and preservation differ by place, so that geography becomes an infrastructure of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Egypt and Greece function as contrary bearers of memory, since the one preserves where the other forgets.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Truth is inscribed in a process of common acceptance and examination, not in an unexamined datum.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] Greek identity is reconstructed through foreign testimony and can no longer rest on self-sufficient self-knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GA-14","text":"[Attractor] There is no complete rule that decides truth from the outset; truth is produced through successive testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-01","text":"The conjunction of nature and nurture recurs in altered form as the conjunction of natural destruction, topography, and preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-02","text":"The constitution is displaced from an object of theory into a bearer tested by war, forgetting, and destruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-03","text":"Ancient hearsay recurs as political discourse, then as a chain of witnesses, and finally as encoded cosmology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-04","text":"Hearing changes from common testing into a mechanism for activating a forgotten past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:D6","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-05","text":"Antiquity reverses its meaning: it no longer signifies merely the age of events, but the survival of bearers of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-06","text":"Egypt assumes a function originally held by Athenian self-presentation: it becomes a mirror and examiner of what is one's own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RMD-07","text":"The loss of the content of the great deed does not annul its function; it remains as an open attractor.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-01","text":"The details of the festival, the persons, and the precise account of the deed remain local.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-02","text":"At the present level rises the general principle that memory depends on bearers, institutions, places, and chains of transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-03","text":"The bridge between the units is the transformation of theoretical design into practical, memorial, and cosmological testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-04","text":"The catalyst of transition is the contrast between Greek boastfulness and Egyptian revelation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-05","text":"The idea that antiquity, truth, and political value can be demonstrated from assertion alone is antiquated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:CGD-06","text":"Individual testimony is absorbed into a higher structure, where truth is produced by collective judgment and institutional continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-01","text":"Capacity reducible to nature alone, race, or essence is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-02","text":"Theory that remains abstract and untested by practice, war, or political use is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-03","text":"Antiquity as automatic proof of truth is rejected, since tradition must judge and be judged.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-04","text":"Forgetting as a merely psychological property is rejected; it is explained through catastrophes, geography, and interruption of bearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:GNX-05","text":"Linear and universal history, in which all experience accumulates without interruption, is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-01","text":"Truth does not presuppose that the event is automatically preserved in memory, poetry, or archive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-02","text":"The idea of a self-sufficient civilization capable of knowing itself without foreign testimony is invalidated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-03","text":"The dichotomy of myth and natural explanation is invalidated, since myth can preserve lost knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-04","text":"The assumption of uniform destruction is invalidated, since topography distributes survival unevenly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:DBN-05","text":"Political evaluation is not separable from the capacity of the speaker and the circumstance of hearing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-01","text":"An unbroken global history that would allow the secure accumulation of all knowledge is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-02","text":"A universal bearer of memory that survives all destructions and transmits uninterrupted continuity is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-03","text":"The complete coincidence of natural antiquity, political continuity, and true knowledge remains impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSA-04","text":"The repressed possibility is that Greece possesses an old civilization which it has simply not yet recalled to memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-01","text":"The martial test of the constitution and the destructive test of memory combine into one principle: a city subsists only when it can act and preserve its account.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-02","text":"Common judgment and the chain of witnesses make political truth a process of transmission, not simple content.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-03","text":"The strangeness of the ancient narrative is transformed, through cosmological reading, into a sign of lost natural knowledge.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SEC2:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-04","text":"Foreign testimony shifts authority from Greek self-presentation to a chain of intercultural memory.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-05","text":"Nature, geography, and political capacity appear as a unified system of conditions of preservation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-01","CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-06","text":"The assignment of the account as recompense and the festival as activation of memory produce a common commitment to the past.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD4","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:XD-07","text":"Theory is compelled to return from action to memory, and from memory to a new test of action.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-01","text":"History is reconstructed as a network of selective survival, in which events, places, institutions, and narratives are not preserved alike.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-02","text":"The city ceases to be a closed ideal form and becomes an archive tested by war, destruction, and forgetting.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-02","CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC2:DNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-03","text":"Political self-knowledge is produced from foreign testimony, because the external gaze discovers internal loss.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_02:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_4:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-04","text":"Political philosophy is transformed into an archaeology of interruptions, which seeks not only what happened, but also what was lost and why.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-06","CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1","CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-05","text":"Myth functions as an archive of survival, conveying truth without immediately guaranteeing literal historicity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-04","CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SE_5:NX3","CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:BSD-06","text":"The bearer of truth is not one person, but a distributed system of persons, places, festivals, gods, and traditions.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-03","CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5","CH_JP8E_SE_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-01","text":"Demand for practical discourse → narrative of an ancient deed → common judgment → renewed demand for demonstration of the constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-02","text":"Destruction → forgetting → apparent youth → foreign testimony → recovery → new precariousness of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-03","text":"The movement extends from the person to the city, from the city to civilization, and from civilization to the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-04","text":"The system's attractor becomes memory under interruption: every truth returns as recovery, not as simple presence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-05","text":"The repetition of forgetting is not redundancy, but a phase change: forgetting becomes from a personal incapacity a cosmic and geographical mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:RLE-06","text":"Where discourse becomes a machine, tradition transforms the unseen past into a present political deed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B01","text":"Demand for political discourse → composition of nature, nurture, experience, and education → selection of a capable bearer.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B02","text":"Constitution → martial circumstance → necessity of practical realization → narrative as political demonstration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B03","text":"Ancient hearsay → doubt → chain of witnesses → common testing → public activation of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B04","text":"Ancient deed → cosmic destruction → loss of bearers → apparent youth → search for foreign testimony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B05","text":"Mythic schema → deciphered natural truth → reconnection of memory and cosmology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B06","text":"Cosmic change → spatially differentiated preservation → uneven cultural continuity → overturning of autochthonous self-knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FGS-B07","text":"Preserved knowledge → foreign examination → common judgment → political reconstruction of the past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B01","text":"Theoretical constitution → necessity of martial application → assignment of discourse to a capable bearer.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B02","text":"Ancient narrative → public hearing → distinction between deed and myth → common judgment of suitability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B03","text":"Antiquity as boast → Egyptian reversal → diagnosis of Greek memorial youth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B04","text":"Memorial youth → periodic floods and conflagrations → mythological encoding of natural truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:AFM-B05","text":"Geographical differentiation of survival → Egyptian continuity → reconstruction of political identity through foreign memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-01","text":"The distinction between theory and practice is displaced into a recurrent system of mutual testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-02","text":"Memory is reclassified from passive storage into political work of reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-03","text":"Forgetting becomes a produced phenomenon of political ruptures, natural destructions, and incomplete transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-04","text":"Myth and natural explanation cease to be mutually exclusive; myth becomes a bearer of lost knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-05","text":"Geography ceases to be a setting and becomes a cause of cultural and scientific inequality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MME-06","text":"Egypt is reordered as a storehouse of preserved memory, and Greece as a place of recurrent forgetting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the narrative of an ancient deed answers a demand for political discourse and recollection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, truth depends on the capacity of the bearer, a chain of witnesses, geography, institutions, and festivals.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, interpretation transfers authority from Greek self-presentation to a foreign bearer of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, reality consists of cyclical destructions and partial restarts, not uninterrupted progress.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, the system requires a reading that combines testimony, hidden natural structure, political circumstance, and common examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-01","text":"Tradition is advanced as a source of truth, but interruption of transmission compels it to be subjected to examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-02","text":"The universality of catastrophes conflicts with exceptional Egyptian continuity; the exception threatens the universal schema.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-03","text":"Myth is deciphered as natural truth, but the narrative leaves open whether it is history, poetry, or a political paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:FL-04","text":"Political self-knowledge requires foreign testimony, so that the city's self-sufficiency is invalidated by the mode of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-01","text":"Antiquity mutates from temporal priority into the result of the preservation and transmission of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-02","text":"Strangeness mutates from a ground for rejection into an indication that the account bears lost knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-03","text":"Geography mutates from the environment of events into an active mechanism of survival and cultural inequality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MP-04","text":"The city mutates from an object of description into a subject that must demonstrate its capacity in crisis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a cyclical archive under destruction, in which knowledge survives only through local and imperfect bearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a link and curator of chains of memory, not a sovereign possessor of truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-03","text":"Time is discontinuous, destructive, and recurrent; the past can become present only through renewed narration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:HSI-04","text":"The possibility of contest lies in the preservation, reconstruction, and common testing of discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B01","text":"The present axial terms suffice for reconstructing the movement from constitution and war to memory, destruction, and intercultural testimony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B02","text":"The precise content of the great deed, the literal historicity of the narrative, and the scope of the cosmic explanation remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B03","text":"The structure is coherent, because the sequence destruction → forgetting → apparent youth → recovery recurs on many scales.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B04","text":"The compression preserves the generative logic, but cannot remove the tension between historical truth, poetic form, and political use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_4:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_02:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, because uncertainty is not resolved but functions as a mechanism of common testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_02@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_02:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 04–06"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 04–06","context":"Section 20 · Section 21 · Section 22","original_title":"Chapters 04–06","original_context":"Section 20 · Section 21 · Section 22"},"original_title":"Chapters 04–06","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 07–09","order":3,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SE_6","CH_JP8E_SE_7","CH_JP8E_SE_8"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_03@R001","sha256":"b12a65f253a4906f98685b2aa2292f368578bbf8b41ab81e83b97376f1ddd9fd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-01","text":"Ἡ κεντρικὴ ἀπορία ζητεῖ πῶς παλαιὰ πολιτικὰ μεγέθη δύνανται νὰ ἀναγνωρισθῶσιν ὅταν ἡ κοινὴ μνήμη ἀποτυγχάνῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἄγνοια ἀναπλαισιοῦται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα περιοδικῆς καταστροφῆς, ἀπωλείας γραφῶν καὶ διακοπῆς παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-03","text":"Ἡ μνήμη δὲν διατηρεῖται φυσικῶς, ἀλλὰ διὰ θεσμῶν, ἀρχείων καὶ ἱερατικῶν φορέων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-04","text":"Ἡ πόλις συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ σύνθεσις λειτουργιῶν, κοσμολογικῆς παιδείας καὶ πολεμικῆς ἀποστολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ πολιτεία ἀναβαθμίζεται εἰς παγκόσμιον πολιτικὸν ὑποκείμενον διὰ τῆς ἀντιθέσεως πρὸς καθολικὴν δύναμιν δουλώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-06","text":"Ἡ παλαιὰ Ἀθήνα προβάλλεται ὡς λανθάνουσα μορφὴ πολιτικῆς ἀριστείας, ἥτις ἀναγνωρίζεται μόνον διὰ ἀνακτήσεως καὶ ἐπαναφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ ἀφανίζει ἅμα τὸν δυνάστην, τὸν ἀμυνόμενον καὶ τὰς ὁδοὺς ἐμπειρικῆς ἐπαληθεύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής· λήθη, ἀνάκτησις, πολιτικὴ ἐπανερμηνεία καὶ νέα ἀπώλεια συγκροτοῦσιν ἀνοικτὸν κύκλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀπουσία μνήμης δὲν ἀποδεικνύει τὴν ἀπουσίαν γεγονότων, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ μαρτυρῇ διακοπὴν τῶν φορέων αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φυσικὴ φθορὰ ἀφανίζει κυρίως γραφήν, παιδείαν καὶ θεσμικὴν συνέχεια, οὐχὶ ἀναγκαίως τὸ ἀνθρώπινον γένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ γραφὴ μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ μέσον ἐπικοινωνίας εἰς μηχανὴν πολιτικῆς συνέχειας καὶ ἐξουσίας ἐπὶ τοῦ παρελθόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πολιτεία γίνεται ὅλον ἐν ᾧ κοινωνικὴ διαίρεσις, παιδεία, θεία τάξις, πολεμικὴ ἰσχύς καὶ μνήμη ἀλληλοπαράγονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ διακεκριμένα γένη καὶ ἔργα, ὥστε ἡ ἑνότης νὰ μὴ ταυτίζηται μὲ σύγχυσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φρόνησις ἐκτείνεται ἀπὸ κοσμικὴν θεωρίαν εἰς ἐπιστήμας, θεσμοὺς καὶ στρατηγικὴν πράξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀρετὴ συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱκανότης ἐλευθερώσεως ἄλλων, ἀλλὰ διὰ μορφῆς ἰσχύος ἥτις δύναται νὰ λάβῃ ἡγεμονικὰ γνωρίσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ καταστροφὴ ἀφανίζει καὶ τὴν Ἀτλαντικὴν ἡγεμονίαν καὶ τὸ ἀρχικὸν Ἀθηναϊκὸν πολεμικὸν ὑποκείμενον, ἀφήνουσα μόνον διαμεσολαβημένην μνήμην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀριστεία ἐμφανίζεται ὡς λανθάνουσα δυνατότης, ἣν ἡ λήθη ἀποκρύπτει ἀλλὰ δὲν δημιουργεῖ ἐκ μηδενός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ γεωγραφικὸς τόπος μετασχηματίζεται εἰς παγκόσμιον χάρτην πολιτικῶν ζωνῶν, ἡγεμονιῶν καὶ ἀντιστάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἱστορικὴ ἀλήθεια ἀναδύεται ἐκ συνδυασμοῦ ἀφανισμοῦ, ἀποσπασματικῆς μεταδόσεως καὶ νεωτέρας ἐρμηνευτικῆς ἐπανασυνδέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἐλευθερία δὲν προϋπάρχει ὡς ἀσφαλὴς κατάστασις, ἀλλὰ παράγεται διὰ ἀντιστάσεως πρὸς συγκεντρωμένην δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ μνήμη ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς γραπτόν ἀρχείον, ἱερατικὴ κατοχή, προφορικὴ μετάδοσις καὶ ἐρμηνευτικὸς φακός· ἡ λειτουργία της μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ φύλαξιν εἰς νομιμοποίησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ αἰτία λήθης εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἐξισώσεως καὶ ἀδυναμίας ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ Ἀθήνα μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ λησμονημένη πόλις εἰς ὑπόδειγμα πολιτείας καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς φορέα καθολικῆς ἐλευθερώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις λειτουργιῶν ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς κοινωνικὴ ἱεράρχησις, ὡς διανομή γνώσεως καὶ ὡς κατανομή πολιτικῆς ἐξουσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-05","text":"Ὁ πόλεμος μεταβάλλει σημασίαν: ἀπὸ ἔργον τοῦ μαχίμου γένους γίνεται τεκμήριον ἀρετῆς καὶ ὄργανον ἐλευθερώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-06","text":"Ὁ τόπος ἀποσπᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν γεωγραφικὴν ἰδιαιτερότητα καὶ μετατρέπεται εἰς περιβαλλοντικὸν, κοσμολογικὸν καὶ στρατηγικὸν παράγοντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ Ἀτλαντὶς δὲν παραμένει αὐτοτελὴς τόπος, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφᾶται ὡς ἀντίθετον μοντέλον καθολικῆς πολιτικῆς ἐπεκτάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ διόρθωσις τῆς ἀτομικῆς ἀγνοίας τοῦ Σόλωνος παραμένει τοπικὴ· ἀναβαίνει μόνον ὅταν ἐξηγῇ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἐξουσίαν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς διάταξις τῶν ἐπιμέρους γενῶν εἶναι κατώτερον σχῆμα, ἐνῶ ἡ ἀρχὴ τοῦ λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ κλιμακοῦται εἰς παγκόσμιον ἀρχιτεκτονικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ κυκλικὴ ἐναλλαγὴ καταστροφῆς καὶ ἐπανεκκινήσεως ἀποτελεῖ τρέχουσαν ἀρχὴν τοῦ συμπλέγματος, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς μοτίβον ἑνὸς κεφαλαίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ γνώσις γεφυροῖ τὴν ἀπωλεσθεῖσαν ἱστορίαν καὶ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἀξίωσιν, ἄρα μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τοπικὸς φορεὺς εἰς δομικὴν ἀρχὴν ἐπικυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ἀπειλὴ καταλύει τὸν περιορισμὸν τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς ἀρετῆς καὶ μετατρέπει τὴν πολιτείαν εἰς ἱστορικὴν ἀποστολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἁπλῆ ἀντίθεσις Ἀθηναίων καὶ Ἀτλάντων ὑπερβαίνεται ὑπὸ τῆς ἀσταθοῦς συγγενείας μεταξὺ ἐλευθερωτικῆς καὶ ἡγεμονικῆς ἰσχύος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ γραμμικὴ ἰδέα ἱστορικῆς προόδου, ἐπειδὴ ὁ πολιτισμὸς δύναται νὰ ἀφανισθῇ καὶ νὰ ἐπανεκκινήσῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ παρόντος μὲ τὸ μέτρον τοῦ δυνατοῦ, ἐπειδὴ τὸ λησμονημένον παρελθὸν περιέχει ἀνενεργοποίητους μορφὰς πολιτικῆς ἀριστείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ αὐτοφυὴς καὶ ἀθέσμως συγκροτημένη πόλις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πολιτεία ἀπαιτεῖ θείαν τάξιν, νόμον καὶ παιδείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἁπλὴ στρατιωτικὴ ὑπεροχὴ ὡς κριτήριον ἀρετῆς· ἡ ἰσχὺς ὀφείλει νὰ ἐντάσσηται εἰς τάξιν καὶ ἐλευθέρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ φυσικὴ καὶ προϋπάρχουσα ἐλευθερία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐλευθερία ἀναφαίνεται μόνον ὅταν ἀντιμετωπίζεται δύναμις δουλώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἱστορία ὡς πλήρης καὶ ἀπρόσκοπτος ἀποθήκη γεγονότων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πρόσβασις εἰς αὐτὴν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σωζομένας μεταδόσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὅτι τὸ παρὸν ἐπαρκεῖ ὡς μέτρον τῆς ἀνθρωπίνης πολιτικῆς δυνατότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀμιγῶς φυσικὴ ἢ ἀμιγῶς γνωστικὴ ἐξήγησις τῆς λήθης· ἡ φθορὰ συμπλέκεται μὲ τὴν ἀπώλειαν θεσμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ ἱστορικὸς λόγος ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος τοῦ φορέως τῶν ἀρχείων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γνώσις ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν κατοχὴν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις πολιτικῆς ἀξίας καὶ συγχρόνου ἀναγνωρίσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ λήθη δύναται νὰ κρύψῃ τὴν ἀριστείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται πολιτεία ἀρετῆς ἄνευ ἱεραρχικῆς διακρίσεως καὶ λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ, ὅπως ἀποκλείεται καὶ ἡ ἀδιάκριτος κοινωνικὴ ἑνότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-06","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἐλευθερία ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ κίνδυνον, πόλεμον καὶ συλλογικὴν ἰσχύν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ αὐτάρκης νεωτέρα αὐτοσυνειδησία, ἐπειδὴ τὸ παρὸν δύναται νὰ κατοικῇ ἐπάνω ἐρειπίων λησμονημένων πολιτειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη αὐτοθεμελίωσις τῆς πόλεως· ἡ ἀρχὴ μετατίθεται εἰς θείαν τάξιν, τόπον καὶ κληρονομημένην παιδείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ δικαία ἡγεμονία δύναται νὰ διαχωρισθῇ ἀπολύτως ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπεκτατικὴν κυριαρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀμεσότης μεταξὺ παρελθόντος καὶ παρόντος· ἡ πολιτικὴ σημασία γεννᾶται διὰ ἀναμνήσεως καὶ ἐρμηνείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-05","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ὁριστικὴ νίκη, ἐπειδὴ ἡ καταστροφὴ δύναται νὰ ἀφανίσῃ καὶ τὸν φορέα τῆς νίκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-01","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ γίνεται ὄχι ἁπλὸν ὑπόβαθρον τῆς ἱστορίας, ἀλλὰ μηχανισμὸς ὃς καθορίζει ποῖα πολιτεύματα δύνανται νὰ γνωσθῶσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-02","CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις ἀποκτᾷ καθολικὴν ἀξίωσιν μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ἀπειλὴ ἀναγκάζῃ αὐτὴν νὰ πράξῃ ὑπὲρ ἄλλων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-04","CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SE_7:D7","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ φύλαξις τῆς γραφῆς καὶ ὁ λειτουργικὸς χωρισμὸς τῆς πόλεως σχηματίζουσιν ἀνάλογον ἀρχιτεκτονικήν: ἡ συνέχεια ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ κατανεμημένους φορεῖς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","CL_JP8E_03:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-04","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πολιτεία ἀνακτᾶται ὡς παράδειγμα μόνον ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀπωλεσθεῖσα πράξις ἐπανασυνδέεται μὲ νεωτέραν θεωρίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-09","CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ φθορὰ ἐξισοῖ δυνάστην καὶ ἀμυνόμενον, ἀλλὰ ἡ μνήμη ἐπαναφέρει ἀσύμμετρον πολιτικὴν ἀξίαν μεταξὺ αὐτῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-08","CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐλευθερωτικὴ καὶ ἡ ἡγεμονικὴ ἐπέκτασις δὲν χωρίζονται διὰ τῆς ἰσχύος, ἀλλὰ διὰ τοῦ πολιτικοῦ σκοποῦ καὶ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς τοὺς ἄλλους.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","CL_JP8E_03:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ πραγματικότης συγκροτεῖται τριπλῶς: ὡς θεσμικὴ τάξις, ὡς δοκιμασία ἐξωτερικῆς ἀπειλῆς καὶ ὡς ἐπιβίωσις μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία τοῦ συμπλέγματος εἶναι μετακαταστροφική· τὸ γεγονὸς ἀποκτᾷ πλήρη πολιτικὴν σημασίαν μόνον ὅταν ἐπανέλθῃ διὰ τοῦ ἀρχείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀρετὴ δὲν εἶναι οὐσία ἀποκεκλεισμένη ἐντὸς πόλεως, ἀλλὰ σχέσις ἀντιστάσεως, ἐλευθερώσεως καὶ ἀναλήψεως κινδύνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχειακὴ συνέχεια εἶναι πολιτικὸν πεδίον μάχης, ἐπειδὴ ὁ κρατῶν τὴν μνήμην κρατεῖ καὶ τὴν ἐρμηνείαν τῆς πολιτικῆς ἀξίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ παράγει διπλὸν ἀποτέλεσμα: ἀφανίζει τὰ πολιτικὰ σώματα, ἀλλὰ καθιστᾷ ἀναγκαίαν τὴν ἐξουσίαν τῆς διαμεσολαβημένης μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-06","text":"Ὁ χρόνος δὲν προάγει ἀναγκαίως τὴν πολιτείαν· ἐπαναφέρει θραύσματα, τὰ ὁποῖα ἀπαιτοῦσιν ἐκ νέου πολιτικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-01","text":"Καταστροφή → ἀπώλεια γραφῆς → λήθη → ἀρχειακὴ ἀσυμμετρία → ἀνάκτησις παρελθόντος → νέα πολιτικὴ νομιμοποίησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-02","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ διάταξις → ἐξωτερικὴ ἀπειλή → πολεμικὴ ἀπόδειξις → ἐλευθέρωσις ἄλλων → ἡγεμονικὴ ἀμφισημία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-03","text":"Ὁ γεωγραφικὸς ὁρίζων διευρύνεται, ἡ ἀπειλὴ καθολικοποιεῖται, καὶ ἡ πόλις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ μεταβῇ ἀπὸ τοπικὸν νόμον εἰς παγκόσμιον ἔργον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:D1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ γραφὴ γίνεται μηχανή: ἀπὸ ἀποθήκη γεγονότων μετατρέπεται εἰς ρυθμιστὴν τοῦ ποῖος ἔχει παρελθὸν καὶ ποῖος ἔχει πολιτικὴν ἀξίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ φθορὰ ἀποτελεῖ σημεῖον φάσεως: ἀπὸ τὴν ἱστορίαν τῶν πράξεων μεταβαίνει ἡ διήγησις εἰς ἱστορίαν τῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ κρυφὸς ἑλκυστὴς τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ παλαιὰ Ἀθηναϊκὴ πολιτεία, ἥτις ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἀπόδειξις, ὑπόδειγμα καὶ ἀνοικτὸν πρόβλημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B01","text":"Περιοδικὴ φυσικὴ φθορὰ καταλύει γραφήν, παιδείαν καὶ πολιτικὴν συνέχεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ διακοπὴ τῆς μνήμης μετατρέπει τὸ ἱστορικὸν γεγονὸς εἰς μῦθον καὶ ἀναγκάζει τοὺς ἐπιζῶντας νὰ ἐπανεκκινήσωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀδιάκοπος ἀρχειακὴ κοινότης συσσωρεύει γνώσιν καὶ παράγει ἀσύμμετρον ἐρμηνευτικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία συναρμόζει λειτουργικὸν χωρισμόν, κοσμικὴν παιδείαν, θείαν ἐκλογὴν καὶ πολεμικὴν ἱκανότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ διευρυμένη γεωγραφία παράγει καθολικὴν ἀπειλήν, ἥτις δοκιμάζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν πολιτικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀντίστασις μετατρέπει τὴν ἀρετὴν ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴν διάταξιν εἰς ἐλευθερωτικὴν πράξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ νέα καταστροφὴ ἀφανίζει τοὺς φορεῖς, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει τὴν μνήμην ὡς ἐρμηνευτικὸν ὑπόβαθρον νεωτέρας πολιτικῆς θεωρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀνεπαρκὴς μνήμη → περιοδικὴ καταστροφὴ → ἀπώλεια γραφῆς → ἱερατικὴ ἀρχειακὴ ἀσυμμετρία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀρχειακὴ ἀνάκτησις → ἀποκάλυψις ἱεραρχικῆς πολιτείας → σύνδεσις κοσμολογίας καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B03","text":"Διεύρυνσις κόσμου → Ἀτλαντικὴ καθολικὴ ἀπειλή → Ἀθηναϊκὴ ἀντίστασις → ἐλευθέρωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B04","text":"Φυσικὴ καταστροφή → ἀφανισμὸς πολιτικῶν σωμάτων → μνημονικὴ ἐπανενεργοποίησις → ἀνοικτὴ ἐρμηνεία τῆς πολιτικῆς ἀρετῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἱστορία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ γραμμικὴν διαδοχὴν εἰς κύκλον καταστροφῆς, λήθης καὶ ἐπανεκκινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ ἀπουσίαν καὶ γίνεται σύμπτωμα ἀπωλεσθείσης ἀρχειακῆς συνέχειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-03","text":"Ἡ γραφὴ καθίσταται πολιτικὸς μηχανισμὸς, ὁ δὲ ἀρχειακὸς φορεὺς ἀποκτᾷ ἐρμηνευτικὴν κυριαρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-04","text":"Ἡ κοινωνικὴ διαίρεσις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ὅρος εὐνομίας, ἐνῶ ἡ ἀδιαίρετος ἑνότης ἀποκαλύπτεται ὡς σύγχυσις λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-05","text":"Ἡ στρατιωτικὴ νίκη ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀπόδειξις συνολικῆς πολιτικῆς ἀρετῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ κατοχὴ ἰσχύος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-06","text":"Ὁ γεωγραφικὸς χάρτης γίνεται ἀνοικτὸ σύστημα πολιτικῶν ζωνῶν, ὅπου ἡ τοπικὴ πόλις δύναται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ παγκόσμιον ἔργον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-07","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἐλευθερίας καὶ ἡγεμονίας παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλῆ διχοτομία, ἐπειδὴ ἀμφότεραι προϋποθέτουσιν ὑπεροχὴν ἰσχύος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** Ἡ διήγησις ἐξετάζει Ἀθήνας, Ἀτλαντίδα, νόμους, γένη, ἱερεῖς, πολέμους καὶ κατακλυσμούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** Ὑπὸ τὰ ἐπιμέρους πρόσωπα ἐνεργοῦσι μηχανισμοὶ ἀρχειακῆς διατηρήσεως, λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ, κοσμολογικῆς παιδείας καὶ στρατηγικῆς ἀναμετρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀρετὴ κρίνεται ἐκ τοῦ εἰ δύναται νὰ ἀναχαιτίσῃ καθολικὴν ἀπειλὴν καὶ νὰ μετατρέψῃ τὴν ἰσχὺν εἰς ἐλευθέρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι καταστροφικὸς καὶ ἐπαναληπτικός, ἐνῶ ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις παραμένει θνητὴ καὶ ἡ μνήμη μεταγενέστερα ἀνασυνθετική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** Ὁ λόγος μιμεῖται τὸ ἀρχειακὸν ἔργον ὃ περιγράφει, ἐπειδὴ ἀπὸ θραύσματα, μεταδόσεις καὶ ἀναλογίας ἀνακατασκευάζει πολιτικὸν παρελθόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-01","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἐλευθεροῖ τοὺς ἄλλους διὰ ὑπεροχῆς, ἀλλὰ ἡ ὑπεροχὴ αὕτη δύναται νὰ λάβῃ ἡγεμονικὴν μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἱερατικὴ μαρτυρία καθίσταται ἀναγκαία πρὸς ἀνάκτησιν τῆς ἀληθείας, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀπόδειξις τῆς μαρτυρίας μένει ἀνοικτή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ τάξις θεμελιώνει τὴν ἀρετήν, ἀλλὰ ἡ καθολικὴ σωτηριολογικὴ ἀξίωσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀξίαν ὑπὲρ τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν ὁρίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-04","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἐμπειρικὴν συνέχεια, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως παράγει τὴν ἀνάγκην τῆς ἀφηγηματικῆς διασώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-01","text":"Ἡ μνήμη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἔλλειψιν εἰς ἐνεργὸν ἀρχὴν ἀναταξινομήσεως τοῦ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-02","text":"Ἡ πολεμικὴ δύναμις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα τάξεως εἰς δημόσιον τεκμήριον ἀρετῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-03","text":"Ἡ πόλις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ τοπικὴ κοινότης εἰς φορέα καθολικῆς ἀπελευθερώσεως, χωρὶς νὰ ἀποβάλῃ τὸ ἡγεμονικὸν στοιχεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-04","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴ διακοπὴ εἰς συστατικὸν μηχανισμὸν τοῦ ἱστορικοῦ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς κυκλικὴ μηχανὴ ἐν ᾗ καταστροφή, λήθη, ἀρχειακὴ φύλαξις καὶ πολιτικὴ ἐπανενεργοποίησις ἀλληλοδιαδέχονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος γίνεται οὐχὶ αὐτόνομος κύριος τοῦ χρόνου, ἀλλὰ φύλαξ, μαχητής, μάρτυς ἢ ἐρμηνευτὴς θραυσμένης συνέχειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι σπειροειδής: τὰ γεγονότα ἀφανίζονται, ἀλλὰ ἐπανέρχονται ὡς ἀνακατασκευασμένα πρότυπα πολιτικῆς πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ διαφυγὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀντίστασιν καὶ διατήρησιν μνήμης, ἀλλὰ οὐδέποτε ἐγγυᾶται ὁριστικὴν νίκην ἐπὶ τῆς φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἐπαρκοῦσιν ὥστε νὰ ἀνασυστήσωσι τὴν κύριαν κίνησιν ἀπὸ λήθην καὶ ἱερατικὴν μνήμην εἰς θεσμικὴν τάξιν καὶ καθολικὴν ἀντίστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀπροσδιόριστον ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθʼ ὃν ἡ κοσμολογικὴ γνώσις μεταβαίνει εἰς συγκεκριμένους θεσμούς καὶ ἡ ἱερατικὴ μαρτυρία γίνεται ἀπόδειξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ τοῦ συμπλέγματος εἶναι ἰσχυροτάτη στὴν σύνδεσιν φυσικῆς φθορᾶς, ἀπωλείας γραφῶν, λειτουργικοῦ χωρισμοῦ καὶ ἀντιμετωπίσεως δουλώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ διαμεσολαβημένην μνήμην, ἐπιλεκτικὴν συμπύκνωσιν καὶ ἀνοικτὴν ἐρμηνείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B05","text":"Ἀντιστέκεται εἰς πλήρη ἀξιωματικὴν μείωσιν ἡ ἀμφισημία τῆς Ἀθηναϊκῆς ἰσχύος, ἥτις εἶναι ἅμα ἐλευθερωτικὴ καὶ ἐνδεχομένως ἡγεμονική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232026668685Z_e36e75d6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 07–09","source_sha256":"b12a65f253a4906f98685b2aa2292f368578bbf8b41ab81e83b97376f1ddd9fd","sha256":"8cdc34700de8c536a276274515f16e2aeb24aebbe83170d3be301c0bf6a197de","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:20:26.671785+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-01","text":"The central aporia asks how ancient political magnitudes can be recognized when collective memory fails.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-02","text":"Historical ignorance is reframed as the result of periodic catastrophe, loss of writings, and interruption of education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-03","text":"Memory is preserved not naturally, but through institutions, archives, and priestly bearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-04","text":"The city is constituted as a hierarchical composition of functions, cosmological education, and military mission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-05","text":"The local polity is elevated into a global political subject through opposition to a universal power of enslavement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-06","text":"Ancient Athens is presented as a latent form of political excellence, which is recognized only through recovery and restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-07","text":"The catastrophe simultaneously obliterates the tyrant, the defender, and the means of empirical verification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BAS-08","text":"The movement is spiral-shaped: forgetting, recovery, political reinterpretation, and new loss constitute an open cycle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The absence of memory does not prove the absence of events, but can testify to an interruption of their bearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Natural decay chiefly obliterates writing, education, and institutional continuity, not necessarily the human race.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Writing shifts from a means of communication into a mechanism of political continuity and power over the past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The polity becomes a whole in which social division, education, divine order, military strength, and memory mutually produce one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Political order requires distinct kinds and functions, so that unity is not identified with confusion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Prudence extends from cosmic contemplation to sciences, institutions, and strategic action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Athenian virtue is constituted as the capacity to liberate others, but by means of a form of power that can acquire hegemonic features.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] The catastrophe obliterates both the Atlantic hegemony and the original Athenian military subject, leaving only mediated memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Political excellence appears as a latent possibility, which forgetting conceals but does not create from nothing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Geographical place is transformed into a global map of political zones, hegemonies, and resistances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","text":"[Emergent] Historical truth emerges from the combination of obliteration, fragmentary transmission, and later interpretive reconnection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Freedom does not pre-exist as a secure condition, but is produced through resistance to concentrated power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-01","text":"Memory recurs as written archive, priestly possession, oral transmission, and interpretive lens; its function shifts from preservation to legitimation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AS3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-02","text":"Natural catastrophe recurs, but shifts from a cause of forgetting to a mechanism of leveling and of inability to verify.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-03","text":"Athens shifts from a forgotten city to a model polity and then to a bearer of universal liberation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-04","text":"The distinction of functions recurs as social hierarchy, as distribution of knowledge, and as allocation of political power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-05","text":"War changes meaning: from the task of the fighting kind, it becomes evidence of virtue and an instrument of liberation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:A3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-06","text":"Place is detached from geographical particularity and converted into an environmental, cosmological, and strategic factor.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AS5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RMD-07","text":"Atlantis does not remain an autonomous place, but is absorbed as the contrary model of universal political expansion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:NX2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-01","text":"The correction of Solon's individual ignorance remains local; it ascends only when it explains the political power of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-02","text":"The precise arrangement of the particular kinds is a lower-level schema, whereas the principle of functional separation scales into a global architecture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-03","text":"The cyclical alternation of catastrophe and restarting constitutes a current principle of the complex, not merely a motif of one chapter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-04","text":"Priestly knowledge bridges lost history and political claim, and thus shifts from a local bearer into a structural principle of validation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-05","text":"The external threat dissolves the limitation of internal virtue and transforms the polity into a historical mission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:CGD-06","text":"The simple opposition of Athenians and Atlanteans is surpassed by the unstable kinship between liberating and hegemonic power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-01","text":"The linear idea of historical progress is rejected, because civilization can be obliterated and restarted.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-02","text":"The identification of the present with the measure of the possible is rejected, because the forgotten past contains unactivated forms of political excellence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-03","text":"The self-generated and lawlessly constituted city is rejected, because the polity requires divine order, law, and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-04","text":"Simple military superiority as a criterion of virtue is rejected; strength must be integrated into order and liberation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-05","text":"Natural and pre-existing freedom is rejected, because freedom appears only when a power of enslavement is confronted.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:GNX-06","text":"History as a complete and unobstructed repository of events is rejected, because access to it depends on surviving transmissions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-01","text":"It is excluded that the present suffices as the measure of human political possibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-02","text":"A purely natural or purely epistemic explanation of forgetting is excluded; decay is intertwined with the loss of institutions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-03","text":"Historical discourse as independent of the bearer of archives is excluded, because knowledge follows possession of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-04","text":"The identification of political worth and contemporary recognition is excluded, because forgetting can conceal excellence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-05","text":"A polity of virtue without hierarchical distinction and functional separation is excluded, just as indiscriminate social unity is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:DBN-06","text":"A world in which freedom is separated from danger, war, and collective strength is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-01","text":"Self-sufficient modern self-consciousness is absent, because the present can dwell upon the ruins of forgotten polities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-02","text":"The human self-foundation of the city is absent; the principle is displaced into divine order, place, and inherited education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-03","text":"A world is absent in which just hegemony can be absolutely separated from expansionist domination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-04","text":"Immediacy between past and present is absent; political significance is generated through recollection and interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSA-05","text":"Final victory is absent, because catastrophe can obliterate even the bearer of victory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-01","text":"Catastrophe becomes not a mere background of history, but a mechanism that determines which polities can be known.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-02","CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","CH_JP8E_SE_6:A2","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-02","text":"Internal order acquires a universal claim only when the external threat compels it to act on behalf of others.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-04","CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SE_7:D7","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-03","text":"The priestly preservation of writing and the functional separation of the city form an analogous architecture: continuity depends on distributed bearers.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-03","CL_JP8E_03:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-04","text":"The Athenian polity is recovered as a paradigm only because lost action is reconnected with later theory.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-09","CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6","CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-05","text":"Natural decay levels tyrant and defender, but memory restores asymmetric political worth between them.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-08","CL_JP8E_03:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:XD-06","text":"Liberating and hegemonic expansion are distinguished not by strength, but by political purpose and relation to others.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-07","CL_JP8E_03:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2","CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-01","text":"Political reality is constituted threefold: as institutional order, as the testing of external threat, and as the survival of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-02","text":"The history of the complex is post-catastrophic; the event acquires full political significance only when it returns through the archive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-03","text":"Virtue is not an essence enclosed within a city, but a relation of resistance, liberation, and assumption of risk.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-04","text":"Archival continuity is a political battlefield, because whoever holds memory also holds the interpretation of political worth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:SD3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-05","text":"Catastrophe produces a double result: it obliterates political bodies, but makes necessary the power of mediated memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:A8","CH_JP8E_SE_8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:BSD-06","text":"Time does not necessarily advance the polity; it restores fragments that require political synthesis anew.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-01","text":"Catastrophe → loss of writing → forgetting → archival asymmetry → recovery of the past → new political legitimation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1","CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-02","text":"Internal arrangement → external threat → military proof → liberation of others → hegemonic ambiguity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS3","CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-03","text":"The geographical horizon expands, the threat is universalized, and the city is compelled to shift from local law to a global task.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:D1","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-04","text":"Writing becomes a mechanism: from a repository of events it is transformed into a regulator of who has a past and who has a political claim.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3","CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-05","text":"Natural decay constitutes a phase point: from the history of actions, the account shifts into the history of memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:D5","CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:RLE-06","text":"The hidden attractor of the system is the ancient Athenian polity, which returns as proof, model, and open problem.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SE_8:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B01","text":"Periodic natural decay destroys writing, education, and political continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B02","text":"The interruption of memory transforms the historical event into myth and compels survivors to restart.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B03","text":"The uninterrupted archival community accumulates knowledge and produces asymmetric interpretive power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B04","text":"The polity coordinates functional separation, cosmic education, divine selection, and military capacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B05","text":"Expanded geography produces a universal threat, which tests the internal political order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B06","text":"Athenian resistance transforms virtue from internal arrangement into liberating action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FGS-B07","text":"The new catastrophe obliterates the bearers, but leaves memory as the interpretive basis of later political theory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B01","text":"Insufficient memory → periodic catastrophe → loss of writing → priestly archival asymmetry.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B02","text":"Archival recovery → revelation of hierarchical polity → connection of cosmology and prudence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B03","text":"Expansion of the world → Atlantic universal threat → Athenian resistance → liberation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:AFM-B04","text":"Natural catastrophe → obliteration of political bodies → mnemonic reactivation → open interpretation of political virtue.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-01","text":"History is reclassified from linear succession into a cycle of catastrophe, forgetting, and restarting.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-02","text":"Ignorance ceases to signify absence and becomes a symptom of lost archival continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-03","text":"Writing becomes a political mechanism, and the archival bearer acquires interpretive sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-04","text":"Social division appears as a condition of good order, while undivided unity is disclosed as confusion of functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-05","text":"Military victory is reclassified as evidence of total political virtue and not as mere possession of strength.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-06","text":"The geographical map becomes an open system of political zones, in which the local city can undertake a global task.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MME-07","text":"The opposition of freedom and hegemony ceases to be a simple dichotomy, because both presuppose superiority of strength.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** The account examines Athens, Atlantis, laws, kinds, priests, wars, and floods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** Beneath the particular persons operate mechanisms of archival preservation, functional separation, cosmological education, and strategic confrontation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Political virtue is judged by whether it can check a universal threat and transform strength into liberation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Time is destructive and repetitive, while political order remains mortal and memory is subsequently reconstructive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** The discourse imitates the archival work it describes, because from fragments, transmissions, and analogies it reconstructs a political past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-01","text":"The city liberates others through superiority, but this superiority can take a hegemonic form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-02","text":"Priestly testimony becomes necessary for recovery of the truth, but the exact proof of the testimony remains open.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-03","text":"Hierarchical order grounds virtue, but the universal soteriological claim requires worth beyond internal limits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:FL-04","text":"Catastrophe nullifies empirical continuity, but simultaneously produces the need for narrative preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-01","text":"Memory mutates from a deficiency into an active principle of reclassifying the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-02","text":"Military power mutates from an attribute of an order into a public token of virtue.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-03","text":"The city mutates from a local community into a bearer of universal liberation, without shedding its hegemonic element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MP-04","text":"Natural catastrophe mutates from an external interruption into a constitutive mechanism of historical time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a cyclical mechanism in which catastrophe, forgetting, archival preservation, and political reactivation succeed one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-02","text":"The human being becomes not an autonomous master of time, but a guardian, fighter, witness, or interpreter of broken continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-03","text":"Time is spiral-shaped: events disappear, but return as reconstructed models of political action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:HSI-04","text":"Escape requires resistance and preservation of memory, but never guarantees final victory over decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B01","text":"These axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal movement from forgetting and priestly memory to institutional order and universal resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B02","text":"The precise manner in which cosmological knowledge passes into concrete institutions and priestly testimony becomes proof remains indeterminate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_7:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B03","text":"The coherence of the complex is strongest in the connection of natural decay, loss of writings, functional separation, and confrontation with enslavement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, but depends on mediated memory, selective condensation, and open interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_6:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_03:MRT-B05","text":"The ambiguity of Athenian power resists complete axiomatic reduction, being at once liberating and potentially hegemonic.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_03@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_03:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 07–09"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 07–09","context":"Section 23 · Section 24 · Section 25","original_title":"Chapters 07–09","original_context":"Section 23 · Section 24 · Section 25"},"original_title":"Chapters 07–09","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 10–12","order":4,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SE_9","CH_JP8E_S_10","CH_JP8E_S_11"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_04@R001","sha256":"cd75e4789ee1fd9b0e1d39c3f41cc916a716edde0a4cdec926065370f6352bc1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ καταστήσῃ τὸν λόγον ἀληθῆ διὰ ἀναμνήσεως, τάξεως, αἰτιολογίας καὶ κοινῆς δοκιμῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἀνάμνησις οὐκέτι σημαίνει παθητικὴν φύλαξιν, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸν ἀνασύνθεσιν τοῦ παρελθόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-03","text":"Ὁ μῦθος μεταφέρεται εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς μόνον ὅταν ὁ λόγος αὐτοῦ ἀκριβῶς καὶ πρεπόντως ἀποδοθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ διήγησις ἀναβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν πόλιν εἰς τὴν κοσμολογίαν καὶ τὴν ἀνθρωπολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία παρέχει τὸ ὀντολογικὸν ἔδαφος, ἐπειδὴ τὸ αἰσθητὸν γιγνόμενον ἀπαιτεῖ αἴτιον καὶ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-06","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία παρουσιάζεται ὡς ὕστερον προϊόν κοσμικῆς γενέσεως, παιδείας, νόμου καὶ μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-07","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ λόγου παραμένει σχεσιακή, διότι ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ θείαν εὔνοιαν, λέγοντα καὶ ἀκούοντας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής· ἀπὸ μνήμην ἐπανέρχεται εἰς αἰτιολογίαν καὶ ἀπὸ αἰτιολογίαν εἰς πολιτικὴν ταυτότητα, ἥτις πάλιν ὑποβάλλεται εἰς ἔλεγχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ ἀληθὴς λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνασύνθεσιν καὶ οὐχὶ πλαστὴν μυθοποιίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ μνήμη μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ χρονικὴν ἐδραίωσιν εἰς μέθοδον ἐνεργοῦ γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης παράγεται διὰ τῆς συνδέσεως γενέσεως, παιδείας, νόμου καὶ προγονικῆς μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶν τὸ γιγνόμενον ἀπαιτεῖ αἴτιον καὶ οὐ δύναται νὰ εἶναι ἀρχὴ ἑαυτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ μῦθος ἀπὸ κλειστὴ μυθικὴ διήγησις μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἐρμηνευτικὸν προσχέδιον τοῦ ἀληθινοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ παραγωγὴ γνώσεως εἶναι κοινὴ ἐνέργεια θείας ἐπικλήσεως, λέγοντος καὶ ἀκουόντων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ τάξις ἀπὸ τὸ ἀγέννητον καὶ νοητὸν εἰς τὸ γενητὸν καὶ αἰσθητὸν θεμελιοῖ τὴν ὕστερον πολιτικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ καταλληλότης τοῦ λόγου λειτουργεῖ ὡς τελικὸν κριτήριον τῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ κόσμος, ὡς γενητὸς καὶ αἰσθητός, ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ὑπερκείμενον αἰτιακὸν λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀνάγκη αἰτίας ἀποδεικνύεται ἰσχυρότερον ἢ ὁ πλήρης προσδιορισμὸς τῆς φύσεως αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Τὸ σύστημα κυκλοφορεῖ περὶ τῆς ἀπουσίας ἀπολύτου ἐγγυήσεως τοῦ ἀληθοῦς λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πόλις ἀναγιγνώσκεται ὡς ἱστορικὴ συνέχεια ἣ συνδέει τὸ παρόν, τὸ προγονικόν, τὸ κοσμικὸν καὶ τὸ θεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ συμπυκνωμένη μηχανὴ διασώζει τὴν φοράν τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀφίησιν ἀπροσδιόριστον τὴν τελικὴν πολιτικὴν διήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ μνήμη ἐπανέρχεται ἀρχικῶς ὡς ἀνάκλησις, ἔπειτα ὡς ἀνασύνθεσις, καὶ τέλος ὡς θεμέλιον πολιτικῆς συνέχειας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς διδασκαλίας μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μηχανισμὸν διατηρήσεως εἰς ἐγγύησιν ἀκριβείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-03","text":"Ὁ μῦθος μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀφήγησιν τοῦ παρελθόντος εἰς μηχανὴν ἐρμηνείας τοῦ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μύθου καὶ ἀληθείας δὲν παραμένει ἀπόλυτος· μετασχηματίζεται εἰς διάκρισιν πλαστοῦ λόγου καὶ ἐλεγχόμενης μεταφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-05","text":"Τὸ ἀμετάβλητον παράδειγμα καὶ τὸ γενητὸν εἴδωλον καθίστανται τὸ ὀντολογικὸν πρότυπον τῆς ἀντιθέσεως μνήμης καὶ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ παρουσία, ἥτις ἀρχικῶς φαίνεται βεβαίωσις, ἀναστρέφεται εἰς τεκμήριον γενέσεως καὶ ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ὑπόθεσις ταυτότητος δὲν τελεσιουργεῖται ὡς βεβαιότης, ἀλλὰ παραμένει ὑπὸ ἔλεγχον καὶ δύναται νὰ μεταβληθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ σιωπὴ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἔλλειψιν λόγου εἰς ὅρον μεταβιβάσεως καὶ ἀναλήψεως νέας ἀφηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-09","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια ἐπιτελεῖ ἔργον, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν ἀβεβαιότητα περὶ τοῦ πραγματικοῦ περιεχομένου τοῦ ἀληθοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀνάγκη ἀκριβοῦς ἀνακλήσεως συγκεκριμένου λόγου· ἀναβαίνει δὲ εἰς τὸ παρὸν ἐπίπεδον ἡ μετατροπὴ τῆς μνήμης εἰς πολιτικὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-02","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ σκηνικὴ κατανομὴ τῶν ὁμιλητῶν· γεφυροῦσα δὲ γίνεται ἡ ἀμοιβαία ξενία, ἥτις μετατρέπει τὴν διήγησιν εἰς κοινὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-03","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀπόδειξις ὅτι ὁ οὐρανὸς γέγονεν· ἀναβαίνει δὲ ἡ γενικὴ ἀρχὴ ὅτι τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὂν ἀπαιτεῖ ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία κόσμος–ἄνθρωπος–πόλις δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ παράθεσις θεμάτων, ἀλλὰ ἀναγκαία κλίμαξ θεμελιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀνάγνωσις τοῦ μύθου ὡς παραδόσεως ὑπερβαίνεται ὅταν ὁ μῦθος γίνεται ὄργανον πολιτικῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ κοσμογονικὴ αἰτιολογία δὲν ἀρκεί καθ᾽ ἑαυτήν· ἐντὸς τοῦ συμπλέγματος recodificata γίνεται ὡς ὅρος πολιτικῆς νομιμοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-07","text":"Ὑποκαθίσταται ἡ ἰδέα τῆς ἁπλῆς ἀναπαραγωγῆς ὑπὸ τὴν ἰδέαν τῆς διαδοχικῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως καὶ ἐξετάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ὁ λόγος ὃς ἀπαιτεῖ ἀλήθειαν διὰ πλαστοῦ μύθου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ πολιτικὴ διήγησις ἡ ἀποκεκομμένη ἀπὸ κοσμογονίαν καὶ ἀνθρωπογονίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀνάμνησις ἡ περιοριζομένη εἰς κεφαλαιώδη σχήματα ἄνευ τῶν καθ᾽ ἕκαστα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ αὐτάρκεια τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ κόσμου, ἐπειδὴ τὸ γιγνόμενον ἀπαιτεῖ αἴτιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος κυριότης τοῦ λέγοντος, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ θείαν εὔνοιαν καὶ ἀκροατῶν μάθησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ αὐτόματη ταύτισις τοῦ μυθικοῦ τόπου πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν πόλιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι ὅτι τὸ παρόν δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ ἄνευ προγονικῆς καὶ κοσμολογικῆς ἀναφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι ὅτι ἡ πολιτικὴ κοινότης ἔχει ἀρχὴν ἐν ἑαυτῇ καὶ οὐκ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ γένεσιν καὶ παιδείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι ὅτι τὸ γιγνόμενον καὶ τὸ ἀεὶ ὂν ἀνήκουσιν εἰς ἓν ὀντολογικὸν γένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι ὅτι ἡ ἀλήθεια ἰσοδυναμεῖ πρὸς ἀπλήρωτον βεβαιότητα, ἄνευ ἐλέγχου καὶ ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ ψευδὲς εἶναι ὅτι ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποκαλύπτει αὐτομάτως τὸ ὄντως ὂν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης λόγου ὃς ἐγγυᾶται ἑαυτὸν ἄνευ μνήμης, παραδείγματος, αἰτίας καὶ κοινῆς κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ καθαρὰ διάκρισις ἡ ἀποκόπτουσα τὸν μῦθον ἀπὸ τῆς ἀληθείας· ὁ μῦθος ἐπιβιοῖ ὡς ἐλεγχόμενον πρότυπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ὃς εἶναι ἅμα αἰσθητὸς καὶ ἀγέννητος, αὐτάρκης καὶ ἀναίτιος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτου ἐγγυήσεως κινεί τὸ σύστημα πρὸς διαρκῆ ἀνασύνθεσιν καὶ ἐπανέλεγχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-01","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ μνήμη γίνεται ἐνεργὸς ἀνασύνθεσις καὶ ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης ἀπαιτεῖ προγονικὴν ἀναφοράν, ἡ ἀνάκλησις μετατρέπεται εἰς μηχανισμὸν πολιτικῆς νομιμοποιήσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-02","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀλήθειαν καὶ ὁ κόσμος αἴτιον, ἡ ἀληθοφάνεια τοῦ πολιτικοῦ λόγου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ κοσμικὴν ἀρχὴν ἣν αὐτὸς δὲν παράγει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_10:D4","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-03","text":"Ἡ μετάθεσις τοῦ μύθου εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς καὶ ἡ διάκρισις ἀγεννήτου παραδείγματος καὶ γενητοῦ κόσμου συγκροτοῦσι κοινὴν λογικὴν μεταφορᾶς ἀπὸ πρότυπον εἰς εἴδωλον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SE_9:D4","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία κόσμου–ἀνθρώπου–πόλεως καθιστᾷ τὴν πολιτικὴν ἱστορία ἀποτέλεσμα καὶ οὐχὶ ἀρχήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπαίτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου συμπλέκεται μὲ τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν ὅτι ὁ ἀνθρώπινος λόγος δὲν δύναται νὰ ἐγγυηθῇ μόνος τὴν ἐπιτυχίαν του.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀκρίβεια τῆς ἀναδιηγήσεως δὲν λύνει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ἀβεβαιότητα· μόνον μεταφέρει τὸ πρόβλημα ἀπὸ τὴν μνήμην εἰς τὴν αἰτιολογίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-07","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ δοκιμὴ τοῦ λόγου λειτουργεῖ ὡς πολιτικὸ ἀνάλογον τῆς κοσμικῆς αἰτιολογίας: ἀμφότερα ζητοῦσιν ἀρχὴν ἔξωθεν τῆς ἁπλῆς ἐμφανίσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_11:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀνοιχτὴ δυνατότης ἄλλης ἐξηγήσεως δὲν ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην λόγου, ἀλλὰ καθιστᾷ τὴν ἀνασύνθεσιν ἀναθεωρήσιμον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα προτάσεως εἰς διαδικασίαν ἀνασυνθέσεως, θεμελιώσεως καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πόλις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ὀντολογικὸν παράγωγον: ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης ἔχει ἀρχὴν ἐν κόσμῳ, ἐν προγόνους καὶ ἐν παιδείᾳ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀποκάλυψις τοῦ κόσμου ὡς γενητοῦ ἀνατρέπει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ αἰσθητὴ παρουσία ἀποτελεῖ ἔσχατον κριτήριον πραγματικότητος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἱστορία καθίσταται ἔγκυρος λόγος μόνον ὅταν ἐνσωματῶνῃ τὴν ἀλυσίδα παράδειγμα–γένεσις–παιδεία–μνήμη.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημικὴ ἀξίωσις τοῦ λόγου συνοδεύεται ὑπὸ ἐπιστημολογικῆς ταπεινώσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἰτία ἀναγκαία μένει ἀλλ᾽ ἀπροσδιόριστος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ μηχανὴ ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἀναζήτησιν ἑνὸς τελικοῦ θεμελίου διὰ διαδοχικῆς ἀναφορᾶς ἀπὸ λόγον εἰς μνήμην, ἀπὸ μνήμην εἰς παράδειγμα, καὶ ἀπὸ παράδειγμα εἰς πόλιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-01","text":"Ἀκρόασις → μνήμη → ἀνασύνθεσις → λόγος → ἔλεγχος → νέα ἀνάγκη μνήμης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-02","text":"Μῦθος → μεταφορὰ → πολιτικὴ ταυτότης → ἱστορικὴ ἀναφορά → ἐπανερμηνεία τοῦ μύθου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-03","text":"Αἴσθησις → γένεσις → αἴτιον → παράδειγμα → κριτήριον ποιότητος τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-04","text":"Κόσμος → ἄνθρωπος → παιδεία → πόλις· ἡ πολιτικὴ ὕπαρξις ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην κοσμολογικῆς θεμελιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπίκλησις τοῦ θείου δὲν κλείει τὸν λόγον, ἀλλὰ ἀνοίγει τὴν συνεργασίαν θεῶν, λέγοντος καὶ ἀκροατῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ ἔλεγχος τῆς καταλληλότητος γίνεται ἀτραπὸς ἀναθεωρήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀκριβὴς μνήμη δὲν ἀρκεί πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-07","text":"Ἀ attractor τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι λόγος ἀκριβής, πρέπων, αἰτιολογημένος καὶ κοινῇ ἐξεταζόμενος, ὅστις ὅμως οὐδέποτε παγιώνεται ὡς ἀπόλυτος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B01","text":"Πρόσφατος ἀκρόασις ἀποδεικνύεται ἀνεπαρκής· ἡ χρονικὴ ἐδραίωσις τῆς μαθήσεως παράγει ἰσχυροτέραν μνήμην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ μνήμη διὰ ἐσωτερικῆς ἐπισκοπήσεως γίνεται ἀκριβὴς ἀνασύνθεσις καὶ ἀναδιήγησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις μεταφέρει τὸν μῦθον εἰς τὸ ἀληθὲς, ἀλλὰ ὑποβάλλει τὴν μεταφορὰν εἰς κοινὸν ἔλεγχον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀπαίτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου ἀναγκάζει τὴν ἀφήγησιν νὰ ἀναβῇ ἀπὸ τὴν πολιτικὴν πόλιν εἰς κόσμον καὶ ἄνθρωπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ διαίρεσις τοῦ ἀγεννήτου καὶ τοῦ γενητοῦ θεμελιοῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην αἰτίας καὶ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ θεμελίωσις ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὴν πόλιν ὡς παιδευμένην, μνημονικὴν καὶ προγονικὴν κοινότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ κλείνει προσωρινῶς μὲ κριτήριον καταλληλότητος, ἀλλὰ παραμένει ἀνοικτὴ διὰ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν πλήρους προσδιορισμοῦ τοῦ αἰτίου καὶ τοῦ ἀληθοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀνεπαρκὴς πρόσφατος μνήμη → χρονικὴ ἐδραίωσις → ἐσωτερικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀκριβὴς ἀναδιήγησις → μετάθεσις τοῦ μύθου εἰς τὸ ἀληθές → κοινὸς ἔλεγχος καταλληλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B03","text":"Ἱερὰ περίστασις → ἀπαίτησις ἀληθοῦς λόγου → κοσμολογία → ἀνθρωπολογία → πολιτικὴ ἱστορία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ διαίρεσις → γνωστικὴ ἀντιστοίχησις → καθολικὴ αἰτιακὴ ἀνάγκη → παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B05","text":"Γενητὸς κόσμος → ἀναγκαία αἰτία → παιδευμένη πόλις → ἀναθεωρήσιμος πολιτικὴ ταυτότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-01","text":"Ἡ μνήμη ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἐνεργὸς παραγωγὴ νοήματος καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ διατήρησις παρελθόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μύθου καὶ ἀληθείας μετασχηματίζεται εἰς διαδικασίαν μεταφορᾶς, θεμελιώσεως καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-03","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης παύει νὰ εἶναι αὐτοτελὴς καὶ γίνεται ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῆς, ἀνθρωπολογικῆς καὶ παιδευτικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις παύει νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς ἔνδειξις αὐταρκείας καὶ γίνεται σημεῖον γενέσεως καὶ ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἀφήγησις τοῦ κόσμου, τοῦ ἀνθρώπου καὶ τῆς πόλεως γίνεται μία ἱεραρχικὴ μηχανὴ καὶ οὐχὶ τρία χωριστὰ πεδία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-06","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος τοῦ συστήματος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνάγνωσιν ἡ ὁποία παρακολουθεῖ μετατοπίσεις, ἀναστροφὰς καὶ ἐπανελέγχους, οὐχὶ μόνον θέματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα πραγματεύεται ἀναδιήγησιν παλαιοῦ λόγου, ἱερὰν ὁμιλίαν, γένεσιν κόσμου καὶ ταυτότητα πόλεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, ἐνεργοῦσι χρόνος, μνήμη, παράδειγμα, αἰτία, παιδεία, νόμος καὶ συλλογικὸς ἔλεγχος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ὁ μῦθος χρησιμεύει ὡς ὄργανον ἐπαναπροσδιορισμοῦ τῆς παρούσης πολιτικῆς θέσεως, ἐνώ ἡ κατανομὴ λόγων ρυθμίζει τὴν ἀνάληψιν τῆς ἐρμηνείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ ἀγέννητον παράδειγμα ἀντιτίθεται πρὸς τὸ γενητὸν παρόν, ἐνώ ἡ μνήμη γεφυροῖ παρελθὸν καὶ πόλιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς καὶ ἐπιτελεστικῶς, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐκτελεῖ αὐτὸ ποὺ διδάσκει: ἀνασυνθέτει, ἱεραρχεῖ, μεταφέρει καὶ ἐλέγχει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-01","text":"Ὁ λόγος ζητεῖται ὡς ἀληθής, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἐπιτυχία του ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ θείαν εὔνοιαν καὶ ἀνθρωπίνην ἱκανότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ταύτισις τῆς παλαιᾶς πόλεως πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν εἶναι παραγωγικὴ ὡς ὑπόθεσις, ἀλλὰ ἀσταθὴς ὡς ἀπόδειξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-03","text":"Ἡ αἰτία τοῦ κόσμου καθίσταται ἀναγκαία, ἀλλὰ ἡ φύσις αὐτῆς μένει ἀπροσδιόριστος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-04","text":"Ἡ συλλογικὴ ἀλήθεια ἀπαιτεῖ κοινὸν λόγον, ἀλλὰ ὁ κοινὸς λόγος δὲν ἐξασφαλίζει μόνος του τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-01","text":"Ἡ μνήμη μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀνάκλησις καὶ γίνεται πολιτικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-02","text":"Ὁ μῦθος μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενον ἀπομνημονεύσεως γίνεται πρότυπον ἐρμηνείας τοῦ ἀληθινοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-03","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ φαινομενικὴν βεβαίωσιν γίνεται τεκμήριον γενητότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-04","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ παροῦσα κοινότης γίνεται ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῆς γενέσεως καὶ παιδευτικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκονίζεται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ μηχανὴ μεταφορᾶς, ἐν ᾗ τὸ ἀγέννητον παράδειγμα παράγει γενητὸν κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι γεγονὸς ἐξαρτώμενον, ὁ δὲ ἄνθρωπος ὂν ἐνδιάμεσον μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς αἰτίας καὶ πολιτικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος δὲν εἶναι γραμμὴ ἀπὸ παρελθὸν εἰς παρόν, ἀλλὰ κύκλος ἀνακλήσεως, μεταφορᾶς καὶ ἐπανελέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ μόνη δυνατὴ στρατηγικὴ ἐλευθερία εἶναι ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις καὶ ὁ ἔλεγχος τῶν γεφυρῶν μεταξὺ μνήμης, κόσμου καὶ πόλεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ μνήμην εἰς πολιτικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν θεμελίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν διάκρισιν ἀναμνήσεως, ἀναδιηγήσεως, μεταφορᾶς, αἰτιολογίας καὶ ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις τοῦ ἀληθοῦς λόγου, ἡ ταυτότης τοῦ κοσμικοῦ αἰτίου καὶ τὰ πραγματολογικὰ κριτήρια τοῦ πρέποντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B04","text":"Συνεκτικὸν μένει τὸ σύστημα ὅταν διατηρῇ τὴν ἱεράρχησιν ἀγέννητον ὄν → γενητὸς κόσμος → ἄνθρωπος → πόλις, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀνοιχτὴ ἀναθεώρησις παραμένει ἀναγκαία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232058366144Z_5447317c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 10–12","source_sha256":"cd75e4789ee1fd9b0e1d39c3f41cc916a716edde0a4cdec926065370f6352bc1","sha256":"8364c114a4aa35d361728f02473c50011763221016c025c4f6b3d3aa09b54db6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:20:58.367127+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-01","text":"The system seeks to make the account true through recollection, order, causal explanation, and common testing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-02","text":"Recollection no longer signifies passive preservation, but active reconstruction of the past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-03","text":"Myth is transferred into the true only when its account is rendered precisely and fittingly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-04","text":"The political narrative ascends from the city to cosmology and anthropology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-05","text":"Cosmology provides the ontological ground, since the perceptible becoming requires a cause and a paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-06","text":"The polity is presented as a subsequent product of cosmic generation, education, law, and memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-07","text":"The truth of the account remains relational, because it depends on divine favor, speaker, and hearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AS-08","text":"The movement is spiral: from memory it returns to causal explanation, and from causal explanation to political identity, which in turn is subjected to examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The true account requires reconstruction and not fabricated myth-making.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Memory changes from temporal consolidation into a method of active knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Political identity is produced through the linkage of generation, education, law, and ancestral memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Everything that comes to be requires a cause and cannot be its own principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Myth changes from a closed mythical narrative into an interpretive outline of the true world.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The production of knowledge is a common activity of divine invocation, speaker, and hearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] The ontological order from the ungenerated and intelligible to the generated and perceptible grounds the subsequent political order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] The appropriateness of the account functions as the final criterion of reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] The cosmos, as generated and perceptible, is subject to a superordinate causal account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The necessity of a cause is demonstrated more strongly than the complete determination of its nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] The system circulates around the absence of an absolute guarantee of the true account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","text":"[Emergent] The city is read as a historical continuity linking the present, the ancestral, the cosmic, and the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GA-13","text":"[Terminal] The condensed mechanism preserves the direction of the account, but leaves the final political narrative indeterminate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-01","text":"Memory recurs first as recollection, then as reconstruction, and finally as the foundation of political continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-02","text":"The repetition of teaching mutates from a mechanism of preservation into a guarantee of precision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-03","text":"Myth shifts from a narration of the past into a mechanism for interpreting the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-04","text":"The distinction between myth and truth does not remain absolute; it is transformed into a distinction between fabricated account and tested transfer.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-05","text":"The unchanging paradigm and the generated image become the ontological model for the opposition between memory and the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-06","text":"Perceptible presence, which initially appears as confirmation, is reversed into evidence of generation and dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-07","text":"The hypothesis of identity is not brought to completion as certainty, but remains under examination and can change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-08","text":"Silence mutates from a lack of account into a condition of transmission and of undertaking a new narrative.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RMD-09","text":"Precision accomplishes work, but does not eliminate uncertainty concerning the actual content of the true.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-01","text":"The need for precise recollection of a particular account remains local; the transformation of memory into a political mechanism rises to the present level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-02","text":"The dramatic distribution of speakers remains local; mutual hospitality becomes bridging, transforming the narrative into a common activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-03","text":"The proof that the heaven has come to be remains local; the general principle that perceptible being requires explanation rises up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-04","text":"The sequence cosmos–human–city is not a simple juxtaposition of themes, but a necessary scale of grounding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-05","text":"The local reading of myth as tradition is surpassed when myth becomes an instrument of political identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-06","text":"Local cosmogonic causal explanation is not sufficient in itself; within the complex recodificata it becomes a condition of political legitimation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:CGD-07","text":"The idea of simple reproduction is replaced by the idea of successive reconstruction and examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-01","text":"The account that demands truth through fabricated myth is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-02","text":"The political narrative cut off from cosmogony and anthropogony is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-03","text":"Recollection restricted to general outlines without particulars is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-04","text":"The self-sufficiency of the perceptible cosmos is rejected, because what comes to be requires a cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-05","text":"The absolute sovereignty of the speaker is rejected, because the account requires divine favor and the learning of hearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:GNX-06","text":"The automatic identification of the mythical place with the present city is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that the present can be understood without ancestral and cosmological reference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the political community has its principle in itself and does not depend on generation and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that what comes to be and what always is belong to one ontological genus.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that truth is equivalent to unqualified certainty, without examination and dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that perception automatically reveals what truly is.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-01","text":"There is absent the possibility of an account that guarantees itself without memory, paradigm, cause, and common judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-02","text":"There is absent a pure distinction cutting myth off from truth; myth survives as a tested model.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-03","text":"There is absent a cosmos that is at once perceptible and ungenerated, self-sufficient and uncaused.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSA-04","text":"The absence of an absolute guarantee moves the system toward continual reconstruction and re-examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-01","text":"Because memory becomes active reconstruction and political identity requires ancestral reference, recollection is transformed into a mechanism of political legitimation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SE_9:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-02","text":"Because the account requires truth and the cosmos a cause, the plausibility of political discourse depends on a cosmic principle which it itself does not produce.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_10:D4","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-03","text":"The transfer of myth into the true and the distinction between ungenerated paradigm and generated cosmos constitute a common logic of transfer from model to image.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SE_9:D4","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-04","text":"The hierarchy of cosmos–human–city makes political history an outcome and not a principle.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-05","text":"The requirement of a true account is intertwined with the recognition that human discourse cannot by itself guarantee its success.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_10:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-06","text":"The precision of retelling does not resolve ontological uncertainty; it merely transfers the problem from memory to causal explanation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-07","text":"The common testing of the account functions as a political analogue of cosmic causal explanation: both seek a principle beyond mere appearance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_11:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:XD-08","text":"The open possibility of another explanation does not invalidate the need for an account, but makes reconstruction revisable.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CL_JP8E_04:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SE_9:A9","CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-01","text":"Truth is transformed from a property of a proposition into a process of reconstruction, grounding, and examination.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-02","text":"The city appears as an ontological derivative: political identity has its principle in cosmos, in ancestors, and in education.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_10:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-03","text":"The disclosure of the cosmos as generated overturns the idea that perceptible presence constitutes the ultimate criterion of reality.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-04","CL_JP8E_04:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-04","text":"Political history becomes a valid account only when it incorporates the chain paradigm–generation–education–memory.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-03","CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-05","text":"The epistemic claim of the account is accompanied by epistemological humility, because the cause remains necessary but indeterminate.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-06","CL_JP8E_04:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:BSD-06","text":"The overall mechanism replaces the search for a single final foundation with successive reference from account to memory, from memory to paradigm, and from paradigm to city.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-02","CL_JP8E_04:GA-05","CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-01","text":"Hearing → memory → reconstruction → account → examination → new need for memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-02","text":"Myth → transfer → political identity → historical reference → reinterpretation of myth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-03","text":"Perception → generation → cause → paradigm → criterion of the cosmos's quality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-04","text":"Cosmos → human → education → city; political existence returns to the need for cosmological grounding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-05","text":"The invocation of the divine does not close the account, but opens the cooperation of gods, speaker, and hearers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-06","text":"The examination of appropriateness becomes a path of revision, because precise memory is not sufficient for truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:RLE-07","text":"An attractor of the system is an account that is precise, fitting, causally explained, and commonly examined, yet never fixed as absolute.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B01","text":"Recent hearing proves insufficient; the temporal consolidation of learning produces stronger memory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B02","text":"Through internal review, memory becomes precise reconstruction and retelling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B03","text":"Reconstruction transfers myth into the true, but subjects the transfer to common examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B04","text":"The requirement of a true account compels the narrative to ascend from the political city to cosmos and human.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B05","text":"The ontological division of the ungenerated and the generated grounds the necessity of cause and paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B06","text":"Cosmological grounding returns to the city as an educated, memorial, and ancestral community.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FGS-B07","text":"The mechanism closes provisionally with a criterion of appropriateness, but remains open because of the inability fully to determine the cause and the true.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B01","text":"Insufficient recent memory → temporal consolidation → internal reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B02","text":"Precise retelling → transfer of myth into the true → common examination of appropriateness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B03","text":"Sacred occasion → requirement of a true account → cosmology → anthropology → political history.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B04","text":"Ontological division → cognitive correspondence → universal causal necessity → paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:AFM-B05","text":"Generated cosmos → necessary cause → educated city → revisable political identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-01","text":"Memory is reclassified as active production of meaning and not as simple preservation of the past.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-02","text":"The distinction between myth and truth is transformed into a process of transfer, grounding, and examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-03","text":"Political identity ceases to be self-contained and becomes the outcome of cosmic, anthropological, and educational order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-04","text":"Perception ceases to function as an indication of self-sufficiency and becomes a sign of generation and dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-05","text":"The narrative of cosmos, human, and city becomes one hierarchical mechanism and not three separate fields.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MME-06","text":"The system's method requires a reading that tracks shifts, reversals, and re-examinations, not themes alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B01","text":"On the surface, the system treats the retelling of an old account, sacred speech, the generation of the cosmos, and the identity of the city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, time, memory, paradigm, cause, education, law, and collective examination are operative.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, myth serves as an instrument for redefining the present political position, while the distribution of accounts regulates the undertaking of interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the ungenerated paradigm is opposed to the generated present, while memory bridges past and city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically and performatively, the form of the account performs what it teaches: it reconstructs, hierarchizes, transfers, and examines.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-01","text":"The account is sought as true, but its success depends on divine favor and human capacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-02","text":"The identification of the old city with the present one is productive as a hypothesis, but unstable as proof.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-03","text":"The cause of the cosmos becomes necessary, but its nature remains indeterminate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:FL-04","text":"Collective truth requires common account, but common account does not by itself secure truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-01","text":"Memory mutates when it ceases to be recollection and becomes political reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-02","text":"Myth mutates when, from an object of memorization, it becomes a model for interpreting the true.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-03","text":"Perception mutates when, from apparent confirmation, it becomes evidence of generatedness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MP-04","text":"The polity mutates when, from a present community, it becomes the outcome of cosmic generation and educational succession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_10:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-01","text":"Reality is figured as a hierarchical mechanism of transfer, in which the ungenerated paradigm produces a generated cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-02","text":"The cosmos is a dependent fact, and the human is an intermediate being between cosmic cause and political form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-03","text":"Time is not a line from past to present, but a cycle of recollection, transfer, and re-examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:HSI-04","text":"The only possible strategic freedom is the reconstruction and examination of the bridges between memory, cosmos, and city.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal movement from memory to political and cosmological grounding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the distinction among recollection, retelling, transfer, causal explanation, and examination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B03","text":"The precise nature of the true account, the identity of the cosmic cause, and the pragmatic criteria of the fitting are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SE_9:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_04:MRT-B04","text":"The system remains coherent when it preserves the hierarchy ungenerated being → generated cosmos → human → city, but open revision remains necessary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_11:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_04@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_04:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 10–12"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 10–12","context":"Section 26 · Section 27 · Section 28","original_title":"Chapters 10–12","original_context":"Section 26 · Section 27 · Section 28"},"original_title":"Chapters 10–12","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 13–15","order":5,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_12","CH_JP8E_SEC3","CH_JP8E_S_13"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_05@R001","sha256":"b0a378c5bdcbd7677e61099ca29659bd4127933558b9d7e3fc5663e529eef3d3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα εἶναι πῶς ἡ ἄτακτος πολλότης δύναται νὰ συγκροτηθῇ ὡς ἓν κάλλιστον καὶ νοερὸν ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀπάντησις μεταφέρει τὸ κριτήριον ἀπὸ τὰ φαινόμενα εἰς τὸ ἀίδιον καὶ νοητὸν παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀγαθότης τοῦ δημιουργοῦ λειτουργεῖ ὡς παραγωγικὴ ἀρχὴ, ἥτις μεταβάλλει τὴν ἀταξίαν εἰς τάξιν καὶ κάλλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B04","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου, ἔμψυχος, ἔννους καὶ καθολικῶς περιεκτικός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B05","text":"Ἡ μοναδικότης τοῦ κόσμου ἐξάγεται ἐκ τῆς καθολικῆς περιεκτικότητος τοῦ παραδείγματος καὶ οὐκ ἐκ ἀριθμητικῆς ἀποφάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B06","text":"Ἡ ὑλικὴ σύστασις ἀπαιτεῖ μέσον δεσμὸν, διὰ τοῦ ὁποίου τὰ διεστῶτα συνάγονται εἰς ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B07","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία συνδέει τὸ νοητὸν εἶδος πρὸς τὸ σωματικὸν γίγνεσθαι καὶ καθιστᾷ τὴν ἑνότητα παραγόμενον δεσμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ κίνησις εἶναι ἀπὸ τὴν ἀγαθότητα εἰς τὴν ὁμοίωσιν, ἀπὸ τὴν ὁμοίωσιν εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἑνότητα εἰς τὸν εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ θεία ἀγαθότης οὐ φθονεῖ, ἀλλὰ βούλεται τὰ γενόμενα ὅτι μάλιστα ὁμοιωθῆναι πρὸς τὸ ἄριστον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ἀίδιον καὶ νοητὸν παράδειγμα προηγείται ὡς μέτρον τοῦ γεγονότος κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ κόσμος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ εἰκόνα τοῦ ἀϊδίου εἰς ἔμψυχον καὶ ἔννουν ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ τάξις καὶ τὸ κάλλος ὑπερέχουν τῆς ἀταξίας καὶ τοῦ ἀτελοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἀγαθότης λειτουργεῖ ὡς νόμος δημιουργικός, ὁ ὁποῖος ἀναγκάζει τὸ γινόμενον πρὸς τὸ κάλλιστον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὅλον ἔχει προτεραιότητα ἔναντι τῶν μερῶν, ἐπειδὴ τὰ μέρη νοοῦνται ὡς περιεχόμενα ἐν αὐτῷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἑνότης δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία διαιρέσεως, ἀλλὰ ἔργον μέσου καὶ ἀναλογικοῦ δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ πολλαπλότης μετακινείται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ἀριθμητικὴν διάστασιν εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν περιεκτικότητα ἑνὸς ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ διαφορὰ παραδείγματος καὶ εἰκόνος καθορίζει τὸ μέτρον τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ εἰκὼς μῦθος ἀποτελεῖ τὸ προσήκον πέρας τῆς γνώσεως περὶ τοῦ γεγονότος καὶ τῶν θεῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ κοσμικὴ πραγματικότης τείνει πρὸς ἓν καθολικὸν ὅλον, ὃ συνάπτει παράδειγμα, ψυχήν, νοῦν καὶ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-12","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ὁμοίωσις δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ μορφικὴ ἀντιγραφή, ἀλλὰ καθολικὴ περιεκτικότης καὶ ἀναλογικὴ σύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀγαθότης ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἀρχικῶς ὡς ἠθικὴ ἰδιότης, μεταλλάσσεται δὲ εἰς κοσμογονικὸν νόμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ τάξις μετακινείται ἀπὸ ἀξιολογικὴ προτίμησις εἰς ὀντολογικὴ ἀναγκαιότητα τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ εἰκών ἀρχικῶς δηλοῖ σχέσιν πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα, ἀλλὰ ὕστερον γίνεται ἔμψυχος φορεὺς τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μοναδικότητα εἰς δεσμόν, ὥστε τὸ ἓν νὰ περιλαμβάνῃ καὶ νὰ συνάγῃ τὰ πολλά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης δὲν καταργεῖται, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ τὴν καθολικὴν περιεκτικότητα τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ ὕλη παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀσύνδετον ὑπόστρωμα καὶ γίνεται ἀκολουθία ἀπαιτήσεων πρὸς τὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-07","text":"Ὁ λόγος περὶ τοῦ κόσμου ἀπὸ ἀξίωσιν ἀκριβείας μετατοπίζεται εἰς ἀναλογίαν καὶ εἰκότα μῦθον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους γνώσεως δὲν παραμένει ἔλλειμμα, ἀλλὰ γίνεται μεθοδολογικὸς κανὼν τοῦ προσήκοντος λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς διάταξις πυρός, γῆς καὶ τοῦ τρίτου δεσμοῦ· καθολικὴ γίνεται ἡ ἀνάγκη σχέσεως καὶ συνδέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-02","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀπόδειξις περὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς οὐρανοῦ, ἐνώ κεντρικὴ γίνεται ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι τὸ τέλειον ὁμοίωμα δὲν διπλασιάζεται ἐξωτερικῶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ σύνδεσις νοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἀναβαίνει ἀπὸ εἰδικὴ κοσμολογικὴ ἀκολουθία εἰς γενικὸν πρότυπον ὁλοκληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκριση εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει τὴν ὀντολογίαν τοῦ κόσμου μὲ τὴν ἐπιστημολογίαν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία καταλύει τὸ φαινομενικὸν χάσμα μεταξὺ νοητοῦ εἴδους καὶ σωματικῆς συνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἀταξία παύει νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς αὐτάρκης ἀρχή καὶ recoditur ὡς ὕλη ἐπιδεχομένη μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται κόσμος αὐτόνομος, ἄψυχος καὶ ἄλογος, ὁ ὁποῖος δὲν ἀναφέρεται εἰς παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀταξία ὡς τελικὴ κοσμικὴ κατάστασις καὶ ἀναγνωρίζεται μόνον ὡς ἀρχικὸν ὑλικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ πολλαπλότης ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ παράθεσις ἀνεξαρτήτων κόσμων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἑνότης ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπουσία διαφορᾶς· ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ σχέσιν, μέσον καὶ δεσμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀξίωσις ὅτι ὁ λόγος δύναται νὰ ἔχῃ ἴσην ἀκρίβειαν περὶ τοῦ ἀϊδίου καὶ τοῦ γεγονότος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-01","text":"Τὸ γεγονὸς δὲν δύναται νὰ κατέχῃ τὴν αὐτὴν ὀντολογικὴν βεβαιότητα μὲ τὸ ἀίδιον παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-02","text":"Ἡ ὕλη δὲν δύναται νὰ ἀποτελέσῃ μόνη τὸν ἔσχατον ὅρον τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-03","text":"Τὸ μερικὸν δὲν δύναται νὰ χρησιμεύσῃ ὡς τέλειον πρότυπον τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-04","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης δὲν δύναται νὰ παραχθῇ ἄνευ σχέσεως μεταξὺ τῶν ὅρων οὓς ἑνοποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία καταρρέει ἐὰν ἡ ἀγαθότης ἀποσυνδεθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν δημιουργικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-01","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει κόσμος ἴσος, πλήρης καὶ ἀνεξάρτητος παρὰ τὸ τέλειον παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἦν πολλότης ἔξωθεν τοῦ ἑνὸς καθολικοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει λόγος ὁ ὁποῖος ἀπαιτεῖ πλήρη ἐπιστήμην περὶ τοῦ γεγονότος καὶ τοῦ θείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ταυτότητος εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος διατηρεῖ τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἀναλογίας καὶ τοῦ εἰκότος μύθου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-01","text":"Ἡ θεία ἀγαθότης γίνεται ἀναγκαιότης κοσμικῆς τάξεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀγαθὴ βούλησις καὶ τὸ κάλλιστον ἔργον συγκλίνουν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","CL_JP8E_05:GA-01","CL_JP8E_05:GA-04","CL_JP8E_05:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-02","text":"Ἡ εἰκών ἀποκτᾷ διπλῆν λειτουργίαν· δηλοῖ μὲν ὀντολογικὴν ἐξάρτησιν, συγκροτεῖ δὲ τὸ ὁρατὸν ὡς ζῷον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC3:D5","CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","CL_JP8E_05:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-03","text":"Ἡ καθολικότης τοῦ παραδείγματος μετατρέπει τὴν μοναδικότητα τοῦ κόσμου ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὸν συμπέρασμα εἰς ὀντολογικὴν ἀπαίτησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:D2","CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","CL_JP8E_05:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία μεταφέρει τὴν ἀρχὴ τῆς ὁμοιώσεως ἐκ τοῦ νοητοῦ πεδίου εἰς τὴν ὑλικὴν σύνδεσιν τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:D5","CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4","CL_JP8E_05:GA-07","CL_JP8E_05:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἄρνησις τοῦ ἀσυνδέτου ὑποστρώματος καὶ ἡ ἄρνησις τῆς ἀτάκτου τελικότητος συγκροτοῦν κοινὴν ἀποφατικὴν ἀρχὴν: οὐδὲν μέρος ἑρμηνεύεται ἄνευ τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX3","CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","CL_JP8E_05:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους γνώσεως δὲν ἀκυροῖ τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἐπιβάλλει λόγον ἀνάλογον πρὸς τὸ ὂν καὶ τὸ εἶδος αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5","CL_JP8E_05:GA-09","CL_JP8E_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης παράγεται ἐκ συμπτώσεως δύο κινήσεων: ὁμοιώσεως πρὸς ἓν παράδειγμα καὶ δεσμεύσεως τῶν πολλῶν εἰς ἓν σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης ἀποβάλλει τὸ καθεστὼς αὐτοτελοῦς ἀρχῆς καὶ γίνεται ἐσωτερικὸ περιεχόμενον τοῦ κοσμικοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἐλεύθερον γεγονὸς εἰς ἀναγκαίαν ἐκτύπωσιν τῆς ἀγαθότητος καὶ τοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία καὶ ἡ ἐπιστημολογία ἀκολουθοῦν κοινὴν ἱεραρχίαν: ὅσῳ κατωτέρον τὸ ὂν, τοσούτῳ ἀναλογικώτερος ὁ λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_12:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ τέλειος κόσμος δὲν ὁρίζεται ὡς ἄθροισμα τελείων μερῶν, ἀλλὰ ὡς ὅλον ὃ τὰ μέρη καθιστᾷ συγγενῆ καὶ λειτουργικά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τοῦ κόσμου ἀποκτᾷ ἀποφατικὴν ἀκρίβειαν: γνωρίζει τὸ μέτρον της ἐπειδὴ γνωρίζει τὴν ἀπόστασιν ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ ἀγαθότης παράγει ὁμοίωσιν, ἡ ὁμοίωσις παράγει τάξιν, καὶ ἡ τάξις ἐπιβεβαιοῖ τὴν ἀγαθότητα τοῦ δημιουργοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὸ παράδειγμα γεννᾷ τὸν κόσμον ὡς εἰκόνα, καὶ ἡ εἰκών ἐπιστρέφει πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα διὰ τῆς ὁμοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἐντείνεται διὰ διαδοχικῶν μεταβάσεων: ἓν παράδειγμα, ἓν ὅλον, ἓν δεδεμένον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης ἀντιστέκεται πρὸς τὴν ἑνότητα, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφᾶται τελικῶς ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ διαφορά τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία ἀκριβείας ἐπαναφέρει τὸ σύστημα εἰς τὸν εἰκότα μῦθον, ὅπου ἡ ἀποφατικὴ ἔλλειψις γίνεται τελικὸς κανών.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B01","text":"Ἀγαθότης τοῦ δημιουργοῦ → ἀπουσία φθόνου → βούλησις ὁμοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B02","text":"Ἀίδιον παράδειγμα → ὁμοίωσις → κόσμος ὡς εἰκών, ἔμψυχος καὶ ἔννους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B03","text":"Καθολικὴ περιεκτικότης τοῦ παραδείγματος → μοναδικότης τοῦ ὁμοιώματος → ἓν κοσμικὸν ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B04","text":"Ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτὸν σῶμα → πῦρ καὶ γῆ → ἀνάγκη μέσου δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B05","text":"Ἀναλογικὸς δεσμός → ἑνότης διατηροῦσα τὴν διαφοράν → καλὴ κοσμικὴ σύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B06","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ ἀπόστασις → γνωσιολογικὸς περιορισμός → εἰκὼς μῦθος ὡς τελικὴ μορφὴ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B09","text":"Ἄτακτος πολλότης → θεία ἀγαθότης → ἐπιβολὴ τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B10","text":"Τάξις → νοῦς ἐν ψυχῇ → ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι → κόσμος ἔμψυχος καὶ ἔννους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B11","text":"Καθολικὸν νοητὸν παράδειγμα → μοναδικὸν ὁμοίωμα → ἓν κοσμικὸν ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B12","text":"Δύο στοιχεῖα → ἔλλειψις αὐταρκείας → τρίτος δεσμός → ἀναλογία → ἑνότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B13","text":"Ὀντολογικὴ διαφορά → ὅρος γνώσεως → εἰκὼς μῦθος → παῦσις τῆς ἀπαιτήσεως πλήρους ἀκριβείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ σύνολον πραγμάτων εἰς ἓν ζῷον ἔχον ἐσωτερικὴν ζωὴν καὶ νόησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-02","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μέρους καὶ ὅλου ἀναστρέφεται, ἐπειδὴ τὰ μέρη λαμβάνουν νόημα ἐκ τῆς συμμετοχῆς εἰς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-03","text":"Τὸ ἐρώτημα περὶ τοῦ ἑνὸς ἢ τῶν πολλῶν μετατρέπεται εἰς ἐρώτημα παραδείγματος, ὁμοιώματος καὶ περιεκτικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς σύστημα σχέσεων καὶ ἀπαιτήσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς παθητικὸν ἢ αὐτάρκες ὑπόστρωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀναδιατάσσεται κατὰ βαθμίδας: τὸ ἀίδιον ἐπιδέχεται σταθερὸν λόγον, τὸ γεγονὸς εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ λόγος πραγματεύεται κόσμον, οὐρανόν, στοιχεῖα καὶ γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ πραγματικότης παράγεται διὰ σχέσεων παραδείγματος, εἰκόνος, ψυχῆς, νοῦ καὶ δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ σύστημα ἀναγκάζει τὴν κρίσιν νὰ ἀρχίζῃ ἀπὸ τὸ ὅλον καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπὸ τὰ μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ἀίδιον προηγείται, τὸ γεγονὸς ἀκολουθεῖ, καὶ ἡ γένεσις ἐμφανίζεται ὡς μετάβασις εἰς σταθερὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ λόγος μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενον, ἐπιλέγων εἰκότα μῦθον ἀντὶ ψευδοῦς ἀπολύτου ἀκριβείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-01","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία παρουσιάζεται ὡς λογικῶς ἀναγκαία ἐκ τῆς ἀγαθότητος, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἐλευθερία τῆς θείας βουλήσεως μένει ἀνεπίλυτος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-02","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ ἀναγκαίαν κοσμικὴν δομήν, ἐνώ ταὐτοχρόνως ὁμολογεῖ ὅτι ἡ πλήρης ἀκρίβεια περὶ αὐτῆς εἶναι ἀδύνατος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-03","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ καθόλου ὡς κάλλιστον εἰς τὸν κόσμον ὡς ὁμοίωμα παραμένει ἀναπόδεικτος γέφυρα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀντίπαλον κοσμικὸν καθεστὼς εἰς ἀρχικὸν ὑλικόν, ὃ δὲν ἔχει πλέον αὐτοτελῆ ἐξηγητικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-02","text":"Ἡ εἰκών μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ παθητικὴν ἀναπαράστασιν εἰς ἐνεργὸν ἀρχὴν ὁργανώσεως τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν μοναδικότητα εἰς παραγόμενον δεσμὸν, ὁ ὁποῖος διατηρεῖ τὴν διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ὑπολαμβάνει τὴν πραγματικότητα ὡς εἰκόνα ἡ ὁποία ἀναζητεῖ τὸ παράδειγμα διὰ διαδοχικῶν σχέσεων ὁμοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι ζῷον κοσμικόν, ἐν ᾧ τὸ σῶμα ἐμψυχοῦται καὶ νοεῖται διὰ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς συνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἐντὸς τοῦ συστήματος γίνεται λόγος πεπερασμένος, ὁ ὁποῖος δύναται νὰ ἀποδίδῃ μόνον εἰκότα ἀλήθειαν περὶ τοῦ γεγονότος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος φανερώνει μετάβασιν ἀπὸ ἀταξίαν εἰς τάξιν, ἐνώ ἡ τελικὴ τάξις ἀναφέρεται ἀναδρομικῶς εἰς τὸ ἀίδιον πρότυπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ἀγαθότητα καὶ τὸ παράδειγμα εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα καὶ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα δομὴ εὑρίσκεται στὴν ἀλληλουχία παραδείγματος, ὁμοιώματος, ὅλου καὶ δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουν ὁ χαρακτὴρ τοῦ τρίτου δεσμοῦ, ἡ φύσις τῆς ἀρχικῆς ἀταξίας καὶ τὸ περιθώριον θείας ἐπιλογῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ φιλοσοφικῆς ἀποδείξεως καὶ εἰκότος μύθου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232126544216Z_75e86010","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 13–15","source_sha256":"b0a378c5bdcbd7677e61099ca29659bd4127933558b9d7e3fc5663e529eef3d3","sha256":"f341616a106bd09e96374f13f1b56e5da9c6c1e2001dbae9861c35b6e556b2cb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:21:26.547244+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B01","text":"The principal problem is how disordered multiplicity can be constituted as one most beautiful and intelligible whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B02","text":"The answer transfers the criterion from phenomena to the eternal and intelligible paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B03","text":"The goodness of the demiurge functions as a productive principle, which transforms disorder into order and beauty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B04","text":"The cosmos is reconstituted as an image of the eternal, ensouled, intelligent, and universally comprehensive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B05","text":"The uniqueness of the cosmos is inferred from the universal comprehensiveness of the paradigm, and not from a numerical decision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B06","text":"Material composition requires an intermediate bond, through which the separated things are brought together into unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B07","text":"Proportion connects the intelligible form with corporeal becoming and renders unity a produced bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B08","text":"The final movement is from goodness to likeness, from likeness to unity, and from unity to the likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Divine goodness does not begrudge, but wishes that what has come to be should become as much as possible like the best.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The eternal and intelligible paradigm precedes as the measure of the generated cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The cosmos passes from being an image of the eternal to being an ensouled and intelligent whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Order and beauty surpass disorder and the incomplete.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Goodness functions as a demiurgic law, which compels what comes to be toward the most beautiful.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] The whole has priority over the parts, because the parts are conceived as contained within it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Unity is not a mere absence of division, but the work of an intermediate and proportional bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Multiplicity shifts from an external numerical dimension to the internal comprehensiveness of one whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] The ontological difference between paradigm and image determines the measure of human discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The likely myth constitutes the fitting limit of knowledge concerning what has come to be and the gods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Cosmic reality tends toward one universal whole, which conjoins paradigm, soul, intellect, and body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GA-12","text":"[Emergent] Likeness is not mere formal copying, but universal comprehensiveness and proportional composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-01","text":"Goodness recurs initially as an ethical property, but is transformed into a cosmogonic law.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-02","text":"Order shifts from an evaluative preference to an ontological necessity of the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-03","text":"The image initially signifies a relation to the paradigm, but later becomes an ensouled bearer of the intelligible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-04","text":"Unity is transformed from uniqueness into a bond, so that the one may encompass and gather together the many.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-05","text":"Multiplicity is not abolished, but absorbed under the universal comprehensiveness of the one cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-06","text":"Matter ceases to be an unconnected substratum and becomes a sequence of requirements directed toward unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-07","text":"The discourse concerning the cosmos shifts from a claim to precision to proportion and likely myth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RMD-08","text":"The incapacity for complete knowledge does not remain a deficiency, but becomes a methodological rule of fitting discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-01","text":"The precise arrangement of fire, earth, and the third bond remains local; the necessity of relation and connection becomes universal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-02","text":"The proof concerning the one heaven remains local, while the principle that the perfect likeness is not externally duplicated becomes central.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-03","text":"The connection of intellect, soul, and body rises from a specific cosmological sequence to a general model of integration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-04","text":"The distinction between image and paradigm bridges the chapters, because it connects the ontology of the cosmos with the epistemology of discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-05","text":"Proportion abolishes the apparent gap between intelligible form and corporeal composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:CGD-06","text":"Initial disorder ceases to function as a self-sufficient principle and is recoditur as matter receptive of form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-01","text":"A self-governing, soulless, and irrational cosmos that does not refer to a paradigm is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-02","text":"Disorder is rejected as a final cosmic state and recognized only as initial material.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-03","text":"Multiplicity is rejected as an external juxtaposition of independent cosmoses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-04","text":"Unity is rejected as a mere absence of difference; unity requires relation, an intermediate, and a bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:GNX-05","text":"The claim that discourse can possess equal precision concerning the eternal and what has come to be is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-01","text":"What has come to be cannot possess the same ontological certainty as the eternal paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-02","text":"Matter cannot by itself constitute the ultimate term of the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-03","text":"The partial cannot serve as a perfect model of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-04","text":"Unity cannot be produced without a relation between the terms that it unifies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:DBN-05","text":"Cosmology collapses if goodness is disconnected from demiurgic activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-01","text":"A cosmos equal, complete, and independent alongside the perfect paradigm remains impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-02","text":"A cosmos that would be a multiplicity outside the one universal whole remains impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-03","text":"A discourse demanding complete knowledge concerning what has come to be and the divine remains impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSA-04","text":"The absence of identity between image and paradigm preserves the field of proportion and likely myth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-01","text":"Divine goodness becomes the necessity of cosmic order, because good will and the most beautiful work converge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC3:A3","CL_JP8E_05:GA-01","CL_JP8E_05:GA-04","CL_JP8E_05:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-02","text":"The image acquires a double function: it signifies ontological dependence, while it constitutes the visible as a living being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC3:D5","CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","CL_JP8E_05:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-03","text":"The universality of the paradigm converts the uniqueness of the cosmos from a numerical conclusion into an ontological requirement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:A3","CH_JP8E_S_13:D2","CL_JP8E_05:GA-02","CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","CL_JP8E_05:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-04","text":"Proportion transfers the principle of likeness from the intelligible domain to the material connection of the elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:D5","CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4","CL_JP8E_05:GA-07","CL_JP8E_05:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-05","text":"The negation of the unconnected substratum and the negation of disordered finality constitute a common apophatic principle: no part is interpreted without the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","CH_JP8E_S_13:DNX3","CL_JP8E_05:GA-06","CL_JP8E_05:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:XD-06","text":"The incapacity for complete knowledge does not invalidate cosmic order, but imposes a discourse proportionate to the being and its form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5","CL_JP8E_05:GA-09","CL_JP8E_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-01","text":"Cosmic unity is produced from the concurrence of two movements: likeness to one paradigm and the binding of the many into one body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-02","text":"Multiplicity sheds the status of a self-complete principle and becomes the internal content of the cosmic whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_13:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-03","text":"Creation is transformed from a free event into a necessary imprint of goodness and the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-04","text":"Ontology and epistemology follow a common hierarchy: the lower the being, the more proportional the discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_12:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-05","text":"The perfect cosmos is defined not as a sum of perfect parts, but as a whole that renders the parts akin and functional.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:DNX6","CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:BSD-06","text":"Knowledge of the cosmos acquires apophatic precision: it knows its measure because it knows the distance from the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_12:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-01","text":"Goodness produces likeness, likeness produces order, and order confirms the goodness of the demiurge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF3","CH_JP8E_SEC3:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-02","text":"Reference to the paradigm generates the cosmos as an image, and the image returns to the paradigm through likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_13:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-03","text":"Unity is intensified through successive transitions: one paradigm, one whole, one bound body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-04","text":"Multiplicity resists unity, but is finally absorbed as an internal difference of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:RLE-05","text":"The incapacity for precision returns the system to likely myth, where apophatic deficiency becomes the final rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B01","text":"Goodness of the demiurge → absence of begrudging → will of likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B02","text":"Eternal paradigm → likeness → cosmos as image, ensouled and intelligent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B03","text":"Universal comprehensiveness of the paradigm → uniqueness of the likeness → one cosmic whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B04","text":"Visible and tangible body → fire and earth → necessity of an intermediate bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B05","text":"Proportional bond → unity preserving difference → beautiful cosmic composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FGS-B06","text":"Ontological distance → epistemological limitation → likely myth as the final form of discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B09","text":"Disordered multiplicity → divine goodness → imposition of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B10","text":"Order → intellect in soul → soul in body → cosmos ensouled and intelligent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B11","text":"Universal intelligible paradigm → unique likeness → one cosmic whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B12","text":"Two elements → lack of self-sufficiency → third bond → proportion → unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:AFM-B13","text":"Ontological difference → limit of knowledge → likely myth → cessation of the demand for complete precision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-01","text":"The cosmos is reclassified from a collection of things into one living being possessing internal life and intellection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-02","text":"The relation of part and whole is reversed, because the parts receive meaning from participation in the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-03","text":"The question concerning the one or the many is transformed into a question of paradigm, likeness, and comprehensiveness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-04","text":"Matter is reclassified as a system of relations and requirements, not as a passive or self-sufficient substratum.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MME-05","text":"Truth is rearranged in grades: the eternal admits stable discourse, what has come to be likely discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the discourse treats the cosmos, heaven, elements, and generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, reality is produced through relations of paradigm, image, soul, intellect, and bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, the system compels judgment to begin from the whole and not from the parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the eternal precedes, what has come to be follows, and generation appears as a transition into stable order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, discourse imitates its object, choosing likely myth instead of falsely absolute precision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-01","text":"Creation is presented as logically necessary from goodness, but the freedom of divine will remains unresolved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-02","text":"The discourse requires a necessary cosmic structure, while at the same time admitting that complete precision concerning it is impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:FL-03","text":"The transition from the universal as most beautiful to the cosmos as a likeness remains an unproved bridge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-01","text":"Disorder is transformed from an opposing cosmic regime into initial material, which no longer possesses autonomous explanatory power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-02","text":"The image is transformed from a passive representation into an active principle of the organization of the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MP-03","text":"Unity is transformed from numerical uniqueness into a produced bond, which preserves difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-01","text":"The system conceives reality as an image that seeks the paradigm through successive relations of likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-02","text":"The cosmos is a cosmic living being, in which the body is ensouled and made intelligible through internal composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-03","text":"The human being within the system becomes finite discourse, which can render only likely truth concerning what has come to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:HSI-04","text":"Time reveals a transition from disorder to order, while the final order refers retrospectively to the eternal model.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC3:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstructing the principal movement from goodness and the paradigm to unity and likely discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B02","text":"The strongest structure is found in the sequence of paradigm, likeness, whole, and bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B03","text":"The character of the third bond, the nature of initial disorder, and the scope of divine choice remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_13:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_05:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, but does not eliminate the tension between philosophical demonstration and likely myth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_12:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_05@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_05:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 13–15"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 13–15","context":"Section 29 · Section 30 · Section 31","original_title":"Chapters 13–15","original_context":"Section 29 · Section 30 · Section 31"},"original_title":"Chapters 13–15","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 16–18","order":6,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_14","CH_JP8E_S_15","CH_JP8E_S_16"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_06@R001","sha256":"8281b21b3b65658b0484002a7637a92b50766be1289ca7d6fc2313743f7698f8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-01","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα ἐστὶ πῶς ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν στοιχείων δύναται νὰ συγκροτήσῃ ἓν τέλειον καὶ αὐτάρκες ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία μετατρέπει τὴν ἑτερογένειαν εἰς σχέσιν, καὶ ἡ σχέσις εἰς ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-03","text":"Ἡ στερεὰ μορφὴ ἀπαιτεῖ διαδοχικὰς μεσότητας, ὥστε ὁ δεσμὸς νὰ μὴν εἶναι ἁπλὸς ἀλλὰ δομικῶς πλήρης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ὁλότης ὁρίζεται διὰ τοῦ ἀποκλεισμοῦ παντὸς ἐξωτερικοῦ ὑπολείμματος, ἐπιδράσεως καὶ συμπληρώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-05","text":"Ἡ τελειότης μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ πληρότητα μερῶν εἰς ἀπουσίαν ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-06","text":"Ἡ σφαῖρα καὶ ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις ἐνοποιοῦν μορφὴν καὶ ἐνέργειαν εἰς αὐτάρκη αὐτοκίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-07","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναδεικνύεται εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν καὶ συγχρόνως περιέχουσαν ἀρχήν, ἥτις κυβερνᾷ τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-08","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σωρευτική καὶ ἀναβατική: ἀναλογία, κλειστότης, αὐτάρκεια, ψυχικὴ κυριαρχία, ὀντολογικὴ ἑνότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀναλογία μετατρέπει τὴν διαφορὰν τῶν μερῶν εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν σχέσιν καὶ ἐκ ταύτης παράγει ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ στερεὰ ὁλότης ἀπαιτεῖ δύο μεσότητας, διότι ἡ ἁπλὴ σύνδεσις οὐκ ἀρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν πλήρη σύστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἑνότης οὐκ ἔστι συνύπαρξις στοιχείων, ἀλλὰ ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις σχέσεων ἥτις ἀνακαθορίζει τὰ μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ τέλειον ὅλον οὐκ ἐπιδέχεται στοιχεῖον, δύναμιν ἢ περιβάλλον ἔξωθεν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A9","CH_JP8E_S_14:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας μετασχηματίζει τὴν τελειότητα εἰς αὐτάρκειαν καὶ αὐτοπαραγωγὴν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ κλειστότης, ἀρχικῶς ὅρος ἀφθαρσίας, γίνεται γενικὸς ὀντολογικὸς ὅρος τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἑνότης καὶ ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις συγκλίνουσιν εἰς μορφὴν αὐτοκινήτου καὶ αὐταρκοῦς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ψυχὴ περιέχει καὶ κυβερνᾷ τὸ σῶμα, ὥστε ἡ συνοχὴ νὰ ἀποκτᾷ ἱεραρχικὴν καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον χωρικὴν μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ αὐτοταυτότης, ἡ αὐτογνωσία καὶ ἡ αὐτάρκεια συνιστῶσι τὸ τελικὸν μέτρον τελειότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D4","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ κόσμος γίνεται ἓν ἔμψυχον, ἐσωτερικῶς πλήρες καὶ ἐξωτερικῶς ἀνενδεὲς ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία ἐπανέρχεται ὡς δεσμὸς στοιχείων, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται εἰς γενεσιουργὸν ἀρχὴν ταυτότητος καὶ ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_14:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-02","text":"Τὸ μέσον μετακινεῖται ἀπὸ μεταβατικὸς δεσμὸς στοιχείων εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἀρχὴν περιεκτικῆς ψυχικῆς συνοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις ἐξωτερικοῦ στοιχείου ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἀπουσία φθορᾶς, αἰσθήσεως, διατροφῆς, ὀργάνων καὶ τελικῶς ἑτερότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ σφαῖρα ἀρχικῶς δηλοῖ πληρότητα μορφῆς, ἔπειτα δὲ μεταβάλλεται εἰς σχῆμα αὐτοταυτότητος καὶ αὐτοκινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκεια μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ πληρότητα τῶν τεσσάρων στοιχείων εἰς μηδενικὴν ἐξάρτησιν ἀπὸ ἕτερον ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη χρονικὴ ἀκολουθία ἀκυροῦται ὅταν ἡ ψυχὴ μετατίθεται εἰς ὀντολογικῶς προτέραν καὶ κυρίαν θέσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀκολουθία πυρός, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς παραμένει τοπικὴ μηχανὴ, ἐνώ ἡ σχέσις καὶ ἡ ἀναλογία κλιμακοῦνται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικότης καὶ ἡ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν ἓξ κινήσεων εἶναι τοπικαὶ λύσεις, αἱ ὁποῖαι ἀναβαθμίζονται εἰς γενικὴν ἀρχὴν ἐσωτερικῆς αὐτοκινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D1","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ κατάργησις ὀφθαλμῶν, ἀκοῆς, τροφῆς καὶ μελῶν δὲν εἶναι αὐτοτελὴς θέσις, ἀλλὰ ἐπιμέρους ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς γενικῆς κλειστότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ σύνδεσις καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ κυριαρχία γεφυροῦσι τὴν κοσμολογικὴν σύνθεσιν μὲ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἀντίθεσις ἀναλογίας καὶ αὐταρκείας παύει νὰ εἶναι τοπικὴ καὶ γίνεται κεντρικὴ γέφυρα τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀνάγκη ἐσωτερικῆς συντηρήσεως παραμένει ἀνολοκλήρωτος μηχανισμός, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐνδογενὴς φθορὰ δὲν ἐξηγεῖται πλήρως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ὁ κόσμος ὡς ἄτακτος συνάθροισις ἀνεξαρτήτων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ τελειότης ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ ἱκανότης, ἀντίστασις, λῆψις ἢ ἐξάρτησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἑνότης ὡς ἀπλὴ συνάφεια· ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἀναλογικὴν καὶ ἐσωτερικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ αἴσθησις, ἡ τροφή, ἡ ἄμυνα καὶ ἡ κίνησις ὡς καθολικοὶ ὅροι ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ φαινομένη χρονολογικὴ σειρά ὡς ἀσφαλὴς εἰκὼν τῆς ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ διαφορὰ δύναται καθ’ ἑαυτὴν νὰ γεννήσῃ κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὸ τέλειον ὅλον χρειάζεται ἐξωτερικὸν περιβάλλον πρὸς τὴν διατήρησίν του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὸ σῶμα ἀποτελεῖ τὸ ἔσχατον ὑποκείμενον τάξεως, κινήσεως καὶ νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἑτερότητα, ἀνταλλαγὴν ἢ ἀμοιβαίαν ἐξάρτησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὁ ἔξωθεν κόσμος ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος ὑπάρξεως, κινήσεως ἢ τελειότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀσύνδετος πολλαπλότης, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα διαφορὰ ὀφείλει νὰ μετασχηματισθῇ εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατον καθίσταται ὅλον ὃ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἄλλον, διότι ἡ τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ πλήρη αὐτοσχέσιν καὶ αὐτάρκειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ ἑνότης καὶ ἡ κοσμικὴ κλειστότης συντίθενται εἰς ἀρχὴν ἐσωτερικῆς σχέσεως ἄνευ ἐξωτερικῆς ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-04","CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία αἰσθητηρίων καὶ ὀργάνων παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ ἔλλειψιν καὶ γίνεται ἀπόδειξις τελειότητος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-03","text":"Ἡ σφαῖρα καὶ ἡ κυκλικὴ κίνησις συγκροτοῦσι κοινὸν σχῆμα αὐτοκινήσεως, ὅπου τὸ περιέχον καὶ τὸ κινούμενον συμπίπτουσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ λύει τὴν ἀντίθεσιν μεταξὺ ἐσωτερικῆς συνοχῆς καὶ κυριαρχίας, διότι περιέχει τὸ σῶμα ἐκ τῶν ἔνδον καὶ ὑπερβαίνει αὐτὸ ἐξουσιαστικῶς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-05","text":"Ἡ διόρθωσις τῆς διηγήσεως ὑποτάσσει τὸν χρόνον εἰς τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν καὶ ἀποσυνδέει τὸ πρῶτον ἀπὸ τὸ πρῶτον λεγόμενον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογικὴ μεσότης καὶ ἡ ψυχὴ ἀποτελοῦσι δύο βαθμίδας τοῦ αὐτοῦ μηχανισμοῦ: ἡ διαφορὰ συνδέεται διὰ ἐσωτερικῆς ἀρχῆς, ἥτις τελικῶς κυβερνᾷ τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_16:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ σχέσιν μεταξὺ μερῶν εἰς κλειστὴν αὐτοσχέσιν τοῦ ὅλου πρὸς ἑαυτό.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ τελειότης ἀνακαθορίζεται ὡς μηδενικὴ ἐξάρτησις ἀπὸ ἕτερον, καὶ ὄχι ὡς διευρυμένη δύναμις ἐπὶ τοῦ ἔξω.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ κοσμικὸν σῶμα γίνεται μηχανὴ αὐτοπαραγωγῆς, ἐν ᾗ μορφή, κίνησις, τροφή, συνοχὴ καὶ νόησις ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ γίνεται ὁ φορεὺς ὃς μετατρέπει τὴν γεωμετρικὴν ὁλότητα εἰς διοικούμενον καὶ ἔμψυχον κόσμον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-05","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ὑποβιβάζεται εἰς ἀφηγηματικὸν ἐπίπεδον, ἐνώ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ τάξις ἀνασυντίθεται ἱεραρχικῶς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CL_JP8E_06:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-01","text":"Διαφορὰ στοιχείων → ἀναλογία → μεσότης → ἑνότης → ὁλότης → ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικοῦ ὑπολείμματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-02","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ φθορά → ἀποκλεισμὸς τοῦ ἔξω → ἀπουσία ὀργάνων → αὐτοτροφία → κλειστὴ αὐτοσυντήρησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-03","text":"Σφαιρικὴ μορφή → κυκλικὴ κίνησις → αὐτοκίνησις → ἑνιαῖος οὐρανός → αὐτάρκεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-04","text":"Σῶμα → ψυχὴ ἐντός → ψυχὴ περιέχουσα → κυριαρχία → ἀναδρομικὴ ἀνασύστασις τοῦ σώματος ὡς κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀναδρομὴ τοῦ «ὅλου» ἀπὸ στοιχεῖα εἰς σῶμα, ἀπὸ σῶμα εἰς ψυχὴν καὶ ἀπὸ ψυχὴν εἰς θείαν αὐτογνωσίαν λειτουργεῖ ὡς κύριος ἐλκυστής.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B01","text":"Ἑτερογένεια στοιχείων → ἀναλογικὴ σχέσις → ἀμοιβαία μετατροπὴ διαφορῶν εἰς ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B02","text":"Στερεὰ ὁλότης → δύο μεσότητες → συνεχὴς δεσμὸς → ἓν ὁρατὸν καὶ ἁπτὸν σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B03","text":"Ὁλότης στοιχείων → ἀπουσία ἐξωτερικοῦ ὑπολείμματος → σφαιρικὴ περιεκτικότης → αὐτάρκεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B04","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ δύναμις → φθορά → ἀποκλεισμὸς τοῦ ἔξω → ἐνδογενὴς λειτουργία καὶ αὐτοτροφία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B05","text":"Ἀυτάρκης σφαῖρα → κυκλικὴ αὐτοκίνησις → ψυχὴ ἐντὸς καὶ διὰ παντός → συνοχὴ καὶ κυριαρχία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B06","text":"Φαινομένη χρονικὴ σειρά → ἀναθεώρησις → ὀντολογικὴ προτεραιότης ψυχῆς → θεῖον ὅλον αὐτάρκες καὶ αὐτογνώμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:AFM-B01","text":"Διαφορὰ στοιχείων → ἀναλογικὴ μεσότης → διπλὸς δεσμός → κοσμικὴ ὁλότης → ἀποκλεισμὸς τοῦ ἔξω → αὐτάρκεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:AFM-B02","text":"Κλειστὴ ὁλότης → σφαιρικὴ καὶ κυκλικὴ αὐτοκίνησις → ψυχικὴ περιεκτικότης → ἱεραρχικὴ τελειότης → αὐτογνωσία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-01","text":"Τὸ μέσον ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀπλὸν μεταβατικὸν διάστημα εἰς γενεσιουργὸν μηχανισμὸν ταυτότητος, συνοχῆς καὶ κυριαρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἀποσπᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν συνύπαρξιν καὶ ὁρίζεται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ ἀναλογικὴ ὁμολογία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-03","text":"Ἡ τελειότης μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἐνέργειαν εἰς τὴν κατάργησιν τῆς ἐξωτερικῆς χρείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-04","text":"Τὸ σῶμα παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀυτοτελὲς ὑποκείμενον καὶ γίνεται φορεὺς ψυχικῆς τάξεως καὶ ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-05","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀνασυντάσσεται ἀπὸ χρονικὴν ἀκολουθίαν εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν σχέσην ἀρχούσης καὶ ἀρχομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ κόσμος εἶναι τετραστοιχεῖος, σφαιροειδής, κυκλικῶς κινούμενος καὶ ἔμψυχος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀναλογία, αἱ μεσότητες, ἡ κλειστότης καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ συνοχὴ συγκροτοῦσι τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ τελειότης ἀναζητεῖται διὰ ἀποκλεισμοῦ, ἀναταξινομήσεως καὶ ἀναστροφῆς τῶν φαινομένων τάξεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ εἶναι εἶναι αὐτοτελές, αὐτοπαθές, αὐτογνώμον καὶ ἱεραρχικῶς διατεταγμένον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διορθοῖ τὴν γραμμικὴν διήγησιν ὑπὲρ βαθύτερης ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ σχέσεις ἀναλογίας, ἀλλὰ ἡ τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἀπουσίαν σχέσεως πρὸς ἕτερον· ἡ ἔντασις αὕτη λύεται μόνον διὰ διακρίσεως ἐσωτερικῆς καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-02","text":"Ἡ αὐτοτροφία προϋποθέτει ἐνδογενῆ φθοράν, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀφθαρσία ἀπαιτεῖ κατάργησιν τῆς φθορᾶς· ὁ μετασχηματισμὸς τῆς μιᾶς εἰς τὴν ἄλλην μένει ἀδήλωτος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-03","text":"Τὸ ὅλον περιέχει πάντα, ἀλλὰ συγχρόνως ἐνεργεῖ καὶ πάσχει ὡς ζῷον· ἡ καθολικὴ περιεκτικότης καὶ ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ ζωὴ οὐ συμπίπτουσιν ἀναίμακτα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-04","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ ἰσότης ἀντιτίθεται πρὸς τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν ἀνωτερότητα τῆς ψυχῆς, ὥστε ἡ γεωμετρικὴ συμμετρία νὰ συνυπάρχῃ μὲ κυριαρχικὴν ἀνισότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ ὑποτίθεται πρότερη τῆς διηγήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ διήγησις εἶναι τὸ μέσον δι’ οὗ ἡ προτεραιότης ἀποκαλύπτεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-01","text":"Τὸ μέσον μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀναλογικὸς δεσμὸς εἰς ψυχὴν περιέχουσαν· ἡ μετάλλαξις αὕτη ἀναβαθμίζει τὴν μεσότητα εἰς κυριαρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-02","text":"Ἡ αὐτάρκεια μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴ πληρότης στοιχείων εἰς ἀπουσίαν πάσης ἐξωτερικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-03","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ χωρικὴ μεταβολὴ εἰς φορέα νοήσεως, αὐτοκυβερνήσεως καὶ ὀντολογικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-04","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ γένεσις μεταλλάσσεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν γένεσιν, ὅπου τὸ ὕστερον λεγόμενον δύναται νὰ εἶναι πρῶτον κατ’ οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα φαντάζεται τὴν πραγματικότητα ὡς σφαῖραν αὐτοπεριεχομένην, ἣ συγκροτεῖται διὰ ἐσωτερικῶν λόγων καὶ οὐκ ἔχει ἔξωθεν περιβάλλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται ὄχι ἀπομονωμένον μέρος, ἀλλὰ ψυχικὴ ἀρχὴ ἥτις περιέχει, κινεί, κυβερνᾷ καὶ γνωρίζει ἑαυτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἐπιφάνεια ἀφηγηματική, ὑποταγμένη εἰς κυκλικὴν κίνησιν καὶ ὀντολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς ἀναλογίας, τῆς διπλῆς μεσότητος, τῆς κλειστότητος, τῆς κυκλικῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς ψυχικῆς προτεραιότητος ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τοῦ κύριου συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν διαφορὰν εἰς τὴν αὐτοκυβερνώμενην ὁλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα ἐν τῇ ἀναλογικῇ συνθέσει, τῇ ἀποκλείσει τοῦ ἔξωθεν καὶ τῇ ψυχικῇ ἱεραρχίᾳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B04","text":"Ἀδιευκρίνιστα μένουσιν ἡ ἐνδογενὴς συντήρησις, ἡ σύνθεσις ψυχῆς καὶ στοιχείων, καὶ ἡ συμφιλίωσις καθολικῆς περιεκτικότητος μὲ ἐσωτερικὴν πάθησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B05","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὑπὸ τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς αὐταρκείας, ἀλλὰ ἡ τελικὴ του τελειότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἄρρητον μετασχηματισμὸν φθορᾶς εἰς συντήρησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232151827572Z_0b7e19c2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 16–18","source_sha256":"8281b21b3b65658b0484002a7637a92b50766be1289ca7d6fc2313743f7698f8","sha256":"567a9701022a663ba0b898662dba66ad8f21cdd501e92525df457b228bbb3f29","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:21:51.830515+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-01","text":"The central problem is how the difference of the elements can constitute one perfect and self-sufficient whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-02","text":"Analogy transforms heterogeneity into relation, and relation into unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-03","text":"The solid form requires successive means, so that the bond may be not simple but structurally complete.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-04","text":"Cosmic wholeness is defined through the exclusion of every external remainder, influence, and complement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-05","text":"Perfection changes from fullness of parts into absence of external need.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-06","text":"The sphere and circular motion unify form and activity into self-sufficient self-motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-07","text":"Soul emerges as an internal and at the same time encompassing principle, which governs the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:SP-08","text":"The movement of the system is cumulative and ascending: analogy, closure, self-sufficiency, psychic sovereignty, ontological unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Analogy transforms the difference of the parts into reciprocal relation and from this produces unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Solid wholeness requires two means, because simple connection does not suffice for complete constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Unity is not the coexistence of elements, but an internal order of relations that redefines the parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] The perfect whole admits no element, power, or environment external to itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:A9","CH_JP8E_S_14:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The absence of external need transforms perfection into self-sufficiency and self-production.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Closure, initially a condition of incorruptibility, becomes a general ontological condition of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Geometrical unity and circular motion converge in the form of a self-moving and self-sufficient order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Soul encompasses and governs the body, so that cohesion acquires a hierarchical and not merely spatial form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Self-identity, self-knowledge, and self-sufficiency constitute the final measure of perfection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D4","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The cosmos becomes one ensouled, internally complete, and externally need-free whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-01","text":"Analogy recurs as a bond of elements, but is transformed into a generative principle of identity and unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_14:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-02","text":"The mean shifts from a mediating bond of elements into an internal principle of encompassing psychic cohesion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-03","text":"The lack of an external element recurs as the absence of corruption, sensation, nourishment, organs, and finally otherness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-04","text":"The sphere initially signifies fullness of form, then changes into a figure of self-identity and self-motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-05","text":"Self-sufficiency passes from the fullness of the four elements into zero dependence on another being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RMD-06","text":"The apparent temporal sequence is annulled when soul is transferred into an ontologically prior and sovereign position.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-01","text":"The precise sequence of fire, air, water, and earth remains a local mechanism, whereas relation and analogy are scaled up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-02","text":"Sphericity and the removal of the six motions are local solutions, which are elevated into a general principle of internal self-motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D1","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-03","text":"The abolition of eyes, hearing, food, and limbs is not an independent position, but a particular result of general closure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-04","text":"Analogical connection and psychic sovereignty bridge cosmological composition with ontological hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-05","text":"The initial opposition of analogy and self-sufficiency ceases to be local and becomes the central bridge of the system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:CGD-06","text":"The local necessity of internal maintenance remains an incomplete mechanism, because endogenous corruption is not fully explained.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-01","text":"The cosmos as a disorderly aggregation of independent parts is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-02","text":"Perfection as external capacity, resistance, reception, or dependence is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-03","text":"Unity as mere conjunction is excluded; unity requires an analogical and internal arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-04","text":"Sensation, nourishment, defense, and motion as universal conditions of life are excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:GNX-05","text":"The apparent chronological sequence is excluded as a reliable image of ontological order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that difference can by itself generate a cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the perfect whole needs an external environment for its preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that the body constitutes the ultimate subject of order, motion, and intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that perfection requires otherness, exchange, or reciprocal dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-01","text":"The external world is absent as a necessary condition of existence, motion, or perfection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-02","text":"Unconnected multiplicity is absent, since every difference must be transformed into internal unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSA-03","text":"A whole dependent upon another becomes impossible, because perfection requires complete self-relation and self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-01","text":"Analogical unity and cosmic closure are composed into a principle of internal relation without external dependence.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-04","CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-02","text":"The absence of sense-organs and instruments ceases to signify deficiency and becomes proof of perfection.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-03","text":"The sphere and circular motion constitute a common figure of self-motion, in which the encompassing and the moving coincide.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-04","text":"Soul resolves the opposition between internal cohesion and sovereignty, because it encompasses the body from within and surpasses it in authority.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-05","text":"The correction of the narrative subjects time to ontological hierarchy and disconnects the first from what is said first.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_16:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:XD-06","text":"Analogical mediation and soul constitute two stages of the same mechanism: difference is connected through an internal principle, which ultimately governs the whole.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_14:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_16:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-01","text":"The unity of the cosmos is transformed from a relation among parts into the closed self-relation of the whole to itself.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-01","CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-02","text":"Perfection is redefined as zero dependence upon another, and not as expanded power over the external.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-03","text":"The cosmic body becomes a mechanism of self-production, in which form, motion, nourishment, cohesion, and intellection depend on internal order.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-05","CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-04","text":"Soul becomes the bearer that transforms geometrical wholeness into a governed and ensouled cosmos.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-07","CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_16:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:BSD-05","text":"Time is demoted to a narrative level, while ontological order is hierarchically reconstituted.","refs":["CL_JP8E_06:GA-08","CL_JP8E_06:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-01","text":"Difference of elements → analogy → mediation → unity → wholeness → absence of external remainder.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-02","text":"External corruption → exclusion of the external → absence of organs → self-nourishment → closed self-maintenance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-03","text":"Spherical form → circular motion → self-motion → unified heaven → self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-04","text":"Body → soul within → encompassing soul → sovereignty → recursive reconstitution of the body as cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:RLE-05","text":"The recursion of the “whole” from elements to body, from body to soul, and from soul to divine self-knowledge functions as the principal attractor.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B01","text":"Heterogeneity of elements → analogical relation → reciprocal transformation of differences into unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B02","text":"Solid wholeness → two means → continuous bond → one visible and tangible body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B03","text":"Wholeness of elements → absence of external remainder → spherical encompassingness → self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B04","text":"External force → corruption → exclusion of the external → endogenous activity and self-nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B05","text":"Self-sufficient sphere → circular self-motion → soul within and throughout → cohesion and sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FGS-B06","text":"Apparent temporal sequence → revision → ontological priority of soul → divine whole, self-sufficient and self-knowing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_16:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:AFM-B01","text":"Difference of elements → analogical mediation → double bond → cosmic wholeness → exclusion of the external → self-sufficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:AFM-B02","text":"Closed wholeness → spherical and circular self-motion → psychic encompassingness → hierarchical perfection → self-knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-01","text":"The mean is reclassified from a simple mediating interval into a generative mechanism of identity, cohesion, and sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-02","text":"Unity is detached from mere coexistence and defined as internal analogical accord.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-03","text":"Perfection moves from external activity to the abolition of external need.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-04","text":"The body ceases to be an independent subject and becomes the bearer of psychic order and principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MME-05","text":"Generation is reconstituted from temporal sequence into a hierarchical relation of ruler and ruled.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the cosmos is composed of four elements, spheroidal, moving circularly, and ensouled.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, analogy, the means, closure, and psychic cohesion constitute the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, perfection is sought through exclusion, reclassification, and reversal of apparent orders.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, being is self-subsistent, self-affected, self-knowing, and hierarchically ordered.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, reconstruction corrects linear narrative in favor of a deeper ontological order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-01","text":"Unity requires relations of analogy, but perfection requires absence of relation to another; this tension is resolved only through the distinction between internal and external relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:D4","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-02","text":"Self-nourishment presupposes endogenous corruption, but incorruptibility requires the abolition of corruption; the transformation of the one into the other remains unstated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-03","text":"The whole contains everything, but at the same time acts and is affected as a living creature; universal encompassingness and internal life do not coincide without tension.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_15:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-04","text":"Spherical equality is opposed to the hierarchical superiority of soul, so that geometrical symmetry coexists with sovereign inequality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:A5","CH_JP8E_S_16:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:FL-05","text":"The principle is supposed to be prior to the narrative, but the narrative is the means through which priority is revealed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-01","text":"The mean changes from an analogical bond into an encompassing soul; this mutation elevates mediation into sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_16:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-02","text":"Self-sufficiency changes from internal fullness of elements into absence of every external relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_15:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-03","text":"Motion changes from spatial alteration into a bearer of intellection, self-governance, and ontological order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MP-04","text":"Temporal generation changes into hierarchical generation, in which what is said later can be first in essence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-01","text":"The system imagines reality as a self-enclosed sphere, constituted through internal relations and having no external environment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_15:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes not an isolated part, but a psychic principle that encompasses, moves, governs, and knows itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:A7","CH_JP8E_S_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as a narrative surface, subordinated to circular motion and ontological hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_16:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B01","text":"The principles of analogy, double mediation, closure, circular motion, and the priority of soul suffice for reconstruction of the principal system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, because it follows the transition from difference to self-governing wholeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_14:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B03","text":"Cohesion is strongest in analogical composition, exclusion of the external, and psychic hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B04","text":"Endogenous maintenance, the composition of soul and elements, and the reconciliation of universal encompassingness with internal affection remain unclear.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_16:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_06:MRT-B05","text":"The system is coherent under the principle of internal self-sufficiency, but its final perfection depends on an unspoken transformation of corruption into maintenance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_15:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_06@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_06:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 16–18"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 16–18","context":"Section 32 · Section 33 · Section 34","original_title":"Chapters 16–18","original_context":"Section 32 · Section 33 · Section 34"},"original_title":"Chapters 16–18","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 19–21","order":7,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_17","CH_JP8E_S_18","CH_JP8E_S_19"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_07@R001","sha256":"4621c2449181d449b896972106f5a7726ec1ee3bff620a865e50a43476edefd5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-01","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα εἶναι ἡ σύστασις ἑνότητος ἐκ ἀνομοίων καὶ δυσμείκτων ἀρχῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης δὲν δεδομένη ἁπλότης, ἀλλὰ παράγεται διὰ μεσότητος, μίξεως, λόγου καὶ ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-03","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ τάξις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἁρμονικὴν κίνησιν, ψυχὴν καὶ κοσμικὴν διακόσμησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀποτελεῖ τὸ μεταβατικὸν ὄργανον ὃ συνδέει τὴν μικτὴν οὐσίαν, τὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν γνώσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-05","text":"Ὁ κόσμος γίνεται ὁρατὴ εἰκὼν ἀϊδίου τάξεως, ἄνευ κυριολεκτικῆς ταὐτότητος πρὸς αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-06","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γεννᾶται ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος καὶ ὡς ἐνεργὸς ρυθμὸς τῆς κοσμικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-07","text":"Ἡ διαφορά, ἀντὶ νὰ ἀναιρεθῇ, ἐγγράφεται ἐντὸς ἱεραρχημένων κινήσεων, γνωστικῶν λειτουργιῶν καὶ χρονικῶν διαιρέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-08","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ κίνησις εἶναι κλιμακωτὴ καὶ κυκλική: ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνομοιότητα εἰς τὴν μίξιν, ἀπὸ τὴν μίξιν εἰς τὸν λόγον, καὶ ἀπὸ τὸν λόγον εἰς χρόνον καὶ γνώσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ὂν συγκροτεῖται ἐκ ἀμεροῦς, μεριστοῦ καὶ τρίτης μεσολαβητικῆς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","CH_JP8E_S_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἑνότης προϋποθέτει μίξιν ἀνομοίων γενῶν καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπαλοιφὴν τῆς διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A6","CH_JP8E_S_17:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ μεσότης μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ὑλικὴν συναρμογὴν εἰς μαθηματικὸν δεσμόν, ψυχικὴν κίνησιν καὶ γνωστικὴν διάκρισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ λόγος καὶ ἡ ἀναλογία μετατρέπουσι τὴν ἑτερογένειαν εἰς μετρητὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ψυχὴ εἶναι ἡ ἐνεργὸς μεσότης ἣ μετατρέπει τὴν κοσμικὴν σύστασιν εἰς κίνησιν καὶ γνῶσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_19:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ κυκλικότης συνδέει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαίρεσιν τῆς ψυχῆς, τὴν κοσμικὴν κίνησιν καὶ τὴν γένεσιν τοῦ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ διαίρεσις οὐ διαλύει τὸ ὅλον, ἀλλὰ ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν κοινὴν σύστασιν ἐν ταῖς μοίραις, τοῖς κύκλοις καὶ ταῖς γνωστικαῖς λειτουργίαις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ψυχικὴ κίνησις διακρίνει τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον καὶ παράγει διακεκριμένα εἴδη γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι ἔμψυχος καὶ νοήμων εἰκών, ἥτις μιμεῖται τὸ ἀΐδιον διὰ γεννητῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ χρόνος ἐστὶ παράγωγος τῆς κοσμικῆς κινήσεως καὶ κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος, οὐχὶ αὐθύπαρκτον δοχεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ τάξις τοῦ ὅλου ἐπιτυγχάνεται μόνον ὅταν ἡ διαφορά παραμένῃ ἐνεργὸς ἐντὸς τῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Τὸ γεννητὸν ἀποδίδει τὸ ἀΐδιον διὰ εἰκόνος καὶ κινήσεως, ἀλλὰ οὐδέποτε ταυτίζεται πρὸς αὐτό.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς μίξις, ἁρμονία, κυκλικὴ κίνησις καὶ εἰκονικὴ ὁμοιότης· ἡ ταυτότης αὐτῆς μεταβάλλεται κατὰ κλίμακα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἑτερότης μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ δύσμεικτον ὕλην εἰς διαιρετὴν φορὰν, ἔπειτα εἰς γνωστικὸν ἀντικείμενον καὶ χρονικὴν διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ τρίτη οὐσία ἀποκτά διαδοχικῶς τὴν μορφὴν μεσότητος, μαθηματικοῦ λόγου καὶ ψυχικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A4","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴ κατανομή μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν κύκλων καὶ εἰς διαφορὰς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ βία τῆς πρώτης συναρμογῆς ἀποσύρεται ῥητῶς, ἀλλὰ ἐπιβιώνει ὡς ἀνάγκη ρυθμίσεως καὶ ἀναλογικῆς συγκρατήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D3","CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-06","text":"Ὁ λόγος μετακινείται ἀπὸ κανόνα διανομῆς εἰς μηχανισμὸν κινήσεως καὶ τέλος εἰς φορέα γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-07","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναδύεται μόνον ὕστερον: ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν τάξιν καὶ κυκλικὴν κίνησιν γίνεται ὀντολογικὸς δείκτης τῆς διαφορᾶς μεταξὺ γεννητοῦ καὶ ἀϊδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ λεπτομέρεια, ἰδίως τὸ ὑπόλοιπον, ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ γενικωτέραν ἀρχὴν: οὐδεμία διαφορὰ μένει ἄλογος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","CH_JP8E_S_18:D2","CH_JP8E_S_18:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀκολουθία τῶν ἀριθμητικῶν λόγων καὶ τῶν ἑπτὰ κύκλων· καθολικὴ γίνεται ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ διαφορά ρυθμίζεται διὰ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A10","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-02","text":"Τοπικὴ εἶναι ἡ κοσμολογικὴ μικτὴ οὐσία· ἡ τριαδικὴ μεσολάβησις κλιμακοῦται εἰς καθολικὴν γενετικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν σύστασιν μὲ τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν γνώσιν καὶ τὸν χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ σώματα εἰς ψυχὴν εἶναι καταλυτικὴ μετατόπισις, διότι ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα διὰ τῆς παραγωγοῦ ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις, ἡ δόξα, ὁ νοῦς καὶ ἡ ἐπιστήμη δὲν εἶναι ἀνεξάρτητα ἐπεισόδια, ἀλλὰ τὰ ἀποτελέσματα μιᾶς κοινῆς ψυχικῆς μηχανῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-06","text":"Ὑπερβαίνει τὸ τοπικὸν ἐπιχείρημα ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ὁ χρόνος δὲν περιέχει τὴν κίνησιν, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ὑπ’ αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς μουσικὴ τεχνική καθίσταται ὑποδεέστερη τῆς ἀρχῆς ὅτι ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκριβῆ ἀλλὰ ὄχι ἀναγκαστικῶς ἐπαναλαμβανόμενην μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-08","text":"Τὸ ἀΐδιον δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς ἀνώτερον ἀντικείμενον, ἀλλὰ ὅριον πρὸς ὃ ἡ γεννητὴ εἰκὼν ἀναφέρεται χωρὶς νὰ ἐξαλείφεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἑνότης ἄμεσος, ἁπλῆ καὶ ἀμέριστος· ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ παραγωγήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:NX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἀποτελούμενος ἐκ μόνων σωμάτων, ἐπειδὴ τὸ σῶμα ἀπαιτεῖ προγενεστέραν ψυχικὴν καὶ ἀναλογικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἑτερότης ἄνευ σχέσεως, μεσότητος καὶ κοινοῦ μέτρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται χρόνος ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς κοσμικῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς ψυχικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται γνῶσις ὡς ἀκίνητος κατοχὴ ἢ ἁπλὴ ἀποτύπωσις τῶν πραγμάτων· ἡ γνῶσις εἶναι κίνησις διακρίνουσα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ταὐτότης παραδείγματος καὶ εἰκόνος· ἡ μίμησις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀπόστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-01","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὸ ὂν ἔχει μίαν μόνην βαθμίδα· ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀλληλουχίαν ἀμεροῦς, μεριστοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ ἐκπηγάζει αὐτομάτως ἐκ τῆς ὕλης· ἡ μορφὴ ἀπαιτεῖ λόγον, ψυχὴν καὶ κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-03","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολλότης εἶναι ἁπλὴ παράθεσις· ἡ πολλότης ἀποτελεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν ἀνάπτυξιν ἑνιαίας μείξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται χρόνος ὡς νεκρὸν περιέχον· ὁ χρόνος ὑφίσταται μόνον ὡς ἐνεργὸς ρυθμὸς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-05","text":"Ἀπαγορεύεται ἡ σύγχυσις χρονικῆς διαδοχῆς καὶ ἀχρόνου εἶναι· τὸ παρελθὸν καὶ τὸ μέλλον ἀνήκουσι μόνον τῷ γεννητῷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D8","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ κυκλοῖ περὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας ἑνότητος ἄνευ διαφοράς, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἀναγνωρίζει ἄλλην ὁδὸν παρὰ τὴν μεσολαβημένην σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος γίνεται κόσμος ὃς εἶναι ἢ μόνον ἑνότης ἢ μόνον διαφορά· ἡ πραγματικότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀναγκαστὴν συνύπαρξιν ἀμφοτέρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπών μένει χρόνος ὃς θὰ ἦτο ἀΐδιος καθ’ ἑαυτόν· ὁ χρόνος ὑπάρχει μόνον ὡς ἐνσώματος μίμησις τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἀποσιωπᾷ τὴν δυνατότητα κόσμου ὅπου ἡ ἑτερότης παραμένει αὐτόνομος καὶ ἀσύνδετος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-01","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς ἀριθμητικὴν διευθέτησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀλυσίδα ὅπου ἡ μίξις γεννᾷ λόγους, οἱ λόγοι κινήσεις, καὶ αἱ κινήσεις χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-04","CL_JP8E_07:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἡ ἀναγκαία μορφὴ ἐν ᾗ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ μίξις γίνεται αὐτοκίνητος καὶ γνωστικῶς παραγωγός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","CL_JP8E_07:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-03","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις γίνεται παραγωγικὴ μόνον ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀρχικὴ τριαδικὴ σύστασις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἐν ἑκάστῃ κινήσει καὶ γνώσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ὀντολογικὴν δυσχέρειαν εἰς διπλὴν λειτουργίαν κινήσεως καὶ γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2","CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","CL_JP8E_07:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-05","text":"Ἡ εἰκονικὴ σχέσις πρὸς τὸ ἀΐδιον ἐξηγεῖ διὰ τί ὁ χρόνος δύναται νὰ ὁμοιάζῃ πρὸς τὸν αἰῶνα χωρὶς νὰ γίνηται ἀΐδιος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","CL_JP8E_07:GA-09","CL_JP8E_07:GA-10","CL_JP8E_07:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογικὴ διάκρισις αἰσθητοῦ καὶ λογιστικοῦ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἴδιαν δομὴν ἣ προηγουμένως συνέδεσε τὸ ταὐτὸν καὶ τὸ ἕτερον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS4","CL_JP8E_07:GA-07","CL_JP8E_07:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-07","text":"Ἡ βία τῆς ἀρχικῆς συναρμογῆς καὶ ἡ ἀκρίβεια τῆς ἀναλογίας συγκροτοῦσιν ἀναγκαίαν ἔντασιν: ἡ τάξις εἶναι συγχρόνως ἐπιβεβλημένη καὶ μετρημένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἱεραρχία μετασχηματισμῶν, ὅπου οὐδεμία ὀντολογικὴ βαθμίς ἐνεργεῖ ἄνευ μεσολαβήσεως τῆς προηγουμένης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ ὕλη, ἡ ψυχή, ἡ κίνησις καὶ ὁ χρόνος δὲν εἶναι παράλληλα ἐπίπεδα, ἀλλὰ διαδοχικαὶ μορφαὶ ἐνεργοποιήσεως τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη καὶ ἡ δόξα εἶναι δύο ἐκβάσεις τῆς αὐτῆς κινητικῆς μηχανῆς, διαφοροποιούμεναι ὑπὸ τοῦ πεδίου πρὸς ὃ στρέφεται ὁ λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται ὁ μηχανισμὸς δι’ οὗ τὸ ἀΐδιον καθίσταται ὁρατὸν ἐν γεννητῇ μορφῇ, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως ἀποκαλύπτεται ἡ ἀπόστασις ἀπ’ αὐτό.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης εἶναι ἐπιτελεστικὴ καὶ οὐχὶ στατική: συντηρεῖται διὰ συνεχῶν κύκλων, διακρίσεων καὶ ἀναλογικῶν ἐπαναλήψεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία ἀποκτᾷ ὀντολογικὴν ἰσχύν: δὲν περιγράφει μόνον τὸ ὂν, ἀλλὰ παράγει τὰς μορφὰς ὑπὸ τὰς ὁποίας τὸ ὂν γίνεται κόσμος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὸ δίλημμα ἑνότητος ἢ διαφορᾶς διὰ συστήματος ὅπου ἡ ἑνότης ἐπιτυγχάνεται μόνον ὡς ῥυθμισμένη διαφορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-01","text":"Ἀνομοιότης → μεσότης → μίξις → διαίρεσις → ἀναλογία → ἑνότης, ἡ ὁποία διατηρεῖ καὶ ἐπαναφέρει τὴν ἀνομοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ μίξις γεννᾷ διαίρεσιν, ἡ διαίρεσις γεννᾷ κύκλους, καὶ οἱ κύκλοι ἐπαναφέρουσι τὴν ἑνότητα ὡς ρυθμισμένην πολλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ τάξις ἐκτείνεται εἰς ψυχικὴν κίνησιν, ἡ ψυχικὴ κίνησις εἰς σῶμα, καὶ τὸ σῶμα εἰς χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-04","text":"Ὁ κύκλος τοῦ ταὐτοῦ παρέχει τὴν ἑνότητα, ἐνῷ ὁ κύκλος τοῦ θατέρου παράγει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαφοράν· ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀμφότερα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν μίξιν ὡς αὐτοκίνησιν, καὶ ἡ αὐτοκίνησις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς γνῶσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος γίνεται ἑλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος: ὁ κόσμος ὁμοιοῦται τῷ ἀϊδίῳ ἀκριβῶς διὰ τῆς μὴ ταὐτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AF4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-07","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τοῦ κύκλου δὲν σημαίνει ἀκινησίαν· σημαίνει μεταβολὴν ἐντὸς σταθεροῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AS6","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B01","text":"Ἀμέριστον + μεριστόν → τρίτη οὐσία → μίξις ἀνομοίων γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B02","text":"Μίξις → διαιρετὸν ὅλον → ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι → ἱεραρχημένη πολλότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B03","text":"Ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι → μεσότητες → ἁρμονικὴ συνέχεια → ψυχὴ συγκροτημένη κατὰ λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_18:D1","CH_JP8E_S_18:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B04","text":"Ψυχὴ → διπλὴ κυκλικὴ φορά → διάκρισις ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου → αἴσθησις, δόξα, νοῦς καὶ ἐπιστήμη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B05","text":"Ψυχικὴ κίνησις → ἐνσωμάτωσις → ἔμψυχος νοήμων κόσμος → εἰκὼν τοῦ ἀϊδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B06","text":"Ἀΐδιον παράδειγμα ≠ γεννητὴ εἰκών → κοσμικὴ κίνησις → χρόνος ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀσυμβατότης ἀμεροῦς καὶ μεριστοῦ → τρίτη μεσότης → βιαία μίξις → ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία → ἁρμονικὴ ψυχὴ → κυκλικὴ κίνησις → γνωστικὴ διάκρισις → ἔμψυχος κόσμος → χρόνος ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AFM-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ διαφορά δὲν ἐξαλείφεται· μετασχηματίζεται διαδοχικῶς εἰς λόγον, κίνησιν, γνῶσιν καὶ χρονικὴν μίμησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς παραγόμενος καὶ ἐπαναληπτικὸς μηχανισμός, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀρχικὴ ἁπλότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διαφορά μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἐμπόδιον τῆς τάξεως εἰς τὸ ἀναγκαῖον ὑπόστρωμα τῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναφαίνεται ὡς κοσμολογικὸς μετασχηματιστὴς ὃς συνδέει οὐσίαν, κίνησιν, σῶμα καὶ γνῶσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ πλαίσιον τῶν συμβάντων εἰς παράγωγον μηχανὴν ἐμφανίσεως τοῦ ἀϊδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-05","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ἀνασυντάσσεται ὡς ἐνεργὸς διάκρισις καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς παθητικὴ κατοχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-06","text":"Ἡ διάκριση ἀϊδίου καὶ γεννητοῦ ἐπιβάλλει νέα ὀντολογίαν, ὅπου ἡ μίμησις ἀποτελεῖ ὁμοιότητα μετὰ ἀποστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** Ἐπιφανειακῶς ἐμφανίζονται μίξις γενῶν, ἀριθμητικοὶ λόγοι, κύκλοι, οὐρανὸς, ψυχή, γνῶσις καὶ χρόνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** Ὑποκείμενος μηχανισμὸς εἶναι ἡ ἐπανάληψις τριαδικῆς μεσολαβήσεως διὰ λόγων, κινήσεων καὶ διακρίσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Ἡ ἐξήγησις ὀφείλει νὰ ἀναζητῇ τὸ παραγωγὸν σύστημα σχέσεων καὶ οὐχὶ νὰ μένῃ εἰς τὰ φαινόμενα ἀποτελέσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Τὸ εἶναι παράγεται ὡς ἔμψυχος κίνησις, ἐνῷ τὸ ἀΐδιον μένει ἄνευ γενέσεως καὶ διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἐπιτελεῖ τὴν θέσιν της, ἐπειδὴ ἀνασυνδέει διαδοχικῶς ὅσα ἀρχικῶς φαίνονται ἀσύνδετα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-01","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ συγχρόνως βιαίαν ἐπιβολὴν καὶ ἀκριβῆ ἀναλογικήν ῥύθμισιν· ἡ ἔντασις αὕτη δὲν λύεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ εἶναι συγχρόνως ἀποτέλεσμα προγενεστέρας ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀρχὴ ἣ παράγει σῶμα, γνῶσιν καὶ χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D7","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-03","text":"Ἡ κινητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ αἰῶνος ὀφείλει νὰ ὁμοιάζῃ πρὸς ὃ κατὰ τὸν ὁρισμὸν δὲν δύναται νὰ περιλάβῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς τεχνικὴ τῶν λόγων καὶ τῶν κύκλων ἀναγκαία μένει, ἀλλὰ ἐν τῇ συμπιέσει ὑποκαθορίζεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-05","text":"Ἡ διάκριση εἰκόνος καὶ παραδείγματος σταθεροποιεῖ τὸ σύστημα, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως ἐξαρτᾷ τὴν κοσμικὴν ὁμοιότητα ἀπὸ μεταφορικὴν γλώσσαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-01","text":"Ἡ μεσότης μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ στοιχεῖον συναρμογῆς γίνεται ἐσωτερικὴ ψυχικὴ λειτουργία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-02","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ κατανομὴ μοίρας γίνεται παραγωγὴ κύκλων, κινήσεων καὶ γνωστικῶν ἀποτελεσμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-03","text":"Ὁ λόγος μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ μαθηματικὸς κανὼν γίνεται αὐτοκίνητος φορεὺς κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μεταλλάσσεται ὅταν ἀπὸ ἀποτέλεσμα κυκλικῆς κινήσεως γίνεται ὅρος τῆς διαφορᾶς μεταξὺ εἰκόνος καὶ αἰῶνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς πολυεπίπεδος μηχανὴ μετασχηματισμοῦ, ἣ συνδέει ἀνομοιότητα, λόγον, κίνησιν καὶ εἰκόνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον δὲν εἶναι ἀπομονωμένη μονάς, ἀλλὰ κόμβος ἐν κινήσει, ὃς διακρίνει, συνδέει καὶ γνωρίζει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι κυκλικὸς ρυθμὸς παραγωγῆς καὶ μιμήσεως, οὐχὶ κενὸν δοχεῖον ἐν ᾧ ἁπλῶς συμβαίνουν τὰ πράγματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἔξοδος ἐκ τῆς ἀντιθέσεως δὲν εἶναι ἀπόδρασις πρὸς ἁπλότητα, ἀλλὰ ἀκριβέστερη ἐνσωμάτωσις τῆς διαφορᾶς εἰς λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς μεσολαβήσεως, τῆς ἀναλογίας, τῆς ψυχικῆς κινήσεως καὶ τῆς εἰκονικῆς χρονικότητος ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ συστήματος ἐν τῷ παρόντι ἐπιπέδῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαίρεσις, ἡ κυκλικότης καὶ ἡ χρονικότης ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς διαδοχικαὶ μορφαὶ τῆς αὐτῆς μεσολαβητικῆς λογικῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν ἡ λεπτομερὴς λειτουργία τῶν μουσικῶν λόγων, ἡ ἀκριβὴς σύνδεσις ψυχῆς καὶ χρονικῆς διακοσμήσεως, καὶ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ σημασία τῆς μεταφορᾶς τῆς εἰκόνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ εἰς ἕνα ἐνιαῖον μηχάνημα δὲν ἀκυροῖ τὰς διαφορὰς τῶν ἐπιπέδων, ἀλλὰ δείκνυσιν ὅτι αὗται παράγονται ἐκ κοινῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B05","text":"Ἀπαραίτητος παραμένει ἡ ἔντασις μεταξὺ βιαίας συναρμογῆς καὶ ἀκριβοῦς ἀναλογίας· ἄνευ αὐτῆς ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης θὰ κατέπιπτεν εἰς ἢ χάος ἢ ἁπλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232223443058Z_7a2ae54e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 19–21","source_sha256":"4621c2449181d449b896972106f5a7726ec1ee3bff620a865e50a43476edefd5","sha256":"f949492268e2e5638563e3cb880f0ada13d49fd35e04b10f187917b03faae455","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:22:23.445781+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-01","text":"The central problem is the constitution of unity from dissimilar and hard-to-mix principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-02","text":"Unity is not given simplicity, but is produced through mediation, mixture, logos, and proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-03","text":"Numerical order is transformed into harmonic motion, soul, and cosmic ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-04","text":"The soul constitutes the transitional instrument that connects mixed being, motion, and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-05","text":"The cosmos becomes a visible image of eternal order, without literal identity with it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-06","text":"Time comes to be as a moving image of eternity and as the active rhythm of cosmic motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-07","text":"Difference, rather than being removed, is inscribed within hierarchical motions, cognitive functions, and temporal divisions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AS-08","text":"The overall movement is graduated and circular: from dissimilarity to mixture, from mixture to logos, and from logos to time and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Being is constituted from the indivisible, the divisible, and a third mediating being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A1","CH_JP8E_S_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Unity presupposes the mixture of dissimilar kinds and not the erasure of difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A6","CH_JP8E_S_17:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Mediation changes from material joining into a mathematical bond, psychic motion, and cognitive distinction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Logos and proportion transform heterogeneity into measurable order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] The soul is the active mediation that transforms cosmic constitution into motion and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_19:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Circularity connects the soul's internal division, cosmic motion, and the generation of time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Division does not dissolve the whole, but repeats the common constitution in portions, circles, and cognitive functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Psychic motion distinguishes the same and the other and produces distinct kinds of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] The cosmos is an ensouled and intelligent image, which imitates the eternal through generated motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Time is a derivative of cosmic motion and a moving image of eternity, not a self-subsisting container.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] The order of the whole is achieved only when difference remains active within unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] The generated renders the eternal through image and motion, but is never identical with it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-01","text":"Unity recurs as mixture, harmony, circular motion, and imaginal likeness; its identity changes according to scale.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-02","text":"Otherness shifts from hard-to-mix matter to divisible motion, then to a cognitive object and temporal difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A5","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-03","text":"The third being successively acquires the form of mediation, mathematical logos, and psychic principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A4","CH_JP8E_S_18:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-04","text":"Division is transformed from numerical distribution into a hierarchy of circles and differences of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-05","text":"The force of the first joining is explicitly withdrawn, but survives as the necessity of regulation and proportional containment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D3","CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-06","text":"Logos moves from a rule of distribution to a mechanism of motion and finally to a bearer of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-07","text":"Time emerges only later: from numerical order and circular motion it becomes an ontological marker of the difference between the generated and the eternal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A12","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CH_JP8E_S_19:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RMD-08","text":"Numerical detail, especially the remainder, is absorbed into a more general principle: no difference remains without logos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","CH_JP8E_S_18:D2","CH_JP8E_S_18:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-01","text":"The exact sequence of numerical ratios and the seven circles remains local; the principle that difference is regulated through logos becomes universal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A10","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-02","text":"The cosmological mixed being is local; triadic mediation is scaled up into a universal generative principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:A3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-03","text":"The soul bridges the chapters, because it connects ontological constitution with motion, knowledge, and time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-04","text":"The transition from bodies to soul is a catalytic shift, because it replaces the effect with the productive principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-05","text":"Sensation, opinion, intellect, and knowledge are not independent episodes, but the results of a common psychic mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-06","text":"The principle that time does not contain motion but is produced by it exceeds the local argument.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-07","text":"Detailed musical technique becomes subordinate to the principle that order requires a precise but not necessarily repetitive form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:A6","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:CGD-08","text":"The eternal is not merely a higher object, but a limit to which the generated image refers without being effaced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-01","text":"Immediate, simple, and indivisible unity is excluded; unity requires production.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:NX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-02","text":"A cosmos consisting of bodies alone is excluded, because body requires a prior psychic and proportional order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-03","text":"Otherness without relation, mediation, and a common measure is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-04","text":"Time independent of cosmic motion and psychic activity is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-05","text":"Knowledge as motionless possession or a mere imprint of things is excluded; knowledge is discriminating motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:GNX-06","text":"Identity of paradigm and image is excluded; imitation preserves distance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that being has only one level; the architecture requires a sequence of the indivisible, the divisible, soul, and cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-02","text":"The hypothesis that form springs automatically from matter is rejected; form requires logos, soul, and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-03","text":"The idea that multiplicity is mere juxtaposition is invalidated; multiplicity constitutes an internal development of a unified mixture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-04","text":"Time as a dead container is rejected; time exists only as the active rhythm of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:DBN-05","text":"The confusion of temporal succession and timeless being is forbidden; the past and the future belong only to the generated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D8","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-01","text":"The architecture revolves around the impossibility of unity without difference, but recognizes no path other than mediated synthesis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-02","text":"A cosmos that is either unity alone or difference alone becomes impossible; reality requires the necessary coexistence of both.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-03","text":"A time that would be eternal in itself remains absent; time exists only as embodied imitation of eternity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSA-04","text":"The architecture leaves unspoken the possibility of a cosmos in which otherness remains autonomous and unconnected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-01","text":"Cosmic order is not merely a numerical arrangement, but a chain in which mixture generates ratios, ratios motions, and motions time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-04","CL_JP8E_07:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-02","text":"The soul appears as the necessary form in which ontological mixture becomes self-moving and cognitively productive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","CL_JP8E_07:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-03","text":"Division becomes productive only because the original triadic constitution is repeated in every motion and cognition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:D4","CH_JP8E_S_18:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-07"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-04","text":"The opposition of the same and the other is transformed from an ontological difficulty into a double function of motion and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2","CL_JP8E_07:GA-03","CL_JP8E_07:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-05","text":"The imaginal relation to the eternal explains why time can resemble eternity without becoming eternal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D5","CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","CL_JP8E_07:GA-09","CL_JP8E_07:GA-10","CL_JP8E_07:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-06","text":"The epistemological distinction between the sensible and the rational depends on the same structure that previously connected the same and the other.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:D3","CH_JP8E_S_19:D4","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS4","CL_JP8E_07:GA-07","CL_JP8E_07:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:XD-07","text":"The force of the original joining and the precision of proportion constitute a necessary tension: order is simultaneously imposed and measured.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2","CL_JP8E_07:GA-02","CL_JP8E_07:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-01","text":"Reality appears as a hierarchy of transformations, in which no ontological level operates without mediation by the preceding one.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-02","text":"Matter, soul, motion, and time are not parallel levels, but successive forms of the activation of logos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-03","text":"Knowledge and opinion are two outcomes of the same kinetic mechanism, differentiated by the field toward which logos turns.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:A6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-04","text":"Time becomes the mechanism through which the eternal is made visible in generated form, but at the same time its distance from it is disclosed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-05","text":"Cosmic unity is performative and not static: it is sustained through continuous circles, distinctions, and proportional repetitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-06","text":"Proportion acquires ontological force: it does not merely describe being, but produces the forms under which being becomes cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:BSD-07","text":"The architecture replaces the dilemma of unity or difference with a system in which unity is achieved only as regulated difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-01","text":"Dissimilarity → mediation → mixture → division → proportion → unity, which preserves and reintroduces dissimilarity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-02","text":"Mixture generates division, division generates circles, and circles restore unity as regulated multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-03","text":"Numerical order extends into psychic motion, psychic motion into body, and body into time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-04","text":"The circle of the same provides unity, while the circle of the other produces internal difference; cosmic order requires both.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-05","text":"The soul repeats ontological mixture as self-motion, and self-motion is repeated as knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-06","text":"The distinction of image and paradigm becomes an attractor of the system: the cosmos is made like the eternal precisely through non-identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:AF4","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:RLE-07","text":"The repetition of the circle does not signify immobility; it signifies change within a stable logos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AS6","CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B01","text":"Indivisible + divisible → third being → mixture of dissimilar kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B02","text":"Mixture → divisible whole → numerical ratios → hierarchical multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_17:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B03","text":"Numerical ratios → mediations → harmonic continuity → soul constituted according to logos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_18:D1","CH_JP8E_S_18:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B04","text":"Soul → double circular motion → distinction of the same and the other → sensation, opinion, intellect, and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B05","text":"Psychic motion → embodiment → ensouled intelligent cosmos → image of the eternal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A8","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FGS-B06","text":"Eternal paradigm ≠ generated image → cosmic motion → time as a moving image of eternity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AFM-B01","text":"Incompatibility of the indivisible and the divisible → third mediation → forcible mixture → numerical proportion → harmonic soul → circular motion → cognitive distinction → ensouled cosmos → time as a moving image of eternity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_18:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:AFM-B02","text":"The original difference is not erased; it is successively transformed into logos, motion, knowledge, and temporal imitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF5","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-01","text":"Unity is reclassified as a produced and repetitive mechanism, not as original simplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-02","text":"Difference passes from an obstacle to order into the necessary substrate of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-03","text":"The soul emerges as a cosmological transformer that connects being, motion, body, and knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-04","text":"Time is reclassified from a framework of events into a derivative mechanism for the manifestation of the eternal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-05","text":"Knowledge is reconstituted as active distinction and not as passive possession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_19:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MME-06","text":"The distinction between the eternal and the generated imposes a new ontology, in which imitation constitutes likeness with distance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** On the surface there appear mixtures of kinds, numerical ratios, circles, heaven, soul, knowledge, and time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** The underlying mechanism is the repetition of triadic mediation through ratios, motions, and distinctions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Explanation must seek the productive system of relations and not remain with phenomenal results.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Being is produced as ensouled motion, while the eternal remains without generation and succession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** The architecture performs its thesis, because it successively reconnects what initially appears unconnected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-01","text":"Cosmic order requires both forcible imposition and precise proportional regulation; this tension is not resolved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-02","text":"The soul is at once the result of prior proportion and a principle that produces body, knowledge, and time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D7","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-03","text":"The moving image of eternity must resemble that which by definition it cannot contain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_19:D6","CH_JP8E_S_19:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-04","text":"The precise technique of ratios and circles remains necessary, but is underdetermined in compression.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:FL-05","text":"The distinction between image and paradigm stabilizes the system, but at the same time makes cosmic likeness depend on metaphorical language.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-01","text":"Mediation mutates when, from an element of joining, it becomes an internal psychic function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-02","text":"Division mutates when, from the distribution of a portion, it becomes the production of circles, motions, and cognitive results.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A7","CH_JP8E_S_18:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_19:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-03","text":"Logos mutates when, from a mathematical rule, it becomes a self-moving bearer of judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:A9","CH_JP8E_S_19:A5","CH_JP8E_S_19:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MP-04","text":"Time mutates when, from the result of circular motion, it becomes a condition of the difference between image and eternity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:D8","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a multilayered machine of transformation that connects dissimilarity, logos, motion, and image.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_19:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not an isolated unit, but a node in motion, which distinguishes, connects, and knows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_19:A4","CH_JP8E_S_19:D1","CH_JP8E_S_19:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-03","text":"Time is a circular rhythm of production and imitation, not an empty container in which things merely happen.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:HSI-04","text":"The possible exit from the opposition is not an escape toward simplicity, but a more exact incorporation of difference into logos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_17:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_18:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B01","text":"The principles of mediation, proportion, psychic motion, and imaginal temporality suffice for reconstruction of the system at the present level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction is coherent because division, circularity, and temporality are recognized as successive forms of the same mediating logic.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B03","text":"The detailed operation of musical ratios, the exact connection of soul and temporal ordering, and the ontological significance of the metaphor of the image remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_18:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_19:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B04","text":"Reduction to one unified mechanism does not invalidate differences among levels, but shows that they are produced from a common principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_18:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_19:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_07:MRT-B05","text":"The tension between forcible joining and precise proportion remains indispensable; without it, cosmic unity would collapse into either chaos or simplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_17:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_17:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_07@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_07:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 19–21"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 19–21","context":"Section 35 · Section 36 · Section 37","original_title":"Chapters 19–21","original_context":"Section 35 · Section 36 · Section 37"},"original_title":"Chapters 19–21","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 22–24","order":8,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_20","CH_JP8E_S_21","CH_JP8E_SEC4"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_08@R001","sha256":"8abc27a25e83675f63139698c78c082130f93fee0ccb62f9065d32e8ba428331","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ διακρίνῃ τὸ ἀμετάβλητον εἶναι ἀπὸ τὴν γενητὴν καὶ κινούμενον τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀνασυντίθεται οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτόνομος ῥοή, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τῆς αἰωνίου φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B03","text":"Ἡ διακεκριμένη κίνησις τῶν κύκλων μεταβάλλεται εἰς σύστημα συγκρίσεως, μέτρου καὶ χρονικῆς ἀριθμήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B04","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἔμψυχος μηχανὴ ἣ συνδέει φυσικὴν κίνησιν, νοητὸν παράδειγμα καὶ σημεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐρμηνεία προχωρεῖ ἀπὸ τὴν ὄψιν καὶ τὸν λογισμὸν πρὸς τὴν παράδοσιν ὅταν τὸ ἀνθρώπινον μέτρον ὑπερβαίνηται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B06","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἀπὸ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν ἀνέρχεται εἰς μέτρον, μίμησιν, σημειολογίαν καὶ ἐπιστημολογικὸν ὅριον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ αἰώνιον καὶ τὸ χρονικὸν ἔχουσιν ἑτερογενεῖς τρόπους τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ χρόνος καὶ ὁ οὐρανὸς συνίστανται ἀμοιβαίως καὶ οὐ χωρίζονται ἐν τῇ γενέσει ἢ τῇ λύσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι μίμημα τοῦ αἰῶνος, ἡ δὲ μίμησις ἐξειδικεύεται εἰς συγχρονισμένας περιόδους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις παράγεται ἐκ τῆς συνθέσεως ταὐτοῦ καὶ θατέρου ἐν ταῖς κινήσεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ταχύτης καὶ ἡ περίοδος οὐκ ἔχουσιν ἀπόλυτον σημασίαν, ἀλλὰ γίγνονται ὁραταὶ διὰ σχέσεως καὶ κοινοῦ μέτρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ ἥλιος λειτουργεῖ ὡς φανερὸν μέτρον, δι᾽ οὗ αἱ οὐράνιαι κινήσεις καθίστανται συγκρίσιμοι καὶ ἀριθμηταί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ χρονικὴ τάξις μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἀφηρημένον μέγεθος εἰς ἀλληλουχίαν ἡμέρας, μηνός, ἐνιαυτοῦ καὶ τελείου χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ δημιουργία εἶναι συμπλήρωσις τῆς ἀνομοιότητος πρὸς νοητὸν παράδειγμα, οὐχὶ ἁπλῆ προσθήκη ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀπὸ τόπος σωμάτων μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ζῷον, μέτρον, μηχανὴν κινήσεων καὶ γραμματεῖον σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτία, ἡ θεία ἐνέργεια καὶ τὸ χρονικὸν σημεῖον συνδέονται ἐν μιᾷ κοσμικῇ ἑρμηνευτικῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ γνώσις διαιρεῖται εἰς λογικὴν καὶ ὀπτικὴν ἀνάγνωσιν τῶν φαινομένων, καὶ εἰς παράδοσιν περὶ τῶν ὑπερανθρωπίνων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς τὸ αἰώνιον νοητὸν ζῷον ἑνοποιεῖ χρόνον, οὐρανόν, θεῖα γένη, κινήσεις καὶ δημιουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-01","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς μίμημα τοῦ αἰῶνος, ἀλλὰ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ γενικὴ ἀναλογία εἰς μετρήσιμον σύστημα περιόδων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ κίνησις διατηρεῖ τὴν κοσμολογικὴν λειτουργίαν της, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ φυσικὴν φορὰν εἰς σχέσιν ἀμοιβαίας μετρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-03","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ φορεὺς χρόνου εἰς ἔμψυχον παράδειγμα, ὅπου ἡ κίνησις φέρει καὶ νόημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ γένεσιν κοσμικῶν σωμάτων εἰς διαδικασίαν ἀποκαταστάσεως ὁμοιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ ἀδυναμίαν εἰς ἀπόδειξιν ὅτι ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δὲν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν κοινὴν συνείδησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ἀρχικῶς ἀπαιτεῖ ὄψιν καὶ λογισμόν, ἀλλὰ ἐν τῷ ὁρίῳ μεταπίπτει εἰς πίστιν παραδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀπλανῶν καὶ πλανωμένων ἀπορροφᾷ τὴν ἁπλῆν ἀντίθεσιν σταθερότητος καὶ μεταβολῆς καὶ τὴν μετατρέπει εἰς ἱεραρχίαν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ σχέσις τῶν ἐπιμέρους πλανητικῶν περιφορῶν παραμένει τοπικὴ λεπτομέρεια καὶ δὲν φορτίζει τὸν κεντρικὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ διάκριση αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου κλιμακοῦται εἰς γενικὴν ἀρχὴν ἑτερογενῶν τρόπων τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἡλιακὴ μέτρησις, ἡ κυκλικὴ τάξις καὶ ἡ θεία ἱεράρχησις γεφυροῦν τὰ κατώτερα κοσμολογικὰ σχήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ὑπολειπομένη ἀνομοιότης καταλύει τὴν ἰδέαν ὅτι ἡ δημιουργία ἔχει ἤδη τελειωθῇ καὶ καταλύει τὴν στατικὴν ἐκδοχήν τοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιμέρους ἀστρονομικὴ αἰτιολογία γίνεται καταλύτης πρὸς ἐπιστημολογικὴν διάκρισιν ὁρατοῦ, λογιστοῦ καὶ παραδοτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀφηρημένη εἰκὼν τοῦ χρόνου ὡς ῥοῆς ὑπερβαίνεται ὑπὸ τῆς σχέσεως περιόδων καὶ κοινοῦ μέτρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ χρόνος ὡς αὐτόνομος οὐσία ἄνευ οὐρανοῦ, κινήσεως καὶ κοσμικῆς σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ταχύτης, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα ταχύτης ἀναφαίνεται μόνον ἐν συγκρίσει κύκλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἄτακτος κίνησις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαφορά, ἡ πλάνη καὶ ἡ ἐπανάληψις ὑπάγονται εἰς τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδιάκριτος ἐφαρμογὴ χρονικῶν ῥημάτων εἰς τὸ αἰώνιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἐρμηνεία τῶν οὐρανίων σημείων ἄνευ ὄψεως, λογισμοῦ καὶ ἱκανότητος διακρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀπαιτεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ἀναγωγὴ πάσης πραγματικότητος εἰς ἕνα μόνον χρονικὸν καθεστώς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-02","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν κύκλων διαλύει τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-03","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ δημιουργία εἶναι ἄνευ ὁρίου προσθήκη ὕλης, διότι ἡ γένεσις ἀκολουθεῖ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-04","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀπόδειξις ὀφείλει νὰ ἐκτείνεται ἐκτὸς παντὸς ἀνθρωπίνου μέτρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-05","text":"Ἀκυροῦται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις φυσικῆς αἰτίας, θείας ἐνεργείας καὶ σημείου, ἐπειδὴ τὸ σύστημα τὰ συνδέει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπούσα μένει ἡ δυνατότης χρόνου ἄνευ κοσμικῆς κινήσεως καὶ ἀναφορᾶς πρὸς τὸ ταὐτόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπούσα μένει ἡ δυνατότης ἀσυμμέτρου κόσμου, ἐν ᾧ αἱ περίοδοι δὲν συγκλίνουσι πρὸς κοινὴν τελείωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπούσα μένει ἡ ἐντελὴς ταυτότης τοῦ αἰωνίου παραδείγματος καὶ τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπούσα μένει ἡ αὐτοτελὴς ἀνθρωπίνη ἐποπτεία παντὸς τοῦ θείου γένους, καὶ ἡ ἀπουσία αὕτη παράγει τὴν παράδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ ἔσχατη ἀπουσία εἶναι ἡ πλήρης σύμπτωσις παραδείγματος καὶ κόσμου· ἐξ αὐτῆς ἀνακύπτει ἡ συνεχιζομένη συμπλήρωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-01","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου, ὅταν συνδεθῇ πρὸς τὴν κυκλικὴν μέτρησιν, παράγει χρόνον διπλοῦ χαρακτῆρος: εἰκόνα αἰωνιότητος καὶ ἀριθμητὴν τάξιν κινήσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_20:D3","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-02","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ φορὰ καὶ τὸ ἡλιακὸν μέτρον μετασχηματίζουσι τὴν διαφοράν τῶν κινήσεων εἰς γνωστικὴν ἀναλογίαν, οὐχὶ μόνον εἰς φυσικὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀτέλεια τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ κόσμου γίνεται ἐνεργὸς μηχανὴ δημιουργίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μίμησις δὲν ὁλοκληροῦται ἅπαξ, ἀλλὰ συμπληροῦται.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:D7","CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ὁρατὴ κυκλικὴ τάξις ἐνοποιεῖ φυσικὴν αἰτίαν καὶ προγνωστικὸν σημεῖον, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἑρμηνεία της ἀπαιτεῖ ἱκανότητα καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὴν θέασιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ὑπέρβασις τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου μέτρου δὲν διαλύει τὸ κοσμολογικὸν σύστημα, ἀλλὰ μεταφέρει τὸ κύρος ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόδειξιν εἰς τὴν θεσμισμένην μνήμην.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος γίνεται ἔμψυχος χρονικὴ εἰκών, ἐν ᾗ ὕλη, μορφή, νόησις, κίνησις καὶ μνήμη λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς μία μηχανή.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ τάξις δὲν εἶναι ἀπλὴ διαδοχή, ἀλλὰ ἀναδρομικὴ βαθμονόμησις ὅπου οἱ κύκλοι μετροῦν ἀλλήλους καὶ ἐπανέρχονται πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία καὶ ἡ ἐπιστημολογία συμπλέκονται: τὸ εἶδος τῆς κινήσεως καθορίζει καὶ τὸ εἶδος τῆς δυνατῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνομοιότης τοῦ κόσμου πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα γίνεται παραγωγικὴ ἔλλειψις, ἣ κινεί τὴν δημιουργίαν καὶ ἐπιμηκύνει τὴν κοσμικὴν διαδικασίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀκρίβεια δὲν καταλήγει εἰς καθολικὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλὰ ὁρίζει τὸ σημεῖον ὅπου ἡ γνώσις ἀναθέτει τὸ ἀόρατον τῇ παραδόσει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-01","text":"Ἀμετάβλητον παράδειγμα → κινητὴ εἰκών → κυκλικὴ μέτρησις → ἐπανεπιβεβαίωσις τοῦ παραδείγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-02","text":"Διαφορὰ κινήσεων → κοινὸν μέτρον → ἀριθμητὴ περίοδος → νέα ὁρατότης τῆς διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ὄψις ἀποκαλύπτει σημεῖον, τὸ σημεῖον ἀπαιτεῖ λογισμόν, καὶ ὁ λογισμὸς ὁρίζει τὸ πεδίον τῆς ἀγνοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνομοιότης παράγει δημιουργίαν, ἡ δημιουργία παράγει νέαν κοσμικὴν τάξιν, καὶ ἡ τάξις ἐπανέρχεται πρὸς τὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-05","text":"Ὅταν ἡ ἀπόδειξις ἀποτυγχάνῃ ἐκτὸς τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου μέτρου, ἡ παράδοσις γίνεται νέος φορεὺς συνέχειας καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὴ διακοπή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-06","text":"Ἀτρακτὴρ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς τὸ νοητὸν ζῷον, ἣ συνάγει χρόνον, θεότητα, κύκλον καὶ δημιουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B01","text":"Ἀρχή: διάκρισις τοῦ ἀμεταβλήτου αἰῶνος ἀπὸ τὸ χρονικὸν καὶ γενητὸν εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B02","text":"Παραγωγή: ὁ οὐρανὸς καὶ ὁ χρόνος συνίστανται ὡς κινητὴ εἰκὼν τῆς αἰωνίου φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B03","text":"Διαφοροποίησις: ἡ ταὐτοῦ καὶ ἡ θατέρου φορὰ παράγουσι κύκλους διαφόρου μεγέθους, τάχους καὶ κατευθύνσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B04","text":"Μετρητική ἐνοποίησις: ὁ ἥλιος καὶ αἱ περίοδοι μετατρέπουσι τὴν κίνησιν εἰς ἡμέραν, μῆνα, ἐνιαυτὸν καὶ τέλειον χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B05","text":"Σημειωτικὴ καὶ δημιουργικὴ ἐπέκτασις: ὁ οὐρανὸς γίνεται ζῷον καὶ σημεῖον, ἡ δὲ ἀνομοιότης κινεί τὴν συμπλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B06","text":"Ἐπιστημολογικὸς περιορισμός: ἡ ὄψις καὶ ὁ λογισμὸς ἐρμηνεύουσι τὸ φαινόμενον, ἡ δὲ παράδοσις ἀναλαμβάνει τὸ ὑπερανθρώπινον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B07","text":"Ἀνακριβὴς χρονικὴ γλῶσσα → διάκρισις αἰῶνος καὶ χρόνου → χρόνος ὡς μίμημα αἰῶνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B08","text":"Μίμημα αἰῶνος → διαφοροποιημένοι κύκλοι → ἥλιος ὡς μέτρον → ἀριθμητὴ χρονικὴ τάξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B09","text":"Χρονικὴ τάξις → τέλειος ἐνιαυτός → μίμησις νοητοῦ ζῴου → συμπλήρωσις τῆς κοσμικῆς ὁμοιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B10","text":"Κοσμικὴ ὁμοιότης → ἱεράρχησις θείων γενῶν → γῆ ὡς χρονικὸς σύνδεσμος → ὁρατὰ σημεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B11","text":"Ὁρατὰ σημεῖα → ὄψις καὶ λογισμός → ὅριον ἀποδείξεως → παράδοσις περὶ τῶν ἀοράτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-01","text":"Ὁ χρόνος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ῥοὴ εἰς δίκτυον συγχρονισμένων περιόδων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-02","text":"Ἡ κίνησις παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὴ μεταβολὴ καὶ γίνεται φορεὺς μέτρου, νοήματος καὶ ἱεραρχήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-03","text":"Ἡ γῆ ἀναφαίνεται ὡς θεία λειτουργία τροφῆς, φυλακῆς καὶ παραγωγῆς νυκτὸς καὶ ἡμέρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-04","text":"Ὁ οὐρανὸς ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς κόσμος, ζῷον, μηχανὴ καὶ γραμματεῖον, ὥστε ἡ φυσικὴ ὄψις νὰ γίνεται ἀνάγνωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις διαιρεῖται κατὰ βαθμίδας καὶ ἀποκτᾷ ὅριον, ὅπου ἡ ἀδυναμία γνώσεως μετακινεί τὸ κύρος πρὸς τὴν παράδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα περιγράφει οὐρανίους κύκλους, ἄστρα, γῆν, θεῖα γένη καὶ χρονικὰ μεγέθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ τάξις παράγεται ἐκ στοιχείων, σχημάτων, νοήσεως, περιφορῶν καὶ ἱεραρχικῶν διακρίσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ γνώσις ὀφείλει νὰ συνδυάζῃ ὄψιν, λογισμόν, διάκρισιν καὶ πίστιν, χωρὶς νὰ συγχέῃ τὰ πεδία αὐτά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι ἔμψυχος, κυκλική, ἱεραρχική, καὶ ὁ χρόνος ἀποτέλεσμα κοσμικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενόν της: διακρίνει, μετρεῖ, ἐπανασυνδέει καὶ ὁριοθετεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκριβῆ λογισμὸν τῶν φαινομένων, ἀλλὰ ἐπιτρέπει παράδοσιν ὅπου ἡ ἀπόδειξις ἀδυνατεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία χρόνου καὶ αἰῶνος ἑνοποιεῖ τὰ δύο πεδία, ἀλλὰ ἐπιβάλλει συγχρόνως τὴν ἀδιαπραγμάτευτον ἀπόστασίν των.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδοσις νοήματος εἰς τὰ οὐράνια σημεῖα ἀπειλεῖ νὰ συγχέῃ φυσικὴν αἰτίαν, θείαν ἐνέργειαν καὶ προμήθειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα εἶναι ὁ ἀτρακτὴρ τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἐντελὴς ταυτότης παραμένει ἀδύνατος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-01","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ εἰκὼν αἰωνιότητος εἰς ἀριθμητὴν περίοδον καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς φορέα σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-02","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ κοσμικὴν κατασκευήν εἰς ἀδιάκοπον συμπλήρωσιν ἀνομοιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν καὶ ὀπτικὴν ἐξήγησιν εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν πίστιν παραδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς ἔμψυχος κυκλικὴ μηχανή, ἣ μετατρέπει τὴν αἰωνιότητα εἰς μετρήσιμον κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος γίνεται ἐρμηνευτὴς σημείων καὶ μετρητὴς κύκλων, ἀλλὰ οὐ κύριος τοῦ παντὸς θείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι κυκλικὴ ἐπανόρθωσις τῆς διαφορᾶς πρὸς τὸ ταὐτόν, οὐχὶ γραμμικὴ ἀπομάκρυνσις ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ διαφυγὴ δὲν εἶναι ἔξοδος ἐκ τοῦ κόσμου, ἀλλὰ ἀκριβέστερη ἀνάγνωσις τῆς κινήσεως καὶ ἀναγνώρισις τοῦ ὁρίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ κεντρικαὶ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ ἀπὸ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν ἕως τὴν ἐπιστημολογικὴν ὑποχώρησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν ἀπὸ διαφοροποιημένην κίνησιν πρὸς μέτρον, χρόνον, ὁμοιότητα καὶ παράδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ λεπτομερὴς μηχανικὴ τῶν περιόδων, ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις τῶν πέντε κινήσεων καὶ ἡ σημασία τῶν λοιπῶν ζῴων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα ἐν τῇ σχέσει παραδείγματος, κινήσεως καὶ μέτρου, ἀσθενεστέρα δὲ ἐν τῷ περάσματι ἀπὸ ἀπόδειξιν εἰς παράδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀξιωματικὴ συμπύκνωσις εἶναι ἐπαρκής μόνον ἐὰν διατηρῇ τὴν ἀναδρομὴν ἀπὸ εἰκόνα εἰς μέτρον, ἀπὸ μέτρον εἰς σημεῖον καὶ ἀπὸ σημεῖον εἰς ὅριον γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232253052865Z_68822996","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 22–24","source_sha256":"8abc27a25e83675f63139698c78c082130f93fee0ccb62f9065d32e8ba428331","sha256":"d66eb94e4ac4a80406dcbbb2f6905c1f74818778511b97ad8db204f05ebb6612","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:22:53.055864+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B01","text":"The system seeks to distinguish immutable being from the generated and moving order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B02","text":"Time is reconstructed not as an autonomous flow, but as a moving image of eternal nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B03","text":"The differentiated motion of the circles is transformed into a system of comparison, measure, and temporal enumeration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B04","text":"Heaven appears as an ensouled mechanism that links natural motion, intelligible paradigm, and sign.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B05","text":"Interpretation proceeds from sight and calculation to tradition when the human measure is exceeded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B06","text":"The motion of the system is spiral: from the ontological distinction it ascends to measure, imitation, semiology, and an epistemological limit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The eternal and the temporal have heterogeneous modes of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Time and heaven are constituted mutually and are not separated in coming-to-be or dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Time is an imitation of eternity, and the imitation is specified into synchronized periods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Cosmic order is produced from the composition of the Same and the Different in the motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Speed and period have no absolute significance, but become visible through relation and a common measure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The sun functions as a manifest measure, through which the heavenly motions become comparable and enumerable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Temporal order is transformed from an abstract magnitude into a sequence of day, month, year, and perfect time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Creation is a completion of dissimilarity toward an intelligible paradigm, not a simple addition of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Heaven is transformed from a place of bodies into an animal, a measure, a mechanism of motions, and an archive of signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","text":"[Emergent] Natural cause, divine activity, and temporal sign are linked in a single cosmic hermeneutics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Knowledge is divided into logical and visual reading of phenomena, and into tradition concerning superhuman matters.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Likeness to the eternal intelligible animal unifies time, heaven, divine kinds, motions, and creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-01","text":"Time recurs as an imitation of eternity, but is displaced from a general analogy into a measurable system of periods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-02","text":"Motion retains its cosmological function, but is transformed from natural course into a relation of mutual measurement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-03","text":"Heaven is displaced from bearer of time into an ensouled paradigm, where motion also bears meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-04","text":"Creation is transformed from the generation of cosmic bodies into a process of restoring likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-05","text":"Ignorance is rewritten from incapacity into proof that cosmic order does not depend on common consciousness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-06","text":"Knowledge initially requires sight and calculation, but at the limit passes into faith in tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RMD-07","text":"The distinction between fixed and wandering bodies absorbs the simple opposition of stability and change and transforms it into a hierarchy of kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-01","text":"The precise mechanical relation of the individual planetary revolutions remains a local detail and does not burden the central mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-02","text":"The distinction between eternity and time is scaled up into a general principle of heterogeneous modes of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-03","text":"Solar measurement, circular order, and divine hierarchization bridge the lower cosmological schemata.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-04","text":"The remaining dissimilarity overturns the idea that creation has already been completed and overturns the static version of the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-05","text":"Particular astronomical causation becomes a catalyst toward an epistemological distinction among the visible, the calculable, and the traditional.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:CGD-06","text":"The abstract image of time as flow is surpassed by the relation of periods and a common measure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-01","text":"Time as an autonomous substance without heaven, motion, and cosmic relation is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-02","text":"Absolute speed is excluded, because every speed appears only in comparison of circles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-03","text":"Disorderly motion is excluded, because difference, wandering, and recurrence are subject to order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-04","text":"The indiscriminate application of temporal verbs to the eternal is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:GNX-05","text":"Interpretation of heavenly signs without sight, calculation, and capacity for discernment is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-01","text":"The system requires the reduction of all reality to one temporal regime alone to be false.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-02","text":"The idea that the multiplicity of circles dissolves the unity of the cosmos is invalidated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-03","text":"The idea that creation is a limitless addition of matter is invalidated, because generation follows a paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-04","text":"The idea that demonstration must extend beyond every human measure is invalidated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:DBN-05","text":"The absolute distinction among natural cause, divine activity, and sign is invalidated, because the system links them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-01","text":"The possibility of time without cosmic motion and reference to the Same remains absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-02","text":"The possibility of an incommensurate cosmos, in which periods do not converge toward a common completion, remains absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-03","text":"The complete identity of the eternal paradigm and the sensible cosmos remains absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-04","text":"The self-sufficient human contemplation of every divine kind remains absent, and this absence produces tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSA-05","text":"The ultimate absence is the complete coincidence of paradigm and cosmos; from it arises continuing completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-01","text":"The distinction between eternity and time, when linked to circular measurement, produces time of a double character: an image of eternity and an enumerable order of motions.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_20:D3","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-02","text":"Common course and solar measure transform the difference of motions into a cognitive analogy, not merely into natural change.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","CL_JP8E_08:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-03","text":"The imperfection of the sensible cosmos becomes an active mechanism of creation, because imitation is not completed once for all, but is completed progressively.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:D7","CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-04","text":"Visible circular order unifies natural cause and prognostic sign, but its interpretation requires capacity and not simple viewing.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC4:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:XD-05","text":"The exceeding of human measure does not dissolve the cosmological system, but transfers authority from demonstration to institutionalized memory.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-01","text":"The cosmos becomes an ensouled temporal image, in which matter, form, intellection, motion, and memory function as one mechanism.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-03","CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-02","text":"Temporal order is not simple succession, but recursive calibration in which the circles measure one another and return toward the paradigm.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-04","CL_JP8E_08:GA-05","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-03","text":"Ontology and epistemology are interwoven: the kind of motion determines also the kind of possible knowledge.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-01","CL_JP8E_08:GA-09","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-04","text":"The dissimilarity of the cosmos to the paradigm becomes a productive lack, which moves creation and lengthens the cosmic process.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-08","CL_JP8E_08:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_21:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:BSD-05","text":"Scientific precision does not end in universal explanation, but defines the point at which knowledge entrusts the invisible to tradition.","refs":["CL_JP8E_08:GA-10","CL_JP8E_08:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-01","text":"Immutable paradigm → moving image → circular measurement → reconfirmation of the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-02","text":"Difference of motions → common measure → enumerable period → renewed visibility of the difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-03","text":"Sight reveals a sign, the sign requires calculation, and calculation defines the field of ignorance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-04","text":"Dissimilarity produces creation, creation produces a new cosmic order, and order returns toward likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-05","text":"When demonstration fails beyond the human measure, tradition becomes a new bearer of continuity and not a mere interruption.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:RLE-06","text":"The attractor of the system is likeness to the intelligible animal, which gathers together time, divinity, circle, and creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B01","text":"Principle: distinction of immutable eternity from temporal and generated being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B02","text":"Production: heaven and time are constituted as a moving image of eternal nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B03","text":"Differentiation: the course of the Same and the Different produce circles of different magnitude, speed, and direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B04","text":"Metric unification: the sun and the periods transform motion into day, month, year, and perfect time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B05","text":"Semiotic and creative extension: heaven becomes an animal and a sign, while dissimilarity moves completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FGS-B06","text":"Epistemological limitation: sight and calculation interpret the phenomenon, while tradition takes up the superhuman.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B07","text":"Imprecise temporal language → distinction of eternity and time → time as an imitation of eternity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B08","text":"Imitation of eternity → differentiated circles → sun as measure → enumerable temporal order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B09","text":"Temporal order → perfect year → imitation of the intelligible animal → completion of cosmic likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B10","text":"Cosmic likeness → hierarchization of divine kinds → earth as temporal link → visible signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:AFM-B11","text":"Visible signs → sight and calculation → limit of demonstration → tradition concerning the invisible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-01","text":"Time is reclassified from flow into a network of synchronized periods.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-02","text":"Motion ceases to be mere change and becomes a bearer of measure, meaning, and hierarchization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-03","text":"Earth appears as a divine function of nourishment, guardianship, and production of night and day.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-04","text":"Heaven is reconstructed as cosmos, animal, mechanism, and archive, so that natural sight becomes reading.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MME-05","text":"Demonstration is divided according to degrees and acquires a limit, where the incapacity for knowledge shifts authority toward tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface, the system describes heavenly circles, stars, earth, divine kinds, and temporal magnitudes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, order is produced from elements, figures, intellection, revolutions, and hierarchical distinctions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, knowledge must combine sight, calculation, discernment, and faith, without confusing these fields.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically, reality is ensouled, circular, hierarchical, and time is the result of cosmic motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, the form of the discourse imitates its object: it distinguishes, measures, reconnects, and delimits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-01","text":"The system requires precise calculation of phenomena, but permits tradition where demonstration is unable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-02","text":"The analogy of time and eternity unifies the two fields, but simultaneously imposes their non-negotiable distance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-03","text":"The attribution of meaning to heavenly signs threatens to confuse natural cause, divine activity, and providence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:FL-04","text":"Likeness to the paradigm is the attractor of the system, but complete identity remains impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-01","text":"Time mutates from an image of eternity into an enumerable period and then into a bearer of signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-02","text":"Creation mutates from cosmic construction into uninterrupted completion of dissimilarity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MP-03","text":"Demonstration mutates from arithmetical and visual explanation into hierarchical faith in tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as an ensouled circular mechanism that transforms eternity into measurable motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-02","text":"The human becomes an interpreter of signs and measurer of circles, but not master of the whole divine realm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-03","text":"Time is a circular restoration of difference toward the Same, not a linear departure from the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:HSI-04","text":"Possible escape is not an exit from the cosmos, but a more precise reading of motion and recognition of the limit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B01","text":"The central principles suffice for reconstruction of the mechanism from the ontological distinction to epistemological retreat.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from differentiated motion toward measure, time, likeness, and tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B03","text":"The detailed mechanics of the periods, the precise relation of the five motions, and the significance of the remaining animals are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_21:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B04","text":"Coherence is stronger in the relation of paradigm, motion, and measure, but weaker in the passage from demonstration to tradition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT4","CH_JP8E_SEC4:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_08:MRT-B05","text":"The axiomatic condensation is adequate only if it preserves the recursion from image to measure, from measure to sign, and from sign to the limit of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_20:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_08@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_08:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 22–24"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 22–24","context":"Section 38 · Section 39 · Section 40","original_title":"Chapters 22–24","original_context":"Section 38 · Section 39 · Section 40"},"original_title":"Chapters 22–24","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 25–27","order":9,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_22","CH_JP8E_S_23","CH_JP8E_S_24"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_09@R001","sha256":"573b263159faddd25e5575caa84cc497a3f8070d8c1442e0abea99811bf8d595","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ πῶς ἡ γενητὴ καὶ ἱεραρχημένη τάξις δύναται νὰ περιλάβῃ τὸ θνητὸν, τὸ παθητὸν καὶ τὸ ἄτακτον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B02","text":"Ἡ θνητότης μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἔλλειψιν εἰς ὅρον κοσμικῆς πληρότητος, ἀλλὰ ταὐτοχρόνως γίνεται ὑλικὸν διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B03","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία ἐμφανίζεται ὡς διαδοχὴ μεταβιβαζομένης δυνάμεως, ἐν ᾗ τὸ ἀνώτατον αἴτιον ἀποκεντροῦται ἀπὸ τὴν ἄμεσον παραγωγὴν τῶν ὑστέρων κακῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B04","text":"Τὸ σῶμα δὲν εἶναι ἁπλοῦν περίβλημα, ἀλλὰ δανειακὸν καὶ δραστικὸν μέσον μεταδόσεως κινήσεων εἰς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B05","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις γεννᾶται ὡς σωματοψυχικὴ μετάδοσις, ἥτις παραμορφοῖ τὴν ἀρχικὴν κυκλικότητα τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B06","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κρίσις ἐντοπίζεται ἐν τῇ ἐσωτερικῇ συγκρούσει λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου, οὐχὶ ἐκτὸς τῶν σωματικῶν ἀναγκῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B07","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία νοεῖται ὡς παραγόμενος τρόπος κινήσεως, ὃν δύναται ἡ ψυχὴ νὰ ἐπανατάξῃ, ἀλλὰ οὐχὶ ἄνευ κυκλικῆς δοκιμασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B08","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής: δημιουργία, ἐνσωμάτωσις, διατάραξις, ἠθικὴ κρίσις, μορφολογικὴ ἔκπτωσις ἢ ἐπάνοδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶσα γένεσις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ δημιουργικὸν αἴτιον καὶ οὐκ ἀναδύεται ὡς ἄτακτος αὐτογένεσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ δημιουργικὴ δύναμις μεταβιβάζεται ἱεραρχικῶς, ὥστε ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις νὰ συνίσταται διὰ μεσιτῶν καὶ διαδόχων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ θνητότης εἶναι ἀναγκαία πρὸς τὴν πληρότητα τοῦ κόσμου, ἀλλὰ ἅμα ἀποτελεῖ τὸ πεδίον τῆς φθορᾶς καὶ τῆς παθητικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ θνητὸν ζῷον συγκροτεῖται διὰ συνθέσεως ἀθανάτου ἀρχῆς καὶ φθαρτοῦ, δανειακοῦ ὑφάσματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ σῶμα λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐνεργὸς μηχανισμὸς μεταδόσεως καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ τῶν ἐξωτερικῶν κινήσεων εἰς ψυχικὴν ἐμπειρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἐνσώματωσις παράγει κοινὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ πάθη, δι᾽ ὧν ἡ ψυχὴ εἰσέρχεται εἰς πεδίον κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀταξία δὲν σημαίνει ἀπουσίαν κινήσεως, ἀλλὰ πολλαπλὴν κίνησιν ἄνευ ἔλλογου προσανατολισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ δικαιοσύνη ὀρίζεται ὡς ἐπικράτησις τοῦ λογικοῦ ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀλόγου, ἡ δὲ ἀδικία ὡς ἀποτυχία τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς κυριαρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἠθικὴ μορφὴ μεταβάλλει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν μοῖραν τῆς ψυχῆς καὶ δύναται νὰ ὁδηγήσῃ εἰς ἐπάνοδον ἢ ἐκφυλισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἐπάνοδος πρὸς τὴν ἀρχικὴν τάξιν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνάληψιν τῆς κυριαρχίας ὑπὸ τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ χρόνος λειτουργεῖ κυκλικῶς, ὡς διαδοχὴ ἐκπτώσεως, κρίσεως, μορφολογικῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ ἐπανορθώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","text":"[Tension] Ἡ θεία αἰτιότης διαιρεῖται, ὥστε νὰ διασωθῇ ἡ ἀγαθότης τοῦ πρώτου δημιουργοῦ χωρὶς νὰ ἀφανισθῇ ἡ ψυχικὴ εὐθύνη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ δημιουργικὴ αἰτία ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμογονίαν εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν κατασκευήν, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἄμεσον ποίησιν εἰς μίμησιν καὶ δευτερογενῆ διαμόρφωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_24:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ ἐξάρτησις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς σχέσις θεῶν, ψυχῶν καὶ σωμάτων, ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὴν ἐνσάρκωσιν γίνεται ὑλικὴ ἀστάθεια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ θνητότης μετακινείται ἀπὸ ἀναγκαῖον συστατικὸν τῆς τελειότητος εἰς ἐνεργὸν πηγήν παθημάτων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_23:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἀριθμημένην κοσμικὴν μονάδα εἰς κύκλον ὑποκείμενον σωματικῇ διασείσει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-05","text":"Τὸ σῶμα, ὃ κατὰ τὴν κατώτερον δημιουργίαν φαίνεται ὡς ὕλη, ἀναδεικνύεται μηχανὴ ἐνεργοῦς ψυχικῆς παραμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀλλάσσει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ συνεπαγόμενον τῆς ἐνσωματώσεως γίνεται ἀγωγὸς ἐξωτερικῆς κινήσεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ἧττα μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ κρίσιν πράξεως εἰς μορφολογικὴν ὑποβίβασιν καὶ κυκλικὴν ἐπάνοδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία ἀποβάλλει τὴν σημασίαν ἁπλῆς ἐλλείψεως καὶ γίνεται θετικῶς παραγόμενος τρόπος ἀντικρουομένων ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ συγκεκριμένη ἱεράρχησις τοῦ ἀνδρὸς ὡς κρείττονος γένους μένει τοπικὴ ἐφαρμογή, ἐνώ ἡ γενικὴ ἀρχὴ τῆς κοσμολογικῆς ἱεραρχήσεως κλιμακοῦται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς σύστασις ἐκ πυρός, γῆς, ὕδατος καὶ ἀέρος εἶναι τοπικὸς μηχανισμός, ὁ δὲ δανειακὸς χαρακτὴρ τῆς ὕλης γίνεται καθολικὴ δομή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀστρολογικὴ διανομὴ τῶν ψυχῶν παραμένει κατώτερος μηχανισμός, ἀλλὰ ἀναβαίνει ὡς ἀρχὴ προϋπάρχουσας θέσεως καὶ ὁρισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ σύνδεσις ἐνσωματώσεως, παθῶν καὶ ἠθικῆς κρίσεως γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια καὶ ἀποτελεῖ δομὴν τοῦ παρόντος ἐπιπέδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐνεργὸς σωματικὴ διατάραξις καταλύει τὴν κατώτερον ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι τὸ σῶμα εἶναι παθητικὸν δοχεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἁπλῆ ἀντίθεσις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ὑπερβαίνεται ὑπὸ κύκλου ἀμοιβαίας μεταδόσεως, ὃς γίνεται κεντρικὴ σύνθεσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-07","text":"Ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ ψυχὴ ἀνακτᾷ τὴν ἀρχικὴν τάξιν μένει ὑποκαθορισμένος καὶ δὲν ἀναβαίνει εἰς πλήρη ἀρχὴν τοῦ συμπλέγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται γένεσις αὐτόνομος, ἄνευ αἰτίου, μεσίτου καὶ ἱεραρχικῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος τέλειος ὁ ὁποῖος θὰ ἔμενεν ἄνευ τῶν θνητῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται τὸ σῶμα ὡς ἀδρανὲς περίβλημα, ἐπειδὴ μεταφέρει καὶ μετασχηματίζει κινήσεις πρὸς τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ αἴσθησις ὡς καθαρὰ καὶ ἀμέτοχος πρόσληψις ἀντικειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀταξία ὡς ἀπουσία κινήσεως, διότι παράγεται ἐκ πολλαπλῶν ἀσυντάκτων ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἐνσώματος ζωή ὡς ἀμετάκλητος μοῖρα, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἡ ἔξοδος ἀπαιτεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν ἀναδιάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ὕλη συνδημιουργεῖ αὐτοτελῶς, διότι ἡ γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἱεραρχικὴν προέλευσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὸ κακὸν ἔχει ἰσόκυρον καὶ ἀνεξάρτητον κοσμικὸν αἴτιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ ἐνσωματουμένη διατηρεῖ ἀπαραβίαστον τὸν ἴδιον νόμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ἠθικὴ κρίσις ἀπαλλάσσει τὴν ψυχὴν ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπίδρασιν τῶν παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ὁ χρόνος εἶναι γραμμικὸς καὶ ἅπαξ περατωμένος, διότι ἡ τάξις ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ὃς ἂν ἦν πλήρης ἄνευ θνητῆς ζωῆς καὶ ἄνευ τῆς φθορᾶς ἣν αὕτη φέρει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐνσώματος ψυχὴ ἡ ὁποία θὰ ἐπανελάμβανεν ἀδιαταράκτως τὴν ἀρχικήν της τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις μεταξὺ ψυχικῆς κινήσεως καὶ σωματικοῦ πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει αὐτάρκης ὑποκειμενικότης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχὴ συνίσταται ἐντὸς κοσμικῶν διανομῶν, σωμάτων καὶ ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-05","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἐγγύησις ὅτι ἡ πολλαπλὴ κίνησις θὰ ἀναχθῇ αὐτομάτως εἰς ἕνα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-01","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἱεραρχία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κύκλωμα μεταδόσεως, ἐν ᾧ ἡ δημιουργικὴ δύναμις διαβαίνει ἀπὸ θεῖον αἴτιον εἰς δανειακὴν σωματικότητα καὶ τέλος εἰς ψυχικὴν ἐμπειρίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_22:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-02","text":"Ἡ θνητότης γίνεται ταὐτοχρόνως ὅρος πληρότητος καὶ μηχανισμὸς διαταράξεως· ἡ ἀξία αὐτῆς δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἐπικινδυνότητά της.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-03","CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_23:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ εὐθύνη γεννᾶται οὐχὶ ἐναντίον τῆς σωματικῆς ἀνάγκης, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς ἀπάντησις εἰς τὴν διατάραξιν ἣν αὕτη παράγει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_23:D1","CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-04","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποκαλύπτεται ὡς ὁ τόπος ἐν ᾧ ἡ κοσμικὴ μαθηματικὴ τάξις μετατρέπεται εἰς ἀσταθῆ ψυχικὴν κίνησιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπάνοδος δὲν σημαίνει ἁπλῆν ἀπαλλαγὴν ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα, ἀλλὰ ἐπανασύνταξιν τῶν κινήσεων ὑπὸ τὴν κυριαρχίαν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_23:D5","CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-06","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῆς θείας αἰτιότητος καὶ ἡ δραστικὴ σωματικότης μεταφέρουσι τὸ πρόβλημα τοῦ κακοῦ ἀπὸ ἕνα ἀνώτατον αἴτιον εἰς κατανεμημένον σύστημα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_23:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς ἱεραρχικὸν σύστημα μεταδόσεως, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστον ἐπίπεδον παραλαμβάνει τάξιν καὶ παράγει νέαν ἀστάθειαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος δὲν εἶναι αὐτάρκης ὑποκείμενον, ἀλλὰ μεταβατικὸς κόμβος ἐν ᾧ συναντῶνται κοσμικὴ τάξις, σωματικὴ ῥοὴ καὶ ψυχικὴ κρίσις.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται μηχανισμὸς ἀνατροφοδοτήσεως, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἠθικὴ ἔξις μεταβάλλει τὴν μορφὴν τοῦ ὄντος καὶ ἡ νέα μορφὴ ἐπαναφέρει τὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-09","CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀντίληψις ἀποκτᾷ ὀντολογικὸν βάρος, διότι δὲν ἀναπαριστᾷ ἁπλῶς τὸ ὄν, ἀλλὰ συμμετέχει εἰς τὸν μετασχηματισμὸν τῆς ψυχικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ σωτηρία γίνεται στρατηγικὴ ἐπανακυριαρχίας ἐπὶ τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν ῥοῶν καὶ οὐχὶ φυγὴ ἐκ τοῦ κοσμικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ σύγκλεισις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἀνακλητή, οὐχὶ ἀπολύτως δεδομένη: ὁ λόγος λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἕλξις, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀνάκτησις τῆς τάξεως μένει ἀνοικτή.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-01","text":"Δημιουργικὴ αἰτία → ἱεραρχικὴ μετάδοσις → δανειακὴ σύνθεσις → ἐπιστροφή τῶν συστατικῶν· ἡ γένεσις ἀναπαράγει τὴν ἐξάρτησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-02","text":"Ἐνσωμάτωσις → σωματικὴ προσβολή → αἴσθησις → διάσεισις τῶν ψυχικῶν κύκλων → ἀνάγκη νέας κυριαρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἧττα τοῦ λόγου παράγει κατώτερας μορφάς, αἱ δὲ μορφαὶ ἐπαναφέρουσι τὴν ψυχὴν εἰς νέαν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ ἑκάστη ἐπανάληψις σημαίνει φάσιν μεταβολῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὴν ἀναπαραγωγήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-05","text":"Ὁ λόγος γίνεται ἕλξις τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐπάνοδος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπικράτησίν του ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀλόγου πλήθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ τριμερὴς κίνησις δημιουργία–διατάραξις–ἐπάνοδος συνδέει τὰ τρία κατώτερα ἐπίπεδα εἰς ἕνα σπειροειδὲς μηχάνημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_24:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B01","text":"Δημιουργικὴ αἰτία → ἱεραρχικὴ διανομή → μιμητικὴ δευτερογενὴς δημιουργία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B02","text":"Δανεισμὸς στοιχείων → ῥευστὸν σῶμα → ἔκθεσις εἰς ἐξωτερικὰς προσβολάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B03","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ προσβολή → σωματικὴ κίνησις → μετάδοσις εἰς ψυχήν → αἴσθησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B04","text":"Ἐντατικὴ αἴσθησις → παρεμπόδισις τοῦ ταὐτοῦ → διάσεισις τοῦ θατέρου → ἄλογος πολλαπλότης κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B05","text":"Ἄλογος πολλαπλότης → σύγκρουσις λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου → δικαιοσύνη ἢ ἀδικία → μορφολογικὴ ἐπάνοδος ἢ ἔκπτωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B06","text":"Ἐπάνοδος τοῦ λόγου → ἀνάταξις τῶν κύκλων· ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀνάταξις ἐπαναφέρει τὸ σύστημα εἰς νέαν ἔκθεσιν καὶ νέαν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B01","text":"Γενεσιουργὸς τάξις → ἱεραρχικὴ μεταβίβασις → θνητὴ πληρότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B02","text":"Θνητὴ σύνθεσις → ἐνσωμάτωσις ψυχῆς → σωματικὴ μετάδοσις → αἰσθητικὴ διατάραξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B03","text":"Ψυχικὴ διατάραξις → σύγκρουσις λόγου καὶ ἀλόγου → ἠθικὴ μορφοποίησις → ἔκπτωσις ἢ ἐπάνοδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B04","text":"Ἐπάνοδος → προσωρινὴ ἀνάταξις → κυκλικὴ ἐπανέκθεσις· ἡ τελικὴ θέσις εἶναι ἕλξις καὶ οὐχὶ ἀμετάκλητον κλείσιμο.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-01","text":"Ἡ θνητότης ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαῖος φορεὺς πληρότητος καὶ ὡς πηγή κινδύνου, οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ στέρησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-02","text":"Ἡ δημιουργία ἀνατέμνεται εἰς ἀρχικὴν σύστασιν καὶ δευτερογενῆ μορφοποίησιν, ὥστε ἡ αἰτιότης νὰ διανεμηθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-03","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς μετασχηματισμὸς κινήσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀμέσως γνωστικὴ λήψις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-04","text":"Τὸ σῶμα μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ κατώτερον ὑλικὸν εἰς δραστικὴν μηχανὴν ψυχικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ ἀξία μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν πράξιν εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν σχέσιν λόγου, πάθους καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ καταλύεται ὑπὸ κύκλου ἀμοιβαίας μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου φαίνονται θεοὶ, σώματα, πάθη, αἰσθήσεις καὶ μεταβολαὶ ζῴων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐνεργοῦσιν ἱεραρχικὴ ἐξάρτησις, δανειακὴ σύνθεσις, μεταβίβασις κινήσεων καὶ κυκλικὴ κρίσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ σωτηρία ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς ἄσκησις κυριαρχίας ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐσωτερικοῦ πλήθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ εἶναι κινείται διὰ γενέσεως, δεσμοῦ, διαταράξεως, φθορᾶς καὶ ἐπανόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀνάγνωσις ὀφείλει νὰ παρακολουθῇ μεταδόσεις καὶ μεταλλάξεις, οὐχὶ νὰ ἀντιπαραθέτῃ ἁπλῶς ψυχὴν καὶ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-01","text":"[Tension] Οἱ γενητοὶ θεοὶ εἶναι κατὰ φύσιν λυτοί, ἀλλὰ κατὰ βούλησιν τοῦ δημιουργοῦ διασώζονται ὡς ἄλυτοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-02","text":"[Tension] Ἡ θνητότης ἀπαιτεῖται πρὸς τὴν τελειότητα, ἀλλὰ παραμένει κατώτερον καὶ φθαρτὸν ὑλικὸν τῆς δημιουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-03","text":"[Tension] Τὰ σωματικὰ πάθη ἐπιβάλλονται ἀναγκαίως, ἡ δὲ κακία ἀποδίδεται ἐν μέρει εἰς τὴν ἧττα τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-04","text":"[Tension] Ἡ ψυχὴ φέρει ἐντός της κοσμικὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ τὸ σῶμα δύναται νὰ ἐμποδίσῃ καὶ νὰ διασείσῃ τοὺς κύκλους αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-01","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ αἴσθησις μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ παθητικὴν ἔκφανσιν ἐνσωματώσεως εἰς δραστικὸν μηχανισμὸν μεταμορφώσεως τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀταξία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἔλλειψιν τάξεως εἰς παραγόμενον σύστημα ἀντικρουομένων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ δικαιοσύνη μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν ἰδιότητα εἰς μορφολογικὴν δύναμιν ἐπαναγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι μηχανὴ ἱεραρχικῶν ρελέ, ἐν ᾗ ἡ τάξις μεταδίδεται ἀλλὰ κατὰ τὴν μετάδοσιν ὑφίσταται παραμόρφωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ὑποκείμενος γίνεται σύνθετον πεδίον, ἐν ᾧ ἀθάνατοι κύκλοι καὶ ῥευσταὶ σωματικαὶ ῥοαὶ συγκρούονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι κυκλικὴ μηχανὴ ἐκπτώσεως καὶ ἐπανατάξεως, οὐχὶ γραμμικὴ πορεία πρὸς ἅπαξ δεδομένον τέλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ ἐφικτὴ ἔξοδος συνίσταται οὐχὶ εἰς φυγὴν ἐκ τοῦ κόσμου, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς ἀνάκτησιν τοῦ ρυθμοῦ διὰ τῆς κυριαρχίας τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν δημιουργικὴν τάξιν μέχρι τὴν ἐπάνοδον ἢ τὴν ἔκπτωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διατηρεῖ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ θεογονίαν εἰς κοσμολογίαν, ἀπὸ κοσμολογίαν εἰς ἐνσάρκωσιν καὶ ἀπὸ ἐνσάρκωσιν εἰς ἠθικὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυροτάτη ἐν τῇ συνδέσει αἰτίου, δανειακοῦ σώματος, μεταδοτικῆς αἰσθήσεως καὶ κυκλικῆς ψυχικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B04","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζεται ὁ μηχανισμὸς τῆς ἀνακτήσεως τῆς ἀρχικῆς τάξεως, καὶ ἡ γέφυρα μεταξὺ κοσμικῆς εἱμαρμένης καὶ ἀξιολογικῆς ὑπεροχῆς μένει ἀτελής.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διασώζει τὴν σπειροειδῆ κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἀμφισημία περὶ εὐθύνης καὶ ἀναγκαιότητος παραμένει ἀναπόσπαστος ὅρος τῆς λειτουργίας του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232322384001Z_f43ec6c4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 25–27","source_sha256":"573b263159faddd25e5575caa84cc497a3f8070d8c1442e0abea99811bf8d595","sha256":"9c8504bd54315c09783f29a1d543cf4e9c11cce4f2a465831b2b176b1ab9837d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:23:22.386450+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B01","text":"The system seeks to explain how generated and hierarchically ordered order can include the mortal, the passive, and the disorderly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B02","text":"Mortality is transformed from a deficiency into a condition of cosmic completeness, but at the same time becomes material of disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B03","text":"Creation appears as a succession of transmitted power, in which the highest cause is decentered from the direct production of subsequent evils.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B04","text":"The body is not a mere covering, but a borrowed and active means of transmitting motions to the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B05","text":"Sensation arises as a bodily-psychic transmission, which distorts the soul's original circularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B06","text":"Ethical judgment is located in the internal conflict of reason and the irrational, not outside bodily necessities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B07","text":"Disorder is understood as a produced mode of motion, which the soul can reorder, though not without cyclic trial.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AS-B08","text":"The overall movement is spiral: creation, embodiment, disturbance, ethical judgment, morphological decline or return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Every coming-to-be depends on a creative cause and does not arise as disorderly self-generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Creative power is transmitted hierarchically, so that cosmic order consists through intermediaries and successors.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Mortality is necessary for the completeness of the cosmos, but at once constitutes the field of corruption and passive disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] The mortal living being is constituted through a composition of an immortal principle and a perishable, borrowed fabric.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] The body functions as an active mechanism for transmitting and transforming external motions into psychic experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Embodiment produces common sensation and affections, through which the soul enters a field of judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Disorder does not mean an absence of motion, but multiple motion without rational orientation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Justice is defined as the predominance of the rational over the irrational, and injustice as the failure of internal mastery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ethical form changes the ontological lot of the soul and can lead to return or degeneration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Return to the original order depends on reason's assumption of mastery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Time functions cyclically, as a succession of decline, judgment, morphological change, and restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","text":"[Tension] Divine causality is divided, so that the goodness of the first creator may be preserved without psychic responsibility being effaced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-01","text":"The creative cause recurs from cosmogony to bodily construction, but is transformed from direct making into imitation and secondary formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_24:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-02","text":"Hierarchical dependence recurs as the relation of gods, souls, and bodies, but in incarnation becomes material instability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-03","text":"Mortality shifts from a necessary constituent of perfection into an active source of affections and changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_23:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-04","text":"The soul passes from a numbered cosmic unit into a circle subject to bodily shaking.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-05","text":"The body, which in lower creation appears as matter, emerges as a mechanism of active psychic distortion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-06","text":"Sensation changes function: from a consequence of embodiment it becomes a conduit of external motion and internal disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-07","text":"Ethical defeat is transformed from judgment of an act into morphological debasement and cyclic return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A7","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RMD-08","text":"Disorder sheds the meaning of mere lack and becomes a positively produced mode of opposing flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-01","text":"The specific hierarchy of the man as the superior kind remains a local application, while the general principle of cosmological hierarchy is scaled up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-02","text":"The precise composition from fire, earth, water, and air is a local mechanism, while the borrowed character of matter becomes a universal structure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-03","text":"The astrological distribution of souls remains a lower mechanism, but is elevated as a principle of pre-existing position and determination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-04","text":"The connection of embodiment, affections, and ethical judgment bridges the chapters and constitutes a structure of the present level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-05","text":"Active bodily disturbance overturns the lower assumption that the body is a passive receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-06","text":"The simple opposition of soul and body is superseded by a cycle of reciprocal transmission, which becomes the central synthesis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:CGD-07","text":"The precise way in which the soul recovers the original order remains underdetermined and does not rise into a full principle of the complex.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-01","text":"Autonomous coming-to-be, without cause, intermediary, and hierarchical transmission, is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-02","text":"A perfect cosmos that would remain without mortal kinds is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-03","text":"The body as an inert covering is excluded, because it carries and transforms motions toward the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-04","text":"Sensation as a pure and uninvolved apprehension of an object is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-05","text":"Disorder as absence of motion is excluded, because it is produced from multiple uncoordinated flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:GNX-06","text":"Embodied life as an irrevocable fate is excluded, but exit likewise requires internal reordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that matter co-creates independently, because coming-to-be requires hierarchical origin.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that evil has an equally valid and independent cosmic cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that, in becoming embodied, the soul preserves its own law inviolably.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that ethical judgment releases the soul from the influence of affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that time is linear and once-and-for-all completed, because order repeats judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-01","text":"There is no cosmos that would be complete without mortal life and without the corruption it brings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-02","text":"There is no embodied soul that would repeat its original order without disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-03","text":"There is no absolute distinction between psychic motion and bodily affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-04","text":"There is no self-sufficient subjectivity, because the soul is constituted within cosmic distributions, bodies, and flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSA-05","text":"There is no guarantee that multiple motion will automatically be reduced to one reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-01","text":"Cosmic hierarchy is transformed into a circuit of transmission, in which creative power passes from divine cause to borrowed corporeality and finally to psychic experience.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_22:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-02","text":"Mortality becomes at once a condition of completeness and a mechanism of disturbance; its value does not annul its dangerousness.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-03","CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_23:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-03","text":"Ethical responsibility arises not against bodily necessity, but as a response to the disturbance it produces.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_23:D1","CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-04","text":"Sensation is revealed as the place in which cosmic mathematical order is converted into unstable psychic motion.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-05","text":"Return does not mean mere release from the body, but a reordering of motions under the mastery of reason.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_23:D5","CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:XD-06","text":"The division of divine causality and active corporeality transfer the problem of evil from a single highest cause to a distributed system.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_23:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-01","text":"Reality is reconstituted as a hierarchical system of transmission, in which each level receives order and produces new instability.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-02","CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-02","text":"The human being is not a self-sufficient subject, but a transitional node in which cosmic order, bodily flow, and psychic judgment meet.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-04","CL_JP8E_09:GA-06","CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-03","text":"Time becomes a feedback mechanism, in which ethical disposition changes the form of the being and the new form restores judgment.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-09","CL_JP8E_09:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-04","text":"Perception acquires ontological weight, because it does not merely represent the being, but participates in the transformation of psychic order.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-05","CL_JP8E_09:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_24:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-05","text":"Salvation becomes a strategy of regaining mastery over internal flows and not an escape from the cosmic mechanism.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-08","CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:BSD-06","text":"The final closure of the system is revocable, not absolutely given: reason functions as an attraction, but the recovery of order remains open.","refs":["CL_JP8E_09:GA-10","CL_JP8E_09:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-01","text":"Creative cause → hierarchical transmission → borrowed composition → return of the constituents; coming-to-be reproduces dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-02","text":"Embodiment → bodily assault → sensation → shaking of the psychic circles → need for new mastery.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-03","text":"The defeat of reason produces lower forms, and the forms return the soul to a new judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-04","text":"Disorder recurs, but each recurrence signifies a phase of change and not mere reproduction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-05","text":"Reason becomes the system's attraction, because return depends on its predominance over the irrational multitude.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:RLE-06","text":"The threefold movement creation–disturbance–return joins the three lower levels into one spiral mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_24:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B01","text":"Creative cause → hierarchical distribution → imitative secondary creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B02","text":"Borrowing of elements → fluid body → exposure to external assaults.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B03","text":"External assault → bodily motion → transmission to soul → sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B04","text":"Intense sensation → hindrance of the same → shaking of the other → irrational multiplicity of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B05","text":"Irrational multiplicity → conflict of reason and the irrational → justice or injustice → morphological return or decline.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FGS-B06","text":"Return of reason → reordering of the circles; but the reordering returns the system to new exposure and new judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B01","text":"Generative order → hierarchical transmission → mortal completeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B02","text":"Mortal composition → embodiment of soul → bodily transmission → sensory disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B03","text":"Psychic disturbance → conflict of reason and the irrational → ethical formation → decline or return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:AFM-B04","text":"Return → temporary reordering → cyclic renewed exposure; the final position is an attraction and not an irrevocable closure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-01","text":"Mortality is reclassified as a necessary bearer of completeness and as a source of danger, not as mere privation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-02","text":"Creation is dissected into original constitution and secondary formation, so that causality may be distributed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-03","text":"Sensation is recognized as a transformation of motion and not as an immediately cognitive reception.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-04","text":"The body is transformed from inferior material into an active mechanism of psychic disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-05","text":"Ethical value is transferred from external action to the internal relation of reason, affection, and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MME-06","text":"The distinction between internal and external is overturned by a cycle of reciprocal transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, gods, bodies, affections, sensations, and changes of living beings appear.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, hierarchical dependence, borrowed composition, transmission of motions, and cyclic judgment operate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B03","text":"At the meta-strategic level, salvation is reconstituted as an exercise of mastery over the internal multitude.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, being moves through coming-to-be, bond, disturbance, corruption, and return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, reading must follow transmissions and transformations, rather than merely oppose soul and body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-01","text":"[Tension] Generated gods are by nature dissoluble, but by the will of the creator are preserved as indissoluble.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-02","text":"[Tension] Mortality is required for perfection, but remains inferior and perishable material of creation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-03","text":"[Tension] Bodily affections are imposed necessarily, while vice is attributed in part to the defeat of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:FL-04","text":"[Tension] The soul bears cosmic order within itself, but the body can hinder and shake its circles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-01","text":"[Mutating] Sensation changes from a passive manifestation of embodiment into an active mechanism of transformation of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-02","text":"[Mutating] Disorder changes from a lack of order into a produced system of opposing motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MP-03","text":"[Mutating] Justice passes from an ethical property into a morphological power of restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-01","text":"Reality is a machine of hierarchical relays, in which order is transmitted but undergoes distortion in transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a composite field, in which immortal circles and fluid bodily flows conflict.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-03","text":"Time is a cyclic mechanism of decline and reordering, not a linear course toward a once-given end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:HSI-04","text":"The possible exit consists not in flight from the cosmos, but in recovering rhythm through the mastery of reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstructing the fundamental movement from creative order through return or decline.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from theogony to cosmology, from cosmology to incarnation, and from incarnation to ethical judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B03","text":"Coherence is strongest in the connection of cause, borrowed body, transmissive sensation, and cyclic psychic change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_24:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B04","text":"The mechanism for recovering original order is underdetermined, and the bridge between cosmic fate and axiological superiority remains incomplete.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_22:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_09:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the spiral movement of the system, but the ambiguity concerning responsibility and necessity remains an inseparable condition of its operation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_23:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_09@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_09:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 25–27"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 25–27","context":"Section 41 · Section 42 · Section 43","original_title":"Chapters 25–27","original_context":"Section 41 · Section 42 · Section 43"},"original_title":"Chapters 25–27","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 28–30","order":10,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_25","CH_JP8E_S_26","CH_JP8E_S_27"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_10@R001","sha256":"21474a4b3d92ee0d160b9b795014a11509761b08d9fcb4689454ae494075082f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ πῶς ἡ ἐνσώματος αἴσθησις δύναται συγχρόνως νὰ μεταδίδῃ κόσμιον λόγον καὶ νὰ γεννᾷ πλάνην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B02","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ ἀναπλαισιοῦται ὡς θεολογικῶς διατεταγμένη μηχανή, οὐχὶ ὡς ἄμορφος ὕλη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B03","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις θεμελιοῦται εἰς δυναμικὴν συνέχεια ἐσωτερικῶν καὶ ἐξωτερικῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B04","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα, ὥσπερ αἱ ἀντιστροφαί, ἀποδεικνύουσιν ὅτι ἡ ὄψις φανερώνει σχέσεις ἐπαφῆς καὶ οὐχὶ πράγματα ἀμέσως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀνάγκη παραμένει ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλὰ ὑποτάσσεται εἰς νοερὰν καὶ τελεολογικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B06","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ λόγου ἀναβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνατομίαν εἰς τὴν φυσιολογίαν, ἀπὸ τὴν φυσιολογίαν εἰς τὴν αἴσθησιν, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν αἴσθησιν εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν αἰτιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B07","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐνεργεῖ ὡς κυκλικὸς δίαυλος, δι᾽ οὗ αἱ κινήσεις τοῦ κόσμου εἰσέρχονται εἰς τὸ σῶμα καὶ ἐπανέρχονται ὡς κρίσεις τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις οὐκ εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἐπίλυσις, ἀλλὰ ἱεραρχικὴ σύνθεσις νοῦ, σώματος, κινήσεως καὶ ἀνάγκης, ἐν ᾗ ἡ γέφυρα μεταξὺ νοερᾶς προθέσεως καὶ σωματικῆς μηχανικῆς μένει ἐν μέρει ἀκαθόριστος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ὁ ἄνθρωπος ὑπάρχει ὡς ψυχὴ ἐν σώματι, καὶ οὔτε ἡ ψυχὴ οὔτε τὸ σῶμα ἀρκεί μόνον εἰς τὴν ἐξήγησιν τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ σωματικὴ διάταξις φέρει λειτουργικὸν καὶ τελεολογικὸν λόγον, ὥστε ἡ μορφὴ νὰ ὑπηρετῇ συγκεκριμένας κινήσεις καὶ ψυχικὰς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κεφαλὴ ὡς ἡγεμονικὸς τόπος μετασχηματίζεται εἰς πρότυπον ἱεραρχικῆς αἰτιότητος, ἐν ᾗ τὰ σωματικὰ αἴτια ὑπηρετοῦσιν ὑπερκειμένην ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ αἴσθησις εἶναι δυναμικὴ σύναψις συγγενῶν δυνάμεων, καὶ οὐχὶ παθητικὴ εἴσοδος ἔξωθεν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A6","CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὁμοιότης ἀπὸ στατικὴ συγγένεια μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀγωγὸν κινήσεων, παθῶν καὶ μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ φαινόμενον εἶναι σχέσις παραγομένη ἐκ ἐπαφῆς, φωτός, λεότητος καὶ κινήσεως, καὶ οὐχὶ ἀμετάβλητον ἀντίγραφον τοῦ πράγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Τὰ σωματικὰ καὶ ὁρατὰ αἴτια εἰσὶ συναίτια, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἀποτελοῦσιν ἔσχατον νοῦν ἢ τελικὴν ἀρχὴν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πλήρης ἐξήγησις τῆς φύσεως ἀπαιτεῖ συμπαράθεσιν νοερῶν πρώτων αἰτίων καὶ σωματικῶν δευτέρων αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ διαταραχὴ τῶν ψυχικῶν κινήσεων καὶ ἡ ἀλλοίωσις τῶν αἰσθητικῶν σχέσεων ἀποτελοῦσι δύο μορφὰς ἀποκλίσεως ἀπὸ τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ὁλόκληρον τὸ σύστημα ἐπιστρέφει πρὸς ἱεραρχικὴν ἀνάταξιν, ἐν ᾗ ἡ κίνησις ὑποτάσσεται εἰς φρόνησιν, σκοπὸν καὶ ἡγεμονίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία κεφαλῆς καὶ σώματος ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ σωματικὴν ὀργάνωσιν εἰς κοσμικὴν διάκρισιν πρώτων καὶ δευτέρων αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια ἐκκινεί ὡς μορφοποίησις τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ καταλήγει ὡς ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ρύθμισις ὁλοκλήρου τοῦ αἰτιακοῦ πεδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-03","text":"Τὸ πῦρ καὶ ἡ συγγένεια ἐπαναλαμβάνονται ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν τῆς ὄψεως εἰς τὴν παραγωγὴν εἰδώλων, ἀλλὰ ἐκεῖ μετατρέπονται εἰς ὅρους πιθανῆς πλάνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_27:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἀπὸ ψυχικὴ διαταραχὴ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς σωματικὴ μετάδοσιν καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς μηχανικὴν ἀνάγκην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ παῦσις τῆς ὄψεως καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ γαλήνευσις τῶν περιφορῶν ἀποκαλύπτουσιν ὅτι ἡ ἀπουσία ἐνεργείας εἶναι ῥύθμισις καὶ οὐχὶ γυμνὴ στέρησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ παιδεία, ἀρχικῶς ὄρος ψυχικῆς τελειώσεως, γίνεται γενικώτερον ὑπόδειγμα μετατροπῆς φυσικῆς ἀποκαταστάσεως εἰς συνειδητὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_25:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-07","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἐπιμένει ὡς ὄχημα, ἀλλὰ παύει νὰ εἶναι παθητικὸς φορεύς, ἐπειδὴ γίνεται ἐνεργὸς μεσολαβητὴς μεταξὺ κόσμου καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ σφαιρικὴ μορφὴ τῆς κεφαλῆς, ἡ λειτουργία τῶν βλεφάρων καὶ ἡ τετρασκελὴς κατασκευή μένουσι τοπικαὶ ἐπεξηγήσεις, οὐχὶ καθολικαὶ ἀρχαί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","CH_JP8E_S_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ ποὺ κλιμακοῦται εἶναι ἡ λειτουργικὴ διάταξις: ἕκαστον μέρος ὁρίζεται διὰ τῆς θέσεως, τῆς κινήσεως καὶ τοῦ τέλους του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐνεργὸς μεσολάβησις τῆς αἰσθήσεως γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει ἀνατομίαν, φυσιολογίαν, κρίσιν καὶ κοσμολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν εἰδώλων καταλύει τὴν τοπικὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι τὸ ὁρατὸν ἀντικείμενον ἐμφανίζεται ἄνευ σχέσεως, καὶ καταλύει τὴν ἁπλῆν ἀντιστοίχισιν μορφῆς καὶ πράγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἰδέα τῆς αἰσθήσεως ὡς βεβαίας προσλήψεως ἀχρηστεύεται καὶ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ τῆς αἰσθήσεως ὡς ἀλυσίδος μεταδόσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις πρώτων καὶ δευτέρων αἰτίων καταλύει τὴν ἐξάρτησιν ἀπὸ ἕνα μόνον ἐξηγηματικὸν ἐπίπεδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-01","text":"Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἔστιν ἄμορφος ὕλη, ἀλλὰ διάταξις ἱεραρχημένη καὶ προσανατολισμένη πρὸς λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-02","text":"Ἡ ὄψις οὐκ ἔστιν παθητικὴ λήψις, ἀλλὰ σύναψις ἐσωτερικῶν καὶ ἐξωτερικῶν ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-03","text":"Τὸ φαινόμενον οὐκ ἔχει αὐτοτελῆ ἀλήθειαν ἔξωθεν τῶν σχέσεων ἐπαφῆς, φωτός, κινήσεως καὶ διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-04","text":"Ἡ ὑλικὴ ἀνάγκη οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ πλήρη κοσμογονικὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλὰ μόνον συναίτιον τῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-05","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις οὐκ ἀναδύεται αὐτομάτως ἐκ τῆς φυσικῆς ἡσυχίας, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ παιδευτικὴν συμπλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ἐνσώματος ἐμπειρία προσφέρει ἀμέσως τὴν ἀλήθειαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐμπειρία διέρχεται διὰ μεταδόσεων καὶ σχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὸ ὁρατὸν ἢ τὸ σωματικὸν ἐξηγεῖ τὸ νοητὸν ἄνευ ὑπερκειμένης ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ φυσικὴ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ νοερὰ δημιουργία ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀντιμαχόμενας καὶ ἀμοιβαίως ἀποκλειομένας ἐξηγήσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ἐπιστροφή εἰς φυσικὴν τάξιν ἰσοδυναμεῖ μὲ ὁλοκληρωμένην ἀνθρωπίνην τελείωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ἀπουσία κινήσεως εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἀκύρωσις, ἐπειδὴ δύναται νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς ἐνεργὸς ρύθμισις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα κυκλοῖ περὶ τῆς ἀδυνάτου ἀμεσότητος μεταξὺ κόσμου καὶ νοῦ· πᾶσα πρόσβασις διέρχεται διὰ σωματικῆς μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία αὐτοτελοῦς ὑλικῆς νοήσεως δίδει δύναμιν εἰς τὴν ἀναζήτησιν ὑπερκειμένης νοερᾶς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδιανόητος μένει ὁ ἄνθρωπος ὡς καθαρὴ αὐτονομία, ἄνευ φυσικῆς, σωματικῆς καὶ παιδευτικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-01","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ σῶμα εἶναι συγχρόνως ὄχημα καὶ δίαυλος μεταδόσεως, ἡ ἐνσώματος ὕπαρξις δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλὴν ὑποταγήν τῆς ψυχῆς, ἀλλὰ μηχανισμὸν παραγωγῆς ἐμπειρίας καὶ διαταραχῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","CL_JP8E_10:GA-03","CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἴδια αἰσθητικὴ συνέχεια ποὺ καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν γνώσιν δύναται νὰ μεταφέρῃ σύγχυσιν, ἐπειδὴ μεταδίδει κινήσεις πρὶν ἡ ψυχὴ ἀνακτήσῃ τὴν ἡγεμονίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_26:D4","CH_JP8E_S_25:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ τῶν εἰδώλων ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι ἡ φαινομένη τάξις παράγεται ἐν τῇ σχέσει τοῦ ὀργάνου πρὸς τὸ ἀντικείμενον, ὥστε ἡ πλάνη νὰ εἶναι ἀποτέλεσμα μηχανισμοῦ καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπλὴ ἀπουσία γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_27:D1","CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος ἀναγκάζει τὴν φυσικὴν ἐπιστήμην νὰ διακρίνῃ ἐπίσης μεταξὺ τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ τοῦ συμβαίνοντος καὶ τοῦ λόγου δι᾽ ὃν συμβαίνει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:D5","CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-05","text":"Ὁ χρόνος, ἡ νὺξ καὶ ὁ ὕπνος δείκνυσιν ὅτι ἡ τάξις δὲν εἶναι ἀκίνητος κατάστασις, ἀλλὰ ρυθμικὴ ἐναλλαγὴ μεταδόσεως, καταστολῆς καὶ ἐπανόδου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη ἀποκτᾷ ἐξηγηματικὴν ἀξίαν μόνον ὅταν ἐνταχθῇ εἰς σχέδιον, ὃ δὲν καταργεῖ τὴν μηχανικήν, ἀλλὰ τὴν ὑποτάσσει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ γνώσις γίνεται ἀναδραστικὴ διαδικασία, ἐν ᾗ ὁ κόσμος μεταδίδεται διὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ τάξις ἐπανερμηνεύει τὴν σωματικὴν ἐμπειρίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ φύσις δὲν ἀναδύεται ὡς κλειστὸς μηχανισμός, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἱεραρχημένον πεδίον ὅπου ἡ ἀνάγκη ἐνεργεῖ ὑπὸ νοερὰν καὶ τελεολογικὴν ἐποπτείαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ πλάνη μετατρέπεται εἰς διαγνωστικὸν σημεῖον: φανερώνει τὴν μεσολάβησιν τοῦ ὀργάνου καὶ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνάλυσιν τῶν σχέσεων ποὺ τὴν παρήγαγον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ τελεολογία δὲν ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην, ἀλλὰ τὴν μετασχηματίζει εἰς ὄργανον ὑπηρετοῦν τὴν πραγμάτωσιν τοῦ δυνατοῦ ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια νοοῦνται ὡς καταστάσεις ἐπιτευκτῆς ἀνατάξεως, οὐχὶ ὡς δεδομέναι ἰδιότητες τοῦ ἐνσώματου ὄντος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-01","text":"Ἐξωτερικὸν φῶς → ἐσωτερικὸν πῦρ → ὄργανον → σῶμα → ψυχή· ἡ ἀλυσὶς αὕτη ἐπιστρέφει ὡς αἴσθησις, κρίσις καὶ πιθανὴ σύγχυσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-02","text":"Ἐνσώματος σύνδεσις → αἰσθητικὸς παρασυρμός → σύγχυσις → χρόνος καὶ γαλήνευσις → παιδεία → ἀνάκτησις ἡγεμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-03","text":"Ἐπαφὴ καὶ ὁμοιότης → εἴδωλον → ἀντιστροφή → ἀναγνώρισις τῆς σχέσεως· ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς ὄψεως γίνεται ἐμβάθυνσις εἰς τὸν μηχανισμὸν τοῦ φαινομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-04","text":"Ἀνατομία → φυσιολογία → αἴσθησις → φαινόμενον → αἰτιότης· ἡ κλίμαξ αὕτη ἐκτείνει τὴν τοπικὴν σωματικὴν περιγραφήν εἰς κοσμολογικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ ἀνάταξις λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος: ἕκαστη διαταραχὴ ἀναπέμπει εἰς ἀνώτερον ἐπίπεδον ἐξηγήσεως, ἄνευ ὁριστικῆς καταργήσεως τῶν κατωτέρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B01","text":"Θεία πρόνοια → λειτουργικὴ διάταξις σώματος → ἡγεμονικὴ κεφαλὴ καὶ ὄργανα αἰσθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B02","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ δύναμις + ἐξωτερικὸς κόσμος → συγγένεια καὶ ἐπαφή → αἴσθησις ὡς μετάδοσις κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B03","text":"Μεταβολὴ ἐπαφῆς → ἀλλοίωσις φαινομένου → εἴδωλον, ἀντιστροφὴ καὶ σχετικοποίησις τῆς ὄψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B04","text":"Ὁρατὰ σώματα + ἔλλειψις νοῦ → διάκρισις συναίτιων καὶ πρώτων αἰτίων → διπλὴ ἐξήγησις φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B05","text":"Αἰσθητικὴ διαταραχή → σύγχυσις κρίσεως → χρόνος, ἡσυχία καὶ παιδεία → ἐπανασύστασις ἡγεμονικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B06","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ ἀνάταξις → ἔνταξις τῆς ἀνάγκης εἰς νοερὸν σχέδιον → κοσμικὴ τάξις ὡς σύνθεσις κινήσεων καὶ σκοπῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B09","text":"Ἐνσώματος ἀταξία → λειτουργικὴ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ σώματος → δυναμικὴ αἴσθησις → σχετικὸν φαινόμενον → διάκρισις πρώτων καὶ δευτέρων αἰτίων → ἐπανόρθωσις ἡγεμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B10","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος δὲν εἶναι γραμμική: ἡ ἐπανόδος εἰς τάξιν ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν ἀρχικὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἀλλὰ πλέον ὡς ἐξηγημένην διάκρισιν νοῦ, σώματος καὶ ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_25:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-01","text":"Τὸ σῶμα μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ ὑποκείμενον ὕλης εἰς ἱεραρχημένον δίκτυον ὀργάνων, ῥοῶν καὶ σκοπῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-02","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις μεταγράφεται ἀπὸ γέφυρα μεταξὺ ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ εἰς μηχανὴν ἀμοιβαίας μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-03","text":"Τὸ εἴδωλον καὶ ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ γίνονται ἐργαλεῖα ἀναλύσεως τῆς σχέσεως, καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὰ προβλήματα ἀντιγραφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-04","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐπιστήμη ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς ἔρευνα πολλαπλῶν αἰτιακῶν τάξεων, ὅπου ἡ μηχανικὴ καὶ ἡ τελεολογία συντάσσονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία, ἡ φρόνησις καὶ ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀναφαίνονται ὡς μορφαὶ ρυθμισμένης κινήσεως, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀκίνητα δεδομένα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα ἐξηγεῖ μέλη, ὄργανα, πῦρ, φῶς, εἴδωλα, ἀντιστροφὰς καὶ ὕπνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, ἡ πραγματικότης συνίσταται ἐκ ἱεραρχιῶν, ἐπαφῶν, ῥοῶν, συγγενειῶν καὶ μεταδόσεων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἔρευνα ὀφείλει νὰ ἀναλύῃ τὸ φαινόμενον κατὰ τὰς μεσολαβήσεις του καὶ νὰ μὴ συγχέῃ συναίτιον καὶ κύριον αἴτιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ ὂν εἶναι δίκτυον ὁμοιοτήτων καὶ κινήσεων, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἔσχατη τάξις αὐτοῦ ἀπαιτεῖ νοερὰν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B05","text":"Χρονικῶς, ἡ τάξις παράγεται διὰ κύκλων ἐνεργείας, ἀποσβέσεως, ἡσυχίας, ἐπανόδου καὶ παιδευτικῆς συμπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B06","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὴν ἱεραρχίαν ποὺ ὑπερασπίζεται, μεταβαίνουσα ἀπὸ μηχανισμὸν εἰς σκοπὸν χωρὶς νὰ ἐγκαταλείπῃ τὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-01","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις παρουσιάζεται καὶ ὡς ὅρος γνώσεως καὶ ὡς πηγή παρασυρμοῦ· ἡ ἀντίφασις αὕτη εἶναι παραγωγικὴ, ἐπειδὴ ἀναγκάζει τὸ σύστημα νὰ διακρίνῃ μετάδοσιν καὶ κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-02","text":"Ἡ νοερὰ πρόθεσις τίθεται ὑπεράνω τῶν σωματικῶν κινήσεων, ἀλλὰ ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς ἐνεργείας της ἐπὶ τούτων μένει ἀνεπτυγμένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-03","text":"Ἡ θεία τελεολογία καὶ ἡ μηχανικὴ αἰτιότης συνδέονται ἱεραρχικῶς, ἀλλὰ ἡ γέφυρα μεταξὺ σκοποῦ καὶ κινήσεως δὲν ἀποδεικνύεται πλήρως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορά εἰς τὸν νοῦν δύναται νὰ ἐξηγῇ τὴν τάξιν, ἀλλὰ κινδυνεύει νὰ λειτουργήσῃ ὡς ῥητορικὴ γέφυρα ὅπου λείπει συγκεκριμένη αἰτιακὴ ἀνάλυσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-01","text":"Τὸ σῶμα μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ὄχημα ὑπηρετοῦν τὴν ψυχήν εἰς ἐνεργὸν μεσολαβητὴν, ὃς διαμορφοῖ τὸ περιεχόμενον τῆς ἐμπειρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὴ συγγένεια εἰς αἰτιακὴν δύναμιν, ἡ ὁποία μεταφέρει κινήσεις καὶ πάθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ πιθανὴν ἔσχατην ἐξήγησιν εἰς ὑποτεταγμένον συναίτιον, χωρὶς νὰ παύῃ νὰ παράγῃ πραγματικὰ ἀποτελέσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἀποκατάστασις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ φυσικὴν ἐπάνοδον εἰς παιδευτικὴν καὶ ἱεραρχικὴν ἀνασύνθεσιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:D6","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς πολυεπίπεδος μηχανὴ μεταδόσεως, ἐν ᾗ φῶς, πῦρ, σῶμα, ψυχὴ καὶ νοῦς συνδέονται διὰ ῥοῶν καὶ ἱεραρχιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος εἶναι κόμβος μεσολαβήσεως, ὃς δέχεται κινήσεις τοῦ κόσμου, μετασχηματίζει αὐτάς, καὶ ἐπιστρέφει εἰς αὐτὰς διὰ κρίσεως καὶ πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι ρυθμικὸς καὶ θεραπευτικός, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τάξις παράγεται διὰ κύκλων διαταραχῆς, καταστολῆς, ἐπανόδου καὶ παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐλευθερία συνίσταται οὐχὶ εἰς ἀπόλυτον αὐτονομίαν, ἀλλὰ εἰς ἐπανεκκαθίδρυσιν ἡγεμονίας ἐντὸς τῶν φυσικῶν καὶ σωματικῶν ὅρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B01","text":"Οἱ παρόντες ἀξονικοὶ ὅροι ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν θείαν σωματοποίησιν διὰ τῆς αἰσθητικῆς μεσολαβήσεως εἰς τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν αἰτιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ σύνθεσις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀναδραστικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ ὑποκαθορίζει τὴν συγκεκριμένην γέφυραν μεταξὺ νοερᾶς προθέσεως καὶ σωματικῆς μηχανικῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B03","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὅταν ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς σύνθεσις νοῦ, ἀνάγκης, σώματος καὶ ψυχικῆς ἀνατάξεως· ἀντιστέκεται δὲ εἰς πλήρη ἀξιωματικὴν μείωσιν ἐκεῖ ὅπου ἡ τελεολογία ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἀναλυτικὴν αἰτιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις διασώζει τὸ ἀληθινὸν πέρασμα ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνσώματον μεσολάβησιν εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν ἱεράρχησιν, ὑπολείπει δὲ τὴν λεπτομερεστέραν φυσιολογίαν τῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT8","CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232349945850Z_2f9e287c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 28–30","source_sha256":"21474a4b3d92ee0d160b9b795014a11509761b08d9fcb4689454ae494075082f","sha256":"8588e9e51e42f5e0c98284dd622c94943359e843be6008d8b42b939e38944ed4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:23:49.946750+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B01","text":"The system seeks to explain how embodied sensation can simultaneously convey cosmic reason and generate error.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B02","text":"Bodily form is reframed as a theologically ordered mechanism, not as formless matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B03","text":"Sensation is grounded in a dynamic continuity of internal and external powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B04","text":"Phenomena, such as inversions, demonstrate that vision discloses relations of contact and not things immediately.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B05","text":"Natural necessity remains necessary for explanation, but is subordinated to an intellectual and teleological principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B06","text":"The movement of the account ascends from anatomy to physiology, from physiology to sensation, and from sensation to cosmic causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B07","text":"Sensation functions as a circular channel through which the movements of the cosmos enter the body and return as judgments of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B08","text":"The conclusion is not a simple resolution, but a hierarchical synthesis of intellect, body, movement, and necessity, in which the bridge between intellectual intention and bodily mechanics remains partly indeterminate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The human being exists as a soul in a body, and neither soul nor body alone suffices for the explanation of the human.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Bodily arrangement bears a functional and teleological rationale, so that form serves specific movements and psychic functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The head as the ruling place is transformed into a model of hierarchical causality, in which bodily causes serve a superior principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Sensation is a dynamic conjunction of kindred powers, and not a passive reception of forms from without.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:A6","CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Likeness changes from static affinity into a conduit of movements, affections, and transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] A phenomenon is a relation produced from contact, light, smoothness, and movement, and not an unchanging copy of the thing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Bodily and visible causes are co-causes, but they do not constitute ultimate intellect or a final principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] A complete explanation of nature requires the conjunction of intellectual first causes and bodily secondary causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] The disturbance of psychic movements and the alteration of sensory relations constitute two forms of deviation from order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The entire system returns to hierarchical reordering, in which movement is subordinated to prudence, purpose, and rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-01","text":"The hierarchy of head and body recurs, but is displaced from bodily organization into a cosmic distinction between first and secondary causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-02","text":"Divine providence begins as the formation of the body, but ends as the architectural regulation of the entire causal field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-03","text":"Fire and affinity recur from the generation of vision to the production of images, but there they are transformed into conditions of possible error.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_27:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-04","text":"Movement is transformed from psychic disturbance into bodily transmission and then into mechanical necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A4","CH_JP8E_S_27:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-05","text":"The cessation of vision and the natural calming of the revolutions reveal that the absence of activity is regulation and not bare privation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-06","text":"Education, initially a condition of psychic perfection, becomes a more general paradigm for transforming natural restoration into conscious order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_25:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RMD-07","text":"The body persists as a vehicle, but ceases to be a passive bearer, because it becomes an active mediator between cosmos and soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-01","text":"The spherical form of the head, the function of the eyelids, and the four-limbed construction remain local explanations, not universal principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:A9","CH_JP8E_S_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-02","text":"The principle that is scaled is functional arrangement: each part is defined by its position, movement, and end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-03","text":"The active mediation of sensation bridges the chapters, because it connects anatomy, physiology, judgment, and cosmology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-04","text":"The theory of images abolishes the local supposition that the visible object appears without relation, and abolishes the simple correspondence of form and thing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-05","text":"The idea of sensation as certain reception is rendered useless and replaced by sensation as a chain of transmissions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:CGD-06","text":"The distinction between first and secondary causes abolishes dependence on a single explanatory level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-01","text":"The body is not formless matter, but an arrangement hierarchically ordered and directed toward function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-02","text":"Vision is not passive reception, but a conjunction of internal and external flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-03","text":"The phenomenon has no independent truth apart from relations of contact, light, movement, and arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-04","text":"Material necessity does not constitute a complete cosmogenic explanation, but only a co-cause of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:GNX-05","text":"Prudence does not arise automatically from natural quiet, but requires educational completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that embodied experience immediately offers truth, because experience passes through transmissions and formations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the visible or the bodily explains the intelligible without a superior principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that natural necessity and intellectual creation constitute competing and mutually exclusive explanations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that a return to natural order is equivalent to complete human perfection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that the absence of movement is a simple annulment, because it can function as active regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-01","text":"The system revolves around the impossibility of immediacy between cosmos and intellect; every access passes through bodily mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-02","text":"The absence of self-sufficient material intellection gives force to the search for a superior intellectual order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSA-03","text":"The human being as pure autonomy remains inconceivable, without natural, bodily, and educational arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-01","text":"Because the body is at once vehicle and channel of transmission, embodied existence does not constitute a simple subjection of the soul, but a mechanism for producing experience and disturbance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","CL_JP8E_10:GA-03","CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_25:A11","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-02","text":"The very sensory continuity that makes knowledge possible can convey confusion, because it transmits movements before the soul recovers its rule.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_26:D4","CH_JP8E_S_25:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-03","text":"The inversion of images demonstrates that apparent order is produced in the relation of the organ to the object, so that error is the result of a mechanism and not a simple absence of knowledge.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_27:D1","CH_JP8E_S_27:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-04","text":"The distinction of soul and body compels natural science likewise to distinguish between the mechanism of what occurs and the reason why it occurs.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:D5","CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-05","text":"Time, night, and sleep show that order is not a motionless state, but a rhythmic alternation of transmission, suppression, and return.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_26:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:XD-06","text":"Necessity acquires explanatory value only when it is integrated into a plan that does not abolish mechanics, but subordinates it.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-01","text":"Knowledge becomes a feedback process, in which the cosmos is transmitted through the body to the soul, and psychic order reinterprets bodily experience.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-01","CL_JP8E_10:GA-04","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-02","text":"Nature does not emerge as a closed mechanism, but as a hierarchical field in which necessity operates under intellectual and teleological supervision.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-03","text":"Error is transformed into a diagnostic sign: it discloses the mediation of the organ and requires analysis of the relations that produced it.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-05","CL_JP8E_10:GA-06","CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-04","text":"Teleology does not annul necessity, but transforms it into an instrument serving the realization of the possible good.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-07","CL_JP8E_10:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_27:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:BSD-05","text":"Health and truth are conceived as states of attainable reordering, not as given properties of the embodied being.","refs":["CL_JP8E_10:GA-09","CL_JP8E_10:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-01","text":"External light → internal fire → organ → body → soul; this chain returns as sensation, judgment, and possible confusion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-02","text":"Embodied connection → sensory impulsion → confusion → time and calming → education → recovery of rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-03","text":"Contact and likeness → image → inversion → recognition of the relation; the repetition of vision becomes a deepening into the mechanism of the phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-04","text":"Anatomy → physiology → sensation → phenomenon → causality; this scale extends local bodily description into cosmic hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:RLE-05","text":"Hierarchical reordering functions as an attractive pole: every disturbance refers upward to a higher level of explanation, without definitively abolishing the lower levels.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B01","text":"Divine providence → functional arrangement of the body → ruling head and organs of sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B02","text":"Internal power + external cosmos → affinity and contact → sensation as transmission of movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B03","text":"Change of contact → alteration of phenomenon → image, inversion, and relativization of vision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B04","text":"Visible bodies + lack of intellect → distinction of co-causes and first causes → dual explanation of nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B05","text":"Sensory disturbance → confusion of judgment → time, quiet, and education → reconstitution of ruling order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FGS-B06","text":"Hierarchical reordering → integration of necessity into an intellectual plan → cosmic order as a synthesis of movements and purposes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B09","text":"Embodied disorder → functional architecture of the body → dynamic sensation → relative phenomenon → distinction of first and secondary causes → restoration of rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_25:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:AFM-B10","text":"The movement of the system is not linear: the return to order repeats the original hierarchy, but now as an explained distinction of intellect, body, and necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_25:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-01","text":"The body is rewritten from a substrate of matter into a hierarchical network of organs, flows, and purposes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-02","text":"Sensation is rewritten from a bridge between internal and external into a mechanism of reciprocal transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-03","text":"The image and inversion become tools for analyzing relation, and not simple problems of copying.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-04","text":"Natural science is reconfigured as an inquiry into multiple causal orders, in which mechanics and teleology are coordinated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MME-05","text":"Health, prudence, and truth appear as forms of regulated movement, not as motionless givens.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME6","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the system explains limbs, organs, fire, light, images, inversions, and sleep.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, reality consists of hierarchies, contacts, flows, affinities, and transmissions of movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, inquiry must analyze the phenomenon according to its mediations and must not confuse a co-cause with a principal cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically, being is a network of likenesses and movements, but its ultimate order requires an intellectual principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_27:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B05","text":"Temporally, order is produced through cycles of activity, extinction, quiet, return, and educational completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:ALT-B06","text":"Methodologically, the form of the account imitates the hierarchy that it defends, proceeding from mechanism to purpose without abandoning mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-01","text":"Sensation is presented both as a condition of knowledge and as a source of impulsion; this contradiction is productive, because it compels the system to distinguish transmission and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_25:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-02","text":"Intellectual intention is posited above bodily movements, but the precise manner of its activity upon them remains undeveloped.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-03","text":"Divine teleology and mechanical causality are linked hierarchically, but the bridge between purpose and movement is not fully demonstrated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:FL-04","text":"Reference to intellect can explain order, but risks functioning as a rhetorical bridge where specific causal analysis is lacking.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-01","text":"The body mutates from a vehicle serving the soul into an active mediator that shapes the content of experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_26:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-02","text":"Likeness mutates from geometric affinity into causal power, which conveys movements and affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_26:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-03","text":"Necessity mutates from a possible ultimate explanation into a subordinate co-cause, without ceasing to produce real effects.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MP-04","text":"Restoration mutates from a natural return into an educational and hierarchical reconstitution of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:D6","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a multilayered mechanism of transmission, in which light, fire, body, soul, and intellect are connected through flows and hierarchies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_27:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-02","text":"The human being is a node of mediation, receiving movements of the cosmos, transforming them, and returning to them through judgment and action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_26:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-03","text":"Time is rhythmic and therapeutic, because order is produced through cycles of disturbance, suppression, return, and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:HSI-04","text":"Possible freedom consists not in absolute autonomy, but in the re-establishment of rule within natural and bodily conditions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:SNX5","CH_JP8E_S_25:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B01","text":"The present axial terms suffice for reconstructing the principal movement from divine embodiment through sensory mediation to hierarchical causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B02","text":"The synthesis preserves the feedback movement of the system, but underdetermines the specific bridge between intellectual intention and bodily mechanics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B03","text":"The system is coherent when recognized as a synthesis of intellect, necessity, body, and psychic reordering; but it resists complete axiomatic reduction where teleology replaces analytical causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_27:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_10:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the true passage from embodied mediation to cosmic hierarchization, but leaves out the more detailed physiology of transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_25:MRT8","CH_JP8E_S_26:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_10:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 28–30"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 28–30","context":"Section 44 · Section 45 · Section 46","original_title":"Chapters 28–30","original_context":"Section 44 · Section 45 · Section 46"},"original_title":"Chapters 28–30","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 31–33","order":11,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_28","CH_JP8E_S_29","CH_JP8E_S_30"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_11@R001","sha256":"e996edc45c418c44c979dc34167c70e0474b9b111b60326eb75477ffb73d033f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-01","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ παθητικὸν ὄργανον εἰς ἀρχὴν κοσμολογικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-02","text":"Ἡ παρατήρησις τῆς περιοδικότητος ἐγκαθιδρύει τὸν χρόνον ὡς ἀριθμητὴν τάξιν καὶ καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν φιλοσοφικήν ἀναζήτησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-03","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία δὲν τελειοῦται ἐν θεωρίᾳ, ἀλλὰ ἐπιστρέφει πρὸς τὴν διόρθωσιν τῆς πεπλανημένης διανοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀποδεικνύεται οὐχὶ ἁπλῆ ἀπουσία ἀταξίας, ἀλλὰ μορφὴ ἐπιβαλλομένη διὰ πειθοῦς ἐπὶ ἀντιστεκομένης ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-05","text":"Ἡ ἀναζήτησις τῆς κοσμικῆς ἀρχῆς ἀναγκάζει τὸ σύστημα νὰ ἀναγνωρίσῃ τρίτον γένος ὑποδοχῆς μεταξὺ παραδείγματος καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-06","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ τῶν στοιχείων διαλύει τὴν ἀφελῆ ταύτισιν ὀνόματος, πράγματος καὶ σταθερᾶς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-07","text":"Ὁ λόγος ἀπὸ ἀποδεικτικὸς γίνεται εἰκὼς, ἐπειδὴ τὰ ἀντικείμενα αὐτοῦ γεννῶνται καὶ μεταβάλλονται ἐντὸς ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-08","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἀπὸ τὸ αἰσθητὸν εἰς τὸ ἀριθμητόν, ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀριθμητοῦ εἰς τὸ αἰτιολογικόν, καὶ ἀπὸ τοῦ αἰτιολογικοῦ εἰς τὸ ἀσταθὲς ὑπόβαθρον τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἴσθησις δύναται νὰ γίνῃ ὁδὸς πρὸς ἀριθμητὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον πηγὴ πρακτικῆς ὠφελείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ περιοδικότης τῶν οὐρανίων κινήσεων παρέχει τὸ μέτρον δι᾿ οὗ ὁ χρόνος γίνεται νοητός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φιλοσοφία μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ζήτησιν περὶ τοῦ παντὸς εἰς μίμησιν τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μουσικὴ καὶ ὁ ῥυθμὸς ἔχουσιν παιδευτικὴν καὶ θεραπευτικὴν δύναμιν, ἐπειδὴ μετακοσμοῦσι τὰς ἐσωτερικὰς κινήσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ κοσμικὴ γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ συμπλοκὴν νοῦ, ἀνάγκης καὶ πλανωμένης αἰτίας, οὐχὶ ἕν μόνον αἴτιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ νοῦς κρατεῖ τῆς ἀνάγκης διὰ πειθοῦς, ὥστε ἡ τάξις νὰ σημαίνῃ μετασχηματισμὸν ἀντιστάσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπουσίαν ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ δυαδικὴ διάταξις παραδείγματος καὶ μιμήματος ἀποδεικνύεται ἀνεπαρκής, καὶ ἡ ὑποδοχὴ ἀναλαμβάνει τὸν τρίτον ὀντολογικὸν ρόλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ εἶναι ὁ ἀπρόσωπος τόπος ἐν ᾧ ἡ γένεσις δύναται νὰ λάβῃ χώραν, χωρὶς νὰ ταυτίζηται μὲ τὰ γιγνόμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὀντολογία τῶν φαινομένων μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ σταθερὰ πράγματα εἰς μεταβαλλομένους σχηματισμούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ ἀκριβὴς λόγος περὶ τῶν γιγνομένων ὑποχωρεῖ πρὸ τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μεταβολὴ ἀφαιρεῖ τὴν ἀσφάλειαν τῆς παγίας ὀνομασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀναλογία κοσμικῆς καὶ ψυχικῆς περιοδικότητος ἑλκύει ὅλα τὰ ἐπιμέρους πεδία πρὸς ἕνα σχέδιον ἀποκαταστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀβεβαιότης δὲν εἶναι ἐξωτερικὸ ἐλάττωμα τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀναγκαῖον ἀποτέλεσμα τῆς ἀσταθοῦς φύσεως τῶν φαινομένων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3","CL_JP8E_11:GA-07","CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","CL_JP8E_11:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ τάξις ἐπανέρχεται ἀρχικῶς ὡς οὐράνια περιοδικότης, κατόπιν ὡς ψυχικὴ ἀρμονία, καὶ τελικῶς ὡς μορφὴ ἐπιβαλλομένη ἐπὶ ἀντιστεκομένης ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ μίμησις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ παιδευτικὴν ἐπανάληψιν τῆς οὐρανίου τάξεως εἰς ὀντολογικὴν ἐξάρτησιν τοῦ φαινομένου ἀπὸ τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ «ἀνάγκη» ἀλλάσσει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ συμπληρωματικὸς ὅρος τῆς κοσμολογικῆς ἐξηγήσεως γίνεται ἀντιστεκόμενον πεδίον, ὃ ὁ νοῦς πείθει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A10","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ὀνομασία μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ «τοῦτο» εἰς τὸ «τοιοῦτο», ἐπειδὴ ἡ ταυτότης ἀκολουθεῖ τὸν τρόπον τοῦ γίγνεσθαι καὶ οὐχὶ πάγιον ὑπόστρωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ τριμεροῦς σχηματισμοῦ, ὅπου ἡ ὑποδοχὴ καθίσταται ὅρος τῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως ἀμφοτέρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἐμπιστοσύνη εἰς τὸ ἀριθμητὸν μέτρον δὲν ἐξαφανίζεται, ἀλλὰ περιορίζεται ὅταν τὸ ἀντικείμενον μεταπίπτῃ ἀπὸ σταθερὰ τάξιν εἰς ῥέουσαν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_30:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδειξις δὲν καταργεῖται ἁπλῶς, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται εἰς εἰκότα λόγον, ὅταν ἡ κοσμολογία ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὴν προκοσμικὴν καὶ ὑποδοχικὴν περιοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-01","text":"Τὸ ὅτι ἡ ὄψις καὶ ἡ ἀκοὴ ἔχουσι συγκεκριμένας ὠφελείας μένει τοπικὸν, ἐνῶ ἡ μετατροπὴ τῆς αἰσθήσεως εἰς κοσμολογικὸν μηχανισμὸν κλιμακοῦται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀστρονομικὴ παρατήρησις καὶ ἡ μουσικὴ θεραπεία εἶναι τοπικαὶ τεχνικαί, ἀλλὰ γεφυροῦνται ἐν τῷ παρόντι ἐπιπέδῳ ὡς δύο μορφαὶ ἀνατάξεως τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ ἀνάγκης ἀναβαθμίζεται ἀπὸ αἰτιολογικὴν διάκριση εἰς μηχανισμὸν κοσμικῆς συνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὰ τέσσαρα στοιχεῖα ὡς δεδομένας ἀρχὰς ὑπερβαίνεται καὶ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ προκοσμικοῦ πεδίου παθῶν καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ δυαδικὴ δομὴ παραδείγματος καὶ μιμήματος καταλύεται ὡς ἀνεπαρκής, ἀλλὰ διασώζεται ὡς βάση ἐπὶ τῆς ὁποίας ἐμφανίζεται ἡ ὑποδοχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀπορία περὶ τῆς ἀκριβοῦς σχέσεως ὑποδοχῆς καὶ παραδείγματος παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη καὶ γίνεται ὅρος τῆς συνολικῆς ἀβεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ αἴσθησις ἔχει μόνον πρακτικὴν ἢ ἡδονικὴν ἀξίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ κοσμολογία ἡ ὁποία ἀνάγει τὴν τάξιν εἰς ἕν μόνον αἴτιον καὶ ἐξαλείφει τὴν ἀντίστασιν τῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὰ στοιχεῖα εἶναι αὐτοθεμελίωτοι καὶ ἀμετάβλητοι φορεῖς οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις τῆς ὀνομασίας μὲ τὴν κατοχὴν τοῦ ὄντος, ὅταν τὸ φαινόμενον συνεχῶς συντίθεται καὶ διαλύεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπαίτησις ἀπολύτου ἀποδείξεως ὡς μοναδικοῦ κριτηρίου ἀληθείας περὶ τῶν ἀρχῶν καὶ τῶν γιγνομένων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ὅπου ἡ τάξις ὑφίσταται χωρὶς ἀταξίαν, ἀντίστασιν ἢ ὑλικόν πεδίον ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται γνώσις ἥτις ἀναπτύσσεται ἐντελῶς αὐτοτελῶς, ἄνευ αἰσθητῶν προτύπων καὶ ἄνευ μετασχηματισμοῦ τοῦ γνωρίζοντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὀντολογία ἥτις θεωρεῖ τὸ γιγνόμενον αὐτοτελὲς καὶ ἀποκεκομμένον ἀπὸ τὴν ὑποδοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος βεβαιότης ἐκεῖ ὅπου ἡ ἴδια ἡ γένεσις παράγει μεταβαλλομένα ἀντικείμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα κυκλοῖ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν πλήρους ἐποπτείας τῆς ἀπολύτου ἀρχῆς, ἥτις μένει ἀναγκαία ἀλλὰ μὴ πλήρως δηλώσιμη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπρόσωπος ὑποδοχὴ εἶναι ἡ κρυφὴ προϋπόθεσις ἥτις καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν ἐνσάρκωσιν τῆς τάξεως, χωρὶς νὰ ἀναχθῇ εἰς φαινόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ὀριστικῆς ἑνώσεως ὀνόματος, πράγματος καὶ μεταβαλλομένου ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀβεβαιότης εἶναι ὁ βαθύτερος ὅρος τοῦ συστήματος, διότι ἡ ἀναζήτησις τῆς ἀρχῆς ἀποκαλύπτει πάντοτε ἕτερον πεδίον ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-01","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ κοσμολογία συνδέονται ὡς δύο βαθμίδες ἑνὸς μετασχηματισμοῦ, ἐν ᾧ τὸ φαινόμενον γίνεται μέτρον καὶ ἡ τάξις γίνεται παιδεία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D3","CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2","CL_JP8E_11:GA-01","CL_JP8E_11:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-02","text":"Ἡ μίμησις τῆς οὐρανίου περιοδικότητος ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς πειθὴ τοῦ νοῦ ἐπὶ τῆς ἀνάγκης, ὥστε ἡ ψυχικὴ καὶ ἡ κοσμικὴ διόρθωσις νὰ ἔχωσιν ὅμοιον μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CL_JP8E_11:GA-06","CL_JP8E_11:GA-11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-03","text":"Ἡ προκοσμικὴ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ ὑποδοχὴ ἀποκαλύπτουν ὅτι ἡ τάξις δὲν ἐφαρμόζεται ἐπὶ κενοῦ, ἀλλὰ ἐπὶ πεδίου ἤδη ἔχοντος πάθη καὶ ἀντιστάσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:D3","CH_JP8E_S_30:A4","CL_JP8E_11:GA-05","CL_JP8E_11:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀστάθεια τῶν στοιχείων περιορίζει ὄχι μόνον τὴν ὀντολογικὴν ἀπόφανσιν, ἀλλὰ καὶ τὴν ἐπιστημονικὴν ἀξίωσιν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ λόγος ἀκολουθεῖ γένεσιν ἣν δὲν δύναται νὰ καθηλώσῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_29:ME4","CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","CL_JP8E_11:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-05","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὸ ἀριθμητὸν μέτρον εἰς τὸ εἰκὸς ἀποδεικνύει ὅτι ἡ γνωστικὴ ἀκρίβεια δὲν ἔχει μίαν μόνον μορφήν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται κατὰ τὴν σταθερότητα τοῦ ἀντικειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_29:D5","CL_JP8E_11:GA-02","CL_JP8E_11:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχία μετασχηματισμῶν, ὅπου τὸ αἰσθητὸν γίνεται ἀριθμητόν, τὸ ἀριθμητὸν νοητόν, καὶ τὸ νοητὸν μορφοποιεῖ ἀντιστεκόμενον γίγνεσθαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_29:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις δὲν εἶναι ἕτοιμος νόμος ἀλλὰ ἐπιτυχὴς ἔκβασις ἐνὸς ἀγῶνος μεταξὺ μορφῆς, ἀνάγκης καὶ ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη γίνεται ἀκριβέστερα ὅταν παραιτεῖται ἀπὸ τὴν ψευδῆ ἀπόλυτον βεβαιότητα καὶ ὁρίζει τὸ εἰκὸς κατὰ τὴν φύσιν τοῦ ἀντικειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_30:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ γλῶσσα δὲν λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀποθήκη παγίων οὐσιῶν, ἀλλὰ ὡς ἐπιτήρησις τρόπων μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ καὶ ὁ κόσμος ἀναγνωρίζονται ὡς ἀλληλοσυνδεόμενα πεδία περιοδικότητος, ὥστε ἡ κοσμολογία νὰ ἔχῃ ἀναγκαστικῶς ἠθικὸν καὶ παιδευτικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_28:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-01","text":"Ὄψις → οὐράνια περιοδικότης → ἀριθμὸς → χρόνος → φιλοσοφία → διόρθωσις τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ διορθωμένη διάνοια ἐπιστρέφει πρὸς τὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν καὶ ἐπιχειρεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ ὄχι μόνον τὸ νοητὸν ἀλλὰ καὶ τὸ ἀναγκαῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-03","text":"Νοῦς → πειθὼ → ἀνάγκη → μεικτὴ γένεσις → ἀναδρομὴ εἰς τὸ προκοσμικόν → ἀνάγκη τρίτου γένους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-04","text":"Παράδειγμα καὶ μίμημα → ἀνεπάρκεια δυαδικοῦ σχήματος → ὑποδοχή → κυκλικὴ μεταβολὴ → ἀστάθεια ταυτότητος → εἰκὼς λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ εἶναι ὁ τελικὸς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος, διότι ἀναγκάζει τὸ σύστημα νὰ συνδέσῃ γένεσιν, μεταβολήν, γλῶσσαν καὶ γνωστικὴν ἀβεβαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B01","text":"Αἴσθησις → παρατήρησις περιοδικότητος → ἀριθμητὴ τάξις → ἔννοια χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B02","text":"Ἀριθμητὴ τάξις → φιλοσοφία → μίμησις κοσμικῆς περιφορᾶς → ἐσωτερικὴ ἁρμονία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B03","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ τάξις → ἐρώτησις περὶ τῆς κοσμικῆς γενέσεως → νοῦς καὶ ἀνάγκη → προκοσμικὴ ἀταξία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B04","text":"Προκοσμικὴ ἀταξία → ἀναίρεσις αὐτοθεμελιώτων στοιχείων → τρίτον γένος ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B05","text":"Ὑποδοχὴ → κυκλικὴ μεταβολὴ → ἀστάθεια ὀνομάτων → εἰκὼς λόγος → ἀποδοχὴ δομικῆς ἀβεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀναταξινόμησις τῆς αἰσθήσεως → ἀριθμητικὴ σύλληψις τοῦ χρόνου → φιλοσοφικὴ καὶ ψυχικὴ διόρθωσις → μεικτὴ κοσμικὴ αἰτιολογία → προκοσμικὴ ἀνάγκη → τρίτον γένος ὑποδοχῆς → κυκλικὴ μεταβολὴ → ὀντολογικὴ καὶ γλωσσικὴ ἀβεβαιότης → εἰκὼς λόγος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-01","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀρχὴ κοσμολογικῆς καὶ παιδευτικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἄμορφον ῥοὴν εἰς μετρήσιμον περιοδικότητα, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκρίβεια αὕτη δὲν ἐπεκτείνεται ἀδιακρίτως εἰς τὰ γιγνόμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-03","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν τοῦ οὐρανοῦ εἰς τὴν προϊστορίαν τοῦ ὑλικοῦ καὶ παθητικοῦ πεδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογικὴ χαρτογράφησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ δυαδικὸν εἰς τριμερὲς σχῆμα παραδείγματος, μιμήματος καὶ ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-05","text":"Ἡ γλωσσικὴ ἀκρίβεια ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται ὡς πιστὴ παρακολούθησις μεταβολῶν καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς κατοχὴ παγίων ὀνομάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ὄψις, ἀκοή, οὐράνια σώματα, στοιχεῖα καὶ ὀνόματα ἀποτελοῦσι τὰ ρητὰ ἀντικείμενα τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, αἱ αἰσθήσεις, αἱ τέχναι, ὁ νοῦς, ἡ ἀνάγκη καὶ ἡ ὑποδοχὴ λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς ἀλληλοσυνδεόμενα πεδία μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ὁ λόγος ὀφείλει νὰ μετατρέπῃ τὴν παρατήρησιν εἰς μίμησιν, τὴν μίμησιν εἰς διάγνωσιν ἀντιστάσεως, καὶ τὴν διάγνωσιν εἰς εἰκότα ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ ὂν συγκροτεῖται ἐκ νοῦ, περιοδικότητος, ἀνάγκης καὶ ὑποδοχῆς, ἐνῶ ὁ χρόνος παραμένει ἀριθμητὴ κίνησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐκτελεῖ τὴν ἀρχήν του, ἐπειδὴ ἀπὸ βεβαιότητα ἐπιστρέφει εἰς εἰκόνα καὶ ἀναγνωρίζει τὰ ὅρια τῆς ἀποφαντικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-01","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἀριθμητῶς νοητή, ἀλλὰ ἡ προϋπόθεσις τῆς ἀνάγκης εἰσάγει ἀντίστασιν ἣν ὁ ἀριθμὸς δὲν ἐξαντλεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ εἶναι ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν ἐξήγησιν τῆς γενέσεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀκριβὴς φύσις αὐτῆς μένει ἀπρόσωπος καὶ ὑποκαθορισμένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-03","text":"Ὁ λόγος ζητεῖ ὀνόματα διὰ τὰ στοιχεῖα, ἀλλὰ ἡ κυκλικὴ μεταβολὴ ἀναιρεῖ τὴν προϋπόθεσιν σταθερότητος ἣν ἀπαιτεῖ ἡ ὀνομασία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη περιορίζει τὴν ἀξίωσίν της εἰς εἰκότα λόγον, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως διατηρεῖ ἱσχυρὰς ἀξιώσεις περὶ τῆς δομῆς τῶν ἀρχῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-01","text":"Ἡ «τάξις» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἕτοιμον κοσμικὸν πρότυπον εἰς ἐνεργὸν πειθὼν ἐπὶ ἀντιστεκομένου ὑλικοῦ πεδίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-02","text":"Ἡ «οὐσία» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μόνιμον ὑπόστασιν εἰς προσωρινὸν σχηματισμὸν, ὃς ὀνομάζεται κατὰ τὸ τοιοῦτον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-03","text":"Ὁ «λόγος» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀπόδειξιν ἀρχῶν εἰς ἐπιεικῆ παρακολούθησιν γένεσης ἣν δὲν δύναται νὰ ἀκινητοποιήσῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος νοεῖται ὡς μηχανὴ μετασχηματισμοῦ, ἐν ᾗ μορφὴ καὶ ἀνάγκη συμπλέκονται ἐντὸς ἀπροσώπου ὑποδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ νοῦς δὲν εἶναι ἀπόλυτος δεσπότης, ἀλλὰ τεχνίτης πειθοῦς ὁ ὁποῖος ἐργάζεται ἐπὶ ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη ψυχὴ γίνεται μικρογραφία τῆς κοσμικῆς μηχανῆς, ἥτις δύναται νὰ ἀνατάξῃ τὰς ἰδίας περιφορὰς διὰ μιμήσεως καὶ ἁρμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι σπειροειδὴς κίνησις ἐπαναλήψεως καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ, ἐνῶ ἡ διαφυγὴ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀταξίαν συνίσταται εἰς μίμησιν καὶ οὐχὶ εἰς ἀκύρωσιν τῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν περιοδικότητα εἰς τὴν τριμερῆ ὀντολογίαν καὶ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐφ’ ὅσον διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀκολουθίαν αἰσθητόν, ἀριθμητόν, νοητόν, μετασχηματιστικόν καὶ ὑποδοχικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος μεταδόσεως τῆς οὐρανίου ὀρθότητος εἰς τὴν διάνοιαν καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις τῆς ὑποδοχῆς πρὸς τὸ παράδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἰσχύς ἔγκειται στὴν ἀλληλουχία μετασχηματισμῶν καὶ στὴν ἀποκάλυψιν τῆς ἀβεβαιότητος ὡς δομικοῦ ὅρου, ἐνῶ ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους ἐξηγήσεως τῆς ὑποδοχῆς παραμένει ἀντιστάσεως σημείον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232417056029Z_bcfaed6e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 31–33","source_sha256":"e996edc45c418c44c979dc34167c70e0474b9b111b60326eb75477ffb73d033f","sha256":"030761e7e5ca13f2e4d17baa2b68026c70af4ff65e6fec27b5a18391c6c8865c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:24:17.059129+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-01","text":"Sensation is transformed from a passive instrument into a principle of cosmological knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-02","text":"The observation of periodicity establishes time as a numerical order and makes philosophical inquiry possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-03","text":"Philosophy is not completed in contemplation, but returns to the correction of misguided understanding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-04","text":"Cosmic order is shown to be not a mere absence of disorder, but a form imposed through persuasion upon resistant necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-05","text":"The inquiry into the cosmic principle compels the system to recognize a third kind of receptacle between paradigm and becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-06","text":"The transformation of the elements dissolves the naïve identification of name, thing, and stable substance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-07","text":"Discourse changes from demonstrative to likely, because its objects come to be and change within a receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:SP-08","text":"The overall movement is spiral: from the sensible to the numerable, from the numerable to the causal, and from the causal to the unstable substrate of becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Sensation can become a path toward numerable cosmic order and not merely a source of practical benefit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The periodicity of celestial motions provides the measure through which time becomes intelligible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Philosophy moves from inquiry concerning the whole to imitation of cosmic order in the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Music and rhythm possess an educational and therapeutic power, because they reorder internal motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Cosmic becoming requires an interweaving of intellect, necessity, and wandering cause, not one cause alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Intellect prevails over necessity through persuasion, so that order signifies the transformation of resistance and not the absence of resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] The dual arrangement of paradigm and imitation proves inadequate, and the receptacle assumes the third ontological role.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] The receptacle is the impersonal place in which becoming can take place, without being identified with the things that come to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] The ontology of phenomena moves from stable things to changing formations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Exact discourse concerning things that come to be yields to likely discourse, because change removes the security of fixed naming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] The analogy of cosmic and psychic periodicity draws all particular domains toward one plan of restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Uncertainty is not an external defect of discourse, but a necessary consequence of the unstable nature of phenomena.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3","CL_JP8E_11:GA-07","CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","CL_JP8E_11:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-01","text":"Order recurs first as celestial periodicity, then as psychic harmony, and finally as form imposed upon resistant necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-02","text":"Imitation shifts from the educational repetition of celestial order to the ontological dependence of the phenomenon upon the paradigm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-03","text":"“Necessity” changes function: from a supplementary term of cosmological explanation, it becomes a resistant field that intellect persuades.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A10","CH_JP8E_S_29:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-04","text":"Naming moves from “this” to “such,” because identity follows the mode of becoming and not a fixed substrate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:A8","CH_JP8E_S_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-05","text":"The distinction between intellect and necessity is absorbed by a tripartite formation, in which the receptacle becomes the condition for the activation of both.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-06","text":"The initial confidence in numerable measure does not disappear, but is restricted when the object shifts from stable order to flowing becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_30:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RMD-07","text":"Demonstration is not simply abolished, but transformed into likely discourse when cosmology extends into the precosmic and receptive domain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-01","text":"That sight and hearing possess specific benefits remains local, whereas the transformation of sensation into a cosmological mechanism is scaled up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-02","text":"Astronomical observation and musical therapy are local techniques, but at the present level they are bridged as two forms of restoring the soul to order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-03","text":"The initial distinction between intellect and necessity is elevated from a causal distinction into a mechanism of cosmic composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-04","text":"The reference to the four elements as given principles is surpassed and replaced by a precosmic field of affections and changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-05","text":"The dual structure of paradigm and imitation is dissolved as inadequate, but preserved as the basis upon which the receptacle appears.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:CGD-06","text":"The local aporia concerning the exact relation of receptacle and paradigm remains underdetermined and becomes a condition of overall uncertainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-01","text":"The idea that sensation has only practical or pleasurable value is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-02","text":"A cosmology that reduces order to one cause alone and eliminates the resistance of necessity is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-03","text":"The hypothesis that the elements are self-grounded and unchanging bearers of substance is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-04","text":"The identification of naming with possession of being is rejected when the phenomenon is continually composed and dissolved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:GNX-05","text":"The demand for absolute demonstration as the sole criterion of truth concerning principles and things that come to be is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-01","text":"A world in which order exists without disorder, resistance, or a material field of receptivity is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-02","text":"Knowledge that develops entirely autonomously, without sensible models and without transformation of the knower, is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-03","text":"An ontology that regards what comes to be as self-sufficient and severed from the receptacle is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:DBN-04","text":"Absolute certainty is excluded where becoming itself produces changing objects.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-01","text":"The system circles around the impossibility of a complete overview of the absolute principle, which remains necessary but not fully expressible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-02","text":"The impersonal receptacle is the hidden presupposition that makes the embodiment of order possible, without being reduced to a phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-03","text":"The possibility of a definitive union of name, thing, and changing subject is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSA-04","text":"Uncertainty is the deepest condition of the system, because the inquiry into the principle always reveals another field of receptivity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-01","text":"Sensation and cosmology are connected as two stages of one transformation, in which the phenomenon becomes measure and order becomes education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:D3","CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2","CL_JP8E_11:GA-01","CL_JP8E_11:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-02","text":"The imitation of celestial periodicity is repeated as the persuasion of necessity by intellect, so that psychic and cosmic correction have a similar mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A6","CH_JP8E_S_29:A2","CL_JP8E_11:GA-06","CL_JP8E_11:GA-11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-03","text":"Precosmic necessity and the receptacle reveal that order is not applied to a void, but to a field already possessing affections and resistances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:D3","CH_JP8E_S_30:A4","CL_JP8E_11:GA-05","CL_JP8E_11:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-04","text":"The instability of the elements limits not only ontological assertion but also scientific claim, because discourse follows a becoming that it cannot immobilize.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_29:ME4","CL_JP8E_11:GA-09","CL_JP8E_11:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:XD-05","text":"The transition from numerable measure to the likely shows that cognitive precision has not only one form, but changes according to the stability of the object.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_29:D5","CL_JP8E_11:GA-02","CL_JP8E_11:GA-12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-01","text":"Reality is constituted as a hierarchy of transformations, in which the sensible becomes numerable, the numerable intelligible, and the intelligible gives form to resistant becoming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_29:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-02","text":"Cosmic order is not a ready-made law but the successful outcome of a struggle among form, necessity, and receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_30:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-03","text":"Science becomes more precise when it renounces false absolute certainty and determines the likely according to the nature of the object.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_30:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-04","text":"Language functions not as a repository of fixed substances, but as a monitoring of modes of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:BSD-05","text":"Soul and cosmos are recognized as interconnected fields of periodicity, so that cosmology necessarily has an ethical and educational consequence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_28:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-01","text":"Sight → celestial periodicity → number → time → philosophy → correction of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-02","text":"Corrected understanding returns to cosmic order and attempts to explain not only the intelligible but also the necessary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-03","text":"Intellect → persuasion → necessity → mixed becoming → regression to the precosmic → necessity of a third kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-04","text":"Paradigm and imitation → inadequacy of the dual schema → receptacle → cyclic change → instability of identity → likely discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:RLE-05","text":"The receptacle is the final attractive pole, because it compels the system to connect becoming, change, language, and cognitive uncertainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B01","text":"Sensation → observation of periodicity → numerable order → concept of time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B02","text":"Numerable order → philosophy → imitation of cosmic revolution → inner harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B03","text":"Inner order → question concerning cosmic generation → intellect and necessity → precosmic disorder.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B04","text":"Precosmic disorder → refutation of self-grounded elements → third kind of receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FGS-B05","text":"Receptacle → cyclic change → instability of names → likely discourse → acceptance of structural uncertainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:AFM-B01","text":"Reclassification of sensation → numerical apprehension of time → philosophical and psychic correction → mixed cosmic causality → precosmic necessity → third kind of receptacle → cyclic change → ontological and linguistic uncertainty → likely discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-01","text":"Sensation is reclassified as a principle of cosmological and educational activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-02","text":"Time moves from formless flow to measurable periodicity, but this precision does not extend indiscriminately to things that come to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-03","text":"Cosmology extends from the generation of the heaven to the prehistory of the material and affective field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-04","text":"Ontological mapping moves from a dual to a tripartite schema of paradigm, imitation, and receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MME-05","text":"Linguistic precision is redefined as faithful tracking of changes and not as possession of fixed names.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, sight, hearing, celestial bodies, elements, and names constitute the explicit objects of discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, the senses, arts, intellect, necessity, and receptacle function as interconnected fields of mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, discourse must transform observation into imitation, imitation into a diagnosis of resistance, and diagnosis into a likely explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, being is constituted from intellect, periodicity, necessity, and receptacle, while time remains numerable motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, the form of discourse enacts its principle, because it returns from certainty to image and recognizes the limits of assertoricity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-01","text":"Cosmic order is presented as numerically intelligible, but the presupposition of necessity introduces a resistance that number does not exhaust.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:A2","CH_JP8E_S_29:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-02","text":"The receptacle is necessary for the explanation of becoming, but its exact nature remains impersonal and underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-03","text":"Discourse seeks names for the elements, but cyclic change negates the presupposition of stability that naming requires.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:FL-04","text":"Science restricts its claim to likely discourse, but simultaneously retains strong claims concerning the structure of principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-01","text":"“Order” changes from a ready-made cosmic model into active persuasion acting upon a resistant material field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-02","text":"“Substance” changes from permanent subsistence into a temporary formation, which is named according to its suchness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MP-03","text":"“Discourse” changes from demonstration of principles into equitable tracking of a becoming that it cannot immobilize.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-01","text":"The cosmos is conceived as a machine of transformation, in which form and necessity are interwoven within an impersonal receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-02","text":"Intellect is not an absolute master, but an artisan of persuasion who works upon resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_29:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-03","text":"The human soul becomes a miniature of the cosmic machine, capable of restoring its own revolutions to order through imitation and harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:HSI-04","text":"Time is a spiral motion of repetition and transformation, while escape from disorder consists in imitation and not in the annulment of necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B01","text":"The principles suffice for reconstructing the transition from sensation and periodicity to tripartite ontology and likely discourse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction is coherent insofar as it preserves the sequence sensible, numerable, intelligible, transformative, and receptive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B03","text":"The exact mode by which celestial correctness is transmitted into understanding, and the exact relation of the receptacle to the paradigm, are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_28:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_11:MRT-B04","text":"The architectural strength lies in the sequence of transformations and in the disclosure of uncertainty as a structural condition, while the inability fully to explain the receptacle remains a point of resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_30:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_11:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 31–33"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 31–33","context":"Section 47 · Section 48 · Section 49","original_title":"Chapters 31–33","original_context":"Section 47 · Section 48 · Section 49"},"original_title":"Chapters 31–33","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 34–36","order":12,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SEC5","CH_JP8E_S_31","CH_JP8E_S_32"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_12@R001","sha256":"50bb3dbe8e909d944563cb5147890e532bf36be37393121d011af54373fa4727","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ πῶς τὸ μεταβαλλόμενον δύναται νὰ φαίνηται ἐν κόσμῳ ὅπου ἡ ὀντολογικὴ σταθερότης δὲν συμπίπτει μὲ τὰ φαινόμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-02","text":"Ἡ πρώτη ἀναπλαισίωσις διακρίνει τὸ γιγνόμενον, τὸ ὑποδεχόμενον καὶ τὸ ἀμετάβλητον πρότυπον, ὥστε ἡ γένεσις νὰ μὴ συγχέηται μὲ αὐτοτελῆ μεταβολὴν οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-03","text":"Ἡ χώρα ἀναφαίνεται ὡς τρίτον γένος, ἀναγκαῖον διὰ πᾶσαν φανέρωσιν, ἀλλὰ ἀδύνατον νὰ ὁρισθῇ διὰ ἰδίου εἴδους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ἀποφατικὴ ἀφαίρεσις τῶν στοιχείων, τῶν ποιοτήτων καὶ τῶν σχημάτων μετατρέπει τὴν ὑποδοχὴν ἀπὸ κρυπτὸν ὑπόβαθρον εἰς ὅρον δυνατότητος τῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογικὴ διαίρεσις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς ἐπεκτείνει τὴν κοσμολογικὴν διάκρισιν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ τρόπος γνώσεως ἀποκαλύπτει διαφοράν τρόπων τοῦ εἶναι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ κίνησις δὲν εἶναι γραμμική, ἀλλὰ σπειροειδής: ἡ φαινομένη μεταβολὴ ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὴν ἀναζήτησιν ὑποβάθρου, καὶ τὸ ὑπόβαθρον ἐπανεισάγει τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀποφατικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-07","text":"Ἡ σύγκλεισις εἶναι λειτουργική, οὐχὶ ἀπόλυτος· τὸ σύστημα ἀποκαθιστᾷ τὴν τριμερῆ δομήν, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖ τὴν χώραν ὡς ἀσαφὲς καὶ ἀποφατικῶς προσπελάσιμον θεμέλιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ γιγνόμενον εἶναι αἰσθητὸν, γεννητόν, κινητὸν καὶ φθαρτόν, ἄρα οὐ δύναται νὰ φέρῃ μόνο του τὸ μέτρον τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ εἶδος ἢ τὸ ὄν ὑφίσταται ἀγεννήτως καὶ ἀμεταβλήτως, ὡς ἕτερον γένος παρὰ τὸ γιγνόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ χώρα ἢ ὑποδοχὴ εἶναι τρίτον γένος, ὃ παρέχει ἕδραν τοῖς γιγνομένοις χωρὶς νὰ ταυτίζηται μὲ αὐτά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ χώρα ἀρχικῶς νοεῖται ὡς ἀπαθὴς δεκτικότης, ἀλλὰ ἐν τῇ δυναμικῇ περιγραφῇ ἐμφανίζεται ὡς πεδίον ὅπου αἱ ἀνίσοι δυνάμεις προκαλοῦσιν ἀμοιβαίαν κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ καθολικὴ δεκτικότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἀπουσίαν ἰδίου εἴδους, ἵνα τὸ δεχόμενον μὴ παραμορφώνῃ τὰ εἰσιόντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πραγματικότης δὲν εἶναι δυαδικὴ ἀντίθεσις νοητοῦ καὶ αἰσθητοῦ, ἀλλὰ τριμερὴς διάταξις εἴδους, χώρας καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φαινομένη ἀλλοίωσις ἀρχικῶς ἀποδίδεται εἰς τὴν εἴσοδον καὶ ἔξοδον μιμημάτων, ἀλλὰ τελικῶς ἐρμηνεύεται καὶ ὡς ἀμοιβαία κίνησις χώρας καὶ ἐνυπάρχουσων δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ χώρα δὲν γνωρίζεται διὰ αἰσθήσεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ δυσχεροῦς λογισμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἔλλειψις ἰδίας μορφῆς ἀφαιρεῖ τὸ συνήθως ὁρατὸ κριτήριον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς μεταφέρει τὴν τριμερῆ ὀντολογία εἰς τὸ πεδίον τῆς γνώσεως, ὅπου ἡ ἀκινησία τοῦ λόγου διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν μεταπειστότητα τῆς πειθοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους ἀποτελεῖ τὸ κρυφὸν θεμέλιον τῆς πολλαπλῆς δεκτικότητος καὶ τῆς ἀκριβοῦς ἐκτυπώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Οὐδὲν φαινόμενον σχῆμα ἢ αἰσθητὴ ποιότης δύναται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ τὴν ταυτότητα τοῦ ὑποκειμένου ἢ τὴν ἀρχὴν τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ διάκρισις τοῦ εἶναι, τοῦ γίγνεσθαι καὶ τοῦ ἐν ᾧ τὸ γίγνεσθαι συντελεῖται ἐμποδίζει πάσαν ὀντολογίαν συγχύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ὑποδοχὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς «χώρα», «δεκτικόν» καὶ «ἕδρα», ἀλλὰ ἡ λειτουργία της μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀδρανὲς δοχεῖον εἰς δυναμικὸν πεδίον κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀμορφία διατηρεῖ τὴν ταυτότητα τῆς, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει σημασίαν: ἀρχικῶς σημαίνει ἀπουσίαν ἰδίου χαρακτῆρος, ὕστερον σημαίνει ὅρον ἀκριβοῦς ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ φαινομένη μεταβολὴ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν ἐναλλαγὴν εἰσόδων καὶ ἐξόδων εἰς ἀσταθῆ ἀμοιβαιότητα δυνάμεων, ὅπου ἡ χώρα καὶ τὰ ἐν αὐτῇ ἀλληλοκινοῦνται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μιμήματος καὶ προτύπου ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἐν τῇ κοσμολογίᾳ καὶ ἐν τῇ γνωσιολογίᾳ, ὅπου ἡ ὀρθὴ δόξα ὑπολείπεται τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ χώρα μεταναστεύει ἀπὸ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὑλικοῦ στοιχείου εἰς τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ὅρου δυνατότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ δυαδικὴ διάταξις μορφῆς καὶ ὕλης ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ τῆς τριμεροῦς σχέσεως προτύπου, χώρας καὶ ἐκτυπώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀναλογία τοῦ χρυσοῦ καὶ τῶν σχημάτων ἐπιτελεῖ τὸ ἔργον τῆς ἀποσυνδέσεως ὑποκειμένου καὶ παθήματος, ἔπειτα δὲ ἀποσύρεται ὅταν ἡ χώρα γίνῃ καθολικὸς ὅρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-01","text":"Τὰ παραδείγματα χρυσοῦ, ἀλείμματος καὶ μαλακοῦ ὑλικοῦ μένουσι τοπικὰ ὡς ἐπεξηγηματικὰ μέσα· τὸ διαβαθμιζόμενον εἰς τὸν παρόντα ὅρον εἶναι ἡ ἀνεξαρτησία τοῦ ὑποκειμένου ἀπὸ τὰ πάθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπλή ἀπαίτησις κοινῆς ὑποδοχῆς κλιμακοῦται εἰς τὴν τριμερή ἀρχιτεκτονικὴν εἴδους, χώρας καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἄρνησις ὅτι ἡ χώρα εἶναι στοιχεῖον γίνεται γέφυρα μεταξὺ κοσμολογίας καὶ ὀντολογίας, διότι ἀνακατατάσσει τὸ ὑλικόν ὡς δεκτικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς δὲν ἀποτελεῖ τοπικὴν θεωρίαν γνώσεως, ἀλλὰ καταλύει τὴν ὑπόληψιν ὅτι ἡ κοινὴ ὀρθὴ δόξα ἰσοδυναμεῖ μὲ ἐπιστήμην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ εἰκόνα τῆς χώρας ὡς ἀμεταβλήτου δεκτικότητος recodificetur ὡς χώρα ὑποκειμένη μὲν ταῖς κινήσεσιν, μὴ προσλαμβάνουσα δὲ ἴδιον εἶδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-06","text":"Ὑπερβαίνει τὴν τοπικὴν ἐξήγησιν ἡ ἀνάγκη νὰ διατηρηθοῦν συγχρόνως ἡ πραγματικότης τῆς χώρας καὶ ἡ ἀδυναμία θετικοῦ ὁρισμοῦ της.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ μεταβαλλομένου μὲ τὸ ἀμετάβλητον ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς χώρας εἰς στοιχεῖον, ποιότητα, σχῆμα ἢ ὁρατὴν ὑπόστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὰ αἰσθητὰ ἔχουσιν αὐτοτελῆ καὶ πλήρη οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ ἀλήθεια ταυτίζεται ἢ μὲ τὴν αἴσθησιν ἢ μὲ τὴν ὀρθὴν πειθώ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς γενέσεως εἰς ἓν μόνον γένος ἢ εἰς μίαν μόνην αἰτίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-06","text":"Ἡ ἀποφατικὴ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ ἀποκλείει τὴν αὐτόνομην ὕλην ὡς παραγωγὸν ἰδίας μορφῆς, χωρὶς νὰ ἀρνεῖται τὴν ἀναγκαιότητα τῆς ὑλικῆς δεκτικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-01","text":"Ἐὰν τὸ φαινόμενον ἦν αὐτοτελὲς ὄν, ἡ διάκρισις προτύπου, ὑποδοχῆς καὶ εἰκόνος θὰ κατέρρεεν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-02","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ χώρα εἶχεν ἴδιον εἶδος, ἡ καθολικὴ δεκτικότης καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἐκτύπωσις θὰ ἦσαν ἀδύνατοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-03","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ γένεσις ἦν ἁπλὴ μετάπτωσις στοιχείων, τὸ τρίτον γένος τῆς χώρας θὰ ἦτο περιττόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-04","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ κοινὴ δόξα ἦν ἐπιστήμη, ἡ ἱεράρχησις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς θὰ ἀνῃρεῖτο.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-05","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ χωρικὴ παρουσία ἦν τὸ μέτρον τοῦ εἶναι, τὸ νοητὸν καὶ ἡ χώρα θὰ ἐξομοιοῦντο ἀδίκως πρὸς τὰ αἰσθητά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα κυκλοφορεῖ περὶ τῆς ἀδυναμίας νὰ ὀνομάσῃ θετικῶς τὸ ὑπόβαθρον, ἐπειδὴ κάθε θετικὸν εἶδος θὰ περιώριζε τὴν καθολικότητα του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους εἶναι ἡ ἀφανὴς δυνατότης ὅλων τῶν ἐμφανίσεων, ἀλλὰ δὲν μετατρέπεται διὰ τοῦτο εἰς ἴδιον εἶδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατον μένει τὸ ὑποκείμενον νὰ παρουσιασθῇ ἄνευ μορφῶν, ὅμως ἀδύνατον καὶ τὸ νὰ ταυτισθῇ μὲ μίαν ἐξ αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἀποστερεῖται τῆς ἰδίας μορφοποιητικῆς αὐτονομίας, ἀλλὰ ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς ἀναγκαία συνθήκη τῆς φανερώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερη ἀπουσία τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους ἐπιστημονικῆς διαφάνειας τοῦ θεμελίου τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-01","text":"Ἡ σύζευξις τῆς ἀμορφίας τῆς χώρας μὲ τὴν τριμερή διάκρισιν μετατρέπει τὴν ἀπουσία μορφῆς ἀπὸ ἁπλὴν στέρησιν εἰς παραγωγικὸν ὅρον τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","CL_JP8E_12:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5","CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναταξινόμησις τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ ὡς μιμήματος καὶ ἡ ἀνάγκη χώρας ὡς ἕδρας ἀποδεικνύουσιν ὅτι τὸ φαινόμενον ἔχει διπλῆν ἀναφοράν, πρὸς πρότυπον καὶ πρὸς δεκτικόν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-01","CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_32:D7","CH_JP8E_S_31:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογικὴ διαφορά νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν ὀντολογικὴν διαφοράν ἀμεταβλήτου εἴδους καὶ μεταβαλλομένου εἰκόνος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-02","CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_31:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_31:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-04","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ ἀμετάβλητον δεκτικότητα εἰς σειομένην χώραν σημαίνει ὅτι ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους δὲν ἀποκλείει πάθος, ἀλλὰ ἀποκλείει μόνον ἴδιον μορφολογικὸν χαρακτῆρα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-04","CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-05","text":"Ἡ τριμερὴς κοσμολογία καὶ ἡ διάκρισις τῶν γνωστικῶν δυνάμεων συγκροτοῦσι κοινὸν κανόνα: ἡ ἀλήθεια ἀπαιτεῖ διάκρισιν ὅρων καὶ οὐ δύναται νὰ συναχθῇ ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν ἐμφάνειαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-06","text":"Ἡ χώρα γίνεται ὅρος μεταξὺ ὄντος καὶ γιγνομένου ὄχι ἐπειδὴ ἀποτελεῖ τρίτην θετικὴν οὐσίαν, ἀλλὰ ἐπειδὴ ἀπαγορεύει τὴν κατάρρευσιν τῶν δύο ἄκρων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-11","CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_32:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_32:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία τοῦ συστήματος παράγει ἕνα πεδίον ὅπου ἡ ταυτότης δὲν ὁρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν φανερὰν μορφήν, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὴν σχέσιν προτύπου, δεκτικοῦ καὶ ἐκτυπώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀποκτᾷ στρωματώδη χαρακτῆρα: τὸ εἶδος παρέχει σταθερότητα, τὸ γιγνόμενον παρέχει φανέρωσιν, καὶ ἡ χώρα παρέχει τὴν δυνατότητα συνδέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ ἀναγκαίως μεταβολὴν τοῦ θεμελίου· δύναται νὰ σημαίνῃ διαδοχικὴν ἐπιφάνισιν μιμημάτων ἐπὶ ἀμεταβλήτου ὑποβάθρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ κατοχὴν ὀρθῶν κρίσεων εἰς ἀναγνώρισιν τῶν ὅρων οἵτινες καθιστῶσι δυνατὴν τὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία τῶν φαινομένων ἀναγιγνώσκεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ἀνισορροπίας ἐντός τοῦ δεκτικοῦ πεδίου, οὐχὶ ὡς ἔλλειψις παντὸς νόμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀποφατικὴ ἀδυναμία γνώσεως τῆς χώρας γίνεται μέθοδος: ἡ ἀκριβὴς σκέψις προχωρεῖ διὰ διαδοχικῶν ἀποκλεισμῶν πρὶν ἐπιχειρήσῃ θετικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-01","text":"Ἀστάθεια μορφῶν → ἀναζήτησις ὑποκειμένου → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίου εἴδους → ἀναγνώρισις χώρας → ἐπιστροφὴ εἰς τὸ πρόβλημα τῆς ἀσταθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-02","text":"Πολλαπλὰ μιμήματα → ἀνάγκη κοινῆς ὑποδοχῆς → καθολικὴ ἀμορφία → δυνατότης ἀκριβοῦς ἐκτυπώσεως → νέα ἀνάγκη διακρίσεως προτύπου καὶ εἰκόνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις μορφῆς λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἑλκτικὸς πόλος: ὅσον ἡ χώρα ἀποφεύγει τὸν θετικὸν ὁρισμόν, τόσον ἀναγκαία γίνεται διὰ τὴν ὀντολογικὴν συνοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς ἀνακυκλοῖ τὴν διάκρισιν εἴδους καὶ μιμήματος ἐν ἐπιστημολογικῷ πεδίῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-05","text":"Ἀνομοιότης δυνάμεων → ἀνισορροπία → κίνησις χώρας → ἀντίδρασις τῶν ἐν αὐτῇ → νέα διαμόρφωσις τοῦ φαινομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ χώρα εἶναι ὁ τελικὸς ἑλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ ὅλαι αἱ διακρίσεις ἐπιστρέφουσιν εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην ὑποδοχῆς ἣν οὐδεμία θετικὴ μορφὴ ἀντικαθιστᾷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B01","text":"Φαινομένη μεταβολή → ἀμφισβήτησις τῆς ταυτότητος τοῦ φαινομένου → ἀναζήτησις σταθεροῦ ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B02","text":"Ἀφαίρεσις σχημάτων, ποιοτήτων καὶ στοιχείων → ἀναγνώρισις ἀοράτου καὶ ἀμόρφου δεκτικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B03","text":"Ἀμετάβλητον εἶδος → ἐνυπόστατον ἐκτύπωμα → αἰσθητὸν γιγνόμενον → ἀνάγκη χώρας ὡς ἕδρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B04","text":"Χώρα ἄνευ ἰδίου εἴδους → καθολικὴ δεκτικότης → φαινόμενα ὡς μιμήματα καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτοτελῆ ὄντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B05","text":"Διάκρισις τρόπων γνώσεως → διαφορά νοῦ καὶ δόξης → ἀντιστοίχησις ἐπιστημολογικῆς καὶ ὀντολογικῆς ἱεραρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B06","text":"Ἀνισορροπία δυνάμεων → σεισμὸς καὶ ἀντισεισμὸς χώρας → δυναμικὴ ἀνασύνθεσις τῆς τριμεροῦς πραγματικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ μηχανὴ συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἀποφατικὴ ἀνακύκλησις: ἡ ἀνάγκη τοῦ θεμελίου ἐπιβάλλει τὴν χώραν, καὶ ἡ χώρα διαφεύγει κάθε θετικὸν ὁρισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀστάθεια τῶν αἰσθητῶν σχημάτων → χωρισμὸς φαινομένου καὶ ὄντος → ἀναζήτησις ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀναζήτησις ὑποκειμένου → ἀφαίρεσις ἰδίου εἴδους → χώρα ὡς ἀόρατος καὶ πανδεχὴς ὑποδοχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B03","text":"Χώρα ὡς δεκτικόν → διάκρισις προτύπου, μιμήματος καὶ ἐκτυπώματος → τριμερὴς ὀντολογία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B04","text":"Τριμερὴς ὀντολογία → ἀμφισβήτησις τῆς ἀποκλειστικῆς αἰσθητῆς ἀληθείας → διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B05","text":"Ἀναγνώρισις ἀνίσων δυνάμεων → δυναμικὴ κίνησις χώρας → τελικὴ σύλληψις τῆς πραγματικότητος ὡς τριμεροῦς καὶ ἀσταθοῦς διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B06","text":"Ἀποφατικὴ σύγκλεισις → διατήρησις τῆς χώρας ὡς ἀναγκαίου ἀλλὰ μὴ πλήρως ὁριστοῦ θεμελίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-01","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητὸν μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν τάξιν τοῦ αὐτοτελοῦς ὄντος εἰς τὴν τάξιν τοῦ ἐξαρτωμένου μιμήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-02","text":"Ὁ τόπος μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὴν περίστασιν εἰς ὀντολογικὴν προϋπόθεσιν τῆς γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-03","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυντάσσεται ὡς τριμερὴς διάταξις, ὥστε ἡ ἀντίθεσις νοητοῦ καὶ αἰσθητοῦ νὰ μὴ ἐξαντλῇ τὸ πεδίον τοῦ ὄντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ὕλη καθίσταται ἐνεργὸς ὅρος δεκτικότητος, ἀλλὰ οὐχὶ αὐτόνομος παραγωγὸς μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια διαχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν ὀρθότητα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ σταθερότης τοῦ νοῦ δὲν ἀναπαράγεται ἐν τῇ μεταπειστῇ δόξῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀναπαράστασις ὁρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπουσίαν ἀνταγωνιστικῆς μορφῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπὸ τὴν πληρότητα τοῦ δεχομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ αἰσθητὰ πράγματα φαίνονται γεννώμενα, φθειρόμενα καὶ μετακινούμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ φαινομένη γένεσις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν τριπλὴν διάταξιν εἴδους, χώρας καὶ γιγνομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ σκέψις ὀφείλει νὰ ἀντισταθῇ τῇ συγχύσει τοῦ χωρικῶς φαινομένου μὲ τὸ ὄντως ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ εἶδος καὶ ἡ χώρα διαμένουσιν, ἐνώ τὸ γιγνόμενον ὑπόκειται εἰς κίνησιν καὶ φθοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐπιτελεῖ τὴν ἀλήθειαν της διὰ ἀφαιρέσεων, διακρίσεων καὶ ἐπανεισαγωγῆς τοῦ ἀποκλεισμένου θεμελίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-01","text":"Ἡ χώρα ἀπαιτεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαία πραγματικότης, ἀλλὰ ἡ περιγραφή της στηρίζεται εἰς μεταφορὰς ὑποδοχῆς, μητρός, τόπου καὶ σεισμοῦ, αἵτινες δὲν ἀναλύονται εἰς ἕνα κοινὸν θετικὸν γένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπαθὴς δεκτικότης καὶ ἡ σειομένη χώρα φαίνονται ἀντιφατικαί, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀντίφασις γίνεται παραγωγικὴ ἐὰν διακριθῇ ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους ἀπὸ τὴν ἱκανότητα πάσχειν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-03","text":"Ἡ χώρα ὑποτίθεται ἀναγκαία διὰ πᾶσαν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ γνώσις της χαρακτηρίζεται ἀσθενεστέρα καὶ ἀποφατικωτέρα ἀπὸ τὴν γνώσιν τῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ δόξης ἀληθοῦς ἐμφανίζει ἱεραρχίαν γνώσεως, ἀλλὰ τὸ σύστημα δὲν ἀποδεικνύει πλήρως εἰ ἡ ὀντολογικὴ διάκρισις θεμελιοῦται ἢ ἀπλῶς ἀκολουθεῖ τὰ λειτουργικὰ γνωρίσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀμορφία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀρνητικὸν γνώρισμα εἰς θετικὴν προϋπόθεσιν ἀκριβείας, ὅταν ἡ δεκτικότης ἀναγνωρισθῇ ὡς παραγωγικὴ λειτουργία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-02","text":"Ἡ χώρα μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ σταθερὸν ὑπόβαθρον εἰς ἀμοιβαίως κινούμενον πεδίον, χωρὶς νὰ παύσῃ νὰ εἶναι ὁ τόπος διατηρήσεως τῆς ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τοῦ τόπου μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν θέσην εἰς ἐσωτερικὸν ὅρον γενέσεως καὶ ἀντιδράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-04","text":"Ἡ γνώσις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀναγνώρισιν φαινομένων εἰς διάκρισιν τῶν ὅρων οἵτινες καθιστῶσι τὰ φαινόμενα δυνατά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἰκονίζεται ὡς τριμερὴς μηχανὴ ἐκτυπώσεως, ὅπου τὸ εἶδος παρέχει τὸ πρότυπον, ἡ χώρα τὴν δεκτικότητα, καὶ τὸ γιγνόμενον τὸ φθαρτὸν ἐκτύπωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ὑποκείμενος δὲν εἶναι κύριος παραγωγὸς μορφῆς, ἀλλὰ ἀπρόσωπος τόπος διελεύσεως, ἐν ᾧ αἱ μορφαὶ ἐμφανίζονται χωρὶς νὰ τὸν ταυτίζουν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι διπλός: ἀμετάβλητος ὡς πρὸς τὸ εἶδος καὶ τὴν χώραν, διαδοχικὸς καὶ φθαρτὸς ὡς πρὸς τὰ ἐκτυπώματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐπέμβασις δὲν συνίσταται εἰς ἐπιβολὴν ἰδίας μορφῆς, ἀλλὰ εἰς ὀρθὴν διάκρισιν μεταξὺ προτύπου, δεκτικοῦ καὶ μιμήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπόδρασις ἀπὸ τὴν πλάνην ἐπιτυγχάνεται οὐ διὰ καταργήσεως τοῦ φαινομένου, ἀλλὰ διὰ παύσεως τῆς ταυτίσεως αὐτοῦ μὲ τὸ ὄντως ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως: ἀπὸ τὸ φαινόμενον εἰς τὸ ὑπόβαθρον, ἀπὸ τὸ ὑπόβαθρον εἰς τὴν τριμερή ὀντολογίαν, καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτην εἰς τὴν διάκρισιν τῶν τρόπων γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἐξάρτησιν κοσμολογίας, ὀντολογίας καὶ γνωσιολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ χώρα συνδέει τὴν γένεσιν μὲ τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑπομένει ἀκαθόριστον τὸ θετικὸν εἶναι τῆς χώρας, ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς μετοχῆς της τοῦ νοητοῦ, καὶ ἡ σχέσις μεταξὺ πάσχειν καὶ κινεῖν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B04","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὡς πρὸς τὴν τριμερῆ ἀρχιτεκτονικήν, ἀλλὰ ἡ συνοχὴ του ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἐπανειλημμένην ἀποφατικὴν ἀφαίρεσιν καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνοχὴν τῆς ἀμφισημίας τῆς χώρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐλάχιστη ἀνακατασκευή διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ δὲν ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὸ ἀποφατικῶς ἀναγκαῖον θεμέλιον διὰ ψευδοῦς θετικοῦ ὁρισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232454438399Z_c47ffc9a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 34–36","source_sha256":"50bb3dbe8e909d944563cb5147890e532bf36be37393121d011af54373fa4727","sha256":"c96b18440c1f8744593810bdae36a812646b535aa63b75c4c85bd148ed5a61cc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:24:54.440830+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-01","text":"The system seeks to explain how what changes can appear in a cosmos where ontological stability does not coincide with phenomena.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-02","text":"The first reframing distinguishes what comes to be, that which receives, and the unchangeable paradigm, so that coming-to-be is not confused with autonomous change of substance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-03","text":"Chōra appears as a third kind, necessary for every manifestation, but impossible to define through a form of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-04","text":"The apophatic abstraction of elements, qualities, and shapes transforms the receptacle from a hidden substrate into a condition of possibility for forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-05","text":"The epistemological division of intellect and true opinion extends the cosmological distinction, since the mode of knowledge reveals a difference in modes of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-06","text":"The final movement is not linear but spiral: apparent change returns to the search for a substrate, and the substrate reintroduces the necessity of apophatic knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AS-07","text":"The closure is functional, not absolute; the system restores the tripartite structure, but retains chōra as an indeterminate and apophatically accessible foundation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] What comes to be is perceptible, generated, mobile, and perishable; therefore it cannot itself bear the measure of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The form or being subsists ungeneratedly and unchangeably, as another kind beside what comes to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Chōra or receptacle is a third kind, which provides a seat for things coming to be without being identical with them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Chōra is initially conceived as impassible receptivity, but in the dynamic description it appears as a field where unequal forces cause reciprocal motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Universal receptivity requires the absence of a form of its own, so that what receives does not distort what enters.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Reality is not a binary opposition of intelligible and perceptible, but a tripartite arrangement of form, chōra, and what comes to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Apparent alteration is initially attributed to the entry and exit of imitations, but is ultimately interpreted also as reciprocal motion of chōra and inherent forces.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Chōra is not known through perception, but through difficult reasoning, because the lack of a form of its own removes the ordinarily visible criterion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] The distinction between intellect and true opinion transfers the tripartite ontology into the field of knowledge, where the immobility of reason is distinguished from the persuadability of persuasion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The absence of a form of its own constitutes the hidden foundation of multiple receptivity and exact impressing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] No apparent shape or perceptible quality can assume the identity of the subject or the principle of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The distinction of being, becoming, and that in which becoming is accomplished prevents every ontology of confusion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-01","text":"The receptacle recurs as “chōra,” “that which receives,” and “seat,” but its function shifts from an inert vessel into a dynamic field of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-02","text":"Formlessness retains its identity, but changes meaning: initially it signifies the absence of a character of its own; later it signifies the condition of exact assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-03","text":"Apparent change shifts from a simple alternation of entries and exits into an unstable reciprocity of forces, where chōra and the things in it move one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-04","text":"The distinction between imitation and paradigm recurs in cosmology and epistemology, where correct opinion falls short of intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-05","text":"Chōra migrates from the order of the material element into the order of the ontological condition of possibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-06","text":"The binary arrangement of form and matter is absorbed by the tripartite relation of paradigm, chōra, and imprint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RMD-07","text":"The local analogy of gold and shapes performs the work of disconnecting subject and affection, and then recedes when chōra becomes a universal condition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-01","text":"The examples of gold, ointment, and soft material remain local as explanatory means; what is graduated into the present condition is the independence of the subject from affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-02","text":"The simple requirement of a common receptacle is scaled up into the tripartite architecture of form, chōra, and what comes to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-03","text":"The local denial that chōra is an element becomes a bridge between cosmology and ontology, because it reclassifies the material as a receptive principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-04","text":"The distinction between intellect and true opinion does not constitute a local theory of knowledge, but dissolves the assumption that ordinary correct opinion is equivalent to knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-05","text":"The initial image of chōra as unchangeable receptivity recodificetur as chōra subject to motions, yet not taking on a form of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:CGD-06","text":"The necessity of maintaining simultaneously the reality of chōra and the impossibility of its positive definition exceeds the local explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-01","text":"The identification of what changes with unchangeable being is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-02","text":"The reduction of chōra to an element, quality, shape, or visible subsistence is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-03","text":"The assumption that perceptible things possess autonomous and complete substance is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-04","text":"The idea that truth is identical either with perception or with correct persuasion is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-05","text":"The reduction of coming-to-be to only one kind or to only one cause is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:GNX-06","text":"The apophatic architecture excludes autonomous matter as a producer of its own form, without denying the necessity of material receptivity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-01","text":"If the phenomenon were autonomous being, the distinction between paradigm, receptacle, and image would collapse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-02","text":"If chōra had a form of its own, universal receptivity and exact impressing would be impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-03","text":"If coming-to-be were a simple transition of elements, the third kind of chōra would be superfluous.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-04","text":"If ordinary opinion were knowledge, the hierarchy of intellect and true opinion would be abolished.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:DBN-05","text":"If spatial presence were the measure of being, the intelligible and chōra would be unjustly assimilated to perceptible things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-01","text":"The system revolves around the inability positively to name the substrate, since every positive form would limit its universality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-02","text":"The absence of a form of its own is the unseen possibility of all appearances, but is not thereby transformed into a form of its own.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-03","text":"It remains impossible for the subject to be presented without forms, yet equally impossible for it to be identified with one of them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-04","text":"Matter is deprived of its own form-giving autonomy, but is shown as a necessary condition of manifestation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSA-05","text":"The system’s deeper absence is the impossibility of complete scientific transparency of the foundation of coming-to-be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-01","text":"The conjunction of the formlessness of chōra with the tripartite distinction transforms the absence of form from a simple privation into a productive condition of coming-to-be.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","CL_JP8E_12:GA-10","CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5","CH_JP8E_S_31:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-02","text":"The reclassification of the perceptible as imitation and the necessity of chōra as seat demonstrate that the phenomenon has a double reference: to paradigm and to receptivity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-01","CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_32:D7","CH_JP8E_S_31:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-03","text":"The epistemological difference between intellect and true opinion repeats the ontological difference between unchangeable form and changing image.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-02","CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_31:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_31:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-04","text":"The transition from unchangeable receptivity to shaken chōra means that the absence of a form of its own does not exclude affection, but excludes only a morphological character of its own.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-04","CL_JP8E_12:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX3","CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-05","text":"Tripartite cosmology and the distinction of cognitive powers establish a common rule: truth requires distinction of terms and cannot be inferred from mere appearance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-06","CL_JP8E_12:GA-09","CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:XD-06","text":"Chōra becomes a term between being and becoming not because it constitutes a third positive substance, but because it prohibits the collapse of the two extremes.","refs":["CL_JP8E_12:GA-03","CL_JP8E_12:GA-11","CL_JP8E_12:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_32:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_32:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-01","text":"The ontology of the system produces a field in which identity is not defined by manifest form, but by the relation of paradigm, receptivity, and imprint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-02","text":"Reality acquires a layered character: form provides stability, what comes to be provides manifestation, and chōra provides the possibility of connection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-03","text":"Change ceases necessarily to mean change of the foundation; it can mean the successive appearance of imitations upon an unchangeable substrate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-04","text":"Knowledge is transformed from possession of correct judgments into recognition of the conditions that make judgment possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-05","text":"The disorder of phenomena is read as the result of imbalance within the receptive field, not as the absence of every law.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:BSD-06","text":"The apophatic inability to know chōra becomes a method: exact thought proceeds through successive exclusions before attempting positive synthesis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-01","text":"Instability of forms → search for subject → abstraction of a form of its own → recognition of chōra → return to the problem of instability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-02","text":"Multiple imitations → necessity of a common receptacle → universal formlessness → possibility of exact impressing → renewed necessity of distinguishing paradigm and image.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-03","text":"The lack of form functions as an attractive pole: insofar as chōra avoids positive definition, it becomes so much the more necessary for ontological coherence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-04","text":"The distinction between intellect and true opinion recycles the distinction between form and imitation in the epistemological field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-05","text":"Dissimilarity of forces → imbalance → motion of chōra → reaction of the things in it → new formation of the phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:RLE-06","text":"Chōra is the final attractive pole of the system, because all distinctions return to the necessity of a receptacle which no positive form replaces.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B01","text":"Apparent change → questioning of the identity of the phenomenon → search for a stable subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B02","text":"Abstraction of shapes, qualities, and elements → recognition of invisible and formless receptivity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B03","text":"Unchangeable form → subsistent imprint → perceptible thing coming to be → necessity of chōra as seat.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B04","text":"Chōra without a form of its own → universal receptivity → phenomena as imitations and not as autonomous beings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B05","text":"Distinction of modes of knowledge → difference between intellect and opinion → correspondence of epistemological and ontological hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B06","text":"Imbalance of forces → shaking and countershaking of chōra → dynamic recomposition of tripartite reality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FGS-B07","text":"The mechanism is constituted as apophatic recurrence: the necessity of the foundation imposes chōra, and chōra escapes every positive definition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B01","text":"Instability of perceptible shapes → separation of phenomenon and being → search for subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B02","text":"Search for subject → abstraction of a form of its own → chōra as invisible and all-receiving receptacle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B03","text":"Chōra as receptivity → distinction of paradigm, imitation, and imprint → tripartite ontology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B04","text":"Tripartite ontology → questioning of exclusively perceptible truth → distinction between intellect and true opinion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B05","text":"Recognition of unequal forces → dynamic motion of chōra → final conception of reality as a tripartite and unstable arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:AFM-B06","text":"Apophatic closure → preservation of chōra as a necessary but not fully definable foundation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-01","text":"The perceptible moves from the order of autonomous being into the order of dependent imitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-02","text":"Place is transformed from a geometrical circumstance into an ontological precondition of coming-to-be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-03","text":"Reality is reconstituted as a tripartite arrangement, so that the opposition of intelligible and perceptible does not exhaust the field of being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-04","text":"Matter becomes an active condition of receptivity, but not an autonomous producer of form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-05","text":"Truth is separated from simple correctness, because the stability of intellect is not reproduced in persuadable opinion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MME-06","text":"Exact representation is defined by the absence of a competing form and not by the fullness of what receives.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, perceptible things appear to be generated, to perish, and to move.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, apparent coming-to-be requires the triple arrangement of form, chōra, and what comes to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, thought must resist the confusion of what appears spatially with what truly is.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, form and chōra remain, while what comes to be is subject to motion and destruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the form of discourse accomplishes its truth through abstractions, distinctions, and the reintroduction of the excluded foundation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-01","text":"Chōra is required as a necessary reality, but its description rests on metaphors of receptacle, mother, place, and earthquake, which are not analyzed into one common positive kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-02","text":"Impassible receptivity and shaken chōra appear contradictory, but the contradiction becomes productive if the absence of a form of its own is distinguished from the capacity to undergo affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-03","text":"Chōra is supposed necessary for all coming-to-be, but knowledge of it is characterized as weaker and more apophatic than knowledge of forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:FL-04","text":"The distinction between intellect and true opinion displays a hierarchy of knowledge, but the system does not fully prove whether the ontological distinction is grounded or merely follows functional characteristics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-01","text":"Formlessness mutates from a negative characteristic into a positive precondition of exactness, when receptivity is recognized as a productive function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-02","text":"Chōra mutates from a stable substrate into a reciprocally moving field, without ceasing to be the place where identity is preserved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-03","text":"The concept of place mutates from an external position into an internal condition of coming-to-be and reaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MP-04","text":"Knowledge mutates from recognition of phenomena into distinction of the conditions that make phenomena possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-01","text":"Reality is imaged as a tripartite mechanism of impressing, in which form provides the paradigm, chōra receptivity, and what comes to be the perishable imprint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-02","text":"The substrate is not the sovereign producer of form, but an impersonal place of passage in which forms appear without identifying it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-03","text":"The time of the system is double: unchangeable with respect to form and chōra, successive and perishable with respect to imprints.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-04","text":"Possible intervention does not consist in imposing a form of one’s own, but in a correct distinction among paradigm, receptivity, and imitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:HSI-05","text":"Escape from error is achieved not through abolition of the phenomenon, but through ceasing to identify it with what truly is.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstruction of the basic movement: from phenomenon to substrate, from substrate to tripartite ontology, and from this to the distinction of modes of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the internal dependence of cosmology, ontology, and epistemology, because chōra connects coming-to-be with truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B03","text":"The positive being of chōra, the exact mode of its participation in the intelligible, and the relation between undergoing affection and moving remain undetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_31:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B04","text":"The system is coherent with respect to its tripartite architecture, but its coherence depends on repeated apophatic abstraction and on tolerating the ambiguity of chōra.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_32:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_12:MRT-B05","text":"The minimal reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, because it does not replace the apophatically necessary foundation with a false positive definition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC5:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_12:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 34–36"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 34–36","context":"Section 50 · Section 51 · Section 52","original_title":"Chapters 34–36","original_context":"Section 50 · Section 51 · Section 52"},"original_title":"Chapters 34–36","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 37–39","order":13,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_33","CH_JP8E_S_34","CH_JP8E_S_35"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_13@R001","sha256":"bab4455ca6755b4f21a904290bd8b2430d23ef6409828a13b1ca59853e26c764","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα εἶναι πῶς ἡ ἄλογος πολλότης μεταβαίνει εἰς κόσμον ὡρισμένων σωμάτων, χωρίς ἡ διαφορά νὰ καταργηθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία δὲν ἐκλαμβάνεται ὡς τελικὴ ἀπουσία μορφῆς, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς ἀνοικτὴ φάσις πρὸς διάκρισιν καὶ σύνταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B03","text":"Ἡ κίνησις λειτουργεῖ ὡς μηχανισμὸς ὃς χωρίζει τὰ ἀνόμοια, συνάγει τὰ ὅμοια καὶ παράγει τόπους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ κατασκευὴ ἀναλύει τὰ σώματα ἀπὸ τὸ βάθος εἰς ἐπίπεδα, τρίγωνα, στερεὰ καὶ στοιχειακὰ γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B05","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία δὲν περιγράφει ἁπλῶς τὰ σώματα, ἀλλὰ καθορίζει τὴν ταυτότητα, τὴν συγγένειαν καὶ τὰ ὅρια μεταβολῆς των.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B06","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ποικιλία παράγεται ἐκ πεπερασμένων μορφῶν καὶ ἀριθμητικῶν συνθέσεων, ὄχι ἐκ ἀπείρου ἀδιαφοροποιήτου ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B07","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ γίνεται δυνατὴ μόνον ὅπου ὑπάρχει κοινὴ στοιχειώδης ὑποδομή, ἐνώ ἡ ἀνομοιότης ἐγγράφει ἀπαγορευμένα περάσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_34:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B08","text":"Ἡ πορεία καταλήγει εἰς πεπερασμένην καὶ θεοδιακόσμητον κοσμικὴν τάξιν, ἣν ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος ὑποστηρίζει χωρίς νὰ ἀποδεικνύῃ τὰ ἀνώτατα θεμέλια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ τάξις προκύπτει διὰ διαδικασίας διακρίσεως, συναγωγῆς καὶ μορφοποιήσεως, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀρχικὴ ἰδιότης τῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κίνησις ἀπὸ σεισμικὸς χωρισμὸς γίνεται μηχανισμὸς γεωμετρικῆς παραγωγῆς καὶ ὕστερον κανὼν μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ὁ ἀριθμὸς συγκροτοῦσι τὸ τί ἐστι τὸ σῶμα, καὶ δὲν προστίθενται ἐξωτερικῶς εἰς ἕτοιμον ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν σωμάτων ἀνάγεται εἰς ὀλίγους πεπερασμένους στοιχειώδεις τύπους καὶ εἰς τὴν ποσοτικὴν διάταξιν αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κοινὴ γεωμετρικὴ ὑποδομὴ καθιστᾷ δυνατὴν τὴν μεταβολήν, ἀλλὰ οὐκ ἐπιτρέπει καθολικὴν μεταβολὴν πάντων εἰς πάντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου συγκροτεῖται διὰ ἀσύμμετρης συγγενείας: τρία γένη μετέχει κοινῆς ἀρχῆς, ἐνώ τὸ τέταρτον ἐξαιρείται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ φυσικὴ ἰδιότης ἑκάστου γένους ἀναγινώσκεται ὡς ἀντιστοιχία γεωμετρικῆς μορφῆς, κινήσεως, βάσεως καὶ στερεότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις ὑπερβαίνει τὴν στοιχειακὴν ταξινόμησιν καὶ λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὄργανον συντάξεως τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ πεπερασμένη γεωμετρικὴ τάξις ὁδηγεῖ πρὸς ἕνα ἑνιαῖον κόσμον, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἑνότης αὐτὴ στηρίζεται εἰς εἰκότα κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν σωμάτων εἰς γεωμετρικὴν ἀνάγκην σταματᾷ πρὸ τῶν ἀνωτάτων ἀρχῶν, αἳ παραμένουν ὑπεράνω ἀνθρωπίνης ἀποδείξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ νοοῦνται ὡς λύσις καὶ ἀνασύνθεσις μορφῶν, ἀλλὰ μόνον ἐντὸς περιορισμένων συγγενειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος συνδέει μαθηματικὴν ἀνάγκην μὲ ἀποφατικὸν ὅριον, ὥστε ἡ ἐξήγησις νὰ εἶναι ἀκριβὴς κατὰ τὰ ἐγγύτερα καὶ ἀνολοκλήρωτος κατὰ τὰ ἀνώτατα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία ἐπανέρχεται ἀρχικῶς ὡς ἄμετρος κατάσταση, ὕστερον ὡς ἀναγκαῖο ὑπόβαθρο τῆς τάξεως καὶ τελικῶς ὡς ἀποκλειστέα τελικὴ πραγματικότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ αἰτία διακρίσεως εἰς ὄρο μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ κατόπιν ὑποτάσσεται εἰς τὴν σταθερότητα τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_35:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-03","text":"Τὸ τρίγωνον ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς ἀρχικὸς τύπος, ὡς στοιχεῖον συνθέσεως καὶ ὡς ὑποδομὴ ἣ μετασχηματίζεται εἰς στερεά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ διαφορά μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ χωρικὴ ἀπομάκρυνσιν εἰς γεωμετρικὴν ἀνομοιότητα καὶ τελικῶς εἰς ἱεράρχησιν δυνατῶν καὶ ἀδυνάτων μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:D1","CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν σωμάτων παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ αὐτοτέλειαν καὶ γίνεται προσωρινὴ ἑνότης ἀνασυνθέσιμων στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-06","text":"Ὁ ἀριθμὸς ἀναβαίνει ἀπὸ περιγραφικὸν μέτρον εἰς γενετικὸν κανόνα καὶ ὕστερον εἰς τελολογικὴν ἔνδειξιν κοσμικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἀναλυτικὴ μέθοδος εἰς ὀντολογικὸ κριτήριον καὶ τέλος εἰς θεοδιακόσμητον σύνταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῶν ἀνωτάτων ἀρχῶν δὲν ἐξαλείφεται, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφᾶται ὡς ὅρος τοῦ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ σεισμικὴ κίνησις τῆς χώρας παραμένει μηχανισμὸς τοπικῆς κοσμογονικῆς περιγραφῆς καὶ δὲν ἀποτελεῖ μόνην τὴν παγκόσμιον ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀναλογία τῶν δύο τριγώνων καὶ ἡ κατασκευὴ τοῦ ἰσοπλεύρου σχήματος εἶναι κατώτερα τεχνικὰ βήματα, ὄχι αὐτοτελεῖς ἀρχιτεκτονικοὶ νόμοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστοιχία τετραέδρου, ὀκταέδρου, εἰκοσαέδρου καὶ κύβου κλιμακοῦται εἰς γενικὴν ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ φέρει φυσικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ στοιχειώδης φύσις γεφυροῖ τὰ τρία μεταβλητὰ γένη καὶ συνδέει τὴν τοπικὴν κατασκευὴν μὲ τὴν κοσμικὴν θεωρίαν μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐξαίρεσις τοῦ τετάρτου γένους καταλύει τὸ τοπικὸν σχήμα τῆς καθολικῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ γίνεται παγκόσμιος περιορισμὸς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλῶς ἕτερον στοιχεῖον καὶ ἀναβαίνει εἰς τὴν ἀρχὴν ἑνοποιήσεως τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀναλυτικὴ γεωμετρία ἀποκτᾷ current-level λειτουργία μόνον ὅταν συνδεθῇ μὲ θείαν διάταξιν καὶ ὅριον γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται κόσμος ὃς ἦν ἐξ ἀρχῆς πλήρως κεκοσμημένος καὶ ἀμετάβλητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἄμορφος ὕλη ὡς ὑπέρτατον ὑπόστρωμα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μορφὴ ἐνυπάρχει ἤδη στὴν γένεσιν τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀδιακρίτως καθολικὴ μεταβολή, ἐπειδὴ ἡ συγγένεια ὁρίζει τὰ ἐπιτρεπτὰ περάσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπειρία τῶν σχημάτων ὡς αὐτόματον ὄρος τῆς πραγματικότητος· ἡ κοσμικὴ μηχανὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἐκλογὴν καὶ περατότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς φυσικῆς διαφορᾶς εἰς ἀριθμὸν ἄνευ μορφῆς, βάσεως καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις μαθηματικῆς δυνατότητος μὲ φυσικὴν ὕπαρξιν καὶ ὁμοίως ἡ ταύτισις εἰκότος λόγου μὲ πλήρη ἀπόδειξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_35:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-01","text":"Δὲν δύναται νὰ ἰσχύῃ ὑλικὴ ἐνότητα ἄνευ ἐσωτερικῆς διαφοροποιήσεως, διότι ἡ ἑνότης παράγεται διὰ διακεκριμένων τύπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-02","text":"Δὲν δύναται ἡ γένεσις νὰ εἶναι ἀκαθόριστος ῥοή· χρειάζεται ἀριθμητικὴ καὶ γεωμετρικὴ ἀναγκαιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-03","text":"Δὲν δύναται ἡ μορφὴ νὰ εἶναι παθητικὸ περίβλημα τῆς ποσότητος, ἐπειδὴ συνκαθορίζει τὴν ταυτότητα τοῦ γιγνομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-04","text":"Δὲν δύναται ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις νὰ ἐξηγηθῇ ὡς αὐτόματη συσσώρευσις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ σύνταξις προϋποθέτει διακοσμοῦσαν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-05","text":"Δὲν δύναται ἡ ἀνθρωπίνη γνώσις νὰ ἀπαιτῇ ἓν ἐνιαῖον ἐπίπεδον ἀποδείξεως διὰ τὰ σώματα καὶ τὰ ὑπέρτατα θεμέλια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτως ἀδιαμόρφωτης ὕλης ἀναγκάζει τὴν κοσμολογίαν νὰ ἀρχίζῃ ἀπὸ ἤδη διαφοροποιήσιμες δυνατότητες.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία καθολικοῦ στοιχείου διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν ἑτερότητα τῶν γενῶν καὶ καθιστᾷ τὴν μεταβολὴν ἐπιλεκτικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία πλήρους ἀναγωγῆς τῆς διαφορᾶς εἰς μίαν τάξιν ἐπιτρέπει τὴν συνύπαρξιν ἑνότητος καὶ ἀνωμαλίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία ἀποδείξεως τῶν ἀνωτάτων ἀρχῶν δὲν διαλύει τὸ σύστημα, ἀλλὰ τοῦ παρέχει ἀποφατικὸν ὁρίζοντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ μὴ διαθέσιμος ἀπόλυτος πολλαπλότης τῶν κόσμων ἀναδεικνύει τὴν ἑνότητα ὡς ἐρμηνευτικὸν ἔργον καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς γυμνὸν ἀριθμητικόν δεδομένον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀταξία τῆς κοσμογονικῆς ἀρχῆς καὶ ἡ πεπερασμένη γεωμετρικὴ ἐκλογὴ συντίθενται εἰς γενετικὴν γραμματικὴν, ὅπου ἡ κίνησις παράγει μόνον ὡρισμένες μορφές.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","CL_JP8E_13:GA-02","CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_34:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-02","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ στοιχειώδης ὑποδομὴ καὶ ἡ διακεκριμένη στερεὰ μορφὴ δείκνυσιν ὅτι ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ κόσμου παράγεται διὰ συγγενειῶν, οὐχὶ διὰ ὁμοιομορφίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_35:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-03","text":"Ἡ λύσις καὶ ἀνασύνθεσις τῶν τριῶν συγγενῶν γενῶν, ἐν συνδυασμῷ μὲ τὴν ἐξαίρεσιν τοῦ κύβου, μετατρέπει τὴν φθορὰν εἰς περιορισμένην ἀναδιαμόρφωσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_34:D3","CH_JP8E_S_35:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστοιχία γεωμετρικῶν σχημάτων πρὸς φυσικὰς δυνάμεις ἀναγκάζει τὴν μορφὴν νὰ ἐνεργῇ ὡς φυσικὴ αἰτία καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὸ σύμβολον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-05","text":"Ἡ περατότης τῶν στερεῶν καὶ ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις συνδέουν τὴν μαθηματικὴν ἀνάγκην μὲ τελολογικὴν διάταξιν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐπιλογὴ ἑνὸς κόσμου δὲν ἀκολουθεῖ ἀναγκαστικῶς ἐκ τῆς γεωμετρίας, ἀλλὰ ἐκ τῆς συζεύξεως περατότητος καὶ εἰκότος λόγου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος ἀνασυγκροτεῖται ὡς πεπερασμένη γενετικὴ γραμματική, ἣ παράγει διαφοράν διὰ συνδυασμῶν καὶ ὄχι διὰ ἀπείρων ἀνεξαρτήτων οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","CL_JP8E_13:XD-01","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ διαφορά δὲν ἀντιτίθεται ἁπλῶς εἰς τὴν ἑνότητα· ἡ ἑνότης συνίσταται ἀκριβῶς ἐκ ρυθμισμένων διαφοροποιήσεων καὶ ἀπαγορευμένων μεταβάσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","CL_JP8E_13:XD-02","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῶν σωμάτων γίνεται χρόνος συνθέσεως καὶ λύσεως, ἀλλὰ ὄχι ἀπεριόριστης ἀναστρεψιμότητος· ἡ γεωμετρικὴ συγγένεια χαράσσει τὰ ὅρια τοῦ γίγνεσθαι.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἑνότης εἶναι συγχρόνως μαθηματικὴ δομή, θεία ἐπιλογὴ καὶ ἐρμηνευτικὴ κρίσις, ὥστε οὐδεμία ἀπὸ αὐτὰς ἀρκεί μόνη.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ἀποκτᾷ διαβαθμίσεις: ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάγκη ἐξηγεῖ τὰ ἐγγύτερα, ἐνώ ἡ θεία ἀρχὴ ὁρίζει τὸ ἀπρόσιτον πέρας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-10","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ὁρίζεται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ σύνταξις μορφῶν ὑπὸ θείαν διάταξιν, ὄχι ὡς ἄθροισμα ἀδρανῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-01","text":"Ἄταξις → κίνησις → διάκρισις → σύναξις → μορφή· ἡ παραγόμενη μορφὴ ἐπανερμηνεύει τὴν ἀρχικὴν ἄταξιν ὡς προθάλαμον τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-02","text":"Τρίγωνα → στερεὰ → στοιχειακὰ γένη → φυσικαὶ δυνάμεις → κοσμικὴ διάταξις· ἡ ἀνάλυσις ἐπιστρέφει ὡς σύνθεσις τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς μεταβολῆς ἀλλάσσει φάσιν: ἀπὸ καθολικὴ ὑπόθεσις γίνεται περιορισμένη δυνατότης τῶν συγγενῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία γίνεται μηχανή, ὅταν ὁ ἀριθμὸς τῶν στοιχείων καὶ ἡ διάταξις αὐτῶν παράγωσιν εἶδος, κίνησιν καὶ μεταβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος, ἐπειδὴ μεταφέρει τὸ σύστημα ἀπὸ τὴν ταξινόμησιν τῶν στοιχείων εἰς τὴν σύνταξιν τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος ἀποτελεῖ τελικὸν βρόχον: ἡ ἀνάγκη παράγει τὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἐξήγησις ὑποδεικνύει τὸ ὅριον τῆς ἀνάγκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B01","text":"Ἄλογος καὶ ἄμετρος πολλότης γίνεται κινητὴ χώρα, ἣ ἐπιτρέπει διάκρισιν τῶν ἀνομοίων καὶ σύναξιν τῶν ὁμοίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ χωρικὴ διαφοροποίησις μετατρέπεται εἰς ἐκλογὴν πεπερασμένων γεωμετρικῶν τύπων καὶ ἀριθμητικῶν συνθέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀναλυτικὴ κλίμαξ σώμα → βάθος → ἐπίπεδον → τρίγωνα ἀποκαλύπτει τὴν κοινὴν ὑποδομὴν τῶν διαφόρων σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ὑποδομὴ παράγει τρία συγγενῆ γένη, ἐνώ ἡ ἰδία στοιχειώδης μορφὴ τοῦ τετάρτου ὁρίζει τὸ ἀπαγορευμένο πέρασμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ στερεὰ μορφὴ μεταφέρει τὴν γεωμετρικὴν διαφοράν εἰς φυσικὴν ἰδιότητα καὶ ἀκολούθως εἰς στοιχειακὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις καὶ ὁ εἰκὼς λόγος ἐνοποιοῦσι τὴν πεπερασμένην μορφολογίαν εἰς ἕνα θεοδιακόσμητον ὅλον, ἀφήνοντες ἀνοικτὴν τὴν ἀνωτάτην θεμελίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B01","text":"Ἄτακτος πολλότης → σεισμικὴ διάκρισις → χωρικὴ ἀπονομή → ἀριθμητικὴ καὶ γεωμετρικὴ τάξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀριθμητικὴ τάξις → πεπερασμένοι στοιχειώδεις τύποι → σύνθεσις στερεῶν → διάκρισις συγγενῶν καὶ ἀσυγγενῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B03","text":"Στερεὰ γεωμετρία → φυσικὴ ἀντιστοιχία → κυβικὴ σταθερότης τῆς γῆς → ἱεράρχησις στοιχειακῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B04","text":"Ἀνασύνθεσις συγγενῶν μορφῶν → περιορισμένη μεταβολή → ἀποκλεισμὸς καθολικῆς ἀναστρεψιμότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B05","text":"Πέμπτη σύστασις → θεία κοσμικὴ σύνταξις → εἷς κόσμος κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα λόγον → ἀποφατικὸν ὅριον τῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἐπαναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀόριστον ὑπόστρωμα εἰς μετρήσιμον, σχηματισμένον καὶ μετασχηματίσιμον σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ταυτότητος καὶ διαφοράς καταρρέει, ἐπειδὴ τὰ σώματα διατηροῦνται ὡς μορφαὶ ἀνασυνθέσιμων στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-03","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ μετασχηματίζονται ἀπὸ ἀντίθετα γεγονότα εἰς διαφορετικὰς κατευθύνσεις τῆς αὐτῆς γεωμετρικῆς διαδικασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-04","text":"Ἡ διάκριση τῶν στοιχείων γίνεται διάκρισις ρυθμῶν κινήσεως, βάσεων, μορφῶν καὶ δυνατῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-05","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις μετακινείται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπιβολὴν εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἐνέργειαν τῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ μέθοδος ἐπανακαθορίζεται ὡς διαβαθμισμένη ἀπόδειξις, ἣ συνδυάζει γεωμετρικὴν ἀνάγκην μὲ ἐλεγχόμενον εἰκότα λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** Τὰ τέτταρα γένη λαμβάνουσι διακεκριμένα κανονικὰ σώματα, ὧν αἱ μορφαὶ καὶ αἱ βάσεις δηλοῦσι τὰς φυσικὰς ἰδιότητας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἀποτελεῖ δίκτυον διακρίσεως, σύνθεσης, ἀντιστοιχίας καὶ περιορισμένης μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** Ὁ λόγος ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἀσαφῆ καθολικὴν γένεσιν μὲ κλιμακωτὴν ἀναγωγὴν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενην ἀποκλειστικὴν ταξινόμησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Τὸ ὂν γίνεται πεπερασμένη μορφοποιημένη τάξις, ἧς ὁ χρόνος ἀναπτύσσει λύσεις καὶ συνθέσεις ἐντὸς ἀμετακίνητων ὁρίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** Ἡ ἴδια ἡ ἐξήγησις μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενόν της, ἀναλύουσα τὸ ὅλον εἰς στοιχεῖα καὶ ἐπανενῶσα αὐτὰ εἰς κοσμικὴν σύνταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-01","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ ἀνάγκη φαίνεται νὰ θεμελιοῖ τὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ θεία διάταξις παραμένει ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν τελικὴν σύνταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-02","text":"Ἡ πεπερασμένη γεωμετρία ὑποστηρίζει ἕνα κόσμον, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀποκλείει λογικῶς τὴν πολλαπλότητα τῶν κόσμων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-03","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ὑποδομὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἑνότητα μεταβολῆς, ἐνώ ἡ ἐξαίρεσις τοῦ τετάρτου γένους διασώζει ἀσύμμετρον διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνάλυσις εἰς ἄκρα γεωμετρικὰ στοιχεῖα προσεγγίζει τὴν θεμελίωσιν, ἀλλ᾽ ἀφήνει ἀδιευκρίνιστον τὴν ἀρχὴ τῶν ἴδιων τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἄταξις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀρνητικὴν κατάσταση εἰς προπαρασκευαστικὸ δυναμικὸ τῆς κοσμήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-02","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ὑπόθεσιν καθολικῆς ῥοῆς εἰς ἱεραρχημένην δυνατότητα συγγενῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-03","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ γλῶσσα περιγραφῆς εἰς ὀντολογικὸ μηχανισμό, καὶ ἀκολούθως εἰς τελολογικὴν κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-04","text":"Ἡ πέμπτη σύστασις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀπροσδιόριστον πέμπτον σχῆμα εἰς ἀρχὴν ἑνοποιήσεως τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι μηχανὴ σεισμικῆς διακρίσεως, γεωμετρικῆς συνθέσεως καὶ θείας ἀνατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ σῶμα εἶναι προσωρινὴ καὶ ἀνασυνθέσιμος διαμόρφωσις στοιχείων, ἧς ἡ ταυτότης ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ μορφὴν καὶ ἀριθμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι κυκλοτερὴς ὡς πρὸς λύσιν καὶ σύνθεσιν, ἀλλὰ γραμμικὸς ὡς πρὸς τὴν ἀνάβασιν ἀπὸ ἀταξίαν εἰς κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ πλοήγησις τοῦ λόγου ἐκτείνεται μέχρι τὴν γεωμετρικὴν ἀνάγκην, ἀλλὰ τὸ ὕστατον θεμέλιον παραμένει θεῖον καὶ ἀπρόσιτον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ ἀταξίαν, διὰ γεωμετρικὴν σύνθεσιν, εἰς στοιχειακὴν καὶ κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν ἡ πλήρης φύσις τῆς πέμπτης συστάσεως, ἡ ἀκριβὴς θεμελίωσις τῶν τριγώνων καὶ ὁ ἀποκλειστικὸς λόγος τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B03","text":"Συνεκτικὸν τὸ σύστημα ἐστὶν ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν παραγωγήν, τὴν περιορισμένην μεταβολὴν καὶ τὴν στοιχειακὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν σπειροειδῆ κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος: κάθε ἀνάλυσις ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ὑψηλότερη σύνταξις, ἐνώ τὸ ἀποφατικὸν ὅριον παραμένει ἀναγκαῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232527102975Z_09957551","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 37–39","source_sha256":"bab4455ca6755b4f21a904290bd8b2430d23ef6409828a13b1ca59853e26c764","sha256":"2540850fdc5c7391ef53ca48b6ed13f51373d62415d900ad4ddb392d91b32cdc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:25:27.106255+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B01","text":"The principal problem is how the non-rational multitude passes into a cosmos of determinate bodies without difference being abolished.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B02","text":"Disorder is understood not as a final absence of form, but as an open phase toward distinction and ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B03","text":"Motion functions as a mechanism that separates unlike things, gathers like things together, and produces places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B04","text":"Cosmic construction analyzes bodies from depth into planes, triangles, solids, and elemental kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B05","text":"Geometry does not merely describe bodies, but determines their identity, affinity, and limits of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B06","text":"Natural variety is produced from finite forms and numerical compositions, not from infinite undifferentiated matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B07","text":"Change becomes possible only where there is a common elementary infrastructure, whereas dissimilarity inscribes forbidden transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_34:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AS-B08","text":"The course culminates in a finite and divinely ordered cosmic order, which the likely account supports without proving the highest foundations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Order arises through a process of distinction, gathering, and formation, not as an initial property of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Motion changes from seismic separation into a mechanism of geometrical production and later into a rule of transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Form and number constitute what a body is, and are not externally added to ready-made matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] The multiplicity of bodies is reduced to a few finite elementary types and to their quantitative arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The common geometrical infrastructure makes change possible, but does not permit universal change of everything into everything.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The unity of the cosmos is constituted through asymmetric affinity: three kinds partake in a common principle, whereas the fourth is excepted.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] The natural property of each kind is read as a correspondence of geometrical form, motion, base, and solidity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] The fifth constitution surpasses elemental classification and functions as an instrument for ordering the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Finite geometrical order leads toward one unified cosmos, but this unity rests on a likely judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The reduction of bodies to geometrical necessity stops before the highest principles, which remain beyond human demonstration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","text":"[Persistent] Generation and destruction are understood as dissolution and recomposition of forms, but only within restricted affinities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] The likely account connects mathematical necessity with an apophatic limit, so that explanation is precise concerning nearer matters and incomplete concerning the highest matters.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-01","text":"Disorder recurs initially as an unmeasured condition, later as the necessary background of order, and finally as an excluded final reality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-02","text":"Motion shifts from a cause of distinction to a condition of transformation and is then subordinated to the stability of bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_35:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-03","text":"The triangle recurs as an original type, as an element of composition, and as an infrastructure transformed into solids.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A8","CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-04","text":"Difference passes from spatial separation to geometrical dissimilarity and finally to a hierarchy of possible and impossible changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:D1","CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-05","text":"The identity of bodies ceases to signify self-sufficiency and becomes a temporary unity of recomposable elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-06","text":"Number rises from a descriptive measure to a generative rule and later to a teleological indication of cosmic unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-07","text":"Geometry shifts from an analytical method to an ontological criterion and finally to a divinely ordered arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RMD-08","text":"The aporia concerning the highest principles is not eliminated, but absorbed as a condition of the likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-01","text":"The seismic motion of the χώρα remains a mechanism of local cosmological description and does not alone constitute the universal principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-02","text":"The exact ratio of the two triangles and the construction of the equilateral figure are lower technical steps, not self-sufficient architectural laws.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-03","text":"The correspondence of tetrahedron, octahedron, icosahedron, and cube is scaled up into the general principle that form bears natural power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-04","text":"The common elementary nature bridges the three mutable kinds and connects local construction with the cosmic theory of transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-05","text":"The exception of the fourth kind overturns the local schema of universal change and becomes a universal restriction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-06","text":"The fifth constitution ceases to be merely another element and rises to the principle of unification of the all.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:CGD-07","text":"Local analytical geometry acquires a current-level function only when it is connected with divine arrangement and a limit of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-01","text":"A cosmos that was from the beginning fully ordered and unchanging is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-02","text":"Formless matter as the supreme substrate is rejected, because form is already inherent in the generation of bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-03","text":"Indiscriminately universal change is rejected, because affinity defines permissible transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-04","text":"The infinity of figures as an automatic condition of reality is rejected; the cosmic mechanism requires selection and finitude.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-05","text":"The reduction of natural difference to number without form, base, and motion is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:GNX-06","text":"The identification of mathematical possibility with natural existence is rejected, as likewise is the identification of the likely account with complete demonstration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_35:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-01","text":"Material unity cannot hold without internal differentiation, for unity is produced through distinct types.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-02","text":"Generation cannot be an indeterminate flow; numerical and geometrical necessity is required.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-03","text":"Form cannot be a passive covering of quantity, because it jointly determines the identity of what comes to be.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-04","text":"Cosmic order cannot be explained as automatic accumulation, because arrangement presupposes an ordering activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:DBN-05","text":"Human knowledge cannot demand one uniform level of demonstration for bodies and the highest foundations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-01","text":"The absence of absolutely unformed matter compels cosmology to begin from possibilities already capable of differentiation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-02","text":"The absence of a universal element preserves the real otherness of the kinds and renders change selective.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-03","text":"The absence of a complete reduction of difference to one order permits the coexistence of unity and irregularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-04","text":"The inability to demonstrate the highest principles does not dissolve the system, but provides it with an apophatic horizon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSA-05","text":"The unavailable absolute multiplicity of worlds brings out unity as an interpretative task and not as a bare numerical datum.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-01","text":"The disorder of the cosmogonic beginning and finite geometrical selection combine into a generative grammar, in which motion produces only determinate forms.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","CL_JP8E_13:GA-02","CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_33:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_34:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-02","text":"The common elementary infrastructure and the distinct solid form show that cosmic unity is produced through affinities, not through uniformity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_35:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-03","text":"The dissolution and recomposition of the three kindred kinds, combined with the exception of the cube, transforms destruction into restricted reconfiguration.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_34:D3","CH_JP8E_S_35:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-04","text":"The correspondence of geometrical figures to natural powers compels form to act as a natural cause and not as a mere symbol.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_33:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-05","text":"The finitude of solids and the fifth constitution connect mathematical necessity with the teleological arrangement of the whole.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_35:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:XD-06","text":"The selection of one cosmos does not follow necessarily from geometry, but from the conjunction of finitude and the likely account.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-01","text":"The cosmos is reconstructed as a finite generative grammar that produces difference through combinations and not through infinitely many independent substances.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-04","CL_JP8E_13:XD-01","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-02","text":"Difference is not simply opposed to unity; unity consists precisely of regulated differentiations and forbidden transitions.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-06","CL_JP8E_13:XD-02","CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_34:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-03","text":"The time of bodies becomes a time of composition and dissolution, but not of unlimited reversibility; geometrical affinity marks the limits of becoming.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-05","CL_JP8E_13:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-04","text":"Cosmic unity is simultaneously mathematical structure, divine choice, and interpretative judgment, so that none of these suffices alone.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CL_JP8E_13:GA-09","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_35:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_35:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-05","text":"Knowledge acquires gradations: geometrical necessity explains nearer matters, whereas the divine principle defines the inaccessible limit.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-10","CL_JP8E_13:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_33:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:BSD-06","text":"Reality is defined as the internal arrangement of forms under divine ordering, not as an aggregate of inert bodies.","refs":["CL_JP8E_13:GA-01","CL_JP8E_13:GA-03","CL_JP8E_13:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-01","text":"Disorder → motion → distinction → gathering → form; the produced form reinterprets the initial disorder as a vestibule of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-02","text":"Triangles → solids → elemental kinds → natural powers → cosmic arrangement; analysis returns as composition of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-03","text":"The recurrence of change changes phase: from a universal hypothesis it becomes a restricted possibility of kindred kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-04","text":"Geometry becomes a mechanism when the number of elements and their arrangement produce kind, motion, and change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-05","text":"The fifth constitution functions as an attractive pole, because it transfers the system from classification of the elements to arrangement of the all.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:RLE-06","text":"The likely account constitutes a final loop: necessity produces explanation, but explanation indicates the limit of necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B01","text":"A non-rational and unmeasured multitude becomes a moving χώρα, which permits distinction of unlike things and gathering of like things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B02","text":"Spatial differentiation is transformed into the selection of finite geometrical types and numerical compositions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B03","text":"The analytical scale body → depth → plane → triangles reveals the common infrastructure of different bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B04","text":"The common infrastructure produces three kindred kinds, whereas the proper elementary form of the fourth defines the forbidden transition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B05","text":"The solid form carries geometrical difference into natural property and subsequently into elemental correspondence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FGS-B06","text":"The fifth constitution and the likely account unify finite morphology into one divinely ordered whole, leaving open the highest grounding.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B01","text":"Disordered multitude → seismic distinction → spatial allocation → numerical and geometrical order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B02","text":"Numerical order → finite elementary types → composition of solids → distinction of kindred and unrelated kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B03","text":"Solid geometry → natural correspondence → cubic stability of earth → hierarchy of elemental powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B04","text":"Recomposition of kindred forms → restricted change → exclusion of universal reversibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:AFM-B05","text":"Fifth constitution → divine cosmic arrangement → one cosmos according to the likely account → apophatic limit of knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-01","text":"Matter is reclassified from an indeterminate substrate into a measurable, formed, and transformable composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-02","text":"The opposition of identity and difference collapses, because bodies are preserved as forms of recomposable elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-03","text":"Generation and destruction are transformed from opposite events into different directions of the same geometrical process.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-04","text":"The distinction of the elements becomes a distinction of rhythms of motion, bases, forms, and possible changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-05","text":"Divine ordering shifts from external imposition to the internal activity of forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MME-06","text":"Scientific method is redefined as graded demonstration, combining geometrical necessity with a controlled likely account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface level:** The four kinds receive distinct regular solids, whose forms and bases indicate their natural properties.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural level:** Cosmic order constitutes a network of distinction, composition, correspondence, and restricted change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic level:** The account replaces vague universal generation with graduated reduction and controlled exclusive classification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal level:** Being becomes a finite formed order, whose time unfolds dissolutions and compositions within immovable limits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative level:** Explanation itself imitates its object, analyzing the whole into elements and reuniting them into cosmic arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-01","text":"Geometrical necessity appears to ground generation, but divine arrangement remains necessary for final ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-02","text":"Finite geometry supports one cosmos, but does not logically exclude a multiplicity of worlds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-03","text":"The common infrastructure requires unity of change, while the exception of the fourth kind preserves asymmetric difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:FL-04","text":"Analysis into extreme geometrical elements approaches grounding, but leaves unclear the principle of the elements themselves.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-01","text":"Disorder mutates from a negative condition into a preparatory potential of ordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-02","text":"Change mutates from a hypothesis of universal flow into a hierarchized possibility of kindred bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-03","text":"Geometry mutates from a language of description into an ontological mechanism, and subsequently into teleological cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MP-04","text":"The fifth constitution mutates from an indeterminate fifth figure into a principle of unification of the all.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-01","text":"Reality is a mechanism of seismic distinction, geometrical composition, and divine reordering.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-02","text":"The body is a temporary and recomposable configuration of elements, whose identity depends on form and number.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-03","text":"Time is circular with respect to dissolution and composition, but linear with respect to ascent from disorder into cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_34:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:HSI-04","text":"The possible navigation of the account extends as far as geometrical necessity, but the ultimate foundation remains divine and inaccessible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstructing the movement from disorder, through geometrical composition, into elemental and cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B02","text":"The complete nature of the fifth constitution, the exact grounding of the triangles, and the exclusive reason for the one cosmos remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B03","text":"The system is coherent insofar as concerns geometrical production, restricted change, and elemental correspondence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_13:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual spiral movement of the system: every analysis returns as a higher arrangement, while the apophatic limit remains necessary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_33:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_35:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_13@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_13:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 37–39"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 37–39","context":"Section 53 · Section 54 · Section 55","original_title":"Chapters 37–39","original_context":"Section 53 · Section 54 · Section 55"},"original_title":"Chapters 37–39","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 40–42","order":14,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_36","CH_JP8E_S_37","CH_JP8E_S_38"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_14@R001","sha256":"4c46b8fd5bfbf4f507ab68ba82f0979a15f19e845e10e0a21ef90692d38cbcb6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἀποδώσῃ τὰς αἰσθητὰς φυσικὰς διαφορὰς εἰς ἀόρατον γεωμετρικὴν καὶ ἀριθμητικὴν σύστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-02","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ σύστασις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν μεγεθῶν, κινήσεων, συγγενειῶν καὶ δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-03","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀφανισμὸς καὶ γίγνονται διάλυσις, ἀντιμαχία, ἀφομοίωσις καὶ ἀνασύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνομοιότης καὶ ἡ ἀνισότης καθίστανται οἱ παραγωγικοὶ ὅροι τῆς κινήσεως, ἐνῷ ἡ ὁμαλότης περιορίζεται εἰς στάσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-05","text":"Τὸ κενὸν ἀποκλείεται, ὥστε ἡ κίνησις νὰ παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς πιέσεως, συμπιέσεως καὶ κυκλοφορίας τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-06","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ ταυτότης διατηρεῖται μόνον ὡς προσωρινὴ σχέσις ἀναλογιῶν, δυνάμεων, τόπων καὶ διαλυτῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-07","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ φορά τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι κυκλοτερής· ἡ τάξις διασῴζεται διὰ τῆς ἀδιαλείπτου ἀναπαραγωγῆς διαφορῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ σύστασις τῶν μερῶν παράγει τὴν κίνησιν, τὸ μέγεθος, τὴν ὀξύτητα, τὴν πυκνότητα καὶ τὴν ἐλαφρότητα τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φυσικὴ ταυτότης οὐκ ἔστιν ἀκίνητος ὕλη, ἀλλὰ κανὼν προσωρινῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀνομοιότης καὶ ἡ ἀνισότης εἰσάγουσι δύναμιν, ἀντιμαχίαν καὶ κίνησιν εἰς τὸ φυσικόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ ὁρατὸν σῶμα ἀποτελεῖ μακροκλίμακα συνάθροισιν ἀοράτων μερῶν καὶ σχημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ μεταβολὴ ἀκολουθεῖ κύκλον διαλύσεως, νίκης, ἀφομοιώσεως, διαφυγῆς καὶ νέας συγκροτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὁμαλότης εἶναι πρόσκαιρος κατάστασις στάσεως, ἥτις δύναται νὰ λυθῇ καὶ νὰ μετατραπῇ εἰς ῥοήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ καθιστᾷ τὴν καθολικὴν κίνησιν ἀλληλοεξαρτωμένην καὶ κυκλοφοροῦσαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ τόπος οὐκ εἶναι παθητικὸν περιέχον, ἀλλὰ μηχανισμὸς διανομῆς καὶ μεταφορᾶς τῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις συνίσταται ἐκ συντονισμοῦ ἀναλογίας, ἀνάγκης, διαφορᾶς καὶ ἀναπαραγομένης κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ σταθερότης οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀποτελέσῃ τελικὸν σκοπόν, διότι ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ διαρκῆ μεταβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] Τὰ στοιχεῖα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἀπολύτως κεχωρισμένα γένη εἰς διαβαθμίσεις λεπτότητος, μεγέθους, πυκνότητος καὶ κενότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ὕπαρξις ἑκάστου στοιχείου ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σχέσεις συγγενείας, ἀντιμαχίας, τόπου καὶ ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ γεωμετρικὴ ἀναγωγὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀπόδοσιν ἰδιοτήτων εἰς τὴν παραγωγὴν πολλαπλῶν φυσικῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_38:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ ταυτότης ἐπιμένει ὡς ἀναλογία, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει λειτουργίαν ἀπὸ σταθερὸν κανόνα εἰς σχεσιακὴν ἰσορροπίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία τῶν στοιχείων μεταλλάσσεται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν δυνάμεων, ὅπου ἡ νίκη καὶ ἡ ἥττα καθορίζουσι τὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_37:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ θεία ἀνάγκη τοῦ πρώτου συστήματος ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν φυσικὴν ἀνάγκην πιέσεων, συγγενειῶν καὶ διαφορῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A11","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια μετακινείται ἀπὸ ἀπλὸν κανόνα ἐπανασυστάσεως εἰς τέλος διαλύσεως καὶ κριτήριον χωρικῆς φοράς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις διευρύνεται: ἀρχικῶς σημαίνει ἀριθμητικὴν διαίρεσιν, ἔπειτα δὲ περιλαμβάνει μάχην, κατασβέσιν, διαφυγὴν καὶ ἀφομοίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-07","text":"Ὁ τόπος μετατίθεται ἀπὸ ἀδρανὲς πλαίσιον εἰς δραστικὸν παράγοντα, ὅστις διασπείρει καὶ ἐπαναδιανέμει τὰ γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης ἀντιστρέφεται: ἀπὸ ὅρον κοσμικῆς τάξεως γίνεται ὅρος ἀκινησίας, ὃν ἡ ἀνωμαλότης πρέπει νὰ διαρρήξῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-09","text":"Ἡ ἀόρατος μικροδομὴ παραμένει θεμέλιον, ἀλλὰ ἡ λειτουργία της μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ ἐξήγησιν ἑνὸς στοιχείου εἰς παραγωγὴν κοσμικῆς ποικιλίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-10","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀντιστοιχία τῶν τριγώνων πρὸς τὰ εἴδη ἀποσύρεται ὡς ὑποκαθορισμένη, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαῖος κεντρικὸς ὑπόβαθμος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀριθμητικὴ ἀναλογία τῶν στοιχειακῶν μερῶν παραμένει τοπικὴ τεχνική, ἐνῷ ἡ ταυτότης ὡς κανὼν ἀνασυνθέσεως κλιμακοῦται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστοιχία ἑνὸς συγκεκριμένου γεωμετρικοῦ σχήματος πρὸς ἓν στοιχεῖον δὲν ἀποτελεῖ καθολικὸν συμπέρασμα, ἀλλὰ ὑπόβαθρον τῆς γενικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ σχέσις ἀνομοιότητος καὶ ἀντιμαχίας γεφυροῖ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν μικροδομὴν καὶ τὴν μακροσκοπικὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ συνδέει τὰ τοπικὰ πάθη τῶν σωμάτων μὲ τὴν καθολικὴν κυκλοφορίαν τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ θεία διάταξις ἀνήκει κυρίως εἰς τὸ κατώτερον κοσμολογικὸν πλαίσιον, ἀλλὰ ἀνακωδικοποιεῖται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχή, οὐχὶ ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ ἐπέμβασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις πυρός, ἀέρος, ὕδατος καὶ γῆς γίνεται κατώτερον παράδειγμα γενικωτέρας διαβαθμίσεως μορφῶν, μεγεθῶν καὶ πυκνοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς στάσεως κλιμακοῦται ἀπὸ συγκεκριμένης ἕξεως εἰς μεταβατὴν φάσιν ἐντὸς κυκλοφορίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D6","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-08","text":"Ἡ ἁπλὴ περιγραφὴ τῶν αἰσθητῶν ποιοτήτων καθίσταται ἀνεπαρκής· ἀπαιτεῖται σύστημα μορφῆς, σχέσεως, κινήσεως καὶ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ στοιχεῖον ἔχει ταυτότητα ἀνεξάρτητον ἀπὸ μορφήν, μέγεθος, κίνησιν καὶ σχέσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ μεταβολὴ ὡς ἄτακτος ποιοτικὴ ἀλλαγή, ἀφανισμὸς ἢ γένεσις ἐκ μηδενός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὁμοιότης ὡς αἰτία κινήσεως· ἡ καθαρὰ ὁμαλότης ἀκινητοποιεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ὁ τόπος ὡς κενὸν καὶ ἀδιάφορον δοχεῖον, ἐπειδὴ ἡ χωρικὴ διάταξις συμμετέχει εἰς τὴν κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις τῶν γενῶν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ συμπίεσις καὶ ἡ διείσδυσις ἀνασυνδέουσιν αὐτά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ σταθερότης ὡς τελικὴ ἐξήγησις, διότι ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀναπαραγομένην ἀνωμαλίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-01","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις δὲν δύναται νὰ ἐρείδεται εἰς ἄμορφον ὕλην, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕλη ἤδη φέρει ἀριθμητὴν καὶ γεωμετρικὴν διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-02","text":"Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ δὲν ἐπιτρέπεται νὰ νοηθῶσιν ὡς ἀσυνεχεῖς ἐκρήξεις, ἀλλὰ ὡς μεταβολαὶ διατηρουμένης σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-03","text":"Ἡ κίνησις δὲν ἐξηγεῖται ἀπὸ μίαν μόνην γεωμετρικὴν μορφήν, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνισότητα, πάθος, τόπον καὶ κινούμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ συνοχή δὲν δύναται νὰ ἐπιβληθῇ ἔξωθεν ἐναντίον τῆς φύσεως, ἀλλὰ πρέπει νὰ πραγματοῦται διὰ τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος ὁμοιογένεια δὲν δύναται νὰ παράγῃ μεταβολήν, ἐπειδὴ στερεῖται διακρίσεως κινοῦντος καὶ κινουμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-06","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστήμη δὲν δύναται νὰ μείνῃ ἐπὶ τῆς αἰσθητῆς ἐπιφανείας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ φαινομένη ἑνότης ἀποτελεῖ προϊόν ἀοράτων σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης κόσμου ὅπου τὰ στοιχεῖα ὑπάρχουσιν ἄνευ ἀριθμοῦ, μορφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἀκινητοποιημένης ἑτερότητος, διότι ἡ διαφορά ἐνεργεῖ ὡς ἀρχὴ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης κενοῦ ἀποκεχωρισμένου ἀπὸ τὴν καθολικὴν κυκλοφορίαν, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα θέσις ἀνήκει εἰς δίκτυον πιέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης τελικῆς σταθερότητος· ἡ διατήρησις τῆς τάξεως προϋποθέτει τὴν ἀδιάλειπτον γένεσιν ἀνωμαλίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπούσα δυνατότης εἶναι κόσμος ὅπου τάξις καὶ μεταβολὴ ἀλληλοαναιροῦνται· ἐνταῦθα ἡ τάξις παράγεται διὰ μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-01","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ μορφὴ γίνεται πραγματικῶς γενεσιουργός μόνον ὅταν ἡ ἀριθμητικὴ διαφορά μετατραπῇ εἰς ἀσύμμετρον δύναμιν καὶ ἀντιμαχίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-01","CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης ὡς κανὼν ἀνασυνθέσεως καὶ ἡ νίκη ὡς ἀφομοίωσις συνενώνονται εἰς μοντέλον ὅπου τὸ ὂν διατηρεῖται μεταβαλλόμενον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-02","CL_JP8E_14:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_37:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνομοιότης παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὴ διαφορά καὶ γίνεται μηχανισμὸς ἀναδιανομῆς τόπων, γενῶν καὶ κινήσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης καὶ ἡ κυκλοφορία συνδέονται ἀναστρόφως: ἡ πρώτη συγκρατεῖ τὴν κίνησιν τοπικῶς, ἡ δὲ δεύτερα διασώζει τὴν τάξιν καθολικῶς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_38:AS7","CH_JP8E_S_38:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ μετατρέπει τὴν τοπικὴν μεταβολὴν εἰς καθολικὴν ἀλληλεξάρτησιν, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα μετακίνησις ἀναδιατάσσει τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_38:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-06","text":"Ἡ στοιχειακὴ ἱεραρχία καὶ ἡ διαβάθμισις λεπτότητος συγχωνεύονται εἰς συνεχὲς πεδίον, ὅπου τὰ γένη διαφέρουσι κατὰ βαθμόν, οὐχὶ κατὰ ἀπόλυτον ἀποκοπήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","CL_JP8E_14:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-07","text":"Ἡ θεία ἀναλογία καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ ἀνάγκη ἀνασυντίθενται ὡς ἓν σύστημα, ὅπου ἡ τάξις δὲν ἐξουδετερώνει τὴν ἀνάγκην ἀλλὰ τὴν ἐνεργοποιεῖ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ μορφὴ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι τάξις ἥτις ἀναπαράγει τὸν ἑαυτῆς ὅρον, δηλαδή τὴν διαφοράν, τὴν πίεσιν καὶ τὴν μεταβολήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","CL_JP8E_14:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ φύσις ἀναφαίνεται ὡς αὐτοπαραγόμενον πεδίον, ἐν ᾧ ἡ γεωμετρικὴ διαφορά, ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ χωρικὴ κίνησις ἀποτελοῦσιν ἕνα μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν σωμάτων μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ οὐσίαν εἰς ἐπιτελούμενον ἀποτέλεσμα ἀντιμαχίας, συγγενείας καὶ ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς φύσεως δὲν εἶναι γραμμικὴ μετάβασις ἀπὸ γένεσιν εἰς φθοράν, ἀλλὰ κύκλος διαλύσεως καὶ ἐπανασυστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ ἕνα ἀρχικὸν κινοῦν εἰς δίκτυον ἀλληλοκινήσεων, πιέσεων, τόπων καὶ μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις καθίσταται δυναμικὴ στρατηγική διατηρήσεως, ἣ ἀποφεύγει καὶ τὴν ἀκινησίαν καὶ τὸ ἄτακτον χάος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐπιστήμη ὀφείλει νὰ ἀναγινώσκῃ τὰ φαινόμενα ὡς ἀποτελέσματα σχέσεων καὶ μεταβάσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἀπομονωμένα πράγματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ σταθερὰ μορφὴ ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς φάσις ἐντὸς ἀδιάλειπτης ροῆς, ἄρα ἡ διατήρησις καὶ ἡ μεταβολὴ παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀπόλυτοι ἀντίθετοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-01","text":"Γεωμετρικὴ διαφορά → ἀσύμμετρος δύναμις → ἀντιμαχία → διάλυσις → νέα γεωμετρικὴ σύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-02","text":"Ὁμαλότης → στάσις → εἴσοδος διαλυτικῆς δυνάμεως → ἀνωμαλότης → κίνησις → νέα ὁμαλότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-03","text":"Ἀνομοιότης → ἀφομοίωσις ἢ διαφυγή → ἀλλαγὴ τόπου → προσωρινὴ συγγένεια → νέα ἀνομοιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ ἐγκλείει τὴν κίνησιν εἰς κυκλοτερῆ βρόχον, ὅπου ἡ μεταβολὴ ἑνὸς τόπου ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀναδιάταξιν πάντων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ ἱεραρχία τῶν στοιχείων κλιμακοῦται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν δυνάμεων, καὶ ἔπειτα ἐπιστρέφει ὡς διαβάθμισις λεπτότητος καὶ πυκνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς διαλύσεως δὲν εἶναι ἀπλὴ κυκλικότης, ἀλλὰ μεταβολὴ φάσεως ἀπὸ ἀριθμητικὴν σύστασιν εἰς κοσμικὴν κυκλοφορίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-07","text":"Ὁ κύριος ἐλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ τάξις διασῴζεται μόνον ὅταν ἀναπαράγῃ τὴν διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B01","text":"Γεωμετρικὴ καὶ ἀριθμητικὴ διαφορά → διαφορετικὴ κίνησις, μέγεθος, πυκνότης καὶ ὀξύτης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B02","text":"Διαφορά μεγεθῶν καὶ σχημάτων → ἀνομοιότης → ἀσύμμετρος δύναμις → ἀντιμαχία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B03","text":"Ἀντιμαχία → διάλυσις τοῦ ἧττονος → ἀφομοίωσις ἢ διαφυγὴ πρὸς συγγενῆ τόπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B04","text":"Διάλυσις καὶ μεταφορά → ἀνασύνθεσις μερῶν → μεταβολὴ στοιχειακῆς μορφῆς καὶ ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B05","text":"Ἀνισότης μερῶν καὶ διακένων → συμπίεσις → ἀπουσία κενοῦ → ἀλληλοεξαρτωμένη κυκλοφορία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B06","text":"Ὁμαλότης → στάσις· διάλυσις ὁμαλότητος → ἀνωμαλότης → κίνησις καὶ ῥοή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B07","text":"Κυκλοτερὴς κίνησις → ἀναπαραγωγὴ διαφορῶν → διατήρησις τάξεως διὰ συνεχῶς μεταβαλλομένων συνθέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B01","text":"Αἰσθητὴ διαφορά → γεωμετρικὴ ἀναγωγή → στοιχειακὴ ἱεράρχησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B02","text":"Ἱεράρχησις → ἀνομοιότης καὶ ἀσύμμετρος δύναμις → ἀντιμαχία καὶ διάλυσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B03","text":"Διάλυσις → ἀφομοίωσις ἢ διαφυγή → ἀνασύνθεσις καὶ μεταβολὴ στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B04","text":"Ἀνασύνθεσις → διαφορὰ μεγεθῶν καὶ διακένων → πίεσις, διείσδυσις καὶ χωρικὴ μεταφορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B05","text":"Χωρικὴ μεταφορά → διαρκὴς ἀνωμαλότης → κίνησις ἥτις αὐτοσυντηρεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B06","text":"Διαρκὴς κίνησις → κυκλοτερὴς τάξις → σταθερότης ὡς πρόσκαιρος φάσις ἐντὸς ἀδιαλείπτου μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-01","text":"Τὰ στοιχεῖα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ὑλικὰ γένη εἰς δυναμικὰ πεδία γεωμετρικῶν καὶ σχεσιακῶν διαφορών.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μικροκλίμακος καὶ μακροκλίμακος μεταβάλλει τὸ κριτήριον τῆς σωματικῆς ὑπάρξεως: τὸ ὁρατὸν εἶναι παραγόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-03","text":"Ἡ μεταστοιχείωσις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀνασύνθεσις σχέσεων, ὥστε ἡ μεταβολὴ νὰ μὴν ἀπαιτῇ ἀφανισμὸν τοῦ ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-04","text":"Ὁ τόπος μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ πλαίσιον εἰς ἐνεργὸν συντελεστὴν παραγωγῆς καὶ κατανομῆς τῶν σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἀναγκαῖον ἀποτέλεσμα ἀνισότητος, οὐχὶ ὡς ἐξωτερικὸν συμβεβηκός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-06","text":"Ἡ στάσις καὶ ἡ κίνησις παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀπόλυτοι πόλοι καὶ γίνονται ἀναστρέψιμοι καταστάσεις τῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-07","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἀντίπαλος τῆς τάξεως εἰς τὸ ὑλικὸν μέσον δι’ οὗ ἡ τάξις ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα ἐξηγεῖ τὰς διαφορὰς κινήσεως, μεγέθους, πυκνότητος, ὀξύτητος καὶ ῥοῆς τῶν στοιχείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, τὰ φαινόμενα ὀργανώνονται διὰ γεωμετρικῶν μερῶν, συγγενείας, ἀντιμαχίας, διακένων, πιέσεως καὶ χωρικῆς διανομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἀπορία περὶ τῆς φύσεως μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν περιγραφὴν πραγμάτων εἰς τὴν ἀνασύστασιν μηχανισμῶν μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ ὂν εἶναι διαρκῶς μεταβαλλομένη σύνθεσις, ἧς ἡ τάξις συντηρεῖται διὰ κυκλικῆς γενέσεως διαφορῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ ἐπιστήμη ὀφείλει νὰ συνδέῃ μορφήν, μέγεθος, πλῆθος, κίνησιν, στάσιν καὶ τόπον εἰς ἓν σχεσιακὸν ὑπόδειγμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θεία ἀναλογία παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἐγγυήτρια τάξεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ μεταγενεστέρα μηχανὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν ἀνωμαλίαν· ἡ τάξις ἄρα δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ ὁμαλότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις τῶν στοιχείων ἀπειλεῖται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναγκαίαν διείσδυσιν καὶ ἀλληλομεταφοράν τους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης ὀφείλει νὰ παραμένῃ ἀναγνωρίσιμος, ἐνῷ συγχρόνως ὁρίζεται διὰ συνεχῶν μεταβολῶν· ἡ ἀντίφασις αὕτη εἶναι συστατική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ ἐξηγεῖ τὴν καθολικὴν κίνησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἐν μέρει ἀδιευκρίνιστον τὸν ἀκριβῆ τρόπον τῆς κυκλοφορίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ἀρχὴν διατάξεως εἰς ἐσωτερικὸν ὅρον πιέσεως, διαλύσεως καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-02","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ κριτήριον ὁμοιότητος εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἀνακατανομῆς καὶ ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ὁμαλότης μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἔννοιαν τάξεως εἰς πρόσκαιρον ἀκινησίαν, ἣν ἡ φυσικὴ δύναμις δύναται πάντοτε νὰ λύσῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-04","text":"Ἡ γεωμετρικὴ μορφὴ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ στατικὸν ὑπόβαθρον ἰδιοτήτων εἰς ἐνεργὸν μηχανισμόν παραγωγῆς ποικιλίας καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ὑπονοεῖ ὅτι ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι κυκλοτερὴς μηχανὴ συμπιέσεως, διαλύσεως, μεταφορᾶς καὶ ἀνασυστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ φυσικὸν ὑποκείμενον δὲν εἶναι αὐτοτελὴς οὐσία, ἀλλὰ κόμβος σχέσεων, δυνάμεων, τόπων καὶ προσωρινῶν μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι ἐπαναληπτικὸς καὶ παραγωγικός· ἕκαστος κύκλος διαλύσεως ἀναπαράγει τὰς προϋποθέσεις τοῦ ἑπομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ μόνη δυνατὴ ἐλευθερία ἐντὸς τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ἀνακατεύθυνσις δυνάμεων διὰ διαφυγῆς, ἀφομοιώσεως, μεταφορᾶς καὶ νέας συνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ τῆς γεωμετρικῆς διαφορᾶς, τῆς ἀνισότητος, τῆς ἀντιμαχίας, τῆς ἀπουσίας κενοῦ καὶ τῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κύριας μηχανῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν, ἀπὸ τὴν αἰσθητὴν διαφοράν καὶ τὴν γεωμετρικὴν ἀναγωγὴν μέχρι τὴν κυκλοτερῆ μεταβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς γένεσις τῶν τριγώνων, ἡ πλήρης λειτουργία τῶν γενῶν καὶ ὁ μηχανισμὸς τῆς θείας πειθοῦς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὁμαλότης, ἡ ἀνωμαλότης, ἡ κίνησις καὶ ἡ ἀνασύνθεσις ἐνεργοῦσιν ὡς ἀλληλοτροφοδοτούμενος κύκλος· ἡ ἀξιωματικὴ συμπίεσις ὅμως ἀφήνει τὴν ἐμπειρικὴν λεπτομέρειαν ἀνυπόκαυστον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232557036705Z_a663f3cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 40–42","source_sha256":"4c46b8fd5bfbf4f507ab68ba82f0979a15f19e845e10e0a21ef90692d38cbcb6","sha256":"2dec8a703abe7482b4a7504b01444e74db59d21fcfbefac51e3ef9c00c146e88","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:25:57.039155+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-01","text":"The system seeks to reduce sensible natural differences to an invisible geometrical and numerical constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-02","text":"The geometrical constitution is transformed into a hierarchy of magnitudes, motions, affinities, and powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-03","text":"Generation and destruction cease to be annihilation and become dissolution, conflict, assimilation, and reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-04","text":"Dissimilarity and inequality become the productive conditions of motion, while uniformity is restricted to rest.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-05","text":"Void is excluded, so that motion is produced from the internal pressure, compression, and circulation of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-06","text":"Elemental identity is preserved only as a temporary relation of proportions, powers, places, and dissoluble parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:SP-07","text":"The system's final direction is circular; order is preserved through the uninterrupted reproduction of differences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The geometrical constitution of parts produces the motion, magnitude, sharpness, density, and lightness of bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Natural identity is not immobile matter, but a rule of temporary reconstitution of relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Dissimilarity and inequality introduce power, conflict, and motion into nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The visible body constitutes a macroscopic aggregation of invisible parts and shapes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Change follows a cycle of dissolution, victory, assimilation, escape, and new formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Uniformity is a temporary condition of rest, which can be dissolved and transformed into flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] The absence of void renders universal motion interdependent and circulating.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Place is not a passive container, but a mechanism for the distribution and transport of kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Cosmic order consists in the coordination of proportion, necessity, difference, and reproduced motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Stability cannot constitute a final end, because order requires continual change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-11","text":"[Mutating] The elements are reclassified from absolutely separate kinds into gradations of fineness, magnitude, density, and voidness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The existence of each element depends upon relations of affinity, conflict, place, and reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-01","text":"The initial geometrical reduction recurs, but is displaced from the attribution of properties to the production of multiple natural forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_38:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-02","text":"Elemental identity persists as proportion, but changes function from a fixed rule into a relational equilibrium.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-03","text":"The hierarchy of elements mutates into a hierarchy of powers, in which victory and defeat determine change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_37:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-04","text":"The divine necessity of the first system is absorbed into an internal natural necessity of pressures, affinities, and differences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A11","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-05","text":"Affinity shifts from a simple rule of reconstitution into an end of dissolution and a criterion of spatial direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-06","text":"Dissolution is expanded: initially it signifies numerical division, but thereafter includes battle, extinction, escape, and assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A12","CH_JP8E_S_37:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-07","text":"Place is displaced from an inert framework into an active factor, which disperses and redistributes the kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-08","text":"Uniformity is reversed: from a condition of cosmic order it becomes a condition of immobility, which irregularity must rupture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-09","text":"Invisible microstructure remains the foundation, but its function shifts from explaining one element to producing cosmic variety.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RMD-10","text":"The exact correspondence of triangles to kinds is withdrawn as underdetermined, but retained as a necessary central background.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-01","text":"The exact numerical proportion of elemental parts remains a local technique, while identity as a rule of reconstitution is scaled up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-02","text":"The correspondence of one specific geometrical shape to one element does not constitute a universal conclusion, but a background to general change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A7","CH_JP8E_S_37:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-03","text":"The relation of dissimilarity and conflict bridges geometrical microstructure and macroscopic generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-04","text":"The absence of void connects the local affections of bodies with the universal circulation of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-05","text":"Divine arrangement belongs chiefly to the lower cosmological framework, but is recoded as internal coherence, not as external intervention.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-06","text":"The distinction of fire, air, water, and earth becomes a lower example of a more general gradation of forms, magnitudes, and densities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:A8","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-07","text":"The concept of rest is scaled up from a specific state into a transitory phase within circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D6","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:CGD-08","text":"The simple description of sensible qualities becomes inadequate; a system of form, relation, motion, and time is required.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-01","text":"The idea that the element has an identity independent of form, magnitude, motion, and relation is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-02","text":"Change as disorderly qualitative alteration, annihilation, or generation from nothing is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-03","text":"Similarity as a cause of motion is rejected; pure uniformity immobilizes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-04","text":"Place as an empty and indifferent receptacle is rejected, because spatial arrangement participates in motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-05","text":"The absolute distinction of kinds is rejected, because compression and penetration reconnect them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:GNX-06","text":"Stability as a final explanation is rejected, because order requires reproduced irregularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-01","text":"Natural order cannot rest upon formless matter, because matter already bears numerical and geometrical difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-02","text":"Generation and destruction must not be conceived as discontinuous eruptions, but as changes of a preserved relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-03","text":"Motion is not explained by a single geometrical form, but requires inequality, affection, place, and that which is moved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-04","text":"Cosmic coherence cannot be imposed externally against nature, but must be realized through internal affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-05","text":"Absolute homogeneity cannot produce change, because it lacks the distinction between mover and moved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:DBN-06","text":"Science cannot remain at the sensible surface, because apparent unity is the product of invisible relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-01","text":"The possibility of a world in which elements exist without number, form, motion, and λόγος is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-02","text":"The possibility of immobilized otherness is absent, because difference operates as a principle of motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-03","text":"The possibility of a void separated from universal circulation is absent, because every position belongs to a network of pressures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-04","text":"The possibility of final stability is absent; the preservation of order presupposes the uninterrupted generation of irregularity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSA-05","text":"The deepest absent possibility is a world in which order and change mutually negate one another; here order is produced through change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-01","text":"Geometrical form becomes genuinely generative only when numerical difference is transformed into asymmetrical power and conflict.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-01","CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_36:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-02","text":"Identity as a rule of reconstitution and victory as assimilation are united in a model in which being is preserved while changing.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-02","CL_JP8E_14:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_36:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_37:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-03","text":"Dissimilarity ceases to be a mere difference and becomes a mechanism for the redistribution of places, kinds, and motions.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_37:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_37:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-04","text":"Uniformity and circulation are inversely connected: the former locally restrains motion, whereas the latter universally preserves order.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_38:AS7","CH_JP8E_S_38:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-05","text":"The absence of void transforms local change into universal interdependence, because every displacement rearranges the whole.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-07","CL_JP8E_14:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_38:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-06","text":"Elemental hierarchy and the gradation of fineness merge into a continuous field, in which kinds differ by degree, not by absolute separation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-06","CL_JP8E_14:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_38:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-07","text":"Divine proportion and natural necessity are reconstituted as one system, in which order does not neutralize necessity but activates it.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","CL_JP8E_14:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_36:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:XD-08","text":"The final form of the system is an order that reproduces its own condition, namely difference, pressure, and change.","refs":["CL_JP8E_14:GA-09","CL_JP8E_14:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-01","text":"Nature appears as a self-producing field, in which geometrical difference, power, and spatial motion constitute one mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-02","text":"The identity of bodies changes from substance into an effected result of conflict, affinity, and reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-03","text":"The time of nature is not a linear transition from generation to destruction, but a cycle of dissolution and reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-04","text":"Causality is transferred from one initial mover to a network of mutual motions, pressures, places, and changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-05","text":"Cosmic order becomes a dynamic strategy of preservation, which avoids both immobility and disorderly chaos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-06","text":"Natural science must read phenomena as results of relations and transitions, not as isolated things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:BSD-07","text":"Stable form is recognized as a phase within uninterrupted flow; therefore preservation and change cease to be absolute opposites.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-01","text":"Geometrical difference → asymmetrical power → conflict → dissolution → new geometrical constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-02","text":"Uniformity → rest → entry of dissolving power → irregularity → motion → new uniformity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-03","text":"Dissimilarity → assimilation or escape → change of place → temporary affinity → new dissimilarity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-04","text":"The absence of void encloses motion in a circular loop, in which the change of one place requires the rearrangement of all.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-05","text":"The initial hierarchy of elements is scaled up into a hierarchy of powers, and then returns as a gradation of fineness and density.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-06","text":"The repetition of dissolution is not mere cyclicity, but a change of phase from numerical constitution to cosmic circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:RLE-07","text":"The system's principal attractive pole is the principle that order is preserved only when it reproduces difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B01","text":"Geometrical and numerical difference → different motion, magnitude, density, and sharpness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B02","text":"Difference of magnitudes and shapes → dissimilarity → asymmetrical power → conflict.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B03","text":"Conflict → dissolution of the weaker → assimilation or escape toward an affiliated place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B04","text":"Dissolution and transport → reconstitution of parts → change of elemental form and identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B05","text":"Inequality of parts and interstices → compression → absence of void → interdependent circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B06","text":"Uniformity → rest; dissolution of uniformity → irregularity → motion and flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FGS-B07","text":"Circular motion → reproduction of differences → preservation of order through continuously changing compositions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B01","text":"Sensible difference → geometrical reduction → elemental hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B02","text":"Hierarchy → dissimilarity and asymmetrical power → conflict and dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B03","text":"Dissolution → assimilation or escape → reconstitution and transformation of elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B04","text":"Reconstitution → difference of magnitudes and interstices → pressure, penetration, and spatial transport.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B05","text":"Spatial transport → continual irregularity → self-sustaining motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:AFM-B06","text":"Continual motion → circular order → stability as a temporary phase within uninterrupted change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-01","text":"The elements are reclassified from material kinds into dynamic fields of geometrical and relational differences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-02","text":"The distinction between micro-scale and macro-scale changes the criterion of bodily existence: the visible is produced.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-03","text":"Transmutation is recognized as a reconstitution of relations, so that change need not require annihilation of the subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-04","text":"Place is transformed from a framework into an active agent in the production and distribution of bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-05","text":"Motion is recognized as a necessary result of inequality, not as an external accident.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-06","text":"Rest and motion cease to be absolute poles and become reversible conditions of constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MME-07","text":"Necessity is transformed from an opponent of order into the material means through which order operates.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the system explains the differences of motion, magnitude, density, sharpness, and flow of the elements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, phenomena are organized through geometrical parts, affinity, conflict, interstices, pressure, and spatial distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, the inquiry concerning nature shifts from the description of things to the reconstruction of mechanisms of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, being is a continuously changing composition, whose order is maintained through the cyclic generation of differences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, science must connect form, magnitude, plurality, motion, rest, and place in one relational model.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-01","text":"Divine proportion is presented as the guarantor of order, but the later mechanism requires internal irregularity; order therefore is not simple uniformity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_38:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-02","text":"The absolute distinction of the elements is threatened by their necessary penetration and mutual transport.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-03","text":"Identity must remain recognizable, while at the same time it is defined through continuous changes; this contradiction is constitutive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:FL-04","text":"The absence of void explains universal motion, but leaves the precise mode of circulation partly unexplained.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-01","text":"Necessity mutates from an external principle of arrangement into an internal condition of pressure, dissolution, and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_36:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-02","text":"Affinity mutates from a criterion of similarity into a mechanism of redistribution and assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-03","text":"Uniformity mutates from a concept of order into temporary immobility, which natural power can always dissolve.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MP-04","text":"Geometrical form mutates from a static background of properties into an active mechanism for producing variety and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-01","text":"The system implies that reality is a circular mechanism of compression, dissolution, transport, and reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-02","text":"The natural subject is not a self-subsistent substance, but a nexus of relations, powers, places, and temporary forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-03","text":"Time is repetitive and productive; each cycle of dissolution reproduces the conditions of the next.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:HSI-04","text":"The only possible freedom within the system is the redirection of powers through escape, assimilation, transport, and new composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_37:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B01","text":"The principles of geometrical difference, inequality, conflict, the absence of void, and reconstitution suffice for reconstructing the principal mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction, from sensible difference and geometrical reduction to circular change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B03","text":"The exact generation of triangles, the complete function of kinds, and the mechanism of divine persuasion are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_14:MRT-B04","text":"The structure is coherent because uniformity, irregularity, motion, and reconstitution operate as a mutually reinforcing cycle; axiomatic compression, however, leaves empirical detail underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_38:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_14@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_14:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 40–42"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 40–42","context":"Section 56 · Section 57 · Section 58","original_title":"Chapters 40–42","original_context":"Section 56 · Section 57 · Section 58"},"original_title":"Chapters 40–42","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 43–45","order":15,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_39","CH_JP8E_SEC6","CH_JP8E_S_40"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_15@R001","sha256":"4be3a7a3e694c29ab63a2bc03d79b76291e1ca2cc00ca8a6fee0b7f9ef1480ee","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-01","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα συνίσταται εἰς τὸ πῶς ἑτερογενῆ σώματα, πάθη καὶ ποιότητες γίνονται ἐκ στοιχειακῶν συνθέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταθέτει τὴν ἑτερότητα ἀπὸ τὰ ὀνόματα καὶ τὰ φαινόμενα εἰς μείξεις, ἀναλογίας, κινήσεις καὶ εἰσόδους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-03","text":"Ἡ ὕλη ἀναφαίνεται ὡς πλέγμα πιέσεων καὶ διαπερατῶν διακένων, ἐν ᾧ οὐδεμία κίνησις ἐπιτελεῖται ἄνευ ἀμοιβαίας μετατοπίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ταυτότης τῶν σωμάτων συγκροτεῖται προσωρινῶς ἐκ πυκνότητος, ἀναλογίας, μικροδομῆς, θερμότητος, ψύξεως καὶ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-05","text":"Αἱ αἰσθηταὶ ποιότητες καὶ αἱ ὀνομασίαι δηλοῦσι δυνάμεις ἐνεργούσας ἐν ταῖς συστάσεσιν, οὐκ ἀνεξαρτήτους οὐσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-06","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις καὶ ἡ τήξις ἐξαρτῶνται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν εἴσοδον τοῦ διαλύοντος στοιχείου καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπὸ μόνην τὴν περιβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-07","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ θεωρία ἐκτείνεται ἀναγκαστικῶς ἀπὸ τὴν σύστασιν εἰς τὰ σωματικὰ πάθη, τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν ψυχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σπειροειδής· ἐπανέρχεται εἰς τὴν ὕλην διὰ νέων ἐπιπέδων, ἀλλὰ ἡ πλήρης λεπτομέρεια παραμένει ἀνοικτή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὰ σώματα εἰσὶ γινόμεναι συστάσεις καὶ οὐκ ἀμετάβλητοι ὑλικαὶ μονάδες.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μεῖξις παράγει διαφοράν γενῶν, δυνάμεων καὶ ἐνεργειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης ἐνεργεῖ διὰ κινήσεως, πιέσεως, ψύξεως, θερμάνσεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς εἰσόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Κενὸν οὐχ ὑπάρχει ὡς ἀνεμπόδιστος τόπος κινήσεως· ἡ πληρότης τοῦ κόσμου ἀναγκάζει τὰ σώματα εἰς ἀλληλεπίδρασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ταυτότης ἑκάστου γένους ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀναλογίας, πυκνότητος, μεγέθους μερῶν, διακένων καὶ χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ποιότης καὶ τὸ ὄνομα ἀναφέρονται εἰς τὴν ἐνεργὸν δύναμιν τῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ διαπερατότης τῶν διακένων καθορίζει τὸ εἰσελθεῖν, λῦσαι, τῆξαι ἢ μετασχηματίσαι ἕτερον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ διάλυσις, ἡ στερεοποίησις καὶ ἡ ῥοὴ εἰσὶν ἀντιστρεπταὶ μορφαὶ μεταβολῆς τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ σωματικὸν πάθος, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ ψυχὴ ἀνήκουσιν εἰς μίαν ἱεραρχικὴν, ἀλλὰ μὴ ταυτόχρονον, ἀλυσίδα ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ γενετικὴ ἀνακατασκευή ἐκ μείξεως εἰς διαφοροποίησιν, ἐκ διαφοροποιήσεως εἰς δύναμιν, καὶ ἐκ δυνάμεως εἰς πάθος ὀργανώνει τὸ σύνολον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ τάξις τῆς ἐξηγήσεως γίνεται μέρος τῆς φυσικῆς, ἐπειδὴ τὰ ἀλληλεξαρτώμενα γένη οὐ δύνανται νὰ ἐκτεθῶσιν ἅμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ μηχανικὴ ἀκρίβεια τῶν βασικῶν σχέσεων δύναται νὰ συνυπάρχῃ μετὰ εἰκαστικῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως τῶν ἀπείρων λεπτομερειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-01","text":"Τὸ πῦρ μετακινείται ἀπὸ τοπικὸν ποιητὴν ἀνωμαλίας εἰς γενικὸν πρότυπον στοιχειακῆς εἰσόδου καὶ διαλύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ μεῖξις μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ γενεσιουργὸς αἰτία σωμάτων εἰς μηχανισμὸν ὀνοματοθεσίας καὶ αἰσθητῆς ποιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ πυκνότης καὶ ἡ ὁμοιογένεια ἐκτοπίζονται ἀπὸ τὰ μέταλλα πρὸς τὴν γενικὴν θεωρίαν μικροδομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς ἀρχὴ ἀναγκαστικῆς πιέσεως, ἀλληλοωθήσεως καὶ ἐξηγητικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ πήξις μεταστρέφεται εἰς διάλυσιν καὶ τήξιν, ὥστε ἡ στερεότης νὰ ἀναφανῇ ὡς ἀναστρέψιμος σύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-06","text":"Τὰ ὀνόματα παύουσι νὰ λειτουργῶσιν ὡς πρωταρχικαὶ ἀρχαί καὶ ἀπορροφοῦνται ὑπὸ τῶν ἐνεργῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῶν σωμάτων μετατοπίζεται πρὸς τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν ψυχήν, χωρὶς ὅμως νὰ ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ τὴν ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς λεπτολογία ὑποχωρεῖ πρὸς εἰκότα μῦθον, ἐνῶ ἡ γενετικὴ δομὴ διατηρεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-01","text":"Τὰ παραδείγματα χρυσοῦ, ἀδάμαντος, χαλκοῦ, οἴνου καὶ λίθου παραμένουσιν ὑποκείμενα τοπικῆς ἐφαρμογῆς καὶ οὐκ εἰσὶ καθ᾽ ἑαυτὰ καθολικαὶ ἀρχαί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-02","text":"Αἱ ἐπιμέρους διακρίσεις τόπου, χρώματος καὶ εἴδους ἀπορροφοῦνται εἰς τὴν ὑψηλοτέραν ἀρχὴν τῆς σχετικῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ σχέσις μείξεως, δυνάμεως καὶ ὀνόματος γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια καὶ κλιμακοῦται εἰς γενικὸν ὀντολογικὸν κανόνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ καὶ ἡ εἴσοδος εἰς τὰ διάκενα μεταβαίνουσιν ἀπὸ τοπικὴν μηχανικὴν εἰς καθολικὴν θεωρίαν μετατοπίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ σώματα εἰς αἴσθησιν λειτουργεῖ ὡς καταλυτικὴ γέφυρα πρὸς ὑψηλοτέραν θεωρίαν τοῦ ζῶντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἰδέα ἀμεταβλήτων γενῶν καθίσταται ἀπαρχαιωμένη, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον γένος ἐρείδεται εἰς λύσιμον ἰσορροπίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ διαδοχὴ τῆς ἐξηγήσεως ἀναβαθμίζεται ἀπὸ ῥητορικὴ διευθέτησις εἰς ἀναγκαῖον στοιχεῖον τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὕλη ὡς ἀκίνητος, ἀμιγὴς καὶ αὐτάρκης μονάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ κίνησις ἐν κενῷ καὶ ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ μεταβολὴ ἄνευ ἀμοιβαίας ἀναπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὀνομασία ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος αἰτία τῆς ὑλικῆς διαφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ καθολικὴ καὶ ὁμοιόμορφος διαλυτικὴ δύναμις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ λύσις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ δομὴν καὶ εἴσοδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἀνεξαρτησία σώματος, αἰσθήσεως καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπαίτησις ὅτι πᾶσα φυσικὴ λεπτομέρεια δύναται νὰ ἀποδειχθῇ ὁμοίως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι τὰ πράγματα προϋπάρχουσι τῶν διαδικασιῶν αἳ αὐτὰ συγκροτοῦσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι μία μόνη δύναμις ἐξηγεῖ πᾶσαν μεταβολήν· ἡ αἰτιότης διανέμεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ἐπαφὴ ἀρκεῖ πρὸς τὴν μεταβολήν· ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ διάταξις ἀποφασίζει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ φυσικὴ θεωρία δύναται νὰ ὁλοκληρωθῇ ἄνευ διαδοχῆς καὶ ἐπανόδου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψεῦδος ὅτι ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποτελεῖ ξένον ἐπίπεδον πρὸς τὰ σωματικὰ πάθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ἀδρανῶν πραγμάτων, ἃ ὑφίστανται πρὸ τῶν σχέσεων, τῶν πιέσεων καὶ τῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης διάστασις φύσεως, χρόνου καὶ ἐξηγήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παλαίωσις καὶ ἡ τάξις μετασχηματίζουσι τὰ ὄντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἡ κυκλοῦσα τὸ σύστημα ἐστὶν ἡ ἀδυναμία ταυτοχρόνου καὶ ἀπολύτου γνώσεως τῶν πάντων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπαγορεύεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ γένος ἔχει ὑπόστασιν ἀνεξάρτητον τῆς γενετικῆς ἀκολουθίας αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-01","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ μεῖξις παράγῃ διαφοράν καὶ ἡ διαφορὰ δηλοῖ δύναμιν, τότε τὸ ὄνομα γίνεται ἔκφρασις σχέσεως ὕλης καὶ ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-02","CL_JP8E_15:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-02","text":"Ἐὰν κενὸν μὴ ᾖ, τότε ἡ στοιχειακὴ εἴσοδος εἰς τὰ διάκενα γίνεται ὁ κοινὸς μηχανισμὸς πιέσεως, λύσεως καὶ συμπήξεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","CL_JP8E_15:GA-04","CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-03","text":"Ἡ στερεοποίησις τῶν σωμάτων καὶ ἡ μεταγενεστέρα τήξις αὐτῶν ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀντιθέτους φάσεις τῆς αὐτῆς δομικῆς λογικῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-01","CL_JP8E_15:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία γῆς καὶ ὕδατος συνδέει τὴν ποικιλία τῶν μικτῶν γενῶν μὲ τὴν διαπερατότητα καὶ τὴν ἀντίστασιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_40:A9","CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-05","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ πάθος ἀνάγεται εἰς σωματικὴν σύστασιν, ἡ αἴσθησις γίνεται ἐπόμενος τρόπος ἐμφανίσεως τῆς ὑλικῆς διαφοράς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις μιᾶς καθολικῆς αἰτίας ἐπιβάλλει δίκτυον ἀλληλεπιδρώντων παραγόντων ἀντὶ μονολιθικῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία ταυτοχρόνου ἐκθέσεως δὲν εἶναι μόνον περιορισμὸς τοῦ λόγου, ἀλλὰ ἀντιστοιχεῖ πρὸς τὴν χρονικὴν διαδοχὴν τῶν γενέσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","CL_JP8E_15:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-08","text":"Ἡ προσφυγὴ εἰς εἰκότα μῦθον ἐπιτρέπει τὴν διατήρησιν τοῦ γενετικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ ἐκεῖ ὅπου ἡ μικροφυσικὴ ἀπόδειξις ὑπολείπεται.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-10","CL_JP8E_15:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-01","text":"Τὰ φυσικὰ ὄντα γίνονται κόμβοι προσωρινῆς ἰσορροπίας ἐν πλέγματι πιέσεων, εἰσόδων καὶ ἀποχωρήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης ἀποκτᾷ τοπολογικὸν χαρακτῆρα· τὸ ἀποτελεῖν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὸ ποῦ καὶ πῶς εἰσέρχεται ἡ δύναμις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματολογία, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ μηχανικὴ σύστασις ἀνασυνδέονται ὡς διαφορετικὰ ἐπίπεδα τοῦ αὐτοῦ γενετικοῦ συμβάντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος δὲν εἶναι ἐξωτερικὸς μετρητής, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς παράγων παλαιώσεως, διαχωρισμοῦ καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ὀφείλει νὰ ἀνακατασκευάζῃ μεταβάσεις καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον νὰ ταξινομῇ τετελεσμένα γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ θεωρία ὑπερβαίνει τὰ στερεὰ ὅρια τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὸ αἰσθανόμενον ὡς ὑλικὴν συνέχειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ ἐξηγητικὴ ἀλήθεια διαιρεῖται εἰς μηχανικὴν ἀναγκαιότητα καὶ εἰκαστικὴν συμπλήρωσιν, χωρὶς νὰ χάνῃ τὴν γενετικὴν της κατεύθυνσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-01","text":"Μείξις → ἀνομοιότης → δύναμις → ποιότης καὶ ὄνομα → νέα διάκρισις γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-02","text":"Ἀπουσία κενοῦ → ἀναπλήρωσις → ὠθῆσις → πίεσις → σύστασις· ἡ σύστασις πάλιν καθορίζει τὴν ἐπόμενην εἴσοδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-03","text":"Διάκενα → εἴσοδος στοιχείου → λύσις ἢ τήξις → νέα ἐσωτερικὴ διάταξις → νέα διαπερατότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-04","text":"Πάθος σώματος → αἴσθησις → σάρξ → θνητὴ ψυχή· ἡ ἀλυσὶς ἀναγκάζει τὴν θεωρίαν νὰ ἐπανέλθῃ εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν βάση.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀκολουθία τῆς ἐξηγήσεως ἀναπαράγει τὴν ἀκολουθίαν τῆς γενέσεως· ἡ μεθοδολογικὴ τάξις γίνεται ὀντολογικὸς δείκτης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ εἰκαστικὴ ἀναπλήρωσις λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀτραπὸς διαφυγῆς ἀπὸ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν πλήρους λεπτολογίας, ἄνευ ἐγκαταλείψεως τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B01","text":"Μείξις στοιχείων → διαφοροποίησις συστάσεως → γένεσις προσωρινοῦ γένους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B02","text":"Ἀναλογία, μέγεθος καὶ διάκενα → διαπερατότης ἢ ἀντίστασις → δυνατὴ εἴσοδος ἢ ἀδυνατὴ λύσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B03","text":"Κίνησις καὶ πίεσις → ὁμαλότης ἢ ἀνωμαλία → πήξις, ῥοὴ ἢ στερεοποίησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B04","text":"Ἐνεργὸς δύναμις → αἰσθητὴ ποιότης → λειτουργικὸν ὄνομα → ἐπανένταξις τοῦ ὀνόματος εἰς τὴν ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B05","text":"Σωματικὸν πάθος → αἴσθησις → σάρξ καὶ ψυχή → ὕστερος ἐπανέλεγχος τῶν ἀρχικῶν σωματικῶν ὑποθέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B06","text":"Ἀδυναμία πλήρους λεπτολογίας → εἰκὼς μῦθος → διατήρησις τῆς γενετικῆς δομῆς χωρὶς ἀπόλυτον βεβαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ μηχανὴ παράγει ὄντα ὡς μεταβαλλομένα ἀποτελέσματα σχέσεων, καὶ γνώσιν ὡς διαδοχικὴν ἀνακατασκευήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B01","text":"Ἑτερότης σωμάτων καὶ παθημάτων → ἀναζήτησις τῆς στοιχειακῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B02","text":"Στοιχειακὴ μεῖξις → ἀναλογία καὶ μικροδομή → ἐνεργὸς δύναμις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B03","text":"Ἐνεργὸς δύναμις → ὀνομασία, αἴσθησις καὶ διαφοραὶ λειτουργικῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B04","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ εἴσοδος → λύσις ἢ τήξις → νέα ῥοὴ καὶ νέα σύστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B05","text":"Σωματικὰ πάθη → αἴσθησις → ψυχὴ → μεθοδολογικὴ ἀναβολὴ καὶ ἐπανόδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B06","text":"Ὅριο ἀποδείξεως → εἰκαστικὴ συμπλήρωσις → ἀνοικτὴ ἀλλὰ συνεκτικὴ γενετικὴ θεωρία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-01","text":"Τὰ σώματα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενα εἰς προσωρινὰ ἀποτελέσματα διαδικασιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ποιότης παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὸν φαινόμενον καὶ γίνεται ἔκφανσις ἐνεργοῦ συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-03","text":"Ἡ διάλυσις ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς σχέσις μεταξὺ δομῆς καὶ εἰσόδου, ὄχι ὡς γενικὴ ἐξωτερικὴ ἐπίδρασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἐντάσσεται εἰς τὴν φυσικὴν αἰτιολογίαν, ὥστε καταρρέει ἡ ἀντίθεσις σώματος καὶ αἰσθανομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος ἀνασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀκολουθιακὴν ἀνάπτυξιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ θεωρία ὀφείλει νὰ μιμηθῇ τὴν ἐξάρτησιν τῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φύσεως καὶ χρόνου ἀποδυναμοῦται, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παλαίωσις γίνεται παράγων ἐσωτερικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τῷ ἐπιφανεῖ ἐμφανίζονται μέταλλα, ὕδατα, λίθοι, πάθη, αἰσθήσεις καὶ ὀνόματα ὡς διακεκριμένα γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ταῦτα παράγονται ἐκ κινήσεως, μείξεως, πιέσεως, διακένων, ἀναλογίας καὶ διαχωρισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ ὄνομα εἰς τὴν δύναμιν καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτης εἰς τὴν ἀνάγκην τῆς ἀλληλεπιδράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ σώματα εἰσὶν ἰσορροπίαι ἐν συνεχεῖ μεταβολῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀκολουθία τοῦ λόγου ἐκτελεῖ τὴν ἀλληλεξάρτησιν τῶν πραγμάτων, ἀναβάλλουσα ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀκυροῦσα τὴν ὁλοκλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θεωρία ἀπαιτεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν εἴσοδον στοιχείων, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως ἀποκλείει τὸ κενόν· ἡ ἔντασις αὕτη εἶναι παραγωγικὴ καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὴ ἀντίφασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-02","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις συνδέει σώμα καὶ αἴσθησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀναβάλλει τὴν πλήρη θεωρίαν τῆς ψυχῆς· ἡ ἐκκρεμότης διατηρεῖ τὴν κλιμάκωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-03","text":"Ἡ διπλὴ κλίμαξ ἀκριβείας καὶ μύθου διατηρεῖ τὸ σύστημα συνεκτικόν, ἀλλὰ περιορίζει τὴν ἀξίωσιν τελικῆς βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία μιᾶς ἑνιαίας αἰτίας ἐνισχύει τὴν ἐξηγητικὴν διασποράν, ἀλλὰ δυσχεραίνει τὴν ἀναγωγὴν εἰς ἓν θεμέλιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τοῦ σώματος μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ συμπαγῆ ὄγκον εἰς διαπερατὸν δίκτυον σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς ποιότητος μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἰδιότητα εἰς ἐνεργὸν δύναμιν ἀναφερομένην πρὸς αἴσθησιν καὶ χρῆσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς αἰτιότητος μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ἐπίδρασιν εἰς εἴσοδον καὶ ἐσωτερικὴν ἀναδιάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς μεθόδου μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ γραμμικὴν παράθεσιν εἰς διαδοχικὴν ἐπανόδον μεταξὺ σώματος, πάθους καὶ αἰσθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι πλήρες καὶ πιεζόμενον πλέγμα διαπερατῶν συστάσεων, ἐν ᾧ ἕκαστον σῶμα ἀποτελεῖ προσωρινὸν κόμβον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον δὲν ἵσταται ἔξωθεν τοῦ κόσμου, ἀλλὰ γίνεται σωματικὸς καὶ αἰσθητικὸς κόμβος τῆς ἰδίας γενετικῆς ἀλυσίδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι ἡ ἀκολουθία μετασχηματισμῶν, παλαιώσεων, διαχωρισμῶν καὶ ἐπανόδων, οὐχὶ ἁπλὸν ἐξωτερικὸν μέτρον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ διαφυγὴ ἐκ τῆς συστάσεως δὲν εἶναι ἔξοδος εἰς κενόν, ἀλλὰ μετάβασις εἰς ἑτέραν διάταξιν καὶ ἑτέραν ἐνεργόν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B01","text":"Οἱ παρόντες ἀξίωμαί εἰσιν ἱκανοὶ πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ μεῖξιν καὶ σύστασιν εἰς πάθος καὶ αἴσθησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη ὡς πρὸς τὴν πλήρη μικροφυσικὴν μέτρησιν καὶ τὴν ἀκριβῆ γένεσιν τῶν αἰσθητῶν ποιοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα ἐν τῇ συνδέσει μείξεως, διακένων, πιέσεως, εἰσόδου καὶ ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ ἀπαιτεῖ διαδοχὴν καὶ ἐπανόδους, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὁλοκληρωμένη θεωρία δὲν δύναται νὰ παρουσιασθῇ ταυτοχρόνως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B05","text":"Τὸ ἀναγκαῖον ὑπόλοιπον εἶναι ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν φυσικὴν σύστασιν εἰς τὴν συγκεκριμένην αἴσθησιν· αὕτη προαναγγέλλεται, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232629208920Z_5250fd6a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 43–45","source_sha256":"4be3a7a3e694c29ab63a2bc03d79b76291e1ca2cc00ca8a6fee0b7f9ef1480ee","sha256":"e6997b69601ac5212bbeacb0da8cf040052d6d6e5f51f59054645fb6644f1176","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:26:29.210847+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-01","text":"The problem consists in how heterogeneous bodies, affections, and qualities arise from elemental compositions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-02","text":"The explanation transfers heterogeneity from names and phenomena to mixtures, proportions, motions, and entrances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-03","text":"Matter appears as a network of pressures and permeable interstices, in which no motion is accomplished without reciprocal displacement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-04","text":"The identity of bodies is constituted temporarily from density, proportion, microstructure, heating, cooling, and time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-05","text":"Sensible qualities and names signify powers active in compositions, not independent substances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-06","text":"Dissolution and melting depend on the internal entrance of the dissolving element and not on mere external encirclement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-07","text":"Natural theory necessarily extends from composition to bodily affections, sensation, and soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AS-08","text":"The movement of the system is spiral; it returns to matter through new levels, but complete detail remains open.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Bodies are compositions coming to be, and not unchanging material units.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Mixture produces differences of kinds, powers, and activities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Natural causality operates through motion, pressure, cooling, heating, and internal entrance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Void does not exist as an unobstructed place of motion; the fullness of the cosmos compels bodies into interaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The identity of each kind depends on proportions, density, size of parts, interstices, and time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Quality and name refer to the active power of the composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] The permeability of interstices determines whether another body can enter, dissolve, melt, or transform.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Dissolution, solidification, and flow are reversible forms of change in internal arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Bodily affection, sensation, and soul belong to a single hierarchical, but not simultaneous, chain of explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Generative reconstruction from mixture to differentiation, from differentiation to power, and from power to affection organizes the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] The order of explanation becomes part of natural science, because interdependent kinds cannot be set forth simultaneously.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Mechanical precision concerning basic relations can coexist with conjectural reconstruction of infinite details.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-01","text":"Fire shifts from a local producer of irregularity to a general model of elemental entrance and dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-02","text":"Mixture changes from a generative cause of bodies into a mechanism of naming and sensible quality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-03","text":"Density and homogeneity are displaced from metals toward the general theory of microstructure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-04","text":"The absence of void recurs as a principle of necessary pressure, reciprocal thrust, and explanatory succession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-05","text":"Coagulation turns into dissolution and melting, so that solidity appears as a reversible composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-06","text":"Names cease to function as primary principles and are absorbed by active powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-07","text":"The theory of bodies shifts toward sensation and soul, yet is not severed from matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RMD-08","text":"Exact detail yields to a likely account, while the generative structure is preserved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-01","text":"The examples of gold, adamant, bronze, wine, and stone remain objects of local application and are not in themselves universal principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-02","text":"Particular distinctions of place, color, and form are absorbed into the higher principle of relative composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-03","text":"The relation of mixture, power, and name bridges the chapters and is scaled up into a general ontological rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-04","text":"The absence of void and entrance into interstices pass from local mechanics into a universal theory of displacement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-05","text":"The transition from bodies to sensation functions as a catalytic bridge toward a higher theory of living beings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-06","text":"The idea of unchanging kinds becomes obsolete, since each kind rests upon a dissolvable equilibrium.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:CGD-07","text":"The succession of explanation is elevated from rhetorical arrangement to a necessary element of the system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-01","text":"Matter as an unmoved, unmixed, and self-sufficient unit is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-02","text":"Motion in a void and external change without reciprocal replenishment are rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-03","text":"Naming as an independent cause of material difference is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-04","text":"A universal and uniform dissolving power is rejected, because dissolution depends on structure and entrance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-05","text":"The absolute independence of body, sensation, and soul is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:GNX-06","text":"The demand that every natural detail can be demonstrated alike is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that things pre-exist the processes that constitute them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that one power alone explains every change; causality is distributed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-03","text":"It must be false that external contact suffices for change; internal arrangement decides.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-04","text":"It must be false that natural theory can be completed without succession and return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:DBN-05","text":"It must be false that sensation constitutes a foreign level relative to bodily affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-01","text":"There is no world of inert things that subsist prior to relations, pressures, and changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-02","text":"The complete separation of nature, time, and explanation is excluded, because aging and order transform beings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-03","text":"The absence that circles the system is the impossibility of simultaneous and absolute knowledge of all things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSA-04","text":"The idea that a kind has a subsistence independent of its generative sequence is prohibited.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-01","text":"If mixture produces difference and difference signifies power, then the name becomes an expression of the relation between matter and activity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-02","CL_JP8E_15:GA-06","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-02","text":"If there is no void, then elemental entrance into interstices becomes the common mechanism of pressure, dissolution, and coagulation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","CL_JP8E_15:GA-04","CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-03","text":"The solidification of bodies and their subsequent melting constitute opposite phases of the same structural logic.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-01","CL_JP8E_15:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_39:A6","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-04","text":"The proportion of earth and water connects the variety of mixed kinds with permeability and resistance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_40:A9","CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-05","text":"Because affection is reduced to bodily composition, sensation becomes a subsequent mode of appearance of material difference.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-07","CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_40:A10","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-06","text":"The lack of a single universal cause requires a network of interacting factors instead of a monolithic explanation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-03","CL_JP8E_15:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-07","text":"The impossibility of simultaneous exposition is not merely a limitation of discourse, but corresponds to the temporal succession of generations.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-09","CL_JP8E_15:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_40:A11","CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:XD-08","text":"Recourse to a likely account permits preservation of the generative mechanism where microphysical demonstration falls short.","refs":["CL_JP8E_15:GA-10","CL_JP8E_15:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-01","text":"Natural beings become nodes of temporary equilibrium in a network of pressures, entrances, and departures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-02","text":"Causality acquires a topological character; producing an effect depends on where and how the power enters.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-03","text":"Nomenclature, sensation, and mechanical composition are reconnected as different levels of the same generative event.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-04","text":"Time is not an external measure, but an active factor of aging, separation, and transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-05","text":"Knowledge must reconstruct transitions and not merely classify completed kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-06","text":"Natural theory surpasses the rigid limits of the body and extends into the sensing being as a material continuity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:BSD-07","text":"Explanatory truth is divided into mechanical necessity and conjectural completion, without losing its generative direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-01","text":"Mixture → dissimilarity → power → quality and name → new distinction of kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-02","text":"Absence of void → replenishment → thrust → pressure → composition; composition in turn determines the next entrance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-03","text":"Interstices → entrance of an element → dissolution or melting → new internal arrangement → new permeability.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-04","text":"Bodily affection → sensation → flesh → mortal soul; the chain compels theory to return to its bodily basis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-05","text":"The sequence of explanation reproduces the sequence of generation; methodological order becomes an ontological indicator.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:RLE-06","text":"Conjectural replenishment functions as a path of escape from the inability to provide full detail, without abandoning the mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B01","text":"Mixture of elements → differentiation of composition → generation of a temporary kind.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B02","text":"Proportion, size, and interstices → permeability or resistance → possible entrance or impossible dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B03","text":"Motion and pressure → smoothness or irregularity → coagulation, flow, or solidification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B04","text":"Active power → sensible quality → functional name → reintegration of the name into matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B05","text":"Bodily affection → sensation → flesh and soul → later re-examination of the initial bodily hypotheses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B06","text":"Inability to provide full detail → likely account → preservation of generative structure without absolute certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FGS-B07","text":"The overall machine produces beings as changing results of relations, and knowledge as sequential reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B01","text":"Heterogeneity of bodies and affections → search for elemental composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B02","text":"Elemental mixture → proportion and microstructure → active power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B03","text":"Active power → naming, sensation, and differences of functional kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B04","text":"Internal entrance → dissolution or melting → new flow and new composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B05","text":"Bodily affections → sensation → soul → methodological postponement and return.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:AFM-B06","text":"Limit of demonstration → conjectural completion → open yet coherent generative theory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-01","text":"Bodies are reclassified from objects into temporary results of processes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-02","text":"Quality ceases to be a mere phenomenon and becomes the manifestation of an active composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-03","text":"Dissolution is recognized as a relation between structure and entrance, not as a general external effect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-04","text":"Sensation is incorporated into natural causation, so that the opposition between body and sensing being collapses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-05","text":"Method is reshaped into sequential development, because theory must imitate the dependence of kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MME-06","text":"The distinction between nature and time is weakened, because aging becomes a factor of internal change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, metals, waters, stones, affections, sensations, and names appear as distinct kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, these are produced from motion, mixture, pressure, interstices, proportion, and separation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, explanation passes from name to power, and from this to the necessity of interaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, bodies are equilibria in continuous change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the sequence of discourse enacts the interdependence of things, postponing but not annulling completion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-01","text":"The theory requires the internal entrance of elements, but simultaneously excludes void; this tension is productive and not a mere contradiction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-02","text":"Natural explanation connects body and sensation, but postpones a complete theory of soul; the incompleteness preserves the escalation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-03","text":"The double scale of precision and myth preserves the system's coherence, but limits its claim to final certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:FL-04","text":"The absence of a single unified cause strengthens explanatory dispersion, but makes reduction to one foundation difficult.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-01","text":"The concept of body mutates from a compact mass into a permeable network of relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-02","text":"The concept of quality mutates from a property into an active power referring to sensation and use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-03","text":"The concept of causality mutates from external effect into entrance and internal rearrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MP-04","text":"The concept of method mutates from linear exposition into successive return between body, affection, and sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-01","text":"Reality is a full and pressured network of permeable compositions, in which each body constitutes a temporary node.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-02","text":"The subject does not stand outside the world, but becomes a bodily and sensory node of the same generative chain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-03","text":"Time is the sequence of transformations, agings, separations, and returns, not a mere external measure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_39:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:HSI-04","text":"Possible escape from a composition is not an exit into void, but a transition to another arrangement and another active power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms are sufficient for reconstructing the principal movement from mixture and composition to affection and sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with regard to complete microphysical measurement and the precise generation of sensible qualities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B03","text":"The coherence of the system is strongest in the connection of mixture, interstices, pressure, entrance, and proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC6:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction requires succession and returns, because the complete theory cannot be presented simultaneously.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_15:MRT-B05","text":"The necessary remainder is the transition from natural composition to determinate sensation; this is announced, but not exhausted.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_40:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_15@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_15:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 43–45"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 43–45","context":"Section 59 · Section 60 · Section 61","original_title":"Chapters 43–45","original_context":"Section 59 · Section 60 · Section 61"},"original_title":"Chapters 43–45","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 46–48","order":16,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_41","CH_JP8E_S_42","CH_JP8E_S_43"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_16@R001","sha256":"751919533b645240df6cdad235c2a69640b5ce3aff509052aa7a06fffd0cabba","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅτι τὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη καὶ αἱ χωρικαὶ ἀντιθέσεις φαίνονται ἀπόλυτα, ἐνώ ἡ φύσις αὐτῶν ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ μορφήν, κίνησιν, ὕλην καὶ σχέσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_42:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναπλαισίωσις μετατρέπει τὰ φαινόμενα ἀπὸ ἀπολύτους ποιότητας εἰς παραγόμενας σχέσεις φυσικῶν μηχανισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-03","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἐξήγησις ἀναπτύσσεται ἀπὸ τὴν μορφὴν καὶ τὴν κίνησιν εἰς τὴν μετάδοσιν, τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὸ βίωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία μετασχηματίζει τὸ ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἀπὸ καθολικὰς διευθύνσεις εἰς σχέσεις φυσικῆς φορᾶς, συγγενείας καὶ βίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-05","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ κόσμου οὐ καταργεῖ τὰς διαφοράς, ἀλλὰ παράγει πολλαπλὰ συστήματα σχεσιακῶν τόπων καὶ μεταδόσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-06","text":"Ἡ φορά τοῦ λόγου εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἀπὸ τὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη ἀναβαίνει εἰς τοὺς μηχανισμούς, καὶ ἀπὸ τοὺς μηχανισμοὺς ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὴν ὀρθὴν ὀνοματοθεσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-07","text":"Τὸ σύστημα γίνεται φυσικὴ μηχανικὴ τῶν σχέσεων, ἥτις ἐλέγχει τὰ κοινὰ ὀνόματα διὰ τῆς ὑλικῆς καὶ κοσμικῆς δομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ θέσις εἶναι σχεσιακή, ἀλλ’ οὐ πλήρως κλειστή, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ μικροδομὴν εἰς γνώσιν παραμένει μερικῶς ὑποκαθορισμένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Οὐδεμία αἰσθητὴ ποιότης νοεῖται ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ σχέσεις μορφῆς, κινήσεως, ὕλης καὶ τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ σώματος διαφορίζει τὰ πάθη καὶ τοὺς τρόπους ἐνεργείας αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ θερμότης καὶ ἡ ψυχρότης μεταγράφονται ἀπὸ ἁπλὰ αἰσθήματα εἰς ἀποτελέσματα κινήσεως, διακρίσεως, συνώσεως καὶ ἀπωθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_41:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ σκληρότης, ἡ μαλακότης, ἡ λειότης καὶ ἡ τραχύτης εἶναι σχετικοὶ προσδιορισμοὶ σωματικῆς ἀντιστάσεως καὶ συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:D5","CH_JP8E_S_43:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ πάθος γίνεται αἰσθητὸν μόνον ὅταν ἡ σωματικὴ μετάδοσις διαπερᾷ τὰ διακεκριμένα μόρια καὶ φθάνῃ εἰς τὸ φρόνιμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ αἴσθησις, ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη ἀποτελοῦσι διακεκριμένα ἐπίπεδα, ἃ συνδέονται ἀλλ’ οὐ ταυτίζονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A12","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φυσικὴ φορά διακρίνεται ἀπὸ τὴν βιαίαν μεταφοράν διὰ τῆς σχέσεως τοῦ σώματος πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς ἢ τὸ ἀνόμοιον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ βαρὺ καὶ τὸ κοῦφον παύουσιν ὄντα ἀπόλυτοι χωρικαὶ ἰδιότητες καὶ γίνονται ὀνόματα φυσικῆς φορᾶς, τόπου καὶ βίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἕκαστον γένος ἔχει συγγενῆ τόπον, ὥστε ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ παντὸς νὰ συνυπάρχῃ μὲ πολλαπλὰς ἀντιθετικὰς φορὰς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ σφαιρικὴ διάταξις ἀκυροῖ τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ἑνὸς καθολικοῦ ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ὀρθὴ ὀνοματοθεσία ὀφείλει νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν πραγματικὴν δομὴν τῶν φυσικῶν σχέσεων καὶ οὐχὶ τὰς ἀνθρωποκεντρικὰς ἐντυπώσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ φύσις ἐξηγεῖται ὡς δίκτυον μεταβολῶν, ὅπου μορφαί, κινήσεις, ἀντιστάσεις καὶ μεταδόσεις παράγουσι τὰ φαινόμενα καὶ τὰ ὀνόματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς τὴν κίνησιν ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μικροσωματικὴν τομὴν εἰς κοσμικὴν φοράν καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς μετάδοσιν πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀπολύτου καὶ σχετικοῦ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἐν ταῖς ποιότησι, τοῖς τόποις καὶ ταῖς ἀντιθέσεσιν ἄνω καὶ κάτω.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-03","text":"Τὸ ἄνω καὶ κάτω μετατοπίζονται ἀπὸ γεωμετρικὰ σημεῖα εἰς ὀνόματα φυσικῆς φορᾶς καὶ σχέσεως πρὸς συγγενῆ τόπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀντίστασις ἀλλάσσει λειτουργίαν: ἀρχικῶς σημαίνει σκληρότητα, εἶτα βίαν μετακινήσεως, καὶ τελικῶς λύπην ἢ ἀπομόνωσιν πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","CH_JP8E_S_42:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ κόσμου διατηρεῖται, ἀλλὰ ἀνακωδικοποιεῖται ὡς πολλαπλότης συγγενῶν τόπων καὶ διαφορῶν κινητικότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἡδονὴν καὶ τὴν λύπην, ὥστε ἡ αἴσθησις νὰ μὴν ἀποτελῇ τελικὸν κριτήριον τοῦ βιώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_43:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-07","text":"Τὸ ἁπλὸν ὄνομα ἐξαφανίζεται ὡς ἐξήγησις, ἀφοῦ ἔχει ἐπιτελέσει τὸ ἔργον τῆς ἐμπειρικῆς ἀφετηρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὴ μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς γεωμετρία τῶν τετραγώνων βάσεων καὶ τῶν ἐπιμέρους σχημάτων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνώτερη σύνθεσις κρατεῖ μόνον τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς μορφολογικῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A10","CH_JP8E_S_41:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-02","text":"Κλιμακοῦται εἰς τὸ παρὸν ἐπίπεδον ἡ γενικὴ ἀρχὴ ὅτι τὰ πάθη εἶναι σχέσεις μορφῆς, κινήσεως καὶ ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-03","text":"Γέφυρα μεταξὺ τῶν κεφαλαίων γίνεται ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς φυσικῆς φορᾶς, ἥτις συνδέει τὴν κοσμολογίαν μὲ τὴν αἰσθητικὴν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-04","text":"Καταλύτης μεγάλης μεταβάσεως εἶναι ἡ ἀκύρωσις τοῦ ἀπολύτου ἄνω καὶ κάτω, διότι ἀναγκάζει ὅλην τὴν ὀνοματοθεσίαν νὰ γίνῃ σχεσιακή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-05","text":"Ὑπερβαίνει τὸ τοπικὸν ἐπίπεδον ἡ διάκριση αἰσθήσεως, ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης, ἐπειδὴ ἀναδιοργανώνει τὴν ἔννοιαν τοῦ βιώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀπόλυτος χωρικὴ διχοτομία καθίσταται παρωχημένη καὶ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ πολλαπλῶν φυσικῶν κατευθύνσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν μικροδομὴν εἰς τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν τῆς αἰτίας παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη καὶ δὲν γίνεται καθολικὸς ἀξίωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἐξήγησις τῶν παθημάτων διὰ γυμνῶν ὀνομάτων ἄνευ σωματικῶν αἰτιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος αὐτοτέλεια θερμοῦ, ψυχροῦ, σκληροῦ καὶ μαλακοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_41:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ πάθους μὲ τὴν ἡδονὴν ἢ τὴν λύπην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἑνιαία καὶ καθολικὴ διεύθυνσις ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἐν κόσμῳ σφαιροειδεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὁμοιογένεια τοῦ σώματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις προϋποθέτει διαφορὰς κινητικότητος καὶ μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀνεξαρτησία τῶν ὀνομάτων ἀπὸ τὰς κινήσεις καὶ τὰς φυσικὰς σχέσεις ἐν αἷς ἐφαρμόζονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-01","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ κοινὸν αἴσθημα παρέχει ἤδη τὴν τελικὴν φυσικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-02","text":"Πρέπει νὰ ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἕν γεωμετρικὸν σύστημα δύναται νὰ ὁρίσῃ τὰς φυσικὰς φορὰς πάντων τῶν γενῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-03","text":"Πρέπει νὰ ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς ἐμπειρίας εἰς ἕνα ἐνιαῖον κέντρον πάθους, ἐπειδὴ τὸ πάθος ἀπαιτεῖ κυκλοφορίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-04","text":"Πρέπει νὰ διατηρῆται ἡ διάκρισις φυσικῆς κινήσεως καὶ βιαίας μεταφορᾶς, ἄνευ τῆς ὁποίας καταρρέει ἡ σχεσιακὴ σημασία τοῦ βάρους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-05","text":"Πρέπει νὰ ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία προηγείται τῆς κοσμικῆς καὶ σωματικῆς ἀναλύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὁ κόσμος ὡς ἕν ἀπόλυτον πλαίσιον προσανατολισμοῦ, ὅπερ θὰ ἔτασσε τὰ πάντα ὑπὸ μίαν κοινὴν διεύθυνσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ ἀπόλυτος ταυτότης μεταξὺ σωματικῆς μεταβολῆς, αἰσθήσεως καὶ βιωματικῆς ἀξίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἕνα ὁμοιογενὲς σώμα, ἐν ᾧ πᾶν μόριον θὰ ἐκινεῖτο καὶ θὰ ἔπασχεν ὁμοίως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης ἐξηγήσεως τῆς φύσεως διὰ στατικῶν εἰδῶν· ἡ πραγματικότης ἀναφαίνεται μόνον ὡς μεταβολὴ καὶ σχέσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπούσα δυνατότης εἶναι ἕνας καθολικὸς χάρτης, ὁ ὁποῖος θὰ ἔλυε ἄνευ σχέσεως τὰς ἀντιθέσεις τόπου, πάθους καὶ σημασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀναίρεσις τοῦ ἀπολύτου ἄνω καὶ κάτω ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμολογίαν εἰς τὴν ἀναίρεσιν ἀπολύτων σωματικῶν ποιοτήτων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-02","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ φορά, ἡ μετάδοσις τοῦ πάθους καὶ ἡ ὀρθὴ ὀνοματοθεσία συγκροτοῦσιν ἕνα ἐνιαῖον σχήμα σχεσιακῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτου τόπου καὶ ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτου ποιότητος συμπίπτουσιν εἰς μίαν γενικὴν ἀρχὴν: οὐδὲν φυσικὸν ὄνομα ἔχει νόημα ἄνευ συστήματος σχέσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-08","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-04","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀναισθησία καὶ ἡ κοσμολογικὴ σχετικότης ἀκολουθοῦσιν ὁμοίαν λογικήν: ἡ ἀπουσία φαινομένου δὲν σημαίνει ἀπουσίαν μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-05","text":"Ἡ διάκριση φυσικῆς καὶ βιαίας κινήσεως μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμικὴν μηχανικὴν εἰς τὴν δυναμικὴν διάκριση ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","CL_JP8E_16:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-06","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν συγγενῶν τόπων προετοιμάζει τὴν πολλαπλότητα τῶν σωματικῶν δικτύων μεταδόσεως· ἡ ἑνότης δὲν ἀπαιτεῖ ὁμοιομορφίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματοθεσία γίνεται ἔλεγχος τῶν ἐπιπέδων: ἐξετάζει εἰ τὸ φαινόμενον ἀναφέρεται εἰς τὴν αἰτίαν, τὴν μετάδοσιν, τὴν φορὰν ἢ τὴν ἀξίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CL_JP8E_16:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς ἱεραρχία μεταδόσεων, ἐν ᾗ ἡ μορφὴ παράγει κίνησιν, ἡ κίνησις πάθος, καὶ τὸ πάθος ἀναγνώρισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ τόπος παύει νὰ εἶναι δοχεῖον τῶν σωμάτων καὶ γίνεται ἀποτέλεσμα τῶν φυσικῶν φορῶν καὶ τῶν σχέσεων συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ σῶμα μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ὁμοιογενὲς ὑπόστρωμα εἰς διαφορικὸν δίκτυον κινητικῶν καὶ παθητικῶν δυνατοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῶν φαινομένων γίνεται χρόνος μεταβολῆς: ἡ ταχύτης, ἡ βραδύτης, ἡ ἐπάνοδος καὶ ἡ κυκλοφορία καθορίζουσι τὸ πάθος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ γνώσις δὲν ἔρχεται ἔξωθεν τῶν φυσικῶν μηχανισμῶν, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ὅταν ἡ μετάδοσις φθάσῃ εἰς τὸ φρόνιμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A5","CH_JP8E_S_43:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἀναγωγὴ ἀπὸ τὸ φαινόμενον εἰς τὸ δίκτυον σχέσεων, καὶ ἀπὸ τὸ δίκτυον εἰς τὸν ἔλεγχον τῶν ὀνομάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-01","text":"Ἐμπειρικὸν πάθος → σωματικὴ μορφή → κίνησις → παραγόμενον πάθος → ἔλεγχος τοῦ ἐμπειρικοῦ ὀνόματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-02","text":"Ἀπόλυτος χωρικὴ ἀντίθεσις → σφαιρικὴ ἀναίρεσις → συγγενὴς τόπος → φυσικὴ φορά → σχεσιακὸς ὁρισμὸς τοῦ τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-03","text":"Τοπικὸν πάθος → μετάδοσις ἢ ἀπομόνωσις → αἴσθησις ἢ ἀναισθησία → ἀναγνώρισις ἢ ἀδυναμία ἀναγνώσεως τῆς αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς σχεσιακότητος σημαίνει φασικὴν μεταβολήν: ἀπὸ σχέσιν σώματος πρὸς μόριον γίνεται σχέσις γένους πρὸς τόπον καὶ ὀνόματος πρὸς κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντινομία καθολικῆς σφαιρικότητος καὶ πολλαπλῶν φορῶν δὲν λύεται, ἀλλὰ λειτουργεῖ ὡς μηχανὴ παραγωγῆς τῆς σχεσιακῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἔλξις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ ἀντικατάστασις παντὸς ἀπολύτου ὑπὸ δικτύου σχέσεων μορφῆς, φορᾶς, μεταδόσεως καὶ σημασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B01","text":"Ἐμπειρικὴ ποιότης → ἀναζήτησις σωματικῆς μορφῆς καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B02","text":"Μορφὴ καὶ σύστασις → διαφορὰ κινητικότητος → μετάδοσις ἢ ἀπομόνωσις τοῦ πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B03","text":"Μετάδοσις → αἴσθησις → ἀναγγελία αἰτίας, ἢ ἀποτυχία μεταδόσεως → ἀναισθησία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B04","text":"Φυσικὴ φορά → συγγενὴς ἢ ἀνόμοιος τόπος → φυσικὸν ἢ βίαιον βάρος καὶ κουφότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B05","text":"Σφαιροειδὴς κόσμος → ἀναίρεσις ἀπολύτου ἄνω/κάτω → πολλαπλὴ σχεσιακὴ χωρικὴ τάξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B06","text":"Σχεσιακὴ φυσικὴ → ἔλεγχος ὀνομάτων → ἀπόρριψις ἀπολύτων κατηγοριῶν → ἀνακατασκευὴ τοῦ κόσμου ὡς δικτύου μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B01","text":"Ἐμπειρικὴ ποιότης → φυσικὴ αἰτιότης → σωματικὴ μετάδοσις → αἴσθησις καὶ βίωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_43:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B02","text":"Τοπικὴ κίνησις → φυσικὴ φορά → συγγενὴς τόπος → σχεσιακὸς ὁρισμὸς βάρους καὶ κουφότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_42:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B03","text":"Σωματικὴ διαφορά → κυκλοφορία ἢ ἀπομόνωσις → αἴσθησις, ἀναισθησία, ἡδονὴ ἢ λύπη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B04","text":"Σφαιρικὴ κοσμολογία → ἀκύρωσις καθολικοῦ προσανατολισμοῦ → πολλαπλὰ συστήματα φυσικῶν τόπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B05","text":"Ἀπόλυτοι χαρακτηρισμοί → σχεσιακὴ ἀναθεώρησις → μηχανιστικὴ φυσικὴ → ὀνοματοθεσία ἀντιστοιχοῦσα τῇ δομῇ τοῦ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ σύγκλισις εἶναι ἡ ἀντικατάστασις τῶν ἀπολύτων ὑπὸ ἑνὸς δικτύου σχέσεων, ὅπερ παραμένει ἀνοικτὸν εἰς ὑποκαθορισμένας μεταβάσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-01","text":"Τὰ αἰσθητὰ πάθη ἀναταξινομοῦνται ὡς ἀποτελέσματα σχέσεων καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς αὐτόνομα πράγματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-02","text":"Ὁ γεωμετρικὸς χάρτης μετασχηματίζεται εἰς χάρτην φυσικῶν φορῶν, συγγενειῶν καὶ ἀντιστάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-03","text":"Τὸ σῶμα γίνεται ἄθροισμα διαφορικῶν περιοχῶν μεταδόσεως, ὄχι ἑνιαῖα καὶ ὁμοιογενὴς μηχανή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-04","text":"Ἡ αἴσθησις ἀποκτᾷ ἰδίαν βαθμίδα ἀναλύσεως καὶ δὲν ἀπορροφᾶται ὑπὸ τῆς ἡδονῆς ἢ τῆς λύπης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις γίνεται μέθοδος ἐλέγχου τῆς γλώσσης καὶ τῶν κοινῶν ἀντιθέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-06","text":"Καταρρέει ἡ ἀντίθεσις μεταξὺ ἑνὸς ἐνιαίου κόσμου καὶ πολλῶν τοπικῶν κατευθύνσεων· ἡ ἑνότης παράγει διαφοράς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-07","text":"Νέα μέθοδος γίνεται ἡ ἀνάγνωσις τῶν ὀνομάτων ὡς ἀποτυπωμάτων μηχανισμῶν καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς τελικῶν ἐξηγήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα ἀφορά θερμόν, ψυχρόν, σκληρόν, μαλακόν, βαρύ, κοῦφον, λεῖον, τραχύ, αἴσθησιν, ἡδονὴν καὶ λύπην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, τὰ φαινόμενα παράγονται ὑπὸ μορφῶν, μεγεθῶν, κινητικοτήτων, μεταδόσεων, ἀπωθήσεων καὶ σχέσεων τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἀνάλυσις ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὰς ἐμπειρικὰς ἀντιθέσεις διὰ μηχανιστικῆς καὶ σχεσιακῆς ἀνακατασκευῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ εἶναι γίνεται μεταβολή, φορά, μετάδοσις, ἐπάνοδος καὶ ἀναίρεσις ἀπολύτων πλαισίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου ἐκτελεῖ τὴν ἴδιαν ἀρχήν: ἀπὸ τὰ ὀνόματα ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὰ δίκτυα ποὺ τὰ παράγουσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-01","text":"Ἡ καθολικὴ σφαιρικότης φαίνεται νὰ ἀπαιτῇ ἑνότητα, ἐνώ ἡ φυσικὴ ἐξήγησις παράγει πολλαπλοὺς καὶ ἀντιθετικοὺς τόπους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-02","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν μικροδομὴν τῶν μορίων εἰς τὴν ἀναγνώρισιν τῆς αἰτίας ὑπὸ τοῦ φρονίμου παραμένει ἀσθενῶς θεμελιωμένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-03","text":"Ἡ σχεσιακὴ θεωρία τῶν ποιοτήτων ἀπειλεῖ νὰ ἀπορροφήσῃ τὴν ἰδιαιτερότητα τῶν παθημάτων, ἃ ὅμως διατηροῦσι διαφορετικὰ ἀποτελέσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς βίας λειτουργεῖ ἄλλοτε ὡς φυσικὴ ἐναντίωσις καὶ ἄλλοτε ὡς κριτήριον βιωματικῆς λύπης, χωρὶς πλήρη ἐνοποίησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A8","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-01","text":"Ἡ λέξις «σχετικόν» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ σχέσιν πρὸς τὴν σάρκα εἰς σχέσιν πρὸς συγγενῆ τόπον καὶ εἶτα εἰς σχέσιν πρὸς τὸ φρόνιμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-02","text":"Ἡ «κίνησις» μεταπίπτει ἀπὸ τοπικὴν φοράν εἰς κυκλοφορίαν πάθους καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς δυναμικὴν ἀξιολόγησιν ἡδονῆς καὶ λύπης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-03","text":"Ἡ «φύσις» παύει νὰ δηλοῖ μόνον οὐσίαν καὶ γίνεται κανὼν φυσικῆς φοράς, ἐπιστροφῆς καὶ ὀρθῆς ὀνοματοθεσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Mutating","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναισθησία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀπουσία ἐμπειρίας εἰς θετικῶς ἐξηγήσιμον ἀποτυχίαν μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα νοεῖ τὴν πραγματικότητα ὡς σφαιρικὸν δίκτυον κινητῶν καὶ ἀντιδρώντων σχέσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἱεραρχίαν ἀπολύτων τόπων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται κόμβος μεταδόσεως, ὅπου τὸ πάθος δύναται νὰ φθάσῃ εἰς φρόνησιν καὶ ἀναγνώρισιν αἰτίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ κόσμου εἶναι χρόνος κυκλοφορίας, βίας, ἐπιστροφῆς καὶ βραδείας ἀδρανοποιήσεως, οὐχὶ ἁπλῆ γραμμὴ μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐπέμβασις ἔγκειται οὐχὶ ἐν ἐπιβολῇ ἀπολύτων κατευθύνσεων, ἀλλ’ ἐν ἀναγνώσει καὶ μετατοπίσει τῶν δικτύων σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ κύριαι ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ μορφὴν καὶ κίνησιν εἰς πάθος, μετάδοσιν, κοσμικὴν φοράν καὶ ὀνοματοθεσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν ὁ ἀκριβὴς μηχανισμὸς τῆς πήξεως εἰς ψυχρότητα καὶ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ μικροδομὴν εἰς φρόνιμον ἀναγνώρισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B03","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ἐπειδὴ ἡ σχεσιακὴ ἀρχὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται διὰ διαφορετικῶν κλιμάκων, ἀλλὰ ἡ συνοχὴ αὐτοῦ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν τῶν μεταβάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασῴζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐὰν διατηρῇ τὴν σπειροειδῆ ἐπιστροφὴν ἀπὸ τὰ φαινόμενα εἰς τοὺς μηχανισμοὺς καὶ ἀπὸ τοὺς μηχανισμοὺς εἰς τὰ ὀνόματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B05","text":"Ἀντιστέκεται εἰς τὴν πλήρη ἀξιωματικὴν μείωσιν ἡ ἀσάφεια τῆς ἀναγνώσεως τοῦ φρονίμου, ἀλλ’ αὕτη δὲν ἀκυροῖ τὴν ἐνότητα τοῦ ὅλου σχήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232701056029Z_388a98af","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 46–48","source_sha256":"751919533b645240df6cdad235c2a69640b5ce3aff509052aa7a06fffd0cabba","sha256":"37ef1f32615b2ec74241540d5cad1e18f22b2dc3212cba9c18ad2669e941d2c2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:27:01.058730+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-01","text":"The principal problem is that perceptible affections and spatial oppositions appear absolute, whereas their nature depends on form, motion, matter, and relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_42:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-02","text":"The reframing transforms phenomena from absolute qualities into derived relations of natural mechanisms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-03","text":"The bodily explanation unfolds from form and motion into transmission, sensation, and experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-04","text":"Cosmology transforms above and below from universal directions into relations of natural motion, affinity, and force.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-05","text":"The unity of the cosmos does not abolish differences, but produces multiple systems of relational places and transmissions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-06","text":"The course of the argument is spiral: from perceptible affections it ascends to mechanisms, and from mechanisms returns to correct naming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-07","text":"The system becomes a natural mechanics of relations, which tests common names through material and cosmic structure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AS-08","text":"The final position is relational, but not fully closed, because the transition from microstructure to knowledge remains partly underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] No perceptible quality is conceived independently of relations of form, motion, matter, and place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The form of the body differentiates affections and their modes of operation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Heat and cold are rewritten from simple sensations into effects of motion, separation, compression, and repulsion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_41:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Hardness, softness, smoothness, and roughness are relative determinations of bodily resistance and constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:D5","CH_JP8E_S_43:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] An affection becomes perceptible only when bodily transmission passes through the distinct parts and reaches the intelligent faculty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Sensation, pleasure, and pain constitute distinct levels, which are connected but not identical.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A12","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Natural motion is distinguished from violent transport by the relation of a body to what is akin or dissimilar.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A4","CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Heavy and light cease to be absolute spatial properties and become names of natural motion, place, and force.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Each kind has an akin place, so that the unity of the whole coexists with multiple opposing motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The spherical arrangement invalidates the hypothesis of a single universal above and below.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Correct naming must follow the actual structure of natural relations and not anthropocentric impressions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Nature is explained as a network of changes, in which forms, motions, resistances, and transmissions produce phenomena and names.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-01","text":"Reference to motion recurs, but mutates from microsomatic division into cosmic motion and then into transmission of affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-02","text":"The distinction between absolute and relative recurs in qualities, places, and the oppositions of above and below.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-03","text":"Above and below are displaced from geometrical points into names of natural motion and relation to an akin place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-04","text":"Resistance changes function: initially it signifies hardness, then the force of displacement, and finally pain or the isolation of affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A9","CH_JP8E_S_42:A6","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-05","text":"The unity of the cosmos is retained, but recoded as a multiplicity of akin places and differences of mobility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-06","text":"Sensation is separated from pleasure and pain, so that sensation does not constitute the final criterion of experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_43:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RMD-07","text":"The simple name disappears as an explanation, having performed the task of empirical starting point.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-01","text":"The precise geometry of square bases and particular shapes remains local, because the higher synthesis retains only the principle of morphological causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A10","CH_JP8E_S_41:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-02","text":"The general principle that affections are relations of form, motion, and matter is scaled up to the present level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-03","text":"The principle of natural motion becomes a bridge between the chapters, linking cosmology with aesthetics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:A10","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-04","text":"The catalyst of the great transition is the invalidation of absolute above and below, because it compels all naming to become relational.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-05","text":"The distinction among sensation, pleasure, and pain exceeds the local level, because it reorganizes the concept of experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-06","text":"The absolute spatial dichotomy becomes obsolete and is replaced by multiple natural directions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:CGD-07","text":"The precise transition from microstructure to recognition of the cause remains underdetermined and does not become a universal axiom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-01","text":"The explanation of affections by bare names without bodily causes is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-02","text":"The absolute self-subsistence of hot, cold, hard, and soft is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_41:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-03","text":"The identification of perceptible affection with pleasure or pain is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-04","text":"The single and universal direction of above and below in a spherical cosmos is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-05","text":"The homogeneity of the body is rejected, because sensation presupposes differences of mobility and transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:GNX-06","text":"The independence of names from the motions and natural relations in which they are applied is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-01","text":"The hypothesis that common sensation already supplies the final natural explanation must be false.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-02","text":"The idea that one geometrical system can determine the natural motions of all kinds must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_42:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-03","text":"The reduction of experience to one unified center of affection must be excluded, because affection requires circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-04","text":"The distinction between natural motion and violent transport must be maintained, without which the relational meaning of weight collapses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_42:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:DBN-05","text":"The hypothesis that naming precedes cosmic and bodily analysis must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-01","text":"Absent is the cosmos as one absolute framework of orientation, which would arrange all things under one common direction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-02","text":"Absent is absolute identity between bodily change, sensation, and experiential value.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-03","text":"Absent is a homogeneous body, in which every part would move and be affected alike.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-04","text":"Absent is the possibility of explaining nature by static forms; reality appears only as change and relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSA-05","text":"The deepest absent possibility is a universal map that would resolve, without relation, the oppositions of place, affection, and meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-01","text":"The negation of absolute above and below extends from cosmology to the negation of absolute bodily qualities.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_41:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-02","text":"Natural motion, the transmission of affection, and correct naming constitute a unified schema of relational causality.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-03","text":"The absence of absolute place and the absence of absolute quality coincide in one general principle: no natural name has meaning without a system of relations.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-08","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_41:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_42:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-04","text":"Bodily insensibility and cosmological relativity follow a similar logic: the absence of a phenomenon does not mean the absence of a mechanism.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-05","text":"The distinction between natural and violent motion passes from cosmic mechanics into the dynamic distinction between pleasure and pain.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-07","CL_JP8E_16:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4","CH_JP8E_S_42:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-06","text":"The multiplicity of akin places prepares the multiplicity of bodily networks of transmission; unity does not require uniformity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-05","CL_JP8E_16:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:XD-07","text":"Naming becomes a test of levels: it examines whether the phenomenon refers to cause, transmission, motion, or value.","refs":["CL_JP8E_16:GA-01","CL_JP8E_16:GA-11","CL_JP8E_16:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-01","text":"Reality is reconstructed as a hierarchy of transmissions, in which form produces motion, motion affection, and affection recognition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-02","text":"Place ceases to be a receptacle of bodies and becomes the result of natural motions and relations of affinity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-03","text":"The body is transformed from a homogeneous substrate into a differential network of kinetic and passive capacities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-04","text":"The time of phenomena becomes time of change: speed, slowness, return, and circulation determine affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A9","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-05","text":"Knowledge does not come from outside natural mechanisms, but is produced when transmission reaches the intelligent faculty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:A5","CH_JP8E_S_43:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:BSD-06","text":"The method of the system is reduction from the phenomenon to the network of relations, and from the network to the testing of names.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-01","text":"Empirical affection → bodily form → motion → derived affection → testing of the empirical name.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-02","text":"Absolute spatial opposition → spherical negation → akin place → natural motion → relational definition of place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-03","text":"Local affection → transmission or isolation → sensation or insensibility → recognition or inability to read the cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-04","text":"The recurrence of relationality signifies a phase-change: from the relation of body to part it becomes the relation of kind to place and of name to cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-05","text":"The antinomy of universal sphericity and multiple motions is not resolved, but functions as a machine for producing relational order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:RLE-06","text":"The attraction of the system is the replacement of every absolute by a network of relations of form, motion, transmission, and meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_42:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B01","text":"Empirical quality → search for bodily form and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B02","text":"Form and constitution → difference of mobility → transmission or isolation of affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B03","text":"Transmission → sensation → report of the cause, or failure of transmission → insensibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B04","text":"Natural motion → akin or dissimilar place → natural or violent heaviness and lightness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B05","text":"Spherical cosmos → negation of absolute above/below → multiple relational spatial order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FGS-B06","text":"Relational physics → testing of names → rejection of absolute categories → reconstruction of the cosmos as a network of changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B01","text":"Empirical quality → natural causality → bodily transmission → sensation and experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_43:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B02","text":"Local motion → natural motion → akin place → relational definition of heaviness and lightness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_42:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B03","text":"Bodily difference → circulation or isolation → sensation, insensibility, pleasure, or pain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B04","text":"Spherical cosmology → invalidation of universal orientation → multiple systems of natural places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_42:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B05","text":"Absolute characterizations → relational revision → mechanistic physics → naming corresponding to the structure of the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_41:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:AFM-B06","text":"The final convergence is the replacement of absolutes by a network of relations, which remains open to underdetermined transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-01","text":"Perceptible affections are reclassified as effects of relations and not as autonomous things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-02","text":"The geometrical map is transformed into a map of natural motions, affinities, and resistances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-03","text":"The body becomes an aggregate of differential regions of transmission, not a unified and homogeneous machine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-04","text":"Sensation acquires its own level of analysis and is not absorbed by pleasure or pain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-05","text":"Natural explanation becomes a method for testing language and common oppositions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_41:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-06","text":"The opposition between one unified cosmos and many local directions collapses; unity produces differences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MME-07","text":"A new method becomes the reading of names as imprints of mechanisms and not as final explanations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_41:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface, the system concerns hot, cold, hard, soft, heavy, light, smooth, rough, sensation, pleasure, and pain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, phenomena are produced by forms, magnitudes, mobilities, transmissions, repulsions, and relations of place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, analysis replaces empirical oppositions by mechanistic and relational reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, being becomes change, motion, transmission, return, and negation of absolute frameworks.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, the form of the argument performs the same principle: from names it returns to the networks that produce them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AF2","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-01","text":"Universal sphericity seems to require unity, whereas natural explanation produces multiple and opposing places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-02","text":"The transition from the microstructure of parts to recognition of the cause by the intelligent faculty remains weakly grounded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_43:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-03","text":"The relational theory of qualities threatens to absorb the particularity of affections, which nevertheless retain different effects.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:FL-04","text":"The principle of force functions at times as natural opposition and at times as a criterion of experiential pain, without complete unification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A8","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-01","text":"The word «relative» mutates from relation to flesh into relation to an akin place and then into relation to the intelligent faculty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_42:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-02","text":"«Motion» shifts from local movement into circulation of affection and then into dynamic evaluation of pleasure and pain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:A4","CH_JP8E_S_43:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-03","text":"«Nature» ceases to signify only substance and becomes a rule of natural motion, return, and correct naming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:A7","CH_JP8E_S_43:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Mutating","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MP-04","text":"Insensibility mutates from absence of experience into a positively explicable failure of transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-01","text":"The system conceives reality as a spherical network of moving and reacting relations, not as a hierarchy of absolute places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_42:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a node of transmission, where affection can reach intelligence and recognition of cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_43:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-03","text":"The time of the cosmos is a time of circulation, force, return, and slow deactivation, not a simple line of changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_41:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:HSI-04","text":"Possible intervention lies not in imposing absolute directions, but in reading and shifting networks of relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_41:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B01","text":"The principal principles suffice for reconstruction of the movement from form and motion to affection, transmission, cosmic motion, and naming.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B02","text":"The precise mechanism of coagulation into coldness and the transition from microstructure to intelligent recognition remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B03","text":"The system is coherent because the relational principle recurs across different scales, but its cohesion depends on the sequence of transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system if it retains the spiral return from phenomena to mechanisms and from mechanisms to names.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_41:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_16:MRT-B05","text":"The obscurity of the intelligent faculty's recognition resists complete axiomatic reduction, but this does not invalidate the unity of the whole schema.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_43:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_42:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_16@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_16:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 46–48"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 46–48","context":"Section 62 · Section 63 · Section 64","original_title":"Chapters 46–48","original_context":"Section 62 · Section 63 · Section 64"},"original_title":"Chapters 46–48","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 49–51","order":17,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_44","CH_JP8E_S_45","CH_JP8E_S_46"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_17@R001","sha256":"7510b2de55c67789cc3360c2b112cfa7a68e2d495ab967abb3b2cec8ae619bd4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα εἶναι πῶς αἱ ἡδοναί, αἱ λύπαι καὶ αἱ λοιπαὶ αἰσθήσεις δύνανται νὰ παραχθῶσιν ἐκ σωματικῶν κινήσεων χωρὶς νὰ ἀναχθῶσιν εἰς ἀμεταβλήτους ποιότητας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_45:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὰ αἰσθητὰ ὀνόματα ἀπὸ τὴν φαινομενικὴν ποιότητα εἰς δύναμιν, πάθος, κίνησιν καὶ σωματικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-03","text":"Τὸ κοινὸν θεμέλιον εἶναι ὅτι τὸ σῶμα οὐ δέχεται παθητικῶς τὰ ἔξωθεν, ἀλλὰ μετασχηματίζει αὐτὰ διὰ κινήσεως, ἀντιστάσεως καὶ ἀποκαταστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-04","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ φυσιολογία τῆς γλώττης, τῶν ῥινῶν, τῶν ὤτων καὶ τῆς ὄψεως γίνεται ἐξειδίκευσις ἑνὸς γενικοῦ σχεσιακοῦ νόμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ αὐτὴ σωματικὴ ἀρχὴ δύναται νὰ ἐμφανισθῇ ὡς ἡδονή, λύπη, γεύσις, ὀσμή, φωνὴ ἢ χροιά, ἀναλόγως τοῦ ὀργάνου καὶ τοῦ τρόπου μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-06","text":"Ὁ χρόνος, ὁ ρυθμὸς, ἡ φορά καὶ τὸ μέτρον δὲν εἶναι ἐπικουρικὰ γνωρίσματα, ἀλλὰ συντελοῦσιν εἰς τὴν γένεσιν αὐτοῦ τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ λόγου εἶναι ἀπὸ τὴν ὀνομασίαν πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν, ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν πρὸς τὴν σχέσιν, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν σχέσιν πρὸς τὴν ἀναταξινόμησιν τῶν αἰσθητῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὡς πρὸς τὴν σχεσιακὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ ἀνοικτὴ ὡς πρὸς τὴν πλήρη μηχανικὴν τῶν μεταδόσεων καὶ τῶν ἀντιστοιχιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ αἰσθητὸν παράγεται ἐκ σχέσεως σωματικῶν κινήσεων, μεταδόσεων, ὀργάνων καὶ μέτρων, οὐχὶ ἐκ αὐτοτελοῦς ποιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ σῶμα εἶναι ἐνεργὸς μετασχηματιστὴς τοῦ ἐρεθίσματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἔξωθεν δύναμις ἀναδιατάσσεται ἐν τοῖς δεχομένοις μέρεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἡδονὴ καὶ ἡ λύπη εἶναι διαφοραὶ τοῦ πάθους ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ σωματικῷ τόπῳ, αἳ μεταβάλλονται κατὰ τὸν ῥυθμὸν ἀλλοιώσεως καὶ ἐπαναφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Τὰ αἰσθητὰ ὀνόματα ὀφείλουσι τὴν ἐρμηνευτικὴν αὐτῶν δύναμιν εἰς τὰς φυσικὰς αἰτίας τῶν παθημάτων, οὐχὶ εἰς ἁπλὴν φαινομενικὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ χρόνος, ὁ ρυθμός, ἡ φορά καὶ τὸ μέτρον καθορίζουσιν ἐὰν μία κίνησις γένηται αἰσθητή, ἡδεῖα, λυπηρὰ ἢ ἀναίσθητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Οὐκ ὑπάρχει μία καθολικὴ μηχανὴ αἰσθήσεως· ἕκαστον αἰσθητήριον ἐξειδικεύει τὴν σχεσιακὴν γένεσιν διὰ διαφόρου μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ φορεὺς τῆς αἰσθήσεως δύναται νὰ χωρισθῇ ἀπὸ τὸ αἰσθητὸν περιεχόμενον, ἐπειδὴ τὸ αὐτὸ μέσον δὲν ἐγγυᾶται τὴν αὐτὴν αἴσθησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἰσότης καὶ ἡ ἀνισότης τῶν μεγεθῶν ἀποτελοῦσιν ὅρους ἀναισθησίας, συγκρίσεως καὶ διακρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Τὰ μεταβατικὰ φαινόμενα, ὥσπερ ἡ ὀσμή, ἔχουσιν ὀντολογικὴν δύναμιν ὄχι διὰ μονίμου εἴδους, ἀλλὰ διὰ τῆς μεταβολῆς μεταξὺ σωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ σχέσις γίνεται ἡ ὕστατη ἀρχὴ τῆς αἰσθητικῆς ἐξηγήσεως, ἐπειδὴ οὔτε τὸ ἐξωτερικὸν οὔτε τὸ ἐσωτερικὸν ἀρκεί καθ᾽ ἑαυτό.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις τελευτᾷ εἰς μετάφρασιν ποιοτήτων εἰς κινήσεις, μέτρα, ἀναλογίας καὶ μεταδόσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀμέσου προσβάσεως εἰς τὰ πράγματα ἀναγκάζει τὴν αἴσθησιν νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς ἐνδιάμεσος μηχανισμὸς καὶ ὄχι ὡς διαφανὴς ἀποκάλυψις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς σωματικῆς ἀντιδράσεως ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἐν ἡδονῇ, λύπῃ καὶ γεύσει, ἀλλὰ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὸ καθόλου σῶμα εἰς τοπικὰ ὄργανα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀλλοτρίωσις καὶ ἡ ἐπάνοδος μεταλλάσσονται εἰς θερμότητα, ξήρανσιν, διάλυσιν, λείανσιν καὶ μετάδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ρυθμοῦ, ἡ ὁποία ἀρχικῶς ἐξηγεῖ τὴν ἡδονὴν καὶ τὴν λύπην, ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὸ μέτρον τῶν γευστικῶν καὶ ὀπτικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ὀσμή μεταστρέφεται ἀπὸ φαινόμενον ποιοτικὸν εἰς σημεῖον μεταβάσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἔλλειψις ἰδίου γένους γίνεται παραγωγικὴ ἀρχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-05","text":"Ὁ φορεὺς καὶ τὸ περιεχόμενον ἀρχικῶς συμπλέκονται, ἔπειτα δὲ διακρίνονται, ὥστε τὸ πνεῦμα, ὁ ἀὴρ καὶ τὰ μόρια νὰ μὴ ταυτίζωνται πρὸς τὸ αἰσθητόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ σύγκρισις καὶ ἡ διάκρισις ἐπαναλαμβάνονται ἐν γεύσει, ἀκοῇ καὶ ὄψει, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλουσι τὸ κριτήριον αὐτῶν ἀνάλογα πρὸς τὸ ὄργανον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","CH_JP8E_S_46:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ὑπόθεσις τῶν ἀμεταβλήτων αἰσθητῶν εἰδῶν ἀπορρίπτεται ἀφού πρῶτον ἐπιτελέσῃ τὸ ἔργον τῆς ὀνοματολογικῆς ἀφετηρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ εἰς μελλοντικὴν συμφωνίαν ἀναστέλλει τὴν τελικὴν ἐνοποίησιν καὶ μετατρέπει τὴν ἀτέλειαν εἰς ἐνεργὸν ὅρον τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικαὶ λεπτομέρειαι, ὥσπερ ἡ διάκρισις στρυφνοῦ, αὐστηροῦ, πικροῦ καὶ ἁλυκοῦ, παραμένουσιν ἐν μέρει ὑποκαθορισμέναι καὶ δὲν ἀποτελοῦσιν παγκοσμίους ἀρχάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ θερμότης, ἡ ὑγρότης καὶ ἡ στοιχειώδης σύστασις παραμένουσιν τοπικοὶ μηχανισμοί, ἀλλὰ κλιμακοῦνται ὡς παραδείγματα γενικωτέρας αἰτιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ κοινὴ ἀρχὴ ἡ ὁποία γεφυροῖ τὰ κεφάλαια εἶναι ἡ γένεσις φαινομένου διὰ σχέσεως μεταβολῆς καὶ ἀντιδράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν γεύσιν εἰς τὴν ὀσμήν, τὴν ἀκοὴν καὶ τὴν ὄψιν καταλύει τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι μία μόνη ποιοτικὴ ταξινομία ἀρκεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ στοιχειολογία καὶ ἡ λεπτομερὴς φυσιολογία ὑποτάσσονται εἰς τὴν ὑψηλοτέραν ἀρχὴν τῆς σχεσιακῆς γενέσεως καὶ δὲν διατηροῦν αὐτοτελῆ θεωρητικὴν κυριότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς συμφωνίας τῶν φωνῶν ἀποτελεῖ ὅριον τῆς παρούσης συνθέσεως, οὐχὶ ἀναίρεσιν τῆς γενικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι αἱ αἰσθηταὶ ποιότητες ὑπάρχουσιν ὡς ἀμετάβλητοι φορεῖς ἀνεξάρτητοι ἀπὸ τὰ σώματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἁπλὴ ἀντιστοίχισις στοιχείου καὶ αἰσθήματος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις ἀπαιτεῖ μεταβολήν, ὄργανον καὶ μέτρον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ φορέως πρὸς τὸ περιεχόμενον, ἐπειδὴ τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ ὁ ἀὴρ δύνανται νὰ κινοῦνται ἄνευ τῆς ἀντιστοίχου αἰσθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις μιᾶς κοινῆς, ἀδιαφοροποιήτου ἐσωτερικῆς δυνάμεως, ἥτις ἐξηγεῖ πᾶσαν αἴσθησιν κατὰ τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἰσότης ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος αἰσθητότητος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἰσότης δύναται νὰ παράγῃ ἀναισθησίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ τελικὴ ἀμεσότης τοῦ αἰσθάνεσθαι, διότι ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις ἀναζητεῖ κρυπτοὺς μηχανισμοὺς μεταδόσεως καὶ μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-01","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ ὑπόθεσις τῶν ἀμεταβλήτων ποιοτήτων ἦν ἀληθής, ἡ ἀνάγκη μεταφράσεως τῶν αἰσθητῶν εἰς κινήσεις καὶ σχέσεις θὰ κατέρρεεν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-02","text":"Ἐὰν τὸ σῶμα ἦν παθητικὸν δοχεῖον, ἡ διαφορὰ ὀργάνων, ρυθμῶν καὶ μέτρων δὲν θὰ εἶχεν αἰτιακὴν ἰσχύν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-03","text":"Ἐὰν ὁ φορεὺς ἐταυτίζετο πρὸς τὸ περιεχόμενον, ἡ κίνησις τοῦ πνεύματος ἄνευ ὀσμῆς καὶ ἡ διάφορος ὄψις τῶν μορίων θὰ ἦσαν ἀδύνατοι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-04","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ ἐμπειρικὴ διάκρισις ἐγγυᾶτο ὀντολογικὴν διάκρισιν, ἡ ὀσμὴ θὰ ἔπρεπε νὰ ἔχῃ ἴδιον γένος καὶ ἴδιον στοιχεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-05","text":"Ἐὰν ἡ ποιοτικὴ ἀντίθεσις ἦν ἀνεξάρτητος τοῦ μέτρου, ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ γλυκύτητα εἰς δριμύτητα καὶ ἀπὸ ἁλυκότητα εἰς πικρότητα δὲν θὰ ἐξηγεῖτο.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα κυκλοῖ τὴν ἀπουσίαν ἀμέσου ἐπαφῆς μεταξὺ ἀντικειμένου καὶ αἰσθήσεως· τὸ ἀντικείμενον εἶναι πάντοτε μεταφρασμένον διὰ σωματικῆς διαμεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἡδονὴ, ἡ λύπη καὶ αἱ αἰσθήσεις ἔχουσιν ἰδίαν αἰτίαν παρὰ τὴν κίνησιν τῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_46:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται ἡ ὀντολογικὴ ἐμπιστοσύνη εἰς τὰ ὀνόματα, ἐπειδὴ τὸ ὄνομα δηλοῖ πάθος καὶ μηχανισμόν, οὐχὶ αὐτοτελῆ οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἑνιαίας ἀρχῆς τῶν αἰσθήσεων ἀναγκάζει τὸ σύστημα νὰ ἀναγνωρίσῃ πολλαπλὰς μηχανικὰς ὁδούς πρὸς τὸ φαινόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-01","text":"Ἡ γεύσις, ἡ ὀσμή, ἡ φωνὴ καὶ ἡ χροιὰ συγκλίνουσιν εἰς μίαν γενικὴν ἀρχήν: τὸ αἰσθητὸν εἶναι γεγονὸς μεταβολῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἰδιότης ἀντικειμένου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-01","CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_44:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς σωματικῆς ἀποκαταστάσεως μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἡδονὴν καὶ τὴν λύπην εἰς τὴν γλυκύτητα, ἡ ὁποία γίνεται λειτουργικὴ ἰατρεία τῆς βίαιας διαταράξεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-03","CL_JP8E_17:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-03","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φορέως καὶ περιεχομένου ἐν τῇ ὀσμῇ ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὴν φωνὴν καὶ τὴν χροιάν, ὥστε καμμία μετάδοσις νὰ μὴ θεωρῆται αὐτόματα ταὐτὸν πρὸς τὸ φαινόμενον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-07","CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἴδια σωματικὴ κίνησις δύναται νὰ διαμορφωθῇ εἰς ἄλλο φαινόμενον, ὅταν μεταβληθῶσι τὸ ὄργανον, ἡ ἀναλογία καὶ ἡ φορά.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἰσότης, ἡ ἀνισότης καὶ ὁ ρυθμὸς συνδέονται εἰς κοινὸν κατώφλιον θεωρίας, ὅπου τὸ μέτρον καθορίζει ἂν θὰ ὑπάρξῃ φαινόμενον ἢ ἀναισθησία.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-05","CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_44:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου γένους τῆς ὀσμῆς δὲν ἀφήνει κενόν, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπει τὴν μετάβασιν εἰς τὸ κύριον ὑπόδειγμα τοῦ αἰσθητοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-09","CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀναβαλλομένη συμφωνία τῶν φωνῶν δείκνυσιν ὅτι ἡ σχεσιακὴ ἀρχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυροτέρα τῆς τελικῆς ταξινομίας, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἐνοποίησις παραμένει ἀτέλεστος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CL_JP8E_17:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης τῶν αἰσθητῶν ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς δίκτυον διεργασιῶν, ἐν ᾧ οὐδὲν φαινόμενον προηγείται ἀπολύτως τῆς σχέσεως ἡ ὁποία τὸ παράγει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ γνώσις τῶν αἰσθητῶν δὲν εἶναι ἀνάγνωσις ἑτοίμων ποιοτήτων, ἀλλὰ ἀνακατασκευὴ κρυπτῶν κινήσεων, μεταδόσεων καὶ ἀναλογιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ αἰσθητήριον ἀποβαίνει μηχανὴ διακρίσεως καὶ οὐχὶ παθητικὸς καθρέπτης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀντίδρασις αὐτοῦ συνδιαμορφοῖ τὸ φαινόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὸν πλαίσιον εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν αἰτιακὴν διάστασιν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ ρυθμὸς καθορίζει τὴν ἔκφανσιν τοῦ πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ μέθοδος ἀπαιτεῖ νὰ ἀναγνωρίζῃ τὴν ποιοτικὴν διαφοράν ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα ποσοτικῶν καὶ μορφολογικῶν σχέσεων, χωρὶς νὰ ἐξαλείφῃ τὴν φαινομενικὴν διαφοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ ἰσχύς τοῦ συστήματος παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἐνοποιήσεως τῶν μηχανισμῶν, ἡ δὲ ἀδυναμία αὐτοῦ ἐκ τῆς ἀναβολῆς τῶν τελικῶν φυσιολογικῶν ἀποδείξεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ αἰσθητὴ ποιότης ὑποβάλλεται εἰς μηχανικὴν ἀνάλυσιν, ἡ μηχανικὴ ἀνάλυσις ἀνασυνθέτει νέαν σχέσιν, καὶ ἡ νέα σχέσις ἐπαναχαράσσει τὴν ποιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ κίνησις μεταδίδεται εἰς τὸ ὄργανον, τὸ ὄργανον παράγει πάθος, καὶ τὸ πάθος ἀπαιτεῖ ἐκ νέου ἀναγωγὴν εἰς κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἀλλοτρίωσις ὀξύνει τὸ πάθος, ἡ ἐπάνοδος τὸ μεταστρέφει, καὶ ἡ μεταστροφὴ ἐπαναφέρει τὸ σῶμα εἰς νέαν κλίμακα αἰσθητότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φορέως καὶ περιεχομένου ἀναγκάζει τὴν θεωρίαν νὰ ἐπανεξετάζῃ ἕκαστον μέσον ὡς χωριστὴν μηχανὴν φαινομενοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους γίνεται ἀρχικῶς ἄρνησις, ἔπειτα μέθοδος, καὶ τέλος ὀντολογικὸς ἑλκυστὴς πρὸς τὴν σχεσιακὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ θεωρία σπειροειδῶς μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν γεύσιν εἰς τὴν ὀσμήν, ἀπὸ τὴν ὀσμὴν εἰς τὴν ἀκοήν, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀκοὴν εἰς τὴν ὄψιν, ἐπαναλαμβάνουσα τὸν αὐτὸν νόμον μὲ διαφορετικὰ μέσα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_46:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B01","text":"Ἐξωτερικὴ δύναμις προσβάλλει σωματικὸν μέρος, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ προσβολὴ μετατρέπεται ἐν αὐτῷ διὰ τῆς ἀντιστάσεως καὶ τῆς διατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B02","text":"Ἡ μεταβολὴ διαδίδεται διὰ τοῦ καταλλήλου μέσου καὶ ὑποπίπτει εἰς ρυθμόν, φοράν, μέγεθος καὶ ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B03","text":"Τὸ ὄργανον συγκρίνει τὴν ἐξωτερικὴν ἀπόρροιαν πρὸς τὴν ἰδίαν ὕλην καὶ παράγει αἴσθησιν, διάκρισιν ἢ ἀναισθησίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B04","text":"Τὸ παραγόμενον πάθος λαμβάνει ὄνομα κατὰ τὴν αἰτιακὴν δύναμιν, ἀλλὰ τὸ ὄνομα δὲν ἀποκτᾷ ἀνεξάρτητον οὐσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐπαναλαμβανόμενη ἀποτυχία τῶν οὐσιολογικῶν ὑποθέσεων μετατρέπει τὴν σχέσιν εἰς ἑλκυστὴν ὅλης τῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀκατέργαστη αἰσθητὴ ποιότης → ἀναζήτησις σωματικῆς αἰτίας → ἀνάλυσις κινήσεως, πάθους καὶ μέτρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B02","text":"Γενικὸς νόμος σωματικῆς μεταβολῆς → τοπικὴ φυσιολογία → γεύσις, ὀσμή, ἀκοὴ καὶ ὄψις ὡς διακεκριμέναι ἐξειδικεύσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B03","text":"Σωματικὴ προσβολή → μετάδοσις διὰ μέσου → σύγκρισις πρὸς τὸ ὄργανον → φαινόμενον ἢ ἀναισθησία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B04","text":"Ἀπουσία ἰδίου εἴδους → ἀνάγκη σχεσιακῆς αἰτιότητος → ἀναταξινόμησις τῶν αἰσθητῶν ὡς μεταβατικῶν παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B05","text":"Σχεσιακὴ ἐνοποίησις → πολλαπλὴ μηχανικὴ διαφοροποίησις → ἀναστολὴ τελικῆς συμφωνίας → ἀνοικτὴ ἀλλὰ συνεκτικὴ κατάληξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-01","text":"Τὸ πεδίον τῶν αἰσθήσεων ἀναχαράσσεται ἀπὸ κατάλογος ποιοτήτων εἰς χάρτην μεταδόσεων, ἀντιδράσεων καὶ συγκρίσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀντικειμένου καὶ φαινομένου γίνεται λειτουργικὴ καὶ ὄχι οὐσιολογική, ἐπειδὴ τὸ φαινόμενον ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ὀργάνωσιν τῆς σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καὶ ὁ ρυθμὸς καθίστανται ὄργανα ἐξηγήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διαφορὰ τῶν φαινομένων δὲν ἀναλύεται χωρὶς τὴν πορείαν τῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-04","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογία τῶν αἰσθητηρίων μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ βοηθητικὴ λεπτομέρεια εἰς ἀναγκαῖον ὅρον τῆς ὀντολογίας τοῦ φαινομένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις ἑνιαίας αἰσθητικῆς ἀρχῆς δὲν καταστρέφει τὴν ἐνοποίησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀπαιτεῖ ἐνοποίησιν διὰ κοινοῦ σχήματος σχέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς συμφωνίας μετατρέπει τὸ ἀτελὲς σημεῖον εἰς ὅρον ἀναγνώσεως: ἡ θεωρία ἰσχύει ὡς μηχανικὴ κατεύθυνσις πρὶν ἢ ὡς πλήρης ἀπόδειξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἐξηγοῦνται γεύσις, ὀσμή, φωνή, χροιά, ἡδονή καὶ λύπη ὡς διακεκριμένα αἰσθητὰ πάθη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὰ πάθη παράγονται ἐκ κινήσεων, μεταδόσεων, ἀντιστάσεων, συστάσεων καὶ ἀναλογιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ μέθοδος μετατρέπει τὴν περιγραφὴν τῆς ἐμπειρίας εἰς γενετικὴν ἀνακατασκευήν τῶν αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου τὸ αἰσθητὸν εἶναι γεγονὸς μεταβολῆς, οὔτε ἀνεξάρτητον πράγμα οὔτε καθαρὴ ἐσωτερικὴ παράστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἀρνητικὴ ἀποδόμησις τῶν οὐσιολογικῶν ὑποθέσεων παράγει θετικὸν σχήμα σχέσεων καὶ μηχανισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θεωρία ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν πλήρη μετάφρασιν τῶν ποιοτήτων εἰς μηχανισμούς, ἀλλὰ ἐνίοτε ἀφήνει τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὸ ποσοτικὸν εἰς τὸ ποιοτικὸν ἀσυμπύκνωτον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-02","text":"Ἡ στοιχειώδης ἐξήγησις τῆς ὀσμῆς καὶ ἡ γενικὴ σχεσιακὴ ἀρχὴ συνυπάρχουσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ πρώτη ἐνίοτε φαίνεται ὡς ἀναλογία μᾶλλον ἢ ὡς πλήρης μηχανική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ αὐτὴ ὕλη δύναται νὰ παραγάγῃ διάφορα φαινόμενα ἀπειλεῖ τὴν ἁπλότητα τῶν ὀνομάτων, ἀλλὰ ταυτοχρόνως ἀποτελεῖ ὅρον τῆς σχεσιακῆς θεωρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναβολὴ τῆς συμφωνίας τῶν φωνῶν διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀνοικτότητα τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ παρεμποδίζει τὴν ὁριστικὴν ἐνοποίησιν τῆς αἰσθητικῆς μηχανικῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ποιότης μεταλλάσσεται εἰς δύναμιν ὅταν ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεῖται ἀπὸ τὸ «τί ἐστιν» εἰς τὸ «τί ποιεῖ».","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-02","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ κίνησις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ φορεὺς εἰς περιεχόμενον καὶ πάλιν εἰς φορέα, ὅταν ἡ μετάδοσις ἐξετάζηται ἐν ἄλλῳ αἰσθητηρίῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις ἰδίου εἴδους μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀρνητικὴν ἔνστασιν εἰς θετικὴν θεωρίαν τῆς μεταβάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-04","text":"Τὸ μέτρον μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ περιγραφικὸν γνώρισμα εἰς γενετικὸν αἴτιον, ἐπειδὴ καθορίζει τὸ ἂν ἡ κίνησις φανῇ ἢ μείνῃ ἀναίσθητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα φαντάζεται τὴν πραγματικότητα ὡς δίκτυον μεταδόσεων, ἐν ᾧ τὰ φαινόμενα παράγονται ἀπὸ διασταυρουμένας κινήσεις καὶ ἀντιστάσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον γίνεται κόμβος δεκτικὸς καὶ ἀντιδρῶν, οὔτε κύριος τῶν φαινομένων οὔτε ἁπλοῦς καθρέπτης αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος νοεῖται ὡς διαφορὰ ρυθμῶν, καθυστερήσεων, ἐπιστροφῶν καὶ μεταβάσεων, ἥτις συνδιαμορφοῖ τὸ αἰσθητόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ διαφυγὴ δὲν εἶναι ἔξοδος ἐκ τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ ἀνασύνθεσις τῶν μηχανισμῶν οἳ μετατρέπουσι τὴν κίνησιν εἰς φαινόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ παγκόσμιαι ἀρχαί περὶ σχέσεως, σωματικῆς ἀντιδράσεως, μέτρου, μεταδόσεως καὶ ὀργάνου ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ τὴν αἰσθητὴν ὀνομασίαν εἰς τὴν φυσικὴν γένεσιν καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν γένεσιν εἰς τὴν σχέσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ τῶν μεταδόσεων, ἡ συμφωνία τῶν φωνῶν καὶ ἡ πλήρης ἀντιστοίχισις ποιοτήτων καὶ ποσοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B04","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν σχεσιακὴν καὶ μεταβολικὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀξιοπιστία αὐτοῦ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνοχὴν τῆς ἀναλογίας καὶ τῆς ἀναβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232730912453Z_dabdd60f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 49–51","source_sha256":"7510b2de55c67789cc3360c2b112cfa7a68e2d495ab967abb3b2cec8ae619bd4","sha256":"437577f8e271a71e9a1e296a993132250bbd3689758aa8c69407fcae7071a9df","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:27:30.915537+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-01","text":"The principal problem is how pleasures, pains, and the other sensations can be produced from bodily motions without being reduced to unchanging qualities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:AS1","CH_JP8E_S_45:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-02","text":"The explanation shifts sensible names from apparent quality to power, affection, motion, and bodily arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-03","text":"The common foundation is that the body does not passively receive external things, but transforms them through motion, resistance, and restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-04","text":"The local physiology of the tongue, nostrils, ears, and sight becomes a specification of one general relational law.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-05","text":"The same bodily principle can appear as pleasure, pain, taste, smell, sound, or colour, according to the organ and the mode of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-06","text":"Time, rhythm, direction, and measure are not auxiliary attributes, but contribute to the generation of the sensible itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-07","text":"The movement of the argument is from naming to generation, from generation to relation, and from relation to the reclassification of sensibles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BAS-08","text":"The conclusion is coherent with respect to relational generation, but open with respect to the complete mechanics of transmissions and correspondences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The sensible is produced from the relation of bodily motions, transmissions, organs, and measures, not from a self-contained quality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The body is an active transformer of the stimulus, because external power is rearranged in the receiving parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Pleasure and pain are differences of affection in the same bodily place, which change according to the rhythm of alteration and restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Sensible names owe their explanatory force to the physical causes of affections, not to mere apparent similarity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Time, rhythm, direction, and measure determine whether a motion becomes perceptible, pleasant, painful, or imperceptible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] There is no single universal mechanism of sensation; each sense organ specifies relational generation through a different transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] The bearer of sensation can be separated from sensible content, because the same medium does not guarantee the same sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Equality and inequality of magnitudes constitute conditions of imperceptibility, comparison, and discrimination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Transitional phenomena, such as smell, have ontological force not through a permanent form, but through change between bodies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Relation becomes the ultimate principle of sensory explanation, since neither the external nor the internal suffices by itself.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Scientific explanation ends in the translation of qualities into motions, measures, proportions, and transmissions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The absence of direct access to things compels sensation to be understood as an intermediate mechanism and not as transparent disclosure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-01","text":"The principle of bodily reaction recurs in pleasure, pain, and taste, but is displaced from the body as a whole to local organs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A6","CH_JP8E_S_44:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-02","text":"Alienation and return mutate into heating, drying, dissolution, smoothing, and transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-03","text":"The distinction of rhythm, which initially explains pleasure and pain, extends to the measure of gustatory and visual affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-04","text":"Smell is transformed from a qualitative phenomenon into a sign of transition, because the lack of a proper genus becomes a productive principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-05","text":"Bearer and content are initially intertwined, but are thereafter distinguished, so that breath, air, and particles are not identified with the sensible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-06","text":"Comparison and discrimination recur in taste, hearing, and sight, but alter their criterion according to the organ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A7","CH_JP8E_S_46:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-07","text":"The hypothesis of unchanging sensible forms is rejected after first performing the task of a nomenclatural starting point.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RMD-08","text":"Reference to a future concord suspends final unification and turns incompleteness into an active condition of the system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-01","text":"Local details, such as the distinction of astringent, harsh, bitter, and salty, remain partly underdetermined and do not constitute universal principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-02","text":"Heat, moisture, and elemental composition remain local mechanisms, but are scaled up as examples of more general causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-03","text":"The common principle bridging the chapters is the generation of phenomenon through the relation of change and reaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-04","text":"The transition from taste to smell, hearing, and sight dissolves the hypothesis that a single qualitative taxonomy suffices.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-05","text":"Elemental theory and detailed physiology are subordinated to the higher principle of relational generation and retain no self-sufficient theoretical primacy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:CGD-06","text":"The postponement of the concord of sounds constitutes a limit of the present synthesis, not a refutation of the general principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-01","text":"The idea that sensible qualities exist as unchanging bearers independent of bodies is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-02","text":"The simple correspondence of element and sensation is rejected, because sensation requires change, an organ, and measure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-03","text":"The identification of bearer with content is excluded, because breath and air can move without the corresponding sensation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A2","CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-04","text":"The hypothesis of a common, undifferentiated internal power that explains every sensation in the same manner is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-05","text":"Equality is excluded as a necessary condition of perceptibility, because equality can produce imperceptibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:GNX-06","text":"The final immediacy of sensing is excluded, because scientific explanation seeks hidden mechanisms of transmission and change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-01","text":"If the hypothesis of unchanging qualities were true, the necessity of translating sensibles into motions and relations would collapse.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-02","text":"If the body were a passive receptacle, the difference of organs, rhythms, and measures would have no causal force.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-03","text":"If bearer were identified with content, the movement of breath without smell and the differing sight of particles would be impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-04","text":"If empirical distinction guaranteed ontological distinction, smell would have to possess its own genus and its own element.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:DBN-05","text":"If qualitative opposition were independent of measure, the transition from sweetness to pungency and from saltiness to bitterness would not be explained.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-01","text":"The system circumscribes the absence of direct contact between object and sensation; the object is always translated through bodily mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-02","text":"A world becomes impossible in which pleasure, pain, and sensations have a cause of their own apart from the motion of parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_46:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-03","text":"Ontological trust in names becomes impossible, because the name indicates an affection and a mechanism, not a self-sufficient substance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSA-04","text":"The absence of a unified principle of sensations compels the system to recognize multiple mechanical paths to phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-01","text":"Taste, smell, sound, and colour converge on one general principle: the sensible is an event of change and not a property of an object.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-01","CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_44:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-02","text":"The principle of bodily restoration passes from pleasure and pain to sweetness, which becomes a functional cure for violent disturbance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-03","CL_JP8E_17:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_45:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-03","text":"The distinction of bearer and content in smell extends to sound and colour, so that no transmission is to be considered automatically identical with the phenomenon.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-07","CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-04","text":"The same bodily motion can be shaped into another phenomenon when the organ, proportion, and direction change.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-06","CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-05","text":"Equality, inequality, and rhythm are connected in a common theoretical threshold, where measure determines whether there will be phenomenon or imperceptibility.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-05","CL_JP8E_17:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_46:A10","CH_JP8E_S_44:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-06","text":"The absence of a proper genus of smell leaves no void, but turns transition into the chief paradigm of the sensible.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-09","CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:XD-07","text":"The deferred concord of sounds shows that the relational principle is stronger than final taxonomy, but unification remains incomplete.","refs":["CL_JP8E_17:GA-10","CL_JP8E_17:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-01","text":"The reality of sensibles is reconstructed as a network of processes, in which no phenomenon absolutely precedes the relation that produces it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-02","text":"Knowledge of sensibles is not the reading of ready-made qualities, but the reconstruction of hidden motions, transmissions, and proportions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-03","text":"The sense organ becomes a mechanism of discrimination and not a passive mirror, because its reaction co-shapes the phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_46:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-04","text":"Time changes from an external framework into an internal causal dimension, because rhythm determines the manifestation of affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-05","text":"The method requires recognizing qualitative difference as a result of quantitative and morphological relations, without eliminating apparent difference.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:BSD-06","text":"The strength of the system is produced by the unification of mechanisms, while its weakness arises from the postponement of final physiological proofs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-01","text":"Sensible quality is subjected to mechanical analysis, mechanical analysis reconstructs a new relation, and the new relation redraws the quality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-02","text":"External motion is transmitted to the organ, the organ produces affection, and affection again requires reduction to motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-03","text":"Alienation intensifies affection, return transforms it, and transformation restores the body to a new scale of perceptibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A5","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-04","text":"The distinction of bearer and content compels theory to reconsider each medium as a separate mechanism of phenomenalization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-05","text":"The absence of a proper form initially becomes a negation, then a method, and finally an ontological attractor toward relational explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:RLE-06","text":"Theory proceeds spirally from taste to smell, from smell to hearing, and from hearing to sight, repeating the same law with different media.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_46:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B01","text":"An external power strikes a bodily part, but the impact is transformed within it through resistance and arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B02","text":"The change is transmitted through the appropriate medium and is subject to rhythm, direction, magnitude, and proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B03","text":"The organ compares the external effluence with its own matter and produces sensation, discrimination, or imperceptibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A9","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B04","text":"The produced affection receives a name according to its causal power, but the name acquires no independent substance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FGS-B05","text":"The repeated failure of essentialist hypotheses turns relation into the attractor of the entire explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_45:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B01","text":"Unprocessed sensible quality → search for bodily cause → analysis of motion, affection, and measure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B02","text":"General law of bodily change → local physiology → taste, smell, hearing, and sight as distinct specifications.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:D4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B03","text":"Bodily impact → transmission through a medium → comparison with the organ → phenomenon or imperceptibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_46:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B04","text":"Absence of a proper form → necessity of relational causality → reclassification of sensibles as transitional affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:AFM-B05","text":"Relational unification → multiple mechanical differentiation → suspension of final concord → open but coherent conclusion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-01","text":"The field of sensations is redrawn from a catalogue of qualities into a map of transmissions, reactions, and comparisons.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_46:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-02","text":"The distinction between object and phenomenon becomes functional and not essentialist, because the phenomenon depends on the organization of the relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-03","text":"Time and rhythm become instruments of explanation, because the difference of phenomena cannot be analysed without the course of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-04","text":"The physiology of the sense organs passes from ancillary detail to a necessary condition of the ontology of phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-05","text":"The lack of a unified sensory principle does not destroy unification, but requires unification through a common relational schema.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_46:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MME-06","text":"The postponement of concord turns the incomplete point into a condition of reading: the theory holds as a mechanical direction rather than as a complete proof.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, taste, smell, sound, colour, pleasure, and pain are explained as distinct sensible affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, affections are produced from motions, transmissions, resistances, compositions, and proportions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B03","text":"At the meta-strategic level, the method turns the description of experience into a genetic reconstruction of causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the sensible is an event of change, neither an independent thing nor a pure internal representation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the negative dismantling of essentialist hypotheses produces a positive schema of relations and mechanisms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-01","text":"The theory requires the complete translation of qualities into mechanisms, but sometimes leaves the transition from the quantitative to the qualitative uncondensed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-02","text":"The elemental explanation of smell and the general relational principle coexist, but the former sometimes appears as an analogy rather than as a complete mechanics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-03","text":"The principle that the same matter can produce different phenomena threatens the simplicity of names, but at the same time constitutes a condition of relational theory.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:A12","CH_JP8E_S_46:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:FL-04","text":"The postponement of the concord of sounds preserves the openness of the system, but hinders the definitive unification of sensory mechanics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-01","text":"Quality mutates into power when explanation shifts from “what it is” to “what it does.”","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:A1","CH_JP8E_S_45:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-02","text":"Bodily motion mutates from bearer into content and again into bearer when transmission is examined in another sense organ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:D1","CH_JP8E_S_46:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-03","text":"The absence of a proper form mutates from a negative objection into a positive theory of transition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_45:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MP-04","text":"Measure mutates from a descriptive attribute into a generative cause, because it determines whether motion appears or remains imperceptible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:A3","CH_JP8E_S_46:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-01","text":"The system imagines reality as a network of transmissions, in which phenomena are produced from intersecting motions and resistances.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_46:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-02","text":"The subject becomes a receptive and reactive node, neither master of phenomena nor their mere mirror.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_46:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-03","text":"Time is conceived as a difference of rhythms, delays, returns, and transitions, which co-shapes the sensible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_45:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:HSI-04","text":"Possible escape is not an exit from the body, but a reconstruction of the mechanisms that transform motion into phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B01","text":"The universal principles concerning relation, bodily reaction, measure, transmission, and organ suffice to reconstruct the principal movement of the system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the transition from sensible naming to physical generation and from generation to relation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT2","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B03","text":"The exact mechanics of transmissions, the concord of sounds, and the complete correspondence of qualities and quantities remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_46:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_17:MRT-B04","text":"The system is coherent with regard to relational and transformative generation, but its reliability depends on tolerating analogy and postponement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_44:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_45:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_17@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_17:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 49–51"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 49–51","context":"Section 65 · Section 66 · Section 67","original_title":"Chapters 49–51","original_context":"Section 65 · Section 66 · Section 67"},"original_title":"Chapters 49–51","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 52–54","order":18,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_47","CH_JP8E_S_48","CH_JP8E_SEC7"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_18@R001","sha256":"f0632fa3fc1f24f3937d98c71d2337c154cebe7109338b3064645cef3377ddbb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-01","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα εἶναι πῶς ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν φαινομένων, τῶν αἰτίων καὶ τῶν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων δύναται νὰ συγκροτηθῇ εἰς ἑνιαίαν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὸ ὂν ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν οὐσίαν εἰς σχέσεις, κράσεις, διακρίσεις καὶ λειτουργικὰς ἀντιστοιχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-03","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀνάγκη δὲν ἀπορρίπτεται, ἀλλὰ ἀνατάσσεται ὑπὸ ἀνωτέραν συνθετικὴν καὶ τελεολογικὴν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ κίνησις ἀπὸ τὴν ὄψιν καὶ τὸ χρῶμα ἀποκαλύπτει ὅτι τὸ φαινόμενον γεννᾶται διὰ συμπλοκῆς ἐνεργειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμογονικὴ ἐπέκτασις μετατρέπει τὴν κράσιν εἰς κόσμησιν, καὶ τὴν κόσμησιν εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν συγκρότησιν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-06","text":"Ἡ ψυχοσωματικὴ ἐξειδίκευσις δείκνυσιν ὅτι ἡ τάξις διατηρεῖται διὰ διακεκριμένων τόπων, μεσολαβητῶν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενων δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἀπὸ τὴν μίξιν εἰς τὴν ἱεράρχησιν, ἀπὸ τὴν ἱεράρχησιν εἰς τὴν διοίκησιν τῆς συγκρούσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις οὐκ ἔγκειται εἰς ἐξάλειψιν τῆς ἀνάγκης ἢ τῆς ἐπιθυμίας, ἀλλ᾽ εἰς τὴν ὑπηρετικὴν ἔνταξιν αὐτῶν εἰς διαρκῆ τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολλαπλότης δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἄσχετον ἑτερότητα, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἐκ σχέσεων, μίξεων καὶ διαφορῶν λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ φαινόμενον ἀναδύεται ἐκ ἀλληλεπιδράσεως ἐσωτερικῶν καὶ ἐξωτερικῶν δυνάμεων, οὐχὶ ἐκ μονομεροῦς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ κράσις τῶν στοιχείων μετασχηματίζεται εἰς θείαν κόσμησιν, καὶ ἡ κόσμησις εἰς σωματικὴν κατανομήν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀναγκαία αἰτία εἶναι ὅρος καὶ ὄργανον τοῦ τέλους, οὐχὶ αὐτάρκης τελικὴ ἀρχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἑνότης συγκροτεῖται διὰ διαφορᾶς βαθμῶν, τόπων καὶ ἀποστολῶν, οὐ διὰ ὁμοιογενείας τῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀρχὴ χρειάζεται μεσολαβητικὴν δύναμιν, ἵνα ἐπιβληθῇ τοῖς κατωτέροις καὶ μὴ μείνῃ ἀνενέργητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ σῶμα λειτουργεῖ ὡς χάρτης καὶ μηχανὴ τῆς ψυχικῆς ἱεραρχίας, ἐνσαρκῶν τὴν διάκρισιν ἀρχῆς καὶ ὑπηρεσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ σύγκρουσις δὲν εἶναι ἁπλῶς ἀνωμαλία, ἀλλὰ ὕλη ἣν ἡ τάξις μετατρέπει εἰς ὄργανον διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] Αἱ κατώτεραι δυνάμεις εἶναι ἀναγκαῖαι πρὸς τὴν γένεσιν καὶ διατήρησιν, ἀλλὰ στεροῦνται τελικῆς κυριότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ λόγος ἀπὸ ἀκριβοῦς ποσολογίας μεταβαίνει εἰς εἰκὸς καὶ μετρημένον λόγον, ὅταν ἡ πλήρης σύνθεσις ὑπερβαίνῃ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ θεία δύναμις συντίθησι τὰ πολλὰ εἰς ἕν, διαλύει τὸ ἕν εἰς πολλὰ καὶ ἐπιβάλλει τάξιν χωρὶς νὰ καταργῇ τὰ ὑπηρετικὰ αἴτια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ τάξις ὑπάρχει ὡς συνεχὴς ἐνέργεια συνθέσεως, μετριασμοῦ καὶ ἐπανιδρύσεως, οὐχὶ ὡς ἅπαξ δεδομένη κατάστασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις καὶ ἡ σύμμειξις ἐπανέρχονται ἀπὸ τὴν ὀπτικὴν γένεσιν ὡς γενικὸς τρόπος παραγωγῆς διαφοροποιημένων ὅλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ θεία σύνθεσις μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιμέλειαν τῶν χρωμάτων εἰς τὴν κόσμησιν τῆς ὕλης καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς τὴν διαίρεσιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη διατηρεῖ τὸν αἰτιακὸν χαρακτῆρα, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ φυσικὴν ἀλυσίδα εἰς ὑλικὸν ὑπηρετικὸν τελικοῦ σκοποῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ἀναστρέφεται ἀπὸ ἀπλὴν φυσικὴν σύγκρουσιν εἰς διοικούμενον ἐσωτερικὸν πόλεμον, ὅπου ἡ βία γίνεται φύλαξ τῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία μεταναστεύει ἀπὸ τὰ χρώματα εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν καὶ σωματικὴν χωροθέτησιν, ὅπου ὁ τόπος δηλοῖ βαθμὸν καὶ λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία πλήρους μετρήσεως δὲν ἀφανίζει τὸν λόγον, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπει τὴν ἀπόδειξιν εἰς ἀναλογικὴν καὶ εἰκότα ἀνακατασκευήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-01","text":"Τὰ ἀκριβῆ χρωματικὰ μίγματα καὶ αἱ ἐπιμέρους φυσιολογικαὶ λεπτομέρειαι μένουσι τοπικαί· ἡ γενικὴ λογικὴ τῆς κράσεως κλιμακοῦται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις θείου καὶ ἀναγκαίου ὑπερβαίνει τὸ κοσμογονικὸν συμφραζόμενον καὶ γίνεται καθολικὸς κανὼν ἀναγνώσεως τῆς αἰτιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ διαίρεσις δὲν παραμένει περιγραφὴ σώματος, ἀλλὰ γεφυροῖ τὴν κοσμικὴν ἱεραρχίαν μετὰ τὴς διοικήσεως τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία ὡς ἁπλὸν ἀντίπαλον εἶναι κατώτερον σχῆμα· στὸ τρέχον ἐπίπεδον ἀνακωδικοποιεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαῖον ἀλλὰ δεδεμένον ὑπόστρωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀκρίβεια δὲν ἀποτελεῖ πλέον τὸ μοναδικὸν μέτρον γνώσεως· ἡ ἀναλογικὴ ἐξήγησις γίνεται γέφυρα μεταξὺ φυσικοῦ καὶ θεολογικοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἐξήγησις τῶν ὀργάνων γίνεται καταλύτης πρὸς ὑψηλοτέραν πρότασιν: ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ διανομήν, μεσολάβησιν καὶ ἐπιτήρησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται κόσμος ὅπου τὰ φαινόμενα εἶναι ἁπλαῖ καὶ ἀμετάβλητοι οὐσίαι ἄνευ σχέσεων καὶ γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ μονόδρομος αἰτιότης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ γένεσις προϋποθέτει ἀλληλεπίδρασιν καὶ σύμμειξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναγκαία φύσις ὡς αὐτάρκης καὶ τελικὴ δύναμις, ἐπειδὴ ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ἀνώτερον σκοπόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ψυχὴ ὡς ἁπλοῦν ἐγώ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ λειτουργία αὐτῆς στηρίζεται εἰς ἄνισα καὶ ἀντιμαχόμενα μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἁρμονία ὡς ἀπουσία συγκρούσεως· ἡ τάξις παράγεται διὰ κατανομῆς, χαλιναγωγήσεως καὶ ἐνεργοῦ μετριασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-01","text":"Τὸ ἄτακτον οὔτε ἡ ὕλη οὔτε ἡ ἀνάγκη δύναται αὐτόθεν νὰ παράγῃ τελικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-02","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ ὅλου δὲν ἐπιτρέπει τὴν ἐξάλειψιν τῶν διαφορῶν, ἀλλὰ προϋποθέτει ἱεραρχικὴν σύνθεσιν αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-03","text":"Ἡ λογικὴ ἀρχὴ μόνη δὲν ἀρκεῖ· ἡ ἐπιβολὴ αὐτῆς προϋποθέτει ἐκτελεστικὴν βίαν καὶ σωματικοὺς μηχανισμούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-04","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ ἐπιθυμία οὔτε ἐξορίζεται ἐκ τοῦ συστήματος οὔτε ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς αὐτόνομος σκοπός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἐξήγησις δὲν ταυτίζεται μὲ πλήρη κατοχὴν τῶν ποσοτικῶν σχέσεων· ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ δύναται νὰ διασωθῇ ἐν μέσῳ ἐλλείψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-01","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος αὐτόματος, ὅπου ἡ τάξις ἀναδύεται ἐκ τῆς ὕλης ἄνευ συνθετικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδιάκριτος συνέχεια μεταξὺ ἀρχῆς καὶ ὑπηρεσίας, θείου καὶ θνητοῦ, λόγου καὶ πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης πλήρους ἐνότητος ἄνευ ἱεραρχίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἑνότης ἀπαιτεῖ ἀσύμμετρον κατανομήν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπουσία εἶναι ἡ ἀπουσία ἀρχῆς ἄνευ ὀργάνων· ἡ κυριότης δὲν ἐνεργεῖ ἄνευ μεσολαβήσεως καὶ διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-01","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἴσθησις γεννᾶται ἐκ σχέσεως καὶ ἡ κοσμικὴ τάξις ἐκ διατάξεως, τὸ αἰσθητὸν ὅλον νοεῖται ὡς παραγόμενη συνεργία καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἑτοίμη οὐσία.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-01","CL_JP8E_18:GA-02","CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_47:D1","CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-02","text":"Ἡ θεία τάξις δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὸν μηχανισμόν· ἐπιλέγει, ἱεραρχεῖ καὶ ἐντάσσει τὰς ἀναγκαίας κινήσεις εἰς τελικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_47:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-03","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἱεραρχία γίνεται ψυχοσωματικὴ ἀρχιτεκτονική, ὅταν ἡ διάκρισις ἀρχῆς καὶ ἀνάγκης ἐνσαρκωθῇ εἰς τόπους καὶ ὄργανα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","CL_JP8E_18:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ὑποχώρησις τῆς ποσολογικῆς ἀκριβείας καὶ ἡ διάκρισις τῶν αἰτίων συγκροτοῦσιν ἐπιστημονικὸν λόγον ὅστις εἶναι ἔγκυρος ὅσον παραμένει ὁριακὸς καὶ ἀναλογικός.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-05","text":"Ἡ διοίκησις τῆς ψυχῆς ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὴν κοσμογονικὴν λογικήν: ἡ κατώτερη δύναμις δὲν καταργεῖται, ἀλλὰ δεσμεύεται καὶ τίθεται εἰς ὑπηρεσίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","CL_JP8E_18:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ ὅλου καὶ ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν ψυχικῶν μερῶν ἀποδεικνύουσιν ὅτι ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ συστήματος ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἀσύμμετρην πολλαπλότητα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_48:D4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-07","text":"Ἡ δημιουργικὴ τάξις καὶ ἡ σωματικὴ διατήρησις συνδέονται διὰ κοινοῦ μηχανισμοῦ: ἡ τάξις ἀναπαράγεται ὅταν ἡ σύγκρουσις ἀναλαμβάνεται ὑπὸ ὀργάνων μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","CL_JP8E_18:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-01","text":"Τὸ ὂν ἐμφανίζεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα διαβαθμισμένης παραγωγῆς, ὅπου ἡ ἑτερότης γίνεται ὑλικὸν ἑνότητος διὰ μεσολαβητικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης δὲν εἶναι στατικὸν σύνολον, ἀλλὰ ἀνακυκλουμένη διαδικασία συνθέσεως, ἀντιδράσεως, μετριασμοῦ καὶ διατηρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-03","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον παύει νὰ νοεῖται ὡς ἑνιαῖος αὐτοκράτωρ καὶ γίνεται συνασπισμὸς ἱεραρχημένων δυνάμεων, ὧν ἡ συνοχὴ κατασκευάζεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ἀποκτᾷ ἀνακατασκευαστικὸν χαρακτῆρα: ἀρκεί νὰ ἀναγνωρίσῃ τὰς σχέσεις καὶ τὰ ὅρια, οὐχὶ νὰ κατέχῃ ὅλην τὴν ποσολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐξουσία ἀνασχηματίζεται ὡς κατανεμημένη διοίκησις: ἀρχή, φρουρά, περιορισμός, τροφή καὶ ἀναπνοὴ ἀποτελοῦσιν ἕνα ἐνιαῖον σύστημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ στρατηγικὴ τοῦ συστήματος δὲν εἶναι ἡ φυγὴ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνάγκην, ἀλλὰ ἡ μετατροπὴ τῶν ἀντιστάσεων εἰς ὑπηρετικὰς δυνάμεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-01","text":"Μίξις → διαφορά → σύνθεσις → ἱεράρχησις → νέα διαίρεσις· ἡ ἑνότης παράγει νέας μορφὰς πολλαπλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-02","text":"Ἀνάγκη → ὑποταγή → μεσολάβησις → ὑπηρεσία → ἀναπαραγωγὴ τῆς ἀνάγκης· τὸ ὑλικόν ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ὅρος τῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS7","CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-03","text":"Λογικὴ ἀρχή → ἀνάγκη βίας → θυμικὴ ἐγρήγορσις → μετριασμός → ἐπανίδρυσις τῆς λογικῆς ἀρχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-04","text":"Ὅριον γνώσεως → εἰκὼς λόγος → διατήρησις τοῦ γενετικοῦ σχήματος → νέα ἀναγνώρισις τοῦ ὁρίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ κατανομή, ἐπειδὴ ἐνσαρκώνει τὴν ἱεραρχίαν, ἐπιβάλλει νέαν διοίκησιν, ἣ πάλιν ἀπαιτεῖ ἀνατομικὰ μέσα μεταδόσεως καὶ ἀναχαίτισης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ ἔσχατος ἑλκυστὴς εἶναι ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ σύνθεσις, ἥτις ἐπανεμφανίζεται ὡς κράσις, κόσμησις, ἱεραρχία καὶ διοικούμενη ἁρμονία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D7","CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B01","text":"Ἐσωτερικαὶ καὶ ἐξωτερικαὶ δυνάμεις → ἀντίθεσις καὶ σύμμειξις → παραγόμενον φαινόμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B02","text":"Παραγόμενον φαινόμενον → ἀναγνώρισις σχέσεων → ὑπέρβασις τῆς ἁπλῆς οὐσιολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B03","text":"Ἄτακτον ὑλικόν → θεία διάταξις → ἀναλογία καὶ συμμετρία → καθολικὴ ἑνότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B04","text":"Καθολικὴ ἑνότης → ἱεραρχικὴ διαφοροποίησις → ψυχὴ, σῶμα καὶ διακεκριμένα ψυχικὰ γένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B05","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ διαφοροποίησις → μεσολαβητικὴ βία → σωματικὴ μετάδοσις, μετριασμὸς καὶ περιορισμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B06","text":"Περιορισμὸς καὶ μετριασμός → διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ ὅλου → ἐπανέναρξις τῆς συνθέσεως ἐν νέᾳ κλίμακι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B01","text":"Αἰσθητὰ φαινόμενα → σχέσεις, κινήσεις καὶ κράσεις → ἀναγνώρισις τῆς παραγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B02","text":"Παραγωγὴ → διάκρισις φυσικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ τελικοῦ λόγου → θεία κόσμησις τῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B03","text":"Θεία κόσμησις → καθολικὴ ἑνότης → ἱεραρχικὴ διαίρεσις ἀθανάτου καὶ θνητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B04","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ διαίρεσις → λόγος, θυμός, ἐπιθυμία → σωματικὴ κατανομή, φύλαξ καὶ δεσμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B05","text":"Σωματικὴ διοίκησις → ἐλεγχόμενη διατήρησις → ἁρμονία ὡς διαρκὴς ἐπανίδρυσις ἱεραρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-01","text":"Τὰ φαινόμενα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ δεδομένα γνωρίσματα εἰς ἀποτελέσματα γενετικῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-02","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης ἀνασχεδιάζεται ὡς ἱεραρχημένη σύμπραξις, ὅπου τὸ ἀναγκαῖον παρέχει ὑλικὸν καὶ ὁ τελικὸς λόγος τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ὕλη μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἀδιάφορον ὑπόστρωμα εἰς πεδίον ὃ ἀποκτᾷ σημασίαν μόνον διὰ διατάξεως καὶ ἀναλογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-04","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναφαίνεται ὡς πολιτικο-ψυχικὸς χάρτης, ὅπου τόποι καὶ ὄργανα ἐνσαρκῶνουσι βαθμοὺς ἐξουσίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-05","text":"Ὁ θυμὸς καὶ ἡ ἐπιθυμία παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἁπλαὶ ἀντιθέσεις τοῦ λόγου καὶ γίνονται ὄργανα ἢ πόροι διοικήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναγκαία μέθοδος ἀναγνώσεως γίνεται γενετική: ζητεῖ τὸ πῶς συγκροτεῖται ἡ τάξις καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον τὸ τί φαίνεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, τὸ σύστημα πραγματεύεται χρώματα, ὕλην, ψυχήν, σῶμα, θυμὸν καὶ ἐπιθυμίαν ὡς συγκεκριμένα φαινόμενα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, τὰ φαινόμενα ἀναλύονται εἰς κινήσεις, κράσεις, ἱεραρχίας, μεσολαβήσεις καὶ μηχανισμοὺς ἐλέγχου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ὀρθὴ ἐπέμβασις δὲν καταστρέφει τὰς ἀντιθέσεις, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπει αὐτὰς εἰς ὑπηρετικὰς σχέσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς, τὸ ὂν εἶναι σύνθεσις τάξεως καὶ ἀνάγκης, ἀθανασίας καὶ θνητότητος, ἀρχῆς καὶ ὑπηρετικῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς καὶ ἐπιτελεστικῶς, ἡ ἴδια ἡ σύνθεσις τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενόν της, ἐπεκτεινομένη ἀπὸ μικρὰς κράσεις εἰς καθολικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θεία κυριότης ὑπερέχει τῶν φυσικῶν αἰτίων, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἐξήγησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν πραγματικὴν ἐνέργειαν αὐτῶν· ἡ ὑποταγὴ δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν αὐτονομίαν τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ ὅλου απαιτεῖ ἄνισα μέρη· ἡ συνοχὴ ἄρα διασώζεται διὰ ἱεραρχίας καὶ ὄχι διὰ ἰσοτιμίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-03","text":"Ὁ λόγος ὁρίζεται ὡς ἡγεμονικός, ἀλλὰ χρειάζεται θυμικὴν βίαν πρὸς τὴν πραγμάτωσιν αὐτοῦ· ἡ τάξις περιέχει τὸ ἀπειλούμενον ἀπὸ αὐτήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ αἰτιότης ταλαντεύεται μεταξὺ κυριολεκτικῆς φυσιολογίας καὶ εἰκονικῆς μεταγραφῆς τῆς ψυχικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-01","text":"Ἡ κράσις μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ φυσικὸν μηχανισμὸν χρωμάτων εἰς καθολικὸν σχήμα ὅπου ἡ ἑνότης παράγεται διὰ διαφοροποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀναπόφευκτον αἰτίαν εἰς διοικούμενον πόρον, ὅταν ἡ θνητὴ ζωή ἀπαιτήσῃ τροφήν, δεσμόν καὶ μετριασμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-03","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ περιγραφή μεταλλάσσεται εἰς χάρτην ἐξουσίας, ὅταν ἡ χωρικὴ διάταξις ἐρμηνεύῃ τὴν ἱεραρχίαν τῶν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης εἶναι μηχανὴ διαβαθμισμένης συνθέσεως, ἥτις μετατρέπει ἄτακτον ὕλην καὶ ἀντιμαχόμενας δυνάμεις εἰς ὑπηρετικὴν ἑνότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον ἐντὸς τῆς μηχανῆς εἶναι ὄχι ἁπλοῦν κέντρον, ἀλλὰ ἱεραρχημένη σύνθεσις λόγου, θυμοῦ, ἐπιθυμίας καὶ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι χρόνος ἐπαναλήψεως καὶ συντηρήσεως, ὅπου θερμότης, ἀναπνοή, τροφή, ἀντίδρασις καὶ μετριασμὸς ἐπανέρχονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ διαφυγὴ δὲν εἶναι ἔξοδος ἐκ τῆς ἀνάγκης, ἀλλὰ ἀναδιάταξις αὐτῆς ὑπὸ ἀρχὴν καὶ μεσολαβητικὰ ὄργανα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν κράσιν εἰς τὴν κόσμησιν καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν κόσμησιν εἰς τὴν διοίκησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν αἱ ἀκριβέστεραι ποσολογίαι, ἡ κυριολεκτικὴ σχέσις φυσιολογίας καὶ συμβόλου, καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἠθικὴ λειτουργία ἑκάστου πάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνάγκη παραμένει ὑλικὸν τῆς τάξεως καὶ οὐδέποτε ἀναγορεύεται εἰς τελικὴν κυριότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ ἡ κίνησις αὕτη μένει ἀνοικτὴ ἐπειδὴ ἡ τάξις ἀπαιτεῖ διαρκῆ ἐπανίδρυσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232801449550Z_9a8028a9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 52–54","source_sha256":"f0632fa3fc1f24f3937d98c71d2337c154cebe7109338b3064645cef3377ddbb","sha256":"471c6383bffae8733fcf0884b169d22cb04096312d9bd65a218e5dfcf5e1b1f7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:28:01.453187+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-01","text":"The central problem is how the multiplicity of phenomena, causes, and psychic powers can be constituted into a unified order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-02","text":"The explanation shifts being from simple substance to relations, mixtures, distinctions, and functional correspondences.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-03","text":"Natural necessity is not rejected, but subordinated under a higher synthetic and teleological principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-04","text":"The initial movement from sight and color reveals that the phenomenon is generated through the interweaving of activities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-05","text":"The cosmogonic extension transforms mixture into ordering, and ordering into the hierarchical constitution of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-06","text":"The psychosomatic specification shows that order is maintained through distinct places, mediators, and controlled powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-07","text":"The movement is spiral: from mixture to hierarchy, from hierarchy to the governance of conflict.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AS-08","text":"The conclusion lies not in the elimination of necessity or desire, but in their serviceable incorporation into enduring order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Multiplicity does not constitute unrelated otherness, but is produced from relations, mixtures, and differences of function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The phenomenon emerges from the interaction of internal and external powers, not from unilateral activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The mixture of the elements is transformed into divine ordering, and ordering into a bodily distribution of functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] The necessary cause is a condition and instrument of the end, not a self-sufficient final principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Unity is constituted through differences of ranks, places, and offices, not through the homogeneity of parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] The principle requires a mediating power, in order that it may be imposed upon the lower things and not remain inactive.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] The body functions as a map and mechanism of psychic hierarchy, embodying the distinction between rule and service.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Conflict is not merely disorder, but material that order transforms into an instrument of governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-09","text":"[Persistent] The lower powers are necessary for generation and preservation, but lack final sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Account moves from exact quantification to probable and measured account, when complete composition exceeds human power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Divine power composes the many into one, dissolves the one into many, and imposes order without abolishing the serviceable causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Order exists as a continuous activity of composition, moderation, and re-establishment, not as a state given once for all.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-01","text":"Opposition and commingling recur from optical generation as a general mode of producing differentiated wholes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-02","text":"Divine composition shifts from the care of colors to the ordering of matter and then to the division of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:A5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-03","text":"Necessity retains its causal character, but changes from a natural chain into material serviceable to a final purpose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-04","text":"Opposition is reversed from simple natural conflict into a governed internal war, where force becomes guardian of rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-05","text":"Analogy migrates from colors to cosmic and bodily spatial arrangement, where place signifies rank and function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RMD-06","text":"The inability of complete measurement does not eliminate account, but transforms demonstration into analogical and probable reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-01","text":"Exact color mixtures and particular physiological details remain local; the general logic of mixture is scaled up.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-02","text":"The distinction between divine and necessary exceeds the cosmogonic context and becomes a universal rule for reading causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-03","text":"Anatomical division does not remain a description of the body, but bridges cosmic hierarchy with the governance of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-04","text":"Desire as a simple opponent is a lower-order schema; at the current level it is recoded as a necessary but bound substratum.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-05","text":"Scientific precision is no longer the sole measure of knowledge; analogical explanation becomes a bridge between natural and theological account.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:CGD-06","text":"The local explanation of organs becomes a catalyst toward a higher proposition: order requires distribution, mediation, and supervision.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-01","text":"A world is rejected in which phenomena are simple and unchanging substances without relations and generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-02","text":"One-way causality is rejected, since generation presupposes interaction and commingling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-03","text":"Necessary nature as a self-sufficient and final power is rejected, since it is subordinated to a higher purpose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-04","text":"The soul as a simple self is rejected, since its function rests upon unequal and contending parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:GNX-05","text":"Harmony as absence of conflict is rejected; order is produced through distribution, restraint, and active moderation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-01","text":"Neither disorderly matter nor necessity can by itself produce final order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-02","text":"The unity of the whole does not permit the elimination of differences, but presupposes their hierarchical composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-03","text":"The rational principle alone does not suffice; its imposition presupposes executive force and bodily mechanisms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-04","text":"Mortal desire is neither expelled from the system nor acknowledged as an autonomous end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:DBN-05","text":"Scientific explanation is not identical with complete possession of quantitative relations; the architecture can be preserved amid deficiency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-01","text":"An automatic world is excluded, in which order emerges from matter without a synthetic principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-02","text":"The undifferentiated continuity between rule and service, divine and mortal, reason and passion is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-03","text":"The possibility of complete unity without hierarchy is absent, since unity requires an asymmetrical distribution of functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSA-04","text":"The deeper absence is the absence of rule without instruments; sovereignty does not act without mediation and governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-01","text":"Since perception is generated from relation and cosmic order from arrangement, the perceptible whole is conceived as a produced synergy and not as a ready-made substance.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-01","CL_JP8E_18:GA-02","CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_47:D1","CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-02","text":"Divine order does not abolish mechanism; it selects, hierarchizes, and incorporates necessary motions into final composition.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-03","CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_47:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-03","text":"Cosmic hierarchy becomes psychosomatic architecture when the distinction between rule and necessity is embodied in places and organs.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","CL_JP8E_18:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-04","text":"The retreat of quantitative precision and the distinction of causes constitute a scientific account that is valid insofar as it remains bounded and analogical.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_47:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-05","text":"The governance of the soul repeats cosmogonic logic: the lower power is not abolished, but bound and placed in service.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-04","CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","CL_JP8E_18:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_48:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-06","text":"The unity of the whole and the division of the psychic parts prove that the unity of the system depends upon asymmetrical multiplicity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-05","CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_48:D4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:XD-07","text":"Creative order and bodily preservation are linked by a common mechanism: order is reproduced when conflict is taken up by instruments of mediation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_18:GA-06","CL_JP8E_18:GA-08","CL_JP8E_18:GA-12","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-01","text":"Being appears as the result of graded production, in which otherness becomes material of unity through mediating order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-02","text":"Reality is not a static whole, but a recurrent process of composition, reaction, moderation, and preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-03","text":"The subject ceases to be conceived as a unified autocrat and becomes an alliance of hierarchized powers, whose cohesion is constructed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-04","text":"Knowledge acquires a reconstructive character: it suffices to recognize relations and limits, not to possess the whole quantification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-05","text":"Power is reconfigured as distributed governance: rule, guard, restriction, nourishment, and respiration constitute a single unified system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:BSD-06","text":"The strategy of the system is not flight from necessity, but the transformation of resistances into serviceable powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-01","text":"Mixture → difference → composition → hierarchy → new division; unity produces new forms of multiplicity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-02","text":"Necessity → subordination → mediation → service → reproduction of necessity; the material returns as a condition of order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS7","CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-03","text":"Rational principle → need for force → spirited vigilance → moderation → re-establishment of the rational principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-04","text":"Limit of knowledge → probable account → preservation of the generative schema → renewed recognition of the limit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-05","text":"Anatomical distribution, because it embodies hierarchy, imposes a new governance, which in turn requires anatomical means of transmission and restraint.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:RLE-06","text":"The ultimate attractor is architectural composition, which reappears as mixture, ordering, hierarchy, and governed harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:D7","CH_JP8E_S_48:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B01","text":"Internal and external powers → opposition and commingling → produced phenomenon.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B02","text":"Produced phenomenon → recognition of relations → transcendence of simple ontology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B03","text":"Disorderly material → divine arrangement → analogy and symmetry → universal unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B04","text":"Universal unity → hierarchical differentiation → soul, body, and distinct psychic kinds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B05","text":"Hierarchical differentiation → mediating force → bodily transmission, moderation, and restriction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FGS-B06","text":"Restriction and moderation → preservation of the mortal whole → recommencement of composition on a new scale.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B01","text":"Perceptible phenomena → relations, motions, and mixtures → recognition of production.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B02","text":"Production → distinction between natural necessity and final account → divine ordering of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B03","text":"Divine ordering → universal unity → hierarchical division of immortal and mortal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B04","text":"Hierarchical division → reason, spirit, desire → bodily distribution, guardian, and bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:AFM-B05","text":"Bodily governance → controlled preservation → harmony as the enduring re-establishment of hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:AF5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-01","text":"Phenomena are reclassified from given properties into results of generative relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-02","text":"Causality is redesigned as hierarchized cooperation, in which necessity supplies material and final account supplies order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-03","text":"Matter changes from an indifferent substratum into a field that acquires meaning only through arrangement and analogy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-04","text":"The body appears as a politico-psychic map, in which places and organs embody degrees of power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-05","text":"Spirit and desire cease to be simple oppositions to reason and become instruments or resources of governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME2","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MME-06","text":"The necessary method of reading becomes generative: it seeks how order is constituted and not merely what appears.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B01","text":"On the surface, the system treats colors, matter, soul, body, spirit, and desire as concrete phenomena.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, phenomena are analyzed into motions, mixtures, hierarchies, mediations, and mechanisms of control.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, correct intervention does not destroy oppositions, but transforms them into serviceable relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically, being is a composition of order and necessity, immortality and mortality, rule and serviceable parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically and performatively, the very composition of the account imitates its object, extending from small mixtures to universal hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-01","text":"Divine sovereignty exceeds natural causes, but the explanation depends on their actual activity; subordination does not eliminate the autonomy of mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:NX7","CH_JP8E_S_48:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-02","text":"The unity of the whole requires unequal parts; cohesion is therefore preserved through hierarchy and not through equality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:DNX4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-03","text":"Reason is defined as ruling, but needs spirited force for its realization; order contains that by which it is threatened.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SNX4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:FL-04","text":"Anatomical causality oscillates between literal physiology and figurative transcription of psychic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-01","text":"Mixture mutates from a natural mechanism of colors into a universal schema in which unity is produced through differentiation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_48:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-02","text":"Necessity mutates from an unavoidable cause into a governed resource when mortal life requires nourishment, bond, and moderation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:D1","CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MP-03","text":"Bodily description mutates into a map of power when spatial arrangement interprets the hierarchy of psychic powers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:ME5","CH_JP8E_SEC7:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-01","text":"Reality is a mechanism of graded composition, which transforms disorderly matter and contending powers into serviceable unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-02","text":"The subject within the mechanism is not a simple center, but a hierarchized composition of reason, spirit, desire, and body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-03","text":"Time is a time of repetition and maintenance, in which heat, respiration, nourishment, reaction, and moderation recur.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:HSI-04","text":"The possible escape is not an exit from necessity, but its rearrangement under a principle and mediating instruments.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC7:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstructing the principal movement from mixture to ordering and from ordering to governance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B02","text":"The more exact quantifications, the literal relation between physiology and symbol, and the exact ethical function of each passion remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT4","CH_JP8E_SEC7:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is coherent, since necessity remains material of order and is never proclaimed as final sovereignty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_48:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_18:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, but this movement remains open because order requires continual re-establishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_47:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_18@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_18:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 52–54"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 52–54","context":"Section 68 · Section 69 · Section 70","original_title":"Chapters 52–54","original_context":"Section 68 · Section 69 · Section 70"},"original_title":"Chapters 52–54","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 55–57","order":19,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_49","CH_JP8E_S_50","CH_JP8E_S_51"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_19@R001","sha256":"e6ea4ecb481511c6bda14141b7c5328296c70ee1c4cf89564f2b1081926bd7c8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ πῶς ἡ θεία τάξις κυβερνᾷ τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα, τὸ ἄλογον μέρος καὶ τὴν ἀμετρίαν τῶν ἐπιθυμιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ καὶ τὸ σῶμα ἀνασυντάσσονται ὡς ἱεραρχικὸν δίκτυον μεσολαβήσεων, οὐχὶ ὡς ἑνιαία καὶ ἄμεσος δύναμις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-03","text":"Ὁ νοῦς δὲν ἐνεργεῖ ἀμέσως ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀλόγου, ἀλλὰ διὰ σωματικῶν ὀργάνων, σημείων, παθημάτων καὶ μετασχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-04","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ καὶ ἡ ἀνατομία συγκλίνουσιν εἰς κοινὴν ἀρχήν: ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐμφανίζεται διὰ ὑλικῆς μεσολαβήσεως καὶ ἀπαιτεῖ ἑρμηνείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-05","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ κατασκευή μετατρέπει τὴν ψυχικὴ ἱεραρχίαν εἰς φυσιολογικὴν, ἠθικὴν καὶ γνωστικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-06","text":"Ἡ πορεία εἶναι σωρευτική καὶ ἀνακυκλουμένη: ἀπὸ τὸν νοῦν εἰς τὸ σημεῖον, ἀπὸ τὸ σημεῖον εἰς τὴν ἑρμηνείαν, καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνάγκην εἰς τὴν ὀργανικὴν ῥύθμισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_51:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-07","text":"Ὁ τύπος τοῦ ἐπιχειρήματος γίνεται γενετικὸς καὶ ἀποφατικός: κατασκευάζει τὴν τάξιν ἐνῶ ταυτοχρόνως ἀποκλείει τὴν ἀμεσότητα, τὴν αὐτονομίαν καὶ τὴν τυχαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις δὲν εἶναι πλήρης ἀπόδειξις, ἀλλὰ ὑποθετικὴ συνοχή, ἐν ᾗ ἡ ἀλήθεια παραμένει ἐξαρτημένη ἀπὸ κανόνα, ἑρμηνείαν καὶ θείαν κύρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ θεία πρόνοια μορφοποιεῖ τὸ σῶμα καὶ τὰ μέρη τῆς ψυχῆς κατὰ τάξιν, σκοπὸν καὶ ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ψυχὴ οὐκ ἔχει ἑνιαίαν γνωστικὴν λειτουργίαν, ἀλλὰ διαιρεῖται εἰς νοῦν, ἄλογον μέρος καὶ σωματικὰς μεσολαβήσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ἄλογον μέρος οὔτε αὐτομάτως βουλεύεται οὔτε αὐτομάτως κρίνει, ἀλλὰ δέχεται τύπους, πάθη καὶ σημεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ μεσολάβησις μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὸ ἧπαρ καὶ τὸ σπλάγχνον εἰς τὸν μυελόν, τὰ ὀστᾶ καὶ τὴν πέψιν, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖ τὴν λειτουργίαν τῆς μεταγραφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ σῶμα λειτουργεῖ ὡς μετάφρασις ἀοράτων ψυχικῶν, θεολογικῶν ἢ ἠθικῶν σχέσεων εἰς ὑλικὰς καταστάσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:D3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ μαντικὴ σημασία δὲν παράγεται ἐκ τοῦ φαινομένου μόνου, ἀλλὰ ἐκ τῆς διανομῆς ρόλων μεταξὺ πάθους, σημείου, ἑρμηνευτοῦ καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ φυσιολογία παρέχει ὑλικὴν συνθήκην τῆς σημασίας, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀποτελεῖ αὐτάρκη ἐγγύησιν τῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ σωματικὴ λειτουργία ἀναλαμβάνει ἠθικὸν ἔργον, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πέψις, ἡ βραδύτης καὶ ἡ ἀνάγκη περιορίζουσι τὴν ἀπληστίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἀνατομία, ἡ ψυχολογία, ἡ ἠθικὴ καὶ ἡ κοσμολογία ὑπάγονται εἰς ἕνα κοινὸν γενετικὸν σχήμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ θνητότης, ἡ νόσος καὶ ἡ φθορὰ δὲν καταργοῦνται ὑπὸ τῆς προνοίας, ἀλλὰ περιλαμβάνονται ὡς ὅροι τῆς κατασκευῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐμφανίζεται κυρίως διὰ ἔμμεσων, ἀτελῶν καὶ ὑλικῶς διαμεσολαβημένων ὁδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ὕπαρξις τοῦ θνητοῦ ὄντος παράγεται διὰ διαδοχῆς μετασχηματισμῶν, ἀπὸ στοιχεῖα καὶ μυελὸν εἰς ὄργανα, σάρκα καὶ ἠθικὴν ῥύθμισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς ἀπομακρύνσεως τοῦ ἀλόγου ἀπὸ τὸν νοῦν ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ἀπόστασις τοῦ μαινομένου ἀπὸ τὴν κρίσιν καὶ ὡς περιορισμὸς τῆς ἐπιθυμίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ λειτουργία τοῦ ἥπατος ὡς κατόπτρου μεταλλάσσεται εἰς λειτουργίαν τοῦ μυελοῦ ὡς ῥίζης καὶ συνδέσμου ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ ἀλλάσσει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ ἀτελὴς πρόσβασις πρὸς ἀλήθειαν γίνεται διαδικασία ἐλέγχου, ἑρμηνείας καὶ κοινωνικῆς ἐπικυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀφροσύνη ἀντιστρέφει τὴν ἀρνητικὴν της ἀξίαν: ἀπὸ στέρησις κρίσεως γίνεται δίαυλος, ὃν ὁ σώφρων ἑρμηνευτὴς ἀνακρίνει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ λεπτομέρεια ἀποσπάται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν περιγραφὴν καὶ προσλαμβάνει γενετικὴν λειτουργίαν, ὅταν ἕκαστον μέρος παράγεται ἀπὸ προηγουμένην ὕλην καὶ ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A10","CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ ἰδέα τοῦ σημείου μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ μαντικὸν φαινόμενον εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν παθολογίαν καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς τὴν πεπτικὴν ρύθμισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀβεβαιότης περὶ τῆς γνώσεως δὲν ἐξαλείφεται, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπεται εἰς μεθοδολογικὴν μετριοπάθειαν καὶ ἀνάγκην θείας συμφωνίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-08","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ διάκρισις νοῦ καὶ σώματος ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ἀλληλεπίδρασιν, ὅπου ἡ ὕλη ἤδη φέρει ψυχικὸν καὶ ἠθικὸν νόημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀνατομία τοῦ ἥπατος, τοῦ σπληνὸς καὶ τῶν ὀργάνων παραμένει τοπικὴ λεπτομέρεια, ἐκτός ἐὰν ἀναχθῇ εἰς τὴν γενικὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_50:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἰδιότης τοῦ ζῶντος ἥπατος καὶ ἡ φθορὰ μετὰ θάνατον κλιμακοῦνται εἰς γενικὴν ἀρχὴν ὅτι ἡ σημασία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ἐνεργὸν ὑλικὴν κατάστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ μαινομένου νὰ κρίνῃ γίνεται γέφυρα μεταξὺ μαντικῆς ἐμπειρίας καὶ τῆς γενικῆς ἀρχῆς τῆς διαμεσολαβημένης γνώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_50:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ διήγησις περὶ ψυχῆς ὡς εἰκότος παραμένει ὑποθετικὴ καὶ δὲν ἀναβαίνει εἰς καθολικὸν ἀξίωμα ἄνευ θείας κυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ βραδύτης τῆς πεπτικῆς κινήσεως ὑπερβαίνει τὸ τοπικὸν παράδειγμα, ἐπειδὴ ἀναδεικνύει τὸ σῶμα ὡς μηχανὴν ἐνσώματης παιδαγωγίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D2","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ μαθηματικὴ σύστασις τῶν στοιχείων γίνεται τρέχουσα γενετικὴ ἀρχὴ μόνον ὅταν συνδεθῇ μὲ τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν γένεσιν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ καταδίκη τῆς γαστριμαργίας δὲν μένει ψόγος, ἀλλὰ μετατρέπεται εἰς ἀνατομικὴν καὶ φυσιολογικὴν ἐξήγησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-08","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀβεβαιότης περὶ τοῦ τρόπου μεταβάσεως τοῦ μυελοῦ εἰς σάρκα δὲν καταλύει τὴν τρέχουσαν ἀρχιτεκτονικήν, ἀλλὰ ὁρίζει τὸ ὅριον τῆς ἀνασυνθέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἄμεσος καὶ αὐτόνομος ἐπικοινωνία μεταξὺ νοῦ, ἀλόγου, σώματος καὶ θείας ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις τοῦ φαινομένου μὲ τὴν ἀλήθειαν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ σημεῖον ἀπαιτεῖ ἑρμηνείαν καὶ κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς φυσιολογίας εἰς ἀδιάφορον μηχανικὴν αἰτίαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕλη φέρει σκοπόν, ἀναλογίαν καὶ ἠθικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπεριόριστος φυσικὴ ἐξουσία τῆς ἐπιθυμίας καὶ ἡ ἀξίωσις ὅτι ἡ ἀνάγκη δικαιολογεῖ τὴν ἀμετρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ σῶμα εἶναι ἄτακτος σωρεία μερῶν ἢ ὅτι ἡ ψυχὴ ὑπάρχει ἄνευ σωματικῆς ῥιζώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-06","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ὁρίζεται ἀρνητικῶς ὡς μὴ ἀυτάρκης, μὴ ἄμεσος καὶ μὴ ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς ὑλικῆς καὶ ἑρμηνευτικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ἀδυνατεῖ νὰ σταθῇ ἐὰν ἡ ψυχὴ θεωρηθῇ ὁμοιογενὴς δύναμις ἢ ἐὰν ὁ νοῦς κοινωνῇ ἀμέσως πρὸς πάντα τὰ μέρη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ νὰ εἶναι ψευδὲς ὅτι ἡ ἔλλειψις λόγου συνεπάγεται ἀδυναμία παντὸς σημείου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀφροσύνη γίνεται ἀτελὴς φορεὺς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ νὰ ἀποκλεισθῇ ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ σῶμα εἶναι παθητικὸς δέκτης, ἐπειδὴ παράγει, μεταγράφει καὶ ρυθμίζει σημασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ νὰ ἀποκλεισθῇ ἡ πλήρης ταύτισις θείας προνοίας καὶ ἀπαλλαγῆς ἀπὸ νόσον, θνητότητα καὶ φθοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-05","text":"Δεῖ νὰ ἀποκλεισθῇ ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ φυσιολογικὴ ἐξήγησις δύναται νὰ ἀναπληρώσῃ τὴν θείαν βεβαίωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-06","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπορριπτομένη δυνατότης εἶναι κόσμος ὅπου ἡ ὕλη, ἡ ψυχή, ἡ ἀλήθεια καὶ ἡ ἐπιθυμία λειτουργοῦσιν ἄνευ ἱεραρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης καθαρᾶς ἀληθείας, ἥτις θὰ ἦτο ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ σώμα, πάθος, σημεῖον, ἑρμηνείαν καὶ κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-02","text":"Τὸ σύστημα κυκλεῖ τὴν ἀπουσίαν ἑνὸς ἀμέσου λόγου, ὃς θὰ ἔλυε χωρὶς μεσολάβησιν τὴν διάστασιν νοῦ, σώματος καὶ ἀλόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:D2","CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπαγορεύεται ἡ δυνατότης θνητοῦ σώματος ὃ θὰ ἦτο συγχρόνως ἀνάγκης ἄνευ περιορισμοῦ καὶ ἐπιβιώσεως ἄνευ φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-04","text":"Ἀπαγορεύεται ἡ ἐξίσωση τοῦ ἀλόγου μὲ καθαρὴν ἀχρηστίαν ἢ μὲ πλήρη αὐτονομίαν· αὐτὸ ὑπάρχει μόνον ὡς ἐξαρτημένη λειτουργία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_49:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀπολύτου βεβαιότητος δὲν εἶναι κενόν, ἀλλὰ ὁ ὅρος ὑπὸ τοῦ ὁποίου ἡ ἑρμηνεία καὶ ἡ διάκρισις παραμένουν ἀναγκαῖαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-01","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἄλογον δέχεται σημασίαν διὰ σωματικοῦ ὀργάνου καὶ ἡ μαντικὴ ἀπαιτεῖ ἑρμηνευτήν, ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐν τῷ συστήματι εἶναι πάντοτε διαδικασία μεταγραφῆς καὶ κρίσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_49:D5","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-02","text":"Ἐπειδὴ τὸ ἧπαρ, ὁ μυελὸς καὶ ἡ πέψις ἀναλαμβάνουσι μεσολαβητικὰς λειτουργίας, τὸ σῶμα γίνεται ἐνιαῖος μηχανισμὸς μετατροπῆς νοήματος εἰς ρύθμισιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-03","text":"Ἡ μανία καὶ ἡ ἀμετρία, μολονότι ἀντιφατικαὶ καταστάσεις, ἀντιμετωπίζονται διὰ τῆς αὐτῆς στρατηγικῆς: ἡ ὀργανικὴ διάταξις περιορίζει ὅ,τι ἀδυνατεῖ νὰ κυβερνηθῇ ἄμεσα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-04","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ εἰκότος καὶ ἀληθοῦς, ἐν τῇ μαντείᾳ, ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὴν ἀνατομίαν: ἡ ὑλικὴ αἰτία ἐξηγεῖ τὴν λειτουργίαν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐχὶ ὅλην τὴν ἀλήθειαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-05","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ γίνεται κοινὸς τόπος ὅπου ἡ θεία πρόνοια, ἡ ψυχικὴ ἱεραρχία καὶ ἡ ἠθικὴ πειθαρχία συναντῶνται.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη σώφρονος ἑρμηνευτοῦ καὶ ἡ ἀνάγκη ὀργανικῆς ἀναλογίας δείκνυσιν ὅτι οὔτε ἡ γνώσις οὔτε ἡ ζωή ἀναδύονται ἄνευ ἐνδιάμεσων κανόνων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-07","text":"Ἡ προνοητικὴ ρύθμισις τῆς ἀπληστίας καὶ ἡ ἐρμηνευτικὴ ρύθμισις τῆς μαντείας συγκροτοῦσιν ἕνα γενικὸν μοντέλον κυβερνήσεως τοῦ ἀλόγου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_51:D3","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-08","text":"Ἡ θνητὴ ἀτέλεια δὲν ἀποτελεῖ ἁπλῶς ἔλλειψιν, ἀλλὰ λειτουργικὸν πεδίον ὅπου ἡ πρόνοια παράγει σημεῖα, ὄργανα, περιορισμοὺς καὶ δυνατότητας γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια ἐν τῷ συστήματι εἶναι κατανεμημένη κατὰ βαθμίδας: ὁ νοῦς κατευθύνει, τὸ ὄργανον μεταγράφει, τὸ πάθος σημαίνει, καὶ ὁ ἑρμηνευτὴς κρίνει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ φύσις παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀντίθετος τῆς ἠθικῆς, ἐπειδὴ τὰ ὄργανα ἤδη ἐνσωματοῦσι περιορισμόν, σκοπόν, ἀναλογίαν καὶ ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ γνώσις γίνεται πράξις ἀναγνώσεως ὑλικῶν μετασχηματισμῶν, οὐχὶ κατοχὴ ἀμέσου ἐσωτερικοῦ περιεχομένου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια δὲν κατασκευάζει ἀθάνατον σώμα, ἀλλὰ σύστημα παρατάσεως, ἀνασχέσεως καὶ ἐλεγχόμενης φθορᾶς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀτέλεια γίνεται παραγωγικὴ συνθήκη: ἡ ἀδυναμία κρίσεως γεννᾷ ἑρμηνείαν, ἡ ἀνάγκη γεννᾷ ρύθμισιν, καὶ ἡ φθορὰ ὁρίζει τὴν ἀξίαν τῆς προνοίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_49:D6","CH_JP8E_S_51:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-06","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς ἀληθείας δὲν εἶναι μόνον στιγμιαῖος, ἀλλὰ περιλαμβάνει ἀναμονήν, ἑρμηνείαν, ἀνάπτυξιν καὶ διαδοχικοὺς μετασχηματισμούς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ θνητοῦ ὄντος δὲν εἶναι ἀρχικὸν δεδομένον, ἀλλὰ ἀποτέλεσμα ἀλυσιδώτου συνδέσεως στοιχείων, μυελοῦ, ψυχῆς καὶ ὀργάνων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-08","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ καὶ γνωστικὴ ἐξουσία ἀνατίθεται στὸν σώφρονα ἑρμηνευτήν, ὅπως ἡ σωματικὴ τάξις ἀνατίθεται εἰς τὴν προνοητικὴν κατασκευήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_50:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-01","text":"Ὁ κύκλος τοῦ σημείου ἐκτείνεται ὡς ἑξῆς: ψυχικὴ δύναμις → σωματικὴ μεταγραφή → πάθος → σημεῖον → φρόνιμος ἑρμηνεία → ἐπανασύνδεσις πρὸς τὸν νοῦν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-02","text":"Ὁ κύκλος τῆς ἀνασχέσεως ἐκκινεί ἀπὸ ἀμετρίαν, μεταβαίνει εἰς πεπτικὴν βραδύτητα, περιορίζει τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν καὶ διατηρεῖ τὸ γένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-03","text":"Ὁ κύκλος τῆς ἐρμηνευτικῆς ἀναβολῆς μετατρέπει τὴν ἐμπειρίαν εἰς ὑπόθεσιν, τὴν ὑπόθεσιν εἰς διάκρισιν, καὶ τὴν διάκρισιν εἰς ἀναζήτησιν θείας κυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ κλιμάκωσις μεταφέρει τὸν ρόλον τοῦ ὀργάνου ἀπὸ κάτοπτρον παθῶν εἰς ῥίζαν τῆς σωματικῆς ὑπάρξεως καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς ἠθικὸν μηχανισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς μεσολαβήσεως σημαίνει μεταβολὴν φάσεως: ἀπὸ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ψυχολογίαν ὁ λόγος ἀναβαίνει εἰς κοσμολογίαν καὶ φυσιολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ ἑρμηνευτὴς γίνεται μηχανή, ὅταν ἡ ἀδυναμία τοῦ μαινομένου μετατρέπεται εἰς κοινωνικὸν κανόνα ἐπικυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX2","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-07","text":"Ὁ κρυφὸς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος εἶναι ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ ἐνοποίησις τοῦ ἀοράτου καὶ τοῦ ὑλικοῦ διὰ διαδοχικῶν, ἀτελῶν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενων μεταφράσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B01","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ διάκρισις → ἄμεσος ἐπικοινωνία ἀποκλειομένη → ἀνάγκη σωματικῆς μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_49:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B02","text":"Νοητικὸς τύπος ἢ θεία τάξις → ὀργανικὴ μετάφρασις → πάθος, ἀνάγκη ἢ μορφὴ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B03","text":"Σωματικὸν σημεῖον → ἀδυναμία αὐτοκρίσεως ἢ ἀμεσότητος → σώφρων ἑρμηνευτής → λογικὴ διάκρισις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B04","text":"Ἀμετρία → νόσος καὶ φθορά → προνοητικὴ ὀργανικὴ ἀνασχέσις → διατήρησις τοῦ θνητοῦ γένους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B05","text":"Στοιχειώδης ἀναλογία → μυελὸς → διαίρεσις θείου καὶ θνητοῦ → ὀστᾶ καὶ σάρκες → συνεκτικὸν σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B06","text":"Ἡ ἀτελὴς ὑλικὴ λειτουργία → ἀνάγκη ἑρμηνείας καὶ κανόνος → ὑποθετικὴ γνώσις → ἱεραρχικὴ συνοχή ἄνευ ἀπολύτου βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B01","text":"Διαιρεμένη ψυχή → ἀδυναμία ἀμέσου κυβερνήσεως → σωματικὴ μεσολάβησις → παραγωγὴ σημείων καὶ παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_49:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B02","text":"Σημεῖον ἢ μαντικὴ ἐμπειρία → ἀδυναμία αὐτοκρίσεως → ἑρμηνευτικὴ καὶ κοινωνικὴ διαμεσολάβησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B03","text":"Ὑλικὴ κατάστασις → περιορισμένη σαφήνεια → διάκρισις εἰκότος καὶ ἀληθοῦς → ἀναστολὴ ἀπολύτου βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B04","text":"Ἀμετρία ἐπιθυμίας → κίνδυνος φθορᾶς → ὀργανικὴ βραδύτης → ἠθικὴ ῥύθμισις καὶ διατήρησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B05","text":"Στοιχεῖα → μυελὸς → ψυχικὴ ρίζωσις → διαφοροποίησις ἐγκεφάλου καὶ λοιποῦ σώματος → σωματικὴ στερέωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B06","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ σωματικὴ τάξις → ἀτελὴς ἀλλὰ λειτουργικὴ ἀλήθεια → ἐρμηνεία, διάκρισις καὶ ἀναστολὴ τελικῆς βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-01","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενον φυσιολογίας εἰς ἐνεργὸν χάρτην ψυχικῶν, ἠθικῶν καὶ θεολογικῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-02","text":"Ἡ μαντεία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ αὐτόματον ἀποκάλυψιν εἰς σύστημα παραγωγῆς, μεταδόσεως καὶ κρίσεως σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία γίνεται γενετικὴ κοσμολογία, ἐπειδὴ ἐξηγεῖ οὐ μόνον τί ἐστι τὸ σῶμα, ἀλλὰ πῶς ἐγεννήθη ἀπὸ στοιχεῖα, μυελὸν καὶ σχήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_51:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-04","text":"Ἡ φύσις καὶ ἡ ἠθικὴ παύουσι νὰ εἶναι χωριστὰ πεδία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ βιολογικὴ λειτουργία ἐνσωματοῖ κανόνα συμπεριφορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_51:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἄγνοια μετατρέπεται ἀπὸ ἀπλὴν στέρησιν εἰς ὅρον ἀνάγκης ἑρμηνευτικῆς, ἐπειδὴ τὸ μηδὲν ἄμεσον ἀναγκάζει τὴν κρίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἱεραρχικὴν ἀλληλεπίδρασιν, ὅπου ἡ ψυχὴ ῥιζοῦται καὶ ἡ ὕλη σημασιοδοτεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-07","text":"Νέος τρόπος ἀναγνώσεως καθίσταται ἀναγκαῖος: ἡ ἑρμηνεία ὀφείλει νὰ παρακολουθῇ μετασχηματισμούς, ὄργανα, παθήματα, χρονικὰς φάσεις καὶ ὅρια βεβαιότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ ἄμεσα ἀντικείμενα εἰσὶν ἧπαρ, σπλήν, μαντεία, τροφή, κοιλία, μυελός, ὀστᾶ καὶ σάρκες.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ ὄργανα, τὰ πάθη καὶ οἱ ἑρμηνευταὶ συγκροτοῦσι δίκτυον παραγωγῆς καὶ ῥυθμίσεως σημασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ γνώσις ἀπαιτεῖ ἀπόστασιν ἀπὸ τὸ πάθος, διάκρισιν τοῦ σημείου καὶ ὑποταγὴν εἰς κανόνα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ὄν εἶναι σύνθεσις ψυχῆς, στοιχείων, σχημάτων, ὀργάνων καὶ μεταβαλλομένης ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ καὶ ἐπιτελεστικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ὁ λόγος μιμεῖ τὸ ἀντικείμενόν του: ἀπὸ διεσπαρμένα σημεῖα κατασκευάζει ἱεραρχικὴν συνοχήν, χωρὶς νὰ ἐξαλείφῃ τὴν ἀβεβαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-01","text":"Ἡ μαντικὴ ἀξίωσις σημασίας ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἀδυναμίαν τοῦ μαντευομένου, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀδυναμία αὕτη ἀπειλεῖ νὰ ἀκυρώσῃ τὴν ἐμπιστοσύνην εἰς τὸ σημεῖον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-02","text":"Ἡ θεία πρόνοια παράγει τάξιν καὶ διατήρησιν, ἀλλὰ τὸ παραγόμενον σῶμα παραμένει ὑποκείμενον εἰς νόσον, ἀνάγκην καὶ φθοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-03","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογία ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκρίβειαν διὰ τὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀρνεῖται νὰ ἀναλάβῃ τὸ κύρος θείας ἀποκαλύψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-04","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀναλογία παρουσιάζεται ὡς ἀναγκαία γενετικὴ ἀρχή, ἀλλὰ ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῶν μετασχηματισμῶν παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D5","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀφροσύνη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀδυναμίαν εἰς δίαυλον ἀληθείας, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἀποκτᾷ διὰ τοῦτο αὐτόνομον γνωστικὴν ἐξουσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τοῦ ὀργάνου μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀντικείμενον φυσιολογίας εἰς μηχανὴν ψυχικῆς, ἠθικῆς καὶ ἐρμηνευτικῆς ῥυθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς ἀνατομίας μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ περιγραφὴν μερῶν εἰς γενετικὴν ἀπόδειξιν τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS6","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογικὴ μετριοπάθεια γίνεται ὄρος συνοχῆς καὶ οὐχὶ ἔλλειψις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ εἰκὼς διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην ἑρμηνείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς πολυεπίπεδος μηχανὴ μεταφράσεως, ἐν ᾗ ἡ θεία τάξις διαβαίνει διὰ στοιχείων, ὀργάνων, παθημάτων καὶ σημείων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος γίνεται οὔτε κυρίαρχος οὔτε ἁπλὸς δέκτης, ἀλλὰ ἐρμηνευτὴς ὑλικῶν καὶ ψυχικῶν μεταγραφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι γενετικὸς καὶ ἐπιστρεπτικός: ἕκαστον σημεῖον ἀπαιτεῖ παρελθόν, παρόν, μέλλον, ἀνάπτυξιν καὶ ἐπανασύνδεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἀπόδρασις δὲν εἶναι φυγὴ ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα, ἀλλὰ ὀρθὴ πλοήγησις διὰ τῶν περιορισμῶν, τῶν σημείων καὶ τῶν ἱεραρχικῶν ἐρμηνειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κύριας κινήσεως: ἱεραρχία → σωματικὴ μεσολάβησις → σημεῖον → ἑρμηνεία → ἠθικὴ καὶ ὀντολογικὴ ρύθμισις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν διαφοράν μεταξὺ παραγωγῆς σημείου, ὑλικῆς συνθήκης, ἑρμηνείας καὶ θείας κυρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσιν ὁ ἀκριβὴς μηχανισμὸς τῶν σωματικῶν μεταγραφῶν, ἡ μετάβασις τοῦ μυελοῦ εἰς τὰ λοιπὰ μέρη καὶ ἡ τελικὴ ἐπικύρωσις τῆς μαντικῆς ἀληθείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ δομὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ὅταν ἡ ἀβεβαιότης θεωρῆται συστατικὸς ὅρος τοῦ συστήματος· ἡ ἰσχυροτέρα της ἀρχὴ εἶναι ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ μεσολάβησις, ἐνῶ ἡ ἀσθενεστέρα ἡ ἀκριβὴς αἰτιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ δὲν ἐξομαλύνει τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ ἀτελοῦς ἀληθείας, ὑλικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ θείας τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232837418947Z_7ff6d8cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 55–57","source_sha256":"e6ea4ecb481511c6bda14141b7c5328296c70ee1c4cf89564f2b1081926bd7c8","sha256":"7246d4af6b3944a75b0fee966bde5bc3fd9fd372b62df8f6d6e96d386757c0cf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:28:37.422219+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-01","text":"The system seeks to explain how divine order governs the mortal body, the irrational part, and the lack of measure in desires.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-02","text":"Soul and body are reconstructed as a hierarchical network of mediations, not as a unified and direct power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-03","text":"Intellect does not act directly upon the irrational, but through bodily organs, signs, affections, and transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-04","text":"Divination and anatomy converge upon a common principle: truth appears through material mediation and requires interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-05","text":"Bodily construction converts psychic hierarchy into physiological, ethical, and cognitive order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-06","text":"The course is cumulative and recursive: from intellect to sign, from sign to interpretation, and from necessity to organic regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_51:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-07","text":"The form of the argument becomes generative and apophatic: it constructs order while simultaneously excluding immediacy, autonomy, and chance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AS-08","text":"The conclusion is not complete proof, but hypothetical coherence, in which truth remains dependent upon rule, interpretation, and divine ratification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Divine providence gives form to the body and the parts of the soul according to order, purpose, and proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The soul does not have a unified cognitive function, but is divided into intellect, the irrational part, and bodily mediations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The irrational part neither deliberates automatically nor judges automatically, but receives forms, affections, and signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A2","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Mediation shifts from the liver and the viscera to marrow, bones, and digestion, but retains the function of transcription.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The body functions as a translation of invisible psychic, theological, or ethical relations into material states.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:D3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Divinatory meaning is not produced from the phenomenon alone, but from the distribution of roles among affection, sign, interpreter, and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Physiology provides a material condition of meaning, but does not constitute a self-sufficient guarantee of truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Bodily function undertakes an ethical task, because digestion, slowness, and necessity restrict greed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Anatomy, psychology, ethics, and cosmology fall under one common generative schema.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Mortality, disease, and decay are not abolished by providence, but are included as conditions of construction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Truth appears chiefly through indirect, imperfect, and materially mediated paths.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The existence of the mortal being is produced through a succession of transformations, from elements and marrow to organs, flesh, and ethical regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-01","text":"The principle of the removal of the irrational from intellect recurs as the distance of the madman from judgment and as the restriction of desire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-02","text":"The function of the liver as a mirror is transformed into the function of marrow as root and bond of soul and body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A6","CH_JP8E_S_51:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-03","text":"Divination changes function: from imperfect access to truth, it becomes a process of examination, interpretation, and social validation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A10","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-04","text":"Folly reverses its negative value: from deprivation of judgment it becomes a channel which the prudent interpreter examines.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_50:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-05","text":"Anatomical detail is detached from simple description and acquires a generative function when each part is produced from prior matter and proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A10","CH_JP8E_S_51:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-06","text":"The idea of the sign shifts from the divinatory phenomenon to bodily pathology and then to digestive regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-07","text":"Uncertainty concerning knowledge is not eliminated, but transformed into methodological moderation and a need for divine agreement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RMD-08","text":"The initial distinction between intellect and body is absorbed into hierarchical interaction, where matter already bears psychic and ethical meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-01","text":"The precise anatomy of the liver, spleen, and organs remains a local detail, unless it is elevated to the general principle of mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_50:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-02","text":"The property of the living liver and decay after death are scaled into the general principle that meaning depends upon an active material state.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A6","CH_JP8E_S_50:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-03","text":"The inability of the madman to judge becomes a bridge between divinatory experience and the general principle of mediated knowledge.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_50:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-04","text":"The account concerning soul as likely remains hypothetical and does not rise into a universal axiom without divine ratification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-05","text":"The slowness of digestive motion exceeds the local example, because it reveals the body as a machine of embodied education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D2","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-06","text":"The mathematical constitution of the elements becomes a current generative principle only when connected with the hierarchical generation of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:A8","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-07","text":"The ethical condemnation of gluttony does not remain reproach, but is transformed into anatomical and physiological explanation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:CGD-08","text":"Local uncertainty concerning the manner of the transition of marrow into flesh does not dissolve the current architecture, but defines the limit of reconstruction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-01","text":"Direct and autonomous communication between intellect, the irrational, body, and divine truth is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-02","text":"The identification of phenomenon with truth is rejected, because the sign requires interpretation and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-03","text":"The reduction of physiology to an indifferent mechanical cause is rejected, because matter bears purpose, proportion, and ethical function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-04","text":"The unlimited natural authority of desire and the claim that necessity justifies lack of measure are rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-05","text":"The hypothesis that the body is a disorderly aggregate of parts, or that the soul exists without bodily rootedness, is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:GNX-06","text":"Truth is defined negatively as not self-sufficient, not direct, and not independent of material and interpretive order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot stand if the soul is regarded as a homogeneous power or if intellect communicates directly with all parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the absence of reason entails the incapacity for every sign, because folly becomes an imperfect bearer of truth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX5","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-03","text":"The idea that the body is a passive recipient must be excluded, because it produces, transcribes, and regulates meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-04","text":"The complete identification of divine providence with release from disease, mortality, and decay must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-05","text":"The idea that physiological explanation can replace divine assurance must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_50:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:DBN-06","text":"The more deeply rejected possibility is a world in which matter, soul, truth, and desire function without hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-01","text":"The possibility of pure truth is absent, a truth that would be independent of body, affection, sign, interpretation, and judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-02","text":"The system circles around the absence of a direct account that would resolve, without mediation, the separation of intellect, body, and the irrational.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:D2","CH_JP8E_S_50:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-03","text":"The possibility of a mortal body that would be at once necessity without limitation and survival without decay is prohibited.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-04","text":"The equation of the irrational with pure uselessness or with complete autonomy is prohibited; it exists only as a dependent function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX4","CH_JP8E_S_49:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSA-05","text":"The absence of absolute certainty is not a void, but the condition under which interpretation and discrimination remain necessary.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-01","text":"Since the irrational receives meaning through a bodily organ and divination requires an interpreter, truth in the system is always a process of transcription and judgment.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_49:D5","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-02","text":"Since the liver, marrow, and digestion undertake mediating functions, the body becomes a unified mechanism for converting meaning into regulation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_49:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-03","text":"Madness and lack of measure, although contrary states, are addressed through the same strategy: organic arrangement restricts what cannot be governed directly.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_50:A2","CH_JP8E_S_51:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-04","text":"The distinction between the likely and the true, in divination, extends into anatomy: the material cause explains function, but not the whole truth.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_50:A9","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-05","text":"Bodily form becomes the common place where divine providence, psychic hierarchy, and ethical discipline meet.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-06","text":"The need for a prudent interpreter and the need for organic proportion show that neither knowledge nor life emerges without intermediate rules.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-07","text":"The providential regulation of greed and the interpretive regulation of divination constitute a general model for governing the irrational.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_51:D3","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:XD-08","text":"Mortal imperfection is not merely a deficiency, but a functional field in which providence produces signs, organs, restrictions, and possibilities of knowledge.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-01","text":"Truth in the system is distributed by levels: intellect directs, the organ transcribes, affection signifies, and the interpreter judges.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-03","CL_JP8E_19:GA-05","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-02","text":"Nature ceases to be opposed to ethics, because the organs already embody restriction, purpose, proportion, and hierarchy.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-03","text":"Knowledge becomes a practice of reading material transformations, not possession of direct internal content.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-07","CL_JP8E_19:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-04","text":"Divine providence does not construct an immortal body, but a system of prolongation, restraint, and controlled decay.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-05","text":"Imperfection becomes a productive condition: inability to judge generates interpretation, necessity generates regulation, and decay defines the value of providence.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CL_JP8E_19:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_49:D6","CH_JP8E_S_51:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-06","text":"The time of truth is not only momentary, but includes waiting, interpretation, development, and successive transformations.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-07","text":"The unity of the mortal being is not an initial given, but the result of a chain-like connection of elements, marrow, soul, and organs.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-04","CL_JP8E_19:GA-09","CL_JP8E_19:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_51:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:BSD-08","text":"Political and cognitive authority is assigned to the prudent interpreter, just as bodily order is assigned to providential construction.","refs":["CL_JP8E_19:GA-01","CL_JP8E_19:GA-06","CL_JP8E_19:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_50:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-01","text":"The cycle of the sign extends as follows: psychic power → bodily transcription → affection → sign → prudent interpretation → reconnection to intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-02","text":"The cycle of restraint begins from lack of measure, passes into digestive slowness, restricts desire, and preserves the race.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-03","text":"The cycle of interpretive postponement transforms experience into hypothesis, hypothesis into discrimination, and discrimination into a search for divine ratification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-04","text":"Escalation transfers the role of the organ from mirror of affections to root of bodily existence and then to ethical mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-05","text":"The repetition of mediation signifies a change of phase: from internal psychology, the account ascends into cosmology and physiology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-06","text":"The interpreter becomes a machine when the inability of the madman is transformed into a social rule of validation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:NX2","CH_JP8E_S_50:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:RLE-07","text":"The hidden attractive pole is the hierarchical unification of the invisible and the material through successive, imperfect, and controlled translations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B01","text":"Hierarchical distinction → direct communication excluded → necessity of bodily mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_49:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B02","text":"Intelligible form or divine order → organic translation → affection, necessity, or bodily form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B03","text":"Bodily sign → incapacity for self-judgment or immediacy → prudent interpreter → rational discrimination.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_50:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B04","text":"Lack of measure → disease and decay → providential organic restraint → preservation of the mortal race.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B05","text":"Elemental proportion → marrow → division of divine and mortal → bones and flesh → cohesive body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FGS-B06","text":"Imperfect material function → need for interpretation and rule → hypothetical knowledge → hierarchical coherence without absolute certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B01","text":"Divided soul → inability of direct governance → bodily mediation → production of signs and affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_49:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B02","text":"Sign or divinatory experience → inability of self-judgment → interpretive and social mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AF1","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B03","text":"Material state → limited clarity → distinction between likely and true → suspension of absolute certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B04","text":"Lack of measure in desire → danger of decay → organic slowness → ethical regulation and preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B05","text":"Elements → marrow → psychic rootedness → differentiation of brain and rest of body → bodily consolidation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:AFM-B06","text":"Hierarchical bodily order → imperfect but functional truth → interpretation, discrimination, and suspension of final certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-01","text":"The body is reclassified from an object of physiology into an active map of psychic, ethical, and theological relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-02","text":"Divination is reclassified from automatic revelation into a system of production, transmission, and judgment of signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-03","text":"Anatomy becomes generative cosmology, because it explains not only what the body is, but how it was generated from elements, marrow, and shapes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_51:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-04","text":"Nature and ethics cease to be separate fields, because biological function embodies a rule of conduct.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_51:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-05","text":"Ignorance is transformed from simple deprivation into a condition of interpretive necessity, because nothing direct compels judgment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_50:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-06","text":"The opposition of soul and body is transformed into hierarchical interaction, where the soul takes root and matter signifies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MME-07","text":"A new mode of reading becomes necessary: interpretation must follow transformations, organs, affections, temporal phases, and limits of certainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the immediate objects are liver, spleen, divination, food, belly, marrow, bones, and flesh.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT1","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, organs, affections, and interpreters constitute a network of production and regulation of meaning.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ALT2","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, knowledge requires distance from affection, discrimination of the sign, and submission to rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological level, being is a composition of soul, elements, shapes, organs, and changing matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_51:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological and performative level, the account imitates its object: from scattered signs it constructs hierarchical coherence, without eliminating uncertainty.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-01","text":"The divinatory claim to meaning requires the inability of the diviner, but this inability threatens to invalidate confidence in the sign.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-02","text":"Divine providence produces order and preservation, but the produced body remains subject to disease, necessity, and decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_51:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-03","text":"Physiology requires precision for explanation, but refuses to assume the authority of divine revelation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:FL-04","text":"Bodily proportion is presented as a necessary generative principle, but the precise manner of transformations remains underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:D5","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-01","text":"Folly is transformed from incapacity into a channel of truth, but does not thereby acquire autonomous cognitive authority.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_49:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-02","text":"The concept of the organ is transformed from an object of physiology into a mechanism of psychic, ethical, and interpretive regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:A5","CH_JP8E_S_51:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-03","text":"The concept of anatomy passes from a description of parts into a generative proof of cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS6","CH_JP8E_S_50:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MP-04","text":"Epistemological moderation becomes a condition of coherence and not a deficiency, because the likely preserves the need for interpretation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:D6","CH_JP8E_S_50:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a multilayered machine of translation, in which divine order passes through elements, organs, affections, and signs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS1","CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-02","text":"The human becomes neither master nor simple recipient, but interpreter of material and psychic transcriptions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_49:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-03","text":"Time is generative and recurrent: every sign requires past, present, future, development, and reconnection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:AS3","CH_JP8E_S_51:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:HSI-04","text":"Possible escape is not flight from the body, but correct navigation through restrictions, signs, and hierarchical interpretations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_51:FGS6","CH_JP8E_S_49:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstruction of the principal movement: hierarchy → bodily mediation → sign → interpretation → ethical and ontological regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT1","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the difference between production of a sign, material condition, interpretation, and divine ratification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_50:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_50:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B03","text":"The precise mechanism of bodily transcriptions, the transition of marrow into the other parts, and the final validation of divinatory truth remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B04","text":"The structure is coherent when uncertainty is regarded as a constitutive condition of the system; its strongest principle is hierarchical mediation, while its weakest is precise causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_19:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, because it does not smooth over the tension between imperfect truth, material necessity, and divine order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_49:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_51:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_19@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_19:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 55–57"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 55–57","context":"Section 71 · Section 72 · Section 73","original_title":"Chapters 55–57","original_context":"Section 71 · Section 72 · Section 73"},"original_title":"Chapters 55–57","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 58–60","order":20,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_52","CH_JP8E_S_53","CH_JP8E_S_54"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_20@R001","sha256":"fdc79a222f1ebb576aa220be5d1ab1989813fa44adf93482db49989dad33959a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ ἐξήγησις τοῦ πῶς ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ διασῴζει τὸ ζῆν, τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν αἴσθησιν καὶ τὴν φρόνησιν ἄνευ πλήρους ἁρμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ ἀρχικὴ στερεότης μετασχηματίζεται διὰ διαδοχικῶν μεσολαβήσεων εἰς κινητὴν, αἰσθητικὴν καὶ προστατευομένην ὕπαρξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια ἑκάστου ὑλικοῦ στοιχείου γίνεται ὅρος τῆς λειτουργίας ἑτέρου, ὥστε τὸ σῶμα νὰ παράγεται ὡς σύστημα ἀντισταθμίσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-04","text":"Ἡ προστασία παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἐπένδυσις καὶ γίνεται διαβαθμισμένη ὀργάνωσις ὀστέων, νεύρων, σαρκῶν, δέρματος, τριχῶν καὶ ὀνύχων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ καὶ ἡ φρόνησις ἀναδεικνύονται διὰ ὑλικῆς ἐλαττώσεως, ἐνῶ ἡ σωματικὴ ἀσθένεια γίνεται τίμημα γνωστικῆς ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-06","text":"Τὸ φυσικὸν αἴτιον δὲν ἀκυροῦται ὑπὸ τοῦ τελικοῦ, ἀλλὰ ὑπάγεται εἰς πρόνοιαν ἣ προσανατολίζει τὴν ὕλην πρὸς μελλοντικὴν χρείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ λόγου εἶναι σωρευτικὴ καὶ μεταβατική· ἀπὸ τὴν προστασίαν ἄγει εἰς τὴν μεσολάβησιν, ἀπὸ τὴν μεσολάβησιν εἰς τὴν ἱεράρχησιν, καὶ ἀπὸ ταύτην εἰς τὴν τελικὴν διάνοιαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-08","text":"Κλείσιμο τοῦ συστήματος δὲν εἶναι ἡ τέλεια σύνθεσις, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀναγνώρισις ὅτι ἡ μορφὴ ὑφίσταται μόνον διὰ ὁρίων, θυσιῶν καὶ ἐλεγχόμενων ἀνεπαρκειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ σῶμα συγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχημένον δίκτυον ὑλῶν καὶ λειτουργιῶν, οὐχὶ ὡς ἄθροισμα ὁμοίων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια ἑκάστου στοιχείου εἶναι ἀναγκαία διὰ τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν συμπλήρωσιν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ στερεότης μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ ἀξία καθ᾽ ἑαυτὴν εἰς φυλακὴν ἣ χρειάζεται νευρικὴν καὶ σαρκικὴν μεσολάβησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ σὰρξ μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κάλυμμα εἰς θερμικὸν, μηχανικὸν καὶ αἰσθητηριακὸν ρυθμιστήν, ὅστις ὀφείλει νὰ περιορίζηται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ λειτουργικὴ ἑνότης παράγεται διὰ διαφορᾶς, ἀρθρώσεως καὶ συνδέσεως, οὐ διὰ ταὐτότητος τῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ φρόνησις ἀπαιτοῦσιν ὑλικὴν ἐλάττωσιν καὶ συνεπάγονται ἀναγκαίαν σωματικὴν ἀσθένειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἀνατομία φέρει ἀξιακὴν ἱεράρχησιν, ἐν ᾗ ἡ φρόνησις καὶ ὁ λόγος ὑπερέχουσι τῆς ἁπλῆς διατηρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ μορφὴ δὲν παράγεται μόνον ἐκ παρόντων παθῶν, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐκ τῆς προϋπολογιζομένης μελλοντικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Αἱ φυσικαὶ συναιτίαι ὑπάγονται εἰς τελικὴν διάνοιαν, ἣ μετατρέπει τὰ πάθη τῆς ὕλης εἰς χρείαν καὶ προστασίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ βέλτιστη σωματικὴ τάξις δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν σύγκρουσιν τῶν ἀγαθῶν, ἀλλὰ τὴν μετρεῖ καὶ τὴν ἐνσωματοῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ προστασία ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς ὀστέινη περίφραξις, σαρκικὴ κάλυψις, δέρμα, τρίχα καὶ ὄνυξ, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσει ἑκάστοτε τὸν τρόπον τῆς μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ στερεότης, ἀρχικῶς φορεὺς σωτηρίας, γίνεται ἔπειτα πηγή ἀκαμψίας, θερμικῆς φθορᾶς καὶ ἀναγκαιότητος νεύρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὸν περίβλημα μετατοπίζεται εἰς ρυθμιστὴν θερμότητος, αἰσθήσεως καὶ διανοητικῆς ἐγρηγόρσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ νευρικὴ μεσότης ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς σύνδεσις ὀστέων καὶ ὡς ἑνότης κεφαλῆς καὶ μελῶν, ἀλλὰ διευρύνεται εἰς καθολικὴν κινητικὴν ὀργάνωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ μεταβάλλει τὸ σχήμα τῆς ἀντισταθμίσεως: ἡ ἀδυναμία της δὲν εἶναι ἀποτυχία, ἀλλὰ ὅρος τῆς φρονήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ διάνοια ἀπορροφᾷ τὰ μηχανικὰ αἴτια, χωρὶς νὰ τὰ καταργῇ, καὶ τὰ ἀνασυντάσσει ὡς ὄργανα μελλοντικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ καὶ ὁ λόγος ἀρχικῶς συνυπάρχουσιν ἐν τῷ στόματι, ἀλλὰ διαχωρίζονται εἰς σωματικὴν συντήρησιν καὶ νοερὰν ὑπηρεσίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς χημεία τῶν σαρκῶν, τῶν νεύρων καὶ τῶν ῥαφῶν παραμένει τοπικὴ, ἐπειδὴ ὑπηρετεῖ τὸ παραγωγικὸν σχήμα χωρὶς νὰ τὸ ὁρίζει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ κατασκευὴ ἑκάστου ὀργάνου κλιμακοῦται ὅταν ἡ λειτουργία του συνδεθῇ πρὸς τὴν γενικὴν ἀντισταθμιστικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ διάκριση ὀστέου, νεύρου καὶ σαρκὸς γεφυροῦται εἰς ὑψηλοτέραν πρότασιν: ἡ ὕλη ὁρίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἔργον ὃ καθιστᾷ δυνατόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ καὶ τὸ στόμα λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς μεταβατικὰ σημεῖα, ὅπου ἡ ἀνατομία γίνεται ἱεράρχησις φρονήσεως, λόγου καὶ βίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ δερματικὴ, τριχική, καὶ ὀνυχικὴ μορφολογία ἀνακωδικοποιεῖται ἀπὸ ἐπιφάνεια εἰς συμπληρωματικὴν τελικὴν μηχανήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀκολουθία γένεσις–ὕλη–χρῆσις γίνεται current-level ἀρχὴ ὅταν τὸ μέλλον ἐνεργήσῃ ὡς ὅρος τοῦ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ σκληρότης, ἡ πυκνότης ἢ ἡ ἀφθονία ὕλης εἶναι ἄνευ ὅρου ἀγαθά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται τὸ ὁμοιογενὲς σῶμα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ λειτουργικὴ διαφορά εἶναι ὅρος τῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ταύτισις μακροβιότητος, ἰσχύος, αἰσθήσεως καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀντίληψις τοῦ δέρματος ὡς ἁπλοῦ ὑπολείμματος σαρκὸς καὶ τῶν τριχῶν ὡς ἀνεξαρτήτων οὐσιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἁπλὴ μηχανικὴ αἰτιότης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μορφὴ ἀπαιτεῖ τελικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀντίληψις ὅτι ἡ προστασία προστίθεται ὕστερον εἰς ἤδη τετελεσμένον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-01","text":"Οὐ δύναται νὰ σταθῇ σύστημα ἐν ᾧ μία σωματικὴ ἀξία κυριαρχεῖ ἐπὶ πασῶν τῶν ἄλλων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-02","text":"Οὐ δύναται ἡ ὕλη νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ μόνη τὴν μορφήν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τάξις της ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ σκοποὺς καὶ ἀνάγκας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-03","text":"Οὐ δύναται ἡ φρόνησις νὰ ἐμφανισθῇ ὡς ἄυλος ἢ ἀσώματος ἀρχή· ἐνσωματοῦται διὰ περιορισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-04","text":"Οὐ δύναται ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς ἄτακτος συσσώρευσις παθῶν, ἐπειδὴ αἱ συναιτίαι ὑπηρετοῦσι τελικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-05","text":"Οὐ δύναται νὰ χωρισθῶσιν ἡ μηχανική, ἡ θερμική, ἡ αἰσθητηριακὴ καὶ ἡ νοερὰ λειτουργία ὡς ἀνεξάρτητα πεδία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἡ δυνατότης σώματος ὃ ἅμα ἔχει πλήρη στερεότητα, ἐλευθέραν κίνησιν, ὀξεῖαν αἴσθησιν καὶ ἀσφάλειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ φύσις παρέχει ἅμα ἰσχὺν, μακροβιότητα, φρόνησιν καὶ αἴσθησιν ἄνευ κόστους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ ὡς ἀδιάφορος φορεὺς νοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕλη ἤδη φέρει ἱεράρχησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνατροπὴ τῆς χρονικῆς τάξεως, καθ᾽ ἣν ἡ μελλοντικὴ χρῆσις ἐνεργεῖ ὡς αἰτία τοῦ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς ἀντισταθμίσεως μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὴν κατασκευὴν τῶν μελῶν εἰς τὴν ἱεράρχησιν τῶν ἀγαθῶν: ἡ φρόνησις κερδίζει ὅ,τι ἡ σωματικὴ ὀχύρωσις χάνει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","CL_JP8E_20:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-02","text":"Ἡ νευρικὴ μεσολάβησις καὶ ἡ τελικὴ πρόνοια συμπίπτουσιν ὡς δύο κλίμακες τοῦ αὐτοῦ μηχανισμοῦ: ἡ μία συνδέει μέρη, ἡ ἑτέρα συνδέει παρόντα καὶ μέλλοντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-05","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-03","text":"Ἡ προστασία γίνεται δυνατὴ μόνον ὅταν ἀποφύγῃ τὴν καθολικότητα: τὸ περίβλημα ὀφείλει νὰ εἶναι ἐλαφρόν, διαφοροποιημένον καὶ λειτουργικῶς ἄνισον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-03","CL_JP8E_20:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-04","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ στόματος ἀποκαλύπτει τὴν γενικὴν λογικὴν τοῦ σώματος: κοινὸς τόπος δύναται νὰ διαιρεθῇ εἰς κατώτερον καὶ ἀνώτερον τέλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φύσεως καὶ σκοποῦ λύεται οὐχὶ διὰ καταργήσεως τῶν φυσικῶν παθῶν, ἀλλὰ διὰ ὑπαγωγῆς αὐτῶν εἰς τελικὴν ὀργάνωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-06","text":"Ὅταν ἡ προστασία, ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ φρόνησις ἀναχθῶσιν εἰς ἕνα σχήμα, ἡ ἀσθένεια γίνεται ἐσωτερικὸς μηχανισμὸς ἀριστοποιήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4","CL_JP8E_20:GA-06","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ μορφὴ γίνεται ἱεραρχικὸς χάρτης ἀξιῶν, ὅπου ἡ διάταξις τῆς ὕλης δηλοῖ τί προτιμᾷ ἡ φύσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ χρονικὴ αἰτιότης διευρύνεται: τὸ μέλλον, ὡς προϋπολογιζομένη χρῆσις, συμμετέχει εἰς τὸν σχηματισμὸν τοῦ παρόντος σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Direct","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐνότητα τοῦ ζῴου δὲν εἶναι δεδομένη ὑπὸ μιᾶς οὐσίας, ἀλλὰ παράγεται ἀπὸ διαβαθμισμένα δίκτυα μεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","CL_JP8E_20:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ ἄριστη κατάστασις δὲν σημαίνει μεγιστοποίησιν ἑνὸς γνωρίσματος, ἀλλὰ ρύθμισιν τῶν ἀμοιβαίως ἀλληλοαναιρουμένων δυνατοτήτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-02","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ τελεολογία δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν ἀνάγκην, ἀλλὰ ἀναδεικνύει τὴν ἀνάγκην ὡς ὄργανον ὑψηλοτέρου σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-01","text":"Ἀνάγκη προστασίας → στερεότης → ἀκαμψία → μεσολάβησις → κίνησις → νέα ἀνάγκη προστασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-02","text":"Ὑλικὴ ἀφθονία → δυσκινησία ἢ ἀναισθησία → περιορισμὸς ὕλης → αὔξησις κινήσεως, αἰσθήσεως καὶ φρονήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια ἐπανακάμπτει ὡς μηχανισμὸς παραγωγῆς: ἡ ἀδυναμία ἑνὸς μέρους ἀνοίγει τὸ πεδίον ἑτέρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ κεφαλὴ ἀποτελεῖ ἀτραπὸν ἐκ τῆς ὑλικῆς ἀντισταθμίσεως εἰς τὴν ἀξιακὴν ἱεράρχησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ αἰτιότης ἐκκινεί τὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ τελικὴ διάνοια ἐπαναφέρει τὴν γένεσιν ὡς σχεδιασμένην χρείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναδρομὴ τοῦ συστήματος καταλήγει εἰς ἕνα ἑλκυστήν: ἡ ὕλη ὀφείλει πάντοτε νὰ ἐξηγῆται διὰ τοῦ ἔργου ὃ καθιστᾷ δυνατόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B01","text":"Ζωτικὴ ἀνάγκη → ἀπαίτησις περιβλήματος → ὀστέινη στερεότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B02","text":"Ὀστέινη στερεότης → ἀκαμψία καὶ θερμικὸς κίνδυνος → νευρικὴ μεσολάβησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B03","text":"Νευρικὴ μεσολάβησις → ἄρθρωσις καὶ κίνησις → ἑνιαῖον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B04","text":"Ἑνιαῖον σῶμα → ἀνάγκη θερμικῆς καὶ μηχανικῆς προστασίας → σάρξ, δέρμα καὶ παράγωγα περιβλήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B05","text":"Περιβλήματα → κίνδυνος ὑπερβολῆς → διαφοροποίησις πάχους, πυκνότητος καὶ σκληρότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B06","text":"Διαφοροποίησις ὕλης → αἴσθησις καὶ φρόνησις → ἱεράρχησις ἀγαθῶν → τελικὴ πρόνοια μελλοντικῆς χρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:AFM-B01","text":"Ζωτικὴ διάσωσις → ὀστέινη περίφραξις → ἀκαμψία καὶ φθορά → νευρικὴ μεσολάβησις → κίνησις → σαρκικὴ καὶ δερματικὴ προστασία → περιορισμὸς ὕλης → αἴσθησις καὶ φρόνησις → τελικὴ διάταξις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀνατομικὴ ἀνεπάρκεια → λειτουργικὴ ἀντιστάθμισις → ἱεράρχησις φρονήσεως → ἐνσωμάτωσις τοῦ μέλλοντος εἰς τὸ παρόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-01","text":"Τὸ ὀστοῦν ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ στήριγμα εἰς περιοριστικὴν φυλακήν, ἣ ἀπαιτεῖ δίκτυον μεσολαβήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-02","text":"Τὰ νεῦρα ἀναταξινομοῦνται ἀπὸ ἐπιμέρους ὄργανα εἰς ἀρχὴν χωρικῆς καὶ λειτουργικῆς ἑνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-03","text":"Ἡ σὰρξ, τὸ δέρμα, αἱ τρίχες καὶ οἱ ὄνυχες ἀναφαίνονται ὡς διαβαθμίσεις ἑνὸς προστατευτικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ἀσθένεια ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἀναγκαῖο ἀντάλλαγμα ὑψηλοτέρας λειτουργίας, ὄχι ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀποτυχία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ὕλης καὶ νοῦ ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ σχέσεως ὀργανώσεως, ὅπου ἡ ὕλη μορφοῦται πρὸς νοερὸν τέλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-06","text":"Ὁ χρόνος γίνεται ἐνεργὸς παράγων τῆς μορφῆς, ἐπειδὴ αἱ μέλλουσαι χρεῖαι ἐγγράφονται εἰς τὴν παροῦσαν κατασκευήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς, ἡ κατασκευὴ ὀστέων, νεύρων, σαρκῶν, δέρματος, τριχῶν καὶ ὀνύχων ἀπαντᾷ εἰς συγκεκριμένα σωματικὰ προβλήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, τὸ σῶμα εἶναι σύστημα διαβαθμισμένων ὑλῶν, ὧν ἡ ἑκάστου λειτουργία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναλογίαν πρὸς τὰς λοιπάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ τί ἐστιν ἕκαστον μέρος εἰς τὸ τίνα κίνδυνον ἀποτρέπει καὶ τί ἔργον καθιστᾷ δυνατόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, ἡ φύσις εἶναι πεπερασμένη διάταξις, ἣ ἐνσωματοῖ συγκρούσεις ἀγαθῶν καὶ μελλοντικὰς χρείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ ἀνατομία ἀναγινώσκεται ὡς παραγωγικὸς χάρτης κινδύνων, μεσολαβήσεων, περιορισμῶν καὶ τελικῶν ἔργων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-01","text":"Ἡ προστασία ἀπαιτεῖ πυκνότητα, ἀλλὰ ἡ πυκνότης ἀπειλεῖ κίνησιν, αἴσθησιν καὶ φρόνησιν· ἡ ἔντασις αὕτη δὲν λύεται, ἀλλὰ ῥυθμίζεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-02","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ πρόνοια ὑπόσχεται τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ φυσικὴ περιγραφή διατηρεῖ μερικὴν μηχανικὴν ἀδιαφάνειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-03","text":"Ἡ φρόνησις ἀναγορεύεται εἰς ὑψηλότερον τέλος, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ ὑλικὴν ἀδυναμίαν, ἣ ἀπειλεῖ τὴν ἴδιαν τῆς ἀσφάλειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-04","text":"Ἡ φύσις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ φυσικῶν συναιτίων, ἀλλὰ ἡ συνοχὴ τοῦ σχήματος ἀπαιτεῖ τελικὴν διάνοιαν ἣ δὲν ἀνάγεται εἰς ταῦτα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἀνεπάρκεια μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἔλλειψιν εἰς παραγωγικὴν ἀρχήν, ὅταν ἡ στέρησις ἑνὸς γνωρίσματος καταστήσῃ δυνατὸν ἕτερον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-02","text":"Ἡ προστασία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὸν περίβλημα εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἀρχὴν διαφοροποιήσεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-03","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ γένεσις μεταλλάσσεται εἰς τελικὴν κατασκευήν, ὅταν ἡ μέλλουσα χρῆσις ἐνεργήσῃ ὡς παρούσα αἰτία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ὑπολαμβάνει τὴν πραγματικότητα ὡς μηχανὴν ἀμοιβαίας ἀντισταθμίσεως, ἐν ᾗ πᾶσα δύναμις ἀπαιτεῖ ὅρον καὶ μεσολάβησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἐντὸς ταύτης τῆς μηχανῆς δὲν εἶναι ἁπλῶς φορεὺς νοῦ, ἀλλὰ ὑλικῶς ἱεραρχημένον ὄν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι προνοιακὸς καὶ ἀναδρομικός: τὸ μέλλον δύναται νὰ ὁρίζῃ τὴν παροῦσαν μορφήν, χωρὶς νὰ καταλύη τὰ φυσικὰ αἴτια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐλευθερία δὲν εἶναι ἀπαλλαγὴ ἀπὸ ὅρους, ἀλλὰ πλοήγησις διὰ τῶν ὁρίων, τῶν μεσολαβήσεων καὶ τῶν ἐλεγχόμενων ἀνεπαρκειῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ current-level ἀρχαὶ ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν ζωτικὴν διάσωσιν εἰς τὴν τελικὴν πρόνοιαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διασῴζει τὸ παραγωγικὸν σχήμα στερεότης → μεσολάβησις → κίνησις → προστασία → περιορισμός → φρόνησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ λεπτομερὴς μηχανικὴ ἀκολουθία τῶν φυσικῶν παθῶν καὶ ὁ ἀκριβὴς τρόπος τῆς ἐπιλογῆς τοῦ βελτίονος ἀγαθοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B04","text":"Τὸ σύστημα εἶναι συνεκτικὸν ὅσον ἡ τελεολογία ὁρίζει τὸ μέτρον, ἀλλ᾽ ἡ ἕνωσις φυσικῆς ἀνάγκης καὶ προνοίας παραμένει ἀδιάλυτος κόμβος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232904899280Z_6136ba2f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 58–60","source_sha256":"fdc79a222f1ebb576aa220be5d1ab1989813fa44adf93482db49989dad33959a","sha256":"405716f12447a1186cb1519c740ff67e6fcea7719297eae98fb8ca0ae6600d50","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:29:04.902477+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-01","text":"The principal problem of the system is the explanation of how bodily form preserves life, motion, sensation, and practical wisdom without complete harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-02","text":"Initial solidity is transformed through successive mediations into a mobile, sentient, and protected existence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-03","text":"The insufficiency of each material element becomes a condition for the function of another, so that the body is produced as a system of compensations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-04","text":"Protection ceases to be a simple covering and becomes a graded organization of bones, nerves, flesh, skin, hair, and nails.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-05","text":"The head and practical wisdom emerge through material diminution, while bodily weakness becomes the price of cognitive superiority.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-06","text":"The natural cause is not annulled by the final cause, but is subordinated to providence, which directs matter toward future need.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-07","text":"The movement of the argument is cumulative and transitional: from protection it leads to mediation, from mediation to hierarchy, and from this to final intelligence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BAS-08","text":"The closure of the system is not perfect composition, but recognition that form exists only through limits, sacrifices, and controlled insufficiencies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The body is constituted as a hierarchical network of materials and functions, not as an aggregate of similar parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The insufficiency of each element is necessary for the reciprocal completion of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Solidity passes from being a value in itself to being a prison requiring nervous and fleshy mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Flesh passes from a covering to a thermal, mechanical, and sensory regulator, which must be limited.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Functional unity is produced through difference, articulation, and connection, not through identity of parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Sensation and practical wisdom require material diminution and entail necessary bodily weakness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Anatomy bears a hierarchy of value, in which practical wisdom and reason surpass mere preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-08","text":"[Mutating] Form is produced not only from present affections, but also from anticipated future use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Natural contributing causes are subordinated to final intelligence, which transforms the affections of matter into need and protection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The best bodily order does not eliminate the conflict of goods, but measures and incorporates it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-01","text":"Protection recurs as a bony enclosure, fleshy covering, skin, hair, and nail, but each time alters the mode of mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-02","text":"Solidity, initially the bearer of preservation, subsequently becomes a source of rigidity, thermal decay, and the necessity of nerves.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-03","text":"Flesh is displaced from an external covering into a regulator of heat, sensation, and intellectual wakefulness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-04","text":"Nervous mediation recurs as the connection of bones and as the unity of head and limbs, but is extended into a universal motor organization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-05","text":"The head changes the form of compensation: its weakness is not failure, but a condition of practical wisdom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-06","text":"Final intelligence absorbs mechanical causes without abolishing them, and reconstitutes them as instruments of future use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RMD-07","text":"Food and reason initially coexist in the mouth, but are separated into bodily maintenance and intellectual service.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-01","text":"The detailed chemistry of flesh, nerves, and sutures remains local, because it serves the generative schema without defining it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-02","text":"The local construction of each organ is scaled up when its function is connected to the general compensatory order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-03","text":"The distinction between bone, nerve, and flesh is bridged into a higher proposition: matter is defined by the work that it makes possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-04","text":"The head and the mouth function as transitional points, where anatomy becomes a hierarchy of practical wisdom, reason, and life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-05","text":"The morphology of skin, hair, and nails is recoded from surface into a supplementary final mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:CGD-06","text":"The local sequence generation–matter–use becomes a current-level principle when the future acts as a condition of the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-01","text":"The idea that hardness, density, or abundance of matter are unconditionally good is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-02","text":"The homogeneous body is rejected, because functional difference is a condition of unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-03","text":"The absolute identification of longevity, strength, sensation, and practical wisdom is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-04","text":"The conception of skin as a mere residue of flesh and of hairs as independent substances is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-05","text":"Simple mechanical causality is rejected, because form requires final arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:GNX-06","text":"The conception that protection is added afterward to an already completed body is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-01","text":"A system in which one bodily value dominates all the others cannot stand.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-02","text":"Matter cannot by itself explain form, because its order depends on purposes and necessities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-03","text":"Practical wisdom cannot appear as an immaterial or bodiless principle; it is embodied through limitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-04","text":"Natural generation cannot be understood as a disorderly accumulation of affections, because contributing causes serve a final order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:DBN-05","text":"Mechanical, thermal, sensory, and intellectual function cannot be separated as independent fields.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-01","text":"The possibility is absent of a body that simultaneously has complete solidity, free motion, acute sensation, and security.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-02","text":"A world is excluded in which nature provides strength, longevity, practical wisdom, and sensation simultaneously without cost.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-03","text":"Bodily form as an indifferent bearer of intellect is excluded, because matter already bears hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSA-04","text":"The reversal of the temporal order is excluded, according to which future use acts as the cause of the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-01","text":"The principle of compensation is transferred from the construction of limbs to the hierarchy of goods: practical wisdom gains what bodily fortification loses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","CL_JP8E_20:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-02","text":"Nervous mediation and final providence coincide as two scales of the same mechanism: the one connects parts, the other connects present and future.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-05","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-03","text":"Protection becomes possible only when it avoids universality: the covering must be light, differentiated, and functionally unequal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_54:A1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-03","CL_JP8E_20:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-04","text":"The form of the mouth reveals the general logic of the body: a common place can be divided into a lower and a higher end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:NX6","CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-05","text":"The opposition of nature and purpose is resolved not by abolishing natural affections, but by subordinating them to final organization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_54:ME3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:XD-06","text":"When protection, sensation, and practical wisdom are reduced to one schema, weakness becomes an internal mechanism of optimization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4","CL_JP8E_20:GA-06","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-01","text":"Bodily form becomes a hierarchical map of values, where the arrangement of matter indicates what nature prefers.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-07","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-02","text":"Temporal causality is expanded: the future, as anticipated use, participates in the formation of the present body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4","CL_JP8E_20:GA-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Direct","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-03","text":"The unity of the animal is not given by one substance, but is produced from graded networks of mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2","CL_JP8E_20:GA-01","CL_JP8E_20:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-04","text":"The best state does not mean the maximization of one attribute, but the regulation of mutually cancelling capacities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SD1","CL_JP8E_20:GA-02","CL_JP8E_20:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:BSD-05","text":"Teleology does not negate necessity, but reveals necessity as an instrument of higher design.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD3","CL_JP8E_20:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-01","text":"Need for protection → solidity → rigidity → mediation → motion → new need for protection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-02","text":"Material abundance → impaired motion or insensibility → limitation of matter → increase of motion, sensation, and practical wisdom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-03","text":"Insufficiency returns as a mechanism of production: the weakness of one part opens the field for another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-04","text":"The head constitutes a path from material compensation to the hierarchy of value.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-05","text":"Natural causality initiates generation, but final intelligence returns generation as a designed need.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:RLE-06","text":"The recursion of the system culminates in one attractor: matter must always be explained by the work that it makes possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B01","text":"Vital need → requirement of a covering → bony solidity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B02","text":"Bony solidity → rigidity and thermal danger → nervous mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B03","text":"Nervous mediation → articulation and motion → unified body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B04","text":"Unified body → need for thermal and mechanical protection → flesh, skin, and derivative coverings.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B05","text":"Coverings → danger of excess → differentiation of thickness, density, and hardness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FGS-B06","text":"Differentiation of matter → sensation and practical wisdom → hierarchy of goods → final providence of future use.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:AFM-B01","text":"Vital preservation → bony enclosure → rigidity and decay → nervous mediation → motion → fleshy and cutaneous protection → limitation of matter → sensation and practical wisdom → final arrangement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:AFM-B02","text":"Anatomical insufficiency → functional compensation → hierarchy of practical wisdom → incorporation of the future into the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-01","text":"Bone is reclassified from support into a restrictive prison requiring a network of mediations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-02","text":"Nerves are reclassified from individual organs into a principle of spatial and functional unity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-03","text":"Flesh, skin, hairs, and nails appear as gradations of one protective mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-04","text":"Weakness is reclassified as a necessary exchange for higher function, not as simple failure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-05","text":"The opposition of matter and intellect is replaced by a relation of organization, in which matter is formed toward an intellectual end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MME-06","text":"Time becomes an active factor of form, because future needs are inscribed in present construction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, the construction of bones, nerves, flesh, skin, hair, and nails answers specific bodily problems.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, the body is a system of graded materials, the function of each of which depends on its proportion to the rest.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation moves from what each part is to what danger it averts and what work it makes possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, nature is a finite arrangement that incorporates conflicts of goods and future needs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, anatomy is read as a generative map of dangers, mediations, limitations, and final works.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-01","text":"Protection requires density, but density threatens motion, sensation, and practical wisdom; this tension is not resolved, but regulated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-02","text":"Final providence promises order, but natural description retains partial mechanical opacity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-03","text":"Practical wisdom is proclaimed the higher end, but depends upon material weakness, which threatens its own security.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:FL-04","text":"Nature is explained through natural contributing causes, but the coherence of the schema requires a final intelligence that is not reducible to them.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-01","text":"Insufficiency mutates from deficiency into a generative principle when the privation of one attribute makes another possible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-02","text":"Protection mutates from an external covering into an internal principle of differentiation of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MP-03","text":"Natural generation mutates into final construction when future use acts as a present cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-01","text":"The system conceives reality as a machine of reciprocal compensation, in which every capacity requires a condition and mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-02","text":"Within this machine, the human being is not simply a bearer of intellect, but a materially hierarchized being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-03","text":"Time is providential and recursive: the future can determine present form without dissolving natural causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:HSI-04","text":"Possible freedom is not release from conditions, but navigation through limits, mediations, and controlled insufficiencies.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B01","text":"The current-level principles suffice for reconstructing the movement from vital preservation to final providence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the generative schema solidity → mediation → motion → protection → limitation → practical wisdom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_52:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B03","text":"The detailed mechanical sequence of natural affections and the precise manner of selecting the better good are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_53:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_20:MRT-B04","text":"The system is coherent insofar as teleology determines the measure, but the union of natural necessity and providence remains an insoluble knot.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_54:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_20@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_20:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 58–60"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 58–60","context":"Section 74 · Section 75 · Section 76","original_title":"Chapters 58–60","original_context":"Section 74 · Section 75 · Section 76"},"original_title":"Chapters 58–60","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 61–63","order":21,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_55","CH_JP8E_S_56","CH_JP8E_S_57"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_21@R001","sha256":"5e1c3d08c78433efffa1c66cdd43572c5a22db5ca624bdb6989d2759f332e20d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-01","text":"Τὸ κύριον πρόβλημα ἐστὶ πῶς τὸ θνητὸν σῶμα διαμένει ζῶν, ἐνώ ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ κατανάλωσις αὐτὸ συνεχῶς φθείρει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὴν φθορὰν ἀπὸ ἀπώλειαν οὐσίας εἰς πρόβλημα ῥοῆς, ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ διανομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-03","text":"Ἡ ζωή ἀνασυγκροτεῖται ὡς ἱεραρχικὴ καὶ δικτυωμένη λειτουργία, ἣ περιλαμβάνει φυτικήν, σωματικήν, πεπτικήν καὶ ἀναπνευστικὴν κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ μορφὴ δὲν ἀποτελεῖ παθητικὸ περίβλημα, ἀλλὰ μηχανισμὸν μεταβάσεως καὶ κυκλοφορίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-05","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ μεταβαίνει εἰς ζωτικὴν δύναμιν μόνον διὰ πλεγμάτων, ὀχετῶν, φλεβῶν καὶ θερμικῶν μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-06","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ ἁπλὴν εἴσοδον ἀέρος καὶ γίνεται ἀντιρρόπως κινούμενος κύκλος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-07","text":"Ἡ κυκλικότης συνδέει τὸ ἐσωτερικὸ πῦρ, τὸ περιβάλλον, τὴν πέψιν, τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ τὴν φλεβικὴν διανομήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἀπὸ τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν διάκρισιν τῶν ψυχῶν πρὸς μίαν ἐνιαίαν μηχανὴν ἀνταλλαγῆς, ἧς ἡ παῦσις σημαίνει θάνατον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ζωή ὁρίζεται πρῶτον διὰ τῆς μετοχῆς εἰς τὸ ζῆν καὶ οὐχὶ διὰ τῆς λογικῆς ἐνεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ζωτικὴ τάξις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὴν ἱεραρχίαν τῶν ψυχῶν εἰς τὴν ἀμοιβαίαν κυκλοφορίαν ὕλης, ἀέρος καὶ πυρός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φθορὰ τοῦ θνητοῦ σώματος ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς θερμότητος καὶ καταναλώσεως γεννᾷ ἀνάγκην ἀναπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Οὐδεμία τροφὴ φθάνει εἰς τὰ μέρη τοῦ σώματος ἄνευ ὀργανικῆς διαμεσολαβήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ σῶμα γίνεται δίκτυον ὀχετῶν, πλεγμάτων καὶ κοιλοτήτων, ὅπου ἡ μορφὴ παράγει τὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ, ἡ πέψις καὶ ἡ φλεβικὴ κυκλοφορία συγκροτοῦσι μίαν κοινὴν λειτουργικὴν οἰκονομίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ αἴσθησις καὶ ἡ ἐπιθυμία δύνανται νὰ ὑπάρχωσιν ἄνευ λόγου, νοῦ καὶ αὐτοκινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ὅπου οὐκ ἔστι κενόν, πᾶσα κίνησις ἀποτελεῖ ὠθουμένην ἀνταπόδοσιν καὶ ἀναπλήρωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Τὸ ἐντὸς πῦρ δὲν εἶναι ἀκίνητον κέντρον, ἀλλὰ πηγή, ἣ διὰ θερμικῶν μεταβολῶν ἀναστρέφει τὰ ῥεύματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ζωή διαμένει μόνον ὅσον ἡ ἀμοιβαία κίνησις ἀέρος, πυρός, τροφῆς καὶ φλεβῶν διαρκεί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Τὸ περιβάλλον δὲν περιβάλλει ἁπλῶς τὸ ζῷον, ἀλλὰ συμμετέχει ὡς ἀναγκαῖος ὅρος τῆς ζωτικῆς ἐναλλαγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς φθορᾶς ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴν κένωσιν τοῦ σώματος εἰς θερμικὴν καὶ κυκλοφορικὴ ἀντιστροφή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_57:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς γεωργικὸ προϊόν, ὡς περιεχόμενον κοιλίας καὶ τέλος ὡς ῥεῦμα ἀναδιανεμόμενον διὰ πλέγματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ φυτικὴ ἀκινησία, ἀρχικῶς σημεῖον ἔλλειψεως αὐτοκινήσεως, μετατοπίζεται εἰς ὑπόδειγμα ζωῆς ἄνευ νοῦ καὶ ἔπειτα ὑποχωρεῖ μπροστὰ στὴν κυκλοφορικὴ δυναμική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:NX2","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ σύνδεσις τῶν φλεβῶν ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς σύνδεσιν κοιλίας, πνεύμονος, στόματος, ῥινὸς καὶ ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A14","CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τῆς διατηρήσεως μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ἀντιμετώπισιν τῆς φθορᾶς εἰς διαρκῆ παραγωγὴν διὰ ἀντιρρόπων ῥευμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ θεία κατασκευή, ἀρχικῶς ἐξωτερικὴ βοήθεια πρὸς τὸ θνητόν, ἀπορροφᾶται ὡς ἐσωτερικὴ μηχανικὴ τάξις τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς κατάταξις τῶν φυτικῶν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων μένει τοπικὴ, ἐπειδὴ ὁ cluster διατηρεῖ μόνον τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς ζωῆς ἄνευ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ γεωργικὴ ἡμέρωσις τῶν φυτῶν κλιμακοῦται, ὅταν ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ προέκτασις τῆς σωματικῆς θρέψεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ διάταξις τῶν φλεβῶν δὲν παραμένει ἀνατομικὴ λεπτομέρεια, ἀλλὰ γίνεται γενικὸς νόμος συνδέσεως καὶ διανομῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κοιλία ὡς δοχεῖον τροφῆς εἶναι χαμηλοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὑπόθεσις, ἣ ὑπερβαίνεται ὑπὸ τοῦ πλέγματος ὡς μεταβατικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_56:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ γεφυροῖ τὰ τρία κεφάλαια, ἐπειδὴ μετατρέπει τὴν τοπικὴ ἀναπνοὴν εἰς γενικὸ μηχανισμὸ ἀνταποδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς φυσικὴ σχέσις πυρός, πνεύματος καὶ ἀέρος παραμένει ἀδιευκρίνιστος, ἀλλὰ ἡ λειτουργικὴ κυκλικότης γίνεται ἀνώτερη ἀρχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ταύτισις ζωῆς, αἰσθήσεως καὶ νοήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ζωή περιλαμβάνει καὶ ἄλογον φυτικὴν δύναμιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται τὸ σῶμα ὡς ἀδρανὲς περίβλημα, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀνατομία παράγει τὴν ἴδιαν τὴς διατηρήσεως λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ στατικὴ ἀποθήκευσις ὕλης ὡς ἐξήγησις τῆς ζωῆς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ζωή ἀπαιτεῖ συνεχή κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ γραμμικὴ αἰτιότης, ὅπου μία μόνη ἀρχὴ παράγει ἀμετάβλητα ἀποτελέσματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-01","text":"Δέον νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ λειτουργία δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ χωρὶς γεωμετρικὴν καὶ ὑλικὴν διάταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-02","text":"Δέον νὰ ἀποκλεισθῇ ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ τροφὴ μεταβαίνει ἀμέσως ἀπὸ τὴν κοιλίαν εἰς τὰς φλέβας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-03","text":"Δέον νὰ ἀποκλεισθῇ ἡ διάσπασις τῆς πέψεως, τῆς ἀναπνοῆς καὶ τῆς κυκλοφορίας εἰς ἀνεξάρτητα γεγονότα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-04","text":"Ἀδυνατεῖ νὰ σταθῇ κόσμος ἐν ᾧ τὸ ἐσωτερικὸν ζῷον καὶ ὁ περιβάλλων ἀὴρ χωρίζονται ἀπολύτως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀπούσα δυνατότης εἶναι ζωή ἄνευ κυκλοφορίας, ἄνευ διαμεσολαβήσεως καὶ ἄνευ ἀνταποδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἀκίνητον ἐσωτερικὸν κέντρον, ὃ θὰ ἐκκινεῖ τὰ πάντα χωρὶς νὰ μεταβάλλεται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος γίνεται ἡ ζωή ὡς ἁπλὴ διαδοχὴ ἐσωτερικῶν καταστάσεων, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕπαρξις της ἀπαιτεῖ περιβαλλοντικὴν ἀνταπόκρισιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ κλίμαξ τῆς ζωῆς μετατρέπεται εἰς δυναμικὸ χάρτην, ὅπου ἡ κατώτερη ζωή δὲν εἶναι ἔλλειψις, ἀλλὰ ἀρχὴ ὀργανωμένης λειτουργίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-01","CL_JP8E_21:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_55:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-02","text":"Ἡ τροφὴ καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ συνδέονται ὡς δύο ὄψεις τοῦ αὐτοῦ μετασχηματισμοῦ, ἐπειδὴ ἀμφότεραι μετατρέπουσιν ἐξωτερικὰ ῥεύματα εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ζωτικότητα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_57:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-03","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ σώματος λειτουργεῖ ὡς αἰτιώδης μετασχηματιστὴς, ἐπειδὴ πλέγματα, κοιλότητες καὶ ὀχετοὶ καθορίζουσι τὴν πορείαν τῶν ῥευμάτων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία κενοῦ ἐνοποιεῖ τὸ φυσικὸν καὶ τὸ ἀνατομικόν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ γίνεται ἀλληλουχία ὠθήσεων καὶ οὐχὶ ἁπλὴ διέλευσις.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-08","CL_JP8E_21:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_57:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-05","text":"Ἡ θεία τελεολογία μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν μηχανικήν, ὅταν ἡ «κατασκευή» ἀναλύεται διὰ μεγεθῶν, διαπερατοτήτων καὶ ἀντιρρόπων κινήσεων.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-02","CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_56:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ζωή ἐμφανίζεται ὡς σύστημα ὅπου ἡ αἰτία ἐπιστρέφει ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα καὶ τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα ἀνανεώνει τὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","CL_JP8E_21:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ζωή δὲν εἶναι ἰδιότης ἀποκεκλεισμένου σώματος, ἀλλὰ ἐπιτυχὴς διαχείρισις ῥευμάτων μεταξὺ σώματος καὶ κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία γίνεται μορφὴ κοσμολογίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διάταξις τοῦ σώματος ἀναπαράγει τὴν γενικὴν τάξιν τῆς ἀνταλλαγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ θνητότης ἀνασημαίνεται ὡς χρονικὸ ὅριον τῆς κυκλοφορίας καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἁπλὴ ἀπώλεια ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης γίνεται κυκλικὴ καὶ κατανεμημένη, ὥστε οὐδεμία ἀρχὴ ἐνεργεῖ ἄνευ τοῦ πεδίου τῶν ἀντιδράσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις λόγου δὲν σημαίνει ἔλλειψιν τάξεως, ἀλλὰ μεταφέρει τὴν τάξιν εἰς ἀνατομικὰ, περιβαλλοντικὰ καὶ θερμικὰ κυκλώματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-01","text":"Φθορὰ → ἀνάγκη τροφῆς → φλεβικὴ διανομή → ἐσωτερικὴ θερμότης → νέα φθορὰ καὶ νέα ἀναπλήρωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-02","text":"Ἀδυναμία ἀποθηκεύσεως λεπτοτέρων στοιχείων → πλέγμα διαμεσολαβήσεως → ἀντίρροπος κίνησις → συντήρησις τοῦ κυκλώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-03","text":"Ἐσωτερικὸν πῦρ → ὠθουμένη ἔξοδος → ἀναγκαστικὴ εἴσοδος → θέρμανσις καὶ ψῦξις → ἀναστροφὴ τῆς ῥοπῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς ἀναπνοῆς δὲν εἶναι πλεονασμός, ἀλλὰ ἡ φάσις ὅπου ἡ ἐναλλαγὴ γίνεται ὅρος τῆς ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἔννοια τοῦ ὀχετοῦ γίνεται μηχανή, ὅταν συνδέει τροφήν, φλέβας, κοιλίαν, πνεῦμα καὶ περιβάλλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ τελικὸς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἡ κυκλικὴ ἀνταπόδοσις, ἣ ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὸ ἀκίνητον κέντρον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B01","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ κατανάλωσις → φθορὰ τοῦ θνητοῦ → ἀνάγκη ἐξωτερικῆς καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς ἀναπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B02","text":"Φυτικὴ παραγωγή → τροφή → κοιλία → πλέγμα → φλέβαι → διανομή ζωτικῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B03","text":"Διαφορά μεγέθους καὶ λεπτότητος → διάκριση στεγανότητος καὶ διαπερατότητος → ὀργανικὴ διαμεσολάβησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B04","text":"Ἀπουσία κενοῦ → διαδοχὴ ὠθήσεων → θερμικὴ ἀντιστροφή → εἴσοδος καὶ ἔξοδος ἀέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B05","text":"Ἀνταπόδοσις πυρός, ἀέρος, τροφῆς καὶ φλεβῶν → διαρκὴς κυκλοφορία → ζωὴ ἕως τῆς παύσεως τῆς συστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B01","text":"Φυσικὴ φθορὰ → ἀνάγκη ἀναπληρώσεως → φυτικὴ καὶ σωματικὴ τροφή → ὀργανικὴ διανομή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B02","text":"Ἱεράρχησις ψυχῶν → ἀποσύνδεσις ζωῆς καὶ λόγου → ἀναγνώρισις ἀλόγου ἀλλὰ ὀργανωμένης ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B03","text":"Δοχεῖον κοιλίας → ὅριον μεγέθους → πλέγμα διαμεσολαβήσεως → ἀμφίδρομος ῥοή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B04","text":"Ἀπόρριψις κενοῦ → θεωρία ὠθήσεως → θερμικὴ ἀντιστροφή → κυκλικὴ ἀναπνοή → ἑνιαία ζωτικὴ κυκλοφορία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-01","text":"Τὸ ὅριον μεταξὺ φυτοῦ καὶ ζῴου μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὴν νόησιν εἰς τὴν ἐνεργὸν συμμετοχὴν εἰς ζωτικὴν ὀργάνωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-02","text":"Ἡ κοιλία, αἱ φλέβαι, ὁ πνεύμων, τὸ στόμα καὶ ἡ ῥὶς ἀνασυντάσσονται ὡς ἓν δίκτυον καὶ οὐχὶ ὡς ἀνεξάρτητα ὄργανα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ γίνεται πρότυπον γενικῆς φυσικῆς, ὅπου ἡ κίνησις ὑπάρχει μόνον διὰ ἀλληλεξαρτωμένων μετατοπίσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-04","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ὡς διαταραχὴ ῥοῆς καὶ οὐχὶ μόνον ὡς ἀπώλεια συστατικοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἐσωτερικοῦ καὶ ἐξωτερικοῦ καταρρέει ὡς ἀπόλυτος διάκρισις, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ζωή παράγεται μεταξὺ ἀμφοτέρων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface** — Ἡ τροφή, τὸ ποτόν, τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ τὸ πῦρ διέρχονται διὰ σωματικῶν διόδων καὶ μεταβάλλονται εἰς ζωτικὰ ῥεύματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural** — Ἡ ζωή συγκροτεῖται ὑπὸ πλεγμάτων, κοιλοτήτων, φλεβῶν, διόδων, διαφορῶν θερμότητος καὶ ἀντιρρόπων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic** — Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὸ βάρος ἀπὸ τὸ μεμονωμένον ὄργανον εἰς τὸ δίκτυον τῶν ἀλληλεξαρτωμένων λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal** — Τὸ ζῷον ὑπάρχει ὡς διαρκὴς γένεσις, ἧς ὁ χρόνος συνίσταται ἐκ ἐπαναλαμβανομένων κύκλων καὶ ὄχι ἐκ γραμμικῆς συσσωρεύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative** — Ἡ μορφὴ τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενον, ἐπειδὴ ἐπανέρχεται διὰ μετασχηματισμῶν ἀπὸ φθορὰν εἰς ῥοήν, ἀπὸ ῥοὴν εἰς κύκλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-01","text":"Ἡ θεία τελεολογία καὶ ἡ μηχανικὴ αἰτιότης συνυπάρχουσιν, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἀνάγονται πλήρως εἰς μίαν ἀρχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ θερμότης φαίνεται ἅμα ὡς πηγή κινήσεως καὶ ὡς μέρος τοῦ κυκλώματος, ἄρα ἡ ἀρχὴ καὶ τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα συμπλέκονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἀναλογία κήπου, φλεβῶν καὶ πλεγμάτων ἐπεκτείνει τὴν ἐξήγησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀφήνει ἀβέβαιον τὸ ἀκριβὲς φυσιολογικὸν πέρασμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἔλλειψις λόγου ἀπειλεῖ νὰ ἐρμηνευθῇ ὡς ἔλλειψις ὀργανώσεως, ἀλλὰ ἀντιστρέφεται εἰς ἀπόδειξιν ἐξωτερικῆς καὶ σωματικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-01","text":"Ἡ «κατασκευή» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ θείαν ἐπέμβασιν εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν μηχανικὴν ἀναγκαιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-02","text":"Ἡ «ἀναπνοή» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ δίοδο ἀέρος εἰς κύκλον θερμικῆς ἀνταποδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-03","text":"Ἡ «ζωή» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ διαβάθμισιν ψυχικῶν δυνάμεων εἰς διαρκῆ ἀναπαραγωγὴν ῥευμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_57:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ ἐκπνοὴ παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀντίθετα γεγονότα καὶ γίνονται ἀντιστρεφόμεναι φάσεις ἑνὸς μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς ἓν ἀναπνευστικὸν καὶ ὑδραυλικὸν δίκτυον, ὅπου ἡ ὕπαρξις συνίσταται εἰς ῥοὰς καὶ μεταβάσεις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον δὲν εἶναι ἀπόλυτος κύριος τῶν κινήσεων, ἀλλὰ κόμβος ἐντός δικτύου ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ ἀνταποδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι κυκλικός, ἐπειδὴ ἑκάστη κίνησις ἐπιστρέφει ὡς ὅρος τῆς ἑπομένης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ μόνη δυνατὴ διαφυγὴ δὲν εἶναι ἔξοδος ἐκ τοῦ δικτύου, ἀλλὰ διατήρησις τῆς ἀνταλλαγῆς πρὸ τῆς τελικῆς παύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ φθορὰν καὶ τροφὴν πρὸς πλέγμα, ἀναπνοὴν καὶ κυκλοφορίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευή διασῴζει τὴν ἱεραρχίαν τῶν ψυχῶν, ἀλλὰ τὴν ὑποτάσσει εἰς ἀνώτερον διάγραμμα κυκλοφορίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ συνοχὴ εἶναι ἰσχυρὰ ὅσον ἀφορᾷ τὴν ἀντιστοιχίαν φθορᾶς, τροφῆς, ῥοῆς, θερμότητος καὶ διατηρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B04","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ὁ ἀκριβὴς φυσιολογικὸς δεσμὸς πυρός, πνεύματος καὶ ἀέρος καὶ ἡ πλήρης σύνδεσις τῆς φυτικῆς ψυχῆς πρὸς τὴν καθολικὴν ψυχολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν φοράν τοῦ cluster, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τελικὴ κυκλικότης προκύπτει ἐκ τῆς προηγουμένης ἀνάγκης ἀναπληρώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T232932539409Z_9d4286d3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 61–63","source_sha256":"5e1c3d08c78433efffa1c66cdd43572c5a22db5ca624bdb6989d2759f332e20d","sha256":"99f279e301ce3971d5c0f4ff00cb6d961402265c0b3745173d9eb0906b878578","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:29:32.542513+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-01","text":"The principal problem is how the mortal body remains alive, while internal consumption continually destroys it.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-02","text":"The explanation shifts destruction from a loss of substance to a problem of flow, replenishment, and distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-03","text":"Life is reconstructed as a hierarchical and networked function, encompassing vegetal, bodily, digestive, and respiratory motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-04","text":"Anatomical form is not a passive covering, but a mechanism of transition and circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-05","text":"Food passes into vital power only through meshes, conduits, veins, and thermal transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-06","text":"Respiration ceases to mean a simple entry of air and becomes a reciprocally moving cycle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-07","text":"Circularity connects the internal fire, the environment, digestion, respiration, and venous distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AS-08","text":"The final movement of the system is from the hierarchical distinction of souls toward a unified mechanism of exchange, whose cessation signifies death.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Life is defined first by participation in living and not by rational activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] The vital order moves from the hierarchy of souls to the reciprocal circulation of matter, air, and fire.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The destruction of the mortal body from internal heat and consumption gives rise to the need for replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] No food reaches the parts of the body without organic mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The body becomes a network of conduits, meshes, and cavities, where form produces function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Respiration, digestion, and venous circulation constitute one common functional economy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Perception and desire can exist without reason, intellect, and self-motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Where there is no void, every motion constitutes a driven reciprocation and replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] The internal fire is not an immobile center, but a source that reverses the flows through thermal transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Life persists only so long as the reciprocal motion of air, fire, food, and veins endures.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] The environment does not merely surround the animal, but participates as a necessary condition of vital alternation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-01","text":"The concept of destruction recurs, but mutates from an internal emptying of the body into thermal and circulatory reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A3","CH_JP8E_S_57:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-02","text":"Food recurs as an agricultural product, as the content of the belly, and finally as a flow redistributed through a mesh.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A11","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-03","text":"Vegetal immobility, initially a sign of the lack of self-motion, shifts into a model of life without intellect and then recedes before circulatory dynamics.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:NX2","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-04","text":"The anatomical connection of the veins expands into a connection of belly, lung, mouth, nose, and air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A14","CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-05","text":"The concept of preservation changes from a response to destruction into continual production through reciprocal flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RMD-06","text":"Divine construction, initially external assistance to the mortal, is absorbed as the body's internal mechanical order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_56:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-01","text":"The precise classification of vegetal psychic powers remains local, because the cluster retains only the principle of life without reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-02","text":"The agricultural taming of plants is escalated when it is recognized as an external extension of bodily nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-03","text":"The arrangement of the veins does not remain an anatomical detail, but becomes a general law of connection and distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-04","text":"The belly as a receptacle of food is a lower-level hypothesis, superseded by the mesh as a transitional mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME1","CH_JP8E_S_56:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-05","text":"The absence of void bridges the three chapters, because it transforms local respiration into a general mechanism of reciprocation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:CGD-06","text":"The precise physical relation of fire, pneuma, and air remains unclear, but functional circularity becomes the higher principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-01","text":"The identification of life, perception, and thinking is rejected, because life also includes irrational vegetal power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-02","text":"The body as an inert covering is rejected, because anatomy produces its own function of preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-03","text":"The static storage of matter as an explanation of life is rejected, because life requires continuous motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:GNX-04","text":"Linear causality is rejected, where one single principle produces unchanging effects.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-01","text":"The hypothesis that function can be understood without geometrical and material arrangement must be false.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-02","text":"The idea that food passes directly from the belly into the veins must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-03","text":"The separation of digestion, respiration, and circulation into independent events must be excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:DBN-04","text":"A world cannot stand in which the internal animal and the surrounding air are absolutely separated.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-01","text":"The most deeply absent possibility is life without circulation, without mediation, and without reciprocation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-02","text":"An immobile internal center is absent, one that would set all things in motion without changing.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSA-03","text":"Life as a simple succession of internal states becomes impossible, because its existence requires environmental response.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-01","text":"The hierarchical scale of life is transformed into a dynamic map, where lower life is not a deficiency, but a principle of organized function.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-01","CL_JP8E_21:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_55:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-02","text":"Food and respiration are connected as two aspects of the same transformation, because both convert external flows into internal vitality.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_56:DNX4","CH_JP8E_S_57:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-03","text":"The form of the body functions as a causal transformer, because meshes, cavities, and conduits determine the course of flows.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-04","CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_56:A6","CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-04","text":"The absence of void unifies the physical and the anatomical, because respiration becomes a sequence of impulses and not a simple passage.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-08","CL_JP8E_21:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_57:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-05","text":"Divine teleology is transformed into internal mechanics when “construction” is analyzed through magnitudes, permeabilities, and reciprocal motions.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-02","CL_JP8E_21:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_55:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_56:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:XD-06","text":"Life appears as a system in which cause returns as effect and effect renews cause.","refs":["CL_JP8E_21:GA-06","CL_JP8E_21:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_57:A11","CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-01","text":"Life is not a property of an enclosed body, but the successful management of flows between body and world.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-02","text":"Anatomy becomes a form of cosmology, because the arrangement of the body reproduces the general order of exchange.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-03","text":"Mortality is re-signified as the temporal limit of circulation and not as a simple loss of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-04","text":"Causality becomes circular and distributed, so that no principle acts without the field of reactions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_57:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:BSD-05","text":"The lack of reason does not signify a lack of order, but transfers order into anatomical, environmental, and thermal circuits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-01","text":"Destruction → need for food → venous distribution → internal heat → new destruction and new replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-02","text":"Inability to store subtler elements → mesh of mediation → reciprocal motion → maintenance of the circuit.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-03","text":"Internal fire → driven exit → compelled entry → heating and cooling → reversal of tendency.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-04","text":"The repetition of respiration is not redundancy, but the phase in which alternation becomes a condition of life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-05","text":"The concept of the conduit becomes a machine when it connects food, veins, belly, pneuma, and environment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:RLE-06","text":"The final attractive pole of the system is circular reciprocation, which replaces the immobile center.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B01","text":"Internal consumption → destruction of the mortal → need for external and internal replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B02","text":"Vegetal production → food → belly → mesh → veins → distribution of vital matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B03","text":"Difference of magnitude and subtlety → distinction of impermeability and permeability → organic mediation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B04","text":"Absence of void → succession of impulses → thermal reversal → entry and exit of air.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FGS-B05","text":"Reciprocation of fire, air, food, and veins → continuous circulation → life until the cessation of the composite.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B01","text":"Natural destruction → need for replenishment → vegetal and bodily food → organic distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B02","text":"Hierarchy of souls → disconnection of life and reason → recognition of irrational but organized life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B03","text":"Belly receptacle → limit of magnitude → mesh of mediation → bidirectional flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:AFM-B04","text":"Rejection of void → theory of impulse → thermal reversal → circular respiration → unified vital circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-01","text":"The boundary between plant and animal shifts from thinking to active participation in vital organization.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-02","text":"The belly, veins, lung, mouth, and nose are reconstituted as one network and not as independent organs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-03","text":"Respiration becomes a model of general physics, where motion exists only through interdependent displacements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-04","text":"Destruction is remapped as a disturbance of flow and not merely as a loss of a constituent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MME-05","text":"The distinction between internal and external collapses as an absolute distinction, because life is produced between the two.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B01","text":"**Surface** — Food, drink, pneuma, and fire pass through bodily passages and are transformed into vital flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B02","text":"**Structural** — Life is constituted by meshes, cavities, veins, passages, differences of heat, and reciprocal motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B03","text":"**Metastrategic** — The explanation shifts the weight from the isolated organ to the network of interdependent functions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B04","text":"**Ontological / Temporal** — The animal exists as continuous coming-to-be, whose time consists of repeated cycles and not of linear accumulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:ALT-B05","text":"**Methodological / Performative** — The form of discourse imitates the object, because it returns through transformations from destruction to flow, from flow to cycle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-01","text":"Divine teleology and mechanical causality coexist, but are not fully reducible to one principle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-02","text":"Internal heat appears at once as a source of motion and as part of the circuit; therefore principle and effect are intertwined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-03","text":"The analogy of garden, veins, and meshes extends the explanation, but leaves the precise physiological transition uncertain.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:FL-04","text":"The lack of reason threatens to be interpreted as a lack of organization, but is reversed into proof of external and bodily order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-01","text":"“Construction” mutates from divine intervention into internal mechanical necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:A4","CH_JP8E_S_56:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-02","text":"“Respiration” mutates from a passage of air into a cycle of thermal reciprocation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:NX3","CH_JP8E_S_57:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-03","text":"“Life” mutates from a gradation of psychic powers into the continuous reproduction of flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_57:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MP-04","text":"Inhalation and exhalation cease to be opposite events and become reversible phases of one mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a respiratory and hydraulic network, where existence consists in flows and transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not the absolute master of motions, but a node within a network of replenishment and reciprocation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-03","text":"The time of the system is circular, because each motion returns as a condition of the next.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_57:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:HSI-04","text":"The only possible escape is not an exit from the network, but maintenance of exchange before final cessation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for a reconstruction of the movement from destruction and food toward mesh, respiration, and circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the hierarchy of souls, but subordinates it to a higher diagram of circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B03","text":"Internal coherence is strong insofar as it concerns the correspondence of destruction, food, flow, heat, and preservation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B04","text":"The precise physiological bond of fire, pneuma, and air, and the complete connection of the vegetal soul to universal psychology, are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_55:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_21:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of the cluster, because final circularity arises from the preceding need for replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_56:MRT6","CH_JP8E_S_57:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_21@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_21:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 61–63"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 61–63","context":"Section 77 · Section 78 · Section 79","original_title":"Chapters 61–63","original_context":"Section 77 · Section 78 · Section 79"},"original_title":"Chapters 61–63","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 64–66","order":22,"parents":["CH_JP8E_SEC8","CH_JP8E_S_58","CH_JP8E_S_59"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_22@R001","sha256":"d2923dc4bb7e4b6d2be150010f6dd5a1b9b002b8862cb932fe91ad53957f562b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ τὴν αἰτιολογίαν τῶν σωματικῶν παθημάτων οὐχὶ ἐν ἐξωτερικαῖς δυνάμεσιν, ἀλλ’ ἐν κινήσεσι, συμμείξεσι καὶ μεταβολαῖς ἑδρῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-02","text":"Ἡ φαινομενικὴ ἑνότης τῶν φυσικῶν, αἰσθητικῶν καὶ βιολογικῶν φαινομένων ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς δίκτυον ἀλληλοπαθῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-03","text":"Ἡ ὁμοιότης καὶ ἡ συγγένεια μετατρέπουσι τὴν ἑτερότητα εἰς ἁρμονίαν, ἀφομοίωσιν καὶ σωματικὴν συνοχήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ζωή ἐστιν ἰσορροπία ἐπιρροῆς καὶ ἀπορροῆς, ἣ διατηρεῖται μόνον διὰ συνεχῶν μετασχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-05","text":"Ὁ χρόνος καὶ ἡ ἐπανάληψις μεταβάλλουσι τὴν ἀφομοιωτικὴν δύναμιν εἰς φθίσιν, γῆρας καὶ λύσιν δεσμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-06","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἀντιστροφὴ τῆς φυσικῆς γενέσεως, ὅταν ἡ ἀναλογία, ἡ χώρα ἢ ἡ διαδοχὴ τῶν συστάσεων διαταράσσηται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ λόγου εἶναι σωρευτικὴ καὶ ἀνακυκλουμένη· τὸ κοσμικόν, τὸ σωματικόν, τὸ αἰσθητικόν καὶ τὸ παθολογικὸν ἀναγινώσκονται διὰ τῆς αὐτῆς γενετικῆς γραμμῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις οὐκ ἔγκειται εἰς ἀκίνητον θεμέλιον, ἀλλ’ εἰς ἀρχὴν ἣ ἐπαναφέρει τὴν φθορὰν εἰς τὴν ἀναστροφὴν τῆς γενέσεως καὶ τὴν λύσιν τῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶν πάθημα ἐκ κινήσεων, μεταβολῶν ἑδρῶν καὶ σχέσεων συστάσεως ἀναζητητέον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ὁμοιότης παράγει συμφωνίαν, ἡ δὲ ἀνομοιότης ἀναρμοστίαν, ἐν αἰσθήσει τε καὶ σώματι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ σύμμειξις καὶ ἡ κατάληψις ταχέων καὶ βραδέων φορῶν μετασχηματίζουσι πολλὰς κινήσεις εἰς ἓν πάθημα ἢ μίαν νέαv σύστασιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ σῶμα οὐκ ἔστιν ἄθροισμα ἀσύνδετων μερῶν, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς ἀλληλουχία ῥευμάτων, δεσμῶν καὶ γενέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Πᾶν συγγενὲς πρὸς τὸ συγγενὲς φέρεται, καὶ ἡ τροφὴ δύναται νὰ γένηται σῶμα μόνον δι’ ἀφομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ζωή συνέχεται διὰ τῆς ἀναλογίας ἐπιρροῆς καὶ ἀπορροῆς, ἣ ρυθμίζει ἀναπλήρωσιν, αὔξησιν καὶ φθίσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ σωματικὴ ταυτότης παράγεται διὰ συνεχούς ἀναπληρώσεως καὶ μετασχηματισμοῦ, οὐχὶ διὰ ἀμεταβλήτου πυρήνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ὁ χρόνος καὶ οἱ ἀγῶνες ἐλαττοῦσι τὴν ἰσχὺν τῶν ἐσωτερικῶν δεσμῶν καὶ μεταστρέφουσι τὴν ἀφομοιωτικὴν σχέσιν πρὸς φθοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] Τὸ σῶμα συγκροτεῖται ἱεραρχικῶς, ἀπὸ τὰ πρῶτα στοιχεῖα εἰς μυελόν, ὀστᾶ, σάρκας, νεῦρα καὶ αἷμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ γένεσις καὶ ἡ φθορὰ δὲν εἰσὶν ἀσύμβατοι πόλοι, ἀλλὰ ἡ φθορὰ ἐκ τῆς ἀναστροφῆς τῆς γενέσεως γεννᾶται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις ὁρίζεται διὰ συγγενείας, λόγου, χώρας, ἀναλογίας καὶ γενετικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Ὁ θάνατος ἐστὶ λύσις δεσμῶν, ἀλλὰ διακρίνεται ἡ κατὰ φύσιν λύσις ἀπὸ τὴν βίαιον καὶ παρὰ φύσιν διακοπήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἀπὸ τὰ φυσικὰ φαινόμενα εἰς τὴν ἀναπνοήν, τὴν τροφήν, τὴν αὔξησιν καὶ τὴν νόσον, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει πεδίον ἐφαρμογῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ σύμμειξις ἀρχικῶς σημαίνει παραγωγὴν αἰσθητῶν ποιοτήτων, ἔπειτα δὲ γίνεται μηχανισμὸς ἀφομοιώσεως καὶ συγκροτήσεως σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ συμφωνίαν φθόγγων εἰς ἐνσώματον ἀναλογίαν, ἣ δύναται νὰ ὀνομάζηται ὑγίεια ἢ ἡδονή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ συγγένεια μεταναστεύει ἀπὸ κοσμικὴν φοράν εἰς διαδικασίαν τροφικῆς ἀφομοιώσεως καὶ ταυτοτικῆς διατηρήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ ῥοὴ παύει νὰ δηλοῖ μόνον κίνησιν καὶ γίνεται μέτρον ζωῆς, ὑγείας, αὐξήσεως καὶ φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ γένεσις ἀποκτᾷ ἀντίστροφον μορφήν· ὅταν ἡ φυσικὴ διαδοχὴ λυθῇ, ὁ αὐτὸς μηχανισμὸς γίνεται φορεὺς διαλύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ αἰτία ὑποχωρεῖ ὑπὲρ ἐσωτερικῆς ἀταξίας, ἀδυναμίας ἀφομοιώσεως καὶ ἀναστροφῆς τῶν συστάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-08","text":"Οἱ τριγωνικοὶ δεσμοὶ παραμένουσι τοπικὸς μηχανισμός, ἀλλὰ ἀπορροφῶνται ὑπὸ γενικωτέρας ἀρχῆς χρονικῆς ἐξασθενήσεως καὶ λύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-09","text":"Ὁ θάνατος παύει νὰ σημαίνῃ ἓν μόνον τέλος καὶ γίνεται διαφορά τρόπων λύσεως, φυσικοῦ ἢ βιαίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-10","text":"Ἡ ἕλξις καὶ τὸ κενὸν ἐπιτελοῦσιν ἀρνητικὸν ἔργον, ἀλλὰ ὕστερον ἐξαφανίζονται ὡς αὐτοτελεῖς ἐξηγητικοὶ μηχανισμοί.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-01","text":"Τοπικὰ μένουσιν ἡ ἀκριβὴς λειτουργία τῶν ἠλέκτρων, τῶν Ἡρακλείων λίθων, τῶν τριγώνων καὶ τῶν χολῶν· ταῦτα εἰσὶν ἐξειδικεύσεις, οὐχὶ ὁ καθολικὸς πυρήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-02","text":"Κλιμακοῦνται πρὸς τὸ παρὸν ἐπίπεδον ἡ κίνησις, ἡ συγγένεια, ἡ ἀναλογία, ἡ ἀφομοίωσις καὶ ἡ γενετικὴ διαδοχή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-03","text":"Γέφυρα μεταξὺ τῶν μονάδων γίνεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ σωματικὸν πάθημα, ἡ ὑγίεια καὶ ἡ νόσος εἶναι διαφορετικαὶ φάσεις τῆς αὐτῆς κινητικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-04","text":"Καταλύτης μεταβάσεως εἶναι ἡ μεταφορά τῆς κοσμικῆς φορᾶς εἰς τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διανομήν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-05","text":"Ὑπερβαίνει τὸ τοπικὸν ἡ ἀρχὴ ὅτι ἡ τροφὴ γίνεται σῶμα μόνον διὰ μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ ὁμοιώσεως, οὐ διὰ ἁπλῆς προσθήκης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-06","text":"Ὑποκαθίσταται ἡ ἁπλῆ ἐξωτερικὴ ἕλξις ὑπὸ δικτύου ἐσωτερικῶν σχέσεων, ῥευμάτων καὶ μεταβολῶν χώρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-07","text":"Τὸ παρὸν ἐπίπεδον παράγει ἀρχιτεκτονικήν, ἣν οὐδεμία μονὰς μόνη δύναται νὰ ἐκφέρει: τὴν ἀλληλουχίαν κίνησις → ἀφομοίωσις → συγκρότησις → φθορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἕλξις ὡς αὐτοτελὴς αἰτία, ἐπειδὴ τὰ φαινόμενα γεννῶνται ἐκ συνδεδεμένων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται τὸ κενὸν ὡς ἐξωτερικὸς μηχανισμὸς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κίνησις ἐξηγεῖται διὰ συνεχοῦς ἀλληλοσυμπλοκῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀδρανὴς ὕλη, ἣ ἀναμένει ἐξωτερικὴν ἐνέργειαν, διότι πᾶσα ὕλη ὑπάγεται εἰς συγγένειαν, διαίρεσιν καὶ φοράν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ σωματικὴ ταυτότης ὡς ἀκίνητος πυρήν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὕπαρξις συνέχεται διὰ συνεχῶν ἀναπληρώσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ νόσος ὡς ἀνεξήγητον συμβεβηκός, ἐπειδὴ ἡ παθολογία ἀποτελεῖ ἀπόκλισιν ἀπὸ φυσικὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-06","text":"Ἀποδυναμοῦται ἡ διάκρισις φυσικοῦ καὶ αἰσθητικοῦ, ὅταν ἀμφότερα παράγωνται ἐκ κινήσεων καὶ συσχετισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-07","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ὁ θάνατος ὡς ἓν ἀδιαφοροποίητον συμβάν, διότι ὁ τρόπος τῆς λύσεως καθορίζει τὸ πάθος καὶ τὴν ἀξίαν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-01","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ κίνησις ἐπιβάλλεται ἐκτός, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αἰτιότης συγκροτεῖται ἐν σχέσει τῶν κινουμένων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-02","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ πάθημα εἶναι ἁπλὴ μεταφορὰ πράγματος, ἐπειδὴ γίγνεται ἐκ συσχετισμοῦ κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-03","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι τὸ σῶμα συντηρεῖται διὰ ἀπλῆς προσθήκης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τροφὴ ὀφείλει νὰ μετασχηματισθῇ εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-04","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ἡ ὑγίεια εἶναι στατικὴ ἀκινησία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διατήρησις αὐτῆς ἀπαιτεῖ ῥοὴν καὶ λόγον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-05","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι γένεσις καὶ φθορὰ εἶναι ἀσύνδετοι, ἐπειδὴ ἡ δευτέρα προκύπτει ἐκ τῆς ἀναστροφῆς τῆς πρώτης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-06","text":"Πρέπει νὰ εἶναι ψευδὴς ἡ ὑπόθεσις ὅτι ψυχὴ καὶ σῶμα χωρίζονται ἀπολύτως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ λύσις τῶν σωματικῶν δεσμῶν ἀφήνει τοὺς ψυχικοὺς δεσμούς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ὑπόστρωμα ἀδρανές, ἀμετάβλητον καὶ ἀδιάφορον, ὑποκείμενον ὑπὸ πάσας τὰς μεταβολάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται κόσμος διῃρημένος εἰς ἀσύνδετα φυσικά, βιολογικὰ καὶ αἰσθητικὰ πεδία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ αὐτὴ κινητικὴ γραμμὴ διαπερᾷ πάντα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-03","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει ἰσορροπία ἄνευ κινήσεως· ἡ διάρκεια ὑποκρύπτει πάντοτε ἀναπλήρωσιν, ἐξασθένησιν ἢ λύσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-04","text":"Ἀδύνατος μένει ἡ πλήρης ἀναγωγὴ τοῦ ποιοτικοῦ εἰς μηχανικὴν κίνησιν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μετάβασις πρὸς ἡδονὴν καὶ εὐφροσύνην διατηρεῖ ἄρρητον κενόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-01","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ φυσιολογία ἀποτελεῖ μικρογραφίαν κοσμικῆς κινήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ φορὰ μιμεῖται τὴν καθολικὴν φοράν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-01","CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀφομοίωσις τῆς τροφῆς καὶ ἡ σύμμειξις τῶν στοιχείων εἶναι μία κοινὴ μορφὴ μετατροπῆς τοῦ ἀνομοίου εἰς ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-03","CL_JP8E_22:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-03","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια δὲν εἶναι διατήρησις ἀμεταβλήτου μορφῆς, ἀλλὰ ἐπιτυχὴς ῥύθμισις μετασχηματισμῶν, ἣ διασώζει ταυτότητα διὰ μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-06","CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-04","text":"Ὁ γήρως ἐστὶν ἡ χρονικὴ μετάπτωσις ἀπὸ τὴν ἐνεργὸν ἀφομοίωσιν εἰς τὴν ἐπικράτησιν τῆς ἔξωθεν διαιρέσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","CL_JP8E_22:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_58:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-05","text":"Ἡ νόσος εἶναι παθολογικὴ ἀντιστροφὴ τῆς ἀφομοιώσεως: ὃ ἔδει νὰ συγκροτῇ, γίνεται φορεὺς διαλύσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-06","text":"Ἡ διαφορά φυσικοῦ θανάτου καὶ νόσου ἀκολουθεῖ τὴν διαφοράν μεταξὺ ὁμαλῆς λύσεως καὶ ἀντεστραμμένης γενέσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","CL_JP8E_22:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_58:D8","CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-07","text":"Ἡ ἑνότης τοῦ σώματος παράγεται ὡς γενεαλογικὴ ἀλυσίς, ἐν ᾗ ἡ διατάραξις ἑνὸς ἐπιπέδου ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς ἄλλα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_59:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-08","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία, ἡ ὑγίεια καὶ ἡ ἡδονὴ μοιράζονται τὸν τύπον τῆς συμφωνούσης κινήσεως, ἀλλ’ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ μηχανισμὸν εἰς ποιότητα παραμένει ἀνοικτή.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-02","CL_JP8E_22:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC8:D4","CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος καὶ τὸ σῶμα ἐμφανίζονται ὡς ὁμόλογα κυκλώματα, ἐν οἷς ἡ φορά, ἡ πλήρωσις, ἡ μεταβολὴ καὶ ἡ λύσις ἀναπαράγονται κατὰ κλίμακας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ ἐξωτερικὴν ὤθησιν εἰς γενεαλογίαν μεταβολῶν, ὅπου ἕκαστον πάθημα γίνεται ἀρχὴ ἑτέρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ζωή ἐστὶ μηχανισμὸς ἐξημερώσεως τῆς ἑτερότητος, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ὕλη γίνεται ἐσωτερικὴ ὁμοιότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ παθολογία ἐστὶν ἡ στιγμή, καθ’ ἣν ὁ μετασχηματισμὸς τῆς ἑτερότητος εἰς ὁμοιότητα ἀναστρέφεται καὶ ἡ ὕλη ἐπιβάλλεται τῷ σώματι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-05","text":"Ὁ χρόνος δὲν εἶναι ἁπλῶς μέτρον, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς παράγων ἐξασθενήσεως τῶν δεσμῶν καὶ μεταβολῆς τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς τὴν ὕλην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ γίνεται ἐξαρτημένη ἀπὸ σωματικὴν συνοχήν, ἀλλ’ οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς ταυτόσημος τῷ σώματι· ἡ σχέση παραμένει δεσμική καὶ μεταβατική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὰ ὀνόματα τῶν φαινομένων διὰ ἀκολουθιῶν γενέσεως, ἀναλογίας, μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ ἀναστροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-01","text":"Κένωσις → εἴσοδος συγγενοῦς ὕλης → ἀφομοίωσις → ἀναπλήρωσις → νέα κένωσις· ἡ ζωή συνέχεται ὡς ἀνακυκλουμένη ἀνάγκη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-02","text":"Ὁμοιότης → συμφωνία → ἁρμονικὸν πάθημα → διατήρησις τῆς φυσικῆς τάξεως· ἡ ἁρμονία γίνεται μηχανισμὸς καὶ κριτήριον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-03","text":"Ἀναπλήρωσις → αὔξησις → ἐξασθένησις δεσμῶν → γῆρας → λύσις· τὸ ἀρχικὸν κύκλωμα ζωῆς περιέχει ἤδη τὸ τέλος αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-04","text":"Φυσικὴ γένεσις → σύστασις → λειτουργία· ὅταν ἡ διαδοχὴ ἀναστραφῇ, ἡ σύστασις γίνεται νόσος καὶ ἡ λειτουργία φθορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-05","text":"Κοσμικὴ φορά → ἐσωτερικὴ φορά → τοπικὴ ἀφομοίωσις → ἀναπαραγωγὴ κοσμικῆς τάξεως· τὸ μικρὸν ἐπαναλαμβάνει τὸ μέγα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-06","text":"Ἀπόρριψις ἕλξεως καὶ κενοῦ → ἀλληλοσυμπλοκὴ κινήσεων → καθολικὴ κινητικὴ αἰτιότης· ἡ ἄρνησις γίνεται θετικὸς μηχανισμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-07","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος τοῦ συστήματος: πᾶσα ἀπόκλισις ὁρίζεται ἐκ τῆς ἀποστάσεως ἀπὸ λόγον, χώραν καὶ συγγένειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-08","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῆς κινήσεως δὲν σημαίνει ταὐτότητα· σημαίνει μετάβασιν φάσεως, ὅταν ἡ ἀφομοίωσις γίνῃ φθορά ἢ ἡ γένεσις ἀναστροφὴ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B01","text":"Φαινόμενον → ἀπόρριψις τῆς ἐπιφανείας αἰτίας → ἀναζήτησις κινήσεων καὶ σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B02","text":"Κίνησις → ὁμοιότης ἢ ἀνομοιότης → συμφωνία ἢ ἀναρμοστία → αἰσθητὸν πάθημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B03","text":"Κενότης → εἴσοδος συγγενοῦς ὕλης → διαίρεσις καὶ ἀφομοίωσις → ἀναπλήρωσις τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B04","text":"Πρῶτα στοιχεῖα → δεύτεραι συστάσεις → αἷμα καὶ ῥεύματα → δυναμικὴ σωματικὴ ταυτότης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B05","text":"Ἐπιρροὴ καὶ ἀπορροή → ἀναλογία → αὔξησις ἢ φθίσις → ἐξασθένησις δεσμῶν → γῆρας καὶ λύσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B06","text":"Ἀνάπαλιν γένεσις → ἀλλοιωμένη σύστασις → μετατόπισις καὶ ἀσυμφωνία → νόσος καὶ φθορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B07","text":"Ἡ συνολικὴ μηχανὴ παράγει τὰς ποιότητας καὶ τὰς παθήσεις ἐκ διαδοχῶν μετασχηματισμοῦ, ὄχι ἐκ ἀσύνδετων ἀρχῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B01","text":"Φαινόμενα ἕλξεως, ῥοῆς καὶ αἰσθήσεως → ἀπόρριψις ἕλξεως, κενοῦ καὶ ἁπλῆς ὤσεως → δίκτυον κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B02","text":"Δίκτυον κινήσεων → συγγένεια καὶ σύμμειξις → ἀναπνοή, τροφή, ἁρμονία καὶ σωματικὴ ἀναπλήρωσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B03","text":"Ἀναπλήρωσις → ἀφομοιωτικὴ διαίρεσις → αὔξησις ἢ φθίσις → χρονικὴ μεταβολὴ τῆς σωματικῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B04","text":"Χρονικὴ ἐξασθένησις → λύσις τριγωνικῶν καὶ ψυχικῶν δεσμῶν → διάκρισις φυσικοῦ θανάτου καὶ βιαίας φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B05","text":"Νόσος → στοιχειακὴ ἀνωμαλία → ἀναστροφὴ γενέσεως → ἐσωτερικὴ διάχυσις φθορᾶς → ἀναταξινόμησις τῆς παθολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B06","text":"Κινητικὴ αἰτιότης → σωματικὴ ἀφομοίωσις → δυναμικὴ ὑγίεια → γένεσις γήρως καὶ νόσου → φυσικὴ ἢ βίαιος λύσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-01","text":"Καταλύεται ἡ ὀξεῖα διαίρεσις φυσικοῦ, βιολογικοῦ καὶ αἰσθητικοῦ, ἐπειδὴ πάντα ὑπάγονται εἰς κοινὴν γενεσιουργὸν κινητικότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-02","text":"Τὸ σῶμα ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ῥευματικὴ καὶ γενεαλογικὴ ἑνότης, οὐχὶ ὡς κλειστὸν ἄθροισμα ὀργάνων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-03","text":"Ἡ διατροφή ἀναβαθμίζεται εἰς κοσμολογικὴν διαδικασίαν, ἐν ᾗ ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ὕλη μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ὑγίεια ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ῥυθμισμένη ἀναλογία ῥοῶν, ἐνῶ ἡ νόσος ὡς μετρήσιμον ἀπόκλισις χώρας, ποσότητος καὶ γενετικῆς διαδοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-05","text":"Ὁ θάνατος ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἑνιαίαν σημασίαν τοῦ τέλους καὶ γίνεται τυπολογία λύσεων, ἀνάλογος πρὸς τὴν αἰτίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-06","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγνωσις τῶν φαινομένων ἀπαιτεῖ ἀναζήτησιν γενετικῆς ἀκολουθίας, ὄχι ἀποδοχὴν τῆς ἐπιφανείας ὀνομάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-07","text":"Ἡ φθορὰ μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τελικὸν ἀποτέλεσμα εἰς ἐσωτερικὴν ἀναστροφὴν τῆς διαδικασίας ἣ συγκροτεῖ τὸ σώμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, φθόγγοι, ῥεύματα, ἀναπνοή, τροφή, αἷμα, αὔξησις, γῆρας καὶ νόσος ἐντάσσονται εἰς μίαν ἀκολουθίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ φαινόμενα συγκροτοῦνται ὑπὸ κινήσεων, ῥοῶν, συγγενείας, συστάσεων, δεσμῶν καὶ μεταβολῶν χώρας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐξήγησις μετακινεί τὸ βλέμμα ἀπὸ τὸ σύμπτωμα εἰς τὴν γενεσιουργὸν ἀκολουθίαν καὶ τὴν ἀναστροφὴν αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ὂν ὑφίσταται ὡς προσωρινὴ σύνθεσις ἐντὸς διαρκούς κινήσεως, ἣν ὁ χρόνος ἐξασθενεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ καὶ ἐπιτελεστικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἴδια ἡ ἀκολουθία τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενον: ἀναλύει, συνδέει, μετασχηματίζει καὶ ἀναστρέφει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία ἐξηγεῖται μηχανικῶς ὡς συμφωνία κινήσεων, ἀλλ’ ἡ μετάβασις ἀπὸ τὴν σύγκρασιν εἰς ἡδονὴν παραμένει ὑποκαθορισμένη.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ συνδέεται ἀναγκαίως μετὰ τῶν σωματικῶν δεσμῶν, ἀλλ’ οὐκ ἀναλύεται πλήρως εἰς τὴν σωματικὴν δομήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-03","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ λύσις χαρακτηρίζεται ἡδεῖα, ἐνῶ ἡ φυσικὴ διαδικασία ὁδηγεῖ ἀναγκαίως εἰς ἐξασθένησιν καὶ θάνατον· ἡ ἀξιολογικὴ γέφυρα μένει ἀσταθής.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ ἀναλογία ἀπαιτεῖ τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ χρονικὴ διάρκειά της παράγει ἀναπόφευκτον ἐξασθένησιν· ἡ σταθερότης ὑπάρχει μόνον ὡς παροδὴς ῥύθμισις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-01","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μεταλλάσσεται εἰς ῥοήν, ἡ ῥοὴ εἰς ἀφομοίωσιν, καὶ ἡ ἀφομοίωσις εἰς κριτήριον ταυτότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-02","text":"Ἡ ἁρμονία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ αἰσθητικὴν σχέσιν εἰς φυσικὸν λόγον ὑγείας καὶ παθολογίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-03","text":"Ἡ γένεσις μεταλλάσσεται εἰς ἀντίθετον αὐτῆς, ὅταν ἡ φυσικὴ ἀκολουθία ἀναστραφῇ καὶ γένηται μηχανισμὸς φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-04","text":"Ἡ ἀναφορὰ τῆς βιολογικῆς φορᾶς εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν φοράν μετατρέπει τὸ σῶμα ἀπὸ ἰδιαίτερον ὄν εἰς τοπικὴν ἐκδοχὴν καθολικοῦ μηχανισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-05","text":"Τὸ «κατὰ φύσιν» μετακινείται ἀπὸ περιγραφικὴν ἔννοιαν εἰς ἀξιολογικὸν κριτήριον, ὅταν ἡ φυσικὴ λύσις ὀνομάζηται ἡδεῖα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι μηχανὴ ἀλληλοπαθῶν ῥευμάτων, ἣ οὐ κινεῖται διὰ ἐξωτερικῆς ὤσεως ἀλλὰ διὰ ἐσωτερικῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ σῶμα εἶναι προσωρινὸς κόμβος, ὅπου ἡ ἑτερότης τρέφει τὴν ὁμοιότητα, ἡ δὲ ἐξασθένησις λύει τὸν κόμβον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ ζῶν ὑποκείμενος δὲν εἶναι κύριος ἔξωθεν τῶν ῥοῶν, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς τόπος ἀφομοιώσεως, ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι λύσις ἐν κινήσει· δὲν ἀφαιρεῖ ἁπλῶς τὴν ζωήν, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλει τὴν ἰσορροπίαν μεταξὺ ἐσωτερικῆς καὶ ἐξωτερικῆς δυνάμεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-05","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐλευθερία ἔγκειται οὐχὶ εἰς ἔξοδον ἐκ τῆς ὕλης, ἀλλ’ εἰς διατήρησιν λόγου, συγγενείας καὶ ἀναλογίας ἐντὸς τῆς ῥοῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B01","text":"Οἱ παρόντες ἀξονικοὶ νόμοι ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς κοινῆς λογικῆς ἀπὸ τὴν κίνησιν μέχρι τὴν νόσον καὶ τὴν λύσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορίζονται ἡ ἀκριβὴς μηχανικὴ μετάβασις εἰς ἡδονήν, ἡ φύσις τῶν ψυχικῶν δεσμῶν καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς σχέσις τῶν στοιχείων πρὸς ἕκαστον νόσημα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτικωτάτη ὅπου ἡ αἰτιότης ἀκολουθεῖ ῥοὰς, γενέσεις, ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀναστροφάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν διατήρησιν τῆς γενετικῆς ἀκολουθίας, ἐπειδὴ ἡ σημασία παράγεται ἐκ μεταβάσεων καὶ οὐχὶ ἐκ μεμονωμένων ἀξιωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀξιωματικὴ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὸν μηχανισμόν, ἀλλ’ οὐκ ἐξαντλεῖ τὰς ἐνδιάμεσους λεπτομερείας οὔτε τὴν ἄρρητον γέφυραν ἀπὸ φυσικῆς κινήσεως εἰς ποιοτικὴν ἐμπειρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T233005354141Z_bec0053d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 64–66","source_sha256":"d2923dc4bb7e4b6d2be150010f6dd5a1b9b002b8862cb932fe91ad53957f562b","sha256":"fc057582bfdfe7f07a3daea28184919751796bc172942cb1b715abe5dc20c4a7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:30:05.357105+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-01","text":"The system seeks the explanation of bodily affections not in external forces, but in movements, mixtures, and changes of positions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-02","text":"The apparent unity of natural, sensory, and biological phenomena is reconstructed as a network of mutually affecting movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-03","text":"Similarity and kinship transform otherness into harmony, assimilation, and bodily cohesion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-04","text":"Life is a balance of inflow and outflow, maintained only through continuous transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-05","text":"Time and repetition transform assimilative power into decline, old age, and dissolution of bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-06","text":"Disease appears as a reversal of natural generation, whenever proportion, place, or the succession of compositions is disturbed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-07","text":"The movement of the account is cumulative and recurrent; the cosmic, bodily, sensory, and pathological are read through the same generative line.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AS-08","text":"The conclusion does not lie in an immobile foundation, but in a principle that returns decay to the reversal of generation and the dissolution of bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Every affection must be sought from movements, changes of positions, and relations of composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Similarity produces concord, whereas dissimilarity produces discord, both in sensation and in body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The mixture and apprehension of swift and slow motions transform many movements into one affection or one new composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The body is not an aggregate of unconnected parts, but an active sequence of flows, bonds, and generations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Every kindred thing is borne toward its kindred, and nourishment can become body only through assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Life is held together through the proportion of inflow and outflow, which regulates replenishment, growth, and decline.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Bodily identity is produced through continuous replenishment and transformation, not through an unchanging core.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Time and struggles diminish the strength of internal bonds and turn the assimilative relation toward decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","text":"[Emergent] The body is constituted hierarchically, from the first elements into marrow, bones, flesh, sinews, and blood.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","text":"[Mutating] Generation and decay are not incompatible poles, but decay is generated from the reversal of generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Natural order is defined through kinship, ratio, place, proportion, and generative succession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Death is dissolution of bonds, but dissolution according to nature is distinguished from violent and unnatural interruption.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-01","text":"Movement recurs from natural phenomena to respiration, nourishment, growth, and disease, but changes its field of application.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-02","text":"Mixture initially signifies the production of sensible qualities, but afterward becomes a mechanism of assimilation and bodily constitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-03","text":"Harmony shifts from concord of tones to embodied proportion, which can be called health or pleasure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-04","text":"Kinship migrates from cosmic motion to a process of nutritional assimilation and preservation of identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-05","text":"Flow ceases to signify movement alone and becomes the measure of life, health, growth, and decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-06","text":"Generation acquires an inverse form: when natural succession is dissolved, the same mechanism becomes a bearer of dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-07","text":"External cause yields to internal disorder, inability to assimilate, and reversal of compositions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-08","text":"Triangular bonds remain a local mechanism, but are absorbed into a more general principle of temporal weakening and dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-09","text":"Death ceases to mean a single end and becomes a difference of modes of dissolution, natural or violent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RMD-10","text":"Attraction and the void perform a negative role, but later disappear as independent explanatory mechanisms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-01","text":"The precise function of electrons, Heraclean stones, triangles, and biles remains local; these are specifications, not the universal core.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-02","text":"Movement, kinship, proportion, assimilation, and generative succession are scaled up to the present level.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-03","text":"The bridge between the units becomes the idea that bodily affection, health, and disease are different phases of the same kinetic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-04","text":"The catalyst of transition is the transfer of cosmic motion into the body's internal distribution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-05","text":"The principle surpassing the local is that nourishment becomes body only through transformation and assimilation, not through simple addition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-06","text":"Simple external attraction is replaced by a network of internal relations, flows, and changes of place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:CGD-07","text":"The present level produces an architecture that no unit alone can express: the sequence movement → assimilation → constitution → decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-01","text":"Attraction as an independent cause is rejected, because phenomena are generated from connected movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-02","text":"The void as an external mechanism is rejected, because movement is explained through continuous interweaving.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-03","text":"Inert matter, awaiting external action, is excluded, because all matter is subject to kinship, division, and motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-04","text":"Bodily identity as an immobile core is excluded, because existence is held together through continuous replenishments.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-05","text":"Disease as an inexplicable accident is excluded, because pathology constitutes a deviation from natural generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-06","text":"The distinction between natural and sensory is weakened when both are produced from movements and relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:GNX-07","text":"Death as one undifferentiated event is excluded, because the manner of dissolution determines its affection and value.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-01","text":"The hypothesis that movement is imposed from without must be false, because causality is constituted in the relation of things moved.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-02","text":"The hypothesis that an affection is a simple transfer of a thing must be false, because it comes to be from the relation of movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-03","text":"The hypothesis that the body is maintained by simple addition must be false, because nourishment must be transformed into likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-04","text":"The hypothesis that health is static immobility must be false, because its preservation requires flow and ratio.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-05","text":"The hypothesis that generation and decay are unconnected must be false, because the latter arises from the reversal of the former.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:DBN-06","text":"The hypothesis that soul and body are absolutely separated must be false, because the dissolution of bodily bonds leaves the psychic bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-01","text":"There is no inert, unchanging, and indifferent substrate lying beneath all changes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-02","text":"A world divided into unconnected natural, biological, and sensory fields is excluded, because the same kinetic line runs through all things.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-03","text":"There is no equilibrium without movement; duration always conceals replenishment, weakening, or dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSA-04","text":"The complete reduction of the qualitative to mechanical movement remains impossible, because the transition toward pleasure and delight preserves an ineffable gap.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-01","text":"Bodily physiology constitutes a miniature of cosmic movement, because internal motion imitates universal motion.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-01","CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_58:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-02","text":"The assimilation of nourishment and the mixture of elements are one common form of transforming the dissimilar into likeness.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-03","CL_JP8E_22:GA-05","CH_JP8E_SEC8:A4","CH_JP8E_S_58:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-03","text":"Health is not the preservation of an unchanging form, but the successful regulation of transformations, which preserves identity through change.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-06","CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_58:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-04","text":"Old age is the temporal transition from active assimilation to the predominance of external division.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-07","CL_JP8E_22:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_58:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-05","text":"Disease is a pathological reversal of assimilation: what ought to constitute becomes a bearer of dissolution.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-06","text":"The difference between natural death and disease follows the difference between orderly dissolution and reversed generation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-10","CL_JP8E_22:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_58:D8","CH_JP8E_S_59:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-07","text":"The unity of the body is produced as a genealogical chain, in which the disturbance of one level extends to others.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-04","CL_JP8E_22:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_59:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:XD-08","text":"Harmony, health, and pleasure share the type of concordant movement, but the transition from mechanism to quality remains open.","refs":["CL_JP8E_22:GA-02","CL_JP8E_22:GA-11","CH_JP8E_SEC8:D4","CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-01","text":"The cosmos and the body appear as homologous circuits, in which motion, filling, change, and dissolution are reproduced across scales.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-02","text":"Causality is transformed from external impulse into a genealogy of changes, where each affection becomes the principle of another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-03","text":"Life is a mechanism for taming otherness, because external matter becomes internal likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_58:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-04","text":"Pathology is the moment at which the transformation of otherness into likeness is reversed and matter imposes itself upon the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-05","text":"Time is not merely a measure, but an active factor in the weakening of bonds and the alteration of the relation to matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_58:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-06","text":"The soul becomes dependent on bodily cohesion, but is not simply identical with the body; the relation remains one of bonds and transition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_58:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:BSD-07","text":"Explanation replaces the names of phenomena with sequences of generation, proportion, transformation, and reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-01","text":"Emptying → entry of kindred matter → assimilation → replenishment → new emptying; life is held together as a recurrent necessity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-02","text":"Similarity → concord → harmonious affection → preservation of natural order; harmony becomes mechanism and criterion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-03","text":"Replenishment → growth → weakening of bonds → old age → dissolution; the initial circuit of life already contains its end.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-04","text":"Natural generation → composition → function; when the succession is reversed, composition becomes disease and function decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-05","text":"Cosmic motion → internal motion → local assimilation → reproduction of cosmic order; the small repeats the great.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-06","text":"Rejection of attraction and void → interweaving of movements → universal kinetic causality; negation becomes a positive mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-07","text":"Natural order functions as the system's attractive pole: every deviation is defined by its distance from ratio, place, and kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:RLE-08","text":"The repetition of movement does not signify identity; it signifies a phase-transition, when assimilation becomes decay or generation reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B01","text":"Phenomenon → rejection of the surface cause → search for movements and relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B02","text":"Movement → similarity or dissimilarity → concord or discord → sensible affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B03","text":"Emptiness → entry of kindred matter → division and assimilation → replenishment of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B04","text":"First elements → secondary compositions → blood and flows → dynamic bodily identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B05","text":"Inflow and outflow → proportion → growth or decline → weakening of bonds → old age and dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B06","text":"Reverse generation → altered composition → displacement and discord → disease and decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FGS-B07","text":"The overall mechanism produces qualities and affections from sequences of transformation, not from unconnected principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B01","text":"Phenomena of attraction, flow, and sensation → rejection of attraction, void, and simple impulse → network of movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B02","text":"Network of movements → kinship and mixture → respiration, nourishment, harmony, and bodily replenishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B03","text":"Replenishment → assimilative division → growth or decline → temporal change of bodily power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B04","text":"Temporal weakening → dissolution of triangular and psychic bonds → distinction between natural death and violent decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B05","text":"Disease → elemental irregularity → reversal of generation → internal diffusion of decay → reclassification of pathology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:AFM-B06","text":"Kinetic causality → bodily assimilation → dynamic health → generation of old age and disease → natural or violent dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-01","text":"The sharp division of natural, biological, and sensory is dissolved, because all are subject to a common generative mobility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-02","text":"The body is reclassified as a flowing and genealogical unity, not as a closed aggregate of organs.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-03","text":"Nutrition is elevated into a cosmological process, in which external matter is transformed into internal likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-04","text":"Health appears as a regulated proportion of flows, while disease appears as a measurable deviation of place, quantity, and generative succession.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-05","text":"Death is separated from the unified meaning of an end and becomes a typology of dissolutions, corresponding to cause.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-06","text":"The reading of phenomena requires the search for a generative sequence, not acceptance of the surface of names.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MME-07","text":"Decay is shifted from a final result to an internal reversal of the process that constitutes the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, tones, flows, respiration, nourishment, blood, growth, old age, and disease are integrated into one sequence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, phenomena are constituted by movements, flows, kinship, compositions, bonds, and changes of place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, explanation shifts attention from symptom to generative sequence and its reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, being exists as a temporary composition within enduring movement, which time weakens.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological and performative level, the sequence of the account itself imitates the object: it analyzes, connects, transforms, and reverses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-01","text":"Harmony is explained mechanically as concord of movements, but the transition from mixture to pleasure remains underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-02","text":"The soul is necessarily connected with bodily bonds, but is not fully reduced to bodily structure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-03","text":"Natural dissolution is characterized as pleasant, while the natural process necessarily leads to weakening and death; the evaluative bridge remains unstable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:FL-04","text":"Cosmic proportion requires order, but its temporal duration produces inevitable weakening; stability exists only as transitory regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-01","text":"Movement mutates into flow, flow into assimilation, and assimilation into a criterion of identity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-02","text":"Harmony mutates from a sensory relation into a natural ratio of health and pathology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-03","text":"Generation mutates into its opposite when the natural sequence is reversed and becomes a mechanism of decay.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-04","text":"The reference of biological motion to cosmic motion transforms the body from a particular being into a local version of a universal mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MP-05","text":"“According to nature” shifts from a descriptive concept to an evaluative criterion when natural dissolution is called pleasant.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-01","text":"The cosmos is a machine of mutually affecting flows, moved not by external impulse but by internal relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-02","text":"The body is a temporary node, where otherness nourishes likeness, while weakening dissolves the node.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-03","text":"The living subject is not a master outside the flows, but an active locus of assimilation, proportion, and resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-04","text":"Time is dissolution in motion; it does not merely remove life, but alters the balance between internal and external power.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:HSI-05","text":"Possible freedom lies not in an exit from matter, but in maintaining ratio, kinship, and proportion within the flow.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B01","text":"The present axial laws suffice for reconstructing the common logic from movement as far as disease and dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B02","text":"The precise mechanical transition to pleasure, the nature of psychic bonds, and the precise relation of the elements to each disease are underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is most coherent where causality follows flows, generations, proportions, and reversals.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_59:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B04","text":"Reconstruction depends on preserving the generative sequence, because meaning is produced from transitions and not from isolated axioms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_58:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_22:MRT-B05","text":"Axiomatic compression preserves the mechanism, but does not exhaust the intermediate details or the ineffable bridge from natural movement to qualitative experience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC8:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_22@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_22:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 64–66"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 64–66","context":"Section 80 · Section 81 · Section 82","original_title":"Chapters 64–66","original_context":"Section 80 · Section 81 · Section 82"},"original_title":"Chapters 64–66","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 67–69","order":23,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_60","CH_JP8E_S_61","CH_JP8E_S_62"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_23@R001","sha256":"f83425d4c4a085ae0ad581d00c94c3c89a2213b70d7eccf84a7a2ae0083416f3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B01","text":"Τὸ κεντρικὸν πρόβλημα εἶναι πῶς ἡ φυσικὴ ῥύθμισις τῶν ὑγρῶν, τῶν ἱστῶν καὶ τῶν διεξόδων μετατρέπεται εἰς παθολογικὴν ἀναστροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις μετατοπίζει τὴν νόσον ἀπὸ τὸ μεμονωμένον σύμπτωμα εἰς τὰς ἀλληλεπιδράσεις ῥοῆς, μίξεως, θρέψεως, ἀναπνοῆς καὶ δεσμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B03","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ βλάβη γίνεται ἀλυσὶς μεταδόσεως, ἣ διὰ τῶν ἱστῶν καὶ τοῦ αἵματος ἐπεκτείνεται εἰς τὸ σύνολον τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B04","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις δὲν σημαίνει ἀκινησίαν, ἀλλὰ ρυθμισμένην κυκλοφορίαν ἣ διατηρεῖ μέτρον μεταξὺ λεπτότητος, πάχους, θερμότητος καὶ ψύξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B05","text":"Ἡ παθολογία ἀποδεικνύεται ὡς ἀποτυχία μετασχηματισμοῦ, ὅταν ἡ ῥοὴ γίνεται κατάκλεισις, ἡ θερμότης πήξις, καὶ ἡ τροφὴ διάλυσις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B06","text":"Ἡ βαρύτης τῆς νόσου κλιμακοῦται ἀπὸ τὴν ἐπιφάνειαν πρὸς τοὺς βαθυτέρους μηχανισμούς, ἕως ὅτου ἡ σωματικὴ τάξις ἀναστραφῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἡ διατάραξις παράγει νέαν διατάραξιν, ἡ δὲ κυκλοφορία τῆς νοσηρᾶς ὕλης ἐνισχύει τὴν ἀρχικὴν βλάβην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις δὲν εἶναι ἁπλῶς ἕν τελικὸν σύμπτωμα, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἀναστροφὴ τῆς συνολικῆς τάξεως τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ σῶμα ὑφίσταται ὡς δίκτυον ἀλληλοεξαρτωμένων ῥοῶν, ἱστῶν, δεσμῶν καὶ διεξόδων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φυσικὴ ὑγεία ἀπαιτεῖ ἀκεραιότητα συνδέσμων, ὀρθὴν θρέψιν, ἀναπνοήν, κυκλοφορίαν καὶ μέτρον πυκνότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὕλη δὲν διατηρεῖ σταθερὰν ταυτότητα, ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλεται κατὰ τόπον, χρόνον, θερμότητα, μίξιν καὶ κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις εἶναι ῥυθμισμένη ῥοή, οὐχὶ ἀκινησία ἢ ἁπλὴ παρουσία ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ νόσος γεννᾶται ὅταν ἀποτύχῃ ὁ μετασχηματισμός, ὥστε ἡ τροφή, ἡ ἀναπνοή, ἡ ῥοὴ ἢ ἡ θερμότης νὰ στραφῶσιν ἐναντίον τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ τοπικὴ παθολογία κλιμακοῦται διὰ μεταδόσεως ἀπὸ ἱστὸν εἰς ἱστόν, ἀπὸ ὀστοῦν εἰς σάρκα, καὶ ἀπὸ σάρκα εἰς αἷμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ τροφή καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ εἶναι διτταὶ δίοδοι, αἵτινες δύνανται νὰ συντηρῶσι τὸ σώμα ἢ νὰ διαλύωσι τοὺς δεσμούς του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ βαρύτης τῆς νόσου ἐξαρτᾶται μᾶλλον ἀπὸ τὸ βάθος καὶ τὴν ἀλληλεξάρτησιν τοῦ προσβεβλημένου μηχανισμοῦ ἢ ἀπὸ τὸ ἐπιφανὲς μέγεθος τῆς βλάβης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φυσικῆς τάξεως καὶ παρὰ φύσιν ἀναστροφῆς ὀργανώνει ὅλην τὴν παθολογικὴν γενεσιουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-10","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ὀνοματολογία ὀφείλει νὰ ἀκολουθῇ τὴν γένεσιν, τὴν ὁδόν, τὴν ποιότητα καὶ τὴν ἕξιν τῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ πήξις, ἡ κατάκλεισις καὶ ἡ στέρησις διεξόδων δύνανται νὰ μετατρέψωσι τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν διαφοράν εἰς συστημικὴν ἀναστροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] Τὸ νοσοῦν σῶμα γίνεται φορεὺς τῆς ἰδίας αὐτοῦ διαφθορᾶς, ἐπειδὴ ἡ νοσηρὰ ὕλη ἀνακυκλοῦται καὶ πολλαπλασιάζει τὰς βλάβας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ «φθορά» ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ἀρχικῶς ὡς μεταβολὴ χρώματος καὶ συστάσεως, ἔπειτα δὲ μεταλλάσσεται εἰς διάλυσιν δεσμῶν, σῆψιν καὶ συστημικὴν ἀναστροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ «ῥοή» μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν φυσικὴν κυκλοφορίαν τῶν χυμῶν εἰς τὴν ἄτακτον μετάδοσιν νοσηρᾶς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ «ἀναπνοή» μεταβάλλει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ μηχανισμὸν ψύξεως καὶ διανομῆς γίνεται ἀπόφραξις, ἔλλειψις, πλεονασμὸς καὶ σήψις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ «τροφή» ἀποσπᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν τροφοδοτικὴν λειτουργίαν καὶ μετατίθεται εἰς διαβρωτικὸν παράγοντα διαλύσεως τῶν δεσμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ «χολή» ἀπὸ γένος παθολογικῶν σωμάτων γίνεται μηχανισμὸς θερμότητος, πήξεως, κατασβέσεως καὶ τρόμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ «τάξις» διατηρεῖται ὡς κοινὸς ἄξων, ἀλλὰ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ περιόδους αἵματος εἰς ἶνας, δεσμούς, διεξόδους καὶ πυκνότητας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις μεταξὺ ἐπιφανείας καὶ βάθους ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς ἱεραρχίαν κλιμακουμένην ἀπὸ σάρκα διὰ ὀστοῦ καὶ μυελοῦ πρὸς θάνατον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς διάκρισις χολῆς, ἰχώρος καὶ φλέγματος μένει τοπικὴ ταξινομία, ἐπειδὴ ἡ cluster-κλίμακα διατηρεῖ κυρίως τὸν κοινὸν μηχανισμὸν μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀκεραιότης σαρκὸς καὶ ὀστέων, ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ θρέψις κλιμακοῦνται εἰς γενικὴν θεωρίαν ἀμοιβαίας ἐξαρτήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ κίνησις φλέγματος καὶ χολῆς γεφυροῖ τὴν ταξινόμησιν τῶν χυμῶν μετὰ τῆς ἀνατομικῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ φυσιολογικὴ ἰδέα τῆς ἀποφορτίσεως γίνεται current-level μηχανισμὸς διακρίσεως μεταξὺ ἀναστρέψιμου καὶ κλιμακουμένης νόσου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ ἀπόφραξις τοῦ πνεύμονος καταλύει τὴν ἀπομόνωσιν τῶν ὀργάνων καὶ γίνεται πρότυπον γενικῆς συστημικῆς κλιμακώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ὀνοματολογία τῶν νοσημάτων παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὴ περιγραφή καὶ γίνεται στρατηγικὸς χάρτης ὁδῶν, ἕξεων καὶ μετασχηματισμῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται τὸ σῶμα ὡς στατικὸν ἄθροισμα αὐτοτελῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ νόσος ὡς ἀκίνητος τοπικὴ βλάβη, ἥτις δύναται νὰ παραμείνῃ ἀνεξάρτητος ἀπὸ τὰ λοιπὰ συστήματα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὕλη ὡς σταθερὰ οὐσία ἄνευ ἐπιρροῆς θερμότητος, τόπου, μίξεως καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἐξήγησις τῆς νόσου διὰ μόνου τοῦ ὀνόματος ἢ τοῦ τελικοῦ συμπτώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ πλήρης διάκρισις ὕλης, πνεύματος, αἵματος, τροφῆς καὶ ἀναπνοῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι ἡ νόσος ἔχει γραμμικὴν καὶ ἀναστρέψιμον μόνον πορείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-01","text":"Ἡ νόσος οὐ δύναται νὰ νοηθῇ ὡς ἐξωτερικὴ ἐπιβολή, ἐπειδὴ παράγεται ἐκ τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς μεταβολῆς τῶν συστατικῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπομόνωσις τοῦ αἰτίου ἀπὸ τὴν ὁδὸν καὶ τὴν κατάστασιν τῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ὑγεία ὡς ἅπαξ κεκτημένη κατάστασις, ἐπειδὴ ἀπαιτεῖ συνεχή ρύθμισιν πυκνότητος, θερμότητος καὶ κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἀναγωγὴ τῶν συμπτωμάτων εἰς μίαν μόνην ἀρχήν, ἐπειδὴ κοινὸς μηχανισμὸς ἐκδηλοῦται διὰ πολλῶν ὁδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος ἐξίσωσις ἐπιφανειακῆς σαρκικῆς βλάβης καὶ μυελικῆς νόσου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-01","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ὕλη παραμένει ἀκίνητος, ἁπλῆ καὶ ἀνεπηρέαστος ὑπὸ τῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται ἡ νόσος ὡς ἁπλὸν συμβεβηκός, διότι ἡ παθολογία ἀναπτύσσει ἰδίαν κυκλοφορίαν καὶ παραγωγὴν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία ἀκεραίου συνδέσμου, καθαρᾶς διεξόδου καὶ ὀρθῆς ἀνακυκλώσεως ἀποτελεῖ τὴν κρυφὴν ἀρνητικὴν ὑπόθεσιν τοῦ συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ πλήρης ἰατρικὴ ἀσφάλεια, ἐπειδὴ ὁ αὐτὸς μηχανισμὸς δύναται ἄλλοτε νὰ θεραπεύῃ καὶ ἄλλοτε νὰ νοσοποιῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-01","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῆς χυμικῆς μεταβολῆς καὶ ἡ θεωρία τῆς ἀνατομικῆς μεταδόσεως συγκλίνουσιν εἰς ἕνα μοντέλον, ὅπου ἡ ποιότης τῆς ὕλης καθορίζει τὴν ὁδὸν τῆς κλιμακώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀπόφραξις ἐνώνει τὰ τρία πεδία τῆς παθολογίας: διακόπτει τὴν ἀναπνοήν, μεταβάλλει τὴν ῥοὴν καὶ ἐγκλείει τὴν νοσηρὰν ὕλην.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-03","text":"Ἡ τροφή καὶ ἡ ἀναπνοὴ ἀποκαλύπτονται ὡς συμμετρικοὶ μετασχηματιστικοὶ δίαυλοι, ὧν ἡ διατάραξις μετατρέπει τὴν εἴσοδον εἰς διάλυσιν ἢ κατάκλεισιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-07","CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-04","text":"Ἡ μετάδοσις τῆς νόσου δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ μεταφορά, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸς ἀναπαραγωγή, ἐπειδὴ ἡ διεφθαρμένη ὕλη πολλαπλασιάζει τὰς ἀρχικὰς βλάβας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","CL_JP8E_23:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ ἀποφόρτισις καὶ ἡ παθολογικὴ κατάκλεισις ἀποτελοῦσιν ἀντιθέτους τροπὰς τοῦ αὐτοῦ μηχανισμοῦ ῥοῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-04","CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_62:D3","CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-06","text":"Ἡ ἰατρικὴ ταξινόμησις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ διατηρῇ ἅμα κοινὸν γένος καὶ ἐσωτερικὴν ἑτερογένειαν, ἐπειδὴ ὁ αὐτὸς μηχανισμὸς ἐκδηλοῦται διὰ διαφόρων ὁδῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-10","CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ ἀιτιότης γίνεται θεωρία μετασχηματισμῶν, ὅπου ἡ νόσος ὁρίζεται ὄχι ἀπὸ τὴν ὕλην μόνην, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ τὸν τρόπον ὃν ἡ ὕλη ἐνεργεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ τοπικὴ καὶ ἡ συστημικὴ παθολογία δὲν εἶναι δύο γένη, ἀλλὰ δύο φάσεις μιᾶς ἀλυσίδος μεταμορφώσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομία, ἡ χυμολογία καὶ ἡ φυσιολογία συμπλέκονται εἰς ἕνα κοινὸν διαγνωστικὸν πεδίον, ὅπου ῥοή, ὄγκος, τόπος καὶ βάθος συμπαράγουσι τὸ σύμπτωμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ παθολογία παράγει χρονικότητα ἀναδρομικὴν καὶ σπειροειδῆ: τὸ ἀποτέλεσμα ἐπιστρέφει ὡς αἴτιον καὶ ἐπιτείνει τὴν προηγουμένην βλάβην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημονικὴ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν πολλῶν νοσημάτων εἰς ὀλίγους μηχανισμοὺς δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν διαφοράν, ἀλλὰ τὴν ἐπανατοποθετεῖ ὡς διαφοράν ὁδοῦ, τόπου καὶ ἕξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-01","text":"Ἀκεραιότης δεσμῶν → ὀρθὴ θρέψις → διατήρησις ἱστῶν· διάλυσις δεσμῶν → διεφθαρμένη ὕλη → ἐπανείσοδος εἰς τὸ αἷμα → πολλαπλασιασμὸς βλάβης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-02","text":"Ἔξοδος χυμοῦ → ἀποφόρτισις· κατάκλεισις → θερμότης καὶ καῦσις· πήξις → ψῦξις καὶ τρόμος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-03","text":"Ἀπόφραξις πνεύμονος → ἀσύμμετρος κατανομὴ πνεύματος → ἐγκλεισμὸς → νευρικὴ διάτασις → σπασμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-04","text":"Ὁ ὄγκος καὶ ἡ ποιότης ἀλληλοτροφοδοτοῦνται: ἡ παρὰ φύσιν ποσότης ἐπιτείνει τὴν ἀλλοίωσιν, ἡ δὲ ἀλλοίωσις μεταβάλλει τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ ὄγκου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἐπιφάνεια λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἔνδειξις, τὸ βάθος ὡς μηχανισμός, καὶ ἡ συστημικὴ ἀναστροφὴ ὡς τελικὸς ἀτρακτοειδὴς ἕλκων τῆς ἐξηγήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ κεντρικὸς ἑλκτικὸς πόλος εἶναι ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις, ἣ ἐπαναπροσδιορίζεται διὰ τῆς ἀπουσίας, τῆς ἀποφράξεως καὶ τῆς ἀναστροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B01","text":"Φυσικὴ τροφή καὶ ἀναπνοή → ἀκεραιότης δεσμῶν καὶ ἱστῶν → ρυθμισμένη κυκλοφορία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B02","text":"Κακὴ δίαιτα ἢ ἀπόφραξις → μεταβολὴ θρεπτικῆς ὕλης ἢ πνεύματος → διάλυσις, κατάκλεισις καὶ στέρησις διεξόδων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B03","text":"Ἀλλοίωσις ὕλης → ἀπώλεια φυσικῆς ῥοῆς → πήξις, σῆψις, καῦσις ἢ ἄτακτος διασπορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B04","text":"Τοπικὴ βλάβη → μετάδοσις διὰ ἱστῶν καὶ αἵματος → πολλαπλασιασμὸς νοσημάτων → συστημικὴ ἀναστροφή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B05","text":"Ποιότης, τόπος, ῥοή, θερμότης καὶ πυκνότης → ἀναταξινόμησις τῶν νοσημάτων κατὰ μηχανισμόν, οὐ κατὰ τελικὸν ὄνομα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B06","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ ἀναστροφὴ τῆς τάξεως → ἐπιστροφὴ τῆς νοσηρᾶς ὕλης → βάθυνσις → πόνος, σπασμός, θάνατος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B09","text":"Φυσικὴ ῥοὴ → ποιοτικὴ ἀλλοίωσις → ἀπώλεια μέτρου → ἀπόφραξις ἢ διασπορά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B10","text":"Ἀπώλεια δεσμοῦ, θρέψεως ἢ ἀναπνοῆς → τοπικὴ βλάβη → ἐπανείσοδος νοσηρᾶς ὕλης εἰς τὸ αἷμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B11","text":"Ἐπανείσοδος → κυκλοφοριακὴ μετάδοσις → βάθυνσις εἰς ὀστοῦν καὶ μυελόν → μείζων κίνδυνος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B12","text":"Πήξις, ψῦξις, σῆψις καὶ νευρικὴ διάτασις → πόνος καὶ σπασμός → ἀναστροφὴ τῆς συνολικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B13","text":"Ἡ ἀναστροφὴ ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὸ σύστημα ὡς νέα αἰτία, ὥστε ἡ νόσος νὰ παράγῃ τὴν ἑαυτῆς κλιμάκωσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-01","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναχαρτογραφεῖται ἀπὸ ἐπιφανειακὸν συμβεβηκὸς εἰς δυναμικὴν μετάδοσιν διὰ τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάγνωσις μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ τὸ ὄνομα τοῦ συμπτώματος εἰς τὴν ὁδὸν, τὸν τόπον καὶ τὴν κατάστασιν τῆς ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνατομικὴ ἀπόστασις ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ λειτουργικῆς συνδεσιμότητος: σάρξ, ὀστοῦν, μυελός, πνεῦμα καὶ αἷμα ἀποτελοῦσιν ἕν πεδίον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-04","text":"Ἡ χρωματικὴ καὶ συμπτωματικὴ ποικιλία ἀναγνωρίζεται ὡς ἐπιφάνεια ὀλίγων μηχανισμῶν ῥοῆς, μίξεως, καύσεως καὶ πήξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-05","text":"Ἡ θεραπευτικὴ σκέψις ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀναζητῇ τὴν ἀπόφραξιν, τὴν ἕξιν καὶ τὸ βάθος, οὐχὶ μόνον τὸ ἐμφανὲς πάθος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-06","text":"Ἡ «ἱερότης» τοῦ νοσήματος ἀνασυντάσσεται ἐντὸς φυσικῆς αἰτιολογίας, χωρὶς νὰ ἀναιρεῖται ἡ ἐξαιρετικὴ δύναμις τῆς διαδικασίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπιφανειακῶς ἐμφανίζονται χρώματα, πυρετοί, καταρροαί, φλεγμοναί, σῆψις, τρόμος καὶ σπασμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B02","text":"Δομικῶς, τὰ συμπτώματα παράγονται ἐκ δεσμῶν, ἱστῶν, ἀγγείων, νεύρων, ἰνῶν, διεξόδων καὶ ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B03","text":"Μεταστρατηγικῶς, ἡ ἐξήγησις μεταφέρει τὴν ἀναζήτησιν ἀπὸ τὸ σύμπτωμα εἰς τὴν ἀλυσίδα τῆς μεταδόσεως καὶ τοῦ μετασχηματισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B04","text":"Ὀντολογικῶς καὶ χρονικῶς, τὸ σῶμα εἶναι κυκλοφοροῦσα τάξις, ἧς ἡ διατάραξις ἐπεκτείνεται, ἐπιστρέφει καὶ ἀναστρέφει τὴν φυσικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B05","text":"Μεθοδολογικῶς, ἡ ἴδια ἡ θεωρία ἐπιτελεῖ τὴν μετακίνησιν ἀπὸ τὰ ὀνόματα εἰς τὰς ὁδούς, τὰς σχέσεις καὶ τὰς ἀναστροφάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῶν πολλῶν νοσημάτων εἰς ὀλίγους μηχανισμοὺς ἀπειλεῖ νὰ ἐξαλείψῃ τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἑτερογένειαν, ἣν ὅμως ἡ ταξινόμησις ἀναγκαίως διατηρεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἐξήγησις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν μετάβασιν ἀπὸ χρώματος ἢ συμπτώματος εἰς σύστασιν καὶ αἰτίαν, ἥτις δὲν εἶναι πάντοτε ἀποδεικτή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις ῥοῆς καὶ πήξεως δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ δυαδικότης, ἐπειδὴ ἡ πήξις δύναται νὰ εἶναι καὶ φυσικὴ ρύθμισις καὶ παθολογικὴ κατάκλεισις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-04","text":"Ἡ θεωρία τῆς ἀναπνοῆς ἀπαιτεῖ ἄμα διανομήν, ψύξιν, ἀποφυγὴν σήψεως καὶ ἐξήγησιν πόνου, ὥστε μία λειτουργία νὰ φέρῃ πολλὰς ἀξίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-01","text":"Ἡ «τάξις» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ φυσικὸν περιοδικὸν ρυθμὸν εἰς ἀνατομικὴν ἀκεραιότητα, ἔπειτα εἰς ἰνώδη ρύθμισιν καὶ τέλος εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἀποκλεισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-02","text":"Ἡ «ἀναπνοή» μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ εἴσοδον πνεύματος εἰς διανομήν, ψύξιν, ἀποτροπὴν σήψεως καὶ, ὅταν ἀποφραχθῇ, εἰς πηγήν συστημικῆς φθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-03","text":"Ἡ «νόσος» μετακινείται ἀπὸ ποιότητα σώματος εἰς ἀποτυχία μετασχηματισμοῦ καὶ ἔπειτα εἰς αὐτοτροφοδοτούμενον κύκλον διαφθορᾶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα φαντάζεται τὸ σῶμα ὡς ἕνα κυκλοφοριακὸν δίκτυον, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ὕλη, τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ οἱ δεσμοὶ ἀναδιανέμονται συνεχῶς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἐντὸς τούτου τοῦ δικτύου δὲν εἶναι κυρίαρχος ὑποκείμενος, ἀλλὰ τόπος διελεύσεως, ρυθμίσεως ἢ ἐγκλεισμοῦ ὕλης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τοῦ σώματος εἶναι περιοδικὸς καὶ ἀναδραστικός: ἡ φυσικὴ περίοδος δύναται νὰ διακοπῇ, νὰ ἀναστραφῇ καὶ νὰ ἐπιστρέψῃ ὡς νόσος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἐπέμβασις συνίσταται ὄχι εἰς ἀντιμετώπισιν ἑνὸς συμπτώματος, ἀλλὰ εἰς ἀποκατάστασιν ῥοῆς, διεξόδου, μέτρου καὶ συνδέσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ φυσικὴν ῥύθμισιν εἰς τοπικὴν διατάραξιν, μετάδοσιν, βάθυνσιν καὶ συστημικὴν ἀναστροφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν ἑνότητα τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ χωρὶς νὰ ἐξαλείφῃ τὴν διαφορὰν χυμῶν, ἱστῶν, ὁδῶν καὶ βάθους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἱεράρχησις τῶν μίξεων καὶ ἡ ἐνιαία σχέσις φλέγματος, χολῆς, ἰνῶν καὶ μυελοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτικὴ ἐπειδὴ συνδέει προέλευσιν, κίνησιν, ποσότητα, ποιότητα, βάθος καὶ παθολογικὴν ἐνέργειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἐλάχιστη ἀνασύστασις διασώζει τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναδρομὴν ἐπιστροφὴν τῆς νοσηρᾶς ὕλης καὶ ἀπὸ τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ ῥοῆς καὶ πήξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B06","text":"Ἀνθεκτικὸν στοιχεῖον εἰς ἀξιωματικὴν συμπίεσιν παραμένει ἡ ἀμφισημία τῶν μηχανισμῶν, οἵτινες δύνανται καὶ νὰ συντηρῶσι καὶ νὰ νοσοποιοῦσι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T233037693479Z_95a668be","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 67–69","source_sha256":"f83425d4c4a085ae0ad581d00c94c3c89a2213b70d7eccf84a7a2ae0083416f3","sha256":"46e88405a3d33bd787a305cad5f4e87a66ad4d76f4b4cfff02e7dfad334767ef","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:30:37.694518+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B01","text":"The central problem is how the natural regulation of fluids, tissues, and outlets is transformed into pathological reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B02","text":"The explanation shifts disease from the isolated symptom to the interactions of flow, mixture, nourishment, respiration, and bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B03","text":"Local damage becomes a chain of transmission, which extends through the tissues and blood to the whole body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B04","text":"Natural order does not mean immobility, but regulated circulation that maintains a mean between tenuity, thickness, heat, and cooling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B05","text":"Pathology is demonstrated as a failure of transformation, when flow becomes enclosure, heat coagulation, and nourishment dissolution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B06","text":"The gravity of disease escalates from the surface toward deeper mechanisms, until bodily order is reversed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B07","text":"The movement of the system is spiral: disturbance produces new disturbance, and the circulation of diseased matter reinforces the initial damage.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B08","text":"The outcome is not merely one final symptom, but the reversal of the body's overall order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The body exists as a network of interdependent flows, tissues, bonds, and outlets.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Natural health requires integrity of connections, proper nourishment, respiration, circulation, and a mean of density.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Matter does not retain a fixed identity, but changes according to place, time, heat, mixture, and movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Natural order is regulated flow, not immobility or the mere presence of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Disease arises when transformation fails, so that nourishment, respiration, flow, or heat turn against the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Local pathology escalates through transmission from tissue to tissue, from bone to flesh, and from flesh to blood.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Nourishment and respiration are twofold channels, which can sustain the body or dissolve its bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] The gravity of disease depends more on the depth and interdependence of the affected mechanism than on the superficial magnitude of the damage.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] The opposition between natural order and reversal contrary to nature organizes the whole pathological genesis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-10","text":"[Persistent] Nomenclature must follow the origin, course, quality, and condition of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Coagulation, enclosure, and deprivation of outlets can transform internal difference into systemic reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GA-12","text":"[Attractor] The diseased body becomes the bearer of its own corruption, because diseased matter recirculates and multiplies injuries.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-01","text":"“Corruption” initially recurs as a change of color and constitution, but then mutates into dissolution of bonds, putrefaction, and systemic reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-02","text":"“Flow” shifts from the natural circulation of humors to the disorderly transmission of diseased matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-03","text":"“Respiration” changes function: from a mechanism of cooling and distribution, it becomes obstruction, deficiency, excess, and putrefaction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-04","text":"“Nourishment” is detached from its nutritive function and transferred into a corrosive factor in the dissolution of bonds.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-05","text":"“Bile” changes from a genus of pathological bodies into a mechanism of heat, coagulation, extinction, and trembling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-06","text":"“Order” is retained as a common axis, but shifts from periods of blood to fibers, bonds, outlets, and densities.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RMD-07","text":"The distinction between surface and depth is absorbed into a hierarchy escalating from flesh through bone and marrow toward death.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-01","text":"The precise distinction of bile, ichor, and phlegm remains a local taxonomy, because the cluster-scale chiefly retains the common mechanism of change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-02","text":"The integrity of flesh and bones, respiration, and nourishment are escalated into a general theory of mutual dependence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-03","text":"The internal movement of phlegm and bile bridges the classification of humors with anatomical transmission.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-04","text":"The physiological idea of discharge becomes a current-level mechanism for distinguishing reversible from escalating disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-05","text":"Local obstruction of the lung dissolves the isolation of organs and becomes a model of general systemic escalation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:CGD-06","text":"The nomenclature of diseases ceases to be mere description and becomes a strategic map of courses, conditions, and transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-01","text":"The body as a static aggregate of self-sufficient parts is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-02","text":"Disease as an immobile local injury, capable of remaining independent of the other systems, is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-03","text":"Matter as a stable substance unaffected by heat, place, mixture, and movement is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-04","text":"The explanation of disease by name alone or by the final symptom is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-05","text":"The complete separation of matter, pneuma, blood, nourishment, and respiration is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:GNX-06","text":"The idea that disease has only a linear and reversible course is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-01","text":"Disease cannot be understood as an external imposition, because it is produced from the internal change of the constituents.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-02","text":"The isolation of cause from the course and condition of matter is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-03","text":"Health as a condition acquired once and for all is excluded, because it requires continuous regulation of density, heat, and movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-04","text":"The complete reduction of symptoms to one single principle is excluded, because a common mechanism manifests itself through many courses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:DBN-05","text":"The absolute equation of superficial fleshly damage and disease of the marrow is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-01","text":"A world in which matter remains immobile, simple, and unaffected by relations becomes impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-02","text":"Disease as a simple accident becomes impossible, because pathology develops its own circulation and production.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-03","text":"The absence of an intact bond, a clear outlet, and proper recirculation constitutes the system's hidden negative hypothesis.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSA-04","text":"Complete medical security is excluded, because the same mechanism can at one time heal and at another produce disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-01","text":"The theory of humoral change and the theory of anatomical transmission converge in one model, in which the quality of matter determines the course of escalation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_62:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-02","text":"Obstruction unites the three fields of pathology: it interrupts respiration, changes flow, and encloses diseased matter.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_61:AS4","CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-03","text":"Nourishment and respiration are revealed as symmetrical transformative channels, whose disturbance transforms intake into dissolution or enclosure.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-07","CL_JP8E_23:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-04","text":"The transmission of disease is not simple transfer, but active reproduction, because corrupted matter multiplies the initial injuries.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-06","CL_JP8E_23:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_61:A6","CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-05","text":"Natural discharge and pathological enclosure are opposite modes of the same mechanism of flow.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-04","CL_JP8E_23:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_62:D3","CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:XD-06","text":"Medical classification is compelled to maintain both a common genus and internal heterogeneity, because the same mechanism manifests itself through different courses.","refs":["CL_JP8E_23:GA-10","CL_JP8E_23:GA-03","CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3","CH_JP8E_S_62:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-01","text":"Bodily causality becomes a theory of transformations, in which disease is defined not by matter alone, but by the manner in which matter acts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-02","text":"Local and systemic pathology are not two genera, but two phases of one chain of transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-03","text":"Anatomy, humoral theory, and physiology are interwoven into one common diagnostic field, in which flow, mass, place, and depth jointly produce the symptom.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-04","text":"Pathology produces a recursive and spiral temporality: the effect returns as cause and intensifies the preceding damage.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:BSD-05","text":"The scientific reduction of many diseases to a few mechanisms does not eliminate difference, but repositions it as a difference of course, place, and condition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-01","text":"Integrity of bonds → proper nourishment → preservation of tissues; dissolution of bonds → corrupted matter → re-entry into the blood → multiplication of injury.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-02","text":"Exit of humor → discharge; enclosure → heat and burning; coagulation → cooling and trembling.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-03","text":"Obstruction of the lung → asymmetrical distribution of pneuma → confinement → nervous distension → spasm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-04","text":"Mass and quality mutually nourish one another: quantity contrary to nature intensifies alteration, while alteration changes the movement of the mass.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-05","text":"The surface functions as indication, depth as mechanism, and systemic reversal as the explanation's final spindle-shaped attractor.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:RLE-06","text":"The central attractive pole is natural order, which is redefined through absence, obstruction, and reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B01","text":"Natural nourishment and respiration → integrity of bonds and tissues → regulated circulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B02","text":"Bad diet or obstruction → alteration of nutritive matter or pneuma → dissolution, enclosure, and deprivation of outlets.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B03","text":"Alteration of matter → loss of natural flow → coagulation, putrefaction, burning, or disorderly dispersal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B04","text":"Local damage → transmission through tissues and blood → multiplication of diseases → systemic reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B05","text":"Quality, place, flow, heat, and density → reclassification of diseases according to mechanism, not according to final name.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FGS-B06","text":"Internal reversal of order → return of diseased matter → deepening → pain, spasm, death.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B09","text":"Natural flow → qualitative alteration → loss of measure → obstruction or dispersal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B10","text":"Loss of bond, nourishment, or respiration → local damage → re-entry of diseased matter into the blood.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B11","text":"Re-entry → circulatory transmission → deepening into bone and marrow → greater danger.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B12","text":"Coagulation, cooling, putrefaction, and nervous distension → pain and spasm → reversal of overall function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:AFM-B13","text":"The reversal returns to the system as a new cause, so that disease produces its own escalation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-01","text":"Disease is remapped from a superficial accident into dynamic transmission through the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-02","text":"Diagnosis moves from the name of the symptom to the course, place, and condition of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-03","text":"Anatomical distance is replaced by functional connectivity: flesh, bone, marrow, pneuma, and blood constitute one field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-04","text":"Chromatic and symptomatic variety is recognized as the surface of a few mechanisms of flow, mixture, burning, and coagulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-05","text":"Therapeutic thought is compelled to seek obstruction, condition, and depth, not merely the manifest affection.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MME-06","text":"The “sacredness” of the disease is reconstituted within natural causality, without the exceptional power of the process being annulled.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B01","text":"On the surface appear colors, fevers, catarrhs, inflammations, putrefaction, trembling, and spasm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B02","text":"Structurally, symptoms are produced from bonds, tissues, vessels, nerves, fibers, outlets, and flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategically, the explanation transfers inquiry from the symptom to the chain of transmission and transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B04","text":"Ontologically and temporally, the body is a circulating order, whose disturbance extends, returns, and reverses natural function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:ALT-B05","text":"Methodologically, the theory itself performs the shift from names to courses, relations, and reversals.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-01","text":"The reduction of many diseases to a few mechanisms threatens to eliminate the internal heterogeneity that classification nonetheless necessarily preserves.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-02","text":"The explanation depends on the transition from color or symptom to constitution and cause, which is not always demonstrable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-03","text":"The opposition of flow and coagulation is not a simple duality, because coagulation can be both natural regulation and pathological enclosure.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:FL-04","text":"The theory of respiration requires at once distribution, cooling, avoidance of putrefaction, and explanation of pain, so that one function bears many values.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-01","text":"“Order” mutates from a natural periodic rhythm into anatomical integrity, then into fibrous regulation, and finally into a mechanism of exclusion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-02","text":"“Respiration” changes from the intake of pneuma into distribution, cooling, prevention of putrefaction, and, when obstructed, into a source of systemic corruption.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MP-03","text":"“Disease” moves from a quality of the body to failure of transformation and then to a self-nourishing cycle of corruption.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-01","text":"The system imagines the body as a circulatory network in which matter, pneuma, and bonds are continually redistributed.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-02","text":"Within this network, the human being is not a sovereign subject, but a place of the passage, regulation, or confinement of matter.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-03","text":"The time of the body is periodic and reactive: the natural period can be interrupted, reversed, and return as disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:HSI-04","text":"Possible intervention consists not in addressing one symptom, but in restoring flow, outlet, measure, and bond.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B01","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from natural regulation to local disturbance, transmission, deepening, and systemic reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction preserves the unity of the mechanism without eliminating the difference of humors, tissues, courses, and depth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B03","text":"The precise hierarchy of mixtures and the unified relation of phlegm, bile, fibers, and marrow remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B04","text":"The architecture is coherent because it connects origin, movement, quantity, quality, depth, and pathological activity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_60:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B05","text":"The minimal reconstruction preserves the system's actual movement, but depends on the recursive return of diseased matter and on the tension between flow and coagulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_61:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_23:MRT-B06","text":"An element resistant to axiomatic compression remains the ambiguity of mechanisms, which can both sustain and produce disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_62:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_23@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_23:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 67–69"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 67–69","context":"Section 83 · Section 84 · Section 85","original_title":"Chapters 67–69","original_context":"Section 83 · Section 84 · Section 85"},"original_title":"Chapters 67–69","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 70–72","order":24,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_63","CH_JP8E_S_64","CH_JP8E_S_65"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_24@R001","sha256":"15640e038882fd410122c907ddb9f05ecce57f81ffc8cc88941fe1cedbca8e0a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ τὴν ἠθικὴν παρεκτροπὴν ὡς παραγόμενον ἀποτέλεσμα σωματικῶν, ψυχικῶν, παιδευτικῶν καὶ πολιτικῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς μετασχηματίζεται εἰς κλίμακα ἀλληλοδιαπερατῶν κινήσεων, οὐχὶ εἰς ἀπόλυτον δυϊσμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-03","text":"Ἡ νόσος ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν ἐνοχὴν εἰς ἀταξίαν κράσεων, παθῶν, ἔξεων καὶ κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-04","text":"Ἡ αἰτιότης διαχέεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἄτομον εἰς τὰ πλέγματα γενέσεως, τροφῆς, πολιτείας καὶ παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντιστροφὴ τοῦ λόγου ἀπὸ τὴν διάγνωσιν τῶν κακῶν εἰς τὴν ἀναζήτησιν τῆς σωτηρίας ἐγκαθιστᾷ θεραπευτικὴν καὶ παιδευτικὴν στρατηγικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-06","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία γίνεται καθολικὸς κανὼν ὑγείας, ἀρετῆς, καλλονῆς καὶ κοινωνικῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-07","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία δὲν ἐπιδιώκει ἀκινησίαν ἢ μονομερῆ ἐπικράτησιν, ἀλλὰ ἀμοιβαίαν, μετρίαν καὶ συνεχή ρύθμισιν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-08","text":"Ἡ τελικὴ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος ἄγει ἀπὸ τὴν ἀσύμμετρον ἐπικράτησιν εἰς τὴν ὁλοκληρωτικὴν τάξιν τοῦ συναμφοτέρου κατὰ μίμησιν τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ ἀνθρώπινον ζῷον ὑφίσταται ὡς συναμφότερον ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος, ὧν οὐδετέρου ἡ αὐτάρκεια ἐπαρκεῖ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ σωματικὴ ἕξις δύναται νὰ μεταδίδῃ τὴν διαταραχὴν εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, ὥσπερ καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ ὑπεροχὴ δύναται νὰ βλάπτῃ τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ νόσος ἐκπηγάζει ἐκ ἀσυμμέτρου ἢ ἀτάκτου κρατήσεως ἐναντίων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν ποσότητα στοιχείου εἰς τὴν ἀδυναμίαν ἑνὸς μέρους νὰ συνυπάρχῃ μετὰ τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἄνοια καὶ ἡ σωματικὴ νόσος εἶναι δύο ἐκφάνσεις ἑνὸς ἀσυμμέτρου συστήματος, οὐχὶ δύο ἀνεξάρτηται ἀσθένειαι.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἠθικὴ πράξις ἀναλύεται ὡς ἀποτέλεσμα προγενεστέρων κράσεων, ἀγωγῶν, τροφῶν καὶ κοινωνικῶν λόγων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ἰατρική, ἡ παιδεία καὶ ἡ πολιτικὴ τάξις συμπλέκονται εἰς ἕν θεραπευτικὸν πεδίον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Τὸ καλὸν καὶ τὸ ἀγαθὸν ὁρίζονται διὰ συμμετρίας, ἀναλογίας καὶ ἀποφυγῆς ἀσυμμέτρου ὑπεροχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ συμμετρία ἀναπτύσσεται ἀπὸ στατικὴν ἀναλογίαν εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν ἀνταπόδοσιν καὶ ρύθμισιν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ τάξις τοῦ παντὸς παρέχει πρότυπον διὰ τὴν θεραπείαν καὶ τὴν ἀνασύνταξιν τῶν ἀνθρωπίνων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ θεραπεία ἀπαιτεῖ ταυτοχρόνως μεταβολὴν σώματος, ἔθους, μαθήσεως, κινήσεως καὶ κοινωνικῶν συνθηκῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","text":"[Tension] Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῆς καθαρᾶς ἑκουσιότητος δὲν ἀφανίζει τὴν παιδευτικὴν κατεύθυνσιν, ἀλλὰ μετατοπίζει τὴν εὐθύνην πρὸς τοὺς μηχανισμοὺς διαμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ ἀλληλεξάρτησις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς ἐπαναλαμβάνεται σταθερῶς, ἀλλὰ μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μετάδοσιν νόσου εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν ρύθμισιν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ὑπερβολὴ ἀρχικῶς σημαίνει στοιχειακὴν ἢ χυμώδη διατάραξιν, ἔπειτα δὲ σημαίνει ἀσύμμετρον ἐπικράτησιν μέρους ἐντὸς τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A1","CH_JP8E_S_64:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κατηγορία μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ τελικὸν πρόσωπον πρὸς τοὺς φορεῖς γενέσεως, τροφῆς καὶ παιδείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀποβάλλει τὸ πρότυπον τῆς ἁπλῆς νουθεσίας καὶ ἀποκτᾷ σύνθετον μορφὴν σωματικῆς, παιδευτικῆς καὶ πολιτικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_64:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ κριτήριον κάλλους εἰς δυναμικὸν μηχανισμὸν ἀνταποδόσεως, ὅστις παράγει ὑγείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:D6","CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία, ἡ ὁποία δὲν εἶχεν ἀρχικῶς κεντρικὴν θέσιν, ἐπανεμφανίζεται ὡς ἀρνητικὸς πόλος τῆς θεραπευτικῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς θεωρία χυμῶν, ἀτμῶν καὶ στοιχείων παραμένει τοπικὴ μηχανικὴ ἐξηγήσεως, ἐνώ ἐπὶ τοῦ παρόντος ἐπιπέδου διασώζεται ὡς γενικὸς τύπος σωματικῆς διαταράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ τριμερὴς ψυχὴ καὶ ἡ ἀκριβὴς ἀντιστοίχισις νοσημάτων πρὸς τὰ μέρη αὐτῆς εἶναι χαμηλοτέρου ἐπιπέδου ὑπόθεσις, ἡ δὲ γενικὴ ἀρχὴ τῆς μεσολαβήσεως παραμένει κεντρική.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ σύζευξις γυμναστικῆς, μουσικῆς καὶ φιλοσοφίας εἶναι συγκεκριμένον παιδευτικὸν παράδειγμα, τὸ ὁποῖον ἀναβαθμίζεται εἰς κανόνα ἀμοιβαίας καλλιεργείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ μίμησις δὲν εἶναι πλέον τοπικὴ εἰκών, ἀλλὰ γίνεται ὑπερκείμενον πρότυπον ὅλης τῆς θεραπευτικῆς ἀρχιτεκτονικῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀτομικὴ ἀσθένεια καὶ ἡ ἀτομικὴ κακία δὲν ἀρκούν πλέον ὡς αὐτοτελεῖς κατηγορίαι· ὑπάγονται εἰς ἐνιαῖον δίκτυον διαμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ ἀκριβὴς μέτρησις τῆς μετρίας κινήσεως καὶ ἡ πρακτικὴ μορφὴ τῆς θεραπευτικῆς παιδείας παραμένουν ὑποκαθορισμέναι καὶ δὲν ἀναβαθμίζονται εἰς καθολικὰς ἀρχάς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ψυχὴ ὡς ἀνεξάρτητος κυβερνήτης τῶν παθῶν καὶ τῶν πράξεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ κακία ὡς καθαρῶς ἑκούσιος καὶ ἐσωτερικῶς αὐτογενὴς ἀπόφασις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ θεραπεία ὡς λόγος ἄνευ τροφῆς, ἔθους, κινήσεως καὶ μαθήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται τὸ καλὸν ὡς μέγεθος, δύναμις ἢ ἀπλῆ ὑπεροχή· ἡ ἀξία ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν σχέσιν πρὸς τὸ ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀκινησία ὡς οὐδετέρα ἢ θεραπευτική· ἡ σωτηρία ἀπαιτεῖ τεταγμένην κίνησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-01","text":"Οὐ δύναται νὰ σταθῇ τὸ σύστημα ἐπὶ κόσμου ὅπου ψυχή, σῶμα, παιδεία καὶ πολιτεία ἔχουσιν ἀνεξάρτητα αἴτια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-02","text":"Οὐ δύναται νὰ ἀναγνωρισθῇ ἡ νόσος ὡς ἁπλὴ ἐξωτερικὴ προσβολή, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀταξία παράγεται ἐντὸς τῶν ἀλληλοκρατουμένων κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-03","text":"Οὐκ ἐπαρκεῖ ἡ γνώσις μόνη πρὸς τὴν θεραπείαν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἔξις τοῦ σώματος καὶ τὸ περιβάλλον συμπαράγουσι τὴν πράξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-04","text":"Οὐκ ἐπιτρέπεται ἡ ἀξιολόγησις ἑνὸς μέρους ἄνευ τοῦ ὅλου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ὑπεροχὴ δύναται νὰ μεταβληθῇ εἰς βλάβην.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-01","text":"Ἡ βαθύτερα ἀποκλειομένη δυνατότης εἶναι ἡ ὕπαρξις ἀμέτοχου, ἀσυσχετίστου καὶ ἑαυτοκυβερνωμένης ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-02","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται κόσμος ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἠθικὴ ἐνοχὴ ἀποκόπτεται ἀπὸ τὰς φυσικὰς καὶ κοινωνικὰς συνθήκας γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-03","text":"Ἀδύνατος καθίσταται ἡ σωτηρία ὡς ἀκινησία, ἀπόσπασις ἢ μονομερὴς ἐπικράτησις τοῦ πνευματικοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπουσία, περὶ ἧς περιστρέφεται τὸ σύστημα, εἶναι ἡ ἀπουσία ἀσυμμέτρου μέρους ὃ δύναται νὰ σωθῇ μόνο του.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-01","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ συμπεριφορὰ μετατρέπεται εἰς φαινόμενον ἐνσώματον καὶ κοινωνικῶς παραγόμενον, ὅταν ἡ φυσιολογικὴ διαταραχὴ συνδεθῇ μετὰ τῆς ἀγωγῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-02","CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_63:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-02","text":"Ἡ μετάθεσις τῆς κακίας ἀπὸ τὸ ἄτομον εἰς τὸ πλέγμα γενέσεως καὶ τροφῆς ἀπαιτεῖ ὄχι ἀκύρωσιν τῆς παιδείας, ἀλλὰ ἀνασύνταξιν τῶν ὑπευθύνων μηχανισμῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-03","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία γίνεται δυναμικὴ ἀρχή, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ἀναλογία τοῦ ὅλου μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἀμοιβαίαν κίνησιν καὶ ρύθμισιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-08","CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῆς ψυχῆς ὡς αὐτάρκους ἀρχῆς καὶ ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῆς ἀκινησίας συγκροτοῦσιν ἀρνητικὸν ὅρον ὅλης τῆς θεραπευτικῆς λογικῆς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","CL_JP8E_24:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἱεράρχησις τῆς ψυχῆς ὡς κρείττονος συνυπάρχει ἀσταθῶς μετὰ τῆς ἀναγκαίας σωματικῆς ἀνταποδόσεως, ὥστε ἡ ὑπεροχὴ νὰ μὴν ἰσοδυναμῇ μὲ αὐτάρκειαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-06","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀνασυντάσσει ταὐτοχρόνως τὸ ἄτομον καὶ τὰ περιβάλλοντα αἴτια, διότι ἡ παιδεία ἡ ἴδια ὀφείλει νὰ κινηθῇ σωματικῶς, μουσικῶς, φιλοσοφικῶς καὶ πολιτικῶς.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","CL_JP8E_24:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-01","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον παύει νὰ νοεῖται ὡς ἀρχὴ τῶν πράξεων καὶ γίνεται κόμβος ἐντὸς ἀλληλεπιδρώντων σωματικῶν, παιδευτικῶν καὶ πολιτικῶν ῥοῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-02","text":"Ὁ χρόνος τῆς πράξεως γίνεται γενεαλογικός· ἡ παροῦσα κακία φέρει ἐν ἑαυτῇ προγενεστέρους τρόπους τροφῆς, ἀγωγῆς καὶ κράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἀνθρώπινη ὑγεία ἀναδεικνύεται ὡς ἐνεργὸς παραγωγὴ τάξεως, οὐχὶ ὡς παθητικὴ ἀπουσία συμπτωμάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ θεραπευτικὴ γνώσις μετασχηματίζεται εἰς ἐπιστήμην σχέσεων, ἥτις ὀφείλει νὰ ρυθμίζῃ ὅλον τὸ δίκτυον καὶ οὐχὶ ἕν μόνον μέρος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ εὐθύνη ἐπανακαθορίζεται ὡς εὐθύνη παραγωγῆς σωμάτων, ἔξεων, λόγων καὶ μαθημάτων, ὄχι μόνον ὡς ἐπιβολὴ κυρώσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","CH_JP8E_S_64:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-01","text":"Στοιχειακὴ ἢ σωματικὴ ὑπερβολή → διατάραξις σώματος → ψυχικὴ ἄνοια → φαινομένη κακία → ἀναγωγὴ εἰς σωματικὰ καὶ παιδευτικὰ αἴτια.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ ἀναγωγὴ τῆς κακίας εἰς τὰ αἴτια μετατρέπεται εἰς ἀντιστροφὴν: ἡ ἐξήγησις τῶν κακῶν γεννᾷ τὴν ἀναζήτησιν τῶν αἰτίων τῆς σωτηρίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἀσυμμετρία ἑνὸς μέρους → ἀσθένεια τοῦ ἑτέρου → ἐπέκτασις τῆς ἀγωγῆς → ἀμοιβαία ἀνταπόδοσις → ἀνασύνταξις τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία ἀρχικῶς ὀρίζει τὸ κάλλος, ἔπειτα ὀρίζει τὴν ὑγείαν, καὶ τέλος γίνεται μηχανὴ ρυθμίσεως τῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις γίνεται ἔννοια-μηχανή: ἡ ἄτακτος κίνησις παράγει νόσον, ἡ δὲ μετρία καὶ συνεχὴς κίνησις παράγει τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-06","text":"Ὁ κεντρικὸς ἐλκυστὴς εἶναι τὸ συναμφότερον, ἐν ᾧ ἡ φύσις τοῦ παντὸς ἐπιστρέφει ὡς πρότυπον διὰ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην θεραπείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B01","text":"Σωματικὴ κράσις καὶ στοιχειακὴ ὑπερβολὴ → ἐσωτερικὴ διατάραξις τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B02","text":"Σωματικὴ ἕξις → μετάδοσις εἰς τὴν ψυχήν → ἄνοια, μανία ἢ ἀμαθία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B03","text":"Ἄνοια καὶ πάθος → ἀπώλεια ὀρθῆς κρίσεως → πράξις φαινομένη ἑκούσιος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B04","text":"Σωματικὴ προδιάθεσις + κακὴ πολιτεία + ἀπαίδευτος ἀγωγή → ἀκουσία γένεσις κακίας καὶ μετατόπισις τῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B05","text":"Ἀναγνώρισις τῆς ἀλληλεξαρτήσεως → ἀπόρριψις τῆς μονομερείας → ἀνταπόδοσις ψυχικῶν καὶ σωματικῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B06","text":"Συνεχὴς μετρία κίνησις → σύνταξις συγγενῶν μερῶν → ὑγεία, ἀρετή, κάλλος καὶ ὁ καλὸς ἄνθρωπος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B01","text":"Ἀρχικὴ φυσιολογικὴ ὑπερβολή → σωματικὴ νόσος → ψυχικὴ διαφθορά → ἠθικὴ παρεκτροπή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B02","text":"Ἀναθεώρησις τῆς ἑκουσιότητος → διάχυσις τῆς αἰτιότητος εἰς τροφήν, πολιτείαν καὶ παιδείαν → θεραπευτικὴ ἀντιστροφή.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B03","text":"Συμμετρία ὡς κανών → ἀμοιβαία κίνησις ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος → μίμησις τῆς κοσμικῆς τάξεως → ὑγεία τοῦ συναμφοτέρου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-01","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κατηγορία ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ γενεαλογικὴν καὶ θεραπευτικὴν χαρτογράφησιν τῶν ὅρων τῆς πράξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς ὑποχωρεῖ μπροστὰ εἰς ἀναλυτικὴν τῆς μεταξύ των συμμετρίας καὶ ἀλληλοκρατήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-03","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἐπεκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἐσωτερικὸν φρόνημα εἰς τὸ σῶμα, τὴν τροφήν, τὸ ἔθος, τὴν παιδείαν καὶ τὴν πολιτείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ὑγεία ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ἐνεργὸς τάξις σχέσεων, ὥστε ἡ ἀπουσία συμπτώματος νὰ μὴν ἀποτελῇ πλέον ἐπαρκῆ ὁρισμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-05","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία καθίσταται πρακτικὸς ὁδηγός: ἡ θεραπεία τῶν ἀνθρωπίνων μερῶν ἀπαιτεῖ θεωρίαν τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, πυρετοί, χυμοί, πάθη, ἀμαθία καὶ κακίαι φαίνονται ὡς συμπτώματα ἀσυμμέτρου κράσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀλληλεπίδρασις σώματος, ψυχῆς, πολιτείας καὶ παιδείας παράγει ἢ ἀποτρέπει τὴν κακίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἐπέμβασις μεταφέρεται ἀπὸ τὴν μομφὴν τοῦ προσώπου εἰς τὴν ἀναμόρφωσιν τῶν συνθηκῶν γενέσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ ζῷον γίνεται γίγνεσθαι σχέσεων, ὄχι ἕτοιμον αὐτοτελὲς ὑποκείμενον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ performative ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἴδια ἡ δομὴ τοῦ λόγου μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενόν της, ἐπειδὴ συνδέει διαδοχικῶς διασπασμένα μέρη εἰς ἕν ὅλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἀπόρριψις τῆς καθαρᾶς ἑκουσιότητος ἀποδυναμοῖ τὴν προσωπικὴν ἐνοχήν, ἀλλὰ ἀναγκάζει τὸ σύστημα νὰ διατηρήσῃ κάποιαν μορφὴν κατευθυντικῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη συνεχούς κινήσεως συγκρούεται μὲ τὴν ἀνάγκην μετρίας κινήσεως, ἐπειδὴ ἡ σωτηρία δὲν ὁρίζεται ἀκριβῶς ὡς ποσὸν ἢ ῥυθμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-03","text":"Ἡ ὑπεροχὴ τῆς ψυχῆς διατηρεῖ ἱεραρχικὴν χροιάν, ἐνώ ἡ θεραπεία ἀπαιτεῖ ἀμοιβαίαν ἐξάρτησιν καὶ ἀνταπόδοσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-04","text":"Ἡ μετατόπισις τῆς εὐθύνης πρὸς τοὺς γεννῶντας καὶ τρέφοντας δύναται νὰ ἀναπαράγῃ ἐνοχοποίησιν ἑτέρου ἐπιπέδου, ἣν τὸ σύστημα δὲν ἐπιλύει πλήρως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-01","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ κακία μεταλλάσσεται εἰς νόσον, ἡ δὲ νόσος μεταλλάσσεται εἰς διαταραχὴν κινήσεων· ἐνταῦθα ἡ ἠθικὴ κατηγορία ἀποκτᾷ φυσιολογικὸν καὶ κοσμολογικὸν βάθος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-02","text":"Ἡ συμμετρία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ μορφολογικὸν κριτήριον εἰς θεραπευτικὸν τελεστήν, ὅστις ρυθμίζει τὰς σχέσεις τῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἀκινησία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ φαινομενικὴν ἡσυχίαν εἰς ἐνεργὸν μηχανισμὸν φθορᾶς, ἐνώ ἡ κίνησις ἀναλαμβάνει θεραπευτικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς ζῶν σύστημα ἀλληλοκρατουμένων κινήσεων, ἐν ᾧ οὐδὲν μέρος ἐνεργεῖ ἀμέτοχον τοῦ ὅλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-02","text":"Τὸ ὑποκείμενον εἶναι συναμφότερον κόμβος, ὃς ὑφίσταται διὰ τῆς ἀνταποδόσεως ψυχικῶν, σωματικῶν καὶ παιδευτικῶν κινήσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι γενεαλογικὸς καὶ ρυθμικός: συσσωρεύει κράσεις καὶ ἀγωγὰς, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ ἀνασυνταχθῇ διὰ συνεχοῦς ρυθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατὴ ἔξοδος δὲν εἶναι ἀπόδρασις ἑνὸς μέρους, ἀλλὰ μεταβολὴ τῆς ἐχθρᾶς κρατήσεως εἰς φιλικὴν σύνταξιν καὶ κοσμικὴν ἀναλογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B01","text":"Οἱ παρόντες καθολικοὶ ἄξονες ἀρκοῦσι πρὸς ἀνακατασκευὴν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ τὴν φυσιολογικὴν διατάραξιν εἰς τὴν κοινωνικοπαιδευτικὴν καὶ θεραπευτικὴν ἀνασύνταξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B02","text":"Ἡ ἀνακατασκευὴ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀναγκαίαν διαδοχήν: σῶμα → ψυχή → κακία → αἰτιότης → συμμετρία → ἀμοιβαία κίνησις → ὑγεία.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσι τὸ ἀκριβὲς μέτρον τῆς μετρίας κινήσεως, ἡ πρακτικὴ μορφὴ τῆς παιδείας καὶ τὸ κανονιστικὸν καθεστὼς τῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B04","text":"Ἡ συνοχὴ τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι ἰσχυροτάτη ἐν τῇ συνδέσει σώματος, ψυχῆς, πάθους, παιδείας καὶ κινήσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀναλογικὴν καὶ ῥητορικὴν ἀντιστροφὴν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀξιωματικὴ συμπίεσις διασώζει τὸν γενεσιουργὸν μηχανισμόν, ἀλλὰ δὲν ἀφανίζει τὴν ἄλυτον ἔντασιν μεταξὺ φυσιολογικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος, παιδευτικῆς ἐπεμβάσεως καὶ προσωπικῆς εὐθύνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T233106716254Z_d7faef7e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 70–72","source_sha256":"15640e038882fd410122c907ddb9f05ecce57f81ffc8cc88941fe1cedbca8e0a","sha256":"2303a92c7124881c21f7d872281804d93e00896f3c21c29c1ecec09fb3783480","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:31:06.719372+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-01","text":"The system seeks to explain moral deviation as a derivative result of bodily, psychic, educational, and political relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-02","text":"The distinction between body and soul is transformed into a scale of interpenetrating motions, not into absolute dualism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-03","text":"Disease is reclassified from moral culpability into a disorder of mixtures, affections, dispositions, and motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-04","text":"Causality is diffused from the individual into the networks of generation, nourishment, polity, and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-05","text":"The reversal of the argument from the diagnosis of evils to the search for salvation establishes a therapeutic and educational strategy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-06","text":"Symmetry becomes a universal rule of health, virtue, beauty, and social responsibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-07","text":"Therapy does not seek immobility or one-sided predominance, but reciprocal, moderate, and continuous regulation of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BAS-08","text":"The system's final movement leads from asymmetrical predominance to the integral order of the soul-body composite in imitation of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The human living creature exists as a soul-body composite, neither of whose self-sufficiency suffices.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] A bodily disposition can transmit disorder to the soul, just as psychic predominance can harm the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Disease springs from the asymmetrical or disorderly predominance of contrary motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Excess shifts from the mere quantity of an element to the inability of one part to coexist with the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Folly and bodily disease are two manifestations of one asymmetrical system, not two independent illnesses.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Moral action is analyzed as the result of antecedent mixtures, upbringings, nourishments, and social accounts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Medicine, education, and political order are interwoven into one therapeutic field.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] The beautiful and the good are defined through symmetry, proportion, and the avoidance of asymmetrical predominance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","text":"[Mutating] Symmetry develops from static proportion into reciprocal requital and regulation of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The order of the whole supplies a model for the therapy and reconstitution of human parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-11","text":"[Terminal] Therapy requires simultaneously the alteration of body, habit, learning, motion, and social conditions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","text":"[Tension] The rejection of pure voluntariness does not eliminate educational direction, but shifts responsibility toward the mechanisms of formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-01","text":"The interdependence of body and soul recurs consistently, but mutates from the transmission of disease into reciprocal regulation of motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-02","text":"Excess initially signifies elemental or humoral disturbance, but subsequently signifies the asymmetrical predominance of a part within the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A1","CH_JP8E_S_64:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-03","text":"Moral accusation shifts from the final person to the agents of generation, nourishment, and education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:A10","CH_JP8E_S_64:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-04","text":"Therapy sheds the model of mere admonition and acquires the complex form of bodily, educational, and political change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_64:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-05","text":"Symmetry passes from a criterion of beauty into a dynamic mechanism of requital that produces health.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:D6","CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RMD-06","text":"Immobility, which initially had no central position, reappears as the negative pole of therapeutic motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:NX5","CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-01","text":"The detailed theory of humors, vapors, and elements remains a local mechanical explanation, whereas at the present level it is retained as a general type of bodily disturbance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-02","text":"The tripartite soul and the precise correspondence of diseases to its parts are a lower-level hypothesis, while the general principle of mediation remains central.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-03","text":"The conjunction of gymnastics, music, and philosophy is a specific educational example, which is elevated into a rule of reciprocal cultivation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-04","text":"Cosmological imitation is no longer a local image, but becomes the overarching model of the entire therapeutic architecture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-05","text":"Individual illness and individual vice no longer suffice as self-standing categories; they are subsumed under a unified network of formation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:CGD-06","text":"The precise measure of moderate motion and the practical form of therapeutic education remain underdetermined and are not elevated into universal principles.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-01","text":"The soul as an independent governor of affections and actions is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-02","text":"Vice as a purely voluntary and internally self-generated decision is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-03","text":"Therapy as discourse without nourishment, habit, motion, and learning is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-04","text":"The beautiful is rejected as magnitude, power, or simple superiority; value depends on relation to the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:GNX-05","text":"Immobility as neutral or therapeutic is rejected; salvation requires ordered motion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot stand upon a world in which soul, body, education, and polity have independent causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-02","text":"Disease cannot be recognized as a mere external assault, because disorder is produced within mutually prevailing motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-03","text":"Knowledge alone does not suffice for therapy, because bodily disposition and environment jointly produce action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:DBN-04","text":"The evaluation of one part without the whole is not permitted, because predominance can turn into harm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-01","text":"The more deeply excluded possibility is the existence of a non-participating, unrelated, and self-governing soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-02","text":"Impossible becomes a world in which moral culpability is severed from the natural and social conditions of its generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-03","text":"Impossible becomes salvation as immobility, separation, or the one-sided predominance of the spiritual.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSA-04","text":"The absence around which the system revolves is the absence of an asymmetrical part that can save itself alone.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-01","text":"Moral behavior is transformed into an embodied and socially produced phenomenon when physiological disorder is joined to upbringing.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-02","CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_63:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_64:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-02","text":"The transfer of vice from the individual to the network of generation and nourishment requires not the annulment of education, but the reconstitution of the responsible mechanisms.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-06","CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2","CH_JP8E_S_64:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-03","text":"Symmetry becomes a dynamic principle, because the proportion of the whole is transformed into reciprocal motion and regulation.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-08","CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_65:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-04","text":"The rejection of the soul as a self-sufficient principle and the rejection of immobility constitute a negative condition of the entire therapeutic logic.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","CL_JP8E_24:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX1","CH_JP8E_S_65:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-05","text":"The hierarchy of the soul as superior coexists unstably with necessary bodily requital, so that superiority does not amount to self-sufficiency.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-01","CL_JP8E_24:GA-09","CL_JP8E_24:GA-12","CH_JP8E_S_64:AS5","CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:XD-06","text":"Therapy reconstitutes simultaneously the individual and surrounding causes, because education itself must move bodily, musically, philosophically, and politically.","refs":["CL_JP8E_24:GA-07","CL_JP8E_24:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_63:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_65:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-01","text":"The subject ceases to be conceived as the principle of actions and becomes a node within interacting bodily, educational, and political flows.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-02","text":"The time of action becomes genealogical; present vice bears within itself prior modes of nourishment, upbringing, and mixture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A6","CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-03","text":"Human health emerges as an active production of order, not as a passive absence of symptoms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-04","text":"Therapeutic knowledge is transformed into a science of relations, which must regulate the entire network and not only one part.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:BSD-05","text":"Political responsibility is redefined as responsibility for producing bodies, dispositions, discourses, and lessons, not merely as the imposition of sanctions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:A4","CH_JP8E_S_64:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-01","text":"Elemental or bodily excess → bodily disturbance → psychic folly → apparent vice → reduction to bodily and educational causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-02","text":"The reduction of vice to causes becomes a reversal: the explanation of evils generates the search for the causes of salvation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-03","text":"The asymmetry of one part → illness of the other → extension of upbringing → reciprocal requital → reconstitution of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-04","text":"Symmetry initially defines beauty, then defines health, and finally becomes a mechanism for regulating motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-05","text":"Motion becomes a concept-machine: disorderly motion produces disease, whereas moderate and continuous motion produces order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:RLE-06","text":"The central attractor is the soul-body composite, in which the nature of the whole returns as a model for human therapy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B01","text":"Bodily mixture and elemental excess → internal disturbance of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B02","text":"Bodily disposition → transmission to the soul → folly, madness, or ignorance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B03","text":"Folly and affection → loss of correct judgment → apparently voluntary action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B04","text":"Bodily predisposition + bad polity + uneducated upbringing → involuntary generation of vice and displacement of responsibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B05","text":"Recognition of interdependence → rejection of one-sidedness → requital of psychic and bodily motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FGS-B06","text":"Continuous moderate motion → ordering of kindred parts → health, virtue, beauty, and the good human being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B01","text":"Initial physiological excess → bodily disease → psychic corruption → moral deviation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B02","text":"Revision of voluntariness → diffusion of causality into nourishment, polity, and education → therapeutic reversal.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:AFM-B03","text":"Symmetry as rule → reciprocal motion of soul and body → imitation of cosmic order → health of the soul-body composite.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-01","text":"Moral accusation is replaced by a genealogical and therapeutic mapping of the conditions of action.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-02","text":"The distinction between body and soul yields before an analysis of their mutual symmetry and mutual predominance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-03","text":"Therapy extends from inner disposition to body, nourishment, habit, education, and polity.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-04","text":"Health is reclassified as an active order of relations, so that the absence of a symptom no longer constitutes a sufficient definition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MME-05","text":"Cosmology becomes a practical guide: therapy of human parts requires a theory of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, fevers, humors, affections, ignorance, and vices appear as symptoms of an asymmetrical mixture.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, the interaction of body, soul, polity, and education produces or prevents vice.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, intervention is transferred from blaming the person to reforming the conditions of generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the living creature becomes a becoming of relations, not a ready-made self-standing subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:ALT-B05","text":"At the performative level, the very structure of the discourse imitates its object, because it successively joins fragmented parts into one whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-01","text":"The rejection of pure voluntariness weakens personal culpability, but compels the system to retain some form of directive responsibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-02","text":"The need for continuous motion conflicts with the need for moderate motion, because salvation is not defined precisely as a quantity or rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-03","text":"The superiority of the soul retains a hierarchical coloration, whereas therapy requires reciprocal dependence and requital.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:FL-04","text":"The displacement of responsibility toward those who generate and nourish can reproduce culpabilization at another level, which the system does not fully resolve.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-01","text":"Moral vice mutates into disease, and disease mutates into disturbance of motions; here the moral category acquires physiological and cosmological depth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-02","text":"Symmetry mutates from a morphological criterion into a therapeutic operator that regulates the relations of the parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MP-03","text":"Immobility mutates from apparent quiet into an active mechanism of decay, while motion assumes a therapeutic function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a living system of mutually prevailing motions, in which no part acts without participating in the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-02","text":"The subject is at once a node, existing through the requital of psychic, bodily, and educational motions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-03","text":"Time is genealogical and rhythmic: it accumulates mixtures and upbringings, yet can be reconstituted through continuous regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:HSI-04","text":"The possible exit is not the escape of one part, but the transformation of hostile predominance into friendly ordering and cosmic proportion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_65:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B01","text":"The present universal axes suffice for reconstructing the basic movement from physiological disturbance to sociopedagogical and therapeutic reconstitution.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction retains the necessary sequence: body → soul → vice → causality → symmetry → reciprocal motion → health.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B03","text":"The precise measure of moderate motion, the practical form of education, and the normative status of responsibility remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B04","text":"The system's coherence is strongest in the connection of body, soul, affection, education, and motion, but depends upon the analogical and rhetorical reversal of the argument.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_64:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_24:MRT-B05","text":"The axiomatic compression preserves the generative mechanism, but does not eliminate the unresolved tension between physiological necessity, educational intervention, and personal responsibility.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_63:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_24@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_24:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 70–72"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 70–72","context":"Section 86 · Section 87 · Section 88","original_title":"Chapters 70–72","original_context":"Section 86 · Section 87 · Section 88"},"original_title":"Chapters 70–72","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 73–74","order":25,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_66","CH_JP8E_SEC9"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_25@R001","sha256":"50621c9c0e1a6b491c4284a9efa90e3d981268f4ddc821dc4b646b45889037b0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-01","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα τοῦ συστήματος ἐστὶν ἡ εὕρεσις κινήσεως καὶ παιδείας αἳ θεραπεύουσι τὸ ζῷον ἄνευ παραβιάσεως τῆς φυσικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-02","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀναπλαισιοῦται ὡς ἱεράρχησις κινήσεων, ἀπὸ τῆς αὐτοκινήτου ἐνεργείας μέχρι τῆς ἐξωτερικῆς καὶ βιαίας ἐπεμβάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-03","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ ἀγωγὴ ὑπάγονται εἰς ἓν σχήμα, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ἄριστη θεραπεία ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὸ θεραπευόμενον ἐκ τῶν ἔνδον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-04","text":"Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐκλαμβάνεται ὡς διαφοροποιημένον σύστημα κινήσεων, οὗ ἡ θεραπεία συνίσταται οὐχὶ εἰς ὁμοιομορφίαν ἀλλ᾽ εἰς συμμετρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-05","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ σύστασις τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἡ κοσμικὴ συγγένεια τῆς ψυχῆς παρέχουσι δύο κλίμακας τοῦ αὐτοῦ κανόνος: συνεργεῖν τῷ ὑφισταμένῳ ῥυθμῷ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-06","text":"Ἡ γνώσις παύει νὰ εἶναι ἐξωτερικὴ κατοχή, καὶ γίνεται ἐπανόρθωσις τῶν κινήσεων τοῦ γνωρίζοντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ λόγου εἶναι σπειροειδής: ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα μεταβαίνει εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχήν εἰς τὸν κόσμον, καὶ ἐκ τοῦ κόσμου ἐπιστρέφει εἰς τὴν ἀγωγήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις οὐκ ἐστὶν ἀπόλυτος κυριαρχία ἐπὶ τῆς φύσεως, ἀλλὰ ἐξομοίωσις τοῦ ἀνθρώπου πρὸς τάξιν ἣν ἡ θεραπεία ὀφείλει νὰ μιμηθῇ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἀξία πάσης θεραπευτικῆς κινήσεως κρίνεται κατὰ τὸν βαθμὸν τῆς ἐσωτερικῆς αὐτονομίας αὐτῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ θεραπεία ἱεραρχεῖται ἀπὸ τῆς γυμναστικῆς καὶ τῆς ἀσκήσεως πρὸς τὴν αἰώρησιν καὶ τελευταίως πρὸς τὸ φάρμακον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς αὐτοκινήσεως μετατίθεται ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, καὶ ἐκεῖθεν εἰς τὴν ἐξομοίωσιν πρὸς τὸν κόσμον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ὀρθὴ ἀγωγὴ σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς ἀποτελεῖ ἓν σύστημα ἡπίας ἐνεργοποιήσεως καὶ ἐσωτερικῆς ἀνατάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Ἕκαστον μέρος τοῦ ζῴου ἔχει ἴδιον ῥυθμὸν, ἴδιον πάθος καὶ ἴδιον τρόπον θεραπείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φυσικὴ τάξις, ἀρχικῶς σωματική, ἀναβαίνει εἰς κοσμικὴν κανονιστικότητα ἣ ὁρίζει τὴν ὀρθὴν παιδείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ γνώσις θεραπεύει μόνον ὅταν μεταβάλλῃ τὰς ἐσωτερικὰς περιφορὰς τοῦ γνωρίζοντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἄριστη ζωή συνίσταται εἰς ἐξομοίωσιν τοῦ νοοῦντος πρὸς τὴν νοουμένην κοσμικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ θεραπεία ἀποβλέπει εἰς ἁρμονίαν κινήσεων, οὐχὶ εἰς ἀπλὴν ἐξάλειψιν συμπτωμάτων ἢ ἀπαλλαγὴν ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀνάγκη περιορίζει τὴν τέχνην, ἐνῶ ἡ παιδαγωγικὴ παρασκευή τοῦ θεραπεύοντος περιορίζει τὴν βίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ κίνησις ἐπαναλαμβάνεται ὡς σωματικὴ γυμνασία, ψυχικὴ ἄσκησις καὶ κοσμικὴ περιφορά, διατηροῦσα τὸν πυρήνα τῆς ἐνεργοποιήσεως ἀλλὰ μεταβάλλουσα κλίμακα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀυτονομία μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ κριτήριον σωματικῆς θεραπείας εἰς ἱκανότητα ψυχικῆς καὶ νοητικῆς ἐξομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἱεράρχησις τῶν καθάρσεων μετατίθεται εἰς ἱεράρχησιν ψυχικῶν μερῶν, ὥστε ἡ θεραπεία νὰ γίνεται διαφοροποιημένη τροφή καὶ κίνησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ ἔξωθεν ἐπέμβασις, ἣ ἐν τῷ σώματι ἀπορρίπτεται ὡς βιαία, ἀνακωδικοποιεῖται ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ ὡς ἀναγκαία ἐσωτερικὴ ἄσκησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:NX1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ φύσις ἀπὸ ὁρίζων τοῦ νοσήματος γίνεται πρότυπον τοῦ ἀρίστου βίου καὶ μέτρον τοῦ θείου προσανατολισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ νόσος καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ διαφθορά ἐπιτελοῦσι κοινὸν ἀρνητικὸν ἔργον: ἀποκαλύπτουσιν ἀποκλίσεις κινήσεων ἀπὸ τὸν προσήκοντα ῥυθμόν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-01","text":"Τὰ εἰδικὰ παραδείγματα γυμνασίων, αἰωρήσεων καὶ φαρμάκων μένουσι τοπικὰ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ κειμένη ἀρχὴ εἶναι ἡ βαθμισμένη αὐτονομία τῆς κινήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ τριμερὴς διαίρεσις τῆς ψυχῆς εἶναι κατώτερον σχῆμα, ὅπερ κλιμακοῦται εἰς γενικωτέραν ἀρχὴν διαφοροποιημένης θεραπείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ γέφυρα μεταξὺ τῶν δύο κατωτέρων μηχανῶν εἶναι ἡ κίνησις: ἡ σωματικὴ ρύθμισις ἀναλαμβάνεται ὑπὸ τῆς ψυχικῆς ἀγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογικὴ θεωρία παύει νὰ εἶναι ἁπλὴ διδασκαλία καὶ γίνεται μηχανισμὸς μετασχηματισμοῦ τοῦ ἀνθρώπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀντίθεσις φύσεως καὶ τέχνης ὑποχωρεῖ, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τέχνη ἀξιοῦται μόνον ὅταν συνεργῇ τῇ φυσικῇ καὶ κοσμικῇ τάξει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ θεραπεία ὡς ἀπεριόριστος ἐξωτερικὴ κυριαρχία ἐπὶ σώματος ἢ ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ὁμοιόμορφος ἀγωγή, ἐπειδὴ ἕκαστον μέρος ἔχει ἴδιον μέτρον κινήσεως καὶ τροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἐπιτάχυνσις ὡς αὐτόματον ἀγαθόν, διότι δύναται νὰ διακόψῃ φυσικὸν ἢ ψυχικὸν χρόνον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ γνώσις ἣ μένει ἀμετάβλητος ἐν τῷ γνωρίζοντι καὶ οὐκ ἐπανορθοῖ τὴν κίνησιν αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀντίληψις τοῦ ζῴου ὡς ἀδρανοῦς ὕλης, ἣν ἡ τέχνη δύναται ἀνευθύνως νὰ μεταπλάττῃ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-01","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ θεραπεία ὀφείλει πάντοτε νὰ ἐπιβάλλεται ἔξωθεν, ἵνα ἡ ἐσωτερικὴ κίνησις διατηρῆται ὡς κριτήριον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-02","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ σωματικότης ἐξαντλεῖ τὸν ἄνθρωπον, ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχὴ ἀναφέρεται εἰς οὐράνιον συγγένειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-03","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ κοσμολογία εἶναι ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὴν ἀγωγήν, ἐπειδὴ αἱ κοσμικαὶ περιφοραὶ γίνονται κανὼν ἐπανoρθώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-04","text":"Δεῖ ψευδῆ εἶναι τὴν ὑπόθεσιν ὅτι ἡ γνώσις ἀρκεί ὡς πληροφορία· ἡ γνώσις ὀφείλει νὰ μετασχηματίζῃ τὸ γνωρίζον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ἐν ᾧ φύσις, ψυχή, καὶ νόησις εἶναι ἀσύμπτωτοι μηχανισμοί· ἡ δυνατότης θεραπείας ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν συγγένειαν αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-02","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπόλυτος αὐτονομία τοῦ ἀνθρώπου, ἐπειδὴ ἡ τελείωσις ἐξαρτᾶται ἀπὸ συμμετοχὴν εἰς προϋπάρχουσαν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπούσα δυνατότης τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι θεραπεία ἄνευ μέτρου, χρόνου, ἢ ἐσωτερικῆς μεταβολῆς· ἡ ἰσχὺς τῆς τέχνης ὁρίζεται διὰ τῶν ὁρίων τούτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-01","text":"Ἡ σωματικὴ θεραπεία καὶ ἡ ψυχικὴ παιδεία συγκροτοῦσι κοινὸν κανόνα, καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ ὀρθὴ ἐπέμβασις ἐνεργοποιεῖ τὸ θεραπευόμενον ἀντὶ νὰ ἀντικαθιστᾷ τὴν ἐνέργειάν του.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-02","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φυσικοῦ χρόνου καὶ κοσμικῆς περιφορᾶς παράγει ἕνα ἐνιαῖον θεραπευτικὸν μέτρον, ὅπου ἡ ἐπανόρθωσις ἀπαιτεῖ συγχρονισμόν, οὐχὶ βιαίαν ἐπιτάχυνσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-03","text":"Ἡ φαρμακευτικὴ βία καὶ ἡ ἐπιθυμητικὴ ἀταξία ἀναδεικνύονται ὡς παράλληλοι τρόποι ἐξωτερικῆς ἢ ἐσωτερικῆς ἀποσπάσεως ἀπὸ τὸ προσῆκον μέτρον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-02","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-04","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία τοῦ σώματος μεταβάλλεται εἰς θεραπείαν τοῦ τρόπου ᾧ τὸ ὂν ἀντιδρᾷ, ἐπιθυμεῖ, γιγνώσκει καὶ κινείται.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_66:ME4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀνάγκη ἐξωτερικῆς ἐπεμβάσεως οὐ καταλύει τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς αὐτοκινήσεως, ἀλλὰ φανερώνει τὸ ὅριον ἐν ᾧ ἡ τέχνη ὀφείλει νὰ ὑποχωρῇ εἰς τὴν παιδαγωγίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ ὀντολογία τοῦ ζῴου γίνεται ὀντολογία ρυθμῶν: ὂν ἐστὶ τὸ ὂν ὅσον διατηρεῖ, διορθοῖ καὶ ἀνατάσσει τὰς κινήσεις αὐτοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ ἐπιστημολογία μετατρέπεται εἰς θεραπευτικὴν πρακτικήν, ἐπειδὴ τὸ γιγνώσκειν ἀνασχηματίζει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ γνωρίζοντος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-03","text":"Ἡ ἠθικὴ αὐτονομία δὲν σημαίνει ἀνεξαρτησίαν ἀπὸ τάξιν, ἀλλὰ ἐνεργὸν συμμετοχὴν εἰς τάξιν ἣ ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἔμαθε νὰ ἀναγνωρίζῃ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-04","text":"Ὁ χρόνος παύει νὰ εἶναι μόνον γραμμὴ φθορᾶς καὶ γίνεται πεδίον ἐπανoρθώσεως, ὅπου ὁ παρὼν βίος συνδέεται πρὸς τὸν ἔπειτα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-05","text":"Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἢ παιδαγωγικὴ παρέμβασις νομιμοποιεῖται μόνον ὅταν μορφοῖ συνθήκας αὐτορυθμίσεως καὶ οὐχὶ ὅταν πολλαπλασιάζῃ τὴν ἐξάρτησιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-01","text":"Ἐσωτερικὴ κίνησις → αὐτονομία → ἁρμονία → ἐνισχυμένη ἐσωτερικὴ κίνησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-02","text":"Νόσος ἢ ψυχικὴ διαφθορά → ἀπόκλισις κινήσεων → ἡπία ἀγωγή → ἐπανόρθωσις φυσικοῦ ἢ κοσμικοῦ ῥυθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία τοῦ σώματος γεννᾷ τὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς ψυχικῆς θεραπείας, ἡ δὲ ψυχικὴ θεραπεία ἐπιστρέφει καὶ ἐπανανοηματοδοτεῖ τὴν σωματικὴν ἀγωγήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ θεωρία γίνεται μηχανή, ὅταν ἡ θέα τῶν περιφορῶν ἐπαναφέρει τὸν νοῦν εἰς τὸν ἑαυτοῦ προσήκοντα κύκλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-05","text":"Ὁ κεντρικὸς ἐλκτικὸς πόλος εἶναι ἡ ἐξομοίωσις: ἕκαστη κατώτερη θεραπεία ἀξιολογεῖται ἀπὸ τὸ πόσον προάγει πρὸς ἁρμονικὴν ὁμοιότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B01","text":"Διαφοροποίησις κινήσεων → διάγνωσις τοῦ προσήκοντος μέρους καὶ τοῦ προσήκοντος χρόνου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B02","text":"Διάγνωσις → ἱεράρχησις μέσων → προτίμησις αὐτοκινήσεως καὶ ἡπίας ἀγωγῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B03","text":"Ἀπόκλισις ἀπὸ τὸν φυσικὸν ἢ ψυχικὸν ῥυθμόν → κίνδυνος πολλαπλασιασμοῦ παθημάτων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B04","text":"Ἡπία ρύθμισις → ἐνεργοποίησις τοῦ θεραπευομένου → ἀνασύνδεσις σώματος καὶ ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B05","text":"Κοσμικὴ θεωρία → ἐπανόρθωσις ἐσωτερικῶν περιφορῶν → ἐξομοίωσις νοοῦντος καὶ νοουμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B06","text":"Ἐξομοίωσις → ἄριστος βίος → ἀναδρομικὴ ἐπιβεβαίωσις τῆς ἀρχῆς ὅτι ἡ θεραπεία ὀφείλει νὰ συνεργῇ τῇ τάξει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B01","text":"Ἱεράρχησις κινήσεων → διαφοροποίησις ψυχικῶν μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AF1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B02","text":"Διαφοροποίησις → ἀνάγκη συμμετρίας, μέτρου καὶ καταλλήλου τροφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B03","text":"Ἀνάγκη θεραπείας → περιορισμὸς φαρμακευτικῆς βίας καὶ ἐνίσχυσις αὐτορυθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B04","text":"Αὐτορύθμισις → κοσμικὴ θεωρία → ἐπανόρθωσις τῶν διεφθαρμένων περιόδων τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B05","text":"Ἐπανόρθωσις → ἐξομοίωσις → ἄριστος βίος ἐν τῷ παρόντι καὶ τῷ ἐπείτα χρόνῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-01","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία ἀναταξινομεῖται ἀπὸ πράξιν ἐξωτερικοῦ ἐλέγχου εἰς διαχείρισιν βαθμῶν κινήσεως καὶ αὐτονομίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-02","text":"Ἡ ψυχή ἀναφαίνεται ὡς ἱεραρχημένον πεδίον κινήσεων, ὥστε ἡ ἀγωγὴ νὰ μὴν ταυτίζεται μὲ ἐνιαίαν ἐπιβολήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-03","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς ὄργανον ἠθικῆς καὶ θεραπευτικῆς μεταβολῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-04","text":"Ἡ γνώσις ἀποχωρίζεται ἀπὸ τὴν ἁπλὴν πληροφορίαν καὶ συνδέεται μὲ ἄσκησιν, ἐπανόρθωσιν καὶ μεταβολὴν τοῦ ὑποκειμένου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φύσεως καὶ τέχνης ἀντικαθίσταται ὑπὸ διακρίσεως συνεργούσης καὶ βιαίας τέχνης.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου διατάσσονται σώματα, κινήσεις, ψυχικὰ μέρη, τροφαί, δίαιται καὶ φάρμακα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἅπαντα ὑπάγονται εἰς ἱεράρχησιν αὐτονομίας, διαφοροποιήσεως καὶ ῥυθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ὀρθὴ μέθοδος μειοῖ τὴν βίαν καὶ αὔξει τὴν ἐσωτερικὴν ἐνεργοποίησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ καὶ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ὁ ἄνθρωπος εἶναι ὂν σωματικὸν καὶ οὐράνιον, πεπερασμένον μὲν ἀλλὰ δεκτικὸν μετοχῆς τοῦ θείου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου ἡ ἴδια ἡ σύνθεσις μιμεῖται τὸ ἀντικείμενόν της, ἀναβαίνουσα ἀπὸ τὴν τοπικὴν ἀγωγὴν εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν ἁρμονίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἀρχὴ τῆς αὐτοκινήσεως ἐνδέχεται νὰ συγκρούηται πρὸς τὴν ἀνάγκην παιδαγωγικῆς ἢ ἰατρικῆς ἐπεμβάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἑνότητα τῆς κοσμικῆς ἁρμονίας μένει ἀτελῶς συνδεδεμένη μὲ τὴν τριμερή διαίρεσιν τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-03","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ περατότης τοῦ ζῴου τείνει νὰ περιορίσῃ τὴν θεραπείαν, ἐνῶ ἡ μετοχὴ τοῦ θείου ἀνοίγει ὁρίζοντα πέραν τοῦ παρόντος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-04","text":"Ἡ ἀμφισημία τῆς ἀθανασίας ἀφήνει ἀδιευκρίνιστον εἰ ἡ τελείωσις εἶναι ὀντολογικὴ μεταβολὴ ἢ μόνον βαθμὸς μετοχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-01","text":"Ἡ κίνησις μεταλλάσσει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ φυσικὸς μηχανισμὸς θεραπείας γίνεται ἠθικὸς, γνωστικὸς καὶ κοσμολογικὸς κανών.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-02","text":"Ἡ θεραπεία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀποκατάστασιν τοῦ σώματος εἰς ἐπανόρθωσιν τοῦ τρόπου τοῦ γιγνώσκειν καὶ τοῦ ζῆν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-03","text":"Ἡ ἐξομοίωσις πρὸς τὸ θεῖον λειτουργεῖ ἅμα ὡς τελικὸς σκοπὸς καὶ ὡς ἀναδρομικὸς κανὼν κρίσεως τῶν κατωτέρων θεραπευτικῶν πράξεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης νοεῖται ὡς σύστημα ὁμοκέντρων κινήσεων, ἐν ᾧ σῶμα, ψυχή, κόσμος καὶ θεῖον συνδέονται διὰ ἀναλογιῶν ῥυθμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος εἶναι ἅμα θεραπευόμενος, θεραπευτής, καὶ ὕλη ἀνασχηματισμοῦ, ὅταν ἡ ἀγωγὴ τοῦ ἄλλου ἀπαιτῇ τὴν ἀγωγὴν ἑαυτοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι ῥυθμὸς ἐπανoρθώσεως, οὐχὶ ἁπλῶς γραμμὴ φθορᾶς· περιλαμβάνει τὸ παρὸν καὶ τὸν ἔπειτα βίον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ διαφυγὴ ἀπὸ τὴν ἀταξίαν δὲν ἐπιτυγχάνεται διὰ κατακτήσεως, ἀλλὰ διὰ συμμετοχῆς, ἀσκήσεως καὶ ἐξομοιώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B01","text":"Τὰ παρόντα ἀξιώματα ἀρκοῦσιν εἰς ἀνασύστασιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ διατηροῦσι τὴν κοινὴν γενετικὴν ἀρχὴν τῆς κινήσεως, τῆς ἡπίας ἀγωγῆς καὶ τῆς ἁρμονίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B02","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένα μένουσι τὸ μέτρον τῆς ἐξαιρετικῆς ἀνάγκης, ἡ σχέσις τῶν ψυχικῶν μερῶν πρὸς τὴν κοσμικὴν ἑνότητα, καὶ ἡ συμφωνία ἐλευθερίας καὶ θείας συγγενείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B03","text":"Ἡ ἀρχιτεκτονικὴ εἶναι συνεκτική, ἀλλὰ ἡ πλήρης ἀνασύστασις ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν σπειροειδῆ ἐπιστροφὴν ἀπὸ τὸ σῶμα εἰς τὴν ψυχήν, ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχήν εἰς τὸν κόσμον, καὶ ἀπὸ τὸν κόσμον εἰς τὴν θεραπείαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T233132740528Z_b3d94bd3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 73–74","source_sha256":"50621c9c0e1a6b491c4284a9efa90e3d981268f4ddc821dc4b646b45889037b0","sha256":"d01d0a9eea27792839af8507162bd43fcf69f4bcb235337ed25ed34b6b82e63d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:31:32.743549+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-01","text":"The problem of the system is to find movement and education that heal the living being without violating the natural order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-02","text":"Therapy is reframed as a hierarchy of movements, from self-moving activity to external and violent intervention.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-03","text":"Bodily and psychic training are subsumed under one schema, in which the best therapy activates that which is being treated from within.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-04","text":"The soul is understood as a differentiated system of movements, whose therapy consists not in uniformity but in symmetry.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-05","text":"The natural constitution of the body and the soul's cosmic kinship provide two scales of the same rule: to cooperate with the existing rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-06","text":"Knowledge ceases to be external possession and becomes the correction of the knower's movements.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-07","text":"The movement of the argument is spiral: from the body it passes to the soul, from the soul to the cosmos, and from the cosmos it returns to education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AS-08","text":"The conclusion is not absolute mastery over nature, but the assimilation of the human being to an order that therapy ought to imitate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The value of every therapeutic movement is judged according to its degree of internal autonomy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Therapy is hierarchized from gymnastics and exercise to suspension and finally to medicine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The principle of self-motion shifts from the body to the soul, and thence to assimilation to the cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The correct education of body and soul constitutes one system of gentle activation and internal restoration.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Each part of the living being has its own rhythm, its own affection, and its own mode of therapy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] The natural order, initially bodily, rises into a cosmic normativity that defines correct education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Knowledge heals only when it changes the knower's internal revolutions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] The best life consists in the assimilation of the thinker to the intelligible cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Therapy aims at harmony of movements, not at the mere elimination of symptoms or release from the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Necessity limits art, while the pedagogical preparation of the healer limits violence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A5","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-01","text":"Movement recurs as bodily gymnastics, psychic exercise, and cosmic revolution, preserving the core of activation while changing scale.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AS3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-02","text":"Autonomy changes from a criterion of bodily therapy into a capacity for psychic and intellectual assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-03","text":"The hierarchy of purifications shifts into a hierarchy of psychic parts, so that therapy becomes differentiated nourishment and movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-04","text":"External intervention, which in the body is rejected as violent, is recoded in the soul as necessary internal exercise.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:NX1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-05","text":"Nature changes from a boundary of disease into a model of the best life and a measure of divine orientation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RMD-06","text":"Disease and psychic corruption perform a common negative work: they reveal deviations of movements from the fitting rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A9","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-01","text":"The particular examples of gymnastic exercises, suspensions, and medicines remain local, because the underlying principle is the graded autonomy of movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-02","text":"The tripartite division of the soul is a lower schema, which is scaled up into a more general principle of differentiated therapy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-03","text":"The bridge between the two lower mechanisms is movement: bodily regulation is taken up by psychic education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-04","text":"Cosmological theory ceases to be mere instruction and becomes a mechanism for the transformation of the human being.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:CGD-05","text":"The opposition of nature and art recedes, since art has worth only when it cooperates with the natural and cosmic order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-01","text":"Therapy as unlimited external mastery over body or soul is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-02","text":"Uniform education is rejected, because each part has its own measure of movement and nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-03","text":"Acceleration as an automatic good is rejected, because it can interrupt natural or psychic time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-04","text":"Knowledge that remains unchanged in the knower and does not correct his movement is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:GNX-05","text":"The conception of the living being as inert matter, which art can reshape irresponsibly, is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-01","text":"The hypothesis that therapy must always be imposed from without must be false, so that internal movement may be preserved as a criterion.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-02","text":"The hypothesis that corporeality exhausts the human being must be false, because the soul refers to heavenly kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-03","text":"The hypothesis that cosmology is indifferent to education must be false, because cosmic revolutions become a rule of correction.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:DBN-04","text":"The hypothesis that knowledge suffices as information must be false; knowledge must transform the knower.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:DNX6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-01","text":"A world in which nature, soul, and intellect are disconnected mechanisms is absent; the possibility of therapy requires their kinship.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-02","text":"The absolute autonomy of the human being is excluded, because perfection depends on participation in a pre-existing order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSA-03","text":"The absent possibility of the system is therapy without measure, time, or internal change; the power of art is defined through these limits.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-01","text":"Bodily therapy and psychic education constitute a common rule, according to which correct intervention activates that which is being treated instead of replacing its activity.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-02","text":"The distinction between natural time and cosmic revolution produces a unified therapeutic measure, in which correction requires synchronization, not violent acceleration.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-03","text":"Pharmaceutical violence and desiderative disorder emerge as parallel modes of external or internal detachment from the fitting measure.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-02","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-04","text":"The therapy of the body changes into therapy of the manner in which the being responds, desires, knows, and moves.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_66:ME4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:XD-05","text":"The necessity of external intervention does not annul the principle of self-motion, but reveals the limit at which art ought to yield to education.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-01","text":"The ontology of the living being becomes an ontology of rhythms: a being is insofar as it preserves, corrects, and restores its movements.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-03","CL_JP8E_25:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-02","text":"Epistemology is transformed into therapeutic practice, because knowing reshapes the knower's internal movement.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-07","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-03","text":"Ethical autonomy does not mean independence from order, but active participation in an order that the human being has learned to recognize.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-01","CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-04","text":"Time ceases to be only a line of decay and becomes a field of correction, in which the present life is connected with the subsequent one.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-06","CL_JP8E_25:GA-08","CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:BSD-05","text":"Political or pedagogical intervention is legitimized only when it forms conditions of self-regulation and not when it multiplies dependency.","refs":["CL_JP8E_25:GA-04","CL_JP8E_25:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-01","text":"Internal movement → autonomy → harmony → strengthened internal movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-02","text":"Disease or psychic corruption → deviation of movements → gentle education → correction of natural or cosmic rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-03","text":"The therapy of the body generates the principle of psychic therapy, while psychic therapy returns and re-signifies bodily education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-04","text":"Cosmic theory becomes a mechanism when the contemplation of revolutions restores the intellect to its own fitting circle.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:RLE-05","text":"The central attractive pole is assimilation: every lower therapy is evaluated by how much it advances toward harmonious likeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B01","text":"Differentiation of movements → diagnosis of the fitting part and the fitting time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B02","text":"Diagnosis → hierarchy of means → preference for self-motion and gentle education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B03","text":"Deviation from natural or psychic rhythm → danger of multiplication of affections.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B04","text":"Gentle regulation → activation of that which is treated → reconnection of body and soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B05","text":"Cosmic theory → correction of internal revolutions → assimilation of thinker and intelligible object.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FGS-B06","text":"Assimilation → best life → recursive confirmation of the principle that therapy ought to cooperate with order.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B01","text":"Hierarchy of movements → differentiation of psychic parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:AF1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B02","text":"Differentiation → need for symmetry, measure, and suitable nourishment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B03","text":"Need for therapy → limitation of pharmaceutical violence and strengthening of self-regulation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B04","text":"Self-regulation → cosmic theory → correction of the corrupted periods of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AS6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:AFM-B05","text":"Correction → assimilation → best life in the present and subsequent time.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:AF4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-01","text":"Therapy is reclassified from an act of external control into management of degrees of movement and autonomy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-02","text":"The soul appears as a hierarchized field of movements, so that education is not identified with unitary imposition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-03","text":"Cosmology is reclassified as an instrument of ethical and therapeutic change.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-04","text":"Knowledge is separated from mere information and connected with exercise, correction, and transformation of the subject.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MME-05","text":"The distinction between nature and art is replaced by the distinction between cooperative and violent art.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level are arranged bodies, movements, psychic parts, nourishments, regimens, and medicines.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, all things are subsumed under a hierarchy of autonomy, differentiation, and rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, the correct method reduces violence and increases internal activation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the human being is a bodily and heavenly being, finite indeed but capable of participation in the divine.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:ALT-B05","text":"At the methodological level, the composition itself imitates its object, ascending from local education to cosmic harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-01","text":"The principle of self-motion may conflict with the necessity of pedagogical or medical intervention.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-02","text":"The unity of cosmic harmony remains incompletely connected with the tripartite division of the soul.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-03","text":"The natural finitude of the living being tends to limit therapy, while participation in the divine opens a horizon beyond the present.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:A8","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:FL-04","text":"The ambiguity of immortality leaves unclear whether perfection is an ontological change or only a degree of participation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-01","text":"Movement changes function: from a natural mechanism of therapy it becomes an ethical, cognitive, and cosmological rule.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT2","CH_JP8E_SEC9:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-02","text":"Therapy changes from restoration of the body into correction of the manner of knowing and living.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D6","CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MP-03","text":"Assimilation to the divine functions at once as a final end and as a recursive rule for judging lower therapeutic actions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:A13","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-01","text":"Reality is conceived as a system of concentric movements, in which body, soul, cosmos, and divine are connected through analogies of rhythm.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SD1","CH_JP8E_SEC9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-02","text":"The human being is at once the one treated, the healer, and the material of reshaping, when the education of another requires one's own education.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_66:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-03","text":"Time is a rhythm of correction, not merely a line of decay; it includes the present and subsequent life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:D7","CH_JP8E_S_66:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:HSI-04","text":"Escape from disorder is achieved not through conquest, but through participation, exercise, and assimilation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:SNX3","CH_JP8E_SEC9:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B01","text":"The present axioms suffice for reconstruction of the system, because they preserve the common generative principle of movement, gentle education, and harmony.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B02","text":"The measure of exceptional necessity, the relation of the psychic parts to cosmic unity, and the compatibility of freedom and divine kinship remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT5","CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_25:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is coherent, but complete reconstruction requires the spiral return from body to soul, from soul to cosmos, and from cosmos to therapy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_SEC9:MRT3","CH_JP8E_S_66:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_25@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_25:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 73–74"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 73–74","context":"Section 89 · Section 90","original_title":"Chapters 73–74","original_context":"Section 89 · Section 90"},"original_title":"Chapters 73–74","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 75–76","order":26,"parents":["CH_JP8E_S_67","CH_JP8E_S_68"],"revision":"CL_JP8E_26@R001","sha256":"d53125cfc436ec0495ca38dad4fa455afcb5f9c91aa1a7dc4303cd620ae741a4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-01","text":"Τὸ σύστημα ζητεῖ νὰ ἐξηγήσῃ πῶς ἡ ψυχικὴ καὶ ἠθικὴ διάθεσις μεταγράφεται εἰς διαφορὰς σωμάτων, φύλων καὶ εἰδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-02","text":"Ἡ φυσικὴ μορφὴ ἀναπλάσσεται ὡς ἐνσώματος ἀπόκρισις τοῦ νοῦ, τῆς ἀνοίας καὶ τοῦ προτέρου βίου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία φαίνεται ἅμα ὡς δύναμις ἀπειθὴς τῷ λόγῳ καὶ ὡς ὄργανον ἐντεταγμένον εἰς τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-04","text":"Ἡ ἀπώλεια τοῦ νοῦ ἐκτείνεται ἀπὸ τὴν ψυχὴν εἰς τὴν στάσιν, τὴν κίνησιν, τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ τὸν τόπον κατοικίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-05","text":"Ἡ ταξινομία τῶν ζῴων οὐ μένει σταθερὰ κατάταξις, ἀλλὰ γίνεται δυναμικὴ κλίμαξ μεταβολῶν κατὰ κτῆσιν ἢ ἀποβολὴν νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-06","text":"Ἡ πολλαπλότης τῶν μορφῶν τελικῶς ἀνατάσσεται εἰς ἕνα κόσμον, ὃς περιέχει καὶ τὰ ἀνώτερα καὶ τὰ κατώτατα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-07","text":"Ἡ κίνησις εἶναι σπειροειδής· ἡ ψυχικὴ ἀποτυχία παράγει μορφήν, ἡ μορφὴ δηλοῖ βαθμίδα, καὶ ἡ βαθμίς ἐντάσσεται εἰς τὴν κοσμικὴν πληρότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-08","text":"Ἡ κατάληξις δὲν εἶναι ἁπλὴ ἀναίρεσις τῆς ἱεραρχίας, ἀλλὰ συνύπαρξις ἱεραρχικῆς ἀξίας καὶ ὀντολογικῆς ἀναγκαιότητος τῶν κατωτέρων μορφῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ψυχικὴ ποιότης καθορίζει τὴν σωματικὴν μορφήν καὶ τὴν ζωικὴν βαθμίδα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ πρότερος ἠθικὸς βίος μετασχηματίζεται ἀπὸ γενεαλογία ψυχῶν εἰς γενεαλογίαν σωμάτων καὶ εἰδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Σῶμα, κίνησις, ἀναπνοή, οἴκησις καὶ εἶδος συγκροτοῦσιν ἑνιαίαν ψυχοσωματικὴν αἰτιατότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_68:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ ἐπιθυμία εἶναι ἔμψυχος σωματικὴ δύναμις ἡ ὁποία κινεί τὴν γένεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ ἐπιθυμία ἀνθίσταται τῷ λόγῳ ἐντός, ἀλλὰ ἐξωτερικεύει τελεολογίαν γενετικὴν καὶ κοσμικήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-06","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἀπουσία φιλοσοφίας καὶ νοῦ ἐπιφέρει καθίζησιν ἀπὸ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην μορφὴν μέχρι τῆς θηριώδους καὶ ὑδρικῆς ζωῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ μορφολογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς ὁρατὴ κλίμαξ ἠθικῆς καὶ νοητικῆς διαβαθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ ζωικὴ μορφὴ δύναται νὰ μεταβάλλεται ἀμφίδρομα κατὰ τὴν κτῆσιν ἢ τὴν ἀποβολὴν τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι ἓν ὁρατὸν ζῷον καὶ αἰσθητὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ τελειότης τοῦ κόσμου ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν παρουσίαν καὶ τῶν κατωτάτων ζωικῶν μορφῶν, ἄνευ ἐξισώσεως τῆς ἀξίας αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ φιλοσοφία καὶ ἡ θεωρία τοῦ οὐρανοῦ εἶναι βιολογικὴ καὶ κοσμολογικὴ δύναμις ἀναβάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ μεταμόρφωσις τῆς ψυχῆς ἐπαναλαμβάνεται, ἀλλὰ μετακινείται ἀπὸ τὴν ἀλλαγὴν φύλου καὶ εἴδους εἰς τὴν συμπίεσιν, τὴν ἀναπνοὴν καὶ τὴν οἴκησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-02","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία παραμένει, ἀλλὰ παύει νὰ εἶναι ἀκίνητος τάξις καὶ γίνεται ἀμφίδρομος μηχανισμὸς μεταπτώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία, ἀρχικῶς γενετήσιος μηχανισμός, μετατίθεται λειτουργικῶς εἰς πρότυπον ἐνσώματου τελεολογικοῦ κινήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-04","text":"Τὸ σῶμα μεταβάλλεται ἀπὸ ὑποδοχὴν ἐπιθυμιῶν εἰς ὁρατὴ γραμματικὴ ἠθικῆς, νοῦ καὶ ἀνοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-05","text":"Ἡ νόσος, ἀρχικῶς ἀποτυχία γενετικῆς λειτουργίας, ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς γενικωτέραν λογικὴν σωματικῆς καὶ χωρικῆς ὑποβαθμίσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:NX4","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-06","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ τρόπον διοικήσεως τῆς ψυχῆς εἰς παραγωγικὴν αἰτίαν βιολογικῆς ἀνωτέρας μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀπώλεια τοῦ νοῦ ἐκτείνει τὴν ἠθικὴν πτῶσιν ἀπὸ σωματικὴν ἀλλοίωσιν εἰς ἀλλαγὴν μέσου καὶ τόπου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-08","text":"Τὰ κατώτερα εἴδη παύουσι νὰ λειτουργῶσιν ὡς ἀπλὰ τελικὰ ὅρια καὶ ἀπορροφῶνται εἰς τὴν πληρότητα τοῦ ἑνὸς κόσμου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A8","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-01","text":"Ἡ λεπτομερὴς λειτουργία τῆς μήτρας καὶ τῆς ἀκαρπίας μένει τοπικὸς μηχανισμός τοῦ γενετησίου παραδείγματος, οὐχὶ καθολικὴ περιγραφὴ πάσης φύσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ εἰδικὴ μετάπτωσις ἀνδρῶν εἰς γυναῖκας ὑποχωρεῖ μπροστὰ στὴν γενικώτερη ἀρχὴ τῆς ψυχοσωματικῆς μεταμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ σύνδεσις ἠθικῆς ποιότητος καὶ μορφῆς κλιμακοῦται ἀπὸ τοπικὴ γενεαλογία εἰς καθολικὴν ἀρχὴν ταξινομήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ γενετήσιος τελεολογία καὶ ἡ ζωικὴ ἱεραρχία γεφυροῦνται ὑπὸ τῆς ἐνσώματης ἐπιθυμίας καὶ τῆς μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-05","text":"Ἡ κτῆσις καὶ ἡ ἀποβολὴ τοῦ νοῦ καταλύουσι τὴν ἀκίνητον ταξινομίαν καὶ καταλύουσιν ὡς γέφυρα πρὸς τὴν δυναμικὴν ἱεραρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-06","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις ἀνθρώπου, πτηνοῦ, τετραπόδου καὶ ἐνύδρου ὑποτάσσεται εἰς ἀναβαθμοὺς καὶ καταβαθμοὺς ἑνὸς συστήματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-07","text":"Ἡ πληρότης τοῦ κόσμου γίνεται ἡ τρέχουσα ἀρχὴ ἡ ὁποία ἀνακωδικοποιεῖ τὰ κατώτερα εἴδη ὡς ἀναγκαῖα, ἀλλ᾽ οὐχὶ ἰσότιμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ φυσιολογία ὡς ἀξιολογικῶς οὐδετέρα καὶ ἀνεξάρτητος τῆς ψυχῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἐπιθυμία ὡς ἁπλὸν πάθος, ἐπειδὴ ἔχει σωματικὴν αὐτονομίαν καὶ τελεολογικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἀναπνοὴ, ἡ κίνησις καὶ ὁ χῶρος ὡς ἀδιάφορα βιολογικὰ δεδομένα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D3","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ζωικὴ ποικιλία ὡς ἄτακτος συνύπαρξις ἀνεξαρτήτων εἰδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-05","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ νόσος ὡς τυχαία βλάβη ἄνευ σχέσεως πρὸς τελικὴν φυσικὴν λειτουργίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-06","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ τελειότης ὡς ἀποκλεισμὸς τῶν κατωτέρων μορφῶν· ἡ τελειότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ὁλότητα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-01","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι κόσμον ἐν ᾧ ψυχὴ καὶ σῶμα διακρίνονται πλήρως ὡς ἀνεξάρτηται αἰτιαὶ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-02","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι νοῆσαι τὴν ἀμάθειαν ὡς ἁπλῶς ἐσωτερικὴν κατάστασιν, ἄνευ σωματικῆς καὶ χωρικῆς συνεπείας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-03","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι διατηρῆσαι εἴδη ἀμετάβλητα, ὅταν ἡ ποιότης τοῦ νοῦ δύναται νὰ μετασχηματίζῃ τὴν μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-04","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι ἐρμηνεῦσαι τὴν γένεσιν ἄνευ ἐπιθυμίας, ἢ τὴν ἐπιθυμίαν ἄνευ τελικοῦ προορισμοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-05","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι ἐκλάβειν τὸν χῶρον ὡς ὁμοιογενῆ ὑποδοχήν, ἐπειδὴ ἡ οἴκησις φέρει ἠθικὴν καὶ ὀντολογικὴν βαθμίδα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-06","text":"Ἀδύνατον εἶναι ἀπομονῶσαι τὴν ἀτομικὴν μοῖραν ἀπὸ τὴν κοσμικὴν πληρότητα, ἔστω καὶ ἂν ἡ μοῖρα εἶναι κατωτέρα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-01","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει κόσμος ἐν ᾧ μορφὴ δύναται νὰ ὑπάρχῃ ἄνευ ψυχικῆς ἀξιολογήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-02","text":"Ἀπουσιάζει φύσις ἀδιάφορος πρὸς τὸν νοῦν, τὴν ἄνοιαν καὶ τὰς μεταβολὰς αὐτῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-03","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀνεξάρτητος τελικότης τοῦ ἀνοήτου· τὸ κατώτατον ἔχει νόημα μόνον ἐντὸς τῆς ὁλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-04","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἀπολύτως ἀσύνδετος πολλαπλότης, ἐπειδὴ πᾶσα μορφὴ ἀναφέρεται εἰς μίαν κοσμικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-05","text":"Ἀποκλείεται ἡ ἐλευθέρα ἐπιθυμία ἡ ὁποία οὔτε ἀντιστέκεται οὔτε ἐντάσσεται εἰς τελεολογικὴν τάξιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-01","text":"Ἐπειδὴ ἡ ψυχὴ καθορίζει τὴν μορφὴν καὶ ἡ ὁλότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὰ κατώτερα εἴδη, ἡ πτῶσις γίνεται συγχρόνως ἀξιακὴ ὑποβάθμισις καὶ ὀντολογικὴ συνεισφορά.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀντίστασις τῆς ἐπιθυμίας τῷ λόγῳ δὲν ἀναιρεῖ τὴν τελεολογίαν, ἀλλὰ γίνεται ὁ τρόπος δι᾽ οὗ ἡ τελεολογία ἐνεργεῖ ἐν τῷ σώματι.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","CL_JP8E_26:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-03","text":"Ἡ μορφὴ, ἡ κίνησις, ἡ ἀναπνοὴ καὶ ἡ οἴκησις συγκροτοῦσι μίαν ἑνιαίαν ἔκφρασιν τῆς ψυχικῆς βαθμίδος.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","CL_JP8E_26:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_68:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-04","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία γίνεται οὐ μόνον μέθοδος ψυχικῆς ἀνατάσεως, ἀλλὰ αἰτία ἡ ὁποία παράγει ἀνώτερον βιολογικὸν καὶ κοσμικὸν τύπον.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","CL_JP8E_26:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-05","text":"Ἡ ἀμφίδρομος μεταβολὴ τῶν εἰδῶν ἀποσταθεροποιεῖ τὴν σταθερὰν ταυτότητα, χωρὶς νὰ καταργῇ τὴν ἱεραρχικὴν φοράν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-02","CL_JP8E_26:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_68:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-06","text":"Ἡ γενετήσιος νόσος καὶ ἡ χωρικὴ ὑποβάθμισις ἀναγιγνώσκονται ὡς δύο μορφαὶ τοῦ αὐτοῦ κανόνος, καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ ἀνεκπλήρωτος λειτουργία ἐνσώματον σύμπτωμα παράγει.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_67:D3","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-07","text":"Ἡ κοσμικὴ πληρότης διασώζει τὰ κατώτερα ὡς ἀναγκαῖα μέρη, ἀλλὰ διατηρεῖ τὴν ἀξιακὴν ἀνισότητα αὐτῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-09","CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-01","text":"Ἡ πραγματικότης ἀνασυντίθεται ὡς συνεχὴς ψυχοσωματικὴ παραγωγή, ἐν ᾗ ἠθική, μορφή, εἶδος καὶ κόσμος ἀλληλοπαράγονται.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-02","text":"Ἡ τελεολογία δὲν ἐπιβάλλεται ἔξωθεν τῆς ὕλης, ἀλλὰ διέρχεται διὰ τῶν ἀπειθῶν, νοσηρῶν καὶ μεταμορφωτικῶν μηχανισμῶν τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-03","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος παύει νὰ εἶναι σταθερὸν εἶδος καὶ γίνεται κόμβος ἐνδεχομένων σωματικῶν καὶ ψυχικῶν μεταβάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-04","text":"Ἡ πτῶσις ἀναταξινομεῖται: εἶναι ἅμα τιμωρία τῆς ἀμαθίας, παραγωγὴ κατωτέρας μορφῆς καὶ ἀναγκαῖον μέρος τῆς κοσμικῆς πληρότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-05","text":"Ὁ χρόνος νοεῖται οὐ γραμμικῶς, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς μεταμορφωτικὴ γενεαλογία ἐν ᾗ ὁ πρότερος βίος ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ὕστερον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-06","text":"Ἡ μορφολογία λειτουργεῖ ὡς κρυπτὴ γραμματικὴ ἠθικῶν, νοητικῶν καὶ κοσμολογικῶν σχέσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-07","text":"Ἡ ἀληθὴς ἔξοδος ἀπὸ τὴν κατωτέραν μορφὴν δὲν εἶναι φυγὴ ἐκ τοῦ σώματος, ἀλλὰ μεταβολὴ τῆς σχέσεως πρὸς νοῦν, λόγον καὶ θεωρίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-01","text":"Ἡ ψυχικὴ ποιότης παράγει μορφήν, ἡ μορφὴ φανερώνει βαθμίδα, καὶ ἡ βαθμίς ἐπιστρέφει ὡς νέος ὁρίζων ψυχικῆς μεταμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-02","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία κινεί τὴν γένεσιν, ἡ ἀνεκπλήρωσις παράγει νόσον, καὶ ἡ νόσος ἐπαναφέρει τὸ σώμα πρὸς τὴν τελείωσιν τῆς γενετικῆς λειτουργίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_67:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-03","text":"Ἡ ἀπώλεια τοῦ νοῦ κλιμακοῦται ἀπὸ ἀπώλειαν στάσεως εἰς τετραποδίαν, ἑρπυσμόν, ἀκάθαρτον ἀναπνοὴν καὶ ὑδάτινον οἴκησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-04","text":"Ἡ κτῆσις καὶ ἡ ἀποβολὴ τοῦ νοῦ μετατρέπουσι τὴν ταξινομίαν εἰς κύκλον ἀμοιβαίων μεταβάσεων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-05","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία ὁδηγεῖ πρὸς τὴν ἑνότητα, ἡ δὲ ἑνότης ἐπανασυνδέει τὰ ἱεραρχικῶς διεστῶτα εἴδη ὡς μέρη τοῦ ἑνός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-06","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία λειτουργεῖ ὡς ἀναβατικὸς ἄξων, ἀλλὰ ἡ κοσμικὴ πληρότης ἀπαιτεῖ τὴν ἐνσωμάτωσιν ὅλης τῆς καταβατικῆς κλίμακος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-07","text":"Ἡ ἐπανάληψις τῶν ὅρων «μορφή», «νοῦς» καὶ «μεταβολή» σημαίνει ἀλλαγὴν φάσεως: ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν ψυχολογίαν εἰς κοσμολογίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B01","text":"Ψυχικὴ ἕξις καὶ ἠθικὸς βίος → νοῦς ἢ ἄνοια → προσανατολισμὸς πρὸς ἄνω ἢ πρὸς γῆν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B02","text":"Ἀναπροσανατολισμὸς τῆς ψυχῆς → σωματικὴ μορφή → κίνησις, στάσις καὶ ζωικὸν εἶδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B03","text":"Ἔμψυχα γεννητικὰ μέρη → ἀπειθὴς ἐπιθυμία → ἔρως → γένεσις ἢ νόσος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B04","text":"Ἀπώλεια νοῦ → μορφολογικὴ συμπίεσις → ἀλλαγὴ ἀναπνοῆς καὶ οἰκήσεως → κατώτερον εἶδος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B05","text":"Κτῆσις ἢ ἀποβολὴ νοῦ → ἀμφίδρομος μετάβασις εἰδῶν → ἀνασχηματισμὸς τῆς ἱεραρχίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B06","text":"Ἱεραρχικὴ πολλαπλότης → συμπλήρωσις θνητῶν καὶ ἀθανάτων → ἓν ὁρατὸν ζῷον → εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ θεοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B01","text":"Ἠθικὴ ἀποτυχία → μεταμόρφωσις ψυχῆς → διαφοροποίησις φύλων καὶ εἰδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B02","text":"Ἔμψυχος ἐπιθυμία → ἀντίστασις τῷ λόγῳ → γενετήσιος τελεολογία → γένεσις ἢ νόσος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B03","text":"Ἀπουσία φιλοσοφίας → ἀπώλεια νοῦ → γήινη ἕλξις → μορφολογικὴ καὶ χωρικὴ καθίζησις.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B04","text":"Κτῆσις ἢ ἀποβολὴ νοῦ → μεταβολὴ ζωικῶν μορφῶν → ἀμφίδρομος ζωικὴ κλίμαξ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B05","text":"Ζωικὴ πολλαπλότης → ἱεραρχικὴ σύνθεσις → κοσμικὴ πληρότης → ὁρατὴ εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-01","text":"Τὸ φύλον καὶ τὸ εἶδος παύουσι νὰ εἶναι ἀπλῶς φυσικαὶ κατηγορίαι καὶ γίνονται ἀποτυπώματα ψυχικῆς ἱστορίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-02","text":"Ἡ σεξουαλικὴ ἐπιθυμία ἀναταξινομεῖται ὡς μηχανισμὸς γενέσεως ὁ ὁποῖος διατηρεῖ ἐσωτερικὴν ἀπειθαρχίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-03","text":"Ἡ νόσος γίνεται σημεῖον ἀνεκπληρώτου τελεολογίας καὶ οὐχὶ ἀπλὴ ἀποτυχία τοῦ σώματος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-04","text":"Ἡ ταξινομία τῶν ζῴων γίνεται χάρτης ἠθικῶν κινήσεων, ἀναβάσεων, καταπτώσεων καὶ ἀμοιβαίων μεταβολῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-05","text":"Ἡ διάκρισις φύσεως καὶ τιμωρίας καταρρέει, ἐπειδὴ ἡ μορφὴ καὶ ἡ οἴκησις ἐκφράζουσι τὴν ψυχικὴν ἀξίαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-06","text":"Ἡ τελειότης μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ τὸ ἄριστον μέρος εἰς τὴν ἀναγκαίαν πληρότητα τοῦ συνόλου.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B01","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ἐπιφανειακοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὰ φύλα καὶ τὰ εἴδη διαφοροποιοῦνται κατὰ σῶμα, κίνησιν, ἀναπνοὴν καὶ οἴκησιν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B02","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ δομικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ψυχικὴ ποιότης διοχετεύεται διὰ τοῦ σώματος εἰς μορφὴν καὶ περιβάλλον.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B03","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεταστρατηγικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἀνάγνωσις τῆς φύσεως γίνεται ἀνάγνωσις ἠθικῆς γενεαλογίας καὶ μεταμορφώσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B04","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ ὀντολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, τὸ αἰσθητὸν πᾶν νοεῖται ὡς ἑνιαία εἰκὼν τοῦ νοητοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B05","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ χρονικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ζωικὴ τάξις εἶναι ἀναστρέψιμος κατὰ τὴν μεταβολὴν τοῦ νοῦ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B06","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ μεθοδολογικοῦ ἐπιπέδου, ἡ μορφὴ ἀναγιγνώσκεται ὡς ἔνδειξις ἀοράτων ψυχικῶν καὶ κοσμικῶν αἰτίων.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B07","text":"Ἐπὶ τοῦ performative ἐπιπέδου, ἡ ἱεραρχικὴ ἀφήγησις μετατρέπει τὴν περιγραφὴν εἰς μηχανισμὸν ἀξιολογήσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-01","text":"Ἡ ἱεραρχία τῶν εἰδῶν φαίνεται σταθερά, ἐνῶ ἡ κτῆσις καὶ ἡ ἀποβολὴ τοῦ νοῦ καθιστῶσι τὰ εἴδη μεταβλητά.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-02","text":"Ἡ ἐπιθυμία ὑποτάσσεται τελικῶς εἰς τὴν γένεσιν, ἀλλὰ ὁρίζεται ταυτοχρόνως ὡς δύναμις ἀντιτασσομένη τῷ λόγῳ.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-03","text":"Ἡ κατώτερος μορφὴ εἶναι ἅμα δίκη τῆς ἀμαθίας καὶ ἀναγκαῖον μέρος τῆς τελειότητος τοῦ παντός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-04","text":"Ἡ φιλοσοφία ὑψοῖ τὴν ψυχήν, ἀλλὰ ἡ ὁλότητα δὲν ἐπιτρέπει ἐξάλειψιν τῶν ἀνοήτων καὶ κατωτέρων μερῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-05","text":"Ὁ μηχανισμὸς τῆς μεταπλάσεως ἀπὸ ψυχικὴν ποιότητα εἰς συγκεκριμένον εἶδος μένει ἀκριβῶς ἀκαθόριστος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-01","text":"Ἡ «μεταμόρφωσις» μεταβάλλει λειτουργίαν: ἀπὸ ἠθικὴν μετάπτωσιν ψυχῆς γίνεται καθολικὴ κινητικὴ λογικὴ τῶν εἰδῶν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-02","text":"Ἡ «ἐπιθυμία» μετακινείται ἀπὸ τοπικὸν γενετήσιον πάθος εἰς πρότυπον τοῦ τρόπου καθ᾽ ὃν ἡ φύσις ἐνεργεῖ διὰ ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D4","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-03","text":"Ἡ «φύσις» μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ σωματικὸν ὑπόβαθρον εἰς ἠθικο-κοσμολογικὸν σύστημα ὅπου ὁ χῶρος ἤδη κρίνει.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-04","text":"Ἡ «τελειότης» μετακινείται ἀπὸ ὑπεροχὴν τοῦ ἀρίστου εἰς συμπλήρωσιν ἑνὸς κόσμου ὅστις περιέχει καὶ τὴν ἀτέλειαν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-01","text":"Ὁ κόσμος εἶναι μεταμορφωτικὸν ζῷον, ἐν ᾧ ἡ ψυχικὴ ποιότης ἐγγράφεται διαδοχικῶς εἰς σώματα, κινήσεις, ἀναπνοὰς καὶ τόπους.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-02","text":"Ὁ ἄνθρωπος ἐντὸς τοῦ μηχανισμοῦ τούτου δὲν εἶναι σταθερὸν κέντρον, ἀλλὰ μεταβατικὸς φορεὺς νοῦ ἢ ἀνοίας.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-03","text":"Ὁ χρόνος εἶναι κυκλικὴ ἢ σπειροειδὴς γενεαλογία, ἐν ᾗ ὁ πρότερος βίος ἐπανέρχεται ὡς ὕστερον σῶμα.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-04","text":"Ἡ δυνατότης ἐξόδου συνίσταται εἰς φιλοσοφικὴν καὶ θεωρητικὴν ἀνάτασιν, ἀλλὰ ἡ κοσμικὴ μηχανὴ διασώζει τὰ κατώτερα ὡς μέρη τῆς ὁλότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B01","text":"Αἱ ἀρχαὶ ἀρκέουσι πρὸς ἀνασύστασιν τῆς βασικῆς κινήσεως ἀπὸ ψυχικῆς ποιότητος εἰς σωματικὴν καὶ κοσμικὴν μορφήν.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B02","text":"Ὁ κεντρικὸς αἰτιακὸς ἄξων διασώζεται μόνον ἐὰν ἡ ἐπιθυμία νοηθῇ ἅμα ὡς ἀπειθὴς δύναμις καὶ ὡς τελεολογικὸς μηχανισμός.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B03","text":"Ὑποκαθορισμένη μένει ἡ ἀκριβὴς γέφυρα μεταξὺ ψυχικῆς διαθέσεως καὶ συγκεκριμένης σωματικῆς μορφῆς.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B04","text":"Ἐσωτερικῶς συνεκτικὴ μένει ἡ ἑνιαία σύνδεσις νοῦ, σώματος, ἀναπνοῆς, οἰκήσεως καὶ κοσμικῆς τάξεως.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B05","text":"Ἡ ἀνασύστασις διατηρεῖ τὴν πραγματικὴν κίνησιν τοῦ συστήματος, ἐπειδὴ δὲν ἐξαλείφει τὴν ἔντασιν μεταξὺ ἱεραρχίας, μεταπτώσεως, ἐπιθυμίας καὶ κοσμικῆς πληρότητος.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"grc","language_name":"Ἑλληνική","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261014T233203968971Z_5f0d5160","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 75–76","source_sha256":"d53125cfc436ec0495ca38dad4fa455afcb5f9c91aa1a7dc4303cd620ae741a4","sha256":"196a784c36504a24247934b0512c21fbded668995b620a250cc231ac66e989e4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-14T23:32:03.971621+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-01","text":"The system seeks to explain how psychic and ethical disposition is transcribed into differences of bodies, sexes, and species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-02","text":"Natural form is recast as an embodied response of intellect, folly, and prior life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-03","text":"Desire appears at once as a power disobedient to reason and as an instrument ordered toward generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-04","text":"The loss of intellect extends from the soul into posture, locomotion, respiration, and place of habitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-05","text":"The taxonomy of animals does not remain a fixed classification, but becomes a dynamic scale of transformations according to the acquisition or loss of intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-06","text":"The multiplicity of forms is finally reordered into one cosmos, which contains both the higher and the lowest.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-07","text":"The movement is spiral: psychic failure produces form, form indicates a grade, and the grade is integrated into cosmic completeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ARG-08","text":"The conclusion is not a simple abolition of hierarchy, but the coexistence of hierarchical value and the ontological necessity of lower forms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Psychic quality determines bodily form and animal rank.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Prior ethical life is transformed from a genealogy of souls into a genealogy of bodies and species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A1","CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Body, movement, respiration, habitation, and species constitute a unified psychosomatic causality.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_68:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Desire is an animate bodily power that moves generation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A4","CH_JP8E_S_67:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Desire resists reason internally, but externalizes a generative and cosmic teleology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-06","text":"[Terminal] The absence of philosophy and intellect brings descent from human form as far as bestial and aquatic life.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Morphology functions as a visible scale of ethical and intellectual gradation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Animal form can change bidirectionally according to the acquisition or loss of intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] The cosmos is one visible living creature and a perceptible image of the intelligible god.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] The perfection of the cosmos requires the presence also of the lowest animal forms, without an equalization of their value.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Philosophy and the contemplation of heaven are a biological and cosmological power of ascent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-01","text":"The transformation of the soul recurs, but is displaced from the change of sex and species to compression, respiration, and habitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-02","text":"Hierarchy remains, but ceases to be an immobile order and becomes a bidirectional mechanism of transition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-03","text":"Desire, initially a generative mechanism, is functionally displaced into a model of embodied teleological movement.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-04","text":"The body changes from a receptacle of desires into a visible grammar of ethics, intellect, and folly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-05","text":"Disease, initially a failure of generative function, is absorbed into a more general logic of bodily and spatial degradation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:NX4","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-06","text":"Philosophy is transformed from a way of governing the soul into a productive cause of a biologically higher form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-07","text":"The loss of intellect extends ethical downfall from bodily alteration to a change of medium and place.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RMD-08","text":"Lower species cease to function as mere terminal limits and are absorbed into the completeness of the one cosmos.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A8","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-01","text":"The detailed function of the womb and barrenness remains a local mechanism of the generative paradigm, not a universal description of all nature.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A6","CH_JP8E_S_67:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-02","text":"The specific transition of men into women recedes before the more general principle of psychosomatic transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A2","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-03","text":"The connection between ethical quality and form is scaled up from local genealogy into a universal principle of classification.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D5","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-04","text":"Generative teleology and animal hierarchy are bridged by embodied desire and form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D2","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-05","text":"The acquisition and loss of intellect dissolve fixed taxonomy and serve as a bridge to dynamic hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A9","CH_JP8E_S_68:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-06","text":"The distinction among human, bird, quadruped, and aquatic creature is subordinated to ascents and descents within one system.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:CGD-07","text":"The completeness of the cosmos becomes the current principle that recodes lower species as necessary, but not equal in worth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-01","text":"Physiology as evaluatively neutral and independent of the soul is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-02","text":"Desire as a mere passion is rejected, because it possesses bodily autonomy and teleological function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:NX1","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-03","text":"Respiration, movement, and space as indifferent biological data are rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:D3","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-04","text":"Animal diversity as a disorderly coexistence of independent species is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-05","text":"Disease as an accidental harm unrelated to final natural function is rejected.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:GNX-06","text":"Perfection as the exclusion of lower forms is rejected; perfection requires wholeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-01","text":"A cosmos in which soul and body are fully distinguished as independent causes is impossible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-02","text":"It is impossible to conceive ignorance as a merely internal condition, without bodily and spatial consequence.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-03","text":"It is impossible to preserve species as unchanging when the quality of intellect can transform form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-04","text":"It is impossible to interpret generation without desire, or desire without a final purpose.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-05","text":"It is impossible to take space as a homogeneous receptacle, because habitation bears an ethical and ontological grade.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:DBN-06","text":"It is impossible to isolate individual fate from cosmic completeness, even if that fate is lower.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-01","text":"A cosmos in which form can exist without psychic evaluation is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-02","text":"A nature indifferent to intellect, folly, and their transformations is absent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-03","text":"The independent finality of the unintelligent is excluded; the lowest has meaning only within the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-04","text":"Absolutely unconnected multiplicity is excluded, because every form refers to one cosmic composition.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSA-05","text":"Free desire that neither resists nor is integrated into a teleological order is excluded.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-01","text":"Because the soul determines form and the whole requires lower species, downfall becomes at once axiological degradation and ontological contribution.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_67:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-02","text":"The resistance of desire to reason does not abolish teleology, but becomes the means through which teleology operates in the body.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","CL_JP8E_26:GA-05","CH_JP8E_S_67:A5","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-03","text":"Form, movement, respiration, and habitation constitute one unified expression of psychic grade.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","CL_JP8E_26:GA-07","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD3","CH_JP8E_S_68:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-04","text":"Philosophy becomes not only a method of psychic ascent, but a cause that produces a higher biological and cosmic type.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-01","CL_JP8E_26:GA-11","CH_JP8E_S_67:ME5","CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-05","text":"The bidirectional transformation of species destabilizes fixed identity without abolishing hierarchical direction.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-02","CL_JP8E_26:GA-08","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4","CH_JP8E_S_68:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-06","text":"Generative disease and spatial degradation are read as two forms of the same rule, according to which unfulfilled function produces an embodied symptom.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-03","CL_JP8E_26:GA-04","CH_JP8E_S_67:D3","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:XD-07","text":"Cosmic completeness preserves lower beings as necessary parts, but maintains their axiological inequality.","refs":["CL_JP8E_26:GA-09","CL_JP8E_26:GA-10","CH_JP8E_S_68:D6","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-01","text":"Reality is reconstructed as continuous psychosomatic production, in which ethics, form, species, and cosmos mutually produce one another.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-02","text":"Teleology is not imposed from outside matter, but passes through the body's disobedient, diseased, and transformative mechanisms.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-03","text":"The human being ceases to be a fixed species and becomes a node of possible bodily and psychic transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-04","text":"Downfall is reclassified: it is at once punishment for ignorance, production of a lower form, and a necessary part of cosmic completeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-05","text":"Time is conceived not linearly, but as a transformative genealogy in which prior life returns as a later body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-06","text":"Morphology functions as a hidden grammar of ethical, intellectual, and cosmological relations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:BSD-07","text":"The true exit from a lower form is not flight from the body, but a change in relation to intellect, reason, and contemplation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT3","CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-01","text":"Psychic quality produces form, form reveals a grade, and the grade returns as a new horizon of psychic transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT4","CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-02","text":"Desire moves generation, nonfulfillment produces disease, and disease returns the body toward the completion of generative function.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS3","CH_JP8E_S_67:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-03","text":"The loss of intellect escalates from loss of upright posture to quadrupedalism, crawling, impure respiration, and aquatic habitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS2","CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-04","text":"The acquisition and loss of intellect turn taxonomy into a cycle of reciprocal transitions.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-05","text":"Hierarchy leads toward unity, while unity reconnects hierarchically separated species as parts of the one.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-06","text":"Philosophy functions as an axis of ascent, but cosmic completeness requires the incorporation of the entire descending scale.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT4","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:RLE-07","text":"The repetition of the terms «μορφή», «νοῦς» and «μεταβολή» signifies a change of phase: from ethical psychology to cosmology.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B01","text":"Psychic disposition and ethical life → intellect or folly → orientation upward or toward earth.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B02","text":"Reorientation of the soul → bodily form → movement, posture, and animal species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B03","text":"Animate generative parts → disobedient desire → eros → generation or disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B04","text":"Loss of intellect → morphological compression → change of respiration and habitation → lower species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B05","text":"Acquisition or loss of intellect → bidirectional transition of species → reshaping of hierarchy.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FGS-B06","text":"Hierarchical multiplicity → completion of mortals and immortals → one visible living creature → image of the intelligible god.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_68:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B01","text":"Ethical failure → transformation of soul → differentiation of sexes and species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B02","text":"Animate desire → resistance to reason → generative teleology → generation or disease.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B03","text":"Absence of philosophy → loss of intellect → earthly attraction → morphological and spatial descent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B04","text":"Acquisition or loss of intellect → transformation of animal forms → bidirectional animal scale.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:AFM-B05","text":"Animal multiplicity → hierarchical composition → cosmic completeness → visible image of the intelligible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-01","text":"Sex and species cease to be merely natural categories and become imprints of psychic history.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-02","text":"Sexual desire is reclassified as a mechanism of generation that retains internal disobedience.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-03","text":"Disease becomes a sign of unfulfilled teleology and not a mere failure of the body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-04","text":"The taxonomy of animals becomes a map of ethical movements, ascents, descents, and reciprocal transformations.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-05","text":"The distinction between nature and punishment collapses, because form and habitation express psychic value.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MME-06","text":"Perfection shifts from the best part to the necessary completeness of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B01","text":"At the surface level, sexes and species are differentiated according to body, movement, respiration, and habitation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B02","text":"At the structural level, psychic quality is channeled through the body into form and environment.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B03","text":"At the metastrategic level, the reading of nature becomes a reading of ethical genealogy and transformation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B04","text":"At the ontological level, the entire perceptible realm is conceived as a unified image of the intelligible.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B05","text":"At the temporal level, animal order is reversible according to the transformation of intellect.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B06","text":"At the methodological level, form is read as an indication of invisible psychic and cosmic causes.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:ALT-B07","text":"At the performative level, hierarchical narration transforms description into a mechanism of evaluation.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-01","text":"The hierarchy of species appears fixed, while the acquisition and loss of intellect render species mutable.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-02","text":"Desire is finally subordinated to generation, but is simultaneously defined as a power opposed to reason.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-03","text":"The lower form is at once a penalty for ignorance and a necessary part of the perfection of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:ME3","CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-04","text":"Philosophy elevates the soul, but the whole does not permit the elimination of unintelligent and lower parts.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A11","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:FL-05","text":"The mechanism of transformation from psychic quality into a specific species remains precisely indeterminate.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-01","text":"«Transformation» changes function: from an ethical transition of the soul it becomes a universal dynamic logic of species.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:FGS5","CH_JP8E_S_68:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-02","text":"«Desire» shifts from a local generative passion to a model of the way in which nature operates through resistance.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:D4","CH_JP8E_S_67:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-03","text":"«Nature» is transformed from a bodily substrate into an ethical-cosmological system in which space already judges.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD1","CH_JP8E_S_68:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MP-04","text":"«Perfection» shifts from the superiority of the best to the completion of a cosmos that contains imperfection too.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:SD5","CH_JP8E_S_68:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-01","text":"The cosmos is a transformative living creature, in which psychic quality is successively inscribed into bodies, movements, respirations, and places.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-02","text":"Within this mechanism, the human being is not a stable center, but a transitional bearer of intellect or folly.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-03","text":"Time is a cyclical or spiral genealogy, in which prior life returns as a later body.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:ALT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:HSI-04","text":"The possibility of exit consists in philosophical and contemplative ascent, but the cosmic machine preserves the lower as parts of the whole.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:A10","CH_JP8E_S_68:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B01","text":"The principles suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from psychic quality to bodily and cosmic form.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B02","text":"The central causal axis is preserved only if desire is understood both as a disobedient power and as a teleological mechanism.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_67:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B03","text":"The precise bridge between psychic disposition and specific bodily form remains underdetermined.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B04","text":"The unified connection of intellect, body, respiration, habitation, and cosmic order remains internally coherent.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_JP8E_26:MRT-B05","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the system, because it does not eliminate the tension among hierarchy, transition, desire, and cosmic completeness.","refs":["CH_JP8E_S_68:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_JP8E_26@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_JP8E_26:v1","source_language_code":"grc","original_title":"Chapters 75–76"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Timaeus","title":"Chapters 75–76","context":"Section 91 · Section 92","original_title":"Chapters 75–76","original_context":"Section 91 · Section 92"},"original_title":"Chapters 75–76","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01","layer":"MC","title":"Jp8E L1 01","order":1,"parents":["CL_JP8E_01","CL_JP8E_02","CL_JP8E_03","CL_JP8E_04"],"revision":"MC_JP8E_L1_01@R001","sha256":"bacacab30f70d8a5a8d3e010aff87fdf9cfef02294edad18d2c31a16cb71bb3c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-01","text":"Τὸ πρόβλημα ἐστὶν ὅπως πολιτικὴ τάξις, ἱστορικὴ μνήμη, καὶ ἀληθὴς λόγος συγκροτηθῶσιν ἐν κόσμῳ φθορᾶς, λήθης, γενέσεως καὶ συγκρούσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:AS-01","CL_JP8E_02:BAS-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-02","text":"Ἡ πολιτεία οὐκέτι νοεῖται ὡς αὐτάρκης παροῦσα κοινότης, ἀλλ᾽ ὡς μηχανὴ διανομῆς ἔργων, παιδείας, μνήμης, γενέσεως καὶ ἀντιστάσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-04","CL_JP8E_04:GA-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-03","text":"Ἡ ἀλήθεια μεταβαίνει ἀπὸ στατικὴν ἰδιότητα εἰς ἀναθεωρήσιμον διαδικασίαν ἀνασυνθέσεως, μαρτυρίας, αἰτιολογίας καὶ κοινῆς δοκιμασίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-12","CL_JP8E_04:BSD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-04","text":"Ἡ λήθη οὐ σημαίνει κενὸν γεγονότων, ἀλλὰ διακοπὴν τῶν φορέων οἳ δύνανται νὰ διασώζωσι, να ἐρμηνεύωσι, καὶ νὰ νομιμοποιῶσι τὸ παρελθόν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-01","CL_JP8E_03:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-05","text":"Ἡ κίνησις τοῦ συστήματος εἶναι σπειροειδής: τάξις παράγει δοκιμασίαν, δοκιμασία ἀπώλειαν, ἀπώλεια μνήμην, καὶ μνήμη νέαν πολιτικὴν καὶ κοσμολογικὴν σύνθεσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:AS-08","CL_JP8E_02:RLE-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-06","text":"Ἡ ἐξωτερικὴ ἀπειλὴ καὶ ἡ φυσικὴ καταστροφὴ λειτουργοῦσιν ὡς δύο κρίσεις τῆς αὐτῆς πολιτικῆς μηχανῆς: ἡ μὲν δοκιμάζει τὴν πράξιν, ἡ δὲ τὴν συνέχειαν τοῦ λόγου.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:XD-01","CL_JP8E_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-07","text":"Ἡ κοσμολογία οὐ προστίθεται ὡς ἐξωτερικὸν κόσμημα, ἀλλὰ καθιστᾷ τὴν πολιτικὴν μορφὴν παράγωγον αἰτίας, παραδείγματος, παιδείας καὶ μνήμης.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:XD-04","CL_JP8E_04:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:AS-08","text":"Ἡ πρόσκαιρος σύγκλεισις τοῦ συστήματος δὲν εἶναι βεβαιότης, ἀλλὰ πρέπων λόγος ὃς δύναται νὰ ἐπανέλθῃ εἰς μνήμην, κρίσιν, πράξιν καὶ αἰτιολογίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-08","CL_JP8E_04:BSA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἑνότης παράγεται διὰ λειτουργικῆς διαφοροποιήσεως καὶ οὐ διὰ ἀδιακρίτου ὁμοιομορφίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-01","CL_JP8E_03:GA-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Ἡ φύσις παύει νὰ εἶναι μόνον κριτήριον κατανομῆς καὶ γίνεται ὕλη παιδείας, γεωγραφικῆς διασώσεως, καὶ πολιτικοῦ σχεδιασμοῦ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-08","CL_JP8E_02:XD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ἀρετὴ ἀποδεικνύεται μόνον ἐν πράξει, κινδύνῳ, πολέμῳ καὶ ἐξωτερικῇ δοκιμασίᾳ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GA-10","CL_JP8E_02:GA-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ μνήμη εἶναι κατανεμημένη πολιτικὴ ἐργασία φορέων, τόπων, γραφῶν, θεσμῶν καὶ κοινῆς κρίσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-05","CL_JP8E_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-05","text":"[Attractor] Ἡ καταστροφὴ καὶ ἡ λήθη δὲν εἶναι ἐξωτερικαὶ παρεκβάσεις, ἀλλὰ μηχανισμοὶ οἳ ρυθμίζουσι τί δύναται νὰ γνωσθῇ καὶ τί ἀναγκάζεται νὰ ἀνακτηθῇ.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-08","CL_JP8E_03:XD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Ὁ μῦθος οὐκ ἐναντιοῦται ἁπλῶς τῇ ἀληθείᾳ, ἀλλὰ δύναται νὰ λειτουργῇ ὡς ἐλεγχόμενος φορεὺς ἀπωλεσθείσης ἱστορικῆς καὶ κοσμολογικῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GA-09","CL_JP8E_04:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Ἡ πολιτικὴ ταυτότης εἶναι παράγωγον ἀλυσίδος κόσμος, γένεσις, παιδεία, μνήμη, νόμος καὶ ἀντίστασις.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-12","CL_JP8E_04:BSD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Ὁ ἀληθὴς λόγος ἀπαιτεῖ αἰτίαν, παράδειγμα, μνήμην, πρέπον, καὶ κοινὴν ἐξέτασιν, ἀλλ᾽ οὐδέποτε κτᾶται ἀπόλυτον αὐτοεγγύησιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:GA-01","CL_JP8E_04:GA-11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Ἡ ἐλευθερία παράγεται ὡς ἀντίστασις πρὸς δύναμιν δουλώσεως, ἀλλὰ ἡ ἰσχὺς ἡ ἐλευθεροῦσα οὐδέποτε ἀποχωρίζεται τελείως ἀπὸ τὴν ἡγεμονικὴν δυνατότητα.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GA-12","CL_JP8E_03:FL-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:RMD-01","text":"Ἡ διαίρεσις τῶν ἔργων διατηρεῖ τὴν ταυτότητά της, ἀλλὰ ἀπὸ κοινωνικὴ κατανομή μεταβάλλεται εἰς ἀρχιτεκτονικὴν τῆς μνήμης, τῆς γνώσεως καὶ τῆς ἐξουσίας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:RMD-01","CL_JP8E_03:RMD-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:RMD-02","text":"Ὁ φύλαξ μετατοπίζεται ἀπὸ πολεμικὸς προστάτης εἰς κόμβον παιδείας, κοινότητος, γενέσεως, ἀρχεῖου καὶ πολιτικῆς κρίσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:RMD-03","CL_JP8E_01:BSD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:RMD-03","text":"Ἡ μνήμη μεταλλάσσεται ἀπὸ ἀναπλήρωσιν ἀπόντος εἰς ἐνεργὸν ἀρχειακὴν δύναμιν ἣ διανέμει πολιτικὴν νομιμοποίησιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:RMD-08"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:RMD-04","text":"Ἡ καταστροφὴ ἀντιστρέφει τὸ πρόσημον αὐτῆς: ἀπὸ συμβεβηκὸς ἀπωλείας γίνεται παραγωγὸς τοῦ ἱστορικοῦ χρόνου καὶ τῆς ἀνάγκης ἐρμηνείας.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:RLE-05","CL_JP8E_03:MP-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:RMD-05","text":"Ὁ μῦθος ἀπορροφᾶται εἰς ὑψηλοτέραν δομὴν, ἐν ᾗ ἡ μεταφορά, ἡ ἀρχειακὴ διάσωσις, καὶ ἡ κοσμολογικὴ αἰτιολογία συνεργοῦσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:BSD-05","CL_JP8E_04:XD-03"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:CGD-01","text":"Αἱ λεπτομέρειαι γάμου, τροφῆς, ἑορτῆς, προσώπων καὶ ἐπιμέρους διηγήσεων παραμένουσι τοπικαί· ἡ διοίκησις δεσμῶν, μεταδόσεων καὶ ἐμπειριῶν κλιμακοῦται εἰς καθολικὴν πολιτικὴν λογικήν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:CGD-02","CL_JP8E_02:CGD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:CGD-02","text":"Ἡ ἀτομικὴ μαρτυρία καὶ ἡ τοπικὴ ἀνάκλησις γεφυροῦσιν τὰ μέρη μόνον ὅταν γίνωνται κρίκοι κατανεμημένης ἀλυσίδος μνήμης.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:CGD-06","CL_JP8E_03:RMD-01"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:CGD-03","text":"Ἡ πολεμικὴ δοκιμασία παύει νὰ εἶναι ἔργον ἑνὸς γένους καὶ γίνεται καταλύτης μεταβάσεως ἀπὸ ἐσωτερικὴν εὐταξίαν εἰς καθολικὴν πολιτικὴν ἀξίωσιν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:RMD-05","CL_JP8E_03:CGD-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:CGD-04","text":"Ἡ κοσμογονικὴ αἰτιολογία κλιμακοῦται ὅταν παύῃ νὰ εἶναι λόγος περὶ κόσμου καὶ γίνεται ὅρος πολιτικῆς νομιμοποιήσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_04:CGD-06","CL_JP8E_04:BSD-02"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GNX-01","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται πολιτεία ἣ ταυτίζει ἑνότητα πρὸς ἀδιάκριτον μῖξιν καὶ ἀνεξέλεγκτον ἐναλλαγὴν λειτουργιῶν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_01:GNX-01","CL_JP8E_03:DBN-05"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GNX-02","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται λόγος πολιτικὸς ἢ κοσμολογικὸς ὃς μένει αὐτάρκης, ἀδοκίμαστος, ἀναίτιος, καὶ ἀνεξάρτητος τῶν φορέων τῆς μεταδόσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GNX-02","CL_JP8E_04:GNX-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GNX-03","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ γραμμικὴ ἱστορία, καθότι ἡ φθορὰ καὶ ἡ χωρικῶς ἀνισόρροπος διάσωσις διακόπτουσι τὴν συσσώρευσιν τῆς γνώσεως.","refs":["CL_JP8E_02:GNX-05","CL_JP8E_02:DBN-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"MC_JP8E_L1_01:GNX-04","text":"Ἀπορρίπτεται ἡ ἰδέα ὅτι τὸ παρόν, ἡ αἴσθησις, ἢ ἡ σύγχρονος ἀναγνώρισις δύνανται αὐτόματα νὰ μετρήσωσι τὴν πολιτικὴν ἀξίαν.","refs":["CL_JP8E_03:GNX-02","CL_JP8E_04:DBN-05"],"d